	insert into reviews(date, listing_id, reviewer_name, comments) values
("2016-12-29", "10091713", "Charles", "Ben's place is in the perfect location. Had a lot of fun staying there."),
("2017-01-05", "10091713", "Lucy", "Ben's apartment was perfect for a few days in Sydney - well located  clean  bright and spacious. It is quite big for a studio  and the floorplan gives the feel of a separate kitchen  bedroom and living area. A great view  well ventilated and bright. Ben was a great host  with really good communication. He was very accommodating with check-in and check out times. Only downside is that the apartment doesn't have wifi  so perhaps not ideal for business travellers or longer stays. "),
("2017-01-28", "10091713", "Ed", "I enjoyed my stay at Ben's place. Perfect location for public transport either to city (5 mins) or Bondi or Coogee beaches.Small but has everything you need to explore Sydney with and best of all  great city views!"),
("2017-02-05", "10091713", "Angel", "The apartment is in a nice building with some cool Art Deco details. Location is good - we pretty much walked to all major sights in city (opera house  darling harbour etc.) and there are some great shops and places to eat nearby (thanks to Ben's suggestions). Apartment has all the stuff you need for a comfortable stay  and Ben is super helpful and excellent in communication. We had such a nice time and would recommend Ben's apartment! "),
("2017-02-07", "10091713", "Melanie", "Ben was an excellent host; he met me on time and showed me around the apartment ensuring that I was comfortable and had everything I needed. The apartment itself is a small but comfortable studio with beautiful views of the city. It's located close to Oxford St with access to public transport if needed. Only a short walk to Darlinghurst and the city. Also  a Woolworths Metro within 200m. Loved the place and would stay again. "),
("2017-02-10", "10091713", "James", "Bens apartment is in a great location in Sydney close to great restaurants  museums  bars and shopping - Everything you need. Ben was also very friendly   helpful and communicative. We would highly recommend ! "),
("2017-02-26", "10091713", "Tyler", "Great central studio!"),
("2017-02-28", "10091713", "Roger", "Great location for work or holiday  clean  lots to explore in the neighborhood  a stress free stay  thanks Ben"),
("2017-03-05", "10091713", "Brad", "Bens apartment was perfect. Great location and everything in Surry Hills  Oxford St and Taylor Sq are walkable. Perfect for Mardi Gra weekend as we watched the parade from the lounge room windows. Would definitely stay here again when in Sydney "),
("2017-03-10", "10091713", "Soohyun", "에어비앤비숙소중에  가장 좋았다"),
("2017-03-12", "10091713", "Emma", "Ben's place is centrally located with a great view of the Sydney skyline. The place looked exactly as it did in the pictures and was the perfect size for the two of us. Ben was a great host -- always quick to respond to my messages and happy to answer any questions. I would highly recommend this place."),
("2017-03-14", "10091713", "Susan", "Ben's place was in a great location and close to transit.  We enjoyed the coffee shop downstairs  the shops and theater."),
("2017-03-18", "10091713", "Cheryl", "The charming apartment is conveniently located with beautiful view of Sydney Tower and Habour Bridge."),
("2017-03-21", "10091713", "Nadine", "Great location. Apartment exactly like pictures. Perfect for two people and nice and clean. Great communication."),
("2017-03-24", "10091713", "Luther", "Great location  perfectly positioned for getting into the city or to Bondi. (It's very close to the Darlinghurst nightlife so it can be a bit noisy on weekends  but you can't be in a central location without a little activity!) The apartment is clean and tidy and great for two  with very good shower water pressure. And that gorgeous view across Sydney! "),
("2017-03-27", "10091713", "Talia", "Great apartment in a fantastic central location! All the ammenities you could possible need and an added bonus of harbour bridge views!"),
("2017-04-03", "10091713", "Pedro", "It was really nice."),
("2017-04-08", "10091713", "Angela", "很小巧精致的房间 独立的厨房卫生间 各项设备齐全 居住十分方便｡位置也十分便利 能观望到悉尼大桥和海湾景色｡美中不足的是入住第一晚隔壁房子在举办彻夜的party及高声唱歌 相当打扰睡眠"),
("2017-04-16", "10091713", "Allison", "Amazing view  great area and a great studio "),
("2017-04-28", "10091713", "Simon", "Great pad!"),
("2017-05-01", "10091713", "Sandy", "Totally hip neighborhood and convenient to great food  bars and sights. Ben is very nice and helpful. The apartment comfortable and homey. "),
("2017-05-09", "10091713", "Kirsty", "Ben was a great host  his apartment was central to Sydneys busy CBD and near lots of good places to eat. We would highly recommend staying here. "),
("2017-05-14", "10091713", "Waan", "Great location  nice view. Clean apartment  comfy bed and strong wifi. Close to everything!"),
("2017-05-20", "10091713", "Tina", "風景優美 設施齊全 屋主親切友善 適合情侶居住"),
("2017-05-29", "10091713", "Pauline", "L'appartement de Ben est fonctionnel  cosy et très agréable. Ben à été un hôte parfait : bonne communication  présent à notre arrivée pour nous remettre les clés  appartement propre.. bref nous recommandons. Et la vue depuis l'appartement est absolument superbe !!! Coucher et lever de soleil sur Sydney magnifiques !!!"),
("2017-06-05", "10091713", "Yuhan", "Ben人非常好 提供了很好的帮助｡房间明亮整洁舒适 在市中心位置 去哪里都可以步行｡乘坐公共交通也很方便｡"),
("2017-06-10", "10091713", "Cassandra", "Staying at Ben's place was fantastic! The view was perfect and the apartment itself was great. It was right in the middle of everything and was full of awesome geeky paraphernalia. Ben's guidebook was also very useful and I greatly appreciated having it. I would definitely choose this as a place to stay again if I get a chance to return to Sydney."),
("2017-06-14", "10091713", "Kiri", "We loved our stay at Ben's apartment! The only very small negative we can say is the noisyness at night on the weekend BUT you can pop to the pharmacy next door and pick up some earplugs and that solves the problem!! Absolutely LOVED the location and decor of the apartment. Ben was so easy to communicate with and made sure that we were comfortable and had everything we needed :-) If you stay here  it is well worth looking at Ben's suggestions for top spots in the area. We went down the road to Bourke St Bakery everyday (amazing coffee and food!!) and went to the Italian restaurant Vacanza on our last night-simply delicious! We would 100% stay again on our next visit to Sydney :-)"),
("2017-06-16", "10091713", "Tim", "A beautiful studio apartment with stunning views in an unbeatable location. Will definitely be staying here again next time. Thanks very much Ben!"),
("2017-07-02", "10091713", "Saiful", "Great stay. Great location. Great host."),
("2017-07-08", "10091713", "Janai", "Great place to stay! Nice and compact  but enough room for two :)"),
("2017-07-12", "10091713", "Alan", "A perfect location to walk to all parts of the city  or to catch well frequented public transport. Many great cafes and quirky shops. Ben's place is the perfect size for a couple and has everything you need for a brief stay. "),
("2017-07-15", "10091713", "Johannes", "Clean  cosy and convenient. "),
("2017-07-22", "10091713", "Gianina", "It was such a cosy room with a beautiful view out of the window. You can watch the sunrise while sitting on the Sofa and having tee.It's a really good located appartment  too. Lot's of bar  Cafe's....We would definately recommend this accomadation!"),
("2017-07-25", "10091713", "Oliver", "Ben's place is great  really stunning views of Sydney and a very convenient location. Ben was also very easy to deal with and check in was a breeze. We'll definitely stay here again if we come back to Sydney."),
("2017-07-29", "10091713", "Martina", "Warm  light filled studio  compact but has everything you need. View from the loo window is pretty cool. An abundance of eating & drinking places all within an easy walk  (recommend the 'Shakespeare pub' 200 Devonshire st  for their Thursday night fish and chip special).Again handy location for the single or couple travellers  easy key pickup and great communication with Ben."),
("2017-07-31", "10091713", "Judith", "Die Wohnung entsprach genau der Beschreibung  die Schlüsselübergabe klappte hervorragend. Die Wohnung war sehr sauber und mit allem Notwendigen ausgestattet. Wir haben uns dort sehr wohl gefühlt und würden sie jederzeit wieder buchen."),
("2017-08-14", "10091713", "Carly", "Great spot! Amazing water and bridge views. Lots of great restaurants and bars within walking distance  and the supermarket is really close. An easy walk to the city."),
("2017-08-23", "10091713", "Alex", "Was a great stay ! Great view toward the city (can see harbour bridge). Clean and tidy room with great access to public transport"),
("2017-09-02", "10091713", "Tracy", "I enjoyed my stay at Ben's place. The studio apartment is cute and neat with a nice view. Great location and very convenient. Check in/check out was easy. Ben is helpful. I would love to stay at his place again next time I am in Sydney."),
("2017-09-09", "10091713", "Angela", "A fabulous place to stay  such a vibrant area with lots of great places to eat.Ben was really easy to deal with and great communication. Such great value for money  would highly recommend."),
("2017-09-11", "10091713", "Angela", "My partner and I had a great stay at Ben's place. The place is small but just a perfect size for a couple and base for a City weekend. The location is fantastic and so many great little bars at cafes at hand. Very handy having a pharmacy below and also a Metro supermarket a few minutes walk. This really is a great value for money considering the location and Ben is so easy to deal with."),
("2017-09-18", "10091713", "Aude", "Very well located studio  very clean and with a beautiful view on the city. It was perfect to visit Sydney as the flat is very near the buses and the center can be easilly acesssed by foot. Ben was very helpful to answer quickly in case of questions. I recommand this location and will return if I come back to Sydney :-)"),
("2017-10-03", "10091713", "Lauren", "This was undoubtedly the worst air bnb experience I have ever had.The studio is filled with the hosts things in drawers  it is very noisy  the shower handles fell off and there were a random pair of rusty nail scissors on the floor  we had people knocking on our door in the night and every single day the block smelt like weed from someone smoking inside.About 6 days into our stay the toilet started leaking - pretty gross when it's leaking on the floor after flushing. I let ben know and he didn't reply. I chased 2 days later and he agreed to come and take a look - afterwards the issue was much worse and the entire floor was covered in water  the shower then also wouldn't turn off. Ben told me he would look into a plumber coming and once again failed to get in touch - I chased and said it was uninhabitable like that .. and Ben then demanded that we leave that very day with no compromise with time to find somewhere else  despite us having 4 nights left and visiting from London. Awful experience all around."),
("2017-10-17", "10091713", "Sarah", "The host canceled this reservation 7 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-10-17", "10091713", "Mingyu", "This place is pretty awesome. It is pretty close to anything you would really need. Within about a 1.5 mile radius (35 min walk) we could really get to any part of town of interest  and anything else uber is always convenient. The place is small and cozy  nothing more you need for your stay. The TV is a smart TV with the youtube app which (we didnt realize till after staying in our other airbnb's without it) was awesome! The only thing is  the bed and the couch kind of sunk in. So we ended up sleeping on the ground. Which honestly isnt bad at all  and made my back feel muuuch better the next day. Honestly didnt detract from the experience at all."),
("2017-10-22", "10091713", "Ania", "Wow......this met all of our expectations and more. Clean and tidy with fresh sheets on a comfy bed and Sheridan towels. Not to mention the extras that I wont bother to take next time we stay like umbrellas  shopping bags  tea bags  band aids and spare blankets. Perhaps having  a hairdryer available would have lightened my luggage! Check in and check out was easy. Ben was available  approachable and very helpful. The location was perfect for exploring Sydney. A 20 min stroll down historic Oxford St to Darling Harbour. Many different buses right out the front to Centre Point  Bondi  Circular Quay  just to mention a few. Don't forget to get your Opal card from any newsagent and you can top it up with cash on line! Walking distance to the train to explore further a field. The studio apartment on the 7th floor has spectacular views ( the photos don't lie!) and is nestled in a friendly community with many restaurants/cafes/shops/chemists all within walking distance. We will be back for many visits I am sure...thanks again Ben!"),
("2017-10-31", "10091713", "Rowena", "We had a great stay at Ben’s place. The location is perfect for exploring Sydney and the apartment had all the amenities we needed  including a well equipped kitchen. We’d definitely stay here again. Ben was quick to respond and he kindly left us some ice lollies  as we had hot weather the first few day!"),
("2017-11-06", "10091713", "Rekha", "Ben's place was very comfortable and close to all public transport and commercial points. We had a wonderful stay. Apartment was very well equipped. Ben was also very quick in response for qns we had on any facility at home."),
("2017-11-14", "10091713", "Jessica", "Ben was an amazing host who had everything we needed. The apartment has a fantastic view of the city skyline and bridge  as well as everything you out need for a comfortable stay."),
("2017-11-19", "10091713", "Lara", "This apartment is in an excellent location to see Sydney and enjoy the area of Surry Hills. A cosy and compact apartment providing everything you need. Ben was very easy to contact and accommodating."),
("2017-11-25", "10091713", "Sarah", "Ben’s place is in a lively  busy Sydney neighbourhood. There’s always lots going on and plenty of great places to eat  drink and socialise. We recommend Messina for amazing ice cream and Bourke St Bakery - both within walking distance.The apartment itself is cosy  compact and ideal for solo travellers or couples who don’t need too much space. It’s bright  stylishly decorated and has all the amenities you’ll need for a few days in the city."),
("2017-12-01", "10091713", "Kate", "Cute studio apartment with bridge views. Easy walk to Darling Harbor and very friendly and accomodating host. Would definitely recommend Ben's place."),
("2017-12-06", "10091713", "Amelia", "Great location  clean apartment  amazing host. Definitely recommend"),
("2017-12-12", "10091713", "Scott", "Great apartment close to the centre of town"),
("2017-12-17", "10091713", "Tegan", "This is a lovely  clean apartment in a very central location. Close to public transport and everything else we needed (e.g. Supermarket  cafes  restaurants). The apartment is very spacious for two people and the view is amazing  we even had a great view of some fireworks on our last night. I would definitely recommend this place. Ben was also a great host and easy to communicate with!"),
("2017-12-29", "10091713", "Jib Walaipat", "Ben's apartment is situated among trendy cafes and bars. It's also only a short walk to a train station  and a longer walk to many tourist attractions. Check-in was easy and the host  was communicative. Weoved our stay. Thank you  Ben!"),
("2018-01-02", "10091713", "Catherine", "The view from Ben's place was spectacular!!!"),
("2018-01-17", "10091713", "Eloise", "Lovely apartment with everything you need! In an excellent location with many great little restaurants and bars nearby. Grocery store is also just down the road. Close to bus stops that'll take you to all of Sydney's major destinations as well as a 10 min walk from Central Station. Ben was a great host and was super easy to communicate with. Would love to stay here again in the future!"),
("2018-02-04", "10091713", "Tabitha", "Worst Airbnb experience ever! On arrival  the apartment was quite grubby and full of host's personal possessions with only 2 drawers left for the two of us over a fortnight. The fridge had half empty jars  food stains were all over the cabinet doors  and the place was dusty.We had a disaster in that we accidentally left the keys in the apartment (that locks behind you!). We were unable to contact Ben for over 2 days as he had left the country without informing us - ending with us out on the street for hours  having to stay in a hostel overnight and eventually paying for a locksmith as we desperately needed our belongings. Ben was not even remotely apologetic once he finally got in contact with us. Once we asked him if it was possible for him to reimburse for the locksmith and other costs  he replied aggressively with snarky and unnecessarily nasty comments about our stay - saying we had left wet towels on the floor when actually we had left one wet towel in the laundry basket that we had used to clean the water from the leaking toilet that was a great inconvenience throughout our stay and has been a complaint from another guest. Also said we raked through his personal belongings which were against his 'rules'  when actually we only used a couple of towels from a drawer since he only left us one bath towel for two people for a fortnight. Ben has also attempted to charge us 100AUD regarding a small stain on the bed sheet  which is a completely ridiculous price especially considering the fee that we paid for cleaning.Furthermore  we asked where he would like his new keys to be left so he could get back in his apartment - to which eventually he said to 'leave them on the kitchen table'. This obviously doesn't make any sense and he only replied a few hours before our departure so we replied we would leave one of the keys in an envelope in his letterbox under his other mail. Only after we requested reimbursement days after we had left  he replied in a hostile manner that he had to pay for his own locksmith as we didn't leave him his key(?). Overall a dreadful experience that we wouldn't like anyone else to go through  as leaving the keys in an apartment when the door locks behind your back could essentially happen to anyone. This could have been handled far more efficiently & pleasantly if the host had actually been a decent person so BEWARE."),
("2018-02-27", "10091713", "Selina", "We travelled with a 4 month old baby. Ben's place was a great location  close to everything - shops  food  transport. Ben was a great communicator and offered us a late check out which was perfect."),
("2018-03-05", "10091713", "Kristie", "Wonderful location  spectacular views."),
("2018-03-08", "10091713", "Andy", "The host canceled this reservation 14 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-03-18", "10091713", "Snowy", "Ben was very responsive and the location of the accommodation is convenient.  It can get noisy on the weekend tho... Overall  a great experience to stay at Ben’s place! Thanks!"),
("2016-01-24", "10209136", "Ayrton", "This stunning place is definately the best accommodation we've had in australia! They make one feel very at home and let you take part on the good vibes ! It's tidy and very comfi.. I really recomend this place for everyone who likes to be surrounded by good people! thanks"),
("2016-02-07", "10209136", "Shabilla", "Isaac's house was as beautiful as can be  the room had sunlight and was cozy  clean and neat. cozy small kitchen comes with the room and a lively backyard with a lovely and very friendly dog that is not shy to say hello to you.Definitely recommend staying at Isaac's  as he is also very nice and kind.."),
("2016-02-08", "10209136", "Alexandra", "Staying here is like ""going home"". You feel part of the family and everyone is really chilled. Highly recommend for those seeking a relaxing time away. Clean and great location. "),
("2016-02-16", "10209136", "Svenja", "A very nice Apartment with a Great big garden and so many nice neighbours! Just awesome there! :)"),
("2013-07-15", "1016739", "Helen", "My stay at David's Coggee Beach house was excellent. It's a big house with 10 large bedrooms  and common livingroom and large kitchen  deck (super nice) and bathrooms (3 bathroom area with individual shower (nice one)  sink and toilet). I met nice people who gave me good advices to get around Sydney. David  the host  is very responsible and responded on the post to my emails while I was there. Being large  the house is very quiet and no one really bother anyone else. A cleaner shows up everyday  they were two ladies when I was there. They do an amazing job keeping the place spotless  and they are also very sweet. Now  Coggee is an amazing place. The house is up the street from the beach- there is also a large green park next to the beach. It's really nice. I went swimming at the ladies bath (sometype of sea water swimming pool on the beach) the first morning despite being Winter: amazing! I find that the picture showing Coggee beach do not make justice. It is so much more beautiful. I can't wait to go back there. (details: bus are down the street  Sydney downtown is 25min away  the airport is 20 min away (35$ for a cab)  Bondi beach is 2 beaches away :p (20min)  and peroquees are all around:)"),
("2015-07-01", "1016739", "David", "David introduced himself almost immediately on arrival and made me feel welcome. Place was exactly as posted. Other guests were interesting  courteous and helpful. Room was comfortable as was the bed. Large  easy share kitchen well organized and clean. The only negative (for me with recent hip replacement surgery) was all hand washing sinks except kitchen sink were one flight of stairs down. Immediate neighborhood pretty residential. Commerce and Coogee Beach just a short walk."),
("2015-12-22", "1016739", "Daria", " David was a very nice and hepful host  we loved it to stay in his Apartment :) it was always clean and tidy."),
("2017-05-02", "1016739", "Ying Tung", "The host canceled this reservation 13 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-08-28", "1016739", "Vera", "When I arrived at Sydney  I received David's message about our arrival time  and let us know the room is ready. The house of David is very easy to find. The house is big. The manager helped us to check in and introduced the use of the house in detail.The room is very big. The bed and storage space are large  The room is tidy and have a TV  even though our English is not very good  Johnny patiently explain for us.There are a lot of rooms. The kitchen has adequate facilities.The tenant from Brazil and France  and all people are very friendly  liking to chat. You can know many friends here  in addition to go out a few steps to reach the beach. The scenery is very beautiful.There are a lot of lines  bus station to attractions which is very convenient.Johnny is very keen to send us to the destination when we leave. The people are very good and here is a very worth to stay.David and Johnny are nice  and I hope I can come here again next time."),
("2017-11-16", "1016739", "Beatrice", "The house is a big house shared by usually long term tenants (months to years). All of them have been lovely and made me feel very welcome even if I was there for a short amount of time. The room was immense and everything was super clean. The location is perfect for access to Coogee beach and multiple food options. Many buses options also to go to CBD.All in all probably one of the best air BnB I've been to."),
("2017-11-25", "1016739", "Florence", "great experience!"),
("2017-12-01", "1016739", "Valentina", "David’s place is full of really nice guests and very close to bars  cafes  shops  transport and beaches. We loved staying here  the place is well equipped with cooking and cleaning facilities. Only downside is the slow Wi-Fi but I believe David is already on the case! Would definitely recommend to anyone who wants to visit Sydney but wants to stay near the coast!"),
("2016-06-30", "10108388", "Matt", "Friendly  helpful and welcoming hosts. Beautiful and comfortable apartment. Located opposite beautiful Hyde Park and close to Sydney's main attractions and public transport. We enjoyed having Sydney on our doorstep and exploring the city. Can't wait to visit again! Thank you Desiree and Julian. "),
("2016-08-22", "10108388", "Chris", "Desiree's Airbnb was perfectly appointed. The space is incredibly clean and welcoming. She had everything I needed for work and relaxation. She also provided helpful instructions and was easy to contact for whatever I needed. The location is great - coffee  grocery  dry cleaning  bars  shopping all within minutes. Love this location!"),
("2016-08-29", "10108388", "Scott", "The place is perfect for that single or couple who is on a getaway. Great location.  Not to mention your Hostess is impeccable."),
("2016-09-02", "10108388", "Jon", "Desireé the host was very friendly and replied quickly to any questions. The apartment was a little noisy from the road outside but it wasn't a big issue. It has obviously been recently renovated and is very clean. There was tea/coffee and milk which was a convenient touch. I would recommend this Airbnb."),
("2016-09-11", "10108388", "Hye Ryoung", "If you are looking for room with have the best location and the most comfortable room condition  Desireé's room is just what you looking for. It's exactly same as the pictures  super clean  large enough for 1 or 2 person and you need only 3 mins walk from the Museum Station. It's also close to the mart  convenience store and easy to take a taxi. What I love the most is that it's just near the Hyde Park. It means that you could walk there every morning and night with beautiful view. And comfortable bed  clean and large shower booth  big screen TV with Samsung Smart-hub  big dinning table... everything in room was ready for your perfect trip. In addition  Desireé is really kind  good-hearted host. I couldn't meet her but she always answer kindly to my messages and give help everytime :D Don't miss this room!! "),
("2016-09-13", "10108388", "Anne", "Desirée is an excellent host. Quick to respond to questions and most helpful. The accommodation itself is spacious and exceedingly clean/tidy. The location is excellent - near to the Museum train station (direct connection to airport in only 15min) and a very pleasant 15min stroll  via Hyde Park  to Martin's place. I would definitely recommend the accommodation to both business travelers and tourists."),
("2016-09-17", "10108388", "Gabriella", "A lovely  clean and spacious apartment right on Hyde Park. We loved the apartment and the little touches - a hand written note and fresh flowers. Thanks for having us  Desiree"),
("2016-09-22", "10108388", "Janine", "My daughter and I came to Sydney for her medical school interview.  Desiree was an outstanding host - providing detailed instructions on every stage of our stay  including our last day where she kindly offered for us to check out later than the arranged time.  The apartment was immaculate and really did provide a home away from home. You could seriously just turn up at his place as everything is provided for the guest's use. Desiree thought of all the little special touches - from fresh fruit and sparkling water to chocolates and flowers.  The location is fantastic - walking distance to all that Sydney has to offer.   Her guide book and restaurant recommendations were wonderful.  Highly recommended  - better than any hotel stay!  We  will be back again!  Many thanks Desiree"),
("2016-09-29", "10108388", "Shane", "Wow my best Airbnb experience by far. Great location very clean and comfortable. Desireé is a wonderful host and her apartment is just fantastic."),
("2016-10-04", "10108388", "Mai", "Really lovely apartment in a really convenient location. The apartment was really well equipped and beautifully maintained. Probably one of the best Airbnb locations we have ever stayed in…thank you so much for everything Desiree!!"),
("2016-10-08", "10108388", "Alex", "Absolutely divine! Lovely spotless apartment in a fabulous location."),
("2016-10-13", "10108388", "Ruby", "Everything is perfect! Location is great. House was very clean and tidy. Desireé is a very kind  helpful and responsible. Our communication are very smooth  no problem at all. It must be one of my favourite airbnb stay! Thank you for the lovely flowers and chocolates. Highly recommend to stay in Desireé 's place for your next accommodation! "),
("2016-10-21", "10108388", "Stephen", "HiWe had such a great time staying with Desiree.  The flat is perfect and centrally located. We couldn't recommend a better host.Steve and Lucy"),
("2016-10-23", "10108388", "Alfie", "What an amazing apartment! I would highly recommend this apartment! I stayed here with my partner and we had plenty of space. It was in a perfect location right across from Hyde park. I did not use the pool but the apartment does have a roof top heated pool which looked great. Apartment was clean and the bed was comfy. Desireé was a wonderful host and had some lovely touches such as stocking the fridge with beers and provided snacks  fruit and milk etc. the bathroom was also stocked with products and didn't even need to use my own shampoo etc. We also were allowed an early check in and a late check out which was just amazing. I will be staying here again on my next visit. "),
("2016-11-03", "10108388", "Abi", "This was a sensational experience from start to finish. Desireé was exceptionally communicative and helpful  across arrival instructions and helpful hints  to being extremely flexible with my check in and departure times from the property. She was wonderfully generous with items left in the fridge for me to help myself to  and even some lovely fresh flowers for me on arrival. It's a gorgeous apartment right in the hub of the city BUT with the bedroom double glazed I had some of the best nights sleeps here I've had in ages. Terrific stay. Best part? Uber wide screen Tv and free NETFLIX! I loved this apartment. Don't hesitate to book."),
("2016-11-13", "10108388", "Bobbie", "Desiree certainly knows how to make her guests feel welcome. Fresh flowers and chocolates on arrival is an example. Her attention to detail was very much appreciated and one of my best airbnb experiences to date. She was also quick to respond to all queries. The apartment is as shown in the photos and immaculately clean. Dont hesitate to stay here!"),
("2016-11-17", "10108388", "Mariano", "Todo ha sido perfecto! La comodidad del apartamento es aún mejor en vivo que en las fotos. Los detalles y amabilidad de Desiree son grandiosos. Sin duda aconsejo por ubicación y comodidades este apartamento para conocer la preciosa Sydney es perfecto!"),
("2016-11-23", "10108388", "Hilda", "Our host Desiree is fantastic she had everything ready for us.  It was so easy we just turned the key and everything was there.  She kept in contact with me to make sure everything was ok which was very thoughtful.  There was fresh roses in the apartment really lovely touch also lots of groceries like tea bags  coffee  milk etc. which was great after a long flight.  There are even bath robes and lovely fluffy towels The apartment is beautiful very luxurious  we loved it.  It's spotlessly clean  great TV  WIFI  everything you need and more. It's a great location. Very easy to walk around from and also Museum station is right on the door step. It was our first visit to Sydney and should we go back I would love to stay here again.  I can't thank Desiree enough. We were absolutely thrilled with it. Truly 5 star."),
("2016-11-26", "10108388", "Reed", "A lovely  comfortable  well decorated apartment in a great location. Very friendly host. I can't wait to stay again. "),
("2016-12-04", "10108388", "Andrew", "Where do we begin? Desireé is a wonderfully thoughtful host that made our stay so special. The apartment looks exactly as pictured - modern  comfortable and clean. The location is fabulous and central to everything! This apartment does not disappoint! Our only regret is that we didn't stay for longer. We will certainly be back the next time we are in Sydney! Thank you Desireé!"),
("2016-12-09", "10108388", "Judith", "My parents loved Desirée's flat. She had left a hand written note and ferrero rocher as well as beautiful  fresh flowers to make it a special welcome. A perfectly stocked kitchen and tasty tea made it really homely. It was also spotless clean and the African styled furnishings gave it a memorable touch. The house has friendly reception staff and they were helpful with giving directions. The location is sublime as it overlooks Hyde Park which is really close to both parts of the city centre. We highly recommend the flat and would happily stay again in the future. Thanks!"),
("2016-12-14", "10108388", "Laura", "My stay at Desireé's apartment was one of my best experiences yet! She's a phenomenal host and the apartment has everything a traveler could need. It's really a luxury stay. Loved it!!"),
("2017-01-05", "10108388", "Vanessa", "Desiree was a fantastic host with a lovely apartment in a great location in Sydney!"),
("2017-01-13", "10108388", "Christopher", "Centrally located  comfortable  4 star quality  beautifully decorated apartment with everything you could need including a lovely view of Hyde Park. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay and are already looking forward to staying here again. Desireé was helpful and responsive. We miss it already. "),
("2017-01-20", "10108388", "Aika", "Desiree's place was beyond our expectations!! The interior of the home was very clean and modern. The location was perfect for exploring the city  and communication with Desiree was always very clear with quick response. If we ever go back to Sydney we will definitely book with her again!! "),
("2017-01-29", "10108388", "Clara", "The apartment is really well located  a stunning view from the rooftop pool on the Anzac Memorial and the Sydney eye tower. Desireé is helpful and kind! A really good address!"),
("2017-02-02", "10108388", "Katalin", "Loved staying at Your place  great location  20 min walk to Opera House  close to great shopping and dining area...Thank You for the chocolate and the flowers!!!"),
("2017-02-06", "10108388", "Deborah", "Loved this apartment.  It is located across from beautiful Hyde Park.  You can easily walk to the botanical gardens  many museums and art galleries  the opera house and much more.  The apartment itself is beautiful  nicely furnished  has all the amenities you would want including coffee  tea  milk  cookies  fruit and more.  There is a convenience store right next to it.  Desiree could not have been warmer or more helpful. She was available any time we had a question.  We already asked to book another stay and we will recommend her place to friends."),
("2017-02-14", "10108388", "Marie", "This is a very nice condo  location was awesome.  We walked everywhere and went to some of the restaurants Desiree recommended  we were not disappointed.  Had a great stay and most certainly would love to do it again. "),
("2017-02-19", "10108388", "Mike", "The apartment was perfectly located and very lovely.  It's just as nice as the pics  and Desiree was the perfect host.  The neighborhood is wonderful  and the guidebook Desiree provided was very useful.  Definitely go to Messina at least once for gelato (we went twice).  We also loved the ARTERY gallery  and bought some nice gifts for friends back home and even a cool painting that I could carry on to the plane.  Overall a great experience and a perfect spot to end our trip to Australia in style."),
("2017-02-27", "10108388", "Ines", "The appartment is very confortable  very clean and new. It is like it's shown no pictures. Desiree was really helpful and left us the basic stuff for everyday needs  such us coffee  tea  sugar and bathroom supplies. The location is convenient  easy to get from the airport and with lots of buses stops  in a nice area. We had a great time! "),
("2017-03-05", "10108388", "Arbel", "This is best place to stay in Sydney! Just few steps to the Hyde Park. Right in the central area which is easy to travel exploring and food hunting.When we arrived this beautiful apartment. Everything you see make you feel like home. Because we were there for the Sydney gay and lesbian mardi gras. You can watch the parade at the balcony (Best view ever).And we thank you for the host making our trip in Sydney unforgettable."),
("2017-03-09", "10108388", "Mirko", "Best apartment ever  super central in the heart of Sydney  100% recommended  check it out!"),
("2017-03-11", "10108388", "Sarah", "My husband and I had a wonderful time staying in Desireé's beautiful apartment. Would definitely stay again."),
("2017-03-21", "10108388", "Richard", "This is a lovely apartment  in a hotel/serviced apartment building.  For once the pictures really don't do it justice.  The hotel rooms get marked down for being dated in reviews on hotel sites  but this apartment certainly isn't.  It's centrally located: it has Darlinghurst's little strip of restaurants just around the corner  and central Sydney equally close in the other direction.  I was here for a week in March and it (unusually) rained every day  so the 60"" UHD Samsung smart TV with Netflix and Stan (Aussie streaming)  as well as Apple TV  was particularly welcome  as was the small gym on the roof.  The pool was less useful  but would be great normally.  Desireé is a very friendly host too.  Highly recommended."),
("2017-03-24", "10108388", "Ishara", "Desireé’s apartment is the perfect place to explore Sydney city from. Perfectly central to all city sights. The apartment was super clean and neat. It hosts beautiful city views  a quick 5 minute walk to Museum rail station  and a hop to great restaurants and nightlife. The apartment is tastefully decorated with art and books from adventurous travels; furnished and accessorized with absolutely everything that I could require  plus more. I was impressed at the Desireé's thoughtfulness in accommodating her guests needs. Such things as a kind welcome note. Petite chocolates  mini fresh milk packs in the fridge  expresso machine and every conceivable toiletry item one could need inside a bathroom cabinet. Discreetly rolled up extension cords so you never have to look for one to reach the wall socket to charge your digital devices. The bed was comfortable  where sprigs of fragrant lavender greeted us laid upon freshly rolled up towels. We loved our stay and highly recommend Desireé as a host. She communicated well  was always polite and prompt with messaging all required information upon booking. There's no doubt why Desireé has been voted as a super host. You will be delighted."),
("2017-04-06", "10108388", "Annamarie", "This is a wonderful place to stay comfortable and clean easy access and very close to Museum Station and  beautiful Hyde Park. The host is marvelous and provided us with so many wonderful amenities. We would definitely stay here again ."),
("2017-04-15", "10108388", "Corey", "Desireé is a wonderful host. She's easy to contact and responds promptly when you send her an email. Her place is very comfortable and clean. She let us arrive early and we had no problem staying an extra night. We really appreciated that!! Transport to the city and surrounding areas are very close to her place. Great place to walk around lots to see and do. I would definitely stay again :)"),
("2017-04-19", "10108388", "Fay", "Lovely  tastefully designed and very clean apartment in a great location. We had high expectations having read the rave reviews and it certainly did not disappoint. "),
("2017-04-24", "10108388", "Helen", "Desiree was the perfect host.  The apartment is just as it is down on the airbnb site.  Desiree answered our many queries and requests super-quickly and she is very approachable and friendly.  The location is really close to all the CBD attractions and public transport.  Desiree added so many extras like a bottle of wine and chocolates to help us celebrate our milestone anniversary. We would highly recommend this listing. Thanks Desiree!"),
("2017-05-03", "10108388", "Robert", "This apartment is a very nice good place to stay  its in a secure building  The apartment is spotless clean and very well maintained  very comfortable  kitchen is well prepared with stove  oven  fridge  microwave  coffeemaker  watercooker  dishwasser  enough pots and pans etc. Livingroom has a comfortable sofa  salon table  mega big TV with many channels  dining table with 6 chairs  extra lounger  two small balconies  one which has 2 chairs and a table. Bedroom with large bed  desk and big closet  bathroom with sink  shower and toilet. The host had many soaps  shampoos  drinks  coffee  wine and bottled water available for us to use  which was very kind and nice ( Im not sure if this is always there) The host replied always quick to any questions we had. We stayed 8 nights and we will return! Thanks Desiree and Julian!"),
("2017-05-12", "10108388", "Lisa", "Fabulous apartment in the centre of Sydney  we'll appointed and great facilities  pool  gym and pay laundry downstairs. Apartment is just like the photos. Communication with Desiree was fabulous and nothing was a problem. Nice personal touches when we arrived. A great place to stay "),
("2017-05-16", "10108388", "Valerie", "Fantastic! Desireé made the entire stay flawless - sent detailed arrival info days before  had keys waiting for us at the front desk  a bottle of wine waiting upon arrival  and a spotless apartment with all possible amenities. Great home base for a vacation. Public transit just across the street  restaurants are within 10 minutes walk  and a taxi stand is available right next door. Highly recommend. "),
("2017-05-28", "10108388", "Dale", "Very tidy  modern one bed apartment opposite Hyde Park. The location was superb for transportation  local cafes  local cafes and restaurants. Great Wifi  safe and secure. The host Desiree is very helpful and has a lot of extra bits and pieces to make stay more comfortable. Would stay again. "),
("2017-06-05", "10108388", "Jessica", "We had a wonderful stay in Desiree's apartment.  Great location  spotlessly clean and very homely.  Would definitely stay again."),
("2017-06-11", "10108388", "Kathy", "If you are heading to Sydney and want a FANTASTIC place that is central and within walking distance to everywhere  especially Darling Harbour  then please stay at Desiree's apartment.  There is everything you could want close by  especially restaurants and public transport  the airport train is just a few meters away. The apartment has everything you could possibly need and more. Desiree's interest and love of people shines through in everything she does; she goes way beyond being a superhost.  Thank you Desiree for making our stay so special and we can't wait to come back  hopefully when the weather is a little kinder."),
("2017-06-21", "10108388", "Mara", "Great location! Everything is in walking distance and the supermarket is just around the corner. The hosts are always available and very helpful. The apartment is very clean and safe. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2017-06-28", "10108388", "Amy", "Perfect central apartment  walkable to everything you need and very close to public transportation options as well. Desireé was an absolutely fantastic host  stocking the kitchen with the necessities and even a bottle of wine! She communicated everything up front very clearly and had great recommendations in her guidebook. We were very comfortable in the apartment for our stay and would highly recommend to anyone looking to explore the Sydney area! "),
("2017-07-05", "10108388", "Thao", "Desiree and Julian were wonderful hosts. The listing was beautifully decorated. Would absolutely love to stay here again during our next trip to Sydney."),
("2017-07-10", "10108388", "Angus", "This is a lovely apartment for a couple. Well fitted out  a few essentials for eating in and decorated with a very tasteful African theme. During the cool winter evenings  the reverse cycle heaters were fantastic. Traffic noise was well muted by the double glass in the bedroom. Desireé was very communicative through our stay and had provided lots of info about Sydney and what to do  where to eat  etc. "),
("2017-07-16", "10108388", "Ric", "This is a little treasure in the best part of Sydney! Desiree was a great communicator  checking in with us all through our visit to make sure all was good - and it was great! Lovely sized apartment  beautifully appointed and fully of little things to make our stay memorable. "),
("2017-09-02", "10108388", "Graeme", "We spent a very comfortable 8 nights in Desiree's apartment.  It is just as it looks in the pictures.  It is smartly decorated with comfortable furniture and lovely modern kitchen and bathroom.  There is a guest laundry in the building with coin operated machines and you can do a big wash and dry for $4 each.  The apartment is bright and airy and has a nice busy city outlook which we enjoyed.  You can certainly hear the buzz of the city around you but you are right in the CBD so that is to be expected and enjoyed.  The location is fantastic.  You can walk to just about everything in the city centre and trains and buses are only metres away if you want to get around more quickly or go further afield.  Very easy access from the airport by train into Museum station. The host  Desiree  was a pleasure to deal with  excellent communication all the way through.  This is a wonderful little home away from home putting you right into centre of the Sydney action."),
("2017-09-11", "10108388", "Mario", "Eine sehr Zentrum nah gelegene Wohnung. Absolut empfehlenswert um Sydney zu entdecken. Man kann optimal zu Fuß in die Innenstadt und läuft nur kurz durch den Hyde Park. Zum Flughafen sind es auch nur 15 Minuten."),
("2017-09-13", "10108388", "Anne", "Enjoyable repeat stay."),
("2017-09-21", "10108388", "Shiya", "We had a great time here. The host is so generous and thoughtful. One of the best places I've stayed! Highly recommend!!!"),
("2017-09-25", "10108388", "Nolan", "Desirees place was awesome. The room was very clean  internet speed was sufficient  and all the goodies that she provides in the room ( extra toiletries  snacks  and even wine in the kitchen and refrigerator were a great bonus.  The location of the condo was very convenient to get around Sydney.  Lots of restaurants and train stations nearby !!!  Desiree was also very quick at responding to our needs and questions . Overall  5 out of 5 stars for us !!!"),
("2017-10-01", "10108388", "Ivy", "The apartment has great convenience to everything. It suits for tourist. Desiree is helpful and warm hearted."),
("2017-10-13", "10108388", "Karen", "Fab location near Museum train station. Apartment sparkling clean and so many extras e.g butter  beer  wine  bottled water  cereal etc that were much appreciated. Would definitely recommend this apartment."),
("2017-10-26", "10108388", "Janet", "Desiree is an amazing host and had the perfect space for us! It started from wonderful communication to easy early check in. It continued with an immaculate unit that provided us an oasis from our sight seeing. We use Airbnb quite a bit and especially enjoy being able to have a kitchen area for a quick breakfast or meal and morning coffee. The unit was close to grocery  public transport and amenities were as if I had lived there. We were there to celebrate my spouse's 50th birthday and were pleasantly surprised by the nice and thoughtful birthday card. Thank you again and we had a blast!"),
("2017-10-30", "10108388", "Benedicte Et Remi", "The apartment is perfectly located  easy access and walking distance to all attractions. Spotless clean  well appointed and really comfy  the seperate bedroom was great especialy when you are traveling with a baby !Thanks again for our great stay :)"),
("2017-11-04", "10108388", "Sue", "A super place to stay - well appointed  beautifully furnished with great facilities within the building. Going to Sydney contact Desiree.Sue Hillman"),
("2017-11-15", "10108388", "Riett", "The apartment was absolutely as expected. Clean and modern. Lots of great restaurants and shopping close by."),
("2017-11-18", "10108388", "Sofia", "Beautiful apartment  clean  modern  nicely decorated. Centrally located  walking distance from everything we wanted to see. Two balconies with awesome views of Hyde Park and Oxford St. We really felt like we were living the Sydney high life. Plenty of towels  bedding  etc  there was even a bunch of shampoo/conditioner/soap to use and coffee  juice and chocolate for us as well. Desiree’s apartment really felt like a home away from home  will definitely visit again next time we’re in Sydney!"),
("2017-11-22", "10108388", "Sheila", "Desireé’s place is extremely well located  superbly comfortable and sparklingly clean. We would love to stay here on every future visit to Sydney."),
("2017-12-09", "10108388", "Rachael", "This space is great. The size is wonderful for a couple  anything you could need was available. Desireé was so easy to work with. We asked for special accommodations for checking in and out and Desireé was swift in reply as well as considerate in communications! The space is even nicer than it appears in the photos and the location is very convenient to so many attractions."),
("2017-12-18", "10108388", "Tom", "This is an amazing place!  LOVED the amenities of coffee  milk  wine bottle  chocolate bar   great TV  lots and lots of towels  and wonderful location.  We didn't use the rooftop pool  but we should have (busy visiting daughter).   Could not have been happier with this choice.  Thank you Desiree."),
("2018-01-01", "10108388", "Mildred", "Super great stay here!"),
("2018-01-09", "10108388", "Colleen", "This is the perfect location. Just a block from a great transit connection but walkable to the main sites too. It’s easy to get anywhere. We took the bus to Coogee and Bondi beaches  to Sydney Fish Market  to Opera House and ferry hub of Circular Quay for the ferry to Manly.  You are also on subway routes too!The home is quiet even though the street and park are well used.  It feels super safe to walk in.There are great grocery and restaurant options right here...and we were hooked on Greenhouse Coffee just a few blocks down to start our day. We enjoyed the Sydney Festival and walked to their events and free activities. The home had lots of lovely touches and thoughtful additions in the bath  the kitchen and a nice collection of books and info."),
("2018-01-21", "10108388", "Zsófi", "Very nice  stylish place  close to everything  in  quiet environment. Check in was easy."),
("2018-01-29", "10108388", "Stephen", "Stylish decor—thoughtful touches—great communication—\0perfect location!"),
("2018-02-06", "10108388", "Patrizia", "This was our first experience with Airbnb and we have been very lucky to choose Desiree as a host. The apartment is lovely  very clean  confortable and well appointed. The size is perfect for two people and the location is very convenient  in front of Hide Park  easy to be reached by the airport via irport likn train that stops just few steps away. All the main city attractions are at walking distance. Desiree is very kind and supporting. You can easily reach her at any time via e-mail and she answers in a few minutes. Highly  recommended!"),
("2018-02-12", "10108388", "Tom", "Great flat in the heart of Sydney. Photos and description exactly as advertised  and host communication was second-to-none! Would recommend if you want to be able to walk anywhere centrally"),
("2018-02-18", "10108388", "Fiona", "This place is really good!! It has convenient location  basically you can get everything you need within 10 minuets-walk. The hosts are super kind and thoughtful. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-02-23", "10108388", "Ben", "Amazing location  loved the area and easy walk to all major sites. Very nice unit and amazing value."),
("2018-03-04", "10108388", "Mark", "Desiree earns a big tick for hospitality and thoughtfulness. The apartment was exactly as described and couldn't have better suited a weekend Mardi Gras getaway.We'd definitely recommend this place to others and can't rate Desiree's communication and responsiveness highly enough. The apartment was spotless  had all the mod cons you could wish for  was convenient to transport and perfectly located with awesome views."),
("2018-03-10", "10108388", "Amy", "Great communication and thoughtful touches! Will definitely stay together"),
("2018-04-21", "10108388", "Vivian", "Amazing location  the apartment was exactly how it described.  Desiree was very responsive and check in was easy.  Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-03", "10108388", "Miguel", "Beautiful view  gorgeous apartment  and perfect location. Would definitely stay here again the next time I’m in Sydney! Thanks for the wonderful stay  Desireé!"),
("2018-05-14", "10108388", "Josee-Lina", "You will feel at home at Desireé's apartment. Beautifully designed  it is luminous  cosy and perfectly situated in front of Hyde Park; the Museum Station is just a few steps away and many bus stops are just downstairs. It' s easy to go anywhere you wish  thanks to the perfect location.And Desireé is a real superhost: Quick to answer my inquiries  she gave me valuable advice during my stay. I recommend strongly this apartment: You will enjoy even more your stay in Sydney (and won't want to leave...). Many thanks Desireé!"),
("2018-05-20", "10108388", "Katherine", "Desireé and Julian’s apartment was a perfect place to explore Sydney from - and delicious Darlinghurst restaurants nearby. They had thought of everything  and we really appreciated the homely touches. The bed is very comfy  there is plenty of wardrobe space  and a comfy couch when a night in is in order. Despite the location right near Hyde Park  it is very quiet and we were not bothered by any noise during our stay. Desireé and Julian were lovely hosts and we appreciated the clear directions and easy check-in and check-out. We would love to stay here again when we’re in Sydney again!"),
("2018-05-28", "10108388", "Tiffany", "I have stayed at Desiree’s place twice now as I travel for work and it’s one of my favourite Sydney accomodation venues. It’s is absolutely spotless  secure  quiet and the most convenient location. Desiree is an excellent and attentive host - this place deserves every great review it gets and more"),
("2018-06-17", "10108388", "Juliet", "Desiree's place was very comfortable & was perfectly located for my trip to Sydney. I came for the Sydney Film Festival  and the apartment was well located on Hyde Par  so I could walk to and from the venue. The studio was very comfortable and well stocked too - the little things such as tea  milk  spreads for breakfast etc were thoughtful. Picking up and dropping off the keys were a breeze and whilst I did not meet my host  she was very responsive and helpful. I can highly recommend this place for a city based jaunt. Thanks again Desiree"),
("2018-06-25", "10108388", "Rebecca", "Really lovely apartment in a fantastic location. The double glazing in the bedroom and super comfy bed meant we slept like a log  and the rest of the apartment is stylish and very comfortable. As per previous reviews  Desiree's thoughtful touches  excellent communication and brilliant local recommendations really shines and elevates the whole experience to something very special. We stayed with our toddler  and the building/apartment has excellent pram accessibility. "),
("2018-07-10", "10108388", "João", "Great apartment in an excellent locations  close to public transportation and countless cafes and dinner spots. Desiree was always super quick to reply and available at all times to meet our requests. We would definitely stay here again if returning to Sydney!"),
("2018-07-23", "10108388", "Terry", "A great convenient location to stay for visitors to Sydney with a great host."),
("2018-08-01", "10108388", "Ross", "Great location and a very nicely presented apartment."),
("2018-08-10", "10108388", "Bronwyn", "Such a great apartment  super host and fantastic holiday!!!  Keeps in contact and replies to messages super fast"),
("2018-08-23", "10108388", "Sean", "Desireé’s apartment is great! It's clean  well lit  comfortable  and located in a great part of Sydney. Desireé is a great host and an excellent communicator. I would love to stay here again! "),
("2018-08-26", "10108388", "Zunilka", "Do yourself a favour  if this place is free  book it!! Stunning. Thanks so much"),
("2018-09-06", "10108388", "Helen", "Wonderful base for my visiting parents. Desireé was so helpful and conscientious and I can’t recommend her apartment enough."),
("2018-09-18", "10108388", "Helen", "Desireé was the perfect host for my parents on their return to Sydney after staying in her apartment the previous week. She was fast to respond to queries and the apartment had lots of thoughtful touches and was in a great location. Definitely would use this when they visit again."),
("2018-09-29", "10108388", "Adam", "Fantastic unit  very central. Lots of amenities."),
("2018-10-06", "10108388", "Sean", "Location  location  location!In the heart of the city  close to transport  close to cafes and restaurants and walking distance to CBD.Hotels are good  Airbnb’s are great!"),
("2018-10-11", "10108388", "Karyn", "This apartment is a wonderful place to stay in Sydney. It is very stylish and comfortable. The location is near transport  shops  cafes and restaurants. Having access to a kitchen also gave me the option of cooking a light meal if I didn't feel like going out."),
("2018-10-22", "10108388", "Pam", "Desiree’s apartment was wonderful. Beautifully furnished  sparkling clean  fabulous location and many thoughtful touches. The location is amazing and i would stay there any time I am in Sydney. Thank you for sharing your home Desireé and your thoughtfulness!"),
("2018-10-25", "10108388", "Stéphanie", "Very good location. Incredible host  Desiree helped us out with everything and responded really fast. Everything we needed was at the appartment."),
("2018-10-30", "10108388", "Judy", "Beautiful rental  perfect location to attractions  busses  restaurants and so much more. Owners go above and beyond."),
("2018-11-09", "10108388", "Lisa", "A wonderfully stylish and authentic apartment. Perfect location. Lots of lovely books to read and thoughtful touches. The hosts are fantastic. I would hope to stay there if ever we are in Sydney again."),
("2018-11-17", "10108388", "Nevet", "we had such a great stay. the location is super  the host is flexible and accomodating and the appartment is sooooo nice plus  plus  plus"),
("2018-11-20", "10108388", "Kyle", "This flat was absolutely perfect! It was located right across from Hyde Park with a beautiful view. It was very central to everything we wanted to do in Sydney. She also left us chocolate  coffee  milk and other food for us which was so lovely to come to. We traveled very far and were immediately impressed by the lovely accommodation and personal touch of Desiree’s flat. I would highly recommend this apartment if coming to Sydney for a city break!"),
("2018-11-24", "10108388", "Aleks", "Wonderfully appointed apartment. Centrally located and a lovely host"),
("2018-11-29", "10108388", "Anne", "Desiree’s place was absolutely perfect for our time spent in Sydney. Amazing location and everything you could need! Highly recommend staying here while in Sydney!"),
("2018-12-11", "10108388", "은혜", "위치가 매우 좋았고  청결하고 집도 넓고 쾌적했어요! 그리고 호스트가 매우매우 친절했습니다"),
("2019-01-12", "10108388", "Mary", "Desireé apartment is so centrally - ideal location! The apartment is a real home from home & has everything you need.Desireé is a super host  very easy to checkin & out. We loved our stay here & didn’t want to leave. :)"),
("2019-01-20", "10108388", "David", "My wife and I had a lovely time staying at Desiree’s apartment. Was very close to public transportation to get around the city. Apartment was very clean and comfortable for our stay. Desireé was very prompt in any communication before and during our stay. Highly recommend."),
("2019-01-28", "10108388", "Matthew", "This AirBnB is not to be missed! Home was very clean and there were thoughtful touches upon check in. I arrived very late at night and the check in process was quick and easy. The host had amazing and quick responses during my stay - great communication. The apartment has 2 balconies which allow loads of sunlight into the space when the curtains are pulled back. Great location for Ubers  Taxis  walks in the park. I stayed for business and I walked to the CBD within 15 minutes - easy. I will definitely stay again!"),
("2019-02-06", "10108388", "Dave", "The moment you enter this Airbnb you realize this is a host who cares.  Chocolate on the coffee table  cold water in the fridge  cereal on the shelf  and roses in the bedroom greeted us.  Nine floors up you can hear the street noise but the bedroom is surprisingly quiet.  The location is near the metro and walkable to the waterfront.  This home and its location were perfect for our 6 night stay.  Would happily return on our next trip to Sydney."),
("2019-02-22", "10108388", "Joyce", "This city sized apartment was wonderful.   Very clean  well stocked with most everything you need.   Located around grocery stores  pharmacies  shops  restaurants and bars.  Great location for exploring Sydney   buses and trains within 5 minutes  walking distance to circular quay. Street noise was remarkably low in the bedroom. The only shortcoming was the internet connection   very spotty if more than one device was was connected.   We would definitely stay here upon our return to Darlinghurst."),
("2019-03-06", "10108388", "Joe", "I highly recommend Desiree's place to anyone visiting Sydney.  It's convenient  clean  and very comfortable.  Desiree was an outstanding host.  She was communicative  helpful  and went above and beyond.  I hope to return."),
("2016-01-23", "10213499", "Ian", "Very happy with my stay here. Tracy was really friendly and everything went smoothly. It's a great little place in a fantastic spot. The lake is sublime. Highly recommended."),
("2016-02-07", "10213499", "Caroline", "Great welcome"),
("2016-02-08", "10213499", "David", "This was a terrific studio  with every little detail considered. Beautiful location across from the lake and a very private studio. Made to feel very welcome by Tracey and would highly recommend!"),
("2016-02-15", "10213499", "Kishan", "Lovely place! Very friendly and accomodating"),
("2016-02-18", "10213499", "Natalia", "We enjoyed our stay at Tracy's house. It was spotlessly clean  and we loved swimming in her lovely pool.It is located close to the beach  lakes and parks. So perfect for people who want to chill out and relax.We also made a new friend with her Hungarian Vizsla dog.Thank you for having us."),
("2016-02-27", "10213499", "Michael", "This is a fantastic situation. Located right across the street from the lake. Tracy offered us bicycles to use on the lake path. The apartment has everything you need and is very spacious. Short drive to the ocean beach for surfing and swimming. Kitchen well equipped. Tracy was very informative and engaging. We really enjoyed our stay!"),
("2016-02-29", "10213499", "Claire", "This was my first time staying in an AirBnB  and it couldn't have been better. Lovely  clean and quiet accommodation  welcoming host and many little things that made the experience enjoyable. As an AirBnB newbie  I wasn't really sure on the protocols for communicating etc. However  Tracy made me feel relaxed and at home. She has a gorgeous  friendly dog and the place is immaculate - she had also left some fresh fruit  juice and water which was super-welcome after arriving on a fairly late flight. All the linens  towels etc were of high quality  and the shower is fantastic!  No air-con  but it's a shady spot and the fan was fine  even on two warm summer evenings.If you are in Narrabeen to stay for any length of time  I can highly recommend this as your perfect home away from home."),
("2016-03-03", "10213499", "Nicholas", "Tracy and her husband were very welcoming and the room was very comfortable."),
("2016-03-06", "10213499", "Anna", "This was my first AirBnB experience and I am glad it was a good one. I couldn't have picked a better host and apartment.Tracy and her family are great hosts. The space was as described - the bed was comfy and the pool area was very relaxing. Could have stayed by the pool all day! There was a lovely selection of teas and some Orange Juice and fruit. While I didn't use much of the kitchen utensils - looked like there was everything you needed to make a nice meal if you were staying longer or wanted to cook.The location is beautiful - easy to walk by Narrabeen lake. Tracy was very flexible and welcoming and easy to communicate with. A very easy experience overall."),
("2016-03-20", "10213499", "Christian", "Perfect studio for a beachy getaway. Went away with the girlfriend and was well suited for a couple. The studio had everything you could need. Had foxtel with IQ which was was a supprise. Was close enough to walk to the beach or pub. Quick to respond to questions. Nothing to fault!"),
("2016-03-29", "10213499", "Gil", "Thank you Tracy.  We had a most enjoyable stay. You live in a beautiful area with great access to the lake  the surf  public transport and all the wonderful facilities of Narrabeen.  The apartment is neat  clean and well appointed . We especially enjoyed eating our breakfast on the balcony while enjoying views of the lake and the beautiful tropical garden.  A great stay  thank you"),
("2016-04-05", "10213499", "Jodie", "Absolutely perfect! Great location opposite the lake  bikes to borrow and Tracy went out of her way to accommodate me! Thank-you  I loved it. "),
("2016-04-26", "10213499", "Sabrina", "My in laws had a pleasant stay. The place was clean  well equipped  has really comfy bed. Thanks. "),
("2016-04-29", "10213499", "Alice", "The place was gorgeous  Tracy was so helpful and brought me down a blanket when I was cold. The area was lovely and in a very safe suburb. Everything you need was there and the bed and couch were super comfy. Thanks Tracy!"),
("2016-05-02", "10213499", "Kimberley", "Really enjoyed our stay- the place was lovely and close to the lake  which we went for a walk around following the track-8k walk in total.Couple of restaurants and cafes near by. We had a hire car so ideal Location for us to explore all the northern beaches and near by Dee why. Tracey was friendly and thoughtful sending through a wonderful recommendation to a place in Newport for dinner/drinks when we were passing through the area!Great trip "),
("2016-05-05", "10213499", "Alice", "Had another lovely and relaxing stay. Everything I needed was there and Tracy even thought to put an extra blanket in my bed before I came to make sure I was warm during the night. Had a lovely walk along the lake and was close to everything I needed. Thanks again Tracy!"),
("2016-05-26", "10213499", "Samantha", "Great Studio  perfect location  had everything we needed. Tracy was lovely  really welcoming. The directions were great  it was easy to find. Would certainly look to book if we ever needed to stay in the area again.  "),
("2016-05-29", "10213499", "Alex", "Fantastic apartment in beautiful Narrabeen. We stayed here while moving out of our nearby apartment and it was perfect. had everything you would need for a fantastic holiday stay just footsteps from the lake. Quiet spot and very private and inside was clean modern and well equipped. Tracy was really easy to communicate with and a great host :) we would definitely stay again."),
("2016-06-02", "10213499", "Robert", "Tracy and Rod were brilliant hosts and pre-trip and during my stay made sure I had everything I needed. The apartment was fantastic and had everything I needed. Wonderful location and completely private. Would stay there again!"),
("2016-06-09", "10213499", "Lisa", "Tracy is a great host  very accomodating and friendly! This place is amazing  your own one bedroom apartment  right across from Narrabeen lake and 10 minute walk to Narrabeen beach and shops. It has everything you need to stay in with a kitchenette  lounge area  heater and extra blankets  even wifi and foxtel! Thanks for having us  we really enjoyed your place. It's perfection :)"),
("2016-06-25", "10213499", "Raja", "We had a great experience at Tracy's place in Narrabeen. The apartment was a great size and located just off of Narrabeen lake. We would definitely recommend staying here and would do so again!"),
("2016-07-16", "10213499", "Simon", "A nice location near Narrabeen Lagoon. There is a lovely path through the forest along the lake to the Sydney Academy of Sport where I attended a few days of training as part of an aikido winter school.Tracy made us (including wife and three-year-old daughter) feel right at home. She was also kind enough to lend me one of her bicycles for the time we spent there."),
("2016-07-24", "10213499", "Tom", "The facilities were all as expected  convenient and would consider staying again if in same location"),
("2016-10-31", "10213499", "Gil", "We had another wonderful stay with Tracy at Narabeen. The well appointed apartment  the tranquil environment and the beautiful lake make it a perfect place to stay."),
("2016-11-10", "10213499", "Andrew", "what a lovely space. Quiet location away from City hustle and bustle. Close to lake  beach and restaurants. Tracy   thank you. You have a delightful place. Nice getaway pad. Great bed  a TV that actually works. Tracy was wonderfully chatty and friendly  a great hostess. Love the gorgeous puppy Sari- very friendly.Highly recommend !!"),
("2016-11-12", "10213499", "Tess", "Very welcoming and super accommodating"),
("2017-01-04", "10213499", "Louise", "Our stay at Tracy's studio in Narabeen was a delight. We were very comfortable and everything we needed was there. The balcony was a great place to sit and read and listen to the birds. Sari (the dog) was an added bonus. She is such a well behaved dog and I loved it when she appeared to say hello. All amenities are close by. Walk to cafes  restaurants and the beach. On my next visit to Sydney I hope Tracy's studio will be available. Tracy is a great host and very accommodating. We felt very ""at home"" staying there.Louise and Patrick (Perth)"),
("2017-01-30", "10213499", "Jill", "Great location by Narrabean lake  lovely walk through to local shops  Restaurants  and public transport. Tracy's place was lovely  compact  but everything we needed for a very comfortable stay."),
("2017-02-23", "10213499", "Veda", "This studio is in a fantastic location that's minutes walk from beautiful Narrabeen Lagoon  cafes  shops  and restaurants. Tracy is a very friendly and helpful host and  if you're a dog owner like me  the gorgeous (and very sweet) Sari was a bonus to have around while I was away from home."),
("2017-03-12", "10213499", "Wendy", "Highly recommended"),
("2017-03-17", "10213499", "Emma", "Tracy's studio is a great space for a single person or couple and is very well appointed with everything you might need for a stay in NarrabeenTracy was very accommodating and friendlyI would recommend this nicely decorated apartment for anyone needing somewhere to stay"),
("2017-04-06", "10213499", "Katrina", "Great bed  excellent cooking facilities  quiet  close to all amenities and transport  everything you need and then add a sociable dog  (if you like to take one for a walk) a lake  beach and the occasional chat and you have Tracy's place! A perfect spot for two"),
("2017-05-26", "10213499", "Jodie", "Tracy's place s in a lovely area   close to the lake and a couple of blocks from the beach .The unit was really comfortable and had everything needed for a quick getaway . Tracy and her husband were very accomodating and it was lovely to meet them both. Thanks for a great stay Jodie :)"),
("2017-07-26", "10213499", "Paul", "The host canceled this reservation 150 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-10-01", "10213499", "Lalena", "Tracy's wee unit was lovely & clean  Tracy is a fantastic host and went above and beyond to help us out!"),
("2017-10-06", "10213499", "Petra", "Tracy's little apartment is a lovely place to stay if you're looking for some peace and relaxation but also not far away from the hustle and bustle. We enjoyed walking and riding around to explore the lake  coffee shops and speciality stores. If you're around on a Friday pop over to the markets - you won't be disappointed."),
("2018-03-07", "10213499", "Elenice", "There's a beautiful lake for a nice walk  so peaceful and lovely."),
("2018-09-27", "10213499", "Rohan", "Great spot. Recommended."),
("2018-10-01", "10213499", "Silke", "A great place to stay- highly recommended! Perfect location and beautifully presented."),
("2018-10-07", "10213499", "Myrl", "A great location if you wish to stay on the Northern Beaches. Very comfortable accommodation and you can park off the street.  The unit was clean and comfortable. Access to cafes and the beach just down the road."),
("2018-10-14", "10213499", "Jessica", "We really enjoyed our stay at Tracy's studio - it was very clean and comfortable  and we particularly appreciated having such a well equipped kitchen. Tracy's place is only a minute's walk to Narrabeen Lake  and also very close to local shops. A perfect place to stay to explore the northern beaches  or just to relax. Thanks again Tracy!"),
("2018-10-21", "10213499", "Leda", "A lovely quiet/tranquil location  close to the lagoon/lake  sea  cafes  Narrabeen Lagoon park and walks.Beautifully decorated  clean and spacious with every amenity needed.  Lots of extras added to make your stay easy.  Milk in the fridge  pantry items  umbrellas  torches  high quality toiletries  Foxtel  wifi etc.  Beautiful flowers and plants to make the area brighter  surrounded by greenery to make your stay feel private and like a retreat.  Lovely artwork and beach themed decor to make the place feel like home at the beach.Lots of off road parking and a very safe area to go for walks and enjoy the lake.  Highly recommend."),
("2018-10-24", "10213499", "Marc", "Clean  cosy and easily accessible.   A very very well priced accommodation for 1-2 people on the northern beaches"),
("2018-10-28", "10213499", "Andy", "Would highly recommend staying at Tracy's place. Such a great self contained spot. Only wish we couldve stayed longer!"),
("2018-11-07", "10213499", "Katrina", "This is a lovely little studio that is attractive  comfortable  and provides everything you could want. A great location  private  close to the lagoon  shops  cafes  beach and public transport.Tracy is a helpful and friendly host."),
("2018-11-10", "10213499", "Kate", "Tracy’s place had everything we could ever need for a little getaway from the city. It’s surrounded by a beautiful lagoon and is literally 7 minutes away from the beach (by foot). The place is sparkling clean  cozy  and very private. The kitchen is so well equipped! We loved having Sari pop by (the lovely vizsla) from time to time. Tracy is such a great host. She is always willing to help out or let you know what’s happening in the area. It was so convenient to borrow the bikes and ride to the rock pool or any of the beaches along the coast. Tracy’s place is a gem. We will definitely come back some time."),
("2018-11-12", "10213499", "Lara", "Such a fabulous spot!  Wonderful host. Everything you could hope for. I highly recommend."),
("2018-11-15", "10213499", "Ann", "Beautiful tropical surrounds. Pretty and private space and very well appointed. Has everything you need for a great stay. Nice and quiet and close enough to walk to main centre."),
("2018-11-16", "10213499", "Tessa", "_"),
("2018-11-17", "10213499", "Kim", "Clean  private & great host - we recommend the ‘cubby’ for a stay"),
("2018-11-20", "10213499", "Gail", "A lovely place to stay. Easy parking and Tracy has thought of everything."),
("2018-11-23", "10213499", "Rhiannon", "Loved it. Such a great location. Highly recommended. Great host."),
("2018-11-25", "10213499", "Tara", "A really nice space! Very close to the beach too."),
("2018-11-28", "10213499", "John", "Great space and location. Great value. I will definitely stay again."),
("2018-11-29", "10213499", "Simon", "Great place. Would stay again. Lots of extras. Great communication"),
("2018-12-06", "10213499", "Scott", "Amazing place  and even more amazing host. The place was ready earlier than expected. Great value"),
("2018-12-08", "10213499", "Sharon", "Wonderful host  lovely space  great location. This property has it all."),
("2018-12-09", "10213499", "Poppy Joy", "Perfect  exactly what you need. Great location  everything you could want."),
("2018-12-13", "10213499", "Joel", "Great space and host. Loved our greeting from Sari on arrival. Will definitely stay again"),
("2019-01-05", "10213499", "Steven", "lovely place with everything you’d want for a short or longer stay"),
("2019-01-06", "10213499", "Nicole", "What a stunning studio. Tracy has thought of everything. I loved my stay and hope to return"),
("2016-02-01", "10552362", "Lizzie", "Beautiful place in a Great Location.Perfect host  Harry was very flexible to requests and punctuatal with replying. On arrival we met Harry's girlfriend - also lovely who was super helpful and stayed in contact with us the wholeWeekend for any thing we needed. "),
("2016-02-22", "10552362", "Graham", "The host canceled this reservation 11 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-02-10", "10416859", "Rick", "The host canceled this reservation 73 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-11-19", "10416859", "Elias", "super comfortable room  great location (few min from manly wharf by bus or a fantastic walk on manly scenic walk). Safe neighbourhood and quiet. Leslie and Eric are great people and have a great family. Thanks very much!  I look forward to catching up again next time I am in Sydney. Elias"),
("2016-12-08", "10416859", "Jean-Gab", "We spend  4 perfect days ! Helpfull and guestfull !  I recommande !"),
("2016-12-11", "10416859", "Callum", "We were warmly welcomed as friends when we arrived. It was very easy to talk with Leslie and Eric. The beds were very comfortable and the bathroom was clean  the shower was very good. The location was very handy to the remarkable Manly and the ferries allowed us to get to the city. The weather was lovely warm during our stay. the views from the balcony was spectacular."),
("2016-12-13", "10416859", "Lorraine", "Very clean and confortable. Nice view on the bay."),
("2017-02-05", "10416859", "Denny And Joanne", "The home  location and experience staying with Leslie and her family for 2 nights far exceeded our expectations. We had a fabulous introduction to Sidney  as this was our first visit to the area. The home was as described and her family was gracious  engaging and very helpful. We will return without a question the next opportunity that we have to visit the Sidney area!Thank you Leslie!"),
("2017-03-06", "10416859", "Marco", "Leslie  Eric and your family are lovely people. we have provided anything we needed. their home is very spacious fit to stay whether on holiday or for work. the bus stop is within walking distance from home. Balgalowah is very beautiful and is very close to Manly. Thank you!"),
("2017-03-18", "10416859", "Nicolas", "Great house with an amazing view over Manly Harbour  lovely room and Leslie and her family made us feel at home. They gave us everything we needed including the Opal cards.A bit far from the city but was worth it for the quality and price!"),
("2017-03-22", "10416859", "John", "Leslie and her family were very welcoming and the accomodation was perfect for me. I stayed 2 nights on business and would happily stay again."),
("2017-03-25", "10416859", "Paolo", "Leslie's place is located in a quiet and family friendly suburb not too far from Manly and the city. The room  located in the basement  is large  with lots of privacy. The house has an incredible harbour/ocean view. Leslie and her family are friendly and full of character. We would definitely suggest this accomodation to anyone visiting Sydney. "),
("2017-04-05", "10416859", "Elliot", "Fantastic area in manly with great beaches and towns. Easy access to city and a nice breakfast included!"),
("2017-04-07", "10416859", "Ben", "Loved it. Great family home"),
("2017-04-25", "10416859", "Felix", "Die Unterkunft ist in gute Lage  nahe zu Hotspot von Manly. Die Fotos zeigen die schöne Aussicht auf das Meer  dich das ist nicht diejenige vom Zimmer aus. Dieses hat gar keine Aussicht / Fenster Es gibt einige Verbeserungsmöglichkeiten"),
("2017-05-08", "10416859", "Tammy", "Value for money stay in a lovely house. Leslie made us feel very welcome and a fantastic base for exploring Sydney."),
("2017-05-19", "10416859", "Mehdi", "We stayed 2night in Leslie's accommodation it was a lovely place. Leslie was really friendly and we appreciated the accommodation and what a beautiful view."),
("2017-05-21", "10416859", "Bronwyn", "Spacious self-contained apartment and wonderfully hosted. Leslie and her family were very welcoming  and offered next level service in a stunning location. Having breakfast on their balcony  overlooking the water and moored boats was a highlight of my trip. I will definitely stay again  thank you for the toothpaste rescue!! "),
("2017-05-24", "10416859", "Van", "Very lovely home with a beautiful view of the harbour . Would recommend to anyone visiting sydney."),
("2017-05-25", "10416859", "Elliott", "Leslie's place was very nice  spacious  and clean! The whole bottom floor made it feel as if it were our own place  and it was nice to meet others from Texas while traveling. Would highly recommend if in the north!"),
("2017-05-29", "10416859", "Wexner", "Excellent host and a spacious room with a great view with the harbour! Convenient to get around with a car too."),
("2017-06-06", "10416859", "Mary", "Leslie's family home is close to the bus line and ferry; an hour ride from the airport and a thirty minute commute to Sydney Harbor.   The room has plenty of sleeping quarters  the bathroom is stocked with all essentials (shampoo  conditioner  body  wash  hair dryer)  and  breakfasts are light and delicious.   Having a refrigerator  microwave tea and coffee pot are helpful; and a washing machine within the unit is terrific.  The family accommodated all are requests; we traveled some days as two persons and some days we had three persons.  Leslie helped us with restaurant suggestions and paths to walk.  "),
("2017-06-10", "10416859", "Madeleine", "Leslie was very accomodating  house was comfortable  clean and spacious. Great value for money. Would recommend. "),
("2017-06-12", "10416859", "Cerissa", "Leslie was very accommodating and provided all the information needed. The room was nice and cozy. Towels  toiletries  etc. were provided. The room had it's own bathroom and washing machine. The room also had its own entrance. Their home was also a few steps away from the Manly Scenic walk which was great. It was also near the bus stop. We would highly recommend Leslie's place. "),
("2017-06-17", "10416859", "Jocylyn", "The apartment was great. It is away from the city area  and in a little town  away from all the noise. The balcony view is great. The room is very cosy with everything you need. There is a washing machine as well. Breakfast was great and communicating with Leslie was very easy and accurate. She was very accommodating and understanding. There is a bus stop nearby that allows us to take the bus to the city. There is a comes supermarket nearby too.Thank you Leslie and family. We'll miss you!"),
("2017-06-19", "10416859", "Michiel", "We really enjoyed our stay here and would definitely recommend to stay here."),
("2017-06-21", "10416859", "David", "Leslie's unit was comfortable  clean and well equipped for travellers. Breakfast! The best ever! Leslie was very kind and friendly.  I strongly recommend Leslie's place."),
("2017-06-25", "10416859", "Neal", "We loved the location  with amazing views of the bay from the deck. The coastal walk to the Manly ferry terminal was delightful and the ride across the Harbour spectacular. We took the bus back to the house from Manly and that was very easy with buses running every 10 minutes.  The apartment was perfect for 3 of us with a small fridge  TV  washing machine and  milk  coffee and tea provided.  We were very comfortable. One really nice touch was the  amazing breakfasts Leslie made for us. Thanks so much.  We highly recommend this place"),
("2017-06-27", "10416859", "Shelly", "Leslie's hospitality was perfect  my friend and I felt very comfortable. We are on a road trip at the moment and have stayed at a few AirBnB and Leslie's is the best so far! Thank you for everything you have done for us "),
("2017-06-30", "10416859", "Karan", "Would recommend if you need a place to crash and experience Sydney. Checking out the buses to the Manly Wharf and the Ferry to the CBD was a thrilling experience. No need for a car to drive around. There are nearby restaurants and Supermarkets for convenience as well as a lovely complementary breakfast provided by the host."),
("2017-07-03", "10416859", "Olga", "It was a good spot to stay for exploring the Manly & Northern Beaches area. Our hosts were very friendly and helpful  and it's obvious they enjoy the company of others."),
("2017-07-04", "10416859", "Ruth", "Leslie's place was very cozy and clean.  It had all that we needed and more.  Leslie and her family were very welcoming and helpful.  Our family really enjoyed our short stay."),
("2017-07-07", "10416859", "Melinda", "We really enjoyed our stay with Leslie and her family. My son was delighted that Leslie's son is a talented jazz musician and they ended up playing some jazz together. It was a very good start to our few days with them. The basement is quite spacious and doesn't feel like a basement  as it is beautifully decorated with Leslie's son's artwork.  I enjoyed my morning tea and fruit provided by Leslie on the deck with a quintessential Australian view; a kookaburra sitting on a nearby television aerial and the Manly ferries on the harbour. A perfect way to start the day! We would love to return and I recommend anyone considering staying to do so."),
("2017-07-08", "10416859", "Mary", "Leslie's home is definitely one that my family and I would love to revisit! It was perfect for an intimate quality time spent with family in the basement studio. While noises of upstairs and neighbour's dogs was audible on occasion  it did not affect our stay. Beds were comfortable and we still got a good night's rest.  The TV entertainment and wifi access was helpful and the stunning views overlooking the sails is second to none!! Leslie's complimentary breakfast was exceptional and her and her family made our stay feel like home - if not  better than our home in fact! Thank you again! "),
("2017-07-12", "10416859", "Cathy", "Great to have opal cards for transport and free parking. Very nice view from deck and lovely breakfast.  Cant beat the price with all the benefits."),
("2017-07-19", "10416859", "Tram", "We stayed for at Leslie's for 7 nights and it was perfect. The location was great & the home had a beautiful view! The room was spacious  bright & clean & had everything we needed. Perfect for the 2 of us as well as a 5 year old. Leslie was so accommodating and she was a great host! Perfect location & we look forward to staying here again soon!"),
("2017-07-26", "10416859", "Francesca", "Our stay at Leslie's place was great and all we needed.The room has all the necessities we needed and all was as described.We ended up being on the go most of the time and for that it was a perfect place for us to stay: close to the bus stop and the ferry station in manly as well.Would stay again!"),
("2017-08-05", "10416859", "Harry", "Leslie was zeer behulpzaam en erg vriendelijk  locatie is fantastisch met een prachtig uitzicht op de haven...."),
("2017-08-06", "10416859", "Dylan", "Check in was very easy  the studio was well maintained (although ceiling heights are low  and the lights are fluorescent). The host was excellent with communication and the location is excellent."),
("2017-09-17", "10416859", "Mohamad Aziz", "Really nice place with great view. Would love to stay again!"),
("2017-09-22", "10416859", "Fedora", "Lovely and clean studio  the host was great - very fast in response and friendly. Would definitely recommend to stay :)"),
("2017-09-24", "10416859", "Nicole", "Leslie was very lovely and accommodating. The room was tidy  the bed comfortable and it was exactly what we needed for our short overnight stay. I would definitely recommend a stay here! Thanks again."),
("2017-09-28", "10416859", "Amy", "Have a beachy holiday in Sydney at Leslie's lovely place. A beautiful walk to the ferry along the bay or a handy bus just down the road make this a great base. We slept well here in the lovely place."),
("2017-09-30", "10416859", "Fiona", "Fantastic location  lovely family  great balance of hospitality and privacy. Will definitely be back."),
("2017-10-05", "10416859", "Irene", "Fantastic place to stay. Private  very clean  excellent location and very good value. Would definitely stay there again and probably will. Family friendly and had helpful advice. Very good for Northern Beaches transport and experience."),
("2017-10-07", "10416859", "Linley", "Loved our stay in lovely AirBNB located in the central  delightful  suburb of Balgowlah. Views beautiful  bed very comfortable & bus stop very handy."),
("2017-10-11", "10416859", "Glen", "Fantastic budget accommodation  great location  close to shops and public transport  quiet area  comfy bed   slept well"),
("2017-10-13", "10416859", "Amy", "Could not recommend this place more highly! Travelling solo with my 3 month old daughter this place was a little piece of home! Immaculately cleaned and well thought out. Small touches like a bath robe  clothes washing and drying facilities  Apple TV and Netflix - all added to the experience! Close to supermarket and shopping centre and bus to Manly. Hosts were friendly and helpful - even letting me store my bags after check out! Sincerely enjoyed my stay. Only downfall is that I wasn't able to stay longer!!Thanks again Leslie!"),
("2017-10-14", "10416859", "Mingyoung", "It was great place to relaxGreat viewBut nothing much to do near the houseBut if u have a car even if you dont  its only 10mins away by bus to Manly"),
("2017-10-19", "10416859", "Dylan", "Fantastic place.  Fantastic host."),
("2017-10-27", "10416859", "Gwenaelle", "Un petit coin sympa  avec des balades au bord de mer toute proche  la vue de la maison est superbe  la chambre à tous se qu'il faut."),
("2017-11-03", "10416859", "Maricel", "Convenient location in a beautiful  quiet and safe neighborhood.  Buses to Manly or to the city are a 5-minute walk away.  Leslie and her husband Eric were very accommodating  helpful and responsive hosts.  The place is clean and comfy.  We enoyed our stay here  and highly recommend this place."),
("2017-11-04", "10416859", "Lyn", "A simple  clean room with galley kitchen facilities (including dishwasher  fridge and induction cook plates (rather than a stove persay) and a good size bathroom.  We were only there one night  so didn't get to experience either the room or the magnificent view (due to poor weather) to any great extent  or the other nice touches like the provided Opal cards.  The beds were comfy and warm.  Loved the spare toothbrush - as I actually forgot to pack mine!  There are quite a few stairs to contend with but this is pointed out in the dossier (that I failed to read carefully).  Also a quiet neighbourhood.  Leslie responded to any query we had very quickly.  A very good first up Airbnb experience."),
("2017-11-12", "10416859", "Claire", "Great value for money. Very large  clean studio. Leslie was a superb host  friendly and reliable. Beautiful view from the balcony. I would recommend for an affordable stay in Northern Beaches."),
("2017-11-18", "10416859", "Ingrid", "Large studio space in a great location with views to the water out the kitchen window. Leslie was a very helpful  friendly host and the studio was clean and well equipped with a comfy bed! Guests should be aware that you can hear muffled noise and voices from the room above the studio."),
("2017-11-27", "10416859", "Emma", "In a very nice and quiet area  Leslie’s house is very comfortable  clean  well-equipped with everything you might need. Close to public transports to the city and to the beach as well. Leslie and her family were very nice and helpful. I would definitely recommed staying at their place!"),
("2017-11-28", "10416859", "Scott", "A great place to spend the night with a beautiful view :)"),
("2017-12-02", "10416859", "Johnny", "Simply one of the best place  well equipped  in a nice quiet neighborhood. Close to Manly Wharf. We loved the stay a lot."),
("2017-12-09", "10416859", "Danielle", "Great hosts! Warm & welcoming. Such a great roomy space- and with a view too!"),
("2017-12-18", "10416859", "Tracy", "Our stay at this airbnb in Manley is highly recommended! The kitchen is very well equipped and practical  great to have a washing machine. The beds are very comfortable and the space very comfortable for 4 people. The view is absolutely stunning and its very easy to get to busses and ferries into the city. Thank you so much for a wonderful stay!"),
("2018-01-14", "10416859", "Chunqin", "Nice living  had everything in the apartment "),
("2018-01-18", "10416859", "Winston", "Organised a night at Leslie’s for my mother. She was very pleased with her brief stay.Thanks."),
("2018-01-24", "10416859", "Sachi", "友人と二人での滞在でしたが､広いお部屋で清潔感もあり､とても快適でした｡ﾊﾞﾙｺﾆｰからの眺めが素晴らしく､朝焼けは特に綺麗です｡歩いて行ける距離にｽｰﾊﾟｰやｴｽﾆｯｸなﾚｽﾄﾗﾝがいくつもあって､食事はいつも楽しみでした｡ﾎｽﾄのLeslieが気さくな方だったので､自宅の様にﾘﾗｯｸｽして過ごせました｡お家の黒猫も人懐っこくて､とても可愛いかったです｡また行く機会があれば､もう一度泊まりたいと思えるお家です｡"),
("2018-01-26", "10416859", "Chris", "Leslie and her family were very welcoming and thoughtful  so many generous offers to ensure our stay was perfect which it was."),
("2018-01-27", "10416859", "Jerry", "Leslie was there when we checked in and showed us around the place. She introduced us to Molly  their pet cat and invited us to use veggies from her garden. It was a very pleasant stay and we would definitely stay there again if we go to Manley."),
("2018-02-01", "10416859", "Clark", "It was great view  quiet and safe  close to public transportation  great value. The owners are very thoughtful  care about details  provide transportation cards  milk & sugar for coffee  I highly recommend it"),
("2018-02-03", "10416859", "Katja", "Very lovely host and well equipped studio  only 10 min drive from Manly"),
("2018-02-06", "10416859", "Jo & Travis", "Leslie's place was perfect  we wish we could have stayed longer than one night. Well equipped with everything you could need and the view was spectacular!"),
("2018-02-07", "10416859", "Rebecca", "Excellent private apartment under the main house. Washing machine and kitchenette was incredibly handy on route to QLD. Leslie is a sweetheart. You won’t be disappointed."),
("2018-02-10", "10416859", "Leah", "Great apartment  convenient location.  The Opal cards were handy  and Leslie even gave us a lift down to the wharf one morning.  Great hosts!"),
("2018-02-13", "10416859", "Leila", "Leslie is such a warm lovely person who welcomed us readily and offered earlier check in to suit our needs and was beyond helpful. The space was perfect size cosy but not at all cramped and she went out of her way to make it easy and provide everything you could possibly need. Definitely worth a visit :)"),
("2018-02-16", "10416859", "Catherine", "Lovely comfortable apartment  great access into Manly! Clean and well maintained! Perfect for our needs! Thank you Leslie!"),
("2018-02-17", "10416859", "Phil", "Great location  friendly hosts. Highly recommend"),
("2018-02-20", "10416859", "Pascale", "Leslie's place is great"),
("2018-02-22", "10416859", "Cheska", "Situated in a quiet suburban area. Walking distance from the bus stop. The kitchen window has a good view of yachts  you can go in the balcony for a better view. They have fresh plants in the garden for cooking. Best accommodation so far in our stay in Sydney. Leslie responds quickly to all our queries. They also have a friendly cat who likes people."),
("2018-02-25", "10416859", "Judith", "Private  clean and easy to get to"),
("2018-03-01", "10416859", "Boyan", "leslie的房子位置极佳 而且有非常棒的厨具｡希望能再次见到你!"),
("2018-03-04", "10416859", "Mel", "We had a great stay at Leslie's place. The apartment had everything you could possibly need and was conveniently located to public transportation  supermarkets and restaurants. It slept four adults and a small child comfortably. Leslie was an excellent host and a great resource for places to go and things to see. Communication was prompt and spot on. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-03-07", "10416859", "Lorna", "Unbelievable value  great facilities with stunning views to boot."),
("2018-03-14", "10416859", "David", "Leslie's apartment was super convenient and very central to transport and shops. Communication was great and Leslie and her husband Eric were really nice hosts."),
("2018-03-18", "10416859", "John", "Spacious  comfortable apartment with everything you need for a relaxing time in Sydney. Having your own transport is an advantage."),
("2018-03-22", "10416859", "Tristan", "Great value for money place to stay when in Manly"),
("2018-03-26", "10416859", "Catherine", "Great place  easy access to everywhere and lovely host"),
("2018-04-03", "10416859", "Catherine", "Vue incroyable du balcon  beau quartier  hôte à l'écoute de nos besoins. L'appartement en soit est humide car au sous-sol mais bon rapport qualité-prix."),
("2018-04-06", "10416859", "Jeremy", "Very convenient and homely space. Nice touches like free use of the excellent kitchen garden. Leslie also communicates very well!"),
("2018-04-07", "10416859", "Christopher", "Very comfortable accommodation. Helpful friendly hosts. Nice view. All contributed to a great weekend."),
("2018-04-13", "10416859", "Ian", "Great location  perfect family space  close to Manly."),
("2018-04-18", "10416859", "Ct", "Perfect view for watching sunrise."),
("2018-04-21", "10416859", "Mel", "A nice affordable stay for a family of five in a central location in Sydney."),
("2018-04-22", "10416859", "Mandy", "Great place and fast response!"),
("2018-04-29", "10416859", "Jen", "Great stay   great service  great value for money.  Thank you."),
("2018-05-03", "10416859", "Mae", "The view from this place is truly beautiful! The kitchen is well equipped. This place could be used just as easily for a long stay as it was for our shorter one. We were there for three days. Leslie was a very thoughtful host  leaving wine and chocolates in the fridge  and even brought by Band-Aids for me when I got a really bad blister from my new shoes. DOWNSIDES:As mentioned in previous reviews  the basement holds moisture. As long as you keep using the de-humidifier  you’ll be okay. A major problem we had was Sydney’s inconsistent public transit  more specifically the buses. If you’re used to relying on transit  look for a place that is closer to the central parts of town. I think of all the buses we took  we had ONE arrive on time. Some showed up 10 minutes after the scheduled time  and one didn’t even show up at all. So  look for something nearer the main harbour or CBD  or you can do like we did a lot of the time: walk down to the Manly Wharf (about 25 min walk) and take the ferry to the main harbour  and only stick to the areas that are closest. Honestly  take the ferries as much as possible. The views are phenomenal. They absolutely -made- the trip for us!"),
("2018-05-05", "10416859", "Daniel", "Great value for money. A nice affordable basement studio in Balgowlah.  We stayed there with our family of 4  for one night."),
("2018-05-05", "10416859", "Rosie", "A convenient location to Manly .A good idea to bring milk  snacks etc as these are not provided"),
("2018-05-10", "10416859", "Melinda", "This is a  great spot with great hosts  it was our second stay at Leslie's and we would like to return again :-)"),
("2018-05-24", "10416859", "Muhammad", "A spacious studio with kitchen and toilet. There is one Queen size bed and a single bed. A Computer table  TV with Airplay. Kitchen has all amenities. Close to Supermarket and bus stop."),
("2018-05-26", "10416859", "Kara", "Great value for its location and ease of access! It is a small area (ideal for our purpose) but with 5 people it is quite cosy. Also  the balcony  whilst beautiful is a shared space so don’t go with the expectation that you’ll definitely be able to use it. We enjoyed our stay and was very convenient having somewhere to stay after a nearby event but probably wouldn’t recommend for a ‘holiday’ purpose."),
("2018-05-30", "10416859", "Angela", "Great for a quick stop  friendly hosts & good walking to restaurants & beaches"),
("2018-06-04", "10416859", "Roger", "All good and I have my privacy on the stay.."),
("2018-06-16", "10416859", "Masaki", "so comfortable room and so kind host! I wanna stay again."),
("2018-07-30", "10416859", "Glynis", "We had a nice stay  and were really blessed with great weather.  If it was hard to be outside  it might have been a little ""cozy"" for staying inside with 5 of us  but a smaller party would manage fairly well.  Beautiful area and view and Leslie was super helpful and answered questions quickly.  "),
("2018-08-03", "10416859", "John", "Great view to the bay and close to public transport.  Leslie is great host."),
("2018-08-09", "10416859", "John", "Leslie and Eric's place is very nice and in a great location. We found buses and ferry's a plenty and really loved the apartment and all it's conveniences. Thanks To Leslie and Eric for a great stay.."),
("2018-09-13", "10416859", "Guglielmo", "Beautiful view  good hospitality  superbe terrace for taking breakfast. Quite far from the center. Could be a little bit more clean  especially if you have children."),
("2018-09-17", "10416859", "Karen", "Leslie's place is great and she's a very helpful host. The location is convenient  lovely view from the deck  peaceful for sleeping and comfy beds - an ideal spot to explore Sydney."),
("2018-09-23", "10416859", "Yvonne", "This apartment is fantastic value  in a great location to enjoy Middle Harbour  Manly Beach and the Spit Bridge to Manly walk... which is spectacular. Comfy beds  spacious bathroom  practical kitchen and GREAT harbour VIEW.  Perfect location for using public transport.  Hope to stay again."),
("2016-01-30", "10423504", "Arthur", "Great House. Only there for two nights. Conveniently located good vibe"),
("2016-02-01", "10423504", "Sharon", "Our stay at Bondi was lovely. Cat welcomed me  was friendly and helpful. The house was very comfy. Close to the beach  coffee shops & cafes. Unfortunately the mozzies were a bother in the only bedroom without nets but this was overcome with extra spray.  And parking is a bother but that is how it is in Bondi. I can recommend and would stay there again. "),
("2016-02-10", "10423504", "Sarah", "We loved staying in this house. We had 4 sisters and our mother for a relaxing 5 night stay. There were two bathrooms which was perfect and the house was cosy and clean. Great little backyard for a few wines in the sun. Thank you."),
("2016-02-13", "10423504", "Yael", "Great house and location. Peaceful and comfortable - and close to the beach and Bondi buzz. Cat was welcoming and helpful. Fresh coffee and milk in fridge was a nice touch."),
("2016-02-15", "10423504", "Tania", "Great pad in the heart of Bondi. A Feeling of absolute calm when you walk in. Great proximity to the beach  cafes and bars. House has everything you need for a short or long stay. "),
("2016-02-20", "10423504", "Jay", "It was great time at Cat's place. Very close to bondi beach about 5 mins walk. And quiet and relax beautiful place. I love to stay again when my next visit. My family was happy too:)Thanks again Cat:)"),
("2016-02-22", "10423504", "Alex", "Cats place is a very relaxing environment. Perfectly situated  close to the beach and shops. She's very helpful and always replies to your requests. You couldn't ask for a better house/host."),
("2016-02-27", "10423504", "Emily", "Cat's flat was ideal for our needs -- three generations visiting North Bondi together. Two bathrooms felt like luxury (as did the king size bed)  and the flat was super convenient to great restaurants (Mamasan and Avila were both tasty in their own ways  and right around the corner) and the beach. Shopping and tasty gelato (our kids were staunch advocates for the Messina Gelato) were only a slight stone's throw further away on Hall St. Having coffee available in the morning was a particular treat (thank you again  Cat)  and there were ample cookbooks to review if we had had the time to really use the kitchen. Communications with Cat were easy for checking in and out; we didn't need to trouble her during our visit because the replacement light bulbs were easy to find when one fixture burnt out. We would definitely consider staying here again. "),
("2016-02-29", "10423504", "Mary", "Had a great weekend away with friends. Great house and location walking distance to cafes and the beach. Amenities were good and Cat also provided beach towels for us to use. Would definitely come back."),
("2016-03-03", "10423504", "Ashwami", "Cat was a great host. The house is lovely  very close to the beach  a great organic bakery and restaurants. The kitchen was well stocked with basic essentials and some cookbooks. Cat was very quick to help out when I couldn't find the water heater switch. Would definitely recommend this house for anybody who wants to stay at Bondi. "),
("2016-03-08", "10423504", "Alex", "Myself and 5 friends stayed in the house for 4 nights and had a great time. The house is an amazing beach house. Good room sizes and lounge area. 3min walk to the beach and a wide range of cafes near by. 10/10!"),
("2016-03-11", "10423504", "Tong", "The house is near the Bondi Beach about 15minutes drive to City｡Nice house…"),
("2016-03-15", "10423504", "Gemma", "Cat was very flexible allowing us to check in early & leave our bags until later in the day when checking out. The house was great  it had everything we needed & Cat was very prompt with dropping over a hair dryer when we needed one! Such a relaxing space & so close to everything! Perfect for our girls trip. Would love to return in winter to make use of the great fireplace!"),
("2016-03-18", "10423504", "Marlène", "Wow! Cat's place is amazing  well located  lot of shops  coffees (Jed's is a dream) around  a perfect beach house! I'd love to come back very soon!! Cat was very flexible with the chek-out  we had an extra afternoon at beach."),
("2016-03-22", "10423504", "Patrick", "Cat was extremely attentive in providing for my families needs. She was flexible with check in times and the house was well presented and very much as described. A lovely experience."),
("2016-03-25", "10423504", "Nichole", "Spacious beautiful Australian home. Its location couldn't have been any better; the beach  bus stop  and grocery store were only a short walk away. Cat was very accommodating  had a well kept home  and fast internet. Our only regret was that we couldn't stay longer. "),
("2016-03-27", "10423504", "Danielle", "The place was beautiful and so so close to the beach and cafes! It was the perfect girls weekend away and we all left feeling super relaxed! The place is exactly like the pictures. I've already recommended Cat's place to many friends. Thanks Cat."),
("2016-04-09", "10423504", "Carole", "Cat made us feel really welcome  the house was clean and tidy  great facilities and great location  close to the beach but not on a busy road.  The house was ideal for us  two families and our mother in the 'annex'. We would definitely recommend the property and would return."),
("2016-04-11", "10423504", "Venesa", "Relaxed vibe  perfect for families or couples  fabulous location  close to great shops  restaurants and iconic Bondi Beach."),
("2016-04-17", "10423504", "Vanessa", "From start to finish  our stay at Bondi Beach Dreaming was enjoyable.  It was homely and comfortable and kitted out with just about everything you could possibly need.  Will definitely book again here.  It is a short walk to Bondi beach  and shops  bars and cafes.  It felt safe  secure and private.  The beds and linen were comfortable and high quality  and the overall feel  was like being at our ""home away from home""."),
("2016-04-25", "10423504", "Lauren", "Great house and location  walking distance to everything in Bondi! Very spacious rooms with everything you need  would definitely stay again. Cat was great to deal with and very helpful."),
("2016-05-08", "10423504", "Cecelia", "Fabulous location and lovely living and dining area  big enough for our group of 8  however there wasn’t 8 adult beds. Probably should be advertised as 6 adults 2 children  the 2 trundle beds were smaller than a single bed an our 5 ft 2 inch companions feet hung off end.Very generous with late check out.Definitely would stay there again."),
("2016-05-15", "10423504", "Tom", "Cat was a great host and catered for our large family group really well!The place itself is very charming and its proximity to the weekend market  the shops and the beach is pretty unbeatable.Highly recommend Cat  and highly recommend the place!Thanks! "),
("2016-05-29", "10423504", "Ashleigh", "Absolutely loved our stay at Cat's place! Fantastic location and beautiful home. Cat was extremely helpful and a great host. Highly recommend!"),
("2016-06-05", "10423504", "Jess", "6 friends and I stayed at Cats lovely house for a weekend and had the best time (apart from the torrential rain)! Cats house has everything you need including an open fire you can light  wood provided. I will definitely book again with a group or even take my family for a trip away. Cat was fantastic to communicate with  responding very quickly. Thank you Cat!!"),
("2016-06-10", "10423504", "Jon", "Great place and awesome location next to some great food. Cat was easy going and flexible on arrival and check out."),
("2016-06-20", "10423504", "John", "Great place and location but needs fixing up. Thankfully Cat was very helpful and responsive to our request."),
("2016-06-25", "10423504", "Shannon", "Cat wasn't there to meet us but we had a fantastic time! The house was a comfortable distance from the hustle and bustle of the centre of Bondi  and only a short walk away from the sea side. Cat's Neighbours were also really friendly and hospitable. Ready to offer us assistance whenever. The heating in the house was great during winter and the wifi was fantastic! The check in process was quick. The kitchen and pantry were really well stocked and the houses was prepped to perfection with small thoughtful things like an international plug adaptor that we had forgotten to bring. Thanks Cat for the lovely stay!! "),
("2016-06-28", "10423504", "Troy", "OK"),
("2016-07-08", "10423504", "Tanya", "Best place to stay  Cat is lovely and very helpful  so close to everything and Cat's place is super clean feels like home and we all had a ball  kids had fun and we loved the kitchen  we will stay again  hoping in summer   as said before  everything close   great restaurants  shopping   transport  and everything  few minutes walk   thanks again Cat  we all loved BondiCheers "),
("2016-07-10", "10423504", "Matt", "Cat's place suited our needs perfectly. It was clean  comfortable  had plenty of amenities and was close to bars  cafes and the beach. Communication was really easy and Cat responded to any of my questions within minutes. We would not hesitate to stay there again."),
("2016-07-16", "10423504", "Catherine", "Cat's house was in the best location. Just around the corner from great coffee shops and just a short walk to Bondi Beach. Bondi Beach itself is still only a 15 minute car ride to the city so it was terrific. The place was lovely and clean and beds very comfortable."),
("2016-07-31", "10423504", "Melanie", "House was warm and decor fantastic. Had a great stay. Cat communicated promptly throughout."),
("2016-08-22", "10423504", "Paul", "We really enjoyed the our stay at Cat's in Bondi. The location was great  and the home itself was a good fit for the two families of 4 who stayed there for a couple nights."),
("2016-08-28", "10423504", "Kathryn", "Great central location only a short walk from the beach  loved all of Cat's recommendations for the area and LOVED the fireplace!  Really homely and comfortable."),
("2016-09-05", "10423504", "Gail", "We loved the vibe of the house  it was comfortable  had a great atmosphere and suited us perfectly. The neighbourhood is full of character and laid back  near the beach and shops  all round great for us."),
("2016-09-08", "10423504", "Benjamin", "Fantastic place everything you want and more.. we enjoyed our time at cats bondi home entirely...!!"),
("2016-09-11", "10423504", "Melissa", "We had a wonderful stay at Cat's place"),
("2016-09-15", "10423504", "Lee", "Great stay Fabulous location Would definately stay again Homely Clean Everything we needed and some! Thank you Cat!"),
("2016-09-19", "10423504", "Katie", "Such a gorgeous oasis. The photos in the listing don't do it justice. It was such an enjoyable stay."),
("2016-09-21", "10423504", "Christina", "Great value  great location and very responsive host. Thanks for having us  Cat. "),
("2016-09-26", "10423504", "Amanda", "A perfect getaway for our girls weekend away! Great location close to the beach as well as some amazing places to eat and drink. Cat's place was homely and welcoming and the ideal amount of space for 5 people."),
("2016-10-03", "10423504", "Erica", "Great stay at Cats house in Bondi! It was everything were after and more. Could not ask for a more perfect location. The house was clean and tidy and the bakery on the corner is to die for  we visited there every morning! Will definately stay again and recommend to all."),
("2016-10-08", "10423504", "Kerry", "Had a great time at our reunion because Cat's place lived up to the photos and description and was just perfect for us."),
("2016-10-10", "10423504", "Stephanie", "Great house and location"),
("2016-10-15", "10423504", "Emily", "Cat's house was great - exactly as described  awesome location close to everything! The house was clean  and the space worked really well - especially since we had 3 kids with us  who were able to spread out and play without getting under our feet! Cat was a very accomodating host  great communication and we felt really comfortable. The little extra touches like extra blankets and towels  and lovely soaps / shampoos in the bathrooms just topped it off! I would highly recommend staying at Cat's place. "),
("2016-10-20", "10423504", "Tanguy", "Very nice family house  well equipped  close to the beach! Very nice breakfasts at the corner juste on the left! "),
("2016-10-23", "10423504", "Jessica", "I organized a weekend away with 4 of my girlfriends and me at Cats place in Bondi the weekend just gone. I was so impressed with the funky beach house and amazing location! The house was fully equipped with everything we needed for the weekend including shampoo & conditioner  beach towels even milk in the fridge. I couldn't recommend this place more if you are looking for a relaxing weekend away with friends or other couples  it was situated within easy walking distance to the general store  awesome little bakery and beach road hotel. We thoroughly enjoyed breakfast at the local Harrys café yesterday morning also. Thanks so much Cat  I will definitely be back :) "),
("2016-10-29", "10423504", "Bianca", "Our stay was fantastic. The house is in a perfect location and is very eclectic & funky. Cat (the owner) was fabulous. She answered any questions I had during our stay straight away and was very helpful. Highly recommend :)"),
("2016-11-07", "10423504", "Jaye", "The host canceled this reservation 32 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-11-11", "10423504", "Matt", "We had a fantastic time in Bondi. Thanks Cat  your house is lovely. Comms were always prompt and very helpful."),
("2016-11-29", "10423504", "Tyson", "Coordinating the check-in time and receiving the keys was effortless and smooth which is always much appreciated. The apartment is a few minutes walk from the beaches and the shops. There is also a cafe at the end of the block which was even more convenient for morning coffee/breakfast. Would definitely recommend!"),
("2016-12-01", "10423504", "Tammy", "We live near Portland  Oregon in the USA and it prides itself on being hip and weird. Bondi Beach must be its sister city times two. As a bunch of aged birdwatchers we didn't really fit in but felt comfortable and accepted anyway. Lots of shops and good restaurants within easy walking distance  and the beach is just as close. There's even a funky little nine hole golf course close by. It's perched on a cliff that overlooks the ocean and has million dollar views.The house worked well for five adults (one couple and three others) and was clean and well appointed. There are even cookbooks displayed in the kitchen in case you wanted to get adventurous. One of the bedrooms is in a guesthouse in the back yard and it was a nice place for the couple to sleep and be apart form the others. Be prepared for visiting bugs  though.Believe Cat when she says that you won't be able to park inside the gate without a high clearance vehicle but you will be able to park in the driveway if your car is on the small side. We had a minivan that was simply too big to allow for pedestrians pushing baby strollers to get by. Parking on the street is for two hours only and the nearest long-term free parking is s few blocks away. Remember to always leave space between you and the next car as locals seem to have no issue with pinning you in if you don't. Cat was great about communicating with us. She seemed available at all times  promptly answering any questions that we had.EricVancouver  WA USA"),
("2017-01-02", "10423504", "Lorraine", "This accommodation is in a lovely location  quiet close to the beach. There was some miscommunication at the beginning  but Cat was exceptional in communication and sorting matters out straight away. The accommodation was very rustic with all mod cons  but in need of some refurbishment with the kitchen  which is due to be done after our visit. The location is easy to get into Sydney central with good transport links. It's also close to the stadiums and Bondi Junction shopping centre.I would recommend this property for a relaxed stay. Thank you Cat!"),
("2017-01-30", "10423504", "Shelley", "what a perfect spot a really beautiful place ."),
("2017-02-12", "10423504", "Anna", "Excellent stay at Bondi. All you can want in closeness to restaurants  the beach  busses and still have a secluded feel to it. The house had everything we needed and it was great for the kids also. We can highly recommend the house and the host Cat."),
("2017-02-25", "10423504", "Bernadette", "We stayed at cats place  travelling from the uk   for our daughters wedding in Sydney .There were 6 members of extended family staying together.Cats place was very homely and cosy  there were lots of extras included  quality toiletries   sun cream and a very well stocked larder that we were encouraged to use.we were left to enjoy our time at the property   and any questions we had were answered promptly by Cat .Highly recommended"),
("2017-02-26", "10423504", "Claire", "The house was perfect for what we needed!  Tranquil and close to shops beach bars and restaurants. Great communication from Cat."),
("2017-03-02", "10423504", "Blaire", "Good place for staying in Bondi. Unfortunately it was raining the whole time we were there so we couldn't really enjoy the nice outside space  which would have made the place a little more open and welcoming. "),
("2017-03-04", "10423504", "Cameron", "Having previously lived in Bondi  we were pleased to discover Cat's quiet beach bungalow. Great proximity to everything in Bondi - just next door to the weekend markets at the local school  3 minute walk to the beach. The house has lots of space - we had no issues with 8 adults and a baby. Cat was an excellent host. Enjoy your stay!"),
("2017-03-09", "10423504", "Craig", "The perfect Australian beach break  in the heart of Sydney"),
("2017-03-12", "10423504", "Tamar", "It was wonderful to be based in such a fantastic location for a long weekend of sunshine in Sydney! Cat was very responsive and helpful with all our requests. The house is clean  very well equipped and suited our family holiday of 3 generations perfectly. We would highly recommend this place to anyone looking for a beachside place to stay."),
("2017-03-16", "10423504", "Sharyn", "A terrific stay in a lovely house near the beach. Host was always ready to respond and let us have an early check in if possible."),
("2017-03-17", "10423504", "Luke", "Fantastic home. Cat was a great host. We had a wonderful stay!"),
("2017-03-26", "10423504", "Joanne", "Great location  straightforward communication  well equipped kitchen. Close to great cafes and Bondi beach. Well recommended"),
("2017-03-28", "10423504", "Meg", "Great location - close to pretty much anything you could need."),
("2017-04-01", "10423504", "Jevon", "A beautiful house. Very large and comfortable  with ample inside and outside spaces. We chose this address to prepare for a wedding. It was perfect. Cat was always available and attended to every need."),
("2017-04-09", "10423504", "Emma", "This place was in a fantastic location. The house was large and very tidy. Cat was very easy to communicate with. Highly recommend for a comfortable stay."),
("2017-04-22", "10423504", "Rhiannon", "The property was exactly as presented  immaculately clean and relaxing upon arrival. Beautiful open space and only a short walk from the main road. Little extras like quality bathroom products and comfortable beds made a huge difference. We will definitely be back."),
("2017-04-28", "10423504", "Scott", "Cat's place out the back of North Bondi is literally around the corner from a hip local scene with good grocers  bar and cafe action. The house is spectacular - classy and comfortable and in excellent taste. Cat is a genuine host and communicates extremely well. If this is the size and location you need  you'll not find better."),
("2017-04-30", "10423504", "Meredith", "Cat's place was warm and welcoming  had everything we needed and was in a wonderful location close to Bondi beach but far enough away to be (Email hidden by Airbnb) munication was easy and prompt.  The house was perfect for a group of friends or a couple of families.  I would be happy to stay again. "),
("2017-05-06", "10423504", "Lauren", "Cat's place was perfect for our girls getaway.  Amazing location  right next to Bondi Beach with a market and Harry's Expresso on the corner.  We walked everywhere.  Lovely  clean and funky décor  great outdoor entertaining space and plenty of beds.  Loved it  thank you."),
("2017-05-13", "10423504", "HuiSee", "Great house  great location. Just a few minutes walk to the beautiful bondi beach!"),
("2017-05-28", "10423504", "Maria Paz", "The house has everything you need and more.  wonderful location just steps away from great coffee and. rea shops and a stroll to the beach. s"),
("2017-06-03", "10423504", "Priscilla", "This house is perfect !! It's in a fantastic location and really made our trip one to remember. Beautiful home and had everything you could need. Cat is a great host In all ways !! Cannot rave enough about this place and you will not be disappointed in any way !!!"),
("2017-06-20", "10423504", "Jessica", "Great location. Easy walk to the beach. An assortment of restaurants down the hill. The house was everything it said it would be. Recommended."),
("2017-06-24", "10423504", "Emma", "We spent a lovely weekend at Cat's place and everything was perfect from the communication  an option to check out late and the most amazing beds! Thank you Cat we would love to stay here again!"),
("2017-07-11", "10423504", "Tom", "Cute traditional Sydney house  in a super location- away from the crazy touristy parts of Bondi  but close to the beach and in the more charming part of this ever-vibrant part of Sydney.Equipped with everything you need  and close to plenty of good bus routes.A bit chilly in this very cold spell of winter  but there are a couple of portable heaters."),
("2017-07-14", "10423504", "Kelli", "Cute place with easy access to bondi and yummy food. A little cold at night through the winter  so if you travel with small children bring extra layers for sleeping! "),
("2017-07-16", "10423504", "Melissa", "Fantastic location. Walking distance to everything. Accomodation outstanding and the host was amazing. Would not hesitate to return."),
("2017-07-19", "10423504", "Matthijs", "Great location  very nice house. Cat had been great in answerring all possible questions"),
("2017-07-24", "10423504", "Lucy", "Fantastic location  great apartment set up and responsive and accommodating hosts. "),
("2017-08-01", "10423504", "Kylie", "Amazing location and every little detail in the house has been well thought out. Fantastic for extended families and groups. We can't wait to come back."),
("2017-08-13", "10423504", "Lyn", "Cat's place was great  location was fantastic  a short walk to restaurants and the shops.  The corner shop cafe was very warm and welcoming and a really funky place to have a light meal or just a coffee. The house was very comfortable for a group of friends or family.  What struck us was the open plan living and plenty of lovely places to sit outside or on the porch or back deck.  Very nice.. would definetely stay again."),
("2017-08-21", "10423504", "Katia", "Le logement est parfait pour 2 familles  nous étions 2 couples avec 4 enfants et l'espace était assez grand pour tout le monde et bien pensé (1 chambre en bungalow en extérieur avec douche/toilette).Le logement était propre (intérieur/extérieur)  tout était prêt pour notre arrivée (hiver à Sydney) couettes sur les lits  bouillottes  radiateurs à disposition et la cheminée feu de bois ! génial ! (vraiment appréciable pour la saison). Le logement est vraiment joli  coquet. On s'y sent bien. C'est confortable (lit douillet) et bien aménagé.Les enfants ont appréciés l'espace extérieur  le bassin à poissons.La communication avec l'hôte a été bien organisé  aucun problème pour récupérer les clés. Le logement est extrèmement bien situé  c'est résidentiel  calme dans le sens ou se sont surtout des familles qui y vivent  c'est près mais aussi loin de l'agitation des bars et restos...branchés de Bondi.Endroit très près de la plage et de l'arrêt de bus (1 min à pieds)  très pratique lorsque l'on est avec des enfants. Sympa d'être juste à côté du marché de Bondi du samedi dimanche.Juste le seul point qui peut être un inconvénient pour certains : l'isolation  ce n'est pas bien isolé pour l'hiver mais c'est partout pareil dans les maisons en Australie (cela doit être appréciable en été !)  et pour le bruit de la route (camion poubelle) et des passants (le week end  la nuit)  aussi  la buanderie des voisins est collée à la chambre/bungalow extérieur  mais cela ne nous a pas plus dérangé  c'était vivable. Nous recommandons vivement se logement aux familles  groupe d'amis qui souhaitent séjourner sur Sydney et plus particulièrement sur Bondi.Merci à l'hôte Cat  pour nous avoir permis de passer un agréable séjour dans une maison à Bondi."),
("2017-08-27", "10423504", "Laura", "Highly recommend this beautiful place. We booked for a girls' weekend  and we were really happy. The place is very clean  and just perfect for a relaxing holiday near the beach. Cat is a wonderful host and easy to deal with. Plenty to see and do  great access to public transport  and the shower is amazing! Would definitely stay there again. :-)"),
("2017-09-02", "10423504", "Leeshii", "This house is so zen. The rooms are gorgeous  it has such a great vibe and set up. The bath tub is awesome  the kitchen has everything you need. The location is perfect  close to everything. Cat is the perfect host  very reliable and flexible. We all had the best time."),
("2017-09-09", "10423504", "Julie", "What a great house. Close to everything Bondi has to offer. We loved the beach and the beach hotel. Really well equipped and very clean. Great big comfortable beds and great little extras. Thanks to Cat for the early check-in  it all went without a hitch. See you next time!"),
("2017-09-16", "10423504", "Erin", "This place provided the perfect accommodation for a getaway with my girlfriends! We all loved the location  the cosiness and the comforts of this place which sleeps 6 very comfortably. Cat was very easy to deal with and even gave us a late checkout which was what we needed for a lie in on our last day before returning to our daily grind! I'd recommend this place to anyone looking to have walking access to all that Bondi Beach has to offer!"),
("2017-09-23", "10423504", "Zoe", "Cat was amazing to deal with. Organized cots and highchairs for my twin babies so I didn't have to arrange a thing. Super helpful!"),
("2017-09-29", "10423504", "Nic", "Cat's place is in a really good location  on a nice residential street but very close to the beach  shops  restaurants and public transport.  The house is really homely and comfortable  and the cleanliness couldn't be faulted."),
("2017-10-05", "10423504", "Zdravko", "Good location and nice house but not 5 star. Needed a good clean and there is no parking within the property. The adjoining property was being renovated  so we had to leave the house most mornings due to the excessive noise from a jackhammer. House had all the amenities most people would need and was very secure. Nice front and back outdoor areas."),
("2017-10-09", "10423504", "Michael", "I would highly recommend booking this house for a group of people. All the amenities you could possibly need  seperate bungalow out the back and fantastic location. Cat was very happy to answer any questions you need and quickly aswell."),
("2017-10-15", "10423504", "Paul", "Absolutely loved sharing a weekend with my daughters at your home. We enjoyed the location  so close to the beach and cafes and the warmth and ambience of the house was exactly what we were hoping for."),
("2017-10-22", "10423504", "Sophie", "Great place to stay  well presented  handy location  host was excellent to deal with. Would recommend for group accomodation in the heart of Bondi"),
("2017-10-29", "10423504", "Fernanda", "The location is fantastic. Walking distance to the beach yet far from the crowds  loads of coffee shops and stores nearby.The house itself has a great feel to it. Hope to come back some day."),
("2017-11-02", "10423504", "淑聪", "Cat’s place is amazing. It have a lovely yard and lovely plants in there. It is very close to the beach  just 10 min work. And Cat has a set of wonderful cook  the house is perfect for people who like cooking."),
("2017-11-05", "10423504", "Kayla", "Just returned from a 2 night stay at this property and we could not fault it. House has plenty of space for 6 adults. Perfect location as it is close to everything. Communication with Cat was above and beyond amazing as she was always so efficient with replies and helpful with anything I needed. I Would definitely recommend this property for anyone looking for a great place  great location and great surroundings."),
("2017-11-13", "10423504", "Sophie", "Fantastic home in a great location to walk to everything in Bondi. Really loved the tranquil feel of the house and the back and front yard. Thanks Cat!"),
("2017-11-20", "10423504", "Mary", "Lovely 7 minute walk to the beach and 2 minutes from the bus stop. Great dining areas both indoor and out! Kitchen perfect for cooking!"),
("2017-11-29", "10423504", "Laura", "Loved the eclectic style and additional room outside.  Very open feeling and well stockedWith everything you need  including beach towels.  Turn right out of the driveway and the organic coffee a shop is at the next corner  which is great for coffee and breakfast."),
("2017-12-02", "10423504", "Sam", "A fantastic house in a great location. We really enjoyed our stay and would definitely stay again in the future!"),
("2017-12-09", "10423504", "Matthew", "Cat's place was great. Pictures just as it was in reality. Also very repponsive and felxible in terms of numbers of people that we were being charged for  even reducing the original price we paid because 1 person couldn't come. Also allowed flexible check in and out times which was very helpful."),
("2017-12-10", "10423504", "Peter", "Plenty of outside spaces to relax. Safe for children. Fantastic location  close to beach  coffee shops and recreation areas. A bit like home away from home."),
("2018-02-02", "10423504", "Caroline", "Beautiful home in a great location!"),
("2018-02-07", "10423504", "Ebony", "Beautiful home! Close to beach and shops. Large home with breeze and comfort"),
("2018-02-12", "10423504", "Jules", "Cat was a quick responder and accommodated all our requests  the bungalow was quirky and more spacious that the photos suggested. The location was excellent and we loved every second. Two families stayed and it was perfect for us. Thanks!"),
("2018-02-15", "10423504", "Chris", "A lovely place to stay. It is a nice little home a short walk from Bondi beach and local shops. Be aware that one of the rooms is the old garage and detached from the main house."),
("2018-02-17", "10423504", "Gemma", "Such a great base camp for visiting Bondi. Cafes and shops close by  and a close walk to the beach! Cat was a great host. Thanks!"),
("2018-02-21", "10423504", "La-Toyah", "We can’t love this house more.Parking was a little tricky but didn’t damper our experience. Highly recommend this stay being close to beach  buses and cafes :)"),
("2018-03-01", "10423504", "Margot", "We loved staying at this house in Bondi;  it was close to the beach  shops  transportation  and the Saturday Farmers Market.  We have many good memories.  We had many good BBQs on the patio.  Such a great setting with potted plants all over.  The house was definitely comfortable for six people."),
("2018-03-08", "10423504", "Brooke", "This house is a five minute walk to the beach - AMAZING location. Perfect for early morning walks to see the sunrise at Bondi Beach. The space is large and the main house shower was spectacular. The bedrooms and living space are large. The small touches were nice - there was coffee available which was huge  and the hair dryer available worked really well (long haired Airbnbers know how important this is)! Cat was an amazing host  and was extremely responsive. The outdoor spade was lovely and the fish are a great touch. As someone who isn’t used to seeing bugs often  the amount of bugs we saw was a bit alarming  but Cat took care of this right away!"),
("2018-03-10", "10423504", "Theresa", "Lovely place  great location. Would stay again"),
("2018-03-19", "10423504", "Daniel", "Great house in perfect location. Would highly recommend and Cat is an extremely helpful owner."),
("2018-03-28", "10423504", "Liz", "LIVE THE BONDI DREAM!  Cat's place is a private oasis in  the heart of beach-chic Bondi  only three quaint blocks to the sand (which my four-year-old insisted on completing barefoot like the locals).  It's as hip as Brooklyn but with better weather than Los Angeles and a fraction of the people   Everything you could want is in the kitchen  and many thoughtful extras in the bathroom.  We enjoyed reading on the front porch and dining al fresco in the garden. Cat was a responsive super helpful hostess with a nice vibe in keeping with the Bondi lifestyle.  Hope to return soon."),
("2018-04-02", "10423504", "Kate", "Cat’s place was a pleasure to stay at. I would definitely recommend this home and will stay there again when the opportunity arises!"),
("2018-04-06", "10423504", "Andy", "Wonderful spot  close but not on top of the cool Bondi scene.  Instantly felt at home there. Kids enjoyed it tremendously. Only slight issue was the neighbours had a young screaming baby which was rather noisy. Cat was great!"),
("2018-04-09", "10423504", "David", "Great spot  short walk to beach and a ton of great cafes and food options nearby!"),
("2018-04-13", "10423504", "Nicole", "This was the first Air bnb booking I have done and I was a bit nervous.  It was the best experience ever.  Cat is an extremely gracious hostess.  Very friendly  great communication and really thoughtful  unexpectedly offering us early check in and late check out because it was possible. The house has a lovely friendly feel to it  and is as amazing as the pictures look  they are accurate.   Loved sitting in the beautiful courtyard  sipping champagne and enjoying the fish.So many small attentions to detail.... having champagne stoppers  insect repellant and a really helpful guide to the house and how to navigate the surrounding areas. Lovely toiletries and an amazing open fire - yes I had the fire going  not because it was really cold  but because I love an open fire and this was one of the reasons I chose the property.  Cat was very accommodating with this and we had plenty of firewood. The fire burnt and drew well.Great location. The house is a very easy walk to Bondi Beach  even for unfit me  and an even shorter walk to groceries  bottle shop  cafe and restaurants.Parking is the only thing that is a bit awkward.  The listing description is accurate in this regard.  If you have a regular size car you will not be able to get into the driveway  which is such a shame.  We were able to get longer stay parking in other streets  but this obviously wasn't as convenient. It was doable though.We thoroughly enjoyed our stay and intend to stay there again."),
("2018-04-15", "10423504", "Stefana", "Stayed for a hens weekend  very central location and access to everything in Bondi. Cat gave us some great tips for restaurants and cafes! The bakery on the corner was insane! Very flexible with check out time which was helpful for our afternoon flights out.. thanks Cat!"),
("2018-04-24", "10423504", "Sue", "Beautiful  spacious  stylish accommodation. Everything that 5 adults needed in a great location. Perfect for us!"),
("2018-05-07", "10423504", "Karina", "We had a great stay at Cats Bondi house. The house is very stylish and had everything we needed. We loved  all the tea and Nespresso machine. The house is close to the beach about a 5 or so minute walk. Close to bars and restaurants. Would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-05-27", "10423504", "Bella", "Nice house & good location."),
("2018-06-16", "10423504", "Julia", "A lovely rustic beach house with good sized beds and great spots for family entertaining.  Added extras were a box of toys for the grandkids  nice products in bathroom and plenty of plates/cutlery/saucepans etc.  cat was very welcoming and provided plenty of information to help us with our stay.  Thank you Cat for your hospitality "),
("2018-06-23", "10423504", "Marni", "Cat’s place is beautiful  we really enjoyed our stay"),
("2018-07-15", "10423504", "Margaret", "Great location  close to beach  restaurants  Rose and Watson Bay.  Cat was very responsive and helpful.  Great local cafe less than 100 metres walk on the corner."),
("2018-07-29", "10423504", "Libby", "A place to relax and rejuvenate x"),
("2018-08-03", "10423504", "Malcolm", "A great location and a fantastic layout."),
("2018-08-07", "10423504", "Anatelyah", "Cat's place is a little home away from home. It feels very cosy  the fire place is a great asset and while you're waiting for it to get going  you can warm up with the gas heater. As we were there in winter  the added heater in each room were a great help as was the hot water bottles :) The bath is so big and instant hot water aplenty!! All the local tips were a great help and we even managed to park our monster 4WD rented car in the driveway ;) A great holiday and we would be happy to return.Thank you Cat."),
("2018-08-18", "10423504", "Michelle", "Good experience in Sydney  convenient location to the Bondi Beach"),
("2018-08-28", "10423504", "Collin", "Excellent!"),
("2018-09-02", "10423504", "Amy", "Beautiful house  great location! Was a wonderful stay!"),
("2018-10-06", "10423504", "Tessa", "You cannot beat this location in Bondi. Walking distance to the beach  cafes and restaurants. The house was big enough to accommodate two couples and two babies plus have some friends over for dinner without feeling cramped. We ended up having bad weather so we were inside a lot but that didn’t matter because the house was so spacious and had a fireplace! I would highly recommend this house."),
("2018-10-14", "10423504", "Tom", "Great stay thanks!"),
("2018-10-19", "10423504", "Ellyn", "Cat's place was the perfect base for our girls' trip in Bondi. We took full advantage of the short walk to everything in Bondi  from the beach to shopping to restaurants. The house had plenty of space  and our group of 5 was extremely comfortable. The large  open areas were perfect for dinners and hanging out together  and the backyard had some beautiful fish!I would definitely recommend this place to anyone who is looking for a stay in Bondi!"),
("2018-10-20", "10423504", "Suzie", "Cat was more than accommodating and an excellent communicator. Her house is brilliant with lovely private spaces and a quick walk to Bondi. Highly recommend :)"),
("2018-10-26", "10423504", "Jacqueline", "great place! super location. close to shops  restaurants  beach  public transport. house has a lovely  zen feeling. makes you feel very safe  comfortable and at home."),
("2018-10-28", "10423504", "Campbell", "lovely space   great location"),
("2018-11-11", "10423504", "Lucy", "Cat was great! The place was welcoming and homey. We felt right at home. Definitely recommend. This was perfect for my family of four. We were able to cuddle up in the comfy couch after a day on the beach. We are especially grateful for our experience here because we had to cancel our previous place at the rocks.  The host there was unaffected with our concerns. All of which were half heartedly addressed  if at all.  The house at the rocks where we stayed had a terrible mold problem. My poor son was having asthma attacks. Luckily  Cat was able to accommodate last minute and she was sure to deal with any concerns we had right away. But we didn’t have any. Everything was great  you won’t be disappointed."),
("2013-04-29", "1047087", "Jacky", "This studio out the back of caths house was a pleasure to stay in. The clever design makes use of a small space and the decore was stylish. Cath treated us with her homemade treats which were a real welcomed surprise.We enjoyed looking out onto her veggie patch  the morning sun lit upnthe big photo of clouds on the wall and was lovely to wake to every morning.Highly recommended."),
("2013-05-06", "1047087", "Diana", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay in Cath's Garden Studio and we're already looking forward to a return visit. The studio itself is light and bright  as well as clean and comfortable. Cath was a welcoming and attentive hostess who was not only knowledgeable and helpful with all our queries  but provided a wonderful breakfast hamper with home made goodies that really made us feel welcome. The garden setting and chooks only added to our experience. We loved the location and enjoyed exploring the adjoining areas such as Newtown and Surry Hills.Thoroughly recommended."),
("2013-06-24", "1047087", "Nicole", "What a wonderful experience staying in The Garden Studio. We arrived and were greeted by the very friendly and attentive Cath - who introduced us to the chickens on the way to the studio. As soon as we stepped inside we felt comfortable. The decor is modern  quirky and stylish  there is a lovely area to sit and watch television  a user friendly kitchenette  a comfortable bed and a clean and modern bathroom. Cath provided us with a lovely array of breakfast and snack options and she even baked a delicious loaf of fresh bread which she left at our doorstep the following morning along with a newspaper. There is a large collection of DVD's to watch and books to read and the studio is in a quiet location with plenty parking - also within easy walking distance of public transport. I highly recommend The Garden Studio to anyone looking for a private  convenient and comfortable place to stay. My partner and I will definitely be returning in the future. "),
("2013-07-07", "1047087", "Joey Faith", "My husband and I had a wonderful stay with Cath.. This lovely garden studio is functional  modern and comfortable.. Delish freshly baked bread and cookies from Cath.. The breakfast hamper is welcoming and generous! Definitely highly recommended!"),
("2013-07-14", "1047087", "Elise", "My boyfriend and me are a young french couple who stayed 1 week in the lovely Cath's studio. We really enjoyed this staying for our first booking on airbnb. Cath is a very smiling and nice person. The studio is fully adjust to feel like home.The basket for breakfast is really complete and everything is thinked that we lacked nothing. Moreover it was a pleasure to be able to taste the delicious biscuits and bread  all home made by Cath. The bus stations and shops are close and there are only 15 minutes walking to go to the station Petersham.I really recommend Cath's studio !"),
("2013-07-22", "1047087", "Narda", "I had a lovely stay with Cath - the studio is beautiful and her chickens are so cute! She was a fantastic host - friendly  easy going  and kind (baked fresh bread!) but respected my privacy which was great. "),
("2013-07-26", "1047087", "Nick", "This garden studio is absolutely comfortable  and private but also very clever in the way it uses space. Cath is a generous host providing muesli  home made muffins and fresh eggs from her very own chooks..wow. I was only able to enjoy 2 nights but I hope to stay again soon. "),
("2013-08-03", "1047087", "Damon", "We had a fantastic time in Cath's beautiful Garden Studio.  Cath's freshly baked bread was amazing & the freshly laid eggs superb! Highly recommended."),
("2013-08-19", "1047087", "Akalya", "The garden studio was a wonderful little place in Marrickville  close to new cafes popular in Sydney!  Cath was a fantastic host and provided more than we expected. We'd recommend couples to stay for a little hideaway away from the hustle and bustle of the city!"),
("2013-08-29", "1047087", "Janice", "The Garden Studio was wonderful. It had everything we needed (and more!) and it is a beautiful space. Cath has thought of everything  from a change of towels mid-week to shampoo  cereal choices  and even a homemade loaf of bread for our 6-night stay. We felt truly spoilt. Marrickville is being hailed as the ""new Surry Hills"" and at the number of quality cafes and food stores nearby was just astounding. We rented a car  and we were really happy with the easy (and free) parking on the street too."),
("2013-08-30", "1047087", "Nick", "Great place to stay in a really interesting suburb I wish I had more time to explore....."),
("2013-12-01", "1047087", "Harriet", "We felt so at home at The Garden Studio  it's a pity we didn't have more time to thoroughly enjoy this cosy space. We loved the ginger biscuits  & freshly baked bread  that Cath handed to us in the morning  still warm from the oven. Cath was approachable & helpful when we needed info on how to get around  but at the same time  gave us the space we needed. Her chickens too  were rather welcoming! A joy to talk to; we appreciated the short exchanges & enjoyed listening to her share bits about herself :) A gem of a place! "),
("2013-12-04", "1047087", "Nobuhiro", "The studio is lovely space and convenient; small kitchen with almost everything  confortable beds  outside table  TV and WiFi service. We found many kind of cereal  jams  fresh eggs  fruits  chocolate  and etc. in the kitchen.  Cath gave us a freshly-baked bread in the first morning  and we could enjoy breakfast with the table in the garden.There is a park near here and it is quiet area.Cath is very friendly and a kindly person.   裏庭にある素敵な可愛いｽﾍﾟｰｽです｡庭のﾃｰﾌﾞﾙで朝食を取りながらゆったり楽しみました｡ｵｰﾅｰに気兼ねなく過ごせるのですが､Cathさんは親切な方で､市内の情報を色々と教えてくれます｡最初の朝に大きな焼きたてﾊﾟﾝをいただき､2日間楽しみました｡"),
("2013-12-07", "1047087", "Patricia", "We had such a wonderful stay at the garden studio.Cath is a very welcoming and generous host.  She even made us  freshly baked bread and cookies!The studio is very well designed and has a very comfy split level bedroom. It's located in a quiet neighbourhood and close to train and bus stops. Guaranteed to make your stay in Sydney unforgettable."),
("2013-12-12", "1047087", "Charlotte", "My sister and I had a lovely time at Cath's Garden Studio. It was the perfect little space with everything we needed. Cath was extremely lovely and helpful making sure we were comfortable and happy whenever we crossed paths in the garden. The fresh bread was amazing to wake up to on our first morning and the food provided really helped us in keeping our spending costs down. I will most definitely return to the Garden Studio next time I am having a little getaway in Sydney!"),
("2013-12-21", "1047087", "Alice", "Cath's beautiful little studio was the perfect place to visit Sydney and the local neighborhood of Merrickville. She provided a wonderful array of breakfast treats as well as fabulous teas! The place was clean  private  and had all the amenities we could need. Thanks for a great visit  Cath! "),
("2014-01-10", "1047087", "Cristina", "Our stay at the Garden Studio was perfect! Cath baked fresh bread and we had breakfast everyday with all the cereals  eggs  vegemite  nutella  etc. she also provided. The studio is small but cozy and she has taken care of all kind of details  we found anything we needed!Cath also was very nice helping us with some directions and printing maps for us  thank you for a very nice stay!"),
("2014-01-16", "1047087", "Charith", "My mom and I had a fantastic time.  Cath is an absolutely wonderful host and the place is lovely  super clean  relaxing and you get your privacy.  Street parking is free!  Do note that climbing the ladder might be slightly tricky  specially if you are slightly tipsy.  Ha ha.  Very happy with my stay and highly recommend the cute garden studio.  Both my mom and I had a great time in Sydney."),
("2014-01-27", "1047087", "Daniela", "I spent one whole week at Cath' studio and I loved everything about it! Cath is a very warm and generous person  nothing can beat her big breakfast hamper and the delicious bread she's providing you with. She even brought me some freshly baked muffins over!There is a direct bus which takes you to the city within 25-35 minutes  depending on traffic. The studio is in a quiet neighborhood  it's perfect to relax after a busy day in the city.This was a 5 star experience  I would book again anytime. Thank you for a lovely time  Cath!Very best Daniela"),
("2014-01-30", "1047087", "Natalie", "We loved the Garden Studio. It is absolutely perfect with so much style  love and details and you have everything you need! The breakfast basket is delicious as well as the self made bread! Cath is very helpful if you have any needs. We could not imagine any better place to stay in Sydney!"),
("2014-02-11", "1047087", "Maya", "My stay at The Garden Studio (4 nights) was thoroughly enjoyed and a great experience... Why I'd recommend you stay:* Lots of privacy  with your own entrance...* Cath is a very generous  understanding  and thoughtful host  and easy to contact. We particularly loved her guides about where to eat in the local area.* TGS is very well located in the central suburb of Marrickville - easy to get into the CBD/Newtown/Surry Hills  and if you drive like me  never any complications with street parking!* The studio was meticulous  and very well stocked - Cath filled the fridge/kitchen with nearly everything you'd need... The variety of teas and delicious homemade cookies were mostly appreciated  and I'm sure most Airbnb users are interested in an espresso machine  which was also available!* The shower in this place is truly amazing.All in all  if you don't mind a smaller place  this is the place for you - we found it worked well for 2 people. Thank you again Cath. :-)"),
("2014-02-20", "1047087", "Anne", "it was our first experience with airbnb and it couldn't have been better. we felt very welcome by cath and the studio offered everything we needed - even an umbrella. all the information cath provided (both in person and written) were highly appreciated. definetely will try to check in here again if i come back to sydney."),
("2014-02-24", "1047087", "Jody", "We spent two days at the Garden Studio and were impressed immediately on our arrival. Such warmth and sincere hospitality. Handed a loaf of baked bread straight from the oven within moments was an unexpected delight. The beautifully styled and thoughtfully prepared space is ideal. We felt that the attention to detail was the best we have experienced using AirBNB. From the generously stocked fridge and hamper  bathroom items  games  videos and books and even picnic gear it was clear the stylish owner is well travelled and knows how to make a space a temporary home. The kitchenette has everything you need. In fact the space and the lovely courtyard was so delightful we surprised ourselves by spending the first morning there enjoying a lazy breakfast reading the terrific range of wonderful magazines rather than head out. The location is great. At the end of the street is a lovely park where we were able to fit in a morning run. Very comfy bed  quality linen  a super quiet fan. Great information and maps were a welcome addition. We would love to return here and most likely will. Highly recommended. "),
("2014-02-28", "1047087", "Leah", "My 4 night stay at Garden Studio was a lovely  tranquil experience.  On arrival I was greeted at the front gate by the fragrance of frangipanis  my favourite!  The studio has been cleverly designed and has a crispy clean  fresh  airy feel to it.  Cath was the perfect host who was there if I needed anything while also giving me a sense of privacy.  All your needs are met at The Garden Studio with extras of yummy home baked ginger biscuits and the morning paper delivered to your front door!  All this with a lush raindrop shower head made for delightful stay - it was a treat and a retreat all in one."),
("2014-03-09", "1047087", "Sean & Summers", "BEAUTIFUL and very easy to use studio in a gorgeous garden!  Everything is done to a really high quality level  from the sheets on the perfectly made bed to the spotless interior and the fantastic breakfast box Cath left for me.  The garden is a wonderful and quiet place to hang out  although it is definitely shared between you and the host.  Privacy feels more private that a room in someone else's house  but probably less than a stand-alone apartment - reasonable since it's a studio in someone's back garden.  The neighborhood is quiet and pretty  with nice cafes and a farmer's market a 15-minute walk.  Getting into and out of other places in the city takes a while; you are not in the center of things  but in a nice neighborhood.  A car or a bike would be more flexible than using transit.  Overall a great place that I would use again!"),
("2014-03-29", "1047087", "Jacinth", "The studio was really lovely. It was very clean  well equipped and pretty spacious. Everything was as how it looks in the pictures. We liked how the studio was designed  it gave us a very comfortable homely feel. Cath was patient and helpful with our questions  and she gave us our privacy  only popped in to give us some baked goodies and fresh towels. Overall we enjoyed our stay there and we would definitely recommend it to our friends."),
("2014-03-31", "1047087", "Simone", "Just spent a lovely weekend with my mom in Cath's Garden Studio. The studio's gorgeous and equipped with everything we needed for a comfortable stay. The area is quiet and pretty interesting too - enjoyed my Sunday morning run in the diverse surrounding neighbourhoods :-) Cath is lovely too and very helpful - will definitely be back the next time we are in Sydney."),
("2014-04-03", "1047087", "Annemarie", "Cath's garden studio is lovely and we enjoyed our 2 nights stay there. Comfy  clean  quiet  generously equipped  private  great location (if you have a car) and perfect if you need to be close to the airport. Cath is welcoming and has definitely lot of taste  the garden and interior is beautiful. And I wish I had a shower like this! "),
("2014-04-07", "1047087", "Caroline", "The Garden Studio has had a Hundred positive reviews and We finally see why! It's all true!Seriously Cath has provided the most thoughtful services  she even personally got us fresh Bread in the morning and Jam donuts too! The place is filled with everything that we need  more than we even expected.She has done such amazing work with a small space  it's functional and we just love the layout and modern design aesthetics! Cutest Studio we've ever stayed in!Thanks Cath!"),
("2014-04-14", "1047087", "Lauren", "Had a lovely stay at Cath's Garden Studio. We chose the studio following the excellent reviews. The place was very comfortable and suited our needs perfectly. The breakfast was the highlight  including fresh croissants and bread. Would definitely return. Thanks!"),
("2014-04-25", "1047087", "Carolyn", "Had a really nice stay at Cath's place. Small space which we were expecting but everything we needed and more. Bed was comfortable  breakfast was great and there was even the facility to cook for ourselves. It is a very convenient place for anyone with a car. Location nice - the pub  the Henson Park Hotel is worth checking out!"),
("2014-05-03", "1047087", "Elaine", "We had a great experience at the Garden Studio. It was so clean and comfortable with every need provided for. I had wondered about the ladder to the bed as in my 60s with a not good knee but it was fine and the bed was exceptionally comfortable. We loved the shower and bathroom provisions and the kitchen was great. We had delicious breakfast every morning with everything provided by Cath and only needed to purchase yoghurt.We had a weekly travel pass and there was a short walk to regular buses and the new Dulwich to Central light rail line which we used daily in combination with rail. Highly recommended ."),
("2014-05-06", "1047087", "Stephen", "My girlfriend has been wanting to stay at Cath's place for quite some time now so she was quite pleased that we were able to book our last few nights in marrickville. Cath is an excellent host and a very thoughtful one as well! She welcomed us with a generous breakfast basket and with freshly baked bread the next morning! She was very organised and had all the need to know information all sorted into a little file with all the maps  delivery menus etc. The location is great just about 15 mins away from the domestic airport and about 25 mins away from the international airport. Our favourite airbnb stay so far!"),
("2014-05-15", "1047087", "Melinda", "I couldn't have wished for a better 'first-time' experience with using Airbnb!!!! The Garden Studio was fantastic. I felt so comfortable staying there  that I completely forgot that it was located at the back of Cath's house. Cath has done an amazing job with making her guests feel welcome and well cared for. The breakfast hamper was beautiful (especially since I'm a fussy eater!!) fresh bread  home made jam  milk  juice  coffee  herbal teas etc etc was ALL provided. Being a tourist to Sydney  the information folder Cath has put together herself was extremely helpful. One night I tried one of her recommended restaurants and the food was amazing. I can't thank Cath enough for allowing me the privilege of staying in her beautiful studio."),
("2014-06-25", "1047087", "Helen", "The Garden Studio is a lovely place to stay.  We were warmly greeted by Cath  and Chips the dog  and once inside the studio there was a lovely hamper of breakfast foods  fresh bread  a coffee machine and various teas - breakfast then sorted for the next four days.The studio is in Cath's garden  with a paved area and table and chairs for sitting in the sun.  While it is small it is very sunny and really well set out with modern furniture and we loved the loft bed.  The bathroom area has a shower curtain  not a door but that was not a problem for us. Cath - thank you very much for making our stay so nice.  Your home baking left for us on one of the days was really thoughtful.  I highly recommend you and your Garden Studio.  "),
("2014-07-13", "1047087", "Sarah", "I did not personally stay with Cath  as we booked her room for an employee on an extended out of town stay. The booking process was very easy  and Cath was very understanding of our needs for the accommodation. The feedback from our staff member has been great - so much so he has requested that when he returns that he stays with Cath once more. The room is in a very central location of the Inner West region  with great access to buses  trains and the light rail at Dulwich Hill. I would highly recommend Cath's property for anyone looking for a cosy  homely location to stay :) Thanks Cath!"),
("2014-07-16", "1047087", "Dana Lee", "The reservation was canceled the day before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-08-13", "1047087", "Sonya", "My partner and I had the best stay at the Garden Studio  and hope to stay again one day. The space was beautifully and thoughtfully designed  and had everything we needed. We loved the generous breakfast spread and enjoyed fresh eggs and homemade bread both mornings  and slept so well in the loft bed. We had our car  and found Marrickville a really easy place to stay  it was very central to everywhere we needed to go (city  Surry Hills  Alexandria)  and parking was easy.Cath had also baked me the most beautiful white chocolate mud cake because she knew my birthday was coming up  and we arrived back to the studio one night to find a box of meringues waiting for us. I'd highly recommend the studio :)"),
("2014-08-18", "1047087", "Daniel", "If you're looking for your own little place while away  this is the place for you. The Garden Studio had all the little things you'd need on a weekend away: a lounge area  a nice little kitchen and bench  a great bathroom and a very comfortable loft.Being out the back of the house  separated by the courtyard  and accessible through path along the side of the house (bordered by a chicken coup) it  is in a very private location.Cath was great too! She was there to greet us and left us a hamper to snack on. I would highly recommend this place to anyone!"),
("2014-08-26", "1047087", "Bethany", "We had a fabulous 5 days in the Garden Studio. Comfy bed  lovely rain shower and a super little coffee machine. Cath is a great host - attentive and yet respectful of privacy. We welcomed a few cuddles from puppy host Chip also! If you are considering the Garden Studio  book it in now. Cath has thought of everything and it is all yours to enjoy. "),
("2014-08-28", "1047087", "Kim", "Absolutely beautiful place. I was only there for a couple of days mid-week however would of loved to have stayed a little longer  dive into some of the books and enjoy the remainder of the awesome food hamper. Everything you need for a home away form home with a great host to match."),
("2014-09-26", "1047087", "Ralph", "Cath is an excellent communicator and an outstanding host. Her studio is perfect  spotlessly clean and everything one could possibly need is  supplied. Even games  umbrellas  egg poacher and toiletries. Her array of tea has widened my tea drinking repertoire enormously. A folder was available outlining all the local cafes  restaurants  hairdressers and any other professional you might need. Before we arrived Cath contacted us to ensure her breakfast hamper contained things we liked. In additional to the hamper  each day we were treated to a range of treats including fresh eggs  delicious cakes or freshly baked bread. Even the paper was delivered most days courtesy of Chips the guide dog in training. After eight days we rolled out of the Garden Studio wishing we could stay indefinitely. This standard was maintained with Cath being extremely busy with an enormous photo shoot as well as her impending wedding this weekend. What a wonderful find. We would definitely recommend Cath to our family and friends and in fact have done so "),
("2014-10-11", "1047087", "Elaine", "We had our second stay at Caths Garden Studio and it was again perfect for our needs. We got up early and ate the breakfAst provided before heading out  but a pleasant spot to relax too. Every need met. We'll be back!"),
("2014-11-10", "1047087", "Paul", "Wonderful host: emailed and asked if we needed anything prior to arrival. Breakfast supplies save you trekking out first thing; Fresh eggs  Bread cereals and well stocked fridgeGreat place for an extended weekend: had everything you would need ( and more).Lovely leafy neighbourhood: AAA +++"),
("2014-11-18", "1047087", "Stefanie", "Staying in Caths cosy little Garden Studio was absolutely wonderful. The Garden Studio is decorated with much love for details  clean  comfy and very charming. Cath was great host. I was totally surprised to see that she prepared a breakfast basket for us with self-made jam and eggs from her three hens. I would definitely stay there again if I ever have the chance to visit Sydney again!"),
("2014-11-23", "1047087", "Stacey", "A beautiful stay was had at Cath's gorgeous cottage. She is a most gracious host  having made me delicious bread and a brownie for my birthday! "),
("2014-12-01", "1047087", "Timothee", "We were welcomed by Cath with fresh bread and eggs and a kind  warm hello. The studio was clean and various food was supplied in the fridge and in a basket.  Also an extra mattress was provided for my friend which was so much appreciated.  The neighborhood felt very safe and friendly and some great cafes and restaurants within walking distance.  I would easily return again and would recommend it. "),
("2014-12-07", "1047087", "Tony", "Cath gave us a warm welcome that included biscuits straight out of the oven! The room was delightful  funky and immaculately clean. Cath has thought of every possible thing a guest might need which gives a stay here a sense of abundance and generosity. From fresh flowers down to oven-fresh bread and the newspaper at our doorstep the next morning. The fridge was well stocked with condiments  chocolates  juice  milk and more. Tea and coffee choices were plentiful. There was a book full of maps  tips on things to do and see  menus for local restaurants and other useful contacts. The space was quiet with no traffic noise  just the cluck of the friendly chickens and someone playing piano in a nearby house (not intrusively!).The location was great for us. Close to several parks and a short walk to Marrickville shopping strip  restaurants  bars (Gasoline Pony) and the train station was about 30 mins walk away. Parking was easy.Communication was easy and prompt which made it easy to change our plans which we had to do at short notice.We'd highly recommend The Garden Studio to guests wanting a peaceful stay close enough to the city."),
("2014-12-09", "1047087", "Paulyn", "Cath was a lovely host  she went above and beyond to provide food  directions and additional supplies to ensure her guests were well taken care of. She maintained the place very well and I would love to stay here again. "),
("2014-12-15", "1047087", "Stacey", "A beautiful moment was spent in Cath's Garden Studio from the warm welcome received from Cath  Chips the in-training guidedog and  the 3 chickens  her scrumptious breakfast hamper and an arranged portacot for our toddler. The studio was fully equipped and beautifully styled. Our privacy was respected. We will definitely be staying again on our next Sydney visit. Thank you Cath "),
("2015-01-11", "1047087", "John", "As description by Cath in her profile  everything is what you see in the picture and the place is amazing clean  neat and tidy. Was pleased to find that the place very cosy and quiet which is a plus point to me. Not forgetting her lovely pet dog  he was super friendly and obedient which i enjoyed so much playing with him even though he has enter the room without notice. :) It's a shame Cath place was taken up when i return to Sydney but will surely choose over her place if i ever return to Sydney for holiday. Thanks for the host Cath.   "),
("2015-02-09", "1047087", "Ingrid", "I had an absolutely lovely stay at Cath's Garden Studio. Such an easy location and I was amazed by how much thought and care was put into looking after her guest's needs. The fresh croissant for breakfast was one of my favourite parts of my stay. The chooks were very cute  as was Chips. Cath is very helpful while still being respectful of your privacy. I would definitely stay here again! "),
("2015-02-15", "1047087", "Dominic", "Wow! What a beautiful little studio. We loved it. Myself and my girlfriend stayed here for two nights and it was perfect for us. There was enough room for two of us to stay but cosy enough to make it feel comfortable. Being in Marrickville  it is so handy to where we wanted to be. The breakfast Cath provided was amazing  such great hospitality. My girlfriend says Cath really knows the way to a girl's heart as there were plenty of amenities included with the stay  even a hairdryer and shampoo/conditioner  not to mention the fully stocked kitchen. Cannot recommend enough for either singles or couples. Cath made us feel very welcome yet with enough privacy that we felt comfortable. "),
("2015-02-20", "1047087", "Nick", "Cath's place was lovely and she was a great host. She left us to our own devices most of the time  but was always available and forthcoming with great advice about the area and very generous with her delivery of home-baked bread  a muesli slice that she made and fresh eggs from her cooks. Marrickville is a really nice area - very quiet and relaxed  but with plenty of dining options within a 15 minute walk and the city and Newtown also very accessible via public transport. Highly recommended!"),
("2015-02-25", "1047087", "Elisa", "Lovely set up! Who expected chickens and a veggie garden in a. Small suburban setting?? I loved seeing the chickens. Wandering a mongst the frangipanis and greeting me as I  left in the morning or as I arrived home. Cath has done a wonderful job creating a sweet and very comfortable place for her guests to stay. Her breakfast hamper was divine and she thought of everything to make her guests welcome! Thank you!!!"),
("2015-03-01", "1047087", "George", "Thank you Cath for a fantastic stay. The Studio was just as described in the listing with all the amenities and appliances one could wish for. The breakfast hamper and well stocked refrigerator made me feel very welcome. Plenty of towels and the shower is a dream.  The neighbourhood is quiet and a ten minute walk across the park to the station.  I highly recommend the Garden Studio to anyone wanting a base in Sydney out of the city centre."),
("2015-04-16", "1047087", "Gareth", "Very convenient to the airport and a vibrant local community  Cath and her place were very accommodating and friendly and the bungalow is to be recommended for short stays. Its small and gets some aircraft noise but its also well maintained  clean  very comfortable and Cath provided a bunch of great breakfasty snacks - I was lucky enough to get some freshly baked muffins also!"),
("2015-04-27", "1047087", "Ray And Sheila", "This was our second stay at the Garden Studio and we were again made most welcome and comfortable. The studio is well equipped  spotlessly clean and Cath is a most thoughtful host."),
("2015-05-14", "1047087", "Jean", "Stylish and beautifully clean. Everything I needed and a great location. Cath is lovely and helpful."),
("2015-05-17", "1047087", "Mel", "Goodness. An air bnb host with both a great sense of style AND with relaxed insight into what makes for guests feeling really welcome and comfortable.  The linen was yummy to sleep in and the plethora of breakfast and snack offerings in the basket and fridge were also a great treat.  We could walk to more in the area than we even managed to do in the 3 days we were there (so there is no shortage of great food or entertainment). Even with an air mattress on the downstairs floor my friend and I felt we had plenty of room.  We'd stay there again in a flash. Next time we'll bring our nona trolleys  and cooler bags and shop up on goodies from the Greek deli and places on illawarra rd."),
("2015-06-02", "1047087", "Alice", "Cath was such a welcoming host! She left is the most beautiful fresh eggs from her hens  home made bread and little midnight snacks. The apartment was clean and tidy albeit small  but cosy!"),
("2015-08-09", "1047087", "Nick", "Beautiful spot in a great location exactly as advertised. The breakfast hamper in particular was a treat! Cath was a great host who made us feel welcome but also respected privacy as needed. We would be happy to stay there again in a heartbeat."),
("2015-08-26", "1047087", "Hasu", "I was organising accomodation for a work colleague   Cath was great   very clear promt communication.A great little pad with everything needed including great light reading material.Our overseas guest was more than happy to stay comfortably for the week and commented on the great sleep she had ."),
("2015-08-31", "1047087", "Kellie", "Cath's studio was a delight. It was all the little extras like a slice of cake waiting for you upon returning back for the evening  home made jam  biscuits  gourmet butter for eggs on toast  chocolate  trail mix... that make it so much more personable and enjoyable than a hotel.  It has to be one of the best and most authentic airbnb places I have stayed in. Cath has thought of everything! Comfy bed  choice of pillows  great shower and super clean. It is also close to the airport and train stations to easily get into the heart of the city. Highly recommended! "),
("2015-09-21", "1047087", "May", "Thoroughly enjoyed our stay. The studio was such a smart use of space; easy to move around and access everything we needed. Spotlessly clean  gorgeous decor  and very modern too.Breakfast provisions were scrumptious and generous. All the little extra touches such as the magazines and DVDs made our stay and we wish we could have stayed on longer just to relax a bit more. Will consider again for our next trip to Sydney."),
("2015-09-29", "1047087", "Ajay", "Cath is a superb  warm and friendly host and was quick to respond to any queries we had during the booking process. The studio is just like it is shown in the pics being even better than a hotel stay. It is fully equipped with everything you need and it has everything as described on the Airbnb site. We were blown away with the fresh and tasty eggs Cath provided us from her own chickens on site. Her breakfast hamper has fresh bread  yogurt  muesli  milk and other baked goods that was more than what we needed. Cath is very thoughtful and considerate of her guests and will provide you all the information required to travel  eat and be like a local which is what we wanted to do in our Sydney stay. We also loved her sense of style and the way she has done up the Garden studio. Also there is a lovely vegetable patch with herbs and greens right outside the studio. Very pretty.  The little details matter like the umbrellas  picnic basket  extra blankets  etc that were provided to us. The studio is not located within the CBD area but that was not a problem at all since we were commuting around via trains and buses and did not find any issues doing so. Also it is in a suburb very close to the central area so you are still pretty close. Besides Marickville has some of the best food and coffee options that we explored in our trip. Stay at the Garden studio and you will not be disappointed. We were sad to leave and only wished we could have stayed longer. This has surely been our best AirBnb stay till date. P.S. Just make sure you are okay to stay in a loft like bed with a movable ladder to climb up and down which may not suit everyone. That was a highlight for us though and we wanted to experience it :) "),
("2015-10-26", "1047087", "Brittany", "We had an amazing stay in Cath's studio. It has absolutely everything you could ever need. The thoughtful touches such as yoghurt  milk fresh bread and fresh eggs were just some of the things Cath provided us to make our stay as comfortable and enjoyable as it was. Beautiful clean studio that has everything and more you could possibly need. We will never be staying in a hotel in Sydney again ! Cath went above and beyond to welcome us and make our stay as comfortable as possible. Heaps of DVDs  magazines and books  fluffy towels and extremely comfortable bed and pillows ! Everything you could possibly need in the fridge and a great location to get to the airport and nearly by restaurants cafes and inner city. We loved our stay at Cath's! Will definitely be back soon! "),
("2015-11-06", "1047087", "Eric", "Cath and the garden studio are just amazing and I thank her for the effort that went into making her studio have all the small items needed to make time away spent comfortably.. I have been left with lasting experience that i shared with my friends and family I don't think I need to say much more.. Thanks Cath and Hazel"),
("2015-11-08", "1047087", "Mary", "Cath was so great in making us feel at home in her studio  she was super accommodating  and hospitable. The studio itself is immaculately clean and very homey  we had access to everything we needed from storage to toiletries. Cath was even lovely enough to provide us with some breakfast options and snacks in the fridge! Cath's place is situated not too far from the city which made it very convenient for us to travel to and from by car. We loved every minute of our stay there Cath  thanks again!"),
("2015-11-15", "1047087", "Leanne", "We really enjoyed our stay at the Garden Studio. Cath couldn't have been more welcoming. She put the effort into getting the kind of milk and bread we liked for the breakfast hamper  which we really appreciated  along with the delicious fresh eggs. She thought of everything - including a little machine for cooking the eggs  some chocolate  homemade jam  chocolate and beers!The studio is pretty easily accessible from the city by bus. The studio is small but big enough for too people. It's really clean and stylish. The only thing we weren't fans of was the bed in the loft - we had a tendency to hit our heads on the roof a bit and it might be a pain for some to go up and down to get to bed. But other than that  couldn't have asked for any better!"),
("2015-11-25", "1047087", "Claudia", "Es war unser erster Airbnb Aufenthalt: wir haben uns bei Cath sehr wohl gefühlt.Das Garden Studio war für uns perfekt: es liegt zwar etwas außerhalb  es ist aber durch diverse Bus-  und S-Bahnlinien sehr gut an die Innenstadt angeschlossen. Das Studio war sehr sauber und ist sehr gut ausgestattet. Es gab eine Mappe mit wichtigen Infos über Einkaufsmöglichkeiten  Cafés und Restaurants in der Nähe  was sehr hilfreich war.Cath war so nett und hat sogar auf meine Allergien ( Tierhaare  Nahrungsmittel etc.) Rücksicht genommen  was ich wirklich klasse fand. Es gab sogar extra nussfreie Kekse für mich. Toll!Vielen Dank Cath für den schönen Aufenthalt bei Dir!"),
("2015-12-01", "1047087", "Prue", "We couldn't have felt more welcome when we arrived at the Garden Studio. Cath had so thoughtfully displayed a ""Happy Birthday"" banner and special breakfast treats for my son's birthday. Everything you need is provided  an array of breakfast supplies - including fresh eggs from their chickens and delicious homemade jam as well as homemade Choc Chip cookies! The accommodation is comfortable and homely - we honestly wish we could have stayed for much longer. Cath has thought of everything - including providing ""Opal"" cards for public transport - so generous! We will definitely be back if we have the opportunity to visit Sydney again. Highly recommended! Thanks again Cath!"),
("2015-12-08", "1047087", "Andrew", "We've had an excellent time at The garden studio. The shower was luxurious and just one of the many features that made this little oasis memorable. Cath was an excellent host  attentive while valuing the privacy of the guest. We loved the dogs! Thank you Cath for a lovely stay. "),
("2015-12-14", "1047087", "Sally", "Cath couldn't have been more accommodating: we had a last minute flight cancellation (Jetstar. Grrr) and therefore a change of arrival time  however Cath was happy to receive us earlier than planned. The house is so peaceful. We had a lovely sleep in the delightful loft bed. And the shower was a real treat.Marrickville has so many interesting nooks and crannies: we explored in all directions past the stunning old homes in Dulwich Hill  the array of Vietnamese restaurants in Marrickville and all the hip places heading up towards Enmore and Newtown. We couldn't have been more pleased with our choice of accommodation."),
("2016-02-08", "1047087", "Emma", "Cath made us very welcome. Although away for the weekend herself she keep regular contact to make sure we had everything we needed. A lovely array of breakfast goodies and snacks including fresh eggs  homemade strawberry jam  some delicious homemade biscuits  cereals  milk  fresh loaf of bread and some choccies n the fridge! Loved the shower! The garden was really lovely too. Thanks for a great stay Cath! "),
("2016-02-19", "1047087", "Ian", "Great spot.  Fantastic quiet place."),
("2016-02-28", "1047087", "Kirsi", "The Garden Studio is lovely and Cath friendly and very helpful. We really enjoyed our stay with a yummy breakfast of cereal or fresh eggs (from the three beautiful chickens) and plenty of things to do. The apartment is perfect  short walk to the train or bus  and close to shops and restaurants. Highly recommended! Thanks Cath for a great stay!"),
("2016-03-06", "1047087", "Jennifer", "The listing of the accommodation was accurate everything was provided  the location was very close to the city and the airport making it very easy to travel to. Cath provided us with an amazing breakfast hamper which was so thoughtful and very convenient to us. The place was very cozy and modern  had a great experience  thanks Cath!"),
("2016-03-12", "1047087", "Juliet", "Cath is one of those lovely people that make everything lovely. She's clearly got an eye for design because this place has been so cleverly done. She left me beautiful homemade jam  fresh eggs from her gorgeous chickens  a chocolate eater egg  milk  a very generous selection of cereals ... she really knows how to make you feel welcome. The cottage is very comfortable and it's completely private  fully equipped  comfortable bed  close to transport. There is nothing at all to fault. I really appreciate it so thanks Cath for a fantastic stay!"),
("2016-03-20", "1047087", "Louise", "A fantastic place to stay away from the hustle and bustle of Sydney but still close to all of the action. Soaking up the morning sun with a cup of tea  a croissant and a good book - pure bliss. Cath sure knows how to make you feel at home  with fresh bread and a well-stocked kitchen. Oh  and a very comfortable bed! Pop down the road to Cornersmith Cafe for a delicious breakfast or read a book under the big trees in the park at the end of the street. I wish I could have stayed longer - I definitely plan to come back!"),
("2016-03-24", "1047087", "Juliet", "I've stayed with Cath before and I would stay again. Cath is a professional at this business without the boring-ness of a hotel. She's lovely  her studio is lovely and the location is great."),
("2016-04-05", "1047087", "Susie", "We loved our stay at The Garden Studio. It had everything we needed for a comfortable weekend  including fresh eggs from the resident chooks! We'd highly recommend it for an easy  chilled out stay in Sydney's inner west. "),
("2016-04-11", "1047087", "Moe And Taeko", "Do yourself a favour and stay here! Cath is an awesome  thoughtful and friendly host. You'll find incredible attention to detail and generosity at every turn in The Garden Studio. Thanks so much for everything  Cath."),
("2016-05-29", "1047087", "Sarah", "The garden studio was so lovely- it was perfect for our Sydney weekend away. Cath was a welcoming and lovely host. The studio was warm and cozy and there was coffee  breakfast  delicious bread  home made cookies- we 100% recommend this. Thank you so much Cath."),
("2016-06-06", "1047087", "Suchada", "We were so happy with Cath's Garden Studio. Everything was clean and looked just like the photos. We felt very comfortable  safe  and right at home. Cath was so sweet to bring us fresh eggs  fresh bread and warm croissants in the morning. She was very kind and helpful whenever we had questions. The fresh towels smelled so good and the bed was super comfortable (we didn't want to get out of bed!) This space is perfect for one or two people. Thank you  Cath!!! :)"),
("2016-07-01", "1047087", "Amy", "Cath's little garden studio we could have hoped for and more! Cath and her pup welcomed us warmly upon our arrival  and the little studio was a warm home away from home. Every little detail had been thought of  and the bountiful breakfast basket was a delight  as was the little delivery from the bread fairy the following morning  and the fresh eggs from the little chickies in the garden :) The location was great - a very comfortable walking distance to Newtown and Marrickville which meant we were able to enjoy the great food  coffee and beer that the locality has to offer  as well as great theatre at the Depot. Cath's recommendations for local must-dos were much appreciated. The street is lovely and quiet  with a park at the end. Getting to and from the train was also a breeze. This is a rare gem  one which we will definitely be returning to! "),
("2016-07-22", "1047087", "Stephanie", "We had a lovely stay in the garden studio. Cath was friendly and gave us some great tips for places to visit in the area. The studio is well designed and had everything we needed. We would definitely stay again."),
("2016-08-16", "1047087", "Kate", "Cath was very warm and welcoming  as were her 3 chickens! The accomodation had everything we could possibly need  even opal cards to use. Fresh bread was waiting at the door on Sunday morning which went down a treat. The studio was snug and warm and I'd like to build one myself  it was very cool! 5 stars :)"),
("2016-08-21", "1047087", "Tania", "We had a lovely stay here! Cath was super helpful when we arrived  and graciously gave us privacy thereafter. The kitchen was well stocked and the accommodations adorable and comfy - we especially loved the shower  which was like standing in tropical rain! Very much recommended. :)"),
("2016-08-28", "1047087", "Sarah", "Excellent self contained studio with everything you need for a comfortable stay with thought put into the little things like bathroom  kitchen and food supplies along with additional bits and bobs like travel cards  umbrellas  power adapters and more! Very lovely host who obviously takes pride in presenting accommodation like their own home.     "),
("2016-09-10", "1047087", "Helen", "Cath was incredibly accommodating and her place is perfect for a getaway for two! Cath's little flat is modern and clean and sleek with a fun loft bed that helped you feel hidden away from the world. The area is great if you want to be a little ways from the busyness of the city but not too far to travel either. Cath provided us with fresh bread and croissants for breakfast which was just the cherry on top of a wonderful stay. Cath is a friendly host who will assist you with anything you need. If you're looking for a calm stay outside the city then this is the place for you! Would definitely stay their again. Thanks Cath!"),
("2016-09-15", "1047087", "Sarah", "Cath was a great communicator and responded quickly to any questions. The studio was charming and a short walk to cafes and train stations etc. The breakfast muesli and freshly baked biscuits were delicious!"),
("2016-09-19", "1047087", "Michael", "Beautiful little place with great amenities and Cath was a wonderful host."),
("2016-09-23", "1047087", "Inge", "We had a wonderful time in the Garden Studio.  It had everything we wished for  good bed  wonderful shower  and more!  A tasteful breakfasthamper i.e. Cath is a great host  who reacts very quickly and let us drop of our bags on her veranda very early in the morning.  We would recommend this address to everyone!"),
("2016-09-25", "1047087", "Liam", "Very nice little studio apartment. Looks exactly like the pictures. We only saw Cath very briefly but she made the whole process very easy. Good selections of breakfast items and a great bathroom  lounge room is small but functional. This studio may not suit you if you're a light sleeper it has a lot of natural morning light and planes flying close by. Location is smack in the middle of 3 train lines all about 15mins walk away.Not super close to the city center  but good if you have a car to park and don't want to pay.Thanks for a good stay!"),
("2016-10-01", "1047087", "Peter", "Cath was fantastic and the accommodation was exactly as described. Great location in a quiet street. Breaky pack was great and fresh eggs from the chickens. Thanks Cath"),
("2016-10-09", "1047087", "Yasmin", "Cath is a fantastic host and her studio space is perfect if you want to stay in the real Sydney! Marrickville is within walking distance to quick bus rides into Newtown and the city. Cath has obviously travelled herself  as she is aware of all the little conveniences to include within her space to make it a really super great stay. Would definitely recommend!!! "),
("2016-10-18", "1047087", "Gerrit", "Cath is een vriendelijke dame maar was niet gecharmeerd over onze opmerkingen over ladder en betonvloer. De buurt ligt direct onder de uitvliegroute van de luchthaven. Veel lawaai van zeer laag over komende vliegtuigen van 06.30 tot 23.00. Bed boven kan alleen kruipend bereikt worden omdat er geen stahoogte is."),
("2016-11-05", "1047087", "Jessica", "Cath was a fabulous host  we arrived late at night and she was very accomodating. The studio was cozy and has everything you need for a short stay. Cath generously provided fresh bread and breakfast in the morning which was very generous and a nice touch. We had a wonderful stay and would highly recommend the Garden studio!"),
("2016-11-11", "1047087", "Laurence", "Le Garden Studio est adorable et au calme. L'endroit parfait pour se reposer après un (très) long vol! Notre hôte a été pleine d'attention pour un excellent séjour. Merci Cath!"),
("2016-11-13", "1047087", "Amy", "Cath has really thought of everything to make your stay comfortable.  The amenities in the apartment are above and beyond anything I expected.  We had a lovely stay and would certainly return."),
("2016-11-15", "1047087", "Liz", "We had a wonderful two night stay in the Garden Suite during our visit to Sydney. Cath was an awesome host! We really loved the functionality and style of the space. It's like a perfect tiny home with everything you need! Cath left an incredible breakfast basket that made our mornings easy and really made it feel like home. She includes a comprehensive guidebook in the unit and transit cards that helped us to get around. Nothing but positive things to say about our visit! We would highly recommend staying here!"),
("2016-11-19", "1047087", "Jessie", "Everything is exactly same as the description and pictures. The garden studio is a small cozy space in lovely neighborhood."),
("2016-11-24", "1047087", "Sandy", "Cath is a super host and fellow frequent traveler and this is very evident in the garden studio.  There are tons of personal touches and amenities that make you feel like you are staying at a very close friend's place.  If you forgot anything at home  she probably has it neatly tucked away in a corner of the studio.  We had a wonderful stay."),
("2016-11-27", "1047087", "Fuzuki", "This place was cosy and comfortable ; my husband and I stayed three nights for our friend's wedding. It has everything we need. Breakfast was great as well ; bread  muesli  eggs are all good. We also walked to marrickville station which has so many Vietnamese restaurants and many of them are so good! Cath is also nice. She made our stay so comfortable .. We would come back when we go back to Sydney. We would definitely recommend this place! "),
("2016-12-01", "1047087", "Sam", "Had a wonderful stay  Cath was the perfect host  a well thought out space with everything you need. Catch let us do laundry and was very attentive and friendly .Thank you :) "),
("2016-12-04", "1047087", "Sharon", "A beautifully and cleverly designed studio  in a great location. Quiet place  fabulous bathroom and wonderful breakfast hamper. Cath's hospitality was wonderful. Highly recommend."),
("2016-12-09", "1047087", "Raden", "Cath's place was a great location for our short stay in Sydney  nice quiet street  close drive or taxi ride to the city and walking distance to shops and public transport and plenty of on street (free) parking. Cath was a great host welcoming us with a clean place  plenty of refreshments and snacks/breakfast upon arrival. Her place had everything we needed to make our stay more comfortable.Highly recommend! "),
("2016-12-11", "1047087", "Victoria", "The Garden Studio is a lovely  comfortable  and beautiful place to stay at  and we would be more than happy to come and stay here again. Cath was very lovely  accommodating  and understanding. We highly recommend her place to everyone. The place was very clean and there were milk  eggs  and a breakfast hamper when we arrived  plus fresh bread in the morning which was a lovely thing to wake up to. The kitchen and bathroom were kitted out with everything that a traveller ever needs plus more. We also loved that it was near a few train stations and bus stops  and it's just a pleasant walk to lively Newtown. Thanks again Cath for having us and for being so understanding! We couldn't rate your place highly enough  if we could give it 10 out of 5 stars we would! :) "),
("2016-12-26", "1047087", "Jenni", "The garden studio is a gem and we loved our time there.  Cosy  but well equipped  Cath's extra little touches make this our top favourite air bnb location.  The breakfast hamper that is provided is a very thoughtful touch; cereal  muesli  baked beans  porridge oats  eggs  juice.  freshly baked bread from the local bakery...Cath was also very accommodating with our dietary requirements-vegan- and provided us with almond milk  coconut yoghurt  dairy free margarine and coconut & chia puddings. Free parking outside was also a bonus and we never had any issues with finding a space.Highly recommend staying here!  "),
("2017-01-03", "1047087", "Julian", "We had a perfect time in Cath´s Garden Studio. The Studio is just as it is described. It is very clean  nicely arranged and decorated. We felt that Cath wants her guests feel really comfortable and happy in it. The breakfast basket with bread  eggs  milk and muesli made it complete. The Studio is not very big but it has everything which is needed. Very nice and lovely! a little treasury :)Cath is very attentive  helpful and extremely pleasant. She was always reachable when we asked for insider tips or had questions concerning locations to visit. The ""cherry on top of the cake"" was that Cath brought us to the airport on our last day! Thanks again!So for us it is not difficult to summarize that Cath (and her husband mark) are excellent ""super hosts""! We loved the week in Marrickville and enjoyed the stay in the Garden Studio. Highly recommended!!! :)Cath and Mark: Thank you very very much for being your guests! It was a great time in Sydney and your lovely Garden Studio. It was a pleasure meeting you!And: the next time you are in germany near to us... you already know... :)"),
("2017-01-07", "1047087", "Steven", "Cath's place is perfect for a little Sydney getaway. The thought to detail is outstanding  and Cath is a lovely and welcoming host. The garden shed has everything you need and more. You have to stay! "),
("2017-02-20", "1047087", "Pravesh", "This Garden studio is  a home sweet home away from your home:) I know you just don't get it from what I have just said.Okay here it is and I am gonna make it short .The studio has got all the essentials you need which  is being mentioned in the house manual.We just loved staying at the garden studio for almost two weeks .I highly recommend this place for a peaceful and enjoyable stay."),
("2017-02-28", "1047087", "Lauren", "My friend and I had a wonderful time at Cath's. The place was beautiful and Cath was lovely. She has equipped the studio with everything you could possibly need and more. I would highly recommend staying here to anyone."),
("2017-03-05", "1047087", "Felicity", "We absolutely loved our stay at the garden studio - the only bad thing was having to leave! It's the perfect base for solo travellers or couples to explore Sydney and is definitely the best equipped Air BnB we've stayed in to date. The breakfast basket was fab  as were the delicious cookies we found on our doorstep when we arrived home  on our last night. Cath was super helpful and friendly (as was Hazelnut the adorable pup!). Highly recommend and would definitely stay again.  "),
("2017-03-12", "1047087", "Jasper", "Really nice  comfortable and clean studio  with all supplies (like fridge  coffeemachine  tea  eggcooker etc) inclusive!"),
("2017-03-22", "1047087", "Fadzilah", "Kath was lovely  to ensure that all were well  good and safe for me. This place is gd and safe for female solo traveller. The lovely studio is very clean  and aesthetically pleasing."),
("2017-03-25", "1047087", "Daniel", "Perfect is the only appropriate word to describe this place! The design of Cath's little studio/loft is exceptional  we genuinely did not want to leave. Great central location in a beautiful leafy suburb  plenty of parking and an incredible host. Cath was so kind and helpful and her Labrador Hazelnut was just adorable. This is perfect place to base yourself to enjoy the best of Sydney - we will be back! 10/10!"),
("2017-03-30", "1047087", "Naomi", "Cath's studio is really lovely.  A cozy set-up with everything you need plus some very kind considerations from Cath in the hamper.  I would certainly stay there again."),
("2017-04-10", "1047087", "Gavin", "Great place  great price  lovely people."),
("2017-04-16", "1047087", "Samuel", "Amazing place  cosy and cute studio  almost felt me and my Wife stayed in a luxury treehouse with the bed on second level. Cath made some. Amazing hot cross buns  convenient little veggie patch and adorable dog to welcome us home  from our various Sydney outings  located conveniently to travel throughout Sydney!"),
("2017-05-07", "1047087", "Iris", "PERFECT!"),
("2017-05-27", "1047087", "Sebastian", "Cath appartment is a wonderful place to stay when visiting Sydney.  The garden appartment is in a quite neighborhood but offers everything in close vincinity (shops  grocery stores  restaurants) and with the 2 Opal cards Cath provides you are perfectly equipped to use busses and trains to explore Sydney. I really enjoyed my stay and was treated like a king. "),
("2017-08-06", "1047087", "Angela", "Fantastic 'Tiny house'  these guys have thought of everything to make the stay comfy and easy. Easy to find  easy to stay  warm and clean. Delicious  free range  home laid eggs for breakfast. I climbed the ladder easier than I thought I would :-) Thank you very much Cath :-)"),
("2017-08-14", "1047087", "Cheryl", "Thanks Cath we really enjoyed our stay at your place. Nice chookies and dog Hazel. Lovely to eat eggs from your chooks and pick greens and tomatoes from your garden!Right balance of privacy and contact - thanks we'll be back."),
("2017-09-22", "1047087", "Nathalia", "Wonderful little home. We stayed at Cath's studio for one month and had an incredible time  the place is quiet and private  yet walking distance to delicious restaurants and pretty parks. The studio is clean  fully equipped  very modern and beautifully decorated  it even has a veggie garden. Most importantly however  was that Cath was the perfect host. We'll be back :)"),
("2017-10-01", "1047087", "Theo", "This is THE garden oasis if you want to stay anywhere near marrickville. Really comfy bed delightful space easy parking plus breakfast. You do need to climb the ladder to bed (and down in the morning) but the space and facilities are superb. A real treasure."),
("2017-10-11", "1047087", "Rachel", "Easily the best Airbnb I've stayed in. Booked based on previous reviews and we can only agree. Plenty of wonderful touches  homemade produce  fridge and cupboards stacked with all the things you could need. Comfy bed and lovely rainfall shower. Clean and tidy. No faults at all. Thank you for a lovely stay Cath!"),
("2017-10-22", "1047087", "Allan", "Fantastic little unit with awesome breakfast provided  very neat and clean. Would certainly recommend!"),
("2017-11-10", "1047087", "Yohay", "The place was as small as shown in the pictures  and still equipped with  everything one may need  including everything for cooking in the tiny kitchen. Cath was attentive and generous in house supplies."),
("2017-11-17", "1047087", "Jeff", "Cath is a great host and easy to deal with. She was thoughtful and even asked what type of milk I preferred. The space is just as described. I was only there for a quick work trip so it was the perfect size for me. It was a quick 15 min walk to the train station too. I would definitely stay there again."),
("2017-11-23", "1047087", "Adam", "Place was great - perfectly located. Would recommend and I will definitely book again"),
("2017-11-27", "1047087", "丽骏", "房间很漂亮 麻雀虽小五脏俱全 能想到的东西房间都能找到 门口有个小院子 坐在那里喝喝茶看看天空再舒服不过房东还很贴心的准备了很多种谷物和面包当早餐房子离tram站有一些远 拖着行李还是挺累的 附近的公交又不太准点不过去哪都还算方便到的前一天房东还很贴心地问了我们想要哪种牛奶 飞机晚点很晚才到还在院子里等着我们房东有只很可爱的大狗狗 不过要白天才能遇到哦"),
("2017-12-03", "1047087", "Tegan", "A lovely place with a really cute loft bedroom  a comfortable downstairs area and Cath left us various goodies to make our breakfast. Cath has lovely garden spaces with chickens  and an area to sit and soak in the sun. Easy street parking and walking distance to cafes and shops. Throughly enjoyed our stay and would recommend to anyone able to manage the ladder. Would happily stay again."),
("2018-01-20", "1047087", "Kristofer", "Lovely garden house with a little bit of a farm-like feeling to it. Cath was quick to respond and even though we had to leave earlier than planned  was very easy to get along with."),
("2018-02-06", "1047087", "Chris", "I stayed at Cath's place for around 10 days and found it exactly as described. A cute space with a comfy bed  clean bathroom and handy kitchen. It included Cath's thoughful touches such as the breakfast hamper which was very nice. I would not hesitate recommending Cath's place."),
("2018-02-28", "1047087", "Charlotte", "Cath was the perfect host! She provided everything we needed from universal adapters to fresh eggs from her chickens. Cath even provides a binder full of information about the area (nearby hospitals  cute coffee places  things to do). The Garden Studio itself is very cute and stylish. My boyfriend and I stayed here for several weeks  and it had everything we needed. We couldn’t have asked for a better host or a better space for our stay in Sydney."),
("2018-03-11", "1047087", "Declan", "Nice little bungalow out the back  sleeping area felt quite small. Overall good but very small."),
("2018-03-16", "1047087", "Kate", "Cath’s Studio was all we needed for a 4 night stay in Sydney. Close to Sydney Uni for the daily commute for lecturesThank you Cath"),
("2018-03-17", "1047087", "Matt", "We had a great stay in Cathy’s studio - had everything we needed  nicely furnished & a cosy space.Would recommend & stay again Cath was great to deal with"),
("2018-03-25", "1047087", "Jenny", "Great place  smallish  but well organised  quiet  close to transport. Quick and helpful communication with Cath. Definitely recommend."),
("2018-09-29", "1047087", "Janelle", "Great location. Beautiful garden. Easy check in. Lovely neighbourhood. Comfy bed. Nice touches like breakfast."),
("2018-11-09", "1047087", "Huang", "Owner is very nice place not big but very clean and comfortable"),
("2018-11-18", "1047087", "Ali", "We really enjoyed staying in this lovely little tiny home! It was plenty big enough. We had everything we needed  heaps of privacy and good supplies! Was definitely more than I expected. We loved staying in Marrickville and Cath’s book of tips were really helpful. It was good being in walking distance to public transport and there was plenty of parking on the street. Really enjoyed our stay and would definitely come back again!"),
("2018-12-22", "1047087", "Daniel", "Cath’s Garden Studio was the perfect place for me to stay while visiting my friends who live in the area! Would definitely stay again. Breakfast provided was a very nice touch too!"),
("2019-02-11", "1047087", "Michelle", "Highly recommend lovely host who makes you feel at home and very welcome on her amazing studio!"),
("2013-05-07", "1073607", "Micael", "After 10 days in such a fantastic terrace  I can say that Natasa is simply the perfect host  and even better person! Friendly  funny and flexible  she is always ready to help  to have a conversation and she makes you feel like at home as you enter the house. The house is clean and tidy  and the kitchen and living room are spacious and with all you may need. The room itself  with double bed  is a perfect and very comfortable place to relax as at home. The house is perfectly located 1 minute (or even less) form Petersham train station  from where you get to the city in a 10 minutes ride. There is also a supermarket and shops nearby  which make it easy to get provisions. Of course  the house has Wifi connection  which is fast and reliable.This has been the first time I book a room through Airbnb and it has been such a fantastic experience that I will definitely consider Airbnb for further stays  and if in Sydney  at Natasa’s place for sure!"),
("2013-05-18", "1073607", "Sarah", "Natasa is an incredibly lovely person and an amazing host! She was so friendly and helpful  always up for a chat or willing to help us with directions. The house is in an unbeatable location  right near Petersham station! It is a super short walk to the station  and just a few stops into the city center. Even though the station is so close  you can't hear the trains from the room  so a good night's sleep is guaranteed. The room itself is very big and gorgeous! Natasa really has an eye for decorating and designed the room to be not only beautiful but very functional! There is tons of storage space  including two locking bedside cabinets. The kitchen is also wonderful and Natasa was kind enough to let us use a shelf in the pantry and another in the fridge. We loved staying here so much and were so sad to leave! Natasa  thank you again for all of your kindness and generosity - you're the best! "),
("2013-06-24", "1073607", "Meg", "A lovely host with great communication.An excellent inner city location. Close to everything including great restaurants within walking distance. Highly recommended."),
("2013-07-13", "1073607", "Hilke", "Natasa was a friendly and communicative host. She was always very busy but took her time to provide us with useful information about places to go  things to see and how to get there. We had chosen her place to organize the further months of our stay in Sydney and booked the accommodation before our arrival in Australia. The house is located in a side road to Petersham rail station - a perfect location to get into the heard of Sydney quick and easy. The room  bathroom and kitchen were equipped with everything you need. We enjoyed stayting at Natasas home!"),
("2013-10-16", "1073607", "Stephan", "Had been a great time! I love the room and the possibility to use the free wi-fi in that room. The train station is so near  you can spit to it.Natasa had been very friendly and helpfully ... even when I get a 'flu she surprised me with some medicals to get better.Sydney in spring is a good place ... Petersham with Natasas room in Sydney in spring close to perfection."),
("2013-11-04", "1073607", "Sandy", "Natasa is a very amazing and lovely host. She was very warmful and helpful  always up for giving advice or to chat. The house is very well located : close to Petersham station so very easy to go to the center (but without any noise from the room). The room is spacious and nice!  And the kitchen (we enjoyed the terrace ;-)  and the bathroom are very well furnished and you have enough space to put all your personal stuff. We had a very great stay so thank you again Natasa !!!"),
("2013-11-23", "1073607", "Romy", "No other place to feel like you're at home : comfy  clean  with all that you may need in your bedroom (from the adptators to the tissues)  the bathroom  in the kitchendo or to your laundry  watch TV or relax in the beautiful cozy garden.As for the host  Natasa is an amazing woman. If you like your independance  no problem either; But you'll miss something by not having a nice and funny chat with your hostess  a multi-talented woman with a viral happinness ;) As mentionned before  don't miss a slice of Natasa's exquisite pizzas or fresh salad.This all could sound as an ad  yet it's all the result of a so very nice stay in this inner west terrace of Sydney.More than highly recommended !"),
("2013-12-22", "1073607", "Lina", "Had a brilliant stay with Natasa. A beautiful person and SO easy to get along with. Has made my 1 month stay absolutely memorable and always had time to help out with even the smallest things and kick back and have a laugh over wine. The house location is easily commutable to the CBD and grocery stores are within 5-10 minute walk. Highly recommend staying with Natasa  she will make you feel right at home. "),
("2014-01-02", "1073607", "Francesca", "Location  room  security  comfort etc are all great. Natasa as a host is what makes this more that a place to just crash. She is a very sweet woman who gave us some great insights into the city. She even showed us the best (and secret) place to get front row for the NYE fireworks overlooking the bridge and harbour. With this being the first Air bnb experience for us we were a little anxious  but as soon as we arrived  we were sure we had made the best decision.Travellers may want to consider a rail card if choosing this location as it saves lots of money for those staying a few days or more. "),
("2014-03-10", "1073607", "Tomislav", "This place is awesome! Me and my wife stayed here for nearly 2 weeks and we felt so comfortable and welcome. Natasa is such an amazing person  so friendly  easy-going  helpful  open-minded and funny. It is so easy to talk to Natasa. She gave us a lot of advices and very good ideas during our stay in Sydney. The location is great if you want to explore Sydney. The train station is very close and it makes it so easy to reach all the places. Natasa's home is very clean and so cozy. Our room was fantastic and very comfortable. We felt like home at Natasa's place and we would stay there again. We highly recommend this place!  "),
("2014-04-22", "1073607", "Amanda", "I have so many great things to say about my 4 week stay with Natasa that I don't know where to start!  Natasa is very welcoming  and she made me feel right at home from the moment I got there.  She is generous and flexible--and one of the happiest people to be around.  Natasa always had the perfect suggestion of where to go  what to do or the best way to get there.  She knows the city really well  and is always happy to give suggestions (or show you herself!).  Natasa will talk with you as much or as little as you want  but we had a great time hanging out downstairs--I never felt like I needed to be in my room.  She even invited me to her famous pizza night with her friends--yum!As for the house/room--it was great.  The location is amazing--so close to both the Petersham train station and a short walk to all of the Parramatta Rd buses.  Everything you need will be close by or short walk away.  The house is great--clean  homely and has everything you need! The green room was perfect--great hard wood floors  comfortable bed  plenty of space for my things--as advertised.  Even with 3 or 4 of us in the house  I never had to wait for the bathroom--everyone had such different schedules that it always seemed to work out.  I did laundry quite a few times while I was there  which was no problem at all--there is a dryer or clothes line.  I would not hesitate for a second to book this house again!  It made my time working away from home so much better by being around lovely people in a very nice home.  I loved it and I hope I get the chance to visit Natasa in Petersham again soon!"),
("2014-07-07", "1073607", "Gordon", "Staying with Natasa was great  lovely house and lovely host. Would definitely stay here again."),
("2014-07-14", "1073607", "Lisa", "Great neighbourhood close to transport and easy to walk to places too. Room was nice and very clean  with character. Natasa wasn't around much and neither was I but she was lovely and helpful. "),
("2014-07-18", "1073607", "Judith", "Super helpful  super nice! Have had an exceptionally great time at her place! Thanks for everything."),
("2014-08-19", "1073607", "Rhiannon", "Our stay with Natasa has been great! She goes out of her way to make us feel comfortable. We have shared many lovely meals together (including her famous pizza!). Her house is clean  cosy and has everything we could possibly need. Natasa has been extremely accommodating and friendly. Would recommend everyone to stay here. Fantastic friendship! The location is great too! Very handy to catch the train or bus (412) to the city or (444/445) to Balmain East Wharf. The local towns Petersham and Leichhardt have everything you need  shopping  restaurants  ATM etc. all less than 5 minute walk away. "),
("2014-11-14", "1073607", "Nicole", "While appreciative of last minute availability and sincere efforts of host in transit  my first ever airbnb stay wasn't particularly encouraging. A working key safe is a priority. I put my work colleague under inconvenience in the 3 trips to home it took to get access."),
("2014-12-29", "1073607", "Sarah", "I really loved to stay in Natasa's house. I arrived after 24 hour travel and she huged me very nice.The room is so beautiful. It loos like at the pictures. The house is great I love her furniture and it's just next to a train station.The bed is so comfy I loved it.She gave me very exactly descreption of how to get there. On christmas eve we went out in a restaurant and she gave me some sweet so I really felt like home. If you want to somewhere really good  go to her house.It was very clean and everything was just great."),
("2015-01-03", "1073607", "Alia", "Natasa est une hotesse charmante et souriante  prete a vous aider.La maison est grande  propre et la chambre identique a la photo avec un lit tres confortable.Nous avons apprecié le quartier de Petersham prêt du centre avec le train.l'accueil"),
("2015-02-09", "1073607", "Anna", "I had a lovely 4 weeks in Natasa's place. She's super helpful and knowledgeable about the area and shows you everything you need. She even took me to the shops on day one!  The house is fabulously close to the station.. about 2 minutes and well looked after. The room was bright  spacious and exactly what I was after.  The kitchen is tidy and super well equipped. Even though we had a full house at times  I never had any issues getting access to the bathroom or washing machines. I thoroughly enjoyed my stay with Natasa and can only highly recommend her place if you are looking for that balance between having your independence ( I was working so many night were spend on marking..) and socialising; we had some pleasant evenings catching up with all house mates and a beautiful glass of wine! Thanks Natasa for making me feel so welcome and being such a great host... I'll be back that's for sure!"),
("2015-02-16", "1073607", "Keefe", "Natasa was a fantastic host who was both kind  friendly and made me feel very welcomed on my return back to Sydney. As this was my first time using airbnb  I had my apprehensions.. However  it immediately disappeared upon meeting her and the other housemates. I would highly recommend staying here if you find yourself needing a place to stay here in Sydney. It cannot get any better! "),
("2015-02-19", "1073607", "Jez", "Welcoming dinner was greatly appreciatedEasy to access out of hours  clean and comfortable Thanks"),
("2015-02-27", "1073607", "Alexandra", "Natasa is very welcoming  friendly and lots of fun.I spent a busy few days in her great terrace and enjoyed one of her delish curries with drinks on the leafy terrace.I’m not surprised she always has so many guests.Thanks Natasa"),
("2015-03-03", "1073607", "Gillian", "I headed directly here from the Airport by train  and it was very easy to find! It's literally beside the Petersham train station. When I got to the home  it was nice and quiet in the surroundings and I liked that very much. The room is as in photos  the bed was comfortable  there's a writing table which was helpful for me. Natasa was really really nice and whipped up dinner for me when I was starving the first night. You'll enjoy your stay here! :)"),
("2015-08-08", "1073607", "Andie", "I stayed with Natasa for around four months starting when I moved over from the UK in April. I was looking for somewhere chilled out to stay while I settled into my new job and Natasa's was perfect. Natasa is s great host  she is welcoming and friendly but at the same time gives you privacy. She knows so much about Sydney and will give lots of advice from anything from restaurants to transportation. I really enjoyed my time staying at Natasa's and definitely recommend for a great base for exploring Sydney."),
("2016-01-08", "1073607", "Monika", "My daughter and I enjoyed our stay at Natasa´s house very much. Everything was like in the description. The house was very charming and the central of the City as well as the Airport was easily to reach by train  which stopped just around the Corner. Besides that we had good luck that Natasa was at home. So we could talk with her  several times  which was just so nice and much fun. She also gave us helpful ideas about restaurants or where to spend New Year´s Eve and so on. We would like to stay there again any time."),
("2016-02-05", "1073607", "Amin", "I booked the room from my account for one of my friends and this is his view: Actually  I was lucky that I spent my first days in Sydney in Natasa' lovely house. I spent more than two weeks there. As other people here mentioned  you feel that you are in your own house and have freedom for yourself. Alot of movies are provided in living room that you can select among them and watch. Also you can enjoy the lovely kitchen and the terrace. Being completely close to trian station  it is perfect for new arrivals like me. Also  the area is completely close to city center. When Natasa is at home you can enjoy talking with her. Unfortunately  we could not see each other so much since most of that time she was on a business trip. However among afew talks that we had  I enjoyed her manner and kindness. Beside your room  there are two other bedrooms in the first floor that you should share bathroom with them. It was ok and we had no problem. Also because the weather at most time was mild  the lack of airconditioning did not cause a problem. Finally  thanks again Natasa"),
("2016-02-29", "1073607", "Aurélie", "I couldn't have dreamed of a better place for my stay in Sydney. The room is exactly as described  spacious and clean. The shared space is also clean and convenient. The kitchen is very well equiped and there is a charming terrace to chill out. Natasa  the host  is a wonderful person: kind  always helpful and very funny. I had a great stay in this place! Thanks Natasa and see you soon. "),
("2016-03-22", "1073607", "Carly", "Natasa was a perfect host! From the moment I arrived at the airport she gave me clear instructions as to how to locate her place via the train. The room was amazing - spacious and clean. The location was great too as I was commuting each day and would only have to leave 5 minutes before to catch the train into the city which would only take 15 minutes. Natasa was always willing to offer advice on places to go and eat too and made me feel really welcome. I would fully recommend staying at Natasa's place and cannot wait to stay again next time I visit Sydney!!! Thanks again for everything :)"),
("2016-04-03", "1073607", "Rosana", "Wonderful host! Natasa was warm and welcoming and kindly organised Uber transport to get us to a show on time within half an hour of arrival!! Perfect location for inner city venues. The room was excellent- clean  comfortable and with lovely homely touches. Highly recommended stay. We will be back when back in Sydney."),
("2016-04-07", "1073607", "John", "Natasa is extremely welcoming and helpful. Her home is very conveniently located beside the Petersham station; very quiet at night though there is also a convenient pub on the corner. Everything was clean and comfortable."),
("2016-04-16", "1073607", "Nick", "Natasha was a great host. Arrangements were made in case I arrived when she wasn't home but in the end they weren't need. Natasha was very welcoming and the house was well presented. Them room was also very nice."),
("2016-04-18", "1073607", "Lorraine", "Natasa was a great host. All arrangements  to arrive and access the property  were d xcellent. We sat and chatted  she made me  feel  very welcome.  Petersham is a good area with transport and  restaurants  nearby."),
("2016-05-02", "1073607", "Yumiko", "Natasa was very friendly I felt like a visited friends house.The room was clean and bed was confutable and house is close to the city.I'll be back againThank you Natasa!! yum"),
("2016-06-21", "1073607", "Adam", "Great location - pub literally 20 metres away.  Petersham station a further 20 metres.  Lovely clean room  great shared facilities  very quiet house.  Nat was very accommodating with being there to let me in and show me around. 3 or 4 people live here but you would hardly know it."),
("2016-07-11", "1073607", "Samantha", "Natasa is an amazing host! Super lovely  friendly  kind and thoughtful. She is very happy all the time  easy going and always go above and beyond for your needs. I felt like I've gained a friend after this. The house is cozy  everyone are very kind  polite and respectful of your space and privacy. Literally ONE minute away from train station which takes you to the city within 15 minutes. Highly recommend! Thanks Natasa once again ☺️"),
("2016-08-15", "1073607", "Charlotte", "Lovely room with cute and super friendly Natasa  which made me had a very good time in Sydney. Like her so much  and the location of the house was super close to the train station. Hopefully can see her again. Thanks a lot!"),
("2016-09-03", "1073607", "Madison", "Natasa was a delight to deal with -always responded quickly to messages and made the whole process a breeze. The room was lovely and the house in an excellent location (train station and pub nearby!). I would definitely recommend a stay here."),
("2016-09-22", "1073607", "Kevin", "One of the best experiences I've had using AirBnB.  Natasa is a gem of a host.  Her place is very well organised and she is super friendly.  Location is right next to station too  which is convenient.  I would highly recommend staying here."),
("2016-09-24", "1073607", "Boni", "Natasa was a wonderful host! I felt so welcomed. The room was lovely and bright and its a sweet neighbourhood  close to trains  cafes and pubs. Would recommend. "),
("2016-09-30", "1073607", "Wanwan", "Natasa is a super lovely and nice host:D The room is all the same as the pictures shown on this page  and all the things are clean! Only 2 minutes walk to train station and bus stops  easy to travel anywhere!"),
("2016-10-04", "1073607", "Hardeep", "Our stay with Natasa was really wonderful. She welcomed us with such warmth and made us feel at home. She would readily help you with all your queries and also offers great tips about the local sightseeing. The room was as good as depicted in the pictures and you can use all the amenities right from the kitchen to laundry. The bathroom was also clean  with good standards of hygiene. The house is really close to petersham metro station and has easy accessibility from the airport. It's also not too far from the city that saves a lot of commuting time. There are a lot of breakfast options available and you can also cook food if you like.  It was a pleasure meeting Natasa. Cheerful and kind hearted that she is she made our stay really worthwhile."),
("2016-11-07", "1073607", "Bob", "I didn't meet Natasa but she sent me comprehensive messages about her house & how to access it  my room and the other guests.  As a result my stay went smoothly and comfortably.The guest room in which I stayed was large & comfortable  with a large window that made the room bright & airy.  There was some aircraft noise but not sufficient to disturb me.The other rooms of the house that I used  the bathroom & kitchen  were also comfortable with appliances working smoothly.The house is conveniently located close to the railway station  with a pub opposite & a good cafe 5 minutes walk around the block.I would heartily recommend Natasa's house."),
("2016-11-07", "1073607", "Alasdair", "We had a great stay with Natasa for 28 days. She is a really friendly and helpfully host. The house and bedroom were spacious and the house is really close to the train station for getting around Sydney easily."),
("2016-11-14", "1073607", "Reza Akmal", "It was a pleasure staying with Natasa! Even if she's a really busy person  she made everything possible  that my stay at her place was very enjoyable and comfortable. The place is great and very well located.Petersham Train station just 100meter from house  Sydney International Airport just 15-20 minutes  we using Uber as per suggested by Natasa and costly around 20 Aud from airport to Natasa House I'd definitely go there again when I come back to Sydney. Thank you!"),
("2016-12-12", "1073607", "Nur", "Another awesome stay with Natasa at what i feel is already my home in Sydney :)"),
("2016-12-29", "1073607", "Yuting", "The location is so nice  very near the train station  it takes 10 minutes to go to city. The room is clean and nice. Natasa is very warm and friendly."),
("2017-01-01", "1073607", "Gordan", "Natasa's house is just by the train station  which is very convenient. We asked her opinions on where to go for new years's eve and she and her friend provided lots of very useful suggestions. She's the best host ever!"),
("2017-01-16", "1073607", "Liz", "Totally unsuitable for older people  dingy  messy garden  description does not say there were 5 people sharing one bathroom - the other shower is downstairs and reached by going outside! There is a cat not mentioned in description. Natasha gave someone our beer which she replaced. it may be cheap to Sydney and convenient for the station but it was very disappointing. Had it not been convenient for our family nearby we would have left on day one. towels not changed on a 10 day visit and we had to request bedding change. It was very hot despite a fan in the room. security is poor with only one locked gate protecting us and no locks on bedroom doors. Not recommended even for backpackers."),
("2017-02-04", "1073607", "Glenda", "Natasa is a welcoming and friendly host"),
("2017-02-12", "1073607", "Daniel", "Quite enjoyed my stay at Nataša's. The room was nice  the bathroom large and well stocked  and the overall hospitality was excellent.The house happens to be a short walk from a strip of great brunch and coffee places. The closest establishment  West Village -a gastropub  for a lack of a better term- is 100 metres away from the house. (It's great for lunch and I instantly fell in love with it for its aesthetic  food offerings  and tap list.)Nataša was a helpful and fun host. We ended up running into each other at pizzeria (Gigi) one evening and enjoying schooners at a brewery (Batch) on another evening. Our casual chats were delightful and full of insight.Not a single complaint."),
("2017-02-16", "1073607", "John", "Natasa's place was a great place to stay for me. The house / room is very clean and comfortable and privacy is very good. The house is close to transport  both bus and train are a very short walk. It is a very nice walk to explore the length of Norton St Leichhardt. I would be happy to stay again and recommend the place to anyone."),
("2017-03-06", "1073607", "Fernanda", "Fiquei hospedada nessa casa por 14 dias juntamente com minha mãe e tudo foi muito bom! Casa limpa  toalhas e lençóis limpos e à disposição. Quando tivemos alga dúvida ou problema foi logo resolvido pela querida Natasa! Localização excelente perto da estação de metrô e a uma caminhada não muito longa dos ônibus e supermercados. Indico essa casa para quem quiser ficar em Sydney por um valor bom e localização boa. "),
("2017-03-30", "1073607", "John", "Natasa's place is very comfortable with a nice big room and great share bathroom. Natasa is very friendly and helpful and I enjoyed my stay very much  over 3 weeks! Very handy to transport  both trains and bus and conveniently between Petersham's Portuguese and Leichhardt's Italian restaurants. Fabulous place to stay! "),
("2017-04-06", "1073607", "Edward", "Great location  right next to Petersham train station - so easy access to the CBD.Room was cosy and ticked all the boxes for us. Natasa was a lovely host  and looks out for all your needs. If you are looking for a place that is good value then this is the place for you. "),
("2017-04-08", "1073607", "Paul", "Perfect Stay. Just what i needed  inner west  next to train station and the host Natasa is the best"),
("2017-04-15", "1073607", "Nicolaus", "Super Zimmer und Haus  nur 1 Minute von der U-Bahn entfernt. Sehr freundliche Kommunikation mit Natasa. Alles sauber und angenehm. Würde wieder hier wohnen wollen! Danke! "),
("2017-05-06", "1073607", "Irene", "My mum stayed at Natasa's during two weeks and she loved her stay. She enjoyed very much the cozy room and the friendly atmosphere. Natasa is a very good host  full of energy and always ready for a good laugh. The house is very conveniently located as it is only 5 minutes walking from Petersham train station. My mum will be happy to stay at Natasa's again next time she will be in Sydney. Highly recommend the place. Thank you Natasa :-)"),
("2017-05-22", "1073607", "Cliff", "It is a nice place with every necessities. Close to the train station  only 2 minutes walk. Easy to get to the city  only 10-15 min. Fully-equipped kitchen. Everything is clean and tidy. "),
("2017-05-27", "1073607", "Claire", "Natasa was absolutely lovely. She described how to get to her place in great detail and even helped me put with my Uber on the last day.Her place was cosy and she even took me out around Sydney!Her place is literally next to the train station which works great if you don't drive in Sydney.She had a dozen types of teas for me to select from and also gave me recommendations for things to visit.I felt very welcomed and at home - as though I had been living there for months!Would definitely stay there again and hang out with Natasa. :)"),
("2017-06-09", "1073607", "Monika", "I selected this airbnb on the basis of its proximity to my son's place.  Although I didn't meet tge host There was very good communication sbout getting into the premises and other facilities. I had a very comfortable night's sleep. My room was very large and the shared facilities were fine. Close to Petersham eailway station which is a plus."),
("2017-07-31", "1073607", "Nancy", "From the moment I arrived at Natasa's I felt at home. She insisted on carrying my massive suitcase up the stairs for me  while explaining the layout of her home. She even suggested a wonderful spot for brunch for my friend and I. (I should actually say even before I arrived since she was extremely flexible and allowed me to alter my stay to a couple days later). My entire stay was extremely comfortable. Natasa gives the perfect balance of privacy and companionship to her guests. She never once disturbed me  but was always willing to have a chat on the rare occasion that we crossed paths (we both were in and out of the house quite often). Any time I was unsure of something she was available by text and always had a quick response. The location is also extremely convenient as it is only about a block from the Petersham station where I was able to catch either the bus or train to wherever I needed to go. You can take the bus to a grocery store  but Norton Plaza has 2 grocers as well as other little shops  and is only about a 10min walk. My only regret is that I did not book Natasa's place for my entire trip! If I return to Sydney I will definitely be booking her home again  and would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable and convenient location  hosted by an extremely friendly and hospitable individual."),
("2017-09-09", "1073607", "Anna", "Friendly"),
("2017-09-21", "1073607", "Maria", "Nataša is a perfect host offering a cozy  clean and comfortable place to stay."),
("2017-10-05", "1073607", "Natasha", "Great host  great house  comfortable room. Perfect stay!"),
("2018-01-06", "1073607", "Laury", "Very good Host and very very great location : 1min to the train and 15 min to central station !Thank you Natasa!"),
("2018-06-17", "1073607", "Celina", "Natasa's place is conveniently located a minute away from Petersham station which makes it super easy to get around Sydney. Her house is quite cosy although it can be a bit cold during winter  but the blankets in the room are definitely enough to keep you warm at night. I only met Natasa on the last day of my trip as she was away but she was lovely  as were her housemates. Would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-06-22", "1073607", "Asuka", "I had a great time with Natasa and other guests. She is so kind and funny.All amenities are there so It was really convinience.Thank you for your kindness."),
("2018-07-13", "1073607", "Buntong", "Amazing place! If it's your date is available  just book it! I love her place. Cozy and right next to the station. I extended my stay from 1 week to 10 days. Highly recommended. Will come back next time."),
("2018-07-29", "1073607", "Buntong", "My second stay with Natasha. If the place is available on your dates  just book it. "),
("2018-08-12", "1073607", "Shahin", "Natasa’s place is lovely and cozy and so is the room. But the. Eat part of the stay is ofcourse natasa whose one of the loveliest people you’ll come across!"),
("2018-08-15", "1073607", "Shahin", "Natasa is one of the nicest people you’ll come across! Her home is lovely and cozy and close to public transport stops"),
("2018-08-20", "1073607", "Vanessa", "Natasa's place is PERFECT!  Pictures are accurate and the place is super clean!She also offerred great range of coffee and tea which make my morning freshened. Just 1 min walk from station but never felt noisy. Homie and comfort stay:)"),
("2018-08-28", "1073607", "Zac", "Natasa’s Place was comfortable and cosy  we shared a wine and had a good chat  perfect place for my work trip. "),
("2018-10-12", "1073607", "Puspa", "We love Natasa’s place. It felt like home away from home. It has all the amenities and very close to train station for transport. Cafes and pub nearby. Natasa is very accommodating host  always up for a chat and easy to live with. Would stay again :)"),
("2018-10-25", "1073607", "Minnie", "Conveniently located - Train station just around the corner + the airport within 25 mins by taxi/ car. Clean and cosy room + necessary amenities in the house available. Thoroughly enjoyed my stay."),
("2018-10-29", "1073607", "Ana", "."),
("2018-11-08", "1073607", "Lucie", "We had a very good stay at Natasa's home. Her house is lovely  the bedroom is spacious and very clean. Natasa is a perfect host  she welcomed us very well and she is very generous. The house is very well located  next to public transport  we were 20 minutes from the city centre. So  it's a perfect location to stay in Sydney  thanks again !"),
("2018-11-17", "1073607", "Sarah", "Great and accurate communication  friendly host  good sized room and comfortable bed.  The location is amazing  right next to Petersham train station  and an easy walk to Leichhardt's Norton Street."),
("2018-11-20", "1073607", "Jussi", "It was a very nice visit to Natasa’s place and definetely recommend it to everyone."),
("2018-11-30", "1073607", "Xifan", "Design house too many painting  super nice owner super super super nice   clean place  everything t (Phone number hidden by Airbnb) good!"),
("2018-12-15", "1073607", "Diego", "Olá!Quero começar falando da facilidade de comunicação com Natasa. Sempre que precisei ela foi rápida em responder e esclareceu todas as dúvidas.Localização: A casa fica ao lado da estação de Trem  literalmente  o que facilita muito os deslocamentos. Fica também relativamente próxima ao aeroporto  inclusive vale a pena usar o Uber se estiver com malas maiores ou em mais de uma pessoa  porque o Trem partindo do Aeroporto tem uma preço diferenciado e pode acabar não valendo a pena.Quarto: Amplo  limpo  tem ar-condicionado  guarda roupas  cômoda  além disso colchão e roupa de cama são bons! Banheiro: Grande  chuveiro bom. É compartilhado com mais dois quartos (que quando fui estavam ocupados) mas não tivemos problemas. Sempre limpo nos dias que estive aqui. Cozinha: Bem equipada e pode ser usada sempre que necessário. Anfitriã: Natasa foi uma excelente anfitriã! Atenciosa  comunicativa  sempre disposta a ajudar no que for necessário. Faz você se sentir em casa! Sem dúvidas ficaria hospedado novamente e recomendo para quem procura um lugar para passar alguns dias em Sydney."),
("2018-12-26", "1073607", "滋榕", "Natasa is a very good host  she keeps her house very clean and everything is in order. The location is great and it's convenient for me to go to every part of the city by train. I've been enjoying a very good stay in her house!"),
("2018-12-31", "1073607", "Bonnie", "Natasa was nice and she responded message quickly! Her place was cute and cozy! Sometimes it’s a bit hot during the daytime in summer. But she gave us a really nice fan! You could find almost any kitchenware you want in the kitchen and made yourself a nice dinner! The location was good as well since it was located just 3-5mins walk to Petersham train station!"),
("2019-02-01", "1073607", "Kim", "Great place to stay  fantastic value for money  very homely  great facilities  great location  fabulous host! Couldn't have been happier with Natasa's home."),
("2014-01-02", "1090153", "David", "We stayed at Aquila House over Xmas and NY in 2013 and had a spectacular time.  The house is stylish and simple  with impressive water views and only a short walk to the beach.  It managed to take 2 adults + 2 children + various other family members and friends with kids for BBQs without seeming crowded.  My sons were amazed to hear kookaburras and have a couple of parakeets come down to join us on the terrace at breakfast.  Susie the owner was very straightforward to deal with and added some really thoughtful touches to welcome us (Xmas tree  hamper  list of best cafés and restaurants in the village).  Just be aware that you should rent a car to get around  same need if you stay anywhere  outside of the very centre of Sydney to be honest.  I highly recommend Aquila House for a genuine summer break."),
("2017-01-04", "1090153", "Charlotte", "A very welcoming host as we were greeted with a much appreciated hamper of food and Christmas crackers when we arrived and the use of the car was very useful! A lovely area of welcoming neighbours and a selection of good shops/cafes  just a steep walk to the beach unfortunately which wasn't a problem for us  but perhaps the more elderly or young would have issues with. The house was as described and in a beautiful location on the northern beaches with the morning sun on the terrace for breakfast! Overall we had a fantastic family holiday here and would come again. "),
("2019-01-03", "1090153", "Janine", "A modern  well equipped  spacious house with amazing views. It was family friendly and very comfortable. Susie was very organised and hospitable."),
("2013-06-25", "1098211", "Matthew", "We stayed at this little quaintly situated sweetheart of an apartment for 3 nights in June and would return. Fits 2 people no problems  and the decorations surround you with a glow of warmth and style. If Location to some of Sydney's great lifestyle treats is an important point for your visit  then this place is well worth considering. See you again Serena!"),
("2013-07-15", "1098211", "Katharina", "I stayed at Serena's flat for two weeks in July  it's a cosy little place  perfectly located to discover the city and the thriving night life around Kings Cross and Surry Hills. Getting around from here is also quite easy - the train station of Kings Cross is just across Williams St and you have buses all around you. The flat is in the basement so no views and it can be a bit dark in winter  but in summer it won't get so hot. The kitchen has all the basic facilities you would need for a holiday stay  the bathroom is neat and everything was tidy.Contact and Check-in/Check-out was easy and prompt  with complementary fruit  bread rolls  jam and milk to start off my stay. There is an ATM right next to the entrance and a bakery across the street  so all very handy."),
("2013-07-23", "1098211", "Natasha", "Serena's apartment is tidy  comfy  attractively decorated and perfectly located just steps from bars  pubs and restaurants. She left us gift basket of jam  fruit  oatmeal and buns that was much appreciated. We could hear music from a nearby club or bar so would advise earplugs but we slept well. Great hot shower! We would definitely recommend it to others. Thanks!"),
("2013-08-05", "1098211", "Jackie", "Serena's place is superbly located  pretty much across the road from King's Cross  a short walk into the CBD with easy access to public transport. We stayed for a weekend  and were lucky enough to be able to check in on the Friday morning  as there hadn't been anyone staying in the apartment the night before. Serena greeted us  gave us advice about the area  and had even made us a breakfast hamper complete with home made jam!The apartment had everything we needed  and was very nicely decorated. The only down side was a fair bit of nighttime noise  as it is located in quite a happening area and we were there over the weekend. Luckily we're not particularly light sleepers so we were still able to sleep.Overall it was a great weekend  and we would definitely stay there again."),
("2013-08-10", "1098211", "Annie", "Serena's apartment is centrally-located and near a lot of great restaurants and bars. The coffee shop next door was really nice. Serena was a great host and greeted us with a tasty breakfast basket. The apartment itself was nice and clean although somewhat dark and the main window faced a lightly frequented alleyway so we generally kept the blinds shut. That said  it was a good place for the price and I would recommend it."),
("2013-08-12", "1098211", "Carolyn", "Had a really great stay at Serena's apartment.  The location was great - we arrived at Sydney airport at 9pm  by 9.30  we were meeting Serena at the apartment and by 10pm we were meeting friends at the Kings Cross Hotel down the street.  Very convenient!The apartment was thoughtfully decorated  the breakfast was simple and nice  the bed was comfy  the bathroom clean.  No complaints!  Surprisingly quiet for the middle of the city.  Would definitely recommend!"),
("2013-08-21", "1098211", "Azizi", "My wife  daughter and I had an amazing time in Sydney and staying at Serena's place. The location is great  it is walking distance from most tourist attractions in the city (if you love a bit of walking like we do - about 25 mins walking to Opera house  Darling Harbour).  Supermarket is just around the corner. And if you are a Muslim looking for halal food  there are a couple of halal restaurants about 5 mins walk from the apartment. Serena's apartment is nice and cozy  the kitchen is well equipped for cooking a simple meal. Oh and Serena is very flexible with check-ins and check-outs; which is super helpful when travelling with a toddler. All in all  it is a great place to stay if you are travelling as a couple or with a small child. "),
("2014-01-08", "1098211", "Brigitte", "I´ve been in Serena´s Place for a bit more than two weeks with my 15-year-old daughter. Everything was nice and clean and very well equipped and organized. We loved staying there. Thanks to Serena."),
("2014-01-13", "1098211", "Jessie", "We had a fantastic mini break at Serena's apartment. It's a great location  very secure  nicely decorated  clean and very comfortable. Serena (and her mum  who kindly checked us in) was a very welcoming host  who was extremely responsive to any queries before and during our stay. It's right near kings cross  and we were there on the weekend  but no problems with noise  and we slept really well."),
("2013-10-14", "1131054", "Shelley", "This apartment is absolutely exquisite. The fittings and furnishings are very high quality and comfortable.  The place is like a beautiful parisian retreat.  The location is close to great cafes  shops and Centennial Park  10 mins from city and beaches.  It truly is a home away from home.  We are originally from Sydney so we know our areas which is why we chose to stay here.  We used to always stay in hotels but NOW we will endeavour to stay here whenever we come to Sydney.  Louise was wonderful  extremely helpful and timely with all our questions.  "),
("2013-12-23", "1131054", "James", "An amazing place situated in the heart of Woolahra  it was just perfect for the night of our wedding. Louise was unbelievably  accommodating  allowing us to drop off some things the day before our stay  setting up candles and flowers  leaving us a fruit platter and great provisions for breaky the next morning and responding to a 12am locked out call! She is a gem - thanks again Louise! The French provincial/art deco styled apartment was luxurious with a super comfy bed  relaxed atmosphere and situated 2 mins walk from Queen street's yummy cafes and delis! We would definitely recommend this place to anyone interested  it is worth every cent and we look forward to staying here again!"),
("2014-01-13", "1131054", "Ilias", "My daughter and I stayed at Louise's apartment. It is absolutely fantastic. Great location  nice little cafes and most of what you could need. Perfectly clean and comfortable. A beautiful shaded veranda great bathroom and kitchen. I would recommend this apartment to anyone."),
("2014-02-17", "1131054", "Deb", "In a word WOW! We loved it here. It had all the comforts of home and more as well as welcoming touches such as fruit and fresh bread.   The amenities were everything you could want and more. The quality of everything was outstanding. We could easily live here and not want for anything. Well done Louise on a fabulous abode! Stunning! We will definitely stay here whenever we are in Sydney.Thank you!"),
("2014-03-04", "1131054", "Nathaneil", "Perfect! Perfect! Perfect! From the time you walk up the stairs to this beautiful  fully stocked terrace you feel right at home! The pictures can't even begin to describe the warmth and and comfort of this immaculately furnished  fully equipped 2 bedroom apartment! With on site parking  a laundry  the most comfortable bedding I have ever slept in  an amazingly sunlight filled kitchen and in one of Sydney cutest suburbs this place was perfect for anyone wanting to visit Sydney! Close to shops  cafés and restaurants and only minutes drive from the cbd staying here was one of the best decisions I have made when visiting Sydney! Louise is wonderful and caters to your every need and is easy to contact! I highly recommend staying here to anyone who is wanting to visit Sydney for any period of time!! :) "),
("2014-06-06", "1131054", "Jude", "Louise's apartment is simply beautiful - the only hesitation I have about recommending it is that it will become so popular I won't be able to stay there again! My colleague and I stayed there for two nights whilst on business and it was so much nicer that the normal corporate apartment - but still had all the small touches you expect (bath robes  toiletries  hair dryer  etc...). It would also be a perfect place to stay for a pleasure. The location is great - right in the Woollahra village - and close to the city. Louise has exquisite taste and the apartment is decorated with a lot of style and panache.  She was an excellent host who communicated with me swiftly and effectively - our check-in was completely hassle free - and we were welcomed with fresh bread  fruit  and milk. We will definitely look to stay here again and highly recommend it to the airbnb community. "),
("2014-07-22", "1131054", "Melissa", "Louise's apartment exceeded all expectations!! Fantastic location  spacious and so tastefully decorated. The most comfortable bed in the world and the bathroom...where do I stop.The welcome bottles of wine  the fruit  movie pass  Louise you are so special. I will stay here every time I come to Sydney. Must agree with another reviewer though  this should be kept a secret as everyone will want to come! Thankyou Louise."),
("2014-07-29", "1131054", "Sean", "I love staying in this apartment  it really is the perfect position in Sydney  its always spotless and beautifully presented. I almost don't want to share a review  just in case its not available in the future.."),
("2014-08-04", "1131054", "Carolyn", "Queen Street is a terrific location with a vibrant village atmosphere  cafes  specialty food stores  boutiques and more. The apartment is full of delightful surprises and charm. So much more than any hotel room. Louise's 5 star hospitality includes sharing her designer furnishings and collectibles with you  the immaculate presentation of the apartment  her warm communication style and her attention to detail to ensure you enjoy every moment of your stay."),
("2014-08-17", "1131054", "Ellie", "Apartment exceeded our expectations. Spacious  clean and with every convenience you might need. Milk  bread and fruit on arrival was an amazing bonus as well as the offer to check out late. Perfect location  easy walk to shops  park  markets and transport. Communication was friendly and prompt. Will stay again when in Sydney. "),
("2014-09-29", "1131054", "Zoe", "What an amazing place! Highly recommend. Even nicer than the photos. We were left a welcome fruit bowl and so forth. Couldnt have asked for more. ! Would definitely stay here  (i'm glad we didnt book the Hughenden nearby  as for the same price this place was incredible) . The spare sunroom with its own bed for one was perfect for the 2rd person staying  and the fact there was wifi  a balcony  amazing location   what more could one ask for. Thanks Louise!"),
("2014-11-13", "1131054", "Karin", "LOVED IT! Such an amazing apartment in a great location.The host was great- we arrived to a fruit bowl and muesli. I could not recommend it more highly."),
("2014-11-15", "1131054", "Jennifer", "The listing was accurate  although the pictures were nice they don't reveal how lovely this place really is. Great location  friendly host  I would love to stay again. "),
("2014-11-25", "1131054", "Carolyn", "Another lovely stay. Thanks Louise."),
("2015-01-03", "1131054", "Kristi", "We loved our stay. The  apartment is super-stylish  quiet  relaxing and really well appointed with all the bits and pieces required to make it feel like a home from home (a superb bed AND fast wifi). The ""welcome pack"" of fruit  bread  milk and eggs with tea and coffee (Nespresso - thank you Louise!) were more than welcome for a couple of weary travellers. The apartment's location is perfect - smack-bang in the middle of Woollahra village with it's lovely shops  pubs and coffee places and a hop  skip and a jump into the CBD. It is perfectly located if you are planning to spend some time in the Eastern suburbs of Sydney.  To top it all off  Louise was very responsive and really helpful. Thanks a lot Louise  if you'll have us  we will be back the next time we are in Sydney."),
("2015-01-08", "1131054", "Conny", "We had a great stay in Woolahra. we enjoyed the beautifully designed flat and the convenience of living in walking distance of Queen Street and Centenial Park. Louise was a great host  meeting is on arrival  going through all the practicalities and popping by just when we left as well. The flat is well equipped  clean and comfortable."),
("2015-01-19", "1131054", "Peta", "Where do I start? The apartment was just lovely and the pictures really don't do it justice. Very spacious  plenty of luxurious little extras  spotlessly clean  comfy lounge and bed  great leafy secure courtyard with parking and a private sunny balcony. We had absolutely everything there that we could possibly want and really felt completely at home... which is saying a lot coming from a couple of fussy individuals like us. In addition  the thoughtful food items waiting for us was a pleasure and Louise's communication and consideration for us was really appreciated. It is just so nice to deal with someone that is so well organised and on top of things. Lastly  the location was just great. So surprisingly quiet... and we found some lovely restaurants and boutiques at our doorstep. I would love to come back sometime and stay a week to just relax and enjoy exploring the neighbourhood. Thanks Louise :)"),
("2015-03-30", "1131054", "Shirley", "It's been a lovely stay at Louise apartment. It is conveniently located with bus stops just a few blocks away  20~30 mins to city centre and bondi beach. It's also very nice of Louise to offer the welcome pack full of fruits and bread and milk. The apartment is just as shown on the pictures  very spacious and stylish vintage furnitures. The area is quiet and safe  with very nice neighborhood. I already look forward to another stay at Louise apartment."),
("2015-05-25", "1131054", "Kate", "An incredible apartment. Imacculately presented  with stunning furniture and design throughout. A welcome pack including fridge essentials and fresh bread was provided  as well as bathroom shampoo  soap etc. Beautifully light-filled  my bridesmaids and I felt like royalty getting ready and the photos are sure to be amazing. Thanks for your hospitality  would recommend to any visitors to Sydney!!"),
("2015-07-06", "1131054", "Robyn", "I can not speak highly enough of Louise's apartment. If you are after the quintessential eastern suburbs stay and experience- this is it. Fabulous  roomy apartment in great location. Louise went out of her way to accomodate us at last minute and made us feel very welcome. Loved it. Robyn"),
("2015-07-15", "1131054", "Grant", "Listing description if anything undersold how great this place was (it's a lot bigger than it appears in the photos  too).  Light  tasteful  airy and quiet  it was a great pleasure to stay here  and perfectly situated near Paddington/ Darlinghurst/ buses to Bondi beach etc. We loved our stay  and will stay again in the future."),
("2015-08-07", "1131054", "Wendy", "I loved the apartment from the minute I parked the car in the car park. The entrance has been decorated beautifully and it takes your breath away. The apartment is upstairs and above a retail shop although you wouldn't know it. It is incredibly spacious  but cosy at the same time. The interior decoration is gorgeous and inviting plus it makes you feel like you are at home. The location is just fabulous and caters for everything. Local cafes for coffee in the morning  restaurants for dinner are walking distance  great retail shopping and local delicatessens. Centennial Park which is a great place to relax. and finally  when I arrived I found that Louise had left me fresh bread  a bottle of wine and some beautiful flowers. I would definitely recommend this property and would stay there again."),
("2015-09-26", "1131054", "Andrew", "Our last minute stay at #84 was a delight  the experience was super easy from beginning to end and Sarah very responsive and welcoming. The very tasteful apartment was spotless and cosy at the same time  a real home from home. Woollahra we discovered is a neighbourhood filled with great shops  eateries and it also proved to be a super convenient part of town - for the CBD  the bays and also the beaches. Highly recommended! "),
("2015-11-02", "1131054", "Josephine", "The host canceled this reservation 59 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-12-01", "1131054", "Elizabeth", "We really loved the area and the apartment and would not hesitate to recommend it to anyone who is going to spend time in Sydney. The apartment was light and airy and had lots of space. Sarah was very helpful and her apartment is really well equipped and carefully prepared for guests.  Queen Street is full of lovely shops and restaurants and close to good buses to get you into the city centre or over to Bondi or other beaches.  Great location and beautifully turned out place."),
("2016-01-10", "1131054", "Dan", "The host canceled this reservation 17 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-04-03", "1131054", "Yirong", "Spacious and clean  loved the kitchen and bathroom.    Sarah was kind enough to let us check in early  this is really a treat after flying for 17 hours!  "),
("2017-04-05", "1131054", "George", "Great place. Great location. Very clean."),
("2017-09-30", "1131054", "Vinka", "A gorgeous  comfortable and spacious place. Our host was timely with all communication and quick to help. Thoroughly recommend and I will be back next time I’m in Sydney"),
("2017-10-30", "1131054", "Beau", "Great apartment in great location. Woollahra is close to CBD  with great transport options; near Paddington with many fine restaurants and has great local stores for food  wine and other essentials.Apartment is perfectly fitted out - new appliances  fully equipped kitchen  nice linens  quality functional furnishings and a nice tree surrounded balcony. In addition  it came set up with lovely toiletries  good basic food items and lovely flowers.Sarah was an attentive  responsive host. She hand delivered an extra key  answered all our questions promptly and allowed us a late checkout when the apartment was free the day after we left. All good!"),
("2017-11-17", "1131054", "James", "Sarah's apartment was fantastic and one of the best airbnb's we've stayed in. Beautiful apartment in a great location. Sarah was very communicative and our check-in/out was very easy. Breakfast groceries on a arrival was a really nice touch."),
("2018-02-20", "1131054", "Katia", "84 Queen is a gem of a property: well-located  well-decorated  well-lit  very spacious and very comfortable furnishings. We appreciated the thoughtful welcoming touches and Sarah's prompt replies when we reached out."),
("2018-02-25", "1131054", "Miranda", "Everything was perfect and surpassed expectations... I can’t wait to stay there again!"),
("2018-05-13", "1131054", "Paul", "This place is a knockout ... stylishly decorated really well located ... short walk to anything you need in upscale area ... just perfect no complaints will return"),
("2018-09-24", "1131054", "Joel", "This is the 4th time I have stayed here and it never dissapoints."),
("2016-06-23", "11396243", "Rachael", "The host canceled this reservation 186 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-02-27", "11396243", "Michael", "The host canceled this reservation 34 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2013-08-19", "1145567", "Deborah", "I didn't meet Alison as she was away  but Adam let me in and explained everything to me. The house is beautifully (and very newly) renovated  the bed was wonderfully comfortable  and I had my own huge bathroom which was very luxurious. The street is quiet but very convenient to everything. All in all  a great bargain and a lovely place to stay - I'll be back!"),
("2013-12-03", "1145567", "Tanja", "Although I did not meet Alison  Adam showed me around.He is very relaxed and this place was realy nice to stay.Great bathroom and friendly quiet neighbourhood.  Easy to go to from this place to go to the centre as well."),
("2014-02-01", "1145567", "Rebecca", "Great stay in Rozelle in Alison's house. I needed a quiet and peaceful place to put my head each night while visiting friends in Sydney and it lived up to expectations!"),
("2014-02-24", "1145567", "Curtis", "Staying with Allison and Adam was wonderful. The place is centrally located and easy to walk to downtown Sydney or even take a bus. I was able to get in a game of cricket with Adam I had a blast coming from America this was my first experience in Australia. The place is very clean and modern love the bathroom and the kitchen is great too. The bedroom was at the top of flat very quiet  clean the bed was very comfortable slept well. I would highly recommend this place for anyone in the future it was wonderful place to stay Adam and Allison are great! "),
("2014-03-04", "1145567", "Marco", "Easy stay with excellent bus connection to the city. Shower was my favourite at this place  besides of that I had a good sleep in the comfy bed."),
("2014-03-26", "1145567", "Patrick", "Adam has been very helpful. House is modern and very quiet. My first time using AIRbnb and am impressed"),
("2014-07-14", "1145567", "Sandy", "The house was in an ideal spot for the party I was attending.  Warm comfy bed and lovely hot shower."),
("2014-11-20", "1145567", "Ziad", "Alison and Adam were my saviours in Sydney. our logistics officer booked us an hotel in the middle of nowhere in Ryde  claiming that it was the nearest point to Sydney Olympic Park as i had to attend the WPC14 with my colleagues. When i check the location  had to cancel and rushed to my ultimate accommodation portal  broadcasting generic message to nearby hosts to secure an accommodation the soonest.Alison was among the first to reply  and to pre-confirm...By the time i got there  Adam was already waiting for me and even kind enough to give me all the directions at 8am and off course waited for me outside to make sure that i'm paying the right cab fee. What can i say Adam  made feel at home from very first moment  kind  genuine and warm welcoming host. The house is is really nice fully refurbished  in a quite and well connected neighbourhood. My room was upstairs  a nice sunny room with  a queen bed and a bathroom attached. After i dropped in my luggage  Adam gave me guided orientation tour to the house  with access to all amenities. Felt like a VIP 5 star treatment as Adam even gave me a pre-paid bus ticket  which made my first(s) bus rides easier as some stations are pre-paid only.  So now that you that i have been at a great apartment  with great hosts  that's all  Rozelle is a really nice neighbourhood. walking distance from my hosts' place  you can make it to the main street packed  with cafe  bars and restaurant  a vibrant market and lot of attractions. if you happen to stay over a weekend don't miss Rozelle Market (Sat & Sun). Now the funny part  Adam was so happy to receive me as he's a all star backgammon player and he knows that Lebanese people are really good at that and he was so eager for round. One night we decided to play a round and Adam's expectations went all down the drain  i think i was the first Lebanese ever to be clumsy backgammon player. We agree that we will play another time via (Hidden by Airbnb) and i will have support from fellow Lebanese players :)All in all  i great time  the house is warm  clean  and comfortable and the hosts are simply AWESOME   "),
("2014-12-01", "1145567", "Ramon", "Alison immediately replied to my booking request and organised for her hubby to meet me as I was checking in late.They were very helpful and gave me a bus card to use. The room was very spacious and the house was close to transport and restaurants.Excellent hosts in an excellent location."),
("2015-02-14", "1145567", "Tegan", "I had a great stay! Alison was very efficient with my booking and advised me Adam would look after me on arrival. Adam was a great host  carried my case upstairs and even invited me to the pub. The room comfortable and had a great view. The bus around the corner was very convenient for me to get into the city. Thanks for having me!"),
("2015-03-06", "1145567", "Yan", "It is lovely neighborhood  very easy access to all the buses to the city center. The host adam has been helpful and was generous to let me use his living room for my work. The first night the room floor was dusty but was happy it was thoroughly cleaned on the second day. The only concern I had was the room has no lock  given I was the only female guest in the house and did not know any of other (male) guests on the first day of arrival  I was slightly nervous in the first night until I met other guests who were very kind and friendly. "),
("2015-08-29", "1145567", "Elise", "Thanks for a great stay  I have stayed here on three occasions  and have been welcomed by a very considerate host each time. The property is located close to shops restaurants and the gym. I would highly recommend this property and am looking forward to my next visitCheersElise"),
("2013-07-15", "1143151", "Juha", "Compact  well-appointed and equipped flat in top location  near public transport and shops. Eleanor is a very responsive and helpful host too."),
("2013-08-04", "1143151", "Redmond", "Lovely compact apartment in a convenient location. Close to nice restaurants in Kirribilli and Milson's point train station. Also a two minute walk from the ferry. Everything we needed was in the apartment and Eleanor quickly sorted out any minor problems we had."),
("2013-10-22", "1143151", "Matthew", "Why would you stay in a hotel when you could stay in this compact but all-you-need apartment in a perfect location just on the north side of the bridge in Sydney?  There are great eateries near by (our favourite - takeaway gourmet burgers overlooking the Opera House and harbour)  and train and ferry only a few minutes away. Eleanor was very flexible and everything went very smoothly  and her provision of breakfast food and staples was very helpful.Recommended."),
("2013-11-22", "1143151", "Emily", "I booked this for family staying in Sydney for my wedding.  My family members staying here thoroughly enjoyed their stay.  The apartment was comfortable and clean and within a great area for being central whilst also away from the hussle and bustle of the city!!  Eleanor communicated well and helped out with all our queries before and during the booking.  Thank you!"),
("2015-04-20", "1143151", "Edward", "My wife and I stayed at Eleanor's apartment for a week - we were met by Eleanor's mum who showed us around and provided us with a welcome pack of food.  The apartment is perfectly located with bus & ferry 2 minutes walk and trains only 5 minutes away. Kirribilli village is great for local shopping and eating out. The communal laundry one floor down was very convenient. The view of the bridge from the balcony is a bonus. We would definitely recommend Eleanor's apartment to other visitors."),
("2015-06-25", "1143151", "Peter", "Fabulous location. close to ferry  train and every great eatery that North Sydney has to offer. Fabulous apartment. very quiet retreat with the hustle and bustle only a short ferry ride away or 15 mins walk over the Sydney Harbour Bridge and you're in The Rocks. "),
("2015-11-27", "1143151", "Tom", "We had a wonderful time at Eleanor's harbourside apartment. You really do have a view of beautiful Sydney harbour and the Bridge from her balcony; a lovely spot to sit outside  have a glass of wine and relax. The location couldn't be better - a 2 minute walk to the ferry and within walking distance of the Ensemble theatre  Flying Squadron bar  the cafes of Kiribilli and we even walked past Luna Park round to the restaurants of Lavender Bay. The apartment is cosy and had everything we needed for our stay. Car parking was a bonus for this area. "),
("2016-01-03", "1143151", "Scott", "Everything about this stay was perfect! While I did not meet Eleanor in person  she was very helpful prior to arrival and communicated in a timely manner. The home was great  it's an awesome location  and was well maintained. No surprises here--just a truly wonderful stay. I spent 30 days at Eleanor's home and would stay there again if I came back to Sydney for a long work assignment."),
("2016-09-19", "1143151", "Leonie", "Eleanor's apartment is very well situated with great access to the city by train  bus  ferry or even by walking across the bridge. The apartment was bright and comfortable with a nice view. Eleanor is a conscientious and friendly host. "),
("2016-09-24", "1143151", "Dominic", "A beautiful  well presented place in a lovely location. Eleanor is a very welcoming host with a great appreciation of the area and provided plenty of suggestions for what to do/where to go. highly recommend. "),
("2016-12-05", "1143151", "Julie", "Eleanor's place is lovely and both Eleanor and her mother were great to deal with and went out of their way to make me feel welcome and help me out. The flat is really great - it has everything you need  including an amazing view of the harbour bridge  and the obligatory Sydney fireworks!! "),
("2016-12-07", "1143151", "Sandra", "Eleanor's place was very clean  comfortable and in a great location  the apartment was well equipped with everything you would need for a stay  including a well stocked fridge  comfortable bed and lounge  and a beautiful little balcony with amazing city views! The fans in the bedroom and lounge were very effective and quiet  and the location was so convenient. It was magical taking the ferry from the city to the apartment on my last night. I would definitely recommend Eleanor's home to other travellers."),
("2016-12-10", "1143151", "Sally", "Great location  very easy to navigate and perfect for a couple. Thanks for a great stay."),
("2016-12-25", "1143151", "Kumiko", "Eleanor was kind to let us check in early.House manual was comprehensive. Little disappointed with little fridge space for 6 nights stay.  Small area to prepare meals. About shower leakage was told on the day. Mould around screen from wet floor was unhygienic."),
("2016-12-31", "1143151", "Robert", "Eleanor was great!  Great neighborhood!"),
("2017-05-04", "1143151", "Donna", "The host canceled this reservation 29 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-07-25", "1143151", "Tan", "Eleanor's apartment was very cosy and just a stone throw away from the ferries which allowed us to access the main tourist spots like the Opera House and Harbour Bridge easily. We were welcomed by Eleanor's mom who showed us how to access the property with ease. The apartment was perfect for couples and provided a homely feeling."),
("2017-07-31", "1143151", "Lynne", "We had 3 nights at Eleanor's place and it was perfect. Location  communication  very warm welcome with a fabulous breakfast hamper.  The views from the windows and front balcony are stunning and the locality offers really handy restaurants  cafes  convenience stores. A 10/10 apartment/location.  Thanks so much Eleanor."),
("2017-10-07", "1143151", "Andrea", "Fantastic location! Very easy access to both ferry and train. Shops 5min walk away.  Clean and tidy place   perfect for a couple or single.  The breakfast basket was much appreciated! Thanks again for having us stay."),
("2017-10-11", "1143151", "Simon", "Great place. Quiet location. Generous breakfast and great place."),
("2017-10-14", "1143151", "Kelly", "We loved our stay at Eleanor’s place! The apartment is cosy and clean. A home away from home! The location is amazing! Next time we are in sydney we will be staying here again."),
("2018-01-27", "1143151", "Cat", "We had a great stay here! The apartment is bright and had everything we needed  the folder full of local tips was really useful! Great location close to the city and Kirribilli is a nice neighbourhood. Would recommend! Thank you"),
("2018-03-03", "1143151", "Hana", "주택가여서 조용했어요. 너무 한가롭게 지냈어요. 페리 타는 곳과 가까워서 편했습니다. 친절하게 작성한 안내북이 있어서 많은 도움이 되었습니다."),
("2018-03-12", "1143151", "Tom", "Great week in Eleanor’s comfortable well furnished and welcoming apartment  (accurately presented ) - lots of wonderful little touches -including a generous and well thought out breakfast basket.  Eleanor was a first class and friendly host  and her information book was a great help .Location was perfect -an easy 5 minute walk to North Sydney wharf - with easy access to Circular Quay and the rest of SydneyThe balcony with a view of Sydney Harbour Bridge  was a great and well used bonus for us All in all a great experience for us"),
("2018-03-26", "1143151", "Natalie And Matt", "We absolutely loved staying here. Fantastic bridge views. Amazing breakfast hamper.  Brilliant guide / tips book. Can walk  bus or catch ttain or ferry to the city. Quiet street. Fantastic apartment in great central location.  Good night life in Kirribilli.  LOVED IT.  Only slight glitch is that the bathroom is an en suite bathroom so if 2 people stay bear in mind you have to walk through bedroom to access shower & toilet and whether you are okay with that."),
("2018-07-23", "1143151", "Brie", "Great place   very central and clean. We had a great time at Eleanor’s place and she was prompt and a great communicator"),
("2018-08-24", "1143151", "Jacki (And Kim)", "A wonderful apartment with a spectacular view of the city. We felt very comfortable during our stay and had everything we needed and more. The apartment is close to shops and restaurants as well as the train and ferry. Enjoyed morning coffee on the balcony with a great view."),
("2018-09-18", "1143151", "Roger", "Eleanor and her family are great friendly and thoughtful everything is excellent."),
("2018-09-21", "1143151", "Antonino", "Outstanding place and host!"),
("2018-09-27", "1143151", "Jack", "Home away from home in Sydney with gorgeous views!"),
("2018-10-27", "1143151", "Roni", "This was a great stay!  Eleanor was fantastic and always ready to answer questions. The view is wonderful and walking around North Sydney was easy. Definitely a great Airbnb!"),
("2018-10-29", "1143151", "Charlotte", "Eleanor is a great host! Her place is nice and convenient! It's located in a lovely neighbourhood and close to public transport! Highly recommended!"),
("2018-11-14", "1143151", "Deb", "Amazing location  great use of space  beautiful views.  Felt very much at home and fantastic to have a lift and parking.  I would definitely book Eleanor’s apartment in the future for my family visiting us."),
("2018-11-21", "1143151", "Jana", "The apartment is in a good location  only a very short walk from public transport and with a glimpse of the Harbour Bridge. Unfortunately the cleanliness and general  kit out of the place was below expectations. Basic things such as utensils were missing and the light in the main room wasn’t working  just to name a few issues."),
("2018-11-24", "1143151", "Michael", "Great place. Great location."),
("2018-11-29", "1143151", "Alma", "Great opportunity to stay in a special part of Sydney in comfortable accommodation within reasonable distance of public transport and eating places."),
("2018-12-02", "1143151", "Gillian", "This apartment is amazing has everything you need and more. Fully equipped and close to restaurants. The hosts are amazing. Highly recommend."),
("2018-12-22", "1143151", "Patrick", "The apartment was as described and Eleanor was a great  communicative host. We had everything we needed during our stay and were within walking distance to everything we needed  including the train stations. Would highly recommend staying here if you’re looking for places in North Sydney. Laundry on site was definitely a plus. Thanks again!"),
("2018-12-29", "1143151", "Kendra", "We loved Eleanor’s place! She provided excellent check-in instructions and even left us cookies on Christmas Day  as well as breakfast items. The neighborhoods of North Sydney and Kirribilli were excellent and close to transit. Highly recommended!"),
("2019-01-02", "1143151", "横山", "Easy access to Sydney city center  brilliant view of NYE fireworks!"),
("2019-01-08", "1143151", "Sharon", "I'm hoping the point of reviews are to help promote both good hosts & guests; helping others in the future. Please be assured this review isn't in spite of my husband's original booking/cancellation made via (Website hidden by Airbnb) which was cancelled days prior to our reservation due to owner (supposably) overbooking! With flights  baby/dog sitter & tours booked  this caused unnecessary stress. Desperately   l searched airbnb for backup accommodation;  at peak time/short notice. I didn't think l would have much luck. Surprisingly & unknowingly  I had just booked the same unit my hubby was told was unavailable! It became even more apparent when Eleanor asked if I had used another I service as dates/surname were familiar. Through further messaging (address revealed) it was confirmed l had indeed rebooked the same unit! I was honest with Eleanor and expressed my disappointment and the unnecessary stressed she caused for no reason. Eleanor's excuse  in her words "" (Website hidden by Airbnb) seemed dodgy and l 'was going' to contact your husband to book via airbnb but it has worked out well""...Really!? Everything aside  we decided to make the most of it; feeling relieved we had accommodation.  I wasn't going to mention this but after our stay  l feel compelled to continue to provide open & honest feedback. I hope others will do the same; not just about this property but others. I was upfront with Eleanor and will continue to do to so to the end. About our stay...good location - nearby restaurants/transport. When organising check in  Eleanor asked us to collect keys from her residence (which isn't just around the corner - it's over 1km away). We requested for cleaner to handover keys which was greatly appreciated. After cleaner left and our return  we struggled to open the front door with lock sticking and then to enter a hot box! There're only ceiling fans to move the air. In January temps; not ideal. Instructions were left on how to operate fan/lights but we couldn't get both working  but thankfully we only got the fans working. If you're thinking about staying here; make sure it's not during extreme hot/cold weather.Every time the shower is used it leaks on the floor & remains wet 24 hrs!  Thankfully  info was left in book so we weren't alarmed. The view described was misleading.  Yes  you can see the harbour bridge if you 'stand' in the lounge. Windows are high & obscure the view. The balcony also overlooks a car park & derelict units. To see the bridge from here you also need to stand to the top end. The balcony door sticks; concerning with a full pane of glass. An accident waiting to happen. Upon departure   we always empty bins  clean and strip beds. But I was horrified to find yellow stains on the bottom sheet at foot end of the bed..eeew! This really was the straw that broke the camels back! Believe me  we are not picky people  easy going  and all our reviews from other properties/ hosts have been positive. If you want true comfort  functional  a proper view; I definitely do not recommend this unit."),
("2013-06-11", "1138483", "Amy", "Belinda and her husband were warm and friendly hosts during our stay and the clean  beautifully designed and cosey but spacious studio was everything we could have wanted for a quiet weekend away. We enjoyed watching the sunset at Port Hacking  a lovely dock across the road from Belinda's home and driving further south through the National Park. Highly Recommended for a relaxing weekend trip just an hour away from Sydney."),
("2013-06-25", "1138483", "Adele", "Bundeena is beautiful. The perfect spot for an easy weekend away from the constant noise of the city. And Belinda and Chris' Garden cottage is a fantastic place to spend time. Stones throw from the beach and beautiful coastal walks  but completely private in a little garden oasis. Birds everywhere. The cottage is fitted out beautifully  with thoughtfulness and great taste. We would love to return. And next time we're hoping for better luck spotting whales!"),
("2013-07-08", "1138483", "Marcia", "Bundeena and Royal National Park is a wonderful getaway from Sydney. Belinda and Chris' garden studio is separate from the house. Staying there was perfect -  It was cosy and inviting  well-equipped and had everything we needed. The porch overlooking the garden was peaceful while having a morning coffee  birds chirping... We walked along Jibbon's Beach the first day  and then to Marley Beach the second day - sighting migrating whales along the way! Very ideal for exploring Royal National Park  and a short walking distance from the ferry. Belinda was a wonderful host  friendly and available whenever needed. Thanks for having us!"),
("2013-07-16", "1138483", "Gene", "Belinda and Chris are lovely people and very welcoming hosts. They were friendly  prompt in their communications  and provided us with a warm  quiet and cosy space for a winter getaway. Their studio is private  very well decked out  and closely situated to the beaches and bushwalks in Bundeena. Thanks for the wonderful weekend away :)"),
("2013-07-29", "1138483", "Giulia", "Belinda was vibrant and welcoming. The studio is lovely  private and decked out with everything you need for a cosy weekend away - there was even a fire pit which Belinda generously allowed us to use. The location is gorgeous  Bundeena is so relaxing  I didn't want to leave!"),
("2013-08-05", "1138483", "Georgia", "The Bundeena garden studio was a delight to stay at. Beautifully renovated  it is light and spacious. It has a very comfy bed in a peaceful environment. A lovely place to wake up to. Belinda is lovely and friendly and made the stay easy and comfortable.An easy place to holiday and one we will be recommending to our Bundeena-bound friends!I look forward to returning one day soon."),
("2013-08-12", "1138483", "Erina", "We loved our stay at Bundeena! Belinda's cottage was beautifully presented with quality comforts  privacy and has all the amenities you could need; perfect for a couple's getaway. The location is ideal just a short stroll to the beautiful beaches  bushwalking and dining. We fell in love with the area and look forward to returning there many times. Thank you for having us  we had a wonderful weekend!"),
("2013-08-24", "1138483", "Brendan", "Hi All  for those wanting a hideaway with the options of city experience if needed  then a cosy bungalow in Bundeena is a must. It was a lovely warm space with the fresh air or Bundeena and modern facilities. The kitchenette and bathroom were easy to use and made my life so easy. With private access it leaves you free to enjoy the environs on your own terms. The beach is a stones through away. I would love to have stayed longer. It is a quiet refreshing space in which to contemplate. A ferry ride to Cronulla is available if one needs to re-quaint once self with urban life  with the addition of train to CBD if needed. I highly recommend for those who have the time to relax and enjoy. Cheers  Brendan."),
("2013-09-16", "1138483", "Grace & Eric", "We've stayed at a few AirBNB places now and this has been the best so far. Everything was as promised and more. The cabin is a renovated artist's studio at the back of the garden  secluded and private behind trees. Belinda  the host  was lovely and welcoming and gave us some advice for how to best take advantage of the natural surrounds and events that were on in town.The amenities were clean and exactly like the photos. We were impressed with the host's taste in DVDs and books provided for our use. We caught the ferry to Cronulla for the day ($12.60 return for an adult  must have cash to pay on the boat - a bit steep but worth it) and had a wonderful time enjoying the spring fair.All in all  the host's made our stay extremely comfortable and gave us the privacy we needed to fully enjoy our stay.Thank you Belinda and Chris!"),
("2013-09-24", "1138483", "Julia", "Hi Belinda  I'd like to thank you allowing us to stay in your beautiful studio. It had all the necessities and was in an amazing location near the beach. Just perfect for our little weekend away! Your artwork is very fascinating as well  I will get in touch with you about those shortly :) thanks again and hopefully we will come back again in the future!"),
("2013-09-30", "1138483", "Jono And Heidi", "We had a fantastic weekend staying at Belinda's studio. The location is perfect  a short stroll to the beaches  bushwalks and the local shops. Ideal setting in the back of her garden and all the privacy you could want! We wouldn't hesitate to come back again!"),
("2013-10-07", "1138483", "Jade", "We had a fantastic stay. The property is lovely  has everything you need. It was very clean and tidy. Very close to the beach  great walks. Incredibly peaceful. We liked it so much we stayed an extra night. Belinda was accommodating and a pleasure to rent from.  I would recommend it to any friend. "),
("2013-10-28", "1138483", "Milarose", "My husband and I just had a perfect weekend in Bundeena.  This garden studio is everything it claims to be - Belinda has very thoughtfully set up this private sanctuary for 2 - it is very charming.   We will definitely come back."),
("2013-11-04", "1138483", "Andy", "We had a very pleasant short stay in Bundeena.  The accommodation was clean  comfortable and close to the beach and village amenities.  We would happily come back  but next time stay for longer. "),
("2013-11-18", "1138483", "Anita", "We had such a fantastic weekend at Belinda’s gorgeous studio. Its just as lovely as in the photos – clean and beautiful and bright and airy and everything there that you could possibly need (even salt and pepper and pasta and tuna…AND scented candles). The place had a lovely vibe and even the bed and the pillows were comfy – and we have a Tempur at home so I’m very picky with beds!  Oh and the artwork is awesome!The garden is lovely too and it’s a short walk to the end of the street to the beach and the national park. The beach is GORGEOUS!! Crystal clear  calm water and pretty seashells. Its also nice and protected so you don’t get blown away or sandblasted which happens on some other beaches.  Just past the beach is a path to the national park  which is so pretty. There were lots of birds and trees and beautiful giant rocks and some Aboriginal carvings. It bucketed rain most of the weekend we were there but we still had a lovely weekend. We’ve already booked our return visit for next month. :-) Thanks Belinda! "),
("2013-11-21", "1138483", "Angharad", "This apartment is a lovely place to stay  it's comfortable  clean and has everything you need for a stay in Bundeena  or even if you want to visit Sydney but don't just want to see city life! We would definitely recommend staying here and would love to stay again when we're back in the Sydney area. "),
("2013-12-15", "1138483", "Lee", "We stayed in Belinda's garden studio for three days last week  and found it to be exactly as advertised. Very private and comfortable.  The location is really good  being so close to the beach. Overall the experience was very pleasant indeed and reasonably priced.  Lee"),
("2014-01-13", "1138483", "Phillip", "Belinda was great to deal with - she was organised  communicated well and best of all provided a perfect retreat! Her granny flat/studio has plenty of space  love and comfort and is perfectly positioned within walking distance to all the attractions!"),
("2014-01-16", "1138483", "Robyn", "We were very pleased with our accommodation and hosts Belinda and Chris. They have accessed what their guests needs may be then thoughtfully provided  everything down to an umbrella I noticed on the verandah. Everything was clean and fresh no tired old cast offs of any kind. We would recommend this BnB highly."),
("2014-01-20", "1138483", "Sarah", "You can't really beat Belinda's place in terms of location and experience. I had a friend visiting from overseas and we had a lovely time in this little laid back beach town. Belinda's place is a cute little place where you can hear the birds sing in the morning and the waves crashing on the shores as you sleep. Just lovely and I couldn't be more happy to recommend it to anyone looking to get out of Sydney for a few days!"),
("2014-02-10", "1138483", "Rhiannon", "Great stay- beautiful  clean  modern apartment. It's a very peaceful location and it is a short walk to three beaches- two of which are literally on your doorstep. Belinda was super helpful and friendly- would definitely recommend / stay again. It was exactly what we wanted- a chilled out stay in / just next to the Royal National Park."),
("2014-02-12", "1138483", "Jessica", "Belinda was friendly and helpful and easy to communicate with  and the studio is beautiful and looks just as it does in the pictures. It is very clean  private and well equipped. And it's only a few minutes to the beach. We had a great time and would be very happy to stay again!"),
("2014-03-03", "1138483", "Kate", "Thankyou Chris and Belinda. Sorry we didn't get to meet you on the weekend Belinda but your correspondence and contact regarding our stay was fantastic.Lovely meeting Chris who settled us into your beautiful studio. It iimmediately felt like a home away from home.   It was clean  bright   private and peaceful. All the little extras like plunger coffee and CD player  to name a few were very thoughtful and appreciated. We had a beautiful stay and loved our walks  in between rain showers. Would love to go back again one day if we are ever in the area. The price for the studio was incredibly cheap for what you get. Thankyou for making it affordable to enjoy a weekend away without breaking the budget .Kate and Darrel "),
("2014-03-25", "1138483", "Kate", "Thank you Belinda. Your studio was perfect. What a wonderful weekend!   We had every creature comfort and the location is close to everything yet felt so secluded. We will be back! :)"),
("2014-04-26", "1138483", "Romi", "The Bundeena Garden Studio was a delight to stay in. The place was spotless and had everything we needed for our 3 day getaway.  We were able to cook some meals  as well as eat out on two occasions. The studio is a minute from beautiful beaches and from the Royal National Park walks. Belinda was very welcoming while also leaving us to do our own thing."),
("2014-04-28", "1138483", "Caroline Lo", "Belinda was a great host and her studio was perfect for a couple's weekend getaway. Belinda was very quick to respond to all my queries before I arrived  and also have clear instructions to arrive. The studio itself is so nice  quaint  secluded and surrounded by nature. It's sits inter back yard of the main house but we were not disturbed at all. All the final touches were included in the studio and there was a really nice designer yet homely feel to the place. The bed was so comfortable :)A very short walk to the water too. Highly recommended :)"),
("2014-06-23", "1138483", "Chris", "Belinda was quick to respond and very accommodating during our stay at her garden studio. The garden studio itself was much larger than we expected  well-furnished  well-equipped and immaculate. Location-wise  Bundeena is a relatively close to the city but is a charming suburb that feels like something more akin to a 2-3 hour drive from Sydney. We had a great time :)"),
("2014-07-28", "1138483", "Todd", "Belinda has an absolutely amazing place in Bundeena. It was extremely clean  bright and beautifully decorated. Exactly as advertised. Belinda was the perfect host  picking us up from the ferry  providing all of the essentials and also leaving tourist brochures for all of the incredible walks in the area. The place is really well located  a short 5 minute stroll to the shops and a few minutes down to Jibbon beach  which really is lovely. We even managed a swim in July! Thanks Belinda  we had a really relaxing and pleasant stay. I would thoroughly recommend Bundeena and Belinda's place to others in the AirBnB community. "),
("2014-08-06", "1138483", "Milarose", "It's great to stay again in this garden studio. Belinda and Chris have kept this place at the highest standards.  We can't wait to be back."),
("2014-08-12", "1138483", "Georgia", "Perfect for a weekend in the Royal National Park! The studio is 100m from a private beach  close to the ferry and has everything you need for a few nights away from home. Belinda and Chris were lovely hosts - they were very helpful and offered us good local food and whale watching tips. "),
("2014-08-19", "1138483", "David", "Great accommodation.  We felt very welcome.  The garden studio was very clean and comfortable - perfect for our stay.  The location is great for visiting the Royal National Park."),
("2014-09-08", "1138483", "Jessica", "This accommodation was really nice. It was a good size  clean and had lots of natural light. We were also impressed with how well equipped the kichen was. Belinda was very welcoming."),
("2014-09-15", "1138483", "Jo", "The studio was lovely and clean with comfortable bedding. The location was perfect for enjoying the national park and beaches. The host was helpful and friendly and gave us good local information."),
("2014-09-22", "1138483", "Alexandra", "We had a lovely time! Belinda was warm and welcoming. The studio was very clean and quiet  and we enjoyed the peacefulness. It was jut what we needed. We hope to be back soon! "),
("2014-10-04", "1138483", "Carmel", "Had a wonderful few days in a comfortable  clean and refreshing environment.  As I was travelling on my own I  appreciated the pickup and drop off for the ferry.  Hope to get back one day with my husband  as was our original plan."),
("2014-10-07", "1138483", "Ann", "Belinda has created a lovely  private studio that has everything we needed and provided a sanctuary at the end of the garden. It is well located close to beaches and the village and very comfortable. "),
("2014-10-28", "1138483", "Joanne", "We checked in for 2 nights stay at Belinda's Cabin and had the most relaxing time. The beaches are within close walking distance and the RSL Club is just a few hundred metres away. The Cabin was extremely clean and comfortable  adequately equipped kitchen and well stocked with books  dvd’s and multimedia equipment for a good quiet weekend and high degree of privacy. A true hidden gem indeed and would definitely recommend for those looking for a quiet and relaxing getaway."),
("2014-11-17", "1138483", "Bryony", "Belinda was very welcoming  she showed us around the property and answered all our questions.The property is as described on the listing. It was very clean and tidy  and beautifully secluded in a leafy garden. The studio had all appliances necessary for a short or long stay.Bundeena is beautiful and quite. The location of the property was perfect  a short walking distance from two beaches and the main village (where you have the main shops  cafe and where you can catch a ferry to Cronulla)."),
("2014-11-24", "1138483", "Guillermo", "The studio is perfect for some relaxing time. It was comfortable  clean and had everything we needed for 6 days. It's very very close from the beach (walking distance) and in a very quiet neighourhood. You can either cook home or go out. Belinda and her husband were very helpful and welcoming. I strongly recommend to stay here"),
("2014-12-01", "1138483", "Anna", "Belinda was a wonderful host - quick to respond to enquiries and warm and friendly on arrival. The studio is beautiful exactly as shown in the photos. Tip - Be sure to read stove instructions before consuming wine. Bundeena is lovely. We enjoyed some short bush walks and lazed about the studio reading the paper. Perfect."),
("2015-01-05", "1138483", "Emily", "A perfect location! Two beaches are a mere couple of minutes walk away. We also did a great walk in the National Park which started just down the road from Belinda's. The studio is extremely clean and the kitchen is excellently stocked with everything you're likely to want and need. There is a great BBQ as well. The studio is separated from the main house by a lovely garden  and feels private and very tranquil. Belinda was a fantastic host - very welcoming and friendly.I would highly recommend Bundeena Garden studio to all. "),
("2015-01-11", "1138483", "Jessica", "A great stay  in a beautiful part of the world! Thanks so much for your hospitality Belinda. The studio was perfect  fitted with all the mod-cons to make for a comfortable stay. "),
("2015-01-13", "1138483", "Rafael", "Belinda is SUPER! She's kind  lovely and  for sure  a SUPER HOST. She did everything for us to feel at home. The studio is super clean  the bed is soft and the trees around made us feel comfortable and in peace.There are some stairs in the backyard in your way to the house  so consider that if you are bringing many bags to carry.We spent 3 days with her and had a great time in Bundenna. The beaches are THE BEST! If you like flat beaches  you will love it. Ask for the Ferry beach and Wattamolla. Super!Well  super guest Belinda  amazing place to stay.. We strongly recomend it :) Thanks  thanks  thanks!"),
("2015-01-16", "1138483", "Reiku", "This place was a perfect getaway for us (two adults). I liked the lightness and space in this apartment and Belinda welcomed us warmly. I would go back to stay here again!"),
("2015-01-21", "1138483", "Nicolo", "We had a lovely stay!! and were pleasantly surprised to find that the studio was just as well presented and cleanly kept as in the photos. Belinda was incredibly welcoming on arrival and very respectful of our privacy during our stay."),
("2015-01-26", "1138483", "Kathryn", "From the moment we put down our luggage we felt at home and relaxed. The garden flat has everything you need and a lovely deck on which to sip a wine at the end of a day at the beach. The location is perfect  just a stone's throw from a number of beaches and an easy walk to the ferry. We didn't use our car at all. Belinda provided all the information and communication required in a friendly and discrete manner. We will be back!! Thank you!"),
("2015-02-04", "1138483", "Helen", "Belinda was very welcoming   directions to the unit and check in was very easy. Situated in a quiet street with parking at the door the apartment is behind her home but at the same time very private with its own entrance and in a separate building. It is light  airy  spotless and well equipped. Belinda has thought of all the little touches and comforts which give the unit a welcoming feel and make for  a very comfortable stay. We had an enjoyable two nights which we would be  happy to repeat."),
("2015-02-09", "1138483", "Kitty", "The garden studio was the perfect spot to enjoy a weekend for two in Bundeena. Beautifully appointed  with many much appreciated extras  and a very helpful but unobtrusive host I couldn't speak too highly of it. I'm sure we'll be back. "),
("2015-02-16", "1138483", "Sharon", "We had a lovely stay. The Studio is private and has good amenities. Belinda greeted us on arrival and was very friendly and helpful  and the Bundeena area is beautiful. We were there for a family function  but there is plenty to do close by if you're just holidaying."),
("2015-02-26", "1138483", "Julie", "This was our first stay with Airbnb and we could not have been happier. Belinda was an excellent host  her garden studio is just as it looks in the photo  spotlessly clean and we especially loved sitting on the verandah soaking up the peace and quiet. Belinda was kind enough to pick us up at the ferry when it was raining on our arrival and had even provided milk in the fridge  tea  salt  pepper etc. Her thoughtfulness was most appreciated. Thanks Belinda  you have set the bar very high for our future Airbnb stays.       "),
("2015-03-03", "1138483", "Nicola", "The Studio was a lovely place for a weekend for my husband and I to get to know Bundeena. Well appointed  comfortable with a nice beach house decor. Quite private for a backyard studio - we only met the host when picking up and dropping off key - there is a separate entryway and the leafy garden outlook meant it was well screened from the main house. The only sounds were the birds and occasional possum. We enjoyed the breezy verandah which kept us cool on a very warm weekend. Very well located - walking distance to all the best beach spots  walking tracks  shops and ferry. Loved it."),
("2015-03-13", "1138483", "Camille", "We had an amazing time in this lovely studio!2 min walk from the beach  the studio got a lot of charm with white ceiling an lots of light and peaceful garden around it.I will be back!"),
("2015-03-16", "1138483", "Loh", "We had a great time at Belinda's place. She made us feel comfortable like we were at home. The studio is beautiful and clean. We hope to come back one day :)"),
("2015-03-24", "1138483", "Zachary", "I'm so glad I booked this beautiful studio. It was clean  well stocked and quiet. Belinda's attention to detail was apparent as she supplies the studio with everything you'll need  with a nice collection of books  movies and music for you to enjoy  and even sensor lights that make sure you don't trip on a stone at night.The studio is also a short walk to several beautiful beaches as well as the neighbourhood supermarket.If you're going to Bundeena  this is the place to stay. "),
("2015-03-30", "1138483", "Marie", "Belinda made us feel vey welcome and informed us of everything we needed to know about the place. Description of the studio was spot on and would recommend others to stay there."),
("2015-04-07", "1138483", "Sean", "The studio was immaculate and a nice sanctuary to come back to after  a long bush walk.Belinda was very friendly and helpful in checking us in  making sure we had everything we needed.It was great only being minutes to the beach  and a stroll to the main shops. Would definitely recommend."),
("2015-04-14", "1138483", "Edward", "Our stay in Belinda's cottage was lovely. The cottage is clean and tidy and beautifully furnished. It was a short walk into Bundeena town and close to access to the beautiful national park. Our host was friendly and welcoming. Thank you!"),
("2015-04-21", "1138483", "David", "It was our second visit to the Bundeena Garden Studio.  Again we were made to feel very welcome and again we found the accommodation perfect for us.  The studio is very private  comfortable  and well equipped and is very handy to the beaches and the Royal National Park."),
("2015-04-23", "1138483", "Nicola", "This was a return visit as I loved staying at the Studio a few months ago. An excellent place to stay in Bundeena as it has a great location  ambience  amenities  privacy - all at a very reasonable rate. The hosts are very considerate."),
("2015-05-01", "1138483", "Alf", " Chris greeted us on arrival  no probs finding the place. Great drive to Bundeena  cottage is in a top spot close to everything. Belinda has made the cottage inside near perfect  99/100. Everything is as it should be  comfortable  cosy  clean  private  just lovely  good supply of the essentials including some food items. We loved the organised disorder  of the gardens with all the eclectic bits and piece. Also the birds and possums did not disappoint. Lovely ferry ride to Cronulla. We highly recommend Belindas cottage for a relaxing stay. Cheers Alf & Polly."),
("2015-05-12", "1138483", "Warren", "Perfect place to explore Bundeena! Belinda met us on arrival to give us the run down of the place  which was  pleasant  private and fully equipped for a weekend away. Minutes walk from the beach  we were able to easily explore the aboriginal rock carvings. The local IGA was open till 8pm every night for our food needs too."),
("2015-05-17", "1138483", "Trudy", "Belinda and Chris have been wonderful hosts! We loved our stay at their garden studio. They  thought of everything for our comfort and relaxation even though the temperate outside dropped to 6 degrees we were very comfortable. The location is also excellent being right within Royal National park with magnificent bush walks at your doorstep  thank you very much for having us  "),
("2015-06-22", "1138483", "Liz", "We had a lovely stay at Belind's place in Bundeena. The studio was beautiful  immaculate and in a great location. We'll definitely be back!"),
("2015-07-20", "1138483", "Andrew", "I spent a lovely weekend in this cute little fully self contained apartment. Belinda has though of all the little things that make your stay amazing. It close to the shops and the beach. There are some amazing nature walks and mountain bike trails in the area. Really good value and i would recommend this little gem to anyone..."),
("2015-07-27", "1138483", "Warren", "Felt very welcome and Belinda accommodated both my late arrival and (slightly) late departure! The description is spot on and a lovely quiet spot in Bundeena..."),
("2015-08-03", "1138483", "Caroline", "Perfect getaway weekend! Bundeena is a lovely place and Belinda's cabine is very well located  comfortable and clean! She gave us all the tips we needed to fully enjoy our stay - we'll definitely be back soon!!"),
("2015-08-10", "1138483", "Sarah", "We had a lovely time staying at Belinda's garden studio. The studio is lovely and cosy  and very peaceful. The location was great too  as right near the ocean  start of a great walk through the national park and not far to the shops. We would highly recommend staying here if you love walking and would like a great place to relax after."),
("2015-08-13", "1138483", "Ashleigh", "This was a great stay! The place exceeded my expectations and is definitely better then the pictures. Belinda and Chris were very friendly. The location is right by the water and there are so many great walking tracks nearby. I would definitely stay again"),
("2015-08-17", "1138483", "Sarah", "Great place to stay.  Belinda made us feel welcome and was really helpful. Studio was clean  cosy and well equipped. Nice and close to the beach. Great place for a chilled weekend away! Would stay again. Thanks Belinda! "),
("2015-08-24", "1138483", "Michelle", "Belinda's place was perfect for a getaway in  Bundeena. The guesthouse is tucked away in a beautiful  lush garden. It is superbly equipped with everything you will ever need and is impeccably clean and very tastefully decorated. Located a short walk from the ferry and close to the beginning of the Coastal walk through the National Park  the location is perfect. The local IGA supermarket is close by and has everything you may need if you want to cook! Belinda was very friendly and informative.Highly recommended!"),
("2015-08-26", "1138483", "Ben", "Belinda was very accommodating and it was a nice relaxed spot!"),
("2015-09-21", "1138483", "Lina", "Great host  showednusbaround when we got there and was very respectful of our privacy during the weekend. "),
("2015-09-25", "1138483", "Shane", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay in the Bundeena Garden Studio  which is located in a lovely garden at the rear of the main house.  Our host Belinda met us on arrival and farewelled us.  She was friendly  welcoming and informative; there for us when we needed her but  never intrusive.  The studio is completely private and is light  spacious and well laid out.  There are many good books  games and DVDs to choose from.  The kitchen has been thoughtfully stocked with a good range of cooking and eating utensils.  The bed and pillows are very comfortable and the bathroom is a good size.  And the whole studio is very clean - we greatly appreciated this thank you Belinda!During our stay the spring weather changed from balmy to cold and rainy.  The studio was warm  dry and cosy.Bundeena  with its beaches and surrounding National Park provide wonderful places to explore - we loved walking around the area.  We thoroughly recommend the Bundeena Studio and Belinda.  "),
("2015-09-28", "1138483", "Misha", "Had an excellent weekend in Belinda's garden studio. The room is very cosy and clean and Belinda has cleary gone to great length to ensure that all the little things you'd want are there. I hope to stay here again."),
("2015-10-01", "1138483", "Glenda", "Excellent! Spotless private studio at the back of Belinda's garden. Well maintained and thoughtfully equipped. Great location for beaches  ferry and National Park walks. Bundeena is a delightful ' hidden' treasure. Belinda was friendly but unobtrusive . Thoroughly recommended"),
("2015-10-03", "1138483", "Emily", "We had a lovely stay at Belinda's place in Bundeena. She even assisted us prior to our trip with some helpful info regarding some walks around the Royal National Park. This is a lovely spot to say; super close to the beach  many walks & sights within the Royal National Park - would definitely love to stay here again."),
("2015-10-06", "1138483", "Kieran", "My girlfriend and I had a delightful stay with Belinda  the place was in a quiet and relaxing location with perfect access to a nice quiet beach for some snorkelling. The property was well equipped (we made great use of the extensive kitchen utensils as there was few eating out options in the town) and beautifully laid out - the photos on the walls were stunning. The veranda was a nice place to sit and chill out and was nicely enclosed by the garden so it was peaceful and nicely separated from the house. Belinda was very welcoming and accommodating.  "),
("2015-10-10", "1138483", "Maddy", "We had such a wonderful time at Bundeena Garden Studio. Belinda made everything so easy for us; she was incredibly accommodating.The studio itself is fantastic. It's clean  comfortable and beautifully designed (Belinda's artwork hangs on the walls). Literally moments from the beach and a short walk to the shops. I can't recommend this accommodation enough! We will definitely be visiting again. "),
("2015-10-12", "1138483", "Madeline", "Very cute eclectic flat! We had clean sheets  absolutely perfect water pressure in the shower"),
("2015-10-16", "1138483", "Mark", "We were made welcome from the start. Very friendly and told us all we needed to know without being intrusive.The accommodation was exactly as described and very restful and surrounded by nature. We had a very comfortable stay and Belinda was very understanding at a difficult time for us (attending a parent's funeral). Nothing could have been improved from our point of view and we hope we can go back again on our next trip to Sydney and spend more time exploring the wonderful Bundeena and the Royal National Park. Thank you Belinda and Chris  you really were great hosts. PS - we loved the book about Sydney's Southern Beaches - The Saltwater People  it gave us a real insight into the Indigenous history of the area and a look at its interesting European history. A perfect book for visitors to read/see. Thanks also for having the basics on hand in the fridge and cupboard- with a late arrival by plane that made the first morning easier.Best regards for the futureRachael and Mark"),
("2015-10-19", "1138483", "Joe", "A beautiful peaceful garden studio with everything required for a relaxing weekend away. Some captivating pieces of artwork and a great selection of books and music. Belinda was very helpful and accommodating  a great host. "),
("2015-10-22", "1138483", "Leah", "I felt so lucky to have been able to stay at this wonderful place.  In an incredible little corner of the world  this calming and well-appointed space was the perfect HQ for a few days of exploring the stunning Australian coast.  Belinda was a gracious and accommodating host  and I appreciate the great taste with which she fashioned this simple studio.  "),
("2015-10-24", "1138483", "Amanda", "We had an incredible time at Belinda's. After a week in Sydney  and coming from New York City  a few days at her quiet  peaceful studio in Bundeena surrounded by the Royal National Park was all I could ask for. I wish I could have stayed longer. The studio is behind her house in a lush garden  perfectly furnished and clean. Belinda let us have our space and at the same time was very helpful  giving my friend a ride to the ferry and providing tips on Bundeena. All you hear are birds  the wind through the trees and the ocean a couple blocks away. The National Park is around a corner and you're at the north tip of the beautiful coastal walk  which if you did it in its entirety would take two full days  requiring camping. We only walked as far as Little Marley Beach. Perhaps if I returned I would have rented a car one day so that I could have seen more of the southern coast of the park.Thank you Belinda! I hope to return."),
("2015-10-26", "1138483", "Indrani", "Belinda was warm and helpful and made my stay very easy. The description details were accurate. It was a lovely idyllic setting in the garden with a side entrance for guests. I loved everything about the place. The studio was decorated in a soothing and artistic way with Belinda's beautiful art works and tasteful furniture and other touches.   I felt like I was in a perfect forest retreat. At night I could hear frogs and crickets and then morning birds and it was lovely to sit on the verandah with tea and walk down to Jibbon Beach nearby. Simply a lovely break. Thank you!"),
("2015-10-31", "1138483", "Tania &  Melvin", "Belinda's studio was an absolutely perfect and idyllic place to stay   and everything is as described in the listing. I stayed here on my own as a retreat to do some writing  and after setting up myself with some groceries  I had everything that I needed in the studio  down to the simplest essentials for cooking. The studio is spacious enough to feel like a home  yet intimate enough to feel like a real beachside getaway shack. With beautiful Jibbon Beach and a bushwalk just minutes away  it was easy to get a nature hit everyday after a writing session in the studio.Belinda was also a very welcoming host  who even offered to pick me up from the supermarket after the weather turned nasty. After setting me up at the start  Belinda and her husband were also respectful of my privacy as I worked  and even though the studio is in the backyard behind their house  I didn't hear a peep. But Belinda was very responsive to my text messages if I needed anything.Would definitely recommend this place for a really comfortable and really reasonably priced getaway  solo or as a couple (my girlfriend visited for an evening and we enjoyed the surrounding beach and bush). Thanks Belinda!"),
("2015-11-02", "1138483", "Rachel", "Wonderful studio in a great location  everything you need inside. Very comfortable bed & lovely and quiet. Key exchange was easy and Belinda was a great host with good communication. "),
("2015-11-06", "1138483", "Frieda & Som", "Belinda was a perfect host  she was welcoming and gave us a run down of the place as soon as we arrived  we were half hr earlier than expected and she still accommodated for us which was great. Neighborhood is relaxing  quiet. It was raining pretty much the whole time we were there but there was plenty to offer to pass time - good reads  music  games. The studio had everything we needed  the quality of linen and towels was 5 star. Thanks for a great stay! Highly recommended! "),
("2015-11-17", "1138483", "June", "This was a great place to stay. Private  quiet  roomy. Close to beaches and ferry. The veranda was a great bonus in the heavy rain. Thank you for meeting us with a brolly Belinda and for the fresh milk and coffee. A lovely stay. "),
("2015-11-21", "1138483", "Ken", "We stayed here for three nights as we travelled along the NSW coast.   Belinda and Chris were both helpful and hospitable. The studio was comfortable  well-equipped and clean  with a nice covered veranda in the secluded garden.  It was also just a few minutes walk to the pretty and quiet Jibbon Beach and a short drive to the shops in Bundeena itself.  The more popular beaches at Wattamolla and Garrie are about 20-30 minutes drive away. Thanks for allowing us to stay in your place.  We would be very happy to stay there again if we make a return trip. Ken and Rosemary"),
("2015-11-23", "1138483", "Chris", "Great place to stay. Very relaxed and easy to get too from Sydney. Belinda was a great host and very welcoming. We had a fantastic time and would recommend Belinda to anyone."),
("2015-12-07", "1138483", "Sophie", "Belinda's place was perfect for a weekend escape! The apartment is extremely well equip with everything you would need. Belinda was a great host explaining the local walks and beautiful places to visit.We look forward to visiting again!"),
("2015-12-11", "1138483", "Poppy", "This is such a perfect getaway spot. Belinda was very welcoming  and also very discreet while we were there. The studio is so thoughtfully put together  not cluttered but with everything you need- especially in the kitchen! Nicely curated selection of CDs  DVDs & books  and the artworks  timber furniture & decorations make the whole space feel very calming. And we loved being so close to the beach  town and bush walks. "),
("2015-12-14", "1138483", "Richard", "A beautiful tranquil garden cottage provided for a very relaxing weekend"),
("2016-01-07", "1138483", "Jono And Heidi", "This was our 2nd time staying at this great property.  It has everything you need to relax and unwind. Beaches just there   beautiful tropical surroundings and friendly hosts!"),
("2016-01-09", "1138483", "Bek", "Belinda was very welcoming and friendly. She's lovely to chat to and pick up some suggestion for the local area. The studio is bright  fresh and has a pretty green outlook into the garden. A minute walk to the beach - you can't ask for a better location in Bundeena. We will be recommending to our friends"),
("2016-01-11", "1138483", "Sarah", "This was a perfect getaway from the city.  A beautiful little apartment with the comfiest bed and best shower ever! I will be going back :)"),
("2016-01-17", "1138483", "Clare", "We had an amazing time in Belinda's garden studio. The location is perfect  the studio is clean  modern  and charming with everything you could need. Belinda was a very accommodating as a host. Can't recommend enough!"),
("2016-01-22", "1138483", "Irene", "Bundeena Garden Studio is as per images and description. It is clean and tidy with added extras in the pantry for your convenience should you require them  as well as fresh milk in the fridge. Belinda is warm and efficient informing us of the possibility of earlier check in when accommodation was ready. The environment felt private nestled down the back of the property. The native birds where a lovely addition to the morning coffee on the verandah. We had a lovely time at the beach all day and then being able to walk back to our comfortable home away from home made for a great break. Thanks Belinda we would like to return again."),
("2016-01-27", "1138483", "Megan", "Everything was as pictured and explained. The beaches  shops and cafes are all within walking distance so we didn't need to move the car at all. Check in/out was easy and Belinda is super accommodating and genuinely lovely. The cooking facilities were handy  we took pre prepared meals and 'zapped' them but also made popcorn in the electric frypan and Bbq'd too. We loved that there was some DVD's and books and games. "),
("2016-02-01", "1138483", "Angela", "Belinda is a friendly and accommodating host  and helped make our stay perfect. The cabin is set in a beautiful garden  which made for a very relaxing setting. The cabin had everything we wanted  right down to the chess set  and a few types of tea on offer. And only a minute walk from the beach. Lovely. "),
("2016-02-09", "1138483", "Suzie", "Belinda was very welcoming.The Garden Studio is very quiet and private in a lovely neighbourhood."),
("2016-02-19", "1138483", "Caitlin", "Our stay was exactly what we were looking for. The location was perfect  only a short drive to the national park and an even shorter walk to the beach. Belinda was very accommodating  providing us with information about the features of the studio as well as surrounding food and activities. The studio had everything we needed including a fully equipped kitchen and barbecue. The studio was quiet and peaceful  the perfect place to relax. We would love to stay again and will definitely recommend to friends.  "),
("2016-03-15", "1138483", "Tom", "An amazing location with beautifully furnished clean living area. Big  well equipped kitchen and clean bathroom. Will be definitely coming  back!"),
("2016-03-29", "1138483", "Urszula", "Belinda is great   friendly host  she saved our lives with her supplies ( as IGA was closed on Good Friday).The accommodation is lovely  private and has everything what you may need. We really enjoyed our stay in Garden Studio and hope to be back! Thank you! Ula & Pete"),
("2016-04-01", "1138483", "Holly", "Belinda and her husband were both very kind and helpful  they were informative but gave us space and privacy too. The property was clean  well equipped with quality towels and linen  kitchen had everything we needed (BBQ was great) and had a nice little supply of pantry items. It was perfect for a relaxing getaway! Had a fantastic time many thanks :) "),
("2016-04-05", "1138483", "Geoff", "I found Belinda's studio a delightful place for my weekend retreat.  It is quiet  comfortable and attractive.  Great access to beautiful beaches and the Royal National Park. "),
("2016-04-17", "1138483", "Tessa", "An absolute gem of a place. Immaculate  lovely location  everything provided that you could possibly need. Belinda was easy to deal with  efficient and friendly. This weekend idyll was everything I hoped it would be and more. Peaceful  easy to arrange  gorgeous location  beautiful accommodation  friendly hosts. Can't wait to book again! "),
("2016-04-28", "1138483", "Katherine", "Brilliant location and perfect little getaway : )"),
("2016-05-02", "1138483", "Matt", "Amazing Space.. Definitely going back soon.. Belinda was the greatest.. she walked me back and showed me everything I needed for a great stay .. she was also a text away all weekend whenever I ran into a hitch... the space is beautiful and just perfect for getting into the beaches  national park and the slower pace of bundeena... "),
("2016-05-07", "1138483", "Yvonne", "Right from when I put in the request for a booking Belinda responded straight away and was constantly in touch with me to provide detailed information about our visit. The studio was very clean and comfortable  and every detail had been thought of  which made our visit very easy and relaxing. Perfect size for a couple!The location of the studio was perfect for us too  a couple of minutes walk to a beautiful beach and close to the entry into the National Park  yet really peaceful.We really enjoyed our weekend away  and would highly recommend the studio for a peaceful and relaxing getaway. "),
("2016-05-11", "1138483", "Rachel", "Belinda's place is exactly as in the photos  modern  clean  comfy and with all the necessary items for our stay. The kitchen was well equiped and easy to use. The neighbourhood is really nice and quiet  and the walk to the beach was really quick. Belinda was a very good host helping us with every detail we asked  including cafes  grocery shops  stores  even the ferry to cronulla  etc  etc  are all really close (walking distance). Overall the place and the host were amazing  me and my husband would definitely recommend them. Thank you Belinda!"),
("2016-05-15", "1138483", "Katherine", "Belinda & Chris were amazing hosts who were quick to respond to questions: provided much privacy; and were lovely enough to allow a late check out. Belinda has great attention to detail and a creative talent shown through the decor of her spacey studio. It felt more like a quaint cottage with a self-sufficient kitchen and patio  where we spent much of our time relaxing.  Their place is surrounded by beautiful plants and trees  and their location is so close to all the beaches and walking trails.  Thank you Belinda and Chris for a lovely stay! We will definitely be back soon :)"),
("2016-05-23", "1138483", "Megan", "Settling back into home and work after a perfect long weekend in Bundeena  I'm already planning a return trip. We'd like to thank Belinda for creating a beautiful self-contained studio space where we were able to relax  surrounded by a leafy garden. We felt immediately at home and had everything we needed to prepare and eat all of our meals there; and after exploring the surrounds during the days we were very happy to relax indoors in the evenings  listening to music and reading. The position of the studio is perfect  only a few minutes in either direction for a waterfront walk and to the local cafes and well-stocked IGA. We were fortunate for a late cancellation that we were able to book in last minute to the garden studio  but will be booking further in advance next trip to ensure availability in Belinda's garden studio. "),
("2016-05-27", "1138483", "Peng Yang", "Great cabin for exploring Bundeena and the surrounding walks. The cabin is in the back of Belinda's property. It's private and has a useful kitchen.Belinda provided the information we needed about traveling to Bundeena."),
("2016-07-19", "1138483", "Madeleine", "Thank you Belinda and Chris for making your beautiful garden studio available for stays. Divine! We had a fabulous time. The studio had everything we needed  great kitchen set up so we could prepare two yummy simple meals  and a lovely little verandah into the garden to enjoy our leisurely breakfasts. Your studio in located only a minutes walk to the best little beach and so close to stunning cliff tops walks in the Royal Nat Park. We had absolute privacy for out stay - which was lovely. Thank you for such a welcoming  private and cosy sanctuary."),
("2016-07-24", "1138483", "Joe", "Had an amazing time at this beautiful little studio. Belinda and Chris were really helpful  which made for an easy check in and a great weekend away. Would defiantly recommend it to anyone visiting the area. "),
("2016-07-26", "1138483", "Jarrod", "The studio is great! Belinda was not home when I stayed  but my partner and I were welcomed by her husband Chris.  He was also kind enough to drop us near the ferry on a rainy day when we departed  as we were bogged down by luggage.The garden is in a serene location with a lovely view of a garden.  Plenty of subtropical birds can be heard which adds to the ambiance.  Along with the tranquility of the studio itself  my favourite part was the walking distance to nearby beaches and Royal National Park.  Both of us ended up at the beach during the morning  day and night!  All in all  the stay was well worth every penny."),
("2016-08-01", "1138483", "Tessa", "I love this little sanctuary. This was my second stay and it was just as lovely as the first. Belinda is a friendly and gracious host - easy communication  lovely welcome. The garden studio is delightful - immaculate and beautifully and comfortably furnished  it has everything you could need. Love sitting on the little deck with my book and a glass of wine! Great location close to beaches and bush walks. Peaceful  private  secure."),
("2016-08-15", "1138483", "Carla", "Belinda & Chris were very welcoming & informative about the area & amenities...We felt very secluded & totally enjoyed our stay. We will be back!!!!"),
("2016-08-25", "1138483", "Taffy & Glenys", "Our hosts were welcoming and friendly and their studio was clean and comfortable with plenty of quality furnishing  fittings and accessories throughout. Bundeena Garden Studio has everything a couple could need including good literature  music and movies for the evening  - or a rainy day."),
("2016-09-04", "1138483", "Cheryl", "Thanks Belinda for welcoming us to your beautiful Garden Studio.  We were also very greatful with your flexibility in changing the night for us as per our request.  The studio was well appointed with a great kitchen which had everything that I required to cook our meals etc.  Shower was also great.  Very close to beach and amenities.  Bundeena is lovely place to visit and Belinda's studio is a perfect place for a couple."),
("2016-09-10", "1138483", "Julia", "Everything was perfect"),
("2016-09-19", "1138483", "Sally", "We were so pleased with the clean  up to date furnishings and equipment. More spacious than the photos looked. Everything was well thought out   including cooking utensils and basics like milk  oil  coffee etc. Lovely location near multiple beaches and short walk to town. We enjoyed the DVD collection and sound system when the weather turned against us.  Belinda gave us a very warm  informative welcome then left us to our privacy. Enjoyed the many birds and possums and feeling like we were in the bush but in the comfort of a lovely home. "),
("2016-09-24", "1138483", "Chantelle", "Everything we expected  beautiful location! Great host! Would recommend for anyone looking for a quiet escape from busy Sydney city! Perfect stay for our first airbnb! "),
("2016-10-16", "1138483", "Kimiko", "Our stay here was so lovely. We will definitely be back! Private  clean  sunny  well equipped  homely and an ideal location to explore the national park. Belinda welcomed us and showed us the ropes and some good walks   We will definitely be back!! Thank you! "),
("2016-10-23", "1138483", "Nanak", "My girlfriend and I spent a lovely few days at the Studio down in Bundeena! We stayed in the cabin as a refreshing getaway  and it lived up to all of our hopes. The location is fantastic - within walking distance from the start of the coastal track in the Royal National Park and just one minute walk from a great beach to watch the sunset at. The cabin is very well equipped - we cooked all of our meals there  it's very warm  the bed is very comfortable  and it's very tastefully decorated. Chris and Belinda were also very helpful during our stay and they responded speedily to all of our communications.Over all  it was a fantastic trip and we would definitely book again!"),
("2016-11-05", "1138483", "Benjamin", "Belinda's garden studio is a great getaway. The place was tidy  clean and good value. I have nothing bad to write and can only recommend to stay here."),
("2016-11-13", "1138483", "Peter", "I really enjoyed my few days stay here  recovering from jet lag so I could start work refreshed and ready to go. I was made very welcome and had everything I needed in the studio. The bit I enjoyed most was sitting out on the deck at night on the warm evenings listening to the 'strange' wildlife. The beaches are a couple of minutes in either direction and local amenities a 5 minute walk.Hard to believe I was only an hour away from Sydney airport  it seemed a million miles away."),
("2016-11-19", "1138483", "Anthea", "Beautiful location  so close to beaches and the National Park. Great little studio with everything you need."),
("2016-11-22", "1138483", "Erina", "We loved our stay at Belinda's beautiful beach cottage. We have stayed before and will definitely stay again :) Thank you."),
("2016-11-25", "1138483", "Pierre", "The true luxury if you are looking for peacefulness  romantic escapade  amazing walks  lSimplicity with elegance describe the hidden paradise of BelindaThank you "),
("2016-11-30", "1138483", "Louise", "What a lovely place this is. Belinda has thought of everything - the stuio was amazingly well equipped  as well as being spotlessly clean. The location was also great being easy walking distance to shops  cafes  beaches and the ferry. Highly recommended!"),
("2016-12-22", "1138483", "Marije", "We had a wonderful stay and will hopefully be back soon."),
("2016-12-25", "1138483", "Yael", "We had a lovely Christmas here - everything was perfect and the beaches were all extremely closeby! Thank you!"),
("2016-12-31", "1138483", "Sarah", "This place is a amazing. Perfect location  great host and a truly peaceful getaway. "),
("2017-01-01", "1138483", "Stefan", "Sehr freundlicher Empfang mit einer super Einweisung in die Unterkunft. Mit weiteren Infos zu den direkten Örtlichkeiten  Stränden  öffentliche Verkehrsanbindung (Schiffsfähre) und den Sehenswürdigkeiten des wunderschönen Naturparks. Das eigenständige absolut ruhig gelegene Appartementhaus entsprach meiner Meinung nach zu 100% der Gastgeberbeschreibung und ist modern mit guter technischer und wohnlicher Ausstattung versehen. Es war sogar möglich kurzzeitig eine 3. Person in Abstimmung mit der Gastgeberin übernachten zu lassen. Insgesamt betrachtet war der Urlaubsaufenthalt hier einzigartig  in einem liebevoll ausgestattetem Ambiente inmitten von grüner Natur und Stränden.   "),
("2017-01-04", "1138483", "Jo", "I looooved staying at this studio. It was so peaceful  in a perfect location and well appointed with everything you need. This is now my preferred 'escape hatch' from the city. I can't wait to go back."),
("2017-01-08", "1138483", "David", "A great place to stay and enjoy the beaches and walks available in the Royal National Park. Its private and stylish with easy access to the local beaches and within walking distance to local shops and super market. Highly recommended."),
("2017-01-20", "1138483", "Julie", "Belinda has created a wonderful cottage.  Very neat  comfortable  and well equiped."),
("2017-01-30", "1138483", "Lance", "Fantastic.  The accommodation was very comfortable   clean  well decorated and a well stocked kitchen. Close to the beach and shops.  We were made to feel very welcome and Belinda is a great host.  We will be back."),
("2017-02-01", "1138483", "Elisa&Carlo", "Wonderful stay!! Belinda was really nice and helpful with suggestions. The house is spacious and well equipped. We highly recommend this place!"),
("2017-02-04", "1138483", "Kathryn", "Another great stay in Bundeena at Belinda's! You can park the car or arrive off the ferry and then walk to everything you need. It is a gentle  beautiful and relaxing place to stay and we'll certainly be back  yet again. Thank you  Belinda."),
("2017-02-25", "1138483", "Lisa", "Was exactly as described. Fantastic place and would stay again."),
("2017-03-04", "1138483", "Nick", "Hosts were great and cabin was very clean and well equipped. Very comfortable stay"),
("2017-03-25", "1138483", "Kristen", "Belinda's stay was immaculate and she really has thought about all the details! Location is great  within walking distance to trails and local amenities  with being peaceful and pleasant at the same time."),
("2017-03-29", "1138483", "Ulrike", "Wonderful place in Bundeena  1 to 2 minutes to stunning beaches. Cute apartment with a lot of nice details. You find everything you need to make yourself at home. Belinda is a perfect host and gives you lots of great advices for your time in the National Park. Wish we could have stayed longer... had such a relaxed time. "),
("2017-04-09", "1138483", "Hey", "Nice cute place"),
("2017-04-18", "1138483", "Mariane", "Great cozy cottage stay! The studio is within a garden which gives a great leafy outlook. Belinda was a very welcoming host. We took her recommendations and went on a beautiful coastal walk- within the Royal National Park. The studio is also walking distance from the beach and the Cronulla ferry.All in all it was a great get-away!"),
("2017-04-25", "1138483", "Pete", "We had a wonderful stay. It was quiet  relaxing and very comfortable. Belinda and Chris are great hosts. The cabin is set in leafy garden minutes from the beach and it has a private entrance. The kitchen is well-equipped. "),
("2017-05-13", "1138483", "West", "Way better than the photos! So clean and well decorated. We wanted to stay a lot longer. Belinda is lovely. The linen was top quality and everything was immaculate. There was even ground coffee and a plunger. Lovely garden. We did get woken up a bit by possums galloping on the roof but that's hard to control this close to. National park!We walked 11km to Wattamalla beach and back again  and saw Wedding Cake rock and fish jumping at the beach. Also the IGA sells liquor and isn't far away. "),
("2017-06-04", "1138483", "Winnie", "Cosy studio exactly as described  perfectly located near the beach and national park. Belinda was extremely helpful and kind. Loved the stay! "),
("2017-06-12", "1138483", "Tania", "Tucked away in a secluded spot in Belinda's garden  this cute  (immaculately) clean and cosy cottage was just perfect for our few days away in Bundeena. It felt very private with lots of little touches that made it very comfortable. It was a great find and an enjoyable few days."),
("2017-06-15", "1138483", "Jarrod", "Absolutely loved the stay here!  Bundeena is a corner of paradise  and this studio is the ideal location to stay in Bundeena.  Just a short walk to the gorgeous beach and entrance to Royal National Park at Jibbons Beach - bushwalking galore!  My partner and I hiked from morning to night our entire time staying there  and the studio was the perfect place to return to for cosy comfort.  The local restaurants and IGA are also a simple 10 minute walk from the studio  making grocery shopping and food outings easy with a scenic walk.Belinda was ever helpful  even after leaving for an out of town trip.  Her husband  Chris  was also attentive and kind.  The studio itself has all the needed amenities  being very clean and feeling comfortable and spacious.  It is privately tucked away in the back of Belinda's property.  All in all I highly recommend and hope to come again."),
("2017-08-06", "1138483", "Tony", "Lovely little secluded cottage well worth a weekend away at this destination.Can't fault it."),
("2017-08-10", "1138483", "Laurie", "Belinda did not disappoint...Bundeena a snails pace away from the more raving Cronulla. Stay and renergise as you explore Jibbon and the National Park. It is  a secluded little garden paradise and as restful as you wish to make it. Perfect for a getaway."),
("2017-08-13", "1138483", "Marija Magdalena", "Belinda's little cottage was very cute and comfortable. For those spending the day out walking/going to the beach it's a great choice. The cottage is at the back of Belinda's house  which was clear on the listing  but might not be ideal for those wanting a place of their own."),
("2017-08-27", "1138483", "Tom", "A lovely cottage that feels a world away from Sydney although only an hour out of town. Short walk to both the beach and cafes / shops of Bundeena and perfect for exploring the Royal National Park. We stayed during winter so were grateful for the heater and electric blankets. Would definitely recommend."),
("2017-09-02", "1138483", "Greg", "The Cabin is located in a handy location and is a very spacious  comfortable and clean. Set in a beautiful private garden and only a short walk to the village centre and beaches. Belinda is a very amicable and accommodating host. We enjoyed our stay and would definitely stay again."),
("2017-09-11", "1138483", "Lance", "Always a great experience.  Excellent amenities and location."),
("2017-09-23", "1138483", "Smita", "Nice place"),
("2017-09-29", "1138483", "Kian Wee", "Belinda and her husband have veen a wonderful host! Studio is located near the wharf and a walkable distance to IGA. The studio is exceptionally clean and the kitchen is fully equipped. The toilet looks newly renovated and the view from the garden is absolutely breathtaking. We will definitely come again!"),
("2017-10-01", "1138483", "Phil", "Belinda’s cabin was beautifully decorated  well equipped and a much larger space than we expected. We particularly appreciated the deck and leafy outlook  as well as the proximity to Jibbon Beach. It was an easy walk down to the local shops to pick up supplies. Belinda was also incredibly welcoming and flexible. Thank you Belinda! We definitely hope to visit again!"),
("2017-10-03", "1138483", "Ariella", "An incredible stay at this warm  cottage with excellent facilities! I recommend Belinda's hospitality highly. She provided us with comprehensive information of the local region. The decor of the space was very comfortable; a wonderful get-away!"),
("2017-10-07", "1138483", "Aaron", "Belinda's place was a fantastic self-contained unit  with the perfect location in Bundeena to explore the surrounding national parks. Belinda was able to provide great local knowledge to set us upon our adventures in Bundeena."),
("2017-10-26", "1138483", "Karin", "Tyst och lugnt och nära till vandringsleder och strand. Fint hus och fantastisk trädgård."),
("2017-10-29", "1138483", "Emma", "Belinda's cabin is very clean and comfortable  and spacious for two. The sun hits the porch in the morning so it's the perfect spot for a quiet coffee to start the day. Super close to beautiful Jibbon beach but everything in town is within walking distance anyway. We would definitely recommend."),
("2017-11-04", "1138483", "Blandine", "Je recommande vivement ce logement magnifiquement bien situé à proximité du Royal National Park  confortable et décoré avec beaucoup de goût. Les œuvres d’art de Belinda nous ont donné matière à réflexion tout le long du séjour ! Parfait également au niveau des équipements  et Belinda nous a donné toutes les informations pour que notre  séjour se passe au mieux."),
("2017-11-11", "1138483", "Sally", "Perfect location  close enough to walk into town and to walk to the start of the National Park trails. Two beaches right across the road  perfect for sunset and swimming. The cottage had everything we needed and was very clean and tidy. Belinda was a wonderful host"),
("2017-11-15", "1138483", "Rudolf", "Garten und Einrichtung mit künstlerischem Flair  sehr sauber und ruhig  Holzterasse umgeben von üppigen Pflanzen  guter Ausgagspunkt für Wanderungen   5 Min. zum StrandEs war sehr erholsam   wir haben den Aufenthalt genossen."),
("2017-11-18", "1138483", "Finola", "The garden studio gave us the escape we needed for our first anniversary getaway. Offering self contained comfort with calm  beautiful beaches and shops/cafes a stroll away and nearby the Coastal Walk with its dramatic cliff edges and seascapes  it would be challenging to find a more well situated spot. Highly recommended for a few days away. "),
("2017-11-22", "1138483", "Rochelle", "Such a delightful studio close to the beach we thoroughly enjoyed the space  the location and the peaceful surroundings x"),
("2017-11-26", "1138483", "Steve", "Had a great time  close to beach Loved it"),
("2017-12-03", "1138483", "Andrew", "A beautiful space set in a tranquil garden. Well appointed and very clean  perfect for an escape from the big smoke to relax at the beach. Great host  easy to deal with and very accomodating."),
("2017-12-16", "1138483", "Claire", "Wow just what the doctor ordered. EVERY tiny thing you needed was there from coffe  milk  appliances  crockery  cutlery  vegemite even tinned tomatoes  shower gel  etc. VERY COOL DVDS  classy chess set  glad wrap salt pepper maps - you name it. All new. All fresh. All those things you hate having to buy at every hotel stay - you dont need to here. Most of all absolute Zen atmosphere. Beautiful  restful location. IGA had anything else you may need. Exemplary communication  cant wait to come back. So grateful to our amazingly accommodating but discreet hosts. Mwah!"),
("2017-12-25", "1138483", "Milton & Donna", "A perfect location to enjoy everything Bundeena has to offer. The cottage was private  quiet and with a lovely aspect over the garden which can be enjoyed from the deck. We strongly agree with an earlier comment the cottage is very comfortable and well equipped with books  cds and dvds.We stayed for 4 dayds over Christmas and found it very relaxing and plan to return."),
("2017-12-29", "1138483", "Nick", "This was a fun and relaxing stay. The place was lovely  clean  and very conveniently located. The hosts were friendly and knowledgeable of the local area."),
("2018-01-01", "1138483", "Alana", "I have to say this place was one hidden gem !! Great location and 2 min walk to Jibbon beach which is a beautiful calm beach good for swimming . 10 min walk to shops which was convenient and had IGA  bakery  take away shops   cafes and liquor store !!!!!! Great hosts and great little set up with the bbq and cosy place ! My partner and I will definitely be back before summers over!!!!We had a great relaxing Nye weekend here. I definitely recommend it if your looking for a nice private weekend away with peace / quiet and great location next to the beach. Thank you Belinda for letting us stay in your beautiful home and looking after us well :)) We will be back soon"),
("2018-01-06", "1138483", "Maria", "A peaceful stay in a well equipped garden studio - steps away from Bundeena beautiful beaches and nature walks. Belinda and Chris are hospitable and responsive hosts. We thank them for a peaceful rest in Bundeena"),
("2018-01-15", "1138483", "Lance", "We are regulars and it is always a treat."),
("2018-02-08", "1138483", "Dinara", "It’s an amazing place to stay at Bundeena  very cozy  clean and extremely close to beaches"),
("2018-02-16", "1138483", "Dinara", "Belinda's place is amazing for staying in Bundeena. Not only the garden studio itself is very cozy and comfortable  but the location is also great. It's very close to Jibbon beach and coast walk. It's very quiet and peaceful."),
("2018-02-28", "1138483", "Cath", "Private bush garden setting  perfume of frangipani  easy walk to a swim  or a coffee shop.Fun to arrive by train and ferry."),
("2018-03-03", "1138483", "Lance", "We are regulars.  Always a great time."),
("2018-03-30", "1138483", "Bruce", "Beautiful location  clean and very comfortable. Recommended."),
("2018-04-02", "1138483", "Linda", "Amazing beaches all nearby. Shops walking distance"),
("2018-04-08", "1138483", "Sebastian", "We had a wonderful stay at Belinda's in Bundeena. The bungalow was very comfortable with great amenities. A compact yet complete kitchen  comfortable bed  clean bathroom etc. Proximity to the beaches and walking tracks in the national park made it an idyllic weekend getaway! We would highly recommend. Thanks again Belinda."),
("2018-04-23", "1138483", "Bec", "Very private accommodation in a great location. Lovely hosts to deal with. Would definitely return."),
("2018-04-25", "1138483", "Cyril", "Great place  lovely location  super stay ... We really do recommend both Bundeena and Belinda's place to visit. We had a great time."),
("2018-05-02", "1138483", "Lance", "Another great stay"),
("2018-05-06", "1138483", "Melissa", "What a fantastic little slice of paradise.  Gorgeous accommodation  spotlessly clean  calm environment and literally just a stones throw from the most stunning beaches ever."),
("2018-05-10", "1138483", "Laurent", "We had a great time and thanks for your advices Belinda. Very friendly host in a pretty place. Perfect localisation to enjoy sunset and the royal nationnal park !"),
("2018-05-13", "1138483", "Sophie", "Le studio est spacieux  bien agencé et très lumineux  bien placé à côté de jolies balades et de plages parfaites pour les couchers de soleil. Bucolique c’est un lieu idéal pour un séjour calme proche de la nature !"),
("2018-06-04", "1138483", "Emma", "The most perfect cottage! I needed somewhere quiet to do some exam study  and Belinda and Chris's place was the perfect hideaway amid lush monsteras (while being close to the ferry and shops!). It's so lovely being able to wake up and stumble into Royal National Park – a five-minute walk down the road. The space itself is tastefully decorated  private and cosy with a well-equipped kitchen. I would love to visit again! Thanks so much."),
("2018-06-11", "1138483", "Antonio", "Great little place  very close to the track and beaches. Definitely recommend it."),
("2018-06-20", "1138483", "Kay", "Very clean and good place for restNear the beach just 1min and 3mins to the supermarket and everything is good Very Kind host!!!!We had great time"),
("2018-06-26", "1138483", "Debra", "Homely place with everything you need and in a great location. We'll be back"),
("2018-07-02", "1138483", "Phil", "This was our second visit to the cabin but the first with our new baby! We hope to keep coming back to this lovely space with all the conveniences you could want in a great location near the beach yet a short walk to the village shops."),
("2018-07-07", "1138483", "Chris", "Perfect spot for a getaway. Wouldn't stay elsewhere in Bundeena."),
("2018-07-15", "1138483", "Stephen", "We had a fabulous stay here for two nights  but could easily stay more. The accomodation is very well appointed with everything you need. If you want to cook and eat-in  the kitchen had everything. But Bundeena shops and restaurants are only a few minutes walk. The studio is in a secluded private location. We would happily stay here again."),
("2018-08-12", "1138483", "Harrison", "Great little granny flat  nice and private  you feel like your just in a little forest "),
("2018-08-13", "1138483", "Laura", "Thank you so much Belinda for the stay in your lovely cottage. The space is perfect - clean  modern design  peppered with lovely vintage touches. We loved looking out the windows onto your lush garden and it was a treat to be so close to such a stunning beach. It's the ideal home base for exploring the Royal National Park. Hope to be back again!"),
("2018-08-19", "1138483", "Jade", "Clean  private  comfortable - everything we needed. The location was beautiful with easy walking access to great beaches and national park trails. Belinda was available if we needed anything  but the cabin was so well set up that we were comfy in a world of our own."),
("2018-08-29", "1138483", "Stephanie", "Belinda's place is SPOTLESS - it was seriously one of the cleanest and most comfortable places we've stayed in. The flat is located at the back of a magical garden. We stayed in winter and in addition to heat  there were electric blankets which were so cozy. The location is amazing  just inside the Royal National Park and we found parking on the street  just outside very easily. Belinda was so lovely and nice too! We will definitely be back. "),
("2018-09-08", "1138483", "Jo", "Belinda's place has everything I needed to hide away for a few days - including subtle lighting  heating & cooling options  wine glasses  and music system for cds  iPod  radio  and a gorgeous private balcony looking out onto lush garden. So close to the sea too. I loved it."),
("2018-09-16", "1138483", "Smita", "Great place for a weekend !"),
("2018-09-20", "1138483", "Rebecca", "Perfectly situated for chilling out on the beach or exploring the coastal walks. Belinda was a great host and had some great suggestions for things to do locally. The apartment is situated in a lovely garden and only a few minutes walk from the beautiful little Jibbon beach. A perfect spot for a relaxing break."),
("2018-09-26", "1138483", "Sarah", "Belinda's place was in an excellent location  so close to the beach! It was spotless and had everything you need to cook. Really relaxing  perfect for a quiet getaway."),
("2018-09-30", "1138483", "Christine", "Great stay at Belinda's comfortable and cosy accommodation.   Booking  check in and check out super easy.  Belinda ensures plenty of pre-check in communication and has local information available for you.   Her place is well equipped  in a great location  and provides privacy and serenity.  The garden outlook is very pleasant and relaxing."),
("2018-10-09", "1138483", "Michael", "Beautiful environment and lovely designed space. Would definitely go again"),
("2018-10-26", "1138483", "Tracy", "Fantastic spot in Bundeena  virtually on top of a beach that I’d call paradise. Jibbon and the walks around the heads are magnificent. Belinda’s cabin is private even though you’re in her back garden. A very comfortable nook! Thanks for accommodating our early bag drop too."),
("2018-10-27", "1138483", "Lynda O", "Great spot"),
("2018-12-05", "1138483", "Lance", "Always a great stay."),
("2018-12-09", "1138483", "Tessa", "That this was my third stay at this lovely place should tell you everything you need to know! It is a delightful getaway in a beautiful location. Can't recommend highly enough even if it means booking my fourth stay will probably be harder!"),
("2018-12-11", "1138483", "Matthias", "Very nicely decorated and clean cottage in a nice garden close to the beach."),
("2018-12-16", "1138483", "Julie", "Clean comfortable accommodation. Suitable for couples. Bundeena is a beautiful area which you can use as a base for exploring the surrounding Royal National Park."),
("2018-12-19", "1138483", "Caely", "I loved my stay here! The garden around the studio makes it feel secluded and peaceful  and the location is excellent - it's very close to multiple beautiful beaches as well as the coastal track in the Royal National Park. The perfect place to go to escape the city for a few days."),
("2018-12-27", "1138483", "Britta", "This gorgeous  little cabin is a perfect base for hiking  swimming and relaxing.  Close to shops and ferry  so if you don't drive it's very convenient. I didn't want to leave.  Belinda was an excellent host  attention to detail with the small comforts in the cabin  and great communication. I highly recommend and look forward to another visit there soon."),
("2018-12-31", "1138483", "Sara", "Belinda was an excellent host who  once she showed us the studio left us to do our own thing. Everything we needed was available in the studio  which was a few minutes walk to beaches  shops and beautiful walks."),
("2019-01-01", "1138483", "Kate", "Such a lovely few days with Belinda in the beautiful Bundeena - well worth a visit! Everything was perfect  thank you again Belinda  we will definitely be back."),
("2019-01-05", "1138483", "Anna", "Belinda was a great host. The place is very clean and location is beautiful  peaceful and very convenient."),
("2019-01-13", "1138483", "Diana", "This was my second time at the cottage and there is so much to love about it.  Generous size space with a lush  green garden and close to all amenities.  You cross the road and the beach is right there  about 3 minutes to the RSL  6 minutes walk to IGA and 2 minutes from Jibbon Beach from where you can do a walk.  Only 4 minutes drive to Beachcomber Ave from where you can start the Royal National Park coastal walk - a really stunning walk.  And Belinda is  well  just a beautiful human being!  Do yourself a favour and stay here."),
("2019-01-15", "1138483", "Emily", "Belinda was an amazing host. I loved my stay here :) Located in a beautiful area  close to beaches  shops etc. Would highly recommend staying here."),
("2019-01-18", "1138483", "Colin", "Very comfortable clean accomodation in a lovely setting"),
("2019-01-19", "1138483", "Elyse", "Lovely cabin. Perfect for a weekend escape in a beautiful location. We would definitely go back again."),
("2019-01-29", "1138483", "Sara", "I had such a wonderful stay at belinda's. The place itself was a tranquil hideaway set within a beautiful garden. I was surprised at how private it was   and I loved how the place was nicely decorated. The location was great - only a minute to a quiet beach. Belinda was fantastic. Very accommodating and respectful of privacy. I would highly recommend this place."),
("2019-01-31", "1138483", "Jarl", "The perfect place if you want to leave the city. On the moment you step on the beautiful old ferry you will have the feeling you are going to an island."),
("2019-02-18", "1138483", "Lance", "Always a great stay.  Fantastic location and very comfortable."),
("2019-02-20", "1138483", "Maxence", "I would highly recommend staying at Belinda's place. It was only a stone away from the beach and only a couple of minutes by car from the National Park walking tracks. Moreover  Belinda was a great host and provided us with much relevant information regarding the spots to eat  shop in the area and most importantly the must do walks. Furthermore  the cabin was very cozy and well decorated and had everything you needed in order to make your trip unforgettable!"),
("2019-02-27", "1138483", "Julie", "It was wild and wet when I had an escape from the city ... was expecting to swim and walk but the space is so relaxing  and the book shelves full of so many interesting reads that it wasn’t hard to stay in and just wander in the weather breaks! Came by train and ferry- perfect start to a welcome break."),
("2019-03-04", "1138483", "Phillip", "Privacy  comfort & possums."),
("2016-03-24", "11719579", "Michelle", "Kate's place was great! I'd definitely stay again.  It was very clean and her roommates are wonderful--very chill and easy to live with.Kate was very considerate of any concerns I had as well and do all she could to ensure I was comfortable."),
("2016-08-15", "11778959", "Joshua", "My production company booked Jason's home to shoot the second series of our online show  A Shared House and we had an incredible time.In the months leading up to our booking Jason made himself available to assist us with any questions or queries we had about our time in the house.Jason was flexible with our schedule and did everything he could to make our stay as perfect and problem free as it could be.The home is immaculately kept and in great condition.  Close to public transport and near by shops. By the end of the two weeks  Jason's home felt like home to our cast and crew. Both Jason and his partner are so welcoming and accomodating - We have now become great friends!!"),
("2016-11-05", "11778959", "Sung Hui(Audrey)", "It was a great time as the host was really kind and helpful. My two boys loved there  they wanted to stay longer but we had to go. Thank you Jason  we hope your always happy. Bye~"),
("2017-06-11", "11778959", "Jiaojie", "house is so so so…lovely and Jason and his wife are friendly!"),
("2016-08-02", "11914814", "Robin", "When we first arrived Leslie and Roy made us feel very welcome  explaining everything in detail so we had a really relaxed and smooth stay without any issues. Excellent access to the beach and local shops  highly recommended."),
("2016-10-02", "11914814", "Geoffrey", "The hosts were absolutely amazing - dean's place is a perfect studio and everything exactly as promised in the listing. The communication was impeccable and everything was like new. Personally thought it was a little expensive but as long as the price is suitable for you  you can't go wrong with staying here. Honestly one of the best Airbnb's I've stayed at - the cleanliness  the treatment and communication from the hosts  the overall ambience of the place and the facilities offered - honestly fantastic."),
("2016-12-07", "12098138", "Andy", "Lizzy's Tamarama pad is a truly outstanding property.  It's amazingly well equipped  spacious  with stunning outlook (from an enormous terrace) and its beautifully maintained.  Lizzy is an absolute pleasure to deal with.  This is a unique property with a wonderful relaxed feel to it.  Also a perfect place to get some serious work done - its quite inspiring."),
("2016-12-27", "12098138", "Zosha", "Lizzy was the best host  and we fell in love with her beautiful home in the best spot in Sydney.  Her home is beautifully equipped with everything you need for a beach holiday  and Lizzy is just downstairs if you need anything. Tamarama beach is literally a 2 minute walk  and our kids spent a lot of time playing in the grassy patch if they weren't catching waves! We have had the best holiday and will definitely be back.  "),
("2017-02-28", "12098138", "Anna", "What a place!! What a host!! It s a dream  watching the beach earing the see lying on a dayboat bed. The place is huge and very close to amazing beaches and beautiful costal promenades... lizzie was a super host  very helpfull and carefull about us having a good time. The terrasse is superbThis place is marvellous!! We had a fantastic family time there we wont forgett"),
("2017-03-01", "12098138", "Johnny", "The big question for me is would I want to stay here again  and the answer is yes - in a heartbeat.To watch the sun rise over Tamarama beach from the comfort of all the cushions in the 'boat' in the sitting room was a delight. Not an early riser? Don't worry  the lorikeets will have you up in plenty of time....!"),
("2017-04-15", "12098138", "Leigh", "Set between Bondi beach and Bronte beach which are easy to walk to. Superb local beach for family and easy to grab an uber to the city. really enjoyed the location and weather."),
("2017-07-09", "12098138", "Luz", "This place is pure magic! I had the most wonderful time with family and we had everything we needed in the house. The location the quiet and friiendly neighbourhood and the spectacular view of the ocean day and night makes this place a MUST to experience. Add to that a gracious host to welcone you and who is always around to assist. Highly recommended for families!"),
("2017-08-15", "12098138", "Emma", "We had an fantastic stay in Lizzy's apartment. The location was excellent and Lizzy was so helpful and accommodating (making sure we had some breakfast provisions after we arrived late at night which was so very much appreciated). The apartment was more than spacious enough for our family of 5. The worst thing about this apartment was having to leave those amazing views behind when we left! I would definitely recommend this apartment to anyone else and would stay here again."),
("2017-09-05", "12098138", "Michael", "Great place right on Tamara Beach. Very cosy and great host who kept in contact prior and through our visit making it very comfortable for us. Easy check in  nice walking areas & very close to cafe's Bondi and surrounding beaches  Bondi Junction for shopping and an easy drive to City. Big spacious apartment with beautiful views and good entertaining areas. And a nice day bed (boat) overlooking beach for the perfect afternoon nap."),
("2017-10-09", "12098138", "Reiko", "We could have really beautiful time with my family in Lizzy's apartment.The view was so wonderful that we enjoyed day and night at balcony.For my 3 years old baby everything is perfect. We wanna be back someday.We really appreciate Lizzy's kindness and helpfulness.Thank you for everything."),
("2017-12-12", "12098138", "Lucas", "This is a fantastic apartment. The view is to die for. It’s very large. It has great facilities. And Lizzy is really helpful. We couldn’t have asked for a better place to stay. We came with 2 very small kids looking for a chilled out holiday in a cool area - this was perfect. Can’t wait to come back."),
("2017-12-21", "12098138", "Hamish", "Lizzy's place is fantastic! Beautiful view of Tamarama beach and only minutes walk from lots of shops and restaurants on Bondi road. Apartment is full of beautiful touches. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-01-06", "12098138", "Josh", "Great host  hospitality and place to stay at. We had a group of 5 and there was plenty of room. Would definitely recommend for anyone looking to visit Sydney and the eastern beaches.Thanks Lizzy!"),
("2018-01-14", "12098138", "Sarah", "If you’re looking for a truly magical stay in Tama this is the place. During our week long stay we never wanted to leave the apartment that was peaceful and zen like. We enjoyed our mornings checking the surf from the balcony and then walking barefoot to the beach for multiple swims. Truly it’s a slice of heaven."),
("2018-02-25", "12098138", "Maysa", "Lizzys house is an amazing spot in sydney.Tamarama is so nice and close to bronte pool that i personally loveeAlso lizZy have alot of details with us. She is always responding in a small time!The house is just perfect!We are looking forward to come backI really love this place and fully recomend it!!!!"),
("2018-03-17", "12098138", "Olivia", "Such a wonderful stay! Lizzy’s apartment is the best place to  stay in the Eastern Suburbs. Convenient  very clean  perfect for families and just above the beach! Last but not least  Lizzy is a great host  making sure we had all what we needed and very responsive. Thank you again for a wonderful stay!"),
("2018-04-03", "12098138", "Michael", "This apartment is excellent - location is a stone's throw to the beach  coastal walk and great cafes  fantastic view  and a really well kept  comfortable and complete apartment for a family.  Thoroughly recommended"),
("2018-04-10", "12098138", "Hannah", "Lizzy's place is just perfect! It is beautifully decorated and has a lovely calm and airy atmosphere. Very well appointed with everything you would need and a lovely balcony and day bed boat over looking the beach to chill. We took our two small children and it is a very baby/child friendly space. We were very comfortable and I would definitely recommend Lizzy's place and should we be in Sydney again we would definitely stay there."),
("2018-05-20", "12098138", "Andrew", "The house was beautiful and Lizzy was the most attentive host. The view from the house was heavenly and the neighborhood was perfect. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-06-13", "12098138", "力", "Lizzy is a wonderful and kind host   her plac is walking-distane to a great park and beach  fifteen minute to bondi beach as well"),
("2018-06-27", "12098138", "Mary", "We loved staying at Lizzy’s place!  The location was fantastic!  The view from the apartment was spectacular!  Super cool Home and we especially loved the boat “couch” in the living room!"),
("2018-07-04", "12098138", "Travis & Melissa", "Lizzy's place was perfect for our family - it's open  airy  with a balcony  some toys for the kids  plenty of entertainment options and so close to the parks and beaches. Lizzy was an awesome host with great communication  some really nice touches (amenities and some food items) and we're really grateful that she was able to accommodate an earlier-than-normal checkin time which we appreciated after 30 hours of planes and airports. We could rave on for ages  but quite simply... we'd never stay anywhere else on a trip to Sydney. "),
("2018-07-10", "12098138", "Mandy", "We thoroughly enjoyed staying at Tamarama from the spectacular view to the furnishings of the apartment which made our stay so special. We were greeted by yummy bread  fruit and other essentials which was greatly appreciated. The location was ideal for exploring Sydney with many great walks and beaches close by. Lizzie was a delightful host and we are already thinking about our next visit ."),
("2018-07-29", "12098138", "Lauren", "Lizzy was a fantastic host and we absolutely loved her Tamarama penthouse  it really exceeded our expectations. Here apartment was clean  fully stocked with everything we needed and more and the location was amazing  close to the beach and a quick walk or bus ride to Bondi Beach. Lizzy went above and beyond to accommodate us and made us feel so welcome  she was wonderful. We have 3 small children and the apartment was perfect for our family  safe  clean and had plenty of toys and other amenities for the kids. We can't say enough great things about our stay. "),
("2019-01-14", "12098138", "Carmela", "Location......view.....location.....view .... sums up our stay at Tamarama. The park next door was perfect for the our pet dog  we walked lots as Bondi was very close  lots of eating and shopping options around. Thank you Lizzy  we hope to be back  you are a great host  communication was perfect which made our stay easy and memorable."),
("2019-01-22", "12098138", "Lorraine", "Lizzy’s Place is fab! Amazing location with a really fab view. So easy to walk down to beach and close walk to both Bronte and Bondi. You feel like a local in this relaxing and spacious apartment. We loved it!"),
("2019-01-30", "12098138", "Sarah", "Lovely apartment in a fabulous location.  Best location in Sydney in our opinion! The photos don’t do it justice. The view to the beach is lovely from the spacious terrace. The kitchen was great  with everything you could need plus.... great for foodies. The bed was extremely comfortable   especially nice after a long trip from the UK. Also there are ceiling fans everywhere which kept us nice and cool in the heatwave temperatures. We didn’t need to use the air con. Ice machine was a real plus too. We felt instantly at home and much preferred it to the flashier looking apartments on offer on Airbnb. Would be great for families too. Thanks again Lizzy for being so helpful and accommodating."),
("2019-02-16", "12098138", "Jesper", "A truly amazing place!Spacious  with a moroccan feel to it  and of course views to die for.On top  Lizzy is a very considerate  helpful and responsive host  who'll do whatever she can to make your stay as enjoyable as possible.If you're looking for a luxurious 'base' that's close to all the southern beaches  and provides easy access to Sydney centre  look no further. You'll never wanna leave..."),
("2013-07-08", "1211285", "Craig", "We stayed at Eduardo and Yvonne's apartment for a week. For us it was perfect  my partner and I had our two teenage daughters with us for a ""shopping"" trip so each day we were heading off and out all over Sydney. The convenience of the flat was brilliant  we could just jump on the bus at the end of the road and head straight to town on the 333. Because we were blessed  with a week of blue sky and sunshine ( in July !!! ) most mornings we would just walk to bondi junction and grab breakfast / coffees then head for the trains. We felt really at home and relaxed each night taking in the views. The kitchen has everything you could ask for to whip up an evening meal which we did most nights. Both runners my partner and I ran most mornings around the park ( directly opposite ) then down to the beach tracks and back up bondi road to the flat  great work out and really fun running around the bays.  Would love to stay again if we get the chance and would recommend to all. Lovely couple and a great home. Cheers Craig and Claire "),
("2013-07-26", "1211285", "Ollie", "This place is in an amazing spot! The top floor  corner spot of a nice Bondi Junction building opposite Waverley Park. From the pictured balcony you get views from Coogee to Vaucluse and from the bedrooms you can see 180 all the way to the city. Location wise  you can't do better with a trip to Sydney. You're only a couple of minutes walk to the train station while not being far from a bunch of beaches including Bondi. The place itself is nice  the lounge is big with really comfy couches and good TV set up. Decorations are all really cool giving it a good vibe. The kitchen has more frypans  pots and utensils than a Masterchef final and the hosts offered that we could use their spices etc. They even left chocolate biscuits and a bottle of wine! Bedrooms are spacious and heaps of linen and towels provided. All in all  a great spot for a visit to Sydney!Ollie"),
("2013-10-01", "1211285", "Christina", "We stayed for two weeks at Eduardo and Yvonne's great apartment.   They were very communicative and helpful  and set the place up to be very welcoming to our family. The apartment is very clean with beautiful views of the ocean and Sydney. The location is great! It is directly across the street from Waverley Park  which quickly became our kids favorite hang out spot. It was great for my husband and I too  because we were able to get coffee and great quality breakfast at the kiosk there. We were also walking distance to the shopping center  grocery shopping  and restaurants. It is also in the delivery zone of some really great restaurants. Bondi Beach is close and was a total hit with the kids. Having laundry in the unit was very helpful for us for our long stay. In addition to television options  there were also many movies including movies for our kids to watch  which was helpful.The location is great  and doesn't require the use of a car to get around. If bringing a car  it is helpful to know that the parking on the premises is labeled as visitor parking with a four hour time limit during the day. It seems like it isn't really enforced and we had no trouble parking there for longer. There is also street parking on the block  which can be crowded during some hours of the day  but parking generally is pretty easy to find either on site or close to it. When we first arrived  the elevator was broken and we had to take the stairs up the apartment. Eduardo and Yvonne were very communicative regarding this issue  which ended up being resolved very quickly and was not an issue at all for rest of our stay. It seems that Eduardo and Yvonne are very responsive to guest issues as they arise.Overall  our stay in Sydney was a great experience  and I think that Eduardo and Yvonne's apartment was a great base from which to explore the city. "),
("2013-10-27", "1211285", "Alessio", "The reservation was canceled 34 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-01-07", "1211285", "John", "Myself  wife and daughter spent three great weeks in Sydney staying at the apartment of Eduardo and Yvonne.They were both prompt and easy to deal with when it came to organising our trip and answering any queries which arose. Both greeted us on arrival at the apartment and could not have made us feel more welcome.The apartment itself is top floor  modern  nicely decorated  clean and well maintained. Two large bedrooms  a well equipped kitchen and bathroom with both bath and walk-in shower. A fabulous lounge/ dining area with large comfortable couches for just relaxing and taking in the wonderful panoramic views. Getting up in the morning and walking into the lounge is a great start to any day  looking over Waverley Park to the ocean  fantastic. If you plan on seeing Sydney and the surrounding area you could not pick a better location. A short walk to Bondi Junction station where trains and buses will take you wherever you want to go. Both Bondi beach and Tamarama beach ( a bit quieter) are only 10-15 mins walk away. Plenty of shops  cafes and restaurants within the immediate vicinity with the easy option of going further afield from the Junction. All in all we had an amazing three weeks and there is no doubt the apartment for both its interior and location helped make that possible. I would highly recommend this apartment to anyone looking for great accommodation in a fantastic location."),
("2015-04-25", "1211285", "Arto", "Erinomainen sijainti. Hyvät kulkuyhteydet Sidneyn keskustaan bussilla ja junalla sekä Bond Beachin bussilla ( kävellen 12 min). Asunnosta on hyvät näkymät Bondille ja Sydneyn keskustaan.Asunnon varustelu on erinomainen. Asunnon kunto on hyvä ja asunto on siisti.  Edu ja Yvonne ovat erinomaisia isäntiä. SUOSITTELEN"),
("2015-07-20", "1211285", "Catherine", "Eduardo gave us a very warm welcome when we arrived and helped to carry our many luggages up to the apartment even though we insisted he didn't have to trouble himself. He also provided us with extra blankets since it was winter. The apartment was very cosy and nicely decorated. Both rooms came with stunning views. The beds were so comfortable we almost couldn't bear to leave the beds in the morning. :p In terms of location  it was quiet and we could hardly hear any traffic. Overall  it was a very wonderful stay for my group of four and we are really grateful for Ed's hospitality! "),
("2015-10-09", "1211285", "Melody", "The place was very cosy and clean. The view from the balcony was awesome. It was a bit noisy at night as there were people driving with very loud engine nearby. Overall  my baby and I had great time in the apartment. Thank you Eduardo & Yvonne!"),
("2017-01-01", "1211285", "Mark", "Great flat in a perfect spot. Close to Bondi Junction for travel  easy access to busses that take you either to Bondi beach ( if you don't want to walk down the hill) or into the city on either the 333 or 380. Flat is exactly as described and the hosts were in constant contact leading up to the arrival to make sure we had everything sorted. Great place would easily stay there again. Mark"),
("2017-04-13", "1211285", "Terry", "Enjoyed our stay at Yvonne and Edu's apartment. Excellent position within easy walking distance of Bondi junction and the train. The apartment was very clean and airy and we enjoyed the views. We found the bedroom a little noisy especially when the window was open. Great to have visitor parking in the basement and very convenient to drive into the CBD or to the beaches. Eduardo and Yvonne were easy to deal with and Edu met us on arrival and helped us up with our bags."),
("2018-12-26", "1211285", "Aoife", "Our stay at Eduardo & Yvonne's apartment was brilliant  the size  location and ammenities in the apartment were great for our stay. They provided great tips and helpful advice about what to eat/do in the area. Really nice top floor apartment with great views and good sized bedrooms."),
("2019-01-01", "1211285", "Sandra", "The apartment is located near Bondi beach  bus services into the city and as stated has good views. Fans were provided to accommodate for no air conditioning. Generally okay and provided a base and adequate. We did find a number of shortcomings which  from a basic starting point left us disappointed. A bottle of wine and some biscuits were there to welcome us.The place listed a single bed that converted into a king size bed. It doesn't and is more of a child bed. Not great for our adult son who stayed with us. Rather a long list of do & don'ts (don't wear shoes  don't open certain windows  do put on humidifier  do open doors   caution with worktops etc) suggested a higher standard of apartment than  it turned out to be. The cooker and facilities were not brilliant and no seating on the balcony as shown in the photos).While not bad it is basic and we were very put off cooking when we found rotting food in the microwave. No TV unless you have iphone. Can be noisy if windows left open. We paid a high price  accepting it was over New Year  it was not the standard we thought we had booked."),
("2016-04-11", "12117514", "James", "Gwen was a fantastic host. She was very accommodating of our late arrival and very early departure. The apartment was exactly as we imagined with a lot of natural light  sleek ""beachy"" decor and only a 5 min walk to the beach  everything you need for a perfect weekend away. I would definitely stay with Gwen again."),
("2016-05-04", "12117514", "Dani", "Great location  lovely helpful hosts. "),
("2016-05-04", "12117514", "Kitty", "Gwen is very sweet! met with her briefly and she gave me good tips. The flat was cozy and clean  5 mins walk to the beach and amazing restaurants: I loved BrownSugar right in front of their place. Staying here depends on what you are doing in Bondi. If it's to party and enjoy the nearby festivities until the wee hours of the night then this is perfect for you. I have to say that this place was a little too loud for my taste. Loud music from neighbors late at night and the busy street wasn't all that fun for an early sleeper like myself dealing with jet lag but it's out of Gwen's control so I just put my earplugs in and hoped for the best. Other than that  their place is perfectly located in safe area  and very close to the beach. Like I said it all depends on what you want out of your stay! "),
("2016-08-29", "12117514", "Louise", "Great location  very close to the beach. Gwen and Jim were very helpful."),
("2016-09-09", "12117514", "Jack", "Great"),
("2016-09-12", "12117514", "Bree", "Best location  the apartment was lovely and super close to the beach  shops and restaurants. Would recommend  Gwen's apartment to anyone and everyone that's wanting to go somewhere funky and fun! Gwen was super helpful with places to go  things to do and with questions and communication was great. Thanks Gwen for the best weekend! "),
("2016-10-16", "12117514", "Alex", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Gwen and Jim's.  Both were great communicators and made our 11pm arrival a breeze!Good little place in an amazing location  only very short walk to the water.  Thanks for having us!"),
("2016-10-29", "12117514", "Hyebin", "House is really close to bondi beach to walk! And many restaurants are near to house;-) Host is also kind! She explained about nice places to visit!"),
("2016-11-13", "12117514", "Tamara", "Gwen and Jim went out of their way to provide me with information on the apartment and neighborhood. They were fast to reply to communication and did everything they could to make sure my stay was comfortable. The location is out of this world. Close to good restaurants and bars and a 5 minute walk to the stunning Bondi Beach. The apartment is easy to access and comfortable. I would definitely stay here next time I am in Bondi."),
("2016-12-10", "12117514", "Jake", "Gwen provided great information regarding the apartment and also the surrounding shops and cafes. 10/10 Was also contactable 24/7 as described. :)"),
("2016-12-28", "12117514", "David", "This property is next to a busy road with a landing walkway the other side. Very hot with no a/c or fan. A very basic apartment with a wooden create as a coffee table!"),
("2017-01-19", "12117514", "Mateusz", "The host canceled this reservation the day before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-02-18", "12117514", "Samuel", "Great location  and very easy to deal with. Thanks. "),
("2017-03-11", "12117514", "Michelle", "Beautiful location. Lovely unique apartment. Highly recommended"),
("2017-10-01", "12117514", "David", "Great location close to Bondi  perfect for us and our puppy. The hosts were wonderful."),
("2017-10-29", "12117514", "Matt", "Great location right in the middle of Bondi. Gwen was so helpful and made the whole process really easy. 100% would recommend."),
("2017-11-15", "12117514", "Lauren", "This apartment was absolutely perfect for a holiday in Sydney. It's a fantastic location-right in the heart of Bondi  5 minutes away from the beach. Gwen was extremely communicative  and left us some great tips for things to see and do in the area.  I wish we could have stayed longer!"),
("2018-01-01", "12117514", "Sarah", "Gwennaelle was very helpful in providing lots of recommendations  house was clean and in a great location"),
("2018-01-03", "12117514", "Nelly", "This place was adorable.  I️t was perfectly located and has everything you could want.  The outside balcony was really nice to wake up to and read.  I couldn’t have asked for a better experience!!  The hosts were also very responsive at all times  which was key."),
("2018-01-20", "12117514", "Steve", "Lovely clean apartment opposite the best nightlife in bondi walking distance to everything and great balcony"),
("2018-03-03", "12117514", "Michelle", "We had a fantastic stay at Gwennaelle's place. Check in was smooth and easy. It is a lovely  clean and spacious apartment in a great location close to the beach and cafes. We would definitely stay again."),
("2018-03-30", "12117514", "Ewan", "Great location  with a lovely big balcony.  Host was extremely helpful & accommodating  especially as we only booked at very short notice."),
("2018-04-03", "12117514", "Erin", "Great location  can be noisy on weekends as busy street. Gwen is lovely though."),
("2018-04-05", "12117514", "Jamilla", "Gwennaelle's has been an amazing host to us for the 2 nights we stayed in Bondi  she had been so  accommodating to our needs: due to circumstances we had to stay another night and she was more than happy to host us which was so kind of her! Her place is stunning and super clean with great amenities! Overall we had an amazing time at her appartment  which was also a short walk from Bondi Beach and really nice restaurants! Would come back  highly recommend to stay here if you're looking for a great host in Bondi."),
("2018-04-22", "12117514", "Kathy", "Great spot. Close to shops. Close to beach. Plenty of room. Pet friendly! Clean! Gwennaelle was a great host! We would stay again!"),
("2018-09-30", "12117514", "Jill", "Great location"),
("2018-11-02", "12117514", "Marcus", "A wonderful little pad in a great location. Gwen is a fantastic host  communicates well and gives great suggestions. Easy and enjoyable. Highly recommended."),
("2018-11-04", "12117514", "Whitney", "Great location walking distance to the beach  bars  restaurants and shops. Expect a little noise at night from nearby bars.  Beautiful cute clean space with wonderful local tips from Gwen and great communication throughout our stay.Wish we could’ve spent more time here! Thank you!Whitney and Jamie"),
("2018-11-24", "12117514", "Olivia", "Our one night stay in Gwennaelle’s apartment was perfect being 5 minutes from the beach! The apartment was clean  tidy  with lots of natural light. The balcony was great for an afternoon wine. We would definitely recommended this apartment and would stay in it again. The check in/out process was easy and convenient :)"),
("2018-12-30", "12117514", "Nina", "great location   walking distance to everything near Bondi. Excellent restaurants and drinks very close to apt."),
("2019-01-01", "12117514", "Ingrid", "Great location  great balcony  nice apartment and comfy bed! Gwennaelle gave us a lot of god info on what to do and where to eat."),
("2019-01-20", "12117514", "Sarah", "Loved staying at Gwennaelles place! She couldn’t have been more responsive or given more local tips - so helpful! It was a short walk from the beach and I just enjoyed spending my time at Bondi. This area has a great vibe in the summer and has everything you need for a great getaway. The space is exactly as shown  comfortable  and with plenty of space."),
("2016-04-15", "12259367", "Sid", "The apartment was neat and tidy. Very close to transport and good location of you're working in the CBD. The check in procedure was very flexible and Angela was very easy to get in touch with and followed up. She even left me a box of chocolates as a warm welcome. Will stay again."),
("2016-04-17", "12259367", "Tyson", "Great area and beautifully presented apartment  very clean. Angela was extremely helpful and easy to deal with. Loved staying here."),
("2016-04-28", "12259367", "Francisco", "Angela was an excellent host - extremely welcoming and helpful throughout my stay. The apartment is immaculate - extremely clean and new  central location  close to shops and the train station. A perfect apartment for people who want to explore Sydney. I highly recommend this Airbnb without any reservations."),
("2016-05-02", "12259367", "Paul", "It was a perfect stay. The location was great as was the friendly service. It was meticulously clean and had the most comfy bed IVE EVER SLEPT ON!!!"),
("2016-05-21", "12259367", "John", "Really enjoyed my stay and I am looking forward in staying again  it's clean  great location for my needs .. Prefect and great wonderful hospitality best regards  "),
("2016-05-29", "12259367", "Gene", "Outstanding communication prior to and during the stay. The apartment was great - would stay again!"),
("2016-06-07", "12259367", "Peter", "Angela was a fantastic host! She was very friendly and responded to any questions that I had.The apartment was nice  clean  and most of all comfortable! It had all the amenities that I needed. Wifi worked perfectly. Great location as it was within walking distance to many sights such as the Rocks  Opera House  Harbor Bridge  Darling Harbor  and George Street (shopping district). It was also conveniently located near the train station if I needed to head someplace far and to the ferries (that I took to Taronga Zoo and Manly Beach).Would highly recommend Angela as a host and her apartment to others!"),
("2016-06-11", "12259367", "Michael", "Fantastic apartment in very convenient location. Getting the keys wasn't a problem at all and was a pleasure to walk into a very clean apartment and have 2 cold beers in the fridge awaiting me too. I was very quiet which suited me as I was staying for business.I would highly recommend this apartment to anyone visiting Sydney."),
("2016-06-20", "12259367", "Anita", "Great location!!!! 10min walk to Pitt at and 10min walk to circular quay. Great little apartment  especially if you're staying in Sydney for more then a weekend! Has a washing machine/drier  which was super convenient. Also a little kitchenette so we could have breakfast etc in. Also Angela left us a cute little gift on arrival  which was the sweetest touch. Definitely will be staying here again next time and recommending it to friends. Thank you!!!!"),
("2016-06-24", "12259367", "Angel", "This was my first Airbnb experience and I feel so fortunate to have stayed at Angela's property.  Angela is extremely responsive and friendly  and the studio is just perfect - so clean and spacious with everything I needed.  Staying here was a breeze :). She even provided me with chocolates and grocery items when she found out this was an extended stay!  I would definitely love to stay here again and highly recommend Angela and the property to everyone visiting Sydney :)"),
("2016-07-07", "12259367", "Angel", "I booked for an extended stay at Angela's apartment and it was everything I could hope for in an Airbnb stay and more! The apartment was extremely clean and well-kept with all the amenities included.  I loved the beautiful marble bathroom and the spacious living space.  The kitchen included a stove top  microwave  toaster and kettle so I was able to easily prepare simple meals and breakfast.  The neighborhood is quiet  safe  and there are various cafes and restaurants just around the corner.  It is also within a short walk to Wynyard station and major shopping spots.  This apartment was perfect for my stay in Sydney and I highly recommend it to everyone looking for a home away from home :)"),
("2016-07-14", "12259367", "Gloria", "Angela's place was exactly as pictured in a nice and secure building. I enjoyed the quietness  and she was very respectful of my needs and privacy. I'd return to her place next time I visit Sydney!"),
("2016-07-30", "12259367", "Colin", "Angela was fast to respond to any queries  and provided excellent directions and arrival instructions.  The apartment was as described  and the location suited me perfectly.  I will be booking again."),
("2016-08-01", "12259367", "Janelle", "Could not speak highly enough of the host! I let her know it was a surprise for my husbands birthday. She went out of the way to put up banners and purchase a cake as a surprise for us! Communication was A+! The room was fabulous and so clean and comfy! Thanku so very much!"),
("2016-08-05", "12259367", "Mary", "The studio is comfortable and really clean.  Great location for exploring Sydney.  Quick walk to The Rocks  Sydney Harbor Bridge and Circular Quay.  Host is very accommodating."),
("2016-08-23", "12259367", "Nashua", "Angela was extremely easy to deal with and was wonderful in going above and beyond to ensure we had a comfortable stay. Her communication was amazing and the overall experience was very positive. We felt very welcomed and can't speak highly enough of her kindness and professionalism.The property is located in an excellent spot - very safe and super close to Darling Harbour  Circular Quay and the CBD (all within 5-10 mins walk).The building has excellent facilities and the apartment is very clean. This was our first Airbnb experience and most definitely will not be our last.We highly recommend Angela and the apartment. Thank you so much again for everything :)"),
("2016-08-29", "12259367", "Beverly", "A gem for any discerning traveller to Sydney! Lovely well appointed apartment with everything you could ask for in a stay  the marble bathroom was a bonus. Private but convenient location in the city - ten minutes walk to Wynyard's main attractions and the shopping district. Angela was a wonderful host  leaving some groceries in the fridge and communicating well to ensure I had a smooth stay. I'd love to be back the next time I'm in town! "),
("2016-09-05", "12259367", "Gaeru", "My husband and I had a great time staying at A's place. It was super cozy  clean and in a good location close to the rocks  circular quay  transit and a grocery store. A was very responsive whenever we had a question. Definitely will recommend this place to anyone visiting Sydney CBD"),
("2016-09-11", "12259367", "Rebecca", "This was the perfect place for my friend and I for our first trip to Sydney! The place looks exactly like the pictures and was as clean as a hotel room when we arrived! Angela was very accommodating and even provided some basic foodstuffs for us in the fridge when we arrived. You could not ask for a better location staying here. It's only a few blocks to Darling Harbour and a short walk to The Rocks and Circular Quay. It was easily accessible and we had no issues throughout our time staying there. I highly recommend this studio and would definitely stay here again!"),
("2016-09-18", "12259367", "Emily", "I've never used Airbnb until this trip  and I was a bit nervous my first go around in an international city  but Angela made the process very smooth and saw to it that everything was taken care of for me. Very clean place and comfortable to stay in."),
("2016-09-22", "12259367", "Cassie", "We had a wonderful stay for 3 night in this apartment. Angela was wonderful and extremely helpful. Her little touches really made it a special stay and the apartment was very conveniently located. We would highly recommend this place !"),
("2016-10-01", "12259367", "Ng", "Didn't had the chance to meet our host  but she was extremely helpful and provide us great suggestion on places to go and how to get around.Went the extra mile by providing us some basic groceries as we had an extended stay. Which was a pleasant surprise :) highly recommend Place was very clean :)"),
("2016-10-04", "12259367", "Riley", "My wife and I spent 5 comfortable nights here. We were completely satisfied with the studio's location  security  cleanliness  spaciousness  and amenities  including the WiFi connection. Andrea communicated well with us  and kindly left us a few food items in the refrigerator. "),
("2016-10-14", "12259367", "Patrick", "Best value for the money!  Great location - walking distance to many of Sydneys best attractions. We loved the fitness center in this building!Very easy check in/out process- pick up key  and leave key!"),
("2016-10-24", "12259367", "Masha", "The place was great  close to everything and just like a hotel. The apartment was well equipped  clean and easy to access. We loved it and would stay there again! Thank you! "),
("2016-10-28", "12259367", "Valery", "Roomy & well equipped studio apartment. Great location! Very close to the Opera House & downtown! Very good contact with host!"),
("2016-10-31", "12259367", "Albert", "Very convenient  cute apt. Great looking bathroom. "),
("2016-11-06", "12259367", "Claire", "The perfect place for a stay in Sydney. Great location and good communication with the host. Would definitely recommend to others and stay here again myself. Thanks for the special birthday welcome for my daughter Angela."),
("2016-11-11", "12259367", "Mary", "All we can say is this apartment and location is amazing.  The proximity to everything is just perfect -- walking distance to just about anything.  The apartment is a good size  extremely clean  and very quiet.  Andrea's communication before our arrival and during out stay was great.  We loved our stay here and when we return to Sydney  our favorite city in the world  we will definitely stay here.  "),
("2016-11-21", "12259367", "Michael", "A's place is amazing  a great location to easily walk to Darling Harbour  Circular Quay and the CBD. The apartment was incredibly clean and well presented on arrival. Getting they keys was really easy  we were settled in within minutes of our arrival and didn't want to leave at the end of our stay!I would definitely recommend A's place to anyone looking for a great weekend in Sydney. We will definitely be back!"),
("2016-11-22", "12259367", "Jen", "Apartment was exactly how described & the extra information given re: keys / directions to the apartment  etc was very helpful. Only complaint (it's a very small one) would be the lack of towels in the room. Good price. Good location. Clean & - lovely host! Will defo be back & have already recommended to friends & family"),
("2016-11-26", "12259367", "Paul", "A was super helpful and always responded quickly to any enquiry. She even booked a car for us to get to the airport early on a Sunday morning  and was very welcoming in every way."),
("2016-12-01", "12259367", "Charlotte", "Apartment is in the perfect spot to explore Sydney with the main attractions all within walking distance. We were able to walk to darling harbour for dinner and the cruises around the harbour  harbour bridge is a 10minute walk and the opera house 20 minute walk. We loved the apartment  and it was great to come back after a day out exploring and jump in the pool! Angela was a great host making sure we had all our details prior to arrival and the details left about amenities nearby and places to explore was amazing. When we are back in Sydney we will be returning to this apartment! Thanks Angela! "),
("2016-12-04", "12259367", "Bryony", "Excellent communication from Angela re access to the property. Walking distance to great restaurants  circular quay. "),
("2016-12-11", "12259367", "Haijuan", "Angela is helpful! My family and I love the SPA in the building. Everything from collecting the key to returning the key was going smoothly. The bathroom is very spacious and so clean."),
("2016-12-14", "12259367", "Tim", "Great location and fantastic apartment. I'd definitely stay again"),
("2016-12-17", "12259367", "Renee", "Very tidy and clean apartment  helpful host"),
("2016-12-29", "12259367", "Robert", "Angela was a terrific host!  Great communication and the condo was exactly as described...clean  great location and easy in & out.  We stayed for a week and a half and really appreciated the close acces to public transportation as we explored Sydney.  Highly recommended!!"),
("2017-01-01", "12259367", "Martin", "After reading the reviews I had high expectations about the apartment.Yes the location is great but the apartment is ok. Way over priced for the quality of presentations offered.Not enough towels for everybody  dishes and cutlery dirty  dusty furniture and kitchen  remote controls were not working  carpet floor dirty. We asked for shower gel as the one provided by the host was empty we got shampoo instead because ""no more available"".When you pay $1 200 for 3 nights in Sydney you can expect a minimum of standard this apartment doesn't offer.Disappointing."),
("2017-01-13", "12259367", "Ingrid", "Thanks Angela for fabulous location to kick-off my adventures in Sydney...the opportunities for exploring were great. And love love love the cold showers & aircon during recent hot weather. I even did a spot of cooking...great to have cooking facilities & would have loved a blender for smoothies. I definitely recommend your place to other business travellers...very accessible to CBD  Darling Harbour  The Rocks & Barangaroo precinct."),
("2017-01-30", "12259367", "Tine", "The apartment was great! The bed was very comfortable  the kitchen was well equipped  and the gym and pool were one of the best I ever had in an apartment stay. While being next to a busy street  the apartment is quite and serene  and the bathroom provides a bit of an oasis with a full-size tub and separate shower. The host was very responsive and extremely helpful. Overall  a great experience."),
("2017-02-02", "12259367", "Jennie", "Location of this apartment is ideal for a trip to Sydney. Very short walk to Wynyard Station  Darling Harbor and Circular Quay. While the apartment is on the 2nd floor of the building (view of street) there is no street noise at night - very quiet. The apartment is more like a hotel room than an apartment - nicely decorated but with no personal effects from the owner. Washer and dryer were convenient to have as well as a small kitchen space. Host was easy to communicate with before and during the stay."),
("2017-02-05", "12259367", "莎兰", "Best host ever!! The house is really nice and cozy and clean with wonderful location. We really like it. Angela is thoughtful and good communicator  best wishes to her. Hope we didn't bother too much."),
("2017-02-15", "12259367", "Chris", "The apartment was fairly central. Bit noisy near the bridge. If you are looking for a studio apartment close to town and don't mind a bit of occasional noise then this should be fine."),
("2017-03-03", "12259367", "Josh", "Great location. A was quick and clear with the responses to any questions I had. The place was very clean and comfortable."),
("2017-03-08", "12259367", "Richard", "This apartment has an excellent location  great access to shops  transit  restaurants. The unit was clean and the bed was very comfortable. Loved Sydney and A's place."),
("2017-03-17", "12259367", "Aimi", "Conveniently located and the host was impeccable. Couldn't have found a more accommodating person if I tried too. Comfortable living space and had some good snoozes while on holiday. Thank you again  A! :) "),
("2017-03-23", "12259367", "Jill", "Great location!"),
("2018-10-02", "12259367", "Ivan", "Overall a great experience . Was bounced out when touched down   Athena was really helpful in locating another available room on the spot ."),
("2018-10-05", "12259367", "Jane", "Central location."),
("2018-10-08", "12259367", "David", "Nice modern flat close to city centre. Spotlessly clean and with great amenities including indoor swimming pool. Athena was very helpful over arrival and departure times - we had a great stay!!"),
("2018-10-13", "12259367", "Zac", "Athena was very thoughtful with accommodating my needs. I needed to check in early and she was able to let me do so. The actual apartment is spacious and has everything someone would need for a stay in Sydney. It’s also very close to one of the harbors so it’s very easy to hop on a ferry and go to the beach."),
("2018-10-21", "12259367", "Ashraf", "Great location. close to all nice places in Sydney.  Clean and tidy. good communications"),
("2018-10-24", "12259367", "Marcela", "Perfect location! Right in the middle of Darling Harbour and Opera!"),
("2018-10-27", "12259367", "Alex", "Great location"),
("2018-10-31", "12259367", "Joselito", "Great location near the harbour. Great value"),
("2018-11-02", "12259367", "Anthony", "The place was in a great location and is good value."),
("2018-11-12", "12259367", "Nanxing", "brilliant location and fantastic pool and spa and gym. the comfort and cleaningness of the room itself needs some attention. a good stay overall for a premium location. very responsive host  thumbs up for the lovely attitude!"),
("2018-11-13", "12259367", "Adam", "Athena’s place is great. Very clean and well located. Would return for sure. Check in was a breeze!"),
("2018-11-17", "12259367", "晨", "这家民宿地理位置很好 距离歌剧院､岩石区､市中心都很近 本身附近也有餐馆和超市｡住宿环境也很好 居住比较方便 推荐作为短期旅游的首选"),
("2018-11-20", "12259367", "Natalia", "Our stay at Athena’s place was great! It was our first stop in Australia and it did not disappoint. It was THE best location for a good price—walking distance to Circular Quay as well as other local transit lines  convenience stores and restaurants (check out the Barangaroo area for some great new restaurants!) The bathroom was spacious and had some good amenities (laundry  extra toilet paper  hair dryer  shampoo and soap). Of note  there is only 1 towel per guest. There is also a kitchenette which has a tea kettle  silverware/plates  coffee  tea  sugar and fridge. The bed was comfy and apartment was clean. We felt it was very secure as you had to swipe in to get into the building and elevator. Athena also made the check-in process seamless. We would stay here again and recommend it to others!"),
("2018-11-22", "12259367", "Stephen", "Great location   great pool and spa   and good amenities. A very pleasant stay"),
("2018-11-30", "12259367", "Gilles", "Athena’s apartment is very nice and facilities are excellent. It is very well located close to Sydney CBD and train and ferry stations. It is also very quiet. Check in was easy and Athena answered my questions quickly. For two people  I recommend the place and would return if I had to stay in Sydney CBD."),
("2018-12-06", "12259367", "Arend", "Excellent location!"),
("2018-12-08", "12259367", "Debbie", "Awesome location!  Liked our private apartment. Very clean. Our host was very nice and pleasant.  Had great amenities . Definitely would come back!"),
("2019-01-10", "12259367", "Chantal", "L’appartement d’Athena a un emplacement exceptionnel. Tous les services sont à proximité ou bien le transport est disponible tous près de l’appartement . Le secteur est très sécuritaire  tout près de Darling Harbour. Plusieurs sympathiques restaurants et cafés .Nous avons adoré notre séjour.  Le seul élément est le manque d’espace dans la pièce principale. Il n’y a pas de sofa et le coin cuisine est au minimum pour une semaine."),
("2019-01-16", "12259367", "소정", "Location is very good"),
("2019-02-04", "12259367", "Marie Claire", "Logement très bien situé dans un bel immeuble ! Produits de première nécessité fournis . Bonne base pour visiter Sydney ."),
("2019-02-10", "12259367", "Tamara", "I loved the location of this apartment.  I was able to walk everywhere or walk to the nearest train station which was super convenient!  I liked having the mini-kitchen of which I made use.  There was butter  nutella   and vegemite spread available for my use as well.  I chickened out and didn't try the vegemite  but I should have!  The place overall was very comfortable and I would highly recommend staying here!  I actually used pool and spa one night and had it all to myself.  Nice views of the bay there.  Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2019-02-13", "12259367", "John", "Perfectly ok for the business trip I used it for. It is obviously a former hotel. its a little tired but comfortable enough. It's on the fringe of the city rather than central cbd but train station fairly close. Lots of cooking smells from adjoining apartments which was a bit annoying. It has a good gym with equipment that seems pretty  much brand new. I didn't use the pool but it looked good."),
("2016-05-15", "12370710", "Melissa", "This place is a gem. Maria is super friendly and generous with her time and pantry supplies. The water really is that close!! The location spectacular to look at and snorkel or just chill out with a coffee on the walkway. The room is very spacious and the window seat just makes you want to connect with your inner cat. We had an amazing time and can't wait to plan another trip to Sydney."),
("2016-05-24", "12370710", "Ron", "Maria is a great host made us feel at home straight away. The room is amazing and makes relaxing a breeze."),
("2016-05-26", "12370710", "Mark", "Maria and her partner Gerry were warm  quiet and friendly. I was made welcome and provided with plenty of directions to find the beautiful space which was shared with me... The bay window photo says it all about the iconic building and the sensational location. For me   real is what I love to experience  and real is what I got... The location and neighbourhood  make this a perfect relaxation point... Older style building with charm and character and great food and coffee right under the window and 5 mins oceanside walk into Manly..."),
("2016-05-29", "12370710", "Alexa", "First experience in Manly with Maria is really wonderful. The room is so spacious and bright just as displayed in the album. We enjoy the sunrise and breakfast on that colourful balcony very much. Maria and her husband are warm sunshine in chilly windy Sydney. We really appreciate their hospitality and kindness. Looking forward to our next visit to that shiny sea and this cute accommodation."),
("2016-06-04", "12370710", "Nicola", "We loved our stay at Maria's. You could not get any closer to the water and her and her hubby were super friendly and welcoming.We will be back!"),
("2016-06-06", "12370710", "Blake", "Maria's hospitality is amazing and makes her guests feel most welcome. We arrived a little later in the evening  and she had all our needs taken care of. Her apartment is in an amazing location  10min walk to the centre of Manly  and overlooks the ocean. It was a pleasure to stay with Maria and would like to return to experience the location again."),
("2016-06-10", "12370710", "Hayden", "Very well presented and an amazing position !"),
("2016-09-04", "12370710", "Michelle", "Very good - great position and Maria and Jerry were lovely"),
("2016-09-25", "12370710", "Karolina", "Maria's and Jerry's place is a real gem!! I've Airbnb-ed a lot in the past months here in Sydney and I must say this place was my absolute favourite of all :) It's a cosy piece of paradise with the most beautiful view  directly above the ocean  super huge bedroom that feels like its own little apartment  incredibly cute decorations  a super comfy huge bed  extremely lovely hosts and a neighbourhood and area that is truly feeling like a millionaires paradise :) Sitting in the pillows at the huge window  or hearing the ocean in bed and having a coffee  ocean breeze or swim right below the apartment felt like the ultimate vacation  I can't recommend it enough!! :) Thank you to both of you for sharing your little paradise :)"),
("2016-12-07", "12370710", "Rory", "Amazing location  snorkelling  surfing & gorgeous shelley beach right on your doorstep. Loved coffee at the boathouse and falling asleep to the sound of the ocean. Maria & Jerry are great hosts very friendly and helpful. Their apartment is in a worldclass location. Stunning. Felt priviliged to stay there.I had a great time. Thanks guys will see u all soon! X"),
("2017-05-04", "12370710", "Clara", "La habitación es muy cómoda  y la vista es espectacular! Muy cerca del Corso de Manly  la playa y cafes. Muy buena comunicación con María y con Jerome. Si volviera a Manly seguro alquilaría de nuevo la habitación!"),
("2017-05-12", "12370710", "Jacquie", "Fantastic room. Fantastic location. Although I never got to meet Maria who was away  Jerry was a fantastic host. A not to be missed room and location. "),
("2017-05-14", "12370710", "Todd", "Maria was off jetsetting when I came to stay ( half her luck ! )  but ensured that I was in good hands with the charming Jerome - well  he's French  so charming of course ; )It's difficult to think of a more stunning spot in Sydney than this iconic building  above the cafe along the Shelley Beach board walk - tranquility itself  no matter the weather.Thank you so much guys - I'll certainly stay again."),
("2017-05-18", "12370710", "Matty", "Amazing stay!"),
("2017-06-03", "12370710", "Clarissa", "Wow  what a view for such a great price. It was like being in the ocean. Amazing room so very comfortable and the hosts were super duper hosts  never there but always checking in. Loved my stay.. it was a special time. Thank you"),
("2017-06-20", "12370710", "Simone", "Maria and Jerome's place was absolutely fantastic... the location was perfect for our long weekend trip away. Close to fabulous cafes  restaurants and the most beautiful beaches.The window seat is to die for... the activity outside in the water of swimming  surf skis and divers is very cool to watch before starting the day's activities.I didn't get to meet Maria but her commutation and friendliness was amazing  she gave us tips of where to go  where to eat and things to do.We met Jerome half way through our stay and he was so lovely and made us feel very welcome.Would absolutely recommend... I want to go back already!"),
("2017-06-30", "12370710", "Anne", "Maria and Jerome are such lovely hosts. They really know how to give you your privacy for your holiday (which I very much appreciate)  but they are always there when you need them via text/call/Airbnb message  which is greatly assuring. They have awesome recommendations on local places (including places with local deals) and the room does not let your expectations down. The view is absolutely amazing  no matter the weather. The room and amenities are very clean  with extra towels and sheets in the cupboard  should you need them. I was worried about heating since it's winter and the listing didn't have heating ticked  but they provided a thermostat heater that kept us nice and cosy. Another cute thing to note was the deco. There's an adorable kiwi bird toy and some binoculars that we took advantage of with the great view from the window. Also  go up to the terrace! You definitely won't be disappointed at Maria's :)"),
("2017-07-04", "12370710", "Marlies", "Thank you so much for sharing your awesome accommodation  ""a piece of heaven on earth "" ! Hope to come back one day... "),
("2017-07-07", "12370710", "Isabelle", "Magnifique endroit et vue de la chambre ! Accueil très chaleureux ! Tout était parfait ! N'hésitez pas !"),
("2017-07-14", "12370710", "Debbie", "Perfect location at Manly with a stunning view.  An easy stroll to Manly and the wharf with breathtaking views along the way.  Maria and Jerry were charming and friendly and willing to share their knowledge of the local area.  So much to see on the beach side of Sydney and away from the crowds of the city.  Highly recommend."),
("2017-07-28", "12370710", "Todd", "The sweetest hosts in THE best location in Sydney. My second visit was ever bit as good as the first. I'll definitely be back for a third..."),
("2017-07-30", "12370710", "Stephan & Erica", "Maria's place is just as it is described. The most beautiful place to wake up in Manly. Maria and Jerry are very friendly hosts. It was a bit wierd for me sharing a kitchen and bathroom with them but everything is clean and tidy so it really is a nice place to stay."),
("2017-08-02", "12370710", "Emiko", "comforting placeI was very happy to find this place. Wave sound · Beautiful blue sea · Sea and starry sky · Delicious restaurant · Wonderful spectacular walking course.And even a wonderful host! Husband feels (Website hidden by Airbnb) wife was a bright  smart  always positive  active and spiritual person.I stayed at this house  what should I do now? I got comfort and courage. I highly recommend it.Once I went there  it was a place I wanted to go again."),
("2017-08-04", "12370710", "William", "Top spot"),
("2017-08-06", "12370710", "Allan", "Great location  best view. Friendly hosts."),
("2017-08-12", "12370710", "Katarina", "No place in Manly is better than this. Such a lovely space  beautiful hosts  easy communication. Perfect location for swimming. Convenient distance to groceries and all the restaurants. Minutes from the Ferry. Best location  best hosts. Privacy is respected. I hope to come back again."),
("2017-08-26", "12370710", "Matias", "María and Jerome where the greatest anfitrions we could have hoped for. The room Is just as seen in the pictures  very spacious and an incredible view."),
("2017-09-10", "12370710", "Andrew", "Great! Such a lovely location  with the most amazing view out of the window. Try and be up for sunrise  it's a special time of day  the locals are in the sea before the sun even comes up! You can't help but feel relaxed watching the ocean and wandering along the walking track. There's also loads of good places to eat! You're only a 15 minute walk to Manly Wharf  then half hour straight into Circular Quay on the ferry. The commuters obviously take it for granted  but it's such an amazing ferry ride! Last but not least  Maria and Jerome are both lovely and very hospitable. Loved it!"),
("2017-09-30", "12370710", "Keith", "Maria & Jerry were great hosts & very welcoming. The room was clean & had a beautiful view of the ocean. Would recommend this place to anyone looking for scenic views or looking to be close to the sensational beaches of manly."),
("2017-10-02", "12370710", "Walkiria", "Maria and Terry  are the most amazing hosts I've ever had!!They made me feel like a friend more than just a guest...  The room is more awesome than how it looks in the photos.  The decorations are flawless  the bed is very comfortable and the cleanliness is impeccable!!! The location can't be more perfect  right in the middle of the 2 best beach spots in Manly and literally in front of the ocean. I still can't believe how lucky I was to be able to stay there."),
("2017-10-15", "12370710", "Riza", "Great place to stay  very close to beautiful beach and snorkeling spot. Wonderful host."),
("2017-10-21", "12370710", "Christine", "As my first airbnb experience in Sydney  Maria's place has reached all expectations & set the level (top rated) for my future bookings. I've only airbnb'ed overseas. Not only was the room palatial but comfortable with excellent views to boot plus the beach right at their doorstep. It was very central to everything I needed. I hope her room will be available with my next trip to Manly. They are excellent hosts  passionate about their area in Manly  great communicator  making sure my stay was hassle free. Thanks again Maria & Jerry."),
("2017-10-24", "12370710", "Eric", "L'endroit est tout simplement extraordinaire  quant à la vue depuis la chambre et bien c'est magique. C'est idéal pour sortir de son quotidien. Maria est très sympathique   bref j'adore et j'aurais aimé rester plus de temps."),
("2017-10-28", "12370710", "Murray", "Great spot  clean room and an amazing view.  Very comfy and Maria and jerry are so welcoming. So easy to checkin and a great central location."),
("2017-11-11", "12370710", "Ted", "Maria is a very gracious host and her place is fantastic!  I️ highly recommend it if you want an idyllic setting with unbeatable view and perfect location at Manly Beach."),
("2017-11-16", "12370710", "Andrew", "Maria and Jerry are incredible hosts - super kind and helpful.  And the view from the clean simple beachy room is one of the best in the world! (if you love oceans and beaches and things that are amazing)"),
("2017-11-18", "12370710", "Terry", "It is one of the most beautiful parts of Australia. Not for sleeping in. Get out and enjoy the day."),
("2017-11-22", "12370710", "Lenise", "We had a fabulous time here  enjoying the positively amazing views from the beautiful window seat  sipping wine and munching chips  while enjoying the exciting passing parade of people walking along the promenade.  The bed was super comfy  the decorations delightful and appropriate and pretty.  There was no problem with sharing amenities with Maria and Jerry  and we would highly recommend their lovely beachside home to all  so don't be shy about the share bathroom and kitchen; it worked out beautifully."),
("2017-12-02", "12370710", "Simon", "Fantastic place  amazing hosts!!I would highly recommend staying at Maria’s place. Fantastic location with everything at your doorstep. But more importantly Maria and Jerry are brilliant hosts. Was a pleasure dealing with them and they made everything as easy as possible."),
("2018-01-05", "12370710", "Lisa", "Maria and Jerome's place was exactly what I needed. An amazing location. I went snorkeling every day and it was just a short step out the front door and you're in the water swimming around big fish and little stingrays. It was fantastic. It was also create just to still in the window and watch people pass by as you listen to the sound of the little waves breaking. I can't wait to come back."),
("2018-01-07", "12370710", "Michael", "Fantastic place! Gorgeous location right on the water over looking the bower!  Close walk to town proper and to Shelly beach. Maria was an excellent host  full of info about manly. We thoroughly enjoyed or time there."),
("2018-01-14", "12370710", "Chris", "Probably the best view in Manly! Great hosts and super friendly couple. Everything else as described and really enjoyed my 5 night stay! Thanks Chris"),
("2018-01-18", "12370710", "Rodney", "Supernice host & place to stay  highly recommended!"),
("2018-01-20", "12370710", "Jasmine", "Beautiful space. Maria is very communicative and helpful. The location is prime!"),
("2018-02-06", "12370710", "Bonnie", "Fabulous location and view! Spectacular! Clean and tastefully decorated. Maria was easy and quick to communicate with . She has set up everything for an easy enjoyable stay ! Thank you Maria !"),
("2018-02-13", "12370710", "Margaret", "Lovely clean and well decorated large room with fantastic view of blue sea.Is situated between two beaches with lovely walk to both. Shared bathroom and kitchen was easily managed with access to fridge and cooker if you wanted to cook.Maria provided excellent and helpful information and is a wealth of local knowledge.Highly recommend this property and host"),
("2018-03-27", "12370710", "Sarah", "Perfect view lovely host great location"),
("2018-04-07", "12370710", "Jiyang", "如果你是海滩男孩儿或者女孩 住在这里是一个明智的选择 房东热情好客非常好 但是由于房子楼下是餐馆卫生不是很理想 在房间内踩死两只虫子 有些家具有点久 在未使用过的床上发现毛发 最重要的是4个人使用一个小的并且不明亮的洗手间和浴室联在一起的不是很方便 并且没有特别的停车位 路边很难停到 很抱歉maria 但是确实从进门为止低过我们的预期 希望稍做改进 接下来会更好｡"),
("2018-04-11", "12370710", "Philip", "An unforgettable location and hospitality that can't be faulted. Thank you!"),
("2018-04-19", "12370710", "대영", "유쾌한  jerome과 활기찬 maria를 만나보세요. 인생 최고의 바다경치는 보너스입니다.에어비앤비 최고의 숙소 중에 하나라고 자신합니다.최고의 경치  편안하고 아름다운 숙소  바다를 좋아한다면 주저하지 말고 선택하세요.숙소에서 세발자국만 뛰면 시드니 최고의 스노클링 포인트가 당신을 맞이 할겁니다."),
("2018-04-25", "12370710", "Lewis", "Great room in a cool flat with top views over the bay. Maria and her husband were more than hospitable hosts - can only recommend to anyone in the area"),
("2018-04-29", "12370710", "Bec", "Great view and close to the water"),
("2013-12-26", "1229797", "Alfonso", "Irene is a lovely and very helpfully host with a very nice place  tidy and clean. Recommended!"),
("2014-01-02", "1229797", "Betty", "It was a great stay in Irene's place! The apartment is clean and cozy  located within walking distance from a train station as well as bus station. Both Irene and John are very helpful and welcoming."),
("2014-01-07", "1229797", "Siobhan", "Lovely apartment great location Irene was very friendly definitely would recommend"),
("2014-02-05", "1229797", "Adrienne", "Perfect place to stay a couple of days to visit Sydney ! Irene is an amazing host !"),
("2015-01-04", "1229797", "棋峰", "Very clean and comfortable house. Location is  very close to city . The house lady is good to us when we stay there. Lovely Sydney."),
("2015-01-16", "1229797", "Toshitada", "The reservation was canceled 5 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-01-21", "1229797", "John", "The reservation was canceled 11 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-01-21", "1229797", "John", "The reservation was canceled 25 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-01-21", "1229797", "John", "The reservation was canceled 32 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-01-21", "1229797", "John", "The reservation was canceled 18 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-02-08", "1229797", "Az", "Clean   Spacious and comfortable room.Very close to staion and up and comming REDFERN CAFES .Great communication and flxible peerson .Freat host and Room "),
("2015-02-10", "1229797", "Vio & Marco", "The reservation was canceled 19 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-02-18", "1229797", "Brenda", "The reservation was canceled 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-02-24", "1229797", "Hugo", "The reservation was canceled 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-04-06", "1229797", "Damien", "The reservation was canceled 3 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-04-09", "1229797", "Elizabeth", "Lovely & very neat apartment with a really comfortable bed & that's really conveniently located. We loved the close proximity to Redfern Station & small shops nearby. Irene was very friendly & hospitable to us & responded promptly to any questions we had prior to our arrival. Highly recommended host!"),
("2015-04-21", "1229797", "Kim", "The reservation was canceled 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-11-28", "1229797", "Meinai", "NICE to meet Irene&Glenn! I had a good time in their home.They provided all that we need  the location for their apartment is convenient for us  room and bathroom are both clean. I had a great trip with my friends in Sydney."),
("2018-01-20", "1229797", "Nathalie", "Very friendly and helpful couple  also the place is great and looks like the pictures. Would recommend it for people with smaller luggage though because the room is on the 2nd floor"),
("2019-01-01", "1229797", "Sebastian", "Irene and Glenn were the perfect hosts  period. Their home was perfect  they made us feel welcome every step of the way and even for NYE standards  our stay was absolutely worth the money. Definitely recommend to other guests! Thank you!"),
("2019-03-04", "1229797", "Jasmine", "I stayed here for 5 nights. Glenn and Irene were really friendly and accommodating. I was running a little  late with check-in but Irene kindly waited for me. The bedroom and private bathroom were spotless and comfortable. The room itself was also very quiet. The location is very convenient  about 7 mins walk to Redfern station. Overall  highly recommended. Thanks for the stay!"),
("2016-05-02", "12256344", "风", "Besides the location is very convent not only near the city center but also surrounded by 2 Coles market. This is the most fantastic and lovely experience I ever had.Paul and his family are very good at taking care of their guests  they prepare milk  honey  orange  cereal for us. During the 2 weeks  they just treat us as same as a part of the family  inviting us to their festival dinner  introducing us to their best friends. Every morning they would ask if it was a good sleep. Every evening  they would say good night before we go back to the room. If ever I will go back to Sydney again  this would be my only choice. 这是我在Airbnb中最最满意的一次住宿体验｡不仅仅这个地理位置很好 去市中心 悉尼歌剧院 门口的公交车直达｡而且周围的配套设施齐全 十分方便｡Paul一家人待客非常之好 如若对待家人｡一直给我们买牛奶 橙汁 谷物 蜂蜜等等｡尽可能地提供信息帮助我们｡只要去悉尼 对于住处 这永远会是我的第一 也是唯一的选择｡"),
("2016-05-16", "12256344", "Clémence", "Paul  Judith et ses enfants nous ont très bien reçus  la maison est agréable  le jardin également. La chambre est spacieuse  lumineuse et au calme. Le quartier est bien desservi en bus et proche de cafés  restaurants. La famille nous a très bien conseillé sur Sydney et ils sont très attentionnés. Nous avons même eu de la baguette au petit dej! Merci encore de nous avoir accueillies  c'était très bien!"),
("2016-05-22", "12256344", "Anna", "I had a lovely stay at Paul and Judith's beautiful home. The house is in a great area and as hosts Paul and Judith were extremely hospitable."),
("2016-06-26", "12256344", "Kate", "Paul and his family were incredibly welcoming  hospitable and really helpful as I started to find my feet in Sydney. The room was lovely and spacious with a very comfy bed. The family were always happy to chat and share a meal but likewise you could have your own space if needed. I cannot recommend this Airbnb more highly."),
("2016-07-05", "12256344", "Jack", "Paul was not there to receive us   however he got his son  Tim to help us with the check in procedures. Both Tim and Nicole are very helpful and friendly  sharing with us food places around the vicinity.  The city is easily accessible from the place.There are lots of food choices in the location as well. The room and toilet is true to picture  it was really comfortable and spacious. We enjoyed our stay there.We especially love the two dogs; really friendly and cute:)"),
("2016-07-15", "12256344", "Gabrielle", "We had a wonderful time at Paul and Judith's lovely  spacious and peaceful home. We were well looked after by Nicola and Tim in Paul and Judith's absence and enjoyed having their home for us alone. We felt very much at home  enjoyed a cosy room upstairs and the location was perfect for my work and close to some wonderful cafes and bakeries in Redfern and Surry Hills. Paul and Judith were especially kind to send me something that I unfortunately left behind. Truly generous hosts and we can absolutely recommend anyone to stay at their beautiful home!! "),
("2016-07-30", "12256344", "Josh & JY", "Paul and his lovely family were very hospitable and more than accommodating. Everything from the room to the kitchen to the rest of the house had personality  charm and above all  a wonderful homey atmosphere. The best part about our stay was Judith's (Paul's wife) excellent selection of coffee and of course  their two very friendly dogs."),
("2016-08-27", "12256344", "Caroline", "Beautiful house in a great location of Sydney. The room was very nice  clean and tidy  in a private spot of the house on the top floor. Also  guests have their own bathroom.My mom and a friend stayed with Paul and his family and I also had the pleasure to meet him one day.Paul is a great host  very hospitable and absolutely helpful  it was great staying with him! Thanks so much for letting them have a great time in Sydney :)"),
("2016-09-13", "12256344", "Maura", "A lovely family   very friendly and welcoming. We felt comfortable as being in our home. Excellent location with good transport connections. City centre and Airport 15 minutes faraway. Wonderful dogs  we loved stay with them because they are easygoing and affectionate"),
("2016-09-22", "12256344", "Nicolas", "Judith and family were wonderful hosts. Great location and very comfortable room ."),
("2016-09-29", "12256344", "Jamie", "Perfect location for an affordable stay in Sydney! Grocery  liquor  and pharmacy  nearby  and commute to Circular Quay or Central train station is easy with a 5 minute walk to 2 different bus stops. Additionally  an Uber to the airport from this location can cost less than public transit! The space is great for single or couple use  with a comfy bed to fall into after a day of sightseeing. The family is very welcoming and resourceful if you need help with anything. The dogs are a great bonus  if you're pet lovers like us. Judith was very flexible with our arrival time considering our flight schedules which made logistics that much easier. "),
("2016-10-12", "12256344", "Jackie", "We spent 10 days at Paul's and Judith's house and felt welcomed from the very first moment. The house is very nice and in a great location. There're many restaurants around and a bus stop just by the corner. The room and bathroom are  spacious  clean and nicely decorated.Paul and Judith  as well as the rest of the family  were very nice  friendly and interesting to talk to. They also gave us many tips about things to do and places to visit in Sydney. We shared many good times with them and we would definitely book this room again.Highly recommended! "),
("2016-10-29", "12256344", "Jerie", "I had a lovely time staying with Paul and his family in gorgeous Redfern! The location is fantastic - not too busy but super conveniently located. Paul  Judith  Tim and Nicola treated me like one of the family. Highly recommended."),
("2016-11-06", "12256344", "Alexander", "After a long day in the city it always felt like coming home  because Paul was so friendly and kind. When we arrived he invited us to watch the Melbourne Cup together and explained us the importance of this event in Australia  which was in fact very new for us and interesting to learn. Paul did everything he could to help us navigate through Sydney and even had Opal cards prepared for us. He and his wife Judith are wonderful people who we enjoyed a lot to stay with. Thank you for a wonderful week!"),
("2016-11-15", "12256344", "Steve", "Paul  Judith and Tim were really friendly and welcoming and I felt at home immediately. The house is so well situated for travelling to city or beaches  its a great place to stay in Sydney."),
("2016-11-21", "12256344", "Chantelle", "Paul  Judith and Tim were welcoming  friendly and completely lovely. They allowed me the space I needed yet were open to a nice chat each evening too. I highly recommend this AirBnB. It's delightful and so are the hosts. "),
("2016-11-27", "12256344", "Jennifer", "We were attending a conference at Technology Park in Redfern  we walked their every day  we were only 5 minutes walk to an amazing array of eateries  Paul's house is a beautiful old terrace in an historic area and as hosts  he and Judith treated us like old friends. Just be aware the room is on the third floor and the stairs are steep. Would highly recommend"),
("2016-12-17", "12256344", "Sandra", "Lovely house owned by delightful people in an interesting location"),
("2016-12-26", "12256344", "Clotilde", "Paul et Judith se sont immédiatement montrés très accueillants et chaleureux. Ils n'ont pas hésité à converser avec nous  nous ont donné des conseils quant aux transports en commun et ils s'intéressaient à ce que nous faisions la journée. Nous avions même le droit à du pain frais tous les matins. Le quartier était conforme à nos attentes: proche du centre-ville en utilisant les transports en commun et très tranquille pour y dormir. Une adresse à recommander les yeux fermés!"),
("2017-01-06", "12256344", "Clarisse", "Chez Paul vous serez reçu comme si vous faisiez partie de la famille tout en respectant votre intimité. C'est une fabuleuse expérience d'intégration."),
("2017-02-13", "12256344", "Lais", "Highly highly recommend!! Wonderful hosts  beautiful house  great location. Feels like a luxury hotel with family warmth. Just wonderful! "),
("2017-02-19", "12256344", "Insoo", "게스트에 대해 많은 배려가 있습니다ᆞ 위치는 중심가와 조금 떨어져 있지만 단독으로 사용할 수 있는 깨끗한 욕실과 넓은 방  그리고 그 곳에 살고 계시는 폴과 주디스의 자상함 때문에 편안하게 지낼 수 있는 집입니다"),
("2017-03-02", "12256344", "Teresa", "I stayed with Paul and Judith for a week and enjoyed meeting them and staying in their home. They have 2 sweet dogs..the bigger one being calmer than the rather noisy smaller one (noisy at 11 at night and possibly at 6am too when I was woken a couple of times by continuous barking though that could have been in the neighbourhood ). I knew the neighborhood because my daughter and family live there and it is great for shops and restaurants and transport everywhere.Visitors should be aware that the room is on the 2nd floor up some narrow  steep stairs. This makes it a bit tricky with suitcases and in the night when you are half asleep and need to go downstairs to the bathroom! The family generously give up their bathroom for guests and use another one downstairs. Great bread for breakfast  particularly the last couple of days!"),
("2017-03-08", "12256344", "Tatiana", "Great place to stay. Paul and Judith were very kind and helpful. It is a perfect place to stay if you want to know an Australian family. The breakfast was very good  the house was clean... good shower and a comfortable bed. Highly recommended!!"),
("2017-03-30", "12256344", "冠傅", "Paul和Judy 非常友善 也非常樂意幫忙你所需要的問題 Paul會給予很多行程建議 相當有幫助"),
("2017-04-10", "12256344", "Guy", "We had a fantastic time here. The house is in a great location  and provided us with a brilliant base from which to explore Sydney. Paul and Judith were very welcoming - would definitely recommend. "),
("2017-04-19", "12256344", "Quentin", "The journey was very nice. The location of the house is perfect  near a bus stop and you can walk into the city easily. The house was clean. We felt like home!thank you again."),
("2017-05-02", "12256344", "Bella + Marco", "Judith an Paul are awesome hosts. We deeply appreciated they stay in there charming and pretty well maintained house. They served fresh baked bread every morning and we celebrated our coffee at the cosy terrace. Judith and Paul are quit entertaining and warmhearted people. We highly recommend to stay with them. JUST GREAT!"),
("2017-06-12", "12256344", "Jason", "Great location. Nice walk to CBD and many shops and restaurants very close by if you want a (very) short walk. Busses very close as well though I didn't have a need to use them. Hosts were very friendly and help out with any info you need. Highly recommended."),
("2017-06-27", "12256344", "Kelsey", "From beginning to end  Paul and Judith made us feel welcome. From the lovely continental breakfast to individual bedside lamps  you can tell they have thought of every detail to ensure you have a comfortable stay. Their place is in a great location  only a half hour walk from the city centre  very close to bus stops and 5mins walk away from two great cafes. We also enjoyed spending time with Bonnie and Benny  their two very friendly dogs :) Absolutely recommended and hope to stay here again next time we are in Sydney."),
("2017-07-04", "12256344", "Gordon", "The home is situated on a corner by a small cul de sac park and is as advertised in the photos. The neighbourhood is gentrified with a number of hip boutique shops  a bakery and cafes nearby with bus stops and a supermarket within walking distance. Paul and Judith were on holiday during my stay but I was well looked after by their daughters who popped in to help if needed. Even the nearby neighbour chipped in to help with getting inside when I arrived late at night and couldn't find the key. During my stay and chats with the eldest daughter and neighbour I could tell that this house had character and raised a nice and respected family. Be careful with the stairs though  they are a bit steep but I only carried a backpack with me. Lastly  the dogs Bonnie and Benny are very obedient  well-behaved and cute! I'd definitely like to come back should the opportunity present itself in the future."),
("2017-07-17", "12256344", "其", "Paul and Judith :Thank you very much for everything you have done for us  please forgive me  because my English too bad  can't express my thanks to you.House clean  beautiful  convenient and provide us with a lot of help.Very happy to be living here.You are welcome to come to China  I miss you guys paul  Judith and every things in the house.living here days will be the best pary of my memory."),
("2017-07-31", "12256344", "Andie", "Paul and Janet are very welcoming and friendly. Location is close to buses and Crown Street in Surry Hills. Perfect for a weekend away!"),
("2017-08-09", "12256344", "Adarsh", "Paul's place is centrally located and very close to the CBD area. If you're looking for a place to stay that's close to the center of the city  a stones throw away from the bus stops  close to a couple of restaurants and a place that says 'You are welcome to stay with us in our house  please make yourselves comfortable' then this is the place to be. Both Paul and Judith go the extra mile and help you get around the city with Opal cards and with suggestions on what you can probably do with your day. We had a lovely time staying at their place and certainly enjoyed their hospitality."),
("2017-08-16", "12256344", "Sharyn", "Warm friendly hosts. Made us feel very welcome. Room was very nice and comfortable. Not too far to walk to the city."),
("2017-08-20", "12256344", "Phillip", "Paul and Judith were incredibly kind hosts who made me and my partner feel incredibly welcome during our stay in their beautiful home. They helped us tremendously in finding our way around Sydney and offered wonderful suggestions for us to do. The room itself was lovely and spacious  and the house is located in such a great neighbourhood  chock full of great shops and restaurants. I'm so happy to have come across this true find and I highly recommend staying here! "),
("2017-09-10", "12256344", "Gerard A.", "Paul and Judith were wonderful hosts  their place truly felt like home away from home  one of the best airbnb experiences we're had (and we have had quite a few good ones).Gerard and Blanca"),
("2017-09-17", "12256344", "Rose", "Paul and Judith t amazing! The local s so good. What a beautiful home."),
("2017-09-22", "12256344", "Paula", "Paul and Judith are kind and friendly hosts who loves to meet new people. Judith is a still working teacher and Paul is at home. They give You good tips what to do in Sydney and are very helpful! Our stay was a Nice experience with interesting conversations with this two. Their Apartment is in Redfern  by feet You Need about 15 minutes to Sydney Harbour Bridge and Opera House. There are some cool restaurants in the area for a typical Aussie-Breakfast. The Supermarkt is just around the corner. We really enjoyed our time with Paul and Judith and hope to meet them again in the future!"),
("2017-09-28", "12256344", "Neil", "A lovely old house situated in a lovely part of Sydney.  Paul  Judith their dogs and their grownup kids are all wonderful people who were a real pleasure to chat with every morning over breakfast and every evening after a long day of sightseeing.  This is one of the nicest experiences I've ever had with Airbnb  keep up the great work  guys  and continue to be awesome smart classy people."),
("2017-10-05", "12256344", "博", "Best experience ever  quiet and nice. Fantastic hosts with high detail explaination for every thing you need and two lovely dogs always waitting for you. Go there without any second doubt."),
("2017-10-12", "12256344", "Jacquie", "Paul is a charming and thoughtful host. He was incredibly kind and helpful and I really enjoyed our little chats. The house is in a great location in Bourke Street so really close to Surrey Hills  Centennial Park and for getting in and out the city. The room is very nice and a little away so you have your own privacy.  I would highly recommend this airbnb."),
("2017-10-17", "12256344", "Stephan", "Paul and Judith were very welcoming. Always happy to help. They even lend us their opal cards for public transportation. A really nice place to stay  when you go visit Sydney for a couple of days."),
("2017-10-21", "12256344", "Heather", "What an amazing house! Beautiful rambling lovely old place in a brilliant neighbourhood in Surry Hills. Just a few minutes walk to cafes  pubs etc...wpuld definitely come back!"),
("2017-10-29", "12256344", "Paul", "I had a great time staying at Paul & Judith’s place!  They are very nice and fun to be with. The house and the room  are both clean and filled with character  meaning very comfortable. It’s also close to quite a few restaurants and bus lines. You can make a turn or two and walk for 30 minutes or so and be at the Opera House!  I recommend it highly."),
("2017-11-02", "12256344", "Else", "Paul en Judith waren zeer gastvrij. De locatie was prima. Op loopafstand  ongeveer 45 min. van het centrum."),
("2017-11-10", "12256344", "Vera", "Paul & Judith were wonderful hosts - we enjoyed staying with them in their beautiful home! We also loved the small conversations with them - they were so nice & open to answer all our questions : ) But they also respected our privacy. The location is perfect - so close to many good restaurants  bars & cafés. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-11-13", "12256344", "Ye", "一对善良可爱的老人 很喜欢和我们聊家常 对我们的出行也很关心 指导我们的行进路线｡在他们家三天 入乡随俗 体会到了悉尼居民的闲适生活｡"),
("2017-11-22", "12256344", "Franziska", "Wenn ihr nach Sydney reisen wollt und euch wirklich mal in der Fremde zu Hause fühlen wollt  dann wohnt bei Judith und Paul.Unserer Meinung nach findet ihr hier eine echte AirBnB-Perle. Hier vermietet nicht ein größeres Unternehmen mit einem fingierten Besitzer  sondern hier wohnt ihr bei echten Sydneysidern und habt die Chance bei warmherzigen  wundervollen Menschen einen kleinen Einblick in das Leben in Sydney zu bekommen."),
("2017-12-12", "12256344", "Caroline", "Nous avons été vraiment bien accueillis et pour notre première expérience avec rbnb  nous avons été très satisfait.Merci de tout notre cœur  de nous avoir permis de passer un séjour très agréable dans votre beau pays. Jean-Marie et Caroline."),
("2017-12-18", "12256344", "Alisa", "I absolutely loved staying here  the hosts are amazing and the location is great. The house has great charm about it and I loved how the neighborhood  is so neat and quite  yet so close to shops  restaurants  cafes  and public transportation for city access. I had access to buses within a few min walk. The room was great  private and comfortable. The dogies are very nice and kind if you like dogs. Overall  amazing stay  would love to come back for sure."),
("2017-12-23", "12256344", "Dave", "Paul and Judith are wonderful hosts and their home is a great base to explore Sydney from! Redfern also has tons of great cafes and restaurants. We would definitely stay here again!"),
("2017-12-28", "12256344", "Chris", "We had a great time here. It is far closer to the CBD than we anticipated so being able to walk to the Opera House on our first night in Sydney was an added bonus. If you're up for the walk Paul knows a lot about the city and gives great advice on how to get about."),
("2018-01-06", "12256344", "Hattie", "Paul and Judith’s house is in a great location  close to loads of cool shops and restaurants and an easy walk/bus ride into the CBD. We stayed for a week and the house had everything we needed. It was very peaceful and the whole family made us feel very welcome and gave us loads of tips on what to do."),
("2018-02-18", "12256344", "Michael", "Paul and Judith really went out of their way to make the stay pleasant and comfortable. They were friendly and sociable as well as leaving you to your own devices if you wished.The house was clean and tidy  with a large bedroom and comfortable double bed. The room did get slightly hot some days but that was to be expected in the middle of summer and a fan was thoughtfully provided Plenty of space for clothes and other items in the room. Check in was very easy and I was let in by one of their friendly (adult) children.They have two well behaved dogs who didn't cause any fuss. It was a large and extremely friendly house and would definitely recommend to anyone thinking of staying."),
("2018-03-23", "12256344", "Dorothy", "Paul and Judith are lovely people and wonderful hosts. I stayed for a month and they were very kind and helpful and we became good friends. The house is in a great location being near useful bus routes  supermarkets and restaurants. The accommodation is excellent value for money. I would recommend it for any length of stay. Be aware that the bathroom is on the floor below. The room is large  with a bed  reading lights lots of cupboards and a hanging rail. .The park outside is lovely but occasionally you can get people talking there late into the night  so make sure you have earplugs."),
("2018-03-28", "12256344", "Sophie", "Lovely friendly warm couple who went out of their way to help us find our way around Sydney :) suggested us places to go and even let us use their public transportation cards and wrote down the bus routes for is in detail so we wouldn't get lost!!! Clean and pretty house. We were very comfortable and had nice chats with them :) we would definitely recommend staying there! Plus their dogs are so friendly :D Thank you Judith and Paul :)"),
("2018-04-04", "12256344", "Pavel", "Paul and Judith are the best hosts and the loveliest couple! Of course we enjoyed the private room at the loft  the comfortable bed  the private bathroom with hot shower  the kitchen and the lovely garden for meals and a beer - but not as much as the heartwarming hospitality by Paul  Judith and their 2 adorable dogs! Everything made us fell like home in Redfern  a lively yet peaceful neighbourhood with lots of wonderful eateries in Surry Hills. One not to be missed is Bourke Street Bakery. Coles supermarket is at doorsteps and Sydney CBD is easily accessible by bus in around 20min. No doubt we will choose to come back there whenever we visit Sydney again."),
("2018-04-09", "12256344", "Rolf", "Toller Service  einfach nur klasse. Danke Paul und Judith."),
("2018-04-14", "12256344", "Christopher", "Paul's place was very convenient for getting us around Sydney.  He and his wife were happy to speak with us and help us out as needed  including use of their washer which was much appreciated.  We highly recommend staying with them.  Only issue that jumps out for folks to be aware of is that the room is up two flights of stairs  so if that might be a problem for you  be aware.  This wasn't a problem for us."),
("2018-04-22", "12256344", "Trish", "Great hosts!  Welcoming and friendly. Love their home oozing great charm and character! Close to transport and if you like walking its only 35 minutes to Darling Harbour. Plenty of colourful  local restaurants. Thank you Paul and Judith... would definitely stay their again."),
("2018-04-28", "12256344", "Michaela", "Wir hatten eine tolle Zeit bei Judith und Paul. Sie waren wunderbare Gastgeber. Das Haus war sehr sauber und die Lage der Unterkunft ist perfekt. Paul hat uns viele hilfreiche Tipps für Sydney gegeben und wir haben unsere Zeit sehr genossen. Viele lieben Dank!"),
("2018-05-26", "12256344", "Saskia", "We had a wonderful time at Judys and Pauls home. We stayed for 4 weeks  because we attempted an English class to improve our language skills. Judy and Paul are lovely hosts  they are very kind and helpful. It was always a pleasure to talk to them. The house and room is welcoming  comfy and clean. The neighbourhood is picturesque  calm but with a lot of nice bars and restaurants. There are plenty of busses running to the city center  main station and the beaches.Thank you for the great stay!"),
("2018-06-08", "12256344", "Liming", "Paul and Judish's house is so beautiful and tidy. They are the  best hosts  caring for everyone and  giving travelers the warmth as home. The location of this house is so good  there are a lots of buses going around Sydney. The markets and Cafes are all around  the streets are beautiful and quiet. walking along the big trees and beautiful houeses is a very comfortable feeling. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-06-18", "12256344", "Marie", "Paul and Judith offered very helpful recommendations throughout our trip and gave us helpful tips for getting downtown  as well as finding great restaurants. The kitchen cart for guests was very convenient  with tea  coffee  chocolate  and muesli included  as well as use of a mini fridge and dishes. I especially enjoyed the muesli! Meals out in Sydney can be quite expensive  so it was nice to be able to prepare lunches in the morning and set out for the day. Paul and Judith’s is conveniently located near two grocery stores  several coffee shops  and numerous pubs and restaurants. It usually took us 30-45 minutes to walk to Hyde Park. We felt that the walk to and from downtown was manageable  though public transit is an option  too. Lastly  the room is very cozy with a wonderful down blanket that’s perfect for chilly  rainy nights. We loved our time in Redfern! Thank you both!"),
("2018-06-27", "12256344", "Christoph", "Judith and Paul are very nice hosts. They live in a beautiful old house in one of the hipper parts of the town with lots of nice little cafes and interesting shops just around the corner. We had a quiet room and a bathroom on our own.  Public transport is perfect  three bus lines are operating nearby and also one station of the local trains is in walking distance. They even gave us a ""rechargeable"" ticket for the busses and boats which was very useful. Don't miss a ferry tour with the boats on the Sydney harbour. They operate between the different suburbs and start at Circular Quay  for example.  We can recommend Judith and Pauls house definetly for your visit in Sydney."),
("2018-08-14", "12256344", "Cyla", "Paul and Judith's house is amazing and comfortable  the bedroom is quiet and charming. They were helpful with everything that I needed. The house is very well located. One of the best airbnb experiences I've had so far  I totally recommend it!"),
("2018-08-21", "12256344", "Marco", "The place was as described. Very well located for public transportation  groceries  and eating. Paul and Judith are very kind and are very willing to help you navigate Sydney  they are very very sweet. Everyone else in the family was also very helpful and nice. The dogs were very friendly and happy. The bathroom was shared  but we have not issued at all. All in the house was very well supply. We really appreciate al the nice touches to make our life easier in Sydney  like the opal cards. "),
("2018-11-04", "12256344", "Milena", "Wir hatten eine tolle Zeit bei Paul und Judith. Da wir sehr spät landeten  konnten wir erst gegen Mitternacht einchecken  was Paul nicht daran hinderte uns herzlich zu Begrüßen. Das Haus war wunderschön. Die Lage perfekt um die Stadt zu erkunden. Jederzeit wieder."),
("2018-11-09", "12256344", "Jessie", "The home is in a fantastic location and Paul + family are wonderful! Great stay in Sydney."),
("2018-12-03", "12256344", "Ruby", "Great value for your stay! It felt like a very authentic Airbnb stay with hosts very open to helping you out and making some good conversation. Basic amenities  price reflective of this :)"),
("2018-12-14", "12256344", "Beth", "Beautiful leafy suburb close to the city. Gracious and friendly hosts."),
("2019-01-16", "12256344", "Gini", "Such a lovely place and village. Also  very good location."),
("2016-12-05", "12740176", "Jaron", "Great place. Perfect for families or adult groups for that matter. Great location. Across road from beach  cafe next door. Great host. Couldn't be more helpful. "),
("2017-01-06", "12740176", "Terry", "Hi Marissa and Damien  thanks so much for the wonderful stay.  Your home was spacious and the times we had 12 people there - it never felt crowded.  The kitchen was well equipped and swimming pool  / trampoline kept the kids entertained.The house was perfect  - we had family from Brisbane and Darwin for a very special and rare Christmas and New Year.The location was perfect  nice and close to beach  an easy walk to movies and local shopping centre.PS: The ocean views from balcony are stunning  and there is nothing better than lying in bed listening to the sounds of the ocean.Once again - thanks so much - Julie and Terry "),
("2018-01-02", "12740176", "Eileen", "Marissa's place is lovely. I was delighted to discover that there is a sea view from the main bedroom balcony and a great coffee shop and restaurants across the road. There is lots of space and great for a big family. It is walking distance to the beach. I would recommend this house highly."),
("2016-05-13", "12655535", "Neda", "Sabrinas place was very spacious  located conveniently and mostly well equipped. It was perfect for exploring the city since it's connected well to public transport and you could also take a walk into the cbd. The only downside is the missing Wifi (which I was unaware when booking) but I guess this will be fixed soon since they just recently renovated the apartment. The apartment was very clean (only the windows and mirrors not 100%- not so important) Communication with Sabrina was easy and pleasant. Would recommend to stay here  especially a larger group of people or a family! "),
("2016-05-18", "12655535", "Nicola", "Lovely accommodation and great location."),
("2016-05-26", "12655535", "Kevin", "Location was convenient to CBD (short cab ride about $10 or nice walk across Darling Harbor Bridge 15 min walk if you stop to watch people and the sites).  Several restaurants are close by along with a larger Coles grocery market and liquor store right across the way.Great communication from Sabrina about the location  features and checking in.  Sabrina reached out several times during the stay to confirm our stay was meeting our expectations.Apartment was very comfortable  well appointed and supplied."),
("2016-05-29", "12655535", "Liam", "I stayed at Sabrina's house with my girlfriend  sister and brother-in-law. Her apartment was spacious  modern and in a great location! Would highly recommend to anybody. "),
("2016-06-06", "12655535", "Lawrence", "Stayed at Sabrina's place for almost a week.  As I need to checked in early due to young kids  Sabrina was helpful in granting early check-in :) The place was neat and clean upon check-in. Initially there was only one heater and request to have extra heaters were met on the same day. Sabrina bought two new heaters and I am very thankful for that.  Another good thing that happened was the new wifi installed ;) Location wise is very good. Minutes walk to Darling Harbour and the Central Station Light Rail. Bus 389 is round the corner to take you to the Sydney CBD which is only one stop away. Generally we enjoyed Sabrina's place and will go back again. "),
("2016-06-18", "12655535", "Terry", "Fantastic apartment with a great location  a very helpful host  and everything was provided. Thoroughly enjoyed our stay!"),
("2016-08-13", "12655535", "Maria Jimena", "El apartamento es hermoso  es muy cómodo y amplio  tiene una decoración muy moderna. La ubicación es excelente  cercana a todos los puntos de interés de Sydney. Sabrina fue muy atenta y amable  y siempre estaba dispuesta a ayudarnos y brindarnos información para que nuestra estadía fuera inolvidable. Definitivamente volveríamos a alojarnos en este apartamento. "),
("2016-08-24", "12655535", "Samuel", "Great host  offered us with late check out  and late check in 1000pm  very professional  easy going and flexible  great location  10mins to 20 mins walking distance to fish market  darling harbour  China town  with free parking onsite. Highly recommend and will be returned for our next trip to Sydney. "),
("2016-09-05", "12655535", "David", "Sabrina was responsive to our questions and very helpful when we met; tea  coffee and milk had been made available on our arrival which was a really nice touchWe arrived by car and they have a private parking bay underneath the apartments which was invaluable and made things so easy This is a great location and the description of the apartment and amenities are very accurate and of high quality and we could not fault anythingWhen next in Sydney I will look to see if this apartment is available as a first choice"),
("2016-09-14", "12655535", "Lyn", "Location of apartment was fantastic. Walking distance to The Star  Fish Market and Darling Harbour. The apartment was also very organised and clean. Loved that there was ample sunlight that passed through the apartment. Parking space was a little tight. Recommend to get a smaller car if you intend to rent one. There are certain things to take note  response from host was not very prompt. Asked for late check out several times and only managed to receive a reply after 3 texts and emails. Parking garage was renovating the day I arrived but was not informed earlier and had to pay for parking several hours. Overall  a good experience."),
("2016-10-01", "12655535", "Shelley", "Very welcome"),
("2016-10-05", "12655535", "Alicia", "Good location."),
("2016-10-16", "12655535", "Cyra", "So close to harbor & city great place to stay!"),
("2016-10-20", "12655535", "Romel", "The apartment is in the middle of everything in Sydney  full of dining and shopping options  close to transportation and excursion stops. We have small children and they very much enjoyed the area  as well as the apartment itself. The apartment is very clean  pleasant  and amenities for travellars are all ready to be used. Sabrina answered all of our questions promptly. Thanks so much!"),
("2016-10-22", "12655535", "Adrian", "Great  spacious and clean apartment in an awesome location. My only suggestion would be two sets of keys  as myself and my colleague with whom I was staying had different dinner plans and had to coordinate to meet up in the city somewhere so we could return home at the same time. Would stay again  thanks."),
("2016-10-30", "12655535", "Olivier", "Excellent welcoming with clear instructions to secure a soft landing in a very clean apartment in a great location. All comfort and convenience  we did not lack of anything related to kitchen  bathrooms  laundry  ... as well as wifi  board games  ""connected"" TV ready for enjoyable moments spent inside."),
("2016-11-04", "12655535", "Elizabeth", "This apartment is run (and owned?) by a management company. It clearly isn't actually anyone's home and has the clinical  impersonal feel of a hotel. But it's well equipped for a stay in the centre of Sydney and the location is very convenient for Darling Harbour. I never met the named host; I was 'checked in' (their words) by someone else who was clearly in a tearing hurry. Beforehand I was just told I would be met  I didn't know where this would be but I couldn't get into the building and had to wait outside in the street. There is no hairdryer or air conditioning (this will make it v hot in the height of summer) and the oven is complicated to work. The design of the building means the apartment overlooks and is overlooked by other apartments and there was some noise at night from neighbours as the units are close together. There is also traffic noise. We were only given one set of keys which was extremely inconvenient. On the plus side the apartment building has a small pool and gym."),
("2016-11-08", "12655535", "Giorgio", "Accoglienza buona.posizione ottima. Apt. Gradevolissimo"),
("2016-11-10", "12655535", "Carmen", "Very professional Airbnb host. Recommend!"),
("2016-11-17", "12655535", "Brad", "Sabrina was a great hostEverything went well  apartment is very nice."),
("2016-11-20", "12655535", "Lilah", "Lovely apartment  very central to everything  a great place to stay for a weekend away!"),
("2016-11-23", "12655535", "CaseWare", "All was good  maybe a fan for hot days would have been nice  otherwise very comfy apartment in a good location."),
("2016-11-27", "12655535", "Helen", "Lovely clean spacious home close to Darling Harbour.  Great spot to explore the city from - thank you Sabrina"),
("2016-11-30", "12655535", "Andrew", "Great location to be in Darling Harbor. Very modern and exceptionally clean."),
("2016-12-12", "12655535", "Tan", "Very friendly and helpful."),
("2016-12-28", "12655535", "Richard", "Very good location and walking distance to CBD. parking space was a big plus for us"),
("2017-01-17", "12655535", "Grant", "Central location close to Star City.  Tidy and spacious apartment."),
("2017-02-05", "12655535", "Gabi", "This is a lovely place to stay. It's a very quick walk to darling harbour  either walk up the hill and across  or through the parking structure down the road and cross at the tram crossing and it takes about two or three minutes!It was very comfortable  two full bathrooms  a full kitchen two bedrooms  could comfortably fit four people. Great area  close to grocery stores  restaurants  pubs  public transport!"),
("2017-03-01", "12655535", "Averil", "This is a lovely apartment in a great area... lots of cute cafes & a great playground  (Pirrama Park) within 10 minutes walk.  Top recommendation is to get the ferry from Darling Harbour to Manly & you get to see the Opera House & Bridge from the water as well as a great day out!Made Comfy - the company that manage this apartment - sorted the Internet within 24hrs when it went down. There is a major issue with this lovely apartment though!  The keys... 1 set provided with fob to enter lobby AND use lift. I didn't think having just one set would be an issue... but  for example  when my husband took our daughter to the swimming pool on the ground floor - I couldn't pop to the shops with the baby because they would need the fob to use the lift & I would need it to re-enter the building = trapped & logistics had to be discussed each time we wanted to do something separately.  We also had to pick the keys up from a random letter box several km away as we were arriving late (7.30pm).  Luckily we were hiring a car - not on public transport - so navigated our way around a strange city to 2 addresses... didn't realise this was the situation when I booked. I hope that they sort the key situation- they clearly listen to feedback as one of the reviews mentioned needing a fan and there are now 3 in the apartment which was brilliant! "),
("2017-03-12", "12655535", "Pietra", "I booked this place for my parents  aunty and uncle. They had a great time and loved the accommodation! They were even accommodated with early check-in to suit their flight arrival time. Thanks Sabrina! "),
("2017-03-15", "12655535", "Niccolo", "Nice apartment in a good location  easy to go around central Sydney from here. Recommended!     "),
("2017-03-20", "12655535", "Tanya", "So delightful to communicate with. Even had some laughs. The place is awesome. Up to date & contemporary with plenty of room to just relax. It's so close to everything."),
("2017-03-26", "12655535", "Allan", "Excellent experience.Overall room was very clean  comfy and spacious.It was an ideal location as we were working at the new Convention & Exhibition Centre in Darling HarbourWe will be back for sure!"),
("2017-03-30", "12655535", "Martin", "Friendly team  great communication. Clean comfortable unit. Very noisy neighbours unfortunately. "),
("2017-04-18", "12655535", "Kanishk", "Nice place  very comfortable and located just off darling harbour. Place was just as described."),
("2017-04-23", "12655535", "Nicolas", "We enjoyed our stay .We wish we had more time to enjoy the pool.Our request for a late checkout was accommodated.Sarah was very helpful."),
("2017-05-02", "12655535", "Natalie", "Lovely accomodation  spacious and comfortable and walking distance to everything. We were very happy and would love to stay here again next year!"),
("2017-05-24", "12655535", "Julie", "Sabrina was prompt in responding which was a saviour to me being stranded in another place which was not cleaned. Simona who checked us in was also friendly and helpful. The location was perfect. Walking distance to Coles  Casino and main attractions at the harbour. This saved us alot of parking fee. The unit was has all we needed and definitely clean. Theres wifi and also designated parking. Im not sure why i missed booking for this place in the beginning but thank goodness I managed to switch to this. Dont think further if you wanna book an accomodation in Sydney! Lastly  thanks Sabrina!"),
("2017-07-05", "12655535", "Annette", "Great locain  comfortable  great faililties & easy communication.  We had a great break here for 4 days  family of 4 & I would recommend this apartment"),
("2017-07-09", "12655535", "Janelle", "A brilliant  quiet  central location; absolutely perfect. Would definitely stay at your apartment again! Thank you so much."),
("2017-07-27", "12655535", "Julie", "Beautiful place  full of amenities like Brand New mini body wash  shampoo  lotion etc. There were also board games and the place was extremely clean and a fantastic place to unwind. Check in was smooth and have absolutely no complaints! "),
("2017-08-12", "12655535", "Willie", "Sabrina's place was quite clean  spacious  and well-equipped. We had a nice stay there!"),
("2017-09-24", "12655535", "Jane", "A lovely unit in a very convenient spot. Easy walk to Darling Harbour and walking bridge to city. Pyrmont ferry terminal close 10 minute walk - 5 stops to Circular Quay with great views of Harbour Bridge  Opera House and other sights as you travel. Coles 300 m away so easy to pick up groceries on way back from ferry. One stop to Balmain on ferry then catch 442 bus up to trendy shops and cafes. Catch 389 bus around corner into city or onto Bondi. Just be aware that all bathrooms in the building are being replaced so there may be some banging noise during the day depending on what level they are working on. Not overly loud at this stage. Clear  quick communication with those managing unit. Would recommend staying here."),
("2017-09-30", "12655535", "Abhishek", "Lovely appartment  very close to Darling harbour (walkable-5 mins). Appartment is well equipped and spacious. Appartment building is not that well kept  however once you are in the appartment you won't feel that."),
("2017-10-02", "12655535", "Rob", "Sabrina's place is well located  for Darling Harbour functions. The beds are comfy and the apartment is well represented in the photos. There is a fair amount of construction going on in the building so check with Sabrina first. It was great to have a garage but be aware that only a small car will fit. Our CX5 was quite a struggle to fit in. Overall a good place to stay in the city."),
("2017-10-27", "12655535", "Paul", "Very clean and central to everything ."),
("2017-11-03", "12655535", "Janet", "Awesome location!!  Everything you need and more!!  Great communication from Sabrina and nice that we were met at the door. Would definitely stay again if I returned."),
("2017-11-24", "12655535", "Alan", "Nice clean apartment. Perfect location  easy check-in."),
("2017-12-15", "12655535", "Ella", "Clean and well positioned. Note that the whole building is currently undergoing construction  so as well as the noise (as mentioned in the listing) the halls and elevator are a worksite. The pool and sauna facilities are lovely though. I’m not sure I would stay here again for the price (& the cleaning fee $200+). There is nothing wrong with the apartment itself  however my experience overall was a little underwhelming. "),
("2017-12-20", "12655535", "Daniel", "The property is just like the description. Location is quite convenient for darling harbor and the rest of Sydney  several places to eat within a 5 minute walk. The space was clean. Staff was very accommodating to meet our requests for an early check in."),
("2017-12-27", "12655535", "Anna", "Lägenheten har ett bra läge i ett mysigt område. Det saknas luftkonditionering så det blev varmt på nätterna."),
("2018-01-08", "12655535", "Phearnouk", "Ideal location  walking distance to most main attractions  very friendly neighbourhood and a beautiful and comfortable home."),
("2018-01-28", "12655535", "Ivan", "Great location  slightly old carpets and walls... No aircon is the main disadvantage considering the humid climate."),
("2018-05-14", "12655535", "Luc", "Very well located.Nice and perfectly equippedI highly recommend"),
("2018-06-12", "12655535", "Briannan", "Great location! Close walk to darling harbour! 15 min walk to town hall station! Cute apartment with everything you need!Car park is tiny though  so will only fit a small car. "),
("2018-06-18", "12655535", "Betsy", "This apartment was lovely. The building itself looks a bit run down but the actual apartment was great! The bathrooms looked brand new and the apartment was spotless and roomy. In addition check in was very easy and smooth. We had a great time there and would definitely recommend anyone to stay there!"),
("2018-06-27", "12655535", "Kathryn", "Great location  great staff and service."),
("2018-07-02", "12655535", "Geoffrey", "Good location  it is on the quieter side of Pyrmont. Still walking distance to the fish market  Darling Harbour and even CBD. The unit is as pictured. Impressed with the newly renovated bathrooms - nice!! Consequently the other rooms are noticeably older - carpet  walls. Easy check-in / check-out process  communication was quick and a breeze. They even allowed us to check-in early which was super helpful. The building is a bit dated  building hallways have some smell although it has some constructions (and we were given a heads up on this). Like others mentioned the parking space is a bit tight but we were able to park Mitsubishi Outlander fine. The unit was clean and overall it was a great stay."),
("2018-07-18", "12655535", "Mimi", "Great location! Host was easy to contact. We had trouble using the stove but host arranged for immediate repairs."),
("2018-08-02", "12655535", "Bronwyn", "Sabina's place offers a great location for Darling Harbour and other Sydney attractions. The place inself is very well equipped with everything you could need. Great for both couples  and families. We thoughly enjoyed  our stay and service Sabrina supplied. "),
("2018-09-29", "12655535", "Lisa", "Great apartment. So close to the city yet in a quiet neighbourhood to get away from the hustle and bustle. And an amazing dinner venue Olvolo 1888 just around the corner. Recommend and will be staying again."),
("2018-11-11", "12655535", "Kamie", "Sabrina's apartment is really well appointed and had many thoughtful touches  like the coffee machine. The provided carpark is really low  don't try and fit a larger car or 4wd in there. Regardless  Sabrina's hospitality was great and the place was clean and welcoming."),
("2018-12-29", "12655535", "Blake", "This place was good value. Great location for walking around downtown Sydney."),
("2018-12-31", "12655535", "Cindy", "Really great place   very spacious   everything was great   if they can put aircon gonna be perfect.. lol"),
("2019-01-09", "12655535", "Emma", "We had a great time. The location is great and check in was very easy. We will definitely stay again if in the area."),
("2019-02-03", "12655535", "Laura", "The space is good."),
("2013-08-19", "1310308", "Anna", "Loved it! Clean  great location and quiet. Great apartment  everything there you need. Mags easy to contact if needed and quick to respond. Highly recommended."),
("2013-10-17", "1310308", "Laura", "We had a lovely 4 day  here. Great apartment  clean and with everything you could need  and in a beautiful part of Sydney. Mags was very patient with my endless emails and very easy to get in touch with.We will certainly be recommending this place to friends.Laura and Tim"),
("2014-01-07", "1310308", "Daphne", "My husband and I stayed at mags chic Mosman apartment to break our journey from London to our home up north. We know the area all and love this idyllic Mosman street which is quiet but close to great cafes  shops and the beach. We loved the clean simple furniture and Mags was so easy to deal with.This is my first airbnb experience as a guest though I have hosted many times and we really enjoyed it.Hope to stay at Mags lovely apartment again sometime  totally recommend it."),
("2014-01-28", "1310308", "Tamara", "Mavis's apartment was charming  super clean and comfortable  and in a simply lovely residential part of Mosman with a five-minute walk to shops. The kitchen was well equipped  and public transport was 10 minutes away. We greatly enjoyed our stay and would gladly go back!"),
("2014-02-16", "1310308", "Benjamin", "We enjoyed staying at this apartment very much.  My wife and I especially loved the location - great Sydney Ferries access and lovely neighborhood.  The apartment was charming  very clean  and well equipped.  Big thanks to Mags  for making us feel so welcome!"),
("2014-02-22", "1310308", "Tegan", "Thank you for sharing your beautifully appointment apartment with us Mags. Loved the claw bath and ornate ceilings! The location was perfect and the apartment and had everything we could possibly need. We'd love to stay again next time we are in Sydney."),
("2014-03-31", "1310308", "Hanna", "Mags' Mosman apartment was lovely and had everything we needed. It was comfortable and cosy and quiet from city noise. It was within walking distance to a few little shops and takeaways."),
("2014-04-14", "1310308", "Julie", "A very easy  no-fuss booking experience. We used the accommodation for two nights as we had a wedding in the area. The location was perfect for us  and within easy walking to shops. The accommodation was great  and we would definitely use it again if we wanted to stay in the same area. We had our toddler with us (we took our own cot)  and it was great to have a park and play equipment nearby. There was no microwave which would have been handy  but the kitchen is well-equiped to manage without it."),
("2014-04-29", "1310308", "Jillian & Jesse", "We're local to the area and were looking for somewhere for our visiting in-laws to stay (as our place is just to tiny to fit everyone).We booked Mags' place and liked it so much we booked again a few weeks later.Mags was terrific to deal with. Great communication. Very accommodating. An altogether terrific host. We'll definitely be booking again for their next visit and would highly recommend Mags' place to anyone else.Thanks again MagsJillian & Jesse."),
("2014-07-03", "1310308", "Sally", "Really lovely apartment in quiet block  great federation bathroom and renovated kitchen. Super clean and well equipped  in a nice leafy neighbourhood close to shops and water.Host is friendly and very fast to respond. Overall a very good experience  highly recommend."),
("2014-07-14", "1310308", "Helen", "Mag's single bedroom apartment was located in a lovely quiet street in Mosman  not far from Military Road.  Everything in the flat worked well. It was very easy to access  being right at the front of the block. We had a car and thought we might have trouble finding a park in the street  but this proved not to be too difficult either night we were there.Thanks for your hospitality Mags."),
("2014-07-18", "1310308", "Anne-Marie", "Mags was very efficient in her communications and made accessing the apartment smooth and easy. Location is lovely and quiet  close to shops and restaurants  as well as scenic strolls around Sirius Cove. Apartment is nicely decorated and has everything you need. Bed is especially comfy. Just one note of caution - it can be quite cold on overcast winter days  as there is only one small heater in lounge room. Otherwise  we really enjoyed our stay."),
("2014-07-28", "1310308", "Chris", "Mags's apartment was spacious  tidy  and beautifully presented. Everything you need is there. Check-in & check-out & dealing with Mags was easy.Location is perfect. The street is lovely & great for walking around. Breakfast place & shops just around the corner. Balmoral beach is a 30min. walk. I would stay here again & would highly recommend it to anyone."),
("2014-08-24", "1310308", "Dana", "What a fabulous little apartment in Mosman! We were down for a wedding and catch ups with friends and Mags' place was perfect.  Check in and check out was simple.  A bus stop  shops and cafes were a very short walk away and the apartment itself had everything you needed. Someone else mentioned that it was a bit cold with only a lounge room heater but there was actually an extra mobile heater when we stayed so we used it to warm up the room before bed and we felt really cosy.I would definitely recommend this apartment to family and friends and I wouldn't hesitate in considering staying there again for another Sydney trip!"),
("2014-09-07", "1310308", "Andrew", "We had a lovely stay in Mags' Mosman apartment. It was exactly as the photos depict and absolutely spotless. The local area is residential with lots of lovely shops and cafés up on Military road. Balmoral beach was a 20 min walk away and circular quay a short ferry ride from south Mosman (the main Mosman ferry wharf was under re construction in September 2014 so was closed). Thanks Mags."),
("2014-10-07", "1310308", "Kristen", "We would like to thank Mags for her hospitality.   The apartment was  in a lovely neighborhood not far from Military Road.  It was a about a 10-15 minute walk to Spit Junction where you can catch a bus  into the city.  We will refer others who visit Mosman and hope if/when we are able to return Mags' place will be available."),
("2014-11-03", "1310308", "Ruth", "The Apartment is in a great location  close to shops  and eateries. If you don't mind a downhill walk it is also very handy to the Ferry from Mosman. A small  comfortable apartment to stay in and well appointed. ( no microwave if that bothers you) . We loved our stay and it suited our needs perfectly. It was easy to organize with Mags."),
("2014-11-28", "1310308", "Thomas", "Cute apartment in a great neighborhood.  It has all the essentials  minus wifi.  A good bet for your money."),
("2014-11-30", "1310308", "Vicki", "We had a wonderful visit to Mosman and the apartment was lovely. It was neat and tidy and the price was excellent.The neighbourhood is so nice with all the trees and was also very quiet.Parking was a bit of a nightmare but we expected that. The ease of booking and the communication with our host was seamless and everything was as described. We would definitely recommend this type of booking  area and our host. "),
("2014-12-17", "1310308", "Hannah", "Great apartment!! Really good location and had all the amenities you need for a short stay! Mags was great to deal with and quick to respond"),
("2015-01-05", "1310308", "Andrea", "The apartment is very well located and the kitchen has everything from dishwasher to washingmachine. Mags provided us with the basics we needed for breakfast. OK for a short stay."),
("2015-02-05", "1310308", "Nicole", "Charming apartment a 20-minute ferry ride away from Central Quay. Okay for a short stay."),
("2015-02-15", "1310308", "Tom", "This apartment was very nice to stay in. The pictures are all very accurate. The location of the apartment is very convenient being around a 10 minute walk away from multiple shops. I recommend this apartment to anyone wishing to stay in the Mosman area."),
("2015-02-28", "1310308", "Joan", "Didn't see/meet the host. A clean flat with well equipped kitchen in a very quiet/safe feeling neighbourhood. We could walk to the bus  the ferry  shops and cafes. Good shower  comfy bed."),
("2015-03-09", "1310308", "Emma", "The apartment was wonderful and just what we needed for two people. It was super clean and conveniently located near local cafes  convenience stores and a newsagent. It's a bit of a hike uphill to the shops but well worth it and the ferry terminal is just at the bottom of the street. Can't wait to come back again!"),
("2015-03-20", "1310308", "Barbara", "Mags was friendly and communicative in her Emails but we had no personal contact. In fact  we had become used to some personal touches from our airbnb hosts and this was somehow lacking.After a few days we grew more used to the apartment and could appreciate the  functional new kitchen and bathroom. Even though the photos do show the apartment correctly  the actual feel of the place was very different to what we had imagined.In our opinion a few improvements would make a lot of difference.Stepping in and out of the bath for the shower could be a problem for someone with limited mobility.Mosman is a fantastic area to be in  beautiful tree lined streets with wonderful houses  shops and restaurants and the apartment is situated well for transport once you work out the bus and ferry connections. "),
("2015-05-10", "1310308", "Sarah", "The unit was very easy to find in a lovely part of Mosman. Mags gave great instructions  always got back to us very quickly answering any questions that we had. Her place was true to the photos  it was very cute  clean and tidy and felt quite secluded. It was exactly what we were after and everything we needed was provided. We were in Mosman attending a  wedding at Gunners Barracks  so we were very close to the venue. The unit is walking distance from lovely cafes on Avenue Road and we had a fantastic meal at Radio Cairo in Cremorne. The ferry is also walking distance but it is a bit of a hike up the hill  but great views on the way! All in all a very positive experience and very good value for money for accommodation in Sydney! "),
("2015-05-19", "1310308", "Mark", "We had a lovely 3 day stay at Mag's apartment in Mosman. The apartment was very clean  well appointed and spacious and provided for all our needs. The bed was warm and comfortable and the kitchen well stocked. This apartment is in a lovely area with leafy streets  shops close by and easy access to ferries and buses. We will definitely be back."),
("2015-05-25", "1310308", "Rowan", "The Art Deco  newly renovated apartment was meticulously clean  with new kitchen and bathroom. Comfortable airy bedroom  with french doors onto a front patio/balcony. We had a minor hiccup with not receiving the combination code for the door key  because the text message was truncated  but Mags was very gracious and patiently waited on the phone until we were able to access the key. All of this despite the late hour of our phone call! The apartment is in leafy  quiet Mosman  within easy walking distance of all the coffee shops & boutiques. Parking was on the street and we were able to get a park each night. It's a very short drive to Mosman wharf  to catch the ferry into the city.We had a very pleasant stay and would recommend Mags' apartment as a comfortable home base for a short Sydney stopover. "),
("2015-05-31", "1310308", "Vicki", "What a wonderful place to stay! This was our second visit to Mag's apartment and it felt like coming home. Mag is a wonderful host and with everything on hand to make our stay more enjoyable. The process of booking and dealing with our host was very easy and Mags was most accommodating  as usual. The area is close to shops and cafés  which we loved. We will defiantly return. "),
("2015-07-08", "1310308", "Glen", "The place was exactly what we were after - a bit of space and all the amenities of home. The apartment was also extremely clean  beautifully presented with lots of character and was well stocked with the basics.The location is perfect - A short walk to military rd (fantastic cafes and shops)  public transport (buses and ferry) and Balmoral (my favourite place on earth).Whilst we had limited contact with our host  Mags  she was very accommodating of us (travelling with an infant)  proactive in contacting us a few time ahead of arrival to make sure we had the information we needed  and knowledgeable of the local area. In summary  we had a great time  loved the place and would definitely stay there again."),
("2015-09-21", "1310308", "Emma", "Mags was prompt in communications and she was very flexible to check in and out times which we really appreciated.The apartment is exactly as seen in the photos and had all the basics that we needed for a short stay in Mosman  it was clean  had a comfy bed and good shower. (though we did notice hot water seemed to run out quickly)We didn't actually meet Mags and we missed the personal touch you often get when staying in airbnb accomodation. "),
("2015-11-11", "1310308", "Matt", "The description was accurate and lovely location. We would definitely use this location and appartment again."),
("2015-11-15", "1310308", "Jill", "Hi Mags!! Had a great stay at your Mosman apartment. Definitely would recommend to others. If their was something that I would ask for improvement; it would be to have better towels. One had bleach marks on them and the other was to have a full length mirror. Thank you so much for your cafe/ restaurant recommendations. The family loved the boathouse in balmoral. Once again  thank you. "),
("2015-12-01", "1310308", "Kiah", "I did not Meet Mags in person but she was quick to return to me when I had queries and pleasant to deal with. The unit is basic but has everything you need for a short stay and was very tidy and clean."),
("2015-12-06", "1310308", "Sharon", "Such a gorgeous apartment  Mags made the whole stay hassle free and very straight forward. Mosman is lovely  we stayed there for a wedding just down the road at Seargents Mess  Chowder Bay. An easy walk to the shops and restaurants of Mosman  quiet street. The apartment is immaculate  just lovely  thank you Mags."),
("2015-12-12", "1310308", "Kim", "Lovely apartment beautifully kept and modestly decorated.  Location of mosman very pretty with all amenities close by.  Lovely ferry ride to get to Sydney main area - would certainly return to this address if in mosman again."),
("2016-01-03", "1310308", "Caroline", "Although the pictures of the apartment were fairly accurate  we were unfortunately disappointed with the apartment. The apartment is in an old building and has been fully refurbished  but the net effect is that the rooms are small and dark with large gaps under all the doors. Also there was no wifi  which we were not aware of when we booked  and was disappointing - I think this should be standard for all rentals. The apartment was clean - but we did find old food in the fridge and freezer.Good location - easy walk to shops and ferry."),
("2016-01-13", "1310308", "Jason", "Mag's accomodation is a beautiful art deco apartment  in a quiet  beautiful location within minutes of the ferry which is a 20 min cruise into the city.  Mags was extremely courteous and helpful in answering any queries or issues that we encountered  and everything was dealt with in a concerned and expedient manner  including one unexpected issue that was quickly resolved ( thanks Mags and James :) The flat was well fitted out and we would love to visit again. One of the nicest places we have visited in Sydney. Thanks again Mags!!"),
("2016-01-26", "1310308", "Ian", "Great communication by host and the place was as described in the listing."),
("2016-03-20", "1310308", "Eve", "We loved our stay here.  The flat is very comfortable and the location  perfect.  The web photos don't do it justice.  The street itself is extremely quiet yet within a short walking distance to shops  restaurants and good public transport.  We also found the place had an ideal weather aspect and always attracted a nice breeze.  Mags was a very efficient host from start to finish.  We were sorry to leave and look forward to a return visit."),
("2016-05-01", "1310308", "Lynn", "Communication with Mags was excellent from the start. When the washing machine was in need of repair prior to our arrival  she let us know  suggested an alternative  and left a change of linens. The apartment was ready for us and was as described. It was simply furnished  but had everything we needed. We did not use the kitchen  so I can't really speak to that  but we enjoyed the deep claw foot tub  abundant hot water  and a good shower. The key lock box  system was efficient and convenient. We enjoyed the quiet  tree-lined street and the short walk to coffee shops  food  and pharmacy. There is no wi-fi and cell connection was spotty.  Overall  the apartment was a good choice for us."),
("2016-10-15", "1310308", "Lucy", "The host canceled this reservation 5 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-11-04", "1310308", "Grant", "Nice tidy apartment in a great area."),
("2016-11-10", "1310308", "Caroline", "The apartment was lovely  comfortable and quiet. 5 min walk to Mosman village where all the shops/cafes/restaurants are. Beautiful Balmoral is only a 15-20 min walk (5 min drive) and the Sydney CBD is easily accessible by ferry or bus. Communications with Mags was really easy. "),
("2016-11-17", "1310308", "John", "Great spot to stay and suited us down to the ground. Host was spot on with communication and offering."),
("2017-01-03", "1310308", "Carry", "Het appartement ligt in een rustige straat en op loopafstand van zee en ferry naar the city Sydney. De voorzieningen zijn basic  geen extra comfort. Geen wifi. Het appartement is donkerder dan foto's suggereren. Prijs / kwaliteit verhouding niet in evenwicht. "),
("2017-01-13", "1310308", "Jody", "My husband and I stayed here for 3 nights for a kid free getaway! We loved the Stylish little apartment in a charming old block in Mosman. Beautiful balmoral beach is. 20 minute walk away - it's a good walk (not one you'd want to do with kids though) Balmoral is a stunning place to relax and swim! The apartment is a 5 minute walk to some great local food options and shops. Lovely quiet area but so close to everything makes is a perfect option!"),
("2017-03-18", "1310308", "Alan", "We have stayed in this apartment on 3 separate occasions  covering a period of nearly four months in total.  Why? It is a spacious airy apartment  ideal for two people  well equipped and nicely furnished  and the landlord has been a joy to deal with on each occasion. The residents of the other apartments have always been friendly and welcoming which is a plus.	The raison detrê of this apartment however is its location. Local buses and shops are a 5 min stroll  with the main shopping centre of Mosman a short bus ride or 20 min walk. Mosman has all one can want in terms of shopping  two small supermarkets  and delightful local shops where we have always found friendly and excellent service  unlike the UK. The library is ideal for wi fi should you need it. In addition there is a local free bus (2 min away) which will take you shopping  to Balmoral beach and Taronga Zoo.  The Ferry stop to the City is but a 15 min walk or 2 min bus ride.We cannot recommend this apartment highly enough  for either a short or long stays. We will continue to return here as long as we are able  as it now become home from home. "),
("2017-04-02", "1310308", "Corrie", "This apartment is a gorgeous space and in a great location. It was also super quiet and near to the ferry which makes it a great trip into the city. Would stay here again."),
("2017-06-24", "1310308", "Corrie", "Very cute one bedder and wonderfully close to Mosman Ferry for a glorious trip into the city."),
("2017-12-18", "1310308", "Ingrid", "Mags' Mosman home is absolutely gorgeous. As a family of three is had everything we could possibly need. We were very comfortable and really settled in for a few months. This place is really more equipped for shortterm stays however.The big  soaking tub was really lovely and the leafy  breezy outlet was beautiful. The proximity to the local shops  park and waterfront at Mosman Bay made life really easy. The ferry wharves nearby were easy to walk to and connections very frequent for Sydney. The bus was harder to get- but by no means impossible.Balmoral beach is very close and we spent lots of time there. The bus stop to get the bus to the beach is a fair walk away- but worth it to avoid the nightmare parking situation in summer! Mind you- the drive isn't far at all  so if you get lucky that is the easiest option.The walk down to Sirius Cove dog beach is lovely and the swimming there is not bad either. You can continue your walk along the headline all the way around to Athol Bay for even better swimming or Taronga Zoo entry.We only had trouble finding a street parking spot maybe twice in almost three months- so that was pretty manageable I'd say.The Orpheum Theatre is delightful and the shopping on Military Road east was great.Beware there is no wifi  microwave or toaster! It's a bit like taking a step back in time. But we loved it all the same."),
("2017-12-29", "1310308", "Lisa", "The host canceled this reservation 27 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-01-01", "1310308", "Bob", "Great little spot"),
("2018-03-12", "1310308", "Heather", "Clean apartment in a quiet street"),
("2018-03-18", "1310308", "Kathryn", "Very clean house on leafy quiet street  a few minutes walk from many shops and restaurants"),
("2018-04-01", "1310308", "Jody", "Great location. Peaceful  perfect for relaxing. Great cafe's and coffee close by. Would definitely return."),
("2018-05-16", "1310308", "Corrie", "Gorgeous Art Deco apartment close to shops and ferry ⛴"),
("2018-05-20", "1310308", "Birgit", "Great location and well set up. Thanks."),
("2018-06-29", "1310308", "Gaby", "Fantastic stay. Great apartment and spot. Look forward to coming back."),
("2018-08-24", "1310308", "Jaks", "This is the perfect little apartment to base yourself if you’d like to explore the local area or have commitments in the city requiring an overnight stay or two. This gorgeous place has character & charm with a warm and welcoming feel. It’s in a very peaceful and beautiful location. The claw foot bath is a welcome feature for those who like to relax in a deep hot bath listening to the birds. Mags the host was friendly  professional and very responsive in all communications. Thank you Mags "),
("2018-11-10", "1310308", "Jane", "A perfect space to relax and get some work done! The lounge and bed were so comfy and the apartment is cosy and welcoming."),
("2018-11-13", "1310308", "Waqas", "the host had great communication mthe location was very well placed. checking in and checking out were easy.  the place was clean everything was very nice. I would recommend this place."),
("2018-11-23", "1310308", "Alex", "Great apartment with everything you need in a lovely leafy suburb."),
("2018-12-02", "1310308", "Justine", "Mags' place is a comfortable  well situated home away from home  in the leafy and peaceful surrounds of Sydney's lower north shore. It was a really nice place to stay."),
("2019-01-03", "1310308", "Alun", "Good location for Mosman  shops and for ferries to circular quay.Flat a bit dark but well equipped. It suited us well. Communication with host good. Will book again."),
("2019-01-13", "1310308", "Helen", "The apartment was in a lovely quiet street and well set up for a couple. There was easy access to local shops and habour walks. Mags was easy to communicate with and very accommodating."),
("2016-09-19", "13193079", "Megan", "I was thoroughly disappointed in this apartment  on arrival we were told we had been moved to a different room. The Room we received had no view  no oven  no dryer  the bathroom was disgusting and had to be cleaned by us on arrival.The walls were covered in marks  we paid for a queen bed  sofa bed and a single bed  however we recieved a double and two singles. The Room key didn't even have the correct room number on it  the fridge had milk stains and none of the cutlery matched..The wine in the room was a nice touch and it was in a great location.."),
("2016-10-01", "13193079", "Daniel", "as listed  thankyou"),
("2017-02-28", "13193079", "Tess", "Do not stay here.  EVER. The ""host"" is rude and invades on your privacy as and when she pleases.  The ""home"" is an ex-hotel room and is one of 40 apartments she owns that have never been lived in. Its dirty  almost everything is broken  the air-conditioning unit leaks  its loud as hell  it cuts out and it looks like it could fall off the ceiling at any point in time.  This place is a cheap and nasty room used to circumnavigate the standards set by normal accommodations.  Still waiting for Airbnb to fix this problem  have been waiting for them to respond for a month!STEER CLEAR"),
("2019-01-02", "13193079", "Jimmy", "Amazing stay and the place is close with a beautiful park. Easy to find foods nearby"),
("2013-09-19", "1321603", "Jude", "My overall experience on Dangar Island was wonderful. Ann created a sense of being cared for  in a relaxed environment. Ann is a wonderful and interesting host with great historical knowledge of the local area. Meal time was fun; some of the food picked from the garden  the rest fresh  delicious and made to suit my individual requirements. Eating breakfast overlooking a pretty garden and watching the river made a pleasurable start to each day. My bed was comfortable and as promised by my host  big soft towels to use in the shared bathroom. The house itself is as interesting as its gracious host and well worth the short ferry ride to visit and stay in for a night or two. Most enjoyable!"),
("2014-01-02", "1321603", "Michael And Minji", "We had a wonderful time staying with Ann at her amazing  historic and endlessly fascinating house. She even cooked Korean food for Minji  making her own version of KimChi! Her attention to detail and desire to ensure her guests have a great time makes Ann the consummate host. We thoroughly recommend a visit to this hidden treasure only 55min north of Sydney."),
("2014-03-31", "1321603", "Fanou", "Upon disembarking the adorable wooden ferry on Dangar Island  the charm of the island operates… boat shacks and pontoons line the shore  houses hide away among the luxuriant greenery… We are met by wonderful Ann at the cafe  and while she takes us to the house telling us all about the island  we already feel looked after and start winding down. The heritage house  very well loved by the owners  is all at once comfortable/cosy  charming and full of wonders… some delicious like: fresh herbs  lemon/orange trees growing in the garden. The'Platypus"" bedroom with its timber walls  vintage lacy mosquito net  clean bed linen & soft towels  made us feel very snug. Ann had even placed some fresh lavender stems on our pillows! We explored the island during the day  hanged at the beach… It felt like the time had stopped for a while. Then  coming back to the house  we were welcomed at night by Ann cooking up a FEAST  literally. She put so much thoughts into the menu and what would please us! The dinner with Ann and her husband was lovely and very much fun. Needless to say that we slept like babies. The next day morning brunch was another delicious meal served on the sunny balcony overlooking the vegetation and the river. We left shortly after and felt we could have stayed for a few more days of true pampering!"),
("2014-04-22", "1321603", "Marieke", "We couldn't have hoped for a more peaceful  beautiful setting for a weekend out of the city. Ann was a very warm and generous host who went out of her way to accommodate our interests including researching a suitable track in ku ring gai national park  and cooking a bevy of delicious vegetarian meals (complete with home grown herbs  veggies and chili!).Dangar island itself houses a warm and friendly community and it was very special to have a host who is so proud and knowledgeable about her corner of the world. We look forward to our next stay!"),
("2015-01-26", "1321603", "Lorna", "Ann and her family were the most gracious of hosts  sharing their house  gorgeous food & (mostly bad) jokes to make me feel a part of the family."),
("2015-04-06", "1321603", "Peter", "Ann is a great host. We felt welcome. She is a local historian and gave us a great insight into the island. The place and location are good. We felt at home. We were very warm at night and it was quite romantic for us. We were on the island for other reasons and would recommend it to others  although I would say that it is fully priced. "),
("2015-10-04", "1321603", "Adrian", "Ann was a very welcoming a thoughtful host. Also a great local historian who shared stories of the early days of the island. The hot breakfast with ham  cheese  fresh fruit and croissants and a perfect egg was a particular highlight. Highly recommended! A++The island itself is small and delightful  with the ferry ride across at dusk just lovely. We also highly recommend hiring a tinnie from Brooklyn to explore the river."),
("2015-12-29", "1321603", "Kate", "We had a lovely time at Ann's place. Ann and her husband are very interesting and considerate hosts. Lots of lively conversation. A lovely brunch.  Both rooms made up for us nicely. Great communication through the booking process.Ann and her husband met us at the ferry and upon arrival I was presented with a surprise birthday cake! How fabulous. Gluten free too for me - very thoughtful indeed. A lovely birthday card too left on the dresser. It's personal touches like this that make for a great stay.So nice to know a bit about the history of where you're staying. Ann does a great talk on the history of the island.If you think you'll need a little sleep in  take earplugs as the local birds get excited in the morning. A wonderful symphony to wake up to  but if you're trying to sleep...  Dangar Island is just wonderful - we keep coming back. It is a truly special place.We'll  come again - both to the island and would happily stay here again."),
("2016-02-15", "1321603", "Andrea", "Ann and Robert are charming hosts! From preparing our favourite foods to allowing us free range of the house and garden and sharing a lovely glass of wine over great conversation  we were made to feel really at home  yet really special. Both the house and the hosts are fascinating—Ann is a font of local history knowledge and Robert's collection of classical music is breathtaking. Beautiful artistic touches are everywhere  making this a truly magical and unique place to stay."),
("2016-03-13", "1321603", "Melanie", "We had a lovely time at Ann and Robert's on Dangar Island. Ann and Robert are both extraordinary people - fascinating and inspiring! We listened to Robert's opera CD on our way home! Ann made the most beautiful brunch for us. Their historic home is warm and inviting. Thankyou for a lovely time :)"),
("2016-07-10", "1321603", "Tanya", "Ann was a gracious host and a fantastic cook. She was very good company and her place is ideally located - very near the wharf  cafe  and bowling club as well as just a short walk to the beach."),
("2016-08-09", "1321603", "Claire", "Thanks so much Ann for being such a perfect hostess - I loved your cooking and was inspired by your garden. Maree"),
("2016-09-23", "1321603", "Rebecca", "A cultural experience to be enjoyed and treasured. Definitely to be on the bucket list of anyone who enjoys diversity and appreciates the finer things in life such as being entertained by a knowledgeable hostess who can share the wonders of permaculture  the arts and history. loved and appreciated every second thank you Ann for opening your home and loving us so dearly."),
("2016-11-14", "1321603", "Celine", "Ann was the perfect host.  From the welcome smile  to the beautiful breakfast and the awesome surroundings  we were not disappointed.  Dangar island is beautiful and the weekend was made even more special by how well Ann looked after us.  Everything was as described and this place is full of history.  Definitely worth a visit "),
("2016-12-29", "1321603", "Cath", "Gorgeous little treasure Dangar is! Ann is generous in sharing her little paradise  her amazing knowledge and stories. We will be back. "),
("2017-01-14", "1321603", "Claire", "A charming B&B with lots of history and character. Ann took care of us and spoilt us with a lovely breakfast each morning. Not great for young families  but lovely for a couple."),
("2017-01-21", "1321603", "Ross", "Heritage house with a lovely host!"),
("2017-02-11", "1321603", "Fiona", "Ann's place is unique  historical and a memorable place to stay.  We enjoyed the history of the house  the stories told by Ann and the very genuine concern for our comfort on what was a 41 degree day.  Breakfast was delicious and tailored to our needs.  Thanks Ann for a lovely stay."),
("2017-03-24", "1321603", "Sarah", "Lovely hosts on a beautiful island"),
("2017-04-26", "1321603", "Lena", "We booked online through Air BNB for two adults and one infant.  Unfortunately  soon after we arrived  Ann told us there had been a billing error and asked for more money  stating we had not booked correctly online and had only paid half of what we should have. We showed her our booking confirmation to prove we had booked correctly  and she “let us stay”. We had booked and paid correctly  it appears there may have been a problem with the Air BNB site. However  from this point on staying there became very uncomfortable.Over the next couple of days there were more problems. She could not tell us the wifi password  so we were unable to use the wifi. She told us we could not use the air conditioning. Finally  she refused us access to the kitchen to heat up our dinner  and told us we could not eat in the house  so we ended up eating cold pies in the garden at night. It was so uncomfortable we decided to leave early  and did not stay the last night. "),
("2017-06-18", "1321603", "Amanda", "Review:Ann was a thoughtful  generous  host with a sense of humour.  We had a freshly painted bedroom with heated king sized waterbed overlooking a marvellous garden by the river.  We stayed in bed until mid-morning. The buffet was enough food for the day!  She had local honey  home-made yoghurt and fruit and herbs fresh from the garden to make teas also top coffee.  Her house is packed with treasures and stories about the island and the Hawkesbury.  We'll be back!!"),
("2017-12-02", "1321603", "Claire", "Ann's place could not be more central to the heart of the island - the Bowlo ! Really easy to find and walk around. Very clean and spacious"),
("2018-01-19", "1321603", "Sanjay", "Ann is a gracious and generous host  with a charming house uniquely positioned to enjoy a trip to Dangar Island. Close to the wharf  the cafe/shop and the Bowling Club  we chose to stay with Ann after a day on the water and thoroughly enjoyed it. Ann's knowledge of the Island's history is second-to-none and her hospitality is amazing - putting on a delicious breakfast for us in the morning. "),
("2018-04-02", "1321603", "Andrew", "Thanks Ann for a wonderful time.  Dangar Island is an absolute gem  made even better by your hospitality  excellent meals and fascinating historic house."),
("2018-04-15", "1321603", "Brian", "Lovely location.  And lovely hosts. And a special garden cutting to remember our short break!  Thanks Ann for a lovely holiday"),
("2018-07-07", "1321603", "Andrew", "Dangar Island has a special quality of itself  and there is probably nowhere better to experience it than Ann's home. With a style and atmosphere that is warm and inviting  overlooking the beautiful Hawkesbury this is a great place to just watch to boats go by from the balcony or  if you like  get the lowdown on the history of the island or a tour of the garden. Thanks Ann also for going to so much trouble to accommodate for my vegan dietary requirements!"),
("2018-08-25", "1321603", "Rachel", "Amazing stay! Loved the heated waterbread and fresh fruit from Anne's garden for brekkie"),
("2018-11-17", "1321603", "Luca", "Great host  stilish home in great location  water views . Highly recommended. Great food at brunch. Thank you Ann and Robert. See you again soon. Luca"),
("2018-12-24", "1321603", "Greg", "PEICE AN OUITE IHOPE DEVELOPERS NEVER FIND TH IS PART OF GODS COUNTRY"),
("2018-12-27", "1321603", "Yui Fai", "Ann is a very special person and you will learn a lot about the Island from her. She makes us feel like home. Her garden is also excellent."),
("2016-07-18", "13299549", "Bill", "Five star location right in the heart of the CBD. Clean  convenient and great value. Will book again."),
("2016-08-08", "13299549", "Catherine", "Pros: perfect location  very clean  extremely central.Cons: some construction noise on street  windows look directly into office building next door (you'll probably want to keep the blinds closed)."),
("2016-08-20", "13299549", "Martine", "L'appartement est très bien situé  ce qui permet de nombreuses visite à pied. L'immeuble est confortable et calme  par contre nous avons passé une nuit blanche car le tramway est en construction et le chantier fonctionne la nuit et peut être très bruyant. Il n'y a pas de double vitrage et la climatisation ne permet pas d'avoir réellement chaud. Nous avons loué une semaine pour 3 personnes et nous avons eu droit à 1 rouleau de papier toilette et un petit paquet prévu pour l'accueil de 2 personnes ( bouteille d'eau  thé ..) Le ménage n'a pas été fait correctement : poussière et objets oubliés sous le lit) Bref tout cela est un peu juste et demande à être améliore  mais la situation géographique racheté le tout."),
("2016-09-09", "13299549", "Rachel", "We really enjoyed our stay at the apartment. The location was fantastic and made getting around in Sydney very easy. We have very young children who were waking very early due to the light in the bedrooms (thin blinds) but otherwise it was great."),
("2016-10-01", "13299549", "Helen", "This apartment has the most fantastic location which absolutely makes up for the fact that it is so dark you have to have the lights on at all times and it is a little run down. If you are out all day - as we mainly were - this is simply not a problem. The living area has enough room for two adult and two small children to co-exist quite happily and the bedrooms were a good size. Something we particularly appreciated was that there were lots of towels - often you are left with the bare minimum so this was great."),
("2016-10-09", "13299549", "Katherine", "A really convenient place that close to Circular Quay. We can find everything on George Street like supermarkets  malls and restaurants. The place is well set with all equipments for cooking and cleaning like home. I do love staying there."),
("2016-10-15", "13299549", "Beth", "Mixed bag on this stay but overall positive.  Great location near Circular Quay and the apartment is comfortable.  However  I was shocked to find out that I was required to supply my own toilet paper  trash bags  etc etc.  so take note.  A few single use items were supplied but having to go to the store and buy my own toilet paper was ridiculous and no forewarning was provided.  There were no instructions on how to use the TV so weren't able to watch it. The hot water in the shower was hit and miss and there were no face cloths.  "),
("2016-10-29", "13299549", "Roni", "This place was in an awesome location and looks just like the pictures!  the kitchen was well equipped and it was great having a washer/dryer too.We felt very safe there and were within walking distance to everything!our host made us feel very welcome and we would recommend this to other travelers for sure!"),
("2016-11-14", "13299549", "Leonie & Bill", "We had a wonderful time in Sydney in every way  superb dining  still savouring the memories  excellent sightseeing  the apartment worked out brilliantly  quiet  clean  perfect for our needs  in a great  location in it's proximity to Circular Quay with all it's forms of transport to anywhere in Sydney  plus cafe's  restaurants  supermarkets and shopping.  We were met on time on arrival at the apartment our host allowing us earlier entry than listed as well as a later departure time to suit our incoming and out going flights which we really did appreciate. Any issues were dealt with efficiently as per 11 light bulbs which were out and needed changing.  Thanks so much for a lovely stay  we'd definitely book the apartment again.  Warm regardsLeonie "),
("2016-11-26", "13299549", "Michael", "Great location and nice apartment. Bathroom a bit tight and the tv is a bit outdated but great base for exploring and enjoying sydney."),
("2016-12-07", "13299549", "Dana", "The location of this apartment is excellent. It's a five minute walk to the ferry and rail terminals and waterfront  and a 15 minute walk to the opera house. It's a suitable size for a family of four  with two beds in the second bedroom. We loved having a washer and dryer. If you plan on using the kitchen  plan on supplying a sponge to wash the counters  salt and pepper  dish soap  paper towels.... There are no extras. This was ok  we just were surprised and ended up buying what we needed. Also  there is road construction going on and it's loud. It goes all night  and some nights were worse than others. Despite the noise  the apartment worked well for our family  and the location is really good."),
("2017-01-29", "13299549", "Robyn", "This appartment is in a fabulous location everything is so close and easy to get to  we had 2 teenage kids with us and all felt safe in the appartment and out on the street  there are fantastic restaurants and market food  bars everywhere it's a lovely short walk to the opera house area the botanical gardens and the city shopping. It was clean and bright with a nice pool on the roof  the only let down was the bathroom is very small and the little things that you expect would to be provided such as salt pepper a roll of toilet paper  sponges an extra tea towel etc are not However there are plenty of quality towels and spare linen provided The appartment has a very good air conditioning system and the beds are very comfortable "),
("2017-02-07", "13299549", "Alpha", "This apartment is very central - 5 minutes walk to The Rocks and Circular Quay  and 10 minutes walk from Pitt Street Mall. There is also a convenience store a few steps away from the building entrance  which came in very handy.The apartment is beautifully equipped  and a welcome pack provides any small extras you might need. The air-conditioning is fabulous  especially during hot days! The beds are very comfortable and the linen is high quality.For people with young children it's great to have a bath tub as well. This apartment has everything you need to have a comfortable stay.The only I would say is to check on the progress and timing of the light rail construction on George Street  as it is very noisy. Otherwise I would highly recommend this apartment."),
("2017-02-17", "13299549", "Craig", "A great Apartment in a great location.  Everything you need is here  the common parts of the building look a little tired but the flat is comfortable and very well located.  The only downside  which the host cannot influence  is the work taking place on George Street installing the new light rail system.  This work is being done at night and can be a little noisy.  I wouldn't let that put you off as everything else is great  but it may be an issue for young children or light sleepers"),
("2017-02-23", "13299549", "Manuela", "Great place  great location! "),
("2017-03-03", "13299549", "Benjamin", "PLEASE READ. YOU'LL BE GLAD. I'm not usually one to write a review. However  I feel that strongly about my stay at this apartment that I feel I must so other travellers do not experience the problems I had. There is exstensive work happening on the corner of George Street & Bridge Street due to the construction of the light rail system(it was very disappointing that this was not mentioned anywhere in the description or throughout the booking process). On the second night 3 of the 4 guests were unable to sleep due to the excessive noise. When I rang the property manager(Arnold) to inform him of the noise and that we were unhappy about it he said that there haven't been any complaints from previous guests and that there was nothing he could do. I explained that I wasn't concerned about other guests  just my party. After much discussion his resolution was a refund for our unused nights in the apartment..............but we would have to find alternative accommodation ourselves! Not only were we wasting our vacation time trying to rectify the situation  but we then had to use more of our time trying to find alternative accommodation. With our vacation time in Sydney being only 5 nights  you can imagine how frustrating this was. Due to the short period we decided to stay on at the apartment. However  the following night there was noise outside the apartment on Bridge Street due to what looked like industrial electricians laying cables underground. Once again waking the party. The apartment itself was very disappointing  dark & outdated. You can not open the living room blinds as there is an office block a few metres directly adjacent. The bathroom is small & the overall cleanliness of the apartment was very poor. There were clumps of dust in the bathroom & when my partner moved the bed to plug in her phone charger  the dust & dirt was discusting! I found this very strange as a $243 ""cleaning fee"" is charged at the time of booking? This was relayed back to Arnold who said that he would get the cleaners back that day. Although the cleaners had returned back there  it was quite evident that they had just done the bare minimum & the large clumps of dust were still in the corner of the bathroom. By this stage of the vacation we had gone past caring and just wanted to enjoy our time in Sydney. Arnold did refund the $243 ""cleaning fee""  but only after a heated discussion. He also had to send in an electrician to fix a power point that was hanging off the wall and on a seperate occasion an electrician to change the light bulbs. Being a property management company you would think the apartment would be checked and this would of been done prior to guests entering the property? In all fairness to Arnold he was very prompt in resolving the issues  but unfortunately it was too little..."),
("2017-03-21", "13299549", "Marie-Eve", "Localisation exceptionnelle  parfait pour famille avec deux enfants  seul bémol  bruyant la nuit car travaux sur rue adjacente.  "),
("2017-03-28", "13299549", "Susanne", "Great location 3 blocks from Circular Quay. Clean and comfort."),
("2017-05-04", "13299549", "Marc", "Comfortable  nicely furnished apartment in secure building with an excellent location walkable to downtown Sydney attractions.  Check-in on the weekends is a little difficult as the property manager is not available and you have arrange to have someone pick up the keys ahead of time or pick them up from a lockbox in a completely different location.  During our stay  there was serious construction noise at night that started on the second night of our stay.  This was unexpected and anticipated to last two weeks.  Keris was kind enough to allow us to relocate to a hotel and refunded us for the unused nights which we greatly appreciated.  We were sad to have to end our stay early.  We would stay here again in the future if we have the opportunity.  "),
("2017-06-19", "13299549", "Daniel", "A bit noisy due to the George St road works and buskers that set up in the alley behind the accommodation  but it is an inner city apartment  so to be expected. "),
("2017-06-23", "13299549", "선호", "It was awesome"),
("2017-07-22", "13299549", "Lucy", "This apartment is large enough for up to 4 people as it has a queen bed and two singles and it has 2 bedrooms  which are clean. The kitchen is of ample size and has some cooking essentials included. The location is central to the CBD which made it perfect for us  as we have a chronically ill/disabled son who can't walk very far or fast  therefore making it easier for us to get around.The apartment is also  very secure  and the internet service was also very good; all in all a great place to stay."),
("2017-10-27", "13299549", "Jared", "Was a nice place to stay at  unit just needs a bit of a face lift and clean."),
("2017-11-06", "13299549", "Lindy", "Fabulous location  great sized apartment with all mod cons  good value for money"),
("2017-11-24", "13299549", "Tom", "Great location  great building  affordable"),
("2016-06-26", "13302796", "Eugene", "Great position  within walking distance of all the major CBD attractions and inner city suburbs like Darlinghurst  Surry Hills and Woolloomooloo. Our host was very friendly and thorough  and easy to deal with. The accomodation itself was fine - 5 beds (incl 3 doubles) in 3 bedrooms.  Awesome easterly view from the 13th floor. Perfect for a boys weekend. The fridge didn't work although I can't mark my host down for that as I didn't contact her to give her a chance to fix. "),
("2016-07-10", "13302796", "Jid", "About daniels  i couldn't give any comment  its Just inna who meet us when arriving n communicate with us along our stay inna stand by to help if you asking..the location is very good  real middle at the city"),
("2016-07-28", "13302796", "Craig", "The apartment is well positioned right on Hyde Park and 300m from the train. There is a great view over King's Cross including sun and moon rises. Rooms are bright and spacious although only one has cupboard space. Gym  swimming pool  Jacuzzi and sauna are easily accessible. The single bathroom/toilet would make it difficult to accommodate 8 people  even though there are beds for 8."),
("2016-08-08", "13302796", "Scott", "Great spot but a bit basic in facilities and furnishings  but that's reflected in the price compared to the updated rooms offered by the resort. Could do with some updating of the property  paint  flooring etc and décor.The property was clean and the host was nice and easy to communicate with.Probably not for me next time but if you don`t mind it a bit ""rough around the edges"" then you cant beat the location."),
("2016-08-15", "13302796", "Kitty", "This is very nice apartment and good location  very convenience for us in Sydney"),
("2016-08-20", "13302796", "Mike", "Great"),
("2016-09-07", "13302796", "Sixin", "good experience"),
("2016-09-21", "13302796", "Karen", "Fantastic location. Host was great and very helpful. Checked out later then the allocated time which was fantastic. Had everything we needed and the beds were really comfortable. It was the second level from the top floor so the view was great. Roof top pool and spa were great as was the view. Pillows were a bit flat and there was only 1 roll of toilet paper for 8 females staying 2 nights. Supermarkets were close by as was everything else. Overall I would highly recommend it there. I will be back."),
("2016-09-26", "13302796", "Jacqueline", "Terrific location. Complimentary bottle of wine was lovely. Perfect for our weekend in Sydney."),
("2016-10-03", "13302796", "Mel", "Great helpful host"),
("2016-10-21", "13302796", "Bayu", "Pros:Location is supurb.Host Inna was very friendly and helpfull.Cons:The apartment was much samller then pictured.Very dusty  all the aircon outlets were caked in dust.Aircon would go under 25 degrees and not work at all some times."),
("2016-12-11", "13302796", "Nicole", "The host was very welcoming and communicative during the whole stay. The apartment location was excellent  really close to supermarkets and a train station. There was unfortunately alot of noise (construction)  lack of basic toiletries and the spa was closed when we were there. "),
("2016-12-16", "13302796", "Debs", "Fantastic location right on the edge of Hyde Park (convenience store next door and BWS and coffee shop within 100 metres)  nice pool on the roof (spa undergoing maintenance at time of visit).  A bit dated  but had everything we needed and Inna was very welcoming and friendly.  Bottle of wine upon arrival - nice touch.  The aircon wasn't particularly effective but a fan was also provided."),
("2017-01-11", "13302796", "Mike", "Great location and apartment met all expectations on the web site and others' comments.  It is basic but has plenty of room  all the basic necessities (air con  large fridge  three bed rooms and plenty of sleeping space.  The roof-top pool is a wonderful extra at the end of a long 40 degrees Sydney day too.  Should advertise this in the main listing as it was a 'must have' for us with two young kids and a teenager in January"),
("2017-01-14", "13302796", "Roslyn", "Good place.  Centrally located and a wonderful host"),
("2017-02-10", "13302796", "Eva", "非常好 市中心 步行很方便 房东也很好"),
("2017-02-15", "13302796", "Yanjie", "the position of this apartment is wonderful. it's near to Australian museum  Hyde park  st. Mary church  art galerry of NSW and royal Botanic park by walk. inna is very nice."),
("2017-02-18", "13302796", "Valerie", "Fantastic position - close to everything."),
("2017-02-23", "13302796", "Sabine", "Inna a été tout a fait facilitante pour toutes nos demandes  et l'appartement est bien équipé et fonctionnel   meme si un toilettage des peintures est nécessaire. l'emplacement est ideal pour découvrir sydney a pied ."),
("2017-03-19", "13302796", "Leo", "Good location"),
("2017-04-12", "13302796", "Vu", "This is a very convenient place  I can walk to lots of places in central sydney easily"),
("2017-04-18", "13302796", "Andrew", "Inna really looked after us!  We will definitely be back :)"),
("2017-05-08", "13302796", "Michael", "Clean and comfortable and a great host!"),
("2017-05-21", "13302796", "Nicholas", "Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2017-06-02", "13302796", "Joel", "Right in the middle of the CBD so this is the place to go for convenience."),
("2017-06-03", "13302796", "Adam", "Great location. Inna was a great host. Great value for money"),
("2017-07-04", "13302796", "Chong", "Great location. Inna privide many useful information."),
("2017-07-08", "13302796", "Xiaoyang (David)", "Inna is a very nice host and provides a lot useful information. My family do enjoy the stay. BTW  the sky bus to airport is really good thanks to Inna."),
("2017-07-27", "13302796", "An Ny", "The house is next to Hyde park. The location is very good. The landlord gives us wine and receives us very well. There was a supermarket nearby  and we also cooked food  which was a good choice for family travel."),
("2017-08-13", "13302796", "Samantha", "Very central! Walking distance to great places."),
("2017-08-20", "13302796", "Tennille", "Inna is a very helpful host.  Gave us tips on places to go which was very helpful.  Let us check in early and check out late."),
("2017-08-25", "13302796", "Chunmin", "不错的选择"),
("2017-09-30", "13302796", "Olivia", "Location was great  apartment ordinary. Bathroom was real small for 5 girls to get ready. Serviced us well for our 3 night work stay."),
("2017-10-10", "13302796", "Yun", "Inna is a very friendly owner   we really had a pleasant stay at Sydney . Despite some aircon leaking issues   and it get fix immediately by Inna. A friend of mine left some cash inside safety box and Inna helped us to bank in back after she found the cash . Definitely worth the five star rating !"),
("2017-10-22", "13302796", "Minh", "The apartment is closed to everything. Suitable price for a central apartment."),
("2017-10-28", "13302796", "Dennis", "Was a great apartment for my friends and myself. The apartment had a great rooftop pool and the location was close to everything."),
("2017-11-15", "13302796", "Cliff", "Great host.  Great location"),
("2017-11-19", "13302796", "Scott", "Great and easy"),
("2017-11-24", "13302796", "John", "We loved it! Thank you Inna for all of your recommendations and making it a great trip for our family!You truly went above and beyond for us!"),
("2017-12-17", "13302796", "Money", "Good location for walking around Sydney CBD comfortable beds."),
("2018-02-18", "13302796", "Binyuan", "We had a good stay at Inna's place. It was next to Hyde Park  and close to the Australian Museum  and the bus station and IGA just few minutes walk. It was easy to communicate with Inna  she gave us many helpful tips and information. We all thank you for that!"),
("2018-03-10", "13302796", "正荣", "房间的位置在CBD 出行都很方便.由于Inna 休假 通过airbnb 邮件没有联系上 最后还是电话联系上. 主人好客 桌上还有1瓶红酒迎客 房间很干净."),
("2018-06-17", "13302796", "Rikki", "No issues here very helpful and good value for money"),
("2018-07-16", "13302796", "Ha", "Very convenient for traveling to CBD by train or bus. Shopping just takes a few minutes from the Inna’s place. Inna is a friend host. It is highly recommended."),
("2018-10-08", "13302796", "CheerfulGer", "Good location. Friendly and thoughtful. Thank you for everything help and queries that I kept asking."),
("2018-11-10", "13302796", "Andy", "For somewhere very central this accomodation ticks the box particularly if you need 3 bedrooms which is quite hard to find."),
("2017-01-08", "13363311", "Nicola", "We had a wonderful stay and the flat was everything we had hoped for. The extra help with cot  pram and even toys for our 15-month old made it so easy. And the flat was in a great area with a few brunch places and restaurants nearby as well as Bondi Junction just a short bus ride away. Overall we'd highly recommend staying here. Thanks Moira!"),
("2016-08-08", "13320545", "Bec And Sam", "It was lovely to meet Jessica  she was an amazing host! The apartment was clean and comfortable. The location was great  with Paddington's amazing restaurants and shops just on our doorstep. Jessica was very friendly and helpful and we're definitely planning on staying here again next time we're in Sydney!"),
("2016-08-19", "13320545", "Stacey", "Jessica is a genuinely kind hearted person. She made me and my boyfriend feel welcome and helped us in the ways that she could.  She also collects art and has excellent taste  so her flat is absolutely adorable! We stayed 5 nights  and everything was comfortable. There's even an electric blanket in the bed. Paddington is a very nice neighborhood mainly of boutique shopping on the main road. Centennial Park is also a 10 minute walk away  so we took advantage of that. I've been in many a Airbnb  and I definitely recommend Jessica and her flat!"),
("2017-03-11", "13320545", "Clair", "Gorgeous host and such a lovely comfortable room. Very flexible with my arrival."),
("2017-03-16", "13320545", "Steven", "Jessica is a great host! Amazing location of the place  wonderful accommodations. Seriously  if you're visiting Sydney I highly recommend staying with Jessica. In between the city and the beach. Amazing! "),
("2017-03-31", "13320545", "榛嫈", "1.房間無對外窗有點悶熱 跟房東借電風扇有所改善 但夏季可能會非常熱2.有天窗可以引進自然光 因此白天光線很好 當然也不可能睡太晚｡3.因為直接睡在房東原本的房間 因此房東會睡在客廳的沙發 所謂會提供的洗衣機等配備都不方便使用 連晚上上廁所都要擔心吵到房東｡4.wifi連線很順暢5.住宿的幾天附近都有人在施工 因此有點吵｡6.餐廳有貓飼料等 因此有蠻明顯的貓味道｡7.距離paddington Saturday market很近8.房間衣櫃不能使用 且空間小 行李箱一打開就沒有空間可行走9.有蟑螂"),
("2017-04-02", "13320545", "Wouter", "A beautiful  clean and cosy place in a nice and convenient neighbourhood. Jessica is a very friendly and helpful host. We enjoyed our stay here!"),
("2017-04-04", "13320545", "Svetlana", "It was my first experience with airbnb and I am glad that my host was Jessica  who is a great host! And it is true - it is 5 star location place - it is walk away from Hide Park  Opera House  Harbour Bridge  Royal Botanic Garden. I would definitely recommend Jessica´s place. "),
("2017-04-06", "13320545", "Mia", "Staying at Jessica's was great value for money and in a top location! A clean and tidy place and Jessica was lovely.Thanks for having us!"),
("2017-04-10", "13320545", "Jocelyn", "Jessica's place was lovely! She was so easy to communicate with and accommodating. The bed was super comfortable and had such nice sheets! She provided us with towels and had some lovely complimentary tea and cookies. Jessica was able to recommend many great local spots and made us feel very welcome. I totally recommend if you're looking for a nice spot to stay!"),
("2017-04-13", "13320545", "Emmanuel", "Lots of stairs. No windows but has ample natural skylights.  The neighborhood is trendy with great transportation access."),
("2017-04-17", "13320545", "Alexandra", "We stayed at Jess' place over the Easter break and it was a great spot in Paddington with lots of nice bars  shops and restaurants near by. It's just around the corner from the bus stop which has buses running to the city centre and also to Bondi. Jess was friendly and helpful and made us feel welcome during our stay. "),
("2017-04-21", "13320545", "Zhaokun", "Jessica is a nice person! She gave us a lot of useful suggestion! Cats are quiet and cute. Thanks!"),
("2017-04-28", "13320545", "Nadia", "Jessica was a lovely host! Despite her being unwell while I stayed there I could always rely on her to help me out with anything around the flat  awesome restaurant and sightseeing recommendations and just generally pleasant company :) The cats were lovely and very affectionate. I definitely felt at home at Jessica's flat. Extremely well located for buses to take you to either Bondi or central Sydney  as it's basically halfway in between. I walked to Mrs McQuarries point one day and it took just over an hour to do so  buses take 10-15 minutes to central. Paddington itself is a cute neighbourhood with some nice places to eat/drink/shop nearby. Quite a few steps to take up to the flat just for anyone who might have issues with that  I didn't. Really enjoyed my stay at Jessica's flat highly recommend it! "),
("2017-05-03", "13320545", "Simon", "Great location  comfy clean bed and great value. Jess is a lovely  friendly  helpful host. "),
("2017-05-06", "13320545", "Nina", "Jessica has a funky Paddo pad in the middle of everything Sydney has to offer. Perfect Sydney stay."),
("2017-05-25", "13320545", "Kayla", "Jessica is so amazing ! She is so sweet and it is in a great location"),
("2017-05-29", "13320545", "Leesa", "Very basic but great value for money if you spend most of your time out and about. Host was lovely and accomodating."),
("2017-06-01", "13320545", "Claudia", "Great place to stay! Very clean and comfortable. Good location and some great eating options around."),
("2017-06-17", "13320545", "Laura", "Jessica était à Paris mais très bon accueil avec sa maman  des cookies chauds  et un chat adorable. Très bon emplacement au coeur de Paddington.La porte ouverte toute la nuit pourrait peut être être remplacée par une chatière en hiver ? Wifi un peu inconstant.On recommande ce logement."),
("2017-12-31", "13320545", "Hannah", "The host canceled this reservation 4 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-06-26", "13320545", "Fiona", "Jessica very kindly accepted our last minute booking - she was very welcoming and her flat is a lovely little place tucked away in Paddington  which has some greats shops and bars and a market and is very well-connected with the CBD.However  we did have some trouble sleeping due to construction noise and paint smells coming through the floorboards  as there was a shop being fitted on the floor below. Jessica had said there might be mess downstairs at the entrance to the flat  but didn't mention that the work had been continuing late into the night. We raised the issue with Jessica during our stay  and hoped she would be understanding when we requested a partial refund after our departure. Unfortunately  this wasn't the case and we had to work with airbnb to resolve the issue."),
("2018-12-02", "13320545", "Sunah", "This trip was very special because I used to  live in Paddington. Jessica's place is in heart of Paddington. It was bit hard to find at first but she was guiding us specifically through messages. Bedroom was neat   tidy and stylish. Had such a great time and thanks to Jessica for suggesting nice places. :)"),
("2018-12-09", "13320545", "Teresa", "My stay was very enjoyable - everything was clean and the room I stayed in was comfortable  - everything worked in the kitchen and bathroom and wi-fi was dependable. Jessica was quick to answer any questions I had  both before my stay and during  and she has a nice welcoming personality!  The area is a big plus  with a trendy feel  lots of eateries  shops and points of interest.  It was easy to get around from there.  My high expectations from previous reviews were met."),
("2018-12-16", "13320545", "Mika", "A cozy little place with artsy decorations. Location is perfect being right above the Paddington shoplots  and easy access to the CBD by the bus stop nearby. The room is clean and comfortable  but may get rather hot during summer. Wi-Fi is a plus  and overall very much great for value!"),
("2018-12-24", "13320545", "Rakhee", "Stayed at Jessica's place for 5 nights. The room was spacious  clean and had everything I needed. Quite stylish and practical!Great location to Bondi and close to bus stops.Would recommend this place!"),
("2018-12-29", "13320545", "Annie", "Great stay in the perfect location!"),
("2019-01-05", "13320545", "Anna", "Stayed here for a week during NYE and really enjoyed it! The place is in a really good location  walking distance from lots of shops and cafes. The room was great  very comfortable and clean  and we ended up using the kitchen which was quite helpful. Overall  we had a lovely time here and would definitely recommend to anyone!"),
("2019-01-10", "13320545", "Manon", "Nous y sommes restés 5 jours avec mon compagnon. La localisation de l'appartement est vraiment bien. À 15 mn de bondi et à 10 mn du centre par des bus directs. La chambre est spacieuse et propre."),
("2019-01-15", "13320545", "Priy D", "Quirky place in nice location. Noisy - particularly if you're not from a big city. Standoffish host. Incident where I was shouted at and accused of trying to watch her do her feet. W hen actually as I was walking to the bathroom  the host was holding her foot up - very much like patients  in my profession - do to show me their injury/ailment/complaint. Therefore  I paused momentarily - about to ask if everything was alright. Got shouted at - totally uncalled for."),
("2019-01-19", "13320545", "Jessica", "The location is perfect  close to everything (between Bondi beach and the Opera house). There is a bus stop very close to have easily access to everything. It’s a lovely place  comfy and Jessica was always there if we had any question. It’s a good place to stay during your holiday."),
("2019-01-26", "13320545", "Melanie", "The apartment is really well located. The bus stop is close to the apartment so you can quickly and easily go to the center and Bondi Beach. Jessica was a very friendly and helpful host."),
("2019-02-01", "13320545", "Josh", "Characterful  clean and friendly AirBnB in a cool and designer part of Sydney. Easy to access the CBD or beaches and great set up in the room.Nice touch with the provision of good coffee and breakfast as well"),
("2019-02-05", "13320545", "Masayuki", "I definitely enjoyed my stay at here. Room is clean and cozy  house is beautiful and artistic  location is convenient  host is  really friendly and great. For me  can’t say anything bad about here!! Perfect!!"),
("2019-02-11", "13320545", "Arsalan", "It is a lovely room in a really good spot of Sydney. Jessica gave me so many tips from what to see to where to go to party."),
("2019-02-25", "13320545", "Stephanie", "Jessica was welcoming and quick to respond to any questions we had. We loved our stay and the location. Easy transport to wherever! We really enjoyed our stay. Highly recommend!"),
("2016-06-10", "12954762", "Leah", "Very close to airport  comfortable bed"),
("2016-06-12", "12954762", "Chad", "Shuang's place was great. It had everything I needed for the Stay and was very clean. I had a small problem with the iron but Shuang had it fixed within minutes! Would definitely recommend."),
("2016-06-13", "12954762", "Patricia", "Very clean and calm. We had one of the two rooms and shared kitchen and bathroom with another traveller (second room). Quiet nice place. Only a 15 minutes walk to the airport. Next time again :-) Thank you very much!"),
("2016-06-20", "12954762", "Phi", "Shuang was very helpful and was very quick with his responses to any questions i had. Was clean and had all the things i needed to have a comfortable stay."),
("2016-06-23", "12954762", "Diego & Iva", "Shuang is a very organised and helpful host. all our questions had been answered quickly and accurate before our arrival. the room was spacious and clean with all the needs for our short stay. the location is near the airport and took us about 25min to walk there with heavy backpacks - easy!definitely recommend Shuang!"),
("2016-06-26", "12954762", "Nicole", "Shuang was a helpful and kind host. The property was accurately described and very close to the airport. My stay was very short  but was perfect for my needs. Thanks Shuang! "),
("2016-07-10", "12954762", "Shekhar", "It was a very pleasant stay. Thank you Shuang for your hospitality!"),
("2016-07-11", "12954762", "Tabitha", "Beautiful home  cute little room perfect for resting your head for the night while traveling. Only $8 Uber ride from here to the airport. "),
("2016-07-11", "12954762", "Austin", "Great!"),
("2016-07-12", "12954762", "Jie", "It's very comfortable to live in this place.The bed is soft and clean.Shuang is a very kind and helpful person and i really appreaciate all his help for us."),
("2016-07-13", "12954762", "Mike", "Shuang's place was perfect for our overnight layover in and out of Sydney airport. It's easy to get to and a short walk from the train station which took us right downtown. It was clean and comfortable. Definitely recommend."),
("2016-07-16", "12954762", "Lani", "This was a quiet  extremely clean  and cozy place to stay after a 11 hr. flight  and was only 10 min. away from the Sydney airport (about $18 taxi fair). I found everything I needed from internet code printed with local maps. I had to wait for my ride to arrive and I was able to wait in the common room and was even given coffee. I highly recommend this very nice and private granny flat. Thank you for the welcoming hospitality! I will stay again if come back to NSW  Australia. "),
("2016-07-18", "12954762", "Kim", "Shuang was very helpful in providing instructions and tips to getting to his place. The room itself is very clean  spacious  and modern. The neighborhood is pretty quiet and the person/people I shared the kitchen and bathroom with were very considerate and quiet. Getting around was pretty easy as it was only a 12 minute walk from Wolli Creek station and shorter walk to a few bus routes that will take you to Sydney or surrounding suburbs. My stay was very short as I was heading to the airport  and it's a relatively easy walk to the airport if you don't have too much luggage. Otherwise  it's an inexpensive taxi ride or short bus trip to the airport  which works just as well. Would definitely try to stay here again if I'm ever in the area again."),
("2016-07-20", "12954762", "Corrina", "It was one of the best places that I have stayed in and I couldn't have asked for a better place and shuang was a wonderful host"),
("2016-07-20", "12954762", "Harriet", "The flat was very modern and we'll equipped  I only stayed for one night but it was a pleasant experience. Only downside was the bathroom wasn't that clean  maybe due to sharing with another airbnb guest  because the room was spotless. Thanks for having me to stay!"),
("2016-08-03", "12954762", "Léonie Elena", "Very comfortable and clean room. Close to food shops and airport. Was a nice experience. I'd love to stay there again. Very lovely host. Thank u very much."),
("2016-08-04", "12954762", "Benjamin", "We stayed just for a short night but enjoyed our stay.Very clean  tidy and modern apartment. A few minutes from the airport  around 15$ by taxi.Thanks again"),
("2016-08-05", "12954762", "James", "Very nice stay.  Shuang's room allows you to go in and out on your own schedule and is perfect for short or overnight stays.  Highly recommended!"),
("2016-08-08", "12954762", "Joanne", "Shuang's place was convenient  clean and tidy. We enjoyed our stay. Thanks  Shuang! "),
("2016-08-08", "12954762", "David", "My girlfriend and I had an okay stay. the bed was clean and comfortable but there was no heat and Sydney was pretty chilly at night (~15C). everything was newly renovated but we still felt uncomfortable using the appliances."),
("2016-08-08", "12954762", "Kate", "Great place to stay when flying out the international airport. Great price  easy to get to airport ($12 uber). Highly recommend. "),
("2016-08-09", "12954762", "Le", "Shuang's place is totally fantastic both in terms of location and quality of the room. It's close to transit  quite easy to find with convenient arrangement for key pick up. And the room is well equipped with all necessities  and above all cleaned professionally  which is what I found to be key to a comfortable Airbnb experience. I was only here for a day and the proximity to the airport was a solid plus  yet I can see this could also be nice for longer travel thanks to the easy access to the city. Thanks for the nice experience and hope next time when I visit Sydney I could potentially stay again here."),
("2016-08-11", "12954762", "Graham", "I'm very glad we stayed here. Close to the airport. Very clean  great hosts."),
("2016-08-13", "12954762", "Linda", "The room was clean  comfortable  and well-appointed. The host even provided electric blankets for us  which were very much appreciated during the cold winter night. We were not chilly at all. The bathroom was very spacious and modern  similar to the room. Would stay here again! "),
("2016-08-16", "12954762", "Timothy", "Clean and fast responses from host. Great stay!"),
("2016-08-17", "12954762", "Jihye", "굿"),
("2016-08-19", "12954762", "Sion", "Needed a place to stay just for the night close to the airport  only $14 taxi ride. Perfect just for the one night quick stay  really clean and comfortable."),
("2016-08-20", "12954762", "Gert", "Gute Beschreibung wie man zur Unterkunft kommt; ich habe alles so vorgefunden wie in der email beschrieben;ich kann diese Unterkunft nur sehr emofehlen!"),
("2016-08-20", "12954762", "Catie", "It was a very nice room and very easy to get to the airport which is what we were after."),
("2016-08-27", "12954762", "Jayson", "The place is nice and clean. Newly renovated so nothing you can faulter. A stand fan would be nice just to circulate air in the room."),
("2016-08-30", "12954762", "和弥", "It's clean room and convenient!"),
("2016-08-31", "12954762", "默兒", "房間很乾淨明亮!也很安靜屋主媽媽人非常親切､我們到達時都已晚上11點多還是親自來迎接非常好的一個停留!謝謝"),
("2016-09-02", "12954762", "Judy", "Easy to find; lots of space; lovely  clean  near-new as described.  Perfect location for our night-before (too early!) domestic flight.  Very easy access to two train lines  so of Sydney close at-hand.  We'd stay there again!"),
("2016-09-03", "12954762", "Jerrold", "Great room  comfortable and clean. Shuang was a great host despite lots of changes that were made. Will definitely be back if I need a place to stay near the airport."),
("2016-09-04", "12954762", "Bohwa", "사진에서 본 그대로 깔끔하고 정돈된 방이었어요. 욕실도 마찬가지. 근처 울월스있어서 장보기도 편리. 호스트는 만나보지 못했지만 사용에는 전혀 문제 없었어요~"),
("2016-09-05", "12954762", "Kooi Lan", "Clean and close to the airport. We stayed there for a night and overall it was pleasant."),
("2016-09-06", "12954762", "Grace", "Had to stay the night before going to the airport the following morning  and the location is superb if you're in a similar situation like me. The place is huge  clean  and absolutely stunning. You will be greeted by a small garden leading up to the gate  and your room is nothing short of a hotel room with a comfy  white bed with warm covers. The place is clean and quiet  and also accessible as there is a 7/11 nearby. Would have loved staying here longer than just one night  but it was a pleasant experience nonetheless."),
("2016-09-07", "12954762", "Dai", "Convenient location. Very close to the airport and just $10 uber ride. The key got stucked the first time I used and the host help us to get it asap. It was lovely to have a short stay here."),
("2016-09-07", "12954762", "Wil", "Was as advertised. Gave shampoo upon request"),
("2016-09-11", "12954762", "Georgina", "Excellent! Immaculately clean.  Love Shuang as he was very accommodating  gracious  warm and hospitable.  Place is very close to the airport."),
("2016-09-13", "12954762", "Peter", "Yes all very good. Bit far from shops. Large Woolworths  10 min walk."),
("2016-09-13", "12954762", "Alvin", "A very clean and comfortable room! The bed equip with electric blanket which make us so warm in the cold night. Highly recommend for this AIRBNB!"),
("2016-09-16", "12954762", "Saima", "The place was clean and self sufficient (bathroom and kitchen). We recommend this place if you're looking for good price and somewhere close to airport."),
("2016-09-16", "12954762", "Mei", "房间很干净舒适 洗衣等设施齐全 离机场很近 进城交通也方便 我们很滿意｡"),
("2016-09-17", "12954762", "満希子", "It's lovely room and quiet.If I go to sydney I will stay there again.Thank you"),
("2016-09-22", "12954762", "Da", "Shaun was very quick at responding to me as I traveled from the airport to his place. And once I got there he was very accommodating in providing a converter charger. Place was beautiful and really close to transportation into the city and airport. I will definitely be coming back  next time with friends! "),
("2016-09-22", "12954762", "Keyla", "If you are looking for a please to stay close to the airport this place is fantastic! Everything was immaculate in the room and bathroom. I'm so happy that I choose this apartment to stay. Definitely recommended!"),
("2016-09-24", "12954762", "Allen", "Clean accommodation with great value!"),
("2016-09-26", "12954762", "Kevin", "Nice clean room  very close to both domestic and international airport terminals. We arrived by taxi but left by train - only 3 stops."),
("2016-09-27", "12954762", "Cara", "Very convenient! The place is lovely and very clean."),
("2016-09-28", "12954762", "Helen", "I was attending a 2 day course in Bexley. Perfect location for a one night stay. The room was spotless and an easy walk to Arncliffe train station."),
("2016-09-29", "12954762", "Damien", "Shuang was very accommodating and helpful! The room was lovely  big and bright and the location so close to the airport was ideal for me!"),
("2016-10-02", "12954762", "Cecile", "Thanks for all. Your home is very nice and welcoming. Good location for traveller close to airport."),
("2016-10-03", "12954762", "Kevin", "nice house located in walking distance from the airport owned by a lovely family."),
("2016-10-06", "12954762", "Lucy", "It was a nice and clean place  with a good neighbourhood close to the airport."),
("2016-10-06", "12954762", "Aline", "Shuang's flat was great. very conformable and good location near to airport. He was very communicative and helpful."),
("2016-10-08", "12954762", "Robert & Lynn", "We were made o feel very welcome by Shuang and his family. The room was quite spacious and very well fitted out. We were overnighting to pick up an international flight out of Sydney and found the location to the airport very handy."),
("2016-10-10", "12954762", "Stella", "The host was very accommodating as we had quite a few luggages with us. Very clean apartment with close location to the train. Also very close to the airport. Overall a fantastic value!"),
("2016-10-11", "12954762", "Willie-Ann", "The rooms were separate from the main house and impeccably clean with white towels and bathmats supplied. Tiled floors and bench space in the bathroom with a washing machine.  Up the stairs on the balcony were clothes drying racks. The bed was comfy and pillows of high quality. Contact with the host was via phone and he or family attended to my requests. There was very little actual conversational communication. Overall a pleasant experience."),
("2016-10-12", "12954762", "J&R", "Beautiful and clean place. And close to the train station. You can walk."),
("2016-10-12", "12954762", "Sandra", "The location is about 5 EASY minutes from international airport. Easy parking in private road.  Access clear amd simple   Spacious bedroom  modern bathroom with AWESOME shower.  Kitchenette well equipped for simple needs.  Wifi excellent.   The bedroom door could be locked.  Great communication.  No traffic or aircraft noise - located in cul-de-sac.  Separate entrance to main house.  Have booked to return  for our next early flight.  Simple and great value"),
("2016-10-14", "12954762", "Sungchul", " I rented one of two bedrooms on a ground floor. A living room/ kitchen and a bathroom were shared. There was a small frig and a small laundry machine. Rooms were very sparkling clean and new. A big TV was in a common living room. Communication was fast and clear. No need to see the host as keys were in a padlock and thus late arrival or early leave is fine. A host seems to live in a house annexed to the AirBnB rooms but entrances were different. Actually  his house is a proper detached house. 15 minutes walk to an international terminal. No need to take a cab if you go to an international terminal. Walk to an int terminal is safe but is not a no trainer due to a airport construction. But it is not too difficult to find a way to it. It is a great place to stay overnight if you have a morning flight. Very competitive price. Good for two people (queen bed)  even with a small kid. "),
("2016-10-18", "12954762", "Tammi", "Very easy to access. It was about a 20 - 30 minute walk from the airport so we just caught an uber for around $8.00. We did share with someone else in the other room and they did get a bit noisy with their tv show when trying to sleep and can be a bit small if you're looking to watch tv as no couch  but for us we were just looking for a place to stay and it was great!"),
("2016-10-20", "12954762", "Rea", "I stayed in room 2 and it was very pleasant. The room was quite roomy  bed was super comfy  had basic kitchenette facilities and bathroom was noce and clean! Had a great stay there and Fen was very welcoming. Shuang was friendly and prompt to reply to queries. Definitely would stay here again. Thank you!"),
("2016-10-22", "12954762", "Daisy", "Highly recommend Place for short term or long term visiting in Sydney. The location is very good  just 10mins walk distance to the wolicreek train station. Close to central and airport as well. The house is very clean. I didn't get chance to meet Shuang  but as we text ms  he is very kind and welcome person. Hope you guys can enjoin in his house as I do. "),
("2016-10-23", "12954762", "Markus", "Shuang's place was neat  clean and tidy. Fabulous for those early morning take offs from the airport."),
("2016-10-23", "12954762", "Tony", "Excellent experience. Room was great and the bathroom was awesome!"),
("2016-10-25", "12954762", "Caitlin", "Shuang's place was great! It was super clean  cute and easy to get to the train station into downtown Sydney. Would definitely stay here again."),
("2016-10-26", "12954762", "John", "Real enjoyed staying here"),
("2016-10-30", "12954762", "Aurélia", "Très bon logement  tranquille situé juste à côté de l'aéroport Très bien "),
("2016-10-30", "12954762", "Natalia & Danijel", "Shuang's place is spotless and amazingly resembles a high end hotel. Just amazing. We never met him but were give very simple instructions and help on getting there. We would definitely recommend him to anybody. Thank you for everything Shuang best of luck with everything.Cheers  Danijel & Natalia "),
("2016-11-03", "12954762", "Theresa", "We were met by a lady who showed us in and went through accomodation. We found the place very convinient and close to everything as described. Very clean and tidy too. Would reccomend to friends travelling to Sydney."),
("2016-11-08", "12954762", "Yashodhan", "vary naice place  quiet  clean  neat and most of all  Shuang is an extremely helpful host. I really loved my stay."),
("2016-11-09", "12954762", "Henrik", "Shuangs place was great and excatly as promised. No problems getting the key and a good nights sleep after 25 hours of air travel."),
("2016-11-10", "12954762", "Jay", "The room was exactly as described. It was clean  convenient  easy access and close to airport. We stayed at Shuang's place as we had an early flight to catch next day. It took us 5 minutes to get to the terminal by Uber and costed us $7. Excellent value for money and would recommend to anyone."),
("2016-11-11", "12954762", "Andrew", "Thanks Shuang. A very nice space. Very smart with the beatiful tiling in the room and bathroom. I did meet your Mum and Dad  very welcoming. The shared bathroom worked well with the couple in the other room.  Very handy to the airport. One stop on train to International  and two stops to Domestic."),
("2016-11-12", "12954762", "보름", "시드니 시티에서 멀지 않은 곳에 조용하고 편안하게 잠을 잘 수 있었다.방 사진보다 더 깨끗했고 깔끔했다.주인 부부도 친절했고 다음에 또 가고싶다."),
("2016-11-13", "12954762", "Sara", "Very happy with my accomodation at Shuangs place. Very clean  neat  nearby the airport and easy to access :-)"),
("2016-11-14", "12954762", "Andrew", "The only difference between it and a queenbed room in a 3-star hotel is  the price :)"),
("2016-11-15", "12954762", "Realyn", "Shuang was on holidays during my trip which was well communicated beforehand  so my check in was with Fen. The place was exactly as described and pictured. It was very clean and has all the necessities for a comfortable stay. Was also conveniently located near Woolworths the supermarket and Wolli Creek train station which is surrounded by a few restaurants  cafe's and other small stores. Would definitely recommend Shuang's place.  "),
("2016-11-16", "12954762", "Sylvia", "I arrived much later than expected after a delay  however Shuang's mother was extremely welcoming and helpful  the room is absolutely immaculate and ideal for easy access to the airport.Thank you!"),
("2016-11-18", "12954762", "Lauren", "Awesome spot to stay near the airport. It's about a 5 minute cab ride to the international terminal. Super super clean  and quick internet. Also  If you don't mind a quick walk (approx 7 minutes) to the train station  it only takes about 15 minutes to get downtown Sydney harbour (cost under 5$ with an opal transit card). Beautiful house  thanks for the stay! "),
("2016-11-19", "12954762", "Jakob", "Fantastische Kommunikation  Wohnung sehr neu und wie beschrieben. Würde wieder dort übernachten. Praktische Nähe zum Flughafen."),
("2016-11-22", "12954762", "Jennifer", "Very pleasant stay at Shuang's place. We needed a one night stay that was close to the airport and this fit the bill. The space is exceptionally clean and the bathroom is huge and wonderful. What was extra nice is that we were able to get some laundry done that evening. There is no dryer  but Shuang provides plenty of hanging racks and clothes pins for our 3 loads of laundry. What a relief to have such a comfy stay and 2 full suitcases of clean clothes for the duration of our trip!I would definitely stay here again for a convenient and super comfy layover at Sydney Airport. "),
("2016-11-23", "12954762", "Gareth", "Lovely little place 5-10 minute taxi ride to the International or domestic airport. 10 minute walk to Wolli Creek train station which is perfect to get to the city centre."),
("2016-11-24", "12954762", "Anthony", "Was  nice and clean and cosy"),
("2016-11-25", "12954762", "David", "Shuang's place is a really good distance from the airport  thus making it a convenient location to stay for that reason. The space was clean  and the bathroom was modern and large. Not much else to do around there  but if you're staying for the airport it's great. "),
("2016-11-26", "12954762", "Huginn", "Very quiet and tidy  we enjoyed this stay."),
("2016-11-28", "12954762", "Larry", "Truly excellent value and convenient access to airport. Was <$10 Uber to International airport  and at 1/3 the price of airport hotel. Shuang was great at communicating and the check-in/check-out process was very simple. House is clean and pretty  with big front yard and gate. While short walk from/to bus station to airport  if coming/leaving at night  do not take the bus (a bit too long of a walk at night in unfamiliar neighborhood). Apartment was very clean and tidy  but gaps in the door led to two cockroaches. Ultimately very worth the price we paid. "),
("2016-11-29", "12954762", "Joanna", "Very convenient to the airport- under $10 in an uber (less than $20 in a cab). Very new  clean and well equipped. Great bathroom and amenities. Excellent value. Very easy check in and late night arrivals catered for. Room has a small fan which is great. I would speculate it would be very warm inside in summer. "),
("2016-12-03", "12954762", "Milita", "The place is great  its modern  clean and cosy.  The bathroom is nice with great lightings. Overall  we enjoyed our stay."),
("2016-12-04", "12954762", "Allison", "The property is in prime location for access to the airport. It's very private  newly renovated and spacious. Shuang responded quickly to any communication and was very accommodating of my late check in. I appreciated how he went out of his way to make sure I had a smooth arrival. "),
("2016-12-05", "12954762", "Jack & Amy", "Clean  modern and very convenient to airport ($22 taxi from domestic terminal).  Great value for money.  Would definitely recommend."),
("2016-12-07", "12954762", "Tom", "Great stay. Very comfortable"),
("2016-12-08", "12954762", "Christina", "This is one of the cleanest Airbnbs I have ever stayed in. Moreover  despite arriving from the airport after midnight  check in was a breeze thanks to fantastic directions. The room is spacious  very private and has all the amenities one could need. Moreover  it is walking distance to the international airport. I didn't have a chance to meet the host but I would HIGHLY recommend this place especially if you are coming or leaving from the airport. Thanks for a wonderful and restful night!!"),
("2016-12-12", "12954762", "Ter Rui", "It was a good stay at Shuang's place. The location is very good. It is near to the airport and it is just a short walking distance to train station. The facilities and amenities provided at kitchen and bathroom are great too."),
("2016-12-16", "12954762", "Andrei", "Everything great. Very clean room  bathroom & kitchen  kitchen with everything needed.. no communication needed because of the code  so that check-in can be done at any time without bothering anybody."),
("2016-12-17", "12954762", "Mei Mei", "Stayed there for a night as was a pit stop for our trip to gold coast. Its basically a old garage converted into two rooms and a main room with shower and toilet shared. Very tidy and well maintained  and the show power was fantastic. great for what we was looking. Yes would book again. Thanks"),
("2016-12-22", "12954762", "Paul", "Great value. Bathroom could do with an extractor fan.Quiet.Secure.Parking easy on the street."),
("2016-12-27", "12954762", "Fabio", "Very nice and clean room/flat. Close to public transport."),
("2016-12-28", "12954762", "Cuifeng", "房间跟图片一样 离悉尼机场很近 打的10分钟不用 大约15澳元｡房间整洁干净｡到入住前shuang都给了很多指引｡到达当晚是悉尼时间10点左右 因为不熟悉路 我们是在房子对面下了车｡shuang的妈妈fen来接我们｡如果你需要在悉尼转机 这里是很不错的选择"),
("2017-01-02", "12954762", "曲", "房间跟酒店一样舒适｡生活用品十分齐全｡房东阿姨很热情 感觉像自己家一样｡还特意来接我们｡没来得及说再见｡谢谢喔 厨房卫生间跟酒店一样舒适｡谢谢"),
("2017-01-03", "12954762", "轩宇", "非常非常干净､像家一样､喜欢~"),
("2017-01-04", "12954762", "Ned", "The proximity to the airport made our life real easy..."),
("2017-01-09", "12954762", "Telshani", "It was a warm and cosy stay! Loved the place! It was soo clean! Probably the cleanest place I have ever seen.Communication was fast and good. Easy checkout and checkin.Highly recommend this place! :)"),
("2017-01-12", "12954762", "Qi", "住的地方很干净 shuang的父母很热心的帮助我们 告诉我们如何去机场!"),
("2017-01-14", "12954762", "Gabriel", "Shuang's home is very beautiful. The international terminal is in walking distance. We didn't meet the host but the communication was perfect. We can totally recommend the room :)"),
("2017-01-18", "12954762", "Tina", "place is easily accessible to public transpo  including airport. flat is very clean  homey and well equipped  including a beautiful garden. would definitely stay there again and highly recommendable. most importantly  host is very kind and accommodating."),
("2017-01-19", "12954762", "Santonia", "It's really clean and nice! Perfect for a night's stay if you get stuck at the airport and really close to the airport. No complaints and I'm usually able to find something. Would definitely stay there again."),
("2017-01-20", "12954762", "Jean-François", "Very clean with all the amenities you need. Very nice shared bathroom. Had no difficulties finding the address. Although there was a little language barrier Shaung was very nice. I had no issues checking in to the room."),
("2017-01-23", "12954762", "Daniel", "Very nice place for visitors. Fen is very friendly  and the house is the same clean and tidy as hotel  strongly recommend living here if you travel to Sydney."),
("2017-01-30", "12954762", "Francesca", "Ver clean and comfortable room. Kitchen great as is modern bathroom. Great location for access to the airport. Highly recommend."),
("2017-01-31", "12954762", "Shirlee", "Arrange for transportation  my Uber App would not work so I payed $50 one way into Sydney.  That is not Shaun""s fault."),
("2017-02-01", "12954762", "Eline", "Good place if you need to be close to the airport. Just lock all doors well and watch you stuff (the kid next door stole my phone  but eventually got it back)."),
("2017-02-04", "12954762", "Jeremy", "Had a 3 night stay at Shuang's place while in Sydney over the weekend. It was quite close to the airport ($17 Uber ride from the domestic and would be less from the International). And it is about a 10-15 minute walk to WolliCreek Station.The place was clean and had everything I needed for my short stay. Shuang was quick to reply to my queries.Great place to stay for a short stopever in Sydney."),
("2017-02-06", "12954762", "铭杰", "不错 离机场近 打车就5分钟"),
("2017-02-08", "12954762", "Jessica", "Very easy to get in and out and close to the airport but about 20 minutes from the city without traffic. Spacious room and nice bathroom"),
("2017-02-09", "12954762", "Lauren", "Great room at a great price!"),
("2017-02-12", "12954762", "정훈", "perpect"),
("2017-02-13", "12954762", "Christian", "All as described  prompt response  highly recommended. "),
("2017-02-14", "12954762", "Jon", "Todo perfecto  muy cerca del aeropuerto. Recomendable."),
("2017-02-15", "12954762", "Lirong", "close to the airport  well equipped  clean and spacious. The communication was great  quick response."),
("2017-02-17", "12954762", "Holly-Ann", "Very comfortable"),
("2017-02-20", "12954762", "Li", "房子离机场很近 转机很好的选择｡房东人很nice 帮忙叫了出租车 其实走路也就15分钟｡房子很干净｡"),
("2017-02-21", "12954762", "Lois", "GREAT place to stay. You could actually walk to intl airport if are backpacking. Bathroom and shower spotless along with room. Food and train about 5 blocks away. Recommend this to anyone"),
("2017-02-22", "12954762", "선호", "Great  great house. I absolutely recommend this house to you. Very clean and well organized house. It is almost 4or5star hotel just without lobby. Fast wifi but only if you want to cook  you might feel a bit uncomfortable. Except it  Perfect!"),
("2017-02-23", "12954762", "Larry", "Very close to airport and clean.  Great value."),
("2017-02-26", "12954762", "Yoon", "very close to the airport! the room was clean and cozy to stay. You can find the house to find easily."),
("2017-03-02", "12954762", "Satya", "This is very nice place to stay. close to Sydney international airport. Clean room. highly recommend to stay."),
("2017-03-03", "12954762", "Gonçalo", "The place is really nice and clean! It was just what we needed for our last night in Sydney. The area seemed also quiet and relaxing! It is a very good option for you! The contact and checkin with shuang was really easy and they were really helpful. We do recommend the place!"),
("2017-03-06", "12954762", "유진", "It was convenient because it was very close to the airport. It also approached the city. It was a clean and comfortable (Website hidden by Airbnb) is a very satisfactory place."),
("2017-03-07", "12954762", "Heike", "Great location  nice and clean  looks exactly like the pictures. "),
("2017-03-08", "12954762", "Chika", "Very clean and nice room!"),
("2017-03-09", "12954762", "Ben", "Very clean  quiet and very close to the airport. Woolworths was a short walk away. Very happy here."),
("2017-03-10", "12954762", "Ke", "地方很好找 而且附近走下有这个小的商业区 里面有餐饮 也有适合的商店可以购买商品邮寄 铁路口附近有个woolworths购买东西也很方便 房间内很干净 也贴心的准备了去机场的路线 推荐要赶早班飞机的亲!"),
("2017-03-18", "12954762", "Gustavo", "Nice place  all great  very clean  good communication. I recommend this place"),
("2017-03-21", "12954762", "Liz", "I stayed at Shaung's place for one night during a long layover in Sydney. The room was clean  near the airport  well-updated and exactly as his description said it should be. The neighborhood was quiet and I was easily able to catch an uber to and from the airport from there. I had a little trouble getting into the place because of a miscommunication through the airbnb app (not Shaung's fault) and Shaung took care of the problem within minutes of me contacting him online! I would definitely stay here again. "),
("2017-03-22", "12954762", "Martin", "Amen!"),
("2017-03-23", "12954762", "Dennis", "Great place close to the airport. It was a great rest stop before my flight out of the country."),
("2017-03-24", "12954762", "骁睿", "Good transfer point for passengers heading for an early fight at international airport"),
("2017-03-26", "12954762", "晓阳", "一来就给我们两张公交卡说出行方便 卡里有余额 但不多 人特别好"),
("2017-03-29", "12954762", "丽欣", "位置很方便 tram下车走路20分钟 tram叫wolii creek 周围有很多餐馆 中餐馆推荐顾家生煎｡shuang的妈妈人很好 房间也特别干净 非常满意!"),
("2017-03-30", "12954762", "Mary And Mark", "Very convenient located near Sydney airport. Great if you need a place to stay overnight. Definitely would recommend!"),
("2017-03-31", "12954762", "Xiaojun", "The room is clear and tidy. In addition  the hosts are very nice. Shuang answered questions very quickly and detail. Fen was friendly and helped me a lot. I had great time here. =)"),
("2017-04-03", "12954762", "程", "离机场近 也很好找 为赶早班飞机住这里还不错 但房间较小 只有一个小窗 相对来说性价比就不是那么高｡"),
("2017-04-05", "12954762", "Maureen", "Very good place to catch a plane. Walking distance from the airport and big supermarket nearby.The appartment is really clean and very comfortable :)"),
("2017-04-07", "12954762", "Goya", "抱歉評論晚了 Host阿姨人非常地好 那是我到Sydney的第一天 隔壁住了一對夫妻 非常熱心 給我喝了他們的咖啡 還帶我去了火車站 他們家的房子很大很漂亮 廚房和洗手間都很乾淨 總之是一次很愉快的住宿｡"),
("2017-04-07", "12954762", "Shanee", "A great location for a quick stop over in Sydney before an international flight. An easy check in and check out that accommodated my super early morning check out time. And a great shower. Thanks!"),
("2017-04-09", "12954762", "Carol", "离机场很近 性价比高 房间很干净舒适 房东阿姨人很好 看我一个人打车较贵 带我步行去机场 非常感谢 下次去悉尼还会再住这里"),
("2017-04-11", "12954762", "雯", "东西都特别齐全 很用心 而且房间收拾得特别干净 入住和退房程序都很简单易懂还不会打扰到主人"),
("2017-04-12", "12954762", "Lisa", "Very clean  nice room. Accommodated our early check in request and was very responsive to our questions. "),
("2017-04-13", "12954762", "Ben", "A great stay as always...thank you"),
("2017-04-14", "12954762", "Mir", "Awesome place to stay if you're traveling from or to the Sydney airport. I liked the place. Excellent. Clean and very professional."),
("2017-04-17", "12954762", "Aya", "It was such a beautiful room. Very clean and comfortable."),
("2017-04-21", "12954762", "绍炜", "环境很整洁 但是需要共用浴室｡ Fen 很热情  总体来说是非常棒的体验"),
("2017-04-22", "12954762", "Lu", "Clean place  a bit small but good value for the money"),
("2017-04-24", "12954762", "Aniruddh", "Clean  convenient stay  close to international airport."),
("2017-04-24", "12954762", "Amy", "Great location if needing an early flight from Sydney airport or arriving from a late flight.In residential area  huge Woolworths and Dan Murphy's liquor store only few hundred metres. Bed reasonably comfortable  office desk and plenty of charge points for devices.Excellent instructions provided  able to gain keys and entry without any assistance which was fantastic.3km to nearby bay St and plenty of restaurants Bathroom well equipped  excellent shower pressure and heat  washing machine also available.You do share shower & kitchen/small living area with another guest if both rooms booked.Could have used a vacuum prior to stay  hairs on floors.Otherwise felt clean  smell and feel though almost like little too much product!Kitchenette  small hot plate  fridge  jug and toaster."),
("2017-04-27", "12954762", "Justine", "A great place within a 20 minute walk to the international terminal. There was some construction near the airport  but plenty of signage directing me to the terminal. Check-in/check-out was very easy and the place was immaculate. "),
("2017-04-27", "12954762", "Phil", "Perfect place to stay. Lovely apartment - highly recommended. Extremely helpful and responsive hosts."),
("2017-04-28", "12954762", "Chloe", "Good for stay close to airport"),
("2017-04-29", "12954762", "匠", "とても静かな地域で過ごしやすいです!少し歩けば大きいｽｰﾊﾟｰもあります!隣の部屋の音が少し聞こえてしまいますが､それが問題なければとても素晴らしい場所です!"),
("2017-05-01", "12954762", "Sheila", "Shuang's place is ideal for a layover in Sydney.  It is within walking distance to the international terminal at the airport as well as close to shopping and transit. Very clean unit and comfortable bed."),
("2017-05-03", "12954762", "Asim", "Good place to stay near airport  had good experience.Newly built facility  with all the required amenities would love to use again."),
("2017-05-06", "12954762", "Federico", "Host preciso nelle indicazioni. Camera semplice ma posizione ottima per vicinanza aeroporto se di passaggio."),
("2017-05-06", "12954762", "Leonor", "The place is perfect if you have to pick up an early flight. Just like 10 minutes drive from/to the airport  both international & domestic terminals  a taxi is around $24. They have all you need and the place is pretty independent."),
("2017-05-10", "12954762", "Mike", "Very nice and cozy. Newly built rooms with modern designs. A 15min walk to train and bus stations. 10mins taxi to the airport. Exactly as described. Good communication thru massaging by the host. Will definitely book again."),
("2017-05-12", "12954762", "Sooyeon", "저렴하고 공항이랑도 가까운 가성비 좋은 숙소입니다 :)"),
("2017-05-15", "12954762", "Cameron", "We only stayed one night at Shuang's place but the room is in immaculate condition and is sparkling clean. Location to international terminal is great  took us 15 mins to walk. Bathroom is superb  and privacy is also great. Shuang was welcoming and kind when we arrived- thank you for the great stay! "),
("2017-05-16", "12954762", "은영", "숙소는 깔끔하고 좋았습니다 하지만 공항에서 생각보다 멀어서 짐이많으시면 가기 힘들것같아요"),
("2017-05-18", "12954762", "Jonathan", "Great place to stay before you fly out of Sydney. It is really close to the airport  very convenient and good value! We would definitely come back again.  "),
("2017-05-20", "12954762", "Abbas", "This was my first time with Airbnb and I needed a room near Sydney airport. Luckily I found a room at Shuang's place. The place looked almost newly built  neat and clean  quite  easy chekin and checkout and it was only walking distance from Sydney international airport. It had everything I needed including kitchen and a very clean bathroom. Great value for money. I would love to stay at this place again in future."),
("2017-05-23", "12954762", "Aspalaila", "Near to public transport and airport"),
("2017-05-25", "12954762", "Amanda", "You can access this property if you arrive later in the evening as there is separate access which makes it convenient.  Clean  Tidy. "),
("2017-05-28", "12954762", "Ben", "Great little overnight stay before catching an early flight. Clean  pristine and very private. Shaung and his dad was helpful when i misinterpreted the instructions and went a little too far up the side of the house and got confused on the entry. Thanks again"),
("2017-05-28", "12954762", "伟佳", "a perfect place to stay"),
("2017-05-31", "12954762", "Daewhan And Lisa", "Shuang's place was nice and very clean! Only about ten minutes walk to a big grocery store and another five to Wolli Creek train station. $10-15 for uber from and to the airport. Highly recommend staying here!"),
("2017-06-02", "12954762", "Brigita", "Sehr sauber  ruhig und komfortabel. Und nah beim internationalen Flughafenterminal. Ich habe mich wohl gefühlt und war sehr zufrieden.  "),
("2017-06-03", "12954762", "Wenbo", "房间干净宽敞 听房东说现在是悉尼最冷的时候 但我们晚上没开电热毯也睡得很舒服｡房东人很好 知道我们第二天六点要出发去机场赶飞机 夫妇俩人开车送我们去了机场 从住处到国际机场很近｡另外 房东是中国人哦 所以我们沟通起来比较方便｡下次去悉尼 还会选择入住的｡"),
("2017-06-04", "12954762", "David", "非常棒的地理位置 可以直接走着去机场｡房间也非常干净 一尘不染｡shuang的妈妈会流利的中文 交流方便｡推荐!"),
("2017-06-08", "12954762", "Gavin", "The space is in a secluded quiet street. The description is accurate. Wi fi is good. Room is good and well equipped. TV in main area only. Bathroom well equipped. The other guests were a little messy and noisy but that's not the hosts fault. About 900 metres to Wolli Creek station and about 800 metres to restaurants."),
("2017-06-12", "12954762", "Caner", "Value for money. You get what you paid for."),
("2017-06-15", "12954762", "琦", "Nice place!Near International Airport."),
("2017-06-17", "12954762", "Gaurav", "The place is very close to the Airport and is great for someone who needs to stay closest to the airport. Shuang and his mom and very helpful and caring. The place is very clean and tidy. I would highly recommend this to anyone"),
("2017-06-17", "12954762", "Britta", "Really nice and cute flat close to the airport! Had a great night sleeping in a bed with heated mattress."),
("2017-06-19", "12954762", "Dee", "I booked this room because my flight was in the morning and Shuang's house is super close to the Sydney airport. All full stars  pretty clean  tidy  quiet! Good mattress hotel level bed sheet set. Even the shampoo and body wash product are of good  quality. The room is as  good as the picture shows."),
("2017-06-20", "12954762", "Mikayla", "Such a cute place to stay at!"),
("2017-06-22", "12954762", "Miell", "Tidy and nice room. The location is very close to airport  Is the best choice to for ppl taking the early airline. "),
("2017-06-23", "12954762", "Tim", "My wife and I needed a room near the airport because we had a morning flight the next day. This room had a perfect location  was within walking distance to the train station/grocery  and was very clean. The aesthetics of the room and bathroom were modern. Basic ""hotel"" amenities were provided. Shuang's instructions were very clear and everything worked as expected. Great price for a great room."),
("2017-06-23", "12954762", "Gurvan", "Contact et entrée facile  très proche de l'aéroport  quartier calme et appartement propreParfait pour une nuit avant ou après un vol!  "),
("2017-06-25", "12954762", "Pierre Antoine", "Nice  place !!! no noise  clean  modern  nice kitchen and bathroom ..."),
("2017-06-28", "12954762", "Desiree Ann", "The place was really convenient since it's just 10-12 mins walk from the restos  wollies and wolli creek station.  The room was relaxing  toilet and bath are well maintained and the kitchenette was good as well. "),
("2017-06-29", "12954762", "Jiyuan", "全程自住住宿离开 非常自由 就是宿舍隔音有些差 能听到隔壁说话声 总体感觉非常好!"),
("2017-07-01", "12954762", "Meredith", "Very clean and nice accommodation. Convenient location to the airport and Wolli Creek train station. Would highly recommend!"),
("2017-07-08", "12954762", "Nina", "Awesome location if you're flying out of the international airport  Lovely hosts"),
("2017-07-10", "12954762", "Larry Xichao", "Very clean and comfortable. 5 stars!"),
("2017-07-11", "12954762", "Carlos", "The place is very nice and clean. The most valuable things is the closeness to the airport. Is perfect for people who will flight at morning."),
("2017-07-12", "12954762", "Caroline", "Great stay! very clean and modern place if you need a room close to the airport. It was easy to find and it cost me only $2 to get there by bus from the airport! A Woolworths is only a few hundred meters away and the bus stop only a short 10 min walk."),
("2017-07-15", "12954762", "Ness", "Great hospitality  helpful and kind host  very clean  highly likeable place! "),
("2017-07-16", "12954762", "Dimas", "I highly recommend this place. This is one of the most well organised airbnb I have ever stayed in. I did not get to see Shuang but the instructions given were clear  the room and the facilities are well maintained  and the house is only 12 minutes walk from the train station  shops  restaurant and supermarket."),
("2017-07-16", "12954762", "Josh", "Easy access and exit  room ok  clean etc. Probably would have put small tv in each room rather than large one in kitchen as chairs in kitchen not comfortable to sit on to watch tv. This would allow for different guests to watch there own programs. Otherwise  not bad."),
("2017-07-18", "12954762", "Jet", "Nice and clean!"),
("2017-07-19", "12954762", "Vince", "The accommodation is within close proximity to Arncliffe rail station and very near taxi ride to the airport which is very handy. The premises and fixture and amenities are very clean and tidy and I would recommend this for anyone travelling thru. Very quite Street away from traffic noise.RegardsVince (Newcastle)"),
("2017-07-20", "12954762", "Nancie", "Perfect set up! Amazing stay! Clean  private  quiet and easy to access. I would definitely stay there again if I ever go back to Sydney"),
("2017-07-21", "12954762", "Lloyd", "Excellent and convenient stay."),
("2017-07-23", "12954762", "Werner", "Great location  clean  comfortable   great host! "),
("2017-07-25", "12954762", "Rika", "Shuang's place is very clean and organized. We didnt meet him during the stay  but he responded our inquiry in time. The place is walkable to train station where you can find a shopping centre with lots of restaurants and shops. We only need 10 min to reach international airport by car."),
("2017-07-27", "12954762", "Ji Hyeon", "Nice place"),
("2017-07-27", "12954762", "Prell", "The room is very clean. Location is very close to the airport. 15 mins walk to arncliff rail station. A quite neighborhood. Everything are well provided  utensils  etc. Washing machine is a plus. The detergent is provided as well  so doing your laundry is not a problem. "),
("2017-07-30", "12954762", "Alan", "My second time staying here  great value  very clean and quiet. I will definitely be staying here more. "),
("2017-08-01", "12954762", "Ji Hyeon", "Nice place!!"),
("2017-08-02", "12954762", "Dana", "Great place! Exactly what I expected. Easy access to airport via train or walk!"),
("2017-08-04", "12954762", "Gregory", "Very clean and quiet Shuang was prompt and polite. The location is an easy walk to the international. You share the common area and amenities with another double room  but not a problem"),
("2017-08-06", "12954762", "Thea Bernadine", "Very nice  quiet place. So close to the airport."),
("2017-08-08", "12954762", "蕾", "出入方便 住房整洁是个不错的选择"),
("2017-08-09", "12954762", "Risa", "空港からとても近いので､早朝の便などの方にはお勧めです｡"),
("2017-08-10", "12954762", "Nuch", "So clean  warm  good smell.Close to the airport."),
("2017-08-12", "12954762", "Richard", "Nice and convenient 10-15 minute walk from international airport."),
("2017-08-13", "12954762", "Yik Rioli Barry", "Very great location ! Will definitely stay here again!"),
("2017-08-14", "12954762", "Stefanie", "Shuang's place is beautiful! The room and bathroom are a substantial size and extremely clean. The comforter is SO comfortable! Shuang was also very prompt with providing directions and instructions immediately after booking and responded quickly thereafter. The Arncliffe train station is only a 10 minute walk and his place is conveniently located minutes from the airport. We stayed here due to an early  flight in the morning. This is a shared space with another Airbnb guest. Both rooms have private access and the door locks for extra security which gave us piece of mind. Overall great stay and highly recommended!"),
("2017-08-15", "12954762", "Lauren", "This was a short one night stay in between flights and the location was perfect for this. It's modern  clean  and close to Wolli Creek station where there's lots of eateries. I would stay here again."),
("2017-08-17", "12954762", "주희", "It was a nice place to enjoy Sydney.1. I met a momther of the host and she was really kind. I arrived at the house quite earlier before the check-in time and it was very chilly  but she allowed me to come in and let me store the luggage. I really appreciate it. 2. Especially what I like most is the cleanliness which is the most important thing to me. It was neat enough. The house is small but there are everything I need.3. The location is not bad as well. I used a taxi about 4 am to go to the domestic terminal and it costed about 2 dollars. It is located in the suburb  but it's not that far to get to the city. I walked 10-15 minutes to the train station and it took about 20 minutes to the city. There is also a bus stop nearby.I am worried if I didn't leave your house clean. I was in urgent situation to go to the airport  so I would apologize it if it offended you."),
("2017-08-18", "12954762", "Milena", "Shuang's place is exactly as described. It is a very convenient place to stay if you need to have a sleep over near Sydney airport. Communication was great  the room and shared areas are good and the shower was awesome! I was able to walk to the international airport this morning.Thanks Shuang for receiving me at your place! I will definitely return and recommend to friends"),
("2017-08-19", "12954762", "Tanya", "Very clean and 5 minutes away from airport! You share a wall with a neighbor but if they're quiet you don't hear anything! Comk"),
("2017-08-19", "12954762", "David", "Very convenientVery cleanGood stay"),
("2017-08-24", "12954762", "Lyee", "First time staying at airbnb. I got off at the wrong bus stop  Shuang's parents fetched me to their home. The room is as showed. Cozy room. Comfy bed.Walking distance to Sydney airport."),
("2017-08-25", "12954762", "莉", "房东妈妈很好 有问必答 房间虽小但很温馨 冬天悉尼冷 有电热毯｡位置很安静 离大超市走路8分钟｡"),
("2017-08-26", "12954762", "Dean", "The place was close to the airport and the check-in was easy in that you could get in at odd hours. Very convenient if you need to stay the night and need to get to the airport early in the am. All the essentials were provided including an iron. You potentially need to share the bathroom and kitchen if there is another tenant in the next room. it didnt matter to me as i only stayed the night. Would stay again in the future if i was making a short stop in sydney."),
("2017-08-26", "12954762", "甘", "very convenience to airport"),
("2017-08-30", "12954762", "Vera", "我们短暂停留了两天 因为回国时间较早 这里离机场很近 拎着两个大箱子走路也就30分钟 房间十分干净 是自助入住 房东人很亲切 房东妈妈也很热心地为我们指路 周围很安静 可以走路到附近的便利店和超市 入住体验非常好｡"),
("2017-09-01", "12954762", "Noa", "Parfait pour une nuit entre deux vols. PropreHôte disponible et serviable."),
("2017-09-02", "12954762", "Chou", "很不错的小房间 干净整洁 不小心反锁了 房东夜里过来给我开门 很感动"),
("2017-09-04", "12954762", "Abby", "Location is easy to find - near Woolies and 7E. Room is super clean and comfortable! 15 mins walk from Wolli Creek stn with some climb up the hill so expect some delay if youre bringing big luggage! Room on ground floor - which is super convenient. Took uber to airport instead of walking as I have huge luggage with me."),
("2017-09-08", "12954762", "Yu", "Close to train station  market and some restaurants. Walkable distance to Airport. Neighbors are a bit noisy but we did no better  either  because we can hear almost everything through the thin wall. The host are really nice."),
("2017-09-10", "12954762", "Ria", "Nice room with full amenities! Recommend to those who need to catch a flight in the morning"),
("2017-09-14", "12954762", "Kaoru", "Shuang's place was super clean and convenience to go to airport."),
("2017-09-15", "12954762", "Katherine", "L'hôte est disponible et hyper rapide pour répondre à nos nombreuses questions. L'endroit est plus que parfait pour un transit près de l'aéroport. La chambre et les lieux sont d'une propreté irréprochable. L'équipement de base pour cuisiner est bien pensé. Un grand merci aux parents de l'hôte qui sont venus nous aider. Un grand merci pour tout !"),
("2017-09-16", "12954762", "Alan", "Another fantastic stay and I can now confirm it is only a 25 minute walk (with luggage) to the international terminal  the walk is safe and follows a brand new walkway for about half the distance."),
("2017-09-18", "12954762", "Jianjin", "帮朋友订的 朋友说房东人超好 很热情 棒棒哒!!"),
("2017-09-20", "12954762", "Renee", "房东妈妈人特别好 有问必答 因为第二天要赶早班机 房东妈妈还特地提前一天指引我们如何去机场 对我们特别照顾｡自助入住的形式 日常设施用品齐全｡地理位置距离火车站和超市都很近 附近还有很多餐厅 有公车可以到悉尼歌剧院 出行方便｡距离机场30分钟步行 适合第二天赶早班机的旅客｡很棒的一次住宿体验 :)"),
("2017-09-26", "12954762", "Mikhail", "Third stay at Shuang's place. As always  easy 20-min walk from the International terminal (with luggage)  smooth check-in  clean  and quiet. Cookies are a very nice touch! Thanks again!!"),
("2017-09-27", "12954762", "Kelly", "Nearby to airport (we were able to walk to the international)  clean and tidy and flexibility with checkin "),
("2017-09-27", "12954762", "Bella", "very nice"),
("2017-09-29", "12954762", "Zhou", "房东的妈妈非要热情 很晚了还给我们开门"),
("2017-10-04", "12954762", "康佳", "很好的体验"),
("2017-10-04", "12954762", "琛", "Lovely house and room  very clean and cozy. Strongly recommended. Btw  Shuang’ mum is very nice and helpful."),
("2017-10-10", "12954762", "新宝", "位置离机场很近 很方便走过去即可｡房东热情周到耐心｡去市中心歌剧院都很方便｡房间整洁东西齐全 性价比高｡非常赞"),
("2017-10-14", "12954762", "Richy", "Perfect place for convenience to the Airport. As advertised  great communication. Thanks!"),
("2017-10-18", "12954762", "Elizabeth", "This place is awesome for anyone who has a layover in Sydney and needs a place near the airport. It’s so pretty and super super clean. It’s also quiet and has everything you need. One of my favorite AirBNB experiences so far!"),
("2017-10-22", "12954762", "Xue", "房东很好 抵达悉尼当日是雨天儿 在bnb上跟房东简单沟通了下从悉尼国内机场坐400路车去民宿 没曾想下bus后没走多久 房东开车来接我了｡下着雨独自拉着大箱子在陌生的街上走有人能帮把手瞬间能感到温暖｡很快到达民宿 房屋很干净 室内设施一应俱全 周边有超市 离Wolli Greek 火车站较近 随后两天出行都是坐火车去市中心及邦迪海滩等游玩 回国可步行至悉尼国际机场 很方便｡"),
("2017-10-25", "12954762", "Ken", "This is a beautiful  very modern space. Just like a new hotel. The location is great: a short walk to the train and shops  it took me just 16 mins to reach the international terminal. 100% would stay here again."),
("2017-10-28", "12954762", "Maria", "It is very clean and comfortable accommodation. I recommend it to those who want to find a place closed to the Sydney International Airport."),
("2017-10-29", "12954762", "Manon", "Great location  really clean and convenient! The place is really close to the airport. We arrived at the domestic airport with the bus 400 and then left by the international airport by walking 20 minutes. We also went to Sydney on the evening with the T4 at Wolli Creek (10 minutes walk) for only 6$ for a return ticket :) we were really satisfied with our stay!"),
("2017-10-29", "12954762", "Kia", "The apartment is clean and tidy! We stayed one night between two flights and it has been a good solution. We reached the airport by feet. I recommend."),
("2017-11-01", "12954762", "Waweru", "Go to place close to the airport. Stylish and easy check in."),
("2017-11-04", "12954762", "Tom", "It's sparkling clean room  feel cleaner than hotel room. I was impressed. Fully self check-in and check-out. I walked with my luggage directly from international terminal to the location  very convenient. Only 10 minutes walk to the train station and about 25 minutes ride to CBD. I enjoyed the stay."),
("2017-11-05", "12954762", "Caroline", "Shuang's place was perfect for an overnight stay before an early flight the next day. The room was clean and comfortable. The place is conveniently located close to the airport. We would happily stay again next time we're in the area."),
("2017-11-06", "12954762", "Martin", "Nice and clean  well equiped room and kitchen  shared bathroom  very easy check-in  check-out  great communication with host. Roughly 15-20 mins walking to and from the airport  less than 15 mins to trains to the central Sydney. All well! Recommended! :-)"),
("2017-11-07", "12954762", "Nahom", "Great accommodation  clean and easy access. Well organised and great location if you have a car (free parking) and well situated in the suburbs."),
("2017-11-08", "12954762", "James", "Perfect location for a stopover near the airport. Not much to choose from within walking distance  but Yan is a great little restaurant. Great find!"),
("2017-11-10", "12954762", "Ian", "V convenient location  close to shops  transport etc Its also nice & quiet!"),
("2017-11-12", "12954762", "Samuel", "Good"),
("2017-11-13", "12954762", "Justin", "Shuangs place was perfect for an overnight stay before flying out of Sydney.  Really clean and quiet."),
("2017-11-15", "12954762", "Wu", "Gd stay!! Value bnb:) highly recommended"),
("2017-11-16", "12954762", "Stefanie", "Really nice Place  Perfect if you Need the Airport next to you. The Communication  the Flat and everything was Perfect."),
("2017-11-18", "12954762", "Josahera", "I Love it...."),
("2017-11-19", "12954762", "Dengyue", "房间不错 很干净"),
("2017-11-21", "12954762", "Jessie", "Shuang是个非常细心体贴的房主 Shuang的妈妈非常勤快和热心 房间设施非常齐全 真的是很方便!"),
("2017-11-22", "12954762", "Elinor", "It's great to stay for transit ."),
("2017-11-23", "12954762", "Andre", "Alles super  sehr sehr ordentlich  super ordentlich. Top geflie§t  1a. Gepäckaufbewahrung geht aber nicht  nur mit fahrradschloss am Eingang. Der ist mit 2 Toren geschützt. Aber gut. Ansonsten parken vor der Tür gratis  Handtücher Waschmittel alles da was man brauchen könnte. Schönes Haus. Aber zu klebe Fenster. Nur 2 oben 60 cm hoch und 90 breit geschätzt unter der Decke. Sonst alles sonst 100 pro wieder für 1 bis max. 2 Nächte"),
("2017-11-24", "12954762", "Jin", "멋진 숙소입니다. 깔끔하고 한적해서 묵기 편했습니다."),
("2017-11-26", "12954762", "Penny", "Thanks for a lovely stay! Good location being so close to the airport  but if you have a suitcase I would recommend an Uber rather than walking from the train station. Nice and very clean room and bathroom with easy instructions in and out. So close to the airport with an uber that cost $10! Thanks Shuang!"),
("2017-12-01", "12954762", "Wan Wai", "Shuang and his mum are super friendly  helpful and very responsive to every enquiries. The house is super clean and tidy! Really enjoy my stay in here. Although the house a little bit far away from wolli creek station  it still a good choice to stay in shuang's house as it is located in a quiet neighbour . It takes around 5 mins walk to get to the supermarket to get what all you need. Thank you Shuang and your mum! I will defintely stay in your place again in the near future ! Cheers!"),
("2017-12-06", "12954762", "Lawrence", "Shuang’s place is really close to the airport so that makes it easy to catch an early morning flight.  Everything is nice and clean.  Walking distance to restaurants and the supermarket.  I would stay here again next time!"),
("2017-12-07", "12954762", "Ryuichi", "Very easy access to Internal airport!Highly recommend!"),
("2017-12-10", "12954762", "Juan", "Good place  very tidy and clean."),
("2017-12-10", "12954762", "Julieta", "The place was very nice and clean. I recommend this place if you have an early start to the airport."),
("2017-12-11", "12954762", "Danique", "Goed bereikbaar met bus 400 vanaf international airport. Lopend had ook zeker gekund qua afstand en als je overdag aankomt. Huis is goed te vinden door de beschrijving van verhuurder. Het is een prima kamer  licht  schoon en comfortabel bed. Badkamer ruim met fohn en wasmachine  gedeeld met 1 ander persoon. Ging bij mij erg goed."),
("2017-12-12", "12954762", "Honoka", "お部屋もきれいで快適でした｡ここにしてよかったです!"),
("2017-12-14", "12954762", "Jonathan", "Shuang  Thank you for your hospitality  I loved staying at your Airbnb. It felt like I was coming home even though I was travelling. Your directions were clear and easy to navigate  the location was brilliant as I was flying the next day very early.I encourage you to think about air-conditioning as it was a hot night when I stayed and even though the fan was excellent and with the window open (screened)  it was very comfortable  the noise from outside woke me a lot through the night. It didn’t bother me too much apart from realising how important cooling is for guests  especially if they are only really sleeping for 4-5 hours and then travelling again. Thank you and all the very best for the future. Kind regards  Jonathan"),
("2017-12-16", "12954762", "Heidi", "Easy to check in and close to the airport. We stayed the night before an international flight early the next morning and had no problems getting a quick taxi. Communication before our stay was very clear  all necessities were provided along with towels and wifi. It could have been a little clearer that there were 2 bedrooms attached to a common area and that we would be sharing with other guests - we had a bit of a surprise when we walked in!"),
("2017-12-16", "12954762", "Shelby", "Lovely place  conveniently located very close to the airport."),
("2017-12-19", "12954762", "Anmeng", "Wonderful place  very close to the airport. Beautiful house."),
("2017-12-19", "12954762", "Isabel", "Das Zimmer und das Badezimmer waren sauber  auch die Küche sah sehr gepflegt aus. Trotz unserer späten Ankunft hat alles super geklappt"),
("2017-12-20", "12954762", "HongBo", "全五星好评!一尘不染 非常的干净整洁｡街区也很安静 适合短期或长期居住 强烈推荐!"),
("2017-12-24", "12954762", "Claudia", "Shuang was very nice and helpful. He did everything to make us feel welcome. The place was nice and simple but with everything you needed. Very nice overall value for money."),
("2017-12-28", "12954762", "一远", "nice room and friendly host"),
("2017-12-29", "12954762", "Emily", "Great stop when we needed a place by the airport.  We were able to check in early and it was so helpful for our short trip!  Clean and great instructions."),
("2017-12-31", "12954762", "Thomas", "We arrived a little bit early and were able to check-in a few minutes earlier than 11am which was great. The check-in information on how to access the apartment was very clear. The apartment is generally clean with a spacious bedroom and a comfy bed. You got a supermarket not far away and on the way to the Train station  however you have to walk a little bit as it is not right around the corner."),
("2017-12-31", "12954762", "恵子", "空港へのｱｸｾｽも良く､期待以上に良かったです｡お風呂やﾄｲﾚなどすべて清潔で､おもてなしの精神を感じました｡ただ､となりの部屋が近いのであまり騒げません"),
("2018-01-02", "12954762", "拓磨", "ﾁｪｯｸｲﾝ手順もｼﾝﾌﾟﾙで､連絡に対する返事も早かった"),
("2018-01-07", "12954762", "Henry", "Very clean  fast response  good value. Thanks for a great stay."),
("2018-01-08", "12954762", "Jessica", "Great location for easy access to the airport"),
("2018-01-31", "12954762", "Rina", "I stayed for 20 days and it was great. Shuang and Hong fen were very accomodating. The place is always clean and everything was well provided from laundry detergents to some kitchen ingredients. I couldnt ask for more. The first and probably the best airbnb experience Ive had."),
("2018-02-04", "12954762", "Ajia", "Shuang的房子位于悉尼机场进城的路边 无论是到机场还是到市区都非常方便 购物也很便利｡房子布置温馨现代 干净整洁｡房东善解人意 给我们的游览提供了很多好建议和省钱小窍门｡我们回国的飞机是晚上起飞 checkout后房东很贴心地为我们保管行李 既安全又方便拿取｡十分感谢!强烈推荐!"),
("2018-02-08", "12954762", "Sarah", "房东是华人 会说普通话 所以交流很方便 Fen姨很Nice 会给我们指路｡房间设备齐全 地理位置也很好找 出了悉尼机场 延停车场的天桥直走到分岔路口再往右边的路直走就能找到公寓所在的街道 步行路程20分钟｡"),
("2018-02-11", "12954762", "Shawn", "It is great place near international airport. I love the house and garden style.Will come next time."),
("2018-02-12", "12954762", "Tobi", "Great as always  it was our second time stay at Shuang’s place. Close to Sydney Airport. We will be back"),
("2018-02-16", "12954762", "Yoshiaki", "I had no internet connection except airport free wifi but I could get to the place without big difficulty! But it is a little confusing to get to the place from the informed bus stop. I felt it was a bit scary that I had to jaywalk. All considered it was a very nice place to stay!!"),
("2018-02-17", "12954762", "Alan", "Great location close to the international airport  and wonderful room to stay."),
("2018-02-18", "12954762", "Nell", "Easy check in and nice clean room with all the facilities"),
("2018-02-19", "12954762", "Graham", "Shuang's listing is very accurate  located very close to the airport perfect for a stop between flights. His place was extremely clean and very organized."),
("2018-02-20", "12954762", "Lawson", "Good value and close to the airport! Very clean and modern. Will stay again"),
("2018-02-22", "12954762", "Lois", "Clean  convenient location. Easy to access. Comfortable"),
("2018-02-23", "12954762", "David", "you could not find a better place so clean and lovely and very close to air port i will stay there every time i go to sydney i can not phraise it enough  david"),
("2018-02-27", "12954762", "Marcos", "Super recomendable!!!"),
("2018-03-03", "12954762", "Fiona", "This was one of the nicest and cleanest Airbnb’s I’ve ever stayed in! Everything was super easy  the communication with the hosts went well and they were so helpful when I got there and checked in. They showed me around the place  which has a well equipped kitchen  a modern and very clean bathroom and everything you need for your stay is provided. The room itself was perfect for one night. It’s also spacious enough to stay with two people. This is the perfect Airbnb when you’re looking for a place close to the airport. I’d definitely recommend it!"),
("2018-03-06", "12954762", "Eric", "Shuang’s place is excellent  very convenient  clean  well maintained and comfortable  walking distance to the international airport really helped  I would definitely recommend to anyone traveling through Sydney"),
("2018-03-08", "12954762", "Maude", "L'aéroport international est a distance de marche  très accessible! Logement confortable et calme. Le train est aussi a distance de marche et dessert 2 lignes."),
("2018-03-16", "12954762", "Roshan", "A place very calm  neat and relaxing with complete privacy. Shuang is a wonderful host and has guided me right from the start and it was very convenient to travel with all the information the host provided"),
("2018-03-19", "12954762", "Shannon", "Great location for an early morning flight. Very close to the airport!"),
("2018-03-21", "12954762", "Shaoke", "入住前因为我的疏忽 选的入住人数是一名 但是房间是可以住两个人的 和房东妈妈沟通过后 多交10刀 顺利入住了｡房子离机场很近 行李不多的可以选择步行去机场｡房间很干净!贴心的准备了各种转换器｡ps:房东妈妈真的特别的热心｡"),
("2018-03-22", "12954762", "Qiaobin", "Shuang的房间非常干净整洁 靠近悉尼机场 去市内也蛮方便 性价比不错 非常抢手的一个房源 房东也很贴心 推荐｡"),
("2018-03-28", "12954762", "Ethan", "Place is near to the airport  both domestic and international. Bus stand with bus route to City is very nearby. Train station is just ~900meters. Place is kept sparkly clean."),
("2018-03-28", "12954762", "Kenneth", "To say the place was clean is just simply an understatement. Check in and check out was easy as."),
("2018-03-31", "12954762", "Alexandra", "Great location close to the airport but a touch out of the city. Very clean and clear communication from host."),
("2018-04-03", "12954762", "Tom", "Great place!"),
("2018-04-04", "12954762", "Sabrina", "Easy and uncomplicated Communication. It was nice and clean - absolute recommendable!"),
("2018-04-06", "12954762", "Uma", "I had booked Shuang’s place for my cousins and they found the place very clean  with good amenities and convenient location."),
("2018-04-18", "12954762", "Dianna", "The room looks just as pictured. The bed is super comfortable which is a bonus. Clean  spotless and two thumbs up for providing shower soap and shampoo! I would definitely stay here again if I need a place close to the airport. Thank you very much for all of your quick responses  Shuang!"),
("2018-04-23", "12954762", "Niko", "Great place. Very clean  easy checkin and out  walked to and from airport. Couldn't ask for anything  more for me 24 hour stay in Sydney."),
("2018-04-25", "12954762", "奇慧", "很漂亮的一栋粉色小楼 房间很干净 房东的回复也很及时｡不错的体验"),
("2018-04-26", "12954762", "Ami", "The place was neat and tidy. Shuang was prompt in responding to my queries. Shuang's mother was very kind in allowing me to stay for few extra hours; as my flight was not until late in the afternoon."),
("2018-04-28", "12954762", "Yan", "离机场很近 走路就可以 先上天桥再过大桥 步行十七八分钟可到｡要去市区环形码头等地方 可以走十来分钟到火车站上车直达｡这片都是住宅区 独栋小别墅 很漂亮 晚上睡觉安静｡"),
("2018-04-29", "12954762", "Shinta", "We stayed at Shuang’s apartment for 1 night and it was a great experience.  The room was clean and although we had to share bathroom with another room  we felt that we had our privacy.  Shuang is quick in responding and the house is clean and has what we needed.  Check in was very smooth.  Thank you!"),
("2018-05-01", "12954762", "Hải", "Great house ! highly recommend."),
("2018-05-03", "12954762", "Nick", "Comfortable and close to the airport."),
("2018-05-10", "12954762", "Tiffany", "Very clean and lovely place. Convenient location. Close to train station  supermarkets and restaurants. Shuang was very helpful and is a very good host. I would love to stay here again next time when I visit Sydney!"),
("2018-05-12", "12954762", "Katy", "Very clear and easy instructions for check in. Lovely clean room. Fast response from host."),
("2018-05-14", "12954762", "Jeongha", "It was perfect. There is nothing to tell about this house bad. I and my boyfriend had time at the house for 3 nights and 4 days. While staying here  we felt we were in a luxury hotel since it was very very clean and very well-organized. Before going to this house  my bf and me were unsure if this house would be real since the house or room was perfect but it was pretty cheap for its perfection. I highly recommend this house to everyone who wishes to stay around the airport (takes only 24mn by walk  20mn by bus from the airport). I love this houseeeee!!!!!"),
("2018-05-16", "12954762", "Jahnson", "地理位置非常棒 离机场超级近 步行20分钟左右就可以到达国际机场航站｡房间干净而且装修简约美观 房东很热心亲和 住宿体验很棒 赞"),
("2018-05-17", "12954762", "Joanna", "It was a great place to stay for an early flight! Excellent value for money  and lovely place."),
("2018-05-19", "12954762", "Glenn", "A nice clean space that is private. I had no problems with a late 9pm checkin. A good nights sleep was had in a comfy bed. Electric blanket was a nice touch on a cold evening."),
("2018-05-19", "12954762", "Callum", "Great location for airport travellers."),
("2018-05-21", "12954762", "Ashish", "First and foremost  amazing value for money. Sparkling clean  interiors thoughtfully done  very practical and welcoming place. The check in  checkout process was seamless too. I would highly recommend this place and would love to stay again here."),
("2018-05-26", "12954762", "Fan Fan", "Shuang房子離Wolli creek station 其實不算遠 回家前重可以去market shop  房子潔静每曰都打掃公用地方､日後再到訪悉尼一定先book shuang 房子 房子很熱賣不一定有空房"),
("2018-05-26", "12954762", "Saranya", "My son stay overnight. He mentioned that the host had great hospitality and easy to check in.  We had great experiences."),
("2018-05-27", "12954762", "Angela", "Shuang's place was lovely! Great value and conveniently located near the airport. It was very clean and check in was very easy. Even though the stay was just for one night  it felt like home already. Highly recommended and would stay again! Thanks Shuang"),
("2018-05-30", "12954762", "Ging Goi", "Good location . Cleaness"),
("2018-06-02", "12954762", "Alex", "Immaculately clean  with new modern furnishings and decor  and clear instructions. I would (and definitely tried) to stay here again! Located in what I would call the suburbs so Uber or self-driving is the best  though location is possible with a bit of walking and train/bus as instructed (or check (Hidden by Airbnb) Maps). WiFi was a saviour. It was cold at night but I discovered the heated blanket and all was alright. There is a washer but no dryer  so expect to hang dry."),
("2018-06-03", "12954762", "Liz", "Great value. Very very clean and so good if you are coming by plane or need to get to the airport."),
("2018-06-06", "12954762", "Ging Goi", "Close to airport And not far from train station and supermarket Nice and quiet streetAnd very clean room"),
("2018-06-11", "12954762", "Bernie", "都很棒 感谢"),
("2018-06-14", "12954762", "Kenny Jing Rui", "The place is nice and clean. Definitely  stay again."),
("2018-06-15", "12954762", "Kirsten", "The room was very clean and the easy check in procedure was appreciated especially arriving so late at night. Overall a convenient stay. However  the room is walking distance from the international airport.  10 to 15 minutes. It is a 18$ uber from the domestic airport. Also the room price is deceiving as it initially said 43$ a night it changed to 53$ when paying and then a cleaning and service fee was also attached bringing the room to 68$ a night  almost double from the airnb quote per night that is stated. So I was unhappy with that surprise but was desperate for a last minute room and took it. The owner seems to be a good business man however he needs to communicate the costs before hand to the customer so there are no surprises."),
("2018-06-18", "12954762", "Vanessa", "tidy and clean   within 20mins walk from the airport  very convinient. thanks!"),
("2018-06-19", "12954762", "Xiangyu", "离机场很近  非常适合赶早班机的朋友们"),
("2018-06-20", "12954762", "Jessica", "Great accommodation. Everything was clean and tidy. Shuang communicated well and the check in instructions were very clear and easy to follow. It was very easy to get to from the airport. I highly recommend and would stay again."),
("2018-06-26", "12954762", "静", "干净整洁 房东热心"),
("2018-07-03", "12954762", "Jacob", "Stylish place  great bedroom  nice bathroom. Super easy check in. 15min walk from train station  quiet street."),
("2018-07-04", "12954762", "Zohab", "Great location. very clean  and reasonably priced. wole definitely stay again."),
("2018-07-07", "12954762", "岚", "和善的房东 环境好 位置方便 走路去悉尼国际机场20分钟左右｡"),
("2018-07-08", "12954762", "Jasmine", "Stayed for one night due to proximity to airport. Clean. Easy check-in. Shower leaks a bit on floor. 7/11 close by with snacks."),
("2018-07-09", "12954762", "Sundar", "It is a very nice place to stay"),
("2018-07-11", "12954762", "Jiaqi", "fair price and great location"),
("2018-07-13", "12954762", "Abbey", "Excellent clean  convenient and safe spot to stay that is close to the airport. Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-07-30", "12954762", "Ben", "What a find! Just minutes from Kingsford Smith makes this a great place to launch from if you have an early flight  or need a sleep after a late arrival."),
("2018-08-04", "12954762", "Kyungkeun", "Very good"),
("2018-08-05", "12954762", "Liam", "great price for a stylish home"),
("2018-08-11", "12954762", "Eun Young", "출장을 왔을 때 공항과 지리적으로 무척 가까운 곳에 위치해 있다.월리 크릭역에서 한정거장만 가면 시드니 국제공항이 나온다.단 시티 여행자에게는 좀 거리가 있다.무척 청결한 숙소 상태에 감동 받았다편안하게 잘 머물다 간다"),
("2018-08-12", "12954762", "Helen", "Great setup. Will use again when flying overseas"),
("2018-08-12", "12954762", "Weiguo", "值得推荐｡距离机场很近 房东是中国人 沟通无障碍｡热情好客 房间收拾的很干净"),
("2018-08-16", "12954762", "Mingsi", "Nice place and valuable to leave for travel  not far to airport  also have the metro train to opera  besides has lots of convenient places to go  the most important I should not forget that there has a smart pretty garden."),
("2018-08-17", "12954762", "Jeanette", "This is a great location   an easy 20 minute walk to the international airport along a safe walkway.  The room is clean and comfortable with a great shower and wifi.  The bathroom is shared between two rooms  but this was no problem.  I felt very safe here.  There is a big supermarket 10 or so minutes walk away  so is a great place to stay coming from or heading off on an international flight.   Would recommend to others.  Thank-you."),
("2018-08-18", "12954762", "Chenman", "Great place!"),
("2018-08-19", "12954762", "Gail", "Shuang’s place is very convenient for international travellers as it is only a casual 20 minute walk to the Sydney International terminal and an easy walk from Wolli Creek train station with our luggage to get to .There were food shops close and we would definitely stay again when travelling overseas."),
("2018-08-20", "12954762", "Wang", "值得推荐 下次还住!"),
("2018-08-20", "12954762", "Changzhou", "Very handy to get the airport within 20minutes walking. Dot have to worry about the traffic or anything jamed on the road. Independent room and good privacy. Thanks again."),
("2018-08-28", "12954762", "Elle", "Sparkling clean bedroom  bathroom! Quiet area  extremely close to the airport  amazing hosts."),
("2018-08-30", "12954762", "Lia", "a brilliant spot for business traveller. quick walk to international airport. Will stay again."),
("2018-08-31", "12954762", "Jun", "His house is very clean and cozy. I strongly recommend his house. It's good choice for you."),
("2018-09-02", "12954762", "Rebecca", "Very clean and convenient to the airport with a short uber ride."),
("2018-09-04", "12954762", "Anneke", "Shuang’s place is perfect if you need to be close to the airport. Very clean  comfortable space. Very accommodating host. Highly recommend "),
("2018-09-05", "12954762", "Issy", "Very nice  Modern place. Very close to international airport"),
("2018-09-07", "12954762", "Alexander", "Shuangs place is absolutely perfect for folks arriving and travelling from Sydney airport. wonderfully clean. Shuang responds very quickly to questions and issues. His dad is a delight and was very helpful when a thunderstorm knocked out the power. they made me feel very welcome in Sydney!"),
("2018-09-10", "12954762", "Lidio", "Great location and fair price."),
("2018-09-12", "12954762", "Faye", "Exactly what you need for a short stay."),
("2018-09-12", "12954762", "Valentina", "If you’re looking for a great accomodation with spectacular service  look no further. This place is amazing for a short and long stay. I highly recommend it to everyone including pregnant women (as I am) who may feel starving in the middle of the night as there is a private kitchen that you can use at any time."),
("2018-09-15", "12954762", "婉婷", "房子到国际机场很方便 也很干净"),
("2018-09-17", "12954762", "Bridgette", "Clean place. Great location  very near to airport. It was exactly what I needed for my stay. Host communicated well and I found a street parking spot almost immediately."),
("2018-09-20", "12954762", "瑞珉", "房间很棒很干净 卫生间也很大 还有冰箱和厨台 下次还会住的"),
("2018-09-20", "12954762", "William", "Great locality from the International Airport  but it certainly is a little confusing getting out of the terminal and carparks  to make your way towards Shuang's place. Mind you  I arrived at night   so not being able to see clearly the surroundings  made it difficult to get away from the airport and carparks."),
("2018-09-22", "12954762", "Sheryn", "A perfect place for a short stopover!"),
("2018-09-24", "12954762", "Wayne", "The accommodation was comfortable and clean  with all essentials provided ... and very conveniently located near the airport  where I needed to be early next day.Communication was via AirBnB / SMS ... but Shuang was always available to contact and always responded promptly.   Self check-in and check-out instructions were very clear and very easy to follow.Highly recommended - especially if you are travelling to or from Sydney Airport."),
("2018-09-24", "12954762", "Indra", "accurate and fast response."),
("2018-09-27", "12954762", "Joe", "Very clean and a good location for the airport"),
("2018-09-28", "12954762", "Kerry", "Great place! Super close to the airport and great hospitality!"),
("2018-10-06", "12954762", "Puyu", "great host  very.clean room"),
("2018-10-06", "12954762", "明", "干净 整洁 性价比超级高 房东想的很周到 会推荐给其他的人"),
("2018-10-07", "12954762", "Yun", "Very comfortable and clean room. It's convenient to take an uber to international airport"),
("2018-10-09", "12954762", "励", "离国际机场非常近 我今天跟着谷歌地图走了22分钟就到了 非常适合早班飞机 房间设施齐全 整洁干净 房东人也不错 回复及时｡"),
("2018-10-11", "12954762", "Yi", "离机场近 入住顺利｡"),
("2018-10-12", "12954762", "Sue", "The room was very conveniently located near the airport with the ability to shower and crash into bed after a long flight."),
("2018-10-12", "12954762", "Hannah", "Shuang's place was perfect for our short stopover in Sydney  it was an easy short walk to Wolli Creek train station and had all we needed for a comfortable sleep. Free parking and a washing machine were additional perks! Would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-10-18", "12954762", "Kareen", "First thing I noticed was how clean the place was. There’s also a washing machine and detergent is provided so you don’t have to worry about getting your clothes cleaned up especially if you’re planning to stay a bit longer. The place is also very convenient - there’s a grocery shop and train & bus stations near the unit. Will definitely recommend this place to my friends coming over to Sydney!"),
("2018-10-19", "12954762", "Ashley", "Shuangs place was very nice. A bit of noise from the people in the room next to us and the beds. But extremely close to the airport and would recommend! Thanks!"),
("2018-10-22", "12954762", "Alexandra", "Appartement près de l’aéroport. Idéal pour un séjour d’une nuit entre deux vols. La chambre et les aires communs modernes se trouvent dans un jolie maison rose entourées de belles fleurs."),
("2018-10-24", "12954762", "Lam", "It was nicw staying at this place. everything was nice and clean outstanding our expectations"),
("2018-10-26", "12954762", "Pedro", "The good thing is location and cleanness. The location is great  near the international airport. A 10-15min walk will get you there. Also  the place was clean  and it was private. The downside was the smell. The room was really damp  with a strong smell. It was so strong  that I inly stayed there one night  but it impregnated my cloths. I would suggest increasing the ventilation of the space  or get a dehumidifier."),
("2018-10-27", "12954762", "Gloria", "We needed a place to stay for 1 night between flights. This place was close enough to walk to from the airport. Bed was fine but the bathroom could be better. Bath gets wet everywhere easily so a bit hazardous when leaving the bathroom because floors are glossy and slick outside the bathroom. Also every room has an odd small step so be careful. This place served our purpose but I wouldn't necessarily do it for a longer stay."),
("2018-10-31", "12954762", "Tommy", "Good little place. $15 uber to the airport. 600. Walk to Woolworths. Good tidy place."),
("2018-11-01", "12954762", "Corey", "This is a very basic room in the downstairs apartment of a nice home. It's very no-frills  but for the price  hard to beat. When they say walking distance to the airport  they mean it  it's about 15 minutes on mostly bike path and you're at the terminal. I wouldn't spend a long holiday here  but for someone needing a quick  cheap place to lay your head down for an evening before an early flight  it's hard to beat."),
("2018-11-02", "12954762", "Bonnie", "Thank you Shuang. Perfect for my early morning flight. Great location and so comfortable"),
("2018-11-04", "12954762", "Indra", "Second time in here. Easy to check in  easy to park car. Will definitely come again next time. A sparkling new TV in my room."),
("2018-11-06", "12954762", "朱", "国际机场就十几分钟到二十分钟步行时间 热情的房主人带着我们走到主路指明方^_^回复也是能在第一时间解决到我的问题｡走几分钟可以走到大型超市 晚上11点才关门 附近还有一个小小堂人街 大概有6到7家的中餐馆｡家里整洁干净｡主要离机场近｡"),
("2018-11-07", "12954762", "Hannah", "Place was very close to the airport. Would recommend if needing somewhere to stay before an early flight the next day"),
("2018-11-08", "12954762", "Stacey", "Lovely room/s. Great shower very quiet location great if you need to sleep."),
("2018-11-09", "12954762", "Ruo Wen", "我自己也是澳洲留学几年了 经常出去玩 住过不少的宾馆和民俗 但是感觉shuang是最棒的一家!!冲鸭!!!"),
("2018-11-10", "12954762", "YenChew", "this room is simplistic but has everything i need  great for short-staying and those who have early morning flight in the next day"),
("2018-11-11", "12954762", "Danae", "Shuang’s Airbnb was incredibly clean and tidy  $10 Uber to the airport and he gave very clear check in and check out instructions which made my stay super easy! I’m fussy with how clean I like things and I like to keep to myself but neither were a problem at all here. Walk from the train station was a bit further than I’d thought but overall a great host and Airbnb!"),
("2018-11-13", "12954762", "Nemo", "Very good"),
("2018-11-14", "12954762", "Sienna", "Near (Website hidden by Airbnb) and considerate~~"),
("2018-11-14", "12954762", "Kelly", "Great simple place to stay for traveling in/out of the Sydney airport. Self check in was easy."),
("2018-11-17", "12954762", "성호", "Everything is fine except that electricity is suddenly out at night. It did came back ours later  but I dont't like that experience."),
("2018-11-19", "12954762", "Kelsey", "Great spot if you have an early plane ride to catch! 10/10 would stay there again"),
("2018-11-20", "12954762", "Seto", "Feel very private for a private room Airbnb. Clean and everything as described. Will definitely return :)"),
("2018-11-22", "12954762", "Jamie", "The place was really close to the airport which is so convenient. Check in was easy and the place was so clean. We really enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-11-24", "12954762", "Melinda", "Nice place  super convenient to the airport."),
("2018-11-25", "12954762", "Charles", "Conveniently located next to Sydney International Terminal."),
("2018-11-27", "12954762", "Hannah", "Shuang's space is beautiful  quiet  clean  and so so relaxing. Only 4 minutes from the airport  by car. Plenty of street parking. Highly recommend to either explore the delicious food in the area or to rest before a flight!"),
("2018-11-27", "12954762", "Ash", "Very Clean and tidy place. Great communication. Will use again and again."),
("2018-11-29", "12954762", "涼加", "The apartment was really clean and close to the Sydney airport  it was 20 minutes walk. One of the things that we struggled was the use of stove. The stove was locked for the safety reason and we had to unlock it  which we didn’t know how to. But the response by the host was really quick and they came and helped us!"),
("2018-11-30", "12954762", "Siying", "Shuang’s place is sparkling clean and has all amenities that you would have. Check in is super easy without bothering the host or other guests. The suburbs is quiet and close to the airport (10mins walking to the railway station then only one stop from there.. should be cheaper taking Uber to get there).Thanks Shuang for hosting me! Would love to stay at your place next time!"),
("2018-12-01", "12954762", "Emily", "单间的设计比较简约 附近有一个7/11｡步行大概5分钟｡但是离机场比较近 打车大概20A$｡共享的洗手间空间还是蛮大的｡"),
("2018-12-02", "12954762", "Hay-Lee", "Great place to stay for catching a flight the next day"),
("2018-12-04", "12954762", "Rosalind", "Shuang and Hongfen were gracious and thoughtful hosts. Descriptive instructions made check in easy. The room was clean and comfortable  and very conveniently located near the international airport terminal."),
("2018-12-06", "12954762", "Annelise", "We enjoyed our stay with Shuang  it was so convenient to be close to the airport. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-12-08", "12954762", "Meredith", "We had a lovely stay at Shuang’s place. We chose Shuang’s place for its proximity to the airport. Airport is within walking distance and there is a train station to the city only a few minutes away. Overall happy with our short stay!"),
("2018-12-09", "12954762", "R.A.", "Awesome host. Highly recommended"),
("2018-12-10", "12954762", "Robert", "Great place to stay if you wanna be close to the airport. We walked there without any problems. Highly recommended."),
("2018-12-11", "12954762", "Camilla", "We had a lovely time at Shuang's place. Everything was as we expected and more. It was nice and clean  and we had no trouble at all during our short stay there. If we need a place in the area some time in the future  I will definitely check if Shuang's place is available."),
("2018-12-12", "12954762", "Jason", "Super clean  spacious  good internet and perfect position to transfer at the terminal 1"),
("2018-12-13", "12954762", "Tarley", "Convenient location near the airport and super fast and efficient communication. The place itself is very simple/straight forward and easy to self check-in 24hrs a day."),
("2018-12-15", "12954762", "Frederik", "Exactly as described. Clean  comfortable and in close proximity to the airport. Would recommend for a short SYD stopover."),
("2018-12-16", "12954762", "Charles", "This is very convenient location for the airport and  with Wolli Creek station only a 10 minute walk away  the city too. Comfortable bed  great shower  (and washing machine if needed). Perfect for my overnight stay. Thanks Schuang and see you on a future visit"),
("2018-12-21", "12954762", "Yan", "位置距离悉尼国际机场T1航站楼很近可直接不行 从市中心坐火车到站距离房子有点距离 当天还下暴雨可打uber｡到达房间由于窗户没有关上 暴雨都通过窗户灌进打湿床铺 及时与房东沟通并改换了床上用品｡"),
("2018-12-22", "12954762", "Marvin", "Shuang's place is really nice. I liked the interiors. The bed is comfortable. Bedroom and bathroom are clean."),
("2018-12-29", "12954762", "盛", "有厨房 餐具齐全微波炉  吐司机浴室特别大 干净整洁"),
("2019-01-02", "12954762", "Shen-Hsiung", "房子整潔明亮"),
("2019-01-03", "12954762", "中峯", "I had great stay."),
("2019-01-04", "12954762", "Jaci", "Nice place very convenient to the airport."),
("2019-01-10", "12954762", "Timothy", "This was my 2nd time staying here. The room is large  clean and comfortable  which is why I came back. It's easy to get to and from the airport. Since the last time I stayed here  they have added a tv to the room so you can watch netflix  which was a great addition. I recommend this place and would stay here again next time Im in Sydney"),
("2019-01-12", "12954762", "Basma", "Lovely space to stay close to the airport"),
("2019-01-20", "12954762", "Kyoka", "It was great stay! Quiet and clean!"),
("2019-01-22", "12954762", "Rose", "Clean room  close to airport. Very convenient for an early flight! Easy self checkin system."),
("2019-01-26", "12954762", "Jake", "Everything was great! Easy check-in and Shuang provided directions that made it very easy to find the place. Super close to the airport so it was perfect for me. Added some nice touches that helped make the stay extra special."),
("2019-01-27", "12954762", "Sangram", "It's really great experience to stay at your place.We live in Sydney  so definitely we are coming again.Really appreciate it ."),
("2019-01-30", "12954762", "Derme", "Nice cool place for summer and very clean"),
("2019-02-02", "12954762", "Alex", "Easy check-in  easy communication  best location if you are coming from or going to the airport!"),
("2019-02-03", "12954762", "Yuxuan", "非常好!房东很贴心!"),
("2019-02-03", "12954762", "Brydie", "The place was spotless  well set out  comfy and had everything I needed"),
("2019-02-04", "12954762", "Timothy", "I travel on business and use Shuang's place. Very reliable and clean."),
("2019-02-06", "12954762", "Grace", "Great location for airport. Great washing facilities and flat was immaculately cleaned. Would recommend bringing some mosquito spray"),
("2019-02-07", "12954762", "Jingjing", "very nice and clean place  close to the airport. Easy to self check in. washing machine is available."),
("2019-02-09", "12954762", "Yang", "Shuang and family provide kind direction  timely communication  and very considerate. Room is clean and cozy  walking distance to int’l airport."),
("2019-02-10", "12954762", "Lois", "clean  convenient as always"),
("2019-02-14", "12954762", "Naomi", "This was a great convenient and affordable stop over before our early morning flight."),
("2019-02-16", "12954762", "Emily", "Great place  with wonderful hospitality and conveniently close to the airport!"),
("2019-02-16", "12954762", "Karolina", "Very close to the airport  walking distance really. The common area and the bedroom were all very clean  and the amenities were great. Nice big bedroom and shared bathroom  there was a fan in the bedroom as well. Would definitely stay here again."),
("2019-02-18", "12954762", "Gina", "Great thanks"),
("2019-02-19", "12954762", "Nadya", "Nice place  better than the photos."),
("2019-02-20", "12954762", "Hocheol", "다음날 일찍 비행기를 타야 해서 공항 근처에 하룻동안 예약한 숙소였는데 가격은 제가 묵었던 다른 에어비앤비와 비교해 조금 높았지만 그만큼 값어치를 하는 숙소였어요! 공항까지 캐리어 들고 걷는건 좀 부담스러워서 기차로 이동했는데 아침 9시 비행기여서 6시 남짓에 이동했음에도 불구하고 공항까지 가는 기차가 운행해서 너무 좋았구요! 주로 중국인들이 많이 거주하는 아파트 지역에 위치한 조용한 주택인데 집 자체도 너무 예쁘고 에어비앤비용 숙소도 정말 깨끗하고 잘 관리해놓으신것 같아 편안하게 묵을 수 있었습니다! 제가 묵은 에어비앤비중에 방도 가장 넓고 시설도 정말 좋았어요. 방  화장실  공용공간 등 모든게 완벽하게 구비되어 있었고 콘센트  샤워기  냉장고  TV까지 사소한것들을 잘 제공해주신 것 또한 큰 배려심을 느꼈습니다. 시내까지 접근하기는 조금 부적당한 위치이지만 공항 근처에 숙소 잡으실 일이 있으면 꼭 이 곳을 추천드립니다!!Perfect location to approach Airport and it was a best place between my Airbnbs in Sydney. All furnitures were well-prepared and clean. I think the host is always very careful about his airbnb. Highly recommended!"),
("2019-02-21", "12954762", "Ami", "Very nice place  sparkling clean  host were lovely and extremely helpful. Will definitely recommend!"),
("2019-02-23", "12954762", "Louise", "A great place close to the airport  perfect for a quick stay over or for a couple of nights."),
("2019-02-24", "12954762", "Danitza", "So good place to stay  near to airport for take an uber not very expensive. Good details in amenities and everything that you could need (as umbrella for rainy day in sydney  for example). Everything nice and clean."),
("2019-02-27", "12954762", "Bala", "非常好的房东 在入住期间给到了很大的帮助｡"),
("2019-02-28", "12954762", "Kerry", "Shuang's place is exactly as described in the listing. The check-in and check-out process is super easy  which is great for the weary traveller! Convenient location if you want to be close to the international and domestic airports  plus within walking distance to the Wolli train station. The room was clean and stylishly decorated with little touches like mints. Bed is very comfortable and I had a great nights sleep! Very important if you have an early flight the next morning. I would stay again."),
("2019-03-03", "12954762", "Paul", "Clean  tidy 2-bed granny flat type place which you get one of the rooms of (separate keys). Super close to the airport that means walking is easy (assuming no big cases)  but not under the flight path. The Train is less than 15 mins walk and has regular services straight into town.  Good cooking facilities and a nice bathroom. No AC if that matters to you  but does have a fan. Would be perfect for a city break or business meeting stay over."),
("2019-03-05", "12954762", "Zaka", "Overall the place is lovely and affordable  it is near to the airport   only $18 Uber to the airport. Best for people who need to catch a flight."),
("2016-07-21", "13333143", "MadeComfy", "We had a returning guests we couldn't accommodate for their requested period. After getting in touch with Ziggy we were very happy with communication  the guests gave good feedback about the property  we will be thinking of Ziggy's apartment whenever we can help a guest. Thanks Ziggy!"),
("2016-09-11", "13333143", "Meegan", "We really enjoyed our stay in Manly. Great location with plenty of coffee shops and resturants just down stairs and even markets on the weekend! Also close to the beach and wharf. Accommodation was just as described and pictured. Full working kitchen was a bonus. Ziggy was easy to deal with and even arranged early checkin. We would definitely choose to stay again."),
("2016-09-16", "13333143", "Tonya", "My husband and I stayed here for 2 nights and we loved it. A very clean and modern studio. The location you can't beat.  Walking distance to main streets.  The studio had a complete kitchen with everything we needed.  The check-in process was smooth.  Would definitely recommend"),
("2016-10-03", "13333143", "Keryn", "Great location  unit very clean and had everything we required"),
("2016-11-13", "13333143", "Tamara", "The Apartment is clean and modern  well equipped with nice linen and very centrally located in the heart of Manly. Ziggy welcomed us warmly when we arrived and was available to contact if needed. The location was perfect for us as it was easy to just walk to cafes or shops or the beach. We would definitely stay here again."),
("2016-11-17", "13333143", "Claire", "J ai réservé cet appart en dernière minute  tout s est très bien passeé  l appart était impeccable  propre et très bien situé au milieu de la rue commerciale. L hôte etait déjà sur les lieux quand je suis arrivée.Cependant wifi n est pas inclu dans le forfait  l hôte m a propose le wifi pour des couts supplementaires."),
("2016-12-03", "13333143", "Marc", "Ziggy is an absolute gentleman. Easy to communicate with and very flexible and happy to help. (Our flight was delayed and we didn't get in till midnight and it wasn't a problem)The apartment is perfect. Location is 10/10. Right in the middle of manly  you can walk everywhere.Will definitely come back and recommend to anyone!!"),
("2016-12-10", "13333143", "Fede", "Ziggy was a great host. We asked for an early check in so we could leave our staff and enjoy the beach  and he was really helpful.The studio is in a perfect location in Manly and had everything we needed to spend a couple of days.We hope to come back in a near future!"),
("2016-12-24", "13333143", "Judith", "Ziggy's place in Manly suited us superbly well. It is just off the Corso so was not at all noisy  it was a very secure  clean  and well appointed apartment for 2 people  close to both beaches  ferries and public transport etc.  The neighbourhood was friendly (cafe owners were OK for us to squat for an hour waiting for our transit to airport) people were helpful and we found great places to eat only minutes away. Can highly recommend Ziggy's apartment in Manly. a top spot!Jude and Brian"),
("2017-01-02", "13333143", "Linda", "The apartment is modern and well located between shops  cafes  ferry  beach and bus. Light sleepers may need ear plugs  as we found the neighboring wall a bit thin. Kitchen & bathroom brilliant  great water pressure and temperature  great air con  stove top and dishwasher.  Even has small spa bath which was lovely. Didn't use BBQ on balcony or oven but available if needed. Basic gym and pool available in apartment building. Tourist maps and booklets supplied. Wonderful home away from home."),
("2017-05-15", "13333143", "Garth", "Ziggys place is great. The location of the unit is close to cafes  shops and beach. Its clean and modern with everything you need. The kitchen was particularly well equipped for those wishing to cook for themselves. Ziggy was helpful when we needed to ask questions. We would recommend his unit to anyone wanting to stay in Manly. "),
("2017-05-23", "13333143", "Giverny", "Perfect location for anything in Sydney.  Looked exactly like the pictures.  Ziggy was very quick to reply to any questions we had. Would stay again."),
("2017-05-29", "13333143", "Jared", "Great apartment in awesome location. Perfect for a weekend away. Ziggy was very prompt with any questions."),
("2017-06-03", "13333143", "Jonathan", "Ziggy's place is excellent."),
("2017-06-15", "13333143", "Amanda", "Lovely place"),
("2017-06-18", "13333143", "Laura", "Convenient location  tidy and comfortable apartment. "),
("2017-06-22", "13333143", "Katey", "Would stay again"),
("2017-06-23", "13333143", "Trisha", "Ziggy place was in the best location  150m from the beach and the corso  500m to Manly wharf  access is on a mall so no traffic noise and so convenient. The place was well equipt  clean and professionally handled. Totally recommend it. "),
("2017-07-03", "13333143", "Troy", "Ziggy provided a great place to stay right in the centre of manly  he was also very flexible which helped out massively! "),
("2017-07-06", "13333143", "Sophie", "Close to everything  nice apartment! "),
("2017-07-08", "13333143", "Roch", "Great location. Easy and tidy"),
("2017-07-10", "13333143", "Lenny", "What a comfortable place for a gateway weekend. Strategic location  cooking friendly. We really enjoy our stay at Ziggy's :)"),
("2017-08-13", "13333143", "Martin", "A lovely apartment  right in the heart of Manly. It was clean  tidy  well appointed and provides everything  required. We were met with a very friendly welcome on arrival and shown the unit  but after that we were left undisturbed. I would happily recommend this apartment."),
("2017-08-15", "13333143", "Catherine", "perfect location right on the Corso. You can walk every where & close to bus and ferry. Clean  modern and comfortable. The host kindly drove me to a function I was attending"),
("2017-10-15", "13333143", "Sandra", "My Daughter and I spent the weekend at Ziggy's. It was so clean and central to the beach and ferry. I would highly recommend this apartment to stay in. Thanks again Ziggy."),
("2017-10-22", "13333143", "Gladys", "Great place. Close to ammenities  comfortable and spacious."),
("2017-11-07", "13333143", "Tobie", "Perfect location  comfortable  clean. A great little place to stay in the heart of Manly. I will definately like to stay again in the future."),
("2017-11-11", "13333143", "James", "Great location and the apartment was perfect for my short stay. Would definitely recommend."),
("2017-11-12", "13333143", "Candace", "Check in and communication was quick  easy and efficient. Ziggy was a great host  as well as quite accommodating to our needs.  You couldn't get closer to the beach  and the markets and ammenities around the apartment were better than expected!"),
("2017-12-10", "13333143", "H", "Great place  great location  great hosts - very responsive."),
("2018-01-18", "13333143", "Mark", "Excellent modern and clean apartment. Close to all amenities and the beach  but also peaceful at night. Great communication from Ziggy. Would recommend for anyone looking for a nice place to stay in Manly. "),
("2018-01-22", "13333143", "Colbi", "This place is amazing in Manly. I have friends who live in the area and commented about how central this place was. Ziggy was great with check-in  the apartment itself was super nice and clean. I told Ziggy  the only thing is the pull out mattress is uncomfortable so if staying with more than 2 people  you might need a mattress pad. He said he was going to look into it. It really is a beautiful spot. Would stay again."),
("2018-01-29", "13333143", "Emma", "We would 100% re-book"),
("2018-02-06", "13333143", "Alex", "Great stylish apartment within walking distance to everything that Manly has to offer. Our favourite place to relax was the balcony that received sunshine throughout the day. The service provided by Ziggy was outstanding  and we most definitely plan to stay again when visiting Manly in the future."),
("2018-03-07", "13333143", "Kim", "Great stay at Manly escape.  Ziggy is a great host.  The apartment is in a great location and very clean.  The building overall is a bit old however the apartment is updated.  The bed was a bit hard but overall we were satisfied with our stay..  location location is perfect."),
("2018-03-09", "13333143", "Elle", "Ziggy's apartment was exactly as described/represented in the pictures. Ziggy was very easy to deal with and he was very accomodating when we needed to make an amendment to our booking. The apartment was modern and very clean and the location was extremely convenient. 2min walk to the beach  5min to the wharf and surrounded by shops. I would highly recommend this listing for a couple wanting to stay in Manly."),
("2018-03-16", "13333143", "Jasmin", "Would highly recommend this place!! It’s in the center of Manly  2 min to the beach  shops and wharf from where you can catch the ferry if you want to go to the city. Very clean as well which is one of the most important things for me. Very nice balcony as well. Thank you  Ziggy!"),
("2018-03-24", "13333143", "Claire", "Great location in Manly  lovely and clean and Ziggy was very easy to deal with. Loved it and would certainly come back!"),
("2018-03-30", "13333143", "Chris", "Beautiful place within walking distance of surfing in the heart of Manly Beach. Great for 1 - 2 people  you cannot go wrong!"),
("2018-04-07", "13333143", "Laura", "Spent 7 nights at Manly Beach and loved every minute of it. The location is great - quick walk to the Corso  the beach or the ferry. There is a lot to explore just walking around. From the outside  the building could use some TLC but Ziggy’s Place is well cared for  bright and airy. The bed is comfortable  bathroom spacious and the place is clean. Lots of towels and toiletries provided  including beach towels. Enjoyed the balcony although the views aren’t that great  there isn’t much foot traffic below  except when the cafe is open but that isn’t a bother. It’s great for bird watching and we were lucky to have cockatoos and lorikeets and noisy miners come to our balcony. Enjoyed the whirlpool and did use the BBQ. Did not use the laundry $6 to wash and dry a load. Neighbors are quiet. Most of all  loved going into the city but coming back to Manly."),
("2018-04-25", "13333143", "Thomas", "This place was super clean and modern.  Loved the patio/balcony where you could see glimpses of the sea  the Corso  and the roof tops of Manly.  During the day parrots came to visit and at night the fruit bats would fly by.  Great grill for cooking meats and veggies on the patio.  The beach just a short walk away.  Snorkeling in Cabbage Tree Marine reserve is full of life with giant cuttlefish  rays  and countless fish. I've never been to a place where at sunrise SO many people were up and active with either surfing  running  swimming  kayaking  yoga  etc.... Manly is a must and this location makes you feel like you are part of something special.(Ziggy  by accident we had a towel out of the room after leaving the keys inside at checkout and hung it on the door. I hope it made its way back in.)"),
("2018-05-10", "13333143", "Leah", "Very central location  well-equipped  good value  very clean and modern."),
("2018-05-12", "13333143", "Darrin", "Ziggy's place was exactly as described in a great location. Everything manly has to offer was in walking distance. Most surprising was the smell of freshly cleaned linen when you walk in the door. 5 stars."),
("2018-05-17", "13333143", "Rowen", "Fab few days in manly. Ziggy was super responsive and helpful  location was amazing. Apartment had everything you could want for a few days"),
("2018-05-21", "13333143", "Melissa", "Central location  fabulous clean and modern space. Ziggy was a excellent host. Will definitely return!"),
("2018-05-28", "13333143", "Bochao", "Great location  easy access to beaches  food and amenities. Really enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-06-09", "13333143", "Hilary", "We loved the location  right in town and walking distance to everything. Apartment was well described  clean and comfortable. We would definitely use again. In summer the pool area would be lovely."),
("2018-06-12", "13333143", "Gerard", "Highly recommended this place Ziggy the host very friendly and gave us a very good thougher handover.Very central to all you need in Manly..will be back again one day "),
("2018-06-13", "13333143", "Jayne", "Great location fabulous apartment easy check in lovely host thankyou"),
("2018-06-16", "13333143", "Penny", "Ziggy's place is very nicely located  close to the Corso  with fresh clean facilities and amenities. "),
("2018-06-18", "13333143", "Margie", "A wonderful relaxing stay in beautiful Manly. PERFECT location  appartment and host. 5 stars!!!! "),
("2018-06-21", "13333143", "Alex", "Ziggy was responsive and very helpful. He greeted me with keys and showed me how everything worked. The apartment was very clean and in a great location."),
("2018-06-29", "13333143", "Helena", "Located right in the heart of Manly  this immaculate  nicely appointed apartment is suited to all kinds of travellers and presents great value for money. Very short walk to ferry  the beach  restaurants & bars yet surprisingly quiet. Fitted with nice  modern furnishings & conveniences  this was perfect for our 5-day stay. Ziggy was a great host with fantastic  prompt communication. Thank you for hosting us!"),
("2018-07-06", "13333143", "Stacey", "The manly escape is exactly as pictured  a very clean compact apartment. Ziggy greeted me on arrival and showed me around the building  its in a great location in Manly. I have mobility issues but i was able to walk everywhere i needed to  its minutes from the wharf and the local Hop on Hop off bus which is something i used everyday. Manly escape was the perfect base  tea and coffee were provided as well as basic pantry staples. In the bathroom Ziggy is very generous with the white fluffy towels and bathroom staples. Thank you so much for a lovely secure place to stay  loved the view from the balcony too!!"),
("2018-07-11", "13333143", "Peter", "Ziggy's place was exactly as advertised  along with a great orientation from Ziggy on our arrival.  Everything in the studio was of an excellent standard and the great location of one block off the Manly Corso and Manly surf beach was perfect.  Excellent value for money and we will book again for Manly/Sydney visits. A super host.  Peter"),
("2018-07-14", "13333143", "Leilani", "Very clean and comfortable. Great location. Host Ziggy was very accommodating. A must stay if staying in Manly"),
("2018-07-19", "13333143", "Oli", "Ziggy was really quick to respond to my calls   and helped us find parking for our car. He and his wife are amazing people to have as a host."),
("2018-07-25", "13333143", "Sandra", "Good location  small but comfortable and clean. "),
("2018-07-27", "13333143", "Peter", "Thanks for the great stay at short notice"),
("2018-07-30", "13333143", "Jen", "Great apartment  great location and parking under building is a great bonus!"),
("2018-08-02", "13333143", "Andrew", "Great location and close to cafes  restaurants etc."),
("2018-08-11", "13333143", "Thea", "Prefer not to write a review  sorry"),
("2018-08-15", "13333143", "Dave", "Ziggy's place was clean  nicely furnished and had all the amenities and services I needed  with plenty of towels  bathroom items etc. The apartment was light and airy  with good facilities and a nice balcony. The location is excellent for everything Manly has to offer. Ziggy was well organised and friendly - an excellent host and I would have no hesitation in stopping here again."),
("2018-08-19", "13333143", "Cam", "Ziggy’s place was an unreal spot in Manly  so close to the beach and in the main town you couldn’t ask for better! He was an easy host to deal with and was flexible with checking in and out. Will definitely be staying again when I’m next in Manly."),
("2018-08-25", "13333143", "Ola", "awesome place in central Manly location! highly recommended"),
("2018-08-27", "13333143", "Briana", "Everything was amazing. I have stayed here twice within one month and it was great! Ziggy was so accommodating with checking in early for a wedding I needed to attend and late check out when needed as well. I will be staying here again!"),
("2018-09-09", "13333143", "Louise", "Exceptionally clean apartment just one block from the beach with everything you could want.   The shower was awesome.  The bed was very comfortable.  It’s even possible to see the sea from the balcony.  The use of the underground car park made life very easy.  Ziggy was extremely accommodating.  A great stay.  Will be back!"),
("2018-09-11", "13333143", "Miranda", "This was a great place to stay for a couple of days chilling in Manly. Clean and comfortable with everything we needed. The location is fantastic - very close to the beach  restaurants and shops but still nice and quiet for a good night's sleep. Would recommend."),
("2018-09-14", "13333143", "Kylie", "Great communication with Ziggy. Made it all very easy. Apartment is in great central location  close to everything which was very handy. Clean and nice light. Would recommend."),
("2018-09-23", "13333143", "Laura", "Great space  great location  what more could you want!"),
("2018-10-04", "13333143", "Julia", "Ziggy’s apartment is in a fantastic position between the harbour and the beach (it even has water glimpses). Communication and check in was timely and easy. It is a very clean and spacious studio apartment. When we are back in Manly we will stay with Ziggy again."),
("2018-10-08", "13333143", "Mina", "Bright and spacious little apartment in Manly  perfect for a short stay. Ziggy and his wife were great hosts  very welcoming and helpful. The apartment is in a fantastic location. Walking distance to just about every Manly attraction."),
("2018-10-13", "13333143", "Edward", "Great place to stay in Manly - the apartment was clean and had everything we needed. Would highly recommend to others"),
("2018-10-17", "13333143", "Trang", "Great location  close to the beach and shops. Very clean and nice apartment."),
("2018-10-20", "13333143", "Fiona", "Modern clean and great location"),
("2018-10-23", "13333143", "Nina", "Fantastic value and location. Super clean and nicely redecorated. Wouldn’t hesitate to book again"),
("2018-10-26", "13333143", "Stacey", "Thanks for having us and your understanding with our delayed checking in. The accommodation was excellent and very clean  loved the extra touch of providing beach towels and soaps  shampoo etc. Will highly recommend to anyone. Thanks Stacey"),
("2018-10-29", "13333143", "Nicola", "Great location in the heart of Manly  surprisingly quiet too. Perfect for a couple  the apartment has everything you need - a home away from home."),
("2018-10-31", "13333143", "Sadik", "Great location  spacious well appointed apartment.  Top host  looking forward to returning one day."),
("2018-11-04", "13333143", "Courtney", "Outstanding location  very clean and has all the amenities needed for a great stay in Manly!"),
("2018-11-06", "13333143", "Aleis", "Clean  close to town and Ziggy is a legend"),
("2018-11-16", "13333143", "Birgit", "Central accomodation in Manly in a modern style. The apartment is on the top floor and you have a little bit of ocean view. It is very gut supplied with kitchen affairs and also different sorts of cappuccino and tea are available. All the furniture is in white and in the bed you can sleep very well. We loved it and would come here again!"),
("2018-11-17", "13333143", "Rick", "Great unit everything in it you will need. Right in the heart of Manly so no need to drive anywhere. Highly recommend to all."),
("2018-11-24", "13333143", "Terry", "This studio apartment in the centre of Manly is  modern  clean and convenient to all of Manly's attractions. The beach is only minutes away  as are the shops  the ferry and other transport. The apartment has all of the amenities you would require for an enjoyable stay."),
("2018-11-28", "13333143", "Layla", "Amazing location  so close to the ferry and even closer to the beach! Ziggy was so helpful as I needed an early check in and he was there to let me in no worries! Very clean and had everything I needed whilst being in Manly. Thank you!"),
("2018-12-06", "13333143", "Ilkka", "Awesome location and well fitted out. Thanks Ziggy."),
("2018-12-23", "13333143", "Thomas", "Ziggy’s studio is in an amazing location. You definitely can’t be more central in manly. A short walk from the beach  the ferry dock  the nightlife and all the restaurants. It’s a small-ish studio  but on on the top floor of the building and has a great and large patio. The plunge pool on the 3rd floor is very small so don’t expect a large pool...and with the beach that close  who needs a big pool!? Ziggy was great. We had another host bail on us the day we were supposed to check in  Airbnb cancelled the reservation and we were left with nowhere to stay. I booked into this new apartment and Ziggy was there  communicating and helping us find the place even though we booked the day of. Two thumbs up!"),
("2018-12-26", "13333143", "Carlo", "Amazing place  super close to the beach! Extremely clean and secure"),
("2018-12-30", "13333143", "William", "Ziggys place is excellent.. its clean  pretty modern and has all of the things you need to keep going... its on the top floor  which is nice as well... the most important thing is that it is in an excellent spot with some brilliant things at the front door... super convenient to excellent beaches or ferry transport... markets on the weekend just outside in the mall.... several great coffee shops in the area and a really great little sandwich shop just outside... i would stay again...."),
("2019-01-02", "13333143", "Jennifer", "A great spot in the heart of manly beach- close to the Main Street and a block off the beach. Ziggy’s place is spotlessly clean and he is a very attentive & accommodating host.The only negative is that the sofa bed is not too comfortable- (mattress is thin and sags in the middle) but probably fine for a small child. I highly recommend this place."),
("2019-01-18", "13333143", "Sandra", "Ziggys place is really close to the surf and lots of food outlets. Very safe and clean. Nice gym on site."),
("2019-01-19", "13333143", "Derek", "Great location and apartment."),
("2019-01-26", "13333143", "Sarah", "We had a wonderful stay at Ziggy’s place! Everything was spotless and Ziggy has thought of everything.The bed was super comfortable  the appliances and furnishings were modern and every other mod con was accounted for - even a blender <3 We already knew the pool and hot tub weren’t the star of the show  but that’s a-okay  because you are a stone’s throw from the refreshing and exciting Manly Beach!We were really sad to be leaving and hope to be back soon"),
("2019-02-03", "13333143", "Alan", "Fantastic location just off the Corso  and metres from the beach. Clean and comfortable  all as advertised."),
("2019-02-05", "13333143", "Rémi", "Great place! Exactly as advertised and Ziggy is super responsive. Highly recommend."),
("2019-02-13", "13333143", "Alex", "Great unit in a fantastic location. Was EXACTLY what we had hoped for and Ziggy was flexible in meeting us to let us check-in a few minutes early.  Wonderful stay and highly recommend!"),
("2019-02-16", "13333143", "Georgie", "Ziggy’s place was great! Very clean  quiet and fantastic location right in the center of town and minutes walk to the beach. Would stay again."),
("2016-07-18", "13437841", "Adam", "The location was very convenient  and the apartment was clean and new - perfect for my girlfriend and I. My only issue was that the sink was quite small  which made rinsing plates  pots and pans quite difficult before putting them in the dishwasher. Overall  it was a great stay  and dealing with Nicki before the stay was a pleasure. Recommended for someone who wants to stay within walking distance to the city. "),
("2017-01-05", "13437841", "Abram & Arthur", "Unit was amazing  a few small issues here and there but otherwise very well thought out and beautiful home. Would stay again. "),
("2017-01-30", "13437841", "Nancy", "Nice flat  centrally located in an elevator building. It was very easy to check in and get settled. I stayed for 3 nights while traveling for business and the listing was a great base camp in the city where I could catch up on work and sleep. Sydney was experiencing a heatwave that week and I was very thankful for the air conditioning. "),
("2017-03-16", "13437841", "Shige", "Nicki and Dave are great hosts! They always responded me in a swift manner with good solutions to all of my minor issues (including the early arrival  coffee machine repair  cleaning service question and light bulb request). I liked the apartment very much. It was convenient to do anything in the city and quiet and comfortable to sleep at night. To highlight the convenience  I want to note that the nearest supermarket is just one or two blocks away (to the north) and pubs and restaurants are also a block away (to the south). Some may worry about bugs at such location  but during my 40-day stay  I did not have any bug issues. The only possible setbacks I can think of are the tiny kitchen sink and occasional odor from outside. The kitchen sink is certainly small although this place has a dishwasher. So  for a short stay and people who do not cook very much will not have any problems. However  if you want to do dishes during your stay  you will probably find the sink space cramped. The outside smell was very occasional during my stay in a rainy summer (I think it was related to the weather). When I noticed the weird smell  I just needed to close the windows to shut it out. The AC works very well. So  it was not a big deal for me to do so. Overall  I am happy with the values and qualities I got here  and I would highly recommend this place to anybody who wants to enjoy the city activities and have good rests in the same time."),
("2017-03-20", "13437841", "Leon William", "Unfortunately very disappointed with the overall listing description which does not accurately reflect any similarities to the actual apartment at all.. 'Uptown' property management state that they offer PLATNIUM Foxtel in all their properties - in this case; the Foxtel box was present but the network connection was not. We could not even manage to watch starred TV.. & it was more frustrating to also realise that most of the Foxtel channels were not subscribed to  therefore there isn't anything PLATNIUM about this packgage! This is not a 1br  it is an older style  but externally refurbished block  there was no room to move & even if we did get the TV working  there was no chance of watching it due to the dining setting blocking the view. Please update the listing description :( "),
("2017-04-03", "13437841", "Stuart", "Great location  great place  felt really comfortable here. Would recommend to anyone staying in town for a few days"),
("2017-04-09", "13437841", "Rachel", "The check-in was really easy  a big relief as we arrived late at night. Extremely clean and had all the kitchen facilities  washer  dryer  big table (used as our working desk)  big long sofa (easily converted to an extra bed for a tall person). The bed was a bit too soft for my preference and I had body ache the next mornings. Not a problem as we are sports masseurs. Other than this  the stay was great.  "),
("2018-03-04", "13437841", "Robert", "Very modern apartment in a great location.  It's particularly convenient to Oxford St.  Lots of cute local restaurants in the area.  Easy to walk to the wharf  downtown  botanical gardens  and opera house.  The owners were immediately responsive when I had a question at check in.  Definitely recommend this apartment."),
("2018-05-21", "13437841", "Matt", "The apartment was great overall. Fantastic location in Darlinghurst  right off of Williams St  a 10 minute walk to Town Hall station. 5 minutes to Hyde Park and 10 minutes to King's Cross. The studio is very well designed  with a nice large living area and floor to ceiling windows. The furniture could use an upgrade  as the chairs are a bit shabby  but they do the job."),
("2018-07-02", "13437841", "James", "Fantastic location  5 min walk to city and surrounded by cafes  restaurants and such. Apartment fit out was very new and nice."),
("2016-08-14", "13520692", "Hooman", "We had the pleasure of meeting Marina in Ian's Absence.Ian's place was fantastic in terms of location  cleanness  hospitality  etc...Ian  and Marina were easily accessible via email and phone. The only drawback was the renovation noise from other units in the building which was out of Ian's control and knowledge.Overall  we found Ian's place a great place for travellers and would definitely recommend to anyone who has a plan to visit Sydney."),
("2016-06-21", "13442098", "Tony", "Our crew stayed here for a business trip for Supanova Popculture event. It was great  spacious and walking distance to everything. Parking was a breeze  restaurants around the area and a convenience store. You even get 10% off at the restaurants when you mention your a resident. "),
("2016-06-26", "13442098", "Sarah", "Nicole was an amazing host. The apartment was perfect and even better than the pictures. Excellent location to see a show at Sydney Olympic Park. Highly recommended"),
("2016-07-10", "13442098", "Maryjane", "From the first email to Nicole  it felt like I was talking to a friend. She was so welcoming and helpful  and responded quickly to every request. On arrival I was met at the elevator with a big smile and the key. My surprise when I walked in the door was immense! The apartment is beautifully appointed  fresh spotless linen  a bowl of fruit  chocolates  and even an array of teabags and biscuits to have with my coffee. Such a lovely surprise. It's a spacious apartment with two beautiful bathrooms and amazing views. Even a large balcony with deck chairs. This apartment truly had everything we needed. There was a chemist near the ground floor doors  and a convenience store as well; coffee shops and cafes are nearby  and an excellent DFO shopping centre nearby (within walking distance; 1.3km I think).  I recommend this apartment to you without hesitation. Thanks Nicole! We'll be back!"),
("2016-07-14", "13442098", "Jenny", "For a family of 5 the apartment was excellent with a fantastic view.   Everything you need is supplied and Nicole is a perfect host.  It is close to restaurants  public transport and sporting events. Highly recommend. "),
("2016-07-16", "13442098", "Leah", "Really nice apartment - everything was clean & comfortable!"),
("2016-07-21", "13442098", "Sco", "A great place to stay. Close to everything in Olympic Park (including being around the corner from the train station)  and a phenomenal view. From the lounge room as well as both bedrooms and balcony you can clearly see every major sporting venue. And what's better is it's only roughly a 10 min walk to any one of them  making it incredibly easy to access any one of them with ease. The apartment itself was very clean  with a modern look and feel  and had everything we needed. And whilst we didn't actually meet Nicole  her communication was excellent and she was very accommodating when we had a couple of extra guests show up at late notice wanting to stay  and she allowed us to have a late checkout.All of this for a great price.Thanks Nicole. I would definitely stay there again."),
("2016-07-23", "13442098", "Lana", "We stayed in the apartment for an even held at Qudods Bank Arena. It was the perfect location  we were able to duck out for a quick shop to the DFOs and a quick easy walk to our event. The apartment was excellent the beds were really comfy and having 2x bathrooms suited us well."),
("2016-07-27", "13442098", "Kate", "Nice touches with fresh fruit  porridge and sweets.  Not set up with cooking ingredients or milk etc.  Lovely modern unit  far better than staying at one of the nearby expensive hotels.  Lots of restaurants in walking distance.  Host was easily contactable and understanding when we left the key in the wrong mailbox."),
("2016-07-29", "13442098", "James", "Was really good staying with Nicole  whe was very easy to conect with and her housr was very clear and organized with everything I needed and well located  super happy  thanks Nicole x"),
("2016-08-01", "13442098", "Ann Marie", "Good location but no supermarkets nearby - only expensive convenience stores. There was a fire alarm on one of the days which shut down the elevator all day requiring us to climb 18 flights of stairs. Other than that we had a good stay."),
("2016-08-11", "13442098", "Jeffery", "This is a lovely 2 bedroom apartment on the 11th floor overlooking Sydney's Olympic Park. Plenty of room and nice amenities."),
("2016-08-15", "13442098", "Candace", "Definitely a great place to stay  such a beautiful apartment. Thank you so much for ur kindly host Nicole :)"),
("2016-08-20", "13442098", "Clair", "Really enjoyed our stay.  The apartment was clean and comfortable with great facilities and had everything we needed.  Very convenient location.  Host was easy to contact and deal with.  Will definitely be staying again when next in the area."),
("2016-08-24", "13442098", "Chester", "Great communication! Great location with great price! Thank you Nicole and Vicky!"),
("2016-09-06", "13442098", "Jiyoung", "Everything good^^"),
("2016-09-13", "13442098", "Rebecca", "Nicole had fantastic communication leading up to and during our stay. The apartment was much bigger than represented in the photos and was in a perfect location accessing event venues around Olympic Park. Would easily recommend and stay again... Thanks for making our trip so easy Nicole !!"),
("2016-09-19", "13442098", "Suzanne", "On entering the apartment we knew straight away we would have a great stay. There was fruit and chocolates in a little bowl  a large and after our journey from Adelaide and working out the train system to get to the apartment we were exhausted and instantly felt welcomed  exactly what we needed. We were there for the Australia Dance Festival which was exactly what Nicole had said just a short 10min walk  so fantastic for our needs. Perfect location with a couple of great places to eat a pharmacy and a convenience store just at the bottom of the apartment building.We would definitely stay again when visiting Olympic Park.Thanks Nicole!! "),
("2016-09-29", "13442098", "Ahlam", "Loved arriving to a wonderful view  top notch apartment with everything you could need on hand. It was very well kept  immaculate and well stocked with tea  coffee  basic pantry items  bathroom and laundry products.  We were 2 families staying together and needed to co-ordinate our outings as there is only one car parking key  that is the only downside. "),
("2016-10-03", "13442098", "Murray", "Apartment was really well positioned and nicely appointed. Could not fault anything during our stay and the nice touches like fresh fruit on arrival was appreciated. Thanks Nicole we will be back."),
("2016-10-09", "13442098", "Monique", "I would highly recommend this apartment. Clean  modern  comfortable and better than expected. Friendly host who spoilt us with biscuits and great communication at all time. We will be back!"),
("2016-10-14", "13442098", "Allison", "Nicole was a wonderful host and really thought of everything. We arrived to fruit  chocolates and biscuits. It was really close to the conference venue as Nicole said and a lovely bright apartment. "),
("2016-10-15", "13442098", "David", "The room was lovely and clean  smelt of freshly washed linen.Fantastic view  really comfortable space  easy walk to restaurants  good parking space and the kids loved the internet.Will recommend and stay again when we next need to come to Sydney.A great first Airbnb experience for us."),
("2016-10-23", "13442098", "Tania", "Fabulous apartment  very clean  modern and spacious. Awesome location  so close to ANZ Stadium for events. Nicole was a wonderful host providing little added touches such as fruit and chocolates. We would definitely look at staying here again."),
("2016-10-31", "13442098", "Jesse", "Very nice apartment very clean and tidy"),
("2016-11-12", "13442098", "Andrew", "My family of five found this apartment to be very comfortable and suiting our needs.  We wil stay again."),
("2016-11-28", "13442098", "Claire", "Fantastic  almost brand-new  nicely decorated  very clean  well-cared for apartment on the 18th floor.  Minutes walk to Olympic Park train station  10 mins walk to Quodos Arena.  More than enough space for 5 of us.  2 double bedrooms (one ensuite with double shower) and a comfortable sofa bed.  2 bathrooms (one with a large bath).  We were met by Vicky who gave us the keys and entry fob for the carpark.  We didn't meet Nicole  but she was in constant communication during our stay to make sure that all was well.  The apartment has fantastic views and is light and airy. Nice touches were the bowl of fruit  plate of lollies and chocolates  biscuits  milk in the fridge and teabags.  We were really impressed and would certainly recommend a stay here.  Such fantastic value compared to the hotels in the immediate vicinity."),
("2016-11-30", "13442098", "Yuxiang", "5-star everything"),
("2016-12-01", "13442098", "Heather", "I have been to Sydney Olympic Park many times for sporting activities  this apartment is an outstanding place to stay in that area.  An apartment with a stunning view  easy access to the things we wanted to do in the inner west of Sydney"),
("2016-12-02", "13442098", "Ronnie", "the place was so nice with a beautiful view. I did my wedding's Chinese tea ceremony there. Nicole was a great host. Without her understanding and support  wedding wouldn't go as smoothly. I highly recommend the place.:)"),
("2016-12-09", "13442098", "Yvonne", "Nicole was a great host. Always prompt with her responses and the apartment as well as the view was excellent. We'd like to thank Nicole for allowing us to stay the night whilst we prepared for the wedding."),
("2016-12-19", "13442098", "Estelle", "We had a great stay inNicole's apartment. Great for when attending any sporting event at SOPAC."),
("2016-12-22", "13442098", "Richard", "Very good. Came to this place on short notice (1 hour) after talking to the host. There are a number of wifi networks in the unit but the host made sure I could connect easily and everything went well. Host left fruit and chocolate too which I didn't eat but was very thoughtful! Top marks!"),
("2016-12-22", "13442098", "Sonali", "Nicole was extremely flexible when it came to check in and out times which we appreciated very much. The apparment was meticulous and well equipped. The view at night was a highlight. It's is surrounded by a multitude of world class stadiums and parks. Public transport at the doorstep and shops/restaurants in abundance."),
("2016-12-31", "13442098", "Victor", "One word. Awesome."),
("2017-01-14", "13442098", "Geoffrey", "All expectations of our accomodation were exceeded ."),
("2017-01-24", "13442098", "Myo Nyi Nyi", "Very clean and tidy place  restaurants nearby  bus stop is at the front of the building  train station is just walking distance.Very easy checking in and out  Nicole is available for contact any time and always helpful  it is value for money  will definitely stay there again."),
("2017-01-28", "13442098", "Leon", "Perfect unit for the Olympic precinct.  Nicole was a great communication and facilitated early check-in.The perfect host"),
("2017-02-08", "13442098", "Rishni", "We had a wonderful stay at Nicole's apartment. From the great communication  to the chocolates on arrival  to the excellent showers and superb views  we got great value for money. Would stay here again."),
("2017-02-11", "13442098", "Nichole", "Handy location for Olympic Park venues.  Easy to find  walking distance to everything  restaurants/cafes nearby.  Check-in process was seamless and Nicole was fantastic communicating prior and after arrival.  Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2017-02-12", "13442098", "Kirsty", "Great location if you are staying to go to a concert  restaurants under the building and can walk to the stadium.  Easy to find. "),
("2017-02-20", "13442098", "Steve", "Absolutely perfect for the purposes of two independent work colleagues attending a trade fair at Sydney Olympic Park. Clean  tidy  close. "),
("2017-03-19", "13442098", "Mike", "Apartment was perfect for what we wanted.  Nice and clean.  Parking downstairs.  Nicole was great with communications and check in etc.Definitely recommended!"),
("2017-04-01", "13442098", "Linda", "Close to all amenities  Sydney Olympic Park stadium.Comfortable well stocked apartment. Even had supply of washing powder  body wash   shampoo and conditioner  very thoughtful. Fruit and chocolates on arrival too. Great communication with Nicole  check in/out was a breeze."),
("2017-04-11", "13442098", "Niaomi", "A beautiful apartment. Loved the fact that Nicole left washing powder  soap  shampoo & conditioner. She was very flexible with great communication. Would definitely recommend."),
("2017-04-19", "13442098", "Sharon", "Clean   tidy with a lot of extra care. Highly recommended "),
("2017-04-20", "13442098", "Veronica", "Nicole was really helpful.  The place was easy to find and clean.  Only one night stay.  Couldn't wash anything up because didn't have a tea towel.  The beds were wonderfully comfortable and lovely to have milk there for coffee.  The hot water was a little reluctant and the floor outside the lift was not there.  Maybe under construction.   Location is great and beautiful views.  Thank you Nicole for a great stay."),
("2017-05-02", "13442098", "Ariel", "Great location  easily accessible to Olympic park. Great communication  reliable.  Great facilities and love the extra little touches."),
("2017-05-09", "13442098", "Kate", "Definable try the Thai downstairs and Mellow Me cafe for breakfast options"),
("2017-05-13", "13442098", "Anastasia", "Wonderful place. Very easy communication. Love it"),
("2017-05-20", "13442098", "Sharna", "Thank you so much for providing an amazing place to stay! Firstly communicating with the host was so easy and quick. The apartment was better than the pictures displayed. Everything was very clean and nicely organized. The view was outstanding!! There was so much to use  plates  cups  cutlery  fresh cold water in fridge  ice in freezer  shampoo and conditioner in both bathrooms  clean towels to use  extra sheets and blankets to use for the sofa bed. What an amazing experience. Thank you again. "),
("2017-05-26", "13442098", "Randal", "Fantastic apartment. Very clean  great communication and perfect location for any event at Sydney olympic Park"),
("2017-06-08", "13442098", "Emma", "We had a great stay at Nicole's and found it incredibly accommodating."),
("2017-06-16", "13442098", "Emma", "Nicole was lovely and her place was perfect!"),
("2017-07-09", "13442098", "Rebecca", "Nicole's place was wonderful - we were in Sydney for a conference and coming home to the apartment was perfect! Comfortable  clean  modern  spacious & a great view! Will definitely be staying here again :)"),
("2017-08-07", "13442098", "Andrew", "Nicole communicates very well  the view is spectacular. Rooms were very clean would recommend to anyone."),
("2017-08-10", "13442098", "Ishu", "Simple  EasyThere are two Thai food restaurant nearby.Wine & Coffee at north street corner is a good place for breakfast."),
("2017-08-18", "13442098", "Swapnil", "Great place to stay at! Walkable distance to bus stand and Train Station!"),
("2017-08-19", "13442098", "Ngoc", "The clean apartment has well-equiped kitchen  beautiful view and strong wifi. Prompt and helpful communication. Thanks."),
("2017-08-20", "13442098", "Raiha", "Great apartment  great location for events at Olympic park! Easy check-in and communication with host. We will definitely stay again!"),
("2017-08-22", "13442098", "Sophie", "Very good place"),
("2017-08-31", "13442098", "Natasha", "Great apartment for business travelers. Short walk to where my trade show was being held. I would happily stay here again  Nicole was a helpful and friendly host who even accommodated an early check in."),
("2017-09-09", "13442098", "Matt", "We highly recommend Nicole's apartment and her hospitality is second to none."),
("2017-09-22", "13442098", "James", "Beautiful apartment  great location"),
("2017-10-01", "13442098", "Debbie", "Great location and fantastic value for money. Nicole was very accomodating and easy to communicate with. Apartment was well equipped with everything you need. Fantastic location if attending ANZ stadium and close to cafes and bars and DFO."),
("2017-10-14", "13442098", "Tara", "Lovely apartment in a great location. Perfect for attending (Email hidden by Airbnb) munication with the host was great. Would definitely stay again."),
("2017-10-19", "13442098", "Wayne", "Easy relaxed host and yet efficient communication in a location that was perfect for our needs great experience will definetly  book again."),
("2017-11-02", "13442098", "Darryl", "A great apartment with a view"),
("2017-11-17", "13442098", "Sarah", "Every detail was thought of. The place was super clean  really luxurious and had such beautiful views."),
("2017-11-25", "13442098", "Antonio", "Room is spacious with a great view. Very clean and comfortable and communication was quick"),
("2017-11-30", "13442098", "Eddy", "Great location   great place to live. Thank you!"),
("2017-12-11", "13442098", "Ayumi", "Great host and lovely apartment. Perfect communications made our stay so easy and enjoyable. Loved the location of the apartment too. Thank you!!"),
("2017-12-12", "13442098", "Matt", "Wonderful apartment with thoughtful touches of comfort."),
("2017-12-20", "13442098", "Ariel", "Convenient location to Olympic park activities and train station.  Great cafes and restaurants within walking distance."),
("2017-12-26", "13442098", "Anita", "Fabulous  big and stylish apartment with nice furnishings and great view. Nicole was very easy to deal with and very quick to respond to any queries. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-12-31", "13442098", "Debbie", "Nicole was so helpful with accommodating our travel and new year plans! Just wonderful!! And the kids loved the treats left for us!! Gorgeous apartment. Thank you."),
("2018-01-22", "13442098", "Fiona", "Amazing views!"),
("2018-02-21", "13442098", "Lindy", "Very clean  perfect for what we need.  Great communication. Will use again."),
("2018-03-01", "13442098", "Jodie", "Short easy walk to stadium. Great restaurants and cafes downstairs. Loved the apartment. Will definitely stay here again."),
("2018-03-01", "13442098", "Michelle", "The apartment was fabulous for our short stay but you could quite comfortably stay for a longer period. It was sparkling clean  in a great location and well equipped.Check in was easy & Nicole was very responsive to questions.I would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-03-11", "13442098", "Ge", "The host is super helpful and the house is immaculate.Plenty of personality and cute finishing touches around the apartment ☺️I definitely recommend Thank you"),
("2018-03-16", "13442098", "Laura", "Such a great location for going to events in Olympic Park!"),
("2018-03-23", "13442098", "Tania", "Great Location  close to all the arenas and easy walk to restuarants etc. Found the apartment clean and tidy  will stay again if we need to be out there again."),
("2018-03-24", "13442098", "Nichole", "We've stayed here before and returned because our last stay was so great.  Really comfortable and clean  and great location.  Thanks again  looking forward to returning another time!"),
("2018-03-30", "13442098", "Karen", "This place has everything you need. Great location wonderful host & plenty of places to eat to choose from. Will definitely stay there again."),
("2018-04-27", "13442098", "Bindy", "So easy to communicate with Nicole. She answers questions really quickly. The apartment is generous in size and  clean."),
("2018-04-28", "13442098", "Sharon", "A great location for events at Olympic Park"),
("2018-04-28", "13442098", "Luke", "Great communication."),
("2018-05-04", "13442098", "Adrienne", "Very responsive. Great location"),
("2018-05-11", "13442098", "Scott", "Thanks Nicole a great unit and ideally located. The unit has a great floor plan with balcony  is perfectly set up with everything you need. Clean  very well fitted out with everything you could want. Fully recommend it to anyone looking for great accomodation close to Showgrounds."),
("2018-05-19", "13442098", "Janneee", "Great and clean place. Everything you need for a comfortable stay. Two thumbs up."),
("2018-05-21", "13442098", "Stuart", "Thoroughly enjoyed our stay. Apartment was stylish  clean and great access to nearby restaurants. It’s also a Perfect location to visit the Olympic sporting facilities. Highly recommend"),
("2018-05-24", "13442098", "Heather", "Wonderful apartment  great location @ Olympic Park  easy access  great views & thoughtful extras. Will make your Sydney stay memorable"),
("2018-06-08", "13442098", "Heather", "A lovely apartment - modern with convenient location and wonderful views. Definitely recommended."),
("2018-06-10", "13442098", "Alissa", "Fantastic apartment! Clean and tidy  good price  great communication from host and within walking distance to Anz Stadium and Quodos Bank Arena...Highly recommend Nicole’s place! Will stay again without any hesitations"),
("2018-06-15", "13442098", "Sahil", "very convenient to public transport as well to the Olympic park. Enjoyed staying  here."),
("2018-08-04", "13442098", "Akshata", "Great location for any Olympic Park events. The apartment is spacious and has great views!"),
("2018-08-05", "13442098", "Nicole", "Awesome location. Great service from host. Great accommodation"),
("2018-08-07", "13442098", "Melissa", "Excellent location. Lovely quiet  well appointed apartment with an excellent degree of cleanliness. Lots of things to see and do in and around the apartment and lots more things very close by. Wouldn’t hesitate to recommend it! "),
("2018-08-08", "13442098", "Kylee", "Great location  lovely space."),
("2018-08-22", "13442098", "Evan", "the apartment is very clean and tidy and the view is fantastic. communication was prompt and host very welcoming. would definitely stay again"),
("2018-08-24", "13442098", "Heather", "A lovely BnB with everything that is required for a great stay at Olympic Park.  Close to Rhodes - IKEA  DFO. Sydney Markets and so much more.  A wonderful place to stay in Sydney"),
("2018-10-01", "13442098", "Michelle", "Excellent staying  here.  Clean and bright and modern apartment with everything you need.   Good bed linens and beds make for a great sleep.    Also close to train station  good restaurants close by and easy walk to most venues Iin Olympic Park   The car park is also useful.  Highly recommend.  We would come again."),
("2018-10-09", "13442098", "InBody Body Composition", "Nicoles place was nice and roomy - lots of seating and even a little desk. Views were great - can get hot if you don't turn on the a/c or open the windows. Great location and very comfy beds"),
("2018-10-24", "13442098", "Karen", "This apartment is in a great location  within walking distance of Olympic Park Station  sports stadiums  restaurants and shops. We enjoyed meals at a nearby cafe and Vietnamese restaurant.  There is also a convenience store  Asian grocer  pharmacy and medical centre within the complex.   The unit presents as photographed with genuine views from a high floor and a furnished outdoor balcony.  It's well equipped although some items (cracked crockery and threadbare towels) need replacing. The check-in process was efficient and informative.  Our only gripe on this visit was with the quality of the cleaning."),
("2018-12-15", "13442098", "Elke", "We had a great stay at Nicole’s apartment - the location was perfect and absolutely ideal for us as we attended a concert at Olympic Park. The apartment slept the 6 of us comfortably. Nicole’s communication was amazing  always very quick to respond and very easy to deal with. We would recommend Nicole’s apartment to everyone  and we definitely plan on staying here again next time we come to Homebush!"),
("2016-06-24", "13562321", "Fred", "Joanna and Ali's place is nicely located in the CBD and close to anything you need. The home is neatly kept and well presented. My interstate guest enjoyed the stay and any issue that came up was quickly looked after."),
("2016-07-07", "13562321", "Mónica", "El apartamento es amplio y está muy bien ubicado ya que está en el centro  además tiene una parada de tren a 3 minutos caminando. "),
("2016-07-12", "13562321", "Mónica", "Really nice apartment with an excellent location in Sydney  I totally recommend it! Also Joanne and Ali are really nice  as they solved all my questions really fast. "),
("2016-07-18", "13562321", "Vin", "Location was excellent and perfect for the places I had to visit during my stay.  Apartment was clean and tidy with sufficient amenities.  7 Eleven across the road was convenient and Commonwealth bank on the corner was handy.  Couple of small issues but sorted with the Hosts."),
("2016-07-21", "13562321", "Olivia", "A lovely little apartment! Comfy bed and everything that we needed for our stay in Sydney. This isn't flash - staying here is about location  not amenities. Super close (walking distance) to everything you might want to visit. Some slight issues with the shower and a little cramped - this is a place for two people for a couple of days maximum! We didn't meet Joanne and Ali but they were great arranging flexible options for our stay. "),
("2016-07-27", "13562321", "Daniela", "Very good location!I just thought the place had an old smell that irritated my allergic nose. :( But may be just me..."),
("2016-08-18", "13562321", "Josie", "The apartment is in a great location. It  does not have wifi and as I was spending two week for work it was an inconvenience so do bare this in mind. I tried to contact the hosts about this and did not get a reply from them. After an issue a week later to do with cleanliness Rob their property manager did reply to me and was very kind in offering me a meal for free for the inconvenience and got a cleaner to come in. A nice apartment on the whole which  just needs some TLC."),
("2016-08-27", "13562321", "Elsa", "It's a convenient one bedroom apt for one person  if you don't need wifi (which is rare and unbelievable)  neither a long and relaxing hot bath (there's prob with hot water  I kept it low to avoid running out of hot water at the end of my shower)  nor a quiet sleep in the morning (massive noise in the neighborhood due to tram construction). This apt is all about location in the city."),
("2016-09-04", "13562321", "Jillian", "The place was spacious and comfortable but the best part about it is the location. It's in the center of town  making all the major destinations easily accessible. In addition  Ali and Joanne were very accommodating with our early check in. The amenities  however  were lacking. We were hoping to shower after our long flight but there were no bath towels when we arrived. I texted Ali and the towels were delivered while we were out for lunch. There was only one tube of shampoo and conditioner provided that were clearly taken from hotels. There was a bar of soap for bathing and it had obviously been used before. The previous things I can deal with  but for our 5 night stay for 2 people  there was only one and a half rolls of toilet paper. I texted Ali for toilet paper  shampoo  and soap twice  but received no response.I loved the apartment  but it needs to be better stocked."),
("2016-09-22", "13562321", "Ross", "The host was very helpful  and all went smoothly."),
("2016-10-15", "13562321", "Richard Kok-Fhung", "We stayed here for a family of four. Fantastic location! Hot water pressure could have been stronger but otherwise it's fantastic accomodation for a short weekend away."),
("2016-10-29", "13562321", "Maria", "Great location   clean and hosts very friendly.  "),
("2016-11-26", "13562321", "Julia", "Communication with the hosts was great and immediate. The apartment is very centrally located and within walking distance of all galleries  shops etc. Perfect for a couple or two friends happy to share a room. "),
("2016-12-16", "13562321", "Albert", "Great place  central and quiet. The actual building is quite old  but the apartment itself is fine. Internet is provided in the form of a 4G dongle. All the cook wear was very useable. The hot water pressure is low  like some of the other guests have mentioned but overall useable.The location is great  for both business travellers and tourists."),
("2016-12-25", "13562321", "Mckee", "The place is easy to find  great location  very close to westfield and supermarket coles. But there is no shampoo and shower gel in the apartment."),
("2017-01-01", "13562321", "Marizabel", "This cozy apartment had everything we needed for our new years holiday in Sydney. All the main touristic spots are literally walking distance (Darling Harbour  Circular Quay  Sydney Town Hall  main shopping centres). When we needed to use the train  Wynyard Station was just a couple of blocks away. Savings time and money with this prime location was definitely a bonus.The flat feels bigger than in the pictures. The building feels old but once you get inside the flat everything is well kept. The main bed and the sofa bed were comfy and with white crisp linens. Had plenty bath and face towels. Did not find a problem with the hot water pressure as previously stated (might have been fixed). There are washing and drying machines in perfect working condition. The bedroom has a ceiling fan that was enough to sleep  there were a couple of pretty hot nights outside but we only needed to turn on the aircon for a couple of hours and the entire flat would cool off. The kitchen has everything needed to prepare all meals.Dealing with the host was also a pleasant experience. All the information requested was given in a straightforward manner without delay. Overall  a great experience! Highly recommended"),
("2017-02-13", "13562321", "Adam", "The apartment is nice and perfect for city stays. My disappointment came when my 70yr old parents we kept awake all night from major reconstruction. Bins are also collected at 130am from outside the apartment. We were not told this was happening.My mum recleaned on moving in. The dust on top of units and cupboard and under the bed was terrible. Expect a light clean and sheet change on arrivalMy parents left 4 nights early and i moved onto my couch. No response when feedback was given after stay. I would recommend the apartment when Sydney tram works is complete in 2018."),
("2017-02-21", "13562321", "Dale", "My stay got of to a bumpy start as the room had not been prepare for my arrival  I assume there was a communication issue between the cleaner and the owner  but the owners rectified the problems the following day  and also offered $60 to cover a couple of meals for the inconvenience .overall my stay was good and description and pictures where accurate  location was great  5 mins walk to wynyard station 15 mins  to darling harbour & 3mins to woolies.I may stay again and would ask for confirmation on the room been ready  before my arrival.      "),
("2017-03-07", "13562321", "Anthony", "A great one week holiday in Sydney for 1st time ....... certainly not the last time  would come again to stay and will recommend to others! Very comfortable and well equipped should you wish to make your own break  lunch to dinner."),
("2017-03-29", "13562321", "Bryant", "Great place to stay in. Clean and well equipped overall. Very near to darling harbour and to nearest train station."),
("2017-04-05", "13562321", "John", "Nous avons passé 4 jours à Sydney  et le séjour dans l'appartement de Joanne et Ali  très bien situé au centre-ville  nous a permis de visiter la ville en nous déplaçant souvent à pieds. L'appartement est confortable et bien équipé  et 3-4 personnes peuvent y séjourner avec plaisir."),
("2017-04-14", "13562321", "Beau", "You can't beat this location. We stayed for almost a week and walked or took a very convenient train everywhere that we cared to go. The size of the apartment was adequate and comfortable but not terribly large. It was reasonably clean and put together but not luxurious. The hosts were very kind to allow us to check in several hours early and we never actually meet anyone in person as the key was conveniently in a lock box. Overall it was consistent with the description and our expectations. I would recommend this for others particularly given the convenient location."),
("2017-04-20", "13562321", "Natalia", "Excelente ubicación. Cómodo apartamento y de fácil alquiler.."),
("2017-07-30", "13562321", "晓杰", "Good"),
("2017-08-10", "13562321", "Matt", "Nice and tidy place right in the heart of the Sydney CBD. Great access to all things in the city."),
("2017-08-19", "13562321", "晓杰", "Very good!"),
("2017-08-27", "13562321", "晓杰", "Very good!"),
("2017-09-09", "13562321", "Yao", "Very central location. The place is not big  but cosy for 2 people. Host is a bit hard to reach  but the check-in is easy enough."),
("2017-09-27", "13562321", "Evandro", "The apartament is very good. It is very close bars  restaurant and metro station. It is perfect for a couple. The apartment does not receive much sunligh. But this is not a problem. I and my girlfriend recomend the Joanne apartament. Everthing is good."),
("2017-10-13", "13562321", "Sonia", "Excellent location"),
("2017-10-17", "13562321", "Louise", "The apartment was central and nicely set out.  The sofa bed is a click clack and not very comfortable.  The air con didn't work and therefore the apartment was stuffy as we felt we couldn't safely leave the window open.We would stay again due to the convenience for the city."),
("2018-01-04", "13562321", "Katerina", "We had a great time! Location is perfect  walking distance to Circular Quay  to the train  bus stops shopping and the supermarket 3 min away! Apartment had everything we needed: equipped kitchen  washer  dryer... very comfortable place! Would definetly recommend it!"),
("2018-02-14", "13562321", "Sarah", "Great location."),
("2018-02-19", "13562321", "Mary", "great location and value"),
("2018-03-02", "13562321", "Jane", "This compact apartment is well located in the CBD for walking down to the quay/Opera House/Park. It is a little tired and shabby. It is fine as a base but not so good if you need spend much time there. The windows look out onto the wall of the neighbouring building and the noise from the street and the garbage collectors goes on into the night."),
("2018-03-08", "13562321", "Jordan", "Good location with near most tourist spots in CBD. Just few mins walk to QVB Darling Harbour...etc. Easy check in and stylish decoration. I will stay again if I come again."),
("2018-05-03", "13562321", "Amanda", "Good central accommodation near train and bus . Bed is soft but slept well. Good for a few nights in city  I stayed for business and it was great with lunge and kitchen for breakfast etc or dinner if you wanted. I ate at local eateries nearby. Easy to book  Great for 1 or 2 travelers  easy entry  secure building . I would stay again. So convenient . Thank u Ali."),
("2018-05-27", "13562321", "Rajan", "Well kept apartment in a great central location. Hosts made stay easy."),
("2018-07-13", "13562321", "David", "Location was great. Perfect to walk to just about all the sights. The unit was small  but had all you would require for a shot stay. Having a washing machine and dryer was a plus. My only negative was the oven was dirty and the floor could have done with a good wash."),
("2018-08-04", "13562321", "Daniel", "Despite the building being quite old  the apartment was very tidy and well looked after. "),
("2018-09-24", "13562321", "Keaton", "Amazing home right in the city. Can’t beat the experience and atmosphere by Joanne/Ali’s place! Had a lot of fun with my friends"),
("2018-10-22", "13562321", "Shane", "Best Location and the Suite is Spacious  ❤️"),
("2018-11-07", "13562321", "Sandra", "The apartment is very well located! You can walk to the shopping centers  the Sydney Opera or the Harbour Bridge! The kitchen has everything you need!We had a good time at Clearance House!"),
("2018-11-14", "13562321", "Owen", "Perfect  problem free stay."),
("2018-11-22", "13562321", "Michael", "The location of this apartment is great - close walking distance to Sydney’s main attractions and anything else in the CBD. There is a Woolworth Express right around the corner to stock up on whatever you would like for food  snacks  or sundries. Very convenient.The apartment windows look into an alley where it is noisy early from garbage trucks  vehicles  and other maintenance. The hosts informed us about this.We had issues checking in as the apartment was not cleaned  which got resolved. That said  we never received confirmation from the host or property manager  after specifically inquiring to both  if the bed linens were laundered after the previous guest left or the bed was just made with the same linens.A few comments about the apartment. The mattress is less than acceptable IMO.  It is lumpy and springy and we could get a good sleep the 4 nights we stayed. Hard to believe this has not been replaced. So  while the apartment is functional as described  it is in need of TLC and better property management attention. The bath and kitchen amenities seem mostly to be leftovers from other guests and there are just some things worn out such as the shower head that does not stay in place making it difficult to shower. Communication with the host was very responsive during the  booking stage but once confirmed and money paid ... and when issues occurred  they were  well let’s just say  less than responsive.Personally  despite the location and premium this apartment should command in the CBD  the value IMO is EXTREMELY low for what they charge when considering all the other factors outlined above and more that I communicated to the hosts directly. I have offered suggestions to the host directly and constructively for them to improve based on above and other details ... however  I have not received a response of course.That said  you will love CBD ... a visit to Baxter’s Inn is a must (you will  understand when you finally find it and immerse yourself with the locals for a drink - there is no food). We had amazing dinners at Bistro Papillon (steps from the apartment) and at Bambini. A visit to QVB (Queen Victoria Building)  Strand and area is a shopper’s haven and both are a must do. Special mention to the ladies at Cue (a ladies fashion shop ... fine Aussie designs). When (not if) you go to the Opera House  be sure to walk through the Botanical Gardens. Lots to explore and enjoy in Sydney.I sure wish our experience at “Clarence House Apartment” was not the last accommodation image we had on an otherwise impeccable 24 day experience of Australia.Michael"),
("2018-12-07", "13562321", "Kajan", "The apartment was in a great location and near restaurants  bars  grocery stores and transport. The self check in and check out process was simple. The place was clean and spacious as per the photos. I'd recommend this apartment to anyone and will stay here again."),
("2019-02-09", "13562321", "Kerryn", "Awesome location! Super accomodating hosts and a relaxing decor  made for a great mini break."),
("2019-02-25", "13562321", "Marie-Charlotte", "Super endroit bien placé"),
("2016-11-28", "13595339", "Chieko", "Mariana was a great host.She was kind warm  and always helpful.I had a great 3 month stay at Mariana's (Website hidden by Airbnb) location it was clean well equipped everything was well prepared.And clean big bathtub I was enjoyed every bath time. "),
("2016-12-08", "13595339", "Racheal", "The studio apartment was exactly what I needed. It was quiet  and had a very comfy new bed. Thank you Mariana for your assistance and the flowers throughout the apartment made it so homely. "),
("2016-12-16", "13595339", "Frances", "Mariana's place is great!  It's in a fantastic location off Macleay Street with lots of cafes and restaurants on the doorstep as well as easy access to the City via train at KingsX and buses.  It also is an easy walk down to Rushcutters Bay park and the water if you're looking for a bit of peace and tranquility. The apartment itself is very quiet  at the back of the buildings and well away from the buzz of Macleay St.  It has also been brilliantly and neatly designed by Mariana with a great bathroom and kitchen with high quality appliances and a really comfortable bed as well as lots of nice  Art Deco touches.  Mariana is a fantastic host - really open and friendly   and generously invited us to use anything in the kitchen and bathroom cupboards.  We would highly recommend Mariana's apartment and Mariana as a host - and would definitely stay here again."),
("2017-01-01", "13595339", "Trupti", "Great central location of the apartment. It's perfect for two people for a few nights. It's truly a studio but Mariana has done a great job putting all the basics in."),
("2017-01-06", "13595339", "Andrew", "Well decorated studio apartment great for couples or single travelers. The apartment is newer and has a great efficiency kitchen with all appliances you need in addition to a nice bathroom.The view looks into an inner space in between apartments and you can see into the neighbors kitchen  but nothing new if you have stayed in big city airbnbs.The apartment did not have A/C at the time of stay  I would recommend this place as long as it's cooler outside or more fans were brought in.The location is phenomenal. Lots of restaurants and a few coffee shops nearby with easy access to Kings Cross Station for your metro needs.Great stay overall!"),
("2017-01-13", "13595339", "Ben", "Great find in a charming building. The apartment is well appointed and the communication and service was fantastic. Will definitely stay again!"),
("2017-01-23", "13595339", "Louise", "Beautiful apartment  very central location (I walked to the city one day) in fabulous Potts Point. The apartment had everything I needed (including a bathtub!) and the host was delightful. Highly recommended and I would definitely come back here."),
("2017-02-01", "13595339", "Gosia", "the apartment is perfectly located. It is located within walking distance of the city center. public transport is also very close to the apartment. everything that was needed was a in the equipment flat. everything was very well organized. I would heartily recommend!"),
("2017-02-07", "13595339", "Petrus", "Beautiful place close to everything  quiet and clean with very nice touches and a super comfortable bed. Really enjoyed our stay!"),
("2017-02-13", "13595339", "Norliza", "Mariana is a fantastic host. She is very friendly and it was very easy to communicate with her.  We love her (Website hidden by Airbnb) is  well equipped and very clean.  There were many cafes nearby and King Cross Stn was a short walk away. We highly recommend this apartment."),
("2017-02-18", "13595339", "Joe And Melanie", "What a terrific little place to stay. Its freshly renovated and homely. The location is excellent with some of Sydney's best restaurants literally around the corner. Also easy access for Uber pick ups etc. Thanks so much for hosting us Mariana  it was lovely to meet you."),
("2017-02-23", "13595339", "Michelle", "The boutique apartment is nice  got everything in it  like cooking stuff and washing machine.  Maybe a bit stuffed during summer cos not quite convenient to open windows in the living room  but it’s around 20+ degrees during our stay  so it’s ok for us. The apt is on 1/F  so need to walk few steps with your luggage. Mariana is very nice and helpful as well."),
("2017-02-25", "13595339", "Mari", "Although it was only for two nights  I had a wonderful time at Mariana's apartment. It is a beautifully renovated room  very clean and the location is great. Definitely recommend it!"),
("2017-03-04", "13595339", "Richard", "This is a great place to stay for a couple visiting Sydney. It is not large but very well equipped with high quality fittings and furnished to a high standard. Kings Cross station is within easy walking distance as are plenty of good eateries and a supermarket."),
("2017-03-12", "13595339", "Bree", "Mariana was a fabulous host  very easy to contact. Brilliant location beautifully laid out apartment!"),
("2017-03-20", "13595339", "Antonette", "Mariana is such a great host..welcomes and bids goodbye to her guest personally. She responds quickly and has created a comfortable & beautiful abode for guest. Her flat is close to Kings cross station  bus stops and hop on/off stop. Close to grocery  market  restaurants and bars...including ice cream shops :). Her apartment is very reflective of Sydney...its a combination of a sense of culture & vintage with the comforts of whats new & functional. I LOVE the fact that we come home to a very comfy bed and bath tub + epsom salt after a very tiring touristy walking day. :) "),
("2017-03-22", "13595339", "Rob", "Lovely location  very well appointed homely feel and great value. "),
("2017-03-25", "13595339", "Helen", "We loved our stay here in Pott's Point! It is walking distance to King's Cross station and very accessible to the city center. Mariana's apartment is clean  well-equipped  and elegant. Best for couples as it might be a little tight for a family! "),
("2017-03-30", "13595339", "Alexander", "Great little completely self-contained studio."),
("2017-04-02", "13595339", "Felicia", "Mariana's apartment is centrally located  done up to a high standard (she installed a Miele dishwasher and induction hob) and is exactly as described in the description. The kitchen is also well equipped should you need to cook. It's clean  convenient and comfortable. Public transport is all within a few minutes walk which is always great. Check-in went smoothly too and we would like to thank Mariana for the wonderful stay. We wouldn't hesitate to recommend her apartment to other guests and would return to stay there during our next visit to Sydney."),
("2017-04-19", "13595339", "Jo", "Great location  wee but very comfortable and well equipped. Lovely and quiet and so handy to all transport  supermarkets and eating places. Loved it."),
("2017-04-24", "13595339", "Jules", "Mariana was an amazing host. She let me check in very early due to my red-eye flight and she also let me check out very late due to my late evening flight home. The place was beautiful  spotlessly clean and is in a prime Potts point / Elizabeth Bay location. Thank you so much for making my stay in Sydney so enjoyable. "),
("2017-04-29", "13595339", "Erica", "Mariana's place is in a beautiful and central location. The botanical garden and art museum are only about a 15-20 min walk away. There is a grocery store down the street and lots of good restaurants close by. It is a great option for a solo traveller or a couple who want to explore this amazing city!"),
("2017-05-04", "13595339", "Hamish", "An absolutely delightful apartment. It's cosy  but the attention to detail and renovation make it a lovely place to hang out in! Highly recommended :)"),
("2017-05-06", "13595339", "Jurphy", "Good place to stay in a great neighborhood. Clean flat that was well-presented by the photographs."),
("2017-05-10", "13595339", "Lillian & Peter", "Stayed here for a short business trip to Sydney. A very cosy apartment  very clean and as described. The bed is super comfortable and the fittings and fixtures are excellent (great shower). I love the location as its so close to Kings Cross and to central Sydney itself. Lots of places to eat  supermarket just down the road and the apartment building is quiet and well maintained. If you have a car  you just need some forward planning and research as parking can be an issue. It only took me one night to find the right spots along the streets though  and there is a pay as you go car park nearby. All in all  a great place to stay and will certainly be on my list for any future trips."),
("2017-05-17", "13595339", "Tony", "Cozy studio that is very clean and comfortable.  Location is *fantastic* -- we walked to everything we wanted to see in Sydney and there is easy access to groceries/food  if you prefer to eat in.Mariana and Don are amazing hosts-- they were accessible for anything we needed and very easy to communicate with ahead of time.One blip: the neighboring apartment was very loud in the middle of the night (twice)  but we let Mariana know and I suspect any issue will be resolved."),
("2017-05-27", "13595339", "Romy", "Lovely host with great communication. Clean  comfortable and central apartment. "),
("2017-06-04", "13595339", "Louisa", "Mariana's place is an absolute gem. Yes it's compact  but it's perfect for a solo traveller or a couple. The furnishings are gorgeous and beautifully arranged  the bed is super-comfy  the kitchen is thoughtfully designed with all the amenities you could hope for  and the shower is to die for. The location is excellent too  on a quiet cul-de-sac with lots of good places to eat and drink within an easy walk  and close to public transport for venturing further. Mariana is also an amazing host - I had sprained my ankle a few days before I arrived  and she brought me crutches to use during me stay! From communications before through check-in and during my stay  she was always responsive and helpful. Highly recommended! I'd love to stay again next time I'm in Sydney."),
("2017-06-11", "13595339", "Rob", "Mariana was so accommodating with our late flight arrival. Great  clean and perfectly located studio. Perfect for the weekend away. Quiet and really comfy bed. Thanks Mariana!"),
("2017-06-19", "13595339", "Tonio", "Great location close to everything but in quiet street. Everything is walkable from there. Fantastic neighborhood  very nice apartment  extremely clean. Would come back anytime. Highly recommended! "),
("2017-07-01", "13595339", "Nan", "It was a really nice stay  great location "),
("2017-07-05", "13595339", "Martin", "Great place to stay  conveniently located  a home away from home. We appreciate all the extra touches that Mariana did to make us feel even more welcome. Now that we've found her place we hope to return."),
("2017-08-03", "13595339", "Deb", "Perfect place to stay in Sydney.  Lovely apt with all you need and a great value.  Mariana's delightful!"),
("2017-08-11", "13595339", "Ramu", "Good place to stay and close to CBD  Mariana's is great host and very friendly."),
("2017-08-15", "13595339", "Mark", "No views BUT perfect for single or couple who want to get out and about and come back to comfort and quiet. All the facilities cleverly included even basic food supplies included and great bathroom."),
("2017-08-22", "13595339", "Haidee", "Marianna's flat was absolutely beautifully finished to a high standard with some lovely Art Deco pieces. The bathroom was exceptionally done and the kitchen is small but had everything packed in - very impressive. The bed was SO a comfy too. Location is perfect to see all the sights and there are a great selection of quality restaurants and cafes close by. Marianna was an excellent host and very accommodating - made you feel right at home. This is a great base for your trip to Sydney so I would not hesitate to recommend it."),
("2017-08-27", "13595339", "Lian", "The apartment is lovely. Everything was thoughtfully provided. I had good wifi  a well equipped kitchen to make brekkie  and lots of hot water for a bath at the end of the day. Great location - easy to catch public transport (bus 311 or walk 7 mins to Kings Cross station)  but the off street parking around the area was mainly 1 hour so it might be tricky if you have a car. Lots of restaurants nearby  Hayes theatre round the corner and small weekend market (Saturday is better). I felt safe walking around even at night as there were plenty of people eating at the restaurants nearby. The apartment is on first floor so you need to be able to carry your bags up a flight of stairs. It only had filtered light as it faced another building so you have to turn the lights on all day long and was noisy when I was staying due to the construction next door. It would not be a place to stay in  ie  if you were planning to be resting indoors during the day time hours. I recommend this place for someone active who is going to be out and about all day. as it quietens down by evening and that's when the apartment is at its best."),
("2017-09-02", "13595339", "Sarah Ruth", "Beautifully furnished apartment that indeed has a lot of personal charm in what is my favourite neighbourhood in Sydney -- Mariana was a lovely host and provided me with a warm welcome."),
("2017-10-02", "13595339", "Mariana", "Mariana's studio is a place where you feel like home. My parents spent 1 month here in Sydney and just loved her studio. New appliances  very clean  great bed and shower... really close to shops  restaurants and train station. Thank you very much  Mariana!"),
("2017-10-05", "13595339", "Steve", "Great apartment  clean  tidy and very comfortable. Fantastic location and very close to the CBD."),
("2017-10-25", "13595339", "Herman", "The place is close to bus stop and  train station. Room is nice and clean. the bed is very confortable. Host is very friendly and easy to contact."),
("2017-11-01", "13595339", "Peter", "."),
("2017-11-05", "13595339", "Rebecca", "Our stay was fantastic! Great and fun neighbourhood with a grocery store just one block away (great for when you want to cook your own food) but also lots of restaurants to choose from (even farmers market on the weekend). The accommodation was spotless and perfect for two people!"),
("2017-11-10", "13595339", "Carol", "Great location for exploring Sydney. Good value. Mariana is a great host and the little touches made a big difference. The block is a bit noisy so ear plugs are useful! Very comfortable apartment."),
("2017-11-14", "13595339", "Celeste", "This was my first Airbnb experience and the bar HAS to have been set very high.  Mariana's place is in a lovely neighborhood  close to public transportation  shopping and a great back-street walk to Circular Quay is very do-able.  Mariana's flat is spotless  quiet and safe - a warm and welcoming host.  I couldn't have been happier and hope to be able to return!"),
("2017-11-16", "13595339", "Rebekah", "Perfect accommodation in one of the best locations. We feel very lucky to have come across such a beautiful spot like this one and at such a decent price. My husband and I always stay in Potts Point/Elizabeth Bay when in Sydney but always spend more money than we'd like on accommodation. Mariana's spot will definitely be our go-to for future trips: it has everything you need and was incredibly clean. The bed was so comfortable and my husband couldn't stop commenting on how great the shower was! ""That was one of the best showers I've ever had. I think it's the shower heads. We need to look into shower heads like these..."" For those who have never been to Sydney  the accommodation is close by Kings Cross station which will take you anywhere you need to go in the city  but there are TONS of great coffee shops and wine bars right outside your front door. Elizabeth Bay is beautiful  a short walk away  which is worth a visit. Perfect place to sit with your morning coffee. My husband and I had a great time.Checking in was seamless. Mariana was the perfect host and very kind. She let us know about something we left behind which was sentimental and made plans to get it back to us. This thoughtful gesture proves what a caring host she is! We can't recommend this place enough!"),
("2017-11-19", "13595339", "Grace", "My best friend and I stayed here for three nights over the weekend and absolutely adored this Art Deco apartment. It was clean and beautiful. The location is outstanding  close to markets  theatre and shops as well as a 5 min walk to the station. Mariana greeted us and was lovely. Already have recommended this place to family and friends."),
("2017-11-26", "13595339", "Jennifer", "Elizabeth Bay is a pretty and convenient location. Mariana’s flat is small but has everything one could need and has been recently redecorated. It was also surprisingly quiet. Some of the best restaurants in Sydney are nearby. If you like to run the Domain and Botanical Gardens are close  as is the Boy Charlton pool. Harbour beaches  Circular Quay  and the CBD are a bus or short train ride away. Highly recommended."),
("2017-11-29", "13595339", "Kellie", "A great wee place in Pitts Point  walking distance to Cirrular Quay  the Botanical Gardens and lots of great cafes and resturants  the kings cross tube is also only 5 minutes walk away. Just perfect"),
("2017-12-03", "13595339", "Cat", "We stayed here a few nights in December. The apartment is really well designed with modern appliances and everything you need for short or long stay. The place is very quiet but still in an incredibly central location. Mariana was very quick in her communication and obliging in her hospitality. Highly recommended."),
("2017-12-12", "13595339", "Gene", "Great place to stay. Location close to transportation  restaurants and a grocery across the street. Very quiet. Amenities were excellent and able to cook and do laundry"),
("2017-12-20", "13595339", "Miranda", "Mariana's place is convenient to everything and centrally located with only few mins walk from KC's station. The apartment is same as desceibed as beautifully Art decorated. The place is fabously clean!!! Love my stay in Sydney as well as this adorable airBnB. Thanks for the beautiful hydrangea in the apartment too. I would defintiely recommend to frds who visit Sydney! ❤️❤️❤️ Though I havent met Mariana in person  her partner Don has given me warm greetings and show me everything in the apartment. Plus  they are fine with my late checkin time  which I am very appreaciated!!!❤️"),
("2018-01-01", "13595339", "Mike", "Great place to stay! Close to the Royal Botanical Gardens and Circular Quay. The appartment is as shown in the pictures  you‘ll have everything you need. Unfortunately  there‘s no aircon  only a fan. So it might get pretty hot in the appartment."),
("2018-02-18", "13595339", "Agnese", "The apartment is beautiful  clean and equipped with all comforts. Mariana is kind and she always meets the needs.I had a really great time here!"),
("2018-02-26", "13595339", "Colin", "Good location   comfortable yet stylish"),
("2018-03-05", "13595339", "Christine", "Un très joli appartement  propre et très bien équipé. Une situation idéale non loin à pied du Botanic garden et de Circular Quay et au coeur d'un agréable quartier où l'on trouve beaucoup de bars et restaurants. Je recommande vivement."),
("2018-03-25", "13595339", "Mariana", "This was the second time at Mariana's place. My parents stayed there for 4 weeks in Sep/2017 and the place was so confortable and clean  and Mariana was such a nice host that I've booked her place for my in laws for 2 weeks. Thanks again  Mariana! Hope to book your beautiful studio again as soon as we know family or Friends are coming to visit!"),
("2018-04-04", "13595339", "Paula", "Mariana's flat was in the perfect location for me to walk to everything. Cute neighborhood with lots of shopping  eateries  and services. The flat has been completely remodeled using high-quality materials. It's quite a small space  very efficient  perfect for a solo traveler like myself. It could accommodate two people  although the kitchen would fit only (Email hidden by Airbnb) fy bed with quality linens  nice bathroom with big tub  everything was new and spotlessly clean. It's a walk-up so you need to navigate two flights of stairs which was no problem for me."),
("2018-04-11", "13595339", "Tracy", "Mariana’s place is stylish and is very well equipped with lots of thoughtful touches. It had everything we needed for our stay. Don was there to meet us when we arrived and was very helpful in showing us the studio. The location is fantastic and given the central location  there is no noise from the nearby restaurants and bars. The atrium architecture of the building means that sound travels and we found the neighbours opposite to be a bit loud at times. Having said that we very much enjoyed our stay and wouldn’t hesitate to book again if we were back in Sydney."),
("2018-04-16", "13595339", "Gail", "This compact apartment had all we needed  including an extremely comfortable bed  great shower with plenty of hot water  lovely art deco furnishings and all you needed to cook up a meal if you wished. Locally there are many good restaurants  a train station and a supermarket all within easy walking distance."),
("2018-05-30", "13595339", "Vicky", "Mariana is a lovely host  easy to get a hold of and happy to help out if you need anything. Having never been to Sydney before I wasn’t sure what was a good area to stay in. I was so happy with the location - Woolworths just across the road  30 mins walk to circular quay  lots of lovely restaurants and cafes and I didn’t feel worried walking around at night alone so can’t ask for better! The flat was lovely. Really clean and tidy with a heater and fans so easy to keep warm or cool depending on the weather. Fantastic rain shower as well! I stayed here for a little over a month and the only thing I missed was having an oven. There’s a microwave and hobs so easy to manage without. Mariana had fly screens in place to keep the room ventilated which was lovely but it was very noisy the first night where we could hear the next door neighbours conversations and music! No problem to take some of them down and no problems with noise once we could close the windows. The internet did drop in and out a little in the evenings but always sorted itself out so again not really a problem. All in all it is a really lovely flat where I felt safe and comfortable in a new city on the other side of the world! Mariana was a great host and I wouldn’t hesitate to stay again.  "),
("2018-06-02", "13595339", "Anne", "Cosey little apartment  so close to anything you want or need!! For a little space it has everything  incredibly well done - could have slept in the dream bed all weekend and not gone out and been happy!! All it’s missing is a view but you step outside and your in the heart of Potts Point - perfect!!"),
("2018-06-13", "13595339", "Paul", "Close to public transport  in a pretty hip neighborhood  very stylish place  great amenities  very nice shower. Also  Mariana is an excellent host! Five stars!"),
("2018-07-10", "13595339", "Tamara", "Mariana’s place was great. In a good location and well setup with a great little kitchen and bathroom both beautifuly renovated. A great place to stay when visiting Sydney."),
("2018-08-13", "13595339", "John", "Really well positioned  cozy  clean and comfortable apartment. Mariana and Don are friendly  helpful and communication was excellent. Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-08-21", "13595339", "Yoon", "It is just a perfect place to stay for your trip at the right location. You can enjoy the cafe  restaurant and Saturday market around  all perfect & lovely. It is also very strategically located for travelling around by train  bus & on foot. Just relax and enjoy ~~"),
("2018-09-15", "13595339", "Pieter", "This apartment is perfectly located and has everything to make a stay comfortable. I loved my time here."),
("2018-09-30", "13595339", "Jenna", "The location is excellent. Central to great dining  Kings Cross  and the train. It is perfect for two people as your home base while exploring Sydney. The washer/dryer was a huge perk!"),
("2018-10-05", "13595339", "Corina", "A cute little studio in the heart of Elizabeth Bay - close to transport  and a wide array of delicious food options. Mariana is a great host  who has included small touches (eg powerboard next to bed so you can charge multiple devices at once) which make the studio even more comfortable. Amazing bath/shower!"),
("2018-10-12", "13595339", "Jakob", "Mariana is the perfect host! Her place is in the ideal location  good surrondings and walking distance to most attractions. She was always kind and helped make our stay as pleasent as possible. I would definetely stay here again. Recommend!"),
("2018-10-14", "13595339", "Alison", "Great little apartment in an excellent location. Mariana was efficient and friendly. Great!"),
("2018-10-21", "13595339", "Bill", "Mariana’s place is a neat efficiency apartment located at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac in a good neighborhood  only a mile from the Opera House and Circular Quay.  There is a supermarket  a pharmacy  at least three restaurants  a convenience store  a coffee and juice shop   a hop on hop off Bigbus stop  and a regular city transit bus stop within 150 meters of the front door.it is also within walking distance to Kings Cross where you can catch the train.  we loved the location.  Mariana is a nice host.  Communication is excellent and she works to provide a nice stay for her guests.  I recommend this place for couples or for individuals."),
("2018-11-02", "13595339", "Sarah", "Mariana's place is a charming Art Deco studio apartment with a lovely mix of restored original features alongside modern  quality comforts. The bed was very comfortable  and the bathroom and kitchen both clean and well equipped.  The apartment is situated in a fantastic location; surrounded by shops  cafes and walks with Kings Cross Station a short walk away. I would highly recommended Mariana's apartment  and would definitely stay again."),
("2018-11-04", "13595339", "Donald", "Very clean room in a convenient location. Thanks for the tips on how to get to the quay!"),
("2018-11-09", "13595339", "Rene", "Great host very attentive!  Beautiful clean apartment"),
("2018-11-12", "13595339", "Liz", "Very nice air B and B.  Would recommend"),
("2018-11-16", "13595339", "Catherine", "Lovely  cozy space in a beautiful area  close to bars  restaurants  cafes  public transport and gorgeous parks and views. Mariana is a very helpful and friendly host."),
("2018-11-21", "13595339", "Canaan", "I loved staying at Mariana’s apartment! Perfect location  the bed was SO comfortable  and all of the amenities you would ever need are there! Communication was super fast and easy! I would definitely stay here again. Thanks Mariana!"),
("2018-11-25", "13595339", "Lucia", "Beautifully renovated Art Deco apartment in great location. Very clean. Would stay here again."),
("2018-11-29", "13595339", "Jane", "A great place to stay - lovely tidy clean and well appointed apartment. Easy walking distance to great food and shopping. Mariana was really helpful and prompt in replying.  I highly recommend staying here."),
("2018-12-08", "13595339", "Caitlin", "I use Airbnb a lot (6-8 times a year for the last 3-4 years) and staying at Marian’s was easily one of my top 3 Airbnb experiences. The apartment has been renovated to completely maximize the space  and the bathroom is honestly a luxury experience (deep soaking tub with both rain and handle shower heads). Another delightful aspect of the apartment was the bed and bedding. Ive found that most Airbnb’s make a minimal effort in this department  but I had one of the best weeks of sleep of my life in that bed. So much so that I actually wrote down the name of the bedding and asked Mariana where she got the mattress in hopes of replicating the set up in my home. Finally  Mariana struck the perfect balance of being available and helpful but respecting my privacy as a guest. It truly was an exceptional experience. Strongly recommend!"),
("2018-12-13", "13595339", "David", "Awesome apartment with everything needed.  The apartment is nicely decorated  very comfortable bed  well equipped kitchen and a nice shower.  Great neighborhood and great location for exploring Sydney.Mariana  the host  was very responsive and helpful during my stay.   I highly recommend Mariana's apartment."),
("2018-12-30", "13595339", "Leroy", "This place is in a great location  affordable for a stay in the city. We enjoyed the cleanliness and the amazing shower/bath combo. Also appreciated having a wash/dry machine for our clothes. We would stay again"),
("2019-01-01", "13595339", "Bea", "Excellent amenities  communication and location. Has everything you need with amazing cafes and restaurants less than 5 mins away. Loved the style of the place too! Thanks Mariana!"),
("2019-01-20", "13595339", "Andrew", "Very thoughtfully provisioned studio and obviously a great location.  Couldn’t fault it."),
("2019-01-29", "13595339", "Holly", "Mariana was a lovely host  met me with the keys and took the time to show me around the unit and how everything worked. The unit was sparklingly clean  the kitchen and bathroom are really nicely renovated and set out well. Although i stayed during a heat wave the fans kept me very comfortable. I’d definitely stay again."),
("2019-02-02", "13595339", "Jonny", "This place is AWESOME. It's small  but perfectly formed and has everything you need for a great stay. The location is absolutely perfect and close to all the best shops/restaurants/cafe's that Potts Point has to offer. Mariana is a fantastic host  very quick to respond and gave a great quality check in. I cannot recommend this place highly enough."),
("2019-02-06", "13595339", "Anna", "Fint och trevligt boende i ett lugnt område."),
("2019-02-15", "13595339", "Amanda Dee", "Mariana's apartment is wonderful. Not only for it's location  really close to many of the most important amenities of Sydney but also for the great job that Mariana did with it. It has absolutely everything that you can imagine or you may need. The design is wonderful and beautiful and all the appliances are brand new and the best quality.We would definitely go back and stay there again and again."),
("2019-02-23", "13595339", "Thabs", "Mariana is an excellent host. She will communicate almost everything you need to know about the apartment when you check in. I especially appreciated the road maps and travel guides in the apartment. I knew I had found a truly Airbnb wonderful host when she recommended I take an ""apple cider vinegar and baking soda"" bath after my long 24-hour flight from Germany. The bath was nice!"),
("2019-02-25", "13595339", "우리", "I chose this accomodation for cook and it had been fully equipped for cooking. I also felt cozy atmosphere and comfortable."),
("2016-07-10", "13689460", "Niamh", "We had a great stay here. Hayley was very easy to communicate with prior to our arrival. The room was spotless and comfortable and the breakfast/coffee was very much appreciated. The central location was perfect for our weekend in the city."),
("2016-07-19", "13689460", "Jordan", "The room was just as described  and was in a perfect location in the heart of Surry Hills.  Getting to the CBD  or walking around the neighborhood were so easy from the apartment.Hayley and Jack made my stay really pleasant  with lots of amenities and insights into the neighborhood and Sydney in general.  They even went out of my way helping me get to my next location.  Couldn't recommend them enough."),
("2016-07-28", "13689460", "Bruce", "Comfortable place to stay  good kitchen facilities  easy access to transport and nearby supermarket  places to eat etc. "),
("2016-07-29", "13689460", "Liya", "My boyfriend was in Sydney for a job interview. Hayley was a great host. The location was perfect as well."),
("2016-08-13", "13689460", "Bruce", "Clean and comfortable lodgings  the hosts made me feel welcome. It's a relaxed household and I'm a returning guest. My preferred place to stay in Surry Hills."),
("2016-08-13", "13689460", "Sean", "This is a cute little cottage in the heart of Surry Hills close to Oxford Street and Central Station Hosts were friendly and made me feel very welcome with brekky provided in the mornings All necessary info was given to me before hand and  any questions I had were promptly answeredArrangements were made to provide a key for my arrival when they could not make themselves available"),
("2016-08-19", "13689460", "Bruce", "Jack and Hayley were great hosts. I felt welcome  the room was comfortable. No problems at all."),
("2016-08-23", "13689460", "Greg", "Hayley and Jack made me feel very welcome. Everything about the listing was accurate and it was a great location and neighbourhood."),
("2016-09-07", "13689460", "Luke", "Jack and Hayley are awesome. Down to earth. Welcoming. Made us feel at home. Would def stay there again."),
("2016-09-11", "13689460", "Barnaby", "Hayley & Jack we're very easy & friendly hosts who I would stay with again."),
("2016-09-17", "13689460", "Tanya", "The location was great  comfortable bed  close to nice cafes and restaurants  easy walk into the city and to central station.  The only issue was the parking  however we parked in a secure car park which was only a 10min walk from the accommodation.  Would definitely stay again.  Thank you Hayley."),
("2016-09-25", "13689460", "Carol", "Very nice host and room  comfort bed  clean bathroom. House is near byaround museum station of airport link  and there are a lot of good restaurants around.:)"),
("2016-09-26", "13689460", "Ken", "該房間的地點非常好 兩位主人也非常貼心 若再次前往雪梨 我們依然會入住"),
("2016-09-28", "13689460", "Brendan", "They were awesome and very accomodating.  Highly recommended"),
("2016-10-08", "13689460", "Luis", "Jack and Hayley have a wonderfully located  comfortable apartment right in the middle of the city. I was able to walk almost anywhere and when that wasn't an option Jack was available to give me some tips on how to reach where I wanted to go (Bus and Train Stations are close by). The place itself is very clean and would definitely stay there and/or recommend it to other people staying in Sydney."),
("2016-10-10", "13689460", "Rori", "Great location and super easy to organise  check in etc. "),
("2016-10-13", "13689460", "Kathy", "Very helpful and warm-hearted hosts. Very good journey in Sydney with the perfect accommodation they have provided."),
("2016-10-15", "13689460", "Ashleigh", "Hayley & Jack were very welcoming and friendly. The location was great  comfortable room and clean bathroom. Would highly recommend and stay again if we were in Sydney. "),
("2016-10-20", "13689460", "Roberto", "Super séjour  maison bien située et très propre!"),
("2016-10-22", "13689460", "Rhiannon", "Jack and Hayley were very accommodating  friendly and easy going. Loved the location and the room was just lovely!"),
("2016-11-03", "13689460", "Louis", "Pleasant stay. Hosts were engaging and made sure I was enjoying my stay. Wifi is very good and fast!"),
("2016-11-05", "13689460", "Gabrielle Moore", "Comfortable bed. Clwan and well organized. Easy access to upper central district. Very safe and friendly community.  Great restaurant s on crown street. Thank you for a comfortable stay."),
("2016-11-10", "13689460", "Fang", "我所说一切属实 纯属个人观点和体会｡"),
("2016-11-17", "13689460", "Jill", "Hayley and Jack are busy people and often out of the house  so although this is a house share I did not see much of them. House more or less to myself. "),
("2016-11-19", "13689460", "Morgan", "Amazing location to get the best out of Sydney  very friendly hosts who made the process very easy . Thanks Hayley and Jack!"),
("2016-11-26", "13689460", "Nicole", "I really enjoyed the stay at Hayley's and Jake's place. They were really helpful and down-to-earth. The neighborhood is fantastic to explore the city. You can do everything by foot  it's safe by night too.Would definitely recommend this place to a friend."),
("2016-11-27", "13689460", "Minako", "Irresponsible lowest host.""We will now be away for the weekend so unfortunately will not get to meet you! ""She sent me this message the day before the afternoon of check-in date  no sorry  no apology  nothing. When the day before I made a final confirmation about check-in  she did not mention anything  I don't know why. I didn't check my e-mail after leaving my home  so I first realized this after arriving at her house. I felt very uneasy  I had to find all things myself.If you need to get away from home  okay  but you should let the guest know at least a few days ago  you are too irresponsible.Also where was ""Nutribullet and breakfast essentials""? I didn't see anything  I had only tea and coffee.Also  I left the house before the checkout time  but after that I got a message about checkout.Lowest host."),
("2016-11-30", "13689460", "Shien", "Hayley and Jack were great hosts  and the location of the apartment was very convenient  within walking distance of bus stops and the train station. The bed was huge and very comfy. Thank you for having me! "),
("2016-12-02", "13689460", "Katrine", "Great location and comfy bed. Thanks for a pleasant stay."),
("2016-12-04", "13689460", "Theresa", "Enjoyed my stay at Hayley & Jack's! Their place is located in a cool neighborhood with a great selection of restaurants/shops with close access to tram lines. Hayley & Jack made themselves open to communication and were quick to respond to any questions. They're a friendly couple and made some great suggestions for restaurants. Thanks for making me feel welcomed!"),
("2016-12-07", "13689460", "Alberto", "A nice place. The bed is huge. They made me feel at home although they were at work most of the time. Very accommodating even when I had to check in late."),
("2016-12-16", "13689460", "Robin", "Hayley and Jacks place is great! It's clean and quiet  and simple. Would definitely recommend."),
("2016-12-19", "13689460", "Gina", "Great location and seamless checkin/checkout process. Lovely place!"),
("2016-12-28", "13689460", "Dominique", "It was a good stay with all basic necessities covered! Clean and well kept. Really nice to have coffee and bread too. Great location by bus from Circular quay and Hyde Park. Uphill climb from Central Station. No aircon but fan is provided for summer nights. Appreciated Jack's fast response to my questions! Thanks!"),
("2017-01-02", "13689460", "Veerle", "The stay at Hayley and Jack's was terrific! They are such nice hosts. The room was also very clean and the bed was a real kingsize. I shared it with my brother and we both had enough space:)! I absolutely recommend this place during a stay in Sydney!"),
("2017-01-09", "13689460", "Raffaele", "La camera rispecchia la descrizione. Molto vicino al centro che é raggiungibile a piedi in 20 minuti circa  e ben collegata con i bus. Molto vicina anche alla stazione 5-10 minuti a piedi. Zona carina e tranquilla con diversi locali aperti fino a tardi. Hayley e Jack sono stati carini e disponibili fin dall'inizio e Jack ci ha dato diversi consigli utili su come utilizzare al meglio il nostro tempo. Caldamente raccomandato!"),
("2017-01-13", "13689460", "Daniel", "Great spot in Surrey Hills only moments from great cafes and restaurants and walking distance to most other central Sydney sights."),
("2017-01-19", "13689460", "Katey", "My stay here was great! Awesome location and the hosts go above and beyond. There was milk and bread left for us to eat/drink and they were available for any questions offering perfect suggestions. Would recommend to a friend"),
("2017-01-21", "13689460", "Vicky", "Hayley's place is very well located  close to Museum Station  which makes it very easy to get to the airport or the city centre.  Also close to Hyde Park  Oxford Street but best of all Crown Street - this is a great street with plenty of restaurants!   There are also supermarkets close by if required (for fruit / snacks).  Place is really nice and quiet  bed is huge and comfy  slept really well.  I only stayed 2 nights but enjoyed my stay and would definitely recommend this place.  "),
("2017-01-25", "13689460", "Gearoid", "Great location  friendly hosts"),
("2017-02-01", "13689460", "Michael", "Hayley and Jack are great hosts and were always very polite and accommodating. The place is comfortable and located in a great neighborhood. Very clean room and bathroom and I would highly recommend to anyone visiting Sydney."),
("2017-02-09", "13689460", "Hyeyoon", "호스트와 의사소통이 잘되고 central station에서 10분거리라서 편하긴해요. 그러나 역에서 오르막길이어서 생각보다 힘들었어요. 청소는 자주 안해줘서 지저분했어요."),
("2017-02-14", "13689460", "Lauren", "My stay at Hayley and James' place was so beautiful and convenient. Such perfect hosts. Easy to communicate with and very helpful with late checkouts. The place is easy to find and close to everything I needed. Food  Aldi  buses and a short walk to Central station. I would def stay again. "),
("2017-02-22", "13689460", "Philipp", "Everything was just fine! Hayley and Jack were great hosts. Very helpful and responsive. Thank you once again for the nice stay!"),
("2017-03-06", "13689460", "Kevin", "Great spot and location. Listing precise and accurate"),
("2017-03-11", "13689460", "Martha", "Check in was easy. Location is great with easy access to transport. Bed is great although the room is a bit small. Hayley and Jack were welcoming and helpful."),
("2017-03-13", "13689460", "Sarah", "Everything was exactly as advertised and fantastic. Great location (10 min to rail station  1 min to bus  30 min walk to Circular Quay  and loads of places to eat and drink v nearby)  comfy bed in nice little house with good storage space  sofas  wifi  and breakfast essentials and tea/coffee provided... and Hayley & Jack were great hosts and I enjoyed meeting them. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2017-03-17", "13689460", "Elizabeth", "Great place to stay. Jack was very helpful and gave clear instructions. Bed very comfortable. Great location."),
("2017-03-21", "13689460", "Jess", "Great location  close to whole food grocery  cafes and grocery stores. Jack was very helpful and gave clear instructions. Clean place. "),
("2017-03-28", "13689460", "Peter", "Great location  and Jack's communication and recommendations were spot on. Would stay again when I'm next in Sydney. "),
("2017-04-01", "13689460", "Almudena", "Aunque apenas coincidimos con Jack  estuvo disponible en todo momento para cualquier cosa que necesitásemos. La casa está muy limpia  la habitación suficiente para dos  el baño es compartido  puedes usar la cocina. Muy bien situado  aunque no hay estaciones de tren muy cerca (a unos 10 minutos caminando)  pero se puede ir al centro a pie.Recomendaría este alojamiento!"),
("2017-04-04", "13689460", "Emeline", " Thank you to Haley and Jack for having me in their home for 3 nights. The area is calm but really near from shops  restaurants and buses. It is really easy to walk down town and in the harbour."),
("2017-04-08", "13689460", "Charles", "Good emplacement."),
("2017-04-10", "13689460", "虹辰", "Nice location. Tidy room. Highly recommended."),
("2017-04-14", "13689460", "Emma", "the location is perfect convenient to almost everywhere around downtown you could think of and jack is very kind giving us some tips as where to go we had a good time!"),
("2017-04-17", "13689460", "Sze", "Walking distance to Sydney CBD  great location!"),
("2017-04-24", "13689460", "Zac", "Jack and Hayley were great hosts! They made everything convenient and were endlessly helpful. Great location  true to advertising  and very affordable. Thank you both!"),
("2017-05-04", "13689460", "Justyna", "I had a very comfortable stay  the room and the whole house was very nice - nice paintings all over the place. Jack was very friendly. I think that the greatest value is location here  Surry Hills is hip! It's also well connected to everywhere with public transport."),
("2017-05-11", "13689460", "Tricia", "Great Location  easy walking distance to Sydney CBD. I was there on business so worked out perfect for me. Didn't get to meet Hayley but Jack was a great host."),
("2017-05-21", "13689460", "Venus", "Great location. Accessible."),
("2017-05-23", "13689460", "Yuan", "What a terrific 2-night stay at Jack's home! Good location  fast wifi  clean bedroom and quiet environment. Great set up inside the room and considerate hospitality. Smooth communication with Jack!"),
("2017-05-28", "13689460", "Laura", "Great location! Easy to get to from central station and plenty of buses around the corner too. Bed was really comfy. Hosts were super friendly and flexible with our checkout - Thanks guys it was great."),
("2017-06-05", "13689460", "Moe", "Jack was helpful  friendly and responsive. I would highly recommend staying at his place in surrey hills. It's in a great location with a ton of restaurants nearby. "),
("2017-06-12", "13689460", "Jack", "I had a great time at their place  Surry Hills is a great location for exploring Sydney. They are walkable to good restaurants and bars  but also able to get a quiet sleep at night. The apartment is spacious and very comfortable  I recommended staying here if you visit Sydney!"),
("2017-06-19", "13689460", "Michael", "Nice littke spot close to cafes and CBD.  Jack and Hayley were very accomodating and the coffee machine was a god send force army morning starts.  Don't need a car when staying here at all.  Great location."),
("2017-07-01", "13689460", "Kayla", "Great location. Lovely hosts"),
("2018-01-28", "13689460", "Valentin", "Nice guy and nice stay. Very convenient"),
("2018-02-01", "13689460", "James", "Great apartment in a perfect location for CBD  the harbour and other central sites. Excellent communication with Jack throughout (he was away for most of my stay) ...... free WiFi and access to coffee machine .... would happily book again - great value for money."),
("2016-07-10", "13530122", "Matthew", "Spend a great 2 nights at Vickie's studio. Well decorated  had everything we need and surprisingly spacious. It was my first time in Sydney  so the location was just perfect; many good cafes and restaurants near by.Vickie is an amazing host  she made sure we were comfortable and well adjusted. Great person to communicate with. "),
("2016-07-10", "13530122", "Fabienne", "Merci Victoria pour votre charmant accueil  votre appartement est charmant dans un quartier animé avec des cafés et restaurants à proximité. 15 mn à pied de CBD et de l'opéra de Sydney. La vue de l'appartement est dégagée et très bien exposé.Merci pour vos messages de compassion suite aux attentants de Nice. Je vous recommande cette adresse.Fabienne"),
("2016-07-17", "13530122", "Jason", "What a fabulous Studio in the centre of Potts Point. I was lucky enough to be one of the first to stay here. Everything is lovely  fresh and new. It's quiet  but at the same time has everything on the doorstep. Vickie is a wonderful host and made sure I was comfortable. "),
("2016-07-23", "13530122", "Chloe", "Vickie was a lovely host and did everything she could to help and make our stay enjoyable. The apartment is in an excellent position - close to restaurants and cafes as well as walking distance from the city. The apartment itself is great with a very comfortable bed and has everything you need."),
("2016-07-23", "13530122", "Alexandra", "Vickie is an amazing host with a beautiful apartment. Location is incredible- right by lovely restaurants and bars  and only a quick ride into the city. The apartment itself was gorgeous- so clean  light and airy. Queen bed is super comfortable as well. I highly recommend this apartment  and would love to stay here again. Perfect Airbnb experience. "),
("2016-07-31", "13530122", "Nadia", "The apartment was exactly like the photos  brand new and very clean.The bed was a fold out from the wall  very comfy and the pillow and blankets were amazing."),
("2016-08-04", "13530122", "Leonie", "Perfect apartment! Great local restaurants and supermarket across the road. Perfect and professional communication from the host. Well done. I will stay here for business again."),
("2016-08-07", "13530122", "Hannah", "Great location! A very nice area with lots of bars  shops and restaurants close by and a nice stroll to the city. Clean  modern and comfortable apartment. Very friendly and helpful hosts who were great at communicating and made us feel very welcome. We would definitely stay there again! "),
("2016-08-11", "13530122", "Chia Ming", "The studio was clean and nicely furnish. The sofa and bed are comfortable  and the apartment has a ledge by the window with chairs to people-watch in the day. It has everything necessary for a short term and long term stay. There is a big TV with chromecast that was so useful when my partner and I simply hung in the apartment after a day of exploring.Victoria was prompt in responses and prepare materials abt the area and the facilities that were very useful. Check-in process was very easy. Highly recommended  and will be very happy to be hosted by her again when I visit Sydney."),
("2016-08-13", "13530122", "Alba", "Apartments is small but it is nice and well located. The street is good and plenty of good restaurants and just 5min walking to king cross station"),
("2016-08-22", "13530122", "Kathryn", "We really enjoyed our stay at Victoria's place. It was a beautiful apartment in a fantastic location; close to all shops and amenities. Kings cross is only a short walk away but most days we walked through the beautiful botanic gardens to Central Quays. We really appreciated being able to stay until after lunch on our leaving day. The apartment was beautifully clean and although cosy had everything we needed.Vickie was an excellent host and responded to any queries very promptly despite being away at the time.I would definitely stay at this apartment again if visiting Sydney."),
("2016-08-26", "13530122", "Sara", "We stayed at Vickie's apartment for five nights and we enjoyed it a lot. The apartment is exactly as shown in the pictures and it's well-equipped  beautiful and cozy (the bed is especially comfortable). Victoria was very friendly and easy to communicate with. When we had issues with the wifi  she immediately came over and sorted everything out  although it was already 8 or 8.30 in the evening. She also gave us a lot of information about restaurants  bars and sights in the area. All of her recommendations were really good too!We had an amazing time in Sydney  thanks to our great host Vickie and her lovely apartment. We can definitely recommend this place! :)"),
("2016-08-28", "13530122", "Giuseppe", "Victoria è un Host perfetto. Ci siamo sentiti molto spesso per cordinare il viaggio. La casa è molto vicina al centro molto pulita e graziosa.  Se dovessi tornare a Sydney sicuramente sceglierò nuovamente questo appartamento."),
("2016-08-30", "13530122", "Ana", "Vickie is The perfect host. She is very nice and polite. The apartment was cute and clean. The location of the flat is good and Vickie gives you recommendations of were to have good meals next to it. We would definetly come back there if we ever came to Sydney again!"),
("2016-09-01", "13530122", "Aaron", "Victoria's Chic City Pad was an an excellent stay!! She made my friend and I feel really welcomed from the start! She communicated clearly about the arrival time and gave us great advice about the city. She also checked in regularly to ensure we were enjoying our stay. The neighbourhood is very posh  a less than 30 minute walk from the Opera House and Harbour Bridge  as well as the Botanical Gardens. It was easy to find from Kings Cross train station and we loved the modern feel and look of the flat. "),
("2016-09-03", "13530122", "Seychelle", "Great apartment close to everything. Vickie was really easy to communicate with on our arrival and knowledgable of the area too! highly reccomend."),
("2016-09-12", "13530122", "Sarah", "The apartment was amazing. Perfect location. So comfortable and had everything we needed. Victoria was communicative and attentive. Would love to come back."),
("2016-09-15", "13530122", "Andrew", "Awesome location and great host. Flexible with arrival and departure needs too. Thanks for a great stay Vickie!"),
("2016-09-17", "13530122", "Melinda", "Victoria was super quick to respond to all questions  the location is amazing  great area for cafes and bars  also very central to close to the train so it's very to get around.  Lovely and clean space  it was a pleasure to stay "),
("2016-09-21", "13530122", "Kym", "Check in was very easy. Victoria was there to meet me  explained the area  where everything was and was very helpful in letting me check out later. It was a great stay  definitely recommend the space for any solo travellers and the area for anyone who is looking for great food  and a nice relaxing atmosphere. "),
("2016-09-24", "13530122", "Helen", "Victoria's apartment was perfect for exploring Sydney for the weekend. It's comfortable  well equipped and super convenient to everything Potts Point has to offer. Victoria was a great host too  meeting me on check in and showing me where everything was in the apartment. I'll be back if I need to stay in the area again :)"),
("2016-10-03", "13530122", "Sasha", "Victoria's place saved me from a terrible previous Air b&b experience I was in. It was extremely clean  comfortable  quiet  and relaxing. She was more than helpful when I arrived and had great pointers on what to do in the area. I wish I could've stayed longer! Highly recommend her place."),
("2016-10-04", "13530122", "Kathryn", "Victoria was a very welcoming host. Her place is excellently located"),
("2016-10-08", "13530122", "Celia-Jane", "Loved staying in this apartment! Perfect location to walk / jog down to Botanical gardens & Sydney Opera House & Sydney Harbour Bridge! Which we did Worthing 1hour of checking in! Lovely secure building with nice friendly reception staff. Check in was easy- Vickie's communication was so great- although she couldn't make it when we checked in- she sent her lovely son who showed us all we needed to know! The apartment itself has a nifty pull down (wall) bed which is super comfortable - more than initially expected! The apartment has perfect use of the space- lots of natural light and natural decor- nice and fresh! Perfect size for a short 3day break in Sydney! Beware of the shower- quite a puzzle to regulate the hot and cold when having a shower... Overall a great stay- highly recommend!"),
("2016-10-11", "13530122", "Jessica", "Perfect host! Vickie was so helpful and full of great recommendations. The location is perfect! Such a lovely area! Great coffee across the road at Bottega Del Vino (and that's coming from a melbourner).Across the road from Woolworths  lovely bookshop down the road and great restaurants on your doorstep! The apartment is small but full of light! Perfect for two people. Will be staying back here if ever in Sydney again.  "),
("2016-10-14", "13530122", "Jen", "Vickie was an absolute lovely host!  She rushed to clean the studio and get us in as early as possible and was an absolutely amazing communicator.  She helped with any and all questions even while staying at other locations throughout Sydney.  I highly recommend her studio as she is prompt and a joy to be around!"),
("2016-10-18", "13530122", "Richard", "The apartment is lovely and the area is simply perfect. A fantastic walk through the Botanical Gardens to Sydney's CBD. Loads of great restaurants  bars and cafes on your doorstep. "),
("2016-10-21", "13530122", "Sierra", "The apartment is in a great location in Potts Point.  There are many restaurants  cafes  and markets right outside the door.  We really enjoyed our time!"),
("2016-10-25", "13530122", "Emily", "Victoria was a very gracious and friendly host! The apartment was clean and as described. She gave us a lot of great recommendations for the area  as well. "),
("2016-10-28", "13530122", "Edmund", "Victoria was at the studio apt to greet us  show us where everything was and to give us advice on finding our way around Sydney. She was very pleasant and helpful.  The apt was very clean  had all we needed and was easily accessible to the CBD  the Opera House and harbour. Lots of restaurants  cafes  shops close by plus a food market right across the street.   A very nice and secure building."),
("2016-11-02", "13530122", "Lavina", "A great experience staying at Victoria's place in Potts Point! Cozy place with great views.. we loved looking out the windows at the comings and goings of the street below. Also very centrally located  it was easy getting anywhere! Everything you need is available at the apartment and with Woolies just across the street  it was easy getting anything else you need too. Victoria is very responsive  and a pleasure to communicate with. Thanks for the great stay Vickie!"),
("2016-11-06", "13530122", "Lynn", "Cozy place to stay for a few days. We had a minor issue in the apartment and Victoria was quick to respond and provided a quick fix. The location is  walking distance to the botanical garden with access to grocery store across the street and good restaurants along the street.  Would stay again if we return for a visit in the future."),
("2016-11-11", "13530122", "Alina", "Vickie is a great host! Such a lovely and helping women  we had a wonderful time at the apartment.I can totally recommend Vickies Apartment for a trip to Sydney and would definitely stay there again  if I get a chance to.The apartment looks just like on the pictures  you will find everything nice and clean. The kitchen is perfect for having breakfast and little snacks at the apartment  but you can cook there as well.The train station is within walking distance. However we mostly walked into the city as you can walk by the water and see the main attractions (opera house  Harbour Bridge). It's a nice walk of about 20min.Vickie was very helpful with every question we had and replied within shortest time.THANK YOU for everything  Vickie!"),
("2016-11-16", "13530122", "Jamie", "We loved staying here!  Vickie was the ultimate host:  Timely  clear communication  extra amenities  and useful tips for this ideally-located (easy walk to key areas) fun  funky  highly diverse neighborhood with a great vibe.Stay HERE  you'll be glad you did."),
("2016-11-19", "13530122", "Joseph", "We had a great time in Sydney staying at Vickie's lovely flat. The location was perfect  the flat was well furnished  and Vickie gave us a great welcome. Thanks for letting us stay."),
("2016-11-25", "13530122", "Sean", "Great little place in a perfect location ... bright and clean"),
("2016-11-26", "13530122", "Jackie", "Amazing experience with Vickie  even though she was unable to be there when we arrived she made the process a breeze and phoned us to make sure we had everything we needed. Vickie was quick to respond to messages and any problems we had. She also provided chocolates  milk and coffee for us until we were able to get to the shops (which is only across the road). The appartment is super close to everything! takes about 25 minute walk to the cbd  and 10 mins to kings cross station which was perfect for us. I would  100% recommend Vickie to anyone who needs a place to stay in Sydney. Thank you again!! "),
("2016-11-28", "13530122", "Delaina", "Victoria was a super host. The place was very clean and looked just like the pictures. It was in prime location. We thoroughly enjoyed staying there."),
("2016-12-09", "13530122", "Ramona", "Die Unterkunft liegt ca. 20min zu Fuß vom Zentrum entfernt. Der Check- in verlief unkompliziert  Viktoria war vor Ort und hat uns viele gute Tipps für Sydney gegeben.  Es gibt sehr viele gute Restaurants und Cafe's in der Nähe. Das Appartement war sehr sauber  ausreichend groß und das ausklappbare Bett war sehr bequem. Eine kleine Küchennische war ebenfalls vorhanden  wo man alles für ein kleines Frühstück finden konnte. Wir würden auf jeden Fall diese Unterkunft noch einmal wählen! "),
("2016-12-10", "13530122", "Jessica", "We had a great stay at Vickie's gorgeous pad! Vickie is super easy to deal with   the apartment is well lite and quite spacious and close to all main shops  cafes and public transport - the perfect spot for a girls night out! The bed is extra comfortable too. Thank you Vickie ☺"),
("2016-12-15", "13530122", "Jeanne", "Clean & spacious apartment for two. 5-10 mins walk to King's Cross Station. Woolworths right across the street. Victoria was very nice to wait for us at the foyer for check-in  highly recommended!"),
("2016-12-19", "13530122", "Arthur", "You would enjoy Victoria and she is very helpful with any suggestions on what to do in Sydney and questions and help with anything to do with Sydney.  Enjoyed her company as well."),
("2016-12-25", "13530122", "MaxBar", "Ein fantastisches kleines Appartment im pulsierenden Stadtteil Potts Point. Alles hat gepasst! Vickie hat uns um Anreisetag herzlich empfangen und uns viele nützliche Tipps gegeben. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und können Vickie und ihr Appartment nur wärmstens weiterempfehlen."),
("2017-01-03", "13530122", "Franziska", "We stayed in Victoria's place for a bit more than a week. The location is just outstanding; cafes  restaurants  cinema  public transport....everything is so close and nevertheless the flat is quiet at night and with air conditioning perfectly temperature wise at night during summer. We loved our time in the flat and thanks to Victoria it was a perfect start. "),
("2017-01-09", "13530122", "Carole", "L'appartement de Victoria est très beau  très agréable  bien situé  très propre  il est parfait. Nous avons adoré ce logement. Il y a tout à proximité  transports  cafés  restaurants  supermarché  à 30 minutes à peine à pied de l'opéra de Sydney et son centre-ville. Victoria est très sympathique et nous a accueilli très agréablement  elle a été de bons conseils durant notre séjour. Nous la remercions infiniment."),
("2017-01-15", "13530122", "Cindy", "A most wonderful first time airbnb experience!  Victoria is a very friendly and helpful host. She kindly offered the use of the apartment from early in the morning after travelling the midnight horror  and met us on arrival. Thank you!We truly lived like locals during our 5 day stay. The apartment  which had everything we needed  is perfectly positioned within 25min walk from the city  in a gorgeous art deco neighborhood. Whilst exploring potts point we uncovered many fantastic local eateries and fabulous coffee spots. So many good memories and too many positives to mention  just do yourself a favour...."),
("2017-01-17", "13530122", "Karen", "The apartment is well represented on the listing.  The area is absolutely charming and Vickie is a great host. Would definitely stay there again!"),
("2017-01-22", "13530122", "Fiona", "We've had a fantastic time in Victoria's apartment. The location is incredible with a short walk to Kings Cross station  loads of restaurants and bars nearby  and we really appreciated all the little extras Victoria provided. We now love Sydney and will be back!"),
("2017-01-27", "13530122", "Lesley", "The apartment was exactly as described. Very near to train stations. Main attraction were easily accessed by one or two stops on the train. It is walkable if you can handle a walk in the heat. The bed was super comfy. Nice small clean kitchen. Free wifi with good signal strength could stream Netflix to the TV. Iron  hairdryer towels were all supplied. Even toiletries and some food items were provided. Helpful instructions on the local area and tips on where to go. First time air bnb and was very impressed. "),
("2017-01-28", "13530122", "Cecilia", "Great location!"),
("2017-02-03", "13530122", "Joachim", "Sehr schöne Wohnung in Top-Lage  Restaurants und Shopping in der Nähe  sehr gutes Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis. Victoria ist super nette Gastgeberin. Die Kommunikation mit ihr im Vorfeld sowie bei Check-in und Check-out war perfekt!"),
("2017-02-06", "13530122", "Ryota", "Vickie is the best host  very friendly and kind. She gave us many advices about what to see  where to visit and how to get there  etc.She took very nice care of us until the very end.And of course  Vickie's place was nice. The room was cozy and clean.Close to restaurants  transportations and others you may need for staying.We definitely recommend this host and place."),
("2017-02-13", "13530122", "Jennifer", "Vickie was an excellent host. Great place for a solo traveler. Safe neighborhood and close to train station. Many food options including grocery store. Quiet apt with good working tv and internet. Would recommend!"),
("2017-02-17", "13530122", "Joel", "Great location  and the apartment is nicely appointed. Vickie was an excellent  communicative host. I would stay again."),
("2017-02-23", "13530122", "Henry", "Great and comfortable stay. Close to everything. Good restaurants and coffee shops within a block. 20 minute walk to Opera House  etc. Vickie was the perfect host.  "),
("2017-03-04", "13530122", "Paul", "Beautiful apartment  great location for access to the city and beaches. Lovely quiet suburb with great cafes on the door step. Vickie was the perfect host too  really helpful and accommodating."),
("2017-03-09", "13530122", "Ian", "What a great city pad!!Victoria was so welcoming and had thought of everything you might need including umbrellas ( which we did need!!)The apartment was spotless & the location was easy enough to get into the centre by foot or bus ... we preferred walking via the amazing Botanical Gardens.. absolutely stunning!!!Well located & fab restaurants on the door step too & if you like Thai food well Victoria recommended The Opium Den ... we went back twice.... omg it was superb!!Thanks again Victoria!Sue & Ian UK"),
("2017-03-15", "13530122", "Helen", "Victoria's place is a hidden gem. Immaculately clean  cosy  affordable  and in a fantastic location it is highly recommended.  Cafes  top restaurants at your doorstep  it is a foodies dream! Very handy transport links with buses outside door  and train station only 7 min walk away. We also loved access to the outdoor pool to cool off in after a day out and about.  Victoria was great to deal with- prompt and reliable with communication and very welcoming. I have high expectations  for accomodation and this ticked all the boxes. Certainly would like to return if ever back in Sydney.  Thanks Vickie.  "),
("2017-03-20", "13530122", "Jessica", "Such a great find! The studio is cute and modern and in a fabulous location! Tons of shops and restaurants  close to bus stops and train stations and a 30 minute walk to the Opera House! What more could you ask for! Victoria is a great host  so easy to reach and always happy to help!"),
("2017-03-27", "13530122", "Andrea", "Vickie's place is in a great location. Close to the city and plenty of restaurants and cafes right at your door step. Vickie is the perfect host."),
("2017-04-01", "13530122", "Jens", "We had a very nice time in this flat last week.In regards to the communication. Vicky was very easy to reach and we always received a swift response. She was very helpful and also had a few nice tips which obviously is the benefit of talking to a local.The flat is located in a very nice area of Sydney with great restaurants and bars right in walking distance.In walking distance is also the Botanical Garden as well as the Opera House. Just to highlight a couple of things.The flat was very clean and we would definitely stay there again."),
("2017-04-04", "13530122", "Fernanda", "The apartment is confortable  spacious and well decorated. The bed is amazing and I loved the big windows with street views. Victoria was lovely. I was travelling with my husband  arriving from a 20 hour flight from Brazil and she let us check in earlier. We really appreciated it. The neighbourhood is charming and full of nice cafes and restaurants. We had breakfast at Zinc cafe everyday. I highly recommend the property and would definitely stay here again. Thank you  Vickie! "),
("2017-04-08", "13530122", "Andrea", "A very comfortable place. In an excellent location. Cleanliness was excellent. Vickie always responded with any questions. Would definitely stay there again."),
("2017-04-11", "13530122", "Katharina", "We had a nice stay in Vickies apartment  which is located in a cool suburb with lots of Cafés and Restaurants. It's a small but optimal used room.Vickie was very friendly and easy to contact Check-In and Out was very easy as well!"),
("2017-04-13", "13530122", "Yuan", "Very good locacation! clean and comfortable! good communication with Victoria."),
("2017-04-16", "13530122", "Laura", "Wonderful location in Sydney. Very clean and comfortable. Victoria is a great host and always contactable."),
("2017-04-23", "13530122", "Paul", "Excellent location - perfect to enjoy a bit of ""local"" flavor but also only a short walk to the train station to explore more of Sydney. Also has a supermarket exactly opposite so extremely convenient. Vickie kept in touch with us and arranged to have the internet fixed very quickly when it failed even though she was not in Sydney at the time."),
("2017-04-28", "13530122", "Victoria", "Victoria was a wonderful host  so hospitable and kindly anticipated our needs while in Sydney. The apartment was beautifully well kept and the location was perfect - quaint locale with convenient shops  cafes and restaurants a stone's throw away without having that crowded or city-like feel.  Zinc  across the street  was our favorite breakfast spot during the visit.  Would definitely choose to stay again on any future visits!"),
("2017-05-10", "13530122", "Sabrina Et Sebastien", "One word to sum up what was our first Airbnb experience: PERFECT! Victoria was a great host from our first contact until we left. The apartment is welcoming  neat and in walking distance to Central Sydney and several good restaurants.We strongly recommend anyone visiting Sydney to book this apartment. We would not hesitate a second to recommend it to friends and family!"),
("2017-05-14", "13530122", "Nick", "Vickie was a great host. The apartment was in a really good location and was as we expected it to be from the description and photos. I highly recommend this apartment for anyone wanting to stay in the Potts Point area."),
("2017-05-18", "13530122", "James", "Great place in the heart of Potts Point."),
("2017-05-21", "13530122", "Rupert Jules", "Amazing accommodation."),
("2017-05-25", "13530122", "Adam", "Great spot!"),
("2017-05-31", "13530122", "Jair", "The location of Victoria's place is very convenient. Easy walking distance to many sights such as museums  St. Mary's Cathedral as well as a nearby harbor with restaurants to enjoy breakfast or lunch.  The room is near a very lively part of Sydney but not so close as to be inconveniencing. Overall  I enjoyed my stay and would return again in the future. "),
("2017-06-07", "13530122", "Dana", "What a fabulous find Victoria's place was!… Close to everything you could possibly want or need. Public transportation was easy accessible or you can simply walk your way to  the Circular Quay area. There's a supermarket directly across the street for your convenience.The studio is exactly as shown in pictures…very clean and tidy and EXTREMELY safe.Victoria was readily available for any questions or  concerns….Such a lovely  vibrant  and interesting person. I absolutely loved staying here!…My only regret was not being able to stay longer!"),
("2017-06-13", "13530122", "Qun", "Lovely apartment with grocery shop and cafes nearby. It is a 6 min walk from Kings Cross station. Victoria was very helpful and kept in touch with us to make sure that we were able to reach the apartment from the airport without much trouble. Would love to visit again."),
("2017-06-25", "13530122", "Alex", "The apartment was very nice & clean  had everything we needed! Close walk to the Harbour Bridge & the Botanical Gardens which was great. I definitely highly recommend my stay here and thank Vickie very much for having myself & my partner and for informing us about the area :) "),
("2017-07-07", "13530122", "Emma", "Amazing apartment and Victoria is so helpful. The area is very cool - cafes galore and some incredible restaurants. I'll be back!"),
("2017-07-13", "13530122", "Alison", "Great place! Beautiful apartment and close to most things (walking distance & close to public transport). Victoria was very helpful and friendly!"),
("2017-07-16", "13530122", "Kevin", "Great knowledge of the Sydney area. Was very helpful for first time timers in Australia."),
("2017-07-21", "13530122", "Ally", "Vickie is a very helpful and gracious host. Will definitely come again. Thanks so much!!"),
("2017-07-22", "13530122", "Pierce", "Victoria was so nice. She gave us a personal check in  with an explanation of the area  food  location etc. There was great communication. Very clear and what  when  where in terms of booking this place and where to meet here. The place itself was extremely clean  restocked  and ready to go. One of the nicest airbnbs I have stayed at.   "),
("2017-07-30", "13530122", "Andreas", "Schöne kleine 1 - Zimmerwohnung  sauber  gut ausgestattet und zentral gelegen. Ideal für einen Citytrip für ein paar Tage!"),
("2017-08-03", "13530122", "Lynne", "A lovely 3 days spent in Victoria's studio apartment. Very well equiped and in a great location for seeing the sights of Sydney ! Victoria's attention to detail made it all the more special. We will definitely be back ! Thank you"),
("2017-08-06", "13530122", "Sharleen", "Victoria's apartment was a short walk to King's Cross station  and well located to travel to the main attractions. The apartment is located in an upscale local neighbourhood with plenty of eateries in the area and a supermarket and deli right opposite. The apartment itself was spotless and very clean. It had everything we needed - toiletries  towels  a small kitchen and coffee. Victoria was lovely and we had a wonderful stay here."),
("2017-08-09", "13530122", "Steven", "It was very nice"),
("2017-08-13", "13530122", "Shili", "The studio was very clean and welcoming  location was perfect as well. Vickie was very friendly  she came to greet us and show us the studio. Not suitable for cooking since the smell will stay in the studio  so we ate mostly around the neighbourhood which was perfectly fine with us since there are so many food options."),
("2017-08-16", "13530122", "Afnan", "Amazing stay"),
("2017-08-20", "13530122", "Chris", "The apartment was spotlessly clean and had all the things we needed e.g extra towels  blanket  kitchen amenities  hair drier  as well as some extras we weren't expecting e.g. plunger coffee  tea & milk  chocolates.   The location is in a lovely area with several nice cafes and restaurants only a short walk away.  There's also a supermarket across the road which is so handy. The outlook from the window was delightful - warm sun  beautiful trees and great to just watch people strolling by!  Victoria is very friendly and helpful (thank you!) and provided us with tips on where to eat and visit -  including the market near the El Alamein Fountain on Saturday morning.  You won't be disappointed."),
("2017-08-23", "13530122", "Simon", "Apartment has everything you need for a work trip based in the best location for short trips."),
("2017-08-30", "13530122", "Niccolas", "victoria is a really great host  she's really handy  and take care of us during stayed at her place. The place just amazing  love the minimalist interior  and looks super clean. and the big window with awesome view. the place close to public transport  bus station just across the street  the train station around 6-7 minutes by walk. i'll coming back to her place. :D"),
("2017-09-03", "13530122", "Tim", "A fantastic little apartment in the heart of Potts Point."),
("2017-09-09", "13530122", "Adam", "Victoria's apartment was perfect for our trip to Sydney. Check in was simple and easy with Victoria kindly telling us all about the local area. The place has everything we needed including decent Wifi. It was close to lots of the best restaurants and bars in Sydney  with Kings cross station only a 5-10 walk away. We wouldn't hesitate to stay here again."),
("2017-09-20", "13530122", "Libby", "We had 4 wonderful nights  at Vickie's apartment.  She met us there  showed us around the apartment and recommended several restaurants you can see on the street below.  The view and location is terrific.  It is an easy 5 minute walk to the train station.  The towels and bedding were top notch.  We made use of the chromecast for streaming tv shows.   The indoor plants are a great touch  very impressed to see a healthy fiddle leaf fig  I should have asked Vickie for tips.  There is nowhere to hang clothes up but when I travel I usually just live out of the suitcase anyway.  Definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2017-09-24", "13530122", "Riccardo", "Small studio in nice building in one of the best parts of Sydney  close to many good restaurants and bars  not to mention several shops  walking distance (20/30 mins) to the CBD and very good connections with public transportation. Laundry options available on each floor of the building. Victoria was a great host  very friendly and gave us lots of informations. Definitely recommended for anyone spending a weekend in Sydney  or as part of a longer trip as in our case."),
("2017-09-29", "13530122", "Andrea", "Compact but comfortable  stylishly decorated and well equipt space that is quite central. Victoria was really helpful and responsive. We really enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-10-06", "13530122", "Lingran", "victoria is really a nice person  and her apartment is cozy and convenient. Will definitely live here again when next time I come here. Thanks for everything~"),
("2017-10-11", "13530122", "Ria", "Really great host  very informative about local restaurants etc. The apartment is close to Kings Cross train station  and a walkabledistance to the CBD. It is as described  small but clean  comfortable and has everything you need for a base whilst traveling around Sydney."),
("2017-10-15", "13530122", "Jeol", "Amazon location and an even better host!"),
("2017-10-21", "13530122", "Trudy", "Vickie""s Chic Pad is a great location and exactly as advertised."),
("2017-10-26", "13530122", "Bryony", "This apartment is in a fantastic location with many local bars and excellent eateries. Walkable to the botanical gardens and central Sydney. The apartment is perfectly equipped and had all the essentials so we were able to cook in our eat out. Highly recommend staying here in a wonderful part of Sydney!"),
("2017-10-30", "13530122", "Judy Ice", "An adorable studio room in a popular part of town. Very close to major attractions. Location was ideal for all travelers needs; all types and price ranges of restaurants  transportation  grocery stores and bottle shops. Safe area of town for walking either during daytime or in the evening. Victoria was wonderful to work with and a great hostess. Studio was well equipped  comfortable and very clean. This was our first time staying in an airbnb. It was a great experience."),
("2017-11-02", "13530122", "Jill", "Victoria's place was the perfect location for our holiday. Vickie was there to meet us upon check-in and shared some priceless tips with us. We had a great time!"),
("2017-11-05", "13530122", "Joe", "The perfect accommodation for my Mum and I. Loved the location especially enjoying a morning coffee and watching the locals (and their dogs!) walking by. Highly recommend this little gem!"),
("2017-11-11", "13530122", "Nadine", "Logement idéalement placé a sydney car tout peut se faire a pied avec de bonnes baskets car beaucoup de montees!!magasin de nourriture juste en face ."),
("2017-11-15", "13530122", "Kelsey", "An excellent location!We walked in to the botanical gardens which were stunning then on to circular quay.The city centre was closer than we thought it would be which was a nice surprise.Public transport was also easy to use and nearby. The apartment had a nice view and everything we needed. The Gypsy Cafe around the corner is worth a visit!"),
("2017-11-22", "13530122", "Giana", "Perfect for tourist who want to live like a local.  Excellent location   perf3ct room.  We experi3nced the electricity problem but Vickie fixed that for us immediately.  Perfect stay."),
("2017-11-26", "13530122", "Patrick", "Ruhige Lage im netten Viertel Potts Point. Alles was man braucht ist vorhanden und Vickie kümmert sich rührend."),
("2017-11-29", "13530122", "Debbie", "Location and price were wonderful. Be prepared for a very small studio  but the accommodations are very comfortable for a few days."),
("2017-12-04", "13530122", "Niklas", "Great Appartement which is good to reach by public transport. We really enjoyed our stay!"),
("2017-12-08", "13530122", "Charne", "My partner and I stayed here for 5 nights. This is a lovely small apartment  that had everything we needed. It was very clean and modern. In the perfect location if you are looking to explore the city  kings cross station is just a 10 minute walk away. The streets surrounding he apartment are full of small business shops and there is a convenience store right across the road. We would definitely rebook if we were travelling here again. Unfortunately we didn’t get a chance to meet Victoria  due to our arrival time. However she responded fast to messages and was very helpful."),
("2017-12-09", "13530122", "Nick", "Vickie was thorough and accommodating with the check in.The place was small but centrally located and had everything we needed to make it a very comfortable stay.Thanks  we definitely recommend!"),
("2017-12-12", "13530122", "Hylton", "Fantastic.! Victoria was a great host and met us in the lobby on arrival and was very friendly and gave ussome great suggestions. It is a small studio apartment which looked exactly like on the website and is perfect for two people. Location was perfect for exploring the city and walkable to restaurants and Kings Cross station. There was a small kitchen with a hotplate  toaster  kettle and fridge - was perfect for our stay. Great area  great location and would definitely book again and highly recommend!"),
("2017-12-16", "13530122", "Michael", "Victoria’s place is in a great location. There are plenty of eating places nearby and lots of interesting shops. All of Sydney’s attractions are within walking distance but public transport is good  we got buses into town and got the train and bus to Bondi Beach. We loved having breakfast looking out of the window at the passers by in the street. Great place!"),
("2017-12-21", "13530122", "Susie", "We had a brilliant time exploring Sydney from Vickie’s apartment"),
("2017-12-27", "13530122", "Derek", "Victoria is a great host as she was always there to answer any of our questions.  The studio is well situated with all the necessary amenities around you.  Very close to Kings Cross station  so very easy to get around.  The apartment was clean and comfortable.  Great stay!"),
("2018-01-02", "13530122", "Tom", "Vickie was a great host  gave us plenty of local tips when we arrived and made us feel very welcome. Lovely apartment in an ideal location for the city and the beaches! "),
("2018-01-08", "13530122", "John", "The apartment is ideally situated for public transport to all of the major attractions. Equally  many places of interest are only a pleasant stroll away. Vickie is an excellent host who fully informed us about the apartment and the locality on arrival. Lots of good local restaurants and a supermarket is just across the road. A great stay and we highly recommend this apartment."),
("2018-01-10", "13530122", "Carole", "I booked Victoria’s place for my parents to stay while they were visiting Syndey for two nights. They had a great trip and loved Victoria’s place. I knew it would be perfect for them as they aren’t well travelled and didn’t know Sydney at all. Victoria was the perfect and host and checked them in early and helped with anything they needed. If I make it to Sydney I will definitely be checking this place for availability. Thanks again Vickie!"),
("2018-01-14", "13530122", "Klaus", "Very nice apartment  perfect location in a beautiful neighbourhood  Vickie is a super-nice host."),
("2018-01-21", "13530122", "Mavis", "地點好 而且有附小廚房很方便 房間整體很舒服 房東回覆迅速讓人很安心｡不過感覺很像小旅館 不太像一般的家｡"),
("2018-01-26", "13530122", "Garth", "Thanks for the fantastic accomodation Vickie. Very clean and loved the personal touches  such as welcome chocolates and the fridge stocked with  milk  water  etc. The location was perfect  with everything being within a short walking distance. The flat was very quiet too which was surprising.  Vickie was the perfect host and very good at communication. Thanks again!"),
("2018-02-01", "13530122", "Leroy", "Die Lage fand ich gut  man ist innert 10 minuten beim Bahnhof Kings Cross und es hat viele kleine Imbisse etc. in der nähe. Direkt vis-a-vis befindet sich auch ein Supermarkt was ich cool finde. Die Unterkunft was sehr sauber und sah aus wie beschrieben. Das einzige das ich bemängeln kann ist die klimaanlage welche anfangs auf unser Bett getropft hat  und auf den Bildern sah die Unterkunft um einiges grösser aus als sie tatsächlich war. Gut fotografiert ;-)"),
("2018-02-03", "13530122", "Rebecca", "We really loved this space  such a great location in lovely affluent Pott’s point with great transport links as well as a nice walk to circular Quay through the botanical gardens. Smart building and v clean  quiet. Vickie was very accommodating and a lovely host. Visit the farmers market just up the road on Saturday mornings. Great supermarket directly opposite."),
("2018-02-07", "13530122", "Karla", "This studio is clean and just as described! Vickie went above and beyond to meet us and had all the basic necessities ready to go. The unit is centrally located in a great neighborhood. My husband and I walked and used public transportation all over Sydney. Look no further for a great place to stay! Thank you  Vickie for having us!"),
("2018-02-12", "13530122", "Loreta", "Lovely stay! The apartment was great  easy to find and get the keys. The location was great with a grocery store and cafe right across the street. The apartment had everything I needed  very comfortable stay."),
("2018-02-18", "13530122", "Gen", "We loved the location of Vickie’s apartment. The area was so quaint with many great cafes in short walking distance and the supermarket just across the street. The bus and train provided us easy access around and the walk to the Opera House and Harbor Bridge through the Royal Botanical Gardens was beautiful  though a bit long. It was relaxing to sit at the bar top and look out at the tree-lined street below or further out to the CBD skyline.  We did find the apartment a bit tight when walking from the main living area to the entry hall where the mini fridge is with the bed lowered  so we probably should’ve raised it when not in use. When I slept I could sometimes feel the the bed frame through the mattress  so I think maybe a memory foam mattress might work a bit better  I’m not sure.  There is a step up/down getting in and out of the shower with somewhat reduced headroom which won’t affect most people but could if someone had limited mobility or was very tall.  The walls were thin but the neighbors were all quiet in the evenings.  Vickie was so sweet to provide coffee  tea  water  muesli  and milk  and she provided us great tips and recommendations on places to go and how to get there! Vickie is truly a superstar host and you’ll be in great hands with her!!!"),
("2018-02-21", "13530122", "Dai", "Cozy and clean!Great!Near to the supermarket"),
("2018-02-22", "13530122", "Monique", "Vickie's apartment was perfect for a 1 night stay in town. The location is so central and although the room is small it offers great value. The double glazing on the windows meant that we had a great sleep.Many thanks again Vickie for a seamless checkin."),
("2018-03-05", "13530122", "Raajaan", "Awesome location!"),
("2018-03-06", "13530122", "Rebecca", "Vickie is an amazing host and the apartment is exactly as depicted - beautiful  central  well appointed and excellent value for money."),
("2018-03-11", "13530122", "Patrícia", "Apartamento muito bem localizado  fácil acesso aos principais pontos turísticos da cidade  vizinhança agradável  bares e restaurantes a vontade  próximo a transporte público. Vickie  a anfitriã  muito atenciosa e prestativa. Se tiver oportunidade de voltar a Sydney  o espaço de Vickie com certeza estará em meus planos."),
("2018-03-15", "13530122", "Rudi", "We love staying at Vickie's city pad. It is a great location  very central and easy commute to the city and other amenities.Being right across the street from the bus stop was an added bonus."),
("2018-03-16", "13530122", "Aimee", "Vickie has been such a wonderful host  and the apartment was the perfect space for my weekend escape to Sydney. Super close to the shops  local cafes and also the harbour. What more could one ask for?"),
("2018-03-18", "13530122", "Nicole", "Victoria's apartment is in a great location. We enjoyed the Saturday market followed by a nice walk to the Royal Botanic Gardens and harbor.  Dinner downstairs at Billy Kwong was delicious. Victoria is quick to respond to questions and provides helpful suggestions for exploring the neighborhood."),
("2018-03-21", "13530122", "Joseph", "We had a great stay with Vickie. Check in was easy and she was very contactable and helpful throughout.  Tea and coffee making facilities appreciated.Fold down bed was very comfy and made the most of the space within the room.  Also very stylishly decorates and (Hidden by Airbnb) TV was a great addition for watching Netflix.Location was great  only a short walk to Kings cross station and loads of cool cafes close by.  Also worth noting is a shuttle to airport run by the hotel for only 14 dollars !!We would happily stay there again."),
("2018-03-22", "13530122", "Blair", "Victoria's place was spotlessly clean. I also enjoyed the real bed sheets (not just a doona like you get in many AirBnb's.) Mcleay St is a great spot for food and shops also."),
("2018-03-28", "13530122", "Janet", "This was our first AirBNB experience  so have nothing to compare it to  however  Vickie was very accommodating and we appreciated all the thoughtful touches in the apartment.  The apartment was small (as stated it is a studio - one room and a bathroom)  but perfectly suitable for a couple as a base to explore the immediate area. The Kings Cross underground is within a 5 minute walk for locations further afield.  There were a couple of minor things that needed to be fixed for future guests (towel rail and shower head in bathroom)  but Vickie said she would get these arranged after we left.  They did not affect our experience in any way  which was very pleasurable."),
("2018-04-25", "13530122", "Patty", "We had a great stay at Victoria’s apartment! We were in Sydney for almost a month as our daughter had just had her first baby and the apartment was perfect for a number of reasons. It was in the perfect location being only a 5 min walk to her place as well as the best street in Potts Point! Just one block away were our favorite places to eat on Challis Street.... Fratell’s  The Fish Shop and Fejays.  Across the street is a great grocery store ... Woolworths.Every Saturday is a wonderful open Market up the street with the best corn fritters I’ve ever had and more. The Kings Cross train station is only 5 min away as well  which made getting around super easy.Her apartment was very clean  bright and comfortable. For being a studio we were a little concerned it may feel cramped for a month stay  but it never felt that way and a lot of that had to do with the the wall of windows that had a great view overlooking the trees and the city.The shower was a little tricky as it was small and you had to step up to get into it  so we bought a small shower mat and that did the trick so there was no more fear of slipping! Victoria has really thought everything thru as far as utilizing her space for the best efficiency and added great touches with all the amenities.We will look forward to staying there again on our next visit to see our daughter and family!"),
("2018-04-30", "13530122", "Maj Lyhne", "Hun var så betænksom. Alt var perfekt  og hun svarede super hurtigt  hvis man havde spørgsmål. Intet at sætte en finger på"),
("2018-05-04", "13530122", "Emily", "Victoria’s place is in the most wonderfully hip neighbourhood  with a location that allows one to walk to the iconic landmarks in Sydney. The loft is decorated in an extremely aesthetically pleasing manner  and her hospitality makes you feel at ease."),
("2018-05-06", "13530122", "Rebecca", "Exactly as described! We were very happy with our three nights at Victoria’s place. Some great eats within walking distance and close to public transport if you want to go somewhere else.Everything you need for a short stay!"),
("2018-05-09", "13530122", "Mike", "This place is in a great spot. Convenient if you like to be close to restaurants and bars. Communication was very quick and clear."),
("2018-05-10", "13530122", "Jason", "Enjoyed me stay. Great location."),
("2018-05-12", "13530122", "Katelin", "Very cosy apartment! Perfect for one or two people for trips! Victoria was a great host and made it super easy to get in contact with!"),
("2018-05-18", "13530122", "Jo", "Great studio apartment in fantastic location.  Very clean with extra touches and everything you needed.  Check in and out was very easy with good communication.  Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-05-20", "13530122", "Marg", "Victoria’s apartment was excellent! Sparkling clean  comfortable  well-appointed and well-located. Although public transport is close by  if you’re prepared to walk a bit  you can easily reach the Gallery of NSW  walk through the Botanical Gardens and on to the Opera House and Circular Quay in about 40 minutes  enjoying the scenery!"),
("2018-05-30", "13530122", "Helena", "Perfect location  the bus to CBD is less than 5 min walk away. The place is clean and cozy. I would go back!"),
("2018-06-03", "13530122", "Chip", "great location. really nice walk to the harbour area. place was a great base in-between all the activities we did in Sydney. nice and Central and easy to access. Woolworths across the road was great and the restaurants around the area were incredible."),
("2018-06-10", "13530122", "Erika", "Victoria has been an amazing host. Her place is fully equipped with everything  cozy  great location and most importantly clean! Will definitely stay at Victoria's again when we visit Sydney!"),
("2018-06-12", "13530122", "Rebecca", "Great location  snug and clean apartment with a very comfy bed. Close to the train station  beautiful walks nearby and heaps of cafes and restaurants on the surrounding streets. Loved our stay here at Victoria’s! "),
("2018-06-16", "13530122", "Benaiah", "Great Studio for relaxing and unwinding. Everything good that’s local is right at your doorstep."),
("2018-06-18", "13530122", "Eirene", "The studio apartment was what we expected and exactly enough for two people  the bathroom though was kinda small. The television was connected to Chrome Cast so I enjoyed that. The location was near the bus stop and a 10-15 minute walk from the train station which is King's Cross. If you're a tourist  you'll probably want to walk around the city center  which is Town Hall (two stops from King's Cross Station). It is very convenient."),
("2018-06-23", "13530122", "Valiha", "Victoria's place is ideally situated.  It has absolutely everything you may need and the supermarket and shops along the road are super handy!  Victoria is great at maintaining communication and is very accommodating.  We had a super stay and wouldn't hesitate to stay there again.  Be sure to check out the local market at the square with the fountain if you are there on a Saturday."),
("2018-06-26", "13530122", "Jacky", "My sister and I had a wonderful stay at Victoria's place! It was in a quiet area that was a quick walk or Uber ride to wherever we were headed. The place was clean and check in was easy. We we're able to make breakfast each morning with the provided amenities. The apartment was perfect for our 3 day stay."),
("2018-06-30", "13530122", "Tobias", "Long story short  with no doubt a five star place. Great location  quiet  clean  store literally across the street... perfect. Will be back!"),
("2018-07-02", "13530122", "Niclas", "Diese Unterkunft können wir nur bestens empfehlenSchönes Appartement in einer sehr guten Lage  drumherum sind viele Restaurants und Cafés mit gutem Essen"),
("2018-07-09", "13530122", "Ella", "Vickie went absolutely above and beyond to make our stay as perfect as possible - offering early check in and also offering us to leave our luggage in the apartment after check out so we could continue to explore Sydney!The apartment itself is simple  in a great location and included everything that was needed for a comfortable  enjoyable stay. The addition of the chocolates  Sydney travel tips as well as local eateries etc was great. Would definitely recommend this apartment and will be back to stay when we next go to Sydney."),
("2018-07-13", "13530122", "Marcus", "Vickie’s apartment is exactly as the photos show! It is a fantastic place. Big room and really good sunlight coming into the apartment. The bed was comfortable and I liked that the showers had really hot water! There is a woolsworth just opposite the apartment! Will not hesitate staying at this place again when I’m in Sydney!"),
("2018-07-18", "13530122", "Ayen", "Highly recommended! Convenient location  beautiful place  hospitable host!  "),
("2018-07-23", "13530122", "Cameron", "A well-located and very clean flat — would stay here again!"),
("2018-07-30", "13530122", "승연", "위치가 정말 좋고 침구류가 엄청 푹신합니다 두분이서 지내기 정말 좋아요. 숙소 창이 커서 해도 잘 들어오고 쾌적합니다. 주인하고 소통도 잘 돼요. 일층에 리셉션같이 항상 상주하시는 분들도 있어서 보안에도 안심되구요. 다음에 와도 또 여기서 지낼 것 같아요."),
("2018-08-05", "13530122", "Misona", "멋진 뷰를 가진 곳입니다. 호스트도 굉장히 친절하셔서 다음번에 시드니가게더면 또 머물고싶어요.시드니 시내에서 조금 멀까봐 걱정했는데city hall역에서 지하철 두 정거장에 중심가 가는 버스도 정말로 숙소코앞에 있어서 불편함을 전혀 느끼지 못했어요.metro라는 큰 마트도 30초 거리에 있어서 아주아주 편했답니다. (Hidden by Airbnb) cast도 있어서 휴대폰이랑 TV연결해서 넷플리스  유투브 등등 볼 수 있어요.정말 좋은 숙소였습니당!"),
("2018-08-24", "13530122", "Kathleen", "AMAZING! The apartment made my trip to Sydney- such a chic space in an awesome neighborhood. Am already planning my trip back!"),
("2018-08-26", "13530122", "Jo", "This is a lovely little apartment in a great area.  Benefits are being close to Kings Cross train station so you can train straight from the airport changing at Central. You can walk into the city through the gardens.  Having a supermarket across the road is great too. Highly recommend this place."),
("2018-08-28", "13530122", "Angela", "Great location  really clean  funky apartment. Good for one or two travellers. Generous supplies and easy communication. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-09-02", "13530122", "Brian", "really good location in Potts point close to everything. Host suggestions  were great and was really helpful. I'd recommend this apartment had all the essentials. small and cosy."),
("2018-09-03", "13530122", "Katharina", "We had a really good time  the apartment is as great as advertised. Perfect place to discover Sydney  by foot and public transport."),
("2018-09-18", "13530122", "Jannel", "Great little apartment  amazing location"),
("2018-09-21", "13530122", "Merle", "Thanks a lot for a very pleasant stay at your apartment! We enjoyed it and recommed it! Also you are an amazing friendly host!"),
("2018-09-23", "13530122", "Wallace", "A great place to stay in Sydney."),
("2018-09-28", "13530122", "Alston", "Victoria's apartment was perfect for us.  We enjoyed the area for its cleanliness  restaurants and cafés.  The convenience to the train after a busy day to come ""home"" was very nice.   An easy walk to central city was our daily preference. Victoria's apartment is well equipped and clean.   Everyday we were pleased to wake up there.  We would definitely return to Victoria's Chic City Pad with leafy outlook.Thanks Victoria for offering  your apartment to others  especially to us!! Bruce and Alston Johnson from Virginia  USA"),
("2018-10-02", "13530122", "Miguel", "Great location!"),
("2018-10-06", "13530122", "婷婷", "房东很贴心 提前几天提供了入住指南而且很清晰 能够方便自助入住｡房间干净整洁 还贴心准备了牛奶果汁巧克力 还有健康的麦片和不健康的泡面 非常全面｡房子距离最近的火车站十分钟 公交站就在楼下 不过悉尼公交经常延误｡房子对面有超市和药店很方便 附近有邮局 沿路很多吃东西的地方｡总体非常好 值得再次入住｡"),
("2018-10-09", "13530122", "Moritz", "Nice little place for a short Stay  food for breakfast including coffee was provided and the area is great as you have nice cafes and Restaurants close."),
("2018-10-12", "13530122", "Agu", "El apartamento de Victoria es genial! La ubicación es excelente  muy cerca del centro y de la estación King Cross. El barrio es bellísimo! Estaba super completo  con todo lo que podría necesitar  tanto en la cocina como en el baño..... muy recomendable!!!! Lo volvería a elegir!!"),
("2018-10-16", "13530122", "James", "Amazing apartment in a lovely part of Sydney. The apartment has everything you need during your stay and more. Victoria was a fantastic host and I wouldn't hesitate to stay again. A 20 minute walk via the botanical gardens to the opera house  makes it ideal for exploring the city!"),
("2018-10-26", "13530122", "Alison", "We had a great stay at Vickie’s apartment. The location is central and there are plenty of nice places to eat and also a supermarket across the road. Vickie was very helpful in messages as unfortunately we didn’t get a chance to meet. I would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-10-29", "13530122", "Craig", "This apartment was perfect. Its a great location with easy access to transport around Sydney and most places are within walking distance. The local area surrounding the apartment is very nice  with lots of restaurants  bars and shops.The apartment was very clean and ideal for us as a couple. Check in was straight forward with good communication from Vickie. Would happily stay here again."),
("2018-11-01", "13530122", "Chau", "Excellent location  walking distance to the Opera house  plenty of restaurants around. The Airbnb unit is very nice  clean and comfortable for 2 in a very secure apartment building"),
("2018-11-06", "13530122", "Brittany", "Great place to stay if you plan on staying a night or two. A little farther than I expected to the opera house. Had to Uber"),
("2018-11-11", "13530122", "Rebecca", "Great place to stay at!"),
("2018-11-13", "13530122", "Schmitt", "This was a wonderful stay; the location could not be more convenient and trendy. Vicki provided excellent local recommendations  which was helpful due to the sheer volume of cafes and restaurants within walking distance. The room was comfortable and clean  and Vicki went well above and beyond to save me when I'd locked important personal items inside the room after checkout (I don't want every guest taking advantage of her emergency hospitality  but I can't thank her enough)!"),
("2018-11-17", "13530122", "Charlie", "A great apartment ideal location  very clean and everything perfect"),
("2018-11-21", "13530122", "Charlie", "Exceeded expectations!"),
("2018-11-26", "13530122", "Tim", "This is a perfect place to explore Sydney from  and Vickie is an excellent host!"),
("2018-12-03", "13530122", "Mark", "Couldn’t be a better location. There’s a food store across the street to stock up and you could spend a month just exploring in walking distance.  The laundry down the hall was very nice to have or you can use a laundry mat across the street.  I’d seek out this very spot if I return to Sydney."),
("2018-12-08", "13530122", "Steven", "I did not have the opportunity to meet Vickie  but everything was clearly and quickly communicated. The apartment is beautifully and functionally decorated  with everything present you could need. The internet is fast and reliable  the kitchen well-equipped. I slept very well in the bed  with a choice of pillow hardness. The place is perfectly located  not far from restaurants  and a very lovely 30' stroll through the impressive botanical gardens to the Opera House. Highly recommended place to stay!"),
("2018-12-10", "13530122", "Ulli", "Great location with choices for everything you might need (cafes  restaurants  supermarket  transport (bus  rail to CBD)  within easy reach.  For walkers  wending your way down to Woolloomooloo  Mrs Macquarie's Chair & Botanical Gardens is a treat.  Vickie's city pad is a comfortable  tidy  pleasant retreat with a lovely view.  The immediate surroundings are excellent  as is the building in which the apartment is situated."),
("2018-12-19", "13530122", "Moritz", "Our stay in Sydney in Victoria's apartment was great. It is nicely and conveniently located in the beautiful Elizabeth Bay area. Public transport can be reached easily and even a walk to the Opera House is easily possible. The apartment is small but equipped with everything that two people need. Even breakfast and coffee was there. We would stay here again!"),
("2018-12-22", "13530122", "Linda", "Perfect base for exploring the city and very well equipped."),
("2018-12-26", "13530122", "Mickie", "The actual unit is in a great location and we enjoyed the walk to the Royal Botanical gardens and Sydney Opera House.  There is also a nice coffee spot down the street.  Unfortunately  in the listing  it says there is free street parking and we could not find any free street parking.  Upon arrival I called the host about the free street parking and she said there was not any.  We would have to park in the paid garage next to the premises  which would be $30-40 per night.  Or drive into another neighborhood (not close) to maybe find street parking.  We were staying 3 nights so that could be up to $90.  I would have figured out a different place or other parking arrangements if I knew ahead of time.  Later she messaged and said that the free street parking is limited by time.  I feel that is quite unfair to say free street parking if it is only for 1 hour or so.  So if you are traveling with a car  this is something to consider."),
("2019-01-03", "13530122", "Thomas", "Victoria's studio apartment is a compact space that is thoughtfully outfitted. The location is great with plenty of amenities within easy walking distance and an easy bus connection to the CBD. Simple meals can be cooked in the kitchen on the hot plate and microwave  however even that can be tricky as there is no extra counter space to do prep or hold hot items other than on the hot plate. Victoria was very accommodating and attentive in her communications."),
("2019-01-13", "13530122", "Jack", "Amazing location  nice cozy apartment !"),
("2019-01-19", "13530122", "Julia", "good location  nice & clean apartment plus if you need anything Victoria is super fast in answering  would stay here again :)"),
("2019-01-24", "13530122", "Lynda", "Very clean  lift very useful  many extras (milk  juice  coffee  etc.  pamphlets to discover the city)  host very quick to answer our questions  well decorated  30 minute walk from opera house. Would recommend "),
("2019-01-29", "13530122", "Hannah", "A fab apartment in a great location. The view from the big window is lovely and great for people watching. The cafe at Elizabeth Bay Marina is a must for breakfast. Victoria was a great host."),
("2019-02-03", "13530122", "Max", "What a great apartment and host. Vickie made our stay amazing  a very lovely person.The place was very modern and clean. At arrival Vickie welcomed us with somgood info about the area and Sydney  and some sweets.Apartments location was really good  and a lot of great restaurants.We can't wait to revisit and stay at this great place again.Love Max and Daniella."),
("2019-02-05", "13530122", "Lena", "Saubere Unterkunft mit perfekter Lage um Sydney zu erkunden. Die Sehenswürdigkeiten sind fußläufig erreichbar.Das Apartment ist klein aber völlig ausreichend für 2 Personen und gut ausgestattet. Wir würden uns wieder für dieses Apartment entscheiden."),
("2019-02-09", "13530122", "Sunyoung", "시티에서 조금 떨어져있는 거리지만시티까지 가는 버스가 도보2분 거리에 있고중대형 마트가 집앞에 바로 있어서 편했어요! 실내는 정말 깨끗하고 잘 정돈되어 있었고 햇빛도 정말 잘 들어옵니다!"),
("2019-02-16", "13530122", "Phoebe", "Victoria’s place is amazing! Great location with a short walk into the CBD  clean and tidy  tips about the local area and much more. Would recommend to anyone!"),
("2019-02-17", "13530122", "Lianda", "I arranged this Airbnb for my parents to come visit Sydney and Victoria was more than happy to help them with instructions and personal requests! Will definitely stay again. My parents thought the place was beautiful and were so excited they kept sending me photos of their stay! Well done Victoria! Thank you so much."),
("2019-02-18", "13530122", "David", "Well located and comfortable place. Generous host. Clear communication. Comfortable bed and pillows. Great shower. All good! Highly recommended."),
("2019-02-23", "13530122", "Suzanne", "Fabulous location with wonderful restaurants in walking distance.    It was also an easy walk into the city taking only about 20 minutes.  In addition  the hop on hop off bus picks up just down the street.   Victoria provided excellent communication throughout our booking process as well as the check in process."),
("2019-02-25", "13530122", "Christina", "Compact and well located. A great place for a short stay in Sydney."),
("2019-03-03", "13530122", "YeiJean", "Victoria’s place was spacious enough for two people and very clean studio. Its location was pretty good. She helped me and responded very quickly whenever I needed her. There is public coin washing machine and dryer on the same floor ($3 each) Everything was quite pleasant and safe."),
("2016-07-11", "13674956", "Andrea", "Millie's studio was perfect! Fantastic location  easy walk to the train and amazing views of the bridge. Millie was quick to respond to my questions and very accommodating with my early check in. Would 100% stay her again. Thanks Millie :) "),
("2016-07-13", "13674956", "Savanna", "Our stay with Millie was absolutely wonderful. Matched the description with a lovely view of the Harbour Bridge. Very spacious apartment within 5 minutes from Lunar Park. Easy access via train and water ferry. Lovely stay!"),
("2016-07-21", "13674956", "Ritchie", "Millie was a wonderful host. The studio was super clean and tidy  and had good wifi and a comfortable bed. Best of all  though  was the amazing view to enjoy from the little balcony. I will definitely recommend to friends."),
("2016-07-25", "13674956", "Daphane", "Millie was a fantastic host! The studio located in the perfect spot - super close to the CBD  but not too close from the hustle and bustle as well. It's only a short 5-10 walk from the train station to the apartment  and the streets are well lit at night so it's safe. Studio itself was clean  neat and comfortable.Will be staying here again if I find myself in Sydney again!"),
("2016-08-06", "13674956", "Chantal", "Fab stay  Millie was so helpful as our plans had changed due to work and flight cancellations but she helped us immensely and was no issues.Absolutely love the location and view wished we could have booked for longer! Perfect home away from home so cosy and homely! Thank you so much for sharing your home enabling us to book it and making our 1st week moving to Sydney so nice!"),
("2016-08-11", "13674956", "Pluie", "Perfect experience! The location  the room  the view  the cereal  the xbox  everything is great! I'll definitely recommend to a friend or book again next time if I'm going to Sydney again. Thank you Millie!"),
("2016-08-14", "13674956", "Bianca", "My daughter and I loved staying at this gorgeous little apartment.  Although the space is small  the furniture and lay out work really well and the place was very tidy.  We felt comfortable in the space  especially because our host went out of her way to make sure we felt welcome. The location is fabulous - close to the train or ferry and within walking distance of the harbour bridge  Luna park  Kirabilli and Wendy's secret garden.  The view from the balcony is gorgeous and we were lucky enough to see fireworks on Saturday night and have some native birds come and visit us in the morning.  Thank you Millie! This is why I love airbnb! "),
("2016-08-20", "13674956", "Olivia", "Great place  helpful host  would highly recommend. "),
("2016-08-26", "13674956", "Kevin", "Millie's apartment is just as advertised. Very clean and tidy but it got a bit cold at night due to no heating system. Millie was prepared though and supplied two thick blankets which made up for it. Overall great experience and very close to the opera house and bridge."),
("2016-09-19", "13674956", "Karine", "Great location - so close to the train station  great place - nice  clean and tidy  Millie is a fantastic host.  I will be staying here again. Thanks Millie! "),
("2016-09-28", "13674956", "Odhran", "Millie was a wonderful host and all was as described - highly recommended."),
("2016-10-01", "13674956", "Geissy", "Millie's place was so pretty and cosy. It's got everything you need. The apartment is also located in a very nice area close to the city and amenities. Every morning you wake up to the harbor bridge view! Millie was also very helpful and flexible to accommodate our needs. She was very easy to talk to and help us feel like home. Definitely a nice place to stay when traveling in Sydney."),
("2016-10-10", "13674956", "Nick", "This was a perfect location for our stay in Sydney. A five minute walk to the harbour bridge and lots of restaurants within minutes of the apartment. Millie was an excellent host and very willing to offer anything we needed. I'd definitely recommend this place to anyone."),
("2016-10-15", "13674956", "Louisa", "Millie was a lovely host  super friendly and great at communicating in the lead up to our stay. The studio is really cute  compact and well designed with some nice touches - coffee machine  emergency toiletries. A great stay  thanks! "),
("2016-10-17", "13674956", "Rodrigo", "fantastic place. thanks so much"),
("2016-10-23", "13674956", "Marilyn", "Millie's place was as she described it and we found it quite comfortable  everything we needed  a cute little place!  The situation is very convenient  the walk to Kirribilli shops  Milson's Point station and the Nth Sydney ferry was only minutes.  It was wonderful looking at the view over to the Harbour Bridge.  Millie met us on arrival and explained details of her place which was very helpful."),
("2016-10-23", "13674956", "Kevin", "Great view great hospitallity..."),
("2016-10-27", "13674956", "Shannon", "Lovely studio apartment with a very welcoming host  who ensured all the comforts of home were taken care of  as well as extras such as toiletries and brekky."),
("2016-10-31", "13674956", "Thalia", "Millie was an excellent host and had gone out of her way to make sure we felt welcome. She was always friendly and quick to reply to our questions. Her attention to detail and thoughtfulness included a handy one-page reference card (how to use the coffee machine  where to find the light switches  etc) and some menus from the local takeaway places. The unit was clean and matched it's photos and description. It was a short walk from the train station (easy even with a suitcase) and there was no noise from the train line. We would definitely stay here again. It was like staying at a tidy friend's house.The view is superb. "),
("2016-11-06", "13674956", "Natasha", "So easy to get around with public transport a short walk away  the apartment was really clean & comfy  the view was amazing  Millie was easy to communicate with  I would definitely stay here again."),
("2016-11-11", "13674956", "Joanne Sullivan", "Fabulous apartment  central location  great facilities and million dollar views!Within walking distance to a fabulous array of dining experiences plus the pubs of both Kirribilli and North Sydney! What more could you ask for!"),
("2016-11-19", "13674956", "Kim", "Millie was great at instructing us how to get to her place and everything we needed to know once we were there. The space itself was nice and private. The one downfall is there is a lot of street noise all throughout the night and especially in the early morning when people start to head to work. So if you're a light sleeper  you might want to book elsewhere. "),
("2016-11-24", "13674956", "Julia", "Millie's place was the perfect location for our stay in Sydney. Just a few meters to the next bus stop and only a few minutes to train station and harbour bridge. The studio was clean and matched the description and had a great view to the bridge.Would definetly recommend this!"),
("2016-12-01", "13674956", "Fiona", "Clear and quick communication with easy instructions for check in/out and how to find Millie's apartment.  Millie's studio had everything I needed for my week in Sydney  and is conveniently located within walking distance to the train  shops and restaurants.  I appreciated Millie's generous sharing of the kitchen equipment and the instructions on the bench made everything easy.  The bed was comfy and the bedding  towels etc. were a convenient touch.  I loved the view too - a wine on the deck watching the bridge light up was just what I needed at the end of each day! "),
("2016-12-06", "13674956", "Khaled", "I stayed in Millie's place with my wife through our short visit to Sydney  and it was a delight. The place is a walking distance to the restaurants and cafes in Kirribilli  and a one train station away from the city. The station is almost 7-minute walk from the building. Millie did her best to make us feel at home. She provided us with many goodies for breakfast  and made sure we get entertained through her movie and game collection.I would definitely recommend Millie's place for anyone visiting Sydney  and I would check it out for availability next time I'm planning to visit."),
("2016-12-13", "13674956", "Cornelius", "Millie provided us with a really cosy apartment in a really awesome area. There are really cool restaurants at the foot of the bridge at Miltons Point. We took the ferry to get there or walked over the bridge. What a fascinating city. And what a spectecular view from Millies apartment. Thanks Millie  we had a great time."),
("2016-12-21", "13674956", "Matt", "We loved the apartment and would love to stay there again in the future. The location was great to get to the centre of Sydney and also the ferry system. The view from the balcony was amazing and the apartment was well equipped (even catering for emergency amenities). Millie was always on hand and very quick to reply to our messages. Thanks for being a great host."),
("2016-12-29", "13674956", "Elaine", "We stayed at Millie's place four nights and congratulated ourselves on a good choice  mainly because of the location. It is in North Sydney which puts it into a lower price bracket  but it is a 5-10 minute walk to the North Sydney ferry which takes you right to Circular Quay  which is the public transportation hub and next to the opera house. You can even buy your public transport pass at the little store next to Millie's. Also  the apartment has a balcony with a stunning view of the Sydney Harbour bridge and skyline. These things compensate for the apartment's tiny size and lack of air conditioning. Millie left us with a lot of breakfast food plus coffee and milk. The kitchen was clean and well equipped. The bed converts from a day bed to a double  and even if we had done it correctly it would have required strength and lifting. If you are not young and strong get her to leave the bed set up for you. The apartment is charming and clean but the public areas of the building  including the laundry room  could use freshening  but don't let that put you off. We would stay there again."),
("2017-01-10", "13674956", "Helene", "It was a beautiful stay in this lovely studio  we enjoyed the time there.And Millie is a great host  the conversation was really good!Thanks very much!!"),
("2017-01-22", "13674956", "Rachel", "It was super easy to get to places and we loved walking over the bridge every day."),
("2017-01-26", "13674956", "Deborah", "Millie's flat was clean  comfortable and centrally located within short walk to ferry and train and just a couple of stops to city. Also  cafes and shops close by."),
("2017-02-02", "13674956", "Shweta", "Great location  close to public transport and comfortable apartment. Millie was a great and welcoming host."),
("2017-02-05", "13674956", "Nora", "Millie's place is just as described. We had a wonderful view from the balcony that we enjoyed having our dinner and breakfast to. Location is great too as it is so near the train station and Milson's point for ferry rides. Definitely happy we made the right choice :)"),
("2017-02-08", "13674956", "Yuyue", "Thank you !!!Thank you for your patience  thank you for providing us with such a warm environment!!"),
("2017-02-14", "13674956", "Alec", "Location fantastic  we needed aircon  the fan just did not cope and some place to put our clothes  it is Millies house but we feel she could have made some cupboard and hanging space otherwise really nice"),
("2017-02-22", "13674956", "Mathias", "Millie is a good host. Check in and check out was without hassle. Millie was available if we needed her. Thank you Millie!"),
("2017-02-27", "13674956", "Alex", "Millie's ""shoebox"" (as she calls it) is an adorable little corner of North Sydney with easy access to trains and buses. Plenty of nearby food and drink  and her recommendations will definitely enhance your stay. Check in/out was easy as could be. Would stay again!"),
("2017-03-02", "13674956", "Wan Lin", "good location"),
("2017-03-07", "13674956", "Valentin", "Lovely studio in north Sydney."),
("2017-03-12", "13674956", "Moritz", "Really close to the Harbour Bridge. Liked the clean and cosy room. Easy checkin/checkout. Would come again!"),
("2017-03-15", "13674956", "Trudy", "Had a lovely stay at Millie's.  Only a 15-20 minute walk to Circular Quay over the Sydney Harbour Bridge.  Very convenient.  Many thanks"),
("2017-03-21", "13674956", "Karen", "We had a wonderful stay! Millie's studio is really cosy and was perfect for 2 of us. It also has a great view of the Harbour Bridge and was close to public transport. Checking in and out was also really easy. Would recommend and stay again."),
("2017-03-27", "13674956", "Lea", "Millie was a wonderful host - the apartment was clean  well equipped  really cute and well located; Millie communicated well and was flexible with my late check in."),
("2017-03-30", "13674956", "Paula", "Perfect unit  clean  cosy and so handy to all north Sydney has to offer. Millie is a great host  communication was excellent. Definitely recommend and will definitely re-book on my next trip to city. Excellent value"),
("2017-04-06", "13674956", "Sally", "Millie's space is just great! It's such a well designed little unit that it didn't feel small even for 2 for 6 nights. We appreciated the spaces to hang and store clothes and the bathroom shelves. Thanks  Millie!The stunning view has been mentioned several times but we also liked the proximity to Kirribilli and other neighbourhoods like Neutral Point (Thelma & Louise's for food!) also The Cremorne Coastal walk is worth it.Getting in and out of Sydney is a breeze. Lots of eating places nearby.Would highly recommend! "),
("2017-04-12", "13674956", "Kayla", "Our stay in Millie's Studio was perfect! The location is very easy to access public transportation or to walk across the bridge. Millie provided detailed notes for her studio and had everything we needed. We would definitely stay here again!"),
("2017-04-18", "13674956", "Christopher", "Everything was just great! It is a cozy little apartment near the Sydney center. Clean and you got everything you need for your stay. Public transport is basically in front of your door. Next time we are in Sydney  we would love to come back! Thank you for letting us stay in your home! "),
("2017-04-22", "13674956", "Anna & Michael", "We very much enjoyed staying in Millie's lovely and very well presented apartment. It's very easy to get to from the airport/city and in a part of town that's a delight to wander (if you can tear yourself away from the balcony with its view of the Harbour Bridge)."),
("2017-04-30", "13674956", "Marija", "Good communication  lovely view and clean homey apartment !"),
("2017-05-05", "13674956", "Koizumi", "The room is so cute & good location!I had a breakfast at the balcony & could see the harbur brigde every morning;)And Millie is so kind!I just wanna stay again.and I like SYD more!!"),
("2017-05-10", "13674956", "Derek", "Great communication  accurate description of the space  perfect location and full of character. Overall an amazing experience and highly recommended. I will definitely be staying here again when I'm back in Sydney. "),
("2017-05-13", "13674956", "Zosia", "I loved Millie's home! I came to Sydney for work and booked Millie's home for the convenience of having everything close by. I ended up spending an afternoon indoors because it felt so homely and cosy. The bed is super comfortable and it was difficult to get up in the mornings! The view from the balcony is amazing and I loved seeing the city skyline and harbour bridge lit up at night. There was plenty of cafes and restaurants within walking distance and the neighbourhood is beautiful.Millie herself was a wonderful host  very welcoming and accommodating. Communication was great.I cannot recommend this space enough :)"),
("2017-05-19", "13674956", "Murray", "Cozy little space with lots of inclusions and views of the bridge.  Walking distance to North Sydney train station  cafes and restaurants. "),
("2017-05-22", "13674956", "Dominique", "I would highly recommend staying at this place.Millie is an incredible host  so accommodating and very swift with communication.The apartment is the perfect size  tidy and cosy  with a very thoughtful use of space. We looked forward to coming home to the space every day. The view is spectacular just like the photos  with a cute balcony to look over the area.  Staying here was perfect with so many public transport options near by  getting into the city or going to crows nest was too easy.  Attention to detail has been paid to make guests feel so at home here  would definitely stay here again!!"),
("2017-05-28", "13674956", "Adam", "Millie's apartment is very close to the train station and in front of a bus stop. Additionally  there are many little cafes within walking distance. Millie was great at communicating with me prior to the trip to provide me with helpful details regarding the apartment  she made check-in seamless. The apartment was clean  cozy  and had everything we needed - even tea! Thanks for the hospitality."),
("2017-06-03", "13674956", "Sojan", "I really loved millie's apartment   close to all public transport and harbour bridge . Nice view of the sky while in the bed and harbour bridge . Communication with millie was really good. I would recommend this plce and will be back again "),
("2017-06-12", "13674956", "Jen", "Millie's place is an absolute delight. The location is excellent  and although she lives in the apartment when she's not leasing it  it is neat as a pin  well organised and thoughtfully presented. The bed is very comfortable  the bathroom is clean and tidy and the kitchen is very usable. Millie mentions that the place is small  but for a solo traveller it is perfectly perfect. I think two people would also be just fine there. Loved it  and look forward to staying again at some stage."),
("2017-06-28", "13674956", "Boris", "Everything was exactly as promised. It is a small studio  comfortable and clean. It is close to restaurants and public transport that can take you wherever you want to go. Millie's instructions were clear and communication via the app was excellent. Very fast wifi. I never actually met the host in person but I had a very comfortable and pleasant stay. "),
("2017-07-02", "13674956", "Kristina", "The appartment is well situated  just a 10 min walk to catch a picturesque ferry journey to Circular Quay. Inside is really cosy and well designed. The bed was super comfy and Millie was a great host. All in all really enjoyable stay!"),
("2017-07-10", "13674956", "Machete", "Fantastic location  cute little place  has everything you need. We spent 2 nice nights in watching DVDs from Millie's large collection! Would definitely recommend. "),
("2017-07-16", "13674956", "Herve", "Une excellente adresse à Sydney  idéalement placée : à quelques centaines de mètres du train ou du ferry!Que demander de plus? Peut être une coupe de champagne à déguster sur le balcon en admirant au loin( pas si loin!) le Magnifique Harbour Bridge!!! A ne pas rater!!;merci Millie !!!"),
("2017-08-03", "13674956", "Ebru", "Great stay  lovely apartment with an amazing view of the Sydney harbour bridge"),
("2017-08-13", "13674956", "Mel", "You will love staying at Millie's. The studio was small but perfectly decorated. It well equipped too! The view is priceless really. It's my favorite park of the stay. In terms of convenience  the Bus stop is right outside the property  12 minutes walk to the train station  and a few minutes to the wharf. Millie as host was nothing but an angel. Check in instructions were spot on  communication was consistent  and very gracious with check in time. I already miss the studio :)... Will definitely stay here again in the future! :)"),
("2017-08-18", "13674956", "Erin", "Millie's place was tops. I was in Sydney for work and it felt like coming home every night instead of a sterile hotel suite. I would gladly stay again. So clean and exactly as Mille described. Thanks so much."),
("2017-09-05", "13674956", "Chiara", "Millie's place is perfect for a stay in Sydney.  We walked to Ferry's loved the restaurants in KIRRIBILLI   really enjoyed our short stay."),
("2017-09-08", "13674956", "Juliette", "Yes  the view is everything you see in that photo  it is not faked  and yes it is to die for. Millie's studio is in a wonderful location  both convenient to shops  restaurants and public transport  yet stylish and glamorous. Both Kirribili/Milsons Point and North Sydney are  10 minute walks away. Her studio apartment is in a fabulous mid-century modern complex and she has arranged and furnished very much in period style with a few quirky popular culture and present day tweaks. It is a light-filled and generous space especially for the solo traveller. Whilst it is in a very busy district  there was not too much traffic disturbance and I could sleep well and comfortably.  Millie was also a thoughtful and generous host  who has excellent clear communication  has worked out simple and efficient processes for check-in and has second guessed the needs of travellers  and catered to them. One felt like a welcomed guest not a paying customer. Thank you and good luck to the talented and creative Millie"),
("2017-09-17", "13674956", "Mark", "Awesome!  Location within about 5 minutes of the train station.  Nice neighborhood...felt like I was ""coming home"" every evening as I walked from the station.  Apartment has everything you need and a great view of the Harbor Bridge from the balcony.  Thanks Millie!"),
("2017-09-23", "13674956", "Laurie", "Very convenient"),
("2017-09-30", "13674956", "Thao", "This has to be one of the best locations I've been to around Sydney. My partner and I enjoyed the place very much and everything was so convenient for us  especially going out. Her place was well equipped and very clean. Would recommend!"),
("2017-10-13", "13674956", "Marta", "Millie's place is a nice small studio  perfect for 1 person or a couple. It is in a nice neighbourhood  and very well communicated. The apartment was tidy and clean  with spare drawers and part of the closet  so you feel like home. The desk gives an extra space  very useful if you are staying for work. I will definitely stay again here next time I need a place in Sydney."),
("2017-10-19", "13674956", "Bonnie", "A very welcoming place  and conveniently located."),
("2017-10-27", "13674956", "Caroline", "Millie's place was fabulous! It's really central  close to public transport (trains  ferries and buses) and perfect for one or two people. It is cute as a button and super clean. Check in and out was really straight forward and she even provided coffee for her coffee machine. I highly recommend it!"),
("2017-10-31", "13674956", "Ken", "Great place  close from the harbour and train!"),
("2017-11-07", "13674956", "창옥", "Super host very good! Her house wonderful and location."),
("2017-11-16", "13674956", "Niamh", "Millie's place is in a great location close to north Sydney  walking distance to the bridge  with a nice view of the bridge from the balcony. Millie is a thoughtful and generous host who was so easy to communicate with  and I would definitely stay here again."),
("2017-11-22", "13674956", "Dena", "Great location and great restaurants surrounding Millie’s place!"),
("2017-11-30", "13674956", "Jihwan", "There was unpleasant gas smell in the house but Millie tried to solve the issue."),
("2017-12-02", "13674956", "Jessica", "great"),
("2017-12-15", "13674956", "Daniel", "Beautiful view  great central location with Milsons Point station just a few minutes walk away.Charming place that had everything that was needed to make the stay a very good experience!Communication with host was quick and easy  Millie seems like a lovely person.Would recommend! :)"),
("2017-12-18", "13674956", "Alex", "Millie's apartment is really nice. It's neat and tidy  and while small  is well laid out and comfortable. The view from the balcony is quite pretty  as you can see the top of the Harbour Bridge."),
("2017-12-25", "13674956", "Raffa", "great Appartment:) we had an awesome stay :)"),
("2018-01-04", "13674956", "Paris", "We stayed at Millie's apartment for a few nights and can highly recommend it! It's in an excellent location (very close to public transport  cafes  supermarkets etc) with an equally excellent view out over the Harbour bridge. The apartment is very comfortable and great to come back to after a busy day exploring. A great place to stay!"),
("2018-01-11", "13674956", "Keilagh", "We had an amazing couple nights at Millie's.  The apt was absolutely perfect for what we needed and Millie was a very considerate host.  Would absolutely stay here again! And the views of the bridge are fab!"),
("2018-01-21", "13674956", "Karen", "Beautiful place with an amazing view over harbor bridge. Very clean  walking distance to the nearest train station or you can have a lovely walk to the Opera House. Millie was super helpful and provided many tips plus she made her own little guides at home you could read and use. Eveything was there and her beautiful place made me feel right at home!"),
("2018-01-27", "13674956", "Jeffrey", "Great location  excellent kitchen. Bathroom could be improved but otherwise well worthwhile and fair value. Millie is a very good host."),
("2018-02-20", "13674956", "Man", "房間設備充足 交通方便 房東很友善及樂於為住客解決問題"),
("2018-02-22", "13674956", "Jessica", "Great place! A wonderful space for two people even sharing the pull out bed. She has AppleTV which allowed my partner to log in and watch a movie we have downloaded. The views are amazing and it was such a short and beautiful walk across the bridge. There is also a cheap ferry that will get you across fast!"),
("2018-02-24", "13674956", "Kandise", "The unit is immaculately clean and tidy and in a fantastic location - just 8 minutes walk to the ferry at North Sydney or Milson's Point station in the other direction - or you can walk the bridge if the weather is nice.  The unit is small but we LOVED it  and I would definitely recommend it for a couple or two friends.  Millie was great with communication and access to the unit was easy.  Thanks Millie for making our stay so enjoyable and comfortable!"),
("2018-02-28", "13674956", "Marta", "The apartment is a little gem in a great location  near the public transport to quickly arrive to the centre. It is a cosy apartment  very pleasant to stay and feel like home!"),
("2018-03-03", "13674956", "Stacey", "Close to the city  easy check in  comfortable accomodation. Well contained studio."),
("2018-03-06", "13674956", "지은", "Close to CBD  very clean very informative"),
("2018-03-10", "13674956", "Melissa", "Lovely  clean and cosy space. Fantastic location. Millie was helpful and responsive and I absolutely loved spending time there"),
("2018-03-11", "13674956", "Mei", "An inviting space in a central location. Millie's apartment was bright  airy and eclectic. With views of the city overlooking the harbour bridge  it was in close proximity to Kirribilli shops  Milsons Point Station and North Sydney wharf. Would definitely recommend for tourists seeking a base to explore Sydney or locals for a weekend away :)"),
("2018-03-17", "13674956", "Helen", "Millie’s apartment was super clean & tidy and in a very convenient location too (you can take the train  bus or even walk to the CBD). The thoughtful provision of amenities and smooth check-in process ensured a lovely stay. Great neighbourhood  felt safe walking back in the evenings."),
("2018-03-25", "13674956", "Tanya", "Lovely little apartment  close to the heart of the city. Walking distance to several attractions and located in a nice neighbourhood. Would highly recommend!"),
("2018-03-29", "13674956", "Nico", "Everything was perfect! Super fast communication - easy check in and out - cosy - awesome view at harbour bridge from the balcony - clean - super equipped - cbd in walking distance over harbour bridge - and a good hot shower (best after 4 weeks in the camper!!!)Could not more recommend  one of the best Airbnb's we had so far:)"),
("2018-04-01", "13674956", "Jess", "Super quaint area and easily accessible by the train. We had a great time and the host was super nice. Would 10/10 stay again"),
("2018-04-07", "13674956", "Bret", "Millie's ""Shoebox"" would be great for one person or a couple looking for a value minded stay in Sydney with great view  clean accommodations  close to Milsons Point train station and even closer to the North Sydney ferry stop that takes you across the harbor to downtown Sydney and the Opera House.  You walk up the road a bit to North downtown and that's where you can buy all the groceries  beer and wine you need for your stay at a pretty good deal.  The views out the balcony are awesome - yes Millie's place is on the corner of a pretty busy stretch of street during commuter hours - but it adds to the charm; watching everyone scurry off to work while you're on holiday!  And the evening time was great for the balcony as you can open up the door  grab a glass of wine and enjoy the views of the Harbour Bridge at evening and sunset.  The bed was very comfortable for one  the kitchen was well stocked  the building itself seemed very safe and secure and it had a nice little counter w/ two bar stools that you can set up your IPad for the day/morning  have breakfast and get some work done before heading out onto your adventures.  You can tell I'm a big fan - as I'm an airbnb Superhost myself back in the USA.  The best part ... Millie's customer service and communication.  I cam a long way from SFO airport landing at 6:30 am after a long flight and Millie went out of her way to make sure I could either do an early check in or bag drop - and she was awesome during my visit with places to check out  etc.  She's a Superhost for a reason.  I've traveled around the world and have been to many countries and continents staying at various Airbnb units - Millie's was right up there for location  value  services  views and cleanliness.  Regards  Bret ~ 3ONE8 Manzanita in Manzanita  Oregon USA ~"),
("2018-04-12", "13674956", "Erin", "Millie's place is great. I have stayed here now 3 times. You can not beat yhe value and the locality"),
("2018-04-21", "13674956", "Phan", "Clean and convenient. Millie is also quick to response to any of our enquiries. Highly recommended."),
("2018-05-26", "13674956", "Joseph", "Clean  perfect location and an affable host.  What more to ask for!?"),
("2018-07-07", "13674956", "Tom", "Millie was a great host and her apartment was perfect. It was clean  spacious and comfy. We had a little issue the first day when the electric tripped (the fuse box is in the wardrobe) but Millie’s friend Shelly and Millie were both so helpful and attentive it didn’t matter! The bed is super comfy and she has everything you could possibly need.The view from the balcony really is the same as the pictures- it’s incredible! I would highly recommend this apartment and wouldn’t hesitate to stay here again! Thank you Millie!"),
("2018-07-16", "13674956", "Eleni", "Everthing was perfect!"),
("2018-08-01", "13674956", "Cliff", "Millie is very gracious"),
("2018-08-24", "13674956", "Susan", "Location is great. Hassle free check in and Millie responded quickly to our questions."),
("2018-09-03", "13674956", "Vanessa", "Millie’s place is very cute  clean and in a very good location. Plus the view is incredible! We had a wonderful stay and will definitely hope to stay at Millie’s again next time we visit Sydney. It really added to our experience ☺️"),
("2018-09-30", "13674956", "Susan", "This is the 2nd time we have stayed at Millie and it was great. Will stay again"),
("2018-10-03", "13674956", "Dylan", "It’s really a good experience!"),
("2018-10-18", "13674956", "Rosie", "Great location! The train station was only 10 mins away. Recommend this place for anyone who wants to explore the city for a reasonable price!"),
("2018-10-20", "13674956", "彤", "公寓做饭的工具一应俱全 配料也是超级多 非常适合度假"),
("2018-10-24", "13674956", "Yzella", "Millie’s apartment is perfect for a solo traveller like myself  or for a couple. The location is perfect  only a short train ride right into circular quay! The view from the balcony  overlooking harbour bridge while I ate my breakfast was something else! Millie responded to my messages super quickly and answered all my questions. Definitely recommend staying here and if I ever get the chance to go back to Sydney this is where I’d hope to stay!"),
("2018-10-26", "13674956", "Hazel Joy", "Small  cozy  and very stylish place! Will definitely come back!"),
("2018-10-31", "13674956", "Edith", "The appartment is very easy to reach by train or bus. It is not big but big enough (and cute) as you will be out most of the time to explore Sydney. Millie is very accurate with response  tries to help the best she can with all kind of tips. The elevator in the appartment building was most convenient with our heavy suitcases..... :). Thanks again Millie."),
("2018-11-08", "13674956", "James", "Millie's apartment is super cute and felt homely the moment I walked in the door. The views from the balcony are superb  a perfect place to spend an evening with a glass of wine. The apartment has a well equipped kitchen  there's good wifi and the bed is really comfy.I loved the location  just a few minutes walk from the station and the ferry (which was a great way to arrive in the city centre!)  and you can easily walk or run to the north side of the harbour bridge and Luna Park. There's a few nice places to have coffee nearby (check out The Flying Bear) as well as amenities and a supermarket in North Sydney.  Crossing the harbour bridge or taking the ferry every day really added to my experience of Sydney.There was a little bit of traffic noise which was the only slight downside (the place would really benefit from double glazing) but I soon got used to it and everything else more than made up for it. I'd love to stay again one day - a real 5 star Airbnb experience.  Thanks Millie!"),
("2018-11-11", "13674956", "George", "Perfect place to stay for a few days to explore Sydney. Short walk to Milsons Point train station and stunning walk over the harbour bridge. Amazing balcony views  would highly recommend."),
("2018-11-14", "13674956", "Laura", "Location was great  10 min walk to train station. View of bridge: amazing. Size: think Manhattan or Tokyo. Bed: extremely comfortable. Quirky and older building/apartment with a few things that remind you its old  though not any pressing issues. Noise at night like any big city  but free parking and an elevator make up for it. However  (Hidden by Airbnb) Maps nor GPS took me to the correct address  so be prepared if you’re driving. Safe  and served the purpose. Recommend to a single or easygoing traveler!"),
("2018-11-18", "13674956", "Vanessa", "Cosy apartment conveniently located close to cafes and public transport. Millie was quick to respond and provided detailed instructions for our stay . Thanks Millie!"),
("2018-11-26", "13674956", "Nathalie", "Beau petit nid avec une superbe vue sur les immeubles et le pont de Sydney.  Quartier tranquille. À 5-10 minutes de marche du ferry ou de la station de train/métro Milsons Point. 30 minutes à pied de Circulay Quay. Quelques petites épiceries en sortant du métro dont 1 du côté de Luna park mais plus haut que la station de train. Parfait pour une personne seule et l'endroit est très sécuritaire. Bien équipé dont un french press et une machine expresso. Pas de cafetière mais une bouilloire. Beaucoup d'équipements pour faire la cuisine. Seul point incommodant est le bruit de la circulation et la luminosité dans la pièce la nuit. Donc  munissez vous de bouchons pour les oreilles et de cache yeux pour la nuit. Aucun bruit entendu des voisins ou du passage. Endroit propre et en ordre mais vieillot. Matelas et oreillers confortables."),
("2018-11-28", "13674956", "Catherine", "Nicely furnished little apartment with everything you need for a stay. Great kitchen facilities and well kitted out. For those that do not like noise  this is not the best option as it is a noisy street."),
("2018-12-06", "13674956", "Christopher", "The studio was great for us to stay. We love to stay in North Sydney and had the best stay in Millies studio with amazing bridge views. The studio is how it‘s described by Millie  for my wife and myself perfect to relax for a week. It‘s not to small as you will stay in it just for the night and in case of staying there for a longer time you can use the balcony with his amazing views.We used the Milsons Point train station  but more often the ferry terminals North Sydney and Milsons Point because of the short ways to Circular Quay and city. Shopping is possible in North Sydney supermarkets which are 10 minutes away.Millie answers very fast and is helpful in everything although there is (nearly) nothing that needs to be explained because of all the information Millie gives to you.Would definitively love it to stay again in Millies studio!Thank you again cheers Chris"),
("2018-12-08", "13674956", "Taylor", "Cutest apartment  perfect area  great amenities and a wonderfully helpful host. Can't recommend Millie enough."),
("2018-12-22", "13674956", "Finuala", "I loved staying at Millie’s! The location is fantastic - walking distance to the station  the harbour  and a selection of cafes and shops. The views of the harbour bridge are great as well. The apartment is well equipped with everything you could need whilst you stay and Millie was very helpful in organising a check-in time and sharing other useful information about the place. I would happily stay here again."),
("2018-12-28", "13674956", "Jason (Cheng-Hsiang)", "This place has fantastic location in a very nice neighborhood. Cute apartment and the host is easy to communicate with. Definitely recommend a stay here."),
("2019-01-01", "13674956", "Brian", "Great location ...... generally nice apartment ..... bathroom needs a refurb ........ behind settee/ bed needs vacuuming"),
("2019-01-16", "13674956", "Natalie", "I agree with positive things that were written in other reviews about the location  view from balcony (I was happy to see a friendly colorful bird visit)  nice host with good communication skills and the wifi connection.  I also feel the bathroom should be remodeled."),
("2019-02-05", "13674956", "Brad", "A great location for seeing the iconic sites of Sydney and the North Sydney beaches. After a 10 min walk to the trains  you can be in the CBD in 10 mins. From the airport to the apartment door was 50 minutes."),
("2019-02-09", "13674956", "진서", "역이랑 엄청 가깝고 하버브릿지도 바로 앞에서 볼 수 있어서 매번 뷰 보고 감탄했네요~! 주택가라 조용하고 안전해서 다음에도 방문하고 싶습니당! I won’t say other words:)) Perfect!"),
("2019-02-19", "13674956", "Megan", "Millie’s place is absolutely amazing. One of a kind with beautiful views and walking distance to all transportations. Great place to stay  with cute little finishing touches. She even had a bottle of wine for us  with snacks and a jar of useful things you need while traveling. Definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2019-02-23", "13674956", "Thomas Peter", "Eine kleine süße Unterkunft unweit der Brücke. Man kann problemlos in die City laufen und die tolle Aussicht genießen. Millie ist eine tolle Gastgeberin. Die Kommunikation klappte super  wir erhielten fast sofort eine Rückmeldung. Alles war so wie beschrieben. Der Wein im Kühlschrank war eine nette Begrüßung.Die Straße ist etwas laut aber nachts wird es ruhiger. Für eine oder zwei Personen ist die kleine Wohnung angenehm für ein paar Tage in der Stadt."),
("2019-02-27", "13674956", "Elaine", "Millie’s places is a gem  you feel like you’re part of neighborhood in no time. It’s clean and cosy. Millie is very thoughtful giving all kinds of good suggestions. I highly recommend this place in North Sydney in a lovely section of Sydney close to ferries and trains."),
("2016-07-06", "13702313", "Henry", "Angela was very friendly and welcoming  I had a wonderful stay in her warm house  couldn't have asked for more. Thanks Angela"),
("2016-07-16", "13702313", "Jo", "Angela's place was very close to the beach  and whisper quiet from road and airport noise.Angela keeps a beautifully kept place. It is extremely well set up for guests and very comfortable.Coby is a real sweetie  was well behaved  and good fun.Thanks guys for being good hosts. I would love to come back."),
("2016-07-22", "13702313", "Ryan", "Angela is a great and friendly host! Had a wonderful  comfortable stay at her place. Its very clean  bed is comfortable  and the room is spacious. The room is quite with fast internet access. Very powerful hot shower  good street parking. I would definitely stay here again and caanot recommend it enough! Thank you Angela!"),
("2016-07-25", "13702313", "Matt", "Very happy with my stay. Very clean and quiet. Would recommend."),
("2016-07-29", "13702313", "정원", "Angela's house was very good. The room is clean and nice better than the pictures. And angela and her son were very kind! Nearby here  there is the brighton le sands beach. That was great also."),
("2016-08-04", "13702313", "家英", "Angela's apartment is a great place to stay  very close to the beach  super clean  with all the convenient appliances on cooking and cleaning. Angela has good tastes on apartment decoration  such as the sweet fragrant candles and the tiny lights spread on flowers and comfortable sofa.... Angela is also a very considerate host and would like share everything with me. It's so lucky of me to meet her  when I try airbnb for the first time. Thank you  Angela"),
("2016-08-07", "13702313", "婕妤", "Angela is very nice. The room is very clean and the bed is very soft. Thanks for ur warm welcome. Strong recommend. I had a very nice trip in Sydney."),
("2016-08-14", "13702313", "GuoQing", "房东非常热情 房间非常非常干净 舒服 离海边很近 非常好 Very gool."),
("2016-08-16", "13702313", "Keita", "Was awesome! Couldn't have asked fora better stay! The room was neat and tidy with everything you could want available!! Plenty of parking and the bus stop that takes you to Sydney center is right on the corner! Thoroughly enjoyed my stay!"),
("2016-08-21", "13702313", "Harry", "Everything is fantastic  more than worth!"),
("2016-08-24", "13702313", "Allan", "Great communication  great location  clean and very well laid out. Angela and Cody were great hosts."),
("2016-08-24", "13702313", "Kenneth", "Angela was very accommodating. Place was very clean exactly as shown in the pictures. Neighborhood is nice and near to some restaurants. She even had some listings of take-away menu on the table.Will definitely recommend to my friends who will visit Sydney."),
("2016-08-29", "13702313", "Johnson", "It was great to meet Angela and be welcomed into her lovely home.  While it's not close to the city center (about 45 mins away via public transit)  it's definitely close to the Airport (15 mins away) and the beach (5-10 min walk).  Uber or taxi is definitely the best way to reach this place from the airport though public transit can be an option if you have a lot of time.Bring your strong arms as you have to take your luggage up to the third floor as they don't have a lift.  But  once you reach to her unit  you'll be rewarded with a great retreat.  The house is very clean and the room was spacious.  There's a big window besides the bed that brings in lots of natural light and there's even a TV in the room! Angela wasn't home the evening we stayed so we weren't able to converse more.  But all in all  my family and I had a very comfortable and enjoyable stay."),
("2016-09-01", "13702313", "Kate & Mohammad", "I am grateful to Angela for her help- I was in a rush to find a place to stay  and I am glad I found her home. She very swiftly communicated with me in regards to how to reach her home. What's more  she has a lovely  tidy  and clean home. Thank you so much for accommodating me at basically a moment's notice! Her home is not too far from the airport  which is best reached by car (I used Uber). "),
("2016-09-02", "13702313", "Carlos", "Very nice  clean and confortable  Angela was very nice. I did like the place."),
("2016-09-04", "13702313", "Rocio", "The place is clean and cosy  I liked the  neighborhood and the bed is comfortable. You will have everything you need. Angela is a a very good host  she received us on the night quite late and was always easy to communicate with her  responsive to all my questions and give us some options to go around. You will enjoy your stay."),
("2016-09-09", "13702313", "Shehzad", "It was a very good stay at Angela's place. Angela was responsive and very kind to guide me the way to get to location. Place is at a good peaceful location yet with some very good views across the road. Overall a good stay!"),
("2016-09-11", "13702313", "Henry Hank", "I really enjoyed my stay at Angela's. Would strongly recommend."),
("2016-09-14", "13702313", "William", "Fantastic place! Location is excellent  and Angela is a great hostess. I really enjoyed staying there and would recommend it to anyone. "),
("2016-09-16", "13702313", "Chris", "Angela and Coby were very accommodating and friendly. Thanks again."),
("2016-09-17", "13702313", "Kevin", "Angela was fantastic. I was able to book at short notice. The appartment is close to the airport.  The room is very comfotable. Everything was great. Thank you angela"),
("2016-09-23", "13702313", "Ibrahim", "Thanks Angela  I will come again and again "),
("2016-10-12", "13702313", "Michael", "Immaculately clean house and room. Great having your own bathroom. The bed was very comfortable and Angela was a great host and flexible when it counted. Also a great area close to beach and walking distance to shops and restaurants. You will be well looked after."),
("2016-10-16", "13702313", "Mo", "Stay here!!!!!! Great room. Service and communication was awesome. I arrived at the airport after midnight and still was able to get a response from her within minutes and room was perfect. Clean bathrooms are very important to me and her bathroom was amazing. Highly recommend it. Thanks again."),
("2016-10-24", "13702313", "Gerald", "Just as advertised  room is spacious and Angela is good at giving instructions on everything. I recommend her place to anyone."),
("2016-11-15", "13702313", "Isabelle", "Perfect host  angela is adorable  everything is pleasant and perfect. we will come back"),
("2016-12-07", "13702313", "Dean", "Ang was a brilliant host. The place is very clean and close to public transport and shops. Extremely happy with my stay and highly recommend staying at Angela's place for any person looking."),
("2016-12-12", "13702313", "Yang", "Angela's house was very clean and lovely It takes 10min to the airport"),
("2016-12-14", "13702313", "Harry", "I never meet the host of the house. As we came late. I can say the place was awsome and angela service was excellent. It was very quite and comfortable."),
("2016-12-15", "13702313", "Jye", "One of the best Airbnb experiences yet! Angela is a wonderful host and definitely knows how to run an Airbnb. Just staying a single night between flights  it was super convenient for an Uber to/from the airport and Angela was very accomodating with a last-minute booking. Hope to stay here again and share more travel stories!"),
("2016-12-27", "13702313", "Wayne", "Excellent accommodation"),
("2016-12-30", "13702313", "Patrick", "Angela was a very welcoming host. She was available via txt msg to communicate about arrival any time. Fresh towels etc we're prepared  besides a key  local info etc. The room and whole flat were very tidy and clean. Angela was a nice host  would recommend staying here. The flat is good to reach with public transport."),
("2017-01-01", "13702313", "Mike", "I had a lovely arrival to the other side of the world with my stay at Angela's Such a nice friendly welcome with a lovely clean room to help fight the jet lag. Thank you Anglela"),
("2017-01-30", "13702313", "Don", "Clean comfortable room with bathroom right beside it for your private use. Friendly hostess who has provides a pleasant staying experience. Walking distance to transport shops restaurants and the beach."),
("2017-02-03", "13702313", "Oskar", "Great location if you want to stay close to the airport and still have good access to the city center (direct bus just 200m away). The apartment is very nicely furnished and very well kept. The room is spacious and the bed very comfortable. Angela is a fantastic host and very keen to answer any queries and help out where possible. Definitely would stay again and recommend!"),
("2017-02-12", "13702313", "Amir", "Angela was a great Host  very friendly and kind. It was the first time we used Airbnb and we had a problem with the booking but Angela called Airbnb for us and helped to solve our problem within 5 minutes. Thanks for that again :). The room was clean as shown on the pictures. My girlfriend and me stayed 3 nights. Reaching the beach just takes 2 minutes by foot.  "),
("2017-02-18", "13702313", "Anthony", "Angela made our stay in Sydney very easy  she informed us well about the neighborhood  public transports  restaurants & everything we needed at her place. She couldn't be there upon our arrival but we communicate seamlessly through Airbnb. She also arrange us because we needed to stay for one more night and it didn't cause any problems to her.Her place was very cosy & nice  so was our room  very bright with all the commodities you'd expect. The bed was very confortable and helps us beat the jetlag easily as we were coming from a 8+12 hours flight from France!The location itself is great  I mean  you can walk to the beach in 5/10 minutes from foot! There is also loads of restaurants/cafes near the beach and you're like 15 minutes away to Rockdale station by bus if you want to go to the city center! The neighborhood is safe and quiet  perfect for families too! Angela lives with her son Coby  and they never bothered us so that won't be an issue at all if you were wondering! Either you want to live your life or socialize is up to you as they are really easy & respectful people! Me and my girlfriend enjoyed our stay very much and we would definitely come back again!"),
("2017-02-22", "13702313", "Adrian", "Lovely house and hosts. Great for overnighters close to airport"),
("2017-02-23", "13702313", "Jang", "Angela was very kind and lovely lady. also her house was very clean and well equipped. I really enjoyed staying there. I would definately visit her again  and recommend to everyone. thank you Angela."),
("2017-02-24", "13702313", "Aika", "We were lucky to get the room last minute as we had a change of plans when we arrived in Sydney so it was a perfect place for us to stay for the night. Communication went really well! The room is nice and bathroom is super clean (so important for me:)) Thank you Angela!"),
("2017-03-04", "13702313", "Toni", "Friendly host. Room has everything needed for a comfortable stay. Recommended."),
("2017-03-12", "13702313", "Erik", "Un très bon week-end dans un quartier tranquille  proche de tout  je recommande."),
("2017-03-17", "13702313", "Robert", "Stayed at Angelas very briefly for one night on way to Southern suburbs.  Place was easy to find and really close to the airport.  Rooms were nice and clean and modern.   Had a delayed late flight and Angela was very responsive and super easy to communicate with  and facilitated a late check in for me which was greatly appreciated.   Highly recommend this place :)"),
("2017-03-25", "13702313", "Kayla", "We crashed at Angela's place for a night. She was sweet and made sure we knew how to get around. There is a bus stop around the corner which made it easy to get back into Sydney. She is more than willing to explain how to get there."),
("2017-04-06", "13702313", "Jagjit", "Great place for travellers who are alone and looking for inner peace as this flat is very near to beautiful sandy beach. This is also recommended to couples who wishes to spend quality time together."),
("2017-04-09", "13702313", "Natalie", "Very fast response and flexible with arrangements"),
("2017-04-18", "13702313", "Tony", "the home was comfortable and clean."),
("2017-04-23", "13702313", "Islah", "I needed to find urgent accommodation and this was perfect! Angela was so quick to reply to all my questions and she was very patient and flexible with check-in and check-out. Very very clean place and a cool vibe in the house! It was lovely to meet Angela and her son  as well as getting to know their travel history a little bit. Will definitely be coming back. "),
("2017-05-07", "13702313", "Mandy", "Angela is very kind and reply the messages to us is quick. she ready for everything is awesome! Her house is tidy and clean. It's very comfortable. highly recommend!"),
("2017-05-21", "13702313", "Catherine", "A good stay"),
("2017-05-28", "13702313", "Marko", "Very nice quiet and clean place to stay. Close to shops and airport. Would recommend. Thank you Angela  great host. "),
("2017-05-31", "13702313", "Hannah", "I needed a place to stay for the night before my morning flight and this was perfect! I took an uber for $17 and it only took 13 minutes. The place is huge and comfortable! I would definitely recommend"),
("2017-06-23", "13702313", "Renee", "Angela's place was lovely  clean and welcoming. The room was exactly as described  the bed was comfortable and the shower was hot. Angela and Coby were lovely  friendly hosts."),
("2017-07-08", "13702313", "Elodie", "I stayed 1 night. Angela's place is actually nicer than the photos. The beach is near and had amazing views. She let me use her phone charger because mine wasn't working and had breakfast available. The unit was very clean and fairly close to the airport and near shops. Angela was also flexible with my check out time. I would stay here again."),
("2017-07-21", "13702313", "Lilly & Jamie", "Wonderful home and lovely hosts! A beautiful location near to the hospital  beach and airport. Many restaurants within a 10minute stroll. Will definitely be staying with Ang and Coby next time I'm in Sydney!! "),
("2017-08-07", "13702313", "Wu", "Angela人很好 很周到和細心 有彈性的check in 時間同check out左之後都讓我們放行李在她家和使用客廳等待上機 回覆訊息時間迅速 兒子Coby怕羞安靜但很可愛｡房子十分漂亮 很有格調和溫暖 如果我一個人再次之往澳洲旅行 會到再次居住Angela的家｡樓下的鄰居亦很友善｡真實的房間同屋比照片還漂亮｡房間十分乾淨 我們check out完看見Angela立刻更換床單 被子等 清潔度滿分｡有張書桌可以用作辦公 很方便｡附近有一個海灘 走1分鐘有個巴士站可以到地鐵｡"),
("2017-08-09", "13702313", "Rohan", "Great location for airport. Great Value. Wonderful host."),
("2017-08-12", "13702313", "玥莹", "房间很舒适温馨 房东人也很好 走的时候帮我们寄存包包 临近的海滩也不错"),
("2017-08-19", "13702313", "Kevin", "非常不错 下订单后房东细致的沟通地理位置及如何进门｡房间干净整洁｡房东还准备各种零食早餐供免费享用｡下次如果有需要还会预定这家"),
("2017-08-20", "13702313", "Sonya", "Exceptionally smooth  prompt and helpful communication from Angela  and a very comfortable and convenient place to stay."),
("2017-08-21", "13702313", "David", "Angela let us in herself  showed us around and made us feel at home straight away. We stayed only the one night  but her room was just what we needed for an 18 hour layover."),
("2017-08-31", "13702313", "Emil", "Ang was a fantastic host  easy to communicate with  and very accommodating. The place is equally as fantastic."),
("2017-09-06", "13702313", "Jonathan", "Great place to unwind after a long flight. Close to the airport and the home was as stated in the description!"),
("2017-09-07", "13702313", "Matt", "Perfect stay!"),
("2017-10-01", "13702313", "Ivy", "Angela and Coby’s home was superb. The entire unit was airy and bright  with a well decorated balcony  which was perfect for an afternoon glass of wine  and having a peek at my work emails. The bedroom is super quiet  which was perfect after a long day work.  The place is a 2-minute walk from the beach  which is fronted by a terrific walking path if you’re keen for a run or long walk. The nearest train station is a short bus trip away  or approximately 30 mins walk.  Angela was super friendly  and has a wealth of interesting stories about her world travels. The conversation even led us to discover we knew someone in common! Small world."),
("2017-10-05", "13702313", "Farhana", "Angela's house was a lovely place to stay during my short trip to Sydney. Her house is spotless and neat  with everything you could possibly need to feel at home. In particular  the tissue box and folder of nearby restaurant pamphlets on the desk were thoughtful touches! The bed itself was comfy to sleep in and the room receives plenty of natural light. Breakfast and towels were all provided  and Angela and Coby are kind and considerate of their guests.  Just a tip to keep in mind how big your luggage will be as there is no lift and you'll have to climb a few flights of stairs to reach her house. Overall a great experience that exceeded my expectations!"),
("2017-10-17", "13702313", "Ali", "Nice lady  open minded and very easy going.Her son is well behaved. A good kid. Clean house/room.20/10"),
("2017-11-30", "13702313", "Nongyao", "ขอบคุณมากๆสำหรับการต้อนรับที่อบอุ่น"),
("2017-12-14", "13702313", "Harry", "very close to the sea. I enjoyed swimming and walking. I felt comfortable like staying my home"),
("2017-12-31", "13702313", "Jeff", "Very close to the airport  nice clear accommodations...and Angela is a wonderful hostess!"),
("2018-01-02", "13702313", "Paige", "Angela was a wonderful host. The room was very clean  spacious and comfortable. It was very convenient from the airport! Thanks again Angela!"),
("2018-01-06", "13702313", "Eva", "My stay was in one word: Perfect. Booking and communications were nice  quick and easy. The room was super clean and comfortable and I had my own bathroom. Angela is a very nice and helpful person. Meeting her was a good start in Australia. (And lets me forget the „Taxi driver“ who ripped me off ;) )Going to the center is easy and quick   just a few bus stops to the next train station."),
("2018-02-08", "13702313", "Isabel", "Best AirBnB experience I had so far. Angela was so friendly and nice. I feeled like home during my stay. It was everything as metioned  very clean and very comfy. I really can recommend this host. If I visit Sydney again  I will book this Airbnb again. Thanks for everything:)."),
("2018-02-15", "13702313", "Nala", "Everything was perfect  a really convenient room with our own bathroom. Really clean  and the breakfast is included. Angela and her son are very discreet and nice! I recommend 100%  perfect value"),
("2018-03-01", "13702313", "Harry", "perfect host and room for me."),
("2018-03-20", "13702313", "Skyler", "Angela's home was very clean and check in was very easy. She and her son were very friendly and she had compiled a book of recommended places to eat  which was helpful. Walking distance from the beach. Recommended!"),
("2018-04-11", "13702313", "Kyle", "Angela takes her Airbnb seriously  but don’t let that make you think she’s strict or rigid! I needed three nights in the middle of the week and she responded within ten minutes. The room was ready in 90 minutes! Then I got a new itinerary to fly out the next day. She obliged and I got a quick refund of my two nights I didn’t need. Also  she was lovely to chat with. All features as advertised. Quaint beachside community. You should book now!"),
("2018-06-14", "13702313", "Kasey", "Super host!  Helpful with any questions we had about the area.  So many things to do with in 20/30 minutes."),
("2018-07-12", "13702313", "子薇", "It is very comfortable and lovely."),
("2018-08-12", "13702313", "Simon", "When I read the reviews I was expecting good things  and it was everything I expected. I do not usually give very good reviews  but Angela was worth it in this case. "),
("2018-08-27", "13702313", "새봄", "시드니 시내하고 멀다는 것을 제외하고는 완벽한 숙소입니다! 매우 깨끗하고 호스트도 친절해요~~"),
("2018-09-05", "13702313", "Florencia", "Angela’s house is beautiful. We enjoy our short stay. It is a real superhost!"),
("2018-09-14", "13702313", "Ahmad Nawaz", "Location: Absolutely fantastic  next to beach (less than one minute) Cafe's  Restaurants and Coles (10 minutes - you don't feel this walk as walking next to beach is itself a pleasure) Bus stand (one minute).  The apartment has quite peaceful surroundings. Room: Has everything that you would need during your stay and the entire apartment is absolutely neat and clean. Also there are cereals available for you  which is a great plus.  Host: Glad that I met Angela  clear instructions and clear communication made the stay as one of my best."),
("2018-09-24", "13702313", "Andrew", "As advertised. Clean and good value for money."),
("2018-09-28", "13702313", "Rock", "Great host and very comfortable space   would arrive again with Angela anytime!"),
("2018-09-29", "13702313", "Titi", "Angela is very nice host. She could give us lots of information about the beautiful local place around her guest house."),
("2018-10-05", "13702313", "Haiwang", "nice location  close to the beach and airport. Warm-hearted host and sweet room."),
("2018-10-14", "13702313", "Ramachandran", "A clean and comfortable place with ex-ordinary hospitality."),
("2018-10-22", "13702313", "Laura", "Nice and very clean home. Angela and her son Coby are very nice and welcoming. Very good location with bus stop 2 mins away and good connection to the city"),
("2018-10-23", "13702313", "Marilyn", "We needed a place to stay that night and close to the airport.  Angela was very quick at getting back to us and very accommodating.   We got an Uber ride there for just over $10 US and less than that for the ride to the international terminal the next morning.  Would stay here again.  Thanks Angela!"),
("2018-10-28", "13702313", "Mutiara", "Angela's place is very lovely and cozy  everything is clean and I feel like I'm in home as I can find everything that I needed. Moreover the beach is just a minute walk from her place! Will certainly come back and recommend this place!"),
("2018-11-02", "13702313", "Erik", "great place  stayed only for one night as I was stopping over for a long"),
("2018-11-03", "13702313", "John", "We are also Air B&B hosts with lots of our own travels to compare.Angela & her accommodation offer are commendable.Great location with easy commute from Sydney Airport  very short walk to beach & photos are an honest reflection of her space.Angela has been more that helpful & is very good as a host.I’d come back here without hesitation. Thanks Angela"),
("2018-11-10", "13702313", "Ruth", "Angela is very accommodating and her place is very fresh and clean. A great location for getting to the airport."),
("2018-11-13", "13702313", "Jessica", "Nice place right by the beach and airport. Would recommend"),
("2018-11-17", "13702313", "Prasaad", "Angela's place is sparkling clean and very comfortable. It is a quick ride from and to the airport and is well connected to bus stops in case you want to go to the city. Angela is very professional and friendly. Highly recommend it."),
("2018-11-20", "13702313", "Jim", "Everything is clean  the location is great. Angela is very considerate and helpful. The perfect place to stay."),
("2018-11-22", "13702313", "Jimmy", "Good place to live in. I reckon this is the cheapest accommodation can be found around the airport prescient."),
("2018-11-25", "13702313", "Sanaz", "Beautiful and airy space  close to the beach and all the cafes and restaurants. Very clean and wonderfully presented."),
("2018-12-01", "13702313", "Andrew", "Angela's place was clean  tidy and most importantly  hassle free. From beginning to end Angela ensured I had everything I needed for a great stay."),
("2018-12-06", "13702313", "Mouhamad", "Angela was very supportive  prompt  the room and amenities were very clean. Thanks for your hospitality Angela."),
("2018-12-09", "13702313", "Dash", "Clean and very pleasant room. I would recommend it"),
("2018-12-30", "13702313", "Hung Bill", "Very good place to live  house is really clean  giving you foods suggestion:)"),
("2019-01-02", "13702313", "Raaj", "Angela was a great host. I had great time staying at Angela's place. Travelers who are carrying huge luggage might face some difficulty due to the location at the top floor. Other than that everything was great over there."),
("2019-01-03", "13702313", "Kevin", "Very good! Totally recommend for eveyone"),
("2019-01-04", "13702313", "Catherine", "a good place to stay   clean and tidy good location"),
("2019-01-11", "13702313", "Nayae", "정말 깨끗하고 좋아요!! 집 뒤에 바다도 멋져요. 이 가격에 이런 집을 구할 수 있어 행복했답니다!! 추천합니다!!"),
("2019-01-18", "13702313", "Trudy", "Perfect location very close to the beach. House & bathroom was spotlessly clean. Coming from Cairns I didn't think I would need an air conditioned room. Unfortunately my week of stay was during a heatwave in Sydney so the room was very hot to sleep in  but comfortable nevertheless"),
("2019-01-20", "13702313", "Crystal", "The place was spotless! I was travelling for work through the area and needed somewhere to rest  Angela's place didn't disappoint. Everything is as described  clean  comfortable and quiet. 5 stars!"),
("2019-01-25", "13702313", "Darcy", "The only thing we were unhappy about was not staying longer!"),
("2019-01-29", "13702313", "Josephine", "I had a great stay at Angela’s place. Listing was accurately described and great value  highly recommended for travellers looking to stay near Sydney Airport."),
("2019-01-30", "13702313", "Philip", "Great place to stay. Host is super nice and sweet. Quick response and very accommodating. Would definitely recommend staying here."),
("2019-02-02", "13702313", "Nicola", "Angela is a fantastic Host the hause is incredible!!!"),
("2019-02-04", "13702313", "Suhui", "Very clean and tidy cozy room  Angela is very helpful with all the question we had about that area  room and place was quite  and couple mins away will reach a street that full of restaurants."),
("2019-02-05", "13702313", "Ellen", "Great place to stay. Sparkling clean home. Very close to the beach."),
("2019-02-07", "13702313", "Dabin", "깨끗하고 친절하고 공항 가깝고 다 좋습니다 주변에 해변있고 레스토랑도 많아요! 약간 개선점이라면 방에 에어컨 없는거ㅜㅠ 좀 더울 수도 있어요"),
("2019-02-14", "13702313", "Mike", "Great stay  would recommend highly"),
("2019-02-19", "13702313", "Jinwoo", "Thanks Angela for having me. Happy to stay again next time"),
("2019-02-19", "13702313", "Hieu", "Bright  tidy  clean and very near bus station. The host is friendly and thoughtful"),
("2019-02-20", "13702313", "Pedro", "Great place to stay. Very close to the airport."),
("2019-02-22", "13702313", "Bonnie", "Homey and clean."),
("2019-02-23", "13702313", "Silas", "Würde jederzeit wiederkommen."),
("2019-03-03", "13702313", "Bianca", "Great stay  spotless clean  comfy bed you don’t wanna get out of. Great privacy tv in the room for you to enjoy in the evening while relaxing."),
("2016-07-31", "13852692", "Kim", "Very happy with the house  beautifully decorated and very spacious. Only issue was there was no wifi. "),
("2016-08-23", "13852692", "Yuting", "Great location. Really close to city. Tidy and clean and absolutely artistic. Vanessa replied all questions on time and really helpful."),
("2016-10-09", "13852692", "Nick", "Vanessa very helpful  a great spot!"),
("2016-10-25", "13852692", "Marcus", "A botiuge place to stay  a little sparse in furnishings and would be a little cold in winter  lots of concrete. In general a nice place to stay and very convenient to restaurants and the city of Sydney. A short walk to the bottom of the hill and you are at the waterfront looking at the Opera House  Harbour Bridge and Luna Park. "),
("2016-10-31", "13852692", "Barb", "Vanessa was extremely prompt in returning all emails.  The location was brilliant and close to many great places to eat  catch a ferry and public transport.  The kitchen was great with all you needed to make a great meal and serve.  I would definitely stay here again."),
("2016-11-15", "13852692", "Catherine At", "We loved the house! We came as 6 colleagues on a conference and had a great time. There was so much space and lots of places to sit  chill or catch up on work. The house was the most unique   modern and trendy place I have ever been to - like a 5* hotel. I might be wary if I had kids though as there its a lot of artwork that I would hate to damage."),
("2016-11-21", "13852692", "Tracy", "The house was quirky with lots of lovely artwork  as well as being very large easily accommodating 6 adults. The house was fully equipped with anything you can imagine - and if there is anything you need  it is central to both North Sydney train station and Mcmahons Point ferry terminal.  Lots of local restaurants  pubs  shops (IGA  Aldi and Coles as well as the fantastic Mcmahons Grocers).  Vanessa was very quick with responses and accommodating us after some previous accommodation with another host ended up being double booked.  Her information and instructions were well written and documented.  The house was very quiet and we thoroughly enjoyed our stay and didn't want to leave."),
("2016-12-10", "13852692", "Kelly", "True to the pictures. The space was huge and more than enough for our family of seven. We loved that we could dine together when we liked in the roomy dining area. It was also a short walk down to a lovely Thai restaurant (Chet Thai)  a little playground for kids  a small grocery store  and if you have time  walk down to the ferry point and you will be struck awe by the view of the harbour. "),
("2016-12-28", "13852692", "Crystal", "It is a nice place  our family enjoy the stay very much. The host is very helpful when we have some questions. "),
("2017-01-02", "13852692", "Andri", "Great apartment and Vanessa was so nice. We loved staying here and we give it the best score that is possible."),
("2017-01-27", "13852692", "Liting", "房间非常漂亮 位置虽然不是CBD但是交通也算方便｡房间对于8人来说非常宽裕｡但是房东的各项要求非常严格 退房时间也非常早 而且在最后一天(当天是中国农历新年第一天)离开时无法寄存行李 导致我们一行人无奈只能拖着行李箱在市内玩了一天 非常疲惫｡"),
("2017-02-15", "13852692", "Mats", "Over all a good place to stay. Two rooms with their own shower /toilett was perfect  the third one needs some finishing... Wifi exist but slow."),
("2017-02-18", "13852692", "Chan", "Big house near Sydney center around 10 mins driving. Tidy  clean and wide space could accommodate almost 10 people. Most of restaurant  bar and groceries nearby. "),
("2017-03-05", "13852692", "Shanker", "We were a party of 8 and we thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Vanessa's place. There is more than ample room and you never feel you're in front of someone else's face. The location of the house is in a beautiful neighbourhood - under 10 mins walk to the North Sydney train station and another 10 mins walk to this fabulous look out point down Blues Point Road.Recommended."),
("2017-03-12", "13852692", "Jason", "This place is perfect for few families and those with children! Plenty of space and not to mention many interest art pieces. Very Walkable to Luna Park  harbour bridge plus North Sydney train station and Greenwood plaza for all your grocery needs. Highly recommend for short or even long stay. :) do bring a clothes rack along if you have plenty of washing to do. Thank you Venessa!!!"),
("2017-03-19", "13852692", "Michelle", "Great location near parks  shops  ferries  buses and trains.  Extremely spacious and well appointed place with beautiful artwork. Quiet and peaceful for large family groups travelling together."),
("2017-03-23", "13852692", "Tom", "Great place to stay... everything was perfect. We had 5 people go over for a conference and it had plenty of space for everyone to have their own room and sitting areas. Vanessa was great to deal with too. Thanks for having us!"),
("2017-03-26", "13852692", "Robert", "The house is absolutely beautiful and stylish! The location is great and close to public transport  cafe and restaurant. Every detail in the house is carefully designed. It represents a very good taste of the host. It is not only a house but a great piece of art. It is definitely enjoyable and lovely staying there. The host is warm-hearted and has very fast response. I would definitely recommend this place to stay in Sydney."),
("2017-04-09", "13852692", "Eric", "Recommended for family stay and great location for sydney visit"),
("2017-04-23", "13852692", "Neil", "The place is very large  with very big common areas that could accommodate everyone twice over. The location is great with transport connections from the airport bring very simple with short walk and train ride. The surrounding cafes and parks. Given the look in photos I was concerned that my 1 and 3 year old might reek havoc this was not the case. The little outdoor areas and the nearby playground were great for them. Supermarket  cafes  pubs are 5mins walk away. Vanessa was helpful and quick to respond."),
("2017-04-27", "13852692", "Benson", "非常美的住宅｡你需要自备洗漱用品 吹风机｡"),
("2017-05-08", "13852692", "Lee", "Love the house it's really decorated nicely with thoughts. Kitchen utensils were equipped would be better to add a bigger pot for large consumptions. We asked for later check out and the host was able to help. Found a dirty underwear in one of the room lol but that's alright.  Overall a pleasant stay easy access to shop for food and drinks and crossing the harbour. The neighbourhood is really beautiful  enjoyed the walk to wharf everyday. "),
("2017-05-13", "13852692", "Eunice", "Vanessa's house was exactly as how it looks on photos or even better! The house is huge and the 8 of us had a great time during our stay. The house is beautifully decorated  and extremely spacious  and there was enough room for the 8 of us to move around without feeling castrophobic. There were very strict house rules from the owner on the rubbish management issue which may come off as very daunting but nothing unmanageable. Otherwise we had an absolute amazing time and will highly recommend this place to big groups looking for a beautiful house to stay in during your time in Sydney. "),
("2017-06-14", "13852692", "Linda", "My family had a wonderful stay in Vanessa’s house – it was the most charming houses we have ever stayed in! Everything is as depicted in the description and photos – large house with lots of roaming spaces and a well-equipped kitchen. We spent most of our time at home admiring her decoration and her books collection. It’s a lovely  quiet neighbourhood with everything nearby – cafes  restaurants  grocers  liquor shops  pharmacy etc. Short walk to the North Sydney train station  or you can also take the ferry from CBD/Darling Harbour to McMahons Point (then either a short uphill walk to the house  or a 2-min bus ride up to street if you manage to catch the half-hourly bus). Totally fuss-free check-in and check-out. As mentioned by other guests  don’t get too alarmed by the list of instructions – just take your garbage out on time and you should be fine (no pun intended lol). I would highly recommend Vanessa’s home!"),
("2017-06-28", "13852692", "Grace", "We stayed at Vanessa's as a company group  was just what we needed. A home away from home  perfect for our short stay. "),
("2017-07-02", "13852692", "Gerard", "Nice place and close to restaurants and ferry."),
("2017-07-08", "13852692", "Mark", "Great place to stay. Close to everything and was perfect for a family lay of 9 to be together and also have private spaces. We had 2 young children and the TV room was great for them also . Would love to stay again one day thanks"),
("2017-07-23", "13852692", "Mary-Jane", "Everyone  everywhere Vanessa place is just a dream! The photos don't do it enough justices! Vanessa was so helpful  she welcome me and my family for my wedding in Sydney.The house was perfect  Lots of space  enough bathroom space for all the ladies and my wedding photos will look amazing!Seriously don't go pass this place!!! You need to stay here.Close to everything  buses  trains everything. She is just amazing!!Dont think twice  book!"),
("2017-08-01", "13852692", "Yi", "it was nice stay at vanessa s place. really convient and close to everywhere."),
("2017-09-04", "13852692", "Lesley", "This is a lovely home in a very central part of Sydney. The home has lots of personality and is beautiful. The only downside was that I left my Kindle behind by accident  and because I don't live in Sydney  and the owner lives overseas it wasn't very easy to organise to have it collected within the timeslots allocated to me by the owner. That can't be helped though. It was my own fault for forgetting it and the owner did the best she could."),
("2017-09-13", "13852692", "Ryan", "We really enjoyed our stay at Vanessa's place! Such a great space - spacious  clean  close to public transport  great communication.Highly recommended."),
("2017-09-25", "13852692", "Karen", "Artistic  inspirational space ideal for big group who drives (especially if tourists); who are punctual (cleaners do show up on the dot on the hour of your checkout); well prepared (remember to BYO amenities like hair dryers  body wash  tea/coffee); responsible (read the manual and follow all to-dos). Since we were such a group we had a lovely stay! Don't miss amazing view of harbour bridge from the end of Blue Points Road!"),
("2017-09-29", "13852692", "Jing", "房子很不错 房间超多｡位置也还可以的 去哪里都近｡就是收了这么多清洁费 退房的时候 还让我们洗碗 哈哈哈哈哈哈｡"),
("2017-10-01", "13852692", "Maree", "Amazing accommodation for 3 couples or a group. Roomy  stylish  convenient and curated beautifully. We loved the area  its proximity to the city  the opportunity to explore a unique area  and the generosity of space. Would definitely book this beautiful home again. A highlight was meeting a local 'Emma' who provided wonderful advice about shopping  drinking and walking in the area. Thanks Emma."),
("2017-11-12", "13852692", "Cate", "Wonderful large open spaces. Great location close to the city  good eat and takeaway and beautiful area for walking and wandering . Very quiet and comfy home for a large group. The host was very prompt with responses."),
("2017-11-22", "13852692", "Gareth", "Cool space  great art."),
("2017-12-02", "13852692", "Simon", "Wow. That is what every said when they entered the place - stylish  huge  and can easily take ten people without feeling crowded.  Indeed we had a dinner of 15+ people with takeaway from the local Thai and the rooms had a great vibe for that kind of relaxed get together. We could walk to North Sydney station or down to Mc Masons Point ferry to give lots of flexible access. A very good neighbourhood with good restaurants and walks by the harbour - put the place itself is in a very quiet street.  And Vanessa was wonderfully responsive to any small issues we had or advice that was needed.  A wonderful place for a large group."),
("2018-01-03", "13852692", "Lauren", "We loved the location of Vanessa's house. We traveled with our entire family and were so pleased when we walked in and realized how huge the place was! The decorations were great and the beds were comfy. You can walk down very easy to take the ferry. It is in a nice and safe neighborhood."),
("2018-01-06", "13852692", "Kirrily", "We had a great stay at Vanessa's Place! I'm from Regional NSW and we stayed with friends of ours who had come in from Denver Colorado. This was their first trip to Sydney and they were blown away by the location. We walked a few blocks down Blues Point Rd to catch the ferry and the view was spectacular. The iconic vistas of Sydney  being the Harbour Bridge  Opera House and Luna Park were just a stones throw away.We didn't take cars with us and spent the entire trip using the readily accessible public transport for trips across the harbour to the CBD.The best part about the location was NOT being in the CBD but still super close. A night ferry across to Darling Harbour for dinner was tourist perfection.We started a game amongst the 9 of us to try and figure out 2 things...1) The original use of the building before it became accommodation and 2) getting to know our host by investigating the furnishings  artworks and books in the library. Although we'll never know the real answers  we had a great time discovering the eclectic array of furnishings  the amazing variety and quality of the art and sculptures as well as the interesting use of antiques and curios. I enjoyed time in the library combing through the broad spectrum of books and journals on hand. Overall  a wonderful stay in a truly imaginative residential space. Well done Vanessa."),
("2018-01-12", "13852692", "Edward", "Very spacious  design-forward home In a fabulous neighborhood.   Short walk to  restaurants  cafés  ferry in to town.  Lovely views of Sydney bridge and the city from several restaurants nearby. "),
("2018-01-29", "13852692", "Sue", "Beautiful and spacious place in a great location."),
("2018-02-03", "13852692", "Warren", "This place is as good as it looks. Really cool style."),
("2018-02-14", "13852692", "Chen", "简直完美!超大的房间 超棒的公共区域!完美的超乎想象!设施相当齐全 并且步行就可以到港口!这么久以来遇到的最喜欢的房间!"),
("2018-02-21", "13852692", "Liao", "房间厨具齐全 客厅超大 有间卧室有些味道"),
("2018-03-15", "13852692", "Mia", "it's very nice place   we enjoy  and will come again .thanks ! Vanessa"),
("2018-03-19", "13852692", "Karin", "This is such a wonderful space  really interesting house in a great location.  We'll definitely be back on our next visit."),
("2018-03-31", "13852692", "Kjerstin", "Beautiful place close to public transport  restaurants  shops and cafes.Perfect for a group of friends to stay together  with room for some privacy as well."),
("2018-04-15", "13852692", "Olivia", "What a property - it's a great space and totally unique! Perfect for a large group of friends having a getaway or getting prepared for a special event  as we were! One annoyance is having to pay extra for parking on the driveway."),
("2018-04-20", "13852692", "James", "Really cool place in a great part of town. The space is ideal for small groups. Really comfy sofas and beds. You are also in a cool part of town v close to the northern working district  and also to nature - go for a morning jog along the coast!! Also recommend the great little deli on Union St just a stone's through away. Sydney living at its best!"),
("2018-04-30", "13852692", "John", "I had my family stay here for 4 days due to my wedding. Location is great and the place is a good size for a large group.When we arrived the place smelled of mould/mildew and very stuffy. It needed to be aired out for 2 days to be acceptable. There were dehumidifiers (3) in the rooms running when we arrived to remove moisture I assume. I opted not to stay there on the eve of my wedding (which I planned to) due to the mildew smell but they coped with it (being  from interstate ) and it was ok half way through their stay after they left the doors and windows open for 2 days. The host was very understanding  sent a property manager to inspect and offered me a partial refund however this ultimately isn’t a solution and it was too hard to move everyone."),
("2018-05-27", "13852692", "Lisa", "Great location   large roomy spaces with eclectic furnishings and artwork to enjoy . A great house with easy walking to local restaurants and city ferry"),
("2018-06-10", "13852692", "Iain", "Lovely house full of character as you can tell from the pictures. We never had a chance to meet Vanessa but everything worked very well  and communication was very clear."),
("2018-06-17", "13852692", "Lany", "This place is huge. Suitable for big family and friends. Kitchen equipment is so complete beyond expectation. The decoration is wonderful.. we have many photos inside the house. Every corner is instagramable . Near north sydney train station and some small groceries. Nice stay at all"),
("2018-06-25", "13852692", "Julianne", "What a place  it’s one of the best I have ever stayed at. If your with family or friends the place is cosy enough and big enough not to be on top of each other.It’s a 10 out of 10 from me."),
("2018-07-03", "13852692", "Paul", "Great space with multiple living areas. Plenty of room for everyone to spread out. The location was perfect. We walked over the bridge to the Opera House. It was close to trains and ferries. Easy walking access to restaurants and shops. It was a bit damp but the multiple dehumidifiers helped. Only suggestion would be to put doors on the bathrooms. Two bathrooms had no doors and the third didn’t lock. We really enjoyed our stay in Sidney and this home made it even better. Thanks"),
("2018-08-19", "13852692", "Andrew", "Victoria's Place is a very unusual accommodation.  It is a conversion of a workshop and is very well done.  The place is filled with quirky decorations. It is very roomy. It can be a touch cold in winter.It is very quiet but also a great location with access to many local restaurants and pubs as well as Luna Park and ferries to the city (about 1km away)."),
("2018-08-22", "13852692", "Natalie", "What a fabulous space. This was a great warehouse conversion home. Victoria was great and communicated well. I stayed here with some work colleagues and it was a perfect space for us to have our own space and also socialise. Everyone said their beds and stay was good  there were just a couple of things that they were uncomfortable with and that's a couple of open windows and see-through curtains that looked straight onto the street  one of the rooms was clearly damp and the person who stayed there was sensitive to damp and mould  unfortunately. The common share bathroom facilities didn't have a lock on the door and the toilet door didn't have a separate lock so a few were uncomfortable with that. "),
("2018-08-28", "13852692", "John", "We've had a great stay in McMahons Point and the amazing space which was very well considered and curated. Everything was as described and there is plenty of space for a large group. The quirky decoration makes for many talking points. Communication was easy  clear and quick. Great location too with easy access to anywhere as it's close to the brigde with plenty of local shops also. A memorable space!"),
("2018-09-10", "13852692", "Shirley", "Amazing value and amazing place... Love the quirky furniture great for photo shoots!"),
("2018-09-17", "13852692", "Lisa", "Beautiful place  good value  great location and close to North Sydney station  very clean! Thank you Victoria. Warm reminder for next guests- please bring your own shampoo  conditioner  body wash  dish washer tablets."),
("2018-09-27", "13852692", "Susanne", "This house is special. We enjoyed the artwork and the quirky bits and pieces.  A great eat in kitchen worked well for us  as did the generous living area. There is plenty of crockery  glasses  pots and pans etc. The location is great. A short walk to coffee shops and restaurants and not far to the ferry."),
("2018-10-09", "13852692", "Jane", "Very spacious  convenient and a creative place to stay.  Easy commute and great local restaurants and cafe just a minute away.  Perfect for groups or large families wanting to stay in a stylish city pad."),
("2018-10-20", "13852692", "Michelle", "We all enjoyed this beautiful home providing the perfect space for our family reunion!!! McMahons Point is also a great location for sightseeing Sydney. We loved the friendly atmosphere and variety of local cafes/restaurants too."),
("2018-10-28", "13852692", "Sue", "Great location near cafes  restaurants  train and ferries. Ample space in quirky home with loads of sitting areas."),
("2018-11-11", "13852692", "Rod", "If you want a large house for a group this is fantastic. Great space and location is easy walk to City over the Bridge"),
("2018-11-25", "13852692", "Snjezana", "Superb location  funky artistic unique huge space...  makes you want to come back... again and again.."),
("2018-11-30", "13852692", "Maurice", "This property was in a great location  close to a gym  coffee shops  restaurants and a lovely walk to the ferry.Great views of the harbour were only a short walk away.Close to the train line and ferry point.Victoria was very accomodating with our check in & out times as my son was arriving earlier and we were given the opportunity for a later check out time.I particularly enjoyed the book shelf (library) with many wonderful topics and subjects that kept me busy.There was 7 of us staying there and the property gave us all our own space to unwind as well as space to come together as a family to play board games and connect.The stylish layout and the art pieces were also part of the experience in staying at this property.We would definitely recommend this property for families or a group of couples wanting to share the experience."),
("2018-12-15", "13852692", "Kath", "A most stylish house to spend the few days prior to our daughters wedding.  Great for photos.  Feel like we were living in a classy antique warehouse with all the mod cons that were needed!  Great location too."),
("2018-12-21", "13852692", "Mindy", "The house is a lot more run down than it looks on the photographs provided. Beds were dusty which resulted in my developing hives on my first night there. Air-conditioning is only available in the kitchen and in one of the toilets. There is a step near the kitchen which can be quite dangerous because its not clearly marked. Both my grandparents missed the step and they nearly fell. Do be prepared to walk uphill from the train station to the home."),
("2019-01-04", "13852692", "Jatin", "Victoria's place in North Sydney is at a fantastic location  with close proximity to Lavender Bay Park and Blues Point Park that offer you fantastic views of the Harbour Bridge and the Opera House. Great for NYE fireworks. Other than that  the house is very well kept  with all basic amenities provided."),
("2019-01-27", "13852692", "Georgina", "Exceptional property in a wonderful location. Extremely spacious and well thought out  with a great mix of modern and eclectic styles. Victoria is very responsive and helpful. The property has plenty of natural light and would be the perfect location to get ready for a wedding. I will definitely be staying again!"),
("2019-01-31", "13852692", "健", "There is no doubt that this is the best in our entire journey home  our whole team are very  very love the family  the traffic is very convenient  shopping is not convenient to cook  and most important  the house was so beautiful  the owner was a great artist  even if any one corner of the sitting at home  you can also feel the rich cultural charm. The nine of us are sure to be back"),
("2019-02-17", "13852692", "Mark", "A spacious accommodation great for a large group. Except some improvements required for air conditioning  all are well.Worth considering!"),
("2016-07-26", "14096512", "Andrew", "A great comfortable little place right smack bang in the centre of circular quay. Contact with host/s was quick and easy too"),
("2016-07-29", "14096512", "Maddie", "Our stay in Jared's apartment was exactly what we needed. It's a very comfortable space for two people. There is a big window that provides a nice view of the surroundings and a lovely breeze. We didn't use the rooftop pool (too cold) but it was gorgeous! The kitchen is very small but it's well set out so there is still plenty of bench space. Being on a high floor the hot water doesn't run for particularly long but it's fine if you leave a bit of time between showers. Checking in and out was super easy! The building is in a wonderful location  we walked easily to Haymarket  Darling Harbour  the Rocks  and Circular Quay. TIP: If you are driving into the city  this is not the place to stay. Parking was a nightmare. Jared does warn that parking is expensive (he mentions $69 in the apartment description) but what I didn't realise is it's not just a $69 flat rate for more than three hours  it's $69 the first day  $50 overnight  then $69 for the next day. In the end we just gave up trying to find cheaper parking and paid. Other than that our stay was wonderful. Thank you Jared for being a wonderful host! "),
("2016-08-01", "14096512", "K.", "The studio's location is very accessible. Its a few minutes walk from both Wynyard and Circular Quay train stations. That was a major win for us. We were able to visit one place in the morning  then return and feed the kids and visit another place in the evening/night. Jared provided us plenty of everything described in the listing.You can even see Sydney Eye Tower from one of the windows. No balcony though."),
("2016-08-05", "14096512", "演", "很干净 结构布局都很喜欢 如果check in的时间能在灵活一点就好了"),
("2016-08-07", "14096512", "Ashley", "It was a great place to stay  awesome location for a good price  and it was a good size for the four of us for four nights. Nice view out the window of the city too"),
("2016-08-15", "14096512", "Melati", "Nice and clean place to stay int he middle of the cityReally recommended!"),
("2016-08-28", "14096512", "Jo", "The location is okay and safe."),
("2016-08-31", "14096512", "Caroline", "Great great location! Lovely little thank you note too. The place was spotless and had everything we needed!"),
("2016-09-03", "14096512", "Steven", "Good Host"),
("2016-09-10", "14096512", "Rachel", "房东非常热情和友好 公寓的地理位置也很好 走路就可以到很多景区 公寓有厨房 可以自己做饭｡一次不错的居住体验｡"),
("2016-09-11", "14096512", "Rob", "Great communication from Jared at the time of booking and leading up to our stay.  The apartment was perfect for us as our weekend was spent mainly in the Rocks and Circular Quay area which was about a 5 minute walk.Pub across the road has all the sports channels (perfect during finals footy) and does a pretty good meal as well.There is a little noise in the morning from the Light Rail project works but overall value for money and location were perfect."),
("2016-09-13", "14096512", "Tim", "Great place in the middle of the CBD. Checking in was super easy and communication with the host was spot on. Great value when you consider what a room of similar size in a nearby hotel would cost."),
("2016-09-14", "14096512", "Elizabeth", "The location was great for our interests.  We literally walked everywhere we wanted to go and we got around.  There are so many great things to see near Mezzo's Studio.  Our check-in and check-out were easy and our requests were handled in a helpful and friendly manner.  I highly suggest this location and the price can't be beat!"),
("2016-09-16", "14096512", "Pei Jing", "房东的房子在悉尼cbd｡位置非常好｡我们转了几天才发现他四通八达｡大门非常有范儿｡房间内设施齐全｡是个好房子!"),
("2016-09-17", "14096512", "Jim", "Thank you for consistent communication and reliable contact. The presentation and location of this property is excellent."),
("2016-09-21", "14096512", "Jacqueline", "Given the location  it was good value for the cost. We had issues with the elevator  but that can't be fixed by the host. "),
("2016-09-23", "14096512", "Sarah", "A smooth pre-stay process with an easy check-in and out procedure. We were a bit late arriving due to flight delays but that was no problem. There were a couple of hiccups that were dealt with quickly and I believe will be sorted for future guests as a result. Fabulous location (a bit of street noise  but that's what you get being in the centre of the city!) and I felt safe in the apartment which was comfortable."),
("2016-09-24", "14096512", "Chrissy", "If your are spending time in circular quay or the rocks this place is well located for the price. It accommodates 4 people with the fold out bed and has everything you need. Our arrival was easy and communication was great. The place does need a really good clean  other than that this was a great pick."),
("2016-10-01", "14096512", "Kelly", "Location was good and price was reasonable  but I would not stay here again.The television only had three channels that worked and none of the lights in the kitchen were functional (so I didn't even try to cook or use anything in the kitchen  thus can't be sure if the appliances work). The bathroom flooded when you took a shower no matter how careful you were  which is probably why there was a lot of mold in the bathroom  particular between the sink and shower. In general  the unit was quite dirty."),
("2016-10-15", "14096512", "Ak", "The location is unbeatable. Bathroom needs an update but other than that we truly enjoyed our stay. Ate breakfast looking out to the city and enjoyed some sunshine at the rooftop pool. Quiet building mostly businesses so no waiting for elevator. And it was more than enough room when my parents joined us for a few days.Host was very prompt to respond to inquiries and worked with us on our early arrival. 2 big thumbs up!"),
("2016-10-20", "14096512", "Mashaba", "Jared was not there himself to handover the apartment but was very thorough in organizing somebody else to meet us there. Loved how clean and airy the apartment felt. And the location was fantastic. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2016-10-21", "14096512", "Rob", "Fantastic neighbourhood. Close to Martin Place in the middle of Sydney CBD. Walking distantie to darling harbour  the rocks  CBD etc. Easy contact with Jared to align arrival times and follow up questions  very helpful and on the ball. Small  slightly dated appartment.  But great bed and fold out bed  all amenities in place."),
("2016-10-21", "14096512", "Paige", "Host was great  I just had to text when our flight landed and we were able to check in at 12 which was really handy. Excellent location. We just needed somewhere to shower and sleep so it fit the bill."),
("2016-10-28", "14096512", "Vigilija", "Perfect place. Everything is near. Great communication."),
("2016-11-01", "14096512", "Sean", "Good location next to Circle Quay and Opera House."),
("2016-11-08", "14096512", "Constance", "The listing description was accurate  the location was great. However the apartment was lacking character  the kitchen was a little bit dirty - needs a good clean"),
("2016-11-09", "14096512", "Julie", "Perfect location - 5 mins from Circular Key and the Sydney Opera House area. Noisy  but to be expected for the location so not a problem for us as we wanted to be close in to everything. Communication was very good  and we were able to pick up the keys with no issues. Little smaller than expected  but absolutely fine for us - a couple. Only real problem was a very soft bed which did not help my back issues. We would stay here again."),
("2016-11-11", "14096512", "Pamela", "Great location!!! Short walk to ferries. Easy safe entry with very comfortable accommodations."),
("2016-11-16", "14096512", "Wendy", "Location  location  location.  This apartment is close walking distance to anything you want to do in the city.  The room is high enough in the building that we slept comfortably with the window open without city noise.  The room is spacious  and the bed is very comfortable.  The bath and kitchen are small and dated  but perfectly functional and it was no problem for us.  I think this is a great deal for a fabulous location.  Don't miss the views from the roof."),
("2016-11-21", "14096512", "Ashleigh", "Great location :)"),
("2016-11-24", "14096512", "Lei", "Wonderful location   hassle free check in and check out :("),
("2016-12-02", "14096512", "Klaus", "Great place to stay...clean  very central location and had everything we needed for our stay. Thanks!"),
("2016-12-09", "14096512", "Janine", "great location within minutes of circular quay  the rocks  and everything the city has to offer. the check-in and check-out processes were smooth and easy. two notes i would share are: 1) there is a recurring tapping/hammering sound that occurs throughout the day and night which i could not identify--perhaps a building-wide issue--that was a bit loud. i had to use earplugs to get to sleep as the noise was a bit disruptive. 2) i didn't end up using the pool because i was afraid i'd be locked out of re-entering the floor from the rooftop stairwell. it appeared to require a key to get back on the 11th floor  but the only key i had did not fit the lock. something to be sure to ask upon check-in so you can be sure to enjoy all the amenities the apartment has to offer."),
("2016-12-13", "14096512", "Aimee", "This is a perfect little apartment centrally located in Circular Quay.  quick walking distance to Opal station which gets you to the train and ferries around Sydney Harbor.  Amazing little breakfast/lunch shop downstairs for amazing coffee and food.  Wifi was great and apartment was clean.  The rooftop pool was small but nice.  great place to stay with my family of 4: two parents and two kids."),
("2016-12-22", "14096512", "Deborah", "Perfect location in the middle of the city. Wonderful place to stay and would love to come back!"),
("2016-12-26", "14096512", "Javier", "PROS: The location is great. Minutes away from the main ferry terminal  which is the best way to reach the different neighbouhoods in the bay  and also very close to the city center CONS: The appartment is no more than a large hotel room. It is aged  lacks any charm  and is not really good if you want to do some cooking. If your aim is to spend time outside and not inside it's perfectly good"),
("2016-12-29", "14096512", "Tracey", "Fantastic location for Circular Quay and the city. Tidy and comfy."),
("2017-01-03", "14096512", "Anne", "We've had an amazing time in the apartment. It has a perfect location!! Everything is on a walking distance. It was perfect!!!"),
("2017-01-08", "14096512", "Anna", "Studio is located in the very heart of Sydney  can't get any better for exploring the city. It is small  but very well equipped. Swimming pool on the roof is a nice bonus too."),
("2017-01-14", "14096512", "Karim", "It is in the central CBD area quite close to both wynard station"),
("2017-01-20", "14096512", "승기", "위치가 서큘러 키 역 근처라 아주 편했고방이 넓고 전망도 괜찮았습니다.소음도 없고 좋았네요잘 지내다가 갑니다"),
("2017-01-27", "14096512", "Qing", "The apartment is located in a nice place.We can walk to the circular quay in 10 mins.The Rocks Royal Botanic Gardens and Sydney Opera House are not far where we can walk to.The apartment is small but equiped well.There is everything we need.Cen is very helpful.But the mattress is too soft for my parents since hard mattress is good for old people's back."),
("2017-02-03", "14096512", "Winky", "The place is close to train station but it is a bit old."),
("2017-02-05", "14096512", "Hannah", "Great location  neat and tidy. Exactly what we were after!"),
("2017-02-09", "14096512", "Kim", "Location  location  location. We were initially underwhelmed by the apartment when we first arrived. It was small  needs some updates and a really good clean. However  the location and he price can't be beat and we would 100% stay here again! "),
("2017-02-11", "14096512", "Gemma", "Great location  neat studio apartment with all the necessary amenities. Highly recommend."),
("2017-02-15", "14096512", "Tiana", "Very central location! Walking distance to the botanic gardens  bridge and opera house. Very clean and neat. "),
("2017-03-02", "14096512", "Karen", "Excellent location with basic  comfortable accommodations.  We could easily walk all throughout the CBD  the Quay  the Gardens  the several bridges.  Very excellent stay in the heart of  Sydney.  Note:  There are several Bridge Streets.  This one is between George and Loftus Streets in the lower CBD.  "),
("2017-03-04", "14096512", "Andre", "The host canceled this reservation the day before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-03-06", "14096512", "Valentina", "The best thing about this flat is its location. Overall is not as I expected it  pictures were better than the place actually was and cleanliness was quite poor."),
("2017-03-08", "14096512", "Bill", "The unit is well located and while small  had everything we needed to be comfortable. It was clean and the bed was very comfy. No complaints at all. "),
("2017-03-30", "14096512", "Melissa", "Our family of 4 (2 6yo kids) stayed at the apartment for 9 nights. Whilst it's a simple studio  the apartment was everything that we could need. Well equiped with cooking  bathroom  washing and cleaning stuff which made the longer stay more comfortable. The communication with host was good- whilst we didn't see any host it did not hinder our stay. The only things to keep in mind at this location is inner city street noises- more on the weekends at night. And also apartment is right next to the elevator which does have an interesting sound but doesn't take long to get used to. Location in the cbd was ideal and super close to public transport options and sight seeing activities. Overall we had a wonderful stay and would recommend to others "),
("2017-03-30", "14096512", "Lea", "Great location for the Opera. Very clean. Enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-03-31", "14096512", "MarieClare", "This accommodation is just great for a night in the city or if you just need somewhere to sleep after sightseeing and dining out. Close to transport  dining and shopping areas"),
("2017-04-05", "14096512", "Glenda", "We LOVED this place!  It was sparkling clean  central to the ferries  the Rocks  the botanical Gardens and the Opera House.  We appreciated the size  with two big windows on the top floor and all we needed for a very comfortable stay.  The water was good and hot  the wifi was good  the bed comfortable.  We would definitely go back and will recommend Jared's place to friends."),
("2017-04-10", "14096512", "Diah", "The apartment is within walking distance to Circular Quay  place was clean and tidy and the host communicate everything clearly. We enjoyed our stay and have no issue. Recommendable. "),
("2017-04-13", "14096512", "Susan", "This small apartment is centrally located to everything we wanted to do.  With 3 of us  the apartment was filled but we weren't in Sydney to hang around the apartment!  With Woolies just down the street  we were able to get heat 'em and eat 'em food that worked great in the kitchen.  The downside was the 24 hour construction on the rail system on the street below.  Incredibly noisy  so if you are coming in the next few months bring earplugs.  The rail system will be great once completed though!"),
("2017-04-16", "14096512", "Michele", "Jared's apartment is in a perfect location so close to the centre of  Sydney and also to the train stations. It is ideal for a couple. Small but we found it ideal for us and definitely value for the cost. The bed is very comfortable. It is a bit noisy at the moment with road construction going on but I still slept very well and I'm a light sleeper! Just used ear plugs. The bathroom is a bit dated but the shower works well.  Check in and out was easy and apartment very easy to find and secure. Would definitely stay again if returning to Sydney. Jared is a great host!"),
("2017-04-19", "14096512", "Bill", "An amazingly great location -- couldn't be better!  But if you are hoping for something above ""very basic""  this isn't it.  The bed is VERY SOFT - very very soft and the place is desperate for some basic upgrades - wouldn't take muchto make it significantly better.  "),
("2017-04-22", "14096512", "Kayci", "Good apartment for the price.  Not paying Hotel prices so don't expect hotel quality.  The bathroom could do with a decent clean."),
("2017-04-25", "14096512", "Arturo", "Jared's place was pretty spot on  I'll go on the things I like such as the location it was a 10 min walk to circular quay the main sightseeing suburb. The room had probably one of the most comfortable beds I've been on haha. I the only big thing that I advice or maybe they could improve was parking (I know it wasn't mention)  I got a rental and it was difficult finding parking overnight in the city that wasn't over priced. I assume since it was a studio the apartments probably had their own parking but that wasn't the case. Overall I Recommend the place. "),
("2017-05-01", "14096512", "Tina", "Great location! 5 min walk to Circular Quay and the Sydney Opera House. We were able to walk and take public transportation to all the sights. The studio was spacious for our family of 3. The bathroom is a bit small but it worked. The bed was comfy and there were plenty of pillows and towels."),
("2017-05-12", "14096512", "Lauren", "This is the best location you can ask for. You're in the center of everything. Apartment is nicer than what you would get in a hotel room. They're doing construction a street over for a light rail  so ear plugs are necessary. But if you're looking for something that's affordable and in an unbeatable location  then you won't be disappointed. "),
("2017-05-14", "14096512", "Sean", "Excellent location with a short stroll to the circular quay and the opera house. Also thanks to the great host - I left something in the fridge after checking out and Ellie"),
("2017-05-17", "14096512", "Amanda", "The main bed was super comfortable and the place was clean and just what we needed.  Close to all the transit and sites.  The shower wall doesn't come out far and there is no curtain to prevent splashing  so you'll need to wipe down the toilet and floor after showering. Bring your own hand towel and wash cloth if you use one.  Also  it's on a heavily used road and the noise is constant.  Light sleepers won't rest well. "),
("2017-05-19", "14096512", "Richard", "Conveniently located in the city"),
("2017-05-23", "14096512", "John Paul", "Very nice location! Walking distance to all tourist spots. Will definitely book again with Jared."),
("2017-05-26", "14096512", "Nakama", "Great place! Really enjoyed the stay! Can be a bit noisy on the street at times"),
("2017-05-27", "14096512", "Brienne", "Very cute studio apartment within walking distance of everything you need. We caught the train from the airport to Circular Quay and it was only a 5 minute walk to the apartment. The only drawback was luggage storage - we were unable to leave our bags before check-in time. This is understandable  given that it is an airbnb and not a hotel  however it was an inconvenience and added cost for us to use public luggage storage. The check-in process was easy and the apartment itself was perfect for a weekend away. Very small and basic but the bed was comfortable and the location couldn't be beaten. "),
("2017-06-05", "14096512", "Debi", "Jared's apartment is very well located. You can see the Opera House & Harbor Bridge everyday coz it's just a 10min walk to Circular Quay. Very accessible to tourist spots within the city  walkable or within 1-2stops from Circular Quay or Wynyard Stations. The space is enough for us 5 (2adults  1 teen  1 child & 1 infant). The place is clean  with every basic thing provided. We did not cook though  so we were not able to use the oven. It was a bit cold though during some nights since it's winter & we were not able to find a heater. Tried to adjust the thermostat to 20 degrees but it turns off. It's more of an airconditioner. But it was fine & we didn't bother to ask Jared anymore since we are outside most of the time. I highly recommend this place in Sydney. If we'll be back  I hope to book this place again."),
("2017-06-10", "14096512", "丽娟", "位置很好!"),
("2017-06-13", "14096512", "Jolene", "Location! 5-10 mins walking distance to everything you would want to see in the CBD! Very accessible to attractions  public transportation and shopping. The studio is a little tight but completely doable for four adults."),
("2017-06-18", "14096512", "Lars", "Amazing location in a nice and comfortable unit  equipped with everything you need for a great time in Sydney.Would recommend the unit for anyone looking for a great time in Sydney at a very central location. "),
("2017-06-21", "14096512", "Alvin", "Strategic location and fast response host"),
("2017-06-23", "14096512", "Phoebe", "The studio apartment was really cold at night  as the room wasn't heated and only had a tiny portable heater. This was made worse by the fact that the second doona was really thin  so didn't keep us warm at night. The room was also quite noisy from the streets.Otherwise a very central apartment  very close to circular quay and most other parts of the Sydney CBD. "),
("2017-06-24", "14096512", "Elle", "Stayed here for 2 nights with my mum and sister - was comfortable for the 3 of us. Very convenient being so close to everything! We could walk to circular quay  opera house  darling harbour & CBD shopping. Great price considering the location. "),
("2017-06-29", "14096512", "Jie", "Very good location. Close to every thing you need for a great vacation."),
("2017-07-15", "14096512", "Lawrence", "Jared's place was perfect for our requirements. It is very near Circular Quay and within a few minutes of the pick-up places for the tours we booked. The description and the instructions he gave were very accurate. Jared  while we did not personally meet him  was very accommodating and prompt with all our queries via email. "),
("2017-07-21", "14096512", "Jinfeng", "价格优惠 设施齐全但是相对简单"),
("2017-07-26", "14096512", "City", "Jared is fast respond guy. Jared's place is perfect location and really convenient to central. The apartment is so lovely and clean. Thanks you so much for the lovely home and is highly recommend."),
("2017-08-07", "14096512", "Jyung", "The location is very good. It is very close to circular quay and opera house. But it is little far from cbd... and its heater is broken. So it is little bit cold while i am staying here.......But they bring oil heater to me. Hahaha......."),
("2017-08-09", "14096512", "Simon", "Great location. Good value."),
("2017-08-10", "14096512", "Gemma", "As expected  right price for the room. Easy check-in. Good location  very close to circular quay"),
("2017-08-26", "14096512", "Kathy", "性价比很高 自由 不用跟别人共用房间和设备 安全 比住酒店划算｡"),
("2017-09-01", "14096512", "Alena", "It was nice to stay here. A bit dirty inside though. Very close to everything you need. Close to Sydney Opera House and Harbour Bridge. Lovely staff."),
("2017-09-03", "14096512", "Emily", "Stayed for one night and was an awesome stay  super close to everything  very tidy  and the host was amazingly helpful and check in was made very easy. They even made the sofa bed for us upon our arrival!"),
("2017-09-09", "14096512", "Sigrid", "Muy buena ubicación"),
("2017-09-12", "14096512", "Audrey", "Very close to Circular Quay station & The rock."),
("2017-09-16", "14096512", "Sunil Kumar", "This place is good coz everything around you."),
("2017-09-24", "14096512", "Jessie", "在悉尼住的这三天非常愉快和舒适｡很有家的感觉 房屋整洁｡步行到附近景点都在10分钟以内 任何时候可以出门 方便 快捷!下次来悉尼还会选择!非常感谢!"),
("2017-09-29", "14096512", "Raj", "We had a fantastic time staying at this amazing place. Our hosts were cordial  communicative  amicable and made our stay really pleasant. We would highly recommend this cozy house for anybody who wishes to explore Mt Gambier and surrounds."),
("2017-09-30", "14096512", "Megan", "Awesome location"),
("2017-10-01", "14096512", "Eunju", "Jared's accomodation was great. The location was quite near to the wharf and it was clean. Especially  Ana and Francisco were so kind. Thanks for everything."),
("2017-10-07", "14096512", "예지", "Very good location and clean room condition."),
("2017-10-11", "14096512", "Kim", "Great place  clean and tidy roomComfortable location !!!kind and friendly"),
("2017-10-15", "14096512", "Nuri", "The location is good  walking distance to opera house and royal botanical garden and ferry terminal and also train station. Air con with an old system so it didn't cold like usual in a daytime  and it makes outside colder than inside.. But ana gave a quick response to check."),
("2017-10-22", "14096512", "Cheryl", "The place is well located  close to food and amenities  and within a short walking distance to the quay.  Jared responded very quickly and key collection was easy and efficient. Only issue we had was noise.  The pub opposite was blasting loud music  especially on Saturday night  till 12:30am.  Street noise starts in the mornings.  The facilities in the apartment are complete and comfortable."),
("2017-10-25", "14096512", "Pamela", "Great location! Walking distance easily to cruise terminal."),
("2017-10-26", "14096512", "Heidi", "Apartment is conveniently located within a short walk from Circular Quay. Baggage storage company just down 2 blocks away. Open from 8am - 5pm at a cost of $13. This was handy as we arrived early in the morning and wanted to go to the zoo for the day before checking in the late afternoon. Communication with our host was prompt and they were flexible with check in time. The apartment was exactly what I expected.  Very spacious for central Sydney. Opening window to let in fresh breeze. The most comfortable bed I have ever slept in . Better than most hotels."),
("2017-10-28", "14096512", "Nuryusniza", "Walking distance to circular quay train station. Surrounded with Sydney main attractions.  Clean house with all basic facilities. Highly recommended. What you see in Airbnb website is what you actual get.. I give 5 star rating. Really satisfied. Thank you Jared and Ana for being a good host. Hope to see you again in future."),
("2017-10-31", "14096512", "Samudra", "This the second time we stay @jared place. Jared management team is professional. I always tell my friend. Aus airbnb--> Jared. Thumb up for you guys . Thanks for Ana and Fransisco for everything."),
("2017-11-09", "14096512", "Olga", "Great location! A short walk from the Opera House. Clean  easy check-in and great communiation. Too easy"),
("2017-11-11", "14096512", "Larissa", "Great place  centrally located and very easy to stay in. Would stay here again  highly recommended "),
("2017-11-18", "14096512", "Standwin", "This studio is at a good location  ."),
("2017-11-24", "14096512", "Jay", "Great place in the CBD  terrific location. Ana was also very patient with us as we were stuck in traffic."),
("2017-11-27", "14096512", "Lil", "Awesome location and walking distance to most attractions. 5 mins walk to Sydney harbour.  Place has everything you need for a short stay and quite comfortable. Would stay there again if visiting Sydney."),
("2017-11-29", "14096512", "Karlz", "Great location  great for overnight  easy to find  great communication via txt."),
("2017-12-01", "14096512", "Nora", "Worth every penny"),
("2017-12-06", "14096512", "Celine", "Great place  !!! great access to everything in the CBD (Opera/Chinatown/Museum)."),
("2017-12-08", "14096512", "Matt", "Great location. Very clean and a fun place to stay."),
("2017-12-17", "14096512", "Ruth", "Fantastic location. Within walking distance to many places of interest. Getting grocery was such an easy feat!Can save a lot on transport. We checked in late and Ana was very kind enough to accommodate my boy & me since I was my first time using Airbnb. Ana was very sweet and helpful in!!! That really makes us feel so welcome! I have read about other feedbacks about noises. As for me  I felt the noise level was not as loud as what others claimed. Since we were living right at the heart of the CBD  we do not expect total silence like living in a cave. We actually enjoyed the random sound of siren from ambulance  party-goers chiming to Christmas songs. It really represents a true heart of a city!A big thumb up for the cleanliness of the places. Not a insect to be found! The air-con system was great! Discover that there is no shower curtain. Not sure if it is to deter people from taking long shower. Maybe having a simple one will be helpful to prevent unnecessary splashes. Just need to put a gentle note to remind to conserve water!Thank you so much Jared for your prompt response and Ana for your great hospitality!"),
("2017-12-21", "14096512", "Zoey", "Very nice place  cozy and well-equipped. The apartment is close to shopping mall  Royal Botanic Garden  Sydney Opera House  Harbour Bridge  etc. We had a great time there  and we'll recommend it to friends."),
("2017-12-26", "14096512", "Chulho", "It was our first experience with airbnb.Our place was still spacious for a family of four.Great location and good security.Everything we ever needed was there for us.Out host was nice and kind too.The place is a bit old  otherwise I will give four star out of five."),
("2017-12-26", "14096512", "Robert & Karen", "Great place to stay. It’s super central and very clean. Awesome  Thanks."),
("2017-12-31", "14096512", "Romina", "El lugar se adecua a nuestras necesidades. La ubicación es excelente y no tuvimos ningún problema"),
("2018-01-06", "14096512", "Stephanie", "Clean and in a prime location! Walking distance to everything! Perfect for two people looking to explore Sydney. Highly recommended!!"),
("2018-01-09", "14096512", "Manisha", "Loved the location (5 mins walk and your in Circular Quay) and the apartments high ceilings (its top floor). Was also surprised to find a small but lovely pool area on the roof."),
("2018-01-10", "14096512", "Michael", "The location is great! It was walkable to everything!"),
("2018-01-13", "14096512", "Jan", "This apartment is bright  airy and in a great location for visiting Circular Quay and the Rocks. Jared is a great host and replied promptly to any messages. We were greeted at the door and shown where the apartment was."),
("2018-01-14", "14096512", "Machya", "The place was fine. The person that checked us in was great! Note ahead of time that the owner gives a warning that the ventilation isn’t great and be careful cooking food—-he said you would have to pay for it if the fire alarm went off while cooking. Other than that it’s in a great location for touristy sights in Sydney"),
("2018-01-15", "14096512", "David", "Host didn’t respond and could check in  finally got told at 8:30 pm to find somewhere else to stay. Terrible host! "),
("2018-01-19", "14096512", "Valentina", "Very good location . Perfect for 2 people."),
("2018-01-23", "14096512", "Tony", "Great spot  great location but also great value"),
("2018-01-27", "14096512", "博华", "该房子地理位置太棒了 市区繁华地带都可步行到达"),
("2018-01-28", "14096512", "Jim", "Great if you need an overnight stay for an event around the rocks or Opera House"),
("2018-01-31", "14096512", "Zhimeng", "位置非常好 楼下就有便利店和早餐店 步行3分钟到租车店铺 步行5分钟到环形码头 可以看到悉尼歌剧院和海港大桥｡"),
("2018-02-02", "14096512", "济思", "房东非常热情 仔细｡"),
("2018-02-06", "14096512", "Lisa", "Great location was close to everything !!!!! Could have used a good dusting and a coat of paint needed some more hangers as well .. but overall a good place ..."),
("2018-02-09", "14096512", "丰", "很好的地段｡去环形码头､歌剧院､皇家植物园､博物馆均只需要步行｡饭店､酒吧､超市也很近｡房间里的电器一应俱全 餐具也准备的很齐全｡居然还有筷子｡总之 体验不错｡推荐"),
("2018-02-14", "14096512", "Carol", "This is a great location! Close to the cruise docks  ferry and the train. We walked to the opera house and had fun exploring the area. Took the train to other places as our main transportation  including to the airport at the end of our stay. The appartment has lots of room and fully stocked kithcen. The bed was very comfortable and there were plenty of towels. A washer and dryer was a bonus. Great place and location for the price!"),
("2018-02-17", "14096512", "Stephen", "Great location. Good value for money"),
("2018-02-19", "14096512", "Keiichi", "予想以上に奇麗でした｡ｼﾝｸがﾋﾟｶﾋﾟｶ｡ｻｰｷｭﾗｷｰに徒歩5分最高のﾛｹｰｼｮﾝです｡"),
("2018-02-25", "14096512", "Eva", "Great location. Short walking distance to the ferry terminal (circular quay)  Sydney Harbour Bridge & Opera House. Apartment is little on the smaller side but perfect for a weekend stay. Prompt response from host also. Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-03-02", "14096512", "Helon", "地理位置优越 离各景点距离很近 步行均可到达十分方便"),
("2018-03-05", "14096512", "Li", "It is very convenient to travel  and you can get to Sydney harbour and the commercial street shopping. The rooms are very comfortable."),
("2018-03-06", "14096512", "Ann", "Close to every thing. Clean with everything you would want. 10 /10 highly recommended"),
("2018-03-10", "14096512", "Alejandro", "Cute apartment in an awesome location."),
("2018-03-12", "14096512", "Timo & Jessica", "We would not recommend staying here at all. For just $10 more you could stay at the Marriott across the road and enjoy a clean room. The apartment was not properly cleaned: gaps between cabinets and white appliances showed piles of dust and dirt; tiles missing on shower exposed mold; stains were all over the walls and there was an intense chemical smell throughout the apartment. The location was perfect  but it seemed obvious the host was cutting corners to produce a profit. We love staying with Airbnb all around the world  but the lack of care and attention to detail in this unit is unacceptable."),
("2018-03-22", "14096512", "Michelle", "Great communication and great location. Everything we needed for a short stay and the bed was very comfortable which helped since this was one stop of many for us on a bucket list trip to 'the other side'. A great way to get the city feel without the big hotel costs and really get a feel for the city. We had a great time."),
("2018-03-23", "14096512", "Allaina", "Jared’s place is in a wonderful location  5 mins walk to most places! A lovely space for an over night trip to Sydney. The only drawback is if sleep if what you want... bring ear plugs- the noise from the roadworks went the entire night. Otherwise  lovely space- reccomend!"),
("2018-03-27", "14096512", "Tara", "Myself  my partner and our two boys (11 and 6 months) stayed for 4 nights at Jared’s apartment.PROS..Location is fantastic  close to Circular Quay which was great for us.Size of the place was very comfortable.Air conditioning works really well.Kitchenette is well equipped for a short stay (small fridge  sink  microwave  kettle  toaster)Beds were comfy and sofa bed had been made up ready for our stay.WiFi was a great plus  and although we didn’t use it much it was nice to have it.Check in was easy and the communication was excellent.CONS..Condition of the place left a lot to be desired. There was left over dirt on the carpet (bits and pieces  food  pieces of crayon) when we arrived. The bathroom needs to be stripped out and replaced  there are tiles missing  the bath tub is in terrible condition  there’s visible mold  the shower screen does nothing and you end up with a completely wet and slippery bathroom floor every time it’s used. There’s a bunch of exposed wires that have been carelessly taped to a skirting board in the kitchen area  fun when there’s a crawling baby exploring the place!Air con  while it worked great  the dial is broken so its hard to know when it’s on or off.I’d recommend a set of ear plugs for anyone staying here as there’s road works outside at the moment so there’s a bit of noise  as well as the apartment sharing a wall with the elevator shaft and a fair bit of noise coming from the roof (top floor apartment). Overall we had a great trip but for the money we spent we could have stayed in a nicer Airbnb (as we have in Sydney before)."),
("2018-03-29", "14096512", "Kameron", "Great Location for those wanting to spend a night enjoying the Sydney Night Scene. Perfect for small groups looking for a place to stay downtown that’s not only centralized but also easy on the Wallet."),
("2018-03-30", "14096512", "Chandler", "Great central location  a bit noisy at night but Jared is a good host and accommodated us :)Thanks again!!"),
("2018-04-07", "14096512", "Helen", "Fantastic location  great communication  bed was extremely comfy. Apartment was just what we needed we New it was a studio but as a family we all found it was still enough space"),
("2018-04-08", "14096512", "Josie", "Perfect location. Great value for money.   Bed is soft and cushions are comfy.   Big leather couch opens to sleep two more.  Kitchenette is functional with toaster and kettle and basic tea/coffee on hand.  You are literally minutes away from circular quay  opera house and shopping.   Only downside is that you are opposite a pub and it can get noisy late into the night as patrons leave plus the lift mechanisms seem to clunk so may not suit if you’re someone that  needs a dead quiet space to sleep."),
("2018-04-10", "14096512", "Katy", "Great location and great amenities! Communication was very prompt and thorough."),
("2018-04-11", "14096512", "Meg", "Hi Jared thanks for having us Your light filled comfy studio apartment was perfect and a great location in Sydney and even better for the circular quay and the rocks area.Jared’s studio apartment is a lot bigger than most expensive hotel rooms in the area too.It is clean with all the major and minor amenities you need for a stay in the city It is located in a beautiful building with quiet and friendly neighbors.Check in was super easy and Jared was very quick at replying to any messages and requests. Jared warned us that there is some city construction close by but we barely heard it and it made no difference to getting around the area via car or walking.We hope to be back at Jared’s place soon thanks for having us."),
("2018-04-11", "14096512", "Chelsea", "The location is superb !! The heart of Sydney!! Just 5 mins walk to Circular Quay Opera house. Many good restaurants around. it’s like a NY style apartment  lovely  sweet and quiet. Perfect for couple. Loved it! Will definitely visit again."),
("2018-04-15", "14096512", "Joy", "Great location !!!!!"),
("2018-04-29", "14096512", "Pawel", "Excellent location  quick communication and confirmation. You can't go wrong"),
("2018-05-01", "14096512", "Robin", "Great space in an excellent location."),
("2018-05-05", "14096512", "Adrian", "Great location  neat and tidy apartment. Will stay again!"),
("2018-05-11", "14096512", "Robert", "Great location and convenient access to public transport."),
("2018-05-13", "14096512", "Huixuan", "房子位置不错 离各大景点都挺近 去哪里步行坐车都可以 出行是很方便的｡只是房子本身有点旧 有看到蜘蛛网和小蜘蛛 厨房有很多工具都没有 切菜刀都没有一把只有一把小刀 做饭不是很方便 也没有洗碗机可用 有红酒杯却没有开瓶器 冰箱坏了 在入住期间漏了一地水 窗帘也坏了｡入住建议问清楚房东是否已解决以上问题｡"),
("2018-05-15", "14096512", "Joanne", "This apartment is in a fantastic location. It’s a short walk to Circular Quay  the Rocks  Opera House and Botanical Gardens. We appreciated the security  of a locked entrance  key swipe for elevator and door lock. It was easy to check in by connecting with Ana. Enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-05-17", "14096512", "Julian", "Good location  nice stay."),
("2018-05-20", "14096512", "Muzhgan", "Location is perfect  super close to public transportation  restaurants and bars. It is right in the city so at times it can be a little noisy. But that’s to be expected in any city!Studio was clean and had everything we needed for our stay. Host let us check in a little earlier as well  thank you! I’d definitely book again!"),
("2018-05-25", "14096512", "Catalina", "Ubicado estratégicamente  cerca al Opera house  nos desplazamos a pie facilmente por todos los lugares turísticos  la chica que nos recibió fue de gran ayuda  recomiendo este sitio 100% y volverla seguramente."),
("2018-05-30", "14096512", "Aramburu", "perfect location."),
("2018-06-01", "14096512", "Howard", "Terrific location - very central to Circular Quay (also very easy walk to Barangaroo Wharf and Wynyard Station)  Opera House  art galleries  shopping etc. Convenient stay - property was as I'd expected."),
("2018-06-03", "14096512", "Sascha", "A great  central apartment  perfect base for a weekend away."),
("2018-06-03", "14096512", "Therese", "Great location. Great communication. We were late on our agreed check in time but ana patiently waited for us. Thank you so much. We enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-06-08", "14096512", "Carolyn", "This cosy unit is suitable for 2 people  3 at a pinch. It is clean  comfortable and close to Circular Quay.We didn't cook in the kitchen  only prepared cereal for b'fast  and made tea and coffee.Being winter  we made use of the convection heater when we returned from an evening outing.The bed was very comfortable   and the bathroom quite modern and sufficient. "),
("2018-06-13", "14096512", "Aurora", "Really great location nearby main attractions."),
("2018-06-15", "14096512", "Milla", "The location is the best   place is very clean and the possibility for an early check up was so unexpectedly pleasing ! thank you and I would definitely recommend this place to other people ."),
("2018-06-21", "14096512", "Kent", "Jared’s place was great  and I can’t imagine a better location in Sydney. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-07-02", "14096512", "Lily", "离歌剧院很近"),
("2018-07-05", "14096512", "Chris", "It’s a lovely house with very clean environment and convenient facilities.  Also the owner is very nice."),
("2018-07-07", "14096512", "Ashwani", "This is an amazing location  we could not have expected anything better.  The location is walking distance from all prominent  landmarks of Sydney and all good restaurants. The place was clean and the host was very responsive and very accommodating  we would highly recommend this place.  "),
("2018-07-08", "14096512", "Emily", "Great location."),
("2018-07-13", "14096512", "Shuhui", "地理位置极佳 交通便利｡"),
("2018-07-15", "14096512", "Cindy", "Location is ok  hygiene is very poor  quilt is very thin  very cold  air conditioning only refrigeration  there is an electric heating  no use."),
("2018-07-16", "14096512", "Antje", "Nice appartment  perfectly suitable for 2  but for a short stay also possible for 4. Perfect location near Circular Bay. All necessary amenities available. In total  a clear recommendation."),
("2018-07-21", "14096512", "Marchand", "Emplacement parfait"),
("2018-07-30", "14096512", "Shuk Ying", "Great location  the host is very helpful and responded quick."),
("2018-08-04", "14096512", "Hyekyoung", "오페라하우스 근처라 야경보러 가기 좋고5-10분 거리에 큰 마트 2개나 있어 좋았어요근데 먼지라던지 곰팡이가 있어서 아쉬웠고 4일동안 인당 수곤 하나라 매일 빨아써야하는 것이 불편했어요 그래도 응답도 빠른 편이었고 괜찮았어요"),
("2018-08-10", "14096512", "Parisa", "This location can't be beat  especially for the price! About two blocks from the ferries and walking distance to several sites  bars and restaurants. Communication was good also. Would definitely stay here again! "),
("2018-08-11", "14096512", "Leigh", "Really appreciated the early check-in. Excellent location  except for noise at night from club across the street. (Which the made the understandable clause about ""fines if you make noise"" a bit hypocritical)Bathroom could do with some basic renovations  tiles fixed/replaced etc.Loved the arch windows high ceilings  lots of light. "),
("2018-08-18", "14096512", "Jarrad", "Fantastic location  though a bit noisy but understandable as it's right in the middle of the city. Would definitely recommend! "),
("2018-08-23", "14096512", "Ning", "Best location! In Sydney CBD  close to everywhere. Very convenient and safe!"),
("2018-09-02", "14096512", "Lydia", "Really good location  walking distance to circular quay & wynyard station so really handy for travelling around for site seeing. Apartment was as expected. WiFi didn’t work properly meaning had to use my 4G majority of the trip but have mentioned this to Jared so hopefully will be sorted. Communication was good  Ana responded quickly and gave clear instructions with photos so that was helpful. Thought it was a bit harsh/ strict for check out times as we asked for a possible late one (only an hour or two- check out is 10am) & it was a flat out strict no  but never mind! Was an overall good stay & would stay again  recommended to everyone"),
("2018-09-06", "14096512", "Jill", "mouldy bathroom spoiled our stay  we would not stay again and think it very overpriced for those conditions. wifi not on for first 2 days"),
("2018-09-13", "14096512", "Samantha", "A wonderful little apartment. We had a great time in Sydney and this apartment was cosy and had a great feel about it. A great place to relax after each long day exploring Sydney."),
("2018-09-14", "14096512", "Robert", "Great location when in Sydney. This place is a regular stop for me."),
("2018-09-18", "14096512", "Chelsea", "Great location in Sydney. About a five minute walk from the harbour. It’s a small studio great for one or two people. There is a washer/dryer that I found super helpful since I ran the half marathon while I was visiting. It’s a good spot to stay a couple days in the city."),
("2018-09-22", "14096512", "Anita", "The location is superb. The service was great unfortunately the condition of the unit itself was disappointing and I felt sorry for the cleaners because they are obviously under pressure because of the high turnover."),
("2018-10-05", "14096512", "Kezza", "This could was ok could be better looked after and maintain better"),
("2018-10-18", "14096512", "Pj", "Really great location...perfect for a couple or small family for a short stay. lil noisy (from outside traffic) but nothing over the top. enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-10-25", "14096512", "Robert", "Great location and easy check-in."),
("2018-11-01", "14096512", "Sandra", "Awesome location. 5 min walk to circular quay. Place is prob only good for immediate family as not much privacy but was perfect for us. The only thing I would have liked was a top sheet on the bed as a quilt is too warm but no sheet is too cold. Bathroom was a little grubby but I guess with a quick tern around of guests it may be hard to maintain. All over VERY good value for money and we will stay again one day"),
("2018-11-02", "14096512", "Emily", "A nice little place  and a great location! We didn't have any troubles here and thoroughly enjoyed our stay :)"),
("2018-11-03", "14096512", "Adam", "great location"),
("2018-11-06", "14096512", "Linda", "Excellent location!   Absolutely everything you need!   Great bed."),
("2018-11-15", "14096512", "Carolyn", "Nice place for a short trip. Great location and speedy response.  recommend for two people."),
("2018-11-17", "14096512", "Wesley", "Great location! Very central and perfect for us who were spending all our time out and about. Very helpful and quick responses from host."),
("2018-11-19", "14096512", "翔宇", "环境很棒  有历史感  日常用品齐全  离悉尼歌剧院很近  步行5分钟差不多就到了  正对面的小巷子进去 有家中餐 Mr wong  味道很好 有许多当地人在那里吃饭   体验非常好!大赞"),
("2018-11-23", "14096512", "康", "Location is awesome"),
("2018-11-27", "14096512", "Heather", "Jared’s place was in the perfect location. About a 10-15 minute walk to the major sights and attractions. The apartment was a little more run down than I was expecting but overall we had a great experience."),
("2018-11-30", "14096512", "Damian", "Great location  apartment & value. Just confirm that the elevator is operating when you book."),
("2018-12-02", "14096512", "David", "Well located apartment clean and good"),
("2018-12-05", "14096512", "Meg", "Jared’s AirBnb was amazing. Super safe and great location- walking distance to everything! Check-in process was very easy and communication was quick. Highly recommend."),
("2018-12-08", "14096512", "Leti", "This is a small/studio apartment in the heart of the CBD and within walking distrance to many attractions including 2 train stations  Circular Quay  lots of pubs/restaurants and coffee shops. Apartment is very clean and had everything we needed. Check in was easy and Jared is very responsive. I would stay here again and recommend to anyone looking for basic accommodation in a great location."),
("2018-12-09", "14096512", "Oliver", "NICE LOCATION  NICE HOST."),
("2018-12-11", "14096512", "Akiko", "Great location and communication was great! I appreciate that they let us check-in early  and it was nice of them to offer to make the sofabed ready prior to our arrival. I was never offered that at other places before. Maybe a bit pricey considering space  but probably it's partially due to the sofabed being open. Many restaurants and stores nearby. We didn't cook  but wish there was a coffee maker. Overall  a great stay!"),
("2018-12-14", "14096512", "Gemma", "Great location and a very comfortable space."),
("2018-12-19", "14096512", "Phan", "Very cozy place in the centre. Very convenient to everywhere. Highly recommended."),
("2018-12-22", "14096512", "Jinseung", "위치가 정말 좋아요. 기차역과 시드니 오페라 하우스도 매우 가깝습니다."),
("2018-12-25", "14096512", "Kylie", "Everything was great  in a great location. Only downside was there were very limited working tv channels."),
("2018-12-31", "14096512", "Wayne", "Awesome location . Great communication"),
("2018-12-31", "14096512", "Liam", "Great spot! thoughtful directions."),
("2019-01-02", "14096512", "Aligo", "The sheet is kind of old and holes on it  so If you’re a highly required person  it’s not a place for you. But the place is near central and got everything you need in the area  near bus stops and train stations."),
("2019-01-14", "14096512", "Amanda", "The apartment was very centrally located  an easy walk to many tourist destinations. The wifi was a bit spotty. It was convenient to have a washer and dryer in unit. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2019-01-17", "14096512", "Anne", "Great location."),
("2019-01-22", "14096512", "Jam", "Great location!"),
("2019-01-31", "14096512", "Marie-Pierre", "We have great  time in Sydney  this accomodation is very well located.I'll recommand it to my friends.Thank you."),
("2019-02-07", "14096512", "Honey", "Ana was very attentive and helpful.   Perfect location for us."),
("2019-02-09", "14096512", "Audrey", "Please show up clear information for everything in advance. For example   if guest arrive late   how much they have to pay or not.  Otherwise   guest will think it will be a part of sevice for the room."),
("2019-02-12", "14096512", "Amanda", "Jared's place was perfect for our 3 day/2 night stay in Sydney before we took off for another city on our honeymoon. The apartment was as described  and perfectly located near Circular Quay. Air conditioning was great to have during the 97 degree day and evening. Ana was very communicative and responsive to any questions we had. Would stay again. Thanks guys!"),
("2019-02-15", "14096512", "Amy", "you couldn't find a much better location for seeing what Sydney has to offer! bed was comfortable and a lot of toiletries and cleaning products left so you don't need to worry about buying things."),
("2019-02-28", "14096512", "Gulshan", "It is a great place to stay in a city and enjoy Sydney."),
("2019-03-02", "14096512", "Rose", "A very clean place with awesome air conditioning and wonderful location."),
("2016-08-13", "14223095", "Mark", "Keythia was a wonderful Host. She made myself and partner feel very at home. The apartment was very clean and tidy with all necessary amenities. The bed was extremely comfortable and the sheets were 5 star. Keythia left out a beautiful selection of breakfast treats. I would highly recommend this apartment. Many thanks Mark & Rebecca"),
("2016-08-21", "14223095", "Mark", "Again we had such a lovely experience staying with Krythia. She is such a wonderful host. Krythia make you feel like your right at home. Highly recommend this apartment. Many thanks Mark and Rebecca"),
("2016-11-13", "14223095", "Yousef", "My wife and I had a really fantastic stay with Krythia. The apartment is super homely  cosy and private. The bedroom we stayed in was really nice and had a private courtyard attached to it. We also had access to our own private bathroom. Everything was really comfortable and clean  and we were able to do our own cooking too. Krythia herself is a lovely hostess. We had several interesting conversations with her and she made us feel welcome right from the start. The apartment is just a few minutes walk from the bus stop  with it being very easy snd convenient to get into the city from there. Highly recommend this apartment  especially if you're a cat lover - Krythia's cat Cindy is super friendly!"),
("2016-11-16", "14223095", "Melanie", "We stayed at krythias apartment for four nights. The apartment and the room is as you can see it on the pictures. Modern and nice looking. Everything was clean and the bed was very comfy. Krythia is a really nice lady and we had some great short conversations with her. We felt very welcomed. The only thing we like to mention for the apartment that is located in a really nice area of Sydney  is that you can only reach it by bus (5 stops) - so there is no tram nearby. The last bus we were able to find to the direction of the apartment left the city at 8:30 pm. That was sometimes a little bit early for us and we had to take an uber (which costs around 20AUD). Everything else was really awesome and we can recommend to stay there for sure. Thank you Krythia for the amazing stay in Sydney."),
("2016-11-20", "14223095", "Diana", "We received a lovely welcome  everything was as described and perfect for our requirements. Thanks so much Krythia  for sharing your home with us."),
("2016-11-24", "14223095", "Jay", "Very good house  very clean room and private bathroom  very lovely cat and one very kindliness host. Spend a nice week with Krythia "),
("2016-11-25", "14223095", "Shauna", "Super comfortable bed and Krythia is very friendly and welcoming."),
("2016-11-26", "14223095", "Daniel", "Krythia room was just what we looked for. Quiet location. Great price. Easy walking to places. Kriathia was a gracious host.  All was as we hoped."),
("2016-12-01", "14223095", "Vikki", "Very comfortable bed  lovely bathroom. Krythia very welcoming."),
("2016-12-03", "14223095", "Meriel", "Very clean and comfortable  "),
("2016-12-05", "14223095", "Raelene", "Very pleasant location  spacious apartment  extremely clean bathroom and kitchen. Excellent WiFi reception. Very friendly and helpful host"),
("2016-12-10", "14223095", "Allen", "Highly recommended. No problems at all ."),
("2016-12-15", "14223095", "Jason", "Great apartment located at a nice area. Good public transportation to the city. Car park available and very easy to get around. Lots of cafes and restaurants around the area. The room is nice and clean with a nice private bathroom. Cindy the cat is very friendly too."),
("2016-12-17", "14223095", "Majella", "Krythia's apartment was clean  quiet and comfortable and close to beautiful Balmoral.  Krythia was very understanding about our late arrival into Sydney and ensured we could access the property in her absence.  Krythia ensured we had everything we needed to make ourselves comfortable for our brief stay (tea  coffee) and was a generous host."),
("2016-12-18", "14223095", "Kim", "Great place  host and value "),
("2016-12-26", "14223095", "Jeryl", "The apartment is in a small  modern complex  very close to a bus route direct to the centre of Sydney (10 minutes). Shops and beach are close but a LONG walk.The bedroom is A-C  very private with very comfortable bed."),
("2017-01-06", "14223095", "Luke", "Amazing place  friendly host and good in value "),
("2017-01-08", "14223095", "Karolina", "Vi spenderade en natt hemma hos Krythia och det var bra. Vi gillade Mosman. Ävenom det är lite längre bort från stan så tyckte vi att det var värd.Tack Krythia!"),
("2017-01-10", "14223095", "Georgia", "Krythia's place is central to Sydney and close to some beautiful beaches. The room is soacuous and the courtyard offers a nice private area to chill out. Krythia was a great host and very accommodating."),
("2017-02-04", "14223095", "Michael", "Krythia was a lovely host. The unit was central in Mossman and a short walk to buses which were only 10 minutes to the city. The bathroom and bedroom was lovely and we had a fantastic time."),
("2017-02-24", "14223095", "Jill", "Mosman is a lovely part of Sydney.  The CBD is easily accessable by public transport and beautiful Balmoral Beach is not far away.  There are many wonderful scenic walks in the area.  Krythia is a kind and helpful. host.  Comfortable bed and great private bathroom."),
("2017-03-14", "14223095", "Joyce", "Krythia definitely earned her superhost. She was lovely and friendly. Her place was clean  comfortable and bright. Best part was the location  so easily accessible to city by public transport. Would absolutely choose her place again if I have to visit Sydney one day. "),
("2017-03-24", "14223095", "Jill", "This is my second ten-day stay with Krythia.  The space isvery comfortable  with great private bathroom and thearea is lovel.y within walking distance of excellent public transport to the city and also  beautiful Balmoral Beach.  Krythia is always most helpful & accommodating. Highly re ommend."),
("2017-03-31", "14223095", "Vanny", "Comfortably away from  but still close to everything in just a fee minutes. We were able to explore all the nearby cities by driving and walking  and kept busy. "),
("2017-04-10", "14223095", "Jill", "This was my third stay with Krythia.  She is an easyand very helpful host.  Highly recommend."),
("2017-04-16", "14223095", "Windy", "Great location  very friendly host  very clean accommodation  lovely stay. "),
("2017-04-21", "14223095", "Wayne", "Modern bathroom and kitchen. Convenience place."),
("2017-05-01", "14223095", "Marcus", "A great place to stay if you want access to the Northern Beaches and to hop on a bus into the city."),
("2017-06-12", "14223095", "Meelika", "The whole apartment was very nice and clean. Beautiful room and private bathroom. The bed in the room was out of this world comfortable. We enjoyed our stay very much :) Definitely recommend!"),
("2017-06-25", "14223095", "Mohana", "My partner and I had a wonderful stay at Krythia's place. Spotlessly clean  easy to access and very comfortable. Krythia is a great host."),
("2017-08-13", "14223095", "Catherine", "We enjoyed our stay with Krythia. The accommodation was very clean  comfortable and spacious  especially with the little outdoor terrace. Krythia made us feel most welcome."),
("2017-10-09", "14223095", "Sure", "The room is much better than it’s advertised. So modernized. The bathroom floor can be heated so that you feel very warm when taking a shower. The kitchen is well equipped with everything. The living room is spacious. Krythia leads a very healthy lifestyle and she goes out regularly to attend different activities. She goes to the gym regularly. We had a good chat and felt so comfortable in her house."),
("2017-10-15", "14223095", "Kayla", "Thank you for having us on such short notice! We thoroughly enjoyed our stay. Felt very safe and the carpark was secure. Lovely space  super comfy bed and particularly fantastic bathroom. Highly recommend to all"),
("2017-10-31", "14223095", "Sharon", "Clean and decent place. Newly renovated bedroom and bathroom with comfortable bed. Easy communication. Krythia is a nice host who can give you all the useful information around the city. We really enjoy our stay with her!"),
("2017-11-11", "14223095", "Sean", "Great place to stay if visiting the bars/cafes/restaurants of Cremorne and Neutral Bay. Entry if from a major road which is handy and as it is in battelaxe block it is quiet at night. Would certainly stay there again."),
("2017-11-13", "14223095", "Dianna", "Krythia was a wonderful host.  She was very welcoming  helpful with suggestions of what to do in Sydney and how to get around.  Her home was very clean with a comfy bed."),
("2017-12-10", "14223095", "Ross", "Modern apartment in good location for access to Mossman and Balmoral.recommended."),
("2017-12-30", "14223095", "Patrick", "Very comfortable room."),
("2017-12-31", "14223095", "Walter", "Nice bedroom and bathroom."),
("2018-01-07", "14223095", "Chang & Xinchao", "Krythia's place is super clean and comfortable. I have never sleep on a bed like this  super soft. Krythia is thoughtful."),
("2018-01-12", "14223095", "Michelle Linda", "This place was close to Balmoral beach and nice places to eat. Having a car spot was handy to travel to the northern beaches of Sydney. Lots of hills in the area too. Krythia was a pleasant host."),
("2018-01-22", "14223095", "Sean", "This is the second time we have stayed here which is probably the most telling point - we love it and would certainly stay again."),
("2018-02-17", "14223095", "Neil", "Lovely host   great position   very clean   convenient and as described ."),
("2018-03-06", "14223095", "Chika", "I felt really comfortable and relaxed to stay there because it was a very tidy place  and had an air-con and a laundry.She was so kind. I wanna recommend to stay there."),
("2018-05-27", "14223095", "Vince", "Great place close to shops in a great area.  Host is accomodating and frindley and will give you space when u want it."),
("2018-07-01", "14223095", "Greg", "Clean  comfortable and welcoming host."),
("2018-07-31", "14223095", "Carolina", "Krythia is a fabulous host  her place is fantastic  clean  beautiful  comfortable  well located  it has everything.I openly recommend it!"),
("2018-10-08", "14223095", "Clare", "Krythia is a very thoughtful  unobtrusive hostess of a very sparking clean and stylish apartment.  It was marvelous to come back after every rainy day to a warm  welcoming bedroom and the steady  hot water of the shower of a beautifully designed bathroom.  It suited our needs exactly.  I have no hesitation in recommending Krythia and her place!"),
("2018-10-15", "14223095", "Tiffany", "Spacious  clean and a great location. Being able to have access to a garage was an added bonus."),
("2018-11-20", "14223095", "Kevin", "Krythia place is  super comfortable. I had the privacy of my own bedroom  the court yard and bathroom with a gorgeous bath tub. The location is superb if you want to be in the right spot for a peaceful stay but also go out and have everything at your finger tips.5 minutes walk to cafe and bus stop right outside the cafe to city   10 minutes walk to local fresh produce and grocer shops  the main strip of Mosman life. I would highly recommend Krythia's place for your next stay in Northern Beaches  Sydney. Thanks so much Krythia  you are an exceptional host too. Krissy."),
("2018-11-25", "14223095", "Peter", "Room was as described. A short stroll to public transport  Krythia communicated perfectly and also provided space for private time.  Local tips for transport were appreciated . I did not use wifi but password was also provided . Thanks  would stay again."),
("2018-12-28", "14223095", "Trine", "Krythia is a friendly host  and the apartment is very close to the bus line directly to the city centre."),
("2018-12-30", "14223095", "Sharath", "Krythia is a lovely host! The place is fantastic! 10/10 would recommend"),
("2019-01-02", "14223095", "Kevin", "Alles perfekt  kann ich nur empfehlen! Krythia war sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit in jeder Situation."),
("2019-01-05", "14223095", "Graham", "Neat clean good location Near new facilities"),
("2019-01-12", "14223095", "Tammy", "We were in Mosman for a wedding so the room was ideal for our purposes being close to the venue.Room and bathroom were very clean and there was also a hairdryer available.Great for what we wanted"),
("2019-01-22", "14223095", "Leon", "Very clean and stylish space! Loved the washroom and overall layout of the flat. Great location as well  being approx. 5-10mins walk from various restaurants and shops. Highly recommended!"),
("2019-02-23", "14223095", "Janelle", "Great location for me as I was attending a conference at Taronga Zoo - the buses were close and also convenient to get to the ferry. The place is nice and the host friendly. Bed is comfy and a great bathroom."),
("2016-01-02", "14250", "Miguel", "We did not meet Heidi but she was very friendly on the phone and always available for any questions that we had. We adored our stay in her beautiful house. It was exactly how she stated  clean  tidy and perfect for what we needed. The neighbourhood was very quiet and the neighbours were friendly. The location was perfect for us. Close to the bus  shopping centers  cafes  supermarkets and ferry station. Thanks for a wonderful stay in your gorgeous house Heidi.   "),
("2019-01-02", "14250", "Andy", "Good location and access to public transport. Host Heidi was helpful and communicative. Nice walks around the area. OK value. Need to like cats."),
("2016-08-31", "14339793", "Hugh", "I had a fantastic stay in North Bondi thanks to Lucy. The room is lovely  with the sound of birds outside the big window and lots of space around the flat too. Lucy's home is beautifully decorated and clean  and located perfectly on the quiet streets of North Bondi  but still a moments walk  away from the beach and a couple of shops. Lucy is wonderful  so welcoming and even offered to cook me breakfast; amazing host!!"),
("2016-11-12", "14339793", "Kent", "It was a pleasure to stay in this room. Lucy coordinated key exchange and welcome with her flatmate. The room itself has views of the beach and a comfortable bed."),
("2017-07-30", "14886923", "Michael", "The location of this property was central to transport - an easy train ride in from the airport and short walk from museum stationLots of communication from the host.The property was nothing special - served its purpose - wouldn't rush back in a hurry - hosts could do a lot more to make the property more accommodating for business guests"),
("2017-08-28", "14886923", "Stephanie", "Nice apartment located in Darlinghurst. Central to many touristic places. Close to little Italy. Many cafes and restaurants around. The place was clean and good for a family of four. Second bed is a convertible that is ok for young kids if to be shared. Easy to check in and check out. Andrea is very helpful and available. Communication by email only."),
("2018-03-25", "14886923", "William", "It was god and a perfect location"),
("2018-05-27", "14886923", "Caitlin", "This place was a great location if you want a simple place to sleep. The place overall was a bit run-down compared to the photos  but was the perfect location if you are interested in walking to the water such as Darling Harbour. Andrea was a very responsive host. Our only complaints were some bathroom bugs and hearing the elevator operating throughout the night since we were right next door."),
("2013-09-09", "1481361", "Annalise", "The apartment exceeded expectations.  First  the location was incredible.  Literally overlooking the Tamarama beach and a beautifull balcany to sit on and watch the world go by.  Secondly  the apartment itself was perfect.  It is clean  with great entertaining spaces and very welcoming.  You don't feel like your invading another persons home but it still feels homely - if that makes sense!  The beds  couch and linen were all clean  fresh and comfortable.Third  it's only a 10 min walk to Bondi!Finally  Wayne is lovely and immediately responded to all my questions.  We only booked the apartment a few days before  and it was my first time dealing with airbnb  so we really appreciated the quick responses.  Also  we had a bottle of champagne and chocolates on arrival which was a lovely surprise!I would highly recommend this apartment.  It is the perfect place for people who want to hang out  relax and and enjoy one of Sydney's premier beach locations.  I will definitely go back if I need a place in Sydney. "),
("2013-09-24", "1481361", "Jacinta", "We had a great stay at Wayne and Kate's place. We travelled to Sydney for a family long weekend and from the moment we opened the door we felt at home. Their home is open and airy with a fantastic view of the beach. The location is perfect  we went on walks along the ""ocean walk"" to Bondi and the opposite direction to Coogee and Bronte. It was great sitting on the balcony looking out at the beach and the many energetic people pounding the pavements and in the water enjoying the waves. Wayne and Kate were great hosts emailing and messaging us with directions to their home and suggestions of places to visit. Nothing was too much trouble. The champagne and chocolate they left for us was also well received . We can not wait to return. Thankyou Wayne and Kate for sharing your beautiful home with us."),
("2013-10-04", "1481361", "Shelli", "Wayne and Kate were wonderful to deal with  quick responses in the lead-up to our stay and comprehensive instructions on how to get the key when we arrived. As soon as we walked in we knew we were in for a lovely stay. The view is magnificent and the apartment is spacious and airy  and well-represented in the photos on the website. The kids loved the big TV which meant more time on the deck for us! Great walks and easy parking which is not easy to come by in Sydney. Would thoroughly recommend this place."),
("2013-10-07", "1481361", "Eleanor", "Holy moly what an apartment. Actually better than the photos! The vibe is clean  open  breezy  sophisticated. After a picnic lunch at Bronte  We enjoyed dinner together at the table and an evening swim. We were a party of 6  and all of us slept comfortably and felt like a million dollars the entire time. The kitchen was awesome to cook in and the balcony a peaceful breakfast spot. It could not have been more perfect. "),
("2013-10-08", "1481361", "Jason", "Everything went smoothly and Wayne and Kate were very easy to deal with. The apartment is stunning  wonderful views of the beach  and although I only spent the afternoon there  my Mum and her friends who stayed over found everything they needed and were raving about the location. I'll be back! :)"),
("2013-10-16", "1481361", "Micae", "We had an absolutely wonderful time staying at Wayne and Kate's place.. you cannot beat waking up to the sounds of the ocean! We had friends travelling from overseas for our wedding  and we could not have asked for a better place to stay; 2-10 mins walk to any of Sydney's great beaches  and all the anemities that you need in an apartment to make the place as comfortable as possible. Wayne and Kate were fantastic in getting back to us on any inquiries and were very thoughtful and approachable. The perfect hosts! now we need another excuse to rent out the place again ;) Thanks for everything! "),
("2013-10-21", "1481361", "Natalie", "We had a great time staying at Wayne and Kate's place. It is an absolutely beautiful apartment in an amazing spot. It was great to fall asleep listening to the sea.Me and 5 girlfriends stayed for a weekend and we were all blown away. The apartment had everything we needed  we just added a few bottles of champers to sip on the balcony and soak up the Tamarama atmosphere. Thanks Wayne and Kate :)"),
("2013-10-29", "1481361", "Jessica", "From the first contact with Wayne and Kate my first experience using AirBNB has been fabulous! Their regular and thoughtful communication was perfect and we were so excited to stay at their beautiful apartment overlooking Tamarama Beach. We arrived to find cold bubbles in the fridge  a block of chocolate and a 'house and area manual' to assist use with everything we needed to know during our stay. The apartment was perfect! Great size for a larger group and it was so nice to have the home comforts right at our fingertips. I cannot recommend this experience enough and look forward to staying at Wayne and Kate's apartment again in the near future! "),
("2013-11-07", "1481361", "Sandy", "We had a wonderful stay at Wayne and Kate's Tamarama apartment. Excellent communication and experience from the very start. Checking in was simple and we arrived to a lovely bottle of bubbles! The view and location are absolutely unbeatable  and the apartment is terrific. The photos do not do justice - it's an amazing apartment! Great lighting  very comfortable  and well furnished. The flat has all the amenities you need and truly makes you feel at home.  We had a very small issue with the internet dropping out periodically but Kate went above and beyond to ensure things were fixed.  And… left us another bottle of bubbles for our troubles  which was so incredibly nice!The apartment was a short walk to Bondi  Bronte and Coogee beaches.  The walk from Tamarama to Bondi is breathtaking.  We were lucky enough to catch the Sculptures by the Sea the week of our stay.Our experience was outstanding and highly recommend Wayne and Kate’s place. We did not want to leave! We look forward to staying at Wayne and Kate’s in the future. Thanks again for everything  Wayne and Kate!  :)"),
("2013-11-19", "1481361", "Andre", "Fantastic spot although the weather was not on our side!I arrived late on the weekend  so Wayne and Kate were super accommodating with my friend John. Place is very secure  has an amazing outlook over the beach. Café’s and restaurants are a short walk away  and transport easily accessible. Great experience and would love to stay there again!"),
("2013-11-26", "1481361", "Sarah", "Thanks Wayne and Kate we had a lovely time at your apartment. Was clean  beds comfy and great view of the beach!!"),
("2013-12-16", "1481361", "Heather", "What an absolutely fantastic apartment and view! The hosts were fantastic to deal with and gave quick and very helpful replies! The apartment had everything we could need for a girly weekend away. Thanks so much  we all had a ball =)"),
("2014-01-08", "1481361", "Michael", "Wayne and Kate's apartment is in a fabulous location right on the beach of Tamarama. It is clean  well maintained and suited our needs with 2 teenage boys. Thumbs up!"),
("2014-01-13", "1481361", "Boiana", "We had a great time  the apartment was lovely  clean  the views were spectacular and all expectations from the posting were met! They even left us bubbly!The owners were very kind and even left us tips for the area.I recommend this apartment and experience highly.-Boyana"),
("2014-03-11", "1481361", "Rori", "Absolutely perfect place to stay in Sydney! The beach is quite literally  across the road! The views are to die for day and night. Short and beautiful walk to Bondi or Bronte for restaurants  bars and bigger beaches if you want them. The apartment is clean and very comfortable   it has everything and more you could want. And the hosts are extremely kind and accommodating. We had a ball staying here! "),
("2014-03-16", "1481361", "Andrew", "Wayne and Kate’s beachfront apartment is simply amazing. From the moment we made an inquiry about the place  Wayne and Kate went above and beyond when responding to our questions and requests regarding the place – even replying within minutes when we sent a message at midnight!Stepping foot into the place  you might have to take a second to realise that you’re not actually in a designer home magazine. All of the amenities are in great condition and all three of the bedrooms were large with the beds comfortable and extremely clean.After settling in and making a cup of tea and coffee with the stocked kitchen  we decided to take a look at the lengthy list of activities that Wayne and Kate had compiled just for us. You can never undervalue local knowledge!While Wayne and Kate’s place is extremely fun  it’s also the perfect place to get some work done. We popped down to Tamarama Beach Café (across the road!) and bought back some coffee and sat and worked at the breakfast bar overlooking Tamarama Beach with our laptops – using the speedy wifi that was provided  of course.Simply  Wayne and Kate are amazing hosts and their stunning apartment is perfect for work  play and everything in between!"),
("2014-03-24", "1481361", "Tiiram", "We loved staying at Wayne and Kate's beautiful apartment right on the beach. The apartment is beautifully furnished and we felt right at home. Wayne and Kate were fantastic hosts and were in regular contact to make us feel welcome. We can't stress enough how good the location is  being able to walk across the road for a swim at a moments notice is amazing. Highly recommended!"),
("2014-04-10", "1481361", "Caroline", "Beautiful location  nice hosts  close to Bondi and Bronte for cafés and restaurants. We had a great time! Thanks Kate and Wayne. "),
("2014-04-22", "1481361", "Julia", "Wonderful apartment and extremely responsive hosts. Wish I were back on the beach!"),
("2014-04-27", "1481361", "Jacqui", "Fantastic apartment  fantastic location  fantastic hosts! Everything was thought of for us and we had a wonderful stay. The best equipped apartment we have ever stayed in...enough of everything  and more! thanks guys!  xx"),
("2014-05-05", "1481361", "Anthony", "Hi Wayne & Kate. We had three couples staying at the apartment for the weekend attending a wedding nearby.  We had a great time in the apartment and enjoyed the generous living space that you don't get in a hotel room. The view of the beach was awesome. Thanks for leaving everything so clean and tidy.I'll definitely be backcheersTony & Stef James"),
("2014-05-12", "1481361", "Oliver", "Had a fantastic weekend in this beautiful beach front apartment  hosts were great and helpful and the apartment was just as pictured if not better.I would definitely recommend staying here to anyone who loves the beach and an apartment that has everything you would need."),
("2014-06-02", "1481361", "Steve", "We stayed here with my parents and our family for our holiday in Australia.  Location was absolutely fabulous - so close to the beach and in the middle of the beach walk so we could do our morning walks either south to Bronte/Clovelley or north to Bondi.  Once we figured out the bus system  it was easy to get back and forth to downtown Sydney from here.  The apartment was spacious  comfortable and we enjoyed our meals on the large balcony looking at the beautiful ocean and coastline.  Had a great time in Sydney - our visit coincided with Vivid Live which was amazing.  Wayne and Kate are awesome hosts - loved the champagne and would highly recommend this place for a family holiday.  House has everything you need."),
("2014-07-08", "1481361", "Charles", "I did not meet Kate and Wayne but all the arrangements to access their apartment and when leaving worked smoothly.  They responded to all notes and met all requests. The apartment is in a beautiful spot with direct access to the beach and a view from the balcony to die for.  All round a very enjoyable experience.  Thanks."),
("2014-08-03", "1481361", "Rhys", "Absolutely fantastic place. Location is breath taking& the view is mind blowing.Would highly recommend this place and many thanks to the hosts for their quick  kind response..We had a gr8 time & look fwd to returning some time soon.Thanx again"),
("2014-08-09", "1481361", "Catherine", "Apartment is in a fantastic location with beautiful views. We loved the coastal walk and were lucky enough to see whales. The kitchen is very well equipped. The apartment worked well for an adult group but would also suit a young family. Parking was not a problem in winter. Public transport to city is very easy. Wayne and Kate were very welcoming hosts."),
("2014-08-12", "1481361", "Nadia", "Kate and Waybe were extremely accommodating and very responsive to my emails. The location is excellent literally the road between you and the beach. A lovely beach stay that I would highly recommend to others."),
("2014-08-17", "1481361", "Loic", "L'appartment est tres bien situe a Tamarama. La chambre principale est spacieuse avec baie vitree. L'interieur de l'appartement est spacieux et clair."),
("2014-09-01", "1481361", "Virginia", "Wayne and Kate were very welcoming.  We didn't select the best day as it was very rainy but it was nice to get away."),
("2014-09-15", "1481361", "Louise", "We had a great stay at Wayne and Kate's beachfront apartment. The location is incredible. You just have to step outside the front door  cross the road and you are at a beautiful beach. A short walk along the beautiful Australian coast brings you to Bondi where there are lots of cafes  restaurants and shops. The apartment is warm and welcoming with modern and bright decorations. It was also clean and had everything we needed to make our stay comfortable. It was lovely going to sleep with the sounds of the waves crashing. Plus  Wayne and Kate donate money to the Tamarama SLSC on behalf of the guests which is a really nice and important gesture. As an added bonus  Wayne and Kate gave us a surprise late check out so we could enjoy the area a little bit longer. I would definitely stay again. "),
("2014-09-23", "1481361", "Dylan", "Out-of-towners and Sydney residents alike loved this apartment and its location. I don't think anyone took their eyes off the ocean. We even had a whale watching session one afternoon  counting about 4 or 5 humpbacks making their way back down the coast for summer.It's an easy walk to Bronte and Bondi  but with Tamarama beach right out front you don't feel like you're missing out on anything. I was coping with some jetlag  but the others were keen to explore. The apartment proved to be a valuable centre point as people did what they wished and then met up again.The apartment itself is clean and well appointed. Definitely somewhere I'd like to spend a lot more time. We had a family gathering for my 30th birthday one night and hired a chef. He was able to deliver a number of courses from the kitchen without any worry.We were a little worried about finding parking  but I don't think we ever failed to find a spot out front."),
("2014-10-10", "1481361", "Tao", "We had a lovely two days staying at Wayne and Kates' place. Wayne was both helpful and welcoming throughout the entire experience. A lovely apartment in a truly stunning location!"),
("2014-10-21", "1481361", "Sophie", "Wayne and Kate's apartment is in an amazing position across from Tamarama Beach. It's spacious  clean  airy and peaceful  it was the perfect getaway for my dads 70th. Their instructions were clear and everything was perfect. Thanks so much for making our dad's bday a great one. He had a blast. "),
("2014-10-27", "1481361", "Catherine", "Wonderful location  it could not have been more perfect.  Great apartment  light  clean  well appointed  homely.  It was a group of adult friends that stayed and we were very comfortable.  Hosts were very responsive  and friendly.   Great experience."),
("2014-11-29", "1481361", "Helena", "We had a fantastic time! The house is ideally located and very spacious to accomodate the group.Thanks so much :)"),
("2014-12-19", "1481361", "Catherine", "Accurate description of property and located in a wonderful area - directly opposite an iconic beach! Great welcome pack with clear instructions on utilities. No problems with local parking. Easy access to beach and local shops. Great location for runners  surfers and sun bathers alike! Our boys wanted to move in!!Highly recommended and may consider a return in the near future!! Loved it!"),
("2015-01-05", "1481361", "Alison", "What a lovely welcoming apartment Great location overlooking the beachChampagne on arrival and lovely touches like coffee machine were an added bonusLoved going to sleep hearing the roar of the ocean and enjoying the sea breezeWould definately stay again"),
("2015-01-27", "1481361", "Christine", "Beautiful view. The apartment is spacious and right next to the beach.  But I'm confused why we received the keys in a coded box when it seems the hosts were staying close enough to the apartment to watch us and count how many people we had entering the apartment. We had a lunchtime BBQ with family from the city and were trying to take advantage of a beautiful spot but were interrupted on two occasions by the hosts driving to the apartment to tell our friends and family to leave the premises. We had no intention of breaching the six sleeper agreement and can't understand why a group of up to 15 people having a BBQ in the middle of the day is inappropriate or warrants the hosts' interruptions . If the hosts intended on being so strict with the number of people visiting  it would have made more sense for them to have advised us of their concerns when handing over the keys."),
("2015-02-19", "1481361", "Pierre", "We spent a week in Tamarama and it was wonderful ! The appartment is really nice and ideally located with a stunning view on the ocean. It was so good to wake up in the morning and to hear the swell ! On top of that   Wayne's organization has been perfect and everything worked well.  If we return to Sydney one day  which I hope  we'll definitely come back to Wayne and Kate's place !Thanks so muchPierre"),
("2015-02-27", "1481361", "Eoin", "I went to Sydney on a business trip and decided I wanted to get a taste of the coast rather than city. Best decision I ever made. The property is right on Tamarama beach  walking distance from Bondi and Bronte and 20 mins from the city center. The property itself was immaculate and very tasteful. Highly recommend. "),
("2015-03-03", "1481361", "Prue", "Wayne and Kate are the most amazing hosts - from the moment we booked with them until we left  our experience was outstanding.  The apartment is wonderfully spacious  clean and well equipped and has the most stunning views of Tamarama.  We found it very difficult to tear ourselves away from the balcony and the beach to explore other areas!  The local tips they gave us for food and coffee were spot on.  Highly recommended!"),
("2015-03-16", "1481361", "Daniel", "Awesome location  awesome host. Cannot fault this listing  simply a wonderful experience and a delight dealing with Wayne and Kate."),
("2015-03-23", "1481361", "Tina", "We found the hosts  Wayne & Kate very accommodating.  They were always very quick to respond to our queries and the unit was as described.  Very good position  spacious and comfortable.  The extra touch of a bottle of champagne was a very thoughtful gesture.  Street parking was not a problem.  There is a cafe directly opposite on Tamarama Beach or a short walk through the park to a strip of cafes at Bronte Beach.  Also a nice 15 min walk around the coast to Bondi.  "),
("2015-03-28", "1481361", "Daniel", "Simply amazing hosts. Every question was attentive and every request was accommodated. Cannot speak more highly of Wayne and Kate. We would rent from Wayne and Kate again in a heartbeat and would host them anytime  simply a delight to deal with. High quality  top shelf people. Cheers Wayne and Kate!"),
("2015-04-04", "1481361", "John", "Wonderful location right on the beach.  Spectacular views from front balcony and study.  Bottle of champagne on arrival a lovely touch from Wayne and Kate to make us feel welcome."),
("2015-04-07", "1481361", "Matthieu", "Appartement fonctionnel pour une famille ou entre amis  terrasse donnant directement sur la plage. Même s'il est loin  Wayne vous aide  si vous avez des questions ...."),
("2015-04-28", "1481361", "Erin", "Wayne and Kate are wonderful hosts and extremely welcoming from the very beginning!  Place was immaculate and wine and chocolates were waiting on our arrival.  Our holiday started off perfectly!  Then Mother Nature showed up.  Unfortunately  we happened to visit Sydney during ""the wettest April in 26 years"" according to news reports.  Winds were howling and there was even a hail storm.  Exciting  but not what anyone wants of plans for on vacation.  And nothing anyone could control.  Wayne and Kate went out of their way to make sure we were safe and comfortable.  They checked in on us several times.  Made sure we had food (there were weather advisories  trees were down  Uber was overwhelmed  and we didn't have a car).  Loaned us their rain gear.  Even dropped off pastries.  No one could have predicted such wild weather conditions.  But we were determined to see Sydney and they were determined to make sure we were comfortable  dry  and safe.  Wayne and Kate went above and beyond to help make our holiday a resounding success even in the midst of a wild storm.  Their spot in Tamarama is iddlic!  They have thought of everything.  Kitchen was well equipped and there was lots of reading available for those rainy days.  The views are more amazing in person.  The storm was fascinating to watch and the little beach cafe/park across the street is delightful.  Their apartment is on the coastal walk from Bondi to Coogee - loved this walk!  Fairly easy walk to Bondi (maybe not for a 3 year old or the elderly  but for most adults).  As stated  weather can't be controlled of predicted.  But these two really went all out for us.  Their care and concern help make our trip so much more enjoyable.  I feel like we not only had a great vacation  but we made some friends.I would definitely recommend this apartment and these hosts!"),
("2015-05-02", "1481361", "Vesa", "The location is absolutely perfect!Other great things about this place:> The shower had excellent water pressure> The views were outstanding  we especially enjoyed watching the surfers and waves while eating breakfast in the study nook.> The location was perfect for easy access to the beach and to coastal morning runs. > The kitchen was well stocked with all the equipment one needed.> The bed was very comfortable  and we enjoyed waking up to the sound of waves."),
("2015-05-05", "1481361", "Skye", "After my original accommodation was cancelled 2 days prior to my wedding I urgently needed to find alternate accommodation for my bridal party.Wayne and Kate made this possible.Their apartment is clean  tidy and has all of those little bits and pieces that you need for a nice weekend away.Thanks again guys!"),
("2015-05-25", "1481361", "Andy", "Had a fantastiic stay at Wayne and Kate's place. We arrived on Friday night in windy and rainy conditions  but were soon cosy in the apartment with the girls snuggled in the provided blankets  and with the heaters on!Everything that we needed was provided for and the hosts quickly answered a couple of texts I sent with questions about the apartment. Waking up to blue skies and the sight of the ocean on the Saturday morning was awesome. Would love to come back and experience the place is summer! Thanks to the hosts "),
("2015-06-02", "1481361", "Deidre", "We had a wonderful 'Girls' Weekend' at Tamarama. Our hosts were most helpful emailing us lots of local information and recommendations. The apartment is in a superb position overlooking the famous Tamarama beach. We were able to watch from the balcony as locals played beach volleyball or walk down to the beach kiosk for a coffee and watch the passing whales!  Just cross the road and you are on the Bondi to Coogee walking path - great walk to Coogee and back.  The apartment is cosy and accommodates six people easily. The sound of the surf will lull you to sleep."),
("2015-06-11", "1481361", "Q", "Wayne and Kate's apartment is a wonderful getaway - the view is breathtaking  the area is peaceful  and the decor of the apartment is charming yet practical. We travelled as a group of 4 girls and found the space very sufficient. The layout of the home is also very convenient for travelling as a group of friends as we all had enough personal space! Wayne and Kate also provide a great set of speakers and very thoughtfully included an iphone4-to-iphone6 converter! Everything was clean and ready for us when we arrived  and all the amenities were great. On top of that  Wayne and Kate were very responsive whenever we needed help with preparing for our trip  checking in to the apartment  and figuring things out in the apartment. We were trying to figure out the dryer quite late one night  and got really stuck  but Wayne and Kate were able to reply to our message immediately - we really really appreciated how quick they were with messaging! We thoroughly enjoyed our stay and would recommend the apartment for sure. "),
("2015-06-15", "1481361", "Sam", "Very nice apartment  was right next to the beach just like the picture shows.  Bus stop nearby and the UBER service us widely used in Australia for private car service. We loved the apartment  traveled with 2 adults and 4 kids.  Wife wanted to take the bedding home because it was so comfortable! We just came off a 18 day cruise so we had a ton of laundry there was a dry cleaner that did it for $50 AUD nearby or you can do it in the apartment with the washer and dryer provided but we had too much.The host was very involved prior and during our stay  they asked us what our interests were prior to coming and gave us some recommendations.  While there they checked on us several times to be sure things were working to our satisfaction and even offered to pickup our laundry and take them to the dry cleaners because we had too much for their unit to handle.  We also accidentally left a iPad there any they are being very helpful in getting it back to us  all we have to do is pay the cost of the until and they are packing it up and taking it to the local DHL office..Very nice experience! Thanks!"),
("2015-06-30", "1481361", "Sandy", "All of our queries prior to arrival were happily replied to very promptly. Wayne and Kate emailed us a list of attractions / activities that may have interested us during our stay. On arrival we were presented with a nice bottle of champagne which we certainly appreciated."),
("2015-07-20", "1481361", "Daniel", "Wayne and Kate are amazing hosts. Their enthusiasm  genuine care and willingness to go above and beyond was very much appreciated. If you are looking for an authentic Sydney experience  this is it! Would definitely recommend their beachfront home to anyone."),
("2015-07-27", "1481361", "Chiko", "outside of building is rather old and worried bit but description is accurate and interior is beautifully done  location is great for relaxing weekend.As I came back from overseas without sleep all night  we hadmixed up where key is.  Kate took taxi from her work to delivery the key and Wayne came to drop bottle but we got delicious croissant!for their apology.  it is very relaxing cosy place"),
("2015-08-03", "1481361", "Rebecca", "Wayne and Kate were friendly hosts who remained easy to contact throughout our stay. The location of the apartment was fantastic - just across the road from Tamarama beach. You can hear the waves crashing on the beach as you fall asleep. We had some noisy neighbours on the Saturday night (that was obviously no fault of the hosts) but otherwise it was a very enjoyable stay. The kitchen is well equipped for cooking  and the apartment was comfortable for the 6 of us. We were lucky to have warm winter weather when we visited and thoroughly enjoyed the beach track walks to Bondi and Coogee. "),
("2015-08-11", "1481361", "Shelley", "Wayne and Kate were great hosts from the very first inquiry. Their responses were very timely  in some cases instant  and extremely informative.Their property is ideal for a relaxed getaway and the views across Tamarama beach from the balcony  study and the main bedroom are stunning... it was very hard to leave! Great cafes and parks are within walking distance either way - around to Bondi or Bronte. Bus stops are are five minute walk and in most cases  we could jump on a bus within a few minutes that took us straight to Sydney's CBD. Inside the unit Wayne and Kate have thought of everything! We wanted for nothing and could find everything easily. The unit is light and bright and well suited for a family or a group friends.The champagne on arrival blew us away and the donation from our accommodation fee to the Tamarama Surfing Life Saving Club was so touching  that we all said we would definitely stay there again!We went to Sydney to participate in the City to Surf fun run and ended up having one of the best long weekends ever!Thanks Wayne and Kate!"),
("2015-08-18", "1481361", "Melissa", "Wayne and Kate made us feel incredibly welcome even before we arrived. They were very helpful giving us great advice on surfboard hire and local eateries which were easily accessible in this beautiful neighbourhood. The apartment itself lived up to all our expectations. It was light-filled  clean  warm and welcoming with stunning views and provided ample space for the 6 of us (two grandparents  us and our two kids) to relax. Going to sleep with the sound of the surf was so restful and the beds really comfy. And the chocolates and sparkling were a lovely touch! Thanks Wayne and Kate. We loved our stay and would definitely return. "),
("2015-09-29", "1481361", "Matt", "Wayne and Kate are amazing hosts  and communicated to us on a regular basis both before and during stay. The apartment is modern  clean and has a great view as per the photos of the beach. Would definitely stay here again  and the best host experience we have had since joining airbnb!"),
("2015-10-05", "1481361", "Therese", "We loved our weekend at Wayne and Kate's apartment. The view was amazing and the apartment was well presented and had everything we needed. The bottle of champagne left for us was a lovely surprise too. We would definitely stay here again."),
("2015-10-12", "1481361", "Nicola", "We had a wonderful stay and the view was most definitely the highlight. What a spectacular aspect this apartment has. Great people watching! We were lucky enough to have wonderful weather for our stay and to sit out on the gorgeous balcony and people watch whilst drinking wine and eating seafood -- well you can't get much better than that! The apartment was very spacious and the kitchen was packed with great cooking materials/utensils etc. It was a comfortable stay and we thoroughly enjoyed it."),
("2015-10-20", "1481361", "Alysha", "Wayne and Kate were wonderful hosts. The apartment was clean and as the pictures depict.  The location was phenomenal and the bottle of champagne a delightful bonus...The amount of thought that has gone into making guests welcome and having all things available was very much noted and appreciated."),
("2015-10-27", "1481361", "Rosalind", "We had a lovely stay at Kate and Wayne's place. The view couldn't be better!  The apartment is a lovely space to relax in and well equipped. Wayne and Kate were great at getting back to us really quickly. Would highly recommend."),
("2015-11-05", "1481361", "Shuo", "Beautiful views and closed to bondi beach  very easy-going. Close to city too. "),
("2015-11-16", "1481361", "Geraldine", "Wayne & Kate we had a wonderful stay in your apartment  the view was amazing  close to everything the unit had everything we needed  thank again we will be back Tony & Geraldine "),
("2015-11-27", "1481361", "TurnKey Vacation Rentals", "Couldn't have been happier staying at Wayne & Kate's. It's in the perfect location - right across from a beautiful beach and a close walk to everything. We felt very welcomed and they were easily accessible to answer any questions. The walk along the beach sidewalk is worth the visit alone. Wasn't sure I'd be interested in returning to Australia again until this visit - now I'd definitely like to make it back and would be happy to stay at their place in Tamarama again. It's a beach house - not 5 star pristine hotel conditions - and we totally enjoyed it!"),
("2015-12-05", "1481361", "Carolyn", "Great place to stay with fabulous views and great beaches at your doorstep"),
("2015-12-15", "1481361", "Shirley", "Wayne and Kate were so helpful efficient and responsive from my first request. The apartment was great and in a fantastic position. Everything we needed was supplied including a bottle of champagne to welcome us - we are here for a family wedding so the best way to start. The balcony is a joy and such a social area.   If we ever have the chance would certainly book again. "),
("2015-12-18", "1481361", "Joseph", "We stayed here with our kids and my mum and everyone had a great time.  Literally across the street from an amazing beach and park - which contained a very nice coffee shop.  Wayne & Kate were great.  Super helpful  very responsive and really great positive Aussie attitude.  I'd highly recommend this place."),
("2016-01-09", "1481361", "Yvonne", "Hosts could not have been more welcoming from the goodies to the lovely bottle of champagne which was a lovely surprise after such a long journey they were also most accommodating with the key pick up location could not have been more perfect we all loved it the perfect hosts and perfect location hopefully we will make it back sometime"),
("2016-01-12", "1481361", "Dalia", "Couldn't recommend this property more highly. Hosts were attentive  lovely and on the ball. Apartment was light  spacious even for two adults and three big boys! The absolute highlight though was the view of breathtaking Tamarama and being able to step across the road and into Sydneys' incredible beach culture. We felt like locals and will be back for sure. "),
("2016-01-18", "1481361", "Grant", "Wayne and Kate were very helpful hosts  and their apartment is in the best spot! Great holiday location  highly recommended."),
("2016-02-06", "1481361", "Qing", "Wayne&Kate's house is amazing! Everything are same as photo on the web location is excellent.and hosts are very welcome!"),
("2016-02-11", "1481361", "Carrie", "The location of Wayne & Kate's place seriously couldn't be more perfect!  You overlook beautiful Tamarama beach  which is right between Bondi and Bronte (both within walking distance).  The decor is simple and clean and the apartment was outfitted with just the right stuff (champagne and a nespresso machine :). The hosts were very accommodating and available to help with anything you need. Highly recommend this location for a base in Sydney.  "),
("2016-02-16", "1481361", "Poli", "Wayne and Kate are super hosts who were really easy to communicate with and very accommodating. We loved the apartment  its beautiful and in the most wonderful location. We would recommend staying here to all our friends and family and hope to return one day. Thank you Wayne and Kate for making this a truly special stay for us all :)"),
("2016-02-27", "1481361", "Silvia", "Der Kontakt zu den Gastgebern hat  sehr gut funktioniert. Wir hatten das Gefühl  dass unsere Gastgeber wirklich daran interessiert sind  dass wir einen schönen Urlaub haben und uns in der Wohnung wohlfühlen. Unsere Fragen wurden immer sofort und ausführlich beantwortet. Die Wohnung entspricht den Beschreibungen und Bildern.  Sie ist sehr komfortabel und geschmackvoll ausgestattet  so dass wir uns gleich wie zuhause gefühlt haben.   Der Balkon hat einen  tollem Blick auf den Strand  den wir gern und oft genutzt haben  da er schattig war und immer ein kleiner Wind für Erfrischung gesorgt hat. "),
("2016-03-08", "1481361", "Phuong", "Wayne and Kate are actually the ultimate  best hosts we've ever ever had - and their place in Tama is absolutely amazing. Clean  modern  so super comfortable - and the views! We were made to feel so super welcome. We loved the fact that Wayne and Kate donate some of their proceeds to the Tama SLSC - so very important to us. Wayne and Kate respected our privacy but were also extremely hospitable if we ever needed anything - and are also really warm people. Nothing was too much of an ask  and we had such a relaxing getaway because of it. Their home was so easy to relax in  and that balcony served as our main living space for our entire stay - it was hard to resist.Wayne & Kate are such wonderful hosts  we'd jump at the chance of staying there again on our next stay  if they would have us.Thanks Wayne & Kate - you're absolute legends!"),
("2016-03-22", "1481361", "Anna", "Wayne and Kate were fantastic hosts and provided great communication about their apartment and the local area.  Their apartment is in a sensational location  impeccably presented and had everything we needed. We thoroughly enjoyed our weekend. Thanks again. "),
("2016-04-07", "1481361", "Harry", "Wayne felt us very welcome and was great at communication and giving advice.  The apartment was clean and tidy and perfect for our stay.  The view was outstanding and we loved sitting on the balcony enjoying the sound of the sea."),
("2016-04-11", "1481361", "Sarah", "Amazing place  great location  perfect weekend getaway spot. Great hosts!"),
("2016-04-24", "1481361", "Melina", "This place was charming  well kept and spacious with the most scenic views. Wayne and Kate were very accommodating and had thought about all the finer details to ensure we had a lovely visit. Would definitely recommend to others. "),
("2016-05-03", "1481361", "Chris", "We had a great time at Wayne & Kate's apartment. The communication prior to and during our stay was fantastic  with everything we needed provided and clearly explained  The view over Tamarama beach is stunning  and we loved listening to the ocean at night.The location is amazing  with many beautiful beaches within walking distance (we'd highly recommend the walk to Coogee). Thanks again for a wonderful stay."),
("2016-05-15", "1481361", "Frances", "The apartment is every bit as good as it looks. The location is amazing. The place is so homely. We had the most fabulous time and would definitely stay here again."),
("2016-05-23", "1481361", "Chantelle", "Such a beautiful house with a gorgeous view right on the beachfront!! House had everything we needed beds were comfy  huge TV  nice living area for us all to relax in! Walking distance to Bondi  free parking  perfect location! Wayne and Kate were so welcoming and provided clear information regarding keys and use of facilities and lots of info about the area. They checked in mid stay to see if anything was needed and always responded promptly! Thankyou for sharing your beautiful home with us!!"),
("2016-07-16", "1481361", "Julie", "We stayed at Wayne & Kate's for a long weekend and it was amazing !!!The location was perfect right across the road from the beach easy walk to Bondi or bronte the apartment was beautifully decorated  beds were super comfy  great kitchen.wayne was a pleasure to communicate with providing easy direction & key info & touched base a day into our trip making sure all was well .I can't imagine a better place to stay if a beach holiday in the heart of Sydney is what your afterThanks Wayne & Kate we really appreciated all your effortsJulie"),
("2016-07-21", "1481361", "Susie", "Wonderful spot. Great hosting."),
("2016-08-13", "1481361", "Jessica", "Wayne and Kate's place is why I love Airbnb. Coordinating our arrival and check out was a breeze - and the apartment was everything it promised - big  sunny and right on the beach. I hope we get to return soon. "),
("2016-09-11", "1481361", "Rebecca", "Wayne and Kate were really nice and available to answer all our questions within minutes of asking them. The apartment is basic  but it had everything we needed  was clean and the location and views were amazing! "),
("2016-10-21", "1481361", "Mark", "An amazing experience Place looks even better in real lifeBest Airbnb hosts I've ever had view is magical and house is perfectly equipped"),
("2016-11-05", "1481361", "Celina", "We had an amazing time staying at Wayne and Kate's beautiful home. The location could not have been better  if what you're wanting is Sydney beach living. While our first choice was to stay directly on Bondi  much to our surprise this Tamarama location was so much better and away from the chaos on Bondi. This three bedroom home was clean and looked exactly like the pictures. Will definitely book this place again if I ever find myself in Sydney."),
("2016-11-11", "1481361", "Jeffrey", "Best Host ever... left my electric toothbrush and they delivered it to where I was staying next in another area.. nothing but Love."),
("2016-11-19", "1481361", "Steven", "Wayne was in constant communication to make sure our arrival was seamless his service was excellent  also the listing description was spot on and the area is  pure gold one of the nicest places you will ever visit."),
("2016-12-23", "1481361", "Susie", "Great communication again"),
("2016-12-23", "1481361", "Kerry", "Wayne & Kate stayed in contact and made sure we had all the details for arrival and a lovely welcome package at the apartment. The apartment is bright  comfortable and has sweeping views of the ocean which is right outside your window. We were also really surprised at how quiet the building was at night. The apartment is in a great location close to transport  beaches and shops. Thanks Wayne and Kate we would certainly choose to stay at your Tama pad again."),
("2017-01-02", "1481361", "Monica", "Great location right on the beach. Champagne and chocolates on arrival a surprising touch. Fantastic sharp knives in the well equiped kitchen with a Nespresso and a good supply of pods to keep us caffeinated!Parking on the street only an issue during the day in the busy summer holiday period but ample spots after hours."),
("2017-01-03", "1481361", "Michelle", "Wayne and Kate's place is amazing  bright and spacious and right beside the beautiful Tamarama beach. It is just a short walk into Bondi along the coast and going in the other direction to Coogee passing some other fabulous beaches. The house has absolutely everything you need and beds are really comfy. Check in and check out were easy. Would certainly recommend staying here and would love to return ourselves one day."),
("2017-01-08", "1481361", "Melissa", "Wayne and Kate's place is everything that we imagined. We stayed there for 5 nights and wished we could have extended our trip! First of all  Wayne and Kate are wonderful hosts. They were very responsive and was happy to answer all of our questions. They were also very accommodating and allowed us to check-in earlier and check-out later to match our flight schedules. Checking in and out was super convenient as they left us with very clear instructions. A manual regarding the apartment was also given to make navigating around the place easier. They even left us coffee and a bottle of bubbles to welcome us! Their apartment is right on Tamarama Beach (2 mins walking)  and about 15-20 mins walk from Bondi Beach making it very convenient to go shopping  have a coffee or breakfast! The apartment itself was very clean  and all toilet amenities (including shampoo  conditioner  hairdryer  clean towels etc) were provided. Even though they didn't have air conditioners  they provided us with huge fans that kept us cool throughout our stay. I highly recommend their place  can't wait to visit again! "),
("2017-02-04", "1481361", "Skye", "We absolutely loved our stay - it was everything we hoped for and more! And to be just across from the beach was incredible. Thanks Wayne and Kate"),
("2017-02-18", "1481361", "Ryan", "Wayne and Kate's property in Tamarama far exceeded any expectations we had.  This was our first airbnb stay  but from just a few minutes after we made the booking  Wayne and Kate ensured this experience would be fantastic for us.The apartment is in an amazing location - literally 50m from the beach and 100m to a beautiful cafe where we enjoyed breakfast each morning.  It's just a short and picturesque walk to Bondi beach  and close to lots of great shops and restaurants.The apartment is very clean and homely.  It has three bedrooms - one with an ensuite - a nice lounge  a fully equipment kitchen  a laundary and a large balcony overlooking Tamarama Beach.The apartment had everything we needed including linen and wifi.We had six adults staying and there was more than enough room for us all  but this location would also be perfect for families of all ages.  We will be bringing our two young children back soon!!We caught a cab to from Sydney airport to Tamarama which cost about $80 each way in a Maxi Taxi.I can't recommend Wayne and Kate's apartment enough.  It's perfect for individuals  couples  families and everyone else.  I'm looking forward to coming back!!"),
("2017-02-26", "1481361", "Abigale", "Wayne and Kates place was great!!! The location was awesome and within walking distance to all the main beaches. They were extremely accommodating with all of our request and even suggested things for us to do when the weather wasn't great. We had a great time and would totally recommend them!! Thanks Wayne and Kate!"),
("2017-03-05", "1481361", "Phuong", "Kate and Wayne are the absolute best hosts! Accommodating  warm  friendly and always on hand to help whenever we needed. We've stayed at their beachfront place in Tamarama before  and didn't hesitate to stay there again. A++ Would stay again  in a heartbeat.Thanks guys!"),
("2017-03-11", "1481361", "Nicholas", "Wayne and Kate's house was everything we'd hoped for  and a lot more. The view is simply spectacular  the house itself tastefully decorated comfortable  and the little touches that make all the difference put the icing on the cake. You must stay here if you're looking for a little hidden beach oasis in Sydney's eastern suburbs. "),
("2017-03-22", "1481361", "Joe", "Amazing views of the beach and really easy to get to other local beaches. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2017-04-01", "1481361", "Fran", "Wayne and Kates place is in a great location looking straight out onto Tamarama beach. Accomodation is good - beds comfy  good kitchen and bathroom. Would stay there again. Jeff and Fran."),
("2017-04-08", "1481361", "Shiz", "This place is in an amazing location. The beaches are at your doorstep. The hosts were very helpful and thoughtful. Definitely worth a visit!"),
("2017-04-16", "1481361", "Cass", "Great view  its all about the view. Over looking Sydney's best beach. Perfect. Transport is a little hit and miss  it always is for the bus but an Uber is only $30 each way from the apartment to the city. Easy stroll along the cliff top to Bondi and all the eating and drinking it offers. Great location for a short break in beautiful Sydney"),
("2017-04-29", "1481361", "Nick", "Amazing space  lots of light and the best views of the beach. Wayne is a great host and we would definitely stay again. "),
("2017-05-05", "1481361", "William", "Hi  We really enjoy the beach view in front of the building.  I think the next tentant will definitely love the Nice home and the local life.Cheers "),
("2017-05-13", "1481361", "Kim", "A very lovely  tastefully and comfortably appointed apartment in a beautiful location. The view is amazing and you can hear the ocean :). It's a moderate walk to food/shops  but through a very nice area. Would happily stay again."),
("2017-07-08", "1481361", "Cameron", "Wayne and Kate's apartment is a fantastic place to stay  in so many ways. The location is second to none...right across from the beach  good coffee nearby and bondi beach is a short stroll away. Parking looks like it might be tricky  but we never had a problem. There is one flight of stairs to walk up  but even my bad knees coped and it's worth it for the view anyway!The apartment itself is gorgeous. Beautiful views  comfy beds  a well appointed 'library'   a selection of toiletries  lovely lamps  vibrant art and everything easy to find and operate thanks to a small information leaflet  or even a quick phone call...Wayne and Kate were both readily contactable and quick to help when we got a bit stuck at check-in!The apartment is very clean...and I'm pretty fussy when it comes to accommodation cleanliness. The linen is fresh  there are towels aplenty  blankets  pillows  complete kitchen...everything you need to be comfortable. I would highly recommend this apartment for up to 6 (Website hidden by Airbnb) a gem. "),
("2017-07-23", "1481361", "Alec", "Wayne & Kate's place was a great experience. The location is great and the view from the balcony was sensational. They made it a really easy with everything set out and done for us with a whole list of things to do in the area. I highly recommend this place as I hope to be returning whenever I'm in Sydney. Very fun weekend over all. Thanks guys !"),
("2017-08-11", "1481361", "Sravan", "The place is as advertised. Clean and with an absolutely beautiful view. Perfect access to our favorite beach in the area with an amazing walk/run/activity trail. Would go back in a heartbeat!!"),
("2017-08-13", "1481361", "Katrina", "Wayne and Kate's place was exactly as expected. Bright and airy and with views to die for. It has everything you need for a short stay and in a great location. Only a short walk away to Bondi but if you don't fancy venturing out there's no need to. Wayne was always quick to respond to questions prior to our stay and left a very handy manual with everything you could need to know about the apartment. The Street parking can be tricky at peak times but is untimed all day which is rare so close to Bondi. A great stay!"),
("2017-09-03", "1481361", "Sue", "We booked Wayne and Kate's place in order to be close (but not too close) to our daughter's wedding venue in Bondi!  It was perfect!!! The sunroom with its amazing view was the perfect place for hair and makeup to be done.  The apartment was spacious enough to give us all plenty of room and the relaxing vibe was just what we needed to keep us calm! The sound of the ocean and comfy beds ensured a great night's sleep.  Wayne and Kate are so thoughtful and accomodating  and their communication is brilliant. We would love to return for a longer and more relaxing stay next time! Highly recommended!!"),
("2017-09-11", "1481361", "Leonie", "The photography is misleading on two areas  they show a nice ambience inside but there are no photos of the exterior and of a building which is outdated and in need of significant repair.  The building is a serious disappointment.  Secondly the interior photography is selective in as much as it doesn't show details including aspects of disrepair.  The paint on the front door chipped and damaged  carpets are grubby and stained  the window coverings are damaged  their is rust on the internal hinges  windows fittings are corroded; laundry bench cracked   all matters that can easily be addressed.  A major disappointment other then location.  A very positive aspect was the owners commitment to sharing the daily tariff with the local surf life saving club."),
("2017-10-07", "1481361", "Frances", "This is the second time my family and I have stayed at Wayne and Kate's apartment in Tamarama. It really is that fabulous. A beautiful apartment to stay in  in the most fabulous location  and the most wonderful hosts you could imagine."),
("2017-10-22", "1481361", "Gautam", "Wayne and Kate's Tamarama beach apartment is a treat to stay. Excellent location and fantastic property. We loved every minute of staying here."),
("2017-11-24", "1481361", "Stephanie", "Great location  clean and comfortable home  accurate listing  accommodating hosts.  You can't go wrong staying at Wayne and Kate's place."),
("2017-12-02", "1481361", "Glen", "Wayne and Kate's place was amazing.  It's the perfect location on Tamarama beach (beautiful beach between and a short walk to Bondi and Bronte).  The house is fully stocked with amenities  beds were very comfortable  and spaces bright and cozy.  Highly recommended."),
("2017-12-30", "1481361", "Dave", "Wayne and Katie's place is amazing  perfect location on Tamarama beach with the Bonding to Coogee clifftop walk right on your doorstep. Wayne and Kate were perfect hosts  very easy to deal with and clearly are thoughtful and generous people. If we come back to Sydney we will have no hesitation in staying there again."),
("2018-01-05", "1481361", "Linda", "Wayne and Kate are truly super hosts and the view from the apartment speaks for itself."),
("2018-02-24", "1481361", "Angela", "We had a great time at Wayne & Kate's apartment. The location was amazing - we could get to three different beaches  all within walking distance  and the views from the apartment itself were unparalleled. Thank you for a wonderful stay!"),
("2018-03-03", "1481361", "Claire", "Amazing location right next to the Tamarama beach. The view is fantastic and the hosts have been great with all our questions! Really enjoyed our stay and can’t recommend it more :)"),
("2018-03-16", "1481361", "Thomas", "Location Location Location! Absolutely loved this apartment. Balcony with amazing view over the beach. A short walk to Bondi or Bronte with amazing cafes  restaurants etc. The host was really flexible and easy to communicate with. Would definitely stay here again and recommend it to anyone!"),
("2018-06-16", "1481361", "Aldys", "Wayne&kate's place was great  we really enjoyed our stay. great space  very clean and tidy.Special note on communication  they were a great host  very quick responses. They provide complete information about our stay  pretty much everything we need to know about the place.Very recommended!"),
("2018-07-07", "1481361", "Karina", "We had a lovely stay at Wayne and Kate’s apartment. The apartment is very comfortable  Wayne and Kate take a lot of care to make their guests feel welcome. The beds are incredibly comfortable  we hade everything we needed and the view is to die for. Watching the ocean from the balcony was both calming and rejuvenating. The cafe on the beach opposite serves great food and coffee and our kids loved the beach and the playground. Thank you Wayne and Kate for being so attentive and thoughtful  we had a wonderful time."),
("2018-07-28", "1481361", "Stephen", "Couldn’t rate it highly enough. Great place  great location  great hosts. It’s a ripper."),
("2018-08-06", "1481361", "Heather", "Wayne and Kate's place is ideally located with views over Tamarama beach. Very comfortable space and beds.  Quiet despite so close to everything.  Bus is 150m down the street. Very enjoyable long weekend stay. Excellent hosts with great and prompt communication"),
("2018-08-13", "1481361", "Katrina", "This is our second time staying at Wayne and Kate’s place and once again it was a wonderful stay. The house is in a great location and wonderfully equipped. You can’t complain waking up to views of Tamarama beach! Beautiful! Their communication is second to none. They provide full information on check in /the house  how to use everything and are quick to respond to any questions! 5 stars!!"),
("2018-08-19", "1481361", "Kate", "Perfect spot above the beach with fantastic views."),
("2018-08-26", "1481361", "Kate", "Wayne and Kate  what a knockout location! Your apartment was lovely and all that we hoped for. A pleasure to deal with you and a terrific place to stay. Kate and Richard & Co. "),
("2018-09-02", "1481361", "Sophie", "Fantastic spot and views. Perfect for a Sydney coastal getaway."),
("2018-09-09", "1481361", "Susan", "This was a great place to stay! Amazing views and very comfortable."),
("2018-09-30", "1481361", "Lauren", "Absolutely stunning location!"),
("2018-10-10", "1481361", "Laura", "Beautiful apartment great location  spacious with all amenities we needed. Beach is lovely. Wayne and Kate communicated wonderfully. We had gloomy weather and the view and location was still enjoyed."),
("2018-10-28", "1481361", "Sarah", "View is amazing  location is perfect. Unfortunately it was very windy while we there and the windows rattled quite loudly. Also  neighbors decided to have a large party and noise went on until early in the morning."),
("2019-01-07", "1481361", "Anne", "Outstanding accommodation  extremely clean  comfortably furnished   beautiful outlook over tamarama beach.  We loved it here!"),
("2019-02-02", "1481361", "Rebekah", "Wayne and Kate's place was perfect for a beachside weekend. There were three of us and the space was just right. Close to restaurants (about 15 minutes walk to Bondi) and overlooking Tamarama. Beds were comfortable and space to prepare meals if you are so inclined."),
("2016-10-02", "14921505", "Adam", "Amazing place  very clean on arrival. They were always available for any questions we had. It was a great stay! "),
("2016-10-07", "14921505", "Jeff", "Thoroughly enjoyed our stay  Bailey was a fantastic host  extremely accommodating. The property and location was better than we expected.Bailey had stocked the fridge and pantry with a few of the essentials for our arrival  a very welcoming touch. Bedrooms and living areas were large and very comfortable. Tranquil location  with beautiful views of Pittwater.Looking forward to our next stay at Bailey's place.  "),
("2016-10-29", "14921505", "Maebelle", "we loved our stay in avalon. place was amazing. views were great and the community was just lovely"),
("2016-11-05", "14921505", "Olesia", "Amazing house with direct access to the beach and private jetty. We had a ball! (Website hidden by Airbnb) you can think of IS in the house. This is not one of those properties that have ""RENTAL"" written all over it  this is a HOME. Breakfasts on the verandah overlooking  the water and the sound of waves crashing against the shore is something special. The house is large enough for a large group  where everyone is comfortably accommodated yet have enough privacy to feel completely disconnected from the group due to the bedrooms being located over three different levels. Tip: you might want to grab a sleeping eye mask as it get pretty bright in the house once the sun is up. "),
("2016-11-19", "14921505", "Liz", "Loved our stay at Bailey amazing home in Avalon! The quality of decor and all his pieces throughout the house very tastefully done. Didn't want to leave and the view from the deck is breathtaking. Down a few steps off the deck and you are swimming in the clear waters of Pittwater.Accommodated our large group very well and hope to return again. Thanks Bailey for the starter pack in the kitchen. Yummy! Great host! Cheers Liz"),
("2016-12-04", "14921505", "Rebecca", "An awesome and amazing house that just made for such a relaxing and easy weekend away. The view is just stunning and the house is very nicely decorated with all the essentials. Loved that the house had access to a private beach. Bailey was so easy to communicate with and always replied promptly to any questions. Thank you for making our stay so lovely."),
("2016-12-17", "14921505", "Susu", "Bailey was a great host! He responded immediately to the reservation and got us out of a sticky situation! The house is absolutely amazing! Has beach acess and the best view of Pittwater! We had the best backdrop and wedding photos! The house is super clean! Modern and comfortable beds. The 4 levels and total of 14 bedroom just gave everyone that extra room to breath and space to move! We will definitely be back!"),
("2016-12-26", "14921505", "Anne", "Great place  very special spot. Private access to the beach and spacious home  great for large groups. Go for it!!"),
("2016-12-29", "14921505", "Geoffrey", "Beautiful  tranquil location on beach. Excellent for entertaining and kids. Place was very clean and well-appointed. "),
("2017-01-15", "14921505", "Leah", "One of the most amazing places I have been to. 100% recommend it"),
("2017-01-22", "14921505", "Penny", "Had a great stay! Fitted our extended family very comfortably and we loved the location and the balcony view. The inclinator made things easy for our elderly guests as the house goes over several levels. Bailey was a great communicator and Paradise Beach is a quiet place to swim and full of character!"),
("2017-02-06", "14921505", "Jessica", "Our family enjoyed a fantastic stay at Beach Escape to celebrate my mum's 60th birthday. There was a lot of planning and logistics in the lead up to our stay and Bailey was always prompt and accommodating with questions. It's a great house for a large family  offering us the perfect bedroom configuration for 9 adults and 4 kids as well as plenty of living space so we weren't living on top of each other. We loved the beautiful Pittwater views and dining outdoors on the large deck facing the view.Beach Escape is also pet friendly which meant all our family were welcome. It was fantastic having the amenities of Avalon only 5 mins drive away but feeling like we were in a quiet secluded area far away from the hustle & bustle of Sydney. There's plenty of pedestal fans but no air con & blinds on west facing windows made for a hot stay on the days that reached almost 40 degrees. But it meant we made the most of the wonderful harbour beach down the stairs. Would highly recommend Beach Escape to large groups. "),
("2017-02-20", "14921505", "Maria", "This house is perfect for a large extended family group. It has so much room that you can go off and have a quiet time by yourself even if the house is fully occupied. The beds  bedding and towels are high quality  and the kitchen has everything you need to cater for a large group. The private beach and the hot tub are wonderful for just hanging out and relaxing. The house's many levels mean that even crying babies don't disturb others in the house.Waking up to the gorgeous views of the trees  boats and water can't be matched. I would highly recommend this house and would come back."),
("2017-02-28", "14921505", "Allan", "A very large home that can genuinely handle a larger group. Lots of retreat areas so people can spread out. Location is the quintessential waterfront Pittwater experience. The host was good on the communication and any issues or advice quickly addressed. Highly recommend this property"),
("2017-03-04", "14921505", "Natalie", "We were made to wait almost two hours out the front without any information from the host as to how to get into the house. Thursday was my actual birthday and this almost had us packing up and heading home - we were minutes away from cancelling the weekend as we had no way of getting in to the house we had booked for 12 guests. We then get inside and everyone starts to arrive and we all shower and use the toilets. By the time we come out the smell of raw sewage is so unbearable that we can't use the balcony for the dinner we had planned or open any windows on a hot day in a house that has no air con (not that air con was ever listed or promised however). The smell only got worse throughout the weekend as we continued to use the bathrooms. 6 out of 12 guests chose to leave on Friday as a result - ruining the weekend we had planned for my birthday. Two of the couples who left had travelled interstate for this. So they had paid for 3 nights and only got to stay 1 in rooms that stunk of sewage. This could have and should have been resolved on Friday or Saturday - but no solution was offered and we were expected to stay in a house that stunk of sewage. On top of this on Friday  as we bring items down from the car into the house we place two cases on a shelf along the kitchen wall and it comes off completely and lands on my foot. After looking at how it was constructed  a 30-50kg shelf was screwed together by 4 small screws and was never constructed to hold any sort of weight  making it a danger to guests. And lastly  the alarm. At 2.30am on the Saturday morning the house alarm (that we had been told did not work) began going off and woke everyone in the house. The four surrounding suburbs encountered a blackout and as a result the alarm went to auxiliary power and then went into alarm (the blackout is obviously not the owners fault) The alarm continued to go off for an hour and there was no information anywhere as to how to make it stop. We were left to figure this out for ourselves. The number we called inside the panel had no idea  the host was not contactable and the lady he put us in touch with suggested ""we push a couple of buttons"". The house should not have been rented out with the sewage pump the way it was and the host should have information on hand for his alarm system. We know that the host MAY not have known the pump was broken  but we did make him aware as soon as we noticed it within a couple of hours of arriving and no solution was offered for the three day stay. If we had..."),
("2017-03-11", "14921505", "Tammy", "A wonderful home away from home. There was enough space to cater and allow for our family of seven couples with little ones in tow. Beautiful view and location. The kiddies loved having their own private beach and bird visitors of cockatoos  kookaburras and lorikeets every day. Just a note to make sure the fridges are cleared of food prior to the next visitors stay. "),
("2017-03-19", "14921505", "Robyn", "This spacious property is truly amazing with stunning features and beautiful views on every level. Bailey's hospitality was exceptional. I would highly recommend this property for a relaxing holiday  especially for large groups of 6 or more."),
("2017-03-26", "14921505", "Greg", "Location is to die for and the beach perfect for regular visits. Great for little kids. The view from both living areas and many of the bedrooms is spectacular. Becuas each room is so beautiful  there were not arguments about who got which room. The living space is one of the most beautiful homely area for relaxing. All in all a most spectacular house. "),
("2017-04-16", "14921505", "Alfonse", "We had a group of 13 and all had a great time there. The house was clean and well equipped from the bathrooms to the kitchen. The house was spacious and having 4 bathrooms between a large group was definitely handy. A few items including milk and soft drinks were supplied and left in the fridge which was a nice touch. Can't fault this house. We all had a fun and memorable stay!"),
("2017-04-30", "14921505", "Veronika", "This house was so beautiful! The location was breath-taking and the house was a delight. The house plan is very well thought through  clean and homely. Our group loved the weekend away  would highly recommend. The host was also very accommodating :D"),
("2017-05-07", "14921505", "Jeremy", "What a great time! We will definitely be back. We stayed over with 5 families and each of us had our own space to hang out and relax. The property is very family-friendly and even our dogs had a fantastic time frolicking on the beach. The beds were super comfy and our host Bailey was available at any time to answer any queries promptly. Thanks Bailey  looking forward to the next trip. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-06-11", "14921505", "Christy", "A wonderful spot! We had 10 adults and 5 children in our group and we all had a wonderful time! There were lots of living areas so everyone could have their own space. The private beach was a hit with the kids and adults alike. Amazing sunsets  and we kept warm with the log fire. The kitchen was on the small size for the size of the house - in saying that  I would happily return!"),
("2017-06-24", "14921505", "Kelley", "We had the most amazing time. The house was perfect in every way to accommodate our large family. The location is central to everything and right on the beach. It was also perfectly for the children.The water views were stunning  the living space was beautiful with the open fire place and the beds were really comfortable.We can't wait to return and stay there again  it was truly the most perfect place."),
("2017-06-28", "14921505", "Erica", "Thanks for a great stay Bailey! The house was amazing and miss waking up to that incredible view! Would definitely stay here again."),
("2017-07-03", "14921505", "Oliver", "Great location spacious accomodation Great views"),
("2017-07-07", "14921505", "Mark", "My wife and 4 kids had a great week in the house. Location and house were both great and Bailey sorted out everything we needed. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-07-13", "14921505", "Jana", "Bailey has been an absolutely perfect host - he has gone out of his way by providing everything you would need to stay here. The house is amazing and the views and location are spectacular. It is all of the little things that made our holiday feel just like home. I would highly recommend staying here with families and friends."),
("2017-07-23", "14921505", "Rachel", "Beautiful home  the pictures don't do this place justice. The spa overlooking the water at sunset - absolutely perfect. Very spacious  amazing views of the water from all the rooms. Close to the supermarket  restaurants  bottle-o. Great location. Perfect size for 10 guests  and would comfortably accommodate 14. Bailey was great with communication. Can't wait to plan another stay  will definitely recommend to friends and family. "),
("2017-08-06", "14921505", "Ben", "Beautiful views  spacious living areas and sleeping quarters  quiet neighbourhood. Very little to complain about. Bailey is very responsive and helpful for any queries."),
("2017-09-24", "14921505", "Marie", "The house is as described and more.  We hosted our mums 80th birthday here and she was blown away by the location.  We had 14 family members staying all having their own great size rooms and areas so we did not feel on top of each other.  I would recommend and will be back again."),
("2017-10-04", "14921505", "Roger", "This place looks great in the photos but really exceeded our (Website hidden by Airbnb) was perfect for our family group of three generations with bedrooms on different levels and a number of living spaces. It was spacious  comfortable and stylish and such an idyllic location. Bailey was a great host. He promptly responded to our questions and we really appreciated the early check-in and late check out. We really didn't want to leave. Highly recommended. Many thanks Bailey.Roger"),
("2017-10-08", "14921505", "Patrick", "The celebration of our Mum's 90th was made very special by a magnificent house in an amazing location. The house had everything we needed or could wish for.  At one stage we had 12 people and it never felt crowded.  All communication was clear and very prompt - a great host."),
("2017-10-29", "14921505", "Jennifer", "This is a wonderful house in a stunning location. We celebrated my 60th birthday here over the weekend. We were a large group of 12 adults and 2 toddlers and the house suited us perfectly . We liked the multiple living areas and we had all our meals on the gorgeous balcony overlooking the view . The 3 fridges were much appreciated. It was fabulous to have our own beach with the toddlers !"),
("2017-11-12", "14921505", "Mathew", "The house is amazing  spread over four levels and with spectacular views of Pittwater. We used the house as a base for our wedding in Avalon and it was perfect to have family all stay under the same roof as well as to get organised in the morning of our big day.The hosts are great and are quick to respond to messaging and with Netflix  Fox and wifi available it was easy to entertain the kids.Thanks again  we hope to come back someday to relive such an amazing time away."),
("2017-11-20", "14921505", "Jon & Silvana", "A lovely house with great views over the bay and water. Lovely bedrooms  lounge areas and large decks for relaxing. Stairs down to the private beach and sea pool.Built down the hillside with multiple levels with a self-contained area on lowest level. Although quite a few stairs - only an issue if anyone has mobility restrictions."),
("2017-12-02", "14921505", "Samantha", "A group of 11 of us (all adults) stayed at Bailey's place last weekend for a wedding  and it was amazing! I would highly recommend staying here. The place is exactly as described  check in was super easy and Bailey was very responsive and chilled out. The views were breath-taking  we had plenty of space (most couples had own bathrooms or shared between 2)  and the beds were really comfy too. Pretty much had our own private beach as well! All in all  a very relaxing stay and perfect place to escape and unwind. Thanks for a great stay Bailey :)"),
("2017-12-28", "14921505", "Louise", "Brilliant location and house is spacious and very well thought out. Bailey is always around to help out if you have any questions.Thoroughly enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-01-04", "14921505", "Julie", "A beautiful home in a stunning location. Perfectly located close to everything but very tranquil and peaceful. Visited by birds  galahs  cockatoos and lorikeets every morning. The house was so comfortable for 10 of us  so much room and lots of privacy. Couldn’t have asked for a better house for our family reunion. Bailey was very amenable with check in and check out.  We had our grandmother who loved the inclinator  young kids who adored the beach and the wildlife  and adults who enjoyed their evening cocktail on the beautiful balcony watching the sun set.  A perfect house for everyone. Thanks for a memorable stay."),
("2018-01-13", "14921505", "Victoria", "Such a tranquil location with stunning views everywhere you look. The house is perfect for a large group and communication with Bailey has been fantastic  he has been very quick to respond. A little car juggling may be required however a small price to pay for this top location."),
("2018-01-20", "14921505", "Justine", "Our stay at Beach Escape was terrific. The location is incredible and although it doesn't have it's own private jetty  there is a public one 100m away. We spent the days boating on beautiful Pittwater and at the basin and retreated back to the house at dusk. Bailey's house in fabulous  with incredible views across Pittwater. Each level has a lounge room and private space for guests. We certainly would love to come back and stay at the Beach Escape."),
("2018-02-18", "14921505", "Carey", "The situation of this house on Pittwater with steps down to a small  perfect beach and swimming area is astounding.  Every evening we watched the sun set from the main terrace  through the trees  over the boats and behind the hills on the far side of the bay.  Although slightly tired  the house was robust and very well designed  cascading down the hillside with light  views and seating areas at all levels.  Everything worked (excellent shower pressure) and we especially appreciated the enormous supply of soaps  shampoos  white towels and stripey beach towels.  We will return as often as we possibly can for more of this magic."),
("2018-02-25", "14921505", "Devanne", "This is a perfect getaway beach house. The beach is right below the house and at night there is a warm jacuzzi to relax. Highly recommend to stay at this house if with a huge family!"),
("2018-03-03", "14921505", "Alysia", "We absolutely loved staying at Bailey's amazing beach palace. You couldn't have asked for a better location overlooking the water. The layout of the house is unique and the styling is chic. We thank you bailey for your hospitality."),
("2018-03-11", "14921505", "Sally", "Wow what a place! We had the most amazing time staying at this property. Bailey the host was very easy to deal with and was quick to help with any issues we had. The access to the beach from the property made our stay. It’s a perfect beach to relax the day away and great for the kids too! The house is huge and can easily accommodate large groups or a few families without getting in each other’s space. The location is beautiful for walks  some amazing houses and greenery to look at. Also there is a cute little cafe just up the road for morning coffees if needed within walking distance. The main town is gorgeous with lots of shops and cafes to keep any one occupied. Loved our stay. Thanks so much."),
("2018-03-22", "14921505", "Michelle", "This was an amazing property that impressed all of our guests. The house was very well presented and clean. Everything was provided and much appreciated. We unfortunately had a rainy week but made the most of the spa. The multi levels made for a great way to get some privacy and shift people around for entertaining. We will definitely book again."),
("2018-03-25", "14921505", "Brent", "Bailey’s place is exceptional and comfortably fits 14 people without feeling like you’re living on top of each other. There are spacious rooms on each floor and views from every level. We absolutely loved staying here and thoroughly recommend it to anyone."),
("2018-04-02", "14921505", "Harmony", "Amazing house & location. I suggest you prepare ahead so that you take everything you need  as in groceries with you  and then stay  relax and unwind! We’d definitely stay again."),
("2018-04-16", "14921505", "Elizabeth", "This is a superb place. We had family visiting from overseas and the generous space was perfect for our group. All bedrooms are well-appointed and beds are incredibly comfortable. The house was very clean  and the kitchen had everything we needed. Views over Pittwater are spectacular - we enjoyed swimming and soaking in the spa - and the neighborhood is quiet. The walk to Avalon Beach is easy and peaceful. Bailey was a great host - check in and check out very straightforward. Would love to stay here again sometime!!"),
("2018-06-17", "14921505", "Brett", "Beautiful spacious house on the waterfront. Whether inside or outside there are plenty of great areas in a fantastic location. Different floors allow guests your independence. Would recommend"),
("2018-06-30", "14921505", "Thu", "A perfect retreat with perfect view! We were a big group and yet didn’t feel on top of each other. The outdoor hot spa with view over Pittwater was definitely a highlight. The direct access to the beach was a great bonus. Bailey was a fab host  very responsive and accommodating. Some of the cabinets and drawers could be more tidy and the bbq wasn’t cleaned properly  but we had a fab stay overall and would recommend the house to other travellers. We’ll definitely love to stay again."),
("2018-07-08", "14921505", "Kim Lan", "Thanks bailey! Your home is beautiful myself and my guests enjoyed every hour of our stay. There were so many rooms and levels that we could just have our time if we needed. Everything about the trip was perfect I would defidefinely come back  perhaps in summer this time! "),
("2018-07-15", "14921505", "James", "Bailey is very responsive. Beautiful place and awesome location. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-07-28", "14921505", "Zoe", "Need to get away with some friends to chill and connect? Baileys beach escape is perfect! Beach off the back garden  tonnes of room for time to yourself and great views from nearly every room. "),
("2018-08-05", "14921505", "Nikki", "Amazing property  great host & perfect location! "),
("2018-09-09", "14921505", "Angelica", "14 lovely ladies had a lovely time at this beautiful house with amazing views from almost every room location is perfect close to many amenities and activities."),
("2018-09-23", "14921505", "Emmanuel", "Really enjoyed the place and its location. The place was amazing!"),
("2018-10-01", "14921505", "Elizabeth", "Wonderful long weekend away at Bailey’s house.Beautiful beach front location with amazing views from the spa and outdoor eating area. Everyone had a comfy bed and their own bath and beach towel. Plenty of pillows and blankets. So much space for a large group - lots of little hideaway areas to relax / get privacy.Kitchen was well stocked with everything you could need  including ice. So many thoughtful extra touches such as body wash  shampoo and books to borrow! Highly recommend."),
("2018-10-07", "14921505", "Liz", "The house is lovely. Lots of bedrooms and separate living areas  so great for a large group. We had a wonderful stay. Thanks so much. Highly recommend "),
("2018-10-14", "14921505", "Marcia", "Baileys house is great there are many areas to have your own space. Beautiful view and decor very relaxing and tasteful. Can’t wait to stay again! Thanks againChris & Marcia Allen"),
("2018-10-20", "14921505", "Emma", "Absolutely stunning house and location ! Great accomodating host! Perfect place for our wedding weekend! Thank you Bailey !"),
("2018-11-03", "14921505", "Colin", "This is a tremendous location for a weekend of pure enjoyment. The house has everything from delightful living spaces to cosy bedrooms and a view ovewr Pittwater which cannot be  beaten.  Couple this with your own little beach and you have something special."),
("2018-11-14", "14921505", "Chayakorn", "Thank you very much. We really enjoyed and this was absolutely great  & fantastic place for us.Recommended!"),
("2018-11-17", "14921505", "Cassie", "Great place with plenty of space. Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-11-25", "14921505", "Dimitri", "House is run down needs maintenance spa didn’t work deck rotten next to spa kids foot nearly went through. House cleanliness not to satisfaction"),
("2018-12-08", "14921505", "Tina", "This place is amazing!! The house and views are better than expected and everything is provided so all you have to do is relax or for those that’s up for adventure there’s so much happening around the area. Bailey has been great and we have already booked to stay again during the new year weekend!"),
("2018-12-27", "14921505", "Natalie", "Bailey’s home on Whale Beach is gorgeous. Palatial and nuzzled into a hill  it is essentially a vertical house with many bedrooms and lots of different common areas to relax  including three decks. The home is extremely comfortable and I highly recommend it. Plus  Bailey was incredibly nice and communicative while planning our stay. Overall a 10 out of 10!"),
("2019-01-01", "14921505", "Tina", "Again we had an amazing time. The place was clean  beds were comfortably and checkin was a breeze. The view and backyard down to the beach is what this place is all about!  Bailey is a great host  we will no doubt stay again. Just a note for those that cannot stand heat the place has no air conditioning so it gets very hot during day and night but there are fans and the beach right at the doorstep to cool off."),
("2019-01-12", "14921505", "Max", "The house was amazing  as were the views. A really lovey weekend with friends. Wish we could have stayed longer."),
("2019-01-19", "14921505", "Francesca", "Such a beautiful home! Perfect for friends or families as there is so much space to have a bit of time apart. The location on the beach and the hot tub were added bonuses! We walked down to Clareville Kiosk for a delicious dinner as well. Such a perfect weekend! Thanks Bailey :)"),
("2019-02-03", "14921505", "Emma", "Bailey was an outstanding host. Easy to communicate with and the house is amazing. What a spectacular view! Thanks Bailey."),
("2019-02-10", "14921505", "Michelle", "Nice beach escape! Lovely view to wake up to each morning.  Many areas to gather with the family. Might get a little hot in the summer tho  as there is no air-conditioning. But many fans provided. Place needs a little more maintenance but overall still cozy and nice. Good responsive host too."),
("2019-02-17", "14921505", "Lauren", "We had a great weekend. House and location are beautiful"),
("2017-01-01", "15060713", "Katie", "Great place to stay  everything worked smoothly with key pick-up and good communication. It's a quiet street so a good night's sleep  yet just a short walk to some great places for breakfast. Really convenient for getting everywhere with the train station just 5 mins away too. "),
("2017-01-10", "15060713", "Olga", "Большая уютная квартира со всем необходимым для комфортной жизни. Расположена в 5 мин от вокзала  в спокойном районе.  До оперы пешком 40 мин  или на метро 3 остановки. Отличный интернет  чистота и порядок. Гибкое время заезда и выезда. Хозяин отзывчивый и доброжелательный  постоянно на связи   общительный и надёжный.Очень рекомендую на любой срок проживания."),
("2017-04-21", "15060713", "Matt", "Location is great and the pool and tennis court are a bonus.  The apartment was quiet and the host easy to communicate with.  I would happily recommend this apartment for anyone wanting to explore Sydney."),
("2017-06-26", "15060713", "Bonnie", "Andrei's place was a delight to stay in  between the tennis court and fussball perfect place for an active person to have plenty of fun  without even leaving the building."),
("2017-08-07", "15060713", "Alexandra", "Great location and fantastic rooftop garden/pool area. Very secure and accessible. Not far from all the main attractions and a ver comfortable apartment. Would defibitley recommend to couples."),
("2017-10-29", "15060713", "Xin Yu", "Had an enjoyable stay at Andrei's place - comfortable  spacious and convenient location :)"),
("2017-11-04", "15060713", "Jennifer", "Andrei’s place is a comfortable unit close to the sights of Sydney. I would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-02-18", "15060713", "Andres", "Great location in the coolest neighborhood of Sydney  next to great restaurants & bars  25 min bus ride to Bondi beach. The apartment has everything you need to have a comfy stay. If you care about having the full amenities showed in the pictures  then ask Andrei to make sure the pool & the tennis court are fully functional before booking."),
("2018-03-04", "15060713", "Connor", "Great stay in a very central location. Nice apartment with everything you need. Andrei was very easy to communicate with."),
("2016-10-01", "15245956", "Aman", "Charlie is an excellent host  great place in an excellent location. Perfect if you want to spend a few night in the city. "),
("2016-10-14", "15332652", "Brooke", "Lilian made the stay lovely  the place was extremely clean. Lilian went out of her way to organise an iron when I needed one which was a huge help. She also wrote me a lovely list of places to eat around the location and they were awesome suggestions! "),
("2016-10-22", "15332652", "Mohan", "Lilian is a good host. She has welcomed me with a smile and made sure I know everything about my accommodation. Her communication is very good and made sure she managed every small thing. Will stay with her again. Lilian's location is very close to Redfern train station and it saved me a lot of time."),
("2016-10-28", "15332652", "Noelene", "Lilian's place is in a quiet street with excellent access to train and food places.    Clean. Secure comfortable. Lilian is friendly and helpfu."),
("2016-11-24", "15332652", "Natalie", "Location is really close to the train which was crucial to my stay. The house was really minimalistic/clean. I was staying there for a month so I wish the kitchen had been a little better supplied. Internet worked well. All three rooms are available to rent so  I do wish there hadn't been as much traffic with other Airbnb guests checking in/out. Lilian herself was almost always available if I had questions  needed anything or simply locked myself out of my room. "),
("2016-12-03", "15332652", "Matthew", "Lilian and her Mum were very accommodating allowing me to check-in early. Her place was clean  tidy and close to transport - very convenient!"),
("2016-12-13", "15332652", "Pilar", "The room is good value  clean  with access to a good shower and close to public transport. It would be excelent if it there was a bed under the mattess :) Lilian is lovely and makes you feel at home"),
("2016-12-31", "15332652", "Hillary", "A great place to explore the city from. Less than a 5 minute walk to Redfern station  which gives you easy access to the whole city. Great house and great hostess! Thanks Lilian!"),
("2017-01-04", "15332652", "Doug", "My stay with Lilian was my first using Airbnb. I was very impressed. Lilian was very quick to respond and was flexible with my check-in time. A definite plus  having just gotten off a long-haul flight.The place was centrally located  a few steps from a major train station. Despite this  the house was quiet at night  making it easy to attend to my jet lag. The house was also clean and well maintained.I would definitely recommend staying here."),
("2017-01-12", "15332652", "Louisa", "Lilian's place was just perfect. Gorgeous  clean and super central. I didn't meet Lilian in person  but her brother was kind enough to let me in and was only ever a text away (Lilian was put if town). Probably the best place I've stayed in Sydney! "),
("2018-01-04", "15332652", "Martin", "Super charming little house mere steps from Redfern Sta. Lilian and her housemates are great hosts who made me feel very welcome. Highly recommended."),
("2018-01-10", "15332652", "Chloé", "The room and the house were so cute! Very well designed! I really enjoyed the little garden (I had my breakfast there  just perfect!) Lilian and her fried are really friendly and lovely! Gave me advices ect... Can not expected better! Next time I sydney i already know where I will stay!Thank you so much Lilian! Was perfect !Xxx"),
("2018-01-17", "15332652", "Michaela", "I couldn't have wished for a better start to my trip to Australia.lilian and her entourage where exceedingly friendly  welcoming and helpful.the room was very elegant in a reduced style.everything  was kept spick and span.you needed sunglasses IN the house for every surface was (Website hidden by Airbnb) was a lovely experience.hope we meet again and best of luck with your projects  lilian!"),
("2018-03-04", "15332652", "Kristy", "Lilian was a great host! I stayed at her place for 2 weeks whilst relocating to Sydney. It is an amazing location  super close to the train station but also walking distance to the centre of Sydney. She was very responsive to email and any questions I had via text once I was staying with her. The house is exactly as shown in the pictures and was always very clean. Lilian was really helpful in terms of local advise and is a very friendly host. I would highly recommend staying at this great terrace house!"),
("2018-09-30", "15332652", "Magdalena", "Great location. Lilian made the arrival and leaving process easy  with very prompt communication"),
("2018-11-01", "15332652", "Zhiyuan (Ryan)", "Lilian's house is a perfect place. Great location  5 minutes walk to the Redfern train station or bus station  which can take you to almost everywhere in Sydney.  Many good restaurants and bars in 10 minutes walking distance. The house is super clean  tidy and stylish. The guest bedroom is very quiet  bright with natural light. The bed is also very comfortable. Lilian and Dave are very nice hosts  they are thoughtful  caring and easy-going.  They made me felt like being home on the first day. They are also very generous  did everything to help me when I stayed in their place. I highly recommend Lilian's place."),
("2018-11-05", "15332652", "Frank", "Lilian and David were very friendly and obliging. Their house is great  in a quiet street yet close to transport. Redfern is a great neighbourhood. Thanks  Lilian and David"),
("2018-11-18", "15332652", "Miranda", "A very homey and comfortable house. Extremely convenient (Redfern station was right around the corner!) too :)"),
("2016-10-13", "15312988", "Wilhelm", "This is a great place to stay! Very clean and fresh apartment  close to beautiful coogee beach and easy to travel around in Sydney. The hosts are great  made you feel welcome and had good communication. I strongly recommend this place!"),
("2016-10-30", "15312988", "Dung", "Cindy is lovely  easy going and very pleasant to talk to. The house was very cozy and clean. Slightly away from the city but has bus right outside that goes directly to the city which is very good. There are many buses slightly longer opposite which takes about 5-10min walk. In the same area  it has restaurants and other shops so it pretty good and near all you need. Close to beautiful Coogee beach as well. Nice to stay at Cindy place. "),
("2016-11-04", "15312988", "Vusal", "The location of Cindy's house is great  quite accessible from the city. You can walk to the Coogee beach easily. The neighbourhood looked safe and is very quiet. Due to my busy schedule I couldn't spend much time at Cindy's house and chat with her. But the evening we met and sat down for a chat was great. She's kind  funny and very helpful. I wish her all the best and hope her place will be available when I visit Sydney next time."),
("2016-11-14", "15312988", "Xi", "Cindy is kind  lovely and easy going. Her house is nice clean and also  quite at night. There are many buses  around there and restaurants just in walkable distance.  I stayed there during my final exam period  and I felt like at home. Nice to stay at Cindy's place !"),
("2016-11-18", "15312988", "Horst", "Ich habe der Aufenthalt bei Cindy und Miki total genossen. Obwohl wir uns in den 3 Tagen kaum gesehen und gesprochen haben  hatte ich immer das Gefühl willkommen zu sein und habe mich total wohlgefühlt. Ein schöner Aufenthalt. Die Stadt ist schnell mit den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln zu erreichen und trotzdem liegt die Unterkunft ruhig. Alles in allem ein sehr schönes wenn auch einfach eingerichtetes Zimmer. Alles sauber und gemütlich. Vielen Dank nochmals."),
("2016-11-29", "15312988", "Oreofe", "This was a lovely home for a short stay. Cindy and Miki were welcoming  nice and informative. Cindy is punctual with her responses to messages. "),
("2016-12-07", "15312988", "Sabrina", "I loved that the place was in a quiet area and close to Coogee Beach. From there you can do the Coast Walk to Bondi Beach which is amazing."),
("2016-12-10", "15312988", "Chloe", "A nice place to stay. well equipped:)"),
("2016-12-27", "15312988", "Eamon", "This place is great!Cindy & Miki are lovely hosts and make their guests welcome.The room is very nice & the location of the apartment is good because Coogee beach is approx 20 mins walk away & bus stops outside lead to the City & Coogee beach.I recommend this place for your stay in Randwick :-)"),
("2017-01-03", "15312988", "Daphne", "The room was exactly as described  small but cozy and comfortable. Ideal for a short stay! It was very clean  and Cindy and Miki absolutely lovely hosts.Located close to shops  restaurants and the beach it was only a short bus ride into central Sydney.Highly recommend it!"),
("2017-01-08", "15312988", "Fernanda", "Ambiente agradável  limpo e bem localizado. Recomendo!"),
("2017-01-19", "15312988", "Ailin", "Lovely stay at Cindy and Micky's place  the location is quite convenient  although space of the room is a bit small. But it is so nice that Cindy provide me with fans in this hot weather! Rooms are also clean and elegant."),
("2017-01-27", "15312988", "Ben", "Great place to stay! Cindy was a great host. Check in and out was easy. Good advice on where to eat out."),
("2017-02-02", "15312988", "Johanna", "The room is really cosy and the bathroom is nice and clean. It was a good place to stay in Sydney eventhough it's not in the inner city  because the bus stop is right in front of the door. :) "),
("2017-02-09", "15312988", "Caitlin", "Fantastic! Very comfortable  clean and neat. Road noise started early but wasn't too bad."),
("2017-02-18", "15312988", "Chris", "I didn't really want to leave! This is a great place. The location is fantastic  10 mins to beach  5 mins to shops and bus stops directly outside the building. Couldn't ask for better. There is only one negative I can think of and even this is minor  no offer of teas or coffees for the morning. But that really doesn't take away from how much I enjoyed my stay! The bedroom was pretty much perfect  very comfortable. Bed was amazing! The apartment itself is very clean and tidy. And Cindy the host was great too! So friendly and welcoming. There is no doubt that I would definitely go back to this AirBnB room. Big thanks to Cindy for having me."),
("2017-02-24", "15312988", "Philipp", "Cindy is a wonderful host  I had an awesome time during my stay in Sydney! The place is close to Randwick and public transport and not far from the city by bus. "),
("2017-03-04", "15312988", "Aya", "No need to transfer to the city. This place is a good location and nice host:)Just wifi connection is not so good. I had a good sleep at there."),
("2017-03-08", "15312988", "Louise", "I didn't see too much of Cindy or Miki  but they were both lovely! Great apartment  super comfy bed and spotlessly clean. Thanks guys!"),
("2017-03-12", "15312988", "Hélène", "I havent met Cindy but her communication prior the checkin was perfect. I met Miki and her bf and they were really friendly and welcoming. I really enjoyed my chats with them and my stay was perfect. Highly recommend! I had a great time  20 min walking distance only from Coogee beach and the start of the coastal walk. "),
("2017-03-20", "15312988", "Thomas-Michael", "I had a good time staying with Cindy and Miki (although I saw Miki just one time). The room is cozy  comfortable and clean  so is the bathroom. The apartment has a great connection to public transport which allows you to be at Bondi Beach or downtown in about 30 minutes. I also enjoyed that there are restaurants close by.Cindy was welcoming and a great host.I would come again."),
("2017-03-26", "15312988", "Joel (Jeremiah)", "Awesome quiet place  yet right near everything you'd want. I stayed at Cindy' s place for 3 nights. Not once did I need a cab. There's a bus stop right at the front door  which is great since Australia's public transportation system is so convienant . Theres a fun lively area right near there with bars and restaurants. Getting in contact with Cindy was very easy. I would stay at Cindy's again. "),
("2017-04-02", "15312988", "Ella", "Cindy is extremely helpful and friendly. The place is lovely and cozy. and very clean & tidy.There is close to bus stops & beachSo easy to go where you want.There is perfect room for single travellersI hope to stay here when i come to Australia again .Thank you  again to Cindy & Miki :)"),
("2017-04-09", "15312988", "Deb", "Location was perfect for attending a workshop at the local University. Somewhere to sleep  friendly  clean and comfortable. Was able to walk to Coogee beach in 20 mins and the Uni."),
("2017-04-19", "15312988", "Haifei", "I really enjoyed my three-nights stayed in Cindy's apartment. It's clean  quite  comfortable and has a good location. "),
("2017-04-24", "15312988", "Keith", "Room located in a nice suburb  easily accessible to beaches and the airport"),
("2017-04-27", "15312988", "Caroline", "Clean  organised  well set up."),
("2017-05-11", "15312988", "Erin", "Welcoming friendly easy going host. Clean unit. Perfect location!"),
("2017-05-21", "15312988", "Sandra", "I really enjoyed staying at Cindy's place. She was friendly and helpful. The apartment was in a great location and so convenient to supermarket and cafes  everything was in walking distance and a short walk to Coogee beach."),
("2017-05-30", "15312988", "Poyi", "Location is perfect! Transportation wasn't a problem at all during my stay. The place is really neat and warm. Everything is great! Checking in and out are really convenient too. I really enjoyed my stay!"),
("2017-06-09", "15312988", "Maisie", "Cindy's place is a small  clean and cosy room to explore Sydney. Cindy and Mikki are friendly and helpful and gave me my own space. It is near Coogee beach but I missed a chance to go to the beach due to the rain while I was there. It is near several buses to get into town and also near cafes  restaurants and shops. "),
("2017-06-16", "15312988", "Victoria", "This is a very comfortable room in a lovely little flat. It's in a great location - close to UNSW and Coogee Beach  and the 374 bus line into the cbd is right outside. Excellent value for money  great communication with Cindy - highly recommend.   "),
("2017-06-27", "15312988", "Man", "Transportation is convenient  there are several bus routes to city within 30 minutes. Cindy's room is good for holiday and relaxation  it is near Coogee Beach and different parks. There also have shopping center  restaurants and supermarkets.  I will definitely recommend this room to all of you^^"),
("2017-07-02", "15312988", "Michael", "Enjoyed staying with Cindy and socializing a bit with her and her roommate. The space was very comfortable and in a convenient location to Randwick and Coogee Beach."),
("2017-07-09", "15312988", "Saskia", "People were friendly and the communication was great."),
("2017-08-15", "15312988", "Ali", "It was really nice stay. Room was really nice and very cosy. Everything was perfect. Cindy is very friendly and helpful host. Probably  my best experience of AirBnb so far."),
("2017-08-19", "15312988", "Cameron", "Cindy's place was comfortable  clean and quiet. Cindy was easy to comunicate with. The apartment included a comfy bed  a good shower  well equiped kitchen in a convenient location with a bus stop out the front door. Thank you  Cameron"),
("2017-08-24", "15312988", "Simone", "I stayed with Cindy while working at the University in Sydney for few days. The apartment is cosy  tidy and comfortable  well located close to everything (including the uni  Coogee beach  restaurants  cafes  supermarket  and a short bus ride to the city centre). Cindy and Claudio are a very welcoming couple  smart and friendly."),
("2017-08-31", "15312988", "Baharak", "Cindy and Claudio's place is very clean and smells fresh. I was in Sydney for work and needed to stay near UNSW. The location was perfect for me  walking distance to work  as well as walking distance to beautiful Coogee beach. There are a couple of nice restaurants nearby for food  as well as some nice cafe  though I only tried 22 Grams by Cindy's recommendation (and liked it so much that went there for breakfast twice more!). My room (which looks like they are turning into a home office) was small and cosy  and had all I needed. Several towels  a rack for clothes  as well as hot water bottle and a small heater that were very useful as Sydney was rather cold during my stay. The only non-pleasant point w.r.t. my stay was the very loud banging noise that was due to the construction in the building (upstairs I think). It would start rather early (sometime between 7 and 8). So if you are not a very early riser  and are booking in very near future  I recommend checking with Cindy and Claudio as to the level of noise. Otherwise  I had a great stay and highly recommend this place  specially if you want to be near Coogee as well as UNSW."),
("2017-09-09", "15312988", "Henry", "房间非常的干净 设备齐全 就是初到澳洲 英语不行 也没跟房东多交流交流 总体不错 好评!"),
("2017-09-19", "15312988", "Asyurah", "Everything about my stay with Cindy and Claudio had been lovely. Their cozy apartment was the perfect place to go home to after a day spent out exploring Sydney. The room was so comfortable  their place was accessible to everywhere quite easily and I had a totally wonderful experience altogether. My brief encounter with them also showed how friendly they are. This place is definitely recommended and I wouldnt hesitate to stay here again if I'm back in Sydney. Cheers. :)"),
("2017-09-23", "15312988", "Luci", "Cindy and Claudio were lovely  interesting  and welcoming. Communication was excellent  check in and check out flexible  the apartment was spotlessly clean  and the room was nicely equipped. It’s a residential street conveniently close to cafes  shops  and public transport. Less than 20 mins walk to UNSW."),
("2017-10-01", "15312988", "Steven", "Lovely couple who make you feel at home.  Perfect place for what I was looking for. Clean  close to the uni and lots of shops around."),
("2017-11-26", "15312988", "Mélanie", "Super logement sur Sydney : a 20min a pied de Coogee beach  très bien relié au centre et a l'aéroport avec un arret de bus face à l'appartement  commerces à proximité  jolie deco et surtout l'accueil  de Cindy et Claudio était adorable  ! Merci encore  Je recommande !"),
("2017-12-19", "15312988", "Maren", "Die Wohnung und das Zimmer waren sehr sauber und alles war vorhanden  wie beschrieben. Zum Strand sind es nur 15 Minuten und die Stadt ist mit dem Bus problemlos zu erreichen. Mit Cindy und Claudio habe ich mich super verstanden und ich würde das Zimmer immer wieder buchen."),
("2018-01-01", "15312988", "Inga", "Tolles Zimmer mit einem sehr sauberen Bad in unmittelbarer Umgebung zum Coogee Beach. Zu Fuß ist dieser in 10 Minuten zu erreichen. Cindy und ihr Mann sind jederzeit für Fragen zu erreichen und ein super Gastgeber. Ein Zimmer welches ich sofort weiterempfehlen kann  hier bist du für einen Aufenthalt in Sydney perfekt aufgehoben."),
("2018-01-08", "15312988", "Chloé", "Very nice place to stay  really clean and cute !Close to the beach and not too far from the city and airport.Cindy was really nice and helpful ! I will be back :D"),
("2018-01-14", "15312988", "Claas", "Cindy and claudio have been very helpful and friendly. Thank you guys so much!! can just recommend your flat to everyone else who's travelling on his own. Hope to see you again"),
("2018-01-17", "15312988", "Simone", "That’s my second time with Cindy & Claudio and it was great again! :-)"),
("2018-01-23", "15312988", "Sarah", "Cindy is very welcoming and her place is very sweet  clean  has everything you would need and close to both the beach and shops"),
("2018-02-02", "15312988", "Katelyn", "Absolutely lovely stay! Very clean and comfortable  in a wonderfully quiet area. Location was perfect and access to public transport was a breeze. Hosts were friendly and accommodating - I will definitely be staying again. Thanks so much! :)"),
("2018-02-08", "15312988", "StarCu", "I really enjoy my stay here. Cindy’s house is really cozy and very comfortable. And both Cindy and Claudio are very nice person. I will live here again the next time I come to Sydney."),
("2018-02-17", "15312988", "Tirtha", "Cindy and Claudio were both amazing hosts! Their apartment is very clean  cosy  and comfy. The location is great  next to many shops and Coogee Beach. Would definitely recommend for someone who needs a quick stay near UNSW or someone who is new to Sydney."),
("2018-02-25", "15312988", "Steph", "Had a short and sweet stay in Sydney. Cindy was very welcoming and friendly from the moment I arrived. Perfect location with easy accessible transport routes into the city and wherever I wanted to go. Would defiantly stay here again in the future."),
("2018-03-02", "15312988", "双跃", "I don’t wanna say anything. I was expelled."),
("2018-03-04", "15312988", "Ali", "Great apartment - lovely and airy. Cindy and Claudio are calm and peaceful  and the decor reflects their personalities. The bedroom faces a main road  but it is surprisingly quiet at night and didn't bother me. The location is great - you can walk to Coogee beach  the racecourse  the university; and the restaurants/supermarkets are very close. Randwick is a really cool suburb for travellers in Sydney to visit  so I'd definitely recommend a few nights in this BnB."),
("2018-03-09", "15312988", "Deepali", "It is a very clean and cozy place. Little far from the main city thogh but if you want to stay close to the beaches  it is the perfect location. I really enjoyed my stay here."),
("2018-03-14", "15312988", "Chiara", "What a lovely stay! The apartment is spotlessly clean  and the bed is very comfortable. It is a 20 minute walk to Coogee Beach  but several supermarkets and a fitness centre are less than 10 minutes walk away."),
("2018-03-19", "15312988", "Adam", "Had a great stay with Cindy and Claudio. Highly recommend to anyone looking for somewhere in the Randwick/Coogee area."),
("2018-03-27", "15312988", "Andrew", "Great place to stay  really nice hosts  super clean place  comfy bed."),
("2018-04-19", "15312988", "Cloudy", "I had a nice stay at Cindy's place. Cindy and Claudio are very friendly. The room is spacious  clean and comfortable. The location is great  with only a short walk to restaurants  shops and supermarkets. It is also very easy to get into the city center as the bus stop is just in front of the house. I would love to come back  when I visit Sydney next time."),
("2018-04-22", "15312988", "Alex", "Nice and close to UNSW  clean  great communication  good wifi. Overall excellent."),
("2018-05-15", "15312988", "Wayne", "Cindy and Claudio were welcoming and helpful. Bed was very comfortable  plenty of clothes storage  handy to bus stop to Sydney  and coogee. Shop close"),
("2018-05-18", "15312988", "Nicholas", "Cindy has an unbeatable location and is one of the friendliest  most organised hosts I've stayed with :)"),
("2018-06-19", "15312988", "Yuri", "The room was so clean and cozy and it was pretty big space for a person they were really thoughtful   polite and friendly i didn't have to wait to use a bathroom i'd love to go there again "),
("2018-06-24", "15312988", "Stephen", "Sunny room in very central location close to everything."),
("2018-07-13", "15312988", "Timothy", "Travelled solo to sydney and it was nice to have a great cosy place to stay in!!! The place is super clean and the hosts are so welcoming!!! Cant wait to be back the next trip ^^"),
("2018-07-16", "15312988", "Wang", "worthwhile"),
("2018-07-21", "15312988", "昊泽", "Perfect room and perfect host"),
("2018-07-28", "15312988", "Cloudy", "As my previous stay  I had a very comfortable stay at Cindy's place. The room is spacious  clean and very comfortable! Only a few minutes walk to the major shops and restaurants and the public bus stop is just at the door. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-08-13", "15312988", "Louisa", "The apartment is in a great location  very clean and excellent value. Thank you Cindy and Claudio!"),
("2018-08-20", "15312988", "Yuqiu", "Cindy’s place is fantastic! 15 mins walk to Coogee Beach  15mins to UNSW  bus to city is just in front of your door. The room is very clean and cozy  really sweet home for travelers.  "),
("2018-08-27", "15312988", "Sj", "Cindy's house is very clean and awesome. and They are very kind. So I can enjoy for my travel in sydney. I strongly suggest for you."),
("2018-08-31", "15312988", "珺青", "Clean and friendly. The bed is big and comfortable"),
("2018-09-15", "15312988", "Pedro", "The house of Cindi and Claudio is a very good place to stay Sydney  is only a few minutes walk to the beach and is easy to take a bus to the city.The flat is clean and tidy and the bedroom is very comfortable  Cindi and Claudio always help me whit all the questions I had  very kind people.I recommend the place. La casa de Cindi y Claudio es un muy buen lugar para conocer Sydney  queda a pocos minutos de la playa y es muy fácil tomar el bus para ir a La Ciudad. la casa es muy limpia y la habitación es muy cómoda  Cindi y Claudio siempre me ayudaron con cualquier duda que tuve y siempre muy amables  muy recomendado."),
("2018-09-17", "15312988", "莉", "Sorry for my late comment.This house is super good.I like it very much  near the Coogee beach and it is very quiet area.Cindy and Claudio are very nice .Especially the koala on the bed very cute.And also sweet recommendations:)I will choose again next time when I go to Sydney"),
("2018-09-25", "15312988", "Kate", "Lovely room  good location  and friendly hosts."),
("2018-10-07", "15312988", "Jana", "This is a wonderful place to stay. Cindy has everthing thought through for her guests  from the late-night check in to the neighbourhood information and hand-labelled little shampoo bottles in the room. Lovely neighborhood  quick walk to UNSW and verv convenient to catch the bus into the city."),
("2018-10-21", "15312988", "Amanda", "Cindy was very welcoming and easy to communicate with. The space was everything I expected  and it made my weekend easy and comfortable. Thank you!"),
("2018-10-29", "15312988", "Mareike", "Cindy is a really kind host and I loved to stay at her place. The room is cozy and perfect for one person.  Coogee beach is not far away and if you need to get to the city centre  then there is a bus stop just around the corner.  I would recommend and return again."),
("2018-11-02", "15312988", "Amélie", "Cindy was lovely and welcoming  the room was bright and airy and very clean. I’d highly recommend staying here"),
("2018-11-05", "15312988", "Jo", "Nice flat  great location for getting to the beach and into the city. Comfy bed."),
("2018-11-10", "15312988", "Adrienne", "Cindy and Claudio exceeded my expectations. They were very welcoming  quick to respond and took such good care of me (I had indigestion one night and Cindy gave me meds)! I really felt like I was staying with friends. Also  they keep their place very neat and clean. Would stay again! And again! Thanks so much guys!"),
("2018-11-17", "15312988", "Yong Zhi", "Nice location  close to UNSW and Coogee beach. Cindy and Claudio were very hospitable. The place was very clean. I would not hesitate to stay with them again."),
("2018-11-26", "15312988", "Yvonne", "Everything’s was good"),
("2018-12-04", "15312988", "Shauna", "Great apartment! Super clean and tidy  comfy bed and overall homey place to stay. Super close to the beach and very easily accessible to the city! Would highly recommend and very much enjoyed my stay there!"),
("2018-12-12", "15312988", "Silvana", "I would not recommend staying here  I did not feel comfortable at all. I felt like a bother or as if I was in their way. Claudio never introduced himself to me which made it very awkward to stay with them  he only spoke to me on the last night of my stay. Overall my experience was not great  the hosts were not very welcoming and I would recommend going somewhere else."),
("2018-12-16", "15312988", "Peter", "Highly recommend Cindy and her place. They were awesome and the room was perfect and great value."),
("2018-12-23", "15312988", "Hailey", "I enjoy the overall experience. - Cindy is very nice  thoughtful and willing to help and her husband is friendly. -The bedroom was clean and cosy. -It's convenient to go to the City and Coogee beach by bus."),
("2019-01-04", "15312988", "Theresa", "Cindy and her husband are really kind and helpful hosts. We had good conversations and they felt like good friends to me. It was great to stay with them!"),
("2019-01-14", "15312988", "Nathalia", "Claudio and Cindy are a really nice and friendly couple. You can ask them anything. Also the room was very nice and clean. Great place to stay!"),
("2019-01-22", "15312988", "Laura", "lovely place  very close and easy access to beaches and city!  lovely couple very kind and helpful! couldn't praise them higher."),
("2019-01-27", "15312988", "Maximilian", "Cindy and Claudio are such a greatly couple and wonderful hosts! Their home has everything you need for a great stay and even more. I barely slept that well anywhere than in this bed. Cindy and Claudio are always down for a chat and answer any questions. On top  they have been super flexible with my arrival and departure. Thanks for the pleasant stay and hope to see you soon!"),
("2019-02-10", "15312988", "Roza", "Friendly couple who give you your space when required. Very comfortable bed. Close to bus stop and 15 minute walk to Coogee beach. Thank you for a great stay!"),
("2017-01-14", "15436372", "Aquaria", "Amazing location and view  we had to extend our stay as we couldn't part with the view and outdoor living area.So close to have a swim or head to Bondi entertainment/shopping area. "),
("2017-01-19", "15436372", "Simon", "I've never had a better place to sit and look at a view for hours each day. The best."),
("2017-01-01", "15453288", "Carlos Roberto", "The apartment is very nice with a very good space and in  amazing location near the supermarket and public transport. There are a lot of beaches near the apartment and is easy to go to the center of Sydney. I recommend it."),
("2018-12-10", "15453288", "Martin", "The host canceled this reservation 14 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-11-20", "15652009", "Fombelle", "We had a Fantastic stay at Georgia appartement that was very well furniture and lot of space and great kitchen.The place is also quite and you are just wake up by birds.The location is perfect in the middle of COOGEE  with walking distance to beach and randwick for shopping and great cafes.Georgia is a great host and we'r looking forward to visit again.Merci et à Bientôt CECILE & OLIVIER "),
("2016-12-01", "15652009", "Frenn", "We enjoyed our stay. Thanks"),
("2017-01-02", "15665837", "Tatsuya", "He's so kind and helps us have a good time here. The room is clean and roommates are also friendly and helpful whatever you ask. I'm glad to stay here!"),
("2017-02-23", "15665837", "Ivan", "The host canceled this reservation 5 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-02-23", "15665837", "James", "The apartment is close to supermarket and food. Public Transport is around the corner 2mins to train station. The room is very well equipped and the house is amazing."),
("2017-01-01", "15719888", "Gaurav", "Bronwyn met us at the time mutually agreed to show us around the house. she was really friendly. We were emailed a house manual which had details one would require. The neighbourhood was quiet and we enjoyed the proximity to city and the convenience to coffee shops and bars. Would definitely recommend this place to our friends."),
("2016-11-16", "15721779", "Matt", "Nice  clean place. Nicole is great at communicating.  Central location"),
("2017-01-01", "15721779", "Marie-Catherine", "Nicole's place is a very nice apartment  with incredible view on harbour bridge and Opera House. It is modern and comfortable  easy to access Bondi Beach and downtown  bus stop just outside the house.Nicole is a very nice and friendly host.We spent a wonderful time there!"),
("2018-01-06", "15747156", "Alistair", "We are an ex Bronte Beach family and so we know the area well. We were thrilled to find such a gorgeous place to stay in such a fabulous position - so close to the beach and cafes yet so quiet and peaceful. We’ll be back if we get a chance!"),
("2018-02-18", "15747156", "Lexie", "If we could give Catherine’s air bnb 100 out of 5 we would. She is a generous host with beautiful home.We stayed as a family with 3 young children (5 3 & 1)  grandparents & us the parents. The 4 bedrooms rooms are huge - so everyone has enough space. Everything in the home is perfect - high quality bedding  toiletries & pantry essentials. The home itself is beautiful. There is a stunning deck to sit out on to enjoy the view of the ocean. There is a grassed area for the kids to run. The home has multiple tvs with Netflix. Catherine is lovely sourcing toys & books for our children.The location is literally 150m from Bronte beach. It is opposite the grounds of Bronte House - so you feel as though you are surrounded by greenery (not in hectic central Sydney). The playground is perfect for young children with plenty of shaded areas & in easy access of local take always for meals in the park (we had pizza & fish & chips most evenings in the park with the kids).Accessing the city is easy with buses directly to Bondi junction then train to city.If you are thinking of visiting hectic Sydney as a family - Catherine’s home makes it a relaxing  thoroughly enjoyable experience.Thank you again. We will be back!"),
("2018-11-25", "15747156", "Pat", "Location location location.  Close to the beach and cafes   this was a great house for our family.  Very comfortable and clean  and communication with Catherine was so fast and easy.  Thanks for your hospitality!"),
("2016-11-05", "15650737", "Rebekah", "Awesome place! Host was very friendly  loved the room set up. Overall positive experience  would highly recommend "),
("2016-11-09", "15650737", "Michael", "Nice home  great for solo travellers that need accommodation for areas on interest near by."),
("2016-11-10", "15650737", "Steve", "Nice place :)"),
("2016-11-12", "15650737", "Janine", "We thoroughly enjoyed Sarah's accommodation.   We were made to feel very welcome.  The room was very clean  spacious and we enjoyed the doors opening out to the pool.  Was nice to be away from the busy city but only a 15min drive from restaurants and shopping in Parramatta. "),
("2016-11-19", "15650737", "Trish", "Sarah was a great host. Very helpful and welcoming. The accommodation was neat and tidy and suited us perfectly for our short trip to Sydney."),
("2016-11-22", "15650737", "Ken", "Sarah family is very friendly and nice. We have dinner together and chat everything. It is nice to stay at her place as it is clean and tidy. Sarah even text me whether want to have some orange juice for my kids as the weather is very hot during our stay. Will definitely recommend staying at their place."),
("2016-11-23", "15650737", "Hanis", "Quick reply from the host. Easy to communicates. A very nice place to stay for family or friends."),
("2016-11-25", "15650737", "Nechelle", "Good host  clean room  good value. But we encountered some dog barking issues whenever the host was not around. "),
("2016-11-29", "15650737", "Nick", "Sarah is a fantastic host! Very helpful and friendly! The room was extremely clean. Highly recommended!"),
("2016-12-09", "15650737", "Sonya", "We were happy to stay here. Public transport is close. Sarah is very friendly and made us feel comfortable. If you want 5star it's not but if you are happy with 4+ you'll be fine. Location was great for us as it was close to public transport and close to drive to shopping centre. Bathroom off garage which is separate to the room but it was very clean. Parking on street in what seemed to be a very safe area we had no issues. Quiet residential area lots of trees and birds."),
("2016-12-11", "15650737", "Toni", "Lovely host & accommodation"),
("2016-12-13", "15650737", "Danny", "My group of 5 guests had an enjoyable and comfortable time at Sarah's cozy home. It is conveniently located between nature to the east and landmarks to the west. We're also very appreciative that Sarah was willing to go out of her way to accommodate our living requirements"),
("2016-12-24", "15650737", "Mark", "Sarah is lovely  but she hadn't attended to some very basic maintenance."),
("2016-12-25", "15650737", "Ravi", "Perfect place for pet lovers and was really good place..."),
("2017-01-02", "15650737", "Eddie", "Sarah is a really nice host. Support our need such as cook tools and storage. We had a great experience in this house."),
("2017-01-09", "15650737", "Shaun", "Big thanks to Sarah for her accomodation! We had a great time staying at her Airbnb. The place is in a nice peaceful area which is near the Norwest Business Park where you will find lots of shops and restaurants. It is also close to public transport. Sarah was very helpful with everything. Highly recommend this Airbnb to everyone!"),
("2017-01-15", "15650737", "Joy", "A great place to stay the night. We were on our way from Victoria to Queensland  and Sarah's room was just right for our family. Lots of sleeping options and a great pool for the kids to splash in."),
("2017-02-20", "15650737", "Franck", "Perfect host! Lovely neighborhood"),
("2017-03-01", "15650737", "Crystal", "Great place! Clean  roomy and comfortable."),
("2017-03-04", "15650737", "Amrinder", "Nice place would go there again"),
("2017-03-07", "15650737", "Sao", "Thanks Sarah! Super stay with my family! Pizzas were great yesterday evening so don't worry!!!"),
("2017-03-11", "15650737", "Tanya", "Lovely stay. Convenient and comfortable. Sarah's hospitality was friendly and helpful. Thank you."),
("2017-03-19", "15650737", "Chan", "Sarah was very lovely. Helpful and always easy to contact if needed. The place was clean and comfy. Location was perfect for when we visited my church at Hillsong -Hills campus. Would definitely stay here again and highly recommend Sarah's place :)"),
("2017-03-24", "15650737", "Mohammad", "The place was really clean and tidy. A microwave oven would be helpful. Sarah was a really nice and kind host."),
("2017-03-31", "15650737", "Rebecca", "Sarah was a very helpful host who was there when we needed her and who we otherwise didn't see. The room is nicely furnished and quite comfortable. The bathroom is shared with the host's laundry and has a separate entrance as stated in the description. The bed was good (soft) and there were basic kitchen amenities which was very handy. This was an excellent place to use as a base while visiting the area. Thank you for your hospitality."),
("2017-04-09", "15650737", "Rekha", "It was wonderful stay..."),
("2017-04-15", "15650737", "Maimunah", "all ok...only we need microwave"),
("2017-04-22", "15650737", "Alexandria", "Sarah was flexible with the check-in and made things convenient for us. She ensured that we had privacy but also checked in when she could to make sure that all was good. No kitchen (as listed) but the mini fridge and kettle were helpful. Location was convenient with a few minutes walk from the bus stop. Our only surprise during the stay was the dog which was doing it's job loyally but got used to us pretty quickly"),
("2017-04-29", "15650737", "Katrina", "We had a great stay! Sarah is a really friendly host and was very willing to answer any queries we had. Room is very clean and has everything you need particularly if you just need a place to stay for just a few nights! Comfortable and felt private and quiet."),
("2017-05-08", "15650737", "Michael", "We had a great stay at Sarah's place. She was a very friendly host and the neighbourhood felt very safe and peaceful."),
("2017-05-14", "15650737", "Mardi", "A quiet and spacious room. Thank you Sarah"),
("2017-05-20", "15650737", "Zac", "Great place. Exactly as advertised."),
("2017-05-26", "15650737", "Janu", "the stay was okay with a great and friendly host.it would be better if there is a heater in the room as it was freezing cold in the night. otherwise there was no any other problems."),
("2017-05-29", "15650737", "Sally", "Sarah's place was exactly as described. Bathroom is separate to main room as outlined in the description  which was fine apart from moving between the two areas in the cooler morning weather. Clean and all basics provided. Sarah was accommodating for check in/out times and attended to requests promptly.  We had a great stay! "),
("2017-06-04", "15650737", "Brent", "Very quiet area  great for a short getaway to Sydney. Sarah is friendly and helpful."),
("2017-06-04", "15650737", "Brian", "Excellent stay. Perfect location  exceptional host and was the perfect stop over for u in Sydney. Thanks Sarah for being a great host."),
("2017-06-09", "15650737", "Royston", "Great cosy house to stay in! Sarah is really friendly too."),
("2017-06-12", "15650737", "Coral", "Sarah is a very warm and welcoming person  and the accommodation was very clean and comfortable. I highly recommend staying at Sarah's place if you want somewhere that is comfortable and a very gracious host.Coral"),
("2017-06-22", "15650737", "Taylar", "Clean  quiet and comfortable space! Very nice neighborhood  exactly what my partner and I needed as we were working odd hours in the area. Sarah was very accommodating with check in/out times and very good with communication. Recommended! "),
("2017-07-02", "15650737", "Maren", "This would be a great place to stay for a family in summer.Sarah helped us to stay warm in winter with extra blankets and heaters.Lovely host and great communication!"),
("2017-07-07", "15650737", "Nigel", "House suited my familyPerfectly as a base for hillsongConference.   Room was as described and access was great allowing us to move in and out as required.  Sarah is friendly and very quick to respond to queries."),
("2017-07-10", "15650737", "Myra", "The place is perfect for us because it definitely accommodated more than 5 people. The place is clean and well presented. The neighbourhood is quiet too. Host Sarah responded to my enquiries."),
("2017-07-13", "15650737", "Jenny", "Sarah is a great host with a very convenient place in a quiet neighbourhood."),
("2017-07-18", "15650737", "Ragulan", "Comfortable space and was accurate to the listing. We went during winter and it was quite cold  Sarah was very accommodating in providing us a heater and any other things we needed. Sarah is very easy to communicate with as well. You had to walk out through the veranda to get to the washroom  so it was a bit cold but I wouldn't see a problem with this during the warmer months. I would definitely recommend the stay for families who need somewhere comfortable and dependable!"),
("2017-07-23", "15650737", "Saad", "Sarah was great host and was always reachable .her place is nicely located for  travelling around Sydney's  western suburbs .The kids had a Funtime  with the cats and the outdoors."),
("2017-07-26", "15650737", "Darcy", "Great space and great location for driving through Sydney."),
("2017-07-29", "15650737", "Nyree", "A comfortable stay for our family of 4.  The lounges were well past their best  but the beds were warm & comfy and we all slept well.  Our girls loved spotting the cats walking around the yard & we loved how close the property was to the family we were visiting.  Easy access to major roads & conveniences  yet really quiet.  Great communication by Sarah  too."),
("2017-08-06", "15650737", "Katherine", "Clean and comfortable.  Sarah was lovely."),
("2017-08-10", "15650737", "Guy", "Comfortable beds and linen. Relaxing neighborhood. Clean and well presented."),
("2017-08-23", "15650737", "Sofia", "Sarah's place is very accurate to the listing  so it is very easy to understand what to expect. Everything was great  but best of all were the soft beds and cats roaming around! The only downside would be how cold it is during the night as the bathroom is located outside and next to a garage  but apart from that  wonderful stay when you're in Sydney."),
("2017-08-27", "15650737", "Karen", "Sarah is a great host and her place suited us very well  comfy beds  excellent shower and location  we were very happy with our stay. We liked it that much we have already booked our next weekend away at Sarah's."),
("2017-09-04", "15650737", "Sameer", "Sarah was a very easy host to work with. Prompt communication. The house is clean but a little cosy."),
("2017-09-06", "15650737", "Verne", "Sarah was really nice and very accomodating. She greeted us as soon as we got to the place and gave us a quick tour . The place was really clean and quiet as well. Would recommend to other travelers."),
("2017-09-11", "15650737", "Fathima", "Perfect location and very cosy place."),
("2017-09-23", "15650737", "Beverly", "Such a lovely space! And such a great host! The beds were comfortable  the outdoor living space was convenient and the location was perfect! We had five people in the space and were very comfortable and well cared for! I highly recommend and look forward to visiting again myself!"),
("2017-09-30", "15650737", "Karen", "Sarah is an excellent host and goes out of her way to ensure that you are comfortable and have everything that you need.We will definitely stay again  thanks Sarah."),
("2017-10-12", "15650737", "Hannah", "Sarah's place was perfect for my event & her hospitality was beyond lovely. The neighbour kept leaf blowing which made the pool dirty but without me even asking the entire household went to so much effort to clean it before my guests arrived for the event despite having a broken cleaner! It was so sweet. The only thing that was a little tricky is that I didn't realise the private space did not have a kitchen  and the door kept falling off it's hinges. Luckily Sarah let me do my cooking in her family space so all was well. An amazing happy go-lucky host who deserves more appreciation! thank you so much! I hope to stay again :)"),
("2017-10-15", "15650737", "Kurtis", "Stunning place with a fantastic location  very friendly hosts and extremely well maintained house"),
("2017-10-15", "15650737", "Susan", "Sarah was a very thoughtful and friendly host. Her place was perfect for us with 4 children and convenient to the Valentine Sports Park. Loved the pool! And a great outdoor area for eating."),
("2017-10-23", "15650737", "Craig", "If you would like to stay in a lovely  home in a quiet part of the city. But with excellent parking or public trasport with in easy reach. Giver Sarshs home a go. Hope to see you next time we need a p k ace to stay."),
("2017-11-03", "15650737", "Melanie", "."),
("2017-11-12", "15650737", "James", "Much more than we expected  it was clean  tidy  and had everything we needed. The host was really kind and helpful  event after going trough any host's nightmare  a group of 20 year old that didn't leave on time and trashed the place. It doesn't have a kitchen  but you can easily prepare a meal  and eat at a 10 seat dinning table. We defenetly recommend to familys or any other kind of group! Thanks again"),
("2017-11-18", "15650737", "Rhiannon", "We loved staying at Sarah's place. It was everything we needed and perfect for the plans we had in the Hills district. Clean and tidy and Sarah is lovely and ready to help with anything we needed."),
("2017-12-16", "15650737", "Shaun", "Nice place with lots of sleeping arrangements. Also big TV with Netflix and Xbox. Not having a sink in the main room can be a little inconvenient for cooking. Cats were a bonus too one of whom is friendly. Nice neighborhood convenient for Norwest Business Park."),
("2017-12-18", "15650737", "Tee", "Our host Sarah is very accommodative and hospital. A pity is that we happened to be there during a particular hot period  and there was no air con in the unit so could be a little stuffy. But other than this minor point  Sarah’s place has adequate provisions to make it a pleasant stay."),
("2017-12-25", "15650737", "Shyam", "Great host but amenities are not good. Bathroom is not attached and not very convenient if a family is staying. Beds and sofas are uncomfortable.I have stayed at other Airbnb's and the stay here was not a good experience for the amount I paid per night for this stay. Amenities need to be surely improved and the property is not so clean as shown in the pictures on AirBnB. It's a great location though."),
("2017-12-29", "15650737", "Jess", "Sarah was very accommodating and has a great place. She has thought of everything to make your stay comfortable."),
("2017-12-31", "15650737", "Daegeon", "Nice house"),
("2018-01-02", "15650737", "Karandeep Singh", "Very good service nice behaviour very helpful"),
("2018-01-05", "15650737", "Helen", "Convenient  reasonably priced unit. Nice host."),
("2018-01-09", "15650737", "Tracy", "Sarah’s place is perfect everything described is correct.The bathroom is next door to your room and all to yourself  the area is quiet and there are plenty of eateries nearby.Sarah is the perfect host  really quick at answering emails  extremely friendly and welcoming  she made you feel at home.  "),
("2018-02-13", "15650737", "Rachel", "Wonderful place to stay! Quiet  comfortable and clean facilities  friendly and helpful host  close to public transport and my partner and I would definitely come back  thank you so much"),
("2018-02-19", "15650737", "Elfaine", "This space is surely value for money and the check in process is smooth. Sarah is kind to cook up the eggs for us as I overlooked as there’s no kitchen. :) We are also well informed about the roaches and was given pesticides too. The room can fit our family of 6+1 but it can be a little squeezy and stuffy at night. The pool was a great addition too  my Niece and Husband enjoyed it. Cheers"),
("2018-02-23", "15650737", "Muhammad", "Nice and friendly host with quick response as she lives upstairs."),
("2018-02-25", "15650737", "Steve", "Lovely place to stay and such a lovelyHost also :)"),
("2018-03-03", "15650737", "Michelle", "Great value for money.   Was a great place for our family of 5 to stay for our trip.  Close to public transport to the City.  Our kids loved that there was a pool.  Sarah was very friendly   happy to answer any questions that we had and made us feel right at home.  Would recommend to anybody looking for somewhere to stay outside of the City Centre."),
("2018-03-05", "15650737", "Heidi", "Sarah was so friendly and really accommodating. The kids loved the pool and even though it was short we had the best time. Easy parking and a lovely street!"),
("2018-03-16", "15650737", "Chantel", "Clean  presentable  friendly  5⭐️"),
("2018-03-18", "15650737", "Amanda", "Sarah was a wonderful host."),
("2018-03-22", "15650737", "Yaseenbaba", "Amazing house..Very quite and peace and definitely relaxing place..Worth spending your money..Almost all the necessary stuff is 5mins close to you..Overall rating in one word would be ""Phenomenal"""),
("2018-03-25", "15650737", "Michelle", "Excellent value for money .Sarah is a lovely host .We were made to feel very welcome"),
("2018-03-29", "15650737", "Mark", "Nice quiet relaxing home"),
("2018-04-02", "15650737", "Thilina Chamara Madusanka", "Our main destinations were Sydney CBD and blue mountain. We found Serah's place as an ideal convenient place in between.  We are a big family of four adults and three children and we still found enough space. Haven't got time to use the pool though. There is a big dining table in the back where we had nice family dinner. We used the washing machine and dryer too. Sarah is a wonderful host too. She replied to my SMS's in no time. Thanks for being so friendly Sarah"),
("2018-04-06", "15650737", "Tim", "The accommodation was ideal for myself and my family. The pool was lovely and a great way to freshen up at the end of a long day. Sarah was a wonderful host  kept us informed throughout our stay and was available should she be needed. Thoroughly recommend."),
("2018-04-22", "15650737", "Ahmed", "Sarah was an amazing welcoming  supportive  understanding and culturally sensitive host. The place is exactly as described.In spite of being quite far from the CBD  all the buses and expresses were less than 9 mns walking time. We could go everywhere in Sydney relying on the nearby public transportation network. We even didn’t need to hire a car as planned; due to the availability of all buses lines near Sarah’s place.Sarah was reachable all the time  gave us a lot of tips about different things. My wife and I liked talking with her. She payed attention to the special things we needed as Muslims (We were surprised  she already aware of our religious needs!)"),
("2018-04-29", "15650737", "Danielle", "Sarah’s place is lovely and quiet while being located close to nearly anything you want to do while in Sydney.This was our first Air BnB experience and we loved it  as did our three children. The space is as clean and comfortable and Sarah was a great host. Her knowledge and hospitality lifted our holiday to a whole new level of enjoyment.Highly recommend!"),
("2018-05-12", "15650737", "Brittany", "Sarah was very lovely  welcoming and very accommodating. We had a great stay. The place was big and had what we needed. Quiet neighbourhood  close enough to great shopping! Thanks again Sarah. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-05-20", "15650737", "Terry", "This is a great sized room with easy access for 2 gents sharing. It was light and airy and clean. Perfect for a few nights  with a welcoming host"),
("2018-06-07", "15650737", "Adrian", "Great place with plenty of privacy. Many fast food outlets close by and a short drive to shopping centres."),
("2018-06-11", "15650737", "Geoffrey", "As first time Airbnb users we were pleasantly surprised. Sarah is very friendly and makes you feel welcome."),
("2018-07-02", "15650737", "John", "Great little place   nice quite neighbourhood  a little out of the city so not too busy  clean and suited what we needed :)"),
("2018-07-19", "15650737", "Tully", "Lovely place to stay as a group clean and affordable and close to amenities."),
("2018-07-26", "15650737", "Peter", "Sarah made sure everything was ok for our three night stay.  The room has aircon for heating with two double beds  and one single (as a top bunk) in a single large room at ground level. Access is easy and the house is in a very quiet neighbourhood. Don't plan to cook there  but there are many good restaurants not far away."),
("2018-08-17", "15650737", "Sam", "Both Sarah and her place was absolutely brilliant. The accommodation was spotless  peaceful and everything written in the listing was there. Sarah herself was such a warm  generous and welcoming host  she responded very quickly and was always on hand if I need anything. Would definitely recommend it the place!"),
("2018-08-23", "15650737", "小窕", "Sarah is very kind and (Website hidden by Airbnb) mum threw the screw of the mirror.But Sarah forgave us.There is just stinking when open the refrigerator.All others are good."),
("2018-09-02", "15650737", "Ananth Prakash", "Very nice place. We were a family of 5  including a 5-yr and a 2-yr old. The room was clean and tidy. The kids loved the cats (Luna  ?) and the backyard. The AC was playing up a bit but Sarah was very helpful & responsive. Example  she asked if my son needed a doctor  since he was crying (a lot) early morning  which was very thoughtful."),
("2018-09-12", "15650737", "Tavrin", "Sarah went above and beyond to ensure our stay was the best that it could be. Would definitely come back."),
("2018-09-16", "15650737", "Denis", "The room was nice  and bathroom."),
("2018-09-23", "15650737", "Steven", "Nice local area  bedroom is self contained  shower & toilet are situated in the shared family laundry. Sarah was a helpful host."),
("2018-10-01", "15650737", "Claudette", "Average."),
("2018-10-07", "15650737", "Philippa", "Nice place"),
("2018-10-12", "15650737", "Glen", "Great place to stay  would definitely go back. convenient location with everything you need"),
("2018-10-13", "15650737", "Danielle", "This was a great little spot to stay for what we needed. It was simple and clean and sarah was excellent to communicate with. She accommodated us for extra people which was great."),
("2018-10-18", "15650737", "Maddison", "Super accommodating and fast responses. Thank you so much!"),
("2018-10-24", "15650737", "Craig", "Good place to stay  I will return"),
("2018-10-26", "15650737", "Jean Marc", "We were 7 adults and we spent only  one night. Good room and we appreciated the patio."),
("2018-11-01", "15650737", "Ben", "Great value for place"),
("2018-11-04", "15650737", "Joshua", "Sarah was a lovely host and we had a great stay!"),
("2018-11-15", "15650737", "Jarryd", "Thank you Sarah for your great hospitality and letting us stay at your place!!"),
("2018-11-17", "15650737", "Noelle", "The place was beautiful  spacious  and close to the venue. Sarah was also such a great host!"),
("2018-11-17", "15650737", "Nathan", "great price and location"),
("2018-12-26", "15650737", "Natasha", "Sarah was always kept in contact  which was great. House was spotless and pool was fantastic. Thank you"),
("2019-01-05", "15650737", "Colin", "Description of the property was spot on  Sarah and her Family were great hosts  the pool was a bonus thoroughly enjoyed our 9 days there  highly recommended."),
("2019-01-05", "15650737", "Waqas", "Great host clean and well equipped room."),
("2019-01-09", "15650737", "Eileen", "I booked Sarah’s place very last minute and she responded immediately and let me know we could check in within the hour! Her place was spotless  the linens were great  and she supplied coffee and cream. We loved the location as it was central to everything but very quiet and peaceful. Sarah was helpful and kind.  We would definitely stay there again!!"),
("2019-01-20", "15650737", "Steve", "We stayed with Sarah for 11 nights while in Sydney for a sporting tournament. The house is in a beautiful area close to where we needed to be everyday. Also close to shops  Food etc. Sarah is such a fantastic host who was always available if we needed anything and was always up for a chat. The room was nice and clean and the pool was the icing on the cake with most days being in the high 30’s low 40’s. We will book again next year and I can’t recommend her enough. Thanks Sarah for a fantastic stay."),
("2019-01-22", "15650737", "Joo Hyung", "good"),
("2019-01-25", "15650737", "Richard", "Amazing pool. So nice to go for a dip on a hot Sydney day. Sarah went above and beyond to get everything ready for my arrival."),
("2019-01-27", "15650737", "Sara", "Clean  friendly  great location  and great price"),
("2019-02-03", "15650737", "Bernard", "Very clean and tidy  the only inconvenience is that the toilet and shower is way outside the room."),
("2019-02-10", "15650737", "Brock", "Fantastic place to stay would recommend to all will definitely stay here again when we next come back in June"),
("2019-02-14", "15650737", "Nazifa", "It’s beautiful and so worth it"),
("2019-02-20", "15650737", "Jonathan", "All good as advertised."),
("2016-11-26", "15745971", "Marko", "Wonderful host Mohit is :) i would highly recommend him. You won't be disappointed and the apartment was very good :) looking forward to my next visit!"),
("2016-12-09", "15745971", "Chris", "Everything was Great"),
("2016-12-29", "15745971", "Benny", "The space is spacious and meticulously kept.  We have a very good time of staying here. Close to all the transports and city  I would recommend staying in the property.  "),
("2016-12-31", "15745971", "Inaam", "comfortable place."),
("2017-01-27", "15745971", "선희", "I reccommend this apartment. I stayed 27 days and had no problem. The host  Mohit and his girlfriend are really kind and warm hearted. safe area and easy access to cityI'll stay this apt. if I have one more chance to visit Sydney."),
("2017-01-28", "15745971", "Tamim", "Clean place  pool  Mohit very helpful. Car spot  comfortable bed and couches"),
("2017-02-03", "15745971", "Lian", "Mohit and his fiance were very gracious hosts. Phone number was provided for easy communication which was highly appreciated. We were a group of three ladies and were very comfortable in the apartment which was clean  modern  airy and close to public transport. And the extra bonus was the pool which we all enjoyed. Glad to recommend and would be most happy to return in the future. Thankyou Mohit. "),
("2017-02-04", "15745971", "Liz", "What a lovely clean and comfortable place to stay while in Sydney. We were very happy staying in such a lovely place completed our grt weekend in Sydney.  See you next yr."),
("2017-02-25", "15745971", "Rebekah", "Super friendly and easygoing! Place was absolutely spotless and the apartment was lovely!"),
("2017-03-01", "15745971", "Kamil Rashid", "Mohit’s place is in a great location ! We stated there for 5 days and it was a very pleasant experience. Great two floor apartment with all the amenities included. Its in a very peaceful neighbourhood and a short drive to CBD and other areas. I highly recommend Mohit’s place !"),
("2017-03-03", "15745971", "Sarah", "Lovely apartment in a great location  perfect for a weekend break in Sydney. Communication with Mohit was easy  a highly recommended host!"),
("2017-03-04", "15745971", "Demili", "The place is perfect and is accurately described. We were greeted by Mohit and his fiance upon arrived. They were lovely and welcoming when showing us the apartment and the surroundings. The apartment was clean  stylish and had everything you would need for a comfortable stay. We left a cardigan at the apartment and Mohit kindly offered to mail it back to us. I would highly recommend this place - great value for money!"),
("2017-03-11", "15745971", "Joshua", "Good communication"),
("2017-03-17", "15745971", "Amelia", "Mohit's place has a great location and the apartment could easily fit 7 of us in it with one person sleeping on the couch. If you rent a car  there's a free parking space at the apartment which is good as parking is really expensive in Sydney. With a car the apartment is about 10-15 mins away from town and it is also convenient to head to other tourist attractions. There's also a train station nearby if i'm not wrong. Mohit was really responsive to queries during the stay and they managed to arrange for a slightly earlier check-in as our flight was early. They met us for the check-in and explained everything about the apartment which was good. It was unfortunate that we met with bad weather during our trip but the apartment was great overall! I personally love the neighbourhood where i did outdoor night runs. On a side note  there's a few cafes and/or restaurants near the apartment too if you are looking for a quick fix ! Thanks for the apartment (:"),
("2017-03-20", "15745971", "John", "Good access to downtown and airport! Nice apartment and pool. Very friendly hosts who met us on arrival."),
("2017-03-24", "15745971", "Bernice", "The apartment was quite convenient (about 800m walk from nearest train station  and there are buses right at the door step) and communication from the host was timely. Would be much better if there was air-con or at least a fan on the top floor where the master bedroom was as the air-con from the lower floor does not travel upwards. "),
("2017-03-25", "15745971", "Yasiman", "Had a great stay here. Close to city and had everything needed"),
("2017-03-28", "15745971", "Beverly", "Mohit was a wonderful host.  Met us personally to show us the place and give us the key.  Everything was great  and close to the airport which is what we were looking for.  A couple of good places to eat within walking distance was perfect for our one night stay. "),
("2017-04-08", "15745971", "Nima", "Great location and lovely hosts."),
("2017-04-09", "15745971", "Dennis", "Near to the airport and apartment is beautiful and clean.  My family enjoyed the stay."),
("2017-04-11", "15745971", "Meyappan", "Mohit is a great host  and has a lovely home. It's a nice well furnished 2 story apartment. He even had netflix which helped us while the time at home.It's a suitable place for couple and families with grown up kids. Not too suitable with families with young kids as the train station was quite a distance away. With 2 young kids and my parents  it proved a bit of a challenge to walk to and fro everyday."),
("2017-04-15", "15745971", "Jiani", "Mohit是个非常好沟通的房东 信息传递很及时｡公寓的位置离机场很近 到市中心也很方便｡房间整体舒适清洁 设施齐全 但床上用品略显破旧 被子的舒适度也不是很好｡"),
("2017-04-18", "15745971", "Christopher", "This is a wonderful  clean  centrally located apartment. My family and I landed in Sydney after 25 hours of travel  and our brief stay at Mohit's  made for the most convenient  restful transition. Six of us stayed here for 2 evenings  and we were quite comfortable.  Thank again!!"),
("2017-04-22", "15745971", "Katalina", "Mohit has a nice place. It was big enough to host the 7 of us. There were 4 adults and 3 children. We stayed for 4 nights and we did enjoy our stay. The place is very secured but I found having one key was problematic when you have 7 people stay in the apartment. Also  there is only one undercover parking spot and finding a parking around the area was very hard. There was also no iron in the apartment. Apart from that  the place is clean  is in a very good location  close to everything and close to the airport. It was what I expected!"),
("2017-04-23", "15745971", "Kim", "A beautiful 2 level apartment that was clean and spacious  a perfect size for 6 guests. The kitchen is good which was well utilised on our stay. Great views. Host has great communication. We enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-04-30", "15745971", "Fina", "The apartment is excellent. Very confortable.Bus stop just at the door. Very easy to reach most important places from there.Mohit has been very kind with us.We have been four nights and we can only say that everything has been excellent."),
("2017-05-04", "15745971", "Awofodu", "很不错的房间 很好的房东"),
("2017-05-06", "15745971", "Adam", "Mohit was so accommodating and we had an excellent stay."),
("2017-05-13", "15745971", "Jiang", "Mohit is a brilliant host   recommended!"),
("2017-05-19", "15745971", "Sam", "Great  affordable accomodation in prime location. Large home with everything you'd expect and more.Would recommend highly."),
("2017-05-20", "15745971", "Chelsea", "Good location. Nice accommodation. Hosts were very nice. Would recommend."),
("2017-05-27", "15745971", "Cajie", "Mohit and Priya were very good host. Priya met us at the allocated time and showed us around the house. The host were flexible and granted all our requests."),
("2017-06-08", "15745971", "Kah Yan", "很靠近车站  出central station也只需要10分钟的路程｡很适合一家大小居住  朋友一起的也不错｡ "),
("2017-06-12", "15745971", "Patrick", "This is a great apartment  not far from Sydney city.  It is easy to access via public transport.  There are lots of fabulous cafés and shops in the vicinity and if you're happy to walk in to the city  you'll pass many great places along the way. I'd be happy to recommend any stay in this property as the hosts were great and the experience was very easy and relaxed."),
("2017-06-15", "15745971", "Christina", "Mohit made communication so easy and we had no problem communicating with him. The place is lovely and the balcony is a fantastic place to chill with friends/family. Will definitely be back again!"),
("2017-06-18", "15745971", "Ashradha", "Great location and accommodating hosts!"),
("2017-06-19", "15745971", "Christina", "Mohit made communication so easy and we had no problem communicating with him. The place is lovely and the balcony is a fantastic place to chill with friends/family. Will definitely be back again!"),
("2017-06-26", "15745971", "Lachlan", "Very responsive and caring host. Good location and nice amenities."),
("2017-07-03", "15745971", "Sherry", "地理位置不错 离机场7分钟车程 离City15分钟车程 房东回复信息很及时 到达时会亲自迎接你 公寓还有免费停车位｡"),
("2017-07-05", "15745971", "Albert Ihsanto", "Mohit is always easy to reach and helpful  the apartment is strategically located near supermarket and airport... The place is nice and cosy...."),
("2017-07-10", "15745971", "冠瑋", "It is very suitable for family"),
("2017-07-15", "15745971", "Adam", "We stayed here as a family of 5 and all was very good  spacious and comfortable. Communication was great and location excellent for a short stay as central enough and close to airport for an early morning flight. Mohit was very flexible as we added an extra day at the last minute and very accommodating re check in times. All in all a very enjoyable if short stay in Sydney. Thanks! "),
("2017-07-24", "15745971", "Chau", "Great location to public transportation as well as local eateries."),
("2017-07-29", "15745971", "Shell", "Great clean and neat apartment in a security complex within walking distance to amazing restaurants and very quiet for being so close to the city and the airport"),
("2017-08-12", "15745971", "Amy", "We loved our stay at Mohit and his fiancé's place.  The place was spotless  comfortable and well equipped.  Thanks both  we wouldn't hesitate to come back again!"),
("2017-08-21", "15745971", "Norm", "Thanks Mohit - nice and convenient stay for us. I appreciate your communication and flexibility."),
("2017-09-06", "15745971", "Abdullah", "Mohit was a great host  very cooperative and easy to deal with. He was great in communication and quickly responded to any question or query before check in until check out. Location is great to any one interested in eastern suburbs or to be near the airport. No much attraction within walking distance for visitors or tourists. Although bus services and green square station is near by and can move you to the city or else where. Will defenetly recommend Mohit and his place."),
("2017-09-09", "15745971", "Ying", "great area close to heaps of selection! Mohit was very helpful and accommodating to our itinerary changes!"),
("2017-09-25", "15745971", "Brooke", "Great location!"),
("2017-10-01", "15745971", "Rak", "its a nice place stay for short time  needs bit fixing."),
("2017-10-05", "15745971", "Jerome", "Perfect location  just 15mins to Bondi  City or Airport. With car park is a plus!"),
("2017-10-08", "15745971", "Wendy", "A stylish modern apartment in a great location. The hosts were very pleasant and accommodating."),
("2017-10-13", "15745971", "Pindz", "Awesome place!! very clean and tidy. Mohit is an awesome host!!"),
("2017-10-15", "15745971", "Arno", "This place is very nice place to stay. We stayed here for two nights with 5 adults & one toddler. The hosts are very quick in communication which was very good. Only one small issue was WiFi which can be slow at times but I think that’s due to many devices using it at same time but that didn’t worry us much anyway. We loved our stay here."),
("2017-10-23", "15745971", "Leni", "Mohit and his fiancée  Priya were very friendly and welcoming. My relatives who stayed at their apartment to attend my daughter's wedding were very happy with everything. Although they couldn't find the password for the wifi but it didn't bother them because they were out most the time anyway. I could've contacted him and asked him about the password but I was so busy myself with my other relatives so I am very happy that my relatives were happy too. The location was very ideal for people who want to go sightseeing around the city area or to go to train station and bus stop. It's very closed to The Grounds of Alexandria where my daughter's wedding reception was. I can highly recommend their apartment and him and Priya who were very professional  friendly and approachable.Mohit and Priya  thank you very much for being amazing hosts and kindness and everything.I can only say nice things about the apartment and the hosts. It's very easy to communicate with them too."),
("2017-10-28", "15745971", "阳", "房间很干净 地理位置交通便利 门口有超市 药店 生活很便利 房主也很友善 沟通无障碍"),
("2017-11-10", "15745971", "Tharit", "It's a very very good place. The location is so good closed to the airport and there is the IGA supermarket at the door of the apartment. Clean and tidy place. All required equipments are provided including cooking and coffee stuff."),
("2017-11-19", "15745971", "Qiong", "Nice place  convenient to get bus or railway.    Mohit is very nice and helps us a lot."),
("2017-12-03", "15745971", "Vincent", "Very nice place to stay with great equipment like comfy sofa and beds  large TV  climate control etc. It takes some time to the central (20-30min iirc) but otherwise the location is good with a shop close by and bus stations around the block. Late sleepers might get woken up early by the sun if you wake up easily. The welcome was lovely and otherwise the communication was great. We enjoyed the stay!"),
("2017-12-20", "15745971", "Ines", "Mohit ist ein sehr netter Gastgeber  allerdings kamen Antworten auf Fragen zumeist mit einiger Verzögerung. Die Wohnung ist schön gelegen  zwischen Flughafen und Zentrum  so dass beide gut erreichbar waren. Die Wohnung selbst bietet viel Platz  erstreckt sich über 2 Etagen und ist schön und praktisch eingerichtet  mit eigenem Parkplatz. Leider waren die Bäder nicht top sauber. Dennoch empfehlenswert."),
("2018-01-18", "15745971", "Erica", "Mohit was great host. Excellant communication  great location  everything was good as described. Unfortunately dryer and dishwasher were broken at the same time and it couldnt be fixed during our stay. Other than that our stay was very pleasant and welcoming. I would definately recommend Mohit's place for sydney visit. Close to city and shopping places. Big Cheers to Mohit and his places. Best wishes"),
("2018-01-28", "15745971", "John", "Very clean  good position and responses are swift. Very helpful host. "),
("2018-02-07", "15745971", "Mirna", "Mohit je odlican domacin  u vise navrata nas je telefonski kontaktirao i docekao u stanu. Stan je prostran  lijepo uređen. Lokacija je odlična između zračne luke i centra. Predlažem da osigura više ručnika  očistiti pecnicu te da nabavi ključeve za kupaonice. Ukupni dojam je vrlo dobar i uživali smo u boravku."),
("2018-02-11", "15745971", "Ange And Dom", "On this trip to Sydney we were travelling with 2 adults and four children aged between 1 to 16 years old. It’s hard to find affordable clean accommodation to suit our needs but Mohit’s apartment was great. We had plenty of space for everyone. The facilities are great and being so close to IGA supermarket was fantastic. Mohit was a wonderful host and responded quickly to our booking and checkin was easy and convenient. We’d highly recommend Mohit and look forward to staying at his apartment again in the future."),
("2018-02-17", "15745971", "Junhua", "The landlord is very good  and then the house is very  very complete  and very clean. Well  we had a very nice few days' holiday here  and the landlord communicated with each other very promptly and had a very friendly reception. I would like to recommend it to others."),
("2018-02-25", "15745971", "Jeremy", "Mohit is a nice host. Nice place!"),
("2018-02-28", "15745971", "Sparrow", "Great place for family staying. Host is helpful  and the location is awesome."),
("2018-03-06", "15745971", "Gareth", "Great space  good size  nice and clean  quiet  good location  air con (needed during summer months)."),
("2018-03-10", "15745971", "Olivia", "Location is excellent  so close to Alexandria and the Inner West which we had come to visit. We stayed with four children who were aged five and under  and the place was well equipped to accommodate all of us (although we were out and about for most of the days). The apartment was very clean and had plenty of everything we needed. Parking spot  swimming pool  security and location make this a great option for a Sydney stay."),
("2018-03-17", "15745971", "Ruth", "My husband and I stayed here with our 15-year-old while he competed at the Australian Junior Athletics Championships at Olympic Park and we had the BEST experience. Firstly  Mohit is an amazing host. He is approachable  helpful and his replies are super fast.We found everything we usually look for in accommodation and more. Firstly  the security and private car park were unexpected and very reassuring. The apartment was spotlessly clean  spacious  comfortable and modern  and included a lot of personal touches. The beds were great and the couches are actually large enough to really relax in. The facilities are brilliant - laundry in the apartment  IGA downstairs  Coles Express and chemist across the road  and Dan Murphy's down the block. We were amazed at how quiet the apartment was considering its location  which was so important to us. It's close to the airport but there was no aircraft or traffic noise. Wonderful!Thank you Mohit for a brilliant stay!"),
("2018-03-18", "15745971", "Danny", "很好的房东"),
("2018-03-23", "15745971", "Vincent", "Great hosts and easy to communicate with. We had a great time in the Appartment. I would like to stay there again. I really can recommend this Appartment. Thanks for all."),
("2018-03-26", "15745971", "Chandani", "Very nice place to stay with family. Felt like home environment  neat and clean. Good security system. Liked it very much and enjoyed our stay for 4 days. Very good communication with Mohit and his wife. They are really good and helpful. Definitely suggest you to stay there for holiday."),
("2018-04-05", "15745971", "Roxy", "Mohit’s apartment is stylish  spacious and clean. He is approachable and replies fast. The location is perfect  there’s a grocery downstairs and it’s very accessible to bus stops which made our trip easier. The kitchen is complete with appliances and utensils. The only thing we noticed during our stay was whenever we enter the apartment  there’s an unfamiliar smell. I would recommend an aircon in the bedrooms since the living room is the only room that has an aircon especially during the summer days. All in all  our stay was great. And we will definitely recommend it to others."),
("2018-04-08", "15745971", "Sara", "Mohit's communication was excellent  a great location and good value for money."),
("2018-04-21", "15745971", "Jack", "Everything was perfect and also the host was really really niceThey had everything prepared. I recommend others this place :)"),
("2018-04-29", "15745971", "Sam", "The apartment was just as it is advertised great time fantastic location and we highly recommend it.We will definately use it again.Thanks Mohit for being an excellent host.RegardsSam"),
("2018-06-11", "15745971", "Maryane", "Such a beautiful apartment  photos are the exact same. Mohit was very quick in responses and quick to accommodate my request! Such a great location and very stylish apartment  and also includes a parking space which is great! 5/5."),
("2018-06-24", "15745971", "Jessica", "It’s really nice!"),
("2018-06-30", "15745971", "良路", "close to the airport. 10 mins walking to the closest train station. nice 2-floor apartment with all necessary infrastructure."),
("2018-07-13", "15745971", "Emma", "It was an absolutely great stay; Mohit was super quick to book us in which was a God send and really helpful in getting us settled in  answering our queries within minutes. Being close to public transport & in a quiet location it was perfect  the space was super nice and modern but above all clean and accurate to the photos. I couldn't recommend it more highly :)"),
("2018-07-22", "15745971", "Rosa", "The place was amazing with everything you could need for a weekend away! In a great location  the aircon and heating in each room was also so good especially in the winter. Thanks for a great stay. "),
("2018-08-12", "15745971", "Michael", "Accomodation was a perfect spot to stay at and everything in the apartment was exceptional. Host made check-ins easy and provided the answers to all my questions. Overall  amazing accomodation to stay at! "),
("2018-08-25", "15745971", "Ben", "Great apartment in a quiet complex. Mohit was a great host and very responsive to questions and assisting with check in and check out.Would highly recommend and would stay again"),
("2018-09-16", "15745971", "Sophie", "Good location - easy distance between the airport and CBD.The IGA store below was very helpful and the pool was a nice extra amenity in a wonderful stay."),
("2018-09-26", "15745971", "Wendy", "I booked my friends in Mohit’s apartment and Mohit was a delight to deal with  he was responsive and allow us a very early checkin. The checkin and out process was seamless. Apartment is spacious and clean and great location. Highly recommended :) thank you so much  Mohit!"),
("2018-10-22", "15745971", "Vikash", "Great communication  and fast responses. Easy check in and out process and provided lots of helpful tips.Thanks again for all your help and support. My family had a great time  and the location is perfect.Thanks again!"),
("2018-10-26", "15745971", "Jolanta", "The stay at Mohit's place was wonderful. The apartment was clean and beds were comfy. Communication with Mohit was great with prompt responses and detailed instructions."),
("2018-11-02", "15745971", "Jens Dalsgaard", "Nice place  close to busses  trains  there is a pool  very nice when it is hot. Mohit is quick to answer"),
("2018-11-08", "15745971", "Rolo", "Great location  off street parking  large space. Recommend!"),
("2018-11-17", "15745971", "Mattias", "Very good communication with the host  house was sparkling clean and accurately listed. My whole family was very pleased!"),
("2018-11-25", "15745971", "Ruihua", "The apartment is clean  well equipped  new  safe and quiet. It has an underground carpark. it's perfect for those have a good rest and visit the surroundings of Sydney. Very convenient: the supermarket is just at the corner of the street. there are many other shops around  even fashion/sport outlets not far away (130  Botany rd; NB sports). shopping center with Coles is 1 mile away. Overall  it was a great stay."),
("2018-12-27", "15745971", "Fulden", "Mohit’s place was wonderful to stay at. Good location  spacious and clean. Mohit was very accessible and responded to queries very quickly. Would recommend for a group accommodation!"),
("2019-01-03", "15745971", "Valentina", "Muy lindo apartamento  muy completo con todo lo necesario.  Tiene una parada de ómnibus enfrente lo que permite una buena locomoción.  Muy cómodo que haya un supermercado debajo.Muy agradable también la piscina  para refrescarse después de haber paseado por la ciudad todo el día.Pasamos una semana espectacular en Sydney."),
("2019-01-06", "15745971", "Meisyal", "lokasi dan tempat yang menyenangkan"),
("2019-02-07", "15745971", "丹丹", "非常开心的一次住宿体验 我们一共两家人住到这里 8天的时间 设施设备非常齐全 卫生干净整洁｡位置也非常的便利(超市 机场 市中心购物都不远)｡孩子在这个城市读书 我想我们每次来都要住在这里｡"),
("2019-02-09", "15745971", "Lena", "Great stay. last minute booking and was still well looked after. Great communication."),
("2019-02-17", "15745971", "Carolyn", "Great host & great location however  it wasn’t quite as clean as we had expected."),
("2019-02-24", "15745971", "Omar", "Great location and apartment. Has everything you need"),
("2019-03-05", "15745971", "Jenny", "Mohit is a very responsive host with great communication. The apartment is well located with a supermarket next door  buses on the door stop  15 minutes from Green Square train station and nearby cafes/restaurants. Unfortunately the apartment is looking very tired and uncared for (photos are obviously from when the apartment and furnishings were still new)."),
("2017-01-08", "15820774", "Peter", "I stayed at this place for 7 days. The description on the website is accurate and the location is superb. The only criticism is because the property is the owners family residence there was virtually no space to unpack a suitcase so we ended up using the kitchen table. Otherwise I was quite pleased with the apartment."),
("2017-01-21", "15820774", "Jon", "Thanks! Great little spot!"),
("2017-03-18", "15820774", "Stijn", "The host canceled this reservation 76 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-01-01", "15877524", "Wayne", "A great and private place close to everything you need for a relaxing stay in beautiful Manley Extremely welcoming and helpful with local tips."),
("2018-01-02", "15877524", "Margarita", "Central place in Manly  close to the Main Beach and Manly Wharf although if you are arriving with luggage I wouldn't recommend walking from the Wharf as home is situated on a large hill.  Worth it to take a taxi even if it is less than 5 mins drive.  Home is clean and compact with good wifi and although we didn't use it  parking pass is available.  Couch and bed comfortable  bathroom clean.  Priced for the high season but a much better option than a hotel in the area.  Overall  I would recommend this home."),
("2017-01-26", "15806964", "Brad", "Great location  beautiful view.  A cozy place for a romantic getaway."),
("2017-02-25", "15806964", "Georgia", "Excellent location  clean and fresh little studio apartment- perfect for a 1 or 2 person getaway. Had everything we needed. Anita was a great host and greeted me on arrival. Building currently under renovation- while there was scaffolding- it didn't block the view and lovely light in the apartment. "),
("2017-04-13", "15806964", "Steven", "Amazing view  location & setup!Perfect little beach getaway & so close to Bondi beach & restaurants. Would stay there again in a heartbeat!"),
("2017-04-19", "15806964", "Rose", "Anita was an absolutely wonderful host  and her place is simply beautiful. She has really put some thought into making the place special for her Airbnb guests. Every day I was just delighted to wake up to the cool summer breeze and gorgeous ocean view. You can see a good part of the ocean straight out the window  and it's really nice to see the sun  surf  swimmers and surfers out there having fun. Icebergs is just a couple of steps away and there is the stunning Bondi to Bronte right outside. It would also be a good writers retreat - I finished a first draft of my PhD dissertation here! The apartment has everything you need for a perfect holiday  and lots of thoughtful little touches everywhere. This is absolutely up there with the best Airbnb experience I've ever had. I would recommend it to everyone. I will be coming back as soon as I can! "),
("2017-05-11", "15806964", "Marcelo", "Clean studio with amazing view to Bondi beach."),
("2017-05-14", "15806964", "Tristan", "Perfect place with stunning views. Lovely waking up to the waves every morning.Will be back."),
("2017-06-06", "15806964", "Sonia", "I had a great stay at Anita's flat. It was fully equipped and clean  even the shampoo and conditioner were provided in good quantities!  The location is perfect  the bus to the city stops right in front the building and its easy to walk everywhere in Bondi from here. Last but not least  Anita  remained available each time I needed it. "),
("2017-06-12", "15806964", "Kristie", "Anita's house is perfect for a lovely getaway at Bondi Beach.  It is opposite the beach with direct access to Icebergs and all that Bondi has to offer.  Quick walk to a local off leash dog park too!  The beach  bars and restaurants are all on your doorstep and the bus stops right out front!  Cannot be beaten for the location!  The place itself is a studio and perfect for a couple.  It is clean and very comfortable with a view of the ocean!  Perfect! Highly recommend!!!"),
("2017-06-23", "15806964", "Malik", "Anita is great host. The building is under refurbishment so there is a lot of noise and ugly scaffolding infront of window so you won't get sea views."),
("2017-06-26", "15806964", "Marion", "Great location and Anita provides a well accommodated apartment with the little extras that were appreciated."),
("2017-07-03", "15806964", "Amy", "The apartment is situated in a great spot in the heart of Bondi. Anita was incredibly helpful and so accommodating throughout our stay."),
("2017-07-06", "15806964", "Hanae", "Bondi Beach is must!! Anita's apartment is within a 2 minute walk distance to the beach. You can walk to all restaurants  bars and market. The train and bus to the apartment is very easy. The bus drops and picks up right in front of the apartment. The apartment is so cute we loved our stay!! "),
("2017-07-17", "15806964", "Nicolas", "Anita's appartment is very clean  very well furnished with the eye for detail and peaceful. The partial view on bondi beach is a bit disappointing but since everything else is almost perfect  this view is definitively secondary. Would warmly recommend Anita's appartment "),
("2017-08-10", "15806964", "Gis", "Great place to spend your vacations at Sydney!... even though is not close to the city center it has an excellent location  the bus stop is right outside the apartment and you can easily go to the downtown using the public transportation (very efficient by the way). You can enjoy amazing views of Bondi Beach which is just a block away and do some surfing while you are there... I highly recommend Anita and this beautiful and cozy apartment for your next holiday at Sydney :)"),
("2017-08-26", "15806964", "Manuela", "It's beautiful and comfortable  the location is suitable close to all the restaurants and shops"),
("2017-09-10", "15806964", "Nic", "AMAZING  couldn't ask for a better place1min from beachAmazing viewSuper sleek studioGreat kitchen & cooking facilitiesNice living area to hangout Extremely cleanLovely toiletries (shampoo etc)Secure parkingGreat communicationEasy 24hr access & checkin Would recommend staying & I will definitely age my stay here again!Thanks so much Anita  great apartment"),
("2017-09-15", "15806964", "Louis", "Anita's place was great for a short business stay. Would absolutely book again."),
("2017-11-04", "15806964", "Patricia", "Anita is an amazing  lovely host - very thoughtful and incredibly sweet! The apartment is immaculate with plenty of amenities. Great stay! Thanks Anita  hope to see you again soon. "),
("2017-11-16", "15806964", "Sian", "Anita is a lovely person. The apartment is very homely."),
("2017-11-25", "15806964", "Shannon", "Awesome location  1 min walk to bondi and great restaurants! Best view of Bondi too "),
("2017-12-09", "15806964", "Tara", "Highly recommend this unit!  GREAT location with amazing views of the beach!! Super close to the coastal walk which I highly recommend you do while staying here! Anita was a great host.  She met me prior to my check in time and allowed me to leave my luggage at the apartment while it was being cleaned.  She also allowed me to check in early after the unit was ready!  She walked me around the entire complex to show me all the amenities and how to navigate the area.   The unit was in great condition and was very well decorated.  I enjoyed waking up each morning to the lovely  view of the beach and ocean right from the bed. On my last day  Anita offered a late check out as the cleaning service was running behind which was greatly appreciated! Anita has great communication with her guests which was very helpful during my stay! Overall   Anita is a really amazing host who was super accommodating!! Definitely don't miss out on this unit!"),
("2017-12-14", "15806964", "Britt", "Anita’s place is exactly as the photos!! It is cute  stylish and a great space to relax in. The best part is you can look at the views of bondi from bed!! Anita went over and beyond with little finishing touches that we really appreciated. We would definitely stay again :)"),
("2017-12-22", "15806964", "Peggy & Jeff", "Tout était parfait !Si vous cherchez un super spot pour rester à Bondi  ne cherchez pas d'avantage  ici c'est le top."),
("2018-01-01", "15806964", "Frank", "Die Unterkunft war perfekt. Die Lage unschlagbar und wir hatten nicht mit so einer Ausstattung gerechnet. Deshalb haben wir einige Dinge mitgebracht  die wir aber nicht (Website hidden by Airbnb) war wirklich Alles da. Anita war die perfekte Gastgeberin  die sogar den Kuehlschrank etwas gefuellt hatte  da wir zu den Feiertagen ankamen. Es war sogar frisches Brot da. Den wagen konnten wir bequem unten in der Garage abstellen und mussten nur mit dem Aufzug in unsere Etage fahren. Die Aussicht vom Bett war ein Traum. Alles war sehr sauber und geschmackvoll modern eingerichtet. Das WLAN hat perfekt funktioniert und war schnell genug sogar fuer grosse Dateien. Wir kommen gerne bald wieder. Danke Anita."),
("2018-01-07", "15806964", "Marie", "Highly recommend  best place we’ve ever stayed! Perfect above and beyond in every way! Bed is sooo comfortable and quality bedding and towels are gorgeous. The view of Bondi Beach is terrific the bus stop is right outside with buses to Bondi Junction  Sydney  Watson’s Bay etc. What an absolutely amazing place the accommodation is immaculate a great layout and size  provision of absolutely EVERYTHING from WIFI  cotton buds  olive oil  milk to such perfect products  a seperate laundry room and even a lift to the car park for a short cut to walk to Tamarama beach (you must!) what an amazing location  we were so very sad to leave! Thank you! "),
("2018-01-13", "15806964", "Lorna", "A clean  cosy and stylish apartment  in an unbelievably good location - the perfect bondi stay. Anita is a great host  she is very accommodating in terms of checking in and out and gave us lots of really helpful tips about bondi and Sydney  as well as being very thoughtful and hospitable. Thanks again for everything!"),
("2018-01-29", "15806964", "Jp", "Anita’s communication throughout the whole process was great. The place is also fantastic  we had a very enjoyable stay. "),
("2018-02-03", "15806964", "Clayton", "Beautiful studio nestled in the hills of famous Bondi Beach.. need I say more?This is the perfect spot for a couple looking to get away yet still in the best location. The apartment has everything you need to live comfortably. It's clean  stylish with tasteful styling/furnishes  and has inspiring views. You'll be close to dozens of cafe's restaurants  shops  bars  and the beach. I was particularly taken back by the quality and quality of restaurants  the food here is amazing and the coffee is unbeatable.Communication by the host is was great  check-in/out was a breeze with the host giving a personalized walk through of the location and amenities. I was even offering a late check-out without asking.It's easy to say that I will be looking forward to staying here again in the near future. Enjoy!"),
("2018-02-16", "15806964", "Shawn", "Anita and her beautiful place at Bondi Beach were above and beyond what I was expecting.  She had lots of thoughtful touches in the apartment and was kept sparkling clean.  Anita was helpful on local attractions and the transit system and responded to any inquiries almost instantly.  WHAT A WONDERFUL PLACE TO STAY IN BONDI.  I will be back!!"),
("2018-02-18", "15806964", "Richard", "We had a wonderful time in Bondi Beach at Anita’s apartment. It’s stylish with nice  small touches like coffee and everything you need. The location can’t be beat with amazing views of the beach. If you’re contemplating Bondi  look no further. Would stay here again in a heartbeat."),
("2018-02-24", "15806964", "Jay", "Great place  highly recommend"),
("2018-02-28", "15806964", "Teri", "Great host! Place was very clean and perfect location for catching bus into Sydney which we did often.  And of course it was great to have a view and beautiful breezes. Grateful for the tips on eateries and Anita's quick responses.  Lovely stay!  Highly recommend."),
("2018-03-03", "15806964", "Shawn", "Good location in Bondi. Right across the street from iceberg restaurant and spa. Convenient  clean and comfortable."),
("2018-03-07", "15806964", "Robert", "Anita was a great host and her place was very stylish and located right next to the beach and the bus stop with a beautiful view of Bondi Beach  and also with plenty of space - perfect for a couple. Anita was extremely thoughtful and even put some food in the fridge for us as we were arriving too late to make it out to eat or shopping. Thanks again!!"),
("2018-03-15", "15806964", "Suzy", "Anita was lovely and she really made every effort to provide everything and anything I needed for my stay. The place was lovely and the location was excellent! Maybe could have done with some blackout blinds but it was lovely to hear the sea every morning! Thanks Anita- great place xxx"),
("2018-03-29", "15806964", "Gill", "Fantastic location with beautiful views. Beach and bars a short walk away and a bus stop right outside. The studio is clean and well equipped for all your needs and Anita was a perfect host. We look forward to staying a third time."),
("2018-04-02", "15806964", "Adam", "Loved this place. Very clean  fantastic view and as close to the beach as you can get!"),
("2018-04-08", "15806964", "Brady", "Location and view can't be beat. It's across the street from Bondi beach  right next to all the restaurants and bars you could want. The view from the flat is amazing  and you can watch the sunrise from the unit. Despite being a studio  the flat felt much bigger. Check-in was easy  and it had everything you need for a great trip. Would love to stay here again!"),
("2018-04-13", "15806964", "Cam", "The best location for morning ocean swims and the best hole-in-the-wall local coffee shop directory across the road. Clean  tidy  don’t expect fast internet but be wowed by the Bondi beach views."),
("2018-04-17", "15806964", "Ying", "Beautiful beachside studio with gorgeous views of Bondi beach.  Steps from icebergs  restaurants  bars  and waves!  Couldn’t have asked for a better stay and would definitely recommend it! Lots of thoughtful little touches by the host  including sunscreen and aloe for those who want to spend a lot of time at the beach!"),
("2018-04-28", "15806964", "Matthew", "Just be a where it will take you about 1 hr on the bus to get in to the Sydney Opera House"),
("2018-04-30", "15806964", "Dwayne", "Fantastic host and apartment. Perfect location  easy walking to pretty much everything Bondi has to offer."),
("2018-05-05", "15806964", "Luke", "View of the beach. Right across from Icebergs. Sytlish. Clean. Well-priced. And a wonderful host with Anita. One of my favorite stays in Bondi. Planning to stay here again."),
("2018-05-07", "15806964", "Tania", "Anita was thoughtful and thorough during check-in to ensure I had everything I needed. The view is spectacular! I would highly recommend this apartment to anyone who wants to enjoy Bondi and everything it has to offer."),
("2018-06-04", "15806964", "Matt", "Whilst the flat is even more amazing than the photos portray  it was Anita's welcome  hospitality and attention to detail that really made my stay in Bondi exceptional. I would recommend to all my friends  there is literally everything you would ever need. And the view of the sea is outstanding."),
("2018-06-10", "15806964", "Joely", "The apartment is GREAT. It’s in a wonderful location  has an incredible view and is very cozy and inviting! It offers (Hidden by Airbnb) Chromecast  which is a nice feature. Public transportation is literally right outside the door. There a lots of eateries nearby and a coffee stand just across the street  along with a convenience store and pharmacy. The host  Anita  is awesome!! She is so nice and accommodating. She gave me lots of helpful tips and suggestions of places to go and how to get there  and she really thinks about the guests and their needs. I really enjoyed everything about my stay."),
("2018-06-12", "15806964", "Katie", "Best location in Bondi. Everything absolutely perfect so beautifully clean and beautifully appointed I really very am grateful to have stayed at Anita's place. She is an extremely courteous and hospital host. Highly recommended."),
("2018-06-25", "15806964", "Cathy", "Great location  stunning views  lovely ambience and amenity.  "),
("2018-07-09", "15806964", "Vassi", "Spectacular view of sunrise.......Our stay in this Bondi apartment was just perfect. The location  the amenities  the attention to detail  how spotless it was and waking up to the amazing view every morning.....wow! This apartment certainly does not disappoint. We cannot wait to be back in Bondi & in this apartment. Thank you Anita for your hospitality. You were such a pleasure to deal with. "),
("2018-07-15", "15806964", "Alison", "Our stay in Anita’s place was the highlight of our trip in Bondi. We were immediately taken away by Anita’s incredible hospitality and generous assistance getting us acquainted with the place as well as the local surroundings. We were instantly amazed by the ocean views seen from the kitchen window. Many of our mornings were spent waking to watch the sunrise over breakfast. The building is just a staircase away from the sand  couldn’t be more convenient. Our stay was made much more enjoyable having this place to call “home” during our time in Bondi  would highly recommend to anyone visiting Bondi! "),
("2018-07-20", "15806964", "Johannes", "Five star host offering a great apartment with amazing views. Thank you Anita!"),
("2018-07-24", "15806964", "Jorge", "Anita’s place is amazing. You have a great view of the beach and the sunrise from her view is to die for. Anita’s nice enough to walk you through and kind of break things down for you. What convenient stores are cheaper rather then you just walk into any store and spend a lot of money. If it’s your first time which it was for me. She is kind enough to give you a list of things you can check out while you are there staying at Bondi or Sydney in general. Overall you won’t be regretting anything staying at this location."),
("2018-08-04", "15806964", "Peter", "This is a terrific studio - clean  bright  well appointed and in in a wonderful location on Bondi Beach. Book now!"),
("2018-08-13", "15806964", "Carly", "We could not have wanted anything more. The booking process and instructions were clear and any questions quickly answered from the start. The apartment is in an unbeatable location with views of Bondi Beach and an easy walk to everything. The apartment was spotlessly clean  modern  impeccably and tastefully presented and every possible amenity considered and provided. Anita was a pleasure to deal with and so accommodating to allow us to bring our dog. Honestly this has been the best air bnb experience we have ever had. Value for money in a prime location where we could bring both dog and a car made the trip a big highlight. Thanks Anita! "),
("2018-08-21", "15806964", "Brendon", "Anita’s place is fantastic and she puts so much attention to detail in everything! I look forward to returning again someday!"),
("2018-09-02", "15806964", "Tamara", "Very cute home to stay in  sparkling clean and a view that takes your breath away!"),
("2018-09-05", "15806964", "Juan & Renee", "This place is great. The location is perfect and the views are incredible. Very cozy for a single traveler or a couple. I would definitely return again."),
("2018-09-12", "15806964", "Matt", "Anitas place was exceptional! Location was perfect and Anita's Hospitality and attention to detail was the best I have experienced so far using air bnb and I will definitely be booking this place again in a few months time. Anita showed me all around the local area to help me adjust to the area and helped me with any requests. this experience was 10/10 Thank You Anita"),
("2018-09-15", "15806964", "Jess", "Anita’s apartment was the perfect place to stay for a weekend in Bondi! Will definitely stay there again."),
("2018-09-20", "15806964", "Mandy", "This is such a special place to stay!  Anita is beyond wonderful and was the perfect host for the perfect apartment in the perfect location.  Just beautiful.  We would return in a heart beat and will be making this gorgeous abode our second home next time we return to Sydney.  We love you Anita!"),
("2018-09-24", "15806964", "Sarah", "Anita’s beautiful apartment is perfect place to stay in Bondi. Location is perfect   the apartment was spotless and everything was catered for. I can’t fault it. Anita communicates everything very clearly and it makes it so so easy."),
("2018-09-29", "15806964", "Kim", "A clean  smart and spacious apartment with view of the beach... watched the moon and sun rise from the bed! One minute to the bus stop and 4 minutes to the beach. Couldn’t have asked for more."),
("2018-10-07", "15806964", "John", "Anita is a lovely person.  She was very accommodating with check in and check out.  It's quite a challenge with long overseas flights that do not necessarily land or depart at convenient times.  Anita was quick to respond  very helpful in showing me around the neighborhood. The place is sparkling clean and has a brilliant view of the beach. Very comfortable and spacious study in an iconic location.  And a thoughtful host who will help you with anything you need!"),
("2018-10-14", "15806964", "Jizi", "Anita’s apartment is extremely tidy  it’s sparkling. I booked the apartment for my aunt and her son  they just love the sea view in the apartment. Anita is very nice and thoughtful  she shown us the facility of the room  given suggestions of good place nearby when we checked in  and prepared milk  cereal and biscuits for the guests. Thank you Anita! Definitely would come back again and highly recommended."),
("2018-10-20", "15806964", "Karen", "Excellent location right above icebergs and walking distance to everything in Bondi.  Good views  super clean with lots of little extras  quiet and comfortable. Anita is quick to respond to all communications. Wifi and Netflix available also."),
("2018-10-29", "15806964", "Talia", "I booked this apartment for my father when he came to visit  he had a great stay! The location is amazing! It is about as close as you can  get to the beach and Icebergs pool. Great cafe and a convince store right across the road  bus stop to the city right out front  and only minutes to the main shops/cafes of Bondi. Beautiful view too! The whole apartment was spotless and the bathtub was brand new. Anita is helpful and super fast with communication. She has stocked the apartment with tons of amenities from an umbrella  to a beach chair  to sunscreen to a sewing kit  she really has tried to think of everything you need. I highly recommend staying here!"),
("2018-11-04", "15806964", "Phoenix Remote Aerial", "Your hospitality to me and my wife make our stay in Australia something special to remember. We have stayed in everything from private island villas to 5 star Sydney hotels while in Australia and your apartment was our best pick by fare. (AC would have been nice  but who cares) We could not have asked for more from you or the accommodations. When we return to Bondi and we will! We will defiantly be staying with you again! If you stay will Anita you will not be disappointed  you will feel like a Rock Star!!!"),
("2018-11-11", "15806964", "Andrew", "I can't recommend Anita's studio enough. Perfect location  perfect host  perfect extra touches."),
("2018-11-19", "15806964", "Alan", "Great location and view."),
("2018-11-21", "15806964", "Rachel", "Anita bent over backwards so that we could have an awesome stay  she was so helpful and welcoming in every possible way! Thank you!"),
("2018-11-22", "15806964", "Paul", "Amazing location just above the icebergers - 2 minute walk to the pool and beach .  Views out over Bondi beach . Clean and nice apartment in an older style block ."),
("2018-12-07", "15806964", "Allie", "Anita is a great host. Very friendly and welcoming and provided great recommendations. The apartment is beautiful and clean with toiletries provided. Right on Bondi Beach and surrounded by tons of shops."),
("2018-12-11", "15806964", "Scott", "Awesome little studio unit; location is terrific; sweet interior homely finishes; superb attention to detail; all topped by a very kind and thoughtful host. Will definitely come back"),
("2018-12-15", "15806964", "Georgie", "Anita was the best host we have experienced and the apartment is so incredibly ideal we'll be coming back many times each year. We cannot sing Anita's praises high enough. The location  space and cleanliness rivals 5 star hotels. Fantastic."),
("2018-12-28", "15806964", "Andrew", "This  place is absolutely stunning.  Anita was such a brilliant host. She greeted me and gave me a tour around the apartment and building facilities which made me comfortable staying here. The apartment was very clean and has amazing views of the beach. Recommend this property for anyone wanting to be closer to the beach be it a holiday or even a staycation!"),
("2019-01-04", "15806964", "Sylvie", "Anita  your hospitality and your apartment were beyond our expectations of what an Airbnb could be. Every day  we discovered new things tucked away in drawers that made our stay so easy and feel like a home away from home. Whether it was fresh water in the fridge when we arrived or the sun screen  goggles  moisturiser  short bread cookies  olive oil  instant cappuccino (and the list goes on...)  we had more than we needed. Not to mention the view and the light. I'm not sure we can stay anywhere else in Bondi without thinking of your home. Thank you again for your warmth! We look forward to staying in your apartment again -- and recommending it to our friends."),
("2019-01-20", "15806964", "Anna", "A lovely place and location. The apartment is really great with a beautiful view. Anita as a host? Can’t think about a better one. She is so thoughtful and welcoming!"),
("2019-01-22", "15806964", "Salyna", "Anita was at the apartment to greet us upon arrival with a very warm welcome. She has thought of every detail and has everything you need for your stay! The location is perfect! Easy transport from CBD to Bondi and right across the road from the apartment. The view across Bondi is amazing and very convenient for the coastal walks. The apartment is spotlessly clean and comfortable. Anita is helpful providing a tour of the building and also giving valuable hints and tip for great coffee and breakfasts. We loved our stay in Bondi and if back will definitely be staying at Anita’s again. Highly recommended."),
("2019-01-24", "15806964", "Tim", "Highly recommend Anita's apartment. The location is amazing and the apartment has everything you need. Anita is such a great host also. We will be back for sure."),
("2019-01-27", "15806964", "Gerrit And Lynn", "This is a lovely studio flat.  Anita was very helpful.  We did not meet as she was off on a weekend trip as well  but that did not stop her from answering questions and being helpful.  The studio is everything that it states on the advert.  I think Anita has taken pains to show the view is partially blocked by the wall in one of the pictures.  Although the main picture in the advert must have been taken from hanging out the side window.  If you move you bed just right - you can sit on the bed and watch the beach (or move a chair to the right spot).  It is not a vista  but you do get a view of the beach.One thing I missed is that there is no air con.  It does not state that there is air con  but I just assumed that there would be.  There is a powerful fan that we did not have to turn on higher than the first setting.The TV reception was really bad.  I am sure that if Anita had been around  she would have been able to sort it out.  She said that it was not a problem in the past.  At her suggestion we used the casting function to the TV.  We tried that with both our phones and laptop.  The result was a lag in the picture to the sound.  We did advise Anita that it was not a huge issue  and it wasn't.  The studio is really close to everything and the place is cosy but not cluttered.  The location is just perfect and Anita was very helpful and accommodating.  We had a great time and unreservedly recommend this place.  Thank you Anita"),
("2019-01-29", "15806964", "Guido", "This was a lovely stay; nice flat. Great view to the sea. Impeccably clean. Great hosts  juts a few minutes from Iceberg's."),
("2019-02-02", "15806964", "Claire", "Modern spacious apartment in fantastic location with very easy access to transport to and from the city. Very welcoming and accommodating host - an overall great experience!"),
("2019-02-05", "15806964", "An", "Our stay at Anita's home was perfect. Even though you are in the heart of Bondi it was a small escape that was made even cosier by all the thoughtful touches that Anita has invested into the space. Thank you for a wonderful stay!"),
("2019-02-15", "15806964", "James", "Five star  book this wonderful apartment with confidence. Super host (Anita) who takes great pride in the property and service that she provides.  The apartment is modern  spotlessly clean and wonderfully located - everything in Bondi is no more than a 3 minute walk away. My wife and I had 7 wonderful trouble-free nights at this property and it will be our first choice when we return."),
("2019-02-18", "15806964", "Helen", "If this Airbnb is available  YOU HAVE TO BOOK IT! There are no words to describe how beautiful and close the beach this apt is. You honestly feel like royalty when you are here. The view is breathtaking- you see Bondi Beach from your bed. At night  you hear the waves crashing against the shore. Perfect location- close to the Bondi strip where all of the cute cafes  shops  restaurants are located. (Also  there is bus stop a block from the apt so you can get to Sydney Harbor/inner city  in 20 min for $3).  Anita does an amazing job at making you feel welcome and accommodated. This Airbnb is spotless  comfortable   and I would stay here a million more times if I could."),
("2019-02-21", "15806964", "Viren", "Anita’s place is excellent. Great location with everything you need."),
("2019-02-26", "15806964", "Corrie", "Anitas place is absolutely amazing the viewer spectacular spectacular the overall feel of the place is so lovely and Anita and her staff are so friendly and helpful if I ever return this would be where I would stay I recommend this space to everyoneabsolutely wonderful place to relax"),
("2016-12-02", "15893952", "Matt", "great place that is clean and quiet. owners were very helpful and I would recommend this property to anyone."),
("2018-04-06", "15893952", "Jitske", "Great  very kid friendly (lots of toys and space to play)  lovely decorated home! It’s not super close to the beach  especially with a stroller it’s a bit of a hike up the hill  but not too bad. Kids absolutely loved it and didn’t want to leave!"),
("2018-12-25", "15893952", "Jelle", "Really nice oasis in Manly with all the necessary amenities. Lauren was lightning fast in replying to any questions. Can highly recommend and when we are back we will try to stay here again!"),
("2019-01-03", "15893952", "Kentaro", "Amzing house and really easy to communicate with host! Definitely recommend this place to stay in Manly!"),
("2016-12-12", "15889399", "Abdollreza", "it's really great place for staying in Sydney"),
("2016-12-17", "15889399", "Suellyn", "What a gem!! Perfect accommodation for our weekend in Sydney. Cabin was spotlessly clean and Steven and his little family made us feel very welcome. Location perfect  within walking distance from great cafes and the train station."),
("2017-01-01", "15889399", "Eric", "Steven was a great host! Communication with him was very easy and friendly. Check in and check out was simple and the place was easy to find. The cabin itself is located behind property and was really cosy and very clean. It is obvious they put in a lot of effort to build such a beautiful cabin. Travelling around was easy as there are lots of cafes/stores in the area and a train station within walking distance. Cannot wait to stay here again!"),
("2017-01-13", "15889399", "Debbie", "Comfortable and clean cabin - convenient location for my weekend in the area."),
("2017-01-28", "15889399", "Dat", "A great little home  has everything you need for a short stay. Steve was very polite and hospitable. Would highly recommend!"),
("2017-02-02", "15889399", "Sibylle", "The airBNB place was a great find. It was really clean  comfortable  quiet & very convenient for the training location (Addison Street Community Centre). Steve  the host  knew the local area well and recommended a number of shops/cafes in the area."),
("2017-02-04", "15889399", "Sienna", "Steven's place is a lovely quiet cabin for any kind of traveller. It was incredibly clean  well quipped and so comfortable. The whole process was so easy and our stay was wonderful. Steven was very helpful and I would recommend his cabin to everyone."),
("2017-02-09", "15889399", "Jessica", "This was the perfect place to stay for us. It was close to public transport for business purposes and close to shops  restaurants  and parks for our little one.Steven and his family were extremely welcoming and helpful.The cabin was beautiful. Clean and light. The air con was a bonus as it was quite warm in Sydney at the time of our stay. They provided a porta cot for our baby which was an added bonus.It was very quiet and peaceful. Steven and his family kept to themselves  but were lovely to talk to on the odd occasion we bumped into them on the way out the door.We would highly recommend this place to stay. Thanks for having us guys "),
("2017-02-11", "15889399", "Cheree", "I couldn't recommend staying at this cabin enough.  It was beautiful and clean.  It's close to public transport and places to eat  but most importantly  the hosts  Steven and Peta were friendly and helpful.  Communication prior to arriving was clear and accurate.  They ensured our stay was comfortable  but also went out of their way with little extras things such as turning the aircon on before we arrived so our cabin was cool when Sydney was in the midst of a heat wave.  Great hosts  and a great place.  "),
("2017-02-19", "15889399", "Karen", "Ideal cabin for our stay  minutes to trains  grocery and laundry. Lovely hosts "),
("2017-02-22", "15889399", "Kelrick", "If I could rate this property six stars I would! Steven is obviously very proud of his property - the cabin is perfectly presented  immaculate  modern  practical and quiet. Restaurants  cafes and public transport are very close by. Hoping to make this my regular stay in Sydney. "),
("2017-03-03", "15889399", "Morag", "Great accommodation and lovely hosts. Beautifully appointed and immaculately finished  this cabin was in the perfect location for our holiday. Easy walking distance to transport  shops  pubs  restaurants and our Australian family. Thanks so much  Moira and Graeme."),
("2017-03-05", "15889399", "Miriam", "We had an absolutely delightful stay; so much better than staying in a hotel or B &B. Highly recommended."),
("2017-03-13", "15889399", "Ivy-Anne", "This is a great private space. The room is all you need for a short time away.  The bathroom is lovely with a great rain shower head.  There is wardrobe and small fridge and microwave. Is place is short walk to the train station which is only a few stops away from central or the bay. There are also lots of pubs and cafes in walking distance.Pack ear plugs if you are a light sleeper because there are planes in this area and maybe a eye mask of you don't want wake us to the sun. Totally I will stay again they next time I am in Sydney."),
("2017-03-19", "15889399", "Leon", "A great little cabin. Very convenient to shops and train  and hosts are very welcoming."),
("2017-03-26", "15889399", "Maja", "Me and my mum stayed in the cabin for a few days and we absolutely loved it. It's close to the train station and the train only takes ten minutes to the city center. The cabin was very clean and beautiful. Steven and Peta were nice and helpful hosts with two lovely children. Thank you Steven  Peta  Max and Zara  we really enjoyed our stay and would recommend this cabin to everyone who visits Sydney for a few days and wants to stay close to the center. Best regards Maja and Katja"),
("2017-03-29", "15889399", "Bryan", "We were delighted with the property. It is very clean and private  and has all the amenities one would desire. Communications from Steven was excellent. We would happily return."),
("2017-04-01", "15889399", "Tara", "Steven and his family offered a perfect personable getaway in a great location close to Sydney. We loved this little cabin and would definitely stay again  also Steven and his family were extremely friendly and helpful."),
("2017-04-10", "15889399", "Kerry", "Clean  modern studio  with some little extras that make a difference. Convenient location to public transport."),
("2017-04-14", "15889399", "Peter", "This is a great place  very new and clean  easy street parking and level easy walk to restaurants ect. I have not stayed in this location before but thought it was great. "),
("2017-04-18", "15889399", "Patrick", "Great location and easy check in  host is near by if needed  private access  would stay again when in Sydney."),
("2017-04-23", "15889399", "Laura", "Great location  close to the station. Very cosy  clean and has everything you need. We loved our stay and will be back. Netflix's and wifi was a bonus  so was the shampoo/conditioner and soap. So many awesome cafes for breaky and also dinner places. We loved the Indian and the famous Portuguese chicken. The room was very bright in the morning  and the planes were loud but that didn't bother us at all.  Highly recommend this gorgeous cabin. "),
("2017-04-30", "15889399", "Rachael", "Great place  great location. Perfect for a weekend in Sydney and a bonus with easy on street parking. Short walk to cafes and restaurants. Host was lovely and great communication. Will definitely book again. "),
("2017-05-06", "15889399", "Juliet", "As good as it looks."),
("2017-05-13", "15889399", "Margaret", "This cabin was beautiful and exactly as described. We found the hosts welcoming and the neighbourhood perfect for visiting family living in the inner north."),
("2017-05-25", "15889399", "Ricarda", "Lovely cabin in a great location. Very clean and private."),
("2017-05-31", "15889399", "Shae", "This beautiful cabin is perfectly located  within walking distance to shops & restaurants. I loved the overall design  far superior to the local hotel. All my needs were met with a lovely space to relax after my work. "),
("2017-06-02", "15889399", "Karen", "Great place to stay in Sydney. Clean  comfortable  great location and friendly and prompt help from Steven."),
("2017-06-23", "15889399", "Kevin", "Really lovely friendly guy. Great lil place to stay."),
("2017-07-10", "15889399", "Jachryandestama", "Steven has 2 lovely cats. :)"),
("2017-07-15", "15889399", "Gabrielle And Tony", "Steven has made a great little cabin with a lot of care and extra expense to give it valuable finishing touches.  It is great value and Steven was kind  helpful and easy to deal with.  For those unfamiliar with the area it might help to know the aircraft noise is enough to wake you up (from 6am) and takes some getting used to  the proximity to family and neighbour activities also means quietude may be elusive. It's a medium density neighborhood where backyard and rear-of-house activities spill into several properties.  There is also no possibility of excluding the morning light with the un-blinded high window. Overall  this listing has a lot to offer   especially if you're not planning a sleep-in."),
("2017-08-06", "15889399", "Bridget", "Steven was extremely helpful and communicative. The space was lovely  with everything you could want for a short stay. Fantastic location and easy to come and go as you pleased."),
("2017-08-13", "15889399", "Laurita", "Steven's cottage is divine  beautiful fittings throughout the cottage with a beautiful cosy feel  the cottage has it own private entrance and space. Steven and his wife are very friendly approachable people. Highly recommend staying here for a lovely stress free stay."),
("2017-09-11", "15889399", "Josephine", "Very nice cottage out the back of a quiet street location in an otherwise busy neighbourhood  very easy to get to local cafes and restaurants and nestled right between Stanmore and Petersham train stations for easy public transport access  great value! :) "),
("2017-09-18", "15889399", "Eirenes", "Steven is a very nice guy. The house is clean and comfortable  and near Petersham Station."),
("2017-10-02", "15889399", "Lee", "Such a lovely space that felt very cosy and private. Location is amazing as there are a couple cafes to choose from and a train station 5 min walk away. Steven and his family are beautiful and were very easy to get along with. They keep everything in perfect condition."),
("2017-10-06", "15889399", "Anna", "Very cute tiny home! Close to train station and great little neighbourhood with great portugese chicken and thai food!"),
("2017-10-09", "15889399", "Miriam", "Steven's place it utterly gorgeous. It is fantastic for a stay in Sydney and in a beautiful suburb close to lovely eateries. Steven and his family are friendly and helpful and we will definitely be returning!"),
("2017-10-18", "15889399", "Katja", "Wir haben  zusammen mit unserer vierjährigen Tochter  4 angenehme Nächte in Peta und Steven's Gartenhütte verbracht. Obschon der von Steven erwähnte Fluglärm gewöhnungsbedürftig war  haben wir uns gut erholt. Von Petersham aus konnten wir Sydney wunderbar erkunden. Peta und Steven waren tolle Gastgeber und waren jederzeit für uns erreichbar. Und das  obwohl sie beruflich und mit zwei kleinen Kindern gerade viel zu tun haben. Wir haben uns willkommen gefühlt und hatten dennoch ein angenehmes Maß an Privatsphäre. Wir haben unseren Aufenthalt sehr genossen. "),
("2017-11-13", "15889399", "Gus", "My little boy(14mths) and I  had a long stay in Steven's cabin  for almost three weeks while my partner was in hospital recovering from surgery.We found Steven and Peta to be very kind and generous hosts during this stressful period  of which we will always be very grateful. The lawn and garden in front of the cabin are perfect for little kids  and there were  playgrounds within walking distance. Numerous good and affordable restaurants and cafes very close by(5 mins walk/pram ride) and I was always able to find street parking. Highly recommend and we'll be back when next in Sydney."),
("2017-11-24", "15889399", "Sean", "Great location (close to shops & public transport)  super comfy with air-con  smart TV and a kitchen. Steven is super friendly & easy to get hold of via Airbnb/on the phone. Would definitely come back!"),
("2017-11-29", "15889399", "Kerra", "Steven’s place is lovely - a really well designed space with great facilities in a good location."),
("2017-12-09", "15889399", "Jessica", "I loved my time at Steven's place. Close to everything  neat  clean with little touches of luxury (can't compete with a waterfall shower head) - this is the AirBnB pick for you if you're searching for a slice of home in the big city. Steven is extremely welcoming and friendly  and if you're not familiar with the area  he'll soon fill your head with all sorts of inside tips and places to eat. Don't miss out on this Petersham paradise.What I loved: *The freedom to come and go as I pleased with ease via the side gate.*The bed was super comfortable. The villa is an ideal space for writers  professionals or anyone looking to get away on their own. Works for couples too. *The proximity to some of my old-school favourites  including Daisy's Milkbar."),
("2017-12-19", "15889399", "孝維", "Steven couple is a very friendly  beautiful and clean house  is highly recommended to everyone  I hope there is a chance to return here."),
("2017-12-30", "15889399", "Lynne", "Great place to stay.  Fantastic location near transport and good coffee/Portuguese chicken places."),
("2018-01-01", "15889399", "Derek", "it was a wonderful private cabin. love the environment!"),
("2018-01-05", "15889399", "Louis", "A great little place in a great location. Didn’t see the hosts much as was out exploring all day  but they were most helpful on check in and through email. The welcome from the cats was an added bonus. I would say that if the plane noise would really be an issue for you  this isn’t ideal  but thanks to the accurate description we went into this well aware of it and it wasn’t bothersome. Overall  a great stay in a lovely cabin in a very convenient location."),
("2018-01-20", "15889399", "Julie", "Stevens cabin is spotlessly clean  feels very secure and safe as it can only be approached through electric gates. Train station is 5 mins away. And there are good restaurants just round the corner"),
("2018-02-07", "15889399", "Debbie", "A lovely clean and comfortable cabin in a safe and convenient location."),
("2018-02-11", "15889399", "Gina", "We had a really lovely weekend stay in Steven's delightful cabin in Petersham and we enjoyed all the sites and sounds of the wondrful Sydney suburb. We hope to stay again next time we visit! Thank you Steven."),
("2018-02-17", "15889399", "Rose", "Tops! Stayed at Stevens with 2 y/o daughter and it was super convenient clean and comfy. Steven was friendly and helpful. Highly recommend!!"),
("2018-02-26", "15889399", "Gerard", "Very clean. Comfortable lounge. Great bed. Soaking shower. Nice little desk looking out the window."),
("2018-03-20", "15889399", "Elaine", "Lovely  airy  clean  modern and comfortable space. Steven and Peta were great hosts  very responsive when we had questions and extremely pleasant to chat with.  They gave great tips on the neighborhood cafes and restaurants and there are several nearby that were our favorites. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-03-24", "15889399", "Clive", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Steven's place. It was clean  airy and sunny with beautiful decor and a very comfortable bed. Our hosts were delightful. Two things to note  parking can be a bit tricky (though we succeeded each time) and the street is under the flight path so you might have a 6.00 am wakeup call that makes you want to duck. We are used to Sydney flight traffic control so we will be going back for another stay."),
("2018-04-02", "15889399", "Rachel", "Nice little place  very comfy bed and good shower.  Good job there's air con as it would be very hot without it! Short walk to Petersham station  the Oxford tavern  Nowa cafe which is excellent.  My only complaint would be the triangular window lets in quite a lot of light in the morning and it woke me up! Other than that it's a nice little place."),
("2018-04-19", "15889399", "Jill", "Steven’s little cottage is a total gem! I’ve stayed in many Airbnbs but this is possibly the best. Clean  stylish  well equipped  great linen  brilliant location  secure. I’ll be back for sure."),
("2018-05-24", "15889399", "Mahavir Gabriel", "Steven is an excellent host  very friendly and supportive. Location is very clean  full of light  simple and nicely equipped  for both  work and relaxation. Unless bothered by some transient airplanes flying over Petersham  which you can get used easily  then the place is also very quiet."),
("2018-07-01", "15889399", "Tess", "Faultless! This peaceful bungalow is exceptional value with everything you'd need during a busy visit to Sydney. It's in such a great location  too. Steven and Peta were easy to communicate with. Thanks for having us!"),
("2018-07-05", "15889399", "Jennie", "We really enjoyed our stay in the cabin in lovely Petersham."),
("2018-07-16", "15889399", "Bella", "Very private location and walking distance to train.  Few stops to the city.  Gorgeous cottage  two beautiful fluffy cats to meet you each morning and one huge goldfish in the pond on the front verandah.  So quiet and clean.  Will be returning.  "),
("2018-07-29", "15889399", "Mary", "Great place  lovely hosts and close to Petersham station. "),
("2018-09-02", "15889399", "Naomi", "The cabin is very comfortable  quiet  clean and beautifully furnished.  Location was perfect for us and we will definitely be staying again.  The communication with our host was prompt & friendly.  We appreciated having a TV also!"),
("2018-09-17", "15889399", "Bek", "I stayed at Stevens place for a few days whilst in Sydney for business. It was lovely and clean  stylish with homely touches. It’s in great location  only a 5 minute walk to the train station and shopping strip. Steven is very friendly and I highly recommend  his place to anyone visiting the area"),
("2018-10-03", "15889399", "Lindsay", "We really enjoyed staying in Steven and Peta's back garden cabin. Beautifully clean  light and had all the essentials. We came with our two young children  and our hosts gave us various options (we settled on a queen sized mattress on the floor for both of them). It was perfectly adequate for four  and for one or two people it would be positively spacious.  Petersham is just a short metro ride from the centre of Sydney  and the cabin is just round the corner from a lovely parade of shops and restaurants  so you will never be stuck for something to eat or drink."),
("2018-10-09", "15889399", "Naomi", "We keep returning to this Airbnb as it offers every comfort we may need and is in a very convenient location.  It has all the amenities you require and is in a quiet and safe area."),
("2018-10-21", "15889399", "Victor & Dougal", "Our stay at Steven and Peta's place was perfect.  We loved the area for its great cafes and Portugese flavour  its proximity to the train line and central Sydney  historic and beautiful buildings etc.  The unit is quaint and very comfortable  nice and clean.  Beautiful towels too  and very charming hosts."),
("2018-10-25", "15889399", "Annette", "We really enjoyed our stay at Steven and Peta's place.  A very well equipped cabin with a very comfy bed.  It's located in a quiet side street but in walking distance to buses and trainline."),
("2018-10-28", "15889399", "Rayid", "Steven's place was excellent - exactly as described  great location  close to public transit  clean  and just wonderful. Would definitely stay there again!"),
("2018-11-04", "15889399", "Kristy", "Steven and Peta’s AirBnB is a gorgeous example of inner city life in Sydney. The area is full of great restaurants and cafes  shady tree-lined streets  and friendly locals. The cabin itself is a cosy  immaculately clean  comfortable and thoughtfully appointed. We also had the pleasure of meeting Steven. A truly great stay - would recommend without hesitation."),
("2018-11-18", "15889399", "Lauren", "Stevens cabin is stunning and filled with light so you will have a cheerful relaxing experience. Definitely recommend it!"),
("2018-11-22", "15889399", "Scotty", "This is a wonderful space very wellAppointed easy access comfy bed and great shower and private Clean and tidySteven is a very amicable host There is cool vegan  cafe Nowa in walking distance from Steven and Petas placeHighly recommended"),
("2018-11-27", "15889399", "Naomi", "We have stayed several times at this Airbnb and will continue to in the future.  It is modern  comfortable  quiet  private and is in the perfect location for us.  Steven always answers us promptly and helps with anything we might need.  We have free parking on the street.  We were also delighted to be able to use Netflix."),
("2018-11-29", "15889399", "Alizeh", "Steven and his family were so accommodating and made us feel so welcome. We had an amazing stay in their cabin! Everything about the place was perfect  from the location  the space  the view  and all the amenities included. It was overall a very laid back and relaxing experience. Highly recommend  and hope to be back again one day soon!"),
("2018-12-07", "15889399", "Debbie", "This is the third time I have stayed in Steven's cabin. It is very comfortable and in a convenient location."),
("2018-12-10", "15889399", "Zelma", "The cabin was lovely & clean  well set out and yes - light drenched. Location was ideal - there was no problem with parking and we found some lovely cafes down the road. Check-in and out was easy & we thoroughly enjoyed our 2 night stay."),
("2019-01-02", "15889399", "Khara", "Lovely  thoughtful hosts who went out of their way to help us with recommendations for our child-related queries. They even left us a bottle of bubbly to see us into the new year. Very kind indeed. A gorgeous  well-designed cottage  that makes you feel like you're in the countryside despite being close to the city."),
("2019-01-21", "15889399", "Naomi", "Steven & Peta have a very comfortable  private  secure and modern unit at the back of their property.  We have enjoyed many visits over the past years.  They are friendly hosts who respond to any requests immediately.  The location is perfect - walking distance to Petersham train station  bus stops and the town centre including restaurants and shops.  It is quiet  has a TV  reverse cycle aircon  a lounge  iron and a kitchenette - everything you need for a comfortable stay.  We wouldn't hesitate to recommend their place."),
("2019-02-22", "15889399", "Tim", "Great value  very clean  nice and quiet  friendly host  private entrance  and it has everything you need for a few nights in Sydney."),
("2019-02-28", "15889399", "Michael", "I really enjoyed my stay at Stevens place. I'll be back again soon. Thanks again."),
("2019-03-02", "15889399", "Madeline", "A beautiful studio to stay in  the place was super clean and had everything we needed. Steven was quick to respond to messages and the checkin process was very easy. Would absolutely stay here again!"),
("2016-11-20", "15920870", "Olivier", "Great location  great studio and unique atmosphere with views over the horse race track! I would definitely stay there again. Oliver is a great guy and it was a breeze to communicate with him! I had an awesome stay!"),
("2016-11-21", "15920870", "Tom", "Had a lovely stay with my girlfriend. The view off the balcony was absolutely amazing  felt like a 5 star hotel. Oliver was very accommodating and gave us some handy tips for things to do in the area - thanks so much for such a great stay!"),
("2016-11-22", "15920870", "Febrinna", "This was my first airbnb and I can hardly put this property into words. The place was clean and comfortable and the view from the balcony was amazing. Waking up in the morning and hearing the horses clip clopping around Randwick racecourse was special and unique. Oliver was super accomodating and he was a great host. I was only there for a night but will definitely stay again!"),
("2016-11-30", "15920870", "Dean", "Your search is over. Amazing central location  close to everything.  Modern  clean space. Well equipped kitchen. The host is easily available and really knowledgeable about the area. Highly recommend.  "),
("2016-12-11", "15920870", "Dean", "Second stay with Oliver. Can't recommend his place enough. Close to everything!"),
("2017-01-06", "15920870", "Jamie", "Lovely modern place in a perfect location for the Racecourse  had everything we needed  and everything was pretty much brand new. Oliver was really helpful  whole apartment was spotless  wish we could've stayed longer!"),
("2017-02-14", "15920870", "John", "Great place  really spacious and amazing views of the Randwick Race course. "),
("2017-03-03", "15920870", "Joanna", "Really good staying in Oliver's apartment. Nice view and quiet. Close to public transportation. Would love to stay next time!"),
("2017-04-08", "15920870", "BanHup", "Oliver is a great host and we find his place suitably located for our purpose i.e. very near UNSW. His studio is also very clean and adequately equipped. He even provided drinks  a fruit basket  ice cream etc! Thanks Oliver. We will certainly be back."),
("2017-04-09", "15920870", "Benjamin", "Oliver was a great host and made our stay extremely easy. The apartment is clean and cool set-up with the TV. View from the balcony is fantastic."),
("2017-04-18", "15920870", "Christopher S", "This is a very nice clean studio  if like Horse Riding this is your spot  the place is very clean in safe neighborhood  Oliver was very helpful with the check in process  and there many good stuff such as coffee  beer  oatmeal  butter  cleaning stuff  dish washer  washing machine  drying machine etc.. It was A+ stay keep up the good work guys thanks for everything"),
("2017-05-23", "15920870", "Joshua", "Oliver has been absolutely awesome. Communication is so easy. The apartment is clean and neat. Travelled for work so bus to CBD is only 17mins away. Everything you need is all there. Even Netflix to relax after a busy day at work. Would definitely will come back to stay when I am back. Thank you Oliver!"),
("2017-06-06", "15920870", "Sutandi", "This is my 2nd time stayed there  and this apt is still amazingly wonderful. The view is really good  nice ambiance  clean and quiet. It's really family friendly.The host also very kind  they prepared everything nicely before we came to the apt. They really cooperative and helpful.Last time i came  they even put welcoming fresh fruits & milk.Definitely will be back there again when i come to Syd!"),
("2017-06-19", "15920870", "BanHup", "This is our second time in 3 months that we are back to this place. That tells a lot of my preference for this airbnb. We love the location - near shops and restaurants and especially its proximity to UNSW where my son is now studying. It is clean and well equipped. To top it all  Oliver is a great host being very flexible and responsive. I would highly recommend his place to everyone."),
("2017-08-28", "15920870", "Julio", "Nice place with a fantastic view of the race track Clean and cozy"),
("2017-09-02", "15920870", "Marcel", "Beautiful and modern furnished apartment with a great Location.Communication with Oliver was very good and easy."),
("2017-09-23", "15920870", "Amanda", "Olivers place is absolutely beautiful! It has a stunning view over the racecourse  so it's a very quiet and peaceful part of Sydney. The apartment was so clean with a very elegant and sophisicted style  I felt so comfortable and right at home. The location is perfect for getting around anywhere in Sydney  close public transport and only a 10 minute drive to city  double bay  Alexandria- it's perfect! I will definitely be staying again! Thanks Oliver :)"),
("2017-10-01", "15920870", "Sinlung", "You just need to bring your shirt and all set!"),
("2017-10-13", "15920870", "Julie", "My husband and I stayed here for a week. The place is great  it had everything we needed.We checked in on a Saturday (race day) and got to watch some of the horses race by from the balcony...with a glass of wine! I also enjoyed watching the horses being trained/walked early in the mornings. The TV was huge and we enjoyed watching Netflix/Stan. Having WiFi was also a bonus.We would definitely recommend friends/family to stay here. We would stay again.Thanks Oliver!"),
("2017-10-17", "15920870", "Brent", "Olivers place is great very quite peaceful areas in Sydney eastern suburbs beautiful new apartment with views of the racecourse Oliver is a great host easy to communicate with for check in and out"),
("2017-10-18", "15920870", "Judith", "Oliver's place is in a really unique location.  When it said trackside at Randwick I didn't really expect that I would be able to sit on the lovely balcony watching the horse train in the morning  like I was in a track side grandstand but that is exactly what happened! It is spacious for a studio  thoughtfully furnished and beautifully clean.  I really enjoyed my stay."),
("2017-10-24", "15920870", "Gordon", "This apartment presented just as anticipated. Terrific location quiet  relaxing  light comfortable and sunny. We only ate in for breakfast but having breakfast on the balcony in the sun with the horses training and the picturesque Randwick Racecourse on your door step was quite special. Oliver was very welcoming and leaving a bowl of fresh fruit on the dining table was a very nice touch. Highly recommend this property"),
("2017-11-11", "15920870", "Luke", "Oliver's place is spot on.  It's easy to see why he receives such great reviews. Would recommend & will stay with Oliver again for sure."),
("2017-11-20", "15920870", "Grace", "Great stay here. Really excellent wifi  better than anywhere else in the country. Close to the bus stop  comfortable bed  nice tv with Netflix! Would stay again."),
("2017-11-26", "15920870", "Erica", "This place is amazing. Lovely location  place/furnishing looks just as great as the pictures. Extremely safe area as well. Oliver was a great host with quick responses!"),
("2017-12-20", "15920870", "Meggie", "My daughter and I had a wonderful stay at Oliver's place at 'The Stables'.  It is new  fresh  comfortable with everything you need and a beautiful balcony opening up to the breeze. We really enjoyed the view overlooking the racecourse  and loved watching the horses getting walked past the apartment. We needed to stay close to the Prince of Wales hospital and I particularly liked that there was a secure car parking space for our car. "),
("2018-02-12", "15920870", "Kevin", "Lovely spacious studio with lots of natural light and very modern! Close to bus stops which go to CBD/beaches etc. everything you could need in the apartment and great view right onto the racecourse  would highly recommend Oliver’s place to anyone  he was very helpful & efficient with any questions we had!"),
("2018-02-16", "15920870", "Rohit", "Oliver’s apartment is conveniently located and has good quality equipment. He is also very responsive. However it appears that he has not paid attention to the cleanliness aspect and we found the place to be quite unclean with used unwashed bed sheets and covers and smelly towels. The supplies were also running low and we had to replenish them (though he did reimburse us). The trash can had something sticky and gooey in it so we just used trash bags without the dustbin. The tea supplies were past expiry date. All in all an unpleasant experience - wouldn’t go there again. Oliver says his cleaners let him down! Anyway  he refunded the cleaning fees  but frankly I expected a clean place to begin with with a so called “5 Star” host. Spoiled our trip. Never again!"),
("2018-02-22", "15920870", "Stew", "Great view of the racecourse and a good place to be away on business. Everything needed to cook a meal was there plus a stash of various sauces  herbs and spices. Mostly very quiet  but expect to hear the clip clop of horses passing by the window in the early morning."),
("2018-03-04", "15920870", "Helena", "This is a great place to stay and will make you feel to stay longer.  Nice place and amenities  close to everywhere."),
("2018-03-08", "15920870", "Carolyn", "Great place  convenient to the bus into town. Appreciated the condiments etc. Would stay again."),
("2018-03-16", "15920870", "Libby", "For my three day work stint at the UNSW this was a perfect base.  Clean  quiet and comfortable.  I liked the minimalist yet stylish decor.  The shower was great  and the kitchen had everything I needed and more.  Oliver is a lovely host.  I needed his help with a couple of things and he was responsive and considerate.  An enjoyable stay."),
("2018-03-24", "15920870", "Gener", "Oliver was very helpful and responded to messages timely. The place was clean and has great amenities I needed  close to Unsw and nice restaurants in the area. Highly recommended"),
("2018-04-05", "15920870", "Andrew", "The apartment is exceptionally clean  comfortable and perfectly presented. Oliver is extremely hospitable and lightning fast with communication and thoughtfulness. He went above and beyond letting me drop off some luggage early. Easy check-in/ out and perfectly located for quietness  yet close to anything you need. Everything was much better than expected  don't hesitate to book this place because I will next time I have the opportunity. The view of the race track while having coffee each morning was pretty cool too!"),
("2018-04-15", "15920870", "Rory", "Oliver's apartment is in a great location. 100m walk if you need to catch public transport or comes with a dedicated underground car spot if you  it.Well fitted out with everything that I needed for my stay. Clean  fast wifi  netflix  comfy bed  view over Randwick racetrack  good cooking facilities and bathroom.Oliver was quick to respond to any communication. Thanks Oliver for the stay."),
("2018-04-23", "15920870", "Jeremy", "Great modern design interior and located right in front of the horse racetrack. Those traveling with a car will greatly appreciate the free underground private parking space available. Will definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-05-12", "15920870", "Bruce", "Oliver’s place is exactly as described but better. Great location for local food and parks and great access to public transport to the city. Highly recommend and will be looking to stay again on my next business trip."),
("2018-05-25", "15920870", "Jo", "A great modern spacious apartment in a secure apartment complex. Perfect for what I needed. Has a laundry & full kitchen & basic kitchen essentials which was great for the meals I cooked. Also excellent public transport options only a few minutes walk away. Fantastic to have a secure car park if you do have a vehicle. The bed was also super comfy.Oliver was great to deal with always replying straight away.My only negative would be that it can be a little noisy. You can hear the lift which is just outside  the family with kids next door & the horses training in the morning. I am however a very light sleeper so may not be an issue for others & despite this I had a great stay & would recommend highly."),
("2018-05-28", "15920870", "Joakim", "I highly recommend this place. Just as described. My girfriend and i had a awesome time here."),
("2018-06-06", "15920870", "Eva", "This apartment was in an excellent location for what we needed. The space was stylish  modern and clean. I loved the attention to detail  including chemical free soaps  shampoos etc. Communication was easy and Oliver was a great host. Thank you!"),
("2018-08-12", "15920870", "Mikhail", "My wife and I loved Oliver's studio! Very clean and modern with beautiful views of Royal Randwick Racecourse. You get to see the trainers take their gorgeous horses for their afternoon stroll as you relax out on the balcony overlooking a plant nursery and the racetrack. The amenities were great and Oliver was very quick to respond to any enquiries. The studio is located in very close proximity to a lot of great restaurants. We were very happy with our stay."),
("2018-09-18", "15920870", "Md. Anower", "Oliver's place is really lovely in views of location  amenities  convenience  and enjoying horse races during the three Saturday evening was an extra! The place is much more beautiful than that described in the photos."),
("2018-09-30", "15920870", "Helena", "Great host and relaxing place makes you  keep coming back.  This is my second time booking with Oliver n still feel home as last time"),
("2018-10-11", "15920870", "Lei", "房间不错 很安全｡厨房设施齐全｡"),
("2018-10-26", "15920870", "Bronwyn", "Great location  awesome space with secure parking  close to food outlets with best view of Randwick Racetrack thanks Oliver"),
("2018-12-30", "15920870", "Sondre", "Reliable guy with a great place. I recommend Oliver as a  host!"),
("2019-01-01", "15920870", "Gabrielle", "Oliver’s place is great. Perfect location with lovely view of race track. Oliver has prompt response with easy check in and check out. Lovely apartment. Next door neighbours and kids slightly noisy and apartment is next to elevator so there is a little bit of noise at night time. Nothing to deter you from booking this great space! Thanks for the stay."),
("2014-05-19", "1584102", "Sally", "Bernadette and Fred were excellent hosts - warm  friendly and welcoming. Correspondence before our visit was great and instructions to the property were clear. The property itself was perfect - we couldn't have asked for more. Our area and the communal areas were spotless and we felt very comfortable in Bernadette and Fred's home. The house is stunning and views are beautiful  and it worked so well with our own living room  bathroom  bedroom and separate entrance. We couldn't have asked for a better experience!"),
("2014-06-01", "1584102", "Audrey", "Bernadette and Fred are fantastic hosts! Warm and welcoming  we felt very comfortable in their home. The 1-bedroom level is beautiful  comfortable  and private. Communications with Bernadette were frequent and clear. She was very flexible and patient with our scheduling issues. Buses into the city are frequent but do check the return trip as we took a long time getting back due to bad planning. Overall  we had a lovely stay and wished we could have stayed longer. Bernadette and Fred are wonderful. And their dog  Bilbo is just pure love. I could write so much more to recommend this place but will leave some of the wonder of discovery to you when you book this place. "),
("2014-06-22", "1584102", "Igor", "I had a great time staying at this beautiful house. Bernadette and Fred are very pleasant and hospitable people and couldn't have been more helpful and accomodating. Their house is lovely  comfortable and clean - 100% corresponds to the description.To tell the truth  the reality was even better than expected: cozy bedroom  big living room  bathroom and separate entrance. Three words best suited to describe this accomodation: hospitable  comfortable  private.I loved everything about it and will stay there whenever I go to Sydney.Bernadette and Fred - Thank you very much. "),
("2014-07-03", "1584102", "Maria", "It's really great! Thank you Bernadette  me and my mother had a good time in Sydney. The house is nice which has desperate living room and door for the guest. There is a nice cafe nearby. thanks again~"),
("2014-07-07", "1584102", "Marie", "I Loved Bernadettes home. It is a stunning house in a beautiful location. The views are amazing and the room was top notch...a great bed  bathroom and sitting area. Bernadette and Fred were very welcoming and friendlyI really enjoyed my weekend in Malabar and will be back.."),
("2014-07-13", "1584102", "Julie", "Our stay at Malabar was comfortable. Bernadette andFred welcomed us on the first night  and gave us the freedom to come and go as we pleased after that. The neighborhood was spectacular. We were a little surprised that there was no view of the coast from our rooms. All in all we had an enjoyable stay. "),
("2014-08-21", "1584102", "Lisa", "ich habe mit 2 freunden bei bernadette uebernachtet. die begruessung war sehr herzlich und wir haben uns gleich willkommen gefuehlt. unser appartement war sauber  grosszuegig und gemuetlich eingerichtet. die kueche durften wir mitbenutzen und der ausblick aus dem wohnzimmer ist atemberaubend! wir hatten einen seperaten eingang und auch die moeglichkeit unsere waesche zu waschen.malabar ist eine ruhige wohngegend  aber der bus nach sydney faehrt direkt vor der tuer ab. bernadette und fred sind sehr nette gastgeber und wir wuerden sofort wiederkommen."),
("2014-08-29", "1584102", "Becky", "Bernadette was away when we stayed  but her husband Fred made us feel very welcome and was a great host (Bilbo their dog was also very friendly!). The house is beautiful  in a stunning location  clean and tidy  has everything you need including use of washer/ dryer. They also provided lots of useful information on Sydney and the surrounding area and were helpful in giving advice on how to get to places. "),
("2014-08-31", "1584102", "Chi", "We stayed in a separate part of the house which had a bedroom  bathroom  and living room.  It was clean and tidy  very cosy  and comfortable.  There were magnificent views of the sea upstairs in the kitchen.  The hosts (Fred and Bernadette) were friendly and made us feel welcome.  We will definitely be coming back if we are in the area again!"),
("2014-09-14", "1584102", "Susan", "Bernadette  Fred and Bilbo were great hosts  very welcoming and very helpful to try and make our stay as enjoyable as possible.  Malabar is quiet with almost a village atmosphere and the house is beautifully situated close to the beach  ocean pool  golf club and the beach cafe.  The accommodation was clean  comfortable and easy to access.  We very much enjoyed our stay and Bilbo (the dog) definitely won my daughter's hearts!  Thanks Bernadette and Fred!"),
("2014-10-01", "1584102", "Kerry", "The apartment was very roomy  great position and comfortable. The new kitchen makes it totally self contained and the sunroom was a delightful bedroom for our daughter.  Lovely decor throughout. Bernadette and Fred were so helpful and willing to please. Short drive to the airport was a bonus for us. Will definitely keep it mind for the future."),
("2014-10-07", "1584102", "Joanna", "Bernadette made us feel extremely welcome. I especially appreciated that she had gone to the trouble of providing all public transport information  including a map of the nearest stops and timetables  also details of nearby eateries.  The apartment is lovely  clean  comfortable   had more than everything we needed and is in a very peaceful neighbourhood.  We thoroughly enjoyed our stay  would not hesitate to recommend to friends and family - fantastic as a base for exploring Sydney and for daytrips to Hunter Valley  Blue Mountains etc. but without the hussle bussle of the city.  "),
("2014-10-10", "1584102", "Matt", "Fred was nice enough to give me a quick tour of the unit and was very friendly and helpful.  The apartment was nicely appointed  very spacious  very comfortable  and the kitchen is literally brand new.  There is a gorgeous sitting area in the front of the apartment with views of Long Bay that is drenched in morning sunlight.  The bed and linens were all clean and very comfortable and generous amounts of soap and towels (as well as beach towels) were provided.  Malabar is a fantastic quiet community out of the hustle and bustle of Sydney that I spent the most time in and enjoyed the most.  I highly recommend checking out Little Bay as well as a fantastic swimming or snorkeling place.Can't say enough good things about the hosts  property  or location.  Would stay again without reservation!"),
("2014-10-12", "1584102", "Juanita", "Fred met us upon arrival and explained everything we needed to know about the unit  which has everything we needed.  A plate of lovely homemade slice made by Bernadette was on the kitchen bench for us! The local area is quiet and beautiful  with the beach only across the road and a corner cafe a short walk away for coffee  breakfast or casual dinner."),
("2014-10-29", "1584102", "Shirley", "My parants and i couldn't ask more for our pleasant stay in Bernadette's beautiful house.  This definitely will be our best memory of sydney. Everything was just perfect. From the welcoming cookie to farewell fruit salad ...Bernadette is so nice and that we do feel a bit sad we didn't have the chance to know her better. She provided more than we need   the kitchen is almost brand new ! We cooked and just felt we had a home in sydney ! The suit is so spacious and comfortable that i could stay for the whole day doing nothing. But sitting in my sun room watching the breath taking view from the window. We spent a lot of time on the beach and walked up to the golf club. We didn't swim but still there is a nice pool from where you can see far into the great ocean. There is even dive boat every friday for people to go diving !It is close to everywhere. Less than 15 minutes drive to city and almost 1 hour drive to all the southern  attractions. Lots of stores  restaurants nearby   can get coffee by 3 minutes walk ! We really had a good time especially this is our first time in australia. So lucky to have Bernadette hosted us. Will come back again for sure. Dear Bernadette   thank you again! Hope you enjoy your tennis and all the best to your family and bilboy !"),
("2014-11-02", "1584102", "Jennifer", "Fantastic. The apartment was perfect  so glad we booked this apartment. Bernadette was warm and welcoming having everything set out for us. You can tell that care was taking to have everything clean and ready for our arrival. All the kitchen basics and bathroom essentials like shampoo were provided. Even an extra yummy treat on arrival.  Great relaxing location in a relaxed neighborhood. I'm sure we will be back"),
("2014-11-04", "1584102", "Harry", "Very warm welcome. Property and location both excellent."),
("2014-11-14", "1584102", "Caglar", "Although it was a short business trip  I couldn't have picked a better place. The house is great with every aspect. Very nice  quite neighborhood. Thanks Bernadette for your kindness and everything."),
("2014-11-18", "1584102", "Roberto", "Excellent place in a beautiful areaWe had a very nice stay and I highly recommend this house. Comfortable  clean and great if you are looking for privacyBernadette and Fred are very friendly hosts.We'll be back."),
("2014-11-27", "1584102", "Elizabeth", "The directions received to find the location and accessing the premises were very helpful and complete.We were met with warm greetings by our host Bernadette upon our arrival.The accommodation was very comfortable and clean with everything supplied that we needed for our stay.Bernadette is a very accommodating and helpful host and helped making our stay very pleasant indeed.The area was very quite  and the front room overlooked the water making the experience very peaceful."),
("2014-12-09", "1584102", "Christopher", "Fred and Bernadette were excellent hosts  and made our week in Sydney much more enjoyable vs staying in a Hotel.  They were there if we needed anything  but also gave us our space.  The home is as advertised in their description.  Bus service just a few steps from your front door.  Strong WiFi signal.  You will find that the bed isn't as comfortable as the one you may have at home  but we slept very well with the ocean breeze cooling the apartment.  Laundry Room is around back of the Main House so be prepared to walk back and forth to manage your laundry.Beach Cafe nearby is open everyday for Breakfast and Lunch but is only open for dinner on Friday and Saturday from 500-830.  Excellent food.Groceries can best be found in Maroubra at Woolies or Coles.  There are also freshmarkets and meat shops there as well.  Great place to stock up if you are cooking for yourselves.Bus Service.  The 399 is the main bus you will use for most trips you make.  End of the line is Circular Quay in the CBD with no transfers.  Recommend getting an Opal Card to make travel quicker and easier.   **TIP** You will need an Opal Card for each traveller  you cannot share them for multiple riders.Airport Travel.  Take the 400 to Maroubra near PIcadilly Place and transfer to the 399 Little Bay.  $3.50 per person vs $40 taxi ride.Beach Walks.  We took the walk from the apartment to Coogee  about 4 miles.  Beautiful walk  but the 1st 1/3 of the walk you are cutting across neighborhoods and parks as the boardwalk isn't complete to Malabar yet.  Bondi to Coogee was very easy to navigate.  You should do both!Overall - We would highly recommend this location for Couples or a small familyon Holiday.  You will feel very ""local"" staying here  but the CBD and action of Sydney is only a 45 minute bus ride away with no transfers.Thanks Fred and Bernadette for starting our Australian tour off with a bang!"),
("2014-12-16", "1584102", "Stephen", "Beautiful setting and very comfortable accommodation.  Right by the sea  very peaceful and yet right next to a bus stop that takes you to CIrcular Quay in around 30 minutes.  Lovely!"),
("2014-12-21", "1584102", "Wei Jun", "Bernadette has been a great host  even going the extra mile to purchase a hairdryer when we needed one. The house faces the beach and the sunrise from the beach is absolutely lovely. Would definitely recommend anyone to stay in this apartment."),
("2015-01-01", "1584102", "Anke", "Wir hatten eine  sehr schöne Zeit bei Bernadette und Fred. Sie sind sehr nett und hilfsbereit.Die Wohnung hat eine schöne neue Küche und ein schickes Bad. Meerwasserpool und Strand sind direkt nebenan und die Innenstadt etwa 20 Minuten mit dem Auto - eine perfekte Kombination"),
("2015-01-05", "1584102", "Phillip", "We had such a lovely time at this super location right opposite the water. The unit is well-appointed  with quality furnishings & linen. It was nice to have a sweet home-baked slice on our arrival. Hope to be back again soon :-)"),
("2015-01-16", "1584102", "Susan", "Great place  even better than before now it has a kitchen and extra room.  Bernadette  Fred and Bilbo were as helpful and friendly as ever."),
("2015-01-30", "1584102", "Elizabeth", "We have just completed two weeks in Bernadette's wonderful property. We were made very welcome with home made slice  fresh flowers and a happy grin from Bilbo the dog!The accommodation was first class - comfy bed  excellent shower and almost new kitchen. The location is also great with lovely views of the pretty bay from the secluded patio where we had breakfast or morning coffee on many mornings.All in all  we would say this was one of the best Air B&B's we've used - and we've used it quite a bit both here and in Europe.Highly recommended."),
("2015-02-01", "1584102", "James", "Bernadette's instructions on how to get there were easy to follow and accurate. We arrived to find chocolate slice on the kitchen table and juice in the fridge. The apartment was very well-appointed and suited our needs perfectly. The location was fantastic with views across Little Bay. We have 3 young boys who were itching to get down to the beach. Fortunately for us  even though nearly all of Sydney's beaches were closed the weekend we were there due to large swells  Malabar Beach was protected form the weather so we were still able to swim.  Malabar is a quiet suburb  away from the usual hubbub of Eastern Suburb beaches. We plan on returning soon for our next Sydney weekend. "),
("2015-02-28", "1584102", "Laura", "We had an amazing time in Malabar. The appartment is fantastic and Bernadette and Fred are lovely people. They are very helpfull and they made us feel very welcome"),
("2015-03-10", "1584102", "Ruwani", "My husband & I spent an enjoyable 4 nights recently at this property which is well presented & spacious with self catering facilities. Our lovely hostess Bernadette presented us with a plate of yummy chocolate slice  juice  milk & fresh flowers. Excellent location with great views of the water. A short walk to the rock pools  bus stop (bus goes to Circular Quay every 1/2 hr) & the Beach cafe which serves reasonably priced delicious meals! "),
("2015-03-28", "1584102", "Keith", "We thoroughly enjoyed our restful stay in this Malabar beach apartment . Fred gave us lots of local knowledge and was really helpful.We enjoyed breakfast at the local beach cafe  and swimming in the rock pool literally across the road.We arrived in the dark from the airport  tired and disheveled   but were welcomed into this comfortable apartment with minimum of fuss  and awoke in the morning to a view of the sparkling ocean.Thank you Fred and Bernadette for our 1st very positive introduction to AirBNB."),
("2015-04-06", "1584102", "Nguyen", "We had a great time staying at Bernadette's apartment  they were friendly and very generous. The view from apartment is just amazing  we definitely will stay again :)"),
("2015-04-12", "1584102", "Peta", "We recently (April 2015) had an amazing time at Bernadette and Fred's place! All communication was prompt and clear and the apartment was well equipped with everything you could need and want. Location was brilliant - beach across the road and ocean pool  walks  cafes and restaurants within walking distance. We had a hire car but public transport stopped right outside and was easy to use for access to the city. Our girls (7yr  11yrs) had a great time and want to always stay here (we have stayed in the city every other time in the past) but this was a lovely change of pace. Fred offered use of kayaks and was extremely hospitable with local knowledge and suggestions. Bernadette left fresh orange juice and chocolate slice when we arrived and cereal and tea/coffee for breakfast. Apartment has new kitchen and there was nothing extra we needed that was not provided.  Thank you so much for a brilliant stay - we will definitely stay again!!!"),
("2015-04-18", "1584102", "Robbie", "Bernie & Fred's home is stunning  immaculate   with the ocean at their door step - you simply cannot ask for anything more accommodation wise.  We thought we knew Sydney pretty well but this area will become one of our favourite new spots.  My (then partner and now) wife Karen stayed here with her bridal party as we searched for accommodation that would allow us to be close to where we would marry the next day.  Fred greeted us warmly on arrival which included a lovely celebratory champagne bottle  a congratulations card  and the most yummy chocolate slices (that were demolished on sight!) - such a thoughtful touch and greatly appreciated.  The accommodation itself was even better than we'd hoped.  Immaculately furnished  clean to a tee  very spacious  with super comfy beds and living area - just what you want when you're   wanting to chillax inside and out.  This was our equal first airbnb experience (Karen stayed here and I was 5 minutes away in other accommodation)  and this sets the highest bar for all future bookings.  Bernie was really easy to deal with during the booking experience and accommodating and flexible to any particular requests we put forward. Great hosts but even better people.  Really  everything you needed was there at your fingertips.  We are lucky to have this home captured as the backdrop for several of Karen's ""getting prepped"" professional photos for the hours leading to our wedding - immortalised forever.  Great value  simply couldn't fault it.  Thank you!!!"),
("2015-05-04", "1584102", "Barry", "We were made to feel very welcome indeed. Bernadette and Fred provided just the right amount of contact.  The apartment was excellent  in a most wonderful situation  across the road from the Pacific! The bus stops virtually outside the property which is very convenient during the hours of 7am to 7pm and is a short walk afterwards.   It is close to a gold club (with a bistro) and close to the Beach Cafe.  Malabar beach is VERY unspoiled and pretty.We were in the area to visit with our son and his family and will definitely return to this property if it is available  on a future visit to Australia."),
("2015-05-24", "1584102", "Georgie", "Sensational!!!  Beautiful views and location  gorgeous apartment and fantastic hosts.  Was just the perfect location for our family weekend.  We all felt comfortable and really enjoyed ourselves.  We highly recommend this accommodation  you will not be disappointed:)."),
("2015-06-01", "1584102", "Andrew", "This apartment was very well equipped.  The hosts communicated well and we had a very accurate description of how to get there and what to do when we did.  Nice little welcome plate of biscuits and some fresh orange juice went down well after our journey.  Kitchen  washing machine  dryer  fridge  hot plate all as new and worked well.  Shower was brilliant.  We found that we didn't need to bring as many things as we did.  The location was great with a local café for your morning coffee less than 5 min walk  a park near by for the kids and a great view.  Took about 30 min by car to get to the city"),
("2015-06-15", "1584102", "Su-Yin & Simon", "We booked Fred & Bernadette's lovely apartment for my parents  who stayed one weekend in June. Because we live in the area  it was nice that they were so close to home  and experienced what Malabar-life is like. My mum even went swimming twice in the rock pool! The apartment was great - nicely furnished  in a scenic location and well-heated. They really enjoyed staying there. Breakfast items - tea  coffee  Milo  Vegemite  milk  orange juice and cereals were also provided. We will definitely book their place again if we ever need to!"),
("2015-06-21", "1584102", "Tomy", "Fred was a very nice man. He helped a lot while me and my family staying. Especially  their dog was so cute. The house was in a perfect condition as the picture. The view from the house is fabulous. We love to stay longer if we could."),
("2015-06-25", "1584102", "David", "So lovely to wake up to water views and a sense of space. Fred & Bernadette took the time to provide lots of little items that really made the accomodation feel like a mates home where you drop by - just bring your clothes and relax. Mum (77) found her bed so comfortable she slept through which she doesn't at home. Our hosts were very polite  always responsive in a timely way.We wish we had more time to enjoy the place and the saltwater ocean pool across the road. Yes we would stay again and look forward to enjoying the delicious slice Bernadette took the time to bake and welcome us with. Thank you for a lovely first AirBnB experience."),
("2015-06-28", "1584102", "Angus", "Fred & Bernadette were very welcoming and helpful. It is in a good location with easy access to the city. With the bay and beach on your door step."),
("2015-07-01", "1584102", "Genting", "My family and I have enjoyed the house and amazing bay view very much. Fred & Bernadette are so friendly and nice. The house is ideal. We just felt like we are at home when we stayed in that cozy place. We wish we had more time to enjoy the lovely house and the water view."),
("2015-07-11", "1584102", "David", "Fred & Bernadette are great hosts. The size  location and range of facilities within their apartment exceeded our expectations. Would definately recommend staying here."),
("2015-07-16", "1584102", "Ann", "Lovely apartment  in a stunning seaside location. Home from home  with everything you need. Bernadette's home baked biscuit's on arrival! Fresh orange and complementary tea  coffee and breakfast cereal  little touches like this make such a difference! Fantastic little beach cafe minutes from apartment is a must! Great find and if we are lucky enough to visit Australia again would definately book in future as we ran out of time to see all that Sydney has to offer!!!"),
("2015-07-20", "1584102", "Teagan", "I loved my time here. Beautiful quiet area  and the place was lovely. Very clean  and nice homely touches. Bernadette had left some yummy homemade slice on the table for my arrival  which was just what I needed after the flight and drive! Great location  close to shops and cafes  yet secluded enough to feel very peaceful. They even helped me work out Netflix! "),
("2015-07-23", "1584102", "Tim", "My wife and I loved this apartment. Very clean  with a lovely homely feel. Lots of little extras similar to a 5 star hotel. Quiet neighbourhood with great views. Would stay again."),
("2015-07-26", "1584102", "Derek", "Fantastic stay. Just like the pictures it was a beautiful apartment and location. Thanks Bernadette for the yummy home made biscuits on arrival with orange juice. Fred was a terrific host and I enjoyed my chat with him. A very wise man! Thank you both so much and can't wait to return. Loved the Beach cafe near by also."),
("2015-08-02", "1584102", "Godwin", "This is really an Ideal home away from home. The apartment is just by the bay and offers great waterfront views. Fred and Benedette are amazing hosts  and in addition to providing excellent suggestions  provided a dossier  which had very useful tips on things to see how to get around. The house itself is a 2 bedroom apartment with the second bedroom facing the waterfront  and furnished with a pull out sofa bed. It's in pristine condition  exceptionally clean and very family-friendly. My two kids both under five years old slept all through the night so I know the were comfortable. Ideal location for a quiet stress free holiday."),
("2015-08-07", "1584102", "Jane", "Fred and Bernadette went out of their way to have the apartment ready early for us after the long flight from England with our two teenage children. There were thoughtful touches like cake  juice  coffee  cereal etc ready to help us settle in. We all felt very comfortable in this spacious homely apartment. Buses into the City were easy to use and close by. A quiet  pleasant neighbourhood in an amazing setting. The view of the bay and nearby golf course were outstanding. We only stayed three nights but would happily have stayed longer."),
("2015-08-13", "1584102", "Seiki", "There are no difference between picture and real apartment.It is beautiful apartment.I really want to go again."),
("2015-08-17", "1584102", "Sarah", "So nice to stay here! Beatiful sunshine beach! Quiet place  u just need to open door then u can enjoy so blue seaside! Will stay here next time! Thanks Fred and his wife!!!"),
("2015-09-06", "1584102", "Ian", "The beachside apartment turned out to be a great choice for us. Bernadette and Fred were a delight to deal with. The apartment was lovely and beautifully sited next to the beach and brilliant for getting into Sydney as the bus stops literally outside the door. This gave us a great start to our Australian holiday and we would recommend it 100%. Thanks Bernadette and Fred!The Worthington family  Harrogate UK."),
("2015-09-16", "1584102", "Anna", "On arrival we had a very warm welcome. We were shown around the accommodation which was of an exceptionally high standard. Our welcome pack included tea  coffee  milk and orange juice. Fantastic location  across the road from the bay. And a direct and regular bus route into circular quay. Would highly recommend staying with Fred and Bernadette and if we find ourselves back in Sydney in the future  we would definitely try and stay there again."),
("2015-09-21", "1584102", "Ma. Christina", "Our stay has been very memorable. The house was charming  clean and well equipped  with the beautiful beach at your doorstep. Fred and Bernadette were very warm and attended to our needs. "),
("2015-09-25", "1584102", "Sherry", "It was everything it promised.  Fred and Bernadette took the time to answer all my questions via email before our stay.  The kitchen was well equipped with basic condiments  milk. juice and homemade sweets."),
("2015-10-13", "1584102", "Karen", "Fred and Bernadette were very welcoming.  There were home baked goods for us on our arrival and a good stock of condiments in the pantry.  Everything was clean and well kept.  Someone was always available if I had questions."),
("2015-10-19", "1584102", "Kim", "This was the perfect location for a relaxed stay in Sydney; located right on  the water  and the local saltwater pool was gorgeous. The   picnic area at the beach includes a large covered play area for the kids and was the perfect back drop for a family catch up. And 10-15 minutes drive form everything in town. I loved it.  Fred and Bernadette provided a very welcoming and comfortable space; and have thought of every detail. It felt like a home away from home. Thank you. Kim."),
("2015-11-12", "1584102", "Jamie", "Fred and Bernadette are a lovely couple and helpful in many ways.The neighbourhood is quiet and is ideal for relaxation.Its a very convenient place to stay to travel around Sydney.Plus the beach view is a surplus!"),
("2015-11-15", "1584102", "Mavis", "They're really nice host. Fred welcome us into his apt when we arrive & help us out with the foldable sofa. It was pouring on that day so he lend us umbrellas as well. Apt was neat tidy & clean. They have juice &water in the fridge as well as brownies as a welcome gesture. We enjoyed 2 days of stay there. They also have an awesome view of the sea just outside the house which we really like.  Would love to stay there again if I vist again. Thanks for having us Fred & Bernadette :)  "),
("2015-11-22", "1584102", "Linda", "We arrived early from interstate and the apartment was ready for us  Fred was on hand to explain everything and give us some tips on catching the bus.   The apartment was exactly as described and the location was fabulous.  The beach and sea pool were much utilised as the temperature climbed to 42 degrees  even beach towels were provided  in fact we had everything we needed for an enjoyable stay.  Although we travelled to Sydney to see the touristy sites  we found it hard to leave Malabar  the cafe a few minutes up the street and the golf club restaurant meant easy access to good quality meals and coffee.  A thoroughly enjoyable stay  thanks Fred and Bernadette "),
("2015-12-01", "1584102", "Tracey", "We were very warmly welcomed by Fred and Bernadette to their home in Malabar. The self contained apartment was beyond our expectations and our only regret is that we only stayed for 2 nights. Fred was very thorough in his explanation of all the amenities  both in the apartment and around the local area.Bernadette made a lovely slice as a welcome which we enjoyed very much with a cuppa one afternoon. We stayed there to attend a wedding held locally and unfortunately didn't have enough time to fully enjoy the area  or even watch the tv!The mattress was comfortable as were the pillows (very important points for me). A friendly cafe serving breakfast and lunch  and dinner on  I think  Friday and Saturday night  was just a short walk away  probably less than 5 minutes. Good menu and reasonably priced. We didn't get to swim in the bay and we didn't have any need for the children's playground but young families could really make good use of both.  We had such a lovely stay and would definitely return  given the opportunity. Thank you very much Fred and Bernadette!"),
("2015-12-17", "1584102", "Senta", "We had a lovely Stay!!! All comments  pictures etc. We're just right! This is the perfect place to stay. We found all we needed for the three off us. Fred and bernadette were really friendly and nice and we loved to be there. Also for citytrips as well as beach vacation perfect destination. U can't find better ( and as we are working in hotel we know what's good "),
("2015-12-23", "1584102", "Lee", "We were really unlucky with the weather. 48 hrs of torrential rain. So it is a bit difficult to review the area as we just couldn't enjoy the beach or sea pool. However the property was lovely. Very clean and tidy. Very modern and all as you would want to find it Bernadette greeted us and showed us around.  Cookies resplendent on the table   fresh orange juice in the fridge. Unless you have a car be prepared  as the nearest useful shop is a bus ride away. Central Sydney is about a 45 minute bus ride away but it doesn't feel that long. If the weather had been kinder I think this would have been a perfect place to explore Sydney from."),
("2016-01-01", "1584102", "Xiaojie", "great house clean good location"),
("2016-01-05", "1584102", "승범", "Fred is very kind and warmI love his house Everything was clean and tidyThe view from the small room was fantastic seeing the sea"),
("2016-01-10", "1584102", "Kim", "Wonderful location and was exactly as described. Very homely and spacious after staying in 1 bedroom as we are travelling this was a luxury for us.Beach across the road which is better than Bondi Beach. Thanks for your hospitality."),
("2016-01-19", "1584102", "Ramsin", "The apartment in Fred and Bernadettes home was wonderful - so clean and new. It was also a pleasure meeting them  they were very helpful and kind. As we didn't have a car  we found it a little difficult dining out  as on our last day  both the local cafe and golf club restaurants were closed (a Monday). There's a little cosy beach nearby and the views from the terrace were wonderful. "),
("2016-01-24", "1584102", "Jen", "We absolutely loved Fred & Bernadette's place and I'm already planning to return soon! The unit is fully self contained  clean and has everything you need (including wifi  Netflix and coffee)!Malabar is a lovely town with a nice quiet beach  great ocean pool  restaurant overlooking the water and a great beach cafe (which does fantastic pizza!).I highly recommend this place  it's great. I'm looking forward to returning soon."),
("2016-02-25", "1584102", "Xiao", "The beach nearby house is as exact as the description  no more than 1 minute to bus station. The hosts is quite warm  and I strongly recommend the house as your best choice in Sydney."),
("2016-03-15", "1584102", "Peter", "We were visiting our daughter in Sydney and we enjoyed our 16 day’s stay at Fred & Bernadette's place very much. The unit is fully self contained  clean and has everything you need (including wifi  Netflix and laundry possibilities). Malabar is a lovely town with a nice quiet beach  great ocean pool  restaurant overlooking the water (open from Wednesday till Sunday) and a beach cafe (open till 15.30 on Friday and Saturday till 20.30). The bus 399  takes 45 minutes to Central Quay  stops in front of the house and in the evening at a 2 minutes walk. For the bigger shopping centers  as detailed in the welcome book  you can better use a car  smaller shops are on a 10 to 15 minutes walk. Fred & Bernadette were very helpful  thanks for using the opal cards. I highly recommend this place."),
("2016-03-22", "1584102", "Bec", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay in Fred and Bernadette's home. Location was beautiful and a calm  quiet contrast to the hustle and bustle of the city.  The apartment was spacious  well equiped and very comfortable. Would not hesitate to stay here again when we return to Sydney. Thank you :)"),
("2016-04-10", "1584102", "Zixuan", "We had a really good experience at Fred's place  they are very responsible and always respond me quickly.  The place is beautiful and Everything was as described  we did snorkelling  swimming and fishing in front of their door.  Highly recommend it to traveller with their own motor vehicle. "),
("2016-04-20", "1584102", "Clivia", "Thanks for letting us stay at your wonderful apartment. It was even more beautiful than in your description and the pictures. What a perfect place to start our holiday."),
("2016-04-26", "1584102", "Jen", "My second stay at Fred & Bernadette's place was great! The morning sun & sound of the waves crashing is just divine. Once again the apartment was clean and there was even a birthday card with a present! I wish I could go back more often  highly recommended."),
("2016-04-30", "1584102", "Sabina", "Such a gorgeous place ! The pictures do not to it justice - definitely recommend this place. Fred and Bernadette are such wonderful hosts !"),
("2016-05-11", "1584102", "Jeffrey", "Fred and Bernadette's home is a magnificent place to stay while visiting Australia. I highly recommend reading the welcome book upon as they have included a wealth of information inside. The views are spectacular and the apartment is clean and pleasant.  A bus pass is a definite must for easy travel into Sydney."),
("2016-05-14", "1584102", "Lisa", "Myself and my Mum (82) and my Dad (83) stayed at Fred and Bernadette's for 2 nights.  Everything was exactly as we pictured.  Good communication before we arrived ensured smooth arrival.Welcome Book was very helpful especially the bus timetable.  Perfect place to stay with the bus stop pretty much on the doorstep going into the city and circular quay.  Very peaceful place to stay."),
("2016-05-19", "1584102", "Eric", "The house is silent and comfortable.  The kitchen has all things we needed.  The location is also very good and it closed to the beach."),
("2016-05-25", "1584102", "May", "Nice n cosy house. Near to shops  near to city. Good stay!"),
("2016-06-28", "1584102", "Roy", "We had a wonderful time at Fred's Place  the unit was exactly as shown in the pictures. It was very beautiful and clean  complete with all the amenities you need. The view from the unit are picture perfect  it has a private beach and walled pool. Going to the city was so easy and convenient by bus that stops just a few meters from the unit. I would definitely recommend this place.  "),
("2016-07-04", "1584102", "Sylvia", "The apt was wonderful  clean  quite  comfortable  convenient transportation with nice view. The apt was exactly how it looks from the pictures  very nice to stay there!"),
("2016-07-10", "1584102", "David", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay!  Fred and Bernadette's place was lovely and inviting.  Upon our arrival  Fred recieved us and showed us around the place.  The place was nicely furnished and information on the local sights were also neatly layed out for us.  The place overlooks the lovely Malabar Bay.  I am confident that future guests will enjoy the place just like we did.Thanks again Fred and Bernadette!   "),
("2016-07-26", "1584102", "Amanda", "Beautiful and super clean place across the road from a beautiful park and beach. Fred and Bernadette are super helpful. Loved the welcome cake and juice upon arrival which was a really nice touch! Thank you for a lovely weekend stay."),
("2016-07-30", "1584102", "Noella", "Enjoyed the few days I spent at this property. Was not familiar with the Malabar area although I have lived in the Sydney eastern suburbs for many years. Quite a discovery! Being in Sydney but feeling like being on a weekend on the South Coast. Lovely. The apartment is very nice with all facilities and very comfortable. Very welcoming thoughtful attentions."),
("2016-08-17", "1584102", "Debbie", "Lovely accommodation that I highly recommend. We were welcomed with fresh cooked banana bread and so many home comforts that made our stay just like a home from home. Fred and Bernadette put so much thought into everything they provide in this accommodation and it was lovely location with a great breakfast cafe just down the road :-)"),
("2016-08-28", "1584102", "Peter", "Fred was a really helpful host. We came with our 11month old son  and he had a high chair and cot waiting for us. The place was spotless and a joy to come home to after a day in the city. Very accommodating and lovely people"),
("2016-09-13", "1584102", "Subhodip", "Me and 2 other friends stayed at Fred & Bernadette's wonderful place. We could not have possibly asked for a better place to stay during our trip to Sydney. Fred/Bernadette provided us with a detailed book on how to get around  where to go for food  best spots in Sydney  and even nearby attractions. They made the arrival process very easy by providing us very good details on how to get to the house. The house itself had a 12/10 view! It really is spectacular to see the coast across the street when you wake up in the morning. The house had plenty of amenities and we did not want for anything. There is a bus that goes directly to Circular Quay in the middle of the CBD so that was very convenient. Altogether  this is the house to stay at if you go to Sydney! "),
("2016-09-25", "1584102", "Denise", "Very friendly and helpful apartment really private and user friendly and exactly as advertised  a hidden gem ☀️"),
("2016-10-04", "1584102", "Con", "Fred & Bernadette's place is just magnificent....Style  ease of access  views and general surrounds were all top class.Access to the city was also easy and although we had a rental car  one could use the bus which travels past the property.Across the street was a wonderful view of the small bay at Malabar and golf courses withing a 3 min walk up the street.The place was clean and had everything one would need for a lovely stay.Would definitely recommend this property for families.We would certainly love to stay there again."),
("2016-10-10", "1584102", "Rod", "The apartment is exactly as advertised and was everything we wanted while we were in Sydney attending a wedding. The apartment was clean  well stocked with consumables and was in a fantastic position on the foreshore of Malabar beach. Checking in and out was easy  parking outside was readily available and the views are spectacular. It was perfect for what we were after for our short stay in Sydney."),
("2016-10-13", "1584102", "Jun Sik", "It was great time to stay in Fred & Bernadette places.Most of all  house is located in near beach side and beach swimming pool. - This can explain about the best benefits for choosing this house!!In addition  House is really clean  tidy and spacious.It is easy to park the car near the house  so no need to worry about the car park.Fred is a nice and kind host that you don't worry about asking himIt is a good experience to stay in this AirBnB in Syd"),
("2016-11-05", "1584102", "Pat", "The apartment was exactly as described. It is quiet  comfortable and relaxing and right next to the sea and right on a direct bus route to the city.Fred and Bernadette provided some nice basics - milk  juice and more on arrival and a very comprehensive guide to the area and the city.We would definitely make a return visit."),
("2016-11-29", "1584102", "Karen", "A lovely apartment in a residential scenic area. Public transport was near and good during the daytime hours. It was very clean and well equipped with comfortable bed and sofa bed. The room at the front was a little noisy with comings and goings as we used this room with the sofa bed as a second bedroom but it was clean and comfortable. Great laundry facilities with soap powder and a drying area. Well equipped with everything we could possibly need and also little extras were included to make us feel at home. The hosts are very friendly and helpful people."),
("2016-12-07", "1584102", "Susie", "It was a great stay and everything was as described. We really enjoyed the place  the hosts were friendly and wonderful. Overall  it was great and we would recommend it!"),
("2016-12-14", "1584102", "Kathy", "We had a perfect stay in Malabar with Fred and Bernadette. It's a wonderful space with everything you need. We shall miss having our breakfast in the sunshine with such a great view of the ocean. We were visiting family and it was wonderful to be so near to the beach."),
("2017-02-14", "1584102", "Laura And Kamilo", "We had such a great stay here. The apartment is perfect for couples and small families. The view to the sea is gorgeous and the area is ideal if you want something authentic and truly local. The beach opposite is lovely and there is a great rock pool and local cafes. its an easy  direct bus into town. thanks so much Fred and Bernadette. "),
("2017-03-05", "1584102", "Gideon", "Excellent apartment with all the facilities a visitor would need. We had an excellent stay."),
("2017-03-11", "1584102", "Krystyna", "Fred and Bernadette's place was lovely  clean and had everything we needed for a great break in Sydney. They were quick to help and reply to messages. I would happily stay there again.It's right on the coast  with a lovely view from the front and is only minutes walk away from the beach  playground and a lovely cafe.They left us out a highchair  and camp cot  banana bread and fresh juice and milk in the fridge. There were towels for the beach and a few beach toys. What more could you want!The apartment in underneath their house  with side private access. Although the front garden goes straight out onto the street (something that concerned me with small kids)  there is actually a gate between your door and the street  so it's safe for kids to mill around out the front of the door whilst you get yourself sorted. The space felt very private and quiet."),
("2017-03-29", "1584102", "Audrey", "A beautiful apartment. Spotlessly clean. Excellent host. Brilliant location. Would highly recommend staying here. My only negative would be no air con but apart from that it was one of the best places we have ever stayed in."),
("2017-04-11", "1584102", "Fiona Saputra", "This lovely and warm house is excellent ... beachfront  warm home feel  bright  clean  public bus stop is just a minute away. The beach is a beautiful one with an ocean pool. So not only dip into it and kids may find it interesting as well.Kitchen is fully equipped with everything a family may need. The host is a kind couple. We were welcome warmly and of course  hope that you are lucky enough like us with a banana cake treat !"),
("2017-04-18", "1584102", "Tyson", "- The beach view in front of the house is simply the best in town.- Fred was a very nice and welcoming host.- The house was in a perfect condition  plus it has a very homely feel."),
("2017-05-02", "1584102", "Abi & Pierre", "Fred and Bernadette were perfect hosts  extremely friendly  warm hearted and interesting to talk to  we only wish we could have had the time to speak more. The apartment was very spacious and spotlessly clean on arrival and has absolutely everything you need for a home from home experience and more  which helps when travelling with small children. We could not have wanted a more perfect place to stay with our little boy and with such amazing views. This is by far the best airbnb we have ever stayed in over all our experiences throughout the world. Thank you."),
("2017-05-08", "1584102", "Adriano", "It was an absolutely lovely stay with my family at Fred&Bernadette fantastic place. We were so lucky because we've booked at the same morning when we arrived and everything was just perfect even they had guests before.Location is fantastic the bus to the city in front of the door and the flat and Fred&Bernadette are just beautiful.A beach in front of the door what else do u need for an unforgettable stay in Sydney!! You can see the love to the details and will not regret to stay with them.Thanks for that and the tasty welcome gifts."),
("2017-05-25", "1584102", "Joanna", "Stunning location  great hosts"),
("2017-06-02", "1584102", "Rob", "Great apartment. Highly recommended."),
("2017-07-05", "1584102", "Eric", "Beautiful living room and kitchen  comfortable bedroom  cabinets and fridge prepared a lot food  you can cook youself  very convenient  very beautiful sea at the door  every afternoon with my girlfriend went to the beach walk. Fred&Bernadette very nice and friendly. Beautiful journey. We are very happy lived there."),
("2017-07-23", "1584102", "Bryony", "Fred & Bernadette made us feel very welcome. The fridge was stocked with the basics and they left a banana loaf. After such a long trip a coffee and cake were much appreciated.The apartment is very homely with everything you need.We have never stayed somewhere with such a breath taking view  simply stunning.It was free and no problem to park our hire car outside.It's about an hour into the city on the bus. There are 2 stops very close by but you will need an Opal card to use these. East Gardens is the local shopping centre where you can stock up in Coles.If we return to Sydney we would not hesitant to re-book this lovely apartment."),
("2017-08-02", "1584102", "Friederike", "We had a great and very relaxing stay. The location is fantastic and it was great to look at the sea from the sofa in the sunroom!"),
("2017-08-11", "1584102", "Gemma", "Had a wonderful week staying in Fred and Bernadette's lovely apartment! Such a stunning location right across from the beach! Fred and Bernadette were wonderful hosts and the apartment had everything we needed! Would definitely recommend for a wonderful beach getaway!"),
("2017-08-18", "1584102", "Honza", "Thanks to Bernadette and Fred our family reunion after more than a year was awesome. Because of the pleasant stay  we felt like at home. I can only highly recommend this place. Great place with a beautiful bay view."),
("2017-09-01", "1584102", "Joon   &", "Very nice place right in front of the beach."),
("2017-09-17", "1584102", "Tracy", "Bernadette and Freds apartment is stylish and comfortable. We were welcomed with a fresh loaf Banana bread and a bottle of wine that set the scene for 10 great days of sunshine and relaxation. The apartment is directly across the rd from the beach  with magnificent views. There is an easy walk to the corner cafe that serves great coffee and food.  with a fabulous playground across the rd for children or big kids and a golf course at the other end of the rd that has magnificent views  up and down the coast. .It has easy access into the city with a close bus stop so  we could enjoy the sights around Sydney and  then return to our haven. We will be  back ☺"),
("2017-11-19", "1584102", "Lucie", "Our stay was truly lovely! We were welcomed by freshly made banana bread and some groceries to get us started. The location is near the ocean  beach  rock pool and golf courses. Great with kids or if you want your peace :) Having a car is more comfortable but there is a bus too."),
("2017-11-26", "1584102", "Linda", "Fantastic relaxing  quiet location."),
("2017-12-02", "1584102", "Lizzy", "Fred and Bernadette were more than accommodating  absolutely beautiful apartment with amazing views!"),
("2017-12-06", "1584102", "Craig", "I would highly recommend Fred and Bernadette's apartment  it is in a fantastic location with great views of the ocean and inlet. Lovely and clean with homemade treats and orange juice and milk in the fridge on arrivalwhich makes things that much more easier.I was staying for work so i didnt get a chance to relax that much  but i would love to go back with my wife and take in all that Malaba has to offer."),
("2017-12-17", "1584102", "Shirley", "Great location  nice and quiet with wonderful views.  Within walking distance of bus into City.  a local cafe and we even had a swim in the  outdoor pool.  Warm  friendly hosts and lovely homely touches .. all you could need."),
("2017-12-29", "1584102", "Richard", "Très bon appartement  cadre idéal. Bernadette et Fred sont des personnes formidables"),
("2018-01-08", "1584102", "Mark", "We had a great stay at Fred & bernadette lovely apartment. Would highly recommend. Cheers mark & dean"),
("2018-01-23", "1584102", "Caroline", "We spent almost 2 weeks at Bernadette and Fred's place with a 5 years old and without car  and really enjoyed those days. It was very convenient to go to the beach by foot and it was a good beach for a little one. Be aware that depending on weather conditions the beach can be quite dirty  but it is cleaned very regularly so we just had this once. It was easy to take the bus into town: it is not running very often (twice per hour) but it is just on the door step. Same to reach a small shopping center  10-15 minutes away by bus (+ waiting time). With one change  you reach Maroubra or other beaches or a big shopping center. We cooked in the apartment  no problem for basics. The kitchen is quite new and has enough space. We appreciate the large fridge  freezer and dishwasher. The laundry is to be shared with the owner and you can usually dry the clothes in the sun. We appreciated the big shower  hot and stable temperature and the bathroom in general. The flat is airy even on hot days  except the main sleeping room. We did not need the provided fans. In the sun room you can let the door open and hear the waves at night (but then also a bit of traffic). The sun room couch bed is very soft (flabby?). For one person just ok. But I wouldn't want to share it. We appreciated the moskito nets everywhere. Kitchen and bath were very clean but the floors and shelves could have need a bit more care. Bernadette and Fred were welcoming and very reactive as we had a problem. It was a very nice  laid-back beach accommodation. With possibility to enjoy a few days in Sydney downtown. A good compromise with a child."),
("2018-02-20", "1584102", "Mary", "What a great place!Wonderful location  perfect hosts and excellent facilities.We received a warm welcome with fresh juice and milk in the fridge together with a delicious home made cake on arrival.Would recommend to anyone looking for a lovely peaceful place which is within really easy access of the city and other areas of Sydney."),
("2018-02-25", "1584102", "Richard", "What a great place and a fantastic location!  The fresh banana bread was a great touch! Fred and Bernadette are amazing hosts!"),
("2018-03-06", "1584102", "Colin", "This is as advertised  very clean  large  close to bus and with a lovely water view. I especially enjoyed swimming in the free  saltwater rock pool only two minutes away. I even ventured a swim across the bay and back on a calm water day. We both loved listening to the ocean waves for a week!Very quiet neighbourhood as well. Highly recommend this to others. Be advised  it is a 1 hour bus ride to Sydney CBD."),
("2018-03-15", "1584102", "Ann", "We loved the location of the property  right across the road from the ocean therefore a great view. Had a great week."),
("2018-04-13", "1584102", "Alan", "Fred and Bernadette's place was exactly as described.  It was clean and comfortable. We had a great stay.They were excellent hosts  around when we needed them and giving us total privacy as well.  They gave us a very useful information pack on the surrounding area. We loved Malabar and its beach  but equally were able to get into central Sydney on the regular 399 bus whose stop was directly opposite.   We had a wonderful two weeks."),
("2018-04-29", "1584102", "Wayne", "Great access to local facilities  comprehensive information provided by the hosts  local beach within 5 minutes walk."),
("2018-05-14", "1584102", "Paul", "This is simply the best airb&b in the locale. It has fantastic walks  restaurants  swimming and golf all nearby. The beach is right out front. Bernadette and Fred have prepared a  very comprehensive guest book which answers nearly all questions you might have. The apartment has everything  most people would need  but we really appreciated the little extras  like Netflix- so we could keep up with our favourite shows while the rain teemed down outside. The bus to the city passes by right outside  the unit and there is easy street parking right out front. Negatives? None that we could think of. We wish Bernadette could control the weather!"),
("2018-06-16", "1584102", "Narelle", "Fred and Bernadette's home is beautifully located right on the Bay.  We enjoyed warm weather which made morning walks a delight. Unfortunately  we did not meed Bernadette  though Fred greeted us warmly and we very much appreciated the vase of flowers  chocolate and fresh juice.The home itself was immaculate and I appreciated the quality linen and towels.We were offered a later check out if we would like it  which was very much appreciated.My Mum  sister and myself had a wonderful time in Sydney enjoying Vivid  the theatre and an NRL game   It was an extra bonus to get a bus directly to Circular Quay on the doorstep.I would definitely stay here again  thanks Fred and Bernadette for a terrific break."),
("2018-07-19", "1584102", "Cristina", "Very kind hosts  very clean and comfortable appartment  calm  all facilities at hand. Super friendly family. Stunning views of the ocean and national park. Best place to enjoy Sydney from a quiet location. "),
("2018-07-27", "1584102", "Danny", "Great place to stay with a homely feel."),
("2018-08-03", "1584102", "Natha", "Amazing spot for nice holiday with beautiful view and quiet area"),
("2018-08-13", "1584102", "Mohd", "Thanks Fred and Bernadette for a very pleasant and comfortable stay! The first time we entered the house  it was all OMG-the-house-is-amazing! The inside was 100% as described and pictured in the photos. And the view was so EXTRA! We managed to enjoy beautiful sunrises before we headed out. We definitely made the right choice staying there! Not just that  we were welcomed with a pack of Tim Tam  milk and fresh juice on our first day! Talking about the facilities and amenities in the house  they’re all complete. From the shampoos  body wash  to clean towels and hangers. From the variety of cookwares and to coffee powders and a box of teabags. Fred and Bernadette were very accommodating too. There was a day where we run out of body wash and told them about it and when we reached home at night  there’s a new one in front of the door. We were out of the house early in the morning and only be home at 9/10pm. Sadly we couldnt manage to meet Fred and Bernadette to say how thankful we were for a very nice stay in their Airbnb house. Luckily we bumbed into Fred after his morning jog right before we left to airport! He was curious of whether we enjoyed our stay and asked if there is anything that is lacking. Worry not  it was all perfect. Thanks Fred and Bernadette. "),
("2018-08-20", "1584102", "Darren", "Perfect place to stay"),
("2018-08-29", "1584102", "Matthew", "a great experience"),
("2018-10-11", "1584102", "Janet", "Wonderful stay in a beautiful location.  We will definitely be returning thank you Fred & Bernadette xx"),
("2018-10-15", "1584102", "Elisabeth", "Een prachtig gelegen appartement . Alles wat je nodig hebt is aanwezig. Mooi uitzicht.Bus naar het centrum stopt voor de deur en gaat elk half uur. Reistijd is wel ongeveer 40 minuten.Wij hebben het kustpad gewandeld van het appartement naar bondi beach. Prachtig!"),
("2018-12-01", "1584102", "Cristina", "Fred and Bernadette are very kind people  they made my check in easier even if I arrived earlier due to a flight change. The house has a marvellous view on the ocean  perfect and quiet location.  The house is well furnished and is very  very clean. Recomended!"),
("2018-12-15", "1584102", "Richard", "A great little place and ideally located. Has everything you need and suited us brilliantly as a family of four adults. The city is about 30-40 minutes away by bus which between 7am and 7pm stops right outside the apartment. A welcome pack including fresh jam was very much appreciated. Fred and Bernadette respected our privacy but were there if needed. Thank you both."),
("2019-01-06", "1584102", "Carianne", "Very nice appartment at Malabar beach! We loved our stay.  The appartment is tidy  spacious and had everything we need for a stay. Nice details our the flowers  wine and TimTams! Communication with Bernadette went very well. I recommend this great place!"),
("2019-01-20", "1584102", "Denise", "Ideal for golfers and beach in walking distance. Did not have a car and used an opal card on the buses /trains  easy to get everywhere on them We are a retired couple over sixty."),
("2019-01-27", "1584102", "Rohena", "We had a great time at Bernadette’s place! Such a beautiful location and amenities  and the extra treats were much appreciated and enjoyed. We actually live in Sydney but not near the beach  so we had a fabulous time exploring the beaches  rock pool  cafes/restaurants and walks  along with more breeze and less humidity than usual ☺️ Highly recommended."),
("2019-02-05", "1584102", "Susie", "Lovely apartment right opposite the sea . We really enjoyed the stay   thank you ."),
("2019-02-11", "1584102", "Jacob", "Stunning location . Lovely place"),
("2019-03-03", "1584102", "Jane", "Beautiful beachside location. Really comfortable apartment. Very clean. Some lovely touches with a bottle of wine  orange juice  biscuits and basics in the cupboard. The apartment keeps cool without the need for air conditioning. Direct  punctual bus service into the city and links to elsewhere. Highly recommended."),
("2016-11-18", "15960997", "Clara", "Terry was an awesome host  always making sure we're feeling comfortoable. The appartment is very nice and has everything you need and an amazing view. We had a great stay!"),
("2016-11-29", "15960997", "Allison", "Terry's place has a beautiful view of the city and was easy to get to and from throughout the day. It was a bit difficult for Uber drivers to find us  but using the hotel across the street as a pick-up spot fixed that problem easily!"),
("2016-12-09", "15960997", "Robin", "I'd be very happy to recommend Terry and Craig to potential guests.  The apartment is spacious  full of light and air and very well located in the midst of all that the eastern suburbs have to offer.  The hosts are very welcoming and keen to make your stay relaxed and fun."),
("2016-12-12", "15960997", "Edelina", "This was my very first Airbnb stay and Terry has made it such a pleasant experience. Our flight were delayed on the runway the night before and we had no means to inform her know in advance but luckily she was willing to wait for us during the pickup. She also took us around the area just to show us where's what and how to get things. Terry is very easy to contact and she always reply messages very quickly. We had an unfortunate family emergency during the trip and she was being very nice  helpful  and understanding. Her place was also the best! Very clean  great view from the room  bus stop just opposite the building and city center is literally within walking distance (we did actually walk and enjoy the view along the way!). "),
("2017-02-04", "15960997", "Luke", "Terry was incredibly friendly and very kindly picked us up and dropped us off at the airport. The apartment was on the 10th floor  so the view of Sydney was beautiful. There was a shopping mall and a park within walking distance  and so was Sydney tower. Almost everything about our stay was perfect  except the air con wasn't too good so it was quite hot  and the road outside was very noisy. We would definitely stay here again though. "),
("2017-02-10", "15960997", "Charlie", "Terry's place was a great base for our time in Sydney  it's a 10min walk to Kings Cross station. Terry was a fantastic host and made us feel very comfortable. "),
("2017-03-03", "15960997", "Ian", "We really liked staying at Terry's place. It is very close to the bus and a few minutes more to Kings Cross. Though you are very much in the city  there is a big park just across the street with lots of green space and room for a long seaside walk. From the balcony one evening we saw a flying fox in the trees... did not expect that!Terry is a great host and I would recommend taking her up on her airport pick-up offer. It's a fair deal."),
("2017-03-08", "15960997", "Ken", "This home stay ticked all the boxes for us. Terry was very helpful and friendly. Arrangements were easy to make before our visit. She met us at the airport and took us back two days later in her car for a small charge. This was very convenient for us. The apartment is spacious and well appointed. It is in a very good location and convenient for the city. Lots of good places to eat within walking distance."),
("2017-03-14", "15960997", "Aditi", "The hosts were great. They made sure we were comfortable. Terry was there at the airport to pick us up and on our way she even gave a quick orientation of nearest train station  restaurants and convenience stores that helped us a lot throughout our stay. The room and bath room were very neat and clean. They had even kept basic toiletaries. We were free to use the kitchen and walk into the house at anytime. Bus stops and train stations are walking distance which is a big plus point. And  not to forget the beautiful view from their house that Yiu cab wake up to. I would rate 5/5 in all aspects. Highly recommended "),
("2017-03-25", "15960997", "Sriprapha", "Very nice place. Clean and comfortable. Terry  the host  was great  very friendly and helpful. The place is very convenience to travel by bus to center of town. Strongly recommend."),
("2017-04-15", "15960997", "Trev", "Terry was fantastic   she picked us up from the airport and was very warm and honest.  She helped us with directions around sydney and what buses / where to visit.  The apartment was great  lovely view of rushcutters bay and the boats.  Right near a park and a short walk up a hill to kings cross where everything was available   shopping  trains etc. Withing walking distance to city. Bus just as easy.  Apartment fully fitted out with cozy and soft bed  relatively noisy due to a busy road but bearable.  Terry and Craig were busy so we didn't see them allot but fantastic hosts. Would stay again and recommend. Thanks Terry and Craig."),
("2017-04-28", "15960997", "媛媛", "It was nice place and near the city. The room I was very clean . Terry is very nice host."),
("2017-05-05", "15960997", "Jodi", "Terry's house is very nice. The best part is the kitchen. It's very tidy and full of different cooking tools and spices. And there were a teddy bear sitting on our bed to welcome us. It's really surprise us. We have a really nice time here.Thanks Terry."),
("2017-05-09", "15960997", "Callum", "Nice apartment to stay for a few nights. own bathroom and plenty of room with amazing views. Terry was great. Very easy to be picked up from the airport and dropped back. Would stay again."),
("2017-05-20", "15960997", "扬", "房东人非常热情!很健谈 就是我们自己英语单词量有限 所以能聊的不多……但是房东真的非常热络 性格开放的小伙伴一定聊得来!房子出行挺方便的 离CBD什么的还是挺近 在厨房就可以看看一个海港 风景真的很棒!不过房子临街 晚上还是挺吵的 对隔音要求高的感觉会……失眠……然后厕所没有通风设施?(肉眼看着有很厚的灰然后找不到按钮) 我们是秋冬来的 不知道夏天有没有影响……最后房东人很好 订她的优步接送机很方便!"),
("2017-06-04", "15960997", "Adam", "Great location. Nice stay."),
("2017-07-08", "15960997", "Shannon", "We had a great stay with Terry. Beautiful house  location and view. I would highly recommend."),
("2017-07-20", "15960997", "Bhupinder Singh", "Terry is a super host and my stay was nothing short of comfortable and pleasant. I would definitely recommend staying at Terry's. Thanks Terry for a wonderful stay."),
("2017-07-25", "15960997", "Joy", "Great location  cafes and bars and stores nearby. Spacious room. Lovely host  always helpful and super polite!Highly recommended!!!"),
("2017-08-14", "15960997", "Clarisse", "Great hostess ! We stayed here during 1 week and everything was amazing with an incredible view on Rushcutters bay!! I recommend!"),
("2017-08-27", "15960997", "Alexandra", "Terry was an incredible host! She offered to pick us up and take us back to the airport. She gave us some great tips on where to go in Sydney and made sure we were well accommodated during our stay!"),
("2017-09-12", "15960997", "Rosy", "Staying with Terry was really quite nice. I stayed 12 days and I highly recommend it. The location is really nice. There's a park nearby and it isn't hard to get to any places. The building is a high rise apartment and the view is really nice - as is the comfortable bed and bathroom to yourself. Terry is flexible with check-ins and helped me with my luggage. I loved it!"),
("2017-09-16", "15960997", "Gillian", "Great location  very clean and easy to communicate. The view is wobderful. Public transport is easy and cheap. Had a lovely time meeting Terry and would recommend. Thanks for your patience with flight cancellations and delays!"),
("2017-09-24", "15960997", "Katie", "Terry was a lovely host and her flat is in a great location with all the amenities you need. She's incredibly friendly and it was lovely to spend some time with her in the evenings watching movies. The traffic can be a bit loud but earplugs sorted that  and her boyfriend was pretty loud the last night with his mates waking me up and keeping me awake in the middle of the night  but Terry was very apologetic for this so shouldn't happen again! Apart from the last night it was a great stay with a lovely host."),
("2017-09-28", "15960997", "Jane", "Terry was an excellent host  friendly and helpful to the maximum. She made sure i knew where to go. Comfy as bed  large room and generous in opening up her home. Great location and views to the bay. Would go back again for sure. Thank you! Jane"),
("2017-10-23", "15960997", "Anisha", "We had a great stay at Terry's in Sydney. The place was neat and clean in a well maintained apartment building. The location was also easily identifiable and close too to train stations.Check in was smooth even though Terry was out on work. We had everything we needed right from bathroom amenities and a comfortable night stay.Note for future travelers - make sure the right Vibe hotel ( Rushcutters bay) is entered in address as there are a couple of Vibe hotels in Sydney"),
("2017-11-05", "15960997", "Jessie", "It is a clean  quiet place and also has a beautiful view. Terry is a super nice host  and I really enjoyed staying there."),
("2017-11-19", "15960997", "Kris Ann", "Had a great stay here!  The views from the apartment are wonderful  and the location is great- very close to Kings Cross station. The room is clean  the bed is comfortable and it was nice to have the bathroom to myself. Highly recommend!"),
("2017-11-24", "15960997", "John", "Wonderful views from a great location for seeing Sydney. Thanks for the use of your facilities and your advice about getting around."),
("2017-11-28", "15960997", "Dirk", "Ich hatte eine feste Buchung diese wurde aber am Abend vorher grundlos storniert"),
("2017-12-04", "15960997", "Daniel", "Terry is a great host ! She was up to every detail ! Lots of movies to choose from if you have a difficult day  great advices of the city and awesome place to stay"),
("2017-12-10", "15960997", "Elliot", "Friendly hosts  clean facilities  comfy bed - would definitely stay here again. Thanks Terry!"),
("2017-12-26", "15960997", "Michael", "Superb apartment in a great location. Bars and shops nearby in King's Cross  a great view of the harbour and a lovely helpful host. A great place to stay."),
("2018-01-06", "15960997", "Hannah", "My friend and I came for a dream trip to see the Sydney at NYE and what a blessing! Terry’s and Craig’s place is in the perfect location - it is very close to numerous eating spots and public transit. There is even a beautiful park and bay right across the street. Thank you for making our vacation! We would and will definitely return. Til next time...."),
("2018-01-25", "15960997", "Arno", "I love the communication with Terry.she was very patient with me. She gave me tips for my trip.And..... the bed is so so so confortable!!!!!! You could stay in  all day long! Thank you terry and see you!"),
("2018-02-16", "15960997", "亮", "房东人很好｡一次完美的住宿体验｡如果再来悉尼 我会再一次入住｡"),
("2018-02-20", "15960997", "培玉", "房子和图片里描述的一样 交通便利(靠近King Cross火车站 前后都有还有直达市区公交站)非常好找~卧室､客厅､厨房都有无敌海景 房间也很舒服~Terry人很热情 我爸妈完全不懂英文 她还是用心帮助 用翻译软件跟我爸妈细心沟通;分享她的投影电视 还特意找来中文电影给我爸妈佐餐 真是无敌好!我们因为行程定的太晚没和父母住一起 每天来接他们Terry也都热情接待 没觉得我们打扰 真的很感谢!"),
("2018-02-23", "15960997", "Cigdem", "Terry's place is lovely! The bed is SO comfy  and the living room is super spacious. Terry was a lovely host and really accommodating. Great location  just a short walk from Kings Cross and Edgecliff station and if you can't be bothered to explore there's a great pool for sunbathing."),
("2018-03-28", "15960997", "Charlotte", "Terry was a fantastic host and very easy to communicate with. Her place was in a great location for Kings Cross / Edgecliff stations (10minutes away) and buses to town / beaches were also just around the corner. Fantastic view of Rushcutters Bay!"),
("2018-04-06", "15960997", "Jermaine", "This was my first trip to Australia and I must say I couldn’t have asked for better hosts and location. Check in was seamless as I arrived early in the morning on Easter Sunday. They gave me tips on transportation and how to get around in the neighborhood. The room has a nice view of the park and bay across the street. They both are very easy to chat with and very open to answer any questions you may have. For being so far away from home  it definitely felt like a home away from home."),
("2018-08-29", "15960997", "Rosette", "I nearly cried when I hugged Terry goodbye. I was there for about 2 weeks and I really felt like I made a friend. Terry was super nice to talk to but she allowed you to set the boundaries so if you wanted to be social  you could and if you didn't want to be you could have your privacy. Even though the listing technically says that you have a private room and washroom to yourself  I actually had the entire place to myself many days. Terry went the extra mile by taking me out to Salsa night for my birthday and we've had her home-cooked dinner while watching movies. The room comes with several guides on stuff to do in Sydney as well. Everything was clean and there was ample space in the fridge and the cupboards to store your food. Amazing experience overall. "),
("2018-09-23", "15960997", "Surbhi", "It was my first Airbnb stay and I couldn’t have expected anything better. It was so convenient and comfortable. The location is amazing and is close to everything. Would definitely recommend this place!"),
("2018-09-30", "15960997", "Tammy", "Very nice host! Terry is very easy to communicate and offered me seamless checkin and checkout. You can access to town easily from her place. Highly recommended."),
("2016-12-19", "15923846", "Adam", "Suzanna was lightning fast at responding and a delight to deal with. The place is very clean  new and close walking distance to the sights of Sydney. Best Airbnb place I've stayed at."),
("2017-02-13", "15923846", "Tracy", "Everything was amazing  couldn't have a more accommodating host. So clean  plenty of room for everyone  gorgeous home. Centrally located  so close the the Sydney Harbour Bridge  the Rocks and Circular Quay. Amazing restaurants at the wharf. We're already working out when to book a return trip!"),
("2017-02-18", "15923846", "Fiona", "An amazing location  a charming  clean and spacious home! Thank you Suzanna for a great stay :)"),
("2017-02-23", "15923846", "Mark", "If you want a central bolt hole in Sydney it couldn't get better than this. We didn't catch a taxi all week because it is so central  yet quiet too.Upmarket accommodation which suits families.Suzanna is a great host if you need tips or advice while you are staying."),
("2017-03-09", "15923846", "Lee", "Great location in a quiet area. House was very clean. Perfect for a group of people.Would definitely stay there again. The communication from the host Suzanna was excellent."),
("2017-03-15", "15923846", "Linda", "Lovely large bedrooms. Kitchen is well appointed. Bathroom is lovely and modern. Very clean and tidy"),
("2017-03-16", "15923846", "Debbie", "We had the best  most positive experience  Suzanna went above and beyond expectation and was an absolute pleasure to communicate with  kept us permanently updated and was an absolutely pleasure. Can't recommend it highly enough ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️"),
("2017-03-21", "15923846", "Tim", "Suzanna and her husband were incredible helpful for all aspects of our stay.  Her unit is in the Rocks which makes it incredibly convenient to restaurants  Circular Quay  the Bridge and all else that Sydney offers.  The unit is newly remodeled and extremely clean.  Check in and check out was a breeze."),
("2017-04-08", "15923846", "Nick", "Excellent location  great house and fabulous hosts. Cant wait to come back."),
("2017-04-15", "15923846", "Stephanie", "Really good and beautiful place. We had a good time here."),
("2017-04-30", "15923846", "Stephen", "Excellent location  within walking distance of all central attractions. Very easy check in/out with clean well equipped accomodation"),
("2017-05-09", "15923846", "子毅", "Suzanna give us some great tips about local attractions and bars and she's very hospitality. Great experience. Thanks"),
("2017-05-29", "15923846", "Aaron", "Awesome house and location  will definitely stay again "),
("2017-06-04", "15923846", "Lara", "Location is perfect for getting around circular quay  the rocks  barangaroo and darling harbour. We walked everywhere with no problems. Only couple of negatives are the steepness of the stairs. They were pretty steep and scary for a toddler. One of the pullout sofas is in a room accessed through one of the bedrooms. Being an old building we had a few issues with having heating on and boiling kettles etc at the same time. And the welcome pack wasn't exactly as shown in pics. Communication with Suzanna was great though. And she managed to sort any problems quite promptly. Property was very clean. Would definitely recommend it to others. But maybe not for families with toddlers. "),
("2017-06-14", "15923846", "Kane", "Great stay in a great home. Would recommend!"),
("2017-06-25", "15923846", "Billie", "Great location within walking distance to circular quay which is very handy! Great communication with Suzanna  she was very helpful and efficient with checking in etc and suggestions for the area! "),
("2017-07-27", "15923846", "George", "Good location."),
("2017-08-23", "15923846", "Charlotte", "Suzanna's beautiful house is in the perfect location with easy access to all the major sites of Sydney. She was a fabulous host sending through many recommendations of places to visit  eat & drink. I will definitely return!"),
("2017-11-02", "15923846", "Jenny", "The house was in a perfect location  super close  and walkable to everything. Suzanna was really nice and easy to work with. She gave us a lot of helpful local suggestions and let us check in really early. The house was really clean and all the bathrooms have been remodeled. It's an older home that has very steep stairs and some creaky doors but overall a great place for a large group!"),
("2017-11-11", "15923846", "Debra", "Amazing location.  You can walk anywhere including a great little pub on the corner.  This intriguing old terrace house has new kitchen and bathrooms and is very comfortable for a short stay.  Beware a 10 am checkout."),
("2017-11-17", "15923846", "Wenjie", "Very good location  just a few minutes walk to the Harbour Bridge  The Rocks  as well as view of the Sydney Opera House. Suzanna was also lightning fast in replying  and is very patient and helpful with all my queries. We had a very pleasant stay in the clean house. Check-in was also a breeze with the hosts contacting us to make sure we had no issues  and they were also flexible when we requested for late check-out."),
("2017-11-26", "15923846", "Timothy", "Our stay in Sydney was great  and Suzanna's place is very conveniently located  with quick access to all of the major sites  dining and transportation. Check-in and check-out was a breeze and we had no issues during our stay. As a frequent user of vacation rentals... the only additional info I feel I need pass on to others is to elaborate on some apartment details. This place is ideal for 3 couples and one single  due to the bedding arrangements. The sofa bed is not the typical foldout  it is small  hard and really not usable. Air conditioning is achieved through 2 portable units and is not installed or ducted  so it is not possible to cool the entire house  just a couple of rooms."),
("2018-01-20", "15923846", "Janine", "Suzanna was very responsive  the terrace’s location is very convenient to the city  close to some great pubs. The house was very clean and accommodated 7 adults and a toddler  will definitely consider rebooking."),
("2018-02-03", "15923846", "Hogan", "Great host and very accurate description!"),
("2018-03-29", "15923846", "James", "Great location  very central. Suzanna was fantastic at giving us some great local knowledge and was very helpful."),
("2018-07-17", "15923846", "Julie", "The location for this property is ideal for enjoying many of Sydney's popular attractions.   You can easily walk to the harbor bridge  opera house  and circular quay.  The Rocks area where the unit is located has a vibrant community and lots of cute shops  cafes  and restaurants.  This property would be well suited for a group of adults who are comfortable sharing space.  Two of the bedrooms must access their room by walking through an adjoining bedroom.   The common sitting area and the upstairs bath are quite small.   The bedrooms are all a nice size as is the dining area  kitchen  and downstairs bath.Suzanna was very kind and responsive to all of our inquiries and booking was easy.  We required an early check-in and it was not a problem.  Check out was also very easy.  "),
("2018-08-30", "15923846", "Todd", "Awesome location and very easy to check in and deal with. Great hosts"),
("2018-09-16", "15923846", "Danielle", "Beautiful house in an amazing location just minutes from the rocks. Great host - easy  quick communication and lots of great tips. Highly recommend"),
("2018-11-22", "15923846", "Lucy", "The location can't be beaten. Close to everything. Suzanna is fabulous to deal with and very helpful. I would reiterate the point about the stairs being very steep and perhaps unsuitable for very young children or people with mobility issues. Other than that  I would highly recommend!"),
("2018-12-27", "15923846", "Ying", "地点和房东都很好 步行可以到很多著名景点 乳歌剧院和海港大桥 能煮食 购物也很方便 适合一家人居住｡"),
("2018-12-29", "15923846", "Brenda", "You can’t get a better located house for 8 people! Lovely!"),
("2016-12-28", "16020247", "Kate", "This house is perfect for an inner city getaway. Beautiful terrace house  very comfortable and Kassandra was lovely and made everything so easy. Highly recommended for location  so close to king st and enmore rd for great restaurants   cafes and bars etc and even marrickville metro when you just need some groceries. A really relaxing beautiful place."),
("2017-01-01", "16020247", "Deivid", "It is a beautiful place to stay in. It is a central place  you can find easily transport  restaurants  markets and pubs. Nearby to the city and Cassandra is a kind and friendly person."),
("2017-01-06", "16020247", "Tessa", "Very accomodating home  had a very welcoming feel to the home and host was very easy to communicate with. Thoroughly enjoyed short walks to the shops and train station making exploring very easy and our stay an overall positive one. "),
("2017-02-18", "16020247", "Jeff", "Great location and perfect little house from which to experience Newtown living! We had a great time and loved Kassandra's tips for local cafes etc. Recommended."),
("2017-02-26", "16020247", "David", "A great place to stay.Good location  close to everything."),
("2017-03-04", "16020247", "Ash", "Good location  not too far from train stations and some cute little cafes around the place. "),
("2017-03-27", "16020247", "Mark", "A perfect little piece of Enmore!"),
("2017-05-14", "16020247", "Tory", "Kassandra's place was perfect and easily slept the 6 of us! It was bigger than the pictures made out! We could easily walk to Newtown and we were a 2 minute drive to the Marrickville metro shopping centre  which made it easy to grocery shop. Kassandra was so lovely and welcoming. Such a lovely spot! I'm jealous! "),
("2017-07-03", "16020247", "Zacharie", "Kassandra's home is absolutely lovely !! You can enjoy the terrace and she has a very cute cat. It's also well located  with plenty of good and varied restaurants around and it's near the train station. I strongly recommend "),
("2017-07-10", "16020247", "Katrina", "Lovely  comfortable house. Arty and quirky  with good heating and great beds. Close to shops  restaurants  transport and nightlife. Would highly recommend!"),
("2017-09-09", "16020247", "Andres", "Great location  well set up  helpful hostess. Very comfortable beds  even the couches. You do have to feed the cat but that's known at the start and no imposition. The stairs are most steep so beware if that's an issue. We would stay again."),
("2017-09-25", "16020247", "Katie", "This welcoming private colourful terrace is a haven in Newtown. Filled with art and colour. Way better than a sterile apartment! Kassandra was so welcoming and explained the house quirks. She is super fast to respond to messages. Beds were comfy and warm. It’s a short stroll to Newtown and you can get a direct train to Circular Quay. The house is leafy inside and out. Shower pressure was heavenly and kitchen has all you needed. The house is just so atmospheric and eclectic - a beautiful experience more than a place to stay. We loved Marrickville markets and Sydney Park.  Loads of great coffee nearby  the best gelato and great organic and health food shops. Totally recommend."),
("2017-10-21", "16020247", "Chris", "Clean but a bit dated. Didn't realise it was a gas oven (rather than electric). However Kassandra is very helpful and attentive   and it was fine once we understood it needed an independent lighter."),
("2017-10-28", "16020247", "Jurnee", "Good location and good vibes."),
("2017-11-11", "16020247", "Steve", "Kassandra's house is very convenient  close to shops  dining and easy transport into the city. We had a great time and would certainly book again."),
("2017-11-19", "16020247", "Angela", "This is a lovely house in a great location. Close to great restaurants and not far to the train station. Very quiet at night and very comfortable. Kassandra has lots of interesting artwork on the walls and it feels very homely. One thing to note is the stairs to the upper floor are very steep as they are in these kind of houses  could be difficult to navigate if you have mobility issues."),
("2017-12-31", "16020247", "Richard", "Quirky property and compact. No air conditioning just fans. However  this is reflected in the price."),
("2018-01-05", "16020247", "Libby", "This property makes no excuses for the fact that it is someone's home in original condition  not a private property dressed up as an alternative to a hotel. Be sure your expectations are clear.Would not recommend as a three/four bed arrangement but perfectly comfortable as a two bed deal.Kassandra' communication was timely and clear. The location is good  particularly for vintage clothes and variety of food  and the street is quiet. The back yard is a sanctuary."),
("2018-07-12", "16020247", "Truc", "The house is near everything  train  bus  shopping centers  etc. It is located in a quiet street although it is just 800m away from one of the busiest streets in Newtown."),
("2018-08-05", "16020247", "Carlos", "Great location to live the Newtown lifestyle. Just 5 min away from all type of services  train station is just 10 min away  and just 4 stops to get to downtown Sydney. If more than 4 people  and someone has to sleep in the coach  the cat can be a bit annoying during the night  she will wake you up when hungry ;). We had a great stat though. "),
("2018-08-11", "16020247", "Vivienne", "Great location close to fantastic cafes  bars and eateries and to public transport.Lovely home with very comfortable upstairs bedrooms.Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-09-23", "16020247", "Anna", "Kassandras home is comfortable  large  and full of fun quirky artwork. The gardens are beautiful and make you feel like you’re in a jungle in the middle of an huge city. The home feels cozy and lived-in  not at all sterile and generic like a hotel. We just moved to Sydney from the US and stayed here while we looked for our own apartment in the Newtown area. Kassandras place was the perfect home base while we explored the neighborhood. The house cat  Shala  is sweet  friendly  and chatty. Though she does have a somewhat annoying habit of jumping onto tables in the morning and pushing things onto the ground to wake you up to feed her. (This can easily be mitigated by closing the door of the room you are sleeping in.) Kassandra responded to all messaged promptly and was a great host. We’ll definitely be recommending this place to anyone who comes to visit us in Sydney."),
("2018-09-30", "16020247", "Josh", "Great"),
("2018-10-02", "16020247", "Joshua", "A beautiful and quirky place right amongst the hustle and bustle of Newtown/Enmore. Great amenities and a beautiful garden to sit amongst nature and bath in the sun."),
("2018-10-06", "16020247", "Umit", "Quick responses  easy to contact if ever needed. Plenty of towels and spots to sleep."),
("2018-10-21", "16020247", "Sabine & Jason", "Kassandra’s place is an unrestored Victorian two storey terrace  a short walk to King St shops. It has comfortable shabby chic furniture and lots of cool and quirky art installations. Sweet Shala the cat will welcome you on arrival."),
("2018-11-17", "16020247", "Anna", "This is a lovely garden & art focussed place to stay  very quirky and fun.  It is so central to everything  easy walk to both King Street & Enmore Road.  It's nice staying somewhere a little more personal  and Kassandra was just SO welcoming.  Highly recommended!"),
("2018-11-27", "16020247", "Silvia", "This beautiful two storey Victorian house is situated 5 minutes away from all the Newtown's attractions but it feels like living in a hidden jungle with its lovely-wilde backyard. The place is full of all comforts and amenities  you'll be surrounded by a strong personality place with cozy and artistic pieces and furniture. Shala the cat add the final touch to make it your home far from home. Just like her place Kassandra is a very friendly person  easy going and friendly."),
("2018-12-01", "16020247", "Caitlin", "Kassandra was a lovely host  so welcoming and helpful! Her home is stylish and comfortable and close to everything you could need.  Everything was easy and we had a fantastic weekend in Kassandra's home."),
("2018-12-09", "16020247", "Jonathan", "Very good location and a nice quaint terrace  lots of room and a really nice back garden  thoroughly enjoyed the stay."),
("2018-12-23", "16020247", "Rachel", "Great place in a great location!"),
("2019-01-27", "16020247", "Claire", "Kassandra's is very quick to respond  her place is great  beautiful garden and so close to everything in Enmore / Newtown - would love to stay again."),
("2019-02-03", "16020247", "Hayden", "Fabulous location  everything within walking distance  easy check in  great communication  clean and tidy."),
("2019-03-02", "16020247", "Verity", "Excellent stay. Kassandra’s home is beautiful and situated in a fantastic location."),
("2017-05-01", "16070826", "Pragati", "I stayed at Nicole's place for my graduation. My parents were with me. We found the place quiet  neat and tidy. It's super convenient (museum station was a 10 min walk) and there are heaps of buses to various beaches. It's also close to shops and convenient stores. Nicole wasn't in town during our stay but she put me in touch with her friend who was very helpful during our stay. We highly recommend this place!"),
("2017-02-04", "16029413", "Jane", "For a girls weekend away we thoroughly enjoyed our stay. Hilde was very welcoming and obviously takes a lot of pride in providing a place that is comfortable  inviting and clean. She has great attention to detail  the house had everything we needed  good aircon for the summer and a well set up kitchen which made cooking a BBQ easy. Hilde provided us with a lovely breakfast with delicious home made bread  jams  muesli and tea and coffee. The house is in a great location within easy walking distance from the beach and shops. Thanks very much for having us Hilde! "),
("2017-02-12", "16029413", "Tricia", "A beautiful 3 bedroom stay. Very comfortable & the hosts supplied our family with beautiful bread & jams for breakfast for our first morning. Everything was above expectation & we also felt very much at home. Thank you to Hilde & David for their assistance & hospitality. A great find on airbnb."),
("2017-03-13", "16029413", "Yukio", "This place was amazing!Not only was Hilde one of the best Airbnb hosts we have encountered (attentive  informative  helpful and reachable  when we needed her)  the place was fantastically prepared. We stayed in the apartment with our 1-year-old and immediately after our arrival it became apparent that a lot of love and a well-developed attention to detail went into making this place as comfortable as possible. The beds were great  the pool was immaculately maintained (no chlorine = great for kids)  the kitchen was well-outfitted with all the essentials and the bathroom stocked with towels. Hilde even went to the trouble of providing our daughter with some toys  which came in very handy.All in all  Hilde's ""Bundeena Base"" was a great launchpad for us to have some family downtime outside of Sydney. A real gem of a region  which is quite reachable by train/ferry as well as car from the city."),
("2017-05-28", "16029413", "Michaella", "All 4 of us had a wonderful time! Hilde also gave us bread and muesli for our stay. Very close to the beach and the shops! Kitchen was very well stocked. The outdoor dining area was a nice treat to watch the sunset over the water."),
("2017-06-27", "16029413", "Rosemary", "Lovely space with a beautiful outlook. Close to everything in Bundeena  with the feeling of a quiet retreat. Great facilities - Hilde has been very thoughtful about the things you need for a relaxing time away. "),
("2017-07-19", "16029413", "Lisa", "This is a beautiful comfortable home  within easy walking distance of a gorgeous beach  the famous aboriginal carvings  ferry to Cronulla  shops and cafes. Definitely recommend for a relaxing stay  in the National Park  well away from Sydney hustle and bustle."),
("2017-07-31", "16029413", "Paul", "A fantastic homely property set in a quiet rural setting with enough local amenities nearby to get by on. The beaches and bays are idyllic and bundeena base is an excellent location to launch local excursions from. Hilde is very welcoming and a fantastic host. Thanks you!"),
("2017-08-06", "16029413", "Rupert", "This is a beautiful spot. A very well equipped house. It was perfect for our family of six. The beds are good quality so we all slept well. The location  within the national park  is fantastic."),
("2017-08-14", "16029413", "美珠", "非常适合度假 周边就是风景 又有超市 生活很方便"),
("2017-08-25", "16029413", "Isabelle", "Je recommande cet endroit magique et l'hôte exceptionnelle. Nous n'avons jamais été reçu avec autant de gentillesse et disponibilité. L'apparte est top  très propre et confortable et le quartier sublime entourés de plages superbes. A découvrir. I highly recomand this beautiful place. Hilde is just perfect! Nice and very disponible for her hosts. The flat is beautiful with a great view. Everyting is very clean and comfortable. You have amazing beaches at 5 min and the national park. We had great holidays."),
("2017-09-02", "16029413", "Liam", "A great setup for families. Walking distance to the beach  a pool and a secure gated yard for the kids to play in. The accomodation itself is also perfect with two young families able to stay comfortably  good kitchen and bathroom facilities  a comfortable lounge area and indoor and outdoor dining options. We will definitely be back."),
("2017-09-10", "16029413", "Julie", "Best place to stay. Easy walk to the beach. The host was friendly and would highly recommend if you want a weekend away."),
("2017-09-23", "16029413", "Angela", "Hildes place is great we had everything we needed. She has it set up perfectly.  Very friendly host I feel she went beyond our expectations.  I would certainly recommend her place and we would love to go back. Thank you Hilde"),
("2017-10-22", "16029413", "David", "Great Space  very hospitable hosts. Lots of Privacy"),
("2017-10-29", "16029413", "Anke", "A really lovely apartment.  The host has included all necessities and luxuries such as fresh warm bread  ground coffee and  champagne.  All rooms were well equipted and 2 bedrooms have view over water. It is a short walk into Bundeena and I would love to go back for a longer stay."),
("2017-12-24", "16029413", "Aletta", "Bundeena base is a very special place  with it's pool and easy access to three different beaches. Hilde is clearly experienced from the hotel industry  and a very professional host  with an eye for detail  like the bathrobes and the welcome package. We felt so at home in this clean and impeccable apartment  we thought we might never want to leave."),
("2017-12-31", "16029413", "Craig", "Hilde's place is lovely and she has provided the personal touch.She is quick to respond to any needs and goes out of her way to make your stay as easy as possible. Her accommodation is clean  warm and inviting. She really has furnished the place with style and thoughtfulness. We loved our stay!"),
("2018-01-17", "16029413", "Eva", "The hosts went above and beyond our expectations in every respect. The place is immaculate and beautifully furnished  the location is perfect. Very close to shops  beaches  the national park etc. and with a nice view. I loved listening to the sound of the waves at night.  The swimming pool was a hit with my kids  especially the cupboard full of toys they could play with in the water. We were provided bathrobes  towels  extra towels for the swimming pool - felt really spoilt. We were a party of 2 adults and 2 children  but the place could conveniently accommodate 6 people. Hilde baked bread for us: what a welcome.  We could bring a dog  and were provided with both practical advice and everything our doggie may need. We had a wonderful stay  my children did not want to go home! Thank you Hilde and hubby for your hospitality. "),
("2018-01-28", "16029413", "Leanne", "Bundeena Base was perfect for our family of 5 for a long weekend getaway. The wifi and Foxtel were hits with the kids  the pool was perfect after a walk or time at the beach  the air con on muggy summer nights was great too. Everything Bundeena has to offer us an easy stroll away. We highly recommend Hilde and Bundeena Base and hope to be back in the future!"),
("2018-02-12", "16029413", "Marieka", "We had a wonderful stay at bundeena base! Beautiful outlook  great amenities and super clean. Hilde and her husband were great hosts and very responsive. Morning walks to the beach are a must  we especially loved the fireworks  what a treat! Highly recommended."),
("2018-02-19", "16029413", "Andre", "Beautiful home  great location by the water  close to National park and it's beaches  nice swimming pool and amenities. Most suitable for families - we were asked to move inside at 9:15pm so as to not disturb the neighbours."),
("2018-02-21", "16029413", "文娣", "The landlord was very hospitable.but we were asked to pay extra cleaning fee when we left .we hope that all the expenses will be understood before we move in next time.thank you."),
("2018-02-24", "16029413", "Rachel", "Hilde was a very helpful host - really proactive in all her communications with us and very helpful at providing a cot etc for our toddler  thanks hilde! The house was great and our kids loved the pool! We will definitely be back."),
("2018-03-03", "16029413", "Ahmed", "Lovely place to stay  and a great host!"),
("2018-03-26", "16029413", "Jason", "Hilde is a fantastic host. She was very accommodating of our schedule and made sure we understood how to use everything. She also had a few nice surprises for us (I’ll keep them secret for the next people  but they were very tasty). The place is clean and spacious and perfect for a quiet getaway. Highly recommend this place to anyone."),
("2018-04-02", "16029413", "Maddy", "Bundeena Base was the perfect place for a low key long weekend. We all especially enjoyed the kitchen  bbq  pool and fluffy robes. The house is close to the shops  multiple beaches and the national park so we always had something explore. Hilde went above and beyond our expectations  meeting us at the ferry to help with luggage and providing not only a portacot with bedding but also a change table  baby bath  bouncer and play mat. Our 3 month old baby had the best time. We hope to make it back there someday!"),
("2018-04-09", "16029413", "Narelle", "I loved our stay at Hilde's place.  Ocean views  and bush meets the sea.  The kids loved the pool and would have been perfectly happy staying put the whole time just to swim."),
("2018-04-28", "16029413", "Ricarda", "Highly recommended 11/10. Great location  comfortable and clean property with gracious hosts. One of our many highlights would be enjoying the spectacular sunsets overlooking the pool and bay while bbq’ing fresh fish and enjoying a glass of wine while our kids played in the garden. We hope to return soon!"),
("2018-06-04", "16029413", "Kelly Curtis", "Although getting there is a task for a large family it is well worth the travel time. Great home with everything you would need."),
("2018-07-10", "16029413", "Michael", "We had a wonderful time at Bundeena Base. Hilde was a great host whose communication was excellent (fast and helpful). She went well beyond the minimum as a host and made us feel very welcome. The house itself is great. The beds were very comfortable  with a choice of types of pillows. We much appreciated the fluffy towels and bathrobes. We had everything we needed for a self-catering family of four. Apart from that  the location in the Royal National Park was ideal for us. We took several walks along the Coastal Trail which was absolutely stunning. The only disadvantage was the 30 minute drive to get anywhere outside the National Park but for us that was a price well worth paying for the quiet beaches in walking distance of Bundeena Base."),
("2018-07-29", "16029413", "Kirsty", "Bundeena Base is lovely  well located and well fitted out with everything you need. The view is beautiful and just a short walk to the beaches  bush walks and shops. Highly recommended. "),
("2018-09-02", "16029413", "Bart", "We enjoyed our stay as 2 couples with children  and Bundeena is a beautiful place to spend a weekend.Hilde's place is downstairs from their residence which is great in case you need anything  but is private  and the back garden and pool are yours. Our children loved picking oranges and playing in the grass."),
("2018-10-27", "16029413", "Chris", "We had a long weekend at Bundeena and thoroughly enjoyed it. Hilde went out of her way to make sure that we had everything we needed both for the 6 adults and a young baby.  Very comfortable  well designed and only a short walk to the beach  shops and club. Swimming pool was a great 30 degrees in spite of the unseasonably cold weather.  All in all would recommend it and would love to return."),
("2018-11-03", "16029413", "Leticia", "Beautiful location  close to beach and very clean place"),
("2018-11-13", "16029413", "Simon", "Lovely private space  perfect for relaxing or exploring the area. Would definitely recommend this place for families or medium groups."),
("2019-01-02", "16029413", "Ben", "The host Hilde was incredibly hospitable and communicative which made our stay really enjoyable.The place was immaculate and the location is fantastic! Would highly recommend!"),
("2019-01-21", "16029413", "Warren", "Great location  beautiful beds and linen.  Everything you want for a perfect holiday including a poolWalking distance to everything including amazing beaches.We will be back"),
("2019-01-27", "16029413", "Leanne", "This was our second stay at Hilde's. For our family it is a perfect spot for a quick getaway. Bundeena's beaches are so close  and then to be able to swim in the pool after a morning at the beach  it's wonderful!"),
("2019-01-30", "16029413", "Maral", "Very relaxing and clean ! Totally awesome  would go again !"),
("2019-02-15", "16029413", "Pászthory", "The host is very kind  the house is very comfortable  modern and well-eqipped  the area is beautiful. We enjoyed the wonderful beach and the walks in the nearby National Park. We hope we can stay again some time. :)"),
("2016-12-04", "16070079", "Anthony", "Cute little apartment  with a great lounge room to relax in after a long day exploring the city.  Very beautifully decorated. Extremely close to transport links and in easy walking distance to many tourist locations  as well as great bars and restaurants nearby. Everything you could want in a little Sydney apartment!"),
("2016-12-18", "16070079", "Helen", "Great location and communication from the host. Check in was Smooth and apartment is exactly what we expected. Loved the books and art around the apartment"),
("2017-01-02", "16070079", "Jason", "Of all the homes we've stayed in via Airbnb  Gregoire's felt the most homely  as though it was our own home away from home. The unique art decor gave the apartment a personality all of its own  which gave a very welcoming feeling  and the moment we entered we immediately felt at home. Thank you so much for making our stay in Sydney just that little bit more amazing!"),
("2017-01-12", "16070079", "Ji Sun", "Perfert!!Good location  Nice houseWe really had a good time in house."),
("2017-02-19", "16070079", "Charmian", "Stylish  modern and very convenient apartment in the heart of Sydney. Within walking distance to a bunch of amazing cafes at Surry Hills. Fantastic."),
("2017-02-26", "16070079", "Christopher", "Fantastic location suitable to all different needs. Walking distance to the majority of central Sydney. Would definitely stay again and recommend to all who are interested."),
("2017-03-26", "16070079", "Sid", "Great location in the city  great management for check-in/out and most importantly  the unit was homely  clean and comfortable!Host was prompt in communication and has pretty much prepared us so that we are well covered during our trip!Definitely recommend and good choice!"),
("2017-04-06", "16070079", "Alex", "The apartment was neat and spacious  with lots of great food places nearby. I walked to the city and the new convention centre easily.Wifi was solid  the coffee machine simple and the amenities were excellent."),
("2017-04-11", "16070079", "Linda", "The apartment was well situated. It was a very comfortable place with everything we needed. I highly recommend it."),
("2017-04-14", "16070079", "성경", "시네 중심가에 위치하고 있지만 하이드파크 근처에 위치하여 너무 복잡하지 않으면서도 보도로 시내 이것저곳 이동이 편리했습니다. 아파트는 생각보다 넓고 깨끗하고 인테리어 디자인이 훌륭했습니다. 다만 체크인시 아파트 전체 카드가 작동하지 않아서 잠시 시간이 지체되었으나 바로 조치가되어서 큰 불편함없이 툭숙하였습니다. 만족스러운 투숙이였고 다음에도 이용할 의사가 있습니다."),
("2017-04-18", "16070079", "Wilson", "Hi Gregoire  It's absolutely a fortune to stay in your lovely place! It was just a great experience for me and my girlfriend to spent our vacation. The location is fabulous  it actually makes me very wanna move to somewhere nearby And also Fabio is just a great person for providing all the info and support. Love the deco in your apartment especially the lightening and balcony. Big thank you again and I will definitely choose your place for the next journey."),
("2017-05-15", "16070079", "Juan", "Amazing place  nice  really clean and comfy. Close to the Opera and many other attractions."),
("2017-06-19", "16070079", "Nicholas", "I highly recommend Gregoire's place in Sydney it's the perfect size for a couple staying in Sydney. Very close to the city cbd with Museum station around the corner to take you anywhere. Lost of nice bars and coffee shops around the corner. Great host that is very prepared with a house manual presenting all transport options and places to stay and eat. We had a fantastic time."),
("2017-06-23", "16070079", "Martin", "Great place  great location - beautiful home with everything you would need. "),
("2017-07-09", "16070079", "Yohan", "Been visiting Sydney for a week's conference in Sydney. Found Gregoire place in strategic CBD location (one step away from Hyde Park and Museum Station) The size of apartment is humongous eventhough the building is kinda old but the Gregoire's unit is modern. The door in shoes room is kinda stuck and cannot be closed. If you are visiting Sydney for leisure or business trip  staying at Gregoire is recommended. "),
("2017-07-12", "16070079", "Mark", "Gregoire' apartment is very well located and clean.  Excellent place to stay for a few nights.  Highly Recommended."),
("2017-08-13", "16070079", "晔", "The host canceled this reservation 44 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-08-22", "16070079", "John", "Gregoire's place is spacious  quite  nicely designed  very convenient and you can expect a quality stay and enjoy great stay"),
("2017-08-25", "16070079", "Ally", "Highly recommend! Gregoire is an excellent host."),
("2017-08-28", "16070079", "Marc", "It has been a joy to stay in Greg's apartment. He made sure everything is spick and span prior to our arrival. Plus it is equipped with everything that is necessary for a home. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-08-31", "16070079", "Amber", "This apt has a very convenient location to everything you will want to do in Sydney! I appreciated the detailed information Gregoire provided."),
("2017-09-04", "16070079", "Joe", "The location was perfect for us. Many of our ""must see"" attractions were in walking distance. Public transportation was close by. (The sub way is so quiet it is possible to carry on a conversation sotto vice). Our host was attentive to all our needs. "),
("2017-09-10", "16070079", "Bridie", "I had a fantastic stay and loved the apartment!! Such a great location in the middle of all the buzz! The bed is super comfy and the apartment is furnished beautifully  I would 100%  recommend Gregoire's place to everyone!! Thanks for having me "),
("2017-10-21", "16070079", "Elevia", "Great location. Perfect for a weekend or long term stay. I stayed 2.5 weeks and really enjoyed the apartment. As a warning: there isn't much closet/dresser space. He had a substantial amount of his own clothes/shoes still there so I had to find other places to keep my things."),
("2017-10-29", "16070079", "Dimitrios", "This is a very nice flat  well located and tastefully furnished great for me as a business traveller or a couple looking for something central.Excellent communication prior to arrival. I had no problems arise and did not need any assistance during my stay.I am very happy to recommend Gregoire’s flat to fellow travellers!"),
("2017-11-19", "16070079", "Gerard", "This was probably the most professional Airbnb I've stayed at. The place was great  everything was well organised and thought out. My stay here was perfect."),
("2018-01-01", "16070079", "David", "Lovely apartment  but could do with a little more wardrobe/drawer space."),
("2018-01-06", "16070079", "Karoline", "The perfect place for a stay in Sydney! Great appartment  cool  moderne and well equipped. The location is perfect  right on the border between downtown CBD  and Surry Hills  with cafees and restaurants. Also the perfect starting point for a morning run through Hide Park and to the botanical garden! We definitely recommend Gregoires place  and would want to come back! We did not meet Gregoire in person  but he and his support team gave us all the information we needed and responded quickly."),
("2018-01-21", "16070079", "Jack", "We had a great stay. It was clean and the building was quiet. Very central and tons of stuff in walking distance  plus close to public transit. "),
("2018-01-28", "16070079", "Andrew", "Looking for a cheap  clean  central place to stay? This is the one for you. Gregiore’s team will help you with anything you need. Keep up the good work guys :)"),
("2018-03-28", "16070079", "Ying", "Gregoire’s place is very stylish and has everything we needed. The location is perfect and the communication was always easy and fast. We really enjoyed our stay there."),
("2018-03-31", "16070079", "Erin", "Close to everything. Good launching point."),
("2018-05-18", "16070079", "Frances", "I had a wonderful time staying at Gregoire’s place in Sydney  it is a beautiful apartment  excellent communication  and the place was perfectly clean! Would definitely stay here if I was visiting Sydney again :) Thank you!"),
("2018-06-11", "16070079", "Emma", "Great city escape!! So central! Very stlylish and homely apartment! ❤️"),
("2018-07-26", "16070079", "Elyse", "Gregoire's apartment is an ideal central apartment with everything you would need.  Public transport is close and an information folder is great value when shopping for food  alcohol  entertainment  transport etc.  Perfect for professionals wanting a quiet  clean and well located place to work  with all amenities.  Recommend this stay to guests."),
("2018-08-20", "16070079", "源", "This is a very good apartment with convenient transportation and there is a subway station nearby. It is the water heater in this apartment that has some problems and cannot be used. I hope it will be perfect when I stay again."),
("2018-09-11", "16070079", "Anna & Sebastian", "The place is perfectly located. We loved how easy it was to check-in."),
("2018-09-17", "16070079", "Priyanka", "A great place for a short stay! Such a delight to be so close to the city and still have a beautiful  fully equipped and stylish apartment to stay in. The small decorative touches really make this space standout. The effort placed in communication was also incredible and super helpful. I could not praise this enough  thank you! It was far better than previous experiences with Airbnb hosts."),
("2018-09-24", "16070079", "Justine", "The apartment is very nice and clean  exactly as shown in the pictures. The communication was easy and the location is good. The internet works properly for those who work remotely. I would recommend a stay here if visiting the city!"),
("2018-10-03", "16070079", "Nicholas", "Gregoire's place is just amazing and well-located near the train station! Just minutes away from all the bustling City! The atmosphere back at home is surreal  it's a perfect airbnb house to go for!"),
("2018-10-11", "16070079", "Michelle & Susan", "The apartment is clean  modern interior and comfortable and in a fantastic location. Given its central location it is very quiet. Thanks for having us stay."),
("2018-11-09", "16070079", "Wendy", "Gregoire was very quick to communicate and his instructions were very thorough.  The apartment was in a great location  very easy to get the bus to many tourist places in the city.  There was a grocery store nearby and many restaurants.  Don't be put off by the hallway as it was a bit shabby but the apartment itself was lovely.  It was well equipped and very comfortable.  Would definitely recommend."),
("2018-11-24", "16070079", "Leah", "We had an excellent stay at Gregoire's apartment. The location is so close to museum station (much easier to come from that station with luggage than to walk from Central station). We found it spacious  well equipped with everything you could need  and very comfortable. Excellent communication and really easy to check in and out using a lockbox."),
("2019-02-07", "16070079", "EungJune", "fine"),
("2019-02-10", "16070079", "Hanad", "Great stay!"),
("2019-02-18", "16070079", "주사위", "Good rocation"),
("2019-02-28", "16070079", "Robert", "Nice apartment very close to Museum Station for convenient travel throughout the area."),
("2016-12-16", "16134812", "Wendy", "Great Place and Great Host!Definitely recommend staying here!10/10!"),
("2018-01-01", "16126537", "Candice", "Great central spot. Short walk to the fish markets  Casino and Darling Harbour. Everything is at your doorstep."),
("2019-01-01", "16126537", "Liz", "Richard’s place was great and accomodated 7 of us very comfortably. Location is perfect near fish market darling harbour beautiful walk to the rocks and circular quay. I could live there forever. Thanks for having the pantry full with useful items and the fridge had a chocolate bar yum. I highly recommend this accommodation Liz"),
("2019-02-17", "16126537", "Akihide", "Location is good."),
("2017-12-19", "16057052", "Guliano", "Great Location from everything we needed  would stay here again and highly recommend to friends!"),
("2016-12-31", "16087198", "Lu", "很好的房子 那一片都是华人区 环境很好 离超市商店很近 离最近的火车站步行15分钟 房间很干净 被子很舒服 还有个衣柜 叔叔阿姨人很好 性价比超高的"),
("2017-02-11", "16087198", "Craig", "Sydney has come a long way since I was 19 and thinking how anglo it was compared to Melbourne.Now I am 52 and delighted to discover an enclave of Chinese food and culture on the upper North Shore. Min very kindly picked me up from the train and sent me the map on his phone when I managed to get lost a few times in the early days. Great big house  an Edwardian gem sympathetically renovated with a lovely pool. Very kind elderly relatives popping in and out and letting me know in Mandarin that it was about to rain (I had washing on the line.) This area is so great for Asian food. Cheap clothing place run by a Korean lady nearby. A delightful area surrounded by native bushland. A holiday at home and a great insight into the contributions made by enterprising recent arrivals. A chilled out house  no hassles. Such kindness that transcends the language barrier. A great month in the Harbour City at an unbeatable price. "),
("2017-03-10", "16087198", "Luke", "Had another Host cancel on me one evening and Min was able to confirm my last minute request and have his parents show me around. Much appreciated."),
("2017-03-18", "16087198", "Vicky", "It's easy to find the shops and restaurants nearby. The room is very clean and Min's parents are very nice  help me a lot during my stay there. For example lend their iPhone charger to me(left mine home )and give me a lot advice of buying gifts for my family and friends. It's a very pleasant trip in Sydney and thanks for their help. 阿姨和叔叔们人很好 很慈善 对我帮助很多 谢谢他们的帮助｡地点很靠近超市 步行去地铁站也很容易｡那里的风光很好 适合散步!谢谢他们 !"),
("2017-04-15", "16087198", "Kevin", "Lovely  warm and welcoming hosts. Very clean. The only downside was the window between my room and the bathroom. You can't see through but if someone is using the toilet at night  my room was bright. Great Neighbourhood  especially for Asian food :)."),
("2017-04-22", "16087198", "Arjun", "Min was quick to respond even though I booked less than 24 hrs ahead. Room was bigger than I expected and clean. Min's parents showed me the room and they were very polite. Overall a very pleasant experience and great value for money."),
("2017-04-29", "16087198", "Him", "All good  nice clean house near eastwood "),
("2017-05-01", "16087198", "Micheal", "15 mins from train  good size room for someone looking for a single or few days rest.  Host is easy to get along with and very helpful."),
("2017-06-02", "16087198", "Tracy", "Good  quiet  and friendly. I'll choose here to live next time I come to Sydney. Thanks. "),
("2017-06-27", "16087198", "Rachelle", "Min's house was nice. Clean  big and had everything I need. The stores and stations were also walking distance from his house. His parents were really nice even tho they don't speak English. They were also very kind to accomodate me even tho my check out date changed.  Recommended to all"),
("2017-07-04", "16087198", "Sarah", "Good location in Eastwood. My sister enjoyed her stay."),
("2017-07-23", "16087198", "Him", "Reasonable place in epping"),
("2017-07-29", "16087198", "Rafeh", "Despite Min not being there himself  he made sure I had everything I needed. The place is very clean and spacious  as advertised  and good value for money. The only bad thing being how it was kinda of far away from the train station (15 mins walk). "),
("2017-08-06", "16087198", "Sunny", "Nice and helpful owners."),
("2017-09-19", "16087198", "Qingqing", "I love my host and the home. It's really a nice place with good transportation  close to the shopping place and good restaurants. Staying here  I have a feeling at home. My room is fantanstice with good sunshine! The house has a nice swimming pool and all the good facilities for us. I can cook  I can use the machine  I can the yard  swimming pool...and anything I need  I can ask the host Yang Dajie to help. Yang Dajie is Min's mom  she just likes a very friendly sister or mom to help us. You will never hesitate to ask her help. She is so considerate to all what we need and she is always smiling and humorous! If you feel lonely while travel alone  it's also the best choice for you. I even have chance to the  food Yang Dajie make  since you can refuse since she is so warm and want to share with you. This is the best host I ever met! Though I left  I miss this place and the peple who stay here. I think I already established a kind of connection with here. I would like to highly recommend friends to come and i will definitely come back again! 我真的很喜欢这里 这里的主人杨大姐和庄大哥是Min的父母 他们是我遇到的最友好的房东 在这里有家一般的感觉 即使我只短暂地在这里居住 但是永远地留下了美好的回忆｡对于旅途中的人来说 常常会感到孤单 但在这里 我却感受到了亲情与友情｡怀着感恩之心 有了这份相遇｡而我相信 他们对待每位短暂的过客都是如此热情 如此真心!我喜欢这里 不仅因为我的房间洒满阳光 院子里有生机盎然的茶花树 有美丽的游泳池 还因为一切人性化的考虑 这里可以免费使用厨房 有一应俱全的锅俱 油盐酱醋 有功能良好的洗衣机 还有秤可以提供 在外出行行李秤重必不可少｡主人做了美食 如果你刚好在 还会分享给你 或者专门留一点给你 这份深深的情谊是非常难忘的｡这里去Eastwood购物中心特别方便 也有不少中餐､韩国餐和咖啡可享用｡这里的公共交通也方便 火车､汽车都便利｡如果有朋友来 我一定推荐给他们｡我再回来悉尼 也一定会重新住回这里｡因为我不仅想找一个住处 还要回来看望我的老朋友｡"),
("2017-10-01", "16087198", "Brendan", "A real gem. Good price  good location. Friendly hosts. "),
("2017-10-05", "16087198", "Yue", "this is the second time i live here  the best place i've ever lived in Sydney! the room is so clean and comfortable. the house owners are so nice. we even held a little party on the mid-autumn festival. here i feel so at home."),
("2017-10-24", "16087198", "George", "The hosts are definitely nice people  and have taken great care of me over the 19days that I stayed with the family. Both Auntie Yang and her husband are great people  who often asked me if I had my dinner  and invited me when they have their family dinner. Really thoughful of them. The house is big  and the room is clean! Hope to be back again!"),
("2017-11-02", "16087198", "Jessie", "交通便利 靠近超市 火车站及商业街 房东热情 大方 友善 随时提供生活方面的建议 给你家一般的感觉 特别适合初来澳洲的朋友居住!"),
("2017-11-08", "16087198", "Richard", "A lovely house and in a very convenient location. Close to public transport  very clean and Min's mother is such a lovely person. Highly recommended."),
("2017-12-02", "16087198", "Duy Khoa", "Very very good accomodation. The Landlords were very nice. Totally worth it for this price."),
("2017-12-09", "16087198", "Alister", "Very quiet area inner street with good sleeping at night. Pretty clean bed and bathroom. Min’s parent is very nice to me between the staying. Awesome atmosphere like at home. Will recommend for all single travellers."),
("2017-12-12", "16087198", "Pradeep", "Thanks for welcoming me at 11pm as my flight got delayed. Wifi is good and got connected straight away."),
("2017-12-16", "16087198", "Tim", "Es war eine super Unterkunft: sauber  ruhig und gut ausgestattet. Die Gastgeber waren sehr freundlich man konnte in Ruhe auf seinem Zimmer sein oder im Garten die Sonne genießen und im Pool seine Runden drehen! Auf jeden Fall zum weiterempfehlen. DANKE!!!"),
("2017-12-25", "16087198", "Spring", "房东的父母接待的我 很热心的两位老人｡还跟我分享他们的早餐｡给我介绍周围的餐饮 房子的设施｡房间也很干净 一个人住完全够用｡房屋的设施也很齐全 也还可以买点食材自己烹饪｡"),
("2017-12-30", "16087198", "Celine", "Room as per listing. Good location with walking distance (10-15mins) to Eastwood centre and train station. Min's parent is so lovely and thoughtful. There's a day which I had bad headache and couldn't go out to grab food  Min's mother prepare me lunch and dinner on that day. Quiet and clean  easy check in  i'll come back for sure."),
("2018-01-20", "16087198", "Simon", "Landlord and housemates are all friendly  house is always clean & tidy  10 min walk to the nearest train station with heaps of groceries and restaurants. Highly recommended to all and will definitely stay here again."),
("2018-03-25", "16087198", "Mehdi", "Exactly as described host friendly and warming"),
("2018-04-21", "16087198", "Diego", "The house has all you need  good room  peaceful place."),
("2018-05-01", "16087198", "Meng", "Great place to stay  reasonable price. The room has three big windows which make the room bright in the day. Overall great experience. Thanks  Min."),
("2018-05-09", "16087198", "Chengfei", "Everything is very good"),
("2018-05-18", "16087198", "Yuto", "Great atmosphere. Kind. Friendly. I loved peole there."),
("2018-05-25", "16087198", "Lily", "Its a beautiful and quiet area."),
("2018-06-04", "16087198", "Faiçal", "it's an awesome experience. Min's parents ar adorable and they are really nice and respectful :) Train and bus station are nearby  that helps a lot. it's an awesome place to be. "),
("2018-06-21", "16087198", "Nick", "The house is quite big  it has a pool. My room had its own entrance and a desk. Transport links are good about a 12 min walk. Shops are 10 min walk"),
("2018-07-11", "16087198", "Su Lynn", "Clean  well-kept  hospitable and gracious hosts."),
("2018-07-15", "16087198", "Nitesh", "It was a nice experience staying here. It was same as shown in the pictures in the ad"),
("2018-08-02", "16087198", "Mohammad", "Great host  always helpful. Min's parents are great."),
("2018-08-06", "16087198", "Chieh-Yi", "The host really kindly  and this room is comfortable for stay."),
("2018-08-07", "16087198", "Kannan", "The advertised #8 room is a great spot for the business traveller who has work in the area. Public transport (bus) easily accessible. Eastwood shops and train only brisk walk away.The rooms is good sized and is private  with separate entry. Has heating to (albeit a little noisy) ward off the winter chill. The shared bathroom is kept really clean and tidy. The non-stop hot water in the shower is fabulous with excellent pressure. It is quiet as a mouse at night. Wifi is excellent. Coffee/tea making facilities - cooking if you’re inclined and even a washing machine to use.Please remember this is someone’s home and therefore no frills like a hotel - the hosts are warm  generous and happy people. Excellent value for money!!!"),
("2018-08-09", "16087198", "Jing", "房东是个非常热心的人 我还没有来澳洲前 详细的告诉了我关于悉尼的路线 就像一个导游一样!而我非常不幸的事情是我的航班错过了 在这种情况下 min还帮我积极的想办法 虽然没有见过面 但是我觉得非常温暖 最后我不得不改行程 min也非常帮我 把住宿的钱退给了我 给她造成了不少的麻烦 我非常感谢她 连面都没见过 这种信任和帮助 我一生都会记住的｡虽然我这次来不了悉尼了 但是下次来我一定住min家 见见我不曾见面 而帮我的朋友!"),
("2016-12-02", "16147619", "Delphine", "The host canceled this reservation 25 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-03-18", "16147619", "Joanne", "The host canceled this reservation 6 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-08-31", "16167487", "Ezzedine", "Super clean house  very easy to find  neighborhood is quite  fast wifi  host is responsible and accurate.In winter the place is very cold."),
("2017-09-08", "16167487", "卓", "一百刀一晚 最多能住五个人 性价比超级高｡离Randwick主街步行十分钟 安静的不能再安静｡家边有一个快餐店 早六晚八 不能再好吃｡房主人在伦敦 但有求必应｡体验不能再好｡"),
("2017-09-10", "16167487", "David", "Great spot- close to Coogee and Randwick pubs/restaurants etc.Les is a helpful guy  he'll sort you out!"),
("2017-09-15", "16167487", "Adesh", "A very nice experience at this place. Close to beach  city and airport. Overall  a good experience here."),
("2017-03-19", "16178963", "Zhu", "Had a pleasant stay. Maria was friendly and helpful and the room was comfortable and clean."),
("2017-03-25", "16178963", "Silvia", "Good location  clean and comfortable "),
("2017-03-31", "16178963", "John", "Maria and her family are lovely  really like the style of house and bedroom is really comfortable.Felt right at home."),
("2017-04-10", "16178963", "Robert", "Maria communicates well & is easy to deal with"),
("2017-04-12", "16178963", "Robert", "Thank you"),
("2016-12-23", "16160263", "Sarah", "Great location  10 minutes walk from the beach  really nice setting   quiet. Justine made sure we would be comfortable. Lovely soaps  croissants orange juice and jam was a nice touch. would definitely go back. "),
("2016-12-29", "16160263", "Matt", "Justine & Sam were very communicative and accomodating and helpful. We had a great stay in this quiet leafy retreat."),
("2016-12-31", "16160263", "Lisa", "Great location about 10 min walk to the beach and cafes."),
("2017-01-07", "16160263", "Lizz", "Justines place was stunning. Perfect for what we were after. Very clean. Great view. Felt very homely. Justine had breakfast and coffee for us as well as fruit and juice and she was super easy to communicate with. Very helpful. Definitely recommend."),
("2017-01-14", "16160263", "Fiona", "Lovely spacious apartment in the trees. 10 minutes walk to the beach.  Justine was a very generous host.  Thank you for the cereal  fruit and chocolates.  Highly recommended and will be back.  Thank you Justine."),
("2017-01-27", "16160263", "Lucie", "What an amazing place! It's even better than in the pictures. It really feels like being in a large and beautiful treehouse! The place has everything you need but we particularly enjoyed the beautiful deck  up in the trees  amongst the birds and cicadas. So peaceful. But also very close to Avalon's beach and cafes/restaurants/shops.Justine was away during our stay so we didn't meet her but it was very easy to check-in and check-out and she was super available via email  answering any of our questions very quickly. A wonderful stay!"),
("2017-02-05", "16160263", "Ray", "Lovely atmosphere amongst the trees. Quiet and peaceful while close to most things. Will definitely keep this one in mind for next visit."),
("2017-02-11", "16160263", "Claudine", "Lovely get away!"),
("2017-02-18", "16160263", "Sandra", "Justine's place was everything what we can ask for and more  the place is just beautiful and Justine is a great host  she was very attentive to our needs all the time and she care that we could have a great time. Thank you Justine."),
("2017-02-20", "16160263", "Catherine", "Great place to stay  lovely host  beautiful location  close to shops and beach.  "),
("2017-02-23", "16160263", "Adinda", "Absolutely a perfect place for a nice getaway. The cosy but spacious place was exactly what we wanted  having a nice view and interior. Only a 10 min walk down to the beach and town. Justine was easy to communicate  left a page of recommended things to do  as well as provided breakfast essentials. Will certainly come back. Thank you Justine. "),
("2017-03-05", "16160263", "Dean", "Gorgeous spot. Waking up with the kookaburra's was delightful. Have to get my darling back next time"),
("2017-04-02", "16160263", "Anke", "Justine's home was perfect for us.  The location was fantastic and the surroundings beautiful. It was exactly like the pictures if not better.  We really appreciated the little things that Justine did for us to make our stay easy and enjoyable.   Thank you Justine and we look forward to coming again in the near future.Cheers Anke"),
("2017-04-15", "16160263", "Melina", "Such a beautiful spot to get away and relax. The place blew us away. The photos don't do it justice. Highly recommend staying and will be back again!"),
("2017-04-22", "16160263", "Gary", "Well appointed place high up in the tree tops with lovely views."),
("2017-05-06", "16160263", "Sophia Jean", "Justine's place was better than I expected. You really have to see it for yourself to truly appreciate it. Surrounded by tree tops and the sounds of birds  I felt relaxed the instant I walked through the door. And with up-scale amenities  it felt on par with a 5 star hotel (with all the benefits of actually not being a hotel!). Would recommend to anyone looking for a retreat-style getaway."),
("2017-06-03", "16160263", "John", "Nice place with a private balcony and huge amount of living space. Travelled alone so had plenty of room  and wasn't interrupted or felt like I was intruding. Great location a stone's throw from all the bars and restaurants."),
("2017-06-11", "16160263", "Leisa", "Beautiful place to stay when you want that quiet time out from daily life. The bath was a major factor for me in choosing this place and it was magnificent! The place was very beautiful and cosy and the views were just amazing!! Absolutely loved it"),
("2017-07-30", "16160263", "Renata", "Spent a lovely weekend at Justine's place and couldn't be happier  it was very cosy and beautiful  surrounded by nature. she also left nice treats and breakfast ready for me. Thanks so much Justine!"),
("2017-08-07", "16160263", "Anna", "A lovely tree house with great space and facilities. The location is central  quiet and only a short walk to Avalon beach  shops and restaurants. The host provided plenty of privacy which is much appreciated. Overall  I recommend due to excellent value."),
("2017-09-03", "16160263", "Jo", "Lovely spot for a weekend get away! We will be back... Thank you!"),
("2017-09-25", "16160263", "Nicola", "Amazing tree-tops style home  had a fantastic stay. Fresh bread  fruit and coffee on arrival made for a perfect breakfast. Stunning views from the deck. Perfect host."),
("2017-10-01", "16160263", "Richa", "Justine was a thoughtful host who have us our privacy. She has an amazing home tucked away in the trees. Highly recommended for a holiday for two."),
("2017-10-22", "16160263", "Diya", "Justine's place was great - the photos don't do it justice. Its super spacious  the balcony is brilliant and looks out to leafy bush  and is easy to get to even without a car."),
("2017-11-11", "16160263", "Daniella", "Justines place was beautiful! The pictures do not do it justice! Perfect hideaway in the trees and so close to the beach and shops/cafes! Loved waking up to a view of the trees and birds and the place is very spacious! Great views from the balcony and all the windows! I couldnt recommend this place enough to anyone wanting a getaway!"),
("2017-11-18", "16160263", "Gillian", "Beautiful home with everything provided. Spacious  private and relaxing. Walking distance to restaurants and the beach."),
("2017-12-11", "16160263", "Morgan", "As many have said before us  the photos really do not do this place justice. The accommodation is a very generous space  full of natural light  a beautiful setting high in the trees with a peaceful outlook.Great deck / balcony for lunch or a drink in the afternoon. Some very nice homely touches with tea  coffee  a few basics and some absolutely cracking c coconut biscuits :)Would definitely visit again."),
("2017-12-31", "16160263", "Jane", "Justine’s place is great and very comfortable with a lovely deck to watch the sunset. It is very close to Avalon Beach and Avalon’s restaurants and bars. My husband and I had a lovely quiet stay over New Years Eve."),
("2018-01-04", "16160263", "Helen", "Justine was a great host  her apartment felt very secluded and private although it was only 10 minute walk down to avalon beach and shops. She was very hospitable and had some nice touches she had prepared for us!"),
("2018-01-06", "16160263", "Stephen", "Great location and lovely place"),
("2018-04-02", "16160263", "Samantha", "Really nice apartment in a great location close to Avalon beach. Photos don’t do it justice!"),
("2018-09-09", "16160263", "Banuja", "Absolutely gorgeous home. Pictures do no justice.  Balcony views are palm trees and so much greenery!!"),
("2018-09-30", "16160263", "Ashleigh", "We had a great stay in Avalon. Justine’s place was great  it was the perfect size for two people. Clean  comfortable and very close to the beach and shops. Justine was also really helpful! We will definitely be back again."),
("2018-11-04", "16160263", "Nicola", "Love this place  perfect escapism"),
("2018-12-30", "16160263", "Rachael", "Justine’s place was lovely. Views were amazing and location was perfect! Justine added some nice touches (coffee  milk cereal) which made us feel at home!"),
("2019-01-27", "16160263", "Sal", "Highly enjoyed our stay. The photos don’t do the place justice - very spacious for 2 people  well decorated and the leafy views from the balcony make you feel you’re far  far away from Sydney! 5 min drive to Avalon Beach and shops  so very handy. Justine also supplies bread  milk  cereal and fruit for brekkie  which is a lovely touch."),
("2019-02-16", "16160263", "Paul", "Justine is a fantastic host who is very friendly  accommodating and responsive. Would book with her again!"),
("2017-12-10", "16183477", "Raymond", "It was great. The place is clean and convenient  located very close to the train station."),
("2017-12-21", "16183477", "Anna", "Cecilia room was big and spacious  ...close to all transport and restaurants..had air con and ensuite and very clean ..Thank you for allowing me to share your home"),
("2018-03-10", "16183477", "Toomas", "Great place. Lovely host."),
("2018-08-11", "16183477", "Ken", "best host  best price"),
("2018-08-12", "16183477", "Marvin", "Unhappy experience with this room  because the room is not tidy and clean. Finally  I gave up to live in this room (Website hidden by Airbnb) Anyway  I hope the landlord  can clean room  carefully  and don’t let the following customers feel down. And Cecilia apologized about this experience for me"),
("2018-11-21", "16183477", "Rodrigo", "Cecilia was lovely and a great hostess. Everything that was promised was offered. Clean and organized place  if you need it in the future  will be my first choice."),
("2018-11-27", "16183477", "Gilbert", "good place to stay"),
("2018-12-04", "16183477", "Q", "Cecilia家位于静街很安静  位置便利  入住和退房都相当方便   房间干净整洁  生活必须品齐全  还有小阳台可以晒衣服  浴室很新很干净  房东回消息都特别快  好评!"),
("2018-12-20", "16183477", "Jeff", "The room and bathroom are clean and everything you need for the stay is there. Doors close with some cranky sound though. Overall worth the value"),
("2018-12-28", "16183477", "Airbus", "Great location"),
("2019-01-18", "16183477", "瑶", "Cecilia很nice 房源位置很方便 房间也很不错"),
("2019-01-26", "16183477", "Lawrence", "Cecilia was quick to respond to my questions  and was able to action my requests quickly. The room has its own en-suite which is good. The room is well ventilated and has a fan  which is all but quiet  and makes sleeping in hot Sydney weather possible. The windows all have bug screens...another essential item. The mattress of the bed is the hardest I have ever slept on...which for me is ok. The room has its own desk and chair  which allows for computer use in the room. The kitchen is very small  and I found that the utensils variety and number did not allow for regular meal preparation...keeping in mind this is a share house so other people are also using the facilities. There is no dishwasher so dishes are done by hand. The washing machine is fully functional and easy to use. The common TV looses coverage often...due to the weather and the location of the house. The train station access is fine  and the station has most amenities. All in all  for the price  a good place to stay."),
("2019-02-12", "16183477", "Jana", "Had a good time at Cecilia‘s place. It was clean and everything went well."),
("2019-02-16", "16183477", "Wei", "這次的住宿我很滿意謝謝"),
("2019-02-21", "16183477", "Na", "Near hurstville train station"),
("2019-03-02", "16183477", "Fifa", "the place was very clean  close to the transportations  and same as what we expect it  Cecilia respond very fast when I need help from her  thanks a lot"),
("2016-12-12", "16166535", "Sandy", "Cleanliness of the bathroom was a major concern for us but the bedroom was very clean and is a huge room.  The bed is very firm  but that may suit some guests staying.  Fei is absolutely delightful and a very interesting man who we did enjoy meeting."),
("2017-01-01", "16166535", "Judith", "We were made to feel very welcome by David and Fei. Thanks so much for having us!"),
("2017-02-04", "16166535", "Karricaj", "."),
("2017-03-06", "16166535", "Trang", "Fei's place is a beautiful and well looked after place. The house is huge with classic touches of decorations. You'd feel like you're travelling back to time. The guests have their own kitchen and lounge area. Fei and his wife make sure that you have everything you need. They often checked on our family  got us fruit and milk on our first days. Fei's wife is a lovely and caring women who was really helpful. The place is totally valuable! I would suggest this to anyone who'd like to stay in a quirky  classic style. Thank you Fei and family  we did enjoy our holiday very much. "),
("2017-03-25", "16166535", "Tony", "David and his wife have renovated this large 1840s home adding their special touch of Chinese art and furniture. A fascinating place to stay in the inner west.  David was a most generous host happy to talk about this interesting property."),
("2017-04-01", "16166535", "Catherine", "This is a beautiful house that is a pleasure to be in. Fei was unstintingly generous in providing assistance and making us feel comfortable. We wholeheartedly recommend it."),
("2017-05-14", "16166535", "Jackie", "This place and it's hosts were absolutely incredible. Amazing house; kind  accommodating  generous hosts; comfortable beds and great location. Thoroughly enjoyed staying here and would return again. "),
("2017-06-13", "16166535", "Sophie", "Fei and David are hospitable and friendly hosts who have such a beautiful home. The location is very central and close to shops and food as well as very accessible. The house is absolutely one of a kind and gorgeously vintage. Definitely worth a stay!"),
("2017-07-23", "16166535", "Kelly", "Such a lovely and charming home  you made our stay so comfortable  thank you!"),
("2017-10-02", "16166535", "Martin", "We used this magnificent house as a our base for a family trip to Sydney and loved the experience. It is a mansion  with beautiful furnishings and large comfortable rooms. Fei and family provided all we needed   including a nice welcome  fruit  facilities  and access to parking on the property. This is not your typical Airbnb  as it is a huge historic house  but we had all the privacy  convenience and comfort that we could ask for in luxurious surroundings. We will definitely stay here when we come back to Sydney."),
("2017-10-08", "16166535", "Tanya", "A large beautiful home  with welcoming gracious hosts. Would recommend without hesitation."),
("2017-11-19", "16166535", "Russell", "Fei and his wife were very hospitable and nothing was too much trouble. It was a truly unexpected and unique experience staying in their magnificent Victorian mansion in the suburbs of Sydney. We had a beautifully furnished  twin bed room on the first floor. There was a beautiful shared bathroom and we had full use of the kitchen. There were bus stops very close by and Petersham station about 10 minutes walk away. Although there was the some aircraft noise it didn't bother us. We would happily stay there again and recommend it. Thank you Fei and Jlan!"),
("2017-11-24", "16166535", "Cordelia", "We had a lovely time here. It was a large room. Breakfast was lovely. Fantastic location  short walk from restaurants and cafes. Great hosts!"),
("2017-12-09", "16166535", "Kiri", "Amazing decor"),
("2018-02-02", "16166535", "Madelaine", "We were able to cook our own meals easily with plenty of fridge space. The house has such a colourful history and so much love has gone in to making it a home."),
("2018-02-08", "16166535", "Louise", "Amazing mansion in Petersham with eclectic  mix of artworks. Fei and Suzanne were lovely  accommodating  hosts. Entry and egress  were a little challenging though with keys required to unlock external gate and then security front door. "),
("2018-02-15", "16166535", "Philip", "Fei and his wife were lovely and very accommodating people. The house and decor are beautiful and this was probably the best value-for-money place in Sydney I've come across. I'd highly recommend it."),
("2018-02-18", "16166535", "Loan", "My family had really great time staying in the house.  Fei and his family are super friendly and provided us all necessary facilities and help us as much as they can. Thank so much for letting us staying in your house."),
("2018-02-19", "16166535", "Belinda Jane", "Wonderful to see the amazing  furniture that Fei has collected from all over the world ."),
("2018-02-20", "16166535", "Rob", "The house is large and first bedroom very nice. Second bedroom nowhere near as described. If they say it's a two bedroom vacancy  unfortunately my advice is not to believe them"),
("2018-02-23", "16166535", "Ting", "位置不在闹市区 走路几分钟到火车站 离机场也不远｡非常古老的建筑 放满了房东的收藏 有逛博物馆的感觉｡房东很热心 准备的非常齐全 唯一不太好的是要和别人共用卫生间 有时候着急真的挺耽误时间｡如果想体会不一样的住宿是很好的推荐 如果想住酒店级别的就算了｡"),
("2018-03-02", "16166535", "Audrey", "Fei夫妻俩非常的好客 准备了早餐的食材给我们 新鲜的水果任吃 厨房的用具和调料都很齐 方便我们自己做早餐 晚餐｡而且房子的位置也不错哦 步行几分钟就能到达petersham train station 出行也很方便｡但因为我们在悉尼的时间太赶了 所以没能好好的参观Fei的大房子!的确是很特别的一次入住体验!"),
("2018-03-04", "16166535", "Catriona", "Interesting Chinese home filled with eclectic art works and furniture. Kitchen available and juice milk etc provided. Reasonably close to city but check out whether trains actually running. Very comfortable room for three."),
("2018-03-06", "16166535", "Cecilia", "I so enjoyed this my stay with Fei and David that I extended it an extra three days. When I first arrived  I said ""Im just checking in  I have to take my cat to the cat-sitter"" ""Bring the cat!"" they said. From the brave openness of this invite  to the windows that let fresh air in all day long  I think 'openness' is the word that best describes the spirit of the house.  David and Fei are living lives of curiosity and enthusiasm  and its great to be around. They have turned a crumbling Victorian mansion into quirky extravaganza of a home  with beautiful objects  and all sorts of full of all sorts of interesting people. They let me use their fully-equipped kitchen and generously stocked personal fridge  which is unusually generous for AirBnB  and did all the things that made me feel that this was my home. Gilmore loved it."),
("2018-03-15", "16166535", "Philip", "I stayed here for a second time  collectively in the last month I have spent about 5 hours looking over accommodation in Sydney (which I know pretty well) and Fei's place is definitely the nicest and most competitively prices. I would highly recommend."),
("2018-03-17", "16166535", "Ginny", "Fei made my son and his friend welcome in her home. Thank you for looking after them."),
("2018-03-18", "16166535", "Michael", "Fanatic place to go and visit."),
("2018-03-23", "16166535", "Cecilia", "Again  our stay with Fei was like wonderland. Its a dream-world. I hope to make it my second home in Sydney : )"),
("2018-03-31", "16166535", "James", "Fei and Jia were very welcoming  generous and friendly hosts. Their home has a unique history and they continue this in their care for it. It is truly beautiful. The room was spacious and comfortable with our own balcony. Great transport links. We very much hope to return."),
("2018-04-06", "16166535", "Madonna", "Fei's heritage home has grand  high ceilings and spacious rooms with antique art and furnishings. The large  modern kitchen with an elegant dining area attached was great for our family needs. Fei is a very helpful and generous host. An excellent stop-over destination if you find hotels sterile and expensive."),
("2018-04-15", "16166535", "Kathryn", "Beautiful family and beautiful home. Felt completely comfortable and welcomed. Will definitely stay again."),
("2018-05-09", "16166535", "Kelly", "A beautiful  spacious heritage home  Fei and Susan are very friendly and  welcoming.  The unexpected touches  such as providing and abundance of breakfast foods made us feel all the more special.  I would love to stay here again next time I am in Sydney"),
("2018-05-13", "16166535", "佳", "非常棒的房东房子很大很美!喜欢民国风的一定要来看看!房东很热情!还给我们准备面包牛奶 根本没想到会这么贴心周到!很感谢!☺️☺️☺️"),
("2018-05-20", "16166535", "Kit", "Fei and Suzanne were lovely hosts! Their house was amazing  so appreciative of them trying to restore this historical house!  Will stay again"),
("2018-09-30", "16166535", "Joel", "Staying at the mansion was really interesting.  It is like it says  a historic mansion in the heart of Petersham.  The building has lots of strange quirks that are reflective of it's history.  Fei and his family and guests were hospitable and really made their house available to us."),
("2018-10-11", "16166535", "Julia", "Fei and his family were wonderful hosts for me and my colleagues who recently stayed at his place. The house was very interesting and beautiful. The family were lovely and very friendly as well as respected privacy. Easy walk to inner Western spots around Sydney. We had a great time!"),
("2018-10-15", "16166535", "Stephanie", "Interesting home  friendly hosts."),
("2018-10-17", "16166535", "Wei", "It's an amazing house. Good location. Fei’s family are very nice. I really love the house historic style. Everything is perfect!"),
("2018-10-20", "16166535", "Marie-Sodévie", "Un accueil chaleureux  une oreille à tout vos besoins  un décor splendide."),
("2018-10-22", "16166535", "Laney", "Extraordinary place and such kind hosts!"),
("2018-10-23", "16166535", "Mark", "Wow! Fei’s house was magical!! Loved our stay there – large palatial rooms  interesting decor and comfortable beds. We were welcomed by Fei’s helpful and friendly son who offered us drinks and snacks and sorted us out with some local knowledge for things to do nearby. Great place  we look forward to staying again."),
("2018-10-29", "16166535", "Jon", "I really enjoyed the fabulous mansion accommodation (with views of Sydney) and Fei's family's welcoming hospitality! The location is perfect for catching transport to the CBD and there are great restaurants right in Petersham. I thoroughly enjoyed my stay!"),
("2018-11-06", "16166535", "Praew", "Fei and his family were great hosts during my stay at their beautiful home.  A short  walk to Petersham train station made traveling to the city so easy!"),
("2018-11-07", "16166535", "Suzanne", "I couldn't be happier with Fei's place.  We arrived earlier than expected and Fei's father showed us around. Fei arrived and welcomed us.  Fei's son opened a bottle of wine and  cut up a mango. He chatted with us.  We had separate sleeping rooms and our own refrigerator.  Groceries and pub within walking distance.  Very safe neighborhood.  Fei even gave my travel partner some tea to take home with him.  I highly recommend staying here."),
("2018-11-24", "16166535", "Joc", "A lovely nostalgic old building.  Great location: 20mins by bus (2 or 3 min walk to stop)   15 mins by train (6 or 7 min walk to station) or $20 Uber ride from CBD.  Fei is a very personable and friendly person whom is passionate about SYD.  Fei couldn't do enough to make us feel at home and show us around.  THANKYOU for all your help!"),
("2018-12-05", "16166535", "Christine", "A very warm welcome great hosts magnificent place to stay very central walking distance to two shopping centres and easy excess to where ever you want to go in Sydney"),
("2018-12-08", "16166535", "Brett", "Great place. Great location. Fantastic for price range"),
("2019-01-01", "16166535", "Marc", "We very much enjoyed our stay at Fei's house.  It was quite an experience. As soon we arived we were greated and welcomed like family.  Fei and his wife made our stay very pleasend and gave us a lot of information on what to do around Petersham. They supplied food and drinks and checked on us every day if we need anything else.  Thank you so much.  We will be back."),
("2019-01-02", "16166535", "Nathan", "Fei’s Place is a beautiful Victorian stately home in an excellent location  with a modern  well appointed kitchen and Fei is the perfect host."),
("2019-01-27", "16166535", "Mike", "This house is amazing!"),
("2019-02-09", "16166535", "Helen", "A fantastic stay with Fei and his wife.  The warm welcome and hospitality was the best we have experienced with Airbnb.  After a very long drive and arriving 5 hours later than expected at night   Fei ended up cooking us a much appreciated meal which we totally did not expect.   The historic house and furnishings were all part of our amazing weekend in Sydney.  We normally do not like sharing rooms in private residences  but Fei's house was so spacious and we had so much of the house to use if needed  plus Fei was such a genuine host who respected our privacy but also was always on hand to provide us with information about the area and Sydney.  Location was superb with a 5 minute walk to delicious Portuguese pastries  charcoal chicken etc .  Public transport was 5 minute walk and 15 minute trip to Circular Quay.    We definitely recommend Fei as a host and his wonderful home and will be back."),
("2019-02-12", "16166535", "Genevieve", "My partner and I were really happy with our stay! Gorgeous home  full of character and even lovelier hosts~We definitely reccomend~"),
("2019-02-15", "16166535", "Robyn", "The description of the house as a mansion does not disappoint. This is a beautiful  stylish home with friendly  hospitable hosts."),
("2019-02-20", "16166535", "Debby", "Fei’s place is very unique and both him and his wife are very friendly and generous people. Their mansion is one of a kind and we feel so lucky to find this place to stay in Sydney. Thank you Fei and Suzanne!!"),
("2019-03-01", "16166535", "Chantelle", "Great location  greats hosts  very comfortable place to stay.The house is absolutely fantastic to admire. You really get a sense of how it may have been back when it was first built. So much for your eye to see! No you’re standard air bnb that’s for sure! Fei and his wife are very friendly and accommodating. Basics for breakfast are provided. Highly recommend!"),
("2016-12-04", "16193945", "Eva", "We had a great stay at the apartment. It is located in a beautiful spot  ten minutes walking distance to Paradise Beach. Fully equipped. Molly was very helpful and made our stay so easy. Totally recommendable.  "),
("2016-12-11", "16193945", "Emma", "We had a lovely stay at this very unique property that is set in a beautiful bushland setting. It is great for anyone wanting to feel immersed in nature but still have the beach and shops just a few minutes away. The design of the home is amazing - with huge windows and all natural materials throughout. Molly was lovely to deal with and made communication easy. Would definitely love to stay again!"),
("2017-01-18", "16193945", "Ekaterina Sergeevna", "Awesome! Better than the pictures. Secluded  cozy place. Thank you very much for the warm welcome. We will definitely back again"),
("2017-01-28", "16193945", "Alexander", "Great place to stay for a relaxing weekend up at the northern beaches. Thanks to Molly and our hosts for a pleasant stay."),
("2017-02-11", "16193945", "Michelle", "Great stay for a weekend away! Molly was fantastic with regards to communication. She was very flexible with our stay and organised in house massages for us which were fantastic as we didn't have to go anywhere. This place is great for a quiet and relaxing weekend. Thanks again!"),
("2017-02-17", "16193945", "Diane", "Wake up to the kookaburra's in this bush surrounded apartment. Would be good for those who seek the recycled look and feel.  Access not suitable for small children or us (70yo). Nice area and excellent check in communication and service. Caring owner was concerned for our car in hail storm and moved it to neighbours garage."),
("2017-04-09", "16193945", "Kelsey", "Secluded spot in the trees  steep access  small but comfortable  nice bathroom  a lovely quiet weekender. "),
("2017-04-13", "16193945", "Brooke", "Great value for money. Great area to visit. Hosts were very attentive."),
("2017-04-15", "16193945", "Nick", "Lovely place  beautifully furnished and set amongst the trees. Effortless check-in and great experience overall. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-04-19", "16193945", "怀玉", "My friends and I are totally enjoying a great time at the house. It is super nice with the trees all around~ enjoy one night stay at the lovely house"),
("2017-04-22", "16193945", "Amy", "The location of this accommodation was perfect for our needs and felt very tranquil amongst the trees however future guests should note phone reception is limited! Future guests should also note that the hot and cold taps on the shower are labelled wrong - we didn't find this out until it was too late as due to the lack of phone service we couldn't call anyone to help. We were 100% impressed with this accommodation but it did serve our needs for the night."),
("2017-05-28", "16193945", "Tash", "A lovely little home tucked in the bush. This is one place in a battle axe street  meaning there are a couple of houses nestled into a hill in the bush. We stayed within the Avalon beach area  which is literally a three minute drive from the accomodation. There's a fantastic French restaurant and bakery close by and the breath-taking beach with a little ocean pool where you can do laps to burn off the croissants.The house is well-stocked with tea  vegemite  pots  pans etc. Beds were comfortable and there were bathrobes to strut around in.  We went at the start of winter and the place had enough heaters to keep it cosy. "),
("2017-06-11", "16193945", "Ishani", "Everything was absolutely beautiful. Self check-in was perfect for our circumstances. The treehouse was idyllic and all of the amenities were beautiful. Communication with the host was outstanding. Would stay here again!"),
("2017-06-16", "16193945", "Josi", "We didn't actually stay here but we used this gorgeous property for a photoshoot. Molly was super helpful and made sure we could start our shoot on time. The property was super clean and exactly as the pictures showed! Great little retreat in Avalon."),
("2017-07-10", "16193945", "Cameron", "Very serviceable accomodation. Great area."),
("2017-08-13", "16193945", "Karina", "A beautiful place for a weekend getaway. Great communication  close to the shops and beach and really comfy beds! Molly was really accommodating as well  thank you!"),
("2017-08-20", "16193945", "Hena", "Great place for a quiet getaway"),
("2017-09-16", "16193945", "Danielle", "The apartment was perfect for our overnight stay. Communication was excellent throughout  and place was in a great spot - not even five minutes drive from Avalon shops and the beach. Beds were really comfy  the apartment was equipped with everything we needed  and it was so lovely waking up surrounded by the bush. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2017-09-25", "16193945", "Jace", "Nice place for living  quiet and peaceful"),
("2017-10-01", "16193945", "Ellie", "A lovely place to relax. Very charming!"),
("2017-11-05", "16193945", "Edward", "This is an amazing place to escape the bustle of Sydney. Comfortable  and close to everything you'd need and nestled in beautiful canopy. Highly recommend."),
("2017-11-18", "16193945", "Samuel", "Gorgeous space  perfect for an escape from the city. Would recommend to anyone looking a place within range of quiet but also cafes and things to do."),
("2017-12-08", "16193945", "Kate", "Beautifully located private apartment in bush setting in Avalon. We stayed for a wedding in Whale Beach and the apartment was perfect for our family. Hosts were very helpful and great with communication during our stay and beforehand. Access to the apartment is via a very steep driveway and stairs which were slippery in the wet so be careful if raining. If parking more than one car parking is on the road which is at the bottom of the steep driveway but there is one spot very close to the apartment which was handy. Beds very comfy  apartment nicely styled and bathroom lovely with a clear roof and lovely toiletries which was a nice touch. Perfect for our stay. Photos are accurate representation of apartment."),
("2017-12-09", "16193945", "Hannah", "Fantastic apartment in a fabulous location. Beware there are no fly screens on any window and given the location in the bush  with a pond outside one main window  mosquitoes were fierce. It was also disappointing that there was no hot water."),
("2018-01-01", "16193945", "Margherita", "I enjoyed my stay at the Avalon apartment amongst the trees  check in and check out was smooth  and communication overall was appreciated. The location was great and especially for the summer time of year. The only critique was the front door and maybe being a bit sturdier  and that the surrounding area was a lot busier than anticipated however it was still a lovely stay."),
("2018-01-20", "16193945", "Mark", "The location is very handy to the beaches and local restaurants  and is also very quiet.  There are some nice touches to the design of the property that add to the experience - the skylights  large sliding timber windows  wrap around verandah  and an outside shower for washing the sand off after a trip to the beach.  The facilities are comprehensive and the beds comfortable.  Suited our family very nicely for our weekend at the beach.  A ceiling fan in the main living area would be an easy and inexpensive way to improve comfort on hot nights  but all in all it is a lovely place to stay."),
("2018-01-21", "16193945", "Renata", "We went to do a photoshoot on the property. It was very beautiful and the hosts did everything they could to ensure we would have a great time. :) thanks guys."),
("2018-02-03", "16193945", "Mandy", "Very nice outlook however a little on the old side."),
("2018-03-17", "16193945", "Nhi", "I stayed here for a birthday weekend getaway. It was my first experience with Airbnb which went smoothly. The communication was timely and helpful throughout the stay. The phone reception /wifi was a bit patchy & there were a few creepy-crawlies which kept my friends up for a portion of the night (didn’t really bother me). Otherwise  we had a relaxing time; the space is cosy and beautiful as pictured  well-equipped  with comfy beds  in a peaceful location. We also enjoyed visiting the cafes and beaches nearby."),
("2018-03-25", "16193945", "Kathryn", "Very cool accommodation set amongst the tree-tops"),
("2018-04-02", "16193945", "Alex", "Billie and Molly have a great apartment with a cosy feel. Located in a very quiet spot and only 5 min drive from Avalon beach. Close to the shops and everything you need. Thanks for having us! Alex & Jo"),
("2018-04-23", "16193945", "Adam", "Great little 'treehouse' and not too far from the main town. Lovely little beach just a short walk away too to go and watch the sunset."),
("2018-07-15", "16193945", "Cat & Will", "Lovely little place for a quick trip away  concierge were brilliant "),
("2018-08-05", "16193945", "Jess", "Amazing place :)"),
("2018-09-02", "16193945", "Imogen", "Easy and friendly communication throughout our stay here. Place was cute and although surrounded by other houses it was nestled amongst trees so it was quite secluded. A rustic but well maintained 1 bedroom cottage well prepared for airbnb guests. About a 20 minute walk to Avalon beach and local shops  restaurants etc. Very steep driveway :)"),
("2018-09-16", "16193945", "Emma", "The location was great for our overnight trip visiting Palm Beach and surrounding areas. The bathroom with it’s clear roof gave amazing light and was a nice novelty.  The house had more of an older cabin type vibe  although the bathroom was really modern and white and clean. Check in was really easy with the lock box and we booked the day of and got a response within the hour. Great service."),
("2018-10-01", "16193945", "Laura", "Our stay was absolutely perfect! The service was excellent to communicate with and flexible with us. The space was beautiful  clean and private. We loved spending time in the afternoon sun that streams into the house. The space is beautifully decorated and had everything we needed. Thanks so much- we hope to be back!"),
("2018-11-28", "16193945", "Andre", "Beautiful space  easy check in  Molly quick to communicate.Would return"),
("2018-12-01", "16193945", "Jessica", "The location is nice and close to Avalon  but it is a  pretty small place and wouldn't recommend it for 4 adults as it only has one bedroom and two single beds in the living room (not as pictured). The photos make it look nicer than it is  it's dark and pretty run down and there were a fair few bugs inside. The place is private which was nice and very green."),
("2018-12-01", "16193945", "Melodie", "Cushie was great. Good communication. The place is not the same as in photos. The place was not very well cleaned and the furnitures were old  from the 70s. The location is amazing though - real disconnection from the city. I would not recommend this place if you are after a bit of comfort. Ideal for a yoga retreat."),
("2018-12-15", "16193945", "Emma", "Lovely stay in a unique little spot"),
("2018-12-25", "16193945", "Lily", "Great location and space amongst the forest but so close to town! Easy check in - thanks!"),
("2019-01-02", "16193945", "Libby", "A truly unique and homely place for a holiday - somewhat small but aesthetically very beautiful inside and out. Convenient to many facilities including Clareville. Just remember to use a lot of insect repellant in the summer."),
("2019-01-24", "16193945", "Kimiko", "Loved this place amongst the trees. Felt like we were up in the mountains in Bali. Had everything we needed and the place has some lovely warm touches. If you’re scared of creepy crawlies it may not be your best option  but we loved it nonetheless. Hosts were really responsive and helpful. Would definitely come back here if we are looking for a quick getaway from Sydney by the beach."),
("2019-01-27", "16193945", "Rachel", "Lovely unit- quiet and clean. Good place to stay to explore the northern beaches from. Had a great stay here and was easy to arrange how to access the place. Thanks for the great weekend!"),
("2019-02-09", "16193945", "Natascha", "This is the second time we’ve stayed at this lovely  leafy  private spot. We love how close it is to everything  yet nestled in the trees it feels like miles from the hustle of Sydney life."),
("2019-02-16", "16193945", "James", "Beautiful home  thank you!"),
("2016-12-31", "16232987", "Varun", "Muñeca and her mother both made us feel like family during our stay. The apartment was easy to find  right across the train station. Pictures really undersell the place  it's beautifully decorated penthouse and feels like a comfy home. We enjoyed our stay very much and highly recommend it. "),
("2017-03-06", "16221015", "Steph", "great location  omio was very nice and accomodating"),
("2017-03-25", "16221015", "Annabel", "Fantastic location with a great host.  Amazing views of a beautiful city."),
("2017-04-11", "16221015", "Orlaith", "I would recommend Omio's place to anyone!The views are breathtaking.. You can see Sydney harbour  the bridge  and the opera house on the skyline  as well as the sea. The pictures don't do it justice!The bedroom is super clean and comfortable  the bathroom (private) is fabYou can walk to Bondi or go into the city in just 15-20 mins.. Perfect!Omio was an excellent host  he was very accomdating  we even stayed an extra nightthanks again!"),
("2017-05-30", "16221015", "Sophia", "Omio is a great host  very nice and easy to communicate with! The place was very clean and easy to get to transportation to get to the city. It is central to Bondi and and Coogee. It was a little bit of a tight squeeze for three adults  but I would definitely recommend the place for two adult and would stay again! "),
("2017-07-05", "16221015", "Eric", "Beautiful apartment with a stunning view and a great light inside! Very sympathetic host too"),
("2017-07-13", "16221015", "啸", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-07-20", "16221015", "Liz", "Omio is a charming   welcoming host.His  clean   modern apartment has amazing views of the city and south to the airport. Totally recommend as a base for seeing Sydney and Bondi beach."),
("2017-08-21", "16221015", "Simonne", "The place was better than perfect.  - great location ( next to shops and the best transport  great lay out  all amenities  wonderful watching the sun set. Omio was a perfect host and was focused in my helping me in every situation. Had a terrific time."),
("2017-08-31", "16221015", "Nicola", "Omio is so awesome! His place is super modern with great view of all of downtown Sydney. The location at Bondi Junction was so convenient to get to so many fun things to do  and he recommended stuff to do that was more of local areas  not just the touristy stuff. I loved the flexibility in checking in  as it was easy to work with him when arriving at our 6am flight  and he even made us coffee and offered us beer! By far one of our favorite places we've ever stayed :)"),
("2018-02-18", "16221015", "Sharon", "Omio is really a lovely host that made us feel welcome from the first day on. He had so many recommendations for the neighbourhood and was also in for some activities to do together! His home is very clean  and the rooftop view is just amazing. I couldn't wish for more than this AirBnB stay  thank you so much Omio for your hospitality and kindness."),
("2018-04-05", "16221015", "Alexander", "Perfect hostPerfect aparmentPerfect locationPerfect everything"),
("2018-09-20", "16221015", "Sindy", "Excellent place for spending a great time  the host is really kind and nice. we definitely recommend this place."),
("2017-01-02", "16289600", "Jonas", "Great location! Jonathen was always nice."),
("2017-01-19", "16234640", "Jay", "Absolutely brilliant! The space is spotless and the views are priceless. The icing on the cake is the spectacular rooftop terrace with 360 degree views of the city. All this in a lovely area within easy walk to the ferry wharf. I plan to come back as often as possible."),
("2017-01-22", "16234640", "Maria Menshara", "We had fun staying in Yang's place. The place is great with lots of sunlight. Everything is brand new. Just add wifi and everything here is worth coming back!!! Thank yang for accomodating us!!!"),
("2017-02-01", "16234640", "Annie", "Perfect location. We really like the view from the apt exactly what u c in the pictures. The surrounding was nice with pathways to the ferry wharf n nearby park. We saw people running up n down the hills right in front of the apt. Parking is easy."),
("2017-02-04", "16234640", "Neil", "My wife & I would like to thank Yang for a wonderful & enjoyable 2 night stay. The communication was great and very friendly. The apartment was fantastic with great views and we loved the rooftop terrace with 360 degree views. We loved getting out on our bikes with many bike tracks in the area  and in less than 5 mins walk we were catching a rivercat to Sydney. The location is brilliant with so much to do in the area. Thanks again"),
("2017-02-11", "16234640", "Jini", "Yang's apartment has stunning views of the water  nature and neighbourhood. There is a bus stop right in front of the building  which is handy. If you walk across the bridge to Rhodes  you'll find a great Cafe called Left of Field  highly recommended. Also there is a great Korean restaurant in Rhodes shopping centre called Smokkim  also recommended. The apartment is close to The Olympic Park and ANZ stadium too. We would recommend Yang's place  this was a good find. Thanks for everything  Yang. "),
("2017-02-17", "16234640", "Seongmoo", "All I have to say is  Awesome!"),
("2017-02-22", "16234640", "Ricky", "A nice brand new apartment with everything you need inside. There is a nice cycling and walking track also by the river."),
("2017-02-25", "16234640", "Dirk", "Clean apartment with very good facilities. Modern and sleek with everything working perfectly. Yang was very communicative and we had a good stay. Be prepared to travel a while to inner city: 1 hour with ferry or 50 minutes with bus/train to Circular Quay/Opera House  but public transport is a breeze to use here. "),
("2017-03-08", "16234640", "Matthew", "Thank you to Yang for letting us stay in your apartment! The location was great for us  5-10 minute walk to ferry and train which we used everyday. The apartment is just as amazing as the photos indicate! We enjoyed the beautiful scenes of the city lighting up at night time via the roof top garden area! Yang was always available via phone when we needed to communicate and responded quickly. Thoroughly impressed with the apartment and location which we recommend to anyone looking for convince to the city but still far enough away from all the noise. "),
("2017-03-10", "16234640", "Seksun", "Perfect apartment at a very perfect location. Very close to Sydney Olympic Park Ferry  we use the ferry to travel to the Opera House and city centre which was very convenient and full of beauiful views along the river. Yang was very good host and we would love to go back to her place again."),
("2017-03-28", "16234640", "Zhenhua", "美丽海滩最特别之处"),
("2017-04-01", "16234640", "Jarrod", "Great first experience using air bnb!Nice new apartment  good location and great service!Thanks Yang"),
("2017-04-19", "16234640", "Chris", "good"),
("2017-04-24", "16234640", "Ling", "The house is very clean  day and night scenery is very beautiful"),
("2017-04-27", "16234640", "Michelle", "Very good with communication. Yang's partner was onsite to meet us and handover keys when we arrived. The unit is gorgeous  brand new and comfortable."),
("2017-05-02", "16234640", "景琳", "是一次很好的住宿体验 全新的高层公寓楼｡环境优美 也非常的干净｡爸爸妈妈来悉尼这几天住的很舒适｡"),
("2017-05-08", "16234640", "Kale", "Very affordable  lovely view  great place to stay if there's an event nearby at Olympic Park you might want to see"),
("2017-05-14", "16234640", "Eunseok", "Wonderful place. We loved the view and the interior of the unit. Many thanks  Yang!!"),
("2017-05-16", "16234640", "Julia", "This new apartment on the 18th has a fantastic view and feels more spacious than it is. Great to be able to use the lovely roof garden on the 26th floor. we enjoyed hiring bikes at the Olympic park and cycling the many riverside and nature reserve paths near by. The ferry ride from Sydnet and up to Parramatta is delightful.There is a lot of building going on in the vicinity of the apartment and Wentworth Point is clearly an up and coming area."),
("2017-05-23", "16234640", "Adam", "The place has a great view over the river and parklands. It was great for a short stay and super clean. There is dedicated underground parking and a beautiful rooftop area. It was an easy walk to the ferry wharf and rhodes shopping mall. Thank you"),
("2017-05-28", "16234640", "Zoe", "Great if you're going to Olympic park for a concert! It's easy to walk to Rhodes Stn or you can even catch a bus there. Lovely and scenic and really modern! Definitely worth the money :)"),
("2017-05-31", "16234640", "Jiahe", "really nice place with a great view"),
("2017-06-09", "16234640", "Abby", "This is a wonderful modern apartment which has all the modern conveniences that one could hope for. Great for a couple with one bedroom . There is a provision to convert the sofa into a sofa bed as well. The apartment is in a secure building and also has a parking space in the basement.But this icing on the cake is the wonderful responsiveness of the host Yang. Very accomodating and quick in responses. Highly recommended."),
("2017-06-11", "16234640", "Catherin", "Yang's place has a 360 degree bird eye view from 18th floor  the view is just awesome and location is stone throw away from ferry and rhodes shopping mall. Thank you for having us!"),
("2017-06-16", "16234640", "Christopher", "Lovely apartment and excellent communication from owner! And it had its own parking space which was a great bonus thank you"),
("2017-06-19", "16234640", "Amir", "Great location for locals  think of it as a break from the busy city. Great location for other travellers if they want to stay in an apartment with amazing views. Lovely  quiet area with plenty of friendly dogs around. Really enjoyed walks down the river and really winding down at the local café (Left of Field is the best spot across the bridge)."),
("2017-06-22", "16234640", "Tayla", "Very happy  good communication. However did smell like cigarette when we walked in. "),
("2017-07-04", "16234640", "Marney", "Absolutely beautiful apartment with stunning views....enjoyed a gorgeous sunset every evening.Nothing was lacking at all  everything you would need is here  washer/dryer  iron  cutlery  wifi...everything!A 10 minute walk to Rhodes station and 15 minutes to Rhodes shopping centre and the lovely bay to go for a nice walk.The hosts are really lovely and accommodating and they will be my first choice for my next visit.Thank you!"),
("2017-07-09", "16234640", "Phil", "Had an amazing stay at Yang's apartment. The apartment was clean when we arrived and the view was amazing at night. It's close to cafes and small restaurants  which was convenient. The apartment was cozy and very modern. Would definitely recommend it to anyone travelling solo or for couples. "),
("2017-07-14", "16234640", "Vannarath", "The place was clean and well-equipped with all basic amenities. We had a comfortable stay and would recommend it to others traveling with a small family."),
("2017-07-15", "16234640", "Angela", "Ee really enjoyed our stayed in yamgs apartment ehich eas clean tody with everything ee needed! Great views  aircons on all the rooms  great kichen bathroom and bedroom eith views. Views all around the house! So convient since we wanted to go to anz stadiun where we eere i a couple of minutes. Great host grrat communicative skills and helpful. Thanks again!"),
("2017-07-25", "16234640", "Chris", "Great location however hosts were unfriendly  late on arrival and the sheets were not changed  sex stain on the Doona! Discussing!! My wife felt sick! Also the apartment needed a good clean. This was our first experience with a air BnB and although the location was great and the apartments views were fantastic the hygiene was appalling"),
("2017-07-28", "16234640", "Callan", "Yang and her husband were excellent hosts. Great communication and were well prepared for our checkin. Apartment was very clean  sunny and only a lovely stroll over the bridge to public transportation. "),
("2017-07-30", "16234640", "Thien", "Had a great time staying at Yang place. Great communication. Prompt reply. Great location. Place was clean. Would recommend."),
("2017-08-04", "16234640", "Alex", "A lovely apartment with great views over the wetlands and the parramatta river. There is so much construction going on in the neighbourhood that its full of bustling activity. No noise at all up on the 18th floor! Would definitely stay again."),
("2017-08-07", "16234640", "Sheriff", "total loss   i hate itthe underground parking is terrible and is like a maze   i lost half an hour every time i get in or out  let alone the storing cages down there which looks like poor government housing  in third world.the apartment has west glass front which will make it boiling hot and the aircon is not central   can not cope with the heat. i would rather rent a full house same price   will never rent apartments again.nearly all the building is occupied by foreigners speaking their language   so it look like you are not in Australia at all!long time to get the keys. the only good thing is the viewI don't recommend it to anyone"),
("2017-08-14", "16234640", "Fernie", "Nice apartment everything as per described. Just a few things to note  I did experience a late check-in  waited an hour plus  for the host's Friend to pass us the keys to the apartment. Also pls remember to park in the designated lot for the unit. Roads can be quite dark at night  But other than those above  it was a very nice apartment to stay in. We enjoyed it very much."),
("2017-08-20", "16234640", "Archana", "A clean and modern new space with fantastic views set in a safe neighbourhood with privacy. Host was super responsive and helped us with all our requests."),
("2017-08-28", "16234640", "Jenn", "Beautiful view and excellent location for Sydney Olympic Park events. Kitchen has good amenities which is great as restaurants are a little few and far between unless you go to the Sydney Olympic Park precinct. Yang is a wonderful host and is very attentive. The bed is a little small if you're tall but other than that absolutely amazing! Construction noise unavoidable but once finished won't be an issue. Highly recommend."),
("2017-09-10", "16234640", "Caroline", "Nice place with great view and quite environment."),
("2017-09-24", "16234640", "Ysabel", "Yang's apartment is perfect! It is a cute little one bedroom place with lovely furnishings and a great view through the many floor length windows covering the outer walls. Neat  clean  quiet and comfortable this apartment is the perfect place for you to come home to after a busy day. I love the accessibility to Olympic Park as we were in town for a concert. Bus stop is right downstairs and there is a beautiful rooftop garden. I couldn't fault the place in any way. It was wonderful and I hope to stay again. :)"),
("2017-10-17", "16234640", "Annamarie", "The location was perfect for us. The view was awesome and Yang was generous and considerate. We would stay again!"),
("2017-10-19", "16234640", "Jessica", "Yang' s place is tidy! Great location"),
("2017-10-24", "16234640", "Chelsea", "Wonderful place  we had a great time. Very relaxing  beautiful views  nice and clean  good shower  close the the train station and a nice cafe too! Would love to come back :)"),
("2017-10-28", "16234640", "Jeh", "Exactly as described. The apartment is spacious  bright with great views and with all amenities. There is a supermarket very close to the apartment and also restaurants and cafes. Will definitely stay here again whenever I'm back in Sydney."),
("2017-10-30", "16234640", "Melinda", "Amazing Apartment!You just have to check into this amazing apartment  with fantastic hosts  a real treasure find and such a great location. Convenient to buses  trains  shops etc."),
("2017-11-03", "16234640", "Ian", "Modern  clean apartment  a very nice stay"),
("2017-11-05", "16234640", "Briony", "We experienced positives and negatives during our stay. First the positives- communication between ourselves and the host was prompt and very helpful  the check in was very easy and the host met us at the arranged time to check us in and explain the things we needed to know  the apartment is located close to shops and there is an IGA just down the road. The apartment is also close to a bus station  the ferry and train station so getting into the city was very easy. The apartment was cosy with lovely views over the parramatta river. It was also well equipped with everything we needed. As for the negatives  unfortunately there were some cleanliness issues. When we arrived we found some dirty dishes  dirty towels and face washers in the bathroom and the shower was quite dirty. We were concerned that the sheets on the bed had not been changed after the previous guest so we contacted the host who confirmed that they had not been changed so we had to strip the bed  wash all bedding and remake the bed. Thankfully the host did respond to our questions promptly and truthfully and provided info about where to find clean bedding - however when staying in an air BnB I don't think it's too much to ask that the sheets are clean. We had to wait up until about midnight for the bedding to dry before we could go to sleep. All in all  good location  good communication  nice little apartment but a few minor cleanliness issues"),
("2017-11-10", "16234640", "Anita", "This is a great spot to stay as a launch into all directions of the greater Sydney area!  All public transport options are available very close by  we took the ferry into the city  it was a really nice trip and if you don't have an Opal card  it's very quick and easy to buy one at the convenience store downstairs.The floor to ceiling windows are pretty amazing and the breeze that comes through at that height was all we needed to keep the apartment at a comfortable temperature. The sunset view is beautiful.The estate has other buildings and common areas being worked on  but it doesn't effect your stay - just great for people watching when you sit at the dining table! :)  There's a convenience store downstairs  there's an IGA about a 2 minute walk away  as well as a coffee place  medical centre  chemist  vet  nail bar and more that looks to open soon!  Then in the other direction  in the same estate  not sure how long it would take to walk (maybe about 5-10 minutes)  but there's a few restaurants there.  You could also walk over the pedestrian bridge to a large shopping centre in Rhodes  it has everything you need there!The hosts were lovely  while we didn't need to call on them during our stay  they seem like they'd do anything to try and help make your stay the best possible."),
("2017-11-12", "16234640", "Philli", "We LOVED this apartment so so tidy and clean   simplistic and stunning Thank you so much to great host also was helpful and very quick to answer phone etc"),
("2017-11-15", "16234640", "Ryan", "Great location  Great view  Awesome facilities would defiantly stay again!!"),
("2017-11-15", "16234640", "Samuel", "We had a great stay  Would definitely come back in the future"),
("2017-11-16", "16234640", "Huan Yie", "Overall a pretty good place"),
("2017-11-22", "16234640", "Jay", "It was good to stayThanks"),
("2017-11-22", "16234640", "Kevin", "Great place with a fantastic view. Was a definite good experience  highly recommended if exploring the regions of bicentennial  olympic stadiums."),
("2017-11-26", "16234640", "Alexander", "Great place.Yang and her husband are lovely and efficient hosts who provided helpful tips/maps/etc for us.The apartment itself was clean and modern  walking distance to the ferry  IGA  and some cafes  and a 10 minute drive from spotless stadium.Thanks a bunch for everything!"),
("2017-11-27", "16234640", "Amy", "Yang’s place is awesome  great location for exploring outer sydney but close enough to get to CBS easily. The apartment is beautiful  clean and had amazing views. As hosts they were outstanding  meeting us a lot later than planned after we hit traffic  showing us to the apartment and helping us get parked. Overall a great property and great hosts."),
("2017-11-30", "16234640", "Brendan", "Yang's place was a beautiful apartment with the best views! The place is furnished with everything you could need and is close to all public transport. I will certainly stay here again"),
("2017-12-21", "16234640", "Thea", "We loved the 18th floor privacy  views and security. Very clean with everything we needed. Our host did everything to make our stay easy and enjoyable. We would stay here again. "),
("2018-01-02", "16234640", "Andreas", "Near the ferry with a stunning lookout the Appartment has everything you need even a parking place"),
("2018-01-06", "16234640", "Daniel", "Endroit tranquille  très belle vu  accès au toit qui est super bien aménagé. Près du ferry pour se rendre au centre-ville. On recommande."),
("2018-01-13", "16234640", "Camille", "Modern space close to transport and shops. Excellent communication from Yang made the stay smooth and enjoyable. Would definitely book again"),
("2018-01-18", "16234640", "Alexander", "A great place  close to public transport  supermarket and olimpic park."),
("2018-01-20", "16234640", "Neelprada", "Yangs apartment is exactly as advertised . They were very accommodating with checkin and checkout times and although we were mainly out and about it was a great place to come back to - the space and furnishing were clean and modern . The apartment did tend to heat up during the day   but the aircons in the bedroom and living room helped cool things down . Would stay here again if in the neighbourhood"),
("2018-01-25", "16234640", "Jung Hyeong", "이 호스트는 지금껏 봐왔던 호스트중에 단연 최고입니다. 게스트들에 대해 굉장히 책임감있고 문제가 생길때마다 발봇고 나서줍니다. 다음에 시드니에 와도 다시 여기로 오고싶네요"),
("2018-01-27", "16234640", "Thomas", "Beautiful place."),
("2018-02-01", "16234640", "Kaidong", "房子很好 适合家庭或者情侣入住｡"),
("2018-02-03", "16234640", "Anna", "The apartment was very clean and stylish and Yang and her husband were great hosts. Highly recommend"),
("2018-02-20", "16234640", "Jennifer", "The apt had wonderful views just like the picture showed. It was clean and had a washer/dryer combo. If you are driving  traffic is crazy. I strongly suggest using the trains or ferries. If you don’t  it can be an hour drive to downtown Sydney. This place is located near the transit stations."),
("2018-03-16", "16234640", "Kerrie", "Yang & Edward provided stylish accommodation 5 mins by car to Sydney Olympic Park. Their apartment had all the amenties needed for a comfortable stay. The late check out (12pm) was wonderful after a night out at a concert and very much appreciated.Thank you for your hospitality Yang & Edward."),
("2018-03-18", "16234640", "Briony", "Great location for a concert at Olympic Park. Shops and restaurants very nearby. The view is a great bonus."),
("2018-03-30", "16234640", "Lukáš", "The place has it all  great location  excellent views  shops and restaurants within a walking distance  ferry terminal just at the end of the street and if you don't want to visit CBD you are in the middle of Sydney Olympic park with great walks  bicycle rides and all the rest. Moreover  you have free secure parking included in the price."),
("2018-04-04", "16234640", "Pamela", "Amazing view from a lovely modern space. Close to ferry stop and a free shuttle to Rhodes train station. Nice building and great host."),
("2018-04-05", "16234640", "Zheren", "I am thankful for Yang accept my request at such late time. The host was very nice and generous. The place is perfectly clean and tidy. And you get to have your own private parking space. The morning view was spectacular and the place had everything needed for multiple people. I took a walk to the wharf this morning  the location is so convenient that it was beyond my expectations. I strongly recommend this apartment to anyone want to stay in the area. Agains thank you for the help Yang."),
("2018-04-18", "16234640", "Thanh Huyen", "Yang and Edward's place looks like the photos. A great location."),
("2018-04-26", "16234640", "Mark", "A very tidy quiet apartment ideally suited for a couple. Good location to shops and cafe. Very handy location for any events in Sydney Olympic Park."),
("2018-04-28", "16234640", "Hilary", "Convenient location for concert-goers  easy transport to and from Qudos Bank arena. Lovely apartment with great views."),
("2018-05-05", "16234640", "Joel", "Really good quality apartment for the price per night"),
("2018-05-06", "16234640", "Mary-Anne", "The host canceled this reservation 111 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-05-16", "16234640", "Melinda", "The convenience of this apartment is fantastic  a short walk to the ferry  buses and trains which all lead to the City  the Stadium  Cafes and more. The hosts are wonderful and the apartment is well maintained."),
("2018-05-17", "16234640", "Louise", "If you need to get to concord hospital this is a great place to stay! Everything is walkable and it’s convenient enough to get an uber if you’d like one. The walk bridge is very close by and easy to get across to concord and Rhodes. Tidy fully equipped apartment to stay in - thank you!"),
("2018-05-19", "16234640", "Rocco", "Nice apartment and conveniently located for my requirements ... modern  clean and comfortable."),
("2018-05-20", "16234640", "Melanie", "This place is amazing. As soon as I walked into the apartment I knew I was going to love every moment of staying here. The place is decorated so nicely and thoughtfully. Very nice neighborhood with a small venue of food places and groceries 5 min walk.  The views from the apartment are lovely and the host is extremely nice and always replies to questions quickly.  Riding the ferry into town is a treat but there is also a train for quicker service.  Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-05-24", "16234640", "Yan", "Great place to stay when traveling in Sydney. Convenient  quite and room is clean.Yang responses very well."),
("2018-05-26", "16234640", "Melanie", "Second time staying and it was just as good as the first. To wake up to a view like this apartment has is unreal. The space is decorated so cute and it is really convenient to get to by ferry or train. Also  its lovely to have a market place so close (5 min walking) to the apartment. Would stay again"),
("2018-05-29", "16234640", "Allen", "Good stay thanks."),
("2018-05-30", "16234640", "Jiaqi", "Modern room with awesome views  great location with big supermarket in walking distance."),
("2018-06-09", "16234640", "Suberna", "Same as described  nice and convenient place."),
("2018-07-09", "16234640", "Ming Wai", "The house is clean enough and has enough space.  The kitchenware and dishes are dirty and need to be cleaned for a long time. The washing machines always suck with the dust  washing powder... The parking area is extremely hard to find and have to use around 10 mins to find the area in the car park. However  the view is perfect which can see the river without blocking. "),
("2018-07-13", "16234640", "Sandra", "Yangs apartment is in an excellent location  walking distance from ferry and bus stop and supermarket very close.  Very warm and sunny  comfortable with great views.  Excellent location to commute to and from Olympic Park."),
("2018-07-20", "16234640", "Mark", "This property is in a stunning location with easy access to the city (albeit by Ferry 1 hr or train 10min walk and 25 min train). Free car parking  awesome cooking facilities and an amazing IGA supermarket within 2 minute walk. The setup for families was good (room for parents  roll out for kids). Communication from Yang was great. Thank you "),
("2018-07-25", "16234640", "David", "Place was in a great location for Qudos Bank Arena concert. Good view and slept 4 comfortably A few spots close by for food and drinks 15 minute walk to the train into the city Took a while to organize getting into the property Would recommend if you’re going for a gig"),
("2018-07-27", "16234640", "Yip", "Awesome view fo the sunset... nice and warm in the winter!"),
("2018-08-04", "16234640", "Stephen", "Great location and views. Owners were very helpful when assistance was required."),
("2018-08-08", "16234640", "Brooke", "Nice apartment  amazing view from apartment and even better from roof. Public teansport is close by. Communication was great  thankyou we enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-08-12", "16234640", "Moonee", "Very nice modern Unit. Lovely location. Good communication and lovely modern kitchen appliances."),
("2018-08-14", "16234640", "Joe", "Location was good if you were attending a concert at Sydney Olympic Park/Qudos Bank Arena  as is only a $12 taxi ride away. It was a 22 degrees winters day in Sydney  however when entering the apartment it was stifling hot  even with all windows open. We closed all windows and blinds and put the air con on and it took forever to cool down the apartment as it has floor to ceiling length windows. I would hate to imagine what it would be like on a 35+ degrees day in Sydney's summer. The bed was rock hard and the pillows offered no support  so I would suggest bringing your own pillow. The total cost was $186.56 AUD for a one night stay on a Monday night  when booking more than five months in advance. $65 of this was a cleaning fee  which I find excessive as to have the bins emptied  sheets changed and a quick vacuum would not take very long. There were a couple of convenience stores nearby. We walked over the foot bridge to find somewhere for lunch but both places were closed  so other than one small cafe nearby there was nowhere within walking distance to eat out."),
("2018-08-23", "16234640", "Hans Wartono", "Yang's apartment is about 45 minutes by train and bus from central station. Bus stop is in front of the apartment. The Sydney Olympic Park Wharf and Rhodes train station are within 5 minutes by bus.It's a nice one bedroom apartment overlooking Parramatta river."),
("2018-09-10", "16234640", "Tam", "This apartment was styled beautifully with amazing views  and super close the public transport ferry terminal for trips into and back from the city. There are many local shops  as well as delicious restaurants conveniently located within close walking distance. I would definitely stay here again  thank you!"),
("2018-09-22", "16234640", "Gain", "Decoration is just like what shown in the pictures. View is great but the cleaning fee of $65 is too much given the cleanliness/condition of the flat. Parking is not straightforward. Recommend to check on the details with the host prior to arrival."),
("2018-09-22", "16234640", "Elysia", "Really enjoyed our stay here! Clean apartment and amazing views  especially at sunset. Parking was a bit confusing  but Edward was helpful in resolving that issue. Other than that  everything was great!! :)"),
("2018-10-02", "16234640", "Belinda", "Lovely view and great location for Sydney Olympic Park and the ferries."),
("2018-10-12", "16234640", "Aida", "Lovely place. Great experience. The views  the furniture  the deco  the convenience. Excellent! Would LOVE to rent again! And for those who say the parking is challenging or confusing  we disagree. It was really easy for us  just have to remember all the lefts and rights :)"),
("2018-11-23", "16234640", "Rain", "Unfortunately the entire place was infested with bedbugs  so we had to cancel our stay. Yang was quick to respond but still charged us for a full night even if we didnt end up sleeping there. Yang did not seem overly concerned about the bedbugs and suggested we use the bugspray in one of the cabinets..we did not expect this. The place was nicely decorated but a bit far from downtown Sydney and the key was inside a safe in the building (and we needed the key to get into that (Website hidden by Airbnb) was quite a challenge! I sincerely hope that the bedbug issue will be taken care of seriously because our stay would have been great had it not been for that."),
("2018-12-26", "16234640", "Manling", "great location and great view from the apartment"),
("2019-01-12", "16234640", "Enisia", "Perfect location   and great view. All the basics you need. Will definitely book here again."),
("2019-01-18", "16234640", "Barry", "We totally loved our stay at Yang’s place. The views from the appartment are stunning and the place is very comfortable and clean. We couldn’t ask for more. It’s a real plus that the appartment is close to the ferry that brings you directly to the circular quai. We higly recommend this place."),
("2019-02-03", "16234640", "Kiran", "It's a very pretty place. I would definitely recommend it."),
("2019-02-07", "16234640", "Jenny", "在Yang家住了愉快的三天 我和家人对房子都十分满意 坐船去悉尼歌剧院得方便 沿途的风景很好 超市 公交车站都很方便｡"),
("2019-02-12", "16234640", "Mario", "Great communication and responds well and quick. Room is clean and set out well. Would visit again."),
("2019-02-18", "16234640", "Taylor", "Place was very clean and presentable however there was only one roll of toilet paper  we had to go buy our own and there was no soap in the bathroom  we had to buy that too. Quick responses to our questions and very accommodating to our early arrival."),
("2019-02-23", "16234640", "Tania", "Beautiful views  great location."),
("2019-02-24", "16234640", "Celina", "The place has all the things you need  host was very thoughtful in having suitable accessories. The place was well clean and tidy!"),
("2019-02-28", "16234640", "Christine", "Excellent apartment loved the space.So close to Ferry and trains beautiful spot  would recommend"),
("2019-03-03", "16234640", "Marika", "ｼﾃｨまで時間はかかるものの､最高の部屋でした｡また利用したいです｡"),
("2017-01-29", "16261574", "David", "Jennifer's apartment was very clean and has amazing views! I think it's one of the best airbnb apartments I've stayed in."),
("2017-02-11", "16261574", "Tony", "Lovely clean apartment ideal as a base and perfect for attending functions at Olympic park. Would come again."),
("2017-02-14", "16261574", "Garry", "Great place!"),
("2017-02-25", "16261574", "Ewan", "Great apartment very close to SOPAC and other sporting facilities. Excellent communication and service. Thank you"),
("2017-03-05", "16261574", "Trent", "Perfect location for events at Sydney Olympic Park  very close. Lovely apartment with great facilities. Jennifer was very helpful and easy to communicate with. Would definitely stay here again."),
("2017-03-09", "16261574", "Terrence", "Great cafe right downstrairs. Easy and quick communication with jennifer."),
("2017-03-11", "16261574", "Jack", "Very clean and great view"),
("2017-03-18", "16261574", "Dina", "Perfect apartment to stay at for any events in Sydney Olympic Park. Jennifer's place had no faults and great value for money! City view was also better than expected....would happily stay here again."),
("2017-03-21", "16261574", "Mai", "Olympic park apt has a nice view and has a quiet surrounding with some eateries just below the apt. Would recommend to people who prefers to stay away from the busy city.  Overall experience is good."),
("2017-03-30", "16261574", "Lisa", "Great location for my daughters competing at Athletics Championships  close to public transport  cafes and restaurants. Accomodation was very clean and spacious for myself and 2 Kids. Just what we needed and great communication with Jennifer.Would definitely stay again "),
("2017-04-06", "16261574", "Susan", "Excellent accommodation. Good location. Ease of  access to centre of Sydney via train. Very clean comfortable apartment. Fantastic views of cityscape. Parking in basement."),
("2017-04-08", "16261574", "Jodie", "Stayed at the apartment while spending time at the Sydney Royal. Was a fantastic location- easy walk from the Showground. And had everything we needed after big days out. Would definitely stay again."),
("2017-04-12", "16261574", "Ramon", "Great easy stay"),
("2017-04-13", "16261574", "Damian", "Great place to stay! Amazing view. Clean  tidy and well equipped. Very comfortable bed which always makes a great difference.Jennifer was lovely to deal with. I won't be looking any further for my next stay in Sydney."),
("2017-04-19", "16261574", "Penelope", "Stayed here over the Easter weekend for the Easter Show.  The apartment is in a great spot  comfortable  clean  magnificent views of Sydney and very good value.  Plenty of cafes  restaurants etc around and Jennifer was a great host."),
("2017-04-22", "16261574", "Mengmingxin", "Jennifer is a really helpful owner  the place she provides is more than fantastic. The apartment is clean  tidy and very convenient. My wife and I had stayed for 3 days and she really enjoyed it. Highly recommend for couples who wish to spend a sweet holiday in sydney."),
("2017-05-06", "16261574", "Ricardo", "Great apartment with amazing views. Much better value than staying at a hotel. Highly recommended."),
("2017-05-06", "16261574", "Ross", "Great place in a great location for our activities on the weekend. Very clean and well appointed."),
("2017-05-15", "16261574", "Brittany", "She is amazing and the house is magnificent with excellent views! Great location and friendly neighbors"),
("2017-05-20", "16261574", "Kris", "Jennifer's unit is close to public transport  restaurants  and the Sydney Olympic Showgrounds. It's nicely proportioned  thoughtfully organised and the views are amazing  daytime and particularly the nightscape - evening drinks on the patio were memorable. "),
("2017-05-24", "16261574", "Mick", "Perfect apartment and location for an event at Sydney Olympic Park. Easy access to public transport with the Sydney attractions only a short train journey ride. Restaurants and cafes close by. Wished we stayed a bit longer now."),
("2017-05-27", "16261574", "Michelle", "Honestly  THE VIEW IS AMAZING!! A home away from home. Everything you need is nearby! Very clean ^__^"),
("2017-05-30", "16261574", "Jack", "Great place for travel. Nice View."),
("2017-06-08", "16261574", "Janisa", "很舒服很干净 环境很好 住得很开心"),
("2017-06-19", "16261574", "Melissa", "Great location  clean and well appointed appartment. Good communication with host. Highly recommend."),
("2017-06-21", "16261574", "Matthew", "Beautiful place  nice size room and very easy communication. Thanks Jennifer!"),
("2017-06-21", "16261574", "Kalesti", "It's was lovely to stay in this apartment because I could walk to Anz stadium. Everything was amazing. Great view. Thanks for letting us stay I would love to stay again."),
("2017-06-24", "16261574", "Daniel", "A great apartment - clean  modern  central and with a gre"),
("2017-06-29", "16261574", "Emma", "We loved our stay."),
("2017-07-07", "16261574", "Laura May", "Jennifer was so helpful and the apartment was perfect to stay in!"),
("2017-07-15", "16261574", "Sarah", "Fabulous!"),
("2017-07-23", "16261574", "Doug", "Great location."),
("2017-07-28", "16261574", "Mark", "Very good value for location  nice apartment with a great view!"),
("2017-08-12", "16261574", "Daniel", "Great apartment. Great view! Awesome host"),
("2017-08-13", "16261574", "Alva", "Amazing view  and very great location!"),
("2017-08-19", "16261574", "Lachy", "Can't go wrong here"),
("2017-08-20", "16261574", "Lachlan", "Really nice  clean and comfortable. "),
("2017-08-24", "16261574", "Sina", "Lovely place would definitely stay there in the future"),
("2017-08-28", "16261574", "Katrina", "The apartment was a great place to stay. Very spacious for three people. It was the perfect location as we attended an event in the Sydney Showgrounds. The apartment was also close to transport  cafes and restaurant. Overall  we would stay again. Thank you Jennifer!"),
("2017-09-01", "16261574", "Nestor", "Great place. Great host. Place was clean and spot on with its description. Great communication with Jennifer. It was my first time to use AirBnb  got lots of questions and Jennifer was always there to assist. A+++++++!!!!"),
("2017-09-07", "16261574", "Bijesh", "Nice home. Good location. Great city view."),
("2017-09-08", "16261574", "Alex", "Very nice brand new apartment with a stunning view. Comfortable bed and nice furniture. Very clean and tidy. Host is hard to contact and communicate.High wind area  the wind noise is strong even inside the apartment."),
("2017-09-23", "16261574", "Tayla", "Very nice place. Lovely location and view  very spacious."),
("2017-10-01", "16261574", "Gyu", "Great place and location! Communication with Jennifer was really easy with quick responses. My family and I love the place. Definitely a place I will come back to in the future. Thank you Jennifer!"),
("2017-10-18", "16261574", "Paul", "Beautiful apartment  excellent communication by Jen.Definitely would recommend and stay again"),
("2017-10-20", "16261574", "Steff", "Great place to stay. Very clean. Would stay again."),
("2017-11-12", "16261574", "Alison", "The apartment was modern and in a very convenient location. The view was fantastic!"),
("2017-11-15", "16261574", "Josh", "Great apartment for business or pleasure. Great location and view."),
("2017-11-22", "16261574", "Frankie", "Good communication and prompt response from the host even though that was a late night check in.The place is nice and clean."),
("2017-11-26", "16261574", "Sam", "Enjoyed our stay.Very nice apartment in a convenient location to the facilities of Sydney Olympic Park.Jennifer was very responsive and attentive!"),
("2017-12-01", "16261574", "Katrina", "Suspect that in lieu of a little effort  Jennifer relies on a system of guests contacting her to ask for things.This included me having to message Jennifer on the travel date to find out access information and needing to wander through countless  randomly numbered mailboxes to find a key.  Although advertised in the listing  we were not supplied with face and hand towels and instead had to make do with the two hard and scratchy bath towels that were visibly worn. The lack of a bathroom floor mat meant a puddle left by the leaking shower was tricky to navigate.None of these inconveniences compared however to the very unwelcome message received late at night from Jennifer asking what time I would be leaving the next day. The was rudely followed up by another message containing a single question mark  the following morning. Both regardless of the fact that the Check-Out time had been stipulated as 10am.All in all an underwhelming experience which was careless and purely transactional in nature."),
("2017-12-09", "16261574", "Luke", "Great location  good WiFi.Maybe difficult accessing apartment if arriving at a very late time  but Jennifer is extremely accommodating in arranging key transfer."),
("2017-12-12", "16261574", "Carlene", "Jennifer s apartment is great  very clean and comfortable   with a good location close to amenities at Olympic Park . We stayed there after a concert   perfect position"),
("2017-12-21", "16261574", "Dean", "We have stayed here a number of times and always good.  Great communication from Jennifer and when we had a small problem  she managed to get it fixed as quickly as possible."),
("2018-01-07", "16261574", "Edwin", "Great location  on site parking  easy check-in/out instructions  clean apartment  quick response."),
("2018-01-15", "16261574", "Edwin", "Nice clean apartment with wifi and big TV!"),
("2018-01-27", "16261574", "Joanna", "Fantastic location and view! Jennifer is a great host and very quick to respond to any queries. Nice unit."),
("2018-02-03", "16261574", "Taya", "Lovely building and spectacular view Vietnamese down stairs is delicious and cheap  there is also a mini mart and coffee shops in the below street which is really convenient Was disappointed to find the couch had a large tear running straight down the centre exposing the sponge of the cushion and there was child’s drawing/permanent marker all over the tv cabinet"),
("2018-02-09", "16261574", "Leong", "Apartment lived up to expectations. Amenities were provided and facilities (washer & dryer) were well maintained. Apartment was in a very good location (within minutes walk from Sydney Olympic Park)."),
("2018-02-12", "16261574", "Adeel", "Wonderful host and fantastic accomodation."),
("2018-02-24", "16261574", "Victoria", "Clean  modern and stylish apartments. Great views neat and tidy  perfect for the stay.Would defiantly stay here again and the host was wonderful and responded to my queries. Easy to get in and out of and much nicer than a hotel or serviced apartment.  Had everything that was needed including coffee for the morning Thank you for a wonderful place to stay in"),
("2018-02-28", "16261574", "Simone", "We had a nice stay in Jennifers appartment. The location is great  parking convenient and fabulous view! Walking distance to Qudos Arena and restaurants around the corner. Cleaning could have been better."),
("2018-03-01", "16261574", "Leanne", "Had a great stay at Jennifer’s apartment whilst attending concert at Qudos Arena. Fantastic secure location with amazing views. Included parking was a great bonus. Good communication with host and comfortable bed. Would definitely stay again if going to the Stadium or Arena."),
("2018-03-09", "16261574", "Jazzmine", "Loved this place! Although a little far from the main city area the view was absolutely amazing! The place is extremely quiet  and it has everything you need for a short stay. There is a convenient store downstairs that stays open pretty late  and there is everything in the (Website hidden by Airbnb) include laundry detergent. Jennifer made the check in process super easy  and explained the directions in detail  so I knew where to go! Whenever I had a question she also replied extremely fast!!"),
("2018-03-10", "16261574", "Crystal", "Place was well located for what we needed. Biggest selling point was the amazing view of Sydney.There is no traditional house manual but information (like wifi password) is provided. I found the information provided before the stay to be lacking however while we were there Jennifer was very attentive to our communication.Parking after some instructions was good.Tip 1 and 7 are kinda together. Make sure it's building 1!"),
("2018-03-15", "16261574", "Lou", "We had a lovely stay at Jennifer’s place. Her apartment is clean  modern  and perfectly located for concerts in Olympic Park. Loved having access to a parking spot! Nice cafe/restaurants downstairs. Check in was smooth and easy!"),
("2018-03-21", "16261574", "Claire", "Great location for Olympic Park events  will stay again!"),
("2018-03-30", "16261574", "Adriano", "The apartment location and amenities are great  the host is quick to reply and help  the car park  main entry doors and lifts can be abit confusing but once your in  you will be in the best spot and apartment for all the attractions nearby."),
("2018-04-01", "16261574", "Amit", "Amazing place and amazing host!!"),
("2018-04-19", "16261574", "Paul", "One of the best apartments within the 3 apartment buildings around Olympic Park. Ticks all the boxes."),
("2018-05-06", "16261574", "Sarah", "Great location for Sydney Olympic Park"),
("2018-05-19", "16261574", "Celeste", "Great location  great little apartment and amazing view"),
("2018-06-03", "16261574", "Simon", "Wonderful apartment with everything you need and in close proximity to all the Olympic park precinct.Jennifer presents a great apartment and is very quick with responses and questions."),
("2018-06-10", "16261574", "Laura", "The location is great for Olympic Park events. Beautiful view! No bin which was random. The host also bombarded me with messages leading up to the night telling me “no party” which I wasn’t having and I didn’t have. Which made me feel unwelcomed. I also couldn’t get into the building (as I didnt have a pass because it’s inside) and had to wait for someone to exit before I got in.The home is beautiful and I enjoyed my stay."),
("2018-06-17", "16261574", "Shari", "Jennifers place is fantastic  I highly recommend booking it."),
("2018-06-24", "16261574", "Michele", "Great Location  great views and excellent communication from Jennifer. Close to public transport  DFO and markets and ideal if you are attending an event held in the Olympic Park precinct."),
("2018-07-13", "16261574", "Sarah", "A great apartment  walking distance to qudos arena and local restaurants. We had a great stay."),
("2018-07-25", "16261574", "Thomas", "Had trouble with the drainage in the shower  but told Jennifer who was quite responsive & cooperative  hopefully it will be fixed by the next occupants stay.Bed wasn’t too comfortable but the room was nice."),
("2018-07-29", "16261574", "Ryan", "Everything as described  but nothing more. Paid a fair bit for this  so was a tad disappointed to see no effort is made beyond the bare minimum - no info/handbook or anything. I did appreciate the easy check-in and not having to meet  makes things alot quicker and easier."),
("2018-08-07", "16261574", "Darren", "Communication was poor. On the day of checkin Jennifer had not been in communication we me so I had to ring Airbnb head office.  Within 30 mins Jennifer responded ?"),
("2018-08-07", "16261574", "Victoria", "Very cozy apartment in a good location"),
("2018-08-10", "16261574", "Emma", "Amazing views!! Very clean and had everything we need"),
("2018-08-13", "16261574", "Craig", "A great appartment with amazing views. Lots of restaurants within walking distance. I recommend this appartment if you are attending any functions in Olympic Park."),
("2018-08-16", "16261574", "Mark", "Second time staying - the cleanliness and clear communication is a blessing for a business traveler and love that view! 5 stars from me"),
("2018-08-19", "16261574", "Kylie", "Lovely place  great location"),
("2018-08-24", "16261574", "Gillian", "Fantastic location with a great view of the city. Easy check-in with a very responsive host. A spacious apartment with a large bedroom and comfortable bed. We would be happy to stay here again."),
("2018-08-25", "16261574", "Grant", "I would firstly recommend all future guest to contact Jennifer 24hrs prior to discuss your arrival time and access. We contacted host 2hrs prior without response (all available forms) until we contacted Airbnb (1hr) to support. This left is suspecting we may need an alternate location  which I’m sure was never the case (got hold 20 minutes before checkin). It would have been the hosts normal style (my perception). The access to the apartment using the instructions we were provided which were on a weekend  meant we needed to follow someone else in to gain access to the security building (hint you can walk through the Vietnamese restaurant if it is open). Also the instruction to get the key were insufficient as there was no information about where the letterboxes are (hint they are located in the middle of the entire building hint which is outside the gym) also to find the key once you locate the letterboxes (hint the key was attached to sticky tape inside the locked letterbox). This treasure hunt is fun if you enjoy puzzles. However If it is raining and you’re in a rush  this is not desirable. The place is in a great location and proximity to events and the views are certainly amazing. The pictures of the spaces are not current and some wear and tear (expected from time to time) is evident (texta marks on tv cabinet which sadly I suspect are from previous guests with kids). The couch has been torn (again sadly for host  probably from a prior guest). The shower required more effort cleaning (visible module in grout) and the drainage is poor as it filled the shower area which overflows into the main bathroom area. For any future guests who choose to stay here for any length of stay  I would recommend that you bring your own things like dishwasher tablets etc. I am confident if these few things are reviewed by the host  this place would receive more favourable reviews and increase its utilisation / price. "),
("2018-08-27", "16261574", "Bel", "Thanks for a great stay  unit was perfect for our concert at Qudos Arena with plenty of restaurants close by and easy walk to arena. "),
("2018-09-17", "16261574", "Sara", "Great location  5 minute walk to the train station. 7 minute walk to ANZ and Qufos stadiums. Beautiful views of the city and harbour bridge. Very secure apartment building."),
("2018-09-18", "16261574", "Kristy", "The view is Amazing. Jennifer was an easy to deal with host. Check in and out was very simple."),
("2018-09-19", "16261574", "Terry", "Great location and walking distance the venues at Sydney Olympic Park. Good views from the unit looking east to the city."),
("2018-09-30", "16261574", "Peter", "good comms  great location near Olympic park  comfy sofa  bonus washer- dryer. great views and sunny."),
("2018-10-13", "16261574", "Rodney", "The property in hombush needs some considerable work done. An review as previously mentioned by other visitors including repairing if the lounge  removal of stains and unblocking of the shower drain need to occur. Also access on the weekend was difficult with nil entry to the main reception to “find” the key as there was no door man present.  Thinking these are isolated events might entice others to believe this should be fixed however we have experienced the same issues as another guest from 2 months ago. Communication was limited and only began after direct contact with air b&b. On a slighty better note the city view was beautiful which I got to enjoy all night as a fault battery in the cupboard alarmed every 30min."),
("2018-11-03", "16261574", "Naomi", "Beautiful apartment in a great location. Very close to ANZ stadium."),
("2018-11-03", "16261574", "Craig", "Very impressive apartment  great location and don’t hesitate to book this one if you in the Homebush area or anywhere for that matter! Great views"),
("2018-11-11", "16261574", "Kristy", "Highly recommended! We had a very good experience here & you can’t go past the location!"),
("2018-11-17", "16261574", "Luke", "Lovely apartment to stay in   great facilities   awesome views of the city and surroundings .Only downfall was having the train run past quiet often and is quiet noisy when trying to sleep at night ."),
("2018-11-17", "16261574", "Emily", "Expect the host not to make contact until you have tried multiple times to contact her and then you’ll need to contact Airbnb to say the host is unresponsive. They will then contact her and give her 30mins to an hour to respond before they can offer you a refund or help you get re-accommodated. (Airbnb are fantastic and very empathetic when this happens) The host will contact you close to the cut of time for your refund. The instructions provided by the host were vague  The only reason they were clear to me is because i had stayed with other hosts in the same building. Suggest taking your own towels as the towels provided have a foul smell that lingers."),
("2018-11-24", "16261574", "Damien", "Jennifer has a nice apartment close to the action of Olympic Park. It is in need of a refurbishment with a ripped lounge and damaged furniture. Jennifer is quick to reply close to your check-in but before this you will not get a reply."),
("2018-12-07", "16261574", "Stephanie", "Great apartment. Very clean and spacious for my partner and I. Location was excellent  close to the arena and train station. Check in process was easy. Would recommend !"),
("2018-12-09", "16261574", "Denise", "Great place to stay with a comfortable bed. Air conditioning works well on hot days. Great views of Sydney cbd and the Harbour Bridge."),
("2018-12-14", "16261574", "Crystal", "Fantastic place  great location  beautiful room  excellent host!"),
("2019-01-07", "16261574", "Adam", "Good apartment with a great view. Would recommend"),
("2019-01-22", "16261574", "Jackie", "The view from the apartment is spectacular and it is really well located. Convenient bus from Strathfield station stops at the door.  Only negative was I had asthma while (Website hidden by Airbnb) idea why and I havent had it for years.  Maybe dust or an air-freshener. Thanks Jennifer everything else was perfect"),
("2019-02-02", "16261574", "Michael", "My wife had a nice stay here.....great views. Host was a little hard to contact re checkin but otherwise all good"),
("2019-02-03", "16261574", "Thelma", "A beautiful spacious 1 bedroom apartment with amazing views  close to many amenities."),
("2019-02-16", "16261574", "Ben", "Apartment has an amazing view and was a good place to stay in overnight after an event at spotless Stadium."),
("2019-02-20", "16261574", "Ashleigh", "We stayed here for an event at the Qudos Bank arena. short walk to the venue  fantastic location. Apartment has great view towards Sydney."),
("2019-02-21", "16261574", "Sharyn", "Fantastic views and location was amazing. I really enjoyed the stay. we went to a concert at Qudos Bank Arena (very easy walking distance) and value for money for location was exceptional."),
("2017-01-26", "16408272", "Nicole", "The host was very friendly and the location was prime"),
("2017-01-27", "16408272", "Daniel", "Great location and great host"),
("2017-01-29", "16408272", "Jayme", "Very convenient to city south  the rocks  Wynyard and circular quay. 2 supermarkets within 2 minutes walk. Plenty of food options. "),
("2017-02-05", "16408272", "Laura", "Apartment in fantastic location  only 7 mins walk to opera house. Chloe was a wonderful host; very accommodating. We greatly appreciated the help she gave us to & from the station. A very thoughtful host. "),
("2017-02-09", "16408272", "Thomas", "Very good location  and Chloe was very flexible and responsive!"),
("2017-02-14", "16408272", "WEn", "Chloe is such a wonderful and accommodating host. Her place was clean and as described  the location was super convenient to everywhere! She was also super helpful with recommending activities and things to do around Sydney. Her apartment was within short walking distance of all major tourist attractions. Highly recommended host  we will stay here again. "),
("2017-02-18", "16408272", "Su", "Central location  lots of great restaurants nearby and so easy to get around"),
("2017-02-26", "16408272", "Aaron", "The place was as expected  would gladly stay here again. Location is perfect  of note it is in a very expensive part of the city  but its Sydney so that is to be expected. Roof top pool is awesome. "),
("2017-03-08", "16408272", "Ranka", "My second  great experience with airbnb - thank you Chloe for being such a great host and for the fabulously located apartment."),
("2017-03-11", "16408272", "Angie", "Chloe was a great host and the location is fabulous. We loved our weekend in the city - close to public transport and easy walking distance to circular quay. We were 3 adults and it was just enough room for us."),
("2017-03-15", "16408272", "Sophia", "The location of this apartment is prime! Easy walking distance to all the inner city attractions and as this apartment shares the building with a hotel  you feel safe coming and going as you please. There are currently major roadworks going on on George street (the street the apartment overlooks) which is really loud at night time as they work throughout the night. If you're sensitive to sound while sleeping  ask the host if they're still working or bring a good set of ear plugs ;) "),
("2017-03-18", "16408272", "Sarah", "Great location. There was a strong smell of damp throughout the apartment though and the bathroom was quite compact. Overall quite basic accommodation and we felt it was overpriced despite the good location"),
("2017-03-23", "16408272", "Ferez", "Fantastic host  great communication and very attentive. Perfect central location! Clean and practical apartment."),
("2017-03-26", "16408272", "Jason", "Just spent the weekend   Chloe very helpful   enjoyed our stay  close to everything   my family had a great time "),
("2017-04-03", "16408272", "Craig", "Great location! Easy access to Opera House etc etc."),
("2017-04-04", "16408272", "Marcus", "Right in the heart of Sydney CBD - great location.Great communication with Chloe  she made the whole process very easy.The apartment also has a portacot - which would be useful if travelling with the little ones.Overall a very good stay."),
("2017-04-08", "16408272", "Jann", "Chloe was a great host  answered all of my questions promptly and very generously allowed us an early check-in and late check-out (mainly for bag storage).  The apartment was very quiet  rarely heard any traffic or other people.  As per pics it was nicely decorated.  There is a small but nice rooftop pool which got a little busy with children (ours included) in the afternoon.  There was also a rooftop BBQ together with stunning views would be a nice way to spend the evening if desired. It was extremely convenient to all modes of transport and many Sydney sights. All in all  I would highly recommend this apartment and Chloe as a host and we look forward to returning to Chloe's apartment next year."),
("2017-04-14", "16408272", "Sindhur", "Pros: Chloe was very responsive and accommodating to early and late check-in requirements.Great lively location close to every thing - no need to rent a car. Walking distance to everything.Cons: Check for construction schedules. The property was inaccessible for us when we arrived as the streets were closed for construction and our cab driver dropped us off several yards from the property with many pieces of our luggage. The Dryer was broken and we decided not to use the terrace pool as we did not have a dryer to dry clothes.Got only ONE access card to the room and we were two families and had to depend on one another to enter the room."),
("2017-04-22", "16408272", "Wendi", "Great - I would go back"),
("2017-04-29", "16408272", "Kaye", "Great central  location for a Sydney holiday."),
("2017-05-01", "16408272", "俊", "Thank you for Chloe letting us living your so nice beautiful house!非常感谢房东 非常好的地段距离火车站仅2分钟步行 距离超市也很近"),
("2017-05-07", "16408272", "Jane", "Perfect location!  Spotlessly clean apartment.  Would definitely recommend!"),
("2017-06-01", "16408272", "Julian", "Great place with a great location  close to Sydney Harbour  would definitely stay again. The hosts were really nice."),
("2017-06-07", "16408272", "Shieleen & Sean", "Great location. It is a 5-10 minute walk to the Harbour. It worked perfectly for our family. The only thing we didn't like was the noise at night from Vivid but that was uncontrollable. Otherwise  great host and great place to stay!"),
("2017-06-12", "16408272", "Paul", "Chloe was a great host. Very easy to get in touch with and was really understanding and accommodating when our travel plans went slightly awry. Apartment is perfectly positioned to explore Sydney ."),
("2017-06-22", "16408272", "Michael", "Great  central location with clean  comfortable beds. Easy to walk to Circular Quay or Pitt Street Mall. Also  easy access to lots of little restaurants and shopping right across the street.Just be aware there is currently heavy construction on George St which woke us up at 2a on a few nights as they were moving stuff around. "),
("2017-06-24", "16408272", "Pey", "Chloe was very responsive to us prior to our stay. Chloe and her husband were great hosts and very pleasant to deal with and understanding. We were three adults and two toddlers and she had a baby cot and baby bath ready for us. The kitchen was also well-equipped. The apartment is neat and clean and very centrally located  some few hundred metres from the train station.We were very comfortable at the apartment.Note: One keycard to get into apartment so we had to coordinate a few times when doing different activities during the day/night  but it didn't really matter to us."),
("2017-07-11", "16408272", "Karen", "Chloe is very easy to work with and her place is in the perfect location for Sydney"),
("2017-07-15", "16408272", "Natalie", "Great location right in the centre of Sydney. Chloe was easy to work with  communicated well and was very flexible when we arrived earlier than expected. Thanks Chloe! "),
("2017-07-23", "16408272", "Sheila", "It's super convenient! Wynyard Station is just ard the corner! Heaps of nice restaurants and walking distance to most tourist spots  Darling Harbour  The Rocks  Chinatown! Feels at home always  after a long day tour!"),
("2017-07-28", "16408272", "Steve", "Great location  comfortable bed. Great place. But  bring earplugs because the roadworks on George St go into the night. "),
("2017-08-06", "16408272", "Linda", "Nice place  plenty of space and comfortable. Great communication."),
("2017-08-08", "16408272", "Tyson", "Lovely apartment! We look forward to staying again."),
("2017-08-13", "16408272", "Jeff", "The apartment is in a fantastic location  very close to public transportation and a grocery store. Plenty of space for our family of 4. Added bonus to have in-apt laundry and we all enjoyed the heated rooftop pool and hot tub. Kitchen was a little light on some supplies (oven mitts/potholder or dish towels)  but that was only a minor inconvenience. Chloe was a very responsive host  we would definitely recommend this apartment to others."),
("2017-08-15", "16408272", "Anna", "The place is in the best location  close to everything. Very clean and spacious"),
("2017-08-23", "16408272", "Shuhao", "Location is great. And Chloe is a friendly and helpful host. Five star!"),
("2017-09-02", "16408272", "Oscar", "Great place  central location and very welcome setting. Chloe is a great host and easy to get in touch with. Our check in and stay was very smooth  thank you very much! "),
("2017-09-10", "16408272", "Steven", "Apartment was as expected. Only issue was getting the keys with the host being 45 minutes late."),
("2017-09-13", "16408272", "Julian", "This is the second time I have stayed here  it's a short walk to the Rocks. Clean and quiet with a great view. Would stay there again."),
("2017-10-02", "16408272", "Matthew", "Chloe was really helpful with check in and check out on a busy public holiday weekend. The apartment really worked for us. 2 couples with 2 toddlers under 2. There is enough room in both bedrooms for a travel cot and all your luggage. Really central location. It is right at Wynyard station and is a 5 minute walk to Circular Quay  7 minutes to Barangaroo  10 minutes to Pitt St mall and a 20-25 minute walk to darling harbour. Plenty of parking around (Sydney CBD prices)."),
("2017-10-07", "16408272", "Sunjoo", "The apartment has a great location easy to access to Circular Quay Rock Trains and Darling harbor  even the supermarket is very close just 5 min by walk.The apartment was so good and well furnished living room beds were so comfortable the kitchen was a bit smaller but you can find whatever you need.If you are looking for a good base to explore Sydney this is a good one:))  Chloe is kind too."),
("2017-10-14", "16408272", "Danyle", "The location of this apartment cannot be beat - if you are looking for a central place to base out of for touring Sydney's beautiful attractions  I highly recommend this location. The responsiveness of the hostess  Chloe  was terrific! All and all  a very pleasant experience."),
("2017-10-14", "16408272", "Indira", "Central location  clean  comfy and easy to access! Chloe was very easy to reach and very accomodating with everything!"),
("2017-10-18", "16408272", "Anisha", "Great location  very convenient and everything you would need can be found in this apartment. For the location  the price is of amazing value. Walkable distance to the local attractions. Chloe is friendly and easy to communicate with  will definitely recommend her apartment for others seeking a central city abode that doesn't break the bank.  "),
("2017-10-25", "16408272", "Theresa", "The only down side to the place was that there was road work being done on the street at such an early time. Other than that  everything else was perfect. I'd recommend the place and stay there again."),
("2017-10-27", "16408272", "Margo", "Fantastic value and so central. Chole is a great host and very accommodating and great communicator. Will definitely stay again."),
("2017-10-29", "16408272", "Sophie", "Great apartment  great location and good value for money :)"),
("2017-11-08", "16408272", "Roland", "Great location and the owner is very easy to deal with. Will stay again."),
("2017-11-23", "16408272", "Mei Tim", "Chloe has been a fantastic host and quick to respond to our needs. The apartment is just next to a train station  CBD shopping areas & tourist attraction  and not to mention a convenient store which makes it a very ideal apartment for a small family to stay. Will definitely love to stay at the apartment again in our next trip to Sydney."),
("2017-12-03", "16408272", "Michelle", "Great location  lovely apartment  we enjoyed our stay  would recommend Chloe's place."),
("2017-12-12", "16408272", "Mark", "Great location. Comfortable beds. Quiet for middle of the city. Chloe was very easy to contact and was prompt I. Responding to our requests."),
("2017-12-16", "16408272", "Sasanka", "A great place! Amazing location for city sightseeing letting you walk everywhere. Chloe was excellent in helping us out and very communicative!"),
("2018-01-20", "16408272", "Paul", "Great location for a City visit. Good size and very clean."),
("2018-02-04", "16408272", "Luci And Ruben", "Chloe's apartment was very convenient for us as it is in a great location. You can easily walk to Circular Quay  The Rocks  Darling Harbour etc if that's what you are in Sydney for. The beds were very comfortable. Chloe was a very good host  very flexible and accomodating. Would highly recommend staying here."),
("2018-02-10", "16408272", "Adam", "Very good location - easy to access everything & good host - easy to communicate with Chloe."),
("2018-02-12", "16408272", "Bing", "The location is a few steps to the major attractions of Sydney  very convenient for everything. Chloe is a kind host and offered us the most necessary help. If parking your car down the apartment building even for short time remember someone must stay in the car to tell the inspector that you are leaving soon."),
("2018-02-15", "16408272", "Tyler", "Chloe was a ray of sunshine and went out of her way to meet us early."),
("2018-02-20", "16408272", "Debra", "Great location! Nice place. Would recommend"),
("2018-02-28", "16408272", "Simon", "the apartment was such as chloe showed in her photographs  everything was  clean and right.the best was the location"),
("2018-03-08", "16408272", "Abi", "The perfect place to stay for a trip to Sydney! It’s so Central  only 5 minutes to Circular Quay and just across the road from a supermarket which was very convenient! The apartment itself was clean and tidy and had all the facilities we needed for a few days stay in Sydney  would 100% stay here again!"),
("2018-03-13", "16408272", "Brian", "Chloe's place was the perfect location  as we love to walk to everything downtown.  The 2 bedrooms were great for 2 couples  and the washer/dryer saved us.  Chloe's communications pre  and during stay were fast  and helpful  including meeting us with the key.  And value was Excellent 5 of 5 stars!!"),
("2018-03-16", "16408272", "Mark", "Great unit in a perfect location . I can certainly recommend. There was works going on in George Street which was a bit noisy."),
("2018-03-18", "16408272", "Barbara", "Great location and value for money. Chloe was pleasant to deal with and was happy to accommodate us dropping our bags off early. Will definitely stay here again on our next trip to Sydney."),
("2018-03-25", "16408272", "Pasi", "Spacious. Great location with the city  piers  services and sights all in walking distance."),
("2018-03-31", "16408272", "Henrik", "Lägenheten är definitivt inte för 5 personer då det inte finns utrymme för mera än 4 personer.Vi fick inte information om det inte fanns 5 sängar.Nödlösningen med en luftmadrass var inte acceptabelt.Lägenhetens läge var utmärkt Heltäckningsmatta i lägenheten är inte bra då den kräver en extremt god städning vilket kan ifrågasättas eftersom det låg så mycket med damm på kylskåpet i köket och köket är helt integrerat med vardagsrummet. De 2 sovrummen var helt ok men det var nästan omöjligt att få utrymme i vardagsrummet med den uppblåsbara luftmadrassen  som inte kan sägas vara en säng utan en NÖDLÖSNING. Lägenheten skall inte hyras ut till 5 personer  för 4 personer är den OK"),
("2018-04-06", "16408272", "Andrew", "Chloe was super helpful when we arrived  even helping us with our many bags up to the apartment. The apartment is well stocked with pretty much everything you'd need  we only cooked once or twice but everything you could need was there. The apartment is in a great location for seeing the sights. 3 adults and a baby were comfortable  albeit slightly squished  especially in the bathroom which is a tight space  we only just had room for the baby bath and adult to shower at the same time  but we managed ok for 5 days  but that would be our only comment  everything else was great.We'd certainly recommend staying at Chloe's place!"),
("2018-04-08", "16408272", "Albert", "Very conveniently located. Chloe was very helpful and the apartment is great."),
("2018-05-04", "16408272", "Marcin", "The apartment is very conveniently located  very close to the opera  the transport hub at at Circular Key  shopping streets  dining area in the Darling Harbour. The place is cosy and clean  equipped with everything we needed."),
("2018-05-28", "16408272", "Arlyn", "The place is very cozy and in great location. Chloe is super friendly and helpful. A recommended place to stay with family. ❤️"),
("2018-06-03", "16408272", "Mariah", "Awesome space  awesome location! Definitely would recommend!"),
("2018-06-09", "16408272", "Bret", "Great location however a lot of roadwork around the property.  Very convenient."),
("2018-06-17", "16408272", "Aurélie", "Séjour très agréable. L’appart est comme sur les photos. Piscine super sur le toit. Très bien placé et très agréable pour une famille de 4."),
("2018-07-02", "16408272", "Michael", "Great location in an upscale building.  Walking distance to EVERYTHING!  Communication was flawless.  Check in/ check out a breeze.  Chloe is a great host!"),
("2018-07-11", "16408272", "Siobhan", "On booking Chloe's apartment  I contacted her several times about check-in due to flights changing. She always got back to me within the hour and was very helpful with directions to her place (even sending pictures of the front door etc.) We had to get a very late check -in and she was very accommodating with this. When we arrived at Chloe's apartment it was exactly as it is on the pictures and was stocked with plenty of amenities (tea  coffee  breakfast goods  toiletries and tourist information). She had also very kindly left three Opal cards for us to access public transport easily  which we made use of.Her apartment could not be more central as within minutes we were in the shopping area or The Rocks near the harbour. As this was our first time in Sydney  this made it very easy to navigate and see all the attractions we had intended to.She had high speed Wi-Fi in the apartment and the rooftop pool and spa definitely relaxed us in the evenings. We also made use of the hotel restaurant which had very friendly staff and good food. On leaving our holiday the front desk organised a taxi for us and Chloe made the check-out very simple for us.Overall  we thoroughly enjoyed our trip and would recommend using Chloe’s apartment to anyone looking to visit Sydney’s attractions."),
("2018-07-15", "16408272", "Jai", "All the communication between Chloe was straightforward and easy. There was a thoughtful welcome gift left and Chloe allowed us to extend our check out by one hour which was greatly appreciated. We’d recommend at any time"),
("2018-07-18", "16408272", "梦楠", "地理位置非常好 可以步行到达shopping center 悉尼歌剧院 住的也很舒适"),
("2018-07-23", "16408272", "Tiffany", "Thank you for having us  and for your wonderful communication along the way. The hotel/apartment is in an awesome location (right across from Wynyard)  and close to Circular Quay. There are roadworks on George St  but they didn't bother us at all. It's a very convenient location if staying in Sydney. There were 2 of us staying in the place  and we had plenty of room. The place was very clean too. "),
("2018-07-29", "16408272", "Diane", "Perfect location!  Couldn’t have been easier to see the sites. The apartment had nice amenities and was comfortably cozy. Chloe was easily accessible and responsive. Do Consider adding an extra day for luggage storage. Arriving from Dallas on a 6 am flight doesn’t provide many options. We ended up storing luggage at smarte carte in the Rocks which worked out ok.  We will be back again!"),
("2018-08-01", "16408272", "Ed", "A nice CBD location close to the business district for business travellers. Nice location with lots of local places to dine."),
("2018-08-05", "16408272", "雅君", "all good!"),
("2018-08-08", "16408272", "Joel", "Great location in the centre of Sydney. Chloe was very accomodating to us  allowing us a late checkout so that our 1-year-old could have a nap."),
("2018-08-23", "16408272", "Michael", "Great location for (Website hidden by Airbnb) works a bit noisy but only started early on one day. Kitchen well equipped to cook a couple of meals in....lots of options nearby for eating out. Chloe was very friendly  efficient and helpful...perfect host!..."),
("2018-08-30", "16408272", "慧", "地理位置优越 过个马路就是地铁站 出行非常方便｡"),
("2018-09-23", "16408272", "Amy", "Great location  convenient to everywhere. Bed is comfortable."),
("2018-09-27", "16408272", "Evita", "This was a perfect location and a wonderful apartment. We plan to visit Sydney more often and have found our place. Chloe is great with communication and the check in was super easy."),
("2018-10-14", "16408272", "Natassja", "This apartment is in such a perfect location  everything is within walking distance. It is very cosy and has everything you should ever need. Truly like a home away from home. Chloe was great at replying to any questions we had and her staff member  Crystal was equally as helpful. It just made our first ever trip to Sydney that much more enjoyable."),
("2018-10-19", "16408272", "Ami", "This apartment (in a hotel) is in a great location in the heart of Sydney's main attractions and easily accessible by public transport. Grocery store  shops  Sydney Harbor  etc were all within very short walking distance as described. The apartment itself is spacious and clean. Makes for a good base to prep breakfast and do laundry. Beds were comfy.  As mentioned in the description there is ongoing light rail work but w/ windows closed the noise isn't bad. Finally the host was responsive to messages and check in was smooth."),
("2018-10-23", "16408272", "Frederic", "Chloe is always available to help and very responsive.. thank you Chloe!!"),
("2018-10-25", "16408272", "Thera", "Awesome location and super comfortable appartment. Just loved it  felt like home"),
("2018-11-08", "16408272", "Xiao", "the house is very good"),
("2018-11-20", "16408272", "Stuart", "Chloe was slow to respond  and didn't respond to messages sometimes. Otherwise a great stay! Great location."),
("2018-11-24", "16408272", "Lyn", "Chloe’s place was fantastic for 2 girls on a reunion weekend could walk everywhere   circular quay rocks markets shopping everywhere just great"),
("2018-12-02", "16408272", "영미", "."),
("2018-12-07", "16408272", "Harry", "Great location and wonderful space. A great way to start a trip to Sydney."),
("2018-12-13", "16408272", "Donna", "Very happy"),
("2018-12-24", "16408272", "Slaney", "Chloe was a great host. Very quick to respond and very accommodating. She made my Dad’s stay very easy with early check in and late check out."),
("2019-01-04", "16408272", "Tommy", "Great hosting"),
("2019-01-16", "16408272", "Monika", "This place is in an awesome location  within easy walking distance to several public transport options and many attractions. It is in a building shared with a hotel  and although reception has nothing to do with this AirBnB  it means when you come home at night you feel safe. The apartment is spacious  and it has good air conditioning. There is currently some building work on George Street  but it was not an issue  it's on a par with any other city noise you would expect in a town - we did not notice it at all and it was very quiet at night. We stayed for 6 nights and we were not disturbed by any people or traffic noise at all. The beds were very clean and comfy  there is plenty of linen/towels in the flat  and also some basic food (tea  milk  sugar) and toiletries  which is great when you arrive after a flight. The kitchen has an oven  microwave and gear for cooking at home  and the supermarket is less than 200 metres away  and there are a variety of restaurants etc nearby. The landlady is lovely and super responsive  and sorted any questions etc before we even unpacked. The apartment is very comfortable. Thank you for a lovely stay."),
("2019-01-20", "16408272", "Karolina", "Great location  2 minutes away from Wynyard station and shops."),
("2019-01-29", "16408272", "Martin", "This Apartment has got to be in one of the best locations in Sydney. Great Host"),
("2019-02-10", "16408272", "Amrita", "Chloe was very accommodating especially as we had a very late arrival and we required late checkout. The location is ideal."),
("2019-02-16", "16408272", "수경", "늦은 체크인을 부탁하였으나 연락이되지않아 새벽 두시 넘어서까지 기다리다가 다른호텔에 숙박하여야했습니다. 컨디션이 좋지않던 저희 엄마는 이일로 인해 시드니 여행내내 약을 달고 사셔야 했습니다. 호스트와는 결국 연락이 되어 호텔비와 숙박비를 돌려받긴 하였으나  시드니 도착날과 그 다음날 컨디션과 기분이 엉망이 되어버렸습니다. 예약한 다음날 숙소에 들어와보니 건조기안에는 세탁물이 가득했으며  부엌선반의 기름은 유통기한이 지난것이 었습니다. 변기도 더러웠으며  커피머신의 캡슐은 커피머신과 맞지않는것이었습니다. 숙소바로앞 죠지스트리는 한참 트램공사중이라 시끄럽습니다. 침대는 편했습니다."),
("2018-08-06", "16532647", "Luciano", "Every thing was good  we asked for a latter check out and she had no problem!"),
("2017-01-21", "16549021", "Jonathan", "This is a great place with plenty of space. If you had a family then this would be awesome"),
("2017-02-02", "16549021", "Ryan", "Great place to stay in cronulla."),
("2017-02-18", "16549021", "Helen", "Very comfortable  close to beach and shops and entertainment. Had a very enjoyable stay and Robert was very helpful and flexible host."),
("2017-02-23", "16549021", "Ryan", "Great place to stay"),
("2017-02-26", "16549021", "Lisa", "Perfect Location  close to the beach with a great Golf club across the road. The accommodation is very comfortable and very spacious and nicely decorated. It was great to have a secure garage for parking too.  It fulfilled our expectations and the owner is a great guy. We highly recommend this listing...."),
("2017-03-11", "16549021", "Shazia", "Great location  friendly service and comfortable accomodation! "),
("2017-03-18", "16549021", "Jonathan", "Would highly recommend  Rob and his place were both Great!"),
("2017-04-01", "16549021", "Shima", "Rob's house is such a wonderful place  clean  comfortable and we all loved it! Highly recommended:) Rob is a very nice guy  we all like him a lot! we will definitely come back!!!"),
("2017-04-07", "16549021", "Julie", "Perfect location. Apartment was great clean & better than what we expected. Rob the host was relaxed& was a pleasure to deal with. Nothing too much trouble"),
("2017-04-23", "16549021", "Fiona", "Close to beach  shops with outside space  clean  friendly and welcoming host. Great for families and kids ( there are stairs) but didn't affect us. All round 5 stars "),
("2017-04-29", "16549021", "Celeste", "Roberts Place was great for our whole family...house was clean and close enough for a stroll into Cronulla mall for coffee or food. Will defiantly stay again if the family heads back to Cronulla"),
("2017-05-13", "16549021", "Sarah", "Good location. Value for money if you're staying for at least 2 nights."),
("2017-05-19", "16549021", "Mark", "Rob's place is definitely a awesome gem! Great location and an even better host. Will definitely recommend Rob's place for others to visit. Thank you for making our visit to Sydney an awesome one."),
("2017-05-27", "16549021", "Trish", "Robert is a wonderful host  central location  clean and very homely"),
("2017-06-11", "16549021", "Kate", "Robs home is conveniently located only minutes from the local beaches  shopping and dining district. His home can fit 2 young families.  The home was clean and Rob was a great communicater and made our family's Cronulla experience a very memorable one. We will definately be coming back."),
("2017-06-18", "16549021", "Cody", "Great place to stay  excellent location. Would stay again."),
("2017-07-03", "16549021", "Jamie", "Great stay  easy access to mall and sports club and across the road was the amazing takeaways awesome seafood platters!  Will definetly stay there again. Rob was the perfect host  welcoming and helpful."),
("2017-07-10", "16549021", "Jo", "Great location - close to beach & shops. Robert communicated well with us as we checked in late after a long drive. Would definitely stay again."),
("2017-07-22", "16549021", "Christine", "Great house for 2 families - very roomy with 2 bathrooms upstairs and bonus bathroom downstairs. Awesome location. Easy walk to Shark Park for footy and along the beach to Cronulla. Great takeaway and golf club bistro just across the road was very convenient. Rob's excellent communication made the whole process so easy. Highly recommended  would love to stay again. Thanks again Rob"),
("2017-08-07", "16549021", "Helen", "Excellent location good size made feel very welcome"),
("2017-08-20", "16549021", "Melanie", "Rob was a brilliant host and the place was spotless with so much space. It had everything we needed and close to all the local hot spots. We had a wonderful time and would highly recommend."),
("2017-09-04", "16549021", "Simon", "A great location but comes with very noisy traffic as it is on a round about on a main road."),
("2017-09-17", "16549021", "Olivia", "Robert is a great host  he was very friendly and made sure we had everything we needed (towels  linen wifi ect). The home is great  sleeps a lot of people and has good common areas. It's very clean and neat! It is close to cafes  nightlife and the beach is so close we walked almost everywhere. The area is safe and there is space for cars. Value for money! Would definitely book again! Thanks!"),
("2017-09-24", "16549021", "Kala", "Robert's place was absolutely amazing  it was everything that we imagined. It is in the perfect location for wondering into Cronulla for cafes and shopping  plus only a short walk to the beach. I would highly recommend Roberts home for your next stay."),
("2017-10-01", "16549021", "Sandra", "Robert is a great host - super friendly and accommodating.  His house is perfect  for a large group - lots of beds  bathrooms and living space and really close to the beach and Cronulla shopping centre  restauraunts  train etc.Would highly recommend and if we're back in Sydney  we'll be looking Robert up!Thanks Robert for a lovely stay!"),
("2017-11-12", "16549021", "Lauren", "Great place  local to everything you need and very homely. The perfect place for our weekend away."),
("2017-11-17", "16549021", "Amber", "Rob was friendly and so welcoming when we arrived! He gave us tips about the local places to eat and explained everything well.His place was immaculate and spacious for our family. It's central to a lot of good spots in Cronulla and easily found. No problem getting meals delivered there. We'd happily stay again!"),
("2017-11-25", "16549021", "Jacqueline", "Location  location  location.  This place is an attached  two-story condo on the beach block. It's walking distance to the train into Sydney and downtown Cronulla. The neighborhood is safe and the ""take-away"" place across the street does great ""long black"" coffee.  Robert  a great host  welcomed me  my husband and 3 small daughters warmly and we had a WONDERFUL time."),
("2017-12-02", "16549021", "Brett", "Good location close to the beach."),
("2017-12-17", "16549021", "Kim", "Great warm place  close to beach and restaurants."),
("2017-12-27", "16549021", "Vicky", "Fantastic location - short walk to the beach and not much further to the shops and many restaurants. Comfortable and clean with a good array of kitchen equipment if you do want to cook. Very comfortable beds. Perfect for a short stay. Railway station within walking distance too."),
("2018-01-02", "16549021", "Emma", "Rob’s Place was great for our group of friends. Walking distance to the beach and close to bars and shops. He was flexible and easy to communicate with. Very accommodating!"),
("2018-01-15", "16549021", "Paulette", "We really enjoyed our stay at Robert’s beach house. Near beach  comfortable and a gracious very helpful host. We will certainly return for more boogie boarding and swims in the ocean pool."),
("2018-02-11", "16549021", "Lee", "Robert is a great host. Beautiful and clean townhouse. Just walking distance to the beach. Would stay there again."),
("2018-02-18", "16549021", "Chantal", "Excellent location  walking distance to Elouera Beach and a short stroll to Cronulla shops.  Convenience of milk bar  take away food and golf club bistro just across the road. Very tidy and functional house  great for families or group.  Rob is a friendly host who is quick to respond to questions."),
("2018-02-25", "16549021", "Fiona", "Clean and Comfortable great location  suited our requirements.  Thanks for having us."),
("2018-03-03", "16549021", "Melinda", "Clean simple and comfortable. Just what we needed."),
("2018-03-12", "16549021", "Todd", "Nice place  only downside noisy traffic  no air-con and blinds in bedroomsRob is a fantastic bloke and really enjoyed our stay very accomdating"),
("2018-03-18", "16549021", "Edmund", "Rob's place is situated close to the beach  take away store and a golf club - making it extremely convenient to travel around cronulla. There was plenty of space and the place was neat and tidy. The house was a little hot (it was a >30 degree weekend) but Rob did provide a number of fans to ease the heat discomfort."),
("2018-04-08", "16549021", "Kim", "Good position wouldn’t recommend staying in summer as it gets very hot but great location and host"),
("2018-05-05", "16549021", "Michael", "Excellent 3 bedroom townhouse with plenty of room and having 3 showers to access was great. location was perfect with very short drive or walks to everything you need in Cronulla"),
("2018-05-21", "16549021", "Kasey", "Great location  very clean. Rob was a great host - very flexible and accommodating. Thanks for a great saty!"),
("2018-06-17", "16549021", "Sarah", "Robert was a great Host. Communication was great  check in easy. Spare bedding came in handy  and the accommodation was clean  tidy & as described. Wouldn't hesitate to recommend."),
("2018-07-14", "16549021", "Nyssa", "Clean  tidy  home close to the best parts of Cronulla. Thank you Robert for opening your home to us."),
("2018-07-24", "16549021", "Laurel", "Great communication and easy check in. The house had everything we needed and was clean and comfortable. Having 3 bathrooms was handy for two families."),
("2018-08-04", "16549021", "Ash", "A perfect location  central to beach  shops and eateries.A little loud at nights with some traffic but very comfortable stay with it been clean and tidy and well looked after. "),
("2018-08-19", "16549021", "Jenny", "Great location - diagonally opposite Golf Club. Only about 1k to Cronulla Leagues Club in one direction and Main Street of Cronulla in the other direction. Nice clean unit with everything you need."),
("2018-09-08", "16549021", "Nikki", "Enjoyed our stay rob was a such an accomodating host and the pictures don’t do the accommodation justice. A really fantastic stay we hope to come back."),
("2018-09-16", "16549021", "Rowan", "Great place for a larger group"),
("2018-09-28", "16549021", "Andrew", "Perfect location and very comfortable"),
("2018-10-13", "16549021", "Nikki", "Robs place is the perfect home away from home   I  would recommend a stay at Robs place to everyone"),
("2018-10-27", "16549021", "Gabrielle", "Perfect spot  spotless  easy check in and a block from the beach. Will definitely be back!"),
("2018-11-04", "16549021", "Dominique", "Great house  fit 5 adults with plenty of extra space (and beds). 3 bathrooms was very handy! the no aircon wasn’t much of an issue as Rob set up fans in all rooms for us!"),
("2018-11-11", "16549021", "Ray", "Convenient location  very clean and good size rooms. Highly recommended."),
("2018-11-24", "16549021", "Lisa", "Very clean and tidy place  fabulous location near gold club and beach. Amazing coffee/breakfast spot at elouera SLSC Rob was a very relaxed and friendly host. No breakfast or tea/coffee supplied. Thanks rob."),
("2018-12-01", "16549021", "Peter", "Great location.Lots of room.Very clean and well presented."),
("2018-12-26", "16549021", "Brittany", "Rob was a fantastic host. The place was neat and tidy and had everything that we needed. The location is great  a quick walk to the beach and only 15 or so minutes from Cronulla."),
("2019-01-01", "16549021", "Sabina", "Amazing location so close to the beach! The house was clean  very comfortable and had everything we needed."),
("2019-01-06", "16549021", "Steve", "Roberts place was a great place to stay! Great location great communication. Can’t recommend him highly enough"),
("2019-01-12", "16549021", "Nadine", "Great house and location really close to the beach and walking distance to the shops and cafes. Rob was a great host."),
("2019-02-11", "16549021", "Greg", "Classic beach house at a great beach!  Beach is 1 block away.  Clean inside."),
("2019-02-16", "16549021", "Damien", "Great location and customer service from Robert! Lovely place with all the perks  easy to stay 8 without any issues."),
("2019-03-03", "16549021", "Jackson", "Roberts place is in a great position and great for large groups or family’s"),
("2017-01-16", "16602162", "新英", "第一次使用airbnb 这个平台确实不错｡很方便｡租到很不错的房间｡交通交通十分方便｡地处热闹街区里面的安静｡市中心 繁华热闹 5分钟到达繁华的大型豪华商场 超市 购物生活方便｡5分钟可以到达中央火车站｡十分钟左右可以散步情人港广场 10分钟左右 可以步行去享受唐人街中餐美味｡西餐当然遍地都是 15分钟以内可以漫步海德公园｡30分钟步行 可以到达悉尼歌剧院｡屋子干净整洁 设施齐全 你也可以自己做饭 因为厨房设施齐全｡房东沟通方便 中文 粤语 英文都可以与之交流｡耐心热情 服务周到｡又问必答 还可以给出不错的建议｡总之 家庭旅游 商务出差 短中期的居住 都是不错的选择｡很好的平台 很好的房东 值得选择｡以后还会有机会来的"),
("2017-01-21", "16602162", "Tim", "Highly recommend staying hereModern  clean & comfortable "),
("2017-01-28", "16602162", "Marina", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-02-21", "16602162", "John", "Fantastic views from this Unit overlooking Darling Harbour. Quick easy lift access. Looking forward to returning"),
("2017-03-04", "16602162", "Jenny", "Great space and location!"),
("2017-03-11", "16602162", "Bronwyn", "Host were absolutely lovely and very accommodating! Would definitely stay with them again. Thank you for a beautiful stay :)"),
("2017-04-13", "16636716", "Peter", "The apartment is in a great location if you have business or pleasure in the Sydney Olympic Park. Good access to the ferry as well. Vicky as a host was very communicative and Accomodation was extremely clean and tidy. Definitely recommended  especially to business travelers."),
("2017-01-13", "16551368", "Kirsti", "My daughter and her friends stayed at Danny's place. Great location  easy check in and check out. Spacious for the group of friends! "),
("2017-01-23", "16551368", "Natalie", "This unit was perfect. Great size  brilliant location   eateries close by  Darling Harbour just a stroll. Massive amount of storage and space in each room  comfy beds  great view. Would definitely stay there again."),
("2017-01-27", "16551368", "琴悦", "condition is not bad just some cockroach position quite good ez to the ferry and to qvb just 15 min walk.Owner pretty good."),
("2017-01-29", "16551368", "Jing", "The location is really great   walk diatance to harbor bridge and also shopa in center !"),
("2017-01-30", "16551368", "Daniel", "Perfect location in Sydney's CBD with great views to both the Darling Harbour and SYD's skyline. Spacious and great for small groups up to 7-8 people. We all of us (6) really enjoyed our stay there!"),
("2017-02-03", "16551368", "Chenyang", "Danny's house is in a great location! My family and I am able to walk to everywhere! It is only three minutes away from darling habour  we can also have a view of darling ha our from balcony!All of my family are satisfied with this house and we will definitely choose to live here again when we comes to Sydney next time!"),
("2017-02-04", "16551368", "Frances", "Danny was great in accommodating to poor organiseation on my part and allowing us to drop our bags off early  and we were greeted by his brother. Danny's place was super convenient for a few of us staying in the city  however it is in a serious state of disrepair  including bathroom tap  shower doors  wardrobe doors  balcony doors etc. we're all broken in some way. Furniture was of low quality you could feel it  especially the beds. Just seemed like basic cheap furniture  compared to other Airbnbs I have stayed at  the quality of this was poor. Despite the great location and affordable price  myself and the other guests probably would not stay there again. "),
("2017-02-10", "16551368", "Azriel", "great place  great location !! "),
("2017-02-11", "16551368", "Alicia", "Danny's place is really nice and bigger than I expected for a city apartment. It was a great location and close to Darling Harbour. Would recommend to stay here."),
("2017-02-16", "16551368", "Terry", "Great location  clean  comfortable and spacious"),
("2017-02-21", "16551368", "Khem", "Great place in an awesome location. Good value for money."),
("2017-02-22", "16551368", "达", "Such a nice apartment very comfortable and very convenient Denny  is a good host  we enjoyed our stay"),
("2017-02-23", "16551368", "Patricia", "My Daughter and her friends stayed  one night  at Dannys place  they like it. The place is clean  located in a good area."),
("2017-03-03", "16551368", "Rba", "Danny is very accommodating. Location is perfect."),
("2017-03-04", "16551368", "Alissa", "Awesome location. So central to everything! No parking but there's a parking station about six doors down and the weekend rates are great! The bedrooms were huge and the beds comfy. I didn't realise there were 3 bathrooms also. We didn't stay in the apartment long but it was really comfortable when we were there. Thanks for having us!"),
("2017-03-07", "16551368", "Xianyuan", "nice apartment. has 3 room. easy walking to everywhere. it is easy to communication with Danny  and he will give you the good suggestion. "),
("2017-03-08", "16551368", "Yvonne", "Great value as a business apartment for 2-3 visitors"),
("2017-03-09", "16551368", "David", "All good."),
("2017-03-11", "16551368", "Taryn", "A great apartment in a central location  close to shops  nightlife and walking distance or quick cab to Cirqular Quay and Darling Harbour. The pictures don't do enough justice - the apartment is really spacious with the added bonus of three bathrooms  which is great for a group! Danny was a very accommodating host and I would definitely recommend this as a great place to stay."),
("2017-03-15", "16551368", "Eliza", "Great location.Walked 5 mins one way to Darling Harbour. Five mins the other way to Queen Vic Building/ Pitt st shops.Danny easy to deal with. Gave us early check in."),
("2017-03-18", "16551368", "Jacquie", "Danny's apartment was good value - located just a short walk to Darling Harbour and with great views.  It was clean  comfortable and just what we needed for our quick visit to Sydney.  Danny was helpful and communicative from the very beginning of our booking. Many thanks!"),
("2017-03-26", "16551368", "Andrew", "Danny's place is very well placed for access to Darling Harbour  Barangaroo and Circular Quay. Hotel level amenities were provided. However  we had difficulty connecting to the wifi and the TV only seemed to work sometimes  so don't stay here if they are necessities for you. Views are outstanding  but city noise can disturb light sleepers.The apartment is furnished in a very old way and is in some need for repair/refurbishment. The lobby and gym/pool  however  are new and excellent."),
("2017-04-02", "16551368", "Jill", "Dannys apartment was in the perfect location. Everything on your doorstep. Very spacious apartment  great for girls weekend with 3 bedrooms  3 bathrooms and lots of wardrobe space. The apartment is a bit tired and could do with some improvements in some places but overall great. Danny was an excellent host. Any queries were answered and dealt with immediately. He also allowed us a late check out. So thank you Danny and see you next time!!"),
("2017-04-04", "16551368", "Juan", "Great Location! Great pool to swim laps! Nice and big apartment! The only concern was that we were 7 friends with slightly different agendas and we were provided with only 2 keys. Other than that  great stay."),
("2017-04-09", "16551368", "Miguel Del Rello", "Grate host  we didn't have WiFi when we arrived  but he solved the probelm right away by setting up a new modem. "),
("2017-04-13", "16551368", "Jason", "Location was good"),
("2017-04-15", "16551368", "Charlotte", "Good location  walking distance to China Town  Sydney Opera House  Darling Harbour. Host is nice and helpful. But unfortunately the air conditioner  oven and parts of the stove not work during our stay. Hope host can fix them soon as to bring the best experience to guests. Not bad experience at all."),
("2017-04-16", "16551368", "Lark", "The apartment is large and suited our family of 6. Danny was a great host and allowed us to leave our bags in the room after checkout time. Some of the apartment was renovated and new but other areas like carpets and kitchen were pretty tired."),
("2017-04-20", "16551368", "Qi", "Very good location and view of Darling Harbour  easily to reach everyplace in CBD. Danny is so nice to arrange everything  here should be your good choice."),
("2017-04-23", "16551368", "Daniel", "Great apartment in a great location  exactly what we needed for family weekend in Sydney. "),
("2017-05-01", "16551368", "Andrea", "Great location to the ICC and the city.  Perfect space for a group of girls travelling. The unit is spacious and beds are comfortable.  Danny is a good host."),
("2017-05-05", "16551368", "Lisi", "Great location in the city  lots of space for everybody& plenty of bathrooms to make your stay easy. Fantastic inner city views. Very clean & comfy beds."),
("2017-05-06", "16551368", "Tianyi", "Comfortable and clean apartment  with easy access to famous spots in downtown.  although couldn't see Sydney theatre from the balcony  it's quite near. Looking forward to come back to Danny 's place again."),
("2017-05-09", "16551368", "Nikki", "Great central spot with 3 large rooms   no parking in the apartment complex but there's public parking just down the road."),
("2017-05-12", "16551368", "Angela", "Central location  great views!"),
("2017-05-15", "16551368", "Yiseul", "nice view!"),
("2017-05-19", "16551368", "Romely", "Great place  great location. Danny was very nice  we would defend come back"),
("2017-05-20", "16551368", "Bradley", "Great sized apartment with exceptional views and in a good area. Very comfortable and close to entertainment and public transport etc"),
("2017-05-25", "16551368", "Gary", "Great place in great location. Thanks for hosting us Danny."),
("2017-05-27", "16551368", "Kate", "Great central location. So easy to get to. We walked all weekend all around the city. View from balcony seemed even better than the pictures! Good beds   linen & fluffy towels. We wished we had another day so we had time to use the pool  spa & sauna. All in all a great place to stay"),
("2017-06-08", "16551368", "Thin", "Very well located and close to darling harbour. The home is spacious enough for 2 families with 3 kids. Danny is responsive and even managed to loan us a travel adaptor after I told him we did not bring any. Will love to visit again."),
("2017-06-16", "16551368", "Craig", "great location for our family to explore inner sydney plenty of room for us and our three kids. pool and spa down stairs was great option for them swell to burn some energy. few nigly things wifi did not work in lounge area and tv reception average at times. other wise great option for big family of group of friends. good fridge  oven  microwave and washer."),
("2017-06-17", "16551368", "Kylie", "Great location. Close to public transport and a small walk to Darling Habour. Host was very accomodating."),
("2017-06-23", "16551368", "Denise", "I would highly recomend this property for so many reasons  location  stunning views  cleanliness  comfort  attention to detail  not just one deep bath but 2. Great gym  swimming pool and spa facilities. I felt very spoilt being there and Danny was so attentive  helpful and kind  the perfect host. "),
("2017-06-25", "16551368", "Bianca", "Apartment as described. Great location  neat and tidy  great view from balcony. Fantastic."),
("2017-07-01", "16551368", "JiunN", "Excellent location with main attractions minutes away. Good security as well and easy to find"),
("2017-07-07", "16551368", "Cecile", "Great  central location. Very spacious apartment. Only issue is that the washing machine did not work"),
("2017-07-08", "16551368", "Thomas", "Very convenient location  close to Sydney nightlife.Nice view of Sydney harbourComfortable beds and nice amenities"),
("2017-07-14", "16551368", "Soledad & Veronica", "Great location. Big  bright  spacious and comfortable apartment. Friendly host. Nice views.Perfect for families."),
("2017-08-03", "16551368", "Ashley", "Basically a good place to stay"),
("2017-08-10", "16551368", "Stuart", "Nice apartment in a great city location. The building had an unexpected plumbing issue when we arrive but Danny organised another apartment for us immediately that suited our needs. A great host."),
("2017-08-13", "16551368", "蔚", "位置很好!出行方便!沟通及时!设施齐全!"),
("2017-08-24", "16551368", "Yan", "房子床可以住六个人 非常宽敞"),
("2017-08-30", "16551368", "Andrew", "Nice location"),
("2017-09-02", "16551368", "Lai Yi", "Danny's place is very close to Darling Harbour and about 10-15 minutes walk to China town. There are a few convenience shops nearby and supermarkets are within 5-10 minutes walk. Food is not a problem at all as Nando's is right opposite of the road and there are cafes within 1-2 minutes walk. Despite being in a prime location  this apartment is located on a quiet street so sleep is not much of a problem. We are a family of 6 adults and 1 toddler and everyone enjoyed the stay."),
("2017-09-09", "16551368", "Kim", "Great location  and works for a group"),
("2017-09-15", "16551368", "Nick", "Supreme location  fantastic view!"),
("2017-09-16", "16551368", "Brendan", "Great location. Very central. Really spacious apt"),
("2017-09-19", "16551368", "Daniel", "Great location and nice  clean apartment  the pool  spa and sauna are a great bonus. We visited for the Sydney marathon and so wanted to do some home cooking  the kitchen was moderately equipped and not fully set up for 6 guests to cook and have a big meal. It could be better equipped for this but there was enough to make do and given how many restaurants and cafes there are in the local area  it was not much of a problem."),
("2017-09-22", "16551368", "Jessica", "Danny's place was perfect for the one night before our cruise. It is very close to harbour and easy to get to!Checkin was good and communication good. I would stay here again."),
("2017-09-29", "16551368", "英", "The location is Very easy to find  and very convenient to tourist attractions ."),
("2017-10-01", "16551368", "Paul", "Place was okay ."),
("2017-10-06", "16551368", "Tammy", "Danny was a very good communicator who ensured our needs were met.His accommodation was in a fantastic location  very accessible to Darling Harbour.Our family loved Sydney and Danny’s apartment location made it very easy to see all of the iconic spots offered along Darling Harbour and Circular Quay."),
("2017-10-08", "16551368", "Sally", "We didn’t end up getting the place we booked via Danny because there was an issue with the toilet however Danny immediately helped relocate us to another one of his apartments and it was perfect!!! His response is speedy and he is very helpful."),
("2017-10-10", "16551368", "Suzanne", "Good location  close to ferries and restaurants and a short walk to Pitt St Mall. Rooms comfortable with everything you need."),
("2017-10-14", "16551368", "Rui", "Danny respond promptly and friendly. I didn't meet him in person and my friend checked in with Danny's accompany. The apartment is as same as the pictures while the decoration quite simple. Only problem is that ceiling of one bathroom leaked for the first two nights we stayed which caused some inconvenience. After contact Danny he fixed it  thank you Danny! The apartment is quite close to city center-- walk 7 minutes to QVB  and Westfield shopping center  10 minutes walk to Hyde park and Sydney tower. Besides  opera house and harbour bridge also on the walking distance. We can easily see the harbour view from the balcony of Danny's apartment which is enjoyable. All in all  we glad found Danny's apartment and enjoy our stay."),
("2017-10-27", "16551368", "Caitlin", "Great location  good stay  couple of little things not repaired or maintained to the highest standard  but didn't really impact our stay"),
("2017-10-28", "16551368", "Gerben", "Great location  good size apartment for 5 adults. Danny provided a late check out in request. Thanks"),
("2017-11-07", "16551368", "Annette", "This apartment was huge and in an excellent location.  You can walk to most major sites within 15 minutes. The TV and wifi worked really well and there were plenty of places nearby to buy food at restaurants and grocery stores. Danny was very nice and easy to communicate with. However  while this apartment can be a great value for a large group  it was a little rough around the edges. For example  the oven was caked with grease and there was an old carpet and doors on the balcony. Also  there were supplies to repair the drawer rollers in the bedroom. However  my 8 year old pulled a drawer out on her foot which took us to the ER for an afternoon so I'm thinking the repair hadn't been completed. Overall a good value and good apartment  but we found it to be a little less excellent than we expected."),
("2017-11-13", "16551368", "Jenny", "Great location.Easy access and good apartment"),
("2017-11-13", "16551368", "Rhian", "Great host and great apartment. Would highly recommend"),
("2017-11-15", "16551368", "Amanda", "Communication with Danny was great and we met his brother upon check in. Location is quite favourable to those like to walk everywhere. 20mins walk to fish market  sydney harbour or less than 10 mins walk to the Sydney tower  Westfield  QVB.... slightly outdated with the furnishing however since we only stayed for 2 nights so overall still acceptable."),
("2017-11-16", "16551368", "Seb", "This place was amazing  deceptively large floor plan  two balcony (city view  harbor view) just fantastic! Would look to book here again when next in Sydney."),
("2017-11-19", "16551368", "Tammy", "Danny is very accommodating and the residents was lovely  clean and exactly as advertised."),
("2017-11-28", "16551368", "Paula", "Danny's 3 bedroom apartment was as describe on the website.  all of the necessary amenities were set up nicely.  the internet was hard to connect to unless in the bedrooms. but overall it was a great place to stay an in the best location.  Public transportation was very near and many sites to visit were within walking distance or by bus.  We enjoyed the ability to cook or go out to eat.  The apartment was stocked like home.  the availability of a washer and drying made it even more attractive.  Clean and set up great..."),
("2017-12-03", "16551368", "Katherine", "Great location  close to everything downtown. Could use a bit of a thorough cleaning and some extra utensils  however  it was close enough to walk pretty much everywhere you wanted to go down by the CBD  so it was a hit with our group!"),
("2017-12-07", "16551368", "Melanie", "Perfect location. Few minutes walk to Darling Harbour where Madam Tassaud  Sea Life and Safari is located. Sydney Tower is just around the corner. Loads of shopping places."),
("2017-12-11", "16551368", "Bill", "nice location!"),
("2017-12-13", "16551368", "Laura", "We had a great stay at the apartment. The view was beautiful and the location was great. Danny was great about letting us leave our luggage in the apartment after check out until our flight that afternoon. Some small things such as scuff marks on walls and wardrobes/doors that dont work as well as they could. But everything was clean and it was good value for money so those little things were not an issue."),
("2017-12-21", "16551368", "Joanna", "The place was very comfortable for our two couples and 2 year old! It was well located and had all the amenities we needed and a great view!"),
("2018-01-01", "16551368", "Angela", "Good location."),
("2018-01-04", "16551368", "Marco", "Il fratello di Danny è stato molto gentile e ospitale  ottima posizione per visitare Sydney. Migliorerei la pulizia. Gentili nel farci mantenere le valigie dopo il check out."),
("2018-01-06", "16551368", "Rodney", "Great central location would stay again"),
("2018-01-14", "16551368", "Yaz", "Danny and his brother's communication was perfect from the get-go ensuring my friends and I were able to check in very late at night. They were very attentive and helpful hosts. The apartment was HUGE!!! photos don't do it justice. Easily hosted a group of 7 guys with ease  with heaps of room to move around. Place was clean and we'll equipped  and made me forget that I was staying at an apartment and not a hotel. The location was also top notch  and a short walk to the ivy. For the price  location and the ability to sleep 8 comfortably  this place is a godsend!!!! Thanks Danny  will definitely be coming back."),
("2018-01-17", "16551368", "Cheryl", "Great central place to stay in the city."),
("2018-01-19", "16551368", "Sue", "The place was really excellent.  We were 5 women having a night in Sydney for a show and finding somewhere for 5 single people to sleep was amazing.  We could quite comfortable have been a family of 7 as 2 of the beds were queens.  The location was great. It is very central and convenient.  We could walk easily to the shops  restaurants and Town Hall station.  The beds were all comfortable as were the couches in the living room.  It was very clean with plenty of nice toiletries.  Danny is a wonderful host and the price was very reasonable.  I would highly recommend this place.  "),
("2018-01-20", "16551368", "Simone", "Awesome location. Spacious floor plan. Suited 6 of us very comfortably. Great pool. Very clean and presentable. Danny and his brother were always contactable and responsive. Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-02-04", "16551368", "Amin", "I liked the place."),
("2018-02-09", "16551368", "(Email hidden by Airbnb)", "地段交通非常方便 离达令港和水族馆超近 以后去悉尼还会优先考虑"),
("2018-02-25", "16551368", "Cilic", "Really nice apt. Convenient location for traveling to Sydney. Fantastic place."),
("2018-02-27", "16551368", "Joanna", "房子负责人非常好客 会提前一天跟你沟通确切到达时间 楼下见面给予钥匙以及带领进入房间介绍所有相信信息｡房间格局 三个卧室:一个大床房带独立卫生间 一个大床房 一个三人单人床｡客厅有沙发｡房间里有三个卫生间 2个洗漱间｡厨具很齐全｡离歌剧院1KM多点 步行就能抵达;离麦考利夫人座椅也很近2KM多点 步行也能抵达;附近的景点很多 房间干净宽敞!推荐悉尼溜达的朋友入住!赞房子的负责人!"),
("2018-03-01", "16551368", "Gary", "Great location. Great price for 3 seperate rooms. Starting to show some wear and tear but does the job. 6 adults easily accommodated.Very responsive.Unfortunate cleaners let the room down  travelled a lot but found a few things I def shouldn’t have! Others may have been more offended. Great value for 6 adults in the cbd though"),
("2018-03-05", "16551368", "Yu Yen", "The space was great for a group as large as 7. Very centrally located and convenient. Probably need a pest control though."),
("2018-03-16", "16551368", "Sarah", "What a great apartment in an amazing location. With views of Darling Harbour and Sydney city  this little gem is a great priced apartment in Sydney city. The hosts were lovely and responded quickly to any requests we had. Highly recommended."),
("2018-03-21", "16551368", "Steven", "Very good location. Plenty of restaurants near by. Danny was extremely fast at communication with us and was more that accommodating.  The extra bathrooms were excellent considering we are a large family."),
("2018-03-23", "16551368", "Paloma", "This home was a true gem we found! The house looked like a model home which was homey and beautifully decorated. They received us with fresh flowers on the table and a basket of wine and goodies. There was everything in the house to make you feel right at home-- all the kitchenware  cleaning supplies  towels  iron/ironing board  hair dryer  shower gel  extra blankets. The beds seemed new and the linens were fresh and very good quality.  It is beachfront property so morning walks were relaxing  the sunset was gorgeous and star gazing at night was spectacular. They also have a closet full of board games  books and a tv. You can buy food at the grocery store and have the most perfect vacation staying home at this property without having to even step out of the house.  Of course  there's a million things to do around here which my family and I did being out or first time in New Zealand but we very much enjoyed every minute of our stay at this house. I would give it an 11 out of 10 and would definitely recommend it. PS- the driveway into the house is a little steep and narrow. It was my first time driving in NZ and with the steering wheel on the right side but I had no trouble getting in and out of the driveway... just be careful and go slow :)"),
("2018-04-02", "16551368", "Cath", "Great place to stay. We were 5 adults and had plenty of room. Location in the city is perfect. Danny’s brother checked us in and he covered everything. Parking very close by at a Wilson car park. Lovely view of Darling Harbour from the balcony."),
("2018-04-12", "16551368", "Carolyn", "Great apartment in a smart building with pool/gym  and in a buzzing location. Danny was also very helpful and flexible."),
("2018-04-21", "16551368", "Denise", "Thanks for letting us stay in your awesome apartment. Mark was great and very helpful.  All in all the apartment was great  it made our time in Sydney amazing. I would recommend your place to anyone."),
("2018-04-24", "16551368", "Deb", "This apartment was spacious enough for us all... 2 adults and 5 teenagers.  The highlight was being able to sit on one of the 2 balconies and watch the action in darling harbour and the city streets.  The added bonus of pool  spa  sauna and gym was great.  Close enough to walk to the main attractions of sydney (bridge  opera house  eye tower  fish market  circular quay etc...and so many great places to eat  plus close to the main train stations).  The apartment itself could use a bit of maintenance  but was comfortable and neat.  Danny is a great host and communicates quickly."),
("2018-05-04", "16551368", "Yvonne", "Absolutely fab location. Very central and a stones throw from darling harbour. Lovely large apartment  comfy beds and plenty of room. Would definitely use the apartment again if we get back to Sydney."),
("2018-05-05", "16551368", "Ronda", "We were very pleased with Danny's place. A super convenient location and very comfortable for six adults. It was tidy and spacious and had everything we needed. We'll ceratinly be back. Thanks for having us  Danny!"),
("2018-05-10", "16551368", "Kevin", "Great location  close to CBD and Darling Harbour. Comfortably accommodated a family of 5. Pool and gym were great."),
("2018-05-12", "16551368", "Doug", "Great location clean and tidy unit  needs a couple of minor repairs but overall good price  good area close to everything."),
("2018-05-13", "16551368", "Suzannah", "Danny’s place suited our needs really well."),
("2018-05-25", "16551368", "Teofilo", "Danny's place is an ideal one and highly recommended"),
("2018-05-27", "16551368", "Nicholas", "Danny's apartment was excellent for a large group  Super spacious bedrooms and living rooms. Fantastic location in the heart of the Sydney close to lots of great cafes and restaurants. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-06-01", "16551368", "Lian", "Great place  great location its close to the city"),
("2018-06-10", "16551368", "Jl", "Well situated in the cbd area and easy access to most places. Apartment was clean and tidy. Danny was responsive and helpful. A very comfortable and enjoyable stay."),
("2018-06-11", "16551368", "Bill", "Great location  clean and tidy. The only thing that I can complain is that the sofa bed is too soft for me  but other people may like the softness.   "),
("2018-06-15", "16551368", "Widia", "It was great to stay at Danny’s Apt to explore Sydney. Everything about  location  location  location.... it’s walking distance to stations  darling harbour  George Street and Pitt Street  QVB  Chinatown etc. Very nice host and helpful...definitely will be back again. Thank you Danny!"),
("2018-07-02", "16551368", "Pete", "This place was in a fantastic location and we could walk or catch transport to most places.The reviews did not make it clear that there are 2 separate apartments within the property and we had the studio.It was very small but adequate for the two of us and we were out most of the time. Great shower. Would recommend for short stays."),
("2018-07-04", "16551368", "Tien", "Great hospitality!!!! My mother is a hard person and she is very happy !!!!!!"),
("2018-07-06", "16551368", "Casey", "Great host  great location "),
("2018-07-10", "16551368", "Cathy", "The location is great! Also the host is very responsive! We loved our stay!"),
("2018-07-13", "16551368", "Felicia", "Nice location and quick response. There are few things that need to be fixed in the room but still working well. One problem was someone with a key opened the room while i was sleeping without knocking. It was quite shocking."),
("2018-07-17", "16551368", "Staci", "This place is in a great location with everything you could want or need near by.."),
("2018-07-22", "16551368", "Jacki", "Great location  terrific facilities and so helpful with our requirements. Just a high five all round ! "),
("2018-07-30", "16551368", "Rodrigo", "Excellent location and great apartment!"),
("2018-08-02", "16551368", "Justin", "Great location!"),
("2018-08-10", "16551368", "Livia", "Studio apartment in a great location in the middle of the CBD. Close to lots of restaurants and shops. Comfortably fit 4 adults however the sofa bed a bit soft for our preference. Would recommend to couples and small families."),
("2018-08-12", "16551368", "Dom", "The Apartment is very clean and in a great location  so close to everything in the city!Danny was a great host and communication was easily accessibleWould definitely recommend!"),
("2018-08-19", "16551368", "David", "Central  reasonably equipped  non personal apartment  with the risk of getting disturbed by noisy neighbours night time due to non existing sound isolation from the entrance door."),
("2018-08-24", "16551368", "Maxime", "Fairly good experience overall. The main problem was the sofa bed which is clearly not a good enough quality for 2 people  perhaps suitable for one person. A little trouble as well with the windows who let the cold air in (can be cold in winter when sleeping in the sofa bed  even with the heating on).On the plus side  communication is good and we were able to check in 2 hours early very easily. The location is very practical to visit Sydney. The pool is nice.Orher than that you have what you need in the appartement but unfortunately you get the feeling early on that it is clearly not an appartement with people living in it permanently (only 4 knives  forks  spoons  glasses etc  and the atmosphere is quite ""cold"").Overall  very good location and practical  with good communication  but the second bed is clearly not good enough. I recommend for 2 people  perhaps 3  but not 4."),
("2018-08-29", "16551368", "Tirta", "The place is central to many landmarks. Town Hall station is just 5 minutes walk away. The place itself is very clean and well-maintained. If you have nothing to do at night because Sydney shops close after 5pm  there is Grace Hotel nearby which includes an Irish pub. There is also a post office just a couple of doors from the Airbnb if you ever need to ship things home. Danny was also very responsive in all our communications which was really comforting."),
("2018-09-10", "16551368", "Ansie", "LOCATION was great  walking distance from Darling Harbor  close easy 12 min walk with luggage from Wynyard Station.  Can get the ferry to Circular Quay and Taronga Zoo  Luna Park  Seaworld  Madame Tussaud and Wildlife Zoo is very close by  everything is walking distance from this apartment.  Reception was prompt and friendly  room was tidy with all you need  washing machine and dryer if needed. It is small  but for a traveler or long stay more than what you will need  4 people can sleep comfortable."),
("2018-10-02", "16551368", "동진", "벌레가 있음"),
("2018-10-06", "16551368", "Jizi", "The apartment is in a good location  close to town hall and big shopping centers in Sydney. But it’s much smaller than I imagined  quit narrow for 3 people to live there. And it’s very hard to contact with the host when we found there is no quilt cover for the sofa bed."),
("2018-10-07", "16551368", "Victoria", "Quite a small studio  comfortable enough for 2 but 4 is quite a squeeze as the pull out lounge bed is quite small."),
("2018-10-12", "16551368", "Umang", "Danny’s apartment is nice and the location is very convenient. However there can be noise from the apartment next door if there are noisy guests staying in there. If you can sleep through the noise  then it’s a great place to stay."),
("2018-12-28", "16551368", "Taylor", "Fantastic location within walking distance of so many of Sydney's sights. Space was definitely a bit more cramped than I had expected  but if you're spending the majority of your time out and about in Sydney  this isn't a huge deal."),
("2019-01-01", "16551368", "Bhanu", "Best location for Darling Harbour and opera house. Close to shopping  bus and train."),
("2017-04-30", "16654584", "Nicole", "Paul and Dianne offer a wonderful cosy cottage . I was so close to everything Balmain has to offer yet the location of the cottage was so quiet and peaceful. This was really a home away from home . Paul and Dianne where very welcoming and readily available if needed . The home was clean and very comfortable. I will definitely make this my first option each and every time. Thanks Paul and Dianne it was a pleasure to meet . Regards Nicole"),
("2017-05-21", "16654584", "Leigh", "Position .... position .... position. Our digs ticked all the boxes  close to public transport  eateries  markets & much much more. Paul & Dianne are great hosts & very helpful with the attractions of Balmain. The house is well presented with all the comforts of a home away from home. We would definitely stay here again on our next visit to Sydney town. Give Birchgrove a go ..... you will not be disappointed. Jan & Leigh."),
("2017-05-31", "16654584", "Nicole", "Paul and Diannes place really feels like a home away from home. Such a perfect spot and parking in the street is easy and accessible. I love staying at this very homely and cosy cottage. Paul and Dianne are lovely hosts and extremely welcoming ."),
("2017-07-16", "16654584", "Bridget", "Paul and Dianne’s place was delightful! Paul greeted us when we arrived and showed us around. The place was compact but very clean and welcoming (they had even had the heaters running so it was nice and cosy when we arrived!). The decor was beautiful  with small vases of flowers everywhere. There was careful thought put into everything right down to the smallest detail  such as the shape of the small vases  two cups in the bathroom cupboard for washing your teeth  and beautiful soft towels. They had provided everything they could think of  which made the stay easy and convenient. The parking situation with the passenger wheels on the curb was annoying but location is perfect  less than 5 minutes walk to Darling Street with all its cafes and restaurants. We also walked easily to the wharf and caught the ferry into Circular Quay.This is definitely an AirBnB we would love to stay in again!"),
("2017-10-14", "16654584", "Jo", "Paul’s place is a beautiful gem. Lovely  tastefully decorated  retreat. Cute little courtyard where we often ate breakfast. The place is well set up for anything you might need. The location is perfect. Close to transport- buses  ferries and restaurants. Our hosts were lovely and we knew if we needed anything they were just a text away. Highly recommend. Jo and Ian"),
("2018-01-02", "16654584", "Linda", "This cosy little cottage is in a fabulous location with so many dining options near by and a short walk to the ferry.  Very quiet street and tastefully decorated throughout. Paul was most welcoming on our arrival and close by should we need anything. Thank you for a great stay."),
("2018-01-16", "16654584", "Stephen", "This place is amazing - in a great location.  Close to shops and buses which enable you to get into the city in around 20 minutes.  The ferry terminal is also close by.  The accommodation is lovely and most importantly has a really comfortable bed with lovely pillows.  The wetroom was the highlight of the day which houses an amazing rainfall shower as well as attachments.  The hosts provide shower gel  shampoo  conditioner and gorgeous thick towels.  There was also an easy to use washing machine which again the liquid detergent is supplied.The kitchen is small but very functional.  There is a fridge  microwave (which we didn't use)  toaster  kettle and all the cutlery you will need.  Best of all there is a Nespresso machine and again pods are supplied but it might be a good idea to bring your own personal favorites.  There is plenty of drawer and hanging space in the bedroom.  My only negative about this place is the smell of moth balls in the drawers and wardrobe.  There is also a safe in the wardrobe with an easy to remember code because it is the last 4 digits of your own phone number and this is also the case for the front door so no need to carry a key.We would definitely stay here again as long as the hosts will have us back!"),
("2018-02-14", "16654584", "Jane", "We had a lovely two weeks here in February.  The place is totally charming  full of character and has a delightful little private garden.  Paul and Diane were wonderful hosts and there were many thoughtful touches such as fresh flowers.  Nothing had been overlooked and everything was high quality.  Lovely comfy bed and pillows and beautiful linens and towels.  We found the location perfect  especially since we had no car.  Just a few minutes walk to the ferry terminal and a few minutes in the opposite direction to Darling Street which is full of shops and restaurants and great little coffee places.  Balmain itself is a wonderful place to stay with its views  beautiful old homes and great vibe  plus easy access to the city.  Highly recommended."),
("2018-08-18", "16654584", "Jo", "Great host  charming accommodation and fantastic location close to transport  local shops and many restaurants and cafes. Really quite perfect for couples or single traveller. Highly recommend."),
("2018-09-26", "16654584", "Elizabeth", "A great experience.  Paul and Dianne were very attentive and charming hosts.   The cottage was thoughtfully appointed and was very comfortable  Balmain  an easy commute to the city and a quiet area."),
("2018-10-05", "16654584", "Ross", "A very neat little home very close to all the best of Balmain .Highly recommenced ."),
("2019-02-28", "16654584", "John", "A great place to stay  highly recommended and Balmain is a very good base especially with the ferry so close by. We have already recommended it to some friends."),
("2017-02-18", "16635022", "Steph", "Jess was extremely helpful & a great host. Lovely apartment close to public transport  lots of restaurants & bars close by. "),
("2017-03-05", "16635022", "Ricky", "I stayed in Jess' apartment for five days and had a wonderful time. The flat is really clean and in a handy location for getting around Sydney. There's some really nice coffee and brunch places nearby and it's close to the redfern station. Jess is a great host and her communication is excellent. Would definitely come back and stay here again."),
("2017-03-17", "16635022", "Chris", "Had a great stay at jess's apartment.Place was sparkly clean  bed was comfy  pool was nice. Everything is as Jess said in the description. One stop to central station but spent most of my free time neandering newtown and erskineville. There is some street noise but it wasnt enough to bother me if you keep the windows shut its fine. This place was really a pleasant surprise after my last air bnb experience. Thanks for having me Jess 10/10 would stay again."),
("2017-04-10", "16635022", "Caroline", "Great apartment in a great central location near the station and lots of bars and restaurants. Everything was as described and  I really enjoyed my stay. Would definitely stay here again if I find myself back in Sydney!"),
("2017-06-10", "16635022", "Matthias", "Perfect location  close from shops and train station  literraly in front of bus stops. Even walking to the center is easy. Redfern/alexandria is a lively neigbordhood  with pubs  barber shop  cofe  etc.The apparment is really good  everything necessary  just perfect  nothing to add.And Jess his a really nice host  respond super fast and there if needed. Higly recommanded."),
("2017-07-22", "16635022", "Phoebe", "Great place to stay  I was in town for work and it was really convenient to the CBD and a very comfortable stay. "),
("2017-07-29", "16635022", "Asif", "Very nice and clean place with all the facilities...very kind hosts...10 min walk from  redfern station and wil hav to climb stairs( no lift) ...loved staying at ur place and definitely would like to be back again"),
("2017-08-30", "16635022", "Michael", "Jess and Matt were great hosts and very responsive. The apartment is centrally located and an easy walk to the train."),
("2017-09-20", "16635022", "Melanie", "Excellent location in a quiet secure building. Enjoyed my stay."),
("2017-09-29", "16635022", "Gooser", "This is the BEST HOST ever!! So sweet and nice! Thanks for taking caring of us  me and my family really enjoy our staying^^ Thank you so much!! You guys gonna love this city as well^^Sincerely from Abess"),
("2017-10-03", "16635022", "Flora", "这个区域没什么人~走路去Train十分钟｡楼下的Thai Food的炸鸡翅很好吃｡提前到的 房东很客气的提前送来了钥匙 房子很干净很喜欢｡感觉房子隔音不是特别好不过邻居没有很吵｡"),
("2017-10-07", "16635022", "Karen", "Jess's place was perfect for our weekend stay in Sydney! Just a five minute walk to the train station  some nice coffee shops nearby and the apartment itself was exactly as described. Thanks Jess!"),
("2017-10-16", "16635022", "Marie-Stephane", "Super appartement bien situé à proximité de la gare de Redfern. Bien équipé. On s'y sentait comme à la maison. Très bonne communication avec Jess. Je recommande sans problème."),
("2017-10-26", "16635022", "Karen", "This a spacious  surprisingly quiet unit given its location on a main road. The amenities are nice with a spacious balcony and outdoor setting at the back. Would stay again!"),
("2017-12-01", "16635022", "Brett", "I do not normally care to write reviews but I had to after staying at this apartment in Redfern. The entire apartment is lovely and it is directly near the train station. The value of the property is great. Unfortunately  just about every Airbnb rental does not allow you to have parties or any big events  including this apartment. However  this apartment complex has a pool and a place to grill out (where you can bring people) which really sets it apart from other Airbnb rentals. What really surprised me was the excellent hospitality. Jess is extremely trusting and nice because she would always help me out with any possible inconvenience that I encountered. For example  once I requested to stay one night less because of my financial budget since I am a broke college student. Jess said that's fine and asks if she can pay me electronically (for the night that I would not be staying)  but I had to ask her if she could pay me in cash because I had zero in my bank account (It takes a few days to transfer) and I needed the money for food for that week (However  I didn't tell her that). I felt bad asking for the cash to be delivered because I knew she had to take care her 3 - week old baby but it was like essential. Without hesitation  she dropped off the money the next day in cash and she didn't know how much that helped me out. Also  they provide you with a pamphlet that lists places to eat nearby  they give you privacy  jess constantly responds to your text messages immediately  and they have the place refurbished with every possible necessity. You would think that they wouldn't care about you and your stay after you give them a down payment  but unlike most Airbnb's  they want you to have a great stay even after you pay. It's like staying at a hotel. I highly recommend this place in particular because I researched all of the possible Airbnb rentals for hours and this was by far the best-valued one that I could find."),
("2018-01-23", "16635022", "Pavlos", "It was an amazing place. Very close to station. Close to supermarket and shops.Clean  quiet and safe place. Well Done Jess for helping me out and my parents for staying there. You made them feel more than like their house.Would strongly recommend it and i look forward to come back again!!!!"),
("2018-05-06", "16635022", "Manuel", "Spacious and very comfortable apartment. Large terrace that allows you to enjoy breakfast  lunch and dinner outside. Very quiet community area with pool to enjoy in summer. There is also a BBQ in the communal area but it is unusable due to dirt. Apartment 10 minutes walk from Redfern station  with bus stop at the door and very well connected. It is 30 minutes walk from Town Hall and 20 minutes from the University of Sydney. Quiet neighbourhood although somewhat noisy due to traffic. In the neighbourhood  you can find all the necessary services. We were in the apartment for 3 months."),
("2018-05-14", "16635022", "Luke", "Good location  clean and comfortable apartment. Would recommend."),
("2018-05-19", "16635022", "Michaela", "This apartment was really fantastic. Both Jess and her partner Matt were amazing hosts. Everything was so clean and comfortable. In a great location  really close to public transport and the city."),
("2018-05-28", "16635022", "Hanna", "Jess was very friendly and helpful. I didn’t meet her but we talk by message. We arrive to the town at morning  and leave really late and she organise to leave us the appartement at 7am when we arrive and  leave us to leave the baggage until we fly back at night that make our couple of days to Sydney easier. The appartement was clean and nice. The bed is really comfortable. It’s really good place to stay when you want to be close to town but not in a middle with all trafic at night.I’m gonna try to be back for sure. Thank Jess! Hanna."),
("2018-07-20", "16635022", "Hannah", "Great location & very clean. Friendly and accomodating - I requested late check out and then also offered to look after my bags for me if I needed. Quick responses for any questions"),
("2018-08-04", "16635022", "Tc", "Had a great stay at Jess’ place. Jess was very responsive at all hours of the day and Was extremely hospitable.  Very close to transport  parks  cafes and the CBD. Would recommend to anyone looking to stay in the Redfern or Alexandria area. "),
("2018-08-12", "16635022", "Kayla", "Beautiful apartment within a short walk of the station which is so close to the CBD. The apartment was clean and extremely homey! We found a lovely cafe near the station which we loved popping into before we headed out for the day. We had a fantastic stay!"),
("2018-09-21", "16635022", "Philippe", "This was an amazing stay!  The host is very hospitable  helpful  and the home is lovely."),
("2018-11-01", "16635022", "Elle", "The apartment is very nice  clean and comfortable! Loved the back balcony overlooking lawn/pool. Location is very convenient  near shops and public transport. Jess was very helpful and friendly; excellent communication. Took care of any situation that arose  as I stayed one month. She’s a super host!"),
("2018-11-04", "16635022", "Daniel", "Great location and facilities. Plan ahead however if you require parking - as with most of inner-city Sydney locations availability is difficult to come by. I pre-booked with Wilson Parking and caught a 10 min Uber."),
("2018-11-17", "16635022", "Karen", "Jess place is perfect  I didn’t want to leave it because have a great location  you can walk to the city And there is a supermarket very close so you can buy everything you need. I think is everything you need!"),
("2018-12-05", "16635022", "Carol", "Jess very responsive to queries.  Apartment very well located for train station into Sydney Circular Quay in 15 minutes. Supermarket close by and numerous places to eat."),
("2018-12-13", "16635022", "Niklas", "Really nice place and the pool was great. Redfern was a new area for us but we liked it a lot. Jess was very fast in responding to our questions both before and during the stay."),
("2019-01-02", "16635022", "Jen", "Jess' apartment was clean  comfortable & very spacious. Close to train station & supermarket. Great pool & balcony. Also quick response if any queries. Definitely recommended."),
("2017-04-20", "16609607", "Krystle", "Lovely studio apartment with great views. Neighborhood was nice with great food and a supermarket downstairs. Much better than getting a hotel."),
("2017-09-27", "16609607", "Gili", "Yuan is really great  very nice and helpful. The apartment is perfect- has everything we needed  new apartment in a new building  great location only few minutes walk from everything! Highly recommanded!!!"),
("2017-11-23", "16609607", "Kei", "Very good location and good security apartments. Nice room and very happy. Easy to access to CBD."),
("2017-12-05", "16609607", "Cassie", "Great location  near the central station. Large space and easy to get access to everything you need."),
("2017-12-06", "16609607", "Conley", "非常干净整洁 很好"),
("2017-12-10", "16609607", "Lauren", "Linda was very helpful. The location of the apartment was great. The apartment was fairly clean."),
("2017-12-10", "16609607", "Fabrizio", "Good location  ideal for who needs one or two nights."),
("2017-12-14", "16609607", "Andrew", "Great location with pretty well all the amenities provided. It has been several years since I'd last spent time in Chippendale  and what's been done with the old brewery site is fantastic. Some really good restaurants to explore!"),
("2017-12-16", "16609607", "Caroline", "We had a very pleasant stay at Linda’s place! She was very reactive and helpful. Clean  functional and located in the CBD the apartment is perfect for a weekend in Sydney."),
("2017-12-18", "16609607", "Heung Soo", "Spacious  quiet and good location.  Great view.  New apartment facility.  Hosts were very responsive and accommodating. Enjoyed the stay!"),
("2017-12-20", "16609607", "Ennis", "The host deserve every word of the great reviews. Communication was practically instantaneous. They provide a warm welcome  a beautifully clean  comfortable home  everything could possibly need for a short stay  in a great location. Really enjoy  looking forward to stay next time! I cannot recommend them more highly!"),
("2017-12-23", "16609607", "Chloe", "Nice and central. Amongst the student accommodation."),
("2017-12-24", "16609607", "Jerry", "A nice place with a nice distance and great view."),
("2017-12-29", "16609607", "Robbie", "Excellent location"),
("2017-12-30", "16609607", "Sarah", "Great location  a quiet and private unit with very good air conditioning"),
("2018-01-04", "16609607", "Mark", "Great location  amazing value. Linda was very accomodating and a great host. Would use again  for def."),
("2018-01-04", "16609607", "William", "Linda's communication was very fast  booking and check in was simple. Linda arranged to meet us at a set time near the apartment. Apartment is in a new building  however for our visit it hadn't been thoroughly cleaned. Photos on listing didn't seem to match exactly with actual apartment. Good location near Surry Hills and Ultimo."),
("2018-01-13", "16609607", "Rhiannon", "Convient location  easy check in and communication. "),
("2018-01-15", "16609607", "Alessandro", "The value for this place was outstanding. There was no couch & no TV. However  the location  the apartment  amenities in the apartment & Linda ( lovely hostess ) were outstanding. The place was very clean  bed was very comfortable. Lots of windows that could be opened. The place has air conditioner  however I prefer fresh air & there was plenty of it. It was hot in Sydney but I never once had the aircon on. Views were lovely. Woolworth just down the road  very close & lots of great places to eat. The area & apartments around look amazing I wish ADELAIDE would take note!!No more than 10 mins from Central Station. Apart from no couch & tv which didn't bother me that much as this place had so much to offer. The value was exceptional ! Definitely would stay again when visiting & definitely would recommend THANK YOU Linda :))"),
("2018-01-17", "16609607", "Changmin", "Good location  good value of money!"),
("2018-01-23", "16609607", "Jonathan", "Linda made sure everything was as comfortable as possible. This is a simple and straightforward space for anyone who wants the basics in a good location and close to transport options and plenty of excellent restaurants."),
("2018-01-27", "16609607", "Sky", "Linda was a great host  the location was ideal and close walk to everything you could ask for"),
("2018-02-07", "16609607", "Danny", "Great value and location."),
("2018-02-12", "16609607", "心远", "物超所值"),
("2018-02-17", "16609607", "Anorah", "The view from the apartment and the location were phenomenal. The host was also quite flexible!"),
("2018-02-19", "16609607", "明东", "比较市中心  到悉尼游客方便出行"),
("2018-02-24", "16609607", "Shweta", "Linda’s place is very central and well connected to public transport and close to good cafes and restaurants. Our only issue was with the toilet cleanliness  which Linda promptly took care off. Apart from that everything else was good."),
("2017-01-20", "16768620", "Mieke", "A nice place to stay for a single traveller. Close to the CBD and close to the Central station  you can easily discover Sydney from Joe's place.  Joe and his roommates were very welcoming and helpful. He gave me all the necessary information and I'm sure we would have had a nice chat but I had to rush out to a concert. The room is small but clean and has a comfy bed. I'd stay here again! "),
("2017-01-20", "16651655", "Mark", "What a great space! Walking distance to Newtown for dinner a big plus. A bit of noise from the nearby Westconnex works."),
("2017-01-21", "16651655", "Andrea", "Steven was lovely from the start & helped me bring my bags in and offered me some fresh strawberries from his garden which I thought was quite nice! The place was quite spacious and on a hot day it still felt cool inside. There was beautiful art around and the location was central. It was easy for me to find a parking spot as well. Even though it was at the back of Steven's place  I still feel like I had a lot of privacy. It was easy to catch a $20 uber into the city (although the train station is close if that's what you prefer). I'd definitely recommend staying here! "),
("2017-01-23", "16651655", "Charlotte", "Walking distance to Newtown  comfortable and had a nice feel. Not on a busy street. No aircon  but wasn't an issue for us. We stayed on a hot night and it was fine! Small space but has everything you need. "),
("2017-02-19", "16651655", "Maria", "Very convenient location within easy walking distance to the train station and handy to the city.  Tidy and functional accommodation  good value for money.Steven was friendly and easygoing and communication was good.Thanks for having me to stay."),
("2017-03-03", "16651655", "Laura", "Our stay at Stevens place was great! We were a last minuet booking and everything was organised very quickly :) Comfy bed  close to everything   and a delicious mango from their garden! Thanks guys"),
("2017-04-25", "16651655", "Fawad", "Everything is as described  pretty decent  was in Sydney for a quick work trip and was a good location and spacious unit. "),
("2017-05-24", "16651655", "Nathan", "Great value for money eh and not too far from St Peter's station"),
("2017-06-23", "16651655", "Jacinta", "The host canceled this reservation the day before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-07-02", "16651655", "Lucy", "It is a nice place with your family."),
("2017-08-03", "16651655", "Juliette", "Each AirBNB is as distinctive as a  finger print or DNA! Another worthwhile experience  another highly acceptable accommodation. The hosts are creative and cosmopolitan people  offering space for guests is a natural extension of their love for travel and interesting places and people. They were helpful and welcoming. Check in and out was hassle-free and straightforward. St Peters is a growing artistic hub in Sydney and this listing captures that ethos .Convenient to transport  10 minutes by train from the CBD  comfortable  well equipped  the spaciousness of this listing is a real stand out feature and  3 people could fit in here. Read the description  the owners are accurate in their outline of the space  but nothing could be faulted in cleanliness  comfort and the facilities provided  would be happy to retur"),
("2017-08-11", "16651655", "Dean", "Great spot. 5 stars all the way"),
("2017-08-13", "16651655", "Ryan", "Great location short walk to train station"),
("2017-08-17", "16651655", "Nathan", "Good proximity to international airport."),
("2017-08-24", "16651655", "Peter", "Comfortable space in the back yard of the property. Functional and ok for short stays. Some aircraft noise unavoidable being close to the airport. City buses about a 5-10 minute walk."),
("2017-08-30", "16651655", "Nautilus", "Excellent quiet convenient  city location with easy walk into Newtown  St Peters train station etc. Great hosts easy check in with everything you need for one night or extended stay. Heater was great and kept us lovely and warm on a cold night. Thanks guys!Tisha and Jarrah."),
("2017-08-31", "16651655", "Lisa", "Exactly what it says on the tin. Great location  private & clean."),
("2017-09-04", "16651655", "Rob", "Great host and amazing space. Accurate as per the description.  The dedicated entrance and onstreet parking really helped me relax. WiFi was great too."),
("2017-09-08", "16651655", "Edward", "we needed a place to stay nearby due to an ill relative  ended up arriving 5hours after we intended but even at 1am Steven came out to greet us and give any assistance. We just needed a place to crash and it turned out to be quite convenient and close to what we needed access to. Would stay again!"),
("2017-09-21", "16651655", "Oktay", "Awesome little hideaway in the midst of the urban sprawl.  Was only there for the night.  Cool little pad.  Everything was as described."),
("2017-09-25", "16651655", "Kate And Thor", "I checked in on a stand-by rate and as such Steven's place is good value for money."),
("2017-10-11", "16651655", "Lynton", "Comfortable and clean. Priced accordingly."),
("2017-11-22", "16651655", "Sarah", "Steven is lovely and his place is super cool."),
("2017-12-08", "16651655", "Ellie", "We loved staying here - great location  easy transport into city and 20 min walk to Newtown which was great. Steven was friendly while also giving us space. The room was as described  not fancy but has everything you need and lots of space  it was perfect for us. Thank you we would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-01-27", "16651655", "Kai", "It’s a good place to stay and Steven is a nice guy. Appreciated the place and I had a good sleep at his cabin. Cheers"),
("2018-02-22", "16651655", "Suzie", "A great place to stay if you are in need of last minute  or budget accommodation. Steve and Jesse are lovely and specifically came to introduce themselves to me after I arrived.  Parking on the street in the evening was fine and the location was convenient for me to get to roads that took me to the CBD  North Sydney and the Airport. As I was in Sydney on business  it would not be somewhere I would normally stay  but I found it safe and convenient. Thanks Steven and Jesse for your hospitality."),
("2018-02-24", "16651655", "Joshua", "Fantastic hosts and awesome studio close to Newtown. Will definitely stay there again!"),
("2018-03-04", "16651655", "Netta", "very cute space and very central!"),
("2018-04-04", "16651655", "Jon", "Pleasant  comfortable and clean. There may be some aircraft noise in the morning  depending on the wind direction."),
("2018-04-27", "16651655", "Apurv", "Stayed at Steven's place for a night as I was in transit and needed a place near airport. Clean and accurate listing. Had no issues with check-in. Good value for money."),
("2018-05-05", "16651655", "Takahiko", "Great value! Pretty spacious and artistic. The place is away from busy districts  so quiet and relaxing. You have everything you need for your stay. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-11", "16651655", "Mandy", "Very nice and cosy space  perfect for relaxing"),
("2018-05-20", "16651655", "Estefania", "The excelent place to stay at least one night  close to all  and with a natural ambient that help you stay relax and confortable."),
("2018-05-21", "16651655", "Tracey", "Great value!"),
("2018-05-31", "16651655", "David", "Steven is a good communicator - prompt  clear and accurate.  The cabin is as Steven describes.  It is a short walk to the lower end of King Street  Newtown  and maintains the traditions of old Newtown.  Marrickville Metro (shopping centre) is very close too for supermarket shopping.  There is a lot of road construction going on at the moment  but Steven's place is a nice  retro haven away from the excesses of Sydney  yet close to the buzz of Newtown  St Peters station  and (as a result) many places connected via public transport.  Steven is the type of host you wish you had more time to spend chatting with.  It is a real 'airbnb' experience - living like a local - a Newtown local.  Steven isn't just someone making a buck  he's offering a local experience.  Steven describes the place honestly...if you want a sparkling Sydney harbour experience  look to the Eastern Suburbs of Sydney.  This is Newtown of old - and the better for that."),
("2018-06-10", "16651655", "David", "Wonderful spot!  You will not regret booking here!Great host"),
("2018-06-11", "16651655", "Kate", "This place is very reasonably priced and functional. I really appreciated that Steven let my sons stay without me being there  very understanding host!"),
("2018-06-23", "16651655", "Najib", "Very affordable place to stay and this unit is very unique"),
("2018-06-24", "16651655", "Kate", "Steven was very welcoming. Bed was very comfortable. Lovely little place."),
("2018-06-26", "16651655", "Louis", "Good value for the price."),
("2018-07-03", "16651655", "Ajith", "Excellent location close to airport ... Steven was really friendly and nice... excellent spot for a stop over...Thanks Steven"),
("2018-07-06", "16651655", "Mariah", "Really good value  very comfortable stay!"),
("2018-07-08", "16651655", "Nathan", "Was really great"),
("2018-07-08", "16651655", "Kevin", "Quiet place  very good privacy. Definitely recommended"),
("2018-07-12", "16651655", "Grace", "Terrific stay at Stevens  good location to the main street in Newtown and lovely self contained place for a stop over in Sydney! "),
("2018-07-12", "16651655", "Pat", "V good value and service"),
("2018-07-16", "16651655", "Pip", "I had a lovely stay at Stevens place. He was such a great host  and let me check in super early after a red-eye flight  and was very accommodating. The accomodation was clean and as appeared in photos on AirBnB. Steven was an excellent communicator and was quick with responses on AirBnB chat. Steven also had good tips for navigating the back streets as a shortcut to get to the local train station  and had some great restaurant suggestions. Thanks for a lovely stay :)"),
("2018-07-19", "16651655", "Steve", "Nice cosy self contained accommodation"),
("2018-07-21", "16651655", "Alexander", "Cute place! Very homely and Steven is super welcoming."),
("2018-07-26", "16651655", "Ollie", "Lovely"),
("2018-07-27", "16651655", "Sarah", "Thanks Steven for your cosy abode  will recommend to my friends if they need a place to stay near the theatre."),
("2018-08-04", "16651655", "Kim", "친절한 호스트; 저녁 늦게 도착했는데 호스트가 배웅나와주었습니다내일 아침 먹을게 없어서 마트정보를 물어봤는데 친절히 답변해주었고 자신의 정원에서 손수기른 파파야  오렌지를 포함해 바나나 등을 가져다 주었습니다"),
("2018-08-09", "16651655", "Nadia", "Steven’s place served as the perfect base for a few days in Sydney. I would describe the vibe as offbeat hippie chic - I loved the indoor plant festooned with tinsel and the guitar left for guests’ use. It might not be the newest place (don’t expect things to be showroom clean!)  but it’s charming  neat and full of character. Steven was friendly and helpful  and made sure I had everything I needed for my stay. "),
("2018-08-14", "16651655", "James", "Great little private space. Good vibes."),
("2018-08-17", "16651655", "Mark", "Great pad. Good space. Informative host. Terrific location."),
("2018-08-18", "16651655", "Amika", "Had a great chat and picked delicious snacks straight from the garden. Thank you for the one of a kind experience!"),
("2018-08-22", "16651655", "Christopher", "Everything you need. Nicely self-contained and good value."),
("2018-10-04", "16651655", "Kate", "Mostly was as described  clean  and we had a good stay. We were disappointed though as a big part of our decision to stay here was based on the ability to do washing and when we arrived the washing machine was broken. It would have been great if Steven had communicated this to us in advance as we would have stayed elsewhere."),
("2018-10-06", "16651655", "L-J", "Steven's studio is well equipped and a convenient walk to St Peters station.  He's a thoughtful host prior to your visit  your arrival and happy to assist in any way during."),
("2018-10-18", "16651655", "Fi", "Clean  full apartment with friendly  cosy atmosphere but laid back  not too fussy. 15 minute walk from King St Shops. Good value."),
("2018-10-20", "16651655", "Tahmina", "Great place to stay and only about a 10 min walk to St Peter’s station  with a king st and Newtown just around the corner!"),
("2018-10-25", "16651655", "Srinath", "Very convenient location and great private space with all the ammeneties . Highly recommend."),
("2018-11-09", "16651655", "DrKate", "Great location so close to the train and airport. Lovely funky vibe to the unit and Steven is a warm and friendly host."),
("2018-11-13", "16651655", "Evelyn & Kerry", "Perfect and quirky little eclectic backyard cabin in Sydney's inner suburbs  close to train station  everything you need and a sense that you could be anywhere in the world!"),
("2018-11-27", "16651655", "Scott TJ", "Great location for getting about that part of town. Excellent value."),
("2018-12-05", "16651655", "Teriece", "Awesome place to stay  especially if you’re into an artsy setting!The garden is beautiful  filled with surprises! I thought it was cozy  though generous in space & nothing beats great hospitality  Steven looks after you. It was really nice!"),
("2018-12-06", "16651655", "Peter", "Don't stay here..."),
("2019-01-08", "16651655", "Theresa", "This space is comfortable and has everything you’d need for a great stay. All interactions I had with Steven were very pleasant and I would highly recommend his place!"),
("2019-01-12", "16651655", "Stephen", "Good budget priced accommodation for one in St Peters. Self contained bedsit with all necessary cooking facilities  large bathroom and fans for cooling. Steven was an excellent host. He took me in as a last minute booking and was very flexible on check-in and check-out arrangements to fit in with my travel requirements."),
("2019-01-28", "16651655", "Ella", "Steven was considerate! Bungalow is described accurately. Steven had female toiletries which is often over-looked and was nice to see. Place appeared nice and clean  had all the kitchen utilities I needed. Even brought me over some milk for a cup of tea!  Mosquitoes were apparently a bit of an issue  but I didn’t even notice as Steven had gone to measures to try and stop it from being a problem with sprays  creams ect. Had Everything for it and I wasn’t annoyed by one once. Just make sure you read about the smoking policy if you’re a smoker  as You must smoke on the street  off the property.  Was great for my quick stay. Thank you!"),
("2019-02-02", "16651655", "Caroline", "Great place to stay. Stephen is a great host."),
("2017-03-07", "16811226", "Weston", "The host canceled this reservation 14 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-03-20", "16811226", "Cedric", "Very good folks. Smooth & responsive communication. They made accommodations for me to check-in the early morning given my 7am-hour flight arrival. They had a welcome package waiting for me. Great location in Bondi -- 'not even a 5 minute walk to the beach. Even offered to provide information on local activities that I might be interested in. Great experience."),
("2018-05-13", "16811226", "Dovy", "The host canceled this reservation 11 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-02-05", "16827551", "Chris", "A very well kept house in birchgrove and only a few minutes walk to buses into the city or a slightly longer walk to the ferry. The check in and out process was managed really well. Good size with a nice courtyard space. A pleasure to stay there."),
("2017-02-09", "16827551", "Michelle", "A great place to stay. Close to Darling Street cafes and resturants."),
("2017-02-11", "16827551", "Mitch", "This place is awesome. Within minutes of Darling street  filled with cafes and restaurants. There was a cot for our 1 year old and even fresh milk for him in the fridge."),
("2017-02-18", "16827551", "Mexx", "Good stays and just walk a bit to darling street with many bars and restaurants as well as woolworth if you want buy stuffs for preparing your meal"),
("2017-02-27", "16827551", "David", "Brilliant 2 bedroom place perfect for a short stay in Balmain. The house is close to Darling street shops and there is a bus stop about 5 mins walk that goes directly into CBD. Theres also a ferry stop which is about 10mins walk and we used that once for an alternative route into town. Theres a pleasant park down the road with fantastic views onto harbour bridge from Birchgrove.The house itself is high spec with everything we needed and we loved using the courtyard for breakfast. Host was excellent and they installed an air con in the living room which worked out really well given the hot summer in Sydney at the time. Couldn't fault the place- highly recommended."),
("2017-03-21", "16827551", "Mark", "We really enjoyed our stay at the property in Birchgrove  and we were able  very easily  to make it our home for the 3 weeks we were there in late Summer....The property was very comfortable  well equipped  and had a great contemporary feel behind the unassuming facade... its location  is well positioned to explore Sydney  with great bus and ferry transport links all of which made our stay on the Balmain peninsular very enjoyable. The local area has many great shops  cafes  restaurants and bars to discover too... it has a lovely village feel.We were met at the property when we arrived by an agent  who made our arrival very easy  and then replied to our texts very promptly during our stay... He was also able to arrange a later check out time  which really helped with our onward journey.A great stay.... and highly recommended listing..."),
("2017-03-27", "16827551", "Phill", "Great place to stay  especially if you have kids."),
("2017-04-08", "16827551", "Brent", "Good location if you're looking for proximity to Balmain & transport to city. Good kids room downstairs.  A selection of toys too.  No problems with communication etc.Currently no curtains on the windows in the main bedroom which meant we didn't sleep well  hopefully the owner will remedy this."),
("2017-04-21", "16827551", "Nick", "Fantastic house  close to the main drag of Darling St for food and drink. Super quick into the city too. Lovely area and decor."),
("2017-05-01", "16827551", "Annemarie", "Great spot and cute house with all the essentials."),
("2017-05-10", "16827551", "Sonia", "In Sydney on business and so lovely to stay in such a beautiful  comfortable home away from home."),
("2017-05-18", "16827551", "Sonia", "Second week in Sydney for business  and enjoyed staying in this lovely home. The neighbourhood is just gorgeous and a calming respite after a busy day!"),
("2017-05-22", "16827551", "Anne", "We loved our stay in this lovely part of Sydney. So close to shops  restaurants and public transport. Lovely walks near the harbour. Accurately described and photographed. "),
("2017-05-25", "16827551", "Andrew", "Amazing house  secure  clean  comfortable  sensational location  wonderful communication. What more could you ask for from an Airbnb? Highly Recommended!!"),
("2017-05-28", "16827551", "Jérôme", "Travelled to Sydney for business and stayed here for 4 nights. The property was very modern and close to darling street. The whole process was seamless and would highly recommend!"),
("2017-05-30", "16827551", "Ian And Eliza", "The home is just lovely. Very comfortable and gorgeous design. Everything you would need is provided. Great location. Beautiful bedroom with sound blocking Windows and a very comfortable bed. Can't recommend the property highly enough. Try it out!! Eliza"),
("2017-06-03", "16827551", "Mel", "My stay at Alex and Kristina's home was great.  Extremely clean with everything you need. Spot on description and photos to what I experienced.  Geoff who will look after you is helpful and sweet.  Highly recommended oh and btw a fabulous location with great eateries and not far from east balmain ferry terminal."),
("2017-06-12", "16827551", "Nicole", "Had a great stay at Alex and Kristina's lovely place . Parking was great and everything wonderful Balmain had to offer was within walking distance . Thank you Alex and Kristina for allowing us to stay . Regards Nicole"),
("2017-06-17", "16827551", "Sonia", "This is a wonderful home and I've enjoyed my multiple stays here. Hosts have been attentive and great at communicating  making for an easy and wonderful stay."),
("2018-07-14", "16827551", "Ashraf", "Wonderful place and very good location  with everything we needed and more. We'll definitely come back! Can't recommend enough."),
("2018-07-27", "16827551", "Brett", "Cute family house with a bit of style and artsiness. 5-10mn walk to Darling St restaurants and grocer  15-20mn walk to ferry. Plenty of buses to take you into town. Quiet hood close to CBD with a clear hip factor but not trendy. Great communication with very nice property manager. Super clean. Only complaints would be the hard pillows (we both got stiff necks)  slippery bathtub (but it’s a great size!)  no bedroom door so not private if anyone’s downstairs (the stairs lead up to an open bedroom)  great heat but rises up to the bedroom so if you want to warm up the downstairs it gets really hot in the bedroom (hard to balance the two)  they’ve covered the bedroom window with a nice shade but it doesn’t cover the awkwardly shaped diagonal window so light comes in at one corner (we covered that spot with a pillow). Overall a good stay but does have its small quirks."),
("2017-10-24", "16813942", "Christine", "A very good place to stay  particularly if you are in Bundeena without a car as the shops are only 10 mins walk away.  Beach very close  with lovely swimming. Altogether a very peaceful place  apart from the noisy kookaburras!  Inclined to be a bit chilly in the mornings (October) until the sun was well up  as it is quite shady  so be sure to take a warm sweater.  A charming cottage and highly recommended."),
("2017-12-26", "16813942", "Alison", "Great open plan house  child friendly  close to the beach. Great place to stay."),
("2018-01-01", "16813942", "Patricia", "Very comfortable cottage in fantastic location.  Everything you need for a relaxing beach holiday"),
("2018-01-14", "16813942", "Kevin & Faith", "Quaint cottage within minutes walk of the quieter end of Bundeena Beach. Surprisingly spacious inside  good facilities (couple of things needing maintenance & cleaning  owner has feedback)  paddle board available is in great condition  restaurants/cafes all within walking distance offer great dine-in and takeway options. Beach is often calm and awesome for swimming. Bundeena Ferry over to Cronulla was great. Local IGA has everything you need. Great little place within an hour of Sydney so don't have to waste time travelling all day just to get away for a while. Cheryl communicates quickly and is helpful with questions.Thanks again Cheryl - Kevin & Faith"),
("2018-02-05", "16813942", "Peter", "It’s a lovely house in a fabulous spot only a minute’s walk from the beach. Very peaceful with a lovely breezy deck  perfect to enjoy a glass of wine while our son ran about. We had a very relaxing long weekend and would definitely come again!"),
("2018-02-11", "16813942", "Georgia", "Great location  just off the beach. Good bedrooms not adjoined. Simple house for a beach holiday. Thanks for the weekend away and opportunity to relax."),
("2018-02-18", "16813942", "Evan", "A great beach house in a secluded  quiet environment. Would love to stay here again. The beach is close  and you can hear the waves crashing all night. The village is a little limited in terms of restaurants  but Cronulla is only a half hour drive away. There's a few cafes and an IGA."),
("2018-02-25", "16813942", "Katie", "Cheryl’s beach house is absolutely stunning! You can hear the waves while you sit and enjoy breakfast on the deck. My friends and I had a wonderful stay. Cheryl was a very accommodating host  making check in/check out very easy. We would definitely come back!"),
("2018-04-15", "16813942", "Merryn", "What a wonderful spot to leave the city behind!  We could've stayed all day in the huge sunny window watching the kids play outside and having naps in the sunshine.  We loved that the house was located at the quieter end of the beach and it reminded me of holidays when I was a child.  If only we could've stayed longer!!"),
("2018-04-22", "16813942", "Rohena", "You have a beautiful place  Cheryl  with excellent finishing touches. We loved staying here and loved the round window. Easy walking to the beach  cafes  tennis  Aboriginal rock engravings  local cluba and IGA. Very relaxing  We look forward to coming again!"),
("2018-04-29", "16813942", "Joanna", "A fab home  2 minutes walk to a spectacular beach. Local shop close by too. We loved our getaway"),
("2018-05-06", "16813942", "Max", "Cheryl’s place is wonderful  we had a great time. Communication with her is very easy. Would recommend the place to anyone looking for a peaceful weekend in lovely Bundeena"),
("2018-05-30", "16813942", "Clement", "A great place & we will return after hearing some points have been attended to."),
("2018-06-10", "16813942", "Elana", "Had an amazing getaway! Cheryl's house couldn't get any better  loved it ! "),
("2018-06-23", "16813942", "Trish", "Fabulous location. So close to the beach and great bushwalking through the National Park. We loved having pre dinner drinks at the community club  whilst watching the sun set over the water. Absolutely beautiful."),
("2018-09-13", "16813942", "Sarah", "What a beautiful location and lovely house. The landscaped garden and proximity to the beach make this stay an absolute treat and the house is very family friendly  with a big sunny deck and lots of space and light. We really loved our stay."),
("2018-09-23", "16813942", "Tonia", "We enjoyed our relaxed weekend awayGreat peaceful location We loved the gorgeous round window"),
("2018-10-01", "16813942", "Calvin", "Great location (a 50m walk to the sand) and the large living room round window and expansive deck were highlights"),
("2018-10-06", "16813942", "Jess", "Great location and beautiful house. On the quieter side of town  just a walk across the road and through a path to the beach  this beach house is beautifully decorated and comfortable. Plenty of space for people in the large dining kitchen and the two bedrooms are apart enough to suit two couples. The surrounds  even in our wet weather  were breathtaking. Great escape from reality with little 3G/4G reception and no wifi!"),
("2018-10-14", "16813942", "Philippa", "Comfortable house   very close to the beach and fabulous round window!"),
("2018-11-03", "16813942", "Christine", "Great location for family holidays."),
("2018-12-08", "16813942", "Merilyn", "We have stayed at Cheryl's place before - it's a lovely relaxing break.  So close to Sydney but a world away from stress.  Bundeena is a family favourite holiday destination so we keep coming back often."),
("2018-12-17", "16813942", "Clare", "The host canceled this reservation 3 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2019-01-04", "16813942", "Jana", "A truly peaceful and tranquil place. We fell asleep with the sound of waves and a cool breeze and truly enjoyed the place and its beautiful garden.Fantastic for couples or families. The deck is suited for long dinners or breakfasts in the shade.The beach is only a walk around the corner.Basics such as spices and cooking oil are provided.  Will definitely be back one day. Thank you."),
("2019-01-13", "16813942", "Micaela", "Absolutely loved our stay at Cheryl’s. The location is amazing and the house is very cosy. We were 5 people staying which was a bit much for this house as the extra bed was more of a day bed. I would absolutely recommend staying here if you’re 4 people or less though. I’m sure I’ll be back!"),
("2019-01-20", "16813942", "Kirsty", "Great location and beautiful home."),
("2019-02-09", "16813942", "Nick", "Lovely spot and a fabulous heritage house with some charming features  big kitchen and nice outdoors. We stayed for a weekend with our two boys and all really enjoyed our family stay."),
("2019-02-17", "16813942", "Rachel", "What a gorgeous property in a spectacular location! We loved the beautiful garden views  lounging on the spacious deck and had everything we needed for a really comfortable beach holiday. This place is beautifully renovated  and it feels completely serene and secluded but is so close to the beach - you can hear the waves at night- and there are so many natural attractions nearby. We’ll definitely be back."),
("2017-01-11", "16708536", "Ross", "The host canceled this reservation 23 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-01-18", "16708536", "Kyle", "Perfect location! Easy access to the beach and the corso. Enjoyed the time spent there. Paul was an excellent host and had quick response times while communicating. Would stay here again and recommend to anyone else."),
("2017-01-19", "16708536", "Richard", "Fantastic location  no need for a car.  Walk to ferry  cafes  beaches and restaurants.  Quiet and comfortable. Great value."),
("2017-01-20", "16708536", "Adam", "Great location  friendly hosts. Definitely recommended!"),
("2017-01-26", "16708536", "Laudani", "Great location  clean apartment and  good hospitality.I suggest this accomodation."),
("2017-01-27", "16708536", "Gerard", "This is a great spot to stay in Manly. Central  clean and great value. Thanks Paul"),
("2017-01-28", "16708536", "Hannah", "Could not recommend this place enough! Was clean  comfortable and central to Manly. Paul was quick and efficient in all aspects of communication. Would definitely stay again when visiting the area."),
("2017-01-29", "16708536", "Antony", "Nice clean place was perfect place to rest after several trips to the beach. Nice place perfectly suited to my family of 4 (my two kids are still haps to share a bed)."),
("2017-03-04", "16708536", "Andrew", "Great stay."),
("2017-03-05", "16708536", "Dan", "Clean  comfortable  well appointed apartment conveniently located to downtown Manly.  A very short walk to the beach  the ferry  and all there is to do in the area.  A pleasure to stay there."),
("2017-03-06", "16708536", "Jessica", "A big thank you to Paul and letting my friends and I stay for one night! Amazing location in a cute  tidy apartment settled in the heart of Manly! Wish we had more time we would've stayed longer! Would recommend to anyone :)"),
("2017-03-10", "16708536", "Tanja", "Great location and really clean apartment. Paul was a lovely host  met us at check in and was available on the mobile if we ever needed anything. Would recommend it! "),
("2017-03-11", "16708536", "Joanne", "Paul's place was in a fantastic location  very walkable to everything! The apartment was clean and well presented and we appreciated the snacks that were left for us when we were in need!! Paul was very helpful and communicated quickly and clearly. Would stay there again for sure!"),
("2017-03-14", "16708536", "Lachlan", "An excellent little flat- very comfortable feel.  It was great to come 'home too'.Paul's place has understated heritage appeal.  The scale and function of the apartment has changed little since its (Phone number hidden by Airbnb) s(?) construction. But the fittings and appliances are all 21st Century. So visitors attain comfort by walking through the door at the same time as experiencing a sense of the past.  This is an experience that should be cultivated."),
("2017-03-18", "16708536", "Mel", "Paul's place was absolutely perfect. A few minutes walk to shops  ferry  bars and restaurants. Clean  spacious apartment with everything you could want for your stay. Would definitely stay again. Thanks!"),
("2017-03-22", "16708536", "Jan", "Great location  well equipped and really good beds. Very friendly and immediate communications  really easy handling. Thanks for the juice and the coffee in the morning  Paul! I will be back."),
("2017-03-27", "16708536", "Susan", "It was central and perfect for our stay"),
("2017-03-28", "16708536", "Noella", "The host canceled this reservation 80 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-04-01", "16708536", "Chris", "Paul's unit is perfect. Clean and comfortable and central. We had a wonderful weekend and will book it again."),
("2017-04-04", "16708536", "Elissa", "Paul's place is in a fantastic spot right near the wharf  beach and shops. It was perfect for us to use as a base to explore the area  and to jump on a ferry for trips to the city  the zoo and more. Our bed was very comfy and - despite being in the heart of Manly - we slept without an issue. Our kids (8 and 11) were happy to share the other bed and had great sleeps too. Thanks Paul for the prompt communications and the lovely little place."),
("2017-04-06", "16708536", "Mike", "Paul was very helpful and his place is in a great location  perfect for exploring Manly and Sydney. "),
("2017-04-08", "16708536", "Romana", "Great unit in the heart of Manly."),
("2017-04-11", "16708536", "Rebekah", "Paul's place was very central. We had a great stay. The apartment is large  comfortable and very clean. Centrally located and in a beautiful old building. "),
("2017-04-13", "16708536", "Dessica", "Paul was a friendly and helpful host. The apartment is strategic-located  walking distance from Manly Wharf. There are wi-fi  towels  shampoo and soap  and many more. I even can get an early check-in and a bit late check-out. Thank you so much Paul!"),
("2017-04-15", "16708536", "Solange", "Apartment was great. Very well equipped. Great stay."),
("2017-04-20", "16708536", "Nicholas", "Great location with full facilities"),
("2017-04-24", "16708536", "Daniel", "This is a great apartment as a base to explore Manly and Sydney. A simple but clean apartment with everything we needed. The biggest plus is its location being so close to Manly Wharf and great restaurants and cafes."),
("2017-05-14", "16708536", "Grada", "Het is een top locatie als je naar Sydney wilt dicht bij openbaar vervoer en strand. De woning is geschikt voor 4 personen. Niet overdreven luxe maar een goede basis woning. Wij hebben genoten de drie oma's."),
("2017-05-21", "16708536", "Chris", "Our stay at Pauls place was very enjoyable. It was clean and comfortable and very central. Only minutes to the Manly Wharf  shops and restaurants. I would definitely stay there again. Paul was very easy to communicate with."),
("2017-05-25", "16708536", "Aaron", "Perfect distance from the wharf and awesome place to stay"),
("2017-05-27", "16708536", "Rosie", "Good base for exploring Byron bay!"),
("2017-05-27", "16708536", "Wade & Renee", "Great location. Walking distance to wharf  cafes beach shops. Nice and clean. Everything we needed for a family of four. "),
("2017-06-02", "16708536", "Nicolas", "Great small apartment for 4 people to enjoy all the things Manly has to offer. The convenient location close to the wharf makes it very easy to get to the city. Very nice overall!"),
("2017-06-16", "16708536", "Pia", "The location of this Air bnb is perfect close to all shops  the wharf and the corso. You can even see the ocean from the bathroom and kitchen. We really enjoy staying at this apartment. "),
("2017-09-04", "16708536", "Sara", "Great location and such a cozy place! Paul is a very helpful host and responded all questions immediately. A note to people who would stay there on a Saturday night: be extra careful parking along the street as the place is very close to a popular bar and the Manly wharf. Someone used a marker (thank god not a permanent marker) to sign a signature on my white car and now I have to send the car to polish to be able to get that off completely. There is a public car park next to the place offering overnight parking."),
("2017-09-10", "16708536", "Ruth", "I travelled from Brisbane to Sydney for a function in Manly and the location of Paul's place was fantastic. I was able to easily manage my luggage from the Manly ferry to the accommodation. Clean  neat  and all that was required."),
("2017-09-16", "16708536", "Megan", "We had a wonderful stay at Paul's place. It's within easy walking distance of The Corso  the beach and the ferry. The house is lovely and open with lots of natural light. The beds are comfortable  we got a great nights sleep! The kitchen is old but has everything you need. Our nearly 2 year old is pretty busy and was interested in everything at her eye level  we brought some of our own toys and the tv was great for distraction! There are some great playgrounds nearby and the beach is great for the little ones. Paul is very easy to communicate with and replies quickly with any questions. Would recommend to couples or small families with slightly older children than ours."),
("2017-09-20", "16708536", "Paul", "This delightful unit is in a fantastic location at Manly  only metres from The Corso. The unit was clean and very welcoming. Both beds were comfortable and there was an abundance of bed linen and blankets. Communication with Paul was prompt and the possession of the unit key was easy. It was a pleasure to stay here and we look forward to a return visit."),
("2017-09-24", "16708536", "Bianca", "Great property. Super close to everything  so could walk everywhere. Beds were comfy  was nice to have kitchen and washing/dryer facilities. Apartment complex was quiet and street was reasonably quiet at night. We really enjoyed our stay here. Just be aware of the spring loaded bathroom window  it tried to take my finger!  Would definitely stay here again."),
("2017-09-26", "16708536", "Katharina", "We had a great time. Location was fantastic close to beach and ferries. Very family friendly. We had everything we needed for a stress free stay close to all the highlights of Sydney."),
("2017-09-30", "16708536", "Louise", "Great place to stay  perfect location close to all amenities  super clean and easy to locate. We had a great stay! "),
("2017-10-02", "16708536", "Fiona", "Great apartment very close to everything you need in Manly without all the noise. Apartment came with all the basics (sheets  towels  parking permit  shampoo  tea) and it’s a short walk to the nearest supermarket  transport  beach  bars  takeaways etc. Apartment has two main bedrooms  kitchen  bathroom  living room but also a little sunroom for extra space so it has a lovely feel to it. We very much enjoyed our stay and would happily come back again. Thank you Paul."),
("2017-10-07", "16708536", "Ross", "What an amazing and spacious apartment in a wonderful area of Manly. So close to everything and also so quiet. Paul was fantastic with his communication and very welcoming. Probably better suited to families with kids older than our 1 and 2.5 due to the stairs but this didn't take away from our trip or the apartment at all."),
("2017-10-18", "16708536", "Kelly", "We had such a great time! Super handy to shops  beach  buses  nice little kitchen  great to have a washing machine and dryer as well. Apartment was just the right size for our family of 4."),
("2017-10-22", "16708536", "Reannan", "Great location. Apartment is neat and tidy. Host communicates well and with quick responses. Would stay again."),
("2017-10-27", "16708536", "Holly", "Beautiful place  close to everything  super clean and a quite area and a homely feel! 10/10 would stay again Would of liked the option to check out later in the day but other than that great"),
("2017-10-28", "16708536", "Janine", "Unit is located close to all of Manlys attractions but in a reasonably quiet spot. No parking but carpark (paid) located just around the corner An older style unit but  very clean and comfortable."),
("2017-11-04", "16708536", "Amy", "Paul’s apartment is in a fantastic  location if you’re wanting easy access to everything Manly has to offer  as well as public transport to other areas of Sydney whilst still being far enough away from the hustle and bustle to enjoy some peace.Apartment suitable for a family or two couples with two separate bedrooms.An older style apartment but very clean and comfortable. Great value for money."),
("2017-11-06", "16708536", "David", "Handy place close to beach and shops. Older style but has some character. Checkin process was easy. Thanks Paul"),
("2017-11-08", "16708536", "Ina", "Great clean place with anything one could ask for. Best location for anything. Close to everything incl. public transport  cafes  restaurants  beaches! Wow. You feel very spoiled staying there."),
("2017-11-22", "16708536", "Stephanie", "Great location. Clean and affordable. Host very prompt with replying and accomodating for requests. Would highly recommend"),
("2017-11-22", "16708536", "Isabelle", "Paul was a great host. Great communication. The unit was ideally located close to wharf and beach. We travelled with 2 small kids. No mention of the flat being on the 2nd floor. A bit tricky with the kids getting up and down. The apartment was cosy and well suited to small kids to crawl around. However a bit dusty on the floors and carpets for the baby who was crawling all over the place. If it's a pad near the wharf of manly you are after this is it."),
("2017-11-24", "16708536", "Ingunn", "Place is as described; conveniently located to everything you need and easy to find. The apartment is very cute and spacious. We had a great time! Highly recommend Paul's apartment to anyone considering staying in Manly :) Thanks for hosting us!"),
("2017-11-27", "16708536", "Kyle", "We originally booked two nights to stay. Unfortunately  the first night we stayed we killed several cockroaches inside the apartment. We killed a large one in the room between the two bedrooms  several small/baby ones in the kitchen  including in the utensil drawer  on the floor  and on the ceiling. Also  a medium sized cockroach got away inside the kitchen drawers. We all were very uncomfortable sleeping there that night. We had to find other accommodations for the next night. We communicated with the owner about the cockroach issue but he says it’s not his fault bugs come in from the outside. He also stated that he had pest control come a week ago. Unfortunately  that didn’t seem to do much for his apartment’s cleanliness  and then became our problem. We were not refunded any amount upon first reaching out to the owner and then also reaching out to Airbnb. My advice is take more pictures than I did. My initial thoughts when seeing a cockroach in the apartment was to kill it  in hindsight I should have taken pictures each time before killing them."),
("2017-11-29", "16708536", "Andrew", "Great location to manly night life"),
("2017-12-07", "16708536", "Lesley", "Great flat - 2 decent sized bedrooms  nice living room and well equipped kitchen and really great location. Recommended!"),
("2017-12-10", "16708536", "Brian", "Great location. Very tidy place. Good communication with Paul. Very pleased"),
("2017-12-13", "16708536", "Graeme", "Great place  easy to find and very central"),
("2017-12-17", "16708536", "Keith", "The location is excellent - so close to the wharf and the beach. The apartment is comfortable and quiet and has everything that you need."),
("2017-12-23", "16708536", "Tony", "Location and apartment are fantastic. Everything was clean  tidy and ready for us. Paul is a great host. Would highly recommend staying here if in the Manly area."),
("2017-12-23", "16708536", "Laura", "Paul's place is in a perfect location for Manly  walking distance to everything we needed. It was clean & tidy & Paul answered our queries very quickly. We would definitely recommend."),
("2017-12-31", "16708536", "Simone", "The location of Paul's apartment is perfect. It's extremely close to the Manly Wharf and a smaller beach which was great for the kids. Paul was very responsive and helpful. We had a great holiday and were really happy we chose Paul's apartment for our stay."),
("2018-01-01", "16708536", "Kuljeet", "Paul was very accommodating in regards to our requirements.   Location is walking distance to all major amenities; highly recommend this locale."),
("2018-01-04", "16708536", "Kelli", "Fantastic position in manly - super clean and have everything we needed. Comfy beds and plenty of room for my husband and I and 2 teenage girls! Will definitely stay again!"),
("2018-01-07", "16708536", "Steve", "Great appartment in an amazing location"),
("2018-01-11", "16708536", "Christie", "Very good address  not far from everything : the wharf  the beach  the shops  but still very quiet  perfect ! The apartment is a bit old but still charming."),
("2018-01-13", "16708536", "Rachel", "Pauls apartment is devine. Great location  clean and fun. Just if you have a baby get a lighter pram as you are on the top floor ."),
("2018-01-14", "16708536", "Debbie", "Perfect location close to both the ferry and beach. Very clean apartment. Great communication. Happy to have families."),
("2018-01-17", "16708536", "Michael", "Brilliant location and a lovely apartment. Host Paul was very responsive and a pleasure to deal with. Unhesitatingly recommend this apartment."),
("2018-01-20", "16708536", "Chantelle", "Our first Air BnB did not disappoint. The apartment was clean & homely. It was in walking distance from the beach and restaurants in a quiet street. It was the perfect size for the amount of guests we had! It was hard to leave the place!"),
("2018-01-22", "16708536", "Emma", "Great apartment  right near manly wharf beach. You can walk everywhere. Photos don’t do it justice!"),
("2018-02-02", "16708536", "Philippe", "Très bien situé  ce logement atypique nécessite des travaux."),
("2018-02-03", "16708536", "Ryan", "Apartment was central to everything and very spacious"),
("2018-02-07", "16708536", "Selby", "Paul is a great host  quick to reply and easy to talk to. His place is clean and spacious and right near the main strip in Manly. Food and shops are close by and I didn't have any difficulty figuring out places to eat. It's proximity to the beach is great too!"),
("2018-02-10", "16708536", "Judy", "This is a great apartment  accurately represented in a perfect location near the ferry wharf at Manly.It was clean  well equipped and we were able to get an early check-in.Communication was prompt.Customers do need to be warned  however  that there is a MAJOR construction site next door  and the noise does severely impact the experience."),
("2018-02-10", "16708536", "Renae", "Great location  clean and a lot of space"),
("2018-02-15", "16708536", "Brian", "It is an old building with three flights of stairs to the (Website hidden by Airbnb) is difficult although Paul does provide a street parking permit for when you get a spot.The apartment is old but pleasant. Sleeping was very hot and uncomfortablebecause of the time of year with no air conditioning or fans.Location is excellent only a short walk to the ferry terminal  beaches  shops  cafes and restaurants."),
("2018-02-15", "16708536", "Nicole", "Great location and good value for money. Paul’s an awesome host and communicates quickly about anything you might need. One of our fav Manly stays"),
("2018-02-16", "16708536", "Ana", "Very clean! Close to everything and comfy beds! Yay!!!!"),
("2018-02-22", "16708536", "Elena", "Paul’s place was beautiful and in the perfect location and up until early check in things were perfect. Unfortunately he kept quiet about the fact that earth moving works were performed right in front our window Mon-Fri 7:30am4:00pm. The house was shaking and you could not understand your own words.He gave us one night free  but we would have appreciated honesty instead. It was not a relaxing stay."),
("2018-02-25", "16708536", "Sonia", "Great location to Manly wharf  corso and places to eat out. Very comfortable unit with lots of light and cool breezes."),
("2018-02-28", "16708536", "Claudette", "The apartment was very spacious and in a great location to walk to both the beach and the wharf. Paul was very swift with communication however we would have appreciated a heads up about the building work next door. Great value for such a central location - the bathroom and kitchen are very outdated but work just fine"),
("2018-03-02", "16708536", "Michele", "A very comfortable and pleasant apartment in a terrific location  a few minutes walk from the ferry  the beach   and the Manly restaurants and shops."),
("2018-03-08", "16708536", "Carol", "Amazing central location right near manly wharf. Spacious apartment with lots of facilities including washing machine and dryer. Comfortable beds. Was great base for our stay with a four year old"),
("2018-03-12", "16708536", "Rebecca", "The Magical Manly Earthquake Experience.We woke each morning in our comfortable bed singing lines from classic tunes like ""Shake  rattle and roll"" or ""I feel the earth move under my feet"".If you like an early start  vibrating beds  mirrors  windows  loud noise and a front row seat to view earthmoving and construction machines in action then this is the place for you!Each morning the show begins at 7AM right outside your kitchen and bathroom windows and continues until 4PM. You will see the amazing performance up close. A large sandpit next door with a huge grey silo in the middle vibrating and spewing out cement dust like a beautiful smoke machine. Enjoy watching the excavators  cement trucks and hard hat wearing performers as they do their thing. As you are so close to the action  the sound quality is excellent - it is very loud. You'll need to book soon as work has already started and this experience may only last until 2020.The manager/owner of the apartment did not warn us about this exciting daily event happening next door. As you can imagine it was a wonderful surprise for our tired family and really lifted our spirits after a long flight  taxi and ferry ride!On a serious note  you will want to get out of the apartment early each day and start exploring the beautiful area of Manly and other parts of Sydney. It was a real bonus to return each evening to find our apartment building was still standing  had stopped vibrating and the noise had ended.If you are still reading and are seriously considering staying at this place then there's something wrong with you but please  read on. The sheets and towels seem clean but the cleaners would benefit from attending vacuum  sweeping and dusting courses. The key pickup location is not secure. The apartment was older but spacious with high ceilings and a few cracks in the walls (not sure if this was caused by the current earth works/construction work).Good times and memories that will last forever!"),
("2018-03-15", "16708536", "Shari", "Great place with a very convenient location to the Manly Ferry.  Comfy beds!  Super host too boot.  Be aware they they are building a new apartment complex next door so there will be some construction noise in the morning.  I’m an early riser so that was fine but for others it could be an annoyance if you didn’t know.  Will definitely stay again."),
("2018-03-16", "16708536", "Kim", "Excellent location and great communication very clean and lovely apartment thank you we would stay again"),
("2018-03-19", "16708536", "Paul", "A great space in the heart of Manly  one of the best suburbs in Sydney. While it is an older style apartment it  very spacious  comfortable  and has all the facilities you will need for a short or even long term stay. We've stayed in a few air bnb apartments in Europe and this one is certainly up to standard. Recommended!"),
("2018-03-20", "16708536", "Jody", "Stayed here for one night as we had friends over from England and wanted to show them Manly and have a few drinks. Can’t fault it in anyway at all. Location was perfect  right in the centre of the high street  clean  tidy and the beds were very comfy. Couldn’t have been happier with the value for money and Paul was very quick at responding and keeping us updated. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-03-21", "16708536", "Zoe", "It is a great location. Near to transport. Near to restaurants."),
("2018-03-23", "16708536", "Trudi", "A great space with easy access to beautiful Manly"),
("2018-03-25", "16708536", "Robin", "Very good value and great location. Very comfortable and spacious and great for 2 couples."),
("2018-03-28", "16708536", "Reuben", "Great location at great price with good communicating host"),
("2018-03-30", "16708536", "Katy", "Great location so convenient to Manly wharf  beaches  restaurants and shops. Clean  neat and well appointed. Hard to find a car park around the flat but parking permit available if you do. All in all we loved our stay. Thanks"),
("2018-04-02", "16708536", "Stephanie", "Paul's place was perfect  close to the beach and had everything we needed. Paul was extremely easy to communicate with and was very accommodating when we required an extra mattress. Check in and out was easy. It was great to have a parking permit as we left the car and walked everywhere during our stay. Thank you Paul."),
("2018-04-08", "16708536", "Kate", "Can't beat the location."),
("2018-04-13", "16708536", "Georgina", "Thank you Paul  perfect position  short walk  to the wharf and beach . Lovely flat with everything we needed and felt very safe and at home ."),
("2018-04-16", "16708536", "Vivian", "Paul was very helpful and response my questions quickly. His apartment is clean and tidy. We had good time at his place."),
("2018-04-19", "16708536", "Jennifer", "Enjoyed our stay. Thanks Paul"),
("2018-04-23", "16708536", "Nigel", "We had a brilliant long weekend in Manly and absolutely loved the apartment - very spacious  clean and we loved the older style feel to it. As I am sure everyone is aware  the location is perfect to enjoy all of Manly's many highlights  and could not recommend higher!"),
("2018-05-01", "16708536", "Annette", "It would be hard to find a more convenient space to stay  two minutes from buses  ferry and beaches in fabulous Manly.  Everything you need for a comfortable stay is provided and cafes  coffee shops and restaurants surround you as well as stunning walks.  Would return in a heart beat.  Thank you  Paul."),
("2018-05-06", "16708536", "Peita", "Well-appointed  clean and very central  Paul’s place is a short walk to everything in Manly. My second time staying here  and I will definitely rebook. You need to be fit to climb the stairs with your luggage to the second floor; if this is not a problem for you  highly recommended."),
("2018-05-07", "16708536", "Shona", "Would suit two couples very well."),
("2018-05-13", "16708536", "Peter & Lea", "Paul was a great host.  Good communication. Great location. Will stay again next time in Manly"),
("2018-05-20", "16708536", "Paul", "Had a a great stay  the location is perfect. Quick response to emails."),
("2018-05-24", "16708536", "Kitty", "Awesome spot  a lot more room than we expected and great location. Really enjoyed our stay  thanks! "),
("2018-06-02", "16708536", "Robyn And David", "Paul's place is very central to the Ferry  shops and cafes. The heater was cosy and beds & pillows very comfortable. Would recommend anyone going to Manly to look at Pauls place"),
("2018-06-04", "16708536", "Monica", "Clean and tidy apartment  comfy beds and everything required for a short stay  and the apartment block was quiet. Very handy location  close to ferry  beach and Manly shops. I'm sure we will look to book again next time we visit!"),
("2018-06-16", "16708536", "Josh", "Easy communication and check in  and a superb location just minutes from tbe ferry and main township"),
("2018-06-17", "16708536", "Olivia", "My partner and I loved our stay. Check in and out was easy and Paul got back to us straight away when we had questions. Great location. We would definitely stay here again :)"),
("2018-06-18", "16708536", "Ollie", "Easy  convenient  value. All good"),
("2018-06-24", "16708536", "Erin", "Paul's place was wonderful! Perfect cosy sunny spot for a weekend winter getaway in Sydney! Location could not have been more central or convenient to everything in Manly!"),
("2018-07-02", "16708536", "Anne-Marie", "Great location and easy to walk to anywhere. Paul was an excellent host"),
("2018-07-10", "16708536", "Robyn", "A very comfortable and well equipped apartment  in an old dark brick building. Fantastic location and a spacious  surprisingly light  sunny interior.Lots of touches to make your stay easy  good bathroom and kitchen  spacious bedrooms.It really was living like a local."),
("2018-07-15", "16708536", "Gregory", "Excellent location in the centre of Manly. Walking distance to the beach and other main attractions. Spacious and comfortable apartment. Paul was very friendly and helpful."),
("2018-07-28", "16708536", "Elizabeth", "Paul’s place is in a great location  however if you have children or a car this may not be the space for you. Parking is virtually impossible and the space is small for more than a couple."),
("2018-08-11", "16708536", "Terrence", "Super geoplaced near the wharf"),
("2018-08-15", "16708536", "Sam", "Great place  would recommend staying here "),
("2018-08-20", "16708536", "Russell", "plenty of tea bags. close to ferry and buses"),
("2018-08-22", "16708536", "Suzie", "Perfect location in an older style apartment. We stayed here and really enjoyed it. Was a bit chilly at night but delightfully sunny during the day."),
("2018-08-26", "16708536", "Dave", "Great spot and great apartment"),
("2018-08-29", "16708536", "Dominic", "Paul's communication was great and the location of the property is good - very central within Manly. Decor felt quite dated but a good option for somewhere to lay the head and explore the area!"),
("2018-08-31", "16708536", "Steve", "Sweet as"),
("2018-09-02", "16708536", "Mark", "Excellent location. Paul was excellent to deal with."),
("2018-09-04", "16708536", "Ru", "Good location & quick response!"),
("2018-09-08", "16708536", "Suzanne", "Great location  close to everything. Parking difficult but if you can snag a park  Paul helps out with a permit. Clean and tidy  lovely little place."),
("2018-09-17", "16708536", "Rob", "excellent location in Manly so close to the wharf. A brilliant place to stay!"),
("2018-09-23", "16708536", "Bruce", "The location is very convenient to everything Manly has to offer and the ferries to Circular Quay (Sydney CBD). The combination of seaside and bayside is very attractive. The apartment is value for money and parking is included."),
("2018-09-26", "16708536", "Juliana", "Paul’s place is in the perfect location. Walking distance to the wharf  restaurants  shops and beach. Good size apartment and met all of our needs."),
("2018-10-01", "16708536", "Jo", "Great little apartment with everything you need in the perfect location.  Communication with Paul was easy and quick."),
("2018-10-08", "16708536", "Geoff", "Comfortable apartment & close to everything in Manly."),
("2018-10-14", "16708536", "Jono", "Great Location and Good Communication from the Host. A few stairs to go up  and parking can be a little annoying  but all and all a great place."),
("2018-10-16", "16708536", "Kim", "very close to shops and restaurants"),
("2018-10-18", "16708536", "John", "This such a great place to stay. Situated so close to everything. This is the second time I’ve stayed here and am sure we will be back next year. Thank you Paul"),
("2018-10-19", "16708536", "Danielle", "Amazing location and host! Would definitely stay here again"),
("2018-10-21", "16708536", "Megan", "Excellent location  close to corso around the corner and sweet little apartment"),
("2018-10-24", "16708536", "Laura Jade", "The photos of Paul's place don't do it justice. It's bigger and nicer than it looks and right in the heart of Manly (with beach views from the kitchen). We couldn't fault a single thing. Just a heads up  parking can be tricky but Paul provides his permit and it is on the third floor which wasn't a problem for us or our three young kids but may be if you are injured or have mobility issues. We loved our stay though."),
("2018-11-04", "16708536", "Olivia", "We had an awesome stay at Paul's place! It was only a few mins walk down to the ferry wharf or to the corso - fantastic location. The apartment was really clean and had all of the amenities you needed. What you see is what you get."),
("2018-11-06", "16708536", "Ziad", "Great location!!!!"),
("2018-11-12", "16708536", "Andrew", "Great location."),
("2018-11-13", "16708536", "Paul", "Great location  large space and helpful host!"),
("2018-11-15", "16708536", "Nicole", "Great unit close to everything. We stayed several times and it’s great value for money in Manly"),
("2018-11-21", "16708536", "Alan-Jane", "Paul's place is in a super location near the ferry and the corso. It was perfect for our requirements  and I highly recommend.  Thx Paul"),
("2018-11-27", "16708536", "Charmian", "We stayed at Paul’s place in Manly for three nights. It’s a comfortable  clean two bed apartment with pretty much all the amenities you’d need. The location was perfect - very close to shops  restaurants  the Wharf (where you can catch the ferry to the city) and a short walk to the beach. The street the apartment is on was quiet. There is major building works going on next door but it was on the side of the bathroom and kitchen so didn’t bother us too much. Parking on the street can be a bit tricky and as it’s a one way street you can find yourself going round in circles looking for a space.Paul was quick to respond to all my messages. I was hoping for a bit more flexibility with checking in and out times as we arrived very early to Sydney and had to leave late but there was no negotiating on this. Luckily we had friends in the city who helped us out on both days.Overall we had a pleasant stay. I would recommend the apartment if you want to stay in a laid back area of Sydney  close to a beach but still with good transportation into the city."),
("2018-11-29", "16708536", "James", "Very well located apartment. A little dated. Some minor easily solved cleanliness issues but overall would recommend for a short break."),
("2018-12-01", "16708536", "Allison", "The host canceled this reservation 3 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-12-01", "16708536", "Julie", "What a perfect place. Clean and tidy  great amenities  close to public parking if required  short walk to the beach and shops."),
("2018-12-03", "16708536", "James", "Nice and clean  great location."),
("2018-12-09", "16708536", "Wendy", "had a great stay t Pauls apartment. Very close to the Corso and the Wharf.  very clean  plenty of towels  pillows etc    great seperate lounge room  very quiet street and just perfect for a week away in Manly"),
("2018-12-13", "16708536", "Lisa", "You can not beat the location !Convenient to everything!"),
("2018-12-14", "16708536", "Nadia", "An ideal location to really experience all of the beauty Manly has to offer. Tricky getting a park but  you don’t need a car as the city is also a quick ferry ride away."),
("2018-12-25", "16708536", "Julia", "Nice apartment in the heart of Manly. Just 3 minutes walk from the ferry and a couple of minutes walk to beaches and shops. Definitely would recommend a stay!"),
("2018-12-27", "16708536", "Julie", "Fantastic location in beautiful Manly."),
("2019-01-03", "16708536", "Chris", "Excellent location - about a 2 min walk from the wharf  shops  restaurants and 5 mins to the main beach. The apartment was clean and beds comfortable. Paul was very quick to respond to any messages. Would highly recommend"),
("2019-01-04", "16708536", "Chris", "Couldn't fault this place  amazing location. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2019-01-06", "16708536", "Minna", "Great location! Within walking distance to the Manly harbour ferry. The place was very clean and the bed was comfy."),
("2019-01-09", "16708536", "Waraporn", "Nice  clean and simple style unit  we felt very comfortable  all  rooms are good size.Close to transport  shopping and restaurants. Walk distance to all beaches around manly  the closer one take few minutes.Paul is promptly respond to the request  easy instructions to follow.The place is a part of our good memories in Manly trip  we definitely come to stay again.Only thing we think the check in is a bit late 3.00PM and check out time 10.00AMAll over I give excellent level."),
("2019-01-14", "16708536", "Grant", "Amazing location! Very prompt replies - just overall a wonderfulexperience - thank you!!!"),
("2019-01-18", "16708536", "Grant", "Great central location. Paul left a few little extras in the pantry and fridge  which was most appreciated.  Place was tidy and larger than expected.  Thanks Paul"),
("2019-01-19", "16708536", "Courtney", "Positioned in the heart of Manly  walking distance to everything you could need (beach  wharf  shops  restaurants). The apartment was spacious and allowed for 4 people to fit very comfortably. Would highly recommend anyone looking at booking Paul’s apartment to just hit book!"),
("2019-01-25", "16708536", "Adam", "Thanks for the stay  great location"),
("2019-01-26", "16708536", "Grace", "A great place to stay in Manly.. next time we will stay longer!"),
("2019-01-27", "16708536", "Dong", "Extremely good location and very friendly responsive host. Very tidy apartment. Parking space on the street can be hard to find but a Wilson carpark is almost next door."),
("2019-02-05", "16708536", "Robyn", "Well located. Some unavoidable noise from the large construction site next door."),
("2019-02-07", "16708536", "James", "The flat would be great for a couple and is well equipped. It is very central and close to everything you need."),
("2019-02-09", "16708536", "Howard", "Great thanks lace close to both beaches good price would stay here again"),
("2019-02-10", "16708536", "Miroslav", "great place and awesome location"),
("2019-02-18", "16708536", "Tara", "Great place in a great location in Manly! The apartment is well stocked and the host was great to communicate with. Check in was easy and also flexible since no other guests were staying the night before we arrived. Thanks Paul!"),
("2019-02-21", "16708536", "Georgina", "A charming flat in an amazing location in Manly.Had everything we needed for our stay  travelling with 2 children aged 7 and 3.A great space to base ourselves for a few days  with access to several beaches within a very short walk which was ideal and close to shops and restaurants. Yet still in a quiet street so no nighttime disturbances.Would love to stay again when next visiting Oz.Thanks Paul for being a great host."),
("2019-03-01", "16708536", "Tatiana", "Great place  great location and great host!"),
("2019-03-02", "16708536", "Jacqueline", "Would definitely recommend! Excellent location  lovely  light-filled space  super clean apartment including the linen  comfy beds  well-equipped kitchen  and street parking available not too far away. Paul responds to messages really quickly too. Thank you!"),
("2018-01-01", "16914825", "Robin", "Me and my girlfriend stayed eleven nights at Andreas place and we were really sad to leave. Very good room with a nice own bathroom. Also a nice kitchen with a big living room. We really liked the gym  pool and the sauna because they are very clean and almost always empty. So you can relax really well because you are almost always alone. We used it almost every day!The location is perfect as it is only 5 minutes by feet to many different bus stops  coles  restaurants and bars. The bus takes you within 10 minutes to the city but you can walk there aswell. Andrea is a very friendly person and answered always very fast when we had any questions and her roommates are also very friendly and helpful. I have nothing bad to say to the place of Andrea and we wish we stayed longer."),
("2018-03-07", "16914825", "Cristina", "We had a nice stay  the place is close to public transport which brings you downtown in 10-15min. Andrea's room and ensuite bathroom were very clean. Andrea was very nice and acomodating  I would definitely stay there again."),
("2017-02-26", "16978814", "Annie", "My partner and I had an amazing experience a Daniel's place! The house and room were both clean and comfortable. Laura (his housemate) and him made sure we had everything we needed  respecting our privacy and being very open during encounters. They are both very laid back and enjoyable. We stayed there for a month and ended up becoming great friends  they are very lovely! "),
("2017-01-30", "16898275", "Johanna", "Trent is a really nice guy who will help you in any way he can.When we arrived the place was a bit dirty but that wasn't Trents fault because he had been awayand his apartment had been out for lease.And he made a really good job with fixing everything so we could have a happy stay!And we did:)The location is great and the apartment is lovely:)The room is pretty small but it didn't bother us at all.Can recommend this place to anyone  close to Bondi and to small hidden beautiful beaches around the coastline."),
("2017-02-06", "16898275", "Jutta", "It's a very nice location  Trend was a very kindly young man. We have all we need. Thank you Trend  we hope we come back again"),
("2017-02-18", "16898275", "Luke", "Trent was a great host. The apartment is situated in a beautiful  quiet and peaceful part of Rose Bay. The apartment was extremely clean. We felt right at home and even shared a glass of red with our friendly host. Highly recommend. "),
("2017-02-25", "16898275", "Jack", "Excellent host really friendly and accommodating. My girlfriend and I really enjoyed are stay here great location plus it was a nice change to the busy hostel life we are used to"),
("2017-03-04", "16898275", "Vicki", "Trents place is in a lovely quiet tree lined street in Rose Bay. It is tastefully decorated and very comfortable. We didn't get to meet Trent  but he was great with his communication and how to check in. I would recommend it for a short stay convenient to activities in the eastern suburbs. "),
("2017-03-20", "16898275", "Jan", "Trent's place is located in a beautiful street meters away from bus stops  café's  golfcourse  etc. We had a great time staying here as it was clean  convenient and cosy. Trent is lovely and will give you all the help or space you need. Highly recommended!!"),
("2017-04-12", "16898275", "Christian", "Trents place is an awesome experience while staying in Sydney. Its tidy  organised and just a short walk to the beach and the ferry. Trent is super cool and makes sure you will have an awesome time. His place is located in a quite neighbourhood. Definitely recommend this place! :)"),
("2017-04-14", "16898275", "Leanne", "Trent is a great host. Very friendly and communication was easy. His place is just as described  clean  bright  airy and located in a beautiful area. Thanks Trent. Highly recommend!"),
("2017-05-13", "16898275", "Riley", "Overall the place was great. Located in a beautiful neighborhood very close to a few shops and restaurants. The apartment was very clean and nice to stay in"),
("2017-05-27", "16898275", "Milena", "Trent's apartment is accurate to the listing and photos - a light and airy space in rose bay close to the city via the nearby ferry. Check-in was a breeze - definitely recommend this place for a stay in Sydney!"),
("2017-07-08", "16898275", "Kerry", "We had a fabulous stay at Trent's place. Conveniently located to cafe's  shops  beaches  transport and parks. Would definitely stay there again. Thanks for a lovely stay! "),
("2017-08-21", "16898275", "Karen", "Great place to stay exactly how described. As a first time Airbnb was a little apprehensive but I needn't have worried as Trent was great and so was the area. Very close to a variety of shops which has everything you need. A very short walk to ferry terminal  Circular Quay 10mins away. The area was great and felt safe to walk around in the evening. Rose Bay itself is a short stroll away with places to eat ect. Although unfortunately didn't meet Trent he was only a text/phone call away. Key pick up was easy and straight forward. Would highly recommend."),
("2017-08-29", "16898275", "Kerri", "We found the apartment to be very comfortable. The location is very convenient close to transport  shops  restaurants and the beach. Although we didn't meet Trent he responded to us via email promptly. If you are without a car there is a GoGet (car sharing service) vehicle that is parked opposite the apartment."),
("2017-09-18", "16898275", "Georgina", "Pleasant  comfortable  spacious apartment. Clean and presentable. Bathroom towels are provided  bedrooms are nicely made up. Apartment owner fantastic for communication in the lead up to booking and confirming.  Apartment is welcoming and would recommend. Apartment is on first floor  so there is one flight of stairs to consider. While off-street parking is available  it may be a bit tricky to find as Rose Bay is a very popular area- keep in mind."),
("2017-09-23", "16898275", "Mal", "A great unit in an awesome spot. Close to cafes and Rose bay shops. Very nice street and quiet  well equipped living space. Would definitely recommend and would stay there again"),
("2017-10-15", "16898275", "Jennifer", "Trents apartment is in a beautiful street  short walk to the ferry terminal where we were able to take a quick 10 minute trip to Circular Quay to spend our day. The apartment itself was comfortable and as described. Minimal to zero noise from neighbours or cars. TV is amazing ! Thanks for having us :)"),
("2017-10-24", "16898275", "David", "This 2 bedroom apartment is in a great location  handy to shops  cafes  ferry  etc. Clean & tidy with large screen TV. Good value & we would stay here again!"),
("2017-10-28", "16898275", "Nina", "The decor and styling of the apartment is extra special and unique. Loved the candles. Nice location - close to shops surrounded by huge  old trees <3"),
("2017-10-30", "16898275", "Felix", "Good"),
("2017-11-14", "16898275", "Amanda", "Trent and his host were quick to respond and made the place homely. Was an absolute pleasure staying there and would stay again / recommend"),
("2017-12-18", "16898275", "Peter", "Great apartment close to shops and restaurants. Really easy city access as short walk to ferry."),
("2017-12-26", "16898275", "Shan", "时尚的家居 很好的位置 附近披萨不错 也有餐厅及小超市 离轮渡大约步行10分钟 很方便｡"),
("2018-01-05", "16898275", "Belinda", "Fabulous Apartment with everything you need. Clean and comfortable - exactly as photographed. Quiet area with everything at your doorstep. Local cafes and restaurants are all excellent. Beaches and shops in wAlking distance. Marina & ferry close by and If your active  run to Bondi and surrounds and back."),
("2018-04-12", "16898275", "Georgie", "Great location - easy walk out along harbour and to ships and restaurants. Easy bus to city. Street parking all day and ok to get. Two bedrooms are at either end of the apt so very private from each other so suit two couples well. Nice light and breeze."),
("2018-04-15", "16898275", "Carrie", "Trent was hospitable and his sunny apartment in leafy Balfour is central  close to Plumer shopping centre and the ferry  straight into Circular Key.  Easy transport everywhere."),
("2018-04-16", "16898275", "Monika", "We spent one night in Terent's place and have to admit that communication between us was great. He responded very quickly to all my questions. Please was ok."),
("2018-04-19", "16898275", "Jane", "In an ideal location  this unit is well appointed  comfortable and convenient.  The off-street parking is much appreciated."),
("2018-04-21", "16898275", "Belinda", "This unit was perfect for my husband and I and our two young girls. The unit was very spacious and nice and bright. The unit was close to public transport and some amazing restaurants. I would def stay here again!"),
("2018-04-22", "16898275", "Jane", "Clean and charmingly decorated. Neighbourhood was quiet  pretty and close to bay. Easy to walk to wharf and catch a ferry over to Circular Quay.Did not meet Trent but communication was quick and easy. Parking available on street for free but can be busy so be prepared that you might have to park further away. We were only there for a night so didn’t have much luggage  but might need to factor that in if you do have a lot of luggage. Posting does mention a private parking space  not sure if there is a separate space other than street or if this just refers to the street but we utilised street.Towels provided. No toiletries so best to pack some.Tip: we found it difficult to unlock the main door by mailbox but there is another door around the other side that was much easier to open with the key.Wifi only worked for about an hour and then we had no wifi at all. Other than that  it’s a great unit in a nice neighbourhood and would recommend."),
("2018-05-02", "16898275", "Michelle", "Trent was prompt and clear in his communications. We did a last minute booking and Trent organised the cleaners to ensure a clean apartment with our arrival. The apartment is located on a quiet residential area. One block away to the sea and a short walk to the ferry. It is a peaceful area and there is plenty of space in the apartment. We found it comfortable and homely with lots of plants and a beautiful kitchen. Would recommend!"),
("2018-05-05", "16898275", "Gatya", "Great location  leafy neighbourhood  spacious  walk to harbour  cafes  ferries. Very enjoyable stay  highly recommended."),
("2018-05-09", "16898275", "Ryan", "Amazing location and great value. Quirky and comfortable in a character art-deco apartment block; peaceful street  lovely to wake up to the sounds of the many birds that reside in the tree lined street. This place showcases Sydney's affluent Eastern Suburb vibe and is only a  5 min walk to a ferry terminal. IMPORTANT: note there is no air conditioning or heating - this was fine for my stay but in mid-winter this could be an issue."),
("2018-05-12", "16898275", "Elise", "Great spacious 2 bedroom apartment. Communication with Trent was easy with quick responses. Would recommend."),
("2018-05-20", "16898275", "Lesa", "Excellent location. Lovely decor. We will stay again."),
("2018-05-21", "16898275", "Kathy", "Cute  convenient 2nd floor apartment with limited street parking."),
("2018-05-28", "16898275", "Ben", "Stay met Trent's high expectations with great communication  and an apartment that matched the brief perfectly. Great location for events east of Sydney. Highly recommend."),
("2018-06-03", "16898275", "Kerri", "Enjoyed our stay second time that we have stayed here. Great location and the apartment is very nice."),
("2018-07-22", "16898275", "Edilson", "It is nice place for a family with 4  near by the markets   public transportation and easy to move."),
("2018-07-24", "16898275", "Jon", "Awesome location  great apartment with everything you need and a short walk to the ferry - Thanks Trent! "),
("2018-07-25", "16898275", "Linden", "Place is in an amazing location. Clean and nice decor. Host was very responsive."),
("2018-07-30", "16898275", "Ludmila", "Great apartment with all the stuff you need in it. Great location 7 minutes walk to the ferry terminal. Trent is a great host who will come address any question you may have. We enjoyed staying at the property"),
("2018-08-02", "16898275", "Babette", "Trent's apartment is lovely for a stay in Sydney  close to bus and ferry stops. The space is beautifully decorated and the beds are very comfortable. Would recommend this place to friends and come here again!"),
("2018-08-05", "16898275", "Michael", "Great place to stay"),
("2018-08-13", "16898275", "Chantel", "Great location and lovely apartment. Very central. Only a 10min walk to the ferry station which goes direct to circular quay  walked from Bondi beach 35mins.  Would stay here again :)"),
("2018-08-16", "16898275", "Tabea", "Great Apartment in a silent neighborhood. But everything is easy to reach by ferry or car.We really enjoyed our stay there! Would definitely stay there again"),
("2018-08-18", "16898275", "Konuray", "The place is so quiet and peaceful. You can use public transport easily."),
("2018-08-18", "16898275", "Christina", "Great location  clean and tidy  easy communication with host. We loved it! "),
("2018-08-26", "16898275", "Kylie", "A great little apartment in a beautiful suburb  with shops nearby and an almost Melbourne feel. 1920s deco building with an apartment that feels funky with some nice touches. Two good sized beds and a killer tv but no dining table. Spotlessly clean and owner quick and responsive to our questions. We loved it and will stay there again without a doubt. "),
("2018-09-02", "16898275", "Rohit", "Amazing location  great place   great response rate  would go there again"),
("2018-09-08", "16898275", "Kimberley", "The location is great. Close to restaurants and cafes as well as public transport. The apartment is spacious and sunny and the private car park is a real bonus. Communication from Trent was great and he was quick to respond both before and during my stay"),
("2018-09-12", "16898275", "Haleigh", "Great communication  space and location!"),
("2018-09-17", "16898275", "Peter", "Great location in Rose bay with the convenience of an easy ferry ride to the city. It’s a good size 2 bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor. Beds were very comfortable  kitchen has all you need and there’s a big tv with good wifi. Great shops for supplies  coffee  pizza and take out foods.The only small negatives were difficulty getting out of the parking area and lack of seating in the living area."),
("2018-10-10", "16898275", "Alan", "Thank you Trent for your prompt replies to all our enquiries before and during our 3 week stay at your home.  We were very comfortable there.  It was ideal for visiting our family and would definitely stay there again on future visits  if we had the opportunity.  Location was excellent with shops close by for every day needs and with public transport – buses and ferry - at the end of the street."),
("2018-11-04", "16898275", "Robert", "A very spacious home  plenty of kitchen utensils great heating perfect all round.A great location and a very accommodating host."),
("2018-11-10", "16898275", "Jennifer", "Great location  in the heart of Rosebay. Clean and spacious two bedroom apartment within a lovely Artdeco building. Good value for money. Easy communication with Trent. Would stay again."),
("2018-11-21", "16898275", "Tom", "Great apartment in a fantastic location.  Close by are small shops  restaurants  pharmacy  bakery  convenience store and wine shop. Close to public transportation  this is a must if you don’t want to drive all the time  or pay for parking in downtown Sydney (expensive). We didn’t see the host  but we had no problems communicating with him. Any questions we had were quickly answered. We had the apartment to ourselves  and the place was nicely decorated. Having a parking spot was nice. Street parking is available  although you usually didn’t get a spot close to the house  so having a reserved parking spot (in the back of the building) was a great benefit.Rose Bay is suburb east of Sydney  but by using the Sydney Ferry (get an Opal card) you get to cruise on the water to downtown Sydney with amazing views of Sydney Harbor all the way. Ten minute walk to the Ferry  and a fifteen minute cruise. Within a half hour  you’re in downtown Sydney by the Opera House  Harbor Bridge  Royal Botanic Gardens  etc.  You can also use the bus/train  to travel downtown (~45 minutes)  but why bother when you can see Sydney from the harbor. We were very happy that we were able to stay here."),
("2018-12-16", "16898275", "Cassimah", "a nice clean apartment  if you need to be in that area it's a great location. Great communication from the host."),
("2019-01-11", "16898275", "David", "Trent's apartment is a lovely  stylish place in a great location. It was ideal for our needs as we were visiting family nearby. if you want access to the many attractions that Sydney has to offer  but don't want to stay in the city  this would be an ideal base as it is an attractive area with great transport links."),
("2019-01-18", "16898275", "Grant", "Great location and excellent communication from Trent  Thanks"),
("2019-01-31", "16898275", "Germaine", "Great location - very accessible to the ferry  beaches  great restaurants."),
("2019-02-07", "16898275", "Lisa", "Great location  short walk to the ferry and local eats. Prompt communication and a wonderful apartment. The car park was very convenient also  would highly recommend this stay."),
("2017-10-03", "17027324", "Monique", "We had a lovely stay. The apartment was clean and perfect for a family with children. Close to Parks and beach. Overall we enjoyed the apartment!"),
("2017-09-17", "16885508", "Shirley", "Great place for a family group to stay. Pool & spa with great outdoor deck area."),
("2018-01-21", "16885508", "Janet", "Staying in this house is like staying at a private resort. The location in the quiet street with the bush right behind the house is wonderful as is the huge private deck with dining table and two beach umbrellas which protect you from the sun at any time of day. We had a lot of fun and relaxation in the lovely pool and spa. Having 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms was perfect for 2 married couples. The zoned air conditioning was very much appreciated. We also appreciated the  well-stocked kitchen which had lots of crockery  cutlery and food-prep equipment. The lounge room chairs were ultra-comfortable. Ruth left useful notes  e.g. how to work the spa. Would love to stay here again."),
("2018-03-18", "16885508", "Jaselle", "We had a wonderful stay at Ruth’s home! It felt like arriving in a resort and was so wonderful to be able to live in the house as though it was our own. The bed in the main bedroom was amazingly comfortable!"),
("2018-06-10", "16885508", "Andrew", "Great spot. Quiet and private. Lots of space and the pool and hot tub are amazing."),
("2018-11-19", "16885508", "Olivier", "Our family enjoyed staying at Ruth’s place. The kids loved the plentiful toys available and the pool and hot tub. The location is very quiet. The kitchen was well equipped. We do not hesitate to recommend it. Thanks for a good stay!"),
("2019-01-20", "16885508", "Janet", "We love staying at Ruth's house. The setting is beautiful in a very quiet street with bush behind. A breeze comes up the valley and kookaburras visit. The deck is perfect for relaxing on with the pool and hot tub and there are maket umbrellas for shade. The air conditioning is great and the kitchen has everything. With two bathrooms the house works well for two couples. Drive to St Ives Shopping Village for supplies or to the station for the train to the city."),
("2017-03-25", "16964637", "Khalid", "This accomodation is located in a nice place near to the main road. Easy to commute on public transport or your own. Very well connected. My room was nice and cosy. It has your own big screen TV and an updated ensuite. Cleanliness outside can be an issue but considering other guests staying there is understandable. I generally kept to my room and was happy.Judy is an excellent host and is quick to resolve issues if you have any. I had a few hiccups the first day and she was quick to address them.I don't mind staying here again if required. Very reasonably priced for what you get."),
("2017-03-28", "16964637", "Karl", "Judy's place is a Boarding house with many bedrooms. We had the bedroom with the on-suite. There was no-body to greet us and another tenant helped us. We called to get two towels for us and then for toilet paper but found that the TV did not work and we could not make contact the third time. The cupboard with the towels looked a mess just chucked in. The fridge was full of food and some looked as if it had been there for quite some time. The kitchen floor tiles are cracked and dirty  the rubbish bin is open and we found some cockroaches in our bedroom. No one there to organise the house in general. We had better value."),
("2017-05-07", "16964637", "Rahul", "The place is very clean with all amenities and also at a location walkable to public transit. I had to extend my stay and I rebooked the same place as I liked it ."),
("2017-05-17", "16964637", "Megan", "Great Location  large  clean Master bed room with great ensuite"),
("2017-07-03", "16964637", "Megan", "Great place  great host!"),
("2017-07-15", "16964637", "Waqas", "House is in a quiet street. Lane becomes quite dark at night. Bus stop and train station are also near by. Good location for offices situated in maquarie park.As for the room  master bed is quite big and well furnished. The heater (split invertor) is quite noisy. Did use the kitchen but it was also ok. Laundry setup was also good. Communication with Judy was excellent. I asked for tv remote batteries and car parking pass ad  arranged quickly.Restaurants and shops are not near by. Nearest is at Lane cove road opposite to marriot or at macquarie center."),
("2017-07-22", "16964637", "Ségolène", "Really good bedroom  the bed is confortable and the room is clean!"),
("2017-07-31", "16964637", "Jessica", "Judy was great to communicate with and easy to reach via email and messages!  Took care of issues quickly when we accidentally locked our keys in our room."),
("2017-08-02", "16964637", "Vinay", "This house is shared house  host doesnt live here or I havnt met her during my stay of 6 days  only available through emails. Room was good but Shower was bit clogged n had hairs when asked to clean no answer. Same thing was with bed linen  was used before  host didnt change even when asked.  Kichen was mess at times as it is shared house."),
("2017-08-09", "16964637", "Megan", "Great location  clean room and bathroom!"),
("2017-08-13", "16964637", "Jiachen", "Great location on a quiet street. The room was very clean and the bed was very comfortable. Judy was also a great host. I had a very pleasant stay."),
("2017-09-11", "16964637", "Megan", "Great place  stayed several  times now!"),
("2017-09-28", "16964637", "Greg", "The room with en suite is in a bit of a share house  so it's not like a lot of AirBnB places. A bit more anonymous and private. Judy  however  does respond super quickly to any requests  and I had no trouble getting what I needed. The street is very close to Epping Road  so there is a bit of noise that comes over from this busy street  but that also makes the location very convenient (so there's two sides to every trait). I would certainly stay again."),
("2017-09-29", "16964637", "Hayley", "A nice simple room with a very comfy bed! Judy was great  very responsive to my messages although I didn't get to actually meet her in person."),
("2017-10-30", "16964637", "Fernanda", "The room is perfect  fit two people confortable. There are good space in the wardrobe. The bathroom is amazing."),
("2017-11-13", "16964637", "Emily", "A lovely  comfortable  room in a very nice house. Everything was clean and it was within walking distance of Macquarie Park and University."),
("2017-11-25", "16964637", "Minh Châu", "Such a nice place  very clean and tidy. Flexible for check in time as my friend arrived a bit earlier."),
("2017-12-14", "16964637", "Sasha", "Nice and tidy. Good place to stay for a short term."),
("2017-12-20", "16964637", "Megan", "Great room  always clean - have stayed numerous times."),
("2017-12-31", "16964637", "Tina", "Room was spacious and comfy. Very easy check in. But it was too far from airport. We've spent $100 more for the taxi from airport due to the late arrival."),
("2018-01-15", "16964637", "Megan", "As always - great place to stay  clean and easy"),
("2018-02-09", "16964637", "Nidhi", "Judy's place is a great place to stay. It is very clean  well managed and comfortable. It is 2min walk from the bus station and 6min walk from train station. Amenities are best in class and Judy is a great host. She responds immediately to any request or need."),
("2018-02-14", "16964637", "Zoe", "Very comfortable stay. Great amenities. Easy check in. Will book again"),
("2018-02-19", "16964637", "Yogesh", "Very good and peaceful stay. Internet  Kitchen was up to the expectation.Thanks for a comfortable stay."),
("2018-02-23", "16964637", "Abhinav", "Thanks Judy for being a great host. It was one my most comfortable stay in Sydney. I liked the room  cleanliness  privacy  and location. In future  your place would always be in my first preference list."),
("2018-03-20", "16964637", "Sneha", "It was a great experience staying at Judy’s. The arrangements were just perfect. The room was spacious with ensuite bathroom and had all quick needed facilities in the room. Best thing was it is a laptop friendly place. The room was attached to a porch which again was very pleasant and relaxing. The kitchen amenities were great too. All utilities were rightly labelled. The entire house and the kitchen were clean. I enjoyed my privacy here. Also  this place is pretty close to the train station which saved me from long walks.Judy was very prompt with her responses whenever I tried getting in touch with her. I would definitely opt for this place again for my next visit to Sydney."),
("2018-04-14", "16964637", "Robert", "Eine tolles Zimmer! Das eigene Bad war prima  die Terrasse wunderschön. Judy war schnell zu erreichen und die Wohnung sehr sauber.Unbedingt zu empfehlen!"),
("2018-04-20", "16964637", "Tiffany", "Great stay at Judy’s place. Walking distance to my course and train station. Highly recommended :)"),
("2018-05-04", "16964637", "Duane", "Great spot will stay again"),
("2018-06-15", "16964637", "Steph", "Thanks for a good stay! Room was big and clean - only issue was the shared kitchen space could get a little messy and there were ants in the bathroom but not a major issue! Heater worked well  bathroom big and clean  very close to big shopping mall with restaurants and close to the train line! Simple but good! Only addition I would include would be a mini fridge in the bedroom - there’s space for it and would make it a more private space without the hassle of a shared kitchen - especially as I was visiting on a work trip and had to leave very early in the morning and was worried I’d disturb other guests."),
("2018-06-15", "16964637", "Manu", "Best accomodation experience in a long time - will be back 10000% for sure"),
("2018-06-30", "16964637", "Sue", "Own bathroon was wonderful. Room was clean and comfortable and as described. Only issue for me was that the A/C is very loud hard to sleep when its on."),
("2018-07-30", "16964637", "Syed", "I stayed at Judy's place for longer durations and it was quite amazing. The place' description was very accurate and it has various room types. Some rooms are equipped with private bathroom which was clearly described.Internet speed was good and decent coverage across all the room. For master bedroom M there  is a separate wifi connection. I have found common kitchen space to be tidy. There is a separate portion allocated within refrigerator for all guests. Overall  I would highly recommend this place. "),
("2018-08-11", "16964637", "Sagar", "Great house. Good privacy  barely saw anyone during my stay. Master room is well equipped for a comfortable stay. Not far from Macquarie Park Station. "),
("2018-08-12", "16964637", "Sue", "Great everytime!"),
("2018-09-02", "16964637", "Sneha", "Opted Judy’s place for the second time. Arrangements were perfect. Happy with the service and prompt responses whenever needed. Would definitely prefer staying here during my next visit as well."),
("2018-09-11", "16964637", "Abdullah", "Was a great stay  would stay again."),
("2018-09-16", "16964637", "Litan", "WIFi connection is not good."),
("2018-09-22", "16964637", "Yess", "exactly as described"),
("2018-11-10", "16964637", "Haroon", "I stayed here for an extended period for work and found the place very suitable to my needs. The garden area was lovely and the room as expected. Would recommend."),
("2018-11-16", "16964637", "Michelle", "Judy's place is all that is expected  possibly more. The individual locks on doors and entry to the house is excellent and very safe. Even though there were other people in the house during my stay  I very rarely saw anyone else. I would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-11-17", "16964637", "Brad", "Very easy to check in and out. Feels like a hotel! Will stay again."),
("2018-12-07", "16964637", "Eme", "Place was as described. The self check-in was very easy. Small issue with the missing parking permit was quickly fixed and everything else was perfect. Good stay all around"),
("2019-01-03", "16964637", "Sevgi", "The apartment was very clean and the Organisation between the other guests was good. The location it’s a little bit to far from the CBD. The train station was out of order for the time and we should take all the time the bus. The station for the bus was close to the apartment."),
("2019-01-10", "16964637", "Greg", "Check in very easy. Room with ensuite and study desk was exactly as advertised. Very clean and well maintained. Although close to busy highways  traffic noise was hardly audible.Kitchen and laundry facilities very good and clean - especially the 'fridge.I will be happy to stay there again."),
("2019-01-19", "16964637", "Nassim", "Good place"),
("2017-03-31", "17027421", "Rebecca", "This is a very clean  airy and comfortable place to stay in what is arguably Sydney's best area. The hosts  Yvonne and Cary  are very welcoming and convivial yet respectful of privacy. The house is modern with all mod cons. The large bedroom (with very comfy bed) is on the ground floor with a good deal of private space in which to relax. There's even a saltwater swimming pool in the back garden! The location is great for getting to the best of the city's beaches and Eastern Suburbs  with Bondi just 15 minutes walk and Rose Bay about 20. The nearest bus stop is just 5 minutes away. From here you can easily reach Bondi Junction  the city and beyond. This is a quiet area  with the nearest shops and bars 10 - 15 minutes walk away  so maybe not an ideal place for the party animal.As far as I'm concerned  after 7 weeks staying here  this place is perfect. My only negative is that any B&B from now on will be a compromise. "),
("2017-04-09", "17027421", "Sven", "We had a great stay at this beautiful place. The pictures don't do justice to reality. In real it's so much nicer! We couldn't wish for a better place to end our trip in Australia. Everything is so luxurous  cosy and tidy. We were sorry we didn't stay longer. Yvonne & Gary are a nice  social couple. They even provided some stuff for breakfast  great! Highly recommend this place!"),
("2017-04-14", "17027421", "Sanchia", "This is the best Air Bnb I've ever stayed in; excellent value for money. It's lovely to have a private area with bedroom and living room. It's a wonderful house and the photos don't do it justice! The bed is very comfy  and the bathroom is great (amazing shower). The kitchen is very well stocked and great to cook in. We made good use of the washing machine  which was very helpful as we're travelling for some time.Yvonne and Cary are incredibly warm and welcoming; they really made us feel at home. I cannot recommend this place enough!"),
("2017-09-23", "17027421", "Russell", "Very comfortable bed  great hosts  private room in a great house"),
("2017-10-07", "17027421", "Julie", "Spacious  clean and stylish accommodation  that you would never get in an hotel. Loved the congeniality  the  coffee and the ambiance. Great location in between the bay and the surf and close to restaurants.Great value for money. Very accommodating hosts. Will be returning."),
("2017-10-23", "17027421", "Craig", "Yvonne was the perfect host; she provided us with an Opal card each  as well as breakfast goods to keep us going through the week. The house and location are absolutely superb and it was one of the nicest places we have ever stayed. Special mention has to go for the bed  which was something out of heaven  the comfiest thing we have ever experienced in our entire lives! Thank you so much for such a lovely stay."),
("2017-11-13", "17027421", "Johannes", "My wife and our little daughter (7 Months) stayed for 10 days at Yvonne's and Cary's beautiful house. Especially the garden and the open plan kitchen and living area are wonderful spots to rest after exploring Sydney. Their location is great and we enjoyed the very pleasant and quiet neighbourhood while you could still easily get to other areas by public transport. Yvonne and Cary are both great hosts and welcomed us warmly. They managed the balance between intimacy and socialising very well. We can definitely recommend this place to anyone who wishes to explore all the nice spots in Sydney but likes to enjoy a lovely residential area close to Bondi beach afterwards."),
("2017-11-29", "17027421", "Shanice", "Beautiful home  very tech Savy and amazing pool   Yvonne was a great host and honestly the most comfortable bed I have ever slept in  beautiful beautiful home would definitely recommend"),
("2018-01-15", "17027421", "Kerry", "Yvonne and Cari were fabulous hosts and made my month’s stay in Sydney very special with their warm generosity and beautiful accommodation. I cannot fault anything. They were there when I needed local information but never intruded in my personal space. I would thoroughly recommend this Airbnb in a heartbeat!"),
("2018-01-24", "17027421", "Lou", "This place is very quiet  facility is complete  the host is helpful  friendly and hospitable  host was very generous  even offered to drive me to buy things  a very pleasant check-in process  the kitchen is very big and pretty! Thanks!这里很安静 设施完善新装修的 主人非常有帮助 友好善良慷慨 甚至提出开车带我们熟悉环境和购物 厨房非常大很漂亮 入住过程很愉快!非常感谢!"),
("2018-02-11", "17027421", "Alexandra", "This was my first experience of staying in an Airbnb & Yvonne has certainly set the bar extremely high!We had a wonderful stay in this beautiful  house which was situated in a great location (10 min walk to Bondi) with friendly & attentive hosts who went out of their way to make us feel welcome (including driving us to our friends wedding to save us getting a taxi!) We had initial reservations of sharing a house rather than get an Airbnb to ourselves but these were diminished as soon as we walked in  with the hosts giving us the right balance of privacy whilst also being able to have some lovely chats (mostly when gathered around the amazing coffee machine!) Would thoroughly recommend to everyone & look forward to returning again soon."),
("2018-02-16", "17027421", "Michael", "The rooms are spacious  with the attached living and study rooms perfect to make the place feel at home  as well as giving me somewhere work. Gracious hosts  and a very stylish residence."),
("2018-02-24", "17027421", "Louise", "Yvonne’s home is amazing and she is a fantastic host. We found the room and adjacent bathroom perfect for our needs  a really lovely space. We were in town for a wedding in Watson’s Bay and it was very easy to get the ferry up and then uber back. The house is ideally located only a 15 min walk to Rose Bay and 20mins to Bondi Beach."),
("2018-03-27", "17027421", "Bastiaan", "The host canceled this reservation 278 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-03-29", "17027421", "Wendy", "A perfect location  walking distance from both Bondi and Rose Bay. A spacious and private area with a very comfortable bed and a beautiful modern bathroom in a stunning home. The outdoor pool is an added bonus. Yvonne and Cary are excellent hosts and hopefully we will be able to return next year."),
("2018-09-30", "17027421", "Wayne", "Our stay at Yvonne and Cary’s incredibly beautiful home was beyond any expectations we had. My wife and I felt so at home here for the three days we had. The photos don’t do this house justice. It has been exquisitely and tastefully renovated and we wanted for nothing whilst here. Both our hosts were kind  warm and welcoming even to the point of offering us a ride to the railway station should we have needed it. The whole house was spotlessly clean and we had access to all amenities one could wish for and a couple of luxury items I wouldn’t have even thought if seeking. Cary is a dab hand on his rather superb coffee machine and as a coffee I must hasten to add  he knows his machine well and produces what can only be described as a top shelf brew. My advice to anyone searching for a place in this price range is just book it and enjoy."),
("2018-10-16", "17027421", "Manfred And Lisa", "Felt so welcome in Yvonne and Cary's home. Could not re commend highly enough. Perfect home away from home."),
("2018-10-25", "17027421", "Chris", "Excellent place to stay.  Yvonne and Carey's house is beautiful and extremely clean.  We felt very welcomed and they went out of their way to be gracious hosts.  Wonderful to talk to and great communicators."),
("2018-11-21", "17027421", "Simon", "Was a Great stay! Yvonne is a very Helpful host.The home is beautiful and extremely large  was great to have the laundry  kitchen and swimming pool. Location is pretty perfect  It’s situated in a quiet street but still pretty close to Bondi/Rose Bay.The room is downstairs at the front of the house  with its own lounge room. The bathroom is just outside the room. So pretty private. Would love to stay here again when coming back.Thank you!"),
("2017-02-01", "17045341", "Nicolas", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-06-17", "17045341", "Jessica", "WOW I cannot recommend these wonderful people enough! The room was spacious and clean  the area was shared but they gave me so much privacy that I would never have a problem :) Ed and his partner gave me a million amazing suggestion on places to go according to what I was interested in and made me feel at home and welcome constantly. Would highly recommend this place! Convenient right into the city yet quiet area :)"),
("2017-07-15", "17045341", "Katherine", "Staying here is a great base if you want to explore the Eastern beaches of Sydney. We walked to nearby Bronte beach  Bondi is a few minutes drive away but it was also comfortable and quiet. Edouard and Helena are good hosts  warm and welcoming and had great tips for good places to eat and visit."),
("2017-09-16", "17045341", "Danica", "Edouards apartment is lovely  quiet sunny in a cute suburb. Not far from a few shops  and a lovely little walk through the park to Bronte Beach. Was the perfect base for visiting friends in Bronte. The room was clean  comfortable and the entire place was nicely styled and tidy too. His flatmate was also very nice and helpful. Fully enjoyed my stay. Woke up to the sounds of the birds in the morning :)"),
("2017-09-26", "17045341", "Ian", "Staying at Edouard's place was excellent  the flat is very clean and filled with style. It's walking distance to beautiful beaches  close to public transport and shops  the walk down to the beach through Bronte Gully is especially recommended. Edouard and his partner are lovely hosts and I felt welcome and and at home in their place  definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2017-09-30", "17045341", "Eleni", "Nice and clean  very friendly hosts"),
("2017-10-15", "17045341", "Don", "Great location  great place.  Ed wasn’t there but his flat mate Loren was an excellent host!  Highly recommend!"),
("2018-01-02", "17045341", "Elise", "We had a great stay during NYE at Eduardo’s place. Nice apartment with all the facilities needed. Bus stop very close. The bus brings you to Bondi Junction  from which you can come everywhere in the city. Would recommend."),
("2018-03-15", "17045341", "朴", "He is a friendly and tidy host.The location is 15 mins to Bronte Beach by feet.We had a great stay! Would stay again and recommend."),
("2018-12-31", "17045341", "Nicholas", "Thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Edouard’s place. Everything was perfect and Edouard always maintained excellent communication. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-02-12", "17113625", "Sylvie&Herve", "Verry good place  good bed   good explainations   we appreciated swiming and jaccuzi after whole day discoverring Sydney  more for young people   so Nice thanks we recommand this place verry cheap and good."),
("2017-02-14", "17113625", "Jane", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-02-15", "17113625", "Garrison", "The place is not too far from Sydney CBD  about 20 minutes walk to central station and $13 one way uber ride. Bus ride to CBD was about $3.80. Air conditioning in the room does not really cool the room properly. It was more like a fan. The building and location was pretty safe. There is a GoGet Pod right in front of the building which is very convenient if you use GoGet. David  the host  was also a very nice and helpful.Overall it was a pretty good place if you're looking for a budget accomodation. Can't really complain for the price."),
("2017-09-17", "17113625", "Daniel", "Good location  10 minutes walk to the closest buses. This is in a good neighborhood and we felt safe walking in the streets at night. It's close to the airport too  shops and services are all nearby.Hosts were friendly  quiet  and left us to do our own thing  which we all appreciate in a share apartment  and were very happy to help if we had any questions or needed anything. Definitely recommend and there is a host of amenities available if required. Not sure how well the air conditioner works  we used it for heating and it seemed to do the trick  even though we couldn't feel any air pressure. Shower and bathroom are both clean and good. We definitely recommend these hosts."),
("2017-02-16", "17028088", "Anthony", "The accommodation was perfectHosts super friendly and helpfulOverall experience wonderfulStay here"),
("2017-02-27", "17028088", "Emily", "A great place with absolutely amazing hosts! They left us food  directions for the whole house  and gave us rides to the train station. They were extremely welcoming and helpful. The place itself is spacious and comfortable  close by bus stops to all areas of Sydney. Right by a great park. Would recommend to anyone  we loved our stay! "),
("2017-03-10", "17028088", "Rebecca", "Great apartment. We stayed for a week upon moving to Sydney. Very clean and new. Well equipped kitchen  lovely bathroom  Foxtel."),
("2017-03-22", "17028088", "Ghislain", "Nous vous remercions de votre hospitalité  de votre disponibilité et de votre accueil  et du très bon entretien de votre appartement. Nous recommandons vivement cette appartement. Nous avons apprecier davoir le minimum de nourriture disponible à notre arriver. "),
("2017-03-28", "17028088", "Elliot", "Hands down the best air B and B I've stayed in highly recommend to anyone great location next to the park easy to get to the city. Clean and comfortable as well"),
("2017-04-07", "17028088", "Patrick", "Kathy goes out of her way to make sure your happy"),
("2017-04-19", "17028088", "Sonia", "Kathy's place locates at the heart of the city  we are close to everything from restaurants  parks to the famous tourist spots. The house is new  clean  well equipped. We get everything we need. It is so comfortable that we feel like being home during our stay. Kathy and Mary are great hosts. They helped us everything we asked for and gave us timely response. They are warm hearted and helpful which makes the whole experience so much nicer and memorable. Whenever we have the chance to come back we will book Kathy's place again  for sure."),
("2017-05-04", "17028088", "Helen", "Kathy and Mary were excellent hosts!  Their  accommodation was perfect for my 2 week stay.  Perfectly presented  clean and very comfortable.  Nice location opposite Centennial Park.  Highly recommended."),
("2017-06-23", "17028088", "Debbie", "Great spot handy to Centennial Park. Parking is a big bonus. Easy access off Darley Road. Modern  clean and comfortable. Hostesses great to deal with."),
("2017-08-15", "17028088", "Erin", "I really enjoyed my stay. The apartment had lots of space  was very clean and was beautifully decorated. I would definitely stay here again."),
("2017-09-18", "17028088", "Jennifer", "My husband and I throughly enjoyed our stay at 'Kathy's place'. We choose this particular Airbnb due to its fantastic location. It is literally a stone throw from the incredible Centennial Park  Park of choice for our two young children. Kathy's place is perfect  it's modern and clean. I felt truly at home. Kathy provided us with complimentary basics (bread  milk  biscuits etc.) which after a long drive to Sydney was bliss! The bed is incredibly comfortable and if you are like me and enjoy a great shower  then you will LOVE the shower nozzle!!! Can not recommend Kathy's place more  we will without doubt be staying there again when we are next visiting Sydney. Absolutely awesome!"),
("2017-10-06", "17028088", "Lin Tai", "交通不太方便 除了步行或叫UBER去就近市中心購物就有点麻煩 希望地鐵快D建做好 但環境是非常舒適及寧靜 而房東就非常親切 回覆亦很快｡"),
("2017-10-30", "17028088", "Theresa", "Kathy and her daughter were such lovely  happy and accomodating laddies handling all added requests we had.A nice cute hideaway  like a cubby house when you go to the top  so watch your head! Lovely bathroom! Overall great experience."),
("2017-11-22", "17028088", "Sophie", "Kathy and her daughter were so friendly and warmTheir home was immaculately clean  larger than you think. All the amenities are offered and goodies in the pantry and fridge. Nothing was missing.Very well decorated and styledAn absolute pleasure being there  felt comfortable in every way. recommend this place to anyone thinking of staying in the eastern suburbs of Sydney.Thank you again Hope to see you again soon!"),
("2017-11-26", "17028088", "Dalvin", "Kathy's place is nice and clean as described.  Well located to a few things if you are ok with taking uber rides then shouldn't be an issue.  Provided some snacks and drinks which was a really nice touch.  Never had any issues."),
("2017-12-04", "17028088", "Grace", "Kathy’s place was such a good choice for a family. It was close to a convenient store and bus stop so getting to Coogee beach and cbd was easy and fast. It was also super close to the airport. This could be a perfect location for people who are doing lots of day trips outside the city and who like being central from all tourist attractions. We could tell Kathy thought about great hospitality. There are everything you need in the house. A huge and beautiful park is right in front of the house so you can run and exercise too. It’s great for longer stay too."),
("2017-12-31", "17028088", "Natalie & Aaron", "Kathy is a wonderful hostess! She is very helpful  provided an easy check in/check out  and easy to reach with any questions. Her space is beautiful! Very stylish  clean  and had everything we needed. Even better than the photos! We truly enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-01-31", "17028088", "Wendy", "We had a wonderful stay. Would highly recommend Kathy’s apartment."),
("2018-02-16", "17028088", "Hai", "Kathy is a very welcome host  if you need everything you can just knock on the door. She prepared milk  drinks and snacks for us  which save us on our first day. Definitely recommend to stay here. Close to the park so very good view  transport is also convenient by bus. The place is incredibly clean and smells great."),
("2018-02-20", "17028088", "Sarah", "A great place in a great location. Easy drive to lots of lovely places and to the airport."),
("2018-02-22", "17028088", "Alexandra", "I stayed with Kathy at her lovely home on a recent business trip  perfectly situated across the road from Centennial Park & restaurants.The room was spotless and the little touches such as bottled water  quality breakfast supplies and bathroom products were appreciated.Kathy and her daughter were the perfect hosts and could not have been more helpful.I would thoroughly recommend staying here for both business or pleasure.Robert  February 2018"),
("2018-02-25", "17028088", "Cath", "Beautiful apartment in a great spot. Kathy and Mary made us feel at home instantly"),
("2018-03-03", "17028088", "Blair", "Great people  great place. Couldn’t ask for any better. We will be back!"),
("2018-03-15", "17028088", "艳萍", "房屋干净､舒适 房东准备了丰富的小吃食 让我居住的很舒心｡"),
("2018-03-16", "17028088", "Millie", "The place was amazing  and very clean. We had a wonderful stay  and Kathy was very accomodating!! Would 100% stay there again."),
("2018-05-12", "17028088", "Maggie", "We recently stayed in  Kathy's place as a base for our 2 months in Australia -  It is in a great location opposite the beautiful Centennial Park. Kathy was an amazing host and made us feel very welcome - nothing was any trouble for her and there were lots of extra touches  including welcome provisions in the  fridge and pantry and even cleaning and bathroom products too.The apartment itself was spacious  well furnished and immaculate  with a lovely comfy bed and a fantastic shower.We hope to see Kathy again on our next visit and would certainly recommend staying there."),
("2018-05-16", "17028088", "Connie", "Lovely place conveniently located next to Centennial Park. Kathy was very welcoming and easy to communicate with. Place is immaculately presented and newly renovated. Thanks for a great stay Kathy :)"),
("2018-05-20", "17028088", "Anna", "Kathy was very responsive. A seamless entry and exit into the house. Right next to park."),
("2018-05-27", "17028088", "艳萍", "房屋干净整洁舒适 房东非常热情 还有各种吃食"),
("2018-06-05", "17028088", "Courtney", "Kathy and Mary were lovely hosts  They were very accommodating! Their place is beautiful and has everything you need. The shower was amazing and it was a very comfortable place to stay. If your on the tall side you wil have to watch your head upstairs but i loved the space and the layout."),
("2018-06-17", "17028088", "Steve", "The apartment is lovely and ideally situated across the road from Centennial Park. Kathy ensured we had great communication and made everything easy. Will stay here again!"),
("2018-06-26", "17028088", "Peter", "Great space and great location!"),
("2018-07-01", "17028088", "Peter", "Great space. Made our weekend getaway super special."),
("2018-07-10", "17028088", "Themba", "Thank you for making the time there go smoothly. We were really impressed with the lay out and design of the appartment & all of the appliances. The bed was very comfortable and the shower was perfect."),
("2018-07-18", "17028088", "Natalie", "Excellent apartment in great location  clean  tidy and a very friendly host. Highly recommend. "),
("2018-08-03", "17028088", "Shyamalee", "Wonderful Airbnb. Beautiful setting with easy parking. Amenities excellent and such a hospitable lovely host. Would highly recommend this place. My fiancé didn’t want to leave!"),
("2018-08-29", "17028088", "Di", "I stayed in Kathy’s place for three weeks and the overall experience was wonderful. Kathy is super friendly and thoughtful. She always responds to questions and needs timely  but you also have enough privacy as you have your own entrance. The place has all the basic kitchen stuff  so it’s ideal for people who’d like to cook themselves. The location is unbeatable as well. I would definitely recommend this place. "),
("2018-09-27", "17028088", "Corina", "Great place!Internet has issues otherwise super!"),
("2018-09-29", "17028088", "Caeley", "10/10 for service everything was perfect Kathy was so helpful. Will definitely be returning in the future."),
("2018-10-11", "17028088", "Charmaine", "Kathy is an excellent host! She has thought of everything you could need! It really is like a home away from home if you are a solo traveller  2 couples or a family of 4. Very close to Randwick Racecourse  Coogee beach and shops. I will definitely stay here again if I’m in the same area of Sydney."),
("2018-12-02", "17028088", "Kye", "Loved the place  even let me sleep in as they didn't have a guest coming the next day :)"),
("2018-12-30", "17028088", "Rachael", "Great hosts and place to stay! The apartment is immaculate  very clean and tidy. Excellent location if you want to watch the horse races and love to walk around Centennial Park. We really enjoyed our stay & will definitely stay again when holidaying and visiting Sydney!"),
("2019-01-07", "17028088", "Frances", "Kathy’s home in Randwick is perfect if you want something close to Sydney but gives you the option to enjoy the towns nearby.  The bus into Sydney is almost outside the house  so this provides a link to the rest of the extensive public transport system (a tram service will be available soon too).  Opposite Kathy’s house is the most amazing Centennial Park; lakes  walks  fantastic wildlife (including flying foxes roosting in the trees!) and a tasty coffee and snack mean you can spend a happy hour enjoying the peace and tranquility. There is so much to see and do in Sydney you will never be bored. We bought tickets for a performance at the Opera House  took ferry rides and walked miles around the streets. The Rocks and Bangaroo are beautiful and fascinating if you are interested in history  social change and architecture. Bangaroo Reserve is ‘must see’! Outside of the CBD are many other towns some with lovely seaside fronts and beaches. The bus to Coogee Beach is about five minutes away and takes you right to the promenade with shops  cafes and glorious golden sands in less than twenty minutes. Kathy is always on hand if you need some help and advice but you have your own space and privacy. A great place for exploring Sydney and the surrounding areas."),
("2019-01-17", "17028088", "Kristin", "Perfectly comfortable stay. Just what I was after for work"),
("2019-01-24", "17028088", "Jim", "Kathy's place was perfect  a minutes walk to the beautiful Centennial Park and great amenities. Perfect if you have a car and want it as a base to explore Sydney and its surrounds."),
("2019-02-09", "17028088", "Nicky", "Not only was Kathy fabulous  also the place was great. Clean and opposite the park made it a beautiful environment inside and out. This is a home away from home with many little touches that made it even more delicious."),
("2019-02-12", "17028088", "Jo & Paul", "Kathys place was as described and she was a friendly host. There are lovely new appliances  beautiful wooden floor boards and a super comfortable couch. The upstairs space is lovely although I did hit my head on the slopes a couple of times and I wished the windows over the bed opened. I also found the mirror too low for me to do my makeup! The main thing that could have been improved for my stay was that I had picked the place because of the floorboards rather than carpet because I have severe asthma and allergies. Every time I stay somewhere I also have to ask hosts to clean with only bicarbonate soda/vinegar or water and ask for anything fragranced to be removed. I also asked if she used scented laundry powder. Kathy assured me that she understood my needs because her son was asthmatic. However I arrived to an automatic air ”freshener” IN in the house  two stinky bamboo stick diffusers hidden in drawers and extremely fragranced bed linen and towels. This meant that for the first night I had to wear a mask and try to air the place. To sleep I had to remove the pillow cases and cover with my own clothes and try not to breathe when using the towels. The whole experience made my asthma much worse and meant I was uncomfortable and un-well for the entire stay. As an Airbnb host myself I think that the host community need to take requests such as these by guests very seriously and start to prioritize the need for clean and chemical free air over the need to “fragrance” a space."),
("2019-02-27", "17028088", "Leonie", "This is an amazing place to stay. Close to the wonderful Centennial Parklands and the apartment was immaculate- there is nothing I could fault about this place or the host."),
("2019-02-10", "17140064", "Jacob", "Spacious accommodations in a perfect location to get to know Bondi. Would be thrilled to stay here again."),
("2019-02-23", "17140064", "Julie", "Great location  family friendly"),
("2014-01-13", "1714235", "Hazelle", "“Wow” is probably the best word I can think to describe this incredible place. The photos just don’t do it justice. Finished with impeccable taste  this place is definitely a gem.  Located on the best part of Mackeral beach  and surrounded by wildlife - including a resident wallaby who comes so close you can feed him by hand! The water as crystal clear as Thailand and just a two seconds away  down a very well paved and not too steep path. The views from the house and tree house are beyond breathtaking and the owner is super nice and attentive. Upon arrival he sent a message to see if we got in OK and during the booking phase he responded immediately to our questions. The BBQ is state of the ark (very important!) and the place is totally set up for entertaining with a great coffee machine  two fridges  plenty of cutlery  glasses  plates etc ... . Everything has been thought of  from hats and repellant to hooks to hang out your wet beach towels. We will definitely be back. Everyone who stopped by to visit us while we were there will be booking too  so I just hope we can get in! Thank you Richard. You have created a little slice of heaven. "),
("2014-01-28", "1714235", "Julian", "If you are seeking a charmingly rustic  secluded getaway to a cottage located twenty metres from a stunning protected beach; look no further.Getting to the house is a boating adventure directly from Palm Beach (either by the ferry  the friendly local boat house  or the water taxi). Not being able to drive to the house is a nice removal from the mundane  however make sure you pack accordingly.The main sandstone cottage is designed to effortlessly entertain large or small groups of people. The generous outdoor setting is nicely accompanied by extra deck chairs and umbrellas.Richard and Claudia have very tastefully arranged the homely living interiors and bedrooms. The tree-house (bedroom and bathroom)  removed from the main cottage  is fantastic and you are treated to a stunning elevated view to the East. Watching sunrise over the ocean from the comfort of  bed is pretty special.The quiet location means sleeping with the doors open to the sound of gentle waves is a must  and the house is well stocked with mosquito coils to make the pests don't interrupt.The recently renovated kitchen contains everything needed for cooking  and is complemented by the large BBQ outside.There are walking trails nearby which can take you to the West Head lookout  Aboriginal Archaeological sites  and tiny beaches dotted around the headland.All-in-all  a very pleasant stay  and we look forward to any opportunity to return."),
("2014-02-04", "1714235", "Luka", "Hands down one of the nicest places i've ever stayed in. Beautifully perched up on the hill it gives an amazing view out to pittwater & across to palm beach. The interior is chic & understated with a perfect combination of beach retreat & stylish home. The house is nestled in the bush with frangipani trees everywhere & plenty of ample space to relax or entertain guests. I'll be back for sure!"),
("2014-02-07", "1714235", "Grace", "We had a great stay at Richard's House. The view was gorgeous and the place is exactly as shown on picture. In the end we extended our stay by 1 extra night."),
("2014-03-03", "1714235", "Gemma", "I recently stayed at Beach House  Great Mackeral with a few friends for a nice chilled out long weekend. The house exceeded all expectations. In an amazing location with a stunning view its was so nice to chill out and enjoy the peace and quiet in such a perfect setting. Clean  tidy and very homely  the house comes with everything you need (and more). Lots of outdoor space to have a bbq and eat with friends which was great. The beds were really comfortable and the tree house is very cool! To open up the doors each morning from there and see the ocean and boats was just lovely. I loved the fact that you had to get a little ferry over and use a wheelbarrow to get your shopping to the house - it all added to a little adventure away for a few days! Would highly recommend a holiday here! I cant wait to go back!"),
("2014-03-24", "1714235", "Zen", "Thank you  Richard  for a wonderful house and experience on a lovely beach. The house is right on the beach. It is charming and thoughtfully decorated. The lizards/goannas can be a bit alarming but it's all part of the experience. The kitchen and linen cupboards are well supplied. And the fishing is excellent :)"),
("2014-04-22", "1714235", "Sarah", "We spent 3 gorgeous nights at Great Mackeral Beach House. The house was equipped with everything we needed and the quality furnishings made for comfortable relaxing time with family and friends. Great for 2 young families  perfect beach for little ones and older folks alike with plenty to do if you ever tire of just soaking up the beautiful view. Owner was very easy to deal with - would definitely recommend this property. The best part was its proximity to Sydney  but the feeling of being worlds away."),
("2014-05-26", "1714235", "Jessie", "We headed to Great Mackeral for a spontaneous weekend away.  The beach house is idyllic - the location is spectacular  and the house is perfect.  Beachy  comfortable and has everything you need!    We swam  lazed and read on the deck lounges  played Jenga  Uno & Scrabble  and cooked up an absolute feast in the well equipped kitchen.  Aside from all that the house has to offer  we also explored a little further afield with trail runs and bush walks in the surrounding areas.  We also loved the remote feel of the location - we basically had the beach to ourselves  but it took us just under an hour to get there from Sydney  including the very quick ferry ride. We have all returned to the city refreshed  and vowing to get back here as soon as we can.  Richard and Claudia were very responsive  and provided clear instructions on all logistics involved.  Thank you! "),
("2014-08-05", "1714235", "Rachel", "This is  the sort of place one wants to remain secret--but the joy of discovering it is too great not to share the surprise! Wonderful  tranquil surrounds coupled with loving attention to simple warm design that welcomes.  Perfect."),
("2014-09-23", "1714235", "Wayne & Kate", "Stunning! Relaxing  charming  private  secluded and stunning again. A sanctuary. We loved being there and so will you. Although don't go! We'd hate to think it will get booked out. We want to go back! Thanks for having us  Richard. You were a helpful and kind host and we hope to deal with you again. You have a wonderful place!"),
("2014-09-30", "1714235", "Fiona", "Such a special place. Not only is Mackerel a special place but this home is in the perfect location on Mackerel beach. A great outlook  view and the beach 10metres away. We immediately relaxed once there and it's so quick to get to from Sydney (even though you feel far far away). The separate bedroom is particularly incredible. An easy house to entertain in and lots of outdoor space.  Great communication too. Thankyou. We will be back. "),
("2014-10-07", "1714235", "Rebecca", "Richard is quick and helpful when responding to my numerous questions. The place was even more beautiful than i had imagined and there was beyond the necessary supplied for us."),
("2014-10-28", "1714235", "Trav", "We were looking for a place to stay for my mums birthday weekend. Scrolling through AIRBNB and we found this place. All I can say is amazing. Great mackerel has everything you could want and more. The house and tree house is amazing. The kitchen is perfect and the view is unbelievable. Photos definitely don't do the house justice. Strongly recommend. The hosts are contactable and super pleasant. Easy to deal with and very accommodating. We will be aiming to stay again soon."),
("2014-11-10", "1714235", "Markus", "One of the most beautiful places I have been to. The house is lovely  in perfect location  quite and peaceful  very well maintained  just a flight of stairs down to the beach  stunning ocean view from the patio. The host Richard is very helpful. 100% recommendable."),
("2015-01-05", "1714235", "Danica", "We found our heaven at Richard and Claudia's place at Mackerel. It was an ideal home and location for our family and the holiday we wanted.Richard's communication was always prompt and helpful  and he and Claudia went out of their way to assist us with several aspects of our stay. "),
("2015-02-17", "1714235", "Matthew", "What a magical place! From the moment we walked in  we knew this place had something special. The view especially in the early mornings was spectacular and we couldn't be happy with our stay.      When you come  no need to bring a thing! The kitchen is amazingly equipped  linen  towels  games... It's all there. And the host was so so helpful and happy discuss any questions we had on the property or on the area.   RECOMMEND!!"),
("2015-03-31", "1714235", "Trav", "We've stayed here before and were so impressed with the place we had to stay again. Richard is easy to contact  communicate with and is so accomodating. The place is amazing. Perfect for a few nights away. The view is phenomenal to wake up to. A must if you're interested! "),
("2015-08-31", "1714235", "Andrea", "Wonderful property that feels like a home away from home. Well stocked with everything you need to be fully relaxed  comfortable and self cater. Beautifully appointed and lots of space as well as privacy if needed. We stayed in the outside cabin - wonderful experience waking up each day to the sunrise and view - the room bathed in sun during the morning. Perfect beach location  amazing views and the sights and sounds of nature on your doorstep. Richard was very communicative  accommodating and helpful all the way through our stay.  Will definitely stay again. "),
("2015-09-29", "1714235", "Justin", "We felt perfectly welcome and warmly invited stepping off the boat and walking up to the beach house.  Everything we needed was there  and even more!  The beach house was exactly as described  and even more beautiful than the pictures.  Everything worked  and the tree house was a great treat too.  Thank you for a great long weekend and we look forward to visiting again!"),
("2015-10-14", "1714235", "Frankie", "Richard was great! He provided a really useful fact sheet for the beach house  which made finding everything for the stay easy and stress free. The beach house itself was incredible. I've stayed at Mackerel Beach many times and I have to say  this place is definitely the most beautiful. It was wonderful having wifi  as the places I've rented in the past have not. I would definitely stay here again! "),
("2015-12-01", "1714235", "Stephanie & Duane", "Richard's Mackeral Beach property is a gem! A perfect escape from the city for a weekend. Good for groups  with a well appointed kitchen. Richard was an excellent host keeping in touch regularly and taking great care to ensure we had a great relaxing time at Mackeral."),
("2015-12-24", "1714235", "Jennifer", "The most ideal location if you are looking for quiet and peaceful. We enjoyed with our 2 children aged 2 and 4 and my husbands parents. The house is beautiful and is equipped with everything you might need. Steps from the house take you straight onto Mackerel Beach....bliss."),
("2016-01-23", "1714235", "Lisa", "Richard's place and Mackerel Beach are fabulous. This house is perfect. Everything is as described  it is truly stunning and just perfect for a relaxing time. Richard is a great host and easy to contact when organising the trip. We first came to know of this place when friends stayed here last Easter and we were at another place  we are so happy to have found a chance to show my parents (from Canada) this amazing location. Loved the treehouse for my parents. Thanks for having us Richard. We WILL be back!! "),
("2016-02-06", "1714235", "Nikki", "Richard's place is pure serenity. Private beach front this house is perfect for a relaxing get away and the kitchen is incredible. Everything you need! The beds are comfortable and the whole area is so serene. Perfect for a little getaway from Sydney! Can't wait to come back."),
("2016-02-08", "1714235", "John", "Fantastic spot with loads of character. Plenty of info from Richard to make sure we had a great stay- which we did. Thanks again."),
("2016-03-15", "1714235", "Myriam & Alex", "RIchard's house is a pure gem! There is no word to describe how amazing and amazingly located it is! Sleep with the sound of the waves  wake up to an amazing sunrise  go down a few steps and go for a swim  sit down at the front of the house and take in the beautiful scenery... The house itslef is very cute and cosy  the kitchen is very well equiped and the tree house is charming. Mackerel Beach is a wonderful place  and the best is it's only 1 hour from Sydney! Oh I wish I could be there every weekend! Richard is easy to communicate with and arranging  and everything was perfect :)"),
("2016-04-23", "1714235", "Melinda", "The view from the Beach House is a stunner - unspoilt panoramic views across the pittwater - it's truely unique and one of our favourites.  We had a wonderful family holiday our children loved the outdoor spaces and had loads of freedom within earshot of us. The house is well appointed and the kitchen has everything you need and more. Richard was a great host and easy to get in touch with. We stayed for 2 weeks and the weather overall was fantastic. We were thankful for this as the main house is small for two families (particularly when it's raining and you can't get outside). One small gripe was the main bathroom which is really in need of an update. The shower drain blocked a couple of times which we had to pump out. There were ants at night coming through the cracks in the wall. It was all pretty basic. The house is not cheap over the school holidays and at the rate we were paying we would have expected this to be in better condition. Overall we had a great stay. PS we thankfully didn't see the 1.5m goana roaming the property  just possums and wallabies!"),
("2016-07-10", "1714235", "Emily", "Richards house at Mackeral Beach was amazing and Richard was a responsive and helpful guest. Despite the initial trouble locating the property in the dark and rain with three children in tow  we were thrilled to arrive and settle in to the small but very well appointed and beautifully decorated cottage. Absolutely everything you could need for a comfortable stay was at your fingertips  not to mention the beach  view  sunrises and an amazing garden  and our family of 5 had a very memorable and unique long weekend there. The only thing worth noting for families with young kids is to be aware that the 'tree house'  whilst stunning  is probably not suitable for children under the age of 8-10 if sleeping alone. Despite this we would return in a heartbeat and recommend to all! Thank you Richard!"),
("2017-01-28", "1714235", "Melanie", "We enjoyed a fantastic stay at Mackerel Beach with our friends and family. The house is small but beautifully appointed with everything you need. So very relaxing. Thank you Ruchard!"),
("2017-02-11", "1714235", "Ed", "We were blown away by Richards place at Mackarel Beach. A short ferry ride from Palm Beach and you feel instantly on holidays and relaxed. The house is right on the beach and has a fantastic view. You'll spend most of your time admiring it. Do yourself a favour and stay"),
("2017-04-16", "1714235", "Vanessa", "Spectacular views! Gorgeous beach front cottage that is stylish and comfortable and very well equipped with all you need to make your stay a delight. Our kids loved the freedom of exploring on their own and the surrounding bushwalks and beaches were stunning.  Sleeping to the lull of the ocean was beautiful and the sun rises were incredible.  You feel a million miles away yet only a 10 min ferry ride from Palm Beach.  Such a great spot we cant wait to visit again.  Richard was a great host - communicative and responsive."),
("2017-04-23", "1714235", "Callum", "This is a fantastic location and great house.  Provides a true 'away from it all' experience while still being close to Sydney.  We we're pleasantly surprised by the beach - the kids had a great time playing on the sand below  while parents could have a wine at the house and watch from above. "),
("2017-10-01", "1714235", "Jonathon", "We spent an excellent long weekend at this lovely spot. Even with six adults and two small children the place felt spacious. The house had everything we needed and more. You couldn't be any closer to the beach and Great Mackerel is a prefect location."),
("2017-10-06", "1714235", "Emma", "A very comfortable home in an amazing location. The perfect place for anyone that needs to switch off for a few days.Communication with Richard was great. He did everything he could to make our stay enjoyable including having the construction workers next door turn their radio down. The kiddies loved the easy access to the beach and also spent lots of time playing the many games that are available.We didn’t want for anything."),
("2017-10-22", "1714235", "Marcus", "This is the perfect paradise for a quiet relaxing weekend. Beachfront is right there and omg the view all over Palm Beach and the lighthouse is simply amazing. There is also a separate tree house/parents retreat/teenagers getaway."),
("2017-10-28", "1714235", "Donna", "WOW just beautiful!Had the most amazing weekend here with our three adult children and their partners/friends. It was perfect for us because my husband and I could retreat to the tree house for peace and quiet and enjoy the breathtaking views. Right from the start  communication with Richard was perfect. He went out of his way to make our stay enjoyable and even organised a mooring so that we could take our boat. The location is just spectacular  very quiet  and breathtakingly beautiful. The house is lovely  comfortable  clean and so well equipped. The showers were amazing and we loved the hot water outdoor shower to get all that sand off. The evenings cooled down enough to light the pit fire to sit around. Just be sure to keep doors closed when not inside  a bush turkey enjoyed a lovely cheese platter. Cant wait to go back."),
("2017-12-10", "1714235", "Andy", "Richard was amazing to deal with. He was great at communication and helping us know how to make the most of our time at this wonderful place. It truly is a special place and well worth a visit."),
("2018-01-11", "1714235", "Kate", "Lovely place and Richard is very helpful."),
("2018-02-04", "1714235", "Alex", "A perfect dream escape for one or many. We were a group of old friends catching up and this was perfect to swim  cook and sit together. Richard is a perfect considerate host and Great Mackerel is a place of beauty."),
("2018-02-14", "1714235", "Ali", "I have been an airbnb user for years and have never experienced a host as wonderful as Richard. He went out of his way to ensure we had a magical trip and we would recommend his place to anyone in a heartbeat. Do yourself a favour and book a getaway at Mackerel Beach - divine location  beautiful house and outstanding host."),
("2018-02-24", "1714235", "Angie", "What an incredibly beautiful location and charming beach house!! We were a group of 8 and found the house cosy and inviting with plenty of space for all of us to relax. Before our trip most of the group had not previously heard of Mackerel Beach  but it has quickly become a favourite destination in Sydney. Richard and Claudia are great hosts and were in touch before and throughout to ensure we had everything we needed. It’s not a matter of if we’ll go back but when! I have already recommended this property to family and friends. Thank you! It was a very memorable weekend away for all of us and the beautiful space you’ve created was a big part of that!"),
("2018-03-04", "1714235", "Kerry-Anne", "This house is only 50 minutes from Sydney CBD and a 10 minute ferry/water taxi ride. It is literally on the beach and most rooms have fantastic views across the water. It is very relaxing and accommodating with everything you might need - just byo food and drink. After 3 days it felt like we had been away for a week. We would definitely come back again."),
("2018-04-14", "1714235", "Martina", "The Sandstone Cottage in Mackerel Beach is just absolutely stunning. The architecture of the house  the choice of furniture  the high quality linen and towels around the house  the handmade ceramics  the collection of art and objects around the house  the outside shower  the list goes on and on. The house has absolutely everything you could possibly wish for. It's one of the most beautiful houses we have ever been in. It makes you feel like you have arrived in paradise. I can recommend this as a serious experience if you wanna have a teste of heaven. :)"),
("2018-05-05", "1714235", "Sophia", "Richard's place is exceptionally beautiful. It's chic and in a truly excellent location. Perfect for a little getaway. Richard was lovely to deal with  generous with his home and the home was thoughtfully stocked with everything you might require. We had an excellent little holiday."),
("2018-05-27", "1714235", "Liz", "My husband and I had a wonderful weekend at Richards gorgeous home  it was deeply relaxing  lovely views accross Pittwater right on the doorstep. We lots of fun and rest  a perfect weekend getaway  highly recommend "),
("2018-07-02", "1714235", "Alan", "Lovely property in a very special spot"),
("2018-07-11", "1714235", "Meagan", "A gorgeous and secluded home that is perfect for a quiet getaway. The house is cozy and fantastically equipped. We enjoyed cooking delicious meals and enjoying the view of Pittwater by day and the fire pit at night.Very family friendly with a number of stunning bush walks to choose from. We highly recommend this property."),
("2018-07-15", "1714235", "Tim", "Simply amazing little house in a relatively unknown part of Australia. We were there for 4 nights but it felt much longer. We played cards and board games at night  did not  turn the television on once. Thanks Richard! "),
("2018-07-22", "1714235", "Jane", "Can't say enough good things about this place. It's in one of the most beautiful spots in Sydney  with a gorgeous  sheltered North-east aspect looking over Barrenjoey Island. The house makes the most of the space - with beautiful and ample outdoor spaces to enjoy the view  and a gorgeously landscaped garden. It's even nicer than the photos if that's possible.The house is full of character and very stylishly appointed  yet relaxed and beachy enough so you feel at ease - and OK with kids!The treehouse bedroom is spectacular and we loved how it was decorated :-)Richard and Claudia have thought of everything - there's filtered tap water  coffee pods  and even a rice cooker which we used. We absolutely loved the fire pit - we were staying in July and were surprised at how much heat it gave as we sat around it watching the moon rise and the stars come out.Mackeral Beach itself is stunning - so nice to have peace from cars  and go for a bush walk on Sunday to Resolute Beach. The ferry was an easy way to travel  as was the water taxi.A wallaby came to visit us on the first night which was lovely. Richard was so nice and helpful to deal with via email and texts. Basically  we all want to move here! Falling short of that  we'll definitely be back for a holiday. "),
("2018-07-29", "1714235", "Michael And Eve", "The location of Richards house is amazing! The views are beautiful and the peace and quiet is like nowhere else we’ve ever travelled! The house itself is well stocked with all the kitchen utensils you could want. It has been updated enough to have all the comforts you want and expect but still maintains the cottage feel. The only downside we experienced was with the mosquitos  even in winter you need to be mindful to keep all doors and windows closed. "),
("2018-08-05", "1714235", "Tim", "Five stars is really insufficient for this place  the position is idyllic  our host was exemplary - he even fixed the weather which was perfect all weekend - and there was great attention to detail and numerous extras such as the fire pit all ready with kindling  or the kayaks on hand and the complimentary bottle of wine. Just perfect."),
("2018-08-30", "1714235", "Matthew", "Richard's cottage is definitely an even better experience than the pictures suggest  very scenic views and lots of comfort. We used the cottage as a unique location for a film production. Richard was extremely helpful in providing local knowledge for ease of logistical preparations. The one trouble my team experienced was unrelated to the location  however  a result of the location's remoteness (only accessible by water). That problem was that the Barge Service cancelled on us due to unexpectedly rough (unsafe) water and wind conditions  which affected schedule on our bump in. You also must not forget anything as it is not practical to run errands if you forget to bring anything with you. Other than this  the film shoot went very well and everyone was excited by the cottage and its views. On another note: the neighbours were incredibly friendly and helpful. It was very easy to make contact with them  liaise with them leading up to the shoot and on the day they were very cooperative on a few requests of ours. The water taxi and barge service operators were also friendly  punctual and cooperative. I would recommend this place and hope to someday return for a weekend holiday to this paradise corner - it really is a hidden gem of Sydney."),
("2018-09-07", "1714235", "Mark", "Beautiful place  perfect view. Richard was v communicative. Had an awesome couple of days with my work colleagues."),
("2018-10-08", "1714235", "Alex", "I recommend anyone who'd like to get away from the tumult of the city this wonderful peaceful hideaway. They've thought of everything for a relaxing get away"),
("2018-10-20", "1714235", "Kerry", "Richards hospitality and beautiful home is an amazing place to stay for any occasion. We are seven women who appreciate great food and great environment. This is a perfect place to relax  read swim cook great food and be amazed by the views accords the water to Palm Beach."),
("2018-11-06", "1714235", "Bill", "Cosy cottage with magnificent tranquil views. Right on the beach so immediate access to the water!"),
("2018-12-16", "1714235", "Allison", "Spectacularly located cottage perfect for walks on the beach  swims and relaxing on the deck with a good book."),
("2018-12-22", "1714235", "Rosalind", "Beautiful views  a very special place to stay. Richard was an excellent host. Great walks  kayaking and swimming in Mackerel Beach."),
("2019-01-27", "1714235", "Louise", "Our favourite Airbnb !! Beautiful home with a breathtaking view. We spent many afternoons watching the sun set and sipping wine. Our children loved the beach and staying at this home too. Stunning decor. Wonderful thoughtful host. A truly magical place to escape to and relax. We will be back!"),
("2019-02-02", "1714235", "Trav", "We’ve stayed at The McCallister’s regularly and always recommend it to others wanting a quick getaway. The house is perfect. The beach is paradise and the view is spectacular. Great hosts and wouldn’t want to stay anywhere else in the Pittwater region."),
("2017-03-30", "17223695", "Sarah", "Anita and Peter are fantastic hosts. The apartment was beautifully decorated and immaculate. Beds are exceptionally comfortable. The location in Manly was perfect  you can see the beach from the balcony  less than 10min stroll to the corso  and less than 20min to Manly Wharf. Loved our stay here and wish we could have moved in permanently! "),
("2017-04-05", "17223695", "Jillian", "This place is a total gem! The location is fabulous in quiet area  30 seconds to beach  and so close to all the good cafes & restaurants. The space itself has just been completely renovated and is super fresh & comfortable. The beds  towels  carpets  everything in the flat  are all really just so nice. Anita & her family are so warm  friendly  and accommodating. Amazing stay. We couldn't have been any happier."),
("2017-04-07", "17223695", "Caroline", "Great place to stay. Close to beach (2 minutes). Close to cafes  shops and restaurants and other entertainment.  Uber also available in the area. Unit is spacious and comfortable.  Hosts communicate very well and are very accommodating with ant issues.   Parking onsite Is fantastic as you always have your space.  Facilities in unit are all you need.  Enjoyed our stay and would love to spend a few days again just relaxing and walking the beach etc.  "),
("2017-04-15", "17223695", "Simon", "Loved the location and the spacious property.  Easy to get around with ferry close by.  Many restaurants  cafes and supermarket for essentials  all very close.  The beach is literally short stroll away.  Well appointed and tastefully furnished.  We loved our week's stay and would stay again if opportunity arose.  The hosts were also very welcoming and most importantly very responsive."),
("2017-04-18", "17223695", "Paul", "Great 3 bedroom apartment on the South end of Manly Beach.  Close to the Corso and an easy walk to the ferry.  You can see the beach from the balcony  only a minute walk.  Apartment was light and airy  and just as pictured.  The common space is pretty big and very comfortable.  It was just me and my wife  so we didn't use the other bedrooms  but enjoyed some extra common space.  There is a washer and dryer  and a brand new gas grill on the balcony.  This is the first airbnb that we have stayed in that had hotel quality beds  pillows and linens.  Very comfortable.  Only stayed 2 nights  but would go back for a week in a heart beat."),
("2017-04-20", "17223695", "Prina", "This apartment is stunning  well equipped  - stones throw away from the beach  shops and restaurants. Anita is a great host and will accommodate where possible and makes you feel very welcome. It was perfect for our stay in Manly and felt like home from home. Would definitely recommend a stay there if you are looking for a place close to the beach with everything you could wish for when on holiday! "),
("2017-04-25", "17223695", "Pascoe", "Anita was a great host and the apartment was very clean and in a awesome location will definitely be back"),
("2017-05-26", "17223695", "Timo", "We (family of 5) have spent all together roughly 2 months in Anita's apartment in Manly. We have nothing but praise about her and her husband Peter who are very responsive and willing to help when needed. Apartment was spotless and decorated with an eye for detail. Beds were fantastic and so is the location 50 meters from the beach."),
("2017-06-29", "17223695", "Stephanie", "This place was just perfect for our stay. We are locals that needed a ""staycation"" so we know the area well  and it is in the loveliest location. Beautifully styled and safe for my 3 kids. Would definitely stay there again (even though we live only a few minutes away)!! Actually  I will definitely be calling Anita again when I have guests in town that need accommodation."),
("2017-07-02", "17223695", "Deirdre", "We had a wonderful getaway to Manly and thoroughly enjoyed Anita's place.  It was in a great location; steps away from the beach.  Anita was a phenomenal host and worked very hard on our behalf to work out an issue that was out of her control.  We have stayed in many Airbnb places and I can say Anita is the best host we have worked with.  The place was wonderful.  Nicely decorated and well appointed.  We loved our trip to Manly and plan to return.  Without a doubt we will reach out to Anita when we plan our next trip.  Thanks for everything Anita!"),
("2017-07-09", "17223695", "Nicole", "Prime location  short walking distance from Manly beach  fantastic cafes and Corso. Off street parking. Immaculately presented accommodation with thoughtful extras to make you feel at home. Great communication from host and flexible check and check out arrangements. Couldn't rate higher."),
("2017-07-16", "17223695", "Michael", "Perfect location for Manly. Very comfortable and Anita was very accommodating. Highly recommended."),
("2017-07-22", "17223695", "Carlos", "Anita is a rockstarshe will go the extra mile for you"),
("2017-07-30", "17223695", "Kimberley", "Great location in the heart of Manly with all that it has to offer. The apartment is light and bright with beautiful decor. Fully equipped with easy access from the garage or side stairs."),
("2017-08-11", "17223695", "Tommy", "This apartment is ideally located in Manly. It is very clean and fresh and It was everything it was documented to be! Easy checkin and no issues at all"),
("2017-08-13", "17223695", "Haydon", "This place is stunning.  Location superb and an amazing lifestyle."),
("2017-08-18", "17223695", "Nicole", "This is great apartment  one of the best I would say  and we have staying in a few different place in Manly over the last 12 months.  The decor is lovely  the rooms are great and beds are all super comfy.  It has a great kitchen and living area as well as a large outdoor seating space where you can see the water.  Fast wifi  Bose Bluetooth  2 smart TV's with Netflix and Spotify.  In all  it's a great apartment that you could easily feel at home living in for either a short or long stay."),
("2017-08-22", "17223695", "Fiona", "The ferry wharf and all of the sights were just a short walk from the apartment. Anita's place was really big  clean  and comfortable and had everything we needed  including an abundance of linen  wifi  Netflix  and complimentary Tim Tams in the fridge."),
("2017-08-25", "17223695", "Haydon", "We love this place. A true gem and delivers everything you need for a getaway in vibrant Manly. Anita is an amazing host and has decorated the apartments in such a beautiful style. Will certainly be back."),
("2017-08-27", "17223695", "Jess", "Had a great stay! The appartment was perfectly situated and Anita was super helpful! Would highly recommend this accomodation!"),
("2017-09-17", "17223695", "Richard", "This apartment is a very stylish and excellently kitted out. It's first class accommodation in a first class location. The Manly ferry is ideal  for seeing Sydney and Manly itself has a very enjoyable spot with great facilities and relaxed feel to it."),
("2017-09-28", "17223695", "Judy", "We just had a fantastic time with 4 teenagers.  Anita is a fantastic host who always responded definitely within the hour and always so helpful.  You can't beat the location of Portobello  you can just walk everywhere. Beach on one end of the street and the harbour on the other  Coles only 2 blocks away. Having a garage to park the car was great as there is only 2 hour parking on the streets.  So many thoughtful extras like a clothes stand  dish rack  heaps of cutlery and dishes  and of course the Tim Tams in the fridge.  Everything was clean  beds were comfy.  Even though there was air-cond in the living area  there was another one in the main bedroom and a heater in the living area  just to make it even more snug  along with supersoft blankets on the sofa.  Loved the view from the balcony too.  Just an amazing place - the best."),
("2017-10-02", "17223695", "Grant", "A fantastically located and beautifully renovated apartment close to the beach in Manly.  Vary spacious with all the amenities that are needed for a relaxing stay for our family of five.  Large garage and off street parking was a real bonus. Anita was a fantastic host  excellent communication and offered flexibility with our arrival.  I have no hesitation in recommending this great apartment and will definitely stay again on our next trip to Manly.  Thanks  Anita."),
("2017-10-13", "17223695", "Alice", "Anita's place is fabulous!! Great location  very spacious and Anita could not have been a more helpful host. We would certainly recommend it to anyone!"),
("2017-10-23", "17223695", "Lorna", "Superb apartment. Superb location. Superb host."),
("2017-10-29", "17223695", "Adriana", "This property is all and more! I will be back and will continue recommending this property who wish to visit Manly. Thanks again for an amazing weekend."),
("2017-11-04", "17223695", "Irina", "Beautiful spacious Appartement to soak up the best of what Manly has to offer. Only 50 m from swim area on the beach and the Shelley beach walk  supermarket nearby  <3  min walk to the ferry and a fantastic host- we had an amazing short stay with our kids."),
("2017-11-12", "17223695", "Robert", "Very clean & comfortable apartment. Close to all amenities.Host was very accommodating.Highly recommended accommodation  we will be back."),
("2017-11-19", "17223695", "Kavitha", "Amazing place..awesome location..great hostess..would definitely recommend"),
("2017-12-29", "17223695", "Kate", "Such a fantastic place  wonderful host and amazing location- highly recommend!"),
("2018-01-05", "17223695", "Renee", "We loved staying at Anita's flat  which has a wonderful deck with big dining tables inside and outside.  The apartment is well stocked with all the comforts of home  nice decor and many kitchen items for preparing meals.  The location is a stones throw from the beach  which you can see from the living room  and a 10 minute walk to the ferry.  The communication was great  too."),
("2018-01-12", "17223695", "Michelle", "Perfectly situated within easy walking distance of the wharf  beaches  restaurants and supermarkets.  The area was also surprisingly quiet and perfect for a family holiday.The apartment is well equipped and we didn't want for anything.I would certainly recommend Anita as a host and this apartment for anyone wanting to visit Manly."),
("2018-02-03", "17223695", "Tim & Monica", "AMAZING location  on the local-side of Manly Corso  just 50m from Manly Surf Club and 100m from Manly Cove (harbour beach). Anita made the process easy and was very hospitable. We loved our stay and hope to come back when we are next in town!"),
("2018-02-09", "17223695", "Stuart", "We had a mixture of ‘first time to Sydney ‘ and ‘ been before’ in our family group. The apartment was so convenient for everything - the beach - the shops and the ferry  it couldn’t have been better. If you are on the beach and have forgotten something it literally only takes a minute to return to the apartment.We had a hire car and the large garage with electronic doors was a major ‘ plus’ as parking In Manly can be a  big challenge especially at the weekend when the beach is busy.Anita has thought of everything - washing liquid - dishwasher tablets- sewing kit - ironing board - so many things that in other rentals you have to go out to stock up with a months supply that you only use for a week. Anita has it all - it’s a small touch that really raises the quality of the rental.We are definitely coming back - already booked for trip two! The first timers and the experienced visitors in our family group all have new memories to cherish of our week in Manly.Anita is very responsive and we are grateful to her for making our week in Manly so comfortable."),
("2018-02-16", "17223695", "Laura", "You can't beat the location! A lovely ocean view and comfortable place to stay. You are in walking distance to everything  but are on a one way portion of the street  so traffic is minimal. The place is clean and stylish. A good value for the money."),
("2018-02-23", "17223695", "Martin", "The department of Anita is the best of Manly  I say it without knowing the others  but I assure you that it is impossible to find a better one. Location 10  comfort 10  cleaning 10 and hostess Anita 10. I think I was clear! Thank you very much Anita  I hope to return soon"),
("2018-02-26", "17223695", "Amy", "Anita and her place were fantastic. The location was amazing. The beds were comfortable and the home clean. The washer and dryer in unit was a huge convenience for our group. Anita was very quick to respond to inquiries and worked to find a place for us to store luggage before and after our check in and out. A true five star Airbnb."),
("2018-03-03", "17223695", "Wendy", "the apartment is spacious and very clean quite location which is nice  the only down for is the bathrooms too small and needs air-cons in the spare rooms. We had a lovely time and Anita is a great host. We would stay again."),
("2018-03-11", "17223695", "Judy", "This is our second time here and it is just great.  You can really relax when you know everything is perfect  not only the location but everything is clean  functional and practical  and on top of that so many nice touches like the Tim Tams in the fridge and the lovely organic shower wash and apple shampoo.  Every time I see a green apple I will think of Portobello!  With 4 teenagers  it is just the best place.  I appreciated the garage and the extra parking spots as my kids have their own cars now and we all come together at Manly.  We are making lovely memories and are already planning our next stay.  Anita is an exceptional host  super prompt replies and so helpful and friendly. Everything is just so fantastic  come and see for yourself and stay as long as you can."),
("2018-03-18", "17223695", "Ross", "Great location obliging host"),
("2018-04-07", "17223695", "Leslie", "Location is second to none and the place is spotless and is equipped with everything you need and more"),
("2018-04-09", "17223695", "Rene", "Fab apartment! Great location and Anita had been very accommodating."),
("2018-04-17", "17223695", "Kris", "Great Location and Amenities. Perfect for families or couples."),
("2018-04-23", "17223695", "James", "This apartment is in an amazing location with amazing views of manly beach. The apartment is spacious and beautifully styled. Would highly recommend"),
("2018-05-28", "17223695", "Kimmy", "The apartment was in a very good area of Manly. Very close to all the action happening on the main street with all the markets and the restaurants. The apartment was close to the beach but  also very quiet. Great spot."),
("2018-06-06", "17223695", "Oliver", "Phenomenal place (layout  size  and amenities) and location - we could see the sea from the balcony. Anita was an excellent host."),
("2018-06-11", "17223695", "Ian", "Highly recommended for location  cleanliness  friendliness  helpfulness and space. This place would suit families or couples looking for beach  cafe and restaurant break. Had everything we needed including secure parking that we can't usually get when we come to manly. Would stay again."),
("2018-06-22", "17223695", "Ivan", "A very thoughtful designed place. The vibe feels like a getaway home since its very close to manly and shelly beach (with great local restaurants) yet its sootheningly quiet. The place is only 5-10minutes to ferry wharf to the city (opera house) as well  its a very convenient.l transportation choice.Anita recommends great local places and was very responsive before  during  and after the stay.There are plenty of house utilities as well so you dont have to worry. I would definitely go back."),
("2018-07-02", "17223695", "Lindy", "We had a great stay in Anita's flat - it was very clean  superb location and plenty of room  would definitely recommend."),
("2018-07-09", "17223695", "Jennifer", "We enjoyed our stay at Portobello it had everything we needed in the unit and so close to shops and a lovely walking path by the beach would highly recommend this beautiful unit and hope we get the opportunity to stay again some time"),
("2018-07-16", "17223695", "Deirdre", "This is our second time staying at Anita’s place in manly.  It is so convenient to everything with all the comforts of home.  Anita is a dream to work with and the apartment has everything you might need.  If you are looking for a place in Manly  you will never regret picking this place.  We love it and will return every chance we get!  Thanks Anita! ❤️"),
("2018-07-29", "17223695", "Judy", "Great location  great place  definitely recommend to anyone wanting to stay in Manly!"),
("2018-08-27", "17223695", "Wayne", "Beautiful apartment in excellent location. Faultless presentation. Anita is an excellent host & very quick to communicate when required. We had a    great weekend & would be happy to return. Can highly recommend."),
("2018-09-11", "17223695", "Freya", "Absolute gem of an apartment just footsteps to the golden sand and crystal blue surf of Manly Beach. Always a pleasure to find a place that is sparkling clean and has the easy style and amenities to make your stay a perfect holiday. We loved everything about this apartment and can’t wait for an excuse to come back. We really appreciated Anita’s communication as a host too."),
("2018-10-01", "17223695", "Francis", "A lovely apartment in a great place Manly near everything but in a nice quite street."),
("2018-10-14", "17223695", "Kylie", "We were very happy to have found such a fantastic place to stay in Manly. The 3 bedroom apartment with lock up garage so close to Manly beach was clean  bright and had everything we needed for our stay from toiletries  hair dryer to kitchen extras. The responses from Anita were quick and she did everything she could to make our stay perfect. The beds were comfortable and the apartment had a great feel with lovely furnishings and everything we needed. We had wifi  netflix which was ideal for the kids as it rained a lot and there was plenty of storage  towels  beach towels and many extras  that made our stay very comfortable. I would highly recommend this apartment and we look forward to staying here again in the future."),
("2018-11-04", "17223695", "Lucinda", "Beautiful apartment in a great location. Easy walk to the ferry into Sydney."),
("2018-11-11", "17223695", "Cathy", "This place is perfection in every way and Anita is a superb host. We had a great weekend in this beautiful home and will absolutely be back."),
("2018-11-24", "17223695", "R Scott", "An excellent experience   in a well maintained beautiful property   great location and management ."),
("2018-12-08", "17223695", "Anne", "Great location.Walk to everywhere necessary for a great break but close enough to enjoy the city by public transport."),
("2018-12-28", "17223695", "Grant", "This place has an awesome view from the large deck with grill  table  and seating. It is close to Blue Mountains hiking trails and lookouts and Blackheath is a nice small town to explore with restaurants  shops  antiques  and art. Katoomba is a very short drive."),
("2019-01-08", "17223695", "Marianne", "Great location! Anita always responds straight away. Well equipped apartment and a great balcony! Close to everything!"),
("2019-01-13", "17223695", "Gayle", "A stylish  well equipped   well proportioned  apartment in the best location.  As good as it looked in the photographs. Anita is a lovely host  quick to respond and made our arrival  stay and departure as simple and convenient to us as was possible .  Hope the apartment is free on my next visit!"),
("2019-02-04", "17223695", "Simon", "Fantastic gem of an apartment with a spacious balcony and sea views. Amazing location  so near the beach! Easy to get around  great local food shops  restaurants  places for breakfast! Wish we could have stayed longer! Would recommend highly."),
("2019-02-10", "17223695", "Bianca", "We had 5 nights at Anita’s place. The location could not have been better  super close to the beach and shops  and walking distance to the Manly yacht club (for the wedding we were there for).The apartment presented as described  and did not disappoint. Communication with Anita was easy and she was prompt coming back to me on queries.Highly recommend."),
("2019-02-23", "17223695", "Angelina", "Great place to stay and very handy to all locations  we very much enjoyed our stay thank you Anita"),
("2013-10-31", "1718606", "Sutara And Steve", "Susan was very hospitable and the cabin was very comfortable."),
("2013-11-22", "1718606", "Jay", "Great little cabin. Private  warm and cosy with everything you need. Susan is a lovely and thoughtful host. Recommended to anyone "),
("2013-11-25", "1718606", "Kylie", "Lovely private little cabin in the back garden with en suite. Susan is a friendly and helpful host. Angelo the cat is also friendly. Close to Norton Street where there are lots of cafes and restaurants. Public transport is also close for a 30 min ride into the city."),
("2013-11-29", "1718606", "Rebecca", "A convenient option for those wanting to be close to the city but have a bit of peace and quiet. The cabin is a lovely space. Although access to the cabin is through the house  Susan is really obliging and friendly. "),
("2013-12-05", "1718606", "John", "Susan was a thoughtful and considerate host."),
("2013-12-16", "1718606", "Kim", "I recently spent a Saturday night in Susan's leafy cabin in Leichhardt - my first Airbnb experience - and was pleased with the ease of booking and low cost. Susan is a friendly  relaxed and hospitable host. The cabin is spotlessly clean  cute  and had a very comfortable bed. Angelo the cat was sometimes chatty but not annoying. The area is convenient and easily accessible by public transport but also suburban which would be interesting for international visitors. The only drawback of the location is the overhead flight path which woke me on Sunday morning  although I went back to sleep once I realised what the noise was! It really felt like I was staying at an old friend's house - one where you could just please yourself - and I'd thoroughly recommend it to others."),
("2013-12-21", "1718606", "Mike & Marisa", "My husband and I had a great stay at Susan's backyard cabin! We were there for 4 nights right before the holiday season and was a last minute stay.  Susan is extremely friendly and accommodating.  We enjoyed chatting with her and her cat Angelo.  The cabin is great for 2 people and was very private and clean. It also has lots of closet space for travelers.  The wifi connectivity was good and there's always street parking available.  We also enjoyed having our breakfast on her verandah. It was very peaceful.  Susan's home is located in a great Sydney suburb that's close to lots of great restaurants and cafes.  Everyday we drove to the Stanmore train station to catch the train to the city  which only takes about 30 min. Very easy and convenient!  "),
("2014-01-25", "1718606", "Kerrie", "Thoroughly enjoyed my stay with Susan. The cabin is clean and private  with plenty of space to relax and watch a bit of TV or read a book. It's also great to have your own clean bathroom and shower. Susan is a lovely host and I would definitely stay with her again."),
("2014-01-26", "1718606", "Geoff & Lenore", "We had a wonderful stay at Susans little cottage. It was perfect for our stay in the city as we were celebrating a friends birthday close by. We had some lovely chats and will be staying with Susan again."),
("2014-01-28", "1718606", "Steve", "Wonderful cottage. Two problems - on the main flight path for Sydney Airport  but tolerable. Make sure you ask Sue if the hot water booster button has been pushed  otherwise you may not get hot enough water in the shower."),
("2014-02-11", "1718606", "Colin", "Our stay here in this lovely little cabin was just perfect for our needs. Susan was a first class host  and did all she could to make us welcome and comfortable. The bed was the most comfortable we've slept in during our 3 months in Oz  (and the stars - a wonderful bonus).  If you're looking for a sterile modern glass and  plastic accommodation - this is not for you. This little cabin is a separate part of a warm and friendly real home  - our cabin had it's own privacy  charm and character  and the en-suit was small but perfectly fitted and extremely functional. When we first realized we had to walk through the house to get to our accommodation  we were a little daunted  but we need not have worried  nothing was simpler and we had our own keys to come and go as we pleased. When we are in this lovely area in the future   we would definitely love stay here again.   "),
("2014-02-18", "1718606", "Andrew", "Susan is friendly and helpful and the backyard cabin is clean  well-equipped and has a comfortable bed. The planes can be loud and frequent at times  but were not so bothersome that we needed to close the window  and there is a curfew so it doesn't go all night. Angelo the cat is sweet."),
("2014-02-23", "1718606", "Joy", "Susan was a very obliging host and made us very welcome. The cabin was everything we required and was well presented. Would definitely stay again."),
("2014-02-28", "1718606", "Belinda", "Susan's accommodation was clean and comfy and I recommend it as a nice place to stay. Susan is friendly and could not do enough to ensure our comfort."),
("2014-03-04", "1718606", "Liz", "I had a long weekend in Susan's cabin and it was great.  Everything was just as described.  The cabin was comfortable and clean.  The location was very convenient with great restaurants a short walk away.  Susan was away during my stay but she arranged for someone to be there to let me in  and to show me around.  I would definitely return if I have to visit Sydney again."),
("2014-03-13", "1718606", "Iuri", "The cabin is perfect  perfect location and very clean  we had a great time during our stay. Susan was very kind and extremely available for our every need  even taking us with our bags to our new home in sydney. Thanks Susan  and greetings to the beautiful cat Angel."),
("2014-03-16", "1718606", "Amid", "Sudan is a truly a great human  she is super nice and very caring. I really enjoyed staying there. It is a great value for the rate offered and the area is really nice too. Next time I am in Sydney I hope I can stay at her place again. I highly recommend staying at Susan's."),
("2014-03-20", "1718606", "Kat", "Susan was a lovely host. The cabin is adorable  and nicely separate from the house. There was plenty of fruit  nuts  juice  and tea for breakfast  and although the bread was running low the first morning  Susan was quick to let us know that evening that she'd bought some delicious bread for the next day (without us having to ask or anything). As I was staying with a vegan friend and a gluten-free/lactose-free friend  the food options were really great.At one point one of my travelling companions had an allergic reaction to her cat  and on the way out  we casually asked if she might have some Telfast or something similar  and she was more than happy to provide that. And in a sudden rainstorm  she equipped us with two umbrellas to ensure that we got to our destination only partially soaking wet.All in all  we had a lovely stay  and would not hesitate to stay here again. "),
("2014-03-23", "1718606", "Jonathan", "Susan was a nice host and helpful in helping us with our sight seeing and transport.  The cabin is on it's own in the back yard which was nice for privacy. We were pleased with our stay."),
("2014-03-27", "1718606", "Brigitte", "We enjoyed our stay with Susan! She was amazing and gave us loads of tips on things to do in Sydney and for our further (Website hidden by Airbnb) cabin is a nice size with private bathroom...all nice and clean. We would recommend Susan to everyone."),
("2014-04-03", "1718606", "Alex", "This was probably one of our best hosts during our trip around New Zealand and Australia. She was very very helpful  giving us advice and tips about the best way to visit Sydney and their main spots.The cabin is big  with plenty of space for two people  its own toilette and shower  and even a small living room where rest. The situation of the place was very good  with plenty of bus stops to the city and other spots of the city.She was as kind to let us use her kitchen  and use some of her cooking stuff. She was really lovely  a perfect host  and we highly recommend staying with her."),
("2014-04-10", "1718606", "Sandra", "Clean  cozy and private. Susan was a great host. I would choose to stay there again in the future. "),
("2014-04-14", "1718606", "Naama", "We really enjoyed staying here. Great location  the room has all that we needed  including great shower and beds. Susan is lovely  helped us a lot in any kind of information we needed. Would surely have came back there next time we in Sydney (but afraid it will be in few years at least...)"),
("2014-04-24", "1718606", "Deysia", "We had a very nice stay at Susan's home. The cabin is adequately sized and comfortable. The neighborhood's commercial area has great dining options and lots of shops. The location is nicely situated for commutes to the city  airport or country. We'd highly recommend a stay at Susan's. "),
("2014-04-28", "1718606", "Candice  & Dale", "We had lovely stay at the Cabin. Unfortunately we did not get to meet Susan  but Angelo the lovely black cat greeted us warmly with cuddles.Easy instructions on how to access the house and central to everything we needed. We had a lovely stay in Leichardt. Thanks for letting us stay Susan. "),
("2014-04-30", "1718606", "Christine", "Very nice place and will stay again.  I stayed in the cottage  which was adequate to my needs.  Hot shower  clean and comfortable bed  good location.  What more does one need?"),
("2014-05-08", "1718606", "Christine", "Susan is the perfect host..warm and friendly but unobtrusive. The cabin is private and comfortable  good shower and has easy access to all Sydney has to offer. Public transport is efficient and accessible. The aircraft noise varies so it's easy to ignore it. Leichhardt is an interesting area with plenty of restaurants and services. I would  certainly stay here again."),
("2014-05-13", "1718606", "Lachlan", "Susan made me feel very welcome and made sure I had everything I needed.  Her little backyard cabin is just perfect and provides a serene  private and relaxing green oasis so close to the centre of Sydney.  Susan willingly shares her kitchen facilities and makes her place feel like a home away from home.  It is very convenient and within easy walking distance to buses and the shops  restaurants and amenities of Leichhardt.  I highly recommend Susan's cabin and will definitely consider staying here again."),
("2014-05-19", "1718606", "Pia", "We really enjoyed staying at Susan's. The hut we lived in was really comfortable and very clean. Susan is a very nice person and gave us all kind of information we might have needed for our stay in Sydney. She was very helpful with our other issues. Susan's place made our stay in Sydney a lot more comfortable and enjoyable!"),
("2014-06-01", "1718606", "Kim", "We were very happy with our stay at Garden Cabin. It was nice and private  located in the rear garden. The cabin is within walking distance to great cafes in the very cosmopolitan Norton St area and we found it very easy to visit the city via the Light Rail which is located nearby. Susan is very friendly and helped us willingly with our travel needs. There was a very generous selection available for breakfast and the bed was comfy. The flights overhead were a bit noisy the day we were there  but we expected that after reading other reviews. We would be very happy to stay with Susan again."),
("2014-06-14", "1718606", "Amy", "Susan is a helpful and accommodating host.  We appreciate the use of her kitchen and umbrella.  The neighborhood is safe with a variety of restaurants  grocery stores  coffee shops and even a dry cleaner/laundry mat (but not ""self-serve"").  There are bus lines and a light rail within reasonable walking distance.  The heavy rail was about a mile away.  The bed is so comfortable  we slept really well!  We enjoyed the sound of the rain on the roof  and listening to the birds in the morning.  Reasonable price."),
("2014-06-21", "1718606", "Joanne", "Had a wonderful week at Susan's cosy cabin. Not only was it close to Sydney  but had a comfortable bed and a relaxed feel. Susan was very approachable and nothing was an issue for her. It was a pleasant place to return after a busy day moving furniture out of my storage unit.  I would definitely recommend this place to anyone who wants a quiet reasonably priced place that is close to the CBD. "),
("2014-06-23", "1718606", "Carolyn", "Susan was a lovely friendly host  she provided a great breakfast and was very helpful with good restaurants to visit and local directions. The studio was perfect - clean  warm and spacious and a great price. The location in Leichhardt was within easy walking distance to eateries and transport. I'd definitely stay here again. "),
("2014-06-28", "1718606", "Caroline", "Great cabin - must be well insulated as it was very cosy!  Extremely comfortable bed and a very quiet place.   Friendly host and welcoming cat!  Having checked in quickly  then left  it was really nice to come back later to a well lit cabin with the heater on. A quick walk to a bus stop - and the Light Rail is within walking distance as well. "),
("2014-06-30", "1718606", "Ivan", "I stayed with Susan for a weekend and just wish that I didn't have to leave! Susan is such a great host  and Angelo the cat was just adorable. I would never have imagined that I'd be able to stay in a cabin in someone's backyard  and would recommend anyone to give it a go. Susan gives a wonderful spread of healthy breakfast everyday  which I greatly appreciate. Upon arrival  she also gave a complete set of linen and towels which is a service above and beyond that which is common. The bed in the cabin was so comfortable that I slept through the nights like a baby. Susan also gave me a lift to the nearby weekend market which was really nice  and the market has many fabulous stalls and produce. She also gave a lot of helpful tips and advice on what to check out in the surrounding areas. The listing is also close to the nearby light rail stations and buses into the city  which makes travelling to and fro easy. In all  I had a truly memorable experience staying with Susan and had a wonderful weekend exploring Leichardt and Sydney city. p.s the wifi is fast too! :D"),
("2014-07-12", "1718606", "Rod Ryan & Rebecca", "We enjoyed our stay with Susan. We were very comfy and warm in the cabin. It had everything we needed and if we needed anything more Susan was very obliging. We look forward to staying there again in the future."),
("2014-07-14", "1718606", "Doreen", "We were very comfortable and cosy in Susan's garden studio. Firstly because Susan is a delightful host - she's warm and welcoming and helpful and generous! I have some allergies  and Susan was so helpful in making everything work for me. The studio itself is clean  nicely presented  self contained  quiet and has everything you need to make it a great base for a few days in Sydney. There's an ensuite bathroom  sitting area  TV  tea-making facilities. Glad it was cosy  as Sydney turned on some chilly days (which we thought we'd left behind in Canberra!). Leichardt is close to the city and an interesting area with plenty of eating places nearby. All in all a great place to stay. Thanks Susan!"),
("2014-07-22", "1718606", "Payton", "Adorable home owned by an amazing person! My mother and me went to Sydney standby and had problems from the very start! We arrived 6.5 hours before check in and Susan was amazing and accommodating  letting us go in early and cleaning up the room a bit. She then helped take us into town and buy a train pass. It was amazing for a first day. Susan is the most helpful person I have ever met and she actually cares that you have an amazing stay in her house. She helps every step of the way and doesnt let anyone fall through any vacation cracks; whether it is getting lost  grocery shopping  buying dinner  or car troubles Susan refuses to let you make a wrong decision and will stick by you through the worst of them! If I ever went back to Sydney  she is the person I would want to be with!"),
("2014-07-28", "1718606", "Lachlan", "Second time staying in Susan's delightful backyard oasis retreat.  Ideally central to so much but a world away from the hustle and bustle.  Susan is an excellent host and goes out of her way to ensure guests needs are met.  Her place is in an ideal location close to services and facilities and easily connected to the city and the rest of Sydney."),
("2014-12-08", "1718606", "David", "Wonderful host. The backyard studio is very comfortable."),
("2014-12-29", "1718606", "Dustin", "I enjoyed my stay at Susans cabin - everything was clean and nice there. Susan is a lovely host and is trying to make your stay as comfortable as she can!"),
("2015-01-04", "1718606", "Tegan", "Susan was a fantastic host who was very accomodating and willing to provide lots of recommendations. The BNB was very tidy and the bed was super comfy. Proximity to the City was great too and was easy to bike ride into. Highly recommend."),
("2015-07-11", "1718606", "Eva", "We had a wonderful time at Susan's. She was really welcoming. It was one of our best AirBNB experiences so far. The included breakfast is a hit  always fresh fruits  nuts and cereals. We would definitely recommend Susan. "),
("2015-07-21", "1718606", "Matt", "What a great place! fantastic area with easy access to the city and walking distance to great cafés. Susan is amazing  she is very sweet and kind so much so I believe I will remain friends with her. The room is lovely with heaps of space and a comfortable queen. "),
("2015-09-27", "1718606", "Tbird", "The studio was perfect for me! I needed a quiet  private space to get my work done. Susan was extremely welcoming and also left me alone which I appreciated. The space was sparkling clean and the bed was fab with snuggly sheets! Thanks Susan"),
("2015-10-01", "1718606", "Tegan", "Susan was very helpful  friendly and accommodating of my needs. The studio was lovely and I wouldn't hesitate to stay here again. Thanks Susan!"),
("2015-10-12", "1718606", "Ants", "It was lovely staying at Susan's studio. Very peaceful  super comfortable and so close to public transport. Susan was very welcoming and so easy to talk to - I was really made to feel at home.  I was able to cook in Susan's kitchen and appreciated having fridge space to use too. The little deck off the kitchen was a perfect space for breakfast. Thanks so much Susan! "),
("2015-10-16", "1718606", "Catherine", "Susan made us feel really welcome  the listing was exactly as stated and the area was great  we loved it. Leichardt was very accessible to the city via the Light Rail and the area felt very safe and friendly. There were lots of cafes and restaurants and a great cinema all within walking distance."),
("2015-10-19", "1718606", "Philippa", "Susan was an excellent host for my friend  and had no qualms about making a 'third party booking'. She was welcoming and informative  and very happy to arrange her schedule to accommodate a late night arrival. Her house is a relaxing and cosy home away from home. "),
("2015-10-24", "1718606", "James", "Lovely little place.Susan was a thoughtful and accommodating host."),
("2015-11-01", "1718606", "Anne", "J ai passé trois jours très agréables dans le studio du jardin de Susan. C est un studio très confortable  très pratique dans lequel on se sent comme chez soi. Le quartier est très calme avec toutes les facilités des transports en commun. Susan m'a très bien acceuillie. C'est une hôtesse serviable et joyeuse.Très bon souvenir !"),
("2015-11-05", "1718606", "Alessio", "Susan was very friendly and helpful to give us a lot of information. Location is good for the public transportation (we used a lot) but very noisy due to the plans!"),
("2015-11-08", "1718606", "Matthew", "Susan is such a lovely host.  We had a private cottage out back   very self contained.  When we arrived she had a local map and gave us an overview of the local area and tips for transport.  The cottage was lovely.  Everything was smooth.  Thanks again Susan!"),
("2015-11-17", "1718606", "Hayden", "Very comfortable room with all you could need. Close to transport and restaurants. Susan is a lovely host  friendly  helpful and always ready to have a chat. I would definitely come back again."),
("2015-11-22", "1718606", "Madeleine", "Erika and I had a lovely time staying with Susan (and Angelo the cat) in Sydney. The room itself is quite spacious and very private  being tucked away in the backyard. Susan was generous enough to provide us with a selection of delicious free breakfast options  which was much appreciated  especially by those travelling on a tight budget! There is plenty of free parking in the street and public transport close by. We would definitely stay here again! "),
("2015-11-23", "1718606", "Simon", "We were made us feel very welcome. Lovely studio at the bottom of the garden with a very comfy queen bed. Would happily stay there again when were next Sydney bound."),
("2015-12-08", "1718606", "Su", "We very much enjoyed our stay in Susan's little cabin. Susan was a very warm and welcoming host  who was extremely helpful with bus schedules and so on. The cabin was depicted very accurately in her pictures. We would definitely stay with Susan again."),
("2015-12-10", "1718606", "Sophia", "Susan and Angelo  her panther in crime (a super friendly black cat) are so warm and welcoming she made us feel right at home. The cabin is a great size with an ensuit and large tv  we were strapped for cash so being able to microwave some quick meals in the room was perfect for us  we were welcomed to use the kitchen but were far too lazy too. The location is fantastic as leichhardt is a safe and quiet residential suburb close to public transport heading right into the CBD. Also a great breakfast selection laid out each morning made all the difference.We will certainly be staying again when we return to Sydney.Thank you again"),
("2015-12-13", "1718606", "Pip", "Susan has a cute little terrace house in a neighbourhood with many Italians in Sydney. We had our own bathroom in the garden studio and it was very clean and comfortable. Susan is a really relaxed host. We were well looked after."),
("2015-12-14", "1718606", "David", "Unfortunately our stay was cut short due to personal situation. Susan was more than accommodating  allowing us to amend the booking at very short notice  even being out of pocket herself. It was a very kind gesture during a difficult time. The space was very clean  and as described."),
("2015-12-19", "1718606", "Geoff", "Comfortable & private"),
("2015-12-21", "1718606", "Michaeli", "Really lovely home and cosy seperate cabin in backyard with own bathroom. Very easy to find and parking was good. I love this part of Sydney and Susan was very friendly and easy to talk with. Offer of a lovely breakfast but I went down the road to a lovely little square with a few cafes. Friendly and easy stay."),
("2015-12-25", "1718606", "Nikolas", "Wonderful quiet and clean studio  host Susan very helpful and friendly - had a lovely stay! "),
("2016-01-03", "1718606", "Marjolein", "We loved our stay at Susan's Garden house! Susan is a very lovely lady  who always wants to help you at any time. She helped us plan a few daily trips and we enjoyed the fresh fruit she made everyday. The house is clean  comfortable and there is acces to everything you need. During our stay I haven't seen any cockroaches in the house  which tells you how clean it is. Good bed  shower  etc. can't really say something bad about this house. "),
("2016-01-06", "1718606", "Brittany", "We had such a lovely stay at Susan's cottage. Although she was out of town during our stay  she left us impeccable instructions and we felt cared for. I'd definitely stay here again! "),
("2016-01-10", "1718606", "Sonia", "Susan was very welcoming! She picked me up from the station on my arrival day! My first day it rained hard all day so I stayed at the house and caught up using wifi!  Susan kindly invited me to go to her swimming club with her which I enjoyed   the exercise was good!Susan encourages use of kitchen and is not 'precious' about her stuff. She provides a nice breakfast of cereals   some fruit  juice and toast :-)"),
("2016-01-13", "1718606", "Heather", "We highly recommend Susan as an air bnb host. She excels at customer satisfaction. We were very happy with the cabin retreat. It was easily accessible by transit.Breakfast was healthy delicious and nutritious. Susan gave us some excellent tourist info as well. Stay here  you won't be disappointed. Great value! We hope to see you again Susan."),
("2016-01-15", "1718606", "Cecile", "We really enjoyed our stay in the Garden studio. It was excellently located and within walking distance of the light rail. The studio was well appointed and comfortable. Susan was welcoming and very helpful."),
("2016-01-19", "1718606", "Donna", "Susan was a wonderful host her little villa was so cute and just what I needed for a great getaway."),
("2016-01-28", "1718606", "Beaver", "Susan is an awesome host. I had many laughs and stimulating conversations. Her cabin was fantastic value. Her breakfast selection was greatly appreciated. A great neighborhood of Sydney with Norton Street nearby. Thanks Susan !"),
("2016-01-30", "1718606", "Pauline", "Susan was a wonderful host and very helpful. Her little cottage was exactly as described and gave us the privacy we needed when working in the area. Susan provided a nutritious light breakfast each morning and anything else we requested. Her home is very near transport to the city and the restaurant area of Leichhardt. We had no trouble parking in the street right outside her house. I would definitely recommend this garden studio."),
("2016-02-02", "1718606", "Don", "A wonderful private cabin behind Susan's inner city cottage. Although I did not get much time to chat I found Susan a wonderful host and the cabin was exactly what i wanted for a few nights. Public transport to the city nearby and I was able to park in the street overnight. Recommended and I'd definitely book again."),
("2016-02-05", "1718606", "Suzanne", "Susan's cottage was everything I had imagined from the photos. She was welcoming and accommodating - I needed to work from the studio so she set up a desk for me. She is easy going and incredibly interesting. An added bonus was the wonderful atmosphere she created -  the other guests  Susan and I had a wonderful meal together and shared stories. I definitely will be returning. Thanks Susan."),
("2016-02-26", "1718606", "Elizabeth", "Susan is lovely. Very accommodating  helpful and nice to chat too ☺Location is great  close to all transport  bars  restaurants and shops.Garden house is a good size  enough for 2 ppl with your own bathroom.Would recommend and would be happy to stay again!"),
("2016-02-29", "1718606", "Agnieszka & Terry", "Our stay with Susan was perfect. It was relaxing and inviting. The accomidation is great with everything you need and private. We would recommend it to anyone. Thanks Susan for your hospitality. :-)"),
("2016-03-03", "1718606", "Rebecca", "Susan provided us with specific information and demonstrated a caring  sharing attitude. The room itself was cosy with a private ensuite. We are familiar with Leichhardt and knew of the plane noise but apart from that  the area was relatively quiet. Thank you Susan! "),
("2016-03-10", "1718606", "Sarah", "My boyfriend and I had a lovely stay in Susan's little garden house. It was our first time trying Airbnb and we were really pleased. Susan was an amazing host  she helped us whenever she could. We really liked the location of her home because it wasn't in the busy city center but you could easily reach it by bus. "),
("2016-03-12", "1718606", "Natasha", "Really nice place to stay  it's nice to be self-contained  basically like a little hotel room with plenty of space and a nice garden. Kitchen amenities available in house. Susan was nice and welcoming. Good location in Sydney too. To be honest the aeroplane noise was a bit of a shock at first but I was tired so I still slept really well from about 9-6 without being woken."),
("2016-03-19", "1718606", "Cassie", "Susan was absolutely lovely! This was my first experience with Airbnb  and I did not know what to expect. Susan was so kind and welcoming  and I instantly felt at home. She was so helpful with recommendations of things to do in Sydney  and helped me figure out the public transport system. The breakfast provided was wonderful  and she even had a converter available for me to use when mine stopped working. The studio was very comfortable  and Susan went out of her way to make sure I had everything I needed. I greatly enjoyed conversations with Susan and her other guests (who were also wonderful). I could not have asked for a better host  and I would absolutely stay here again! Thank you  Susan  for making my stay so wonderful! I cannot say enough good things about Susan and her lovely home!"),
("2016-03-23", "1718606", "Cally", "Very nice and clean self-contained cabin. The bed is comfy. Noise from plane is acceptable. Susan is a welcoming host. She prepared fruits and breakfast for us. She is very helpful to suggest us what to do during heavy rain in Sydney. Finally we got to go swimming in Olympic park. Highly recommend Susan's place."),
("2016-03-26", "1718606", "Leah", "Susan is a very welcoming host. She provides information about the public transport  which was really helpful. She also had really good recommendations for what to do in Sydney. The Studio was very clean and comfy. The plane noise was alright. You didn't have to set an alarm so you get up early and you see something of Sydney. The breakfast was very good. There were fruits  muesli  toast and coffee or tea. All in all I really enjoyed my stay in Sydney at Susan's studio."),
("2016-03-26", "1718606", "Rory", "Private cabin in a good location with plenty of free on street parking. On the flight path for Sydney airport so long lie ins aren't an option as they seemed to start flying over around 9am. Susan was very welcoming to her home"),
("2016-03-30", "1718606", "Malvina", "We had a great stay at Susan's place. The cottage is as good as the pictures. Susan is a great host and help us with lots of informations before and during our stay. We highly recommend her place. Many thanks Susan.We loved Sydney and had a nice weekend in Australia. The place is very central and very close to the city centre. Buses was easy to catch even on Sunday and public holiday. We will definitely love to stay again at Susans in the future :-)"),
("2016-04-02", "1718606", "Paul", "Susan has a small cottage at her home in the backyard. Perfect for one or two people. I stayed there 3 nights and really enjoyed my time there. The cottage comes with everything you need including your own bathroom. Susan is a very gracious and polite host. She took the time to explain the best way to travel in and out of the city. Took only 20-30 minutes to be right in the middle of Sydney. Such a beautiful city!! Wish I could have stayed longer. Enjoyed my time at the cottage."),
("2016-04-10", "1718606", "Alisa", "Thank you Susan for this wonderful stay! The accomondation was very cosy and the breakfast was delicious  especially the home grown passion fruits!"),
("2016-04-18", "1718606", "Shane", "Susan was a lovely and friendly host.  She went to great lengths to make us feel welcome and to offer advice with respect to transport and facilities within the suburb.  The studio was very neat and tidy  representing excellent value for a visitor to Sydney.  Being separate from the main dwelling  this studio was also very private and peaceful."),
("2016-04-27", "1718606", "Tara", "This is a lovely place to stay in Sydney's inner-west - very convenient to public transport and Leichhardt. Susan is a wonderful host  very accessible  welcoming and communicative. "),
("2016-04-29", "1718606", "Rowena And Jim", "Susan was a lovely host. Very welcoming and friendly. The house was conveniently located and Susan gave me some great recommendations. The cabin was very comfortable and clean. Would definitely book again."),
("2016-05-02", "1718606", "Clo", "Susan was nice and explain the vehicle network in very detail. Although we have not much communication but i can feel Susan is willing to talk. I may visit back to Susan place when i visit Sydney next time."),
("2016-05-06", "1718606", "Hyo-Jin", "Susan is an incredibly intelligent and warm person. Her welcome was planned for in advance  as she tends to be quite busy herself. On my first day  I was given the rundown on the breakfast options  free wifi  chats with her pets  and the security of the household. The cabin was spacious  kitted out with a book selection  a digital TV  kettle and heater  pretty much everything. The place was pristine and my nights were very peaceful. My plans are to stay there for a retreat every now and then. Thanks very much Susan  for being so flexible and knowledgeable :) "),
("2016-05-26", "1718606", "James", "Susan was very welcoming on our arrival. I loved the fact we could have our own studio which was clean and comfortable  all we needed for our stay in Sydney while visiting family close by. Would book again if the opportunity arises."),
("2016-05-31", "1718606", "Sue-Ellen", "As we were visiting family Susan's studio was perfect for us"),
("2016-06-09", "1718606", "Jennie & Jeff", "We were welcomed warmly into Susan's home and the cabin was warm and cosy. Situated in a lovely quaint area in a convenient location  accessible to shops  buses  etc. Very quiet  apart from planes. A generous supply of breakfast provisions each morning was appreciated. Thank you Susan. "),
("2016-06-12", "1718606", "Robert", "Susan was an amazing host  she was so welcoming and the studio was a great treat for my wife and I. The studio was at the bottom of a lovely garden which included a fully equipped en-suit and the room had a kettle  TV  microwave and was furnished very comfortably. The 470 bus stop was only a 10 minute walk from the property. Susan provided a variety of cereals and tea in the morning which was a nice surprise. Overall a great stay. "),
("2016-06-14", "1718606", "Helen", "Susan's studio is an excellent choice for those wanting to explore Sydney's inner west. Her place is close to public transport and and it's really easy to get into and out of town. Susan provided detailed instructions for getting to her place. The studio itself is cosy and comfortable. Breakfast in the morning in the main house was also a nice touch."),
("2016-06-20", "1718606", "Genevieve", "We felt very welcomed by Susan  especially since we weren't sure what time we were arriving. She was very accomodating to all of our needs. We decided to leave early due to personal responsibilities but we enjoyed our stay nonetheless :)."),
("2016-06-27", "1718606", "Nicholas", "Susan was a great host! She was keen to give us great travelling tips and was always happy and pleasure to chat with. She makes sure to give you your space as well and is pleasantly accommodating. The location is superb (quiet neighbourhood) and are in close proximity to public transit - about 10 minutes to central station by bus."),
("2016-06-27", "1718606", "Stacey", "Really appreciate the prompt reply from Susan and she got the room ready for us in less than a day after we sent our request through.Nice and clean bedroom with our own private bathroom in the garden. Lovely and friendly cat in the main house is always ready for cuddles:)"),
("2016-07-05", "1718606", "Juliette", "I was an AIRBNB virgin  and I found my first  experience overwhelmingly positive.The garden pavilion behind a typical Sydney historic cottage was cute  clean  compact but above all comfortable.With an ensuite bathroom  heating  microwave  hot water jug I had everything I needed for a business  conference and research related trip.Wonderful gourmet café style breakfast options and a generous and considerate host enhanced the experience even further.The position  is ideal for Sydney busses with several options for the Unviersity of Sydney  University of New South Wales  Central Station and the CBD. Parramatta Rd is about 10/12 mins walk awayThe district is cosmopolitan and convenient with many reasonably priced restaurants  cafes  pubs and a supermarket again about 5-10 minutes walk away. I found it safe and quiet  ideal for either business or the non-extreme travellerLike most of historic inner west/southwest Sydney  jet aircraft fly remarkably close above one's head in this suburb on occasions I can not praise this  facility too much and  if all AIRBNB's are like this  ... well.. viva la revolucion "),
("2016-07-16", "1718606", "Ollie", "I had a very enjoyable experience staying here for 3 nights! Susan was very hospitable and a lovely host.Highlights were the ensuite bathroom (loved the hot shower) and breakfasts. I definitely plan to stay here again next time I'm in Sydney!"),
("2016-08-02", "1718606", "Lutske And Paul", "We enjoyed staying at the cabin in Susan's backyard. The cabin is fully self contained incl. comfy bed  fridge  microwave and ensuite. It is close to several bus stops  the light rail and the airport (you will hear airplanes).Susan is a lovely host! She makes sure there is a good self-service breakfast each morning and above all she goes out of her way to ensure you have a great stay. She also has plenty of insider tips on Sydney."),
("2016-08-14", "1718606", "Kaylah", "Susan was a lovely and welcoming host. The studio is well equipped with everything you need for your stay and it's a really convenient location for buses into the city."),
("2016-08-15", "1718606", "Nurhayaty", "Great host. Lovely house n neighbourhood. Really feel like home."),
("2016-08-24", "1718606", "Shen Leng", "Love the space and privacy of the cabin. It was so comfortable and cosy I took my time to get ready every morning and never left the cabin until 11am. Great for a solo retreat! Susan was a great hostess and I enjoyed my conversation with her."),
("2016-08-29", "1718606", "Mere", "For my first time using Airbnb  Susan's Garden Studio was such a fantastic little place to stay in! I really enjoyed my stay. Super close to transportation and supermarket! Susan was a great host and was very helpful. Highly recommend."),
("2016-09-10", "1718606", "Liz", "Had a great time in the garden suite at Susan's! It was my own private bungalow which was just lovely. Leichhardt is an awesome suburb of Sydney and I found the bus system to be very easy to navigate with a stop at the end of the street (1 min away). Tons of cool cafes along Norton street  especially Petit Fours - delicious French bakery!If you're looking for a more quiet relaxing Sydney vacation  this is the place to be."),
("2016-09-12", "1718606", "Anna", "Our stay was so comfortable and the place was nice. It was clean  quiet and we didn't have any problems or issues. Also  Susan was very helpful and accommodating. Thumbs up! "),
("2016-09-15", "1718606", "Terence", "Susan was great  we talked before my arrival  she met me at the door when I arrived. The location was perfect for me  It beats any hotel that I have ever stayed in.Great value for money  and just really pleasant.Thanks"),
("2016-09-18", "1718606", "Jo", "Susan's place is in a great location  and the separate studio nice and private. Everything was as described and we were very happy!"),
("2016-09-25", "1718606", "Christine", "Very central to light rail to Leichhardt  privacy is great susan will make people's stay pleasant I would go there again"),
("2016-09-26", "1718606", "Christine", "we felt comfy in the studio we  my husband was building cubby house so it was great we were able to be close to my daughter's house which was worksite privacy was good pubs clubs light rail close."),
("2016-10-11", "1718606", "Gareth", "Lovely cozy cabin retreat tucked away in the back garden. Very comfortable stay  close to tons of restaurants and a lovely little cafe just around the corner  the local tart. Susan was very hospitable and made us feel welcome in her home."),
("2016-10-11", "1718606", "Erin", "Stayed at Susan's lovely cabin for a couple of nights on a brief trip to Sydney. Susan was very welcoming  helpful and everything was as described. Easy walk to the cafes and restaurants of Leichhardt and a very handy nearby bus stop. I would definitely stay here again."),
("2016-10-22", "1718606", "Cassie", "This was my second time staying with Susan. She is absolutely the best host anyone could ask for! Susan is kind  helpful  and incredibly generous. The room is very comfortable as well. I would absolutely advise everyone I know to stay with Susan. She's the best!"),
("2016-11-01", "1718606", "Chrissie", "Susan has a caring and lovely character. I will give her 10 stars or even more for the service and everything provided."),
("2016-11-17", "1718606", "Melody", "Susan's garden cabin was very comfortable and private. Susan was very helpful if I needed anything and the location was good."),
("2016-11-21", "1718606", "Ikhwan", "Lovely cozy cabin retreat tucked away in the back garden. Its really like living in private resort in a tropical forest which is really nice and calm. The place is in a great location  and the separate studio nice and private. Everything was as described and we were very happy"),
("2016-12-01", "1718606", "Jennifer", "Great quiet private cottage in central location.Susan is a great host making our stay very pleasant.We would stay here again."),
("2016-12-02", "1718606", "Ambre", "Really Nice studio close to the city!"),
("2016-12-05", "1718606", "Alexander", "Susan is super friendly and very helpful. Quick to reply and answer any questions I had  both before arriving and during my stay. The room was clean and the bed was comfortable  really couldn't have asked for more. I would definitely recommend staying with Susan if you plan on visiting Sydney! "),
("2016-12-06", "1718606", "Aaron", "Close to everything we needed with private setting."),
("2016-12-07", "1718606", "Jon", "Room is self contained in the garden with a sitting area and en-suite. Very private. Great location and on street parking."),
("2016-12-11", "1718606", "Rianne", "Susan's house was a very comfortable place to stay. The little house in the garden is more than just a private room; it has chairs and a private bathroom with toilet! Susan was also a great host and very helpful anytime. I would definitely recommend this place.Thank you susan!!!!"),
("2016-12-23", "1718606", "Gözde", "Susan was friendly and helpful."),
("2016-12-31", "1718606", "Adam", "We had a lovely stay! Susan was very helpful and kind. She gave us great advice on where to go and the best way to see the NYE fireworks that suited our style. Great  clean  private studio."),
("2017-01-08", "1718606", "Lauren", "Susan was very lovely. She is a good host! The room was nice but it always smells very bad.. When we opened the Windows the Amts were going everywhere! Thats why we opened to Windows  rarely.. But we had Amts anyway."),
("2017-01-17", "1718606", "Ben", "Very very very goooooodd"),
("2017-01-22", "1718606", "Daniel", "It's a very good house   that u can have independent bathroom and space   Susan is a very good host   nice   very enthusiastically  and also have a good time with the little cat   every night he always talk to me   I really miss him now ! "),
("2017-01-28", "1718606", "Paula", "We loved the studio and Susan was such a friendly  obliging host   always available but never intrusive. It had everything we needed - especially a fabulous fan in that awful heat (!) . Eating breakfast on the back verandah was very pleasant . There is a lovely park close by and proximity to public transport makes everything accessible . Thank you Susan for your generous hospitality . We will definitely return . Hopefully Sydney won't turn n 37 degrees for us next time !! "),
("2017-01-30", "1718606", "Amanda", "Great  clean place! Susan was pleasant even for my short stay!"),
("2017-02-03", "1718606", "Damien", "Susan was very welcoming and allow us to check-up earlier in the morning as the room wasn't occupied the day before. The only cons is that the flat is in the Sydney Airport way. So it van be noisy 1 or 2 days per weeks (Noice sharing  the airport way s changing every 2 days). Thank you Susan  I recommand this place. "),
("2017-02-04", "1718606", "Katie", "Lovely little place  all the amenities you need and a very cute  friendly cat :) Susan was very accomodating and great communicator! "),
("2017-02-16", "1718606", "Préma", "Susan a le coeur sur la main : sens de l'accueil et de l'hospitalité. Elle est précieuse pour donner des conseils  s'assure que nous ne manquons de rien et que tout se passe bien. Une très belle rencontre. Mille mercis et à bientôt! "),
("2017-02-19", "1718606", "Constantin", "Susan has been such a nice host. I would recommend staying at Susan's at any time . We had some great days. Not only because of Susan but of our little private granny flat as well! Thanks a lot Susan"),
("2017-02-24", "1718606", "Gillian", "Susan's studio is in a good location for transport links to the city. The studio is clean and comfortable with facilities to have drinks and heat snacks. Susan is helpful and accommodating.We did have issues with the busy flight path on certain mornings. Make sure you get an opal card before you use any local transport and watch out for expensive taxis from the airport."),
("2017-03-03", "1718606", "Zachary", "Great place  friendly host! :)"),
("2017-03-04", "1718606", "Ross", "Great host. Great and prompt/easy communication. Very polite. Only issues were very small and very much a personal opinion  you have to walk through the house to get the the little cabin out the back (Susan just said g'day when we walked through and very much gave us our space after a long drive  she was very chill about us walking through at any time of the night even through we were in early and out at a reasonable time) and the planes going to/from the airpott can be a bit of pain. But the cabin out the back is beautiful  very clean everything you need shes helpful to let you know as you get there etc. Definitely will look her up again!"),
("2017-03-22", "1718606", "Annette", "I genuinely enjoyed my one-week-stay at Susan's garden studio. It contains everything you need and if you want to cook your own meal  you can do so at the kitchen in the main house. Breakfast fast excellent  lots of variety. Susan herself was very helpful and always up for a nice chat. I received lots of good tips where to go and which busses or trains to use. You might consider bringing earplugs with you. Depending on the time of day  weather and/or logistics at the airport you could hear some airplanes. But this didn't bother me much. I would definitely stay at Susan's place again. "),
("2017-03-24", "1718606", "Kristin", "It was our first trip to Sydney and we weren't sure what area to stay in. Although due to the rain we ultimately ended up ubering the flat is very conveniently located near several bus stops. It's completely private as well and clean. It's got all the basics needed for a great get away. You can make breakfast in the main house and she's for oatmeas  cereals  teas and coffees to choose from. Although The weather was muggy if you keep the fan on and the windows cracked you can blow most of it out. Susan is also very down to earth and very helpful with directing us with travel! Would definitely recommend."),
("2017-03-25", "1718606", "Marie", "This is fine if you want a basic place  but it is not as private as the description. We had to walk through the whole house to get there  and then had to go back into the house to find basics like cups and tea bags and milk. There are a lot of mosquitos - we had brought our own mossie spray and I recommend it."),
("2017-04-01", "1718606", "Natalie", "I stayed at Susan's place during a work trip.  It was great because I was less than 5minutes from the office.  The place is clean and comfortable with all the basics I needed.  Susan gave me more than expected as there was even breakfast items ready for me to use :)  I booked with Susan because of how affordable the room was and I really do not have any negative comments about my stay at her place."),
("2017-04-05", "1718606", "Joy", "an excellent garden studio.   Under the flight path  but fortunately there is a curfew and one did get used to the planes after 24 hours."),
("2017-04-10", "1718606", "Brendan", "Staying with Susan was lovely  she was incredibly helpful. The room was very tidy  gave us our own space and had everything we needed. Public transport links and nice cafes were all only 5mins walk away. Thank you Susan!"),
("2017-04-14", "1718606", "Margaret", "A very comfortable stay in Leichardt with flexibility provided at all times for our visit to our daughter living nearby. Many thanks Susan."),
("2017-04-18", "1718606", "Crystal", "She was so helpful to explain us how to get to the city and the places we can visit. The place was also pretty good  clean and there's nothing more than it is shown in pictures. "),
("2017-04-21", "1718606", "Niccola", "Good place to stay   got a quick uber into Newtown for dinner. Nice backyard and friendly cat "),
("2017-04-25", "1718606", "Akiko", "Susan's place is a hidden gem. No pretentious  great price for the location  clean and down to earth comfortable space. "),
("2017-04-27", "1718606", "Jennifer", "Susan was incredibly helpful with everything from how to get around to making me feel welcome. The quaint studio was a perfect home away from home. Will definitely stay again! Thank you Susan!"),
("2017-05-02", "1718606", "Jennifer", "Susan's place had on street parking and was very handy to the places I needed. It was clean and comfortable. Susan is a very pleasant host."),
("2017-05-06", "1718606", "Emily", "Susan's kindness and careful consideration to accommodate to my needs began before I had even arrived at her beautiful little cabin. I was made to feel comfortable  warm  and well looked after. The cabin stay was just the perfect size for 2 or 3 guests. I enjoyed the bathroom fascilitiles also  as they were a good size. There are 2 mirrors  one in bedroom/living room  and 1 in the bathroom  which was perfect. We were also able to spend time in the kitchen and living areas inside the main house. Affordable  comfortable  close to beautiful Italian quisine  close to bus stops for transport into the city. Thank you for such a wonderful stay in an architecturally stunning suburb such as leichhardt. I will definitely consider staying again if I was to be in the area. Emily."),
("2017-05-14", "1718606", "Ana Maria", "I stayed in Sydney for a working weekend and I just needed a quite place for my self  I didn't wanted to share room or bathroom. This place is good for that. And I knew I wouldn't had the time to cook  so it didn't bother me to share kitchen. Susan is really helpful. The house is easy to get to/from the CBD.Just be aware of the noise of the airplanes... I think is good value."),
("2017-05-19", "1718606", "Phil", "Everything is as Susan describes. Looking forward to staying there again."),
("2017-05-21", "1718606", "Kiri", "The cabin is cosy and private and just how it looks in the pictures. We were very comfortable and happy with our stay. Easy driving access to the city and inner west  as well as being a great spot to walk to cafes and transport etc. Susan is generous and friendly. We will be back!"),
("2017-05-24", "1718606", "Mark", "Leichhardt is a great location to base yourself. Susan accommodation  is perfect. "),
("2017-06-01", "1718606", "Arnaldo Ariel", "I felt at home at Susan's place. It's a lovely house and a quiet neighborhood. In the mornings it was a pleasure to have breakfast listening to the birds under the shadow of trees.Early in the morning the jets began to fly on their landing approach to the airport. Although loud  for me was an excellent way to wake up and begin my explorations of the city. Also  Im a big fan of airplanes  so I was delighted to watch and listen them pass overhead. But don't worry  at the night they stop and it is possible to sleep very well.The studio was comfortable. And is provided with a bookshelf full of books. I loved that."),
("2017-06-06", "1718606", "Valerie", "Susan was so friendly and helpful during our stay making it easy and convenient.  The facilities were great and we felt very welcome!"),
("2017-06-16", "1718606", "Phil", "Good place to say.  Bungalow is private."),
("2017-06-30", "1718606", "Phil", "The bungalow is great. The areoplanes do start early"),
("2017-07-03", "1718606", "Tristan", "The studio is very cosy and in a great location. The light rail is just a short walk away and I found it very easy to get to everything. If you're driving  as I was  there is always a park on the street and you are just off a major arterial road (without any noise!). Susan was a lovely host  very friendly and accommodating  which made my first AirBnB experience very smooth and pleasant. Would recommend!"),
("2017-07-09", "1718606", "Sorcha", "Susan has a vast knowledge of Sydney and was always willing to chat to us and offer advice as to things to do or the best transport links. The accommodation was clean and exactly as advertised. With breakfast provided too  our trip was very enjoyable."),
("2017-08-30", "1718606", "Charles", "Logement très bien  Bus à proximité  Quartier calme."),
("2017-09-06", "1718606", "Nichole", "An amazing place to stay!"),
("2017-09-10", "1718606", "Susan", "Inadequate night lighting to access studio.  Bed and pillows uncomfortable."),
("2017-09-25", "1718606", "Chelsea", "A convenient and comfortable studio!"),
("2017-10-04", "1718606", "Des", "Great location close to everything and we enjoyed our privacy in the backyardThis is real value for your money Thanks"),
("2017-10-17", "1718606", "Luke", "Great for my first airbnb experience. Susan is accomodating and friendly. The studio is private and perfect if you are working as i was and need somewhere to rest your head"),
("2017-11-04", "1718606", "Jean", "The position and access to shops and restaurants was a little stroll from Susan's place  but was perfect because once eaten you could walk off the meal on your way back to Susan's"),
("2017-12-12", "1718606", "Daniel", "Susan's Place is nice and clean   this is the second time we came to this flat   everything is good   great value for travel with couple in SYD ."),
("2017-12-25", "1718606", "Sara", "We had a nice stay at Susan’s place. She’s a lovely host  great communication. Studio was cozy and clean. Good location  easy to get around with public transport. Everything was just as described!"),
("2018-01-02", "1718606", "Kristyna", "Susan was so lovely to talk with and her knowledge of the area was excellent. The location was central to everything and the space was clean and cozy."),
("2018-01-13", "1718606", "Caitlyn", "Easy check-in and out  Susan is very friendly and helpful. :)"),
("2018-02-05", "1718606", "Kelsey", "Great convenient location to Sydney. Easy walk to the light rail and Susan was great to get along with."),
("2018-02-12", "1718606", "Rachel", "Susan’s garden studio was lovely and spacious with a good size bathroom. Susan was friendly and helpful and really went the extra mile to make our stay pleasant. Excellent transport links into Sydney city centre  very easy to get in and out of the centre."),
("2018-02-16", "1718606", "Andrew", "Great self contained garden bungalow.  Close to transport and a short walk to coffee and cafes in norton street."),
("2018-03-17", "1718606", "Brittany", "Susan is a lovely host with a lovely home! Very helpful and welcoming. Directly underneath a flight path so it was a little noisy but love the Eco-friendliness of the place  and Angelo the cat :)"),
("2017-03-05", "17319927", "Mark", "A lovely apartment in beautiful Bondi. It matches the new photos and the Bondi beach area is easily walkable. It's a bus ride to downtown Sydney - pretty easy. There are a lot of stairs if that bothers you  and no AC. The street is quiet and a very short walk to shops  restaurants  beaches  pools  boutiques and some of the best walking paths (in the world?)."),
("2017-03-13", "17319927", "Jenny", "Lynne could not have been more helpful  what a fantastic host. Her apartment was lovely  clean and very quiet. The lockup garage was super handy. Our family of 3 really enjoyed the proximity to all of the Bondi amenities. The apartment is up a few flights of stairs which we didn't mind  but worth noting if you struggle with mobility. Would highly recommend. "),
("2017-03-27", "17319927", "Nele", "Great Vacation: we enjoyed our stayAwesome Appartment: everything there what you needExcellent Host: she is a lovely women and made us feel like homeMagnificent Neighbourhood: Everything is quite and cleanSuperb location: everything is nearby"),
("2017-04-01", "17319927", "Annalyce", "Perfect location  waking distance to lots of great cafes and restaurants and only 10 minutes walk to Bondi Beach. The apartment was nicely furnished and very clean and Lynne was a great host."),
("2017-04-25", "17319927", "Christopher", "Lynne has a lovely home in Bondi"),
("2017-05-27", "17319927", "Courtney", "Lynne is a fantastic host and very flexible with our check in and out time.  She has great communication skills  helpful and friendly. We love what Lynne has done to her apartment  it is big and spacious.  The biggest by far from most places we have stayed in Bondi Beach and other parts of Sydney.  The home is lovely  nicely decorated with leafy outlook & quite (great for sleeping) and as a bonus  super close to everything Bondi has to offer  in fact about 100m to restaurants  shops and transport and 5 mins walk to beach.  Highly recommended to friends and family.  Will definitely be back again.   Thanks Lynne for your hospitality."),
("2017-06-02", "17319927", "Luke", "Lynne was great host. We locked our keys in and she was so helpful getting us back in. Great location in quiet street yet so close to the hub of bondi."),
("2017-06-10", "17319927", "Kerenza", "An awesome location and place to stay! Lynne is an awesome host  she was very helpful and flexible with early check in and late check out. The apartment was spotless and very spacious. The home is exactly as shown on the listing  close to the beach  restaurants  shops and transport.  Will definitely come back and stay here again! I highly recommend to anyone. Loved it! Thanks Lynne!"),
("2017-06-19", "17319927", "Courtney", "Lynne is an awesome host  I stayed at her home last month  not only her home was really nice and everything is of high quality and most of all is her hospitality and here I am again.  Lynne is also very honest.  I didn't even know I have made an error in my booking  she quickly corrected the over payment and returned the over payment to me immediately.  Thanks heaps Lynne  what a fantastic host!!   I highly recommend her place  everything was just perfect  quite and only a short walk (200m) to beaches  restaurants and shops... I come to Sydney often and her home will now definitely be my base. This is a home away from home.  Will see you again.  Cheers."),
("2017-07-15", "17319927", "Jessica", "Lynne's place is very central for cafes and the beach  whilst on a quiet road.Lynne was very helpful and friendly."),
("2017-11-11", "17319927", "Xena", "Lynne's place is fantastic  great location!!! Just a short stroll to Bondi Beach  very close to many restaurants and shops. The place is exactly as described and extremely clean. Lynne was very accomodating  she made 100% sure we arrived safely and had everything we needed. Will definitely stay again next time we come to Sydney."),
("2017-11-20", "17319927", "Paul", "Great modern apartment in the heart of bondi! Good value and walking distance to everything you need. Lynne was a great host and very helpful if we had any queries. Would stay here again!"),
("2017-12-30", "17319927", "Kim", "Lynne really went the extra mile to make our stay enjoyable. The location is perfect for beach and cafes  but still wonderfully quiet. Would definitely stay again"),
("2017-12-31", "17319927", "Christina", "Amazing host and place! Absolutely loved our stay  would definitely recommend."),
("2017-03-04", "17438054", "Reid", "Perfect AirBnb! Highly recommend."),
("2017-03-12", "17438054", "Kyra", "I was in Sydney with my family for a holiday and we've had a lovely stay at this new granny flat. It was above and beyond our expectations. If I could rate it  it would be an easy 10/10. This place was way better than a 5-star hotel. This was my first Airbnb experience and they have set the bar so high. From day one  George and Lucia had been nothing but helpful  attentive and on the ball of everything. There was so much thought given to every little detail of the house. The house was super clean and it always had an amazing scent. Fresh linen and towels were provided  and the bed was amazingly comfortable. The kitchen was fully equipped and everything needed to cook was there  including the recipe books. Commuting was rather easy. We took the train most of the time to travel to the city. The nearest train station is Kingsgrove Station which is about 10-15 minutes walking distance. Opal cards can be purchased from a convenience store at the station. We also downloaded the ""Opal Travel"" app to check on the train times and fare estimate. The nearest supermarket is Woolworths which is only 2 min walk from the train station. There are many restaurants around the train station too. This place has truly made us feel like home and there is absolutely nothing better than returning to a cozy house after a really long day in the city. George and Lucia were the best host we could ever ask for. We will definitely stay here again if we return to Sydney :)"),
("2017-03-30", "17438054", "Mobin", "George and Lucia's Granny Flat was a great place to stay. Its new  clean and easy to reach. They were very responsive and welcoming and cared about our needs. George even gave us suggestions on how to spend our time in Sydney and took us to a shopping mall on his day off. Their place is indeed cosy and quiet and it is beautifully designed as well. I was very satisfied with my stay and I highly suggest this place if you are looking for a place in the area! I wish the best for this kind family hope to see them someday in my home country   Iran. "),
("2017-04-19", "17438054", "Gunit", "Our stay was very comfortable. We had extremely long working hours everyday  this place kept our sanity :) We always looked forward coming back to it. Highly recommended. The hosts are very easy to deal with and always willing to help. We felt as if we were a part of their family. The accommodation could not have been any cleaner and well kept. TEN STARS"),
("2017-04-30", "17438054", "Mengistu", "George  Lucia and his family are so great and welcoming people. They treated us very well with due respect and provided swift responses to all our queries. Their flat is new  so clean and furnished with high quality fittings & kitchen items. The area is quiet  peaceful  close to public transport and walking distance to shopping & restaurants as well. For sure  this place is my number 1 choice for the next trip. With full confidence I recommend everyone to stay in the flat. Definitely  you will enjoy every minute over there. George & Lucia  many thanks for being a great host! If I am asked to give you a grade  I would say 10/10. Hope we shall see you soon!"),
("2017-05-06", "17438054", "Daniel", "Great place to stay. Clean  new  private and well set up. George was a very welcoming host  would highly recommend as a place to stay.  "),
("2017-05-15", "17438054", "Chris", "We needed a place to stay while our house was being painted. This granny flat was perfect for our small family. It is quite new  very clean and had all the amenities we needed for a comfortable stay. George and his family are warm and friendly. This was our first airbnb experience and we loved it. "),
("2017-05-21", "17438054", "Peta", "Top Rate AirBNB.  Spotless  cosy and beautifully presented. Easy access to Transport  Shopping and Restaurants - We only drove our hire car 20 klm in 3 days!!George and Lucia have thought of everything and are fantastic communicators.  We Highly Recommend staying with them.       "),
("2017-05-25", "17438054", "Ursula", "Awesome place and hosts! I would stay there anytime again!"),
("2017-06-05", "17438054", "Helen", "Great place to stay in Sydney  location was perfect for us and the accommodation was 5 star. Helen and Alice"),
("2017-06-09", "17438054", "Phil", "We stayed at George and Lucia's lovely cottage for a week recently and found it to be perfect and our home away from home.From offering to help with our luggage to sorting Netflix and making us welcome George was a wonderful host.The cottage is very quiet and even has its own entrance.Thank you for having us"),
("2017-06-10", "17438054", "Tracie", "Comfortable  clean modern  and private; they thought of it all - the house had everything we needed. The furniture is modern and comfortable! A great place to stay would book again without hesitation. Thank you to George great hospitality. "),
("2017-06-27", "17438054", "Giuseppe", "Thank you very much for the great hospitality  cleanliness  decoration  location and facilities as well your commitment  .I could never imagine more than I had during my stay in your wonderful place.I will rent again."),
("2017-07-02", "17438054", "Kate", "This would have to be one of the best airbnbs we've stayed in. The place was brand new  immaculate and fitted out with everything one would need-awesome attention to detail. We were traveling with our toddler and George and Lucia were thoughtful enough to provide some toys and even a step stool for her in the bathroom. It's that sort of stuff you don't see all the time but makes things much easier! Great hosts. "),
("2017-07-09", "17438054", "Eugene", "The apartment is clean  well-equipped with different amenities. A full functioning kitchen for you to do some cooking. The owners have been really helpful during my stay."),
("2017-07-31", "17438054", "Melissa", "Great hosts! Cosy and has everything you need. Very quiet  homey and comfortable for any occasion. Food and shops within a close range. "),
("2017-08-12", "17438054", "Renato", "Ospiti puntuali gentilissimi e ben organizzati con pulizia e comodita'"),
("2017-08-17", "17438054", "Italo", "Amazing hosts! This place is amazing and George and Lucia thought of everything to make our stay comfortable. Traveling with two small boys they were thoughtful enough to provide some toys that kept the boys busy for hours. It's things like this that makes it even more special. Would definitely book here again and recommend George and Lucia's Cozy New Granny Flat. Thank you for having us."),
("2017-08-24", "17438054", "Fiona", "The house is located in Kingroves  should be less than 10 mins to train station."),
("2017-09-18", "17438054", "Stefan", "We arrived after midnight but George was waiting for us with a smile. He even got us groceries so we could get down to breakfast as soon as we woke up. The house is just perfect. Well maintained and very cozy. George and his family are very warm and make you feel at home as soon as you arrive. This was our first Airbnb experience but they sure set the bar high. Thanks for everything!"),
("2017-10-20", "17438054", "Mick", "Hospitality  First Class. Accommodation  First Class  We were made to feel special. Our first taste of Air BNB. George & Lucia`s Granny Flat will be hard to beat. They really have set the bar high. Nothing is too much trouble.ThanksMick Hartley& (son) Jack ."),
("2017-10-25", "17438054", "Cheryl", "Amazing hospitality excellent accomodation with all the home away from home amenities  definitely recommend  George and Lucia Cozy Granny flat."),
("2017-10-29", "17438054", "Amy", "So helpful and made us feel very welcome."),
("2017-11-12", "17438054", "Stephen", "Very nice place quite  clean not very far from public transport with almost everything prepared.Lovely and handsome host with his lovely family especially lovely kids and dog are all quite friendly and hospitable.Might be lack of external scenery but terrific inner environment."),
("2017-11-15", "17438054", "Jonathan", "Very good"),
("2017-12-03", "17438054", "Jerry", "Highly recommanded! George and lucia's place is absolutely beautiful  quite  confortable and fully equip with all the amenities which is perfact for our family of 3."),
("2017-12-12", "17438054", "Damian", "A wonderfully clean and comfortable space at a great price! Great deal!"),
("2017-12-29", "17438054", "Changhui", "the flat feels cozy and comfortable  tranquility and fully equipped with what you may need  especially to cook food you like.just good for 3-person family to stay.really good experience to feel local people live community.it is near the train station  convenient."),
("2018-01-06", "17438054", "Dwayne And Sally", "Sydney's best kept secret.Part of us  really doesn't wish to write this review  because then word will spread at how totally amazing this Air BnB is!However  by sharing this review  brings the kudos and the praise that both George and Lucia have put into building this B'nB.Don't be fooled by the name 'granny flat'. This is so much more than the old granny flat of yesteryear. This flat is a place where anyone  even granny won't want to go home!It is really clear that both George and Lucia really enjoy having their 'granny' visit  because the accomodation is astounding and was originally built to lodge her when she visits from abroad.You arrive via a second  private and secluded entrance at the rear of the main home. The terraced entrance welcomes you and is a beautiful spot to dine alfresco of a morning or enjoy the native birds and a chilled glass of wine in the afternoon.The kitchen is modern and well appointed. Stocked with all the essentials as if you were at home. We were welcomed with fresh bread  milk  fruit  chocolates and a bottle of bubbles for new years eve. This made such a welcome sight after having been travelling for the previous ten days and really couldn't be face the shops that late in the warmth of the afternoon.The bedroom was appointed with plush linen  mountains of pillows to dissolve into  the design features  really made you feel like you have just stepped into a double page spread of an interior design magazine.After a weeks stay in the leafy suburb of Kingsgrove  we are leaving now as if we are new friends of the family.Thank you for all the 'plus ones' George and Lucia  they have not gone unnoticed  and your family has really gone above and beyond what we thought was required.As first time Air BnB users  you really have set the bar ridiculously high!We look forward to coming back to Sydney to catch up again! Next time we'll supply the bubbles.xxx Sally  Dwayne and Mon"),
("2018-01-14", "17438054", "Julie", "A lovely spot  close to the airport with easy access to public transport. Super clean accommodation with great amenities!"),
("2018-01-24", "17438054", "Colin", "Thank you George and Lucia for a wonderful stay in your amazing granny flat.  You have thought of everything for a very comfortable stay.  We were in Sydney visiting family and the location was perfect   Wendy & Colin"),
("2018-02-05", "17438054", "Danne", "Love love love this Airbnb!!! Like most of the people here have said  the granny flat looks just like the pictures :) it’s very comfortable  very cozy  very clean and has everything we could possibly need—extra towels  umbrella  washer  Netflix… the list goes on!! This is the first time my parents rented an Airbnb (they were hesitant at first) and they absolutely loved the experience; kept saying they didn’t wanna leave and if permitted  they would rent this place again the next time they’re in Sydney!  the place is also close to the train station and food shops  100% recommend!!"),
("2018-02-10", "17438054", "Robin", "This was our first Airbnb experience  and it was amazing. The bar has been set extremely high for us based on this time. George and Lucia went so far above and beyond what they needed to do as hosts. They truly thought of everything and their offering is magnificent. The flat looks brand new  is very stylish  yet VERY comfortable. The location is convenient to both the airport and the train station. In total  it is an ideal place to stay in Sydney at a very reasonable price. Our only regret is not having more time to spend there."),
("2018-03-01", "17438054", "Ashley", "This Granny flat is wonderful.  So many nice amenities are included.  We really enjoyed our 18 days there.  George and Lucia are great hosts.  We give them our highest rating - 5 STARS!"),
("2018-03-04", "17438054", "Nadia", "This was the best Airbnb experience!  George and Lucia were wonderful hosts!  The place had absolutely everything we needed and more.  It was very clean  modern and comfortable!  Highly recommend! 5 stars!"),
("2018-03-15", "17438054", "Giuseppe", "In this amazing granny you will find the maximum comfort and the stay in a highly prepared place  very clean and healthy with all types of facilities that let you keep coming again and again.George is a perfect host   so nice that change you from a guest to a friend level."),
("2018-03-31", "17438054", "Mary", "Outstanding in every way!!  If there were more stars in the ratings I would use every one!  They have set a very high standard for future Airbnb experiences."),
("2018-04-02", "17438054", "Yixiao", "This granny flat is almost the best place I’ve ever stayed on Airbnb! Rooms are really really cozy and all the things we need can be found there. George and Lucia are very nice and helped us a lot. The place is near Kingsgrove Train Station where it’s convenient to take the train to City."),
("2018-04-11", "17438054", "Rosemary", "The house was lovely  clean and very comfortable. All amenities were there. It was peaceful and quiet. Overall we really enjoyed our stay and would highly recommend it for anyone wanting to stay in the area."),
("2018-04-18", "17438054", "Laura", "Absolutely the cleanest  best equipped accommodation with gracious hosts.   We will definitely stay here on our next trip to Sydney."),
("2018-04-29", "17438054", "Diane", "We stayed at the Granny Flat whilst visiting family in Sydney.  It's not in the centre of Sydney but there are good rail links from Kingsgrove station a short walk from the property.  The accommodation is of the highest quality in terms of furnishings  facilities and cleanliness. It was good to have our own entrance so we could come and go as we please.  George and Lucia have thought of everything you could need away from home including shopping bags  washing powder  toiletries and food cupboard staples such as cooking oil  herbs and pasta.  The welcome gift of a box of chocolates and a fridge stocked with milk and butter was really useful.  There is a small Coles supermarket at the petrol station nearby (right at the end of the road) and there is a Woolworths  plenty of restaurants and smaller shops in Kingsgrove. George is very friendly and willing to help in any way he can during your stay.  Would definitely recommend and we will use again."),
("2018-05-15", "17438054", "Hoang", "George and Lucia are great host! everything is perfect and more than we expected"),
("2018-06-09", "17438054", "Frida", "George and Lucia’s flat was perfect. We stayed there for three weeks while renovating and it had everything we needed: kitchen with all the required cookware  super comfortable bed  TV  aircon etc. Also very pleasantly decorated. The extra touches also made it stand out: welcome chocolate  cozy winter sheets  robes  and lots of coffee! Can’t speak more highly of the hosts who made us feel very welcome and offered to help with anything we needed. Train and bus transportation is also handy and nearby. The only negative was the walk to the train station is a bit grungy and industrial  otherwise the granny flat is located in a nice little cul de sac. Would highly recommend staying here. Thanks again G & L!"),
("2018-06-15", "17438054", "Joe And Nicki", "A stunning granny annex that is a short distance from all the amenities that is needed in a busy city. The annex is spacious  light  modern and well presented. It only took 10 min to get to the train station and a further 20 min to get into the centre of the city. George and lucias granny flat felt private  secure and like a little retreat! We highly recommend staying here with or without children. "),
("2018-06-18", "17438054", "Silvia", "It is actually our first time on air bnb and the first experience with this place was an awesome one  the place is very clean  tidy and George actually went on the extra mile by providing us with some toys  knowing that we have our son with us as well. George has been very helpful and we look forward to staying in this place in the near future"),
("2018-08-20", "17438054", "Jean-Daniel", "Sofar my best experience with AirBNB in Australia! A fantastic flat with everything you need in there  close to the station. George and Lucia are very nice."),
("2018-08-31", "17438054", "Goh", "The place is great to stay because close the community i.e train station  Chinese restaurant  shopping mall and also airport."),
("2018-09-06", "17438054", "Linda", "Oh my goodness  what an amazing stay we had. Perfectly presented home with wonderful touches throughout.Will stay again and again when we are in the area!"),
("2018-09-22", "17438054", "Yee Wee", "We had a wonderful stay at the granny flat. The unit is very cosy and well equipped with all the high quality kitchen appliances. George and Lucia are very detailed and thoughtful person  they prepared everything we need. They even provided 2 full bags of lego block toys and soft toys for my children to keep them occupied and entertained.  The granny flat is highly recommended if  anyone is looking for accommodation around kingsgrove/nearby sydney Airport."),
("2018-10-01", "17438054", "Monique", "Beautiful and modern decor and we felt very at home. We loved how personalised they made they experience (instead of just stating 'dear guest') and suggested local cafes and restaurants to try. Great location with public transport a short distance away."),
("2018-10-13", "17438054", "Deborah", "This place has it all  value for money"),
("2018-10-20", "17438054", "Kobus", "Very modern and clean  highly recommended."),
("2018-10-25", "17438054", "Katie", "George and Lucia provided a beautiful cosy space for their guests. The flat was modern  super tidy and very comfortable. Would recommend to anyone looking for a nice space to call home!"),
("2018-10-27", "17438054", "Chris", "A clean and well decorated modern flat."),
("2018-11-02", "17438054", "Kiara", "George and Lucia's Granny Flat was amazing. It was clean  convenient and a nice home away from home. They were great and following up with us to make sure we were ok and nice and settled. I would definitely stay here again and recommend others to stay as well."),
("2018-11-09", "17438054", "Han", "geweldig compleet. prima huis met veel privacy. Alle voorzieningen aanwezig."),
("2018-11-10", "17438054", "Jessica", "Our stay was absolutely wonderful. The beds were very comfortable  there we snack on the table for us when we arrived and a note with suggested places to eat around the area. George and Lucia were very responsive and I would strongly recommend booking if in the area :)"),
("2018-11-20", "17438054", "Iain", "We loved our recent stay at George and Lucia’s Granny flat. The place is very stylish  modern  very clean & has all the essentials you could possibly need for your stay. It’s extremely quiet on a night too and felt very safe. Both George and Lucia are great hosts  very welcoming & are always available for any help you may need. It took about 15 minutes on the train to get into the CBD but it’s a straight line from Kingsgrove so made life really easy to get about.Would recommend the granny flat to anyone looking to explore Sydney!"),
("2018-11-25", "17438054", "Ailsa", "Dear George and Lucia - we had a great stay at your beautiful cozy property. You have created a wonderful environment for travellers  to stay and feel ‘at home’.  We were visiting our family who live about 10 minutes away from the Granny Flat so great location and very peaceful and quiet given it is no distance from some main roads.  The granny flat is beautifully maintained and sparkling clean. It offers all the creature comforts  including full kitchen amenities and if you just want to watch TV  Netflix is at your disposal.   George and Lucia are the perfect hosts  always there if you need them:). Thank you for the chocolates  - "),
("2018-12-02", "17438054", "Bradley", "George and Lucia went above and beyond our expectations. It was truely the best experience that we could have had.They were such genuine and gracious hosts which made our very first Air bnb experience one that has set high standards.We will certainly turn to them again for accomodation for our next visit to Sydney.I highly recommend that you experience their ‘Cozy Granny Flat’  but not so much so that we can’t get a spot in there again haha. (I’m joking of course).But in all seriousness  the standards are that of a 5 star hotel."),
("2018-12-14", "17438054", "Janan", "Everything you need in a compact unit. Quiet street. Great hosts. Perfect for a base as we were out often visiting cousins and sightseeing.  Very happy!"),
("2018-12-27", "17438054", "Shannon", "George and Lucia’s place was fantastic! Very thoughtful hosts  they went above and beyond to ensure my parents stay was enjoyable! The flat was perfect! Clean  actually spotless heaps of added extras! Highly recommend!!"),
("2019-01-03", "17438054", "Joshua", "I highly recommend this place! We had an amazing time in Sydney  especially Lucia’s and George’s hospitality was incredible! Thank you!"),
("2019-01-10", "17438054", "Athena", "This has to be one of the nicest places I’ve ever stayed in. Immaculately clean and beautifully decorated. George and Lucia were fantastic hosts and provided just about everything. I can’t say enough about this property. Will definitely be coming back!"),
("2019-01-12", "17438054", "Darren", "One of the best airbnb's I've ever stayed in. Hosts went above and beyond to make sure stay was great. There was chocolate on the counter and in the refrigerator  fresh eggs  water  and a fully stocked bathroom that had EVERYTHING you might need. I was super impressed. Never seen an airbnb with so much attention to detail.A few other things to note:-Beautiful decor and interior design. Pictures do not do it justice.-AC/aircon is ice cold and does a great job in the Sydney summer-There's a small  intimate patio outside with seating and a deck.-internet has strong signal though Australia's 4g/lte is so fast most of the time cell phone tethering is actually faster. I got speeds of around 5mbps.-Towels are high-end hotel quality. Very soft and fluffy.-Washer  in unit! Very nice one at that. This flat has nicer appliances than i have at home.-Actually has 2 full sized beds  one in the bedroom (great sheets and duvet!) and one in a small alcove behind the couch."),
("2019-01-14", "17438054", "Robert", "G & L's place is a perfect place to rest up."),
("2019-01-28", "17438054", "Laura", "George and Lucia’s home was beyond wonderful! A beautifully relaxing stay with everything and anything you could need! They were wonderful hosts  very thoughtful  easy to communicate with  and always happy to offer help or assistance! Their granny flat is very private and a cozy little oasis away from the hustle and bustle of Sydney  but with shops  trains and facilities a quick walk away! Perfect for any travellers needs!Can’t express how wonderful their Airbnb really is!"),
("2019-02-10", "17438054", "Walter", "Great place to stay at!! The house is clean and it is around 10 minutes walk from train station."),
("2019-02-15", "17438054", "Peggy", "very clean."),
("2019-02-22", "17438054", "Georg", "It is a wonderful place to stay in Sydney. We found all we needed to feel “at home” during our stay.  George and Lucia were very helpful with any questions and made it a wonderful experience.They were wonderful hosts  easy to communicate with and always happy to offer help or assistance!Their granny flat is very private and a little oasis in Sydney  with shops  trains and facilities a quick walk away! Perfect for any travellers needs! We really enjoyed staying there!"),
("2019-02-28", "17438054", "Jay", "Very neat and tidy granny flat. Will definitely be using again."),
("2019-03-02", "17438054", "Jaq", "Wonderful stay at George and Lucia’s lovely home.Lovely private setting and sparkling clean and with everything we could ever need for our short stay.George’s recommendation for dinner was also a real highlight to our stay.Thank you"),
("2018-01-03", "17613188", "Louisa", "The host canceled this reservation 56 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2019-01-04", "17613188", "Teddy", "Keith was a great host. Everything was well organised. My parents had a lovely stay. It's definitely a place that I will recommend to anyone who wants to stay somewhere quiet  convenient and very comfy."),
("2017-04-11", "17624702", "Rupert", "Fantastic apartment! Great location  5 minute walk to Bondi Beach  no hesitation in recommending this place to stay! Really nice modern feel to the apartment as well  felt right at home! Top it off with great views looking across Sydney from the Balcony! We'll be back for sure :) "),
("2017-04-15", "17624702", "Keith", "Perfect place for a small group. The house was very comfortable and the balcony was awesome for sunsets - you can see the Opera House and Harbour bridge. You can walk to Bondi beach in 15 and about 20-25 minutes to the heart of area on Hall Street; the walk back is uphill! Communication was great and made for an easy check-in and check-out process."),
("2017-05-07", "17606304", "Jaye", "A gorgeous townhouse  with old world charm and modern features. The location is great  really central with yummy cafes within walking distance. Parking was easy too. The furnishings were all lovely and the kitchen is a great size and well equipped.The bedroom was cosy with a sunroom at the front which was great to relax in  have a chat or read a book with a glass of wine. We'd definitely look to stay again next time we're visiting Sydney. "),
("2017-05-20", "17606304", "Maxx", "Patrick & Christine's place was amazing. Spacious rooms (the photos make it look smaller instead of bigger!)  the area is quiet and peaceful. The sunroom is PERFECT for sitting around with a cup of tea and a book. Communication was clear and friendly  buses right outside and a short walk to a train station  a quick drive/uber/taxi/bus to nightlife in Newtown  it's got everything you'd need. Couldn't recommend it enough. Thanks again Christine and Pat!  "),
("2017-05-30", "17606304", "Laura", "Patrick and Christine's place was lovely  and beautifully renovated with very modern touches. The unit was actually  much bigger and spacious compared to the photos. It was well equipped with comfortable and cosy furniture in particular  the lounge and the bed was extremely comfortable. All the linen from the towels  to the bedding  extra blankets etc were of high quality. The little court yard was a great little outside area where you could bask in the sun  great for my 3 yr old boy! Check in was easy and the communication between the owners and myself were always prompt and friendly. Thank you for our stay :-)  "),
("2017-06-05", "17606304", "Nic", "Great hosts. Very clean and tidy. All good."),
("2017-07-01", "17606304", "Sue", "We were very happy with our stay at the cottage. It is in a great location for public transport including buses  light rail & rail. The local shops at Dulwich Hill have all your grocery needs with lots of great cafes & bars to choose from. The internet was great & Netflix was a nice bonus. Patrick & Christine responded immediately to nay issues or queries we had. The appliances were modern & worked well. Bedding was of a high quality & the bed very comfortable. Everything was as listed on the amenities site. The pantry items & consumables supplied were a lovely bonus. The only downside was that the 2 radiators were inadequate for the area to be heated. We would recommend this cottage."),
("2017-07-11", "17606304", "Carolyn", "This is a very good stay with plenty of space. We would have liked curtains in the bedroom rather than just frosted glass as it was very bright at night. The radiators worked well keeping us warm (it was slightly less cold than it had been). It was absolutely spotless  and the hosts were super efficient in their communication."),
("2017-07-15", "17606304", "Marilyn", "Stayed 2 nights in July 2017.  This lovely 1 bedder is handy to everything and was extremely neat  clean and presented beautifully.  Bedding  linen etc were beautiful and everything you could possible need in the kitchen.  Will definitely book again next time I'm in Sydney.  The hosts were great communicators and obtaining access to the accommodation was no trouble.  Parking in side street only a few meters away."),
("2017-07-19", "17606304", "Sean", "The house is located in a quiet place  if you're not in a hurry to do some business or traveling through cities  this house is a good choice. The host is very kind and nice!"),
("2017-07-23", "17606304", "Shannah", "Although based on a main road we were able to find parking easily and the traffic noise was not too distracting. We were able to create a cosy space with the heaters and fantastic bedding and appreciated the local menus left - highly recommend Zeus for souvlaki! The wooden floors next door meant the noise carried through however this wouldn't stop me staying here again. Fantastic check in process and such lovely  warm attentive hosts. "),
("2017-07-25", "17606304", "Jacqui", "Business like and efficient communication from the hosts and an easy check-in process. My 5pm arrival was slightly challenging in terms of traffic and getting to the correct side of the road  then finding parking in an adjacent street (if you are not used to Sydney traffic this can be a bit stressful). Comfy bed and a spacious and modern unit."),
("2017-07-27", "17606304", "Pat", "Wow! What a place. All looks so tidy and clean! The place is located in a good spot and you really can chill  Pat and Chris will have everithing sorted out for ya'all."),
("2017-07-30", "17606304", "Sue", "Very clean and comfortable. Spacious well thought out  everything you need for a comfortable stay. Close to shops and cafes Light rail. Child friendly (I had my 2 grandsons). Would stay again. Sue"),
("2017-08-04", "17606304", "Julien", "Superbe petite maison qui permet d'accueillir jusqu'à 4 personnes (1 chambre avec lit double et canapé/lit double dans le salon)Quartier très calme et agréable. 10 min à pied de la station de train Dulwich Hill et du Light Train (tram) permettant d'accéder rapidement à l'aéroport et au centre. Lignes de bus proche. Nous avons adoré notre petit séjour et nous reviendrons lors de notre prochaine visite à Sydney."),
("2017-08-07", "17606304", "Shingo", "Great accommodation. Clean and comfortable. Highly recommend!"),
("2017-08-25", "17606304", "Bin", "Very good experience. the house is far beyond our expectation. very tidy and very new. We cooked everyday. the washing machine was the best."),
("2017-09-01", "17606304", "Robyn", "This was the perfect location for me. The house was very clean and tidy.  The bed was very comfortable.  I really appreciated the sunny nook as the weather was quite cool.  The house had everything I needed  even a washing machine  although I didn't get a chance to use it.  I would definitely stay again for the location and value for money."),
("2017-09-05", "17606304", "Eva", "A perfect location for visiting family or friends in the Inner West.My relatives were absolutely delighted - and told me to keep this address in mind for any future visits :-)Top score in every respect  thank you Patrick and Christine."),
("2017-09-10", "17606304", "Bronwyn", "Great location; great facilities; great value."),
("2017-09-25", "17606304", "Mikaela", "Really lovely home. Cozy  clean  quiet neighbours. Easy to navigate to and from  already had all the necessities in the house. Will definitely look to stay here again in the future"),
("2017-10-06", "17606304", "재규", "It was clean and good for spending time with our family. It was easy to use transport because the bus stop and light rail station was close."),
("2017-10-19", "17606304", "Tony", "We had a very comfortable stay at Patrick and Christine’s place. The location is great  close to bus and tram public transport  along with a good selection of GoGet vehicles. There are some great shops  pubs and places to eat nearby  with every cuisine catered for.The house itself is well appointed  modern and clean with everything you expect and need for a comfortable stay. Patrick and Christine responded quickly to all communication and the 12pm checkout was fantastic. 10am is such a hideously early checkout time. I’d definitely stay here again."),
("2017-10-29", "17606304", "Andrew", "My parents stayed here for about a week while visiting me. They had a great time and really enjoyed the house."),
("2017-11-06", "17606304", "Nandor", "Nice cosy place  perfect a weekend getaway  close to darling harbour"),
("2017-11-14", "17606304", "Cheryl L", "Location is excellent for an inner-city-kind of experience. Only a five-minute walk to the light rail. Home was charming  with gorgeous wood floors  updated bath and kitchen."),
("2017-11-29", "17606304", "Imogen", "This place was great. Much more spacious than I expected for a one bedroom unit (long hallway  big kitchen  lounge room and bedroom). The place was absolutely spotless when we arrived  especially the bathroom  which is always so important (hate when the bathroom is dirty!) Patrick and Christine were so accommodating when we had a last minute change of plans and asked if we could check in early to get ready for an event that afternoon. I will definitely stay here again!"),
("2017-12-03", "17606304", "Kate", "Gorgeous new kitchen and bathroom  lovely bedroom. The second bed  a sofa bed in the lounge  is really only useful for a child and takes up the only living space. This house ideal for a couple  not so great for two adults who were not sharing a bed. Great public transport options nearby. Christine very responsive on checkin and purchased a fan for us as it was quite hot in the house. No screens on any windows or doors mean you have to lock up everything at night. Shared wall with neighbours quite thin and wooden floors throughout are lovely but noisy from next door  especially when heels are being worn there! Thank you Christine and Patrick."),
("2017-12-07", "17606304", "Lucy", "Absolutely gorgeous place!  Really spacious and comfortable.  Would highly recommend."),
("2017-12-09", "17606304", "Sean", "Patrick and Christine's place is well located  close to food options and public transport. We enjoyed a delicious dinner and breakfast based on their recommendations  and found our way quickly into the city via the light rail."),
("2017-12-13", "17606304", "Yan", "Patrick and Christine's place is ideal for a small family or couple. The house is very clean and cozy ."),
("2017-12-16", "17606304", "Joanne", "Nice accommodation And basic amenities were provided including equipment for young kids"),
("2017-12-25", "17606304", "Yi", "lovely place"),
("2017-12-28", "17606304", "Rajendra", "Great location and good value for money."),
("2018-01-02", "17606304", "Kelly", "Excellent value. Patrick and Christine were very accommodating to all our needs"),
("2018-01-04", "17606304", "James", "Patrick and Christine's place was great! Hosts were very helpful and easy to communicate with!!! Conveniently positioned  immaculately clean and perfect for a short stay. Thanks guys!"),
("2018-01-24", "17606304", "Bridge", "We had a lovely stay. The house was just like in the photos. Confortable bedding and a cute courtyard where thé kids could go outside. Situated on a main road so maybe a bit noisy because of vehicles at times. Very clean. Duplex."),
("2018-02-05", "17606304", "Kuang-Hao", "Lovely house"),
("2018-02-18", "17606304", "Mari", "What a great little home! Everything we needed plus more. Clean and tidy  comfortable bed and plenty of fans to keep the place cool when it was hot and sticky outside!! Patrick and Christine were prompt to communicate and helpful. The location suited us perfectly  being close to public transport and restaurants (and a stones throw from where our daughter lives!!) We will be recommending this property to our friends and family."),
("2018-02-22", "17606304", "Jonathan", "Great house  great location!"),
("2018-02-24", "17606304", "Nicholas", "Great place to stay !"),
("2018-03-04", "17606304", "Thomas", "Christine and Patrick were amazing hosts! Their beautiful one bedder is modern  stylish and extremely clean. The house is just a short walk to the train station and main street. Thank you again for a fantastic stay!"),
("2018-03-11", "17606304", "Patricia", "This is the second time we have stayed in one of Christine and Patrick’s Airbnb’s and we loved it. Comfortable  clean and close to great things around the inner west. Thank you! We will be back. Trish"),
("2018-03-24", "17606304", "Giuseppe", "It was really amazing  good location   cleanness  perfect hospitality  thanks a lot  Patrick and Christine Giuseppe"),
("2018-04-08", "17606304", "Katy", "I booked this AirBnB for my parents who were visiting me nearby. The place is lovely  spacious and well appointed  and not far from the bustling Dulwich Hill shops. The bed was very comfortable and my parents enjoyed their stay here."),
("2018-04-13", "17606304", "Anna", "A lovely stay here at a stylish place. Good location for cafes nearby  Greek food delivered for dinner. All the things you need for a nice stay plus a bonus little sun room. Bed comfortable. Bathroom is gorgeous and new. Above all that  Patrick and Christine kindly accommodated me and our schedule for check-in which was much appreciated. Thanks again. Anna and Ash"),
("2018-04-26", "17606304", "(Email hidden by Airbnb)", "Thank you. Great location  no fuss."),
("2018-04-30", "17606304", "Kathryn", "This Dulwich Hill house is a great little pad for a couple or small family. Full kitchen  laundry  bedroom and living spaces with a great little sunroom for toy play! Don’t be fooled by main road location - parking actually very easy. Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2018-05-16", "17606304", "Sue", "This is a lovely  clean & comfortable ‘all of house’ accommodation. Everything that is stated on the information for this place is accurate. The hosts were quick to respond to any queries we had."),
("2018-05-26", "17606304", "Johanna", "This AirBnB  is well located in Dulich Hill . We enjoyed being able to walk to the Marrickville shops  train stops  and local restaurants. The house was spotlessly clean and contained a well  appointed kitchen and laundry. It has a cute backyard that captured the afternoon winter sun no was completely private. There is also a cute small sunroom off the main bedroom that captures the afternoon sun also."),
("2018-06-16", "17606304", "Bec", "This place was spotlessly clean  private and comfortable. Location was central and close to transport and checking in/out was easy. It was like a more private  more cosy hotel. I would stay again."),
("2018-07-05", "17606304", "Horacio", "Good property  well maintained  clean and warm"),
("2018-07-10", "17606304", "Bronwyn", "Such a large and comfortable and well equipped Airbnb is hard to find in this area.  It has lots of space and is extremely well equipped. A gem."),
("2018-07-19", "17606304", "Nguyen", "Patrick & Christine's place is so nice  quiet  stylish and charming - very clean and well-equipped. The tram and train stations are in walking distance (7mins and 15mins respectively). We would love to stay longer!"),
("2018-08-18", "17606304", "Shona", "Patrick and Christine’s place was immaculate and great for getting to know Sydney! It felt very homely and was handy for bus  light rail and train - perfect for getting around everywhere. Would recommend! "),
("2018-08-26", "17606304", "Sandra", "Patrick and Christine’s house is a lovely place to stay and just right for my husband I and our son to stay for the weekend.  Clean and tidy and comfy bed."),
("2018-09-06", "17606304", "Takeo", "Very comfortable house with every appliances well equipped. We had very nice time there. Strongly recommend to couples."),
("2018-09-22", "17606304", "Raimee", "Really great experience. Coffee in the sun room was great. Only thing is that the person staying next door seemed to be walking around in high heels at 1am and it was very audible through the wall. Other then that amazing."),
("2018-10-01", "17606304", "Trace", "the house looked so much better than the photos! definitely a 5 stars choice!!! zero hassle  easy parking and sparkling spotless house. what more can you ask for!"),
("2018-10-06", "17606304", "Misty", "Neat and tidy home."),
("2018-10-15", "17606304", "Colin", "Great would stay there again"),
("2018-10-21", "17606304", "Hazel", "Lovely clean and comfortable place. Close to transport and very well equipped."),
("2018-10-25", "17606304", "Talya", "Lovely place to stay in a neighbourhood with lots of public transport options. We really enjoyed our time in Sydney  thank you!"),
("2018-10-29", "17606304", "Sally", "Great spot for us  spacious and surprisingly quiet given the location. Would highly recommend. Thanks so much."),
("2018-11-01", "17606304", "Ryan", "Excellent accommodation"),
("2018-11-10", "17606304", "Cassandra", "Christine and Patrick’s place was perfect for our stay. We were there for a week and it had everything we needed! It was very clean  had plenty of amenities  the check in process was simple and the on street parking was easy. We enjoyed our stay and next time we’re back for a week or so we’ll be checking if this place is available!"),
("2018-11-17", "17606304", "Kristi", "Great place! Very clean and bright! Loved our stay here"),
("2018-11-25", "17606304", "Yan", "我们居住得很舒服 房间干净 整洁 离公交站很近｡"),
("2018-12-15", "17606304", "Renee", "Great place for couples or those with baby or toddler. Easy to get around and lots of nice touches to make it feel like home"),
("2018-12-25", "17606304", "Irene", "My parents were very happy after their 4 days stay at Christine and Patrick. The place is nicely decorated  the bed is very comfy and the location is very convenient if you want to be in the Inner West. All this combined with good and timely communication. I highly recommend this place :-)"),
("2019-01-02", "17606304", "Samuel", "Excellent place to stay- clean  accessible  spacious (even for 3 people!) and easy to communicate with Christine and Patrick. A lot of basic bits in the house to help with cooking and general ease of living. Thank you again!"),
("2019-01-10", "17606304", "Liz", "Lovely Australian home with real character. Beautiful details and high ceilings. Good to have private outside space. Well appointed galley kitchen. Transport (buses and trains) close by and easy to use. Very comfortable and relaxing space to relax in after busy days in Sydney. We had a lovely time."),
("2019-02-17", "17606304", "Renae", "Had a great stay at Christine and Patrick's when visiting family that lives nearby. Plenty of room for the two of us. My son was lucky enough to score the main room while I was fine on the sofa bed. Easy check in. Secure place  very clean and had everything you need to stay. So grateful for the shampoo in the bathroom as mine had exploded in my suitcase during my flight. These little touches make a difference! Most appreciated the check out time of 12pm!  Very comfortable space we would stay again. I can definitely recommend. Thanks Christine and Patrick:)"),
("2019-02-23", "17606304", "Brandon", "Amazing and cool house for a short getaway for the weekend. Reasonable proximity to the airport and good access to public transport. The bedroom is awesome with a sunroom to the front to chill."),
("2019-02-28", "17606304", "Katy", "My parents enjoyed a great stay at Christine and Patrick's place  it is comfortable and well appointed. Perfect for visiting my family in Dulwich Hill"),
("2019-03-04", "17606304", "Tiffany", "Beautiful home in a fabulous area.  very clean  lovely bed and everything you need.  We enjoyed our stay very much. Thank you for having us."),
("2017-03-25", "17795782", "Martin", "Beach and Surf :D"),
("2017-04-19", "17757543", "Rachel", "Emma's White House was perfect for my husbands long stay for work purposes.He had everything he needed and Na (the host) was awesome.... extremely pleasant and helpful. She always made sure that his stay was comfortable. Communication was prompt and efficient.The location was quiet  safe and close to amenities. The unit is away from the house and he wasn't disturbed by noise.It was fantastic value for money and he would most definitely stay here again. I highly recommend this Airbnb to others. Thanks Na for making the time away from home so pleasant. "),
("2017-07-12", "17757543", "Jensen", "Definitely Recommend"),
("2017-07-15", "17757543", "Susu", "房东很热情 房子环境比较好 很安静 最吸引我的还是房间的私密性 全力推荐｡"),
("2017-07-30", "17757543", "Kerry", "Na is a warm and welcoming host. I will be back next year. The accommodation is very conveniently located for anyone needing somewhere in the Campbelltown area. With your own entrance and security lighting  it was easy to come and go. The water was warm and had excellent pressure for showers. Thanks again"),
("2017-09-17", "17757543", "Ephraim", "Na looked after us amazingly. Made it so easy to stay here and at the same time completley private. We loved it."),
("2017-09-21", "17757543", "Karen", "Na's  place was convenient for our visit in Sydney and very comfortable. She was super accommodating and helpful. Parking was no problem.  Communication was absolutely outstanding as Na is a very responsive host.  Plenty of towels are provided  lovely soaps and shampoo.  I would definitely visit again!"),
("2017-10-02", "17757543", "Rebecca", "Great place to stay Na is very welcoming"),
("2017-11-25", "17757543", "Nathan", "We very much enjoyed our stay. Very comfortable  the host is very accommodating and caring. Peaceful location and very short walk to public transport. Would gladly return again!"),
("2017-12-05", "17757543", "Amit", "It was an amazing experience to stay at Na's place. She is very hospitable and understanding. I booked the place for 15 days but i had to reduce the stay due to some personal emergency and it was very gracious of Na to accent the modification.The  place was very clean and a must stay if you are around that area.I would highly recommend Na's place.Thanks a lot Na."),
("2017-12-10", "17757543", "左左", "房子处于生活小镇区域 离高速很近 房主非常热情响应很快｡"),
("2017-12-28", "17757543", "LaCoco", "Emma's White House Has everything you need.Na is a lovely host and an awesome new longtime friend who I'm happy to have met! Beautiful family  beautiful home xo"),
("2018-01-01", "17757543", "Ong", "Nice friendly hosts. very good hospitality. we will come back again. Highly recommended."),
("2018-01-08", "17757543", "Mimi", "This is a lovely self contained place. It’s quiet  has all the necessary amenities  and is an easy 10-15 min walk to the train station. Na is very well organised  easy to talk to and helpful."),
("2018-02-27", "17757543", "Amrita", "My parents really enjoyed their stay at Na's place. Na is an excellent host; communication was great throughout their stay and Na was always available for any questions. The place is neat  clean and very comfortable."),
("2018-03-25", "17757543", "Amrita", "My parents had a wonderful time at Na's place. They stayed there for about 2 months - Na's place became a home away from home! Lovely house  neat and clean and very peaceful. Na is a wonderful host and an outstanding person. She's very helpful and friendly.  Overall I would recommend this place to all!"),
("2018-04-15", "17757543", "Karen", "Na is very helpful and hospitable! Very clean  and nice touches like flowers on the table. We needed to be in this area and if that comes up again  I wouldn’t hesitate to book in again!"),
("2018-05-08", "17757543", "Mimi", "It was pleasure to return to Na’s place again. It’s in every way as advertised  clean  self-contained  near to shops and restaurants.  Easy to get to and near public transport."),
("2018-05-14", "17757543", "Karen", "Nothing"),
("2018-06-04", "17757543", "Maree", "Na's - 'Emma's White House' is everything that it says it is. Comfortable with every amenity you need provided. Privacy assured. And Na is a lovely  friendly and very helpful host."),
("2018-07-30", "17757543", "Collette", "We stayed here for 4 nights to attend a convention near by. Is a cute little granny flat. Close to everything. Na was a great host  easy to deal with. For how close it is to the highway  it was really quiet. Would stay here again"),
("2018-09-24", "17757543", "Dae Joong", "마트나 패스트푸트가 가까이에 있어서 좋았어요 집에도 필요한 물건들이 다 있어서 불편한 점 없이 잘 지냈어요"),
("2019-01-05", "17757543", "Karen", "Very accommodating hosts  willing to help with anything. Having a washing machine is a bonus."),
("2019-02-02", "17757543", "Erin", "Great private unit with a lovely & thoughtful host"),
("2019-02-11", "17757543", "Wendy", "Great home  very good for value!"),
("2019-02-23", "17757543", "Mackenzie", "Na was a wonderful host  and Emma’s White House is a lovely little place to stay for short or long periods of time."),
("2017-04-27", "17797004", "Marius Helge", "Agnes was a great and very friendly host. The apartment was nice and comfortable  and had a perfect location in Redfern. "),
("2017-05-11", "17797004", "James", "Good place to stay"),
("2017-05-26", "17797004", "Richard", "Agnes is a very well travelled  polite and informative host. Excellent all round Airbnb expert."),
("2017-07-20", "17797004", "Leah", "Easy to communicate with and tidy place"),
("2018-02-15", "17797004", "Anton", "Wenige Minuten vom Bahnhof redfern entfernt  dadurch alle Sehenswürdigkeiten leicht erreichbar. Ruhige Umgebung. Geschäfte und Lokale alle zu Fuß erreichbar"),
("2018-04-19", "17797004", "Matthew", "Awesome little apartment to yourself. Very kind host  very easy check in  no Wi-Fi but great amenities  everything working well  nice touches and character in the rooms!"),
("2018-07-05", "17797004", "Harison", "The unit is very comfortable. There is a store nearby. And Agnes is a great host!"),
("2018-07-12", "17797004", "Aurélie", "Well equipped apartment perfectly located. Agnes was reachable very easily and helpful. Small but perfect apartment with everything we needed. 5 minute walk from the train station. I highly recommend this place. Thanks again"),
("2018-07-21", "17797004", "재윤", "Wonderful place to stay. Great location with all the things you need prepared in the house. Nice and cozy  and also very clean too. Agnes was very friendly and supportive  making our stay even better. I'd like to thank her for helping us out on our wonderful stay in Sydney."),
("2018-09-15", "17797004", "Cauê", "Great location  clean and great host."),
("2018-10-06", "17797004", "Bruce", "Fabulous host   great place. Brilliant stay.Definitely stay again  400 m from Redfern train so convenient."),
("2018-10-19", "17797004", "Lucy", "Super convenient and comfortable place for solo travellers or couples. Easy walking distance to Redfern and Surry Hills."),
("2018-11-15", "17797004", "Matt", "A lovely place  close to everything in Redfern."),
("2018-11-22", "17797004", "Liangjue", "Room is clean and decent though not fancy. Fantastic location. I had to check out in the morning but Agnes kindly accommodated me to leave my luggage in the apartment until the evening as my flight out was late. Great communication."),
("2018-11-28", "17797004", "Erin", "Staying here was a real pleasure  like a little home away from home."),
("2018-12-27", "17797004", "Yeongjong", "이곳은 진짜 에어비앤비 입니다. 다른 곳과 달리 실제 호스트가 거주하는 공간을 대여해줍니다. 엘레베이터가 있어서 너무 편했고 대중교통 이용하기에 최적의 장소입니다. Agnes 는 아주 친절하고 꼼꼼하게 숙소 이용에 대한 것을 알려주었고 약간의 늦은 체크인도 배려해주어 고마웠습니다. 실제 시드니에 사는 듯 머무르고 왔습니다. 편안한 장소입니다."),
("2019-01-01", "17797004", "Jim", "Excellent-value apartment just a few minutes walk from Redfern Station. Has everything needed  including a large kitchen  washing machine + dryer  secure underground parking."),
("2019-01-12", "17797004", "Siao Liang", "Agnes is a good and friendly host.The place is close to the train station.Though there was no Internet at house we still had two comfortable nights.Thank you."),
("2017-05-05", "17913605", "Josh", "Was a pleasure to stay at Matt's house! Really close to the quiet side of King St and the room was everything you could want. Not only that  Matt is a super nice guy and was an excellent host. Matt's dog is beautiful and amazingly cute. Really had a great time and the place comes strongly recommended! For value for money  this is one of best listings in Newtown. Thanks so much for having me! Next time I'm back I would definitely rebook. Stellar! "),
("2017-05-13", "17913605", "Erin", "The room at Matt's place was gorgeous  the bed was really comfy and the place was  really nice  clean and walkable to public transport and Newtown. Matt was really friendly and great to chat to and Nina the dog was so cute. Loved staying here - thanks again Matt for an awesome stay :)"),
("2017-05-26", "17913605", "James", "Matt is a really easy going dude  he has an awesome doggy called ""Nina""  if you like it close to shops and eating hot spots stay with Matt!"),
("2014-01-06", "1789833", "Sophie", "Nous avons passé un séjour familial à Sydney magique. La maison de Steve et Jessica est idéalement située entre Bondi beach et toutes les autres plages   non loin du centre dans un quartier calme.Steve et jessica se sont montrés très prévenants   nous laissant à disposition une maison confortable et sereine . La maison est grande   joliment décorée et moderne dans ses infrastructures .Nous recommandons vivement ce logement pour une famille ."),
("2015-01-03", "1789833", "Menaka", "Steve and Jessie's beautiful Bondi home is emblematic of what Airbnb is all about: experiencing a location through the lens and comfort of a local. Clean  spacious  and comfortable  their house felt like home within minutes of arriving. They even left us a Sydney guidebook and a fridge with all the essentials! The location is excellent - near lots of shops and restaurants  and just a 10-minute walk from the beach. Even their neighbors were friendly  popping by to make sure we had everything we needed. We had a truly magical time in Sydney  much of which we attribute to our amazing accommodations. Thank you Jessie and Steve!"),
("2016-01-05", "1789833", "Susan", "Jesse and Steve's home is located on a quiet cul-de-sac in a vibrant and convenient neighborhood. Good food  coffee  workout opportunities  the beach - all within walking distance. Loved that. The house was spotless and very comfortable. Great living/entertainment area. Jesse and Steve were exceptionally welcoming: we were greeted with flowers  and they called to see we were comfortably settled. Overall  a very positive experience.   "),
("2018-04-30", "1789833", "Andrew", "Jessica's house is large and airy  very well appointed  located on a quiet street but minutes away from everything. I would have no hesitation recommending to friends and family."),
("2019-01-03", "1789833", "Gareth", "Great home! Jessica and Steven were very nice and helpful prior to arrival and in the small time we met them when checking in.The place felt like home for the time we were there which was exactly what we were looking for thank you!"),
("2017-03-29", "17829178", "Ben", "Underwhelmed is a word that comes to mind to describe my stay.  While the location is good being close to the main hub of Glebe  the general condition of the premises is poor.  Several parts of the apartment are in a state of disrepair including the blind in the main bedroom which is hanging by a cable tie and  is completely dysfunctional.  The TV is also not working and has been out of action for some time which is not clearly stated in ad.  "),
("2017-04-16", "17829178", "Joanne", "Elises’s place is in a handy location just off Glebe Point Road. It is close to the city  to public transport  to beautiful old St. John's Church and to the interesting array of shops and places to eat in Glebe.It was clean  and the small  walled garden courtyard provided a pleasant place to sit and enjoy a glass of wine in the sun! An affordable option in a great location. "),
("2017-04-22", "17829178", "Tahlia", "Nice location  lovely home and a great stay  we enjoyed our time here ☺️"),
("2017-04-30", "17829178", "Thuy", "Glebe is a great neighbourhood  Elise's place is in a great spot  walking distance to cafes & restaurants on Glebe Point road and the Glebe market (Saturdays). 20 minute walk to Darling Harbour. Newtown and Chippendale areas are also near by.Check in and check out was easy and communication was good.The apartment caters for your basic needs and has a nice little courtyard  and is clean.A couple of things to note: there is no iron available (as per Elise's advertisement - but I forgot to check this when making the booking). There is a bit of noise from the upstairs tenants and from the street as the apartment/bedroom is located along the street path. We were out of the apartment most of the time anyway but just something we noticed.Overall  affordable  clean and in a a great location."),
("2017-05-05", "17829178", "Gabrielle", "Well equipped apartment  good communication from our host  well managed property in a truly convenient location"),
("2017-05-07", "17829178", "Mikki", "Our stay was comfortable during this time  however we could tenants above us walking around. Though there was a great kitchen space no microwave or TV available.The location is lovely with markets and cafes 5mins walk up the street and though communication was great during our stay we did not confirm entry to the room until midday of check in day. "),
("2017-05-19", "17829178", "Elliot & Liz", "Lovely place in an really good location"),
("2017-05-20", "17829178", "Georgia", "Small  basic apartment in a great location. OK for short stays."),
("2017-05-30", "17829178", "Rebecca", "My friend and I originally booked the courtyard unit to stay in for a week while visiting Sydney  but on the day of our check in Elise informed us she had moved us to a newly renovated unit in the same building. At first we were a little bummed to not get a courtyard  but the new unit was very spacious and well decorated with brand new appliances and features so we were ultimately fine with the switch. The location of the place is fantastic with restaurants  shops  and transportation just a couple of blocks away. However  the street its located on is fairly busy so if you're a light sleeper bring some ear plugs with you as cars and people pass by at all hours of the day and night. Also while the bathroom in the unit was nice and new  the floor does tend to get wet from the shower so bring some flip-flops to use in there! But overall we had a nice stay! "),
("2017-06-04", "17829178", "성호", "적당히 좋은 위치 조용함"),
("2017-06-12", "17829178", "Kerry", "Glebe is a cool area to stay in. Close to Cebtral Sydney  either walking  light rail or bus. I would suggest that the apartment is better for one person or a couple as the fold put couch isn't too comfy. "),
("2017-06-20", "17829178", "Matt", "."),
("2017-06-24", "17829178", "Lucy", "Great place to stay in Sydney. Great price and host was contactable for any issues. Would recommend this apartment for a couple"),
("2017-07-03", "17829178", "Jiahao", "Overall it's a good place to stay for two."),
("2017-07-08", "17829178", "Margaux", "A great apartment ! Confortable with good location !"),
("2017-07-15", "17829178", "Ralph", "Great place and very close to the harbour.Great location"),
("2017-07-21", "17829178", "Christine", "Loved this modern accomodation! Open space great for weekend getaway. Close to shops and cute cafes. Very easy to communicate with owner. Was given a detailed document upon arrival and great tips!"),
("2017-07-25", "17829178", "Wenxuan", "Although have some episodes  finally solved through smooth communication with the host  low price and good location!"),
("2017-07-27", "17829178", "Kevin", "This listing is very spacious and a walkable distance from Broadway Shopping centre. Communication with Elise was fantastic and she was fast to respond. Overall this listing setved its purpose well."),
("2017-07-30", "17829178", "Blair", "Elise's apartment is located in the very central yet quiet neighbourhood of glebe close to the CBD. The area itself offers some interesting things a short walk away but getting to the CBD or livelier Newtown is very easy also."),
("2017-08-03", "17829178", "Isabel", "The apartament is located in a quiet neighbourhood next to the city center and Elise take care of her guest perfectly."),
("2017-08-09", "17829178", "Alexia", "The apartment has easy access to public transport and the Darling Harbour is only walking distance away."),
("2017-08-13", "17829178", "Tate", "Elise's nifty little apartment packs a lot into a small space. A perfect place to use as a base just a bus ride from the CBD and a 5 minute stroll to some of the funkiest bars  restaurants  cafés and markets Sydney has to offer. The place was clean and well supplied with linens  cook ware  a compact but perfectly functional little kitchen and bathroom and an oh so comfy bed! There are a few furnishings yet to be assembled and a few pictures yet to be hung but a brilliant apartment in a very cool location nonetheless.Would absolutely stay again :)"),
("2017-08-14", "17829178", "Greg", "Great place"),
("2017-08-17", "17829178", "Wang", "Good location and neighbors are all very quiet. Love the style of decoration. Elise is very friendly. It's a good journey."),
("2017-08-19", "17829178", "Ryan", "This was a perfect spot for me. Although not much insulation  which made for a bit of a draft throughout the house and bathroom. But this was still a great little apartment  the bed was very comfortable and a very clean little place. Thanks again!"),
("2017-08-22", "17829178", "昱涵", "Elise的公寓在Glebe 离市中心比较近 交通很方便｡房屋宽敞 设施齐全 房东人也很好!性价比很高哦 推荐｡"),
("2017-08-24", "17829178", "Cindy", "Hi"),
("2017-08-27", "17829178", "Lané", "I highly recommend this studio apartment  because of its prime location and lovely neighbourhood. We enjoyed every moment of Sydney and to top it off  we had a great place to stay. Elise was very fast to reply and accomodating. Thanks!"),
("2017-09-30", "17829178", "Zax", "Perfect place for group tour. Very clean and tidy studio. Nice owner respond fast."),
("2017-10-01", "17829178", "Jessica", "Great space"),
("2017-10-06", "17829178", "Sandra", "The host canceled this reservation 85 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-10-08", "17829178", "Angela", "Great location  close to cool old pubs and bars and you can walk to Darling harbour  etc. Nice and new and clean inside  perhaps a bit dark though. Comfy bed  we slept well. Not much privacy when you open the door/ window for fresh air as you are right on the street  people can see straight in.You are told to take all your rubbish with you on departure  which is a little inconvenient."),
("2017-10-10", "17829178", "Nadia", "Absolutely love this place ! Highly recommended"),
("2017-11-02", "17829178", "Jeffrey", "Okey. Average. Standard"),
("2017-11-21", "17829178", "Hong", "Everything is well prepared  comfortable beds  functional kitchen  tiny bathroom  air-conditioner and TV provided. Just a little noisy when cars pass. Checking in is easy. Good location for walking to fish market and Chinatown."),
("2017-11-22", "17829178", "Yinhua", "good"),
("2017-12-10", "17829178", "Samuel", "Very well located and in a nice neighborhood. The apartment is comfortable  although it has its quirks."),
("2017-12-17", "17829178", "Maria", "We enjoyed our stay :) the airbnb was very spacious and beds were comfy with plenty of amenities. It is a close walk to Broadway shopping centre. Host responds very fast to messages. Very good value for money."),
("2017-12-19", "17829178", "Leonard", "Nice quiet location and clean apartment."),
("2018-01-09", "17829178", "Nick", "Brilliant place  very good host."),
("2018-01-13", "17829178", "Glenn", "Funky place within 15 minutes walk to the city.  Has everything needed for your stay.Only real downside was local parking was a bit painful"),
("2018-01-17", "17829178", "Stella", "Great stay  handy spot! Nice space and everything you need. Super close to bus stops and restaurants/cafes."),
("2018-01-24", "17829178", "Justine", "We really love this department in Glebe. Quite and convenient. Elise is very helpful and quick to response. 6-min walk to bus station  10-min walk to fish market  15-min to Coles supermarket (Broadway Sydney)  20-min walk to Darling Habour. Airport transfer by Uber is around $45-50."),
("2018-01-27", "17829178", "Sarah", "Spacious  value for money. Beautiful area. If you're looking for somewhere modern  beautiful and well maintained  then I highly recommend. Exactly what we were looking for."),
("2018-02-07", "17829178", "Amity", "房东姑娘回复很快 性格很好｡房子空间设计很合理 周围很安静 走路去海鲜市场和悉尼大学都挺方便的｡"),
("2018-02-10", "17829178", "Sam", "Cool place and awesome location  will use again and would recommend to others."),
("2018-02-13", "17829178", "Hayley", "Sweet little place  good location  within walking distance to great bars  coffee and restaurants. Definitely recommend!!!"),
("2018-02-14", "17829178", "George", "A nice and cosy place  well located near the Main Street of Glebe with a short walk to great restaurants and shops. Upon arrival  the place was clean  and we felt very welcomed and safe. The bed was super comfortable and cosy  with a bedroom television and some good DVDs supplied. There was an aircon above the bed which kept the place cool the whole time. There was also a lot of closet space. Overall a great spot  would definitely stay again!!!"),
("2018-02-28", "17829178", "Michelle", "Elise’s apartment was central and spacious and in combination with her prompt response  my family’s time in Sydney was wonderful. There was a slight hiccup with the cleaning when first checking in but Elise arranged for cleaning staff to come immediately and that matter was rectified. Would highly recommend her place!"),
("2018-03-04", "17829178", "Dan", "A fantastic apartment that was exactly as described. Great amenities. We had no issues during our 3 day stay."),
("2018-03-08", "17829178", "Fan", "地理位置非常好 可以走路去中国城吃饭 也可以走路去歌剧院区域(大约3公里)｡从机场出来如果超过2人可以直接打车到这个小房子 澳币40-50刀｡因为房子是木质结构且有点年头了 隔音真的不算太好 楼上邻居的每个脚步都可以听到更不用说他邀请朋友以及放歌唱歌｡房子临街在一条还算车多的主道旁边｡Elisa回应问题非常迅速 是个蛮好的房东｡"),
("2018-03-09", "17829178", "Nick", "Elise was prompt with communication and the apartment was as described and spotless! The location is super convenient. The street it’s on is pretty busy  but that was easily accounted for with earplugs!"),
("2018-03-11", "17829178", "Soojin", "Really nice place and location!"),
("2018-03-14", "17829178", "Jeremy", "Good location  room  and good communication."),
("2018-03-16", "17829178", "Arminda", "Elise is a very profesional person who provide all information for a great stay at Glebe.The place is small  modern and cozy apartment with excellent location  also you can always find a free car park for two hours on the street.I highly recommend it.Thanks Elise for your lovely hospitality.Kind regards Arminda"),
("2018-03-17", "17829178", "Tegan", "Great location. Glebe is lovely."),
("2018-03-26", "17829178", "Steve", "Very nice. Comfortable. Close to the light rail."),
("2018-03-28", "17829178", "Amy", "Great accommodation that is 5mins drive from the city. Perfectly clean  stylish and comfortable. Would definitely recommend and would love to stay again!"),
("2018-04-02", "17829178", "子怡", "Such a nice experience! The house is clean and the beds are comfortable. Good location if you enjoy a small walk to the city and darling harbor (not super close). It is close to China Town and Fish market as well. Elisa is a great host. Very professional and always available."),
("2018-04-03", "17829178", "梓", "This place is super modern and has a great bathroom. And the location is great as well!"),
("2018-04-06", "17829178", "Alan", "Lovely place. Very cool space. Everything you need to be comfortable. Very handy location for eating  shops and transport"),
("2018-04-09", "17829178", "Irina", "Very easy to communicate  a good location  all amenities  fully equipped kitchen. It might be a bit noisy but it is a good place overall."),
("2018-04-27", "17829178", "Mathew", "This is a great place to stay. Very clean and tidy and in a good location I would defiantly stay here again."),
("2018-05-11", "17829178", "Sallie", "This place had so much potential but sadly didn’t quite deliver. It is certainly a trendy apartment but the place was incredibly noisy  both from the street & the upstairs tenants. The bed was the most uncomfortable bed I’ve ever slept in & really is ready for the tip as it has lost all springs through the middle section. I was disappointed that there was not even coffee or tea supplied & the bathroom soaks through after 1 shower (the bath mat easily become saturated). I was also disappointed that you had to pay up to an extra $75 to have the spare bed made up when requiring 2 beds for 2 guest  so we just bunked in together.On a positive  after requesting an iron she did eventually deliver  unfortunately it was on our last day of our stay."),
("2018-05-24", "17829178", "Jing", "Very convenient checkin and friendly host. Tsk for response my question in late night. Great location. Really clean place. Very suitable for 3-4pp stay for days."),
("2018-05-29", "17829178", "Manuela", "My two roommates and I were lucky to find a 5 night rental upon our arrival in Sydney. What initially started as a bad experience because of the overwhelming cigarette smell was improved when our host Elise came to freshen up the place that same night. Overall  an okay experience until the last day when it ended up being awful because of Elise’s passive aggressive and rude attitude. We asked Elise if we could leave our luggage after we checked out because we were gonna be in town all day and didn’t want to keep our luggages with us. In my messages I repeated multiple times that I would pick up my luggage in the evening. Elise agreed and in my thank you message I said we would swing by at night  she said have a good evening. Her instructions included washing the dishes and taking out the trash (which to my fault I didn’t see but we only left two dishes and left the trash in the basket). She stated we should be out by 10  we left the Airbnb at 9 and left our bags packed. I received an incredibly passive aggressive call at 3 asking why we hadn’t picked up the luggages and saying the place looked like a pig-stye (actual wording she used). The message had never stated a time to pick up the luggage and I had said evening/night at least three times in my request. She was extremely passive aggressive and disrespectful on the call. She asked when we would pick up the luggage because she had a dinner party that she would have to leave early from if we came in the evening. After stating that it would be incredibly inconvenient for her to leave her dinner party early multiple times  she then said she would have to charge us for keeping our luggage there. I firmly disagreed because it was not something she had mentioned before or something we had agreed to. I simply stated that if she had wanted to charge a fee she should’ve stated that before. She then began to ask if we were gonna leave a bad review  which genuinely came out of nowhere. I said no and she said that if we were gonna leave a bad review we were to come and pick up our bags immediately  but if we were gonna leave a good review we should chill where we were and we could come at night to pick up our bags. I thought this caveat was unprofessional  especially considering no time was set for us earlier. We were unhappy with this caveat so we said we would come pick up our bags immediately. She said that meant we were gonna leave a bad review and so she was gonna leave the Airbnb because she felt “threatened” (actual words again). The phone call was an awful 9 minutes that I would never repeat again. The phone call sourly ended with Elise saying she couldn’t wait..."),
("2018-05-30", "17829178", "Bohan", "Great place! Would be even better if there’s more lighting in the living room"),
("2018-06-03", "17829178", "Ben", "Fantastic location  easy to get to the city. The unit is clean  well furnished and perfect for a long weekend couples stay in Sydney"),
("2018-06-19", "17829178", "Madeline", "very good location! would recommend"),
("2018-07-01", "17829178", "Sue Anne", "Elise is quick to respond to inquiries and the place and its amenities meet our needs."),
("2018-07-08", "17829178", "Michael", "Elise's place is in a fantastic neighborhood and just a short and easy walk to public transit to the center of town. There are lots of cool bars and restaurants in the immediate area. The only real down side is that if guests are not used to city noise  they might find it a bit loud.  (I also live in a city  and didn't find it problematic at all.) I recommend this for a couple or a single guest who wants a cool Urban neighborhood close to the center"),
("2018-07-13", "17829178", "Beth And Ryan", "What a cleverly designed apartment! They've made such great use of the space  everything you could possibly need is ticked into clever cupboards - it's as if Tony Stark designed a studio apartment. Great location a few blocks from all the fun of Glebe's main drag  and we walked into the city most days. Great value  easy check in  would 100% stay here again. "),
("2018-07-19", "17829178", "Hayley", "Elise has a lovely place to stay.  Great communication and great location.  Lovely and clean."),
("2018-07-23", "17829178", "Aden", "Nice apartment obviously purpose built for Airbnb.  Looks good and is clean but it’s insulated with paper.  You can hear conversations  every footstep from above and road noise.  The neighbours above were up late which meant didn’t sleep until they stopped moving..."),
("2018-09-24", "17829178", "Seb", "Great place in a good location. Host very helpful. Would stay again!"),
("2018-10-18", "17829178", "Boyang", "It’s a nice place. Everything is good."),
("2018-10-21", "17829178", "Vickie", "Great location  easy to find  nice neighborhood  self check in super convenient and efficient  place is clean and nicely decorated with everything you need  except coffee. Walls are thin so you can hear people talk or walk by but not a big issue for me as at night when you sleep it is quiet. What bothers me is the second night it was very windy after the thunderstorm  something kept banging  on the window periodically and woke me up at 5am. Unsure how often it gets windy or is it just me who’s unlucky."),
("2018-10-23", "17829178", "Riaz", "Clean Convenient and Central"),
("2018-10-24", "17829178", "Sophie", "A great space in the inner city at a reasonable price. Highly recommend."),
("2018-11-10", "17829178", "Claudia", "Elise’s place is great! Easily accessible by public transport  with plenty of room  natural light and comfy beds."),
("2018-11-20", "17829178", "新伊", "整套房间设计的简直太棒了!洗漱用品和厨房用品非常齐全.太喜欢了"),
("2018-11-26", "17829178", "Vivian", "Great stay  close to many shops. Clean and as expected."),
("2018-11-28", "17829178", "Marcus", "Great location  close to cbd. The whole process was easy and hassle free. Had a great stay. Thanks again Elise."),
("2018-11-28", "17829178", "Katie", "Elise’s apartment is lovely  clean and as pictured. It’s a great space to stay and the location is handy. The bathroom was nice however the water in the shower could have been hotter. The bed is really comfy. Check in is super easy with the code lock however you need to make sure you close the door properly otherwise this creates a security issue. There was a mix up with our bag drop prior to check in which was disappointing and inconvenient. Elise is a good communicator."),
("2018-12-09", "17829178", "Henry", "Glebe was a quaint artsy neighbourhood. Place was easy to locate. Great design  cosy and clean place with lovely amenities well provided. However  bed mattress lacks spring support. Surrounding road and residents' noises were heard clearly due to the hollow walls."),
("2018-12-20", "17829178", "Joanna", "Good location in nice area. Quite noisy upstairs neighbours though (you might need ear plugs). Nice studio apartment. Responsive host."),
("2019-01-01", "17829178", "Emily", "Elise’s home is very close to the cutest eateries and not far from the main city at all. Couldn’t have chosen a better place to stay for New Years!"),
("2019-01-04", "17829178", "Kevin", "This apartment was a good choice for the provided amenities and convenient location. The walking distance to shops and cafes in Glebe was awesome for a visitor from out of town.The fact that this apartment is on the first floor made air movement and noise in the evenings a little bit of an issue  but for the value that is just something to consider.Overall this was a good experience!"),
("2019-01-17", "17829178", "Yin", "This is an amazing modern creatively designed studio! We absolutely loved the interiors and thought put into making this space work. All the small bonus touches really made it feel like an hotel experience. The location is close enough to shops and cafes yet is still nestled amongst a quiet residential area.  Elise was great to deal with during the entire process  and communication was prompt friendly and honest. Would definitely stay again if we're in the area.  This is an absolute gem of a place if you're looking for a creative and stylish home at an affordable price point compared to your standard boxed apartment!"),
("2019-01-20", "17829178", "Erika", "Great apartment in the city; we loved the location. The space was clean  and neatly furnished. Parking was better than anticipated as we found a parking spot close by each time. Elise was very friendly and helpful."),
("2019-01-24", "17829178", "Debbie", "Elise was quick to reply and helpful with any questions we had! Beautiful and clean place  short walk to shops and take away places. Very kid friendly and fitted all our needs as a family of 5 :)"),
("2019-01-28", "17829178", "Petra", "Great!"),
("2019-02-04", "17829178", "Bashari", "Great place & good hospitality"),
("2019-02-06", "17829178", "Natasha", "Great apartment! It was large  spacious  well equipped  and clean. Check-in and check-out was very easy/quick!"),
("2019-02-09", "17829178", "致杰", "pretty good"),
("2019-02-14", "17829178", "俊维", "地理位置十分好 旺中带静很有历史感 房东准备很充足 十分棒 下次来会再次入住"),
("2019-02-23", "17829178", "Kesiena", "Great location  clean  modern and fully equipped"),
("2019-02-24", "17829178", "Carolyn", "Elise responded very quickly and was a great host. The place was clean and provided all standard amenities. Walls must be thin as we could hear everything from the streets to next door neighbours. Other than that  convenient location and great accommodation. Would recommend. Thanks again Elise."),
("2017-04-21", "17915093", "Dominic", "Staying with Allen was very comfortable. Centurian park next to the corner  Bondi Junction 7 min walk with shopping mall and plenty of cafes.House was very clean and brand new. Large and modern kitchen with dining area (you can use it for laptop working as well). Room is small but tidy and contains everything you need.Allen was very kind and help whith everithing I ask him.Highly recommended as for people who arrived at first time to Sydney as for inveterate traveller."),
("2017-06-01", "17915093", "Vera", "The flat was very clean and I appreciated the tea and breakfast materials Allen left for me. The bedroom was nice and clean and the bed was very comfortable  plus there was a heater as it was quite cold in Sydney! The flat is about a 12 minute walk from Bondi Junction  which is great for shopping and transport connections. It's a nice quiet home in a safe neighbourhood.Although comfortable for my stay  the room pictured isn't entirely accurate - there was natural light from the skylight but the window itself actually looks out onto a grey brick wall about 6 inches away - not the pretty view pictured. The flat has a well equipped kitchen and amenities you'd need for a leisure or business stay (ironing  wifi  table)."),
("2017-06-09", "17915093", "Winston", "Super clean and close to the train station. Even though  Allen was overseas for the duration of the stay  there wasn't a single problem with check-in or communication. Highly recommend."),
("2017-10-07", "17915093", "Jane", "It is a very clean house. The other occupants are helpful. There are skylights in all the rooms which make the rooms light and bright"),
("2017-10-17", "17915093", "Robert", "A great location and a clean place to stay"),
("2017-10-22", "17915093", "Amy", "Clean. Has 2 housemates I was unaware of."),
("2017-11-17", "17915093", "Darren", "Awesome place. Definitely recommended."),
("2017-11-23", "17915093", "Arne", "The place is clean and the location is great. Unfortunately  Allen has an extremely disturbing flatmate. I felt so uncomfortable that I left the house two hours after arrival."),
("2017-12-01", "17915093", "Jo", "Allen’s place was very clean and quiet but easily accessible. Although the window in the room looks out on a wall  there is natural light in the bedroom from a skylight. No problems with the housemates and Allen gave me everything I needed to know"),
("2017-12-02", "17915093", "Hennes", "The host canceled this reservation 27 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-12-29", "17915093", "Claire", "Great house and great host!"),
("2018-01-09", "17915093", "Gemma", "I recently travelled to Sydney for work and enjoyed a pleasant stay at Allen’s."),
("2018-01-29", "17915093", "Wlff", ""),
("2018-02-17", "17915093", "Sarah", "The place is clean and in a good location for seeing both the city and Bondi Beach. Allen’s housemates are very nice and very helpful  giving lots of useful advice. There was confusion about check-in  however. I asked for an early check in but when I arrived  I wasn’t able to get in. Took about 20 mins of knocking and calling one of the other tenants before I was able to get in (luckily I was with a friend who had a phone!). The guest wasn’t supposed to be checking out until that afternoon  so the host had got the dates mixed up. Was resolved in the end but an inconvenient start to the stay. Otherwise  this is a great place to stay and I would recommend it to others."),
("2018-03-28", "17915093", "Romy", "Allen's home was clean and our room was spacious. It's not too far from the beaches ans parks. We enjoyed our stay there and definitely recommend it!"),
("2018-05-05", "17915093", "Dianna", "The room was very comfortable and the house was super cozy and clean. Allen always shared recommendations for Sydney and was a very nice host! I would definitely stay here again the next time I visit Sydney :)"),
("2018-06-08", "17915093", "Eddy", "Nice place  near to Bondi Junction station. Nice house/bedroom. Worth it! "),
("2018-06-21", "17915093", "Alexandre", "Allen's place is nice  a bit far from the train station but very close to the park. The room has a heater which is nice. The kitchen and bathroom are ok. "),
("2018-07-19", "17915093", "Alex", "great location and clean"),
("2018-08-10", "17915093", "Ania", "I had a great stay. Everything was good  friendly atmosphere and nice location. Highly recommended! "),
("2018-08-20", "17915093", "Angela", "It was nice  you have everything very close to the home  librery   the cheapest supermarkts  shops and the communication with the beach."),
("2018-09-03", "17915093", "Julia", "It’s a lovely place to stay in a perfect located environment. Allen is a really sympathetic and friendly host as well!"),
("2018-11-04", "17915093", "Viktoria", "Thanks Allen for the stay! That was really nice from the host that he provided a lot info in advance and local hints as well. Breakfast is not provided  just some cereals and milk (and leftovers from previous guests) and the room is really tiny  already full with the host’s stuffs. Hard to find place for your own baggage. The location is okay  few minutes walk from stations  beach is cca 20 minutes by bus."),
("2018-12-28", "17915093", "Linda", "Allen is a perfect host. Really enjoyed my stay there."),
("2019-01-01", "17915093", "Arika", "Very quite area but close to public transport and easy to get beach also the city.  Allen response very quick and organized very well. I recommended this place!"),
("2017-05-26", "17967409", "Tom", "Helen & Mike are the perfect host. Their home is beautiful  their company fantastic and the overall service is the best I have received in Australia outside of a hotel setting. I honestly can not recommend them higher  they really are great people! Thanks so much  Tom. "),
("2017-11-28", "17967409", "Shaun", "What an absolute pleasure it has been staying with Helen and her husband (Mike). Helen and Mike had gone above and beyond to ensure I was both comfortable and felt at home. You could not ask for better hosts! My room and bed were comfortable and all other needs were met. Anyone looking to stay in and around the Hills District look no further! 5*****"),
("2017-12-16", "17967409", "Kevin", "Helen and Mike are very nice and hospitable and I enjoyed the clean and quite room during my trip. Thank you very much. Hope to be your guest again next time when I am back to Sydney :)"),
("2018-02-10", "17967409", "Yinika", "Helen and Mike were great hosts  very friendly  kind and relaxed. I was in the area for some archaeology work  and would often come back to the spotless house covered in dust and mud  but they never complained. The house is in a quiet location but only a short drive to the supermarkets."),
("2018-07-19", "17967409", "Cecilia", "Would definitely stay again :)"),
("2019-02-09", "17967409", "Joanne", "This was a lovely place to stay with very welcoming people. They were willing to help with info about the locality and anything else necessary.  The accomodation was pleasant and airy even on hot days.  It was beautifully kept. I would not hesitate about booking here again."),
("2017-04-16", "18047246", "Sebastian", "This modern and clean house is located close to the Blue Mountains and an ideal place to stay for a one day trip. Well-equipped kitchen and big TV."),
("2017-04-23", "18047246", "Olivia", "There is not much to do around Jordan Springs  there are a few restaurants and a supermarket in walking distance so for one night all right. Van was a great host.. friendly and helpful "),
("2017-09-17", "18047246", "Nils", "A very nice place and room. Ven is a nice person and I had a great night :)"),
("2017-10-13", "18047246", "Gabriela", "Ven's place was good for our purpose."),
("2017-10-21", "18047246", "Elisabeth", "Very clean house  quiet and nice people"),
("2017-11-02", "18047246", "Heide", "My daughter stayed at Ven’s for a week while on Uni placement. She loved it. It was clean  comfortable and walkable to the shops. A great place to stay."),
("2017-11-10", "18047246", "Norhidayah", "Ven were very kind we enjoy stayed there the house very clean and comfortable with a complete kitchen tools thanks Ven"),
("2017-11-16", "18047246", "Mark", "Ven is a friendly guy with a modern tidy house - it suited my needs. Would recommend."),
("2017-11-25", "18047246", "Michal", "Ven's place is nice and clean. Ven is very welcoming host. Property is in quiet area in walking distance to supermarket and restaurants. I definitely recommend!!!"),
("2017-12-01", "18047246", "Keith", "Ven was very nice and friendly."),
("2017-12-14", "18047246", "Weelin", "Ven was very welcoming. The place was quiet and clean with all the amenities required. Very convenient for Nepean hospital and an easy walk to the shops."),
("2017-12-31", "18047246", "Ana Sofia", "Ven was really nice  very helpful and very respectful to our privacy."),
("2018-01-09", "18047246", "Gabriela", "We enjoyed our 5 night stay at Ven's very much.  He is a very friendly  easy going man and we would definetely stay with him again. Easy check in even though Ven was at work and our room had everything that was needed. We appreciated having the spacious bathroom and separate toilet for our use only.   Thank you very very much for your hospitality Ven. :-))"),
("2018-02-03", "18047246", "David", "Clean and airy accommodation   warm and friendly and helpful  host"),
("2018-03-10", "18047246", "Michal", "Great place and amazing hospitality.We did enjoy four weeks of stay at Van’s place."),
("2018-03-12", "18047246", "Michael", "Couldn't get a better deal! Well worth a try. (We got the spider man bed linen!)"),
("2018-03-26", "18047246", "Domenico", "Absolutely recommended"),
("2018-04-14", "18047246", "Allysa", "Ven's place is really nice and so clean. Will recommend it to my friends."),
("2018-04-28", "18047246", "Pauline", "Ven accepted our request 2 hours before our arrival. The room was very nice and clean and so was the bathroom which we had for ourselves."),
("2018-05-11", "18047246", "軒右", "The host is very nice and friendly  the place is close to the shopping mall. We have good staying experience here."),
("2018-05-27", "18047246", "Yang", "The room is tidy and clean  with separate toilet and bathroom. It’s a good place to stay for a couple or a single person.  Ven is a very nice person. We had a little difficult to find the house when checked-in  because the street number is not included in the address. We had to call Ven to get exact address.  The bedroom door has a screaming sound when opening and closing  so it was embarrassing when we would like to use the door at early morning or at night.  It would be better if it’s been fixed.Overall  it’s a comfortable place to stay."),
("2018-06-18", "18047246", "Marisa", "Ven was a really nice host. He was always very kind and welcoming.we had a very great stay at his house.everything you'll need was in there and we we're welcome to use It. Highly recommend his place we would definetely come again!"),
("2018-10-05", "18047246", "Franziska", "Ven ist ein sehr netter Gastgeber und stellt euch alles zur Verfügung was man benötigt. Das Zimmer und Bad war super sauber und es gab nichts auszusetzen.  Das Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis ist nicht zu toppen. Wir würden sofort wieder kommen."),
("2018-10-14", "18047246", "Sam", "Ven is a lovely host  the room is nice and modern and we really appreciated having our own bathroom."),
("2018-10-24", "18047246", "Ross", "Clean home that is directly across from a park. Ven was very accommodating. Close to the mountains and easy enough to catch a train to the city."),
("2019-01-13", "18047246", "Émilien", "Really good place   a wonderfull welcome . I recommend"),
("2019-02-20", "18047246", "Sneha", "Good place. Easy access to shops."),
("2019-02-23", "18047246", "Aldo", "excellent accommodation  comfortable and very cozy"),
("2019-02-26", "18047246", "Shanae", "A very new and comfortable house with everything you need. Ven is friendly and helpful."),
("2017-04-06", "17944310", "Micky", "Excellent communications with Mona  however we didn't need much as everything in the accomodation was provided and perfect"),
("2017-05-06", "17944310", "David", "I can highly recommend this property. Great location. Very clean. The host Mona was awesome  very helpful and great communication. Thank you"),
("2017-05-14", "17944310", "Danilo", "Very friendly hosts."),
("2017-05-17", "17944310", "Matt", "Great stay  very easy to organise with and talk to.I would highly recommend the flat for anyone wanting a private homely feeling!"),
("2017-05-26", "17944310", "Porcha", "We had a comfortable stay at Ali's place! The place was equipped with all that we needed for our stay."),
("2017-06-01", "17944310", "Rhonda", "The Host was very accommodating  the property was spacious for the 3 of us  and close to all that we needed on this visit.  We would certainly recommend this  accommodation all who are looking for a stay in Sydney.. "),
("2017-06-10", "17944310", "Coral", "We found Ali's place to be very comfortable and clean and would recommend to anyone wanting to stay in a nice place. Ali was very friendly and welcoming.Thank-you AliCoral"),
("2017-06-11", "17944310", "Manohar", "Our host  Ali was very friendly  kind and easy to communicate with. The flat was beautiful  tidy and very well equipped to have a comfortable  stay. Off street parking was a plus. I would highly recommend this property to anyone for their stay in Sydney. We will certainly try to book this property again on our next visit to Sydney. Thanks heaps :)"),
("2017-06-17", "17944310", "Sindhu", "The granny flat was modern and clean as depicted in the photographs. Ali was also super friendly and available at all times for us to contact him. Would definitely love to stay here again!"),
("2017-06-28", "17944310", "Annie", "Beautiful apartment and Ali was more than accommodating. Very cosy."),
("2017-07-04", "17944310", "Joseph", "Great place to stay in and well connected to public transport. Excellent hosts"),
("2017-07-12", "17944310", "Lori", "This is a great place to stay in a beautiful home.  It was a great location for us as we were wanting to be close to Hillsong Church and it was not more than a 5 minute drive.  Communication was great with the Ali as he was very helpful when we had questions!"),
("2017-07-14", "17944310", "Tara", "Excellent accommodation.  The host was always quick with replies.  Highly recommend."),
("2017-07-17", "17944310", "Matthew", "Ali is very friendly  the place is clean and tidy. Is a wonderful place and great value! "),
("2017-08-18", "17944310", "Jean-Pierre", "I can definitely recommend Ali's place. Beautiful granny flat with all the essentials needed to get by. It is great that there is Netflix and internet included as well as it helps a great deal with entertaining kids now and then when needed. The location is also great with easy access to and from the suburb. We really enjoyed our time here."),
("2017-08-20", "17944310", "Carmen", "This place was perfect for us. Quite and easy location."),
("2017-08-23", "17944310", "Yvonne", "Ali's place is stunning  beautifully appointed and clean. I am a returning guest  and extremely appreciative of Ali and his family to be so respectful of my privacy  but immediately and happily available when help is required. Such a great place to stay."),
("2017-08-25", "17944310", "Pene", "I am now making Ali's place my regular second home!  always clean  tidy and Ali is so accommodating it makes it a pleasure to stay there especially after my long days at work.  thanks Ali :)"),
("2017-08-26", "17944310", "Lloyd & Sonia", "Ali's place is clean and modern. It's in a quiet location and was close to the suburbs we were visiting. Ali was very available and responsive. We would definitely stay here again."),
("2017-08-31", "17944310", "Yvonne", "Ali is a fabulous host  always willing to assist when needed. All his places are stylish  clean and comfortable. It's an I deal place for me to come home to when away from home whilst in Sydney for work."),
("2017-09-04", "17944310", "Jan Willem", "Great place in a nice and quite neighborhood. We stayed just one night in Ali's place and for us it was a great stopover."),
("2017-09-10", "17944310", "Janice", "Clean  modern accommodation with off street parking.  Suitable for short stays."),
("2017-09-14", "17944310", "Pene", "I always stay with Ali when in Bella Vista. Beautiful clean accommodation. Always a pleasure"),
("2017-09-27", "17944310", "Andrew", "Awesome experience! Ali was a great host and the space was very nice. He was very accommodating and quick to respond to all questions we had. The apartment is in a great neighborhood and is very well equipped and comfortable"),
("2017-09-30", "17944310", "Jerry", "Lovely place  Ali was very responsive and the place was perfect"),
("2017-10-02", "17944310", "Glenn", "The unit is exactly as described - new  cozy  quiet  and clean.  Primary reason that we chose this place is the short distance to Hillsong Church and sure enough  we got there within a 10 minute drive.  Ali is a great host.  He responded to all of my questions quickly.  He was also very easy to deal with and provided an easy check in and check out process.  Will definitely look to book this place again next time we are in the area."),
("2017-10-07", "17944310", "Lisa", "Ali's place is easy to get to if travelling to Sydney and then great to access many parts of Sydney without huge traffic delays.  We enjoyed our stay in the excellent and very clean Granny Flat which catered to our needs nicely. Quiet suburb yet close to major shopping centre and motorways to get you where you want fast. Great value and would hesitate to book again. Lisa"),
("2017-10-15", "17944310", "Simon", "Nice place although the building could do with some finishing. Overall we were happy with our stay."),
("2017-10-18", "17944310", "Jarryd", "Nice place"),
("2017-10-26", "17944310", "Paul", "Super friendly and convenient and comfortable apartment with all the mod cons. Will definitely keep in mind for my next trip. Thanks Ali."),
("2017-10-28", "17944310", "Tiana", "The place is beautiful and Ali is a wonderful host - especially enjoyed the early Christmas tree touch :-) Thank you so much for having us!"),
("2017-11-12", "17944310", "Andrew", "Ali is a superhost. His place is very nice and would recommend it 100%."),
("2017-11-17", "17944310", "Julia", "Great flat  communication and location! Highly recommend a stay with Ali - super friendly and accommodating!"),
("2017-11-25", "17944310", "Kontraktor", "Very friendly owner......very new n nice place"),
("2017-12-03", "17944310", "May", "Maryam and Ali were very friendly and helpful hosts who responded very quickly to our requests.  The venue was very clean and comfortable. We'll definitely stay there again."),
("2017-12-07", "17944310", "Heather", "Loved it. Wonderful family who made our stay with kids easy. Very beautiful space as well!"),
("2017-12-09", "17944310", "Jamie-Lee", "Check-in was breezy  the house is so beautiful inside and out  very cosy and clean. Maryam & Ali are very friendly and welcoming. You have complete privacy. Check-out is easy. Overall  it was a very nice night and I will definitely stay here again in the future! :) "),
("2017-12-10", "17944310", "Andrew", "very nice place  ! Ali and Maryam are super hosts and i  highly recommend their place!"),
("2017-12-13", "17944310", "Samantha", "Good place to stay! Cosy and modern. I'd come back"),
("2017-12-13", "17944310", "Chris", "Great space  modern kitchen and bathroom  fast wifi. Everything as described  good communication."),
("2017-12-20", "17944310", "Peter", "Better to provide some breakfast"),
("2017-12-27", "17944310", "Katie", "Was a great space for us.Nicely laid out flat.Could have been cleaner but understand its was a busy time of year."),
("2018-01-02", "17944310", "Robyn", "This is a good location outside of the city. The neighbourhood is quiet and within walking distance of public transportation. The flat itself is the perfect size for a family of four. Amenities are a bit sparse for cooking in  but the place was clean and comfy. Host Ali is friendly and accommodating :-)"),
("2018-01-04", "17944310", "Peter", "We couldn’t stay there but communication was great"),
("2018-01-15", "17944310", "Ahmad", "Highly recommended  very clear and comfortable  hospitality is great  worth every penny"),
("2018-01-21", "17944310", "Ace", "Clean  neat and helpful. Thank you"),
("2018-01-28", "17944310", "Adam", "Bring a pedestal fan if its hot (or particlarly humid) as the aircon has a code protected minimum of 23 deg c  and make sure not to accidentally leave anything as you wont get it back."),
("2018-02-04", "17944310", "Jody", "Host are very accommodating to your needs it is clean and tidy it is a little small so would only recommend 4 people at most"),
("2018-02-09", "17944310", "Patrick", "I would have to say you will not be disappointed not one single complaint nothing but 100% comfort and cleanliness. Place is stylish and has everything you need and wonderful family thanks heaps"),
("2018-02-17", "17944310", "Ely", "Maryam and Ali are friendly hosts. Nice apartment and very clean. We really enjoyed our stay.Highly recommend!"),
("2018-02-22", "17944310", "Kylie", "Ali is a great host who responds promptly to all enquiries. The granny flat is a very convenient location to visit HSS and had everything we needed for our stay including a fast wifi connection."),
("2018-02-26", "17944310", "Margaret", "We will definitely stay here again. Modern   clean and in a great location. Thank  you Ali for being a great host."),
("2018-03-01", "17944310", "Sivateja", "Nice and clean family home  has all amenities that we needed. Had no issues whatsoever. Warm and kind hosts Maryam and Ali. Will definitely stay again if need be."),
("2018-03-11", "17944310", "Dwight", "This is a good place to stay  all amenities that we needed  very clean and modern with Ali being a great host  very helpful  to every queries. We stayed in his luxurious granny flat for 10 days. I would recommend his place."),
("2018-03-14", "17944310", "Cameron", "Great  cozy stay! Highly recommended"),
("2018-03-16", "17944310", "Vaughn", "Lovely little unit  feels homely  spacious and luxurious all at once. Very tidy and modern. I wish I could live there permanently!"),
("2018-03-17", "17944310", "Camilla", "Easy check in  ali was very helpful on arrival and friendly. Plenty of space and our own path to and from studio to the car. Shops wernt too far away either!"),
("2018-03-22", "17944310", "Gurudut", "Great Location. Very Clean and Ali is a very friendly host.."),
("2018-03-24", "17944310", "Janet", "Clean and modern home with wonderful communication. Thanks"),
("2018-03-28", "17944310", "Gurudut", "Great location . Clean accommodation  and great host"),
("2018-04-01", "17944310", "Peter", "A great hideaway in a quiet and quality area."),
("2018-04-09", "17944310", "Mahmoud", "A nice  modern apartment  great view of the beautiful Hills suburb. It suited our family of five perfectly and we enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-04-27", "17944310", "Vaughn", "Great place! This was my second stay there."),
("2018-04-28", "17944310", "Yasmin", "Great place  lovely hosts  10/10 would recommend"),
("2018-04-29", "17944310", "Leila", "My partner and I enjoyed a relaxing night at Ali’s place. Our host was very quick and easy to communicate with. We loved the place it was very clean  stylish and overall a nice quote neighbourhood. We made use of the Netflix and would definitely come back and stay here.Thanks so much for having us!"),
("2018-05-04", "17944310", "Phil", "Just an all-around great experience.  Ali was very quick to respond with every question I had from booking to departure.  Their place was beautiful  clean  great location and excellent value-I highly recommend!"),
("2018-05-05", "17944310", "Prachi", "Spacious place with good access. Friendly host  very good at communication."),
("2018-05-12", "17944310", "Mir", "Ali and Maryam. My wife and I can't thank you guys enough for the place. Your granny flat was beyond our expectations in many ways. It was very clean and the accessories in rooms  kitchen and bathroom were more than adequate. The furniture was very comfortable and everyone had a very warm and comfortable sleep. The price we paid was far less than what I would have been willing to pay. The layout of the granny flat was well thought through to guarantee full privacy. Definitely well recommended with no hesitation :) :)"),
("2018-05-13", "17944310", "Lidia", "Amazing place!"),
("2018-05-18", "17944310", "Varun", "Great property and quiet location."),
("2018-05-24", "17944310", "Esh", "Great place to stay in the suburbs. Very stylish place with lots of room for our family. Thank you Ali and Maryam for a pleasant stay."),
("2018-06-01", "17944310", "Greg", "Good  quiet  clean  neat excellent accommodation... great host...!!!"),
("2018-06-03", "17944310", "Min", "luxury stylish home to live in. Loved it!"),
("2018-06-04", "17944310", "Grant", "Great place to stay! Clean  modern  comfortable bed  Netflix included. Perfect stay. Thanks again!"),
("2018-06-10", "17944310", "Linda", "It’s a simple granny flat with home facility"),
("2018-06-11", "17944310", "Jess", "Open loungeroom / kitchen area with a nice balcony to sit and talk with friends! Very modern and has everything you will need for a comfortable stay! Very happy!"),
("2018-06-12", "17944310", "Amanda", "Brilliant place on a quiet street  everything we needed was there"),
("2018-06-22", "17944310", "Robyn", "This is a lovely place to stay  all the comforts of home and a very stylish well appointed accommodation.  "),
("2018-06-24", "17944310", "Nadia", "Great value for money. Great host."),
("2018-06-27", "17944310", "Maria", "very high quality fit out unit  loads of room to spread out  very quiet location  beds were comfortable  the property is elevated so the glorious morning sun revealed an lovely view through the huge windows  great place to enjoy a coffee and breakfast  very easy to get on and off the motorway  this is a very classy place"),
("2018-07-01", "17944310", "Haley", "Ali’s place is an incredible value and beautiful space! We stayed here on a Saturday night and went to Hillsong church the next morning. Ali was a wonderful host and even brought over some extra virgin olive oil  which was extremely helpful as we forgot our bottle at the hostel we were coming from. There are a few steps to climb with suitcases  but it was no problem for us. I can’t over emphasize how incredible the space is! Thank you for a wonderful stay!"),
("2018-07-02", "17944310", "Lin", "Ali and Maryam were very friendly and the house was amazingly clean and beautiful. Nice settings inside out and it has got everything we need. Would love to come back again. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-07-09", "17944310", "Louie", "Great location with warm host!"),
("2018-07-11", "17944310", "Tan", "Great neat and tidy place  modern and in a very good neighbourhood. Easy street parking ."),
("2018-07-19", "17944310", "Jill", "Beautiful  modern space. All the amenities we needed. Very nice balcony for sitting outside. "),
("2018-07-30", "17944310", "Mark", "Our 11 days stay was great  Ali was very helpful when messaged her questions about the area and bus routes. Was a perfect location for what we were doing Australia  Hillsong Church/College is a 10 minute bus ride! Thanks for everything  I’m sure we will stay again next year when we go visit our daughter at the college! "),
("2018-08-02", "17944310", "Catherine", "Ali’s place is in such a great place  super close to Norwest business park  supermarket and shops.So quiet at night  which was great. Everything you need to cook a meal and relax after a long day."),
("2018-08-02", "17944310", "Faye", "This is a beautiful 2 bedroom granny flat  really well presented  amazing view of the sunset.  Hosts were great communicators.  Everything was documented and really easy. Location perfect for castle hill  norwest or seven hills.  A steep driveway and a few steps to navigate but this was also made clear.  Thanks Ali and Maryam."),
("2018-08-04", "17944310", "Qiuye", "Ali is so nice and help me a lot."),
("2018-08-06", "17944310", "Rusty", "Great location  everything you need for a short stay. Very responsive hosts & great value for money!"),
("2018-08-08", "17944310", "Trish", "Great location  total privacy respected. Very clean  stylish apartment in a lovely quiet area. Thoroughly recommended. "),
("2018-08-23", "17944310", "Navid", "Perfect"),
("2018-08-25", "17944310", "Linda", "A lovely apartment - sparkling clean and everything there that we needed. Ali and Maryam were very responsive to our communications which made arrival  check-in and departure very easy. Highly recommend."),
("2018-08-28", "17944310", "Bill", "Stayed 1 night it was fine ."),
("2018-09-02", "17944310", "Kailah", "Really nice place that was easy to locate. Ali was very responsive and super helpful!"),
("2018-09-03", "17944310", "Jack", "Extremely quiet location that is very simple to reach and leave  even with heavy traffic.To enter the property  you need to walk up a short but steep driveway  walk down a very narrow side path barely wide enough for you and difficult if you have rolling luggage  then walk up a flight of stairs. not the place to stay if you have knee problems.Aside from takeaway chinese (3 min drive)  any other amenities are 10 mjnutes away so do your shopping first.  Don't rely on the host tea/coffee  there isn't any milk provided and it is all budget variety."),
("2018-09-06", "17944310", "James", "Nice  clean apartment.  Great communications and very easy check in and out.  Upscale  nice neighborhood.  Very quiet."),
("2018-09-09", "17944310", "Jye", "Very very comfortable place and great communication Highly recommend and great value for money"),
("2018-09-12", "17944310", "Craig", "Just as expected. Good stay"),
("2018-09-14", "17944310", "Hassan", "Nice place"),
("2018-09-22", "17944310", "Michelle", "The apartment was clean and as described.  There are a number of stairs up a narrow sideway to climb so is tricky with large suitcases  anyone with issues climbing or lifting would find it hard to access."),
("2018-09-24", "17944310", "Rizwan", "Stunning home in a great location"),
("2018-09-26", "17944310", "Daniel", "Thank you for hosting. The granny flat was spacious  clean  comfortable and well designed. Highly recommended and will visit again. Great value."),
("2018-09-26", "17944310", "Michael", "Ali is very friendly and helpful that we have wrongly trigger the Alarm and  he come immediately to help us to turn off the alarm.  He has  no complain for it at all.  The house has a nice view when you sitting on the sofa.   Hot water for bath is very important that let us relax after the long trip.  The environment is quiet and comfortable that enable us to sleep well after all."),
("2018-09-27", "17944310", "Wayne", "Stay here on a regular basis. Always a great stay."),
("2018-09-30", "17944310", "Daiyanti", "Really nice place to stay in and also very fast replies from Ali! Thank you for your help!"),
("2018-10-06", "17944310", "Danielle", "A lovey place and area"),
("2018-10-07", "17944310", "Trish", "Great neighbourhood. Stylish and expansive accommodation option that it close to nearby private hospital. Very clean and sophisticated accommodation. Would thoroughly recommend."),
("2018-10-15", "17944310", "Tristan", "comfy bed  Netflix  hosts easy to deal with. Will def stay again when in the area."),
("2018-10-22", "17944310", "Alanna", "Amazing place  very clean with nice views. Host were very helpfull"),
("2018-10-31", "17944310", "Annica", "Bra boende i ett mycket lugnt område."),
("2018-11-03", "17944310", "Bronwyn", "Excellent location  good value for money. Will stay again."),
("2018-11-06", "17944310", "Peter", "Mooi appartement  op prima locatie dicht bij de Blue Mountains. Netheid liet wel iets te wensen over"),
("2018-11-09", "17944310", "Emily", "Lovely place  perfect place to lay our head for the night with all that you need."),
("2018-11-12", "17944310", "Angela", "Very clean  modern in a lovely area. Loved every second in this air bnb. would 100% recommend  I know I will definitely be back here! Thank you very much"),
("2018-11-13", "17944310", "Rebecca", "Photos make the place look a lot bigger than what it actually is"),
("2018-11-17", "17944310", "Nathanael", "Lovely place. Recommended"),
("2018-11-17", "17944310", "Dana", "Very comfortable & clean place to stay with all necessities provided. Short distance to a couple of shopping venues  close to main roads for driving  yet in a quiet street! The house itself is just beautiful! Check in was made super easy with very clear instructions!We would not hesitate to stay here again!Thank you Ali ☺️"),
("2018-11-22", "17944310", "Josh", "This property was exactly as I expected. Simple with some nice touches and the price was perfect."),
("2018-11-22", "17944310", "Kerrie", "Good value."),
("2018-11-24", "17944310", "Janelle", "A fabulous place in a great location."),
("2018-11-26", "17944310", "Julie", "Pretty nice area to stay. Some improvements needed to verandah space to make it more homely. Great view and ample space."),
("2018-11-29", "17944310", "Tj", "Ali’s place is an amazing get away. Everything is clean and modern  and you’re provided with everything you’ll need  including and friendly and accommodating host! I’m very pleased with my stay here  and think i’ll come back."),
("2018-12-01", "17944310", "Beth", "Ali and Maryam were great communicators. thankyou for your excellent service."),
("2018-12-04", "17944310", "Kailah", "Conveniently located and private. Communication with Ali always exceeds expectations; excellent response rate. Great place for a quick getaway."),
("2018-12-06", "17944310", "Katherine", "Ali and Maryam have a hidden gem here in the Hills District. It is quiet but close to restaurants and businesses in the area. It is clean and modern and felt very luxurious for our midweek getaway. It has everything that you need. We had complete privacy as it has its own entrance. There was great communication with the owners as well. We will definitely be returning for another stay and can highly recommend this granny flat to others. Thank you so much Ali and Maryam for sharing your beautiful accommodation with us."),
("2018-12-08", "17944310", "Henry", "great flat  located in affluent neighbourhood"),
("2018-12-11", "17944310", "Melinda", "Really cool place  super easy  really stylish and close to grocery stores and what not.  Kitchen could’ve had a few more cooking appliances like pots or salad bowls.. tv remote had no batteries but that’s no biggie and walls are a smidge thin. The place itself is REALLY AWESOME though! Super sleek and loved my stay here!"),
("2018-12-15", "17944310", "David", "Great value and a great place to stay. I’ll definitely stay there when ever I’m in the area."),
("2018-12-15", "17944310", "Beth", "Beautifully styled and clean.The washer and dryer came in very handy.Beds and pillows are amazing!"),
("2018-12-19", "17944310", "Jeremy", "Good solid place.  Cheers Jeremy"),
("2018-12-20", "17944310", "Kelsey", "Very clean and modern space!  Comfy bed  nice porch. They were quick to respond to our request to book which was so very helpful. Thank you for a nice stay."),
("2018-12-21", "17944310", "Katiana", "Ali was a professional and respectful host who dealt with an issue (out of his control) we had very quickly and efficiently. He was a great host and I would recommend his lovely granny flat!"),
("2018-12-25", "17944310", "Donna", "Great location within 10 minutes walk of family in Bella Vista.  Ali was extremely helpful."),
("2018-12-28", "17944310", "Wong", "Ali’s place is a great place to stay at. It contains everything you need  clean  neat  spacious. I hope more will come and stay here in future."),
("2019-01-03", "17944310", "Kumiko", "good space location  Perfect place!!"),
("2019-01-04", "17944310", "Siddharth", "We found the place very clean and communication was very prompt for us to take quick decisions on the last moment."),
("2019-01-06", "17944310", "Domenico", "Nice place and communicationSuper clean and very well maintained Lovely hostThe apartment though it’s a bit smaller than expected and a bit overpriced for what it offers Overall good experience"),
("2019-01-10", "17944310", "Harrison", "A stunning apartment with everything that you could need and want. Spotless inside and out. Awesome hosts and very happy with the value!Thanks so much for hosting!"),
("2019-01-15", "17944310", "Penny", "Luxurious apartment with everything you need. Very comfortable"),
("2019-01-16", "17944310", "Justin", "Great space and would recommend"),
("2019-01-17", "17944310", "Caitlen", "Fantastic little spot"),
("2019-01-23", "17944310", "Pam", "highly recommended for anyone to stay"),
("2019-01-27", "17944310", "Aaron", "A little oasis in Sydney's West. For the cost  the space was incredible. Spotless. Easily accessible by car. Tonnes of off the street parking. Highly recommended."),
("2019-02-08", "17944310", "Sandra", "Ali’s place is exactly what you hope for in a residential area of Bella Vista."),
("2019-02-09", "17944310", "Winnie", "Amazing stay"),
("2019-02-14", "17944310", "Khalida", "Great place to stay specially if you want a quiet and serene location. Though a few stairs can hinder an easy access."),
("2019-02-15", "17944310", "Charlie", "Fantastic"),
("2019-02-16", "17944310", "Nikita", "Everything about Ali's place - from check in to check out was absolutely perfect! The flat itself is very nice  clean  and comfortable. The neighborhood is beautiful too and there are lots of malls  shops  restaurants etc within a short driving distance. Thank you Ali for a wonderful stay :)"),
("2019-02-24", "17944310", "Kieran", "lovely place to stay. stylish and comfy. will stay again."),
("2019-02-28", "17944310", "Scott", "Great location for work  close to a supermarket and M7/M2. Had all the nice amenities. Ali was quick to respond to any messages"),
("2017-04-18", "18083735", "Michael", "Greg is so helpful all through our stay. They are how the perfect hosts should be."),
("2017-04-29", "18083735", "Cynthia", "Fantastic experience at Greg's place! I highly recommendThanks"),
("2017-05-04", "18083735", "Michelle", "Very clean studio with beautiful view nice garden.good location.Greg was so nice and gave us many useful information.highly recommend!Greg的小屋给我们留下很深的印象｡小屋子距离chatswood 火车站很近｡附近还有快速公交 10多分钟到市中心｡房东很热情 提前跟我们确定到达时间｡小屋不大 但很干净｡花园很美 有个金鱼池 主人还有只可爱的猫 屋主非常热心 经常问询是否需要帮忙的 给了很多信息｡小屋性价比也不错｡推荐!"),
("2017-05-07", "18083735", "Bastian", "Very friendly host with a beautiful apartment surrounded by a nice garden and lovely neighborhood. Host even prepared a bottle of wine and some stuff to eat for us! He also has a nice cat! Thanks again!"),
("2017-06-18", "18083735", "Allison", "Warm  comfortable  great location and great communication from Greg and Maggie."),
("2017-06-23", "18083735", "Sharryn", "Very clean  homely  inviting and hosts are very welcoming and helpful"),
("2017-07-06", "18083735", "Beth", "Greg and Maggie's place was perfect for us. Greg was a very welcoming host. Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2017-07-08", "18083735", "Chandini", "It was a pleasure to stay in Greg's beautifully kept cabin. It overlooked a lovely garden and we enjoyed sitting in the little patio. We enjoyed the fruit and yoghurt and the home made marmalade and cereals mix. Wish the cat was less aloof!"),
("2017-09-20", "18083735", "Doron", "Greg & Maggie were friendly and helpful - even helping me take my bags from and to my car.There's secure off-street parking and the bungalow overlooks a pleasant garden. I appreciated the strawberries  yoghurt  loaf of sourdough bread and jams in the fridge. This place is close to the city and northern beaches - very convenient."),
("2017-09-24", "18083735", "Sarah", "We had a wonderful stay at Greg and Maggie's place. The studio is spacious and contains everything you need. Greg and Maggie are more than accommodating and always ready to offer some help or advice. Although it is a little far from the center  public transport is readily available."),
("2017-10-08", "18083735", "Rosemarie", "I enjoyed my stay at this place very much.  The studio was clean and my hosts couldn't have been more thoughtful.  The place is set in a lovely garden and when you enter the studio you will see that Greg and Maggie have thought of everything that you might need.  Millie the resident pussycat and the visiting  parrots and magpie were surprise bonuses!  I shall certainly recommend this studio to my friends who wish to visit Sydney."),
("2017-11-02", "18083735", "Amber", "What a wonderful place to stay. Our stay was over a week long and we thoroughly enjoyed every aspect. The location was in easy walking distance to everywhere we needed to go and close to public transport for everywhere else. The studio itself is lovely! Very clean and tidy and has everything you need. Greg and Maggie are wonderful hosts - extremely kind and helpful. We will definitely stay again if we are back in Sydney. Highly recommended! :) :) :)"),
("2017-11-12", "18083735", "Petrea", "Great quiet spot - walking distance to chatswood. Lovely little granny flat with everything you need. Clean and tidy. Friendly hosts."),
("2017-12-08", "18083735", "Kerrie", "Great self contained space accessed through a lovely garden. Greg and Maggie were very helpful hosts and provided information about surrounding area. We enjoyed the bush walk down to Middle Cove. The secure parking was also appreciated. We look forward to staying again."),
("2018-01-05", "18083735", "Stacey", "G&M's place has everything that you need  plus super clean  neat and tidy. Quick to reply  plus very clear instructions given.  Great place to stay!"),
("2018-04-25", "18083735", "Clair", "Greg & Maggie are amazing hosts who are very friendly and accommodating. Their place is just right for a couple. It also came with nice little touches like food in the pantry. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay with them."),
("2018-04-29", "18083735", "Maggie", "Cosy and great location   easy walk to some good restaurants. 10 minutes drive to Crows Nest which made getting to my work location convenient. Clean ! Great extras provided and very much appreciated after a long drive.Will be back highly recommend!Thanks Greg and Maggie for you quick responses and hospitality"),
("2018-05-03", "18083735", "Clair", "No regrets  nice  clean  quiet & reasonably priced and to top it up fantastic host"),
("2018-08-03", "18083735", "Rachel", "This is the perfect place to stay & explore the north areas of Sydney. Greg & Maggie were so kind and welcoming. The place was a beautifully cosy and perfect for my mid week getaway. A lovely outdoor seating area with a view gave it that country getaway feel. Great coffee machine & artworks throughout the place. Thanks for the wonderful stay :)"),
("2018-08-19", "18083735", "Richard", "Place is clean and location is quiet. All good."),
("2018-08-24", "18083735", "Brad", "Very quiet location in walking distance to Chatswood. I had a nice stay and looking forward to staying again sometime soon"),
("2018-08-26", "18083735", "Meg", "Greg and Maggie’s studio was great  couldn’t fault it :)"),
("2018-09-03", "18083735", "Shao Ju", "Cleaning  FriendlyFull equipmentLovely secret gardenCommunication"),
("2018-09-05", "18083735", "Ross", "Greg and Maggie were fantastic hosts.  The studio was presented exactly as the photos and was spotlessly clean with beautiful linen and towels.  The breakfast supplies were a  wonderful surprise and so thoughtful.  Perfect location to visit my daughter in Castlecrag private hospital."),
("2018-09-08", "18083735", "Billy", "Greg and Maggie are very caring and informative and the place is private  extremely well appointed  clean and comfortable. We’d go back in a heartbeat."),
("2018-09-24", "18083735", "Gerald", "Beautiful place  easily accessible. The breakfast supplies were a thoughtful and personal touch that contributed towards a really wonderful and relaxing stay. Definitely recommended!"),
("2018-10-30", "18083735", "Aiko", "Greg&Maggie are very friendly and fantastic hosts. The studio is located quiet residential area  very clean and tidy self- contained apartment. I would recommend this place  I really enjoyed my stay. Thank you"),
("2018-11-14", "18083735", "Kevin", "TOP 1 choice is you want to stay in Sydney no matter travel or work   you can have tranquil life in here with adorable cat and energetic frogs . Also you can meditate in imposing garden and grab a cup of coffee. Greg and Maggie can give you plentiful information about transportation."),
("2018-11-25", "18083735", "Christopher", "Greg and Maggie are great  they were super chill and their space was amazing. The studio was really clean and had everything I needed for the weekend. Will definitely stay again on my next trip to Sydney."),
("2018-11-27", "18083735", "Jacinta", "Greg & Maggie were the best hosts one could ask for. Their space was a home away from home peaceful  clean  comfortable and welcoming. Situated close to shops  public transport and just enough distance from the bustling city. We will be back for sure!"),
("2018-12-03", "18083735", "Lydia Evangelia", "We really enjoying staying at this cozy studio! Place was sparkling clean  had a fully equipped kitchen n toilet/bathroom  comfortable bed  fast internet etc! Greg and Maggie are excellent hosts  very discreet and gave us some great tips. Studio is close to everything  i would recommend it even if you have no vehicle. See you next time Greg and Maggie☺️"),
("2019-02-06", "18083735", "Michael", "Value for money - super location - will stay again - many thanks"),
("2019-03-04", "18083735", "Aya", "Greg and Maggie are very kind and welcoming host. I got the best Airbnb experience here. The place was very clean and there are everything I need and more. There are food and drink. Also I could enjoy Netflix. Checking out day  he drove me to bus stop so I didn’t need to walk with my suit case. And he helped me when I left my stuff at the place. They are very great host. I super recommend this place Thank you very much"),
("2017-06-10", "18130053", "Daniel", "Highly recommended apartment. It's spacious  clean  stylish and very easily accessible from the mascot subway and buses. Near the airport as well. Evan is also very prompt in responding so we really appreciated that. Thanks  we enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-07-02", "18130053", "Sharon", "Thanks Evan for a fantastic place to stay. Brand new  walking distance to train station  cafes and IGA. Only two train stops from Central. Couldn’t fault it"),
("2018-07-16", "18130053", "Nicholas", "Good place to stay for a good value"),
("2018-07-24", "18130053", "Tsai-Mei", "Evan's place is fabulous  the apartment is exactly same as pictures as prefect as clean. It's worth to choose Evan's place  my parents and I are love it. "),
("2018-08-10", "18130053", "Eoghan", "Execellent apartment in a great location  shops  trains etc all located within 5 minutes walk. Train only 8-10 minutes to city centre and all the main spots.Uber cheap to any beaches - bondi/coogee or even to cbd. Apartment was immaculate with everything you would need. Much better than any hotel.Any advice or help Evan had replied within minutes.Excellent stay  didn’t want to leave so got our own apartment across the road! "),
("2018-09-08", "18130053", "Stefanie", "Wonderful stay- would come back at any time & can totally refer to everybody. Thanks Evan for your all time quick responses & your local tips as well as your ongoing support. He is such a great host."),
("2018-09-17", "18130053", "Mike", "It was exactly as advertised. There was a small issue with the dryer not working but it sounded like it had just stopped working so no big deal. Overall it was a great deal."),
("2018-09-30", "18130053", "Dawn", "Thank you so much Evan  you were an excellent host  always helpful and quick to reply  your apartment is wonderful (facilities and location)!"),
("2018-10-05", "18130053", "Fang", "Very good location and equitment. I will recomend this apartment to my friends if they will travel to Sydney."),
("2018-10-12", "18130053", "Susan", "This is a great place to stay.  $15 Uber from airport recommended as a lot of road works happening but if no luggage Mascot is a 5 min walk. The apartment is very well appointed and if it hadn't rained so much the deck would have been brilliant. Easiest check in ever  very well appointed and Evan responded  immediately to any query. Highly recommended and I'm hard to please!"),
("2018-10-20", "18130053", "Madleen", "Amazing apartment with a nice view  great way to experience Sydney  Evan is really friendly and also really easy to communicate with  I can highly recommend the apartment to anyone who wants to visit Sydney"),
("2018-11-01", "18130053", "Judi", "Great location. Five minutes to train restaurants  and shopping"),
("2018-11-16", "18130053", "Syafidah", "Place was as per picture! Really awesome place to stay in  we wished we had the chance to stay longer! Surrounding area is still under some construction  but it wasn’t any major issue. Place is very accessible; only 5mins from the airport and cost between $15-$18 by Uber. There is also a petrol kiosk abt 2-3mins walk with a 24hr convenience store which was good if you need to get stuff urgently. Mascot train station is barely 5mins walk from the apartment and it takes you everywhere into the city which is abt 3 stops away. There are plenty of eateries outside the train station you can choose from  and there’s a Halal Thai eatery serving good food as well as a Kebab store and also an Indian cuisine place  to name a few  which was a plus for us considering we are Muslim. There’s also a big Woolsworth for you to shop across the station. Evan’s place is huge  very comfortable and very clean! Great to relax after a long day out on the huge and comfy sofa! Thank you Evan!"),
("2018-11-18", "18130053", "Denise", "Evans’s place is nice and clean andBeautiful!Has everything you need I stood there With my friend she had her space and I had mine two beds and two bathroom"),
("2018-11-22", "18130053", "Alvin", "The place is nice and clean with plenty of sun lights. And Evan was really helpful about check-in/out  he even offered a late check out for us  that was really sweet. Recommended to all!"),
("2018-11-25", "18130053", "Devina", "Evan’s is a great host. Easy to contact and has a clean apartment to stay."),
("2018-12-06", "18130053", "Ashley", "Very clean and spacious! Lots of amenities included. Evan is wonderful with communication! Great price! Definitely recommend this place!"),
("2018-12-09", "18130053", "Steven", "Beautiful apartment in a great location!"),
("2018-12-16", "18130053", "Bettina", "Die Wohnung von Evan war sehr großzügig  modern eingerichtet und geräumig. Sie lag einige Gehminuten von der Metro entfernt  die direkt in die Stadt fuhr. Zum Flughafen eine Station. In die Stadt - je nachdem  wo man aussteigen wollte - 2-4 Stationen. Alles in allem ist die Unterkunft von Evan empfehlenswert und die Kommunikation lief auch sehr gut. Er hat uns auch Eier und Mangos im Kühlschrank hinterlassen  an denen wir uns bedienen konnten. Die Wohnung an sich ist echt toll mit einer echt schönen Aussicht. Man kann auch sehr gut auf dem Balkon sitzen."),
("2018-12-30", "18130053", "MinJung", "The house was really nice and spacious. I liked the two storied house. Two bathrooms were clean and nice. The location was also very nice but little bit noisy at night"),
("2019-01-01", "18130053", "Oliver", "Stayed here over New Years and it was great. Close to public transport  shops and the airport. Also  the place feels modern and had everything we needed. Would recommend.Cheers  Oliver"),
("2019-01-07", "18130053", "Joseph", "u want value for money every thing is a 2 minute walk 5 too train station absolutely amazing place"),
("2019-01-14", "18130053", "Rebecca", "Everything was neat and tidy. I liked the airy style of the loft a lot. Close to the city  close to the airport  trainstation nearby. A lot of working process in this area  it is not silent there! Keep this in mind. But after all  it’s a great apartment and Evan is a perfect host. Would like to stay here again if I am ever been to Sydney again :)"),
("2019-01-23", "18130053", "Lary", "Great place that is accurately captured in the pictures. Ample room for a family with a good living room  kitchen  and two bathrooms. Everything was clean. Close to the train station and a supermarket as well. Evan's response time made the whole experience hassle-free."),
("2019-01-27", "18130053", "Pablo Juan", "The apartment is almost new. Everything works perfect. It is nice  confortable  and very well equipped. So the stay is very cozy. We really enjoyed the time there. It is close to the airport and to the Mascot train station so you are in very few minutes to the city and to the airport. It gives you plenty of freedom to move. In 10 minutes you are in Circular Quay or in less than an hour in Bondi Beach."),
("2019-02-01", "18130053", "Tom", "Really enjoyed our stay at Evans place. Clean and stylish  great location and close by to the station. Communication was fast and helpful. We'll definitely come back in the future!"),
("2019-02-02", "18130053", "Linda", "The host canceled this reservation 137 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2019-02-04", "18130053", "Elaine", "It is near the airport. only 10 mins to central city. nice and tidy place."),
("2017-09-17", "18149310", "Whitney", "Such a magical spot! My boyfriend and I booked a spontaneous weekend away to this little slice of paradise and were actually surprised and stoked that it totally exceeded our expectations. The view is stunning  the space is immaculately clean  very modern and minimalistic in design  yet has everything you need.. plenty of storage space for a longer stay  as well as kitchen appliances and beautiful stove. Comfy couch that converts into a double bed  TV with netflix  etc.. Our hosts were so friendly and accommodation  it actually felt sad to leave! We live just over the bridge  so we're happy we'll be able to make our stays at Ian's place a more regular thing!"),
("2017-10-07", "18149310", "Beby", "Ian and Dorota were a great host  we really enjoyed our stay  outstanding view in a nice peaceful area. We were made to feel very welcome  the room itself was very spacious and had everything you needed for a short stay. Would definitely comeback if we’re in the area. Thank you Ian and Dorota."),
("2018-04-09", "18149310", "Peggy", "The host canceled this reservation 255 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-04-28", "18149310", "Yvette", "A stylish peaceful studio  really enjoyed my stay. Thank you very much!"),
("2018-09-15", "18149310", "Rachael", "Clean  comfortable and chic space with gorgeous views. My boyfriend and I thoroughly enjoyed our stay. Thank you for having us."),
("2018-10-01", "18149310", "Mat", "Quality location and comfortable accommodation with everything we needed! Thanks"),
("2018-10-28", "18149310", "Liam", "Highly recommended..."),
("2019-02-24", "18149310", "Leanne", "It was a stylish comfortable room - Ian was wonderful to deal with"),
("2019-03-02", "18149310", "Hilary", "Great place well furnished with a lovely look out.  Ian was a wonderful host.  All the small and big details catered for.  The pictures don’t do this place justice!  Perfect for couples and weekend stays."),
("2017-04-10", "18082902", "Carmen", "This is a nice room i like this kitchen  if you like cooking is good  Very serious  enthusiastic Introduction  about his house  and i like the big windows of the house the house clean and comfortable  next time will come  thank you Cedric"),
("2017-04-15", "18082902", "Nuomi", "Really good location and the owner is really friendly."),
("2017-05-07", "18082902", "Jorge", "Great place  looks exactly like in the pictures and it's very close to Central Station and right across the street from University of Sydney. Quiet are and nice neighborhood with plenty of parks  coffees and restaurants. Cedric was always available  supportive and was flexible to accommodate to our check in time."),
("2017-05-16", "18082902", "Wendy", "My guest Nick said:My stay in Forest Lodge was all smooth sailing. The apartment was clean and had everything you needed. Cedric was quick to respond to messages and happy to help. It was easy walking distance to Suburbs like Chippendale  Glebe and Broadway. And the chocolate croissant from Goose Bakery down the street was worth writing about too. "),
("2017-05-27", "18082902", "Cari", "The aparment is well located  near the university but far from de downtown... howbut there is a good public transportation. I had a problem with wi-fi but Cedric could fix it quickly. Itis a good option in a quite place! "),
("2017-06-02", "18082902", "Nancy", "A very cosy place and Cedric was really helpful when we needed him. The place is perfect for 2 people and very clean. I will suggest this place for next time...."),
("2017-06-05", "18082902", "Jessica", "Cute apartment in a nice location. Cedric has really thought about everything you need for a short stay! Well styled and clean. Apple TV was great. Recommend heading down to see the Tramsheds in Harold Park."),
("2017-06-08", "18082902", "Layla", "Great price for the place. Good location  quick uber around. Really clean place  got all you need for a stay somewhere. Great communication with the host  but didn't bother us at all."),
("2017-06-09", "18082902", "Louise", "Cedric went above and beyond to make sure I had a great stay. He was amazing to communicate with and I felt very comfortable and at home from the moment I arrived. The place was clean  spacious and in a fantastic area I would definitely recommend this place. "),
("2017-07-08", "18082902", "Nicolas", "Small and cosy studio very well maintained and very convenient for people looking accommodation close to the University of Sydney. Well connected by public transportation. Small problem with WIFI the first day  but quickly and efficiently solved by Cedric."),
("2017-07-14", "18082902", "Elisabeth", "Nice studio  well located near public transport. Well equipped kitchen  with supermarkets are about 10 or 15 min walking distance.  "),
("2017-07-21", "18082902", "Craig", "Cedric was a great host. Easy to deal with. The accommodation was enjoyable as per expectation. Will book again when back in town."),
("2017-08-06", "18082902", "婷婷", "A very nice place! Quite close to Sydney uni! It's clean and comfortable! And there is even a book introducing the costal walks in Sydney!"),
("2017-08-21", "18082902", "Nancy", "The best place to enjoy Sydney and Cedric is really helpful."),
("2017-09-11", "18082902", "Ehsan", "Great hospitality and location"),
("2017-10-06", "18082902", "Yili", "Cedric's place is near the city  a very convenient location to all the attractions. This place is great for someone who would like to cook while they stay  having all the kitchen appliances that you need."),
("2017-10-16", "18082902", "Jonathon", "Cedric's apartment was spot on. It exceeded our expectations and was exactly what we needed. He was fantastic to deal with and we'll definitely be back.  Great part of town  close to lots of lovely places to eat and public transport was a breeze. The apartment was immaculate and very comfortable. Cedric thought of everything from easy check in and out  to all you need in the kitchen  bathroom and living area. The new Nespresso coffee machine  Apple TV and Wi-Fi all added to our stay being very enjoyable. Well done Cedric  you've got it right. I would recommend this apartment to anyone wishing to stay and explore everything Sydney's inner west and CBD has to offer."),
("2017-10-22", "18082902", "Jyh Yoong", "Perfect place for couple getaway in Sydney."),
("2017-11-06", "18082902", "Constanza", "Good place to stay in a good location. Cedric was very helpfull and answered back very quickly."),
("2017-11-08", "18082902", "Patrizia", "Great place. Very central to the inner west."),
("2017-11-27", "18082902", "Tristan", "Cedric was extremely friendly and easy to communicate with. He even checked in on me on the second day to make sure everything was ok. The apartment was clean and was stocked with all the basic household essentials to be able to drop my luggage and relax for a few hours before heading to the closet shopping centre  Broadway. Close to public transport and the city  i would recommend Cedric's apartment to any solo or couple coming into Sydney."),
("2017-12-03", "18082902", "Benedict", "It was great Cedric was responsive and the place is great"),
("2017-12-08", "18082902", "Muteb", "Good location"),
("2017-12-18", "18082902", "Emma", "Cedric' apartment was really relaxing. I felt safe and secure and loved the sunsets out of the big windows. It was a perfect little sanctuary to come home to in the evenings after study days.  There's a great little supermarket 10mins walk away on Missenden Rd which had everything I needed including a great healthy organic section. The bed was really comfortable. The wifi fast and the Netflix and coffee machine a bonus. Thanks Cedric."),
("2018-01-20", "18082902", "Bérengère", "Cedric has been a really good host. He always answered quickly if I had any questions. Really a good place to stay."),
("2018-01-28", "18082902", "Graham", "Tidy apartment close to University of Sydney and short distance from CBD"),
("2018-03-01", "18082902", "Roger", "This studio apartment is very practical. In the main space there's a bed  sofa  plus table and two chairs  and there's also a kitchen and bathroom. The kitchen is modern and well-designed  and is fully-supplied with equipment  utensils  crockery  cutlery  tea and coffee  spices  etc. The bathroom is unrenovated but the shower is hot with good pressure  and the space works well. The bed was comfortable.This top-floor apartment is not overlooked  and has a pleasant urban outlook. The location is supremely convenient to Uni of Sydney  and just far enough from Parramatta Road that noise is not a problem. There are frequent buses nearby  on several routes. Next time I won't bring a car. There are only a few on-site parking spaces  and when these are taken or reserved you may need to park some distance away if you need unrestricted parking."),
("2018-03-08", "18082902", "红", "还行吧｡网络不够稳定 前两天都没发上网｡浴室龙头漏水 有些影响休息 其他都还好｡"),
("2018-03-16", "18082902", "Glenda", "Enjoyed my stay - good neighbourhood and very walkable for groceries  coffee  laundry  and transit. Two fans kept the space cool enough and the bed was comfy. Great home base to explore the city. Easy self check-in and Alex was prompt to reply to any inquiries."),
("2018-03-17", "18082902", "Kristin", "Good spot for a stay just out of the hustle and bustle. Easy walk to Glebe Point Road  cafés  pubs and eateries close by. Bed was comfy and the fans did a good job of keeping us cool even though it was pretty hot weather. Definitely good value for Sydney!"),
("2018-04-01", "18082902", "Kenny", "不推薦現實和相片中介紹的不相符窗戶封滿塵屋內很焗 明顯很久沒有人執拾很多螞蟻電視接收很差淋浴間的浴簾有很多徽菌還有的資訊是房間的位置在建築物的頂樓建築物十分殘舊和荒蕪沒有電梯 大概要上三層"),
("2018-04-06", "18082902", "Daniel", "This is a fantastic place to stay  close to public transport  great walks close by  peaceful and very thoughtful touches made by the hosts. Would highly recommend this place to a solo traveller."),
("2018-04-13", "18082902", "Yisi", "Brock and Alex's place is very cute and super close to the Sydney University. We enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-06-18", "18082902", "Marion", "Les PLUS : Agréable studio  lumineux  pratique  bien desservi par les bus  lit très confortable  petite cuisine équipée.Les MOINS : Le bruit des voisins (aucune insonorisation)  la douche et le lavabo qui coulent et gouttent en continu  la TV qui ne fonctionne pas  aucun échange ou entrevue avec l'hôte."),
("2018-07-05", "18082902", "Laura", "This apartment is conveniently located near The University of Sydney  clean  and the bed is comfortable. However it is also a bit worse for wear - the tap and toilet run  the curtains don’t fit the windows  and ants came for my toothpaste! It was fine enough for me as I was out most of the time."),
("2018-07-18", "18082902", "Hieu", "The place is very convenient to travel around the city  and it has its own charm"),
("2018-07-21", "18082902", "Kellie", "Great location close to Sydney uni and bus stop into the city. Place was very cosy and hosts were easy to communicate with. Would recommend Brock’s house =)"),
("2018-09-08", "18082902", "Nathan", "I stayed at Brock's place for two weeks. It is a nice place with a lot of light  right next to the university and in a good neighbourhood. I really enjoyed my stay!"),
("2018-09-13", "18082902", "Amy", "Cute little place with everything you need for a short stay over.  Apple TV and all"),
("2018-09-16", "18082902", "Maree", "Great location   comfy bed  quiet and private."),
("2018-10-17", "18082902", "Joanna", "The studio is in a safe and quiet neighborhood. During my stay I commuted to the CBD via bus and uber. The bus stop is on the corner and is an easy ride into the city. There are cafes  pubs  and convenience shops very close and within a short walking distance. Great spot for the price!"),
("2018-10-27", "18082902", "Ché", "this place is exactly what it says on the label. simple studio in a good location for a fair price.  really comfy bed  usable kitchen (I've left you some ) easy check in and check out."),
("2018-11-08", "18082902", "Jared", "Great kitchen! Close to where I needed to be. Would stay again"),
("2018-11-17", "18082902", "건용", "Good view... It is exactly same on the picture. It is close to the Sydney University. In the room  there is the brochure to introduce Sydney trips  bites  etc and it is very helpful.There is a convenience store away from the house. But the broadway Sydney mall (about 10 min walk from the house) is good for shopping  food and souvenirs."),
("2018-11-22", "18082902", "Simine", "Good location  comfortable apartment."),
("2018-11-22", "18082902", "Michael", "Great spot  easy to find and check in  booking at almost no notice worked fine."),
("2018-12-07", "18082902", "Salvia", "Had a great stay and will definitely be back. Close to shops  markets and public transport. Very convenient."),
("2019-02-11", "18082902", "Vandana", "Good place to stay if you’re looking for one near the city."),
("2019-02-12", "18082902", "Hanne", "Quick and easy communication  had a good stay. :)"),
("2019-02-27", "18082902", "Geoff", "Great few days in Glebe at Brocks place!"),
("2019-03-04", "18082902", "Sherri", "This apartment is in a great location for bus transport to city. It’s sparkling clean  comfortable bed  lounge suite to sit & relax  kitchen amenities are great ... toaster  microwave  coffee maker  good sized fridge  oven & cooktop  dishwasher. A ‘welcome pack’ on arrival was a thoughtful touch! We stayed 5 nights  and we wouldn’t hesitate to stay there again."),
("2017-06-09", "18255921", "Beverly", "Imogene's flat was perfect for our stay. Within walking distance to shops  good coffee  and the beach. It was quiet  the bed comfortable with lovely white sheets and tidy and clean. Imogene was helpful and accomodating with our booking. "),
("2017-08-15", "18160399", "北京雅皮", "非常好"),
("2018-01-01", "18160399", "Nathanaëlle", "Appartement parfait pour trois personnes ou couple + 1 enfant. Littéralement à deux pas de la station de train Hurlstone Park sur la ligne T3 qui amène au cœur de Sydney donc très pratique pour visiter la ville tout en étant au calme. Quartier résidentiel très calme avec petits commerces dans la rue adjacente et parc pas loin. Bref idéal pour aller découvrir Sydney en étant dans un petit coin calme. Rien à redire sur la propreté des lieux. Nous ne nous sommes pas croisés avec Angelina mais elle a su répondre à toutes nos demandes. Merci à elle et sa famille pour ce séjour."),
("2017-05-06", "18316061", "Carrie", "Louise is a phenomenal  warm  helpful and responsive host! Her home was a gorgeous and artfully styled oasis mere minutes from the CBD. I loved every aspect of this stay and highly recommend for those who want a retreat during a business trip or weekend get away - 5 Stars and Thank You Louise!"),
("2017-05-19", "18316061", "Carrie", "I'll be back here again and again! It's an awesome retreat or gorgoeus alternative to another boring work hotel! Louise goes out of her way to Ensure a beautifully decorate  luxury oasis awaits all her guests with scrumptious snacks  breakfast  and all the mod cons you could want. Don't miss your chance to stay!"),
("2017-11-15", "18316061", "Natalie", "So tranquil despite its central location. Felt like our own private oasis. Lots of thought has gone into this listing to make it comfortable and liveable. Lots of careful little touches that make it a lovely place to relax."),
("2018-01-07", "18360303", "Kirsten", "Lovely house & well maintained. Everything you could need for a comfortable stay is provided. There were 4 adults & 2 children in our party  and there was more than enough space.Pool is a very welcome addition- especially to escape the Sydney heat!Wouldn’t think twice about rebooking if we’re ever fortunate to be in Sydney again!"),
("2017-06-02", "18315277", "Eoghan", "Great location! I was here for 3 weeks and it was close to beach and public transport. Perfect apartment"),
("2017-06-05", "18315277", "Pierangelo", "Great location  walking distance to bondi beach and many restaurants and  cafes! Nice and big apartment  super comfortable .The host was always reachable .Would recommend this airbnb for sure!!"),
("2017-06-30", "18315277", "Charlie", "Really lovely little apartment.  Bright and cheerful  cozy and warm.  Very central with everything you need at hand but set back slightly so you don't have to feel in the middle of everything if you don't want to.  Sarah has thought of everything to welcome you during your stay.  I loved the colourful plastic cups  bowls and plates for my lil girl.  Lovely kitchen to work in and great shower too.  Loved our stay here."),
("2017-07-03", "18315277", "Rob", "Nice place in a great location.This is a flat in a great location. Minutes only from the beach  public transport and of course  the cafes of Bondi Beach. The flat is well laid out and well suits someone staying in the local area. Sarah was a great host. We had a few initial issues but she was very efficient and courteous in resolving them. Her directions to get to the flat and the keys was terrific and worked like a dream. Well worth considering for your stay in Bondi"),
("2017-07-31", "18315277", "Rogério", "A casa da Sarah é muito acolhedora e  a com uma excelente localização. Nos comunicamos pouco  porque em Sydney tudo é muito interativo  além de termos uma filha que mora por lá. Mas Sarah passou todas as informações necessárias e não tivemos necessidade de ligar para ela.Um ótimo local para se hospedar. O único detalhe é que estávamos em três e para quem usava o sofá cama era necessário passar pelo quarto de casal para ir ao banheiro. Ideal para dois.Outro detalhe é que seria melhor se houvesse uma pia/tanque na área de serviço."),
("2017-08-09", "18315277", "Pepijn", "Stayed for 7 nights in this spacious apartment at a great location. Close to the beach  shops and restaurant.  Plus well connected to the city via public transport. However the cleanliness for the apartment was not good.  Hairs and soap remains the bathroom (and some mold as well) and food remains in the Kitchen.  Contacted the owner about this and she offered to send a cleaner  so perhaps it was just a one off thing."),
("2017-08-13", "18315277", "Ron", "Awesome location and cool apartment. Great contact from Sarah. Would stay again"),
("2017-08-26", "18315277", "Louis", "Nicely appointed Bondi flat with all the essentials. Will stay again."),
("2017-08-31", "18315277", "Jamie", "Great place to stay"),
("2017-09-29", "18315277", "Patty", "Great  comfortable stay. Very convenient location close to everything in Bondi."),
("2017-10-31", "18315277", "Joesph", "Great!"),
("2017-11-11", "18315277", "Alana", "Perfect location! Great fit for 2 people on beach holiday. Tight fit for 3. Instructions to locate key were clear. Cleanliness was average. A bit noisy mornings and night."),
("2017-12-28", "18315277", "Jaymi", "Great location  just a few blocks from Bondi. Plenty of restaurants and cafes in the neighborhood. Spacious and clean apartment  perfect for two people."),
("2017-12-30", "18315277", "Emma", "A tidy and spacious unit for a 1 bedroom. Close walking distance to some great restaurants  shops and the beach. Outside of the building is quite smelly as garage system is in a bit of a mess but this is happening a lot in the area because of the number of units. The host is really helpful! Great spot for a short stay in Bondi."),
("2018-01-01", "18315277", "Mark", "Perfect location in Bondi  close to everything! Excellent communication from Sarah and overall great weekend holiday spot."),
("2018-02-28", "18315277", "Anthony", "This flat is very good with a great location!"),
("2018-03-03", "18315277", "Jeremy", "Great place to stay!"),
("2018-03-18", "18315277", "Greg", "I cant reccomend it. Location okay nut that is it."),
("2018-03-26", "18315277", "Erin", "Great location. Close to amazing cafes and short walk to beach and Main Street. Great communication."),
("2018-04-02", "18315277", "Lisa", "Great size and location."),
("2018-04-09", "18315277", "Rose", "Sarah’s place was a perfect stay in Sydney. Her location in Bondi is absolutely central to everything you need to have a memorable holiday."),
("2018-07-03", "18315277", "Michael", "I stayed at this apartment for 4 weeks and it's the biggest feature is its location and proximity to the beach  just  5min walk. The place is quite large for 1 or 2 people. The only issue was that a number of light bulbs were not working inside and the bed was average comfortable. However  it was fully furnished and also included a washing machine which was great. All in all  it was a pleasant stay."),
("2018-07-30", "18315277", "Chris", "Unfortunately we didn't have a pleasant or restful stay here. Noise from car mechanic shop and building construction site right beside the apartment was so loud that it felt like it was coming from inside the unit! Went on all day long and none of this was mentioned in her listing! The noise was so unbearable that we had to cut our stay short. No one would want to waste their money on a noisy apartment while on vacation  especially after a very long flight!Even with recorded audio as proof  the host still would not refund for the days we didn't stay. Obviously she doesn't bother checking what goes on around her apartment regularly and that is just negligence! She doesn't seem to care much about guest satisfaction!"),
("2018-08-08", "18315277", "Marco", "For sure the biggest value added of this house is the location  just 5 minutes from Bondi Beach. Another plus is the bus stop just right in the corner that bring you to Bondi Junction where you can get the tube. The check in isn’t the easiest one whereas there are instruction (mostly if done in late evening). The flat is perfect up to 2 persons and is quite clean  even if something more could be done. At the end  considering the general picture  I’d suggest this accommodation to another guest."),
("2018-08-13", "18315277", "Nick", "Convenient location on Curlewis St near the corner with Glenayr Ave.  Close to shops   restaurants and public transport.  Apartment is located at the rear of the property so relatively quiet.  Easy check-in process.  Did not deal directly with the owner but rather through Airsorted.  A few broken light globes were replaced promptly.  TV reception was inconsistent and needs improving.   Notwithstanding this  this is a nice apartment and we would stay there again."),
("2018-08-18", "18315277", "Loz", "Very clean place and in awesome location. Although  parking says free all day  it doesn't mention you need to move your car every 2 hours every day you stay there - ruins your time if you do not know of this  we left a day early. Bring toilet paper and soap as these were not available at our stay. (they said they would reimburse us of the toilet paper) "),
("2018-09-21", "18315277", "Georgina", "Great location! Cleanliness wasn’t great - had to throw lots of food out from previous people. Inside wardrobes were dirty."),
("2018-11-01", "18315277", "Diana", "Good location and nice flat  there is a building site and a motor garage next door which is worth mentioning as it can be noisy."),
("2018-11-04", "18315277", "Gavin", "Great spot to stay  close to the beach  shops  restaurants and bars. Nice area too!"),
("2018-11-16", "18315277", "Stuart", "This is a fantastic place to stay. Location is fantastic. Great comfy bed. Great WiFi. Nice easy to follow instructions for entry and great quick communication. The place is roomy with everything you need. We stayed for 12 nights and had a great time."),
("2018-11-19", "18315277", "Richard", "Great location for a 8-10 min stroll to the beach  plenty of cafes and shops much closer. Spacious place with great master bedroom  but small and uncomfortable (double) sofa bed in lounge - may be better to book a proper 2 bed place if you need two proper beds."),
("2018-11-25", "18315277", "Christian", "Great central location. Excellent communication. Nice  serviceable unit."),
("2018-12-02", "18315277", "Stephanie", "Great location be weary thatt it is up a flight of stairs"),
("2018-12-26", "18315277", "Steve", "I stayed at Sarah's apartment for approx. 3 weeks and highly recommend it to others...  it's a really clean n tidy place... very spacious and a 2 minute walk from the beach...  The host was very helpful with getting back to me quickly when I needed her help a few times..  Many thanks Sarah !!"),
("2019-01-03", "18315277", "Mauricio", "The place's location is amazing! Bondi is a great area and the apartment is very close to everything. Some non-major things were a bit off which lessened the experience: dirty towels/linen  leaky faucet  broken towel rack. But overall we had a good experience. Sarah and her team were great at coordinating everything."),
("2019-02-10", "18315277", "Ruth", "Great location"),
("2019-02-12", "18315277", "Natasha", "I would not recommend staying here. It was simply disgusting.  The location was accurate but the photos were edited with a filter to make the apartment seem clean  however that was not the case. The apartment was filled with dust  mold  and rust. Things in the apartment came dirty and broken. Not to mention the apartment was infested with maggots. I was supposed to stay 11 nights but thank goodness I was able to get out as soon as possible and got a hotel for a remainder of my trip in Sydney. I’ve stayed in Airbnb’s in Berlin  Paris  Positano  Milan  Lisbon... and had even just moved from one in Sydney to this one. I had never experienced something even remotely close to this one. This Airbnb needs to be put off the site because the living situation is unhealthy!"),
("2019-02-19", "18315277", "Cameron", "A fantastic apartment in a fantastic location. Perfect for getting around and staying close enough to the beach. Apartment was spacious  well-furnished with washing machine/dryer  kitcheb utensils and fans for the heat!"),
("2019-02-22", "18315277", "Amit", "Amazing place for a vacation in Sydney! Great location"),
("2019-02-23", "18315277", "Kelly", "An excellent location  was clean and practical. It’s not fancy  nor particularly quiet but it’s what you would expect for Sydney. My one suggestion would be a bin and a second set of keys as it’s not amenable to two guests with different plans."),
("2017-05-19", "18345625", "Carlos", "Great place  location and room. Fiona was a great host and she also let us use a tv room in the second floor. Room and bathroom were clean and we had everything we needed. She provided guidance on public transport and places to visit. Jackson  her dog  is lovely and very calm. We definitely recommend this. place."),
("2017-07-08", "18345625", "Matthew", "Really suited what we needed during our stay in Sydney. Shame we didn't have time to enjoy the local beach. Felt really at home with the top floor at our disposal  to chill and unwind after a day out and about."),
("2017-07-19", "18345625", "Taki", "The best location. An awesome couple. And even if you don't like dogs  their dog is beautiful  friendly. Great location. Fantastic room and gorgeouviews of the ocean. Highly recommended. 11/10 can't wait to return and visit.... Thank you so much for a home away from home..."),
("2017-08-04", "18345625", "Marion", "Nice well furnished room in a quiet neighborhood. Hosts are very kind and helpful  the dog is really cute  you'll fall in love with him.We definitely recommend this place and had a beautiful stay there."),
("2017-08-13", "18345625", "Ross", "Fiona and her family made sure we felt welcome in their home. We had plenty of privacy upstairs; a very quiet house. Excellent host!"),
("2017-09-23", "18345625", "Sandy", "Mon copain et moi avons passé un mois chez Fiona. La maison est parfaite  très grande et la chambre se situe au premier étage. Tout était propre  on avait notre salle de bain privée ainsi qu'un balcon et qu'un salon avec TV pour nous. Fiona et Steeve sont des personnes formidables avec qui on peut facilement discuter. Leur chien Jackson est très câlin et super gentil (très sage). Je recommande cette chambre à tout le monde !"),
("2017-10-13", "18345625", "Chris", "Fiona and Steve’s place is absolutely fantastic for a homely and quiet stay close to the city. Close to the beach and shops. Great stay for a business/pleasure trip !"),
("2017-11-01", "18345625", "Bruce", "Really awesome stay. Highly recommend. Very comfortable room  clean and nice shower. Friendly dog and great location"),
("2017-11-12", "18345625", "Rick", "Very friendly  close to the beach  lovely water views  quiet neighbourhood  clean and comfortable."),
("2017-11-25", "18345625", "Peter", "great people  great place and one very spoiled super friendly doggie"),
("2017-12-02", "18345625", "Barbara", "Fiona was a great hostess. I was able to come and go as needed. The dog was no problem  in fact quite friendly. The bed was very comfortable and tastefully furnished. The bathroom was clean and for my own use. Overall recommend for short stay visitors to the area."),
("2017-12-16", "18345625", "Bubba", "Fiona's place is in an exceptional location  nearby the beach and some stunning views and park facilities as well as a lovely cafe.  The amenities are very nicely arranged and very clean.  Everything is stylish and modern and Fiona is delightful.  I would highly recommend staying!"),
("2018-04-15", "18345625", "Graham", "Excellent host who was extremely helpful. Very convenient to Airport and beaches."),
("2018-05-03", "18345625", "Woon Sun", "I chose Fiona’s place because it was near Randwick Golf Course .Steve and Fiona where helpful and accommodating with you feeling obliged to continuously chat.They left us to the upstairs area with privacy yet with the added benefit of being able to reach out downstairs to them when needed"),
("2018-05-23", "18345625", "Silke", "Beautiful well equipped room in a separat floor with a stunning view over the beach."),
("2018-06-15", "18345625", "Edwina", "Great location  accommodation and hospitality.Very friendly family and cute dog.  Hosts were helpfulbut not intrusive and made me feel very welcome intheir home.I stayed in a lovely  bright bedroom  which was quiet witha very comfortable bed and good amenities.I had a very enjoyable stay and it was a pleasure to meet this host family."),
("2017-07-21", "18338274", "Ruthe & Andy", "Bill's house is an opulent oasis. We were 3 colleagues in town for a trade show  and this was a wonderful base to relax in. 2 mins walk from the light rail station made it really easy to get around. The third bedroom is up a flight of quite steep stairs. There are good hand rails  but those with limited mobility would be better in the downstairs rooms. Beautiful things surround you throughout the property. The beds were very comfortable and there were plenty of amentites. A true home away from home. Highly recommended. "),
("2017-07-29", "18338274", "Stefan", "Very nice house Best place to live in Sydney.Bill is a very nice man who takes care of his guests and their wishes. Absolutely reconommable"),
("2017-08-03", "18338274", "Caroline", "Great. House in reachable location. Really comfy beds and all needs catered for. Good communication. Very highly recommended."),
("2017-08-06", "18338274", "Ela", "Bills's Place is exactly as described and with 4 bedrooms certainly has plenty of space. We loved the little courtyard in the back with the fishpond. The beautiful antique furniture and deco was a nice touch to a classic terrace house in contrast to the modern kitchen and bathroom.The house manual was very helpful in explaining everything to do with the house.Location is perfect  just 2 minutes walk to the light rail and 2 minutes to shops and restaurants. Bill was very helpful with our request to extend our stay a couple of hours so we didn't need to wait at the airport.  We would definitely like to stay again."),
("2017-08-13", "18338274", "Jane", "This is a beautiful  well-equipped and comfortable home full of eclectic decor and in a great location  close to transport  cafes  restaurants  interesting shops and markets. The stairs to the top bedroom are steep and the only bathroom is on the ground floor  so not suitable for anyone with disabilities or young children  but perfect for those who appreciate beauty and art and good living and prefer to be in an area that is lively and hip during the day but quiet at night. The sunny courtyard is a bonus  as are the friendly neighbours."),
("2017-08-28", "18338274", "Jeff", "Great house and location highly recommend"),
("2017-09-20", "18338274", "Sarah", "Very beautiful house  worth the money! Very good communication and we even checked in early. Definitely be back again."),
("2017-09-25", "18338274", "Anthony", "Beautiful period house. Very spacious and tidy. Amazing location so close to transport and city. Made to feel very welcome by our host. An absolute pleasure. Would choose to stay here again."),
("2017-10-05", "18338274", "Matt & Halina", "Great location to central city. Bill's home is very nice  clean and had great amenities. Bill sorted parking permits for us which was great. Thanks  we will definitely be back."),
("2017-10-09", "18338274", "Diep", "Feel like living in owb own home. Amazing house with beautiful garden.Close to Darling Harbour  about 20 minutes walk. Close to restaurants and supermarket.The host was very supportive and quick response for any querry or issue.Absolutely will come back if travelling to Sydney."),
("2017-10-16", "18338274", "Justine", "Great location  great for family  plenty of amenities and supplies provided and quick helpful host .  Would definitely stay again.Book about property was great for advice as well as house information and history.Thanks for a great stay"),
("2017-10-22", "18338274", "Cindy", "A lovely house in a great location with a very thoughtful and considerate host.  A real find!"),
("2017-11-01", "18338274", "May", "Bill's place is full of characters as he stated in his advertising.  Lots of books  pictures  vases  antiques and more. It is spacious and comfortable. Nice kitchen and bathroom  very clean. Beautiful courtyard - unfortunately we could not enjoy much due to lots of stormy days.  We suggest people with children younger than four years old be more thoughtful about renting the place  due to Bill's antiques displays in the house. Also taking your children to toilet at night is a bit of a walk."),
("2017-11-06", "18338274", "Carol", "Lovely house in great central location  2 minute walk to light rail station. Great couples house  very comfortable and everything we needed was there."),
("2017-11-09", "18338274", "Adrian", "Great location"),
("2017-11-14", "18338274", "Pearl", "Bill has been a wonderful host  very communicative and helpful with the checking in and out process as I booked his place on behalf of my in laws. My in laws enjoyed their stay and I would recommend his place to other travelers traveling in a group."),
("2017-11-19", "18338274", "Jay", "Staying at Bill's place is a home away from home. Beautifully decorated and enough room for 3 couples. Comfy beds  beautiful courtyard. It has everything you need  full kitchen if cooking. Very conveniently located in Glebe  only minutes from Light Rail Station  a short walk to Glebe Point Road to busses that take you into the CBD  lots and lots of restaurants  cafes  supermarkets. A short walk to the Glebe Markets held every Saturday (a must do in Glebe). Bill was very helpful and prompt in communicating  his book is very informative. Parking is scarce in Glebe  however Bill was able to supply parking permits at a very small cost. Value for money!!!"),
("2017-11-24", "18338274", "Yang", "Very nice house and Bill is very thoughtful."),
("2017-11-25", "18338274", "Tanya", "Wonderful home.... an oasis on the city. Close enough to everything but when you close the door it is a sanctuary within the hustle and bustle. Sit in the private garden and relax."),
("2017-12-02", "18338274", "Cathy", "房子很有特色 让我感觉到房东的文化底蕴丰厚｡地理位置十分满意｡房东人很好 我们早上退房下午飞机 就帮我们保管行李 好让我们早上去逛｡"),
("2017-12-09", "18338274", "Kathryn", "Bill is a most helpful and hospitable host  and the house is beautiful  peaceful and relaxing. It is located in a leafy suburb close to the CBD & right around the corner from restaurants  cafes and bars. Bill's place is the perfect base from which to explore Sydney and is a pleasure to come home to after a day out. The bedrooms are spacious  the kitchen is newly renovated and contains everything you need  and the living area is homely and comfortable. Bill's home is furnished with interesting and unique artworks and antiques  and the courtyard is a relaxing spot to enjoy a morning coffee or a glass of wine in the evening. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-12-16", "18338274", "Nicholas", "Do yourself a favour and stay at Bills house. The locations in Glebe is wonderful  close to the city and Glebe but in a gorgeous quiet location. The house is really big and allows a large group to expand into the space. Bill is a very accommodating host. Thanks for everything."),
("2017-12-17", "18338274", "Elizabeth", "Great location  excellent host  very well provisioned house. Spacious bedrooms  good quality linen. Super kitchen. Had a great stay."),
("2017-12-19", "18338274", "Mona", "Bill is nice and patient. He made a very useful information booklet for all customers  including all kinds of travel information you need!The house is more amazing than the photos on website. You won't be disappointed!"),
("2017-12-30", "18338274", "Leandro", "A beautiful house  in an amazing location. Bill  a great host. Everything was easy and simple. I really recommend it!"),
("2018-01-01", "18338274", "Connor", "Bill's place was FANTASTIC!  The house was very clean  organized and Bill was a very hospitable host.  Definitely a hidden gem in a great part of the city!  Thanks for making our NYE stay great!"),
("2018-01-07", "18338274", "Robyn", "Beautiful home  great location  very comfortable  great host.Thanks for a perfect stay Bill.We felt very lucky to enjoy your beautiful home.Robyn"),
("2018-01-27", "18338274", "Cara", "Bill was a lovely host  easy to communicate with  quick to respond. He ensured we had everything we needed and knew the locations of nearby essentials. The house was spacious  clean and equiped with all we needed. Beautiful art."),
("2018-02-05", "18338274", "Romica", "The house is an older style  full of character and art  and Chinese (Website hidden by Airbnb) has spacious bedrooms and modern kitchen equipped with all the appliances however we found the living area a bit dark  with no sunlight during the day. Another con would be only one toilet for the whole house.The host is very responsive and happy to assist anytime.Overall a nice stay  and would recommend it to the fellow travellers."),
("2018-02-09", "18338274", "雪", "整套房子干净 整洁｡布置的比较紧凑温馨｡摆放了很多画 照片 装饰品 Bill是非常周到细致的主人 准备了详细周边购物 交通 出游指南｡厨房用具非常全 我们一家五口做饭聚餐 不亦乐乎｡距离旁边轻轨站Glebe只有100多米 很方便｡主人家的小院子很棒 还有个小鱼池 绿植茂密 坐在院子里吃酒喝茶也是美事!"),
("2018-02-12", "18338274", "瑞", "Bill很贴心的提醒我们一点钟可以提前入住了｡对于凌晨七点到达的一大家子早休息一个小时很重要 关键是感觉到了切实的关心｡距离鱼市场步行十分钟 然后从鱼市场距离daring harbor十分钟 中间经过一个儿童乐园不错｡继续步行十分钟就到了海德公园 然后一路沿着公园走到皇家公园｡临近海边看当地人锻炼身体 读书 几个朋友喝啤酒都十分惬意｡悉尼核心区步行一个半小时够了｡带着孩子们走走停停 步行是最好的选择｡感谢Bill准备的旅游建议｡桌子上放了一大本书｡各种电器使用说明 到远近的商店信息｡很用心的人｡屋里各地带回来的艺术品｡泰国的 中国的元素不少｡推荐大家来悉尼住在Bill家｡再次感谢"),
("2018-02-20", "18338274", "Jing", "Bill is a very nice people he gives me a lot of tips how to tour in Sydney."),
("2018-02-24", "18338274", "Lindsey", "My family and I had a great stay at Bill's Place. The house was roomy  with everything you need  and in  great central location to get around Sydney. Bill was also very responsive and detailed in his communication. Would highly recommend."),
("2018-02-27", "18338274", "Meredith", "Beautifully appointed place conveniently located to city transit. Gracious  accommodating  informative host.  Highly recommend!!"),
("2018-03-08", "18338274", "Naomi", "Bill’s place is fantastic and fantastically located. He was also a very attentive host providing lots of helpful info and responding quickly. Thanks Bill!"),
("2018-03-13", "18338274", "Brett", "Highly recommended this amazing terrace home. The owner has thought of EVERYTHING. truly felt as if we had the experience of a lifetime.     Comfortably slept 5 adults with room for extras if we needed it. Don't go past this air bnb.... It was our first and blew us out of the water...."),
("2018-03-18", "18338274", "Jamie", "Beautiful house in a great location  easy to walk into city or the light rail is only a five minute walk from the house. Bill was very accommodating as we arrived two hours earlier than expected (party of six). Also let us stay longer than normal checkout time. Everything you need for your stay is detailed in the house manual  bill also took the time to show us around explaining the workings of the house. Only issue for us (Scottish folk) was we couldn’t open any of the windows as no fly screens  maybe not a problem for others though. Would recommend staying here."),
("2018-03-23", "18338274", "Laulene", "Bill was a great host. He met us at the house and showed us around. He gave us a lot of tips. The house is amazing. So beautiful with everything you might need! We can definitely recommend staying here! It is beautiful!"),
("2018-03-25", "18338274", "Liz", "Amazing house. Beautifully decorated  quiet  relaxing. So close to public transport  restaurants and shops. Tea  coffee and condiments included.Full laundry and fully equipped kitchen. Delightful outdoor areas. Plenty of information about the area. Better than the best hotel. True luxury. Would stay here again in a heartbeat."),
("2018-04-02", "18338274", "Curt", "What an inner-city haven this place is.Even more charming than it appears in the photos. Clean  quite and perfectly situated in Glebe for all it has to offer  as well as close to transport options to take you where ever you want to go.Highly recommended"),
("2018-04-08", "18338274", "Grace", "Bill's house is located at strategic place where you can reach to many tourist spots easily. The walking distance from the house to Sydney fish market is less than 10 minutes. There is a light rail station nearby. We were impressed when we see the fully equipped kitchen.You can even do some baking stuff with this nice kitchen. We feel grateful when Bill allowed us to check in earlier and check out late.  He is a good host and his house is well maintained."),
("2018-04-16", "18338274", "Nitin", "It was a wonderful stay for me and my family at Bill's house. It is exactly as what is there in the description and photos. Would strongly recommend to stay here if one is traveling to Sydney."),
("2018-04-21", "18338274", "Fiona", "Such a gorgeous house and so spacious for the location! Would stay again!!"),
("2018-04-29", "18338274", "Harry", "This was my first airbnb experience and I really hope my future ones are as oustanding as this one. The place is in a good location  clean and modern but you still get the 1800s terrace housing experience. All amenities were outstanding and very good detailed information was provided."),
("2018-05-06", "18338274", "Veronica", "The house is amazing - beautiful interior design and decorations. A handy house manual tells you lots of stories behind the house and it’s fascinating. Great location  all rooms are spacious and got comfy bed  very clean and kitchen is well equipped with everything you could need. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-11", "18338274", "Stuart", "If you are looking for a great 4 bedroom place in Glebe with heaps of history & character then look no further than Bills place. Retains some of the original charm with some furniture & decorations which it has a great new kitchen & bathroom. On a quiet street walking distance from Glebe shops or only a quick cab ride to city this is a great launching pad to explore the city from. Highly recommend Bills place."),
("2018-05-19", "18338274", "Stacy", "Hi Bill  we had a great stay. Thanks so much for your hospitality. The house was lovely and clean and well equipped. Easy walk down to Darling Harbour each day of our conference. Perfect location. Highly recommended"),
("2018-05-27", "18338274", "Bianca", "Fantastic home with plenty of space  close to public transport and eclectic mix of art and furniture. Would stay here again."),
("2018-05-31", "18338274", "Carolin", "The host canceled this reservation 80 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-06-17", "18338274", "Paul", "Good value   close to local cafes and  transport. Nice to have room for 3 couples to feel at home an not in a hotel."),
("2018-06-25", "18338274", "Shane", "Fantastic place  far better than the photos show. Great location just out of the hustle of the CBD. Highly recommended."),
("2018-07-07", "18338274", "David", "The ambience of the house is wonderful  the location is great for exploring Sydney CDS/Harbour area. Just take note there are 4 brms and 1 bathroom."),
("2018-07-11", "18338274", "Michael", "Great place thanks bill !"),
("2018-07-16", "18338274", "Bonnie", "Fantastic house with beautiful art work and comfortable amenities. Close to public transport  downtown Glebe and Sydney CBD. Bill was very hospitable.Will stay again. "),
("2018-08-01", "18338274", "Maeve", "Highly recommend Bill’s place for space and location.  It far exceeded our expectations.  A very stylish environment.  The host was first rate."),
("2018-08-06", "18338274", "明芳", "非常好了"),
("2017-06-26", "18569613", "Chloe", "It's cozy and quiet place to stay. There's a really good location  close to supermarket and 20 minutes walk from fish market. It's especially suitable for someone who use public transportation. "),
("2017-07-07", "18569613", "Jenny", "A great centrally located house a short walk from everything. Jamie was easy to deal with. Only issue was the lack of toaster and microwave in the kitchen. But otherwise a great place and would definitely recommend."),
("2017-07-15", "18569613", "Sze", "Easy 15mins walk to Central station. Food and supermarkets right across the street. Overall  great value for accommodation in Sydney."),
("2017-06-29", "18616850", "Sibella", "A perfect hideaway tucked in a laneway of leafy Paddington. A perfect spot to relocate whilst we were renovating our kitchen with a hop  skip & a jump to my favourite shopping hub of Glenmore Road as well as the delicious Jackie's. The 3 bedroom cottage looks so pretty from the outside and beautifully furnished & styled on the inside  it made me pine to move back to Paddington."),
("2017-07-09", "18616850", "Gemma", "A little gem of a cottage in Paddington. A wonderful place to unwind ... like a little retreat from the world."),
("2017-07-16", "18616850", "Nick", "Great location and nice and clean"),
("2017-07-22", "18616850", "Sibella", "Another great stay in the cottage! I feel like moving in here instead of my newly renovated house."),
("2017-08-11", "18616850", "Niko", "Bradley's place is top notch  super comfy and very recent renovated old Paddington cottage. Close to shops  restaurants  pubs and Oxford St transport. Would recommend for two couples or two singles.Kitchen with all the bells and whistles!Will be staying again!!"),
("2017-08-18", "18616850", "Rob", "We were fortunate to secure a stay at Bradley's place in (Email hidden by Airbnb) munication with Bradley was first rate throughout. The property is a quaint cottage superbly located in Paddington within walking distance of numerous great watering holes and eateries. The cottage was spotlessly clean and very homely for our stay in Sydney.  It was a great find and Bradley is clearly an experienced host."),
("2017-08-26", "18616850", "Kate", "Bradley's home is spotlessly clean and beautifully furnished. The bedlinen is crisp and fresh and the beds are very comfy. There's an abundance of generous supplies  like Aesop bathroom products  extra towels  and beer in the fridge. Bradley was a prompt and polite host - we couldn't ask for more.  The house is just around the corner from oxford st shopping and the nearest cafe  Jackie's  is superb. Despite its central location the street itself is lovely and quiet.We would absolutely return here!!Just a note for anyone with young kids or mobility issues - there is a very narrow and steep flight of stairs to the bedrooms.Overall  we just loved it!!Amazing place."),
("2017-09-10", "18616850", "Marcus", "A lovely and cosy cottage in the heart of Paddington. It was a great place to stay and was within walking distance of just about everything! We really enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-09-23", "18616850", "Leisa", "Bradley's cottage is absolutely gorgeous. The location in Paddington is fantastic for walking. The cottage is beautifully presented with the most amazing linen! Bradley was so helpful  we would stay here again in a heart beat  Many thanks."),
("2017-10-01", "18616850", "冬旎", "Bradley的这套房子是典型的小而美的类型 除了进去的道路和楼梯比较窄 其他都非常好 屋子很漂亮 Bradley也非常热情友好 介绍了很多当地的好吃的 非常感谢!"),
("2017-10-08", "18616850", "Ally", "Great location  very charming and spotless! Will definitely recommend to friends visiting Sydney. Thanks Bradley"),
("2017-10-20", "18616850", "Justine", "The house is in a great location  central to exploring many parts of Sydney. The house has everything you need to feel at home while away from home. There is plenty of equipment to cook up a meal and even laundry machines for your use. There are many great places within walking distance including eateries  shops and a great wine store. Its easy to get to the beach and to the city within a short period of time from the cottage. The cottage is cosy  and I think its notable that only one of the three bedrooms  has a door that closes. Lastly  as mentioned in another review the stairs are very narrow to get to the second and third floor  so be aware of you physical capabilities when staying here. We enjoyed our trip to Sydney very much."),
("2017-12-18", "18616850", "Nisa", "Loved loved loved staying here. I booked the place for my (rather particular mother in law) and she said it was the first rental she didn’t have to go out and buy cleaning supplies and scrub head to toe. Our favorite - apart from the wonderful location - was the styling of the place  from the high quality linens to the choice of crockery and decor. Thanks!"),
("2018-01-05", "18616850", "David", "Lovely character cottage that ticks all the boxes for visitors fromInterstate or overseas. Highly recommended."),
("2018-03-05", "18616850", "Cleve", "Outstanding residence. Perfect location. Stylish. Spotless. Bradley is communicative and easy going. Definitely consider staying again when I'm back in Sydney."),
("2018-05-26", "18616850", "Deborah", "Quaint and pretty cottage in a wonderfully quiet location . Very close to the wonderful shops and amenities of the Paddington. A lovely home for a romantic weekend get away . Great host in every way."),
("2018-05-30", "18616850", "Julie", "This cottage was quintessential Paddington. Very centrally located   very clean  and the flowers and starched white sheets were a special and unexpected treat. Only thing that surprised us was the  bedroom and bathroom were on different levels.  We loved our stay and would highly recommend this cottage. "),
("2018-07-19", "18616850", "Jeanine", "Bradley's Paddington Cottage is absolutely gorgeous.  Beautifully decorated  fantastic location in Paddington and yet very quiet.  Lovely old cottage  with modern kitchen  bathroom and heavily sheets & bedding.  I would easily recommend it for those looking for a beautifully appointed cottage in Paddington.  "),
("2018-08-31", "18616850", "Charlotte", "Mary Place is a unique  tidy  spotless  charming cottage with the upmost attention to detail and a lovely sense of home away from home. There are exquisite antique linens  beautifully placed candles  a fireplace  quirky furniture  a miniature garden  all the nice kitchen amenities required. It is ideal for guests who appreciate this stylish touches and will look after the it so. The location was wonderful  we could see stars from out the sky light from the attic bed  magpies would sing in the morning  the fireplace glowing in the evening. A thoroughly enjoyable and memorable stay in a beautiful and loved cottage. Thank you Bradley"),
("2018-10-12", "18616850", "Nicole", "We absolutely loved staying at Bradley's house! It was charming and in the most perfect location. It was chilly and rainy the week we were there  so it was nice sitting by the fire at the end of the night with a glass of wine. Sleeping on the top floor was a dream! The french doors in the kitchen leading out to the yard would be perfect to open on summer nights. If we're ever in Sydney again  we'd love to stay at Bradley's house again!"),
("2019-01-01", "18616850", "Chris", "I would highly recommend Bradley’s beautiful home as a place to stay. It is cosy and comfortable with beautiful furnishings  linens and every thing you could need is considered. It’s in a great location and easy to get around. But we were also happy to come back and relax in this wonderful space."),
("2017-06-09", "18841207", "Suzanne", "It was close to the airport and very clean. Highly recommended"),
("2017-06-20", "18841207", "Phil", "A pleasant and hassle-free place to stay. Really good value."),
("2017-07-09", "18841207", "Yong", "Very clean room and the May is veryFriendly."),
("2017-07-17", "18841207", "Zhuoshi", "May is quite warmhearted and super nice. The room is clean and the mattress is soft which make me home over here."),
("2017-10-02", "18841207", "Erika", "May is a lovely person  I'll recommand her anytime! oh and  her dog daisy is adorable!"),
("2017-11-12", "18841207", "Joanne", "Lovely self contained place with washing machine  TV bathroom. May was very helpful and nice. Good location near restaurants. Unit was very clean. Secure place. I would stay here again."),
("2018-02-26", "18841207", "刘", "房间很干净 可以自己做饭｡距离火车站大约步行20分钟 还是挺方便的｡火车站有大超市｡房间内东西很全｡"),
("2017-06-04", "18793287", "Ailsa", "We absolutely loved staying at The Cov. The house was delightful  full of character  clean and equipped with everything we could need. Communication from Joy was excellent and the location of the house was perfect for us. We highly recommend staying at this place and we'll be back for sure  we hope. Joy was also hugely helpful when I left my earrings behind. She went out of her way to make sure I had them before we were on the road again."),
("2017-06-17", "18793287", "Ben", "Joy's house is very conveniently located to restaurants  bars  cafes  public transport and great food shopping in a great neighborhood. Her home is thoughtfully appointed and very comfortable with convenient self check-in"),
("2017-06-23", "18793287", "Sharon", "Close to shops and public transport  great kitchen  neat and clean  great communication."),
("2017-07-18", "18793287", "Sue", "The location for us was perfect . It is close to shops restaurants and public transport. The house had everything we needed."),
("2017-08-30", "18793287", "Ming", "Really a comfortable house for the family. Very convenient traffic to the city and community nearby. Only 4 minutes' walk to Marrickville train station. The house is federation style with beautiful high ceiling  the landlord has excellent taste for selection of pictures  such as oil painting  Chinese painting  scenery pictures  make the house vivid  I like them very much! The facilities in the kitchen are all ready. The landlord is very communicative  thoughtful. The car can be parked alongside the street freely. By the way  there is a very good Chinese restaurant supplying Canton breakfast  tasteful and original  just by 10 minutes' walk."),
("2017-09-28", "18793287", "Peter", "This is a great space in Marrickville  I was working in the area and it really suited my needs. I would not hesitate to stay again."),
("2017-11-26", "18793287", "Suzanne", "Stylish house  great location  perfect!"),
("2017-12-04", "18793287", "Anne", "This apartment is really beautyful! We loved the perfect kitchen equipment. All the lovely details and the warm atmosphere made us feel like home. Very friendly and caring host. :-)"),
("2017-12-26", "18793287", "Frances", "The Cov House is beautiful  and beautifully appointed. We cooked a Christmas lunch there and found everything we needed in the kitchen  and the rest of the house was no different. Joy responds promptly to messages and was very helpful both before and during our stay. We had a lovely Christmas and couldn’t have asked for anything more."),
("2018-01-04", "18793287", "Paul", "This is the perfect house for two couples. Very well equiped and location is close to shops and train station. Highly recomended"),
("2018-01-24", "18793287", "Artur", "A very modern and cosy but truly historical house! Parks  supermarkets  public transport within walking distance. The library is fantastic!"),
("2018-02-19", "18793287", "Raquel", "Nice house  comfortable and near to everything.  If you have any question Joy will answer ASAP and so kindly. The experience has been a real pleasure!! Thank you once again!!!!"),
("2018-02-21", "18793287", "Jules", "Joy is a super smart host that has thought of everything a guest could need. Seems silly  but I appreciated all the USB chargers around the house in the perfect spots. Really considerate with her communications too. Was as smooth as you'd hope."),
("2018-03-03", "18793287", "Warren", "We loved our stay here. Just like the pictures - maybe better! Very clean with excellent amenities. Very convenient location. Joy was a joy to deal with. Would happily recommend & will be staying again."),
("2018-03-08", "18793287", "Emilya", "Great stay! Very close the train. We are local so know the area!. It doesn’t have a garden but a short drive to parks."),
("2018-04-02", "18793287", "Ben", "We had a great stay  the house is family friendly and in an excellent location!Joy was very accommodating and responsive to all of our questions.We had a very nice little journey by train into the city each day and much preferred staying in a nearby suburb compared with the city center. Would recommend this house to anyone.Thanks again Ben and family"),
("2018-04-04", "18793287", "Theane & Ian", "“It was the best of times it was the worst of times”. Best- the House was superb  beautifully furnished in a good location. Worst- 1. The door lock broke and we got trapped inside the house for almost two hours on our first morning. Which was harrowing with small children and no food. 2. The host could not be contacted when we had trouble with Check in. Leaving us standing on the door step with young children at 11pm at night. 3. The renovations next door were quite loud especially with young children sleeping during the day. Overall I think the place is great but we were unlucky with the mishaps."),
("2018-05-25", "18793287", "Jodi", "The host is really helpful  the place itself was disappointing. You feel a bit trapped in there as it's a house that has been cut into 2 flats and this one has no real outlook or access to the outside... other than the path to the front door. If you are basically just sleeping there it probably wouldn't be an issue but if you want somewhere where you can relax in a lounge room  cook a dinner and sit down and enjoy it etc etc this probably won't be what you are after. Really close to the station though  which was great. Nice high ceilings. Just not that comfortable or welcoming."),
("2018-07-25", "18793287", "Erin", "We had a wonderful time at the Cov  a great place to stay & location was tops. Thanks for everything Joy! "),
("2018-09-20", "18793287", "Patricia", "A cosy & neat house"),
("2018-09-24", "18793287", "Libby", "Very comfortable and clean home."),
("2018-11-18", "18793287", "Mitch", "Great space  and location"),
("2019-02-11", "18793287", "Robin", "Ideal location for Marrickville and very convenient for the city train. The Cov is exactly as described  Joy checked regularly that all was well. Hope to be able to stay here again for next Sydney visit"),
("2019-03-03", "18793287", "Samara", "Great location in Marrickville and a very clean and lovely home."),
("2017-05-19", "18620288", "Ilias", "I would happily live in this apartment as it is. The view is spectacular and the apartment is very comfortable with a very well equiped kitchen good internet and all the comforts of home including a nice bed. I love this location  close to the train and direct access to the city but in a lovely neighbourhood again with unbeatable views of the harbour. Everything is good quality and the inclusions well thought out to make things easy for your stay. I have rented Airbnb properties all over the world  this is one of the first ones that I sent links to my friends. You won't be disappointed."),
("2017-05-21", "18620288", "Jp", "Really had a good time in the apartment.Accurate description  and so happy to offer that to my sister's and husband first trip to Australia  Sydney.Mavelous view when waking up  we've been lucky with the weather  great situation. Close to the ferry -10 mn  Neutral Bay  very close  couldn't be better. Feeling so lucky finding this apartment and being accepted.Quiet environment  safe car park  good internet  all facilities... Good bed (according to my sister)  I had the sofa and cannot complain either  what else can you expect?Check-in has been brief  straight forward  well organised.Stephen has been a great host and I want to thank him again.I hope to come again  one day  if it's not over booked !!!100% satisfied...JP"),
("2017-05-30", "18620288", "Zachary", "Stephen was a fantastic host let me check-in early and also offed late check-out place had everything you needed to make yourself at home plus more hardly had to go out and buy anything & was so clean  defiantly recommend this place to anyone looking at staying."),
("2017-06-10", "18620288", "Harrison", "This apartment has a beautiful view right when you walk in. It's the first thing we noticed. You look southwest towards the water. The apartment is nice and well stocked with everything you'd expect. It's also just up the road from the North Sydney ferry what and just a street or two over from Milsons Point train station. Stephen was always quick to respond and work with us anytime we had questions. I was very impressed."),
("2017-06-16", "18620288", "Rod Rodrigo", "Cozy apartment   just a walk over the bridge and your in town .Best way to see Sydney. Great location with a water view. Train and ferry close by .Hard to leave the apart!!!Would return for sure .The host very easy to comunícate."),
("2017-06-22", "18620288", "Jessica", "Stephen is such an amazing host. Promt and extremely hemohim . The property is everything you want and need!"),
("2017-06-27", "18620288", "Henry", "It was a beautiful apartment that's new on Airbnb with a few kinks to work out."),
("2017-07-31", "18620288", "Laura", "Stephen was a wonderful host and accommodated our late check in. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-08-18", "18620288", "Bryan", "The apartment is spacious and clean. All amenities are there and it's close to the train station. It's full on natural light and has great views of the harbour. Highly recommend!"),
("2017-09-11", "18620288", "Virginia", "A lovely apartment with beautiful views. Very clean & tidy. A great location on the north shore & wonderful hosts who went out of their way to be helpful. Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2017-09-15", "18620288", "Ben", "Such a great place for a few days whilst working at Milsons point. The balcony looking over the water and really comfy bed are a real bonus and the place is just the right amount of designer chic. Will book again next time for sure!"),
("2017-09-17", "18620288", "Scott", "The apartment is very clean and has a beautiful view. The location is very quiet but it's just a short walk up to the restaurants and bars at Kirribilli. And having a parking spot was great because finding on-street parking would be challenging. We'd definitely stay there again"),
("2017-09-24", "18620288", "Katy", "Great one bedroom pad in Sydney with easy access to public transport  cafes  restaurants and bars. Also had a fold out couch which meant my Mum could stay the weekend. Highly recommend - we had a great time!!"),
("2017-10-01", "18620288", "Gary", "From the excellent meet and greet we had a great stay. The location was awesome with local cafes  ferries down town  and an easy walk over the harbour bridge. All in a lovely part of Sydney. The apartment was comfy  well equipped and with an amazing view."),
("2017-10-10", "18620288", "Kim", "This apartment was wonderful.  The view was spectacular with a nice balcony. The bed was very comfortable and the water pressure in the shower was great!  I highly recommend Stephen's place."),
("2017-10-14", "18620288", "Ralph", "Enjoyed our weekend in this lovely apartment which had everything we needed including a super location with a lovely sea view. The bed was very comfy and apparently the sofa bed was awesome too. Well suited for 2 people."),
("2017-10-20", "18620288", "Peggy", "Beautiful apartment with gorgeous views of a small bay. Spotlessly clean and very well stocked with dishes etc.  The bed and sitting are are very comfortable.  Easy 5 minute walk down the hill to a quick ferry to Circular Quay and you can get anywhere from there  and a slightly longer walk to N Sydney/Kiribilli shops  restaurants  and the train. Stephen was a great host. He went out of his way to get us in for early check-in and he checked in on us on our first morning to make sure everything was ok. This is not the place for you if you want to be in the middle of bustling Sydney activity  but if you want a beautiful  quiet place that's close enough to get anywhere  we highly recommend this one!"),
("2017-11-13", "18620288", "Jonathan", "Great location  Clean  Easy check-in and check out. Good communication. Would recommend."),
("2017-12-07", "18620288", "Marnix And Nicole", "Great spot  nice view over harbour. Modern clean apartment  has all you need.Excellent water pressure in shower!Easy check in.May get a bit hot on warm summer days  as the sun comes through early in the morning.Great stay  would book again."),
("2017-12-09", "18620288", "Elise", "Great little base from which to see Sydney   We would stay again."),
("2017-12-12", "18620288", "Lee", "Very comfortable and clean  fabulous views  a rare find!"),
("2017-12-26", "18620288", "Jutta", "Die Unterkunft liegt sehr zentral im angesagten Kirribilli  zu den Cafés 5-10 Minuten Fußweg  ebenso zur Harbour Bridge und der Bahnstation Milsons Point.Zur Fähre 3 Minuten und dann in 10 Minuten zum circular quay.Wir können die Wohnung nur empfehlen und werden sie bei unserem nächsten Sydney Aufenthalt bestimmt wieder buchen. Auch die Fotos im Internet entsprechen genau den Gegebenheiten."),
("2018-01-06", "18620288", "Andrew", "We had a great stay. Really loved the view over Neutral Harbour and how central and easy it was to commute everywhere. Highly recommended."),
("2018-02-01", "18620288", "Xudong", "嗯 这是一次愉快的旅途｡very nice room!"),
("2018-02-03", "18620288", "Stephen", "The apartment is just as its described in airbnb and we could not have asked for better.  Our own parking spot below right near the entrance to the lift  a corner apartment with all the facilities we needed and Stephen went out of his way to make sure that little glitches were quickly rectified.  The location is amazing - so easy to get to from either side of the harbour and being on an upper floor we had amazing views over the harbour.  Grocery stores and restaurants are about 500m from the apartment and do require some hill climbing if you walk  but again the views made walking very enjoyable.  Don't forget to bring or get Opal cards if you you want to use the ferry which is just 300 metres straight down the road."),
("2018-02-07", "18620288", "Debby", "Thanks for having us. Wonderful place with great location."),
("2018-02-15", "18620288", "Tony", "Very comfortable & well equipped unit  small balcony with lovely views of Careening Cove & the harbour. Bedroom has large wardrobe & plenty of drawers. Slow but adequate elevator. Excellent location - 5 minute walk to N Sydney ferry   bit over 10 minutes to Milson's Point station  with shops & food outlets  15 minutes to Coles supermarket at N Sydney. Only downside - there seems to be no direct access outside the building from the upper basement level  where the parking slot is  to the lower level where the bell-pushes are. So if you don't have the door key you have to walk right round the road  a bit tedious.Otherwise we had a vey comfortable stay & would had stayed longer had it been available."),
("2018-03-06", "18620288", "Laura", "Great place  very convenient  clean  close to cafes and shops etc and transport into town. Stephen was a great host who responded quickly when we needed help and was flexible with meeting us."),
("2018-03-10", "18620288", "Karel", "Great apartment in a good location with good shops and restaurants. Wonderful view of harbour. Well equipped and spacious. Easy walk to ferry."),
("2018-03-16", "18620288", "Andi", "This is a lovely apartment with a fantastic view. It was a quick walk to the train or ferry so very convenient for getting around Sydney.  It’s a very quiet neighborhood but there are some nice places to eat a short walk away. Stephen met us as we arrived and explained all we need to know for our stay. Highly recommended for those exploring Sydney."),
("2018-03-22", "18620288", "Richard", "Apartment is sparkling clean with great views. Checking in was met by Cristy who was helpful and polite. Highly recommend these guys"),
("2018-03-27", "18620288", "Susie", "Fabulous location  only a few minutes walk to North Sydney ferry stop. A 15 minute walk to many Kirribilli restaurants and cafes. The apartment is very comfortable and well equipped. There are all the little added extras  that you don’t get in a hotel. Views of the harbour are beautiful. We had beautiful weather 17-24 degrees. If it was a hotter evening  the apartment may have been a bit warm  as there is no aircon or thru flow of breezes. We would definitely stay again  but not in summer."),
("2018-04-16", "18620288", "Mohamed", "Great stay"),
("2018-04-18", "18620288", "Stephen", "Our second time in this apartment in a couple of months and as with the last time we really enjoyed it.  Good brisk walks required to ferry  trains or cafes but all are not long and the location gets you to you to anywhere in the CBD quickly.  Excellent value for money for an apartment with dedicated parking."),
("2018-04-22", "18620288", "Andrew", "Nice and quiet  beautiful little spot with lovely views and a beautiful clean home. Will be back again!"),
("2018-05-05", "18620288", "Gareth", "Beautiful view!!!Lovely apartment.Excellent location.5 mins walk to ferry port  10-15 mins walk to Milsons Point & North Sydney train stations.Local grocery shops  Bars and restaurants 5-10 mins walk also.Would highly recommend this apartment to any prospective booker."),
("2018-05-25", "18620288", "Tristan", "A wonderful place to stay! A beautiful  bright apartment with harbour glimpses. Easy communications with Stephen and a great experience all round."),
("2018-05-28", "18620288", "David", "Fantastic place and location  exceptional service from Stephen  thanks."),
("2018-06-12", "18620288", "Yukie", "It was for my parents to stay and they really enjoyed the view from windows and balcony. Nice quiet area  also convenient location. Everything was in the unit for their stay. Thanks!"),
("2018-06-17", "18620288", "Tina", "Cristy has been a good host providing us with information about tranaportation and restaurants in the neighborhood. the location was quiet and convenient."),
("2018-06-21", "18620288", "KaiChi", "One of the best place i've ever stayed! Beautiful apartment with great location. Very thoughtful on all the small details  will stay again!"),
("2018-06-24", "18620288", "Jaidev", "The view from the apartment is beautiful and it's got everything you need in it. Location is perfect and I'd definitely stay here again the next time we visit Sydney"),
("2018-07-03", "18620288", "Cess", "This place is true to its word of the gorgeous and amazing view from the room! Cleanliness is A Plus and complete amenities!"),
("2018-07-10", "18620288", "Sue", "106 High Street was easy to find and a fantastic location.  We loved having a harbour view and being just a short walk from North shore wharf.  Milsom's wharf was beautiful too  tucked away in a secluded inlet where you could sip coffee  eat and enjoy clear skies and local boat activity. The local theatre had some amazing performances so we did not need to venture far.  Local eateries were of a high standard  although we were glad to find the local Aldi in North Sydney to help out with budget constraints!  We were able to run around Kiribilli and under the Bridge as well as over it.  A beautiful city and very pleased we stayed on this side. Stephen was very helpful and was on hand to ensure our stay was memorable. Many thanks from us UK visitors."),
("2018-07-15", "18620288", "Cherylee", "A gorgeous apartment exactly like the photos. Sparkling clean and easily accessible to the ferry  great local parks for the kids  relaxing yacht club  cafes and Luna Park."),
("2018-07-18", "18620288", "John", "Simply Amazing. Great location  only a short walk from public transportation. Has a great local market right around the corner and a short distance from an amazing view of Sydney’s best sights. Clean  comfortable and relaxing. Couldn’t ask for more for a Sydney get away. "),
("2018-07-25", "18620288", "Peyton", "Great location! Perfect for what we wanted! Train station and ferry within walking distance! Parking spot available for our car. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-08-05", "18620288", "Rosie", "Lovely apartment with views of the harbour and the bridge.  Down the road to the ferry and short distance to trains.  Great location.  Definitely recommend."),
("2018-08-08", "18620288", "Alex", "Lovely quiet place to stay with beautiful views and all the amenities I needed"),
("2018-08-10", "18620288", "Roi", "Was great"),
("2018-08-12", "18620288", "Emma & Gareth", "A great location with views and a clean  tidy and comfortable place to stay very accessible to the city without a car  which is good as the car park is quite tight. "),
("2018-08-20", "18620288", "Jessica", "This property is our Executive's number 1 choice each time he comes to Australia from Europe. For more than a year now. Superb view  fantastic property  and the easiest communication with the host! "),
("2018-08-25", "18620288", "Marek", "Great location and facilities  short walk everywhere. Lift a bonus. Would stay again"),
("2018-09-01", "18620288", "Sandy", "Fabulous place to stay. Views and close to everything. Highly recommend and will be back next time I’m in Sydney"),
("2018-09-17", "18620288", "Annelies", "My parents really enjoyed staying at this air bnb! It’s a very good location  there is a lot of easy transport  there are nice restaurants and bars. The apartment is clean the interior is nice and they really enjoyed the water views! I would definitely recommend this place."),
("2018-09-26", "18620288", "Owen & Judy", "Excellent place to stay in Sydney"),
("2018-09-29", "18620288", "Sam", "Stephen’s place is what is described but location is fantastic.It’s 5 minutes walk to Kirribilli and Harbour Bridge and you don’t need any public transport to move around locally I.e Milsons Point  McMahons point(if you love walking).Quite neighbourhood and fantastic waiter views."),
("2018-10-02", "18620288", "Matthias", "we choose stephens appartment as a base to explore sydney -worked well because of the ferries. next wharf 3 min walk. very nice cafe ( flying bear) in 4 min walk  great tip by cristie  who let us in on our late arrival   11pm.after all a great place to stay!!"),
("2018-10-07", "18620288", "思祺", "地理环境好 性价比很高 是悉尼富人区的生活 周边很安静 走路几分钟就到码头 不到10分钟就到火车站 去市中心就是相隔一桥 极力推荐!"),
("2018-10-11", "18620288", "Yuvraj", "Overall  this is a decent apartment if you're looking to stay in North Sydney.  While quiet and secluded  it's conveniently near regional bus  train  and ferry services. If you're planning to arrive via car  I'd recommend bringing a small one as the parking space is quite small."),
("2018-10-17", "18620288", "Oliver", "Worth place to stay"),
("2018-10-21", "18620288", "Jacob", "Good stay. Ok location  better rent a car for travel"),
("2018-10-22", "18620288", "Jake", "Thank-you :)"),
("2018-10-29", "18620288", "Ninetta", "apartment (number 42) is managed by an agent - Sydney Holiday Rentals. It is clean  nicely furnished and decorated  has a well equipped kitchen and is  located in a quiet area of north Sydney.  It is in an oldish block and is as described on the air bnb site  except for  parking. On phoning the agent to arrange a time to be met at the apartment  we were advised there had recently been difficulties with other residents parking in space 42. So  surprise  surprise when we arrived  yes there was a car in space 42. The agent insisted we park in space 43 instead which belonged to another apartment that sydney holiday rentals also manage.  This was not a full size spot and we had great difficulty fitting our Subaru into the spot. After scraping the side of the car on the adjacent concrete pillar it was obvious this spot was next to useless for all but micro cars. After asking the agent 3 times to contact the building manager in order to locate the owner of the car in spot 42 ( which was a standard sized spot) she very reluctantly went away and made a phone call. Miraculously  the owner materialised within less than 5 minutes and begrudgingly moved her ‘illegally’ parked car.  The agent’s insistence we park elsewhere on the property and her resistance to call the building manger  made us wonder whether apartment 42 does not  despite the literature provided for arrival and the advertising  actually come with parking space 42. So  if you need parking  we suggest you find another apartment.At no point did the agent apologise  either for not being able to deliver on the parking space  nor for arriving 30 minutes late to meet us at the department despite insisting we arrive no later than 4.00.  Unfortunately this experience spoilt our stay."),
("2018-11-15", "18620288", "Wolfgang", "Auf Grund der Lage  Ausstattung und Ausblick unbedingt empfehlenswert"),
("2018-11-25", "18620288", "Mel", "This sunny one bed apartment is in a fabulous location ."),
("2018-11-29", "18620288", "Karishma", "Stephen was prompt with his responses  and even offered us suggestions for a rainy day. The apartment has a great view  location and is definitely worth the price. Note  however  that this isn't like other Airbnbs and is run by a rental management  so lacks a 'personal touch' if you're expecting one. Also  the check-out process is stringent and a little tedious  but wasn't a deal-breaker for us given how nice the place was."),
("2018-12-03", "18620288", "Phuong", "Stephen was extremely prompt in communication before and during our stay. The apartment has a beautiful view of the Sydney Harbour and a very thorough binder of local attractions and ferry schedules."),
("2018-12-05", "18620288", "Ami", "Fantastic views  and a clean  comfortable stay. Thanks!"),
("2018-12-27", "18620288", "Tim", "This apartment is fantastic. Great host  great location  we will definitely be back!"),
("2019-01-03", "18620288", "Elisabeth", "The Apartment is wonderful. We have been there for our last week in Australia and it was a great time. Everything you need is there. The Location is perfect (near trains  buses and ferry) and a short walk from the Harbor Bridge. We would definitely choose the Apartment again  when we come back to Sydney once a time."),
("2019-01-11", "18620288", "Alison", "This apartment is well appointed clean and comfortable. Close to Milsons point train and ferry stations for easy city access.  Parking space is a bonus as you won't need your car but awkward for large cars. Would definitely stay here again."),
("2019-01-18", "18620288", "Riikka", "We enjoyed at our mini holiday in this appartment. Views are amazing! There where everything we needed in this appartment. Neightborhood is bit quiet  but you get easily around by ferry and train."),
("2019-01-24", "18620288", "Jutta", "It was our second time at the apartment.All was very good again.It’s a great place for a few days in Sydney"),
("2017-06-08", "18905958", "Michelle", "Nice place  very neat in a great location  Eric is respectful  great company and makes you feel at home. It was a pleasure to stay here."),
("2017-06-11", "18905958", "Nancy", "Eric was a lovely guy he really was BUT house was filthy  room advertised was the wrong room  got there and he hadn't cleaned the room. Had old bedsheets that someone had just slept in. Dust everywhere  toilet was filthy and when I asked where the towels where he said didn't I bring my own. Said I was fussy because I liked things a certain way. My last night bought me a towel but I had already gone and bought one because first night I had to use a hand towel to shower with. It was freezing with no heating. Really disappointed as I needed a place to chill as I had a few busy days of work in sydney but this made me feel really unsettled and yuck. I told him how air bnb works and he didn't see interested and just kept saying I was fussy. I had someone's cup on the bedside table and yeh it just wasn't great at all. But again nice bloke bad host. "),
("2017-05-28", "18917356", "Bethany", "Matt was an incredible host! He made our stay as stress-free as possible and went above and beyond our expectations! Highly recommend staying with him at his gorgeous apartment! Great location  too!"),
("2017-06-04", "18917356", "Matthew", "Matt’s place really is a gem  it was exactly what I wanted… Clean  Tidy & Spacious. Matt was a great host  really flexible on my check in and out and great to chat to. Location wise it was great giving quick access to the city and walking distance to the bars in Newtown. Totally Recommended."),
("2017-06-17", "18917356", "Viral", "Such a great place. Matt was a great host  the place is so close to city and is super close to public transport and in a very nice neighborhood. Definitely recommend to all."),
("2017-07-08", "18917022", "Graeme", "Right on the waterfront  close to beaches. Everything walkable. A great place to stay"),
("2017-07-12", "18917022", "Jo", "Location is excellent  close to ferry  cafes  swimming and snorkelling. Even on a wet day it was exciting."),
("2017-07-15", "18917022", "Helen", "Rob was great to deal with! Very helpful  friendly and timely - nothing is too much trouble.Clean bedding (like a hotel)  towels and clean bathroom.Photos aren't quite the same as the property. It's quite aged and in need of a good clean or complete renovation."),
("2017-07-21", "18917022", "Nick", "Was very considerate in hard circumstances"),
("2017-08-11", "18917022", "Steven", "Great location but not ideal for a family. 1 small wardrobe  no cooker and very tired and outdated. Needs a good clean and fresh paint."),
("2017-10-15", "18917022", "Phillip", "Cosy home and perfect location"),
("2017-12-17", "18917022", "Harlea And Kellie", "The host canceled this reservation 380 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-02-22", "18917022", "Anne", "This place is not at all what we were expecting from the advertising.It was so unclean (filthy stained carpet and sofa bed  didn't smell nice and obviously previously used bed linen for the spare beds) and small that we had to find alternate accommodation.I'm certainly not a snob and I'm happy to camp but not one of us could bring ourselves to sleep there even just for one night.  So disappointed!  I have used Airbnb previously and was extremely happy with our choice.Only positive was the great location but even that couldn't keep us there."),
("2018-04-08", "18917022", "Eden", "Perfect location!  Loved it!"),
("2018-10-22", "18917022", "Andrea", "Could not ask for a better location. Right on the water  cafe next door  parking and 10 minute walk to Manly Corso and ferry. Rod’s hospitality was fabulous. The room itself is nothing flash  but great value for money and has everything you need. Will definitely be back!"),
("2019-02-02", "18917022", "Erin", "Great stay! Had a great time"),
("2019-02-09", "18917022", "Sebastian", "This place was AMAZING!! 1 bed and 1 sofa bed and 1 rolling bed. The unit is self was clean and 100% as expected. Location Location Location!!! This place is 8 feet from the ocean. It was beautiful to walk outside and go snorkeling with minutes of waking up. Perfect to watch the sunrise with a cup of coffee. On top of that the walk along the ocean to the downtown area was stunning. Seeing the surfers and waves roll in on the walk was nice. It is only a 8 min walk to the main downtown of manly. Rod was awesome and very helpful. He even had a free for our car. 100% will rent again."),
("2017-08-14", "18935312", "Lafras", "The host canceled this reservation 39 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-01-13", "18935312", "Tracy", "Club Cliff was an exceptional property. Great for a family stay in Manly"),
("2014-01-04", "1907162", "Carly", "We had a wonderful relaxing stay at a beach break and lake. The location was great and the apartment was positioned directly between the beach and lake. It was also a very short drive to other nothshore beaches such as whale beach and palm beach. The host Terri was lovely  helpful  and very responsive to any queries.  The next door neighbours were also very friendly and welcoming which made you feel at home. Overall we had a great stay and didn't want to leave!"),
("2014-01-09", "1907162", "Julie", "Teri's apartment was just perfect for our northern beaches holiday.Just a couple of minutes walk to Narrabeen beach  the lake and  cafes. The apartment was clean and very functional. We had a great time!"),
("2017-02-21", "1907162", "Kyoko", "Very quiet and convenient location  Teri was very quick and smooth in communications.  Loves to go back."),
("2019-01-06", "1907162", "Damen", "We stayed at Teri’s place with our 2 young kids - perfect place for families. Pool right out the patio. 2 minute walk to lagoon and kayak hire  4 minute walk to beach. No need for a car (plenty of buses and easy to walk everywhere on the scenic walk path). Lots of good food options / cafes within a 4 minute walk.  Lots of toys /plates / cups for the kids made the stay great for our family."),
("2017-06-20", "19165058", "Charline", "Solange were absent for our staying but their Argentina'housemates were nice. Good place to walk near to oxford street with good cafe and restaurants.We enjoyed our stay in Sydney"),
("2017-06-11", "19197922", "Melanie", "The host canceled this reservation 196 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-06-28", "19197922", "Leigh", "Great apartment with views  Clean and tidyEverything you needed was there"),
("2017-07-10", "19197922", "James", "Good location with everything you need. Would be happy to stay here again. If you're traveling for work and a connection to the internet is necessary I'd recommend bringing a 4G modem  the connection got a little unreliable during peak times. "),
("2017-08-09", "19197922", "Renee", "Lovely place would definitely stay again!"),
("2017-12-01", "19197922", "Dale", "Excellent location with a great view. Brigitte was a very good host."),
("2018-02-09", "19197922", "Lisa", "My daughter Lisa organised us this Airbnb. This review is written in her account:I liked the contact with Brigitte. Flat was tastefully furnished  kitchen appliances and utensils very good. There are lovely palm trees in front of the flat. Unfortunately  the Wifi is very poor  as is the tv with only one channel working. Screens were not fixed so we had lots of mozzies. Sybille and Thomas  parents of Lisa Studach"),
("2018-11-09", "19197922", "Sarah", "Brigitte is easy to communicate with and very hospitable. You need to be comfortable with stairs so not suitable for some travellers."),
("2019-01-13", "19197922", "Heather", "Stayed in Brigette's lovely spacious modern 1 bedroom apartment with sofa bed. Only 20 min walk to the beach and 5 min drive to supermarket so handy for everything in Dee Why."),
("2017-07-09", "19254909", "Melissa", "I nice tidy unit. However  if travelling in winter  just check if a heater is being provided as it gets very cold.Also  if you need a car space  maybe ask if one can be blocked off or reserved for you  as the tenants take up all of the visitor spaces. "),
("2017-08-20", "19254909", "Adrian", "Nice clean apartment that is close to transport and shops."),
("2017-09-08", "19254909", "Robert", "The place was more or less as advertised  however  it was clear that the host did not make a lot of effort to prepare the place for a guest. Everything  from the refirgerator to the bathroom closet was full of her belongings."),
("2017-09-27", "19254909", "해빈", "I booked this place for my parents and they loved this place"),
("2017-10-05", "19254909", "Robert", "Cost little apartment in Randwick  great location for us as we were visiting family nearby. It's also right beside lots of nice shops  restaurants and bars. Perfect for a couple or one individual staying for a couple of days. Shobhna was very good at keeping in touch and responding to my queries before the booking."),
("2018-03-06", "19254909", "Carmen", "Location is close to public transport  shops and restaurants. Overall a very nice stay."),
("2018-08-27", "19254909", "Matthew", "Shobhnas place was clean comfortable and quiet."),
("2018-10-03", "19254909", "Nick & Gill", "The host canceled this reservation 91 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-10-21", "19254909", "Jenna", "We stayed at Shobna’s place for a week. Pros: inside the apartment is nice  newly renovated and modern; location is near to a good pub  bus stop and coffee shop; Shobna was open to a late check out. Cons: the block is a bit run down and has a resident horder on the ground floor  the underground car park does not fit a small van  the hot water runs out quickly in the shower  the bed stoops down in the middle  we were only provided with one front door key (and asked to pay $120 for a second key) which made it difficult given there were two of us; no iron."),
("2017-06-16", "19238057", "Trieu", "Only stay here for one night but wanted to stay longer. Arriving late on Thursday night  we were warmly welcome by the host couple. Daniel and Elena were super hosts I've ever had as they fulfilled beyond our needs  so friendly and generous couple. We were invited to have a late meal with them too and apparently Daniel is a professional chef because the food was just amazing. Thank you isn't enough for these wonderful hosts. A truly enjoyable night. We will surely be back. "),
("2017-06-28", "19238057", "Neshla", "Excelente habitación  muy cerca del transporte público. Elena y Daniel no ayudaron en todo con mucha amabilidad. Totalmente recomendado "),
("2017-06-30", "19238057", "Mohamed Shali", "Daniel and Elena are very nice couple. The place is very clean and the towel is thick and huge. Their hospitality is superb. The supermaket is very near. For those who are driving   you have to beware toll road. It is near to airport but it is a distant to city due to heavy traffic especially motorway.  Overall   we like the place to stay and the couple is very friendly ."),
("2017-07-03", "19238057", "Eva", "We had a great time in this house together with Elena and Daniel. It´s a quiet place only a few walking minutes from wooly and train station away. Parking is possible in the street. We can definetly recommend this place!!!"),
("2017-07-20", "19238057", "Rebecca", "Room is wonderful   clean and tidy.Kitchen have anything you need.Is close train station  by walk around 10minsI'm so glad to meet this guys.Just coming  and you will know what I mean.很開心來到這裡  房東主人 Daniel&Elena很熱情的款待!房間乾淨又整潔 廚房什麼東西都有｡用走的只要10分鐘左右即可到達火車站希望下一次有時間可以在過來住;)"),
("2017-07-28", "19238057", "Pip", "Really enjoyed your hospitality and company. Nice to see a happy couple. Wish you well in your Airbnb. Great value for money."),
("2017-08-08", "19238057", "Johnny", "Great   very Nice people   all shop in padstow   30 minutes to cbd"),
("2017-08-12", "19238057", "Natalie", "It was really good staying with Elena and Daniel so we decided to stay again!"),
("2017-08-19", "19238057", "Simon", "Great stay  great communication. Very much appreciated guys :)"),
("2017-08-22", "19238057", "Natalie", "This was a third and final time with Daniel and Elena. Great hosts  would highly recommend  very friendly and always up for a chat. Thanks for having us!!"),
("2017-08-25", "19238057", "Pascal", "Thank you so much (: I really enjoyed it"),
("2017-08-27", "19238057", "Blandine", "We really enjoyed our stay at Daniel & Elena 's ! the house is really great  with everything you could need  the room is perfect and the bathroom as well ! Close to the train station to the city and the airportWe really recommend this place"),
("2017-08-30", "19238057", "P", "The place is valuable  comfortable with around shops & restaurants. Not far from the train station and bus stops. And be a quiet place!"),
("2017-09-09", "19238057", "Kien", "Daniel and Elena are great hosts. Because of some reasons  I booked my stayed at very last minute. They were still able to set up a check in for me tho both were busy. The house is nice and clean. Everyone in the house is also friendly. "),
("2017-09-12", "19238057", "SoHyeon", "We saw them briefly  but Elena tried to help us. Thanks."),
("2017-09-21", "19238057", "Pip", "This is my second visit with Daniel and Elena.  Great place and great value.  I recommend it to everyone."),
("2017-10-03", "19238057", "星妍", "房东人特别好"),
("2017-10-28", "19238057", "Elisabeth", "Sehr nette Gastgeber."),
("2017-11-08", "19238057", "Lauren", "Daniel and Elena's place was lovely. Perfect for what we needed  outside of the city  away from all the traffic. Their home is set in a quiet residential area with easy walking distance to Woolworths and plenty of eateries. Daniel & Elena are wonderful hosts who make you feel at home. Prompt communication and they allowed us to check in at 11am which was very helpful. Would definitely recommend staying here if your looking for something a bit cheaper than Sydney prices."),
("2017-11-16", "19238057", "Mohammed", "Very good suburb  nice hosts  close to transport"),
("2017-11-28", "19238057", "Robert", "A serviceable place to spend the night  but overall very average.  We wished the ventilation was better - the night we stayed it was a little hot.  We had a small fan  but we never got comfortable.  Daniel seemed like a good guy  but he rushed through the walkthrough of the space.  The neighborhood was fine  and it was quiet at night."),
("2017-12-22", "19238057", "Jake", "Nice place to stay  if you need anything the hosts are more than happy to help out."),
("2018-01-04", "19238057", "Jenny", "Daniel & Elena are lovely hosts  they are very helpful and their home was perfect for our time in Sydney! Our room was very nice and comfortable  the kitchen is well equipped and the bathroom was more than we wished for as well. If I ever come back to Sydney I would love to stay at their place again."),
("2018-01-14", "19238057", "Vania", "We stayed really comfortable to Elena and Daniel ‘s place.Was nice to meet their as host   they are such a good people and very helpful for everything."),
("2018-02-01", "19238057", "Daniella", "The location could have been a bit closer to the tourist areas we wanted to visit. The train rides were longer then anticipated in listing. The train station was a bit of a walk with heavy luggage’s. But overall the area was quiet and  House was very comfortable and clean.  Daniel and Elena were very nice and respectful."),
("2018-03-03", "19238057", "Jason", "Great place to stay  the hosts are wonderful friendly people with a lovely home"),
("2018-03-30", "19238057", "Samantha", "I had an amazing tine staying at Daniel and Elenas and would recommend it to anyone! If you are looking to stay in Sydney. Choose this beautiful place! A special thank you to the host Lynne! She was amazing  thoughtful  kind and caring. She looked after me like I was a member of the family! Thank you so much to you all for taking so good care of me :) (Phone number hidden by Airbnb)"),
("2018-04-25", "19238057", "Fische", "It is clean  not far from the city  close to train station. Comfortable room with nice people. A lady who also stays in the house is very nice  so friendly and took care of us a lot."),
("2018-05-07", "19238057", "Tina", "Daniel heeft ons erg gastvrij ontvangen. De kamer is ruim en het bed is erg goed  ook voor lange mensen. Het station is op loopafstand en met de trein ben je in een half uurtje in hartje Sydney. Met een auto ben je snel in de natuurgebieden rondom de stad.De badkamer en keuken hadden iets schoner gemogen  maar dat kwam misschien omdat Elena er niet was en Daniel erg veel moest werken."),
("2018-05-11", "19238057", "Kiki", "地點位於安靜住宅區 離市區有段距離但停車方便 Daniel and Elena 給我們很足夠的私人空間 不打擾房客且讓我們很安心使用屋內資源｡"),
("2018-05-17", "19238057", "Nina", "Großes Haus in einer ruhigen Umgebung. Alles was man braucht ist leicht zu Fuß zu erreichen. Um in die Innenstadt zu kommen muss man allerdings etwas zeit einplanen. Aber insgesamt eine schöne Unterkunft mit sehr freundlichen Gastgebern!"),
("2018-05-19", "19238057", "Chelsea", "Really nice house  simple room  unfortunately we weren't able to be super social as we had a very short busy stay  but the time we had with Daniel and Elena was very short but they were both very friendly and approachable  would totally stay again!"),
("2018-05-29", "19238057", "Margaret", "Close to shops  public transport  and eateries!"),
("2018-06-16", "19238057", "Pete", "Lovely place  about an hour train journey to the main parts of the city. Pleasant area and very close to the train station. The house and room is always kept clean and they are lovely people!"),
("2018-06-18", "19238057", "Tom", "Can’t recommend enough  lovely clean space run by lovely people. Very accommodating for our check in/out. Wish this place was available in every city! About 6/7 mins walk from Padstow station which is on the airport line."),
("2018-07-11", "19238057", "SHreya AMatya", "Great place to stay Affordable Quite"),
("2018-07-17", "19238057", "Thao", "The house is near Padstow station which is very convenient to get around and easy to find. The space was clean  tidy and organized. There was a heater in the room. The hosts were very responsive to messages and happy to help. A couple who stayed in the room next door were so nice and friendly. They also suggested some great places to visit. Would highly recommend."),
("2018-11-13", "19238057", "Jaspal", "very nice clean tidy house felt like My own house close to market and of course station wow  will love to book it again on my next trip thanks guys"),
("2018-12-30", "19238057", "Krishni", "A great place with very convenient location and Daniel & Elena were friendly and great hostesses. They even agreed to keep our bags after we checked out until we watched the NYE fireworks and come.Thank you Daniel & Elena!!"),
("2019-01-07", "19238057", "Luana", "Daniel y Elena fueron muy acogedores  siempre dispuestos a ayudar. La casa está bien equipada  tiene buena ubicación  a menos de 10 minutos caminando a Padstow station  a una hora de CBD aprox en tren."),
("2019-01-10", "19238057", "Hai", "great place to stay at Sydney for a very affordable price."),
("2019-01-13", "19238057", "Peggy", "Our stay at Daniels and Elenas house was very good. Everything was clean  both were supernice and welcoming and we also enjoyed meeting the other guests that stayed there. Can recommend it!"),
("2019-01-16", "19238057", "승주", "The weather was so hot that I reserved an air conditioner house  but there was no air conditioner in the room.and an air conditioner in the kitchen. But the air conditioner broke down and I couldn't use it.But the rest of the facility was fine."),
("2019-02-16", "19238057", "Nobby", "It was like a home away from home. We went there for a one stay but extended more than one month. Daniel and Eliena were so friendly. we would recommend this place for anyone. Train station is just stones throw away."),
("2019-02-18", "19238057", "Karina", "It was a great stay!"),
("2017-07-10", "19270950", "Tammy", "Great location and good facilities  would stay again in the future"),
("2017-07-26", "19270950", "Fran", "Good places to stay  the one issue that arose was dealt with quickly & effectively. Would stay again."),
("2017-07-27", "19270950", "Lv", "不错的房子 性价比很高 推荐给大家 还会再来的"),
("2017-08-01", "19270950", "Faye", "good"),
("2017-08-15", "19270950", "Paul", "Walking distance to Green Square station."),
("2017-08-24", "19270950", "子尧", "交通十分便利 离coles步行就好 还有挺多美食店 房东很热情 回复问题也很耐心 很开心的一次入住~"),
("2017-08-26", "19270950", "Maira", "Great cosy apartment. Home owners were great to communicate with and were attentive with our requests. Would recommend to anyone wanting to stay close to the city."),
("2017-09-04", "19270950", "Jade&Najib", "Convenient location"),
("2017-09-10", "19270950", "Amal", "Will was very polite and accommodating. Thank you"),
("2017-09-18", "19270950", "Daniel", "A wonderful placd to stay   very clean and modrn apartment with a convenience store about 50 meteres away on ground level its worth a stay and a very quiet area too. If i get the chance i would return"),
("2017-09-23", "19270950", "David", "Apartment was as advertised and have great facilities like a gym and pool. The location is great because it's a walking distance to the shops and cafes."),
("2017-10-09", "19270950", "Rich", "great apartment"),
("2017-10-14", "19270950", "Yi-Duan", "....."),
("2017-11-25", "19270950", "Adly", "Good location. Clean space and comfy for four people."),
("2017-12-02", "19270950", "Leonie", "This apartment is as described. It is air conditioned  clean and well presented  close to transport  and with dedicated parking should you require it. It is also convenient walking distance to a wide variety of restaurants and close to the East Village shopping centre. We would happily return when next we are visiting Sydney."),
("2017-12-31", "19270950", "Anna-Karin", "A modern and functional apartment in a cool area of Sydney. Close to train station  restaurants and a big food store. "),
("2018-02-11", "19270950", "Sam", "Nice modern place with a sunny balcony"),
("2018-03-12", "19270950", "Clint", "Great comms  lovely place and location"),
("2018-04-02", "19270950", "Li", "Good accommodation!Near bus stop and colesVery convenient!"),
("2018-05-04", "19270950", "Lamees", "The location was great. The host was helpful and accommodating. The apartment had basic furniting."),
("2018-05-27", "19270950", "Bru", "Nice clean apartment in a secure building. Close to the shops and the city. Great for extended stays. Hosts are very responsive and even gave us an early check in."),
("2018-06-17", "19270950", "Shana", "Lovely stay  close to train station in Green Square  very responsive to my messages and communicated everything well to us. Would definitely stay again. :)"),
("2018-06-26", "19270950", "Nina", "地理位置很好.很方便~"),
("2018-07-20", "19270950", "Olya", "I like this house very much"),
("2018-08-16", "19270950", "Doris", "挺好的房间"),
("2018-09-14", "19270950", "Yuankun", "非常简洁舒爽的房间 安静而且设施齐全｡"),
("2018-10-01", "19270950", "John", "Great place and fairly convenient location close to the supermarket n small eateries. Host is communicative n accommodating"),
("2018-11-06", "19270950", "Beverley", "You can be confident that you will get exactly what you booked. It's a nice clean  well-lit apartment suitable for 1 or 2 people staying for a month or more. Both the heating and the air-conditioning work well. Bed and sofa are comfortable. Balcony and windows on 3 sides give good flow of fresh air. No traffic noise and only ocassional noise from works yard next door. However  when the weather got better the basket-ball court in the square was used non-stop from 7 am to 10 pm on weekends and many weekdays (mostly students)."),
("2018-11-09", "19270950", "Marvyn", "Nice accommodations"),
("2018-11-10", "19270950", "Jay", "Host was very attentive  quick and helpful with responses. Amenities were great and easy to access. Kitchen was underwhelming and fairly empty (cups  plates etc.). Overall a good and cost efficient stay."),
("2018-11-17", "19270950", "Abbey", "Sparkling clean and comfortable apartment. Convenient location with bus stops  supermarkets and restaurants nearby and Green Square station a 20 minute walk away. We had difficulties opening the seized up key safe - if this happens to you just keep jiggling it!"),
("2018-11-22", "19270950", "Daniel", "great apartment"),
("2018-11-22", "19270950", "Mark", "Great place to stay at. Neat and tidy and not far from the city."),
("2019-02-02", "19270950", "William", "Great location  a short walk to Green Square station and the nearby shopping centre. I would stay here again given the chance. Make sure to read through the house rules thoroughly  they aren't unreasonable but there are a lot of them."),
("2019-02-20", "19270950", "Cristina", "Great location. The flat is very spacious and well stocked with a lot of facilities. The check in and check out process had been smooth."),
("2017-08-06", "19348489", "Mehrab", "We stayed in Isabelle's apartment for one month. We found Isabelle hospitable and thoughtful. Her beautiful studio was so clean and we enjoyed its amazing sunlight  great view and location (close to open spaces  CBD  cafes and restaurants). In short  this experience increased our expectations regarding a place to stay in Sydney!"),
("2018-01-07", "19348489", "Felix", "We love the studio. Very comfortable  clean and convenient to major tourist locations. Isabelle answers all questions promptly and is very accommodating. We highly recommend stating here."),
("2018-01-28", "19348489", "Felix", "Great location. Both residential and touristy with many shops around. We could walk nearly everywhere and if we were tired the train and buses are right near the house. Make sure to have coffee at La Douce France right near the house. The studio is very comfortable  sunny and fully equipped."),
("2018-02-10", "19348489", "Frank", "Isabelle was extremely communicative throughout the entire stay. The location and space was great and I thoroughly enjoyed my time there. Would definitely recommend to anyone looking at booking."),
("2018-08-05", "19348489", "Шамиль", "Everything was great  I really enjoyed my stay in Sydney. Thank so much to Isabelle."),
("2019-01-12", "19348489", "Jonathan", "Isabelle's place is cosy and in a great location with leafy Rushcutter's Bay Park on one side and bustling King's Cross on the other. There are lots of places to eat nearby and the two major supermarkets are not too far away. It's nicely decorated  airy  the bathroom is relatively new and the internet is really quick."),
("2017-07-13", "19376053", "Xinying", "A warming and cleaning house  it is convenient for walking to city. Andrew is a friendly guy as well. "),
("2017-08-08", "19376053", "Phạm", "Great place"),
("2017-08-16", "19376053", "Martin", "Great location in Chippendale  which is very lively and nice. It is also close to  Redfern  which we found very nice and romantic. The apartment is ideal for people who want to be part of the city life as it is  close to the railway station. Furthermore the circular quai can be reached on foot in half an hour. We will definitely go back."),
("2017-08-19", "19376053", "Soledad", "Such a nice apartment   great location close to the starion . Great communication with the host ."),
("2017-08-20", "19376053", "Duncan", "This is a great central location. We spent the night as we were attending the rugby at ANZ stadium. Station was close by and convenient. I appreciated the opportunity to stay. My wife  brother and sister in law were very comfortable."),
("2017-08-23", "19376053", "Zoe", "Andrew's place was exactly like described. It's clean  bright  well-equipped  and spacious for 4. We really enjoyed our stay. Will definitely recommend Andrew's place to everyone who's staying in Sydney. Great value!"),
("2017-08-27", "19376053", "Sarah", "Fantastic!"),
("2017-09-03", "19376053", "Blanca", "Andrew's apartment is very nice and close to everything!"),
("2017-09-16", "19376053", "Richard", "Great experience to live this area which is so convenient to the City. U can get all u wanna. Thanks for professional service  Andrew "),
("2017-09-17", "19376053", "Jessica", "Large  clean  spacious apartment. Very accommodating."),
("2017-09-21", "19376053", "Echo", "Really nice apartment! Clean and well organised. Just five minute walk to the train station  very convenient! Air conditioner works perfectly! Also  good conversation with Andrew. Amazing experience!"),
("2017-09-28", "19376053", "Yujeong", "깨끗하고 위치좋은 숙소입니다. 호스트분이 커뮤니케이션이 잘 되고 친절합니다. 기차역  CBD와 가까우며 근처에 큰 마트  식당 등 편의시설이 많습니다. 특히  걸어서 10분 정도 거리에 한인타운이 있기때문에  특별히 한국분들에게 추천하고 싶은 숙소입니다."),
("2017-10-05", "19376053", "Jack", "Everything in Andrew's apartment was perfect. He made it clean and sweet. The location was superb  less than 5 mins walk to UTS and Central. Plenty of restaurants and supermarkets near by. Andrew had some excellent taste in wine. If you're into Australian wine then definitely have a chat with Andrew."),
("2017-10-06", "19376053", "Hua", "多收钱"),
("2017-10-16", "19376053", "Liv", "Andrew's place was perfect for our two night stay. We were in Sydney for a short trip and found Andrew's apartment to be in an excellent location  well presented and furnished with everything we needed. We particularly enjoyed dinner down Spice Alley and it was handy to have coffee  public transport and the supermarket all within a 3 minute walk."),
("2017-10-22", "19376053", "文龙", "一次非常不错的体验 房子的地点很好 干净 整洁 房东Andrew人很好 虽然未曾谋面 但仍能感受到他的热情｡这是一次值得回味的体验!"),
("2017-10-25", "19376053", "Aspasiya", "Great apartment in a great location! I would definitely recommend Andrew's apartment to anyone visiting Sydney. The space is large and clean and walking distance to Central station. There are taxis always passing outside and it Uber's arrived very quickly also. You are always getting two bedrooms which is very good value. Andrew is extremely responsive and provides all the information that you will require. I wouldn't hesitate to stay again. Thanks Andrew!"),
("2017-11-11", "19376053", "Carole", "Excellent and super convenient location. The facility of this apartment is pretty nice. The communication with Andrew before checkin was very smooth and helpful."),
("2017-11-19", "19376053", "Lucky", "We really like this apartment! Clean and bright  same as in the photo! Mr Andrew is easy to communicate. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-11-25", "19376053", "Jass", "Great location and space. Beds were comfortable!"),
("2017-12-09", "19376053", "Sarah", "The apartment was great - clean and had everything we needed. It’s located in an area where you have everything at your door step and a short few mins walk to the central train station made getting around so much easier. We had some weather issues with our flight on arrival but Andrew and his team were very accommodating with our check in. Would definitely stay again."),
("2017-12-13", "19376053", "Carmen", "Andrew’s place is very convenient to access around as a first time visitor in Sydney  it’s about 5-10mins walk to Central station  Central Park Mall is very close by  you can get most essentials there. There’s cafe and restaurant within walking distance.  Andrew’s place is neat and tidy  very well equipped.  I would recommend this to any visitors and remember to book early."),
("2017-12-16", "19376053", "Ashleigh", "Great location  clean and tidy place  defiantly worth the money !"),
("2017-12-18", "19376053", "Carmen", "This is the 2nd time I stay at Andrew’s place  it fits my purpose of stay. The neighbourhood is convenient and safe to travel around."),
("2018-01-02", "19376053", "Tayne", "Brilliant apartment  and a fantastic host. We greatly enjoyed our stay  the apartment was clean  well furnished and wonderfully located."),
("2018-01-13", "19376053", "Ross", "Andrews place was great  superb location and lovely apartment. Would very much recommend for anyone in staying in Sydney for break!"),
("2018-01-21", "19376053", "Withchild", "집 규모와 구조는 좋았어요...그런데 차도 옆 2층이라 문을 열어 놓으면 자동차 소음이 심하고 닫으면 에어컨이 없어 더운 날씨에는 집이 좀 덥고 습했어요...또 저흰 초등생이 2명이 있었는데...매일 일정 시작전에 1km정도를 걷고 시작을 해서 좀 힘들어했어요...왕복이면 2km는 매일 일정과 상관 없이 꼬박...- -;; 그리고 무엇보다 바퀴벌레가 출몰해서 와이프와 아이들이 기겁을...욕실 하수구에서 직접... 나오는 것도 봤다네요...- -;; 또 특이하게 소방 싸이렌이 오작동을 2번이나 몇 시간 동안 해서 저희를 과롭혔어요... 그래도 성인 여행자들이면 넓고 잘 구비된 시설들에 충분히 교통걱정 안 하고도 다닐만한 숙소입니다...저희처럼 자녀 둔 가족과는 좀 맞았을 뿐이예요..."),
("2018-02-03", "19376053", "Simon", "Trevlig lägenhet nära mysigt och myllrande restaurangområde. Alla faciliteter man kan behöva och gångavstånd till stan."),
("2018-02-08", "19376053", "Liping", "The apartment is really great and has everything we need. The stay is enjoyable. Andrew is a nice host."),
("2018-02-13", "19376053", "Lucky", "This is our second time staying here. Very nice apartment. highly recommended!"),
("2018-02-16", "19376053", "Ningyi", "Andrew的房子地理位置很好 在UTS附近 第一个路口下去就有一个大商场 里面有Woolworth超市 离central station也很近 直走大约几分钟 Chinatown､darling harbour､QVB等都在步行范围｡入住也很方便 房间里很干净｡只是临街 晚上车经过声音很大 没有空调 只有空调扇 2月的天气还是蛮热的｡其它都挺好的 Andrew回复消息很快 谢谢｡"),
("2018-02-26", "19376053", "Tatiana", "Great place - would definitely go again."),
("2018-03-02", "19376053", "나라", "It is spacious and well-equipped! Good~!"),
("2018-03-05", "19376053", "Constantine", "Convenient and a great place for a short trip."),
("2018-03-10", "19376053", "Linna", "The apartment is near the central station(about 10min (Website hidden by Airbnb) is clean and tidy."),
("2018-03-22", "19376053", "Maria", "The apartment is spacious and you will find everything you need to cook in the kitchen. It's very close to public transportation  which was a plus but at the same time it gets noisy from the street traffic. There's no AC  only 2 fans (one big and one small) so we had to open the windows to get some fresh air (the apartment was smelly when we checked-in). One of the rooms has no windows which was good when you're jetlag as it gets really dark. Both beds were very comfortable.Communication with Andrew was always good and he responded right away. We had some hiccups checking-in (apparently the doorbell was not working  so we had to wait outside the building for 20 minutes).There are several restaurants walking distance  and you should definitely check Spice Alley and try a couple of their restaurants."),
("2018-03-23", "19376053", "Elliot", "Great location near central station and great bars and restaurants. Apartment was very stylish and communication with host was excellent. Also price worked out very good value for four people."),
("2018-03-29", "19376053", "Shintaro", "ｾﾝﾄﾗﾙ駅徒歩5分｡ﾊﾞｽ乗り場も近く､どこに行くにも便利な立地｡子供2人の家族4人で滞在｡ｷｯﾁﾝはｷﾚｲで冷蔵庫も大きく1週間ほどの滞在に最適でした｡洗濯機､乾燥機あり｡物干し台も有ります｡室内も清潔ですごしやすいです｡できればﾄｲﾚが2つあればもっと良かったです!ありがとうございました!"),
("2018-04-14", "19376053", "Tamsin", "Great venue  comfortable  well resourced and handy for travel amd food."),
("2018-04-29", "19376053", "Lara", "Andrew’s apartment is so central for going out in the city. The rooms were clean and spacious. Andrew was so helpful to deal with leading up to our stay and very understanding about changing our check in time. Highly recommend staying here!"),
("2018-05-01", "19376053", "Hong", "really nicr apartment and near the central station｡ clean and tidy house. enough for four people live"),
("2018-05-19", "19376053", "Megan", "Andrew's place was perfect for a group of 4 traveling to Sydney. There were so many great places to eat like Spice Alley and countless cafes for breakfast or lunch. The proximity to the Central Park Mall and the Central station was so convenient. The local tips were great. We already want to plan a trip back to Sydney!"),
("2018-05-27", "19376053", "Joe", "We found it a great location for exploring Sydney  right next to central station. We thought it could use a little TLC to fix a few little things  and found the main bedroom a bit noisy from the traffic at night. Andrew was very easy to communicate with throughout. No major issues overall but felt the photos made the flat appear better than it was in person."),
("2018-06-02", "19376053", "Bonnie", "The location is convenient and the host is nice. But we could hear some noise from the bar across our apartment at night."),
("2018-06-03", "19376053", "Pei-Syuan", "Nice place  good to stay a couple days. Thanks "),
("2018-06-06", "19376053", "Haruka", "Communication was great  Andrew’s place was clean  stylish and in a great location. "),
("2018-06-13", "19376053", "Binary", "the apartment is near the train station. Convenient and clean. everything we needed are all provided."),
("2018-06-20", "19376053", "Susan", "We love this apartment. The location is amazing  near to main train station and we can even walk to harbour area. There’s great eating places and supermarkets nearby  around 5-10 mins walk. Even a shopping mall 15-20 mins walk. The apartment is very clean  comfortable  and comes with all the amenities needed for our stay. The wifi is strong and was great for us. Andrew is a great host and we had no problems at all checking in and out . He gives very clear information. He’s even left some tips on some great places to eat and buy stuffs. Thanks so much Andrew !"),
("2018-07-15", "19376053", "Radek", "Andrew's apartment was great and in the middle of a lively neighborhood with many great restaurants & few bars  close to shopping and Central Train station! The apartment was very quiet and we enjoyed our walk around the area as we toured Sydney. I would highly recommend his apartment to anyone visiting Sydney and would come back anytime! Thank You!"),
("2018-07-22", "19376053", "Tracy", "The landlord is very enthusiastic. We have informed them all the matters needing attention before we go  so we can check in very quickly and conveniently when we arrive. The house is located in the downtown area. It is easy to get to the downtown attractions. There is a central railway station nearby and it is convenient to go farther."),
("2018-08-25", "19376053", "格式設計", "The apartment is so wonderful for traveler to stay."),
("2018-09-02", "19376053", "Jasmine", "Nice place and good location. We stayed with our family. I recommend to stay:-)"),
("2018-09-13", "19376053", "Amber", "Great place near the trains! Would stay again"),
("2018-09-16", "19376053", "Lan-Anh", "Thanks for being the best host I’ve ever met! Communication was quick and easy! Everything is as stated on his advertisement - in fact  you received even more than you expect! Andrew has this little cheat sheet that he provides that has FAQs and local tips such as nearby restaurants and directions to important places. The apartment was stunning! I’ve been to Sydney before and no host has been better than Andrew. Water pressure is strong and amazing (from experience I’ve always experienced showers have a little drizzle coming out from the shower head). One of the reasons I chose this place was the kitchen. There’s a full kitchen and woolies is right around the corner so it’s great to shop and cook up some midnight snacks. 10/10 would recommend!!!!"),
("2018-09-28", "19376053", "Heidi", "Convenient  clean and spacious."),
("2018-09-29", "19376053", "William", "Great place  very close to the heart of the CBD  quick replies from the host and the whole experience was as easy as I could’ve hoped for."),
("2018-10-03", "19376053", "琳", "房间位置非常好 交通方便 离central火车站走路10分钟就能到 周边商场超市餐饮也很齐全｡对面Queen St左侧除8点半到17点之外时间可以免费停车 路边也有免费分时停车位"),
("2018-10-05", "19376053", "Bruce", "Very central location to UTS  USyd and UNDS. Nice big space and well equipped."),
("2018-10-15", "19376053", "Patricia", "Fabulous apartment . Spacious and stylish. Would highly recommend to anyone visiting Sydney. A tip! Visit Spice Alley for food. Only a few minutes walk."),
("2018-10-25", "19376053", "Zhiyu", "Great location and nice place to stay  would definitely recommend to anyone staying near central station"),
("2018-11-05", "19376053", "Nissa", "Andrew was great host  very responsive with queries... The location was good  easy access to supermarket  Chinatown and transportation. The apartment is facing a main street so bit of noise factor..."),
("2018-11-20", "19376053", "Sally", "."),
("2018-11-21", "19376053", "Catalina", "Perfect location close to everything  train station just few minutes walking  very big  modern and clean place perfect for a good rest after a long day in Sydney. Everything you need  free coffee and tea  nice balcony  very comfortable beds. We would definitely recommend this place and come back again. Thanks Andrew."),
("2018-11-25", "19376053", "Berry", "Location is great. Very close to central but if you're a light sleeper than avoid it because of the main road next to the apartment. Lots of noise at night"),
("2018-12-01", "19376053", "Jessica", "A perfect appartment in the center of the city  close by central station and with a very helpfull host.  We had a wonderful time here and if we come back we will definitely hope we we can return to this appartment."),
("2018-12-06", "19376053", "Angela", "Bright and airy Accommodation 10in walk to main central station ( links airports  blue mountains and more).  Used lock box to access property  details were emailed time prior to stay. Would be more than happy to stay at Andrews place again when I return to Sydney."),
("2018-12-10", "19376053", "Shane", "This apartment is perfectly located  with easy access to public transport  amazing food spots (you MUST go to Spice Alley for dinner and finish with dessert at Koi)  bars  restaurants and the city itself. Andrew is an excellent communicator who responds quickly  and the check in process is super easy. I would recommend this as a great spot to base yourself and go exploring all that Sydney has to offer."),
("2018-12-16", "19376053", "Fenta", "Andrew’s place is beyond my expectation. Me and my family really enjoy our stay. The location is good. It is really suite for someone who stay with family."),
("2018-12-22", "19376053", "Harry", "Great place in a fantastic location!"),
("2018-12-27", "19376053", "Lisanne", "An appartement at a perfect location  really beautiful and good communication with the owner. I highly recommend it."),
("2019-01-02", "19376053", "Kristen", "Andrew's place corresponds completely to the advertisement. Communication with Andrew was very easy and timely.The only caveat I might add is that  as is indicated in the description  the apartment has two fans  but no AC. We stayed there during a fairly intense part of Sydney summer and we roasted. The flip side is that the double doors to the balconies kept the noise out completely. So in winter (or in milder seasons)  it's a quiet (and more temperate) place to stay!"),
("2019-01-13", "19376053", "Julianne", "super clean flat and Andrew is alwaus answering your questions very fast. the location is perfect to discover the city"),
("2019-02-20", "19376053", "Carole", "good location and apartment. Help us enjoy our trip very much"),
("2014-01-02", "1950395", "Carolan", "Debbie and David have a beautiful house which we enjoyed thoroughly while visiting Sydney.  Plenty of space  fantastic kitchen and lovely pool and garden area for barbecues.  Very close to Manly for ferry trips to Sydney  but Manly itself was a big hit with us.  Definitely best beach according to our girls.  We can't recommend this house highly enough and will definitely be back. Thank you to both.  Great hosts!!"),
("2016-12-30", "1950395", "Jo", "This is a fantastic family home in a beautiful part of Sydney. Great views  excellent outdoor decks and the perfect size pool.  Beds were very comfortable and the linen was of a good quality.  Plenty of a space for a family or in our case multi generational family.  Great coffee shop and local shops nearby although I would suggest you need a car to access restaurants and major shops.Kitchen is well stocked with everything you need.Very comfortable family home."),
("2017-01-07", "1950395", "小米", "excellent exprience in debbie's house!"),
("2016-08-18", "1944996", "Osz", "Had a pleasant stay at this apartment. Did not get to meet Annie personally but she was easily contactable and was very helpful with any questions or enquiries. Overall a good experience."),
("2016-08-22", "1944996", "Louisa", "The apartment was great  just like the photos. It was lovely to have the balcony too - it gave a sense of space. Furnishings were very comfortable. We cooked most nights and the kitchen had everything we needed but we were very central to many restaurants if we wanted. Highly recommend."),
("2016-09-11", "1944996", "Michael", "We come to Sydney every month for work – and this is the best Airbnb we've stayed in yet. Will definitely be back! :)"),
("2016-09-28", "1944996", "Esther", "The location of this apartment is convenient to get to the CBD and there are great eateries around. The apartment is just like the photos  makes you feel welcomed and comfortable. Annie was easy to contact and communicate with and she was very friendly. We had some problems with the front door lock but Annie was very helpful and responded to our need quickly. Highly recommend staying in this apartment."),
("2016-10-06", "1944996", "Jacqueline", "I had a fantastic time staying in this studio apartment on Surry Hills. Annie met me early morning on a Saturday to hand over the keys  she was helpful in giving a quick introduction to the area. I had a silly issue with locking the door and she was quick in responding. The apartment is very nice  it is within a secure complex  light-filled  nicely decorated and had a nice little balcony. Location-wise it is extremely convenient (15 minute walk to CBD) and the area had a lot of bars and eateries. Apartment also came with wifi and Netflix! What more can you ask for. I definitely would recommend staying here. "),
("2016-10-10", "1944996", "Jayden", "Had a fantastic weekend at Annie's apartment.  She met us at the apartment and had a quick chat about what was in the surrounding areas.  Apartment is clean  just like the photos and close proximity to a lot of cool lunch spots and nightlife.Would definitely recommend staying here."),
("2016-10-16", "1944996", "Kathy", "Annie was very helpful with accomodating our early check in and provided plenty of information about the neighbourhood. The listing was clean  had a great location as everything was only a 20min walk away and provided plenty of entertainment/amenities for when we wanted to stay in. Overall  pristine listing and great host!"),
("2016-10-22", "1944996", "Fran", "We LOVED staying at Annie's place! And would definitely stay here again. She was very welcoming and accomodating with our check in time when our flight was delayed. The apartment is clean  bright  comfortable and is in a great location! We walked into town everyday and to the harbour bridge/ opera house from the apartment easily (25 min walk). I would highly recommend this place!"),
("2016-10-27", "1944996", "Steven", "Annie was awesome  very welcoming and communicated very well."),
("2016-11-15", "1944996", "Stephane", "We stayed 6 nights in Annie's flat.Communication with Annie was efficient. Annie was very helpful and accommodated our arriving time.Her flat is authentic and very nice to live in. It is very close to all transportation and at a reasonable walking distance from Sydney CBD. The neighbourhood have all you need and a excellent choice of eateries.We definitely recommend Annie's appartement for holidays in Sydney!"),
("2016-11-19", "1944996", "Ying", "We loved Annie's place. The location was great; close to eateries - lovely coffee located at every turn - and Oxford St is just around the corner. If you're driving  parking is mad though - most parking spots are either 1 or 2hr max without the need for tickets (and paid parking is quite dear) and you only get a rest after 10pm when parking rules don't apply anymore (mind you  some are midnight  so read those parking signs carefully) - and before you know it  you're back up moving your car again in the morning around 9am/10am  depending where you've parked.  There are a few nice spots where parking on the weekend is free  but they are hard to come by.  Annie's place is close to most attractions  so you don't really need a car. Suggest that you save the trouble and Uber around - it's quite reasonable. "),
("2016-11-23", "1944996", "Brent", "Wonderful  centrally-located amazing studio!"),
("2016-12-02", "1944996", "Paul", "Where do I start? The neighbourhood is first class. During our seven day stay  we had brunch in one of Surry hills many quaint little cafes every morning  each no farther than a 5 minute walk. The food was incredible as was the coffee. You're two minutes away from an awesome little wine bar on crown street. Bus stops are a short walk away which take you to Bondi Beach in minutes and Central Station is a ten minute walk where we took an train to the Blue Mountains  (recommend that). The apartment itself is excellent. Really cosy  clean and tidy (with Netflix too if you've had an active day). I'm really pleased with our stay and would thoroughly recommend  it! Look no further!!"),
("2016-12-12", "1944996", "Antti", "Annie's place was all in all excellent. I would recommend staying here in Surry Hills rather than the busy CBD which is still only a nice 15 min stroll away. Recommended for anyone looking for a place in Sydney."),
("2016-12-17", "1944996", "Kim", "Annie  her contemporary loft + the local flavor of the SH neighborhood were all fantastic...a perfect pad for our 4 days in Sydney. We loved her  designer sensibility and our access to everything. Annie was responsive and thoughtful - providing everything to suit a traveler's needs. Thank you for a wonderful first-time visit !Kim + Vida "),
("2017-02-12", "1944996", "Mark", "This is a compact and stylish apartment in an attractively lively area  with a bookshop below and Circular Quay about half an hours walk away. Annie is very friendly  communicated very well in advance and met me on arrival to show me around. This is a great place to stay for a couple or a solotraveller wanting to see the city."),
("2017-02-18", "1944996", "Michael", "Location  Location. Annie's place was stylish and comfortable and close to all the inner city action. Annie was a great host."),
("2017-03-07", "1944996", "Jay", "This place is an absolute gem - a central location  very clean and quiet  all the amenities are up-to-date and well maintained. The shower was spacious with good hot water system. The kitchen was extremely well equipped. I especially enjoyed the coffee machine. The host  Annie  was definitely the best part of this stay. She let us know in advance everything we needed to know  was very accommodating to our requests such as check-in and check-out times. A very nice place  I highly recommend it to anyone who is looking for a place near Surry Hills and Sydney CBD."),
("2017-04-10", "1944996", "Haifaa", "Best - place - ever. Searching for a private appartment with the look&feel of the true and hip Sydney  don't go further  this is it.Very comfortable and stylished loft nested in the middle of the scenic Surry Hills and its beautiful terrace houses  it is the place to be if you are searching for a place with charm and all amenities you need . The best coffeeshops and restaurants nearby  10min away from Central station & Museum station  you will even be able to reach Townhall/Victoria building in 15 minutes walk tip top  and Botanical Garden in 20min. Annie and her friends are a bliss to deal with  smooth & easy check-in and check-out  very nice comms and timely follow-up. My new destination #1 when in Sydney! :) Thank you Annie!"),
("2017-06-14", "1944996", "Ali", "I stayed at Annie's apartment for 10 days and it could not have been more perfect. It was in a great location  walking distance to cool shops  cafe's and restaurants. The apartment was fully equipped and I never felt like I didn't have what I needed. Annie was a great host and was very accommodating when I decided to extend my trip twice. I would highly recommend Annie's apartment for your stay in Sydney! "),
("2017-07-02", "1944996", "Anne", "Thank you  Annie  for a wonderful home and your flexibility. We had an amazing stay. Your Apartment cannot disappoint!"),
("2017-07-15", "1944996", "Mike", "We had a great time staying at Annie's apartment.  The apartment is well equiped and is an ideal base for a couple.  It is conveniently located and only a couple of minutes from many of Surry Hills' popular cafes.   It was an easy walk to Hyde park and the city.  Annie was great to deal with and responded quickly - thank you!"),
("2017-07-25", "1944996", "Le", "good place to stay. recommended"),
("2017-07-31", "1944996", "Charlene", "Great location. Amazing host. Made my trip perfect!"),
("2017-08-12", "1944996", "Winnie", "Nice cosy studio at a very central location.  Good space for a single / couple travellers.  Exterior reno work can be noisy in the morning but I could still sleep over it for a lay in."),
("2017-08-21", "1944996", "Josephine", "Annie was a great host  easy communication and check in/out. Would recommend this apartment  perfect for single or couple and great location!"),
("2017-08-27", "1944996", "Matt And Lou", "Great location  accessible to Surry Hills and the CBD. Excellent for work or play.  Annie's home is what Airbnb is all about. Thank you!"),
("2017-09-03", "1944996", "Elizabeth", "Annie's place was incredible - smack bang in the middle of everything but the apartment itself seemed secluded from the noise of the streets below. Walking distance to oxford street and all the call bars in Surry Hills  really couldn't ask for a better location! Annie's apartment had everything you could think of and more  and Annie was accommodating and a pleasure to deal with :) We couldn't recommend Annie's apartment highly enough!"),
("2017-09-17", "1944996", "Scott", "Annie was a fantastic host. Very responsive and welcoming! The flat is gorgeous. Very modern and comfortable! The flat is in the best location in Sydney. Walking distance everything. Pick any direction and you'll find great cafes  bars  and restaurants. All of Annie's food suggestions turned out to be fantastic as well! Would definitely recommend this place!"),
("2017-09-22", "1944996", "Elle", "Annie' apartment is fantastic! I loved the decor and space  there is scaffolding outside the balcony so your views are obstructed but this didn't bother me.  Location is amazing  heaps of places to eat & drink and only 15 mins walk to the CBD. I would definitely stay again."),
("2017-09-28", "1944996", "Steve", "Annie was very helpful throughout the stay. The apartment was comfortable. Easy walk into the city. Plenty of restaurants nearby"),
("2017-10-05", "1944996", "Chloe", "We enjoyed our stay very much!! Annie was super responsive and contacted us before we came to make sure she would be waiting for us at the apartment. The place is located in a great neighbourhood and we walked everywhere. Tons of restaurants in the neighbourhood. Thanks again!!"),
("2017-10-18", "1944996", "Whitney", "Annie's place was in an excellent location. It was really easy to check in and she was very quick to reply. The building itself is secure and right in the middle of Surry Hills so as other's mentioned - lots of restaurants and bars. We walked most places and were able to catch the train and also the bus several times. The apartment did have most everything we needed. The only disappointing part was the noise. The building was going through renovations so they started working around 6:30a during the week and we could hear jackhammers. Also  the apartment is right across the elevator. Overall  we enjoyed our stay - just wish we could have slept in some days."),
("2017-10-27", "1944996", "Dylan", "Annie’s apartment was fantastically well located in a hip and central region of Sydney  walkable to most major attractions and public transit to those beyond walkability. Additionally  it was clean  well-stocked  and Annie was an affable host who met us on arrival to help us get settled and remained in contact and nearby had any issues arose. Thanks for a great stay- would be happy to stay again in the future!"),
("2017-11-04", "1944996", "Dimitri", "Great place and great location.  Really enjoyed our stay there.  Annie was great and really easy to deal with."),
("2017-11-11", "1944996", "Filippo", "Annie was a great host  super helpful. She met us at the flat and provided us with all the info on the flat and the neighbourhood as well!The flat is very stylish  has all the amenities and even a terrace. The location is fantastic - there's independent cafes and great restaurants and cool shops in every direction.So happy we stayed here!"),
("2017-11-16", "1944996", "Kirri-Mae", "Annie’s place was perfectly as described. A lovely small apartment flooded with fresh air and light thanks to the wall-to-wall windows in the living room and kitchen. We used it for a week as a work base and it was such a convenient location to quickly walk to cafes  restaurants  bars and shops. Annie was quick and super helpful with all communication making the stay even more comfortable. Would definitely recommend and hopefully stay again!"),
("2017-11-23", "1944996", "Britney", "Not only was this apartment an absolute dream  but Annie went above and beyond as a host. She was extremely responsive  helpful  and made sure we had everything we needed. The apartment is in an awesome  very happening area with tons of vintage shops and cafes right on the block. The apartment itself was gorgeous  well-designed  and very homey feeling. We had an incredible experience here! Highly recommend :)"),
("2017-12-10", "1944996", "Georgia", "This place is great. If anything is much nicer than it appears from photos. If you’ve ever been to Sydney before you know Surry Hills is a beautiful neighbourhood  great for both nightlife and cafe society during the day. This apartment is in a fabulous location right in the middle of things  but was also extremely peaceful and quiet. Annie was a really great host as well. Always prompt with communication  helpful and very flexible. We arrived at the apartment at 11:30pm and Annie was very cool about waiting for us  and then was super efficient in giving us the keys and all the necessary info and just leaving us to it  so we made our dinner reservation and were happy! Recommend."),
("2018-01-01", "1944996", "Kylie", "Annie was a fantastic host to deal with - super responsive and flexible - she even left us a bottle of bubbly to start our NYE celebrations early (thanks!) Easy check in and check out  nice  cosy and compact apartment in a good location with plenty of cafes  convenience stores and other eating options nearby. We walked down to Circular Quay and covered other parts of the city by foot which was pretty easy  though there seemed to be lots of buses nearby. Close enough to the CBD without being right in the thick of things. Thanks for having us :-)"),
("2018-01-04", "1944996", "Molly", "Annie's apartment is a beautiful loft in a perfect location to explore Sydney. Annie is also a great host -- she was completely accommodating with check-in and came all the way down from Manly to greet us at the apartment. She also gave great recommendations for spots to check out in the neighborhood. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-01-16", "1944996", "Thy (Tee)", "Great studio in the heart of Surry Hills which is great for anyone that loves been close to cafes  restaurants and easy walk into the city. Annie is lovely and very quick to respond to any questions. Check-in/out was very easy. The studio is cute  stylish and quite considering the location. Was a perfect base for our 6 nights stay in Sydney."),
("2018-01-25", "1944996", "Charlie", "Friendly and communicative host with a lovely flat in a great location. Surry Hills was an amazing neighbourhood. And the flat had everything we wanted and very comfortable. Really enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-02-11", "1944996", "Mary Anne & Jean-Paul", "Annie’s Place was great for our week stay in Sydney. She was a really helpful and responsive host and allowed us to check-in early after our long flight  which was amazing. She gave us lots of tips for local venues and touristy things to do. We really enjoyed morning coffee each day at Pieno just up the street from the apartment and ate dinner each night locally as there were so many great options.The only downside was  the construction in the building and we found it a bit noisy.  I’m sure that once that is over  it won’t be an issue. High recommend a stay in this lovely apartment."),
("2018-02-17", "1944996", "旻玥", "Annie was so sweet and helpful  even she was tired she still waited for me at her place   showed me around and gave me suggestions. This was the best location  easy to everywhere  and the apartment was super cozy and fashionable . I was so happy that I could spend these days at Annie’s place  this was an amazing traveling  hope I could come once more."),
("2018-02-22", "1944996", "Lauren", "Annie’s place showed much better in person. The decor was cute and definitely reflected Surrey hills trendy vibe. There was so much to explore in the area and was perfect walking distance to anything. The bed was super comfy and the place was quiet after a long day out. I would definitely recommend this place to others."),
("2018-02-28", "1944996", "Tetsu", "Looking for hip neighborhood with walking distance to food  bar  boutique shops & even a slice of pizza!  Annie place is right center of everything in Surry Hills.   Amazing host with super quick response.    I would definitely come back to stay with such a stylish place!!!!!  Thank you ;)"),
("2018-03-05", "1944996", "Sergio", "Annie has been an excellent and friendly host and I really appreciated her prompt answers and efficiency. The aptm was clean and she provided all we needed during our stay. We never needed to contact her  which shows she made sure in advance that her visitors would be taken care of.I can definitely recommend Annie’s airbnb and her hospitality. It highly contributed to a very pleasant stay and trip to Australia.Sergio"),
("2018-03-08", "1944996", "Virginia", "Great spot to stay! Annie is a great communicator and the studio is lovely. It’s a great and lively part of town to be in so highly recommend staying there if you want to experience a thriving part of Sydney."),
("2018-03-11", "1944996", "Richard", "Great location"),
("2018-03-16", "1944996", "Christopher", "Lovely accomodation  loveliest host."),
("2018-03-17", "1944996", "Terry", "Annie’s place is lovely and stylish - the perfect spot for a weekend stay in Sydney. The neighbourhood is great  there’s lots going on. The apartment has all you need  a terrace and a rooftop pool too!"),
("2018-03-22", "1944996", "Brooke", "Annie’s place was the perfect location for my work trip to Sydney. The apartment was clean and tidy and Annie communication was fantastic. I would defiantly recommend Annie’s apartment for your next trip to Surry Hills."),
("2018-03-25", "1944996", "Melissa", "Great apartment. It was beautiful  clean and perfectly positioned in Surry Hills. Annie was very responsive and accomodating. Staying here was an enjoyable part of our stay in Sydney."),
("2018-04-06", "1944996", "Colin", "Lovely place in a perfect location. Great interior! Might get a little noisy if you let the window open at night and a little warm if you don’t use the fans. Other than that we had a great stay!"),
("2018-04-08", "1944996", "Erinne", "Amazing space and location! Walking distance to anything you might need. Annie was great with communication  check in was a dream. Will definitely be back.Thanks!"),
("2018-04-12", "1944996", "David", "A stylish pad in the thick of Surrey Hills  literally a stones throw from Oxford Street.No excuses for cooking here (although you could)  you are surrounded by bars and restaurants. Annie met me on arrival and was more than happy to help with local knowledge.  She was a quick and excellent communicator.Great location  great apartment  great host."),
("2018-04-15", "1944996", "Angus", "Great spot super close to restaurants and bars."),
("2018-07-06", "1944996", "Christopher", "Perfect!"),
("2018-07-18", "1944996", "Stephanie", "The host canceled this reservation 57 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-08-12", "1944996", "Katie", "Bright and beautiful apartment. Perfect location. Attentive host. Clean and tidy."),
("2018-08-21", "1944996", "Elle", "Close to public transport  10 mins walk to Museum station. A lot of places to go eat around the area and grocery stores if you plan to do shopping for regular food. The apartment itself is really cozy and quiet  no noise from the outside. Annie was a great host  great communication. Overall a great place to stay and would definitely book again! "),
("2018-11-08", "1944996", "Nicholas", "Ideally placed unit close to all amenities  prompt and accurate communication with a seamless check in ensured a stress free and enjoyable stay. Would love stay again on my next trip to Sydney. Thanks Annie !"),
("2018-11-19", "1944996", "Becky", "This apartment is super stylish in a busy  hip neighborhod. The location is close to tons of great restaurants and relatively easy access to public transport. When the weather is nice and you throw those huge gorgeous doors open you can definitely hear the neighbors - but no one was excessively loud or at odd hours or anything."),
("2018-12-09", "1944996", "Clàudia", "The apartment is even better than in pictures. Good location and good communication with Annie  who is very friendly and helpful."),
("2018-12-30", "1944996", "Edward", "Perfect location and perfect flat. Looks much better than the pictures and has a really nice rooftop pool. Highly recommended ! Annie was also very helpful"),
("2018-12-31", "1944996", "Ryan", "Great location with with great food and bars nearby. Quiet and clean place with a great balcony for relaxing. Rooftop pool was perfect to cool off in after touring the city. No a/c in apartment  but had plenty of fans to cool us down. Great host!"),
("2019-01-03", "1944996", "Sarah", "Stylish  well-equipped apartment in great location. We really enjoyed the private balcony. Highly recommended."),
("2019-01-10", "1944996", "Satu", "Absolute delight! We loved staying here especially as we like to cook! It was amazing (sorry about all the food we had toLeave behind  I hope it goes to good use) :) We are definitely coming back."),
("2019-01-16", "1944996", "Amanda", "I LOVED Annie’s space. Bright  stylish and such a good location - I will definitely look to come back and try out the roof top pool!"),
("2019-01-22", "1944996", "Maggie", "Great space with interesting decor. The bed was in an interesting and cozy place and the bathroom extremely clean and spacious. P.S. If you can't find the remote for the speakers it might be under the couch pillows  not the host's fault. We found it randomly at the end of our stay so future dwellers be warned! haha"),
("2019-01-28", "1944996", "Craig", "A lovely little place in a great location. We could walk or catch the bus into the city centre very quickly  and buses run to the main beaches from basically outside the door. Special thanks for the local tips!"),
("2017-07-03", "19574869", "Kerri", "The apartment was in such a fantastic location! Easy to join the Bondi to Coogee coastal walk and what an amazing walk it is! Loved sitting out on the 'generous' balcony and enjoying the view down to Tamarama Beach SLSC. Thank you so much Ruby for this little 'oasis' in a beautiful part of the world!"),
("2017-07-13", "19574869", "Alissa", "Was a wonderful place with a treat view. Ruby was very nice and quick in all her responses. Would highly recommend."),
("2017-07-30", "19574869", "Jen", "I stayed at Ruby's for a weekend with three friends and we had a great time  such a lovely place. Walking distance down to Tamarama beach or easy walk around to Bondi. Great view from the balcony too. Ruby was really great to deal with and really responsive. "),
("2017-08-06", "19574869", "Juliana", "Ruby is an excellent host  but the photos don't show with accuracy all spaces. A lot of dust everywhere and a little bit dirty in the balcony. The building is in remodelation process and there is an scaffold in the main access and block the view as well. We didn't be warned in that issue."),
("2017-08-12", "19574869", "Lizzie", "This place really is beautiful. The view  watching the boats from the balcony is stunning  especially if you're crazy enough to wake up for sunrise. Ruby was really accommodating and friendly."),
("2017-08-20", "19574869", "Sarah", "Loved our stay and the view is stunning! Ruby gets back to you immediately and is just gorgeous. Ocean walks  great restaurants...you name it! Everything is a stone throw away. Thank you Ruby  we will be back."),
("2017-09-10", "19574869", "Sean", "Beautiful views and a great location"),
("2017-10-06", "19574869", "Lyndon", "The host canceled this reservation 87 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-10-14", "19574869", "Jade", "A perfect girls weekend away. Enjoyed our time on the amazing deck with the most spectacular view! Ruby was very fast in responding to any enquiries I had. Highly recommend:)"),
("2017-10-27", "19574869", "Aaron", "The apartment has the most amazing view to the ocean right from the bedroom & living room. Very clean  airy and spacious for an apartment. Ruby was an awesome host. Very fast to respond to any questions I had and very friendly. I would highly recommend. Aaron"),
("2017-10-28", "19574869", "Harvee", "Absolutely loved it. Better than Bondi"),
("2017-11-04", "19574869", "Sean", "Excellent location for those keen to walk around the local area  and there's plenty of bus routes nearby to get into Bondi junction and/or the city  lovely view and nice big deck.  Kitchen and bathroom could use a bit of updating  but otherwise a great spot."),
("2017-11-07", "19574869", "Kyle", "At first I was a bit taken back due to the age of the apartment compared to what I am used to for that price.  But after settling in found it homely and very comfortable.  Ruby was great with communication and the location is outstanding and stones throw away from beautiful beach.  Thank you so much for opening your home I really did enjoy our time there.   Definitely love tamarama."),
("2017-11-11", "19574869", "Sven", "Great place with amazing view!"),
("2017-11-15", "19574869", "Dan", "The balcony and the view really do help make this place a little magical... thanks Ruby!"),
("2017-11-19", "19574869", "Rosanna", "Ruby was a great host. She was in touch and answering all of my questions (and I had lots of questions as this was my first air BNB experience)The apt was lovely. I would definitely recommend it!"),
("2017-11-25", "19574869", "Judy", "A real gem. Great location. Right on coastal path. Close to bus networks. Ruby was really helpful with timely and informative replies to our questions. If you stay  be sure to build in time to enjoy the view and local walks."),
("2017-11-26", "19574869", "Ellie", "Amazing place with a great balcony and views of the ocean. In a very convenient location and could easily walk to the beach and Bondi. Ruby was a really easy to deal with host and everything went according to plan!"),
("2017-12-02", "19574869", "Lee", "A great little apartment in a fantastic location. Views from the deck are stunning and it is a lovely walk along the coast to either Bondi or Bronte beaches."),
("2017-12-17", "19574869", "Lou", "We had a great time here; loved the view from the balcony. Kitchen needs update"),
("2018-01-02", "19574869", "Carragh", "10/10 - Ruby was an extremely accommodating host. A great stay all round for my first experience with Air bnb  my friends and myself thoroughly enjoyed our stay in Bronte at Ruby's apartment :)"),
("2018-01-09", "19574869", "Mark", "Great spot and cool apartment. Would not hesitate to recommend it."),
("2018-01-15", "19574869", "Natasha", "Ruby was very responsive to all of our queries. The balcony at Ruby's place was really lovely and we ate every meal out there  however as has been commented by other reviewers the kitchen and bathroom is quite dated. It was very convenient to walk down the ""Tamarama steps"" and onto the path towards Bronte and Bondi each day."),
("2018-01-19", "19574869", "Carrie-Ann", "The view and balcony at this apartment is AMAZING!Such a great location as well.Ruby made check-in and arrangements super easy.The bathroom and kitchen are very basic and a little run down compared to the rest of the apartment which is lovely.Unfortunately the bedframe in the main bedroom kept breaking and was very unstable... hopefully it will be fixed for the next person. Overall a lovely place to stay in the Eastern Suburbs."),
("2018-01-28", "19574869", "Sam", "Great location. Bed was broken  but other than that was good."),
("2018-02-07", "19574869", "Richard", "A great apartment! Fantastic view of the ocean  spacious apartment with great outdoor space. Easy and quick walk to Bronte beach and Bondi. All amenities provided and superb communication from Ruby. Highly recommended and would definitely stay again."),
("2018-02-14", "19574869", "Anthony", "Ruby's place was perfectWould recommend to anyone"),
("2018-02-16", "19574869", "Kellie", "Ruby's apartment is all about the location - great view and terrace  a short walk from the Bondi to Bronte coast walk and Bondi / Tamarama / Bronte beaches. The apartment itself is pretty tired  but if you're more into the beach than interior design  I'm sure you'll love it."),
("2018-02-26", "19574869", "Katie", "Place is exactly as described. Clean and has a great balcony  it has a quintessential beach house vibe.Ruby was great at communicating and very accommodating at requests. Very central location but just be weary that the neighbourhood has steep hills and stairs."),
("2018-03-17", "19574869", "Tim", "Great place to stay. Awesome view off the deck and the location was spot on. Close to everything you need. Thanks again"),
("2018-04-09", "19574869", "Anton", "Nice place to stay!"),
("2018-04-15", "19574869", "Scotty", "Ruby is responsive and very hospitable. We had an enjoyable stay"),
("2018-04-28", "19574869", "Chris", "A lovely location and apartment where you had a view of the bay and an excellent location to relax and chill"),
("2018-05-06", "19574869", "Eric", "Location is great  close to Tamara and Bronte beaches  and Ruby was helpful.However  the apartment needs to be refreshed and is not occupied  so less charming."),
("2018-05-25", "19574869", "Eva", "Wow.... absolutely amazing location. Sitting on the balcony soaking up the sunshine & amazing view. It was such a relaxing place to stay!The location is super close to coastal walk and shops on Bondi rd.Ruby was very quick to respond & helpful during our stay in Sydney."),
("2018-06-03", "19574869", "Andre", "Great apartment - looking out over the balcony at a stormy winter ocean. Stunning."),
("2018-06-11", "19574869", "Emma", "The apartment was really great for the price! A great location with a nice view from the verandah. The apartment is old but still comfortable and had everything you need for a great stay in Bondi"),
("2018-08-06", "19574869", "Mike", "The apartment’s location was fantastic  close to the beach and close to the restaurants shops etc. the view from the big balcony was awesome. Waking up every morning to that view was particularly special. The hosts were very helpful with our arrival and assisted with activating the TV etc. The apartment itself was tired and in desperate need of renovation. The bathroom was mouldy. The kitchen was good  except the stove and oven were rusty and didn’t work. Other than that is was great."),
("2018-10-01", "19574869", "Jacob", "This place is beautiful. The deck’s view is breathtaking and it’s a short walk to the beach. Great value for money"),
("2018-10-07", "19574869", "Junhyeok", "The bathroom and toilet are all dirty and the carpet smells old. The house was old as a whole and the rusty tables and chairs were seen first.Our family arrived at this place and booked another place in 5 minutes. It's too low a quality for the price."),
("2019-02-27", "19574869", "Madeline", "Une vue magnifique  des personnes adorables et réactives  de bons conseils  une belle déco  du confort  parfait ! L'appartement est un peu excentré mais très bien desservi  un avantage pour s'évader de cette grande ville de Sydney dans un cadre super zen. Top !"),
("2017-08-06", "19508741", "Ben", "Lovely apartment in a great position. Hosts Tessa and Rod are delightful and a pleasure to deal with."),
("2017-08-13", "19508741", "Aaron", "It was a wonderful stay at Tessa and Rod's. They have a great little pad set up for guests and were generous with supplying delicious home made muffins. 10/10 would stay again!"),
("2017-09-09", "19508741", "Christian", "We were on a cycling trip around Kuran-Gai National Park and decided to stay around Newport for the night. Tessa And Rod’s place seemed like the perfect fit and it sure was.Communication: Very easy to organize everything. It only took a few moments to organize our arrival and they were both there (and Charlie the dog :) to greet us when we arrived.The place: It is a very cozy unit below their house. It was very peaceful and quiet. TV had Foxtel and it was nice to just chill and watch the news. Heaters were provided and very welcome as the weather git a but chilly.Breakfast: Muesli  milk  tea  fruit  and homemade marmalade and toast - what else can you ask for! It was very nice to have access to these things.Cleanliness: Very clean and very well kept! We cannot recommend this place enough  and if we ever decide to have another cycling trip close to the Northern beaches  we'll definitely stay here again. Thanks for everything!"),
("2017-09-09", "19508741", "Matt", "We immediately felt relaxed & welcome when greeted by Tessa  and sampled some of her amazing home-made jam & muffins. Accomodation was very spacious & had everything we needed  300m walk down to the Newport Arms for dinner  we had a great stay thanks Tessa & Rod"),
("2017-10-06", "19508741", "Joanna", "What a wonderful welcome  with so many thoughtful touches.  A very comfortable night at Tessa and Rod's - I'd definitely recommend it to others."),
("2017-10-13", "19508741", "Emmanuel", "Tessa and Rod are both so very friendly and accommodating  and they have a wealth of local knowledge. Tea  coffee and breakfast provided  clean and tidy space  sanctuary-like yard and the most beautiful and calm (outdoor) dog. Can't fault the place or the hosts. Oh and of course  delicious home made berry and muesli muffins :)"),
("2017-10-14", "19508741", "Selena", "That your for an amazing and comfortable stay"),
("2017-11-04", "19508741", "Carla", "Thanks so much for having me Tess and Rod. Place was perfect and you were very accomodating."),
("2017-11-12", "19508741", "Georgina", "Accurate information. Relaxing stay  quiet/relaxed location. Hosts were reliable and prompt with communication. Cosy and fresh space  cute for a weekend away"),
("2017-11-24", "19508741", "Sudeep", "Beautiful house.Comfortable arrangements and 100 time much better than my expectations.They are very supportive and warm people.They look after you very well...Thank you guys"),
("2017-12-03", "19508741", "Marc", "Amazing hosts with a beautiful place. Very helpful and very comfortable. Easy to relax and enjoyed our stay. Will stay again."),
("2017-12-06", "19508741", "Glenn", "A lovely place to stay and wonderful hospitality! Thank you Tessa and Rod!"),
("2017-12-17", "19508741", "Paul", "Wonderful nights stay in a beautiful little guest apartment with everything you need and more. Amazing hosts super helpful and friendly and the little extra touches went a long way to making this a fantastic weekend escape.Thank You Tessa and Rod"),
("2017-12-22", "19508741", "Warren", "Great accommodation and very conveneint.  Great hosts."),
("2017-12-30", "19508741", "Leigh", "Great location and has everything you might need. Just great."),
("2017-12-31", "19508741", "Ben", "One of the nicest and friendlier places I have stayed  very homey and so good to chill at  will recommend"),
("2018-01-01", "19508741", "Denise & Richard", "A lovely place in great location with a true quintessential B&B experience including home made muffins and jams.  Very hospitable  flexible and responsive hosts.  "),
("2018-01-04", "19508741", "Mike", "Great hosts. Lovely spot great for a mini getaway from the city really enjoyed the place close to lots of beaches and parks.Thanks"),
("2018-01-05", "19508741", "Tom & Laura", "Fantastic place to stay! Only there for a night but could have stayed for a week. Tessa and Rod were a lovely couple who helped us with where to go the day after. Best Air BnB so far."),
("2018-01-09", "19508741", "Nigel", "A great place to stay  the place was very clean and roomy  Tess and Rod were very welcoming  they even provided me with some breakfast including an amazing home made plum jam. Thoroughly recommended"),
("2018-01-21", "19508741", "Mitchell", "Great spot to stay  close shops and restaurants. Tessa and Rod are great people and easy to get along with.. I would definitely stay there again."),
("2018-01-25", "19508741", "John", "Best airbnb place we have stayed yet. The room was really spacious and it had it's own private lounge room. Lovely area to sit outside and great location  close to so many nice beaches. Tess and Rod were lovely and very friendly and helpful. Would recommend this place to everyone."),
("2018-01-28", "19508741", "Mitch", "Top spot  and very hospitable hosts! We'll surely be back again"),
("2018-02-11", "19508741", "Ben", "Lovely place close to the bus stop"),
("2018-02-17", "19508741", "Geraldine", "Felt like a home away from home. The thoughtful touches throughout  from the homemade muffins and jam to the bathroom amenities made us feel very welcome. Tessa and Rod are brilliant hosts  ready to provide any assistance needed."),
("2018-02-23", "19508741", "Deen", "Very nice and kind people"),
("2018-02-25", "19508741", "Stephen", "A lovely big apartment  in a great location at a great price. Apartment was very clean  easy to get to and had heaps of room - separate bedroom and living area. In an area with terrible parking it was great to have off-street parking. A small walk down the hill takes you to Justin Hemmes' fabulous Newport hotel - a sensational place for lunch or a drink. A short drive or 15 minute walk down a slight slope will get you to the beach or shops and Newport's wonderful cafes and restaurants. Communications were great  lovely hosts  and for this area  a real bargain price."),
("2018-02-28", "19508741", "Dennis", "Everything was perfect. It's a  wonderful  nice flat in a quite area. Tessa and Rod a really lovely helpful people. When I'm around I want to book this accommodation again  definitely. Best Regards :-)"),
("2018-03-03", "19508741", "Sarah", "Wonderful home away from home. Everything you could need & more. The garden and fish pond was a lovely spot for a morning tea and the homemade products left for breakfast was a great unique and tasty touch! Thanks Tessa for the great stay and flexiable check in / out :)"),
("2018-03-03", "19508741", "Suhela", "Amazing location  just up the road from the Newport Hotel  but also walking distance into town if you're headed that way. Very much enjoyed our stay at Tess and Rod's."),
("2018-03-05", "19508741", "Claire", "In terms of the location it was perfect where we needed to be. The Newport pub was superb and only a couple minutes walk down the road. The homemade marmalade and muffins were delicious and a truly delicious idea. Tessa and Rod went out of their way to assist us and make us feel at home. The place also has some privacy which is great. We will definitely visit again!!"),
("2018-03-09", "19508741", "Alon", "Welcoming  easy going  great communication. Clean and private accommodation. Great location  great value. This is what Air B&B is about.See you again."),
("2018-03-10", "19508741", "Liam", "Tessa and Rob were amazingly hospitable and went out of their way to ensure our stay was a great experience.I can't wait to stay with them again in the future.If I could give 6 stars I would!Highly recommended."),
("2018-03-17", "19508741", "Juergen", "This is a little gem at the Northern Beaches. Tess and Rod were the most welcoming hosts and the little studio exceeded our expectations. From the moment we arrived until we departed we felt at home (and) away from home. (pardon the punt). Loved following the suggestions of the local pub and restaurants. Tess' decoration with personal touches and home made little gestures were really appreciated.  Great private outdoor area amongst lush gardens to soak in the afternoon sun. We couldn't have asked for more. Highly recommended."),
("2018-03-18", "19508741", "Elle", "Perfect location for anyone visiting Newport - the Airbnb had everything we needed and more  with breakfast provided and homemade muffins and jam which was a lovely personal touch!"),
("2018-03-26", "19508741", "Jane", "Great place - everything we needed. Would recommend."),
("2018-03-31", "19508741", "Elena", "Lovely space and buses very close by. Relaxed environment and other places just a short bus ride away. Great for our short weekend getaway!"),
("2018-04-01", "19508741", "Bronia", "Tessa are wonderful hosts who care a great deal about their guests comfort and have all the  personal touches to make you feel at home. Even delicious homemade muffins and marmalade. It is central but very quiet. I hope to return."),
("2018-04-08", "19508741", "Bryony", "We had a delightful time on a mother-daughter bonding stay. Tess and Rod were so kind and welcoming  always remaining respectful of our privacy while also being available should we need assistance. They were very kindly flexible on our check in and out times and were even sweet enough to help us with our bags. Thank you!"),
("2018-04-08", "19508741", "Annabelle", "Rosie and David my parents said that this was a great place for them being close to the Newport pub which they were going to  and that the beds were very comfortable as well. Breakfast was included."),
("2018-04-13", "19508741", "Raimund", "Great spot and very friendly and helpful hosts. Tess and Rod made me feel right at home and the little extra touches in the apartment made me feel very welcome."),
("2018-05-06", "19508741", "Stephen", "A great little place for our get away."),
("2018-07-01", "19508741", "Richard", "Great spot in Newport  and two lovely hosts in Tessa and Rod. We had a really nice stay  very comfy!"),
("2018-09-02", "19508741", "Tian", "Lovely home  great location and amazing home made muffins!"),
("2018-09-08", "19508741", "Gloria", "Definitely worth the stay!"),
("2018-09-09", "19508741", "Katrina", "Tess & Rod were wonderful hosts. They were there to greet us on arrival and explain the accomodation and available to answer our questions. The unit is cosy has a beautiful courtyard  and is a good size  the beds are very comfortable. It had everything we needed. Brekky was lovely with home made muffins and jams.Tess even offered to drive us back to our transport  thank you for a great stay."),
("2018-09-14", "19508741", "Ian", "Great location with great privacy"),
("2018-09-15", "19508741", "Nicola", "Tess  Rod and Charlie the dog gave us a warm welcome.  We were pleased to find a homey  quite and comfortable place.  Homemade muffins and jam were very much appreciated.  Thank you!"),
("2018-09-28", "19508741", "Scott", "We had a wonderful stay at No33  Tessa and Rod were so friendly and very helpful with local tips. Beds were comfy and room was really quiet with a lovely garden surrounding. I would highly recommend staying here  we hopefully will next time we are in Newport and will definitely try the Thai restaurant just down the road."),
("2018-10-01", "19508741", "Nathan", "Hassle-free and homely touches. We had a great stay and our only regret is not staying longer!"),
("2018-10-08", "19508741", "Shane", "Very clean and quiet apartment. Directly across the road from the bus and close to everything else. Both Tessa and rod are very lovely people and make you feel very welcome."),
("2018-10-12", "19508741", "Maggie", "Tess  Rod and Charlie were great hosts. They were very thoughtful and welcoming to their comfortable home. We would definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-10-14", "19508741", "Chris", "An excellent room at an excellent location. Just a short walk down to the Newport Mirage and local pub. The location is quiet with Tessa and Rod the perfect hosts for the stay."),
("2018-10-18", "19508741", "Andrew", "Had a great stay at this place  hosts very friendly as the place was spacious and comfortable  Tessa also baked some great cakes and had fruit and juice and other food/snacks ready to go! Will be back"),
("2018-10-20", "19508741", "Dianne", "Very homely with total privacy located underneath hosts house. It's a fabulous location for any event being attended at the Newport Mirage as its only a 5 minute walk away. Having an iron  walk in robe and full length mirror was very convenient. Loved the courtyard with pond and homemade jams and cake on arrival with a great selection of teas  hot/cold drinks and fresh fruit available. Environment was very peaceful listening to birds and frogs with a pretty scented garden along the entrance pathway. Thank you to the hosts Tess and Rod. x"),
("2018-10-29", "19508741", "Wendy", "Exceptional value  in a great location  comfortable  clean  thoughtful touches such as home made muffins and jams  large space and extra large private courtyard with fountain  lovely and friendly hosts"),
("2018-11-04", "19508741", "Maureen", "A wonderful short stay. Vibes in this space are very special....both tranquil and and uplifting."),
("2018-11-09", "19508741", "Phillip", "Tess and Rod are wonderful hosts. We greatly appreciated the breakfast provided  as well as the chocolate cake. A wonderful place to stay in a great location."),
("2018-11-10", "19508741", "Virginia", "Great bnb  convenient  super clean and great extras  loved the chocolate cake."),
("2018-11-21", "19508741", "Annie", "Tess and Rod are just the lovliest people.   A fresh loaf of bread and home made jams and muffins and other breakfast goodies awaited us on arrival.  you actually have a totally separate lounge  bathroom  and bedroom.  As well there is a fantastic sunny open patio area  complete with a fishpond  beautiful flowering creepers and local frog (although we coud hear him we couldn't see him)!! All of this is the deal! We would definitely recommend  and would love to stay again if the situation arose. Thankyou Tess and Rod!"),
("2018-11-23", "19508741", "Jason", "Tess and Rod a great hosts with a lovely home in a great location for what I needed. Good  honest accomodation."),
("2018-11-24", "19508741", "Paul & Chloe", "Great place for a weekend getaway in Newport. Tessa is a wonderul host."),
("2018-12-01", "19508741", "Luisa", "Great space in the perfect location. The space is lovely and big  with separate tv room  big bedroom and a lovely patio with fountain. There is onsite parking and the location is only 4 mins walk to the stylish Newport hotel and 15 mins walk to shops and cafes and the beach. Great location and Tessa and Rod were very friendly! Will def come back!"),
("2018-12-15", "19508741", "Paula", "Great location and very welcoming host."),
("2018-12-21", "19508741", "Matthew", "Great location  good access and plenty of parking."),
("2018-12-28", "19508741", "Justin", "This place is awesome!!! It has everything you are looking for. Tessa and Rob are extremely nice and will help with anything. They gave us many suggestions for places to eat or to explore. They made sure we had everything we needed and everything laid out for us. They greeted us right when we got there and showed us around. They have baked goods for when you enter your place. The area is really spacious and easy to maneuver. They have a dog Charlie who is really nice. There aren't enough words that do this place justice. This place is one of the best airbnb's I have ever stayed at and would recommend it to anyone who is staying in the area of Newport or just in Sydney in general."),
("2018-12-29", "19508741", "Christopher", "Very hospitable hosts! Great location  close to local amenities and the beaches. Excellent value for money."),
("2018-12-31", "19508741", "Robyn", "We thoroughly enjoyed our one night in Newport - the studio was spacious  gorgeously decorated and welcoming. We especially loved the extra touches of hospitality that Tessa made. Hopefully we’ll be back!"),
("2018-12-31", "19508741", "Melanie", "amazing area  lovely home  Tessa and Rod were welcoming. Charlie was adorable. I will definitely be back!!"),
("2019-01-10", "19508741", "Richard", "Tessa and Rods unit was superbly situated for us - close to our family  lovely cafes and restaurants  and of course  the local bus service right past the door. Would recommend it strongly and love to stay again."),
("2019-01-13", "19508741", "John", "Warm welcome. Quiet and comfortable. Garden at the door. Muffins for breakfast with home made jam. Free to air and Foxtel TV and easy to access wi fi."),
("2019-01-26", "19508741", "Sheena", "This is an attractive  comfortable and spacious place  with a welcome outdoor terrace and sitting area. The rooms are large and comfortable  and the breakfast supplies are a bonus. Highly recommended as a base to explore the northern beaches."),
("2019-01-28", "19508741", "Simon", "Great place to stay. Keen to come back."),
("2019-02-03", "19508741", "David", "one of the best Airbnb's I've ever stayed at. Tess was very welcoming and the location was perfect for a weekend away."),
("2019-02-08", "19508741", "Benjamin", "What a great location so much to see in a small area. Such a warm homely feel and so relaxing. Wonderful hosts that were a pleasure to deal with."),
("2019-02-24", "19508741", "Gillian", "Private  spacious  welcoming  well set up  comfortable - a feeling of being at home (only with no chores to do!)"),
("2019-03-02", "19508741", "Anna", "We can’t thank Tessa enough for her hospitality. From freshly baked cakes  to useful local knowledge. We were so comfortable for our stay  could have easily extended!! Thanks for having us "),
("2017-08-08", "19599721", "兴刚", "非常干净舒适的房间 适合旅行的朋友入住｡"),
("2017-08-10", "19599721", "Gopal", "Huy's place is one of the best Airbnb experience I have had. The location is central  the host is super friendly  and the kids are adorable. I would highly recommend this place."),
("2017-08-11", "19599721", "Ana", "Take care with level of dust and odour"),
("2017-08-14", "19599721", "Niall", "Good location (but then I live around the corner - I needed to move out for a few days while my floor couldn't be walked on:-) ) For non-locals  it's opposite a supermarket  near a bus stop  and not too far from either the CBD or the airport. The room is a completely private space  on a different floor to the rest of Huy's flat  with own bathroom. Huy wasn't at home  but his young niece was very helpful in letting me in. My only comment would be that the room is quite cluttered - I kept knocking things over :-("),
("2017-08-16", "19599721", "Gabriel", "친절한 할머니  똑똑한 14살 아이와 개구진 쌍둥이가 사는 집입니다. 공간은 완전히 1 2층으로 분리돼있습니다만  어느정도 가족적인 분위기를 좋아하시는 분들께 추천드립니다. 저는 이 곳에 머물었던 기억때문에 시드니를 다시 올 것 같을 정도로 행복했습니다. 真好｡Awsome :)"),
("2017-08-17", "19599721", "윤호", "너무 좋았고 다음에 또 오고 싶습니다"),
("2017-08-23", "19599721", "Princy", "The location can't be better. Bus/train stations are within walking distance and Coles is literally 10 meters away. Huys families were very friendly. Private bathroom was definitely a big bonus for this price!"),
("2017-11-24", "19599721", "James", "Great location for me in Waterloo-Private bathroom is nice!  Family was super nice"),
("2017-11-28", "19599721", "Rebekah", "Everything was so lovely! My sister and I really enjoyed our room  the location and the friendliness of the family!"),
("2017-11-28", "19599721", "Nicola", "Great location  easy to get to central Sydney or the Airport. Good communication from Huy. There isn't a great deal of room if there are two of you with luggage  but if you are travelling light  then it's fine and Huy's mum is lovely!!"),
("2017-11-29", "19599721", "Andrew", "Absolutely wonderful Air BnB experience. Lovely home. Private nice room with own bathroom. Great quick communications. Highly recommended. We'll be back"),
("2017-12-08", "19599721", "Sohel", "Close to shopping centre and bus stop. Good location"),
("2017-12-14", "19599721", "Sarah", "Huy and his family were very welcoming and helpful hosts. Location is fantastic  and the room was lovely and private - overall very comfortable stay and would recommend!"),
("2018-01-05", "19599721", "Ray-Ray", "Huy is a good host.Let me feel comfortable to stay there.It’s a good location."),
("2018-12-28", "19599721", "Kim", "The place is so convenient to amenities  city and shopping. Huy is a very nice person accommodating all the needs. Thank you Huy."),
("2017-07-04", "19641701", "Sue", "The host canceled this reservation 13 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-08-11", "19641701", "Sajal", "Very Clean  tidy and nice place. Host is very hospitable  helpful and accomodatable. "),
("2017-08-17", "19641701", "D Divine", "My Aunty and her friends had a good time over there. They were suppose to go around Sydney but they jus fell in love with laura home and prefer to spend more quality time at home. Laura is a very nice lady and helpful. I love the way she decorated her home and with all the convenient she provided at home just perfect. You need nothing except your luggage :) Highly recommended! I will book again for any of my friends and family for the next trip!"),
("2017-09-01", "19641701", "Jo", "We really enjoyed our stay at Laura's apartment. It was clean  cosy and had an amazing view of the city. We made good use of the local ferry  which was only  a short walk from the apartment. Laura was a helpful and friendly host. "),
("2017-09-04", "19641701", "Adeline", "Appartement très bien situé  proche du centre ville mais dans un quartier très calme. Très bon rapport qualité/prix. Je recommande"),
("2017-09-10", "19641701", "Wendy", "Fabulous apartment in a lovely suburb of Sydney. Full facilities for a thoroughly enjoyable stay. Foolishly I had a lot of luggage and probably would have struggled with the stairs had my cousin not come to my rescue. Once my luggage was in the apartment the stairs weren't an issue at all. From the couch in the lounge room and the bed in the Main bedroom you can admire the spectacular harbour bridge and surrounds."),
("2017-10-20", "19641701", "Franco", "Good value for money Good location Short stroll to ferry"),
("2017-11-14", "19641701", "Martin", "We enjoyed our stay at Laura's place a lot. The ferry terminal to the city is just a few steps away  and the view is just overwhelming. It's a quiet and pretty neighborhood and shops  cafes  and restaurants are not too far away. The apartment is quite spacious and the kitchen has everything we needed. The instructions on where to find the key were a bit unclear to us at first  but in the end everything worked out well."),
("2017-12-11", "19641701", "Derek", "All o.k once we got over a problem at check in."),
("2018-01-18", "19641701", "Jon", "Laura’s apartment was great - fantastic location with amazing views  clean and comfortable. We particularly liked the large kitchen  air conditioner and iron and ironing board. Thanks Laura!"),
("2018-01-23", "19641701", "Tegan", "Great apartment! Highly recommend."),
("2018-01-30", "19641701", "Claudia", "Very modern  bright apartment with all necessities including lovely toiletries. it was a short walk to the ferry and Laura was a great host. I would definately stay here again."),
("2018-02-03", "19641701", "Michelle", "Laura's place was lovely and immaculate. The proximity of her listing to the ferry and the available parking spot made it easy to commute around Sydney. The only drawback was the flight of stairs leading up to the apartment  but this was easily outweighed by the views outside once you arrive."),
("2018-02-16", "19641701", "Maroua", "The place is well located if you want to visit Sydney downtown and northern suburbs.The apartment is very clean and quite convenient. The neibourhood is pretty calm. Laura is reactive and answer to all question very quickly."),
("2018-02-23", "19641701", "Chris", "Great place really enjoyed our stay"),
("2018-03-02", "19641701", "Kirsty", "Lovely clean apartment with lovely views of the harbour bridge!  Close to the Ferry and walking distance from the shops on Military Road. I’d definitely recommend this apartment to friends"),
("2018-03-18", "19641701", "Karen", "We enjoyed staying at Laura's place.  She provides a great Airbnb at a value. She was quick to respond to any communication.  The beds were comfortable.  It was great having wifi!  The ferry was a small hike away  which made it easy for us to get around the city.  There are six flights of stairs up to the unit which ended up being a bonus to us  in helping us work off all the great food we had been eating all day.  There are towels  toiletries and some basic condiments in the kitchen for cooking.  I would recommend her place to other travelers."),
("2018-03-21", "19641701", "Stuart", "The apartment was very well maintained and clean. It is located in a fabulous and secluded area of Sydney. Catching the ferry to the city  and discovering the rowing club (for drinks) were highlights. Late afternoon visits by the cockatoos was a treat too. You will need to have a car to visit the local shops for groceries."),
("2018-03-24", "19641701", "Kelsey", "Great location with view of the Harbour Bridge and walkable to catch a ferry across to Circular Quay. Great value and great place."),
("2018-03-29", "19641701", "Helene", "Great little appartment  very clean and tidy! Laura was easy to communicate with. Comfortable beds too :)"),
("2018-04-02", "19641701", "Sarojini", "We enjoyed our stay so much at  Laura's place! It was so comfortably clean  well furnished and  strategic! we enjoyed the amazing view and beautiful birds waking us up every morning!!! "),
("2018-04-06", "19641701", "Alexis", "It was a very good stay at Laura’s house  we had a little problem with the internet signal  but nothing important due that we spend almost all the time in the city  a little hike to the pier wish let you very close to the opera house. Was a nice trip. Very fast response."),
("2018-04-22", "19641701", "Chelsea", "Great location to reach the ferry to city or walk to beach and military road for great food. Beautiful view. Not big but great for mostly just sleep overnight. Cleanness could be approved. But overall great value!"),
("2018-04-25", "19641701", "Gemma", "Thanks Laura  the apartment is beautiful and very comfortable. I'd stay again if visiting Sydney in the future!"),
("2018-04-29", "19641701", "Grant", "Lovely house and good value. Laura was good with communication and very helpful."),
("2018-05-21", "19641701", "Björn", "The apartment was very nice with an amazing view over north Sydney and the Harbour bridge. The apartment is perfect for 3 or 4 people and has everything you need."),
("2018-06-12", "19641701", "Isadora", "O apartamento é limpo e novo  exatamente como nas fotos  e o bairro tranquilo. As estações de trem ficam um pouco distantes  mas tem uma balsa bem próxima que te leva rapidamente para o centro. Laura responde as mensagens na hora."),
("2018-06-17", "19641701", "Herry", "If you want to experience a ferry  Laura’s place is just about 15 mins walk to the Bay. Clear view to the Bridge."),
("2018-06-22", "19641701", "Norman", "Lovely place away from the hustle and bustle  at the same time just a short trip away to Sydney CBD. Clean accommodation with tons of amenities provided  also comes with a parking slot."),
("2018-08-18", "19641701", "Sara", "Great location  close to ferry. Very clean and Laura was a great host!"),
("2018-10-05", "19641701", "Lauren", "Laura was an incredibly helpful host  While i was staying there the power went out and she kept in contact with me throughout the day with updates on when it would be back on. The apartment was really clean and spacious. I will defiantly stay here again if im ever in need of a place to stay in Mosman."),
("2018-10-10", "19641701", "Miki", "Thanks to Laura  a very nice and thoughtful host. My friends & I really enjoyed our stay at  Laura's apartment. Everything was perfect as described  it's stylish  clean  comfortable and much better than we expected which this place makes us feel like home. It is convenient as located few minutes walking distance to Mosman bay (20 minutes to city by ferry. Would definitely recommend this place to my friends if they traveling at Sydney."),
("2018-10-24", "19641701", "ByungSoo", "멋진 장소입니다. 멋진 시드니의 경치를 경험하세요. 아침과 저녁 페리를 타고 다니는 경험 또한 놀라운 경험입니다.다만 가방이 무거운 사람들은 조금 힘들수가 있어요. 페리에서 내려서 언덕과 계단을 올라가야 하고  아파트 계단을 올라야 합니다. 짐이 많은 사람들은 체크인과 체크아웃을 할때 우버를 이용하심이 좋겠네요."),
("2018-11-23", "19641701", "Justin", "Location was perfect for what we needed.  Nice neighborhood away from the main city.  Walking distance from the harbor which took us to and from Circular Quay."),
("2018-11-25", "19641701", "Fonnie", "Its a great unit with a beautiful view where you can stay comfortably while exploring all over Sydney.  The unit is beautiful and has everything you need and more!"),
("2018-12-08", "19641701", "Melody", "The place is the same as shown in photos. Laura is very responsible and very responsive to messages."),
("2019-01-02", "19641701", "Irina", "The place is lovely  it has a great view of the city and is located in residential and  leafy  suburb  short and beautiful ferry trip to CBD. Laura is a great host  who gave us some very useful tips."),
("2019-01-27", "19641701", "Em", "If future travellers wish to stay somewhere stylish  affordable  clean and with fabulous views...then this IS the place in Sydney for you!!"),
("2019-02-16", "19641701", "Peter", "Great location with an amazing view. Host is responsive and friendly. Hope to stay here again."),
("2014-01-02", "1975244", "Alexander", "We had a wonderful time at Adams place. The Flat was clean and hab everything you could need. 5 mins to KingsCrossAlex"),
("2015-01-04", "1975244", "Pernilla", "We had some wonderful days in Adam Roberts apartment . The apartment is centrally located in a nice part of town close to much. It has a nice big terrace and private exit to the housepool and great views over the rooftops and the sea."),
("2016-01-05", "1975244", "Drew & James", "We loved staying at Adam's gorgeous apartment - The location is fantastic  right in the middle of Potts Point which has to be one of the best areas around Sydney. The layout of the apartment it great and has been very well put together - fabulous interior style that is all very welcoming. Huge comfy sofa's  great big bed  grand dining table and then there's the terrace with views out to the harbour -  it's a perfect place to lounge and enjoy the outdoors. Thank you for sharing this wonderful space!!"),
("2018-01-03", "1975244", "Lili", "Adam is an amazing host! He truly cares about the little details and communicated with us on a regular basis (pre-trip and during) to make sure we were doing okay. We truly loved the location and the views. Amazing find in Sydney. Recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable apartment away from the touristy traps of Sydney."),
("2017-11-20", "19768922", "Jean-Christophe", "The host canceled this reservation 40 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-12-30", "19768922", "Leandra", "Robert was an excellent host and the apartment was lovely. Loved the sunny balcony. Nearest station was North Sydney which was a few stations to almost everything."),
("2017-09-16", "19768051", "Lee", "Fantastic Location   nice house!"),
("2017-09-30", "19768051", "Tong", "very nice"),
("2017-10-07", "19768051", "Tmeeka", "We just spent a weekend at this wonderful home! Lovely presented 3 bedroom home with amble room for added comfort! Comfy beds fantastic outdoor area which included a  grassed area and a wonderful in ground pool! We couldn't have asked for a better location or home highly recommend this central home!"),
("2017-10-16", "19768051", "Annett", "Great house in a great location. Very close to the bus stop and walking distance to the beach."),
("2017-10-28", "19768051", "Barina", "A fantastic house near the beach. Clean  comfortable and a lovely garden  outdoor area and pool.Highly recommended. Loved Maroubra and the beach area.Great communication- everything was easy Barina"),
("2017-08-21", "19739919", "Sinead", "Excellent value. Close to heaps of public transport and a short walk to Marrickville. A Woolies less than 10 mins away. Very quiet and clean. Stayed here for a few weeks with husband and baby while locating permanent accommodation. It is small and basic but clean and and excellent location. There is a beautiful kids park around the corner and less than 10 mins walk to cooks river. Only 15 min bus ride to Enmore/Newtown. Communication was excellent and fruit and cookies were left out to."),
("2014-01-02", "1984069", "Melissa", "Ward was really helpful from the beginning. Location is what you are getting here. The view to the ocean is amazing and it's central to everything in manly."),
("2014-11-10", "1984069", "Julie", "The location and view are amazing! Couldn't be better. Ward was very helpful and accommodating. We had a great stay in Manly!Ward was quick to respond and made us feel very welcome in his unit."),
("2014-11-13", "1984069", "Graeme", "Great position and view of Manly beach from the balcony. Ward is a great guy too. Really enjoyed our stay thanks."),
("2015-02-08", "1984069", "Catalina", "A fantastic location - you could not be closer to the beach and bustle of beautiful Manly. Ward was a very helpful host  answering queries promptly and kindly leaving us a fridge full of food - very helpful when travelling with small children after a long flight. The flat could do with a little TLC  but the location and the view more than make up for this. A place to kick off your shoes  grab a beer and head straight out to the surf. Fantastic cafes and restaurants nearby too. Would stay here again. "),
("2017-10-20", "19846740", "Matthew", "Great place   very modern  clean   easy to communicate with the hosts   definitely worth a stay"),
("2017-11-03", "19846740", "Jenny", "We found this apartment to be really wonderful to stay in! The view is amazing (although not the water view shown in the photo  which must have been taken from the south side of the building). But wonderful all the same. The apartment faces north You can see a little bit of ocean in the distance  beyond Manly I guess.  We looked forward to coming home to the apartment every day. So comfortable. It helps to pull the curtains a bit going out for the day so it doesn’t get too hot. There is a great cafe with friendly staff  and good coffee and food in the courtyard below.  It’s called Springtime. There is a bus-stop to shoot into town in about 7 minutes almost directly across the road. Lots of restaurants nearby including a very colourful Mexican one. The directions  to get in if   you are driving  need to be clearer. And it helps to know that it is on level 11  and that the attachment on the key needs to be held near a small box to make the lift go to your level. All in all a magnificent and thoroughly enjoyable stay  and really comfortable beds. "),
("2017-12-18", "19846740", "Mia", "Great apartment I’m a great location. Was just a bit disappointed at the lack of utensils in the kitchen and also we clearly stated that we needed a 3rd mattress however although being told there was one there it wasn’t anywhere to be found. Our 4th guest had to sleep on a cot mattress for 2 nights."),
("2018-01-10", "19846740", "Marc", "I truly recommend this place."),
("2018-01-29", "19846740", "Joe", "Perfect apartment in a great location and is equipped with cot  change table  high chair and toys for small children."),
("2018-02-26", "19846740", "Sunny", "Good location bus stop in front of building  5 mins walk to wolli ."),
("2018-03-17", "19846740", "Rachel", "Wonderful space. Very clean and comfy. Great for kids. Quiet but with amenities and restaurants all very close. Could have used a few more plates and cups  but that’s being picky. We’d absolutely stay here again and recommend it to families."),
("2018-04-15", "19846740", "Alex", "We enjoyed staying in Crows Nest - it's close to the main hub of the suburb and a quick walk to trains to get into the city.  Also  the memory foam mattresses were really comfortable - everyone was saying they slept really well!"),
("2018-04-27", "19846740", "Amin", "It’s a beautiful apartment for families with kids. We truly enjoyed our stay and highly recommend this place. The communication was great and we had everything we needed. Thanks Will and Rãchël"),
("2018-05-24", "19846740", "Gabriel", "The apartment is great  very spacious  comfortable and in a great location for tourism or business."),
("2018-06-22", "19846740", "Adam", "Great location and a lovely apartment with fantastic views. Recommend staying here"),
("2018-07-05", "19846740", "Liew", "Very spacious apartment with a huge TV in the living room and v comfortable beds :)"),
("2018-07-10", "19846740", "Philip", "Fantastic location. Close to bus and trains. Nice french pastiserie nearby."),
("2018-07-14", "19846740", "Ruihang", "nice place for family with young kids"),
("2018-07-29", "19846740", "Kate", "Great and convenient spot to Crows Nest  North Sydney and the Mater Hospital. Clean apartment and comfortable beds."),
("2018-08-05", "19846740", "升旭", "整体来说还不错 位置稍微有点偏"),
("2018-09-24", "19846740", "Hanan", "Had a great stay!"),
("2018-09-26", "19846740", "Josie", "Convenient location"),
("2018-10-06", "19846740", "David", "There are some things you will be pleased with here but the cleanliness  clutter  kitchen facilities  bedding  crockery and plates will not be what you will enjoy  I'm sorry."),
("2018-10-11", "19846740", "Sarah", "Great location and lovely 2 bedroom apartment.Limited storage for guests  and kitchen essentials was limited.Would stay again!!"),
("2018-10-13", "19846740", "Carlos", "Excellent  will definitely stay again when I am back."),
("2018-11-19", "19846740", "Kevin", "Would be an ideal one or two night stop over. Lovely beds/sofa and toys for kids. Very little space if you wish to unpack any clothes (even if just one person) not much kitchen ware if you want to prepare meals. So I wouldn't recommend for longer stays although our family of 5 managed for a week."),
("2018-11-28", "19846740", "James", "Will and Rachel were amazing. So helpful when we lost our car keys. We didn’t have kids but this is the best place for kids under 6."),
("2019-01-08", "19846740", "Bojena", "Well located but terribly run.The keys were given to me 4h late.The entire place was very dirty.Not even vacuumed.No Space for hanging or even shelf’s for personal staff  all full of hosts things like if they were living there.Floor in the living area full of plastic toys which were always in the way.Kitchen sticky  the walls and all.Pantry full of half started smelly ingredients.Under the sofas and the rest of furniture dust dirt lost items including old passport combs etc.Dryer in the laundry with dirt from weeks and weeks.Balcon-more of the same -dirt and storage for the host .I have pictures to show.Never will I look at this place again and I would not recommend it to anyone who doesn’t like filth."),
("2019-01-16", "19846740", "Alice", "Hi I’m very much aligned with Bojena feedbacks (last guest in jan)! Her comments are Not “unfair” Will and Rachel ...sorry! I confirm  This place is not well run. Maybe the location and the appartement itself are great. But cleanliness please!!!! And There is no excuse of early checkin this time....What is it then ? Anyway  as hosts you have the responsibility of providing a clean and tidy place . And your place is not! I had to clean the place for 2 hours to make it acceptable. I had to do a laundry of my sheets on arrival. The sheets were not even the right size to cover the mattress. We decide not to use the kitchen appliances as they were dirty and had to do take away and restaurant every time! The fridge was so dirty I refused to put food in it. I had to vacuum the floor....and on the top of that they didn’t had any hair dryer (the host asked me to buy one and ask for refund. Yes sure  I’m on holidays and I have to take care of the equipment of your appartement Will...).I have past experiences with Rb’nb that have been fantastic! This experience is such a disappointment in regards.... I’ll make sure to look better at the guests comments in the future.I do not recommend this appartement.Alice"),
("2019-01-20", "19846740", "Ryan", "Great location. A comfortable stay. Would recommend without hesitation"),
("2019-02-04", "19846740", "Peter", "great location with lots of good restaurant around. close to shopping and to the city. some issues with the cleanliness but nothing major. will stay there again in the future"),
("2019-02-17", "19846740", "子嫣", "挺不错的 推荐哦"),
("2014-01-17", "1979960", "Alexey", "Great place to stay  great location!!!The apartment was clean cozy and had everything needed for a comfortable stay.Jeremy was a very caring and helpful host.I recommend Gracious Darlinghurst Terrace as a great place to explore Sydney!"),
("2014-01-28", "1979960", "Ashleigh", "The Darlinghurst Terrace is a great and spacious property in a fantastic location. Jeremy was wonderful to communicate with and was able to help with any concerns we had due to being from outer-state. Highly recommend."),
("2014-02-10", "1979960", "Laura", "Great house with ample amount of space and everything we could have needed. So central and convenient  yet a very quiet and beautiful street. Loved our weekend in Darlinghurst!"),
("2014-03-10", "1979960", "Ty", "The house was in a fantastically convenient location and easily accomodated all 8 of us. House is situated very close to bus lines that go to the city or Bondi Beach  kings cross and all the darlinghurst cafe's and night life is minutes away/Jeremy attended to any issues we had straight away and was a pleasure to deal with. highly recommend the house and Jeremy as its host."),
("2014-04-07", "1979960", "Donna", "Incredibly convenient! Lovely house. Clean and inviting. Everything in good working order.Enjoyed a lovely weekend with my guests from out of town (8 in total) and had a great time. Jeremy has been a pleasure to deal with- prompt responses and made an effort to be helpful and accommodating. Would definitely stay here again.Parking can be a bit tricky but is possible. This is obviously the pay-off for staying in such a central location."),
("2014-05-17", "1979960", "Zixiang", "We loved how big the house is  and how awesome the location is. The house was baby friendly with a baby chair and toys. Thumbs up! However....... There are only 2 toilets for 8 guests. Everyone must try the gelato parlour nearby. Keep a lookout for its door bitch. Haha"),
("2014-05-27", "1979960", "Megan", "Had a wonderful time at Jeremy's house. The kids especially loved the stairs and the loft bedroom.  The views from the balconies a must see. Located very close to Sydney cbd. Local buses just a street away  5 minute dawdle. It is possible to walk into / from the city which we found after the bus left us behind and no taxi would take us because they didn't have a baby seat. We were a family group of 7 so we caught a mini bus from the airport which cost us approx $60. Soo much easier than catching then train and walking with 7 + bags. Would love to stay again. "),
("2014-06-12", "1979960", "Steve", "The perfect location.  Close to bus and rail stops. Many local resturaunts. Jeremy is very responsive to any issue and responsibly accommodates his guests. He communicates quickly and is any amazing guy. The Gracious Darlinghurst  Terrace accommodates up to 8 people comfortably. All bedrooms are upstairs and the City lights view is worth every step. Thanks Jeremy. We will definite return for our next visit to Sydney."),
("2014-06-17", "1979960", "Josh", "Jeremy's Darlinghurst house is a beautiful property and was a perfect base for several of our family members (including a couple of small children) who came to visit Sydney for the week. They really loved all the cool decks attached to the bedrooms - the city views are brilliant.Jeremy himself is a very helpful and welcoming host. I'd highly recommend this place to anyone who wants to do the inner-city experience and not skimp on comfort!"),
("2014-06-28", "1979960", "Kim", "We booked Jeremy's lovely property as an offsite location for a work project. Jeremy was very friendly and professional and also extremely responsive - he replied to all of my messages immediately. This place has a lot of character and is in a great location for anybody visiting Sydney for the first time. Thanks again Jeremy!"),
("2014-07-18", "1979960", "Elena", "Jeremy was prompt in communication  check-in/out was smooth and listing location is top-notch. Would have loved to see a little more care/attention to detail in fit out to truly feel at home. "),
("2014-08-03", "1979960", "Karen", "Would just like to express how much we enjoyed our stay at Gracious Darlinghurst. Great family Accomadation in a fantastic location. We would definitely stay again & would recommend to others. Thank you to our host Jeremy Godwin for all your help with our holiday in Sydney. The Wright Family x"),
("2014-08-04", "1979960", "Belinda", "The listing was as expected  well described by host.  Communication with host was effective and in a timely manner.  Clear entry instructions. Comfortable house for 7 people. Everyone reported having slept well and being warm enough. There were extra blankets if we needed.  There were towels laid out for all the guests  plenty of room to hang clothes  and 2 showers and toilets."),
("2014-09-11", "1979960", "Cheryl", "The house was gorgeous  and perfect for jet-lag recovering guests. Darlinghurst was a great location from which to see Sydney. We loved it all. "),
("2014-10-27", "1979960", "Ryan", "Jeremy was a fantastic host. Everything was organised and exactly as planned. Thanks for making everything so easy!We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Jeremy's place in Darlinghurst and would definitely stay again and recommend to friends."),
("2014-10-30", "1979960", "Ann Loraine", "The place is perfect for a big family getaway! Spacious  convenient  equipped  nice and comfy. "),
("2014-12-30", "1979960", "Robert", "We had a great stay in Jeremy's Terrace House.  Arrived early  but the cleaner let us drop our bags and we headed off on foot to explore Sydney.  Darlinghurst location is excellent.  We walked to the Sydney Cricket Ground for a match  walked to the Botanical Gardens and city center.  Great pubs/bars close by as well.  Jeremy stopped by first day to drop off a new kettle.  Pleasant host! Everything was clean and orderly.   Great place to start our visit down under!"),
("2015-02-19", "1979960", "Matthew", "We had a fantastic stay in this house. It is in an excellent location in walking distance to major attractions. The immediate area has fantastic cafés and restaurants.Arranging the stay was easy and Jeremy was a very accommodating host  always easily contactable. We'd definitely stay here again."),
("2015-05-31", "1979960", "Joseph", "Beautiful  enormous town house in a perfect location.  Within easy walking distance of the train station at  Kings Cross  the bars  restaurants and clubs on Oxford Street and even the centre of the city.  Stunning views of the city from the balcony outside the uppermost  Swiss-chalet style bedroom.  We had four adult males staying in the house and we all had plenty of space.  For a group of people  it's also very economical: much cheaper than trying to find a similar hotel suite for the same price.  Perfect for a short or extended stay in Sydney  and surprisingly tranquil for such a central location.  Small tip: if there are two or more of you  it's just as cheap to get a taxi from the airport than taking the train. Jeremy is also very friendly and helpful."),
("2015-06-08", "1979960", "Sam", "Loved the location as we were able to get in and out of the city so easily. The house was lovely and we had a great time there. Thank you."),
("2015-06-11", "1979960", "Derek", "Jeremy is great!  Very nice and accommodating.  We didn't have much interaction but when I called or emailed he was right on it.  And helped me deliver a box to his place.   We were out of the apt most of the time so I can't comment much on the place but it had all the basics of what you would need.  Darlinghurst is nice and quiet  great little breakfast spots. "),
("2015-06-28", "1979960", "Michael", "We had a great stay at this Darlinghurst property. The location was very good in terms of walking to the city centre  catching buses or trains and there were very good restaurants and a supermarket nearby. The living area and bedrooms were large and comfortable. The kitchen was well equiped and two bathrooms serve the four bedrooms well. We would rate this property highly for anyone looking to rent four bedrooms near the central city."),
("2015-07-12", "1979960", "Jamie", "Nice spacious house  quiet area that's within walking distance to the hustle and bustle of the city. Nice and clean. Could see myself settling there "),
("2015-07-17", "1979960", "Matthew", "I travelled with 7 companions and we thoroughly enjoyed staying at this property.Location trumps everything - especially in a city like Sydney - and this house is perfectly situated and really good value for money.Supermarkets  pubs  restaurants  night life  the CBD  opera house and harbour are only a short walk away.The views from the east facing bedrooms are spectacular  both with good sized private balconies to enjoy.Jeremy is a delightful and responsive host.  He was always quick to respond to messages and to answer any questions. I was worried about parking because this house doesn't have a carport or driveway. But Jeremy has an arrangement with a nearby car wash that charges only $20 a day.  It was convenient and hassle-free.   When comparing other options for a group of 8 or so  this house is excellent value for money.  At around $60 a head per night  you won't find anything in Sydney for that price - let alone a gorgeous house like this!  "),
("2015-08-03", "1979960", "Yiran", "Jeremy has been super helpful while we lived in this beautiful place in darlinghurst. It is very convenient to the CBD as well. Great experience in Sydney."),
("2015-08-24", "1979960", "Rachel", "This is a great location for easy access to public transport  the city and surrounds. Comfortable beds and ample hanging space compliment the spacious four bedrooms. It was a nice place to rest after a busy day sightseeing."),
("2015-09-14", "1979960", "Claudia", "The Darlinghurst Terrace was a great place to stay with my family. Location was excellent  very close to the city  Oxford st & great dining options.  The rooms were large and kitchen/dining too.  I would stay again"),
("2015-10-10", "1979960", "Feng", "房子与照片相差非常远 比较失望｡"),
("2015-10-24", "1979960", "Jacques", "Location of this place is really convenient quiet to relax and only less than 10 minutes of walking to major markets shopping mall. Lots of cute restaurants cafes in narrow streets nearby which make strolling very agreeable. Four big bedrooms make life easier for our group of 7. The place is super clean and well stock of kitchen utensils plates cutlery coffee maker. Jeremy emailed us in advance the instruction to get in the place also. Would definitely recommend this place to everyone ."),
("2015-11-12", "1979960", "David", "The house is well situated in a pleasant suburb taking only about 15-20 minutes to walk into Sydney and is also close to major bus routes for exploring further afield  as well as having shops and restaurants nearby. The house is quite spacious  and equipped with all the necessary appliances  including wifi  to make the stay most enjoyable. If the weather had been better during our holiday then we would have made more use of the balconies that provide impressive views of the city. The house was clean and tidy when we arrived and the entry instructions were quite clear. Jeremy was very accommodating by arranging an early check in and  late check out.      "),
("2015-11-27", "1979960", "Ain", "Jeremy is an amazing host! He answered our calls as soon as he can and all his instructions regarding the house were very clear. The house is also perfect for families. 8mins walk to nearby shops  food places. Thumbs up!"),
("2015-11-29", "1979960", "Joyce", "The house is nice and it is located in good location  especially the view on roof top is really stunning. However the furnitures and amenities was not in very good condition. and quite some flys within the house. No air-conditioning  might be a problem for summer time. i feel over-price comparing to the quality of the house.   "),
("2015-12-26", "1979960", "Holly", "We very much enjoyed our stay in Darlinghurst.  The house was large  fully equipped and comfortable. The roof terraces were a treat. The location was ideal for access to downtown Sydney either by walking or public transportation. Jeremy made every attempt to accommodate our schedule.  The house was mostly as described but the furnishings were a little tired."),
("2016-01-01", "1979960", "Manika", "The host was very welcoming. The property was very nice and clean. Enjoyed our stay there."),
("2016-01-07", "1979960", "Astrid", "We had a good time at this place. The location is perfect for a visit to Sydney - all major sights are more or less in walking distance. Jeremy was very helpful and accessible  and he responded immediately in case of concerns or problems. The house is very spacious and easily accommodates a group the size of ours (8 adults)  it just could do with some TLC. We had the 'Big Wet' (non-stop rain for four days in a row!) so unfortunately we could not enjoy the decks and balconies. "),
("2016-02-12", "1979960", "Yudong", "It was a really nice stay! The location is perfect  and everything you might need is just within walking distance or a short drive. Everything in the house is well signed and it just took us a sec to find the things we needed. Jeremy is a awesome host! Big thanks from my families and me!"),
("2016-03-02", "1979960", "Jill", "We really appreciated how well Jeremy communicated with us before/during/after the stay.  He is more than willing to help with anything you may need.   The property is spacious and offers a washer and dryer which was greatly appreciated.  We liked the neighborhood  especially the breakfast/coffee shop on the corner.  It's within walking distance to many restaurants.  Also  very close to public transit.  Only negative  is there is no air-conditioning... so if you visit in summer  it may be an issue for you.  However  it's so much cheaper than staying in a hotel! "),
("2016-03-10", "1979960", "Kevin", "Great house in a great location  easy communication with the host and very helpful. The house is more than big enough for a big family. The balcony's were great with great city views. The amenities were great  wifi  washing machine etc. only downside was no air con which we would have liked."),
("2016-03-15", "1979960", "Colin", "The house is spacious and in a great location. The two terraces are a lovely way to spend an evening with a bottle of wine. Jeremy is a very responsive host and fixed a couple of very minor things (bulbs out) we asked for straight away and with minimal fuss. There is no air con which means the house gets very hot in the warm weather."),
("2016-03-31", "1979960", "Ken", "We had a great time staying at Darlinghurst.  Fantastic Victorian style home on a quiet street (for the city at least) near great restaurants and public transportation (Kings Cross train stop).  Jeremy was easy to communicate with by phone and text and resolved any issues quickly."),
("2016-04-13", "1979960", "Ethu", "Jeremy was an extremely helpful host. Communication both before and during our stay was prompt  friendly and of great assistance. The location of the apartment is super and the whole family had a lovely time."),
("2016-04-18", "1979960", "Ethu", "This was our second stay at Jeremy's lovely Darlinghurst property. A very pleasant experience indeed."),
("2016-04-21", "1979960", "Yangmei", "Great location and very helpful host!"),
("2016-04-26", "1979960", "Danielle", "This was our first time using Airbnb and we was so happy with how easy the whole process was. We had an early flight so were kindly allowed early access which was much appreciated. The house was wonderful  very well equipped  clean and spacious with many outdoor sitting areas and a fantastic view of the city from the top deck. We loved the area with lots of cafes and restaurants very close by and Hyde Park only a 10 - 15 min walk away. Would definitely stay here again"),
("2016-05-02", "1979960", "Anna", "Easy access.  Lovely and clean."),
("2016-05-18", "1979960", "Mark", "Great location and very responsive host!  Easy walking to all key attractions and home was very comfortable. Definitely enjoyed our stay. Thank you  Jeremy!"),
("2016-05-29", "1979960", "Laura", "This is the second time I've booked Jeremy's place. He is punctual in responding to queries and always so helpful and polite.The area is perfect and the house clean  spacious and has pretty much everything you need. My family loved staying here. Great coffees at the Rusty Rabbit on the corner too!Id book again in a heart beat.Thanks again Jeremy. "),
("2016-06-28", "1979960", "Roy", "Jeremy is one of the most helpful and responsive host you can have. One of our heaters was down and he brought a new one to replace the very evening after we left a message! Apart from the low water pressure on 2nd floor  everything else plus the convenient location makes the trip a notch better than it already is:) "),
("2016-08-29", "1979960", "Natascha", "The place is exactly as presented in the pictures. Its clean  well stocked and the location is perfect for getting around all the sites while still enjoying a good nights sleep. Jeremy is easy to communicate with and generously accommodating. If you stay  try the Rusty Rabbit cafe just a block away. "),
("2016-09-07", "1979960", "Clarence", "The house was big and spacious enough to accommodate the 7 of us! Furnitures are a bit old  but the location of the house was quite centralized. It is 10-15mins walk from King's Cross station. Overall  we had a wonderful stay there and Jeremy has been very helpful in answering our enquiries. "),
("2016-10-17", "1979960", "Tamsin", "My friends I stayed here and we couldn't have been happier with our choice. It's a lovely quiet neighbourhood with great cafes and so close to the city. The place itself was tidy and spacious for my 7 large group. Would highly recommend to anyone and would be top of my list to stay again. And to top it off the host (Jeremy) was great to communicate with."),
("2016-11-06", "1979960", "Clare", "We stayed here while visiting Sydney for a family function and found the house large enough and very comfortable for the 7 of us. The kitchen is well equipped and Jeremy was very accommodating of our requests for a cot and high chair for our daughter. He was also very responsive throughout our stay and responded quickly to our questions. The house is located in a lovely neighbourhood  with many food and entertainment options nearby. Only downside is the upstairs room did get rather hot  but fans are provided. Overall it provided for a clean  comfortable stay."),
("2016-11-15", "1979960", "John", "Great house in a great location. Jeremy was very responsive and helpful."),
("2016-11-26", "1979960", "Jonathan", "A fantastic property that is within walking distance of the CBD. It is surrounded by cafes  restaurants  and watering holes. I would highly recommend this property to anyone wanting to experience the true Sydney lifestyle."),
("2016-11-29", "1979960", "Le Lodge", "quite near to city center. house is good for large group."),
("2016-12-06", "1979960", "Mary", "This was a great location to stay in. We enjoyed the convenience of being able to walk to and from the local bars and restaurants of Dalinghurst.The four bedroom set up was perfect for our family .Jeremy was easy to converse with and the house was clean with a great kitchen set up Would be happy to rent this place again in the future."),
("2017-01-15", "1979960", "Ansley", "I love this house!!! Bed is comfortable and near more coffee shop"),
("2017-01-28", "1979960", "Melissa", "Great location. Only issue we had was due to no air conditioning and no fly-screens there were bugs everywhere as it was hot when we stayed. The downstairs shower is a hassle as water goes all over the bathroom floor after each shower as there is only a shower curtain around it. Other then that the house was clean and in a very nice  quiet neighborhood and Jeremy made organizing the trip and our stay incredibly easy. "),
("2017-02-23", "1979960", "Nigel", "Booked this for work colleagues and they loved the place. Jeremy's communication was great and made it really easy."),
("2017-03-07", "1979960", "Jeremy", "Jeremy is a friendly and communicative host. Whilst the place is large and in a great location/close proximity to everything you'd need  we did have some severe issues with cleanliness and bugs in the house. We raised this with Jeremy immediately and he took it very seriously  organising for the cleaner to come back first thing the next day which we appreciated. I believe the situation with bugs has now been taken care of.Jeremy also allowed us a late check-out which was greatly appreciated.Overall I could recommend this place for a family to stay as the above-mentioned issues have now been resolved. "),
("2017-03-14", "1979960", "Elizabeth", "Great please to stay. Would recommend."),
("2017-03-18", "1979960", "Rosemary", "Our stay was quite good. It was fairly close to the city which is what we needed  with cafes etc nearby. There were 4 of us so we could have a bedroom each. Price was very reasonable and it suited our purpose. It was well stocked. Unfortunately the stairs presented problems for some of us who have joint issues."),
("2017-03-23", "1979960", "Kim", "The house was nothing like the listing. It was filthy dirty and smelled of urine and was over run with cock roaches. It was un hygienic and uninhabitable  we had to seek alternative accomodation and are requesting a full refund......"),
("2017-04-05", "1979960", "John", "Jeremy was an excellent host and the house is perfect for a base near the cbd. The bars and restaurants locally are great. The house makes living in the area easy when working out of Sydney."),
("2017-04-08", "1979960", "Rae", "Great Location and easy access to public transport very clean. Thanks to Jimmy for looking after our cars. Would recommend this home. Jeremy was easy to communicate with and very helpful.  Would definitely recommend this home for a great stay in our beautiful city Sydney."),
("2017-04-11", "1979960", "Annie", "房間地點很好 但屋比較舊及污糟｡"),
("2017-04-14", "1979960", "Andrew", "House is in a great location and Jeremy very easy to deal with and most helpful. Property could do with a bit of an update although very clean but decor looking tired."),
("2017-04-21", "1979960", "Angela", "Jeremy was a great host overall.  The townhouse was exactly like the photos.  Beautiful and clean space in the perfect area. The views from the balconies onto the city skyline were such a nice touch. Like a secret hiding spot! The neighborhood is safe  scenic  and quiet.  Once you walk a couple blocks there are a bunch of restaurants  bars  cafes  corner stores  and anything you would need. Great nightlife on Victoria Street! The main issues was some basic TLC. The bath towels need to be replaced.  Missing some essentials  such as hand towels in bathrooms and hand soap as well.  There were also no screens on windows + the no AC threw us all off.  Not sure why there were no screens on the windows  especially since we would need them open to let cooler air in.  We were worried about bugs coming in  so made sure all food was kept in the refrigerator.  Maybe this is a Sydney thing?  One of the couches in the living room definitely needs to be replaced.Besides these doable updates  our stay was perfect.  We really enjoyed the space  had fun sitting around the beautiful dining room table eating breakfast that we comfortably made in the very spacious kitchen  and had a nice sleep every night in the bed.  The Townhouse is affordable  great location  and comfortable.  I hope these updates will be made so future guests can enjoy it even more!"),
("2017-05-02", "1979960", "Minh Quang", "The accommodation is clean and convenient to discover Sydney city. The house is family friendly  we can find all we need inside the house and the neighbourhood."),
("2017-05-06", "1979960", "Huong", "We had a great time staying at this place. Jereymy is a really good host"),
("2017-05-11", "1979960", "Alex", "The property is a great place to base yourself in central Sydney. There are 4 double beds and 2 bathrooms. Jeremy was a great host and was very easy to communicate with."),
("2017-05-31", "1979960", "蘩俐", "房屋位置很好 只是过于老旧了 顶层木地板走起来有声音 阳台门锁不住 浴室竟然找不到一个可以挂毛巾的挂钩 隔音很差 总而言之一切只赢在了地理位置｡"),
("2017-06-10", "1979960", "Lisa", "Perfect location. Great  clean and well equipped house.Absolutely perfect! "),
("2017-06-17", "1979960", "Bruce", "A fabulous property with a fabulous host.This is a great place in a great part of a great city. Jeremy really is a generous and considerate host who goes out of his way to make available a beautiful and comfortable home.We really couldn't recommend more highly."),
("2017-07-12", "1979960", "Ed", "Great house and great location"),
("2017-07-23", "1979960", "Mary-Jane", "Best location  perfect for a large group!!!!!!! Clean and Jeremy is a great host! Seriously we travel a lot and moving forward will always use air b n b than uou"),
("2017-08-18", "1979960", "Guin-Ming", "Jeremy's place was great.  There is plenty of room for guests as the 4 bedrooms can accommodate many. Three different terraces to sit out and enjoy as well as the back yard.  The real advantage is how close it is to shops and sights.  A short walk to hyde park  oxford street and kings cross. Walk a bit more and you are at the royal botanical gardens and the opera house.  Big kitchen and dining table so everyone can sit and eat together. Washrooms were smaller then expected and a few more stairs then we thought but we would highly recommend staying here if you are in Sydney and want to be near the CBD and some of the tourists sights."),
("2017-08-25", "1979960", "Sebastian", "Let's be clear - this is an incredible space. The Airbnb is bigger than it appears in the pictures  and the views far more stunning. The neighborhood is also so charming and underrated - so many excellent cafes and restaurants  and yet still so quiet. You will not find a better Airbnb in Sydney for this value - period. Jeremy was also a delight to facilitate this process - organized  quickly responsive  and willing to go that extra bit to accommodate your needs. Being a frequent Airbnb host myself  I was so impressed. I would recommend this property to anyone I know visiting Sydney  and can't wait to hopefully stay here again! Thanks again  Jeremy!"),
("2017-08-27", "1979960", "Jeffery", "Jeremy was very accommodating and provided friendly prompt communication and assistance. Highly recommended."),
("2017-09-01", "1979960", "Alexandra", "Great location  nice space for our group of 8. Full kitchen and four bedrooms each with double beds. Note the upstairs bathroom has only louvred doors (not entirely private when there are a load of people in the place) and the downstairs bathroom has the nicer shower  but is located in the utility room next to the washer and dryer. Jeremy was great in responding quickly to some very minor issues  such as burned-out light bulbs."),
("2017-09-06", "1979960", "Jane", "We had a great stay in Jeremy's place. It was a great location and exactly as described. Would highly recommend."),
("2017-09-15", "1979960", "Michelle", "What a great location  with a generous sized house.  The kitchen  dining and living rooms are very comfortable sizes  and a bonus for each bedroom to have its own level  two with balconies.We would happily stay again and definitely recommend it to others.Jeremy was very easy to communicate with  our booking went very smoothly!We hope you enjoy your stay also!!!"),
("2017-09-22", "1979960", "Amber", "房屋很好 楼梯很陡"),
("2017-09-27", "1979960", "Vladimir", "The host canceled this reservation 59 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-10-04", "1979960", "Mark", "Great house in great location with a fantastic host. Was on site when we arrived and the internet wasn’t working. Was straight onto sorting  went out bought new modem and fixed problem. Shows how great a host he is."),
("2017-10-26", "1979960", "Neil", "Jeremy was easy to communicate with and his place was really great!"),
("2017-11-05", "1979960", "Sara", "Gorgeous house... quintessential Sydney terrace! And some amazing properties in the surrounding streets to admire.Plenty of room for all 7 of us  without feeling cramped at all... although one of the couches needs updating. Fantastic location- a short  easy stroll into the CBD & Pitt St. Mall. We were surprised just how close we actually were  the maps are deceiving!Fantastic cafes at your doorstep. NB. The house isn’t ideal for people with any mobility issues (the main bathroom isn’t accommodating & the old knees were a bit tired by the end of the weekend!)We stayed in early November  which was ideal. But much further into summer & I would have struggled with the lack of cooling in the house... No air-con = open windows = mosquitoes! But if mosquitoes aren’t an issue for you... go for it!"),
("2017-11-16", "1979960", "Tina", "The Gracious Terrace House of Jeremy is a great place to stay  and we’re we really enjoy time being there. Good location  clean house  plenty of rooms for our family with an infant  kid  and group of 6 people. Thank you Jeremy for your quick response and definitely stay again when we visit Sydney! All the best Jeremy!"),
("2017-11-22", "1979960", "Sharon", "Jeremy was a breeze to deal with during a challenging time for our family. We had a family member in St Vincent's hospital at very short notice and Jeremy's place is a few minute walk away. Restaurants  shops and the city are so close. Parking was wonderful and the location was safe and quiet. We were needy guests due to circumstance and Jeremy was very patience and kind and nothing was a problem. Thank you!"),
("2017-12-16", "1979960", "Clare", "Let's start with the positives - this house was in a great location  close to pubs  restaurants  shops and amenities. And the beds were comfy. Now for the negatives - and there are a few. First  the house needs a thorough clean and paint: the walls are dirty  the carpets are dirty  the kitchen needs a scrub. There's no air-con  and when the heat reaches 39 degrees as it did when we were there  that was an issue. Yes  we knew that when we made the booking  but at least provide decent fans that don't sound like a jet engine taking off. The downstairs shower leaked every time it was used; the upstairs bathroom was ancient and needs replacing  and the bathroom itself had saloon doors - privacy be damned. The sofas in the lounge need replacing: one was worn  the other like sitting on a rock. The dining table and chairs were passable. The four bedrooms felt grimy; only three had doors  the fourth wide open at the top of a staircase - far from ideal. The towels were threadbare. Plus  with 8 of staying  I would expect at least 8 of everything: cutlery  wine glasses  plates  water glasses  mugs - there were not. We arrived an hour early and the house was still dirty from the previous tennants  with towels on the floor  rubbish in the property. When we came back two hours later  it still wasn't ready. The spare keys were not where they should have been. Jeremy showed up the following day with flowers as an apology and spare keys - but we had no vase to put the flowers in. This house COULD be great - it has the space for 8  two lovely balconies  comfy beds  great location. But it was far from great for us  and I'd say  until it's cleaned and refurbed and some of the money the owner is making is ploughed back into the property  you'd be better off booking elsewhere."),
("2017-12-17", "1979960", "Katie", "Excellent location  lovely spacious rooms. Perfect place for a getaway."),
("2018-01-06", "1979960", "Sam", "Jeremy’s place was very nice  in a perfect location. It was comfortable for 8 guests and the views from the deck were beautiful. Would defiantly recommend the stay!"),
("2018-01-13", "1979960", "David", "A beautiful house in a great location! Furniture was very basic though. Could also use air-conditioning to help with the heat - although there are small fans everywhere."),
("2018-02-04", "1979960", "Mark", "Hi Jeremy Sorry for the late response but we have been busy. Jeremy responded promptly to our request and was helpful with suggestions by email. My wife  myself & my family all enjoyed our stay at this house.. Location could not have been better. We were within walking distance of all we came to do such as go to the theatre  walk in the Botanical Gardens  eat at good restaurants and for some to visit the shops.We found it is in a great central location. Your accommodation provided for us what we (Website hidden by Airbnb) has a lovely spacious living area  a fully equiped kitchen  good laundry facilities and four (Website hidden by Airbnb) toilets and bathrooms were both more than adequate. We enjoyed the cafe nearby called "" The Rusty Rabbit"". We would not hesitate to rent your accommodation again. Thank you.Mark"),
("2018-02-11", "1979960", "Marion", "This accommodation is full of character  with great views  especially from the top level. The kitchen was modern with plenty of cooking equipment. We were glad of the large fans in the bedrooms as we were there in summer. There is a great cafe nearby. Jeremy answered my queries very quickly. We had a lovely stay!"),
("2018-02-19", "1979960", "Ling", "Jeremy 的热情好客 每次的反馈都非常及时 在我们到来之前还特意在房子放置了鲜花美化环境｡房子周边的配套还算方便 走路2-3分钟就有餐厅 10-15分钟就有超市 公交车站也是5分钟的路程｡家里的配套设施一应俱全 我们8个人居住得非常舒适｡唯一的小缺点就是这里的蚊子有点多 不过房东很及时又很贴心地为我们准备了各种灭蚊用品｡"),
("2018-02-22", "1979960", "Nikki", "Jeremy's terrace had a lot of character  in such a great location which was incredibly quiet considering...the views of the city were beautiful! With 4 bedrooms we all had our own space  3 with balconies and seperate living zone meant that the 5 of us had our own down time...we could walk to most places that we went to Sydney to experience and it was easy to get in touch with Jeremy who let us leave our bags at the house so we didn't have to carry them around with us on our final morning. Would definitely recommend the house and location if visiting Sydney esp if travelling with 4+adults...."),
("2018-03-10", "1979960", "Margie", "This property is in a fantastic location so central to the city. Jeremy is a fantastic host who went out of his way to ensure our stay was hassle free. Exceptional communication replying swiftly to any messages. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay and loved that our whole extended family could be together. Would definitely stay at this property again and would recommend it to others needing a central location."),
("2018-03-17", "1979960", "Sandie And Naylin", "Awesome location  clean and neat. Don't leave the attic room door open in summer though unless you have lots of insect protection. Mosquitoes had a field day until we got up and sprayed. Nothing Jeremy can do about that. We have already booked his place again in June."),
("2018-03-21", "1979960", "Ahmed", "Good space!"),
("2018-03-28", "1979960", "Agata", "Our stay at this beautiful terrace was a great experience and I would not hesitate to book again. The views were lovely both during the day and the night. The house was large enough for all 8 of us to exist very comfortably and everyone enjoyed all the history and quirks this special house has to offer. We had everything we needed and Jeremy was very informative. We took in the neighbourhood on our walks and enjoyed a truly great breakfast at the cafe nearby. It was a special stay and we will remember it fondly."),
("2018-04-09", "1979960", "Niko", "Jeremy’s place is perfect for groups wanting to stay in central Darlinghurst. I will always check to see if it’s available every time I’m heading to Sydney! Really great location and very comfortable!"),
("2018-04-21", "1979960", "Chrissie", "A fantastic location right in the heart of Darlinghurst. Very good value for money and would highly recommend any visitor to Sydney to hit up Jeremy for accommodation. 100% would stay here again."),
("2018-04-25", "1979960", "Kelly", "If you have not been to Sydney  do it NOW! And Jeremy's place is a superior place to stay. It is super close to everything. Just a couple of blocks from the train station on tree lined  hilly neighborhood streets. Trains/buses great way to get around town  clean  fast  inexpensive. Jeremy's place is well located  super great historic home with all the modern amenities including kitchen  bath  etc. Neighbors are great. Many nearly coffee shops  cafes and corner groceries! You will love Jeremy's place!"),
("2018-04-29", "1979960", "James", "A great place for a group visit to Sydney - well located near cafes and public transport. Highly commend Jeremy’s hospitality."),
("2018-05-04", "1979960", "Helen", "The host canceled this reservation 54 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-06-01", "1979960", "Karim", "OK"),
("2018-06-03", "1979960", "Fozia", "Jeremy was an excellent host  and his terrace was absolutely beautiful. Check in was a breeze  and Jeremy provided lots of tips and information for our stay. Communication was very easy and quick. The terrace was very clean with a lot of character. You’ll find two balconies in this home with extraordinary views of the city. Furthermore  you’re only a stroll away from great cafes  restaurants  shops  and bars. My stay was with 5 other adults  but there would be enough space to accommodate 2 more very comfortably. We all had a wonderful experience at this gorgeous terrace."),
("2018-06-11", "1979960", "Sandie And Naylin", "second time we have stayed here. Excellent location and lovely home. Jeremy allowed us to leave our bags there as our flight was later in the day. Will definitely use again and highly recommended"),
("2018-06-19", "1979960", "Theresa", "Nice house near to SYD CBD area. Car is not recommended as the parking fee is expensive. Public transport and MRT can be accessed easily. No concern in getting nice food nearly."),
("2018-07-04", "1979960", "Ashley", "This was the perfect place to stay in the city. Not only were we centrally located but the upper balcony has the most incredible view of downtown for sunset. Stay here!!"),
("2018-07-24", "1979960", "Alison", "A great place to stay that is not too far from Sydney's city centre."),
("2018-07-30", "1979960", "Michelle", "Sensational location with amenities at your doorstep. Jeremy’s property is a great place to stay for a family get together. We will be back."),
("2018-08-03", "1979960", "Nicole", "Amazing! We used Jeremy’s place as our base for a team business trip to Sydney. Jeremy was extremely responsive and did what he could to accomodate us dropping bags off early - breezy as checkin process. What we loved about this house was everything. There are 4 bedrooms  3 which each have their own balcony. The top rooms balcony has views of the city and the sunsets are STUNNING. Great place for evening wines. (It would be great if there were some fairy lights here is a small lantern).The kitchen has everything you could need  so would be very comfortable for families or long stays. The neighbourhood is safe and easy to explore. There are many great cafes within walking distance.Lookout for the Neighbours friendly cat  Fudge. We will stay here again in a heartbeat!"),
("2018-08-13", "1979960", "Robert", "Our second stay with friends such a great location . Nice large  roomy and well set out Terrace house . Thanks again Jeremy "),
("2018-08-25", "1979960", "Nina", "Jeremy is a great host! Nothing was too hard for him and he was always available for me. All the instructions left for us was clear and Jeremy was also very easy to communicate with. The place was great too  it was so clean and everything was prepared for us. My family of 6 and I thoroughly enjoyed our stay  all of us think the house is homey and cosy. We loved every bit of the experience living in the house and would recommend Jeremy & his place to everyone!"),
("2018-08-29", "1979960", "Leanne", "Highly recommend to all  very spacious!! We had 8 guests and it was very comfortable and close to all attractions.. will be definitely stay again !! Thank you Jeremy !! "),
("2018-08-31", "1979960", "Sudhir", "Great place & location"),
("2018-09-03", "1979960", "Mary-Ann", "Jeremy's Terrace was very home like and relaxing. Our family had a great stay with plenty of room for every one. The home has everything you need for an easy getaway to Sydney."),
("2018-09-06", "1979960", "Kate", "Our stay at this Darlinghurst apartment was great! A terrific location with easy access to the city and comfortable beautiful home to stay in. It was great for our family trip!"),
("2018-09-17", "1979960", "Julia", "High recommend Jeremy's Airbnb for groups of friends who'd like to explore Sydney! Location was amazing as we were a 10 minute walk away from the city :) The space was clean and larger than I had initially expected with 4 bedrooms with some individual balconies in the terrace house. Would definitely book again for my next Sydney trip!"),
("2018-09-22", "1979960", "Ben", "Amazing stay and super helpful - best value I have had in Sydney over 3 years of traveling there 10 times a year."),
("2018-09-23", "1979960", "Leanne", "Our stay was absolutely wonderful!The view from the top bedroom is amazing  overlooking the city. The house is very clean and tidy! The rooms are spacious and stylish. It has everything you need and we felt extremely spoilt on our weekend away.Jeremy is a great host  easy to contact  accommodating and always gave a quick response to my queries. Thanks again!The terrace is very well located  close to everything  in the heart of Darlinghurst. Thank you Jeremy for everything  we hope to be back soon."),
("2018-09-25", "1979960", "Naomi", "We stayed at Jeremy’s place for a work trip to Sydney. It was in a great location and great value for money"),
("2018-09-30", "1979960", "Paul & Karen", "Our stay at Jeremy's place at Darlinghurst was above all expectations.  There were 3 married couples staying and we were all very pleased and amazed at our accommodation.  Jeremy was easy to communiate and the terrace was lovely and clean with plenty of extra available for us to use.  The outdoor balancies were great to enjoy a morning cuppa or an evening beverage watching the sunset.  The terrace was close to cafes and restaurants.  We were also pleased to find out we were very close to the city and public transport from both ends of the street.  I would have no hesitate in recommending Jeremy's place.  Thank you for sharing your place with us for our weekend away. Cheers Paul and Karen"),
("2018-10-04", "1979960", "Jing", "Same as description. Nice house and react very quickly."),
("2018-10-07", "1979960", "Michelle", "Enjoyable stay.  Great central location.  Easy to communicate with host.  Awesome wifi.  Would recommend."),
("2018-10-10", "1979960", "Liz", "Awesome terrace! Easy walk to great cafes  eateries and shops!  Awesome views from the terrace balconies. We had 8 guests in total and never felt crowded! Easy check in and great communication!"),
("2018-10-10", "1979960", "Sarah & Ryan", "Beautiful house in an awesome and very central location...Jeremy was easily available to reach when needed ahead of check in"),
("2018-10-14", "1979960", "Camilla", "Such a fantastic location! Lovely big kitchen and dining space. The home can house four couples comfortably. It is a very close walk to Oxford street and the CBD."),
("2018-10-22", "1979960", "Zoe", "Highly Recommended. This terrace house was great accommodation for our weekend getaway in Sydney. The house was clean and spacious enough for 5 adults. We used 3 of the 4 double rooms and it was handy to have 2 bathrooms. The back courtyard was great for a lazy afternoon relaxing with wine and nibbles. The neighbours cat  Fudge  came to say hello and went for a wander through the house and out the back  balcony - he seemed to know exactly where he was going :).It is in a great location for Oxford St which has lots of bars/restaurants/shops and plenty of bus services to the city. There's a wonderful cafe at the end of the block - The Rusty Rabbit. It's in between 2 train stations  it's a bit hilly from Museum tho so best to use Kings Cross (or get the bus) if you have luggage.Jeremy was very responsive to communication and everything was as described. Would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-11-03", "1979960", "Bianca", "The home was amazing. An awesome space in a great location! Jeremy was extremely helpful and accommodating and communication with him was a breeze. Would highly recommend anyone looking for a great place to stay here. Thanks for having us Jeremy  hope to be back in your great space again!!!"),
("2018-11-04", "1979960", "Mike", "A wonderful space and 5-Star location. Jeremy’s description and photos of the terrace were on point.Communication was easy and efficient  and Jeremy was accommodating to our requests. Would recommend as a great place to stay for a weekend in the heart of the city"),
("2018-11-12", "1979960", "Paul", "Great convenient place in the heart of the action at a reasonable price"),
("2018-11-13", "1979960", "Jillian", "Beautiful  well-maintained home in a fantastic location  well-suited to our group of colleagues in town for a conference. Very accurate information provided  Jeremy was very easy to liaise with."),
("2018-11-14", "1979960", "Fern", "Super impressed with the property. Great location  modern interior and excellent value for money. Cannot wait to book with you again! Thanks Jeremy"),
("2018-11-15", "1979960", "Alexandra", "Outstanding location  Darlinghurst has a great café  dining and local bar scene and is only walking distance to the city. It's a lovely terrace house so you will get a real Sydney local experience here. I booked the house for some meetings but will definately book again if I have visitors coming to Sydney."),
("2018-11-18", "1979960", "Anna", "This beautiful home is perfect for larger groups. The living and dining area is spacious and comfortable. We had a group of 6 and really enjoyed the private decks and outdoor area. Wonderful location  so close to everything you would want for a Sydney stay."),
("2018-11-20", "1979960", "Neil", "Nice place a great location. Jeremy is a top bloke and very helpful. Thanks"),
("2018-11-25", "1979960", "Jane", "Clean  convenient and Jeremy was excellent to deal with. Will stay here again!"),
("2018-12-08", "1979960", "Josh", "Jeremy’s place was great! Check in and all communications were super easy and the place was ideal in terms of location and the space itself. Would definitely recommend to anyone"),
("2018-12-13", "1979960", "Imogen", "Jeremy’s place was a great stay in the heart of the city. Lovely terrace apartment  easy check in!Would stay again!"),
("2019-01-17", "1979960", "Jørgen", "Nice place in a great location."),
("2019-01-19", "1979960", "Natalie", "This property is exactly what you see  a relaxed  wonderful property in a fantastic location. A little warm during Sydney's heat wave with no aircon  but fans in every room helped get the air flowing. There was plenty of room for the large group of us  all adults  and it was a very comfortable and homey. Beds were comfy  and everything provided as stated  and lovely and clean. Easy check-in/check out process. Would definitely recommend this property to everyone!"),
("2019-01-29", "1979960", "Cameron", "The property is in an incredible location in Darlinghurst with the most stunning views of the Sydney skyline. Jeremy is an amazing host who was accommodating  responsive and helpful"),
("2019-02-07", "1979960", "Emma", "Great location  very roomy  lovely Darlinghurst terrace! Would recommend."),
("2019-02-15", "1979960", "Jess", "Beautiful old terrace house in an amazing location. We loved our stay!"),
("2019-02-23", "1979960", "Jennifer", "Great place to stay in a nice area. Our stay was completely hassle-free - something you don't always get with some places. Instructions were thorough and no need for a whole lot of communication throughout our stay  though Jeremy was easily contactable if needed. Overall we had an extremely pleasant stay."),
("2019-02-27", "1979960", "Maureen", "Fantastic location4 bedrooms close to shops. Close to Kings cross and not to expensive in taxi if you want to head to circular quay. Great Host"),
("2018-10-23", "19995621", "Coro", "Don’t book this house. It is incredibly dirty full of insects all over the bedrooms  kitchen  and toiltet. My family and me are VERY dissatisfied with this house. Really bad. We tried to contact the owner but they are not polite at all"),
("2018-10-29", "19995621", "Rosey", "Great location  walking distance to beach. Older style property. Garden needs to be maintained.Very responsive host."),
("2017-12-31", "20044641", "Kris", "Over all is good!"),
("2019-01-01", "20044641", "Sophia", "Communication was very difficult because she only can speak Chinese and doesn't understand english. The kitchen was very dirty  e.g. the dishes or the microwave. There was no oven."),
("2017-08-20", "20055551", "VIncent", "Adrian's house is well located  just few minutes away from Hyde park and Oxford street. Everywhere is walkable and close to train station and bus stands to most of the area. The room is exactly same as the photo  there is a private balcony which I always spent my evening there with some good Aussie wines.Communication is good before and throughout my stay  his housemate David is very friendly too.Thanks Adrian! "),
("2017-10-05", "20055551", "Shin Khoon", "Location is central to the CBD"),
("2017-10-15", "20055551", "Daisuke", "立地はとてもいいです｡ただ､決して綺麗な家とは言えないので女性などにはおすすめできないです｡ただ､若い女性も住んでいたので､あまり気にならない方は大丈夫かと思います｡"),
("2017-12-10", "20055551", "Patricia", "It was a pleasure to be a host at Adrian’s house. The house is located in the city center close to everything  including the opera house by 10 minutes walking. Great public transport. The roomates were very friendly. The room has a great balcony for summer and everything you might need. Thank-you guys for hosting me. I miss you."),
("2018-01-03", "20055551", "Ida Leona", "Adrian was a very nice host! Very friendly  social and helpful to me and my friend. great location of the apartment!"),
("2018-01-10", "20055551", "Emma", "Comfortable room with great balcony that gets sun all morning. Great location - walking distance to pretty much everything. The guys are all really lovely and helpful. Would recommend!"),
("2018-01-17", "20055551", "Jason", "Great location and group of guys to settle down in Sydney. Made life easy and enjoyable"),
("2018-01-23", "20055551", "Eleonora", "Super central location  very practical from the airport and close to nice cafes  restaurants and city amenities.Very good company  Adriano and the rest of the crew made me feel home  sharing meals and engaging in interesting conversations. They were also very flexible for my checkout  much appreciated!Definitely a good experience!"),
("2018-03-05", "20055551", "Claire", "I can’t quite put in to words how much I loved staying with Adrian and the boys. From start to finish they were welcoming  inclusive  friendly and a dream to live with. From sharing food to being invited on nights out  I feel like they couldn’t have done more. It felt like a home from home and I’d hugely recommend this place to anyone thinking of staying here. The room is great  the local amenities are awesome and everything is walking distance. A lively  friendly house with top notch  wonderful people. I couldn’t have wished for more."),
("2018-03-23", "20055551", "Marlon", "Great place and I Definitly highly recommend and I will came back !"),
("2018-03-29", "20055551", "Jacob", "Really chill place in a great location. Pleasant and scenic walk to the harbor and close radius to lots of good bars/restaurants."),
("2018-04-14", "20055551", "Cyrille", "Great times  super cool people in the house  calm  respectful  clean  just overall super chill in a great great location. I highly recommend :)"),
("2018-05-28", "20055551", "Nina", "I had such a great time at Adrian’s house !Very central location with a quiet room and super fun hosts  it s the perfect place to get social  Miss you already guys  I ll be back !"),
("2018-06-02", "20055551", "Emily", "The apartment is 15-20mins walking distance to all the major attractions. It’s in the city center but in a quiet neighborhood with a lot of restaurants and coffee shops just downstairs. The guys are very welcoming and I had a great time in Sydney. I would definitely stay here again when I come back (hopefully sometime very soon) :)"),
("2018-06-04", "20055551", "Zoe", "I really enjoyed my stay! Very welcoming and inclusive. The house is super central to everything in Sydney. I couldn’t recommend it more"),
("2018-06-08", "20055551", "Drew", "This location is hard to beat  with trendy spots and the main attractions all within easy walking distance. Adrian & crew are super friendly and have great tips for how to get a local experience."),
("2018-06-18", "20055551", "Mason", "Thanks Adrian and Rhys for an awesome stay! I loved the location - very close to public transport and a 15/20 minute walk to Sydney Opera House. Both guys were super friendly and offered recommendations for the area."),
("2018-06-22", "20055551", "Fahad", "Adrians place is dope!  Lovely chill housemates"),
("2018-07-02", "20055551", "Bryce", "My experience here was not good at all.  Expectations were not super high  I was just looking forward to a fun place and people to hang with  but the cleanliness and noise levels were unacceptable. The room itself is nice and location is great but major issues were that the roommates came home at 3am two different nights being very loud and it was impossible to sleep because you can hear everything in the house. There was a dead coachroach at the bottom of the steps no one picked up for a day. The kitchen is super messy and disgusting. A roommate broke a glass on the kitchen floor and they just put a towel over some of it  and then kind of picked it the next day but there were shards everywhere still. I was crunching glass for the next 3 days under my shoes. The bathroom did not have a working light which made the other airbnb guest - yes they rent out another room- pee all over the seat because you can't see in the bathroom at night. I didn't meet Adrian  he wasn't there. The other 2 roommates are really nice guys  so I hate to leave this bad review  but it just sucked being in a super dirty house and then getting woken up and having to listen to drunk people be loud and obnoxious while you try to sleep in the middle of the night. If you don't care about dirty places  it might be fun to stay there if you are partying with the guys  but my experience was not good."),
("2018-12-31", "20055551", "Süntje", "The small room with the balcony is very nice. In general the house is in a very good area and close to the CBD. Staying at Adrian’s House for 6 month was great and a real Australian experience. All housemates (Adrian  Conor  Rhys and Alessandro) integrated me into their circle of friends and took me to cool places. Thanks for becoming good friends and for the amazing times. I’ll miss you and visit you soon. :-)"),
("2017-11-20", "19990097", "Syeda Tamanna", "Awesome"),
("2017-11-22", "19990097", "Ijaz", "This is a big house and the host is very accomodating. He let us check-in early and also later helped me open the door  when the door key was with my friends.  But I guess the title of ad is a little-bit misleading. It sounded as if it is close to opera house but it is quite far from the city. The main reason we booked this house was our misunderstanding of its location."),
("2017-12-02", "19990097", "David", "The house is very comfortable and very close to the station. The house was clean and as he described. George is a great host and very accommodating. His communication was awesome and very welcoming for the duration of our trip. We are sure to return.Thanks George!"),
("2017-12-15", "19990097", "Peter", "Wonderful place. Perfect for a stay for large group of people and a nice homely fee. Highly recommend!"),
("2017-12-17", "19990097", "Marnee", "Great big space for a large family booking. George was quick to reply and very forthcoming with information on the house."),
("2017-12-30", "19990097", "Vikrant", "Great home for a short stay ... close to everything  has all amenities that most people would need on a break. George was great and prompt in communicating with us. The home has basic facilities but offers great value for money. Highly recommend for a short  stay for large groups."),
("2017-12-31", "19990097", "Darpan", "Good house near to public transport...Requires some decluttering"),
("2018-02-06", "19990097", "Ming-Hui", "George is a nice guy  friendly and quick response. The house is spacious and there is a backyard with organic herbs. Nice place to relax and enjoy the life. Thank you."),
("2018-02-11", "19990097", "Dangfang", "非常舒适干净的房子 适合全家居住 设施很全 房主很热情 有机会还会再来"),
("2018-02-12", "19990097", "Emily", "George was very communicative and helpful. The property is very spacious and looks just like the photos. Thanks for having us! :)"),
("2018-02-23", "19990097", "Kent", "也住到很舒服的｡"),
("2018-03-03", "19990097", "Garbrielle", "I found George’s house to be impeccably clean and orderly. George made an effort to make sure the house was aired and cool. When we arrived George had turned on misting fans/normal fans in each bedroom and had turned on air conditioning in the main area. There was also nice music playing in one of the living areas. The linen was clean and fresh and plenty of towels were provided. There was an ashtray and bench seat in the backyard provided for smokers as well as a pleasant outdoor alfresco area. George had coke  water  beer and noodles stocked in the cupboards and fridge with a piggy bank system where you left money for what you had taken. We were very pleased with this and brought some coke as we hadn’t packed any drinks with us for our travels. Another thing I was impressed with was the quality hand washes/body washes and shampoo and conditioner that George had generously provided. This property is great for families with children as there was a cot provide in one of the rooms if you should have need of it. We were all very pleased with this property and will be staying here again if we need to stay in the area again. Thanks George for making sure we had an enjoyable and pleasant place to stay in. "),
("2018-03-03", "19990097", "Kristian", "George is a great host  all the questions i had for him he answered quickly and precisely.Great stay for the price i paid!"),
("2018-03-11", "19990097", "Amanda", "Very happy with our stay. Quick responses from host  very helpful information before we arrived.This was a great experience. Definitely will book again next time we are travelling to this area."),
("2018-03-22", "19990097", "Kata", "George is a great host. His place is value for money! We were travelling as a group into Australia from overseas and were quite delighted that he kept track of our travels even including a snapshot of the current train timetable. The host always responds to questions within time and clarified things where there was a need to. He even went the extra mile to pick up our luggage at the train station. The house adequately fit eleven women with more space to spare. We enjoyed the place and are certain others will too! His place became our home away from home for the seven days we spent there! Thank you George!"),
("2018-03-26", "19990097", "Helen", "The house is as advertised and good value for money. An aging house with eclectic furnishings  it totally suits a budget-minded family needing to accommodate a range of ages and interests . The dinning and living rooms are a big plus. The location was quiet and yet handy to shops and train station. George gives lots of tips that are very helpful. We have already recommended this house to our friends who travel to the Campbelltown  area periodically."),
("2018-03-31", "19990097", "Milan", "Good place to stay and booking. Very neat and tidy."),
("2018-04-08", "19990097", "Clara", "Georges place can accommodate a big family with everything you need it was exactly what we needed.The location to the train is EASY 5 mins walk.We did alot of exploring while we were in Sydney both by train and car.The blue mountains drive and woolongong was far easier and faster than i expected by car. (First time driving in Sydney) Loved our stay thankyou George "),
("2018-04-11", "19990097", "Mick", "George was very accommodating to our large group of 13   had fans running to chill the rooms before we arrived and had more than enough room for everybody  he responds fast when you need to ask questions."),
("2018-04-14", "19990097", "David", "Great place  close to train station"),
("2018-04-23", "19990097", "Sharad", "It was amazing time staying at your home"),
("2018-04-29", "19990097", "David", "Don't be deceived by the Photos this is a lovely roomy home with plenty of space. Clean and Comfortably accommodating many in a sort of eclectic charm. Central to public transport and easy access to the motor ways  while being tucked away in a quiet location. Loved our stay  thanks George"),
("2018-05-05", "19990097", "Manon", "Great stay at George´s house with all my friend !  Thanks very much"),
("2018-05-15", "19990097", "Enis Nadia", "The house is very clean  big space  and I enjoyed stay there. It is highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-27", "19990097", "Sherene", "I can only say George is a 5 stars host that I ever met before! A traveler like me  I traveled very often in a year  Airbnb always the best option for me to book for my stay. I traveled 8 countries last year and this year I had been 4 countries up to date! So far non of the host provided such a great service like George. He wrote me daily train schedule  remind me of the road block  changes of the train schedule and even he planned for my itinerary on the daily basic. There was this night when we faced a small issue at home! I text him to ask for help! Without asking much  George appeared in the home and help us solve our problems. When we running out of idea of places to go. Again he visited us at 10pm plus to discuss with us of his friend (travel agent) day tour packages for us! George always very thoughtful towards our stay! He even offered to send our luggages to the train station when we left the place! All 13 of us rated his place 5 stars not only for our stay but also because of his warm hospitality! I will definitely recommend all my friends to choose him! Great location  comfortable house   thoughtful host with very affordable rental!"),
("2018-05-29", "19990097", "Kristene", "This was our favorite of all the places we stayed on our two week visit to New Zealand and Australia.  George was a great communicator  before our stay  during and after.  His house is such fun.  There was plenty of sleeping arrangements for 10 people; in fact  we did not use all of the beds.  We all loved the furnishings  which are eclectic  interesting and fun.  I highly recommend this airbnb."),
("2018-06-10", "19990097", "Graeme", "mattresses are stuffed hope he gets new ones and cleans the place up a bit"),
("2018-06-17", "19990097", "Fiona", "The house spacious and clean. There’s free breakfast as well! The owner is very friendly  responsive and approachable. :)However the heater from the air-con was not as strong. "),
("2018-06-25", "19990097", "Marlon", "George's place was great! It was clean and spacious enough to accommodate a big family like ours. Its location is in a quiet neigbourhood and is close to the train station (less than 5 min drive) if you wanted to go to the city using public transportation. George was also great in sending instructions and in communicating with me from the moment I booked his place all the way up until we left.I would not mind booking his place again if ever I get the chance to go on holidays with a big group again."),
("2018-07-07", "19990097", "James", "Great for a big group!"),
("2018-07-10", "19990097", "Lan", "最好的房东 很细心的给了很多信息 非常感谢 住过那么多Airbnb George 是我碰到的最好房东 没有之一"),
("2018-08-04", "19990097", "Echo", "George是超赞房东!热情好客 体贴周到｡对我们造成的一些问题十分宽容 真诚感谢 强烈推荐!!"),
("2018-08-05", "19990097", "Mahesh", "A convenient place  not much space but an interesting house with so many gadgets.  Always a prompt reply.  Thank you George. "),
("2018-08-11", "19990097", "Huiyu", "房子有个大庭院供孩子们玩耍 房东给了我们很多建议和帮助 让我们的行程方便了很多｡"),
("2018-08-16", "19990097", "May", "Highly recommended"),
("2018-08-19", "19990097", "Ros", "the house is clean and well stocked with furniture plenty of beds and seating."),
("2018-08-26", "19990097", "Lena", "Just as described and great value. Everything you need and clean with very comfy beds!"),
("2018-09-02", "19990097", "Gias", "If you have a big family  it’ll be great value for money."),
("2018-09-12", "19990097", "Fye", "It was a pleasant stay for me and my other ten friends from September 5th until September 12th 2018 at George's place. The photos didn't do the house justice since it's far more spacious in real life. It's perfect for big groups and family. The Macquarie Fields train station isn't that far away and it goes straight to Central Station and Opera House! George was extremely responsive including in the middle of the night. Ask for anything  he will make sure your request will be granted as soon as he could. If there's any improvement I could recommend is only the entrance. George  that huge tree in front of the house got to go mate. Anything else was PERFECT! Thank you so much George. You are awesome! Looking forward to my next stay next year."),
("2018-09-16", "19990097", "Thai", "Nice place to live for the best value. I will recommend it"),
("2018-09-23", "19990097", "Julia", "The place is more like a home rather than a sensational hotel. It has everything you need  and George is very considerate. The price is very economical compared with others. A good choice to choose while in Sydney."),
("2018-09-30", "19990097", "Roshan", "Comfortable and clean house. We were a large crowd and thoroughly enjoyed the provided amenities and the large backyard. Above all thanks for the great communications from George and the help from George when the house key got locked in the roll down desk."),
("2018-10-13", "19990097", "Tho", "Super spacious and very homely styled house. Everything was very clean  all beds were made beautifully and George was a wonderful host. He always replied within the hour and was very helpful throughout the whole stay and even with checking out. Would highly recommend! Lovely large backyard too perfect for the big group we had"),
("2018-10-28", "19990097", "Leni", "George was an excellent host. Very hospitable and kind. He went out of his way to drive my friends to the grocery and the clinic. He is truly amazing."),
("2018-11-10", "19990097", "Linda", "A great place to stay with very homely feel and room for a large family or group. Catered very well for our large group at great value. Host was very informative and provided good timely communication.Easy check in and check out with no hassles.Would stay here again."),
("2018-11-24", "19990097", "Sue", "George is a very helpful and fast responsive person. He answered all our queries and help in provide the transport and places to visit. The house is very spacious and fully equipped would recommend for big group."),
("2018-12-10", "19990097", "Poh Meng", "Home  sweet home  we arrived late  George had turned on the lights & music for us. The house is in great location  easy drive to Blue Mountain  direct train to town with only AUD2.70 on Sunday  free parking at the train station. Slightly far from city but we live like local  driving around the township is a great experience. George is extremely friendly & helpful  very informative. Jetstar lost our luggage when we returned from Melbourne  George helped us to keep the luggage as we were not around when Jetstar returned our luggage. Great host  great stay  we enjoy our stay."),
("2018-12-24", "19990097", "Sau Ching", "幾好 但地方距離市中心較遠遠"),
("2018-12-27", "19990097", "Jahangir", "Excellent accommodation for a big family or group  Best price. The property had a lot that you need  including a very spacious backyard. We enjoyed our stay very much. Thanks George."),
("2018-12-27", "19990097", "Bennet", "I found the accomodation to be homely and has plenty of character and history. One can tell that those who grew up in this home pursued many interests and hobbies. It was perfect for our overnight trip to Sydney. There were more than enough beds for the 9 of us. The large dining table indoors was a perfect place for mealtime conversations. If we were staying longer and if the weather was not as hot  we would have loved using the large backyard for some outdoor activities. George made sure the house was clean and ready before we arrived."),
("2019-01-13", "19990097", "Debra", "We had a wonderful stay here. It was perfect for our family of 6 & George was amazing at keeping in touch with us before we arrived  during our stay & after we left. it was much appreciated. The house has a lot of character & I am sure a bit of history as it is an older building as most are in the area but for us that was what we loved."),
("2019-01-23", "19990097", "Serah", "George was a very good host. He responded to our queries on time. The house was clean and the beds were so comfy. Its so homey and welcoming. Thank you so much."),
("2019-01-27", "19990097", "Cleopatra", "George is lovely."),
("2019-02-03", "19990097", "Abraham", "Nice and cozy place. We enjoyed our stay here."),
("2019-02-14", "19990097", "Dangfang", "Very beautiful house  suitable for family or group  nice owner."),
("2017-10-23", "20038668", "Naomi", "The host canceled this reservation 8 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-01-05", "20038668", "Matt", "Very nice property  it is well cleaned and very spacious. The area what we stayed in is a very nice area and we had very friendly neighbours"),
("2018-02-02", "20038668", "Taylor", "Tracey's place was fantastic. It's a very spacious and beautiful home."),
("2018-12-30", "20202806", "Sammie", "Our stay in Manly was really great  the location of the apartment was ideal  just across the street from the beach. The apartment is perfect for the location with great space and a homely feel. Would definitely recommend.The hosting was great with awesome local tips."),
("2017-09-16", "20206764", "Lachlan", "Great little place in a quiet street in Bronte. William was a great host  emjoyed our stay!"),
("2017-09-30", "20206764", "Mandy", "Great position"),
("2018-01-06", "20206764", "Margie", "Lovely renovated home with separate studio downstairs. We stayed as a family group and enjoyed visiting local beaches and cafes. Walk to beach (although the walk home is tricky for little legs). On street parking is free and easy. Thanks for having us  we would stay again."),
("2018-01-14", "20206764", "Bryony", "We had a great stay at Will's place in Bronte! The house was super clean  spacious and had really comfortable beds. The location was also brilliant  with a short 10 minute walk to Bronte beach. We would definitely stay here again and thanks again to Will for being a great host - also for the late checkout due to our night flight  which was really appreciated!"),
("2018-01-16", "20206764", "Kai", "The host canceled this reservation 9 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-02-28", "20206764", "Lauren Jade", "Exceptional place and great stay! Amazing location to walk to beaches  host was great help as well  thanks"),
("2018-05-20", "20206764", "Brenda", "The place is really nice and clean! It kept 7 of us warmed at night And there’s a good number of amenities available from kitchen appliances to laundry and shower amenities. Comfy beds too!Upon arrival  Sacha was quick to respond with check-in details and kindly guided us virtually through the house. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-08-12", "20206764", "Stacee", "Sacha's place is in a great Bronte location  a short walk to both Tamarama and Bronte beaches. The house was well equipped for self-catering  and the host was quick to respond to any queries we had during our stay. Recommended!"),
("2018-08-19", "20206764", "Debra", "Fabulous house in great location  easy check host very quick with enquiries  had all that we needed!!Our party of 6 adults and 3 children fitted perfectly into 4 bedroom two bathroom house  just make sure that is what you are getting!!Deb "),
("2018-09-24", "20206764", "Pete", "Highly recommend  very comfortable space in walking proximity to beach  cafes and stones throw to city. Host was very accommodating and communication was very easy."),
("2018-09-30", "20206764", "Chris", "Sacha’s place was easily the best AirBnB that I have had the pleasure of staying at in Sydney. Sparkling clean  stylish interior  excellent location (5min walk from the beach); this AirBnB has it all.Sacha himself was also the best AirBnB host that I have had in Australia. Incredibly accomodating  instant responses and just a very friendly guy overall.Highly recommend the place to anyone going to Sydney!"),
("2018-10-03", "20206764", "达", "非常好的位置 走路到邦迪海滩或者波特郎海滩15-25分钟 房间里面各种炊具和调料很齐全 不过如果是晚上到的话建议先吃完饭再过来 离最近的超市和餐馆也要走路15分钟｡做饭很方便 房东小帅哥很帅!"),
("2018-10-06", "20206764", "Marcelo", "The apartment was very nice  we had everything we need to spend a great weekend. Sacha was very kind and handy host  helping with everything we need to enjoy our stay."),
("2018-10-14", "20206764", "Clare", "Great location to explore eastern Sydney. We did loads of walking including the Bondi to Coogee coastal walk. Favaloro cafe just round the corner is a great spot for coffee and the house was great."),
("2018-11-01", "20206764", "Mira", "Tolles Haus mit großer Terasse und schönen hellen Räumen im Obergeschoss in einem netten Stadtviertel  das sich sehr gut eignet  wenn man ein bisschen Ruhe sucht in Sydney und in Strandnähe wohnen möchte. Am Bronte Beach gibt es einen großartigen öffentlichen Pool mit Meerwasser direkt am Strand. William war immer erreichbar und sehr hilfsbereit."),
("2018-11-11", "20206764", "Patrick", "Great place  great location  great host! The place was incredibly comfortable and very well positioned to get to beaches! The host was helpful with any questions and really quick to reply. Would stay again in a heart beat!"),
("2018-11-13", "20206764", "Lynda", "Stylish home with Ana amazing main bedroom. Sunlight and trees and blue sky form the main bedroom. Very comfortable home and a lovely host!"),
("2018-11-17", "20206764", "Andrew", "Great modern house a short walk to Bronte beach with great coffee shop one street away.  Super spacious and loads of amenities  perfect for our group. Would stay again and recommend for larger groups or families"),
("2018-11-25", "20206764", "Andrew", "Sacha's place was great. Perfect location as it's close to just about everything you want on the eastern beaches."),
("2018-11-28", "20206764", "Gareth", "perfect house. great interiors  location fantastic. communication from host was ideal. highly recommended"),
("2018-12-01", "20206764", "Gem", "Definitely recommend this place- perfect beach pad and we didn’t want to leave :) very comfortable and hospitable."),
("2018-12-09", "20206764", "Tim", "Amazing location - walking distance to Bronte and Tamarama! Great space for a weekend away with friends."),
("2018-12-14", "20206764", "Daniella", "Sacha’s place was amazing  it is in great location only 8 minutes away from the beach. He was a great host and gave us tips to get around the neighborhood. The house is beautiful and very comfortable  it is by far the best airbnb I’ve stayed in  my family and I didn’t want to leave!"),
("2018-12-19", "20206764", "Yin", "What an amazing place! Would highly recommend to anyone looking to stay near the beach. Excellent proximity to Bronte  Bondi and Coogee. Stylish house with excellent furnishings. Sacha was also very easy to communicate with. Looking forward to staying again."),
("2018-12-23", "20206764", "Hugh", "great place and host"),
("2018-12-27", "20206764", "Josep Maria", "Sacha’s house in Bronte is a great place to stay and visit Sydney. Modern design style and comfortable.Bronte beach walking distance through a nice park  Bondi beach really close. Do not miss a run by the sea either north or south (down to Cogee).Sacha was a great host  answering messages in Christmas!I strongly recommend this host and house!"),
("2019-01-01", "20206764", "Ella", "Great location and great host! Communication was easy and the house was extremely comfortable and great for a large group."),
("2019-01-11", "20206764", "Samara", "We had a great stay in the house and it’s in a great location. We had a car and found parking on the street easy and the house is just a short 5min walk to the beach. Our 17 month old loved the park by the beach and the playground. The house itself is very modern and the bedrooms are filled with light but they also have good blackout blinds which we appreciated. Would definitely recommend for anyone looking for a beachside escape in Sydney."),
("2019-01-15", "20206764", "Zoe", "Everything you want out of an Airbnb. Great spot  quiet street  clean  awesome main bedroom  easy to check in and light and airy. Really helpful touches if you’re traveling with the family."),
("2019-01-28", "20206764", "Davina", "Perfect house for our Sydney stay. Great location - easy walk to Bronte beach; baby friendly - stair gates and baby cot and high chair and generally a great space - well equipped kitchen and bbq. We enjoyed ourselves so much we stayed here for an extra few nights. Thanks Will for being so responsive before and during our stay!"),
("2019-02-02", "20206764", "Ben", "Our weekend trip at Sacha’s place in Bronte was great. Super modern  clean and spacious inside and only a very short stroll down to the beach. If only the weather was better!!Sacha was great a host  easy to deal with and was really flexible throughout our stay"),
("2019-02-07", "20206764", "Elvina", "Sacha is very responsive and a great host. The house is very clean with everything we needed. House is less than 10 minutes walk to the beach  and Sacha gave us great local tips. Would def recommend anyone travelling to Sydney and want to be close to the beach and coastline."),
("2019-02-10", "20206764", "Christina", "It was very nice to have met Sacha in person. The house is a very lovely place that I have always dreamt to have! It was the perfect place for us to have a family gathering this weekend! The place was stylish  spotless and had lots of space for each of us to relax."),
("2019-02-15", "20206764", "James", "Amazing house in a beautiful area of Sydney - thanks so much"),
("2019-02-23", "20206764", "Raquel", "We loved the place  it has everything.The walk to the beach was 10 minutes and we didn’t have a problem with that except that it was hard going up the hill for my mother on the way back to the (Website hidden by Airbnb) mother just turned 90 and it would help if we knew about this in advance. We got a car from a relative and we solved the problem.Thank you Sacha  you were a great host and we enjoyed our stay very much"),
("2019-03-03", "20206764", "Jo", "Wonderful place. Ideal for a group. Host contacted us as soon as we landed. Warm welcome with all the information."),
("2017-08-14", "20374683", "John", "Phan went out of her way to meet us at her place and had plenty of information about the neighbourhood  etc.  The apartment was clean and well equipped.  It was a great place for a good price and close to everything we needed."),
("2017-08-20", "20374683", "Alex", "Very convenient for a short stay."),
("2017-08-27", "20374683", "Daryl", "Great location  could get anywhere easily & it was really nice."),
("2017-09-10", "20374683", "Anthony", "We enjoyed our stay in Chippendale  it's very central and the apartment is quite large. Phans communication was also great and the place is excellent value for money."),
("2017-09-18", "20374683", "Cheryl", "Thankyou so much for having us! The place was beautiful and clean! Also  the host was so lovely and friendly :) This apartment was also so close to everything you need. I will definitely be staying here everything I come to Sydney!"),
("2017-09-24", "20374683", "Elliot", "Phan's place is in an excellent location and good for a few people. The bedrooms upstairs are not necessarily separate - with a half wall in the middle but if you're happy to share  it is definitely very central to all of the things. Phan was very nice and met us at the place to check in and was very responsive to communications during he stay."),
("2017-10-02", "20374683", "Jesse", "The apartment is good value and in a great place  Phan is also a good host"),
("2017-10-08", "20374683", "Su", "房子位于中央火车站旁 地理位置优越 靠近悉尼科技大学  (Hidden by Airbnb) 都很方便 公寓是复式两层的 简洁实用 适合无烟煮食｡"),
("2017-10-15", "20374683", "Daisy", "地点绝对一级棒"),
("2017-10-25", "20374683", "Mei Mei", "Phan's premise is as per the pictures  clean with new furniture. Location wise  it's very convenient as it's near to food stores  grocery  and Central train station  all within 5-10 minutes walking distance.Thanks Phan for being great host  she answered my queries promptly and patiently. Will definitely recommend friends and families to stay over."),
("2017-10-28", "20374683", "Gunchi", "Amazing place and Phan was so friendly and sweet!"),
("2017-11-02", "20374683", "Jian", "Good location"),
("2017-11-11", "20374683", "Louise", "Great location  was a little bit noisy traffic wise  shops  pubs and public transport all very close. Home was clean  furnishings at a minimum  but comfortable enough. Strange burn’t plastic smell  host explained that heavy cooking/burning had happened previous. However even with doors opened for fresh air and a smelly candle  the smell would not go. In saying that I would stay again  as the location was fantastic and we could sleep 8."),
("2017-11-15", "20374683", "Wing Shing Vincent", "Love the location and the apartment so much!! Nice beds  near city !!"),
("2017-11-26", "20374683", "Chris", "Great location! Very clean double story apartment   full furnished  very comfortable. It’s so convenient to go anywhere in Sydney CBD with walking.  Woolworth just 3 minutes away. The host is very friendly and helpful. All good!Phan very responsive to any questions you may have about the place. I will definitely stay again"),
("2017-12-01", "20374683", "Ben", ""),
("2017-12-07", "20374683", "Tanner", "Great place  great host"),
("2017-12-18", "20374683", "Cheetthaphong", "Phan was a great host  always responding quickly and answering any questions. Stayed with a group of 7 people and there was plenty of room for all of us. Location is great  everything we needed was within walking distance."),
("2017-12-23", "20374683", "Joey", "Phan was very helpful and great on the communication. A very good air bnb host."),
("2017-12-31", "20374683", "Alex", "Phan was a great host - she from time to time would message me and check how things went.  It was very kind of her to also get us fruits and wine in advance!"),
("2018-01-02", "20374683", "Simon", "Ideal location and lovely host who kept us fully informed"),
("2018-01-08", "20374683", "Sarah", "Great location  very close to Central station/transport hub & amenities. Great host  super fast communication. It is central city location so can be a bit noisy at times"),
("2018-01-20", "20374683", "April", "The apartment was in a great location  cheap parking only a 5 minute walk away  close to broadway shopping centre and central train station. The whole apartment was clean  tidy and had everything you needed including the little extras such as shampoo  body wash  linens etc. I couldn’t fault this apartment at all and the host was extremely good at communicating and ensuring that you were having a good experience. "),
("2018-01-31", "20374683", "Emma", "Great location! Great host!"),
("2018-02-04", "20374683", "Chloe", "Nice clean apartment. Was nice and central to everything we needed. We had a great stay."),
("2018-02-09", "20374683", "佩仪", "房东很友好 到达后马上就能得到接待｡公寓干净也舒适 步行至唐人街和情人港也很方便｡"),
("2018-02-16", "20374683", "Han", "Near to public transit"),
("2018-02-22", "20374683", "Angie On Sin", "Phan is such a great host who is very friendly and helpful. Her place is clean and everything is handy. The location is very convenient which is just next to the central station. Highly recommend this place for families and friends!"),
("2018-02-24", "20374683", "Telly", "The place is close to everything you need and it’s a great size to fit quite a few people!"),
("2018-03-01", "20374683", "Chris", "Great place to stay with air con! Location and value was great. Definitely recommend!"),
("2018-03-15", "20374683", "Ivan", "Good location..."),
("2018-03-17", "20374683", "Rose", "Great space! So close to public transport  night life and shops and restaurants! Amazing host - replying almost immediately to all my questions."),
("2018-03-26", "20374683", "Chris", "Phan was very responsive  friendly and accommodative. We had a walking tour booked before check in time  and I thought we would have to miss the tour. However she was kind enough to offer early check in for us! The place is close to Chinatown and train station is just 5 mins away. Will definitely stay again during our next visit :)"),
("2018-04-04", "20374683", "Lori-Ann", "This location is great. Walking distance from the Central railway station as well as close to food and shops. Phan is an excellent host. We arrived in Sydney at 630 am and Phan allowed us to drop our bags off around 10 am so we could get started on our day . The apartment is very clean and secure. It was perfect for a group of 4 ."),
("2018-04-05", "20374683", "Stella", "與Phan溝通十分順利 也願意在check out 後讓我們寄放行李 房子離車站近 設備齊全 滿適合家庭入住"),
("2018-04-10", "20374683", "荣", "跟房东沟通顺利 也帮了很大的忙｡房间干净整洁 出行方便 家里人很满意 有机会再来入住｡"),
("2018-05-06", "20374683", "Tony", "Enjoyed our stay at Phan's place. Good location and friendly host with great communication."),
("2018-06-07", "20374683", "Shierly", "We had a good stay."),
("2018-06-14", "20374683", "Naomi", "Located in the heart of Sydney  this beautiful apartment is perfect for a family or friends getaway! Phan answers all questions almost instantly and is an overall amazing host! Thank you for making our trip memorable! "),
("2018-06-16", "20374683", "Weiling", "A very nice place  very clean and nice location. The host is nice too. Me and my family have had a very good time ^^"),
("2018-06-24", "20374683", "Bronwyn", "Great location."),
("2018-07-09", "20374683", "Heng Tsui", "Good location. Cozy and Warm house."),
("2018-07-14", "20374683", "Amy", "Pham was quick to respond to requests and did her best to make us comfortable during our stay. The apartment is spacious  tastefully decorated and in a excellent location."),
("2018-07-22", "20374683", "Stacey", "The location is excellent  the place is clean  modern and had everything you could need. Phan was an absolute pleasure to deal with. 100% recommend!"),
("2018-08-03", "20374683", "May", "我是帮朋友定的 因为要开车过去 房东很nice 很早就帮我预留了车位!对这个房子的感受就是位置太好了 central station旁边 到China town走路几分钟｡而且房东热情周到 房间里面干净利落 布置得非常舒适｡以后还会推荐朋友住｡"),
("2018-08-17", "20374683", "Taylor", "Great location - stayed a week for a family holiday! Easy walk to train/bus stations and plenty of good restaurants around. The apartment was clean  cozy and right for what we needed. We even had extra guests come and go  Phan was more than helpful with that! Would highly recommend :) "),
("2018-08-22", "20374683", "Peggy", "Phan responses quickly. The location is close to Central station (only 5 min walk)  Woolworth supermarket (only 3 min) and China town (only 8 min). It is very convenient and we enjoy our stay."),
("2018-08-29", "20374683", "Pearllyn", "Phan's place was very comfortable for our group of 5. The apartment was clean and was convenient and easy to locate. Phan was great at responding and was always happy to help. A great stay overall!"),
("2018-09-04", "20374683", "Lee Len", "There’s a short cut to walk from Central Station. Will be good to find the way thru the tunnel of the station"),
("2018-09-09", "20374683", "Jacob", "Great location. Perfect place for a group of friends. Close to restaurants/bars. Very clean. Great amenities. Enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-09-15", "20374683", "Duron", "超级好的房子 位置超级好 房东人也超级好 最好的选择~"),
("2018-09-18", "20374683", "娟", "房主凡姐恰如其分的热情 有问必答｡我们到的早 12点不到就到了 应该是下午3点才可以入住 凡姐提前让我们摆放行李｡小黑也特别可爱 大家都抢着要抱他 来了就可以看到可爱的小黑啦!! (Website hidden by Airbnb) 房子的地理位置特别好 去达令港 歌剧院 皮特街都可以步行过去｡想买药妆的话 150米处就有一个 买蜂蜜和羊奶粉要开门就去｡这里的店关门都比较早 需要早点规划好｡想自己吃海鲜可以去鱼市场买了自己做 也可以直接在那里吃｡ 离悉尼大学很近 如果想托运什么到国内的话那边就有快递 (Website hidden by Airbnb) 屋子收拾的整洁干净 在悉尼这个寸土寸金的地方 有这么大的地方 交通便利 价格还这么优惠 真的太难得了!! (Website hidden by Airbnb) 谢谢凡姐请的冰淇淋 太好吃啦!!!"),
("2018-09-20", "20374683", "Angela", "Phan was a delightful and wonderful host who was truly helpful in making sure we had a great time. She was accommodating and went above and beyond  even setting up a comfortable extra bed to make sure we slept well. The apartment itself was spacious  extremely clean and in an excellent location. We really couldn’t have wanted anything more. Would highly recommend to anyone!!"),
("2018-09-26", "20374683", "Terence", "Phan is super accomodating  providing all the essentials that we needed. It was a pleasure to stay as guests at her's house  I would defenitely recommend this place to anybody staying near central."),
("2018-10-02", "20374683", "Imran", "Great location  exceptional and very accommodating hosts which was a real benefit as we were a group of 7 people."),
("2018-10-06", "20374683", "Wei", "凡姐的房子地理位置非常好 去任何地方步行即可到达 附近就有一家大超市 买东西吃饭都很方便!最赞的是凡姐个人的魅力 给了我们很大的帮助 真的是由衷的感谢!以后会再来入住 也会推荐朋友来入住!"),
("2018-10-21", "20374683", "Jessie", "As soon as you walked in everything was absolutely spotless. Quick responses by Phan. A lot of space which I was presently surprised about. Great stay overall. Will definitely be back if we are in that area again."),
("2018-10-26", "20374683", "Harry", "Adequate but be careful if travelling with people who don't want to sleep in same room."),
("2018-10-27", "20374683", "Alma", "Location was excellent form our purposeIt was difficult that we only had 1 set of keys for  5 people."),
("2018-10-30", "20374683", "Steven", "Phan provides great hospitality to those that are staying over. She is quick to answer calls and makes you feel very welcome and that you are an important guest staying over. The apartment itself felt very homey  had cute little decorations and touches that makes the place stand out."),
("2018-11-03", "20374683", "David", "Clean and comfortable location close to transport and restaurants. Very helpful and friendly host."),
("2018-11-17", "20374683", "Jo", "Very central unit  clean and spacious for seven adults.  Phan was an excellent host with great communication."),
("2018-11-25", "20374683", "Siaw", "Fabulous location - less than 5 mins from Central station and just round the corner from Spice Alley and all that Chippendale has to offer"),
("2018-12-01", "20374683", "Sarah", "Excellent central location close to the city.  Apartment was very nice and we all had a good stay."),
("2018-12-14", "20374683", "Sun", "A good experience in Sydney. The house is clean and the location is outstanding."),
("2018-12-16", "20374683", "Shruthi", "A nice apartment in a convenient location. Host was not flexible with check in and check out Time and even entered the apartment at around 10 in the morning until we left the apartment. However  she was easy to communicate with and responded really quickly to any questions."),
("2018-12-24", "20374683", "Karina", "Great location. Clean apartmentPhan is an awesome host and was very responsive to queries throughout our trip."),
("2018-12-30", "20374683", "婷", "房东很热情 给我们很多建议 搭车还帮我砍价~房间很干净 离市中心真的很近 全城走路去哪里都很方便 离woolworths也特别近｡很感谢房东的热情款待｡下次一定会推荐朋友再来｡"),
("2019-01-01", "20374683", "James", "Phan was accomodating in every request. Place was clean and location is fantastic. Will stay again in future"),
("2019-01-27", "20374683", "Rosy", "Great location  excellent communication. We enjoyed our family stay here."),
("2019-01-31", "20374683", "Sunny", "房东实在太好了 不光给了我们各种当地的出行建议 还配合我们的行程给予了不少方便 让我们可以放心去玩 不需要担心行李问题 特别友好贴心｡更给力的是 当天晚上我们离开 叫不到的士 房东二话不说帮我们沟通并让我们成功顺利坐上了的士｡感激不尽 在异国他乡 有这么乐于助人 友好的同胞｡下次如果再去悉尼 也会选择这里｡"),
("2019-02-04", "20374683", "洁", "Phan 非常的nice 带着她的小狗狗迎接我们入住｡房子交通非常便利 走到中央车站南广场只要三分钟｡去任何地方都很方便｡厨房设施比较齐全 唯一不足的是我们一行九个人 入住还是有点挤 五六个人比较合适｡在市中心算是性价比比较高的地方｡"),
("2019-02-11", "20374683", "健怡", "房子地址很方便 离悉尼主要景点都蛮近 到最远的歌剧院走路只要半小时 楼下就有公交站 对面就有便利店 很方便｡房东热情 能提供有效的建议 入住方便｡小狗很可爱:)适合一家人居住｡"),
("2019-02-15", "20374683", "贞芬", "房间也非常的干净 设施都齐全｡"),
("2019-02-19", "20374683", "Claudia", "Phan was a very nice host. She was always concern in making us to feel at home. Everything was clean an tidy. The apartment is perfect for a big family or group. The location is very good."),
("2019-02-25", "20374683", "Trent", "Great space in a great location"),
("2017-08-24", "20578419", "Angie", "Su was an exceptionally accommodating host and her apartment is as lovely and well appointed as it looks! Su was extremely responsive and helpful in the lead-up to my arrival. Unfortunately  I had to cut my trip short because of a personal issue in my family  and Su couldn't have been more understanding or gracious about the situation"),
("2017-08-25", "20578419", "Ann", "A great place  comfy bed  decorated very nicely and was bigger than expected! Hosts were lovely  with prompt replies and were very accomodating. Would definitely recommend and stay again :-)"),
("2017-08-26", "20578419", "Susan", "Su is a great person and also a great host  she was willing to answer any questions and to chat about anything that came up and she is a great company to be with. Her place is really nice and clean and comfortable. Th location is just fantastic  close to everything in the center by foot  don't need to use any transportation services (except for the train/taxi from/to the airport). I loved my stay at Su's place and I would gladly come back and I recommend it to others."),
("2017-09-27", "20578419", "Yiran", "It's really a good apartment with grat location. Have a good time there."),
("2017-10-01", "20578419", "Mingming", "We stayed two nights in Max's apartment. Host is very considerate and warm-hearted. Ready to serve and answer your need and questions. Room is pretty clean and tidy  also located just near central station. Had great time there. Thanks."),
("2017-10-08", "20578419", "Yiqian", "sooooo convenient and clean apartment! The owner is very nice and if you are planning stay in Sydney this place definitely is your first choice!"),
("2017-10-10", "20578419", "Pippa", "A lovely  clean and conveniently located apartment  well appointed and communication with Max and Su was exceptional. A few broken item items that can be easily fixed would have made my visit 5 star."),
("2017-10-14", "20578419", "静", "Su的房子地段很好 central 站出来步行5分钟之内 去市区基本都可以步行到达｡房子内部装修较新 特别要提的是 床垫很舒服｡两房的房型非常适合家庭出游｡房东总是能及时的有问必答 下次来悉尼应该还会预订Su的房子｡"),
("2017-10-16", "20578419", "Raymond", "Not too bad"),
("2017-10-23", "20578419", "Indriyanto", "Wonderful place  location so nice... Central station only 3-5 min reached. Surrounded by cafe and coffees store...and affordable too"),
("2017-11-04", "20578419", "Bintang", "Su's place is nice 2 bedrooms apartment  close to public transport  restaurant and walking distance to everywhere. Su was quick response and helpful."),
("2017-11-13", "20578419", "Beatrice", "Great location and value! Much recommended to everyone traveling in Sydney. Max is a great host."),
("2017-11-16", "20578419", "Michelle", "Very central apartment  really spacious and clean and decorated lovely. Fully equipped with washing machine and dryer and kitchen"),
("2017-11-25", "20578419", "Zanae", "Great apartment in a fantastic location  close to public transport."),
("2017-11-28", "20578419", "Amy", "This is a charming apartment in a great location. Easy walking distance to many places and just a block from the train if using public transportation.  Unfortunately our TV did not work (not that we were using it much) to Su's credit  it was changed the next day. However  the wifi then broke  which left us a drift as we did not have a local phone and could only communicate via texting. Overall  lovely apartment. If you plan to cook any meals  be warned the kitchen is not well stocked. bring your own French press if you can't wait to visit one of the wonderful cafe's near by. Overall   good value with. A few glitches to be worked out."),
("2017-12-04", "20578419", "Karen", "Family of five (including 2 small kids) came to stay at Max's place. Max was such a generous and accommodating host and allowed us to check-in earlier upon our request. Fantastic location near Central train station and bus stops  and easy walk to Paddy's Market/ Chinatown/ Powerhouse Museum. Apartment is clean  spacious  and has all the amenities travelers could possibly need (i.e. cooking utensils  plenty of dishes and cutlery  dishwasher  full-length mirrors on the closet doors  built-in wardrobes with hangers  airconditioning  washer/dryer). Would definitely recommend this home to families with kids or up to 6 adults."),
("2017-12-08", "20578419", "Matt", "Great place to stay. Max was very quick in his responses and was always very informative and patient.The flat was exactly as described and is in a great location in Surry Hills"),
("2017-12-20", "20578419", "李思嬴", "An excellent trip with warm reception and convenient location : )"),
("2017-12-24", "20578419", "Ken", "Good location  near to Central Station  with 15-20 minutes to the downtown areas  10 minutes walk-able distance to Chinatown. Easily accessible to popular places like Circular Quay  Daring Harbour  Bondi via trains/buses and there are few fast-food restaurants and convenience store  supermarket downstairs. Quiet most of the time except a bit of noise during daytime from the construction work opposite to apartment building. The apartment main door is located in main road which is easily to find.There are minor issues on the smoke-alert  disk washer  except these other facilities in the apartment are well-operated. TV is small comparatively (think under 20-25"")  Kitchen stuff are well-equipped  Beds / Sofa-Bed are comfortable.Apartment host responds to the inquiries in reasonable time  and willing to help most of the times  during my stay  the host provides extended baggage storage services which is excellent."),
("2018-01-10", "20578419", "Joanne", "Great stay  will be back in the future"),
("2018-01-14", "20578419", "Stephanie", "Fantastic location"),
("2018-01-19", "20578419", "한별", "위치가 정말 좋았다. 근처에 있는 카페에 그냥 들렀는데 퀄리티 좋은 식사를 했고  버스와 트레인 등 교통에 대한 접근성이 정말 좋은 위치였다. 화장실이 다소 물조절하는 방식이 낯설고 옛날 방식인 것과 와이파이가 ADSL이라 느린점을 제외하고는 정말 만족했다."),
("2018-01-21", "20578419", "S", "The place is exactly as pictures. Comfortable and convenience. Had AC breakdown but other than that  everything was good. Thank you!"),
("2018-01-22", "20578419", "Gavin", "A very uncomfortable stay. We turned up to find there was no air con and could not reach the host as soon as they realised they had done wrong. The apartment had had its fire alarm removed for some reason also."),
("2018-01-24", "20578419", "Rémi", "Very nice location in Sydney!"),
("2018-01-27", "20578419", "중엽", "중앙역과 가까워 교통이 편리하고 걸어서 주변을 관광하기에 좋았음"),
("2018-02-03", "20578419", "Ikram", "Great place to stay with close to all amenities."),
("2018-02-04", "20578419", "Eden", "Thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Su's gorgeous apartment! Modern and tidy yet bright in personality - a very homely space! The location was perfect  close to Central and all things fun within the city. Communicated mostly with Max who was very helpful in assisting our check-in and other info - definitely helped make our stay as easy and enjoyable as possible. Would 100% book again! Thanks :)"),
("2018-02-16", "20578419", "筱涵", "房子附近很方便 房間很乾淨 但房東的訊息回覆很慢｡"),
("2018-02-18", "20578419", "Sophie", "Su’s apartment is in an amazing location  just a 30-minute walk from Circular Quay and close to lots of lovely restaurants. Apartment is really lovely and Su and the team were so accommodating about letting us check in early. A great stay."),
("2018-03-05", "20578419", "Jesse", "The location was perfect for us  very close to both Central Station (and therefore the airport)  and cafes and shops around Surry Hills and Oxford Street. The apartment is larger than we expected and was nice and clean. Having an additional set of keys readily available for larger groups of people would be good to save some hassles."),
("2018-03-08", "20578419", "Karla", "El departamento es como figura en las fotos  quizás un poco más chico de lo que pueden sugerir las imágenes. Una de las habitaciones es solo una división del salón  por lo cual no cuenta con la privacidad adecuada.  Si bien la ubicación es buena  el departamento no tiene ventilación las ventanas son fijas y el departamento tiene olor a humedad .Por lo demás si no tenes presupuesto  esta bien."),
("2018-03-11", "20578419", "Natasha", "Su & Max's place is in a great location  close to the main CBD and awesome cafes and restaurants. However a few things caused me to leave a 4 star review - the cleanliness was not up to standard  bedheads and shelves were dusty. Also  the washing machine was left on when we arrived causing a blockage and subsequently water all over the bathroom floor with no apology or explanation. The most confusing part was the host/cleaner knocking on the door and entering to grab a vacuum cleaner/put away some clean towels in the middle of our stay. We all stared in confusion as she walked in without saying anything  entered a bedroom and then left again. It doesn't seem like a huge deal but I keep thinking  what if I had been in the shower and exited to the bedroom to find someone in it - I would have been terrified.There was also no dishwasher tablets  no clean sponge and no clean tea towels for us to use. For this reason I am leaving a 4 star review."),
("2018-03-12", "20578419", "Chad", "Good communication although cancelled stay"),
("2018-03-13", "20578419", "Wanzhu", "Very good location and very clean  comfortable!"),
("2018-03-16", "20578419", "Kira", "Such a great location! We enjoyed exploring the neighborhood  and it was a lovely walk down to the harbor  through the Botanic Gardens and to the Opera House. The apartment was very comfortable."),
("2018-03-21", "20578419", "Jeong Sook", "1)위치-매우 훌륭함. Peddy's market  central station  world squre  korean mart (한호마트  코스코스)와 매우 인접하며 세인트 메리성당까지 10-15분 거리. 2)비행기가 오전 10시 30분 도착이라 체크인 시간 3시까지 짐을 들고 다닐것이 걱정이었으나 친절하게도 10시 30분에 짐을 맡겨놓을 수 있게 해주셔서  편하게 다닐수 있었다 (Website hidden by Airbnb) 3)세탁기 건조기 구비되어 있어서 매우 편리함 (Website hidden by Airbnb) 4)번화가에 위치하나 아파트 주변 조용하고 저녁 8시까지도 근처 coles마트로 장보러 다닐수 있을 정도로 안전함 (Website hidden by Airbnb) 5)전반적으로 청결함 (Website hidden by Airbnb) 6)day tour 만남 장소인 리지스 스퀘어까지 7분 거리."),
("2018-04-01", "20578419", "Laura", "Great location. Walking distance to amazing restaurants and bars. Really enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-04-06", "20578419", "Elkie", "very nice view from the apartment!"),
("2018-04-07", "20578419", "奥布瑞", "这件公寓简直像家一样 我喜欢它别致的格局 更喜欢和享受房东Max热心的建议和帮助｡虽然一直没能见面 但是Max为我们营造了家一样舒服的环境和氛围｡期待下一次悉尼之行!"),
("2018-04-11", "20578419", "Peggy", "We enjoyed the fact that the apartment was close to everything that we needed and public transportation. Max responded to all of our requests really promptly and even gave us extra service by transferring our bags to one of his other properties so that we could stay an extra night."),
("2018-04-12", "20578419", "Dave", "Great location and value. Spotlessly clean and great communication."),
("2018-04-15", "20578419", "Elizabeth", "Highly recommendSurrey Hills is a great spotThe apartment is reasonably well equiped"),
("2018-04-18", "20578419", "Eve Marian", "The apartment was clean and tidy  beds were comfortable  everything was there  and the location was perfect! Could not ask for more. Will definitely stay there again!"),
("2018-04-21", "20578419", "晓俊", "MAX的公寓就在伊丽莎白街沿街的一个玻璃门里 离中央车站和唐人街都很近 离轻轨也很近 附近吃饭购物都很方便的 公寓对面有个开放的公园 总之此次体验很棒"),
("2018-04-23", "20578419", "Edmond Teo", "Amazing apartment at an amazing convenient location. Place was exactly as describe  it was way better then what we expected. The host went to further miles by providing Washing Machine Powder  Shower Gel and lots of kitchen amenities. It just awesome staying of at Max's Place! Highly Recommended."),
("2018-05-01", "20578419", "Qian", "Great location  clean rooms.Wonderful place to stay in Sydney."),
("2018-05-11", "20578419", "Matt", "Great location minutes away from Central Station and all Surry Hills has to offer. Stayed here for a business trip and would definitely recommend again. Having towels  toiletries  etc provided was a nice touch as well."),
("2018-05-16", "20578419", "Seow Say", "Location is great  within 5 min walking distance to Central Station  and Hay Market."),
("2018-05-21", "20578419", "Lynette", "Lovely comfortable apartment in a great location. Was very impressed with the host. Communication was excellent and no trouble dropping our luggage early. Great having our own washing machine and dryer. I would recommend staying here."),
("2018-05-23", "20578419", "Phoebe", "Its a nice experience that i first time visit Sydney."),
("2018-05-26", "20578419", "Steffi", "We love the place so much! Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-29", "20578419", "Hie Hiong", "Clean & cosy place to stay . Close to centre station which easy to use public transport to visit around ."),
("2018-06-15", "20578419", "Vicky", "Location is good... value for money..But if want to sleep in day time than no chance you can sleep their in day..Too much noice from construction work around....Easy location  everything close.. but apartment needs few repairs..Things like sugar was there to use but not in a jar  just a open packet..Glass  plates were not washed properly by last guest...Max was very friendly and able to give quick response...Still i will give 4 star as it was value for money...."),
("2018-06-21", "20578419", "Gabriela", "Good."),
("2018-06-25", "20578419", "Amy", "My family and I stayed in this apartment over the weekend. It was the first time I had booked with Airbnb - communication and assistance from our hosts was fantastic throughout the booking process and our stay. The apartment was clean and tidy. You really can’t beat the location - close to central station  only a block from secure parking and a short walk to Darling Harbour."),
("2018-07-01", "20578419", "Eliaty", "Great location  near central station and bus stop."),
("2018-07-14", "20578419", "Scott", "Great value for space and close to everything in the city"),
("2018-07-28", "20578419", "Shanshan", "建议不要做中餐 煮点意大利面可以 油烟不好散｡"),
("2018-08-12", "20578419", "Mikayla", "Good place  great location! "),
("2018-09-02", "20578419", "Jixiang", "很好的居住体验 我很喜欢地理位置"),
("2018-09-16", "20578419", "Rosie", "Fantastic location! Great place to stay if you're just looking for a comfortable bed and amenities such as a washing machine and dryer. After the cleaning fee and airbnb VAT fees  it cost $307 AUD a night  which is quite expensive compared to a hotel. But in saying that  you won't get some amenities mentioned and location may not be as ideal as Surry Hills. I was a little disappointed initially (looked better in the photos) but if you take into account this fantastic suburb location and want a clean and comfortable stay  then look no further. Lastly  it's a bit of an inconvenience with one set of keys when the listing stated two would be provided. The host did let us drop our luggage earlier but we couldn't officially check in til after 3pm."),
("2018-09-21", "20578419", "拾得", "公寓位于这座美丽城市的中心地带  距离达令港和悉尼国际会议中心 ､悉尼大桥､歌剧院､植物园､当代艺术博物馆 等著名景点都不远 地理位置优越"),
("2018-09-23", "20578419", "Casey", "A great  central place to stay! Short travelling distances to places to explore in Sydney. BNB was clean and exactly as the photo - nothing to fault. Host has quick responses and is very understanding. He sorted out  a small problem in our stay very professionally. Overall  would definitely recommend this place if you are looking to explore what Sydney has to offer."),
("2018-09-28", "20578419", "Mengying", "The location is great and Max is very helpful for our stay."),
("2018-09-30", "20578419", "Hannah", "A great place to stay  would definitely recommend. a wonderful location with a nice modern feel  only issue is the host took multiple messages to reply."),
("2018-10-04", "20578419", "Peter", "房间较小 办公楼隔断而成 主卧与客厅厨房链接 墙体无法封闭 与客厅相通 私密空间较差｡"),
("2018-10-13", "20578419", "Tiffany", "位置很好 就在中央车站边上 去市中心逛很方便｡不推荐使用厨房 抽油烟机没什么用｡"),
("2018-10-18", "20578419", "Oosman", "Overall great value and centrally located"),
("2018-10-21", "20578419", "David", "Good location but it ends there. Very old apartment for the price that was paid for 3 nights accomodation in Surry Hills  Sydney."),
("2018-10-24", "20578419", "Jit Han", "Listing looks nicer in the pictures. Quite evident that the apartment has gone through some wear and tear. On check in  keys were not in the specified area. Host was quick to help with that."),
("2018-10-27", "20578419", "Sammy", "Awesome location!"),
("2018-11-04", "20578419", "Clare", "Great 2 bedroom apartment minutes from Central Station. Great value and will definitely stay there again."),
("2018-11-21", "20578419", "Spencer", "a niceplace"),
("2018-11-23", "20578419", "英", "Wi-Fi根本不能使用 和房东沟通后没有任何解决措施 公寓比较旧床品有一股汗味 是一室一卫用隔板改的 墙没有封 私密性很差 窗外就是在建的楼房与图片不符 虽然公寓的位置不错 交通便利 但是性价比较低 wouldn't recommend."),
("2018-11-24", "20578419", "Sharon", "Location and the appartments foyer was the highlight. The apartment itself was a little older than expected  the city views were not as shown.Hosts communication was friendly and check in was painless."),
("2018-11-26", "20578419", "新伊", "很小 卧室是用木板隔开来的.没有窗户 很闷.当我打开被子 床上还有两只蟑螂 住得很不愉快"),
("2018-12-06", "20578419", "Haoyu", "Really convenient apartment which close to the central station."),
("2018-12-09", "20578419", "Alexia", "Overall our stay was good  and the apartment is as it is represented except for the view has been totally blocked out. On my booking I requested the sofa bed but that was not organised  but the manager was good to fix we just had to wait till later in the afternoon and they charged extra. The wifi didn’t work and I had no response when I asked for it to be looked at. And on check out   the care taker came in before 10am asking when we will be out. I said sorry running a little late and the response was we have to charge you for 30min!! Unfortunately this was a terrible way to end the stay and also does not represent Airbnb’s hosting model."),
("2018-12-16", "20578419", "Lee", "clean  comfortable  quiet hotel."),
("2019-01-03", "20578419", "Koshi", "Thank you so much for me a great experience."),
("2019-01-13", "20578419", "Francis", "The place was exactly as expected. We had a great stay. The place is nice and modern. It's within minutes of central station  a lot closer than I thought which was a great bonus. Communication was good throughout."),
("2019-01-20", "20578419", "혜지", "To have none"),
("2019-01-29", "20578419", "Long", "Great appartment as shown in the photos. Would recommend as it is easy to access in the cbd area."),
("2019-01-31", "20578419", "Felicity", "Was a nice space in a great location."),
("2018-02-22", "20698056", "Mary", "the place was perfect and very clean  and value for money. The host is very polite and very helpful. i will recommend it to anyone"),
("2018-02-23", "20698056", "Jason", "nice apartment and nice view."),
("2018-02-28", "20698056", "Jason", "Nice place"),
("2018-10-19", "20698056", "Zoe", "I really tried to see the positives with this whole booking so it wasn't a negative review but I couldn't actually rate you zero - it wouldn't let me. So you have 1*So I'll start with a thank you. Thank you for nothing.We feel really let down by you as a company.  You cancelled our 1st  booking  apparently there was a problem with your airbnb account. (my alarm bells should have been ringing then  but the apartment seemed perfect for us  location and price wise). When I contacted you about the issue we re-booked. When requested you price matched the 1st booking. When I requested check-in details I had no response  3 days prior to departure or day before departure. After a 27+hr flight from UK to Sydney we arrived at the airport and went to check the address details and directions and found the email to say the apartment booking had been cancelled. I get the reason  if its true  I understand. But we landed at 9pm with nowhere to stay. Did you personally offer to help us or find us alternative accommodation with you?  A BIG FAT NO! Refund when requested. Next day we attempted to book another apartment with you and you actually declined us  when really you should have been helping us  to find somewhere to stay.That is what shocked me the most  the unhelpfulness. You knew why we wanted to stay  you knew the problems we had had before - none of them our fault and still you refused to help. No thanks to you  we now have a different apartment/hotel for the duration of our stay - not with your company. To say we were disappointed is an understatement. I WOULD NOT RECOMMEND YOU."),
("2017-09-17", "20804897", "Alex", "Staying at Emmy's place was okay  and I would recommend it for the price  which is probably the cheapest you can find around. The house  as well as the room  is probably not the greatest  but you're absolutely paying what you get. I only had two minor issues:1) I thought that 'flexible check-in' meant: 'tell me when you arrive and I'll open the door'. It's not like this  at least not in this case. I was arriving at 11PM/midnight and Emmy informed me she couldn't check me in and asked me to find another place where to stay. The problem was I didn't have the possibility to book another room as I was boarding the plane to get to Sydney  and I didn’t want to arrive to a place I didn’t know  late at night  without even knowing where to go to sleep. Luckily Emmy found a solution and I was granted access to the house. I haven’t seen Emmy during my stay  but I saw Patrick  who I think manages the room when she’s not there. They have both been nice and for any issues I encountered they were there to help. The house is a boarding house  so although you’ll have a private room  you’ll be sharing it with other people. The ones who were at Emmy’s when I was there were very nice as well! 2) The bathroom wasn't too clean and the room was a bit dusty  which made it difficult for me to sleep  being allergic to dust. As I paid a cleaning fee  to be fair  I was expecting a higher standard in terms of cleanliness. If I hadn't paid that  it would have been totally understandable. But again  as it is cheap and they are nice  I absolutely recommend staying at Emmy’s!"),
("2017-09-22", "20804897", "Karolis", "The host canceled this reservation 98 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-09-25", "20804897", "Tsz Kin", "The host canceled this reservation 5 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-09-17", "20788503", "Raychel", "Best that you could ever asked for"),
("2017-09-20", "20788503", "Mishka", "The host canceled this reservation 9 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-09-23", "20788503", "Jamet", "Logement situé à 10 min à pied du city town  l'arrêt de train venant de l'aérport. Appartement charmant  très lumineux avec accès à une cuisine bien équipé si besoin.Literie très confortable avec climatisation si besoin. Quartier commercant juste à côté  accès facile pour les principaux sites à voir (que ce soit à pied ou en utilisant les tranports).Notre hôte Holly s'est montré d'une grande gentillesse à son accueil et était arrangeante.A recommander sans problème."),
("2017-09-27", "20767798", "Yan Ting", "Good location. But building quite old."),
("2017-10-01", "20767798", "Brad", "Great place  great location"),
("2017-10-03", "20767798", "Sean", "Central location in Circular Quay  great spot to get around from  easy to contact the hosts very friendly people. Had a great time."),
("2017-10-07", "20767798", "文俊", "市中心 位置很不错 歌剧院 鱼市场 唐人街半个小时路程就可以走到了｡房子住得很舒适｡"),
("2017-10-07", "20767798", "Belinda", "The room was good! Not much mirror space for a lot of girls getting ready at the same time! But it was greaaatttt!!"),
("2017-10-14", "20767798", "Jess", "In a great city location and reflected the advertisement of the property. The host insists on many house rules so be sure to read."),
("2017-10-25", "20767798", "Tyson", "A comfortable place in a great location! We look forward to returning."),
("2017-10-28", "20767798", "Vannesa", "Great location. Clean and tidy."),
("2017-10-28", "20767798", "Rachel", "Would recommend this place for anyone wanting a weekend away in the city! Close to everything"),
("2017-11-08", "20767798", "Stephanie", "Jared""s place is a little expensive but would be perfect for a big group. Be cautious in the bathroom. The shower and washer leak a little. There is no shower curtain so that takes a little getting used to. Beauitful place and location"),
("2017-11-09", "20767798", "Alison", "Great location  only 2 minutes walk to Circular Quay and hosts were very accommodating  thank you."),
("2017-11-11", "20767798", "Hayley", "We stayed for 2 nights in this apartment  very central and handy to Circular Quay  the Rocks area and the Sydney CBD. Communication with Jared and Ana (who met us on arrival) was very good. The apartment is accessible by lift  but there are a few steps up to the entrance of the building. The space is quite comfortable for a family or small group. There are a few minor quirks - e.g. the bathroom is rather small and water from the shower tends to spray onto the bathroom floor. There is a bit of street noise but that's to be expected in this very central location."),
("2017-11-14", "20767798", "Benjamin", "Can't go wrong. Nice and central with what you need. Basic setup  but nice and clean. Great price for a great location."),
("2017-11-15", "20767798", "Joshua", "Unbelievable location at a reasonable rate"),
("2017-11-18", "20767798", "Sarah", "The apartment could not be in a better location if you wish to explore the heart of the city."),
("2017-11-23", "20767798", "Don", "Great spot  very convenient for the train"),
("2017-11-25", "20767798", "Mike", "Great location in the middle of the city. However  the apartment itself is below average. Even though it is clean and tidy  massive issues with construction noises in the building and also the bathroom. The washing machine and dryer is literally in the shower  so next to no room to fit. Also  shower drainage is blocked."),
("2017-11-30", "20767798", "Luke", "Great spot for 2 couples who want to have a fun night out and not worry about how to get home safely lol"),
("2017-12-04", "20767798", "Kanya", "It was a really great experience to stay  perfect location and place. Hosts were really nice and helpful."),
("2017-12-08", "20767798", "Lilian", "The apartment is well located but be aware of the following: (i) there is a wash machine and a tumble drier in the shower which prevents the shower door from being closed; thus water splits all over the bathroom; (ii) there is no internet at all (even if Jared promises you that there will be one available by the time you check in; (iii) Jared is unreachable and unfriendly."),
("2017-12-10", "20767798", "Caitlin", "Very clean  great location!"),
("2017-12-11", "20767798", "Monique", "Fabulous location for scenic views just down the road at Circular Quay and Botanic Gardens! Also extremely convenient for eating at Mr Wong right across the road and the bar underneath Palmer & Co.Would definitely recommend this to anyone visiting for work or pleasure!"),
("2017-12-13", "20767798", "Danii", "Great stay! Spacious unit for Sydney CBD. Perfect location for circular quay  Pitt st mall  train stations  the rocks  all just 5min walks away. Thanks Jared will definitely recommend your property to others."),
("2017-12-14", "20767798", "Kieren-Lea", "Great location  very clean and comfortable stay!"),
("2017-12-16", "20767798", "David", "Amazing location and very comfortable - bring some ear plugs though if you want to sleep - or have quite a few drinks like I did :)"),
("2017-12-19", "20767798", "Joshua", "Awesome place to stay in Sydney  Close to everything you need  all in waking distance. We have 4 adults and 2 children in the apartment  so the space was a bit small for big group with many things. If you are 4-5  plenty of spaces. Great hosts  will come back next time."),
("2017-12-23", "20767798", "Doug", "Great location  but that’s about it. Very overpriced and not clean enough."),
("2017-12-26", "20767798", "Fernan", "Its very close to everything and Ann was very nice! Highly recommended!"),
("2017-12-28", "20767798", "璐", "公寓离悉尼歌剧院､海港大桥非常近 走路只需要5分钟 离维多利亚女王大厦只要10分钟 附近有两个train station 非常方便｡公寓内洗衣服很方便 有一个洗衣机和烘干机 厨具都有但没有调料"),
("2018-01-02", "20767798", "Julian", "This unit is very expensive for what it is  namely a small loft style apartment with no views.  The unit has some cleaning issues  reported day 1  which have been ignored by the owner to date-not happy."),
("2018-01-07", "20767798", "Idan", "Excellent location BUT the apartment is small and especially the toilet and shower. The term ""cosy"" is very optimistic when describing the shower which is VERY small and without even a curtain to cover the splash. At the time of our stay there were lots of consideration work outside including weekend. If coming with a car  parking is an issue. Maintenance is okay although the doorknob seems displaced and duktaped and also more kitchen appliances can be very helpful. Apartment was clean. Beds are okay  more on the hard side but it's a matter of preference. An extra set of keys can also be helpful.Location  as said  is second to none and Ana was very helpful!"),
("2018-01-12", "20767798", "Beth", "Great location  very spacious!"),
("2018-01-13", "20767798", "Chris", "Jared's apartment is located in a great spot in close proximity to circular quay. The apartment is of reasonable size and easily fitted the two couples staying. Access to the building requires a security fob for the front door and key to the apartment. Unfortunately only 1 set of keys is provided which makes it incredible challenging if there are more than 2 people staying. I contacted Jarad early in the stay however he wasn't willing to provide the key. It is also worth noting that the bedrooms back onto a laneway with rubbish trucks coming past in the early hours of the morning (we stayed on a friday/sat night). I would suggest bringing ear plugs and eye shades as the outside street light does shine into the rooms. The apartment was reasonably clean and apart from the access issues  was great value. "),
("2018-01-16", "20767798", "Neil", "This is a great apartment  highly recommended. Situated in the heart of the city yet quiet  be assured of a good nights sleep in the super comfortable beds.Good communication with an efficient checking in system. The apartment is spotlessly clean with everything one could possibly want supplied.We had a very pleasant stay  Thank you Jared."),
("2018-01-19", "20767798", "Ben", "Amazing location!"),
("2018-01-21", "20767798", "Kim", "What a fantastic spot- so close the circular quay and the rest of the city. Everything was super comfortable  plus nice and clean. We had a great stay and would definitely come back next time we go to Sydney"),
("2018-01-25", "20767798", "James", "Great place. Highly recommend"),
("2018-01-27", "20767798", "Kathryn", "If you would prefer a place in Sydney to use as a base  this is it. Perfectly positioned amongst everything Sydney-ish. A good space to lightly relax with another couple after a concert or night out on the town. Maybe not a place you would chill in for a weekend to 'get away from it all'.Good beds  although light buffer to noise on Bridge St & George St  and air con in slightly larger room.Bathroom tricky to feel comfortable in  but clean  as for kitchen.Very reliable communication with check-in etc.Easy  has the basics for what you need and notes well communicated in explanatory information."),
("2018-02-01", "20767798", "Gary", "Great Location near Circular Quay.  Home was suppose to have WiFi but host said company was having problems so no WiFi during our stay.  Washer Dryer is located in the shower. Washer discharges onto the shower floor. If shower is left on more that one minute  it overflows onto bathroom floor."),
("2018-02-01", "20767798", "Jessica", "Thank you for having my partner and I stay a last week. The apartment location and layout / style were wonderful.Fix the shower/laundry situation for future guests and you’re perfect."),
("2018-02-07", "20767798", "Nathalie", "Emplacement parfait!"),
("2018-02-11", "20767798", "迪", "房子的位置非常好 公寓看上去很高级 安保也很好 房源离地铁和商业中心都很近 房东回复也很及时 接待的小姐姐人很nice 楼下就有便利店 美中不足的是淋浴间的空间有点小 不过也算够用 还是一次不错的体验｡"),
("2018-02-12", "20767798", "Klaus", "Tolle Lage ! Zum weiterempfehlen!!"),
("2018-02-16", "20767798", "Asura", "good location. everything is quite good."),
("2018-02-18", "20767798", "Saf", "Absolutely great location. Walking distance to everywhere within city. One thing should be mentioned is that the building is old and there is only one bathroom  so if more than 4 people live in there will be a problem. We had 6 people originally  but once we saw the apartment we booked a hotel suite immediately."),
("2018-02-21", "20767798", "Jia", "最便捷的位置 距离悉尼歌剧院和海港大桥均步行十分钟左右 距离达令港和鱼市场也不远"),
("2018-02-25", "20767798", "Joseph", "Great position.  clean."),
("2018-02-27", "20767798", "Vijay", "Great location with a very accommodating host"),
("2018-03-02", "20767798", "Alex", "Jared's place is really conveniently located.  His assistant ana was also very prompt in dealing with our requests and inquiries.  overall they are very helpful  will definitely stay again next time."),
("2018-03-04", "20767798", "Anthony", "."),
("2018-03-10", "20767798", "Gail", "Awesome location in Circular Quay and close to Rocks as well as lots of bars and restaurants. Very few amenities including toilet paper and paper towels. Lots of nearby construction noise. Shower was awkward at best. I still highly recommend for its location if you don’t mind austerity."),
("2018-03-11", "20767798", "Keith", "Great location with a short walk to the port! We had 6 guests that slept comfortably and the host had everything set up to meet our needs! Ana was very helpful in getting us into the place and Jared was quick to respond."),
("2018-03-15", "20767798", "Michelle", "Clean n spacious  close to tourist attractions  v convenient"),
("2018-03-17", "20767798", "Justin", "Apartment was in a great location. Good size for 5 people. Shower was quite small as washer/dryer were in the same space. Water was slow to drain away so bathroom floor was always wet and the hot water ran out quite quickly. Apartment was easy to find and very secure. Close to transport. Thanks Jared."),
("2018-03-24", "20767798", "Kat & Came", "Ana was lovely at the check in. The apartment is great  the only issue is with the toilet there is a washer and a dryer inside the shower which makes it super uncomfortable to have a shower. There is a temporary construction site next to the apartment that began working at 7am."),
("2018-03-27", "20767798", "Charlotte", "Apartment was in a great location close to Circular Quay and shopping. The apartment was what we expected and was plenty of room for four people to stay. It was clean  modern and was in a nice building/neighbourhood. The only thing that is stopping me giving it 5 stars is the bathroom - the shower doesn't drain properly and is quite small as the washing machine/dryer are in there; the shower curtain isn't long enough so the bathroom floor gets very wet (but this is something easily fixed). Overall  would definitely recommend."),
("2018-03-27", "20767798", "Andrew & Alice", "The apartment is in a fantastic location a short walk down to Circular Quay. The beds & living area are comfortable & all basic kitchen  bathroom & laundry amenities are provided. Highly recommended for a stay in a superb part of Sydney!"),
("2018-03-31", "20767798", "Florian", "Great to explore Sydney - almost everything is in walking distance"),
("2018-04-01", "20767798", "Elaine", "Lovely place. Close to circular quay"),
("2018-04-07", "20767798", "Sofia", "Really nice location of the apartment!"),
("2018-04-08", "20767798", "Mark", "We were a family of 6 who really enjoyed our stay.  The location was outstanding being around 200m back from Circular Key.  I would highly recommend the apartment for anyone looking for a clean  well appointed apartment in the heart of Sydney."),
("2018-04-14", "20767798", "Cinzia", "ABSOLUTELY AWESOME LOCATION!"),
("2018-04-16", "20767798", "Donna", "Jareds place is so central to the city and surrounded by wonderful amenities.  The unit has everything you need and 4 people can stay here very comfortably. The noise from the street is very minimal even with the works going on it was quiet. The host Jared was very quck to respond to all emails and checking in with help from Ana was so good she is wonderful  . I would definately stay here again."),
("2018-04-20", "20767798", "Florence", "The apartment looked exactly like the photos and was kept very clean. Location was great especially since it was close to 2 stations. The hosts replies where quick and helpful. Would recommend to anyone that wants an Airbnb in the CBD."),
("2018-04-27", "20767798", "Imogen", "Awesome spot in the city easy to walk to great sites  restaurants and malls. Cosy vibe and spacious."),
("2018-04-28", "20767798", "Laura", "This apartment is in an excellent location in the CBD. Jared was quick to respond to all questions and a very easy check in process. The apartment was clean and tidy."),
("2018-05-01", "20767798", "Lynne", "Great location  nice space and comfortable  especially the pillows! All communication was seamless and I was met on time and shown around the flat when I arrived.  I'd stay again."),
("2018-05-05", "20767798", "Graham", "The apartment was as expected. No problems except the noise at night time from the light rail construction."),
("2018-05-06", "20767798", "Michael", "Great clean place and ease of access"),
("2018-05-13", "20767798", "Rhiannon", "No description about the shower or warning about road works  also was cockroaches in the bathroom"),
("2018-05-15", "20767798", "Poh", "Great place with good locality.Host is so helpful and easily contactable...all check in and check out procedure is easy...I really like your padlock with bruce lee picture...i hope i can get onei can’t find it in sydney"),
("2018-05-19", "20767798", "Louise", "Great location  great space and easy communications with host - five stars"),
("2018-05-21", "20767798", "Hannah", "Check in was smooth and communication was easy! Convenient location and great security."),
("2018-05-24", "20767798", "Manda", "Would stay again!! Perfect location"),
("2018-06-01", "20767798", "Tenzin", "The apartment was very spacious and roomy. Everything was very clean and the location is great!"),
("2018-06-02", "20767798", "Andrea", "Well located & good value"),
("2018-06-08", "20767798", "Louise", "This is incredibly well positioned and close to everything! Little bit of noise from construction but that can’t be helped. Clean place and well appointed."),
("2018-06-09", "20767798", "Karen-Louise", "Awesome location  very clean and tidy"),
("2018-06-10", "20767798", "Laila", "Nice accommodation clean and well appointed. Communication fast and Jared was very accommodating with my changes.Thank you"),
("2018-06-11", "20767798", "Jacinta", "Great location- close to the rocks and circular quay  Pitt st mall 5 min walk. Great communication  clean and tidy place. Definately would recommend. "),
("2018-06-17", "20767798", "Jacqueline", "Great location! We went with our daughters and had a great time."),
("2018-06-23", "20767798", "Carmen", "very nice"),
("2018-06-24", "20767798", "Laura", "Great location and excellent communication with host."),
("2018-07-04", "20767798", "Ryan", "FANTASTIC position. Such a short stroll to Circular Quay. George St road works a bit annoying but any accomodation in the area would have the same problem at the moment. Will definitely stay again next time we are in Sydney. Thanks for having us."),
("2018-07-06", "20767798", "Molly", "Fantastic location provided walking to Circular Quay  Opera House  dinning and shops. You definitely want to use public transit as parking is quite expensive in the area. Very clean and well styled apartment. We got some noise from the street through the large bedroom windows but nothing that kept us up all night. One key for the elevator for our group of 6  was slightly inconvenient but manageable."),
("2018-07-07", "20767798", "Liz", "there was a lot of noise from roadworks outside the bedroom windows all through the night."),
("2018-07-11", "20767798", "Haibo", "房子位置很好 离悉尼歌剧院很近｡步行15分钟｡超市也很便利｡唯一不足的是房间的沙发床 大宝睡的时候有一条缝 不舒服｡毛巾虽然有准备 但不适合洗刷使用｡最好用白色毛巾｡只是一点建议而已｡淋浴房很小 老人不方便｡其他的都还可以｡物业管理人员安娜非常好!"),
("2018-07-13", "20767798", "Zhonghua", "我和朋友两家一起住的 生活设施齐备 是个很温馨的小家 最主要是位置非常棒 毗邻悉尼市很多的景点 步行即可到达｡房东人很好 有问题也立即帮助解决｡这次是很棒的住宿体验｡"),
("2018-07-26", "20767798", "Marine", "Idéal pour découvrir Sydney"),
("2018-08-05", "20767798", "Jess", "Great Location"),
("2018-08-06", "20767798", "Juliana", "Perfect location to enjoy Sydney and great communication"),
("2018-08-08", "20767798", "Bruno", "Clean and comfortable spot in the Sydney central business district. Location is great being less than a 5 min walk to Circular Quay and The Rocks."),
("2018-08-10", "20767798", "Sandra", "Jared place was really accommodating and great communication with Ana"),
("2018-08-12", "20767798", "Liam", "Fantastic location. Very much enjoyed our stay. Thank you."),
("2018-08-17", "20767798", "Vivek", "The property was nice and clean. Great location and value for money. Host was super quick in communicating and also provided airport pick up and drop service for a good deal. Cheers"),
("2018-08-18", "20767798", "Mark", "Great to place to explore sydney. Very close to Circular quay and all major sites. Nice and clean appartment"),
("2018-08-19", "20767798", "Sheryl", "great for a group and great location"),
("2018-08-20", "20767798", "Karen", "Excellent location.  5 minutes walk to Circular Quay and 10 minutes to the Opera House with cafes and restaurants all over.  20 minutes to airport and Jared and Ana looked after our bags for the day so we could go round Sydney for the day.  Cost $8 per bag - well worth it! They also arranged a lift to the airport.  Very prompt and efficient.Apartment was comfortable and well- equipped.  All good and will definitely stay again. Many thanks to Jared  Ana  Jeff and Francisco!"),
("2018-08-23", "20767798", "Jacqui", "Great apartment in a great location.  Clean and tidy."),
("2018-08-25", "20767798", "Mike", "Great location in the middle of the city."),
("2018-08-28", "20767798", "茜茜(Xixi)", "perfect location! apartment manager could provide airport pick up and drop off service  charge reasonable price   that is very convenient for international family tourists  very recommend!"),
("2018-08-29", "20767798", "Natasha", "Amazing. We will be back. So central to everything. Incredible place which was spotless and clean. We came down for a work award ceremony and didn't want to leave!"),
("2018-08-31", "20767798", "Nigel", "Pros: Excellent location  clean and comfortable. Cons: A little bit of noise with the nearby construction during the day. No dishwasher if you plan to eat in. Shower would be tight for bigger people.We enjoyed our stay and felt this place was good value."),
("2018-09-09", "20767798", "Carine", "Good experience at Jared place"),
("2018-09-11", "20767798", "Malu", "Great location ... close to Circular Quay and a short distance to The Rocks !"),
("2018-09-22", "20767798", "Nicholas", "Clean apartment in a great location. Owner was very helpful."),
("2018-09-24", "20767798", "Jane", "The location of the apartment was very good. Walking distance to the Rocks and Opera House. The apartment was nice and it was comfortable for the 5 of us. However  the bath area was a little small for us and it gets choked quite easily. The owner should get this fixed quite easily. But other than that  everything was perfect."),
("2018-09-25", "20767798", "Sarah", "Beautiful and clean. Fit 2 couples and a child easily. Great location to Circular Quay and the Opera House. Would stay again."),
("2018-09-26", "20767798", "Hazel", "房间很干净舒服 但是整体尤其是卫生间没有图片看起来那么大｡四个chen成人入住会略有点挤｡热水够热 但是多人使用的话间隔要开一些 不然会不够热水｡"),
("2018-10-03", "20767798", "Qiaoling", "Good location and cleaning linens. Ana was the one for communication and she has done a brilliant job. The kettle wasn’t working and the shower drain was blocked upon arrival  but Ana managed to get everything fixed within hours of notice. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-10-10", "20767798", "Ronald", "Conveniently located for cruises & provided needed amenities"),
("2018-10-10", "20767798", "Roland", "The location is excellent. However  due to the works and services collections right outside the bedroom windows throughout the night it was impossible to get any sleep."),
("2018-10-11", "20767798", "Klaus", "No tea or milk available. Disapointing considering the priceand its suppose to be a B&B"),
("2018-10-14", "20767798", "Kirsty", "Fantastic location  clean  secure. Wonderful!"),
("2018-10-17", "20767798", "Miles", "Had a relatively good stay at this airbnb  but could have been better. The best thing about it is the location. Location is everything when you travel  especially considering commute in Sydney is expensive. It's just about 10-15 walk to Circular Quay which leads you to other nearby tourist attractions. The apartment is very spacious. Lots of room to move around. I stayed with my family. We were 4 in total so the 2 bedrooms were good. It's nice they had a washer and dryer  although we didn't use them. Only issue was  the washer is hidden INSIDE the shower  meaning it took up half of its supposed space which made it so cramped and small. My parents are senior citizens so they had a hard time moving around. I honestly can't imagine a bigger man (Westerners/Europeans) being able to move around there comfortably as my parents are not that big to begin with. There were also a few stains on the sofa and carpet  but the rest of the area and furniture were clean.. Other than that our overall stay was good. Ana  our contact during our stay is great too. Kind and very responsive. However  we had some issues with the car service they offered. I'm not sure if this is an isolated case with the specific driver we were assigned to  but he was always late and he also got into an accident on our 3rd supposed pick up from him which made us have a hard time getting back very late at night. This accident also affected our airport transfer on our last day and we had not been notified sooner so we could hire another car service. OLA was suggested (an app like Uber that's supposedly cheaper) but we had a hard time getting a car the morning of our flight. In fear of missing our flight we had to get an Uber instead (good thing there was a car nearby) and it cost us A LOT of money. We just wish this could have been handled better..."),
("2018-10-18", "20767798", "Kylie", "Great location  so convenient for us as we were seeing a show at the Opera House. Loved it thank you "),
("2018-10-20", "20767798", "Thomas", "Location was fabulous. Walking distance to everything  including the Rocks  Opera House and Sydney Harbor Bridge. The Apartment was clean and had everything you need in regards to linens  toiletries  and kitchen necessities. There was a bit of construction noise but it seems like the entire city of Sydney is undergoing renovations. Would definitely come back."),
("2018-10-20", "20767798", "Kym", "Perfect location for weekend get away.  So close to Circular Quay  Opera House etc.Modern  Clean everything you need for a couple of nights away.  Thank you."),
("2018-10-25", "20767798", "Charlotte", "Great location. Flexible check-in which we appreciated. Pull out couch bed was made up perfectly when we arrived. The place is as in the photos  but feels quite plain when inside  bare minimum and nothing on the walls. If you're just using it for sleeping though I'm sure it would be fine. Needs more lights  not very well illuminated - not a big issue though. Best part is the location!!!"),
("2018-10-27", "20767798", "Mark", "Great location and communication."),
("2018-10-28", "20767798", "Emma", "The location was perfect for what we needed  with the apartment being clean  tidy and easy to access. Apartment came as described and communication with Ana was faultless. The mattresses were firmer than our personal taste  but linen and rooms were clean. Noise levels can vary  but not something the owner can prevent or control. Overall the apartment comes accurately described and located in a great area!"),
("2018-10-30", "20767798", "Mac", "Great place and a fantastic location if you're in the CBD for work"),
("2018-11-02", "20767798", "Karen", "Fantastic communication  great location and the apartment was lovely. Highly recommend - wonderful"),
("2018-11-04", "20767798", "Max", "Great place and very accommodation to our requests."),
("2018-11-09", "20767798", "Peak", "Great location !!!"),
("2018-11-10", "20767798", "Trudy", "Great Location - quiet and comfortable"),
("2018-11-14", "20767798", "Kay", "Really nice place to stay! The location is perfect  only few minutes walk to the Sydney bridge & the opera house. And the hosts were very nice  well communication  reply message quickly. Love it ~"),
("2018-11-15", "20767798", "Chirag Trilokbhai", "excellent location. basic amenities and furniture. they give one key for door only...difficult to manage.."),
("2018-11-19", "20767798", "Gabriele", "Great location to stay. All attractions are in walking distance and from circular quay you may easily reach Manly  Bondi Beach and the Airport."),
("2018-11-20", "20767798", "Trent", "Great location - short walking distance to Circular Quay and CBD."),
("2018-11-23", "20767798", "Chloe", "Great location. Clean and check in/out was smooth."),
("2018-11-25", "20767798", "Natalie", "Nice basic apartment close to city and circular quay ok for a quick stay."),
("2018-11-25", "20767798", "Michael", "Parking is a bit expensive  but necessary. We paid an additional $85 for the night for parking only. The location is excellent."),
("2018-11-26", "20767798", "Russell", "OK value  great location but parking is a nightmare if you are staying during the week. We stayed on Monday afternoon and looked for a park. Wilson was $86 per day. We were going to be up for $86 x2. We thought quick and called a hotel with valet parking nearby that I have stayed at before and got it for $57 for two days with 24/7 access.If you are also going to turn up during the day in a car  don't expect anywhere near the building to park to off load your luggage. All streets are no parking in the area for a long way away. You will need to try find a loading zone and be very quick with your hazards on."),
("2018-11-29", "20767798", "Lynette", "All was good but the lifts weren’t working. We had to carry our suitcases up 6 flights of stairs.  It wasn’t the best start to our trip. Also if you do stay here  be very mindfulOf the noise. It was worse than what we expected"),
("2018-11-30", "20767798", "Charles", "Awesome place  super location."),
("2018-12-05", "20767798", "星", "位置很方便 比想象中小一些 但无碍｡入住指南没那么详细 所以费了些周折 不过总体还算好找"),
("2018-12-06", "20767798", "Maureen", "Great location"),
("2018-12-09", "20767798", "Millie", "absolutely amazing little space so close to everything. can’t wait to return in the future!"),
("2018-12-10", "20767798", "Nicole", "Great stay at Jared’s place! We needed a night in Sydney  close to Circular Quay  and Jared’s place fit the bill!"),
("2018-12-11", "20767798", "Sara", "Had a great stay  thanks"),
("2018-12-13", "20767798", "Charles", "Jared's place is in a great location on the 6th floor of Bridge Street  in the heart of the city. He manages quite a few properties across the world  so we did not get to meet him personally. We took the train and got off at Circular Quay and walked about 10 minutes with our luggage. It was a great jump off point to catch the cruise ships  the Royal Botanical Gardens  and the Sydney Opera House. Ana  the local agent  had a limited schedule  but dropped off our keys at the apartment and was very communicative throughout the check-in and check-out process. The room was fit to sleep 6 adults and was spacious enough for my family. The place did smell of disinfectant and the carpet showed some signs of wear. Keep in mind that you are in the city  so train and traffic noise will be part of the experience. We  really enjoyed being in a centralised location. We would consider this place again for a future stay."),
("2018-12-21", "20767798", "Ganesh", "Great space in the city  walking distance from all the major sights of Sydney. couldn't think of a better way to introduce my in-laws to my home city :-)"),
("2018-12-24", "20767798", "Dylan", "Great spot for a couple nights in Sydney and spacious"),
("2018-12-25", "20767798", "Megan", "Ana’s place is very convenient to the city and is a simple home with basic needs and amenities. Perfect for a little trip to the city."),
("2018-12-27", "20767798", "Lianne", "Perfect central location to everything sydney !"),
("2019-01-02", "20767798", "Steven", "A little older interior look  no window views but has the basic amenities."),
("2019-01-04", "20767798", "Megan", "What a great spot! Perfect location  great building  stylish apartment. Thank you so much!! 10/10 will stay again!"),
("2019-01-05", "20767798", "Jarryd", "Great location in the CBD  close to Circular Quay. Apartment was as described. Check in was easy  and on time. Overall great location to stay."),
("2019-01-08", "20767798", "Claudia", "This apartment is in the perfect location in Sydney: 5 mins walk to Circular Quay  Botanical Gardens and the Opera House. This was perfect for our short stay as we got to see a lot of Sydney in a short time and felt like we were right in the middle of everything. The flat is nice and clean and big enough for the five of us ( all adults) to comfortably sleep at night  maybe not so much for families with small children who want to spend a lot of time in the flat - but who would want that  it's Sydney and there's so much to see. Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2019-01-08", "20767798", "Mark", "This spot is handy to everything and close to transport options from the airport. It was perfect for us for our transiting through Sydney."),
("2019-01-15", "20767798", "Thomas", "The location is great as you can easily get to many points of interest. We were unlucky as there was a lot of construction work directly around the building the whole day and night during our stay. Jared gave us finally a refund for this  so we are okay with that. The apartment has not so much light as the pictures indicate but this is not a blocking point for visiting Sydney. Check In worked easily."),
("2019-01-23", "20767798", "Jennifer", "Great location. Clean  neat and tidy. Great for families."),
("2019-01-27", "20767798", "Bridget", "good location  clean house and good communication"),
("2019-02-01", "20767798", "Neville", "Jared's place is in an extremely convenient position being just 10min walk to Circular Quay.Jared's place kitchen and bedrooms have bare essentials. Please take note that only 1 set of keys are issued.We enjoyed our stay in beautiful Sydney"),
("2019-02-07", "20767798", "Russell", "Great apartment ideally located for the CBD  Harbour Bridge  Opera House and many other areas of interest. Highly recommended."),
("2019-02-08", "20767798", "Diane", "地點方便"),
("2019-02-14", "20767798", "Claudio", "Gran ubicación en Sydney"),
("2019-02-18", "20767798", "은희", "1. 위치-윈야드역과 써큘리키역 중간에 위치해서 두 역을 5-7분 도보로 이용 가능해서  야간페리  이용이나 하버브릿지나 오페라하우스 야경보기에 편리합니다2. 침실 중 한 침대커버에서 악취가 나서 침대커버 벗겨서 여분의 이불로 바꿔서 사용하였고3. 주방의 겹은 손대기에 끈적거려서 주방세제로 2번을 씻어서 사용했습니다"),
("2019-02-22", "20767798", "Wendy", "Had a lovely stay at Jared SSP's place  so close to everything you need. Enjoyed a lovely dinner seafood cruise  walk around the Rocks  lovely meal at Cockles Bay and shopping at Darling Harbour."),
("2019-02-28", "20767798", "Daniel", "Nice cosy place  great facilities  coffee shop downstairs  and only a short walk to Darling Harbour and Circular Quay. We stayed with 2 adults  and 3 kids and it worked perfectly for us. Would recommend!"),
("2017-09-28", "20865085", "Amanda & Mick", "Lovely  homey little place. Beautiful location. You can see the water from the front door. We really enjoyed our short stay. Jenny the host was very friendly and helpful but left us to do our thing which we liked.The bed is super comfy too. (Also thanks for breakfast Jenny! )"),
("2017-10-13", "20865085", "Kim", "Best host! So lovely! And the house was perfect and very close to the beach ..."),
("2017-10-20", "20865085", "Tina", "All goes for show when you read the tittle 'blissful bronte'! Could see the beach from our front door  such a immaculate stylish home cosy feel. Close to all the amazing cafes  5 min walk to the beach... no worries! Jenny was helpful sweet host and answered questions we had and followed our requests. This is my first airbnb experience also and was def a great one! Would def stay here again if I return to Sydney :)"),
("2017-11-27", "20865085", "Paul", "This boutique size apartment was clean  stylish and very good value. Close to two lovely beaches. Jenny was thoughtful and happy to help with anything. We will be back."),
("2017-12-13", "20865085", "Frankie", "Really cute little appartment right near Bronte beach. It was spotless when we arrived and Jenny was accommodated our check in time really well! Would highly recommend"),
("2018-01-03", "20865085", "Isa", "I had a lovely /comfortable stay at Jenny’s place. It is well equipped and interiors are tastefully done. A good size bedroom and bathroom. Close to cafes ands pleasant walk to the beach. The air conditioning is a plus! I thoroughly recommend this host!"),
("2018-01-10", "20865085", "Amie", "Jenny's home is in the most idealic picturesque coastline of Australia. You are also a stone's throw away from Tamarama or Bronte beach. Upon arrival  there was snacks  fruit and breakfast goodies for our stay and also celebratory champagne for our honeymoon. The furnishing was gorgeous  the aircon was amazing after a sunny day on the beach and communication was superb if we ever needed a thing. We cannot wait to return! Thank you so so much"),
("2018-01-14", "20865085", "Katie", "Jenny was a gracious host. She made sure we had everything that we needed. She even left some bread  butter and jams. The house was stocked with milk and tea as well. Very comfortable bed. Clean spacious living area. Beautiful view. The experience was wonderful. I would definitely stay there again."),
("2018-02-01", "20865085", "Jenny", "Great place and Jenny is a lovely host. We had a great time in Sydney!"),
("2018-02-07", "20865085", "William", "Jenny is a wonderful (Website hidden by Airbnb) was our first Airbnb ever and Jenny did everything to make us feel like home...we are actually coming back to Jenny's in 2 weeks before to go back to France...Jenny ="),
("2018-02-16", "20865085", "Harrison", "I had the most delightful holiday thanks to Jenny. She really did make the difference  and went above & beyond the call of duty to ensure I was comfortable & happy.She was helpful without being intrusive  and by far exceeded any experience I’ve had with any other Airbnb Host’s I have met/ dealt with to date. The place itself is very comfortable and certainly exceeded my expectations.I would quite happily stay at Blissful Bronte again . Thanks again for your amazing hospitality Jenny.Warm regards Harrison"),
("2018-02-21", "20865085", "William", "Jenny is a wonderful person  the house was an amazing place to stay. Great location  great amenities  great communication and great advice . Well for our first and 4th Airbnb that was an amazing experience  hope to be back there one day...also hope to see Jenny in France soon!!!thanks again for everything. Merci beaucoup!!!!"),
("2018-03-03", "20865085", "Chris", "We loved staying here. The location is ideal  being moments from the beach. The space is as described and I would not hesitate to stay again."),
("2018-03-07", "20865085", "Vicky", "One holiday with two stays here! Fabulous place would return again!"),
("2018-03-15", "20865085", "Vicky", "Spotless apartment in fantastic location  sea views  excellent bus links to Bondi Junction and from there excellent rail links into Sydney and the surrounding area - very easy to use  just get Opal card and top up as needed.Jenny is a very thoughtful host and groceries were in fridge for our arrival  fantastic not to have to find supermarket after long haul flight.Will definitely recommend to friends and family  very comfortable base  would not hesitate to book again.Many thanks Jenny for letting us stay."),
("2018-03-21", "20865085", "Kelly", "We had a lovely time at Blissful Bronte. Jenny was great at communicating and made us feel very welcome. Everything that we needed was there  from air-con to beach towels! The place was immaculate and we don’t have a bad word to say about it. The location is perfect for couples or families as it is very close to Bronte beach and very close the bus stop. If we visit Bronte again  we will be sure to book into Blissful Bronte :-) thank you for making our experience so smooth."),
("2018-03-25", "20865085", "Jack", "Great place great location  would recommend"),
("2018-04-01", "20865085", "Tom", "Jenny was a great host  super friendly. Property was very clean & tidy. Great location with everything you want in walking distance"),
("2018-04-11", "20865085", "Ann", "Beautiful  cosy Airbnb. Location is amazing. Thank you Jenny  I loved my stay."),
("2018-04-17", "20865085", "Nancy", "Fantastic location with glimpses of the beach and 15 mins walk away to beach and cafes. Bus just across the road to Bondi Junction. Great front of house and very private. Lovely hostess"),
("2018-04-22", "20865085", "Lynsey", "Beautiful apartment  exactly as described  in peaceful location 5 minutes walk to the beach. We stayed 3 nights and had a lovely time  thanks Jenny :)"),
("2018-04-30", "20865085", "Traceypops", "The amenities are excellent and Jenny is a thoughtful  helpful and very welcoming host. There are all the things you needed   a real home from home  even beach towels  picnic bag and some food in the fridge for tired travellers. The location is excellent - just a couple of minutes from the beach.  Excellent value for money."),
("2018-05-04", "20865085", "Ben", "Great location with the beach down the road and every thing you need."),
("2018-05-11", "20865085", "Jason", "Fantastic host. Great location. Sparkling clean. There were some really thoughtful touches for our little girl. We hope to come back."),
("2018-05-17", "20865085", "Robyn", "Perfect place to stay.  Comfortable and immaculate presentation. Close to the beach.  Jenny is just lovely and very hospitable.  Thoroughly recommend this lovely house and location."),
("2018-05-21", "20865085", "Nicolas", "Nice place  beatifull area to spend some days and perfect hospitality"),
("2018-06-05", "20865085", "Anna", "Blissful bronte was amazing   Jenny is amazing ! The location is great  5 minute walk to the beach and a bus stop to bondi basically outside of the flat. Jenny gave us milk and bread for when we arrived  we arrived to Sydney at 7- so this was amazing ! The place was super clean  and had everything that we needed. Jenny replied to messages so quickly which was really appreciated  she gave us fresh sheets and towels after the first week. There was air con and heating which is great as Sydney does get cold at night time. I really recommend staying here  it’s great for the price in a amazing location and really comfortable. Thanks so much Jenny for everything and will stay in contact! Thanks  Anna and John "),
("2018-06-17", "20865085", "Jennifer", "Blissful Bronte is an excellent choice if you want to stay in a well-equipped apartment  a lovely host and stunning nature close by! Public transport (bus stop) is very close by  and the city centre and the airport easy ro reach. A small shop just across the street provides you with basics  but Jenny even ensured that the fridge was not empty upon arrival.The apartment is cosy  and you‘ll find everything you need. Wifi was stable  which is always important  if you also have to work. Cars can be parked on the streets for free. Bronte beach is a 5 minutes walk away  and less crowded (and thus more lovely) as Bondi. But the Coastal walk connects all Eastern suburb beaches  which is really great and nice hike. At Bronte you‘ll find nice cafés for having a coffee or great breakfast.I would definitely recommend Jenny‘s apartment  and actually I already did! Thanks again  Jenny!"),
("2018-06-25", "20865085", "Elen", "Blissful Bronte was such a beautiful place to say. Only a 5 minute walk to beautiful Bronte beach. Jenny was so lovely and helpful. There was nice touches to the place - including some milk and English muffins which was so nice considering we didn't get there until late. The place/amenties/furniture were all lovely and immacutely clean. A walk from bronte  to bondi is must. Jenny recommended having lunch at the Bondi icebergs (casual bistro area) which we did. We are so glad she told us about it as we had no idea you could eat there and it was lovely with a beautiful view! It is also super easy to get transport from the street or beach. Will definitely be recommending blissful bronte to friends and family!"),
("2018-09-03", "20865085", "Andrea", "I will keep my stay with in Sydney and in Bondi / Bronte in a very good memory and it also made a significant contribution to staying in a holiday apartment where I felt so much at home. Jenny welcomed me warmly and provided me with all kinds of useful information and was always available to answer my questions.Thank you very much  Jenny!"),
("2018-09-08", "20865085", "Kate", "My partner and I had the most amazing stay at Blissful Bronte  it’s a stunning  sparkling clean and spacious apartment minutes walk from incredible beaches and cafes. The apartment is very private and comfortable and has everything anyone would need.  It’s close to everything  we walked to both Bondi beach and Bondi junction. Iv stayed in many air Bnbs in Sydney and this will be the only one we will book from now on.Can’t wait to return!! Thanks Jenny :)"),
("2018-09-14", "20865085", "Rachel", "Jenny was fab! Lovely  welcoming and her place is in the perfect location."),
("2018-09-19", "20865085", "Rafael", "Thanks for the wonderful time in your apartment. Was a wonderful time and we felt like home. There was even stuff in the fridge and all basic items you need. When we come back to Sydney we will for sure come back. The beach is really around the corner and the connection to the city is perfect and easy. Thanks for the perfect time!"),
("2018-09-28", "20865085", "Ray", "Best possible location to visit the beaches  Bronte  Tamarama  and Bondi. The City is only a bus ride away.Jenny is really nice person as well as a very professional host.  You will like this place."),
("2018-10-03", "20865085", "Ryan", "Awesome location.The space is clean  spacious and comfortable and I’ll be staying again next time I’m in the area"),
("2018-10-09", "20865085", "静", "我要用汉语来写这个评价 就是想告诉大部分中国朋友 你若来悉尼 Jenny家是个不错的选择 当然 用汉语写评价也是因为我英语水平有限啦｡我和老公来度蜜月 看到澳大利亚很多漂亮的景色便订了机票和住宿 但我们的英语真的很差 还好Jenny特别热情 又很有耐心 会为我们解释一切工具的使用方法 听不懂时还会给我们找来图片｡房子的位置在邦迪海滩附近 附近有360公交站 虽然离悉尼市区有些远 但交通很方便 而且走的也很快｡房内的设计很温馨 各种东西都很全 真的像是住在一个家的感觉｡再次感谢Jenny的招待｡"),
("2018-10-14", "20865085", "Madeleine", "Perfectly clean  modern facilities  ocean view  great access to public transport  quiet neighbourhood. As a young couple  Jenny’s space was perfect for our weekend getaway!"),
("2018-10-25", "20865085", "Christine", "Friendly   Spotless. and very helpful"),
("2018-10-29", "20865085", "Cynthia", "Jenny was an amazing host who provided our stay with all the necessities for us and my daughter. She was thoughtful to even provide toys for my daughter and ensured we were comfortable. The location was a huge win as we had to walk down the streets and we were at the beach. Definitely recommend this place to anyone who is visiting Bronte"),
("2018-11-05", "20865085", "Frauke", "Great apartment.  We were amazed at what Jenny provided. It was not only a generously sized  lovely decorated and sparkling apartment with great aircon and perfect location to beach and public transport but Jenny was professional and  charming. From brand new beach towels to beautiful soft and large bathroom towels and crisp  ironed lovely bed linen to a fridge with essentials and a larder with coffee  tea  biscuits it felt like a home away from home.  The price service ratio is phenomenal. No wonder she’s booked well in advance.  We already recommended her to friends from overseas."),
("2018-11-12", "20865085", "Ines", "This was even more than perfect - definitely one of the best Airbnb experiences we have ever met. There were so many amenities given to us  such as food  bath utensils and so much more. The apartment is equipped with all devices you might need. Jenny and her daughter Emma are excellent hosts. We can only highly recommend to stay at this place."),
("2018-11-18", "20865085", "Amanda", "I cannot recommend this apartment more highly - we arrived late at night to find the fridge stocked with milk  cheese  jam  butter and English muffins. The apartment itself is roomy  bright and very private. It was so very clean and all linen and towels were of a high quality. In terms of location  the beach is literally a moment away with a short walk to the end of the street. You can see the ocean from the front door! I worked from here for a day using the table and was very comfortable. Overall an awesome place to stay and experience the eastern suburbs. I particularly liked Bronte as it didn’t feel as busy and as cluttered as Bondi. Jenny is a lovely host and was only too happy to assist in any way required."),
("2018-11-27", "20865085", "Claire", "108 Hewlett Street Bronte is a small hidden paradise. It is appealing from the first moment. So close to the beach and only a short bus ride to Bondi Junction  it is positioned beautifully- far enough from the city to feel like a getaway but close enough to be convenient. The apartment smells lovely  looks modern and well appointed and it is very private. Jenny is a superb host- extremely friendly and thoughtful- she provided breakfast staples in the fridge and cupboards to get us on our way the first morning.  All of the appliances were modern and in great shape  the furniture modern and comfortable- the bed was lovely  made up with fresh crisp sheets and pillows  with warm blankets in the cupboard. If we’d needed them there were also beach towels. The bathroom was very clean and modern and Jenny had supplied shampoo  conditioner and shower gel.We had a wonderful time- there was great detail provided by Jenny regarding public transport routes and timetables. Jenny was the ultimate super host- even holding an umbrella to shelter us from the rain whilst waiting for our departure taxi!You’ll love it!"),
("2018-12-05", "20865085", "Carolin", "I had a wonderful time at Blissful Bronte. Previous guests describe very accurately and eloquently how great this place is. Definitaly recommendable  great location  superb host; I hope I can come bay some day. Thanks  Jenny  for a perfect stay in my old street from student days."),
("2018-12-10", "20865085", "Monique", "Awesome apartment  location and host. Can’t recommend highly enough  and we will definitely be back. The home has been furnished with much love and the extra touches are so appreciated and go above and beyond Easily one of the best bnb we have enjoyed! Thanks Jenny"),
("2018-12-17", "20865085", "Mark", "What a lovely  stylish space.Spotlessly clean  stylishly appointed with modern appliances.Ample space  bathroom a little tight but totally satisfactory and shower i (Website hidden by Airbnb) quite roomy which is the main factor. The BB is elevated with screened windows that can open to let the sea breeze and the partial sea views in.Excellent location  few minutes walk to Bronte or Tamarama Beach  (personally our pick of the Sydney beaches).Jenny is a wonderful host  and  has taken great pride in the way she has set up her BB.Happy to help though never intrusive.Would we return?In an instant!It was a pleasure to meet you Jenny.Thanks for providing a lovely and much needed break.cheers Mark and Leigh."),
("2019-01-02", "20865085", "Nina", "Excellent place  had a lovely calm air about it.  Jenny was wonderful from beginning to end and a very kind hostess  thoughtful little touches made the world of difference  would stay again here in a heart beat!"),
("2019-01-06", "20865085", "Mary Ann", "We had a great stay at jenny's place. Jenny's communication was prompt and clear. The apartment was clean and the kitchen had lots of supplies  including breakfast food for our 3 days. It is a very easy 5 minute walk through the park to the beach and of course the Bondi to Coogee coast walk is at the doorstep. I highly recommend Jenny's place."),
("2019-01-19", "20865085", "Ray", "This is the best it can get on AirB&B"),
("2019-01-23", "20865085", "Raegan", "I loved my stay at Jenny's. In addition to the flat being as shown in the pictures and lovely  it is a short walk to the beach - a bit uphill on the way back. Jenny has thought of everything you could need to stay there and extra touches like sunscreen were much appreciated. Jenny always responded quickly to any messages I sent. She was flexible with my check in time as I arrived early after a long flight. I wouldn't hesitate to recommend this Airbnb to anyone looking for a place to stay in Sydney."),
("2019-01-26", "20865085", "Heath", "Nothing but praise for this wonderfully located  spotless and comfortable apartment in Bronte. Jenny is a warm  friendly and accommodating host with prompt communication; nothing was too much trouble. The apartment is adjoined to the main house   but with your own front door and a completely self contained living space with kitchen  large lounge room  separate bedroom and bathroom  as well as respectful hosts  the space feels entirely your own. Five minutes walk to the beach and with a bus stop out the front  it’s a quiet spot but not too far from the action. A really great base for a relaxing stay in Sydney."),
("2019-02-06", "20865085", "Harriet", "Jenny was a superb host and everything about the accommodation was excellent.  Situated in a prime beach location ideal for all beach lovers  early morning swims and evening walks are at your doorstep.  A great comfortable bed  air conditioning and a great fan for warm nights made this stay comfortable.  The living area is light and spacious  the bedroom was great with storage options  and it has a really good shower within a small bathroom. The stay was great and we will be returning in the future."),
("2019-02-24", "20865085", "Bob", "This is a wonderful airbnb in easy reach of the glorious beach's and Sydney itself.We were visiting our son who lives in Bondi Junction and it couldn't have been more convenient.The accommodation has everything you would ever need and is beautifully clean. We were even given fresh sheets and towels for our second week. Jenny is lovely and a great help. Don't hesitate just book it."),
("2019-03-01", "20865085", "Georgia", "Jenny was one of the most accommodating air bnb hosts I have experienced  the communication was clear and very helpful and the place itself was relaxing  clean and overall very enjoyable. 10/10 would recommend to all looking for a quiet beach getaway!"),
("2017-10-01", "20906161", "Vern", "What a fantastic apartment right next to Central Station. This opens up the entire city to you through the trains  buses and light rail. Use the Opal card to save on costs. The living room is well laid out and the couch is well built and comfortable. The TV is run through the Internet so there are many options to chose from. The closest market is downstairs and a small Woolworth a block away. The unit is in a secure building and on the top floor for great views. If you like trains  you will love it more! The kitchen has everything to make your own meals  which we did. When we arrived Alexey and Olga had a lovely bottle of wine waiting for us. Very thoughtful and considerate host. The bed was very comfortable. We used the downstairs bathroom with the large tub and shower  so convenient. The stairs are easily manageable but not for wheelchair users. The bathroom upstairs has a shower and the washer and dryer. That is such a plus for travelers. I would say we were able to enjoy our week in Sydney so much more because we rented this apartment. This is the very best value to be found and we're thankful we booked it. Highly recommend and would book it again if in Sydney."),
("2017-10-15", "20906161", "Nicky", "Great centrally located apartment. I loved the balcony - it's a real suntrap and a lovely place for an afternoon drink. The bed was comfortable and it's great there are two bathrooms - one on the living/dining level and another off the bedroom. It's opposite central station  so it's really easy to get everywhere via train. Just note there is some construction going on - firstly on the road outside (it's literally all ripped up) so you need to catch a Uber from the road around the corner. Secondly the building is under maintenance (roof terraces being are renovated) - but it didn't concern me at all. Wifi was good and quick. Overall I'd happily stay there again and really enjoyed my stay."),
("2017-10-20", "20906161", "Ruixue", "The apartment is very stylish and lovely. Alexey was very thoughful during our stay. Great location  1 min walk from central station. We cut short our stay due to unforeseen situation. But overall the stay was wonderful! Thank you Alexey!"),
("2017-10-20", "20906161", "Jackie", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-12-08", "20906161", "Adam", "A very clean and neat apartment  provided by a fantastic host who communicates promptly  was happy to accommodate my very late arrival time  and provided a number of thoughtful touches like a bottle of wine on arrival. Proximity to Central station is great  meaning access to the CBD is very simple  and the background noise is not disruptive (and ends completely in the later evening anyway). A great place to stay for solo or couple travellers looking to get out and explore  or a business person (as in my case) who need quick access to the CBD paired with a clean  safe place to come home to each night."),
("2017-12-11", "20906161", "Cameron", "Alexey's flat is awesome. Amazing location right next to central station and offers a lovely view overlooking the hustle and bustle of central station. The apartment is in immaculate condition and is very homely. Alexey has furnished it beautifully and we were availed ourselves of the nespresso coffee machine and various DVDs available. Thanks Alexey!"),
("2017-12-14", "20906161", "James", "This place is fantastic. Feels like a New York loft apartment with cool bedroom and trendy decor. The apartment is a stone's throw from both Central station and Surry Hills which has some awesome cafe's  restaurants and bars! Alexey was delightful and showed me through everything during check-in  and was flexible with check in times. He was also quick to respond to any questions I had."),
("2017-12-17", "20906161", "Kristen", "Simple  clean  and good location. Alexey was very helpful and good to communicate with."),
("2017-12-19", "20906161", "Jem", "Alexey was a great host  very quick to communicate and has a lovely  small but split level apartment in an excellent location. It worked perfectly for us with a small child  we could put him to sleep and still stay up without waking him. We went to the park and the pool  very easily got around to the rest of the city."),
("2017-12-24", "20906161", "Shalina", "The place was great and Alexey was an amazing host. It’s a central location and easily accessible to the train. This place is perfect for those who have never used a train before because all trains end up at this location. The train system starts in a loop first and then branches out into the rest of the city and his place is within this loop. The place is much larger than what the pictures depict. 2 floors with 2 full bathrooms and 2 balconies. There is a very nice restaurant below. Prior to staying in the apartment we thought the noise from the trains would be a problem at night but I️ dont actually remember hearing them.  So I️ basically slept like a baby and I’m a very very light sleeper. It could be that the trains stopped running at night but I’m not actually sure. All in all  this is a great place to stay. We highly recommend it."),
("2017-12-26", "20906161", "Sunho", "Very clean  Stylish decoration  Easy access to Central Main staion  Excellent communication  Good matress for traveler  My family had really good time in this double floored apartment. The building is the best for traveler by train and also could be used for ones who wants walking along to the City  Hyde park. Addiotnally  the nice cafe and restraunt in SurryHills are recommnedable."),
("2017-12-29", "20906161", "Pavel", "Lovely two level apartment just by the Central station. Lots of lovely cafes and restaurants for all budget and taste in the neighborhood. Thank you for hosting us  Alexey!"),
("2018-01-06", "20906161", "Jennifer", "This is a fantastic apartment right in the middle of things. Alexey was a great host and went out of his way to make sure we had everything we needed. The apartment is very thoughtfully provisioned - you have everything you could need so you do feel very much like you are home away from home. Fanatastic location just near to lots of great eateries - and directly opposite Central Station. I have already recommended this place to friends. Their is construction on the street outside but this did not impact on us at all. The apartment really added to our experience of Sydney."),
("2018-01-09", "20906161", "Orshi", "Love love loved this apartment! The personal touches around the space with the paintings and books really made it cozy and comfortable. Complimentary Nespresso pods were also definitely a plus; however  once we discovered the breakfast place downstairs  we took every chance to order coffee from there. Seriously  some of the best food just in the next building over. Multiple other eateries and shops in walking distance. The train station is less than 3 minutes walking and Chinatown is 15 minutes walking. Usual city sounds come in from the outside but nothing loud to complain about. Would definitely stay at Alexey and Olga's place again if I ever return to Sydney. "),
("2018-01-15", "20906161", "Brianna", "Perfect location right next to train station and lovely host with excellent communication!"),
("2018-01-28", "20906161", "Russell", "Where do i start. This is a fantastic location  right beside Central train station. If you wanted to walk the town  you had great access to walk to Circular Quay  Paddy's Market  or Darling Harbour.  Your were pretty well within walking distance to grocery stores  restaurants and liquorland to name a few.  The apt is kept in great condition and had comfortable beds.  The balcony was a great place to wind down for the evening.  WiFi is provided and was pretty solid. Our host  Alexey  was always on top of things.  He met us upon our arrival and was always just an email away with quick responses to any questions i had. If you want a host that is looking out for your best interests  and is a great communicator Alexey fits the bill.Thanks for a great week Alexey!"),
("2018-02-01", "20906161", "David", "Fantastic apartment  central location within walking distance of everything but also right next to public transport. Great host  so friendly and was there if we needed anything. Would recommend to anyone and would definitely come back to stay again soon!"),
("2018-02-15", "20906161", "Verena", "Die Wohnung ist einfach klasse!Liegt direkt vor dem Hauptbahnhof von wo aus man im minutentakt in alle Richtungen fahren kann.Mit der Bahn ist man in 10 Minuten am circular quay und es gibt auch eine direkte Verbindung zu den Blue Mountains!Alexey ist ein toller Gastgeber!Er hilft bei allen Problemen  gibt dir Tipps und fährt einen sogar zu orten zu denen man möchte :)Die Wohnung an sich ist super!Sehr viele Küchenutensilien  Shampoo und der Rest ist alles vorhanden!Wir würden sofort wieder diese Wohnung nehmen  wenn wir nach Sydney kommen!"),
("2018-02-21", "20906161", "Elizabeth", "Lindo apto en un lugar ideal  ya que está a unos metros de la estación central  y a pie pudimos recorrer el centro de la ciudad! Recomiendo a los futuros viajeros  destacando la prolijidad del mismo y con todo lo necesario para sentirse como en casa."),
("2018-02-27", "20906161", "Amanda", "Great location!! Well presented with good amenities. It was way closer to everything than expected. We wished we stayed here for our whole stay in Sydney. Beautiful home  very comfortable bed! Alexey was very helpful & prompt with communication. Complimentary wine was a lovely touch  thanks so much. Recommend!"),
("2018-03-03", "20906161", "A", "Alexey's place is comfortable  spacious for 2 people  and in a great location. The unit is in an apartment building just across from the Central train station with easy access to CBD of Sydney (10 min train ride or 20 min walk). The unit is 2 levels  with a full bathroom  washer/dryer and kitchen. Communication with Alexey was fast and straightforward. We were able to self check-in early  and the instructions were clear and easy. We didn't have a chance to meet Alexey  but he checked in with us during our stay. We had a great stay and hopefully will be back to visit Sydney and stay here again!"),
("2018-03-10", "20906161", "Ville", "Superior communation with fast answers! Location is great  especially for flight passengers: trains are close and the apartment is easily accessible with luggages. Thank you!"),
("2018-03-16", "20906161", "Ian", "Alexey's place is an excellent apartment opposite Central Railway Station and had us fascinated watching trains coming and going all day.  Ideal for getting public transport to anywhere in Sydney and beyond.  Two bathrooms and great cooking facilities. Washing machine  dryer  and dishwasher all there."),
("2018-03-23", "20906161", "Jan", "If you like quirky you will love this place. Conveniently located opposite Central station and close to Woolworths and park."),
("2018-04-09", "20906161", "Zoe", "Alexey's place is very nice with everything we need  including all necessary consumables and some food.   The flat is spacious with two floors + roof separating living room and bedroom  together with two washrooms. We enjoyed staying at the roof for the sunset.     Alexey is one of the Best Host I have met. He has tried his every effort to let us have a nice stay and responded promptly. He was willing to offer us helps when we were in need. Incidentally  the lift was out of order for a couple of days during our stay. It was really out of Alexey's control. He has even come to carry luggages and drive us to the airport. If you are looking for a place in sydney  please dont hesitate to stay at Alexey's place. Thanks so much  Alexey =)"),
("2018-04-13", "20906161", "Ben", "Thanks for having me Alexey. Great location and a lovely bottle of wine on arrival- much appreciated."),
("2018-04-14", "20906161", "Nicole", "Great location in Sydney  close to Central Station easy walking distances to everywhere we wanted to go...thanks Alexey for being a great host and your great customer service... Nice touch with a bottle of wine... Thankyou ... Steve and Nicole"),
("2018-04-21", "20906161", "Priya", "Fun and spacious apartment  in a great location. Would certainly recommend."),
("2018-04-30", "20906161", "Joan And John", "Alexey's apartment is in a great location and has everything needed.  He was a thoughtful host  communicated promptly with us at all times  and answered all our queries.  We would be very happy to stay there again when next in Sydney."),
("2018-05-04", "20906161", "Bronwyn", "Perfect host and great place - thanks Alexey!"),
("2018-05-06", "20906161", "Lizzie", "Great place and value for money  Alexey was super helpful and easy to communicate with"),
("2018-05-10", "20906161", "Louise", "Alexey was a great host. His apartment was exactly as described an the location was idea for the trains to everywhere.  When I come back to Sydney I'll definitely be looking to book here again."),
("2018-05-13", "20906161", "Jessie", "Great! Perfect location and lovely decor."),
("2018-05-20", "20906161", "Marcus", "Great location. Right next to Central Station. Cozy place with lovely deco. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-23", "20906161", "Ming", "The location just right next to central stationPlus wifi supplied. I m highly suggest this place for ppl travel or business :)"),
("2018-05-28", "20906161", "Fiona", "Great place to stay for a visit in the city. The view was incredible"),
("2018-06-09", "20906161", "James", "Excellent spot and a great space to spend a week  with easy access to downtown Sydney (and anywhere else via the train).Alexey was an extremely responsive host  both leading up to and during our stay. Could not have asked to for better from him."),
("2018-06-11", "20906161", "Ramona", "Alexey's place is centrally located  just  metres away from Central Station. It's clean  comfortable and Alexey went out of his way for a flexible check in for us. There are also very thoughtful touches around the house - such as chardonnay on arrival. Highly recommend."),
("2018-06-16", "20906161", "Michael", "The apartment is excellent  located literally steps from Central Station. Very easy for transportation  especially to/from airport. Comfortable place  really enjoyed my stay. Balcony is nice! Alexey is a great host  fast responses to messages. Easy arrival/departure."),
("2018-06-19", "20906161", "Jaime", "This place is charming and close to public transport. It made taking the train to an from the airport very convenient. It was walking distance to some tourist areas and close to a grocery store. I was very happy with my stay and communication was always prompt. There was a lovely touch of wine on arrival. It was clean with convenient amenities."),
("2018-06-24", "20906161", "Braeden", "This was my first AIRBNB Experience  I truly enjoyed the creative and functional space. Three balconies were incredible  great city skyline views. Very quiet building. It is close to the train station  but this does quiet down around 11pm every night. The place is warm  the heaters are warmer and the two guest bathrooms meant I could enjoy the privacy of my own space and visitors could use the one upstairs. The tv didn’t quite work with limited reception; but if you don’t want to watch television or sports the whole time you’re there - head on out and experience SYDNEY night life just a stone throw away and in some cases  right next door! If you want a cheap quick eat - dominos pizza is down stairs; that was great for a sobering up recovery with my parents who visited. For my first AIRBNB experience this house was exceptional and Alexey was very hospitable  I had planned on visiting with my partner but they broke up with me before I arrived from Melbourne. Alexey was very sweet leaving a bottle of wine for me and checking in on me to make sure I was okay. All in all an amazing experience."),
("2018-07-01", "20906161", "Alicia", "Amazing location!"),
("2018-07-08", "20906161", "Alyssa", "The apartment was as descibed  Alexey was a responsive host. There was something happening at Central Station in the wee hours that meant sirens were going off all night  and the construction in Chalmers St was noisy  but that didn't start til 9 am. The first night was totally fine  slept like logs.You need to be ok with stairs and the mattress is on the floor. The mattress is a good one. The apartment has everything you could want  great kitchen and bathroom. It was handy having two bathrooms.Being right near Central is great for transport  we got to town late and were still able to get the train to Circular Quay in time for the show."),
("2018-07-11", "20906161", "Michelle", "Great place to stay - amazing location! :)"),
("2018-07-20", "20906161", "Billy Rakhmat", "Look  some Airbnb host could be an agent which just set the accomodation purely for business BUT Alexey is totally different  the host is care & thoughtful  it feels like home. BASICALL ALL YOU NEED FOR YOUR TRAVEL.. & wait for it... it (literally) only 86 steps away from the Central Station exit 6 ! amazing location to go anywhere...."),
("2018-07-23", "20906161", "Cassandra", "Alexey was amazing to work with. He worked to make our check in/check out times best to fit our schedule. He had wine waiting for us  which was a nice personal touch. Everything with keys exchanging went very smooth. He kept great contact throughout the stay. The area is right by the train station  at the moment there was some construction so parking would be very difficult to find. There is a cafe/pizza place and servo on the bottom floor which was very convenient. The apartment itself is very trendy  with a small lounge are  but bring DVDs to watch! The balconies were lovely  and caught the sun all day. "),
("2018-07-30", "20906161", "Leila", "Alexey’s place is awesome  very unique and in a great location. Alexey was also great at communication and made me feel at ease as I knew we were looked after prior to coming to stay. The apartment is quite loud and the TV has very little reception but other than that it was a great stay! Thanks Alexey :) "),
("2018-08-01", "20906161", "Dane", "We had a very brief stay and the apartment was literally across the road from Central Station. Our booking was very last minute and Alexey's responses were very prompt - very good communication. The one negative was the noise from the station which was quite noticeable from the bedroom."),
("2018-08-04", "20906161", "Steve", "Alexy's flat is next to Central Train Station. That makes it very convenient to get around Sydney.  The deck is nice.  Flat is small  but that is expected in middle of a big city. Everything you need is provided. There is no WiFi  which was disappointing.  The blinds don't  cover the whole window   so there is quite a bit of light at night.  There is also noise from Central Station. If you are a sensitive sleeper   this might not be the best spot. Otherwise I recommend it. He is a responsive host. "),
("2018-08-10", "20906161", "Zahra", "Really great place  I would highly recommend staying here. Alexey was a great host very communicative. The apartment had everything you could need and the location was great! "),
("2018-08-17", "20906161", "Hongting", "Alexey is really nice and kind. He replied quickly and let us early check-in without any fee. The apartment is very clean and all things needed are well prepared. It got a super good location  just two-minute walk to Central Station with a beautiful view of the city through the window. Self check-in is really easy. Highly recommend!!"),
("2018-08-20", "20906161", "Karl", "Communication was great  less than 50mtrs away from central station  easy check in and out  room was very clean really enjoyed my stay"),
("2018-08-31", "20906161", "Rhys", "Great place  awesome location. Clean  cozy and comfortable. would recommend to anyone. Alexey was very communicative and helpful. 10/10"),
("2018-09-05", "20906161", "Julie", "Alexey’s place was absolutely perfect for our visit to Sydney. Steps away from the train station  which was incredibly convenient  and the home itself is very well appointed and had everything we could have needed. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-09-16", "20906161", "William", "Great place good host"),
("2018-09-19", "20906161", "Hazel", "Ideally located next to Central Station and plenty of cafes in the area. The apartment was easy to find and felt secure.The apartment was clean and bright with a balcony on both levels. Pleasantly surprised to find extra touches  such as extra towels and some toiletries also available. The kitchen was well equipped and we enjoyed the complimentary wine on arrival. Would highly recommend. The apartment is close to transport and a 30 minute walk to the CBD."),
("2018-09-21", "20906161", "현민", "good"),
("2018-09-23", "20906161", "Tiina", "This apartment is very interesting on 3 levels so make sure you can handle stairs;)I found the location fascinating. Directly opposite the railway station and work going on putting in the light rail but it did not impact in the evening at all. Loved sitting on the balcony with generous bottle of supplied Chardonnay   people and train watching. And the lovely city lights beyond. Though the trains seem to go through the night ( I looked if I got up) I did not hear (Email hidden by Airbnb) fortable mattress (on floor as in photos) and lounge to relax on after a long day out and about. I wish I’d had time to read some of those great looking books!Very homey and comfy and great location to get to anywhere!"),
("2018-09-26", "20906161", "Alexander", "Alexey’s space was lovely! A great host  he made sure we could check in and out when needed  and responded to messages quickly. Extra touches like bringing us coffee  and providing a bottle of wine on arrival made the trip even better!"),
("2018-10-03", "20906161", "Susan", "This is the ideal location for a single person or couple if you plan on travelling around Sydney and to country NSW. Public transport to everywhere is at your doorstep including trains  buses and light rail. A small convenience store is next door for milk and snacks. The range there  however  is limited and you would struggle to find ingredients to make a meal. Other food options are very close by. The bed is very comfortable and the balconies have nice views over Central Station towards Haymarket. Although there was a little bit of noise from the trains  it was minimal."),
("2018-10-06", "20906161", "Pingchun", "The best choice if you travel in Sydney first time.Very good location and you can walk to Sydney maybe 40 minutes. Clean room and we slept tight. You can cook Chinese food since there is Chinese soy sauce."),
("2018-10-09", "20906161", "Leo", "One of the best location. infront of central train station. this place have everything you need. quick to response to inquiry. and going over and beyond with the personal touch of a welcome wine . If you are looking for a place to stay  do not hesitate to book this awesome apt. great place and great host!"),
("2018-10-12", "20906161", "Victoria", "The place was absolutely amazing and in the perfect location! Communication was so easy and the little touches like the bottle of wine made it extra special. Honestly could not have booked a better place for our time in Sydney!"),
("2018-10-15", "20906161", "Villalf", "Fantastic location; My first time in Sydney and the apt is at the heart of almost everything. Such a convenience to go around"),
("2018-10-19", "20906161", "Adelia", "Alexey’s place is very nice & clean. I love his two storey place which is close to everywhere. Close to many different kinds of restaurants. I love it coz it’s walkable to China town where you can buy cheap different kinds of souvenirs from Australia. Alexey was very helpful & upfront in answering our queries. Very good host who was very easy to reach out when we have questions. Definitely recommendable 100% & definitely will stay again when we decided to go back to Sydney."),
("2018-10-24", "20906161", "Yuen", "Alexey 's house located next to the Central Station which is very convenient for all travellers. The house is clean  stylish design  with a lovely balcony  all amenities are provided. However there were little problem about the shower tap and aircon  but Alexy responded quickly and promised to fix it. So the house still highly recommended."),
("2018-10-28", "20906161", "Louise", "Everything was as expected  great price and location. Very strong communication with host. Would recommend for anyone wanting to stay somewhere close and affordable to the CBD as the train is across the road and lots of ammentities near by."),
("2018-11-04", "20906161", "Nick", "A great location and a great host. Everything we needed was there and it was an excellent house."),
("2018-11-07", "20906161", "Alyssa", "Cozy little place literally right next to Central Station.  Alexey was quick at responding and the early check in was also so helpful. Loved the balcony!"),
("2018-11-13", "20906161", "Nicole", "Alexey’s place is exactly as pictured and is very clean. It might be a little noisy for light-sleepers due to the close proximity to the Central railway station  but the location is perfect for travellers wishing to explore Sydney CBD on foot or public transport! The main issue we had during our stay was that the only elevator in the building was not working. Carrying heavy luggages up and down 8 levels would not be ideal so it may be good to check if the building management has repaired the elevator"),
("2018-11-19", "20906161", "Sumaya", "Pros:Central location: This Airbnb is  Surry Hills and is extremely close to the central station which has ties to many lines. Perfect for those who want to convenience and close to some of the popular and trendy bars. Quick responses:  Alexey's response were quick which we appreciated. We had a change in date in our Airbnb and he was flexible in changing dates.Cons:Unclear directions:  We would have preferred more clear direction and a step by step using AirBnB check in process. We spent (Phone number hidden by Airbnb) minutes looking for the building because the (Hidden by Airbnb) Map didn't pin point us the cab to the right location and the direction detailed was confusing. We used both Uber and 13cab and they both dropped us to the back of the building.  Broken elevators for the entire trip: We completely understand that this is out of Alexey's control. This is an old building so it was not a surprise. That said  we wish Alexey informed us about the broken elevator in advance. One of the neighbours mentioned that the elevator was broken for a few days and it's not an uncommon thing for it to happen to the building. Carrying 2 luggages + carry on to the 8th floor was extremely challenging. Please watch out if you are carrying luggages or have a small family. Initial feedback given:  When we shared with you our initial feedback about the direction  elevators and the humidity in the room  Alexey's responsive was defensive instead of finding a solution.  He subsequently suggested that we could leave to a new hotel/airbnb with a full refund with receipt. We were taken by surprise because our feedback was honest and were simply looking to help him as a host. We were surprised to have read that message without any solutions. It felt like he'd  rather have us leave so that he can avoid any possible reviews."),
("2018-12-17", "20906161", "James", "Neat  tidy  stylish and convenient. A great place with a equally great host."),
("2018-12-27", "20906161", "Rexie", "Unfortunately we only stayed one night  instead of the intended 5 nights. The lift had broken down and the apartment was on the 8th floor.  2 large suitcases and 8 flights of stairs for 5 nights  it just wasn't convenient so we moved to a hotel. Alexey (the host) was very helpful and quick to respond to the issue  refunding the rest of our stay. The lift was fixed the next day  but by then we'd booked the hotel already. On the upside  the apartment is as per the pics. Very clean  the mattress was comfy and lots of space in the apartment. Nice white wine on arrival too. The location is great  but do pack ear plugs if you're a light sleeper - right opposite Central train station  which is very busy. Also some roadworks taking place."),
("2019-01-10", "20906161", "Beatrice", "Nous avons apprécié l'appartement  qui est très bien placé pour tous déplacements dans Sydney  sa vue  le confort  de la chambre et la réactivité d'Alexey. Nous avons aussi eu droit à la panne d'ascenseur  mais que sur 2 jours. Les travaux pour la nouvelle ligne du tram étaient au pied de l'immeuble et très bruyants (ils seront terminés fin 2019) mais cela était gérable avec les boules quies. Aussi  nous avons évité de nous asseoir dans  le canapé  rigolo  ancien mais défoncé et poussiéreux. Au final  nous avons apprécié notre séjour chez Alexey et n'excluons d'y retourner peut-être en 2020"),
("2019-01-11", "20906161", "Kyla", "Quirky artsy apartment in amazing location. Alexey was super helpful and responsive and would definitely recommend staying with him if you’re heading to Sydney :D"),
("2019-01-15", "20906161", "Nezia", "The place was just as advertised. We loved staying close to the Central train station as it really saved us time because trains were central to our trip itinerary. It was clean  close to everything  plenty of amenities  and one of us snores  so having two different levels really helped!  :)"),
("2019-01-31", "20906161", "John", "Excellent location for a great price - thanks Alexey:)"),
("2019-02-10", "20906161", "Kate", "the location is great if you come from the airport or want to explore the city by foot or using public transport.   I cannot fault my experience."),
("2019-02-12", "20906161", "Tom & Tracey", "Good location next to central station. Fairly spacious unit with lots of amenities. It is particularly suitable for younger people. Alexey is an excellent  caring host. The unit can be hard for taxi or Uber driver to find  but the entrance is just a few meters left of Dominoes Pizza. Light sleepers may have difficulty with light as the blackout curtains do not fully close."),
("2019-02-14", "20906161", "Kenneth", "Alexey is very helpful"),
("2019-02-22", "20906161", "Tammy", "Charming quirky space. Lots of towels  shampoo and conditioner. Condiments in the fridge. Good coffee maker. Bring ear plugs for the night because you can hear the trains."),
("2019-03-03", "20906161", "Cody", "Friendly host  great location"),
("2017-09-29", "20906942", "Vik", "The rental lives up to its pictures.Brand new  spacious and well equipped.Very responsive host. Conveniently situated. Good value in an expensive city.Nothing less than 5 stars!"),
("2017-10-01", "20906942", "Jessica", "Unsafe secondary stove top plugged into the wall with a Chinese adaptor that makes physical sparks and that could burn the place down  dead cockroaches in shower and kitchen cupboards  not very clean."),
("2017-10-02", "20906942", "Xinko", "Xinhui's apartment is in a quiet little street  very clean and tidy  and everything is the same as the picture. There is a  convenience store nearby  everything is convenient and totally beyond our expectations. Thanks to xinhui for providing free luggage."),
("2017-10-05", "20906942", "Bryan", "The apartment was cosy for myself as I was travelling alone and stayed for 3 nights. It would fit a couple perfect. There is a double bed with nice quilts  it was comfortable for me. Good lightings  internet and TV were all working well during my stay. What you see in the picture  is exactly how it is. The Location is very safe  especially since it is very nearby UTS where u have lots of students roaming around. The location is excellent  very near Central Mall and HayMarket. I could even walk to the Fish Market and Darling Harbor in 15 mins.  I highly recommend the apartment by Xinhui. He made renting very easy and was very very quick in responding if you needed any information."),
("2017-10-08", "20906942", "Layne", "Nice room in convenient location. Xinhui was easy to get in contact with & helpful."),
("2017-10-13", "20906942", "Phoebe", "A clean and very spacious apartment with tons of storage. The Bosch washer / dryer is a great addition although an iron would also be useful for business travelers like myself. Xinhui is friendly and accommodating. Check in is super easy with keys in a combination locked box and the apartment is quiet but well located for the city."),
("2017-10-15", "20906942", "Joe", "Had a great stay  would definitely stay again!"),
("2017-10-21", "20906942", "Tania", "Fabulous! Thanks!"),
("2017-11-01", "20906942", "Mia", "The place is located right in the central Sydney. Short distance to everything. Everything is great except the room could be much cleaner. There was dust in the bathroom. And there was no dish rack."),
("2017-11-05", "20906942", "Rachel", "As per previous comments  issues with cleanliness and lack of crockery/towels upon arrival. Able to contact owner and he provided new towels  coffee cups  dishrack  tea towels etc the first morning and provided a small refund which was appreciated.  Main bed is soft but comfortable.  Very convenient location  mostly walked to nearby places or into town.  Easy to get to/from airport."),
("2017-11-19", "20906942", "Aleisha", "Great location. Very clean and nice layout. Quick communication with host."),
("2017-11-22", "20906942", "Simon", "Nice appartment and good localisation to visit Sydney.Good adress to stay."),
("2017-11-26", "20906942", "Kimberley", "Studio apartment  about a 10-15 minute walk down to darling harbour  which was perfect for us attending a conference at the convention centre. Easy checkin. Good apartment all round. Would stay again!"),
("2017-11-28", "20906942", "April", "Excellent location in a quiet leafy suburb. Within walking distance to many good eateries and shops. Great place for exploring Sydney."),
("2017-11-29", "20906942", "Nicholas", "Great stay! Clean"),
("2017-12-09", "20906942", "Paut", "Keurig en praktisch appartement in rustige straat. Heel dichtbij de technische universiteit  openbaar vervoer en op loopafstand van alle belangrijke attracties van Sydney. Perfecte WiFi."),
("2017-12-22", "20906942", "Minghui", "位置在中国城后面街区 去中国城很方便 还有小露台可以喝喝茶"),
("2017-12-27", "20906942", "Setio", "If you do not mind with place that needs more than 1km to station  it is a very good place to stay. Very cozy and convinience to stay."),
("2017-12-29", "20906942", "Josh", "Perfect location and friendly neighbours. Would definitely stay again and recommend!!"),
("2018-01-03", "20906942", "Milly", "Great  comfy little apartment very close to the action. Clean and new. We had a great stay."),
("2018-01-04", "20906942", "Colin", "What a great spot! Easy access and fantastic little apartment. Such an easy walk into China Town and darling harbour. Coming from Sydney ourselves we have stayed in lots of places and this little part of town was great for us and our kids. You do need to sort out parking but small price to pay. Our host was a champion and place was clean and well set up. Will be back."),
("2018-01-11", "20906942", "Heather", "Nice apartment  super clean  great location."),
("2018-01-16", "20906942", "Gabriél", "Amazing location and great host communication  the apartment looks exactly as advertised."),
("2018-01-30", "20906942", "Liz", "Great location and spacious studio apartment. Perfect for two but could easily accommodate two couples with the fold out sofa. Everything you need to be a good base for Sydney:)"),
("2018-02-02", "20906942", "Ada", "Neat and open studio space with lots of storage units. The bed was super comfy. The walls are very thin though so you can hear noises from next door  however the neighbourhood itself is very peaceful. The bathroom is nicely renovated and clean but there were mosquitoes hanging around possibly because the front window was left open before we arrived. Would not recommend cooking as the kitchen is very small. The fish market is also a walkable distance away. Overall great spot :)"),
("2018-02-05", "20906942", "Vithuran", "Amazing location"),
("2018-02-09", "20906942", "Nelson", "Place exactly as described. Very spacious and clean. We had a very enjoyable time."),
("2018-02-10", "20906942", "Jason", "很好的主人 不错的体验｡"),
("2018-02-14", "20906942", "Yibei", "I love the place! It's warm and at grate location! The place feel like home:)"),
("2018-02-24", "20906942", "Susanto", "I love the location  very closed to next bus stop( just 15 minute walk- turn right and turn left) walk to broadway street. Near spicy alley and shopping mall.China town is just 15-20 minute walk. Great location and room as described.1 thing is minus just the master bad. To soft for me  but i really love the Room design.I will stay here again next Time."),
("2018-02-24", "20906942", "Leanne", "Quiet  comfortable apartment and easy to find."),
("2018-03-03", "20906942", "晓珊", "这是一个十分友善贴心的房东 对住户需求响应十分迅速 住宿体验很棒"),
("2018-03-03", "20906942", "Rachel", "Central location. Great communication from host before my trip made checkin a breeze. It’s a nice apartment  but had trouble locking the door which easily jammed  so at times didn’t feel as secure."),
("2018-03-08", "20906942", "Bamba", "最寄り駅からは10~15分と程よい距離ですが､大きいｽｰﾂｹｰｽを持って移動していくのは少し大変だと感じました｡お家自体は路地を入ったところにあるので車も殆ど通らず静かな環境でとても落ち着けました｡綺麗に掃除もされており特に不自由さは感じませんでした｡"),
("2018-03-10", "20906942", "Estelle", "Fantastic  stylish and spacious apartment in a great location!"),
("2018-03-13", "20906942", "Raj", "Great apartment in an ideal location with easy access to the CBD."),
("2018-03-14", "20906942", "Kary", "房东人很nice 反映迅速 房子地理位置超级好 离市中心非常近 走路就能到｡周围有著名的科技大学 悉尼大学 环境优美 随处可见大学生｡唐人街走路过去没几分钟就到了 能轻松选择好吃的的中国餐｡住在这里性价比很高!下次还会考虑你家!谢谢让我和朋友在悉尼度过愉快的两天一晚!"),
("2018-03-18", "20906942", "Rebekah", "This is in a great location  being walking distance to Broadway Shopping Centre and the ICC.  The space is one room with a bedroom cupboard as a divider which I didn't realise at first.  The only major downside for our stay was there wasn't a microwave.  Otherwise it's a lovely  fresh & clean place to stay."),
("2018-03-23", "20906942", "Gu", "Nice studio  close to anything you need!"),
("2018-03-25", "20906942", "Ken", "Listing and photos accurate. Clean."),
("2018-03-26", "20906942", "Emma", "Xin is a great host!"),
("2018-04-08", "20906942", "Fanfan", "Thanks for having us Xinhue however I wasn’t really pleased with the stay. There is only 1 bed and a fold out couch that is claimed to be a bed but really isn’t. There’s bugs in the shower and a hotel is cheaper. Wish I had a better experience but I didn’t.. The place is smaller than expected too... Thanks for preparing the rooms though."),
("2018-04-14", "20906942", "Pauline", "Great location and base to explore the city  near the central station  short walk to Darling Harbour.The flat is as you can see on the pictures  nice  modern and spacious. The kitchen is relatevely well equipped for some small cooking or breakfast. There are also really good place for coffee and breakfast right around the corner. The host is really reactive and nice  indications to find and access the appartment were clear and easy. Check-in was smooth. Only the cleanliness was not up to my preference."),
("2018-04-17", "20906942", "Shania", "Amazing apartment and close to everything. 15 min walk to Darling harbour and 20 mins to the local Ferry. Great location."),
("2018-05-03", "20906942", "Helen", "Veldig fin leilighet med meget god beliggenhet. Mange utesteder og butikker i nærheten."),
("2018-05-07", "20906942", "Nick", "Modest home in a great location."),
("2018-05-25", "20906942", "Jessica", "Great location and place! Perfect size  everything you need. Easy check-in and great communication "),
("2018-05-30", "20906942", "Felicia", "A bright and airy space  private entrance  and amazing location - right near UTS  minutes to the city  and around the corner from many great eateries along Broadway. I would definitely be back to stay here again!"),
("2018-06-07", "20906942", "Julie", "This place is in a good location! Beside the quite street  things are clean and the host is very helpful!"),
("2018-06-19", "20906942", "Vandy", "perfect house  good location  nice and warm reply with reasonable price  Xinhui is a good host with a wonderful accommodation. Recommend to everybody."),
("2018-07-01", "20906942", "Yisha", "Very clean and quiet. Good place to stay!"),
("2018-07-06", "20906942", "Rachel", "Very good space to stay in. Lots of room and super clean too! Quick replies from host :)"),
("2018-07-10", "20906942", "Anuj", "It was wonderful stay."),
("2018-07-13", "20906942", "Felipe", "Hermoso dto y genial la ubicacion. Volveriamos sin dudarlo. Muy recomendado !!"),
("2018-07-14", "20906942", "Christopher", "Great place would highly recommend"),
("2018-07-17", "20906942", "Zhiqi", "great experience"),
("2018-12-05", "20906942", "Vil", "As described. Default check out time is too early at 10am  but got the feeling it would have been extended if I had asked. Normally airbnb is at midday."),
("2018-12-14", "20906942", "Yang", "This place is near the China Town and Sydney Uni. Just no train station in this area. The house is clean and lovely."),
("2018-12-29", "20906942", "Rosanne", "No reply when I asked how to use the oven."),
("2019-01-08", "20906942", "Stefan", "."),
("2019-02-13", "20906942", "Kent", "great space in a great location."),
("2019-02-17", "20906942", "Sara", "Good value for money - location was an excellent base for exploring Sydney  being so close to Central Station. Fitted out with all the basics - kitchen had cooking utensils  but the microwave/oven is a bit confusing and we couldn't find any instructions. The sofa-bed was more comfortable than the mattress and there was plenty of space in the studio apartment."),
("2019-02-20", "20906942", "James", "Location was great as it was near city and chinatown. However  the floor was not very clean but overall a value for money stay."),
("2019-02-27", "20906942", "Junqu", "好房子 好位置 交通便利 下次还会选择预订"),
("2019-03-02", "20906942", "Jordan", "Would book again!"),
("2017-11-01", "21063718", "Kel", "Very modern  one year old  two story house. Tota and family are great hosts always attentive and helpful to our needs. Room with private bathroom was fantastic. Very neat clean  tidy and very spacious with lots of room and great open planning. Recommended as a very good airbnb house and hosts."),
("2017-11-10", "21063718", "Tim", "It was a really nice time there"),
("2017-11-13", "21063718", "Matteo", "My stay at Tota's house was Amazing! She is a really kind host with a beautiful family. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-11-17", "21063718", "Denise", "Nice clean place to stay. Tota always tried to help us and her children are also extremely friendly and helpful."),
("2017-12-31", "21063718", "宗燁", "Very helpful and thoughtful."),
("2018-01-04", "21063718", "Candy", "It was great to stay with Tota’s family. Definitely will come back again"),
("2018-01-12", "21063718", "Candy", "Always feel home when I stay with Tota’s family"),
("2018-01-19", "21063718", "Candy", "Always feel home when I stay with Tota’s family"),
("2018-05-27", "21063718", "Qing", "A nice family  easy to communicate"),
("2018-05-28", "21063718", "Joelaine", "Tota went out of her way to make me and my family feel comfortable in her home.She made sure we got everything we needed.The house is spacious and in a quiete neighborhood."),
("2018-06-14", "21063718", "Hanane", "I enjoyed my stay Tota is friendly and helpful  the House is very clean as well"),
("2018-07-07", "21063718", "Elodie", "Good to have your own bathroom and balcony. Big room. Good."),
("2017-10-02", "20962081", "Arok", "Great place  we will definitely stay there again."),
("2017-10-07", "20962081", "Jolene", "Super clean  great location  lots of extras provided. Our host was really quick to respond to our questions. We would definitely stay here again."),
("2017-10-17", "20962081", "Sushma", "very good location  all the required facilities was nearby  it was like an another home to us. Darling harbour  was at walking distance. we recommend the best place to stay"),
("2017-10-20", "20962081", "Leteisha", "Great location close to public transport and an easy walk into central Sydney. Enjoyed the stay  the place had all the amenities for a comfortable stay with the family."),
("2017-10-22", "20962081", "Shane", "Lovely central location with a nice open plan feel and two shower rooms"),
("2017-10-31", "20962081", "Dipam", "Great stay at a great location"),
("2017-11-02", "20962081", "Margaret", "A neat and clean place in a great location"),
("2017-11-11", "20962081", "Judy", "Although in a very busy location this apartment is very quiet ... very clean and hosted by an owner who communicates promptly. As there were three of us we appreciated two bedrooms with individual ensuites."),
("2017-11-15", "20962081", "Michelle", "Good location"),
("2017-11-16", "20962081", "Summer", "Min was a very accommodating host. We were in Sydney for an appointment that ran longer than expected so our check in changed a few times and Min was very understanding. Any questions I had were answered quickly and the units location is very convenient. It is a 10 minute walk from Central station  across the road from World Square (restaurants  cafes and Coles)  5 minutes to Museum Station and China town is very close too. The unit was clean  having two bathrooms was very convenient  the massage chair is wonderful and there is a nice view from the balcony. The only suggestion I would have is some more pillows on the bed  but this is a personal preference. I would definitely look to stay here again while in Sydney."),
("2017-11-20", "20962081", "Olly", "All went to plan ☺️"),
("2017-11-25", "20962081", "Feny", "Great place in a great location. Messaging chair is definitely a big plus  especially after long walk in the city "),
("2017-12-05", "20962081", "Caroline", "Min’s place is very central  clean and great valueThanks Min"),
("2017-12-09", "20962081", "Watit", "There’s many facilities especially messaging chair which is the best relaxing thing after travelling."),
("2017-12-18", "20962081", "Flore", "It was a great place. We were so happy to rest there after our Road trip.It was very calm and we enjoyed the swimming pool every morning with our one year’s baby. A coat was also available.Thank you very much!"),
("2017-12-21", "20962081", "Pierre", "Really cool place ! Everything was clean  the two bedrooms + 2 bathrooms was perfect for the 4 of us. She was reactive  fast to respond to our demands like to arrive early and leave later. I higly recommand !"),
("2017-12-25", "20962081", "晨", "Great place for travel in Sydney~"),
("2017-12-27", "20962081", "Jiahui", "Good location at Sydney CBD  very close to the China town and Darling habor."),
("2017-12-28", "20962081", "Dina", "The massage chair is one of sydney's hidden gems. We had a great time at Min's apartment - Great location  easy access to transport  food  and attractions. Would definitely recommend for your next stay!"),
("2018-01-03", "20962081", "Maggie", "Everything you would need  central location.  I agree that the massage chair is a really nice bonus  we got plenty of use out of it.  Min was very responsive to our needs  thank you Min!"),
("2018-01-05", "20962081", "Hannah", "Great location  comfortable and clean. Min was very helpful and quick to respond to any requests. Thanks so much Min."),
("2018-01-06", "20962081", "Peter", "Great little apartment in an amazing location. Just across the street from World Square  close to Central Station  and only a short walk into the heart of the city. The apartment was clean  quiet  and included an awesome massage chair. Also the pool was a nice treat. Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-01-07", "20962081", "Emma", "Great clean stylish place with city views. Very central location for someone visiting Sydney city!"),
("2018-01-14", "20962081", "Jemma", "Min’s place is so close to everything and we were able to easily walk everywhere. The train is also close by for those who don’t like walking as much as me! The rooms were lovely and air conditioned and the kitchen fully functional. We loved the addition of the massage chair! Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-01-17", "20962081", "Xiaoying", "quite good!"),
("2018-01-19", "20962081", "Marcelo", "La vista desde el balcon es espectacular. Muy buena ubicacion"),
("2018-01-22", "20962081", "James", "A fantastic stay. Min's place was perfect."),
("2018-01-30", "20962081", "Alex", "The apartment is very stylish and clean. Though there 's a tiny problem that a room is in lack of conditioning since we are staying in summer of Sydney. All is all  a nice place to stay and only minutes walk to china town which need not worry to find good food to eat."),
("2018-01-31", "20962081", "Ryan", "Great clean apartment in a prime location in the heart of Sydney. Thanks for having us Min."),
("2018-02-03", "20962081", "Shu Hua", "Location is great  very close to restaurants and shop  walking distance to everything  after a long day of walking the massage chair is a plus. Only down side is the bathrooms  the shower is more of mist water instead of actual normal water running  preventing a good shower after a long day."),
("2018-02-07", "20962081", "Derek", "位置非常好 很方便 楼下就是world square和coles 吃饭购物都很多选择"),
("2018-02-08", "20962081", "Rossen", "We stayed for a night at Min’s place. Great location  nice and clean. We would happily stay again. Thanks."),
("2018-02-08", "20962081", "芳", "The host canceled this reservation 12 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-02-13", "20962081", "Kisung", "Just perfect!  Facilities were all well working and location was great. You can walk to many tourist spot."),
("2018-02-18", "20962081", "肖霞", "地理位置绝对优势 达令港 唐人街 维多利亚女王大厦等 玩 购基本步行解决 附近超市 商场很多｡主人家很热情 友好｡一发现厨房没有汤锅 不方便煮面 跟主人反应后 主人马上送过来｡住宿地方干净 整洁 客厅沙发够大 可以铺成双人床 最爱的是按摩椅 每天玩累了回来都要按一下｡完美的住宿 期待下次有机会还能入住"),
("2018-02-19", "20962081", "Daniel", "Great apartment you can choose when you visit in Sydney."),
("2018-02-27", "20962081", "My Tien", "Min’s place was a great spacious apartment for the 5 of us that stayed there. It’s right in the middle of the city area and close to so many restaurants and shops. She was lovely to communicate with and we had a great time. The massage chair was an extra bonus and we all loved it."),
("2018-02-28", "20962081", "Luke", "Great space in a fun lively location in Sydney  amazing view of the city  and very clean!"),
("2018-03-03", "20962081", "Cathy", "Enjoy to stay Min's house"),
("2018-03-07", "20962081", "Feng", "Min很好 房子地角很好 很便利"),
("2018-03-15", "20962081", "Helen", "apartment was fantastic and location was perfect for our stay as it was close to the city  restaurants and public transport  host was great to deal with. very quick responses to queries. Definitely recommend staying here."),
("2018-03-17", "20962081", "Paul", "The massage chair is fantastic and the location couldn't be better.  As I said the only thing I would change would be the towels."),
("2018-03-24", "20962081", "Paul", "This place is clean  is in a great location and has plenty of night life and good eats downstairs.  Also within reach of everything by walking  including a luggage storage place across the road. Min was a great host  very responsive and helpful with advice and let us check in early."),
("2018-03-28", "20962081", "Martin", "Great place to stay - close to the heart of Sydney.  We didn't get to meet Min  but the place was clean  well organised and was everything we needed.  Should point out that the entry system is a fully electronic from the front door  through the elevator to the apartment door  - no need to walk past an inquisitive receptionist  etc."),
("2018-04-06", "20962081", "Sarah", "Die Wohnung ist sehr zentral gelegen mit einer wunderbaren Aussicht zwischen vielen Hochhäusern  was am Abend einfach gigantisch aussieht. Man geht ca. 20 Minuten zu Fuss bis zum Opera House  hat aber innerhalb von 4 Gehminuten Zugang zu 2 verschiedenen Train-Stations  welche in 2 Stops beim Circular Quay sind. Das Apartment ist sehr gross  man hat zwei Badezimmer und zwei Schlafzimmer  ein grosses Wohnzimmer und eine grosse Küche. Ich hätte mehrere Wochen dort verbringen können  habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt und empfehle diese Unterkunft absolut weiter."),
("2018-04-08", "20962081", "Bec", "Min's place is lovely and in an excellent location - very convenient. It was a perfectly sized place for my sister  my neice and I. Beds and couch were comfy and the inclusion of some toiletries in the bathroom was much appreciated.The key did not work upon check-in  however Min was able to come over and arrange for entry and it worked fine the next day.We would stay here again.Tip: you can park across the road in the World Square carpark for pretty reasonable (inner city) rates."),
("2018-04-13", "20962081", "Nancy", "Good location and very roomy apartment"),
("2018-04-18", "20962081", "Jawhar", "It couldn't be better located. Bars  restaurant  shops surround the place. And 20 min walking distance from Opera House. It's very convenient. I had an amazing stay !!!"),
("2018-04-22", "20962081", "Peter", "Great location  walkable to CBD and Darling Harbour. Nice pubs and restaurants nearby. Balcony was a hit also  get a real big city feel."),
("2018-04-27", "20962081", "Keziah", "Easy comfortable and convenient stay. Highly recommend"),
("2018-04-29", "20962081", "Dean", "Great location  great host"),
("2018-05-06", "20962081", "Peter", "Excellent location and communication by Min. Great value for money"),
("2018-05-24", "20962081", "Dj", "She’s a great host! Thank you!"),
("2018-05-30", "20962081", "Alven", "The best Experience ever! My family all fall in love with quilts and sheets. Massage chair is the solution for tired body. And location is near everything!!!  1st recommend accommodation for holiday or business trip in Sydney."),
("2018-06-04", "20962081", "Dao", "Great location"),
("2018-06-28", "20962081", "Billie", "公寓很干净 地理位置也很好 有按摩椅非常好!下次还会考虑入住｡"),
("2018-07-03", "20962081", "Mary", "Great location."),
("2018-07-04", "20962081", "Jorja", "Lovely apartment that was clean and tidy. Min was very quick to answer questions. Overall a very pleasant experience."),
("2018-07-06", "20962081", "Joe", "A fantastic place to explore Sydney from with a really helpful host."),
("2018-07-18", "20962081", "Jose", "Amazing location  modern and wide appartment  close to everything you need for a quick trip in Sydney. Great hosts! "),
("2018-08-08", "20962081", "君", "非常感谢min提供的这套住房 安全整洁出乎我们的意料 市中心地理位置 出行超方便 客厅内有煤卫 可以自已做饭 还有洗衣和烘干机设备｡厅内按摩椅是额外的惊喜 回来累了可以享受一下按摩服务｡主人想得很周到 咖啡红茶都俱备 非常感谢 有机会还会入住｡"),
("2018-08-14", "20962081", "Felix", "Good location. +1 for massage chair. Showerhead can be better"),
("2018-08-15", "20962081", "Hyung Jun", "We are 4 persons.It is comfortable to stay.Location is very good."),
("2018-08-18", "20962081", "Maggie", "Super location and love the massage chair"),
("2018-09-10", "20962081", "Jose", "It is our second time at this airbnb  great experience again. Min is a great host!"),
("2018-09-15", "20962081", "Matthew", "Barring one issue  this was a nice place to stay and very convenient. That one issue was that there was a sign by the elevator that greeted when we arrived  CLEARLY stating that airbnb was illegal in the building and we could be evicted. If you don't care about that kind of thing  this is a great place to stay. As for me  I found it very stressful."),
("2018-09-29", "20962081", "Jing", "very nice location"),
("2018-10-01", "20962081", "Julian", "Great stay and fantastic communication. Perfect location close to everything you need"),
("2018-10-04", "20962081", "Jenny", "非常好的房源 地段很好 去达令港步行十几分钟就到了 离海德公园和澳洲博物馆还有圣玛丽教堂都很近 机场过来不到二十分钟｡旁边有一个超大的Coles超市 也有亚洲超市 方便买菜做饭｡按摩椅很棒 超级舒服｡房东人很好 回复很及时｡"),
("2018-10-06", "20962081", "Lillian", "First time try Airbnb  really enjoyed. Min's apartment has everything we need and the location is so convenience. Min has been very helpful. Highly recommended."),
("2018-10-13", "20962081", "Claire", "Great central location! Clean."),
("2018-10-18", "20962081", "David", "Very good stay"),
("2018-10-20", "20962081", "Jason", "Good apartment and location but the building has a no airbnb policy so there is a chance of being kicked out if caught which is unsettling"),
("2018-10-28", "20962081", "Adeline", "Strategic location and fast response host"),
("2018-11-01", "20962081", "Catherine", "Great location  right across World Square with Coles Supermarket at the basement. Close walking distance to Darling Harbour  Sydney Tower Eye  Hyde Park and BigBus station. There was 1 night where both lifts are out of service  couldn't get down for dinner  luckily we have some food in the apartment which was meant for next day breakfast. Overall  we enjoyed the stay  massage chair is plus point at the end of the day after more than 15 000 walking steps."),
("2018-11-05", "20962081", "Debbie", "Location is great and the massage chair was a bonus. But the second bedroom is very very small and the shower door in the en-suite does not shut properly and water goes everywhere. Min’s communication was fine and it was easy to gain access.There also seemed to be some question about the “legality” of an Air BnB in that complex."),
("2018-11-11", "20962081", "Thu", "The apartment had an outstanding location. It is very closed to World Square with shops and Coles supermarket. It is closed to train stations as well (Town Hall station and Museum station). The house is very clean when we checked in. It has everything that we need. The host is very careful  actively contacted me for the check in  check out  and when I asked. Very quick response. My family love the massage chair. It works well. Just 1 small thing is about the bathrooms. The glass doors cannot be shut properly so water comes out to the floor while showering."),
("2018-11-20", "20962081", "Jacinta", "Prime location. Easy access from airport  with 5 to 10 mins walk from Capitol Square light rail.Convenient to go to everywhere with plenty of eateries around."),
("2018-11-27", "20962081", "Chrina", "很好的位置 離各景點都可步行到達 邊上就有coles超市 離百貨公司也很近"),
("2018-11-28", "20962081", "Dragan", "Nice and clean place centrally located in Sydney!"),
("2018-12-02", "20962081", "Jan", "Very good location"),
("2018-12-05", "20962081", "Paul", "Excellent location  very quiet well maintained space. Appreciated the clear instructions and responses were quick and to the point! Thanks  Min!"),
("2018-12-10", "20962081", "Jenny", "沙发有些脏"),
("2018-12-16", "20962081", "国娟", "have a dark room  means ones bedroom without window"),
("2019-01-02", "20962081", "Sandra", "It’s a lovely place at the heart of Sydney’s CBD!"),
("2019-01-07", "20962081", "Joanna", "Hi Min  Once again thank you so much for your great service and hospitality. It was the perfect space for the kids and I to chill out and relax after a day seeing the sights of Sydney.Very well located  we walked everywhere  Sydney Aquarium  Circular Quay to see Luna Park  Meyer  Darling Quarter and  Event Cinemas. I will highly recommend staying here to friends and family.Joanna"),
("2019-01-09", "20962081", "Yudhi", "The apartment is in great location  restaurants and shops only 5 minutes walk. Host is very kind and quick response."),
("2019-01-17", "20962081", "Laura", "Great location  Haymarket is right in the city. Nice clean apartment."),
("2019-01-22", "20962081", "Lina", "The location is very good. The Coles is very near the apartment  so you can buy anything in it. You can go to every scenic spot in 25 minutes via walking. The host is very helpful. But the shower head are not so good."),
("2019-02-06", "20962081", "Dong", "房子地理位置很好 附近生活相当便利｡房间内设施也十分齐全 而且有两个卫生间 对于一家五口出行的很方便｡"),
("2019-02-09", "20962081", "Lienyala", "交通便利"),
("2019-02-16", "20962081", "佩", "其实悉尼不大 公务靠近华人区 楼下不远就有很多奶茶店和中国餐厅 大多可以支付宝 步行到皮特街买买买到歌剧院都是十几分钟的路程"),
("2017-10-07", "21127680", "Bruce", "Nice place nice host"),
("2017-10-12", "21127680", "Lavina", "Coffee's place is close to the city and great location with restaurants and shops around. Walking distance to the main tourist points. Highly recommended."),
("2017-10-13", "21127680", "Junha", "it is in the downtown. it is clean and good"),
("2017-10-15", "21127680", "Shauna", "Location. Size of unit could certainly be good for families too. Building facilities."),
("2017-10-22", "21127680", "Lay Hoon", "Good location... Clean.."),
("2017-10-27", "21127680", "Gayatri", "The location was amazing and Coffee was very welcoming  but the food stench in the entire place was awful. Otherwise  I'd totally recommend this place!"),
("2017-11-10", "21127680", "Ryan", "The unit is in a good location near Central Station as well as museum.  We walked down to Circular Quay a couple of days  but it is a long walk.  Close to Chinatown.  Overall we were pleased with the location.  The unit itself is nice and clean.  There was laundry in unit which we took advantage of since we are traveling for 5 weeks.  Bed was okay  but pillows were not great.  Kitchen had everything we needed  and there is a store just downstairs where you an get supplies.  Overall I would recommend and we would stay here again."),
("2017-11-13", "21127680", "Steven", "Good location and close to China Town."),
("2017-11-16", "21127680", "Marcus", "Great location."),
("2017-11-22", "21127680", "Jucara", "Coffee e uma anfitriã maravilhosa sempre pronta a ajudar"),
("2017-11-26", "21127680", "Alexis", "Nice & clean place."),
("2017-12-17", "21127680", "Alex", "Coffee’s place was great  close to public transit and the fun part of the CBD. It was spacious  clean and convenient. Do note if you are only a party of two and expect to use the sofa bed as a second bed  it will be locked unless you pay a fee."),
("2018-01-05", "21127680", "Kaja", "A very nice place and helpful host."),
("2018-01-09", "21127680", "Minha", "We had some miscommunication between my partner and the host  so my partner didnt really like when checking in. Also  we both really like to take a bath but bathtub was so dirty that we didnt even touch. Except for that everything was fine."),
("2018-01-24", "21127680", "Shuang", "the location of the apartment is really convenient! Next to the central station. really nice to stay 8 days here! !"),
("2018-01-31", "21127680", "Ashley", "Coffee was extremely helpful and responsive. Her place was very clean and centrally located. Would definitely recommend :)"),
("2018-02-07", "21127680", "Jianhong", "房东回复及时 有问必答｡房子靠近中央火车站和唐人街 周围有很多吃的地方｡走路五分钟可以到达海德公园和教堂｡植物园步行大概要25分钟左右｡房子干净 自助入住和退房｡非常推荐 适合一家三口入住｡"),
("2018-02-21", "21127680", "JasonCool", "Nice location with good price.Easy to go everywhere ."),
("2018-02-24", "21127680", "Sonal", "Great host with a great apartment in the heart of CBD. Thank you once again for hosting us"),
("2018-02-27", "21127680", "Avinash", "Make sure you are provided with the full address including the signage at the entrance of the building. Make sure you are inducted about door entry to the building and the apartment. Make sure you are clearly informed of the floor the apartment is on as the apartment number does not have any relation to the floor number!If you intend to cook in the kitchen then do request the inventory of the cooking pans & pots  crockery (including glasses) and cutlery. Do check if there is and cleaning pads and washing up liquid in the kitchen. Do all these before booking the apartment.Finally  compare the rate of the apartment with a 4 star hotel near by."),
("2018-03-05", "21127680", "Jason", "The apartment is in a good area with lots of good Thai and Chinese restaurants and about a 10 minute walk to the Central Station. The flat is rather basic and a bit dated and could use a bit of renovations and a deep cleaning. The kitchen amenities are sparse and not really adequate for a long term stay. The bed was comfortable  but the sofa was not. We were there for only 5 days which was OK. It is pretty much as advertised  but nothing really special. It was reasonably priced for what it was. Thanks Coffee"),
("2018-03-11", "21127680", "Anyu", "Great place. Nice and cozy."),
("2018-03-30", "21127680", "Mena", "Thank you to Coffee for allowing us to stay in your apartment for 2 weeks. The apartment itself was very centrally located with easy access to the trains and was all we expected. Would definitely recommend."),
("2018-04-01", "21127680", "Chanvichet", "Great place to stay  close to everywhere. I would recommend this place for anyone who love you enjoy their new experience at Sydney"),
("2018-04-05", "21127680", "Juliette", "Great place to stay in central Sydney. Loved our stay!"),
("2018-04-09", "21127680", "Weibin", "周围非常便利. 正如房东所说的一模一样.! 附近有很多吃的. 不怕饿到. 打车都很方便! 很推荐"),
("2018-04-11", "21127680", "Yufeng", "Very friendly host  great location. affordable price. Highly recommended!!!"),
("2018-05-10", "21127680", "Guilherme", "Pontos positivos:Localização excelente no centro  perto de parada de ônibus e de metrô  mercado grande  restaurantes  bares  no centro de Sydney. Apartamento grande de um quarto  e tudo novo  com varanda. Muito bem equipado (forno  fogão  geladeira  máquina de lavar roupa  máquina de secar  chaleira  torradeira  micro-ondas  mesa na sala com cadeiras  dois sofás  TV  cama muito confortável no quarto  ótimo chuveiro). Comodidades interessantes (shampoo  condicionador  sabonete líquido de banho  papéis higiênicos  detergente  secador  etc). Coffee é muito prestativo  responde no chat do airbnb muito rapidamente sempre. Check in e check out ocorreram perfeitamente. Pontos a melhorar:Aquecedor não estava funcionando durante a minha estadia. Tampa da banheira era pequena e não segurava a água  portanto não conseguimos utilizar ela. Sofá cama para a terceira pessoa é desconfortável  o colchão é bem fino (uns 5cm de altura)  fica a sugestão de  futuramente  trocar por um sofá cama mais confortável."),
("2018-05-13", "21127680", "Xiaojing", "非常适合家庭旅游"),
("2018-05-21", "21127680", "Tia", "Great location"),
("2018-05-26", "21127680", "Andy", "Coffees place is in a great location.the apartment is very secure and comfortable.coffee was very quick to respond to any questions"),
("2018-06-17", "21127680", "Sarah", "This is a well located apartment very close to good food and public transport. Good and speedy communication from the host"),
("2018-07-11", "21127680", "ShuMin", "Coffee’s apartment is conveniently located in the CBD  with close access (5-10min walk) to 2 train stations  supermarkets and endless choices of eateries. The apartment is (very) spacious and has everything that we need (washing machine  dryer  pots and pans  utensils  etc). The central heating in the apartment appeared to have broken down and Coffee rushed over to help us with it and brought us new extra blankets. She even called us in the middle of our stay just to make sure we were ok—absolute superhost! We’d give her 50 stars if we could!! Thank you so much for hosting us  Coffee! We’d definitely stay again at your place! Just a note for travellers coming in from Sydney airport: we got cheated by the taxi driver and paid $160 for our ride to the apartment when it should be just around $50. Please check the cost with the taxi driver before getting onto the taxi!"),
("2018-07-13", "21127680", "梦冉", "Good!"),
("2018-07-15", "21127680", "Aiko", "It was nice stay. If Aircon/ heater did work well  it would be much better."),
("2018-07-25", "21127680", "Tristan", "Great spot in the city. Functional  everything you need for short stay. Good communication."),
("2018-07-30", "21127680", "Aidan", "great place for a family visiting with great location. would definately book agan !"),
("2018-08-03", "21127680", "Tristan", "Coffee’s place is in a great location  and good value. Excellent communication."),
("2018-08-05", "21127680", "Carolyn", "Coffee's place is extremely clean and looks just like the photos! She is an amazing host that communicates quickly and efficiently. The check-in process was very simple and quick. Her apartment is in an ideal spot within the CBD and i highly recommend staying at her place for short/ long stays!"),
("2018-08-20", "21127680", "政伟", "挺好的周边环境 距离火车站非常近 购wu物游玩非常方便!"),
("2018-09-11", "21127680", "윤국", "시티중심에서 위치해서 이동이 편리했습니다."),
("2018-09-17", "21127680", "Andy", "very good location and apartment   would definitely come again . Coffee was very easy and flexible to communicate with   and would definitely recommend.thank you"),
("2018-09-21", "21127680", "Olivia", "Great location"),
("2018-09-22", "21127680", "Nick", "Nice place  really central to a lot of features  nicely styled inside."),
("2018-10-04", "21127680", "忠", "位置很好"),
("2018-10-13", "21127680", "Cancan", "房屋实际比图片上明亮漂亮!客厅的窗帘打开后 是一个大阳台 可以晾晒衣物 洗衣机､洗衣粉､烘干机一应俱全｡厨房用具也很齐全 燃气灶､微波炉都很好用｡房屋地段方便､配置舒适便捷 非常满意!"),
("2018-10-23", "21127680", "Mark", "Fabulous apartment in such a convenient part of the city. It’s a short walk to Central station and the city’s restaurants  bars and parks. Coffee is an excellent host and the apartment was so clean and comfortable. I hope to come back."),
("2018-10-27", "21127680", "Maged", "Excellent location. Close to everything I needed around CBD"),
("2018-11-06", "21127680", "Nick", "位置很好 无论是去海德公园 QVB 还是达令港 基本就1公里多一点的距离｡去唐人街 中央车站也很近｡房东也给了不少很实用的建议｡公寓足够大 设施比较齐全 只是没有看见电吹风｡"),
("2018-11-10", "21127680", "Gavin", "Great communication from the host  and surprisingly quiet given it's position in the city."),
("2018-11-18", "21127680", "Stephanie", "Lovely apartment. Everything was as described and very helpful  friendly host."),
("2018-11-20", "21127680", "Jimin", "사진과 크게 다르지 않고 위치는 완벽하게 좋았으나  숙소가 오래되어서 인지 악취가 많이 나서 향초를 한참 켜두었습니다. 냄새가 특히나 화장실과 세탁실 하수구에서 많이 났습니다. 주방욕품 역시 얼룩이 있고 청결하지 못해 주방을 사용 못하였습니다. 체크인 시에 방 호수 및 올라가는 방법에 대한 설명이 부족해서 로비에서 조금 기다렸습니다. 하지만  체크인 시간 전에 도착했음에도 불구하고 친절히 맞아주어서 오랜 비행의 피로를 풀 수 있었습니다. 감사합니다."),
("2018-11-22", "21127680", "Joshina", "great place. great location"),
("2018-11-30", "21127680", "MbErYeol_", "房源地点不错 就在中央火车站附近 去其他地方都很方便｡"),
("2018-12-02", "21127680", "Wing Yan", "Comfortable stay and good location"),
("2018-12-07", "21127680", "Dao", "Good location."),
("2018-12-07", "21127680", "Kai", "you can expect a clean apartment with nice small touches to make you feel at home."),
("2018-12-15", "21127680", "Ani", "Coffee’s space was nice and clean. It was nice to have a full living room  bedroom with a king bed  bathroom  kitchen and balcony. There is also air conditioning and an indoor pool in the building. Coffee was a very nice host and very accommodating and quick to respond. We felt very welcome. There is a washing machine and dryer in the apartment but during our stay the dryer wasn’t working  not the host’s fault. We didn’t mind but asked for extra towels and sheets since we wouldn’t be able to dry ours. She only brought extra towels. The only negatives were that we had to buy some of our own supplies that we thought would have been provided. There were only two rolls of toilet paper provided for our 8-night stay. We also bought our own paper towels  dish sponge  hand soap (bathroom and kitchen hand soaps were only half full)  trash bags  and salt and pepper for our food. Even though it didn’t cost much to buy these extra things  we felt they should have been provided for the price we paid.  Overall it was a good space and we enjoyed our stay."),
("2019-01-01", "21127680", "Fred", "Parfait pour la communication  la localisation de l’appartement et des loisirs offerts sur place. La piscine et la salle de sport sont des vrais atouts pour le séjour. A 3 minutes de « Central Station » idéal pour se rendre partout dans la ville. Apparemment au calme et Coffee toujours présent pour répondre à nos attentes. Ce séjour était tout simplement formidable. Très belle expérience."),
("2019-01-05", "21127680", "Wendy", "We had a great (Email hidden by Airbnb) munication was great and respond was always fast.The place is great and better than the pictures as they we’re taken in the evening.The location of the appartment is great"),
("2019-01-28", "21127680", "Angela", "An ideally located and comfortable apartment."),
("2019-02-24", "21127680", "Yelim", "외국인들 후기에 베리 클린  클린이라은 얘기가 많아서 깨끗한 줄 알았는데 아니에욥^*^ 생각보다 낡았고 못 쓸 정도는 아니었는데 와!!!깨끗!! 이정도는 아니었지만 뭐    쓸만하네    정도였어요위치는 뮤지엄역에서 5분  센트럴에서 5분 정도로 엄청 좋아요근처에 12시까지 하는 coles도 있어요가격 대비 가성비는 굳!전반적으로 만족하지만 화장실이 호텔급으로 깨끗했으면 하면 별로일 거 같아요"),
("2018-01-03", "21281467", "Wen", "The location is very nice. Every morning I can wake up by a very nice water-front view! All the furniture and facilities are luxury and perfect. We had a very nice New Year holiday in this house. Ben is a very nice guy  he help us a lot and gave us many trip advises in Sydney. There is a complimentary parking space  and if you wanna walk or take public transport  it's always very convenience. I think whether you are alone or with families  the apartment is always a best choice!"),
("2018-07-04", "21281467", "Tim", "Ben’s place is even better than in the photos  amazing views straight over bay and marina. Beds very comfy  lots of hot water and good heating. Apartment is homely with books and plenty of games for our kids. Ben was quick to respond and gave local tips for cafes and getting about. Had a wonderful stay."),
("2018-07-24", "21281467", "Mariette", "Nous avons séjourné une semaine chez Ben qui a pris soin de nous accueillir et de nous renseigner très chaleureusement. L’appartement est très agréable et la vue très belle  avec des facilités de stationnement. Je vous le recommande vivement."),
("2018-08-21", "21281467", "Claude", "We had a wonderful staying at Ben’s place.  It is such an awesome (Website hidden by Airbnb) two year old absolutely loves boats and imagine his excitement waking up to boats and ferries everyday!  It was such a treat for us to get into town using the ferry; we took the ferry to Barangaroo and Watson Bay for lunch and my son was over the moon.Ben was also great organising things we needed for our baby  like a cot and baby booster seat  and provided little touches like toys  hair dryer  candles  heater in the bathroom etc.  (winter when we were there). It was also great that he stocked up! We arrived so late and were so hungry the first night we were grateful there were lots to eat in the fridge and snacks too!The entertainment in this place is awesome  also large sofas great for entertaining if you have people over.  I love this location with options of cafes  restaurants  parks and the ferry close by.  We treated ourselves to Catalina on the last night and it was so romantic.  The only thing I wished for is a coffee machine for some good coffee. We slept fine through the night  but for light sleepers the slight traffic noise is not ideal.  All in all a great stay!"),
("2018-09-19", "21281467", "Elizabeth", "The host canceled this reservation 8 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-11-25", "21281467", "Ruth", "Absolutely wonderful apartment right on the water at Rose Bay  with a very thoughtful and welcoming host. We particularly loved having the park and small beach just across the road  there's also a cafe and restaurant right there too for added convenience! Ben is a wonderful host  very responsive and flexible with arrangements  he also took a lot of trouble to make the apartment comfortable for our son  with a cot and high chair. It's a fabulous space  would highly recommend it for a lovely place to stay in Sydney!"),
("2019-01-10", "21281467", "Jane", "We had an amazing time at Bens place! Great location and communication with Ben was on point. Would highly recommend this place and would definitely come back :)"),
("2019-01-14", "21281467", "Brent", "This is a great place with a wonderful view and within easy reach of a lot of interesting places and things to do.  I highly recommend Ben's place."),
("2019-03-01", "21281467", "Jade", "Ben's place is really cool.  Very high tech. TVs in every bedroom and living room. It's on the 3rd floor of an older building with a great front view to the bay which brings a nice breeze.  It's convenient located to bars  laundry and the ferry. The ferry journey to CBD is just amazing. A must do. It's very quiet to sleep even with the windows open. During the day though there is noise from the cars passing in the busy road."),
("2017-11-17", "21244482", "Guillaume", "Joseph is welcoming you and the apartment get a lovely terrace to have lovely moment !We enjoy the barbecue and have a very good rest."),
("2017-11-24", "21244482", "Jian", "Very value flat. Homeowner is very passionate! My dad was a very picky person on sleep and all the extra requests were soon fulfilled  we sleep well in there. Great location  just 5 minutes walk to the beach and public swimming pool. Coles  woolworth and bottle shop are nearby. Inside house sound insulation is not good  suitable for family living. Neighboring animals keep small animals and occasionally see chickens during the day. However  These animals are quiet at night. Housing fully functional. Front yard is particularly beautiful.很棒的房子!走路到沙滩和建在海边的公共游泳池只需要5分钟｡房东很热情 发短信要加枕头之类的一般立刻就能会｡小镇上的coles woolworth和bottle shop很近 开车要5分钟｡房屋内隔音不是很好 我是和父母一起住 所以没有很大影响｡前院很美 泡杯茶看看书挺不错的｡周围邻居会养一些小动物 白天偶尔会看到隔壁养的火鸡....晚上很安静 没有动物吵｡"),
("2017-12-06", "21244482", "Francois", "Joseph is a great host.I had a wonderful stay - 10/10.Great spot  superb location  super friendly courteous landlord.I was here in Sydney on work and it honestly felt like an amazing holiday.Will be back soon"),
("2017-12-20", "21244482", "Helen", "The Garden Flat is quite unique hidden away as it is in a wonderful jungle-like garden with many interesting features. There is a feeling of being away from the bustle of the town yet it is actually near the beach  ocean pool and the Strand.Joseph has made the flat very comfortable with some nice extra touches to welcome travellers on arrival. We loved tucking into the local fruit.It was so relaxing to sit eating breakfast on the deck while looking out at the garden and identifying the local bird life.We thoroughly recommend the Garden Flat for a delightful stay in Dee Why "),
("2017-12-25", "21244482", "Fede", "The hosts were very friendly at all times.They brought us a big box of toys so that our son can play with them.The place was very clean and close to the beach  just a 5 minutes walk. Parking was very easy. We hope to come back soon!"),
("2018-02-14", "21244482", "Kenedie", "A clean  quaint little place close to the beach!"),
("2018-02-18", "21244482", "Michael", "Nice space with an awesome under cover entertaining area for a small gathering. Nice and quite and the host was extremely responsive and attentive when needed. Thanks for the easy stay Joseph!"),
("2017-11-05", "21426586", "Tung", "I would definitely recommend this place for other travellers . Bella is very helpful and friendly. There is a bus stop right in front of the building and it only takes 10 mins to CBD. Plus  her apartment is super nice and clean."),
("2018-01-03", "21426586", "David", "Pros - great host  location  clean  quiet.Cons - Temp accommodation whilst FT occupant away hence their stuff present in storage drawers / cupboards. "),
("2017-12-18", "21451259", "Bridget", "Very nice and great location!!!"),
("2018-01-03", "21451259", "Joanne", "A stunning home in a lovely location  three minutes away from a bus stop taking you directly into the city of Sydney or to one of the many picturesque beaches under ten minutes away and Queens Park at the end of the street. There are also plenty of cafes in the area which do lovely breakfasts and coffees.It was an amazing place to take the family  we could not have felt more at home. "),
("2018-01-09", "21451259", "Leanne", "Ronda' house was our little home away from home.  The decor was beautiful and the apartment was spotless with everything there that we could possible need.  Ronda was great and went above and beyond leaving beach chairs and umbrella out for us.  The price for such a great location was fantastic for our family of 5.  We will be back."),
("2017-11-06", "21421463", "Sue", "The location was perfect for our needs and the apartment was quiet.  The check in did not go well as we weren't told which apartment it was and the key had to be collected from another location over 1km away which we didn't know either until we got there  and had sent the uber off.  The listing says there is a key safe but they didn't use it for us.  The host wasn't contactable either despite calling the 24 hr number a couple of times and leaving messages  so the whole process took about an hour and a half.  The apartment is tiny and is more of a bedsit rather than having a separate bedroom.  This also made me wonder about the very expensive $170 cleaning fee."),
("2017-11-14", "21421463", "Jenny", "Great apartment with walking distance to bus stops and cafes. The property is very safe with the access control system. Suitable for the girls. Nice and helpful staff."),
("2017-11-17", "21421463", "Danielle", "Very clean and well put together apartment. Would suit a longer stay. I was on a business trip so just needed a bed. The location is amazing.  Comfy bed. Lots of additional amenities to make your stay more comfortable."),
("2017-11-27", "21421463", "Melissa", "The apartment was super clean and had a lot of conveniences.  There is no view to speak of but we only slept there so that wasn't such a big deal. Quiet street. Great washer/dryer for use. Good amenities. Beware of the footboard on the bed- it sticks out beyond the mattress and loves to bite your shins. The biggest headache was the check in process; we arrived a bit late and had to check in at a hotel that was kind of far away - especially when dragging our luggage uphill most of the way late at night. Also  do NOT get on the elevator - in our jet lagged state we failed to notice the lettered-wing and got on the elevator only to get stuck for 10 minutes... especially concerning as the emergency button didn't seem to work. You'll be on the first floor; door was open and unlocked when we arrived but for the rest of the visit it was locked when arrived to add to security."),
("2017-12-08", "21421463", "Renee", "Great comfortable little apartment for a business trip.  Full size ironing board and good quality iron was nice.  Later check in meant I had to get the keys from another location which was easy enough  just a little annoying."),
("2017-12-19", "21421463", "Tristan", "I really enjoyed this unit. It was probably the most functional space anyone could have created for a studio. It has everything you need and more. A workplace  living area  kitchen  washer/dryer  balcony  nice bathroom  and plenty of storage space throughout. The only downside is the unit is not equipped with AC. Fortunately they provided two fans which were very helpful and needed. Everything else was perfect and the host did an excellent job communicating and assuring I had a great stay. The location of the unit is within the Darling Harbour area and only a ten-fifteen minute walk from the Central business district. Near a park and many businesses and restaurants. Would recommend it to a couple or single person."),
("2017-12-29", "21421463", "Lylyan", "Verything was perfect!"),
("2018-02-10", "21421463", "Tim", "Great location  great place."),
("2018-02-18", "21421463", "Neal", "The apartment is fantastic and the stay was one of the easiest experiences I had in terms of check-in/out and overall communications. The surrounding area is nice with the various piers and parks. The apartment was very clean  well decorated and spacious. Would highly recommend for future visitors to the area. Only feedback I can give is that I couldn’t work out access to the gym but that may have been my failure. Other than that  the stay was excellent and responses to any messages were very fast. Thanks!"),
("2018-03-06", "21421463", "Kevin", "Location is great. The place is well decked out and true to the advertisement. The sofa bed can use a firmer mattress but the main bed is comfortable .   Satisfied in general ."),
("2018-03-31", "21421463", "Gilberto", "The place was clean and equipped with everything  including extra soap and towels  and even a face scrub. Facilities are great  especially the swimming pool. The only downside is that checking in requires picking up the key at a nearby hotel  which took a few minutes"),
("2018-08-22", "21421463", "Damon", "Great  neat flat with everything you need in a beautiful pocket of Sydney."),
("2018-09-03", "21421463", "Kevin", "My parents  both in their seventies  stayed in the apartment for eleven nights.  They were very satisfied and found it to be very comfortable and well furnished.  They did suggest that it would have been helpful if the equipment  e.g. washing machine and coffee machine  had simple instructions on their use.  Also  there was very little cutlery - especially a shortage of spoons.They did appreciate the surrounding quiet environment."),
("2018-10-06", "21421463", "Giselle", "Clean  confortable place in an outstanding location."),
("2018-10-14", "21421463", "Sharna", "An absolute stunning apartment  so stylish and spacey  very modern and great location  everything was very easy with checking in and out l  host was very very helpful!!"),
("2018-11-08", "21421463", "Gerry", "This property has a decent-sized balcony with open or closed shutters and is a terrific space for a quiet sit or a nice breakfast.  The lounge is also decent-sized and has an awesome Smart TV.The bedroom is a ‘nook’ style  behind the full-sized kitchen - which has a large  clean and effective fridge.  So privacy has to be managed  but for a couple this is not an issue.The bathroom is new  modern  roomy and has a larger cnr shower.Everything was provided from toiletries  towels  milk  bikkies  even spare batteries for the remotes.This property is 1 min walk to Star Casino  3 mins to a full-sized Coles supermarket  5 mins to Darling Harbour and 15 mins the the city of Sydney.  This was all walking times  not driving.I rented a car from AVIS in the casino and they let me park it for free in the casino for 3 days as well.This is a super apartment for a couple or 2 individuals.  It is very quiet - like dead quiet  but the city noise is heard when the windows and balcony doors are open.  I love that noise  but you hear nothing when they are closed.The pool is large at 30m long  but it is on the opp side of the complex."),
("2018-11-11", "21421463", "Kate", "Great location and cute apartment. We really enjoyed our stay and would stay again."),
("2018-11-17", "21421463", "Michael", "Very nice appartment !"),
("2018-12-01", "21421463", "Maulik", "Perfect studio apartment in Pyrmont in Sydney. A short walk from the CBD and the fish market. Very clean and comfortable. One queen/full bed and one sofa bed that sleeps two."),
("2018-12-21", "21421463", "Holly", "perfect location for fantastic value!"),
("2019-01-01", "21421463", "Javier", "Do not book this apartment on summer season. Don’t make the same mistake I did: Note that there is NO AIR CONDITIONING and the apartment gets really warm; it is very hard to sleep. Communication with the host was impossible; still waiting for a “solution”."),
("2019-02-05", "21421463", "Hayley", "Thank you for such an amazing stay. We really enjoyed our time and it was everything we expected. Loved the apartment  and swimming pool was a plus. We only just realised a few days in that there was a bus stop right round the corner from us. This came in very handy. Close to the casino  close to shopping malls  close to a supermarket. Even had Netflix which made our time that much more enjoyable during our downtime. 20min walk to cbd and nearest train station. Only thing I could recommend is having a more powerful fan as we ended up sleeping with the sliding door open. I ended up getting bitten a few times. But other then that was an awesome stay. Thank you for being a lovely host."),
("2019-02-13", "21421463", "Jose Vicente", "Apartment was clean  well equipped and in a good location with bus stops nearby and a 8min walk to the pier."),
("2019-02-17", "21421463", "Angela", "Great location  perfect for the two of us and would defiantly stay there again"),
("2017-11-05", "21530399", "Lisa", "I really enjoyed the stay. Yasmin is very easy going  thoughtful and friendly. She prepared us some chocolate and wine as it was my boyfriends birthday.  The house is amazin with grate design. Walking distance to bus to the city. Our room is very comfy with ensuite and aircon. Definitely recommend!"),
("2017-11-09", "21530399", "Alexander", "The best airbnb accommodation  which I ever had. Not recommended though  because I want to save it for myself:-)"),
("2017-11-15", "21530399", "Richard", "Yasmin was highly responsive and a great host. Very stylish apartment and comfortable. Highly recommend!"),
("2017-11-24", "21530399", "Margaret", "Yasmin's place is great! It is convenient for transport anywhere around the centre of Sydney. The local shops and restaurants have a wonderful selection of great food. To top it all  Yasmin's home is beautiful  inviting and a great place to have as a base. Yasmin keeps everything sparkling and organised and provides you with useful tips for your trip."),
("2018-01-03", "21531457", "Nelly", "Absolutely loved our stay at Jan & Ella's place! Such a lovely house  a lot bigger then expected which was good because most places are a lot smaller and can start to feel really squishy and hot after a few days especially in summer. Location was great  short stroll to the train station  cafes & shops and super close to the city. Everything we needed (and more!) was provided to ensure we had the most comfortable stay. Thank you guys for all the helpful tips and great communication - such great hosts and I definitely recommend you to anyone!"),
("2018-03-18", "21531457", "Alison", "Such a great place to stay. Super stylish  spacious and in a great location. It was so easy to  get around by walking or public transport & Jan was so helpful with local tips. I wish we had more time to try them all. I would highly recommend Jan's place."),
("2018-06-17", "21531457", "Michael", "Jans place is well located near the rail station ( about 5 - 8 mins walk) and is a newly done up & well appointed residence."),
("2018-07-04", "21531457", "Prudence", "We loved our stay at Jan’s house. Its deseptively spacious and very confortable. The courtyard would be beautiful to use during the warmer months.I have sometimes found Sydney a bit overwhelming  but Erskinville is a calm pocket. Thank you again"),
("2018-07-09", "21531457", "Ella", "Really nice apartment  very clean and had everything we needed plus much more. The street is very quiet and theres alot to see and do nearby. A perfect stay!"),
("2018-07-10", "21531457", "Jochen", "Nice and clean  convenient terrace in Erskinville  thoughtful layout and finishes. Jan was very communicative and helpful."),
("2018-09-24", "21531457", "Brie", "Very lovely house  well presented  clean and comfortable   in a great area very close to the city. Brilliant place to stay."),
("2018-09-30", "21531457", "Jayde", "What a cute little house! Would definitely stay there again. Had everything we needed and the location was amazing."),
("2018-12-29", "21531457", "Kanokwan", "Loved our stay in this property was in an amazing location close to the airport and city. There was also street parking right out the front. Dealing with Jan has been very easy as she responds quickly  and she was also understanding of our needs (e g. checking in early as we arrived in Sydney early). Her place is kid- friendly. Thanks Jan."),
("2019-01-04", "21531457", "Christian", "A great spot to stay in Central Sydney. Ein großartiger Ausgangspunkt  um aus zentraler Lage heraus Sydney zu erkunden. Nette und hilfsbereite Nachbarn  persönlicher Kontakt schnell möglich. Sehr schön und persönlich eingerichtet; man hat das Gefühl  bei Freunden zu Gast zu sein. Die Küche ist komplett eingerichtet  um selber zu kochen und sich wie zu Hause zu fühlen."),
("2019-01-05", "21531457", "Amy", "Jan's place was absolutely lovely! It was a fantastic location  and the house itself is such a beautiful and comfortable space to be in. We hope to come back soon!"),
("2019-01-11", "21531457", "Daniel", "really nice place  so much natural light which I loved. AC works well and cools downstairs. 5-10min walk to station  shops and pubs"),
("2019-01-25", "21531457", "Alexandre", "The house was cozy  sparkling clean and in a good location  near a train station. Hosts responded quickly to messages. 5 stars!"),
("2017-12-25", "21583253", "Jordan", "Nice cosy apartment style home close to ships and transport"),
("2017-12-31", "21583253", "Dung", "The house is super. We enjoyed our new year holiday with relaxing  clean and comfortable house. Fully furnished and amenities"),
("2017-12-15", "21568012", "Joachim", "The rooms are quite dark and not very pretty  but for this price - including a very good breakfast at Cafe Decolata - it's a good offer.Recommended for budget travelers who don't care about a fancy room and like free breakfast."),
("2018-01-04", "21568012", "Nathan", "Great value"),
("2018-01-06", "21568012", "Tyson", "Clean room  friendly host and super cheap too what more is there to ask for?"),
("2018-01-26", "21568012", "Daniel", "Quiet and cheap place. You get what you pay for."),
("2018-02-03", "21568012", "Liam", "Good for the price"),
("2018-03-15", "21568012", "Justin", "Gd place to  stay for the price a bit noisy in the front room with traffic  planes  horns tooting. But an enjoyable stay."),
("2018-03-18", "21568012", "Bridget", "The room was good for the price."),
("2018-03-18", "21568012", "Dainius", "Good for money"),
("2018-03-24", "21568012", "John", "David's place was fine.  It was easy to get to from the airport by bus  which stops right outside the cafe shown in the pictures.  As expected  the place has all the basic amenities one needs  and there are lots of restaurants in the area as well as a supermarket."),
("2018-03-29", "21568012", "Henry", "This is a good option for a cheap place to stay  but only if you plan to be out doing things during the day; the space is very small  not a problem if you make the most of your time in the city.      The wifi is great  very helpful for trip planning etc. Kitchen and fridge is small; I spent most nights out with friends so this wasn't an issue.      David was very communicative and fast to be so. I didn't have phone access until the day I was to arrive at his place and he was available for info and plannin (Website hidden by Airbnb) Not a far walk from king street and some other cool suburbs  and its a half hour metro ride to be at the opera house for reference (Even closer to the airport so its a good middle point). Overall a good cheap place to stay for non fussy travelers intending on seeing Sydney whilst saving some money."),
("2018-05-09", "21568012", "Kevin", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-06-16", "21568012", "Connor", "Basic but very good value! Place is a 5 min walk from train station and shops  in a good area with bars and for food."),
("2018-07-25", "21568012", "Magalie", "Good place. Central. Next to bus stop. Good value for money"),
("2018-07-31", "21568012", "Liam", "David’s place was very good"),
("2018-08-25", "21568012", "Doug", "This is great value and you can cook your own food with all plates etc provided. If I get more work at the same place I would really like to stay here again."),
("2018-09-12", "21568012", "Nana", "David's place is good for people on the go.. it's a really small room (I had 3 suitcases and ended up having to put one on the chair and another on the table just to save space). The walls are quite thin. Wifi is fast enough to use  sometimes a bit slow/spotty for watching things. I wasn't home a lot and I really just needed a place to sleep so this place was great. I saw David a few times during my stay and he was always very kind and welcoming. :)"),
("2018-09-16", "21568012", "Reverien", "Good place to stay"),
("2018-09-29", "21568012", "Dinah", "Surprises!"),
("2018-10-07", "21568012", "Ros", "David offers very cheap accommodation and it is fine for the price. David was very quick to respond to any issues or queries that I had."),
("2018-10-22", "21568012", "Margaret", "This accommodation has 8 rooms (mine was approx 3m x 2.5m) and very basic  the bed was comfortable and there is a bar fridge in the room for your day to day needs. The premises are quite old and could do with a spruce up however the location for me was only 5 min from an event that I was attending so brownie points for that."),
("2018-10-24", "21568012", "Robert", "Prior to arriving at David's Airbnb  I did not have the false assumption that I would arrive to a luxurious room; I understood I was choosing a cheap price over great accommodations.  What I did arrive to was nothing in which I had prepared myself for.  The entrance was through a back alley  which I knew before  but I did not realize it would lead to a loading dock with stairs leading to a row of numbered rooms  an apartment or any type of real living conditions.  After getting to the top of the stairs  I was instantly hit with the repulsive odor of the Airbnb.  As I continued walking in  I noticed the bathroom in the dark hallway  which I instantly knew I would not be using  due to the smell getting stronger.  I still held hope for my room  thinking maybe a fellow guest had left the bathrooms a mess.  When I entered the room  I was even more disappointed.  The sheets were clearly not changed and there was hair on the pillows  the floor was disgusting  there was no window and a hole in the ceiling  and the bed was held up by crates.  The smell was just as strong in the room as it was in the entrance and hallway and I did not even feel comfortable putting my bags down.  I sent David a message that the room was not accurately listed  and I was going to find different accommodations.  I stayed at a hostel for the next few nights  only $3 more than David's Airbnb  and it was a dream compared to David's room.  Before my arrival  David was very responsive with Airbnb messages  and sent me a very detailed message regarding my self check-in.  He responded to my message about leaving his Airbnb within a few hours  offering me a different room in the same complex.  I informed him I already made different arrangements in this time  and do not see how a different room could be much better.  I asked for a full refund and he never responded.  I contacted Airbnb  and they were able to get me 1/3 of the initial payment.  Sad to say  but I do not recommend this Airbnb."),
("2018-12-04", "21568012", "Yumi", "This place is good for the price! I loved my room. Very easy access to the city. A bit of construction noise  so I would suggest light sleepers to bring earplugs."),
("2018-12-13", "21568012", "Frieda", "Good value for money  would rent again"),
("2018-12-26", "21568012", "John", "Place just as described. Good small room."),
("2019-01-07", "21568012", "Alejandro", "Cheap accommodation in Sydney. 5 km from downtown. Easy to reach everywhere by Uber or bus. Internet works. Hosts is very friendly and helpful. One consideration for claustrophobic people  is the room does not have windows"),
("2017-11-15", "21583732", "Steffen", "Our stay was great: good location  great room with good facilities and awesome hosts! There is just a short 5-minute-walk to metro station and the metro takes ca. 15min to Circular Quay. The hosts give you enough time for your own but they are great to have a chat as well."),
("2017-11-19", "21583732", "Kalsini", "One of the best homestay I have experienced. Friendly & very helpful host who makes you feel at home."),
("2017-11-28", "21583732", "Dinesh", "Ellie's place is very clean and spacious. Close to shops and great neighbourhood. I would definitely stay here again when I visit Sydney."),
("2017-12-03", "21583732", "David", "Kevin and Ellie are very nice people and are welcoming and generous hosts.  Their apartment is spotless  comfortable and very nicely decorated.   The guest room and bathroom are great in all aspects and the apartment is ideally located.  I would strongly recommend this accommodation."),
("2017-12-12", "21583732", "Magdalena", "My friend and I felt so welcome. We were so excited about being at the other side of the world and kev and Ellie took good care of us and gave us good tips what to do and where to go! I can totally recommend this air bnb."),
("2018-01-07", "21583732", "Olivier", "Lovely perfect home with all necessary attention to their guests! Ideally located close to a train station that gets you to central Sydney in a dozen minutes. You greatly contributed to make my Sydney city trip amazing! Thank you"),
("2018-01-09", "21583732", "Kate", "Ellie's place is perfectly described - well appointed bedroom and bathroom (which is shared but didn't feel like it - really I had it all to myself for my brief stay!). Her home is very close to transport yet very leafy and quiet.  Ellie was flexible with my arrival time  and helpful with parking  making a cup of tea  explaining wi fi etc. Enjoyed my stay - highly recommend."),
("2018-01-13", "21583732", "Jesse", "Ellie and Kevin's home is fantastic and they are a very welcoming couple. The location is close to transport  shops and restaurants. I was very happy here as their apartment was really beautiful  very clean and the room I stayed in very comfortable. I could highly recommend anyone to stay there "),
("2018-01-17", "21583732", "Graham", "Delightfully welcoming hosts and feels like home away from home.  I was offered share in their dinner!  Great location close to Artarmon Station.  Good internet and comfy bed.  I'll be back!"),
("2018-01-20", "21583732", "Trevor", "Convenient location for the train (about 5 mins walk)  yet I heard no train noise at all! Very friendly hosts who were happy to help in any way they could."),
("2018-03-11", "21583732", "Bohan", "Ellie’s place is as clean  reachable and well-equipped as you imagine. Living area is very nice with a lot of amenities making your stay enjoyable and easy. Private room is well-lit and spacious with much comfort. The house sits in a quiet and peaceful neighborhood. Shopping facilities and train station is just 5 mins walk away. City center is only 15 mins train ride  or you can go to Chatswood  the local Centre with huge shopping malls and fancy restaurants  which is just one stop away. This is an ideal place for both business and leisure travelers come to visit Sydney."),
("2018-01-04", "21612701", "Camille", "Tout était parfait  la localisation  la vue  l’appartement décoré avec goût  la ville etc... je recommande sans aucune hésitation cet appartement. De plus Kinga est une hôte très sympathique et arrangeante. J’espère pouvoir y revenir un jour !"),
("2017-12-14", "21648743", "Sten", "Nice and quiet place to stay!"),
("2017-12-30", "21637487", "Andrea", "Kasey was a fantastic host with great communication. Her apartment is beautiful with so many cozy touches. Her place is right in the heart of Bondi with everything you need right outside the door!"),
("2018-01-04", "21637487", "Hayley", "Location was amazing and right around the corner from a great cafe strip. Great restaurants were all walking distance and the bus was not far and easy to get straight into the city. Located on the main strip on Bondi it was perfect for a few relaxing days at the beach. The apartment was small but better than the photos and has been tastefully renovated recently. Very comfortable for two people and the personal touches were nice. We had a great time :)"),
("2018-01-07", "21637487", "Clare", "Kasey's apartment is beautiful! Right on the beach (yet away from the road so less noisy)  and beautifully finished. Our stay was like staying in a hotel. Highly recommended."),
("2018-01-15", "21637487", "Angie", "Fantastic location and comfortable stay. Kasey is wonderful at communication and make our time here so easy!"),
("2018-01-17", "21637487", "Ella", "Hands down the cutest little secret spot in Bondi!! Right on the beach front  brand new apartment  not to mention done up so well! If you don't book this place  you're missing out big time! THANKS SO MUCH KASEY :)"),
("2018-01-20", "21637487", "Makéda", "This place is amazing ! Perfect location  lovely apartment with everything you need. Communication with Kasey is very easy ! I strongly recommend "),
("2018-01-22", "21637487", "Ian", "Great apartment  exactly as it looked in photos. Right on the parade  just across from the beach. Kasey was very helpful and quick to respond. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-02-01", "21637487", "Monica", "El lugar está recientemente remodelado y es muy lindo y estiloso  cerca de todo  al frente de la playa  del transporte público y a dos cuadras del supermercado.Tiene lavadora y proporcionan toallas  jabón  shampoo y acondicionador.Lo mejor para esta época de verano es la jarra con agua helada esperandote en el refrigerador.El dpto es muy iluminado aunque no tiene ventanas hacia la calle principal. Para los que lleven maletas hay que subir unas escaleras hacia el primer piso.Se puede cocinar pero tener cuidado para que no suene la alarma de humo.Tiene horno  hervidor  tostador todos nuevos.Excelente lugar para unos días en Bondi.Nos encantó.Y Kasey preocupada de cómo estábamos siempre.Gracias Monica"),
("2018-02-05", "21637487", "Manny", "Intimate apartment on Bondi Beach. Kasey kept in touch and provided all the information required for an easy stay. Thanks"),
("2018-02-09", "21637487", "Gary", "Kasey been a amazing host! Location was perfect  right across the street from Bondi Beach. Check on us regularly about our stay and constantly offering help if we need any. Thank you again Kasey for being such a good host!"),
("2018-02-22", "21637487", "Ryan", "Great location  very modern  awesome host. 10/10"),
("2018-03-03", "21637487", "Amy", "Kasey's apartment is brilliant. The location is perfect  being right on bondi beach and close to all the restaurants and bars that Bondi has to offer. The apartment itself is very clean and has everything you need for a comfortable and relaxing stay. Kasey was a brilliant host - she was incredibly responsive and helpful and constantly offered us any help if we needed it. A fabulous stay on Bondi - thanks Kasey!"),
("2018-03-08", "21637487", "Toby", "Amazing place in brilliant location"),
("2018-03-10", "21637487", "Campbell", "Kasey’s place is perfect. Amazing location  great value and communication and checkin was super easy. Right in the heart of Bondi :)"),
("2018-03-16", "21637487", "Danija", "This home is in a great location (can't beat it!) and photos of the property are accurate.The sheets and towels were very clean.Check-in was seamless  and communication with the host was regular and timely.One minor thing to note  it was fairly warm in the property - no aircon. The property is located so  so close to the beach and is a beautiful location  so this was not much of an issue for us as we were mostly out and about. A fan has been provided at the property.I would stay again!"),
("2018-03-24", "21637487", "Sarah", "Such a cute one bedroom apartment in the perfect location. It’s small but packs a lot in and all the action is on your doorstep. Gorgeous renovation and super easy to communicate with. I would stay here again and again."),
("2018-04-23", "21637487", "Chiara", "Nicely styled All that is needed for a comfortable stay provided"),
("2018-04-27", "21637487", "Jarrod", "Kasey's place was great. It was very clean and in a great location  right on the beach. Would highly recommend!"),
("2018-05-02", "21637487", "Hubertus", "Great apartment  fantastic location.. like the style and it is renovated very nicely. Enjoyed to jump out of the door into the ocean and to have all the nice cafes and restaurants around"),
("2018-05-13", "21637487", "Pascale", "Kasey’s appartment was clean and well located  and we had overall a nice stay in Bondi"),
("2018-05-26", "21637487", "Sarah", "Kasey was a wonderful host  very responsive and helpful. Her home had all the amenities we needed and was in a perfect location - right opposite the beach and surrounded by plenty of hip cafes and supermarkets. Would stay again!"),
("2018-08-05", "21637487", "Andrew", "Great location and stylish  nicely renovated apartment. Not much wardrobe space for clothes but otherwise well equipped. Kasey was very helpful and responsive. I would recommend this to friends."),
("2018-08-10", "21637487", "Alison", "Very nice  clean place right on the front at Bondi. Kasey's very helpful & quick with responses. "),
("2018-08-21", "21637487", "Leanne", "Lovely little apartment in an ideal location for exploring Bondi Beach. Kasey was a wonderful host  great communication & very accommodating with check in & check outs. Would happily stay again. "),
("2018-09-18", "21637487", "Matt", "So close to Bondi beach  cafes and the nightlife. A comfy bed and all the things you need for a great getaway."),
("2018-09-28", "21637487", "Brittany", "I had an excellent stay here. The apartment is ideally located directly across from the beach with lots of shops and restaurants in walking distance. Kasey was super responsive and accommodating!"),
("2018-10-03", "21637487", "Sarah", "The most central location in Bondi. The apartment was beautifully styled and exactly as it looks in the photos. A great place to stay."),
("2018-10-07", "21637487", "Pierce", "Kasey’s apartment is clean  modern  and perfect location for a stay in Bondi. All appliances are new and run well and Kasey was very attentive in making sure everything was up to standard. I would gladly recommend this apartment to anyone wanted to stay in Bondi!"),
("2018-10-11", "21637487", "Michelle", "Had a great stay! Right across Bondi beach. Very clean and Kasey was lovely to deal with!"),
("2018-10-16", "21637487", "Malcolm", "Kasey is a great host and the apartment is everything we imagined location is brilliant and I wouldn’t hesitate to recommend it to anyone Malcolm"),
("2018-10-29", "21637487", "Candelaria", "I would definitely recommend this apartment!Very clean and tidy.Location is great  in front of the beach.Communication with Kasey was so easy  and she even let us check in early in the morning!Thanks for everything!"),
("2018-11-03", "21637487", "Larissa", "Kasey's place is a must stay for anyone wanting to check out the Bondi area! Kasey provides wonderful hospitality and her place is totally adorable! Just steps away from Bondi Beach :) Her place is perfect for 1-2 people and i couldn't be happier with our experience there! Thanks Kasey!"),
("2018-11-09", "21637487", "Niamh", "Look no further! Perfect accommodation for your stay in Bondi. Ideal location- So close to the beach yet you don’t hear any noise from the apartment. The air con is great too and a rare find around Bondi.The weather lads is exactly like the pictures and very clean. Kasey was super responsive and very accommodating with my request to extend the stay.Thanks Kasey."),
("2018-11-11", "21637487", "Luke", "Fabtastic apartment ight on the beach close to great restaraunts and shops"),
("2018-12-12", "21637487", "Annette", "I absolutely loved my stay at Kaseys beautiful flat! The furnishings and attention to detail made me feel right at home. Kasey herself was an absolute brilliant host  very attentive  lovely and so super quick with responding to anything and everything. Last but definitely not least....location  location  location. Kaseys flat really is located at the heart of Bondi which is just awesome and leaves you with endless possibilities to explore and enjoy your days! I‘ll definitely was sad to be leaving and will return for sure! Thank you Kasey!!!"),
("2018-12-16", "21637487", "Stephanie", "The location is superb- right in the beach! Kasey was really lovely to engage with. The space is so nice  very organised and clean! Highly recommended!"),
("2018-12-18", "21637487", "Ellie", "Wonderfully clean and stylish apartment steps from the beach - I even considered missing my flight home to stay longer! Kasey is an amazing and responsive host  could not recommend the apartment more highly!"),
("2018-12-25", "21637487", "Aline", "This flat is perfectly located for an early swim in the morning. Your literally on bondi beach within seconds. Everything is just around the corner. Nice place just in the middle of ‚where the magic happens‘..."),
("2018-12-26", "21637487", "Hunter", "Excellent location and Kasey was very easy to communicate with. I would recommend."),
("2018-12-28", "21637487", "Gwen", "Kasey’s place was perfect for our Bondi Beach adventure. The apartment was so cute and sparkling clean  with thoughtful touches everywhere. Kasey was quick to respond to us and went out of her way to work with us on a late checkout. We had the best time!"),
("2019-01-01", "21637487", "Simeon", "Kasey’s place is the best place to stay in Bondi. You can literally walk out of the apartment and right onto the beach. She was such a fantastic host  extremely responsive and accommodating  and we will certainly be back one day!"),
("2019-01-05", "21637487", "Ali", "The apartment in a great location very close to a wide range of restaurants  shops and is across the road from Bondi Beach. The apartment is beautifully furnished with a minimal  yet rustic and calming feel. Divine linen and the apartment even included beach towels."),
("2019-01-13", "21637487", "Jennifer", "Kasey was quick and helpful with all our communications. Her place is just as lovely as the photos and in a perfect location for a beach holiday. Would definitely love to stay again."),
("2019-01-18", "21637487", "Diane", "The location is unbeatable! Across the street from the beach and right in the middle of shops  cafes  bars  and stores. It’s a perfect spot for those who plan to lie out on Bondi Beach  walk over to Tamarama Beach  or take an Uber/ferry to Sydney’s downtown area. Missing it so much!! The unit itself is cute and only one flight of stairs up. Something tells me you won’t spend TOO much time indoors here  though!"),
("2019-01-25", "21637487", "James", "A good couple of days."),
("2019-02-04", "21637487", "Roman", "Amazing apartment only a step away from the beach. The space is very nice with attention to the detail and there is everything you need to make your stay comfortable. Kasey was a brilliant host and very responsive. Don’t look any further - this is the place to stay in Bondi Beach!"),
("2019-02-14", "21637487", "Taylor", "LOVED staying here. So close to the beach and close to restaurants and shops. The place was a cozy and comfortable place to come back to at the end of the day. We had everything we needed and more to make us feel at home. I’d come back in a heartbeat!"),
("2019-02-19", "21637487", "Dennis", "Amazing location combined with a cute space which is very well thought out.  Lots of helpful tips and would stay here again. Cheers!"),
("2019-02-23", "21637487", "Lota", "Kasey’s place is really nice! Location is perfect! I will definitely come back!"),
("2017-11-06", "21612973", "Lukas", "The place is beautiful. The room is big  the bed really comfortable and you even have Manly Harbor views when the weather is nice. Jackie and Martin are honestly some of the nicest and friendliest people I've ever met. They were super welcoming and nice and if you want to know any cool places that you can visit don't hesitate to ask  they know a lot about Sydney and Australia in general. I'll definitely be back at their place."),
("2017-11-11", "21612973", "Jarek", "Great hosts  nice place  beautiful location. Recommended!"),
("2017-11-22", "21612973", "Lukas", "I loved my second stay at Jackie and Martin's place. They're such kind people and the place is simply amazingly comfortable :)"),
("2017-12-03", "21612973", "Rattana", "Many thx for Jackie and her husband for having me as a guest in their super lovely and clean apartment  the place is exactly the same as it shows on profile   plus i can see the ocean from my cosy room with sunshine wake-up call in the morning :)   i will definitely go back to their place for my next visit to manly beach :)"),
("2017-12-12", "21612973", "Taflyn", "Close to the heart of things in Manly (although a wee bit of a steep walk back up to apartment). Jackie was happy to go above & beyond to ensure a lovely stay - beautiful apartment! Very friendly & welcoming. Comfy & very peaceful with beautiful view!"),
("2017-12-14", "21612973", "Cat", "Jackie + Marty are terrific hosts + their designer apartment in Manly is extremely desirable. The communication was clear  honest + accurate + the apartment exactly what the images show (if not better!) - waking up to the sea breeze + a view to the harbour was so relaxing! A short walk to the harbour this apartment makes for the great overnight or weekend stay! A  Manly must!"),
("2018-01-13", "21612973", "Kerryn", "Jackie and Martin are amazing. This was my first time using air bnb and I couldn’t have had a better experience. I was only there for 2 nights but Jackie and Martin made me feel very welcome and comfortable. This is a great location  you can walk to the beach in a few minutes and was able to utilise a parking permit which Jackie and Martin provided to park on the street. Beautiful home and a lovely couple  would absolutely stay again."),
("2018-01-21", "21612973", "Andy", "Jackie and Martin  the hosts were kind  considerate and welcoming.  The flat is beautifully designed and stylishly appointed. The bedroom is compact and absolutely fine for a short stay.  There is a steep hill up to the flat to keep you fit! "),
("2018-02-05", "21612973", "Daniel", "Jackie en Martin zijn zeer gastvrij en vriendelijk. Hun huis is een plaatje uit een  woonmagazines. Inrichting en verzorging top geregeld. Een prettige plaats voor een rustig verblijf."),
("2018-02-07", "21612973", "Steffen", "Nice stay  perfect if you want to be close to Manly"),
("2018-02-14", "21612973", "Jackson", "Jackie and Martin were amazing and went above and beyond to make us feel welcome and comfortable for the entire trip.  Check in was very easy and there were no issues whatsoever during our stay."),
("2018-02-19", "21612973", "Marianne", "Jackie & Martin were wonderful hosts and we had a great time in their home."),
("2018-02-21", "21612973", "Nadine", "Most amazing room ever! Cosy bed  awesome furniture and lovely host! Highly recommend this place !"),
("2018-02-25", "21612973", "Vanessa", "Best Aur b n b hosts in a lovely place and location!  So friendly and helpful - delightful people - made us feel right at home! Can’t recommend more highly!!"),
("2018-03-03", "21612973", "Elaine", "You will be delighted with your stay with Jackie and Martin. They are very considerate  welcoming and inclusive .We were most taken by their engagement in conversations about our mutual love of travels and other experiences.It was such a pleasure to be accomodated in their stylish apartment."),
("2018-03-08", "21612973", "Sophie", "Jackie was such a lovely  creative  and hospitable host. It was my birthday and I receieved a handwritten card. The apartment was clean  peaceful  and highly curated. I would definitely return!"),
("2018-03-12", "21612973", "Sarah", "Jackie and Martin were amazing hosts and made us feel at home! The space was styled beautifully and sparkly clean. Was just a short walk to the centre of Manly  the beach and close to great food! The perfect place to stay in Manly! Will definitely be back again :)"),
("2018-03-18", "21612973", "Debra", "A very bright  modern and exceptionally clean home. Fabulous views of Manly and the Heads from your room and the living room.  The walk up from Manly Ferry is scenic but steep. ....great exercise.. the hosts Jackie and Martin are very helpful and considerate.  It is a shared bathroom and all other facilities with the hosts but wasnt a problem for us for the two nights. Would recommend this little Gem of quiet and handy location."),
("2018-03-22", "21612973", "Dorothy", "Jackie and Martin are great hosts. The apartment and my room were beautiful  clean and quiet. I had lovely views of the harbour. Martin was there to meet me and offer advice about the best places to swim. Thank you for a relaxing and enjoyable stay!"),
("2018-04-06", "21612973", "Joey", "Jackie has created a beautiful space in this airy and spacious apartment. The room was perfectly clean  with an extremely comfortable bed  and a great view over Manly at sunrise. Jackie is a very accommodating host and I’d recommend this place to anyone travelling to Manly."),
("2018-04-07", "21612973", "Lucy", "Oh my word. This place is so beautiful! Communication with Jackie was exceptional and she left wonderfully clear instructions for finding the apartment. Jackie and Martin are delightful and the house is spotless. The walk up the hill to the house after a day in the sun certainly got my heart pumping  but it’s in a really good location. I sure hope you’ll have us again sometime!"),
("2018-04-16", "21612973", "Véronique", "Really convenient location for exploring Manly  and a beautiful flat. Design touches are really nice  and the room has a view of the harbour. Everything was perfectly clean  and the bed was very comfortable. Jackie and Martin are very kind hosts  very welcoming and helpful. Would recommend to anyone."),
("2018-04-26", "21612973", "May Ling", "Great stay.=)"),
("2018-05-10", "21612973", "Hilton", "The apartment is immaculate  yet homely  and the  facilities exceeded my expectations. The hosts made me feel relaxed and at home. Will definitely stay here again..."),
("2018-05-27", "21612973", "Adele", "This is the perfect place to stay in Manly! Would highly recommend!!"),
("2018-06-02", "21612973", "Maja", "It was such a pleasure to stay at Jackie’s apartment! It’s super beautiful  very clean and full of light ;) It is located in this quiet area of Manly and you have to walk a little bit up the hill   but the bay views from the bedroom are totally worth it ! Jackie and Matt are great hosts  very helpful and responsive. They made this long list with recommended places for coffee  lunch  dinner and things to do  see. I felt very welcome at their place and at the same time I had my own space. All in all  it was a great experience   I would totally recommend Jackie’s place to anyone who wants to explore Manly ! "),
("2018-06-09", "21612973", "Angela", "Jackie’s place is gorgeous  a verywelcoming space with lovely hosts to match. Great local tips also. Thanks again!"),
("2018-06-12", "21612973", "Eriko", "I really enjoyed staying with Jackie and Martin.The apartment is as beautiful as it is on the photos with stylish furniture and cute little plants.The minimalistic style inspired me to live like they do!Thank you for making me feel at home and being such a great host. Would love to come back!!"),
("2018-07-06", "21612973", "Rodney", "We had a wonderful stay at Jackie's place in Manly. Everything was great and we were made to feel so welcome. The location was perfect for us  we were able to leave the car behind and enjoyed the ferry ride over to the city.....we would highly recommend Jackie's place to anyone coming to Sydney.Rodney and Nokie"),
("2018-07-13", "21612973", "Beth", "Great place for a stopover in Manly! Sunny morning views from the room and Jackie and Martin were very easygoing and friendly  with some good tips for places to go in Manly. Thanks guys!"),
("2018-08-25", "21612973", "Kay", "Can not recommend this airbnb highly enough! The hosts are stellar. The accomodation is great and the location is an easy walk from the ferry and beach. Highly recommend"),
("2018-09-04", "21612973", "Loraine", "Jackie was an amazing host! Her apartment is as cute as the pictures. She provided a space heater when it was cold  made me tea  and even gave me her bananas when I came home starving! Staying here was the best  I would recommend it to anyone."),
("2018-09-09", "21612973", "Angela", "What a wonderful place to stay. Jackie and Martin’s hospitality was definitely a highlight and their cosy fireplace a pure delight. Highly recommended."),
("2018-09-14", "21612973", "Janine", "Great stay"),
("2018-09-18", "21612973", "Alia", "Jackie is an amazing host! Would definitely stay here again. Beautiful  clean  and walking distance to cafes and shops!"),
("2018-09-27", "21612973", "Joe", "My wife and I stayed with Jackie and Martin for 4 nights  they couldn’t have been more helpful and their flat is the perfect space with great views across Manly Bay - we would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-10-01", "21612973", "Natalie", "Lovely clean apartment a few mins walk from beach. However the owners are there all the time  sleeping in room next door. If you want a private getaway  perhaps not the best place as there is no opportunity for privacy at all. Bring your eye mask unless you like waking up with birds as the room is full of light with no curtains."),
("2018-10-12", "21612973", "Gerard", "A conseiller sans problème."),
("2018-10-27", "21612973", "Morgan", "Beautiful space  awesome location very close to everything. Parking was a little hard but where isn’t hard to find a park in Sydney!"),
("2018-10-28", "21612973", "Zuzana", "Jackie with her husband were very helpful  They gave us the map with the local stuff to do  also They recommend us the local restaurants. We could stay longer in the appartment before our flight. The flat is Beautiful and amazig. We really would like to return one day :)"),
("2018-11-03", "21612973", "Graeme", "Nice place  beautifully renovated. Handy to down town Manly and the ferry. My room even had a desk which was perfect for catching up with some work."),
("2018-11-05", "21612973", "Rawan", "Highly recommended! Jackie and Martin are such exceptional hosts. My husband and I had enjoyed staying with them for two nights at their gorgeous apartment. Thank you again  guys!"),
("2018-11-08", "21612973", "Stuart", "It's a lovely place in a great location.  The hosts are very friendly and helpful."),
("2018-11-17", "21612973", "Milena", "That was definitely the best Airbnb we've ever stay at! Lovely hosts always happy to chat with you but without overwhelming  beautiful apartment (if you are worried that photos are photoshoped and better than the reality - you don't have to  the place is amazing ;)  great location (yes  even with the ocean view in the distance)  local tips what to explore. 10/10!"),
("2018-11-20", "21612973", "Matt", "Stay here when you go to Manly!! Jackie and Martin were the most amazing hosts. The place is very easy to access. Their home is a dream to be in. Would recommend their place to anyone first before staying anywhere.  They’re the best couple. Jackie even made me a tea brew when I wasn’t feeling well. Thanks again for an amazing stay!"),
("2018-11-23", "21612973", "Dejan", "We enjoyed our Sydney visit from Manly. Why? Because it was great to drive every morning via ferry into the city and to have the great view on the harbour bridge  the skyline and of course the great opera. In fact that was our initial reason to book our days at Jackies flat. In our eyes the best way to travel smoothly into the city without any stress. Our „home“ was great as well  we enjoyed the beautiful flat from the first second on. Worth to mention: Jackie and her husband are great conversation partners."),
("2018-11-29", "21612973", "Rohan", "Having to be in Manly for work always lends itself to a stay like this one. Jackie and Martin were wonderful hosts  easy to communicate with and really enjoyable to be hosted by.Manly is a beautiful suburb  the unit is walking distance to everything and like the area has both charm and history. THe really surprise is inside. The renovation is elegant  tasteful and professional. The room itself has water views and is comfortable and functional.It’s on my list to revisit next time I back bu the sea!"),
("2018-12-02", "21612973", "Joseph", "Amazing place and amazing peopleWas abit of a last minute thing for us but that was no problem with themThere was great communication on how to find the placeA leaflet of places to eat and things to do ectAnd the location was a couple of minutes walk from the ferry terminalWould recomend"),
("2018-12-12", "21612973", "Callum", "Amazing place  amazing people!"),
("2018-12-16", "21612973", "Vincent", "Had great stay. The apartment is clean and stylish and very close to the beach. Would definitely recommend."),
("2018-12-28", "21612973", "Rich", "What an amazing apartment  in a beautiful part of Sydney & hosted by the most welcoming couple. Jackie & Martin were the perfect hosts & made me feel at home from the very first moment. Jackie was always very quick to reply to my messages  and they were very accommodating  even when I checked in 7 hours late due to a cancelled flight.I will be sure to return next time I’m in the area."),
("2019-01-13", "21612973", "Mark", "The alpha and omega of mMy Air B&B"),
("2019-02-08", "21612973", "Jutta", "You have a nice room  comfortable bed and a great view to the wharf from your room. Jackie and Martin are helpful and very kindly person. We highly recommended this room in Manly."),
("2019-02-10", "21612973", "Brendan", "I loved this place and hated to leave! Martin and Jackie are so kind and were perfect hosts. I cannot say enough good things about my stay.One thing that I feel should be mentioned  if you plan to walk to the beach  it is down some steep hills  and the walk back is up some steep hills. If physically that would be a problem  is should be noted  but I rather enjoyed the walk!"),
("2019-02-21", "21612973", "Anna", "Martin’s place was excellent! Great location and such a stylish  clean space. It’s a shame they’re selling their cute place! Thanks again for everything!"),
("2019-02-25", "21612973", "Kazuki", "ｵｼｬﾚでﾏﾝﾘｰの雰囲気ととてもﾏｯﾁした素敵な家でした｡ﾎｽﾄのMartinには現地の情報やﾌｪﾘｰのお得な乗り方を教えてもらいました｡同じ金額でそこそこのﾎﾃﾙに泊まるなら迷わずMartinの家をおすすめします｡"),
("2019-03-04", "21612973", "Dominik", "Martin & Jackie are true superhosts. We stayed her in early March 2019 and had a fantastic time. Super apartment and Martin personally ensured our stay in Manly as comfortable and smooth as possible. AirBnB at its best. Thank you!"),
("2018-02-16", "21625832", "Jorge", "La casa está excelentemente equipada y si uno quiere estar cerca de Sydney (40 minutos en auto) pero en un lugar tranquilo es inmejorable. La mejor playa para mi gusto (Palm Beach) está solo a 10 minutos. Sin dudas un lugar de elite.."),
("2018-03-03", "21625832", "Julie", "This house has it all!! Views  lots of bedrooms  every convenience you could need from coffee machine to bean bag lounges to sit on the deck and take in those views.  As a group of five women  we each had our own room with room for more if needed and while we didn’t visit with our kids  would also suit those with children. Our host was very responsive and the house was impeccably clean and stylish. The kitchen had everything and the bathrooms spacious. Just what we needed for a quiet girls weekend away from the hustle and bustle. We had an incredible lunch a short drive away at the new Merivale restaurant Bert’s Bar & Brasserie at the Newport  a must if you’re in the area and looking for a very special dining experience. Loved the house  there’s a cafe a short picturesque walk and Avalon shops a short drive. We’ll be back!"),
("2018-03-17", "21625832", "Kristen", "We all loved our stay here. The house is beyond beautiful. The view is amazing and the house was perfect for our weekend getaway. Thank you to Erin and jo for your hospitality We had the best time."),
("2018-03-24", "21625832", "Sophie", "Jo’s house is absolutely stunning. The view over Clareville is gorgeous and the house is very well equipped  comfortable and immaculately clean. We would definitely stay again."),
("2018-04-01", "21625832", "Ames", "The view from the deck ! Was amazing"),
("2018-04-08", "21625832", "Rue", "The place is described as it is  very nice and homey! Everything was provided for and communication was excellent. The house is just a moments walk away from the beach and the living room view is stunning. Thank you for such a great stay!"),
("2018-04-22", "21625832", "Renee", "Ticks every single box! Amazing house in a relaxing setting  with everything you could possibly need & more. We can’t wait to go back again. Highly recommend."),
("2018-05-24", "21625832", "Leo", "Beautiful spacious tranquil house with amazing views"),
("2019-03-03", "21684913", "Lisa", "What a lovely  lovely older home . The private enclosed deck allows you to open the bedroom doors   fall asleep and wake to the sounds of crashing waves and native birds on beautiful Tamarama beach . The house is atmospheric  bright light and welcoming with its large entertaining spaces and roomy galley kitchen. Lovely touches were added with a few footballs my son was able to enjoy. I regularly use Airbnb  I’d definitely recommend this home   it’s been one of our favorites."),
("2017-12-31", "21716100", "Marianne Terry & Richard", "Tam's place is the ideal family home for a perfect getaway. The location was great to avoid the crowds but close enough to Curl Curl  Freshie and Manly to enjoy the beaches and all that the area has to offer. The pool was a definate draw card and the outdoor area is conducive to rest and relaxation. It's obvious that Tam is a keen cook as everything is thought of and available for entertaining. Would definately recommend and would come back again!"),
("2018-01-05", "21716100", "Anthony", "Great place  fully equipped house  Tam is great host  great beach 5-10 min easy walk away. "),
("2017-11-15", "21648821", "Peter", "The host canceled this reservation 11 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-12-15", "21648821", "Mariano", "Casandra and Davi's place was perfect for our family. Very modern and confortable  it is really well located  close to restaurantes and a very nice shopping center  and not so far to Sydney CDB. We had a great stay and we would like to recommend it."),
("2017-12-22", "21648821", "Jihye", "This place was a very good place. Clean and excellent interior! This house is near a shopping center."),
("2017-12-25", "21648821", "Diego", "It is a beautiful place to stay  very clean  comfortable and in a great location."),
("2017-12-28", "21648821", "Jason", "Cassandra and David were terrific with communication and check in was easy and seamless. The apartment is in a good location for ease of access to Sydney city and eastern beaches."),
("2017-12-30", "21648821", "Dean", "it's a nice place to stay. it's location is good  very close to CBD. Rooms are spacious  kitchen is stylish. Kids are really like it  coz  they found some board games provided by the host."),
("2018-01-01", "21648821", "Morgan", "Hi  we all had a great stay at the place was perfect for our stay. Our dinner unfortunately fell through on new years eve but the kitchen was so good we were able to cook a nice dinner for ourselves. The only down fall we had was how hot the apartment got. We thought the apartment was air conditioned but were a bit disappointed with the small mini evaporative cooler as it did little to nothing to help with the heat around the apartment. At minimum it would have been nice to at least have a fan in each room to help sleep at night. Apart from that our stay was great. Thanks for having us."),
("2018-01-21", "21648821", "Janis", "This place was perfect! Very nice  large space great for our family to hang out if we had no plans in evening. Area was quiet  buy also livrky if that is what you were looking for. Very close to shopping and restaurants. Great place for families with young kids or young adults! Thank you the great stay!"),
("2018-01-25", "21648821", "Feng", "Hi Cassandra  David  We enjoyed stay in your nice  clean place. The location is great  close to shopping and restaurant. We walked to station to city and catched bus back  very convenient. Thanks again! Feng"),
("2018-01-29", "21648821", "Dipika", "The location of the property was perfect  close to everything and nice quiet area. There is no air-conditioning system in the house  and the host provided fans but that did not do the job as the house got really hot and we all struggled to sleep at night. The 2 occasional chairs in the living room was an interesting design and slants to the front so was very uncomfortable - we were 6 adults and the living room furniture couldn't accommodate was all comfortably. "),
("2018-02-03", "21648821", "Darren", "Check everything before stay..make sure is working everything"),
("2018-02-11", "21648821", "Kailan", "Thank you for having us. Will definitely recommend and stay again"),
("2018-02-25", "21648821", "Briody", "A great stay right near the Sydney CBD. Thank you for such great hospitality"),
("2018-03-06", "21648821", "Sam", "This place is great.. residential yet close to everything. Modern  just like the images  big and spacious. The value is amazing for what you get"),
("2018-03-10", "21648821", "April", "Amazing spot  fun area  fresh space  what a great place to call home for the weekend!"),
("2018-03-28", "21648821", "Cathy", "Nice apartment & convenient location"),
("2018-04-09", "21648821", "Judith", "This apartment was just as described. It was bright and spacious with plenty of room for three couples. The location is perfect with easy access to Sydney airport and the CBD and with a good shopping centre nearby and plenty of restaurants and cafes nearby. The neighbourhood is safe  green and attractive. Dealing with Casandra and David prior to arrival was very easy with prompt responses to my questions. I would recommend this apartment and would stay there again."),
("2018-04-19", "21648821", "Scott", "Great location  spacious  nice/comfy furniture  very nice hosts and support crew. Very efficient check in and out process. We hope to stay again soon"),
("2018-04-21", "21648821", "Ketan", "Beautiful clean apartment  close to city. Casandra and David were great hosts. Quick responses to any queries  etc."),
("2018-04-28", "21648821", "Joy", "The unit is very good for your family to stay in Sydney  walking distance to public transport and close to a shopping centre and eateries. Modern unit with most of what you would want for your stay  for a larger family like ours  thanks it was great"),
("2018-05-10", "21648821", "Abhishek", "Hi  everything was perfect apart from cleanliness and some desperately needed maintenance"),
("2018-05-20", "21648821", "Leeanna", "Great location close to everything and very clean! Very stylish and was a wonderful alternative to a hotel room. Very quiet place to stay but close to everything."),
("2018-06-09", "21648821", "Aramis", "Nice location  close to everything  very clean and great entertainment facilities. "),
("2018-06-16", "21648821", "Ze Thong", "Worth the price"),
("2018-06-20", "21648821", "Felicia", "The place is very lovely. Thank you for welcoming us with flower .. we love itThe place have everything you need and have complete stuff for cook and bbqReally comfy bed and large space"),
("2018-06-26", "21648821", "Christine & Stephen", "Nice light apartment perfect for a large family group. Plenty of storage for luggage. Convenient location with shops and public transport fairly close....bus less than 5 minutes walk and train about 15."),
("2018-07-01", "21648821", "Paul", "Spacious family friendly apartment close to the city and many things to do."),
("2018-07-03", "21648821", "Cp", "A modern apartment in strategic location near a shopping mall  clean and cozy setting coupled with a well equipped kitchen making our stay a memorable one."),
("2018-07-07", "21648821", "Cymmon", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Cassandra and David’s place. The location was amazing with an easy walk to parks and shops. Nice quiet streets  very family friendly. Well set up to accommodate two families especially with two car spaces. Inside it was modern and clean. Highly recommended."),
("2018-07-22", "21648821", "Kai", "Very friendly hosts with a wonderful home. The location and surroundings are lush and very accessible. The hosts responded quickly to any of our inquiries. The home was clean and spacious. Would definitely recommend staying here."),
("2018-07-25", "21648821", "Marco", "Nice apartment just three step from the road in a quite area"),
("2018-07-30", "21648821", "Henk", "Beautiful apartment  close to a large Coles. Take a good coffee at the coffee shop on the entrance of the shopping mall.Apartment is well equipped and offers a lot of space. Neighborhood is perfect and Green Square station is about 10mins walk and offers fast transport to the city."),
("2018-08-06", "21648821", "Lucinda", "plenty of space and lots to do near by :)"),
("2018-08-09", "21648821", "Kannis", "房子很大但不太歸一 而且晚上會聽到飛機女經過的聲音｡"),
("2018-08-12", "21648821", "Hayley", "Fantastic apartment! We loved our stay here  it’s set up beautifully and the location is fantastic. We’ll be back! "),
("2018-09-16", "21648821", "Leo", "Very easy to communicate to. Nice place and location"),
("2018-10-01", "21648821", "Nathan", "Great location  very stylish space with everything you need to feel at home in Sydney!"),
("2018-10-05", "21648821", "Sara And Espen", "As a family of 5 we have enjoyed the spacious and nice apartment. The parking lot at the garage and its location makes it very easy and convenient. There are also a variety of restaurants  supermarkets and playgrounds just walking distance.Communicating with David was easy and would just suggest they have a closer eye on their outsourced cleaning and maintenance to be sure everything is cleaned and working prior to guests arrival."),
("2018-10-13", "21648821", "Kim", "A lovely apartment  great location and David and Cassandra made communication  super easy and were extremely prompt with responses.We would certainly stay there again."),
("2018-10-27", "21648821", "Chelsie & Zac", "Casandra and David's flat is in an excellent location.  We loved having the flexibility to take the train  or to drive from the location easily.   The proximity to the East Village Shopping center is also a great convenience.  We found the beds to be very comfortable and the kitchen to be well stocked.  We also loved the patio grill."),
("2018-11-03", "21648821", "Bethaney", "Modern apartment with excellent amenities  lots of natural light and a lovely cool breeze when you open the sliding doors. Only a short walk to the shops  park and train station in a quiet neighborhood. Easy check-in/out and excellent communication!"),
("2018-11-06", "21648821", "Michael", "Graet unit  location and amenities.  Will use again"),
("2018-11-10", "21648821", "Joey YuChiao", "地點很好 附近有三個公園 有兩座兒童遊戲場 是親子友善的住宿環境 有提供一個兒童餐椅在家裡可以使用;走路五分鐘就有大型超市賣場 非常方便!清潔部分給4分希望可以再加強:)"),
("2018-11-17", "21648821", "Emer", "beautiful location good public transport nice place for family's and relaxing"),
("2018-11-26", "21648821", "Tony", "It is a very clean and lovely place to stay and we will be back in July."),
("2018-12-15", "21648821", "Jessica", "This apartment is fantastic  amazing hosts with helpful and easy communication. Location was perfect if you need to be close to the city. The apartment it’s self is beautiful and I would 100% stay here again!"),
("2018-12-20", "21648821", "Yiwei", "Casandra and David’s place was lovely and we had a really good time here. They provided everything we need and it was definitely worth money."),
("2019-01-01", "21648821", "Shayna", "Cassandra and David’s place was super nice! So clean and modern  great location and they were very swift with their responses to me."),
("2019-01-06", "21648821", "Daniel", "Great place in a great area. Had a weekend with some mates watching the cricket. 10 minute Uber or 30 minute walk from the SCG. Nice modern apartment that sleep 8 full grown men."),
("2019-01-11", "21648821", "Greg", "Very short walk to shops  restaurants  cafes (great coffee) and Coles. Being from the country  I was surprised at how quiet the streets was at night. I enjoyed the walk (12mins) to the station and getting the train into town."),
("2019-02-02", "21648821", "Joel", "Great place to stay!"),
("2019-02-06", "21648821", "婉琳", "屋子里居然没有空调 因为在一楼 开着窗s很吵很吵 难以想象 也许晚上外面很凉快 但是为了隐私又必须拉上窗帘 接着就是开电扇 很热很热 如果屋子配有空调就完美了 装修很好 位置一般 出行必须打车 价格昂贵"),
("2019-02-08", "21648821", "Sophie", "Great place to stay - Casandra and David had everything organised for us and communicated everything very well. Very easy check-in and check out. Central to shopping centres  restaurants and public transport. Uber into town approx $20  which was very easy."),
("2019-02-15", "21648821", "Nicole", "Great location so close to East Village. Great spot between airport and town and safe area with great buses to town or Bondi."),
("2019-02-16", "21648821", "Eryn", "Bright and modern house in a great location. Close to shops and parks. Perfect for a family get away."),
("2019-02-19", "21648821", "怡帆", "很糟糕的入住体验 房间和位置还行 但是房东不负责任 没有及时回应 一共入住4天3晚 第一天买了一袋食物晚上烧 煤气灶头却坏了 跟房东反馈 房东说明天上午来检修 让我们用BBQ炉子 第二天等了一整天 没有任何人联系来修理 房东只说抱歉 却没有任何行动 要等到第三天才来修理 BBQ也没有液化气无法使用!房东也只会说不好意思 很不负责!房间里面 硕大的蟑螂有好几只看见 很可怕!"),
("2019-02-28", "21648821", "James", "Fantastic apartment and location. Very spacious  modern and clean. Very prompt  clear communication at all times. Cassandra and David went out of there way to buy a travel cot for our six-month old too  which was greatly appreciated. Very useful having the underground car park too. Would definitely recommend this apartment as a great base from which to explore Sydney."),
("2017-12-31", "21815026", "Helena", "Very nice place to stay at :)"),
("2018-09-05", "21815026", "Brooke", "The host canceled this reservation 9 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-12-08", "21768317", "Marie", "Would recommend this stay to everyone  very clean stay  Jessie and James are very kind and helpful. We could use the public transport cards and a 4G card of them  They picked us up at the AirPort  put water and eggs in our fridge .. Good bus and train connections to Sydney and to Macquarie University. Very nice stay  everything you need is there. Thank you Jessie and James!"),
("2019-01-03", "21768317", "ZihSin", "Jess is very kind people  the house is very tidy and comfortable! We had a great experience!"),
("2014-01-31", "2161945", "Jianfeng", "Marcelle is very nice. The house is very good because it is near the beach. The house is very suitable to a big family."),
("2014-03-12", "2161945", "Aileen", "Ons verblijf in Maroubra Beach was zeer goed. Het huis ligt ideaal op slechts twee minuten lopen vanaf het strand. De baai is mooi  met veel surfers en een groot breed strand. Met het openbaar vervoer is de trip naar Sydney centrum goed te doen. Met twee kleine kinderen was de afstand misschien iets te groot (zo'n 45 min tot aan Circular Quay) maar als volwassene is het prima. Het huis hadden we helemaal voor onszelf en ideaal was de tuin aan de achterkant. Iedere avond hebben we hier de bbq aangestoken en heerlijk gegeten. Al met al was het een zeer goed verblijf."),
("2014-04-11", "2161945", "Fiona", "Fantastic location only a minutes walk from the awesome Maroubra surf beach.We hired the whole property which slept eight of us comfortably.The house was well equipped and the host had allowed use if all her kitchen gadgets. It was child friendly too.There was an excellent playground by the promenade and an ocean filled pool a 10 minute walk away.Good transport links to the Harbour area and other local beaches. Easy walk to supermarket with taxi back.Lovely row of cafés minutes from house with excellent choice of food and Seals club also.We had a fantastic stay in Maroubra!"),
("2014-06-06", "2161945", "Roseanne", "Marcelle's house is clean  big and comfortably accommodates 8 adults. If you love reading  there are plenty of books in the living area and kitchen.  The beach is 2 minutes walk from the house and a grocery shop nearby. On the day of arrival  Marcelle was at the house to welcome her guests.  My fellow Rotarians enjoyed their stay.  I never got to meet Marcelle but our communication was easy and reliable.  She even rearranged the bedrooms to meet our specifications. The WIFI at the house functions perfectly well and I was enable to keep in touch with our team in Maroubra while in San Souci.  One can easily access the CBD by a short bus ride to the train station. I would highly recommend a stay at Marcelle's residence to Sydney visitors looking for a beach-side house in a quite neighborhood. "),
("2014-07-16", "2161945", "Peter", "Had a great time in Sydney which was made even better by the stay at Marcelles lovely home . The house is spacious and well appointed with convenient access to the laid back Maroubra lifestyle or  easy access to the city as required . Marcelle left clear and concise instructions on everything to do with the house and further information for people not familiar with Sydney ."),
("2014-08-06", "2161945", "Kenneth", "We have a good stay at Marcelle's house at Maroubra Beach. The house is equipped with almost everything except WiFi and cloth dryer. Marcelle is very helpful and got us a hairdryer when we requested one from her.The only bad experience we had is from the dirty floor at the kitchen area. Just wear shoes inside the house if you don't want to have black ink on your barefoot. We informed Marcelle about the floor and she quickly cleaned it but still not perfect.Location of the house is only a few minutes walk to the beach and only 15 minutes drive to Sydney city or airport provided there is no congestion.  Overall  we are happy with the stay but it would be better if the house get cleaned regularly and hygiene level is improved. "),
("2014-08-13", "2161945", "Jacki", "There were 8 of us staying in this home and it was confortable and welcoming. The 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms were key for our stay and met our needs.The home was ready for us when we arrived and even thought it was not necessary it was available for late checkout. The community provided necessary groceries  a restaurant or 2 and coffee shops. I really wish we had gone in the summer as Mercelle's home is a quick walk to the beach. "),
("2014-09-02", "2161945", "Jack", "Great location  right by the beach. The place is cosy and furnished quite nicely. Bedrooms are large and comfortable. Definitely recommended."),
("2014-09-08", "2161945", "Tom", "Had a great stay with ample space. Very accommodating host. Beautiful location albeit the weather. Thank-you so much. Would definetly stay again"),
("2014-09-23", "2161945", "Paul", "Very nice place  close to the beach and shops. Relaxing and cosy house with spacious rooms! Only 15 min away from city and is very convenient with public transport! "),
("2014-10-07", "2161945", "Cameron", "Marcelle's house was a great place to stay. It's only a stones throw from the beach(best beach in the Eastern Suburbs) and even closer to a variety of coffee shops. Public transport is easily accessible from the house too. I would recommend this house to any anyone coming to see Sydney  especially since it can sleep up to 10 people."),
("2014-10-14", "2161945", "Regina", "We are group of 10 and have a great stay in Marcelle's place. Everything is as described. The house is close to the beach  transport and daily shoppings. Instructions for running the house are clear. Thanks and recommended."),
("2014-10-20", "2161945", "Whitney", "It was a pleasure staying in Marcella's home.  The house was well presented; each room even had travel toiletries.  The beds were comfortable and everyone enjoyed a good night sleep despite a small amount of noise from the neighbours.  Location was perfect  only a 5min walk to the beach and a short cab ride from the airport (~$50 for a maxi cab).  There were some lovely cafes and restaurants in walking distance and looked as though even more were about to open up.  Marcella was a fantastic host and I would definitely not hesitate to recommend a stay in her home."),
("2014-11-04", "2161945", "Anna", "Marcella is a welcoming host providing all the details that we needed about the house and the place.  It was close to the beach and shops and just a 15-20 minutes drive to the city."),
("2014-12-01", "2161945", "Gerard", "Marcella's house at Maroubra is a wonderful space that hosted our party of seven adults easily. Two minute walk to the beach and around the corner from a club  hotel and restaurants. We had a fantastic time. Marcella responded quickly to our request and was happy to accommodate a late departure. Thanks Marcella."),
("2014-12-11", "2161945", "Benjamin", "Had a great time at Marcella's place. Walking distance to the beach and food places. Transport into the city was also easily accessible with multiple routes to take. Would highly recommend this place for any group that is going to Sydney."),
("2014-12-15", "2161945", "David", "4 bee hives in the backyard when the host knew we were bringing children was not a good start. House needed a good airing out and kitchen a thorough wipe down. Also tv and dvd not working. Once we had come to terms with these drawbacks  the place was fine but not worth $500 a night in our opinion. "),
("2014-12-19", "2161945", "Jodie", "Marcella is an awesome host  such a lovely friendly lady who made us feel most welcomethe accommodation was perfectly described and we throughly enjoyed staying there  we would have no reservations in recommending Marcella or this property to anyone  "),
("2014-12-22", "2161945", "Gill", "Flying in from interstate  Marcella was flexible with arrival and departure times. House was very clean and in ideal location for beach and cafes. Felt very welcome with tea  coffee  cereal  milk etc.  Marcella supplied beach towels for us all on request.  All 9 of us really enjoyed our stay and would loved to have stayed much longer."),
("2015-01-05", "2161945", "Julia", "The house was perfect for our needs -- two minutes from the beach and close to shops  restaurants  the pub and a frequent bus service to Bondi Junction and Sydney.  The house is more spacious than it looks in the photos --  six people spanning three generations could have been difficult but it wasn't  we never felt on top of each other.  The rooms were all very nice and the kitchen well-equipped for the most part. We all enjoyed our stay  Marcella was very accommodating when we requested an additional night. I would definitely recommend this to my friends."),
("2015-01-20", "2161945", "H", "Marcella was a great host. Trying to organise holiday accommodation for 8 adults is never straightforward  but Marcella made life a lot simpler! She responded quickly to messages and was very flexible  giving me the option of adding an additional bed when my guest numbers changed last-minute.The house is in a great location  1 block away from a great beach & close to cafes and shops. The house is spacious (includes parking!) and each room is quite large - great place to stay."),
("2015-01-31", "2161945", "Ole", "Despite noisy neighbours and a few insects in the kitchen we had a nice stay. Good location near the beach and bus stop. Good space for our family of 6."),
("2015-02-02", "2161945", "Lexi", "I booked Marcella's place on behalf of family and she was extremely communicative in making sure their needs were met and that getting in was trouble-free. I would recommend dealing with Marcella without hesitation!"),
("2015-02-09", "2161945", "Kassandra", "Thank you for such a great stay. House was clean and a lot bigger then the photos make it look. Plenty of room for our large group. The spa upstairs was nice after our pamper night."),
("2015-02-20", "2161945", "Jill", "We were a party of seven including two children and one toddler. Marcella's descriptions of the the house were accurate and communication with her was very good. Her directions were clear and arrangements for collecting the key etc. clear and easy. The house was very close to the beach  shops and bus stops  we hardly needed to use the car while we were there.  There was plenty of room in the house to each have our own space as well as communal space.  We particularly liked the outside shower which was great to use after spending time at the beach. Marcella provided plenty of beach towels  which were much appreciated especially by our overseas visitors. The fans in each room were much appreciated as it was hot in Sydney while we were there. The neighbours were noisy a couple of times  this was more of a concern to us as there were young children in our party. We enjoyed our stay and Marcella's house was good value for money."),
("2015-02-24", "2161945", "Michael & Marcelle", "Marcella is a great communicator and her place was super for our three families of adults and children. Close to the beach  restaurants and a super playground. Thanks Marcella."),
("2015-03-02", "2161945", "Na", "The house is beautiful and lovely. There are a lot of stores nearby. The beach is only 50 meters faraway. There are a rock swimming pool nearby that I love the best."),
("2015-03-18", "2161945", "Yu Ting", "My family and I had a good stay at the accommodation. Marcella had clear instructions on necessities pasted around the house. The house has 4 bedrooms which are spacious ebough for up to 10 people! Also  there is a cardboard full of books of different categories  good for avid readers!The house is easily accessible to shops and eateries. The best thing the fact that it is so near to the scenic beach! Good for families or friends who want a short getaway!"),
("2015-03-30", "2161945", "Danny & Martha", "We stayed in a group of 11 and absolutely loved the house. It was clean and comfortable. Marcella provided everything we needed and more. While there are many books and household items of hers around  she made sure there was plenty of storage for us including heaps of space in the fridge and wardrobe space in each room. The location of the house is perfect. A very short walk to the beach but off the main drag so not too busy. Most importantly everything was as described or better. Thank you for opening up your space for us. "),
("2015-04-13", "2161945", "Matt", "We had an excellent time staying in Maroubra. Marcella was extremely welcoming to our group and was more than happy to tell us about the area. We look forward to returning one year"),
("2015-04-21", "2161945", "Dean", "We had a great weekend.  Marcella's house is beautifully placed near the beach a little hospitality strip.  We didn't spend a lot of the time at the house  but enjoyed the fact is was reasonably close to Randwick Racecourse (what we were there for) and not too far away from the city.  If you go there  make sure you check out the Spanish Restaurant just around the corner.  It was absolutely superb.  "),
("2015-04-28", "2161945", "Rob", "Great location and a lovely house  only wish I had more time to enjoy the area more.  The rooms were as expected and the space was warm and welcoming.  Thanks Marcella for a great stay in Sydney. :)"),
("2015-05-11", "2161945", "Alyssa", "First time using airbnb and Marcella's place has exceeded my expectations. Ideally located  it was quiet  yet close to everything. There was a great fenced park 2 min walk away for the kids. Well appointed  warm and homely with a fantastic library (which time did not permit me to enjoy). Would definitely recommend this place to a group of several families or friends."),
("2015-06-09", "2161945", "Peta", "We had a great stay. The place was well equipped and in a great location- walking distance to beach  park and cafes. "),
("2015-06-29", "2161945", "Rosie", "Marcella was very welcoming  even leaving us milk in the fridge! Her place is in a fantastic location  right near the beach  and was the perfect place for our family get together. Lovely and cozy in winter and would be fab in summer  so close to the beach. Would definitely stay again"),
("2015-07-06", "2161945", "Annemarie", "Thank you Marcella for this lovely home. We so enjoyed our visit. Your description of the house and area was perfect and your attention to detail in all the instructions was outstanding. I would highly recommend your place. Thank you also for being so quick to get back to me each time I contacted you and for your flexibility. A huge thank you again"),
("2015-08-03", "2161945", "Antony", "Marcella was very easy to contact and graciously accommodated my requests for early check in and late check out. We had no problems during our stay. (was a little cold at night but it was expected in winter and all the beds had electrical heaters)The house felt like a friend's home and was comfortable to stay in. There were 8 of us and the house did not feel cramped at all (except for when we had to take turns using the 2 bathrooms but that was not a big issue)The neighborhood was nice and quiet with no concerns about security.Parking was ample for 2 cars on the drive and there was plenty of street parking (just be careful if you have low lying cars as the driveway has an awkward angle that will give your bumpers a some affection especially if the car is loaded with passengers - found this out the hard way)All in all a very pleasant experience for my first AirBnb stay :) Thanks Marcella!"),
("2015-08-29", "2161945", "Sarah", "I needed a house for 6 of my operators as we were working nights at the Sydney Airport. We booked with Marcella as the location was perfect  we had a few hiccups with our start date on the run way and Marcella was nothing but a delight to deal with  she accommodated us the best she could and it is very much appreciated. We needed to add additional nights onto our stay and this was not a problem. Marcella is a amazing and from the feedback from my operators (6 men) the house is fantastic.We as a company and myself as an individual will defiantly book with Marcella at the City Surf Sun & Sand again."),
("2015-09-21", "2161945", "Mabel", "Marcella was very quick with her replies and very easy to get to the accommodation. Location was very good and near the beach. Her place was very spacious and more than enough room for our group. Accommodation was generally quite clean but perhaps the upstairs wasn't used as often so it was a bit dusty. We had a small welcome pack which was a very nice touch! The extensive library was very impressive  wished we have more time to make more use of it. "),
("2015-09-28", "2161945", "Elizabeth", "Marcella's welcome was very enthusiastic and warm. Her home is in a very quiet  safe area and very well positioned to the beach  corner shops  cafes and restaurants. "),
("2015-10-01", "2161945", "Han", "The house is very clean & roomy.  The location is excellent  minutes walking to beach and only half an hour bus to CBD.The book collection in the living area is a huge bonus.  After a long day  it's great to read a lovely book.  Many books I have as well  so it is more like reading at home."),
("2015-10-07", "2161945", "Carol", "This would make a perfect stay for a group of 8-10! Marcella has a cosy home with comfortable beds. She was a helpful host who considered all our needs and made suggestions and arrangements for us accordingly. The house is located a short walk away from the beach and local cafes for our coffee runs. We had 12 people (so we really pushed the limits!) and Marcella helped us arrange all the beds as we needed and allowed us the use of the couch and a spare single mattress - I especially appreciated the linen and towel which was set out in the lounge room for these two; it added a friendly welcoming touch! The comprehensive information provided in our Airbnb communications was also printed out and visible on the fridge so we didn't have to keep checking our phones. There was an ample number of power point spaces - crucial so there's no fighting over phone chargers. The only issue we had was that we couldn't turn on the fan ventilation in the kitchen despite following the instructions and pushing on all the buttons  there was a light which indicated something was on  but no fan. It made for a pretty stuffy kitchen especially since we happened to be there when it rose to 38 degrees. We tried to open up the back door but there were too many flying insects and mosquitoes all too eager to fly in and join the feast. We made do and had an enjoyable time regardless."),
("2015-10-11", "2161945", "Joo Young", "호스트가 부재중이였으나  메뉴얼에 따라서 체크인을 쉽게할 수 있었으며  비치와 샵이 가까이 있어 생활하기 편리했네요..집이 다소 지저분하것 빼고는 잘 쉬다 왔습니다^^"),
("2015-10-20", "2161945", "Pasha", "Very easy to find house with easy access to beach and nearby amenities. Keys provided so we were able to  move in without any hassle. all bedding was clean. i was concerned about 10 adults all staying on one place  the bedroom space was excellent with everyone having enough room at night  however the living space is small and we were not able to sit together anywhere in one room which was a shame as it was a special family get together - i recommend not too many adults because of this. - dining space max 6 people. limited outdoor space to sit and eat. besides this  it was a great opportunity to have time with people we hadn't seen for a very long time and this made up for it allthanks"),
("2015-10-27", "2161945", "Jennifer", "Our stay was lovely. Marcella was very accommodating and her home was lovely. Location was great  only a few min walk to the shops and the beach. Great communication and response from the start. She even let us have a late check out and was very understanding when one of the guests accidentally took a key home. I would definitelt recommend staying here."),
("2015-11-27", "2161945", "Megan", "Great!We got in early before the agreed time and Marcella allowed us to drop our bags off as the house was still being cleaned  this was greatly appreciated!Clean  neat  tidy  quiet  plenty of room and just a stones throw to nice cafes and the beach. If you're looking for something just a little quieter than busy Bondi  this is it!Thank you for having us!"),
("2015-12-15", "2161945", "Jo", "Marcella made us feel absolutely welcome and her place is in the most amazing location for a trip to Maroubra.  She was also so accommodating when our trip plans got changed and had to arrive a day later than originally planned.  Thanks for a great stay and I would definitely recommend Marcella's place  its tops and she's lovely."),
("2015-12-19", "2161945", "Shawn", "This is a very good location to the beach and near to CBD. The property is comfortable however it's quite dusty on the second floor and there's a lot of mosquitoes around the house. Some of us got bitten quite badly but owner did provide insect repellent. Bad luck for us on power failure on the 2nd day but owner got it fixed so no complaint on that  although update can be more prompt to remove the anxiety we faced when approaching the night time with the problem still outstanding."),
("2015-12-29", "2161945", "Sara", "Marcella is a great individual. She was more than happy for us to check in earlier. The location is really nice  only 2 min walk to a beautiful beach and also there are many great cafes around. However house was a bit dusty and older than we were thinking. There were some insects and cockroaches around. It wasn't big enough for 10 adults specially if you are traveling with family as there wasn't enough space in the living room for late night gatherings!  "),
("2016-01-05", "2161945", "Sharyn", "Brilliant location close to fabulous beach and shops.  Comfortably accommodated our group of 10.  Marcella ensured we had everything we needed and communicated well in the lead up to our stay."),
("2016-01-07", "2161945", "Peter", "Place was perfect for us. We were a group of 8 - beds were really comfy  bedrooms nicely furnished. Place is spacious  clean and family friendly. Large kitchen and living space worked well for us also. The beach and cafes were literally around the corner - ideal location. Space to park our cars was great as well. Marcella is a pleasure to deal with. Very positive experience!"),
("2016-02-29", "2161945", "Morgan", "Marcella was easy to deal with and it was simple to find all amenities in the house. Plenty of rooms for everyone in a large group to have their own space. Short walk to the beach and quick car ride to local shops."),
("2016-03-08", "2161945", "Christine", "Everything was well set up for our group of 11.  A great location and a comfortable base for our weekend in Sydney.  The kids really enjoyed the beach."),
("2016-03-12", "2161945", "Tim", "Marcella is a great host and available to contact as required. as this is a used house (not just rental space) the house is full of useful kitchen/living items to make the stay more user-friendly  although some may feel it is somewhat ""busy"". There is an extensive library for anyone with time to explore. The property is ideal for exploring Maroubra and the beach. Internally it feels a little dark without lights on- possibly due to proximity of other buildings and mature vegetation at the rear.  Heat at the time meant we needed fans in every room which were provided. Overall a great site and well located."),
("2016-03-16", "2161945", "Chi Lam", "We had total 7 people stayed for 3 nights. We all enjoyed a lot your spacious and tidy house!!! Walkable distance to the beach  shops  bars and restaurants  close to airport and downtown  your house is a really good place for a gang of friends or family for holiday!"),
("2016-03-30", "2161945", "Ankur", "We had very good experience in the house. Everything was available and in rightly manner. House has enough space and good collection of books.I would definitely recommend this to friends."),
("2016-03-31", "2161945", "Vivian", "The location of the house is excellent due to its vicinity to the Maroubra beach and downtown city.  The house is spacious  good enough for a big family or a group of friends.  It's also nice that the house has lots of cooking utensils that allow you to prepare food so we can make our own food sometimes.  The host is also very nice to let us use the seasoning in the kitchen.  The only comment of the house is a bit older than we expected and we encountered small insects inside.  The repellent that was provided in the house was useful in that case.Overall speaking  it's a nice stay for my family."),
("2016-04-04", "2161945", "Felicity", "What a great place!!! Location was brilliant! So close to the beach & cafe's The house fit is very comfortably! Everything you need is there. Just add food! Great first experience! Thanks so much"),
("2016-04-11", "2161945", "Whissie", "It's a nice house  clean  comfortable and everything is orderliness. We like it. "),
("2016-04-16", "2161945", "Mari", "Marcella is a great host.  Communicated with us when the house was ready.   The location and the size of the house was great  able to accommodate a party of 10 comfortably.  Cons:pillowskitchen-was so sobathroom- no hand soap"),
("2016-04-17", "2161945", "Jennifer", "Just had the most fabulous weekend with my family at Marcella's very welcoming home  perfect for the 9 of us.  So close to the beach and restaurants.  Without hesitation would go back again."),
("2016-05-01", "2161945", "Jacob", "Perfect location  house was wonderful and clean great communication from host A+++ "),
("2016-05-08", "2161945", "Sarah", "Marcella's home is in the best location and extremely suitable for a large group.  Rooms and living area have ample space.  I found it easy and a pleasure to deal with Marcella.  Thanks again for sharing your home with me and my friends."),
("2016-07-07", "2161945", "Wee Sheng", "Everything was good except that the house was abit small and wasn't much comfortable for our 12 ppl large group. Everything else was good enough. The host was great."),
("2016-07-11", "2161945", "Zhenhui", "You can find everything in this house. 20min from dt. Near beach. Recommend."),
("2016-07-21", "2161945", "Brendan", "The house was lovely and comfortable  very close to restaurants etc."),
("2016-07-25", "2161945", "Lee Anne", "Marcella was fantastic at communicating with us. She arranged for early cleaning & check in. Great location ! Couple of minutes to the beach. Excellent location for going into Sydney to see the sites. Also convenient to airport."),
("2016-08-01", "2161945", "Ollie", "Great host  great communication  great location. Would go back. Perfect place for a business retreat. "),
("2016-08-09", "2161945", "James", "Marcella's house was perfect for our reunion of two families (each of 2 adults and 2 kids). Both families were comfortable and at the same time not feeling that they were living on top of each other. The house had everything we needed to have meals in as well as a good choice of venues within 5 minutes walk. The area is great with the nice beach on the doorstep. The city was easy to access (40 mins by bus traffic permitting) with the bus stop just around the corner. No complaints from us and we will definitely consider staying again should we require so many beds!"),
("2016-08-17", "2161945", "Tracie", "great location. very close to beach. The check in procedure was easy and smooth. The house itself was clean and cosy. will definitely come back again! Thank you Marcella"),
("2016-08-25", "2161945", "Bernie", "A really great place to stay  handy to public transport and the beach. Off street parking is a bonus because it gets very hard to find a park on the weekends.The beds are comfy and there are plenty of them. 7 seniors stayed for one week and none of us have any complaints.There are plenty of kitchen utensils  plates  cups  glasses etc if you need them. We dined out quite a lot at the local restaurants which had pretty good tasting food.Next time we need to be in Sydney we will definitely be staying at Marcella's place  its got everything we need and it's close to the beach.Thank you for having us Marcella."),
("2016-08-27", "2161945", "Andrew", "Great place and location. Marcella was quick to reply prior to our stay."),
("2016-09-17", "2161945", "Paul", "Marcella was fantastic. She was more than happy to help and assist us in our needs. The location was great  close to the beach and neat little cafe's and convenience stores. The Maroubra ""Seals Club"" near by offered a venue which could easily cater for our large group providing great meals at cheap prices."),
("2016-09-24", "2161945", "Vivian", "We all enjoyed our time at your humble abode. Thank you  it is a beautiful home and everything was supplied we were all well looked after and I'll be sure to recommend this place to family and friends. Location was conveniently just a short stroll to the beach and shops. Thanks you Marcella "),
("2016-10-06", "2161945", "Adrian", "Nice and quiet neighbourhood. Extremely close to Maroubra Beach and several cafes and restaurants. House has a lived in  comfy feel with dozens if not hundreds of books on several bookshelves. Access was quick and easy and Marcella was easily contactable for all our questions. Internet is not blazingly fast but was more than sufficient for our needs."),
("2016-10-17", "2161945", "Jo", "Love  Love  Loved it.   Everything was within walking distance  the beach  lovely cafes and eateries as well as transport.Our host Marcella  was very accommodating to our needs and was always on hand to answer any questions or requests.I would without hesitation recommend to anyone looking for a place to stay would not be disappointed.Thank you Marcella."),
("2016-10-22", "2161945", "Brent", "location of this place is spot on with the coast line and shops only a short walk from the front door."),
("2016-11-11", "2161945", "Charito", "The house of Marcella was perfect for our group of 10. House was clean and comfortable  Well equipped with what we needed  clothes washer  electric iron  complete kitchen items since we did a lot of cooking esp. breakfast in the mornings. The backyard space was great for entertaining guests.The location was ideal  near the beach and walking distance to the bus stop going downtown. Marcella was very accomodatingand helpful and was ready to help when  we needed an extra key to unlock a bedroom and when the faucet in the kitchen sink got loose. Will definitely recommend this place for future stay. Thank you  Marcella for our positive new experience with the Airbnb."),
("2016-11-12", "2161945", "Barbara And Andrew", "We had a great time at this place. The location is fabulous with access to food outlets   a great coffee shop  Chalk and Clubs  providing multiple options to eat out.  The beach is so close and the bus stop a few minutes easy walking  with two buses to the Circular Quay  taking approx. 40 mins.Marcella's place is lived in  most of the beds are comfortable  the fans in the rooms were a great idea as it was warm when we there. Marcella communicated well and was responsive to questions. Check in was easy. "),
("2016-11-19", "2161945", "Grace", "Marcella was a wonderful host who was very accommodating to our needs and always tried to be flexible with check-in and check-out. The place is lovely  it was perfect for our big group and we all had a wonderful time there. And so close to the beach! We felt very welcome during our stay and would definitely recommend to anyone looking for a place for a group in Sydney. "),
("2016-11-25", "2161945", "David", "We had a great stay at Marcella's place. 4 big bedrooms spread over 2 levels means everyone had plenty of their own space. The fact that it is a 1 minute walk to the beach with plenty of cafes in between meant we could wander between the house and beach very easily! Great little outdoor area with table and chairs as well.Highly recommend it!"),
("2016-11-26", "2161945", "Hirini", "Everything you need is right there"),
("2016-12-10", "2161945", "Laura", "It was great for what we needed - we wanted 10 out of town family members to stay together for a wedding and marcellas place was great for that!"),
("2016-12-27", "2161945", "Ronan", "Fantastic location and a great space for a big family. Super close to the beach and very comfortable accommodation - we stayed over Christmas and very quickly felt at home. Marcella was quick to respond to any queries at all stages of our booking and stay. I would definitely recommend her place to future guests."),
("2017-01-01", "2161945", "Rafael", "Excellent location near the beach and cafes  pretty comfortable place that can host quite a lot people and nice friendly host. "),
("2017-01-06", "2161945", "Wesley", "Great house  only issue was I didn't realise there was no air con and the weather was pretty hot"),
("2017-01-07", "2161945", "Sophie", "Great location average house very cluttered  bathrooms and kitchen need a good clean heating and cooling very limited not good value for money "),
("2017-01-28", "2161945", "Ben", "Good place on the beach parks shops everything a your door step"),
("2017-02-06", "2161945", "James", "Everything was perfect. Marcella was very accommodating of our requests. Would definitely stay again."),
("2017-02-12", "2161945", "Mark", "House was in good location close to beach and cafes. However it was very hot and air conditioning would have been nice"),
("2017-02-18", "2161945", "Nic", "Would without a doubt stay again if travelling with a group."),
("2017-02-21", "2161945", "Charles", "Great Location. Clean and Tidy inside. Marcella was great to deal with."),
("2017-02-23", "2161945", "Grace", "Good place near the beach"),
("2017-03-05", "2161945", "Matthew", "Marcella is an incredibly helpful guest. When we requested if we could check in early after a long flight from the USA she went out of her way to insure the cleaners came early  which we were most thankful for  after a long flight "),
("2017-03-12", "2161945", "Jasmin", "We had a great weekend at Marcella's. Great location  close to beach  cafes etc. House was perfect in terms of space  interesting decor etc. Marcella made us feel very welcome! Thank you :) "),
("2017-03-18", "2161945", "Fiona", "Very interesting home. Lots of books. Bedding was excellent. Great value and convenient. Great communication and patience from host as I had a few issues setting up with Airbnb. Once that was sorted everything went smoothly and Marcella was very accommodating with any requests I had. Thanks heaps Marcella."),
("2017-03-25", "2161945", "Mohammed", "Great place to stay  great host  clean house  lots of options.Would love to be there next time!Recommended."),
("2017-04-02", "2161945", "Joel", "Great place to stay."),
("2017-04-08", "2161945", "Guy", "The house was perfect for what we were after with a number of us travelling to Sydney for an event. Location  could not have been better and facilities were great."),
("2017-04-14", "2161945", "Joshua", "Marcella was very helpful and easy to contact  and the place was great and have everything we need for a group of 9!The only downside was the floor wasn't that clean  but overall the place was huge and we had awesome stay!"),
("2017-04-24", "2161945", "Toni-Jade", "Fantastic location  spacious home with everything in walking distance. "),
("2017-04-30", "2161945", "Phoebe", "Everything is good. Just a bit dirty around the living room."),
("2017-05-06", "2161945", "Andrew", "Good spot"),
("2017-05-14", "2161945", "Katrina", "Marcella's home is a great for a group of 10-11 people. It was great to find a home that could accommodate a big group and still provide single bed options. The house was nice and cosy  had good sized living spaces and is so close to Maroubra beach  cafes  restaurants and shops. Parking is competitive but thankfully Marcella has a drive-way that you can park the car in.  The electric blankets were a nice touch for those who may stay during winter. Our group was comfortable and had plenty of space - thanks for the great stay!"),
("2017-05-29", "2161945", "Jignesh", "Marcella was very easy to communicate  all the bed arrangements are as expected. I would recommend this is good place for long or short term visit to Sydney "),
("2017-06-12", "2161945", "Hiro", "Our group of 14 friends and family has just had a very comfortable stay at Marcella’s house over the June long weekend. The communication with her was smooth  and the detailed info sheet and the house rule book explained all that we needed to know. She was also kind enough to rearrange the time for the post-departure cleaner so we could spend some extra time – which allowed me to go surfing and the others enjoy a walk along the beach. I’d recommend Marcella’s house for those seeking a comfortable/spacious place to stay close to a beautiful beach."),
("2017-06-18", "2161945", "Toni", "Wow. What a fantastic location. We parked our cars and walked to club  cafes  beach in a few minutes. The food at these places was also excellent. Marcella was so accomodating and her home was perfect for our large group of friends. We will definitely be returning if Marcella will have us but hopefully for more than 1 night. Thank you Marcella for sharing your lovely home with us. "),
("2017-07-02", "2161945", "Christine", "The location is very good"),
("2017-07-07", "2161945", "Binh", "Great place for a bunch of ppl who love traveling"),
("2017-07-09", "2161945", "Melody", "Marcella's place was beautiful! Close to the shops and the beautiful beach. Thanks so much Marcella!"),
("2017-07-15", "2161945", "Rob", "Great location  2 minutes from cafe's and the waterfront. Ideal for larger groups and families. The house was clean and tidy. Marcella is quick to respond to enquiries and made the check in process easy. I would recommend staying here. "),
("2017-08-12", "2161945", "Tai", "Marcella's place is very big and got lots of book. Near to the beach. But the floor is quite dirty and dust. We even need buy a mop to clean it by our own as we need to stay there for 4 days. Overall is great and nice."),
("2017-08-14", "2161945", "Mary", "Marcella's house was just what we wanted and as described in a great location."),
("2017-08-26", "2161945", "Paul", "Fantastic host and house in a great location  super close to beach and cafes. Would highly recommend for a short or longer term stay."),
("2017-09-09", "2161945", "Nicole", "Great location  in a beautiful part of sydney"),
("2017-09-18", "2161945", "Lisa", "Great location  2 minute walk to maroubra beach  local cafes and places within walking distance. The beach is beautiful and the area is not so far from the airport. Around 15-20 minute drive. The neighbourhood is quiet  and peaceful. Cleanliness of the place could have been better  with it being abit dusty and a few cockroaches here and there. Other than that  the hosts are quite friendly  easy to communicate with and easy going."),
("2017-09-25", "2161945", "Jayne", "Great location and caters for a big group."),
("2017-09-30", "2161945", "Yisheng", "this is a great place and landlord is very helpful."),
("2017-09-30", "2161945", "Peter", "The house was big and very nice  very comfy and Cousy.We really enjoyed our stay and had a lovely time at the home. It was very central to where we had to go."),
("2017-10-01", "2161945", "Benjamin", "Fantastic location  great spacious  private home near the beach and very close to cafes etc.. Apart from one small cleanliness issue can't fault this place. It was a great time away."),
("2017-10-07", "2161945", "Tom", "Perfect location  fantastic clean large house! Easy check in/ check out! 10/10"),
("2017-10-30", "2161945", "昕昊", "这个房子很棒 位置很好 就是距离超市比较远 附近没有什么超市 装修风格多样化 房间里有挂着和服 没有问可不可以穿 后院有烧烤炉 但是炭火需要去稍远的加油站买"),
("2017-11-06", "2161945", "Jordan", "Excellent location  plenty of space and perfect for a large group.  11 of us stayed and it was great."),
("2017-11-26", "2161945", "Sean", "Fantastic place in a great spot. Couldn't recommend more highly."),
("2017-12-19", "2161945", "Mahadi", "Near to beach & bus stop to city center"),
("2017-12-29", "2161945", "Nicholas", "Marcella was a great host and was very responsive to any inquiries we had. It was great to stay overall."),
("2018-01-04", "2161945", "Amit", "Great location with a fantastatic host"),
("2018-01-06", "2161945", "Jessica", "Great location walking distance to beach and cafes. Property has space for 2 cars which is very convenient. Host is quick to respond and very accommodating."),
("2018-01-13", "2161945", "Jade", "Excellent location to cafes  beaches and parks. Very quiet. Only thing when hot or air needed not many of the windows open  there are fans in bedrooms which help. Thanks for the stay."),
("2018-01-29", "2161945", "Robert", "A great location if you want to be close to the Eastern beach suburbs. Off street parking is handy and access was quite simple."),
("2018-02-03", "2161945", "Emily", "Perfectly located home for our group of 11. Right next to the beach  shops  cafes and restaurants. Good communication with the host. Great layout for social settings in the lounge room."),
("2018-02-11", "2161945", "Tai", "great location to beach n shops"),
("2018-02-15", "2161945", "花", "位置特别好 在离海边只要步行5分钟｡房东很热情随和 我们提前把行李放进去 退房后又放了一个多小时才拿走行李 非常满意｡房东是个非常热爱生活的人 各种厨房用具调料很全 简直是中国人的福音｡满意!"),
("2018-02-17", "2161945", "Lisa", "Great spot  plenty of room for everyone! Thank you "),
("2018-03-03", "2161945", "Jasmine", "Awesome host  awesome location  awesome house"),
("2018-03-30", "2161945", "Rajesh", "Wonderful stay for a large group. Highly recommended.Thank you"),
("2018-04-07", "2161945", "Gretta", "We had a wonderful stay at Marcella's place. The location is fantastic and Marcella was extremely friendly."),
("2018-04-23", "2161945", "Tanja", "Marcella's place is in a great location just minutes to walk from shops and restaurants. Loved the enviro conscious rubbish system and the full book shelf in the open kitchen/dining area. The house is cosy and our group loved the back yard to enjoy a coffee chat or our meetings together. Saying that  it would have been quite crowded to have them indoors ( rainy days?). We were there with 15 people  which i believe is too big a group for Marcella's house. The fridge capacity as well as sleeping arrangements ( if you look for average comfort in space and matresses) as well as dining space were not sufficient to host that many adults. Marcella answered to my inquiry for 'what to do?"" but could unfortunately  no find solutions to our space problems. They stayed unaddressed and no compensation was offered. All in all it s a 3 out of 5 for us."),
("2018-04-29", "2161945", "Holly", "A great location and very helpful host! We very much enjoyed our stay here."),
("2018-05-28", "2161945", "Ps", "If you want to be near the beaches it’s at a strategic location and excellent if you want to be near Maroubra beach. Very near shops - cafes  restaurants  small convenient stores. Within the area but not walking distance are many shopping centers including Westfield Eastgardens. This house is really about location. Actually house is cosy and spacious enough but it’ll be better if it is neater and cleaner. Walls are thin so big groups staying in the house can expect noise being heard anywhere in the house - you will hear people talking in the dining room downstairs and walking up/down the stairs when you are in the upstairs bedrooms. "),
("2018-06-03", "2161945", "Eliza", "Great location right near the beach. House was clean and a very comfortable stay. Would definitely stay here again if we’re back in Sydney!"),
("2018-06-09", "2161945", "Toni", "Marcella’s home is lovely. Our social group have now stayed there twice and very much enjoyed it. Everything is so convenient and the location is brilliant."),
("2018-06-16", "2161945", "Snoozle", "Well equipped and spacious for our family to stay and enjoy Maroubra. Great spot. Close to beach and shops."),
("2018-06-22", "2161945", "Stephen", "Great place for a big group! Very clean and easy to get to."),
("2018-07-01", "2161945", "Denise", "Marcella's home is in an amazing location just around the corner and walking distance from a wonderful array of restaurants  coffee shops and the beach and had ample room to host our party of 12.   Marcella was quick to respond and assist in all our queries.  Thanks so much for hosting us!"),
("2018-07-08", "2161945", "雪萍", "体验很好"),
("2018-07-16", "2161945", "Yousuf", "Great location and very responsive host. Highly recommend."),
("2018-07-29", "2161945", "Tiara", "The rooms were excellent not (Email hidden by Airbnb) munal areas were also spacious !!! So many things to look at and appreciate which definitely made for a homely stay . Definitely recommend!!!"),
("2018-08-12", "2161945", "Bradley", "Awesome place to stay"),
("2018-08-18", "2161945", "Sarah", "Fabulous to communicate with  everything was exactly as shown/described We would definitely stay again!! "),
("2018-08-25", "2161945", "Sandra", "Great experience all round. Thanks for accomodating us."),
("2018-08-26", "2161945", "Chris", "Very nice  spacious place close to the beach!  Also very convenient to the bus which we used to travel to the SCG. "),
("2018-09-09", "2161945", "Paul", "Great location and a large house able to accomodate a few families or separate individuals  each room is individually lockable. Very handy to all events or places in the Eastern suburbs. Great communication from the host  Marcella"),
("2018-09-15", "2161945", "Tor", "Great host  great house and fabulous location! Thanks so much for having us!"),
("2018-09-22", "2161945", "Bjarne", "Great spot will return anytime. We enjoy our stay"),
("2018-10-07", "2161945", "Tahni", "Close to beach. Very unclean - floors  sand in beds  cockroach in kitchen. Lack of cooking equipment - we had to go and purchase a frying pan."),
("2018-10-29", "2161945", "Mitchell", "Great location and perfect for a large group."),
("2018-11-17", "2161945", "Jacob", "Unfortunately  the house was not cleaned properly and meant that we had to wear shoes inside to stop dirt and grime from collecting on our socks/feet. Also  the house is very dark  the lounge and dining area (which are the only communal areas) felt like a cave most of the time. But is a great location in Maroubra and was quite affordable by Sydney standards."),
("2018-11-18", "2161945", "Steven", "Great place to stay. Highly recommend"),
("2018-11-25", "2161945", "Steve&Chloe", "Great location  easy walk to cafes and the beach!"),
("2018-12-02", "2161945", "Joe", "Fantastic location only a few minutes walk to the beach  cafes and shops. Just note that the house is a little dusty and sandy in parts."),
("2018-12-03", "2161945", "Jordan", "Very nice home  has all the amenities you need and is in a prime location!!"),
("2018-12-08", "2161945", "Jenna", "Excellent location. Just a very short walk from the beach and cafes.Easy communication with the host. Excellent layout of the accomodation giving everyone ample space if they need it."),
("2018-12-19", "2161945", "Celeste", "Very spacious home   great location close to the beach  comfortable beds with clean linen  off street parking was a bonus. Great home in a quiet Neighbourhood. Thanks Marcella for making our week in Sydney comfortable!"),
("2018-12-21", "2161945", "Rajesh", "Thanks a lot again for the wonderful stay."),
("2018-12-29", "2161945", "Braden", "Great location a few mins walk from the beach. Convenient for large groups. Communicative host with fast responses."),
("2019-01-01", "2161945", "Bijit", "Great place and Great host... Marcella offered us early check-in which saved my day and we could see the New year firewokrs...! Thanks heaps ....Really Enjoyed our stay and we ended up wanting to extend our stay . Great place and great location. I am willing to book again if i am here in near future."),
("2019-01-07", "2161945", "Jonathan", "Fantastic house  great location very comfortable and our host made everything so easy."),
("2019-01-16", "2161945", "Hannah", "Super handy location to beautiful Maroubra beach.  Able to accomodate our large group and very responsive to communication."),
("2019-01-27", "2161945", "Christopher", "Overall a very good house  the location amazing  5 minute walk to the beach along with several cafés and a pub. Quite comfortable for up to 10-12 guests  would be very cramped with 15 although it could be done! Very cozy  would definitely recommend to others!"),
("2019-02-02", "2161945", "Ryan", "Good place and really close to the beech"),
("2019-02-11", "2161945", "Fang", "房子位置不错 离海滩很近｡其他都完美 缺点就是没有空调 夏天房间有点热 不过好在晚上睡觉凉快点 不影响睡觉"),
("2019-02-16", "2161945", "Richard", "could not complain"),
("2019-02-22", "2161945", "Amanda", "Very nice place  super clean and cozy! Great location right next to the beach and rock pools. Plenty of space for a large group! 10/10"),
("2017-12-30", "21884466", "이", "Roomies were all very friendly  and room was clean!"),
("2018-01-05", "21884466", "Rohit", "Wonderful hosts that went out of their way to make our stay a good (Website hidden by Airbnb) of the best Airbnb experiences ive ever had"),
("2017-12-11", "21851474", "Justine", "This place was perfect for me while I was traveling solo in Sydney. It's close to buses  a bit of a walk to train stations  and close to a supermarket and lots of cafes.It can be a little loud in the area - mainly birds and dogs which I'm not used to - and you can hear the garage door opening when the car is driven in and out  but it didn't bother me at all. Perfect little place for one person."),
("2017-12-16", "21851474", "Geneva", "Beautiful space and great hospitality!"),
("2018-01-18", "21851474", "Harry", "It's a great  stylish place  with quick access to the city and trendy local areas. We loved it and would recommend. "),
("2018-02-18", "21851474", "Céline", "The place from Kristin was perfect for two people ! Everything was really clean and the design of the app was really nice !"),
("2018-02-27", "21851474", "Andrea", "Great stay!"),
("2018-03-06", "21851474", "Thomas", "Great space. Close to public transport to get into the CBD. Clean and tidy. Lots of privacy."),
("2018-03-14", "21851474", "Liz & Conrad", "This was one of our favorite Airbnb experiences and after traveling for 7 months straight have stayed in A LOT. The interior is stunning  clean  and makes great use of a small space. We had everything we needed and then some to cook meals in as well. The bathroom was very clean and spacious and there is a washer which came in handy. Would stay again!"),
("2018-03-16", "21851474", "Mallory", "Absolutely loved this space. It’s in the perfect area and just a walk away from Surry Hills. Kristin was a great host!"),
("2018-04-01", "21851474", "Sophie", "Really nice little place  and Kristin was really friendly and helpful. I had a problem with the wifi and they got it fixed straight away. Good communication  too."),
("2018-04-07", "21851474", "Stephanie", "We had a great stay! The space is beautifully designed and considered. It was exceptionally clean and tidy. Well located for public transport and great food and drinking spots a stones throw away.Thanks!"),
("2018-04-11", "21851474", "Andrea", "Second time I’ve stayed and again I was very happy with the place. Thank you!"),
("2018-04-14", "21851474", "Joel And Don", "The space is really luxurious and private and was the perfect location for my conference in Redfern. Didn’t meet my hosts but all communication leading up to my stay was great. The design and feel of the room and bathroom is top notch. Waterloo is a pretty lively locale and I didn’t always feel completely safe entering the property through the garage late at night. Only a minor bother. Thanks."),
("2018-04-21", "21851474", "Anna", "Kristin and Nichola’s place was such a lovely space. Thoughtfully designed  stylish and a great location. Communication was great. Would definitely stay again and would recommend to friends."),
("2018-04-23", "21851474", "Mai", "It was such a nice stay at Kristin’s. Stylish  clean  convenient and very hospitable.Definitely recommend!"),
("2018-05-19", "21851474", "Charlie", "Very cute studio in a great location!"),
("2018-05-26", "21851474", "Mathew", "Visited Sydney for a work trip and this place was perfect. Easy to access late at night  a nice walk to public transport and had everything I needed. Will stay again"),
("2018-06-03", "21851474", "Marta", "This is a great little apartment in a quiet back street  great wifi and amenities!"),
("2018-06-12", "21851474", "Vanessa", "Great location  clean and comfy home  and all the amenities you need. Communication was easy and directions for the apartment were detailed and helpful. I would absolutely stay here again."),
("2018-07-01", "21851474", "Kain", "great  stylish little place to wake up in. quiet yet central location in Sydney. :)"),
("2018-07-17", "21851474", "Lindsay", "A beatifully designed studio apartment  well connected for city. Great hosts."),
("2018-08-04", "21851474", "Remy", "Standard studio apartment  clean  good value."),
("2018-08-05", "21851474", "Alayne", "Trendy spot  very clean and private. Walkable to cafes etc."),
("2018-08-14", "21851474", "Vic", "A nicely designed space  great shower."),
("2018-08-19", "21851474", "Andreas", "The place is really nice. The bed is conformable. Everything was clean and tidy."),
("2018-09-03", "21851474", "Fiona", "Nice and easy location."),
("2018-09-09", "21851474", "Georgina", "We loved our stay at Kristin’s!The location is amazing and we walked everywhere from the house.The room is very comfortable and clean. Perfect for two people.We would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-09-26", "21851474", "Jeremy", "Lovely space  and great hosts."),
("2018-10-13", "21851474", "Ernest", "A very simple yet stylish place. Easy check in and check out."),
("2018-10-22", "21851474", "Karen", "Amazing shower room. Excellent accommodation  and sparkling clean xx"),
("2018-10-26", "21851474", "Yong Sheng Mitchell", "Very cosy  beautifully designed place with extremely accommodating host (allowing me to extend my check in and out timings). Location is comparatively good  with accessible public transport to the city. However  I do recommend renting a car for leisure travel as there are ample free parking in the neighbourhood. Amenities were well stocked and good quality  bed was comfy with good ventilation (air-con and fan available). There were a few small insects seen during the stay as the room is built above a garage space. That said  it was neat and clean looking when we first arrived!"),
("2018-10-28", "21851474", "Max", "A great place  clean  stylish and convenient. The bird sound in the early morning may be a nuisance to somebody want to get up late."),
("2018-10-31", "21851474", "Bill", "Great location very comfortable studio apartment with a quality finish."),
("2018-11-04", "21851474", "Niamh", "Lovely little studio!"),
("2018-11-14", "21851474", "Jeremy", "Moments away from galleries cafes and numerous other points of interest."),
("2018-11-18", "21851474", "Joo Yee", "Great place to be at if you want some place relaxing."),
("2018-11-22", "21851474", "Loryn", "Very quick responses. Accommodation was tidy."),
("2018-11-25", "21851474", "Lucy", "Great home with everything you could need!"),
("2018-12-09", "21851474", "Shuh", "Lovely guest pad that is separate from the main house which gives us privacy. The space is modern and beautiful as listed. We had a lovely and comfortable stay. Thank you!"),
("2018-12-13", "21851474", "David", "Beautifully styled and furnished apartment  handily located near public transport with easy access into central Sydney. Kristin and Nichola are very helpful and made our stay memorable!"),
("2018-12-22", "21851474", "Loren", "Lovely place in a great location :) The studio is modern  clean and practical... the perfect place between the beaches and the city!"),
("2018-12-24", "21851474", "Adelynn", "This space is cozy and really well designed. Materials used were great so gave a really solid and homey feel to it. Amenities were great. The space was used really well so while it looked minimal when we first came in  all the stuff we needed was in the cupboards. Love this place."),
("2018-12-29", "21851474", "Sharon", "We had a pleasant stay at Kristin's place which is easily accessible via public transport. The studio had a modern feel and the bed was very comfortable! Bathroom had plenty of amenities. Overall  we enjoyed our stay here and would recommend Kristin's place to other travellers!"),
("2019-01-03", "21851474", "Adrien", "What a Nice stay in Sydney ! Great place close to Sydney City. Near the bus and all facilities around. Stylish brand new bedroom and bathroom ! We recommand !"),
("2019-01-12", "21851474", "Loren", "Awesome place  I stayed here twice during my trip - Lovely clean apartment :)"),
("2019-01-26", "21851474", "Larissa", "Great place!"),
("2019-02-03", "21851474", "Marti", "Awesome stay! This little suite is perfect for two. Plenty of space to spread out and lots of amenities. Very clean  and hosts are super responsive and helpful. Found the walk over to Redfern quick and easy to the shops and restaurants and about a 12 min walk to the trains...bus was very efficient too. Love it!"),
("2019-02-23", "21851474", "Laura", "We are a couple with a toddler and we stayed in this apartment for 3 weeks. It’s small but well designed with a great use of space  it was absolutely perfect for us. Comfy bed  very well equipped kitchen and great bathroom! There was also a portacot and highchair for us to use which was great. Lots of public transport options nearby. A perfect base in Sydney."),
("2019-02-24", "21851474", "Leslie", "Stylish place  great stay!"),
("2019-03-01", "21851474", "Nina", "The apartment is in a very central location  convenient from the airport  bus stop is right outside the apartment to get around the city. Very quiet. Amazing large bed and hotel quality sheets and towels. The apartment has absolutely everything you need. Great kitchen  AC  tips  easy check in. Highly recommend the apartment! Fast responses from the hosts! Excellent stay in overall!"),
("2019-03-03", "21851474", "Ruby", "Cozy studio  very bright apartment. Comfortable bed"),
("2018-01-01", "21884991", "Lois&", "Ive was a lovely host who made us feel very welcome"),
("2018-02-02", "21884991", "Rongye", "happy"),
("2018-04-19", "21884991", "Kenley", "The host canceled this reservation 81 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-09-09", "21920190", "Samantha", "The host canceled this reservation 107 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-12-02", "21992856", "Brandon", "The apartment is small but in a great location. Good value."),
("2018-01-01", "21939239", "James", "Don was a really helpful host who responded straight away to all our questions. The apartment itself is very nice and also located in a great area. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-01-02", "21939239", "Alejo", "The best place where I have hosted ever !! And Don have been the only Airbnb host who thinks in each detail to make us feel comfortable and plenty . Thanks"),
("2018-01-05", "21939239", "Kristine", "This location in Surry Hills is very convenient to the SCG and Sydney CBD.The apartment is stylish   clean and quiet  and host Don is very helpful with anything you need to know. Also for us  we loved the inner city feel  its vibe  and the funky cafes in the surrounding streets. Dons place has plenty to offer if you love walking around in an interesting neighborhood."),
("2018-01-15", "21939239", "Damien", "This is a brilliant place to stay if you want to be in the middle of Surry Hills and yet cocooned at the end of a little laneway. There are so many great cafes  restaurants  shops and yoga classes within walking distance  but if you need a car there are at least 10 GoGet cars within minutes walking distance. The space is lovely and clean and Don has lived there for a long time so can give great advice on local things to check out. Great for a couple or one person. I'll definitely be back!"),
("2018-01-21", "21939239", "Mario", "Don’s place exceeded all our expectations. The location was is the heart of Surrey Hills. The apartment was the spacious and had a beautiful patio. Not too mention very clean and new. Don’s hospitality was fantastic and I couldn’t ask for more. He made us feel at home!"),
("2018-01-25", "21939239", "A J", "If you are wanting to experience living in arguably Sydney’s best neighborhood  look no further than one of Don’s perfectly appointed apartments in Surrey Hills.  Located in a terrace house playfully and surprisingly accurately named after Barbary Lane  the multistory (and multi-storied) complex in Armistead Maupin’s Tales Of The City  you can easily blend into the vibrant local scene.  Shops  restaurants  and nightlife are all within the surrounding blocks; while the major attractions like the opera house and Harbour Bridge are either a short ride or slightly longer walk away.  Both apartments feature outdoor space; well-equipped kitchens and bathrooms; washer/dryer; air conditioning; and designated living  dining & sleeping areas.  Everything was spotless; the mattress was comfortable; and the towels were soft and fluffy. Don was the perfect host — excellent communication  there whenever you needed him and yet invisible if want/need privacy.  He even offered to take me and my rather cumbersome bike box to the airport.  On a national holiday  no less!  I would happily stay here again during future trips to Sydney."),
("2018-02-02", "21939239", "Justin", "I stayed in Don's apartment for a week. It's a large studio  nice and private  and very comfortable. It's a short walk to all that Surrey Hills has to offer. (And that's a lot!) I'd definitely stay here again."),
("2018-02-04", "21939239", "Samantha", "Booked the accommodation for my aunt and her fiancé during their visit. Everything went well. Don is always responsive when needed. Thanks for hosting them! :)"),
("2018-02-06", "21939239", "Laina", "Such a lovely space  exactly as depicted.  All the amenities you could ask for with a few thoughtful touches thrown in.  Don was super responsive and check in was a breeze.  Can highly recommend  and would definitely stay here again next time I'm in Sydney!"),
("2018-02-15", "21939239", "Mary-Ellen", "I really enjoyed my stay at Don's well appointed  comfortable and quiet inner city pied a terre. Really great location and had everything I needed. Don was a courteous and pleasant host. I would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-02-26", "21939239", "Francesco", "Don's flat is spacious and cozy and it has everything you need to enjoy a great stay  including a nice little garden and a fully equipped kitchen.The flat is very quite but it's just around the  corner from so many superb cafes and restaurants. The area  Surry Hills  is in my opinion the most vibrant and interesting in Sydney and Don's place is right in its heart.Don is a fantastic host and a very nice person: communication was great from the moment I booked to when I checked out and during my 9-day stay he constantly made sure I was enjoying my staying. And I certainly did: I hope I'll have the chance to travel again to Sydney and stay at Don's flat once more"),
("2018-03-04", "21939239", "Kylie", "Don's place is a beautiful  clean apartment with a secluded courtyard  a beautiful respite from exploring Sydney streets. There is lots to see and do within walking distance. Don was extremely responsive to messages and even met us at the corner of the lane to make sure we didn't get lost finding the place. Our flight wasn't till the evening and even though we had to check out earlier in the day he stored our bags for us till we needed them. Overall this apartment was everything we needed including incredibly fluffy towels and the most comfortable pillows! We wish we had booked another night!!"),
("2018-03-24", "21939239", "Carol", "I can honestly say that Don is one of the best (and nicest)  hosts in my experience.  Besides having a place that is super clean and has a comfortable bed/furnishings  he has thought of everything that you might need/want for your visit.  The kitchen has everything you need to cook if you don't want to eat out every night  he provided granola/milk/cookies   a card with 2 coffees from a local coffee shop  power converters  a hair dryer  and a line and clothes pins to dry your clothes outside if you like (he has a washer and dryer).   He responded immediately when I had questions about anything.  Oh  and the place is super quite.  I never heard any street noise (even though Surry Hills is a happening place).  There are a ton of good places to eat nearby that aren't super expensive compared to other parts of Sydney. You will love it at Don's place!"),
("2018-03-27", "21939239", "Zoe", "Great little studio in an awesome neighborhood. Lots of cafes  bars  shops nearby and easy access to many busses or a 10 minute walk to Central train station. We also appreciated that there were dishes  cooking supplies  and a few basics in the kitchen to make the stay even more comfortable. Don was quick to respond to all messages and very welcoming."),
("2018-04-06", "21939239", "Kathi", "Surry Hills is just adorable and Don’s place is a perfect retreat.  Really cute space  private outdoor area  comfy bed  sparkling clean with good linens and great location.  We use Airbnb frequently and this was one on top of the list.  Many thoughtful touches.  For a traveling couple having washer  dryer  equipped kitchen make for a great stay.  Thank you Don!"),
("2018-04-08", "21939239", "Elijah", "Beautiful hidden apartment  very well presented  everything you need at your fingertips  great host  great communication  will definitely be back next time I'm in Sydney!! Thanks for everything Don!!"),
("2018-04-13", "21939239", "Simon", "What a great place to stay at. Central  close to good restaurants and nightlife and had a great feel to it. The amenities were perfect and Don was a very helpful host  thank you. I would definitely return."),
("2018-04-15", "21939239", "Kelly", "Don was a great host and very hospitable. My girlfriend and I also enjoyed a good cup of coffee at the nearby cafe on Don’s tab. The central location was perfect for our trip  walkable to a bunch of restaurants and gelato. The unit was awesome  with everything we needed. It was also void of any outside noises  so we got a great night’s rest. Great place. Great stay."),
("2018-04-23", "21939239", "Sandra", "Don is an amazing host  nothing is too much trouble  very welcoming and friendly  making sure that you have everything you need.  The apartment is beautifully clean and well equipped with lots of extras that you would not expect. Everything from first booking to check in has been seamless and Don's response rate is first class. The apartment is so well situated  really central and convenient.  Cant fault this apartment and will definitely be returning  thank you Don for your amazing hospitality and attention to detail!"),
("2018-04-30", "21939239", "Kayla", "An excellent stay in Surry Hills. The location was perfect  close (and far enough away) from the train station  and buses. The studio unit was equipped with all the necessities for a great stay. Don was a superb host - nice to be met on arrival  and he gave some great local food and coffee suggestions."),
("2018-05-08", "21939239", "Duane", "I've been staying in airbnb rentals for more than six years and I can say without hesitation that Don's place in Surry Hills was my best Airbnb experience to date. Don's hospitality was first rate - he responding quickly to my inquires  greeting me upon my arrival  and made sure I had everything I needed for a comfortable experience. The rental itself was sparkling clean and comfortable.  I was amazed at how quiet it was  being in the middle of a large city. The location is wonderful - just a short walk from Central station with a bus stop less than a block away. In addition  there are lots of fine restaurants in close proximity. My two favorites for breakfast were Cafe Con Leche just across Fitzroy Street and Suzie Q  a short walk away on Hutchinson.  I had a wonderful 7 night stay at Don's place in Surry Hills and I highly recommend.  A great value!"),
("2018-05-10", "21939239", "Karen", "This place was great. Only stayed a night but very clean and had everything I needed. Don was very helpful in showing me everything. Would recommend."),
("2018-05-10", "21939239", "Chey", "Great accommodation.  Thanks"),
("2018-05-12", "21939239", "Josephine", "Great location"),
("2018-05-24", "21939239", "Chris", "Good location nice clean apartment"),
("2018-05-26", "21939239", "Kate", "A fantastic find in a perfect location. Don's communication made the stay easy. A perfect  affordable space for a couple to explore the city."),
("2018-05-30", "21939239", "Heidi", "Fantastic apartment in a fantastic spot. So close to great food and transport. It had everything you could need - and all the appliances and furniture etc were quality and seemed brand new. Very clean. The only negative for us was the mattress on the bed was very firm - we prefer a softer one. But won’t stop us staying again :)"),
("2018-06-02", "21939239", "Heather", "Great little apartment close to everything! Would recommend for anyone wanting to be close to the city."),
("2018-06-18", "21939239", "Charlotte", "Unfortunately my stay with Don was cut short as he changed his mind about allowing my dog to stay with me  but other than this the apartment is perfect in every way. It’s a great area and well equipped  and I’d definitely recommend it especially for shorter stays. While I was disappointed in my stay - I understand it was a very particular situation that will probably not apply to future guests as I imagine Don will now implement a strict no-pets policy."),
("2018-06-25", "21939239", "Jesse", "Great location & service."),
("2018-07-05", "21939239", "Stéphane", "Don est très accueillant et serviable  l'appartement se trouve idéalement dans Surry Hill  proche de la gare (15 min à pied)  arrêt de bus à 300m  des restaurants  cafés et bars. Tout était propre et il y avait tout à dispostion  tout est neuf idéal pour une longue durée et surtout un très bon WIFI. Je le recommande sans aucune hésitation. À bientôt"),
("2018-07-08", "21939239", "Joel", "Very convenient  clean and well presented. I would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-07-12", "21939239", "Philip", "Don sure deserves his super host. Could not fault a thing Thanks Don"),
("2018-07-20", "21939239", "Antje", "Schönes  gut ausgestattetes Appartment in ruhiger Umgebung. Im Viertel sind einige Restaurants und coole Bars  die gut zu Fuss zu erreichen sind. Don war ein sehr aufmerksamer Gastgeber.  "),
("2018-07-29", "21939239", "Ann", "The apartment is spacious  clean and comfortable. Very convenient location. There are many good restaurants and cafes nearby. Public transportation within walking distance. Don is a friendly and kind host. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-08-03", "21939239", "Daniela", "Don was very kind  everything in the apartment was very clean  the apartment has everything you could need. The neighborhood is quiet and near to supermarket  convenience store and easy walking to sydney center. Could not be better. "),
("2018-08-05", "21939239", "Kate", "Don was a fantastic host. Easy to communicate with and always responded quickly. The location was perfect  close to pubs  restaurants and an easy walk to the SCG. The apartment was clean and tidy and had all the comforts of home. Really appreciated the coffee card with 2 pre paid coffees for the local cafe! Would stay here again!"),
("2018-08-12", "21939239", "Salpy", "Thank you so much Don we enjoyed our weekend stay very much. definatly will stay again"),
("2018-08-16", "21939239", "Gerry", "Don was an amazing host offering all amenities even the ones you wouldn’t think about. From all the basics down to the awesome towel warmer  the place had everything and Don was willing to help with any detail. I highly recommend it! "),
("2018-08-22", "21939239", "Bonnie", "Room is sooo clean. He is very nice and good location. Perfect airbnb!!"),
("2018-08-26", "21939239", "Tim", "Magnificent space  great location  host couldn't have been better. Highly recommended if you want a place anywhere around Surry Hills."),
("2018-08-31", "21939239", "Daniel", "Beautiful comfortable space that has great attention to detail - amazing  caring & attentive host.I highly recommend this for great inner city getaway - quiet and safe too. Amazing comfortable bed and lounge. Kitchen has everything you need in terms of pots and pans. "),
("2018-09-04", "21939239", "Jamie", "Thoughtful host  great communication  perfect Surry Hills location. My 2nd time staying with Don. I hope to be back."),
("2018-09-07", "21939239", "Dan", "Don's place was perfect! The space is spacious and clean and it was a pleasure staying there for the three nights that I was in town. The location is fantastic  and Don was extremely friendly and helpful. I'd definitely stay there again next time I'm in Sydney!"),
("2018-09-09", "21939239", "Alex", "Dons place was great - super clean  with all the amenities of hotels that usually carry a much heftier price tag. Best part was that Don was an absolute lifesaver - my flight was cancelled and I needed somewhere to stay but booked late at night on a Friday - Don gave up his evening to come and meet me personally and make sure I was settled in. Highly recommend anyone visiting Sydney!"),
("2018-09-15", "21939239", "Stephanie", "Wonderful place. Perfect location and convenient to walk everywhere. My husband and I really enjoyed the neighborhood. The place has nice amenities and was very clean and taken care of well. We are thankful for Don’s hospitality and the coffee was a nice touch."),
("2018-09-21", "21939239", "Simon", "What a great place to stay at  central great restaurants close by and the accommodation has everything you need.  Thanks Don for a great stay."),
("2018-10-01", "21939239", "John", "We will always be grateful for the wonderful experience of staying in two of Don's units/Flats in Surry Hills in September 2018. We are certain that we could not have stayed anywhere else within our budget that would have been a better experience. Don is a top bloke an absolute gentlemen his kindness will never be forgotten. We will not hesitate to recommend Don's units to any of our family  friends and colleagues if ever they plan to visit Sydney Australia. Don's units are modern  stylish and very comfortable  we were fortunate to find this gem of a place."),
("2018-10-06", "21939239", "Yuyan", "Don was friendly and helpful  would highly recommend..."),
("2018-10-14", "21939239", "Armando", "Very nice private place and wonderful neighborhood."),
("2018-10-18", "21939239", "Mat", "Fantastic space at Don's apartment. A delight to stay in and I will be back for sure."),
("2018-10-22", "21939239", "Suzanna", "Recommendable"),
("2018-10-25", "21939239", "Mat", "I really love staying at Don's apartment. It's large and light  very modern and in a great area. I will be back for sure."),
("2018-10-28", "21939239", "Tatiana", "Wonderful flat in Surry Hills! The place was exactly as listed and a perfect location. Great updated furniture and appliances- a towel warmer was an added bonus! Don communicated well and it was great to have him accessible in the flat above.. we blew a fuse and he was down to help out in moments. He was also kind to leave a card prepaid for two coffees at the cafe across the street.  Would 100% stay here again!!"),
("2018-11-01", "21939239", "Mat", "As always  a great stay at Don's beautiful apartment."),
("2018-11-14", "21939239", "Youngji", "It was just PERFECT place to stay! better than picture; SUPER CLEAN! 5G wifi  great amenity  awesome facility(fridge  smart tv  fan  air con  microwave)  large space  free coffee coupon!Don is really kind and nice. It is absolutely much better than hotel! amazing experience. HIGHLY RECOMMEND."),
("2018-11-19", "21939239", "Manos", "Very clean place and everything you need is in there. He responds really fast and he is willing to help you with anything! Just ask him."),
("2018-12-07", "21939239", "Elizabeth", "Great place to stay in Surry Hills!   Wonderful location and host."),
("2018-12-09", "21939239", "Somnuk", "Clean central great little townhouse will everything you need"),
("2018-12-10", "21939239", "Cherie", "Seriously great location and Don is a very knowledgeable host ."),
("2018-12-17", "21939239", "Guy", "Incredible location  sparkling clean and a fantastic host who responds quickly and goes the extra mile. Very thoughtful and helpful - all round a fantastic stay in Surry Hills and great value. Highly recommend to all."),
("2018-12-20", "21939239", "Susanne", "Dons place is a travelers heaven  as a constant Air B&B user for Business  l found Don’s place a wonderful retreat  a true gem with quality amenities  beautiful high end decor right down to the cutlery.  Thankyou ."),
("2018-12-29", "21939239", "Marek", "We really enjoyed our stay at Don's place. It's such a cozy little studio in a good location. Very quiet and comfortable. Don is a fantastic host who let us stay longer on the check out day as our flight was not until late evening. The place has everything you need and is super clean. Would definitely stay again in the future!"),
("2019-01-01", "21939239", "Rosie", "What a cute trendy studio apartment with awesome set up. Best host ever and location is super amazing with restaurants all around. Love the ability to contact Don anytime for small needs and the quality of bed  pillows and linen was super high. High quality touches I personally appreciate. ThanksCan't wait to stay again xx"),
("2019-01-02", "21939239", "Jenny", "Don is a fantastic host. Excellent communicator and very friendly and accommodating. The apartment was well equipped  clean  comfortable and quiet  and well located near bus stops and Crown Street. Would love to stay here again."),
("2019-01-06", "21939239", "Gregory", "Fantastic -thanks for having us."),
("2019-01-09", "21939239", "Tim", "This is a brilliant place to stay  kept perfectly clean  in a great part of Sydney and overall a wonderful experience."),
("2019-01-11", "21939239", "Bee", "Very clean  better experience than staying at a hotel. Don was courteous and helpful  would recommend Don's place to anyone wanting to stay in Sydney!"),
("2019-02-02", "21939239", "Mat", "Always a pleasure to stay at Don's lovely apartment. It's a home away from home."),
("2019-02-10", "21939239", "Jovana", "This a great studio in an excellent location. There is a washer and dryer that's very convenient for travel  and all the basics in the kitchen for cooking. I'd say it's easily big enough for 1-2 people. My fiance and I stayed here for a week together and loved it. We really fell in love with the neighborhood while we were there. Surry Hills is such a cute neighborhood with a bunch of delicious restaurants nearby. This apartment is very close to a couple of great bakeries and a gelato shop that we frequented often. There are also multiple grocery stores of varying sizes within walking distance (5-10 minutes). It's right next to a park that's great to relax at. There are a couple of bus stops that are a 2-5 minute walk away  and Central station (train and bus stop) is only a 10 minute walk away. We didn't have a car and only used the buses to get around  and it worked out really well. It is only about a 15 minute bus ride to the downtown Sydney area with the Opera House  and a very scenic (over the bridge) 45 minute bus ride to the zoo. We really enjoyed our trip to Sydney  and would recommend this apartment to others if they plan to visit."),
("2019-02-16", "21939239", "Tracey", "Dons place is wonderful absolutely loved it... it’s very stylish ideal for a couple.. it was also very clean and Don had left some lovely touches as it was stocked up with tea coffee sugar even a bottle of milk which was definitely appreciated as we only arrived late at night. The apartment is ideally situated very close to bars and restaurants and also the train station... I would definitely recommend and I would love to stay here again... it was nice to know that Don was there and you know that you could call on him whatever the time day or night"),
("2019-02-24", "21939239", "Nikhil", "Don's place is in a fantastic location in surry hills. Close to the best cafes and restaurants Sydney has to offer. The apartment is spacious  clean and has all the amenties for a comfortable stay in Sydney"),
("2019-03-03", "21939239", "Johnnie", "Five Stars!!!! Amazing host who is super professional and attentive. This was my favorite Airbnb rental ever and I have rented quite a few.  Amazing space that is clean  modern  and nestled in the best neighborhood. The space boast all the comforts you should expect on vacation and many more. I highly recommend this space and I can’t wait to return to Sydney to stay again."),
("2017-12-06", "21971876", "Madhu", "The host canceled this reservation 21 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-01-03", "21971876", "Fiona", "Juliette's home had the most stunning views of the sea from her living room and is only a short car or bus journey to the nearest beach.The room is exactly as seen in the pictures with lots of useful amenities such as your own TV with foxtel  fridge and microwave. Juliette was very speedy to respond to any queries  helpful with local knowledge and would go out of her way to help  e.g. we mentioned we were going to visit the Blue Mountains the next day  and quickly Juliette was on on the phone to her neighbour asking about local spots to see/hike that were less touristy.I would highly recommend staying with Juliette and I would love to stay there again if I'm in the area."),
("2018-01-27", "21971876", "Jacques", "Great large room  with two very comfortable beds. One single and one queen  perfect for the two of us on a work trip. Loads of shelving to unpack into  with a small bar fridge for left overs. A desk in the room was fantastic as a computer desk for our stay. Juliette invited us to use anything in he kitchen for cooking  as well as provided us with delicious filtered water and space in her family fridge.The bathroom was clean and sizeable  private and accessible  just across from where the room was. Access to the patio and garden through the room too! Lovely family and supportive vibe in the house  I’ll certainly be back next time I’m in town! Thanks again Juliette!"),
("2018-02-15", "21971876", "Marty", "A delightful family  lovely big room  in a clean and welcoming house! Thanks for having me "),
("2018-02-25", "21971876", "Gilles", "Nice room ans freshwater is a great place!!"),
("2018-03-11", "21971876", "Andora Michi", "Great place  super friendly family. We had an amazing time staying at Juliette' house. Absolutely recommended :)"),
("2018-03-16", "21971876", "Mick", "Juliette has a beautiful  modern and spacious home. She welcomes you with a smile and three wonderful children. Prepare to become their new best friends. The home is well equipped and Juliette is an exceptional host. Thank you forking us feel so welcome. I would have loved to stay longer."),
("2018-03-20", "21971876", "Marine", "We really enjoy our stay at Juliette’sThe house is nice modern and brightThe room was big enough for 3 with everything we need. The bathroom just for us was a plus and very niceJuliette is so lovely and welcomingThank you :)"),
("2018-04-12", "21971876", "Rosemary", "Juliette's place is beautiful  magnificent views. I was made so welcome. it was a joy to stay with them. "),
("2018-04-20", "21971876", "Daya", "Beautiful place with a beautiful  accomodating family that made us feel right at home! Will definitely come back if I’m back in the area :)"),
("2018-04-24", "21971876", "Sophie", "Our room and bathroom were sparkling clean and very spacious. It was also lovely to have our own kettle and fridge. We really felt at home here and it was lovely to meet Juliette’s friendly children. We felt really welcomed and were grateful of the local knowledge Juliette shared with us. We were also really glad to find somewhere so easy to park our hire car. Thank you for having us!"),
("2018-05-07", "21971876", "Ernest", "Me and the Girls had a great stay at the house of Juliette and for sure we will back again when visiting Sydney again .Thank you very much again for everything.Regards.Ernest"),
("2018-07-25", "21971876", "Cicilia", "Juliette's house was amazing and beautiful. I love the city view from her dining room. her childrens are very lovely. Thankyou for the place :)"),
("2018-09-30", "21971876", "Kaja", "Lovely place  and a lovely family! Was such a pleasure getting to know the area and the family. Would definitely recommend staying here"),
("2018-11-19", "21971876", "Kaia", "Juliette's place has such a lovely-homey feel to it. House is sparkling clean and everything you need or can think of Juliette's got it. On top of it  Juliette is an amazingly warm person! Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-11-24", "21971876", "Jaimi-Lea", "A very private part of the house. It was very quiet  good for study. There was table space and a fridge which I obviously didn't read about because I was so excited to see that."),
("2018-12-01", "21971876", "Anne", "Great value for money. Friendly host. Great position for our needs."),
("2018-12-06", "21971876", "Kenneth", "Beautiful place thank you for your hospitality"),
("2018-12-18", "21971876", "Elle", "Outstanding stay! Everything about staying here was perfect  the location is incredible. Right along side all the beautiful northern beaches  just a walk away from public transport - although there are hills around it wasn’t an issue at all. There are shops and restaurants nearby also. We had use of the kitchen area which was wonderful  one of the nicest houses we’ve ever had the pleasure of staying in. The moment we arrived we felt at home. We have two young children and she was incredibly accommodating  even going to the lengths of pulling her children’s old toys out for our children to play with. Cannot recommend staying here enough  you’ll love it. Thank you Juliette"),
("2018-12-30", "21971876", "Karin", "You will get an extraordinary view from the kitchen/ dining room across the northern beaches to manly!"),
("2019-01-13", "21971876", "Nina", "Our stay in North Curl Curl was just great. The location is good  it is only a 15-20 minutes walk away from the beach. The place is very clean. If we have had some questions  Juliette always helped us. I would highly recommend this place!"),
("2019-01-18", "21971876", "Ginger", "Beautiful house and great location.  Easy access to the beaches (20 minute walk).  Lovely spacious room with all amenities nicely organized.  Friendly interesting people.  We felt right at home!"),
("2019-01-28", "21971876", "Christine", "super sauber  Lage top  mit dem Bus in die City in 30 Minuten  Haltestelle unweit der Unterkunft  Strände Curl Curl und Dee Why um die Ecke. Jederzeit wieder! Wir können die Unterkunft auf jeden Fall weiter empfehlen!"),
("2019-02-20", "21971876", "Jo", "Very comfortable with lovely views from the kitchen area. Friendly family and very modern house with all amenities."),
("2017-12-05", "21988560", "Betty", "Overall  I rate Tim's place 5 stars. Its a great place to stay for sight seeing. Its very close to the train station  city and airport. The place was clean and had a large clean shower. He was easy to talk to. I would stay again."),
("2017-12-12", "21988560", "Patrick", "A great place in a great location.  Tim was very hospitable and provided us with local tips  breakfast and use of his apartment.  I would definitely recommend staying with Tim!"),
("2017-12-14", "21988560", "Tiankun", "Very nice experience"),
("2017-12-20", "21988560", "Liam", "I had a fantastic stay at Tims house Very clean  very warm and friendly atmosphere Right beside train line in quiet cul de sac street I will definitely return to Tims when I am in Sydney again"),
("2018-01-04", "21988560", "张", "房主非常热情友好 位置交通非常便利 值得再次入住"),
("2018-01-09", "21988560", "Jan Peer", "Tim and Liz are very friendly and warm-hearted persons. I felt like I was at home! Highly recommended :-)"),
("2018-01-14", "21988560", "Jie", "excellent value"),
("2018-01-19", "21988560", "Carine", "My boyfriend stayed at Tim's and his wife's for one night and had an excellent stay there. It's perfectly located when you're on transit."),
("2018-01-21", "21988560", "Tara", "Tim and his wife are very nice. They not only give us so many advice about our travel but also make our travel happy and convinient. When we want to go out he will take us to the train with his car. More then that he took us to the sydney beach by car and introduce Austrailian food in woolwoth in detail to us. And even having dinner with us together with delicious food. Thank Tim and his wife very well and if I come back to sydney again I’ll choose Tim’s house absolutely!"),
("2018-01-22", "21988560", "Glen", "Very professional and friendly hosts with nice personal touches.Great location for access to Sydney International Airport"),
("2018-02-10", "21988560", "Xiaochao", "I love the bed and the kitchen:)The location is very convenient:)"),
("2018-02-16", "21988560", "Saut", "Very friendly host and a nice space to relax and work. Fully recommended  surely happy to come over again."),
("2018-02-17", "21988560", "Simon", "Tims place is sensational if you want an easy walk to the airport through the park.  No taxi   no bus   no train needed. Bloody great!!"),
("2018-02-24", "21988560", "Ariana", "Great one night stay for next day early departure to the airport"),
("2018-03-03", "21988560", "Crystal", "Tim’s place is convenient  clean and perfect for travellers who are seeking a central location  close to public transport."),
("2018-03-15", "21988560", "Polly", "Nice space  really well located  Tim was a really easy to communicate with host. Thanks very much"),
("2018-03-19", "21988560", "栋", "房东很热情!"),
("2018-03-26", "21988560", "Panthip", "I had a really great time at Tim’s place. Clean and tidy room. Close to the train station and not too far from the CBD."),
("2018-03-29", "21988560", "Anna", "Tim’s place has great access to public transport and is a quick uber ride to the airport. Comfy bed and very clean - would highly recommend to anyone with an early flight or in need of a place to stay for a night!"),
("2018-04-16", "21988560", "Jenny", "Perfect location for airport. And easy transport into the city. Great apartment"),
("2018-04-21", "21988560", "凯月", "Tim is a very nice landlord and His partner Liz is so kind. The good environment and different type of facilities are provided. also  he provide some food  drink and sources to us."),
("2018-05-06", "21988560", "Andrew", "Nice place near airport"),
("2018-05-18", "21988560", "Jong Geon", "깨끗하고 침대가 푹신푹신 했고 아침에 눈뜨면 햇살이 들어왔고 공항이랑 가까워서 지하철로 이동하기 좋았다"),
("2018-05-31", "21988560", "Wei Fan", "Fill comfortable"),
("2018-06-22", "21988560", "Mitchell", "Great place for an overnight stopover. Good bed and pillows and a nice apartment."),
("2018-06-25", "21988560", "Smári R", "It was a pleasure to stay at Tim's. The apartment was clean and had everything I needed  Tim and his girlfriend are friendly and easy to talk to. I would stay again."),
("2018-06-28", "21988560", "Grace", "Tim went out of his way to help me out during my stay. He is unbelievably generous and accommodating. Neat little set up. Perfect location to the airport."),
("2018-07-08", "21988560", "Carla", "Tim and Liz were a great host. He replied very fast and was very informative in giving local tips and signs all over the apartment to make sure the visitor wouldn't feel confused when they were not around. Their place was really homey and clean. Overall really great experience during my stay there."),
("2018-07-15", "21988560", "佳蕙Brianna", "The location is very easy to access since Arncliff station is just next to the apartment and Wolli Creek station within 15 min walk!! A Uber only cost about $18 to the airport (Same as the train but much better).        The apartment is very clean and lovely decorated. I loved the clean bathroom and the spacious living room. Tim & Liz kindly used very clear and specific sticky note to help familiarize everything. (Website hidden by Airbnb) I did enjoy the short stay and recommend it to the other travelers . :))"),
("2018-07-25", "21988560", "Demi", "very nice experience!"),
("2018-08-24", "21988560", "Mizuki", "They have a super host literally. The room was cozy and sparkling clean! The mattress is awesome I went to sleep soon as my head hit the pillow."),
("2018-09-15", "21988560", "Protais", "Quick communication Flexible self check in.Warm welcomeNo cars or trains noiseConvenient place to city  trains and  airport"),
("2018-09-16", "21988560", "Avelina", "The flat is a lovely  homely space. I felt very comfortable in it. Tim and his girlfriend had prepared a folder with lots of useful information  instructions for the washing machine etc. and tips on how to get around and where to eat locally. They even left train cards in the room for you to use to get into town  along with maps and leaflets about tourist attractions. Sadly  I never got to meet Tim or his girlfriend as we missed each other in the evening and I left too early to catch a flight the next morning. However  by email Tim seemed very charming and helpful!"),
("2018-09-21", "21988560", "Lizzie & Grover", "I had a great stay at Tim’s place  very convenient to shops and airport."),
("2018-09-27", "21988560", "奈緒", "想像以上にとても清潔で､帰りたくなるお家でした｡Timさんはとても親切で､最初何もわからない私を駅まで車で送ってくれました｡すごく快適でした｡"),
("2018-01-01", "22005432", "Christian", "Treen’s place is lovely  clean and charming. A great place to relax if you’re coming for a holiday  and its location to nearby shops  cafes  and Bondi beach is icing on the cake. Highly recommended."),
("2018-01-20", "22005432", "Matthew", "A lovely house  stylish and well appointed close to Bondi beach. Perfect for my family to stay  on a business trip with me. 5 stars from us and would absolutely stay again. Treen was an absolute pleasure to communicate with."),
("2018-01-28", "22005432", "Sam", "Amazing place to stay. Beautifully styled  spacious  comfortable home. 5 min walk to the beach. Loved it."),
("2018-02-17", "22005432", "Claire", "The bedrooms were comfortable with lots of storage and air conditioning. The bathroom was clean and for longer stays there is a washing machine. The lounge and kitchen and spacious offering a great area to entertain. We made good use of the BBQ too.The kitchen is well stocked with herbs and spices and all cooking equipment which we had access to.Treen was fully accommodating with arrival times and any questions we had.A great stay had by all!"),
("2018-02-24", "22005432", "Sarah", "Treen's place is perfect for families. It's excellently located in close proximity to restaurants  Harris farm and other markets  excellent coffee  and many other shops  and is of course an easy stroll to the beach. Treen is very responsive to any needs or concerns. The place is well stocked with kitchen supplies and condiments  and baby toys for the bath. We would love to stay again in the future and recommend to others."),
("2018-03-01", "22005432", "Daragh", "The host canceled this reservation 31 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-03-09", "22005432", "Mark", "Treen’s place is fantastic  and suited our family of 6 perfectly. It’s spacious  modern and bright  and she was kind enough to leave toys and books for our kids  which was incredibly helpful. The location is ideal  just 3 minutes walk to the trendy cafes on Hall St and 5 minutes walk to the beach. Treen was a fantastic host - very helpful and accommodating before our arrival  and available during our stay - though we didn’t need her  since the place was so great. Her home is perfect for families or a group of 6 looking for a charming house in the heart of one of Sydney’s best neighborhoods."),
("2018-03-27", "22005432", "Binny", "The most perfect location to enjoy all that Bondi has to offer and just far enough out of the madding crowd to feel like you are in a peaceful home. Fantastic local tips and if you have children it is the perfect house. A big long hallway  safe and green private backyard  gorgeous books and toys and a five minute walk to the beach. We will be back!"),
("2018-12-21", "22005432", "Chris", "Great property in a prime Bondi location. Amazing living spaces and backyard with lots of thoughtful amenities (basic food  toiletries etc) which made it feel like a home away from home."),
("2018-12-28", "22005432", "Kate", "We had such a wonderful time at this beautiful Bondi home. It is clean  bright  stylish and perfectly located close to great restaurants  cafes  shops and of course- Bondi beach. It was so hard to leave as it felt like home! We will be back!"),
("2019-01-01", "22005432", "Hannah", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Treen's beautiful house at Bondi :) the location was fantastic we could easily walk to cafes  restaurants  grocery shopping and of course the beach! The atmosphere of the house was lovely  it really did have a beautiful positive feel to the property. I would definitely stay here again :)Thank you Treen "),
("2019-01-06", "22005432", "Ralph", "The host canceled this reservation 55 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2019-01-07", "22005432", "Delcia", "The house is in a great location - just 5 minutes walk to the beach and a few minutes from Hall Street cafes and restaurants. The neighborhood is quiet and residential. We enjoyed our stay. Treen was very helpful and quick to respond to our queries.  The house is all we needed with 3 bedrooms  open plan kitchen and living and a small back garden.  A second or bigger bathroom would have been ideal but the houses in the area tend to be small  so not an option. Would recommend for a stay in Bondi."),
("2019-01-12", "22005432", "Rachael", "We loved staying in Treen’s beautiful home. It suited us - four old friends - perfectly. The home is beautiful and well laid out with a lovely private garden and a great kitchen and living area. The beds were comfortable and the home immaculate and beautifully styled. It is a short walk to Bondi beach and we loved waking to Bronte and swimming at Icebergs. It’s a great neighbourhood. Treen was a kind and gracious host. Thankyou for having us."),
("2019-01-18", "22005432", "Stuart", "A fantastic house in a fantastic location.  Super comfortable place in walking distance to shops  fantastic coffee and the beach.  Treen is a wonderful host and couldn’t be more welcoming."),
("2019-01-28", "22005432", "Meegan", "Fabulous place to stay.Great house... lager than photos show...Great location and very attentive host.Would stay again"),
("2018-03-28", "21999107", "Jessica Ngaio", "Absolutely beautiful house  just a stones throw to camp cove. Our host was fantastic and made sure we had everything we needed  even breakfast in the morning. We will definitely stay again      when in Sydney next. This listing is perfect  a must stay  ticks every box  it is beyond 5stars and it doesn't get much better than thisCheers"),
("2018-03-31", "21999107", "Marco", "One of the best Airbnb we stayed in. The hosts are friendly  welcoming and have a really good taste for interior design. When we are going back to Sydney  we are definitely staying at this place. Not only because of the hosts but also for the location itself and it’s nice beaches!"),
("2018-04-07", "21999107", "Ray", "Fantastic location near the beach  harbour and restaurants/bars. All no more than 5/6 minutes away.Lovely apartment with beautiful garden."),
("2018-04-12", "21999107", "Tom", "Amazing! location and lovely hosts added with a lot of attention to details"),
("2018-04-18", "21999107", "Joni", "This was the best air bnb I’ve ever stayed in! Book it and experience beautiful  relaxing Watson’s Bay! Neil and Jane were great hosts and our entire stay was exceptional! I’ve already recommended to family and friends and I’ll be looking to stay again in the near future. Thanks Neil and Jane!!"),
("2018-04-26", "21999107", "Ayela", "As others have said this is one of the best air bnb places I have stayed at - the place is gorgeous and private yet conveniently located and has such a wonderful feel. I would highly recommend it."),
("2018-05-09", "21999107", "Karol", "Neil and Jane's place is absolutely lovely on every level!  The neighborhood is wonderful and provides a nice break from the bustle of Sydney  yet is easily accessible to all the great spots by ferry.   The apartment is beautifully appointed and affords plenty of privacy.  The breakfast and wine provided were delicious.  Neil and Jane were exceptionally responsive and helpful prior to  and throughout  our stay.  We truly enjoyed meeting them and can't wait to return!  Highly recommend staying here!"),
("2018-05-13", "21999107", "Clayton", "Neil sure knows how to host  this place is just what you require if you are going  stay in Sydney  communication was easy and the self contained apartment was more than we hoped for. Modern fresh super clean and all the small things catered for like Robes beautiful  hand wash  shower gel   fruit   muesli  wine etc etc. Camp cove is only a short 2 minute walk and with a bottle of wine in one hand and a glass in the other you get to watch a sunset in a place like no other  All in all one of the best places we have stayed while experiencing Airbnb ."),
("2018-05-25", "21999107", "Jim", "WOW!!  This may be the best Airbnb experience you will ever have  it's got everything.  The host is professional and super friendly and the apartment the location is premium with easy access to a beautiful beach  amazing walking trails with gorgeous views and   "),
("2018-05-27", "21999107", "Thomas", "This is an absolutely fantastic airbnb destination. The hosts are fantastic. The location is perfect. The actual apartment is REALLY nice  (much better than the photos let on) and spacious. We will definately be coming back. Neil & Jane are the best."),
("2018-06-01", "21999107", "Ayela", "Amazing space love staying here and Neil and Jane make it so welcoming"),
("2018-06-03", "21999107", "Patrick", "Everything had an exceptional attention to detail  was hidden away in a private beautiful garden in a exclusive part of Sydney  Neil was very helpful and a great host  would definitely recommend and stay again."),
("2018-06-10", "21999107", "Lynette", "Watsons Bay and Camp Cove are one of our favourite places in Sydney but to have a stylist accommodation with a wonderful host made our stay so enjoyable.Neil the accommodation was so cosy on a wet winter day but the complimentary bottle of red looking into the red hot stones of the gas fire next to the person you love was perfect.We can not fault this ABNB and we will be back with our swimmers to enjoy the pool and beautiful Camp Cove beach."),
("2018-06-22", "21999107", "Carmel", "Gorgeous private space with tranquil garden outlook. Warm and generous hosts. Couldn't fault it!"),
("2018-09-02", "21999107", "Dee & Alex", "My husband and I stayed in this beautiful space as our friends were getting married near by at the Watson’s Bay Hotel.  This was a prefect location as it was only a short walk (3-5 min) to the wedding venue yet far enough away that we felt like we had a bit of space from the hustle and bustle of the weekend.Neil was excellent in communicating and answering any questions we had leading up to our arrival and checkin.  We didn’t really need much attention while there  but he was quick to reply when we did.What really made this space special was not only the beautiful decor (so clean and relaxing)  but really the extra amenities provided were absolutely amazing.  From the wonderfully yummy breakfast items   the bottle of wine  the soft bathrobes  the comfortable pillows & bed  the lovely bathroom amenities (which we liked so much that we went out and purchased some for own home!)  the beautifully scented living room candle  I could go on and on.If you are thinking of staying here  I wouldn’t think any further!  It was a perfect oasis nestled into a lovely quiet neighbourhood.  If there was a love button  I’d click it!  Thanks for the exceptional stay guys!"),
("2018-09-09", "21999107", "Amanda", "My parents stayed here for their anniversary and it was perfect! Comfortable  beautiful  cosy and so close to the beach! Thank you "),
("2018-09-11", "21999107", "Paul", "Wonderful space in a great location. The apartment was spotlessly clean and very welcoming. Every light welcomed us when we arrived near midnight after an unpleasant flight and roadworks near the airport and it felt like we had found a quiet oasis after a hectic trip.The supplied croissants  bread  wine  fruit  milk (and other things I have forgotten) were all great and helped us survive our early morning business meeting.If you are coming to Watson's Bay  this place should definitely be on top of your list. We loved the village feel of the place  even though it is on the edge of Sydney and hosts a fairly major tourist attraction (The Gap). We are more than happy to recommend it.Highlights:1.  The food2.  The garden outlook and sense of privacy3.  The welcome provided to us by Neil  the host4.  Proximity to spectacular locations and lovely walksProblems:The only thing that we could call a problem was that the Wifi kept dropping out BUT Neil specifically came to tell us about the problem and apologise and to tell us that a technician was coming out the next day to fix it. In other words  whilst the loss of Wifi was a little inconvenient  we cannot fault the response."),
("2018-09-16", "21999107", "Betsy", "A very tasteful apartment with a tropical outlook. Everything you would need is supplied and it is a magical location with gorgeous homes along the way when you walk from the ferry and water front.The most lovely small beach on Camp Cove is also just around the corner. This place is an oasis from the hustle and bustle of the city and you just need to jump on the ferry a short walk to reach many of the destinations on offer in Sydney.Thank you again to both Jane and Neil we appreciated the thoughtful attention to detail  and the privacy you provided with the feeling that you were both very approachable if we needed anything."),
("2018-09-20", "21999107", "Teresa", "Neil's place is absolutely beautiful! The studio has everything you need and more! It is well located and very quiet. Neil and his wife Jane are great hosts  they have the best wine and the best bread and are very friendly  helpful  respectful and interesting conversation partners. Great eye for details! and good uber skills too :) we will come back 100%"),
("2018-09-29", "21999107", "(Email hidden by Airbnb)", "I’ve used bnb a couple of times  and Neil’s place is the best.  Very comfortable  clean and equipped with everything we can ask for.  Most of all I love bbq in the garden.  Will definitely come back."),
("2018-09-30", "21999107", "Dylan", "Clean stylish place in a great location. Neil was an excellent host throughout  the stay. I will definitely be back. Thanks Neil."),
("2018-10-08", "21999107", "Shereen", "Neil and Jane are the best hosts!!! Their spot is a little piece of heaven on earth and they go out of their way to make you feel superbly well taken care of and at home. I would highly recommend their place. It is very comfortable  has everything you need and close to fabulous restaurants and public transport. I had the most magical stay. Treat yourself!"),
("2018-10-11", "21999107", "Priscilla", "We came for a staycation away from Sydney  and it was everything we wanted and more.Staying here at Neil's place went far beyond our expectations. The actual place is impeccably and luxuriously designed. It feels incredibly spacious  yet grounded and cozy.  The linens  couch  and king mattress were excellent quality for deep restoration. We ended up planning our trip during an uncharacteristically dreary and rainy week in October  and Neil did everything he could to accomodate us on our beach holiday. We thoroughly enjoyed warming up near the fireplace  and delighted in some sleep ins knowing Neil had already generously taken care of breakfast- a full fruit basket  loaf of bread  yoghurts  croissants  assortment of jams  butter  nut butter  eggs  three kinds of cereal  milk and honey. We mentioned before heading out one evening we were going to get some take away and bring it back  and when we came back Neil had a couple of beers waiting for us packed in ice out in the lush backyard that we had to enjoy in privacy the entire stay. Neil struck the perfect balance between being available when we needed  and giving us lots of privacy. The home is on a very quiet street  quality/luxury neighbourhood. It is located a short walking distance from the major Watson's Bay sites  and there are plenty of even quieter and accessible coastal bush walks."),
("2018-10-16", "21999107", "Hilary", "One of the best Airbnb experiences we have had anywhere in the world. Neil is an excellent host who went out of his way to be helpful and welcoming  even giving us a lift back from the supermarket when it was raining! A beautiful place right near the beach. Very quiet and relaxing yet an easy ferry or bus ride into the city. We could not fault it and  cannot recommend highly enough."),
("2018-10-20", "21999107", "Paul", "Camp Cove is a real gem and Neil is a terrific host. The property is located within 5 mins walk to the Watsons Bay wharf which makes it easily accessible to the Sydney ferries while being in quiet Watsons Bay. The property is also a minutes walk to camp cove which is a beautiful small beach. There are many additional local walks as well. The property is beautifully decorated and private. There are so many thoughtful touches and everything you could possibly need is there. The property is also stocked with delicious breakfast items. Neil provided a lot of useful local information and is extremely friendly. Overall an outstanding stay and we would definitely return."),
("2018-10-25", "21999107", "Kathleen", "We had an outstanding visit and will be recommending Neil’s apartment to anyone we know visiting Sydney. We really enjoyed the wine and all of his recommendations in the area  it made for a wonderful visit to Watson’s Bay. Thank you Neil  for sharing your slice of paradise."),
("2018-10-27", "21999107", "Peter", "Excellent location. Great hosts"),
("2018-10-31", "21999107", "Nicola", "Neil's place was everything and more. A great location for getting around Sydney but located in a beautiful & peaceful location with great walks and beaches nearby. The accommodation itself was excellent  well thought out with good touches from breakfast and toiletries to the layout of the apartment. Would most definitely recommend and only wish I could have stayed longer."),
("2018-11-09", "21999107", "Carol", "Great apartment close to lovely beach and easy access to Sydney.  Neil is great host and would definitely recommend."),
("2018-11-12", "21999107", "Renata", "Great location in beautiful Watsons Bay. Neil has great recommendations on restaurants and activities!!"),
("2018-11-15", "21999107", "Cassandra And Roger", "What a wonderful location with complete amenities  relaxing space  and a superb host. Neil is beyond gracious  ready to lend a helping hand or provide answers. His information on enjoying Watson's Bay is spot on including great dining recommendations (absolutely check out Brown Sugar!)  flexibility and care. Thank you for a memorable and relaxing stay!"),
("2018-11-17", "21999107", "Fiona", "Neil was a super host. The accommodation was fantastic and so well located to walks around the harbour. We will definitely stay here again."),
("2018-11-22", "21999107", "Kyle", "Amazing location steps away from a beautiful sandy beach.  Brightly lit living space with a large comfortable bed.  TV Chanel selection was great  I was able to watch the NFL games and they had Netflix.  Neil was great answering questions and pointed us out to some amazing restaurants within walking distance."),
("2018-12-02", "21999107", "Jessica", "This was by far the best Airbnb Experience we have ever had! Neil and Jane's place is a DREAM  the accommodations  the beach  the restaurants nearby  the ferry  the cliff walks!  We literally kept pinching ourselves because we couldn't believe we were living (and could afford) such a luxury vacation in a luxury paradise! We cannot say enough wonderful things about this rental.  It is absolutely a decision you will not regret  we loved the place so much  that we never even got out and explored the city.  We truly just thought that it couldn't be better then exactly where we were.  An absolutely perfect relaxing and splendid holiday.  Many thanks to you  Neil and Jane!"),
("2018-12-11", "21999107", "Jeff", "Neil’s place was absolutely beautiful and Neil was a great host. I had some questions early on that he addressed quickly and made our international trip much easier. We will stay here again if we are back in the Sydney area!"),
("2018-12-15", "21999107", "Holly", "Wonderful place. Beautifully decorated with thoughtful extra touches."),
("2018-12-18", "21999107", "Jim", "This is an outstanding place to stay in Sydney with so much to see and do and even just to unwind. Great hosts and will be coming back for sure. Highly recommend"),
("2018-12-21", "21999107", "Susann", "Neils place is a treasure in the middle of paradise. Not much more to say  we just enjoyed our stay. Neil is a great host!"),
("2018-12-27", "21999107", "Iulia", "Amazing garden  wonderful location close to the beach  yummy welcome package  great people. Highly recommended for a relaxing retreat in Sydney!"),
("2018-12-31", "21999107", "Noelle", "From the outset this was a hugely positive experience.  Very quick responses and Neil and Jane kindly allowed us to drop our luggage before we were due to check in.  The apartment is really gorgeous and brilliantly located a two minute walk from the lovely camp cove beach.  There were many thoughtful and generous touches from lovely soaps to loads of food  wine and even a bottle of sparkly on New Years Eve!  Neil and Jane could give lessons in being fabulous hosts.   The beds were comfortable and the linen was fresh and beautiful  great pillows and the bathroom/shower was great. The apartment even has a pool and barbecue.  I really couldn't recommend this property enough for a couple or three people - I was with my two adult daughters and we had plenty of room etcThe final kindness was when we were leaving when Neil drove us to the ferry with our luggage!5 Stars all round!"),
("2019-01-06", "21999107", "Katherine", "What a pleasure it was to stay here.  immaculate presentation & our hosts Neil & Jane were so very accommodating  nothing was a worry and were very informative about our surroundings & just delightful to chat with.  Camp Cove is a fantastic  well equipped and quiet apartment.  Every little detail had special thought put into it & we felt right at home.  cannot recommend it highly enough & we are booked for the next trip already.  Thankyou Neil & Jane for a lovely experience!"),
("2019-01-15", "21999107", "Tom", "Location is A+++; walking distance to world class beach; sunset views across the street.  Quite space with magnificent garden.  Unit itself is much larger then photos suggest.  Great design aesthetic; devoured books on hand.  Neil is a wonderful host:  gracious  helpful.  Unit is fully appointed with all you need to enjoy a long stay in beautiful Watsons Bay.  Best Airbnb stay to date!"),
("2019-01-18", "21999107", "Phillip", "Neil was an excellent host  and the unit was a lovely place to stay. We'd certainly love to come back and stay again"),
("2019-01-21", "21999107", "Joan", "Neil’s place in Watson’s Bay  is the perfect location for a get away in Sydney. He is easy to communicate with and very accommodating  providing beautiful fresh produce for our stay. The house is beautifully furnished  it feels like you are in your own little tropical oasis and then as soon as you step out the front door you are a minute away from the lovely camp cove beach and a couple of minutes walk to Watson’s Bay hotel and the famous Doyle’s restaurant. There are also so many lovely walking tracks along the foreshore that provide you with spectacular views of the city. My husband and I had a fabulous time and would highly recommend Neil’s place!"),
("2019-01-26", "21999107", "Kylie", "An amazing property with so much to offer. Could not fault one thing. The perfect weekend!"),
("2019-02-26", "21999107", "Frank", "You will meet a true super host who anticipates your every need and who is as responsive as we have ever experienced."),
("2019-03-03", "21999107", "Brian", "Very happy with my stay. Neil was great with taking any worry out of the visit. The place itself was a tropical getaway from the hustle and bustle of the city  yet very accessible. It was a joy to take the ferry’s everywhere around Sydney (and much more affordable than Uber or taxi). I took at least 10 boat rides in 48 hours which added to the adventure. Download the app as suggested to find all the pick up times. Watson’s bay is a cool little beach town with one hotel. Loved the tropical back yard and swimming pool. Also all the breakfast foods and coffee Neil arranged were great. Thanks again!"),
("2017-12-23", "22020910", "Peggy & Jeff", "Anita is a pleaser. She will do all she can to make your stay in her perfectly situated flat on bondi beach. If you search for a spot in Bondi  here it is ! Highly recommanded"),
("2018-01-16", "22020910", "Julia", "The studio was so beautiful! Amazing design and so clean! Everything was perfect  Anita is very kind and everything that we needed she answered us! Thank you so muchh"),
("2018-01-19", "22020910", "Ayusa", "We enjoyed a nice ocean view from the window. The apartment is located right next to a bus stop to/from the city  and everything you need - beach  shops  cafes  restaurants are all within walking distance but yet it’s surprisingly very quiet. We enjoyed morning coastal walks to North Bondi and Bronte. Anita provided a few cups of yogurt  milk  butter  etc as well as beach towels and they were all helpful. I highly recommend this place!"),
("2018-01-27", "22020910", "Millie", "This apartment was great for our quick Bondi stay. Location is great; right on main street  but beach side so the noise is not much. Beautiful view of Bondi from window and walking distance from all shops/entertainment and scenic walks. Check-in/ out easy with help from Anita  who also provided us with lots of helpful tips about the neighborhood. Bus to Sydney right outside apartment making for easy access to the other sites. No air-con  but fan and window helped immensely. Great place for a beach vacation in Bondi! Definitely would recommend to anyone."),
("2018-02-08", "22020910", "Ben", "Stylish studio with amazing views of Bondi beach and the ocean. Good kitchen and bathroom  well equipped - perfect place to stay in Bondi. 2 minute walk to Icebergs or to the Beach. Anita was easy to communicate with and very welcoming. Thoroughly recommended."),
("2018-02-11", "22020910", "Tim", "Anita is an absolutely lovely person and outstanding host. Her communication was proactive and timely; she greeted us with a warm welcome and wished us safe travels upon departure; and she went out of her way to ensure that we enjoyed our stay.The location is perfect  the view is amazing  and the apartment is clean and cozy with all the amenities you could need. Anita is a beautiful soul who radiates positive vibes. Our experience in Bondi Beach wouldn’t have been the same if we hadn’t met her. Thanks  Anita!"),
("2018-02-15", "22020910", "Cassandra", "Anita’s place is very well decorated and perfectly located right near Bondi beach. Wow  the view! There were little touches like the basic food and shower products provided which is great for the light traveler. Anita was very helpful and hospitable  and gave some great tips for things to do in the area. Comfortable bed and very clean. Very highly recommend!"),
("2018-03-09", "22020910", "Hayden", "Great location and felt at home right away!! Host was excellent play was well presented and tidy. we'll be coming back for sure."),
("2018-03-10", "22020910", "Olivia", "What an absolutely amazing find. Anita was so wonderful and accomodating  even letting us check out late and store our luggage for us while we explored Bondi. Check in was easy and Anita was always in touch to make sure we had the perfect stay. The property is stunning  beautifully decorated and absolutely immaculate and clean. Anita has thought of every detail even leaving us snacks and toiletries. I couldn’t recommend this place more highly and will be staying here again! 10/10 from us ! "),
("2018-03-17", "22020910", "Emma", "From the minute we booked to stay in Anita’s Bondi apartment everything was perfect. Communication was quick  the apartment looked exactly as it does in the photos  the location is amazing and Anita goes out of her way at check in to ensure that your stay is perfect."),
("2018-03-23", "22020910", "Dione", "I booked this room for a colleague who was visiting on a secondment  and he was very happy with the stay. A great way to wow visitors from London - access to one of our most iconic beaches. He said it was very convenient  well-appointment  comfortable and well-stocked with thoughtful additions  which was really useful to him. It's very likely we will be booking again."),
("2018-04-03", "22020910", "Emily", "Anita has a wonderful  comfortable place with a beautiful view. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-04-07", "22020910", "Mario", "The studio was as described  location for us absolutely fantastic  the apartment was comfortable and cleanCarolina and Anita were fantastic hosts and we got some great tips on local restaurants We really enjoyed our stay"),
("2018-04-11", "22020910", "Julia", "Amazing  thoroughly enjoyed!"),
("2018-04-18", "22020910", "Tamara", "Anita was a fantastic host and went above and beyond. This was my second time in Bondi Beach and next time I visit I’ll be staying here again. 5 stars! The location is central to all the Bondi has to offer. It’s near a busy street but with the windows closed you don’t hear much."),
("2018-04-25", "22020910", "Andrew", "This apartment was a perfect getaway. It had everything you need. It was walking distance from shops and restaurants and a bus stop a stones throw away. Anita was super helpful and very hospitable making our stay that little bit better."),
("2018-05-02", "22020910", "Richard", "When we visit  Sydney we usually stay at the Four Seasons Hotel. This time we tried booking Airbnb in Sydney. We arrived 11pm at the apartment and our self check-in was so easy. We got surprised that our host Anita prepared cheese  ham  and bread for us. It was a very thoughtful gesture because we were so hungry. She even prepared milk and cookies. Wow  its the first time i ever experienced  this in an Airbnb. Her apartment is way bigger than the normal room at Four Seasons.Everything was so clean.  Plus the amenities are even better.She even had beach towels prepared and beach chairs.  Her bed sheets and towels are high quality. The bed also was very comfortable.  We love her apartment so much.  Personally  we think its the best we have ever stayed at. I'm surprised that this apartment is not yet in the Airbnb Plus category. Because Anita's apartment should be at the Airbnb Super Plus category. She even has Netflix in her Smart TV. Her kitchen is so complete with all the cooking amenities.She even had pasta for us.  In our last night  she even gave us a going away gift. Anita was so sweet and thoughtful.  If there was an award body that gives out awards  Anita should be given the Super Super Host Award for Airbnb. We stayed for 8 days.  She is the best and her apartment is the best we have ever stayed so far. We will surely  be back. A million Thanks Anita!!!!"),
("2018-05-05", "22020910", "Andrew", "Fantastic location  great host and spotless apartment.   Perfect"),
("2018-05-10", "22020910", "Yao", "Great apartment. Anita is very kind and prepare everything I may need which is way too much beyond my expectation. You can see bondi beach in the apt and bus stop only 10meter away. Overall it is good choice when you travell to bondi. Thx Anita."),
("2018-05-21", "22020910", "Danielle", "Home away from home! I can't write enough good things about this cute Airbnb in Bondi Beach! The sunrise view & ocean view was impeccable and it the best location  right near Icebergs and the amazing Coastal Walk. Anita was an exceptional host. She met me when I arrived early to help with my luggage and allowed me to leave my bags while I explored Bondi until the place was ready. She gave the best tutorial of everything I would need to know in the apartment building and checked in with me throughout my stay. Complete white glove service! Thanks  Anita. I'll be back!"),
("2018-05-26", "22020910", "Rachel", "Anita was easy to contact and quick to respond to all our requests. The apartment was everything it is advertised to be and more. It was extremely clean and had everything we needed to make our stay feel homely and very comfortable. We look forward to staying here next time. Thanks Anita"),
("2018-06-03", "22020910", "Leah", "Very comfortable bed  the ‘partial’ view of the beach is great. Anita is a lovely and generous host  who made us feel welcome. We enjoyed our stay very much. Thank you!"),
("2018-06-09", "22020910", "Gary", "Anita's place is lovely. It is in an excellent location and has everything you need for a comfortable stay. Would definitely recommend staying here."),
("2018-10-31", "22020910", "Hugh", "Lovely location; comfortable  clean  well equipped and spacious apartment with superb view. Anita was welcoming and extremely helpful."),
("2018-11-09", "22020910", "Leah", "Exactly as described. The location was spot on  the apartment was exactly what was pictured. Anita went above and beyond to make sure that we were comfortable and provided additional information as first time guests to Australia. ie. public transportation. We arrived much earlier than check-in and she allowed us to leave our luggage at the apartment while we explored the beautiful Bondi Beach. Everything was provided in the apartment. There was no additional stress to locate sunscreen  beach towels  beach chair  even a beach hat was available! Comfortable cozy place  cozy bed  and it was so lovely waking up in the morning to see the beautiful sunrise off of the ocean while sipping a cup of coffee in the comfort of our room."),
("2018-11-11", "22020910", "Sandy", "Anita’s place made for a wonderful weekend away with our grandson!  A perfect location  lovely flat  great view  and up to date and really comfortable. Anita was a pleasure to meet and deal with. She made everything easy!  We loved our stay and can recommend Anita’s place unreservedly!  Thank you Anita!"),
("2018-11-25", "22020910", "Myriam", "Really good studio apartment in perfect location in Bondi Beach. The apartment is right next to the 333 bus stops on Campbell Parade and one minute from the beach  Bondi icebergs and the Bondi to Bronte Coastal walk. And It has a great view of the beach! Anita was a wonderful host  on time  helpful  welcoming. We had a great experience. We will be back to this apartment and would definitely recommend it to others."),
("2018-12-02", "22020910", "Geneviève", "Anita is a fantastic host! She made sure my parents’ stay was pleasant and comfortable. She would check on them regularly to make sure they had everything they needed  and accommodated them at the check-in and check-out.The apartment is beautiful and extremely well located. You definitely can’t find a better spot in Bondi! I highly recommend Anita’s apartment for a short or a longer stay if you want to experience Bondi at its best!"),
("2018-12-09", "22020910", "Jinhyung", "I & wife stayed here for the first trip in Sydney.We really enjoyed days and never forget our memory in here. Room is very clean and all stuff we need are prepared in a room. I think it is ok to bring your personal things like a clothes.And this room has a very nice view of Bondi beach.If you want to have a good memory in Bondi beach  I strongly recommend Anita's room. Thank you so much for your help  Anita! :)"),
("2018-12-22", "22020910", "Shirley", "This studio apartment is in a wonderful location in Bondi Beach. With stunning views from the studio and panoramic views from the rooftop! We stayed 11 days and it was relaxing and enjoyable! It was the perfect home away from home. Anita was the most helpful and gracious of hosts. The apartment is fully ready  with everything you’d need in the kitchen  bathroom and even beach towels and beach chairs! Thank You Anita!"),
("2018-12-30", "22020910", "Sarah", "We had the most incredible stay at Anita’s property in Bondi. Anita is a lovely  helpful and generous host and the apartment was just perfect! Highly recommend!"),
("2019-01-06", "22020910", "Raymond", "Many thanks Anita for your warm hospitality. The apartment is very nice with very spectacular Bondi Beach view with excellent location. Your tips for the local restaurants and all the information are very useful. We had some good local  experience of the Bondi Beach and enjoyed so much with the kids. Also thanks for the special kid meal plates for the kids."),
("2019-01-13", "22020910", "Damien", "Perfect beach location with classic Bondi Beach views from the apartment and rooftop terrace.A really good sized studio space  It was super clean and well presented - just like the photos. Anita is an outstanding host  very responsive  helpful and friendly."),
("2019-01-18", "22020910", "Jas", "Anita’s place is the perfect location for anyone who wants the beachside holiday. Located right across from the famous Bondi Icebergs  you can easily get to Bondi Beach and walk the coastal walk to many of the other beaches. The apartment itself is sparking clean  beautifully decorated and has everything you’d need for a great stay. Anita was there to help with anything I needed and gave me a tour around the area showing me the pools and restaurants nearby and the shortcuts on how to get there. Anita was very sweet and extremely helpful going above and beyond to help with both check in and check out. Would highly recommend staying here!"),
("2019-01-24", "22020910", "Lucrecia", "Anita’s place is better than the pictures!Everything went wonderfully! Anita is an amazing host!"),
("2019-02-01", "22020910", "Daniel", "Stunning location. Very clean. Comfortable bed. Even down to the smaller touches like beach towels and tea bags. Anita was a very helpful host and easy to communicate with. Highly recommend."),
("2019-02-05", "22020910", "Jeong", "When you wake up in the morning  you can see beautiful sunrise. Very nice ocean view in cozy house."),
("2019-02-09", "22020910", "Will", "Anita’s place was in a perfect location with an amazing view. Everything about the apartment was clean  neat and tidy. I had a fantastic stay and would recommend staying there."),
("2019-02-17", "22020910", "Vincent", "Had a great few days in Bondi in a well located apartment. Anita was fantastic  recommending a few local spots to visit. Will definitely be back and highly recommend."),
("2019-02-19", "22020910", "Liz", "Great location with a nice view. Clean and central to Bondi. It is a part of a complex where other air bnb people rent  and some of the guests were noisy  especially late at night. The walls were super thin. Very comfy bed and big window that allows fresh air in all night!"),
("2019-02-23", "22020910", "Tuija", "Strong recommendation for this place! Staying at Anita's place was just amazing. The apartment was absolutely clean and there was everything you could wish for your stay. Anita even left few eggs for me to eat! The location is fantastic. Just next to Bondi Beach or almost ON the beach. :) And Anita was one of the kindest and caring host and she helped me with everything I needed. I would definitely come back here."),
("2019-03-02", "22020910", "Alix", "This apartment was one of the best experiences I have had on Air B&B. Anita has a tidy  organized and comfortable home with the most spectacular views. The apartment sits on the south end of Bondi with direct access to the beach. The building is a little older  but that does not matter when you have a home in such a magical place. Anita is a wonderful host  taking the time to share local information  being always readily available and just a lovely  kind person. The access to the city is super easy  with the bus directly outside the front door. I would never stay in a hotel in Bondi again  as this place is far better value."),
("2019-03-03", "22020910", "Rodge & Christl", "very good  place"),
("2017-12-28", "22068048", "Raghu", "Much better than the photos. Tastefully done up decor. (Even the collection of books)Nice and clean had everything we needed. Lucy and Ralph lovely people very warm welcome and very friendly. Happy to have found this place. 40 minutes from cbd great getaway!would love to visit again"),
("2018-01-03", "22068048", "Steven", "Clean  modern  comfortable  lots to see and do in the area. It was a get away from the holidays for me and I loved the change of scenery and alone time."),
("2018-01-29", "22068048", "Leesa", "We stayed at Lucy and Ralph's for a couple if nights with our 2 teenage boys.  The unit was fresh and clean and the beds were amazingly comfortable.   Beautiful garden bush setting and all the amenities were wonderful.   Lucy and Ralph were warm and friendly and extremely helpful.  Thank you"),
("2018-02-15", "22068048", "Glenn", "I am reticent to write a good review as I would love to keep this place a secret. But so deserving of praise - Lucy and Ralph have got this SO right. Terrific spacious and well equipped. Private bush setting  modern awesome kitchen. A true home away from home. Have already booked a return trip. So nice to be out of the rat race and relax in a peaceful leafy cul de sac location. Bravo Lucy and Ralph! 10/10."),
("2018-03-15", "22068048", "Glenn", "My second time here now and a LOT more to come. The peace and quiet is excellent as are the amenities and accommodation. Awesome hosts who leave you in peace but are all but a holler away. My preferred stop for time to come. Very spacious  modern  clean and well equipped."),
("2018-03-22", "22068048", "Elizabeth", "Loved staying here! It was such a beautiful place! Can't wait to visit again"),
("2018-03-25", "22068048", "Christina", "Outstanding value. Spacious  clean and beautiful in a very quiet location. I'm happy to book again in the future. Highly recommended. Thanks again  Lucy."),
("2018-04-02", "22068048", "Parul", "The place was very organised  clean and beautiful. Our host Lucy was extremely helpful and quick in response. Travellers can stay there as the space is new and close to beautiful sites in Sydney. So  This place is highly recommended for travellers."),
("2018-04-06", "22068048", "Glenn", "I just keep coming back. My favourite of all times. Lucy provides a superb air bnb experience. The peace  privacy and tranquillity combined with an incredibly comfortable and well appointed accommodation makes this feel like your second home."),
("2018-04-10", "22068048", "Sarah", "We absolutely loved Lucy’s place- absolutely beautiful  immaculately clean and set in gorgeous trees with a backyard for the kids! Loved it  and will def be back. Thanks Lucy!"),
("2018-04-13", "22068048", "Melissa", "This wonderful hideaway in Mount Colah is the perfect place for a work trip with family! A true home away from home. Plenty of living area options so that everyone can find their own space. Great kitchen facilities and dining area to feed the whole family. Teenage children and young children are all well catered for with a wonderful secure private outdoor space - all safety concerns taken care of! Local shops  takeaway  wonderful sports grounds  playgrounds and beautiful bush walks just a minute’s drive away. Close to major shopping centres and public transport. An easy commute to the city yet you can wake up in the tree tops with bird song!!! Lucy has thought of everything to make your stay a pleasure. We will be back for sure."),
("2018-05-09", "22068048", "Lois", "BEAUTIFUL APARTMENT!!! The host  Lucy was so hospitable and thoughtful  although this time we only had a short meet up.  The place is extremely clean and comfortable.  Highly recommend to all of you wanna explore another side of Sydney."),
("2018-05-15", "22068048", "Chad", "Perfect place for a peaceful getaway!  We loved the apartment. The light-filled space was clean  beautifully well-equipped with great amenities and plenty of space to relax.  We really enjoyed our time there and would definitely stay again. Thanks Lucy for your hospitality."),
("2018-05-27", "22068048", "Kym", "This is an outstanding apartment with fabulously comfortable beds  excellent bathroom and fully contained kitchen. One of the best air bnb apartments I have stayed in. The host was great with communication  the key was easy to find and the partner was immaculate! Thankyou. We loved our stay xx"),
("2018-05-30", "22068048", "Mikaylah", "Lucy maintains a wonderful property - clean with everything you need and in a quiet area but not too far from town for a night out. Lovely hosts and highly recommend Tree Fern Garden Apartment."),
("2018-06-03", "22068048", "Anna", "Immaculate apartment  spacious  clean  pretty outlook. Lucy has thought of every thing. Very well equipped kitchen if you want to cook and a dinning area inside and out. Lovely outdoor area. Comfortable bed."),
("2018-06-08", "22068048", "Jennifer", "The apartment was beautiful  spacious  clean and quiet. My only regret was that I didn’t get to spend more time there. Lucy was very thoughtful and considerate. Communication was excellent. I look forward to returning soon. "),
("2018-06-20", "22068048", "Lawrence", "We had a wonderful stay!  The apartment is clean  modern  open and delightful.  Great kitchen  dining area and yard.  Hosts – Lucy and Ralph – helpful  friendly  welcoming but also unobtrusive.  Pleasant 15 minute walk to train station.  Would definitely try to stay here again. "),
("2018-06-28", "22068048", "Jennifer", "I absolutely love how spacious the place is.  It's fantastic when travelling with family."),
("2018-07-09", "22068048", "Kelly", "Wonderful clean and beautifully decorated place  well equipped kitchen and plentiful linen. access to backyard with native birds  laundry and washing line. great place for the family to come and spend time in a quiet par of the city. close to a bus stop if you dont want to walk 20min to the station. had trouble getting an uber XL or maxi cab to leave though. we will pason the details of the private maxi cab to Lucy so others can use."),
("2018-07-12", "22068048", "Joan", "This was very suitable for our needs and we enjoyed our time. Have recommended it to other family members."),
("2018-07-15", "22068048", "Michael", "An outstanding apartment and very clean  everything you would expect and more  with an excellent bathroom and fully contained kitchen. The hosts are really lovely people. Clear communication and access made very easy. Many thanks!! We'll def be back. "),
("2018-07-17", "22068048", "David", "What a great place you both have. Close to the things we need and affordable. Very well appointed and nice to have a place to sit and relax with your own hot drink at the end of a long day."),
("2018-07-28", "22068048", "Emma", "Lucy and Ralph were both very friendly  nice and easy to talk to. Such a nice  HUGE place to stay  and absolutely loved all the green in the gardens! Was very relaxing coming home to the waterfall going in the pond. Thank you so much for having myself and Jade whilst we were training for work. I highly recommend Lucy and Ralph’s home to anyone! "),
("2018-08-10", "22068048", "Greg", "Excellent  clean  everything you need for your stay"),
("2018-08-18", "22068048", "Ginie Frank", "Best spot I have stayed in in Sydney.Well worth it 5 Star renovated accomodation "),
("2018-08-25", "22068048", "Jennifer", "I absolutely love staying at Lucy’s. The unit is very clean and comfortable. Lucy and her husband are very kind and thoughtful. They gave me fresh flowers from the garden and remember the little things I like. I look forward to returning soon."),
("2018-09-02", "22068048", "Sushil", "Perfect apartment in a beautiful  quiet  relaxed setting still so handy to all that Sydney has to offer. Lucy and Ralph are the perfect hosts  we were welcomed with lovely  considerate gifts and kind hospitality. The apartment is comfortable  well equipped and private with lovely views and a gorgeous outdoor area that makes the most of the beautiful area. Thank you so much for a wonderful stay Lucy and Ralph!"),
("2018-09-07", "22068048", "Glenn", "I just keep coming back. a home away from home. very spacious and well appointed and very quiet environment. A true gem."),
("2018-09-16", "22068048", "Angela", "The apartment was beautiful  luxurious and cosy.  The beds were very comfortable. Lucy was a great host. She even had plastic plates  cups and a kids stool to make our kids stay easy too."),
("2018-09-22", "22068048", "Derek", "Ralph and Lucy were excellent hosts. The apartment was light and airy  spacious with an excellent kitchen and had everything we wanted. We will stay again."),
("2018-09-29", "22068048", "Bronwyn", "Ferntrees is one of the best Airbnb's I have ever had the pleasure to stay at.Lucy and Ralph were the perfect hosts  friendly and most welcoming.The apartment was spotless and such a lovely space to stay. Everything I needed was there and loved the yard with the waterfall and visiting birds.Would highly recommend Ferntrees and will certainly return for future visits.Thank you Lucy and Ralph and all my best to you both."),
("2018-10-02", "22068048", "Andre", "Amazing experience! Extremely clean  tidy  welcoming and comfortable. 10 out of 10  do not think twice before booking it."),
("2018-10-05", "22068048", "Glenn", "I just keep on coming back. Always a pleasure to stay. My favourite home away from home."),
("2018-10-17", "22068048", "Shane", "You can expect a modern comfortable apartment under the hosts home. The apartment is in a quiet street in leafy Mt Colah.Well supplied with linen  utensils and cutlery. The hosts are always available but are happy to leave guests alone if that’s your preference."),
("2018-10-21", "22068048", "Steve", "Great accommodate  spotlessly clean  well equipped  nicely appointed with a fantastic host.  I heartily recommend this place."),
("2018-10-27", "22068048", "Samuel", "Great Host  great house  great location which is near to a beautiful national park. You will not go wrong with this Airbnb."),
("2018-11-05", "22068048", "Kym", "."),
("2018-11-18", "22068048", "Willem", "can recommend this place.  But you need your own transport"),
("2018-11-22", "22068048", "Helen", "What lovely home. It really felt like a home  instead of a hotel. So many lovely decorator touches  plus books and magazines. Beds and lounges were very comfy. Beautiful outlook with lovely trees and very quiet. Close to national parks and a short drive to shops."),
("2018-11-28", "22068048", "Hanseung", "한적하고 조용한 공간깨끗하게 정리되고 모든 것을 갖춘 공간즉각적인 호스트의 대응과 따뜻함이 있는이 공간을 추천합니다ps 시티로 나가는 길이 조금 멀지만(40분) 시티 외곽이나 시드니 북쪽 관광을 생각한다면 위치도 지리적으로도 나쁘지 않음가격대비 흘륭한 숙소"),
("2018-12-02", "22068048", "Angela", "This littlehome away from home is by far the nicest accommodation we have stayed at. So much thought went into making it a lovely time to spend our holiday at.Spotlessly clean everything you might possibly need is at youre fingertips. Lucy and Ralph are down to earth friendly people and very approachable. If you are lucky enough to stay at this beautiful accommodation Im sure you will have a wonderful experience as my Son Grandaughter and myself did.Great location lovely outdoor area and even fresh milk and coffee available on our arrival. Thankyou Lucy and Ralph we loved our stay and look forward to seeing you again."),
("2018-12-06", "22068048", "Patrick", "The kitchen was great to cook in and was stocked well with the small things that one can sometimes forget when traveling like cooking oil  salt n pepper"),
("2018-12-08", "22068048", "Sandi", "Good communication  very clean and contemporary facilities. Private with lovely garden around.  Easy access.  Couldn't have been a better experience.  The hosts went out of their way to make our stay enjoyable."),
("2018-12-13", "22068048", "Tim", "Fantastic apartment in a quiet neighbourhood  very comfortable place to stay with very friendly and responsive hosts!"),
("2018-12-16", "22068048", "Phil", "Wonderful child friendly accomodation which was amazing clean and immaculate with everything you could think of to need! Beds were super comfy and it was lovely being surrounded by beautiful fauna. Lucy and Ralph were really friendly and made us feel very welcome and at home. Would def stay again at this wonderful home ."),
("2018-12-26", "22068048", "Sharon", "Extremely clean apartment inside& out. The hosts Lucy &Ralph are very welcoming.Beautifully decorated.  A lot of thought has been put into the finer details. There is wifi& (Website hidden by Airbnb) abundance of extra Manchester. Aircon. Anything you need is definitely there. A lovely kitchen with excellent cooking facilities."),
("2019-01-01", "22068048", "Dan And Roxie", "Lucy & Ralph were amazing hosts  above and beyond our expectations for our family stay.  Their property is nestled in a beautiful leafy suburb that creates a very relaxing vibe for a holiday  the train station was nice and close which made for an easy commute into the city.  The space is huge for a 2 bedroom and our family of five comfortably fitted  and the laundry facilities were great for catching up on all our children's washing.  We really enjoyed our stay."),
("2019-01-27", "22068048", "Phoenix", "Very good experience staying at Lucy’s spacious apartment. There space is clean and tidy with all the necessities we need for a comfortable 16 nights stay. And Lucy and her husband are very nice and considerate  they went extra miles to make us feel at home and comfortable. I recommend her place for future airbnbers."),
("2019-02-02", "22068048", "Peta-Jane", "This unit was private  modern  comfortable and welcoming. More than big enough for our family of four.Lucy and Ralph are so lovely  there was plenty of tea bags  oil  salt and pepper etc  plus toiletries for those who forget or don’t have what they need."),
("2019-02-09", "22068048", "Almin", "5 stars from me  it was perfect !"),
("2019-02-13", "22068048", "Yaoxiang", "It’s an awesome place more than our expectations. The hospitality  warmth and passion from Lucy and Ralphs impressed us a lot. Frankly speaking  Lucy and Ralphs are the best householder we met in the world. We will choose the same place without any hesitation if we come back to Sydney next time!"),
("2019-02-15", "22068048", "Darrek", "We really enjoyed staying here  Lucy took excellent care of us and we enjoyed the peaceful space she provided! The extra amenities were very helpful  including the nice picnic table outside! I would definitely recommend to a friend!"),
("2019-03-06", "22068048", "Angie", "Fantastic accomodation. A home away from home and much better than we expected  with lovely thoughtful touches on arrival. Both Lucy and Ralph are fine people. Very warm  friendly and hospitable. Highly recommend."),
("2018-01-11", "22124796", "Jaco", "Great location and a great appartment in general. Places like these are why I prefer AirBnb above hotels."),
("2018-01-18", "22124796", "Jaco", "This was my second visit and I enjoyed it as much as the first time. The location is perfect both for business travel  being close to the CBD as well as leisure  being close to the harbour.Thanks again."),
("2018-01-20", "22124796", "Jade", "The most beautiful apartment. Such a nice pool and good gym. Very happy i choose this place."),
("2018-01-25", "22124796", "Shermalie", "Very central and close to Barangaroo restaurants."),
("2018-01-27", "22124796", "Charles", "Thank you :)"),
("2018-02-02", "22124796", "Yashodara", "Tam was excellent with her communication with me. She responded immediately and contacted me multiple times to check how my stay was.The apartment is beautifully decorated. The balcony is huge and perfect to spend time in. Location was great and walkable to all the places including Opera House  Harbour Bridge  Eye Tower etc"),
("2018-02-10", "22124796", "Patrick", "This listing is a great location to explore many of Sydney CBDs attractions. Communication was easy & the place is clean with well appointed furnishings."),
("2018-03-10", "22124796", "Marco", "Great apartment  with the balcony being genuinely amazing! Location is not prime in the CBD which makes it hard to get to the eastern part of the city  but it’s very close to The Rocks and Barangaroo. The team were very helpful with arranging cleaning of the apartment 3 times during my stay. No microwave in the apartment though."),
("2018-03-28", "22124796", "Stacey", "Beautiful  safe building in a great area of Sydney with first-class amenities! The apartment itself is clean  stylish  and comfortable."),
("2018-03-31", "22124796", "Wendy", "Although I did not meet Tam  she is an excellent and proactive communicator.  Because of this  our self-sufficient check in went smoothly and we felt supported  although she was remote.  The space is clean  ideal for it's balcony and proximity to Barangaroo  CBC  The Rocks & Circular Quay.  Our stay was comfortable and enjoyable.  Many thanks  Tam!"),
("2018-04-02", "22124796", "Nolan", "Gorgeous place and amazing host!"),
("2018-04-20", "22124796", "Andrzej", "The apartment in reality looks even better than on the photos. It is very spacious  so it felt really good to rest there after entire day in an office. I especially enjoyed all the comfort furniture: sofa in the living room  couch and armchairs on the balcony. It is very clean and elegant. It has many different sized lamps  so it is easy to make it well lit in the evenings  whatever's your preference. Especially worth mentioning is the balcony. Even though there is no view to speak of  because the neighbouring buildings block it off as it is only 2nd floor  sitting on the balcony during the weekend or in the evenings was surprisingly relaxing. It is probably due to combination of the facts that the balcony is big  the chairs are very comfortable and the sound of the city is somehow dimmed after everyone left the city center. Speaking of which  the location is absolutely great  it is close to everything I wanted to see in Sydney: Opera House  Ice Cream  Restaurants  Offices  Cafes. And if you want to go there in a fresh shirt  there are very well working appliances in the apartment: washing machine  dryer  and a huge ironing board and a very good iron. I wish I had such in my home. Overall  I highly recommend the apartment."),
("2018-05-13", "22124796", "Dani", "Tam was super accessible  we never felt like we were a hassle if we needed to ask a question. It's a lovely spot  surrounded by a part of Sydney we'd not explored yet. Very comfy bed  spacious bathroom  perfect for a cosy stay or a place to come home to in Sydney. We loved the balcony in particular. A great central home  hosted very well."),
("2018-06-18", "22124796", "Aaron", "Great location"),
("2018-07-01", "22124796", "Sean", "Great spot and great host"),
("2018-07-30", "22124796", "Mark", "Great apartment in Central Sydney. We stayed in the apartment for almost all of July. We were able to walk almost everywhere we wanted to go (although we did make use of our Opal card ... Wynyard station is 2 blocks away).  Both Darling Harbour and Circular Quay are within easy walking distance. We very much enjoyed the gym  pool  and spa pool. Tam was the most responsive host we have encountered in our Airbnb stays: she usually responded within 5 minutes to any questions we had. We had one minor issue which Tam immediately resolved. The huge balcony has partial views of Darling Harbour. We will undoubtedly work  with Tam when we return to Sydney and highly recommend this apartment."),
("2018-08-22", "22124796", "Aidan", "Very nice apartment in a great location right by Barangaroo with a great balcony. Everything was spotless and the bathroom was one of the highlights. Would definitely recommend in the future!"),
("2018-08-30", "22124796", "Tracy", "This Apt. was very nice and clean. Close to the Rocks  Bridge Climb  Circular Quey  and Sydney Opera House. We recommend eating at The Lord Nelson Pub and Brewery  just a short walk on the same street as this Apt. Have a pint...or two..Tracy & Julie      Arlington  Texas USA"),
("2018-09-09", "22124796", "Olivia", "Stylish  safe and quiet apartment in the heart of the city. Thankyou for your incredible hospitality. I will definitely be staying here again for future trips to Sydney."),
("2018-09-18", "22124796", "Ashley", "Beautiful and stylish home with excellent amenities and in a great location. Will absolutely stay again."),
("2018-09-22", "22124796", "Melissa", "A great to stay! Highly recommended!"),
("2018-09-23", "22124796", "Inder", "Excellent apartment and location. We had no problems at all during our stay! Will hopefully be back soon.Tam responded almost instantly to all our messages - which was really helpful!"),
("2018-09-29", "22124796", "Jeff", "Had a great stay with my wife at this apartment in Sydney.  Great location at the Rocks end of the city  easy stroll from Wynyard Station via Clarence Street. Highly recommend this apartment."),
("2018-10-04", "22124796", "Elliott", "Anne's place is in a service apartment located a few blocks away from the new office and restaurant district of Barangaroo.  It is also very close to the Wynyard train station so convenient transit connections to the airport and other public transit.  Everything in Sydney CBD is very accessible from the apartment.  The apartment is appointed nicely exactly as advertised.  I found the apartment very quiet and private  and I'm a light sleeper!  The apartment is on the 2nd floor facing away from the street and toward Darling Harbour  but doesn't have much of a view of water - just the Barangaroo buildings.  But it is a great homebase for exploring Sydney  with great transit access  a full kitchen  a good washer/dryer  and perfectly nice marble bathroom with large shower and large bathtub.  I was pleased with the rental and would recommend it as a more spacious alternative to a hotel."),
("2018-10-09", "22124796", "Carole", "Great location but do your research first when walking as  (Hidden by Airbnb) maps sent us a very long way round a few times.Central to great amenities and nice to have use of the pool."),
("2018-10-13", "22124796", "Charlie", "We had a wonderful time in Sydney while we stayed at this amazing place.  The condo was clean and very nice.  The location was also close to everything we wanted to see."),
("2018-10-20", "22124796", "Lee", "Really lovely apartment   great location"),
("2018-10-27", "22124796", "Ellie", "Cute apartment  exactly like the pictures. The location was great - close to Circular Quay but also had a few cafes and a convenience store right on the same street. Very clean and convenient for anyone who wants to be in The Rocks/Circular Quay area."),
("2018-11-01", "22124796", "Paul", "A place that makes you feel welcome in which you can relax and enjoy your stay."),
("2018-11-05", "22124796", "Donald", "Stop your search. Stay here."),
("2018-11-08", "22124796", "Kevin", "Stayed at Anne's place during our 2 night stay in Sydney. The location was great and right in the heart of the CBD. Anne was very responsive and accommodating. Would recommend to anyone traveling to Sydney!"),
("2018-11-11", "22124796", "Brent", "This is a beautiful flat in Barangaroo and easy walking to cool restaurants and cafes on Darling Harbour.  Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-11-16", "22124796", "Lynanna", "Apartment is situated in the heart of Sydney . We walked to nearby sights such as the Rocks   Sydney Aquarium and Barangaroo . Get your Opal Card and take a Ferry over to the Opera House and take in the amazing sight of the Harbor Bridge . Wynyard Station is within walking distance . Take the train up to Katoomba and spend the day at the Blue Mountains . After a long day of sightseeing make your way back to the apartment for a quite evening on the Balcony where you can relax and take in the city views of Sydney ."),
("2018-11-24", "22124796", "Nicole", "Very clean and tidy and all inclusions  as advertised."),
("2018-11-27", "22124796", "Cat", "This apartment is lovely  good size and lovely bathroom. Good location too."),
("2018-11-29", "22124796", "Alex", "Great location  clean  great value. Highly recommend"),
("2018-12-06", "22124796", "Katie", "Updated apartment with kitchen and big balcony. Good location near the rocks area!"),
("2018-12-14", "22124796", "Jess", "This was such a wonderful place. The balcony is way bigger than the photos depict and the decor is just adorable in the apartment. The pool and gym were also state of the art and it is literally the perfect location to stay at if you want to experience Sydney. I would highly recommend this home if you are planning a trip here!"),
("2019-01-08", "22124796", "Edel", "The apartment is very comfortable  well maintained and supplied with all the basics in both kitchen and bathroom.  We really enjoyed the outside deck area for a morning coffee or evening cocktails! The building complex also offers a well equipped gym and swimming pool which was a great way to unwind after a busy day.  The location was excellent for both touring the historical Rocks area or enjoying the shops and restaurants of bustling Bangaroo.   We could not have picked a better location."),
("2019-01-22", "22124796", "Andy", "Very nice place!"),
("2019-01-28", "22124796", "Simon", "We spent a very enjoyable six nights at this property  it is in great location within walking distance of the Rocks Barangaroo and Cockle bay which has many lively bars and restaurants. The apartment building is modern and very safe with a 24/7 concierge. You should be aware that there is major development in this area for the next few years and that it can be noisy with construction work during the day  this was not a major issue for us. The apartment is well furnished and is as it appears in the photos it is up to the standard of a good four star hotel. We found the check in to be a little irksome and the apartment a little lacking in what we would consider to be expectations in a top end property such as additional towels and sufficient toilet rolls for a weeks stay. We also felt there should be a house handbook which is particularly important for overseas visitors not familiar with how the air con and appliances worked as well as providing emergency numbers and location of the local hospital.Whilst none of this spoilt our stay we have passed our comments onto the owners who’ve responded positively."),
("2019-02-02", "22124796", "Craig", "Wonderful location  great layout for the one bedroom apartment with a nice outside deck.  Very responsive to inquiries.  Access to the fitness center in the building was wonderful...Would stay again on if in Sydney again"),
("2019-02-14", "22124796", "Paul", "this place is in an excellent location."),
("2019-02-22", "22124796", "Gena", "I had a good stay in this apartment. It is centrally located   Lowe to public transit and felt safe. Pictures are accurate  apartment was clean  and the outdoor space can’t be beat"),
("2019-02-28", "22124796", "Todd", "Exactly as described-will return!  Thank you!"),
("2019-03-04", "22124796", "Carol", "We had a short break at Tams apartment. The photographs accurately show the apartment. It is in a great location being walking distance from Circular Quay s  The Opera House  Botanical Gardens and Darling Harbour. We had a great time and would have loved to stay longer."),
("2018-01-04", "22165464", "Matt", "Location was brilliant  parking easy  undercover and secure. The balcony is large. We really could have used an air-con during our stay and the place does not have one. It has 2 portable fans  but that was not enough to beat Sydney's summer heat. For everything else the place was OK."),
("2018-09-29", "22153101", "Lebron", "We absolutely loved our time at Leah’s! The location was amazing  super close to the train station so it was a breeze getting around. The place itself was modern  very clean  spacious  had all the amenities you need and more! Would recommend to anyone  thanks again :)"),
("2018-11-04", "22153101", "Heather", "We had a fantastic stay thanks Leah!"),
("2018-12-31", "22153101", "Yves", "Perfect place to stay in Sydney. We were very happy with this clean and large appartment. The location is really good; we took the train or the ferry to go to the CBD which is a really short stroll either way. Leah was really nice and responsive. Even with our late arrival  everything was easy. I only have positive things to say about this place!"),
("2018-01-07", "22198157", "Louise", "Duncan’s place offered the perfect family break for us. It’s very accessible from Sydney but gives the feeling of being far away from it all. The location is great being just a short drive from several beaches  shops  cafes etc. The house is incredibly well equipped with everything you can think of and the host went out of their way to provide helpful information and little touches which made us feel very at home. It’s a very sociable home with several eating and entertaining spots in the house: an upper balcony & bbq overlooking the treetops and ocean as well as a lower deck  dining table and bbq area downstairs. The garden is private and the pool area lovely for lounging around under a shady tree. We would have no hesitation recommending Duncan’s place."),
("2019-01-03", "22198157", "Brianna", "Duncan was an amazing host. Great communication with very easy check in. The place was immaculate and had everything we needed and more. Such a beautiful place would definitely recommend."),
("2018-04-06", "22208993", "Fides-Ann", "Our stay at Alex‘s apartment was great. The house is in a great location and the rooms were clean and well equipped. We didn‘t meet the hosts but they left us a notice with helpful information. We really enjoyed our stay and recommend this apartments to others! Thank you!!"),
("2018-05-20", "22208993", "Hillory", "Aleksandra was a wonderful host. She went above and beyond to accomodate our family and make us feel at home. Her place was just as described-perfect location  clean and spacious. I would highly recommend her place to anyone wanting to stay in the Bondi/Bronte area. We hope to stay again in the future."),
("2018-01-07", "22216525", "Jay", "It's my first time to rent house on Airbnb . Fortunately   I choose Willyan's house . Willyan is very friendly people . It's very tidy and clean . If you like surfing   you can't miss this house   just walk 1 min than you can arrive beach   everynight you can hear sea sound from beach   it's very comfortable ."),
("2018-01-04", "22265304", "Tom", "Wow. Stunning location. You can't get closer to the beach. Perfect distance from the corso."),
("2018-07-10", "22265304", "Catherine", "Mark's place was in a fantastic location  right on the beach front. He was really easy to communicate with and we enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-10-07", "22265304", "Mike", "Mark is a good host and apartment is in a great location."),
("2018-02-15", "22269344", "Alex", "The host canceled this reservation 14 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-02-24", "22269344", "Christie", "Best apartment ever! Very stylish  clean  well appointed and a great comfy bed. The location is perfect. Will definitely stay again :)"),
("2018-01-04", "22295090", "Nick", "Close to everything Manly has to offer"),
("2018-01-01", "22296970", "Jay", "Really enjoyed staying with Serena and Mohmed!"),
("2018-01-04", "22304343", "Sasha", "Our family of 4 had fantastic time staying at Sarah’s stylish place with  harbor view! We could not wish for a better place for New Year’s Eve. 3 minutes walk from the major transport hub  close to the CBD  and Bondi beach. Sarah was a great host who looked after us and made sure we were very comfortable. Super fast communication  clean place  fast WiFi  much more! Thank you Sarah for being our host!  Highly recommended. "),
("2019-01-01", "22304343", "Alfredo", "I’m sorry to write a bad review but we are very disappointed about this booking. I’ve sent this comments to the owner but we haven’t received any response or assistance. The place was very dirty. It Looks this hasn’t been cleaned to receive people. Actually it looks it has not been cleaned in a while.There were cockroaches all around the place  mainly in the living room and the kitchen. Bed clothes in the Bedroom were used (you expect clean sheets when you book a place)Sitting in a sofa so dirty is disgusting. And the tv and electronics were not properly connected to use. Everything is full of dust and dirtiness.We had to clean the chairs and table to be able to use them. The add says “breakfast provided” but that was not been arranged.The humidity smell is really bad and it should be a comment in the description warning about that before booking.To sum up  our stay in this place was not pleasant. We came with a lot of expectations to have a good time for new year in Sydney. This is the first time I have a bad experience with Airbnb.My family want to have a good time and don’t want to waste all our days being uncomfortable. They asked me to move to a clean place from the beginning. This was a big problem because booking with no anticipation here  these days is very difficult to find and also is very expensive. I would like to cancel from the first day but we couldn’t find another place until now.I’m claiming for the full refund plus the cleaning fees since this apartment hasn’t been cleaned for receiving us. I also ask for the service fees to compensate this really bad experience. This is the first time I have a bad experience booking a place with Airbnb. I know this is just an isolated case and I trust that the company will resolve my dispute fairly."),
("2018-01-19", "22268452", "Virginie", "Shawn is a great host  he did everything to make our stay confortable and gave us some really nice places to go visit. The room is very cosy and just 5 minutes from the ferry wharf to get you to the city center. We had a lovely stay there and would definitely go back :)"),
("2018-01-28", "22268452", "Aleksandra", "Shaun's apartment is in a nice neighbourhood. Rose Bay is quiet  beautiful and great located area. You can find bus and ferry direct to the center. Shops and cafes are very near. Although  the most important thing about that place is the owner. It was a pleasure to get to know Shaun. He is very kind and helpful person. Thankful to his tips  it was easy to go around Sydney."),
("2018-02-08", "22268452", "Kačka", "Nice accomodation in superb location! 12 mins ferry to CBD  30 mins walk to Bondi beach. Shaun is nice host too! We enjoyed our stay 100%"),
("2018-02-15", "22268452", "Jörg", "Simply good!"),
("2018-02-18", "22268452", "Sabrina", "Nice place  very close to Rose Bay (5 mins walk) where you can easily hop on the ferries. You can find some small shops nearby for almost everything you need. Also  Shaun's hospitality was the best and he was more than willing to help and explain how to get around the city!"),
("2018-02-22", "22268452", "Lars Ole", "The apartment was extremely clean throughout the visit. It is sunny and spacious. Bathroom and kitchen was in perfect condition. The bed was comfortable and the location of the apartment was close to the bus stop and the Ferry.The communication was great and the check-in was hassle-free. Shaun was very welcoming and we felt at home during our stay.All in all we loved our stay with Shaun and highly recommend the apartment."),
("2018-02-27", "22268452", "Noemie", "We had a great stay at Shaun's place. The area is great  with a beach  buses and stores/restaurant nearby.The bed was very confortable and the kitchen well equiped. Shaun was a very nice host  the quality/price  ratio is really good  I recommend the place!"),
("2018-03-08", "22268452", "Michelle", "A generous and very accomodating host. Accessable to the ferry ride to CBD.. :)"),
("2018-03-15", "22268452", "Diana", "Shaun house is great choice to stay in . It is very clean. Shaun was very helpful."),
("2018-03-22", "22268452", "Tim", "The place could be a little cleaner and bug/spiderfree but bedides that the value you get is very good for the price you pay"),
("2018-04-02", "22268452", "Nicolai Alexander", "Nice and quiet neighborhood  pretty close to Bondi Beach by walk. The landlord is a very social and kind person."),
("2018-04-08", "22268452", "Jen", "First time to Sydney and Shaun's place was key to my amazing experience. Relaxing room  close to transit and tasty food  and walking distance to Bondi made for a perfect base for exploring Sydney. I definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2018-04-14", "22268452", "Pascale Et Gérard", "We really enjoy our stay in Shaun's flat. Shaun is a real nice host  very helpfull. We had interessant discussions. The flat is located in a nice area  10 minutes from the town center by ferry. We recommand his Airbnb !"),
("2018-04-19", "22268452", "Miguel", "Hey  for me  -perfect- close to ferry to city ( walkable) if you stay late in the city ferry close at 9pm. I don’t cook means I don’t know about kitchen  Room is small but enough to sleep the nite and go  place is great value for me."),
("2018-04-24", "22268452", "Taechasit", "Good place to be. Close to the bus stop and ferry but not train. If u plan to travel and get back late at night u probably wont be able to find the bus and ferry as well. The bed is great and very comfy. The apartment is quite and clean. The bathroom is abit old and has be kept clean. The overall is great. Shaun is a nice guy!!"),
("2018-05-01", "22268452", "Dr. Hasan", "Shaun is a very kind and helpful person. He is also very flexible in terms of check-in and check-out time if no one is coming to the room that day. The place in located just nearby Rose Bay Wharf and a ferry would take you to the central (near Harbour Bridge/Opera House) in 12 minutes. It was a good stay at Shaun's place. :-)"),
("2018-05-05", "22268452", "Minjae", "시드니 시티와 이곳은 페리로 최단거리로갈수있고 페리타고 시티까지 가는 경치는너무 아름답다 그리고 버스 정류장도가까이있어 움직이기가 너무 편했다무엇보다도 shaun의 친절함은 엄청났다떠나는날 집에다가 선글라스를 놓고왔는대나한테  먼저 알려줘서 금방 찾을수있었다다음 시드니 여행때에도 shaun과 함께하고싶다~^^ 집안에 식기 조미료 다있어요~ 편안한 공간입니다!!!"),
("2018-05-14", "22268452", "Matteo", "Shaun have been an amazing host. The house was clean and quite and Shaun was always available in case needed. Rose Bay is a very nice neighbourhood and the house is located in a convenient position."),
("2018-06-02", "22268452", "Hannah", "Location of Shaun's place was amazing. I just had to walk a couple blocks away  catch the ferry  and go anywhere I liked. He recommended some good places to go and I love them all. Loved having the kitchen and all the necessary appliances needed to cook for myself  lovely cute place!"),
("2018-06-19", "22268452", "Aira", "shuan's place is close to rose bay  10minutes from sydney opera. it's my 1st time in sydney and his place is much recommended if you want to see opera house and bondi beach.close also to train station about 10 minutes from rose bay via ferry. shaun's is quick to response in all y inquiries. easy to communicate with."),
("2018-06-28", "22268452", "Nick", "Rose bay is beautiful  the buses are 4 minutes walk and the 7 minutes. The entrance to your bedroom is through Shaun’s bedroom  though I did not find that a problem"),
("2018-07-08", "22268452", "Carla", "I'm glad I didn't let my perceived awkwardness of having to walk through the bedroom to get to the guest room get in the way of choosing this property. I did nearly all my SYD travel via ferry and it was fast and convenient. Also a half hour walk to Bondi Beach and the cliff walk. I felt welcome and the bath products are great. :)"),
("2018-07-12", "22268452", "Carla", "Shaun was very welcoming and also very respectful of our space during the stay. He was always ready to help when we needed something. We totally recommend to stay at his house. Rose Bay is a lovely place and is only one stop from Circular Quay if you take the ferry which is pretty near Shaun’s house."),
("2018-07-26", "22268452", "Laura", "Probably the most comfortable bed I slept in on my whole trip through Australia! Shaun was quick to answer any questions I had. He has a great kitchen to cook in and the location of the house is close to both the bus and ferry. It was a very quiet  relaxing stay. Cheers!"),
("2018-07-28", "22268452", "Anthony", "Shaun was very communicative and his apartment was clean and close to public transport I would recommend this apartment and Shaun as a host."),
("2018-08-29", "22268452", "Marie", "Excellent location. I haven't seen Shaun as I was always visiting the city when he was home but all the communication was great before and during our stay"),
("2018-09-03", "22268452", "Thales", "Shaun is very good people  he made us feel at home. Nice person to have a talk and have a beer!"),
("2018-09-08", "22268452", "Jia Jia", "Shaun is an amazing host! He pretty much makes me feel like in a home. I can wander around and use many facilities in the house. Also Shaun responded text or in person very quick and kind. The room is big and clean. but the whole house's too cold to me. One thing I'd like to suggest to Shaun is that ""the hot water only running 8 mins"" should be info on the house profile  so people can consider if this condition fits them."),
("2018-09-27", "22268452", "José Roberto", "Shaun is a great host  the flat is conveniently located near public transportation and a short walk away from Bondi Beach."),
("2018-10-03", "22268452", "Léo", "Shaun is a really Nice guy  me and my girlfriend are pleased To meet him  he is obliging.Nice first impression of australia.il parle aussi très bien français pour aider les frenchies a leur arrivé. vous ne pouvez rêvé meilleur hôte !"),
("2018-10-09", "22268452", "Yajing", "All good.Everyone can enjoy yourself here."),
("2018-10-21", "22268452", "Sophia", "Contactable."),
("2018-10-31", "22268452", "Martin", "great host  made sure I was all checked in ok. great location a 30 min walk to Bondi beach and a bus that can take you to the city just by the house."),
("2018-11-07", "22268452", "Sandra", "Shaun’s place is great and unbeatable value for the budget traveler  a super convenient spot close to public transport. I had everything I needed for staying 6 nights and would definitely book again. Shaun was very helpful and quick in replying too. Thanks Shaun!"),
("2018-11-15", "22268452", "舒謙", "房間位置有點尷尬 是跟屋主的房間連在一起(就是要進去房間時會先經過屋主的房間的意思) 有隔著門但沒有鎖｡浴室也沒有鎖(很怕用到一半有人突然進來)｡會介意的人可能要考慮一下在浴室看到不少小蟑螂房間空間很小(除了床剩下一條小走道 大概跟床一樣長 跟枕頭的長一樣寬) 無法打開2個人的行李箱 不太方便 當時我們是把一個人的行李箱放在外面 要拿東西的時候打開 拿完再關起來｡洗澡的時候熱水大概7分鐘就會沒有 當時洗完頭髮還沒洗澡就沒熱水離市區有一段距離 但交通還算方便 出去走5分鐘就有通往市區的公車 走8分鐘就有渡輪可以到環形碼頭跟機場的交通比較麻煩 要轉2-3次的大眾運輸"),
("2018-11-22", "22268452", "Marcel", "Very clean room. Much privacy whether Shaun was there or not. Immediately felt like home."),
("2018-12-01", "22268452", "Aiza", "Nice place and very accessible to the  City!"),
("2019-01-25", "22268452", "Bernard", "This place suited me perfectly. I’m not sure if it’s the same for everyone but it was for me. Very clean and functional. Small but enough for my use. Vicinity to Rose Bay wharf is unbelievably close. I would come back here if I needed to stay in the vicinity."),
("2019-01-31", "22268452", "Jennifer", "Shaun is a really nice and helpful guy  but the place was just dirty. I am really sorry to say that  but unfortunately it is true."),
("2019-02-10", "22268452", "LaFlèche-Raphael", "Shaun has been the first guy I met in Australia when I flew from Canada.  I very appreciated our conversation and the advices he gaves me about where to go and what to do around! If you're looking for something cheap around Sydney  I would totally recommand it! Cheers"),
("2019-02-13", "22268452", "Laura", "It’s not the ritz but it’s cozy and comfortable. Perfect for those of us that can’t afford the moon. Shaun was super helpful with suggesting places to see and is very kind hearted. Also the bed is very comfy! I had the best night sleep!"),
("2019-02-24", "22268452", "Sean", "I enjoyed my stay at Shaun's place. It had everthing I needed  comfortable bed  nice kitchen  great location  minutes away from bus stops  ferry to the city but most of all Shaun's a helpful  nice and easy going guy. Highly recommended !"),
("2018-01-15", "22308786", "John", "We have stayed at many Airbnb homes  this is our all time FAVOURITE place! The apartment is brand new  perfect layout  dual level which offers both privacy + space. For even the most fussiest of travellers - I highly recommend you book as this you couldn't hope for a better team then L'Abode  so thank you for making our holiday so great!!"),
("2018-01-28", "22308786", "Frederic", "This was a great place. Highly recommended based on location and quality of the accommodation and value for money"),
("2018-02-14", "22308786", "梓宜", "Perfect  very clean  suitable for family live  kitchen have all things needed. Beach is very closed  woolworths is about 7 min walk. Our family like this house very much."),
("2018-02-20", "22308786", "Shaun", "A superb two floor property in a great location just minutes from the beach. Clean  fantastic amenities and in reach of airport and city as required. Would highly recommend this property to all."),
("2018-02-24", "22308786", "Meryl", "It was a great stay! Pictures do not do it any justice as view from balcony was absolutely amazing and it was a very stylish apartment for a nice girls weekend."),
("2018-03-08", "22308786", "Christoph", "This is a great apartment with an awesome rooftop terrace and great sea view. Everything was brand new (Feb 2018) and barely used. Very comfortable for 2 couples. Great location close to the beach and all things you need to have in daily life are close by."),
("2018-03-11", "22308786", "Trang", "The penthouse is clean and amazing. We loved the outdoor bbq area as well as the spacious balcony. It is only 2 mins walk to Coogee beach which is super convenient. Will definitely book again next time when we want a weekend getaway to the beach! :)"),
("2018-03-19", "22308786", "Jantal", "This apartment was the best was very very comfortable and soooo close to absolutely everything we didn’t venture far just to all the amazing eating and drinking holes we didn’t cook once although everything u need is right there in the kitchen.  the rooftop was everything we needed for our catch up with our girlfriends who came from nz and interstate for a long awaited catch up it was just fabulous would definitely recommend this apartment for a relaxing getaway."),
("2018-04-08", "22308786", "Will", "Excellent apartment in a great location  with a great view"),
("2018-04-12", "22308786", "Sally", "We had a fantastic stay with plenty of room for a family of 3 teenage boys.  The location was ideal (a quick stroll down to the rockpool and beach each morning for a swim before breakfast) and the views from the balcony are breathtaking.  We sipped drinks watching the sunset and city lights begin to twinkle. The apartment seems practically brand new and is perfectly equipped with everything you need.  Thanks for a lovely Coogee holiday - we'll definitely be back."),
("2018-04-29", "22308786", "Alexis", "This apartment is beautiful  from the decorations to the spectacular view from the balcony. You will feel right at home"),
("2018-05-16", "22308786", "Kate", "The Bream Penthouse was perfect for our mini-break. Close to the beach  restaurants  bars and cafes but far enough away to be nice and quiet. And luxury at such an affordable price!!!  Thank you guys for a fabulous stay. Will be back for sure."),
("2018-05-21", "22308786", "Tracie", "This is an amazing apartment in a great location! Entering the property the first time can be a bit tricky  and if the cleaners can up their game slightly  the experience at this apartment would have met our expectations and more."),
("2018-07-14", "22308786", "Sarah", "This apartment is a in a great location and is almost new. The furniture was modern and nice  bed comfortable. Very quite in the bedrooms. However  we had a number of maintenance issues that were clearly there prior to our arrival and left unfixed. This was disappointing and seemed careless. For example the toilet seat in the ensuite was broken and not stable to sit on  the ensuite door handle had been snapped off so if the door closed could not be opened from the bedroom  there was a broken drying rack that had been dumped on the patio  the towel rail in the main bathroom was broken off and there was no where to hang towels  the coffee machine was broken and the heating system on the top floor emitted a really bad smell. I guess there was a dead mouse or rat in the system or roof. "),
("2018-08-05", "22308786", "Shane", "This property is exactly as pictured  which does not do justice to how good this place is. Spotless and everything is in great condition  bathrooms are clean and the outdoor area is the perfect spot to spend an afternoon overlooking the water. Plenty of space and great contact from the host make this the perfect place to stay. Hope to be back!!!"),
("2018-08-31", "22308786", "Leora", "Great apartment. Central location. Clean and fabulous :)"),
("2018-09-16", "22308786", "Nathan", "Beautiful place in a great location"),
("2018-09-28", "22308786", "Bryan", "Value for the location it is at and the amenities it has."),
("2018-09-29", "22308786", "Kate", "Great location  beautiful apartment."),
("2018-10-13", "22308786", "Louise", "Beautiful clean apartment  great views and close to everything"),
("2018-11-18", "22308786", "Kerry", "Lovely place to stay"),
("2018-11-22", "22308786", "Tom", "The apartment is a great location for anyone looking to stay in or around Coogee. The quality of the apartment is fantastic and the balconies are great spaces for lounging  dining or viewing a sunset.Communication was easy and quick  with check-in and parking made clear with detailed instructions upfront.There's everything you need for a comfortable stay  I would highly recommend it."),
("2019-02-10", "22308786", "Wilhelm", "Great location  very neat property  “on the ball” hostWill book again"),
("2019-02-18", "22308786", "Julia", "What a lovely space! Clean and quiet with lots of light  gorgeous patio with a view of the ocean  fully equipped kitchen with cool filtered water  close to Coogee Beach and shops  quiet and cool bedrooms on lower level with all amenities. Plenty of bedding and towels. Hosts are responsive to questions. Loved the keyless entry. Large flight of stairs inside apartment so not good for those with a disability or bad knees. Perfect space for my friend and I as we had our own bedroom and bathroom   and a hope step and jump to the beach. Thanks for a fantastic stay I will be back!"),
("2018-01-08", "22341528", "Sarah", "Good location. Good if you just want someone to sleep."),
("2017-12-23", "22335017", "James", "Imran was friendly and hospitable  and I slept very well in the bed in the large room.  The apartment is very close to North Sydney station which so convenient and wonderful when travelling to things in Sydney.  The room is also great value. The apartment has simple decor and is in an old block of flats  but the other benefits more than make up for it. Thanks Imran !"),
("2017-12-29", "22335017", "Wolfgang", "to get to your room or to the kitchen you have to go through the room where the host is sleeping .you have to share the same toilet with him.the location is very central and for that usually possibly very silent (during my booking unfortunately there was construction work next door going on).the house  has also a very nice roofgarden (in case you are smoker)"),
("2018-01-03", "22335017", "Lamson", "An amazing man with a wonderful flat which is good location   clean & tidy! I love to communicate with the owner who always have a lot of imagination."),
("2018-01-05", "22335017", "Morgan", "Great host and a great location."),
("2018-04-02", "22344471", "Geoffrey", "Fantastic location  incredible views  and very comfortable accomodation for a short or long stay break."),
("2017-12-28", "22323221", "Andrew", "This was a great space. The host was responsive  friendly and extremely hospitable. A short walk to places like Dan Murphy's  cafes and lots of cheap and cheerful restaurants. Close to public transport (30 minutes from CBD)  and 15 minutes by Uber to CBD  Newtown and most of the iconic beaches (Bondi  Coogee etc.) The dogs also had a blast! Great value for money. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-01-01", "22323221", "Nathalie", "Nice and spacious  BnB with a very nice  spacious sunny terrasse. Near to the airport   Maroubra and Cogee beaches.  35 min with the bus  to the CBD.  Although it's near to the airport and you can see a lot of airplanes  it is not too noisy.Attentive and nice host.  I would certainly recommend it to my friends."),
("2018-01-13", "22323221", "Alexandria", "Good communication & friendly host. Apartment is in good proximity to the city and sights. Very easy to get around if you have a car  with the host allowing you to park out the front for free. The apartment had everything we needed but unfortunately needed a thorough clean. With a good clean this apartment would be a great place to Base yourself whilst exploring Sydney."),
("2018-01-26", "22323221", "Yonglin", "这是我第一次在BNB上订房 对这次住宿体验十分满意 房间宽敞､明亮､干净 卧室里准备了我们所需的床上用品 卫生间有洗漱用具､毛巾､香薰等 厨房用品里一应俱全 房东考虑的十分周到｡我女儿到新南威尔士大学读书 这里离大学不到5分钟的车程 很方便｡一次愉快的经历｡"),
("2018-02-21", "22323221", "Celine", "Agata is a great host. She was here everytime we needed her.The apartment is very well located and easy to reach thanks to the bus.In addition the apartment was very well equipped. We would have liked to have a vacuum cleaner for more cleanliness but we do not regret our choice. I highly recommend Agata's apartment."),
("2018-03-18", "22323221", "Paige", "Loved the space  it was close to public transport making getting around Sydney very easy. Perfect size for what we were after as well."),
("2018-04-17", "22323221", "Nataliya", "Posto fantastico per chi viaggia    chi Cerca una vera casa. Comodo  pulito  molto famigliare. Agata e Jason sempre la pronti per dare una mano in qualsiasi momento. Posizione no ne centrale  ma con centinaia di pullman si muove bene dappertutto. Questa zona “Asiatica” come negozi e locali maggior parte ci sono solo loro. 4 banche 2 minuti da casa. Centro circa 20 min in pullman. Le spiagge 15  20  30 minuti: scegli dove vai ogni giorno ( una nuova).Aeroporto vicino( ma nessun fastidio  o rumore forte) . Letto comodo   tutto molto bello. Gatto e cane sono simpatici.  Grazie Agata e Jason per tutto! Sono stata bene ! Nataliya"),
("2018-05-03", "22323221", "Molly", "Great location near public transport restaurants and supermarkets.Agata is really kind and hospitable everything we need was provided highly recommend this apartment."),
("2018-06-22", "22323221", "Michael", "Exactly as described. Great location and value especially if you need access to UNSW/NIDA. Was very close to lots of yummy Asian eateries that I didn’t have a chance to explore but looked fabulous. The hosts were lovely and good communicators  but happy to leave this introvert alone as well."),
("2018-08-01", "22323221", "Keith", "Perfectly convenient location with good amenities."),
("2018-08-12", "22323221", "Kateřina", "Agata's place was very nice and cozy. It had its own private entrance and we were able to use a parking spot in the driveway. We visited Sydney in the winter  so the temperatures were a bit cool  but there was a little electric heater that was sufficient to keep us warm. We also appreciated the nice roomy bath tub which can be very convenient after a cool day outside. The kitchen provided everything we needed. Agata even left a tube of Vegemite in the kitchen cabinet  so guests can try this Australian speciality even if they are afraid to buy the whole thing for themselves. We would definitely recommend this place!"),
("2018-08-18", "22323221", "Jules", "Agata was a great host  with very quick responses  nothing was too much trouble. Well worth it."),
("2018-08-25", "22323221", "Sean", "Lovely spot to stay for a bit. Stayed with a few friends. The balcony is great. Would love to stay again"),
("2018-09-14", "22323221", "Adam", "great spot. super easy and clean and had everything I needed. would gladly recommend"),
("2018-09-28", "22323221", "Rebecca", "Great place to stay with everything you might need. Location was pretty good. Easy to get buses everywhere."),
("2018-10-07", "22323221", "Kate", "Wonderful place ! Everything you need in a beautiful space. Communication and check in/out was 10/10 ! Would stay here again."),
("2018-10-13", "22323221", "Brittney", "Nice cosy space for two people"),
("2018-10-30", "22323221", "Chen", "交通非常便利 离UNSW步行只需要15分钟｡周围有许多餐馆可供选择 也可以在家烹饪简单的早餐｡Agata回复非常及时 也很热心帮助解决问题｡非常推荐这个地方｡"),
("2018-11-04", "22323221", "Meg-An", "Agata was very responsive and provided all info we needed about access to / getting settled into the unit both ahead of our stay and during it.The unit was basic however had everything we needed for our trip to Sydney  since we didn’t spend a lot of time at the unit. We had clean towels and sheets provided  and the bathroom had everything we needed. It was clean but it was an older unit  which I think people can sometimes mistake for dirty (based on previous reviews I read).We were able to park our car on one half of the shared driveway  being sure to leave the other half of the driveway for Agata and her family to access their garage + home (which backs into to the unit and the garage provides their access to their home). There was also street parking though. We had a brief interaction with Agata and her family by chance as we were heading out one day  which was very pleasant. Agata was very kind and hospitable  however was sure not to be a presence during our stay.Since our stay fell on a warm time of the year  it did get quite hot inside in the afternoon and evening. There is no air con  just a pedestal fan which was in the bedroom. Which could be moved about if you needed it in the lounge room. However I feel in summer it would get super hot inside.Our two dogs felt right at home there - there is a good outdoor space perfect for dogs (secure gate and fences  small grass patches with trees  and a large secure deck area).  There is also a park about a 10 minute walk away from the unit which was great!!Thank you for welcoming us and our two dogs into your home Agata. We had a great trip and appreciated the convenient location & solid base for our time in Sydney."),
("2018-11-23", "22323221", "Brandon", "Super easy and pleasant owner  handy location"),
("2018-11-28", "22323221", "Peter", "Great host"),
("2018-12-05", "22323221", "Thomas", "Had a great stay  thanks!"),
("2018-12-14", "22323221", "頔", "房子周边很安静 道路两边都可以停车｡屋内设施齐全 厨房用具都很干净｡会推荐朋友们也来选择此房源｡"),
("2019-02-02", "22323221", "Christine", "I stayed at Agata’s place for the first three weeks after I moved to Sydney  and I absolutely loved the apartment. It’s a self-contained apartment with a private entrance and a wonderful patio  which is particularly delightful during the Australian summer. The place felt very much like home right away  and it’s close to buses and local shops and restaurants. Buses take less than 30 minutes to the beach and the city  and UNSW and Randwick village are both within walking distance. The bed is comfortable and the TV has Netflix  while both the kitchen and bathroom is equipped with all the basics (such as shampoo  soap  toothpaste  essential toiletries  washing powder  milk  oil  salt  pepper  etc.). Agata was a fabulous host: she was quick to respond to requests (such as replacing the bug spray when it ran out)  and kindly received some mail for me too. I couldn’t have wished for a better place to start off my time in Sydney  and I highly recommend Agata’s place!"),
("2019-02-14", "22323221", "John", "Fantastic hosts. I would rebook in a heartbeat"),
("2019-03-01", "22323221", "Laurel", "There were very nice amenities  and it also felt like a really safe and secure place to stay.  Agata has thought of everything you need for an extended stay.  We made all breakfasts  lunches and even some suppers at home and we had every kitchen amenity that we needed.  The community has great coffee shops  a grocery  excellent bakery  liquor store all within a 15 minute walk to UNSW campus.   This apartment is EXCELLENT for visiting scholars to UNSW and I strongly recommend it.  The wifi is excellent and if any problems come up  Agata responds quickly to help.  The great outdoor space is a huge plus and the privacy of the unit makes you feel like you have your own home.  It is close to multiple public transit stops to get you where you need to go  and a nice 30 minute walk to the beach.  We were visited by a few spiders and beetles  but once again Agata responded quickly to help and had left bug spray in the unit to handle any unwanted guests.  I would happily return to Agata's unit for a repeat visit to the university."),
("2018-02-19", "22295401", "Jo", "It’s wonderful place. Very close to station"),
("2018-03-05", "22295401", "Lucy", "We stayed at Griffin's space in Kings Cross/ Potts Point for a week and enjoyed it - the flat was bigger than I was expecting and being high up got beautiful light which we loved. It really had everything we needed. Griffin was very quick to respond to my messages and checked up on us mid week to make sure everything was fine which we appreciated. The location is fantastic being a couple of minutes to Kings Cross station and all the amenities the area has. The only thing I would mention is that being so central it can get a bit noisy in the flat  especially as the slatted window in the kitchen doesn't close as far as we could see and there was an air conditioning unit or something on the other side of it. But with ear plugs this didn't bother us too much and all the other excellent points more than made up for it. Thanks Griffin! Lucy and Ben"),
("2018-03-16", "22295401", "Rebecca", "Wonderful little place! Great location  easy access to Kings Cross  and close to plenty of food options. Griffin was prompt with responses  helping out with a check in time and very accommodating. Would stay again!"),
("2018-03-20", "22295401", "Martin", "Nice  small apartment. Perfect for short trips to Sydney."),
("2018-03-23", "22295401", "Lauren", "Griffin was responsive  relaxed and very helpful. The studio is cute  well equipped for what you need as a city pad and location great for nightlife  transport links and shops. Tastefully decked out  its size isn’t an issue as it’s well put together. Lovely touch of flowers and fruit from the market too ;)"),
("2018-03-28", "22295401", "Olga", "Cosy and clean apartment in a vibrant area. Griffin is very responsive and thoughtful host. We liked complimentary coffee and snacks provided. Recommended!"),
("2018-03-31", "22295401", "Caitlin", "Awesome stay! Perfect home-base for exploring Sydney that’s got lots of fun nightlife and coffee shops within a few blocks for anyone who wants to do a little work and plenty of play. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-04-19", "22295401", "Alex", "cool place to stay and near everything."),
("2018-04-27", "22295401", "Todd", "Griffin was an amazing host and after a long haul flight from London we arrived to groceries as the supermarkets would be shut for ANZAC day! It was these small touches along with a stylish and extremely clean apartment that made our stay well worth it. If we ever come back to Sydney we will definitely be staying here again. Thank you Griffin!!"),
("2018-05-02", "22295401", "Daniel", "Lovely studio  not the easiest entrance with any amount of bagage. Studio is lovely however."),
("2018-05-07", "22295401", "Nico", "Great spot for a short trip to Sydney. Very close to public transport and great food options all around Darlinghurst and Potts Point. Griffin was an excellent host and we really enjoyed our stay in his nice little apartment."),
("2018-05-10", "22295401", "Yoann", "Great place. Griffin is very available"),
("2018-05-29", "22295401", "Charlotte", "We had a great stay here. Griffin is an awesome and genuine host - very helpful and attentive! It was the perfect location for us as we spent a lot of time walking and exploring all surrounding areas. It’s a compact space which Griffin has done a very good job of making very effective and had everything we could have needed. And a very comfortable bed and pillows ! Plus very good wifi"),
("2018-05-31", "22295401", "Jacqui", "Would highly recommend Griffin's place - fantastic location  very clean  excellent communication"),
("2018-06-02", "22295401", "Sasha", "This is a sweet little central apartment. Great access to transport  entertainment and food!"),
("2018-06-08", "22295401", "Paulina", "We had a lovely week staying at Griffins. The place itself is tiny but it had everything we needed! Amazing location right beside Kings Cross Station so super convenient to catch public transport. My favourite part was that One Yoga is literally 2 doors down! Also the restaurant right across the street - Silly Tart - is a must visit! Griffin was quick at responding if we had any questions and very accommodating. Thanks again!"),
("2018-06-12", "22295401", "Paul", "Griffin was a lovely host and was very communicative when we needed him. Room was a little smaller than anticipated but was very neat  tidy and well kept."),
("2018-06-17", "22295401", "Nikki", "Griffin was a great host! He was so kind & welcoming when we met him at check-in. The studio was perfect for a quick trip to Sydney.  Cute  clean and adorably decorated. Loved it!"),
("2018-07-03", "22295401", "Chia Chen", "Griffin was an exceptional host with great hospitality. He was very welcoming and experienced with his explanations and tips. Really appreciate the aesthetically designed apartment with complementary condiments provided by Griffin! Overall  extremely pleased with Griffin  the apartment and it’s convenient location (very near the train station and surrounded by lots of food)! (: "),
("2018-07-07", "22295401", "Jennifer", "Griffin is a doll. He's very generous. The studio has everything you would ever need  including a white cockatoo on the rooftop across the way  bellowing. So easy to get to  and to get around  whether by transit or walking. Loved it."),
("2018-07-14", "22295401", "Vilja", "Griffinin asunto oli siisti ja viihtyisä. Siellä oli kaikki mitä tarvitsin viikon majoittumiseen. Sijainti oli hyvä: parin minuutin kävely Kings Cross asemalle. Alueella on kauppoja ja ravintoloita  jotka ovat myöhään auki. Miinuspuolena onkin  että katu/alue oli alkuyöstä usein aika meluisa. Alue on trendikäs ja eläväinen ja se kuului myös asuntoon. Parina ensimmäisenä yönä naapurit pitivät niin kovaa meteliä  että minun oli vaikea nukkua. Kerroin tästä Griffinille  joka lupasi ystävällisesti selvittää  voiko tehdä asialle jotakin. Loppuviikon nukuinkin paremmin  eivätkä naapurit enä häirinneet samalla tavalla. Griffin on ystävällinen ja avulias majoittaja  kommunikointi hänen kanssaan sujui mutkattomasti."),
("2018-07-17", "22295401", "Alyssa Janirryl", "Griffin's place was perfect for our 3 day stay in Sydney. The location was very close to the train station and also a reasonable walk to the harbor. The place was also well decorated and we had no problems checking in and out! Would definitely recommend for anyone visiting."),
("2018-08-02", "22295401", "David", "Nice amenities (Coles opposite)   very close to King Cross Station. Unit has no lift  can be difficult for client with large luggage. "),
("2018-08-07", "22295401", "Sherin", "Griffin’s place  is super central - train and bus station within a 1 minute walk  a lot of restaurants  super cozy clean studio. "),
("2018-08-14", "22295401", "Lucy", "This apartment is decorated nicely and in a great location. It’s a real apartment and not a hotel room  so expect the charms and imperfections of an apartment in an old building. Everything works and is clean and check-in was easy. "),
("2018-08-20", "22295401", "Yannis", "Highly recommended. Griffin is a great host and very helpful to any questions! We love the location of it  very close to Kingscross Station. The studio is lovely with everything I need for a weekend  i.e a big comfy bed by windows. The apartment is a few storey up in the building which requires a few staircase walking. Mindful if you have mobility issues. "),
("2018-09-04", "22295401", "Anne", "Très bon séjour chez Griffin qui m'a très gentiment accueillie et renseigné sur les sorties possibles dans le week-end. L'appartement était propre  bien équipé avec une vraie petite cuisine et quelques ingrédients de base. Une corbeille de fruits était également à disposition. J'ai particulièrement apprécié la Wi-Fi portative !"),
("2018-10-05", "22295401", "Olivia", "Nice!"),
("2018-10-09", "22295401", "Rovina", "Griffin's place was clean and conveniently located. And the bed was super comfortable. Griffin was also very accommodating with our early check-in time. Great stay overall!"),
("2018-10-14", "22295401", "Isabel", "Griffin was a lovely host who helped us out with everything we needed for our stay in Sydney. His apartment was cute and clean and perfect for our long weekend away. Good location near a supermarket  lots of cafes/restaurants and the train station. Thanks Griffin!"),
("2018-10-19", "22295401", "Will", "Kings  Cross is packed with cool bars and good places to eat. The flat is next to the train station making it very quick and easy to get to central Sydney and out east to Bondi etc. The flat is basic but well laid out with a nice cosy feel. Kitchen and bathroom are very small so a long stay might  it be ideal for 2 people.Had a great time and would be happy to stay again if visiting Sydney! Thanks"),
("2018-10-27", "22295401", "Michael", "Griffin was very helpful and responded quickly to messages. The studio is in a fantastic location for exploring Sydney."),
("2018-11-09", "22295401", "Arne Philipp", "Nice  stylish apartment with a comfortable bed! Easy communication. Area is a bit rough  former red light district  but house felt really safe."),
("2018-11-16", "22295401", "Joe", "Enjoyed my stay in Sydney at Griffin’s place.  Although small  it worked perfectly for me.  Great location and very clean with lots of charm.  Griffin met me as planned and let me in.  Great communication from booking until check out."),
("2018-11-21", "22295401", "Rebecca", "Griffin's place was amazing! It is an old apartment  but super clean and very charming. Griffin was incredibly prompt with communication and our check in and check out was smooth. Griffin was super understanding as well when our flight was canceled last minute! The apartment is located in Kings Cross  really close to the train station which was great and really easy to get to and from the airport. However  it is Kings Cross be warned. One business next to the apartment is an adorable dog grooming parlor and the business on the other side was a gentleman's club...strange mix! However  considering Kings Cross is a ""drinking area"" we had no issues with noise from the street and felt safe walking around at night (there was two of us). There is no aircon in the apartment but the little fan works nicely. Also there is no fly screen on any of the windows which means you have to watch the windows if they are open (think bugs and birds). Griffin left some sparkling water and fruit in the apartment which was really lovely too. All in all  I recommend the apartment and would stay again!"),
("2018-11-24", "22295401", "Michelle", "Great location and great place! I would highly recommend staying here while visiting Sydney."),
("2018-11-27", "22295401", "Izabella", "Griffin is a great host; friendly  flexible and kind. We were confronted with bad weather conditions in Sydney (our flight was cancelled) and he gracefully let us stay longer to accomodate alternative travel. Also Griffin answered  quickly and accurately to all our questions. The appartment is near Kings Cross Station and is easy to get to by tube from the airport and city center. You can walk from the city center  it is not far but you have to like climbing like I do! The building is an oldie but goodie. It is functional  nice and light. The appartment is on the 5th floor so I was greatful that Griffin could get my suitcase upstairs. I would never have been able to do it on my own.The place consists of 3 spaces: a bedroom with a confy bed  table and a closet   a bathroom with a bathtub and connecting this a small kitchen where  you can cook.Griffin left for us water and some stuff in the kitchen which was very kind and handy for the first day.There are 2 big supermarkets 2 minutes away.There is an baggage airbnb nearby if you need to store your luggage. Very easy and good."),
("2018-12-08", "22295401", "Calum", "Great little place to stay for a couple  excellent location  just a street up from the train station  Holey Moley and restaurants and coles. We felt very safe around the area  considering the bad reputation Kings Cross has  and being told we were next to a Gentlemen’s Club. Would recommend  perfect for a couple."),
("2018-12-21", "22295401", "Harriet", "Perfectly located  bright  airy and stylishly decorated. Griffin was a very helpful host and we had a lovely stay here."),
("2018-12-26", "22295401", "Theodora", "Griffin was a great host and the apartment was perfect for our needs. Compact  minimal and clean it was the ideal base from which we could explore the city. Highly recommended."),
("2019-01-04", "22295401", "Amy", "Griffin was a great host! Highly recommend his place!"),
("2019-01-12", "22295401", "Fay", "Extremely well-located  Griffin’s place is ideal for either lone travellers or a couple. Also to note the area felt safe and the studio apartment was beautifully decorated and the bed extremely comfortable and the place very clean. Would recommend!"),
("2019-02-05", "22295401", "Rubymay", "Such a great little place! Perfect location  legit two minute walk from the train station and amazing restaurants/shops. Griffin was an amazing host  such quick communication with great responses. My only suggestion would be to get a microwave. ;)"),
("2019-02-10", "22295401", "태림", "lovely studio! nice location  clean room. almost everything you need is provided. room decorations are good."),
("2019-02-17", "22295401", "Hannah", "Griffin's met us for check in which was super nice as we arrived quite late  he had also got us some fresh fruit. The place is in the perfect location for transport around the city. It is a pretty busy area at night on the weekends but this isn't an issue in the apartment. Everything was as we expected  lovely and clean. This place is perfect for a trip to Sydney."),
("2019-02-25", "22295401", "Emma", "Griffin’s apartment was amazing!! The space was beautifully decorated and had plenty of space  even for a small apartment. The kitchen had all the basics needed  and the whole apartment was super clean when we arrived. The location is excellent- only a couple minutes walk to Kings Cross Station  and we walked to the Opera House and Sydney Harbour Bridge in 25-30 mins. The WiFi was also great- a little box you could take around with you in the city so you could always have access to internet (handy for maps!). Overall we had an excellent stay!"),
("2019-03-03", "22295401", "Robert", "This apartment is all about the access and convenience to get into the city and It’s true to description and size.What I loved is you are literally a block from King’s Cross Station which gets you to all the trains in the city.The apartment is located about 4 flights of stairs (no elevator) so just preplan on luggage.There is a full size grocery store 2 blocks away and a upscale Woolworths also within a couple of blocks not to mention tons of cafes.There was a small challenge at checkin but I was impressed with how quickly Griffin stepped in to remedy the situation.Overall great experience and provided everything I needed to enjoy my visit to Sydney."),
("2018-01-01", "22343897", "Maja", "Location was perfect! Very close to train station and many restaurants and shops. Communication with Freya was good she always replied to my messages very quickly. Place is very alternative  always full of different people but also good for relax. The only thing I didn't like was cleanliness of the house. But if I had a chance I would book it back!"),
("2018-01-18", "22343897", "Hari", "Great location close to the station and the city center. Quick response and great housemates. The cleanliness of the house was a little relaxed definitively encountered some roaches. But I would come back without a second thought"),
("2017-12-31", "22346270", "Bronwyn", "The room and bathroom were very clean and nicely decorated. It’s a very pretty area  close to plenty of bus stops and shops. Sam was very kind and helpful  I would’ve loved to get the chance to meet in person. Would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-01-03", "22346270", "Katrina", "Very quiet and relaxing place to stay  the Castle towers is a 10min walk . Sam and Penny are very warm and welcoming and always happy to help out. Highly recommended."),
("2018-02-02", "22346270", "Nader", "Great host in a great location. Sam is extremely kind and hospitable and the house is sparkling clean!"),
("2018-02-08", "22346270", "Nader", "The room is super spacious with room to cook and Sam is a super generous and kind host."),
("2018-02-10", "22346270", "Angela", "Lovely clean and well presented accommodation. Not quite as private as the pictures depict. Children running in courtyard outside bedroom. Lack of air conditioning in Sydney summer heat was a big negative. A very large house fully booked made it quite noisy."),
("2018-02-16", "22346270", "Denise", "Sam and Penny were the perfect hosts they really made us feel so safe and taken care of. We were traveling from Ireland and they couldn't have made us feel more at home. It was like home from home. They were so friendly and generous and even entertained us a few nights  Penny cooked some traditional Chinese food for us which was to die for and offered great advice on local transport  places to go around Sydney etc and it was so lovely getting to know them. We had all the essentials wifi  TV and more  it was clean and very cosy and the bed was super comfortable! We simply loved it. It's not often you meet people as genuine and caring as Sam nothing was too much trouble for them. They were the definition of Superhosts!!. Thanks Sam & Penny"),
("2018-03-17", "22346270", "Sam", "It is at great location. The room was tidy and clean.  You can get anything you need at foot step. Sam and his wife was very friendly and give a lot of help for local information."),
("2018-04-18", "22346270", "明泉", "性价比较高"),
("2018-07-17", "22346270", "Eric", "Sam & Penny (His wife) are so gracious and generous with their time & hospitality. The room was as described  very comfortable space to stay in  all shared zones are clean & tidy. This place is the definition of bang for your buck  and you'll make two lovely friends along the way too."),
("2018-07-27", "22346270", "William", "Great host highly recommend will be staying again"),
("2018-08-02", "22346270", "William", "2nd time I have stayed and will be staying again. Very friendly house and host. Highly recommended this place to anyone"),
("2018-10-01", "22346270", "Talha", "A wonderful spacious and clean room with all standard amenities to make your stay a very comfortable one. The internet connection is great and communication with Sam is seamless. Sam is extremely helpful and goes the extra mile to fulfill any requests for you and your family. Thank you for hosting us. Cheers!"),
("2018-10-28", "22346270", "Kailyn", "Perfectly understand why Sam is a super host. Sam's place is by far the best place I have ever stayed in terms of bnb. The place is well managed. Everything is very clean and well designed. Had a really pleasant stay there. Highly recommended!!!!"),
("2018-11-17", "22346270", "Albert", "Sam was very responsive and friendly. The room was well furnished and kept clean. Enjoyed my stay here!"),
("2018-11-27", "22346270", "Eros", "Wonderful and lightful home  amazing hospitality  very quiet and big room with direct access to the backyard  the other guests were very kind and friendly. Sam and his wife are the best hosts I have ever met: thoughtful  helpful  always smiling and peaceful.Next time in Sydney will be surely at Sam's."),
("2019-01-02", "22346270", "Kayleigh", "Sam and Penny were gracious hosts and made castle hill feel very homey!"),
("2019-01-19", "22346270", "Xandy", "Sam is truly a super host! very responsive to messages  and very hospitable as well. the house is neat and tidy  it is basically the same as the pictures posted online. Would definitely reccomend his place to everyone! Me and my husband love the different types of vegetables and fruits planted within the front yard of the house  most especially the strawberries! "),
("2017-12-26", "22297561", "Prudence", "Great location  just off the M7 but quiet neighbourhood. Private entrance with car park right out the front. Easy checkin  even on Christmas Day. Comfy bed. Old bathroom with European style toilet in shower but worked well enough for us."),
("2018-01-06", "22297561", "Siân", "Sam was as amazing host! The place was in perfect condition  and the bed was super comfy. During our stay  Sam provided us with fresh sheets and towels  also giving us opportunity to use the house upstairs. Thank you for everything Sam! :)"),
("2018-01-10", "22297561", "Nick", "Nice clean 1 bedroom unit. Everything you need to make yourself comfortable. Clean and tidy and in a great location. Thanks for the awesome accomodation."),
("2018-01-13", "22297561", "Alison", "Great little spot. Neat and tidy. Sam was a great communicator and nothing was too much trouble"),
("2018-01-14", "22297561", "Chloe", "Lovely studio with all the homely features. Sam was outstanding with communication and responding. She was very accomodating and flexible to make sure our stay was fantastic! Highly recommend this beautiful place :)"),
("2018-01-20", "22297561", "Michelle", "Great people  great service  can be a little noisy if you are a light sleeper  Overall we’re very accomodating  "),
("2018-01-24", "22297561", "Mary Ann", "Very cozy and comfortable. Very quiet neighbourhood and a lovely room. A great host as well! Enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-01-25", "22297561", "Hemant", "Excellent value for money.. cant get anything else at this price."),
("2018-01-26", "22297561", "Tim", "Very nice place  Sam was very informative and a great host. Thanks"),
("2018-01-27", "22297561", "Joanna", "Lovely  modern  cosy apartment. Friendly hosts  easy to communicate with! Good value for money! "),
("2018-01-28", "22297561", "Michelle", "Clean place  comfy bed  pillows and couch!"),
("2018-02-12", "22297561", "Jordan", "Great place to stay"),
("2018-02-13", "22297561", "Helen", "Stayed 2 nights at sams . Easy check in   shops walking distance."),
("2018-02-21", "22297561", "Deslie", "Sam is a wonderful  host and great with Communication.The place is Lovely and Modern."),
("2018-03-01", "22297561", "Mathilde", "Sam place is really well located to visit Sydney ! Don’t take your car if ypu have one and jump in the public transports ! Easy to take and really near the airbnb ! And whenever you need tips or help Sam and her boyfriend are really helpful for it ! The area around is nice and quiet perfect after daily trips in the city to breath out ! And plus I really enjoy doing my yoga every morning outside with the singing parots around ! Will recomend it even more for couple to stay in but no problem if you are comfy about sharing the bedroom/living room with your friends or family as we did with my mum ! Come there and enjoy your stay !"),
("2018-03-10", "22297561", "Karen", "Great little place! Sam communicated very well with us before and throughout our stay. Very well equipped place; we found it perfect for our needs. Parks and shopping centre within walking distance. Wouldn’t hesitate to stay again!"),
("2018-03-15", "22297561", "Kf", "Sam is such a great host who went above and beyond to help make sure my needs are accommodated. That does not mean travelers can be demanding of her. Be nice to this charming lady! Lol! The place is also very convenient with a nearby mall and bus station. Suitable for single or couples traveler."),
("2018-03-18", "22297561", "Anna-Rose", "Sam is beyond helpful with any questions you have or if you need anything. Extremely friendly and welcoming. We really enjoyed staying here"),
("2018-03-24", "22297561", "John", "Basic facilities but no proper kitchen. Adequate for s short stay for a couple but too small for comfort for an extended stay and kitchen/cooking facilities not reaaly suitable for cooking evening meals. Great wifi and pleasant  friendly and helpful hosts."),
("2018-03-30", "22297561", "Linda", "This is a neat studio flat  its in a quiet road near to shops not far from highway to City. Basic fascilities as per description. Clean and great for short term use."),
("2018-04-03", "22297561", "Helen", "Nice place  good value for money!"),
("2018-04-06", "22297561", "Jenny", "Very nicely styled studio.. Nice stay.. good privacy."),
("2018-04-09", "22297561", "Romilda", "Very happy with my stay @Sam's place.  Cute apartment feel with modern touch and privacy. All the basics were provided. Well maintained and kept. Sam had a info booklet  which helped me alot with my stay and exploring the area- really liked that. Will surely come and stay here again. Highly recommend it."),
("2018-04-11", "22297561", "Warren", "Good  location in quiet neighbourhood."),
("2018-04-12", "22297561", "Dianne", "Comfortable  clean and convenient  below family home so expect a bit of normal family noise."),
("2018-04-16", "22297561", "Priya", "Sams place is really nice and cozy.. was perfect for my family.. quite nice and central as well. Would be happy to stay here again.."),
("2018-04-19", "22297561", "Brendan", "Great value  nice touches including a beer in the fridge! No hassle stay"),
("2018-04-21", "22297561", "Natasha", "Sam was so hospitable and thoughtful. Equipped with everything I needed  including comfort. Quite location yet close to motorways. I strolled to the local shop  easy walk. The manual provided was detailed. I will be booking again in the future."),
("2018-04-26", "22297561", "Zviko", "Sam was so lovely. Such a beautiful space  with everything you need."),
("2018-05-08", "22297561", "Suman", "Sams place is nestled  in very quiet  peaceful and resedential area. Place was very tidy  comfortable bed and sofa. Sam and husband were great host  showed excellent hospitality. Perfect for two of us. Would recommend anybody and willstay again if I get an opportunity."),
("2018-05-17", "22297561", "Amaninder", "Good"),
("2018-05-30", "22297561", "Nie", "Aussie living exp."),
("2018-06-02", "22297561", "Gurbachan", "Great location and very clean. Amazing"),
("2018-06-05", "22297561", "Angela", "Great thanks for the coffee and milk"),
("2018-06-09", "22297561", "Bev", "Polite helpful hosts  great location close to amenities  but still private enough to relax. Lovely clean space with everything you need."),
("2018-06-13", "22297561", "Catharine", "Really lovely space  nice and close to transport and shops. Sam was really helpful and quick to respond."),
("2018-06-17", "22297561", "Mike", "my stay there was pretty good and they helped me a lot.They are very kind and patient."),
("2018-06-22", "22297561", "Katrina", "Sam is ver professional. Her responses were very quick and outstanding. The residence is in a lovely suburb of Sydney  Kings Langley. If you're looking for a nice self contained unit  please give it a go! "),
("2018-06-25", "22297561", "Rosie", "Easy to get to  good value for money and great communication."),
("2018-07-03", "22297561", "Evelyn Nutan", "Excellent location overall very quiet n cozy plc n cost wise very reasonable clean n tidy .."),
("2018-07-13", "22297561", "Anand", "Good place to stay for a couple if you want to stay in that suburb. Close to bus stop if you don’t want to drive"),
("2018-07-21", "22297561", "Alicia", "Was great to come back to after a busy day! Thoughtful touches and great amenities."),
("2018-07-25", "22297561", "David", "Great spot and really cozy stylish place."),
("2018-07-31", "22297561", "Dana", "Great if you don’t like the city but still want to be super close to shops and things to do. As mentioned you can hear some footsteps from the home above however Sam and everyone that lived there were courteous and there was no extreme noise or anything like that. I’d stay again!"),
("2018-08-09", "22297561", "Ziggy", "Sam should get extra positive points... when was the last time your host UNDERSTOOD how to sleep comfortably. This is the only host to use proper pillows that support your neck  thus spine  for a good sleep.The accommodation: It is oddly picturesque as a converted garage situated at the bottom of the main house.The greatness:•Friendly residents. •The USB plug socket. Accommodation Tip: The towel rack is attached to the doorway between the main room and the kitchen.Recommendations: Go to Church Street for those evening vibes. What felt missing from an Airbnb superhost: That welcome home goody bag feeling - this would incident a typical bathroom cup to put one's toothbrush in  cold water in the fridge  a full loaf of bread or dietary snack alternatives with spreads  an option of tea/coffee during the stay; these finer super host experience touch was being missed. However there was the salt and pepper condiments. The minutiae of an Airbnb feel was not felt  like a pen and pad  a welcome book with recommended foods and attractions. The neutral (for light sleepers): 1. Only for the well instructed  and using your own power source. Good luck getting your Android to work with the MirrorCast device; don't forget to bring a 2A USB charger. 2. The 6am singing from the bird wildlife for about 30mins. This is AUS  this should be expected and accepted by residence  otherwise try the CBD. 3. The road noise in the distance (this is hardly noticed if not sensitive to sound) 4. As mentioned by the host. The acoustics are not great and you can hear upstairs. This made it into the next category below.The not so satisfying: Unfortunately as the accommodation is a conversion of the ground floor on the property  you can clearly hear the TV  conversations  wonderful chimes from the doorbell and footsteps through the front door from the property owner(s) upstairs. • The accommodation does not retain heat. • The digital signal for the TV in the accommodation always cuts off. • Bowls are provided :-)   but there are no larger size bowls... :-( • The accommodation door does not stop a cold  draught • The Wi-Fi is a home network. If you're able to connect  you will be sharing your devices visibility over the router during busy times with the others in the above property. You can accidentally play your music/videos to the wrong TV or speaker and shock the people in the building upstairs. This is also a security issue for the tech. savvy. • There's only one mirror and one sink  it is head height and is only in the kitchenette-shower. •The bed blanket visually looks like it has seen better days. • Bring your own coffee capsules for the machine."),
("2018-08-15", "22297561", "Kathy", "Overall is good"),
("2018-08-19", "22297561", "Chamika", "Sam is a wonderful host. The apartment was very clean and tidy. All the necessary facilities and amenities are provided. Being so close to a shopping centre also is a huge plus. I will definitely stay at this apartment in the future. I highly recommend it if you are looking for good accommodation."),
("2018-08-21", "22297561", "Imtiaz", "It was good experience. Thank you."),
("2018-08-28", "22297561", "Neel", "Serene location  close to shops and public transport (buses)  good communication by host and we'll maintained property. "),
("2018-08-30", "22297561", "Duncan", "Price and position were ideal for my trip. Place was clean and organized. If you’re a light and early sleeper be mindful of the noise from upstairs - just TV  walking etc. Otherwise all good  thanks Sam. "),
("2018-09-13", "22297561", "Vaisakhan", "It was a nice place to stay. Had some issues with the linen and pillow which the host was happy to solve or offer solution.....Overall good stay...."),
("2018-09-30", "22297561", "Irma", "Cute. Compact. Private. A coffee machine with coffee  milk  sugar provided was lovely. Bed was comfy and really liked the pillows  not too soft  not too hard. We liked that the toilet was within the shower stall as it’s self-cleaning. A bit of a noise issue coming from upstairs which we did not mind at all. Close to bus stops and a good 15-minute walk to shops which was handy."),
("2018-10-07", "22297561", "Connie", "Good place - simple  cheap & just what we needed!"),
("2018-10-14", "22297561", "Johann", "Fantastic place has a base camp for Western Sydney however it is more suitable for business trips or for short stays due to the limit space. House is located in an ideal spot close to major highways and local shopping centre but nested inside the suburbs so you escape the noise pollution."),
("2018-10-20", "22297561", "Cameron", "Nice little flat. Everything we needed. Good location for me. Coffee machine and a few DVD's were nice added touches. Tv is a bit small though.The place is easy to find and access. Apart from the sound of some foot steps from time to time through the floor/ ceiling above  The place is peaceful & quiet and we weren't disturbed at any point during our stay.Would definately consider staying there again.Thanks"),
("2018-10-28", "22297561", "Andrea", "Stayed at Sam‘s place and although near a busy road the place was relatively quite and peaceful. The coffee place a quick 5minute drive was my daily stop. Breakfast  lunch and dinner.   Great food. Comfortable bed and overall a clean  neat place with a lovely view.  Would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-11-01", "22297561", "Craig", "Suitable for my needs."),
("2018-11-03", "22297561", "Eun Hye", "It was a nice place to stay. Quiet  nice  clean  comfortable  and spacious! I liked the easy check in and out system as well. Thank you Sam and Lee!"),
("2018-11-09", "22297561", "Rod", "Don't be taken in by the photo and description. I found the accommodation wanting and wouldn't stay there again."),
("2018-11-11", "22297561", "Shwetha", "It is as advertised. 100% would recommend this place"),
("2018-11-22", "22297561", "Colin", "The description of the property is fair but the finish in the bathroom/toilet/kitchen was poor compared to the lounge/sleeping area. Room enough for 2 people but I doubt for four  steep driveway  less suitable for older people."),
("2018-11-25", "22297561", "Debbie", "Sams was excellent"),
("2018-12-03", "22297561", "Avtar", "Nice place"),
("2019-01-01", "22297561", "Machteld", "The place is nice and Sam reacts very quickly which was great!"),
("2019-01-02", "22297561", "Rian", "great place  terrific and attentive host."),
("2019-01-24", "22297561", "Gareth", "The accomodation was functional and provided everything I needed for my stay. Sam is a super friendly host and always responds quickly with a friendly reply."),
("2019-02-06", "22297561", "Cathy", "Great location. Safe neighbourhood.  Easy walk to supermarkets and restaurants and quick drive to major freeways.  The accommodation was perfect for our needs."),
("2019-02-08", "22297561", "Sam", "Well setup space for the size. Had everything I needed for my work trip. Would stay here again."),
("2019-02-14", "22297561", "Geoff", "Well worth checking out Sam's place  simple  clean and good location"),
("2019-02-16", "22297561", "Sumair", "its good to book in advance and nice place to stay"),
("2018-01-03", "22367184", "Kerrie", "Aimee & Dan's place is located in a vibrant part of the city. A walk or short bike or bus ride to many of the attractions on offer. Particularly good for attending any concert or sporting event at Alliance or Sydney Cricket ground.  The apartment is stylish providing all the comforts of home. The facilities are amazing with a gym and pool in the complex and many restaurants & cafes just downstairs. Thank you for sharing your home Aimee & Dan."),
("2018-01-04", "22295354", "Damien", "We had a great stay at Tracey's studio. It was very clean and comfortable with everything we needed. Tracey was responsive and gave us good instructions to find the place. Would definitely recommend."),
("2018-01-14", "22295354", "Jeffy", "This is my fifth or sixth times I stayed with Airbnb  and all I can say is this is the best experience I’ve ever had! Tracey is a very nice and caring owner  she always answer to my questions in a short period of time  very responsive. The apartment is very clean and new  with a modern interior and stylish decorations. The location is convenient  only 10 -15 mins driving distance to the city. If I ever go back to Sydney I would definitely stay there again  highly recommended."),
("2018-01-16", "22295354", "Leslee", "A lovely apartment  very comfortable and hosts are a lovely young couple. Good value and close to public transport and all that Leichhardt brings  an inner city oasis with hidden gems. Would recommend to friends and family."),
("2018-01-26", "22295354", "Andreas", "Studio32 is a little heaven that made us feel very comfortable after a long trip. Tracey has done a great job setting it up with all you need. It’s exceptionally clean and has a slick design. The proximity to the airport was the key feature for us  however  as Tracey correctly stated in the description the planes do not Tack-off or land during the late hours of the night. We’d recommend the studio32 to anyone."),
("2018-01-30", "22295354", "Lara", "Tracey is an amazing host  she is very helpful with directions and respond promptly. My partner and I love her place as it’s close to restaurants  shops and public transport. The place is a modern studio on top of a garage which was very tidy  relaxing and quiet. Would love to come back again for our next trip! :)"),
("2018-02-04", "22295354", "Daniel", "Tracey's place was the perfect pad to explore Sydney from. We appreciated the modern  comfortable nature of the place and the 24/7 keypad access  removing the need for keys.. It's a 10 minute walk to Lewisham station and a 25 minute train ride to the city. We were also grateful for the small tocuhes  such as WiFi  milk and tea. Overall great experience!"),
("2018-02-04", "22295354", "Christopher", "Amazing!!"),
("2018-02-05", "22295354", "Emma", "Great little studio and at a great price."),
("2018-02-06", "22295354", "Alice", "The space was very clean and new. It was perfect for our one night stay!"),
("2018-02-10", "22295354", "Apinan", "I had a really nice time staying in Tracey's studio. It was as described and more. Highly recommended for a home away from home when you are in Sydney."),
("2018-02-10", "22295354", "Josephine", "Great bolt hole in the inner west. We'd stay again."),
("2018-02-12", "22295354", "Syed Ahsan", "Lovely place to stay near CBD. Close to all amenities. Peace and quite location. Easy to all transport nearby! Marketplace just 2 mins walking distance. The studi itself have modern stylish look and extra clean and on the top tea/kitchen facilities provided. Overall a 4.5 star place to stay!"),
("2018-02-14", "22295354", "Ujowal", "Traceys place was very modern and clean. Even better than the pictures.  It is not too secluded from the city or restaurants as there are many great cafe's  and restaurants in walking distance. Tracey was a great host who respected our privacy.  Would love to come back and stay at traceys place if i am ever in sydney again. Many great touches inside  the studio including breakfast items and cutleries. Thank you tracey"),
("2018-02-16", "22295354", "Brett", "Very nice and comfortable modern place"),
("2018-02-19", "22295354", "Carol", "Great place!! Lovely little touches  would stay again  communication great and easy access."),
("2018-02-22", "22295354", "Murray", "An excellent place to stay  especially if you are driving. Very new  well thought out private unit with all mod cons. Small but great for one or two. I would definitely stay there again."),
("2018-02-24", "22295354", "Cara", "Lovely  private studio  perfect for exploring Sydney. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-02-25", "22295354", "Gabi", "Our stay was only short  but Tracey's place is great! It is clean and cozy  and has everything you need. Good location too. We'll definitely be back! Thanks for having us."),
("2018-02-26", "22295354", "Karen", "Clean  stylish and cute"),
("2018-02-28", "22295354", "Sarah", "Great place to stay if visiting sydney  close to everything  much more private than you'd think and check in was a breeze!"),
("2018-03-02", "22295354", "Abel", "Beautiful little studio. Loved it. Would definitely use again"),
("2018-03-03", "22295354", "Jane", "The unit was easy to access and exceptionally clean and modern. Tracey gave accurate directions and provided everything we could possibly need."),
("2018-03-05", "22295354", "Rebecca", "A beautiful  private  modern apartment. It is obvious that Tracey has put a lot of thought into setting up this place  and providing everything that you need for a great stay. We discovered lots of little extras to enjoy. We stayed on a Sunday night and had no trouble finding street parking for our car. Communication and access instructions were clear. I would recommend it!"),
("2018-03-05", "22295354", "Alan", "The place was ultra modern and very clean and tidy. A great place to stay"),
("2018-03-06", "22295354", "Bill", "Very comfortable and clean  nicely appointed - perfect for what I was looking for"),
("2018-03-14", "22295354", "Rebecca", "I booked this studio for my cousin and daughter on holiday from NZ and they loved it. Looked fantastic just liked the images and was very modern  clean and had everything you need. Definitely would book again."),
("2018-03-16", "22295354", "Monique", "Would recommend Tracey to anyone!Such a nice studio which contains everything you need! Tracey was great at giving me tips for the local area and had great communication. I will definitely recommend Tracey's place to friends going to Sydney."),
("2018-03-17", "22295354", "Achille", "Loved it! New  clean and private!"),
("2018-03-19", "22295354", "Dorana", "Amazing place  perfect for two of us. Clean  beautiful and easy location (close to shops). Great air conditioning in the 40degree heat. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-03-21", "22295354", "Joelle", "Lovely place! Exactly as shown on the photos ..we enjoyed our stay there"),
("2018-03-30", "22295354", "Jonathan", "Studio 32 is modern  stylish  and comfortable. My stay here was fantastic and I would not hesitate to rebook the place."),
("2018-04-02", "22295354", "Libby", "Studio 32 is a very comfortable and sparkling clean space suitable for a couple wanting easy access to the city. Surrounded by Leichhardt eateries and shopping - great place to stay."),
("2018-04-02", "22295354", "Megan", "Super efficient with check in and ensured everything was up to standard for our overnight stay. The space was small but the decor placement was utilised so well the area felt so much greater. Super stylish and accomodating with tea  coffee and small breakfast needs like cereal and milk.Location wise was perfect for us  closest train station was a couple minute drive away! Will definitely stay here again"),
("2018-04-04", "22295354", "Amy", "This stylish studio was just perfect!"),
("2018-04-07", "22295354", "Alissa", "A very cool and contemporary little studio. Great location  a few minutes walk from the shops. The perfect size for one or two people. My sister had dinner with me and there was more than enough room for us to eat and sprawl out comfortably. All in all  it was great value for money. I'd definitely stay again."),
("2018-04-12", "22295354", "Lisa", "My stay at Studio32 was perfect in every way. It was beautifully decorated  impeccably clean and provided everything I needed for a short stay. The information about the local area was very helpful and had easy access to cafes and shops nearby. Would definitely be back and highly recommend as a lovely place to stay in the inner west."),
("2018-04-14", "22295354", "Julie", "Lovely place  modern and clean and the size perfect for 2 people."),
("2018-04-15", "22295354", "Janine", "Tracey's place was the perfect accommodation for our  overnight needs at a nearby function. It is very new & really clean. Although it was a little difficult for the Uber to navigate to late at night - given that the entrance is via a couple of laneways. We enjoyed our stay and will return when next visiting our friends in nearby Haberfield."),
("2018-04-16", "22295354", "Lauren", "Great stay  flexible hosts. Local amenities all you need a walk away."),
("2018-04-17", "22295354", "Nick", "A great place to stay when I come to Sydney on business."),
("2018-04-21", "22295354", "Alissa", "The studio is comfortable and convenient enough that I stayed twice when I was in town. Tracey was even nice enough to help me when I was too tired and silly to open the door. Definitely recommend."),
("2018-04-22", "22295354", "Cath", "Great location. Comfortable Bed. Will stay again."),
("2018-04-22", "22295354", "Rachel", "Amazing  way nicer than it looks. Great little quiet place"),
("2018-04-24", "22295354", "Lisa", "Another enjoyable stay. All aspects exceeded my expectations. Will be a regular visitor for work trips and highly recommend for it’s location  fresh modern decor and special touches."),
("2018-04-25", "22295354", "Tricia", "Amazing  brand new stylish studio  has everything you need & only minutes to shops and transport  lots of natural light  very comfy bed  highly recommend this stay."),
("2018-05-01", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay when I come to Sydney"),
("2018-05-05", "22295354", "Jun", "Great place to stay!"),
("2018-05-06", "22295354", "Natalie", "Was a cosy little place for us for the night and easy to walk to the train to get to the city! Was lovey and clean and the bed was super comfortable!"),
("2018-05-08", "22295354", "Tsen", "The place is really cozy  clean  and tidy. Self check-in is really easy and convenient. Check in anytime to a bedroom with ensuite and kitchenette was great for our last minute trip to Sydney.The neighborhood was quiet  we had a good sleep."),
("2018-05-09", "22295354", "Brandon", "The studio was exactly as advertised. Checking in/ out was a breeze. Though the studio isn’t the largest  it is extremely cosy and homely. Would definitely recommend it!"),
("2018-05-11", "22295354", "Lisa", "Beautiful place to stay with everything you need and more. Very comfortable and convenient location. Hosts are friendly and responsive to any questions. Highly recommend."),
("2018-05-12", "22295354", "Anita", "The studio is very clean  modern and quiet.  We would definitely recommend to people to stay here.  All the little extras have been thought of.  Great shower!"),
("2018-05-16", "22295354", "Lara", "Tracey’s place was fantastic! A home away from home. All the little touches such as breakfast and tea / coffee making facilities  decor  tv and the bathroom were great. It was close to the shops and the bus  so easy to get about. Would recommend to anyone. Will be coming back!"),
("2018-05-21", "22295354", "Rose", "Great location  very clean and tidy  good value"),
("2018-05-23", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay when I am in Sydney...."),
("2018-05-26", "22295354", "Tahlia", "Lovely place  easy to access"),
("2018-05-27", "22295354", "Cindy", "Great place with a super stylish fit out!"),
("2018-05-29", "22295354", "Sam", "Cosy  comfortable and clean place with with stylish modern decor. Easy check-in and out. Approximately 10 mins walk to the nearest train station. Note that occasional airplanes can be heard  but not at night. Would recommend."),
("2018-06-02", "22295354", "Janelle", "Beautifully clean. Comfortable bed. Great location. Easy access and check in. We will be back"),
("2018-06-02", "22295354", "Don-John", "Fantastic location  stunning finishes and great attention to detail and outstandingly clean"),
("2018-06-04", "22295354", "Sydney", "Very clean and modern. Bed very comfortable. Free parking on street. Only took 20 min to get to opera house by train. Lots of restaurants and grocery store within walking distance. Only negative was that you are able to hear the planes taking off in the early am"),
("2018-06-06", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to Stay....."),
("2018-06-08", "22295354", "Lucas", "Wonderful space. Self-contained  completely private  simple & stylish  very clean and only a 5 minute walk to the bus which will get you into the heart of the city in 20 minutes. I will definitely try to book here again next time I visit Sydney."),
("2018-06-10", "22295354", "Shannon", "Studio32 was a great Airbnb with everything you needed. It was clean  thoughtful and situated in a quiet alleyway. Highly recommended."),
("2018-06-10", "22295354", "みのり", "It was really clean.We had a good nightThank you so much"),
("2018-06-13", "22295354", "Catherine", "Great little studio in a great location"),
("2018-06-16", "22295354", "Vinod", "Good place to stay at. Very private and cosy."),
("2018-06-18", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay.... as always."),
("2018-06-20", "22295354", "Lisa", "Absolutely love Studio32.  Fabulous space  lovely modern decor  spacious and all the amenities you need for a comfortable stay. In a quiet street within walking distance to cafes   shops and public transport. I look forward to my next visit."),
("2018-06-23", "22295354", "Michelle", "Such a stylish little find. Loved the black and white theme of the house  it all flowed so beautifully. Great for short stays  no stove top etc but if you won’t be in the house for most of the day you’ll be fine. Also would’ve been good if there was shampoo and conditioner etc but just a note for next time. Make sure you come prepared!"),
("2018-06-24", "22295354", "Daniel", "We didn’t actually come across Tracey in our stay  but her Studio 32 flat is fantastic. It is very modern and very clean. It has a separate entrance down a back street for added privacy which is very secure. We drove and were able to park unmetered and untimed on a nearby street for the whole weekend (1 minute walk away).Studio 32 is located above their garage (separate from the house) within easy walking distance to plenty of cafes  retail shops and restaurants. Lewisham train station is only about 10 minutes walk away.Being under the flight path  it can be slightly noisy with planes overhead at times  but this is unavoidable and goes hand in hand with its fantastic location.I’d highly recommend Studio 32 to others!"),
("2018-06-27", "22295354", "Elise", "Tracey's place was really comfortable  clean and stylish. It was also in a great location as we went into Newtown area for a concert and food - we caught the train in and then uber home - both which were super easy to do. Street parking was really easy as well."),
("2018-06-29", "22295354", "Gemma", "Studio 32 was such a great place to stay  very clean and beautifully presented."),
("2018-07-02", "22295354", "Colleen", "Tracey’s studio was exactly as described plus it was very clean and comfortable.It suited our requirements including easy parking and close to major facilities.I highly recommend this property and will be back"),
("2018-07-04", "22295354", "Nick", "Lovely place to stay when I am in Sydney...."),
("2018-07-08", "22295354", "Nicholas", "Perfect! Nice space  clean  great amenities  quick communication 10/10"),
("2018-07-08", "22295354", "Catherine", "Great studio in a great location"),
("2018-07-10", "22295354", "Emily", "The studio was wonderful and so well designed. We really appreciated all the thoughtful additions to the room  and communication was detailed and easy. It was perfect accommodation for a short stay in Sydney. I’d certainly recommend!!"),
("2018-07-14", "22295354", "Joyce", "The room was lovely and very nicely decorated. Location was great! Off street parking is not directly in front of the entry way  but just a quick 1min walk away! Will recommend "),
("2018-07-15", "22295354", "Fran", "Great for what we needed which was somewhere central to crash before an early flight in the morning. Great location to explore cool part of Sydney. Simple option  and Very new and clean."),
("2018-07-16", "22295354", "Alice Lok Yee", "Great place to stay! Clean and tidy place with all the utilities provided. Such an awesome experience staying in this place with full satisfaction."),
("2018-07-17", "22295354", "Trisha", "This gorgeous studio is beautifully kept and the thought put into the set up and arrangement makes staying here a comfortable and relaxing experience. Close to everything and wonderfully quiet. A smaller space as a studio  yet it feels spacious and open. An uncluttered kitchen that has all the things you need. All the paradoxes. A joy to stay there. :)"),
("2018-07-19", "22295354", "Lisa", "Perfect in every way. Definitely my favorite place to stay for my regular work trips to Sydney."),
("2018-07-22", "22295354", "Bridget", "Tracey’s place is wonderful! It is very modern and stylish yet cozy. Everything was sparkling clean and there was a lovely little selection of tea  coffee  breakfast foods etc. There is even a thoughtful guide with local restaurants and shops. I definitely recommend Tracey’s place and plan to stay there again."),
("2018-07-25", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to satay when I come to Sydney."),
("2018-07-27", "22295354", "Janet", "Beautiful quiet modern studio near to shops and transport"),
("2018-07-29", "22295354", "Clarine", "Tracey’s place was spacious  bright and ultra-modern. Highly recommended! "),
("2018-07-30", "22295354", "Yesora", "We had a lovely time at the Tracey house!"),
("2018-08-02", "22295354", "Lisa", "As a regular guest  I’m always delighted to return to Studio32. Great location  everything brand new. Really appreciate the extras like hot chocolate  milk and cereal. Amazing value in the vibrant inner west."),
("2018-08-04", "22295354", "Leonie", "The struggle up the back lane was worth it- a wonderful little oasis in busy Sydney up a narrow staircase (don’t bring a wide /big suitcase). Lovely place!"),
("2018-08-10", "22295354", "Catherine", "Great studio  great location"),
("2018-08-13", "22295354", "Lauren & Troy", "This is a great little self contained unit. It was super clean  looked very new and modern. Private entry was great and check-in and out was a super easy and smooth process with all details sent through the day before. The shops and public transport a super close  an easy walk away. Cannot fault it  was a lovely place to stay for a long weekend  close to family living in the area. Thanks."),
("2018-08-14", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay when I am in Sydney on business"),
("2018-08-18", "22295354", "Damian", "What a fantastic place! Excellent communication and check-in arrangements. Sparkling clean  beautiful and large space  fantastic location  warm and we'll equipped. A++++++"),
("2018-08-19", "22295354", "Sara", "We had a great stay at Tracey's."),
("2018-08-22", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay when in Sydney on business"),
("2018-08-25", "22295354", "Sandy", "We loved our stay in Studio 32.  The decor is very smart and comfortable  the location is handy to shops  restaurants  a cinema  public transport and a couple of nice parks - a tiny one at the bottom of the street and larger  Petersham Park  less than 10 minutes walk away.  Basic provisions  local information  and small  thoughtful extras made it a very comfortable location for our weekend in Sydney.  We'll happily return when next in Sydney!"),
("2018-08-27", "22295354", "Don-John", "Tracey's place is always an amazing stay as it's cozy and absolutely clean with thoughtful touches. The stylish and trending decor is fantastic! The bed is amazingly comfortable and we love staying here  which is why we keep coming back."),
("2018-08-28", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay -"),
("2018-08-30", "22295354", "Lisa", "Perfect! Always a delight to return to Studio 32."),
("2018-09-01", "22295354", "Cameron", "What a lovely and clean little apartment! I would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-09-02", "22295354", "Hilary", "thank you tracey. your little retreat is a perfect  private place. i didnt want for anything. xx"),
("2018-09-03", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay -"),
("2018-09-09", "22295354", "Leonie", "Clean  well-organised  new and easy to find your way around the neighbourhood."),
("2018-09-10", "22295354", "Lawrence", "Great little spot  close to everything "),
("2018-09-17", "22295354", "Pam", "Comfortable  sparkling clean  thoughtfully decorated  small but perfectly formed with lots of appreciated added touches."),
("2018-09-19", "22295354", "Lara", "Tracey’s place is a great place to stay. Easy to get to  great amenties and a great vibe. Almost feels like you are staying at your own house!"),
("2018-09-20", "22295354", "Pam", "This apartment is clean  comfortable and has many little touches that make it a great place to stay for a short time. Tracey is welcoming and helpful."),
("2018-09-24", "22295354", "Joanne", "Great stay - funky space - great to explore the area - very handy to buses etc"),
("2018-09-25", "22295354", "Alanna", "Studio32 is a great little spot  close to a supermarket and a station. It only took about 45 minutes to get to the airport via public transport which was really handy! The bed is really comfy too. Perfect spot for a short stay  had all basic kitchen appliances but no cooker so mightn’t be ideal if you are wanting to cook. But for us it was great and more than we needed :)"),
("2018-09-25", "22295354", "David", "Lovely place deserved to stay!"),
("2018-09-28", "22295354", "Catalina", "Lovely place! High recommend"),
("2018-09-29", "22295354", "Mitchell", "great space and easily accessible. Couldn't have asked for better after a late night at a wedding."),
("2018-10-02", "22295354", "Chris", "Great host  quick responses  good location. Would highly recommend Tracey’s place for a couple"),
("2018-10-07", "22295354", "Laurie", "Studio 32 is spotless  very comfortable  private and has all the amenities you could want for an overnight or longer stay."),
("2018-10-10", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay....."),
("2018-10-11", "22295354", "Lachlan", "Cozy little place that’s within arms reach of all you could possibly need in the city! It has all you need for a pleasant stay."),
("2018-10-13", "22295354", "Lisa", "Beautifully designed & well kitted-out studio in quiet Leichhardt laneway. Lots of natural light from long windows overlooking the rooftops. Gorgeous bathroom & kitchenette  comfy bed. Recommend and would return."),
("2018-10-16", "22295354", "Niki", "The accommodation was perfect - clean  stylish and with all the essential amenities. It was a great location for us whilst visiting our son in Leichhardt  we can highly recommend!!"),
("2018-10-22", "22295354", "Laurie", "Lovely  clean and private accommodation  close to amenities and the Italian influenced Leichhardt."),
("2018-10-23", "22295354", "Nick", "Great place to stay when in SYDNEY on business...."),
("2018-10-27", "22295354", "Melanie", "Tracey’s place is really stylish and comfortable!"),
("2018-10-28", "22295354", "Sarah", "Great location  clean and cosy. Super amenitiies  highly recommended."),
("2018-10-30", "22295354", "Deanna", "Tracey’s apartment was a joy to stay in. It is a beautiful  sparking clean apartment  and is in an excellent location close to a big shopping centre. The checkin and out was so simple  and the thoughtful touches really bought the experience to a new level. I would recommend anyone to stay here !!"),
("2018-11-02", "22295354", "James", "Fantastic location halfway between the city and the Sydney Olympic Park complex. Perfect for those in town for entertainment and then being able to enjoy all the things Sydney city have to offer. Would easily recommend and return in a moments notice. 5 stars all the way!"),
("2018-11-04", "22295354", "Helen", "A modern  clean and comfortable studio. All inclusions are perfect. This Sydney suburb is directly under the flight path and has aircraft noise."),
("2018-11-07", "22295354", "Annette", "We really enjoyed our stay in Tracey's flat. It's compact and very well designed.  The quiet air-conditioner helped us effectively through a couple of hot days/nights.  The apartment is very well equipped. Even though centrally located (minutes' walk from bus stops and train stations) it was very quiet.  Occasional aircraft noise did not bother us."),
("2018-11-09", "22295354", "Ellana", "Really awesome place heaps nice"),
("2018-11-14", "22295354", "Jane", "Studio 32 is a great place to stay...near enough to Sydney CBD with great local amenities. Buses are nearby and frequent. The room is immaculate  comfortable and stylish...I hope to be back on my next trip in 3-4 months. Tracey was welcoming and responded quickly to any emails. Certainly a credit to the Airbnb community"),
("2018-11-16", "22295354", "Tanita", "Was such a great place to stay! Super clean and cozy and central to all the happening places! Will definitely be staying here again!!"),
("2018-11-18", "22295354", "Sandra", "Tracey’s place was stylishly decorated with lots of thoughtful touches. It was perfect for a special night away for a couple. Close to some great cafes and restaurants and train was a short walk away. Tracey provides lots of info on the local area including maps which was helpful. Thanks for having us. It was a perfect weekend."),
("2018-11-19", "22295354", "Paul", "A beautiful and simple space in a great area. One of those places that I'm tempted to give just one star so that we can keep it to ourselves!"),
("2018-11-20", "22295354", "Lara", "I love Tracey’s place!"),
("2018-11-22", "22295354", "Emma", "Tracey’s place was well located  amazingly clean and very easy to check into as well as park. I would definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2018-11-26", "22295354", "Pariss", "Great little studio in a good spot in Leichhardt. Very comfortable and stylish. We would definitely stay again."),
("2018-11-27", "22295354", "Yvonne", "Great stay"),
("2018-12-01", "22295354", "Jessica", "A great  cosy place to stay. Very stylish and clean with all the basics that you need."),
("2018-12-04", "22295354", "Karin", "Very comfortable stay! Felt right at home! Definitely recommend ☺️"),
("2018-12-05", "22295354", "Lisa", "Fabulous private apartment."),
("2018-12-10", "22295354", "Tiffany", "Tracey’s place was amazingly clean and felt like home with the some of the creature comforts added. It was very easy to check in and private  we didn't feel intrusive at all. I would definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2018-12-13", "22295354", "Stefan", "Scher schönes Apartment und viele gut durchdachte Details. Sehr stylisch und mit allem eingerichtet  was man so braucht. Habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt."),
("2018-12-14", "22295354", "Tim", "Lovely space to unwind between city adventures"),
("2018-12-15", "22295354", "Kate", "We really enjoyed staying at Tracey's loft studio apartment.  Easy self check in process and the studio was spotlessly clean.  Very comfortable bed  lovely shower and very efficient use of the space.  We'd love to stay again and would recommend this place for anyone wanting to stay in the Inner West of Sydney."),
("2018-12-22", "22295354", "Nicole", "Had an amazing stay  the place was lovely  clean and such an easy stay."),
("2019-01-30", "22295354", "Patrick", "Great location near some good restaurants. Very modern space!"),
("2019-02-06", "22295354", "Lara", "Great place. Stylish  great bathroom and bed and the kitchenette is perfect to make easy meals. A/c in summer a blessing as well."),
("2019-02-09", "22295354", "Debs", "Nice clean studio apartment in a fantastic location. Enjoyed our stay."),
("2019-02-10", "22295354", "Shannon", "Tracey's place was excellent. Perfect sized unit with everything you need and a stylish bathroom to boot.Super close to cafes and public transport...Tracy was kind enough to grant us a late check out as well.Great stay!"),
("2019-02-12", "22295354", "Lachlan", "Absolutely amazing space; close to transport and other services  very clean and comforting. Would stay again and again and again!"),
("2019-02-17", "22295354", "Joseph", "This studio is a compact yet comfy  well-maintained place to lay your head – well connected via train and light rail to the inner west and centre of Sydney. Recommended."),
("2019-02-20", "22295354", "Katelyn", "Can’t pick out anything bad about our stay at studio 32. Very comfortable  stylish and homely apartment"),
("2019-02-23", "22295354", "Annika", "Clean and excellent location! Tracey provides clear and accurate instructions. Perfect for an overnight stay."),
("2019-02-23", "22295354", "Sam", "Great location  extremely clean and easy check-in. Highly recommend"),
("2019-02-24", "22295354", "Andrew", "This place is great  so clean  private highly recommend."),
("2019-02-26", "22295354", "Paul", "All in all a good private place very clean & tidy Great location within walking distance of a park  Market place & many Restaurants Breakfast in the form of oatmeal sachets& condiments Tea & Coffee Unrestricted parking on the street close bye"),
("2019-03-01", "22295354", "Genna", "We had an amazing one night here. Had everything we needed for our short stay and was in an awesome location.  The room was really private which we loved. Thanks Tracey"),
("2019-03-03", "22295354", "Emma", "Tracey’s place is fantastic. We have stayed twice now and it is conveniently located  close to great restaurants and cafes and easy to catch the train. The space  especially the bathroom  is comfortable and plenty big enough for two. Wouldn’t hesitate to stay there again."),
("2018-01-01", "22378312", "Terry", "Nice & clean  great location with easy walking access to the city  harbour & train station. Thanks again."),
("2018-01-04", "22378312", "Erika", "Good spot at a great location  next to train station and a few bus stops  great restaurants and bars  20 minutes away from the CBD."),
("2018-01-16", "22378312", "Ariane", "Lachlan's place is great located surrounded by coffee shops  bars and restaurants. Train station and supermarket is around the corner. The interior has been simple. However  the entrance walk way through the tropical jungle was quite impressive and unexpected. Furthermore  the appartment includes a nice roof terrace to hang washing :) Lachlan is an awesome host and very supportive and care taking. All in all it was a great experience and I would recommend it."),
("2018-01-22", "22378312", "Rebecca", "Great spot - 5 mins walk to Kings Cross station  buses  20 minute walk to City.  Restaurants  cafes  bars all in close proximity. Lachlan the host  was obliging  friendly  helpful and checking in was easyWas a little bit of noise from Main Street late at night (but you have to expect that in a central location) and from 7am onwards due to construction works (guess this is temporary). Overall enjoyed our stay and great value for money"),
("2018-02-07", "22378312", "Hugo", "Thanks you. Just no WiFi in apartment and the kitchen was no equipped ( no casserole  salad bowl...)"),
("2018-02-11", "22378312", "Jon", "Great location only few minutes from Kings Cross station yet quiet and peaceful. Coffee shop few doors up the street is also worthwhile."),
("2018-02-21", "22378312", "Alice", "Good location and space. Lachlan was very friendly and on time when we arranged check in."),
("2018-03-01", "22378312", "Nico", "Location: It is very good location only a few minutes from Kings Cross station  so you can go everywhere in a couple of minutes. Apartment: Clean  comfy and has everything that you can need.Owner: Very friendly   has a helpful attitude and assists you in whatever you need.So triple check = 100% recommended"),
("2018-03-04", "22378312", "Patrick", "Fantastic place  Lachlan (the host) is a top bloke  very helpful and accommodating. Have an awesome timeCheers mate! :-)"),
("2018-03-11", "22378312", "Sebastian", "El departamento es amplio y es perfecto para 3 personas que estan de vacaciones . La zona esta muy buena ya que hay buenos bares y restaurants. Esta a 15/20 min caminando del centro de la ciudad. Un supermercado esta a 200 metros. Realmente si vuelvo a Sydney  volvería al mismo lugar."),
("2018-03-16", "22378312", "Alexandra", "Stayed at Lachlan’s place for a work trip for a week. The location is perfect only a 20min walk to the city and after work locally there are so many restaurants and things to do that it couldn’t have been better. The place is clean and exactly as the pictures show it to be. Lachlan was available for anything we needed. I would recommend this place to anyone and would definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-03-18", "22378312", "Maude", "My parents and I stayed at Lachland’s place for 3 nights to visit Sydney and the surrounding and the location was just perfect! Close to restaurant  cafes  shops and the train station. Communication with Lachlan was really good and he is very nice and friendly! The place was neat  however the kitchen was poorly equipped  we had only one toilet paper roll for the length of our stay and the beds very very uncomfortable. Generally speaking the place was good and I would recommend it for a short stay in Syndey!"),
("2018-03-21", "22378312", "Jeroen", "Lachlan is a great host! Easy to contact and quick responses. The apartment is amazing to stay in. Close to all you need and far away to have a peaceful stay. Definitely a recommendation to enjoy your stay in Sydney!"),
("2018-03-30", "22378312", "Alexander", "The flat is near KingsCrossStation. Supermarket and Restaurants are near. The Host helps to enjoy the stay."),
("2018-07-13", "22378312", "John", "We really liked Lachlan's apartment. Lachlan was very helpful and responsive. The location is about half way between the Rocks and Bondi beach which was nice. The only complaint was we were there in winter and the nights were very cold and there was no central heating and we only had one small space heater to heat four rooms. Otherwise  highly recommended. "),
("2018-07-30", "22378312", "Jonathan", "This apartment is a great one if you want to explore Sydney for a few days. Close to Kings Cross station and supermarkets  bars etc."),
("2018-08-02", "22378312", "Lydia", "Lachlan is a terrific host. Amiable and kind. His location is right in the heart of a bustling town.  So close to everything."),
("2018-08-07", "22378312", "Kelly", "The location is very nice!"),
("2018-08-14", "22378312", "Sara", "Great location and amenities for a short stay very close to central Sydney. Easy check in and out plus great local shops and eateries"),
("2018-08-17", "22378312", "Jen", "A perfect  central location and very clean and spacious apartment. Lachlan’s communication was excellent and he was really helpful and accommodating. Would definitely recommend as a great base for a Sydney trip! "),
("2018-08-21", "22378312", "Russell", "A great apartment in a great location. It is within walking distance of the harbour and also very close to Kings Cross station. The rooms were comfortable."),
("2018-09-01", "22378312", "Nathan", "Great location near Kong’s cross with plenty of places to eat nearby. I felt like I was able to escape the city and relax without really leaving the city."),
("2018-09-17", "22378312", "Vishruti", "Great value for money given the location. Super close to the train station and local groceries. I’d definitely live here again!"),
("2018-09-26", "22378312", "英华", "Very close to city centre!"),
("2018-10-01", "22378312", "Annalyse", "The location was perfect  very central with great public transport near by. After some understandable complications with check in  Lachlan went above and beyond to make things up to us and ensure we had the best stay possible in Sydney. We would 100% go back."),
("2018-10-24", "22378312", "Simon", "super easy check in and a really nice spot and location  highly recommended!!"),
("2018-11-04", "22378312", "Gauthier", "Very nice flat in a very good location .Close to the city center."),
("2018-11-29", "22378312", "Cara", "Great location - very short walk to kings cross station. Apartment is fully furnished - nothing fancy but all you really need."),
("2018-12-05", "22378312", "Justin", "Lachlan's place is great. It's in King's Cross  which used to be the area to go out clubbing  but is now getting to be a bit more relaxed. The apartment itself is really nice  clean  and fairly large. Lachlan was extremely quick and helpful with his responses. Check in and check out were a breeze. Everything was great  except for the dryer in the apartment. If you do laundry  I recommend hanging the clothes out on the line on the roof."),
("2019-01-06", "22378312", "Domy", "Appartement très bien situé."),
("2019-01-13", "22378312", "Carolina", "Really nice location and very comfortable apartment! Perfect"),
("2019-01-22", "22378312", "Julia", "Great location and easy as well as friendly communication. Very supportive in terms of making sure we had everything we needed since there were e.g. not enough glasses for the three of us. Windows were not opening/closing properly but even though Lachlan offered to get them fixed during our stay  we agreed fixing them after would be alright. All in all  awesome location and great host!"),
("2019-01-27", "22378312", "Nick", "Really fantastic location  super close and accessible to the city  kings cross  bondi beach  and local amenities like a super market. However  there is no proper ventilation so the room becomes very stuffy and hot during the day and evening."),
("2019-02-02", "22378312", "Berit", "Centrally located  nice host  but not quite what we were expecting....."),
("2019-02-07", "22378312", "Cc", "The bnb is conveniently located. And the host is helpful."),
("2019-02-14", "22378312", "Perrine", "Très bonne localisation ! Appartement propre et équipé du nécessaire."),
("2018-01-01", "22362742", "Jing C.", "Very good host  helpful and responsible  room is tidy and comfortable  definitely come back"),
("2018-01-03", "22362742", "Katie", "This place is well situated and secure. Walking distance to all major transportation and the local restaurants are fantastic. Would highly recommend."),
("2018-01-08", "22362742", "Luke", "The apartment was very nice  in a great location and the check-in process was quick and easy. Had a very nice stay in Sydney for the cricket!"),
("2018-01-10", "22362742", "Moyra", "Great apartment  great location  would recommend it to anyone wanting to be in the middle of the city. We loved it  will definitely be back. Eleni was fantastic to deal with also!"),
("2018-01-13", "22362742", "Vanessa", "Awesome position.  Beautifully appointed. One of the nicest Airbnb's we have stayed in.  Close to awesome bars and restuarants as well as the city.  Highly recommended and we will be back."),
("2018-02-01", "22362742", "Jerry", "Good location and lovely place"),
("2018-02-04", "22362742", "William", "If you are a foodie like my wife and I. This location is out of this world.Rey's Place on the ground floor is the best ""Suckling pig"" I have ever had.Really good Restaurants from every nation. On the corner is a great coffee shopThe Apt. was really nice. Check in was easy. Enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-02-11", "22362742", "Paul", "Eleni's place is situated in a fantastic spot in Sydney. Right amongst it. The unit is clean  chic and well decorated. A comfortable bed takes up just about all the space in the bedroom and a comfortable pullout sofa can be used  as a second bed. All in all thoroughly recommended. Cheers Paul"),
("2018-02-12", "22362742", "Han", "位置不错 房间也很好 房东回复很及时｡"),
("2018-02-16", "22362742", "Martin", "Excellent place  very stylish and in a great location. Coupled with an excellent host who communicates very promptly makes for a relaxing stay in central Sydney"),
("2018-02-17", "22362742", "Amirreza", "Nice stylish apartment in a very central location. There are plenty of options close by for food and drinks. Eleni and her mom were great hosts :)"),
("2018-02-20", "22362742", "Zoe", "Great location  easy to reach famous tourist spot including the Opera House  Darling Harbor  China town  etc. Also only 10min walk to supermarket. The apt is very clean with IKEA style decoration  and clothes washing machine  dish washer  oven are friendly to use. Host Eleni is very considerate and helpful  even first aid pad is also available for use in cabinet."),
("2018-03-07", "22362742", "Roy", "The location was perfect because everything that you would need is within walking distance.  Eleni was a great host and was very response when we had question.  We will definitely stay here again."),
("2018-03-22", "22362742", "Andreja", "Very satisfied  everything was as expected  very good location  excelent host..."),
("2018-03-24", "22362742", "Katie", "This unit was just ideal and everything and more! We cannot recommend it more highly!"),
("2018-04-03", "22362742", "Irene", "Eleni’s house is very clean and comfortable. The location is very good. Eleni and her sister are very nice. Everything is very well!"),
("2018-04-08", "22362742", "Lucy", "Eleni’s home is beautiful and clean and welcoming for our weekend in Sydney."),
("2018-04-15", "22362742", "Louise", "Darlinghurst is an excellent location for a city stay. It's cafe and club culture makes for a fun vibe. The area is buzzing at all hours  and fortunately the apartment is nice and quiet  for when you do actually want to sleep. It's a nicely laid out and decorated apartment and I would stay again or recommend to friends."),
("2018-04-17", "22362742", "Emma", "Great little gem in the heart of every thing. Elenis place is clean and well appointed and communication is quick and easy. Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-04-18", "22362742", "Joel", "This Airbnb is akin to a good hotel suite  very clean and nicely appointed. Darlinghurst is magic and this apartment puts you in the heart of it. Quiet but super central at the same time. Fabulous host  highly recommended!"),
("2018-04-22", "22362742", "Wenxin", "This is a really nice place to live."),
("2018-04-24", "22362742", "Eline", "The apartment was stylish  clean and super convenient. It is located within walking distance to some of the biggest attractions in Sydney  perfect for a group of tourists like us who enjoyed a lot of sightseeing. The host made everything super easy for us from check - in until the end of our stay. We had a perfect stay at Eleni's place!"),
("2018-04-29", "22362742", "Laura", "Clean neat space  ideal for people wanting to be close to the city  but not in amongst the hustle and bustle. Bed was comfy! Pull out soda was good too. Thanks!"),
("2018-05-20", "22362742", "Prerona", "Amazing apartment close to the city and restaurant  tastefully done and warm host"),
("2018-06-08", "22362742", "Anke", "Thankyou Eleni for providing such a wonderful unit.  It was perfect for our requirements  exactly as the photos showed   in a very good location and the construction noise that you advised us of was minimal and did not impact our stay at all.  Many thanks."),
("2018-07-04", "22362742", "Carol", "The apartment was exactly as it appears in the photo's.  A lovely space  beautiful decor. Fresh and completely updated. Eleni was extremely responsive both before and during our stay. She went out of her way to make our stay comfortable. The location was great for travels all throughout Sydney  from the beaches to the opera house  harbor bridge  Darling Harbor and all surrounding areas. "),
("2018-07-07", "22362742", "기민", "집은 사진에서 보는것과 동일합니다. 깨끗하고 예뻐요. 항상 질문에 친절하게 응답해주셔서 감사했습니다."),
("2018-07-11", "22362742", "Chris", "This was the first time I have booked through Airbnb and Eleni has set an extremely high standard for all my future bookings.  Everything worked smoothly from our first communication to the last.  Her apartment was perfect for our stay.  It is situated in such a great area  close to shops and even within walking distance to the CBD and Circular Quay.  It was sparkling clean and provided all the amenities we needed.  Thanks again Eleni for being a great hostess!"),
("2018-07-16", "22362742", "Jisu", "사진보다 실제 공간이 더 넓은느낌이어서 예상보다 좋았습니다. 쇼파베드도 생각보다 편해 큰 불편함이 없었습니다. 주변에 괜찮은 식당도 많고 나쁘지않은 숙소입니다. 단점이라면 수압이 약해서 샤워할때 조금 불편했어요.  There was a problem(it's not Eleni's fault) and she try her best to solve it. She is kind host:) The house is lovely  and there are lots of fancy restaurants around this place. Moreover  the house is bigger than I expect."),
("2018-08-05", "22362742", "Gianni", "Bell’alloggio in una posizione eccezionale per visitare Sydney"),
("2018-08-17", "22362742", "秀娟", "房间厨房用品齐全 房间很干净｡位置很好 距离大部分景点都能步行到达｡"),
("2018-08-27", "22362742", "Shuli", "Beautiful and clean apartment in a great neighbourhood  lots of lovely cafes in the vicinity. Eleni was a very helpful host. We enjoyed the stay a lot  thanks Eleni!"),
("2018-09-30", "22362742", "Lisa", "Perfect location for our trip to Sydney. Not too far from Museum train station for trip from airport (~$18) and also just a short walk uphill to bus stop to Bondi Beach ($3.66!). Numerous restaurants  cafés  and shops both uphill and down.  Washer and dryer were nice to have and full kitchen too. Bed and sofa bed were very comfortable. Easy access in and out."),
("2018-10-16", "22362742", "Michael", "Great place"),
("2018-10-21", "22362742", "준희", "comfotable location and clean house"),
("2018-10-30", "22362742", "Kiki", "This was my second stay with Eleni in a different unit of the building and it was just delightful.  Extremely clean  cute space  convenient washer/dryer  etc.  The location is amazing and I've now become friends with the restaurant downstairs that has an incredible food menu and cocktails!  Highly recommend making this your home while staying in Sydney."),
("2018-11-08", "22362742", "Sheronna", "Very pleasant stay  however  a few cockroaches and spiders that visited that made it a tad unpleasant. Host did have bug spray which was great. And host was a great communicator and had other people to contact in her absence. Lovely and thoughtful touches and very convenient location. And  the cleaners were very lovely as well. Thanks Eleni."),
("2018-11-10", "22362742", "Rosey", "A great location  very clean bright space - perfect for a weekend getaway in Sydney!"),
("2018-11-16", "22362742", "Linda", "We enjoyed staying at Eleni’s Place. It was very clean and quiet and all communication went well. If was easy to walk most places in Sydney from this location. Would stay there again if we return to Sydney."),
("2018-11-21", "22362742", "Hary", "Thanks for being a wonderful host. Great place and so central in the city. Eleni was so quick to respond to queries and made sure the stay was as enjoyable. Would happily stay again."),
("2018-11-25", "22362742", "Saad", "Great location and nice modernly well equipped apartment.  Recommended."),
("2018-11-28", "22362742", "Sen", "every thing ok"),
("2018-12-04", "22362742", "Rachel", "Perfect little space to start our Australian adventure. Hubby got a work out schlepping our stroller up and down the flight of stairs  but it was manageable. The bed was so comfortable and made it easy to recover from the jet lag. The location is great  with some of the best Thai food we’ve had  just around the corner at Roy Siam. Thanks eleni for letting us stay at your adorable flat."),
("2018-12-08", "22362742", "Patricia", "Well located  well decorated and well equipped  a very good option to stay in Sydney. A few things could be improved on the cleaning side but sure that Eleni as a great host she is will take care of it."),
("2018-12-18", "22362742", "Gu", "Nice apartment!"),
("2018-12-26", "22362742", "Flavia", "Great location  was able to walk everywhere  and stylish flat. WiFi/internet was sometimes down but we suspect that was due to the poor weather we had when there! Really clean flat and Eleni was very responsive. Check in and out was super easy too! Only on street parking is available which is expensive so if you have a car could be worth finding somewhere cheap to park before arriving."),
("2019-01-03", "22362742", "Bernard", "Would highly recommend close to town and and nice area to stay. Very clean and tidy and the host is exceptional"),
("2019-01-20", "22362742", "James", "Highly recommended and had a great 3-week stay. Fantastic location near restaurants  bars and only 5 min walk to the city. Excellent quality bed with top notch pillows and nice linen. Spacious living area  nice bathroom and kitchen stocked with plenty of glasses and utensils."),
("2019-02-03", "22362742", "Elizabeth", "The location is what this place is all about.  It’s very quiet but downstairs are fun cafes and restaurants. Walk to CBD. Run to opera house & botanical gardens. Has everything you need.  We had one request during our 2-wk stay and host was very responsive."),
("2019-02-05", "22362742", "霞", "房间设施齐全 离市区景点比较近 走路可达｡但房屋里是窄的楼梯 提重的行李上楼有点儿麻烦 我订的是两张床 四个人 抵达时只有一张床 沙发床是自己铺的｡"),
("2019-02-06", "22362742", "Melissa", "Eleni's place was a great overnight stay. Will definitely keep it in mind for future business trips."),
("2019-02-09", "22362742", "Zachary", "Eleni’s place"),
("2019-02-12", "22362742", "Hung", "Super clean  modern and conveniently located. Bath amenities were really nice too. Above a great restaurant too (don't worry  you don't get any noise)."),
("2019-02-15", "22362742", "Kelsey", "I thoroughly enjoyed staying at this property. It is close to many excellent places to eat and walking distance to do many landmarks meant that it was perfect for us. Thanks Eleni!"),
("2018-01-18", "22530493", "Paul", "Great location  very comfortable and convenient to transport  walking paths  supermarkets  restaurants etc"),
("2018-02-05", "22530493", "Toby", "We stopped in Elise’s place for a couple nights as we were headed to a music festival close by  it was a perfect location and a good size house  with options to hang inside or chill out on the back deck!"),
("2018-02-10", "22530493", "Peter", "A stylish abode; one if nicest I have experienced."),
("2018-02-19", "22530493", "Patricia", "This place is amazing. It's just 1 minute walk to the bay and 500m from the very nice restaurants at Lyons Road.We had a wonderful time there with our family. The backyard with a spacious wooden deck and very green lawn were perfect for having a bbq and enjoy the weekend in Sydney."),
("2018-02-24", "22530493", "Sabrina", "Elise was an amazing host. The location was perfect and it was really easy to get into the main parts of the city. The house was everything we wanted and more! Would definitely stay here again and recommend to friends & family."),
("2018-03-05", "22530493", "Joanne", "Really lovely house with everything that we needed. It's a 15 minute drive out of the city  which worked fine for us. It really was excellent value"),
("2018-03-11", "22530493", "Garry", "Well positioned for our purpose  but there were some issues with the upstairs bathroom."),
("2018-01-11", "22536752", "William", "Nice room at a good price. OK for getting your head down at night and getting sone rest. Host sounded very friendly through communication."),
("2018-01-14", "22536752", "Jeong Min", "this host are not able to contant. phone number was wrong and not answering my message though the airbnb app.therefore i wasted my time and cash i couldnt even checkin"),
("2018-01-18", "22536752", "Hannah", "A nice quiet and cheap accommodation.Good new washing machine. Clean and Lulu is really friendly :) The next bus stop ist really near by! All in one a nice stay with a fair price."),
("2018-01-19", "22536752", "Karan", "Nice snd confy 1 night stay.Good option for a quick night accomodation."),
("2018-02-02", "22536752", "Shannon", "Great value for money! The location is only around the corner from the library and the castle towers shopping centre which was so handy. Lulu and her mum were really helpful in accommodating. Thanks you both!"),
("2017-12-26", "22412815", "Faiz", "Leena was a very welcoming and approachable host. She was also accommodating to our needs. We really had a good time. The house was spotless clean and well equipped. The shopping centre and public transport was within walking distance and the neighbourhood was very green and friendly."),
("2017-12-31", "22412815", "Luke", "I cannot speak more highly of Leena and her property. Without going into too much detail Leena assisted me and my family far and beyond in a difficult time and we are forever grateful to her. I reccomend this place 100 percent."),
("2017-12-31", "22412815", "Anita", "Leena was an extremely warm and delightful host! The place was wonderfully spacious  tranquil  clean and well equiped for our stay. The personal touches on arrival made us feel very welcome and I would not hesitate to book this place again and again  absolutely loved our stay!"),
("2018-02-03", "22412815", "Melisa", "Fanastic place to stay if you are visiting a loved one at the Adventist Retirement Village. Leena was a wonderful host."),
("2018-02-12", "22412815", "Jessica", "House was neat. 'Pet Friendly' only means animals are allowed outside  not inside. Made things difficult  and I had known this  I would have booked elsewhere."),
("2018-02-17", "22412815", "Likeleli", "Sleeping pattern great walking distance to shops. Big deck to share all meals."),
("2018-02-22", "22412815", "Alisha", "Leena is a great host .her place is beautiful and spacious! It's was also very clean . I would highly recommend staying here"),
("2018-02-25", "22412815", "Karen", "We loved the accommodation with everything we needed for a comfortable stay."),
("2018-03-03", "22412815", "Eric", "Clean and tidy very accessible for us we would recommend it to friends Thank you Leena"),
("2018-03-08", "22412815", "Mitch", "Thank you ! the communication was great!"),
("2018-03-16", "22412815", "Noriko", "The children enjoyed it with a wide deck."),
("2018-03-17", "22412815", "Noriko", "Supermarket and park are near and is very convenient for children."),
("2018-03-19", "22412815", "Noriko", "Every morning  birds coming to the trees in the garden enjoy."),
("2018-03-21", "22412815", "Noriko", "The time spent on a wide deck is a very good memory."),
("2018-03-22", "22412815", "Noriko", "I borrowed it to spend the same time with many friends. Families with children also enjoyed it.    Thank you very much."),
("2018-03-26", "22412815", "Jade", "The house was everything described and perfect for our kids and dogs. The communication from Leena was great. We shall return."),
("2018-04-02", "22412815", "Narelle", "Fantastic staying at Leena's place  great yard for the dogs and the aircon was so welcome on hot days  great halfway spot for our dog shows  the place has a great carport we backed the dog trailer under so dogs were comfortable sleeping..   will come again  Leena and family are so friendly and helpful..."),
("2018-05-06", "22412815", "Angeline", "Overprice for a dated house with old fixtures. Bathroom not able to latch/lock. Not the best presented house. Found some dead insects on the bed and kitchen cupboard. Pictures are not very accurate. Hats off to photographer. No carpet in main bedroom  just floorboards. Not sure if wifi works. Was turned off and no instructions found. Bed arrangement were not as we had arranged. Not happy with our stay.  Won't be back."),
("2018-05-16", "22412815", "Prateek", "Leena has a huge house and backyard too . But there is no hot water 24X7 . It comes at very odd hours . The bathrooms don’t have locks so it is a little problem if you are staying with your family . We had a good time but he house needs to be modernised ."),
("2018-05-20", "22412815", "Paula", "Lovely quiet neighbourhood. Decent space for a small family. Nice and neat home. Will stay again!"),
("2018-05-25", "22412815", "Emmy", "Prompt replies  easy to organise. Beds and linen fantastic"),
("2018-05-27", "22412815", "Jessica", "Leena’s a great host  she replied very quickly and the house can accomodate up to 6 people comfortably."),
("2018-06-11", "22412815", "Emma", "A lovely host who is happy to help. A nice little house. Thanks for having us!"),
("2018-06-22", "22412815", "Colleen", "The house was a great size in a good location for our group. It had most things we needed except hot water system broke down the last morning but that is an unpredictable.Checkin was really easy and the place was lovely and clean.Thanks Leena."),
("2018-06-24", "22412815", "Cecilia", "Loved Leena's place.  Will definitely recommend this property to others."),
("2018-06-28", "22412815", "Clint", "Great host. Good spot"),
("2018-07-08", "22412815", "Jocee", "Leena made it a point to immediately answer every queries  and offered any help or services that we might need. And she already replied with action on some minor suggestions for further improvement of the property such as trimming of trees/branches along driveway for easier parking of vehicle  etc. Overall  I will recommend this place to my friends/relatives especially for big families like us. Thanks Leena for being a nice and great host! God bless always"),
("2018-07-13", "22412815", "John", "A great place to stay for a few nights."),
("2018-07-16", "22412815", "Courtney", "Perfect space for the 10 of us! We had great space and use of the backyard which we all enjoyed  would definitely come back. "),
("2018-07-20", "22412815", "Caroline", "Good location to Featherdale Wildlife Park and Blue Mountain."),
("2018-07-22", "22412815", "Craig", "In a great quiet location but still close to shops  plenty of take-aways  and the Motorway. I stayed with 2 of my dogs in a dog trailer  and it suited me to a ""T"" .  The trailer fitted under the carport and behind a set of gates  so the dogs were very secure. You need be confident reversing a trailer but it is do-able. The backyard is pretty much secure  but if your dog was determined  I think it would manage to escape.  This place suited me for the 3 nights I stayed there. Leena was the perfect host and very easy for a first timer to deal with.   "),
("2018-08-05", "22412815", "Andrew", "Very quiet location and very close to shops like coles and woolies for essentials. 5 min drive to Blacktown Plaza if you feel like going shopping. The basic usual essentials are in the house for the stay and comfy beds."),
("2018-08-26", "22412815", "Kieran", "All rite"),
("2018-10-13", "22412815", "Rangi", "nice little lovely home and a quiet area which was great for relaxing out the back enjoying the sunset :) also has a spa shower which was a bonus and not to far away from shops/restaurants  also nice and private. Great communication with host and everything was higher level than expected enjoyed my stay thanks Leena"),
("2018-10-15", "22412815", "Faiz", "I really enjoyed my stay at Leena's place. She is very friendly and accomodating  so communication was effortless.The place is very clean and well equipped. There is a huge backyard with a variety of flowers that attract colourful birds. I really enjoyed watching the sunset sitting in the huge entertainment deck.There is easy access to the Sydney CBD via M7/M2. Shops  cafes and takeaway restaurants are just a few minutes walk away."),
("2018-10-16", "22412815", "Akshay", "I had a short stay at Leena's place  but I'm really looking forward to a longer stay with a big group. There are facilities to accommodate up to a dozen people.I was impressed with the immaculate presentation. It is very clean and nicely decorated. The well-lit kitchen has all the facilities that one requires for cooking. Just outside the kitchen is a huge entertainment deck for family get-togethers.The place is located in a quiet  leafy street  where there is local traffic only and heaps of free parking. Within 5 minutes walking distance  off James Cook Drive  is the Kings Langley shopping centre with Coles  Woolies  boutique shops  restaurants  cafes and takeaways.Just 3 minutes walk in the opposite direction  off Sunnyholt Road  are fast-food restaurants and specialty shops.Vardy's T-Way bus stop is a 3-minute walk away with direct buses to Parramatta  Blacktown  Castle Hill  Hillsong Church and Rouse Hill.Less than 2 minutes drive away is M7. For Canberra  go west and bypass the city. Drive east to quickly get to Sydney CBD via M2 in an hour."),
("2018-10-21", "22412815", "Debbie", "Very handy and spacious"),
("2018-10-28", "22412815", "Leisha", "Great communication  very clean  reliable  close to shops  quiet neighbourhood  great back yard to sit and relax after a long day. The kids had plenty of room to run around"),
("2018-12-08", "22412815", "David", "Amazing Communication  Friendly and Helpful. Good Location for western Sydney amenities."),
("2019-01-02", "22412815", "Dylan", "Absolutely loved this house over New Years Only a short walk to bus’s and station and housed 8 people comfortably Host reply’s fast and with all the information we needed Would stay again 10/10"),
("2018-01-26", "22536824", "Lukas", "Alles gut. Sehr zu empfehlen. Super gelegene whg. In der nähe vom hippen Quartier Newtown. Alles gut und tolle tipps."),
("2018-02-09", "22536824", "Robert", "We stayed at Clare’s place for 4 nights in Sydney. Everything about it was amazing. Great central location  with the public transportation leaving from just a few minutes by walk. Newtown itself is a vibrant neighborhood with lots of nice bars and restaurants  but Clare’s place is secluded and very silent. Clare provided us with some useful local tips  and is really friendly. The room is spacious with a nice bed  and Mollie is the cutest puppy dog you will get to meet!! Will definitely recommend the place  we will come back here once again in Sydney!"),
("2018-02-24", "22536824", "Stanislaw", "Calre is a great  communicative host with positive attitude. She loves her life  she loves Newton and is willing to show the neighbourhood  additionally she helps us to find ourselves in new city. Place was clean  warm and comfortable. What's more there is a cute puppy called Molly  one of the best we met :)"),
("2018-03-10", "22536824", "Liam", "Myself and partner had a great stay at Claire's. Claire's place is clean  modern and very close to the train station  just a few minutes walk. There's also Newtown  just a walk away for cafe's  shops etc. Her dog Molly was also very cute. Thanks for our stay. Would recommend to others."),
("2018-03-24", "22536824", "Ivan Geoffrey", "Enjoyed my time staying in Clare’s house. Her place was modern and clean. The proximity to the train station was perfect. I could go anywhere I want easily. Its in the quiet end of Newtown so you wont get bothered by the youthful crowd. Clare made my stay as comfortable as possible giving me tips and tricks around the area and the city. Wouldn’t mind staying there again in the future."),
("2018-04-06", "22536824", "Robbie", "Loved the place and loved Clare too! Lovely house  Molly the dog is lovely too (hide your socks though she likes to take em haha). The location was great  Clare was great  she let us check in at 8 in the morning as we had an overnight bus from Melbourne! Stay was above and beyond our already high expectations :)."),
("2018-04-17", "22536824", "Amanda", "Claire was a phenomenal host. Welcoming  easy going  and full of great tips for exploring the neighbourhood."),
("2018-05-06", "22536824", "Melissa", "We had a great stay at Clare's place while we were in town to see if we would like to move Sydney. Clarw was really flexible and responsive to our very last minute arrangements and even let us leave our bags on the last day  which was really helpful. The room was great and excellent location to see Newtown and the rest of the city via the train! Thanks for a great stay"),
("2019-02-18", "22536824", "Gustavo", "Clare is so friendly and a great host  Molly her dog is so lovely!!. The room is nice & clean  the bed is really comfortable and the ceiling fan is perfect for summer. Location is really good if you want to try Sydney’s great train system you get to central station in a few minutes."),
("2019-03-04", "22536824", "Kirsty", "Super chill vibe  adorable dog and great location. Only a 5 min walk to Train Station which makes getting around super easy. Also a 5 min walk to bus to Coogee  which is an amazing beach. House is neat and has a lovely atmosphere which is nice to come home too. I'd stay here again!"),
("2018-02-20", "22509800", "Alex", "Super convenient location  located in Haymarket between Chinatown and Surry Hills. The building location is on the quiet side of the block  but when you walk out the front door and turn either corner there are endless casual eateries with fantastic food  many open late too. Check out Boon Cafe and Yok Yor! Tumbalong Park and Darling Harbour are an 10 minute walk  Chinatown and Market City are steps away. And one block the opposite direction is the tip of Surry Hills!"),
("2018-02-26", "22509800", "Tan", "Amazing location close to centre station and china town and about 10 minutes walk to Darling harbour and Westfield shopping mall.The room is very clean  wifi is fast  great city view from the balcony. Centre air-condition woking well  the bed is very comfortable. The host Sally is very kind and polite  i am highly recommend this accommodation  if you are travel with your families or friends."),
("2018-03-08", "22509800", "Jose", "Perfect  location and nice balcony with views"),
("2018-03-12", "22509800", "Lisa", "Great place to stay! Surrounded by public transport options and a wide variety of eating places. Sally’s place is Exceptionally clean  comfortable and well presented. Also loved the access to the pool  spa and gym. Sally’s communication with us was fabulous. Looking forward to coming back!"),
("2018-04-02", "22509800", "Kei", "Sally’s apartment located in a very convenient area and she is a very nice host!!"),
("2018-04-23", "22509800", "Fiona", "Sally's apartment was close to both Museum Station & Central Station.  There is a supermarket  convenience store and lots of places to eat close by.  It is in walking distance to The National Museum   Powerhouse Museum and Darling Harbour.  We enjoyed having access to the pool and spa too.  A great spot for a family holiday in Sydney."),
("2018-05-05", "22509800", "Kim", "If you are looking for an easy check-in and nice  central location then this is the place for you. We enjoyed the views from the balcony and the spaciousness of the place. Note this is not a two bedroom in the traditional sense as the couch  table and access to the balcony are all in the space considered the second bedroom. This worked fine for us but could be confusing if looking at the photos and thinking they are separate bedrooms from the living space. Sally was very easy to communicate with and was most accommodating for luggage drop off in the morning. This is in a centrally located area and very easy to get around."),
("2018-05-29", "22509800", "Tracey", "On the whole  our experience of renting this apartment was really great.  Location - fabulous  a really good  central location  so easy to walk or get transport to wherever you want to go.  And it really is only five minutes walk to Central Station!Check in - this was so easy with absolutely minimum fuss .  Cleanliness - the apartment was kept very clean.Equipment - the apartment was very well equipped.Layout - The apartment was bright and spacious.  But please note this is not a traditional two bedroom apartment.  The lounge/tv/dining table are in the larger bedroom.  Host - Sally was great with ongoing communication  and although we didn't need to  we felt that she would have been easy to reach had we needed her.Just one note  although the info says that the apartment is newly furnished  there are still some aspects that haven't been upgraded."),
("2018-06-09", "22509800", "Lok Hang", "Beautiful place  very central location  anything you need is nearby with few minutes walking distance! Would defo recommend to anyone considering their stay at Sydney!"),
("2018-06-13", "22509800", "Winda", "Sally’s apartment is very cozy  got everything we need there. Just walk distance to the city. Easy selfcheck in and out also."),
("2018-06-21", "22509800", "Jose", "n'hésitez pas à choisir l'appartement de Sally sur Sydney  l'emplacement est ideal pour ceux qui veulent avoir la ville sans dépenser en moyens de transports.l'appartement est tel qu'indiqué   propre  lave-linge   seche linge avec wifi et netflix  et piscine et spa à disposition   pour un maximum de 4 personnes.les indications et communications avec Sally sont claires et nettes   à recommander!"),
("2018-06-25", "22509800", "Laura", "Sally's place is in a great location with access to the Hey Market  Capital Theatre  Chinatown  central station and a short stroll to World Square.  The apartment is very spacious and has great views of the city.  Easy access in and out and it was great that Sally gave us two access keys.  We loved it and so will you.  Definitely will stay there again."),
("2018-07-05", "22509800", "Mine", "Sally is a very responsive and friendly host. The apartment is clean and cozy with very nice city view  close to central station   various restaurants nearby. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-07-30", "22509800", "Ellen", "Great location  great host! You get the value of your money!"),
("2018-08-15", "22509800", "Xing", "Sally is very good owner. And the apartment located very well. Easy to find the room key. Room big and nice."),
("2018-08-18", "22509800", "Amitkumar", "Good place and locationit was my first time to book thru AIRBNB and i had a good experience"),
("2018-08-19", "22509800", "Brandon", "Great location however photos were slightly misleading. There was no photo showing the bed in the dining room with the sofa bed. There was also some hair still left on the bed linen  sheets  and pillows."),
("2018-08-23", "22509800", "Sam", "was good location and clean flat"),
("2018-08-25", "22509800", "Kelly", "Great location  clean and tidy. Worth every cent! "),
("2018-09-09", "22509800", "Adrian", "The unit is very well located and great value. Sally is an excellent host"),
("2018-09-17", "22509800", "Kara", "We stayed for 3 night here  Sally's place is so close to everything. Fast responses to questions. I would definitely recommend this apartment."),
("2018-10-05", "22509800", "毓", "因为提前到了悉尼…所以联系房东是否可以提前入住…真的很感谢房东…满头大汗的收拾卫生…为了尽快让我们提前入住…房间不是严格意义上的两室…因为一间卧室就是在起居室放了沙发餐桌等东西…不过这丝毫不影响…房子最棒的是位置…基本步行到唐人街到coles到皮特街都可以…真的非常好…站在大阳台就可以看到中央车站…很好…"),
("2018-10-08", "22509800", "Rewi", "great place to stay  right in the heart of Sydney."),
("2018-10-14", "22509800", "James", "Great apartment  walking distance to pretty much most places in the CBD. Host was very welcoming and helpful. Would stay again."),
("2018-11-15", "22509800", "Kuan-Yu", "So lucky for us.We changed hotel before we arrived one week ago.The apartment is in a good location near the central station and city."),
("2018-11-20", "22509800", "Jennifer", "TLDR:  We had a pleasant stay as a family of 5  with kids ages 8-13.  It was clean and as described.  Some things were annoying but we slept well and loved the accessibility.  Sally's place has a GREAT location for public transit. Legit <10 min walk (kid-pace) to the central train station  once we figured out the fastest route.  We used the trains and buses and also walked to many central destinations.  Perfect for our needs.  Don't be put off by the odd configuration.  The lounge room with beds is spacious and comfortable.  We used it both for kids' bedroom and eating.  Didn't spend a lot of time in the apartment otherwise so that was just fine.  The only issue was eating over carpet; we had to vacuum to manage crumbs between meals.  The biggest drawback here was in the bathroom.  The toilet is LOUD when it's refilling--kind of a squealing sound as if the shower is on.  Made us not want to flush after anyone went to bed.  And speaking of the shower  it was one of the worst I've encountered!!  Low pressure and the temperature would change randomly from cold to scalding hot (and NOT while anything else was using water in the apartment.) My family was amused by my yelps as I got hit by hotter water than I could stand  but I wasn't!  A bath was more pleasant  and perfect for the kids  but be aware that the tub is an odd shape.  It narrows at the upper end and anyone larger than my US-size-10 bottom can expect not to be able to sit in it for a soak.  Kitchen is clean and minimally-adequately-equipped.  There are just enough pots & pans to do some basic cooking  but only one huge awkward knife.  I've suggested they get a better set!  There was a dishwasher but not much detergent so we mostly washed by hand.  I wish there had been a teapot--I made tea in a saucepan.  You'll find some very basic supplies (salt/pepper/sugar/tea) but otherwise pretty much bare cupboards--this isn't one of those places where you'll find some edibles left from previous guests.   That's fine; some people really prefer it that way.  Just be aware you'll need to supply most all condiments  oils etc.  if you plan to cook.  We liked having the clothes washer and some detergent was provided.  The shades are good in the bedroom but in the lounge/bedroom there's a slight bay window that can't be darkened as fully.  Thankfully the kids were jet-lagged enough to sleep well anyway.  One thing that gave me a weird feeling were all sorts of ominous signs and letters to residents posted in the lobby and elevators--it sounds like the building is recently under new management and getting its financial affairs in order?  Also lots of rules about visitors and not letting people in or loaning out your key  which made me wonder if they've had problems with objectionable people?  We didn't encounter anything untoward  but it doesn't create a great atmosphere."),
("2018-11-26", "22509800", "Agus", "A very strategic location in the middle of two train stations.One of the places that provide an exact address and place. If you're not new to the Airbnb  you should know what I mean.Compare to the Oaks in the same building  it's at least 25% cheaper. All amenities and all facilities as per Sally's mentioned in the property details.For the eateries  just go down and you can find the famous Yok Yor nearby but I prefer Chon Siam for daily meals.For Indonesians  there is Toko H2O below for your daily needs  they even sells lontong oncom and es doger.For breakfast  you can find Mist Cafe. Go there early to get the affordable breakfast set.Nearest proper supermarket is Coles in World Square  less than 1 km.The Chinatown and Paddy's market are in the walking distance.In short  if you are agree with the prices  you are better directly book this property."),
("2018-12-03", "22509800", "Simone", "Well valued  clean and tidy."),
("2018-12-31", "22509800", "Marcell", "Awesome location  walking distance to everything you need in Sydney."),
("2019-01-12", "22509800", "Kath", "amazing location. very clean and secure. communication fantastic and easy check in and checkout. definitely on my list each time I go to Sydney  thanks Sally."),
("2019-02-12", "22509800", "장심", "Sally's house is in a perfect location."),
("2019-02-16", "22509800", "Ji", "Great locaction   nice host."),
("2018-02-03", "22661818", "Andrew", "Kate was a great host and had an exceptional apartment. Kate was amazing to deal with through her quick responses and friendly attitude. We had a wonderful time in Manly in her apartment. The apartment itself was stylish  clean  had great facilities and offered exceptional beachfront views. The garage offered safe and easy parking for our stay in Manly and the secondary car park in front of the garage was an added bonus. With the apartment being a walking distance to all main attractions  it made the apartment location a perfect stay for us.We left Kate’s apartment with a better stay then expected  we loved the apartment and our stay in Manly. We highly recommend Kate and her apartment!"),
("2018-02-10", "22661818", "Russell", "Great location"),
("2018-02-17", "22661818", "Hong", "对面就是曼丽海滩 房间整洁 房东细心 交流顺畅 适合家庭居住｡"),
("2018-02-22", "22661818", "Mark", "Comfortable beach front unit. Everything you need. Great view."),
("2018-02-27", "22661818", "Merritt", "We had a wonderful relaxing vacation at Kate’s apartment. We didn’t have  a car and didn’t need one. The beautiful beach is across the street. We walked to supermarkets  restaurants and shopping. The bedding is amazing. It is one of the most comfortable beds I’ve slept in. Kate was really patient with all of my questions and always responded quickly.Thanks Kate!"),
("2018-03-04", "22661818", "Elliot", "Awesome position  nice place and everything you need at your doorstep Thanks for having us"),
("2018-03-17", "22661818", "Cathy", "Great place great location"),
("2018-04-22", "22661818", "Melanie", "Perfectly positioned apartment at the quiet end of Manly beach but still close to everything. We loved spending time on the generous balcony taking in the beautiful view. The two car spaces were super-convenient and the friendly host was easy to deal with. Loved the decor too!"),
("2018-05-06", "22661818", "Brendan", "Kate was extremely helpful and the location was amazing. Highly recommend."),
("2018-12-21", "22661818", "Tamara", "Amazing apartment and location!"),
("2018-12-29", "22661818", "Stephen Susan & Fred", "Perfect place for a perfect week in Manly."),
("2018-12-31", "22661818", "James", "Splendid location  nice flat  near to shops and cafes but away from the heavy tourist traffic. Recommended."),
("2019-01-03", "22661818", "Darhim", "Location was perfect. Dedicated parking spot was vital for us as we had a car and the area was super busy. The balcony with the awesome view is where we spent most of our time. I also liked the utility room downstairs which had a shower for us to clean off the sand from the beach."),
("2019-01-06", "22661818", "Bronwyn", "What a wonderful place to start the new year. Located right across from the flags in the beach at North steyne.  Great flat   with an even better view and  very  close to restaurants . Thank you ."),
("2019-01-31", "22661818", "Andrew", "Epic view!!!  Love this place"),
("2019-02-06", "22661818", "Rebecca", "The location is fantastic! Morning tea on the balcony over looking the beach couldn't be beat. Only ten minute walk to the main Manly strip and a fabulous cafe and restaurant only one block away.  I highly recommend!"),
("2018-01-22", "22711366", "Lisa", "We spend a great time at Austin’s house. He is a really friendly   always helpful and great host we received always a promptly answers when we had questions. The house is very pretty we enjoyed a pool  a wonderful open kitchen  a beautiful barbecue area everything is very clean. The house is close to the city just a short walk to the train and 20min drive. We would absolutely recommend this room and would come back if we are visiting Sydney again. Lisa & Timon"),
("2018-01-28", "22711366", "Julia & Johannes", "Staying at Austin's house is a real treat. It looks awesome  like in the pictures and you are welcome to use all the facilities  including the outside entertainment area with bbq and pool! Austin is a very polite and caring host. He wants everyone to enjoy their stay and answers all questions immediately. Canterbury train station is just a short walk away  as is Woolworths and Aldi. We would definitely stay here again. Thanks for everything  Austin."),
("2018-02-17", "22711366", "Rich", "This is a really great place. Best airbnb we've had. Spacious  modern  well presented and has everything you could possibly need. The swimming pool and bbq are the icing on the cake. It's a 10 minute walk to Canterbury station where you can be central in 20 mins. Austin is welcoming  friendly and generous. Prompt to respond and happy to help. Would definitely recommend his place. Thanks for having us Austin."),
("2018-02-20", "22711366", "Yijun", "必须为Austin打call.点赞｡其实住之前没有看过评论就订了 订的时候就知道不在市区 在郊区 不过我们自己租车就觉得没关系  入住前Austin一直给我们很多指引 我们住了4天下来 都是有保持着跟我们沟通 担心我们有没有什么需要帮助 最贴心的事 入住的时候问他吹风筒在哪里 他说他平时都不用 所以家里是没有的 我就没管了 打算早上起来就出去洗头算了 结果第二天Austin特意给我准备了一个新的吹风机!当时那个感动呀 真的是快要哭了｡总之 一切都很不错的｡谢谢Austin｡"),
("2018-03-16", "22711366", "James", "Austin's place is absolutely beautiful  so much so I've decided to stay a little longer. He's a fantastic host and is unbeatable in hospitality  lovely little touches like chocolates on the pillows. Combined with a flawless and tidy home + lovely pool!"),
("2018-03-21", "22711366", "James", "A super host!"),
("2018-01-04", "22337456", "Ebrahim", "The place is super enough  bus rides right at doorstep  amazing urban living pad with selective European cafes just a few footsteps away. Great service and feels saturated for Sydney touring."),
("2018-01-06", "22337456", "Kirra", "Modern and stylish appartments  short walk to shops and the train station. Neat and tidy. We enjoyed our stay and would definitely recommend to future travellers!"),
("2018-01-07", "22337456", "Emma", "This is an amazing place to stay! Very impressed with the presentation and the special touches Wendy has added to make the stay perfect. This is great place and you will not regret the choice. Wendy was attentive and helpful... and  Wow what a bed!! We feel asleep to it’s soothing massages! Will stay here again in a heartbeat. Thanks so much"),
("2018-01-10", "22337456", "Nermin", "This place was newly listed with no existing reviews so i did take a risk when booking it. I'm so glad I did because the apartment was spectacular. So modern and roomy with amazing facilities like a gorgeous indoor pool and gym in the complex  with secure parking. The bed was so comfortable  the kitchen fully stocked with everything we needed and the bathroom shower was amazing. Beautiful marble finishes and stylish furniture.Communication was very easy and fast with Wendy and she made sure to stay in contact with us if we had any questions.The location is also fantastic  we walked to The Grounds of Alexandria  one of Sydney's best eateries/cafes. We loved the place so much."),
("2018-01-13", "22337456", "Gino", "very clean and the host is very kind if i have a chance i will visit again"),
("2018-01-15", "22337456", "Fangyi", "It will be a pity to miss that apart. It has comfy and clean furniture and living environment. The host couple are approachable and nice. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-01-15", "22337456", "Lee", "Great little unit. Looked brand new. Overall clean and comfortable. Good location  convenient to airport  city and Eastern Suburbs. I would definitely stay here again"),
("2018-01-18", "22337456", "Glen", "It was good stay  tidy and comfortable. Also good location."),
("2018-01-22", "22337456", "Jake", "An amazing apartment with great facilities at a good price. Host very helpful... would stay here again!"),
("2018-01-23", "22337456", "Lachlan", "Nice and clean apartment  great location for access to parts of the city."),
("2018-01-26", "22337456", "Darren", "Wendy (Host) provided excellent communication while staying at her apartment in Roseberry. The apartment is very new and features all the modern touches expected in such a new development. We were both very impressed with the double bed (adjustable back and foot positions with variable massage settings) and felt the on-site fitness and swimming complex was a cut above the norm. A big thank you must also go out to the host as we left some clothing behind which was posted the very next day  does not sound very much however we are based in New Zealand so I put this down as very much going the extra mile. "),
("2018-01-28", "22337456", "Calvin", "Very clean and everythings in great condition. Host was quick to replu y messages. Shops/restaurants around the location."),
("2018-01-30", "22337456", "Leean", "Very clean and stylish. The stay was super comfortable"),
("2018-02-01", "22337456", "Cristina", "Wendy's place is very stylish. She communicates very fast and gives excellent directions for checking in and finding her place. The apartment has special touches to make you feel at home."),
("2018-02-05", "22337456", "Laura", "Amazing location  beautiful and clean apartment. Great little place. Will definitely stay there again!"),
("2018-02-05", "22337456", "Miracle", "Most beautiful apartment iv stayed in  amazing area and very comfortable  house was extremely tidy and smelt amazing   host was so kind and was very quick with response and made sure we had everything we needed for our stay! Will defiantly be staying there again! Absolutely beautiful"),
("2018-02-18", "22337456", "Sherri", "Wendy’s place is nice and modern. Even though we did not meet  she responded quickly to any inquiries that we had. Up and coming neighbourhood. Convenient access to airport by Uber."),
("2018-02-19", "22337456", "Jorja", "Wendy was a fantastic host  such a stylish and cozy apartment that was extremely modern and amazing to stay on  would definitely be back"),
("2018-02-22", "22337456", "Jülie", "Wendy’s Unterkunft ist sehr modern und schick eingerichtet. Wir waren drei Mädchen  die für drei Nächte hier untergekommen sind. Da Wendy unterwegs war  hatte sie vergessen  dass wir zu dritt anreisen und daher war das dritte Bett nicht vorbereitet. Wir informierten sie also  dass wir noch das dritte Bettzeug bräuchten. Sie hat dann ganz schnell jemanden organisiert der uns das dritte Bettzeug und ein drittes Handtuch beschaffen hat. Die Kommunikation mit Wendy verlief super schnell und sehr gut. Sie hat sich ganz schnell bemüht uns entgegen zu kommen und uns noch einen Rabatt gegeben für die Unannehmlichkeit. Das fand ich super! Das Apartment war ansonsten mit allem ausgestattet was man braucht und das Bad ist sehr schön! Unser Check-in lief reibungslos und schnell. Für ein paar Nächte kann man hier gut unterkommen. Verschiedene Busse fahren die Straße runter und ein Schwimmbad sowie ein Fitnessraum bietet die Unterkunft auch. Ich würde die Unterkunft weiterempfehlen allerdings nur zu zweit. Das dritte Bett bzw. Sofa nicht ganz so komfortabel ist. Daher hat man allein oder zu zweit hier sicher eine fantastische Zeit. :) ein Supermarkt ist etwas weiter  aber wir haben uns eh viel in der Stadt aufgehalten also war das in Ordnung für uns.Besonderes Lob für die tolle Kommunikation!"),
("2018-02-27", "22337456", "Mireille", "The place was beautiful  modern and easy to get to. Its a quick ride to the international airport and there are great cafés and food spots about an 800m walk from the place. It is located closely to a bus station that can take you straight into the city and other train connections for site seeing and shopping. There is a spare pull out bed which was useful traveling with my dad and a nice little balcony to spend time outside. Id stay here again!"),
("2018-03-02", "22337456", "Lisa", "We stayed at Wendy's place for two nights. Wendy is very helpful and easy to reach via Mail. Check in was easy and the place is clean and nice. Wendy offered to help us with our luggage and provided us with all information we needed for the stay. To reach the centre of Sydney is possible by bus that leaves close by. Supermarkets/Restaurants etc. are close by as well as the airport. Can highly recommend Wendy's place."),
("2018-03-06", "22337456", "Ally", "Wendy is a nice person and this room is quite comfortable and amazing"),
("2018-03-07", "22337456", "Christina", "Was fantastic"),
("2018-03-10", "22337456", "Andrew", "After a long day of sightseeing in Sydney it was time to check in this lovely 1BR apartment. What a comfort that everything has been taken care of. The cleanliness and comfort to an apartment ready for your arrival. Spent the last 3 nights and I could simply call it my second home. Wendy has been very accommodating and is happy to help with any questions you may have in relation to the apartment to the area! Certainly one apartment not to overlook with a indoor swimming pool  spa and sauna!Will book here again when I come back to Sydney!"),
("2018-03-15", "22337456", "Sarah", "The apartment is nice & clean. it is closely located to the airport & CBD area which was really convenient. Wendy was quick to respond to our queries & was really helpful. It was such a pleasant stay."),
("2018-03-20", "22337456", "Regina", "The apartment is in a good location  close to the airport ($15.00 Uber) and within walking distance to eateries.  Breakfast at Grandmas 5 minutes down the road was excellent.  The Cannery is also within walking distance where you can get a bite to eat or coffee.  I found the bed too hard but that may be personal preference whereas my husband likes hard beds.We were unable to get the TV to work at all as there two remotes to the TV set up and looked everywhere for instructions but there wasn't any.  Eventually I called Wendy for instructions which we followed and still nothing so contacted her again  same thing  so I contacted her again and eventually she said she would send someone the next day as she thought it was too late but we said it was okay and someone came within 25 minutes.  Wendy's communication was good however she should have known about the new TV set up.  The only access to the TV was through UTube.   We were disappointed with the lack of utensils.  There was a wok to cook in and no saucepans or frypan. There no salad servers or spatula  basically just basic.  I looked in the drawers for clean tea towels and found two small cloth placemats which I used as a tea towel.  There were no sponges or dishwasher tablets.  I did find a used tea towel in the laundry but did not want to use it.  The only thing in the apartment was some tea bags which I am sure was left by the previous tenants. Every Airbnb we have stayed at has been great and provided basic cooking provisions such as oil  salt and pepper  coffee  tea  condiments etc and some hosts have been very generous and left fresh bread  fruit and other lovely delights. Not that we expect that this is what every host should provide but the basics I think is not asking too much Every Airbnb we have stayed at has provided either a Nespresso machine/ plunger or both. 2 bath towels and hand towels were provided but there was no bath mat.  It would have been nice to be provided with pool towels as we did use the pool and luckily it was hot enough on the balcony for the bath towels to dry.  Be prepared for loud bangs as tenants in the building would often let their doors bang.  It is a lovely apartment and I would stay again provided essentials etc as mentioned above were provided."),
("2018-03-21", "22337456", "Maimai", "Wendy’s place is very nice. Modern and new unit with clean amenities. Very short walk to bus stop (bus no. 343) which can directly take you to the heart of the city near Westfield/Eye tower. Did not get a chance to use the pool and gym but looked really good. Wendy is a very good host  very understanding and accommodating. Will definitely book this place again. Thanks Wendy :)"),
("2018-03-25", "22337456", "James", "Went above and beyond with our stay. Comfortable  clean  modern apartment. One bedroom but plenty of room. Will definitely be back!"),
("2018-03-27", "22337456", "Jaycee", "Wendy was easy to get a hold of and helpful. The apartment was a 15 min walk to the train station with ample parking. House had everything expect a few kitchen basics like salt  pepper  oil. But I suppose those aren’t standard in any travel hotel with a kitchen. Just couldn’t be a nice added touch for guests. The apartment did have an incredible master bed that massaged and moved into the most comfortable reading position ever. It was a wonderful space for a weekend Sydney trip."),
("2018-04-02", "22337456", "Shijun", "It has been a great experience staying at Wendy’s place. Checkin and checkout has been smooth. You will have the entire apartment on your own  highly recommended for budget travellers with family  there is a nice balcony too  and a swimming pool in the building (though I dont have time to try it out).I am quite satisfied with the overall cleanliness of the space  bathroom water was warm and confortable. Location wise  its just a few minutes walk to bus stops which can take you to CBD area directly. 3 supermarkets nearby are just 2 busstops away too."),
("2018-04-07", "22337456", "Michael", "Wendy is a very kind and welcoming host. Good communication and easy check in.Her apartment is very modern and stylish and in a nice neighborhood.  The massage bed is great ;-). Happy to come back next time we are down under."),
("2018-04-09", "22337456", "旭峰", "房间非常整洁 入住很方便 街区很安静 房东也非常热情回复非常及时 很好的入住体验"),
("2018-04-11", "22337456", "Pei Ying", "We have a great stay at this place. Wendy is quick response. Place is clean and modern. Close to the public transport. The pool and gym facilities looks good but we don't have time to use it."),
("2018-04-15", "22337456", "Zina", "Very lovely host easy to communicate and well service. I would check again in future"),
("2018-04-17", "22337456", "Ninglin", "A lovely place to stay  much better than I expected .The living room is very large with a wonderful TV program."),
("2018-04-18", "22337456", "Brendan", "Wendy looked after me and my partner. Place is clean  well maintained and has everything you need. Thanks again Wendy for being so hospitable."),
("2018-04-23", "22337456", "Susan", "We booked on short notice  we found Wendy's accommodation excellent.  Responses were prompt and helpful. We were flying to Canada because of a sick grandchild  the hassle free night at Wendy's was a good start to a long journey."),
("2018-04-29", "22337456", "Gemma", "We had a great stay in Wendy’s apartment! She was very helpful and was always contactable when needed. The apartment was clean and spacious and was perfect for four adults. Definitely would recommend to anyone visiting Sydney!!"),
("2018-05-02", "22337456", "Elisa", "Clean and stylish place.  Very comfortable stay!  Wendy was terrific in her communication and check-in.  We stayed here at the end of our trip  and it was very convenient to the airport."),
("2018-05-03", "22337456", "Ava", "I booked Wendy’s place the night before! For such short notice  Wendy went above and beyond to make sure we felt we’d received value for money. The place was cleaned perfectly  her responses were extremely professional and fast which was necessary in this circumstance. I will definitely be booking this place in the future!"),
("2018-05-06", "22337456", "Khai Meng", "Wendy has a wonderful apartment - new  spacious  modern  well furnished and very comfortable. Furnishing were great.  It is in a nice and quiet residential neighbourhood  close to airport and downtown.  Wendy was very helpful and super prompt in her responses.  We enjoyed our stay very much and highly recommend Wendy's apartment."),
("2018-05-07", "22337456", "Annie", "Wendy is a very helpful host  she responded to all our queries promptly and is always willing to help more. The flat is spacious  new and clean  check in and out are easy. I would like to come back next time!"),
("2018-05-11", "22337456", "Annisa", "The place was enermous for the 3 of us  It's a new building so everything is clean and tidyThey even have the netflixBus station nearby  get to town in approx 20mins - 35mins  by uber to town cost 30aud"),
("2018-05-12", "22337456", "İhsan", "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️"),
("2018-05-21", "22337456", "Po Cheung Dalen", "Clean and really stylish places! Wendy is being so helpful through out our journey with quick response!"),
("2018-05-25", "22337456", "Nick", "Great place  nice and close to nearby restaurants and cafes. Quick enough to get a ride into the city to go out. Apartment was excellent  very clean  and the bed super comfortable"),
("2018-05-27", "22337456", "Marie", "Great accommodation and great amenities..  Fast responses... Easy to check in... Everything well prepared for our check in... Near airport.. Owner is very flexible to check out timing... Location is near everything. Hassle free visit. Thanks!☺️"),
("2018-05-30", "22337456", "Kai", "Good location. Can take the bus to CBD directly."),
("2018-05-31", "22337456", "Sarah", "Easy to access. Very comfortable stay"),
("2018-06-02", "22337456", "Xue Chen", "Nice quiet place"),
("2018-06-02", "22337456", "Rhys", "Amazing modern and clean space"),
("2018-06-06", "22337456", "Chirine", "Had a great stay at Wendy's. Best part was the indoor pool  spa and sauna! There was a bit of a situation  because of the weather our shoes stained the carpet but Wendy was so understanding with us and let us take care of it. Will definitely stay at Wendy's again!"),
("2018-06-08", "22337456", "Steven", "Perfect location and clean. Wendy is a great host. I'd love to come back."),
("2018-06-14", "22337456", "Pangeran", "It was a great experience so modern  clean  neat  perfect stay with friends!"),
("2018-06-18", "22337456", "Eliya", "Wendy is definitely a great and understanding host. She always reply quickly and try her best to fulfill our queries. Love everything about the accommodation. Very near to the bus stop  hence easier access to transportation. If I were to travel to Sydney again  I would definitely book this accommodation again! Plus the best part is  her tv (netflix of course)!"),
("2018-06-20", "22337456", "Melvin", "Amazing place and convenient location. Wendy is very accommodating and responsive to messages."),
("2018-06-23", "22337456", "Jin Jack", "Great place  clean and near to airport! It would only take you 10mins to/from her place. Modern design  with a smart TV (need your own nexflix ID) which does add value to the whole experience."),
("2018-06-27", "22337456", "Shaun", "Excellent location stylish aparment and Wendy is a great host"),
("2018-07-05", "22337456", "Michael", "Great apartment  although no TV access the place was clean and Wendy was very responsive. Would go back there if I was in the area"),
("2018-07-11", "22337456", "Novie", "Wendy’s place is very modern and stylish. Located not so far from the airport which only 10 min ride by taxi from airport. The train station were around 15 min walk but there were several bus stop that can connect you with the city. Since we are the first timer to Sydney  we are not so sure using the bus to the city. We just use the bus to get to Bondi Junction. The rest we are using train. There are quite complete cooking ware provided in the apt  so we are able to cook simple breakfast. We have lovely stay in Wendy’s apartment despite of the faucet on the kitchen sink issue that we have on our last day in Sydney which it was pop out suddenly when we use it  seems the faucet connection were not that strong so the water pressure make it pop out. Hopefully  Wendy’s husband can fix it easily. The communication with Wendy is also quite fast. She responded timely  no issue at all. Even her husband came on 9 pm to explain us how to use the TV. Thanks a bunch Wendy for letting us stay in ur apt and letting us leave our luggage in ur apt until 2 pm in our last day. We have great stay! Cheers!"),
("2018-07-13", "22337456", "Nathalie", "Perfect location  close to the CBD and very confortable place!"),
("2018-07-13", "22337456", "Amy", "Wendy’s place was immaculate and stylish. Was perfect for a short stay and close to public transport and the city. Wendy’s communication was friendly and prompt. Would highly recommend."),
("2018-07-19", "22337456", "Arielle", "modern & spacious unit in good location"),
("2018-07-23", "22337456", "Iñaki", "Hemos estado muy a gusto. Las instalaciones estan muy bien y el apartamento bien equipado. Con la red de autobuses nos hemos movido muy bien hasta el centro de Sydney."),
("2018-07-25", "22337456", "Parmella", "What a great find for a good price. Modern apartment with special touches and massage bed. Easy check in and check out. I would stay here again"),
("2018-07-27", "22337456", "Laura", "It is a lovely place! Thank you very much for having me Wendy!"),
("2018-07-29", "22337456", "Zeshaan", "Fantastic place at a great location."),
("2018-08-14", "22337456", "Nicholas", "Wendy was excellent with communication and making sure everything was ok. The apartment is very stylish and the massage bed we had some fun with  very firm mattress. Thank you Wendy "),
("2018-08-16", "22337456", "Janice", "Perfect location and so convenient to access public transportation.The apartment  is clean and provides u great hospitality.Wendy is very helpful and will guide u throughout your stay.Overall experience was awesome.I'll recommend this apartment to every couple and families !!"),
("2018-08-22", "22337456", "Priscilla", "沒有分享"),
("2018-08-30", "22337456", "Justin", "Wendy’s room was immaculate  bathroom was big aswell as the shower! Everything was better then I expected I would definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-09-06", "22337456", "Thanh", "Good place to stay  nice and clean"),
("2018-09-09", "22337456", "Bryan", "Beautiful apartment a great location. The view is amazing especially if there is a lighting storm."),
("2018-09-12", "22337456", "Michael", "The place was spacious and well decorated with a very comfortable bed and very good amenities"),
("2018-09-13", "22337456", "Anthony", "Nice clean place. Major problem was no towells which Wendy was not able to rectify. To her credit she did everything in her power to make up for it."),
("2018-09-25", "22337456", "Karin", "Great apartment and location"),
("2018-09-27", "22337456", "Katrina", "Great little apartment for our family. Close to public transport and funky cafes. We also loved the swimming pool facilities. Wendy replies to all messages so incredibly fast as well. We loved Sydney - thank you"),
("2018-09-30", "22337456", "Lauren", "Really nice apartment in a great area! Super modern and tidy however make sure you bring toilet paper  hand soap  milk etc as it wasn’t provided. Also if there are more than 2 of you staying make sure you pack more bath towels as only 2 were provided."),
("2018-10-03", "22337456", "Peter", "We very much enjoyed our stay at Wendy's place. It is very clean  nicely stocked in case you want to cook some meals at home  and the building pool/whirlpool/sauna was great after long days of walking. Wendy was super accommodating! Highly recommended!"),
("2018-10-07", "22337456", "敏", "可能是墨尔本的房东太周到了 到了悉尼就感觉到落差了 房子很宽敞 位置也很好找 只是交通不是很方便 周围只有巴士站 最近的火车站走路过去要15min钟 吃东西也不是很方便 附近只有一家便利店｡因为uber故障 所以打车也不是很好打 而且卧室的枕头里面不知道装的什么 沙沙响 不是很舒适｡细节还是有很多可以改进的 希望Wendy把民宿越做越好｡"),
("2018-10-10", "22337456", "Estefanie", "We loved Wendy’s place! Is so comfy and clean  close to everything! 100% you should stay here. Everything what we needed was there. Thank you Wendy for your hospitality  we will definitely come back!"),
("2018-10-13", "22337456", "Milla", "Wendy's place is stylish and very clean. The balcony is lovely. Pool and sauna were amazing. Wendy replies to messages very fast and is flexible. I highly recommend Wendy's place."),
("2018-10-23", "22337456", "Craig", "Great place with easy access to transport and the city. Quiet neighborhood. Wendy is spot on with prompt communcation. TV remote wasnt working proper but I am sure Wendy will sort it out"),
("2018-10-24", "22337456", "Everson", "Wendy’s place was stylish and immaculate. Luxurious features with a reasonable price. It’s a little bit out of the city but I would recommend staying here. Thanks again Wendy."),
("2018-10-27", "22337456", "Kelvin", "Clean and good location!! Comfortable place to stay at!Value for money!"),
("2018-10-29", "22337456", "Carina", "We have stayed in a few Airbnbs for our Australia trip  this is the best among all. -Easy to find free street parking-clean  stylish home in a quiet area-clear instructions for check in (we reached at 10pm!)-responsive hostOverall  we love it very much. Will be staying here again when we come back"),
("2018-10-29", "22337456", "Susan", "A clean and stylish place and modern facilities."),
("2018-11-03", "22337456", "Elise", "Home away from home! This is a great place to stay when traveling in Sydney. The place is cozy and safe! It’s a wonderful place that feels like home when you are traveling. Lots of room and clean! Great stay"),
("2018-11-05", "22337456", "Kimwai", "Wonderful place  host is so nice and very helpful!"),
("2018-11-08", "22337456", "Kathy", "Wendy's place is very comfortable for 2 or 3 people. It is relatively close to grocery stores  the train station.  The bed was very comfortable and we slept well each night. Wendy responded very promptly to my texts. We enjoyed our stay there very much!"),
("2018-11-10", "22337456", "Jill", "We enjoyed our two-night stay at this stylish apartment. Loved the space  the fast WiFi and the comfortable bed. Access was easy and Wendy was quick to respond to a couple of minor queries. I wouldn’t hesitate to stay there again and would definitely recommend to friends."),
("2018-11-14", "22337456", "Thibaud", "Everything was great and Wendy was very reactive and helpful. Thank you!"),
("2018-11-17", "22337456", "Sharyn", "The location is fantastic and it really suited us. The bed is comfortable and shower was great. Loved the access to the pool and gym. We would stay here again."),
("2018-11-22", "22337456", "Peggy", "Wendy is a great host!She’s really nice and helpful  every time she reply promptly when I have questions or problems. I really appreciated.The place is good and convenient  bus stops are just at the corner.Surely I’ll stay here again when I visit Sydney again."),
("2018-11-24", "22337456", "Nicholas", "Place is in a great location near the trains and with a solid balcony view  the house was clean and Wendy was really solid with communicating making sure we where on the same page for check in and check out times and we had no problems getting in. Was a super enjoyable stay."),
("2018-11-27", "22337456", "Darron", "Great location for us to get to NIDA also close uber ride to airport. Apartment was nicely appointed and plenty of space for two people. Good facilities and bathroom was great. Great communication from Wendy  quick responses."),
("2018-12-02", "22337456", "Jacqueline", "Wendy was easy to reach and check in was straightforward. Loved the amenities  excellent location and plenty of street parking available."),
("2018-12-05", "22337456", "Lan", "Wendy is an attentive host and replies are very quick. The apartment is conveniently located 1km from Green Sq station and many breakfast/lunch/coffee places are within a 100-700m radius. We enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-12-11", "22337456", "Jacinta", "We really enjoyed our stay at Wendy's apartment. It is a very stylish space and the aircon worked a charm when the weather became hot! I reccomend Wendy's apartment to anyone who would like to stay in a small but chic and inviting space while they explore Sydney's charms."),
("2018-12-14", "22337456", "Nabeel", "A nice place for a few days in a good location. Wendy was very quick to respond to any queries"),
("2018-12-25", "22337456", "Padraig", "Wendy's apartment is in an excellent location: bus 304 travels directly from Wendy's road to Circular Quay in central Sydney while the Green Square train station — on the line that serves both downtown Sydney and the international and domestic airports — is less than 15 minutes walk from the apartment. The apartment was clean  modern  and comfortable.  With two of us staying there  there was a double bed in the bedroom and a couch that turned into a double bed in the living room. Thus  we had plenty of space. Having air conditioning in the apartment was a real joy during a hot December. Wendy was really diligent about communicating with us. Overall  we were very happy about our stay in Wendy's apartment. The kitchen was equipped with a stove/oven and microwave. The one recommendation that we would make — based on the fact that we were there for nine nights — would be to have a full set of cooking pots and pans. But that was a minor issue that did not detract from our positive experiences in the apartment."),
("2018-12-30", "22337456", "Christina", "It's a spacious and well equiped apartment for four  much better than I've expected  and the wifi connection is very good. Less than 5 minutes walking distance to the bus stop to get to the city."),
("2019-01-04", "22337456", "ｻﾗ", "とても素敵なお部屋でした!ｼｬﾝﾌﾟｰなどもあり助かりました!"),
("2019-01-05", "22337456", "Anita", "Wendy’s place was just what we needed for our one night  post wedding stay. It was in a great spot  leafy suburb and close enough to local shops. The place was very clean and very cool on a hot summers night. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2019-01-06", "22337456", "Rod", "Overall the apartment was neat and tidy and we had a good stay. Areas to be improved: No soap in bathroom. No coffee or tea provided. Toilet seat does not fit the bowl so when you sit on the seat the toilet lid whacks you in the back."),
("2019-01-09", "22337456", "郁傑", "Good"),
("2019-01-10", "22337456", "Senem", "This flat is unbeleaveble. Its clean  huge and good located. Wendy is a very nice and helpful host. She answers very quick."),
("2019-01-13", "22337456", "Ashleigh", "Great stay  stylish and spacious place  very clean!"),
("2019-01-23", "22337456", "Cassie", "Very nice place! Clean and central to everything.   Although  there is no free parking on the premises.  A long story  but you need permission to park in the visitor parking and a key to unlock and lock the parking bolt  she doesn't have a designated car park!  Street parking is 2 hours ""but apparently no one ever checks"".  Wendy tries her best to make your stay comfortable.  I would definatley recommend her place otherwise."),
("2019-01-28", "22337456", "Iluka", "Easy  stylish space and Host was very reliable"),
("2019-02-02", "22337456", "Mini", "Good stay"),
("2019-02-04", "22337456", "Hollie", "The apartment is near the supermarket and the cafe"),
("2019-02-06", "22337456", "Rasif", "Nice for a quick stay!"),
("2019-02-12", "22337456", "奇貓", "Very tidy and well-mannered."),
("2019-02-15", "22337456", "璐", "房子离机场有四公里左右 周围都是住宅区 坐公交门口走几步就有比较方便 但是地铁站比较远 晚上到达建议还是住机场附近就好 机场离市区比较近｡房间适合两人入住 多了睡沙发但是沙发不太舒服 厨房配备和墨尔本住的一些房子比起来确实要差许多 但是毕竟悉尼住房本身就贵些 感觉还是住机场的酒店公寓更划算方便一些｡"),
("2019-02-19", "22337456", "현정", "호스트의 친절함과 빠른답변이 좋았고  문제발생을 고려한 배려가 편하고 좋았다. 수영장 헬스장을 마음껏 이용할수 있어서 좋고  에어컨도 시원하고 좋았다.  또 시드니 갈때 이용할수 있겠으나  마트가 1키로를 넘게가는것은 알아둬야할 사항.^^"),
("2014-03-04", "2278444", "Georgina", "We had a great time in Paddington; the house is fascinating and the room was perfect. Sadly we never met Arnie in person  instead were shown around by his easy-going and lovely friend. Paddington Market is just across the road and we walked everywhere along Oxford St. Highly recommended."),
("2014-03-09", "2278444", "Elsa", "Dear Arnie and Lorraine  thank you so much for having us at your wonderful place. It was a really nice and homy place for us. Love the room  the cozy bed and also the fresh air that comes from our 2 windows. The house has a good natural light  a wonderful kitchen  and a stunning bathroom. I also give Arnie a lot of credits for his artworks that filled most of the entire house. He is truly a fine artist. Lorraine was also a good host to us  very friendly and has a lovely smile. Thanks for the wonderful experience and sharing your lovely place for us."),
("2014-03-18", "2278444", "Jason", "What a cool house!  A great way to stimulate the creative mind while staying in comfort. The bedroom was very comfortable and the hosts were really nice. Great historic area with cafes and little specialty shops just around the corner. This quickly became my favorite airbnb place."),
("2014-03-22", "2278444", "John", "The house was a treasure trove of colour and art. The location was easy to get to by bus. The bedroom was clean and fresh.Entry and exit and wandering around the neighborhood was safe and simple.Arnie and his partner were both easy going  polite and made the this first time using airbnb a pleasure.Thanks guys. Highly recommend this place."),
("2014-03-26", "2278444", "Arnold", "Perfect location in a truly special house. The room was lovely and very clean;  and as quiet as confortable. Arnie was very arranging and helpful. We stayed a total of 3 nights. Paddington is a great area of Sydney  very central. You can go anywhere from here  the bus stop was very close.I would highly recommend anybody to stay here. "),
("2014-04-02", "2278444", "Chris", "Wow!  What a great way to experience Sydney.  A beautiful city  and a beautiful home base for your stay.  Arnie's place is funky and creative (reflecting its owner)  and centrally located right in the middle of all the action.  Walking distance to great places  and all the public transport to take you anywhere else you want to go.  And Arnie is a warm host.  Totally recommended!"),
("2014-04-21", "2278444", "Rudyard", "Once I mastered the bus system  I realized how easy it was to get to Arnie's Victorian home. The room assigned to me was spacious; however the bedsprings of the antique bed creaked  and made me paranoid about disturbing the rest of the occupants of the house (and other guests). After a long day exploring the city  the creaking bedsprings did not bother me as much on the second night.The bathroom is up another set of stairs  but clean and spacious too.Arnie was very helpful when I discovered I had lost the key to my luggage  and I really appreciated that.The house itself is filled with Victoriana and of Arnie's large paintings.The neighborhood of Paddington is very boutiquey and fun to wander through.  There are a number of bookshops (which I love) and many furniture and clothes stores. Went to a couple of cafes for breakfast in the neighborhood; the food was reasonably priced and the coffee was great.All in all  a different and attractive face to Sydney  than what I was used to. I'm glad I chose this home on this Sydney visit."),
("2014-05-03", "2278444", "Kate", "Arnie's house is beautiful  it's in a great location and both him and Lorraine were very welcoming. Possibly the comfiest bed I stayed in during my time away! Highly recommend staying here."),
("2014-05-07", "2278444", "Christophe", "Amazing sleep clean great house and host loved itxxx"),
("2014-05-19", "2278444", "Fiona", "We only stayed one night in Arnie's house  it would have been great to have stayed longer with very friendly hosts and a comfortable bed and a super location."),
("2014-05-29", "2278444", "Jenny", "I stayed here while exhibiting at a nearby trade show.  Arnie's house was just what I needed and it was a pity I didn't have time to 'put up my feet'.  Arnie was interststae for most of my stay so I didn't get much time to chat with him but I enjoyed chatting to the other guests in the evening.  They loved the house and were very interested in its history.The lack of street parking was the only negative.  There is a small parking area leading to the house  but my parking skills were obviously lacking and I incurred a $1400 damage bill from the car rental firm due to scrapes on the vehicle.  Despite that I would certainly return because the house was well located and much more enjoyable than staying at a hotel."),
("2014-06-03", "2278444", "Xiaoyu(笑语)", "Arnie's house is just like what we can see from airbnb a piece of art.From the outside  you can see it's as normal as the other houses standing by. But when you entered in  how to describe it  a feeling of stepping in a gallary.The rainbow-coloured stair hanged-up drawings historical furnitures etc.We were so glad to stayed in their house for two nights. We love it and hope more people can appreciate the beatiful house."),
("2014-06-10", "2278444", "Pam", "Friendly host  quiet neighbourhood  comfortable bed."),
("2014-07-22", "2278444", "Roby", "I made a good choice. It's walking distance to cool little cafés  quiet neighborhood right in the city  the room had the comfiest bed  charming house with beautiful artwork everywhere  and lovely host! Will def book again next time I'm back in Sydney."),
("2014-07-29", "2278444", "Sue", "Our host Arnie made us welcome.  The location is great  one street back from Oxford Street  the room is private  the bed comfortable  the bathroom generous. "),
("2014-08-25", "2278444", "Elizabeth", "I enjoyed my stay with Arnie  Lorraine and Arabella. Arnie was very welcoming and it was a delight to get to know Lorraine. The house is amazing - very creative space  as you would expect with Arnie being an artist. The location is superb - very exclusive and trendy Paddington with lots of designer shops in the side streets as well as Oxford Street. Very handy to city and transport. Thanks for your hospitality."),
("2014-08-30", "2278444", "Audra", "Thanks for a lovely stay! Wonderful place  great host and fantastic location. Would definitely be back! "),
("2014-09-22", "2278444", "Daniela", "Arnie and Lorraine are very nice and friendly  they gave me a warm welcome and suggested great spots for breakfast  dinner and walk around.The house is clean  unique and looks exactly like the pics  in addition there is all what you need ie. wi-fi  adaptors  hair dryer etc...and also maps  books  and delicious ginger tea!The place has a great location in Paddington  really close to transport   lots of interesting little shops  cafes and restaurants. I loved it!"),
("2014-09-28", "2278444", "Trent", "Very responsive  smooth checkin/checkout  some unexpected little niceties  and a very interesting house."),
("2014-10-15", "2278444", "Dawn", "Arnie was very helpful but also left us to come and go as we pleased and to use the facilities in his lovely home.  He gave us good recommendations of places to visit and pubs to eat in.It was a great location and neighbourhood with lots of shops  cafes and restaurants within walking distance.  It was also near a bus route  which meant that the city centre and beaches were easily accessible.It was our first AirBnB experience and we would recommend it."),
("2014-11-01", "2278444", "Jasmine", "Staying in this lovely place was truly an amazing experience! Yes the pictures are accurate and the place is located in the perfect spot 2 min walk from the bus stop  nice/safe area and the chance to do lots of shopping. Arnie and his partner were more then welcoming and if you get the chance why not have a look at Arnie's great art work. The bed was soft and comfy wasn't much noise at all. I also want to say thank-you for dealing with my last minute booking. I highly recommend anyone to stay at this listing you will not regret it I promise. I can't wait to stay again!!"),
("2014-11-04", "2278444", "Lubi", "Lovely. What a great pad and well positioned location. Arnie was friendly and helpful."),
("2014-11-10", "2278444", "Galit&Alex", "Spectacular place on the colonial side  fantastic area with true Sydney spirit  nice and helpful host. Rather quiet  no street traffic could be heard. Good value. Highly recommended."),
("2014-11-11", "2278444", "Shayla", "The listing description was accurate. The house was clean and had lovely accommodations. We loved the location. The neighborhood was off a busy street where we could easily catch a cab or take a bus. Also had cute boutiques  restaurants and pubs on the side streets. The location definitely made us want to come back and be able to explore Paddington more. "),
("2014-11-14", "2278444", "Tiffany", "My stay at this beatutiful home was memorable & exactly what I needed. The house reflected the way the pictures looked and the room was spacious and very comfortable & also secure. Paddinton was a lovely suburb with friendly people & great shopping  food  cafe's and bars.Arnie & Lorraine were welcoming & even though I didn't meet Arnie until day 3 I felt at home and welcomed based on the energy & peace in the home.  Thank you!  I will definitely be back again in the future! Tiffany"),
("2014-11-15", "2278444", "Esther", "Unable to review as details on how to enter studio arrived too late.  Door and mobile not answered on arrival so did not stay."),
("2014-11-18", "2278444", "Jon", "Arnie was a good host.  We didn't see all that much of him since we were out most of the time  but he was helpful in our short interaction.  He was also gracious about us waking them at 10:30 when we couldn't figure out the lock.The house is old and interesting  and in a great location.  Very easy to get to many great neighborhoods in Sydney from his location.My only complaints were having a shared bathroom  and that the room was right next to Arnie's own bedroom.  The close proximity didn't cause any issues really  we just had to be extra quiet to not disturb them.  There is another bedroom on the other side of the house which would have provided better privacy  but that was occupied during our stay.  The shared bathroom wasn't a major issue  though there was a couple times when it was unavailable."),
("2014-11-23", "2278444", "Laura", "We had a lovely time in Arnie's place  the house is lovely but we simply fell in love with the neighborhood: what a fantastic area! It's very safe  beautiful and there are cafés  pubs  public transport and a convenience store very nearby. It was a great base for our days in Sydney. We definitely recommend staying here. "),
("2014-11-27", "2278444", "Woods", "Great stay - Arnie and Lorraine were very welcoming and the house is just as fun as the pictures - great art! The room was comfy and in a great location  would stay here again."),
("2014-11-29", "2278444", "Joel", "Grand old house with heaps of charm in the thick of Paddington. Room was big with a real comfy bed. Hosted by a very lovely and welcoming couple  relaxed and friendly. Fresh towels and even a chocolate on the pillow!"),
("2014-12-01", "2278444", "Jay", "The place was great  better than describes. Very impressive place and will definitely look at going back. Ace!"),
("2014-12-06", "2278444", "Ashleigh", "This is a destination home. You should go to Paddington simply for this majestic abode. Arnie and Lorraine are sweethearts - we had great chats  they allowed me space when I wanted it but were around and fun to hang out with. Though they were away when I arrived  they left clear instruction for how to get in and called me to check I was ok.A visit to this house is worth it solely for the interior decoration - a personal art gallery of infinite intrigue. The bedrooms are plenty spacious for a short stay. The house on a quiet street just set back from where it's all happening on Oxford St. There's a plentoria of top notch and unique food and retail shops around.The only drawback is that there's only one bathroom but the downstairs bathroom was being repaired on the last day of my stay so should be solved shortly.Truly  I now count this beautiful family as an extension of my own and I'm certain you will too."),
("2014-12-08", "2278444", "Julian", "We were welcomed by cute little notes all over the house as the hosts were awayReally enjoyed the location and their home is very interesting"),
("2014-12-12", "2278444", "Tim", "Cool house  good location  nice people  would stay again  thanks!"),
("2014-12-30", "2278444", "Marika", "A beautiful house with beautiful paintings. Arnie's family is very kind  the accomodation is confortable  clean and located in a preatty and quite roundabout. The center is 30 minutes walk away and the bus to downtown stops closed to the house."),
("2015-01-19", "2278444", "Maria", "Unusual and sophisticated house  very good location in a quite street  possibility to get to the beach by bus or on foot (40 mins walk)  and very hospital and lovely owner. Thank you  Lorraine :)"),
("2015-01-28", "2278444", "Rentao", "Arnie's house was beautiful as others have said  and he and his family were very welcoming and friendly. It takes about 15-20 minutes by bus to CBD and the Opera House."),
("2015-02-02", "2278444", "Peter", "Host was very helpful in finding the place  when I couldn't work out directions; room adequate; bathroom clean and pleasant  although shared; house has steep stairs without handrail in one section; great location  close to everything  public transport short walk away"),
("2015-02-03", "2278444", "Gail", "This was our second visit to Arnie's wonderful house and it felt like coming home.  The house is gorgeous  the rooms are great with very comfortable beds and the location is excellent. Arnie and Lorraine are brilliant hosts who really make you feel welcome and couldn't be more helpful or easy going. Highly recommend!"),
("2015-02-04", "2278444", "Tanja", "Arnie's arty pad was as welcoming as the eclectic images on airbnb. He was very warm  happy to share stories about the unique residence and equally happy to give me complete space to do what I needed whilst I was there. The guest room I was in felt like I had gone completely back in time and the bath (as deep as the ocean)  well  that will just have to wait til next time. Arnie's arty home in Paddington is a stones throw away from Oxford st which is super handy. Whether for work or play  in this pad  you must stay. I'll be back for sure! Thanks Arnie."),
("2015-02-10", "2278444", "Emily", "Amazing  beautiful and sophisticated house with beautiful paintings  fantastic kitchen  very hospital and lovely owner (Arnie and Lorraine)  Very good location in a quiet and pretty street  possibility to get to the beach and city by bus  Thank you  Arnie and Lorraine :)"),
("2015-02-25", "2278444", "Nick", "Arnie and his wife were both friendly and helpful. The house is in a great neighborhood and is centrally located so it is quick and easy to get almost anywhere. The home itself is eclectic  charming and elegant. Definitely a good spot to stay!"),
("2015-02-28", "2278444", "Edward", "Arnie was a courteous and friendly host. He kindly accepted my booking last minute. It was a pleasure to stay in his home for my first two nights in Sydney. Pleasant surroundings  a comfy bed and delicious tea made the stay very relaxing. The local guidebooks were a welcome touch. I would return!"),
("2015-03-09", "2278444", "Margsandmacdaddy", "Arnie and Lorraine were excellent hosts. They were welcoming but not intrusive. I stayed at this bnb for 4 nights while my husband was in St Vincents Private Hospital. The bnb was in a great location a 15-20 minute walk to the hospital. It is in a safe area with plenty of cafés and restaurants in the vicinity.  The keyless entry saved the worry about carrying keys. My first time using bnb. A good experience. Thank you."),
("2015-03-13", "2278444", "Simon", "T"),
("2015-03-16", "2278444", "Peter", "Wow  what a delight is was to stay at Arnie's Paddington house. Arnie made everything easy for Jacinta and I to enjoy Sydney and the local area. He suggested dining places and interesting tours. If the grind of Sydney wears you down  relax by the pool. If its raining  enjoy the fabulous art collection on every wall.The house is a period gem with 18ft ceilings and with very high quality modern appliances. That's it......a gem!"),
("2015-03-21", "2278444", "Nadege", "Accueil discret du propriétaire qui nous a laissés nous installer et aller et venir comme nous le souhaitions. Arnie est une personne serviable."),
("2015-03-26", "2278444", "Wendy", "Our host was very congenial  but owing to our travel arrangements  we only saw him briefly.  He was helpful in showing us the room  the bathroom and the front door system.  "),
("2015-03-27", "2278444", "Jodie", "Its neighbourhoods like this that make me want to move to Sydney! The location was perfect  being between the city and Bondi with a great variety up-market of shops and boutiques. Arnie and his wife are both intelligent and friendly. I stumbled to make eye contact with them at times because I trying to take in the collective of interesting artworks. My only regret is that I didn't book another night. Thanks for having me. I would love to stay again."),
("2015-03-28", "2278444", "Michele", "Thank you Arnie and Lorraine for letting me stay in your very interesting home. Also appreciate you accommodating me a such short notice. Will be back :) much appreciated Michele"),
("2015-04-03", "2278444", "Joel", "I had a brief  but very enjoyable stay at Arnie's very unique and interesting historic house. Arnie made everything about the stay very easy and provided a great introduction to the neighbourhood with very useful recommendations. Paddington is a really lovely area and the house is perfectly located in the middle of the nice shops  restaurants and bars  but on a very quiet street. Wish I could have stayed longer."),
("2015-04-09", "2278444", "Bernhard", "Everything was okay  friendly house"),
("2015-04-15", "2278444", "Eliana", "We had an amazing stay at Arnie's and Lorraine's home. The house is beautifully decorated  with a really interesting art collection. We also liked a lot the neighborhood  with charming architecture and close to public transport.Our room was super comfortable  we had to work during our stay and everything work well  wifi connection is good and we enjoyed working by the pool or inside with a hot cup of coffee. We also got the chance to meet other guests and have a nice talk with them.Definetly recommend this place   it's was our first time in Sydney and we loved it. Like other guests mentioned on her review  it makes you want to move there!So Arnie and Lorraine  thank you! "),
("2015-04-19", "2278444", "Mariana", "Arnie was the best host ever! His house was amazing and not only did he open up his house to us but was also kind enough to introduce us to some of his amazing friends when we had an awesome mexican night with lots of food and cocktails galore. It was an incredible experience and I can't wait to go back again soon!"),
("2015-04-21", "2278444", "Sarah Alexandra", "This was one of the loveliest houses I've ever seen! The decor is absolutely stunning  from the red painted living room to the walls covered in an assortment of paintings to the regal marble bathroom with gilded mirrors. We stayed in one of the double bedrooms which was very comfortable for just two nights. I think this would be a great option for renting the whole property but if you're just staying in one room it does feel a little like you're disturbing the family. Also a little odd that their daughter sleeps in a corridor outside the guest room. We found that rather uncomfortable  even if they put a door or a curtain across the corridor to block it off would have been better. There's also no mention of the fact they have a kid on their profile. Other than that  a wonderful house."),
("2015-04-29", "2278444", "Damian", "Funky 70s place. Great bed."),
("2015-05-04", "2278444", "Vanessa", "I really enjoyed my stay at Arnie's place. It's an amazing house in a fantastic location. Communication was easy and everything went smoothly."),
("2015-05-09", "2278444", "Melissa", "The reservation was canceled 6 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-05-09", "2278444", "Daniel", "The reservation was canceled 14 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-05-16", "2278444", "Patrick", "Our stay with Arnie was a pleasure. He was responsive to our messages before and during our stay. He was home when we arrived and provided great recommendations on places to visit.The house is very well-located. Paddington is an absolutely delightful neighborhood. We enjoyed exploring the wide-range of cafes  restaurants  and stores (we definitely recommend dinner at Eat Thai). Likewise  we enjoyed having the option of a leisurely stroll down Oxford to the CBD or choosing one of at least three bus lines to whisk us quickly to our destination.With regards to the house itself  this is certainly a property for anyone with an appreciation for art. Arnie has a well-curated collection  including many of his own works. During our stay  there was a guest in the second bedroom  but we didn't have any issues with the shared bathroom."),
("2015-06-07", "2278444", "Lubi", "Arnie and his family are wonderful hosts. Making my guest feel welcome and comfortable with the level of support received prior and during stay. Thanks"),
("2015-06-09", "2278444", "FrankVee", "Very enjoyable and warm reception.  The unit has automatic booking  so Arnie was unaware of us coming  thus we only gained access around 3:30.  Thus  suggest you call ahead to ensure all are aware.Lovely interesting house  I will attempt to return on my next visit."),
("2015-06-27", "2278444", "Jeanette", "What an interesting place to stay  and very comfortable after 23 days tenting in the Northern territory. I liked Arnie and I enjoyed having a good stroll all about Paddington - great location."),
("2015-06-29", "2278444", "Kate", "Arnie & his daughter were both very friendly and welcoming.  The listing was as it's described on Airbnb.  The house is in a great location in Paddington."),
("2015-07-02", "2278444", "Joanna", "Nice location and very close to the bus station   ten mins to CBD. We was really enjoying our stay. The house is so cool ! Especially it's fantastic interior design. The room was super comfortable! We love everything here!  Definitely will book again!!! "),
("2015-07-06", "2278444", "Aaron", "Super easy access to the beautiful home he has created. Great to talk with the entire family. It was one of the best experiences I've had with airbnb. I was even lucky enough to have a ""long black"" or as I would call it an Americano "),
("2015-09-03", "2278444", "Caren", "The host canceled this reservation 34 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-10-07", "2278444", "Nicholas", "I really enjoyed my stay. The location was very handy for me. The house is fantastic and a bit of a gem. My room and bathroom were very comfortable. Arnie and his family are lovely."),
("2015-10-08", "2278444", "Lily", "The house is really cool just like a art gallery.And it is very regrettable that we did not meet the host because we only stay for one night.But I think they must be very nice because our plane arrived late and the host left a lot of sticky note to help us know more about the house.That is really very sweet!"),
("2015-10-30", "2278444", "Sean", "Felt welcome and allowed privacy- lovely coffee in the morning too!Nice area and handy for Sydney"),
("2015-11-11", "2278444", "Jann", "Arnie was nicely relaxed. Excellent area. Nice and quiet  but plenty of good cafes and bars. We'd definitely stay again. "),
("2015-11-16", "2278444", "Yao", "The host canceled this reservation 9 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-11-20", "2278444", "Xiaoxi", "Arnie家真的非常非常漂亮 非常有艺术气息｡房东夫妇两个人也非常友善 有什么事他们尽力帮助你 而且不会打扰你｡Paddington区周围有很多咖啡馆 风景也很美丽｡总之住在他们家你会觉得很值得｡"),
("2015-11-22", "2278444", "Tara", "The host canceled this reservation 6 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-11-25", "2278444", "Pavane", "Arnie and Lorraine's Artists Home in Paddington is a true gem. Wonderful and warm hosts with a truly unique and interesting house in the best location in Sydney. They were kind and relaxed  the place was comfortable  you didn't want for anything and though I didn't have time on this trip you could easily spend some wonderful hours in the eclectic decor of the really fantastic bohemian style lounge. The surrounding area is teaming with cafes - The Bonython is literally next door - The Alimentari down the road and tonnes of great restaurants - a few minutes to Oxford St via William St - minutes form regular buses and taxis. Paddington is a great area of Sydney. Historically  culinary and fashion wise with a market on Saturday. Believe me - a fine way to experience Sydney as a visitor. If you are a solo traveler or a pair looking for old Artistic Sydney charm on a realistic budget then this is the place. Wish I could have got to know the hosts better. Can't wait to go back. Great people doing a great thing. "),
("2015-11-27", "2278444", "Lu", "The host canceled this reservation 3 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-12-13", "2278444", "Chadd", "Arnie and Lorraine are super sweet and hospitable. Arnie  always up for a chat and has a great knowledge of Sydney if you're a first timer or even a regular visitor looking to have some different experiences. The house very unique and easy to get visually lost in. It's also clean  spacious and located perfectly for those wanting to feel central to the city and not too far away from the eastern beaches for summer visitors."),
("2016-01-11", "2278444", "Brittney", "The host canceled this reservation 9 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-01-11", "2278444", "Parag", "The host canceled this reservation 27 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-01-14", "2278444", "Saki", "The host canceled this reservation 18 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-02-29", "2278444", "Chris", "It was an awesome experience staying at Arnie's place. Located at centre of Paddington great food and neighbourhood. 15 walking distance to CBD  if you want somewhere with great characters  please book this place. Bring your running shoes   centennial parklands just 2 minutes away great running track."),
("2016-03-15", "2278444", "Jessica", "Arnie and Lorraine's property is an absolute treasure! Steeped in art and history and only one street back from Oxford St (and the delightful Saturday Paddington markets) I couldn't have picked a better place to stay. There's two Airbnb rooms who share the beautiful stone bathroom but I rarely noticed the other guests  the room I had isn't pictured but had a great feel with gorgeous natural light and plenty of space. Arnie and Lorraine felt like old friends after my week there and I'll definitely be back! "),
("2016-04-29", "2278444", "Michael", "Arnie and Lorraine welcomed me as part of their family. Their hospitality knows no bounds and I was met every day with tales of their adventures and their ever evolving home. I highly recommend spending time with the Arnold's if you ever get the chance"),
("2016-05-02", "2278444", "John", "Arnie and Lorraine were great hosts who catered to my every needs. The house and location itself were perfect."),
("2016-05-04", "2278444", "Jiatong", "It is really artical"),
("2016-05-10", "2278444", "Karen", "Fantastic location. Perfect walking distance to everything in Paddington. Our privacy was respected & the owner very kind."),
("2016-05-20", "2278444", "Jess", "My experience at Lorraine and Arnie's home was below average. When I first walked into the house to drop off my luggage  Arnie opened the doors and quickly walked away making me feel like an inconvenience.The room that was given unfortunately looked nothing like the room that was in the photos. The house felt very cold  dark  and lifeless. The house also probably needed a proper clean  it smelt very dusty. The bathroom doors despite no opened windows would occasionally just open itself which was annoying when you're in the shower or on the toilet. I used the scales on the ground that I found and leaned them on the door so that my time in the bathroom wasn't interrupted. The wifi also did not connect if you were upstairs  which meant you were not able to use the internet in your own room. The pool could've used a clean  looked like nobody had swam in there for a few years. Lorraine also made a point that we weren't allowed to walk up the stairs in our shoes which is fair enough  however the manner in which she did it was like a parent lecturing a child which I thought was unnecessary. A highlight of our stay was Arnie's daughter Arabella  she was very well-mannered and welcoming. "),
("2016-06-01", "2278444", "Samantha", "Arnie & Lorraine lead a life full of love. I felt right at home in their vibrant world of eclectic art and wonderful  engaging conversation. I was lucky enough to visit when they had their engagement party and had the chance to dance into the early hours  celebrating. My week in Sydney was incredible and was made more so with the friendship and welcoming arms of them both. I intend to return and highly recommend staying. "),
("2016-06-07", "2278444", "Helen", "Just back home from a wonderful 5 night stay in Sydney with Lorraine and Arnie.  loved their house  its location and most of all their care and attention.  Best coffee for miles!!! I love Paddington and their home reflects its essence - history  art  good vibes and a communal sense.Any concerns? No but if you are older like me make sure you turn on the light for the top flight.  Will I stay again ?  Yes please!!!!! "),
("2016-06-16", "2278444", "Alex", "As picture showed  it is a creative home. Located in eastern sub  easy to access city. The queen size bed is fit for solo traveller more than the couple."),
("2016-06-20", "2278444", "James", "This house was phenomenal. Great location  great art  and great people. Thoroughly recommended. "),
("2016-06-27", "2278444", "Maud", "What a house !! Exactly the pictures ! An artist home where you never get rid of exploring the decoration !"),
("2016-07-06", "2278444", "Bruce", "I enjoyed my stay at this very interesting house. Loraine's greeting and introduction to the house was pleasant. I was out early and home late so didn't see much of my hosts  in fact missed Arnie completely.  The bedroom was stylish and interesting  the bed super comfortable with good pillows and I slept really well. Nice Edwardian feel to the room but bedside lamps too weak for reading. A jug of water disappeared on the second day and never came back which was a problem because of the perilous trek to the bathroom to get a glass there and back! Which brings me to the bathroom which is spectacular and welcoming.The shower Good and reliable   the big tub looked great  I never used it. But the stairs up to the bathroom are the real problem. There's no bannister  and it is really difficult descending steadying yourself with your elbows on the walls and avoiding the art works as you clutch your clothes  towels and glass of water. Looking down the full length of the stairs with no handrail gives  me vertigo. I did appreciate the house and its atmosphere  and  the surrounding streets with the loved architecture and surprising shops was where I wanted to be ."),
("2016-07-21", "2278444", "Paul", "Great neighborhood and easy place to stay (for the second time)."),
("2016-08-03", "2278444", "Moira", "Great house and we loved staying in Paddington! Arnie made some great recommendations for places to eat in the area."),
("2016-08-15", "2278444", "Elena", "Super vintage style house. Really love it and we had a very good time here. Arnie and Lorrine are very helpful and gave us some suggestions as well. Thank you so much and we would definitely highly recommend this place."),
("2016-08-27", "2278444", "Amanda", "Thank for Lorraine give us free parking! You were patient waiting us late arrival. Sorry about this. The house looks like an art gallery full of artistic atmosphere. All of indoor equipment are historic and modern too. It was only a night for our staying that hadn't used the amazing kitchen. I hope I can visit the house again.这座房子座落在一个很有历史感的安静的街区 附近都是维多利亚式建筑 建议对于澳洲近代历史感兴趣的人士前往入住 你可以看到房主的收藏以及日常使用的设施(例如家具或水龙头)都体现了近代澳洲殷实之家的生活特色｡买点小酒 饮品和甜品在这房子的餐室､泳池边或者套房里的阳台消磨几小时都是不错的选择"),
("2016-09-07", "2278444", "Yusu", "very fancy decorated house! nice hosts as arnie and lorraine! wish to stay longer"),
("2016-09-28", "2278444", "Riccardo", "Arnie house is realy a special place like look at the pictures. Full of interesting objects and atmosphere.The location perfect  very central but at the same time very quite too.Arnie is a very kind person...he did everythink to make my stay confortable. In plus he drive me around to the city showing to me the best parts of Sidney. P.s. ...Arnie has a very special studio too...full of his interesting art pieces . Thanks Arnie and Loraine nice to see you again. Raccomanded "),
("2016-10-11", "2278444", "元馨", "It's a stunning house. Vintage decorations.We had a really nice stay. But parking is not convinient around."),
("2016-10-15", "2278444", "Ebony", "What an extraordinary home! I had a delightful stay in the green room. Arnie and Lorraine were everything you would want from hosts - welcoming  friendly and inclusive and happy to leave you to it also. I highly recommend their home plus it is in a great location  easy to get to the beach and city."),
("2016-11-11", "2278444", "New", "My host was asleep when I arrived but that didn't matter - they had covered all the important bits and I fell into a nice big bed. I met Lorraine in the morning for a cup-o-tea."),
("2016-11-17", "2278444", "Brady", "Gorgeous Victorian-style terrace  outrageously decorated with all kinds of fascinating art  artefacts and fittings. A super creative retreat with friendly hosts  and a pool out back."),
("2016-11-20", "2278444", "Paul", "This home is truly one of a kind. I enjoyed staying at Arnie and Lorraine's unforgettable home. The room was great and the Paddington location was a great base from which to explore. Highly recommended."),
("2016-11-29", "2278444", "Hannah", "I felt very at home here. Arnie and Lorraine are warm and relaxed. The bed was super comfortable and it was quiet at night. The location was perfect- my favourite part of Sydney. Loved being surrounded by all the art."),
("2016-12-04", "2278444", "Yasmina", "This is a fantastic central location  with loads of shops/  restaurants/ bars/ pubs within a 5 minute radius. The room I stayed in was ample for one person and the shared bathroom is amazing - both are large and kept very clean. Arnie and Lorraine are both lovely and I really enjoyed my stay. Would definitely recommend this accommodation to others looking to stay in Paddington."),
("2016-12-09", "2278444", "Saskia", "Incredible place!! Wish we could have seen it in all it's glory! Thanks for having us!"),
("2017-01-03", "2278444", "Josephine", "The host canceled this reservation 35 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-01-13", "2278444", "India", "Incredible house. Incredible stay! :)"),
("2017-01-21", "2278444", "TingYu", "The house looks fantastic! Bus stops just at the corner and there are lots of restaurants and bars nearby. Hosts are friendly and willing to help."),
("2017-02-02", "2278444", "Peter", "This was a comfortable place to stay in the middle of Paddington -- a residential area close to the city center with pubs and restaurants nearby."),
("2017-02-13", "2278444", "Gary", "The host canceled this reservation 14 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-02-16", "2278444", "Amy", "Had a wonderful stay at Arnie & Lorraine's place in Paddington. The house has so much charm  and I was very comfortable in one of the upstairs bedrooms. The area has loads of cool restaurants and cafes  and they provided a list of recommendations for the neighborhood  which was really helpful. Would highly recommend anyone to stay here! "),
("2017-02-21", "2278444", "Danni", "Can't imagine this house is over 100 years because it's maintained so well. The room is cozy and fans and air condition are there. The highlight is the bathroom  the decoration is just amazing! Although this place is not located in the city central but still really handy."),
("2017-02-24", "2278444", "Gersende", "Great artistic house in a fantastic neighborhood ! Nearby very nice restaurants  bars and shops but still quiet ! Walking distance for train and bus station. Room is beautiful and clean as the bathroom . The only missing would be aircon...Lorraine gave us a warm welkome !To recommand !"),
("2017-03-18", "2278444", "John", "Exactly in the right location for meA quirky & interesting decor and art works. The hosts couldn't be more helpful. Very accomodating"),
("2017-04-05", "2278444", "Claire", "Place was in the midway btw CBD and Bondi beach so location was great with a car. Bedroom and living space is very clean with living necessities and utilities like towels and printer kindly prepared and available for use. Indoor decor design was classic and contentful. Host were really nice and friendly to allow us to use every utensil in the kitchen. Great stay"),
("2017-04-28", "2278444", "Julian", "Excellent and unique place to stay whilst in Sydney. Arnie and Lorraine were very friendly and helpful. The Paddington area is a great place to stay. Out of the way  but very direct when going into the city.The house is full of character and my stay was very comfortable. Recommended!"),
("2017-05-24", "2278444", "Shannon", "Really beautiful house in a great location"),
("2017-07-17", "2278444", "Edwin", "Really nice room with enough space and interesting environment :)"),
("2017-08-13", "2278444", "冠文", "房子很棒"),
("2017-08-23", "2278444", "Monica", "Very unique house! Enjoyed my stat"),
("2017-09-01", "2278444", "Celine", "Beautiful house in a lovely neighbourhood. Great location with lots of buses on the doorstep so easy to get everywhere. Had a really comfy stay here with everything I needed. Lorraine was lovely and helpful and got back to me super fast when I had any questions. Would definitely stay here again next time I'm in Sydney."),
("2017-09-16", "2278444", "Scott", "Arnie and Lorraine are friendly and accommodating  the house is spacious with everything you'd need and it's close to public transport"),
("2017-10-02", "2278444", "Sophia", "Great location  easy access to the city/bondi beach. Unique interior  clean  cozy. "),
("2017-10-09", "2278444", "Anita", "Een heel bijzonder huis om in te verblijven in een superieure buurt in Sydney. Prima uitvalsbasis voor een bezoek aan de stad."),
("2017-10-15", "2278444", "Katrena", "Really enjoyed our nights stay in the heart of Paddington.  So close to Boutique Shops  Cafes and Iconic Paddington Pubs.  We were made very welcome and loved the ambience of the quirky decor.Would definitely stay again.Katrena and David"),
("2017-10-22", "2278444", "Charles", "Great place  great hosts  very friendly and welcoming"),
("2017-10-26", "2278444", "Matthew", "Good location  comfy bed smallish room thou. There was a semi-permanent tennant when I was there and he started work early...woke me at 5 but otherwise nice house"),
("2017-10-31", "2278444", "Sarah", "The host canceled this reservation 10 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-11-10", "2278444", "Jess", "Arnie and Lorraine's home is stunning and filled with wonders. Incredibly comfortable and in a great location- we highly recommend a stay!"),
("2017-11-25", "2278444", "Sally", "We loved the central location  the quirkiness of the house and hospitality of the hosts.  We would return again when we visit Sydney. We couldn't have found a better place. Simple Marvellous!"),
("2017-12-02", "2278444", "Ryan", "Amazing house in a great location"),
("2017-12-28", "2278444", "Zoe & James", "Impressive old home in a great location. The design of the bathroom  view of the pool and massive art collection was a bit of a luxury for us. The eclectic space made us feel at home."),
("2018-02-21", "23106836", "Vivian", "Perfect private space"),
("2018-03-01", "23106836", "James", "Super close to work for me  comfortable bed  didn't really have time to do anything more than sleep at Judy's."),
("2018-03-11", "23106836", "Liujeng", "Perfect location and nice room"),
("2018-03-16", "23106836", "Chris", "If you need a place to stay while working in Sydney's Macquarie Park area  then this place is perfect."),
("2018-04-05", "23106836", "James", "5th time I've stayed. Judy is always very wuick to respond and her easy check in process makes it very flexible when i sometimes have to check in late :)"),
("2018-04-13", "23106836", "James", "Enjoyed my stay again this week  thanks judy."),
("2018-04-21", "23106836", "Nicole", "Loved our stay at Judy's place! She gave great advice on where to visit and her home is beautiful! We are hoping to come back one day!"),
("2018-05-06", "23106836", "Kamaea", "Great location  close to train station. The shared bathrooms shower is really dodgey and needs to be fixed. Also there is abit of road noise in the back rooms. Other then that I enjoyed my stay"),
("2018-05-19", "23106836", "Arun", "Loved the privacy as well as the comfort at Judy’s place. Very neat and clean room work all amenities. Nicely maintained  lawns in the front and back. Not far from the local markets and Macquarie Park station."),
("2018-05-28", "23106836", "Mike", "WOW!  This is a gem of a place in the north of Sydney... super close to public transport - only 10mins to Chatswood CBD and about 20 to Sydney CBD by train.  Great house with all the amenities  plus some  you appreciate in hotels.  Loads of space and super clean.  The renovated bathroom was a nice touch and would have liked to utilise the outside area more had I stayed longer.  Highly recommended for anyone looking to stay in the area  or out of Sydney CBD with easy access to it."),
("2018-05-31", "23106836", "Duane", "Great spot to stay Clean tidy and great location to all services Enjoy D"),
("2018-06-07", "23106836", "Paul", "Nice house  nice and clean  very convenient to where I was working. lots of rooms sharing facilities  which wasn’t a problem for me but maybe depending on the guests staying."),
("2018-07-01", "23106836", "Nihar", "A private well furnished place best for professionals."),
("2018-07-07", "23106836", "Erin", "The host is very helpful with directions for getting to the city  and is very flexible with check in time."),
("2018-07-12", "23106836", "Adam", "The accommodation is close to where I was working  great bathroom and kitchen  laundry. Made life very easy for me."),
("2018-08-11", "23106836", "Leilani", "Very clean house with modern bathroom and kitchen appliances. I thoroughly enjoyed my stay. There is a pin code lock on the front door and each bedroom  and the kitchen cupboards / fridge space is colour coded to correspond to your room. I don’t think this is the hosts home but rather house with 4/5 rooms for private hire through AirBnB which suited me fine. There is a little dining area but no television/lounge room. About a 15/20 minute walk to Macquarie Centre. About a 10 minute walk to Macquarie Park station. I stayed for 2 weeks while working nearby. Would recommend."),
("2018-08-16", "23106836", "宇航", "非常完美的体验!住了一周时间 很周到专业 下次还去!"),
("2018-08-20", "23106836", "Bader", "Good place  I like the heater inside the room  also I like to self-check in "),
("2018-08-22", "23106836", "Abinaja", "Judy's place is very accurate to the listing. It was sparkling clean and the check-in process was so easy. Very nice location if you want to get away from the city a bit  but still very close to the train station. There are quite a few guests at the place  but they are not intrusive at all. Overall  would definitely recommend! "),
("2018-10-26", "23106836", "鸿菲", "房屋离公交站走一个路口 厨房可以简单煮个鸡蛋 很干净 可以洗衣烘干"),
("2018-11-24", "23106836", "Erik", "very responsive and hospital host. the place is well maintained. you won't regret the choice."),
("2018-12-01", "23106836", "Chiong Lim", "Good value accommodation at North ryde. Ample parking space and Suitable for business travellers"),
("2018-12-07", "23106836", "Katsunori", "Very clean."),
("2019-01-02", "23106836", "Sebastian", "Good place to stay and relax away from the city. The backyard is beautiful."),
("2019-01-10", "23106836", "Samuel", "If you need a place to stay near to Macquarie University  this is perfect. It’s only a short walk to the campus."),
("2018-02-10", "23206433", "Kenneth", "The host canceled this reservation 5 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-11-28", "23210058", "Brian", "Perfect in every way."),
("2018-12-05", "23210058", "Therese", "Booked on behalf of a colleague from Melbourne who found the apartment to be in a superb location and very clean. The Hosts were very welcoming and thankfully waited for my colleague and family to let them in after they had their flights cancelled. Highly recommended place."),
("2018-12-21", "23210058", "Andrea", "Perfect location for a beach holiday and lovely place to stay."),
("2018-02-15", "23219232", "Grace", "I had such a lovely stay at Jake's place. It was only a short visit but Jake was so accommodating throughout my stay. He was flexible with check in times and made sure he was home to let me in. The apartment is STUNNING. Light filled clean apartment by the water  short walk to see the harbour bridge along the bay. Very spacious room with large wardrobe  desk and fan (summer in Sydney!)  Kitchen has everything you need  very clean and stylish bathroom too. The street comes off Glebe point road so while very quiet and peaceful you are only a short walk from cafes  bars  transport options and supermarkets. Would definitely stay again and recommend to other airbnb users. Thank you Jake!!"),
("2018-03-11", "23219232", "Mitika", "Beautiful house!"),
("2018-03-19", "23219232", "Sophie", "Very very clean and lovely flat - would recommend to everyone"),
("2018-04-04", "23219232", "Cornelia", "It was such a pleasure staying with Jake! He is a wonderful host! The apartment is perfektly located and very clean. We felt like being at home."),
("2018-03-17", "23309295", "Joel", "Poor communication with the real estate agency next door that runs this AirBnb. I had cockroaches all through my room. Permanent residents felt like this was staying in commission housing flats and not a hotel as the name suggested."),
("2018-02-15", "23171144", "Jannette", "The apartment was great  exactly as advertised. Oriel was fantastic  everything was super easy. Highly recommend  11/10."),
("2018-02-17", "23171144", "Ebony", "Fantastic place to stay"),
("2018-02-22", "23171144", "Elodie", "Logement bien situe et Oriel est un garcon adorable et  tres serviables avec une gentillesse! Je vs conseille vivement"),
("2018-02-24", "23171144", "Shan", "Flexible check in time  really appreciate that Oriel let us leave our luggage in the apartment before the checkin time."),
("2018-03-05", "23171144", "Michael", "His place was clean and in a great location. Oriel responded quickly and thoroughly to questions."),
("2018-03-11", "23171144", "Gina", "Oriel was a great host  he responded within seconds to every message we sent  arranged extra blankets to be delivered in minutes and made check-in and check-out extremely stress free when we had such a busy schedule to work around.  The unit was clean and had everything we needed to accomodate us for our doTERRA Convention stay.  I will definitely contact Oriel if we require accommodation in Sydney again. There is a great little Italian Restaurant directly downstairs  along with a convenience store  and pub within 50 metres. Walk to George Street or Darling Harbour in minutes.  Ideal location.   thanks Oriel!"),
("2018-03-16", "23171144", "Nicole", "Oriel is a fabulous host. He was super friendly and responsive and met us at the apartment to show us around.The apartment itself is in a fabulous location with great views over to Darling Harbour and easy walk to nearby cafes and city shopping. It has a gym and pool.Compared to hotels around it’s an absolute bargain. There’s a hefty cleaning fee but assuming that stays the same no matter how long you stay. We only stayed one night so proportionally it was a lot but if you stayed over a longer period the per night rate would be less. Even so it was still very economically priced.It’s fully furnished but otherwise empty  and although not absolutely brand new it’s in great condition and clean and tidy. It’s just as described and in the photos."),
("2018-03-25", "23171144", "Cassandra", "Great central location  fabulous view. Very comfortable and great for multiple people."),
("2018-04-02", "23171144", "Jimena", "Muy buena ubicación! Oriel es muy atento  siempre a disposición  comunicación rápida.El departamento es muy cómodo y amplio."),
("2018-04-14", "23171144", "Carolyn", "Quick & easy check in with Oriel. No surprise as his communication dorting coming process was A+"),
("2018-04-16", "23171144", "Kirsty", "Great place to stay.. stones throw from the harbour... clean and tidy...responsive host"),
("2018-04-19", "23171144", "Jen", "Fantastic central location with good food/Cafes and an EzyMart close by  nice and roomy and with water views. Excellent communication by host and we were even able to leave our bags upon arrival  prior to checking in."),
("2018-04-22", "23171144", "Lisa", "Extremely clean and we had everything we needed at the property. The location was great and it was super easy to walk to main spots like Darling Harbour  George St and Pitt St shops. A fun and lively stay."),
("2018-04-25", "23171144", "Belinda", "Oriel was charming.I appreciated that he was able to give us an early check in as I was travelling with my daughter and 2 small grand babies.He helped us with our luggage as parking was a problem. I needed to offload our belongings then drive the car to a nearby Wilsons Car Park.This would have been very challenging without his help.Many thanks Oriel."),
("2018-04-28", "23171144", "Marion", "Great location with easy walk to many destinations.    Great views and lovely host with excellent friendly communication.   Definitely recommend"),
("2018-05-08", "23171144", "Yvonne", "Mi evaluación es excelente  La ubicación es estratégica  a pocos metros de la bahia de Darling y de la zona de negocios Pitt street . Llegas caminando a la Opera en minutos .las vistas del departamento impresionante  el departamento está muy bien equipado La cama matrimonial no era la mas cómoda en la que he dormido pero fue lo suficiente para tener muy buen descanso."),
("2018-05-21", "23171144", "George", "A fabulous apartment in the best spot. Thank you Oriel for being such a responsive host."),
("2018-06-03", "23171144", "Peter", "Oriel's place is centrally located within all the major city attractions.  It is a stones throw away to Darling Harbour and the busy Market St.  Oriel was very accommodating to a few of our requests and is lighting responsive.  I would highly recommend booking his apartment."),
("2018-06-07", "23171144", "Elliott", "Awesome host  very friendly and helpful. Highy recomend!"),
("2018-06-10", "23171144", "Lorraine", "Oriel was so helpful and always prompt with his responses. The building was very secure and the apartment was just as described. Lovely view of darling harbour and an even better short stroll to enjoy the great restaurants and bars there. Looking forward to coming back to Sydney and will definitely stay here again. Great little pizza/pasta place just next door with beautiful  friendly staff."),
("2018-06-14", "23171144", "Amanda", "Lovely apartment  great location  great value   spectacular view. We experienced a bit of a glitch with the booking but it wad remedied quickly and we were made to feel very welcome. Highly recommend the Caffe Amici downstairs (make sure you arrive hungry!)"),
("2018-06-16", "23171144", "Lisa", "We could not fault this property! Ideal location literally minutes from Darling Harbour  spotlessly clean and modern  prompt communication with the owner  straight forward check in  a beautiful outlook over the water to the Maritime Museum and plenty of space for our group booking of 4. 10 out of 10!"),
("2018-06-25", "23171144", "Erika", "Very convenient.  Close to all major attractions"),
("2018-06-28", "23171144", "Alice", "Lovely place  beautiful view of Darling Harbour. Perfect stay for a free days in Sydney."),
("2018-07-01", "23171144", "Ben", "Other than an issue with checkin on the day it was a great stay."),
("2018-07-05", "23171144", "Gail", "Oriel was so responsive and accommodating! Beautiful place and close to everything!"),
("2018-07-11", "23171144", "Kellie", "Fabulous location  so central to everything that piqued our interest. The apartment was spacious  well appointed and Oriel was great to deal with. Highly recommended."),
("2018-07-15", "23171144", "Keith", "Apartment was well located and within walking distance or close to public transport for everything we wanted to do. Unit was spacious  clean and tidy. We were 2 couples and the 2 bedroom/2bathrooms was ideal. Overall was perfect for what we were looking for  for a long weekend break."),
("2018-07-19", "23171144", "Uma", "Nice place to stay in Sydney  close to attractions."),
("2018-07-28", "23171144", "Christophe", "Perfect location in city centre"),
("2018-08-13", "23171144", "Evelyn", "Oriel was an easy host to deal with  check in and out was straight forward. The apartment is bright and spacious with a good views towards Darling Harbour. If you want to be close to Darling Harbour this place is perfect as its roughly a 5-10minute walk down the road depending on your speed. Its also central enough to walk to The Rocks  Circular Quay  Hyde Park  Sky Tower  and shops  all roughly 20mins and if you're coming home late or with bags of shopping the public transport costs are reasonable. There is traffic noise but not anything I wouldnt expect in such a central city location and the apartment is several stories up so the noise is not excessive.  Overall i wouldnt have any issue recommending the apartment to family/friends. "),
("2018-08-19", "23171144", "Clinton", "A fantastic host who made everything easy. Highly recommended."),
("2018-08-26", "23171144", "Kate", "Bigger than expected  this apartment provided the perfect stay for us in Sydney. Handy to everything  lovely outlook to the water and nice and tidy. Oriel responded quickly to any queries and provided a smooth check in/out process. Will be back!"),
("2018-09-02", "23171144", "Jennifer", "Perfect spot! Easy accessible location  close to Darling Harbour and cafes. It was very clean and had amazing views! Was a wonderful weekend!!! Thank you for letting us stay!"),
("2018-09-08", "23171144", "Brian", "Stunning location  very clean and tidy and excellent value for money"),
("2018-09-13", "23171144", "Donghoon", "the location was just fabulous. only 5 min walk to Barangaroo and heart of Sidney.Oriel was perfect host with warm heart.however smoke alarm was little bit sensitive. I was just cooking my steak with hoods on with high function but the alarm rang so easily. Otherwise his place was just perfect."),
("2018-09-16", "23171144", "Adam", "We had a great weekend here as an extended family. The oldest was 95 and the youngest 8 months  and everyone was comfortable. Our host organised a cot for our baby and access for the oldies was easy. There's a nice view of Darling Harbour from the lounge/balcony and it's just steps away from Barangaroo  ferries  restaurants  and the city of course."),
("2018-09-21", "23171144", "Trey", "Great location! Enjoyed our visit."),
("2018-09-30", "23171144", "Peter", "Greta location"),
("2018-10-04", "23171144", "Kirsten", "Everything you need in a great location. Oriel couldn’t have been more helpful."),
("2018-10-16", "23171144", "Nadine", "This is a great appartement for two couples. Close to everything. Great  quick responses by the host and easy check-in. Recommend without hesitation and would certainly love to stay again. Thank you  Oriel"),
("2018-10-18", "23171144", "Briana", "Great location!"),
("2018-10-22", "23171144", "Valerie And Jim", "We had a wonderful stay in the apartment.  Thank you Oriel for being so patient with us and our paddling group.  We would love to come back again and when next in Sydney will definitely try to book with you again."),
("2018-10-27", "23171144", "Gilda", "Great place to stay as well as a great location.  Highly recommend it!!!"),
("2018-10-31", "23171144", "Winnie", "The apartment is clean and comfortable  and the host is quick in responding and very helpful"),
("2018-11-05", "23171144", "Jen", "Place is perfectly situated close to everything  building has good  secure set up and the pool was a hit with the kids. Oriel’s communication is excellent and he is very accommodating and provided us with some useful tips- we would definitely use this apartment on a return trip"),
("2018-11-13", "23171144", "Colleen", "Great location and view. Oriel was fantastic at communication."),
("2018-11-14", "23171144", "Jack", "Oriel’s place is just as expected  and had everything you could need for a night away!"),
("2018-11-16", "23171144", "Nancy", "Oriel’s place was great! Big place had plenty of room for all five of us. Very comfortable.! Wonderful location - easy walk everywhere. Great communication with Oriel too! Had a wonderful vacation :)"),
("2018-11-18", "23171144", "Rhys", "Excellent location."),
("2018-11-21", "23171144", "Elliott", "Great location (easy walk to just about everything)  very accommodating hospitality by Oriel  however the apartment might be a bit tight for 5 people so I would recommend either 4 or less to stay there.  The view from the balcony was very cool as well!  Overall great experience."),
("2018-11-22", "23171144", "Monica", "Great location  tidy and clean modern apartment  very easy access to Darling Harbour area and the inner city. Treat yourselves to lunch at Machiavelli in Clarence street  a three minute walk. Having two separate bathrooms was bonus and view of the harbour from the bedrooms and the living room was lovely. Oriel was excellent with his communication and his check in instructions and the three of us really enjoyed our stay. Thank you!"),
("2018-11-24", "23171144", "Shirley", "A great location in the Sydney CBD  particularly to access Darling Harbour and Harbour Cruises. Comfortable apartment for 4 guests."),
("2018-11-26", "23171144", "Paul", "Great location  spacious and excellent communication by Oriel"),
("2018-11-28", "23171144", "Ye", "Great Location!Oriel is very nice and helpful  the apartment is very clean and comfort and the view was amazing:)"),
("2018-12-01", "23171144", "Cascie", "Oriel is a very helpful host who is always willing to come to your aid should you need it."),
("2018-12-06", "23171144", "Julie", "GREAT LOCATION!  Easy walking to downtown attractions/ restaurants  etc. Large space  well appointed. I recommend it without hesitation."),
("2018-12-07", "23171144", "Gerry", "Perfect location close to Darling Harbour and an easy walk to Circular Quey and Chinatown. The apartment is spacious and has everything needed for a trip to Sydney. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-12-20", "23171144", "Narelle", "Oriel is a  wonderful host. He was quick  clear and warm in all his communication.  The apartment is very well equipped and in an absolutely fantastic location within a safe  clean and modern building. Being a frequently used property it is showing some signs of wear but I wouldn't hesitate to book in here again."),
("2018-12-25", "23171144", "Adam", "We really enjoyed our time in Sydney. The accommodation was ideally located and exactly as described. We found the accommodation no problem with a 20 minute ride from the airport. An easy 15 minutes walk to the ferry terminal and The Rocks. Thanks again Oriel!"),
("2018-12-29", "23171144", "Madison", "Fantastic apartment in a great location. Some lovely little touches through out the apartment made us very at home. Will definitely keep this apartment in mind when visiting Sydney again. Thanks Oriel."),
("2019-01-04", "23171144", "Sidney", "Oriel was extremely easy to communicate and accommodated our late check in  extremely clean and location was in walking distance to everything! Would definitely stay here again"),
("2019-01-07", "23171144", "Alex", "Really friendly helpful host  great location  good service."),
("2019-01-10", "23171144", "Blaise", "Spacious  modern apartment in a fantastic location. Wonderful views of the harbour. Communication was excellent. Highly recommended!"),
("2019-01-15", "23171144", "Fernanda", "Muy lindo departamento y muy bien ubicado. El anfitrión siempre estuvo a nuestra disposición."),
("2019-01-17", "23171144", "Kari", "Clean apartment with a nice view. Public transportation was easy to find and good restaurants nearby."),
("2019-01-22", "23171144", "Penny", "A good few days once we arrived although we dealt with Chen and the phone number on the listing does not relate. A bit dated but provided everything described. My husband was getting spiked by the couch in the living area but just had to be careful. It is in walking distance to the Wharfs and the city bus tour bus stop is close by with tickets being purchased on the wharf"),
("2019-01-27", "23171144", "Hunter", "Great position great host we will definitely return to this apartment"),
("2019-01-30", "23171144", "Katrina", "Oriel’s spacious apartment is in a terrific location  just a short walk to Darling Harbour restaurants  harbour tours and water taxis. Plenty of shopping close by at King and George and we found the distance to the Circular Quay area (Sydney Opera House  The Rocks  Botanical Gardens  Sydney Bridge) very walkable. The apartment kitchen had all the amenities we needed and more! I’d recommend Oriel’s place as a great base for touring Sydney. He was very kind to allow us to store our luggage before check-in  which was a huge help. This was our first visit to Sydney  we would definitely come back. :)"),
("2019-02-04", "23171144", "Gary", "A great position very central  to transport markets Circular Quay and Darling Harbour."),
("2019-02-06", "23171144", "수정", "신속한 피드백과 위치가 좋아서 여행하기 편했어요"),
("2019-02-09", "23171144", "Lynne", "Great location amenities to share for travelling couples 2 bedroom and bath"),
("2019-02-14", "23171144", "Ajit", "This place is great location wise and is within walking distance of Sydney’s most popular attractions of Darling Harbour."),
("2019-02-18", "23171144", "Kelsi", "We really enjoyed our stay at Oriel's  it had everything we needed.The location was great  nice and central and close to public transport. Made for a great place to base ourselves  for our first time in Sydney."),
("2019-02-21", "23171144", "Jill", "Grateful to the cleaners allowing us to leave our luggage in the room before check in. Apartment in excellent location. Departure delayed as the fire alarm went off and we had to evacuate the building. Not a huge problem for us and better to be safe than sorry but it's a long walk down."),
("2019-02-24", "23171144", "Melissa", "Great location and great communication!!"),
("2019-03-04", "23171144", "Patti", "This two bedroom apt. Has a nice partial view of water and boats. However  it only sleeps four adults comfortably unless you can sleep in a children’s metal cot with a thin foam pad  both of which were broken when we got there. It took several   texts  frustration and waiting  but we did get a functional cot that night. Having only two nights in Sydney  we didn’t need the aggravation. Also  we were really grossed out by the black mold in the bathroom shower grout lines."),
("2019-03-06", "23171144", "Ian", "Lovely apartment in the heart of the city with view towards Darling Harbour  well presented and clean"),
("2018-02-19", "23222456", "Thilini", "great location & place we extended our stay of initial 1 night to 6 more nights & then another night again! :) Donna was helpful and we had some common interests that she handed us her classic recipes  etc from her café for ours. all good luck with ur new ventures! :)"),
("2018-02-24", "23222456", "Bin", "It is a perfect choice. Very different experience. Not far from the city center. Quiet and clean. Donna is very nice to help us to find the train station. Love this place  expecting more chance to live there."),
("2018-02-28", "23222456", "Ayman", "Awesome!"),
("2018-03-05", "23222456", "Marimal", "The host as well as the house was lovely!  Tiny house full of restored furniture  the vintage vibe was soo nice! Just perfect! Had a lovely chat with the host even though we stayed there for a short time. Took us all together 1h with the train and by feet to get to the opera house. Would definitely go again!"),
("2018-03-13", "23222456", "Hany", "A very trendy place with all the amenities readily available. Sutherland station is just a seven minute walk which was ideal for my daily commute to the city during my stay. Donna was lovely to deal with and looked after us for the duration of our stay."),
("2018-03-15", "23222456", "Sundhari", "This is a lovely value for money.Really cozy place to stay at"),
("2018-03-15", "23222456", "Byron", "Beautiful place and a wonderful host - a home away from home. I've already booked my next stay and now consider myself a regular!"),
("2018-03-16", "23222456", "Ian", "Donna and Matt are very gracious and accommodating hosts. They are good communicators and take great pride in maintaining the integrity of their heritage cottage."),
("2018-03-18", "23222456", "Phillip", "Donna is a very welcoming host and also very friendly. She was helpful all through my stay and very polite. The location of the place is far out of Sydney central but very close to the train so very easy to get there and back from most places in Sydney! The price of this place is very cheap and well worth it! I highly recommend this place!"),
("2018-03-24", "23222456", "Katrijn", "Donna's house is really cute! Nice beds and very hospitable. Thanks for the great stay!"),
("2018-03-30", "23222456", "Jonathan", "It was just a bed for the night for me and was perfect for that. Great value."),
("2018-04-02", "23222456", "维中", "安静舒适 性价比高 适合入住｡"),
("2018-04-08", "23222456", "Michelle", "Very poor condition  it is too old to stay . It is uncomfortable to use the bathroom at all . There r lots of messy stuff to put in the limited space . It was the bad experience to stay . And it is with long distance from railway station. There are too many rules and restrictions in this house . Bad feeling. The couple could not be able to enjoy nice sleeping because the bed made the much  noise ."),
("2018-04-10", "23222456", "Amanda", "A very original old house with everything you need. Donna  very easy going and a great help. Nothing too much trouble would stay there again. Thanks Donna"),
("2018-04-27", "23222456", "Byron", "Donna is a super host  helpful  friendly and the communication is fantastic! The house is a work of art  the room beautifully decorated and the bed very comfortable. I’ve stayed before and will definitely stay again - a home away from home. A++"),
("2018-05-01", "23222456", "Byron", "Great as always! A++"),
("2018-05-25", "23222456", "Peter Pam", "Recommended as great value  convenient location and an interesting house."),
("2018-05-31", "23222456", "Erika", "There is a car space front of accommodation  but it was very hard to find in the dark at night time."),
("2018-06-02", "23222456", "Cassie", "Donna’s place was lovely and cosy. She accommodated us by moving the beds together and made us feel welcome. Donna has some amazing art in her house and lovely rustic furniture. We enjoyed our stay. Peace!"),
("2018-06-05", "23222456", "Byron", "Great as always 10/10"),
("2018-07-04", "23222456", "Mark", "房东是一个艺术家 我们交流的很开心｡"),
("2018-08-13", "23222456", "Toomas", "Great place. Fantastic host"),
("2018-08-15", "23222456", "Alan", "What you see is basically what you get.  It is comfortable historic but not luxurious (heritage listing prevents that).  Donna was very hospitable and I had a welcoming cup of tea soon after arrival.  I would happily stay with her again."),
("2018-09-09", "23222456", "Alex", "Donna was a lovely host and the cottage is so beautiful. Thank you for your hospitality!"),
("2018-09-11", "23222456", "Oliver", "Didn't stay for long  but it's a nice place and Donna was lovely."),
("2018-10-01", "23222456", "Sofia", "Nice linens and confy beds."),
("2018-10-07", "23222456", "Lisa", "Charming place with a charming host. We enjoyed meeting Donna and some of her family  and staying in her delightful chique cottage."),
("2018-10-12", "23222456", "Ma", "A very comfortable stay.location r easy to find. Thanks for ur hospitality"),
("2018-10-14", "23222456", "Steven", "Very enjoyable stay! Nice and cosy house. Donna and Matt are very friendly and hospitable."),
("2018-10-18", "23222456", "Larissa", "Sehr schön und empfehlenswert:)"),
("2018-10-25", "23222456", "Steven", "My second stay in a short time with Donna and Matt and again had a great time. They're very nice and interesting people  and the house is cosy. Close to Sutherland station and the shops  restaurants etc.."),
("2018-11-10", "23222456", "Patricia", "A lovely character cottage with soul. Look forward to a return visit.Host very accommodating and a warm welcome."),
("2018-11-16", "23222456", "Colin", "Lovely cottage and amazingly lovely host. Would definitely stay there again. Thanks very much."),
("2018-11-18", "23222456", "Jalal", "Excellent host and a lovely place to stay as always. Highly recommended"),
("2018-11-24", "23222456", "Andrea", "Donna was super communicative and made the whole process very smooth  even though she was busy all evening."),
("2018-12-31", "23222456", "Lesley", "Nice leafy suburban location with excellent train links to the city.  Nice host but only 1 tiny bathroom to share which was located at the other end of the house from the bedroom."),
("2019-01-10", "23222456", "Rosalie", "The location was great for us as it is easy walking distance to Sutherland shops and station. It is easy to find and there is adequate parking. The price is fine for what you get. The house is quaint but rather cramped for space especially with full furniture and a tiny bathroom/laundry used by the hosts and sharing guests."),
("2019-01-23", "23222456", "EddieJanet", "the accommodation was great. and the hosts were very friendly. hospitality was awesome."),
("2019-02-10", "23222456", "Rosemary", "loved the historical value of the cottage"),
("2018-02-23", "23312848", "Janine", "Richard is an extremely nice and cool dude who welcomed to his home. The pool was absolutely splendid and the house!. His house is just up the road from the beach which is very convenient and the neighbourhood is quiet."),
("2018-03-01", "23312848", "Claude", "Beautiful place in a beautiful part of the northern beaches. Richard went out of his way to assist with everything."),
("2018-03-12", "23312848", "Vanessa", "Great location and great house! Richard was a very relaxed host and made us feel at home. We had use of the pool which made our stay even more special. Would definitely recommend."),
("2018-03-19", "23312848", "Matthew", "WOW! Where do I begin!? This was without a doubt the most amazing Airbnb experience I have ever had. Richard responded to my initial inquiry within minutes and answered every question I had right away. I proceeded with the booking. The key was waiting for me on arrival (early) and I opened the door to one of the most beautiful homes I have ever stepped foot in. Panoramic views of curl curl beach from the front of the house and an incredibly beautiful pool with waterfalls in the backyard. Gorgeous hardwood floors  brand new appliances  incredibly comfortable beds  washer and dryer  flat screen TV and a beautiful grass area to do some morning exercises after a fun surf. Clean linens and blankets awaited and a very comfortable living room couch for late night movies. That’s just where it begins. Richard went way above and beyond to make me feel welcome in to his home and ensure that I was having a great stay. We were fortunate enough to have a fun swell fill in overnight and Rich didn’t hesitate to let me use one of his brand new boards so I could go out the next morning. The weather got incredibly hot on Sunday and rich again went out of his way to bring me his own fan/cooler and even cooked me a gourmet burger! As if he wasn’t already kind enough  he continued to go out of his way with kindness and great vibes the whole stay. I have to say  I am forever grateful for this experience! I don’t write many reviews  but something has to be said about the kindness and professionalism. I felt like I was in my own home! The house is a 2 minute walk from the beautiful North Curl Curl white sand beach. If you are lucky enough to find this Airbnb available  do NOT hesitate to book immediately. You will be very thankful you did. 10 stars on every single category. I will be booking this place again as soon as I am back in the area. Richard  THANK YOU so much for making my stay as memorable as you did. You guys are some of the coolest  kindest and most genuine people out there. See you soon!Cheers!-Matt"),
("2018-03-31", "23312848", "Brendon", "Great spot in amazing house !"),
("2018-06-15", "23312848", "Alex", "Great location in North Curl Curl. Very nice apartment. Communication with Richard was easy - super fast responses. Place was immaculate on arrival and really is just up the road from the beach. Great spot to jump in your wetsuit and walk down for a surf. Plenty of space in the apartment  facilities and kitchen are modern  great bathroom/shower  a garage to leave surfboards in out of the way and a big Smart TV and comfy sofa to enjoy Netflix on in the evening. Parking right outside. A superb place on the Northern Beaches to relax and a host who ensures you have a great stay with tips and help. Hopefully  I'll come back again in summer to enjoy the pool and BBQ! Thanks again  Richard. Alex"),
("2018-10-09", "23312848", "Andrea", "Richard is a gracious host and the place presented as pictured  but not as expected.The queen size sofa bed referenced was not a sofa bed  was sub-standard and did not provide an adequate sleeping facilty. The additional bedding supplied for the sofa bed consisted of a sheet and quilt cover  without a quilt or blankets. The advert was misleading. There was only one  proper bed  not two queen size as stated.What would've made our stay more positive  apart from adequate bedding  would be the inclusion of a few  simple additions  such as:* a full dinner and cutlery set.* an assortment and approriate number of glasses  including wine glasses.*  the supply of basic condiments  eg salt  pepper  sugar  oil  milk (for upon arrival)  an assortment of tea bags  glad wrap  foil etc.* a few serving platters and utensils.* a supply of toilet paper.* a secured premises. It was concerning that we discovered on a regular occurance  the front door left unlocked  even though we  ensured we locked it. This gave us concern for our property security and personal safety. The outdoor entertainment area was lovely and enjoyable. We didn't get to use the pool due to inclimate weather  but it looked inviting.Location was great and close to the beach and public transport.We would stay again  providing the inclusion of a proper sofa bed and bedding  and improved security."),
("2018-10-21", "23312848", "Maria", "We had a great time in North Curl Curl and loved staying at Richards place. We had everything we needed. Coffee  tea and little treats when we arrived. Amazing. Communication was really quick and efficient. Not used to having a shared entry with the host  but that was not a problem at all. We had all the privacy we needed. The beach is really close and the view is amazing."),
("2018-10-28", "23312848", "Jen", "So nice to have a home to go to! We settled straight in. Thanks for having us Richard!"),
("2018-11-12", "23312848", "Stephen", "A beautiful house in a quiet upmarket location. Nice touches from Richard with some groceries and toothbrushes. We found it convenient for access to Manly and the ferry terminal. I recommend getting the App Ride plus who for $3.10 per person will pick you up from the door to any location in the catchment area. You can book a time slot in advance  Monday to Friday only up to 9.30 pm. Otherwise a frequent bus service just down the road number136. Parking in Manly car parks is free for 2 hours but expensive thereafter. So best to leave the car behind if going into Sydney CBD. North Curl Curl beach is just down the road. Distant views of Sydney from the front of the house."),
("2019-01-02", "23312848", "Andrijana", "The appartement is very beautiful and has a lot of space. We had a great time at Richards home. Our daughter enjoyed the pool  and we loved to have our breakfast outside. Thank you Richard for your hospitility!!"),
("2019-02-12", "23312848", "Robert", "Richard was a great host and we had a great time staying at his place. The house is a quick walk to the beach and has an amazing viewpoint over the water!"),
("2019-02-19", "23312848", "Mari", "We had a great stay  the location is amazing.Watch the sunrise over the ocean just a short walk from the house. Very spacious living room  great to have the outside area too."),
("2018-04-14", "23364269", "Sarka", "It was a nice apartment to stay in and it is worth the price. The only problem in the area is parking  as it is challenging to find a free spot- since we owned a car. There are also planes flying over the complexes  therefore there will be some noise  but not often- it wasn’t as noticeable for us. Otherwise it was a nice stay with all appliances and necessities provided- also Hafid was fast to respond to our messages. Recommend."),
("2019-01-01", "23364269", "Teba", "great"),
("2018-02-28", "23402460", "Jonatan", "The rooms were fine but the bathroom and kitchen are very dirty and outdated."),
("2018-02-28", "23398484", "Chris", "Frances and Bruno are two very lovely hosts! Their house is a gem in an amazing suburb and the room is clean  big and airy! They respect your privacy but are always up for a chat if you feel like it. I really enjoyed their company and hospitality. And they will do all they can to make your stay the best it can be! In Short: Their Airbnb is the place to go if you’re in Sydney!"),
("2018-03-04", "23398484", "Rachel", "Frances and Bruno were fabulous hosts. Extremely friendly  kind and accommodating and I definitely plan on staying here again. I enjoyed their lovely character home. The area is also great with some very good places to eat and drink nearby. I found it walkable to a lot of places including the CBD (but I do enjoy walking). However  Frances was very helpful with public transport information had I needed it."),
("2018-03-16", "23398484", "Melina", "Frances is an exceptional host  she takes great care of her guest  make sure everything is going well and enjoy conversation. She is always helpful if you needed anything. Her house is beautiful with a wonderful garden  very cosy  clean and close to the city (20 min walking distance to Hyde Park) in a  very nice neighborhood with restaurants  galleries and shops. It is a very good spirit house. I felt very comfortable and I am very thankful!a"),
("2018-03-24", "23398484", "Gavin", "Amazing people! Arrived here fresh off the plane from the U.K  didn’t know anyone or anything about Sydney .... Frances and Bruno went above and beyond helping out and treated me like family. Would recommend to anybody looking for a super friendly place to stay in!"),
("2018-03-29", "23398484", "Sabine", "It was truely wonderful to stay at Frances&Brunos. The house is really beautiful and they put a big effort in being the perfect hosts. Would recommend it anytime for a stay in Sydney."),
("2018-04-02", "23398484", "Jason", "Very nice and sweet people and very helpful. Great location and nice and quiet. Had a cute dog."),
("2018-04-02", "23398484", "Jason", "Iit wha the best place so far on my  average"),
("2018-04-09", "23398484", "Chung Yan", "There is nothing bad about the place. It is located within walkable distance to the central  with lot of restaurants and cafe nearby  quiet and safe neighbourhood. Also  Bruno and Francis are very helpful on everything like the transport  sightseeing  events in Sydney etc... Especially  I would like to thank for their help on the little excitement I made in the night and last day morning. Definitely  I will stay at their place again :)"),
("2018-04-13", "23398484", "Michaela", "It has been my best Airbnb experience ever! Frances and Bruno were so kind and mindful towards me and I really appreciated it to stay at their light fludded house during my time in Sydney!"),
("2018-04-24", "23398484", "Juan", "Frances and Bruno were great host  they worried about all the details and they even prepare a welcome dinner for me. A wonderful detail! The house  is located some blocks from the central station  there are many restaurants and a supermarket near the house. It is easy to go to the most important places by bus. I enjoyed the experience a lot  thank you very much!"),
("2018-04-29", "23398484", "Wall", "It was like my mom's house."),
("2018-05-07", "23398484", "Rob", "Frances and Bruno went out of their way to make my stay as comfortable as possible. I was made to feel part of the family  and extended my stay twice as it was such a great home to stay in. The home is lovely  in a great location and the service they provide is amazing value for money. I'd definitely recommend to anyone looking for somewhere to stay!"),
("2018-05-24", "23398484", "Annie", "if this place is available -grab it. Francis is a very welcoming host  the location is great   the bed is very comfortable - it's all all you could want in a place to stay. Lovely experience."),
("2018-06-03", "23398484", "Ben", "X"),
("2018-06-24", "23398484", "Rachel", "This is a return visit staying with Frances and Bruno. They are absolutely wonderful hosts in every way. Super considerate and lovely  excellent location  very comfy bed in a lovely clean space and prompt and easy communication. I highly recommend them and will definitely stay here again if I get the opportunity."),
("2019-01-03", "23398484", "Yulia", "It's an amazing place to stay. Frances and Bruno are the best hosts  very genuine people - they gave a lot of tips and made sure that I feel comfortable in all respects. A special thanks for breakfast - simple but delicious. Location is very convenient. I also liked the whole house and the garden - very authentic and clean. A little dog Stephie is adorable and was (unfortunately) almost invisible. Zero disruption."),
("2018-03-13", "23428550", "Wei-Fan", "房子整理的很整齊但是不知道為什麼很多蟑螂.....如果你不討厭蟑螂的話可以參考ˊㄜㄗ"),
("2018-03-15", "23428550", "Nilesh", "The location is close to airport(15 mins in car) and 20 min bus to Central Station  so not too bad  value for money. we noticed some bugs and notified Felix to take care of it in future. Also notified of noise making fans (there is no A/C). The bus stop to Central station is just outside apt  so convenient. The Woolworths is also close by  that was helpful to us as well. Not too fancy a place  but good value for money (except for the bugs and dust) for a night or two."),
("2018-03-25", "23428550", "Firouz", "Pretty good house walking distant  to everything"),
("2018-03-30", "23428550", "Aline", "The unit is very comfortable and it seems it has just been renovated. The location is good and also there's a car space to park. The shower is very good and the beds are comfortable."),
("2018-05-09", "23428550", "Christine", "Great location to get to the city and airport"),
("2018-05-16", "23428550", "Dasha", "Great value for money  at a convenient location between the airport and the city. The apartments is clean and recently renovated  it is still missing some homely touches but has everything you need and it was perfect for us to spend the night at before our long haul flight. Small shopping centre with Woolworth and Aldi nearby  and a nice park for kids too which was handy."),
("2018-05-18", "23428550", "Jacob", "Felix’s place was great and family friendly!"),
("2018-05-20", "23428550", "Lotte", "Awesome"),
("2018-05-30", "23428550", "Noor Adilah", "Great location nearby shopping centre. Clean with basic amenities."),
("2018-06-03", "23428550", "Youhwan", "clean  cheap  good house"),
("2018-06-06", "23428550", "Sachi", "Cozy accommodation;)Simple!"),
("2018-06-10", "23428550", "Ryan", "Outstanding location. So close to the airport and close to the city!  It was exactly what we needed for the night. Felix was great to deal with and had great and easy check in instructions."),
("2018-06-11", "23428550", "Tae Ho", "Felix's place was cozy and located close to city. Will return again!"),
("2018-06-12", "23428550", "硕", "性价比很高的住宿 周边道路都可以免费停车 设备齐全 主人很善于沟通 位置比较好找｡没有看到蟑螂｡适合自驾旅行｡"),
("2018-06-17", "23428550", "Abuhanifah", "Excellent place to stay to visit Sydney and feel local."),
("2018-06-23", "23428550", "Najib", "Great host and very helpful. Accomodation very clean and complete. Good place and affordable place to visit"),
("2018-06-25", "23428550", "Nan", "Great place and well recommended."),
("2018-06-30", "23428550", "Nicky", "Great value for money and the location was within walking distance of everything you need"),
("2018-07-05", "23428550", "Karthik", "one time place. except few hot water problems"),
("2018-07-08", "23428550", "Colin", "Good location  hard building to identify and once there difficult to locate front door."),
("2018-07-10", "23428550", "Gerard", "This is a well located place with a host who responds quickly and is very helpful. It is clean and spacious with pretty much everything you'd need. Very good value."),
("2018-07-14", "23428550", "Michael", "Despite some cleanliness issues (dirty stove  bathroom floor needing a clean) myself and the rest of my group had a peaceful stay. There was no noise from the neighbouring apartments and we heard no aircraft noise from our arrival (around 7pm) to our departure the next day (8.30am). We stayed on a Saturday night.Felix was very prompt in his communication before and during our stay which was appreciated. He sent a text message to check that we were able to check in okay. Felix has detailed instructions including photos on how to find his apartment. I followed them step by step and it was not too difficult to find. When I reported that there were only 2 towels (we were a group of 4) he came over immediately after work to deliver more towels  hanging the bag on the outside door handle so as not to disturb our stay.I was amused that the bottom 2 thirds of the second bedroom window actually looks INTO someone's garage. The kitchen would benefit from more cutlery - there were no teaspoons to make tea/coffee nor enough cutlery for everyone (4 of us) to eat at the same time.I couldn't find street parking but since I have a smallish car (Astra sedan) I was able to use his garage which is not suitable for medium or large cars (FYI) as it is much narrower than a normal garage. My suggestion is to reverse in as one wall is pretty much just a thin layer of flexible tin and you can squeeze out of your car that way. "),
("2018-07-19", "23428550", "Mohan", "Felix is very quick to respond to questions!Unit is close to local shops  walkable distance!Very close to public transport!Loved the mini courtyard in the front!"),
("2018-07-19", "23428550", "华", "Felix's apartment is convenient for (Website hidden by Airbnb) clean and sanitary.Very good."),
("2018-08-02", "23428550", "(Email hidden by Airbnb)", "Convient acomodation"),
("2018-08-04", "23428550", "Sachin", "Nice Stay"),
("2018-08-06", "23428550", "Sarah", "It was a perfect appartment in Sydney !"),
("2018-08-10", "23428550", "Iain", "Was great Felix very quick with responding and place was all freshly renovated.."),
("2018-08-12", "23428550", "Hyeyoung", "Gooood"),
("2018-08-15", "23428550", "Henry", "Very good  feel convenient and comfortable "),
("2018-08-17", "23428550", "Ray", "."),
("2018-08-29", "23428550", "Steve", "So close to shopping centre / cheap eats and bus route. Clean; secure and would stay again. Thanks for the hospitality."),
("2018-09-06", "23428550", "Ricca", "Not very clean. not the best position. But cheap."),
("2018-09-08", "23428550", "Joe  Wai Shan", "We spent two nights with everything needed in the property. Place is clean no bad smell. We are fine with individual beds  sufficient cookware with salt and pepper seasoning. Wifi worked consistently but no fast at all. Needed to sweep the toilet floor after shower as shower water leaking out on the floor it's slippery. Close to supermarket. Nice neighborhood for help."),
("2018-09-17", "23428550", "Ash", "The host canceled this reservation 10 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-09-19", "23428550", "Li Shin", "Convenient location where nearby to the grocery store. Suitable for those that prefer to have light cook during the stay."),
("2018-02-21", "23357535", "Cristiana", "Really nice position and Really clean"),
("2018-02-26", "23357535", "Craig", "aprtment was great good size living and (Website hidden by Airbnb) was fantastic right in the middle of the city"),
("2018-03-01", "23357535", "Andrew", "Johannes please use my note to you I thought that was the public review and my phone is about to go flatThxAndy"),
("2018-03-03", "23357535", "Andy", "Awesome location. Brilliant BIG BED. Spacious apartment"),
("2018-03-17", "23357535", "Gillian", "Great apartment in the CBD area. Location was great for us as we were doing local sightseeing  ferry's from circular key and buses from martinplace. Small IGA supermarket in Martin place as well. Some nice local eating places around as well. Everything was few mins walk for us maximum so perfect place to stay if you are doing local touring in Sydney area.Key collection great instructions  no problems with getting in and apartment was clean and cool."),
("2018-03-25", "23357535", "Corinne", "Johannes was a pleasure to communicate with. I booked on behalf of a colleague who had an excellent stay."),
("2018-04-01", "23357535", "Sam", "Good-sized apartment in the centre of the business district. Good communication for check-in and check-out. Rooftop pool & terrace is a nice touch but gym is tiny and desperately needs repairs. 10 mins to Rocks / Opera House / Darling Harbour / Barangaroo."),
("2018-04-13", "23357535", "Maor", "Clean and organized"),
("2018-05-28", "23357535", "Mark", "Great location...that’s it...very noisy from external sources  bins emptied at 2am  and the nightly bottle smash around 3 am. Building work opposite starts at 6 am every day including Saturday. Appliances are dated  drier didn’t work for 4 weeks  oven very noisy  smoke alarm super sensitive  hot water scalding  shower head suitable for under 5 footers  shower grout mouldy  lights very dark  the vertical blinds don’t keep out much light at night from the offices opposite. Lifts clunky...got stuck in one on first day there.Gym equipment is either broken and very rusty..pool surface paint is peeling  and the pool area gets sun for approx 15 minutes a day if you chase across the sun bedsUnless location is the ultimate for you  I would look elsewhere for a more modern and better kept apartment for the money. Doesn’t really offer good value."),
("2018-05-30", "23357535", "Nicole", "Johannes is a great host and was super easy to get in contact with.  The apartment is very conveniently located by Martin Place and provided us with a good base in Sydney for a few days.  The space is a reasonable size for inner city Sydney  and the king bed was a huge plus.  I would definitely stay here again in future."),
("2018-06-04", "23357535", "Kah Weng", "What a great one-bed room apartment right in the middle of the CBD!! Full amenities  clean and really stylish. thoroughly enjoyed my stay! Johannes is very responsible and responsive. Excellent stay  highly recommended. "),
("2018-06-06", "23357535", "Gabby", "The place was great and right in center city so walkable to many main areas!"),
("2018-06-14", "23357535", "Robert", "Great one bedroom apartment. I cooked a couple of nights and kitchen facilities were fine. Check in worked fine. Location is great. Johannes let me know he was available if required  which he wasn't. "),
("2018-06-19", "23357535", "Frank", "JOHANNES was great and quick to respond. Great 1 Bedroom apartment with pool  spa and gym! Great space in an awesome location. "),
("2018-06-25", "23357535", "Merle", "This was a very well-equipped apartment with an awesome location."),
("2018-06-29", "23357535", "Kathryn", "Great  central location in the Sydney CBD. Very close to Martin Place railway station  and a wonderful IGA supermarket allowing for self-catering.  The apartment is a good size  and nice to have a small balcony with furniture when the weather is warmer. The bedroom is spacious with a large king bed and mirrored wardrobes. The kitchen is a good size and has everything to knock up a meal. If staying longer  having the cupboard laundry is a huge bonus. We will return when staying in Sydney again. Highly recommended. Johannes was good to communicate with  and arrival and departure was simple."),
("2018-07-06", "23357535", "Katherine", "Johannes’ place is great!  Wonderful location within walking distance of at least three train stations and the harbor.  Delicious king sized bed and excellent kitchen amenities.  Johannes is very responsive and helpful."),
("2018-07-14", "23357535", "Graeme", "This apartment was exactly as described in that it is central to everything in Sydney CBD. Pros - location  location  location. Easy to get anywhere in Sydney CBD. Handy super market just a few minutes walk in Pitt street. Great communication with Johannes.Cons - Lots of construction work right outside the balcony. Cleaners hadn't done a great job prior to our visit [I have made Johannes aware of this] . Tumble dryer not working properly so hard to dry towels and tea towels. Johannes arranged additional towels for us.So if you intend to spend your days out exploring Sydney and just need a central location with a great bed  this is the place. "),
("2018-07-18", "23357535", "Chanette", "Very nice  clean and spacious apartment in a great location. Check-in was a bit difficult because I never received the instructions (not sure if it was the Airbnb app or what) and Johannes was unfortunately out of reach. But after a few hours we finally managed to get it. There was no light in the bathroom when we arrived (not sure how the cleaner managed to clean without any light) so we had to change the light bulb ourselves.Besides that the stay was very nice and the apartment is lovely."),
("2018-07-23", "23357535", "Gareth", "Excellent location  with great communication from the host and a very easy self check in process. Bed was comfortable  and apartment was warm and nicely decorated. Shower pressure is excellent  but hot/cold taps can be a little tricky to balance for shower temperature. Very good value  highly recommend."),
("2018-07-31", "23357535", "Wynand", "Great location  loved the self checkin and great response from host."),
("2018-09-26", "23357535", "Scott", "It's a very nice apartment. It's in the CBD  so it can be a bit noisy  especially as there's construction on the building over. The host is very timely with communication and actually went above & beyond to help me."),
("2018-09-30", "23357535", "Alessandra", "N"),
("2018-10-27", "23357535", "Melody", "Central location - perfect. Spacious and clean. Entry info well detailed. Welcome manual very useful. Host is easy to communicate with. Perfect for a weekend getaway."),
("2018-11-16", "23357535", "Jocelyn", "Great central location with plenty of amenities and a helpful host."),
("2018-11-17", "23357535", "Panashe", "great place  great location  no issues."),
("2018-11-23", "23357535", "Roslyn", "You will not regret staying here beautiful & airy apartment    convent   clean   peaceful  comfortable fully recommend this place to all . Johannes was wonderful  to work with as well very helpful"),
("2018-12-06", "23357535", "Ryan", "Had a great experience staying in this apartment.  I was in Sydney for work and stayed here for two weeks.    Full kitchen  washer and dryer  good bed  great location in CBD!"),
("2018-12-10", "23357535", "Vanessa", "Super close to everything and elegant chic apartment."),
("2018-12-21", "23357535", "Allen", "Wonderful place. Great location Highly recommend"),
("2018-12-28", "23357535", "Laura", "Great apartment  just in the middle of everything! Really close to the main attractions of the cityThe kitchen is very good equipped and the bed is huge and comfortable! The communication with Johannes was perfect  really fast and niceHighly recomendable!!"),
("2019-01-20", "23357535", "Lynne", "Nice place Good location"),
("2019-01-26", "23357535", "Emilia", "Fantastic location. Close to everything  beautiful walks all around. Great space as well - fantastic for a couple. Very comfortable living room and bed  lots of closet space  cute balcony  very functional kitchen. Would stay here again!"),
("2019-01-30", "23357535", "Sophie", "Great location  very spacious  loved the welcome tips."),
("2019-02-06", "23357535", "Christine", "Cet appartement est idéalement situé  à 5 mn à pieds du train et des bus  au cœur de la CBD. Parfaitement bien insonorisé  il offre un lit et un espace de vie confortables. L'établissement sécurisé est facile d'accès et siège autour de petits commerces utiles pour les besoins quotidiens. Vivement recommandé pour une escapade amoureuse à Sydney."),
("2019-02-08", "23357535", "George", "Location is excellent.  We walked everywhere with no problems.  Nice well stocked kitchen  close to restaurants.  Clever check in with the lock box which we found with no problem.  View in inward to large office buildings. Not the most private location but we were in the heart of Sydney.  We felt safe and comfortable.  Thanks for a great stay."),
("2019-02-10", "23357535", "Linda", "Clean place. Great  central location."),
("2019-02-11", "23357535", "T", "Clean and well presented"),
("2019-02-13", "23357535", "Jill", "This is a great location for concerts at the City Concert Hall and visits to the NSW Art Gallery. There is a bit of construction noise at the moment due to the upgrade of nearby Martin Place Station  but it's OK if the windows and doors are closed."),
("2019-02-20", "23357535", "Jules", "Well where to start! This apartment is a real home away from home in the CBD area of Sydney and within easy reach of everything. The apartment has one bedroom  bathroom and a spacious kitchen/lounge/dining room. The kitchen has everything you could need including a dishwasher  a washing machine and a tumble dryer. We did use the oven once and it was a bit noisy but cooked really quickly. The bathroom is a good size but it’s a bit tricky to get the shower just the right temperature. Having said that it’s a good size and once you get it going it is great. The bed is comfy with plenty of storage in large sliding door wardrobes. The air con works really well and cools you off just when you need it. We turned it off at night as it was cool enough to sleep and it is a little noisy when it is running. There are plenty of little reminders to make sure you turn everything off before you go out which we found really helpful. Up on floor 14 (difficult to find if you don’t know where it is as it’s not written down anywhere) there is a pool and jacuzzi with seating and a BBQ. You will need your key fob to get up in the lift and to get through the pool door. There are ladies and gents changing rooms but we didn’t explore them. When we were there the pool looked dirty and unusable (we have informed the owners) but the jacuzzi was perfect after a long day in the city. The location of the apartment is 11/10 perfect. Come out of the front door and turn right. Go down the stairs by the Japanese restaurant and follow the alley to Pitt Street. This will lead you wherever you wish to go. It is an easy walk down to the Rocks District (15 mins) full of history. The Quays (15 mins) with all the ferry trips you could want and on to the Opera House (20 minutes) all times approx from the apartment at a slow/medium pace. There is a brill supermarket literally 3 minutes from the apartment. Turn left out of the apartment up to the main road  turn right and walk along to Martin Place and directly in front of you there are some stairs down ward passed a burger stall. Go down these and to the left you will find an escalator down to a great shop. Took us ages to find it so hope this helps!We used the Hop On Hop Off Bus and it was fab!! It is only a two minute walk up to Elizabeth St to the bus stop so easily accessible. They also have some great special offers on if you want to visit lots of the other attractions. We also went on the Champagne afternoon boat tour (Quay 6) and did the tour of the opera house. We were lucky enough to see an Opera at the Opera House and loved every second. All in all we loved the place in Sydney and will definitely be passing the info on to friends and relatives. Although maybe we should have kept it a secret so we can go back again!! Lol. Thanks Tam and Johannes who always replied quickly to questions and to the lady at the foyer desk who helped us find the pool. All in all 11/10 from us!"),
("2019-02-23", "23357535", "Markus", "Sehr sauberes und bequemes Apartement im Zentrum von Sydney."),
("2018-03-18", "23493822", "Haiming", "很好很干净 位置不错 距离eastwood及MQ uni都很近 值得推荐"),
("2018-03-31", "23493822", "Ye", "Simple nice place :)"),
("2018-04-02", "23493822", "Chieh-Yi", "Room is clean and comfortable  has independent entrance for it  you can have good privacy."),
("2018-04-15", "23493822", "Yuri", "谢谢热情好客房东的招待 是非常友好的房东 非常干净的房间 五星推荐哦!"),
("2018-04-22", "23493822", "Chironjit", "A great room in a nice neighborhood. Great host who provided all the required amenities and who was very helpful when needed"),
("2018-04-23", "23493822", "Mark", "The host was very kind with quick response  the room was small but clean with a comfy bed and ensuite  however no bath towels were provided upon request  only a small hand towel for the stay  the ensuite door was not working properly  and the room seemed to be right next to the kitchen and the family was very loud from 8am to 11am so we couldn't sleep in. Other than that  it was not bad for its price."),
("2018-04-25", "23493822", "YoungBeen", "Good cost value"),
("2018-04-27", "23493822", "Liliia", "Nice  tidy  comfortable place for stopping. Friendly householders.The fastest respond for request!"),
("2018-05-02", "23493822", "Kimberley", "Xiaowen was very accommodating to my request of an early check in. The space is great and everything you need for a short stay."),
("2018-05-06", "23493822", "Larissa", "Great place! Very cosy  just a reminder that there are only tea towels so you have to bring your own towels but other than that everything was good :)"),
("2018-05-07", "23493822", "Mira", "We cannot recommend this property enough. Great host  sparkling cleaning  safe parking spot and neighbor hood. Great value of money  perfect for short stay."),
("2018-05-15", "23493822", "Tony", "Very clean studio  Xiaowen met us outside to make sure we got in safely. Was small but perfect for our one night stay!"),
("2018-05-17", "23493822", "Sandra", "The host was very quick to respond and was able to help with our late check in time. She was also very helpful with our needs and the place was very clean and nice."),
("2018-05-20", "23493822", "Jamsheed", "Xiaowen was a wonderful host and provided a great place to stay for our visit to Sydney."),
("2018-06-09", "23493822", "Ting", "Nice place !!"),
("2018-06-21", "23493822", "Isabel", "Xiaowen is very nice to welcome us. The location is very quiet and suitable for someone who travel in Sydney."),
("2018-06-23", "23493822", "Grant", "Stylish and comfortable."),
("2018-06-24", "23493822", "병준", "Great master bedroom with in built bathroom.I’d recommend to anyone visiting Epping for a stay."),
("2018-07-05", "23493822", "Vu", "Will comeback again."),
("2018-07-19", "23493822", "Erin", "This is a very small  private space perfect for one or two people in a secluded  residential area. It is a bit far from public transport as the bus stop is a bit of an uphill walk  but very much doable nonetheless! Xiaowen is great at communication and is fast with responses to any messages or inquiries. I loved that I had my own entrance and bathroom as well as a lot of closet space and great  modern aesthetics. My only things to specify are that guests should bring their own bath towels  and when I first booked this space it was listed as a private unit but it is actually on the side of the house and connected to the main house within the room by a locked door — I could easily hear noise from the kitchen during the morning and day  and the family also occasionally will play a piano that is located very close to the door. Other than that everything was very clean and check-in/out was very easy and convenient!"),
("2018-07-22", "23493822", "David", "Xiaowen was very prompt with her responses and was very friendly! Would recommend!"),
("2018-07-23", "23493822", "Mira", "We would love to come back. Sparkling clean  good location  free parking  easy communication  could not be better. "),
("2018-08-04", "23493822", "Hans", "Very nice private room... wasn’t expecting this good place   and very nice people   I checked in at 4am ... as many others refused to let me in late but she stayed and showed us the room"),
("2018-08-05", "23493822", "Soma", "A brand new room close to Sydney's attractions at an affordable price represents good value for money."),
("2018-08-07", "23493822", "Chanelle", "A lovely host and a beautiful room. No kitchen use"),
("2018-08-08", "23493822", "Tzu Hsuan", "Sparkling clean and good shower"),
("2018-08-09", "23493822", "Weiling", "Brand new toilet  easy access"),
("2018-08-13", "23493822", "XiaoXue", "all good"),
("2018-08-17", "23493822", "Shannon", "Great private place and private bathroom. It was very clean."),
("2018-08-20", "23493822", "Michael", "Xiaowen's place was great very comfortable and stylish. Had everything you needed for a great sleep. Unfortunately I didn't meet Xiaowen but spoke on the phone she was very helpful and polite."),
("2018-09-23", "23493822", "Nicolás", "place nice to stay and the area is cozy"),
("2018-10-05", "23493822", "Huixin", "Disappointed. The room is NOT the master room showing in the photo. It's a TINY room located at the side of the house just like a MOTEL room. LOW VALUE with such kind of room with NO access to kitchen  washer  dryer  hair dryer. In short  only access to a bed and a bathroom. Besides  the hosts were unfriendly. I arrived at about 22:30 and I knew it was late. So I was very polite but the tone of the host made me felt uncomfortable and she even hanged me up while I didn't finish talking. While the host saw my parents  she promptly return back to the house without even greeting to my parents. It was the most UNWISE choice I ever made to book 3 nights for them. That was the WORSE experience they ever had in Australia."),
("2018-10-07", "23493822", "Leo", "Great"),
("2018-10-13", "23493822", "Gavin", "Lovely room"),
("2018-10-15", "23493822", "Luca", "Great host! Beautiful house in a quiet location! Amazing private room"),
("2018-10-17", "23493822", "Zhiren", "房间很新很干净 房东一家很nice 抵达的时候下雨了还打伞出来迎接帮拿行李 感谢"),
("2018-10-20", "23493822", "Juan", "Good bedroom to stay 1 or 2 nights  very nice bathroom  all very clean and neat.  The bedroom is a bit smaller than it seems in the pictures  it was a bit confusing when I arrived  cause the photo is mirrored in the ad  and the picture in the wall is missing. But had a good stay regardless  and a good price.  The bedroom is accessed from outside  no connection to the rest of the house  this makes the place very private."),
("2018-10-22", "23493822", "Abby", "最大的败笔就是图片和实物完全不是一间房间  也小不少   这个感觉很不好｡不喜欢这种行为｡如果用实拍图其实房间不错的 干净整洁 像motel  适合临时住一晚｡有独立卫生间 基本用品   坐落于整体个house侧边单独修的一间房间 所以私密性比较强  如果你把它当成是motel其实还不错的  然后页面提到空调 衣架没看到有｡ 隔音不好｡全部如实描述｡"),
("2018-11-09", "23493822", "Vivian", "The room looked exactly like the photos. It even had its own door for private entrance which was nice. It would not have been a convenient location to get to without a car but we knew that prior to booking because our friend was able to drive us around. The neighborhood is very safe and xiaowei was very nice upon arrival Everything was great for our 2 night stay!"),
("2018-11-14", "23493822", "Michael", "Quick and helpful communication... new  clean and centrally located to greater Epping!"),
("2018-11-18", "23493822", "Cai", "there's more place for improvement"),
("2018-11-19", "23493822", "Yuyun", "很干净 很舒服"),
("2018-11-22", "23493822", "Austin", "The place seemed slightly different from the photo  but it certainly has everything you need! Perfect for solo or couple travellers. The private entrance straight to the ensuite room was definitely useful :)"),
("2018-11-24", "23493822", "Genevieve", "Good value place to stay with comfortable bed and modern bathroom. Very clean and easy check in. Fast responses too. Note: there is family noise from very early in the morning on the weekend. So not good for travellers who want to sleep in  or are light sleepers. Otherwise a pleasant stay."),
("2018-11-26", "23493822", "Adrian", "Brand new and spotlessly clean. Very comfy bed and no traffic noise!!!I will stay here again."),
("2018-11-27", "23493822", "Denise", "Clean  modern space with a separate entrance to the main house. The hosts were extremely hospitable. Do note that the room is smaller than it looks in the photo  but that wasn’t a problem at all because it was enough for 2 people to stay for just a night. Overall a lovely stay  and I would book this place again in future."),
("2018-11-28", "23493822", "Lu", "very good place to stay  economy while closed to the Eastwood area"),
("2018-12-01", "23493822", "Lisa", "Very nice place"),
("2018-12-11", "23493822", "Oluwatoba", "very clean and quiet"),
("2018-12-13", "23493822", "Lijin", "Great place for money. Modern place with recent renovation. Private entrance and silent community. Highly recommend this place to anyone."),
("2018-12-16", "23493822", "Harry", "Great location  quick responses and very helpful host. Recommend it if you want to stay close to Eastwood  Epping  parramatta areas."),
("2018-12-28", "23493822", "Christine", "Xiaowen's accommodation offers a clean  modern bedroom & adjoining private bathroom. The room size is on the small side  however  there is excellent storage and the quality of the amenity is very good. The bed is really comfy; the complimentary bath products are of good quality; the privacy of the room is excellent and access is easy; and the neighbourhood is very quiet for relaxing  undisturbed sleeping at night. We used this accommodation as a base when visiting family & friends (so we were out most of the day & into the evening) and it served us very well in that context. Good value for money."),
("2019-01-02", "23493822", "Roberto", "La stanza era molto pulita  ma la foto su airbnb non corrispondeva alla stanza in cui abbiamo soggiornato  nella foto sembrava molto più spaziosa."),
("2018-03-22", "23529310", "Kathryn", "Gracious home and hosts. Spacious  private and very comfortable attic room - would definitely recommend to others. Casey and Larry were welcoming and easy to communicate with. Location was close to parklands  harbour and great cafes. Thanks very much Casey."),
("2018-04-05", "23529310", "Oliver", "Wonderful place.felt at home after 10 min.We did not want to leave.Great location to explore Sydney"),
("2018-05-02", "23529310", "Kelly", "Casey and Larry made us feel very welcome and at home. The attic room is large and spacious with a great ensuite. A lovely area of Sydney to stay  not too far from the CBD and attractions."),
("2018-05-07", "23529310", "John", "The room was pleasant  spacious  well appointed comfortable and private. Casey & Larry were welcoming and I enjoyed chatting."),
("2018-05-10", "23529310", "Meg", "All good. Beautiful house. Close to the wonderful Globe Point Rd. Comfortable  charming  friendly  perfect."),
("2018-05-13", "23529310", "Richard", "A delightful hide-away. The attic room is large and nicely furnished  with a good bathroom close by. Helpful and charming hosts and a quiet neighbourhood."),
("2018-05-17", "23529310", "Andrew", "Casey was a lovely host!   The room is comfortable and very convenient to Sydney University and surrounds.   I had a problem-free stay :)"),
("2018-05-21", "23529310", "Kelly", "Casey's place is a spacious attic room with convenient ensuite. The room is beautifully furnished with lots of extras."),
("2018-05-27", "23529310", "Mukesh", "Great location & communication. I booked the space for my business partner. He had a super comfortable stay and would highly recommend this stylish little gem with amazing hosts  Casey & Larry. "),
("2018-06-07", "23529310", "Catherine", "Casey is an excellent host. The room is large and very comfortable. We highly recommend Casey’s Airbnb."),
("2018-06-12", "23529310", "Tricia", "Casey and Larry are wonderful hosts and made our stay very comfortable. The beautiful and artistic house is in a great location and the room is well appointed. I’d certainly stay here again!"),
("2018-06-25", "23529310", "Kelly", "Casey is a warm and friendly host making sure we had everything we needed. The room is spacious and warm with lots of welcoming extras and homely touches. We will definitely be back. Thanks Casey."),
("2018-06-27", "23529310", "Iliana", "Wonderful stay  thank you Casey and Larry! Was peaceful  comfortable  private…a beautiful home to experience. Very much enjoyed the conversations with both of you about Sydney and life in general _/\_"),
("2018-07-06", "23529310", "Andrew", "Clean   comfortable amd convenient!  Casey's place fits the bill - as well as being a lovely host :)"),
("2018-07-17", "23529310", "Ioannis", "5* experience. Totaly recommended."),
("2018-07-31", "23529310", "Philipp", "Amazing apartment  very close to USyd! We loved staying there and don't even want to leave  Casey and Larry are just lovely!"),
("2018-08-19", "23529310", "Joyce", "The host are very kind and both the room and the bathroom are very clean."),
("2018-08-26", "23529310", "Zohie", "A tranquil and calming space  up high with beautiful natural light.A great space with our own private bathroom and amenities. Perfect while while in Sydney for work.Casey and Larry were warm and welcoming. I would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-09-02", "23529310", "Meredith", "Casey and Larry immediately made me feel at home. They are warm  generous and kind.  The room is private  spacious and clean and well located.  Whether you have either a busy or relaxing trip planned you are able to enjoy it at your own pace. Time spent with Casey and Larry is also a delight."),
("2018-10-01", "23529310", "Bunny", "It’s really a nice place! Good location near Sydney university. Casey and Larry are so nice .The house is  beautiful Quiet and very clean. Thanks for great hospitality. Highly commended ~ hope we can come again ^^"),
("2018-10-06", "23529310", "Mukesh", "This was the second time my friend Dain stayed here and he absolutely loved it! Great location; great space; great hosts!!"),
("2018-11-02", "23529310", "Isela", "La casa está increíble  llena de detalles y arte. Me encantan las casas antiguas y esta estaba hermosa. El vecindario es de lo mejor  es muy relajado y seguro. Tienes parada de autobús muy cercana y puedes llegar caminando a tiendas y restaurantes  el barrio vale mucho la pena recorrerlo.Casey y Larry fueron excelentes anfitriones.El cuarto en muy amplio y cuentas con un baño al lado que solo es para esa habitación. En la habitación podías prepararte café o té  está muy iluminada y es bastante amplia.Hay que subir muchas escaleras y te lo avisan con antelación  para nosotros estuvo muy bien.Lindos detalles en la habitación y el baño  realmente teníamos todo lo necesario.Pudimos lavar algo de ropa y eso fue muy bueno para nosotros.Es un hermoso hogar  que Casey y Larry compartieron con nosotros."),
("2018-11-07", "23529310", "Sasa", "Thanks to Casey and Larry  we had a great time in Sydney.they are the greatest hosts.Lovely room and comfortable place leave us a good memory Casey ’s informations are useful we tried 4 restaurants that Casey wrote in the information book all of them are delicious and have a great atmosphere thank you so much!"),
("2018-11-11", "23529310", "Nayla", "I had a fantastic stay with Larry and Casey.Comfortable  clean and airy light-filled space. Great location and lovely hosts.Would highly recommend and hope to be back."),
("2018-11-16", "23529310", "Dominik", "We had a great stay at Caseys and Larrys place. Thank you for everything :-)  Casey and Larry were very welcoming and supporting hosts. a great place to stay."),
("2018-11-18", "23529310", "Claude", "Très bonne prestation et très beau cadre à Forest Lodge."),
("2018-11-21", "23529310", "Candy", "Great host and lovely stay! Great location  informative book that introduced the neighbourhood very well. Easy to get into the city by Uber. Thank you so much Casey and Larry! Recommended."),
("2018-11-25", "23529310", "Maggie", "Great location. Lovely hosts. Great accommodation in a lovely character home."),
("2018-12-01", "23529310", "萱", "Both Casey and Larry are sooooo warm and sweet! The location here is very convenient. Their house is very particular. We had a very nice day in Sydney."),
("2018-12-07", "23529310", "Robyn", "A wonderful large room and spotless bathroom.   And QUIET!  Casey and Larry are superb hosts. Happy to chat   gave me some great tips on what to do whilst respecting my privacy.   Good location.  Highly recommended."),
("2018-12-09", "23529310", "Annie", "This is a fantastic get away close to the heart of Sydney thankyou for a memorable time!"),
("2019-01-06", "23529310", "Agnes", "I highly recommend Casey and Larry’s place!Great and welcoming hosts nice and helpful  quite unique location beautiful and spotless house  definitely go for it!!"),
("2019-01-28", "23529310", "Damien", "The best host ever !!! Larry et Casey sont des gens géniaux  d’une grande hospitalité et de bons conseils ! Nous n’hésiterons pas à retourner dans leur belle maison dès notre retour à Sydney !"),
("2019-02-04", "23529310", "铁铮", "nice accommodation and nice couple. I already think it is my another sweet home there. hope to go there again."),
("2019-02-22", "23529310", "梦诗", "The hosts are very good  .The transportation is convenient.The room is so gorgeous and neat.Highly recommended!"),
("2018-03-03", "23510317", "Jessica LL", "We have a great days in Dan’s place and Dan was very responsible host with  very quick responses Quite and peaceful loft with really lovely garden views from the balcony Super close to Central Station and very convenient location Will come back next time in Sydney"),
("2018-03-31", "23510317", "Sarah", "It is a really stylist loft apartment in a great location. just less than 5 mins walk to central station and supermarket. The check in is easy  and Lucy and David are great responsive host. Recommended"),
("2018-03-31", "23510317", "Kc", "A super convient place. The location is just great. The room is really clean and cozy. Although the kitchen is bit small  it is enough for me to make simple meal."),
("2018-04-05", "23510317", "Dan", "Beautiful place to stay . Highly recommended"),
("2018-04-09", "23510317", "Harleen", "Listing as described. Walking distance to public transport and some really nice restaurants."),
("2018-04-13", "23510317", "Zac", "Great loco and space  thanks!"),
("2018-04-18", "23510317", "Robert", "This apartment has so much potential but as it is now just didn’t work for us. We visited during a time where the weather was 90F degrees and the “air conditioning” isn’t air conditioning at all. It is a standing unit where you must keep the sliding door open 8-10 inches all day/night if you want to use it  thus defeating the purpose and letting all the hot air in. It made the loft unbearable. So much so that we had to sleep downstairs on the couch and air mattress. The bathroom was nice and it has a full kitchen and washer. Those are the nice things I can say. Check in was easy and he accommodated us early which we appreciated. David (who we were in contact with) did try to help us but there were just too many problems. The WiFi worked 20% of the time we were present - he blamed it on us using too much bandwidth - we were simply trying to connect an iPhone to the internet and to text - not stream movies or download anything. The beds were uncomfortable but the place would be a good value if the WiFi worked and if it had actual air conditioning as advertised and how the pictures lead you to believe. Because we had to keep the door open (security risk) so many bugs  spiders  etc. came in too. Also the smoke detectors are covered in aluminum foil which is a safety risk. I would not recommend this Airbnb to anyone at its present state but it could be great for the cost and for bigger groups as it sleeps 5-6 somewhat comfortably. Our stay  however  was not pleasant at all and we could not wait to leave."),
("2018-05-05", "23510317", "Roy", "This location is really central and the apartment is clean. Highly recommend it! Great host too."),
("2018-05-08", "23510317", "Ester", "Jason's accommodation is in a very good location.  However it had a shabby feel to it  mainly due to the poor workmanship of the building."),
("2018-05-09", "23510317", "Home Sweet Home", "距離標示上建議可以再清楚一點｡希望您未來越來越好~加油!"),
("2018-05-16", "23510317", "Yo", "It was okay  not bad not any issue "),
("2018-05-17", "23510317", "Dan", "Lovely loft to stay :)"),
("2018-05-18", "23510317", "Tomy", "Ok."),
("2018-06-06", "23510317", "Joel", "Nice spot would stay again"),
("2018-06-11", "23510317", "Lourdes", "Good location  friendly hosts. "),
("2018-06-16", "23510317", "Stuart", "Great apartment  nice and clean  in a great location.  Instructions and communication for checkin were great  making our stay a breeze."),
("2018-06-18", "23510317", "Eloise", "While in a great location  and still a specious apartment  there were a number of items missing/not thought if that would have made the stay a lot better. It is a two stores loft but all open so no doors to separate the two beds/sofa bed which is fine but just be aware. There was no bath mat  no cups for water or mugs for teas  no milk even for a tea  towels were very small and old  and hard to dry cause no heated towel rails  beds could have sheets as well in case doona is too hot. It was fine for a short stay as we weren’t in the room much but still value for money wasn’t there."),
("2018-06-22", "23510317", "Azzy", "Jadon and davids olace was awesome.theyre hospitality is secomd to none."),
("2018-07-13", "23510317", "Danielle", "Jason is very friendly and helpful! This apartment is in an excellent location with very quiet neighbors. This was a perfect stay for my business trip. The apartment had ample room and great facilities  yet was also very comfortable and relaxing. I would recommend this stay to anyone visiting Surry Hills looking for somewhere quiet to stay."),
("2018-07-17", "23510317", "Nicole", "The flat is very central - it takes only a few minutes to the central train station! It was very clean and comfortable."),
("2018-07-18", "23510317", "Sheree", "Excellent location. Check in smooth and easy! Great stay"),
("2018-07-27", "23510317", "Eduardo", "The place was ok... I do believe it was a bit pricy for what you get. On the other hand  its location was great and the host always replied rapidly to any questions. "),
("2018-07-31", "23510317", "Samuel", "Our stay was awesome. Jason's communication was sensational and made checking in quick and easy.I would highly recommend this place to anyone looking to stay in central Sydney at an affordable and efficient location."),
("2018-08-06", "23510317", "Jessica", "Great stay"),
("2018-08-07", "23510317", "Pauline", "Convinient location  spacious  bright."),
("2018-08-13", "23510317", "Julia", "Location of the apartment is a short walk to Central Station. The accessibility saves us a great deal of travelling time. David was quick to response to my queries and I really appreciate that. Instructions from the host was very clear and checking in was a breeze. We had a great stay."),
("2018-08-18", "23510317", "Hadleigh", "Great place to stay.  Close to good cafes and the train station."),
("2018-08-22", "23510317", "Tine", "Very good location!"),
("2018-08-22", "23510317", "Inleel", "The apartment was nice and clean. A smooth check-in  along with prompt responses from the host made the trip hassle free. Only downside was one of the neighbours was noisy during the day."),
("2018-08-28", "23510317", "Princess", "The loft was so spacious and clean! The location was about 5-7 minutes away from Central and the neighnorhood was great! I would definitely book Jason's loft again when I come back to Sydney."),
("2018-08-30", "23510317", "Annie", "Absolutely wonderful place! So perfectly located in Surry Hills! It was fun walking around the area but also it was in the perfect place to catch a train!"),
("2018-09-03", "23510317", "Tim", "Great location and nice little city break."),
("2018-09-05", "23510317", "Greg", "Great communication. Fantastic location. Super easy check in. Old apartment. Good value."),
("2018-09-09", "23510317", "Stacey", "Lovely apartment in the most convenient location in Sydney."),
("2018-09-13", "23510317", "Keaton", "Great little spot  good location and nice check-in experience."),
("2018-09-17", "23510317", "Brenda", "Jason and David were very responsive hosts and facilitated an easy check in process despite arriving quite late at night. The loft was in a great location  central to public transport and walking distance to some yum eateries. Amenities in the loft were quite basic which was not too problematic as we did not spend much time physically there. Due to the proximity of the neighbours  it was not uncommon to be woken up early if the neighbours were up and about. All in all  an adequate place to return to after a long day of adventuring the city."),
("2018-09-25", "23510317", "King Yan", "Location location! I enjoyed the stay a lot! It’s just a 5-min walk from the Central station. Owner of the place replied instantly to solve our enquirers. Appreciated!"),
("2018-10-01", "23510317", "Matt", "Cool place  excellent host!"),
("2018-10-07", "23510317", "小慧", "温馨提示一下中国游客民宿是没有拖鞋的 所以要提前预备好会比较方便"),
("2018-10-10", "23510317", "Isabella", "Close to plenty of dining options and a short walk to the train. A Comfortable place to stay."),
("2018-10-11", "23510317", "Chris", "Great communication throughout  very clear instructions and easy to access the property.The apartment was clean and as advertised  in a great location.I would stay here again."),
("2018-10-22", "23510317", "Valérie", "Good location and communication with the host."),
("2018-10-28", "23510317", "Vanessa", "Great location and cute little place! I stayed here with my parents for 4 nights and it was perfect for a weekend trip! Check in was easy and uncomplicated! Communication was good  and the place was clean a spacious for 3 people! 5 stars from me!"),
("2018-10-31", "23510317", "Jan Matthew", "Shower head needed to be replaced. Pillows had a bad smell. Curtains needed to be washed."),
("2018-11-03", "23510317", "Leisha", "Very clean and tidy spot  great location and great communication from Jason - however not too impressed with the air con not working when it was 37 degrees outside!"),
("2018-11-07", "23510317", "Ronan", "Everything's good except the shower head is not working properly."),
("2018-11-10", "23510317", "Alexandra", "Really fast replies and very welcoming"),
("2018-11-13", "23510317", "Maria", "Even better than in photos! It feels very stylish and spacious but homely at the same time. It had everything we needed (it even has a walk-in wardrobe!). The hosts were very nice and attentive and the place is super well located (you can even walk to the Opera House like we did). Really recommended!!"),
("2018-11-14", "23510317", "Caoimhe", "Jason and David were extremely helpful  attentive hosts however the apartment was a little below our expectations. Quite basic standard and very poor shower. Fine for a brief stay if you’re not spending a lot of time in the place."),
("2018-11-18", "23510317", "Megan", "Jason was a great host who accommodated a last minute early check-in request. The place has the essentials  and we enjoyed the balcony the most. Walking distance to restaurants  bars  and coffee shops in the area as well as public transit."),
("2018-11-29", "23510317", "Jessica LL", "A beautiful loft and great host"),
("2018-12-01", "23510317", "David", "Great location and everything was as it reads and looks in the ad. Easy check in and helpful communication for a first time Airbnb user."),
("2018-12-04", "23510317", "Nick", "Really nice place  lots of space and finished to a nice quality  good and quick communication as well"),
("2018-12-07", "23510317", "Micaela", "Great location near the train station."),
("2018-12-09", "23510317", "Yue", "Good choice"),
("2018-12-14", "23510317", "Joanna", "Really nice apartment within walking distance from the train station  and the apartment is quite spacious and clean."),
("2019-01-02", "23510317", "Emma", "Perfect location and a beautiful home. Would definitely recommend"),
("2019-01-24", "23510317", "Kelly", "I had stayed at this place for three weeks for work. This is a great place to stay short term. David and Jason are very responsive and make checking in and checking out easy. However  I would not recommend staying here long term during the summer. There is not a fully installed aircon- it is a portable fan/aircon which doesn't really cool the place too well  especially on the warmer days. Jason did purchase and install two fans for me during my stay though  which I greatly appreciated.Also  the shower head does not really work and sprays out minimal water. Otherwise this is a good  place to stay at during the winter or cooler days for a weekend. The place is nicely decorated and comfortable and is in a great location."),
("2019-02-08", "23510317", "Ashley", "all as described"),
("2019-02-13", "23510317", "Anne", "Great place in a perfect location. Exactly as described. Spacious and cute decor. Would recommend staying here. Just two things that were not perfect: The wifi was too slow to use and the aircon unit is a big mobile unit but requires the window to be open which on a hot day does not quite work. Other than that a beautiful apartment to explore Sydney."),
("2019-02-14", "23510317", "Reid", "My experience was not entirely pleasant  booked the room but did not stay due to uncleanliness upon arrival."),
("2019-02-20", "23510317", "Robert", "When we originally saw this place listed  we instantly thought it looked  new  clean and very stylish and we were quite excited to spend our 5 days in Sydney here with our baby. Unfortunately this excitement dwindled on a daily basis. Our initial check in was great and David was most accommodating of us needing to check in earlier than 3pm  which was great. When we arrived  the place was very warm  we saw the air con wasn't actually a proper air con unit  but a mobile one sticking out of the patio doors side window. It appeared quite old as well and did not pump much cool air  further than 2 or 3 metres  so it's understandable why it was warm. There are two fans to help  one downstairs and one in the main bedroom upstairs. I think it should be made clear in regards to this in the listing.  Plus you have to empty the water container (3-5litres) every day yourself. Then we looked around the place and to be honest it's a lot more tired than it looks in the photos. There are cracks and patches on all walls and two holes in the ceiling  which leaked when it rained on the last stay. The kitchen units are also looking tired and some do not shut properly. The shower doesn't work properly  it runs more like a tap due to the shower heads holes all being worn away. I reported this on day 2 of our stay and David offered to replace it but I said we would get by. On reflection I wish I'd insisted on replacing the shower head  because I have since read other reviews and saw that someone in January reported the shower not working as well  so nothing has obviously been done to correct it and may not after my report either. There were hand prints all over the patio doors and on day 3 we had been making our bed and found an empty condom wrapper under the bed. so not great on the cleaning front either. This was also reported and David offered to have the place re cleaned  but with us only having 2 days of our stay left I saw very little point. We pay for cleaning  so you expect that side of things to be done properly. We didn't notice until we left as our suitcases had been placed under the stairs  but when we took them out to leave they were covered in dust. I hope these issues are fixed for the next guests."),
("2018-07-19", "23636182", "Min", "The host canceled this reservation the day before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-09-16", "23636182", "Belinda", "This accommodation was amazing! The apartment was spacious  with great views  a peaceful neighbourhood and close to shops and restaurants! The host  Purple was very welcoming  and made us feel at home! We were sad to leave and highly recommend this apartment!!"),
("2018-11-04", "23636182", "Tess", "The apartment was very spacious. The room was as per the picture. It had all the facilities and Purple was a delightful person. She even kept a packet of chocolates as a welcome gift  which was thoughtful :) I had a comfortable stay  but would like to suggest to change the description to room in an apartment(considering it was not an entire apartment to myself). Thanks for hosting me."),
("2018-12-04", "23636182", "鸣洋", "非常棒的airbnb体验 房子的整洁和细节都让我们非常惊讶｡感谢房东提供这么优秀的房子｡很期待下一次还有机会去Rhodes旅行｡强烈推荐给大家｡"),
("2018-12-09", "23636182", "Pamela", "To future customers you can expect clean towels ready to use  basic toiletries provided  laundry machine and dryer  cutlery  dishwasher and utensils. The hosts are very friendly and attentive to your needs."),
("2019-01-01", "23636182", "Jackie", "Clean and nice"),
("2019-01-11", "23636182", "Jackie", "Good location  nice view. Excellent!"),
("2019-01-05", "23730118", "Joana", "Very good location! The bus stop is just a minute walk from the door. The restaurants and cafes within the area are very  very good! The house is very spacious and Tarah was such a lovely host! I would definitely recommend this location  especially if you are travelling with kids."),
("2019-01-25", "23730118", "Mark", "The host canceled this reservation 35 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2019-01-05", "23862155", "Ivana", "We had a great stay at Boudine’s place. The apartment was clean and tidy. Big plus was a very comfortable bed  good shower and fast wifi. Walking distance to Bondi Beach  shops and restaurant. I would absolutely recommend this place for anyone who likes to stay at Bondi but wants to be away from the busy streets.Thanks for the great stay Boudine!"),
("2019-01-28", "23862155", "Carla", "Boudine’s apartment is perfect for a Bondi visit- Only a short walk to the beach! Also really nice and modern and super clean!"),
("2018-03-19", "23650892", "Damon", "The apartment was not clean and had dog urine on all the carpets. It took 24 hours for 1 of the rugs to get replaced and the new one seemed masked with odor spray. The owner told me the place was clean after the first day but the urine smell was still in the apartment which kept us locked in our rooms while we weren’t out and about in the city. It was very unpleasant even after getting the cleaning fee and one nights stay refunded to us. It was a total break down in communication between the management company and the own  but that shouldn’t be at my expense after I had just taken a 14 hour flight from California."),
("2018-03-23", "23650892", "Gemma", "Naveen's place is located in a great central area of Sydney - close to shops  bars and restaurants (can thoroughly recommend the Spring salad from Tropicana at the bottom of the building!) as well as the station (King's Cross) and the Hop On Hop Off bus route.As a host Naveen was very responsive and made some great suggestions for places to head to around and about Sydney."),
("2018-03-27", "23650892", "Shane", "Great apartment & great location! Would stay here again!"),
("2018-04-03", "23650892", "Ava", "The location is alright.. host is friendly and helpful.. but the cleanness is so well.."),
("2018-04-11", "23650892", "Raymond", "Naveen's place is in an amazing location  and was great value for money. She was communicative and very helpful."),
("2018-04-29", "23650892", "Leticia", "Naveen is an excellent host  very friendly and thoughtful :) we were welcomed with a bottle of wine and face masks  which I thought was a wonderful touch. Definitely recommend!!"),
("2018-05-09", "23650892", "Helen", "A lovely large apartment. Perfectly clean and really comfy beds. It's great to have the bedrooms on one floor and then the large living area below - feels like a house! Naveen left a welcome basket of fruit and veggies from the market which was a lovely touch. I have to admit I fell in love with Darlinghurst as Victoria Street outside has lots of great cafes and restaurants and it's an easy walk into the city or lots of trains and buses. There is a stunning view of the harbour bridge and opera house from the gym and pool. Having a concierge is good too  a sense of luxury and security. I had an issue with the washing machine but Naveen was very quick and easy to respond and sort everything out for me. Would happily stay here again and recommend it to others."),
("2018-05-13", "23650892", "Lara", "Very stylish  awesome location  great host"),
("2018-05-19", "23650892", "JEri", "Naveen’s place is absolutley amazing for style location and price.Naveen has a great eye for quirky things  the artwork and decorè is fabulous..The gym and pool are on the same level right next to the apartment and are a real bonus.This place is truely a rare gem..Thankyou Naveen!"),
("2018-05-20", "23650892", "Franck", "Appartement sympathique  emplacement super on retrouve tout ce dont on a besoin au pied de l'immeuble."),
("2018-05-26", "23650892", "Frank", "Great space and fantastic location"),
("2018-05-28", "23650892", "Cara", "Naveen was a great host and myself and my friends had a great stay at the loft."),
("2018-06-03", "23650892", "Catherine", "Naveen’s apartment is in a great location near shops and transport and she was very available to answer any queries we had. I would definitely recommend this apartment and hope that we get to stay here again."),
("2018-06-14", "23650892", "Jet", "The place is very classy and conveniently located  near enough to walk to the CBD during good weather and very near the Kings Cross station to access all parts of Sydney. Just ensure that your arrival is clear so that the unit will be ready when you arrive. The concierge service is top notch and makes a big difference. Tons of restaurants around covering all cuisine  price levels  etc. Would recommend the place to friends. Naveen is very responsive and will make your stay as pleasant as possible."),
("2018-06-16", "23650892", "Nihal", "Beautiful apartment  great location (close to train station). It is very stylish  spacious  good value for money  and has all the amenities one would need when staying away from home."),
("2018-06-26", "23650892", "James", "Naveen is a great host with great local knowledge and communication. Check is and out was super easy and the concierge is great and adds a professional touchThe property is in an ideal location close to so many awesome places to eat and drink. The property itself is lovely the photos give you a good insight into what you will experience - great size and great to spend time in"),
("2018-07-12", "23650892", "Supriya", "Very stylish apartment in an excellent location close to all amenities.Our host was helpful and flexible with check in and check out times which was great."),
("2018-07-15", "23650892", "Bronwyn", "Amazing place was spacious and great value. Close to shops and transport. Only one thing negative; the traffic could be heard from the bedrooms even with ear plugs on."),
("2018-07-18", "23650892", "Zoe", "This little gem was so so delightful  better then what I was expecting  Naveen was so lovely to suggest places to go out and eat and have a few drinks. The two bedrooms was accommodating for both me and my co-worker. Had a lovely time in Sydney I recommend staying here to everyone  the location is so good near the station and local restaurants and bars."),
("2018-07-21", "23650892", "Jax", "This apartment is great! Convenient location  beautifully decorated and very comfortable. We stayed with a young baby and felt we had everything we needed. We would happily stay here again :) "),
("2018-07-30", "23650892", "Alex", "Great spot to explore the city. Lovely stylish apartment in a great area. Would highly recommend."),
("2018-08-16", "23650892", "Jaime", "Awesome place! And the staff at the building were super friendly. Loved it"),
("2018-08-20", "23650892", "Matt", "Great apartment with all you need  great close nearby amenities easy access to public transport and Uber/taxi pick up/drop off points."),
("2018-08-28", "23650892", "Nathan", "A bright and spacious loft apartment. The decoration  styling was stunning. The bedrooms are awesome for the views and the comfort. The location is so user friendly  close to everything from great cafes for the morning brunch. To an array of restaurants for dinner. And easy access to the city. Best for people arriving via public transport. Puppy friendly  which meant our cavoodle was safe and comfortable too. "),
("2018-09-02", "23650892", "Avi", "Good communication"),
("2018-09-09", "23650892", "Nat", "Naveen’s place was amazing and we truly enjoyed her place! We were rarely in the apartment as we were out sightseeing  but definitely a great spot to relax and enjoy the views! Will return again soon!"),
("2018-09-16", "23650892", "Rachel", "Naveen’s apartment is amazing - very stylish & well located. We loved being able to unwind in Naveen’s apartment whilst still so close to wonderful restaurants & shopping  as well as being so close to the city! Naveen is a wonderful host and very responsive - thank you again for sharing your beautiful apartment with us :-)"),
("2018-09-19", "23650892", "Kate", "We attempted to stay here on business trip to Sydney. The apartment was not at all what we expected  there were blood stains on the sheets  hair left in the sink  grim on the shower floor and the toilets were dirty. Naveen was very unprofessional in her response to this and we ended up leaving because we felt very uncomfortable."),
("2018-10-01", "23650892", "Rhonda", "The apartment is comfortable and roomy. The location is amazing  just a short walk to Kings Cross station and very close to the city. Plenty of lovely cafes and restaurants very close by. Communication with host Naveen is excellent. Concierge service was excellent also."),
("2018-10-04", "23650892", "Angela", "Naveen's apartment in Darlinghurst is an absolute delight. So close to everything and incredible value. We felt at home there. We had a great stay with everything fun in Sydney at our doorstep. Five thumbs up."),
("2018-10-18", "23650892", "SoupedUp", "Hotel like concierge services  great Dalinghurst location. Pictures of accomodation are accurate.Could be a little cleaner  however nothing bad. Would recommend & would stay here again."),
("2018-10-21", "23650892", "Rebekah", "Fabulous place in a great neighborhood."),
("2018-10-23", "23650892", "Alan", "Amazing place. We really enjoyed our stay. I'll most definitely stay at Naveen's place again!"),
("2018-11-02", "23650892", "Rebekah", "Great location!  Close to transit  restaurants  pubs  shops  everything you need.  The apartment is spacious and beautifully decorated creating a very comfortable atmosphere.  Host responded to our needs very quickly.  The concierge staff at the front door were all very friendly and welcoming."),
("2018-11-16", "23650892", "Katie", "Great place  great host  great stay"),
("2018-11-30", "23650892", "Rolando", "Very nice and Creative arquitecture industrial design apartment High end range and oven   stainless steel kitchen counter . Two floor design with hard wood and steel staircase. I loved it.Naveen is so helpful  friendly and attentive.  The place needs deep cleaning  not the everyday clean that’s ok"),
("2018-12-03", "23650892", "John", "Clean  well appointed  very handy to food and transport. Gym on same floor as apartment is well equipped with a great view. Did not use pool just outside but a valuable additional facility. Naveen left coffee pods and tea bags etc and plenty of utensils for cooking. Caution to older people  it is a split level apartment so be prepared for steep stairs between bedroom floor and living area floor. The bed spaces are also sunken. Very comfortable big beds and plenty of power points. Concierge at ground floor entrance handles admission  very attentive service."),
("2018-12-09", "23650892", "Kirsten", "Naveen's place was absolutely beautiful! Perfect location in vibey Darlinghurst and close to Kings Cross Station and buses. Loads of restaurants nearby.Check in was super easy with the building concierge who also kindly kept our suitcases after check out when our flight was delayed.High end toiletries provided. Washing machine and dryer available. Gym on the same floor. Excellent communication. Only notable thing is that there is bottle collection early in the morning which didn't really bother us but if you're a light sleeper or wanting somewhere quiet then maybe stay outside the city.For the city slickers  this apartment is definitely an excellent spot!"),
("2018-12-13", "23650892", "Claude And Michael", "Location  Location  Location - with a great set of Concierge staff who are friendly and very helpful on a 24/7 basis - as is your host Naveen - who's very prompt in getting back to you if needed - and very important to us our Companion Dog was welcomed into a very pet-friendly building - Thanks Naveen"),
("2018-12-15", "23650892", "Samantha", "Stylish and roomy apartment with amazing restaurants on your doorstep."),
("2018-12-23", "23650892", "Monika", "房子蛮时尚的 但是我一个人住的确有点过大了｡整体还是喜欢的"),
("2018-12-30", "23650892", "Greg", "great communication  amazing location and pool area"),
("2019-01-05", "23650892", "Geon", "Great stylish accommodation. Great location. The host was responsive to questions prior to our arrival. I have no hesitation to return to this suite again in the future."),
("2019-01-19", "23650892", "Alice", "Naveen is a wonderful host  her apartment is very stylish and comfortable. Secure apartment for anyone wanting to stay close to the city  with just a short stroll to many cafes and places to eat!"),
("2019-01-25", "23650892", "Holly", "Naveen’s place was perfect for my family and I. Since I have children  I always prefer places with minimal carpets especially in the bedrooms and this is just what we need. Prior to our arrival  Naveen already informed me about the AC breaking down and she tried her best to offer solutions to make us feel as comfortable as we can.  We stayed the first night without AC in the middle of summer but it was ok since there’s a cool breeze at night. However  it does get loud especially with the window open but it is expected as with any convenient locations.  Naveen was super nice replied us promptly with any of our concerns. We enjoyed our stay there."),
("2019-01-30", "23650892", "Tara", "Great location and very easy to check in and out  concierge were great.The place is ideally located in Darlinghurst with shops and restaurants right outside  Coles and Woolworths are within a couple minute walk.It was great to have a place with a fully equipped kitchen and plentiful space  with the two levels and set up you don’t feel cramped and can comfortably hang out in the apartment without being on top of each other. Most other hotels in Sydney don’t have that luxury.Thanks for having us!"),
("2019-02-14", "23650892", "Pietro", "Great apartment-highly recommended."),
("2019-02-14", "23650892", "David", "Location is amazing although a busy noisy street all night but hey your in the center of it all and it’s expected."),
("2019-02-21", "23650892", "Kristen", "Naveen’s place was wonderful! The location is perfect to get to anywhere cheaply  especially by public transit. The air conditioning was not working when we arrived  however  Naveen had great communication and made sure we were comfortable during our stay. My only complaint would be that there was renovations going on within the building (which is out of Naveen’s control)  but we were unaware before we arrived and they were noisy and at one point were painting our door and elevators when we were trying to exit the apartment. Overall our stay was absolutely amazing and I would stay again!"),
("2019-02-22", "23650892", "Natasha", "Great location and at the heart of the city. Tap was broken when I got there but host was responsive and assured us it'll be fixed. There was miscommunication between us  the host  neighbours and reception regarding things stuck on the wall and late checkout but it got resolved in the end. There were a few roaches walking around that I suspect were from recent renovations to the apartment"),
("2019-03-04", "23650892", "Tayla", "Very stylish and spacious apartment in a perfect central location"),
("2018-12-25", "24169674", "Darren", "Great stylish place!Would definitely come again."),
("2018-04-29", "24187105", "Andrew", "Great spot by the beach."),
("2018-12-15", "24186748", "Lisa", "I can’t recommend this home highly enough.  It’s in a perfect location  close to shops and buses into town.The house itself is lacking NOTHING!It’s a lovely airy place with all the things you could need to just relax and chill."),
("2018-12-28", "24186748", "Polly", "An absolutely stunning house with everything you could possibly need. Our family had an amazing time and our children loved the pool. The house is brilliantly located!The host is fabulous to deal with - always contactable and super helpful!!"),
("2019-01-04", "24186748", "Angela", "We enjoyed our stay overall. On our first night (nye) we couldn't do our hair as there wasn't a hair dryer in the house  but Debbie dropped one off on the next morning. The linen on one of the beds had some stains  so we had to washed it before using it.The house is beautiful and is well located."),
("2018-04-26", "24365442", "Nathan", "Great place to stay. Very clean  close to public train system  shops  restaurants  and even a supermarket (Woolworths) a block away. Patricia is a great host and super friendly. Lots of history in this area and the locals will definitely have good conversations about it at local restaurants or bars. Very nice social part of town. My dad and I really enjoyed our stay here and highly recoment this location and host."),
("2018-05-06", "24365442", "Veronica", "We stayed in Patricia's beautiful terrace house in Erskineville for the weekend. It's a stunning home and the guest room on the top floor is very cute  clean and comfortable. The location could not be better – within easy walking distance to public transport  shops  cafes and bars  and cultural centres. Thanks so much to Trish and her gorgeous kids for having us!"),
("2018-07-22", "24365442", "Tim", "Great location  friendly host  lovely room and adorable cats ❤️"),
("2018-09-29", "24365442", "Dean", "Perfect place to stay. Amazing host and a more than ideal location."),
("2018-10-15", "24365442", "Ruari", "Amazing host. Lovely place  100% would go back!"),
("2018-10-28", "24365442", "Eva", "Patricia is a wonderful host  very warm and thoughtful. The beautifully decorated house is located right in the centre  short walk to king street with all the restaurants and shops. All communication was fast and clear. The cats were adorable. We enjoyed a our stay a lot !"),
("2018-11-03", "24365442", "Hanna", "Trish’s home was so lovely  clean and cute and close to everything! She was very nice and gave us tips on good local cafes. Would definitely stay here again and recommend to everyone! Thanks Trish :)"),
("2018-12-03", "24365442", "Dávid", "We were staying at Patricia's place for almost 2 weeks.  She was very kind and helpful the whole time. The house is 100 far from a supermarket. The trainstation is 5 min walk. By train the Cenral is also 5 min. (2 stops). Although its this close to the centre  the neighbourhood is very calm and peaceful. And the cat is very cute :). If we would go back  we would book at Patricia again."),
("2018-12-11", "24365442", "Trish", "Patricia's home is close to some amazing cafe's entertainment  public transport and it was so easy to stay there.  Patricia made us feel very at home and whilst we were out every day  walking  shopping  eating or just checking out Sydney  we felt very welcome at her home with the children. We very much enjoyed their company  along with their two cats!"),
("2018-12-30", "24365442", "Natalie", "Nice place and nice householder  cute kittens. Close to every famous points"),
("2018-12-31", "24365442", "Silvi", "Excellent host! Took great care of us  like we were family."),
("2018-04-30", "24413268", "Joanne", "很好很喜欢  房东是广东人  即使有一点小意外  但是房东的热情足矣抵消  从住宿到维多利亚女王大厦 中国城的路程不远 开车只有十几分钟 不过我每次出门都是打uber  总体来说还是值得推荐的望房东生意越来越好!"),
("2018-05-07", "24413268", "Monique", "Rooms were spacious and close to the harbour bridge and the Opera house for nice walks at night."),
("2018-05-13", "24413268", "Matthew", "Great location  very clean and tidy  and well priced. However there is a bit of construction that occurs out the front which may be an issue for people who like to sleep in  but on the whole we were very happy with our stay!"),
("2018-05-21", "24413268", "Lizzy", "Place was great but if you need to get a hold of the host for any reason at all you were screwed. Messaged them the first night of my week long trip there and never heard from them. Luckily it wasn’t anything majorly important but had to go buy my own towels."),
("2018-05-27", "24413268", "Lou", "Great location for vivid experience value for money"),
("2018-06-02", "24413268", "Kim", "Top location in Millers Point. Very clean and fresh  easy check-in  and host was accommodating with later check-out. Would stay again."),
("2018-07-05", "24413268", "Joe", "The host canceled this reservation 4 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-09-17", "24413268", "Rhiannon", "**HIGHLY RECOMMEND** Absolutely top location  great communication and affordable price"),
("2018-12-13", "24413268", "Sebastian", "Great place in the best location if you need to be near the CBD.  Would recommend anytime."),
("2018-12-15", "24413268", "Aimee", "Great place for a quick stay if you aren’t planning on being in the place for a long time. Appreciate the stay. Thanks"),
("2019-01-27", "24413268", "Anil", "The host canceled this reservation 10 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-04-23", "24360345", "Zee", "Excellent studio apartment to stay in."),
("2018-04-29", "24360345", "Linda", "Ian's airbnb was situated in a very convenient location. My friends and I booked the place for a concert at Hordern Pavilion and it was only a 10 minute Uber ride . It is very close to the city as well and parking was readily available. It was a very nice and cosy apartment to share with close friends. I would definitely book Ian's airbnb again for future events as well as recommend it to other people.TIP: when ordering an Uber  order it from downstairs and outside the building  its cheaper by $2 <3"),
("2018-05-12", "24360345", "Sarah", "Great location  close to shops and restaurants at East Village. Excellent  prompt communication and easy check-in and check-out."),
("2018-05-21", "24360345", "Deb", "Great value for money!"),
("2018-05-26", "24360345", "Estrina", "Thanks for hosting us Ian! The apartment is very spacious and location is really good. It’s quiet and near the airport. :)"),
("2018-06-06", "24360345", "Atul", "The place scores 4/5It was good in all termsTrain station was however a good 15 - 20 minutes walk"),
("2018-06-09", "24360345", "Raman", "Great value"),
("2018-06-17", "24360345", "DeAndre", "Great location   great place "),
("2018-06-21", "24360345", "Syazwanie", "Great hospitality   amazing house & very friendly :)"),
("2018-06-28", "24360345", "Qian", "apt位置很好 门口有篮球场 zetland交通都很方便 离超市餐馆都很近 很推荐"),
("2018-07-09", "24360345", "Richard", "離最近的Green Square火車站約15~20分鐘腳程 稍微遠一點點"),
("2018-07-12", "24360345", "Anthony", "Great place & great location!"),
("2018-07-20", "24360345", "Gordon", "Responble landlord"),
("2018-07-25", "24360345", "Yuyao", "The apartment is cozy and clean except the microwave doesn’t work and I think you can only take buses."),
("2018-08-05", "24360345", "Long", "Ian's place was amazing! Great neighbourhood with walking distance to shopping mall! Great host that gave clear and easy instructions! Highly reccomend!"),
("2018-08-10", "24360345", "Edwina", "Great apartment  Well located. Apartment had everything I needed. "),
("2018-08-13", "24360345", "Nan", "A nice place"),
("2018-08-17", "24360345", "Natalie", "A great place to stay. Ian is lovely and so responsive! The area is awesome and the apartment is lovely.. thanks so much Ian we will be back!!!"),
("2018-08-25", "24360345", "Gabriel", "Ian was a very good hostess. Her apartment is really nice. The neighborhood is safe and beuty."),
("2018-09-02", "24360345", "Wendy", "A quiet  comfortable apartment. Ian responds immediately to contact which I found very helpful."),
("2018-09-13", "24360345", "Shi", "Kevin and Ian are really great hosts! Communication with them was clear  quick and concise.They were so hospitable  they even checked up on us for last minute requests before our check-in.  Also  they provided us with detailed instructions which made check-in & out  a breeze.The apartment was immaculate. Exactly what we thought it would be.  Extra towels  linen and the little details such as name tagging the drawers made it extra special. The location of the apartment is amazing. Other than being relatively close to the city  it also has a mid sized shopping centre close by and public transport is everywhere.We will definitely book this place again."),
("2018-09-23", "24360345", "Nick", "Nice apartment in easy location between the airport and CBD (tourist areas). Hosts were good with communications and the place was clean."),
("2018-09-29", "24360345", "Jake", "Great place to stay  value for money."),
("2018-10-06", "24360345", "Xzzzy", "房东态度可以 但是房间卫生一般"),
("2018-10-14", "24360345", "Thomas", "Clean place  amenities available closeby  great host"),
("2018-10-28", "24360345", "HAOZHi", "The only problem is the air mattress needs to be fixed"),
("2018-11-11", "24360345", "Iris", "Bel appartement  bien équipé. L’immeuble est doté d’une piscine  un jacuzzi  un sauna et une salle de musculation. Nous avons passé un bon séjour. Je recommande."),
("2018-11-14", "24360345", "Pauline", "Great place to stay and easy access to the shops❤️"),
("2018-11-18", "24360345", "Kaitlyn", "Ian's place was very nice  in a good location and had everything we needed."),
("2018-11-22", "24360345", "Sharmila", "A great  light  bright  spacious  modern apartment  with all amenities  in a super location.Initially  on arrival  there were quite a few broken and run-down things that surprised us  like no security on the balcony door (!) and bedside lamps not working  etc  but Ian assured us he hadn't been aware of any of them and was most accommodating and managed to address them all promptly.We would definitely stay there again. Thanks Ian."),
("2018-11-24", "24360345", "Ritu", "Great location and value for money! A perfect space for 2 - very spacious. The swimming pool is lovely too. Would stay again!"),
("2018-11-29", "24360345", "Xie", "Great location. Very close to east village shopping center."),
("2018-12-02", "24360345", "Chirag", "I think it’s a decent stay just outside of the CBD  I think it can be a perfect stay if Ian and Kelvin could make a few changes. But apart from those both the guys have been really nice and humble and quick in communication. Check in was pretty straight forward and instructions were perfect."),
("2018-12-08", "24360345", "Jane", "Ian is a fantastic host who responds promptly and ensures everything is ready for his guests. The apartment was clean  comfortable and well-situated. We were able to easily walk to restaurants and public transport links. Overall we had a great stay!"),
("2018-12-28", "24360345", "Van", "The place was super convenient for me  especially since I booked last minute  but it felt a bit neglected. Could use some shine!"),
("2019-01-06", "24360345", "Felix", "Everything was perfectly fine and Ian always replied very fast !"),
("2019-01-12", "24360345", "Alessandro", "The flat is nice and matches the photographs perfectly with everything one might need. The awesome extra is the pool and hot tub which really help you unwind at the end of the day. The hosts  while never met personally  were organised and clearly take their 'job' to heart."),
("2019-01-17", "24360345", "Lisa", "Everything is what you expect and satisfactory but the tv was not working for my whole stay of four nights. I’m sure they will resolve it but it did have a negative impact on my stay."),
("2019-02-02", "24360345", "Jim", "Our very first ever AirBnB transaction.  Very adequate and as described. Great location-short walk to transit and area shops  cafes  restaurants  grocery store. Area can be noisy  but apartment is very quiet once balcony door is closed-no issues when sleepingBuilding itself was clean and very quiet-rarely did we see anyone else. Ian was generally quick to respond but not always as helpful as expected in resolving issuesAmenities were provided but minimal/sparseTV (one of our requirements) was problematic and was never really got resolved to our satisfaction. Apartment was generally clean but some areas could use additional attention. We were thinking of renting a car but didn’t. In hindsight it was a good move as street parking while available  free spaces weren’t plentiful.  Again  public transit was nearby and more than adequate. Nothing major that would prevent us recommending staying here to others."),
("2019-02-13", "24360345", "Amber", "Excellent communication and location. Would stay here again"),
("2019-02-22", "24360345", "Arhum", "Modern one bedroom apartment that offers a very comfortable stay  hosts are great and the place is clean  close to the airport and well maintained"),
("2018-06-05", "24477058", "Quan He", "The location is superb and the habour view around five docks is astounding."),
("2018-06-10", "24477058", "Nigel", "Great apartment. Great location. Perfect stay"),
("2018-07-14", "24477058", "Jenny", "Great little place. Great for a small family (our family of 5 was fine  but we were out alot so maybe better for 2 couples or a smaller family). Very clean and lovely bedding etc. Well worth the money. Great location in between city and where we had conference. Quick to respond as well as hosts that was great! Would recommend! "),
("2018-07-16", "24477058", "Christopher", "Everything was fine"),
("2018-07-19", "24477058", "Adrian", "Convenient location in the inner west.  Nicely appointed.  Host were nice to deal with. I recommend staying here."),
("2018-12-18", "24477058", "Sue", "Apartment is wonderful  and in great location - easy to get to the city and the west. Very close to the water and a great walking path nearby.  Quiet location. Undercover parking is very handy."),
("2019-01-05", "24477058", "Elodie", "Charlotte's apartment is very well located. You have a bus stop just nearby and the ferry is about 10 minutes walk (so you can reach Circular Quay after enjoying a 30 minutes ferry trip and admire Opera House).  It's quiet and not far from nice cafe in Chiswick.  Charlotte has provided everything needed and answered quickly.  I recommend."),
("2019-01-27", "24477058", "Carol", "The location is perfect and overlooking a large green space is very special"),
("2019-02-03", "24477058", "Curtis", "Epic place"),
("2019-02-08", "24477058", "Jenni", "."),
("2019-02-15", "24477058", "Romesh", "Brilliant host  timely communication and detailed check-in summary. Very nice and we'll maintained apartment. Excellent location with access to transport links."),
("2019-02-19", "24477058", "Damien", "Great place in a great location. Very spacious and very quiet!"),
("2018-06-04", "24498566", "Alex", "Felicity was communicative and pleasant  the room was clean  quiet and comfortable. I would recommend to other guests. "),
("2018-06-18", "24498566", "Georgia", "Beautiful room with a surprisingly lovely view  loads of sunlight in the room and such a comfy bed. The house is in such a great position  so close to Central and Surry hills  was sad to have had such a short stay. The stairs up to the room are very steep so make sure to watch your step! Thank you for a wonderful stay Felicity  I had a great time."),
("2018-04-18", "24460964", "Albert", "Thank you again for your hospitality and lovely accommodation!"),
("2018-04-19", "24460964", "Frankie", "Anton's place was absolutely perfect. Superb Sydney location  very clean and comfortable and good value for money. His communication throughout was exemplary and in turn was very helpful. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-04-20", "24460964", "Crystal", "The house was beautiful  the bed comfortable  the neighborhood quiet and extremely convenient to everywhere. Anton was a very friendly host throughout  all communications were very clear - all in all  one of my best experiences on airBNB!"),
("2018-04-30", "24460964", "Angie", "Anton was a perfect host. He was ready and waiting when I arrived and thoroughly took me through the apartment and building features! The apartment has lots of natural light and the decor is really well thought out. Really appreciated nice touches like some fresh fruit being provided as I arrived relatively late. All the appliances are new and the whole place was absolutely spotlessly clean. Couldn't ask for a better location  right next to all the conveniences of Elizabeth St and a short stroll away from the CBD. If you're coffee-inclined there are plenty of good cafes nearby and if you're alcohol inclined then there are lots of great bars too.  Will definitely be back  thanks Anton!"),
("2018-05-14", "24460964", "Mingming", "Although I did not meet Anton personally  I could feel his hospitality through email communication. He accommodated  our early check in request and was quick to respond. My family and I really enjoy our stay at his apartment. The apartment is also stylish and modern. I would definitely come back. Anton  Thanks for being flexible and responsive!"),
("2018-05-15", "24460964", "Jeremy", "Great location. Spacious apartment that was clean and comfy."),
("2018-05-23", "24460964", "Elaine", "I had a lovely 7 night stay in this accommodation while visiting with my sister and friend. The location was perfect  a short walk from the centre and close to the train for other trips. The amenities in the apartment were all in working order and included a washer and dryer. The jacuzzi bath was particularly luxurious. We would definitely return. Max and Anton were the perfect hosts."),
("2018-06-05", "24460964", "Andrew", "A great place to stay close to the city"),
("2018-06-11", "24460964", "Quang", "Good Location. Fair price. Full of amenities and facilities. The place is clean and well furnished with style. Check in and check out is easy. Would definitely stay here again for next Sydney trip"),
("2018-06-16", "24460964", "Samantha", "Amazing location and stunning apartment!!"),
("2018-06-23", "24460964", "Steven", "Great location  great value for 2 bedrooms in the city"),
("2018-06-24", "24460964", "Valentina", "The apartment is great!! So clean and just a few blocks from Central Station. Anton and Max were very friendly."),
("2018-06-27", "24460964", "Casey", "Handy spot for a quick work trip! My colleague and I stayed for one night and the place had everything we needed like speedy internet  a work desk and two decent bedrooms. The location right in the middle of city is really handy  plus easy access to Central train station. Only downside of this is that it is quite loud (as you are in the city and next to trains)  so if you are a light sleeper I recommend a pair of ear plugs or sleep in the bedroom that is away from the external wall. "),
("2018-07-04", "24460964", "Melissa", "Easy and central appartment  great communication and check in. Thanks. "),
("2018-07-07", "24460964", "Heidi", "This place is great location  very clean and tidy and the hosts were very easy to contact."),
("2018-07-12", "24460964", "Yuxuan", "It’s a fantastic place for living! Not far away from the train station and shopping center. 10 mins from Chinatown."),
("2018-07-18", "24460964", "Arijit", "A lovely apartment in a great location."),
("2018-07-24", "24460964", "Jinkylyn", "Great place and location is convenient."),
("2018-07-27", "24460964", "梁", "It’s really near China town!Good location!"),
("2018-07-28", "24460964", "Abigail", "Great place! Great location!"),
("2018-08-01", "24460964", "Peter", "My family and I stayed for 4 days. The apartment is in a fantastic location  just a short work from Central Station. The apartment was clean and had a great view of Elizabeth Street. No issues with the check-in and we were greeted and shown the facilities at the commencement of our stay. "),
("2018-08-04", "24460964", "梓锋", "Awesome location. Cannot find any apartment convenient than this house in Airbnb. It is very suitable for tourists who come to Sydney first time."),
("2018-08-11", "24460964", "Renate", "The apartment is in GREAT location (just a five-minute walk to the Central Station) and you can easily find some good Vietnamese and Thai restaurants in the area."),
("2018-08-12", "24460964", "Amanda", "A quaint space in a fantastic location! Very responsive and accommodating hosts. Would stay again but would pack ear plugs as the trains are quite noisy. Thanks Anton and Max!"),
("2018-08-18", "24460964", "Gary", "Would use again if we return to Sydney and want that side of town.Quieter than expected given right on Elizabeth St."),
("2018-08-20", "24460964", "Ali", "本次旅行最不满意的住宿 地理位置就不错 走5分钟去到中心站 楼下有便利店7仔 中心站出站有一家小型超市 可以满足简单需求 到世界购物中心要走10分钟｡但住宿条件不行 房间的灯很多不亮 整间屋只有卫生间有卷纸 厅里没有提供纸巾｡卫生间的干衣机里有很多衣物｡去时遇见一位女士开门交钥匙 她要求我们进屋要脱鞋 不可以穿鞋踩整屋地毯 觉得不太合理｡我订2天 第二天那位女士10点多过来敲门 进来后到处看 好像是检查我们似的｡wifi退房那天一醒来就上不了 估计改了密码｡太多不满意了 除了靠近中心站 其他选择需慎重｡"),
("2018-08-23", "24460964", "Harris", "Very nice apartment in a good area with lots of cafes and restaurants  close to the CBD as well."),
("2018-08-24", "24460964", "Jason", "Place was sparkling. Very convenient location. Kitchen and washer and dryer worked well. Check in and check out worked well."),
("2018-08-26", "24460964", "欣芮", "位置很好 沟通顺利 不错的民宿"),
("2018-09-01", "24460964", "维嘉", "Fantastic apartment with good location"),
("2018-09-04", "24460964", "Ashwin", "The location of the place is fantastic as it is very close to the central railway station etc. Visitors here can also stroll around Surry hills with variety of great restaurants  shopping malls  et al. However there were connectivity issues with the Wi-Fi in the apartment. Overall a good experience."),
("2018-09-11", "24460964", "Chin Heng", "location quite strategic   overall  satisfied."),
("2018-09-16", "24460964", "Karl", "A very comfortable and well located apartment with everything you would need to have an enjoyable stay!"),
("2018-09-21", "24460964", "Toni", "Great convenient location with everything either at your door or just around the corner.  Apartment was a bit sparse but had necessities  nicely decorated  clean sheets and all over generally. Host was really attentive when we needed them - thanks guys!"),
("2018-09-26", "24460964", "정민", "There is no information where to put garbage in the building."),
("2018-10-06", "24460964", "Samantha", "Anton's place is clean and comfortable and the location is great for exploring the city. 10/10  would recommend!"),
("2018-10-10", "24460964", "Porr", "Good space for who looks for location near Central station."),
("2018-10-18", "24460964", "Joe", "The washing machine is fantastic... Best we've experienced in over 10 Airbnb stays in Australia. Disappointed that the apartment has no microwave.  Lack of basic amenities such as paper towels  facial tissues  and wash cloths."),
("2018-10-23", "24460964", "Maddie", "Great location. 20 mins to Bondi 20 mins to airport 5 mins to closest train station 10 mins to city shops Lots of food places around / lots of options on uber eats. Very clean place and great fit for 1-4 people."),
("2018-11-06", "24460964", "Arash", "Thanks for the hospitality"),
("2018-11-13", "24460964", "Ka Hui", "The location is great and walking to distance to central station  Chinatown and CBD. House is clean. Only one negative point is microwave is not available on site."),
("2018-11-13", "24460964", "Roger", "Anton’s place is centrally located. Quick turnaround for communications as we coordinated early check in. Recommend!"),
("2018-11-16", "24460964", "Human", "The apartment’s location is very good. It is near the central station. We can go by foot for half a hour to every view spot."),
("2018-11-18", "24460964", "Meg", "AMAZING!!"),
("2018-12-12", "24460964", "Caitlin", "Super fast response from Anton! The location is incredible with only a 2 minute walk to central station and short cab rides (15 minutes no matter the direction) to major locations! The apartment was so clean and modern and just perfect! This will definitely become our go to when visiting Sydney!"),
("2018-12-15", "24460964", "Ben", "great location for the surry hills cafe and surrounding location. if sightseeing around the city it's a 40 minute walk to the rocks. the common area was a little on the small side"),
("2018-12-22", "24460964", "Lisa", "Great condition and it was a quite place!!"),
("2018-12-25", "24460964", "Hung", "It’s an amazing apartment! The couch turns into a sofa bed and there’s air conditioners on the roof. I would recommend this apartment to many people!"),
("2019-01-02", "24460964", "Turcu", "It's a good place to stay!"),
("2019-01-10", "24460964", "Bilal", "A clean place with a perfect location Big Bang for the buck"),
("2019-01-12", "24460964", "Vincent", "Great place right next the station and its clean"),
("2019-01-13", "24460964", "Przemyslaw (Paul)", "Awesome location and a really great host!"),
("2019-01-14", "24460964", "Joel", "Clean and comfortable  really solid location  and great beds. What more could you ask for?"),
("2019-01-19", "24460964", "Elliott", "Stylish and comfortable space in a great location"),
("2019-01-27", "24460964", "Jason", "Fantastic apartment.Location  facilities all great. Air con fought back the heat wave outside.We had a great 4 day break and Anton was a great host who let us arrive flexibly and fixed the kettle when it broke immediately.Couldn't fault it !!"),
("2019-01-30", "24460964", "Patrick", "What a great downtown Airbnb! 5 star unit and amazing communication with the host. Easy to get to get to and the area is a blast too  would definitely recommend"),
("2019-02-04", "24460964", "Krisia", "Very clean and comfortable apartment  hosts were very easy to communicate with."),
("2019-02-06", "24460964", "Michaela", "Anton’s place is right near Central Station and is great value. Lots of good little cafes nearby. The apartment has two tastefully decorated bedrooms with a new kitchen and city views. Beds were super comfy - thanks Anton for a great stay."),
("2019-02-11", "24460964", "우재", "Location is good갸굑댜비 뱔류안죻음 샤쥔이 2쀼게 나옴욕죠갸잇우나 뜨겨윤뮬이 오레쓔면 안냐엄"),
("2019-02-16", "24460964", "Carly", "Lovely clean apartment. Fantastic location. Four people stayed for 2 nights and would definitely stay here again"),
("2014-06-24", "2456142", "Petra", "We never met Dave and Debbie in person  however must say that they were very hospitable  even from a distance. We were welcomed with a bottle of wine and a fruit platter ... The flat is situated in a residential area that has great views on the city. Recommendable! "),
("2014-07-07", "2456142", "Sherlyn", "Staying at Dave's place was so pleasant!We were first greeted by a very friendly caretaker of the place when we drove in and immediately felt safe living there. Then  as we entered the house  everything that we saw was exactly like in the pictures.The living space is spacious  furniture is well put together  very functional and most importantly  the place is clean and cosy. We miss the place already.We especially like the kitchen and how well-stocked it was  letting us cook without much hassle. We could also do our laundry and hang our clothes to dry since it was winter.I would highly recommend Dave's place if you want a home away from home!You can also plug in your iPhone and bob to your own tunes. This place is fit for not only families but young people/couples who'd love a comfortable place to stay while on vacay."),
("2015-03-30", "2456142", "Franck", "We spent a week in Dave's place in Dover Heights and felt welcome; Dave provided helpful informations even if he wasn't there.The building in itself is not fantastic  a bit of packed upon and next to each other feeling but the apartment was like described. Kitchen fully equiped  nothing missing but not really convenient to use. for a salad or a breakfast ok. It will satisfy most people I guess.Also Good TV screen and Hi-Fi system  good bathroom etc.It was a quiet stay  away from traffic or any disturbing noises.We walk 20 minutes to get the boat stop in Rose Bay and the buses were less far. Many good eating options around and supermarkets.The place is in a ""good taste"" living area. "),
("2018-05-27", "24460520", "Paulo", "You can tell Julia is a superhost because of her attention to details. From small welcome cards to simple but carefully selected breakfast products.The location is great  just a quick walk away from Kings Cross station. Great appliances make the stay very comfortable and I thoroughly enjoyed the selection of teas and coffees offered.The apartment itself is very ""hygge""  a term we learned reading one of the books available. It's very cozy and the decoration along with the lightning is beautiful.Not only we stay here again but easily see ourselves living there.Thanks Julia!"),
("2018-06-01", "24460520", "Michał", "Julia was a caring host. Altough we have not met in person she was available online  giving us hints and information about restaurants etc.Place is just 5 minutes from metro station and eventhough its located close to bars & restaurants its calm and peaceful. Last but not least - the interior. Place is well designed - scandinavic minimalism (visible hygge concept influences)   a lot of space  nice lights  well equiped kitchen  new tv with (Hidden by Airbnb) chromecast so you can share your mobile screen on tv.  This is really a place you feel good in and cant wait to come back ;-)"),
("2018-06-03", "24460520", "Helen", "Nice  clean  compact space in the heart of Kings Cross. Bread  butter  jam  tea or coffee things were left for us which was a lovely touch. Thanks Julia!"),
("2018-06-08", "24460520", "강", "역과 가까이위치해 있어 너무 편했어요!그리고 편의시설을 보니 세심한 배려가 보였어요!"),
("2018-06-09", "24460520", "Erin", "A delightful apartment- close to everything but very quiet  spotlessly clean  lovely fresh towels and bedding."),
("2018-06-14", "24460520", "Jes", "This is a very cute apartment in a great location. Close to trains and only a 25 minute walk to the Botanic Gardens and the city. Would recommend!"),
("2018-06-16", "24460520", "Barb", "What an amazing place to stay!!So close to everything  cafes  restaurants  makets  train station as well as a short (15-20 mins) walk to the city  circular quay and oxford street.Comfy bed  good linen  nice and clean. Julia even had fruit  milk and cereal in the fridge. Awesome collection of records along with a player keeps us entertained most evenings.Julia checked in on us and gave us some awesome recommendations for eating out. 100% recommend  we will be back!!"),
("2018-06-19", "24460520", "Adam", "Thanks Julia  it was a very well designed and comfortable space to stay while we were in Sydney. "),
("2018-06-22", "24460520", "孟立", "House is very clean  and just walk 5 mins you can to train station!"),
("2018-06-28", "24460520", "Sean", "Excellent location very close to King's Cross train stations and walking distance from the various high profile sights in Sydney's harbour. Julia has a clean and tidy apartment with modern furnishings and great communication as a host. My only minor complaint was that the internet access was somewhat slow and spotty making it a bit tricky to plan the next day's activities so plan ahead."),
("2018-07-01", "24460520", "Daniel", "Great place and host. Highly recommended!!"),
("2018-07-15", "24460520", "Madeleine", "We had a lovely time at Julia’s! A quick walk from the train station  convenient to the city  beautiful comfort touches. Stay here :)"),
("2018-07-17", "24460520", "Daniel", "Very clean  well decorated  bright and comfortable space. Pretty roomy inside compared to other apartments in the area. Unbeatable location close to great cafes  Sydney harbour and transport. Contained within a pretty nice older building too  and very quiet at all times of day/night. Recommend."),
("2018-07-20", "24460520", "Priscilla", "The place was really nice and it was super easy to get around like going into the cbd and stuff. Will definitely come back when I’m visiting Sydney next time!!"),
("2018-07-22", "24460520", "Karena", "had a great stay in the airbnb! loved the interior design of the apartment!"),
("2018-07-26", "24460520", "Gemma", "Clean and in a great and happening location. I would stay here again whilst in Sydney for work"),
("2018-07-28", "24460520", "Paul", "Lovely apartment that was stylishly fitted out and very tidy. Some quirky little touches with a record player and access to a roof terrace. The apartment is ideally located in Potts Point  is very private and we appreciated the peace and quiet the apartment afforded. Highly recommended."),
("2018-08-04", "24460520", "Nicole", "If you need an Air B n B in Sydney book this place! It was perfect for our stay  excellent location you are 5 minutes from the subway or could even walk into the city. The place itself is clean and has everything you will need. We loved this air B n B! "),
("2018-08-08", "24460520", "Chelsea", "Great value for money  perfect location! Everything you need for a Sydney getaway! "),
("2018-08-10", "24460520", "Charles", "Great location  walking distance from Kings Cross. Having (Hidden by Airbnb) chrome on the TV was handy for watching Netflix and the apartment was very well maintained."),
("2018-08-19", "24460520", "Phoebe", "Great studio apartment in central location near public transport in Sydney. Sparkling clean on arrival and thoughtful touches."),
("2018-09-06", "24460520", "Emily", "A great place to stay  clean  in a great location and very comfortable. I really enjoyed my stay and would definitely stay again."),
("2018-09-10", "24460520", "Zakariya", "Très bonne appartement avec un style new-yorkais. L’emplacement est très sécurisé et le quartier est nickel. Je recommande les yeux fermés cet appartement."),
("2018-09-13", "24460520", "Marie-Sophie", "The apartment was great. It was decorated very lovely and everything you need for a stay in Sydney is there. Besides this the apartment is very clean und you feel home very easily. It is close to the city center and easy to walk to all important places in Sydney. I would recommend this place for everybody."),
("2018-09-17", "24460520", "Shunya", "This place is best accommodation in Sydney."),
("2018-10-06", "24460520", "Patrick & Alison", "This is a lovely apartment  perfect for our weekend in Potts Point. Beautifully styled  impeccably clean  great use of space and with many thoughtful touches from Julia. Communication always prompt and helpful and a great location - peaceful and tucked away  but right near to great bars and cafes. Highly recommended."),
("2018-10-09", "24460520", "Gerard", "Lovely place in a great location.Will definitely use this as our base n Sydney again"),
("2018-10-14", "24460520", "Jason", "Julia’s place is very clean   cosy and in a great location. Easy to check in and out . Would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-10-19", "24460520", "Lindy", "This was the perfect place to stay. Quiet  clean  close to public transport and the city. The apartment was lovely and very comfortable. Definitely stay again next time."),
("2018-10-22", "24460520", "James", "Great location  everything you need was provided."),
("2018-10-25", "24460520", "先生", "The house was very private and well equipped  and we had an unforgettable evening."),
("2018-10-30", "24460520", "Manon", "Julia’s flat was perfect to discover Sydney in 2 days  located in a lovely neighbourhood  close to everything by foot and so well equiped and decorated. Will come back without any hesitation."),
("2018-11-11", "24460520", "Natasha", "Julia’s place was exactly as pictured and described! Very well put together house  we joked that we wanted to decorate our apartment like it when we got back. The amenities Julia kindly left us were a very nice touch and much appreciated! Everything about Julia’s airb&b is very cozy  from the towels to the bedding. The location is unbeatable with the opera house only 20 minutes away! A very nicely located apartment. If you get the chance I would 100% recommend!"),
("2018-11-13", "24460520", "Collin", "this place was great but heed Julia's warning about parking. we rented a car because we were going to drive South one day but it can be pretty expensive to park in the city ($40+ a day). if you can Uber or walk  I definitely recommend this place. Julia is an awesome host!"),
("2018-11-18", "24460520", "Mia", "Fantastic apartment! Great location and amenities (with many thoughtful touches) Julia was a wonderful host  incredibly prompt and very helpful. Would highly recommend staying here."),
("2018-11-25", "24460520", "Jana", "Perfect location  stylish apartment. Great breakfast spots on that street-glider  holm. Hope I can come back to Sydney one day."),
("2018-11-27", "24460520", "Moritz", "Beautiful Apartment!!! Super tidy and clean  easy Check-In  awesome location - just a comfortable walk to opera house and CBD. A lot of fantastic restaurants in the area. Hop-On/Off Tour-Bus has a stop in 3 minutes walking distance to the unit. Love this place and would definitely come back !"),
("2018-12-10", "24460520", "Kamie", "Julia's place sits in a great location with a short walk to everything you'll need. Communication was prompt and the self check in process easy. There was everything I needed for the couple of days I was there and I'd definitely stay there again."),
("2018-12-17", "24460520", "Matías G", "Julia appartment is just fantastic. It has everything you need and it’s confy and nice as the photos. Thank you very much Julia for a really nice stay and if we ever come back to Sydney will be at your lovely place. :-)"),
("2018-12-21", "24460520", "Matteo", "Julia’s flat is beautiful and perfectly functional for short or long stays. We enjoyed the outstanding location near Kings Cross  the kitchen/bathroom amenities  and the extra comfy bed!"),
("2019-01-01", "24460520", "Mia", "Second time staying at this fantastic apartment. Julia is an amazing host  with great knowledge about the local area with a functional apartment in a great location. Will certainly stay here again - 10/10 accom!"),
("2019-01-09", "24460520", "Scott", "A great stay at Julia’s!The location was brilliant as a base for exploring the city and for local amenities. The apartment is lovely inside  a comfortable home from home on holiday. Julia was a great host and replied quickly to the questions we had  despite the fact she was on holiday herself! Would definitely stay here again."),
("2019-01-13", "24460520", "D & J", "PROS: Fantastic location in one of our favorite neighborhoods in Sydney  clean flat  not cluttered.CONS:This was a last minute booking  booked on the day as we had enquired about checking in the following day but as it was sitting empty we decided we may as well go ahead and switch rather than extend our current place as we had to check out the next day when the owner was returning period since the flat was sitting empty  as hosts ourselves  we figured they would probably be glad to get an extra night stay and additional money  but instead she acted as if she was doing us a favour.We had requested to leave our bags with the cleaner as we were checking out at 11am from our current flat at the time - knowing the cleaner would be at this flat prior to 3 preparing it for us (we wanted to put perishables in the refrigerator). We were told no  that we could not drop our bags  for the cleaners safety. This was very strange since we have hundreds of reviews  have been hosting an Airbnb in Manhattan and other cities for nearly 10 years  are superhosts (not to mention one of us is an NYC attorney  weighs 93 lbs/42 kilos and only owns 5 inch plus heels and dresses and such and looks quite dressed up and out of place in Sydney to begin with  I only wear fitted trousers and loafers  so neither of us exactly look like the sort that would be intimidating any cleaners)  and since we are Airbnb hosts/guests. She stated that clearly we must understand this ourselves  so we replied that we absolutely always (at no additional charge) do our best to accommodate guests checking in early or checking out late  and that even on same day turns  we do this  and we absolutely always allow people to drop off their bags even before the cleaner has cleaned or if she is there so that they don’t have to carry them around with them and may enjoy their limited time in the cities in which we host (mind you on two continents).She continued to state that surely we understand  which obviously we made clear that we did not  but okay  we will drop our bags at the 3 pm check-in time and sit around with them nearby until then.We then checked in and realized no fans were provided. There is a ceiling fan in the bedroom but the living room gets no circulation at all (faces a wall)  so on hot days and nights it gets very stuffy. Also  it is a pocket wifi  not a proper modem  so do not expect great wifi. We continually received error pages  directing us to the internet providers information site (ie the sort you get if you haven’t paid your bill or have run out of data). Annie states in her informational section in the flat and on Airbnb the Wi-Fi is quite poor in Australia and Sydney  but we visit Sydney every year and usually rent a townhouse in Paddington (unfortunately has been sold since last year and this was a very last minute New Year’s Eve trip)  and obviously had switched from another flat which was just a five minute walk away  and have never had any issues with Wi-Fi previously.The host did send us a partial refund for this  upon a few reminders (I should add that she had stated when we checked in that we could extend a day  as they had an empty day before their next booking  but then after we had complained about the Wi-Fi and she offered us ~US$35 as a credit  she stated that we could not extend a day  and that is when we again reminded her about the WiFi credit extended  as we had planned to put it towards our additional day). The roof is not really usable  as it is so small with a giant laundry hanging rack that fills the majority of it and the rest is filled with a table  so the one time we tried to use it  it was pretty awkward as if anyone else is up there  not only is all the space taken but it’s kind of awkward to have to say sorry and turn right back around as you basically walk right into them. Plus they’re over your head (the flat is on the top floor)  so you hear them walking around and moving the table and such  but obviously sound isn’t a huge issue coming from Manhattan. There isn’t a view by any means  so we really missed the roof we’d moved from. Finally  Annie  the manager  messaged us the day prior to leaving just to remind us we had to be out by 10am. Sorry  but not only is 10am early (which didn’t matter as we had a flight to catch anyway)  but messaging on your final day kind of puts you in a bad mood telling you to be out so early (and not politely either). As hosts  we always message the morning of check out  so as to respect the fact that guests might be trying to enjoy their final day and don’t want to sour any final time.  Its a shame other hosts can be so rigid and inhospitable  in so many ways."),
("2019-01-26", "24460520", "Derek", "Julia’s place was great for my stay!  It was easy to get to by public transport from the airport and nicely located near the CBD and other areas.  While it did get warm during the day  you should be out exploring! And it cooled down nicely with the fan on and window open at night.  It was exactly as presented and a great spot for my first visit to Sydney.  Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2019-02-05", "24460520", "Laura", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay in this stylish  comfortable apartment in a wonderful area of Sydney. We had been a bit concerned about the location before we arrived  but it turned out to be a close walk from the apartment to a nearby train station to get around town or out to Bondi Junction and the beach  and it's also located close enough to the CBD/harbor that we were able to enjoy a comfortable walk home from the Opera House and through the Botanical Gardens one day. The Potts Point neighborhood has loads of great restaurants and shopping as well. The apartment was very comfortable  with everything we needed to prepare our own meals  and many of the products in the home were natural and/or organic  which we appreciated. Julia was also extremely easy to communicate with  and responded to messages quickly - we had an issue one day with the WiFi connection and she had it corrected in less than 10 minutes. We thoroughly enjoyed our time in Sydney  and a large part of it was our stay in this apartment - we would not hesitate to book here again!"),
("2019-02-11", "24460520", "Kim", "Julia's place was really nice  well set out  light and was really comfortable. Special touches around. Would have been even better with aircon  however we survived with the fans :)"),
("2019-02-21", "24460520", "David", "Nice place in a good location for getting around Sydney."),
("2018-05-21", "24608152", "Suzette", "Fabulous host that made us feel very welcome and quickly assisted with anything we needed to feel comfortable. Great value for money. Great sunrises every morning from the lounge room."),
("2018-06-08", "24608152", "Felix", "Godelieve is a very kind women and staying in her place was really nice. I highly reccomend this house  spacious and cosy. Great for relax and enjoy a great time near the beach and shops."),
("2018-08-25", "24608152", "Natalie", "It was ok."),
("2018-09-26", "24608152", "Mathew", "Great location! Close to the beach and shopping areas. The apartment has everything you need to enjoy your stay and Godelieve is very hospitable. Overall great stay!"),
("2018-10-19", "24608152", "Adam", "Good location nice views."),
("2018-11-19", "24608152", "Mark", "Nice  quiet place to stay with good amenities."),
("2018-12-05", "24608152", "Debbie", "Our employees enjoyed staying at this property.  It was close to where they were working in the area and we would definitely look at booking again if the need arose.  Both Godelieve and Tam were very accommodating when we needed to extend our booking on a couple of occasions so that was very helpful to us."),
("2018-12-17", "24608152", "Alex", "A beautiful and relaxed place to stay. Very comfortable and Godelieve is a very welcoming  generous and kind host. The view from the balcony is beautiful & although the pool is shared & Godelieve lives upstairs it feels very private. Godelieve was very kind lending us toys for our 3 young boys and trying to get us a wooden cot for our ongoing stay in Sydney to take with us. Would recommend as a great and relaxing  place to stay and explore the northern beaches."),
("2018-12-22", "24608152", "Julie", "Great views of Dee why beach and a lovely pool. Walk to beach and shops. Host was lovely and helpful with everything and quick to respond. Thanks for the lovely stay"),
("2019-01-03", "24608152", "Sarah", "Really lovely stay in Dee Why at Tam’s property .The pool and outdoor lounge area was ideal for my parents to relax in the evening sun .Thanks for all your hospitality :) Thanks   Sarah"),
("2019-01-09", "24608152", "Sandy", "The place was neat and the pool was lovely. Beds were very comfortable with plush pillows and linen. We had internet access and brought our own devices as no TV for evening movies. Did share the unit with a few 8 legged friends but to be expected as this is Australia. A short walk or drive to the beach and restaurants. Godelieve was kind and as she shares the pool and lives upstairs  she was respectful of our privacy.  Thank you for our lovely stay at your place."),
("2019-01-15", "24608152", "Bianca", "The place was very clean and well stocked with a few personal touches.  The pool is amazing to have  especially with children.  Bright and airy with the doors and windows open and beds were pretty comfortable."),
("2019-01-19", "24608152", "Jenny", "Our family has been made to feel very welcome at Godelieve’s place  Godelieve was extremely accommodating when we needed to check in a few days earlier and was also very accommodating when tiger air cancelled our flight we needed to change or checkin time  she made a stressful situation all good again.  Tam who looks after the property is also extremely helpful for any questions we had before and during our stay.  The location is perfect and apartment very clean and comfortable  the pool right outside is perfect for cooling off and outdoor furniture great for the warm evenings by the pool.  It has everything needed and more for our families needs! Thanks again Godelieve and Tam :)"),
("2019-01-25", "24608152", "Jenny", "Extended our stay  great location all as discribed  great host happy to answer any questions  great place for family or couples with everything you need for a perfect home away from home  highly recommend this as a base to explore the northern beaches..... if you can pull yourself away from the pool :)"),
("2019-02-04", "24608152", "Christian & Kirsty", "Third time we’ve stayed  and enjoyed it again. The kids loved the pool. Check in and check out and communication very easy. Would definitely stay again."),
("2019-02-09", "24608152", "Hayley", "Great location in Dee Why. Slow communication before check in resulted in the cleaners being there when we arrived  but that wasn't a big problem."),
("2019-02-15", "24608152", "Peter", "We had a great stay! Pool is lovely and apt is located in lovely area in northern Sydney. Definitely recommend!"),
("2018-05-09", "24735200", "Alejandra", "Natalia is a great host  I would definitely recommend staying at her place. The unit is very clean  wifi works perfectly. The room is big and the location amazing  walking distance to Coogee Beach."),
("2018-05-27", "24735200", "Kev", "I had a fantastic stay at Natalia's apartment. Great location and great host. I highly recommend it!"),
("2018-05-12", "24660064", "Laure", "We spent two weeks in this apartment really well located. Stephen was really helpful and replied really quickly to all of our questions. The apartment was really clean when we arrived. It is located near to the Harbour Bridge (10min walking) where you can have a really nice view on the Opera House. It was really easy to go to the CBD by the train  Milsons Point station is only 10min walking (and then 1 stop to go to Town Hall) or you can still walk on the bridge to go to Circular Quay.  The kitchen is really well furnished with a big fridge  microwawe  oven  and gas hotplate. We had a really good time  the area is really quiet  some convenience stores are really close to the apartment and there is a COLES and ALDI in North Sydney around 10min walking. I think it's one of the best whole apartment you can find in Sydney regarding quality/price/location. Thanks again Stephen!"),
("2018-05-21", "24660064", "Tom", "Great place  located just 5 minutes north of the sydney bridge  you can walks across to south sydney in 15/20 mins (all along the bridge so its a nice walk!). Very clean  all the facilities you would need! Would recommend and stay again!"),
("2018-05-24", "24660064", "Kaytlin", "This was a great place and great location! Had everything we needed  in the kitchen  bathroom and even had cheap laundry! Stephen was an awesome host! Met us and did a walk through  explained everything and was super easy to get a hold of for anything! Definitely recommend staying here :)"),
("2018-06-19", "24660064", "David", "Good value and good location.  Happy to recommend."),
("2018-07-02", "24660064", "Marianne", "Great location and good value."),
("2018-07-09", "24660064", "Rune", "great place and great location"),
("2018-07-13", "24660064", "Warren", "Thank you Stephen  great apartment centrally located  great value for money."),
("2018-07-16", "24660064", "Samantha", "The apartment is located in a beautiful and quiet neighborhood  but only takes 10-15 minutes to walk across the bridge to the busier side of town. Stephen was very quick to respond with questions and made sure we knew where to find things like extra towels and blankets. He was also very accommodating  as we arrived early. The people living in the area were also incredibly friendly. We encountered a couple of neighbors  all of whom were very kind and welcoming  and even provided good suggestions for things to do in the area. The Flying Bear is just by the park  and has excellent views of the harbor- definitely check it out!It was a little chilly at times  but a space heater was provided. "),
("2018-08-02", "24660064", "Shaan", "This apartment was everything that I needed  nice and quiet and close to public transport (a short walk to Milson's Point or Ferry). Stephen was awesome and communication was quick and efficient  great value for money as well."),
("2018-08-11", "24660064", "Josephine", "Great communication as Stephen responds really quickly! Location is superb and the apartment is definitely worth the value. I’d totally recommend!"),
("2018-08-17", "24660064", "Erick", "It was the perfect place. Very near to many tourist spot.I will definitely chose this place again if I have the opportunity to come again to Sydney."),
("2018-08-29", "24660064", "Tarson", "Excellent place. Highly recommend this place for everyone."),
("2018-08-31", "24660064", "Sergio Andrés", "Affordable place to stay in SYD  I'll go back."),
("2018-09-11", "24660064", "Allison", "This property is reasonable value for $Loved the location and the sun light streaming into the unit. Lovely and peaceful and a good size apartment.If you’re ok with a worn lounge and a shower head that does wet you but not much else ... then give this one a go ... afterall it’s got to be one of the cheapest around so we were ok with these little problems.The hosts provided an efficient friendly service ... so thank you :)Allison and Daniel"),
("2018-09-18", "24660064", "Jolene", "This is very nice place to stay for a short trip to Sydney! You can cross the Harbor Bridge by foot  train or bus. There is also a ferry terminal nearby but you need to check the schedule first. Thank you Stephen for opening up your place on Airbnb."),
("2018-10-09", "24660064", "Alex", "Great place for a business trip with everything needed"),
("2018-10-14", "24660064", "Daniel", "Clean and plenty of room. Good value."),
("2018-10-29", "24660064", "Kirsty", "Check in was easy and great communication. Apartment is as described. Location is great  lovely quiet area but very easy to get around."),
("2018-11-05", "24660064", "Breanna", "Great place  really spacious for the location and the price."),
("2018-11-13", "24660064", "Jennifer", "Spacious apartment in a very promising location  near to the ferry to circular quay  with beautiful Jacarandas in full view down the streets. However  more pride has to be taken in the maintenance and cleanliness of the apartment."),
("2018-11-17", "24660064", "Tania", "Fantastic location and easy to access. Stephen is a professional and knows how to meet expectations. This unit is basic - but this is clearly described in the advertisement so we knew what to expect. Very clean and very quiet. Firm but comfortable mattress. This is our second stay with Stephen - we are in Sydney regularly and will only book through him. Many thanks"),
("2018-11-21", "24660064", "Serena", "Nice place and perfect location!!"),
("2018-11-25", "24660064", "Clara", "The location were great! Super Easy to take the train or the ferry in to town. The bed was hard  but overall our stay was nice!"),
("2018-11-30", "24660064", "Tania", "Loved my stay here. Great location well secured apartment with a very home-like feel to it. It's super close to the North Sydney Ferry station. Really enjoyed my stay here and definitely recommend this place for your next visit to Sydney."),
("2018-12-21", "24660064", "Elzzy", "The place was good close to everything Host was great iwill come back again."),
("2019-01-03", "24660064", "Peter", "The apartment has all you need and the location is very good."),
("2019-01-12", "24660064", "Elzzy", "It was a nice place to stay"),
("2019-01-21", "24660064", "Jose", "This North Sydney apartment is very convenient and well located  with nearby Ferry  train  buses and shops and restaurants. Stephen's welcome and attention is good and efficient. I would definitely come back here and recommend the apartment to any visitors."),
("2019-02-06", "24660064", "Bee", "Excellent apartment. Quiet and in a lovely area. A few more fans would be good but we loved it. Thanks Stephen "),
("2019-02-10", "24660064", "Luke", "Great location. Good little place"),
("2019-02-20", "24660064", "Brenda", "Alert! We give honest reviews!!! This place was booked because of the location and other reviews. We came to Australia to celebrity our 25 th wedding anniversary  trip of our life!  We were checked in with Steve who was very accommodating and pleasant. He pointed out that the carpet is old but clean. It really does have ripples in it from being so old. I thought  no biggie  we can live with that. Over the course of the first 24 hours of our stay many more red flags surfaced. You cannot turn on the hot water in the kitchen if anyone is using the shower- immediately it goes cold. The oven is weird  no directions on how to use it either. The kitchen floor is not tacked down! Looks lovely in the pictures but it is just splashed down. I walked on it in my bare feet and it came up! Underneath is disgusting!  The carpet in the bedroom has a big burn mark in it  which was covered by a bath mat. The bed is hard  not comfortable at all. There was an air mattress on top of the cabinet in the bedroom but it’s too small for the bed. The couch is good looking but has painful springs poking up in 2 cushions. One odd thing is in the bedroom there are side table on either side of the bed  which is nice. The dresser is tucked into the corner  but the side table makes it impossible to open the bottom drawers of the dresser. Awkward!  The kitchen utensils were disgusting and we had to wash everything before we used it.  The cabinet under the sink is awful as well. We hope this place improves because the location is wonderful."),
("2018-05-28", "24848349", "Mikhayla", "Enjoyed my stay  fantastic location   excellent host. "),
("2018-06-02", "24848349", "Luigi", "The host canceled this reservation 212 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-06-17", "24848349", "Lin", "Carol and Ian were lovely hosts who went to great trouble to ensure I had a good stay  including a local area guide   a heater and bathroom toiletries. "),
("2018-08-05", "24848349", "April", "We definitely do recommend staying here! Carol is so lovely and friendly. She greeted us in person at Museum train station which is an extremely convenient location. Her place is only 2-3 mins walk from the station and about 5 mins walk into Hyde Park. The room was very comfortable - lots of pillows  and she even gave us water and cookies! Ian was also very kind to us and gave us suggestions on transport around Sydney. The bathroom was also very modern and clean. Also no issues with check in and communication. Very responsive. "),
("2018-08-24", "24848349", "Paul", "What a great experience - thanks Carol and Ian for your warm and welcoming hospitality. I had a wonderfully easy and relaxing stay. I look forward to seeing you both again."),
("2018-09-28", "24848349", "Chun Kit", "I would recommend Carol and Ian’s place to everyone"),
("2018-09-30", "24848349", "Abigail", "Great night away with my partner! Very welcoming and friendly hosts! They went out of their way for us and we really appreciated it. 10/10 from us. We will be back  thank you!"),
("2018-10-07", "24848349", "Wei-Lin", "房東非常的有耐心和友善 家裡非常乾淨 窗外也有很美的景色 最棒的是位置在市中心很方便 非常推薦大家入住!"),
("2018-10-20", "24848349", "Liam", "Carol and Ian's place is perfect. Location on Oxford Street is central to the city  trains  and great restaurants. The apartment is neat and modern  with fantastic views of the city. The hosts are lovely people that are great to talk to but also respect your privacy. I'd stay at Carol and Ian's place again."),
("2018-10-20", "24848349", "Niamh", "I stayed for one night only - place is well located and is a lovely clean apt. Room doesn’t have a lot of space but overall I enjoyed my stay and would stay again."),
("2018-10-29", "24848349", "佳航", "Carol and Ian did really good job! We do enjoy this trip! They provide best services and give us very useful travel advice!  Definitely recommended! Great thanks!非常棒的一次体验!Carol and Ian真的是超级棒的房东!他们人非常好 很亲切 就像朋友一样!他们热情好客!给我们推荐了很多可以去的地方 还在第一天告诉我们怎么机场到住处的火车 而且Ian还专程去车站接我们!总之在他们的帮助下一切顺利!Carol是非常亲切又漂亮的女房东 她感觉很温柔 有一天早上还为我们准备了早茶!房间超级干净!一切井井有条!房间窗外的景色也不错 阳台上有个懒人沙发 可以在哪里看看风景!他们简直太棒了!非常非常难忘的一次入住体验!强烈推荐!地址位置也很好 就在city那边 唐人街什么的走路几分钟就到了!很感谢他们!"),
("2018-11-13", "24848349", "Isla", "Incredible hosts! Ian and Carol went above and beyond to make my stay enjoyable and comfortable. They are real authentic people who genuinely care about your stay and experience with them. Will be back."),
("2018-11-23", "24848349", "Bora", "they are really good host who cares guest. Carol and Ian  they always cares about you The location is perfect to go anywhere in sydney. Hype park  surry hills  town hall  and so on. Plus  the apartment area is quite queit at night. so no worry about noisy sounds! I definitely recommend this house for all people :)"),
("2018-11-29", "24848349", "Margot", "Fantastic hospitality and great location.  Carol and Ian are great hosts and made us feel like old friends visiting.  Highly recommend as the place to stay when visiting Sydney CBD"),
("2018-12-05", "24848349", "Gavin", "Thank you Ian & Carol for your hospitality and hosting. Thoroughly enjoyed our time in Sydney and felt very comfortable in your home. Want to mention how convenient the location was and how helpful you were in getting us around town & picking up from the train too! If we come to Sydney together I’d like to stay there again! Thank you so much!"),
("2018-12-10", "24848349", "Alicija", "Would like to say a big thank you to both Carol and Ian for their hospitality. They are terrific hosts  who truly go out of their way to make your stay the best it can be. The location of their home is perfect; everything was super easy to get to  whether that be by walking or public transport. Would definitely recommend staying at their home! I'm sure we will be back soon! :)"),
("2018-12-26", "24848349", "Jihye", "숙소가 정말 좋았어요! 시드니가면 무조건 다시 여기로 잡을거에요. 깨끗하고 위치도 너무 좋고  조식이랑 과일도 늘 있어서 편하게 먹었어요. 집 시설도 되게 깔끔하고 좋았습니다. 테라스에서 일정 끝나고 맥주마시는 것도 짱이에요! 무엇보다 호스트분들이 인생 호스트였습니다. 비내리는날 직접 역안으로 데리러 와주시고 우산도 씌워주시고  짐도 들어주셨어요. 친절 보스였어요!!!!❤️"),
("2018-09-14", "24858356", "Susannah", "I loved staying at this adorable apartment. The location is amazing  literally metres to the beach and handy to everything. The apartment is modern  clean and very well equipped  I had everything I needed for a perfect getaway in Bondi.The bed was super comfortable and the kitchen and bathroom are immaculate.But the best part was waking up  walking outside and having gorgeous Bondi Beach at my doorstep.Heavenly! Thank you Natasha  I will be back."),
("2018-09-26", "24858356", "Ian", "Stunning apartment in a perfect location. Right next to Bondi Beach and easy access to everything you need. Apartment was totally kitted our. And the hosts were extremely accommodating. Would definitely stay again."),
("2018-10-13", "24858356", "Naoisa", "This is the perfect location in Bondi! If this apartment is available for your chosen dates I highly recommend it. Beautiful space  perfectly clean  incredible location  rooftop with a view of the beach and Bondi Icebergs - everything you could possibly need. Natasha could not have done more for us  going above and beyond as our host and her local insights meant we had the best recommendations for Bondi and throughout Sydney. I will definitely stay here again on my next trip to Bondi! Thanks Natasha :)"),
("2018-10-29", "24858356", "Nicola", "Natasha was extremely helpful and responsive to any communication. When we arrived there were thoughtful touches such as fresh flowers and a lovely bottle of chilled wine.The apartment had everything we needed and was comfortable and very clean.Natasha offered good advice about the area and local amenities and restaurants. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay and found the apartment to be in an excellent position for visiting Bondi  catching buses and eating out.The only slight negative about our stay was the noise from traffic and other residents chatting in the corridor early in the mornings which made earplugs necessary- however we realise you can’t have the convenience of being near to a bus stop and amenities without hearing the traffic noise!"),
("2018-11-06", "24858356", "Jessica", "Lovely apartment and perfect location  Natasha was very kind. I highly recommend this place"),
("2018-11-15", "24858356", "Nathalie", "Great location Great hostGreat town"),
("2018-11-19", "24858356", "Daniella", "The place was an AMAZING location! Natasha gave some great local tips and made check in/checkout seamless. Would HIGHLY recommend."),
("2018-11-22", "24858356", "Jason", "Great host that is hospitable and caring.  Place is nice  clean  fully equipped  and conveniently located.  Prompt responses and wanted to check up on my status. Very important for solo travelers. Great price for location.  When in bondi  stay at natasha's studio.Jason"),
("2018-11-28", "24858356", "Jeff", "Amazing location and Natasha was the perfect host.  Showed me around  left me some food and a bottle of wine... couldn't ask for any more.  I'll be back."),
("2018-12-09", "24858356", "Sam", "Natasha was an exceptional host and we really enjoyed our stay! The place was stylish  metres from the beach and very cozy. Natasha did a fantastic job at communicating with us  she helped us find the best restaurants  bars  must see spots and was a wonderful host. I would absolutely recommend Natasha’s suite - it was perfect! "),
("2018-12-21", "24858356", "Rohan", "Lovely host. Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2018-12-29", "24858356", "Sam", "Place is in amazing location  right near the beach and the many cafes  restaurants and bars nearby. The perfect place for a getaway. Natasha was incredibly friendly and helpful and made the process smooth from start to finish. Highly recommend!"),
("2019-01-03", "24858356", "Aoife", "Natasha was an excellent host  and exceeded our expectations and provided a great start to our stay with nice little touches! Would definitely recommend this place to friends "),
("2019-01-13", "24858356", "Danielle", "Natasha and Johnny made our stay so easy. The place was immaculate and the location is epic! Very easy to communicate with and the little extra touches didn't go unnoticed. Thanks again   we will definitely be back!"),
("2019-01-19", "24858356", "Markus", "We stayed in this lovely apartment for one week and had a fantastic time! Natasha is a wonderful host  welcomed us with a bottle of wine  shared a lot of recommendations for restaurant and activities with us and was always very responsive. The apartment has a perfect location right next to the bondi beach. There is also a rooftop with a fantastic view and the bus station to the city center is just in front of the apartment. The apartment itself is very modern  cozy and you feel at home. It has a perfect size for two people. We will definitely stay there again if we get back to Bondi Beach. Highly recommended."),
("2019-01-27", "24858356", "Sylvia", "Natasha was an incredible host. Her apartment sits in the heart of Bondi  its walking distance to the beach  shops and restaurants. Not only that the hospitality provided by Natasha was outstanding. The room was spotless clean and we were gifted a bottle of champagne upon arrival. Natasha even bought our fur baby a chew toy for his stay. I highly recommend airbnbing with Natasha she’s wonderful."),
("2019-01-31", "24858356", "Paula", "Very nice apartment  very well located  we recommend it!!!!"),
("2019-02-03", "24858356", "Rob", "Outstanding location. Was a real treat to experience Bondi Beach this way. Highly recommend."),
("2019-02-12", "24858356", "Jake", "Great little pad in a truly sensational location  very clean  has everything you need. It was smaller than expected  and it's on the ground floor which means the window looks out on to the main road. A little noisy at night (backpackers opposite) and you can hear the early risers rushing down to the beach  but it's not too bad. All in all very good!"),
("2019-02-18", "24858356", "Mitchell", "Natasha was a great host. She stayed up extra late on Friday evening to greet us on arrival from the airport and to show us around the apartment.  Was happy to give us some local info before arriving and put us in contact with hair dressers etc for a wedding. Also loved the wine and food left for us on arrival. Also the biggest sell point is the LOCATION. 1 minute from the beach. 10/10 would recommend and stay again!"),
("2019-02-22", "24858356", "Jasmine", "Cute little studio apt at the beginning of Bondi Beach. Great food around!"),
("2019-03-02", "24858356", "Darren", "Natasha's place is in a great location  just steps from Bondi Beach and the Icebergs pool. The apartment was clean and it had all the amenities we needed. The air conditioner was a bit noisy but it worked well. The Murphy bed was very comfortable. There were laundry machines in the building but you needed to pay to use them. Natasha put together a very informative local guide book and she passed along unused transit passes that were left behind by her previous guests. Natasha is a kind and flexible host. She let us check in a bit early and met us at the apartment to explain everything we needed to know. She responded promptly to all messaging.My only criticism of Natasha's place is that it was on the ground floor right beside a very busy sidewalk. The only window faced the sidewalk  which afforded absolutely no privacy if the curtains were left open. This is just simply the design of the apartment  not much that can be done. However  if you can find reasonably priced accommodation  that faces the ocean or is on a higher floor it may be worth spending the extra money for the scenic views and added privacy."),
("2019-01-01", "24917020", "Tonia", "Fantastic location  close to beach  park and some great restaurants. The place was very well presented  clean and owner very responsive to questions."),
("2018-05-25", "24874349", "Ai-Ling", "Perfect location with quite neighborhood also convenience to heart of city  airly living area and comfy room where I got quite nice rest.Sarah is a considering host and easy to communicate  I had a great stay here!  Definitely recommend to people who like to have pravicy and also explore Sydney!"),
("2018-06-16", "24874349", "Elize", "Nice place in a quaint neighborhood."),
("2018-07-01", "24874349", "Masato", "really nice place"),
("2018-09-26", "24874349", "Vanessa", "Sarah’s place is in a very nice area  super convenient/ walking distance to the CBD. Lots of restaurants in close proximity. We mostly did our own thing  but Sarah also invited me to a dinner  which was thoughtful. We had a couple of miscommunications  but all worked out in the end. I probably had way too much baggage to stay here (including dive gear)  but Sarah was accommodating  and this wouldn’t be an issue if you were traveling light (which I rarely do  due to the nature of my work)."),
("2018-10-21", "24874349", "Nathalie", "Great place  great location  lovely host! Would stay again for sure!!"),
("2018-10-26", "24874349", "Marie", "Great place for a stay  ideally located in Elizabeth Bay  10 min walk to King Kross and shops. Sarah is very reactive and nice. The room is light  very comfortable and clean. I recommend it."),
("2018-11-10", "24874349", "Joe", "Sarah was a very easy host to stay with. she was great at communicating and was very mindful about helping me whenever possible!"),
("2018-11-14", "24874349", "Maria", "Pleasure to stay with Sarah after arriving from Ireland to begin my move to Sydney.  Really nice apartment  great service  helpful tips & friendly demeanour. Would highly recommend."),
("2018-11-19", "24874349", "Ina", "Great spot  wonderful host.  I would love to stay again."),
("2018-12-31", "24874349", "Anna", "Clean and quiet place as described."),
("2019-03-01", "24874349", "Raffaele", "i liked my stay. the location was great between King Cross and a beautiful park along Elizabeth bay. Sarah was friendly and helped me when i had to check in earlier and check out later."),
("2018-05-26", "24916551", "Amanda", "Fabulous family sized house! Very clean & Tidy. Well equiped ammenities. Delighted to find toiletries provided as we forgot to pack ours. Very close to train station  IGA and restaurants (all within walking distance). Alice and Richard were great hosts  willing to provide any request. Will definitely book this very affordable house again."),
("2018-06-06", "24916551", "Sravani", "Alice and Richard are very sweet hosts. They were in touch with me from the moment I booked the AirBNB to when we checked out of their place. They welcomed us with a little gift basket of food and kept a little note to make us feel at home. Their hospitality was excellent! I’d highly recommend their Home to anyone!"),
("2018-06-11", "24916551", "Angel", "Alice is a great host! She’s easy and accommodating to all of my request. I love the location and it’s close to the nice eateries  very convenient!"),
("2018-06-19", "24916551", "Georgina", "Alice's place was exactly as advertised. Great space for great value. The location was also fantastic in that everywhere we had to go was within an hour. We especially loved the personal touch like the box of chocolates that greeted us on arrival. Very happy with everything including comms with Alice."),
("2018-06-24", "24916551", "Asif", "The place : Plenty of room in a nice and cozy house.. located close to the train station and parks and in a safe and quiet neighbourhood. Not too far from the airport. There is ample parking - off street or on street. The hosts : very prompt  flexible and most of all they respect your privacy. "),
("2018-06-28", "24916551", "Yang", "Very nice host  always a quick reply. House is clean and tidy. Thanks for preparing the coffee and tea."),
("2018-07-05", "24916551", "Aziman", "Alice and Richard are great host. Very easy to reach and responded quickly when needed. As a welcome gesture they even offered us free timtam and multiadaptor. All rooms were well kept and equipped with comfy beds. Great location walkable distance to Beverly Hills train station. Lots of shops and restaurant nearby. The only downside is the shower pressure and temp control which can either be too hot or too cold. Overall we had a great stay. Would definitely recommend to anyone"),
("2018-07-08", "24916551", "Kayden/Daryn", "A great place. Perfect for our family that came to visit us during our working holiday. We had a great stay and the hosts were always ready to help answer questions or provide things."),
("2018-07-12", "24916551", "Syamsidar", "Alice's house is very clean n comfort..near the grocery store..love to stay.."),
("2018-07-15", "24916551", "Shifali", "Thanks a ton for a wonderful stay. The amenities you guys offered were amazing. In short  it was a home away from a home!! Highly recommended to everyone!"),
("2018-07-23", "24916551", "Handy", "its a nice place and spacious"),
("2018-08-08", "24916551", "陈", "地理位置不错 走路10分钟到地铁站 房间宽敞 用品齐全 就是设施稍旧一些 房东很周到很好沟通 入住比较温馨 房子整体性价比不错"),
("2018-08-13", "24916551", "Siu Ying", "A great place! Very clean and the host is nice and caring."),
("2018-08-16", "24916551", "洁", "这是一个很温馨的住处 离机场很近 去华人区吃饭也不远｡我们早班飞机抵达悉尼 房主友好的安排我们提前入住｡期间热水出了一点小问题 房主也很及时的帮忙解决｡下次来悉尼还会选择这里｡"),
("2018-08-22", "24916551", "Tan", "Alice and Richard are wonderful host. they are not only thoughtful  helpful and try to make our stay a memorable one. the house has games and books for those who are worried about a boring night.  they made every effort to ensure their guests are comfortable in their house.  thumbs up for this pair of super host. "),
("2018-08-29", "24916551", "Mick", "A fantastic experience - a beautiful home with amazing hosts. Our little family loved the place and we were able to access public transport  playing spaces and public facilities such as cafes and supermarkets very easily. Alice and Richard ensured our stay was comfortable and enjoyable and were very easy to communicate with. Would stay here again in a heartbeat. "),
("2018-09-02", "24916551", "Justin", "Responsive host. Quiet  lovely neighbourhood. Short drive away from eateries and shops. Convenient to and from the airport."),
("2018-09-11", "24916551", "Amin", "Staying at Alice is the good choice i have made. The response is very fast. Very helpful event in the last minutes. You will not regret choosing this place to stay..A very quiet place  good area  near to train station and mini mart.. everything is GOOD.. Thanks Alice :)"),
("2018-09-17", "24916551", "Valasi &", "Beautiful home  had everything we needed and we never wanted to leave. Would definitely hire this home again anytime we visit the area. Highly recommend this place!!"),
("2018-09-30", "24916551", "Rowena", "Close to Train. Great price. Not a lot of utensils but quite enough for what we needed for our stay.  Would strongly recommend staying at Alice's place as it is nice and simple and clean."),
("2018-10-07", "24916551", "Kathy", ""),
("2018-10-17", "24916551", "Mick", "Great value for your money  especially if you’re on a budget. A good location with easy access to many services such as the train station  cinema  a park and Uber eats. Would recommend to others trying to travel with 5 or 6 people on a budget. The house comes with an above average TV and great wifi which can handle many devices connected at once. Overall our stay was enjoyable and Alice is a fantastic host."),
("2018-11-10", "24916551", "Md Mostafizur", "Summer time facilities"),
("2018-11-15", "24916551", "文学", "坐地铁可以去悉尼市中心｡"),
("2018-11-26", "24916551", "Danny", "Very good house very nice host."),
("2018-11-30", "24916551", "Harris", "it's a nice and tidy place around 7 minutes from the station which is not bad. good value for money."),
("2018-12-09", "24916551", "Illya", "Special thanks to Alice & Richard for being a nice host. Both are responsive. The house is near with Beverly Hills train station  located in a quite and beautiful neighbourhood. We found that the kitchen utensils were well provided and we got comfort bed and clean bedsheets. The living room was spacious & TV was provided. There was a washing machine  iron with iron board and a cloth hanger in laundry area but it would be great if there is a dryer as well.Overall I had a nice stay in Alice's place because it is such a cozy and spacious house"),
("2018-12-13", "24916551", "Colin", "The house is old and sparsely furnished and needed some maintenance. But it was clean and spacious. It is in a good location within walking distance of Beverl Hills station."),
("2018-12-30", "24916551", "彪騰", "It's very good & lovely . And nearly station."),
("2019-01-17", "24916551", "Ir. Mohd. Salleh", "Alice house is humbly described in the BnB. The house has provided me everything I need as a traveller  didn’t expect so much. I really appreciate the way she and her husband handle the power outage problem  thanks so much."),
("2019-02-11", "24916551", "Catherine", "close to station"),
("2019-02-15", "24916551", "Zhihuan", "还不错 价格很划算｡"),
("2019-02-19", "24916551", "Nathan", "Great place to stay. Very spacious and rooms are decent. Hospitality was great!"),
("2018-05-26", "24863216", "Genevieve", "Vivian's loft apartment is perfectly located  close to great coffee spots and transport. Ten minutes from the beach and the stunning Bronte to Bondi coastal walk- not to be missed. The apartment has beautiful fixtures  a fantastic bed and a great shower. We would definitely stay at Viv's again  she was a generous and helpful host."),
("2018-06-03", "24863216", "Melissa", "Vivians little place is A+++. It has all you need without the expense of staying in the city.  The bus and train stations are close by if you want to venture to the city.  The space is clean  fresh and beautiful."),
("2018-06-09", "24863216", "Stacey", "Vivian's place is lovely :) The apartment is stylish and really beautifully appointed. Everything is new and shiny! Vivian was responsive and lovely to deal with. Anything I needed  she followed up. It was a good location and close to the beautiful Bronte Beach and public transport. It was a really great experience staying at Vivian's place  I thoroughly recommend it to others!"),
("2018-06-18", "24863216", "Jenna", "Vivian’s place is a homely beautifully styled studio and I couldn’t have felt more comfortable. She is super easy to get in touch with and happy to help anyway she can. Highly recommend her place!"),
("2018-06-26", "24863216", "Lesley", "Vivian’s place is beautiful  clean  fresh  welcoming and secure.The bed is extremely comfortable with 1000 count sheets making it feel very luxurious. The place is literally a 10 minute walk through the park to the beach. Gorgeous walks  great cafes - totally recommend! Vivian was a generous host."),
("2018-06-30", "24863216", "Lucy", "Vivian’s place was lovely and cosy! Only a short walk down to Bronte beach!  She was a great host with quick responses and very helpful."),
("2018-07-05", "24863216", "Scott", "Vivian’s place is great. Stylish  comfortable and extremely clean. The location is perfect for activities in the eastern suburbs. Vivian’s communication was excellent and check in and out was super easy."),
("2018-07-10", "24863216", "Carly", "Loved staying here  great location and amazing space. Has everything you need  Vivienne was quick to respond to any questions and the place has great amenities. Would definitely recommend to friends and stay again."),
("2018-07-16", "24863216", "Jade", "I absolutely loved my (Email hidden by Airbnb) pletely private  super clean  the comfiest bed ever  a little kitchenette - nothing more to ask for here. Vivian took my booking last minute  accommodated my check in and was such a pleasure to deal with. I can't wait to come back! x"),
("2018-07-22", "24863216", "Lais", "Vivian's place is perfect! Next to the beach and super clean.I loved!"),
("2018-07-28", "24863216", "Pippa", "Small but clean and modern space in great location."),
("2018-08-01", "24863216", "Scott", "A great second stay in this comfortable studio. Communication and cleanliness were superb."),
("2018-08-06", "24863216", "Peter", "This studio is wonderful and we hope to be back soon! It is super clean and stylish and in a great location!"),
("2018-08-13", "24863216", "Eunmi", "깔끔하고 아늑한 집이었습니다. 브론테비치와 걸어서 10분거리에 있어서 산책하기에도 좋은 위치에 있습니다. 5분정도 거리의 버스정류장에서 본다이정션까지  바로가는 버스도 있습니다."),
("2018-08-19", "24863216", "Calliope", "The studio is very comfortable  clean private and easy to check in. The location is great  an easy walk to Bronte Beach and Vivian even provided beach towels to use. It was a great please spend a weekend in Sydney and would happily stay again"),
("2018-08-21", "24863216", "Julie", "Pictures don't do it justice; a really beautiful space with your own private entrance and all the touches of home comforts! Could not recommend Vivian and Patrick more- easy instructions and lots of privacy.  You will not be disappointed!!"),
("2018-09-01", "24863216", "Therese", "Clean  modern & nice place."),
("2018-09-09", "24863216", "Ilya", "good place"),
("2018-09-14", "24863216", "Hugh", "excellent location in a compact studio  all required for a few days by the beach"),
("2018-09-16", "24863216", "Arlene", "The perfect spot to do coastal walks and chill at the beach. The perfect studio to escape from Sydney city life  but easily accessible too! Best of both worlds :)"),
("2018-09-23", "24863216", "Jill", "Perfect location and so easy to get to Bondi. Great value for money!"),
("2018-09-27", "24863216", "Amanda", "Great comfortable bed and great touches such as a beach bag and towels! The studio is very modern and has a great shower also. The keyless entry was very easy to use and made the check in process very stress free. Would stay again."),
("2018-10-24", "24863216", "Kadri", "I loved staying in this apartment. Everything was just superb. I’d definitely come back :)"),
("2018-11-03", "24863216", "Rebecca", "A fabulous small and compact studio in a great location for the eastern superb beach life"),
("2018-11-06", "24863216", "Michele", "Vivian’s place was wonderful. We stayed there after a conference  and wanted to be in walking distance to the beach. The studio flat is perfect for two  with all the amenities  and extra touches like coffee  milk  hair dryer  beach towels and nice linens and toiletries. Vivian also offered us a late checkout and did her best for an early one but we didn’t end up needing it.Her place is a short 7-8 minute walk downhill through a park to the quieter Bronte beach. It’s also about a 30 minute walk along the coastal cliffs to Bondi. All in all it was exactly what what we wanted and we wish we could have stayed longer."),
("2018-11-10", "24863216", "Cristian", "Great cosy spot near one of Sydney’s great beaches."),
("2018-11-11", "24863216", "Lizzy", "Vivian’s place was modern  well furnished and clean! Great location  thoroughly enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-11-21", "24863216", "Julia", "Absolutely adored Vivian's place! Amazing location  loved the beach bag and towels  the good reviews are very well deserved. Can't wait to come back!"),
("2018-11-24", "24863216", "Hannah", "Great location  within walking distance to the beaches. Stylish place with house inspo with the finishing touches to their styling. Easy self check in which was convenient after getting delayed coming in. Recommend Vivian’s place for a weekend get away!"),
("2018-11-30", "24863216", "Carolina", "Beautiful studio in a great location.  Vivian was incredibly communicative and helpful in arranging my stay."),
("2018-12-03", "24863216", "Callum", "Lovely space  well appointed  great location"),
("2018-12-06", "24863216", "James", "Lovely spot & easy to get to the city by Bus and Train if you need."),
("2018-12-11", "24863216", "Ellen", "Small but very stylish and clean. Great for one person or a couple. 15 min walk to the beach and off street parking available 100-200m away (free and untimed)."),
("2018-12-16", "24863216", "Stephen", "This place is just perfect  and the location is amazing! If you’re thinking of booking then do it! Thanks again so much for the stay Viv "),
("2018-12-28", "24863216", "Luke", "Charming little space with modern touches within walking distance off all the beaches. Great host  even shared a Christmas gift as we stayed through the holiday! Would recommend."),
("2019-01-09", "24863216", "Damon", "What an amazing place to stay in one of the most beautiful areas of Sydney. Right from the start I was greeted with amazing hospitality  an extremely clean (and new) space  and every little touch you could imagine already accounted for. Vivian was so responsive and even checked in to make sure things were fine. The place was very comfortable (for two)  well laid out and in a location that couldn't be any better if you like heading out to the beach and the surrounding areas. I primarily travelled with Uber Pool  but it was also very close in terms of public transportation options. Loved the beach towels and beach bag and the brand new shower. Air conditioner worked fantastic. Wi-Fi and internet was great. Overall would stay here again in a heart beat  thanks for the great stay!"),
("2019-01-12", "24863216", "Jim", "Excellent location  great value and the beach towels and beach bag addition were great"),
("2019-01-15", "24863216", "Maya", "Within walking distance to the beach  this sparkling clean studio was perfect for our stay in Bronte."),
("2019-01-17", "24863216", "Susan", "We really enjoyed our stay. Such a cute house and so clean! Vivian is a great host. Quick response and easy access to the place. A quick walk to the beautiful Tamarama Beach. There’s a great cafe just around the corner. Can’t wait to go back!"),
("2019-01-20", "24863216", "Brian", "Stayed for a weekend and everything from check in to location and walkability of the area was perfect. Great spot for solo or a couple to spend a weekend."),
("2019-01-23", "24863216", "Kathryn", "Comfortable and clean studio  really handy for a short stay in Sydney! Walking to the beach and shops is so easy from here and it really helped having aircon. Would definitely stay here again. Vivian was a great host and really easy to get hold of for any queries we had :)"),
("2019-01-24", "24863216", "Mikayla", "fantastic studio in a convenient location"),
("2019-01-27", "24863216", "Stasia", "This place checked all the boxes for me: flexible checkin/out  great AC  great location  responsive hosts and a clean space. Bonus! It was cute. Will definitely be back."),
("2019-02-01", "24863216", "Brianna", "Perfect place to stay! Great location  perfect apartment  very cosy bed! Definitely would recommend."),
("2019-02-03", "24863216", "François", "Very clean  well situated  easy to access. Hope to come again."),
("2019-02-08", "24863216", "Suzee", "Lovely fitout in a very convenient location"),
("2019-02-10", "24863216", "Megan", "Beautiful studio with thoughtful touches! Very central to multiple beautiful beaches! We enjoyed our relaxing weekend on the coast and Viv was a great host!"),
("2019-02-16", "24863216", "Thomas", "I stayed 4 nights at Vivian's  the location was perfectly located 5mins of the best Sydney beaches. The studio was pristine fitted with everything I needed. The day I arrived there was a mini glitch with the door system  5mins after my call  Patrick came over and fix it. Definitely a place to stay for few days !"),
("2019-02-18", "24863216", "Sabine", "Great access to the beach.Very comfortable unit"),
("2019-02-20", "24863216", "Anna", "Vivian’s place was exactly as advertised. Well located  cosy yet spacious  comfortable  and with a lot of thoughtful extra touches. Perfect place to stay when you want to experience the most iconic beaches of Sydney."),
("2019-02-26", "24863216", "Nicky", "Vivian's place was perfect for my parents stay in Bronte. It was beautifully presented  very clean and in a great location for exploring the beaches. The use of space and private entrance were great. I would highly recommend this air bnb."),
("2018-06-08", "24993202", "Mark", "The place is amazing  with everything you need. The location closed to most of the sightseeing places and 2 train station. Mike always response within 10mins and give valuable response. We definitely will reserve here again when we visit Sydney again."),
("2018-06-17", "24993202", "Elaine", "Mike is a great host felt special picking up the keys and having barista coffee thrown in.The space is great the photos don’t do it justice  walking distance to Woolloomoo Wharf and Kings Cross clean  fresh and surprisingly quiet being in an major overpass.Highly recommend Mike as a host and the space would stay again!"),
("2018-07-05", "24993202", "Matthew", "Amazing place in a great location. Highly recommend"),
("2018-07-08", "24993202", "Lucy", "The accommodation was beautiful and well centralised. The host was friendly with great communication. Definitely recommend"),
("2018-06-24", "25148829", "Stephen", "Fantastic place  amazing location   and Arianne made it all so simple with her wonderful communication"),
("2018-07-01", "25148829", "Darshan", "Arianne's place is well located in the city  close to most of the places. It was great to stay there and wish to meet them soon."),
("2018-07-22", "25148829", "Nicolas", "Really nice house  modern and full equipped. Arianne and Phillip are amazing hosts  making you feel like in your own house. They responded fastly to any enquiry and were always worried about us and our hispitality."),
("2018-08-30", "25148829", "Casey", "Can’t mention how convenient the place was. Adrianne was quick to respond to queries. She was flexible with check in and out. The place is equipped and it was a great base to get to the city."),
("2018-09-08", "25148829", "Alex", "The house is spacy  with nice back yard and very clean. It is close to public transport. Communication was easy with Arianne. I recommend the place!"),
("2018-09-12", "25148829", "Zety Akhtar", "Arianne's place was exactly like as (Website hidden by Airbnb) was cosy and comfortable..the location was great as it was near the train station..arianne was a good host very responsive.. eventhough i didnt have a chance to meet her but her mother denise was very nice welcoming me and family to the house.."),
("2018-06-03", "25410221", "Broede", "Thea was a lovely host and an excellent—and speedy—communicator."),
("2018-06-10", "25410221", "Sophia", "Thea was an amazing host  quick communicater and we felt welcome from the second my partner and I met her. Her place is super cosy and is incredible  as well as super close to lots of shops  restaurants and public transport. Would 110% recommend staying here; she is incredibly hospitable and nice."),
("2018-06-17", "25410221", "Angus", "Super easy  replied quickly & great location."),
("2018-07-28", "25410221", "Agustina", "Thea’s place was lovely  a couple of details like she could maybe add more utensils (pans  cups  glasses) in the kitchen and the hot water in the shower wears out too soon. She doesn’t have WiFi so check the ad before booking! She’s very sweet and  responsive. I really enjoyed the private and quietness of this place in my first days in Sydney! Thanks for everything ;)"),
("2018-08-19", "25410221", "Brietta", "Thea's place is perfect for one - clean  safe and conveniently located. Thea and her sister made communication really easy. Thanks again!"),
("2018-10-06", "25410221", "Nina", "Thea的房子距离悉尼大学很近 而且房子安静且干净 还舒服 以至于我们每天早晨都不想起床｡虽然没有wifi但是我们并不觉得这个问题很难熬 毕竟房间里信号不错｡Thea真是人美心善 我的行李箱轮子遇到了点问题 没法把它带去凯恩斯 征得Thea同意她愿意让我把行李箱寄存在她的公寓 这可帮了我大忙 让我在凯恩斯能轻装游玩 非常感谢｡我会记得这次澳洲旅行遇到的各位善良友好的澳洲人民｡Thea's house is very close to the university of Sydney  and the house is quiet and clean and comfortable  so that we don't want to get up every morning. There's no wifi  but we don't find it particularly difficult. After all  it's a good signal in the room.   Thea was so kind that I had a problem with the wheel of my suitcase and couldn't bring it to cairns. With Thea's permission she was willing to let me deposit the suitcase in her (Website hidden by Airbnb) helped me a lot. It allowed me to travel light in cairns. Thank you very much. I will remember the kind and friendly Australian people I met on this trip."),
("2019-01-04", "25410221", "Salome", "Thea’s place was perfectly located. A great space which was well maintained and exceptionally clean. Thea was an excellent communicator and was in touch very promptly to reply to all of my questions. Staying there during summer  the studio was very cool during the day. It is well located close to public transport and major shopping centres. There are many great cafes in the area  and a very welcoming and diverse neighborhood. Definitely good value for money."),
("2018-06-10", "25684995", "Alex", "Super great location  very close to a range of great restaurants and bars. The apartment is quiet and old worldly but with character and modern comforts. It was the perfect combination of peace and privacy in amongst a bustling area with great nightlife "),
("2018-06-11", "25684995", "Jerrie", "Great place"),
("2018-06-18", "25684995", "Nina", "From apartment to King cross station only 5mins very close. 3mins have a supermarket.good. Room so clean.  Nice Johannes"),
("2018-07-06", "25684995", "Pascale", "L’appartement est très bien situé  un peu petit mais convient très bien pour 2 personne. Il est propre.Johannes répond rapidement aux questions"),
("2018-07-07", "25684995", "Ella", "The apartment is close to some nice restaurants and about 30 mins walk from many main attractions. Very easy to access from the train station. Johannes is quick to respond to questions. I would recommend his place to travelers who wish to see Sydney but not stay in the busy central city."),
("2018-07-18", "25684995", "Candice", "Nice spot at a great location. Supermarket and 24h food kiosks just round the corner  and the train station is just minutes away on foot. However  might not be suitable for younger travellers as it is within the red light district of Sydney with plenty of strip clubs around. That said  it is a safe gated building which never left us any worries."),
("2018-09-17", "25684995", "William", "Great spot! Johannes is prompt with his responses  and made sure my stay was pleasant. The proximity to nearby shops and restaurants  and the short walk to Kings Cross station from here are ideal."),
("2018-11-04", "25684995", "Alex", "Great location but expensive for what is a tired granny flat."),
("2018-11-18", "25684995", "Charlotte", "Great spot!"),
("2018-11-29", "25684995", "Kylie", "Great apartment in a perfect location"),
("2018-12-02", "25684995", "Gemma", "We had a great stay  such a great location! Johannes was very helpful and a wonderful host."),
("2018-12-06", "25684995", "David", "Great location  good sized flat & very good host offering clear instructions & help. Would stay again"),
("2018-12-08", "25684995", "Roy", "."),
("2018-12-22", "25684995", "Marcus", "In the middle of Potts Point  a central spot for backpackers. The area apparently used to be much more lively before Sydney’s lockout laws. There are a few nice places close by. I especially recommend the ramen shop that you can see out the kitchen window to the right in the alleyway.As for the apartment it has everything you need  like towels  shampoo  and a kitchen (not that you’re gonna cook and eat at home!). It’s a clean space to rest after exploring the city."),
("2019-01-30", "25684995", "Elad", "Perfect visit great experience"),
("2019-02-02", "25684995", "Luke", "Perfect location  good value  safe  everything you need."),
("2019-02-04", "25684995", "Michael", "A great place to stay!"),
("2019-02-11", "25684995", "Lew", "Fantastic location. Nice old building - the lift took me back. Apartment was as described - also very well stocked. Would highly recommend to anyone looking for a place to stay in Potts Point."),
("2019-02-21", "25684995", "Hana", "A great apartment in a great location  there were no problems with anything at all  definitely recommend."),
("2019-02-27", "25684995", "Ryu", "They were awesome and the room also awesome.I recommend it."),
("2018-08-04", "25961494", "Angus", "Very modern and comfortable apartment. Great location and short walk to centre of Newtown  with an easy check in process - ideal for late check ins. Guillermo very easily contactable and accommodating "),
("2018-08-26", "25961494", "Nadiah", "Guillermo was quick to reply to all my queries. I had to check-in a day earlier and he was thoughtful enough to leave a day before and after my stay empty from my booking for last minute changes like mine. The place was great  though I didn’t get to meet Guillermo  his housemate was welcoming enough. There’s a lot cafes and restaurants nearby so you won’t go hungry. 10 mins walk to both St Peters and Newtown train station so that was very convenient too. It was a wonderful and I would definitely book this place again!"),
("2018-10-16", "25961494", "Jessica", "The apartment is modern and beautiful  with  a balcony that receives plenty of sun.  I really enjoyed my time staying here  and the location is perfect!  The hassle free check-in is also a plus."),
("2018-07-05", "25977467", "Shahrin", "The house was very clean and spacious. The hosts were really great and sent us detailed information for check-in. Overall  would come back here!"),
("2018-07-10", "25977467", "Chiranth", "We had an extremely comfortable stay at Jared’s. The hip apartment is spacious for 2 and we particularly liked the pull-out sofa that became a comfy day bed after a long day of walking around. The area is right across CBD  well connected but still pretty quiet. Great bedding in the master room and overall super clean and well-maintained  with all amenities provided. Gabbie  our point of contact  was always reachable and very helpful and friendly. It was all the little touches like a personal note  a coffee machine  indoor plants and soft rugs that made it a homely experience. Thank you!"),
("2018-07-12", "25977467", "Mona", "Very homely and chilled quite and close to the city"),
("2018-07-24", "25977467", "Lydia", "I got this place on last minute and everything was absolutely wonderful :) The host provided very good instructions on everything and the self check in was extremely easy :) Thanks again."),
("2018-07-26", "25977467", "Gert", "The appartment is very well located right at the center minuts walk from Darling Harbour."),
("2018-08-01", "25977467", "Jake", "This place is in a very good location  the host helped us whenever we needed and it was a really nice stay for all of us. Would highly recommend and book there again :)"),
("2018-08-04", "25977467", "Shenghua", "Really nice place with big private space and great location."),
("2018-08-08", "25977467", "Lorraine", "Excellent location! They also have access to Darling Harbour through the carpark at Level 2. The master bedroom can be a bit noisy as you can hear travellers coming in and out at odd hours but otherwise everything was great!"),
("2018-08-17", "25977467", "Hanna", "Jared’s place was just what we needed - great location with the basics. Wonderful value for Pyrmont!"),
("2018-08-19", "25977467", "Yvette", "Great apartment in a fantastic location. Space is ample for three people and is spotlessly clean. Beds comfy with nice linen. Good communication and super easy check in/check out.Walk to everything - no car necessary.Would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-08-19", "25977467", "Daniel", "Great Location to the CBD and Harbor. Nice apartment (as advertised!) with more than enough room for two using both the bed & fold out couch comfortably. The shower had great water pressure too :) & Excellent communication with the host with clear and easy instructions."),
("2018-08-23", "25977467", "Deanna", "This apartment was ideally situated for darling harbour just a very short walk away. The apartment was clean and tidy and the bed was comfy. Even the sofa bed was comfy. It had all the amenities needed. For an excellent stay in the city x."),
("2018-08-27", "25977467", "Stephen", "Excellent choice if you travel with 3-4 people and want to stay close to central city."),
("2018-08-29", "25977467", "Jordi", "Highly recommended! we've loved our stay there. Thanks!"),
("2018-08-31", "25977467", "Valentina", "Clean  central apartment. Perfect place to sleep while you’re out and about. Thanks for everything."),
("2018-09-05", "25977467", "Caitlin", "beautiful place  I enjoyed my stay there alot! lovely how high the ceilings are  looks very spacious and cool!"),
("2018-09-11", "25977467", "Zairis", "The house located at strategic (Website hidden by Airbnb) 5 minutes walk to Darling Harbour and the convenient store.Walking distance to the bus station and the most important is the place is secured with tight security.Overall me and my friends had a great stay during our vacation !"),
("2018-09-14", "25977467", "Amir", "A true gem indeed  just a few minutes walk to Darling Harbour and the Light Train. Cafes  convenience stores and Coles in walking distance. Communication was super fast. Place was just as described and more than we expected... felt at home right away. Recommended to our friends too. Thanks Jared and Gabbie :)"),
("2018-09-21", "25977467", "Julie", "Nice clean apartment  close to Darling Harbour & tourist destinations of Sydney. Comfy bed & good amenities"),
("2018-09-26", "25977467", "Grace", "Nice apartment  loved the decor  very clean. In a great spot.Communication was quick.Positive experience ❤"),
("2018-09-28", "25977467", "Ju Yeong", "응답이 빨라서 좋았어요. 앤틱한 감성이라면 추천이지만  현대식 시설을 원하시면 만족하지 못 할수도 있어요."),
("2018-10-06", "25977467", "Heather", "Amazing location especially for this price. The apartment has everything you need  and the hosts are really prompt with communication."),
("2018-10-13", "25977467", "Melanie", "This was a great place to stay  so central and close to amenities. The apartment itself was spacious and comfortable."),
("2018-10-16", "25977467", "Myalie", "Good  clean & close all activities"),
("2018-10-19", "25977467", "Sarah", "Great apartment and great location! Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-10-23", "25977467", "Morris", "Amazing location  everything was within walking distance. Clean & cosy. Noise from people walking on along the corridor can he heard from the bedroom every now and then. Quick communication."),
("2018-10-25", "25977467", "Ashlee", "Lovely apartment  close to darling harbour and the CBD! We walked everywhere which was great. Apartment was clean and great size!  Was a tad bit noisy at night time from people walking around the building/apartments but didn’t fase us at all! Great stay  would recommended!!"),
("2018-10-27", "25977467", "Leqi", "good location (Near the Darling habour & light rail station)Large square  enough for 4 peopleAlso the host is friendly"),
("2018-11-07", "25977467", "Keith", "Very clean   exactly as described in the listing. Very convienent for Darling Harbour & Convention Centre."),
("2018-11-09", "25977467", "MingRui", "Nice place to stay."),
("2018-11-09", "25977467", "Sharnie", "Amazing location and well priced.Host is very accommodating with quick responses."),
("2018-11-14", "25977467", "Carolin", "Gabbie helped us with the check-in and everything around the Airbnb. The place is more spacious as expected on the photos and the location is amazing - right by Darling harbour! Gabbie responded to queries very quickly  which was very helpful. Unfortunately the fridge wasn’t working properly  however she managed it super well and even got a new fridge within 1 day of telling her. Very impressed! I would highly recommend this place  the only thing which is a bit of a shame is the lack of natural light (as buildings are built so close to each other in Sydney) and the main bedroom faces the hallway within the building  however if you’re not planning to be indoors all day this is the place for you! Thanks Gabbie"),
("2018-11-16", "25977467", "Claire", "Great apartment in a central location in a unique building. Had everything we needed. Communication with host/representative excellent. Would recommend."),
("2018-11-20", "25977467", "Kirri", "We stayed here overnight to go to a concert and the apartment couldn’t have been more perfect for what we needed. Ideally located  secure  private  superbly maintained  and easy for a visitor to navigate. The sofa bed was prepared for our arrival as requested. There were towels and sheets from previous guests on a rack in the lounge room  but they were kept out of the way and didn’t intrude on our enjoyment of the apartment at all. Thank you very much  we highly recommend it."),
("2018-11-22", "25977467", "Michelle", "This air bnb accommodation is in a fantastic location with the Sydney light rail almost at your doorstep. Great value for money."),
("2018-12-06", "25977467", "Eduardo", "Great stay  apartment was clean and the photos were very accurate. Location was superb  and communication was outstanding. Definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2018-12-08", "25977467", "Trish", "Fantastic accomodation good Value for money great location.super tidy with a homely feel.Thankyou."),
("2018-12-15", "25977467", "Lori", "Larger than anticipated. Good location. Comfy beds. When arriving read instructions slowly and purposely and all will be fine. Gabbie communicated quickly when I was a little  confused with instructions. We came into Sydney from overseas and were exhausted after 24 plus hours in transit and we ended up loving the place and location. Definitely get a good Sydney vibe in this area."),
("2018-12-15", "25977467", "Jane", "Great accommodation  easy to follow instructions and fantastic location. Everything you needed right at your doorstep.  Great host too."),
("2018-12-22", "25977467", "Rachel", "Terrific location! We were very comfortable here in our week long stay in Sydney."),
("2018-12-28", "25977467", "Jessica", "This is a really good sized one bed apartment for two but could easily fit two more in a sofa bed. It’s nicely decorated inside and has a cute little balcony. There was everything we needed inside - well kitted our kitchen for cooking our own meals and toiletries etc. Really comfy bed! Communication was super quick and really clear. The location is perfect for accessing the darling harbour area. We had a great two night stay  I would recommend this place."),
("2019-01-01", "25977467", "Jean", "Awesome place! Great location!"),
("2019-01-06", "25977467", "Natalia", "Our stay was great! We didn't have any problem and everything was easy for us. The location is really comfortable and the apartment is clean and roomy. Thank you!"),
("2019-01-10", "25977467", "Eva", "Great location  very close to Darling Harbour. Sadly the neighbours were very noisy the days we were there  but after we had a talk to them it helped. Good space for 3 people."),
("2019-01-12", "25977467", "Michael", "The apartment is in a great central location.  There were three of us and there was plenty if room and it was very comfortable. The area was busy but we felt quite safe and there is plenty of sit seeing options within walking distance."),
("2019-01-23", "25977467", "Sue", "Perfect location"),
("2019-03-01", "25977467", "Helen", "Great location  air conditioning not adequate  neighbouring apartment had leaking water pipe which could be heard all the time"),
("2019-03-04", "25977467", "Jane", "Great location.  Easy access to Darling Harbour.  Comfortable and well equipped apartment."),
("2014-04-14", "2609433", "James", "We had a lovely stay here - just one night. Quiet  relaxing  a lovely second floor room and picturesque backyard."),
("2014-05-15", "2609433", "Kohei", "Various of people are together in her house. You can talk and have dinner with them without something wall.Cecilia will teaches us about permaculture if you want.'Cause she is crazy about it.For me the story was very interesting."),
("2014-05-19", "2609433", "Zazie", "A warm greeting by Cecilia and a gorgeous haven away from the hustle and bustle.  With possibly the comfiest bed around!  Thank you Cecilia  we will definitely book again!"),
("2014-05-25", "2609433", "Clive", "It's a lovely house in a quiet street. Cecilia is a wonderful host who keeps the house clean and tidy  and we would happily return. Her young guests were very interesting people. It's a treat to have an ensuite bathroom at an Airbnb place. The upstairs Zen room is a little world of its own."),
("2015-02-02", "2609433", "Jovita", "I enjoyed every moment of my stay in this house - full of light  style  harmony and fresh smell of flowers. But the most important that due to my stay in Cecilia's house  I found my own people  who are searching for something more and strive for bigger in their lives. I loved this experience of sharing  learning and living together like a family. Definitely  my time in Sydney was so amazing thanks to this exceptional chance to live in this lovely house.      "),
("2015-12-07", "2609433", "Matt", "A lovely warm house  host is very welcoming and helpful. Treetop room is perfect and as described. Enjoyed my stay and would say again. "),
("2018-01-02", "2609433", "Kadir", "Our stay at Cecilia‘s was very nice.We liked the fresh eggs from the chickens alot. :)"),
("2018-01-14", "2609433", "Stephen", "One of the best AirBnB places I've visited around the world  and I've been to dozens of countries. Wonderful place and host."),
("2018-02-10", "2609433", "Kevin", "Cecilia's place is extra-ordinary  she makes the house feel very peaceful and chilled! Having great interesting guests where interaction is relaxed and enjoyable! I would stay again where ever your next home is. Thanks very much  Kevin"),
("2018-02-20", "2609433", "Claus", "The stay at Cecilias and her housemates home was inspiring. Great People  perfect surrounding!It is a pitty  that this house will not be available soon ....My best wishes!"),
("2018-02-25", "2609433", "Santosh", "Cecilia is a wonderful soul and her communication was excellent. The place was very unique and felt like I was meditating in a wood but with all the comforts of a home. We had some great conversations and her housemates were also very friendly. Unfortunately  her place at Annandale is not going to exist anymore but I wish her all the best and hope to stay at her new location in my future trip.Cecelia  thank you very much for everything and all the best for your upcoming adventures !"),
("2018-03-01", "2609433", "Margaret", "What Cecilia has created in the Inner West of Sydney is nothing short of amazing! The house is quite magical and the garden likewise with chooks and wonderful plants providing a restful experience after a long day of work. What a pity I was the last guest. Please look out for what Cecilia does next though. I have no doubt it will be onward and upward!"),
("2018-06-22", "26244400", "Mary", "The host canceled this reservation 182 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-09-23", "26308209", "Philip", "Gail’s Guest House is a hidden gem in a beautiful garden setting. The space is brand new and was immaculately presented  with a lot of attention to detail. Gail and Kim were very accommodating and Gale baked fresh bread  which was a nice surprise. The location is great  close to the airport and only 5mins walk to some really nice beaches.I would highly recommend this place for a weekend getaway or longer."),
("2018-10-01", "26308209", "Garrison", "This private & quiet retreat offered a pleasurable solace  but so well situated being a short walk to the beach  golf course & local cafes.Gail & Kim were delightful hosts  & very accommodating. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-10-28", "26308209", "Marcella", "Six stars. Great place  private and quiet. Close to airport  local shops and a fantastic beach. I'm looking forward to staying with these friendly hosts again."),
("2018-11-09", "26308209", "Luke", "Great space with generous hosts. This is a great find."),
("2018-11-15", "26308209", "Wei", "I’d highly recommend this room. Gail is thoughtful - not only make the room clean but also have prepared almost everything needed for short term visitor including food and drinks in the fridge. Location is close to public transport and beach and about 30 min to Matraville by walk."),
("2018-11-18", "26308209", "Ariana", "Gail is a fantastic host with a great property - all the comforts of home and more. Fresh baked bread was a highlight. Thanks for a great stay."),
("2018-11-21", "26308209", "Luke", "A really great find  clean and great space with everything you need and thoughtful touches."),
("2018-11-24", "26308209", "Marcella", "Great accommodation and pleasant friendly hosts. This was my 2nd visit and I’ll be coming back."),
("2018-12-03", "26308209", "Kathryn", "This is such a perfect self contained unit for a solo traveller. Gail is such a generous host and the room was beautiful and sparkling clean. I loved my stay here and look forward to my next visit ."),
("2018-12-09", "26308209", "Da", "A perfect little hideaway amidst a beautiful garden & thoughtful host."),
("2018-12-17", "26308209", "Tracey", "Gail’s place is fantastic! The beach is just down the street and the bus stop is nearby. I found it easy to commute into downtown on the L94. There is great food and drinks within walking distance  as well! The cabin is really nice and sparkling clean and I was more than comfortable."),
("2018-12-23", "26308209", "Kathryn", "I just love Gail’s place and Malabar is such a relaxed part of the Eastern Suburbs of Sydney ... The perfect spot to stay in every way."),
("2019-01-01", "26308209", "Maxime", "Petite maison en arrière-cour  très privée.On y trouve tout ce que l'on a besoin  et même un peu plus.La cuisinette est complète  le réfrigérateur comporte plusieurs items essentiels au petit déjeuner  on y trouve café  pain  œufs  beurre  céréales...le lit est confo  la climatisation est puissante  la propreté est parfaite.À 20 min de voiture du centre-ville de Sydney.J'y retournerais sans aucune hésitation.Et les hôtes sont supers!"),
("2019-03-03", "26308209", "Christophe", "Thé place is convenient  very clean  located privately at the end of a very nice little backyard. The owners gave me useful orientation. Goodies were awaiting both on the pantry shelf and in the fridge ! They lent me a rechargeable bus/ferry card on top of a few maps. In case you lose some hygiene items  a number were available.  Air conditioning worked well. Place to park for me. Super."),
("2018-07-14", "26414600", "Lukas", "Very dirty: Beds  Kitchen  Floors.Location very nice.If clean  nice place"),
("2018-07-08", "26340840", "Bev", "Beautiful house  very well presented and clean. Large bedrooms and comfortable living areas. Large back verandah was an ideal gathering space for our family weekend  we could eat and sit comfortably out there during the evening.10 min walk to coffee  cafes etc or hop onto Ferry for further afield.Highly recommend"),
("2018-07-13", "26340840", "Kelly", "Clean  homely and the owners were extremely nice and helpful. Would recommend. "),
("2018-08-05", "26340840", "Marni", "This place was lovely and was great for our family with young kids.  It would also be a fabulous entertaining space out the back decking and backyard for entertaining a group.  The house has two living areas  the front room and back deck which is well contained and warm for day to day meals and living also.  Both the caretakers and owners were very attentive to our requests and communication.  This place has everything you need to be very comfortable.  The place was super clean and tidy  everything as the pictures show.  We loved our stay  thank you! "),
("2018-08-16", "26340840", "Stella", "This house is very nice especially suitable for family with young kids. Our kids love the trampoline very much. We love the outdoor living space  this area is excellent and out of our expectation. We enjoyed staying there for meal and entertainment. It is very good to have a heater there  very comfortable! The spa in the outdoor area is also good for us to relax. The location is convenient   only a few minutes walk to take ferry. Everything is true as they described. Only thing was that the dishwasher was out of order and reported on the second day of our stay. Although we were kept inform that they were trying to fix it  it was not fixed at the end of our nine days stay. It was quite inconvenient for us as we cooked everyday and we have 8 people to dine. Anyway would recommend."),
("2018-08-26", "26340840", "Tash", "What a beautiful home! Franca and Allessio were wonderful hosts  answering quickly and so helpful when we had questions. The bedrooms were all well appointed and comfortable  the kitchen had plenty of crockery and glassware  and everything was clean and tidy! The outdoor space was wonderful and warm and great for relaxing as a group. The house is in a great location close to lots of things but far enough from the city to be quiet.We loved staying here :)"),
("2018-09-23", "26340840", "Andrew", "It was a great stay and beautiful home. Half our dance crew stayed at Franca and Alessio's place whilst we rehearsed for our upcoming premiere - it was a massive week and we really loved coming back to this gorgeous house."),
("2018-10-01", "26340840", "Eli", "Lovely home  lots of room and very clean. The owners were happy to help and very quick on responses. Reccomened this place for families and groups going into the city or just for a weekend away in this lovely neighbourhood. will be back! thank you very much!!"),
("2018-10-05", "26340840", "Alyssa", "amazing place ! super clean and spacious for any group ! Shame we couldn’t use the hot tub because of the rain but other than that everything was very pleasing  would definitely come again !"),
("2018-10-13", "26340840", "Joey", "This home was amazing! The location is not even 5 minutes from the city. The house is beautiful and the outdoor seating area and backyard is really nice for bigger groups. Check in was very smooth and the house looks exactly as advertised.The owners are very prompt with their responses and are always happy to help.Would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-10-22", "26340840", "Suresh", "Very much recommend this place."),
("2018-10-31", "26340840", "Chen", "It’s a very good house to live  clean  comfortable and the host is very kind and warm-hearted  so the house is a good choice for living!"),
("2018-11-10", "26340840", "Nicola", "Gorgeous home!"),
("2018-11-23", "26340840", "George", "Good house and central position"),
("2018-11-25", "26340840", "Kerry", "We would like to sincerely thank Franca and Alessio for being so helpful despite our very short notice. Their house is absolutely beautiful and extremely well equipped.The stunning federation detail throughout the house has been preserved with finesse whilst still offering modern kitchen   bathroom and outdoor entertainment facilities! Thankyou for sharing your elegant house with us.Kerry and the crew."),
("2018-12-28", "26340840", "David", "This is an amazing gem at Drummoyne. The house is spectacular and has all the essentials for a big group of people. Franca and Alessio are very accommodating and great people. They were able to accomodate us on Boxing Day as we had two last minute cancellations. I can’t recommend them enough. I will definitely be back."),
("2019-01-19", "26340840", "Andrew", "we LOVE staying at Franca & Alessio's place  - we're repeat customers!!"),
("2019-01-28", "26340840", "Max", "Lovely home would recommend this place for when staying in a group and want a quick trip into places like darling harbour"),
("2019-02-14", "26340840", "Huang", "old house with much amenities and great location if you are driving."),
("2019-02-21", "26340840", "Nathan", "Very nice house built in the 1920's located in the Drummoyne neighborhood.  This is a close-in suburb to Sydney - only a few miles  but about 30-45 minutes by car  depending on traffic.  There is on-site parking for 2+ cars  which is really nice  although street parking was easy to find in the neighborhood as well.  Close to cycling/walking paths that run all over the area.  The house is in great shape and has a very nice outdoor living area that we enjoyed.  There were a lot of board games in a closet  which was a plus for our kids.  I'd definitely stay here again."),
("2019-03-02", "26340840", "Danielle", "A great property! The best furniture and layout for a family getaway! The location is awesome too with lots around!"),
("2018-07-15", "26430039", "Nancy", "The house is a lovely open space surrounded by trees. The beaches are beautiful  closeby and easy to drive to. So much to do outdoors  and lots of restaurants and cafes in the area for the evening. The house is stocked withe an entire kitchen of stuff which was great. It was a really nice winter stay in the school holidays. The host brought us a  beautiful welcome hamper of teas  coffee  chocolates and wine  etc.  Very nice."),
("2018-07-21", "26430039", "Rebecca", "Wonderful hosting. Accommodation as advertised - such a lovely part of the world! But the real stand out was the helpfulness and hospitality of hostess. She did everything to make it comfortable and easy with food and nibbles and drinks so that the first night. / morning could be relaxing and worry free."),
("2018-08-06", "26430039", "Renee", "It's a beautiful place  even more lovely than in the pictures.  There's a calm and care to the place that makes is homely while still being a glamorous getaway. And the host was so helpful  and knowledgeable about everything.  Didn't have to think once about the accomodation or amenities  so we could totally focus on why we were there. "),
("2019-01-05", "26430039", "Andrew", "Fantastic property and host.  Beautiful part of Sydney."),
("2019-02-17", "26430039", "Hayley", "Very easy to deal with and super accommodating hosts."),
("2019-02-23", "26430039", "Brittany", "We had a lovely stay thanks to Kathryn over the weekend. We were welcomed with a bottle of wine  chocolates  bread  milk  fruit and other goodies and were allowed an early check in and late check out. The house was clean and kitchen filled with everything you might possibly need. The balcony had a gorgeous view and we loved that we felt we were in a mini rainforest. My only piece of feedback would be that the main bedroom should have had blinds  it was really hard to sleep in in the morning with all of the natural light. But otherwise 10/10. We thank you for welcoming us into your home and being so flexible and accomodating."),
("2018-08-26", "26474245", "David", "Fantastic space and location  really nice hosts to ensure the check-in was smooth and stress free. Incredible space  great value and I couldn't recommend more highly! Thanks Leigh!"),
("2018-09-02", "26474245", "Andrew", "Leigh's place was perfect for our family of 5.  A 2 min walk to the beach  30 seconds to cafe's and 2 mins to the Supermarket.   Buses to take us into the city were available at the end of the street.  The place was spotless  comfortable and had everything we needed.  The kids loved the Netflix and playing trivia on the (Hidden by Airbnb) smart speaker.   A highly recommended place to stay."),
("2018-09-12", "26474245", "Mottel", "This is simply the best possible location if you’re planning a trip to Coogee. The apartment was immaculately clean and Leigh was super helpful and responsive with check-in/out. The apartment has high ceilings and an abundance of natural light. We’ll be back."),
("2018-09-19", "26474245", "Ally", "Honestly  you can’t pick a better location than this! It’s in the heart of coogee. A bunch of restaurants to pick from for all price ranges (a fish called coogee was our fave) and the beach is down the block  including the coastal walk to Bondi which was really nice.More important.. the hosts Leigh & Tania are super awesome! They made the check in and check out process very easy and clear and also got us in 2 hours early. The apartment is very roomy  clean and bright. We’re so happy we picked this spot for our Sydney stay. Thanks guys!!"),
("2018-09-23", "26474245", "Christian", "Great apartment - spacious and close to the beach + transport to get into the city. Great selection of Cafes within 2 minutes walk and plenty of places for dinner  drinks etc. Top place to stay in Coogee"),
("2018-09-29", "26474245", "Grace", "Lovely place! Leigh and Tanya helped me really ease into my first Airbnb!"),
("2018-09-30", "26474245", "Adam", "A must stay if you’re in the area!"),
("2018-10-05", "26474245", "Steve", "Great spot and host all good !!!"),
("2018-10-10", "26474245", "Miyo", "Leigh’s place was amazing. Location is unbeatable and the place was big enough for family of 4(all adults). The place was more than expected. Loved home decoration as well. Everything is around there  bus  cafe   restaurant  pub  super market. It made our trip very easy and comfortable."),
("2018-10-13", "26474245", "Justin", "Fantastic place to stay. All the needed bits and pieces throughout the apartment and all the local shops give plenty of variety and quality when it comes to food choices.Super easy check in and great communication with Leigh and his team Thanks Again!"),
("2018-10-28", "26474245", "Martin", "Great place to stay in Coogee. Very comfortable apartment. The beach is only 150m away and there are endless choices for food."),
("2018-11-04", "26474245", "Adam", "Unbelievable facilities  location and cleanliness. Leigh is unbelievably organised  professional and punctual. Highly recommend"),
("2018-11-08", "26474245", "Arwen", "Stylish unit in fabulous central location in fantastic Coogee. Leigh was very responsive to messages and extremely helpful. Thank you."),
("2018-11-10", "26474245", "Nicholas", "Had a great stay. Was a great spot and the place was clean. Leigh was easy to get in touch with making check-in a breeze."),
("2018-11-16", "26474245", "Chris", "Leigh’s place is very spacious and comfortable. It is very convenient to restaurants  bars and walking/running trails along the beaches. I would definitely recommend staying here."),
("2018-11-21", "26474245", "Teri", "This place is set up really well for a family. Perfect beach decor and having a washer/dryer combo was a definite plus. Lots of places to eat nearby and the beach is so close. Everything you need  including a grocery store right up the street. Leigh was an incredibly helpful host. Thank you for the stay!!"),
("2018-11-23", "26474245", "Bill", "Leigh’s place is absolutely perfect. Great location  clean  spacious and Leigh made coming and going extremely easy. Highly recommend this as a place to stay."),
("2018-11-29", "26474245", "Eden", "A nice and cosy unit  with a great central location along Coogee Bay Road."),
("2018-12-01", "26474245", "Teena", "Great convenient location  right in the centre of Coogee. Nice roomy apartment. Would stay again."),
("2018-12-20", "26474245", "Richard", "It is a very nice place with a perfect location  only a minute from the beach and the bus stop to catch buses to CBD. We enjoyed our stay very much! Leigh is a wonderful host."),
("2019-01-02", "26474245", "Anita", "Leigh's apartment is superbly located  close to the amazing Maloney's grocer and some fabulous restaurants and cafes but most importantly only a short walk to the amazing Coogee beach. The apartment is clean and comfortable  especially the beds! Quiet as it faces away from the street. We had a fantastic stay!"),
("2019-01-23", "26474245", "Annette", "A bright  fresh and spacious apartment  perfect for our family of 5. The location is brilliant   very close to everything  and surprisingly quiet."),
("2019-02-07", "26474245", "Nicholas", "Great location  reasonably priced!"),
("2019-02-09", "26474245", "Britt", "Leigh’s place is the perfect spot for a quiet coastal getaway  in the heart of thriving Coogee. He’s a great host who went over and above to make our stay easy and enjoyable. I would highly recommend Leigh’s place for your next beachside holiday."),
("2019-02-14", "26474245", "Maíra", "Confy place really well located."),
("2018-07-01", "26334724", "Regina", "Apartment was amazing  exactly what's needed for a few friends or a family. Location was great as we did not want to be directly in the cbd and cleanliness spotless  would definitely stay again."),
("2018-07-30", "26334724", "Carl", "The apartment is in a great location - under 10 mins walk from Redfern station. Central air conditioning is a big plus especially in winter.The IGA over the road is very handy.Good hosts who communicated well with us throughout our stay.Check in and check out is simple and easy."),
("2018-08-16", "26334724", "Giles", "The apartment is great - airy and tidy.  Redfurn is an area being redeveloped so not full of eateries so you might need to travel.  The check in procedure (lock box) needs to be sorted out as at present it's not really safe to arrive a night."),
("2018-08-23", "26334724", "Gianfelice", "The place was overall very nice. The apartment was decently located and very comfortable for a family of 4. Although we had a few misunderstandings with the property managers  it was a very pleasant experience and we would definitely recommend it!"),
("2018-08-31", "26334724", "Miral", "Cozy and clean place. The location is perfect for me and almost same like the pictures."),
("2018-09-13", "26334724", "Vitaliy", "Amazing hostsHelp was always a phone call away.5 min walk to metro  great cafes nearby. Thank you Franca&Alessio"),
("2018-09-29", "26334724", "Pan", "Franca & Alessio My friends and I stay at Sydney for 8 nights in your apartment. The location is very convenient. We can visit any places in a very short time. Your place is very fancy and comfortable.We would like to stay at your place next time if we come back to Sydney again!Thank you so much!Pan"),
("2018-10-06", "26334724", "Lu", "Franca and Alessio are very nice person. They answered my question and requests very fast! Also the apartment is very clean  we got a good living experience in there."),
("2018-10-09", "26334724", "Emma", "We stayed here for a few nights with our 3 month old and the in-laws. We had everything we needed for our stay and the location is brilliant. Redfern station is such a short walk and the location made it easy to navigate around Sydney with a young baby. The hosts communicated well and quickly before and during our stay and allowed a late check out which was great as the weather took a bad turn and we had a later flight booked.I would recommend staying here."),
("2018-10-14", "26334724", "Clare", "Great space and location and wonderful communication"),
("2018-10-20", "26334724", "Monique", "We chose to stay here due to proximity to the Australian Technology Park conference venue - 6-mins walk away!A great set of cafes  restaurants and bars kept us entertained locally...but 5-mins walk to Redfern Station makes getting to the city or inner-west super-easy too.Set in a beautiful  safe complex  it’s easy to feel like a local. The apartment has everything needed for cooking and a night in too. We hope that the hosts will keep on top of the cleaning  as it’s a great apartment to call home."),
("2018-10-27", "26334724", "Bruce", "Comfortable modern apartment within easy walking distance to trains and buses  close to city. Supermarket is just over the road."),
("2018-11-02", "26334724", "Michelle-Lisa", "Die Wohnung hat eine gute lage. Es sind ca 5 Minuten zur Bahn und auf dem Weg gibt es ein süsses Kaffee und einen Spar. Es hat ein Zimmer mit Badezimmer und das andere Zimmer hat das Badezimmer um die ecke nicht im Zimmer was einwenig doff war. Aber alles im einem war es toll in der Wohnung."),
("2018-11-03", "26334724", "Hannah", "Enjoyed our stay at Franca and Alessios place. Apartment was as described on the listing and in the pictures and location is close to Redfern and Surry Hills and within easy reach to the city. Check in was very smooth and great instructions were provided and response to emails was swift. Would recommend."),
("2018-11-07", "26334724", "Jia Ling", "great location and lovely place"),
("2018-11-08", "26334724", "Kyle", "Great house in a fun area! Really enjoyed the trip!"),
("2018-11-25", "26334724", "Barbara", "The location for us was a little too far from the hospital but otherwise Franca and Alessio were great hosts"),
("2018-11-28", "26334724", "Charlotte", "The place was really lovely and Franca & Alessio responded to everything we asked extremely fast!"),
("2018-11-30", "26334724", "Jessica", "Fantastic apartment  had everything we needed and communication was really efficient."),
("2018-12-25", "26334724", "Mark", "Was clean  great location and easy check-in!"),
("2019-01-01", "26334724", "Hanna", "We had a pleasant stay at Franca and Alessio’s place. Location is decent and the hosts were very easy to communicate with."),
("2019-01-15", "26334724", "Keiran", "Thanks for a great nights sleep in your wonderful apartment. It was clean  had nice touches that I enjoyed and was so close to Redfern station the city was not far away at all! It was secure  private and clean"),
("2019-01-22", "26334724", "David", "Great place to stay. With loads of little touches  such as tea  coffee bottled water and toiletries. There has been an obvious effort and pride in setting out the unit to make it feel welcoming."),
("2019-02-10", "26334724", "Chen", "先说好的地方 房东很热情 说话很礼貌 沟通无障碍｡地理位置还可以 离悉尼歌剧院和购物中心坐车十几分钟吧｡房间干净 虽然在路边 但关了门很安静｡不好的地方有两个 入住的时候 钥匙盒房东放在建筑外 不远 晚上真的是不太好找｡厕所特别小 两个房间都是大床房 没有分开的单人床｡"),
("2019-02-22", "26334724", "Utppal", "Overall we had a comfortable stay at Franca & Alessio's  apartment. Redfern Station is only a 5 min walk away and convenient stores & several food joints are in close proximity - making the apartment conveniently located.A little more attention to the cleanliness and functioning of kitchen appliances would have made our stay more pleasant."),
("2019-02-23", "26334724", "Daniel", "Great  tidy apartment in a really good location near shops  restaurants and Redfern Station."),
("2018-09-12", "26609688", "Henry", "Shared a stay a the Little Albion for work - great location  spacious and super clean rooms  really lovely atmosphere. All in all a lovely experience. Highly recommended"),
("2018-11-06", "26609688", "Henry", "Fast becoming a regular visitor to the Little Albion! A sparkling clean room with detailed amenities  and a friendly stylish ground floor area to do a little work over breakfast before going round the corner to enjoy Surry Hills. Really lovely to spend time with Wendy again  and the fact that everyone knows your name is charming. Looking forward to coming back again soon!"),
("2014-06-02", "2660996", "Daniel", "Doris was great  she was very accommodating with when I could check in (11pm) and she responded to my communications in a timely fashion.  They have a beautiful home that I wish I could have taken advantage of more."),
("2018-10-09", "2660996", "Michael", "Doris is a great host. She went out of her way to make sure we were comfortable and our stay was enjoyable. We liked it so much we are staying again next week."),
("2018-10-17", "2660996", "Michael", "Doris is a great host.  She made us feel right at home.  The room is lovely and clean and a separate bathroom is available for guests' use.  We enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-07-15", "26728997", "Lin", "房東人很好 熱情 訊息都有即時回覆感謝Jill這幾天的照顧"),
("2018-07-20", "26728997", "Kieron", "The host canceled this reservation 3 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-07-23", "26728997", "Nicolas", "good cheap and clean place to live ! with really good host.  Really friendly  will visit them if i have the occasion for sure ! "),
("2018-07-31", "26785847", "Kishma", "Great cozy apartment. Just as described.  Quiet neighborhood  or at least where this place is was quiet.  A short walk to the Kings Cross subway station so it is well situated.  The staff at the Regent Court where you pick up the keys was super friendly and helpful and very responsive via email.  I would absolutely recommend to others or stay there again myself the next time I'm in Sydney."),
("2018-08-14", "26785847", "Caitlin", "We loved staying in this cosy flat  it’s so charming and it felt like home right away. The location is great – close to all the action but on a quiet street and everything just felt fun and easy. Thank you for sharing your beautiful home with us! "),
("2018-08-21", "26785847", "Raja", "Very stylish and great flashback to the past with the Art Deco! Highly accessible to downtown Sydney!"),
("2018-11-02", "26785847", "Chloé", "My husband and I loved our stay at John’s apartment. We booked for 2 weeks and ended up extending another week! The location is the biggest drawcard  being so central and close to kingscross station along with lots of great cafes (Jeremy & Sons  Room 10  Primary Coffee) and restaurants (buffalo dining club and Apollo). The apartment itself is super cute and welcoming. John was always on hand to help with everything we needed. Thank you for having us!"),
("2019-01-06", "26785847", "Julia", "John has a really comfortable apartment. Potts Point is a pretty neighborhood. Checking in was easy. We are all in all very ppleased with our stay."),
("2019-02-13", "26785847", "Patricia", "A really interesting period apartment."),
("2018-07-21", "26829659", "Kristy", "Great service. Would recommend this place to anyone in a heart beat. A++++ host. Quick to reply to messages"),
("2018-07-24", "26829659", "Steve", "Joseph’s place is perfect for a visit to Homebush. Don’t stay in a hotel!!!"),
("2018-07-27", "26829659", "Soniya", "The property is great with a spectacular location."),
("2018-07-28", "26829659", "Arash", "Joseph had an appointment  however  his mom came for check in and she did the follow ups. She is so friendly and welcoming. The unit is modern and comfortable. Spectacular view and great location. Close to ANZ stadium and public transportation. I totally recommend Joseph’ Place. "),
("2018-08-02", "26829659", "Trish", "Would definitely stay here again it was lovely and clean and close to everything we needed. The beds are comfortable and the view is amazing. Joseph was very accommodating and friendly. Great place!"),
("2018-08-04", "26829659", "Khoa", "Amazing place and host!"),
("2018-08-11", "26829659", "Kerry", "We had a fabulous stay in Homebush  thanks to the location and convenience of this fantastic property  which was an easy walk to ANZ Stadium  restaurants and other amenities:)"),
("2018-08-12", "26829659", "Nicole", "Wonderful location for anything going on near Homebush. Clean  polite host"),
("2018-08-13", "26829659", "Amy", "Joseph was a great host and was very accommodating. Thankyou for letting us stay in your lovely apartment!  Was exactly what we were needing"),
("2018-08-13", "26829659", "Rachael", "Overall the place is amazing value for money. Location is excellent for (Email hidden by Airbnb) munication with the hosts is easy.  If you do decide to stay here make sure you print out the instructions given by the hosts to get into the car park and up to the unit as it is a bit tricky.I would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-08-20", "26829659", "Mere", "Thank you for being an accomodating host. The apartment is lovely and stylish with perfect location to sporting locations and awesome eatery’s Great value"),
("2018-08-24", "26829659", "Louise", "Everything was great. Clean  convenient  good communication. Everything you could need and all for a great price."),
("2018-08-26", "26829659", "Laura", "Joseph and Judy’s place is just what we needed for our stay at Olympic Park. It is so clean and comfortable and everything we needed was there . Even after a mix up with the keys   they were so understanding but please make sure you listen carefully to their instructions and don’t make the same mistake we did  We hope to be back soon "),
("2018-08-26", "26829659", "Angela", "Great location. Walking distance to the stadiums. Just what we need for our overnight stay."),
("2018-09-01", "26829659", "Eilagh", "Joseph is an excellent host. The accommodation is excellent  easy access to public transport and good parking for vehicle. There is ample space for all luggage. The kitchen is well equipped and above standard. The space is ideal for relaxing or traveling into the city. Air-conditioning and fresh air easily accessed while traffic noise is at a minimum. A great place to stay when visiting Sydney!"),
("2018-09-02", "26829659", "Eunmin", "Over all good."),
("2018-09-03", "26829659", "Chris", "Good value  great location at Olympic Park  good view and very good coffee down the road. Will use again."),
("2018-09-06", "26829659", "Vanessa", "My little girl and I stayed at Joseph's place for 3 nights. I've stayed at few air bnbs and this has been the best by far and great value for money. it was very spacious  and the view was amazing   especially by night. Joseph was always quick to reply to any messages and was very welcoming. Thank you Joseph for a great stay. will definitely be back."),
("2018-09-17", "26829659", "Beatrix", "Great place in great location. Very helpful. Thank you"),
("2018-09-17", "26829659", "Sue", "P"),
("2018-09-19", "26829659", "Asta", "Place was easy to get to  walking distance from everything in the Olympic park area. Was bigger than expected. Perfect place to stay! Will stay again."),
("2018-09-25", "26829659", "Phoebe", "The place was immaculate & Joseph and Judy were amazing . Would definitely stay again !"),
("2018-09-29", "26829659", "C", "I was given the check in info one day before my stay though Airbnb officially said I would be given all the info three days before my stay. Host did not provide WIFI access though it was mentioned in the AD. Have been provided most of the kitchen ware. Location is very convenient if you got yourself a car. Secure parking space is a plus point. Close to DFO if you like shopping. All in all the whole apartment is fine and worth the money( nearly 300 for 3night)."),
("2018-09-30", "26829659", "Mick", "Great place to stay - clean and comfortable. Would recommend"),
("2018-10-02", "26829659", "Silvio Esteban", "Es un departamento bonito y muy espacioso. Nos encontramos con algunos detalles desprolijos en los dormitorios  con sábanas arrugadas  algunos pelos en las almohadas  y polvo en los muebles. ´Puede que se haya descuidado esto por nuestra solicitud de ingreso unas horas antes del horario acordado  pedido que nos fue amablemente concedido."),
("2018-10-04", "26829659", "Megan", "It was located on perfect and easy to find the place with nice views!^^"),
("2018-10-06", "26829659", "Aimee", "Judy was lovely and very welcoming and the communication was great! Fab  clean  well-presented apartment with a great view in a handy location. Good value for money."),
("2018-10-07", "26829659", "Tila", "Great apartment! And great hosts"),
("2018-10-09", "26829659", "Scott", "Great place  Amazing location  very helpful  we would stay again"),
("2018-10-11", "26829659", "Eva", "We had a great stay at the this apartment. It was bigger than expected and everything we needed was there. Nice view included. We would stay here again. Thanks again for hosting us! ;)"),
("2018-10-14", "26829659", "Peter", "Great service  beautiful place  fantastic value and close too olympic park. Extremely happy an will be back again."),
("2018-10-19", "26829659", "Tish", "Very well managed by Joseph and Judy. Great communication throughout our booking and arrival greeting was lovely. We enjoyed the whole apartment and it was nice to stay in comfy beds! We will definitely be back to stay here again. Awesome location to the stadiums and secure parking... ideal place to stay in Olympic park!"),
("2018-10-20", "26829659", "Stacey", "The place was great  spacious and roomy. We were attending ANZ for a conference and whilst it was only me who stayed there  you could easily accomodate 5-6 adults comfortably. Two bathrooms is also great when trying to get ready. Great views from the balcony and air con and blinds made more a comfortable stay.The kitchen space was great but you will need to take your own milk  tea/coffee and breakfast items if wanting to use them. There is a convenience store downstairs and just outside but beware it is quite expensive too so only purchase limited items there. A few restaurants etc also down there with variety of cuisine too."),
("2018-10-20", "26829659", "Tam", "Great value. Everything was really good! No complaints.  Highly recommend to others."),
("2018-10-22", "26829659", "Cassy", "Perfect location for X Games at Sydney Olympic Park. Only a 10 minute walk  great location and host"),
("2018-10-26", "26829659", "Annette", "Great location with great views. Joseph was quick to respond to any questions."),
("2018-10-29", "26829659", "Heather", "Great location & view Very convenient for events & activities at Olympic Park & surrounding district."),
("2018-11-01", "26829659", "Renae", "Joseph's apartment is great for a short stay especially if you need to be in the Sydney Olympic Park precinct. It is walking distance to the main stadiums. Plenty of food options walking distance. Joseph and Judy were very easy to communicate with  promptly replying to any messages and  accommodating with requests. The car park was great  instructions for check-in easy to follow. My only feedback to Joseph would be to spend more time on ensuring the apartment was cleaned properly. Overall the stay was good and it was value for money."),
("2018-11-03", "26829659", "Justine", "Great apartment  had everything we needed and more ! Can’t wait to go back ❤️"),
("2018-11-07", "26829659", "Jessica", "Lovely  modern and comfortable apartment. Close to the train station. Joseph was a great host"),
("2018-11-09", "26829659", "Emily", "Place was very convenient to Olympic Park with great cafes and restaurants on the street. Great hosts with quick response times"),
("2018-11-11", "26829659", "Bradley", "Fantastic location for any event at Olympic Park. Very tidy apartment and host very responsive. Would definitely stay there again for any Homebush events."),
("2018-11-15", "26829659", "Tim", "Great place  perfect location."),
("2018-11-16", "26829659", "Amy", "Conveniently located  clean and tidy property."),
("2018-11-17", "26829659", "Hannah", "Great apartment to stay in when attending events at Olympic Park. Plenty of places to eat in the area and quick responses from the host when needed."),
("2018-11-23", "26829659", "Helen", "I’d really recommend this place if you’re seeing a show or sporting event at Olympic Park. It’s very handy and a just short walk from the stadium/arena  along brightly lit streets. Very comfortable and with two bedrooms and bathrooms would suit either families  friends or colleagues who need a place to stay."),
("2018-12-03", "26829659", "Hoang Phuc", "That was a great place to stay. Highly recommended!!!"),
("2018-12-07", "26829659", "Ian", "Lovely apartment with great service from Joseph and Judy - already looking forward to my next stay."),
("2018-12-08", "26829659", "Ashley", "Joseph's place was fantastic  definitely the nicest airbnb apartment in the building. Joseph was super helpful. highly recomend"),
("2018-12-13", "26829659", "Joel", "The unit was in a fantastic location to Olympic Park. It was very clean  tidy and well presented. I would highly recommend this host to anyone. 10/10"),
("2018-12-14", "26829659", "Amanda", "Great location especially if you are headed to a concert etc.  Fantastic cafe downstairs for breakfast and convenient store close by.  Amazing view from the balcony.  Would stay here again. Joseph was a great host and was quick to respond to my queries."),
("2018-12-16", "26829659", "Mya", "服务周到 干净卫生 非常好!"),
("2018-12-23", "26829659", "Vanessa", "Joseph’s apartment is amazing! Very clean and tidy. Joseph has been great help  very quick respond. The apartment is very new  it has everything you need. There are grocery stores and restaurants available downstairs. 5mins walking distance to the station. About 20 mins drive to CBD. Secured parking. I had a wonderful stay in his apartment  I would definitely book this apartment again if I visit Sydney."),
("2018-12-31", "26829659", "Anne", "L'appartement est très bien. Le transport en commun est près mais pour aller en ville  il faut planifier environ 1 heure. Le Wifi n'est pas régulier et donc le signal est souvent faible.The apartment was really fine. The commune transport took us an hour to go to the city and the wifi was not regular  but it’s quite usual in Australia.In the end  it’s a REALLY good value and the host were easy to contact.Thanks a lot!"),
("2019-01-05", "26829659", "William", "This is a very modern apartment in an incredible location. I wish I had more time to explore the surrounding area than I did. The host was very accommodating to travel plans  and very responsive to my communications. I would definitely stay here again if I come back to Sydney."),
("2019-01-09", "26829659", "Brian", "Won't be disappointed"),
("2019-01-18", "26829659", "Jessica", "This place was great! Wonderful location - parking included which was awesome. Perfect walking distance to restaurants and both stadiums. Quick responses and communication. Recommended!"),
("2019-01-20", "26829659", "Huong", "Great value for money! Easy communication and great location"),
("2019-01-21", "26829659", "Susan", "Joseph""s apartment was amazing. Everything you need is there"),
("2019-01-24", "26829659", "Katherine", "Fantastic location  close to events  Bicentennial Park  cafes and transport.  Easy to follow instructions from owners on parking and apartment access.  Very comfortable and appointed apartment.  Would definitely recommend."),
("2019-01-24", "26829659", "Nikki", "Great location for Olympic Park events"),
("2019-01-25", "26829659", "Kath", "Relative close to Qudos arena  neat and tidy apartment."),
("2019-01-28", "26829659", "Corinne", "Thanks kindly for hosting us  we had a nice stay. Very convenient location for events/concerts at Olympic Park"),
("2019-01-29", "26829659", "Dione", "A beautiful property. In a great location. Very stylish  great views  and a perfect place for a getaway! Quick responses from host  and very helpful. We will definitely come again :)"),
("2019-01-31", "26829659", "Enisia", "Great location :) and the apartment was very well set up and stylish with a homely touch. The host were very understanding and rapid in reply as I requested to check our late due to unforeseen circumstances. Will definitely stay again."),
("2019-02-02", "26829659", "Tony", "Great location if you are attending anything in the Olympic Park area. Easy access  and plenty of food options nearby."),
("2019-02-11", "26829659", "Tori", "Great location in Sydney Olympic Park  nice space with parking spot and washer in the unit."),
("2019-02-14", "26829659", "Jade", "Perfect!!"),
("2019-02-15", "26829659", "Jodie", "a beautiful place to stay   comfortable and tidy. nice hosts.  we will stay here again."),
("2019-02-16", "26829659", "Ashlee", "Great location in Sydney Olympic Park. The apartment is a neat and tidy place with everything you could want. The view was very nice  looking out to ANZ stadium. We were very happy with our stay and Joseph is great at communicating about checking in."),
("2019-02-20", "26829659", "Sharon", "Well appointed apartment in a great location for any events in Olympic Park."),
("2019-02-21", "26829659", "Belinda", "Highly recommend. Great location for events at Sydney Olympic Park. Modern  clean apartment."),
("2019-02-22", "26829659", "Janellece1", "Great location"),
("2019-02-24", "26829659", "Travis", "had a good stay"),
("2019-02-25", "26829659", "Lynn", "The apartment is beautifully apportioned  spacious and has beautiful views. It is clean and comfortable  with all amenities as advertised. Joseph was very helpful with storage of luggage  as we arrived very early before check in time  and wanted to explore the town. The area felt safe and the train and bus were nearby and easy to use for guests without cars. (The bus stop was right outside the building  and the bus and train were exceptionally clean and also felt safe). I recommend researching the process for where to buy passes for the bus and train."),
("2019-02-27", "26829659", "Kate", "A nice homely unit. Close to everything you need in Olympic park."),
("2019-03-01", "26829659", "Amy", "We only stayed for a night at Joseph's place but we found the apartment spacious and comfortable. It was also nice to be within walking distances to the major stadiums."),
("2019-03-02", "26829659", "K.J.", "Great location  very clean  good check in. Thx b much"),
("2018-08-12", "26934151", "Sheena", "We had a great stay at George's place. He was very prompt in his responses. Loved his tips for good restaurants and bars in the neighbourhood. The apt is very cosy  clean and comfortable. It's perfectly located in the central with easy access to the metro. Total value for money."),
("2018-08-20", "26934151", "Matthew", "Great cosy equipped  apartment in excellent location. Excellent value for money."),
("2018-09-02", "26934151", "Philip", "This apartment was just perfect for my wife and I. Perfectly sized and located  very comfortable  professionally fitted out  unbelievably quiet and private even though it's just a stone's throw from Sydney's famous nightlife and a short stroll to the harbour foreshore.  Reasonably priced  we will definitely make this our No. 1 place to stay in Sydney."),
("2018-09-07", "26934151", "Duncan", "Great spot. Very clean and cozy. Great location to local cafes and in a cool and safe neighborhood."),
("2018-09-17", "26934151", "Duska", "Great apartment. Fantastic location. George could not have been more helpful."),
("2018-09-22", "26934151", "John", "Nice place. Great host. Terrific location. Near what remains of Sydney nightlife as well as great places to dine out and breakfast."),
("2018-09-29", "26934151", "Olivia", "Great stay!!!"),
("2018-10-01", "26934151", "Fiona", "Loved staying at George’s apartment. Amazing location  parking was excellent and the unit itself spacious  clean and stylish."),
("2018-10-13", "26934151", "Ian", "This is a great find in the Elizabeth Bay area. George took our reservation on short notice  and was very responsive. The apartment exceeded our expectations- it's very well kept and has all the amenities we were hoping for including a washer and dryer in unit and full kitchen. Check in was simple and straightforward  and George was easy to reach when we had a question. I highly recommend this rental."),
("2018-10-16", "26934151", "Tracey", "The apartment is in a great location - on a quiet street within an easy walk through the Botanic gardens to the centre of town. Buses and trains can be caught just a few minutes walk away  and there are all the shops you would need to stock up also within walking distance.The accommodation was very clean  well equipped  stylish  comfortable and spacious. The kitchen had everything you might need - including a coffee machine and pods and dish washer! The key collection/drop off  process  was easy  and the building secure. It was one of the few places we found with two separate double bedrooms.We didn't see the pool because the weather wasn't really great  but we did spend some time sitting on the balcony enjoying the trees and the birds. All in all it was a lovely few days and for a very reasonable cost  thoroughly recommended!"),
("2018-10-25", "26934151", "Vicki", "Perfect location!  Close to the train station so it was very easy to get anywhere.  The neighborhood was full of great restaurants or if you want to stay “home” there are grocery stores close by.  The kitchen had everything you needed to cook.  We loved hanging out on the balcony to unwind and relax after full days of exploring.  Beautiful place!!!"),
("2018-10-29", "26934151", "Alistair", "Perfect host and location - thoroughly recommend!"),
("2018-12-07", "26934151", "Chrissie", "Absolutely perfectly located for Sydney  and great access to transport links  lots of local amenities  comfy and well presented place with lots of space and loads of added extras. George is good to communicate with and couldn’t fault our stay."),
("2018-12-26", "26934151", "Marta", "George’s apartment is an example of what Airbnb should be .  George made sure everything is clean and new as well as stylish. We found his apartment very comfortable and it was so nice and quiet ."),
("2019-01-03", "26934151", "Lauren", "We stayed in this apartment for one week during December. Exceptional location - only a short walk to the train station. Apartment clean and host responds very quickly to all messages!"),
("2019-01-08", "26934151", "Vesna", "A stylish wee unit in a handy location.  George the host was very easy to contact and very friendly. Appreciated the air conditioning  nice linens  amenities in the bathroom and furnishings. Thank you for your hospitality."),
("2019-01-18", "26934151", "Amanda", "Excellent property and host. Check-in straightforward  property delightful - very clean  well-appointed and with extra touches to make it feel like home. Host not present on arrival but responded promptly to queries and ensured a totally smooth stay. Property ideal for us  including a delightful balcony; aircon in bedrooms & livingroom all individually controlled; plenty of space and amenities  and utensils. Area perfect: gorgeous  quiet  transport links all v convenient and close. Would stay at George's place again and would recommend without hesitation. Lovely."),
("2019-01-21", "26934151", "Gabby", "George’s place is in an excellent location to the train and some really nice cafes right outside. The area can be a bit dodgey at night time but it definitely means you get to see a more authentic side to Sydney. Beautifully styled and comfortable. Will definitely keep this in mind when I visit Sydney again."),
("2019-01-26", "26934151", "Alexandra", "Thank you George for hosting us!  We enjoyed staying at your apartment. Great location  close to good restaurants and coffee   transport  historic places and parking was relatively easy too."),
("2019-01-30", "26934151", "Carmen", "George is an amazing host  the location is great And very quiet."),
("2019-02-04", "26934151", "Marion", "Well placed apartment for the area  clean and tidy. Had everything we needed."),
("2019-02-09", "26934151", "Debbie", "George is a great host.  He is very communicative.  He left very good detailed check in instructions and checked in with us the next day to make sure everything went well with check in and everything with the apartment was ok.  His apartment is very nice and very comfortable.  We would definitely stay here again."),
("2019-02-10", "26934151", "Stephen", "This is a great property in a lovely area of Sydney. The beds were really comfortable with nice touches in the apartment. There are plenty of restaurants near by and the historical Elizabeth House just down the road. It's a comfortable walk to Woolloomooloo but there are hills and steps."),
("2019-02-13", "26934151", "Alana", "George’s apartment is centrally located close to mcleay st and the harbour. It is a gorgeous  relaxing sanctuary with everything you need to enjoy The beautiful harbour city"),
("2019-02-19", "26934151", "Dawn", "George’s apartment is great everything and more that you need for up to 4 people.  The check in was smooth and although we didn’t see George he let us know he was at the end of a text. Lots of amenities provided  kitchen ware  toiletries everything you would need. The apartment was very spacious and immaculately clean. The best bit for us was location- 30 minute walk to the Sydney harbour great! Overall this was a great place to stay thanks George"),
("2019-03-02", "26934151", "Jonathan", "Great apartment.  George is very responsive and instructions are very clear."),
("2018-08-24", "27009904", "Jason", "Very accommodating host. Easy to communicate with. Would stay again."),
("2018-08-25", "27009904", "John", "Friendly hosts  clean and well appointed apartment. soundproofed from traffic ten floors below  comfortable beds  shampoo  conditioner and body wash products in the bathroom  good strong stream shower. Good view of part of Sydney from the windows  handy access to bus and train."),
("2018-08-26", "27009904", "Jaime", "Great space"),
("2018-08-27", "27009904", "得盛", "Tim  and Mel are very friendly and helpful  they especially prepare snack bar for us. "),
("2018-08-30", "27009904", "Sally", "This is ideal accommodation for a couple or a single traveller who wants to be near the city and on the Airport route.  Lovely modern clean functional accommodation and welcoming hosts."),
("2018-09-13", "27009904", "Alex", "Lovely place in a central location. Room is lovely with a really comfortable bed. Would recommend staying here in Sydney too anyone  great value for money as well! Host even dropped us to airport on return flight for cheap fee!"),
("2018-09-16", "27009904", "Xiyun", "Tim and Mel’s place is as lovely as it looks; even better  should I say  when you consider their hospitality and thoughtfulness. They truly put themselves in their guests’ shoes and do their best to accomodate to your preferences (within limit  of course). I had a delightful time staying at their residence  which was very close to the Green Square train station  and I would highly recommend their place to anyone looking for a comfortable  affordable and convenient place to stay!"),
("2018-09-17", "27009904", "Hannah", "We had a wonderful stay with Tim and Mel. Their place was clean  comfy  spacious and super close to the station. They were great hosts."),
("2018-09-21", "27009904", "Nick", "Perfectly located less than 100 meters from Green Square Train Station (one stop away from Central) this place is just as beautiful as the photos. Very  very clean and Tim and Mel are so kind and easy to chat with. They also give you your own space if that’s what you like. I had a lovely gift basket of muesli bars and crisps on the bed when I arrived. The whole area is brand new  and buildings are still going up  so there’s a bit of construction going on around the place (Sept 2018)  however  it didn’t ruin my stay. The apartment building Tim and Mel’s place is in is very beautiful - quiet too!Local tips: I’d recommend popping into Textbook Boulangerie which is about 200m away - amazing French Pastries. Grounds of Alexandria isn’t far either - hip cafe/coffee options. The new library is worth popping into as well - it’s quite a spectacle at night.Woolworths is virtually on your doorstep too.Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2018-09-27", "27009904", "Yufan", "Nice person& clean area  we are so appreciate for your welcoming."),
("2018-09-28", "27009904", "Massimiliano", "Very nice hosts. It’s a very clean apartment. Convenient location. Close to the airport"),
("2018-10-01", "27009904", "Maiko", "空港､家､ｵﾍﾟﾗﾊｳｽが全て同じ路線なのでとても便利でした!また駅から家もとても近く疲れて帰ってきても大丈夫です｡部屋の中もとても清潔で手入れが行き届いていて､快適に過ごすことができました｡機会があれば次回も泊まりたいです!"),
("2018-10-05", "27009904", "Chanelle", "I recommend this place  but more importantly the hosts! They were so welcoming and helpful had everything ready and presented so well. If you want a comfy.. beautiful and convenient place to stay? Hit Tim and Mel up! you won't be disappointed :)))"),
("2018-10-06", "27009904", "Hung-Nam", "A wonderful place to stay!So clean and comfortable!The location is great! Only 1 train stop from down town Sydney.Tim and Mel were so friendly!"),
("2018-10-06", "27009904", "Ling", "Tim and Mel are very lovely hosts. They are helpful and do provide the best for their guests.We've had a nice experience staying with them at their little nest.Their place is just as displayed on website  very clean & cozy.Will definitely recommend them and the place to anyone. And will be back again ourselves!Thanks Tim and Mel :)"),
("2018-10-08", "27009904", "Quentin", "Great stay  easy communication with host"),
("2018-10-09", "27009904", "Laura", "Sydney is a horrible place."),
("2018-10-11", "27009904", "Gloria", "We had a lovely night stay at Tim and Mel’s place. The apartment was very conveniently located  (10mins from the airport and 2 mins from a train station). The place was clean  beautifully furnished and comfortable. Tim was a great host and communication was a breeze. Will definitely stay again. "),
("2018-10-15", "27009904", "Matthew", "Tim and Mel’s place was impeccable. It ticked all boxes and exceeded my expectations. Communication was great and Tim was very helpful to me as a guest newish to AirBnB.  Close to public transport  excellent cafes and shops. Great AirBnB experience."),
("2018-10-15", "27009904", "Vickii", "Tim & Mel were great hosts! The house was very clean and neat  and location is great too! Tim also responded very quickly to my messages. Thanks for the snacks  it's such a thoughtful addition! :)"),
("2018-10-18", "27009904", "Mei", "A pristine and immaculate new apartment with charming hosts  5 minutes walk from Green Square train station and Woolworths.  Great to have my own private bathroom and room next to it.  Amenities exceeded my expectations.  Felt thoroughly safe with lockable door  secure entrance and internal monitoring by hosts."),
("2018-10-19", "27009904", "Jamie", "Extremely cute and comfortable apartment! Tim & Mel were great hosts  always available for questions and recommendations. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-10-21", "27009904", "Ye-Jin", "Although I am fairly familiar with Sydney as it wasn’t my first visit; Tim & Mel’s Place was a great place to be.The apartment is very close to the airport and the train station (walkable distance) which was a big plus for me  easy to travel in between central and explore the best parts of Sydney. Proximity to airport via train was also very convenient.The apartment was very clean and tidy  Tim was very easy to communicate with.Definitely recommend a stay over Tim & Mel’s place if travelling Sydney :)"),
("2018-10-23", "27009904", "Sulla", "The room is quite clean and cozy  and the location is great. It is very convenient to travel. Tim  and Mel are great hosts! Hope to stay again "),
("2018-10-26", "27009904", "John", "Modern spick-n-span 10 floor accommodation with friendly hosts and only 210 meters from the Green Square Train Station."),
("2018-10-30", "27009904", "Hugo", "We stayed at Tim & Mel’s for 4 nights. The place was spotless and well located near  Green Square station. Check in was very easy and the hosts were quick to respond when contacted. We initially had a slight issue with the camera in the living area and where it was placed. After discussing this with Tim & Mel they agreed to move it to a more agreeable place within the room. We’d like to add that we were happy with the host’s response. All in all  a very good stay in a well located apartment."),
("2018-10-30", "27009904", "Zoe", "Tim & Mel are very friendly host. The place they have is so clean and new and stylish  and the best part is the location which is just few mins walk away to an underground train station which connects directly to CBD in just a few stops. They also provided us with snacks in the room which was a very thoughtful gesture and they also allow us to use the dryer and washer which was handy for us after we have traveled outside for a few days. Just a little drawback to the apartment is the construction on going at the opposite building which stop late at night and starts around 7 am in the morning  which Tim provided us ear plugs for. Not an issue for us  as we are quite an early riser. Overall  is a very good stay at Tim and Mel's place! If i were to come back to Sydney  I will definitely be back to stay with them!"),
("2018-11-02", "27009904", "Alexander", "Great location. Stylish apartment with thoughtful touches and good value. Can't fault it"),
("2018-11-04", "27009904", "Anthony", "Tim was a great host and his place is well located  accommodating and very convenient to get around in Sydney. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-11-06", "27009904", "Tiffany", "Tim & Mel’s place was phenomenal! Great location as it was less than a 5 minute walk from Green Square Station. Sparkling clean and bright room. Modern and bright. I would recommend anyone staying in Sydney to stay with Tim and Mel. They offered tips for local places and were extremely welcoming and accommodating."),
("2018-11-07", "27009904", "陈", "非常好客 会给很多当地游玩的建议 期待下次见面"),
("2018-11-13", "27009904", "Yizhou", "房子的位置很棒 一分钟到train station 跟central station只有一站房东人很棒 会准备小零食和速溶饮品 房间很干净 浴室会有洗发水护发素沐浴露可以用"),
("2018-11-18", "27009904", "安琪", "很好的房东"),
("2018-11-19", "27009904", "惊蛰", "Comfy and cozy apartment! It's only minutes' walking to the Green Square Station. Tim and Mel are very nice hosts. Recommend!"),
("2018-11-29", "27009904", "敏", "老板人很nice 热情而有礼貌 住宿干净 交通方便 有机会再去｡"),
("2018-11-29", "27009904", "Tennille", "Great hosts  lovely comfortable accommodation."),
("2018-12-01", "27009904", "Farhana", "Communication with Tim and Mel was fast and easy and their place was great! Located just a few minutes away from Green Square station which connects you to the CBD in just a few stops.The bright and airy room was so cozy and comfortable. They had also provided some snacks in the room which was a thoughtful gesture.Would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-12-03", "27009904", "Giang", "New apartment very near to airport. Host is friendly and helpful."),
("2018-12-05", "27009904", "Adrian", "Classy  clean and comfortable space in a modern new apartment building. Tim could not have been more helpful and was there to greet us  even at an 11pm check-in.Thoughtful touches like providing ear-plugs to combat the noise from overnight road works and letting us leave suitcases there for the day after we had checked out were definitely over and above.Highly recommended to business and leisure travellers alike."),
("2018-12-07", "27009904", "Xiya", "It is just overall so great!!!!"),
("2018-12-10", "27009904", "Elisabeth Zoe", "Tim was very responsive and understanding of the fact that my flight got delayed. The place is amazing - sparkling clean  quiet  spacious. I really enjoyed staying there!"),
("2018-12-13", "27009904", "Rose", "Great place in an excellent location. Stylish and spotless it’s more like staying in a luxury hotel room. Thanks Tim"),
("2018-12-16", "27009904", "穗玲", "We had a impressive experience in our stay. It’s a safe  clean and really stylish room. The hosts are very nice and sweet who would prepare some snacks for us in case we will feel hungry anytime. Beside  the place is so convenient that we can easily access to everywhere in this city we want to go. Really recommend it to you."),
("2018-12-17", "27009904", "Xochitl", "Best hospitality ever  love the cleanliness and tidiness of this place. No shoe policy is my way to go in my house  so I appreciate having it in places where I travel to. The place is brand new and well maintained  bed is comfy. Linen soft and clean. I forgot my converter for the outlet and they had two available! Life savers! I would define you highly recommend it to anybody!"),
("2018-12-18", "27009904", "Natesha", "I had a great overnight stay in Tim and Mel’s beautiful apartment  they were incredible hosts and would recommend their place to anyone coming to Sydney!"),
("2018-12-20", "27009904", "Georgia", "Lovely clean space close to the airport. The hosts were very flexible with checking in and out  and gave some tips for exploring the local area!"),
("2018-12-27", "27009904", "Raymond", "Excellent location close to the train station  only a couple of stop to the city centre  supermarket and cafe nearby  room and bathroom was clean  street parking nearby. Overall we had a good stay at Tim & Mel's. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-12-29", "27009904", "Amber", "The host canceled this reservation 4 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-12-29", "27009904", "Liqun", "The host canceled this reservation 10 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-12-29", "27009904", "Ann", "The host canceled this reservation 12 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2019-01-02", "27009904", "Liping", "很棒很棒的!!"),
("2019-01-24", "27009904", "Natesha", "This my second time staying at Tim and Mel’s and it was just as awesome as the first time! I had an evening flight and Tim arranged for me to keep my luggage in the apartment until I went to the airport."),
("2019-02-08", "27009904", "Sk", "First of all  the location was very nice.(Walk 3-4 minutes from Green Square Station or bus stop)The cleanliness of the room  living room  and bathroom were also very satisfactory.There were washing machines and dryers  so it was convenient.the check-in process was satisfactory.Above all  Tim was very kind. If I visit Sydney again  I want to stay here."),
("2019-02-09", "27009904", "Gary", "Tim delivered AirBnb excellence! The apartment was stylish  faultlessly clean and very well-located to a train station and supermarket. The bed linen was premium  and Tim was a polite and friendly host who was very responsive in prior communication. He was interested in us and making our time in Sydney enjoyable  offering tips on the weather and things to do. 10/10!"),
("2019-02-17", "27009904", "杨帆", "The bedroom is spacious and clean. Tim and Mel are kind and friendly. It was very comfortable and convenient to live in here."),
("2019-02-21", "27009904", "Josefin", "Great  friendly and kind hosts! Made it feel like home :) quick response  every time."),
("2019-02-28", "27009904", "Andrew", "Fantastic space! Wonderful hosts  awesome location  great facilities. Modern  clean  and very well presented. A welcome pack for guests was a lovely touch too!"),
("2019-03-03", "27009904", "Stephanie", "Clean  great location so easy to find from the train station  and supermarket 2 mins walk. A beautiful view and a lovely quiet place to get a good nights sleep. Tim and Mel are really thoughtful hosts! Highly Recommend."),
("2015-01-04", "2711936", "Avi", "Karen is a wonderful host.I really enjoyed her place and her company. Her place is clean comfortable and close to all (2 min walk to the beach)Karen guided me through all my stay and thanks to her my 4 days visit was a filled up with the right activities.Thanks you karen for being such a great host I hope one day to come back."),
("2015-01-12", "2711936", "Nancy", " Karen is a great host. She really looked after me throughout my stay and helped me with all manner of things. I felt very welcome in her place . I liked that the place was so conveniently located to everything: the  shops  the  great variety of eating places and the lovely waters of Bondi Beach. Transport was very easy to the city or Bondi Junction. The place was clean and the bed very comfortable. I would definitely stay again !  Thank you Karen ."),
("2015-03-03", "2711936", "Lily", "Karen is a lovely host. Her place was tidy  clean and comfortable. I felt very welcome and well looked after during my one week stay.The place was conveniently located and close to the beach  shops and transport routes. Thank you Karen!"),
("2015-09-15", "2711936", "Elodie", "Karen is the perfect flatmate for me. Quiet  clean  respectful  nice. I had a great time with her. She is also considerate to her guests  trying to help me to find some shops or stuff like that. The bedroom is sunny  clean and cosy. The bed is comfortable and is bigger than he looks on the picture. The Appartement is also more beautiful than on the picture. The kitchen is very well equipped. What else to say. The location of the flat is vey close to the beach not even 5 limited walk.I had a great time in this Appartement and will definitely come back there if I visit Sydney again."),
("2015-12-23", "2711936", "Beryn", "Karen is a wonderful host and her home is lovely.  She made me feel so welcome and helped me with all my questions about Bondi.  I had a wonderful night’s sleep in Karen’s peaceful home.  Her guest room is very comfortable.  I was also lucky enough to sample Karen’s cooking.  She’s a wonderful cook!  Karen’s home is in a fantastic location near Bondi Beach.  It was such a treat to be so close.  Just a short stroll and you’re on the sand.  Next time I stay in Bondi  Karen’s place will definitely be my first choice for accommodation  and I would love to see her again."),
("2016-02-20", "2711936", "Matt", "Had a great week in Karen's lovely apartment. The room was clean  light and spacious. Karen's a great host and went out of her way to make sure I was happy. Great location few minutes walk to the beach  restaurants and cafe's and easy access to public transport. Would definitely recommend for anyone visiting Bondi! "),
("2016-03-09", "2711936", "Fernanda", "Karen is an amazing person! Big heart and a master cook chef  if you like heath food! The bedroom is bigger than in the pictures! Loved my stay! "),
("2016-04-20", "2711936", "Claire", "I was made very welcome by Karen and shown around the apartment which was indeed bright and sunny and perfectly located in Bondi. Easy to walk to the beach and shops and bus and restaurants.thr room was comfy as was the whole apartment. I would stay here again! Thanks Karen"),
("2016-05-15", "2711936", "Lisa", " Stayed with Karen for almost 2 weeks. Where do I begin?  To say she was a fabulous host is an understatement. She was very kind  helpful and took time to write places of interest  to visit. I was made to feel very much at home at put at ease. Couldn't have picked a better place to stay.  I have enjoyed doing yoga with her going for walks we even found time to go for dinner one evening. I would highly recommend this place to stay as it is so close to the beach and public transport. Would definitely come back!"),
("2016-09-05", "2711936", "Dario", "My experience was great! Karen is too hospitality and the best yoga teacher I ever had. The flat clean and ordered  really close to Bondi beach and others points of interest. Surely I'll know where to go when I'll come again in Sydney.Thank you Karen for the beatiful experience."),
("2017-01-08", "2711936", "Anna", "I thoroughly enjoyed my stay at Karen's apartment! It is extremely close to Bondi beach  in a clean  safe building.  The location is also near 4 different buses to the nearest train station.  It was very easy to get around.  Food and shopping are nearby as well. The room is very comfortable and clean.  I felt very at home and everything I needed to know was explained the first day.  Wi-fi was also available whenever I needed it.  Karen was fun to talk to as well. I enjoyed learning more about Aussie life and things to do in Sydney through her.  I hope to see her again the next time I visit! "),
("2017-02-22", "2711936", "Adiel", "I have spent one week at Karen’s. Awesome place  pretty close to the beach. She explained everything when I got to her place  like house rules and things to do in the surroundings. The room is exactly as seen in the pictures  pretty clean and organized. Breakfast available. I was able to use the laundry room. Karen was a great host  very easygoing and helpful on answering questions regarding the region and it's culture. Definitely recommended."),
("2018-10-09", "2711936", "Kristina", "I loved staying at Karen's place. She is such a kind person and made me feel like home. The place is very close to the beach and in the perfect location for a stay in Bondi. I highly recommend her place and I'd be happy to stay again."),
("2018-10-22", "2711936", "Angelique", "Had a chance to stay with Karen over the weekends and I'm glad I have chosen her place. It's very near to everything especially to the beach. Place is very cozy and nice. Karen is a super host! She is very hospitable and kind. She even gave me a tour and recommended the best spots to visit in Bondi  and on my last day I was a bit in a hurry to get back to the city and she offered me a ride to the bondi junction."),
("2018-10-30", "2711936", "Zé", "Karen is one of the best hosts I've ever had the pleasure of staying with. More than a stay  I made a friend in Bondi! Don't hesitate to stay with her."),
("2018-11-21", "2711936", "Delia", "Karen es como un amigo que espera por tí.  Preocupada de todos los detalles.  La pieza es muy acogedora  extremadamente limpia al igual que todo el depto.   Un lugar muy tranquilo ademas de su excelente ubicación a pocas cuadras de la playa y los lugares de entretención y comercio.  Con locomoción para cualquier lugar de Sydney.  Excelente"),
("2018-12-31", "2711936", "Markell", "My stay at Karen's place went according to plan. Super A+ host and would gladly come back again!"),
("2018-09-23", "27473087", "Adrian", "This place is very well located in Bondi. Suits for 4 peoples easy  good value for money. Cassandra is very communicative and will provide what you need. I definitely recommend this place."),
("2018-10-14", "27473087", "Adriana", "The host canceled this reservation 31 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-09-09", "27479560", "Teigan", "Erin’s Airbnb is exactly like the photos it’s clean and stylish and so easy to check in. Such a beautiful Airbnb if you’re looking for a home away from home this Airbnb is the one you’d want to book!"),
("2018-09-21", "27479560", "Philip", "My family loved staying at Erin's place. The place is beautifully styled  pristine clean  and in short proximity to Wanda beach and the sand dunes. Perfect for a beach get away. Couldn't recommend Erin's place highly enough! 5 stars!"),
("2018-09-23", "27479560", "Emma", "We LOVED our stay! Location was incredible and the place itself was immaculate. Will definitely be staying again next time we are in Sydney! Everything we needed and more."),
("2018-09-27", "27479560", "Julie", "Erin was such a good host  easy check in and provided lots of little extras. Good location close to beach and shops. Immaculately presented with super comfy beds and great entertainment such as Netflix and wifi. I would Highly recommend The Tides Beach apartment"),
("2018-10-06", "27479560", "Emma", "A very  quiet location.. a beautiful tidy and well presented studio apartment. So close to the beach! Host was easy to get in touch with  and most helpful. Would definately stay here again."),
("2018-10-08", "27479560", "Graham", "Very clean and well set out  you dont need to bring anything. A good location only minutes from eating places."),
("2018-10-14", "27479560", "Amanda", "Thank you Erin for an absolutely incredible stay! We loved your place  it was very modern  stylish  impeccably clean.  We were very comfortable and felt we had privacy too. The apartment had all the facilities we needed. Thank you again for the nice additional touches. We loved staying  it was very convenient and if there is ever another opportunity to come back to Cronulla in the future we would stay again. Highly recommend."),
("2018-10-22", "27479560", "Laura", "Five star! Clean  fresh and beautifully styled. We had absolutely everything we needed. Wish we could have stayed longer. Excellent location  perfect host and communication. Would stay here again.I would highly recommend this accommodation to anyone!"),
("2018-11-10", "27479560", "Graham", "Erins place is super nice with great hospitality."),
("2018-11-13", "27479560", "Alison", "Lovely place to stay. Absolutely immaculate throughout! Would highly recommend ❤️"),
("2018-11-23", "27479560", "Charlie", "Loved our stay was the perfect girls pad and was so clean! Great beds and pillows which was awesome being pregnant! We honestly had a really nice stay and felt at Right at home when we didn’t want to go out."),
("2018-12-01", "27479560", "Sally", "Super clean and comfortable  with great amenities  my family enjoyed staying at Erin’s place."),
("2018-12-07", "27479560", "Jac", "Spotlessly clean and modern accommodation not far from the beach. Quiet location and ideal for getting away from the hustle and bustle but only a short drive to shops and cafes etc."),
("2018-12-23", "27479560", "Cathy", "Beautifully presented space with comfy beds. Beach is a couple of minutes walk and so many things to do and see within a short drive."),
("2018-12-27", "27479560", "Peter", "Very thoughtful host - providing both a porta-cot and a high chair for my little one...made the stay all that more simpler and easier."),
("2018-12-28", "27479560", "Georgia", "Erin's place was great! The location was fantastic  the place was incredibly clean and tidy and provided everything we needed. Erin was easy to communicate with and very thorough in her information which was helpful. We'd definitely stay here again :)"),
("2018-09-16", "27498126", "Sébastien", "Lovely and friendly people  close to National Park. Great communication."),
("2018-12-10", "27436445", "Amin", "over all good service"),
("2018-08-21", "27555785", "Becky", "The apartment exceeded our expectation with its view and its modernity  its within walking distance from central station  Chinatown  10mins walk to Pyrmont bay  and tram stop to fish market. The host replies rather quickly to any request or simply any questions. Most housing appliances were provided. Highly recommended "),
("2018-09-17", "27555785", "Juan", "位置非常非常好｡几天都是靠步行和公交去各个景点的｡公寓干净 房东热情｡"),
("2018-09-25", "27555785", "Jason", "非常棒的房子!绝对给你惊喜!"),
("2018-09-27", "27555785", "Derek", "thank you for providing a nice accomodation for my family trip. better than expected. highly recommend."),
("2018-10-20", "27555785", "Charmaine", "Our group of five enjoyed our stay at Cy's place. The location was really great as it was in the middle of Haymarket and easy to get around by foot. Thanks for having us!"),
("2018-11-01", "27555785", "XinYu", "房源地理位置很好 房间比想象中大 性价比很高 会向朋友推荐该房源｡"),
("2018-11-08", "27555785", "Tuitamala", "3 colleagues and I were in town for 5 nights and the place was home away from home! We loved the space so much! Highly recommended!"),
("2019-01-05", "27555785", "Madhu", "Cy provided an excellent place to stay. All amenities were provided  great location  spacious. Quite a new apartment with beautiful views. Lot of restaurants  grocery shops  nearby public transport and walkable to most landmarks. We were a group of 8  and it fit us quite nicely. He even helped us out with a later checkout as per our flight times. Would highly recommend."),
("2019-01-18", "27555785", "James", "Great location. value to stay"),
("2019-01-27", "27555785", "Marcus", "Such a great place to day. Very central and close to everything. Incredible service."),
("2019-02-03", "27555785", "Jenna", "Cy was an amazing host who was super understanding when our flight was delayed and we couldn’t check in till 4pm. The location of the place was outstanding with it only being a 10min walk to darling harbour and a 10 minute train ride into the CBD! 10/10 would recommend and stay again!"),
("2019-02-15", "27555785", "Eva", "It's a convenient and pretty place."),
("2018-08-21", "27580166", "Katie", "We had a fabulous time at Studio Bimbadeen. Stunning location by the river  very tranquil and relaxing. Shirley and her husband were lovely and very hospitable and their little dog was so sweet. We will definitely be coming back here."),
("2018-09-16", "27580166", "Christopher", "Would highly recommend this place  couldnt ask for more from an airbnb  great location and room. The hosts were so helpful and friendly."),
("2018-10-01", "27580166", "Adrian", "Lovely place and outdoor area"),
("2018-11-03", "27580166", "Anthony", "Great host to stay with. Very private place with lovely views over the water.Easy to access and great location."),
("2018-11-10", "27580166", "Martha", "The views are amazing  the studio is styled beautifully and light filled and very private. You won’t be disappointed.."),
("2018-12-08", "27580166", "Merryn", "A lovely  relaxing place on the river. Shirley is a great  thoughtful host."),
("2018-12-30", "27580166", "Madison", "The most beautiful souls inside and out — I had a wonderful stay here. Aside from the accommodations being immaculate (great location  cozy  clean  and everything you need) Shirley is absolutely fantastic. I would be so happy to stay again!"),
("2019-02-16", "27580166", "Eleni", "What a wonderful stay we had here!!! Will definitely be returning - the views are simply stunning and the studio was so beautifully designed. We loved it all!"),
("2019-03-02", "27580166", "Gillian", "What a stunning environment and the accommodation felt luxurious and amazing. The photos don’t do it justice and we loved everything they have done to make it such a heavenly space."),
("2018-11-10", "27590773", "Brian", "If you stay in this apartment and feel that it is not up to the standard you are expecting then you are the type of person who expects to buy a Rolls Royce for BMW money."),
("2018-09-22", "27735420", "Vera", "住这里非常舒服 干净 东西齐全｡就像自己家一样 非常满意｡周边交通便利 购物便利 下次来悉尼依然会首选Francoise的家"),
("2018-09-30", "27735420", "Mohammed", "I recommend this place great value for money homely feel"),
("2018-10-13", "27735420", "Susan", "Awesome quiet location  beautiful decor. Short walk to great cafes and train. Nice leafy suburb  plenty of dining choices  takeaway and eat in. Well equipped kitchen  comfortable beds and bedding. Enjoyed a 2 night stay."),
("2018-10-21", "27735420", "Jingwen (Olivia)", "This place is so convenient! My parents enjoyed the stay! Great place and really nice host"),
("2018-11-09", "27735420", "Shahab", "Very clean"),
("2018-11-29", "27735420", "Sc Services", "Lovely stay within Francoise's place - would recommend."),
("2019-01-28", "27735420", "Luca", "tutto perfetto  ottima pulizia  bellissima casa  Francoise persona speciale"),
("2019-02-26", "27735420", "Francis", "Great host. The apartment was clean and well presented. Highly recommended."),
("2018-08-20", "27814857", "Rob & Amy", "The White House is a fabulous  chic terrace within walking distance to great restaurants  exclusive shopping as well as so many other culturally enriched experiences. Kerry and Adam were the perfect hosts. They met us upon arrival - which made the entry etc effortless. The kids loved the outside area - the backyard was a heaven-send considering you’re only 5 mins to the CBD. I would recommend to anyone travelling with a family - or who needs to be located close to the CBD for work or an event. We will be back soon!! "),
("2018-08-22", "27814857", "Joanne", "The White House is a cute  immaculate house in Leichhardt. Kerry was a great host  she answered all my questions promptly and was very welcoming. She is a local herself and was able to give me heaps of local information. We will definitely be returning next time we are in the area."),
("2018-11-23", "27814857", "Anthony", "Great location near the light rail  and it had everything we needed for our short stay in Sydney"),
("2018-12-31", "27842018", "Angie", "A quite  relaxing area close to shops and public transport. The rooms are spacious and lovely big backyard."),
("2018-08-21", "27716426", "Hansel", "I would definitely recommend this to everyone who still has doubts and is looking through the reviews. There are so many good experiences that I don’t even know where to start. But let’s start with Charles  he is super accommodating and friendly. The communication with Charles is very warm and efficient  and he is also a responsible host who really cares. And the location of the house is very convenient. It’s close to everything I need plus  so many good restaurants and pubs  which I don’t really need during weekdays  but if you are a foodie  then......The house itself is clean  tidy and comfortable to stay at. I would say it feels like home  apart from my home is never this clean... All in all  I would come back again if I have the opportunity. "),
("2018-08-23", "27716426", "Michelle", "A lovely  obviously newly refurbished apartment in a good location. My boyfriend and I wanted a space close to public transportation and this fit the bill perfectly. Really clean  nicely decorated  fully stocked with the essentials  and a criminally plush bed. The shower is also amazing and the host picks really nice soap! The host Charles was always very friendly and prompt with communication. The unit isn’t large  but for a short term stay and for a couple  it’s more than enough.I would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-08-26", "27716426", "Monique", "Expect a clean  modern and cosy home in a great location!"),
("2018-09-03", "27716426", "Philip", "Excellent facilities  comfort  and location"),
("2018-09-10", "27716426", "Imantha", "Great value and very tidy!"),
("2018-09-12", "27716426", "George", "Great place  was just as much a pleasure as the first time!"),
("2018-09-16", "27716426", "Jerome", "We both had an amazing stay the the Buxton House and really loved the Scandi-styled interior. Very clean and minimalistic! The place itself was cosy in the back of the house - it is an elongated kind of area  so could be quite hard to get things moving around. Nevertheless  we made it around comfortably. Neighborhood is safe  albeit hearing stories about walking at night around Refern. We had no troubles walking back to the apartment at about 11pm. There are lots of coffee and food options opened in the day and Buxton House is really close to Sydney Central with various methods there. Really loved the place and would definitely stay again when we're back in Sydney!"),
("2018-09-20", "27716426", "Akiya", "I worried redfern is dangerous. But it is safety."),
("2018-09-24", "27716426", "Amy", "Nice  clean and cozy studio. Great location- approx 5min walk to bus station and 10 min walk to Redfern train station. Check-in and check- out instruction was clear and simple. Charles was very quick and helpful with messages. We had a wonderful stay! Thank you Charles :)"),
("2018-09-27", "27716426", "Elise", "Awesome location  nice decor  comfy bed.  What more could you want!"),
("2018-09-28", "27716426", "Tanya", "Always a pleasure to stay  check in and out is so easy  brilliant location  clean  fresh and my new home away from home."),
("2018-10-10", "27716426", "Maria", "We really enjoyed staying at this apartment. It’s located in a cool district  very close to all sights. The apartment is clean  there is everything that you may need  we had a great time and I definitely can recommend this place to all  The communication with Charles was good  I received answers to all my questions quickly."),
("2018-10-13", "27716426", "Catherine", "A clean  light and modern apartment within reasonable walking distance of the city centre. A little on the cosy side  but perfectly comfortable!"),
("2018-10-28", "27716426", "Bob", "Close to public transport  shops and resotos  Wollies and more. Best cooking utensils of any place I have stayed. Great host!!"),
("2018-10-29", "27716426", "Manfred", "Great place to stay  and Charles is responsive and easy to coordinate with. Thank you!"),
("2018-10-31", "27716426", "George", "Excellent stay as per usual thanks again"),
("2018-11-03", "27716426", "Thea", "responses quickly and very hospitable"),
("2018-11-06", "27716426", "Daniel", "Fantastic location. Redfern and Central station are both an easy walk away. Many good bars and restaurants nearby. Unfortunately the WiFi in flat 3 doesn’t work. Otherwise excellent. Charles is a quick responder to any queries."),
("2018-11-11", "27716426", "Justus", "Very nice and clean apartment. We enjoyed our stay a lot and can highly recommend this place!"),
("2018-11-17", "27716426", "Annie", "Charles’ place is clean and location is fantastic! Parking on street is available as well  highly recommended for any travelers"),
("2018-11-21", "27716426", "Catherine", "Notre séjour de 3 nuits pour 2 amies étaient parfait. Le lit est super confortable  Charles répond rapidement à ses messages et lorsqu'il manquait quelque chose  nous l'avions le jour même. Un bel endroit tranquille et bien situé pour visiter Sydney :) merci encore Charles!"),
("2018-11-25", "27716426", "Andrew", "We enjoyed our stay at Charles place in Redfern.  Unit is in a great location for both Sydney CBD  Redfern  Surry Hills  Waterloo and access to the Airport.  Unit was spotlessly clean throughout and communication from Charles was excellent at all times.  Keyless access system works well and provides great security.Although a comfortable stay  the unit is small with no seating area other than 2 small stools in the kitchen  this wasn't a surprise to us as its clearly shown and stated in the listing but could pose problems for longer stays or days where the weather dictates you need to be inside!Would stay again for 1 or 2 nights when in Sydney."),
("2018-11-29", "27716426", "Karylle", "We enjoyed our stay in Buxton house.- Charles was very efficient in replying and accomodating our request of luggage drop off and early check in.- Unit was spotlessly clean  strong shower  good quiet AC and has basic utensils needed in the kitchen. - Location is perfect for going around as it’s approx 3minutes to the closest bus stop and 20mins to central cbd; woolworths is around the corner for your grocery needs; cafes and pubs within the vicinity.- The check in was smooth and secure. Even though the house seems fully booked  we can hardly hear any noise in our unit. It’s also secured as CCTV cameras are around the exterior of the apartment."),
("2018-11-30", "27716426", "Vanessa", "The space was so cute! The host was very easy to communicate with and the check-in process was super efficient!"),
("2018-12-02", "27716426", "Grace", "Nice place  super easy check in."),
("2018-12-06", "27716426", "Peppi", "Very nice place and would recommend it to anyone looking a Place to stay at Redfern."),
("2018-12-09", "27716426", "Jack", "great place  great location!"),
("2018-12-15", "27716426", "Lucas", "I booked our 4 apartments for my family to visit for my birthday -Great central location - a stroll from Redfern station - close to Parks   shops  minutes from bars and restaurants - set in the village atmosphere of Redfern   so close to city - walk everywhere and enjoy the array of food in the neighbourhood Miny apartments   great air con & bed with fresh linen - glam touches - big private bathroom - TVs Would recommend and stay again"),
("2018-12-28", "27716426", "Jen", "It's a very nice place and very well situated. Charles allowed us to leave our luggage in the backyard for a couple of hours after our check out. We'd stay there again!"),
("2019-01-06", "27716426", "Heather", "Great Location. Prompt assistance and communication from Charles. Excellent wifi. Quiet accommodations close to all the fun spots. Supermarkets within walking distance. Train station just down the road."),
("2019-01-14", "27716426", "Rachel", "Great location  the host was easy to get in touch with!"),
("2019-02-01", "27716426", "Wouter", "Perfect place to discover Sydney. Very clean and comfy."),
("2019-02-11", "27716426", "Ying", "Beautiful and cozy place. Cafes and restaurants are just nearby. Great place to stay:)"),
("2019-02-12", "27716426", "Bethany", "Clean and neat  in a good location close to good coffee and transport into CBD."),
("2019-02-18", "27716426", "Bethany", "We didn’t have a very good stay here unfortunately. The place was tidy we just think the cleaning of the place needed improvement. There were makeup stains and grubby marks on the pillows and doona cover  little spiders on the ceiling throughout the house  hair on the pillows  doona cover and throughout the bathroom on the shower walls and on the toilet. It was very uncomfortable and we were glad we only booked one night. If it was cleaned properly it would have been a great place to stay."),
("2019-02-25", "27716426", "Laura", "Second time was just as lovely as our first."),
("2018-09-26", "27932125", "Jenna", "Imogen’s place was absolutely great. It was very clean and the room was large and away from the common spaces. She is friendly  and super accommodating. Her Bondi Beach location couldn’t be better. It’s just a few minutes walk from the beach and right in the middle of many cafes/shops/grocery stores. The location is quiet and felt safe at all times. Would definitely stay again and recommend it!"),
("2018-09-26", "27932125", "El", "Imogen’s place is just perfect. In the heart of Bondi  it’s close to everything you need. It’s light and sun-filled  and spotlessly clean. She is incredibly gracious  with on-the-money local’s recommendations. The bathroom was gorgeous. The whole place was beyond relaxing. Loved  too  having such a big space to myself - the room is lovely and oversized  with a desk and a massive mirror. Wish I could live there!"),
("2018-10-01", "27932125", "Ryan", "What a great stay - location is amazing!!! Everything is at your door step and the house is very stylish and clean. The room is a great size with comfy bed. Imogen was an excellent host and is super easy going. Her tips on things to do in Bondi really made my trip. Highly recommend."),
("2018-12-03", "27932125", "Robin", "Amazing location!! Just a couple of minutes walk down to Bondi Beach and tons of good restaurant just outside the door! The apartment was super clean and tidy and got a really nice relaxing vibe to it. Same goes for the room which also have a big comfy bed that I slept very well in. Imogen was a great host making me feel at home right away! Check in went very smoothly and she was quick at replying at all times. I couldn’t recommend a place more highly if you want an awesome bondi experience! :)"),
("2018-12-15", "27932125", "Sophia", "The whole apartment had such a good vibe and Imogen has a wonderful personality - I enjoyed my week at this beautiful apartment and there was absolutely nothing that I could complain about. I’m already planning on coming back soon! Loved it! :)"),
("2018-12-26", "27932125", "Cassandra", "Amazing location  quick walk to all the shops  cafes  supermarket and beach. Imogen is a wonderful host  she’s incredibly friendly  accommodating and laid back. The apartment itself is beautifully decorated and has such a good vibe. The room is spacious including a desk and large closet. The bed was super comfy with top quality linen. The bedroom was away from the common areas but next to the bathroom which was convenient. Overall the apartment was amazing and clean - highly recommended."),
("2018-12-30", "27932125", "Kara", "I loved my stay at Imogen's place. Location was perfect - minutes away from Bondi Beach and lots of amazing restaurants and cafes. The room was large  with tons of storage and natural light. Imogen was the perfect host; super sweet and helpful. I would stay again and  I highly recommend it."),
("2019-01-06", "27932125", "Allie", "Imogen was a great host and the space was lovely and located close to the beach and public transport."),
("2019-01-15", "27932125", "Joyce", "I stayed at Imogen’s appartment the first week in Sydney. It was the perfect start for my adventure. Imogen was very helpfull and the appartment is perfect. It is clean  has all the facilities you need and it also looks very good. Also all the good places are around the corners with 5 minuts walking. I stayed in many airbnb’s before but this is one of my favorites. I would highly reccomend it!"),
("2019-01-30", "27932125", "Annabelle", "Imogen’s flat is very clean. There are easily accessible shops and restaurants as well as a good bus service to Bondi Junction.Imohen was friendly  welcoming and very helpful giving me local tips and advice.She provided milk  bread  tea  coffee  veggiemite and honey.I would have no hesitation with booking with Imogen again   if I return to Sydney."),
("2018-09-01", "27789416", "Olivia", "Beautiful and clean space  great for a quick Sydney trip."),
("2018-09-06", "27789416", "Hong Xiang", "place is clean but location is abit inconvenient"),
("2018-09-28", "27789416", "Rashmi", "It’s good stay and both are very helpful."),
("2018-10-11", "27789416", "Hugh", "It’s a very good apartment that is located near the supermarket. So convenient."),
("2018-11-01", "27789416", "Tomoyuki", "Great place. Place was very neat and tidy. Everything you need was available and supermarket was 5mins walking distance. Would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-11-16", "27789416", "Kevin", "The location of the unit is great  right near East Village shopping centre. There is a dog park close by so if you are a dog lover you will find yourself by the park. The unit is quite small but was great for our stay. Kelvin was very attentive and check in was easy."),
("2018-11-18", "27789416", "Judy", "It was a lovely apartment to stay at for a weekend getaway  it was clean and homely. Kelvin and Kate also really look after their guests and home  checking in on our stay from first to last day."),
("2018-11-22", "27789416", "Zhenyi", "New apartment close to the city center. The hosts are responsive through the app."),
("2018-11-28", "27789416", "Ryan", "Apartment was perfect for a short family stay in Sydney for two adults and two young children."),
("2018-12-09", "27789416", "Alec", "It was a very clean apartment. Even the sofa bed was super comfortable and the apartment had everything you needed. The cafe and supermarket is conveniently close with plenty of options for good food around the area."),
("2018-12-29", "27789416", "Zach", "great place. quiet neighborhood an easy train from the airport with easy access to downtown or anywhere you want to go via a few different bus options"),
("2019-01-02", "27789416", "Maggie", "Kelvin & Kate are wonderful hosts  and the apartment is lovely! Very clean  bright  and well-organised  and very close to Coles and other shops. A bit of a walk from the train station  but easy to find if you are using Uber or taxi. They always replied to any communication within seconds  and I greatly appreciated them as hosts! highly recommended."),
("2019-01-18", "27789416", "Vanessa", "Great host. Good communication Just beware you can’t open the windows as they are locked."),
("2019-02-11", "27789416", "Oleg", "It was a very comfy stay! Will definitely stay here next time."),
("2019-02-16", "27789416", "Federico", "check in was a bit of a strange routine and the apartment was a bit hard to find. The apartment was clean though and had everything we needed. The apartment claims to have 2 rooms but it actually has one and a sofa bed."),
("2017-02-26", "2820832", "Michael", "Great location  well appointed house with everything one needs and a fabulous host."),
("2018-01-22", "2820832", "Jaime", "I can't recommend this home enough! A well thought out layout for family gatherings  a huge pool and large garden area all make for a memorable stay. All of the amenities are high quality to go with the home and no detail is missed. A beautiful home that we will be back to stay for sure!"),
("2018-04-13", "2820832", "Patricia", "Joanne and Sean are so welcoming and we had a truly wonderful stay in their lovely home.  It was well located for visits to Cronulla and the lovely beaches all around and also not far from the station to make travelling into Sydney city centre easy and convenient.  Not to mention the free bus service from Woolooware station to the local rugby games at Cronulla Sharks!The house is modern  light and airy and so very spacious - that even with 3 grandchildren and their 2 cousins who live in Caringbah  - we all enjoyed the space without falling over each other.  The pool  trampoline and play room were a big hit with the children.It was spotless  tastefully decorated and with all amenities including a barbecue and downstairs shower room and utility room. The kitchen was well equipped - which made mealtimes a pleasure.  There were also lots of personal towels and beach towels.A great place to stay in a quiet residential area - highly recommended."),
("2018-08-24", "2820832", "Julie", "A spacious house in a great location  a lovely host who makes sure you are at feel at home.  For those with a family the added playroom is fantastic.  I would highly recommend for those wanting to stay in the Sutherland Shire  2 minutes drive to Cronulla and surrounding suburbs.  "),
("2019-02-23", "2820832", "Keith", "Jo & Sean have a really great house with fantastic space and excellent facilities. It was spotless when we arrived and Jo and Sean were very responsive to everything we needed. A fantastic location  10 minutes from the beach and walking distance from the train. Great house that gave us a wonderful holiday."),
("2018-10-10", "28231022", "Jackie", "Great place. A bit noisy when a train goes pass"),
("2018-10-23", "28231022", "奇", "很好的公寓 空间大 布局合理｡出行很方便 有地下车库 且里火车非常近 推荐"),
("2018-11-19", "28231022", "Bill", "Nice new 1BR apt in a very convenient location. Its very quiet even though it is right beside the Epping railway station."),
("2018-12-29", "28231022", "俐俐", "Good location. Very modern apartment."),
("2018-09-28", "28345512", "Sascha", "This was my first time booking a property on (Hidden by Airbnb) and after staying at Dee Why Vista  it definitely will not be my last!  I absolutely adored the apartment  it is in such a perfect location and so family friendly.  We booked a last minute trip to Sydney to visit some friends who live in the Northern Beaches and are so glad we booked this apartment.  My kids loved all the toys and being able to run downstairs and play at the park that is right next to the apartment.  It was wonderful to have such a short walk to the beach and most of our time was spent here.  The kitchen is extremely well stocked and we really enjoyed being able to use the BBQ and spend time out on the balcony.  The local’s guide was really useful in planning our trip and our communication with the host was fast  easy and reliable.  I highly recommend this apartment and can’t wait to stay again."),
("2018-12-17", "28345512", "Natacha", "Don t hesitate. It s a wonderful place to stay.Very good situation in front of the beach  close to supermarkets  restaurants and bus stops.The appartement is spacious  fully equipped  very clean  and quiet.You arrive there  you unpack your bags and you are home.If you have questions  you just give a phone call and Jodie gives you the answer.No private parking but personally I had no problem to find a place for my car in the appartement street .My family and I were there for 4 days. If one day I come back to Sydney  without hesitation I will stay at Lyn’s place.Natacha"),
("2019-01-05", "28345512", "Callie", "A bright & airy apartment with everything you need to have a relaxing beach holiday. With amazing views of Dee Why beach & shore front restaurants a 2 min walk away. The apartment is beautifully decorated & well appointed. Coles & Woolworths at the end of the street. Will definitely be back!"),
("2014-09-11", "2838442", "Michael", "Great location  close to services  spacious room and made to feel very welcome. "),
("2014-12-29", "2838442", "Sven", "Hey Rhonda thank you so much for the perfect time we spent together at your place. Even your advices for everything where helpful. your knowledge about Sydney is awesome! Especially for New Years eve. We really appreciated your easy going way and will definitely not hesitate to book your homestay again when we are coming back to Sydney.Thanks Sven and Florian"),
("2015-09-08", "2838442", "Justin", "Rhonda welcomed me into her home with open arms from the very start. She went above and beyond to make my stay with her truly an unforgettable one. I felt like I found a home away from home when staying in her granny flat. She is a very kind woman who will make you feel comfortable and at peace when staying at her home  giving you a chance to really experience what Australian hospitality is truly like. She was helpful in guiding me towards the shopping center as well as highlighting the bus schedule for me  which definitely came in hand. I can't say enough about her and the willingness of help she gives. Whether it's locating sights to see  helping with jobs  or just making you feel safe and at home while staying with her you cannot go wrong choosing Rhonda when looking for accommodation. The area is pleasant  quite  and beautiful. It's very close to the shops and train station  there is also a bus stop outside the house across the street. Not only is Rhonda a gem but her son is very kind and helpful as well. Honestly if you're going to stay in the Shire of Sydney  Australia and you want to save cash doing so while getting a remarkable aweinspiring experience Rhonda's lovely granny flat is the way to go. Trust me you will not be disappointed."),
("2015-11-20", "2838442", "Todd", "Rhonda was very welcoming happy to have a chat or let you do your own thing. The house   gardens and neighbourhood was very nice like a real b&b not just a place to stay. Nice and close to shops and not too far from cronulla beach. I would recommend. "),
("2015-12-19", "2838442", "Nathan", "Staying with Rhonda was brilliant  I honestly couldn't have asked for more. She was always really welcoming and I felt really comfortable staying there. The room I stayed in was great  I had my own little area which I really appreciated. Everything felt really homely which I really liked. I would definitely recommend to anyone wanting to stay in the south Sydney area."),
("2015-12-24", "2838442", "Steve", "My experience at Rhonda's place was amazing.  Rhonda is super nice  friendly  kind and easy going.  She will do anything for you and can provide heaps of insider knowledge on Sydney and surrounds.  The granny flat style accommodation is perfect  chocolates on arrival  little sops and shampoo to use  super comfy bed  nice sheets  everything you could ask for.  Miranda is a lovely suburb that is very safe and family friendly  nice big trees with lots of birds  close to transport and shops and not far from the beach either if you have a car.  I could not recommend highly enough for anyone visiting Sydney to stay at Rhonda's house  you won't regret it!"),
("2016-02-12", "2838442", "Emma", "Very welcoming  friendly and attentive. Nice neighbourhood quite and very leafy and green. Relaxed environment. "),
("2016-03-13", "2838442", "Sheri", "Had a great experience here. Lovely location  excellent service. Cannot complain. "),
("2016-09-09", "2838442", "Jewel", "Rhonda was a very lovely host and a wonderful friendly lady. And she took my booking at the last minute to give me her clean and spacious granny flat to sleep in. Thanks so much. From Jewel :)"),
("2016-10-02", "2838442", "Joanne", "I drove down from Qld for the NRL grand final and found Rhonda and her family to be warm  friendly and generous hosts. They added little touches  like the care pack and the local information in the cosy granny flat  and I felt instantly at home. We had dinner at a local cafe on Friday night  and the food and company were great!The street and yard are very pretty with lots of trees and birds.I would definitely recommend this little piece of heaven  and would definitely come back!"),
("2016-10-29", "2838442", "Jase", "Thank you Rhonda  you provided a great experience and the reason why I did not chose a local hotel or other accommodation. You made me feel very welcome in your home and I enjoyed staying there. Your hospitality was second to none and I would love to come back and stay next time I am up that way.Thanks again  and best wishes for you and your family."),
("2016-11-04", "2838442", "Catherine", "Very helpful and quick response for a last minute need for accom for one of my employees. I was also told they were friendly and very helpful on arrival."),
("2016-11-08", "2838442", "Teresa", "Rhonda and Michael  Thank you very much for your hospitality. You made me feel welcome at your house."),
("2016-11-14", "2838442", "Sally", "All good  comfy bed  adequate amenities just as described  extremely helpful host(s)  just a bit difficult to find in the dark  re house numbers and access to the rear of the property."),
("2016-11-29", "2838442", "Anil", "Rhonda is a great person and she is very hospitable to the guests. I was made feel comfortable and the communication was good. We found common ground to talk about and exchanged our thoughts. I would suggest other guests to definitely give a go at her place. It's private and cozy."),
("2016-12-01", "2838442", "Anthony", "Rhonda's place was as described. It was clean and Rhonda was very helpful with information about the area. Rhonda travels around and uses Airbnb herself so knows how to make your stay comfortable."),
("2016-12-31", "2838442", "Samantha", "Rhonda was amazing! Honestly can't fault my stay at all."),
("2017-02-09", "2838442", "Lucy", "I had the most wonderful stay with Rhonda and her family. It was my first time in Australia and I was quiet anxious to arrive. But straight away I met Rhonda and she showed me round where I was living  and the local places in the area. The location was perfect  I walked approximately 15 minutes everyday to Westfields where the bus stops/train station are located. It's a 7 minute train journey to Cronulla beach too. Westfields has every shop you'd ever need and some lovely food places. I felt extremely welcome and comfortable throughout my stay  I can't thank them enough! "),
("2017-02-28", "2838442", "Kim", "Rhonda has a lovely home   great location  Rhonda is a beautiful host "),
("2017-03-07", "2838442", "Melissa", "Welcoming and friendly hosts; quiet  comfortable and tidy room – I would recommend Rhonda's place to anyone looking for simple and spacious digs. With the bus right by the door  take advantage of being off the main road to enjoy leafy surrounds and a restful night's sleep – and still only minutes from shopping or to hop on the train to the beach or city. I had a lovely stay  and wouldn't hesitate to book with Rhonda again."),
("2017-03-08", "2838442", "Seonghoon", "Rhonda was great Host  She send me really nice message. the Granny plat  was really huge & comfortable. I really had relaxed time over there. I would  highly recommend  any guest visit the near place. Thank you Rhonda."),
("2017-03-28", "2838442", "Emmanuel", "A charming peaceful place with a lovely owner!The comfortable granny flat is independent  in a nice garden  feeling like in the forest  a beautiful natural environment.Rhonda is amazingly welcoming  easy going  knowledgeable and full of kindness.I felt like in a pleasant family.5 stars are not enough!"),
("2017-05-16", "2838442", "David", "Great."),
("2017-05-25", "2838442", "Daniel", "Rhonda is a Lovely host."),
("2017-06-17", "2838442", "Natalie", "Better than a Hotel Room :)"),
("2017-07-14", "2838442", "Dale", "A lovely clean place to stay with a wonderful host."),
("2017-08-04", "2838442", "M. G.", "Nice cozy stay at Rhonda's place  I would recommend it to future travelers to that area."),
("2017-08-06", "2838442", "Calum", "A large and comfortable room separate from the rest of the house. Rhonda and Michael could not be more accommodating and helpful hosts!!"),
("2017-08-12", "2838442", "Anne-Lise Nasu", "Rhonda has been very helpful and she was happy to accommodate anything. I had a great time staying there."),
("2017-08-18", "2838442", "Theunis", "Rhonda made me feel at home and I can recommend her place to everyone. I look forward to stay there again."),
("2017-09-11", "2838442", "Paps", "Rhonda is very friendly  can help you is needed! The place is very nice and quiet! Thank you again"),
("2017-09-30", "2838442", "Jeff", "Rhonda was very quick in answering any questions I had about the room location things to do in the local area etc. She was friendly and helpful and very considerate of my needs. I would recommend her to anyone seeking  quiet clean and comfortable accomodation."),
("2017-10-17", "2838442", "Benjamin", "Rhonda's place is great  especially if you want to be near Sydney  but not in the city.  Close to transit  shopping and beaches!  Truly a great spot with a wonderful host."),
("2017-10-21", "2838442", "Blake", "I cannot recommend Rhondas place highly enough. I was in Miranda on my own for a National Bodybuilding Competition. Rhonda  who had no idea of the processes involved from competitors standpoint was just so accommodating and open. Nothing was an issue or to much trouble for her. Rhonda has an outstanding understanding of the local area and anything you may need to make your stay that much more seamless. If I could give more stars I would. .  Thank you Rhonda for all you did for me especially in the last day when tge logistics of my return flight etc fell into a heap .... "),
("2017-11-01", "2838442", "Tanya", "This was fantastic value for a super quick stay in Miranda. Great privacy  easy to get to and Rhonda was fantastic to communicate with. Would recommend. :)"),
("2017-11-05", "2838442", "Roshan", "Rhonda was an incredibly kind and thoughtful host. She went the extra mile to ensure I was well looked after and was comfortable with my stay. I had an early departure flight and was up at 4am  but so was Rhonda as there was a power cut in the night in Sydney and she was concerned that my alarm clock may have reset! Very thoughtful.. Her home and the sleep out with great privacy for us guests was nice and spacious  very well maintained  nicely scented and very comfortable. Gymea is a great wee part of Sydney with good vibes  great people and offers a side of Sydney very different if travellers have only encountered the commercialness of the CBD/Darling Harbour etc. This was one of the best Airbnbs I have ever stayed at and will continue to use each time I attend transformative workshops in Gymea - Thanks Rhonda!"),
("2017-11-13", "2838442", "Jack", "Highly recommend! Cool private room  along with access to all the households facilities. Rhonda and her family and top of the range  such genuine people.Couldn’t recommend highly enough!"),
("2017-11-17", "2838442", "Matilda", "Rhonda is very welcoming and accommodating. Her granny flat is nice and private and great to stay in."),
("2017-11-18", "2838442", "Michelle", "I️ had a short stay in Miranda.   It was very easy an close to where I️ needed to be.   Rhonda was very helpful and welcoming  along with great suggestions on places to visit.   The place was comfortable and clean an suited my needs.ThanksMichelle"),
("2017-11-29", "2838442", "Erica", "Great value! You feel at home and can easily come & go without any disturbances with the room conveniently located separately to the house. Rhonda and her family are very warm and welcoming. Highly recommend."),
("2017-12-13", "2838442", "Esther", "Had the most restful 5 night’s sleep. Clean and tidy little granny flat set in scenic bush land. Loved being woken up by the Kookaburras every morning. Rhonda and Michael were very welcoming and caring. Home away from home for me. Would definitely recommend Rhonda’s if its a B&B you’re after."),
("2018-01-01", "2838442", "Yuchen", "I enjoyed 3 nights in this wonderful cabin. Rhonda Michael and Cathleen are caring and easygoing. Love to stay again."),
("2018-01-26", "2838442", "Anthony", "All was good and came in very handy thank you"),
("2018-01-28", "2838442", "Kieran", "Rhonda was a lovely host who drove us to the train station several times free of charge and also provided some complimentary sweet treats. Her space is kept spotless clean and I would highly recommend her Airbnb to anyone."),
("2018-02-04", "2838442", "Neil", "I was greeted by a lovely warm welcoming smile  the price the location he huge private granny flat and the wildlife nestled background :)"),
("2018-02-06", "2838442", "Greg", "Overall great accommodation in a lovely location and a hospitable host."),
("2018-02-15", "2838442", "Byron", "Friendly  nice and relaxing ... peaceful!"),
("2018-03-05", "2838442", "Stuart", "Not only was this is great place to get some much needed rest Rhonda made me feel very welcome. Very personable and good conversation. The room was perfect secluded and comfortable."),
("2018-03-10", "2838442", "Bradley", "Pleasant people"),
("2018-03-10", "2838442", "Perry", "Great place"),
("2018-04-20", "2838442", "David", "Great location! have stayed with Rhonda a few times now  and whilethe apartment/room is separate to the main living area  Rhonda welcomed me to feel free to use the main house also. Great value!  private entrance  perfect location in the shire... thanks Rhonda."),
("2018-04-21", "2838442", "Mauricio", "Beautiful premises  wonderful private space & incredible hospitality shown to my pups. I would return without a second thought"),
("2018-04-28", "2838442", "James", "Granny flat accommodation close to Miranda/Sutherland exactly as described. Perfect for a few nights. Friendly communicative hosts  would recommend."),
("2018-07-29", "2838442", "Jo", "Rhonda is a ""super host"" in every sense of the word. Welcoming  thoughtful  relaxed and has great taste in music & movies! I was able to cook myself a meal in her kitchen  even though Rhonda was in the midst of cooking for herself and her son ...... nothing was too much trouble. Then after we'd eaten  we settled in to her warm cosy loungeroom to watch a movie. There's a nice sunny outdoor table and chairs to eat breakfast at and the sparkling clean bathroom & toilet were easy to access from the unit  even in the middle of the night. A 5-star experience at a very reasonable rate!"),
("2018-08-05", "2838442", "Timothy", "Great hospitality! Rhonda wasn't going to be around on the night that I stayed there  but she called to make sure I knew where everything would be and to make sure everything went smoothly."),
("2018-08-19", "2838442", "Matt", "A great cheap stay for one"),
("2018-08-21", "2838442", "Ashlee", "Fantastic hospitality and lovely  spacious room. "),
("2018-08-23", "2838442", "Max", "Clean  spacious and comfortable room. Rhonda is a great host. "),
("2018-09-30", "2838442", "Graham", "I had a great stay  lovely place and even lovelier host."),
("2018-10-12", "2838442", "Katie", "A lovely calm  quiet space to chillout. Great amenities  kitchen  bathroom. A great stay "),
("2018-10-13", "2838442", "Jase", "Second stay with Rhonda  always the perfect host who makes sure her guests are well looked after. Great host."),
("2018-10-23", "2838442", "Kitty", "Rhonda was hospitality was outstanding! She is so lovely and attentive! Everything an air bnb host should be! the room was wonderful! Private with everything you needed at your fingertips!!! 11/10! No hesitation about staying here again! Thanks so much for having me! It was perfect!"),
("2018-10-26", "2838442", "Robert", "Quaint  cosy and great location for quick and easy access to the Convention Centre in the Royal National Park."),
("2018-10-27", "2838442", "Francis", "A neat clean  and spacious place to stay which is close to Gymea  Miranda Fair and Cronulla Beach. Rhonda was a great down to earth host."),
("2018-11-04", "2838442", "Liam", "Rhonda is an excellent host  communicated quickly  the prace was clean and fresh. Happy to recommend."),
("2018-11-16", "2838442", "Patty", "Reasonable price Lovely space Quiet Pretty garden No complaints"),
("2018-11-20", "2838442", "Ruth", "Rhonda is a welcoming host. You’ll feel at home in a comfortable space in anyvery pleasant neighbourhood"),
("2018-11-22", "2838442", "Colin", "Fantastic host and a great room in a separate granny flat. I’d definitely stay there again. Thanks Rhonda!"),
("2018-11-24", "2838442", "Bob", "I recommend this as a great place to stay"),
("2018-11-25", "2838442", "Jason", "Rhonda was very accommodating. Thanks :)"),
("2018-11-26", "2838442", "Jochen", "I had lovely stay. All was perfect."),
("2018-12-03", "2838442", "Ruth", "Have written before - great space  comfortable  easy to relax  convenient kitchen and bathroom  restful sleep in comfortable bed!!"),
("2018-12-05", "2838442", "Ruth", "Wonderful relaxing welcoming"),
("2018-12-06", "2838442", "Colin", "Excellent in every respect. I can’t fault the place or the host  Rhonda. Very happy with my stay. Thank you."),
("2018-12-07", "2838442", "Joel", "A lovely little get-away in a leafy suburb  not too far (by car) from the beach.Rhonda certainly is a ‘super-host’!Thanks again for the cabin  cuppa and conversation. And lots of good local suggestions.Cabin is quiet and clean  with shared amenities in the main house."),
("2018-12-08", "2838442", "Yuh-Kuan", "Nice and quiet  good space  very friendly host.  It’s very relaxing   peaceful  and a great place to stay for the night"),
("2018-12-10", "2838442", "Ruth", "Rhonda’s place is welcoming and it’s easy to relax. The best place."),
("2019-01-05", "2838442", "Dominic", "Great stay  thanks Rhonda!"),
("2019-01-08", "2838442", "Ruth", "Home away from home!!"),
("2019-01-27", "2838442", "Krista", "Enjoyed my stay. Was exactly what I needed."),
("2019-02-02", "2838442", "Aaron", "Rhonda was very friendly and helpful."),
("2019-02-19", "2838442", "Philip", "Enjoyed my own quiet space away from the main house but felt welcome in the house for anything I needed.  A very comfortable restful stay. Thanks Rhonda"),
("2019-02-21", "2838442", "Ayla", "Sadly  I didn't get to meet Rhonda  as our schedules were opposite  but she was very communicative during the check-in process. The flat was lovely – the perfect escape from the city  that I very much needed. Everything was incredibly clean and the bed was very comfortable. For such an affordable rate  I would definitely recommend Rhonda's flat to others."),
("2019-02-22", "2838442", "Kira", "Absolutely lovely and relaxing.  A quiet tranquil spot away from everything to rest and recharge before the next adventure. It felt like being at home   so welcoming and hospitable. Really comfortable bed and amenities. Will definitely stay there again or recommend to anyone needing a comfy place to call home for the night.  I especially enjoyed sitting on the verandah admiring the beautiful garden. Thankyou Rhonda "),
("2019-02-23", "2838442", "Zach", "Would recommend this place to anybody Rhonda was very kind and helpful great hospitality very spacious room thanks Rhonda see you next time :)5 stars"),
("2019-02-28", "2838442", "Zach", "11 out of tenGreat value and comfortable environment. Rhonda is an amazing host :)Nice thoughtful touches"),
("2018-09-23", "28469726", "Arek", "Very good location  walking distance to the beach. Great communication with Shiki."),
("2018-09-30", "28469726", "Bella", "All good"),
("2019-02-12", "28469726", "Henrik", "Good location  close to good coffee and local buses. Walking distance to BJ. Soft bed."),
("2019-02-17", "28469726", "Aykut", "Sehr gut gelegen und nicht weit vom Strand. Nette WG Gemeinschaft.Beim öffnen der Türschloss hatte ich Probleme...aber nicht schlimm nette Wohngemeinschaft :-)"),
("2018-10-11", "28629163", "Pauline", "Really clean  nice and luminous flat  central  you can do everything by walking"),
("2018-10-22", "28629163", "David", "The host canceled this reservation 69 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-10-26", "28629163", "Matti", "Great apartment. Great host."),
("2018-11-12", "28748403", "Khalisa", "Nida’s place was great for my 7 days in Sydney. It was really clean  10 mins away from the train station and 5mins to the nearest mall (Target/KMart for shopping  Coles/Woolworth for groceries and the mall also has its own foodcourt and restaurants). Nida also was very accomodating and made us feel at home. We managed to really enjoy our stay in Sydney because of her! Her home was actually one of the memorable parts of sydney because of how comfortable we were staying at her place! Highly recommended and thanks again Nida!"),
("2019-01-05", "28748403", "Hai", "The place is a brand new apartment.  There is a portable A/C in room which is perfect for summer heat in Sydney."),
("2015-12-22", "2889953", "Graeme", "We had a great time with Jyoti  they were great hosts and went out if their way to make us feel welcome and comfortable in their home. The bedroom and bathroom are very spacious.  Would definitely recommend staying here. "),
("2016-01-02", "2889953", "Sujit", "Jyoti is very friendly and made us feel at home during our stay.She is very helpful  gave lots of local information and places we could visit during our stay in Sydney.Would definitely love to stay here again. "),
("2016-05-01", "2889953", "Kate", "Staying at Jyoti's home was like staying in the home of an old friend. She and her family were welcoming  the accommodation was delightful and the neighbourhood was quiet and friendly. "),
("2016-05-15", "2889953", "Qing Ling", "The host canceled this reservation 51 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-05-23", "2889953", "Chan", "Wonderful experience staying at Jyoti's place which is only 3-5 min drive from Sydney Olympic Park and only a short walk to the Newington marketplace where there are restaurants  cafes and a supermarket. Also a short 5-7 min drive to the Sydney Olympic wharf where you can enjoy a 1 hour ferry ride into Circular Quay.  Very comfortable bed and private bathroom for our use.  Jyoti & her family were very hospitable and friendly - we loved conversing with them - just like talking to like-minded old friends."),
("2016-06-08", "2889953", "Anna", "Jyoti and Uttam's home is a lovely home in a quiet  friendly neighbourhood. Before I even reached the house  locals in the street gave me warm hellos! I had a car and parking on the street was no problem. A lovely location near Olympic Park  super close to Newington shops  cafes  restaurants. My room and bathroom were very very generous and homely and my stay was perfect and relaxing. I am really happy to have stayed with some a warm  welcoming family. A wonderful AirBnb experience! "),
("2016-09-11", "2889953", "Pauline", "I feel like I truly have a second home in Sydney  Joyti and Uttam are such a nice couple  they treated me like their daughter  they walked me to the market place  which is super convenient from their place   even drove me to the place I need to go  and we had such an amazing conversation:D; also grandma is really nice  she reminds me my own grandma  she truly cares about me if I have enough to eat  if the quilt is warm enough  etc. I am really grateful for what they did for me  and it is my privilege to stay in this house! Thank you  Joyti  Uttam and grandma  looking forward to visit you again!I had my own toilet and bedroom  which is great!"),
("2016-10-07", "2889953", "Audrey", "I had the most amazing experience with Jyoti in Newington. She made me feel so welcome  and was able to help with anything I needed. Their house is beautiful – I loved the room! It was truly a great place to stay. Highly recommend!"),
("2016-10-21", "2889953", "Kathrzn", "The house was easy to find and I was welcomed and settled in by Jyoti's mum. Everything was just lovely. It's a great spot if you need to be close to Olympic Park."),
("2016-10-29", "2889953", "Charlotte", "Jyoti and her husband were very welcoming  kind and considerate hosts. Jyoti made me feel very comfortable and she was always willing to help and assist with questions. A pleasure to be in their home"),
("2016-11-08", "2889953", "Amy", "I had an amazing Airbnb experience at Jyoti' house! Her family welcomed me with an open heart. Not only they picked me up from the station and invited me for dinners  they truly cared about me. I felt like home! The room is bigger than the picture looks  the house is located 3 mins walking distance from the market place and bus stop. I basically had the guest bathroom to myself  I certainly had a lot of privacy. It was such an amazing experience! I highly recommend this place for both a short and long term stay near by Olympic park. "),
("2016-11-15", "2889953", "Bonnie", "Jyoti and her husband were very welcoming and considerate of my needs. The room was very spacious and clean. The location was also great as it was near supermarkets and cafes. I would highly recommend to people visiting Sydney :)"),
("2016-11-22", "2889953", "Masa", "This place is finding home in another country being treated like a family member. Jyoti and her family live in a great harmony not just with themselves but with the environment and neighbours. If you look for not just a room to stay or convenience  but for the experience home away home  this is the place. "),
("2017-01-02", "2889953", "Barbara", "It was a pleasure to be with Jyoti and her family. They received me as a friend   were very kind and caring. As Jyoti was away a couple of days  her husband  Uttam  gave me all tips for transport and seeing the Sydney fireworks. The room is exactly as decribed. The house is close to a marketplace  with supermarket and cafes. I really had a good time with them."),
("2017-01-26", "2889953", "Vanashree", "Lovely  serene location accentuated by the fresh smell of eucalyptus trees  sounds of the birds and nature trails. Good access to public transport  shopping centre with Woolworths  banks  variety of restaurants and cafes within 5 minute walking radius. Room is spacious and home is cosy and comfortable. Jyoti and her family are calm natured  easy going and so helpful with orientating me to the area. I could not have had a more comfortable stay. Thank you Jyoti and family:)"),
("2017-02-09", "2889953", "Monica", "why arent there more than 5 stars available?? ;)i hit the jackpot!my stay with jyoti  uttam and grandma was home away from home  i felt like i belonged to the family!first of all  the communication with jyoti is great  she is straight to the point  providing excellent information and tips  she even offered to pick me up from the train station  i felt welcome from the first minute i arrived  the house is absolutely spotless  clean and tidy with a very peaceful and loving atmosphere  lovely back garden  the guest room is  very spacious and clean  the bathroom is spotless  spacious and modern. jyoti and family were helpful in every possible way  thank you so much for letting me use your bike! shops  restaurants and a supermarket are within 5 minutes reach.a bus stop to the train station only a few minutes away.i would most definitely stay here again.thank you and all the bestnamaste"),
("2017-03-24", "2889953", "Eunice", "First of all  this is a place really makes me feel at home! Aunt Jyoti and and uncle Urtum are very hospitable and kindness. I have to mention when I came back late in one night  they messaged me and confirmed whether I was OK.  Regarding to the house  there is a well decorated and pretty house in a very quite  beautiful and safe neighbor. More importantly  it is so convenient because it only takes less then 5mins to bus station and newington market place. "),
("2017-03-31", "2889953", "Lynda", "Highly recommend staying with Jyoti  Uttam & Grandma. I was made to feel comfortable & most welcome. The area  was extremely handy to Olympic Park where I was working so I could walk to work. A peaceful  stress free environment a short stroll to restaurants  cafes & Woolworths. Many Thanks & one million stars. "),
("2017-04-10", "2889953", "Ajith", "It was really a wonderful experience staying with Jyothi and her family . Guys...You won't miss your home.... nice couple.. I prefer to stay here again ... this place is really quiet and convenient ... really a good residential area ..house is very clean and well equiped ...Thanks Jyothi and Family and I really enjoyed staying at your property ... Thanks for the wonderful experience"),
("2017-05-27", "2889953", "舟", "Beatuful house kind host and convenient location. Near bus stop  supermarket and restaurants."),
("2017-07-04", "2889953", "Haitham", "The host canceled this reservation 10 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-07-07", "2889953", "Gayle", "Jyoti was warm and friendly and her communication was excellent. Her home is neat and clean and had everything I needed. It's in a very pleasant area and is conveniently located close to shops and Olympic Park.I wouldn't hesitate to stay again."),
("2017-08-03", "2889953", "Bijesh", "I loved my stay at Jyoti and Uttam's place. They are a lovely couple and made every effort to make sure I had a pleasant and comfortable stay. The house is at a very nice and safe neighborhood. Room was very comfortable. I would definitely recommend anyone to stay there."),
("2017-09-24", "2889953", "Wendy", "The bedroom and bathroom were  spacious  very clean and tidy. The whole family was very wonderful and welcoming of me so I felt comfortable staying there. Jyoti's mother even offered to show me around the neighbourhood to see local shops and restaurants. Do note that the bedroom is located upstairs so if you're carrying a lot of luggage  be prepared to carry it up and down on arrival and departure. Even though it was a short stay  I enjoyed it and hopefully will get to meet this lovely family again."),
("2017-10-20", "2889953", "Ajith", "this is my third time staying with this family.. great experience"),
("2017-11-05", "2889953", "Karen", "Jyoti and her family were lovely and welcoming hosts who went above and beyond to assist me and make me feel welcome.  The room was spacious and the bed comfortable.  Their house was just a short bus ride away from Sydney Olympic Park train station  as well as The Lodge  YMCA/Armory in the Olympic Park grounds.  Newington Marketplace was a short 2 minute walk and had a number of restaurants  as well as a Woolies.   If I ever need to return to a function at The Lodge or Olympic Park  I won't hesitate to stay with Jyoti and her family again!  Thanks!"),
("2018-01-01", "2889953", "Geul", "1. The room is more spacious than it looks in the picture and the ceilling fan will keep the room cool. 2. You can either take a bus and a ferry or a bus and a train to get to the city. There are less frequent bus from the station to the place at night so you should probably check it in advance. From Strathfield  it takes roughly 20 mins by bus. 3. You can find lots of affordable/good Korean eateries in the near area as there is a hugh korean community. 4. If you are looking for super convinient place  this is not for you but if you like staying away from the coty"),
("2018-04-16", "2889953", "Bay", "The host canceled this reservation 149 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-06-30", "2889953", "Blair", "Fantastic accommodation  very spacious bedroom  comfortable bed  clean bathroom  amenities close by  lovely neighbourhood  great hosts. I highly recommend."),
("2018-07-13", "2889953", "Gayle", "Jyoti's home was clean  tidy and comfortable. Jyoti and her husband were warm and friendly and made me feel very much at home. Their home is conveniently located 20 mins walk from Olympic Park and 5 mins walk from the shops."),
("2019-01-01", "2889953", "Maiko", "nice to meet you.thank you so much."),
("2019-01-25", "2889953", "Susan", "A welcoming family in a well kept spotless home. Loved all the plants & outdoor use of land in a city environment. Close proximity for me and my plans in Olympic Park. Many thanks for the help with transport in the area. I would happily stay with you in he future."),
("2019-02-23", "2889953", "Eddie", "Jyoti and Uttam were so lovely and accomodating. They were super helpful with travel tips and made me feel very welcome. My highest reccomendations for this Airbnb."),
("2018-10-23", "29037867", "Rogier", "Great location  nice host and good looking apartment!"),
("2018-11-01", "29037867", "Michelle", "Excellent location within very short walking distance (50 metres)  of the beach   restaurants  beauty  fashion  and easy to use public transport system. Katys home has a comfy clean bed well lit rooms a modern apparment style and lovely thoughtful touches. I would highly recommend Bondi suite to anyone wanting a personalized hotel stay without the expense."),
("2018-10-19", "29084122", "Eugenia", "Kelly is a great host! Really friendly and helpful!"),
("2019-02-17", "29084122", "Phuong Thanh", "Kelly is a friendly host  ready to help if u want. Room is large enough n very very clean w full of sunny. The location is so good  15mins to Epping station and so comfortable w bus. The time spent here made my discovery in Sydney be easygoing."),
("2019-01-02", "29108266", "Greg", "Alex was a great and flexible host and was very quick to respond to our changing requests"),
("2019-02-09", "29108266", "Katherine", "Alex had thought of everything. From fruit on my arrival to putting bath salts in the bathroom. It was close walking distance to Dee Why beach and some incredible walks up to Long Reef and all the way to Freshwater. I would highly recommend Alex’s apartment and will definitely consider staying there again in the future. Wonderful stay ♥️"),
("2014-06-24", "2900140", "Clair", "If your looking for a place to fully relax  hear the sea from the comfort of your bed or get up early and see the sunrise on the beach. Then this is the place for you. We had a lovely couple of days and Anne was a great host and gave us loads of lovely treats for our stay. My little boy loved playing with the toys and we loved the peace and quite."),
("2014-07-16", "2900140", "Lorna", "Anne was extremely generous and helpful  and a wonderful host.  The apartment is lovely  light and bright with everything I needed  and more  such as a very comfortable bed and a great shower.  Lots of morning sunshine and night-time ocean waves - my favourite go-to-sleep sound!  And exactly as the description says  it's just a few minutes easy stroll to the beach which is fabulous  even in the middle of winter.  The neighbourhood was peaceful with cafes and shops only 5 minutes away.  I absolutely loved my time at Neiafu and Newport  and can't wait to return.  Thank you so much Anne. "),
("2014-08-10", "2900140", "Sarah", "Neiafu is an excellent choice! In a wonderful location  a minutes walk to the beach and a few minutes to great cafes  restaurants and shops. Close to transport  yet very quiet. We had a fabulous time there. Everything we needed was all there. Delicious treats  the Sunday paper  great shower  comfy bed and beautiful Italian sheets.  Anne is a lovely  welcoming and helpful host. Not one complaint!"),
("2014-10-12", "2900140", "Sherelle", "We really enjoyed our stay at Neiafu  it was a great weekend... Anne was very helpful and lovely  with the smallest of touches that made our stay even more memorable  like cookies and chocolate when we arrived  breakfast cereal and snacks left out and having an early/late check in/check out.Her place had a real homely feel  very comfortable and the bed was soft and gave us a good night sleep!This was our first airbnb experience and we would highly recommend her place for everyone to stay at... We only live in Neutral Bay so not far from Newport  but coming just for the night felt like we had got away from the hustle and bustle and we found it so relaxing  peaceful and quiet! We went on a little adventure on Sunday and found an amazing beach to just chill out at  so topped the weekend off nicely!We will definitely go back in the future ;) "),
("2014-10-26", "2900140", "Gray", "Great place to stay. I wish I had planned to stay longer.."),
("2014-11-14", "2900140", "Christoph", "A great place and we had a great stay. The hostess is very friendly and very quick to respond to our request. In addition  the apartment is clean and meets the pictures. A definite recommendation!"),
("2014-11-15", "2900140", "Robert", "Wonderful beachside self-contained apartment. Great access and beautifully presented. Thank you again."),
("2014-11-25", "2900140", "Amelie", "Wonderful 10 days in Newport! Thanks Ann and Ron for a warm welcome in their cozy house. They are very friendly and easygoing people. Their place really became my home during my vacation. It was so comfortable and easy. Newport beach is 5 minutes away. There are so many beautiful places around as well. In their house I found everything I needed to spend my time comfortably. I hope to spend my next vacation there as well."),
("2014-11-30", "2900140", "Nicki", "We had a wonderful time at Neiafu! Everything was so easy and well-organised  clean and tidy  Anne and her husband were very friendly and welcoming and they even put out some food for us and gave us some great advice about the area. I would love to come back!"),
("2014-12-28", "2900140", "Belinda", "We were very happy with the location of Neiafu and loved being so close to restaurants  shops and the beach.  The apartment was clean and bed comfortable;  Andi had left lots of provisions for our stay  including a Xmas gift under a tree!  Beach towels were a welcome touch too.   Unfortunately  Andi and Ron were away when we arrived leaving us unsure of access areas. "),
("2015-01-02", "2900140", "Bea", "Leider war unsere Erfahrung im Neiafu nicht so erfreulich. Der von der Gastgeberin per E-Mail (nicht aber über Airbnb !) stornierte 3. Tag unserer Buchung wurde bei Ankunft nicht komplett von ihr erstattet  obwohl ich sie im Vorfeld mehrfach darum gebeten hatte  über das Airbnb-System zu stornieren  damit alles seine Ordnung hat. Als ich sie um die korrekte Erstattung bat  sagte sie  wir könnten auch gleich wieder gehen  sie habe die Preise erhöht und wir könnten froh sein  es zu dem Airbnb-Preis bekommen zu haben. Nach dieser Diskussion war die Atmosphäre für uns so unerträglich  dass wir keinesfalls Sylvester dort verbringen wollten (abgesehen davon  dass die Wohnung nicht besonders sauber war) und am nächsten Tag das Zimmer wieder geräumt haben  natürlich ohne eine Erstattung ihrerseits. Wir hatten durch diese Buchung leider nur Ärger und doppelte Kosten. Zur Unterkunft: Küche m. kleiner Lounge im Erdgeschoss  recht dunkel und m. Tür zur Gemeinschaftsterrasse. Küche voll eingerichtet  Kochutensilien und Geschirr vorhanden. Müsli  Milch  Butter  Marmelade und Croissants standen auch bereit.Oben sind Bad und Schlafzimmer m. Tür zur Terrasse der Gastgeberin.Wenn man keine großen Ansprüche an Sauberkeit und Privatsphäre hat  ist es durchaus passabel und nicht weit zum Strand und in den Ort."),
("2015-02-08", "2900140", "Millie", "The place was lovely and cosy! Just as described. It was in such a great location - close to the beach  shops and tennis courts! Highly recommend for weekend getaway! Anne was so sweet and even left us chocolates  snacks and breakfast. Thank you!"),
("2015-02-19", "2900140", "Christoph", "Clean and nice place. Good hosts. Very close to the beach. All you need really"),
("2015-03-01", "2900140", "Laura", "Anne's place was perfectly adequate for a one night stay in Newport although the place we stayed in is not the same as the photographs. We were also unsure which of the areas we could access as the flat is attached to the main house. But we appreciated the snacks that were left for us and the apartment was clean and tidy."),
("2015-03-22", "2900140", "Melinda & Derek", "My partner and I enjoyed our short stay at Andi's Neiafu unit 2.  It was clean  well set-up  comfortable and welcoming unit.  Kitchen is fully stocked and lounge area downstairs had all that we needed. The queen size bed was comfortable and bathroom (shower) is located upstairs. The bathroom is on the smaller size but works for the place. Perfect for a couple or a single traveler who wants to chill out. There are also some lovely places to sit outside and it has a tropical beach feel about it. Additionally  it was a pleasant surprise to have little treats and breakfast items left for us in their kitchen area. We wished we had more time to explore the area as our stay was a short one. Bottom line  I recommend this place and hope to stay here in the future again."),
("2015-08-23", "2900140", "Danny", "My wife and I were met by Ron who showed us the way to the property. It was clean and comfortable with a lounge/kitchen downstairs and the bathroom/bedroom upstairs. The hosts provided us with a range of fruit  cereals  juice  milk and some pastries which was was more than enough for our one night stay. There were plenty of books  DVDs and board games also available which was great!Note that it this is not a separate property  but part of the hosts' house. However  it is reasonably isolated and was fine for my wife and I. The location is very close to Newport Beach and Barrenjoey Road with its bevy of cafés and restaurants. Also  the property we stayed at was different to the photos but we would still recommend it!"),
("2015-11-08", "2900140", "Dave", "Place was great. Very good location  nice and easy to access. "),
("2015-11-22", "2900140", "Aaron", "Thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Neiafu! It was exactly what we were after. Peaceful  clean  quiet  and close to everything we needed. Will definitely stay here again if we're ever in Newport. :)"),
("2015-12-10", "2900140", "Deb", "lovely very easy to deal with thank you"),
("2016-01-02", "2900140", "Jessica", "We stayed in unit 1 at Neiafu  which is the unit shown in the photos above. The area was quiet and beautiful  and as described it was a very short walk to Newport Beach and to local amenities (cafes  supermarkets  restaurants  etc.). Our hosts were friendly and the food left for us was much appreciated  and saved us buying breakfast items for our 2 night stay. As noted by previous reviewers there are 2 units that are rented out  and the outside areas shown are communal for all guests staying on the property. Thank you for a pleasant stay."),
("2016-02-11", "2900140", "Deb", "Great as it was previously thank you"),
("2016-02-21", "2900140", "Ian", "Chocolates  croissants  fruit  eggs  drinks and spreads  dvd's  books  maps  games  all very comfortable and an easy walk to the beach and shops in a nice street with trees. We loved it."),
("2016-07-07", "2900140", "Jennie", "We had a lovely stay at Neiafu. The unit is well appointed and provisions including cake on arrival were much appreciated. Location is excellent being quiet yet close to Newport Beach and the Newport shopping area with it's numerous restaurants. The bathroom is quite small and a bit awkwardly arranged but everything else very functional. Hosts were lovely and arrangements went smoothly."),
("2016-07-30", "2900140", "Allan", "The neighbourhood very quiet and everyone we meet were extremely friendly.Anne went out of her way to leave lots of goodies which were much appreciated."),
("2016-09-24", "2900140", "Katerina", "Our stay was very comfortable! The place was very nicely presented and welcoming. Thoroughly enjoyed and would highly recommend."),
("2016-10-29", "2900140", "Marie-Anne", "Wow! Talk about a super host... It only begins to describe Andi's hospitality.From the minute I arrived she made me feel like I belonged. The apartment has everything you would ever need plus plus plus!A 2 minute walk to the beach... 5 minute walk to some fabulous cafes and restaurants... you couldn't get more central.The bed was one of the most comfortable beds I have ever slept in and the pillows were great!  I could just have easily stayed in bed all weekend if the weather wasn't so lovely.I will definitely be back!"),
("2016-12-24", "2900140", "Kath", "I booked this apartment for my stepdaughter and her partner to stay in when they arrived from the UK. It was perfect - private  comfortable  convenient  very close to the beach  friendly hosts who were very accommodating. Would recommend!"),
("2017-03-11", "2900140", "Oliver", "The host canceled this reservation 32 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-03-27", "2900140", "(Email hidden by Airbnb)", "Unit 2 is in a great location but we were very disappointed with the poor level of cleanliness in the bathroom & kitchen."),
("2017-08-07", "2900140", "Amy", "We stayed in Unit 2  which is a different place to the pictures - it should be noted that this unit has a staircase  in case that may be a problem. Despite it being a different place  we enjoyed our stay and the location is absolutely fantastic - we left our car in the street and just walked around Newport for our 2-night stay. There's a great community feel to the area. Appreciated the fruit and breakfast items left out  as well as some choccy and a couple of beers! :)"),
("2017-10-14", "2900140", "Alex", "A lovely experience once again. Anne and Rob are fantastic hosts. We loved every bit of our stay. It’s a nice area that we’ll be coming back to many more times."),
("2018-01-01", "2900140", "Sadie", "Anne is a genuinely lovely lady and a great host. Very generous with her time and local knowledge.  We were travelling with our young son and she had a cot and high chair  as well as a basket of toys which made all the difference!The flat is really well located near to Newport Beach and we were able to borrow a sun umbrella and boogie board. It’s quite compact but perfect for one or two people wanting to get away from the city for a few days. We were able to get there by bus directly from Sydney."),
("2018-02-08", "2900140", "Jaime", "Great location close to Beach and Newport centre!"),
("2018-02-17", "2900140", "Bethan", "Great relaxed location. 2 mins walk to Newport beach / town and 15 min walk to Newport arms. 10 min drive to palm beach. Perfect for a weekend away."),
("2018-03-12", "2900140", "John", "A great place to visit for a little beach holiday on Sydney's Northern Beaches. Well away from the City hustle and bustle a short stroll to the beach. Great public transport if you need to get to the City  Manly  or even further North to Palm Beach. Andi is such a wonderful host and the place is so comfortable  quiet and relaxing!"),
("2018-03-17", "2900140", "Eva", "The location of this airbnb is just perfect. You can walk to town  to the beach - the neighbourhood is quiet  and the people are really friendly. Feels like a proper getaway from the busy city life. Perfect space for me  my partner and our little puppy dog. Highly recommend."),
("2018-07-04", "2900140", "Robyn", "This host cancelled same-day of my check in as they wouldn't accept dogs even though their listing I'd pet friendly and instantly bookable.Left stranded in Sydney  she also fraudulently asked me to cancel the booking at my end to appear that the guest cancelled and not the host.Why? Because she would receive the cancellation fees.Even went to the point of telling me she had contacted Airbnb and they advised her I was to cancel!Beware of this dodgy operator.Many others out there who are honest and operate with integrity"),
("2018-10-28", "2900140", "Sandy", "Comfortable accommodation in a great  quiet location  5 minutes walk to downtown Newport and the main beach.  Private guest suite with well equipped kitchen and separate entrance.  Excellent bed and large pleasant bedroom.  The food Anne supplied made for a generous breakfast and lovely home baked treats were very welcoming.  Thank you for offering a great place to stay."),
("2018-11-04", "2900140", "Kana", "Great location  hospitality and  quick response. It takes only few minutes walk to the beach. We really enjoyed it."),
("2018-12-19", "2900140", "Lyndie", "The treats and fruit were really lovely. Minuit's from beach and shops  very good hosts  would recommend. The parking was on the street but it was not a problem. We had our Egyptian Mau cat with us and it all worked really well. Thank's Anne and Ron and Happy Christmas to you and your family.Cheers Lyndie"),
("2019-01-08", "2900140", "Nicola", "An amazing location with a very comfortable and homely stay. Brilliant location just a few  minutes walk from beach and town. Great stay!"),
("2019-01-12", "2900140", "Taleah", "Great location  very homely! Comfortable bed and great food supplied for breakfast. Overall very satisfied."),
("2019-01-18", "2900140", "Helen", "Welcoming hosts who are very thoughtful."),
("2019-01-28", "2900140", "Andrew", "Had a great stay here. Very quick and informative responses to messages and questions. Description in ad very accurate. Literally 2 minutes to a great beach. 5 mins max walk to shops/cafes.  15 minute walk to other side of Newport. Thank you Anne."),
("2019-02-04", "2900140", "Annabelle", "Excellent location. Short walk to beach and cafes/shops. Perfect for a wkd away. Very welcoming hosts."),
("2019-02-09", "2900140", "Suraya", "Lovely host and nice little place  very well located in Newport. Excellent value and so close to the beach. Would stay again."),
("2018-10-21", "29240750", "雯巍", "交通便捷 靠近地跌和公交车站 很方便去市中心和DFO 附近有超市和购物中心  房间很整洁 布置的很温馨 房主很nice 性价比很高 是一次极好的入住体验"),
("2018-11-02", "29240750", "Mia", "close to public transport  very nice hostess and nice room."),
("2018-11-04", "29240750", "Shuan", "Great!"),
("2018-11-06", "29240750", "Jack", "沟通很及时 地点也很方便 强烈推荐"),
("2014-05-19", "2936130", "Jun Wu", "The reservation was canceled 17 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-11-07", "2936130", "Eloise", "Katie was an absolute pleasure to deal with and made it easy to book  gain access and use her fantastic apartment.  Couldn't have been easier.  We were a couple with two young kids  the living space is amazing and very big  it has a real New York loft feel with an amazing style - something for everyone.  Plenty of bathrooms and two good size double rooms.  A 5 minute walk to the light rail and 10mins to all the inner west can offer.  It was perfect for what we need: a home in Annandale/Lilyfield whilst we were between houses - thank you."),
("2015-11-09", "2936130", "Petra", "Beautiful  clean  amazing apartment! Everything as described and would highly recommend it!"),
("2015-12-31", "2936130", "Camilla", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay in Katie's apartment! We felt right at home throughout our whole stay; the space was clean and tidy  and the home décor was intriguing! The location was absolutely perfect for us. There were plenty of lovely coffee shops and restaurants in the area  and it was just a short 10 minute drive to the heart of all of Sydney's finest attractions. We would certainly recommend Katie's apartment to anyone looking for a wonderful  relaxing time in the outskirts of Sydney's CBD! Katie's hospitality was seamless  and she was helpful and informative throughout the whole process!Thanks again Katie!"),
("2018-10-30", "29466814", "Leanne", "This place was adorable  with lovely details and personal touches - just perfect for my needs. The area had a great vibe  and the location so close to cafes and transport  made getting around and eating out so easy. I will definitely stay again  perhaps a week next time  as it was also very affordable."),
("2018-11-01", "29466814", "Erik", "A perfect studio in the 'heart' of Sydney. Great host tastefully furnished neat & tidy top location  and about a third of the price of comparable hotel accomodation. Thoroughly recommended  and can't wait to return."),
("2018-11-04", "29466814", "Kylie", "Absolutely amazing. It was my first time using Airbnb and Cathy made it a wonderful experience. The place was so fresh and tidy. Will definitely stay there again."),
("2018-12-02", "29466814", "Ellen", "We had a lovely stay at Cathy’s place. It was clean  cosy and a great location. Cathy was very warm and friendly and the whole process was very smooth and easy.  Would definitely recommend!Thank you Cathy :)"),
("2018-12-06", "29466814", "Soumya", "This is a neat little studio unit  tucked away off one of the narrow by lanes in Redfern.  Easy walk to the train station  shops  and amenities.  Cathy was a wonderful host  and met me in person during check-in. I found everything as described in the posting.  The unit is thoughtfully done up with nice personal touches to make one feel at home.  I’d highly recommend this place to anyone visiting Sydney and looking for a cozy place to stay for one or two people."),
("2018-12-08", "29466814", "Lyly", "Excellent stay  comfortable & cosy"),
("2018-12-27", "29466814", "Josh", "Our stay at Cathy’s was good. It had a cool vibe  for the space available  Cathy has made it look great with some cool artwork  books layed out in a funky way on the shelf  wooden features etc. Bed was comfy  shower was good (doesn’t just dribble water) and it’s in a good location. Just around the corner from redfern station  which makes getting into the city centre super easy. The nearby surrounding area is alright  few shops and bars nearby. Cathy is very attentative  too. She replies to your messages as quick as you would reply to a text. So if you need anything  you’ll get an answer pretty quick."),
("2018-12-30", "29466814", "Dongchuan", "位置好 good location"),
("2019-01-02", "29466814", "Mats", "Good location  clean  cozy. Like our own little home in Sydney. It had everything we were looking for in a Airbnb! Cathy was very nice as well  thanks again"),
("2019-01-07", "29466814", "Ian", "The flat is very well decorated and clean making my stay very enjoyable and relaxing. Cathy’s finishing touches and care for detail made it all the more enjoyable. The location is great with nice cafes and shops very close by. Thank you for a very enjoyable stay"),
("2019-01-19", "29466814", "Sam", "An amazing host! Cathy went the extra mile in ensuring i was comfortable and had everything i needed. The flat is well laid out  clean and pretty. Could not have asked for a better host. Highly recommended!"),
("2019-01-02", "29574733", "Théo", "The host is crazy but don’t worry about the knife.The house isn’t clean but if you like the cockroach that’s ok."),
("2018-11-29", "29576644", "Susan Yanbo", "The house is in great location. The house is also very clean and tidy and exactly the same as described in the photos. The host is very friendly and easygoing. All the utilities are functioning well. Recommended to those who plan to hang out with friends in a quiet and private house."),
("2018-12-09", "29576644", "Zhi Jie", "Recommend the place to anyone with large groups."),
("2018-12-25", "29576644", "Andrew", "Place is accessible  there are restaurants near-by. Wonderful for big group of friends looking for a place to chill."),
("2018-12-30", "29576644", "Ben", "a pleasant stay overall but quite expensive for what it was"),
("2019-01-28", "29576644", "Reevan", "The place is outdated  and gets very hot  no AC"),
("2019-02-05", "29576644", "Sylvia", "The house is sparkling clean  good location. Feeling very cool in this summer night even the host has installed new airconditions for the guest  I dont need to turn it on  which is unbelievable. Super friendly host  we have spend time for chating and give me a lots of informations about Sydney. I will definitely come with my family and friends next time when I come Sydney again. Thanks for the reception."),
("2019-02-17", "29576644", "John", "Great and comfortable stay!"),
("2018-11-07", "29770616", "Greg", "i think you should wait on this place until Ilhwan gets it into shape."),
("2018-11-13", "29770616", "Tara", "This is a great spot in a very convenient location. I would definitely stay here again if I was visiting Sydney. Ilhwan was very prompt to respond to messages as well."),
("2018-11-16", "29770616", "John", "A great location close to everything you could want in the CBD. Lots of space in a clean and safe environment."),
("2018-11-24", "29770616", "Matthew", "Good apartment in a great location"),
("2018-11-29", "29770616", "Liu", "The location here is excellent  and the living environment is also very good  which is a place for traveling. It is very close to the platform  so you can easily go to the place you want to go  and there are many restaurants downstairs."),
("2018-12-04", "29770616", "Natalie", "Great apartment in a fab location only slight downside the tv had no reception"),
("2018-12-07", "29770616", "Emma", "Great location"),
("2018-12-09", "29770616", "Stef", "Great place to stay  comfortable and easy access which is around CBD."),
("2018-12-12", "29770616", "姝婷", "位置非常好性价比很高 房屋也非常干净整洁 而且房东的回复及时迅速｡房子里的东西非常全 有两个小小的缺点是热水不是特别热 还有电视机收看的频道特别卡 除此之外都非常好!"),
("2018-12-14", "29770616", "Najihah", "loving this place for how centrally located and spacious it is. ilhwan replied promptly and let us store our luggage after checking out. overall experience was great and definitely recommend this place for a group of 5 people looking for a value of money"),
("2018-12-17", "29770616", "Sukhdev", "Be careful"),
("2018-12-24", "29770616", "Thang", "A very well located and convenient apartment with a wonderful host. Highly recommended."),
("2018-12-26", "29770616", "Jefin", "Clean and nice"),
("2018-12-27", "29770616", "Siwon", "Our family had a wonderful experience at Ilhwan's place. Would definitely visit again."),
("2018-12-28", "29770616", "Khiem", "This is by far the best location spot and great value for what you pay for! The host pick us up from the seperate car park and drove us to the apartment and back the next day  also pick me up and drove me back to grab my wallet that ive forgot which he didnt need to do. Best host in the area and definitly would come back. He has gone above and beyond what we expected and pay for the worth."),
("2019-01-12", "29770616", "Adam", "A fantastic space in a fantastic location. Minutes from Central Station  an easy walk to Chinatown and Darling Harbour. Very comfortable furnishings and clean space and good noise protection in a busy location. Ilhwan takes great pride in his place and service and is a wonderful and very communicative host. Highly recommend both this place and Ilhwan."),
("2019-01-20", "29770616", "Sohel Samuel", "What a nice space to spend holiday in Sydney. Neat and clean  huge space  amazing central location in Sydney. Everything is in walking distance. I felt that I am staying at home."),
("2019-01-25", "29770616", "Prashanth", "Nice plalce located in a good area with many shops near by."),
("2019-01-31", "29770616", "Linda", "Great apartment Great locationGreat host"),
("2019-02-02", "29770616", "Hannah", "Excellent stay  great facilities  close to cool cafes  supermarket  cinema  public transport. Short drive to airport and Sydney harbour. Highly recommend!"),
("2019-02-05", "29770616", "Shanshan", "位置好 房内各种设备齐全 房东热情回应迅速 有可能还会再住｡"),
("2019-02-19", "29770616", "Andres", "Excellent host !!"),
("2019-03-05", "29770616", "Anita", "Gut ausgestattetes  sehr zentral gelegenes Appartement."),
("2019-01-03", "29974058", "Tom", "Nice location  host where amazing and very forth coming on messages back and forth with us during the whole stay. Good overall and recommend it because it was a nice apartment with good security to get in and also had the necessary stuff you needed."),
("2018-11-20", "30092070", "McKenzie", "The host canceled this reservation 40 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-11-19", "30056291", "Lisa", "Nick & Ed were so warm welcoming & friendly. They helped me get settled in  recommended a good spot for dinner & left me alone. I slept peacefully & the location was perfect :)"),
("2018-11-21", "30056291", "Andrew", "Nick is an excellent host and his place is 5 star standard. Great central location  beautifully furnished  spotlessly clean  good amenities  you can't ask for more. Check in and check out was easy and Nick is a great host. I highly recommend staying with Nick and I would definitely stay again!"),
("2018-11-22", "30056291", "Louise", "Really lovely room in a stunning apartment overlooking the city. The bedroom was super quiet and Nick was very generous in making us feel at home  encouraging us to make use of all facilities - even the booze cabinet! He also gave great recommendations for places to eat and was very friendly and welcoming. Thanks Nick!"),
("2018-11-28", "30056291", "Kirsty", "Nick has a stunning apartment in a perfect location walking distance to everything. Gorgeous city views and a super comfy bed.Nick is a friendly and accommodating host with great style. Highly recommend a stay here."),
("2018-12-04", "30056291", "Edwin", "Definitely not recommended! Only book if you're willing to take the risk of being homeless midstay!The host was unreasonable  appallingly proud and would assume the worst of you. I'm gonna be honest  the place was nice and the location was great  but the host made the experience a nightmare. I made a booking for me and my dad to stay for two nights. There was a mistake in my part where I booked for one guest instead of two. However  I messaged Nick and told him WE (two of us) were coming. Nick also personally met my dad and me at check-in and he was fine with it. He later requested an extra charge for that (extra guest) and we duly paid. In the beginning  Nick seemed like a nice guy  showing us the place and told us to ""feel at home"" and ""feel free to use the washing machine etc etc."". We stayed the first night and it was all good.Then  on the second day  out of nowhere  with no prior communication  we were told to LEAVE the apartment. One of the reasons being that we ""abused"" the facilities. Apparently  using the washing machine and dryer twice is considered abusing the facilities in this apartment. Mind you  we only used the dryer again because the clothes were still damp. On top of that  I was accused of taking advantage of them by bringing extra guests (plural) with no evidence. Nick and his partner would later contact Airbnb and claimed that they saw my parents (plural) and they heard a female voice from their room. I was amazed because I didn't know my mum could teleport. I also find it odd that the host asked us to leave in the afternoon when they had actually decided to kick us out from the early morning. It became apparent after I realised that I could no longer get a refund for the second night because it had started. They claimed to have felt uncomfortable hosting us but appeared to be more than comfortable to receive the money despite their sudden cancellation. We really tried to communicate and cooperate as best as we could with Nick to reach an amicable solution. However  the host and his partner are more than happy to let us be homeless for a night since they've got their money. I'm not saying that the host would kick all future guests out  but are you willing to risk getting kicked out midstay? Because I won't be the last one. All it takes is for one of them to say they're uncomfortable for whatever reason they may have and there's nothing you nor Airbnb could do about it."),
("2018-12-12", "30056291", "Karen", "This is an amazing apartment to stay in. The views are fantastic and Nick’s recommendations on restaurants were spot on. The place is spotless and nice extra touches like meeting me when I arrived even though my timing was out just made my visit more special. Nick is a very thoughtful host and certainly goes that bit extra to make your stay enjoyable. Thanks again Nick"),
("2018-12-23", "30056291", "Jennifer", "Such a beautiful and cosy apartment with views from the lounge/kitchen that pictures would definitely do no justice. I felt like I was at home. Nick stayed in the front bedroom but it felt like he wasn’t there at all  not until we needed his help with a hiccup trying to get the bathroom door unlocked haha. He is such a beautiful person  and I would without a doubt be recommending his beautiful place to any friends that wish to stay in the city in the future!"),
("2019-01-02", "30056291", "Jack", "Great host and a lovely place to stay! Would highly recommend"),
("2019-01-26", "30056291", "Nick", "Nicks place is amazing  he is very helpful and knowledgeable  the place is outstanding and beautiful right near Oxford street I would stay here again"),
("2019-01-31", "30056291", "Louis", "Everything was perfect !Ideally located nice appartement & view.Hosts very nice  helpful  discreet and welcoming !!"),
("2019-02-13", "30056291", "Rob", "ticks all boxes host was kind and friendly"),
("2019-02-19", "30056291", "Maria", "Thanks to Nick for being such a great host! I truly enjoyed my stay  everything was great - the apartment absolutely clean  has amazing view and located close to everything (such as Bondi Beach and Sydney Opera House)  Nick was very helpful with making me comfortable at his apartment and gave me several tips where to go in Sydney! Highly recommend this place!"),
("2019-02-22", "30056291", "Tommy", "Nick's apartment is well appointed and well located. The room is tastefully decorated with plenty of space and a private bathroom. I enjoyed staying with Nick  who was very friendly and hospitable. I felt very welcome and at home."),
("2019-02-22", "30056291", "Ryan", "Nick was a great host  provided a clean environment and a friendly approachable face. Would stay again!"),
("2019-02-27", "30056291", "Rob", "this is a top of the range airbnb stay and guests won't be disappointed or have anything to complain about - it ticks all the boxes nick is  also up there when it comes to hosts nick is a kind friendly and runs his airbnb in a professional way and this place ticks all the boxes"),
("2019-02-08", "30117558", "Moritz", "Very very kind and helpful people!!! Great hosts!"),
("2018-11-26", "30129770", "Chloé", "Mark amd Sarah are a lovely couple with a lot of tips for you about how to get the best around in sydney and what are nice places to goIf you enjoy to travel you will get more than just along with them"),
("2018-12-07", "30129770", "Alyssa", "This was our favourite bnb so far. In a great location a couple minute walk from the train station  super easy check in and in a sweet little apartment. Mark is a super friendly host while giving you all the privacy you want. Would highly recommend to anyone!"),
("2018-12-30", "30129770", "Jule", "Me and my friend loved staying with him. He was very friendly and we couldn‘t have asked for a better host! The room was very clean and he gave us some great tips!"),
("2019-02-09", "30129770", "Chanelle", "Mark and Sarah are nice and welcoming people. Again  Thanks a lot for everything !"),
("2019-01-01", "30206982", "Martin", "A lovely place  very well placed  and the house is really pretty. I didn’t had the luck to meet Kirsten in person as she was overseas but she was available super quickly by text.I had an awesome stay :)"),
("2018-11-29", "30239722", "Kristel", "Very good staying! Highly recommend!"),
("2019-02-17", "30294051", "Derrick", "Great no frills  no nonsense place where the host respects your privacy.  Close to transport / restaurants  and a stone throw away to the city."),
("2018-12-07", "30242421", "Amy", "Great! Definitely we will back!"),
("2018-12-20", "30242421", "Kate", "Good size  modern apartment  in a great location and with a helpful host"),
("2018-12-30", "30242421", "다미", "This place is really good to stay. Near the airport  near the city.Cozy and calm. The Host is very kind. One more thing i liked is i used the laundry and dryer for free."),
("2019-01-08", "30242421", "Zofia", "Nice clean room in share apartment.There is no clothes ironing facilities and only basic cooking facilities."),
("2019-01-03", "30377044", "Isabelle", "Great accomodation. Clean and had everything you needed. The location is amazing right at Bondi  it can be quite noisy at night time though. Thanks for a great stay Matt!"),
("2018-12-14", "30323119", "Jannick", "Je recommande cet appartement  aux voyageurs  dans ce quartier  proche des commerces et des restaurants"),
("2018-12-18", "30323119", "David", "I really enjoyed staying at Phoebe's place. She is definitely an exceptional host. Will go the extra mile in making your stay as comfortable and stress free as possible. Short walking distance to major shopping district and restaurants. Surprisingly quiet apartment considering its excellent location. Really enjoyed my stay. Thank you Phoebe I be back."),
("2019-01-17", "30323119", "David", "Lovely spot  great location in one of my favourite areas of Sydney. Pleasant  no frills  would almost certainly stay again."),
("2019-02-19", "30323119", "Mingxiao", "A very nice apartment near the Ashfield Station  with all necessary items such as fridge and air conditioner."),
("2019-02-20", "30323119", "Jennifer", "Phoebe is a great host who respond very quickly. Her apartment is beautifully decorated and it is very clean. She also provide generously and we enjoy strolling down the shops. The provision of carpark space is a great plus. We will recommend the place to anyone. Thanks"),
("2019-02-26", "30323119", "Yipeng", "整个入住体验很舒服 位置很赞 日出第一束光照进房间 让我一天的心情大好｡房东非常热心｡感谢对我的帮助｡"),
("2018-12-23", "30403212", "Brian", "Great location and sunny apartment. Fabulous hosts. Views of the water are enticing. Short walking distance to Bondi Road for fabulous local shopping options for groceries  fresh f&v  seafood and supplies. We will definitely be back!"),
("2018-12-25", "30403212", "Briana", "If your looking for an ideal location with an easy walk to Bronte  Tamarama or Bondi beach; I highly recommend staying here! Very comfortable and convenient! Thank you Marcela for your Hospitality!"),
("2019-01-09", "30403212", "Gabriella", "Great location  modern and comfortable apartment. Has everything you need."),
("2018-12-03", "30412858", "Rong", "The location is amazing. Right off the Harbour  and close to a lot of restaurants. The building is also nice with a pool and hot tub. The amazing kids playground at darling quarter is one kt a km away. The apartment is spacious and clean. Great host and very quick to respond. Highly recommended."),
("2018-12-04", "30412858", "Sarah", "This stylish apartment has all you need. From a beautiful view to a exquisite dinner  you could last days without worrying about your home. Two bedrooms accompanied with a gym and swimming pool add extra if your traveling with others! You can walk around the Darling Harbour to find the prodigious tastes of Sydney right as you enjoy you stroll with it.    Highly recommended location and stay!"),
("2018-12-05", "30412858", "Andy", "If you're heading to Sydney and hoping to stay in Darling Harbour  Angela's apartment is ideal. The kitchen contained all of the equipment you could need and the supermarket is just a minutes walk away. The location was great. The apartment was tidy & quiet. Great value for families wanting to stay close to some beautiful sights and tourist attractions. We would highly recommend Angela's apartment."),
("2018-12-21", "30412858", "Adam", "Very good"),
("2019-01-01", "30412858", "Terry", "位置十分方便｡"),
("2019-01-04", "30412858", "Brodie", "The location is fantastic! The swimming pool was a real treat  we enjoyed staying in the apartment. Angela was a great host."),
("2019-01-09", "30412858", "Malin", "You cant find a better place to stay if you go to Sydney!"),
("2019-01-12", "30412858", "Monika", "If you don’t feel disturbed by very simple furniture and quiet noisy sleeping rooms you can book it. If you expect a flat on a high floor with Harbour view this is not the right place."),
("2019-01-19", "30412858", "Lauren", "The location of this apartment is amazing  it is right next door to Darling Harbour. So that is the best feature by far! It was clean and had 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. There is a large baby cot in the main bedroom which takes up a lot of space if you are not needing it!It was clean and well cared for. The swimming pool and spa on the roof is fantastic!!Compared to other places I have stayed in  this one seemed to be pretty basic as there was really no added touches. But it’s functional and a good apartment"),
("2019-01-22", "30412858", "Derek", "Overall fantastic location and very responsive host BUT the apartment itself does not live up to the photos. The apartment needs some maintenance issues taken care of which we see previous guests have also mentioned."),
("2019-01-28", "30412858", "Kerrie", "On the positive side the apartment was in a fabulous location - close to attractions  restaurants and shopping. The check-in was seamless  despite my concerns about picking up keys from a convenience store. The apartment came with parking -  a real bonus in this area of Sydney. It took me 2 turns to find the carpark  but that was my fault I should have watched the video Angela provided on the day rather than a few days before. The apartment was very well equipped - dishwasher  washing machine and dryer etc. The beds were very comfy. Really good Wifi. On the negative side I was disappointed that we were only given one bath towel each (for a 4 night stay) and a fairly thin towel at that. No hand towels or face washers. The apartment was clean but could probably do with a spruce up as it looked a little tired. My big problem was the TV. It didn't work. When my husband telephoned one of the contact people he received a telephone call back saying that he couldn't help us and would get someone to look at it the next day - a bit too late as we were leaving the next morning. He also told my husband that he had spoken to the Concierge at the building and that a number of apartments were have antenna problems. We then tried to tune  the TV again and were able to ""find"" over 200 channels - but all of them were locked  including the free to air channels. My husband contacted the second contact person and he got back to us and said he couldn't understand why we were having problems as the family that had moved out that morning didn't have any issues. This was a complete lie - we had been in the apartment for the last three nights. I don't like people lying to me. Why not simply say that you can't rectify the problem  apologise for the inconvenience and leave it at that.  It wouldn't have been any big deal.Finally I don't like hosts asking me (on several occasions) to give them a 5 star rating. I only give honest feedback."),
("2019-01-28", "30412858", "Sarah", "Kind hospitality greets you while this spacious apartment gives you the slightest touch of home. While summer dawns on fabulous Sydney  the upstairs pool will show much of a necessity while you enjoy your stay. The bathroom functions well and the bedrooms feel as if your own! While you enjoy your stay  there are many tastes still yet to find. A sublime holiday stay for everyone and anyone!!!"),
("2019-01-30", "30412858", "Paul", "As you enter this comfortable apartment  it gives you a hearty welcome as you discover the many wonders of Sydney. Other add on's of this visit include a gym if you need a work-out and a wonderful pool that proves a fundamental as part of the torrid atmosphere of the city. The bedrooms are absolutely stunning! All the sheets are clean and the room itself is magnificently spotless. It is located at a perfect spot  with the closeness of the best 5 star hotel! A clear cut stay that's worthwhile!"),
("2019-02-06", "30412858", "Justin", "Everything is perfect  I have to say thanks to the host."),
("2019-02-15", "30412858", "Sarah", "As the many attractions of Australia open  this vast apartment will give you a lifetime experience. The building is next door to the harbour and many exquisite restaurants that will light up your visit! If the hot sun bothers you too much  you can easily go to the pool that also gives you a beautiful view of the city. I recommend this homely apartment to everyone and anyone!"),
("2019-02-25", "30412858", "Justin", "Perfect accommodation  love to stay again"),
("2018-12-26", "30479760", "Novita", "Lower your expectation! :)"),
("2018-12-30", "30479760", "Armin", "Contact the host and make sure the air con and other amenities listed are ACTUALLY working and EXIST as I was fooled about the aircon which was broken and he knew it but didnt inform me. Its very similar to a hotel room structure and he is not leaving in the premises  therefore be aware of likely poor communication as for my time he was overseas and couldnt get to him by phone."),
("2019-01-01", "30479760", "Scott", "Rooms are extremely small  the photos on the listing are a little deceiving. The place is fairly close to a few little shops. It is newly renovated and modern but overall the stay was fairly average."),
("2019-01-06", "30479760", "Aria", "The room itself while small was clean  the rest of the apartment was less than abismal regarding cleanliness."),
("2019-01-21", "30479760", "재광", "정말 훌륭합니다.신축이라 시멘트가 조금 떨어지기도 하는데 아주 깔끔하고 편리한 숙소였습니다"),
("2019-02-02", "30479760", "燕红", "交通很便利 入住体验不错!"),
("2019-02-25", "30479760", "Phoebe", "Perfect location and perfectly furnished  keypad was so handy rather than having a key  quick responses from ken if I ever needed help  very nice and modern would stay here again"),
("2019-02-26", "30479760", "Napassorn", "Ken is a superhost and great communication with fast responses."),
("2019-01-20", "30675540", "Sebastian", "Great place. Very relaxing. Owners very helpful."),
("2019-01-28", "30722343", "Kyle", "Patty’s house was beautiful decorated  nice and close to famous Bondi  remarkably quiet being only meters to all the action. Patty always responded quick and answered all questions I had for her. She was very flexible with check out asking me first what time I would like...I would recommend to anyone who wants to be amongst the action but can look forward to some peace and quiet 5 stars ⭐️"),
("2014-07-07", "3042637", "Matt", "We had a great time staying with Susan in Bronte. The place is self contained and quiet. Susan had thought of everything.  The place really was perfect.  We can't recommend this place highly enough!"),
("2014-07-10", "3042637", "Simon", "We had a wonderful time staying in Susan and Greg's garden studio. It was quiet  private  stylishly decorated and only minutes from a great little shopping village. The bed was very comfortable and our hosts were just delightful! A highly recommended stay! Brigita and Gerard  Hobart  Tasmania"),
("2014-08-02", "3042637", "Linda", "Susan is great and a very attentive and friendly host and very informative on where things are locally and in Sydney if you don't know the area so well. I really enjoyed my stay at Bronte B&B studio. It is a lovely space in a garden setting  quiet and in a street where you can park easily and walk to the beach and restaurants. The studio is well set up with a comfy bed and everything you would need. The fridge was packed with nice things like strawberries and yogurt and it's easy to have a light meal/breakfast etc. There's also an outside paved area among the trees with table and chairs which makes it lovely.   Bronte is a great area and the cliff walk to Bondi is great. I would fully recommend this and so much better than staying in a hotel."),
("2014-08-04", "3042637", "Jane And Anton", "Bronte Studio is a wonderful place to stay. The studio is bright and beautifully presented with everything we needed. The yummy fresh breakfast was an added bonus  not to mention the chocolate. Susan and Greg are lovely hosts and were there to help with any questions. The location is fantastic  we love bronte. "),
("2014-08-12", "3042637", "Harley", "Susan and Greg were very nice hosts    they were helpful while still giving  us a lot of privacy . The Studio is really nice   is well equipped   nice bathroom   linen   clean   everything is new inside . The garden where the studio sits is beautiful  a quite peaceful location you could think you were in the countryside but its close to Bondi."),
("2014-08-18", "3042637", "Casey", "What a perfect introduction to air bnb. Susan is the most welcoming host and from the moment we arrived we felt at home. The immaculate studio is set in a beautiful garden in your own private oasis. Susan could not do enough for us and her attention to detail made our experience flawless.  The fresh flowers on the bedside  the organic range of breakfast treats & crisp comfortable linen made it hard to leave. The location is an easy walk to the local cafés  transport & beach. Everything is at your finger tips. We cannot thank Susan enough for making our stay the perfect few days away  we look forward to coming back. "),
("2014-08-25", "3042637", "Tanya", "The little room at the back of Susan and her family's house really is a garden retreat. This part of Bronte is very quiet as you are away from the busy streets. We were made to feel very welcome with email communication beforehand and coffee/tea/breakfast supplies in the mini fridge and a little chocolate was a lovely surprise. This place is clean and private and I wouldn't hesitate to recommend staying here. The bonus was being able to walk from the house down to Bronte beach through the beautiful park nearby."),
("2014-08-28", "3042637", "Tim & Courtney", "This place was brilliant- lovely hosts and a great little pad to escape. Definitely will stay again"),
("2014-09-01", "3042637", "Christine", "This is a great place to stay  beautifully presented  very private (including own entrance)  great location (in terms of proximity to Bronte beach  the Bondi cliff walk  local restaurants and public transport to the city)  and extremely comfortable. The apartment is set at the rear of the stunning backyard garden with its own outside private area with table and chairs. Hosts are engaging  helpful and interesting without being intrusive."),
("2014-09-06", "3042637", "Sarah (Sally)", "I loved staying at Bronte B&B Studio. Such a peaceful spot where the loudest noises are those of glorious bird-calls. The bed was very comfortable. The provided breakfast food delicious. Susan was prompt in replying to queries before my stay and then on the day was really terrific helping out with a rushed task that was well above the expected. I would recommend Bronte B&B unreservedly."),
("2014-09-08", "3042637", "Derek", "Susan's studio truly surpassed all our expectations. It is set in a corner of their stunning rear garden. The room was clean  comfortable and inviting and the light breakfast was fresh and delicious. Susan and her family were beautiful hosts! We would certainly stay a second time round - no hesitation.Thanks Susan & family."),
("2014-09-21", "3042637", "Dominic", "We were warmly greeted by the owner Gregory  who showed us the studio and provided useful information like where to eat  distances to regions etc. The studio was immaculate – very clean & stylishly decked out. The studio includes thoughtful touches such as: maps and travels guides of Sydney  wifi  iPod/iPhone sound system adapter  beach towels  soaps  shampoo/conditioner  hair dryer  iron. The kitchenette was complete with amenities and complimentary food: oats  yoghurt  orange juice  fruit  milk  coffee. The studio is in a gorgeous garden setting. Its quiet and located just 5 min walk from the beach and 3 min walk from the delicious Three Blue Ducks. We would definitely recommend booking Bronte B & B Studio."),
("2014-09-28", "3042637", "Jill", "We thoroughly enjoyed staying here at the Bronte B&B! Susan and Greg are lovely hosts  and they certainly go out of their way to make you feel comfortable and welcome. It is a beautiful little home  ideal for a relaxing quiet break. Everything was wonderful! We certainly will be back soon!! "),
("2014-09-29", "3042637", "Elaine", "I booked this studio for my parents as we were visiting Australia for a whirlwind tour that required a lot of travelling in a short space of time. I could see they were tired and needed a nice place to relax for the day before we flew the very long journey back to Ireland and I felt Susan and Greg's studio looked perfect. I had a lot of questions for Susan before I booked (and I was also booking very last minute) and she took the time to respond to each one  and very promptly too. My parents only stayed for one night (two days) but they really enjoyed the peace and tranquility of the room and the area. The studio is bright  airy and comfortable with lovely bed sheets and complimentary beach towels which was a nice and thoughtful touch. A lovely array of breakfast foods was left out and Susan and Greg also offered a great recommendation for a cafe nearby that turned out very well.Bronte is a beautiful and peaceful area and the coastal walk from Coogee to Bondi is absolutely breathtaking. I highly recommend this area and this studio for those looking for some peaceful beach time."),
("2014-10-05", "3042637", "Sara", "Susan was absolutely gorgeous  so kind  welcoming  and lovely. The studio is fresh and comfortable - amazing really! we loved our stay more than we can say 10/10. Gorgeous area."),
("2014-10-09", "3042637", "Sylvia", "Susan and Greg were very helpful  letting us leave our bags when we arrived early and keeping in touch to let us know when the room was ready.  The studio is as comfortable as it looks - it's in a beautiful garden setting and the neighbourhood is a pleasant and safe place to walk around.  We thoroughly enjoyed our stay here  thank you."),
("2014-10-14", "3042637", "Linda", "Susan was a fabulous hostess. She offered advice on many things to do and see in Sydney. We loved her place - it was private  charming and sparkling clean. The garden outside was beautiful. Lastly - we could walk to the beach!"),
("2014-10-18", "3042637", "Oliver", "The Bronte Studio was Great. Susen and Greg were excellent hosts. They made us feel very welcome. The Beach is only a short walk away and the Main Street Provides everything from coffee places to Restaurants. We would definitively stay there again."),
("2014-10-23", "3042637", "Lachlan", "Great location  great accommodation and great hosts. Well priced  nothing more to ask for.   "),
("2014-10-27", "3042637", "Orla", "Susan's garden studio is a tranquil oasis hidden amongst the crazy world of over priced  poor quality and noisy Eastern Suburbs rentals.It was such a pleasure to have found this place. It's the perfect place to recharge. Everything was clean and beautifully presented and the studio was stocked with everything you might need  right down to spare toiletries/ umbrella/ Tupperware! And the breakfast provisions were just delicious.It's one of those places you don't want to tell too many people about  just in case it's booked out next time I want to visit."),
("2014-11-01", "3042637", "Sonia And Damien", "Staying with Susan and Greg was the perfect airbnb experience. They checked on us on our way in to Sydney to make sure we knew where to come  met us on arrival with maps and great local knowledge about the best things to do in Bronte and surrounds and provided a tranquil beautiful sanctuary with amazing provisions. We almost ran out of fridge space! :-) the garden is gorgeous and a beautiful place to sit and the bed was the best we've slept in since leaving home months ago. Greg and Susan even did our laundry for us! Way above and beyond ... All I have left to say is stop web searching and stay here. You wont find better. "),
("2014-11-09", "3042637", "Ed", "We love staying in the studio - it was high standard accommodation and everything was perfect for us. We also loved the area and it is  easy to get around by bus everywhere if you didn't want to hire a car. Susan and Greg were amazing hosts - they were extremely helpful and welcoming and even took us along to the local Starfish club one evening which we really enjoyed. If you want to stay in 5 star boutique type accommodation in a beautiful garden setting with great hosts book this studio ."),
("2014-11-22", "3042637", "Lani", "Susan's Bronte cottage was fabulous! So beautiful  light-filled and comfortable. Susan has taken care to make the studio a real home away from home. When staying at an apartment while on a trip it's often the little things you remember the most that help make your trip a special one. There was muesli  milk  juice and fresh fruit waiting upon arrival. How lovely! And the location could not be better--a 10- minute walk to the beach (one of Sydney's most beautiful!)  and an even shorter one to the charming main street with cafes and shops. Thanks so much  Susan. Can't wait for the next visit!"),
("2014-11-24", "3042637", "Deborah", "Our stay was absolutely fabulous. Susan was very welcoming and was extremely helpful with instructions and directions upon our arrival. The studio was clean and fresh and tucked away in a beautiful garden. It was perfect for a couple nights away from the busy hustle of the city. We would highly recommend the Bronte studio. Thank you Susan and family for being so accommodating."),
("2014-11-28", "3042637", "Brendan", "We were made to feel very welcome. A very nice  relaxed place to stay."),
("2014-11-30", "3042637", "Anne", "Susan was very welcoming  texted us prior to arriving.  Happy for us to us the amenities and leave our bags.  Gave us a few hints of the local cafes etc."),
("2014-12-06", "3042637", "Jet", "We had a fantastic stay at The Bronte Studio. It is very clean and nicely decorated. Excellent location to explore the beaches and only 30 minutes from down town Sydney. Susan and her husband were very friendly troughout our stay and gave us some very nice suggestions for diner etc."),
("2014-12-08", "3042637", "Sarah", "The place is lovely and Susan very nice and welcoming.Everything was clean and quietDefinitely recommend!"),
("2014-12-10", "3042637", "Sarah", "We had a lovely stay at Bronte B&B and Greg and Susan were very helpful hosts. It is a little haven of quiet and not far from the beach and great cafes. Thanks to our hosts! Sarah"),
("2014-12-28", "3042637", "Tobias", "We loved staying the B&B at Bronte. A beatiful and peacefull gardenhouse and garden and great hospitallity from Susan and her family. Bronte is a beatifull neighbourhood as well."),
("2015-01-01", "3042637", "Helene", "The Bronte B&B Studio is a little gem in a beautiful seaside neighbourhood  and yet with good transportation links to the CBD.  The accommodation is exactly as pictured  and is very peaceful  being in the garden of Susan and her husband's lovely home.  Our hosts were extremely welcoming and helpful  telling us about local restos  public transit into the city  and calling taxis when we needed a faster mode of transportation.  The breakfast provisions provided were generous and healthful  and we appreciated Susan remembering that we are vegetarians.  If you want a relaxing stay in Sydney  near a beach  the Bronte B&B Studio is the ticket  and Susan and her husband are great hosts.  Highly recommended."),
("2015-01-04", "3042637", "Meesha", "The Bronte B&B Studio was just the space we were looking for after returning from a week out bush over new years. The studio is private  clean and tranquil. A little oasis in the heart of Bronte with the beach only a short (hilly) walk away. Fridge was stocked with juice  milk and fresh mangoes (yum!) and the bathroom with organic and cruelty free products. It was a delight to stay. Susan was great to deal with and also offered to keep our bags in the main house while we went out sight seeing as we had a late flight.Highly recommend."),
("2015-01-28", "3042637", "Mandi", "What a magical spot! Everything was perfect (except the weather!) ☔️Lovely informative welcome - the studio was spotlessly clean with fresh flowers from the garden & a fridge full of goodies. Great location with nearby cafés & the beach a short walk away. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay & would highly recommend to others visiting Sydney. Thanks again"),
("2015-02-11", "3042637", "Christina", "We absolutely love Bronte B&B!!!We couldn't have found a better place to stay  hidden in Susan and Gregs lovely green garden  you feel very private. You have an area of the garden to your self. The studio have all your need for a perfect stay. The soap is lovely (Susan helped us buy some  to take home). The beakfast all organic  lovely mangos  avocado  lovely bread  everyting tasted amazinig. The area has some nice restaurants and coffee shops  bronte beach is lovely to.You will use a bit of time in public transportation going to Bondi junction. to connect with the train and other busses. You can do amazing walks close to the ocean  and make sure to go to Coogee Beach too.Susan was a lovely host and took very good care of us and was very helpfull  very easy to communicate with. This is such a lovely place stay and we couldn't have hoped for any better. We hope will have the opportunuty to go back.Anders & Christina  Copenhagen  DK"),
("2015-02-14", "3042637", "Mark", "We were made to feel very welcome from the start and the Studio was  exactly what we were hoping - quiet and peaceful  yet we were still close to all attractions. The Studio is located within what could be called a "" secret garden""  and our privacy was guaranteed. Walk to Bronte beach (downhill there but uphill on return) and enjoy the coastal walk from Bondi to Coogee. Thanks again."),
("2015-02-16", "3042637", "Eleanor", "I loved staying with Susan and Greg! The studio was well-furnished  and it provided the comforts of home. The fridge was stocked w easy breakfast goodies  and I was really enchanted by their gorgeous gardens. It's also a very quiet and nice area  roughly 5-10 minute walk to Bronte Beach.  From Bronte  you can do the coastal walk through to Tamarama and Bondi. It made for a perfect weekend away to be at the beach and living like a local  and with such lovely hosts. I would stay with them again given the chance. "),
("2015-02-18", "3042637", "Virginie", "We had a wonderfull stay at Susan's  the studio is well furnished and the private courtyard very appreciable. The place is very quiet and you can go easily to Bronte beach and the superb walkway to Bondi."),
("2015-02-20", "3042637", "Rohan", "Susan and Greg were brilliant hosts having thought of everything beyond just a comfortable stay for the three of us. There was Greg ready with maps and things to do  places to eat  Cricket kit for my 7 yr old boy and easy to remember wifi password. Susan had a mini botanic tour for us at her pretty garden early morning. And to top it all they even helped us pack!Best hosts ever..."),
("2015-02-23", "3042637", "Claire", "Me and my boyfriend stayed for 3 nights in the Bronte studio and absolutely loved it! The self-contained studio is at the back of the main house in the beautiful garden and Susan has really thought of everything you could possibly need. Susan and Greg were lovely hosts with lots of helpful advice and information about the local area (we loved Clovelly Bowls Club situated on top of a cliff where you can visit as a guest for a few very reasonably priced drinks). The neighbourhood is beautiful  with some nice local eateries where we had one of the best (and cheapest) steaks we've ever had at Eugene's! Bronte beach is only a 10 minute walk away  and other beaches (including Bondi) can be reached via a gorgeous coastal walkway. Sydney city centre is easily accessible via the local bus stop at the end of the street. We would love to return and stay with Susan and Greg again  and cannot recommend their beautiful studio enough! Thanks again :). "),
("2015-03-01", "3042637", "Jo", "The hosts made us feel so welcome! We were so spoilt :) From the fresh juice  mango  chocolate and organic yoghurt in the fridge  to the beautiful soaps  shampoo and fresh white linen. They gave us directions to good local cafes and walks  we barely used the car as were in great walking distance to the beach and shops. Came home so relaxed  will definitely be back! Thanks guys  "),
("2015-03-08", "3042637", "Anthony", "Our recent stay with Susan and Greg was every bit as good as we expected. We arrived quite late in the evening which wasn't a problem for Susan and Greg and they made us feel very welcome showing us around and giving us tips on the local area.The studio was very clean and the fridge full of fresh fruit  Juice Yoghurt etc all organic which went down a treat for breakfast.Greg brought us fresh bagels and bread from the local bakery a couple of the mornings which was a nice surprise.They also offered to do some laundry for us which was very thoughtful and a great help as we had been in Australia a couple of weeks by the time we stayed in Bronte.For anyone looking for a peaceful retreat in a lovely garden setting in a nice residential area  this is the place to stay.Thanks to you bothCheersTony & Pat"),
("2015-04-23", "3042637", "Dave And Mia", "While the weather let us down  we were really happy with this place  and touched by Susan's hospitality. The studio was thoughtfully set up  and had a really nice feel. We would recommend it to all."),
("2015-04-26", "3042637", "Muriel", "Superbe. Tout était parfait. L'accueil chaleureux de Susane  le magnifique jardin  la décoration  tout est fait pour se sentir à la maison tout en étant indépendant."),
("2015-05-03", "3042637", "Ira", "It was a pleasure staying at Susan's and Greg's garden studio. A beautiful retreat with respectful hosts. A lovely experience. Thanks!"),
("2015-05-07", "3042637", "Meinrad", "We had just a perfect time in susan and gregs garden. They are so helpful an welcoming."),
("2015-05-10", "3042637", "Andrew", "Quiet  clean and relaxing place to stay. Will be staying again and highly recommend to any couple looking for a place to stay in Bronte."),
("2015-05-12", "3042637", "Mark", "Susan was extremely hospitable welcoming Katie and myself to her beautiful B&B studio. We enjoyed  breakfast in the sunny private garden and the recommended cafes and restaurants in Bronte and close by Coogee. Our stay was topped off with the fantastic costal walk through to Bondi beach. Would highly recommend.Thanks a bunch Susan!"),
("2015-05-20", "3042637", "Dominic", "Exactly what it said it would be and more. Really lovely private space in the garden of a family home. 10 minutes from the beach (up a steep hill) but a lovely walk and fantastic beach so well worth it. Susan and her family were the best Airbnb hosts we've had. Around just enough to give exactly the right amount of support that we needed without being too much. But also going above and beyond the call of duty bringing gorgeous breakfast food and even helping us with a bit of washing for our 8 week old baby which was so so helpful. Overall it was a really lovely experience with great people. Highly recommended. We'll be back for sure!"),
("2015-05-31", "3042637", "Gweneth", "The studio was beautifully set up and very comfortable.  Susan and Greg were very accommodating and looked after me really well.  The neighourhood was in a great location  close to the beach  shops and public transport. I would return in a heartbeat!"),
("2015-06-02", "3042637", "Louise", "We had such a relaxing time- the garden outlook was beautiful and it was like being in the country in the middle of Sydney! The bed was lush and room cozy (we needed the heater as it was freezing in Sydney this weekend!)Susan was such a lovely host- she was very welcoming  provided us with great tips for local eateries and everything was within walking distance. We would definitely visit again.... Thank you Susan."),
("2015-06-08", "3042637", "Eva", "My partner and I Loved everything about Bronte b&b; the hosts were lovely  the accommodation perfectly clean and wonderful+  the neighbourhood quiet  picturesque and central.  Would definitely visit again."),
("2015-08-02", "3042637", "Steve", "It is quite apparent as to why Susan has the title super host!Our stay was one of the most pleasurable we have ever experienced in Sydney and we look forward to staying with Susa again pending availability."),
("2015-08-09", "3042637", "Kimberly", "The apartment was lovely and had a lot of privacy. Love that the view from the bed was the garden itself and there are tables outside you can have breakfast at. Amenities were provided and Susan even stocked the fridge with breakfast. Susan was very helpful and even remembered to book a cab for me to the airport when I completely forgot. Neighbourbood is wonderful and safe. Location is near the beach (only 5min walk) and walking distance to the supermarket  restaurants and cafe. Great stay and a highlight during my trip to Australia. Bronte and Susan's apartment is highly recommended! "),
("2015-08-13", "3042637", "Rory", "Susan and Gregg are the perfect hosts  not only with their warm welcome and lovely local bread  yoghurt and fruit  but their considered expert knowledge both locally and the wider Sydney area. Their studio matched the expectation and was snug  private  quiet and well presented  we liked it so much we stayed twice! Bronte is a perfect location for stunning coastal walks  funky eats(3 blue ducks and the Pavilion mm!) and easy bus and train  best of all is Susan and Gregg as hosts!"),
("2015-08-16", "3042637", "Cathal", "We had a very enjoyable stay at Susan's studio. The studio was extremely comfortable  private and in a great location. We would be happy to stay again"),
("2015-08-18", "3042637", "Morgan", "Beautiful home away from home! Susan and Greg are fantastic hosts. Incredibly helpful and provide a really wonderful experience. Nothing is a problem and they went out of their way to accommodate us and our baby girl. Loved the location  morning walks to the beach  plenty of great cafes near by  especially love the stunning oasis of a garden setting. Impeccably clean and well equipped. This will be our regular Sydney place to stay. Thanks so much. "),
("2015-08-23", "3042637", "Juhee", "Susan's studio was great bright for us. Wonderful sunshine  lovely garden and beautiful Bronte beach ;-) so warm welcome when I'd came there. Have good time and enjoy at stayThank you so muchLovely"),
("2015-08-30", "3042637", "Steve", "Susan again made our Sydney stay memorable.We can't recommend her highly enough.she is a deserved Super Host!"),
("2015-09-05", "3042637", "Manuella", "Staying at Susan and Greg's is like staying in a boutique hotel with your own little private patio. The studio was comfy and pristine clean and had all you need for breakfast and tea at hand. Plus you get wonderful granola  proper orange juice and gourmet yoghurt  and even fresh bagels on our second day in! Our hosts were so welcoming and helpful and even offered to do our laundry. The location is perfect for exploring the Eastern beaches of Sydney (great coastal walks from Bronte to Coogee and Bondi) and there are also regular buses to the city nearby. We loved it and definitely recommend!"),
("2015-09-13", "3042637", "Vivien", "Susan's studio is lovely and made a perfect nest for us during our stay in Bronte. Susan and her friends' welcome was nothing but warm. Highly recommended."),
("2015-09-21", "3042637", "Marnie", "Our stay in Bronte was lovely. Communication with Susan was easy and clear. Susan and Greg were welcoming and very respectful if our space and privacy. We knew they were around if needed though felt we had our own space too. A great little pad in the gorgeous Bronte. Highly recommended . Thank you"),
("2015-10-02", "3042637", "Megan", "Hubby and I loved our stay at Greg and Susan's B & B.  The cottage is private and surrounded by lovely gardens. Light breakfast provided was just right  delicious and healthy.  We really enjoyed being able to walk to beaches and great cafes.  Thank you Greg and Susan for your hospitality and the unexpected little touches that made our experience so enjoyable."),
("2015-10-05", "3042637", "Christopher", "Very warm and welcoming hosts. Lovely spot in a terrific neighbourhood."),
("2015-10-10", "3042637", "Maximilian", "We had such a wonderful and memorable time at Susan's cosy Studio in Bronte Beach. Susan and Greg gave us a very warm welcome and spoiled us throughout the entire stay. The Studio  which is seperated from the main house  provides everything you would need and makes you feel home from the very beginning. It is perfectly located if you like to combine your visit to Syndey with a day  or two  at one of the city's most beautiful beaches. We hope to be back soon!"),
("2015-10-12", "3042637", "Melanie", "We absolutely loved our stay at Bronte B&B Studio! Susan was so accommodating and the studio was clean and fresh and tastefully decorated. We loved all the extra touches - fresh fruit and yogurt in the fridge  lovely organic teas! It's a nice short walk to the beach and there are lovely cafes and restaurants nearby. We will definitely be recommending the studio to our friends and would stay there again when we are next in Sydney."),
("2015-10-16", "3042637", "Heather & Mike", "Every detail was perfect and this was a great stay in what was a very busy week for me.  Susan and Greg made me feel completely at home.  Plus  it was really excellent value.  Thank you so much."),
("2015-10-18", "3042637", "Harry", "Thank you Susan and Greg  for being such friendly hosts and for a pleasant stay in your lovely  quiet  peaceful  comfortable studio garden retreat near Bronte beach. Would be pleased to stay there again and to recommend it to others"),
("2015-11-01", "3042637", "Nico", "Susan was a fantastic host  she's been very attentive in every detail of our stay  from the first contact to saying goodbye.The place was really lovely and nested in Susan's gorgeous garden  which in itself is a little heaven. The small details  like a lovely breakfast  international power plug adapters  and beach towels were simply delightful.We had a wonderful time and I highly recommend her place."),
("2015-11-04", "3042637", "Beata", "My husband and I stayed at Susan's and Greg's studio over three days in early November.  When walking through the back garden towards a small building at the back  we were stunned by the subtropical beauty of its setting  with a huge purple jacaranda tree and flowering hedges.  The view from the inside towards a private outdoor dining space was no less spectacular.  The photos of the interior were very accurate: a light  very nicely decorated and comfortable room  with a well supplied kitchenette (the bar fridge thoughtfully hidden in a cupboard blocking out any possible noise)  and an en suite  bathroom. Both  Susan and Greg replied to our messages promptly before our arrival and were very welcoming when we got there.  At the same time  while available if needed  they left us to ourselves respecting our privacy  which was greatly appreciated.  Susan was very generous  supplying not only maps and guides to the area  as well as her personal recommendations regarding local cafés  but leaving ample gourmet breakfast provisions in the fridge  and a surprise basket with fresh bagels  organic butter and Yarra Valley jam on our doorstep the next morning.Its location was our original reason for choosing the studio: in the heart of stunning Bronte  within easy walk to the beaches and the annual Sculpture by the Sea exhibits along the shore between Tamarama and Bondi.  What a treat!"),
("2015-11-06", "3042637", "Harriet", "The studio was exactly as described a lovely private place to stay. Every thing was clean and tidy and Susan was really welcoming and helpful. A great place to stay!"),
("2015-11-16", "3042637", "Michael", "A beautiful studio set in a gorgeous garden with all the little thoughtful touches needed to make a truly special stay. Thank you again."),
("2015-11-22", "3042637", "Helen", "Susan & Greg were incredibly welcoming and generous. The location is perfect-quite close to great beaches and local shops and restaurants. The studio was spotless and well equipped with everything you need )plus everything that Susan knew you would need but you forgot). The fridge& kitchen was stocked with goodies that made it feel like Christmas-such a treat.The shower is great  bed super comfy and the space very private. It was a perfect weekend stay and I am thankful that Susan responded promptly to my last minute request. Beautiful studio  lovely hosts!! Looking forward to staying again soon. "),
("2015-11-29", "3042637", "Fiona", "We had a fantastic time at Susan's place. She was there to greet us when we arrived and showed us to our room. The room was perfect. Extremely jeat and tidy and had absolutely everything we needed. It was quite private amd very close to the beach and shops so getting around was easy from her place. Will definitely be heading back again in the future!"),
("2015-12-15", "3042637", "Sara", "Our stay at this charming cottage in Bronte was very pleasant.The place was spotless with very nice hosts that went out their way to make us welcome.we would stay here next time and recommend it to friends."),
("2015-12-19", "3042637", "Susanne & Martin", "Susan's studio in Bronte is a jewel. Located in her beautiful garden  the studio was just the perfect place for our stay in Sydney. Super well equipped with everything you need. Not only is the place beautiful  Susan is also the perfect host. Very sweet  caring and always there to help when you need anything. Thank you. "),
("2015-12-24", "3042637", "Jennifer", "Susan and Greg are some of the most caring  welcoming and thoughtful hosts I have met. Their studio is the perfect place to stay near Bronte beach - light  airy  very clean and well appointed with a super comfortable bed  roomy bathroom and the comforts of home. I awoke every morning to the sound of birds and an ocean breeze  and loved relaxing in the beautiful garden space which they have lovingly created. It offers the quintessential Bronte neighborhood experience - 10 mins stroll to the beach  close to the best restaurants and is located in a lovely street full of native flora.But what makes this home really special are the hosts' thoughtful gestures - everything from the breakfast items they left me  through to local tips and suggestions  as well as an invitation to join them for festive celebrations. They are both natural hosts - available if you need assistance but also offer guests privacy and personal space.This is the perfect place to stay at one of Sydney's best beaches (as a single or couple). I look forward to enjoying Susan and Greg's hospitality and friendship again very soon!"),
("2016-01-08", "3042637", "Lynne-Marie", "I think this was my favourite place to stay ever. The weather was very rainy when I stayed but this was the perfect place to hide out  relax and get over my jet lag. Lovely quiet spot. The facilities were fantastic and I arrived to fruit  milk  orange juice  yoghurt...chocolates! The place is beautifully decorated and everything has been thought of! Susan and Greg were just great. Always to hand and very attentive (even doing my washing) but they gave me my space and the accommodation is very private. Couldn't fault it. Thanks so much! "),
("2016-01-27", "3042637", "Sean", "Bliss! We had such a lovely time in Bronte and that was all thanks to Susan & her husband and their studio setup - to say we highly recommend this place would be an understatement. The location made for a convenient base to access both the city and the nearby surrounds of the eastern suburbs. The studio itself had all the facilities we needed for our stay with the decor and lighting creating the relaxing coastal oasis that we were after - even a tasty local breakfast was provided as a bonus! Thank you Susan  was so lovely meeting you and feeling so welcomed into Bronte."),
("2016-02-09", "3042637", "Angie", "Susan and her husband Greg were great! They gave us great advice on the area  did a load of laundry  and had yummy treats for us to eat.The studio was so comfortable  clean  and i loved how open it was. Thank you!"),
("2016-02-12", "3042637", "Stu", "We had a lovely time at Susan and Gregg's beach studio. We were made to feel very welcome  the studio was immaculate and every morning we had a basket of fresh bread and jams left outside our door.The studio is nestled under trees which keeps it cool  along with the ceiling fan above the bed.Bronte is a peaceful suburb that is perfectly positioned for everything. The Bondi and Coogee walk is a must and Bronte is on route along that walk.Thank you Susan and Gregg for being a wonderful part of our three week Oz adventure. :-)"),
("2016-02-15", "3042637", "Nick", "Nature brings out the best in us and this garden studio does exactly that. The studio lies at the bottom of a very grassy garden surrounded by large trees. We loved opening the double studio doors to let the morning light stream in through the leaves. Valentine's Day was a delight with warm bagels  churned butter and strawberry jam delivered to our door. We had planned to go out for breakfast but it was too good to resist and we felt better for staying at home with each other. Bronte cafes  restaurants and beach just a stroll away and we found ourselves talking about moving there. Susan and Greg are awesome hosts. We think this place is pretty special. N"),
("2016-02-16", "3042637", "Nicola", "We had a lovely time staying with Susan and Greg. They made us feel so welcome  introducing the apartment thoroughly and the local area too. They even helped us with local taxis and arranged a travel cot for our little one.The apartment has great links  with amazing walks to Bronte  Bondi and Coogee. We ate in Susan and Gregs wonderful oasis garden one evening and in local restaurants.The apartment was very clean  practical and just like the description.Would definitely recommend this place! "),
("2016-02-21", "3042637", "Dan", "I had a very pleasant stay."),
("2016-03-08", "3042637", "Jette", "We felt very welcome from the first moment. Our little house was in the end of  a wonderful garden. We felt very private. The location is fantastic in a quiet place  close to the City and 8 minutes walk to the beach with a wonderful oceanpool to swim in. Susan and Greg are great hosts  very caring and helpful they even did our laundry. They also invited us to a local jazz house and we had a great time together. It seems like the Airbnb spirit comes from their hearts. We  loved our stay and would come back if we get the chance. It's highly recommended!"),
("2016-03-10", "3042637", "Greg", "Such a wonderful place to stay and a wonderful location. Susan and Greg were lovely hosts. They pointed us in the right direction for best places to swim and eat and left us to it. We had a relaxing three days/two nights and managed to get in several trips to the beach. The flat itself was quiet  spotless and very comfortable. Whilst we stayed before arriving here in a hotel in town  this place was better  more relaxing and a place we are already thinking we would like to return to. "),
("2016-03-15", "3042637", "Gail", "I really enjoyed my stay at this Bronte home.  It was exactly as described - only better.  It was a safe haven - and easy walking to the best bakery (Iggy's) I've been to  as well as a juice bar  coffee shop and a couple of great restaurants.  Also not such an easy stroll to the paths along the coast (just because of the hills!) but no distance at all.  Highly recommended."),
("2016-03-17", "3042637", "Emily", "My boyfriend and I had a lovely 2-night stay at Susan and Greg's Bronte beach cottage. They have thought of everything to make it seem like home! We really appreciated the delicious and thoughtful breakfast  and also enjoyed being so close to great restaurants. We didn't miss having air conditioning despite the hot weather as there was a refreshing breeze and we were able to keep the windows open. "),
("2016-04-06", "3042637", "Debra", "What a find! Bronte B&B surpassed our expectations. It was relaxing  comfortable and had everything we wanted and more! Susan and Greg were delightful  giving us our own space but there when we needed anything. If we ever return to Sydney we will know where to stay!"),
("2016-04-10", "3042637", "Muriel", "Very nice as usual.Everything was ready and Susan is always very friendly."),
("2016-04-12", "3042637", "Jeremy", "Beautiful studio at the end of a pretty garden. Well equipped and had a very nice stay. Would love to go back if back in Sydney. Highly recommended."),
("2016-04-16", "3042637", "Akiko", "Susan was very considerate  warm and welcome  so as hubby :) Garden flat is at the rear of lovingly maintained older style house. Room is as you see in the photo and very tastefully done. quality bedding  loved the floor tiles in the bathroom  leafy garden to enjoy quiet time and reading. Friendly cat sits on your lap. Beware of mozzies though. I am usually the last person to get bitten  but I attracted plenty in the garden. The suburb shops and Tamarama beach has ""local"" feel and lot less commercial than places like Bondi and Coogee. Easy bus ride to Bondi junction and city. Very nice coastal walk we enjoyed. We had a nice time."),
("2016-04-18", "3042637", "Elizabeth", "Susan's Bronte B&B Studio is a wonderful place to stay if you have the chance. The studio is very nice  clean  and secluded  just as pictured. It makes excellent use of a small space. Susan and her husband are very friendly and welcoming. She was great with communication  and really helpful in providing information about the area. She was very generous in providing tasty breakfast/snack food and drink (specific to our vegan diet) during our stay. The neighborhood is lovely  and the beach is just a short walk away  downtown a longer walk (or bus)."),
("2016-04-22", "3042637", "Kimberlee", "We very much enjoyed Susan and Greg's Bronte B&B.  The location was ideal for beaches and the coastal walk.  There were also neighborhood shops and restaurants within an easy walk.  We appreciated that beach towels and breakfast were provided.  We also appreciated their flexibility about check out when our plans changed.  The studio is just like it looks in the pictures and the garden is a very peaceful place to wake up in.  We recommend to anyone looking for some quiet  peaceful time in a great area."),
("2016-04-25", "3042637", "Hima", "The garden bungalow is amazing  a little oasis.  Super cute and very comfortable and stocked with everything you need.Susan is a great host.  She was awesome about letting us drop our bags off early  and even offered to help  if our daughter who is studying abroad for a semester  in Sydney  needed anything.  Highly recommended."),
("2016-05-08", "3042637", "Anne", "We arrived and were pleased to see the house was on a good street with lovely gardens. We were welcomed warmly by Greg. The studio was warm  clean  with lovely provisions. In the morning I found fresh bagels and jam on the step so I could relax and not have to go to the shop!  Walking to Clovelly and Bronte was a delight. We enjoyed breakfast in the Garden. Thanks for a lovely stay. Regards Anne and Rodger "),
("2016-05-10", "3042637", "Renee", "Susan's Bronte B&B is absolutely perfect! Susan and her husband were extremely welcoming and lovely people to have a chat with. Her room in Bronte is located at the end of their beautiful backyard  separate from their house and is precisely as described on Air BnB. The room is bright  spacious  super clean and has all the amenities that one could possibly need whilst away  with a big comfortable bed to boot! Susan had thought of everything for the room  from an iron  insect repellent to breakfast  a fruit bowl  tea  coffee (real coffee) and chocolate!! They are a short walk from cafes and restaurants and Bronte beach and a longer walk to Bondi. Highly recommended host! "),
("2016-05-22", "3042637", "Paul", "This was a perfect place to stay  and was just as we imagined it. It's in a nice quiet spot yet the beautiful beach and coastline are handy and access to downtown and anywhere else is easy and quick by bus and train (with an Opel card each). The buses often run every 10 minutes. The coastal walks to either Bondi in the north or Coogee in the south are recommended. There were some good choices for restaurants locally or towards Bondi Junction. Susan and Greg were great hosts and were helpful in every way. I wouldn't hesitate to stay here again when visiting family in Sydney. "),
("2016-05-24", "3042637", "Hugh", "So comfortable and homely. Susan really has thought of everything to make your stay truly wonderful."),
("2016-05-30", "3042637", "Sarah", "What a stunning place to stay! Both Susan and her husband Greg were there to greet us upon arrival and showed us to the quiet  clean and well appointed studio. They were more than happy to help with directions  restaurant suggestions etc. There were so many lovely little touches in the studio  plenty of supplies including T2 tea  chocolate and fresh orange juice.  Their studio is really close to everything Bronte has to offer and I wouldn't hesitate recommending this to anyone visiting Sydney and the area."),
("2016-06-06", "3042637", "Maria", "This was such a beautiful place to stay - everything was so thoughtfully appointed and lovely and it's in a great spot. There was delicious muesli  fruit  yoghurt and other treats for us to eat. Susan and Greg were very generous hosts - they even dropped over fresh bagels on Sunday morning! We would love to come back again - we had a wonderful time."),
("2016-06-08", "3042637", "Kaaren", "Thank you Susan and Greg. Your studio is perfect."),
("2016-06-13", "3042637", "Maureen", "We had a great long weekend here.  It's a very nice studio but definitely suits a stay during finer weather so that you can take full advantage of the outdoor table and chairs.Excellent location - close to shops and beach  and easy street parking.Lovely hosts.  Thank you!"),
("2016-06-19", "3042637", "Jo", "We only stayed one night but it was a lovely clean and comfortable studio. tucked away at the end of the garden it was quiet and private. Everything was provided that we needed. The Nespresso was great when we didn't want to go out for coffee! The studio is easy walking distance to Bronte beach  pubs and restaurants. We didn't actually get to meet susan  her daughter checked us in. but communication with her via Air BnB was easy. I would definitely stay again if I go back to this area. "),
("2016-06-30", "3042637", "Catherine", "We had a marvelous stay at Susan's beautiful cottage. The attention to detail  tasteful decor  gorgeous garden and warmth of our hosts was very much apprecited. Beats a hotel room! Wonderful location and very convenient to the best of Sydney's eastern beaches. Susan and Greg - you are a super Super hosts! Look forward to returning soon. Catherine"),
("2016-07-04", "3042637", "Zack", "Wow! Susan and Greg  thank you for being such wonderful hosts in Sydney! We truly felt welcomed and at home in Bronte Beach-- and would recommend your place to anyone visiting-- hands down! The cottage was incredibly comfortable and was the most magnificent starting point for jogs along the beach  brunch at the beach  and short rides into Surry Hills/downtown Sydney for sightseeing and evenings out. Thank you both for the tips and the wonderful hospitality!!"),
("2016-07-09", "3042637", "Tamara", "What a gem! From the minute we arrived  Susan makes us feel very welcomed. Loved everything about the place. Susan is the perfect host  everything is well thought of - the good food guide books to the beautiful tea cups  really make you feel right at home. Highly recommended."),
("2016-07-11", "3042637", "Jim", "we stayed at Susan's house for two nights. It is our best experience in AirB&B. House is just look like pic. so clean and comfortable with big garden outside. you will get everything you need in Susan's house. Especially  Susan is a amazing host. she is so kind and helpful. She made breakfast for us  which is amazing and delicious. Thanks Susan for everything during our stay. You make our travel to Australia more meaningful and fruitful. "),
("2016-07-16", "3042637", "Kat", "Susan's place is beautiful and she makes you feel like just a friend that has come to stay. The studio has absolutely every little thing thought of. Parking is easy  public transport right around the corner and great cafes and shops just a 5 minute walk. I definitely recommend it. You have easy access to everything but your own little garden oasis to escape back to."),
("2016-07-19", "3042637", "Anna", "Susan made me feel very welcome when I arrived  asking me in for a coup of tea and some dessert! The studio was very lovely to stay in with lots of thoughtful touches like a variety of tea  beach towels for swimming and tide time charts. I had a lovely time staying here and would definitely recommend it. "),
("2016-07-25", "3042637", "Josh", "Absolutely going to book here again. Susan and her partner were very accommodating and even dropped off breakfast the morning after our first night."),
("2016-08-01", "3042637", "Steve", "Staying at Susan's is the best. She is SO thoughtful and caring  supplying a gorgeous organic breakfast of fruit  muesli and juice. ( and chocolate!). The location is fabulous  just a short walk past amazing realestate to Bronte beach and pool. Our electric blankets were on and the place heated on arrival. Susan knew we are going through tough times with family illness and surprised us with a beautiful breakfast basket on Sunday morning. She is a treasure and we are honestly disappointed if we are unable to stay there. Jenni and Steve"),
("2016-08-08", "3042637", "Steve", "We continue to chose to stay here because Susan is so caring and thoughtful. Everything is taken care of and all the extras like the tea selection  the chocolate and the fruit are lovely"),
("2016-08-16", "3042637", "Lauren", "Very welcoming holiday stay in Bronte. Susan and Greg's little oasis at the bottom of their garden gave us privacy and allowed us to relax. Very comfortable studio unit."),
("2016-08-22", "3042637", "Jess", "Susan's place was fantastic! Bright and lovely  in a great location. I stayed for three nights while in town for work. I had a hire car with me  and street parking wasn't an issue. Would definitely stay in this gorgeous studio again!"),
("2016-09-04", "3042637", "Ingrid", "We absolutely loved our stay in Bronte. I would highly recommend staying here for a perfect weekend away. Susan and Greg were lovely. They greeted on arrival and made sure we were comfortable. Susan left me her umbrella as it was raining the day we arrived. They provided us with great tips on what to do and where to go in the area. The studio is beautiful. We were provided with tea  coffee  orange juice  chocolate and other breakfast treats. Fresh bagels were delivered to our door on the first morning. The studio is very private  and comfortable- it has everything you need and more. The wifi works well  which was important as I worked on the first day we arrived. The location is perfect. It was a lovely short walk to local cafes and to beautiful Bronte beach. We walked to Bondi along coastal walk one morning and to Coogee one evening. It was a short uber to Bondi and Coogee for a night out. I would recommend for anyone to stay here and I am now completely in love with the Bronte neighbourhood. Stay here and you'll feel like a local! "),
("2016-09-09", "3042637", "Emily", "We arrived to Susan's place a little tired from a long travel day  but we were so relieved to arrive to Susan's Bronte Studio - a relaxing getaway! The pictures portray the little studio perfectly. Plus  the little yard and garden area makes the cottage even more quaint. I highly recommend the Bronte studio if you want to easily access Bronte beach and also Bondi! We went surfing and swimming at Icebergs (only 10 minutes away!) Don't hesitate. Book it! (If it's available.) :) "),
("2016-09-12", "3042637", "Brigid", "The ideal retreat. Thoughtful touches. Excellent linen.  Lovely setting. Friendly hosts.  I'll be back."),
("2016-09-17", "3042637", "Richard", "My wife and I were made to feel very welcome - even a special delivery of local bagels with jam /butter to our doorstep the next morning . The  studio is at the back of a long and beautiful garden ( the smell of night jasmine was remarkable ) .Susan showed us the local secrets - Three Blue Ducks cafe and the pathway down to Bronte beach : the bus stop ( straight to Bondi Junction ) is close also . Cant commend it high enough if you want to be on this side of town - very quiet as well"),
("2016-09-21", "3042637", "Monique", "I had a wonderful stay at Susan's B&B in Bronte. It was a beautiful studio  which opened onto a lovely view of her garden. It had all the amenities for a comfortable and relaxing stay. We enjoyed the light breakfast each morning. Only a 10 minute walk to the beach and bus stop into town at the end of the road. I will definitely be back and be recommending to friends and family! "),
("2016-09-24", "3042637", "Bradley", "Susan is a wonderful host! The studio is lovely and has everything you'd need for a comfortable stay. Very clean  and a very comfortable bed which is a huge plus. The garden rounds the whole place off and makes it that much more charming. Susan is very kind  and prompt about responding to any questions you might have. If I'm in Bronte again someday I'll definitely stay at her studio."),
("2016-09-28", "3042637", "Jasmine", "Susan was very hospitable even before we arrived at her place.  She was very thoughtful to contact us to provide information needed to get to her place.  Susan also provided suggestions for dinners and cafes to hang out around the Bronte area.  She even provided options for vegetarian!   The studio is exactly what you see in the pictures with a lovely garden.  While we had to walk pass the main house to get to the studio  it was very private at the back of the house and even your own garden.  My only regret was the weather  that it was too cold on the days we were there for us to hang out in the garden to enjoy our wines :)"),
("2016-10-07", "3042637", "Helen", "Utterly delightful and a home from home in every way. All the comforts and lots of additional touches that made the stay special"),
("2016-10-08", "3042637", "William", "Susan's place is perfect. The studio is very comfortable and private  and Susan was a great host. Location is great  just a short walk to the beach. Will definitely stay again!"),
("2016-10-12", "3042637", "Saartje", "After traveling half way around the world it was lovely to experience a warm family welcome that made me feel at home straight away! The studio is exactly like on the pictures and was more comfortable than I've could have wanted! I would recommend it to everyone!"),
("2016-10-17", "3042637", "Graham", "Perfect stay! Studio was everything we could have asked for. Clean and with everything we needed. Waking up to the best bagels we've ever eaten on our door step was quite the treat. Thank you!"),
("2016-10-23", "3042637", "Philip", "So much attention to detail in the unit and precisely as advertised. It was such a comfortable place to stay. Susan went above and beyond to make everything enjoyable and easy  too. "),
("2016-10-29", "3042637", "Erica", "Susan is a fabulous host  she did everything to  help my European guest welcome and able to enjoy his stay. He loved staying with Susan and  is very keen to come back to Bronte....organic chocolate  beers  fresh bagels....comfy bed  fab location  warm and helpful host  what more could you want?erica "),
("2016-11-01", "3042637", "Nina", "Had a lovely short stay at Susan's place. She even took the trouble to forward my forgotten phone charger to me!  Thanks Susan"),
("2016-11-14", "3042637", "Jonathan And Pauline", "This is a super air BnB in a great location we recommend it unreservedly"),
("2016-11-17", "3042637", "Andrea", "Susan's place is a fantastic studio in Bronte. We loved our first AirBnb experience. They have set the bar high. We would highly recommend it to people who want to immerse themselves in the area. Take your walking shoes and soak up the atmosphere! Also so close to local restaurants and public transport. Thank you"),
("2016-11-19", "3042637", "Danielle", "Susan and her partner were extremely accommodating. Immaculate place with a short stroll to the beach and cafes. Thanks for a wonderful time."),
("2016-11-22", "3042637", "Wilmi", "Susan made us feel at home with plenty of information about the area and we had a few lovely chats under the mulberry tree. We really appreciated the breakfast spread! The apartment is great for exploring the Bondi-Coogee coast and provides a tranquil space close to the beach and related activities."),
("2016-11-24", "3042637", "Gayle", "Susan was fabulous - everything was super-smooth  and she had provided everything I needed. A lovely  relaxing little flat at the end of a magical garden. The beach is a short walk away and a bus very close that links up with the trains. I will definitely be back. "),
("2017-01-05", "3042637", "Bao", "Susan and Greg were excellent and inviting hosts.  My stay here was wonderful and over & beyond what I had expected.  Staying at this studio bed and breakfast was a 10/10.  Here you will have peace and quiet with a lush & scenic backdrop.  You will have all the amenities to live comfortably as well as all the amenities needed going to the beach.  They've thought of everything!"),
("2017-01-07", "3042637", "Courtney", "Susan and Greg met me at the property and gave me a run down of some places to eat  the best beach areas to head to and walking paths. I hadn't realised that a light breakfast was included so there was organic yogurt and milk provided  some fruit and muesli so was nice way to start the day and enjoy it in their courtyard. The bungalow was clean  well appointed and a thoroughly relaxing place to stay only a short walk from cafes and the beach. Susan and Greg themselves were friendly  helpful and generally lovely people. "),
("2017-01-10", "3042637", "Becky", "My husband and I loved staying at Susan's place. She thought of everything to have there in the kitchenette and we found everything so clean and tidy. The location is great and so close to the shops and cafes around Bronte (an adorable and safe suburb)! Susan and her partner had great suggestions and were always available for communication. It felt very homey coming back at the end of the day and we definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2017-01-15", "3042637", "Siobhan", "Susan's little flat was lovely and private  clean  comfortable and in a great location if you want to explore Sydneys beaches while avoiding the crowds at Bondi. We walked north on our first day and south on our second  both highly enjoyable and a great way to soak up local life. The apartment is incredibly well equipped with everything we needed  check in was great and we particularly loved the little court yard for tea/drinks in the shade in the afternoon. Would definitely stay with Susan again next time."),
("2017-01-23", "3042637", "Maddison", "Susan was a wonderful and accommodating host and although we never met her she provided excellent communication. The studio was clean  spacious and comfortable and within walking distance to the beach  cafes and bus stops. This is a must if you are looking for a quiet beach escape! "),
("2017-01-28", "3042637", "Lucy", "This space is bright and airy with everything you need. Very secluded  yet Susan is on hand if necessary. Lovely walks to beach and great coffee shops nearby. Public transport close too. Had a lovely stay and enjoyed the breakfasts. "),
("2017-02-01", "3042637", "Martin And Francine", "Staying at Susan's was absolutely fabulous. The place is immaculate  really comfortable and the linen is spectacular. The place has really nice towels ( including great beach towels)Susan also provides you a very nice Organic Breakfast  yogurt and really good muesli. All in all this is a 5 star stay. Susan is very welcoming and the room has all the privacy and quietness in the world. Very recommended.  "),
("2017-02-04", "3042637", "Tara-Lee", "It was an absolute delight staying here. So close to Bondi and Clovelly. The cottage is so comfortable and the attention to detail was excellent. The bed was super comfortable and there was even a light breakfast for us to enjoy. I highly recommend this property!"),
("2017-02-07", "3042637", "Bettina", "Susan's backyard studio is a true gem. With its own shady garden it provides a nice resting area when returning from Sydney city trips. The place is 5 minutes from Bronte beach and all its small shops and restaurants. Absolutely beautiful."),
("2017-02-10", "3042637", "Will And Jo", "Best Airbnb stay ever! We like to think that we're pretty good hosts  but we can learn from Susan and Greg. The place is gorgeous  at the back of an enchanted garden (with a private entrance)  but totally private. Perfectly set up and equipped for a couple. But it was the personal touches that made it so great: Coffee  tea  milk  juice  bagels delivered to our door  and Susan and Greg were really kind and friendly while giving us all the space we needed. The location is also perfect. Beautifully quiet street  a couple of minutes from a great cafe (Three Blue Ducks) and a fabulous fish restaurant (Moxhe - don't miss out on this one!). Bronte Beach and the gorgeous Bronte-Bondi walk less than ten minutes away on foot. Can't wait to be back for another lovely stay. "),
("2017-02-14", "3042637", "Jette", "We'll be back very soon!  Wonderful place to stay!"),
("2017-02-20", "3042637", "Carole", "We so enjoyed this apartment and fell in love with Bronte. Verycomfortable  private  peaceful and very convenient for the beach and cafes. We didn't want to leave! Thank you so much."),
("2017-03-03", "3042637", "Jette", "We have stayed at Susan's place several times so this is a place we like very much. The house has a great location  close to public transport and restuarants  and the garden is very exsotic. Susan and Greg are excellent hosts. Very friendly  almost like 'old friends'. This place is highly recommeded.   "),
("2017-04-01", "3042637", "Wolfgang", "We have had the chance to stay 4 weeks in this lovely cottage house. It was perfect so near by everything   beaches   wonderfull Iggis bakery   restaurants .We Highley recommand this place too if you would like to stay quite and in a wonderful garden with a lot of birds and a lovely cat called sunday .next time in Sydney we will stay here again ."),
("2017-04-02", "3042637", "Chelsea", "The studio was bright and spacious  with beautiful decor. Susan was very hospitable and offered some wonderful tips about the area. "),
("2017-04-06", "3042637", "Lucy", "Susan has such a lovely calm oasis studio in the bottom on her garden in Bronte.  It was a wonderful place to stay for 3 days. Very clean  quiet and excellent location near lots of cafes  bronte beach and buses to Bondi and beyond.  We had a great stay with Susan and her partner Greg who were both very accommodating.  We would absolutely recommend her place in Bronte and we will be staying here again on our next visit to Sydney for sure!"),
("2017-04-10", "3042637", "Chris", "Susan was fantastic. They made us feel like family and it was truly a home away from home. The attention to detail was wonderful and the everything was spotless. Will stay again for sure!!"),
("2017-04-16", "3042637", "Gillian", "Susan's studio is perfectly located in Bronte.The garden is just superb and the studio was so inviting and comfortable.Faultless."),
("2017-04-19", "3042637", "Summer", "Susan's studio was just divine! Set in a secluded garden but a short walk to restaurants and the beach. She was a great and thoughtful host  with all amenities and then some - anyone would need. A delight. "),
("2017-04-23", "3042637", "Anthony", "Beautiful place is a perfect location & very kind  friendly hosts. Perfect . . "),
("2017-04-27", "3042637", "Anthony", "Place was perfect"),
("2017-05-06", "3042637", "Bruce", "Susan was a brilliant host and the little touches in the room (e.g. Fresh flowers) made all the difference."),
("2017-05-09", "3042637", "Heike Michaelsen", "Sehr schön  immer wieder gern  tolle angenehme Ausstattung mit Coffeemaker  Milchaufschäumer  Kühlschrank  Wasserkocher... eben alles  was man auf die schnelle braucht. Der Garten ist ein Traum und entspannt von hektischen Großstadt-Touren. Zu Fuß nur wenige Minuten zum Strand und dem schönen Bronte-Bondi-Walk. Wenn es nachts mal kühl werden sollte  ist eine gute Heizung vorhanden. Werde die Unterkunft wieder gern buchen."),
("2017-05-14", "3042637", "Ruth", "Beautifully appointed studio with everything you need to enjoy your time in Sydney set in a lush and inviting garden."),
("2017-05-22", "3042637", "Jane", "We had a fantastic time  great location and easy walk to beaches and transport. A lovely basket of breakfast goodies was left at the door to enjoy. Highly recommended."),
("2017-05-27", "3042637", "Lorraine", "Definitely highly recommend if you like quality linen and towels  delicious complementary breakfast  coffee machine  private outdoor space and fabulous  location in Bronte. Susan is a great host and this place has all the extra touches for a very comfortable stay."),
("2017-05-28", "3042637", "Adam", "Susan was a superb host. Her communication prior to arrival was excellent. The studio was clean  very comfortable and modern. Her place is within walking distance of cafes and the beach and very quiet. Highly recommended. "),
("2017-06-04", "3042637", "Michael", "Susan and Greg provide a beautiful space which misses nothing a hotel provides (ok maybe room service but I didn't want that) yet with extras such as privacy  quietude and a beautiful garden setting.  I also really appreciated Susans timely responses made in a very professional yet greatly warm way. Highly recommended  ("" "),
("2017-06-12", "3042637", "Ailee", "We had a lovely weekend at Susan's studio. Great location for exploring Bondi  Bronte  Clovelly and Coogee. Very clean  warm and comfortable and looks exactly as pictured. "),
("2017-06-15", "3042637", "Gabriel", "Wonderful area  the place was super clean and homely  great court yard for breakfast and the hosts were wonderful  so welcoming. A real treat to stay here. "),
("2017-06-17", "3042637", "Hilary", "This is a great little place. We spent 3 nights here and loved it. It's situated in a suburban area  about 10 minutes walk down the hill to Bronte beach and to the path which is part of the sublime Coastal Walk which runs from Coogee to Bondi. Its also about 200m easy walk to the local shops where there are several great restaurants  a fabulous sourdough bakery  a pharmacy and delicious coffee. This is also where you catch the bus which runs very regularly and goes into the city and to Central via Bondi Junction. We just left our car parked outside the house and used the bus during our stay which we found very easy and convenient.The accommodation is a small separate studio tucked up the back of Susan and Greg's beautiful garden. It has a generous paved area outside with seating which is under a beautiful big old tree which must be gorgeous in summer. The position of the studio creates a sense of space and privacy. The studio itself is small but roomy. It is fresh  modern  tastefully decorated  exceptionally clean and very comfortable. Every detail has been thought of  from the shampoo and conditioner supplied  to the iron and mini ironing board  the spare towels  the beach towels  tissues  crockery and cutlery  to the lovely simple breakfast  coffee  and herbal teas. There is a reverse cycle A/C  TV and radio. The bed was very comfortable and the shower was great.Susan was lovely to deal with  friendly and helpful  and very quick to respond. She and Greg were very welcoming and helpful but then left us to ourselves which is what we like. The studio feels private and separate from the house and is very quiet. We would highly recommend this studio and would be more than happy to stay here again."),
("2017-06-28", "3042637", "Ben", "Beautiful spot to stay - easy walk to the beach and Susan and Greg we're very easy to co-ordinate with."),
("2017-07-02", "3042637", "Steven", "Susan was a great host. She was very flexible and accomodating fir us in our stay. The property is clean and I a great location and we would definitely stay again. Highly recommend.Steve"),
("2017-07-10", "3042637", "Helen", "Just a lovely welcoming little BNB."),
("2017-07-14", "3042637", "Shamila", "Susan and Greg's place was perfect for our stay. It was cozy and warm  and private. Greg greeted us when we arrived  and provided a map of local options  and even some breakfast foods and snacks for us while we stayed at the studio -- so sweet! We love Bronte and would absolutely stay here again. "),
("2017-07-18", "3042637", "Marion", "Beautiful independent studio  easy access to transport  to the beach  and the Bronte shops. We had a lovely stay  the hosts were very welcoming and friendly. The studio is very quiet  at the back of Susan's lovely property  with its private entrance at the back of the garden . It is nicely furbished  and with all amenities  and lovely touches such as fresh fruits  fresh flowers  and good products for breakfast (and no problem with accomodating for dietary requirements). A great place to stay! "),
("2017-07-23", "3042637", "Nicole", "great quiet locationwell equipped private studioDelicious breakfastshort walk to cafes and public transport close to amazing Bronte to Bondi walkSusan is a very helpful and accommodating  host"),
("2017-07-31", "3042637", "Daniela", "Susan & Greg's have created a gorgeous little studio at the bottom of their garden in lovely Bronte. It was super comfy  very clean  warm in winter with lots of natural light. A light breakfast is included and it was a lovely touch - the fridge and pantry was stocked with teas  coffee  milk  juice  yogurt  fruit  cheese  cereal and porridge. Greg even dropped us a basket one morning of freshly baked bagels  butter and jam. Just fabulous! Susan and Greg were lovely and very approachable. We spoke about our mutual interest in bees and gardens and Susan was kind enough to leave us some of her books to read. We can't speak highly enough of this airbnb experience - we will definitely be back the next time we visit Sydney."),
("2017-08-11", "3042637", "Luke", "The Bronte Studio is the perfect getaway. Close to beautiful beaches  the quaint standalone sits in a beautiful backyard garden with easy access to the street. "),
("2017-08-13", "3042637", "Wen Wen", "My partner and I loved staying at this lovely Bronte studio for the weekend. Conveniently located  every amenity thought of  and Susan and Greg are welcoming. I would highly recommend."),
("2017-08-20", "3042637", "Leone", "I had a wonderful stay with Greg & Susan. Their Gorgeous little Chalet was just ideal for my stay. Greg & Susan certainly do accommodate for everything & so neat & clean . So close to shops  beach & cafés. I certainly would recommend their place for anyone wanting to stay in BrontyLeone"),
("2017-08-28", "3042637", "Jen", "Susan's place is perfect for a weekend near the beach. Set in a beautiful backyard she has thought of everything  including breakfast  which is often overlooked with BnB. This was one of our best experiences staying at an Airbnb and we would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a 5 star experience of Sydney."),
("2017-09-28", "3042637", "Sharon", "Susan's place is a little cottage at the end of a beautiful backyard that offers lots of privacy and a comfortable stay for a couple.  Our hosts provided lots of extras that were unexpected but definitely appreciated.  Susan's place is close to bus transport and a short walk to Bronte beach and the coastal walking track from Bondi to Coogee.  I would have no hesitation in recommending Susan's place to couples looking for accommodation in Sydney's eastern suburbs."),
("2017-10-01", "3042637", "Monique", "Perfect for a mini break and a fantastic alternative to a hotel. Clean  comfortable and very welcoming. It was a oasis!"),
("2017-10-05", "3042637", "Scott", "Susan’s place was everything listed and more! She made sure that we could check in early after our long flight from the States. There were breakfast items in the refrigerator that worked very well for our mornings. She also provided fresh bagels that helped us make it through until lunch that day. The room was very very nice  secluded on the property and very quiet. It had everything that we needed and more. It is located close to a number of great restaurants and the beach! Just all around one of the best stays we had with fantastic hosts!"),
("2017-10-11", "3042637", "Erica", "Very well equipped secluded cottage. Very clean & very thoughtfully and thoroughly equipped. Beautiful area very close to beach & great cafes"),
("2017-10-14", "3042637", "Ashlyn", "Can't say enough good things about our stay at Susan's guesthouse! The place is beautifully decorated and was very clean when we arrived. Everything we could think of was provided  including a map of the area & info on restaurants  (5 minute walk to restaurants and the coast!). Susan was always easy to get in touch with & quick to respond when we had any questions. Above all else  Susan & Greg's hospitality was what stood out the most. They were so thoughtful (bringing us bagels one morning  lending us peroxide when my husband came down with an ear infection). I don't think we've had a more pleasant Airbnb experience. Highly recommend staying here!"),
("2017-10-16", "3042637", "Robin", "This is a great studio guest house. It is exactly as pictured. Susan and her husband were great hosts. The help arrange my early arrival and very early departure (booking a taxi for me). You really have a private space and gardens which makes for a nice quiet stay. I appreciate the espresso machine and coffee packs  also the milk  yogurt  juice  fruits  berries and granola. I would definitely stay again. It is in walking distance to great restaurant and coffee shops  and Bronte Beach."),
("2017-10-19", "3042637", "Alice", "It's a lovely place to spend few days in Sydney - it looks fantastic  very thoughtful details and delicious breakfast to enjoy outside with the cute kitty Sunday. Susan and her husband were super nice too  gave us lots of tips for Sydney and the Blue Mountains - great hosts!would love to come back!"),
("2017-10-25", "3042637", "Yulia", "Отличное место  если вы хотите быть поближе к пляжу. На улице нет проблем с парковкой  можно смело арендовать машину и оставлять ее рядом с домом. Сам район подходит для спокойного отдыха. Домик - замечательный  чувствуешь себя по-настоящему в гостях  уютно  чисто  свой дворик!"),
("2017-11-03", "3042637", "Alex", "A beautiful little spot of Sydney and a charming place to stay. We truly loved our stay at Susan and Gregs apartment at the end of their garden. We travelled with our 10 month old boy and the place was just perfect and had everything we needed. Greg brought us fresh bagels each morning which was a nice touch. Bronte is fab  with cool restaurants  coffee shops close to the beach and beach pool and also has excellent bus links to Bondi Junction and the trains. Thanks so much for having us guys! Alex  Lou and Flynn"),
("2017-11-15", "3042637", "Jessica", "Susan and Greg’s Place is fantastic-a perfect base in Bronte  a short walk around the coast from Bondi Beach. Wish we could give them a 11 out of 10 rating!The studio is beautiful  clean and has everything you might need. There has been a great deal of thought put into the detail. A delicious breakfast is provided and regularly topped up to give you a great start to your day.Susan and Greg are incredibly friendly  helpful and welcoming. They go above and beyond to make sure your stay is comfortable and that you have everything you might need.The jacaranda tree in the garden is a perfect setting in November and there are great cafes and restaurants nearby in Bronte - definitely check out the Three Blue Ducks!Great studio  great hosts  great holiday!"),
("2017-11-20", "3042637", "Michael", "Terrific place/excellent host."),
("2017-11-29", "3042637", "Ju-Young", "The studio is a beautiful  clean  private and peaceful place. Located in the backyard of Susan's lush garden you literally feel nested among the birds singing all day long. We couldn't meet Susan and her husband in person  the more we appreciated the caring and communication prior to our arrival as well during our stay with the co-host Jeni. We loved staying in Susan's studio and the Bronte neighbourhood and recommend it to everyone who appreciates a down to earth yet bright spirited environment."),
("2017-12-05", "3042637", "David", "An excellent recommendation from friends.The accommodation was great with all that you could want and spacious set in a lovely garden.The location was ideal for the beach at Bronte and walks to nearby beaches.The buses to central Sydney were ideal with only a short journey time.If we ever return to Sydney we would definitely use again"),
("2017-12-11", "3042637", "Carole", "Our second visit to Bronte and to this studio. We do love it. Thank you for everything you do to make our stay so lovely."),
("2017-12-12", "3042637", "Petrit", "Susan's place was charming and delightful. Just what I needed and as advertised. An excellent host"),
("2017-12-17", "3042637", "Damian", "Wonderfully private garden setting with everything you could want."),
("2017-12-29", "3042637", "Zonda", "Just do it!"),
("2018-01-01", "3042637", "Christopher", "Lovely  quiet retreat for two. We spent some wonderful days here around new year's eve and enjoyed the nice beaches in walking distance. Public transportation to Sydney downtown is also nearby. The studio is decorated with heart and we even got offered a small breakfast and wine and many good recommendations for our stay in Sydney."),
("2018-01-05", "3042637", "Sophie", "We had a thoroughly enjoyable stay at Sudan’s studio and particularly enjoyed the garden setting. The studio met all our needs and we really appreciated the variety of breakfast items including the organic bagels Susan went out to buy for us one morning. Thank you Susan for a lovely stay!"),
("2018-01-13", "3042637", "Nathan", "This place is the perfect quiet retreat  nestled in a beautiful garden setting. The studio is clean  cosy and modern  and Susan and Greg are very thoughtful  friendly hosts.It’s within walking distance to plenty of good places to get a cuppa or a meal  and of course the beach. And if you want to go further afield there’s a bus just down the road."),
("2018-01-19", "3042637", "Anthony", "The place was fantasticWould recommend to anyone"),
("2018-01-26", "3042637", "Sosa", "This place is simply gorgeous and so are the hosts! The studio offers everything you could ask for  privacy  TV to watch the Aussie Open  nespresso machine for an extra coffe or two  a fridge to cool drinks  a sparkling clean bathroom  AC  wifi  etc The garden is lush and the walk to the beach is not too bad. Breakfast places are near by and a trip to Bondi or Coogee does not take too long either.Highly recommended!"),
("2018-01-27", "3042637", "Matthew", "You will love this place! A quiet  secluded and beautiful garden setting. Close to some excellent cafes and restaurants. A lovely short walk to the beach. The hosts were so hospitable and accommodative of our late arrival and late departure. This helped make our stay just perfect. A simple yet fresh and healthy breakfast of muesli  milk  yoghurt and fruit was included  along with an extensive assortment of teas and coffee  sparking water and sparkling wine. The studio apartment is fully decked out with air con  clothes hanging space  kitchenette with everything one may need  iPod dock with remote control  a giant shower head  beautiful towels  linen and other finishes. I only wished I could live here. We will definitely be back for another stay!"),
("2018-02-10", "3042637", "Leslie", "We spent a wonderful 8 days at Susan's flat at the bottom of the garden.  It's like a fairy bower with a large mulberry tree and a small terrace for outdoor eating.  The accommodation is small but immaculate and stylish  with a terrific shower head  quite the largest we have ever seen.  All mod cons  even a hair straightener so we wanted for nothing.  Susan and Greg are the most charming and considerate hosts.  Their hospitality is outstanding as are the fabulous surroundings of Bronte Beach nearby.  We would return in a heartbeat."),
("2018-02-18", "3042637", "Elena", "Sitio precioso  muy bien atendidos"),
("2018-02-28", "3042637", "Michael", "If you're looking for a great place to stay while in Sydney  look no further. We spent a wonderful 10 days at Susan and Greg's place  they're friendly hosts who are available when you need them. Everything has been thought of at this lovely studio  all amenities are there. Just a short stroll from Bronte Beach and the local shopping strip with a couple of great restaurants. A special mention here for Moxhe  try it out if you can. Public transport to Bondi Junction and the city can be found just around the corner.All in all this place is worth the money and we should like to come back in the future."),
("2018-03-02", "3042637", "Vicky", "Gorgeous little studio set in amazing gardens. Bronte beach and some lovely cafes are only a short walk away. Susan and her husband were great hosts  making us feel very at home!"),
("2018-03-11", "3042637", "Steve", "A beautiful apartment in a magical settingIf you are thinking of visiting Sydney then Bronte is to be highly recommended as a place to base yourselves and the only place to stay in Bronte is in Susan and Gregg’s stylish and comfortable apartment. The room is thoughtfully decorated in a simple modern style and has a great shower room included. It sits within their lovely shady garden and is a hidden gem. Great hosts supplying knowledgeable tips for trips and eating - don’t miss Three Blue Ducks or UYen Vietnamese restaurant; Char Rotisserie and Iggy’s Bakery in Bronte nearby. Bronte is on the Bondi to Coogee cliff walk and is one of the most beautiful bays - only a short walk from the apartment - though a steep climb back!A hire car is useful though buses trains and especially the Rose Bay Ferry are easily found. Opal cards give hassle free access to these public transport options to the City - but take the ferry for the best views and experience. Your hosts will deliver fresh bedding and often bagels as well as jam and honey for breakfast - though gong out for breakfast and brunch is clearly a Sydney institution given the quality and choice available - Shuk or Lox Stock and Barrel both in North Bondi and Three Blue Ducks in Bronte."),
("2018-03-25", "3042637", "Miruna", "Susan's place is a gem! It is super clean and fresh and has everything you need for a get-away. The lovely touches such as fresh fruit delivered on the door step in the morning and delicious supplies added to the experience. It was a little oasis in a great part of Sydney. The place is within walking distance to shops (3 -4 minutes) and within a 10 minute walk to Bronte beach with even more cafes. Susan was always available via phone when needed.Bronte beach is spectacular part of Sydney and so is Susan's place."),
("2018-03-28", "3042637", "Judy", "Wonderful studio in a secluded spot at the rear of a beautiful garden. We had a private outdoor table. Delicious breakfast with yummy muesli and fresh fruit. Lovely soft towels and even beach towels were included. The studio is a short 8-10 minute walk to Bronte beach and the coastal walks to either Bondi or Coogee.Cafes and restaurants are only a few minutes walk away.Our hosts are friendly with a wonderful welcoming. Highly recommend this as a place to stay. We look forward to returning."),
("2018-04-03", "3042637", "Judy", "A fantastic studio  in a great location. In a  quiet and peaceful garden setting  a few minutes from Bronte’s best coffee shops and bakery. This studio is only 8ish minutes from the beach and he coastal walks to either Bondi or Coogee.Highly recommend at stay in this studio."),
("2018-04-15", "3042637", "Felicity Dinah", "We loved the proximity to shops  cafes  yoga studio! and the beach. Susan's house is very peaceful and quiet despite being so close to the beach and bustling shops. There is an amazing bakery just around the corner whose bread is outstanding. Susan and Greg are very friendly  generous and thoughtful  we had many lovely chats together  as well as being given a lot of personal space. They have a big lawn with established trees and birdlife  perfect for spending time on with our baby. youll definitely enjoy your stay here  it is a very special spot."),
("2018-04-22", "3042637", "John", "In our opinion this is a great location to explore Sydney.  Within easy reach of the beaches without being in the fast lane pressure cooker of the CBD.Public transport is so easy with the OPEL card. Just park up and explore."),
("2018-04-24", "3042637", "Rosie", "Bronte B&B studio is cute  clean and comfortable with everything you need for a weekend away. It’s in a great location – quiet and peaceful while still being only a couple of minutes’ walk from the beach  shops  cafes and public transport. Susan and Greg were great hosts giving us local tips and delicious treats from the nearby bakery."),
("2018-04-30", "3042637", "Susan", "Than You for a Brilliant stay.  We loved your Studio Apartment and found it to be perfectly out fitted with everything you could need for a comfortable stay.The bed was extremely comfortable  the linen spotless and the towels fluffy. The Teas and coffee provided along with the Breakfast goodies and fruit perfect. Susan was extremely helpful with any  knowledge of things to do and places to go. Very happy to recommend to all the Bronte Studio Apartment."),
("2018-05-14", "3042637", "Conrad", "Superb hosts. Very cute private cottage located in the garden. Fantastic location and amenities. Love Bronte and the cafes/restaurants along McPherson st."),
("2018-05-22", "3042637", "Robert", "Beautiful room in a great location. Some very nice touches and surprises."),
("2018-05-24", "3042637", "Pauline", "Well presented  comfotable granny flat type accommodation in a lovely garden setting. The best hosts you could experience."),
("2018-05-30", "3042637", "Lorraine", "Our second time staying at Susan’s place and it did not disappoint. Great hosts  central location with good transport  quiet stately neighbourhood and lots of special touches. Looking forward to our next visit!"),
("2018-06-02", "3042637", "Erica", "You won't be disappointed"),
("2018-06-17", "3042637", "Meiyang", "The host is very friendly and nice. And they provided very delicious croissants.  Also the place is near to the beach"),
("2018-06-25", "3042637", "Alistair", "Susan and Greg were perfect hosts. Their studio is beautifully furnished and had everything we needed for a long weekend getaway. We would love to come stay again!"),
("2018-06-30", "3042637", "Yohan", "Me and my partner stayed in this Airbnb and we absolutely loved it! I’ve stayed in over 53 Airbnb’s across the world and this Airbnb was hands down one of the best places we’ve ever stayed in. The location was so close to the beach and some of the best cafes in Bronte. The room was so cozy and clean! The breakfast was so delicious with some really high quality produce. You can really tell that Susan has put a lot of love and thought into this Airbnb to make sure each guest has the best time! I would 1000% recommend this place to anyone!"),
("2018-07-09", "3042637", "Rhonda", "Terrific in every way!  Susan was an amazing host.  Upon my arrival  she warmly greeted me like I was a long lost friend. The space is beautiful and shows such attention to detail. It could be featured in a home design magazine. Delicious yogurt  fresh fruit  and granola plus teas and coffees were provided. The linens were so cozy  I slept like a baby. The place had every special touch you can imagine. Susan gave great recommendations and was so helpful.  The location is ideal.  It's a short walk to a small grocer  pharmacy  and coffee shops and cafes  plus a most amazing bakery. You must eat breakfast at Three Blue Ducks. A little beyond the shops lies the big  blue sea that can be enjoyed by walking the coastal trail or from one of the local beaches. Bronte and Bondi beaches are easily accessible on foot."),
("2018-07-13", "3042637", "Leone", "Susan’s place is a beautiful spot to stay  lovely & clean & beautiful our side area  I certainly would go there again & thoroughly recommend it.Leone"),
("2018-07-15", "3042637", "Nha", "Very beautiful garden; nice balance of good hospitality and  privacy as you need. Location is divine. Near beach but away from tourists as you are able to hang out at local strip. Would stay again!"),
("2018-07-27", "3042637", "William", "The best Airbnb I have stayed in  in Australia & Overseas "),
("2018-08-03", "3042637", "Allison", "Susan's cottage is so sweet  compact but with everything you need and nothing you don't need. She is so kind and friendly. We loved staying at her cottage and will miss the birds singing every morning. If you want to be near Bronte Beach  it's just wonderful. "),
("2018-08-18", "3042637", "Lucile", "My spouse and I spent our first days honeymoon at Susan’s place.The studio is so lovely (we both agreed it was our best Airbnb experience in the last 5years)  comfy  calm  perfectly located (very close from the beach and good restaurants). Susan and her husband are very good and caring host.Fully recommend the place !Thank you Susan :) "),
("2018-08-26", "3042637", "Roci", "We simply didn’t want to go back home after 4 days of being here. This Airbnb exceeded our expectations after seeing the photos and read reviews. The location is perfect for a quite weekend away  close to the beach but also convenient to get to the city for more touristy options. The studio is beautiful  super clean and has everything (literally everything  even slippers). The private courtward is also amazing. Susan and Greg are beautiful people  really nice to talk to but also really respected our privacy. Totally recomendable studio for spending some time in Sydney but away from the city madness."),
("2018-09-01", "3042637", "Andrew", "Beautifully appointed accommodation and close to all that Bronte offers."),
("2018-09-03", "3042637", "Sam", "My partner and I had the most amazing time. The studio was lovely and was located in a gorgeous garden. Susan really went to great lengths to ensure we had a pleasant stay."),
("2018-09-09", "3042637", "Lauren", "this is such a special spot! beautifully situated in a garden oasis  close to the beach and great cafes  and hosted by the nicest people! Susan also added so many special touches - teas  chocolates  organic snacks  awesome soaps and hair products. we'd definitely stay here again."),
("2018-09-15", "3042637", "Ari", "Location is great  area is very quiet. Susan and Greg were very nice and very helpful. The studio itself is a small cabin in the garden  very private and contains all that is needed. Very recommended."),
("2018-10-07", "3042637", "Mark", "A wonderful 2nd stay in this studio. We love the location  the privacy  accessibility to Eastern beaches (Clovelly  Coogee  Bronte and Bondi) and your warm hospitality . Once again highly recommended."),
("2018-10-14", "3042637", "Penny", "Our weekend at Susan and Greg's place was relaxing and fun. We walked to Bondi and Coogee along the coast  and ate at the local cafes. (Three Blue Ducks was so good we ate there twice.) The studio is set in a lush garden  and has lots of natural light. It's also quiet and cosy - perfect for catching up on sleep. We travelled from Central by train and bus  which took about 40 minutes on average  with one change at Bondi Junction. Susan and Greg were excellent hosts. Greg met us at the house and dropped us at a bakery for lunch so we didn't get rained on  and on our second morning  we found muffins in a basket on our front step. We'd visit again with pleasure."),
("2018-10-18", "3042637", "Jacinta", "Fantastic beautiful relaxing place to stay. Perfect hosts. Great location. Will stay again."),
("2018-10-21", "3042637", "Ana", "Perfect !!"),
("2018-10-24", "3042637", "Jenna", "WOW. This was by far the most outstanding AirBnB experience I have had to date. Susan's place itself is perfectly located a short walk from Bronte beach and is a gorgeous garden hideaway under the shade of a mulberry tree  that we loved coming ""home"" to each day. The space is tastefully designed and decorated and the thoughtful touches went above and beyond ... from delicious gluten-free muesli  to the high quality tea selection  and natural and high quality soaps  high-speed WiFi. Our hosts were easy-going  kind and friendly  we felt immediately at home and were only sorry we didn't have more time to spend with them. Thank you!"),
("2018-10-27", "3042637", "Zara", "Susan’s studio is bright  clean and wonderfully located in Bronte. The beach  a fab bakery  and great cafes and restaurants are all a short walk away. Susan was a wonderful host and the little touches and local knowledge made our trip extra special."),
("2018-11-03", "3042637", "Karin", "We enjoyed our stay at this lovely place very much. Susan and Greg are very welcoming hosts and the accommodation exceeded all our expectations. We will certainly recommend it to our friends and would love to come back and stay again soon."),
("2018-11-11", "3042637", "Louise", "A definite consideration if u want to be in Bronte it’s got all you need"),
("2018-11-17", "3042637", "Kim", "Susan’s studio is a wonderful space: stylish  sparkling clean  quiet  close to the beach and a very quick bus trip to Bondi Junction  and set within beautiful gardens. Susan added some thoughtful  unexpected extras  was very accommodating of our flight delay and provided excellent dining recommendations. We would happily stay again."),
("2018-11-21", "3042637", "Les", "Susan would be an excellent host for a couple looking for a personal and caring bed and breakfast experience.  We were disappointed in the size of the facility (plenty of room outdoors in the garden - but that was spoilt by mosquitoes).  The breakfast offerings were high quality and unusual but limited in choice and very much a DIY experience."),
("2018-11-23", "3042637", "Yane", "Wonderful hosts  thoughtful and nice place with great location. Will stay again next time"),
("2018-12-07", "3042637", "George", "I can fully recommend this stay. Susan and Greg are great hosts. The studio is fully self contained  quiet and private. Bronte is a terrific location  particularly if you like the beach."),
("2018-12-16", "3042637", "Daniel", "My girlfriend and I stayed at Susan's for a weekend. The studio was beautifully decorated and had everything we could need for a perfect trip. They had a lovely garden and a beautiful outdoor setting for us to enjoy. Susan and Greg were very welcoming and gave us plenty of advice on the local area. We hope to come back soon because staying here made the trip so much more special."),
("2019-01-05", "3042637", "Clare", "Susan's garden studio is the perfect place for a few days stay. The location is fantastic and it was lovely for us to sit out on the terrace and have a delicious coffee (Susan kindly provides Nespresso pods to use in very stylish cups!). They studio decor is beautiful and there were so many thoughtful touches. Susan was so considerate in helping us with an early check in. I couldn't recommend her place more highly!"),
("2019-01-07", "3042637", "Scott", "This place is a gem. We arrived on a rainy day  but managed to enjoy being close to the beach.  The space is outstanding  as others have highlighted.  We loved the quick walk down to the beach and the many cafes in the area. Communication was proactive and quick and the hosts are a delight!  We really felt at home. Finally  we had flight troubles from NZ to Sydney and Susan was nice enough to hold the place for us even though we missed a night. We can’t wait to return!"),
("2019-01-11", "3042637", "Amy And Cloudesley", "We loved our stay in Susan and Greg’s garden studio. The location is great and the studio is well equipped and full of thoughtful touches. Thank you!"),
("2019-01-17", "3042637", "Elaine", "We can Highlight recommend staying at this lovely Place and These Great hosts. Amazing Little hideaway in a lovely garden  everything you need is either in your House Ort you can ask Susan and Greg and thy will Kindly help you  either with Equipment e.g. A Great sun tent for the Beach or with local tipps. It Was a Perfect stay!"),
("2019-01-19", "3042637", "Sosa", "Greg & Susan’s place is simply gorgeous!!! We LOVED staying here. If you are looking for privacy  while still being looked after this is your place. Greg & Susan are fantastic hosts  they even surprised us one morning with a beautiful breakfast basket  which was placed discretely in front of the guest house’s door. The guest house is super clean with great amenities. Local restaurants are within a very short walking distance  and so is the beach. This airbnb is 5 Stars all the way  very highly recommended!!"),
("2019-01-23", "3042637", "Rob", "The cottage is a lovely & peaceful oasis tucked back in a gorgeous garden.  After a hot day at the beach  this is a perfect place to retreat.  Highly recommend!"),
("2019-01-27", "3042637", "Karol", "They are real super hosts everything was perfect. We could even leave our bags there before chech in. Food was amazing. So was the space. We are looking forward to staying again soon."),
("2018-12-25", "31002017", "Sasha", "pros-great communication and availability to talk  even during holidays -willingness to resolve issues -location-competitive price-newly renovated kitchen  living and bed-Apartment rooms look like the picturescons-cockroaches present. before booking  ask if this is still a problem. we left after one night instead of the original length of booking from this issue (but hosts were willing to resolve without any problems)-no wifi  even though it was listed as having in inclusions -only has a fan  no air con. This apartment heats quickly in summer weather  so air con is quite necessary in my opinion-run down apartment complex (old)-hallway is outdoors (I.e. when exiting the apartment  the hallways leading from the elevators to rooms are outdoors on balcony)"),
("2019-01-02", "31002017", "Rupert", "Good location but no aircon..."),
("2019-01-07", "31002017", "Linda", "An all you need apartment with good location close to store  bars and restaurants"),
("2019-01-21", "31002017", "Mirjam", "Nice  clean room. Nice small kitchen en bathroom. Just everything you need for a citytrip in Sydney. Great communication  good price  PERFECT location."),
("2019-01-26", "31002017", "Cannon", "Nice little spot  very co corner beautiful and clean. Lacked AC which I didn’t realize  so that’s my fault. But it does get hot in summers."),
("2019-02-02", "31002017", "Jack", "We had a lovely stay in this apparent  the location is perfect. There are many shops and restaurants  in the locality and the city centre is easily accessible. The apartment was very clean and comfortable to stay in. We would definitely recommend this place to stay in Sydney."),
("2019-02-06", "31002017", "Judy", "公寓位置比较方便 但是在一个十字路口处 吵的很 灰尘也很大 房间很小 窗帘设计很不合理 不遮光｡早上太阳出来直接晒出一身汗 没有空调｡入住一晚上后要退 结果2000多的房费只能退250 只好再忍了两个晚上｡"),
("2019-02-11", "31002017", "Bernardo", "Lovely flat very central  with nice pubs nearby. Perfect for a quick visit to Sydney!"),
("2019-02-18", "31002017", "준형", "신속한응답이 좋았어요"),
("2019-01-31", "31088238", "Anne-Laure", "Appartement très bien placé"),
("2019-02-10", "31088238", "子棹", "非常好的位置｡距离Daring habour还有central 火车站走路可以到达｡距离悉尼大学非常近 周围超市吃的都很近 很方便｡"),
("2019-02-15", "31088238", "Gege", "靠路边有点吵 特别到了凌晨6点的时候摩托车的声音就像在房子里面 其他设施还不错 例如有各种炊具和碗碟｡离超市也很近｡距离旅游景点都需要步行7-20分钟｡如果你能走路的话 这里还不错"),
("2019-01-28", "31059672", "Michael", "Great location  great hosts  great apartment. I have nothing less to say than simply great!! about my pleasent stay and warm hospitality by a lovely couple. Thank you"),
("2019-02-02", "31059672", "Jacintha", "Amazing and such a cozy place ... had a lovely time and near to beaches and definitely would recommend this place to anyone ;)"),
("2019-01-01", "31134257", "Mehak", "Hong is a lively and wonderful lady. She has a heart of gold. She kept us very comfortable and treated just like her own family. Provided us with the privacy we wanted. The place was wonderful. House was cosy and the room was sparkling clean and bed was very much comfortable.  She also provided us the crib for our toddler. She has a lovely and friendly dog. She went out of the way to provide us comfort. Also she hosted a wonderful New year day lunch for guests. The room also had an AC which was much needed in warm nights of December. Highly recommend to everyone."),
("2019-02-18", "31318633", "Field", "Naturally the first thing that is most unique about staying at Andy’s place is that you are living in an attic/loft with 2 skylight windows that bring in plenty of sunshine! It’s not everyday you get to wake up with the sun shining down on you which made waking up very pleasant just busking in the morning light. Second of all  I don’t think we’ve ever been on a more comfortable bed. Every night we fall asleep so easily and soundly and every morning it takes us ages to get off the bed because it’s really just that comfortable. You have to try it to believe it.While Andy wasn’t around in the place  her friend Jacque was and she was the warmest person ever. We were late checking in on the first night and she waited for us to get back so she could welcome us in. The toilets are also very extremely clean and well fitted  hot water readily available.Andy also lives in a really nice quiet neighbourhood that isn't too far off from the city too  which is great cos travelling is convenient and you still get to come home to peace and quiet. That being said  there are plenty of great cafe's and eateries around the neighbourhood  so if you feel like avoiding the city hustle  you're covered.All in all  we can’t recommend Andy’s place enough and we will definitely be back again soon!"),
("2019-02-26", "31318633", "Hyeseul", "Andy’s place was a lovely  bright and sunny room even though it was a bit far from lightrail or bus stops. I stayed for one week and it was a perfect choice for me. It have spacious bed and all the lovely objets  and the view of the city was beautiful."),
("2019-03-04", "31318633", "Anne Marie", "Andy's place is really lovely  check-in was simple and is a good proximity to Sydney CBD an as well as some lovely bay walks. Housemates are super welcoming and the kitchen is equipped with basic necessities to cook in the kitchen. The room is a little bit warm in the summer due to being on the top floor but Andy has provided a fan. The room was very clean and spacious with comfy pillows and nice bedding. Highly recommend!"),
("2012-01-24", "310414", "Adam", "We really enjoyed our stay! Great location  modern and clean appartment and very helpfull and nice host. We can definently recommend. Note that the bed is snug for two large adults  but we didn't mind :o)"),
("2012-02-11", "310414", "Nicole", "David's place was really beautiful and (Darlinghurst) is the perfect location from which to explore the rest of Sydney.  The bedroom has plenty of space to 'unpack' and the adjacent balcony is great when you want stop moving for a bit.  The shared kitchen and living space are very comfortable."),
("2012-02-19", "310414", "Mitch", "DJ was a delightful host.  His place is amazing.  It's clean  modern and much better than staying in a hotel.  Its tastefully appointed and has all the conveniences that a traveler could want  at an affordable price.  His place is ideally located on the boundaries of Surrey Hills and Darlinghurst with a bus stop just steps away.  You have access to a sunny balcony from your bedroom and the bed is quite comfortable.  DJ will give you your privacy if you want but is also quite friendly and willing to help with suggestions for meals or things to do.  I will definitely stay here again if I have the chance to return to Sydney.    "),
("2012-02-27", "310414", "Adrián & Andy", "David's place is perfectly located if you want to enjoy the city. It's also very tastefully designed. We found everything we needed. The place was clean and quiet. David is a true gentleman. We had some scheduling problems and had no place to stay  he took us in with really little notice and saved our trip. "),
("2012-03-03", "310414", "Umesh", "David is a great host. Wish i had more time to get to know him :) Apartment was spec and just as shown in the pictures. GREAT location. David also was very helpful and always attended to anything i asked for. Overall a great experience."),
("2012-03-26", "310414", "Duncan", "A fine host in a comfortable and stylish house in quiet location yet close to transport  food and nightlife."),
("2012-03-30", "310414", "Kees", "I had a great stay with David  he was very friendly and the house was in perfect shape!"),
("2012-04-13", "310414", "Jeroen", "Had a great stay at David's modern styled and very clean house. He was very flexible in accommodating my very early arrival. The location can't be beat  it's very central and I was able to walk to the meetings I had in Sydney. There is a lot to do nearby but the apartment is a block away from the noise: you'll sleep well! I wish I could have stayed longer!"),
("2012-04-17", "310414", "Pat", "My visit to Sydney was pretty hectic  so I only saw David once during my stay  at the start of the trip - but he was friendly and helpful  and his house is lovely and in a great location."),
("2012-05-01", "310414", "Angelika", "I spent beautiful and very relaxing 2 weeks in  Davids house. The room with the fantastic terrace ensuite was great. The house had a very positive atmosphereand I felt welcomed..David is a very decent  polite and nice host.The house is situated in a  small and quiet street which is situated in the heart of beautiful Darlinghurst. A lot of restaurants  cafés and shops around and parks in food distance. I can recommend Davids place 100%!Thanks one more time David!"),
("2012-05-21", "310414", "Damien", "The house is in a great location only a couple of hundred metres from Tailor Square. Its walking distance from all the entertainment and dining options on Oxford Street  Victoria Road and Kings Cross.The bedroom was nice but a little small for a male-male couple with luggage. The bathroom is nice but it's a little awkward walking up and down the stairs to get between the bedroom and the bathroom. If you're not worried about privacy this is just an inconvenience. The bathroom's location next to the living area is also a little embarrassing when you have those noisy moments."),
("2012-05-27", "310414", "Steve", "Great host! I really enjoyed my stay with David  he made me feel very welcome  and the room was perfect. The private bathroom is just down the stairs  and there is a door straight onto the terrace from the bedroom  which was lovely in the mornings to get a little sun! Very comfortable bed (better than the one I have at home)  and plenty of storage space.Everything worked perfectly  the wifi was fast  and David left me space in the kitchen should I wish to buy food. He also very kindly let me use his washing machine when my trip was extended  and even hung it out to dry when he got home before me! Very kind and accommodating host  highly recommended for your stay in Sydney!I'd also recommend ""the wholemeal cafe"" just round the corner"),
("2012-06-01", "310414", "Steve", "As before... Great host!"),
("2012-06-23", "310414", "Sara (Scout)", "Other folks have said it all--- David is a great host  his house was lovely  and it made my stay in the city quite enjoyable.  I will definitely stay with him again if I ever make it back to Sydney!"),
("2012-08-03", "310414", "Ezra", "Way better than staying in a hotel. Dj's apartment is clean  modern and welcoming not to mention its central location  Loved my stay"),
("2012-08-08", "310414", "Eada", "Great location. Could travel to Townhall easily by bus and the bus stop is just 5 minutes walk away. The area is generally safe because its located near the main junction and I feel safe walking back home because it's not one of those dark streets that you can see elsewhere. Lots of food located nearby . House is really clean and very comfortable."),
("2012-08-14", "310414", "Stephanie", "Our stay (my boyfriend and I & a friend and I) with DJ was very conveniant. Our plane got in late which was no drama at all. The place is very conveniantly located in walking distance to all the good spots in Paddington  Surry Hills and Darlinghurst and about 15 - 20 minutes walk into the CBD. Everything was lovely and clean and the house was easy to get in and out of. DJ even provided a succinct list of dinner spots to try. I would definately reccomend staying here to all travellers. Thanks! "),
("2012-08-29", "310414", "Leanne", "I very much appreciate staying at David's place. He is a wonderful host. Any question I had  if he didn't know he'd look it up on his i-pad...even  'what time does the sun rise?' His place is clean and attractive. I loved the little balcony off of my room. I ate most of my meals out there. I hgihly recommend his place. Thank you  David."),
("2012-09-08", "310414", "Mo", "Great place! Stylishly designed. You got foxtel in your room which is amazing for quiet nights in during the week. And you also have your own bathroom. The place is on a quiet street but only 1 min walk to Oxford st and Bourke st where everything is!"),
("2012-09-17", "310414", "Rindra", "I loved staying at David's house as it was the perfect place for my trip when I went to Sydney for a conference.1- The location is very convenient (close to business district but in a quiet and nice area). There were also many food places around. I found a good grocery store and a fine pizza restaurant near the house  which was one David's recommendations. 2- David was very helpful and welcoming. He was kind enough to let me check in early and check out late on Sundays. 3- The house is very clean and modern. The bedroom is comfortable and it has a nice terrace. What I loved the most about my experience is that although I had tons of work to do during my stay  David's place allowed me to do so with tranquility and convenience.I highly recommend this place to people who needs tranquility  comfort and convenience. I will definitely recommend it to my friends  and will check it out again when I will return to Australia."),
("2012-10-15", "310414", "Dan", "Had a great stay with DJ even though it was only for a couple of nights  he was a very welcoming and considerate host. Definitely would recommend a stay there. "),
("2012-10-27", "310414", "Bennie", "We had a fantastic stay with the mysterious DJ Walker  who is always impeccable with his sense of timing!  He is well organized  well groomed  clean and tidy with a readiness to be available over the mobile.  The place is clean  minimalist yet spacious with a splendid layout of equipment tucked away in mystical drawers and doors in neat little compartments. The design of the place is quite enchanting  and we are tempted to ask if the man himself had designed the place?!Lovely neighborhood that is easy with get around  strong WiFi signal  with nice brekkie eateries and convenient access to public transport.  Suitably enchanted for our 8 days stay here  and proud to say that we love to call it our home  albeit a short while.  Will definitely ask to come back again if we were to visit Sydney!  GOD bless!"),
("2012-11-20", "310414", "Tanya", "David's house is really nice and the location is awesome. I strolled along the area and let myself getting lost in the city and exposed to so many cool areas in Sydney like the famous Oxford St  Hyde Park   Surry Hills  Kings Cross and Victoria St.  The bed in my bedroom is so comfy  I had a hard time every morning to leave the bed.  It is just too comfortable.  I just love how David prepares all the helpful Sydney Guide and various board games he has in the guest room. Definitely a place to stay if you're after a nice and cozy place in Sydney. "),
("2012-11-24", "310414", "Tine Juul Reingaard", "I stayed for two nights at David's place with my boyfriend. We were very busy with work but had a great stay! The apartment was very clean  new and nice. The location worked out really well too for us. Wish we would have had more time - e.g. to relax outside on the balcony.David was uncomplicated  and seemed to be a really great guy.I would definitely stay at David's place again. "),
("2012-12-11", "310414", "Christine", "I stayed at David's place for 11 nights and loved it. It was exactly like on the pictures and very clean. unfortunately I wasn't around a lot  but when we had a chance to chat  David was a helpfull and very pleasant host.The place is only a few minutes away from the bus stops at Oxford Street and shops and restaurants/cafés are practically around the corner  still the area was very nice and quiet. I certainly would stay at David's place again."),
("2013-01-05", "310414", "Caroline", "Great location  very safe  nice house. I recommend to stay with Dj who is a friendly and unomplicated host. Thanks Dj!"),
("2013-01-14", "310414", "Will", "The stay with David was very comfortable  safe and relaxing. A great side street off the main road  but without any noise...even on your private balcony!David was a good host in making sure you settle into the area alright. He provided excellent choices for restaurants and bars  maps and activity booklets throughout Sydney.David was great to stay with  for the short time I was there  but was good a chat after I'd been winding through the city all day.I recommend staying the David  for the quality house and room  good company and location (an easy walk to Hyde Park).Thanks David."),
("2013-02-10", "310414", "Geneviève", "Nous avons passe presque 3 semaines chez David. Notre chambre était petite mais très confortable  très pratique en rangements  et surtout elle donnait sur une terrasse adorable  ce que nous avons beaucoup apprécié  ainsi que la salle. Bain indépendante. Davis est un hôte charmant  discret  aidant. Nous avons adore ce séjour chez lui."),
("2013-03-14", "310414", "Alex", "Place is as shown. AC is very good  perfect after running around Sydney all day. Clean and safe building. "),
("2013-03-19", "310414", "Murray", "I stayed at David's place for 4 nights while I was in Sydney for a friend's birthday. His place was exactly as it looks in the photos.  It was secure  well appointed  spotlessly clean and despite it's proximity to Darlinghurst's nightlife  it was very quiet.The room had everything you could want  a comfy bed  plenty of storage  aircon  TV with Foxtel and direct access to a sunny deck.  The private bathroom was also modern and  luxurious.David was a thoughtful and considerate host and made me feel completely welcome.  The booklet he had compiled of the many great cafes  bars and restaurants in the area was also very useful  and I sampled many of them. The location is superb  with so much within walking distance  buses practically on the doorstep and trains just a short stroll away. I would definitely stay at David's place if I was in Sydney again and highly recommend it to anyone heading to Sydney. This was my first experience with AirBnB.  I don't think I'll ever stay in a Hotel again!Thanks for a great stay  David!"),
("2013-04-09", "310414", "Lydie", "I really enjoyed my stay by David  the appt was really clean and he's a perfect host  well organized and very helpful. You will have all the privacy that you might need.All you need will be already in the room: recommendations  map  wifi code  plug  umbrella  extra blanket  everything!The bed is very comfortable  and the terrace is such a luxury to enjoy some calm after walking all the day in that big city.The location of the appt is efficient  as its really easy to get in all the different area of Sydney (the Domain  Botanical garden  Opera House  circular quay to get the ferry  Potts point and Oxford street is just down there).David was kindly let me do a laundry  which is great when you are traveling for a while. I will definitely stay by him again for my next trip to Sydney."),
("2013-05-12", "310414", "Rich", "Great place to stay whilst I acclimatised to Sydney.  Great host too  made me feel welcome and provided all the info I needed to know the area."),
("2013-08-10", "310414", "Duncan", "Perfect spot in inner city Sydney - my second visit and just great! Comfortable  brilliantly located  peaceful yet moments from the action should you chose to join  and David is a great host."),
("2013-11-28", "310414", "NaTa", "I really enjoyed my stay at David's place. He is very helpful and friendly host. The room is really comfortable and clean. Definitely will stay here again if I visit Sydney one day."),
("2013-12-09", "310414", "J A", "David was a great host during our stay at his place in Sydney. His house is very clean  comfortable  and well located. Several nice neighborhoods are within walking distance from his place  easy access to the major sightseeing attractions by bus around the corner  affordable places to eat  bars  clubs  and much more close by. David was friendly  and we even were able to catch a few drinks with him. Great host!"),
("2013-12-22", "310414", "Mikkel", "I had a wonderful 4-day stay with DJ  who was very nice and welcoming. The apartment itself was perfect; clean  spacious and in a perfect location. I had my own room with air-con  TV  closets etc. and even had my own bathroom!If you're in Sydney I can definitely recommend staying at DJ's!"),
("2014-01-01", "310414", "Ben", "I stayed in this guest room end of December for three nights. I had an excellent stay here  my first Aibnb experience. David was a great host. The room was exactly as described. Clean  very near to city centre  own bathroom  ... I have not a single thing to complain about and would stay here again  should I travel again to Sydney."),
("2014-01-06", "310414", "Mario", "We spent a week (during New Year's Eve) at Dj place. Everything was perfect : room clean with terrace and bathroom clean. Location is very good (restaurants  bars   bus connection  etcc). Definitely a place to stay. Bye Dj"),
("2014-01-09", "310414", "Dirk", "We stayed for only 3 nights  which is far too less for such a great place. Loved the little terrace  perfect connection to city and sights (we walked a lot)  super internet connection  luxury textiles and even our private shower... Everything was as expected and better. David was a perfect host. We'd love to stay there again and definitely recommend it."),
("2014-01-15", "310414", "Robin", "DJ was a very nice host.The room and the bed are very comfortable. You get your own bathroom which is a very nice plus. The apartment is very well located  well connected in terms of public transportation. Recommended."),
("2014-01-22", "310414", "Simon", "Had a great stay here  it was clean and spacious and had everything I needed. The location was perfect with Surry Hills and the CBD only a short walk away. If you're new to Sydney  there's plenty of advice where to go and what to see too. I highly recommend it."),
("2014-02-03", "310414", "Erik", "We've stayed at Davids place for 7 days and it was as beautiful as in the pictures. Although we didn't see David a lot  he was a great host and provided everything we needed. The location is amazing; Darlinghurst is a very lively neighbourhood  though the house' location is very peaceful. Within 200 meters is a busstop that brings you to Bondi beach or the Sydney Harbour both within 15 minutes. Also nice is Surry Hills  a lovely neighbourhood to go out for dinner or a drink  which is located within a 10 minute walk from the residence.We surely recommend this place!"),
("2014-04-02", "310414", "Mike", "I stayed at David's house for a few days while traveling through Sydney. He was a great host: helpful  considerate  and accommodating. He also had great tips and suggestions for exploring the area. His house is perfectly located centrally yet quietly tucked away.  On top of that  his place was just like the pics...just amazing! I would highly recommend David (and his place) as a host and I wouldn't hesitate to stay there the next time I am in Sydney!"),
("2014-04-19", "310414", "Craig", "David has a very stylish home and it is kept in excellent condition.   I especially enjoyed the patio off the bedroom.  David has his own personal guide to Sydney listing some of his favorite places which I found helpful.  Great location if you want to be in this part of the city."),
("2014-04-26", "310414", "Clarice", "I stayed at David's lovely apartment for 6 days. Upon my arrival  David showed me around and he had even put together a scrapbook with recommendations on places to eat! The apartment is exactly like what you see in the pictures. It was very clean and everything that you could possibly need to make your stay as comfortable is provided! There are a couple of nice cafés near surry hills and oxford street. It takes just a straight bus to the cbd or to the beach! David is a very nice person and it is safe to stay there for solo travelers. I highly recommend his place! Thank you for making my stay really comfortable and I really felt at home =)"),
("2014-05-05", "310414", "Craig", "The reservation was canceled 13 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-05-07", "310414", "Alexander", "I stayed with David for a week at the end of April  as I was between apartments.. The perfect host  an immaculate place and very quiet and peaceful. I would highly recommend it to anyone."),
("2014-06-16", "310414", "Andrew", "Great location!  David's place was really well set up and he provided us with helpful information to explore the local area.  The place helped to make our stay in Sydney relaxing and fun. We would definitely stay there again."),
("2014-09-14", "310414", "Lex", "David and his place impressed me even before we walked up his doorstep.  Little did I know that his place was located within the gay district of Sydney  which was a huge bonus for my husband and I  and it already made us feel like we were at home.David had an awesome place and it looked even better than what we saw in the photos  if that's even possible!  Overall his place is sleek  modern and very clean.  I love the pieces of artwork all around his place; they add just the right amount of character.   Our room was fully equipped with such great amenities including a tv  an iPod player  a balcony  and a private bathroom with not one - but TWO - showers!  I felt like my husband and I were in a candy store =)In addition  David provided a very helpful and well-compiled visitor booklet which contained valuable information about the nearby bars and restaurants with his own descriptions and reviews of each place  and even provided maps for each section.  And let me tell you  we went to almost half of the places he recommended in the booklet and they were all AWESOME!  David definitely has great taste  and that is saying a lot.  David even joined us for dinner during one of our nights there  where we got to know him better.   He is such a nice and friendly guy!David went above and beyond our expectations as an airbnb host  and I would definitely recommend him to anyone who is looking for an awesome place in a centralized and convenient location in Sydney.Thanks so much  David!"),
("2014-09-29", "310414", "Dennis", "Had a great time at David's. Awesome apt...private (Website hidden by Airbnb) sure you are aware that the bedroom and the bathroom / private are on two separate floors. The place is literally a few minute walk from bars  clubs  cafes  and safe haunts. "),
("2014-10-13", "310414", "Tess", "DJ was a great host. His place is in an awesome location and bed was very comfortable."),
("2014-10-20", "310414", "Yoyo", "Great place with a good bathroom and balcony. Great location - close to transport  shops and great cafes. you can walk to many designer brand shop in the Oxford street  I really love there."),
("2014-11-02", "310414", "Akshobh", "David's place was very homely and welcoming. It was spotlessly clean and tidy and you feel right at home  perhaps may even make you want to refurbish your house to look like David's place.It's nestled away in a quiet street corner but in a centrally located part of town. A short bus ride to circular quay with good bus connectivity to other popular tourist places such as Bondi. The room was so well equipped with a smart TV  cable  an iPod player and a balcony. For those new to air bnb and used to hotels  you will get the privacy and creature comforts of a hotel room with a homely vibe here.David has also gone through lengths to prepare a Sydney restaurant and bar guide and so sweetly leaves you with a bar of welcome chocolate (caveat for those watching their holiday weight :D). Pity  I only met David on my first day. Our separate timings kept us from catching up. "),
("2014-11-10", "310414", "Hsin-Peng", "David is very thoughtful  he prepared a booklet with many neighborhood eateries plus lots of notes which is very handy! The room and the house is exactly the same as shown in photos  very clean and neat  David did a great job on renovating it. The location is perfect  it is in a quiet alley and everything is within 5 mins walk  the buses is very convenient and take ppl to CBD  Bondi  Glebe  etc. Our stay with David is wonderful thanks to his hospitality."),
("2014-11-15", "310414", "Asfian", "Very nice and clean place. The room comes with cable TV. Truly hotel standard! Lots of nice cafes within walking distance. It was a really pleasant stay."),
("2014-11-24", "310414", "Robin", "Wonderful welcome  I really appreciated  you have evrything for a perfect stay : quiet Place in a quiet Area  your own bathroom  kitchen Fully furnished  Tv with cable  and a lovely balcony.David  Thanks for evrything "),
("2014-12-02", "310414", "Georg", "We really enjoyed our time at Davids House. It is perfectly located - very close to transport  Cafés  Shops and you can easily reach a lot of sights by relatively Short walks (Opera House  Harbour Bridge  Darling Harbour  ...)The House/Room is very clean and Looks exactly like the pictures. Very nice room with balcony  TV  comfortable Bed and a Lot of Space to store your belongings. The bathroom also is very clean and Even bigger than expected.David is very nice and helpfull - he can help you Out in almost every Situation. David even created a booklet  which recommends some nice Bars  Restaurants and Breakfast-Offers.Thanks for everything  David. We really enjoyed staying with you/at your beautiful place.We can totally recommend David and his House/Room"),
("2015-01-09", "310414", "Sebastiaan", "David was a very friendly host. The room suits all our needs: clean  comfortable bed and nice balcony. We recommand this place very much. Nice neighbourhood with lost of good restaurants. Thanks David for your hospitality."),
("2015-01-22", "310414", "Simon", "Three reasons why you should definitely stay here:- Perfect location: in a quiet street and yet close to both the city centre and gastronomic paradise Surry Hills. Very well served by public transport too.- The house itself is smartly renovated  the room and your bed comfortable  and you have your own bathroom and even a terrace!- You stay with a very attentive host. He seems to be online all the time  replying instantly  which is really practical for bookings or any further questions. And he has just thought of everything  including a charming welcoming package and a booklet with the best local spots to have breakfast  lunch  dinner  a drink...This has been my first experience with airbnb  and a real good one!"),
("2015-02-09", "310414", "Birger Christian", "We had a pleasant stay in David's appartment and it is a great location for exploring the city. The surroundings are very cozy with a lot of restaurants and cafe's nearby. The room was fine and clean and we especially enjoyed the adjacent balcony. David was very helpfull host when needed. We would definetly recommend the place to others. Lone & Birger"),
("2015-02-19", "310414", "Joyce", "It was an awesome stay. The place is beautifully decorated and it looked totally the same in the photos. It was clean  neat and nice hospitallity by David. The place is very near town  walking to the stations was so easy.  Overall I love the stay and thank you for the stay and holding you up on the first night : ) Awesome! I will come back again. "),
("2015-03-06", "310414", "Richard", "Location  location  location! DJ's place is in a great location. The accommodations are modern   comfortable and nice. As a host DJ is great. He was very welcoming  during my entire stay I felt welcomed and at ease. I highly recommended DJ."),
("2015-03-11", "310414", "Alex", "DJ was a nice host. He was there upon our arrival. Great location if you want the hustle and bustle of Darlinghurst. House is located in a very quite neighborhood. For two grown adults the room is a little small  plus luggage makes for a tight fit."),
("2015-04-02", "310414", "Adam", "DJ was a fantastic host.  everything was as advertised  lived up to the other reviews  and he couldnt be more helpful.  I would absolutely stay with him again.  "),
("2015-04-19", "310414", "Meghan", "We had a great stay at David's place! The location is perfect...on a quiet street but only a block or so from tons of cafes  bars  shops  and restaurants. David also had some great food recommendations. Everything in the house was new and kept very clean & tidy. The terrace off of the bedroom is very nice. I definitely recommend staying here."),
("2015-05-09", "310414", "Xiaoying", "很好的房子 干净｡位于一条很安静的小巷子里｡位置很好 方便游玩｡房东很友善 不会干扰到你｡我们很满意!very good!"),
("2015-05-16", "310414", "Sarah", "It was really a nice and pleasant stay. The place is very neat and tidy and its exactly in the pictures! Dj was very accommodating and very flexible with the check in time as well. I appreciate it. Thank you for letting me stay David!"),
("2015-05-27", "310414", "Andrew", "David's place is an adorable fully renovated Victorian double story shop front/terrace with all the mod cons. It is so incredibly central making for a quick walk to all the best Cafes and restaurants in Surry Hills. The location was perfect for me as I was in Sydney on business so was able to schedule a lot of my business meetings over coffee - David's location subsequently made my time very efficient. Upon arrival David provided clear instructions on the house amenities. He graciously provided a bottle of red wine (which I didn't drink but the thought was very much appreciated). We didn't see a lot of each other due to our busy work schedules. I unfortunately left my wallet at David's when I was in  rush to leave so he offered to post this to me in Victoria. His house is spotlessly clean and I loved having cable tv available in the room when I just wanted to chill out for a while. The house is located behind busy Taylor square but it get like it was locked away in a private suburb - there was no evidence of any street noise at all. A little oasis in a very busy intersection of Oxford and Flinders st. I look forward to having the chance to stay with David again in future."),
("2015-06-01", "310414", "John", "David was a great host. We had a lot of privacy and the house is fantastic! It's a very beautiful home and is located nearby to everything you could want and only a short stroll to the city. Brilliant."),
("2015-07-26", "310414", "Geoff", "David was really welcoming and the room is well appointed. The property is well renovated and designed with downstairs guest bathroom a massive bonus. Location is unbeatable  and I've decided to stay again. "),
("2015-08-28", "310414", "Geoff", "Great property  great facilities and awesome location. David was really welcoming and hospitable and very responsive to any questions or concerns. No hesitation in recommending this property. Would definitely stay again. "),
("2015-10-11", "310414", "Steffen", "Wir haben die Zeit bei DJ sehr genossen. Das Haus ist perfekt gelegen - ganz in der Nähe von Cafés  Geschäften und man kommt sogar zu Fuß in die Stadt/zur Oper (oder mit einem der unzähligen Busse). Das Haus/Zimmer ist sehr sauber und sieht genauso aus wie auf den Bildern. DJ ist sehr nett und hilfsbereit  wenn wir ihn gebraucht haben  war er jederzeit da  ohne dass man zu sehr aufeinander sitzt.  Danke für alles!We really enjoyed our time at DJs House. It is perfectly located - very close to transport  Cafés  Shops and you can easily reach a lot of sights by relatively short walks. The house/room is very clean and looks exactly like the pictures. DJ is a very nice and helpfull guy and helped us when ever needed! Thanks for all!"),
("2015-10-20", "310414", "Esther", "David is nice  the house is well located 15 mins walk to Chinatown and hydepark. I will choose next time."),
("2015-11-03", "310414", "Sebastian", "David was a great host. Everything need was provided. Room was clean and cosy all bars were in walking distance. I had a great time in Sydney. I can highly recommend his place. Thumbs up!"),
("2015-12-08", "310414", "Frank", "Dj is a nice host who provided warmest welcome and great hospitality. He self created a guide book to show me where to eat  to see and what to do in Sydney. He helped me to do laundry twice during my 5 day stay. He is place is well deco and quiet at night. The bed is extremely comfortable and I had good sleep every night. A nice place and I recommend his place to whoever Travelling to Sydney! "),
("2015-12-22", "310414", "Philip", "Great stay with DJ! Place was in a great location  cool historic building from 1860's  very clean house  and DJ provided loads of amenities including an entire professional guide to the city  which I took full advantage of & had a blast doing so! Thanks again DJ for hosting in your perfect spot!!"),
("2016-01-06", "310414", "Fredrik", "Me and my friend had a week in Sydney over New Years. It was very hard to find a place to stay  but DJ was quick and easy to communicate with! We enjoyed the location of the house because it's walking distance to the inner city and has easy access to beaches by buss. David is very kind and helpful  and he has made a great guide for what you can do in Sydney and some popular bars/restaurants. Our experience of the city and the house was good  although it rained a lot... We don't know what we would have done without the huge umbrellas you provided haha. Would definitely stay at your place again if I'm ever in Sydney again. Thank you for your hospitality."),
("2016-02-06", "310414", "Terry", "I stayed for DJ for 2 and a half weeks.The pics are accurate  the place is immaculate and clean and quiet  the location is incredible  and DJ was very helpful. I must admit found the layout of the guest bathroom odd...you have to walk down the stairs and kind of go through the lounge to get to it. Some people may be comfortable with that. I wasn't. One negative  and it was a big shock with me being from London  was that I came home one day and there were tons of tiny spiders on the wall of my room  that must have come in from the patio. I managed to spray as many as I could  but I must have missed a few as the following few days I kept seeing bigger and bigger spiders in the room. I told DJ about it and he cleaned the dead spiders and spray off the walls  but really what should have happened is that the room should have been fumigated the next day  or I should have recieved some kind of compensation.I guess spiders are not seen as a big deal in Australia. So overall good  except for the spiders."),
("2016-02-13", "310414", "Dwight", "Wonderful stay! David was very hospitable and it was as if we had the entire place to ourselves. Would definitely return!"),
("2016-03-01", "310414", "Marion", "Ich hatte das Zimmer bei David für eine Woche gebucht.Alles war wie beschrieben bzw. auf den Fotos abgebildet  sehr schön und sauber. Die Lage ist optimal  um die Stadt zu erkunden  Bushaltestelle gleich ums Haus  dennoch ist das Zimmer selbst ruhig  so dass man gut schlafen kann.Wer ein Zimmer im CBD sucht  ist hier richtig.David war bemüht  mir zu helfen  wenn ich eine Frage hatte und sehr höflich.Danke David!"),
("2016-03-25", "310414", "Rodney", "Great house  great location and a great host. "),
("2016-04-27", "310414", "Osiel", "I spent a week at David's house. I must say this is by far and away the best place I have ever stayed. His house is very nice  modern decoration  very clean  close to bus stops  cafés  restaurants and a walking distance from CBD. The room is clean and spacious with a very comfortable bed  cable tv  air conditioner  a large balcony. The bathroom is very clean and the shower is perfect. Adapters for Australian plug is available in the room (although I had mine  I think it was very kind of him for supplying it to guests). David was very kind. I give this a mark of 10 out of 10. I would definitely stay at David's house again. Thank you very much."),
("2016-05-20", "310414", "Astrid", "Dj was very helpful and kind. Het made me feel very welcome. There was a welcome bottleneck of wine and information about the neighbourhood. The room was exactly as described with a comfortable bed and netflix. I had a great stay and would absolutely book here again!"),
("2017-02-02", "310414", "Hans", "The place was really nice and in such an ideal location close to a lot of attractions and just a quick commute away from the CBD  among other places to visit. It was clean  convenient  and had good space. I also liked that I had my own bathroom. Overall I would say David's place is a recommendable one if you're looking for a place to stay in Sydney."),
("2017-03-13", "310414", "Don", "Thank you David for being such a wonderful host. Got me settled in pretty quick and was helpful in answering my queries promptly"),
("2017-03-31", "310414", "Chandrashekhar", "Stayed here for  2 weeks. The place is as the pictures depict. Overall  a comfortable stay with all the  amenities a business or casual traveller would need.David is a nice and accomodative host. Would stay here again."),
("2017-04-09", "310414", "Matt", "I had a wonderful stay at David's home. What an incredible location literally on the doorstep of Flinders St and Oxford St (including many of the most well-known gay bars/clubs)  and yet so quiet. From there you can also pretty much get yourself anywhere in Sydney really easily and quickly. The property is exactly as described  and if anything  had a few pleasant surprises in terms of the various things he provided. Oh  and the bed is super comfy. I didn't have much opportunity to interact with David (as I was mainly seeing friends and attending a wedding)  but he provided everything I needed and was really nice and flexible. I would very happily stay with David again the next time I'm in Sydney."),
("2017-04-20", "310414", "Wouter", "Private balcony  aircon  Fox  Apple TVQuality linen and lush towelsVery close to Oxford Street and public transport David is friendly and a very food host."),
("2017-05-03", "310414", "Stanislava", "David is such a lovely host - and was really kind and accomodating. The house is lovely  and the room has the most beautiful terrace roof. The location is brilliant  and so easy to walk from. Everything is set up great  and I'd be so happy to stay again any time! "),
("2017-05-14", "310414", "Alex", "David's place was great.  It's a super cool place with some very fun artwork and it's right around the corner from Oxford Street which has a ton of bars and restaurants.  The place was incredibly clean.  The bedroom has a door directly out to a terrace which was great as well.  David was very responsive and a great host.  He had a great booklet of suggestions on things to do  places to eat  etc.  and even joined in on a trip to the bar.  Very respectful of space and very pleasant to be around!Definitely will recommend this place to friends and family that visit.  "),
("2017-05-30", "310414", "Darius", "David's place is awesome  amazing location and I loved my little morning routine of doing yoga in the sun on the patio outside my room. David was lovely and very easy going  he is a gentlemen."),
("2017-08-22", "310414", "Matt", "David was an excellent host. Very helpful and respectful. The location was great and the home was welcoming and tidy. Couldn't be happier with the experience and service provided."),
("2017-08-25", "310414", "Michelle", "David was a very flexible and accommodating host. He was very communicative and understanding."),
("2017-09-21", "310414", "Dominique", "It's clean   close to everything  best place to stay and highly recommend  it to anyone visit in Sydney  :)"),
("2017-10-31", "310414", "Maximilian", "David is a friendly and forthcoming host!"),
("2017-11-24", "310414", "Lei", "David is a great host and the place is closed to public transport and the CBD.   Definitely would recommend this place to my friends (btw  thx so much for chasing away the spider)"),
("2017-12-10", "310414", "Laila", "David was a lovely host. My check in plans kept changing on my behalf and he remained super flexible. The location is unbeatable - super close to shops  cafes and safely located to walk to and from. The private tv and netflix was a real treat - I may have binge watched a night or two free from judgement. David was a lovely warm host throughout my 4night stay. 110% recommended :)"),
("2018-01-15", "310414", "Chris", "David's place was a great find. Lovely house with everything you need  and very close to all the tourist sites. The book of recommendations was a lovely touch. Would highly recommend to other visitors!"),
("2018-02-10", "310414", "Jorrit", "Great first stay in an AirBnB - David was easy to communicate with  friendly  and the checkin process was a breeze. The house and the room were great  in a perfect location and very neat and tidy."),
("2018-02-24", "310414", "Gabriela", "David is truly SUPERhost! I loved everything about his place! Location (just 2mins from Oxford Street  walking distance to Hyde Park  public transportation to City/Bondi/Central within minute of walk) his renovated house with all comfort and extra touches. Staying at David’s means to have responsive host who pays attention to his guests and privacy or friendly chat (as desired). I enjoyed my stay at David’s and it’s definitely right spot to stay in Sydney! Hope to be back again soon!Gabriela"),
("2018-03-03", "310414", "Brian", "I stayed at David's place for 3 nights for Mardi Gras weekend and it was a perfect place for me  being close (walking distance) to restaurants  bars and public transportation. David was a great host  very communicative and he also helped me check-in early once I arrived from my cruise.The bed was comfortable and the bedroom has air conditioning for extra comfort. The bathroom being in the first floor does create a little bit of inconvenience but this is stated in his listing very clear and was not a surprise. I highly recommend David's place and would stay again in future trips to Sydney."),
("2018-03-09", "310414", "Anna", "David has a really stylish apartment in a great location. It looks exactly like the pictures.  David went out of his way to be accomodating and I really enjoyed my stay."),
("2018-03-18", "310414", "Oosha", "Very lovely home!! We had a great time staying at this lovely home  also we did try the bar recommendation at the welcome book  such a cool chill place to be with friends at night!"),
("2018-03-27", "310414", "Annett", "Perfekt gelegen  in wenigen Minuten zum öffentlichen Nahverkehr  Cafés etc.  ruhig und doch mittendrin.Tolle Tipps von David."),
("2019-02-01", "31344231", "Silke", "A tidy  modern apartment in a very convenient spot in Neutral Bay  close to shops  banks  a post office and several restaurants and cafes. We enjoyed our stay very much and would have loved to stay longer."),
("2019-02-07", "31344231", "Isabelle", "This place is very well located in Neutral Bay.  Nice restaurants  Pilates studio around and beautiful places for walking."),
("2019-02-10", "31344231", "Matthew", "Really nice place  great location."),
("2019-02-13", "31344231", "Jason", "This is a nice apartment  it’s well located  and has loads of restaurants nearby to suit a variety of budgets."),
("2019-02-16", "31344231", "Christopher", "Patrick's place was great  and he was nice enough to leave a thoughtful box of chocolates :) Definitely a great and convenient place to stay  and he has a lot of valuable information for anyone who is new to Sydney!"),
("2019-02-24", "31344231", "Melissa", "房东准备了巧克力 很友好｡自助入住很方便｡但是预定前没有相告 隔壁几米的地方在施工 每天早餐7点开始吵的无法睡觉｡走路去City基本不可能 太远了｡入住当天被告知洗衣机坏了不能用｡整体来说 体验一般 简单的过渡入住两天可以 但不要预期有度假休闲的期待｡"),
("2019-01-12", "31391139", "Claire", "Super friendly and accommodating host in a great location."),
("2019-01-26", "31391139", "Harmonie", "Horrible host and disgusting place  DO NOT EVER STAY HERE"),
("2019-02-14", "31391139", "Jandra", "All good"),
("2019-02-24", "31391139", "Genesis", "Everything was perfect and clean"),
("2019-03-02", "31391139", "瞳", "最高でした!"),
("2019-01-19", "31461289", "Ana", "Muy céntrico. Poco limpio."),
("2019-01-20", "31461289", "Jasmine", "Really nice room"),
("2019-01-23", "31461289", "Jasmine", "It is really a nice room very good location"),
("2019-01-25", "31461289", "Andrew", "great location. disappointed with dirty bathroom"),
("2019-01-28", "31696863", "Nayer", "Gunsen’s place was amazing... the apartment was beautifully renovated and fully equipped with everything. It’s only a 5 minute walk to the beach and shops which is very convenient and has a great big balcony to sit and enjoy the fresh air! I would definitely recommend Gunsen’s place... I know I will be going back again some time!"),
("2019-02-09", "31696863", "Hayley", "Great place to stay! Lovely place. location is amazing  so close to the beach  shops and restaurants. Great communication. I would definitely stay here again!"),
("2019-02-16", "31696863", "Jacob", "Don’t hesitate booking this place  you won’t be disappointed!"),
("2019-02-23", "31696863", "Michael", "awesome place .. will be staying again real soon"),
("2019-03-02", "31696863", "Jodie", "Brilliant location. So close to beach and cafes. Lovely relaxing time and spacious enough for 7"),
("2019-02-24", "31804891", "Craig", "Great View and Location. Robert is a great host."),
("2019-02-22", "32361436", "Grace Duignan-Pearson", "I had a great time staying with Anya  Urs and Finn. The room is light and bright with lots of space  and on a quiet road in Bondi that's still close to all the action and within walking distance to the Junction.The place was really clean and Anya was great with her communication (particularly as I booked really last minute). I would definitely recommend their home as a great  peaceful base from which to explore Bondi."),
("2019-02-19", "32388469", "Angela", "This family was wonderful. They shared there beautiful home with us. Had great amenities and very accommodating. Excellent response time.  Thanks Karan and family!"),
("2019-02-23", "32388469", "Mehedi", "Karan and his family are the best host I have encountered so far with AirBNB. Felt like family away from home. I will highly recommend his place to every one."),
("2014-09-23", "3731634", "Craig", "Great location for my needs with much needed parking. Pete was a great host who could accommodate my needs with no issues at all. Look forward to staying with him again on my next visit."),
("2015-02-04", "3731634", "Jeremy", "Pete is a young nice guy. Serious and hard worker he makes you feel at ease and home. The room was big and very comfortable. I got my own private bathroom which was big. Location was perfect too  10min walking to darling harbor. The neighborhood is nice and cool."),
("2012-08-23", "394428", "Julie", "Stayed with Kerri as we needed somewhere close to the family (who have grown too much to fit us into their small house). Beautiful apartment and a lovely bedroom and bathroom for our use.  Kerri is a great host and a really nice person - with excellent taste.  We'd be happy to recommend her place to anyone and be happy to stay there again."),
("2012-10-14", "394428", "Remon", "Rather than an awesome room  Kerri was really an amazing host  very supportive and sociable. I enjoyed staying with her  it was a nice experience.  She would never hesitate to answer any question or even to offer any kind help."),
("2012-11-26", "394428", "Twiny", "The flat is as per the pictures: decorated with taste  offers nice spaces and is very clean. The room is very pretty and the double bed has a super comfy matress- good sleep guaranteed. It was also much appreciable to have a own bathroom&toilets.Kerri is welcoming and communicating with her was easy (i needed a room for the following day and she replied straight away). I felt comfortable as soon as I arrived  she is such a nice and warm person.Moreover she is full of attention  I did not stay long but the bathroom had been cleaned and new fresh towels provided. It was no problem to use the washing machine (There is a tumble dryer  but also the possibility to have the clothes dry on the balcony). Just felt like home.In short  a quality and easy stay with a fantastic host. I highly recommend anybody to stay at this place.Kerri  I will remember the discussion we had around a glass of wine! Thanks for having hosted me."),
("2013-01-03", "394428", "Katia", "l'hôtesse très sympathique   accueillante  serviable   nous a fait découvrir la ville et les environs le jour de notre arrivée  l'appartement est confortable  propre et bien décoré  le petit déjeûner copieux  nous avons eu le plaisir de voir avec Kerri le feu d'artifice du 31/12/12 sur sa terrasse ;nous sommes très heureux de l'avoir connue Katia et Pierre  "),
("2013-01-22", "394428", "Remo", "It was a great pleasure to stay in Kerri's house. Everything looked like on the picture. The flat was very tidy and clean. Kerri is a kind  open and helpful person and she knows a lot about the life and the world which means you can have very good discussions with her. I will never forget my stay and I can highly recommend to everyone to stay in Kerri's house!"),
("2013-06-24", "394428", "Kirsten", "Kerri's apartment in Petersham was comfortable and convienient for our stay in Sydney. Everything was beautifully presented and the bed was very comfy!  We would stay again."),
("2013-07-28", "394428", "Greg", "Staying with Kerri was my first airbnb experience and it could not have been better. Right from the moment I made the reservation  Kerri welcomed me with an offer of directions  which as it turned out I didn't need as her place was very easy to find. The apartment is beautiful and comfortable with much attention to detail. I was given a great bedroom with a very comfy bed and had my own beautifully appointed private bathroom. The place had the feel of a five star hotel  but with the added bonus of Kerri's friendliness. Immediately downstairs is a very cool cafe serving awesome breakfasts  so I ended up passing up the generous continental style breakfast that Kerri had offered me. The apartment location is perfect  as just down the road is the lively area of Newtown with its many bars and restaurants. I highly recommend staying with Kerri and look forward myself to staying there again in the future."),
("2013-08-07", "394428", "Kirstin", "Perfect host  perfect house and perfect cat! I would stay with Kerri without hesitation. Clean  tidy  modern  friendly  welcoming and relaxed. Perfect!"),
("2013-09-25", "394428", "Gwen", "Kerri hosted my Mother In Law while we had an overflow of guests in our house. We couldn't have asked for a more perfect experience than she got with Kerri. The apartment is like an immaculate hotel  with a very good sized bedroom and uber-modern bathroom for my MIL. Kerri was the perfect host and friend to my MIL  sharing movies  wine  stories and friends with her. Can't quite believe how perfectly it all worked out. Thanks so much Kerri!"),
("2013-10-21", "394428", "Therese", "Loved the stay at Kerri's place. Beautifully appointed and fantastic location. The view from the apartment was incredible. Great also having a cool little caf right alongside a gorgeous park. Thanks Kerri for providing a high quality bnb stay. It was really appreciated."),
("2013-10-28", "394428", "Catherine", "Staying at Kerri's was my first experience with Airbnb. It completely exceeded my expectations! I had such a fabulous experience thanks to Kerri. Her home is beautifully decorated and quite comfortable. I immediately felt right at home. Kerri couldn't have been more gracious. She is a very bright  fun-loving person and she made my stay in Sydney very special. I highly recommend staying at Kerri's place!"),
("2013-11-11", "394428", "Catherine", "Second time staying with Kerri. What can I say? Best place to stay in the Sydney area. Not only is this a comfortable  clean home  Kerri is the best host EVER! Absolutely loved my stay here! "),
("2013-11-19", "394428", "Mohammed", "It was great pleasureto stay with Kerry.We felt as we were in our home.Kerry was supportive friendly kind and lovely.Her home was not less than what has been shown in the pics.You get all appliances and amenities without trouble.We loved our stay too much amd highly recommend it to anyone.A+++++:)"),
("2013-11-29", "394428", "Anna-Maija", "We are an elderly couple (but not old) from Finland visiting Australia and Sydney for the first time. Staying in Kerris place was also our first airbnb experiance and it is hard to imagine any better place and host for us. We were so pleased and happy all the time  8 days. It was easy to use public transportation from Stanmore railwaystation. We used everything train  bus  ferry and even light rail. Kerris home is beautyfully furnished  just for our taste. And she had everything in order  very tidy  very organized. We had a very good brekfast and we even enjoyed two dinners with Kerri. Kerri helped us in every way even when we had some problems. We felt like we had visited a good friend. We can warmly suggest Kerris home for everyone. If we ever come to Sydney again we will try to meet Kerri again."),
("2013-12-02", "394428", "Rosemary", "Kerri was a wonderful  very friendly host. The apartment was spotlessly clean and the bed very comfy. "),
("2013-12-06", "394428", "Rod", "I visit Sydney for work a few times a year and previously have stayed in motels. It is extremely difficult and expensive to find anything close to the city. So I thought I'd give airbnb a try and Kerri's place looked and sounded great. I was really pleased to have found Kerri's lovely apartment. Very comfortable and well designed and Kerri is the perfect host: even cooked me a lovely meal when I arrived and provided secure parking for my car. Kerri is very friendly and easy-going and you quickly feel like you're staying at an old friends house.Thanks Kerri. I'm sure I'll be looking to stay again on future trips to Sydney"),
("2013-12-09", "394428", "Kristy", "Kerri is a wonderful host  she made me feel very welcome and comfortable in her beautifully decorated and clean apartment. Kerri is very accommodating and thoughtful and would totally recommend staying at her lovely home."),
("2013-12-14", "394428", "Adnan", "I had an amazing stay with Kerri. She has a beautiful place that is walking distance from Newtown  a hip neighbourhood where you can spend many hours wandering and discovering quaint shops. Kerri is very hospitable  she picked me up at the train station  and made me feel right at home. The room and the apartment overall are out of a design magazine. Beautifully done. Thanks Kerri!"),
("2014-01-09", "394428", "Sandra", "Staying with Kerri in Sydney was wonderful!  She is a lovely hostess whose home is beautiful and comfortable.  Indeed it was my very best Airbnb experience and I have use these listings many times!"),
("2014-01-13", "394428", "Julius", "We had a wonderful stay in Kerri s home. She is a great host  all the comments so far speak for themselves. Great location close to the city and the airport  nice neighborhood  wonderful Appartement  everything clean  you'll have your own bathroom. It was perfect for our stay. Kerri responds quickly and was really trying to make everything work out for us. Recommended to everyone."),
("2014-02-03", "394428", "Joanna", "Kerri was an amazing host! She immediately made us feel right at home and treated us like family. I highly recommend her very nice apt for anyone wanting to stay in a central area in Sydney."),
("2014-02-09", "394428", "Jennifer", "Kerrie is a wonderful host  could not have asked for better. Beautiful apartment  very clean and great to have your own ensuite. Would love to come and stay again one day!"),
("2014-02-20", "394428", "Julie", "We've stayed a few times with Kerri.  She's a great host and her apartment is lovely.  We're happy to recommend and look forward to our next visit."),
("2014-02-23", "394428", "Jack", "Kerri's place was conveniently situated only about 20 minutes walk to theatres and restaurants in Newtown and about 20 mins drive to the airport for Saturday morning pick up. The bed was very comfortable  lovely bathroom and living area and Kerri was a helpful host. Being under the flight path was a novelty for our very short stay (and no planes overnight). However  the traffic noise from the busy main road was a bit of a problem for us and woke us up early. Although for convenience of location I would consider staying there again."),
("2014-02-27", "394428", "Gudrun", "Kerri is a very nice person and a great host. The location was simply perfect for me…everything was how Kerri descried. I can recommend Kerri."),
("2014-03-09", "394428", "Thomas", "Great host  great time!! We really enjoyed our stay in Petersham  we discovered Sydney by train and bus - erverything close by. Kerry gave us a lot of brilliant tips and made us feeling like home. Thanks for everything  looking foreward to see you again  Thomas and Margarteha from Germany"),
("2014-03-17", "394428", "Shane", "Kerri was the perfect host kind and couldn't do enough for us we felt like part of the family .The apartment was gorgeous  and central to railway and shops our bed was very comfortable and ensuite  was nice and fresh and recently renovated .We enjoyed our stay in Sydney and will come back and hopefully come and stay with Kerri again ."),
("2014-03-21", "394428", "Kirstin", "The reservation was canceled the day before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-03-24", "394428", "Jo", "The apartment is everything you would want  clean  well designed and close to shops  cafes and train.  Kerri is a very gracious and friendly host  we enjoyed our stay and would most certainly come again.  Thanks Kerri!"),
("2014-04-01", "394428", "Graham", "Kerri's was a lovely place to stay and she was both friendly and helpful too. It was only a short 15 minute train ride to the centre of Sydney so with a my multipass it was easy.Listen to kerri's hints and tips as Watson's bay was truly fabulous."),
("2014-04-15", "394428", "Lise", "I arrived at Kerri's place  and thought  Hmmm...when can I move in? This is a fabulous apartment  and Kerri is a generous  thoughtful host who contributed a great deal to making my stay in Sydney very enjoyable indeed. Plus  we had a lot in common  which made for some lovely conversations! I would heartily recommend this place to travelers seeking a fine welcome in a beautiful apartment. Only word of note: if you're someone who needs absolute quiet  it's a bit noisy on weekday mornings (not weekends  which are much quieter).   "),
("2014-05-12", "394428", "Julie", "Another great stay with Kerri  room lovely as always. "),
("2014-07-25", "394428", "Chelsie", "Kerri was very nice and accommodating. Unfortunately I was unable to stay last omits but she was a pleasure to communicate with and will definitely be a place for next time! Thanks Kerri!"),
("2014-08-12", "394428", "Helen", "A wonderful first AirBNB experience for us. A beautiful welcoming home with charming decorations and Kerri is an excellent host. She greeted us with a glass of wine and gave us good advice on trains and where to eat.  We slept in a comfortable big bedroom with good lighting and elegant furnishings. Will stay there again."),
("2014-08-18", "394428", "Jane", "My husband and I spent four nights at Kerris.The accomodation was great lovely bedroom and bathroom clean and uncluttered.Kerri was a warm and friendly host and very welcoming- nothing was too much trouble.The location is fabulous cafés and transport on the doorstep.Even the cat was friendly."),
("2014-10-21", "394428", "Bernard", "Our first australian experience was at Kerri's home. The place is located at 20 min from CBD and 2 train-stations from a vibrant and colorful place called Newton. Kerri has been more than helpful  provinding us with usefull and detailed information about Sydney and its surbubs  places of interest and much more. Everything was exactly as described. We are really looking forward to spending some more time in her apartment in a fortnight."),
("2014-11-05", "394428", "Bernard", "Kerri is a wonderful host! She is warm  friendly and helpful. She even drove us around to visit Sydney. Her apartment is nice and spacious enough to enjoy a comfortable stay. The location is on walking distance to public transportation. If we are ever back in Sydney  we would have no hesitation to stay with Kerri again. Highly recommend! Thanks for a great stay !"),
("2014-11-12", "394428", "Susanne", "Kerri was the most wonderful and accommodating host I could of wished for."),
("2014-11-16", "394428", "Cornelia", "The reservation was canceled 3 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-11-19", "394428", "Barb", "Kerri’s place and Kerrie are special  even better than the pictures.  I selected Kerri’s accommodation for ease of commuting by train and the beautiful décor.  I balked at the prospect of hauling all my luggage up a slight hill to her place  and Kerri cheerfully was at the Petersham station in 5 minutes on a Saturday afternoon to drive me to her apartment.  I found the Stanmore Station (less than a 15 minute walk past some nice houses) easier  and walked it at night and felt safe.  I was at Kerri’s for a demanding conference  and being at her place was like a relaxing resort.  The home ambiance is so beautiful and the plant and sun make it a very special home away from home.  Some of the memorable touches:  really soft sheets  a well-appointed private bathroom  a friendly cat  the self-serve breakfast of fruit/cereal/yogurt laid out in the morning (one morning she left eggs and a tomato with a pan and spatula too)  the plants and view from the veranda where I ate and read  and the lovely decorations from her travels.  There’s also a nice  upscale grocery just down the street.  We didn’t see too much of each other  and the lengthiest time we spent was when Kerri generously took me to my rental car office in Mascot near the airport.   Kerri’s friendly and adaptable when you have odd plans like I did.  It was a treat to stay here!  "),
("2014-12-03", "394428", "Jessica", "Great place and a lovey apartment! Highly recommended! I would definitely stay here again in Sydney!"),
("2014-12-09", "394428", "Lisa", "I thoroughly enjoyed my stay at Kerri's place. She is a wonderful host and very welcoming. There was a delicious cooked dinner on my arrival and a lovely Breakfast laid out for me to help myself in the morning. I enjoyed sitting on the spacious balcony looking back towards Sydney. The whole place is very clean. The bedroom is spacious and the bed very comfortable. I enjoyed my own bathroom with plenty of fresh towels. Kerry's place is a lovely peaceful home away from home.  I would come back anytime I am in Sydney. Thank you very much Kerri."),
("2015-01-19", "394428", "Eleanor", "Staying at Kerri's place was absolutely wonderful! Kerri is an awesome host  very friendly  warm  welcoming and great to talk to. She always ensured I was comfortable and even drove me to the next place I was staying in Dulwich Hill. A lovely breakfast of fruit  cereal and yoghurt was laid out for me to help myself every morning and Kerri made a yummy cooked breakfast for me on my last morning. I also enjoyed dinner a couple of times with Kerri which was great  she is a fantastic cook! The room was lovely  clean  really nicely decorated and with its own modern bathroom. I also loved the chocolates! Wish I could have stayed longer  I would definitely stay again. Thanks Kerri! "),
("2015-02-28", "394428", "Lee", "Kerri was very welcoming for minute one the apartment is lovely & nothing is to much for kerri she always helps & advises which is a great help kerri joined me & my family for dinner out one evening which says how easy a person she is to get on with I fully recommend a stay here & will defiantly stay here again when I come back to Sydney"),
("2015-03-10", "394428", "Lee", "My 2 nd stay in the space of 2 weeks this time for 7 days another pleasant experience no probs just left to do my own thing kerri was always there for advice of places to see & things to do.the apartment is a fab place to stay & a steak in the newington hotel opposite is a must."),
("2015-03-15", "394428", "Lee", "Fab host def recommend"),
("2015-09-29", "394428", "Ruth", "Our first ever Airbnb experience was just perfect.  Kerri is a lovely host  the apartment is very stylish and we had a yummy breakfast too.  We couldn't have asked for anymore.  Kerri was very efficient from the first point of contact and we were made to feel very welcome.  She gave really good restaurant recommendations which is always nice when staying in a new area.  The train station is close so  it made everything accessible.  We will definitely stay here again."),
("2015-10-04", "394428", "Annette", "Had a great stay with Kerry who is a wonderful host. The location is excellent  just a short walk to Stanmore or Petersham stations with quick trips to the city and airport. Kerry's home is very clean and well laid out with plenty of privacy and your own bathroom. A great video and book library  beautiful deck area for meals and just relaxing...what more could you need? Breakfast was laid out and Kerry even cooked me a meal on arrival and picked me up from my daughters place. A wonderful host  beautiful home..... I'll be back!   Thank you so much Kerry"),
("2015-11-05", "394428", "Julie", "Another great stay. Thanks for looking after us again."),
("2015-11-27", "394428", "德衍", "We had really good time in this beautiful house. The pillows  sheets and towels are clean and smell good. Its location is good. We walked less than 10 mins from Petersham station. The host prepared some fresh fruits  milk and toast for us for breakfast and we liked it very much. We will choose here to stay if we come Australlia again."),
("2015-12-05", "394428", "Bernard", "It was the 3rd time we stayed at Kerri’s place and it was as perfect as the 1st time.The room is nicely decorated and big enough for accommodate comfortably 2 people and the bathroom next door was for our private use only. Kerri is a very communicative and interesting person  always ready for a chat and a glass of wine on the terrace or in the large living area.The apartment is well located  on walking distance from Stanmore train station  which is at about 20 min from CBD.I would recommend this place without hesitation to anyone who is looking for a comfy stay in Sydney."),
("2015-12-08", "394428", "Jodie", "We stayed with Kerri after we had moved house and before flying to Europe for a holiday and it was exactly what we needed! Kerri is a lovely  thoughtful host  offering us breakfast for the morning and making sure we were comfortable. Her place is really lovely  the bed is very comfy and the shower is the best! It's also very conveniently located to the cafes  shopping and nightspots of Newtown and Enmore  with the city a short train ride away. I would highly recommend Kerri's to others looking for a Sydney stay. "),
("2016-02-15", "394428", "Pierre", "It was very fun to stay at Kerri place  Very nice house  to share time talking at night with Kerri on her balcony with wine was just perfect and lovely. Kerri make you feeling at home. She also help me to be able to find the way to see the koala refuge. Thanks Kerri  for sure if I have the chance to go to Sydney again I will ask you if a can stay at your place again. "),
("2016-05-08", "394428", "Tony", "This is the second time I've stayed at Kerri's place.  Kerri is a friendly and generous host who takes great care with the appearance of her beautiful home.  Easy to organise a check-in time.  Handy location only a 5 minute walk to Petersham station.   Good value."),
("2016-11-17", "394428", "Lynette", "Kerri is a fantastic host and I truly enjoyed my visit. I would recommend Kerri and her apartment to anyone."),
("2016-11-23", "394428", "Lynette", "Kerri is a wonderful host and I always thoroughly enjoy her hospitality and friendliness. Cheers Lynette"),
("2016-11-26", "394428", "Rachel", "Clean and comfortable room  renovated apartment in modern style  excellent balcony space."),
("2016-11-29", "394428", "Lynette", "Excellent and friendly host with a beautiful apartment and excellent room and bathroom. Recommend to anyone looking for a clean  neat and well maintained apartment in a good neighbourhood for shops  restaurants  public transport."),
("2016-12-06", "394428", "Lynette", "Excellent host. Fantastic property. Clean and beautifully appointed. Handy for public transport & shops."),
("2017-01-18", "394428", "Angela", "We had a wonderful time staying with Kerri for almost three weeks.  She is a fantastic host and made us feel truly welcome in her lovely home.  We especially enjoyed the delicious fresh fruit salad prepared freshly every day to accompany breakfast.  The property is only a few minutes away from the train station  just 15 mins to the centre of the city  ideal for Sydney sightseeing.  Newtown  with its vibrant shops and estaurants is just a short walk away which was excellent for us as we became regular visitors to the Cow and Moon (voted best ice cream in the world).  We have no hesitation recommending Kerri and will definitely stay again when we next return to Australia."),
("2017-03-09", "394428", "Louretta", "Beautiful apartment with a great balcony looking out to the lights of the city   where we enjoyed one or two wines . Kerri's hospitality was outstanding.Very close to the train station take aways restaurants.   This will be my first choice of accommodation when I next visit Sydney ."),
("2017-05-06", "394428", "Hannah", "Kerri was such a welcoming and friendly host who went out of her way to ensure my stay was comfortable. The apartment was immaculate  the bedroom spacious and the facilities modern. The location was perfect  with everything I needed within walking distance. For my first airbnb experience it was perfect  would highly recommend and will be staying there again!"),
("2017-10-01", "394428", "Tim", "What a pleasant surprise after a string of ""less than expected"" experiences on air BnB.    The secure parking and lifts are just the beginning.  Kerri has created a delightfully modern and stylish home that lends itself to being shared.   Truly tasteful and functional bathroom  and it was all mine.  It all continues upstairs with the perfect kitchen  a sun filled dining and lounge area  flowing  out onto large private deck with views of a vast city skyline  including the harbour bridge  which is probably ten kilometres  away.   Truly magnificent.  Yes there are some big noises from the road out front  and the jumbo jets above  but it really isn't a problem.  Kerri loves this space and who wouldn't."),
("2017-12-03", "394428", "Louretta", "Kerri's apartment is in a very handy location to restaurants shops and trains. Easy to get into the city. Great views from the balcony.  Kerri's hospitality is outstanding . I had a wonderful time . Thank you."),
("2014-09-22", "3936009", "Ray", "Excellent location to great cafe and restaurants.  Apartment is very modern and comfortable.  Excellent hosts."),
("2014-09-28", "3936009", "Michelle", "Naveen and her husband Tris were exquisite hosts.  We were welcomed by Tris who working in the restaurant biz is a connoisseur of great eats and recommended some rad cafes.  The room was absolutely stunning  you wake up to a beautiful view of the rooftops and city  it makes it hard to want to get out of bed.  You are walking distance to quite a lot and have easy access to the train.  Naveen is super on top of checking in to ensure your needs are met and has great energy.  She invited us for a glass of wine when she arrived home from work and it felt like we were catching up with a friend.  I highly recommend staying here  it was a really lovely experience!  "),
("2014-10-04", "3936009", "Wayne", "Naveen is so good n very careful person  even i was staying only 1 night. She will msg me make sure im alright. The house is very very modern and there is a gym room...view is awesome...could able to see both harbour bridge n opera house. I like the room soooo much with a big window ...could see the city view all the day. The doggy felix is so cute .i love him so much...very very good dog n love to play with it.i highlu recommended people to stay here."),
("2014-10-13", "3936009", "Lim", "The hosts are very friendly and helpful. Great location and a real stunning room!"),
("2014-10-16", "3936009", "Erika", "Naveen and Tris are fantastic  and their dog Felix is precious!  The apartment is decorated perfectly and feels like home. We had a great dinner together  and I learned a lot about Sydney from them. A great stay!"),
("2014-10-20", "3936009", "Anna", "Naveen and Tris are absolutely delightful hosts. I had such a great stay with them. This was my first airbnb experience  so I had no idea what to expect and I was blown away by how well it all worked out.Their place was exactly as described and as per the pictures. Location is fabulous - right in the thick of all the action in Darlinghurst and walking distance to everywhere I needed to go during my stay. The guest room is stunning - super comfy bed with high quality linen etc. Spotlessly clean and the most amazing view from the floor to ceiling window. Guests have their own private bathroom which again was spotless  great water pressure etc. Naveen has thought of all the little details - there is even a box of hotel style toiletries/amenities for guests to use. Their dog Felix is super cute and very well behaved.I was very busy during my stay  but Naveen and Tris were very relaxed about me doing my own thing. They took me to a local cafe for a great coffee on my last morning and it was really nice to get to know them a bit. Tris even went out his way to drive me to the airport when we found out that trains weren't running. I really felt like I was staying with friends. I found them very easy to communicate with when booking and Naveen responded promptly to all of my messages. Would absolutely stay here again and have already recommend this property to friends who are planning trips to Sydney. "),
("2014-10-27", "3936009", "Ronny", "I have stayed for one week with Naveen and Tris. The flat is perfectly located and really nice. Naveen and Tris have been really helpful and were great to hang out with."),
("2014-10-31", "3936009", "Emily", "Naveen and Triston were awesome hosts! They're place is in a great location in Darlinghurst with many things to explore. We had great time hanging out with them and thoroughly enjoyed their home."),
("2014-11-12", "3936009", "Fabiano", "Even thought I barely met Naveen  Tris  her partner  was very kind and helpful showing me around their place and giving me advices about the neighborhood. The room has a great view  and their place was clean  organized and very well decorated. I really felt comfortable and well hosted. The location is also very nice with good restaurants  bars and cafes just around the corner. Would definitely go back if I had the chance."),
("2014-11-17", "3936009", "Lucy", "We absolutely loved Naveen and Tristan's place  it is very well decorated and was always kept very neat and clean. We felt super comfortable and at ease. The guest's bedroom and bathroom are upstairs so you definitely get your privacy. They prepared everything you need  shampoo  conditioner  hair dryer  towels  body wash  etc. And you'll find plenty of pillows and a very comfortable bed  plenty of closet space  and A GORGEOUS VIEW! Naveen and Tristan are both very kind and helpful  and you will LOVE their dog Felix my goodness such a bundle of joy. Location of the b&b is very convenient  you are just 1-2 train stops away from the major scenic spots. You will find the best Gelato shop just down the road. There are plenty of restaurants super closeby. The neighborhood felt safe and welcoming. We loved Sydney because of this b&b :)"),
("2014-11-20", "3936009", "Michele", "Naveen and Triston were lovely hosts.  Phil and I enjoyed their place and their company  especially dinner at the Metropole.  They are good company and easy conversationalists.  We traded many enjoyable travel stories and their kavoodle ""felix"" is also a delight.  It took us only 25 minutes to leisurely walk to the City from their apartment.  Our room had a huge window view and own bathroom.  The pool and gym are right next to their apartment - very handy."),
("2014-12-01", "3936009", "Romain", "Naveen and Tristan were absolutely amazing hosts. Very helpful and understanding  I get my bearings in this new city very quickly thanks to them. Their place is also so nice and next to everything! Not to forget the BBQ we had on the terrace ! I really enjoyed my stay and I wish we'll have the opportunity to meet again !"),
("2014-12-08", "3936009", "Mimi", "I have stayed at a lot of Airbnbs over the past year or so  and Naveen's place was definitely the most special. The apartment itself was lovely  modern  great décor  awesome building w/ a pool and gym  etc. The location is also superb  super easy to get to the CBD and plenty of bars and restaurants and shopping close by. Most importantly  Naveen and Tristan are just the loveliest hosts  so gracious and inclusive  and I genuinely felt welcome in their home. Their puppy is really cute too :)"),
("2014-12-12", "3936009", "Kevin", "Stylish apartment with a lovely dog. This place is awesome and it is super clean and convenient. Highly recommend everyone to consider this place when browsing in Airbnb."),
("2014-12-15", "3936009", "Ben", "Amazing hosts! Best air BnB yet. In a great location for food drinks coffee and transport. They have an adorable dog  a gorgeous apartment and a view to die for from the pool.We were encores down for a beer and a wine and had a great conversation.I am likely to be going back on my next work trip in a few months."),
("2014-12-18", "3936009", "Yannik", "Naveen and Tris are great hosts! We felt welcome right from the minute we entered the door! The room is clean  modern and has a great view! We went out for dinner together in Kings Cross and enjoyed the nice atmosphere a lot! All in all once can say that this is a perfect place to stay  even the location of the flat is excellent!"),
("2014-12-20", "3936009", "Madeline", "I stayed at Naveen's place for three nights in December  one for work and two for pleasure and it was great! Excellent location  lovely host who was extremely helpful and welcoming. I wanted to stay away from a hotel and have a less solitary experience and I couldn't have asked for a better place. The room is a little noisy on a weekend night which is to be expected for the area and I didn't realise there was air con which probably made it a little worse with the windows open. Otherwise it was perfect  clean  well maintained  stylish and with a personal bathroom. I look forward to returning! "),
("2014-12-29", "3936009", "Samson", "We enjoyed the time staying at Naveens' and Tris' apt and can highly recommend staying with the two. Location was great  easy to achieve all sights in walking distance....both were very friendly and helpfull and when it came to picking up our rental car at the airport  Tris was giving us a ride...isn't this nice??? Thank you again for the time and for the hospitality. Stay in touch. Xoxo Bettina & Sam"),
("2014-12-31", "3936009", "Ryan", "This definitely falls into the 'must stay' category! Not only was the room and accommodation well above expectations  but the neighborhood is great and very good for walking around to enjoy everything including the opera house  botanical gardens  and great restaurants. Naveen and Tristan were perfect hosts and it was a real treat talking to them and sharing in a great dinner Naveen made. "),
("2015-01-03", "3936009", "Ian", "Tristan made us feel very welcome upon arrival  showed us everything we'd need and recommended a great place to have breakfast! Although we unfortunately didn't end up meeting Naveen  she was very helpful over the phone! The apartment was exactly what we were looking for  the use of the gym and outside pool (with stunning views across the city and harbour bridge) are a great addition! We loved the style of the apartment too  very cool. Loved Darlighurst  conveniently located when travelling into the City and not too far from Bondi. We would highly recommend staying with Tristan & Naveen!"),
("2015-01-12", "3936009", "Felicity Jane", "We had an awesome stay at Naveen and Tristians. It was really easy to get to  excellent access to public transport  all the city sights and places we wanted to go. There is a wealth of good cafe and bars in the area and we were given excellent tips on which ones to go to. Friendly  clean  welcoming great amenities and views! lots of personal space or good chats."),
("2015-01-15", "3936009", "Sally", "We had a wonderful stay at the stunning rooom in Darlinghurst.  Naveen was a terrific host providing a beautiful room with great views of Sydney  a very comfortable bed and linens  excellent and abundant organic toiletires  and an affectionate dog named Felix.  We worked out in the gym  used the sauna and swam in the pool. the location was close enough to walk to the CBD  or Sydney Opera House and yet  feel like we were in a neighborhood that had lots of stores  restaurants and shops. Naveen gave us excellent suggestions about restaurants to eat in and we felt totally welcomed and comfortable during our 3 day stay.  If you go to Sydney  stay with Naveen.  You will be very happy."),
("2015-01-23", "3936009", "Bek", "Naveen and her Husband Tris were beyond amazing hosts!  I arrived in Sydney with my partner for our birthdays  and he had to leave that evening due to work commitments  leaving me to stay in Sydney alone for the night.  Naveen invited me to eat the most delicious dinner with them and we stayed up talking.  I was very grateful for the company!  They gave me the perfect amount of privacy when needed.  The apartment was in an amazing location  easy to wander in and out of the city in 15 minutes walking time.  Felix the dog is an additional bonus to this adorable city stay and won me over very easily with those puppy dog eyes!  Thank you for making my birthday such a pleasurable experience. x"),
("2015-01-26", "3936009", "Lea", "We had a wonderful stay with Naveen and Tristan. They were terrific hosts and made us feel very welcome - providing lots of great tips on nearby cafes and bars  and even bathrobes. The bedroom had an amazing view and was large and spotless. The apartment is in a fantastic location - close to the city and lots of great places to eat and shop - and is really comfortable and super stylish. Definitely would stay with Naveen and Tristan again!"),
("2015-02-05", "3936009", "Juliette", "Naveen and Tristan have a stylish and cozy apartment in a cool neighborhood. They are very nice and make u feel like home. Always ready to give me travel tips. Love their dog Felix! Plenty restaurants  bars selection around and 5 mins away from train station  bus station  2 mins to supermarket. And thanks for Naveen's recommendation of gelato which were really good! Great stay. Hope go back one day to play with Felix again. :)"),
("2015-02-14", "3936009", "Campbell And Caroline", "Great hosts - loved it!"),
("2015-02-20", "3936009", "Bogu", "Cozy apartment and nice host. Everything was so comportable. Location is also convenient to access everywhere."),
("2015-02-21", "3936009", "Misaki", "Location close to train station."),
("2015-02-22", "3936009", "Katherine", "I only got to spend one night in this house but it was definitely a great experience. Naveen and Tris were very accommodating and friendly. They invited me out with them but also gave me my own space.  The house is as described. It is renovated and a lovely modern look. The apartment is very clean throughout and the bed is very comfortable. I loved the floor-length window and loved having my own bathroom. All in all  I felt really at home there and it made my short business trip to Sydney much easier.  I would very happily stay there again."),
("2015-02-24", "3936009", "Cissy", "Perfect host! Naveen&Tristan were awesome!They were always very friendly and helpful. The apartment located in a great neighborhood. Lots of cafes bars supermarket are nearby. Walking distance to the train station  very convenient to everywhere. Their dog felix is a cute friend  love to play with new guests. Hope to see Naveen&Tristan again in Beijing."),
("2015-02-25", "3936009", "Debra", "Fantastic place to stay - beautiful apartment in a top location. Hosts were very accommodating Would definitely stay there again. Thanks Naveen!"),
("2015-02-28", "3936009", "Sébastien", "Super séjour dans une chambre en hauteur avec accès à une piscine et une salle de sport au 6 ème étage!!! depuis la piscine vous pourrez voir l'opéra de Sydney!Située au centre de Sydney nous avons pu tout visiter à pieds! plein de restaurants très bons dans la rue.Merci beaucoup à nos hôtes  qui sont charmants  à l'image de tous les australiens!En espérant pouvoir revenir un jour en Australie...Nous recommandons largement la chambre de Naveen!!"),
("2015-03-09", "3936009", "Nick", "The location was perfect and close to so many restaurants  cafes  and grocery store. Within walking distance to the train/bus stations and a nice walk to downtown to the Opera House and Harbour! The apartment itself is beautiful and unique! Definitely recommend this place and would stay here again! Naveen made the room very welcoming by providing us with lots of amenities and even a bottle of champagne to celebrate our honeymoon! Lots of maps and booklets available in room for those first time to Sydney."),
("2015-03-11", "3936009", "Rebecca & Paul", "Naveen's place was a great stop over in our trip to Australia. Our only regret is that we didn't stay longer! Great communication during the booking and Ricky was a fantastic host during our stay. Felix is a lovely little dog  very well behaved and a lot of fun to be around. Really lovely  clean  modern apartment block. I highly recommend to stay here."),
("2015-03-15", "3936009", "Thibault", "We were received by Ricky  which was dog-sitting for Naveen  and he was always happy to help. The place is gorgeous and exactly as displayed in the pictures. Really close to King's Cross Station  where it was easy to take a train to go anywhere.Hope we will be able to meet Naveen the next time we will be in Sydney!"),
("2015-03-16", "3936009", "Pia", "We loved our stay at Naveen's apartment. It's a beautiful space in a great location  and the best coffee just a few floors down. :) The checkin couldn't have been easier and communication with Naveen was very quick. The apartment is stylishly appointed  and every little convenience considered - there was even a power adapter for international guests.Sadly our hosts were travelling so we didn't meet them this time  but Naveen's friend Ricky was available to assist with any queries. Wish we could have stayed longer! "),
("2015-03-19", "3936009", "Elijah", "Naveen was very communicative  making sure I was okay with the place I was staying in and the over all accommodations all the way through until I showed up.  The location is fantastic. A bunch of awesome eateries with a stones throw and a 25 minute walk from the Circular Quay."),
("2015-03-20", "3936009", "Hanna", "The apartment is a great choice if you would like to stay near the city centre located in a chic neighborhood scattered with nice little cafes.  Ricky  our host is very friendly and helpful which made our stay very enjoyable!  "),
("2015-03-26", "3936009", "David", "The room and location were stunning. So comfy."),
("2015-03-29", "3936009", "Damian", "I had the most enjoyable early morning swim to wake me up. I felt very welcomed and would happily stay again."),
("2015-03-31", "3936009", "Kenny", "A great place to stay in. Very nice apartment! Comfy bed  with a fantastic view from the room. There are nice cafes just below the apartment.Ricky our host was friendly  and Felix (very excited dog) made our stay better :)Recommended to stay. I would stay here again if I'm in Sydney."),
("2015-04-05", "3936009", "Jessica", "Naveen and Tris have a well-appointed place in the cozy Sydney neighborhood of Darlinghurst. The area is bustling with cafes and well-rated restaurants. Naveen and Tris were attentive hosts even though they had just come home from a long trip themselves. They went out of their way to interact with us and we even stayed up late one night chatting over wine. The location is very close to King's Cross station which makes it a breeze to do day trips (we did Blue Mountains and Bondi) and get to/from the airport. However  the only con is that there is no direct subway line or bus to Circular Quay/the Rocks area. Walking 20min  you're in the city  but it probably took us 30-40 min to walk to the Rocks area.Overall it was a pleasant stay!"),
("2015-04-09", "3936009", "宇辰", "This is obviously a great place to stay. Stunning room  comfy bed  convenient location... Naveen is very nice and friendly. The cute doggy Felix makes it even better to stay here. Very recommended !"),
("2015-04-14", "3936009", "Eileen", "It was a lovely experience staying at this AirBnB.  As soon as you walk in the room you are struck by the wall to wall window looking out onto the city and to the street below.  Loads of great cafes are right nearby.  Naveen and her partner (Tristen?) were wonderful and helpful.  Their dog was gorgeous!! The room was very comfortable.  As long as you sleep with the windows shut you will not get much noise (there is a fan if you need it).  We had a great time!"),
("2015-04-18", "3936009", "Phoebe", "This is a very beautiful home and we felt very comfortable staying here. We met Naveen and Tristan as our paths crossed briefly during our stay  yet this was no hindrance and it was lovely to come and go as we pleased and still feel so welcome. Felix is a massive draw card (if you like dogs/animals) and was a delight to come home to each time!The room is lovely  the bed very comfortable and the amenities well maintained. Overall it is a great example of quality Airbnb accommodation.Location-wise it is fabulous. Wonderfully close to many of Sydney's highlights and with instant access to great coffee  food and bars. It is on a main road and a stone's throw from Kings Cross  so be aware that if you are a light sleeper you will need earplugs to help reduce the noise. However  this doesn't diminish the appeal of the place but rather just something to be prepared for.We would happily stay here again whenever we are in Sydney and highly recommend it to all fellow Airbnb-ers. "),
("2015-04-26", "3936009", "Cherry", "Naveen is a nice host. Her apartment located in the hart of Sydney  is convenient for walking around the CBD. But the dog was smelled and the room too. "),
("2015-04-28", "3936009", "Jay", "6 stars from us! Thanks Naveen  Tris  and Felix. Loved your home  and your hospitality!"),
("2015-05-01", "3936009", "Alex", """Exactly what airbnb should be!"" Fantastic location  only 5 mins to the city. The room and private bathroom were was amazing. Lots of places to eat out or go for a drink nearby. Great hospitality.Thank you Naveen  Tris  and Felix."),
("2015-05-03", "3936009", "Maria", "We excellent communication right from the beginning. We arrived late on our first night but Neveen happily made alternative arrangements for our key collection. Both Neveen and Tristan were exceptional hosts  who went out of their way to make us feel welcome  right down to the last detail. They were also more than happy to point out the best local coffee and restaurants. It was an absolute pleasure staying with them and Felix was an added little treat to our stay. We highly recommend this gorgeous apartment for anyone staying in Darlinghurst. "),
("2015-05-08", "3936009", "Glenn", "My first trip to Sydney plus first Bnb experience were perfect thanks to Naveen and her husband Tris.  The neighborhood  was a great one where everything were so close and convenient  I actually had a number of my meals nearby and they were all very good.  The train was just 5 minutes away and we could get to almost anywhere within 40 minutes.   Naveen and Tris are a cute couple  they were super helpful  I think I must have messaged Naveen 30 times throughout the trip asking questions from places to eat  to places to shop and visit.  They knew almost all the answers to my inquiries and on the rare occasions they would find it out for me in no time.  The main problem was not having enough time and appetite to visit all the great restaurants they recommended. As for the apartment  it is exactly what it looks like in the pictures  (which for me was the main reason I chose their place ) living in tiny apartments in Hong Kong  I find the place very spacious and all the necessary amenities were their for you on your arrival.  Their little pet Felix was also very friendly and is a great companion when the couple is out for work.All in all  my first bnb experience was perfect and thanks to the couple  airbnb has a new loyal customer. "),
("2015-05-12", "3936009", "Benjamin", "Bel appartement et bonne localisation. Très bien desservi aussi. La sdb privative est un pluS.  Un poil bruyant pour ceux qui ne sont pas habitué aux ambiances urbaines nocturnes mais rien de rédhibitoire."),
("2015-05-19", "3936009", "Ruiyang", "lovely host  lovely house and lovely puppy~~great geographic position and adequate sunshine~~"),
("2015-05-24", "3936009", "Ge", "It's a great experience living at Naveen' s cozy apartment. Everything is as satisfying as the description and the pictures  the neighborhood  the good location and the nice apartment. Naveen and Tristan prepared some useful maps  guides and even a photography album of Kings Cross ;-) All of those what they have provided are thoughtful and sweet. And their doggy Felix is so lovely! Wish we could visit her place again. "),
("2015-05-31", "3936009", "Wenting", "room is amazing and hosts are great (including the lovely pet - Felix!)"),
("2015-06-08", "3936009", "Mandy Ling Li", "Naveen and Triston were lovely hosts. The guest room is stunning!! It is very well decorated and was always kept very neat and clean. We felt super comfortable and at ease. The guest's bedroom and bathroom are upstairs so you definitely get your privacy. They prepared everything you need  shampoo  conditioner  hair dryer  towels  body wash. Location was great  easy to achieve all sights in walking distance. "),
("2015-06-22", "3936009", "Rifat", "A really nice room with a great view. Location was very convenient too  close to CBD and train station nearby. Naveen and Tristian were very welcoming and responsive. "),
("2015-07-01", "3936009", "Patrick", "Perfect location which close to the train station with nice cafe and bar nearby.Both Neveen and Tristan are very friendly and willing to give useful advise for us when to travel around.We would love to stay here again whenever we are in Sydney and highly recommend it to all of you."),
("2015-07-08", "3936009", "Jessie", "The wonderful expenrience has made our tour Sydney a memorable one. Not only the amazing appearance of the modern apartment but also the cozy home-like atmosphere make it suitable for tourists travelling in this city. It's been surprising to find very single that may be needed durig the stay are provided and placed in immediate reach. Thanks to Naveen to make it nicely. I bet this is exactly the  accomadation everyone is looking for!"),
("2015-07-17", "3936009", "Candice", "The place is exactly as what the pictures show. The dog  Felix is so friendly and would lie down besides us just taking a nap. Also the guest room is quite cozy and faces the street with a french window. Everything  shops  cafes  stations are within a couple minutes' walk. It is very convenient to get to the tourist spots. Lovely apartment! Plus: the cafe downstairs  named Latteria(if my memory serves me) is s (Phone number hidden by Airbnb) nice! You shouldn't miss it!"),
("2015-07-19", "3936009", "Marc", "Everything was great  lovely couple and cute dog :)"),
("2015-07-20", "3936009", "Ashley", "Naveen & Tristan were awesome  they were such great host's. it was our first Airbnb & recommend this for sure  you have your own  space with bedroom and bathroom  so cool!!  loved it.Ash&Jas "),
("2015-08-03", "3936009", "Clarence", "Naveen and her husband have been one of the most patient hosts we had in our trip and was also the last place we stayed in Sydney before leaving. We want to thank her graciousness and consideration towards us as we fumbled through our last few days  trying to say bye to the amazing city. Naveen and her husband were also nice enough to provide interesting guides to cafes  maps and provided a thorough walk through of the neighbourhood which incidentally is - we believe to be - one of the cooler neighborhoods if you enjoy pubbing and cafe hopping.Her home was exactly as described in the listing if not better and wowed us the moment we entered the house. We had our own private toilet just outside our room and was delighted with how immaculately clean the it was. Our room was cozy and the mood lighting light (that amazingly has 6 colors to choose from) made the room funky yet extremely homely. The space in the room was spacious enough for two people and 3 luggages. The bed was also extremely comfortable and to top it off was provided with comfy bath slippers and robes. Her living room is definitely one to check out and her husband Tristan gladly talked to us about how the design came about.It was a pity we did not get to try out the gym  the pool and the sauna which was literally the adjacent room from the house.Lastly  Naveen's dog has got to be the friendliest and cutest dog we have met in our travels  being extremy warm and cuddly and perhaps only barked once throughout the entire stay to greet us when we came back. It really gave us no trouble at all despite Naveen's joke on being a threat to our shoes.Overall  the stay was good and we would recommend the place to anyone who wants to be close to the city but yet need an affordable place to stay. Thanks Naveen!! "),
("2015-08-11", "3936009", "Dan", "Had a lovely stay with Naveen et all. The perfect spot for access to the City  the cross and New Town. Easy to find  easy to access via the concierge service and exactly as describedGreat bars and restaurants nearby and fantastic recommendations from Naveen! Both Naveen and Tristan were very welcoming and helpful from start to finish"),
("2015-08-17", "3936009", "Nadège", "Staying at Naveen's place was wonderful! When you arrive  you are welcomed by the very cheerful little Felix  so prepare to cuddle him! Had no problem to get from the airport to Kings Cross station and then from the station to Naveen's place  and the concierge knew I was coming  so everything went well.The room is beautiful  the bed hard to get out of and the view amazing. Naveen gives a lot of attention to details so you will find everything you could ever need in your room. Naveen and Tristan were very nice and I enjoyed talking to them  even though I didn't see a lot of them because I had so much to do in three days.Besides  the place is close to a lot of touristic areas. You can walk to  the museum (around 15 min if you stop at redlights  10 min if you're not patient)  Sydney tower (25 min  and you walk through a park)  then continue through George Street to Circular Quay  the Opera House  and then walk through the Royal Botanical Garden to go back home. This place is definitly a good pick."),
("2015-08-21", "3936009", "John", "Fantastic apartment  super hosts and very friendly dog. The flat is well positioned for access to the trains and buses making travel to CBD easy yet far enough out of the hussle and noise for a quiet mooch around Darlinghurst and Woolamooloo. "),
("2015-08-31", "3936009", "Sheryl", "It had been 3 wonderful nights stay at Naveen's place. The environment was very comfortable and it looked just the same as the photos shown. The view from the bedroom was absolutely brilliant  especially at night  where you could actually see stars if the sky is clear enough. Being away from home  it felt warm to be greeted by the lovely puppy  Felix. Moreover  the location is perfect as it is extremely near the Kings cross train station and only 2 stations away from the city. Would definitely recommend to friends!"),
("2015-09-21", "3936009", "Sami", "Naveen's place is beautiful and very clean. She is very welcoming and was open to all of the questions we had about the city. She also had a little box filled with all sorts of toiletries for us  which we loved! The apartment itself is located near lots of restaurants and bars and it was very easy to get around the city with the train station being close by. I definitely recommend this place!"),
("2015-09-24", "3936009", "Vivienne", "Everything is more than satisfied and amazing in Naveen and Tristan' s apartment! Me and my sister have spent three nights in their lovely home  they have prepared everything we need in our specious room as well as the private bathroom. We enjoy all the details and atmosphere  it is exactly looks the same as the photos.The gym and swimming pool just 3 seconds from home  super convenient. There are lots of designable café and bar on the street nearby  train station just 5mins walk.It definitely is the best choice for everyone who have a plan to stay in Sydney. Highly recommended."),
("2015-09-28", "3936009", "Bodo", "Naveen's place was awesome. Near Kings Cross and in 20 min walking distance to the CBD. Having a little dog in the apartment was a nice plus :) ."),
("2015-10-01", "3936009", "Yoyo", "This is our first Airbnb and it is definitely a wonderful experience. Location is perfect as city is just within walking distance. Naveen and Tristan are both very accommodating and responsive  and prepared all we need in the bedroom and private bathroom. Love the little cute dog Felix too!Highly recommend this place to all of you!"),
("2015-10-04", "3936009", "Jaimi", "What a perfect place to stay in Sydney. The room is exactly how it's pictured  so funky and modern. My partner and I stayed for two nights and we had a great time  Naveen  Tristan and Felix are very accommodating and the room is perfectly located. Will be back for sure. "),
("2015-10-20", "3936009", "Chris", "The apartment is awesome and the hosts are very welcome. The view of the room is perfect and clean. The host are thoughtful and prepare many stuff that I can use.In particularly  the dog is so....o cute and friendly.If I have a chance to go to Sydney  I will choose this again!"),
("2015-10-27", "3936009", "Janice", "We were welcomed by Felix when we arrived  check-in was easy as key was left with the concierge and Naveen was very flexible with the check in timing :)Home is just a stone's throw away from King Cross Station  which made it very easy for us since we were departing Sydney from Naveen's place. King Cross is on a line that links to many places you'd wanna visit when in Sydney. There are also many cafes + Coles near Naveen's apartment so that's where we settled most of our breakfast + groceries.Room + Home looked exactly like the pictures  tastefully decorated. Bed was indeed super comfortable & hard to get out of every morning.Naveen left us with our own little space (room + bathroom) which gave us enough privacy but also helped us when we approached her for suggestions on things to do /places to visit in Sydney. Overall a great host & we would highly recommend this place especially for its location when you're visiting Sydney. Thanks again Naveen :)"),
("2015-10-30", "3936009", "Ivy", "Naveen  Trista and Felix are very nice hosts. Their apartment is lovely and just as described. Room for us is tidy and clean and we love the view of that room! "),
("2015-11-02", "3936009", "Philipp", "The Apartment was great  the location is ideal for sightseeing and going out. There are a lot of bars  restaurants and a great Ice cream shop nearby. The room looks like on the pictures. Naveen was very nice and check-in and out was easy."),
("2015-11-08", "3936009", "Toni", "I loved everything about Naveen and Tristan's home - amenities  decor  location and their cute puppy  Felix. Naveen was a great host - providing toiletries  sunscreen and aloe Vera (just in case) and even a beach bag! Both Naveen and her husband were very hospitable; offering places to go and even inviting you along for a drink. Their home is in a great location: close to the train station  beaches  CBD  Opera House/Harbour Bridge and fantastic cafés/restaurants. "),
("2015-11-09", "3936009", "Regan", "We had a fantastic stay at Naveen's place. Everything was exactly as described and communication was very easy. Close to everything in the city and a great view from the room."),
("2015-11-12", "3936009", "Irini", "Loved the location of this place. It was very comfortable and I felt great coming home to a nice room. I appreciated having my own bathroom and access to the gym/pool/sauna  which look over the harbor. Hosts were helpful and the stay was easy and stress free. Would stay here again for sure."),
("2015-11-16", "3936009", "Nelly", "Absolutely loved staying with Naveen! The room was incredible (even better in person)  apartment was stunning and she went into every detail to make sure we had everything we could possibly need. Having our own bathroom was so convenient as well and the location was great - everything you could need was close by and the train station was a short walk. Naveen was also great help with transport & places to go and eat. Will definitely be staying again next time I'm in Sydney!"),
("2015-11-19", "3936009", "Joseph", "We had a great time at Naveen and Tristan's place! We arrived in the morning  and they had already left for work by the time we got to their place  but the concierge knew we were coming and everything worked out very smoothly. The room has a gorgeous view  and we woke up to a beautiful sunrise each morning. Naveen and Tristan were very friendly and gave us lots of good information about the area. Our room was well-stocked with all supplies we needed during the stay  which was very useful. It was my first Airbnb experience and it was definitely a good one! Oh  and their dog  Felix  is an awesome little buddy who loves to just sit next to you and snuggle."),
("2015-11-21", "3936009", "Ying", "我们在这里住了两晚 男主人非常友善｡房东的作息规律 所以晚上整个屋子都很安静｡卧室和卫生间干净 步行至city需要20分钟｡"),
("2015-11-23", "3936009", "Sherri", "The room was very clean and they had a nice set of clean towels on the bed when we arrived. The view was amazing and the concierge was incredibly helpful."),
("2015-11-27", "3936009", "Xiaodong", "I like everything in the house: the design  color  the lovely dog!  Naveen and her husband are very friendly ! "),
("2015-12-01", "3936009", "Gregory", "This apartment/room is a great place to stay in Sydney for the solo traveler or for couples.  It's a 5 min walk from the Kings Cross subway station.  The neighborhood has a bunch of great bars and restaurants.  It's centrally located and you can easily walk to many parts of the city.  If you are a light sleeper (I am not) then the street noise could be a bit bothersome on a Friday or Saturday night because the windows are single-paned (I did not have any problems with the street noise)  but otherwise the accommodations are exactly as described and shown.  Comfortable bed  private bathroom  workout room and pool on the same floor.  Staying at this place felt like staying at a nice hotel in many ways.  Naveen and Tristan's wifi signal is strong and fast.  They provide soap  tea and fresh towels in your room should you need those things.  You can come and go as you please and Naveen and Tristan are a wonderful couple and excellent hosts.  They are easy to talk to and they offered many good suggestions about restaurants  bars  and sites to see (thank you for the Lil' Darling and ferry to Manly Beach recommendations!).  Naveen even graciously invited me to dinner with her friends; who were just as enjoyable to talk to as N & T.  And for dog lovers  little Felix will warm your heart.  I would absolutely recommend this room to a friend or any person looking to stay in the heart of Sydney with three wonderful and interesting hosts.        "),
("2015-12-10", "3936009", "Greg", "Naveen and Tristan were absolutely wonderful hosts (as was Felix - who is adorable and cuddly).  The room and amenities were even better than I expected  and I would whole-heartedly recommend this listing.  The location was perfect for quickly getting to Sydney's hot spots  and the local restaurants and coffee shops were a delight to wake up to every day.  Even the concierge/doorman went out of his way to be accommodating in any way possible.  If you are considering staying with Naveen  book it now.  You won't regret it. "),
("2015-12-11", "3936009", "Mike", "Absolutely ideal. Amazing location  STUNNING home  hospitable hosts  staggering view from the room! Can not fault this experience  whatsoever. Super cute puppy  too! Thank you very much  Naveen. I'll be back."),
("2015-12-16", "3936009", "Jane", "Nice home in a great location."),
("2015-12-21", "3936009", "Gary", "The room had all the facilities needed and the location was superb. Being a busy street  it can get a little noisy at nights. In the mornings  there are many cafes right across the street and even sightseeing spots with museums and cathedrals nearby. "),
("2015-12-25", "3936009", "Yun", "Nice room with spectacular view. You get what you see from the photos. Cute dog - Felix."),
("2016-01-12", "3936009", "Fleur", "Naveen and Tristan were great hosts from start to finish. Though we didn't cross paths much  my partner and I felt really welcomed and looked after through our week.Upon arrival  we were greeted by Tristan and the lovely puppy Felix. Tristan was sure to give us advice and recommendations for the local attractions and where was best to set up our banking and mobile networks. This was really helpful to us.The room itself was perfect  fit with a very comfortable double bed  a huge window looking out onto the neighbourhood  and all the amenities we could possibly need.I would highly recommend this place to anyone looking to explore Sydney and the surrounding areas  real value for money."),
("2016-01-25", "3936009", "Louise", "Our stay was fantastic  the room and bathroom were private and extremely clean and comfortable. The location is only a min from the train station and centrally located to bars  cafe's and restaurants.  Our stay was completely hassle free and very convenient.  "),
("2016-02-04", "3936009", "Ben", "Naveen and Tristan have a great airbnb setup perfect for someone who just needs a place to stay close to the city. They prefer guests don't use the public spaces or kitchen which is fine however wasn't mentioned before booking. They've thought of everything else one might need  we appreciated the beach bag tremendously! Would definitely recommend for people who travel independently. "),
("2016-02-07", "3936009", "David", "Extremely assisting host we arrived early morning after an overnight flight and we were welcomed to the unitGreat room with private bathroom and a very friendly felix the dogBuilding has own gym and pool if inclined to useGreat location on the edge of the cross with many cafes in the same street  5  minutes to the station for easy access to the  city"),
("2016-02-08", "3936009", "Tim", "Great spread in a lively neighborhood. Walking distance to train and myriad bars/restaurants. I've been to Sydney 10 times  but somehow never visited Darlinghurst till now. (Thanks  Airbnb!) Naveen could not have been more accommodating--she even helped me sort out the train times for my pre-dawn airport schlep. Will return! "),
("2016-02-09", "3936009", "Domenic", "Thanks for taking us in on such short notice! We stayed just one night and it was a great experience overall. The bedroom and bathroom were very clean. Naveen is extremely organised and thoughtful  providing a number of things for guests to use from bathrobes to a beach bag to quality bath products to a candle and mood lighting. A unique room with floor to ceiling window overlooking the street. And a gym  sauna and pool! (Be sure to check out the view from the pool). Naveen was flexible with our requests  including a late check-out  and check-in was easy - they have a concierge desk where we picked up the keys as they were not home when we checked in. Tristan is also a great guy. One thing to beware of is that you may be tempted to steal their dog Felix - friendliest dog ever! Only thing to note is that the downstairs kitchen  living area and balcony are off limits so it's just the room and bathroom - kind of like a hotel set-up  but the location is extremely convenient with lots of cafes  supermarket  bakery  juice place etc. all very close by :-)"),
("2016-02-11", "3936009", "Paul", "Great room in a great location  can't recommend this highly enough. Naveen and Tristan were fantastic hosts. I would recommend you book with them. "),
("2016-02-12", "3936009", "Glenn", "Great location with cafes  bars & restaurants right on your doorstep. Very convenient apartment with room & bathroom next to each other. Arriving late was no problem and convenient access via concierge. Highly recommend for a business traveller. Felix the friendly dog came to say hello in the morning which was a nice reminder of home."),
("2016-02-17", "3936009", "Licia", "Naveen's place was clean and nice  conviently located near the train station. Naveen and Tristan were lovely hosts and their dog  Felix  is a delight too. Great stay!"),
("2016-02-22", "3936009", "Margaret", "We had a great time staying with Naveen and Tristan. Their place is in a great location to eat or drink in Darlinghurst or to explore the city. They gave us great recommendations on ways to get around  where to eat and to shop. We would definitely stay with them again!"),
("2016-02-27", "3936009", "Stephen", "Fantastic clean apartment and great hosts! The room has an amazing view of the neighbourhood and sunrise. Naveen  Tristan & especially Felix were very welcoming  helping us out with local info and towels for the beach. The location is perfect for exploring sydney and we thoroughly enjoyed our stay."),
("2016-02-29", "3936009", "Kirsty", "We LOVED staying with Naveen and Tristan! They have an amazing home in an ideal spot for exploring the city. They provide so many great added extras like a beach bag and bath robes.... you wouldn't even get that in hotels! The sauna and pool were great to relax in every afternoon and they have the cutest dog who is super friendly. Thanks for being so warm and friendly  you really made us feel at home:)"),
("2016-03-05", "3936009", "Ben", "Fabulous apartment & fabulous hosts! Look forward to staying here again!!!"),
("2016-03-08", "3936009", "Natalie", "The room was incredible. The wall to wall glass panorama view of Darlinghurst was beyond compare and looking out at that view each night before bed was a joy beyond compare. I really appreciated having a bathroom to myself and the amenities provided by the hosts were perfect. I especially appreciated the filtered water in the room after a long afternoon walking around the city. The room was large and spacious and access to wifi  fresh towels  cups and a pedestal fan for when the room got too hot really made it feel like home and made it easy to settle in. Overall  this was an amazing place to stay. I have no complaints."),
("2016-03-13", "3936009", "Antonella", "Naveen apartment is very nice! Very well decorated and walking distance from everything. They have been very gentle and helpful to us. We miss Felix a lot!!! He is a very friendly and beautiful dog!"),
("2016-03-16", "3936009", "Esther", "My experience at Naveen's place was the best I've had with Airbnb  from making the booking to checking out! The place was clean  spacious and tidy  provided with more than just the essentials! The location was amazing with everything you need at your doorstep from grocers to cafes  bakeries  restaurants and more.Not only was Naveen well organised but her communication was flawless which made the whole experience easy  comfortable and memorable. We initially booked for Saturday to Monday but ended up extending another night and checking out Tuesday evening. She was really accommodating considering my friend had a late flight and even let us check out at a time suitable to us even upon a late request. Checking in and out was a breeze! We had no issues with anything whatsoever!Being able to catch Naveen and Tristan  though briefly as they are very busy  made it even more pleasurable! I highly recommend this place and will definitely book again! "),
("2016-03-22", "3936009", "Andres", "Excelente cuarto  tenia todo lo que esperábamos y hasta mas. La ubicación del departamento es excelente  tiene cerca varias paradas de buses y la estación del tren  también esta rodeado de excelente restaurantes y cafés. El departamento es increíble y aunque nos vimos poco con Naveen y Tristan siempre nos hicieron sentir como en casa  Felix salía a despedirnos todos los días y siempre nos recibía de la mejor manera  es un perro muy simpático.  "),
("2016-03-31", "3936009", "Yutong", "Naveen is so considerate and helpful. It is really a nice experience while staying here enjoying the lifestyle of them. The room is tiny n clean and what surprised us most is the puppy FELIX! Love here and I will be sure of coming back again"),
("2016-04-02", "3936009", "Kylie", "Great communication with Naveen beforehand  felt very welcome & good quality inclusions with our stay!!! Fantastic neighbourhood  cafes galore at our doorstep & reasonably priced parking nearby. Good private room & bathroom with toiletries supplied & Naveen was very friendly. We come from the country so the road noise of the inner city was noticeable but if you are used to a bit of city buzz noise at night it's fine!! "),
("2016-04-09", "3936009", "Helen", "Naveen was a lovely host and her puppy was adorable! The room has a stunning view  the facilities were clean  easy check in/out  great location and overall I was super happy. Can't wait to come back again :)"),
("2016-04-17", "3936009", "Fiona", "Naveen is friendly and professional. The room is private and the location is great for exploring Sydney. I would recommend it."),
("2016-04-20", "3936009", "Nushin", "Amazing. Private room with everything you would need and more. Naveen and Tristen are both super sweet. They treat you like you're one of their own guests and genuinely make you feel like that. I highly recommend!"),
("2016-04-25", "3936009", "Suzy", "It is my first time been to Sydney. Everything just wonderful really good start from this apt  just my journey really comfortable and really just like wifi name there is no place like home  the renovation is totally my dish. It's just so good   and so many nice details   opal cards  food and travel guide tea coffee shampoo everything I need here   and when I was in the name. Navieen walks like a cat try not make any noises on the staircase  which it's really make me feel touched. Love it. Was going to book another 3days when I back in Sydney   but all booked out this month. But when I have a chance. I need to go back here play with Felix have a nice sleep!"),
("2016-05-04", "3936009", "Marti", "The room was great  exactly as it was described.Naveen had everything set up for a great stay. The room had an amazing view towards the ocean (you can't see it  but amazing views of the sunrise and sundown).Best local tip - drink coffee and eat breakfast everyday across the street at LATTERIA - get to know the locals!"),
("2016-05-13", "3936009", "Joeltron", "I had a LOVELY time staying here! We kept to ourselves in the private room which overlooked the city.The coffee machine was an awesome touch and we felt very welcomed the entire time. Looking forward to staying again!"),
("2016-05-20", "3936009", "Ben", "Lovely room  view and a great way to wake up with a full floor to ceiling window facing East! Naveen & her partner are wonderful  friendly hosts!"),
("2016-05-22", "3936009", "Patrick", "Great location in the center of the city. Awesome views and a cute puppy. What more could you want? Thanks again Naveen!"),
("2016-05-28", "3936009", "Joeltron", "Stayed for my second time with Naveen  this time shorter but just as lovely as the first!We first visited her for the location and keep going back for the amazing vibe and also Felix. Looking forward to future visits too!"),
("2016-05-30", "3936009", "Heather", "Fantastic location to explore Sydney... thanks Naveen for all your recommendations and making us feel welcome. Loved being so close to the sauna!. Cheers Heather"),
("2016-06-04", "3936009", "Jay", "Naveen's place was amazing and the room had a beautiful outlook with one of the comfiest beds I have ever had the privilege to sleep in!Would happily book again next Sydney trip!"),
("2016-06-06", "3936009", "Sophie", "We had a great stay and was made very welcome . The stunning room was excellent and more than we expected. Naveen's place was 100% accurate to profile description. The place has a chilled & relaxed vibe to it. It is well presented  clean and thoughtful too.Thank youSophie&Vincent"),
("2016-06-13", "3936009", "Madeleine", "Lovely place  great area! Will be staying here again :)"),
("2016-07-05", "3936009", "Sarah", "We felt right at home in Naveen's place and they were very welcoming. As expected the room was fantastic and she had supplied everything we needed and more! We really enjoyed our stay :)"),
("2016-07-11", "3936009", "Petchada", "There are a lot of amenities there. I really like soap and body balm. I think the room is alittle bit cold but there is a heater  tea and coffee for you.Regarding the location  it is not far away fron CBD. You have to take a bus or the train. During this period  it has some construction. So  you may use the replacement bus or taxi to Naveen' home.Last but not least  I am really impress the view of Darlinghurst from our room."),
("2016-07-19", "3936009", "Gabriela", "My sister and I stayed here and loooved it. The view from the room was incredible. And it is so close to the station and surrounding cafes and restaurants. Super easy to get around the city from here too. Naveen and Tristan were incredibly accommodating; answering all of our questions promptly prior to arriving and welcoming us warmly when we final arrived late at night. Their little puppy was so cute and loving! We really enjoyed staying here and it would definitely be our first choice for next time we come to Sydney!"),
("2016-07-24", "3936009", "Talia", "This is a beautiful room in a great location! The views can't be beat and the bed is so comfy. Most importantly  Naveen and Tristan were kind a gracious hosts. They had great food recommendations in the area  Naveen outlined a lovely long day trip for me to take (in detail!)  and I was messaging her every 5 minutes with questions which she answered promptly and kindly. She even invited me to the markets with her and arranged for me to take a free yoga class in her studio (unfortunately I couldn't make it to either bc I got a bit sick)I'd definitely recommend this place and/or stay there again. "),
("2016-07-26", "3936009", "Antoine", "Perfect stay  friendly hosts  lovely bedroom and well located. I highly recommend it! "),
("2016-07-28", "3936009", "Ji", "We really enjoy our stay at Naveen's home the stunning room is amazing!! the room is clean and bright has everything we need. Naveen is also very nice and friendly.  "),
("2016-08-02", "3936009", "Mo", "The room really has a great view and the location is perfect. But we were not really impressed since it was fairly dirty (dog hair in the room  on the bed  hair in the sink  dust) which just didn't fit the to the otherwise very modern place. Then what I found most random and I have stayed at many many airbnb  that 6 out of 8 pictures of the place are of parts which you never going to see. Its totally alright to say ""we do not share kitchen and living room"" and the apartment is perfect for that since you have your own space upstairs but why advertise then with all these pictures? I think that is a bit misleading. Otherwise it's a great place but needs some improvements again after a high number of guests."),
("2016-08-06", "3936009", "Wendy", "The best place with amazing view. Thx for preparing a lots of staff in the room. Wanna back again:)"),
("2016-08-10", "3936009", "Gianmarco", "5 star hotel room! Don ' t miss it!"),
("2016-08-14", "3936009", "Kathryn", "The best parts about Naveen's place was  for me  the location and the wonderful view. It's near everything and there is lots of great eating around. The floor-to-ceiling window gives a lovely view of the neighborhood. The place seems very popular  so check in and out might be a bit less flexible than other air b'n'bs  but communication was great and everyone (including the pup!) was very nice."),
("2016-08-15", "3936009", "Katie", "This was perfect for my short weekend stay in Sydney. Comfortable  really conveniently located  and check in/check out was a breeze. It's a lively neighborhood  so  expect a little street noise. Would definitely stay again  thanks!"),
("2016-08-17", "3936009", "Dena", "Naveen was very hospitable  the description as listed is spot on and the location was very close to downtown and a close walk to the pier  Harbor bridge and Opera house."),
("2016-08-20", "3936009", "Mo", "It is just the way it is at the picture and felix is the goddest little cute creature."),
("2016-10-01", "3936009", "Jerry", "房间超级明亮!床前就是大落地窗!!房东住在楼下所以不会互相打扰到 狗狗很可爱喜欢舔我的手 楼下客厅设计也很棒 有机会还会再来!"),
("2016-10-11", "3936009", "Maria", "Great area to stay in Sydney! Loved the open windows in the bedroom."),
("2016-10-23", "3936009", "Anastasia", "I had a fantastic stay at Naveed's home. The room was exactly as it looks on the picture  with a stunning view. Very comfortable bed. The location is excellent as well and allows you to explore the inner city of Sydney by foot."),
("2016-10-27", "3936009", "Assaf", "I have spent 3 nights at the room.Overall I has a very good experiance. The room looks just as advertised. It's big enough  view is great and I found the neighborhood great to grab a meal when coming back in the evening. Location is nice as well.I had a lot of privacy during my stay. Naveen and Tristan where away for the most part and when they are in  they are usually hanging out in the leaving room down stairs. The building is a bit on the fancy side with a concierge downstairs (which kept an eye on my language during the last day) and a swimming pool and a gym with a fantastic view of the harbor and opera house. "),
("2016-11-04", "3936009", "Anna", "Really enjoyed my stay  great location and lovely bedroom  would definitely recommend! "),
("2016-11-11", "3936009", "Charissa", "Great location in Darlinghurst. Super close to Kings Cross station. Didn't get a chance to meet Naveen as we were hardly around but she was really helpful via message beforehand. Everything was in place for us. Felix is a total sweetheart and we miss him already! Will definitely stay again when in Sydney."),
("2016-11-28", "3936009", "Devin", "Great stay in Sydney and couldn't be happier with the acomodations. Even though this was a shared rental  it felt incredibly private. Upon showing up accessing the unit was super easy  and everything a hotel would provide for was provided by this rental. Overall very happy with the experience and would stay again!"),
("2015-01-22", "4138110", "Lara", "Nice little apartment half an hour away from Sydney. It's a good place to stay at if you're in Sydney for longer  but wouldn't recommend it for a shorter time. "),
("2015-11-07", "4138110", "Cristian", "Naby was a wonderful host and her great personality reflects in the service she provides - offered drinks and food in the evening  shared a few jokes and a story - her welcoming attitude represents exactly what AirBNB stands for! Despite this listing being for couch surfing  Naby provided an air mattress and very comfy bedding in the living room. I highly recommend Naby!"),
("2015-12-01", "4138110", "Lynden", "Was a very welcoming place to stay and had a great time! Thanks alot"),
("2016-01-02", "4138110", "Alex", "Naby is a great host. She is really kind and goes out of her way to make your stay as comfortable as possible.she even took me out to the beach with her family during my short stay.Her place is about 20 minutes by bus from the city center and i never had any trouble catching one. I can highly recommend Naby to ever who wants to have good time in Sydney and doesn't mind a little bus ride. Thank you heaps Naby !"),
("2016-01-21", "4138110", "Noman Zareen", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-04-20", "4138110", "Umashankar", "The area is really nice and the premise is very secured. Just in front of the bus stops and near to Top Ryde shopping complex and various food options. The accommodation is quite good value for the money and all the amenities are available. Also one very positive thing was not mentioned in the listing that  the apartment have a small  well decorated veranda to spend time smoking  drinking and having fun or enjoying solitary time.Naby is really warm and welcoming. She is very helpful and spent significant amount of her free time with me (she is a very busy lady with her career). I would like to visit her place again.Thank you Naby !!! Hope to see you again. "),
("2016-05-12", "4138110", "Squirrel", "I was only there one night  but Naby was extremely welcoming. The room (her son's) was very tidy and comfy. "),
("2016-07-28", "4138110", "Billy", "Yeah. The stay was awesome. Naby  and the people I was lucky enough to meet were awesome to hang out with."),
("2014-12-26", "4158278", "John", "A lovely place to stay. Perfect for a family.Just around the corner from everything.The home was better than described. As you envisaged there was competition for the hammock. Thanks Emma & family for letting us stay in your home.John  Pam  Matt & Josie. "),
("2015-01-02", "4158278", "Maria", "The house was amazing and beautiful; also the owners family were very close and just a call away to solve any little hiccups and questions that we had. Clovelly is great  the house area was quiet at night and during the day with easy walking distance to the beach and restaurants. Also very close by to public transport (fundamental in Sydney) and for us that drove there  free and easy to find parking in the same street. We did love it the stay. "),
("2015-01-14", "4158278", "Daniela", "Look no further this is the perfect place!!!Emma was  absolutely beautiful to deal with and her house reflected her.  Emma was always quick to reply to my questions and did what possible to cater for our visit. The house...Extremely comfortable; modern conveniences: coffee machine  multiple bathrooms  comfortably catering for 2 large families.The pool was a great hit as was the kids retreat upstairs.Location...Fantastic surrounded by beautiful beaches  great places to eat and an easy busy ride to the city centre."),
("2015-12-19", "4158278", "Alicia", "Emma is a wonderful host. The house and area were great - a perfect place to stay for a family. Upon arrival  Emma welcomed us into her home and made sure that we had everything we needed. After a very long flight from Europe  we were grateful and soon found (with three children) that we couldn't have made a better choice. The house was very comfortable. Whilst we had a car  it would have all worked fairly well without one too. Having had several airbnb experiences to date  this by far was one of the best!"),
("2014-10-07", "4076976", "Jade", "My partner and I had a wonderful stay at Pittwater Paradise. The accommodation was spotless and we were delighted to receive a welcome gift from Evelyn consisting of  wine  fruit and muffins. The kitchen was stocked with essential items such as milk  juice  tea  coffee  butter – really a nice touch. The view over Pittwater was lovely and relaxing  and the proximity to shops  beaches etc was fantastic. Evelyn was a wonderful host and more than happy to suggest dining options and other activities to do whilst on the northern beaches;  the house manual was also very informative.  We really had the best time and hope to return one day!"),
("2014-10-09", "4076976", "Kimberly", "The apartment was amazing. The views were wonderful - sunset overlooking Paradise Beach is breathtaking. The apartment had all the amenities we needed and we were more than comfortable during our stay. The beaches were easily accessible  but the pool was a good alternative for when we didn't feel like leaving the place.Furthermore  Evelyn was an absolutely sweet and kind host. Her and her family live just upstairs  but were not intrusive at all. Evelyn made every effort to ensure we were happy and looked after. Thank you for having us! "),
("2014-11-12", "4076976", "Alex & Dina", "We had an amazing stay at Pittwater Paradise! Stunning views from the bed and living room area! Evelyn is a great host - very friendly and easy to talk to. The apartment is full of daylight and very clean. Pittwater paradise is the perfect getaway! We didn't want to leave..."),
("2014-11-24", "4076976", "Craig", "A beautiful apartment in a beautiful part of the world! Evelyn was vey helpful and responsive  willing to help us anyway she could to ensure an enjoyable stay. When we arrived  she gave us a quick tour and then left us to make ourselves at home  but was just a quick call away if needed. A bowl of Fresh Fruit  Tea & Coffee  Yoghurts in the Fridge and a bottle of Australian Red wine (which didn't last long) were left to welcome us. The area is very peaceful  but only a 20 minute walk to the shops  cafes & beach of Avalon  from where you can catch a bus for the short trip up to Palm beach. I strongly recommend taking the walk up the Barrenjoey Headland. The views up by the lighthouse are spectacular and made for the ideal setting for my marriage proposal..... and she said YES!!! The perfect end to a perfect weekend away. We will be back!Thank you Evelyn x"),
("2014-11-28", "4076976", "Danielle", "What a spectacular location! The apartment  the view  the birds in the morning  dreamy and hard to leave! Evelyn was wonderful  friendly  considerate and thoughtful  a pleasure to meet and Avalon and Pittwater are really magical! One of the most peaceful and special places I've ever been to."),
("2015-01-19", "4076976", "Keith", "Fantastic location and view.Clean with lots of space.Exactly as listed"),
("2015-02-23", "4076976", "Michelle", "We had a wonderful stay at Evelyn's place! The apartment had plenty of space and was very close to shops and near by beaches. It was a very relaxing stay and would definitely stay here again!"),
("2015-03-14", "4076976", "Elizabeth", "This apartment was in an amazing location with beautiful views. It was as described  had everything we needed and was nice and spacious. Everything was so close by  with so many lovely beaches to visit and a pool to swim in when we just felt like lazing about.Evelyn was a great host. Her family lived upstairs  but you wouldn't even know they were there. Thank you for having us  we thoroughly enjoyed our stay!"),
("2015-03-30", "4076976", "Sophie", "Gorgeous  light filled space! Evelyn was a lovely host - she was there if you needed anything but left us to enjoy the beautiful surroundings. Thank you  we would love to visit again "),
("2015-04-28", "4076976", "Thomas", "Very nice and clean place with everything you need. Exactly like the photos. Great view and nice neighbourhood with nearby shops. Would defiantly stay again"),
("2015-05-04", "4076976", "Madeleine", "We stayed at Pittwater Paradise for our wedding. From the get go  Evelyn was so accommodating and went out of her way to ensure we had everything we needed. I got ready at the place before the wedding with my bridesmaid and Evelyn even invited us to take some photos on her upstairs balcony  The bed was super comfy  shower was great and we really had everything we needed. we will definitely be back one day! It was just perfect! Thank you Evelyn - you are so kind (we enjoyed the champagne too!) "),
("2015-06-17", "4076976", "Kathi", "Evelyn was great about communicating with me. Everything was like the pictures  if not better. The open  airy feeling of the place was more than a photo could capture. It was quiet and serene. We slept well and enjoyed the peaceful environment. Avalon is a quaint town with much to offer in dining and shopping. Evelyn was very helpful in recommending lovely dining experiences  including a splurge at Jonah's Whale Beach. Go there  even if only to have a drink and take in the view! We will definitely rebook with Evelyn  as it was a perfect getaway."),
("2015-07-02", "4076976", "Kylie", "Glorious setting and fabulous self contained apartment. Pittwater is also close you can almost reach out and touch it!  Very private and quite - perfect for couples!"),
("2015-09-07", "4076976", "Dani & Sarah-Jane", "Evelyn was a very welcoming and mindful host.  She greeted us with warm hospitality (and even a bottle of wine and some fresh fruit).   Evelyn was very prompt with her communications and flexible with our check-in and check-out times.  The space is the lower level of her home which is completely private with separate access  complete kitchen facilities  ensuite and sauna facilities.  The view of the pool and the water in the background was a beautiful sight to awaken to in the morning.  The surrounding beach areas and points of interest are easily accessible from the property.  Evelyn's place is definitely a piece of paradise - the perfect setting to unwind and relax  which is exactly what we needed. "),
("2015-09-14", "4076976", "Ciara", "Beautiful apartment with stunning views. Evelyn was very welcoming and helpful. The apartment had all the amenities we needed  location was perfect. Beautiful walks near by. We would definitely return and highly recommend to others."),
("2015-10-06", "4076976", "Elke", "My husband and I just returned from Evelyn's place over the Oct long weekend. We had such a wonderful stay and didn't want to leave. Evelyn and her husband were so welcoming and we felt right at home"),
("2015-10-11", "4076976", "Nicolas", "Evelyn was a great host. We had a lovely weekend. I recommend the place!"),
("2015-11-04", "4076976", "Maria", "We came to Avalon for a relaxing no stress holiday and that's what we got. My husband and I will definitely be returning"),
("2015-11-10", "4076976", "Niamh", "We stayed 3 nights at the beautiful Pittwater Paradise  the apartment had a gorgeous view and was incredibly peaceful. It was close to beaches  and great places to eat.Evelyn was a great host  gave us some great tips on where to go and even gave us a bottle of wine on arrival. I will definitely be back. Niamh & John     "),
("2015-11-12", "4076976", "Nicole", "We'd like to thank our hosts for a wonderful stay!  The apartment was as beautiful as advertised  and just as private as we'd hoped.  The sauna worked wonderfully  and the beach towels were huge and thick! Don't underestimate the value of the birds and the books!  We definitely recommend this place.  Pittwater paradise indeed.  :)Karl and Nicole"),
("2015-11-18", "4076976", "Michelle", "Great little spot  just as described in a beautiful part of Avalon. Evelyn was excellent in communicating with us and her partner was extremely welcoming with lots of tips for our stay. We had a car but the shops and main beach were in walking distance. The rooms were very clean and we appreciated the tea  coffee (and wine!) that was provided. I loved spending our last day relaxing by and swimming in the pool  the views from here were spectacular.  Thank you Evelyn for such a fabulous experience  I highly recommend it and would love to return :)"),
("2015-12-07", "4076976", "Rohan", "My wife and I enjoyed a relaxing & comfortable stay. Great place to get away to for the weekend. Beautiful scenery  peaceful & very private. Would definitely go back. "),
("2015-12-14", "4076976", "Tresan", "We loved the apartment   it was a lovely place to spend our weekend. Located in a beautiful area   close to beaches   cafes and restaurants.  Thanks for having us!"),
("2016-01-05", "4076976", "Kurt", "We had a wonderful stay at Pittwater Paradise. It was a great location with a clean and modern house plus an amazing view. It's rare to find a gem like this. Reluctant to put such a positive review as I want this to be just our secret but too good not to share! A must for anyone who wants to spend time in Avalon  Palm Beach or Whale Beach. Evelyn was a great host and though she was on holidays at the same time she still responded in a timely manner and was very welcoming and hospitable."),
("2016-01-08", "4076976", "Avi", "Thanks for sharing was amazing!"),
("2016-01-27", "4076976", "Daniel", "A great apartment and brilliant location. We had such a relaxing time and would definitely return."),
("2016-04-08", "4076976", "Amanda", "We were welcomed with a lovely bottle of wine and Evelyn came to meet us our first evening and gave us lots of useful information about the area.The apartment was as described and provided every comfort we needed.We loved the local area  lots going on in Avalon which was an easy walk away. The beaches are stunning and we enjoyed visits to Cottage Point and Palm Beach.A thoroughly enjoyable holiday. Thank you."),
("2016-04-11", "4076976", "Gemma", "Evelyn's apartment has the most beautiful views and is a lovely  clean and comfortable place to stay.Evelyn was great to deal with  very prompt  friendly and kind.We would highly recommend staying at this apartment!"),
("2016-04-26", "4076976", "Ghassan", "Evelyn is a great host. I look forward to spending time once again at her little getaway ."),
("2016-05-15", "4076976", "Lucky", "The location of Evelyn's apartment is great! Amazing views  quiet neighborhood and still close to the beach  shops and restaurants. The apartment is very clean and tidy and provided with everything you need! Great getaway for the weekend! "),
("2016-05-30", "4076976", "Philip", "Evelyn was a fantastic host. From first contact  Evelyn was super friendly and welcoming. My partner and I stayed at Pittwater Paradise over our wedding weekend and Evelyn went out of her way to make sure we were comfortable and had everything we needed. All previous comments about the amazing views  great location and excellent host are fully justified. On our wedding night we were very touched to come home to a chilled bottle of bubbly. Hope to return one day! Thank you Evelyn and A!"),
("2016-07-25", "4076976", "Bonnie", "Beautiful  clean and tidy property. The view over Pittwater is amazing (and uninterrupted). Being the middle of winter we didn't get much use of the pool. Although the cold didn't stop one of us from jumping in! The property also had a sauna which was an added bonus. Evelyn was an amazing host in being flexible with check-in/out times and was not short on tips and suggestions on things to see and do in the area. Having a car was helpful to be able to get from A-B  however Paradise beach and Clareville Kiosk are all within walking distance."),
("2016-08-17", "4076976", "Maree", "Evelyn is a wonderful Host. She made me feel very welcomed. I loved her beautiful space  it was peaceful and  relaxing. Fabulous view and everything one needs. I found the location perfect for some R'n'R. "),
("2016-08-21", "4076976", "Dave", "Thanks for a great holiday."),
("2016-09-10", "4076976", "Sonia", "Pittwater Paradise is a lovely get away apartment for two.  The hosts were warm and welcoming  and flexible with check in and out times. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay. Thank you!"),
("2016-09-17", "4076976", "Jonathan", "Evelyn's apartment is real oasis of calm and luxury. Absolutely perfect for a relaxing weekend. Evelyn greeted us with all the local tips and a nice bottle of wine! All one really needs to do is open the giant patio doors and sit back to enjoy the stunning views out over the swimming pool to the water and national park beyond - bliss. The apartment is finished to a very high standard and also has a sauna to relax you even further. We had a wonderful day following Evelyn's tips with a walk up to the Barrenjoey lighthouse for breathtaking views  a delicious brunch at The Boat House sat right on the water  a cocktail at Jonah's looking out on the ocean and a gourmet dinner at the Clareville kiosk (only minutes from the apartment). We will be telling all our friends and hopefully will certainly come again soon."),
("2016-09-25", "4076976", "Arthur", "We had a great stay at Evelyn's place. The place is just as by the pictures  the view is very impressive and the swimming pool  completely private for us  although quite cold at that time of the year  was worth a dive in! Evelyn did all to make our stay very confortable  and accomodate the place for our ten month old! "),
("2016-10-02", "4076976", "Candice", "Beautiful location  close to amenities  and fantastic host communication. We had a wonderful stay!"),
("2016-10-15", "4076976", "Paola And Arie", "Evelyn's place was the perfect spot for our relaxed weekend away by the water.The views was stunning and we loved the sauna and the pool too.Nice interior design and great location. We easily walked to Avalon as well as the nearby Paradise beach.Thanks Evelyn for having us!"),
("2016-11-05", "4076976", "Trent", "Evelyn was very welcoming  helpful and insightful should we need to know anything about the local area. The location was perfect  peaceful and everything was just great for a quick break away from the hustle and bustle of Sydney! "),
("2016-11-12", "4076976", "Janeen", "We spent a wonderful weekend in a clean  spacious  well equipped  quiet  beautifully presented apartment. The views are gorgeous from the apartment and the pool  beach towels provided  we enjoyed a swim on each of our 3 days. It was lovely to hear the birds  watch the boats  enjoy the view from the whole apartment  we didn't like to leave  but enjoyed some nice walks around the area and a swim in the ""Pittwater"". We were lucky to see two stunning sunsets  the weather was fantastic so we decided to self cater...takeaway on our second night from the lovely little Indian Restaurant 5 mins walk down the road. ..couldn't get a better seat with views to match. We didn't meet Evelyn  but we had good communication prior to our stay  and keeping private suited us  thank you Evelyn   we will tell our friends and be happy to return!"),
("2016-11-19", "4076976", "Maria", "Evelyn was incredibly welcoming giving us great flexibility with arrival and departure times  providing great tips for what to see and do in the area  making sure we had all we needed for a luxurious stay. This truly was paradise away from the busy life we lead in Sydney. We loved sitting on the deck watching the spectacular sunset  soaking up the sweeping water views  swimming in the refreshing pool and relaxing in the spacious lounge. We will be returning and highly recommend this stay for locals and those wanting a truly memorable Australian beach stay."),
("2016-12-10", "4076976", "Mary", "Evelyn's place is perfect. The location is stunning  the unit is clean and modern. The pool was beautiful and the area was quiet. Evelyn took us in a short notice without hassle and it was exactly what we were hoping for and more. A beautiful spot with wonderful views. Perfect for a quiet weekend away surrounded by nature. Thanks for having us. Highly recommend. "),
("2016-12-24", "4076976", "Polly", "Lovely apartment!  Clean  light & airy. Scenery beautiful.  Close to shops and beach. Stayed there on our wedding night  perfect!! "),
("2017-01-09", "4076976", "Conny", "Evelyn is a Wanderflug host  she made me fell very welcomed and her place is real oasis of calm  luxury and beauty - it is peacful and relaxing. The view over Pittwater is amazing with spectacular sunsets and the swimming pool  completely privat for me. Evelyn did all to make my stay very confortable. I thanks Everlyn to having me!"),
("2017-01-14", "4076976", "Victoria", "A beautiful stay at Pittwater Paradise - would recommend for anyone after some rest and relaxation. A gorgeous base for exploring. Thank you!"),
("2017-01-17", "4076976", "Phil", "We knew there were many beautiful places to visit in the area but the apartment and it's aspect were so stunning we spent almost all our time there enjoying the view and the pool. It was only a short walk to an intimate little Greek restaurant  a bottle store and a grocers shop  - and to the most aptly named Paradise Beach. Couldn't have wished for better. Superb. Our expectations were high. They were exceeded. We're already planning a return trip."),
("2017-02-05", "4076976", "Jeremy", "We had an amazing two nights at Evelyn's place. We booked a few nights before the trip and Evelyn accepted our booking and communicated promptly. The weekend temperature was in the high 30's and the pool was a refreshing retreat from the heat. The beaches around the area are amazing as is the view of Pittwater bay from the room. Evelyn's recommendations of restaurants and cafes was extremely helpful and we enjoyed every single one of them. Once again thank you Evelyn for allowing us into your home."),
("2017-02-09", "4076976", "Amy-Kate", "Beautiful spot  relaxing stay. Thanks so much! "),
("2017-03-04", "4076976", "Kathrin", "Evelyn and Anthony are wonderful hosts. Always available and approachable while at the same time totally respecting one's privacy. Helpful with tips on local to dos  very hospitable  flexible and proactive (e.g. towel and linen change during our 10 days stay).The place itself is a great choice as well: stunning views over Pittwater Bay  fully equipped and tastefully furnished. It is located in absolute proximity to two beaches; Avalon with the ocean beach  its shops and good restaurants is in walking distance. To sum it up: highly recommended  we would visit again anytime."),
("2017-03-18", "4076976", "Dean", "Such a beautiful outlook and lovely apartment. Quiet  spacious  clean and natural light all make for an amazing stay. The pool is a great addition. And thank you for the shiraz Evelyn  it was enjoyed from the living room couch looking out to Pittwater. Just what we needed for a weekend getaway from the city. "),
("2017-04-28", "4076976", "Jacquie", "Evelyn's apartment is just perfect   its clean and tidy and nicely decorated. It is very easy to get about the Northern beaches from where the apartment is. The views from the balcony are beautiful and its wonderful to wake up each morning to such a gorgeous view. Evelyn is a fabulous host and she will go out of her way to help you make the most of your time in her apartment. Its easy to get around but its better to hire a car as it takes about 30 mins to walk into Avalon but once there  its a lovely little place to wonder round and to have a nice meal (we highly recommend Yoda if you like Thai food) there is a little bar called The Mill which is nice to have a few drinks in (Happy hour is 5-6pm). All in all we had a fabulous time and we defineltly will be going back .  "),
("2017-05-10", "4076976", "Jenny", "Wonderful location. The views are spectacular. Very relaxing. Evelyn and Anthony lovely hosts and allow you plenty of privacy."),
("2017-06-10", "4076976", "Louis Harding", "Really nice spot  nothing like waking up to that view "),
("2017-07-02", "4076976", "Jo", "Amazing spot for a long weekend over looking the water and relaxing. Such a special spot. We will be back!"),
("2017-07-10", "4076976", "Carole", "Wonderful spot gorgeous view and very relaxing"),
("2017-07-20", "4076976", "Diana", "I enjoyed my stay in Pittwater.  The arrival was seamless and owners were very accommodating.  Short walk to Avalon beach where you can find a grocery store and many cute shops.  If you are traveling during winter  I recommend packing warm clothes because it gets chilly at night (I had no idea how cold it could get).  I also strongly recommend purchasing groceries to have in hand."),
("2017-07-23", "4076976", "Shane", "Awesome stay and location. Thanks"),
("2017-08-26", "4076976", "Joe", "We had a fantastic weekend here. Evelyn and her partner Anthony provided us with so many great recommendations and were always happy to help us. We couldn't have asked for more! Thanks very much!"),
("2017-09-17", "4076976", "Jodi", "We were blown away by this place. Everything was pristine  the view was spectacular and host helpful and respectful. We will definitely be visiting again!"),
("2017-09-25", "4076976", "Sean", "Amazing property with an even more amazing view to wake up to. Can't recommend it enough."),
("2017-09-27", "4076976", "Thomas", "Evelyn was extremely kind and helpful with going the extra mile with requests. She had a comprehensive guide on things to do  where to eat and even a little local history about the area. The place was nice and clean and the views were quite splendid. Really enjoyed the stay and would recommend it for anyone looking to escape from the bustle of the city."),
("2017-09-30", "4076976", "Anni", "Great place to stay  relaxing and beautiful. Avalon is close by with great food."),
("2017-10-08", "4076976", "Lachlan", "Awesome place. The view was incredible and the apartment just perfect. Strongly recommend"),
("2017-10-19", "4076976", "Tammy", "We had a wonderful week in Pittwater. The view from the unit is brilliant- and the presentation and comfort provided within the accommodation is excellent.Evelyn was a warm host  and her local knowledge very helpful. Thanks for a lovely holiday!"),
("2017-10-21", "4076976", "Natalie", "Stunning views and a beautifully decorated apartment. Perfect for our romantic getaway. Such a peaceful setting in the midst of nature. Evelyn was a lovely host and recommended some great local places to eat at. Would highly recommend this place!"),
("2017-11-12", "4076976", "Gilly", "What a picturesque and relaxing place to call home for a few days. We came for our baby moon and it was perfect. Stunning views over Pittwater  the apartment had everything we needed and we barely left! Loved the pool and privacy. The local restaurants were excellent. Highly recommend this place."),
("2017-11-19", "4076976", "Alex", "A fantastic little hideaway. Perfect for a break from Sydney or romantic weekend away. Lovely hosts who look after you and provide a very warm welcome. Everything was as expected and a little more  great little touches. Thanks Alex and Maddi"),
("2017-12-09", "4076976", "Shannon", "Such a lovely place to spend my partner's birthday. Thank you Evelyn for the wine  your thoughtful suggestions of the area and flexibility on check out. The apartment looks much better in real life  we thoroughly enjoyed our time in the pool and the sauna was a great touch!"),
("2018-01-27", "4076976", "Libby", "We had a great (Email hidden by Airbnb) munication was easy and Evelyn and Anthony were lovely hosts.The pool and the view are fabulous  you can easily stay in but the property is also located close enough to Avalon  Whale Beach and Palm Beach that going out for dinners and lunches is also easy."),
("2018-02-02", "4076976", "Karina", "Evelyn’s apartment - in addition to having its own pool and incredible view - is a short walk from a gentle and quiet sea pool and an organic cafe. We spent a lovely few days in a very picturesque location..."),
("2018-03-04", "4076976", "Nance", "Paradise Found!  This property is even better than the photos depict -- if you are looking for an idyllic escape in a relaxing atmosphere with fabulous views  this is the place.  Evelyn is a fantastic host who made us feel like locals.  The addition of having your own private  refreshing pool at your doorstep makes Pittwater Paradise an ideal location for a weekend getaway  or a longer stay.  We thoroughly enjoyed our two weeks at Pittwater Paradise."),
("2018-03-10", "4076976", "Scott", "Wonderful view to wake up to and excellent local knowledge of great restaurants and things to do."),
("2018-03-13", "4076976", "Kouhei", "I stayed here for 2 nights in March in Evelyn's place. It's a beautiful self-contained apartment and pool with amazing views over Pittwater. It's in such a peaceful location and is within 5min walking distance to Paradise beach  the local corner store and restaurants. You are also a 2min car ride away from Avalon - which has a stack of cafes  restaurants  banks  gift stores and a big supermarket.The rooms were a great size and the place was super clean. Evelyn personally greeted me upon arrival and had many recommendations for local restaurants and things to do. There was also a nice bottle of wine waiting for us to make us feel extra welcome.Evelyn's place is the perfect place to hang out and relax or to use as a base to explore all the spectacular northern beaches (e.g. Palm Beach  Whale Beach  Avalon Beach  Newport Beach). I would recommend Evelyn's place to any couples looking for a relaxing bush and beach retreat. My only regret is not staying there for longer."),
("2018-03-17", "4076976", "Sally", "Beautiful property with stunning views and beautiful pool! So many amazing beaches to check out around the area. Awesome Wholefoods cafe within walking distance of the house that we visited 3 days in a row for brekky (best smashed avo ever)!! Evelyn and Anthony provided a bottle of wine to welcome us which was lovely. As there is no oven in the unit  Anthony was kind enough to let us use his oven upstairs one night. Not a lot of phone reception in the area but the property has great wifi included! The bed was super comfy and shower pressure was awesome. Thanks :)"),
("2018-03-23", "4076976", "Beee", "Very close to everything. Lovely couple and amazing views m."),
("2018-03-26", "4076976", "James", "I cannot recommend Evelyn's enough. She was absolutely brilliant and so welcoming. The apartment is self contained  spacious  and gorgeous. The bottle of wine was very well received and the views are second to none."),
("2018-03-30", "4076976", "Matthew", "We loved spending time here. The private pool is wonderful at the end of a day enjoying the area. The view by itself was worth the money."),
("2018-04-02", "4076976", "Des", "Wow! What a gorgeous place and a fabulous view as well. Beautifully appointed  everything you need or wish for. Including a very cute lap pool and a small sauna. Evelyn’s communication was not only prompt but very personable. We were made welcome from the moment of our arrival. We highly recommend Evelyn’s for couples looking for something special."),
("2018-04-05", "4076976", "Anisa", "Nice peaceful location  would recommend to someone looking to spend a lot of time doing outdoor activities and enjoying the area. The space is underneath the main house however privacy was not an issue."),
("2018-04-08", "4076976", "Richard", "Pretty much as advertised. Stunning view!! Lovely health cafe at the end of the road. Some nice walks. Just a really nice getaway for us."),
("2018-04-10", "4076976", "Michael", "Highly recommended place to stay  lovely hosts and beautiful apartment close to all the beaches"),
("2018-04-15", "4076976", "Edwina", "This was such an amazing place to stay. Our hosts went above and beyond. Thank you so much for making our special day magical"),
("2018-04-18", "4076976", "Trevor", "Evelyn's place was stunning. Very thoughtful touches in the rooms  including a bottle of wine to enjoy! Avalon had incredible food and coffee  and palm beach was a great place to explore. It's about a 15-20 minute walk to Avalon  but well worth the walk. Transit is also very easy to get to/from the home  including trips to Palm beach and Sydney. My girlfriend and I had thoroughly enjoyed our stay  and would definitely come back!"),
("2018-04-22", "4076976", "Pamela", "My husband and are just back from Evelyn’s place.  We had a lovely time  it was just like the photos  a very simple but tasteful design.  The veiw was amazing and loved wake up to it every morning.  Evelyn is so nice if there was anything we needed all we had to do was knock on her door."),
("2018-04-26", "4076976", "Anthony", "I"),
("2018-05-30", "4076976", "Jacob", "Evelyn and Andy are the most warm-hearted and helpful hosts we ever had. The place is truly worth the label ""AirBNB plus"" as it has everything one could dream: spacious and light filled living room  comfortable bed and bathroom  amazing views  pool and sauna... We enjoyed our stay to the fullest!"),
("2018-06-11", "4076976", "Jordan", "Was a great stay at Evelyn’s place  would definitely recommend."),
("2018-07-15", "4076976", "Joel", "Great weekend stay!"),
("2018-07-29", "4076976", "Kt", "Thank you Evelyn for making your beautiful accommodation available to share with us via AirBnb. You live in a truly beautiful part of the world. Waking up to the stunning view over the Pittwater River was so relaxing. We highly recommend your place to anyone seeking a truly tranquil retreat. We hope yo see you again! Many thanks  KT and Karl"),
("2018-08-01", "4076976", "晓凌子", "The landlord is very kind. Thank you very much for taking us to the seaside and picking us up"),
("2018-08-04", "4076976", "Wayne", "Handy location for walks and short drive to avalon shops."),
("2018-08-18", "4076976", "Joakim", "Evelyn's place is exactly as in the pictures. Very clean and stylish! Great views and close to everything."),
("2018-08-22", "4076976", "Adele", "Evelyn was the perfect host  she responded very quickly and made her place available at very short notice. I would highly recommend staying at this place  it’s stylish  has a fantastic view and is very close to the town centre. Thanks Evelyn :)"),
("2018-09-30", "4076976", "Orestes", "A glorious water view is what you can wake up to  and Evelyn is a respectful and gracious host. If you are looking for a launch pad to the beaches  this is a great pick. Unfortunately no full kitchen  so plan to eat out!"),
("2018-10-20", "4076976", "Pachi", "Great place  amazing views  has everything you need. Even a sauna! Loved it  Would go back."),
("2018-10-27", "4076976", "David", "Clean spacious and great views. 10 minute walk into Avalon where there are lots of places to eat and shop."),
("2018-11-02", "4076976", "Dilini", "Evelyn was a wonderful host. The location was beautiful and we had a wonderful stay. The internet and phone reception is a bit patchy which may be a problem for guests who need to keep in touch with work. Otherwise  everything was perfect!"),
("2018-11-05", "4076976", "Alexander", "Great weekend away"),
("2018-11-12", "4076976", "Cassandra And Roger", "Palm beach was magical  and Evelyn's place all the more so with fantastic views and wonderful accommodations. A real slice of paradise!"),
("2018-11-29", "4076976", "Brigitta", "A great retreat with a lovely view and pool. It was exactly as expected and we had a lovely stay.The only faults are that WiFi and 4G access are poor  and the kitchen does not have an oven."),
("2018-12-17", "4076976", "Sally", "Fantastic Airbnb stay. Was easy to find  easy check in. Great location and lovely space. Comfy bed and couch  plenty of kitchen utensils  pots etc. for cooking. Avalon is a nice quiet area and very pretty with a charming township."),
("2018-12-20", "4076976", "Mike", "Beautiful self-contained apartment. A perfect northern beaches getaway."),
("2018-12-22", "4076976", "Andy", "Lovely stay at a great property  nice area and host."),
("2018-12-31", "4076976", "Erin", "We had a wonderful time  the place was stunning in terms of the decor  the facilities and the view  we loved it"),
("2019-01-07", "4076976", "Tamasin", "This is a cosy place that is well equipped and has a stunning view. We really enjoyed the pool even when the weather turned rainy. Despite the accommodation being underneath the home of the hosts we felt we had plenty of privacy especially since the pool is overhung by the second story verandah. Phone reception (we're with optus) and WiFi a bit patchy but we got by. Would love to stay again."),
("2019-01-09", "4076976", "Chelsea", "Such a beautiful home tucked away with an amazing location!! Thank you Evelyn for your great hospitality."),
("2019-01-19", "4076976", "Sean", "Magnificent views of the bay and a warm host made me feel very relaxed . Having your own private pool with and access to well secluded beaches was a big draw card as well."),
("2019-01-27", "4076976", "Mark", "Fantastic self contained unit with great views over the pool down to the water below. It’s an easy downhill walk to Clareville Beach/Clareville Kiosk and a short drive to a number of great beaches including Palm Beach. Avalon town centre & beach is close by (2 minute drive or a pleasant walk) with all its cafes and restaurants. We would definitely stay again!"),
("2019-02-01", "4076976", "Sen", "Evelyn and her husband were amazing hosts. Their apartment is clean and spacious. We loved having the  pool and the sauna in the apartment and there is an incredible view of the sea.Our location was perfect with many of the beaches nearby. Overall an incredible experience  I would highly recommend Evelyn's apartment to anyone."),
("2019-02-03", "4076976", "Carole", "Evelyn’s place is just perfect...I’ve not stayed at an Airbnb before where I just did not want to leave. The view  the pool  the location...perfect  perfect  perfect! So keen to return!"),
("2019-02-22", "4076976", "Vicky", "This place is AMAZING. The photos don’t do the place justice. We stayed here for 5 nights with our 3 month old baby and it was the perfect place. It is clean and the private pool with gorgeous views made it so relaxing. It has a stove  microwave and little fridge for when we wanted to reheat food. It’s located well with a short 3 min walk to the Forage cafe for excellent morning coffees and short 10-15min drive to Palm Beach for seeing the Lighthouse and dining at the Boathouse or Jonas at Whale Beach or even Bert’s at Newport. Evelyn is a great host and we can’t wait to stay here again."),
("2019-02-28", "4076976", "Nathaniel", "A beautiful apartment overlooking Pittwater. Paradise. Everything is so close. With you’re own pool and sauna. Highly recommend. Loved our stay"),
("2019-03-03", "4076976", "Amanda", "Thank you for sharing your home. The privacy was outstanding with check in greating only but available if needed.We loved your towels and linen  they were a very nice touch.Your view was priceless and the atmosphere was very relaxing with a touch of luxury."),
("2014-10-27", "4164487", "Chelsey", "This room and apartment are a great little find - in a lovely quiet area in Rozelle with great transport links into the city via bus and walking distance to some awesome pubs & into Balmain. You could also walk into the CBD in 40 mins (which we did a few times across the Anzac Bridge).We stayed with Duncan and Ashlee for three weeks and they are perfect hosts - gave us space to do our own thing but always there if we needed advice on Sydney (it was our first time to the city) and generally great company.The room itself is spacious and well furnished with plenty of space for storage  the bed was really comfy with an electric blanket for when the nights got a little chilly  and Duncan's information sheet in the bedroom was a great reference point. Kitchen  Living Room and Bathroom are ample sized and well equipped. There is nothing I can fault this property on nor the hosts - a great first experience of Airbnb and Sydney for us. Thank you so much guys!"),
("2014-11-30", "4164487", "Piero E Sara", "The room is really nice and comfortable! The bus stop is very closed to the apartment. Duncan and Ashlee are wonderful! They're nice  kindly  friendly and hilarious! You couln't ask for more!"),
("2014-12-11", "4164487", "Konstantin", "Excellent and cheap accomodation! The best Thing is that you can take all the buses and it is just 1 busstop to the CBD!Duncan is very very friendly and funny.The room is tidy  good bed  there is enough space (also in the kitchen) and it is a calm place. I really recommend this apartment! :-)"),
("2014-12-17", "4164487", "Kim", "Duncan and Ashlee provide a lovely room and good  friendly experience and stay.The room is very clean and set up perfectly for arrival with a lot of space to store personal items and clothes. Everything was made easy and hassle-free  and the location itself is perfect for a quick tram or bus into town  so it easy to find be first time also. We didn't get to chat much with the hosts as we were coming and going and exploring  but we enjoyed our short time spent in their company.We recommend this place for all aspects of a stay  and would be happy to stay longer than the 4 nights we had there. "),
("2015-01-02", "4164487", "Uwe Karla Hanna & Lukas", "Duncan und Ashlee waren tolle Gastgeber: freundlich  hilfsbereit und großzügig - bis hin zu einer Einladung mit ihnen das Silvesterfeuerwerk auf einer der Ferries zu erleben. Unvergesslich!!!"),
("2015-01-11", "4164487", "Kim", "It was our first time staying with airbnb and we couldn't have wished for a better start.Their place is very nice  clean and comfortable. Ashlee and Duncan were nice hosts and we enjoyed the conversations which were quite entertaining as well not to forget the nice self made honey we had! :)It was handy to be so close to the city and it was easy to get there as it's just one bus stop.Thanks for accommodation us.Cheers Mathilda and Kim"),
("2015-01-15", "4164487", "Caroline", "Duncan made us feel home from the very beginning. The room is very well located (close to the bus stop and only 2 stops to Queen Victoria Building/the city)."),
("2015-01-23", "4164487", "John", "First time Airbnb  Duncan was the perfect host the room was exceptionally clean as was all of accomodation. Rozelle is the perfect place to rest whilst visiting Sydney."),
("2015-02-17", "4164487", "Colin", "Duncan and Ashlee are great hosts! They were welcoming and went out of there way to assist me with every thing. The location is great  it's a nice neighborhood and very easy to get into the city. The house has everything you need. I had a great stay  I recommend it!"),
("2015-03-02", "4164487", "Lawrence", "Staying at Duncan's place was a pleasant experience.  The apartment was clean and in a fantastic location.  Duncan is a great host and would always make you feel welcome.  Definately a recommend staying here if you need to find a place to live for a few days."),
("2015-03-11", "4164487", "Sidney", "Duncan & Ashlee's place made our stay in Sydney really convenient. Friendly people  very clean place  very close to Sydney (one bus stop to city)  nice recommendations"),
("2015-03-16", "4164487", "Fairuz", "From the moment we arrived we were made to feel welcome by Duncan & Ashley  who are both fantastic hosts. The bedroom was cosy  and the rest of the apartment was spotless. The location is convenient as it's only a 10 mins bus ride away from the city centre. We were provided with lots of useful advice on things to do around the city  and had lots of fun & interesting chats with the hosts! Thanks again for your awesome hospitality!"),
("2015-03-20", "4164487", "Linda", "Duncan and Ashlee were the perfect hosts for our first experience with Airbnb in Sydney. From the first moment they let us feel home and give us the feeling of being very warm welcome. It was a pleasure to stay at their very cozy  clean and beautiful home! Thank you so much!!"),
("2015-03-30", "4164487", "Joanne", "So glad that our first Airbnb experience was a positive one! Duncan is prompt with his replies on (Hidden by Airbnb) once contact was made. No problems checking in  the apartment is cozy and clean  and well-equipped. Also just 5 mins by bus across the ANZAC bridge into the city. We looked forward to coming 'home' each day after our explorations. Thanks again  Duncan and Ashlee for contributing to our  memorable stay in Sydney!"),
("2015-04-06", "4164487", "Enis", "Duncan's place was certainly one of the best places that we stayed in. Duncan was very welcoming  along with his partner Ashley. They made us feel at home  and we didn't miss anything. The room was very spacious and comfortable  and the location was perfect. I would certainly recommend this place to anybody looking for a quality accommodation for affordable price."),
("2015-04-20", "4164487", "Christin", "Lovely hosts  beautiful place  perfect stay!We loved staying with Ashlee and Duncan and really enjoyed chatting with them! They we're so friendly  caring and we felt very welcome!The guest room is perfectly equipped  the bed so comfortable and we could really feel that they're both experienced travellers and therefore know about travellers' needs: chocolate on the bed  maps and recommendations   the cleanliness of the whole place and the warm atmosphere  everything just perfect!The apartment is also located very good  it is quiet  perfect for a relaxing sleep  but at the same time very easy to get around from there and we felt very safe in the nice neighborhood!Of course communication was very easy too! Highly recommended  if we return to Sydney we would love to stay with Ashlee and Duncan again! Thank you so much for everything!!"),
("2015-05-08", "4164487", "Chiara", "Our stay was perfect. We stayed at Duncan’s home for 2 weeks.Duncan and Ashlee are very friendly and kindly. They are always ready to help and give advice of everything we needed.  It was a real pleasure to stay at their place. The house is exactly as pictured  lovely! The room as well as the bathroom are very nice and clean. The place is very conveniently located. There are only 5 mins away bus stops. The neighborhood is quiet and so nice.Great experience and highly recommended!"),
("2015-05-25", "4164487", "Andrea", "This was my first Airbnb stay  and what a great start. No nasty surprises  the accommodation was just as described  comfy  clean  great almost inner city location and affordable. The information sheet provided with the accommodation was perfectly understandable & helpful for anyone who is not a Sydney local  like me. And the little touches that make it special were unexpected but lovely...the Lindor Balls  the Frangipani toiletries  all add to a relaxing experience.Duncan and Ashlee were fabulous hosts who are happy to be as involved as you want them to be and have a wealth of info on many things  as well as the odd anecdote or two. Very easygoing and personable  couldn't fault them! Couldn't be happier with my first visit  and hopefully I will have the opportunity to stay with them again in the future  now that I've fallen in love with Rozelle just a little bit more."),
("2015-06-01", "4164487", "Nicolas", "The apartment and the room are clean. Close to bus stop. (5min from CBD) Duncan and Ashlee are friendly  helpful and easy going hosts. We recommend. "),
("2015-06-06", "4164487", "Rachel", "Thank you for everything. Ashley and Duncan took turns to chat with us  though all of us was in and out quite alot. Glad we had time to hang out briefly. All as described- clean and crisp  and felt truly welcome."),
("2015-06-24", "4164487", "Jon", "Fantastic hosts  beautiful clean room  hidden gem  many thanks!"),
("2015-06-29", "4164487", "Ewelina", "Duncan and Ashley were both very friendly and helpful  but also let us have privacy in the house - we weren't home that often but never had an issue feeling cramped. Great stay!"),
("2015-07-08", "4164487", "Philippe", "Cosy and very well located. Very nice neighbourhood at only one bus stop from CBD. Duncan is a great host  always ready to help with good tips. We had a wonderful time. "),
("2015-07-13", "4164487", "Laura", "I had such a great stay with Duncan and Ashley.  Their little apartment was very inviting and had everything I needed. It was clean and tidy and nicely presented with bunches of flowers which were replaced/refreshed during my stay. More little touches such as the brand new white fluffy towels rolled on the end of my bed and topped with Lindt Chocolates made this stay a really pleasant experience. And as for Duncan and Ashley.....these are two super friendly  interesting and generous people. I had a great chat with Duncan when I arrived and he invited me to come on his boat... and then chatting to Ashley on the last night she offered to come along with me to a gallery the following day.  These two go out of their way to include you in Sydney.  I could not recommend this AirBnB enough."),
("2015-07-24", "4164487", "Morten", "This was my first experience using airbnb  and I gotta say I'm really glad i did it. The apartment was just as described and very clean. Duncan and his girlfriend was the perfect hosts  they will gladly help you with whatever you ask them  and Duncan even drove me to my next accommodation when my stay was over. I give Duncan and his apartment my highest recommendation. Enjoy your stay! :)  "),
("2015-09-23", "4164487", "Robert", "I booked Duncan's place with only a few days notice. I arrived to a lovely cosy house which was clean and tidy. Duncan was an awesome  entertaining host. But was rarely around due to his work commitments. The room was quiet  tidy and warm. The bed I have to say was the comfiest bed I've slept in for a long while. I really could charge my batteries up here! Access to Sydney CBD was super easy  only being a 5 min walk from the bus stop. I also met Ashley  who took my out to a really great quiz night. "),
("2015-10-03", "4164487", "Rafael", "Duncan was a great host! His place was great and cozy  located in a good neighborhood. I'd definitely stay there again."),
("2015-10-13", "4164487", "Charmaine", "We had a wonderful stay at Duncan's place. The apartment was very well situatated  we loved  the neighbourhood and we were close to the city. The apartment was very clean and tidy. Duncan and Ashley  were very sweet and helpful. The bed was very very very comfortable. We would definitely stay there again."),
("2015-10-24", "4164487", "Vinicius", "Since the moment we arrived at the place Duncan was so kind with us. He was ALWAYS attentive and ready to help us and answer our questions.We loved our stay.The place was clean  bright  quiet  7 minutes walk to a bus stop that you can go everywhere.The neighborhood is quiet and simple."),
("2015-11-03", "4164487", "Lance", "Duncan was a fine host.  He's knowledgeable about so many things: Sydney  travel  horses  the sea - he's a commercial sailor. Ashee's an excellent host as well. Great  positive experience.  The place is super clean!"),
("2015-11-14", "4164487", "Marine", "If you choose airbnb to meet nice and friendly people  you are at the good place. The flat has a very good location. The heart of Sydney is served by regular buses. The neighborhood is great and quiet. Duncan and Ashley gave us a lot of advices. We had access to the kitchen. The flat is clean  the bedroom has a lot of storage and is very comfortable. It was a great stay. You can book without hesitation !"),
("2015-11-20", "4164487", "Margaret", "Duncan and Ashlee are perfect AirBnb hosts - their place is lovely and nothing was too much trouble. Their apartment is located very close to the city - just a quick bus trip. Highly recommend staying here if you are in Sydney!"),
("2015-12-23", "4164487", "Christian", "Amelia and myself had a lovely stay with Duncan and Ashlee. Their place is conveniently located 1 bus stop away from Sydney CBD. They were both welcoming and accommodating and we would definitely recommend  them to future guests."),
("2016-01-16", "4164487", "C", "Highly recommended.  Duncan and Ashlee are great and very accomodating.  The place is neat  quiet  and perfect and is just one bus stop away from the city.  The neighborhood feels safe as well.  Would love to be back in their place someday."),
("2016-02-03", "4164487", "Matus", "Our stay in Sydney was fabulous. Not only because the city itself is fantastic  also because Duncan and Ashlee were most helpful whenever needed. Room is very pleasant with comfy bed. Always very clean and tidy. 10-12 minutes bus ride to city centre. Its a shame though that we didn't have  more time to chat together  because these guys are really easygoing. Highly recommended to stay here. "),
("2016-02-18", "4164487", "Jordane", "VERY LOVELY :)Nice little cosy apartment with great hosts!Duncan and Ashlee are there to help you if you have any question.We spent 2 weeks there and we hardly recommend the place!!!Really close to the city (10 minutes by bus) and to everything else you have to see in Sydney.It was a real pleasure to meet them both  we hope to see them again one day :)GO  you won't regret it!"),
("2016-03-01", "4164487", "Lydie", "Super hôtes  super sympas  super disponibles ! Duncan et Ashlee vous avez été super adorable avec nous. Notre séjour à Sydney n'aurait pas été complet si on ne vous avez pas rencontrés !!! Surtout ne changez rien ! Je recommande ++++ Bonne continuation à tous les 2..... Lydie "),
("2016-03-09", "4164487", "Tamsin", "Duncan and Ashlee are two of the friendliest people you will ever meet. Both of them were working a lot during our stay but were always chatty and happy to offer any advice we needed and made us feel very much at home! The place is in a great location and was always clean and tidy  we very highly recommend to any and all who have plans to visit Sydney!"),
("2016-03-11", "4164487", "Christian", "We have thoroughly enjoyed our second stay with Duncan and Ashlee. They are both lovely hosts and we would recommend to future guests."),
("2016-03-25", "4164487", "Sam", "Great people felt like I had known them for years"),
("2016-05-01", "4164487", "Lea", "The room was very nice and clean  the location is perfect very quiet everything is near. Duncan was very helpful   we recommend this place !  "),
("2016-05-20", "4164487", "Hew", "We really enjoyed our stay with Duncan and Ashlee. They're a very friendly couple and were great to chat to over the course of our stay! The room and apartment was in impeccable condition and  whilst we didn't need to use them  the pre-loaded Opal cards were a wonderful gesture! It was great to get to know both of them; absolutely great people to have the pleasure of meeting."),
("2016-06-04", "4164487", "Hayley", "Duncan and Ashlee were fantastic hosts making us feel welcome and at home right from the get go. They are both really lovely  laid back and have a great attitude towards Airbnb. The property itself was exactly as described  very clean and in an awesome location. The prepaid opal cards were a huge help and all the advice to help with our trip was very appreciated. Our first trip to Sydney and it couldn't have been better. We would definitely stay here again and really recommend it! You will really struggle to find better value on Airbnb let alone in Sydney! Thanks again guys!! "),
("2016-06-12", "4164487", "Andy", "Duncan and Ashlee were great hosts! We arrived in a Friday night after work and as soon as we walked through the door they offered us a beer and to have dinner with them. It is in a brilliant location just 1 bus stop from the city and has a lot of good restaurants and bars on Darling Street. They were very welcoming hosts and we felt at home and comfortable for the duration of our stay. It was a good sized room and the place was clean and had everything we needed and more. They also cooked us dinner later in the stay which was very nice! I would recommend staying here very much!!"),
("2016-06-24", "4164487", "Andrew", "A great stay! Duncan and Ashlee are friendly  down to earth and full of good tips for the area. The room itself is comfortable  and not too far away from the city. Duncan and Ashlee are very welcoming and fantastic across the whole stay "),
("2016-08-28", "4164487", "瑜芯", "This is my first time Airbnb experience. It was lucky for Liena and me to stay with Duncan and Ashlee for a month. They are nice  genuine and funny! The unit is exactly what it looks like on the picture. The space and the bed are enough for two people to stay. A wardrobe and a chest of drawers are enough for us to place our belongings. There were lots of hangers as well. Duncan prepared a cupboard for us and we had  space in refrigerator. And he even prepared Opal cards  though we chose to use ours. The whole apartment is tidy and clean. It's really comfortable.  Living here won't be disturbed by noise. And the house is really closed to Town Hall (5 minutes by bus)   which is in CBD.  It saved plenty of times and money when traveling around. Though my English is not well to express clearly  Duncan and Ashlee were so kind they listened carefully. It was definitely funny  learning Australian culture or slang with them! They 're both willing to share and help. Sometimes they would serve us food  two of them are good at cooking.Liena and I appreciate their kindness  because during our stay we had made inconveniences they still treated us truly. It's absolutely worth to stay with them and learning Australia from them. Best choice!"),
("2016-09-13", "4164487", "Andrew", "I've never been to Australia before and I didn't know anybody in Sydney  nor did I know how to get around when I arrived  so naturally I was a little nervous.  However  both Duncan and Ashlee put me at ease  they are very friendly and easy-going people who showed me the nearest bus routes and had Opel bus passes readily available.  After we introduced ourselves  I was able to go out to the nearest grocery to buy food.  Plus they are centrally located.  They are very close to the Sydney Opera House and to the Sydney Exhibition Centre on Glebe Island where OZ Comic Con took place the weekend I was there.  They also took me out for a beer and invited me to their whale-watching boat trip where I actually got to see whales!  Room was very nice and cozy  I got use of the kitchen and even the living room to watch TV.  Bathroom was clean too.  And very quiet too  I slept soundly all six nights I was there.  And they have free wi-fi.  They also provided towels  soap and shampoo.  Finally  you can't beat the price especially for that location!.  If I ever visit Sydney again in the future  I would love to be at their place again!  : )"),
("2016-09-17", "4164487", "Laura", "My boyfriend and I were looking for somewhere to stay in Sydney that was good value for money but with a homely feel and Duncan's place didn't disappoint. The room has so many little details from all the maps  the welcome information to the lindt chocolates on the towels! Although Ashlee and Duncan lead very busy lifestyles  they were always very friendly when they were around and made our stay very comfortable. The location is so convenient to get right into the heart of Sydney  just a short bus trip away (literally!) If you're considering between a hostel/hotel in the city or this air bnb - book the air bnb. It's really good value for money in a city that definitely comes with a hefty price tag."),
("2016-09-29", "4164487", "Lucille", "J'ai passé un séjour agréable chez Duncan. La chambre est très confortable et la résidence est proche des transports pour un accès facile au centre-ville. Je n'ai pas passé beaucoup de temps avec les hôtes parce que nous étions tous très occupés mais ce sont des personnes adorables et qui font en sorte de rendre le séjour très agréable. Merci à eux !"),
("2016-10-04", "4164487", "László", "They kept me updated how early I can check in  and even sent me a notifier when the room was ready. Through the stay they were both real friendly  open  helpful  plus they surely can give you a few tips what to see and where to go! The room is clean  comfy  a small heater unit is also provided if you happened to come at wintertime. We are fully satisfied with the room and recommend it to anyone lookinh for a safe  nice stay in Sydney!"),
("2016-10-11", "4164487", "Simon", "The perfect location to be able to get into the centre of Sydney quickly with lots of public transport options. Ideal place and a friendly welcome too!"),
("2016-10-17", "4164487", "Carolin", "Duncan and Ashlee were great hosts! Friendly  funny and always willing to answer your questions. We loved the Bondi to Cogee Coastal Walk  which was recommended by Ashlee. We really enjoyed our stay  the chats and the movie night. The ferry ride with Duncan was awesome!! The room was very clean  cosy and the bed very comfy. We also liked the pre-loaded Opal cards  the chocolate and the maps. The apartment is located in a quiet neighbourhood and is close to a bus stop. The city centre is just 10 min away. Great experience and highly recommended!!"),
("2016-10-30", "4164487", "Nick", "We have stayed here for a couple of days the talkings where great and Duncan can if you like it show you whales whith his boat. We are glad that we have been by them"),
("2016-11-11", "4164487", "Nguyen", "Duncan and Ashley are wonderful hosts. They have been very kind to me. The place is nice and cosy  though if you are a couple it might be a little small (I was by myself so the place was perfect). Very convenient to catch buses to the city also."),
("2016-11-20", "4164487", "Hadil", "We didn't see much of Duncan and Ashlee but they made us feel very at home! Lovely room in a good location. Felt very comfortable! The place was clean and tidy but homely and lived in. There were opal cards ready for us to use which was so handy! The guidebook was also a great tool. Really enjoyed our stay here and would recommend it to others for sure!"),
("2017-01-05", "4164487", "Sappho", "Duncan and Ashlee weren't just any hosts to us but they became our Australian Family. They're both incredibly funny  kind and helpful. The apartment itself is super clean and the room is very spacious and comfortable. They provide everything you need. Even if something were missing they would make sure that you get it. The first night I mentioned that I'm scared of insects and the next day Ashlee came home and placed baits all over the apartment just in case. In the 6 weeks we stayed with them they helped us with so many different things completely unrelated to their apartment and just made us feel so very welcome and at home. We spent Christmas and New Year's Eve with them and those two are so lovely people  you couldn't wish for better friends and especially not for better AirBnb Hosts.Duncan and Ashlee: thank you so much for everything  we are so happy that we got the chance to meet you both."),
("2017-01-13", "4164487", "Julieta", "Duncan is a great host  although we didn't meet  he made sure that everything was alright.The apartment is very clean and lovely  as in the photos! Thank you Duncan!"),
("2017-02-12", "4164487", "Emily", "Such a lovely house  that is in a great location.. quiet suburb but so close to the city! Everything and more you could need for a comfortable stay; we stayed for a month and it was perfect for us! Duncan and Ashley are so friendly and more than happy to help us out with anything! Would highly recommend as a very affordable and great location accomodation for the city. "),
("2017-02-17", "4164487", "Evelyn", "We had a great stay at Duncan's and Ashlee's apartment.Everything was really clean  comfortable and it really felt like a ""home away from home"".They are both so nice and friendly - unbelievable! We also had a tour with Duncan on a ferry and that was one of our highlights in Sydney. So we can highly recommend to stay here. "),
("2017-02-27", "4164487", "Mark", "Couldn't ask for better hosts if you tried. Ashlee was very welcoming when we arrived and both were very helpful. highly recommend having a beer with duncan and listening to his stories. If am ever back back in Sydney will definitely be looking to stay here again."),
("2017-03-30", "4164487", "Giorgia", "Definitely the best home outside home we've ever had! The house is lovely  clean and super comfy. You will find everything you need for your stay in Sydney. Thank you Ashley and Duncan for hosting us and being always welcome and helpful. We really enjoyed staying at your place  see you soon!"),
("2017-06-14", "4164487", "Brian", "Duncan's place was a perfect Airbnb. Duncan and Ashlee were welcoming  helpful and made sure that the entire stay was as hassle-free as they possibly could. They are Super Hosts who are very experienced in thinking of the things that a guest will need  well in advance of the guesting thinking of those things themselves!The room and apartment is meticulously clean  the location is very good for the heart of the CBD (5 minutes over Anzac Bridge /  1 bus stop to the city). I don't think Duncan and Ashlee could have done any more as hosts to improve my stay in Sydney. They were excellent - thank you Duncan and Ashlee!!."),
("2017-07-16", "4164487", "Romy", "Unser Aufenthalt bei Duncan und Ashlee war wirklich klasse! Die beiden waren supernett und haben uns bei all unseren Fragen geholfen. Außerdem war die Wohnung sehr gemütlich und mit allem ausgestattet  was man so brauchte  sodass man sich sofort zu Hause fühlen konnte. An unserem letzten Abend hat Ashlee sogar für uns alle ein leckeres asiatisches Gericht gekocht.Alles in allem haben wir uns sehr wohl gefühlt und würden sofort nochmal zurückkommen  sollten wir wieder in Sydney sein."),
("2017-08-18", "4164487", "Salim & Éléanor", "Nous avons passé une dizaine de jours très agréables chez Ashlee et Duncan. La chambre est confortable  le quartier est calme (avec quelques restaurants un peu plus loin). Ashlee nous a donné de très bons conseil pour visiter Sydney et nous nous a fait sentir comme chez nous : cuisine et salon libres d'accès  possibilité d'utiliser le lave-linge … Le logement est un peu éloigné du CBD à pied  mais beaucoup de bus passent à quelques mètres du logement et sont direct vers le centre (5 minutes de bus à peine). C'est une bonne adresse et nous le recommandons à tous ceux qui veulent rencontrer des sydneysiders :)"),
("2017-09-16", "4164487", "Ashley", "It's was amazing to stay with Duncan and Ashlee! They are both extremely nice  communicative and open. Their place is exceptionally clean and equipped with all you need to have an overjoyous experience in Sydney. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-11-02", "4164487", "Friederike", "Wir haben uns bei Ashlee und Duncan sehr wohl gefühlt. Das AirBnB hat eine gute Lage und war stets sauber.  Die beiden sind tolle Gastgeber  die uns unsere Zeit in Sydney durch Tipps und spontane Aktivitäten unvergesslich gemacht haben. Hoffentlich sehen wir uns irgendwann mal wieder! :)"),
("2018-03-24", "4164487", "Charlotte", "Die Unterkunft ist schlicht aber sehr schön eingerichtet und hat alles was man braucht. Man ist zu Fuß in 5 Minuten an der Bushaltestelle und braucht ca. 15 Minuten in die Innenstadt. Die Nachbarschaft ist ruhig und es hat einen Park in der Nähe. Man kann auch sehr schöne Spaziergänge um die Hafenbuchten unternehmen  die besonders schön beim Sonnenuntergang sind. Ashlee und Duncan sind zwei wundervolle Menschen und sind weitaus mehr als nur Gastgeber! Wir hatten 5 unvergessliche Monate mit ihnen und sind überglücklich sie kennen gelernt zu haben! Herzlichen  Dank nochmal für alles was ihr für uns getan habt! Es gibt nur positives über die Beiden und ihrer Unterkunft zusagen.❤"),
("2018-03-29", "4164487", "Sylvia", "Duncan and Ashlee were amazing hosts! They were friendly  welcoming and went out of their way to check in with me and make sure I was having a good time in Sydney. I was in Sydney for business  and also enjoyed the beautiful walk to Circular Quay. For those who prefer not to walk  there was plenty of public transport. Their home was clean  tidy and homey. It was a great stay; I enjoyed the comfortable bed  excellent shower pressure and evenings chilling out in front of the TV. I can only highly recommend staying with them; you'll be in a great location in fantastic hands."),
("2018-03-30", "4164487", "James", "The place was super clean and the guys were perfect hosts. I'd recommend the place to anyone."),
("2018-04-04", "4164487", "Anna", "Duncan and Ashlee are two lovely persons! The flat was clean all the time and we slept verry good in the bed! (: Both of them were friendly all the time and gave us great tipps!"),
("2018-04-24", "4164487", "Cheng Yue", "Duncan and Ashlee were excellent hosts. My daughter and I enjoyed staying in their super clean and tasteful home. It is our home away from home! Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-25", "4164487", "Yui", "Best location in Sydney!! Really quiet area! Enjoy the time in Duncan and Ashlee's House. Both of them are so lovely and like the nature so much! Also they are a great designer of their house! The photos hanging in the room are the great proof! Next time if I have a long term vacation  I'll still choose to live here! Thank you  Duncan and Ashlee! Best experience in Sydney. "),
("2018-06-08", "4164487", "Kingsley", "Exellent affordable stay. Really lovely hosts."),
("2018-06-23", "4164487", "Lindsay", "Duncan and Ashlee's flat is in a lovely area of Sydney.  It is close to some lovely parklands going down to the waterfront  near the shops at Rozelle  the amazing Orange Grove market on a Saturday and has good links into the City Centre.  The room for one or two people is of a good size  the bed is comfy and the whole flat spotlessly tidy and clean.  I thoroughly recommend Duncan and Ashlee - they are great hosts.  "),
("2018-07-13", "4164487", "Peter", "A really lovely room hosted by a great couple. Good location just a couple of bus stops away from darling harbour. The apartment is really cosy with some lovely cosy touches."),
("2018-07-20", "4164487", "Denise", "Amazing place to stay at especially if you like some privacy :) stayed here for a week and its super convenient!"),
("2018-07-28", "4164487", "Craig", "Awesome place to stay.  Very hospitable and friendly and has everything you need. Definitely recommend for future travellers"),
("2018-08-26", "4164487", "Léa", "Logement très propre  accueil irréprochable  à un arrêt de bus du centre ville  bref parfait pour un séjour sur Sydney avec calme et confort."),
("2018-09-22", "4164487", "Lewis", "Great value for money. Very clean and in a nice suburb close to everything."),
("2018-10-03", "4164487", "Sandeep", "Great place with amazing hospitality  and it is only located 1 stop away from the city! Duncan and Ashlee are amazing and have some great tips to share."),
("2018-10-21", "4164487", "Vishal", "The house is very close to CBD and darling harbour and is very quiet. The house was sparkling clean and duncan and ashlee are very amicable"),
("2018-11-11", "4164487", "Scott", "Great location  5 min drive to the city and 15 mins to the beach  very good value  couldn’t ask anymore from an Airbnb"),
("2018-11-21", "4164487", "Nina", "Duncan and Ashlee's place is very close to the city. The kitchen the bathroom and bedroom everything you want in a home and very clean and tidied up! It really is a ""home a way from home"". Duncan and Ashlee are very friendly kind people. Even though this was our first airbnb with staying with the host  we never felt uncomfortable! These two lovely people will help you out with anything!Thank you very much!!!"),
("2018-12-01", "4164487", "Alessandro", "Duncan & Ashlee are lovely hosts. Helpful and funny  we will miss them even though we only spent 1 week there! Thanks again D&A!"),
("2018-12-10", "4164487", "Naomi", "Duncan and Ashlee are great hosts and their place was clean  cosy and very close to everything. Would definitely stay here again :D"),
("2018-12-31", "4164487", "Florian", "Superhosts for a reason! Flat was located better than expected  only short walk to bus stop from which frequent buses need 5 mins to CBD.We even got something priceless from Duncan (no further details to avoid everyone expecting this)"),
("2019-01-15", "4164487", "Sekou", "Hi  I travel a lot  staying in airbnb's all over the world and they were the best hosts I ever had. Not saying the other places were't great but the were the best. I would urge everyone visiting Sydney to stay here if they can. It super comfortable  clean  one stop from central Sydney  affordable  and their kindness is on another level."),
("2015-01-06", "4413137", "Lucrezia", "Everything was perfect! The couple is very nice and the house is in a perfect spot very clean and the atmosphere was perfect for the christmas period :)thank you very much ragazzi!!!:)"),
("2016-09-05", "4413137", "Katarina", "Nicearea close to beach"),
("2015-01-31", "4502957", "Andrew", "It would be difficult to overestimate how fantastic Hannah was as a host. We arrived in Sydney having been let down only 24 hours before arriving when our previous host gave us a late cancellation. We needed a property that could accommodate five children and Hannah came up trumps.Hannah remained in constant contact with us throughout that stressful arrival day and offered us her house for the week. She was an absolute lifesaver and rescued our holiday. (For the record  Lisa Peterson of L'Abode Accommodation let us down with the cancellation and never inquired about our welfare throughout our stay in Sydney !)Onto the house  it was beautiful  well equipped and a perfect location. Hannah and her family greeted us on our arrival and made us feel at home. We did not need anything extra and had a fantastic stay. We exchanged a couple of mails with Hannah during the week and knowing she was available was great.The shops are close - supermarkets / restaurants and it was quick and easy access to the City. Great spot.As I previously said  Hannah went out of her way to assist us and we are so grateful. Her house is perfect and if we are in Sydney again  I wouldn't hesitate to call Hannah again. 10 / 10......Lisa Peterson of L'Abode accommodation was just appalling. Just imagine arriving in a city 12 000 miles from home (Sydney from London) with a wife and five kids and having no accommodation  with it being cancelled just six hours before you got on the plane  but email and with no personalized apology. Then magnify that issue with a host that just didn't (and obviously still doesn't care). This has really affected my view of Airbnb and I am not an advocate of the process  especially as I appear to be unable to warm other travellers about L'Abode Accommodation. I suppose Trip Adviser might assist but Airbnb should consider this for future."),
("2016-01-05", "4502957", "Elise", "This was our first airbnb experience and it has been super positive. Hannah was very welcoming  sending us a beautiful info pack and answering our questions. We never met in person but felt she was available if we had any questions during our stay. The description of her place is accurate. Hannah has a flair for decorating and gardening and we loved the style of her house. We loved being able to walk to boutique shops  groceries  restaurants and of course THE beach! Our young teenage children would walk home from the beach on their own...Bondi has a hip young vibe and the house was always a great place to return to after a day at the beach or dinner at one of the many restaurants just around the corner. We would rent the house again if we ever return to Sydney."),
("2016-01-21", "4502957", "May", "Hannah and James were excellent hosts. Lots of local information provided and checked in with us every so often to see if everything ok. Clean homely place exactly as described..bigger than photos suggest. Highly recommend"),
("2016-02-09", "4502957", "Catalina", "We had great holidays at Hanna's house. The place is beautiful and very comfortable. Specially the kitchen and the garden.  The location is perfect. Hanna was a very good host  very helpful and kind with small details. Highly recommendable to spend holidays with the family! "),
("2016-02-20", "4502957", "Emma", "We were so excited about staying at Hannah's Bondi house with our son and friends from New Zealand. When we arrived  everyone was so happy about the fabulous location  the spacious size of the house and gorgeous garden complete with warm outdoor shower. We particularly liked the way the back of the kitchen could be opened up completely so the kids could run in and out. However  during our stay we started to notice a few things that didn't sit well with us. These were the issues we encountered: the upstairs toilet would flush during the night (waking us up); the flushing mechanism for the downstairs toilet wouldn't flush properly sometimes; three out of the four lights in the downstairs bathroom didn't work (which meant we were pretty much showering in the dark); the AC in the kitchen didn't work; on arrival we found old used soaps in both bathrooms; there were no instructions on how to connect to the internet;there was no ironing board  dustpan & brush  and only one plug for the two bathsWe got in touch with Hannah about some of these issues during our stay and indeed the bathroom lights were due to be fixed but this never happened. On our final morning when we were doing our final bits of packing  the cleaning team turned up half-an hour before check-out. We had very little warning about this and we felt this particularly unfair given we had two toddlers in the house. Overall  we felt that Hannah's house is not being kept/managed to a standard that warrants £326.00 a night. While we appreciate there will always be wear and tear in a family home  this property really needs some attention and updating. Erratic plumbing and broken lights shouldn't come as standard for a property at the price bracket. "),
("2017-12-26", "4502957", "Rahsaan", "Let’s start this review on a positive note. The property is a nice size for a family of 4. It’s located in a great area and accessible to lots of amenities and the beach. It’s got great commitment areas (like  the family room and the kitchen ). Hannah is a responsive host  who accommodated our request for an early check in. Yet  we got got off to a rocky start. The property had a number of challenges (e.g.  excessive dust & cobwebs throughout  bugs  malfunctioning lightning  chipped dishes  moldy smelling & outdated bathrooms  hard to use or leaking showers  etc.). We had to have the cleaners come back and still had to clean ourselves. It’s never good when you discover previous guests underwear under beds and need to treat for ants. For the price point  it’s hard for me to recommend this property (regardless of size of home and location)."),
("2018-01-02", "4502957", "Katie", "This was a great place. Very big by Sydney standards and amazing location. We really enjoyed the short walk to Bondi Beach every day.A few maintenance issues here and there from previous tenants however Hannah was very responsive and helpful when these were raised."),
("2018-02-22", "4502957", "Denise", "This is the most perfect Bondi location. A great spacious home with a garden and exceptional kitchen space.  Great feel and so close to shops  restaurants and the beach."),
("2018-06-02", "4502957", "Nina", "HI Hannah My husband and I loved our stay in your beautiful home.The location in Bondi within walking distance off the beach and all the great resturaunts was great thank so much for all your great local tips..we loved Lox Stock & Barrel for breakfasts!All the beds were so comfortable and we loved your linen sheets.The kitchen and backyard were so great for long lunches and we loved the fireplace next to the TV for movie nights.We had such a great stay and really appreciate you looking after us so well.We look forward to staying again when we are next in town!Thanks Nina"),
("2018-07-22", "4502957", "Jennifer", "Beautiful and cozy house in the most amazing location  just minutes from Bondi restaurants  shops and the beach! The kitchen was very well stocked  with beautiful little touches arranged for our arrival. We were made to feel very welcome! Having the entire house meant our family of five could relax with enough room! I thoroughly recommend booking this place!"),
("2018-08-28", "4502957", "Linda", "Hannah's home is spacious and very well equiped  especially if you like to cook or barbecue.  Everything was clean and ready for our arrival and she provided a welcome package which included bread  milk and various snacks. While it is very well set up for families  especially those with young children  it would also be suitable to 3 or 4 couples.   It is conveniently located about 5 minutes for the high street where you can find a butcher  a grocer  a bakery and a delicatessan as well a number of cafes and restaurants.    It is about a 10 minute walk from Bondi Beach  so a perfect location for anyone looking for a beach holiday.   Hannah was very quick to respond to our questions and gave us some helpful suggestions as to things to do while we were there.   It was a 5 star visit."),
("2018-12-09", "4502957", "Lucas", "Great accommodation  good location and friendly and responsive host."),
("2018-12-18", "4502957", "Alvin", "Great location  good for a family stay  feels like home"),
("2019-01-14", "4502957", "Ashlyn", "The house is in a great location for access to Bondi Beach.  It is on a quiet street and away from the noise of Bondi.  The house would be suitable for families."),
("2014-12-12", "4499095", "Andrew", "Dino’s apartment is presented at an exceptional boutique-hotel standard with additions such as a full working kitchen  laundry and fresh linen. The position of the apartment is in one of Sydney’s most sort after locations and just moments (2 minutes) walk to Sydney Harbour. The view through to the water past the iconic Moreton Bay Fig tree is tranquil and beautiful. The man himself is a perfect host whom is both easy going and professional. He was a pleasure to converse with as well. The apartment is decorated immaculately in a light and white Sydney contemporary style with controllable lighting  a HiFi stereo as well as a large television in both the lounge and main bedroom.The main bedroom has a view through the trees from the balcony to Elizabeth Bay and is fairly envy making. You can keep all the windows and balcony door open with no fear of intruders due to the height. That makes it an even nicer space to come home to after a day in the sun.In addition  it’s the little details that make this place stand out. Things such as a quality iron and ironing board for business shirts  a washer that come with good detergent as opposed to the cheapest and about a thousand fresh towels. It is effectively a luxury home.I had friends over for dinner and we were stunned at the quality of the kitchen equipment as well as the number of serving platters  tumblers  champagne and wine glasses.When I lived in the country years ago and nearby  finding a car space could take hours. Dino has a car space with electronic entry. It's the envy of the area and a bonus for anyone hiring a car.I thoroughly recommend this apartment  which will probably be permanently booked out when people find out how good it is. "),
("2015-01-05", "4499095", "Amed", "Dino was such a great host. The check-in/out process was seamless. The apartment itself was amazing. It was well equipped   clean and very well decorated. The location is great  as the apartment is centrally located in Elizabeth Bay neighborhood. We had a wondeful time in Dino’s apartment  and would definitely recommend Dino's place to anyone considering visiting Sydney."),
("2015-02-08", "4499095", "Paul", "Dino was a superb host and the apartment is beautifully presented in a charming neighbourhood close to everything and exactly as it was advertised. The pictures are 100% accurate. Everything was immaculate on our arrival with beautiful fresh orchids in every room - just gorgeous. Very private and secluded accommodation and the onsite parking was a bonus. Highly recommended  we'd stay again in a heartbeat."),
("2015-02-15", "4499095", "Maarit", "Dino's home is such a wonderful place to stay. The unit is superb: nicely furnished  very clean  quiet yet perfectly located in Elizabeth Bay  and it features all comforts of home. It accommodates four people very well. Dino was polite  welcoming host and easy to deal with. We can highly recommend staying in this place. "),
("2015-02-21", "4499095", "Lucy Blair", "Dino responded really promptly and was so easy to deal with. He was already in Europe when we arrived  so his friend  Rick let us in and get us oriented. Rick was so lovely and had lots of great tips about the neighborhood. The description and pictures aren't accurate - the place is EVEN BETTER! It's stunning. Absolutely stunning. And so tranquil. We would love to stay there again. And we'd love for Dino to design our apartment! "),
("2015-02-28", "4499095", "Colin", "Dino was out of the country when I arrived so his friend Rick handled check-in and check-out.  All went smoothly.  Rick's a nice guy - very friendly and helpful.The apartment is excellent.  Spacious  stylish  nice quiet residential block  good location.  A few minutes walk to Macleay Street  pleasant 20 minute walk to the Botanic Gardens and CBD.  Thanks Dino  I wish I could have stayed longer. "),
("2015-03-12", "4499095", "Fernando", "Dino's flat is amazingly beautiful. It's minimalist on it's best. Fully equipped  everything you absolutely need. Kitchen is also fully equipped. It's located in the beautiful Elisabeth Bay neighbourhood  you can pretty much walk to everywhere from there... full of cafes and nice restaurant. "),
("2015-05-27", "4499095", "Jason", "I couldn't have asked for a better experience for my stay in Sydney. Dino was a fantastic host  always accessible and helpful and his apartment is perfectly sleek chic  and in a great location.  Many thanks Dino for a very stress free and relaxing stay. "),
("2015-06-20", "4499095", "Robert", "The apartment in Elizabeth Bay is quite excellent and in very convenient location.  It is very close the shopping street of Potts Point  but a couple of blocks away and therefore much quieter.  The flat faces towards Sydney harbour  and there are glimpses of the water  but it is very private because of large trees outside the windows.   The building is also very quiet and I heard no noise from any neighbours.The flat is also beautifully designed   in a modern clean  taste   with all the facilities one needs for a short or long stay.  It is very well equipped for a comfortable stay with all the facilities one needs for cooking  relaxing and working  with good Wi-Fi.  The flat has the feeling of Dino's own  refined taste  yet with a homely feeling due to books  a comfortable sofa  fresh linen and bedding and a good (Website hidden by Airbnb) covered parking is very convenient and there is also a city bus stop just around the corner.   One could not wish for a better apartment. "),
("2015-07-06", "4499095", "Geoff", "Our stay at Dino's apartment was fantastic. The lead-up was straightforward with clear communication between Dino and us. The apartment is very well appointed  with more than meets the eye . The main bed was the most comfortable we have slept in! Location is brilliant with coffee shops  markets and transport close by. Great walks in the early morning around Rushcutters Bay and one morning we walked into the CBD via Wooloomooloo  the gardens and the Opera House. Rick managed our arrival and departure in a friendly and welcoming manner  and I would have no hesitation in recommending this apartment - I am sure we will stay there again."),
("2015-07-12", "4499095", "Jarryd", "Dino's apartment was beautifully decorated and was situated in the perfect location at Elizabeth bay. Dino was out of town at the time however his friend Rick was very helpful with the check in and answered all of my queries. I highly recommend staying here and will hopefully return soon!!"),
("2015-07-28", "4499095", "Xanny", "The apartment was fantastic- exactly as described and checking in and out processes were both straightforward and easy. It's a lovely  peaceful place; incredible given how central and ideal the location is ! The area is the best in Sydney  just minutes from the best restaurants and cafes  situated right between Elizabeth Bay and Rushcutters Bay- perfect for pleasant walks along the marina. We loved it and would love to stay in Dino's place again. "),
("2015-08-07", "4499095", "Adam", "Dino's place in Elizabeth Bay is fantastic!Great apartment with everything you need for a short stay. Very modern with fm great finishes throughout the apartment with a great little view of the bay from the lounge room. It's a perfect spot for being close to the city and public transport to get everywhere you need. This is a very busy area of the inner east of Sydney and what I was very happy about is that it was nice and quiet- even on the weekends.Rick who is Dino's friend who organises the check in's was very friendly and very reliable in communication and it was a pleasure to meet him. There is basically nothing to fault with this apartment. All I can say to people is that you should like a very firm memory foam mattress to sleep on. I love my medium firm mattress I have back home and it did take me a couple of nights of sleeping to get use to the great firm mattress Dino has in his apartment.The bed is fantastic and the heating (including the heated floors in the bathroom)Is great for the cooler months in Sydney.I would definitely stay here again! 10/10!"),
("2015-09-21", "4499095", "Yvon", "We were lucky to have booked Dino's place last minute as we decided to stay longer in Sydney. The appt is quite popular and there are good reasons for that!Communication & Check inFast feedback and smooth communication although Dino was in a different timezone when we booked. Rick helped us to check in and was real friendly and showed us around in the house.LocationWas just perfect. Quite central and can walk to all the major popular area's. Also very close to King's cross and Wooloomooloo but the street is nice and quite. Also within 5-min walking distance to good super market and upscale dining. The appartmentWe are also really big on modern interirors and designs. Dino's the place was a real gem. You cann see that he has invested substantial enegery and money to decorate but also to maintain the place. Top quality materials everywhere  but also top quality amenities. Dino really cares. Everything is custom made and built in  which made the appartment feel real spacious without compromising on the number of facilities. We were with the two of us  but the sofa bed in the study room can cater for another 2 if needed.FacilitiesEverything worked perfectly  but we really loved the floor heating in the bathroom as spring was just starting and Sydney was still quite chilly. Dino also had his own parking space  which was a real plus as parking can get quite pricey in Sydney. The bed was comfy and Dino had a nice selection of books and cd's which made the stay really enjoyable as well.   "),
("2015-10-06", "4499095", "Xiaobin", "The building and interior is great. And easy to catch bus 311 which can go to the city. Very quite and nice neighborhood areas. Recommend to who wants a quite holiday."),
("2015-10-24", "4499095", "Cathy", "Dino's apartment is just perfect. Beautiful  very well equipped in a dream neighbourhood for foodies. Dino is also the perfect host. Thank you."),
("2015-11-25", "4499095", "Hallie", "Dino was a fantastic accommodating host with a simply gorgeous apartment. Totally professional and wonderful on all levels.This apartment is a MUST.."),
("2015-12-09", "4499095", "Dean", "Lovely apartment and location. A friend of Dino meet me to let me in and the place was perfectly clean and welcoming."),
("2015-12-13", "4499095", "Isabel", "We had a lovely time during our stay in Sydney in Dino's apartment. It's a great location with a view through the trees on the harbour from the 5th floor. The area is superb with restaurants  bars and a grocery store in walking distance. The apartment itself was super modern and stylish - just what you expect from an architect - and looks just like in the pictures. We were welcomed by Rick  a friend of Dino  who is taken care of the apartment when he is away. Communication was great from both of them and we felt well taken care of. Definitely would recommend the place :)"),
("2016-01-27", "4499095", "Hans", "Hello dino  your Appartement was beautiful - the best we ever had! It's a dream  the place  very quiet  central position  the Architektur  furniture and equipment. Thanks for all. We like to come again. All the best  hans Jörg & jin"),
("2016-03-05", "4499095", "Jude", "We had a lovely time during our stay in Sydney. Dino’s apartment is in a nice quiet neighbourhood and central position. Its an easy walk to Kings cross Train station and restaurants. Wooloomooloo is also a easy walk away.We were welcomed by Rick  a friend of Dino  who is taken care of the apartment when he is away. Communication was great from both of them and we felt well taken care of. I can recommed a good coffee from  “ Poppies “ on the corner owned by a lovely Greek family always served with a smile and a chat!Many thanks Dino"),
("2016-04-04", "4499095", "Sherman", "Amazing apartment. Modern interior  awesome design with well detailed decor. Quiet surrounding with many nice cafe for coffee and excellent breakfast. Smooth communication with Dino  and a big thanks here to Rick for helping us check in late at 11 pm.Have to say it is one of the best apartment in AirBnb i've ever stay in. "),
("2016-04-10", "4499095", "Laura", "We really enjoyed our stay in Dino's beautiful apartment in Elizabeth Bay and it was very difficult to leave. Dino is a great host and communication is prompt and easy. The apartment is well situated close to great cafes  restaurants  lovely parks and stunning views of the Bay's along the many wonderful walks we enjoyed and not far from the many wonderful sights and venues that Sydney has to offer. We are very fussy with our bedding and Dino's bed is extremely comfortable. I recommend Lizzies next door for fresh delicious food if you want to eat in and Fratelli Paradiso on Challis Ave for great coffee. Our stay at Dino's lovely apartment was wonderful and we hope we will be able to visit again.  We have also enjoyed a stay in Dino's apartment in Lucca Italy last year  both places are beautifully styled (a testament to Dino's good taste and flare for design).  We thank you Dino for allowing us to stay in both places and your apartment in Elizabeth Bay was wonderful."),
("2016-05-14", "4499095", "Dean", "I've stayed at Dino's place before and enjoyed it again this time. Lovely apartment in a great location!"),
("2016-05-19", "4499095", "Cathy", "It's the second time I've had the pleasure to stay at Dino's apartment. It feels like home. Great location. Great amenities.  Super clean. Great Wifi. Great host. There's no better place to stay in Sydney. Thanks Dino! Hope to be back soon."),
("2016-06-25", "4499095", "Eric", "Great apartment in a very secure building in an upscale neighborhood on the water.  Tons of cafe options  some really good restaurants with diverse cuisine  and parks with a lot of green and great views. Dino and Rick are very friendly and helpful. Wonderful experience. "),
("2016-07-12", "4499095", "Melody", "The apartment is just like in the photos and there are 2 great cafes where you can get the famed aussie brekkies. Yums! Location is pretty good but avoid going through King's Cross station if you are coming back late. Instead  there is a bus (311) you can take from Central station that goes right to the door of the apartment. Only downside is that the birds/animals? nesting in trees in front of the bedroom can be noisy at night. Haven't figured out what they are since i always thought that birds sleep at night... But all in still a good stay!    "),
("2016-07-27", "4499095", "Juana", "My first Air bnb (being the sceptic who is used to the luxury of 5 stars hotel) and it blew me off. In love with Dino place and all his collections/ taste. Regretted not booking a longer stay. Would love to be able to visit Dino's place in Lucca one day. Already singing praises about Dino' s place to friends and will have no second thought about staying there again.Thank you Dino & Rick."),
("2016-08-24", "4499095", "Emily", "Great area and lovely apartment in Elizabeth bay. Everything as described. We'd stay again!"),
("2016-10-23", "4499095", "Beatriz", "Tengo que poner un 10 al apartamento  a la zona y a Dino. Todo han sido facilidades y la comunicación abierta en todo momento. El apartamento tiene de todo. DE TODO. Es muy cómodo  con mucha luz que le hace muy agradable y la decoración y el cuidado con que están escogidos los detalles le dan aún más valor. La zona me ha encantado también. A unos 10-15 minutos de una estación de tren y el autobus al lado del edificio. Lo recomiendo sin ninguna duda. No tiene ninguna pega."),
("2016-11-06", "4499095", "Michael", "Great location with a modern  clean and spacious interior. Nice views of Elizabeth Bay and close to cafes and all that Potts Point has to offer. Dino was super helpful through the check in and check out process too."),
("2016-11-17", "4499095", "Anne", " Très belle prestation  bel emplacement de nombreux magasins et restaurants  à proximité du centre et de l'opéra. J'ai pu tout visiter en marchant  à recommander pour une ou deux personnes."),
("2016-11-26", "4499095", "Alex", "Harry Seidler architectural masterpiece. Great light and inspiring place. Excellent location in Elizabeth Bay/Rushcutters Bay. Very well equipped and maintained. Sydney as its best!"),
("2016-12-05", "4499095", "Beth", "Dino's apartment is great. It's in a neighborhood that is ""real"" (changing for the better with few tourists) with plenty of great restaurants (we recommend Cho Cho San and Ms G's - both easy walks). His style is appealing  quite minimalist with no handles showing  all white and mirrors  and easy furniture. We appreciated having a balcony to sit on with a glass of wine after sightseeing. Even though we didn't meet Dino himself  communications were easy and efficient and he arranged for us to arrive early after our 17 hour flight from the US (6 AM arrival at SYD). Public transport is very convenient  both bus and train. We walked to Circular Quay to start our first day. We highly recommend a stay at Ithaca Gardens! Thank you  Dino. "),
("2016-12-19", "4499095", "Phil", "Wonderful place  great setup  great neighborhood. Would recommend to anyone staying in Sydney for a few days or a few weeks."),
("2017-02-07", "4499095", "Marjan", "Het appartement ligt in Elizabeth Bay  een aangename  rustige buurt. Winkels en openbaar vervoer kortbij. Als ik in Sydney zou moeten wonen  zou ik zeker daar naar een woonst zoeken!!"),
("2017-04-25", "4499095", "Stephan", "Beautiful apartment with an ultimate clean design in a quiet part of Elizabeth Bay. Excellent cafes  restaurants and everything else you need close by. Dino is a wonderful host  communication  check-in and check-out were straight forward and everything worked out perfectly. His tips for cafes/restaurants were very good. His place is fully equipped. Apartment comes with a parking space  which is very convenient since parking in Sydney is either tough or unbelievably expensive. Recommend to walk as much as possible  since both public transportation and self driving are not much fun in Sydney. Should we be in Lucca in the future  we will try to book Dino's place there as well."),
("2017-05-23", "4499095", "Thomas", "My best ever ABB stay-full stop. All the positive things you'll read in other reviews about Dino's place are true. High standards  amazing location in a quiet neighborhood . Great communication. Highly recommend."),
("2017-06-02", "4499095", "Andrew", "This is a gem of an apartment in much sought after Elizabeth Bay. The very clean and well furnished apartment itself is on a quiet street and has views of the sea. Cafes and restaurants are just a few steps away."),
("2017-06-10", "4499095", "David", "A very nice and stylish flat in a great neighborhood - peaceful but just steps from several cafes for breakfast and a five-minute walk from lots of nice restaurants and shops in Potts Point. We were in Sydney to scout a neighborhood to live in and this was central to many parts of the city. Dino was responsive to queries and his rep in the neighborhood was friendly and available for help when needed. Would warmly recommend the address."),
("2017-08-26", "4499095", "Millie", "We stayed at Dino's place for three weeks while we moved back from the UK to Sydney. The apartment really is an oasis. Dino has taken a great deal of trouble in its design and it contains every convenience one can think of (including a very marvellous CD collection). It was the perfect base for us. It's location can't be bettered  we don't think. Thanks a lot Dino."),
("2017-10-10", "4499095", "Robert", "We loved our stay at Dino’s beautiful apartment close to popular cafes  restaurants and bars.  A short walk to nearby parks and approximately a 20-minute walk to the Sydney Botanical Gardens/Opera house.  The apartment is clean  modern and spacious.  We could have easily stayed longer!"),
("2018-01-02", "4499095", "Matt", "Great space in a great location  would definitely recommend it!"),
("2018-01-15", "4499095", "John", "Stayed for ten days  good price  location.  Love to walk so enjoyed walking everywhere.  Through Rushcutters to Double Bay  Verona Cinema on Oxford St  Woollahra and Botanical Gardens/City via Woolloomooloo.  Although Uber arrive within minutes.  Would stay again."),
("2018-10-26", "4499095", "Sean", "Dino's apartment is exactly as described and is well equipped.   The beds are very comfortable and the apartment is well suited to anyone with mobility problems as there is step-free access from the street to the apartment.  Unfortunately our stay was constantly plagued by noise from works in the building  during the whole 4 weeks.   There was concrete cutting  drilling  hammering  etc  which made staying the apartment during the day very unpleasant.   But it was quiet and pleasant in the evenings."),
("2018-11-18", "4499095", "Faith", "Great location  lovely decor  responsive host."),
("2019-01-02", "4499095", "Nick", "Great apartment and amazing location. Handy for everything. Very comfortable and had everything we needed. Highly recommend."),
("2016-11-29", "4448723", "Deon", "Dont think you can ask for more from the host and the accommodation. No excuses here. If you are creative you can make almost anything with the kitchenette. Perfect location. All the privacy you need and conversation (mostly by text) but the host is always happy to pop in. Bed is comfortable and all the netflix ypu can have at your leisure. Go for it!"),
("2016-12-08", "4448723", "Melani", "Michele immediately responded to our request to stay at her place. Her place is very clean  comfortable and safe. The location is quite and relaxing  but also a few streets away busy with restaurants and plenty of coffee shops. Michele made us feel welcome. Thank you  Michele."),
("2016-12-12", "4448723", "Stefano", "Nice accommodation and close to the active area of Newtown.Really caretaking hosts."),
("2016-12-14", "4448723", "Shane", "Great spot with very welcoming & helpful hosts."),
("2016-12-31", "4448723", "혜정", "호스트 미쉘은 엄청 친절하고 연락도 잘되는 호스트에요! 연말 연시라 걱정되는 것도 많았는데 잘챙겨주고 배려도 많이 해주었어요 트램에서 조금 걸어야 하지만 집도 깔끔하고 주변에 유명한 곳이나 음식이 많아서 좋았어요! 그리고 간단한 과일이나 잼이 있어서 꺼내 먹을수도 있어요! 시드니에서 즐거운 시간을 보낼수 있게 해주었어요! 숙소를 찾는다면 여길 추천할께요!!Michelle is a very friendly and good host! We are many worries about the holiday season  but I felt good about taking care of us. I had a little walking from Newtown station  but it was nice house  and a lot of famous places. We have a great time in Sydney! If you find accommodations  I recommend you here!"),
("2017-01-06", "4448723", "Mario", "Michele was so helpful and accommodating during my trip to Sydney. She was on point with anything extra I needed and even though the hallway between the main room and bathroom is just behind a partition I never felt like my privacy was compromised. Definitely recommend staying here if Newtown is convenient for your time in Sydney."),
("2017-01-17", "4448723", "James", "Lovely clean and quiet little space. Michele's communication was excellent. Would love to stay again."),
("2017-01-28", "4448723", "Elaine", "The place is so clean and it pretty much has everything you need inside  just like the hotel! "),
("2017-02-02", "4448723", "Kim", "Lovely hip street  Michele was a really lovely helpful host and the accomodation was clean and comfortable!"),
("2017-02-06", "4448723", "Ellen", "Easy and welcoming communication before we arrived.Arriving late at night was no problem at all.The place was spotless well equipped comfortable and beautiful (Website hidden by Airbnb) not expect to have fresh fruit coffee tea shampoo etc. provided awesome!The place was an entirely private section of a family home perfectly cool on a hot summer day and very close to all great things in Newtown.Would certainly stay there again!"),
("2017-02-14", "4448723", "Brian", "I was only able to stay at Michele's location for the one night  upon arrival to Australia prior to other arrangements. It's a good quiet neighborhood and I had a good quiet stop. I stretched my legs a bit for a nice long walk from there to Chinatown and back  was able to use the Wifi for all my work needs  and appreciated the milk and berries & grapes available in the fridge. "),
("2017-02-28", "4448723", "Laura", "Michele is an amazing host  thoughtful  considerate  she made sure from the start we'd have a great stay at her place.Don't think twice  just book it!Thanks again Michele :)"),
("2017-03-04", "4448723", "Amy", "Michele's place is in a great location  in a lovely green neighbourhood that's an easy walk to the train and all of the action. Communication was great  and she kindly let us store our bags until we left for our flight later in the day. "),
("2017-03-21", "4448723", "Eleanor", "I only stayed at Michele's for one night but I'll definitely be back next time that I'm in Sydney! The accomodation was perfect  so close to the main streets of Newtown and public transport whilst also being secluded enough that I was able to relax and wind down during the night. The room had everything I could have asked for and even felt like my own little hotel suite. Michele was nothing but accomodating throughout my entire stay and I'd definitely recommend staying here to anybody thinking about it. "),
("2017-03-25", "4448723", "Clark", "Michele gave us a warm welcome and explained the suite to us on arrival. Place is handy to Newtown and public transport. Sofa bed was comfortable  and has a little kitchenette which is ideal for staying a few nights. Bathroom is brand new and very functional given the size. I would certainly recommend Michelle's place to other travellers."),
("2017-03-30", "4448723", "Raj", "I had a great stay here in my old neighborhood  in the two days before my wedding. As a former local I can attest to the convenient location  it's a short walk to the heart of Newtown.The place was very clean and Michele has thought of everything to ensure a comfortable stay. She's a very attentive host  friendly and helpful and respectful of privacy. Can highly recommend staying here if you're looking for the inner west experience. "),
("2017-04-04", "4448723", "Kylie", "Stunning place to relax in a beautiful part of Sydney! Michele could not have done more to make us feel welcome! Fantastic communication  easy to find and little extras like beautiful fresh fruit for an early breakfast made our stay extra special. Loved it! Thank you! "),
("2017-04-06", "4448723", "Alistair", "Michele was very quick to respond to enquiry  nice clean room in a quiet street  only stayed one night but would be a great place to stay for a longer trip"),
("2017-04-23", "4448723", "Josie", "Fantastic accomidation. Clean and comfortable room. Small touches to make your stay enjoyable. Respectful and friendly hosts. We will be staying again. Thank you so much!"),
("2017-05-04", "4448723", "Amanda", "Great location and studio very well equipped. Easy access to city and night life in Newtown."),
("2017-05-06", "4448723", "Zoe", "I felt well looked after at Michele's place. Great location on a quite residential street but really close to lovely bars  cafe's  food and transport.  Good communication and much care taken. "),
("2017-05-17", "4448723", "Asahi", "Michele is an incredible host. She is always in contact and responsive to all our queries. The room is cozy  clean  convenient and with nice amenities. Pretty near to king street (hip venue for hip bars  clothes and food)."),
("2017-06-03", "4448723", "Rohan", "So kind and accommodating  thanks Michele for your understanding and hospitality. Stellar!"),
("2017-06-08", "4448723", "Richard", "A welcoming touch was some fresh fruit and a jug of milk in the fridge. A quiet tree-lined street  with a few planes flying over in the evenings (not-too-loud). An easy walk to the restaurants of King Street. We'll stay again."),
("2017-06-12", "4448723", "Makeda", "Perfect  affordable and private for a young couple. Feel like we were really catered to. Michele has excellent attention to detail. We had a really nice time. Thanks again!"),
("2017-06-22", "4448723", "John", "Put simply  this is the best value place you can stay in the Sydney inner city. Amazing location  and set up  if you're local or from overseas do not pass this place up!"),
("2017-06-28", "4448723", "Kimberley", "Michele was a fantastic host and always willing to help out with requests! The place itself is exactly as pictured  if not better as the sofa bed has been upgraded to a real bed. It is clean and the kitchenette is well stocked. Would definitely recommend staying here to my friends and would consider staying here again next time. It is a short 10min walk to Newtown station which is a few stops from the city centre which is really convenient. "),
("2017-07-11", "4448723", "Jon", "A great room to hang out in around Sydney. Was close to Newtown and plenty of restaurants and shops. We walked everywhere."),
("2017-07-26", "4448723", "Rebecca", "Michele is a wonderful host and the suite is fantastic. Great location  comfortable and cosy. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-07-27", "4448723", "Megan", "Michelle was really easy to deal with and made an emergency visit to elderly incapacitated parents much less stressful than it otherwise may have been."),
("2017-07-28", "4448723", "Amy", "We only had a short stay for a a quick trip to Sydney. This place was perfect: clean  close to local shops  venues and well equipped with all the essentials and more. Lovely modern bathroom and comfy bed."),
("2017-07-30", "4448723", "Tim", "Great place! Would happily go back. Clean  friendly and nice ambience in a good area in Sydney. Michele was a thoughtful host who had everything covered and organised."),
("2017-08-05", "4448723", "Itay", "Michele was incredibly welcoming and kind  helping us with any request or question. The apartment has a very comfy bed and a superb bathroom  and was neat and clean when we entered. The neighborhood is very quiet  although it is only a short walking distance (about 8 minutes) from the train station  several pubs and coffee places and lots of restaurants. The only drawback is having a central air conditioning system  controlled from Michele's part of the house right next to the partition  though whenever heating was needed she quickly turned it on (responding in just a minute or two).Overall  this is an excellent value for your money's worth  and I highly recommend it."),
("2017-08-07", "4448723", "Adrian", "Michelle's place has a great feel and is more like a studio apartment. The private bathroom is a bonus and the privacy provided by a simple divider in the hallway is adequate while allowing for the homeliness of not being totally isolated from the family life of the house. Everything is brand new but one gets the impression that  even if it wasn't it would still be beautifully presented in Michelle's wonderful style. She has thought of everything which makes the stay a memorable experience."),
("2017-08-10", "4448723", "Lottie", "房间很好 超级干净｡洗手间也很漂亮｡房东人超nice 送了我们草莓和牛奶｡但是隔音不是很好 而且冬天住的话有点冷 暖气是整个房子的 关上房间门就没有暖气了｡"),
("2017-08-12", "4448723", "Jayde", "Michele place is perfect in every way. Michele provides every thing you would need and has created a space that feels homely. The bathroom is INCREDIBLE! Wish i had that at my house and the bed is extremely comfortable. Plus great location!Would highly recommend this to everyone."),
("2017-08-14", "4448723", "Marissa", "A lovely quiet location close to the best in Newtown  plus a short walk to the train station. Really clean  comfy bed  2 big sofas  as new bathroom  lots of coffee pods and a little fridge. Highly recommend."),
("2017-08-18", "4448723", "Bernadette", "Thanks Michelle. Your home is beautiful. Love the new bathroom. Very comfortable bed. Really enjoyed the coffee/ tea and breakfast. A wonderful gem. I hope to come back."),
("2017-08-21", "4448723", "Paula", "Michelle had great communication prior to arriving and then during our stay.Everything was as expected.Fully recommend to anybody wanting to stay in Newtown.We loved the town vibe and I purchased lots of retro gems  the people were friendly and cafes great all within walking distance. Had a wonderful time :)"),
("2017-08-24", "4448723", "Missy", "Michele is the perfect host and always quick to respond with any enquiry or information. The apartment is well located near King St Newtown and had everything I required to make my stay feel like home. You can choose to interact with the rest of the house or remain tucked away in private if that is your preference. Definitely putting it on my list of ""go to"" places to stay when I am in Sydney."),
("2017-08-25", "4448723", "Karen", "This accomodation is best value for money in the inner west area. Very close to everything and Michele has thought of everything to make my stay comfortable  very clean and tidy and with added coffee machine and breakfast cereals included. Could not fault this accomodation at all  also very private. Well done Michele certainly would stay again. Karen"),
("2017-09-03", "4448723", "Sammy &", "We had a great stay at Michele's  it was private  cosy and had all the comforts of home. Would highly recommend it to anyone wanting an easy experience in a great part of Newtown."),
("2017-09-08", "4448723", "Andrew", "Michele's place is comfortable and convenient .. and a lovely place to stay :)"),
("2017-09-10", "4448723", "Eliza", "Had the perfect stay at Michele's place. Everything is clean  comfy and as advertised and I had everything I needed. Location is great as well! Would definitely stay here again when next in Sydney. Thanks so much Michele!"),
("2017-09-19", "4448723", "Ludivine", "The accommodation of Michele is very clean and very practical! The bedding is really very comfortable. Michele is an attentive host and very attentive. I highly recommend this accommodation. Also the area is great close to everything but very quiet."),
("2017-09-21", "4448723", "Sue", "Michele's place was wonderful; luxurious  comfortable  convenient  quiet and private. Michele has thought of everything that makes a stay easy and enjoyable. I enjoyed trying the local pubs and cafes  and exploring the historic streets. Top accommodatin!"),
("2017-09-22", "4448723", "Damon", "Comfy bed  grey shower Really close to Newton main shops. Enjoyed our stayThanks Michelle"),
("2017-09-24", "4448723", "Monica", "Great value  comfortable place  easy walk to trains  cafes  restaurants  pubs  etc.  Would stay here again."),
("2017-09-27", "4448723", "Christopher", "This is a beautiful room with great amenities and wonderfully provate! Michele was great at staying in contact and made me feel really welcome. I'd recommend her place to anyone!"),
("2017-10-01", "4448723", "Nikolett", "Michele’s place was an awesome stay. It was close enough to Newtown to walk to all the cafes and bars. The room is spacious and very comfortable with amenities to cook small meals if needed. The shower was great and looked very new. The bed was cozy and there was no noise from the street!I think Michele has really got everything perfected to the last detail. Great value for money and we hope to stay again sometime!"),
("2017-10-04", "4448723", "Cheryl", "Michele was super communicative and thoughtful. Her space is very comfortable  and the bathroom is spa-like! I also really loved the location; close to transit and fun restaurants and shops  but a quiet and lovely neighbourhood."),
("2017-10-08", "4448723", "Heema", "Good host who was easy to communicate with :) place was nice and clean with all necessary amenities. Location was as stated  located 10mins walk from Newtown station which is super handy and close to all the shops  food and bar. Overall  lovely  10/10!"),
("2017-10-23", "4448723", "Chris", "Very well provisioned place. Friendly and diligent hostess. Very comfortable and as advertised. Thanks Michelle."),
("2017-10-25", "4448723", "Jessica", "Easy to find  great location  easy parking and a lovely clean  fresh and tidy place to stay. The bathroom was spotless!!"),
("2017-10-29", "4448723", "Gary", "Easy to find  great location  modern  clean and tidy place to stay. Good host who was easy to communicate with. 10mins walk from Newtown station  shops  food and pubs"),
("2017-11-06", "4448723", "Paul", "Excellent location and spacious suite with integral bathroom.I enjoyed my stay.Michele was also very responsive and helpful to my requests."),
("2017-11-11", "4448723", "Dan", "Very nice accommodations. Friendly and helpful host. Clean and convenient stay in Newtown  Sydney. Highly recommended."),
("2017-11-13", "4448723", "Scott", "Nice spot in Newtown... the best of Sydney.Michele is too easy to deal with."),
("2017-11-17", "4448723", "Molly", "Great location and perfect for one person or a couple. Very spacious room and comfrotable bed. An Excellent value."),
("2017-11-17", "4448723", "Paul", "A great place to stay  everything at your doorstep... Michele is a lovely host with a great property  the rooms were exceptionally clean and very well appointed  we were happy little campers indeed "),
("2017-11-18", "4448723", "Kayla", "Michele was very easy to communicate with and the home was very easy to find! She did an amazing job accommodating us in many ways even though we only stayed one night. The neighborhood reminds us a bit of Brooklyn  as we are from the States. It’s quiet  yet you can take a short stroll to a park  cafe  and a main strip of restaurants and shop! She has great WiFi  and we stayed in a bit to work before going out to explore. We used the coffee press and snacked on some fresh strawberries and cereal she supplied."),
("2017-11-24", "4448723", "Rob", "Im so appreciative of the time that Michele took out of her schedule to give me advice on where I could take my girlfriend for brekky and a massage  she went above and beyond  being helpful is a rare quality these days! The room had nice wooden floors  a high ceiling  comfy bed  was very well equipped and was private. The bathroom was super clean and modern. It was a quiet street but within walking distance of lots of cafes  pubs  restaurants  shops. I wont hesitate to stay again or to recommend to family and friends. Thanks for a great stay. Cheers  Rob and Sal"),
("2017-11-27", "4448723", "James", "A lovely cottage room and ensuite in the heart of beautiful Newtown. Close to the shopping strip  10 minutes from buses and trains  and Michele is lovely!"),
("2017-12-04", "4448723", "Pascal", "We had a great stay at this airbnb. The apartment was easy to access and Michele was very communicative and helpful. The apartment is well situated with close distance to both buses and the train station. Michele also provided some treats for us in the fridge upon arrival  which was very appreciated. However  we want to point out that the apartment is very perceptive. We got kindly told that we were too loud at 10:30 pm  and out of our four mornings we woke up to a screaming child twice. Apart from that we are very happy with this stay."),
("2017-12-07", "4448723", "Leon", "Excellent location close to Enmore road and Newtown station  very happy with everything that was provided - Michele was a terrific host. Especially liked the array of breakfast items  and the various appliances that were made available"),
("2017-12-17", "4448723", "Marieke", "A lovely spot! Couldn't be better located - a lively neighbourhood with lots to see and eat  close by the park and Newtown train station is only about 5min away - so only about 20-25 minutes to reach the Opera House and ferries. Michelle is helpful  but very respectful of privacy. Importantly - very comfortable bed!"),
("2017-12-28", "4448723", "Geoffrey", "Terrific place in a perfect location :) As the description says this is a room (& seperate bathroom) within a house - the area is partitioned from the rest of the house and has it's own door to the street  so it works. The room itself is terrific - Michele has made a lot of thoughtful touches (coffee  fresh milk etc) and it's very-clean. The area is perfect for exploring the inner-west of Sydney. Michele is a very responsive and generous host (inc kindly allowing us a later check-out due to our flights) - thank you!!"),
("2017-12-30", "4448723", "Fumi", "Very clean and warm place. We really enjoyed staying there."),
("2018-01-02", "4448723", "Lachlan", "Really nice and affordable place to stay with everything you need and more. Short walks to public transport to get to the city. Would highly recommend!"),
("2018-01-03", "4448723", "Jeff", "The place was very clean. Michele was very nice and accommodating. We would recommend this place to anybody."),
("2018-01-12", "4448723", "Brian", "Michele was very helpful host who communicated well. The room was very comfortable for our couple. It is located near Newtown stn  10 mins walking distance. Would stay here again!"),
("2018-01-17", "4448723", "Lauren", "We had a great stay and the apartment was self contained   spacious and very comfortable. Thank you!"),
("2018-01-22", "4448723", "Jen", "This place was a real gem - the perfect location  a wide range of amenities to accommodate your every need  provision of food assortments  and all at such a great value. Michele was beyond amazing  with impeccable communication  helpful tips  and flexibility with our check in and out times. Couldn't have asked for a better stay. Highly recommended and will definitely be returning next time we visit Sydney. Thanks for everything Michele! Kind Regards  Jen and Liam. "),
("2018-01-25", "4448723", "Travis", "Great spot."),
("2018-01-29", "4448723", "Dave", "Can’t recommend this place highly enough! It’s very close to the centre of Newtown  an up and coming suburb of Sydney with very good public transport access to the CBD/Opera House etc. Even an Uber to/from the airport is only roughly $25AUS! The place itself is perfect  you’re own secluded area of the house  cut off from the rest of it by a curtain  it very much feels like you’re own private space! Michele had even put out tea  coffee and cereal and fresh fruit  milk and cold water in the fridge for my own personal use. She’s really thought about everything!I would not hesitate to stay here again if I came to Sydney!"),
("2018-01-31", "4448723", "Gemma", "Great place to stay with a comfortable bed  great amenities and conveniently located. I really appreciated having breakfast readily available every morning before heading off for my day. Michele was really easy to communicate with too. Would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-02-05", "4448723", "Giordana", "Very quick responses and great communication. Nice residential quiet area with cafes and restaurants within walking distance."),
("2018-02-09", "4448723", "Anne", "I had a super smooth and comfortable stay. Newtown is a great  lively area  and I wish I had more time to poke around. I had a couple of snags with travel (broken lock  etc.) and Michelle was able to help me figure out a solution. The food/dishes situation is a little un-orthodox  but everything is clearly laid out  and works exactly as the description says. It was clean  quiet  stylish  and accessible to many interesting spots to check out & eat at. Textbook example of easy  restful place for my quick trip."),
("2018-02-15", "4448723", "Ben", "Really lovely studio apartment. Michelle was a fantastic host and really went out of her way to make sure everything about our stay was comfortable and convinient."),
("2018-02-18", "4448723", "Shakira", "Check in was all too easy and my partner and I really enjoyed coming back to the accommodation after a busy day of sight seeing.  It is very comfortable accommodation and Michele is extremely helpful and makes herself available if need be.  Newtown is a great spot also."),
("2018-02-19", "4448723", "Rachel", "Michele was quick with communications and provided a lovely  warm and well equipped place to stay.  The fruit bowl in the fridge was a lovely touch as was the ample breakfast provisions.A short walk will take you to the main street of Newtown with plenty of shops and the train station.I highly recommend staying here either for a short or longer term stay."),
("2018-02-22", "4448723", "Andrew", "Very convenient  private and well-resourced room near King Street  Newtown."),
("2018-02-25", "4448723", "Jenny", "Michele's place was as described  very clean  great that it had its own kitchenette for coffees and cereals/fruit provided which was a lovely touch. Wads a great location for us and private access to the street. Would recommend this air bnb to others.  A++"),
("2018-03-04", "4448723", "Roberta", "This Place is very good! Close to the train station and in a really nice area of Sydney! Communication with the host has been great! We really recomand this Place!"),
("2018-03-06", "4448723", "Kate", "Michele's place is centrally located close to the newtown vibe. We'll equipped and comfortable. Great communication."),
("2018-03-07", "4448723", "Marita", "What a gem! Great little hideaway in a fantastic location. Michele was an incredible host and communication was excellent. Do yourself a favour and book Michele's gorgeous place next time you're in Newtown/Camperdown."),
("2018-03-11", "4448723", "Naveen Jeremy", "Michele's place was conveniently located close to King street. The bathroom was clean and relatively new. It was not that difficult to find parking around in the area (over the weekend) and Michele was kind enough to provide visitor parking vouchers just in case we needed them.The large studio room has a door which isolated us from the rest of the house and we had our own bathroom. TipsWhere to eat: Cookoo Calley (near the Newtown station)Cairo Take awayThe rising sun Messina for dessertsEarl's Jukebox for drinks (slightly expensive but great atmosphere)Blood wood for dinner"),
("2018-03-17", "4448723", "Celine", "Me and my husband spend few days at the apartment and it was really nice!The indidications to go there are very clear and it's close of the train station at Newtown.It's a small apartment but very clean  all the staff we need to cook are there; I recommend this place to visit Sydney!"),
("2018-03-20", "4448723", "David", "Michele was a great host  with clear  easy communication and lovely small touches (fresh fruit in the fridge was great!)The place is in a perfect location  close to King Street and Newtown train station. Great secluded room with private entrance  exactly what we wanted! Thanks Michele :)"),
("2018-03-22", "4448723", "Kathrin", "My parents stayed at Michele's place for a few days and had a great time. Really good and fast communication and super easy check in as they arrived very late.  They had fresh fruit coffee and tea and a few other things which was awesome!  Definitely would stay again!  Thanks!"),
("2018-03-24", "4448723", "Chris", "We had a great stay at Micheles. Lovely new bathroom  the rest of the facilites suited us for our stay"),
("2018-03-25", "4448723", "Amanda", "Excellent facilities plus extras to make you feel at home - choice of teas and coffees  along with toiletries in the bathroom. Spacious and quiet room close to main street and train station."),
("2018-03-27", "4448723", "Karina", "This is a great space for 2 people  so clean and tidy and has everything you could need! So many lovely thoughtful touches. It is in a beautiful old building that has been restored perfectly. The location is excellent. It is in a quiet street  but a quick 5-10 min walk finds you in the heart of Newtown. Michele was so friendly and welcoming and made our stay very special. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-03-28", "4448723", "Michael", "Great place  good location  consideration given to the finer touches. Recommend!"),
("2018-04-02", "4448723", "Jayson", "It was a lovley time staying with Michele  she was very quick with replies and very accommodating with us. Allowing us to check in earlier  and providing us with a bunch of travel info with getting to the house from the airport and how to get around Sydney from the Airbnb aswell. Would definitely stay with again when coming back to Sydney."),
("2018-04-03", "4448723", "Federico", "This is a wonderful place to get some rest and explore the great Newtown area. Very clean and a great kitchennette.  Communication was also fast and clear! Great place!"),
("2018-04-06", "4448723", "幸", "Michele has a beautiful  clean and tidy room for couple or friends to stay. The room located in a quiet  safe and convenient place. She offered a lot help during our stay. Very recommended~"),
("2018-04-08", "4448723", "Natasha", "Michele was a wonderful host and we thoroughly enjoyed our stay. Her place is central and comfortable  close to restaurants and the train station. She responded to any queries quickly and helped make our stay as comfortable as possible. Thank you Michele."),
("2018-04-11", "4448723", "Fabrice", "Comfortable and close to public transport. Quiet at night  which I appreciated a lot."),
("2018-04-14", "4448723", "Melissa", "Michele’s place is wonderful. It’s in a nice quiet street but is close to everything in Newtown! We had a great time and will definitely be back!"),
("2018-04-17", "4448723", "Sadhana", "Lovely bed and shower. Excellent location. Comfortable couches. Cereal and proper coffee"),
("2018-04-19", "4448723", "Ursula", "We loved staying at Michèle’s place. It’s sparkling clean  spacious  comfortable and in a great location. Real coffee supplied and plenty of teas and condiments etc. Great value for money. Highly recommend. Thank you for a good stay."),
("2018-04-22", "4448723", "Mikayla", "Such a nice space to stay in  very close to newtown and easy to get around the city! My sister and I had a great time at Michele's house!"),
("2018-04-26", "4448723", "Ben", "Great spot and amazing room with all the mod cons. Shared corridor with partition to host's house but still very private."),
("2018-04-28", "4448723", "Natalie", "Had a great stay! Thank you Michele"),
("2018-05-01", "4448723", "Stephen", "One of the best Airbnbs we've ever stayed at. Great location  and a perfect space for a Sydney getaway. Newtown is brilliant and you couldn't ask for a better place to spend a long weekend away. Great access to Newtown  and just a few minutes from the Enmore. Perfect."),
("2018-05-08", "4448723", "Satti", "spacious  clean and very comfortable accommodation. Private front entry was great so I didn't disturb the family when coming in late. Gorgeous leafy suburb in a quiet area. Loads of nice wee shops and eating places within easy walking distance. loved the street art and general good vibe in the area.  felt very safe a a single female  traveller. only 10 minutes to train and buses so easy to get into the city centre. Highly recommended"),
("2018-05-10", "4448723", "Mark", "Michele’s place is lovely  great location   and quiet. Michele is a caring and helpful host couldn’t be happier...thanks Michele"),
("2018-05-13", "4448723", "Jill", "Great location  beyond clean & a cosy place to stay.Michele was such a great host  and was quick to help with anything.Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-16", "4448723", "Ali", "The room was nicely maintained and designed. All the required household were present which made our stay comfortable. Thanks."),
("2018-05-17", "4448723", "Jennifer", "Michele’s B&B is wonderfully located near cosmopolitan Newtown. 10 minute walk to Newtown Station while also being in a quiet area. Lovely presented room  spotlessly clean and comfortable . Perfect for a Sydney visit."),
("2018-05-20", "4448723", "Kristin", "A fantastic clean space right in the heart of Newtown/ Camperdown. Comply bed  sparkling new bathroom. Loved it"),
("2018-05-26", "4448723", "Monica", "Michele's place is in a great little neighborhood and a super quick walk to King's Street for amazing food options! The place is so cozy and we couldn't have asked for a better stay/location."),
("2018-05-30", "4448723", "Cliff", "A lovely space in an interesting area. Highly recommended."),
("2018-05-31", "4448723", "Paul", "This was perfect for me. I loved the Bluetooth speaker so I could access all my audio on my iPhone. Strawberries in the fridge. Air conditioning was great on the cold night."),
("2018-06-10", "4448723", "Leonie", "Nice quiet street a s very comfortable studio. Well located for exploring the Newtown area."),
("2018-06-13", "4448723", "Giordana", "Michele was wonderful to communicate with and a great host. The check in instructions were a bit confusing with two entrances  but it was cleared up in the end. Overall a quaint accommodation  great location and very affordable."),
("2018-06-18", "4448723", "Shannon", "Fantastic value for money. A nice private end of the house. Michele was a very attentive host!"),
("2018-06-19", "4448723", "Shar", "Michele offers a spotlessly clean B and B. The booking process was seamless  communication good and facilities were excellent. Very close to the main part of Newtown and Newtown Station. Safe area to walk to and from."),
("2018-06-25", "4448723", "Michelle", "Super comfy bed and lovely linen. Very clean with everything you need. Great location."),
("2018-07-09", "4448723", "David", "better than we had hoped for in all respects"),
("2018-07-16", "4448723", "Laurence", "amazing !!"),
("2018-07-18", "4448723", "Claudia Patricia", "The studio was perfectly clean  plenty of treats for breakfast and all you need for a nice rest after a busy day. Definitely want to come back!"),
("2018-08-06", "4448723", "Donna", "We had a great stay!  The Airbnb is so conveniently located  it didn't take us long to get our bearings.  And the living space is fantastic  it was all that we needed and then some.   Thanks Michele for being such a fabulous host! "),
("2018-08-13", "4448723", "Georgia", "So clean and spacious! Really great location as well. Michele is lovely and very very accommodating"),
("2018-08-15", "4448723", "David", "Michele is certainly a super host. The studio was more than what was described and superbly appointed! Lots of lovely little touches from the groovy red door to the lovely chest as a coffee table! The bathroom is beautiful and the shower fantastic. Great bed and super comfy couches. A really top place to stay and perfect for our needs on this trip to Sydney."),
("2018-08-16", "4448723", "Andrea", "The room had everything to feel at home. Thanks for the strawberries  cereal options  coffee  tea  spreads... Loved the red door and the location. Very close to the main restaurants  cafe  train station and bus area. Super private and comfy. "),
("2018-08-20", "4448723", "Fiona", "My husband and son stayed at Michelle's Air bnb and said it was very clean  comfortable and central.  Michele went out of her way to make their stay comfortable and she was a great communicator.  Thanks Michele.  we will certainly keep your place in mind for future stays."),
("2018-09-01", "4448723", "Rachel", "A great location right near the Center of Newtown. It was a very homely and welcoming space that Michele has gone above and beyond to make her guest feel welcome and safe. Especially as a solo traveler it was great to know she was easy to contact and always there to help if I needed anything. Thanks for being such a great host!"),
("2018-09-02", "4448723", "Clare", "A great location for seeing family and also only a short walk to places like King Street in Newtown and the train station. Comfy accomodation and just as described  thanks Michele."),
("2018-09-13", "4448723", "Andrew", "I've stayed at Michele's place before and  once again  it was an enjoyable and problem-free experience.The are is clean and inviting with useful and thoughtful touches like the coffee machine  toaster  kettle etcIt's definitely still on my ""list of good places to stay"" :)"),
("2018-09-16", "4448723", "James", "Michele was  very accommodating  all communication was quick and clear. The studio accommodation was super conveniently placed (Walking distance to Enmore Theatre/Newtown)  immaculately clean and cosy. Lovely inclusions such as breakfast cereal  tea  coffee and milk. Would thoroughly recommend. Thank you again Michele."),
("2018-09-20", "4448723", "Robert", "A very comfortable Airbnb with a great location and all modern the conveniences you need thank you again to our hosts."),
("2018-09-24", "4448723", "Tonnette", "excellent host! super quick communication and a very convenient location!"),
("2018-09-29", "4448723", "Janet", "The flat got everything I needed. The neighbourhood is very quiet at night  but it is also quite close to the Newtown city centre. You can see the graffiti on the house when walking to train station. Just the bathroom is actually outside of the room which you will need to step to the hallway. Other things look fine and nice."),
("2018-09-30", "4448723", "Brendan", "We stayed with Michele for one night in September 2018. The room is within their home  but has its own private entrance and bathroom. The guest area is only separated from the hosts home by a curtain (there are doors on both the bedroom& bathroom!) although it is still very quiet and private. Michele is a great host and has set the space up well with a comfortable bed  nice towels & linen and tea and breakfast cereal provided. The location is great - a very quiet back street but only a few minutes walk to the bars and restaurants of Newtown."),
("2018-10-06", "4448723", "Christina", "I spent two nights at Michele's place and had a great stay. It's near some cool cafes in Newtown (which Michele kindly recommended)  and it's an easy walk to the train station. The space itself is fairly small but it's bright  modern and clean and had everything I needed. The fruit and cereal were great to have in the morning and the shower was excellent. Michele was also very accommodating about me dropping off my bag earlier in the day and was always quick to respond to any messages. I would happily stay here again!"),
("2018-10-11", "4448723", "Nicola", "This is a fabulous area to stay in and we enjoyed  the atmoshere and vibe."),
("2018-10-14", "4448723", "Cyndy", "Fantastic location and a lovely place to stay when visiting Sydney."),
("2018-10-17", "4448723", "Toby", "Really lovely cosy place in a vibrant and hip part of town. Cleverly and tastefully appointed to make a great cost effective studio. Michele is a fantastic host as well  with cereals  coffee  tea  milk   and offering to go beyond with helpfulness. Thoroughly recommend."),
("2018-10-28", "4448723", "Rachel", "Great space and wonderful host"),
("2018-11-10", "4448723", "Teagan", "Michele has thought of everything to make your stay easy and comfortable. Amenities are clean and modern. Close proximity to cafes  park  hospital  university and the city. It’s perfect for all types of trips"),
("2018-11-13", "4448723", "Evan", "Great stay in Newtown! Close to everything and very accommodating host."),
("2018-11-13", "4448723", "Charlotte", "Despite being one of the smaller Airbnbs we’ve stayed in this holiday this is one of my favourites. Well located  easy check in and it feels very cosy when you come in  especially after a flight. I appreciated the nice touches like plenty of breakfast supplies and the strawberries  and Michele was very communicative"),
("2018-11-14", "4448723", "Nik", "Great place! Cosy  clean  tidy and also an amazing location. Quick responses too. Definitely will stay again!"),
("2018-11-15", "4448723", "Sam", "I had a really nice but very short stay.Arrived quite late & left early so I didn’t manage to meet my hosts but our communication was great & they were so flexible.The place has so many thoughtful touches to make the stay more convenient. Comfortable bed also.Just make sure you close the windows when you go to sleep as the airport is not far away."),
("2018-11-21", "4448723", "Helen", "Stress free check in. Excellent communication. Wonderful space. Definitely 5 star!"),
("2018-11-24", "4448723", "Ruth", "Terrific value. Fantastic location  quiet but close to the action and transport. Clean  comfortable and well appointed ...All you need for a comfortable stay."),
("2018-11-26", "4448723", "Toni", "Lovely place in a great location within walking distance of Newtown train station and shops and restaurants. Great host. Beautiful bathroom!"),
("2018-11-27", "4448723", "Tanya", "Highly recommended to stay in such a convenient location. A short walk to Enmore Theatre for those seeking an easy overnight stay. Great communication form the host  lovely atmosphere and well priced for the area."),
("2018-12-01", "4448723", "Gwyn", "Very clean and modern."),
("2018-12-04", "4448723", "David", "Michele's place is very clean and comfortable accommodation within walking distance to everything  in/ around Newtown.  Nicely furnished with many extra finishing touches. Would definitely consider using again."),
("2018-12-15", "4448723", "Nik", "Great location  Great place! have stayed here before and will stay again! Thank you!"),
("2018-12-18", "4448723", "Mishio", "It was clean and comfortable!"),
("2018-12-27", "4448723", "Helen", "This is a gorgeous apartment in a beautiful part of Newtown. A perfect base for exploring the city. Michele is a fantastic host. Highly recommend :)"),
("2018-12-31", "4448723", "Marco", "Michele has been great.He helped us since the beginning with their info and immediate answer.Also if Michele was not in Sydney at our arrival (due NYE) he take care that we'll safely find and enter into the apartment.House is in good position  quite and safe  good equipped.we enjoy our stay in Michele apartment and we hope to see him another time."),
("2019-01-07", "4448723", "Melinda", "Really nice place — clean  friendly  very nicely furnished — with a fridge — cereal  fruit  bread  bread  coffee and a pitcher of milk waiting for us.  It has dishes and flatware  and a plastic tub and drainer for washing dishes. The bathroom/shower are upscale and very nice.  Michelle is quick to respond to emails and phone calls  and is very helpful.  I’m sorry we weren’t able to coordinate our respective timing so we could meet in person.  The location — Newton — is downscale trendy — close to the metro train station  so getting to places was fairly easy.  We were pleased with our stay there.  Amazing murals and graffiti."),
("2019-01-11", "4448723", "Mitzi & Katie", "Nice room in great location. Perfect for a return stay in my old stomping ground."),
("2019-01-15", "4448723", "Sarah", "Michele was quick to respond and very helpful when I wanted to extend my stay. Place was nice and clean too. Would recommend."),
("2019-01-21", "4448723", "Diana", "Great place to stay. Safe neighbourhood that isn't far from the station (10 minute walk) along pretty tree lined streets with late Victorian houses  many with iron lacework balconies. The main room was very clean  airy and the bed was comfortable. Loved the over head fan which kept me nice and cool. The bathroom was equally very clean and the shower worked well. Good coffee making facilities and well equipped kitchenette."),
("2019-01-26", "4448723", "Whitney", "Michele responded to messages promptly and was very accommodating. Her places fits 2 people really well  and it is a short walk to the train station."),
("2019-02-02", "4448723", "Daniel", "Great location.  clean. perfect."),
("2019-02-07", "4448723", "Debra", "Everything you need for a comfortable stay in a great location."),
("2019-02-09", "4448723", "Max", "Cannot recommend highly enough. Brilliant place in the best location. Thanks Michele!"),
("2019-02-11", "4448723", "Etienne", "This is a very nice apartment at 7 min. walking distance from restaurants. It is ideal for a short stay. A small breakfast is included (cereals  few fruits  coffee) and should be eaten on the old chest while be sat on the sofa. Air conditioning is central  so don't expect it to have necessarily a cool temperature. The bathroom is outside the apartment  but close to the room. So you need to get out in a short passage that would normally goes the other apartment  but that is closed with a panel  to enter the bathroom. Because the top of the passage is open  when getting to the bathroom  you need to be quiet to ensure not disturbing the other people. Because that the only water point is at the bathroom  it's a bit complicated to wash the dishes  but Michele offers to wash it with her dishwasher. Communication with Michele is smooth and easy  and overall  it's a good quality for the price."),
("2019-02-14", "4448723", "Arthur", "interesting and stylish accommodation that has everything you need and everything you want is close by"),
("2019-02-18", "4448723", "Declan", "Michele was a lovely host & has a terrific space:)"),
("2019-02-19", "4448723", "Paula", "Loved the fresh fruit and coffee machine and the bathroom is brand new."),
("2019-02-24", "4448723", "Christine", "It is a very clean and cosy room with ensuite bathroom inside the owners family home  but with your own entrance. We had everything we needed and the location in Newtown is great."),
("2019-03-02", "4448723", "Carmel", "We had a great stay at Michele’s place. The location was in a quiet area but just a couple of minutes walk to the centre of Newtown  which was lively and full of restaurants and bars. It was very easy to get in and out of the centre of Sydney on the train. The studio itself was very clean and had everything we needed for our stay. We wouldn’t hesitate to recommend staying here!"),
("2019-03-06", "4448723", "Ines", "Nice and clean studio  everything as described. The bathroom is very modern and very clean. Bedsheets and towels as well as milk  coffee and cereals provided.But keep in mind: If you are looking for a perfectly private accommodation this isn't it. You have your own room with your own front door. However  to get to your bathroom you need to use the hall the family also uses. There is a six-foot high partition in the hall but of course you can be heard/can hear when entering the bathroom etc.. Also not having a sink in your room can be a little awkward - although Michele offers to do your dishes if you send her an e-mail and leave the stuff by the partition. It's kind of like sharing a flat without talking to each other but hearing there is someone next door. Still  the family is very quite so if you don't mind that  it's fine.Newtown is the perfect location to discover Sidney  many botique shops and hip restaurants - it costs around 3 Aus $ to get to city centre by train; 10 mins walk to the station."),
("2014-11-18", "4471162", "Kate", "What a great apartment! Absolute beach front. Amazing views.  Open plan  light  bright with a great designer feel thanks to gorgeous furniture and a wonderful art collection.Mal was fantastic. Very welcoming and helpful. Going above and beyond expectations by dropping in a great DVD collection! Very thoughtful. The vase of gorgeous fresh flowers was a lovely touch also.Bondi is now a mecca for some seriously great restaurants  groovy little bars and some of Sydney's best coffee. We were spoiled for choice.We loved our stay here and will most definitely be back. Thanks Mal!"),
("2014-11-26", "4471162", "Ben", "Great apartment with a great host. Mal met us on day one & went out of his way to ensure we were happy guests. New kitchen & bathroom added to the value of the apartment with the incredible location & views. We felt right at home in Bondi  immediately. Having 3 kids of his own  Mal was extra helpful with the loan of a cot  high chair  stroller & dvd's which made travelling with our own little one that much easier. I'll be booking with Mal again when next in Sydney."),
("2014-11-30", "4471162", "David", "Absolutely great place to stay and a wonderful experience. The apartment itself is very nice and very comfortable; it is light  airy  relaxing - all the things a beachside apartment should be. And the location just can't be beat. It is right on the beach and right next to everything you want to be near  while retaining the laid-back 'neighbourhood' vibe that the best parts of Bondi seem to manage. The views are  needless to say  spectacular. Mal was very friendly  offering us some local insights into places we might want to check out (or avoid) and although we didn't call him again after we checked in  he was sure to let us know we could call if we needed anything. In short  the perfect place to stay in Sydney. Would go back again in a second."),
("2014-12-07", "4471162", "Alex", "Great spot"),
("2014-12-14", "4471162", "Ichlas", "We booked the room VERY short notice (the day before  flying in from Europe :) and where a little worried if Mal would be able to arrange for our move in so quickly. You bet he did :) He was down in Melbourne on the day of our arrival but he had it all arranged  the place was in top condition  and the crib was waiting for our little girl. Mal was great in all respects  a good example being how quickly he sorted out an issue with the Internet Service Provider. He even left me a temporary data SIM card for the few hours of downtime (that were not his fault)! He also put together a list of day trips and even kept a few of our suitcases for us while we went onwards to travel the country. We were so thankful as it saved us trememdous hassle and airflight baggage fees. The apartment itself is exactly as the pictures show - really awesome and in the midst of Bondi. We had a great time and will for sure return to visit Mal´s place when we come back to Sydney."),
("2014-12-27", "4471162", "Joe", "This was a great location next to the beach with plenty of room for a family of four and a great view of the beach.  Mal was very responsive and provided restaurant recommendations.  We enjoyed our stay on Bondi Beach!"),
("2015-01-05", "4471162", "Claudia", "Mal was absolutely fantastic!He made us very welcome and comfortable within his apartment.The pictures and description of the place doesn't do it justice  as it is magical!The neighbourhood was great  cafes  restaurants  and locals were all wonderful!Would love to stay here again!"),
("2015-01-17", "4471162", "Ian", "The host was great  the apartment was perfect and the neighborhood is amazing. A great place for a great vacation."),
("2015-01-30", "4471162", "Alvaro", "We had a wonderful time at the apartment. Waking up to the view and having a coffee early in the morning was the best part. The place is fantastic and it's well equipped with anything you need to have some rest and days off"),
("2015-02-01", "4471162", "Raimi", "Fantastic location with spectacular views! Mal was very accomodating  meeting us on the day of arrival (even though we were late) and allowing for a later check out (was a lifesaver given our late flight out). Very well furnished and the perfect little getaway."),
("2015-02-06", "4471162", "Michel", "Good apartment. If you've got kid(s) be aware that there is no door for the bedroom. At all. Also if you come in a car  the parking outside is 1P or 4P and incredibly expensive  up to $17 per hour. You can find free parking about 10-15 minute walk away. Bondi waves always work so if that's your thing this place is worth the steep price"),
("2015-02-09", "4471162", "Michelle", "Staying at Mal's place was an absolute delight.  The photos are true to the decor but cannot begin to properly describe how wonderful it is to be perched up in your ""Sydney home"" watching the world go by on Bondi Beach. The best location in Sydney by far! And Mal is the perfect host.  So quick to respond to all enquiries and goes above and beyond to make your stay really special.  Thanks for everything  Mal. I am telling all my friends in NZ about your place and coming back for sure.  Mals tip for Jo and Willy Depot Cafe was brilliant. .. Great food.  Great people.  Not touristy. Made you feel like a local."),
("2015-02-12", "4471162", "Neeraj", "Great apartment with a really nice view of Bondi beach. Superb location with everything within walking distance."),
("2015-02-21", "4471162", "Zixian", "Mal is a very nice  host  he always solve my problems and all questions related to the apartment settings on time. Apartment is very clean. the Actual sea view is not bad  same as the picture shown on the website. it is a fantastic place to enjoy your holiday time. "),
("2015-02-23", "4471162", "Kayla", "This was one of the best trips I've taken thanks to Mal and his beautiful apartment. It was exactly as advertised and in the best location you could ask for. We were directly across the road from Bondi Beach and the apartment was incredibly clean and comfortable. Mal had provided us with everything we could possibly ask for - beach towels  internet  movies  fresh fruit and tips on what to do in Bondi. I will definitely recommend Mal's apartment to friends and family and I hope to return soon myself! "),
("2015-02-25", "4471162", "Geri", "Mal was very prompt in all my replies and queries to him. He was also kind enough to allow me to place my luggage in the apartment before check in time.The location of this apartment is good  some shops and eateries within 7 mins walk and the view of the beautiful beach is to die for. Apartment is a pretty run-down building but the interior of Mal's apartment is cozy.After dropping our luggage  we left the apartment for cleaners to clean up the place.When we check in officially after 4 pm  fresh bedsheets were provided. house was cleaned up. There were some leftover food in the fridge though  probably by guest before us. There were some baby roaches crawling around the kitchen stove/ cabinets. flooring was abit sandy and sticky. But I have to say the wind was really quite strong...hence the sandiness.The kind size bed in the Bedroom & single bed outside is very comfortable.I enjoyed reading my book  watching the clear blue sky and gorgeous view...plus the lovely breeze on the single bed or dining table. Overall  it's a lovely place to stay."),
("2015-03-04", "4471162", "Kirsty", "Mal was a great host. We arrived early. Mal was there to meet us. The communication was very easy through text messages and phone calls. He even helped us carrying a huge suitcase from ground floor to the third floor.Great holiday staying right on the bondi beach!Highly recommended!"),
("2015-03-12", "4471162", "Ben", "Amazing place! Perfect location and very clean and modern place!"),
("2015-03-21", "4471162", "Kathryn", "The place was great.  Mal was always  near the phone when I had any queries  and was amazing at accomodating unusual check in/out times.  I would definitely stay here again.  The bus is right outside the door and in only a 45 minute ride you are in the heart of the city.  Had a wonderful time."),
("2015-03-26", "4471162", "Levi", "We stayed at Mal's place right on Bondi Beach for four days and it was HUGE! For a family of four  it was really great because we could spread out. The kitchen was also great and had full sized appliances. The beds were dreamy and the location  if you like to be ocean front  was amazing. We rented a car which now in hindsight was only good for heading out to the zoo or back to the airport because parking around there was awful. And really  there was enough to do right around there so we barely used the car anyway. Mal came over and met us and showed us around the apartment a bit. He actually brought us bread  milk  butter and orange juice  which we were not expecting at all. Plus  he gave us a bit of history on the place  the neighborhood  and a bit on Sydney which was great. He was very friendly and we enjoyed talking with a local. Internet was good and there was a washer and dryer on the roof  too  which was convenient. Just get some coins for it. Highly recommend. I am thankful for AirBNB reviews bc we have stayed in some awesome places over our travels!"),
("2015-03-30", "4471162", "Evan", "Awesome place right on the beach. very happy to recommend to others. Mal was easy to contact and we thoroughly enjoyed our stay!"),
("2015-04-06", "4471162", "Lisa", "Perfect location! Mal's cafe and dining suggestions are spot on !"),
("2015-04-10", "4471162", "Janine", "The location is very convenient to the beach  cafes and the beautiful coastal walk.  The building itself is a little weather beaten and the entrance to the apartment a bit unkempt - we had to remove a box of garbage to go up the stairs.  The apartment is efficient and comfortable however the dishwasher was very hard to open and when I did it had dirty dishes inside and the linens were worn.  "),
("2015-04-19", "4471162", "Andy", "What an amazing spot! A great location  close to all that Bondi has to offer... I was hosting friends visiting from abroad and they'll now leave with some pretty special memories of this part of the world... Great communication from Mal made things simple and straight forward and he has plenty of local knowledge for first time visitors...All in all a great stay..."),
("2015-04-26", "4471162", "Ingrid", "Great stay. Really nice apartment right on bondi. Host very accommodating. Would recommend."),
("2015-05-17", "4471162", "Pilsung", "Very good"),
("2015-05-22", "4471162", "Sebastien", "perfect apartement  really well situated. only problem with the dishwasher we didnt arrive to make it work. "),
("2015-05-25", "4471162", "Patrick", "Amazing location. Waking up facing Bondi was a great experience. Walking distance to public transport  shops  food and beach. "),
("2015-05-29", "4471162", "Natasha", "Great location right on Bondi Beach with spectacular views  only a short stroll the beach front shops. Mal made check in easy for us and was helpful with any questions that we had. The only downside is that there is no free parking available anywhere nearby and we had a vehicle. "),
("2015-05-31", "4471162", "Carly", "We stayed in this apartment for 2 nights over a weekend and found the location excellent. The apartment has great views of the beach. It was well equipped  clean and comfortable.  The owner was very helpful and easy to work with. We would definitely recommend this apartment to other visitors. "),
("2015-06-08", "4471162", "Amanda", "Our family had an excellent weekend at Mals place. The apartment was in an excellent location  had an awesome view and was more spacious than the photos depicted. It was pretty chilly at night but there were extra blankets to pile on the beds and a heater in the living room. Would recommend staying and thought it was good value for our family :-)"),
("2015-06-15", "4471162", "Francesca", "It was a beautiful location  and provided us with everything we needed ! "),
("2015-07-03", "4471162", "Clayton", "Mal was a pleasure to deal with as this was my first time booking a place using Airbnb. The place was exactly as the photographs show and is in a fantastic location. Cannot recommend Mal and this apartment any higher"),
("2015-07-08", "4471162", "Jamie", "I can vouch that the view is real and gorgeous! This apartment is in the perfect location  especially for surfers or aspiring surfers. Even in the winter  classes are offered. Transferring over the keys (the hardest part of airbnb in my opinion) was painless and Mal was easy to coordinate with. We enjoyed the Italian place he recommended and the burrito place down the street.  The cab app he recommended was a lifesaver for getting me to the airport without dropping a ton of money on an uber or lugging around my bags! On colder days  I highly recommend using the dehumidifier Mal provides  because the heater causes a bit of condensation. The second and third bed don't have much privacy  but would be great for families on a vacation."),
("2015-07-26", "4471162", "Simo", "Mel was a great host. Location was ideal and close to everything you'll need while at Bondi."),
("2015-08-02", "4471162", "Nick", "Mal is an attentive host and a friendly  warm guy. Before I arrived Mal sent a couple of recommendations for good local eats and was happy to help me figure out where to park a vehicle safely  without cost. When I arrived I was very glad for the tea and coffee Mal provided in the kitchen.The photographs for the view and the apartment are accurate and the location is top notch. I stayed in the front room in a single bed and my Mum stayed in the bedroom. A little street noise wafts up at nighttime but nothing particularly late and nothing troublesome. Morning runs along Bondi beach and the Eastern Beaches headlands walk were amazing.The building is older  although the apartment was renovated sometime in more recent years and perfectly comfortable. Heaters provided in each major room made Sydney's winter fine. There is no lift in the building  so it has walk-up stairs to the third floor. There is a roof terrace commanding fine  unobstructed views of the bay and Bondi beach. Definitely on my list to stay again."),
("2015-08-13", "4471162", "攀", "在邦迪海滩结束了澳洲行 非常愉快 感谢Mal 房中的景色特别好 邦迪沿岸的行走更是令人叫绝 遗憾的是没有全部走完｡从这里去city也很方便 买张公交卡坐333 380直接去｡特别感谢的是Mal为我们延长了最后一天下午的停留时间｡这是一次非常棒的体验!"),
("2015-08-16", "4471162", "Joel", "Mals place was amazing and Mal is an awesome host  very welcoming and willing to help. The apartment is in a ridiculous location and it is actually more impressive than the photos. If your going to stay in Bondi  always check if Mals is available  you will love it."),
("2015-08-30", "4471162", "Natasha", "Mal was great to deal with and easily contactable.  He let us know about some of the local places to go to and had a booklet with some things to do in the local area available for us to look at.  The unit was fantastic and the view was amazing!  It was so close to Bondi Beach and we were able to walk to the shops and restaurants and there was public transport just across the road.  We would love to go back and stay another time!"),
("2015-09-06", "4471162", "Rebecca", "We made a last minute booking and although Mal was out of town   he responded quickly and gave clear direction on how to access the apartment. He was also flexible on check in and out times. The view is amazing  exactly as portrayed in the pictures. We didn't spend much time in the apartment but it is clean and has everything you need to enjoy your stay.  So much to do and great places within walking distance to eat and drink. Only warning would be for those with physical challenges- apartment is on the 3rd floor with no lift. "),
("2015-09-08", "4471162", "Alana", "Our booking was last minute and Mal responded very quickly. He was not in town at the time  but we were able to access the apartment easily.The views from the room are just as pictured – amazing! The location is perfect for a stay at Bondi…wish we could have stayed longer!We didn’t spend a lot of time in the apartment  but it certainly has everything you need for a comfortable stay."),
("2015-09-13", "4471162", "Leila", "The apartment is absolutely fabulous  I highly recommend it. Mal is also helpful and responsive. I will  stay there next time I am in Sydney."),
("2015-09-25", "4471162", "Donna", "Fantastic location to truly experience Bondi.  Apartment offered all needed  & the comforts wanted  by an adult  teen & child.  "),
("2015-10-02", "4471162", "Richie", "Very good. Mal delivered sheets & pillow cases to us at 8 o'clock at night (and a bottle of wine that evaporated very quickly) & remade the beds after his cleaner let him down on 2 separate occasions. We had a great chat and contact with Mal via AirBNB App or text was prompt & courteous. As a person who lives in and around the area Mal knows all the ins & outs & is very pleasant to deal with. Apartment is right across the road from the beach Bondi is a very funky area with a mix of both residents & tourists. It is a great place to just chill out & people watch or to get in amongst it. Each day you will see people surfing off the main beach from dawn to dusk. Many of you will know that the TV Show Bondi Rescue is shot down here in the Summer months. Great walk along the coastline also from Bondi to Coogee Beach (about 8 km). This takes you past the famous Icebergs Pool & Restaurant/Bar. The walk is well worth doing as is also eating & drinking afterwards at The Pavillon in Coogee (plenty of food options available & Gluten free meals as well - try the sashimi you won't regret it) Our daughter is gluten/lactose/MSG intolerant and we found all places that we ate at locally were able to cater for this. We ate at Raw Bar (my girls said best sushi they have had)  Porch & Parlour (breakfast  coffee & dinner place - great tunes played the night we were there - White Stripes  SRV  etc.). Bondi Hardware (On Hall Street  shared plates/Tapas restaurant - good indie vibe & acid jazz being played when we we there) Aquabar Cafe (Next door to Porch & Overlooks Beach - good breakfast & great coffee) & Trio Cafe Bar locally. The Apartment itself is as you see it a 1 bedroom with 2 further beds available in the front room (1 bed slides out from under the other). Small bathroom but more than adequate & clean  has good water pressure & plenty of hot water for showers & great WiFi. Fridge in kitchen is excellent & heating in both bedroom & lounge also very good & simple to use. Easily caters for a family of 3 like us or 4 people using both beds in front room. Beds were good to sleep on (main bed is king size). Foxtel TV provided (basic package  so no sports  movies or some entertainment programs). Also DVD player & Sony sound dock that you can play your IPods/Phones through via Bluetooth. Buses available across the road which can get you to Bondi Junction & into the city. We used Uber extensively - X  Taxi & Black. Never had to wait more than 5 minutes for a pickup. Now for the fusspots  these comments didn't affect us nor detract from the great time we had  but some people can be more picky..."),
("2015-10-05", "4471162", "Caroline", "Fantastic location! Awesome view  would definitely recommend the unit for a nice weekend away. "),
("2015-10-12", "4471162", "Barbara", "Key was ready for us.  Book of information was provided and we were made to feel welcome.  The location is fabulous with great views straight across to Bondi Beach.  Bus stop outside the door.  We loved our experience of being so close to the beach and of staying in an old Bondi ""flat"".  Many thanks  Mal."),
("2015-10-19", "4471162", "Zac", "Loved staying here! The pictures of the house and view are completely accurate and it is a complete gem!Can't wait for another weekend away."),
("2015-10-24", "4471162", "Gregor", "Wir hatten einen tollen Aufenthalt in einer typischen Beach Wohnung. Alles tip top. Nette Cafés in der Nähe  der Bondi Beach direkt vor der Türe. Genial. Thanks to Mal. "),
("2015-10-25", "4471162", "Mark", "Easy access  close to everything and incredible veiw."),
("2015-10-29", "4471162", "Jane", "If you want to immerse yourself in the bondi beach vibe  this is the perfect apartment. The view is magical and you can be on the beach and in the water in less than 3 minutes! Mal was welcoming  generous and helpful. Thank you for a wonderful stay. "),
("2016-02-15", "4471162", "Marc", "Mal was great- very helpful  lots of tips and quick to respond. The flat was just as you see in the photos  amazing location right opposite the beach and within easy walking distance of anything you could want to do in Bondi. The rooftop is the cherry on top and the perfect spot to kick back after a day on the beach. Everything worked  the place was clean and we loved it. Would definitely come back!"),
("2016-02-18", "4471162", "Tom", "Amazing apartment in a prime location. Highly recommended."),
("2016-02-21", "4471162", "Suz", "This was an amazing apartment in a brilliant location. Just a stones throw from the beach  a supermarket and plenty of dining options all within a short walk. The apartment was lovely and spacious with everything you could need and more. Mal welcomed us  made sure we had everything we needed and told us about a great kids pool at the north end of the beach for our toddler. We'd love to come back and visit again one day. "),
("2016-02-27", "4471162", "Nicholas", "Mal's apartment is incredible  such a wonderful spot. Mal was a great host  really accommodating and generous with his time. Highly recommended. "),
("2016-03-08", "4471162", "Mark", "Mal was a great host. Everything was ready and available in the apartment. Mal was also accommodating when I stayed an extra day"),
("2016-03-15", "4471162", "Kelly", "Amazing appartment with a stunning view. The pictures on the profile are accurate  you cant stay much closer to the beach than this. The appartment is well equipped  spacious  clean and his free WIFI.There is a bus stop just outside the door which makes it really easy to commute to the city and back. Though Bondi can be really busy at the weekends the appartment is not in the middle of the ""party section"" which gives you peace and quiet when needed. Mal was the perfect host who was always quick to reply via messages or App to any questions we had. It was even possible to have a later check out as we were flying out late. We had an amazing stay and couldnt have asked for more !! Highly recommended to anyone !!!"),
("2016-03-19", "4471162", "Priscilla", "Mal was an excellent host  very friendly and on top of it with suggestions if we needed them. The place is clean and cozy but the best part is the view of the ocean and the easy accessibility to the best Bondi has to offer. We were there for two days  didn't have a car and didn't need one as the ocean  cafes  Bondi Icebergs and sea front walks are right at your footsteps!"),
("2016-03-29", "4471162", "Daniel", "A very convenient apartment  with Bondi beach literally steps away from the front door. Beautiful views! A word or warning: if you're driving parking is all metered at a rate of $7 an hour so it works out very expensive if you're not planning to drive around whilst you're staying. Mal was a great host and very accommodating - some great suggestions for dining and drinking in the local area. Wifi was very handy to look up places to visit. Would definitely recommend this place to others!"),
("2016-04-01", "4471162", "James", "A beautiful home with an excellent view. Mal kept the place in perfect condition and our stay was a pleasure. Though we didn't catch him  he was easy to communicate with and I would recommend his place to anybody - one of the best spots in Sydney."),
("2016-04-07", "4471162", "Andy", "We stayed at Mal's apartment for 4 nights and were very happy there.  The view and access to Bondi Beach made the experience wonderful!  Access and communication with Mal were very easy.  He gave us lots of good advice on restaurants  local activities and night life.  We had a fantastic time and would stay there again.  Highly recommend!"),
("2016-04-21", "4471162", "Karen", "Luxury location but not exactly luxury accommodation. This apartment has great space and potential and the owner is lovely  however it would benefit from new towels  bedding  windows that actually shut  a paint job and a plumbing upgrade. Advertised as luxury but be aware you are paying more for location which as mentioned is pretty fabulous. If location is primary concern than this is unbeatable."),
("2016-05-22", "4471162", "Louis And Allie", "Mal was very nice and arrived with some groceries and fresh flowers a few hours into my stay and also shared with me some favorite spots to visit in the neighborhood! Overall  a really nice place to stay - great location in North Bondi  easy check-in process  good communication leading up to the stay  and it felt very safe (for a solo woman). Mal was great with offering to let me check out later on Sunday if it was better for my flight schedule.I would not describe the apartment as ""luxury"" as the post does  but it could be there with some minor improvements. I did love the natural light and high ceilings! The apartment building was quite loud many of the nights (thurs/fri/sat)  but that's no fault to Mal of course  just the neighbors. They typically quieted down by around midnight or one - and it is Bondi after all - nothing that wasn't solved with a pair of earplugs."),
("2016-06-19", "4471162", "Daniela", "Great overnight stay! Mal was very hospitable with excellent communication and was flexible with check-in/check-out times. Quaint space with lots of light and very comfortable. Thanks so much adding to a lovely weekend away!"),
("2016-10-25", "4471162", "Nat", "Mal was very accommodating and super friendly. We had a fabulous time at his place!"),
("2016-10-29", "4471162", "Terese", "Fantastic location  fantastic home  fantastic host."),
("2016-11-24", "4471162", "Jennifer", "Mal was fantastic and easy to communicate all logistics! He offered lots of suggestions of where to go nearby for food  drinks and local sites.  We had a wonderful time in AU!"),
("2016-12-08", "4471162", "Anthony", "Mal was a wonderful host and his properties are just as described.  He met us when we landed and gave us a nice orientation to the house as well as some information on how to get around and where to find groceries and restaurants.  The house was very clean and well stocked  and we had everything we needed.  If we had questions while we were there  Mal was always very responsive and helpful.  We would definitely recommend his properties."),
("2017-01-03", "4471162", "Murphy", "The apartment is very centrally located (only a 2 minute walk to the beach and a 5 minute walk to the main shopping strip. Mal was extremely communicative  answering all our questions within minutes. The apartment is large enough to comfortably fit multiple guests and was well-equipped with everything we needed  especially kitchen utensils. Neighbours are a bit noisy and at the time of our stay there was no rooftop access  but otherwise we enjoyed our stay and would come here again. "),
("2017-01-26", "4471162", "Ludvig", "Nice apartment  close to the beach and no problems at all with Mal. :) "),
("2017-01-28", "4471162", "Christopher", "Amazing location on the beach! Spacious apartment with plenty of sunlight and a beautiful view. Mal kept us up to date and was very responsive."),
("2017-02-05", "4471162", "Allan", "Amazing view! Great location"),
("2017-02-08", "4471162", "Hwangmin", "Amazing location & amazing host!But not luxury  just reasonable."),
("2017-02-11", "4471162", "Eugene", "Great Bondi peach pad. Literally steps to Beach and great restaurants/coffee/bars."),
("2017-02-19", "4471162", "Jonathan", "The apartment is in an amazing location with great views over Bondi. It was the perfect pad for my parents to stay in while visiting from the UK and they would love to sta there again. Mal was really responsive to all of our questions and great to deal with. Thanks Mal!"),
("2017-02-27", "4471162", "Nicholas", "This place is in a great location  across the road from the beach. RSL and shops are only a short walk. If your after a view this is the place to stay."),
("2017-03-10", "4471162", "Matthew", "If you want to wake up to the sound of the ocean  this is your spot"),
("2017-03-14", "4471162", "Anne", "The apartment was in an excellent location with amazing views of Bondi beach. Mal was very helpful with our late check out request."),
("2017-03-23", "4471162", "Julian", "Great communication from start to finish. Amazing location right on Bondi. Certainly an enjoyable week."),
("2017-03-25", "4471162", "Ben", "What a great place. Cannot fault it. To top it off yhe views of Bondi Beach just across the road are amazing. Mal is a wonderful host who will make sure your stay is confortable"),
("2017-04-03", "4471162", "Kerin", "Stunning location."),
("2017-04-16", "4471162", "Sophie", "Was an amazing little apartment for the weekend. Perfect views. The only thing was that the bathroom door was quite hard to shut and the fire alarm battery was dead which meant it kept beeping every so often. Would highly recommend this place. couldn't have been happier with it! Mal was great at communicating with me prior to arriving. Just need the leak on the ceiling to be fixed! :) Thanks again!!"),
("2017-04-22", "4471162", "Thea Sijing", "Mal is a great host who responds to my text really fast. Overall  it's a good apartment very near to the beach. "),
("2017-04-23", "4471162", "Michael", "Mal's place in Bondi was just perfect for our quick weekend getaway to a wedding in Bondi. We enjoyed all the benefits of the beachfront location with the comfort of a nearby clean  quiet and cosy space to escape back to. "),
("2017-04-29", "4471162", "Kyle", "Great location with a stunning view of North Bondi Beach. Close walk to an array  of restaurants and cafes. Also a market close by which was very convenient."),
("2017-05-03", "4471162", "Mike", "What an incredible location!!! The apartment is spacious and has everything you need. Comfortable bed. You can't beat the view!"),
("2017-05-06", "4471162", "Nicole", "Enjoyed our stay"),
("2017-05-27", "4471162", "David", "Great place  in a great location across from the beach. The rooftop was great too. "),
("2017-07-09", "4471162", "Alexandria", "Mal's apartment was great and he was a helpful and responsive host. The apartment was as described and right on the beach and public transport straight across the street. Close proximity to great bars and restaurants. We had a really wonderful time. I'd suggest if someone is sleeping in the sun room that you pack a sleeping mask as the street lights are a little bright. Would 100% recommend this place to stay. Will be back!"),
("2017-07-17", "4471162", "Sarah", "The location was perfect with amazing Bondi beach views. Mal is an attentive Host.Good accommadation but not luxury.A hole in ceiling that needed to be fixed with a bowl to catch the drips in the sunroom area and no wifi for our stay which was disappointing.Great cafes  bars  outdoor entertainment. "),
("2017-07-23", "4471162", "Margaret", "Sensational weekend at the best end of bondi.  Great views  like having your own home right on the beach. Close to the best cafes  easy to park  easy to get around and Mal was so easy to communicate with.  Best weekend "),
("2017-08-06", "4471162", "Chantal", "A gorgeous apartment in the perfect location. Quiet and scenic  right on the beach  but just a minutes walk to all of great restaurants  cafes and shops that Bondi has to offer. Also super-handy to public transport which made it easy to explore wider Sydney from this location."),
("2017-08-10", "4471162", "Irene", "The appartment is very well located  close to Bondi  with an incredible view.Mal is very welcoming and caring  providing all the information necessary  allowing our privacy  and very fast at responding  such a pleasure to have a host like this!  Thank you"),
("2017-08-13", "4471162", "Benjamin", "The apartment is well located in Bondi with sensational views over the beach. Check in process was easy and Mal was easy to communicate with. No issue whatsoever and a very comfortable stay."),
("2017-08-20", "4471162", "Jeremy", "Mal's place in central Bondi was perfect. A great location  just over the road from the beach and close to cafes  restaurants and bars and a clean and comfortable top floor apartment with a great view. Highly recommend."),
("2017-09-10", "4471162", "Etto", "Really cute apartment. Mal was very responsive and kind  moreover the apartment is extremely well located. Great to live in it but not exactly up to the expectations for general maintenance of the house. There is a big mold stain caused by a leak in the roof and a pot on the floor to catch the drips. The windows could have been a bit cleaner and there were other signs of mold in a few spots."),
("2017-09-23", "4471162", "Mia", "Amazing location and view"),
("2017-10-01", "4471162", "Julia", "We had such a wonderful time  Mal was very helpful  the apartment was so central and a stones throw to the beach. "),
("2017-10-08", "4471162", "Alison", "Fantastic place to stay - amazing location - would definitely recommend"),
("2017-10-29", "4471162", "Kyle", "Fantastic location  beautiful unit! can't wait to come back!  thanks again "),
("2017-11-12", "4471162", "Jessica", "The host canceled this reservation 4 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-11-16", "4471162", "Nancy", "Great location   nice view !"),
("2017-11-23", "4471162", "Claudia", "This was the first time I had ever used air bnb. Overall the apartment was great. Location was perfect with great views of Bondi beach. It is on the third floor  so consider this if you have a lot of luggage. Apartment could have been a bit tidier  but I think the turnaround was a little rushed - I assume that for the most part things are all ship shape. Our host left us alone  which was fine but a check in text asking if everything was OK would have been appreciated and thoughtful."),
("2017-12-03", "4471162", "Benedikt", "Superb Bondi Location - you can‘t live closer to the beach than that. Great for a couple. Small caveat is that the appartment can get quite warm during the day."),
("2017-12-19", "4471162", "Margaret", "Great location   nice sized unit and great host.We met Mal when we arrived and he was on hand to help with anything we needed..Perfect size for a couple or with 1 child. Will definitely stay there next time we are back in Sydney."),
("2018-01-06", "4471162", "Linda", "Mal’s communication is excellent  with replies coming back quickly. The view is fabulous. Beach  shops  restaurants/cafes and bus close by.However  there are some big problems with the apartment.There are three flights of stairs (no lift) to reach the apartment.There is a major roof leak  with HUGE patches of mould  even requiring a bowl to catch the drips.Cleanliness was an issue. - The cleaners left several items leaving one unsure how clean the place was.- The bed linen was extremely crumpled making it difficult to feel confident it was clean.- The windows are filthy  partially obscuring the fabulous view.Mal did not meet me  as stated in the ad."),
("2018-01-13", "4471162", "Gabriel", "Wonderful"),
("2018-01-28", "4471162", "Aaron", "Great location  can see all of Bondi Beach right from the dining table. Very close to public transport  shops & restaurants. Mall is very quick to respond to any queries.Aaron"),
("2018-02-04", "4471162", "David", "Location is just perfect .. I have a quick response for a couple of details at my arrival so I recommend Mal’s place widely"),
("2018-02-08", "4471162", "Mike", "Awesome spot with a host who is quick to reply and easy going. The location is the key here  it is literally right off the beach. It gets a little warm at night (we were in the peak of summer) but Mal had a few fans that were easy to plug in  which helped a good deal. Bondi is simply the best and this one wins with location."),
("2018-02-10", "4471162", "Joanne", "Mal’s place is in a great location close to everything with beautiful beach views."),
("2018-02-15", "4471162", "Alexandros", "The place to be in bondi !!! Really beautiful apartment !!! The best view and two steps from the beach"),
("2018-02-19", "4471162", "Troy", "Great view and location  tidy apartment  requires a little maintenance but would stay again..."),
("2018-02-23", "4471162", "Shane", "Awesome location across the road from Bondi Beach. Stylish apartment with comfortable beds and great kitchen. Previous people have left some ingredients which helps keep costs down (don't buy balsamic vinegar - there are three full bottles there). Check what's in the cupboard before you shop. The only two detractors were out of Mal's control - leak in the roof (he says he's been nagging the strata to have it fixed) and noisy buses bringing endless groups of tourists. Foxtel subscription seems to have expired  but maybe we just didn't know how to operate it. Fast WiFi internet. Overall a very pleasant stay."),
("2018-02-25", "4471162", "Kendall", "We enjoyed our stay at Mel's Bondi apartment. It had a great view and was in a perfect location for enjoying Bondi. Mel was quick to respond and a great host."),
("2018-03-12", "4471162", "Mia", "Nice apartment in Bondi  incredible location & view"),
("2018-03-21", "4471162", "Ann", "The view and location are fantastic.The apartment is on the 3rd floor and there is no lift  but it was not a problem for us.The apartment was excellent value for three people.The washing machine and dryer are not located in the apartment  once again not really a problem to go up to the next level.The leaking ceiling and mould is a major problem.  We didn't get a lot of rain  but the floor around the sunroom bed was very wet.  Not sure what happens in winter?The toilet seems to have been ""broken"" for weeks.  Hopefully  fixed the day we left.Mal was excellent  responded quickly and helped with any problems."),
("2018-04-09", "4471162", "Erlend", "Luxury is probably not the word I would use to describe this flat. Yes  the view and the location is top notch. But a mouldy hole in the roof when it’s raining (and not informed about in the ad) and sleeping in a bed that feels it’s in the middle of a roundabout is not five stars. Great roof terrace though  and short distance to everything North Bondi has to offer. But the flat needs a proper clean up. Cupboards and wardrobes were also a mess."),
("2018-04-20", "4471162", "Alex", "The place was beautiful  clean and in the perfect location for all things bondi."),
("2018-05-28", "4471162", "Emil", "Mal is an excellent host. He had a welcome binder with great suggestions for the area and on top of that was super responsive when I asked for additional recommendations. Also  could not beat the view or the quick walk to the beach. Something  I've seen  but did not fully appreciate till getting there  is that Bondi is a busy neighborhood  so you can hear the traffic info the night  but I've stayed for just about a week and after second night was pretty used to it  though I wish I could open the windows and listen to the ocean instead -- that was the dream before coming"),
("2018-07-06", "4471162", "Marc", "Perfect location  postcard view  and a great feel to the place. Mal's communication was spot on  we would definately come back again. Marc  Hamish and Sophie"),
("2018-07-10", "4471162", "Reina", "Exactly what is was portrayed to be. Enjoyed out stay"),
("2018-08-06", "4471162", "Jane", "No problem communicating with Mal  check-in easy etc. Apartment spacious & well-located. Plenty of hot water for the bath  and loved the Epsom salts after a big day of walking. Gas heater kept me warm. But the place itself felt a little stark and empty on arrival - no sign of the attractive sofas and colourful rug and cushions  lamp etc that feature in the lovely well-lit wide-angle photos. A couple of non-functional/broken light fittings  some random objects lying around as if forgotten  unopened mail  scrawled-on sheets of paper  a half-full kitchen tidy  the kitchen-wipe scrunched up and a bit smelly...All very minor deficiencies  I know  but cumulatively a little unwelcoming  and not what I’d call ‘luxury’! Also I didn’t realise quite what a busy noisy road the flats are on (noticeable if sleeping in front room) . But having said all that  the beds are comfortable  the sheets and towels fresh and good quality  the view a pleasure  the kitchen really well- equipped  and the roof top a delightful spot to catch some winter sun and sip my coffee. Enjoyed my stay. "),
("2018-08-13", "4471162", "Brittany", "AMAZING place!! Highly recommend for people wanting to run City2Surf! Beach is literally right in front of you when you wake up!! Perfect location and definitely so much value for money!"),
("2018-09-16", "4471162", "Jack", "Incredible! Lovely location  and a stylish comfortable apartment"),
("2018-10-02", "4471162", "Xueyang", "Wonderful place. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-10-05", "4471162", "Michael", "Great HostGreat house Enough said"),
("2018-10-27", "4471162", "Finn", "Great location and fantastic host! Highly recommended!"),
("2018-11-18", "4471162", "Ellen", "Will be back  great place."),
("2018-11-30", "4471162", "Nick", "Awesome location. Nice and tidy."),
("2018-12-18", "4471162", "Carmel", "Great location  and good local amenities"),
("2018-12-21", "4471162", "Myrto", "very nice place. very good host."),
("2019-01-01", "4471162", "Pete", "Perfect location for Bondi Beach. Great view. You can walk everywhere. Quick Uber to the wharf."),
("2019-01-05", "4471162", "Shane", "Great location"),
("2019-01-19", "4471162", "David", "Great pad. Fantastic location. Thanks for the local tips Blanca was a surprise packet and just love North Bondi fish"),
("2019-01-28", "4471162", "Emad", "Just do not believe the photos."),
("2019-02-04", "4471162", "Tim", "Mal’s communication was so appreciate by me during my stay. His prompt responses meant I felt welcome and looked after despite us never meeting. The home is a great location from the beach - there’s no excuse for not having multiple swims each day! I’d recommend Mal and his home to friends and family"),
("2019-02-12", "4471162", "Lisha", "Mal is so kind and warm hearted  he gave us a lot of advice about local shops. And the view outside the window of the house is fabulous  we will definitely choose to stay here again if we come back."),
("2019-02-17", "4471162", "Andy", "Great!"),
("2019-03-02", "4471162", "Christine", "The view is second to none. A wonderful spot in Bondi.You pay highly for the views ."),
("2019-03-03", "4471162", "Carson", "Mal’s place has it all and is a must stay. You are steps away from the beach and all the restaurants/bars/cafe. Clean and has all of the amenities you need if you don’t care to go out. If I come back to the Bondi Beach area  I will be looking to book Mal’s place again."),
("2014-12-13", "4532525", "Raymond", "Linda was extremely responsive and attentive from the moment the booking request was made. She went the extra mile to make sure I would locate and enter the apartment easily  that I would have amenities ready for me before I even set foot in the country. She showed genuine care and concern  which is at times uncommon even among friends. Her apartment was spotless  thoughtfully designed and easy to get to from the airport (using airport-hotel shuttle buses  stop at Y Hotel Sydney South). It is minutes from cafes and the train station. It has a gorgeously open balcony and generous sunlight during the day. As it is very well insulated  I imagine stays during winter would be comfortable as well. The only guests who should reconsider this apartment are those who are unable to use staircase  as the bedroom is a stairway-up from the living area. Linda is an excellent host with an amazing apartment and if I were more selfish  I would not have spoken too highly of it  so that I can have it more to myself! :)"),
("2014-12-20", "4532525", "Alec", "Had a great time at Linda's apartment. Linda was very welcoming  communicated extremely well and even left a fair amount of food for our use! The apartment was great  access easy and had three balconies for general excellence. The neighbourhood is great; King St is a ~1 km stroll from the door  but there lots of other things closer if you don't want that variety."),
("2014-12-24", "4532525", "Jothi", "Linda was a great host.  Although we couldn't meet her  she did everything that we asked for and made sure we were comfortable.  The listing was accurate and the neighbouhood was quiet and calm even though the place was very close to the city.She also provided us with milk  bread  yoghurt and cereal for breakfast.I would recommend staying here to anyone who is going to Sydney."),
("2014-12-28", "4532525", "Yunjeong", "It was great to stay at Linda's. Linda was kind enough to answer all of our request! We arrived at Sydney late night of Christmas eve so couldn't go for buying food or something. So Linda did shopping for us! We could have enjoyed great christmas dinner thanks for Linda ;) and House located near downtown  so we could walk to Darling Habour very easily. There was some trouble though. There was a black out for an hour  and we could'nt use Wifi. Linda was very sorry for those problem  so she give us USB for internet. She said she was waiting for Wifi installation and it will be available soon. I will stay at Linda's if I go Sydney again! ;)"),
("2015-01-02", "4532525", "Leilane", "Linda's apartment is a cozy place where you feel at home. It has a great location  near train station and close to the city. Unfortunately we were there for only two days  but we would like to stay much more. Linda is very careful  left all instructions and worried about all the details for our comfort. We even had food available in the kitchen  which was extremely important in the early days of adaptation. We can only thanks and recommend Linda's place eyes closed."),
("2015-01-04", "4532525", "Prashanth", "Located centrally  as described a very quick trip to Sydney CBD. The building itself is a bit old but the apartment was neat and tidy. Linda was a great host  easily contactable  very responsive (I got responses within 15 mins of my queries!!). I did not meet her personally but she provided clear instructions on how to enter the place. The kitchen was fully equipped and there was milk  bread  coffee & cereals left for our use. Our stay here was very comfortable and I would definately stay here again.  "),
("2015-01-07", "4532525", "Jeannie", "We had a lovely relaxing time here. Linda  was friendly and helpful. The apartment is well equipped and close to everything. "),
("2015-01-14", "4532525", "Soo", "Linda's b&b is fantastic. She bought fruits and wine for me  I was so impressed. Exept it  there were so many things to eat. And everything is clean  closed to the city. Thank you  Linda!"),
("2015-02-19", "4532525", "Sandi", "Great. Linda was very helpful in the lead up to our guest arriving.Our guest felt very welcome. There were some issues with the wifi at the beginning of our guests stay - but Linda quickly rectified it. Our guest was most happy with his accommodation."),
("2015-03-08", "4532525", "Lynn", "Linda made me feel very welcome  with a few personal messages  and had left some food for me  which was well-received.  The apartment was a great size for me  and made me feel at home."),
("2015-03-11", "4532525", "Janies", "Linda very nice! Lovely bnb & good location. Walk 4mins to red fern station. Lovely bnb! Very recommend!"),
("2015-03-15", "4532525", "Lauren", "We had an awesome time at Linda's apartment. Great location  and the apartment had everything we needed. Would definitely stay again! Linda was the perfect host  and was always available when we needed her."),
("2015-03-19", "4532525", "Anshul", "Great place  so close to everything. Enjoyed my stay thoroughly. Highly recommended for other guests for future bookings. "),
("2015-03-25", "4532525", "Jimmy", "Linda was a lovely host and has a very lovely home. Which is close to restaurants  public transport and all other things you could need. It was very easy getting around the city and surrounding areas thanks to the comprehensive information provided to us upon arrival. I thoroughly enjoyed my stay and would recommend staying at Linda's apartment to anyone looking for accommodation."),
("2015-03-30", "4532525", "Catherine", "We stay in Linda's cosy house for 5 nights! Linda is very kind who prepare many food for our stay! The location of the house is close to Sydney's attractions and only 5 minutes walk to the train station! Linda is helpful to our problems in Wifi and TV! The only things need to concern is you may feel a little bit hot for the third people who sleep on the sofa at night  but you can turn on the fan or cooler if you want! Thanks Linda!"),
("2015-04-07", "4532525", "Clement", "Hi linda  this is marie and thierry. We have just finish our trip in sydney and blue mountains. Back to work tomorrow ! We enjoy the city and you appartment in redfern. Everything was ok. Quiet area and not too far from the center of sydney. We rent bikes at town pikes.Thanks for your advices and all the rest. Sorry for my english we are not used to travel so much out of french countries and my lessons from school begins to be very far"),
("2015-04-14", "4532525", "Max", "There was a note  that made us welcome. There was milk in the fridge. The kitchen was well stocked. A great location. Highly recommended. Accessible to galleries and public transport."),
("2015-04-21", "4532525", "Jessica", "Linda was an excellent host  very helpful and really easy to deal with. Everything in the apartment was really well explained and she included lots of extra details and helpful tips on Sydney so it felt like we had insider knowledge! The apartment is small but perfectly formed and had everything we needed in it. There's an excellent supply of guide books and we did a few do the self guided walking tours. There's not much in the way of restaurants nearby but pretty much every train in Sydeny seems to stop at Redfern which is only 4mins walk away so it was easy to get around. Bring your ear plugs as the road behind can be noisy with the windows open. As well as seeing the sights I'd recommend making time to experience Aussie brunch which is quite unlike anything I've eaten before. We went to the Three Williams Cafe which is 10-15min walk away. Haven Coffee near Central Station was also a regular stop."),
("2015-04-28", "4532525", "Linda", "Our host  Linda was extremely helpful and helped to sort little issues that we had on arrival.   We suggested a minor improvement to her and she was happy to take our feedback on board.  The area was a little off putting at first however  once we got to know it and also appreciate the proximity to the CBD and the train station and also a very good pub across the road  we were very happy.   The accommodation provided all that we needed but to be honest we felt it was a squeeze for 4 adults.   Much more comfortable for just two.  Ideally located for walkers and very secure.  Internet access was good.  Linda provided excellent information about Sydney with lots of tour information  sight-seeing blurb and also lots of maps.  Once a booking had been confirmed  Linda provided excellent information for us to read in advance of our stay and all very helpful to make our arrival problem free."),
("2015-05-07", "4532525", "Nina", "We had a great time staying at Linda's apartment. It certainly felt like a home and not just some hotel room. Also the location of the apartment is great. There are lots of nice cafés nearby to have breakfast at and it is really close to the CBD and also to central station from where it is easy to go anywhere you like in Sydney. Linda is a super nice host who tries to make your stay as comfortable as possible. We'd definitely stay there again."),
("2015-05-14", "4532525", "Jessie", "Great place to stay! Very good location neat and tidy apartment. Secure parking for the car was a huge bonus. Linda was lovely to deal with and very helpful during all aspects of our stay. Would highly recommend and recommend Linda. Easy to contact before during and after our stay.  Thank u so much once again! If ever revisiting sydney will book again!"),
("2015-05-19", "4532525", "Jayson", "Linda was very welcoming  made us feel at home in her lovely home.  Great location  secure parking  will definately stay again."),
("2015-05-25", "4532525", "Ashley", "Property was great. Linda most helpful. Didn't actually meet her but she was  always available on the phone if needed. Arrived to find a box of chocolates set aside for us and a freshly stocked fridge for breakfast. A very easy experience all round. Late checkout greatly appreciated."),
("2015-05-30", "4532525", "Belinda", "My friends and I had a very pleasant stay! Linda was very helpful and easy to contact. She answered all our queries promptly. Great location  nice cosy apartment.. Couldn't recommend it more! Would definitely be back! "),
("2015-06-05", "4532525", "Chew Eng", "Linda is a very helpful and welcoming host. She alerted me to the Vivid event and a free  orchestra nearby way before my arrival. She is also very responsive in answering to my queries and replacing the heater which did not work well in warming us on our first night.The location is superb as it is within walking distance to Chinatown.The secured parking is very useful. The apartment is clean and bright. We felt very at home."),
("2015-06-17", "4532525", "Ashok", "Staying in this apartment  hosted by Linda  was a wonderful experience for me and my wife. All kitchen amenities provided  hot water and good plumbing  quiet  near Redfern station and the University  plus a coffee shop and pub right across. The host bot a rice cooker for our use too. "),
("2015-07-04", "4532525", "Man Ling", "Linda is really kind. She checked in on us on the day when we arrive and her apartment is 5 mins of walking to Redfern station and about 10 mins to Central station. Could not have ask for more and I really love the quietness of the apartment within the residential area."),
("2015-07-12", "4532525", "Olivia", "Linda left us the keys in the letter box for us to checked ourselves in.  It is a lovely place and it's same as the pictures posted. Quiet area  only few minutes walk from the train station! There's also a garage for our rented car  which makes it so convenient for us. Linda's place have basically everything  from laundry liquid to heater. The lovely note and OZ's all time favorite TimTam was a great bonus! Clean and nice place to live in!  "),
("2015-07-18", "4532525", "靖旻", "Linda is very kind and passionate  she reply to us via Airbnb ASAP if we have any problem. The house is very good  clean and viewing well. The location is very convenient for those who don't have a car. I think if I go to Sydney again  I will live here again!"),
("2015-07-22", "4532525", "Huixian", "Linda has been gracious and wonderful  catering to our every need including an early check in and a slightly later check out when hearing of our fight timings. Very helpful  helping us with figuring out navigation and how to get an opal card. House is exactly as shown in photos  and everything was very easy. Very near to Redfern station  and my friends and i enjoyed our stay there!"),
("2015-07-24", "4532525", "Karen", "Although I didn't meet Linda she contacted me when I arrived and a couple of times during my stay to check that everything was OK. Linda's place was as described  neat and tidy and in a reasonably quiet and safe area  close to everything. "),
("2015-07-27", "4532525", "Sean", "Linda's apartment is very cosy and is just right for 4 person. Her descriptions of the apartment are accurate and the location really made our stay in Sydney very much convenient. Though I didn't meet her in person  she actually prepared many things to welcome my stay and remained contactable throughout. I would definitely recommend this apartment to people who are looking for a trustworthy  affordable  and centrally located apartment in Sydney."),
("2015-08-24", "4532525", "Siti", "We really love Linda's apartment and it is really near to the city thus making everything feels convenient. We also enjoyed the facility given at Linda's house and thank you for the timtam! so good we love it!! Definitely a place you want to stay if you are going to sydney :P"),
("2015-08-30", "4532525", "Lisa", "Our stay at Linda's apartment was fantastic. The accommodation was clean and comfortable with all the necessary amenities. The neighbourhood has many cafes and was an accessible walk to the downtown. Linda was a good host checking in on our stay and leaving information about the city along with coupons and treats."),
("2015-09-04", "4532525", "Sarah", "I had a great Stay at Linda's apartment. She left a tonne of handy information  was flexible about leaving my bags behind for a few hours on my last day  and went out of her way to check in and make sure I was doing ok. Much appreciated. "),
("2015-09-22", "4532525", "Sunny", "Linda's place is just lovely and very close to Redfern train station. The house is clean and neat. Superb value with garage parking. We rent a car for two days and that was very convenient with no trouble to find parking spot. Highly recommend and definitely will return in the future. Give mine appreciation for hosting a great place."),
("2015-09-24", "4532525", "Helen", "We had a wonderful stay in Sydney - Linda's home was perfect for us with everything we needed. Linda was a fantastic host - great to deal with. The apartment was in a quiet block but close to everything - great cafe just across the road and close to the station."),
("2015-10-02", "4532525", "Jane", "Linda's apartment is tidy and located near CBD and transportation to everywhere. Linda is nice and ready to provide help anytime. The apartment provide anything you need during the stay. I will recommend to friends definitely."),
("2015-10-09", "4532525", "Andrea", "This was a wonderful place to stay while on our trip to Australia! Quick walk to everything as promised  and comfy place to sleep after a long day exploring."),
("2015-10-19", "4532525", "Henrique", "Just like home!Linda's apartment is perfect in every sense. Is close to train station  markets and coffee shops in a lovely neighborhood. Beside that  the house have everything we need  from laundry  kitchen  living to an amazing bed."),
("2015-10-27", "4532525", "Danni", "Loved Linda's apartment! Linda provided all the information before hand so checking in was a breeze  and she even let me in early after a long haul flight  infinitely appreciated! The location is amazing  there's some lovely cafes just across the road and the train station a small walk away. The apartment was really quiet at night and felt very safe. Would definitely recommend and would stay here again!"),
("2015-10-29", "4532525", "Grace", "Linda was such a lovely host! The apartment was exactly as the description had mentioned.. It's in a great location  walking distance to everything you need! I had such a great stay here  could no recommend it more :) "),
("2015-11-01", "4532525", "Lorraine", "Nice and clean house. Linda is a very responsible host and she responded quickly. 10 min walk from Redfern train station and you can go anywhere in the city. Only shortcoming is there are quite many ants in the house."),
("2015-11-07", "4532525", "Shan", "I had a great stay at Linda's place. The apartment was as described: neat  with full amenities  and well situated close to the Redfern train station. Linda herself was very well organized and communicative during the stay. I'd definitely recommend it. I especially liked the box of TimTams she left out before my arrival :)"),
("2015-11-15", "4532525", "Noel", "Linda left a variety of foods for us at her apartment - breakfast things  and a variety of teas. Tim tams too! The wifi worked well as did the utility room's white goods that we used. The parking space was really useful. We were travelling with our 9 month old son. Linda provided us with a cot for him to use (for free) which was terrific. We had some queries and Linda got back to us immediately with answers to our questions. We liked the ""manual"" she left for the Redfern area which highlighted activities we might otherwise not have done like visiting the local weekend market.The Redfern neighbourhood is a bit of a hipsters area. There's a good (bike) coffee shop opposite and we had a ridiculously good Sunday lunch at the pub next door. The very well connected underground station is a short walk away. The area felt very safe."),
("2015-11-20", "4532525", "Liz", "Linda's unit is a lovely warm place as is Linda herself.  The unit is well equipped and Linda has thought of everything  there was nothing we needed that was not supplied.  Terrific location and area  excellent value for money. "),
("2015-12-02", "4532525", "Tan", "A cosy and quiet apartment within the city fringe  with cafes & convenience store nearby. Walking distance to Red fern train station and we even walk to Sydney Fish Market  although my kids were complaining about it.The kitchen is stock up with all sort of food and seasoning. Thank you  Linda."),
("2015-12-13", "4532525", "Kevin", "We loved our stay in Linda's place. We've stayed in nicer places in better locations but in Linda's apartment  you'll feel at home. I won't repeat the positive and accurate descriptions below  except to emphasize that it is accurately described  in a safe and interesting area  and close to all major tourist sites. Linda had stocked her place so well that we didn't need to dash to the store when we arrived. This generosity is a reflection of your host who loves travel and those who do. Thanks  Linda. Book it."),
("2015-12-18", "4532525", "Zora", "This apartment is clean and lovely and everything just like the description. Linda is so nice and all the foods and the welcome Timtam are so helpful when we arrived. We spend a great time there."),
("2016-01-02", "4532525", "Fabian", "My Family and I stayed at Linda's apartment the last two weeks of December 2015.  From the time the booking was made Linda has been in contact with me  about the apartment the area and things to do in and around Sydney  thank you Linda!!The apartment it self is as listed on Airbnb. It's comfortable cosy and everything a traveller or holiday makers requires. My family and I also loved the area it was a nice quiet and safe area. If ever I return to Sydney I would hope to return to Linda's apartment. Thank you Linda for everything!"),
("2016-01-05", "4532525", "Sophie", "Absolutely lovely stay here... Linda was so helpful and full of little tips on where we could visit and travel advice. She did everything she could to make our stay comfortable and feel like a home away from home. Great location  so close to the station and only minutes away from all tourist sites. We will definitely be back if we find ourselves over this side of the world again! Thanks so much for everything Linda :) "),
("2016-01-11", "4532525", "Angela", "Our host Linda made us very welcome  provided more items  e.g. food/washing powder  umbrellas which we needed.  Other items beyond our expectations.  The apartment was exactly as shown on the website. Very clean  comfortable bed  bathroom perfect. She provided us with information with regard transport  local shopping and places to eat.  The off street parking was very accessible and secure. The instructions were well set out.  We liked the area. She was very interested to make sure we were comfortable. We would strongly  recommended to couples like us. "),
("2016-01-20", "4532525", "Nina", "Linda has thought of everything that might be needed by a wide variety of guests The apartment is compact and decorated in a neutral modern style. It is very conveniently located for a visit to Sydney The house rules are reasonable and easy to follow. A no-fuss stay. Thank you."),
("2016-02-12", "4532525", "Michael", "This is a very convenient  cosy and perfect appartment in the center of a lot of action: Central station is 8 minutes to walk and then your are close to all attractions in Sydney. The neighbourhood us lovely  typical Sydney townhouses with a great pub on the other side of Abecrombie Street. It is 6 minutes walk to the train station Redfern.The appartment has all you need and the shopping for these needs is at Redfern station.Linda is a very helpful host  always available by sms if you need advice.This unit is very recomendable for 2 or 4 people. Have fun! Thank you Linda!Michael Wendt - Germany"),
("2016-02-16", "4532525", "Hao", "Linda is very responsive and considerate. Easy access to CBD and Sydney university. We really enjoyed the stay at her place"),
("2016-02-18", "4532525", "Xiaodong", "The house is not far from the University of Sydney. It is very quiet around the house. The landlord is a very nice person. We have everything we need. Let us feel very comfortable and friendly!"),
("2016-02-23", "4532525", "Michelle", "Linda's house is clean and comfortable (makes me feel at home) though sometimes it can be hot cuz I visit Sydney during summer. Other than that  I love that it is near the MRT- took me only few minutes to walk and Central Park Mall and SPAR Redfern that are nearby are awesome- lots of food and fresh food to buy and great atmosphere. "),
("2016-03-01", "4532525", "Sophie", "Linda was great giving info to make our arrival smooth as it was our 1st time in Sydney. The apartment was as described in the lsiting and photos  there was bread and more for us to have breakfast which was very convenient to start with. Location is great too  only a few minutes from Redfern station  which links to Circular Quay in 10-15 minutes only. Overall  comfortable stay with a great host. "),
("2016-03-12", "4532525", "Lee", "Linda's apartment is very well located  close to RedFern train station and in walking distance of the CBD. The breakfast items were much appreciated  with an array of cereals  bread and peanut butter and jam and honey. Several kinds of tea and instant coffee and milk also.We also appreciated the washer/dryer and hanging lines on the balcony upstairs. We would definitely return if in Sydney again."),
("2016-03-15", "4532525", "Sandra", "Linda did everything possible to make our stay perfect she even text us to see what bread we liked and left a packet of timtams on the table.The apartment is ideal for 2 people and is equipped with all you need the wifi was good it was great to have secure parking also to be so close to the station 3 stops to circular quey there is a good quiet pub over the road and also a little cafe  restaurant and shops within walking distance"),
("2016-03-22", "4532525", "Dora", "Really excellent stay. Linda has provided well and very thoughtfully. Thank you   Location most convenient. Dora"),
("2016-03-26", "4532525", "Jan", "Flat basic but comfortable. Good commute area and neighbourhood felt safe for two ladies. A good resting place if you are out exploring Sydney."),
("2016-04-06", "4532525", "Winnie", "We couldn't have asked for more.  :)  Great host  location  and oh so comfortable!"),
("2016-04-09", "4532525", "Phearern", "Linda was a great host and regularly kept in contact to ensure we were having a great time and there were no issues.Everything was as described and the location was great. The walk to the train station was not too far; even with a crying infant and suit cases being wheeled. Great restaurants were only a short walk away as well.The information left in the house for nearby attractions and was great  as was the access to the Entertainment Book.I would highly recommend staying here. The next time we are in Sydney  Linda's apartment will be the first place we will try and book :)"),
("2016-04-28", "4532525", "Li", "Linda's house is nice. It is plain and not large. However  it is quite and clean. You can find everything you need. The most important is that the location is very closed to stations and you also can easy walk to city. It is also a safe location too. Just good for 3 of us to stay in. We are enjoy the stay there. Lin Li"),
("2016-05-09", "4532525", "Laurent", "L'appartement de Linda est parfait  très bien situé et au calme dans un beau quartier de Sydney avec tout ce dont on peut avoir besoin à proximité : métro  restaurants  supermarchés  jardins. L'appartement lui-même est grand et agréable avec plusieurs balcons... Tout est comme sur les photos. Nous n'avons pas rencontré Linda mais elle a répondu rapidement à toutes nos questions et a fait de son mieux pour rendre notre séjour encore meilleur. Sydney est une grande et belle ville et ce lieu est un point de chute idéal pour la visiter."),
("2016-05-29", "4532525", "Annie", "Très bon séjour chez Linda. Appartement impeccable et très bien équipé. 15mn à pied de la gare centrale ou station de train à 5mn. Linda est très réactive pour répondre à nos questions et nous donne de bons conseils sur les événements à ne pas manquer. Je recommande sans hésitation !"),
("2016-06-22", "4532525", "Andy", "Linda was excellent and more than helpful. It was very easy to communicate and keep in touch with her. She even accommodated for our late check in and late check out!Apartment was excellent and couldn't have been better!Thanks Linda!"),
("2016-06-30", "4532525", "Jie Ying", "Linda has been a warm and fantastic host! She gave us very good recommendation of the sight seeing places  sharing with us the nearby facilities/groceries markets etc. The house is really spacious for the two of us  with a living room/kitchen and a bedroom area on the second level. Very clean and neat  with all the daily necessities catered for! I will definitely be back should I be back to Sydney! Thank you Linda for the wonderful memory! "),
("2016-07-09", "4532525", "Hendry", "Nice place  close to Redfern station. Listing description is accurate  and guidance instruction is super clear.Place is well supplied with basic needs (i.e. Towels  shampoo  soap  laundry detergent  extra beddings  teas  etc.).Linda is very responsive and welcoming. "),
("2016-07-18", "4532525", "Bob", "This was our first experience with an AirBNB booking and we were very impressed with how easy Linda made the whole experience from getting the key  the welcoming packet of biscuits  the offer to use all and sundry within the apartment. The location was perfect for us in that it was outside the CBD area yet walkable to it. The local restaurants  cafes were great and we have no hesitation in recommending the apartment to others.Chris and Bob"),
("2016-07-21", "4532525", "蔡", "Lovely place to live! Warm and comfy apartment with everything we need. Locating at the place close to station therefore easy travel everywhere. Highly recommended!"),
("2016-07-26", "4532525", "Kevin", "It was an honor to have had Linda as my very first AirBnB host. She was very accommodating and easy to talk with. She made sure we had everything we needed during our stay. She also provided directions to the best restaurants and tourist attractions.  As for her place  it's well-organized and has an ample amount of space. The space is very comfortable that we were easily able to settle in. It also has all the essential appliances that a home needs. Its location is very convenient as it is relatively near to the city  close to grocery stores and restaurants  and within reach of a train/bus station for those who want to go around. I would highly recommend staying at Linda's place to anyone planning to visit Sydney! We sure had a great and hassle-free time during our stay!"),
("2016-08-01", "4532525", "Latke", "Linda is a really nice person  the cleaning is good and the living goods are sufficient. Very excellent experience!"),
("2016-08-17", "4532525", "Heather", "With good communication from the start  Linda made the process easy. She gave clear instructions to pick up the key  use the wifi and left maps with advice on places to visit. The location was perfect for us; near family and the railway station.  We hired bikes from over the road ($20 for half day) and cycled to Balmain. Great cycling along the river but busy roads. You can walk to the city centre- we walked offroad through parks to Darling Harbour and the botanical gardens. Comfy big bed with good quality bedding and loads of hot water. Everything else was a bonus. Glad there was a heater as our first evenings were chilly and a television to watch the Olympics. The wifi was welcome. The Eveleigh Hotel opposite had good meals but we mainly shopped at Coles in Broadway and Spar opposite the station. We thought of hiring a car so the car parking space was a plus but actually travelled everywhere by the excellent public transport. The Opal app was really helpful; we already had Opal cards. It's a modern block that looks a little prison-like compared to the cute houses in the rest of the street but is big enough and well-equipped. There's a big sofa which converts into a big sofa bed. The upstairs bedroom has no door  it's a railing but a good size and watching tv on low downstairs was ok and didn't disturb the sleeper. I would stay there again."),
("2016-08-27", "4532525", "Xiaoxing", "Lina is a very nice host  and the apartment is comfortable  quiet to live in. "),
("2016-09-08", "4532525", "Alexia", "It was really good to stay in Linda's place  perfectly communicated  close to everything! Great experience there  hope to come back again :)"),
("2016-09-16", "4532525", "Himanshu", "Excellent place to stay. Linda was always available and helpful with everything that we needed. We did a late check in and she arranged bread for us  and cookies for my daughter which was great. It was nice meeting her. The best part is the connectivity to the station  very convenient. Would definitely recommend her place. Himanshu"),
("2016-09-21", "4532525", "Keith", "The whole experience had been amazing. Linda is very friendly  responsive  took time to check in with us during our stay to make sure we are good and accommodating. A pity we didn't meet her during our stay. But her attention to details and making sure her guests are well taken care of is remarkable. On the apartment  it was fantastic. Location was awesome and it has everything we need. Feels like home  would certainly come back again if we visit Sydney :)"),
("2016-09-30", "4532525", "Puneeth", "Stayed with Linda's for 2 days. Location is brilliant and the house is equipped with all required amenities. Would recommend it for both short and long term stays."),
("2016-10-07", "4532525", "Adam", "Comfy mattress upstairs! Very useful Opal cards & tasty welcome bread  which was especially useful after a 29-hour trip and arriving in the middle of the night."),
("2016-10-09", "4532525", "Timea", "We had a great stay at Linda's lovely home. The apartment is located in a nice neighbourhood  close to public transport and perfect to explore the city. Linda was a great host and the communication was smooth. The apartment is clean  cozy and furnished with everything we needed. I would definitely stay here again!"),
("2016-10-17", "4532525", "Zakiyya", "This was my first Airbnb experience and I couldn't ask for a better one. First of all  the location is very convenient and the neighborhood is quiet and safe. The apartment is clean  has everything you need  and dare I say  more than you can ask for. Linda wants you to feel at home and she succeeds  : we really felt at home. I went to Sydney with my parents (60 and 70yo) and therefore I had some concerns regarding their comfort. As a matter of fact  they loved the place ! They were really happy about the whole experience and this is the most important for me. Linda is really helpful  attentive and  flexible. We were welcome by a lovely note and some Tim Tam and we loved this attention. No matter how much I think about it  I cannot fault the accommodation  nor the host. I am really glad to have had Linda for my first experience  but the downside is that she has raised the bar for the next one ! :-) "),
("2016-10-20", "4532525", "Kelly", "What a cute little apartment. Great views from the balconies. Clean tidy and spacious. red fern is a coll area there is food options nearby and coffee across the road. Train station is very close. Linda was easy to deal with friendly and answered all questions promptly. Thanks for having me stay."),
("2016-10-26", "4532525", "Luis", "Linda was a great host  and was very helpful and responsive with all our questions.  She provided us with Opal cards  which we recharged once done.  Checking was quick and painless.Unit is near the Redfern train station  and 25 minute walk from Central station.  The route to/from the Redfern station is not well lit  so we didn't feel safe walking there late at night.Accommodations are good for a couple.  Room is a bit chilly at night  but Linda provides heaters to warm up the rooms.Very nice and large clothes washer/dryer  which made doing laundry a breeze."),
("2016-11-02", "4532525", "Sarah", "Linda was a treat to communicate with  very responsive and warm. Her apartment was equipped with everything we needed for a week long stay. I highly recommend her place! Thank you very much Linda. "),
("2016-11-10", "4532525", "Almuth", "From the moment I have booked the apartment Linda has always replied to messages immediately. She answered quickly whatever question I had. The location of the apartment is great since it's only about 5min walk to the train station. Food shops are not far away either. The apartment has all you need and it is in particular nice that you can use everything in there (like tea  jam  butter  oil etc). I loved the one balcony with morning sun. One of the best things were the instructions and recommendations she put together and provided in the apartment. So you could go back to this document and read what sights you should visit  where the garbage room is  what you have to do when checking out etc. Thanks so much Linda  you are a great host!!! I can definitely recommend the apartment to others."),
("2016-11-21", "4532525", "Jon", "I had to work a few days at the University of Sydney  and this place was a short 5 minute walk to campus which was awesome. But it was also only 5 minutes to the nearest train station so when I started sightseeing  it was also super convenient. The apartment was clean and quiet and in a really pretty neighborhood."),
("2016-12-14", "4532525", "Vagish", "Really central and close to everything. Great balconies and very clean. Well stocked and we had a great time there!"),
("2016-12-18", "4532525", "Radzillah", "Linda is a lovely host...very accomodatiing in answering our queries. Nice and clean place. Near to train station  Redfern and shopping mall  Broadway. Also a wslking distance to Glebe Saturday Market. We had a great time."),
("2017-01-06", "4532525", "Ruth", "Linda was a superb hostess  she was easily contacted via email throughout our stay. When we had a minor problem with one of the toilets she responded very quickly.   The directions on how to access the apartment were easy to follow  and we had no trouble on arrival or departure. We really enjoyed how close the property was to the train station and the downtown areas of Sydney  while at the same time the neighborhood was still very peaceful and quiet.  Providing Opal cards (for the city transportation) was a real plus.  And since we are runners  having a washer and dryer for laundry  and not needing to take stinky clothes back home was lovely.  Overall a wonderful stay in Sydney."),
("2017-01-14", "4532525", "Rafael", "Pro: Linda is a great host. Communicates well. Amenities in the apartment are good  she provides everything one needs. Plenty of space  two couples could stay comfortably. Con: No air conditioning. Most of the year this should be fine but I was here during a heat wave and it made the stay unbearable. Most of the time I wore only shorts and was still sweating like crazy  even with fans on and windows open."),
("2017-01-20", "4532525", "Ariel", "Linda was a very helpful hostess to us! She prepared everything we needed. We enjoyed cooking every morning."),
("2017-02-03", "4532525", "India", "We had a lovely stay at Linda's  the place was tidy and clean  beds were comfortable. It was in a convenient  location and communication and check-in with Linda was easy- she was very accommodating! Thank you for a lovely stay! It is a great place and I would recommend it! "),
("2017-02-15", "4532525", "Kami", "This was our first AirBNB rental. Linda was an excellent host. The unit was very clean  and everything you can think of was provided (paper towels  laundry soap  shampoo  shower gel  dish soap  even sunscreen). The best thing was that the kitchen was FULLY stocked and the washer/dryer were super convenient. Having the OPAL cards ready to go made it really easy. Be sure to read up on how to use them and top them off as the least you could do online is $40 AU per adult card  and it took up to an hour to be available. Top-offs can also be done at the station in lesser denominations. Bed was comfy  plenty of clean sheets and towels were available. One ice tray was provided for ice  which was plenty for us. Fans were plenty to keep cool in summer as long as you leave doors and windows open. Suggest taking Uber to and from the airport as most economical method  but leave plenty of time to travel; though only 5 miles from the airport it took over 30 minutes to drive. The only drawback to us was that there was very little counter space in the bathroom  but we adapted to that easily. We loved staying there and will happily go back should we ever find ourselves in Sydney again. "),
("2017-02-19", "4532525", "Aleksander", "I came here with my two American buds  and we had a great time. Linda was very prompt is any request/questions I had. The place was great  beautiful balconies  and location was perfect. Right next to the train station. Would highly recommend this place for travelers."),
("2017-03-04", "4532525", "Karen", "I stayed here for twelve days  as I had various business meetings in the city. It was a perfect location. A great little neighbourhood with good transport links to get around Sydney.  Linda was a great host and was very flexible with check-in and check-out times. The apartment was clean and comfortable and was equipped with basic equipment. It was perfect for me on my own and for putting up a friend overnight on the sofa bed. Good value for money."),
("2017-03-29", "4532525", "Floriane", "The location is good  close to public transport and centrally located to visit Sydney  the car park is very convenient as well. We didn't meet Linda in person but the communication went great  she was very responsive. Cleaning to be improved. "),
("2017-04-02", "4532525", "Patrick", "I booked Linda's place for my Dad who was visiting Sydney. He really enjoyed his stay. It was walking distance to everything and Linda was very thoughtful in how she prepared the place for visitors."),
("2017-04-14", "4532525", "Sheetal", "Linda's place is perfect for a small family and friends stay. It is equipped with everything you need for a comfy stay  as the advertising quote says!! The location is perfect to catch up any place in and around city on foot... Very close by is Redfern station and Spar supermarket  which ease out routine stuff.My 3 yr old son enjoyed the most... the apartment is absolutely child friendly. Linda is wonderful host! Very responsive and supportive. We would definitely come and stay here in future!!Look forward to stay here again nd again.... cheers!!"),
("2017-04-22", "4532525", "Mary", "Cannot recommend this place enough. About 4 minutes from Redfern station which will get you anywhere you need to go. The appartment was clean and welcoming. Linda was communicative throughout our stay. Could not ask for a better host or appartment!"),
("2017-05-01", "4532525", "Joanna", "This is a wonderful place to stay for a few days in Sydney.Location is fantastic and the host Linda was wonderful - nothing was too much trouble. I'll definitely stay here again as it offered much more space than just a single room.Linda was so fast to respond to messages and even come to rescue me when I locked myself out!"),
("2017-05-05", "4532525", "Richard", "Linda is a great host and provided assistance to me on arrival and to her guests departing  to accomodate everyone s preferences. The property is very cool. Dont want to tell everyone incase its busy when I need it.. shhhh"),
("2017-05-11", "4532525", "Francis Jake", "Apartment is very tidy and complete. Well maintained and organized. Location is near to train station and city is well within reach. Great place if your visiting Sydney."),
("2017-05-14", "4532525", "Nora", "Linda's apartment is cosy but very comfortable. She really thought of everything. She is always reachable and helpful.I can only recommend her."),
("2017-05-20", "4532525", "Bella", "Linda was such a great host  and her place was neat. All the necessities were included and the location was perfect. We had such a lovely stay in Linda's place!"),
("2017-05-25", "4532525", "Leonie", "A great location and all the amenities that you need in the apartment to have a comfortable and enjoyable stay."),
("2017-05-31", "4532525", "Michel", "Appartement charmant  calme et bien équipé. Les instructions de Linda ainsi que les informations et documentations sur le quartier  les moyens de transport  les endroits à  visiter etc parfaitement claires et utiles. Situation idéale pour visiter Sydney  tout près de la station de train/metro Redfern  ou même à pied à 15 mn de la gare centrale. ...Séjour parfait. J'y reviendrais sans hésitation. Thank you Linda."),
("2017-06-06", "4532525", "Ranjit", "Great stay  linda was very helpful!!!"),
("2017-06-10", "4532525", "Rhoda", "Linda was extremely helpful with check in and available for other enquiries. The location is super close to great cafes and restaurants. Great place to stay if you plan on going out a lot."),
("2017-08-13", "4532525", "Alex", "Great location and nice unit for my wife and I. Host was super helpful and responsive."),
("2017-08-19", "4532525", "John", "Very good location and suitable accommodation"),
("2017-08-21", "4532525", "Partha", "Linda is a great host very responsive in answering queries. Place looks tired and more scrubbing is required. Location is good but the neighbourhood is sketchy for family stay"),
("2017-08-29", "4532525", "Iñigo", "The stay at Linda's house has been absolutely a success.Well equipated  located in a quiet neighborhood and close to the center  clean and with all the commodities you can need to spend some days while you visit the city.If i could come back again to Sydney  i would choose it without any kind of doubt.She has been very helpful and available at all times.If you have doubts...forget them; this is the best choice!Thanks for all Linda!"),
("2017-09-25", "4532525", "Peter", "Linda’s place was situated in the perfect location and the place was spacious  and provided more than you could ask for with a stay in Sydney!Linda was a fantastic host who was more than accommodating during my stay. Thanks a bunch!"),
("2017-10-01", "4532525", "Wayne & Samantha", "Comfortable  clean unit. Great base from which to travel and explore Sydney. OK size for family with kids (we are a family of 5). Probably better suited for older kids though given the staircase. (Our 19 month old had a fascination with the stairs which Kept us on our toes. :-) overall a good experience. Recommended."),
("2017-10-14", "4532525", "Clara", "Linda’s place is comfortable and convenient. It was nice that the bedroom area on the second floor was separated from the living area. Also  there was an extra bathroom downstairs with toilet and sink. The airbnb was close to plenty of restaurants and cafes as well as the Central Park and Broadway malls. You can go to the city center by train from the Redfern station  which is only 5 minutes away from the apartment. Check-in and check-out were easy. Although we didn’t get to meet Linda in person  she was always available on text and was a wonderful host :)"),
("2017-10-21", "4532525", "Jo", "Linda's place is lovely and have all the items that we will need to make ourselves comfortable. Linda is very responsive and easy to contact even though we never get to meet her. The only slight problem is that we need to climb a flight of stairs to get to the apartment so will need to carry the luggage. But other than that l  it was a nice stay. "),
("2017-10-28", "4532525", "Leah", "Great host  great location  great value. Highly recommend staying with Linda!"),
("2017-11-06", "4532525", "Mehdi", "Definitely recommend a nice and clean place  best location."),
("2017-11-17", "4532525", "Trevor", "If you use Uber check on (Hidden by Airbnb) maps that it has you on the right location for pickup."),
("2017-11-20", "4532525", "Tom", "Linda’s apartment in Redfern was excellent and we very much enjoyed our stay. The apartment was well furnished  very comfortable  and the kitchen had everything we needed to make some breakfast. Having an upstairs bedroom provided some nice separation between living and sleeping areas. Multiple balconies are a bonus! The location is excellent  from Redfern station it is a 10 minute train journey to Circular Quay and the trains are very regular. Alternatively  a walk to the Opera House is about 45 minutes through town. If we’re back in Sydney we will be staying at Linda’s apartment and we have recommended it to our friends in Redfern who need a reliable place nearby for family to stay when they are visiting. Thanks very much!"),
("2017-11-22", "4532525", "Caia-Reis", "Linda's beautiful place is located in an amazing location and a short walk away from plenty of amenities (the supermarket  post office  plenty of eateries etc). Check in was a breeze and the place was spacious and clean as described. It even came with its own parking lot! We were really thankful that Linda was hospitable and kind enough to bring in another fan in the sweltering heat just so she could make sure we were comfortable. Would most definitely recommend to other travellers and will be sure to stay again if we happen to be in the area! A***"),
("2017-12-13", "4532525", "Lauri", "We enjoyed our stay at Linda's place. The apartment was clean and well equipped. Especially the kitchen included everything we needed and two bathrooms were a blessing for four people. The bed in the main bedroom was ok and two people slept on the sofa bed quite nicely.The location of the apartment was good. The only downside is that there is no AC; the place (especially the upper floor) can get quite hot if it's very warm outside.We can highly recommend Linda's place!"),
("2017-12-19", "4532525", "Allen", "Fantastic host.  Very prompt responses and highly attentive to the incoming heatwave --- Linda went out of her way to get a misting fan to help our little one adjust to the hotter climate Would definitely stay again of back in Sydney"),
("2017-12-23", "4532525", "Alfred", "Linda was EXTREMELY! helpful. Check in was a breeze. Her home was very comfortable with all modern amenities  in a quiet street.Walking distance to train stations  and shops. Will definitely stay here again."),
("2017-12-31", "4532525", "Liana", "We’re very satistied with Linda’s Apartment. It was clean  with the very complete kitchen tools  utensil  and assorted teas. Linda provide a good goods and services. The apartment is the same as the pictures  within walking distances to the Redfern station  and she is responding very quicky to our questions. Highly recommended for travellers coming to Sydney."),
("2018-01-07", "4532525", "Jonathon", "It was such a lovely stay. Stayed over New Years and Linda allowed us an early check on which helped us so much. The location is perfect close enough to the city and the little touches around the house made us feel so welcome. Thanks Linda!"),
("2018-01-10", "4532525", "Alida", "Linda's place was wonderfully convenient to inner Sydney CBD yet remained quiet and peaceful.  Everything required for a comfortable stay was available & Linda was in contact & provided lots of tourist information in her unit. We had a car  so the undercover security parking was terrific  no need to search for on-street parking.  Public tranport was also easy to access from this location  only  a short stroll to the local train station. Wouln't hesitate to stay here again  as it was exactly what we were looking for and met all our requirements for a wonderful stay in Sydney."),
("2018-01-13", "4532525", "Jose Luigi", "Great Stay"),
("2018-02-04", "4532525", "Dorothy", "What a great find  convenient location  quiet  close to public transport and walkable to many attractions. Secure space  secure parking  comfortable bed  plenty of towels   a nice restaurant nearby  plenty of room and privacy."),
("2018-02-09", "4532525", "Chris", "Fantastic stay. Hospitality was great. Linda was very responsive and ensured that we were happy. Place is in a really nice neighbourhood   close to the city and Redfern station (never waited more than 5 mins for a train)."),
("2018-02-19", "4532525", "Chao-Lien", "回覆速度很快且清楚"),
("2018-02-26", "4532525", "Maisy", "It’s really a great place to stay as it’s near Redfern station  making it convenient to travel to either places.The house is neat and equipped with all essential that you need."),
("2018-02-28", "4532525", "Carol", "Great place  super clean  perfect location and Linda was very responsive and nice (before  during and after our stay)We enjoyed our stay and definitely recommend Linda's place."),
("2018-03-06", "4532525", "Bob", "well situated for railway station and in a safe up and coming area with a real sense of history  the flat is comfortable and has everything you would need for any length of stay  bed is comfortable and having two toilets is a bonus.No problem with noise (except the stairs which do creak a bit) and plenty of fans to keep cool in both lounge and bedroom.Linda responded very quickly to any questions and we would recommend the apartment."),
("2018-03-19", "4532525", "Ulrich", "Gut ausgestattet  tolle Lage  zentru (Hidden by Airbnb) ah. Super Kontakt mit Gastgeberin."),
("2018-03-23", "4532525", "Maria", "The apartment exceeds the description  perfectly located  clean  well equiped   Linda could not have been more helpful. Redfern is a cool place to stay lots of great and interesting places to eat at and very easy to travel round from. Highly recommend!! "),
("2018-04-07", "4532525", "Christine", "L'appartement de Linda est confortable et très bien équipé. Tout est bien pensé et pratique pour un séjour agréable. L'emplacement est bien situé et calme. Linda est disponible pour répondre à nos questions. Nous avons passé un super séjour!"),
("2018-04-11", "4532525", "Judy", "Great place  great host  convenient location  my family was very happy staying here!"),
("2018-04-12", "4532525", "Joel", "Linda communicated well with prompt replys. The car space is great especially in the busy city. The place was clean and quiet with thoughtful additions such as opal cards and Timtams on our arrival.There is a great little bar across the road from the apartment which was wonderful to sit and people watch in the afternoon."),
("2018-04-18", "4532525", "Bee Kee", "Great host  fast respond. Place very near Redfern station. House very tidy and comfort."),
("2018-04-24", "4532525", "Crystal", "Linda was super responsive and thoughtful. There were opal cards ready for us to use and suggestions for food and sightseeing. The place was clean and everything was prepared for us enough to experience a five star rating stay. The place has got a washing machine and a balcony for us to hang the clothes. We used all the spaces provided - did our morning exercises in the balcony  took photos at the other balcony and dad used the toilet downstairs. The night before we checked out  Linda texted us and said she could offer a late check out as there were no late requests. My parents loved staying at Linda’s and I bet they would stay here again next time."),
("2018-05-07", "4532525", "Rekha", "This bring my first AirBnB experience  it was definitely better than most of my hotel stays. Place is situated at a very convenient location with easy access to public transport. Linda is very reaponsive and very genuine and accomodating to all the requests. Overall  a very positive experience. Thank you so much! Highly recommend this place for a pleasant and comfortable stay!! :)"),
("2018-05-29", "4532525", "Rachel", "Location was perfect as it's 5 mins walk away from Redfern Station which has trains to many lines. Lots of university students walking around so it's more lively  though the street it's on is peaceful. 5 mins walk another way brings you to lovely cafes (Cafe Ella was my fav for coffee and pastries). Inside the home  it's spacious and cosy with full amenities. Appreciated the electric heated bed during winter. Linda has also been very helpful and responsive when I've got questions on the fly. Thank you!"),
("2018-06-13", "4532525", "Wenyan", "非常非常棒的房东 有事与她联系 都会悉心解答 因为都是年纪比较大的阿姨伯伯 又不会英文 遇到了很多问题 还好有Linda帮忙 都一一解决了｡非常赞\(≧▽≦)/!房子也很整洁干净 可以说是一应俱全｡总的来说 住的非常舒服!谢谢!希望下次来澳洲还能住你的房子｡｡｡｡那个时候希望有空调就好了!Very  very good landlord.older aunts and uncles cannot speak English  they have many problems. Fortunately  Linda has helped them.Thank you so much.This is a very comfortable house to live in.and very clean and tidy.I hope to live in your house next time I come to Australia... "),
("2018-06-20", "4532525", "Olivia", "This is my second time staying with Linda. Linda;s an amazing host  quick to respond with messages and very thoughtful. The place is similar to the pictures posted. 5 minutes walk to red fern station. Would definitely recommend this place. "),
("2018-07-13", "4532525", "Saudyono", "Linda's place is truly amazing! It has all the stuff that you would expect from a real ""home"" and not just some guest-house. Cooking materials and utensils  cloth detergent  tea & coffee selections  toys for kids... you name it  she has it :) (the kids love the TimTam :) )Communication is super-easy and she responded almost in real-time. The location of the place is also superb - 5 mins walk from nearest train station. And for those who rent car  the apartment comes with a dedicated parking slot in the basement!I strongly recommend Linda's place to anyone coming to Sydney!!"),
("2018-07-20", "4532525", "Jie", "This apartment is located near Redfern station  it is a very convenient  and quiet place. The host Linda is a very nice lady. My daughter and I had a wonderful time here. Love Sydney!"),
("2018-07-31", "4532525", "Steven", "Linda is exceptional from booking to check-out. The property is conveniently located too. Will definitely come back to book again."),
("2018-08-22", "4532525", "Yiping", "Really good place to live in!"),
("2018-09-02", "4532525", "Ian", "Great place  great neighborhood  great host! We stayed for 10 days and felt right at home."),
("2018-09-09", "4532525", "友輔", "Thanks Linda. This apartment was pretty good for me to stay. The host: Linda was so kind and the response was very quick. Thanks to Linda  I really enjoyed the trip in Sydney. I definitely recommend everyone to chose this apartment."),
("2018-09-15", "4532525", "Sara", "We had a great stay at Linda's place. Loved the location  perfect too as we were there for an event at Carriagworks which is a five minute walk away. Close to the train  good cafes/restaurants in the area. You can easily work to Redfern and Chippendale to explore the wider neighbourhood. Easy check in and quick response from Linda  helpful info booklet on the apartment and area.  Clean apartment  balconies  all details thought through with everything you need for an enjoyable stay. Quiet at night  I slept so well! Recommended and would definitely stay again"),
("2018-09-19", "4532525", "Lyn", "Great location and easy to find. Car space is an added bonus"),
("2018-09-22", "4532525", "Jenny", "很高兴能入住Linda & Linh 的房子 早上飞机到达 很早就入住了｡位置很方便 离市区 唐人街20-25分钟慢悠悠步行可到｡主人关于入住提示很详细 很贴心并回复迅速｡居家用品很齐全｡床上用品很舒服｡很适合短期在悉尼居住｡"),
("2018-10-01", "4532525", "Melanie", "linda and linh were super accomodating and allowed an earlier check in as my flight landed early. overalk the place is comfortable and the shower has good pressure and hot water. the place was relatively close to the station and was easy to get around from."),
("2018-10-05", "4532525", "Melody", "My parents and I spent a very great time in Linda's home. The house was comfy and service was excellent. My family made a terrible mistake but Linda is so kind that she tried to solve this problem many times. We had a good communication with each other to look for a best way to cope with the problem. I am sooooo happy to chat with Linda ❤ Thanks Linda!Btw  everyone may like the lovely house and the location is so convenient! It's the best choice to select in Sydney!!! I will live next time when I come to Sydney!"),
("2018-10-14", "4532525", "KangarooIslandFam", "Linda’s place was great. Close to great coffee shop/pub  Redfern train station  city and many other amenities. The apartment has lots of convienences which made our stay very accommodating."),
("2018-10-23", "4532525", "Shannon", "great unit. clean and tidy"),
("2018-10-27", "4532525", "Wenjun", "Linda very nice  answer quicky  near to city and station."),
("2018-11-03", "4532525", "Sukanta", "It is our first trip to Sydney  with my family including our 1-year-old  and all thanks to Linda  this was an amazing trip. Especially  my 1-year-old enjoyed it a lot. The property is very very close to Redfern (5 min walk) which means going to anywhere in the CBD is very very easy. There are a good cafe and a pub just in front of the property  which means you are covered if you are too lazy :-).We chose to cook most of the days  as Linda ensured all cooking amenities are readily available for the guests. I could reach out to her and ask her any question and always got a prompt response. Overall  I highly recommend this property to anyone  especially anyone with kid(s)."),
("2018-11-10", "4532525", "沐亭", "clean and cozyclose to station  city and the university of SydneyHave three balconiesConvenient for cooking at the unit"),
("2018-11-23", "4532525", "Jane", "The place is easy to everywhere and the owner prepared everything for the guests"),
("2018-11-30", "4532525", "Wendy", "Nice host  quick respond  good location near to train station."),
("2018-12-05", "4532525", "Mark", "Overall nice place and good host"),
("2019-02-02", "4532525", "소연", "Linda is a Good host!"),
("2019-02-09", "4532525", "Matthew", "Pleasant apartment in a very convenient location."),
("2014-12-14", "4589874", "Michael", "Staying at Craige's and Leonie's place was a great experience. The description was accurate and the rooms were clean and tidy. The appartment is very nice and just a five minute walk from the beach with heaps of nice restaurants just around the corner. Craige and Leonie are very friendly and nice people that provided excellent advise and support. I hope that I will have the chance to stay at their place  when I visit Sydney again."),
("2014-12-23", "4589874", "Stephanie", "Beautiful home in a great location. 5 minute walk to tons of cafes and restaurants and 5 minute walk to the beach. Family is very nice. They leave the front door totally open a lot of the time so if you are paranoid or untrusting with your things just be aware! But seems like a great neighborhood and we were not worried about our things. Some bugs like cockroaches but apparently this is normal for the area. Room was big and spacious with a tv and lots of closet space! Access to beach chairs was nice. Very good experience with lovely people."),
("2015-01-05", "4589874", "Catherine", "We. Were so happy to spend a week there...very close to the beach  and with very nice people...Craig and Leonie are very welcoming personnelThank you so much"),
("2016-04-06", "4589874", "Melissa", "It was a beautiful stay  5 min to the beach and really nice people!"),
("2016-04-18", "4589874", "Ana Carolina", "Craige and Leonie are very easy going!! Me and my boyfriend felt very confortable in the house and for use all the areas. The house is on a very good location... near to the beach  shops  cafes and public transport. "),
("2016-04-26", "4589874", "Alina", "it was just great  the location and the house are perfect and the hosts are very friendly"),
("2016-05-01", "4589874", "Alejandro", "If you are looking for something comfortable  great  near the beach  with tranquility  with excellent hosts  a nice house  private bathroom  large kitchen and also with yard where you can rest and even a barbecue  no doubt this is the best where can you be !!!"),
("2016-06-01", "4589874", "Léa", "CRAIG&LEONIE are two amazing host! They pefectly welcome us and made us feeling really confortable for our stay. The home is exactly as expected  beautiful  clean and warm ! The room is also cosy and quiet  everything to have a lovely life.Really easy to communicate with them and they don't hesitate to share their australian experience which is really enjoyable :) As many things which made our travel unforgettable ! "),
("2016-08-12", "4589874", "Madi", "We had a great few days in Bondi. The house is gorgeous. Everyone was lovely and the location was fantastic."),
("2016-08-13", "4589874", "Marion", "My stay in Bondi Beach with Leonie and Craige was perfect! The house is as described  very spacious and in a great location. Only a few meters to cafés  restaurants and supermarkets. You can use the kitchen and the beautiful garden. Having my own bathroom was fantastic  it's pretty new  with a bathtub. Very good WiFi in the entire house. Leonie and Craige are wonderful hosts. Prompt communication  easygoing  helpful and also very open! I'm happy I got to know them. Thank you very much!"),
("2016-08-16", "4589874", "Suzie And Andy", "We enjoyed staying with Craige and Leonie  it was great"),
("2016-08-21", "4589874", "Elspeth", "Very convenient stay with relaxed friendly family."),
("2016-09-06", "4589874", "Bill", "Craige and Lee made us most welcome.  The room and house was as described.  We stayed with Craige and Lee for almost 2 weeks as I recuperated from surgery at St Vincents Private Hospital Needless to say the location was fantastic  as it was a 30m walk to the bus stop  the cafes and shops.  The range of cafes was overwhelming so deciding on where to eat was a delightful problem to overcome.With a sizable Jewish population living in the area  it was a cultural experience to spend time browsing through Golds World of Judaica shop. We ate out most nights and made our breakfast and lunches back at the Craige and Lee's where all the facilities were available.It was an easy stroll to Bondi Beach and again down on the waterfront there were even more shops and cafes.The bus which ran like every 10 minutes took us to the massive Bondi Junction shopping centre and also to St Vincents Hospital. What a great location and great hosts."),
("2016-09-13", "4589874", "Cuiyun", "It is my first time to use Airbnb  finally I figure how to handle  craige & leonie they are super friendly  we had a good experience  the house is located at a very good location  just walk few minutes then you are at the beach and also close to restaurant and cafe  clean and privacy  the garden is nice. Generally everything is nice"),
("2016-09-14", "4589874", "Fischer", "This was our first airBNB booking  so we weren't really sure what to expect. We were very pleased. The room was good. Craige made us very welcome and explained the setup very well. "),
("2016-09-24", "4589874", "Tony", "Very nice people are Craige and Leonne.Most helpful and friendly.  Made us feel welcome and  'at home' during our brief stay.  Great location in the heart of Bondi  very close o everything needed on holiday."),
("2016-10-04", "4589874", "Elspeth", "Friendly Relaxed family. Very convenient location."),
("2016-10-06", "4589874", "Sanjay", "Received by Lea at the house. Guided us well. Very Friendly Host.Made us fell at home during entire stay. Craige has excellent sense of humour.  Very considerate as well. Could not have been better"),
("2016-10-08", "4589874", "Oliver", "Craige was accommodating from the moment we arrived late and he stayed up to give us the tour to the very end of our stay. Super helpful with advice for us regarding local attractions and the easiest way to get from A to B. The actual property itself was stunning and brilliantly placed  literally a few mins from Bondi Beach. Couldn't recommend this highly enough. "),
("2016-10-16", "4589874", "Phaea", "Craige and Leonie were great hosts. We had nice talks and they gave us a lot of good recommendations about where to eat and what to do in Bondi/ Sydney. Moreover the other residents of the house are great as well. The house itself is also quite nice and the location is fantastic! Next to the beach and with great restaurants nearby. We loved our stay!"),
("2016-10-22", "4589874", "Andrew", "All perfect! This is a great house within easy walking distance of everything at Bondi and a forty minute bus ride to Sydney CBD. A friendly reception  and Craig is well organised with the arrival  stay and departure. Everything was as it should have been! "),
("2016-10-24", "4589874", "Craig", "Great spot  with great amenities! "),
("2016-10-29", "4589874", "Lani", "I can't thank Craige enough for making us feel so welcome. It was my first time using AirBnb but I didn't at all feel uncomfortable and he was so accomodating! The location couldn't have been better! Thanks so much for everything  I would defiantly stay there again."),
("2016-11-01", "4589874", "Kiera", "We had s great stay! Craige was so friendly and lovely. Would stay again! Highly recommend- awesome location"),
("2016-11-04", "4589874", "Lawrie", "Graige & Leonie gave us a friendly reception and accommodated our early arrival. They are excellent hosts and make you feel welcome and relaxed.  The place is in a superb location being only few minutes walk to Bondi Beach which is well serviced with transport to Sydney every 10 minutes. We loved having breakfast in their peaceful backyard listening to the bird-life in the mornings. The area is nice and quiet considering its handy locality to everything Bondi offers. Overall an excellent stay with a good sized bedroom and own bathroom. Highly recommend ! Judy & Lawrie (NZ)"),
("2016-11-12", "4589874", "Liam", "This was my first Airbnb and after my wonderful experience with Craig  Leoni and family it will not be my last. Friendly interacting hosts  beautiful patio area with wild parrots flying around (great place to relax after a hectic day)  large kitchen  dining area and sitting room bedroom with private (Website hidden by Airbnb) were always made feel at home. Great quiet area close to Bondi Beach and shops and restaurants very close by.Why pay over twice as much for a small hotel room."),
("2016-11-15", "4589874", "Shannon", "We had a great stay in Bondi. We were in easy walking distance of the beach  restaurants and shops and it was any easy trip to the city.  We were made to feel welcome right away  and Craige and Lee were wonderful hosts! Thank you!"),
("2016-11-21", "4589874", "Djoulian", "Beautiful and great house ! Craige and Leonie are perfect ! It's the best housing of Bondi Beach !"),
("2016-12-01", "4589874", "Irene", "It's centrally located for all the action in Bondi Beach area.  Heaps of great restaurants  cafes  shops.  Very close to beach. The parking space was GOLD."),
("2016-12-05", "4589874", "Gail", "Great place to stay close to the beach.Lots of choices for dining and a local market is only a short walk away.Bottle shop( liquor store) is close as well.Craige and Lee are awesome!Invited me to join them for a barbecue."),
("2016-12-07", "4589874", "A", "It was so good.Host was so kind  and very good place"),
("2016-12-10", "4589874", "Claire", "Our stay was really nice! Craige and Leonie are friendly and really helpful. Great location with the beach bars and breakfast/dinner options in walking distance!Nice ferry trip to downtown and other locations."),
("2016-12-18", "4589874", "Ana", "I had a super enjoyable stay!! The location is absolutely great  short walking distance to the beach  cafes/restaurants  shops.. Craige and Leone are lovely and definitely make you feel very comfortable and welcome at their place! Great experience overall."),
("2016-12-22", "4589874", "Gonçalo", "Very good hosts  room matched indications. 5 min walk to the beach  very convenient. Room was a bit too hot but mainly because I preferred to shut down the window to avoid any bugs at night. There is also a fan system if required. "),
("2017-01-01", "4589874", "Vera", "Mistakenly booked this private room in a person's shared house; we've always had private rooms in the past. Turned out great  though!Location was excellent  hosts were incredibly helpful and kind - especially with getting around and other recommendations. The room we had was upstairs with our own  non-shared bathroom next door. The bed was comfortable and the room temperature was good. House had all the amenities you might want  laundry  cookery  etc. Only downsides I can think of are 1. during the hot summer days there is no air conditioner  but there is a powerful ceiling fan that kept the room at a pleasing temp. And 2. There was a big cockroach that flew in through the open window one night  but that's on us for leaving the window open. Highly recommended place - easy walking distance to any Bondi area  or a smooth bus ride anywhere else. Also  pretty close to the Rose Bay ferry for a super quick ride to downtown (rather than the slower bus)."),
("2017-01-04", "4589874", "Daisy & Rana", "Nice hosts  great location "),
("2017-01-14", "4589874", "Beth", "We had a brilliant time here at Jan 2017. Craige could not be any more helpful for giving us information on the best places for local dining  drinks and sites to see. Both were super friendly and made us feel very relaxed. Our only downside was that we did not stay longer. I would definitely recommend here. "),
("2017-02-04", "4589874", "Jeff & Lorelei", "This place is a must. So close to Bondi Beach and many fantastic restaurants. A 1/2 hour walk to the Rose Bay Ferry which is the way to travel to Sydney and the other water side communities. The outdoor space was a haven after a full day of touring!"),
("2017-02-11", "4589874", "Allyson", "The location is perfect as well as quiet  mere minutes from the beach and all of Bondi's bar and restaurants. Perfect for single or couples traveling that want all Bondi has to offer but also a good nights sleep. All of the shared amenities offered give it that 'at home' feeling and the availability laundry in the house is a life saver after beach days. The back garden and hot tub is a added luscious luxury and I always felt I could partake if I wanted.Craig and Lee are very friendly and extremely helpful and the fellow travelers that share the house are ideal house mates. One of the best Air BnB's I've stayed in. Will 100% book again. "),
("2017-02-20", "4589874", "Anna Zielonka", "We spent 6 days in Bondie Beach with my husband and 1 year old daughter. We strongly recommend this place - Craige & Leonie are fantastic hosts - they were answering all our questions and recommended great place to see in Sydney. Location of the place is very good - just next to Bondie Beach - very close to all restaurants and shops  but it is quiet at the same time. We really enjoyed our time there and we will recommend it to all our friends!"),
("2017-03-04", "4589874", "Jeff", "Great hosts  very cosy  but not very private. We did not expect a house share with family and lodgers. It meant we could not cook and enjoy the lovely garden. Great location."),
("2017-03-04", "4589874", "Sian", "We loved staying at craige and Leonies! Lovely place  great location and very welcoming hosts!"),
("2017-03-08", "4589874", "Milena", "Incredible house and top guests  5 minutes from the beach and from great cafés. Their garden is lovely and the room is very comfy. Thanks a lot!"),
("2017-03-19", "4589874", "Gwen", "Everything was lovely & we had a great stay"),
("2017-03-25", "4589874", "Ian", "Great Location. Lovely place and superb hosts."),
("2017-04-08", "4589874", "Freddie", "What an amazing place! We thoroughly enjoyed our stay here and we hope to be back soon!"),
("2017-04-13", "4589874", "Claire", "This is the perfect place to stay to see both Bondi and Sydney. It is very easy to get to and from on public transport and is close to some great cafes  restaurants and ice cream parlours. Craig and Leonie were so welcoming  thoughtful and kind and made our stay so enjoyable with wonderful recommendations and assistance. The bed is very comfortable and the private bathroom was immediately next to the room and immaculately clean. The area whilst close to shops and restaurants was really quiet at night and only a few minutes walk to Bondi beach.This was a wonderful place to stay and I would highly recommend to anyone. We had a truly amazing holiday here. Thank you so much."),
("2017-04-17", "4589874", "Kata", "Just wanna say thank you for Craige & Leonie for this amazing few days we could spend in their home. There is nothing to complain about  everything was clean and georgous. The place is very close to the beach  there is many restaurants  coffees around  and the neighbourhood is quiet. They are the most welcoming  friendly people I have ever met  gave us all the information we needed to know  and helped with everything they could. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-04-24", "4589874", "Marisa", "Great place- awesome location - walked everywhere in heart of bondi! Quiet street with such a convenient location! Will be back for sure!"),
("2017-05-14", "4589874", "Mattie", "Great location and home. You're walking distance to everything in Bondi and near the bus. They have a huge backyard and a large kitchen  giving you plenty of space to cook what you want. One night Lee and Craige brought us bowling which was really fun!! Highly recommend "),
("2017-05-19", "4589874", "Avrîl", "Beautiful modern clean house with friendly helpful hosts. Location could not be more central in Bondi. Had an amazing stay - highly recommend."),
("2017-05-28", "4589874", "Brenda", "When I go back to Sydney  I will definitely stay at 41 Roscoe Street  Bondi again. It is an inviting and warm environment  and my hosts  Craige & Leonie were absolutely respectful of my privacy but on hand for anything I needed. It was a really a beautiful experience to be so far from home (Italy)  and yet to feel so safely contained in this quiet  convenient  and beautiful house. The amenities in both room and kitchen were outstanding.  There’s an overall feeling of soft and peaceful accommodation. Just around the corner there are plenty of great places to eat or have a coffee. Bondi Beach is less than 5 minutes walk away and the scenery is hard to beat.I can’t really find any flaws at all!  Adriano  Italy"),
("2017-06-03", "4589874", "Vicki", "Couldn't recommend Craige and Leonie's place highly enough! The house is lovely  everyone was very welcoming and fun to be around. Bondi was everything we had hoped for! The area is great for food with lots of very reasonably priced places which would cater to everyone. Craige recommended a fantastic Thai restaurant called Bangkok Bites which we ended up visiting twice in our five days there. Would also highly recommend the coastal walk from Bondi to Coogee as a must-do activity. Getting into Sydney town centre was super easy  there are multiple ways to do it but we enjoyed catching a ferry which gives you views of the opera house and harbour bridge. "),
("2017-08-15", "4589874", "Kelly & Albert", "Craige and Leonie are great hosts!  The location is excellent!  Walking distance to the beach  restaurants  bus stop!"),
("2017-09-10", "4589874", "Doug", "Craige and Leonie's place is great  nice room  great spa and secluded backyard  also sooooo close to all the action in Bondi.Around great experience  and hosts that make you feel welcome.Check it out !!!!!!!"),
("2017-09-16", "4589874", "Victor & Lauren", "Beautiful place with nice vibes! Very close to the beach and great cafes and restaurants. Friendly welcoming family  thanks!"),
("2017-10-01", "4589874", "Arno", "We have appreciated calm and serenity during our stay  the cosiness of our room and the total comfort we were expecting . B sure we keep an excellent souvenir of this pleasant stay and that we will be good ambassadors .You can rely on us for good publicity of your hospitality among all our relations and contacts."),
("2017-10-12", "4589874", "David", "Craige and Leonie are great hosts and have a fantastic house in one of the best parts of Bondi. A few minutes from the bars  cafes and beach  their house is an oasis of calm. Our hosts kindly shared the public areas with their guests  including the fab Bali inspired garden with hot tub  BBQ and sun chairs. I highly recommend this as a great base to explore Sydney."),
("2017-10-25", "4589874", "Sanne", "Craige & leonie have a lovely home which is located great at bondi beach."),
("2017-10-29", "4589874", "Emily", "Craige & Leonies place was great - super close to shops and bars and of course the beach! They were great at responding and check in and out was so easy! We had booked thinking we had a whole apartment rather than just one room in a house - but we still had plenty of privacy. Thanks again!"),
("2017-11-08", "4589874", "Victoria", "Our stay at Craig & Leonie’s place was lovely  perfect for experience the Bondi’s lifestyle  5min to the beach  1 min to the restaurants and cafes. The garden is really nice. Thank you "),
("2017-11-17", "4589874", "Madison", "Location was perfect! Craige and Leoine are great hosts!"),
("2017-11-22", "4589874", "Stephanie", "Hôtes très sympathiques et discrets maison bien pratique"),
("2017-11-28", "4589874", "David", "Craige & Leonie's home is very spacious and they are a very relaxed couple.The bed was very comfy.The location is ideal for visiting Bondi and surrounding area.The local bus stop is 2 mins away and there is a big choice of eateries in the area."),
("2017-12-03", "4589874", "Emma", "Craige and Lee are wonderful hosts and have a beautiful house in Bondi - just a hop  skip and jump from the beach but far enough back to not be immersed in all the front strip hustle and bustle. Real local vibe to the surrounding streets and phenomenal food options close by for any foodie... or they welcome you to spark up the barbie in their beautiful garden whenever you like. Thank you both!"),
("2017-12-22", "4589874", "Pal", "What can I say about the hosts Lee & Craige. What a lovely genuine couple and nothing was too much for them. They let us check in early as our flight got in st 7am and usually check in is at 2pm. They left some hints and suggestions of what to do in the room with contact details and everything we needed to know about the area  where to get public transport  eat and go out. They even lent us beach towels. Lee lent me her straightener. WiFi too. Bathroom was super clean with a great shower. They got us a cab when an uber let us down. It was like being at home abroad. Very casual down to earth couple. In an ideal location near Bondi Beach. Just a 5 min walk but yet away from the hustle & bustle of the parade opposite beach. First time booking an Airbnb and so glad it was such a happy experience."),
("2017-12-28", "4589874", "Patrick", "Couldn't recommend this place enough. From the moment we arrived Craige and Leonie were so kind and made us feel at home by showing us around and giving us guidance on where to visit and things to do. The house is amazing  clean and the garden is beautiful. It's a perfect spot as restaurants and bars are literally round the corner and bondi beach is only 5 mins walk. Even though it is so close to the nightlife it's on a quiet road so getting a good nights sleep was easy. We had Xmas dinner with their family which was incredible generous. You have to do the walk from bondi beach along the coast to Coogee as it's stunning!! Overall couldn't fault anything about our stay and if we ever need somewhere to stay near bondi in future I will be coming straight back here. Thanks again for an amazing few days. Patrick and Elle x"),
("2018-01-04", "4589874", "Mike", "Room and bathroom were nice the common areas outside looked tired compared to photos could of been due to the weather as there was some rain when we arrived. Location is good for access to Bondi beach and the surrounding cafes."),
("2018-01-07", "4589874", "Pablo", "Perfect location  beautiful house. Highly recommend this place! Very close to the beach and main streets and the house has everything you would need and more. The garden is beautiful and it even has a BBQ. We enjoyed it very much."),
("2018-02-02", "4589874", "Janoeke", "De locatie is perfect  op loopafstand van het strand. Je krijgt veel lokale tips en je kunt in het huis overal gebruik van maken. Zelfs kaartjes voor openbaar vervoer liggen klaar."),
("2018-02-09", "4589874", "Christina", "Wir hatten einen tollen Aufenthalt bei leonie und craige. Die beiden waren extrem hilfsbereit und sehr freundlich. Die Lage des Hauses kann nicht besser sein  sehr ruhig und entspannt  gleichzeitig war die Hallstreet mit ihren Restaurants und Shops direkt um die Ecke. Zum Strand waren es keine 5 Minuten. Wir hätten es nicht besser treffen können!"),
("2018-02-15", "4589874", "Amanda", "Great spot  amazing location. Craig and Leonie are very nice and very accommodating  make great recommendations."),
("2018-02-22", "4589874", "Kimberly", "Hosts are very welcoming and location is perfect to maximize your experience in Bondi Beach."),
("2018-02-26", "4589874", "Pauline", "Location was brilliant  bed very comfortable  we felt very much at home."),
("2018-03-03", "4589874", "Marco", "Very nice hosts  fantastic garden  convenient location"),
("2018-03-27", "4589874", "Manju", "Wir haben die letzten Tage unserer Australienreise bei Craige und Leonie verbracht und hatten eine sehr schöne Zeit in Sydney. Die Unterkunft ist super gelegen und ein guter Ausgangspunkt  um Sydney zu erkunden. Man kann den tollen Bondi to bronte walk machen oder von Rose bay aus mit der Fähre nach Central Sydney. Craige und Leonie waren super gastfreundlich und haben viele wertvolle Tipps gegeben. Wir haben uns sehr wohl in ihrem großen schönen Haus gefühlt und wären viel zu gerne länger geblieben! Vielen Dank nochmal!"),
("2018-03-30", "4589874", "Wendy", "Deze airb&b is zeker een aanrader. Goede locatie vlak bij Bondi beach  gezellige woning en goede kamer met eigen badkamer. Voldoende privé met daarbij gezellig contact met de overige gasten en verhuurders. Graige en Leonie zijn spontane mensen en zeer behulpzaam met geven van tips en je comfortabel voelen. Wij hebben een top tijd gehad."),
("2018-04-08", "4589874", "Jacki", "Great location. Walking distance to bondi beach  shops and transport."),
("2018-04-22", "4589874", "April Ebru", "This was my best Airbnb stay (I tried many) as Craige & Leonie are wonderful host. They are very helpful  very friendly  easy going  they try their best to make you feel that you are at home. They are very social and talkative. The room and bathroom are very clean  very big. I loved their garden  it feels like you are in 5 star hotel garden:)... The location is super  very close to beach  the best cafes and restaurants in Bondi. My overall all stay was wonderful in that house. Thank you for being such a nice host"),
("2018-07-16", "4589874", "Sofia", "Craig y Lee facilitaron mi estancia en Bondi."),
("2018-10-10", "4589874", "Aaron", "We booked several Air Bnb's throughout our trip  this was the best one!"),
("2018-10-28", "4589874", "Nienke", "Can recommend this beautifull and warm home in Bondi to everyone! ❤"),
("2018-11-04", "4589874", "Safia", "I enjoyed the stay in Bondi! The location was perfect and super close to the beach and all the restaurants in the area. The tips and information provided was super helpful! The conversations were lovely as well! He only things I was surprised by was that It wasn’t as clean as I thought it would be based on reviews and ratings. I also wasn’t expecting to have additional Craig and Leonie which I would have appreciated being disclosed ahead of time or in the description. Otherwise if you’re looking for a low key  relaxed time then this is a great option!"),
("2018-11-10", "4589874", "Lucy", "Very hospitable and great location. They gave us a list of where is good to go in Syndey and  information on how to get to places  making our first time in Sydney  very easy :)"),
("2018-11-13", "4589874", "Jennifer", "I had a lovely stay at the Bondi Beach  Retreat at Craige and Leonie’s place.  Steps from everything and still only heard the birds chirping in the morning.  Very easy going and comfortable."),
("2018-11-22", "4589874", "Elvira", "Great location  near to the beach and restaurants. Craige & Leonie are friendly and relaxed. After checkout we may use facilities.  very kindful. Spitefully the house wasn’t clean  a lot of dust in the sleepingroom   and the bathroom was’t clean either."),
("2018-12-10", "4589874", "Nina", "Everything was as it should have been! Craige & Leonie was lovely   helpfull and witty. Very relaxing and Good experiense for the first airbnb! Thanks!"),
("2018-12-21", "4589874", "Hayley", "Great location  convenient short walk to beach  and cafes. Fantastic outdoor facilities  great to sit back and relax in the hot tub with the Balinese like surrounds."),
("2019-01-17", "4872526", "Sean", "My daughters and I had a great stay at Peter’s place! It was clean and spacious and the location is just great. Up in the hills with a view of the ocean and the valley below and only a few minutes drive to shops  restaurants and the beaches. Peter is a great host and we had a great experience overall!"),
("2019-01-19", "4872526", "Carissa", "It’s a granny flat and the aircon doesn’t reach the bedroom so was hot. Peter was nice but the price for the place that we were provided was poor"),
("2019-01-25", "4872526", "Pinar", "Fantastic hosts and beautiful apartment  would book it again any time. The apartment has everything you need and Peter and Pauline have been great with communications and made the entire process super easy and convenient."),
("2019-01-27", "4872526", "Andrew", "House is in a stunning location nestled in the hills of Bilgola. Really enjoyed the privacy  light filled rooms and stunning views. Would definitely recommend this place to anyone looking to get away from the hustle and bustle of Sydney while still being in a central location to access some of Sydney's best beaches."),
("2019-02-02", "4872526", "Anna", "The place is in a beautiful  peaceful location with an amazing view and sounds of the ocean. The apartment is very private and self contained - great amenities. I highly recommend this place and Peter was great to communicate with."),
("2019-02-14", "4872526", "Malcolm", "Beautiful apartment with amazing amenities!"),
("2019-02-16", "4872526", "Neil", "Clean and tidy  well appointed  easy check-in  stunning view from the balcony  short car trip to beaches and Pittwater. A perfect spot for a weekend at the northern beaches."),
("2019-02-27", "4872526", "Simone", "Great place and hospitality  we had a short stay but it left a great impression!"),
("2019-03-01", "4872526", "Ben", "Great place for a weekend away with great private views!"),
("2019-03-02", "4872526", "Elizabeth", "Great place to stay for a weekend away on the northern beaches. The apartment was clean with modern amenities and a great view in a lovely location. Our host was very reliable to contact and we would definitely stay here again!"),
("2015-04-08", "4919014", "Carmen", "Had an amazing time in Manly  much credit due to the apartment and it's amazing location. This apartment was tastefully decorated with plenty of wardrobe space so you could unpack and feel at home!! Also  we could not have asked for a better position  we were so central to absolutely everything from cafes to shopping  it had an amazing view of the beach and surrounding areas! Would definitely stay here again! And recommended it to everyone!!! "),
("2015-09-28", "4919014", "Claire", "Jarmo a été trés chaleureux et trés souple quand aux modifications de dates éventuelles   contact trés agréable et sans complications inutiles .  L'appartement est juste GENIAL   hyper propre du sol au plafond en passant par le linge de maison   rien ne manque pour un séjour à Manly et en arrivant aprés un long vol il est bien agréable d'y trouver du thé du café et tout le nécessaire pour commencer le séjour .De jour comme de nuit la vue est .....wouahouuuu   .....encore mieux que ça   ....extraordinaire. Merci à Mr et Mme Jarmo   je reviendrai !!!!"),
("2016-03-08", "4919014", "Melissa", "Beautiful apartment. Great location. I would love to rent this place again!Thanks for everything Jarmo!Noah"),
("2016-04-06", "4919014", "Rose", "We had a wonderful stay at Jarmo's apartment in Manly.The view  just as it was shown in the photo  was amazing! We got a clear sight of the activities on Manly Beach  even Shelley Beach  surfers riding the waves  sail boats anchored in sea  kayaks out in sea  I could even spot my young daughter on the beach from the apartment! The view should enough reason to choose Jarmo's apartment!Corso  which is the main strip of shops  is just a short skip away. The farmers' (Wednesday) and craft (weekends) markets are just outside the building. A 24/7 convenience store is just round the corner. Being so central  it gave us the opportunity to try different restaurants  cafes  little coffee shops around the area every meal.It was an easy stroll to Manly Wharf  too  to catch the Manly Ferries to Sydney. On our last trip to Sydney  my husband left his Opal card with just under 20 mins to catch the next ferry. He made it to the apartment and back to catch that ferry. Jarmo strongly recommended we use the Manly Ferries and we could now understand why. The slower pace of the Manly Ferries allow us to enjoy the view of the Sydney Harbour and its surrounding area  Watson Bay and North Head (which you could see from the apartment) each time we took the ferry.Jarmo was thoughtful to provide all our necessary toiletries  washing and laundry detergents  milk  tea and coffee (with coffee machine!) in the apartment. There were even umbrellas for the rainy days! Jarmo is also very helpful. He answered my non-stop numerous questions about the apartment and Manly. He inquired about the fare for the airport shuttle bus for me  gave suggestions on the tours and gave me recommendations on things-to-do on Sydney and Manly etc. He is definitely a Superhost!"),
("2016-04-17", "4919014", "Christine", "Jarmo met my husband and I and showed us around the apartment.  It was exceptionally clean  comfortable and well appointed. We enjoyed our stay here as the apartment met all our needs and the view of the beach was beautiful! It was conveniently situated close to the Corso  ferry and shops. The only drawback was the bustle of people leaving pubs late at night  especially weekend nights."),
("2016-06-21", "4919014", "Dmitry", "It's awesome  value for money (comparing with another appartments i lived in)  beautiful ocean view  nice equipment  good location. If you still have a doubt - you shouldn't"),
("2016-08-13", "4919014", "Tobias", "Stayed there 3 weeks with one child and baby during winter and loved it. Lovely  very friendly and well organised hosts. Fantastic views of Manly and Shelly beach. Very well equipped apartment. Feels all new and clean! Everything in close walking distance: shops  cafes  restaurants  weekend markets   transport  pleasure walks  etc.  Residential parking available. Despite a bit of renovation noise we had from one of the units next to the apartment for a few days during the week we would stay there again any time! Manly beach is just beautiful and you get the best views there!"),
("2016-08-22", "4919014", "Guto Nevelyn", "It was amazing... I took my family in a business trip and also TO celebrate 12th wedding anniversary and that is why I have chosen Jarmo's place  cause It is in an amazing place with a perfect view and great facilities...The true is that JArmo and his wife were amazing  I am for sure going to stay there many times from now on... If you are looking for the perfect place... Dont think twice  this is the place  and also the price is more than fair... Believe me  around the neighborhood you are not going to find a better place and not even a better price...Thanks a lot mr. Jarmo  we hope to see you very soon :)"),
("2016-10-22", "4919014", "Bre", "If you are looking for the ideal spot to stay in Manly Beach - look no farther!  Not only is the host easy to access  the studio apartment is decked out with every detail needed to make staying in Sydney effortless.  Being someone from the U.S. Jarmo has thought of everything to make sure you know to get around on the Ferry's and can get a hold of them if you need anything at all!  We stay in Sydney every year and this is by far the best spot - it is so peaceful  serene and relaxing  what more could you ask for!   The home is spacious and I literally can't think of a single thing that could have been done better - this place has everything!   5 stars and if you are thinking of staying in Manly look no further as you won't find a better place or a better host!  Thank you so much Jarmo!"),
("2016-11-02", "4919014", "Chrystal", "We had a great stay at the apartment! It was very clean and the hosts were very friendly and did everything to ensure we had what we needed including a crib and highchair. It was very handy to beach and shops which was very handy with bubs!"),
("2016-12-17", "4919014", "Sheldon", "Great place for a vacation. Awesome view of the beach  cute little place with everything in it. It is close to all the shops and the ferry so getting to things without a car is no problem. Good selection of Netflix  YouTube and cable on the TV. All around good time."),
("2017-08-24", "4919014", "Dietrich", "I've stayed in the building 3 times and it's such a brilliant location. Their place is perfect. Really nicely appointed and they couldn't be nicer. Highly recommend :)"),
("2017-10-03", "4919014", "Chris", "Fantastic apartment in a great location. We would love to stay again if we are ever in Manly."),
("2018-03-24", "4919014", "Neil", "Top hosts. Great apartment in a brilliant location. Really well set up and sparkling clean. Strongly recommended."),
("2018-04-12", "4919014", "Michelle", "The apartment is bright and modern and the views are amazing.  It was lovely to be met personally and taking up to the apartment and shown how everything works.  A very nice touch."),
("2018-08-11", "4919014", "Maria Jose", "Hemos estado muy a gusto en casa de Jarmo. Desde el primer momento fue un detalle que nos esperase su hijo para explicarnos todo lo referente a la casa. La comunicación con el ha sido muy buena siempre y eso se agradece. La casa muy limpia y con todo lo necesario  incluso mas  como el aparato de música  la cama muy cómoda y la cocina aunque pequeña con bastantes utensilios.La casa es igual que en las fotos  no decepciona en absoluto. Las vistas son increibles. Y esta en pleno centro de Manly y a dos pasos de su fantástica playa.Ha ido una buena semana en Sydney!La recomiendo totalmente!"),
("2018-08-20", "4919014", "Briar", "Great location and view  clean and tidy room and had everything we needed. Would definitely stay again :)"),
("2018-09-15", "4919014", "Fiona", "Great spot  good location and the family is very nice easy to communicate."),
("2018-09-19", "4919014", "Chris", "Jarmos apartment is fantastic  it was our 2nd stay here.The communication and checkin is greatApartment is clean  nice and fresh  everything you need and the view is amazing.the location is perfect  right next to the corso and beach."),
("2018-09-28", "4919014", "Luis", "El departamento es tal cual se ve  muy bien ubicado y Jarmo es un gran anfitrion. Muy recomendable"),
("2018-11-25", "4919014", "Ken", "The views from this apartment are simply stunning and they might be the best in Manly.  I highly recommend waking up early to catch a sunrise right from your bed or dining table with a coffee -- it's an unforgettable one.   During the morning  in the direct sunshine  the apartment can get quite warm if you don't utilize the shades properly  so be sure to do so.  The apartment is in an incredibly convenient location  walking distance to the beach  a ton of shops and restaurants  and most importantly for me  a 5 minute walk to the Manly ferry wharf.  Jarmo and Terje were incredibly helpful with anything I needed and I'll definitely be back!"),
("2018-12-21", "4919014", "Brooke", "Great location!"),
("2019-01-18", "4919014", "Ruben Dario", "Excellent apartment  near to the beach  clean  good price and good comunication with the owner."),
("2019-02-01", "4919014", "Matt", "Great place  great location and amazing views."),
("2012-06-18", "501382", "Ahmad", "Great stay at Luise's flat. It was modern and new  very clean and simply we felt like home from home.Luise is a perfect host and so friendly  she provided us with everything we could need to know in sydney. Highly recommended host and definitely I wish to meet her again once I get Sydney."),
("2012-06-25", "501382", "Helena", "It was a lovely apartment with a relatively good location. There were numerous buses that could get us to town quickly. The house was very well furnished. The furniture and fittings and kitchenware were all clean and new. The exterior of the building may seem rather run-down but once you enter the apartment  it truly feels like a home away from home. Louise was a great host and we would be happy to return again in the future. "),
("2012-07-02", "501382", "Eduardo", "Great place. Clean  modern and tidy. "),
("2012-08-05", "501382", "Chiara", "Absolutely perfect! Tidy  clean  tasty furnished. Location is great too: opposite Centennial Park  15 minutes bus ride to the spectacular beaches of Clovelly and Coogee and 10 minutes to the CBD. Louise was a great host  very kind and helpful...I definitely loved her place."),
("2013-06-30", "501382", "Wendy", "I really enjoyed my stay at Louise's place. She was always responsive an helpful and her apartment has everything you need - not to mention convenient. I wouldn't hesitate to recommend her place to others!"),
("2013-07-07", "501382", "Lars", "The reservation was canceled 175 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2013-07-14", "501382", "Kenneth", "Comfortable apartment right next to a beautiful park. Sits in one of the major traffic hub in eastern Sydney with buses to take you into City and south eastern suburbs conveniently.Helpful and friendly hosts too!"),
("2013-08-11", "501382", "Hasan", "We have enjoyed our stay at Louise's flat. It is modern and spacious  and full of sun light. All the appliances are new and working excellently. The little herb garden was useful in cooking with fresh herbs. Louise is very considerate and friendly. I would very much recommend the flat for a comfortable unforgotten stay."),
("2013-09-13", "501382", "Sadia", "I had a fantastic time at Louise's apartment. Its a full of light airy apartment- a quality I just love. It was very neat and tidy with lots of space  great wardrobes and a fully functional kitchen with some lovely spices and goodies. The herb patch is my favourite part and I enjoyed all the fresh thyme roesmary and parsley.Its a 20 minute bus travel to the city with a great frequency of buses and a bus stop just opposite the house.Thanks Louise for a wonderful stay :)"),
("2013-11-23", "501382", "Tudor", "Spotless Sydney apartment for a decent price  that hidden gem that we are all secretly looking for. There are few things better than having breakfast on the balcony  on a sunny day  and stalking parrots from nearby trees. Louise was a great host and cared to our every need."),
("2014-01-25", "501382", "Barbora", "We enjoyed our stay in Louise's apartment this past January. The flat is really  fantastic  both beautiful and practical  very well equipped and pleasant. Louise and John were nice and helpful.  We would recommend this place to anyone. Only one little note: Alison Rd is very busy and rather noisy at the peak hours."),
("2014-02-19", "501382", "Helena", "Thank you so much Louise and John  what an amazing apartment and location. We really enjoyed our stay and it made our time in Sydney very relaxing. Would definitely recommend staying here and we will be sure to try and book this apartment for our yearly visits. Thank you again.We were easily able to walk to our event at Moore Park and it was a cheap taxi fare from neighbouring suburbs of Paddiington and Surry Hills. Some great local dining options also just around the corner. The amazing Coogee beach is an easy car ride away and also has other great dining venues too. I am a lover of dining out but if you wanted to stay in and cook the apartment has a great kitchen too"),
("2014-03-02", "501382", "Corinne", "Louise nous a accueillis très chaleureusement.On a trouvé un appartement très propre  bien décoré et agencé. Situé entre les belles plages (Coogee  Clovelly  Bondi) et le centre de la City il est très pratique de circuler rapidement en bus d'un côté comme de l'autre (environ 15 mn de trajet).Nous vous le recommandons volontier."),
("2014-04-02", "501382", "Elin", "I spent a lovely long weekend at Louise's apartment. The place is modern  comfortable and spotlessly clean - exactly as it looks in the photos. The location is great too  with easy access into the city and to the beaches. I ummed and ahhed about getting a more expensive  but not as nice place by the beach and i'm really glad I chose not too. This was the perfect for getting around easily and spending  a few days of feeling at home in a city that's very far away from home! Plus Louise could not have been a more accommodating host - thank you for helping to make my last week in Sydney so great."),
("2014-04-08", "501382", "Werner", "Very lovely  sunny and clean apartment.Very tastefully furnished.All equipment available including washing machine and dryer.Although we did not meet Louise she arranged everything perfectly!It might be a little noisy because of nearby mainroad....."),
("2014-04-13", "501382", "Robert", "Louise's place was perfect for traveller  work or couple  quiet yet very convenient location with transport at the door to the city in 10 mins  very clean and hospitable hosts  it was a pleasure and I will be returning soon I'm sure "),
("2014-05-10", "501382", "Mabel", "The apartment was as immaculate and perfect as the pictures and has everything u need. The location of the apartment was awesome  a short 5-10min drive to the city and Westfield Eastgardens where we went for a late night movie. The only thing to note is that there are no lifts so be prepared to walk up 4 flight of stairs. Other than that  all was good. Louise was amazing  she was very responsive and helpful. Highly recommended :)"),
("2014-05-17", "501382", "Paul", "Our stay in Louise's apartment was like a home from home and she was always available  helpful and answered any queries promptly.The bed was very comfortable and our adult son was more than happy on the sofa bed and in front of the TV!The immediate area was not so good for food shopping but we always managed to get what we needed in the CBD before returning each day. Bus journeys in and out were easily negotiated.Thank you Louise for making us so welcome!"),
("2014-06-02", "501382", "Ross", "Another wonderful Airbnb experience! Exceptional apartment with great instructions."),
("2014-06-20", "501382", "Rita", "I stayed at Louise apartment for 2 weeks cause it is close to UNSW. It is convenient to visit my son who studies there. The apartment is same as the pictures shown in website  it is very clean with well equipped kitchen. I feel like at home and both me and my husband are satisfied staying here."),
("2014-07-21", "501382", "Justin", "Louise's place is fantastically airy and inviting  with big open windows that view out onto the Sydney skyline. The space was plenty big for my girlfriend and I for 4 weeks after we relocated our lives from London to Sydney. The kitchen has everything you need to prepare meals and everything is of top notch quality (we even bought the same kettle after using the one in Louise's kitchen!). The bedroom has the most comfortable bed ever and tons of wardrobe space to store your stuff. Massive TV in the lounge room and the dining table allowed us to work during the day and have full meals of an evening. Buses to the city are right out on Alison Rd and it only takes 20 min to be in the heart of Sydney. Quiet neighbourhood  close to shops in Kensington and a short drive from Randwick/Waterloo for more shopping. Centennial Park across the road is great for weekend walks too."),
("2014-08-23", "501382", "Gill", "Had a very good time here  lovely apartment  easy travel as local buses frequent to city  central station   circular quay  and beaches would highly recommend.Fast wifi. Very friendly welcoming host."),
("2015-01-06", "501382", "Y", "The apartment is as the photos portray it. It is well located  and we got around fairly easily having a car with us.  The sofabed is convenient if you prefer two sleeping places.  The dishwasher and washing machine worked reasonably well and the kitchen was outfitted well enough for cooking some meals at home.  Jenny keeps a great garden outside  and it's nice to have a couple basil or salad leaves at hand.  Do bear in mind the walk up when booking  we were well aware of this  so it was fine  but understandably for some with many bags it could get a little tough.  The neighborhood is otherwise quiet  and parking seemed to work out fine.  "),
("2015-08-09", "501382", "Mushir", "Very clean and tidy apartment. Just opposite Centennial Park. Few minutes from the bus station departing to all major stops.  7-8 mins to grocery (a bit expensive but serves your need). The flat is on the second/third floor (stairs no lift). WIFI  TV  Cooking  Heating all facilities available. Highly recommended.  "),
("2015-09-02", "501382", "Andrew", "The apartment was very clean and had everything i required for a short stay. Bed was a great size and very comfortable. Really liked the couch  great for relaxing on. Excellent sound system. Louise was very helpful. Everything was as shown in pictures if not better. "),
("2015-09-06", "501382", "Hendrick", "Good communication with host. Very central location to all major neighborhoods in the city. Unit is well furnished."),
("2015-09-14", "501382", "Marcus", "Lovely place! Very convenient to central area (10 mins bus ride)  safe place. Will definitely come back again"),
("2015-11-03", "501382", "Vinicius", "This place I was just perfect for our trip. The place is just as shown in the pictures: clean  organized  bright. The kitchen is well equipped and the living room / bedroom are very comfortable. It takes only one bus to go to city centre. The host was impeccable  very efficient in the communication and made my first ""airbnb"" experience so much easier. Totally recommended!"),
("2016-01-03", "501382", "Molly", "The host canceled this reservation 12 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-01-03", "501382", "Carla", "The host canceled this reservation 58 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-01-17", "501382", "Kari", "Apartment was excellent - cosy  spacy and including all necessities and more - real home away from home. Apartment is very clean  has excellent bed  nice bathroom  all exactly like in the pictures.Communication with Louise was easy  prompt and polite. Lack of aircon did not bother us at all  as it was possible to keep the windows open and thus get nice cool breeze towards evenings and in the night time. We were especially happy about the insect shields in all windows.We would propably have missed the Centennial park visit if we had stayed elsewhere. Now  as it was so close  we got there on several days and enjoyed the parklife  birds  especially. Bus stops were quite close the apartment and there were very frequent schedules  short waits only  to city center (ca. 20 minutes by bus).Altogether very positive first ever experience for us of using airbnb."),
("2016-04-03", "501382", "Karl", "The host canceled this reservation 3 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-08-09", "501382", "Kayla", "Our stay at Louise's place was fantastic - we didn't want to leave! The apartment was very clean with a well-stocked kitchen - everything we needed to have an enjoyable stay was right at our fingertips and Louise was incredibly helpful and had great suggestions for things to do/see. Would recommend for anyone looking for a cozy home base to explore Sydney!"),
("2016-08-12", "501382", "Wontae", "It was good!!!"),
("2016-08-25", "501382", "Martin & Annie", "We needed a base in Sydney for two weeks work and Louise & John's place worked perfectly. It was probably a little better equipped than described: always great to get back to."),
("2016-09-08", "501382", "Johannes", "a really nice flat  tiny and clean  good for three person. nice kitchen. close to the city and opera. i would stay there again...thx"),
("2016-09-15", "501382", "Brian", "Wonderful apartment unit. Very clean and cozy. Louise mum was an absolute superstar. Clean bathroom too. Getting to CBD was easy. We always travel by UberX to Central Station which usually will cost us around $12-15 dollars. Many eateries within 10 minutes walking distance. The ""travel around guide note"" and ""house manual print-out"" which was prepared by Lousie  was very helpful indeed. The downside is the unit is on the 3rd floor with no lift. But in overall  we enjoyed the stay."),
("2016-09-18", "501382", "David", "I very enjoyed Louise's flat. It gave a very good experience of what it feels like to live in a modern flat in Sydney."),
("2016-11-29", "501382", "Jane", "Louise responded to our requests so quickly both for the initial booking & on arrival to make sure everything was to our satisfaction.Great location for doing business in Sydney with everything required for the stay. Thanks!"),
("2016-12-10", "501382", "Melissa", "Place as described if not better. Was quite hot without aircon  but still completely bearable. Great location  close to shops  restaurants  bowling  bars etc.. Paid about $15-20 for an uber to circular quay! Thanks for the lovely stay. "),
("2016-12-31", "501382", "Hyejin", "Very clean house as it shows in the picture. Me and my family enjoyed staying here. Not really close to city but quite nice neighbourhood!"),
("2017-01-02", "501382", "Susan", "Just spent a comfortable couple of nights at Louise's spotlessly clean  modern apartment. Everything was exactly as described  the TV is huge  the bed is extremely comfortable and the kitchen has everything you could need to whip up any sort of meal. I hired a car and was able to park easily close by  but the busses are also frequent. The bathroom has a great shower head  and there is a washing machine if you need to do any washing. Louise responded promptly to any messages  and was friendly and helpful. It is on the third floor  so there are stairs to climb  but it does mean that the flat gets a lovely breeze. A 100% positive experience. Thanks again Louise"),
("2017-03-04", "501382", "Rosemarie", "Clean and tidy  within easy reach of buses to the centre.  Everything we could need was provided."),
("2017-03-06", "501382", "Risako", "the appartment was very clean and pretty. Location was absolutely perfect;  not in the center of the city but close enough!"),
("2017-05-22", "501382", "David", "Great place to stay.  They are very helpful if you need anything"),
("2017-06-07", "501382", "Songyi", "Nice host  Beautiful flat. Convenient  transportation. Good location Everything was perfect so my friends and I had great time:)"),
("2017-06-13", "501382", "Shaun", "Close to amenities  lovely  clean & good value for money."),
("2017-06-17", "501382", "Keyang", "Louise is such a nice host. She answered my every single question patiently and gave us thorough instructions. She's really thoughtful and she prepares everything that you can think of in the house."),
("2017-09-15", "501382", "Chengyu", "The room is clean with beautiful sunrooms. Close to bus station and national park. However  i am very disappointed about what happened here. After I went back to my home. The house ownner emailed me about several questions need me to pay. He mentioned about stains on the rug in the living room and damage to the rug. (I strongly doubt this point) and also mentioned the flat was not left very clean (We washed all dished  throwed all wastes and cleaned living room). We are still discussing about the repaire fee. Please everyone  be caution."),
("2017-09-30", "501382", "Laura", "Louise's apartment was very clean and tidy. We were greeted by her partner in the afternoon and he showed us where everything was. Was so close to public transport  shops and restaurants. We had the best time and would recommend this place to anyone."),
("2017-10-06", "501382", "Linda", "The apartment was so clean and tidy. Very helpful  we did get a little lost  made contact and all sorted. Overall it was a great stay  great apartment in a great location."),
("2018-01-05", "501382", "Mary", "Louise’s place is ideally located to walk to SCG (Sydney Cricket Ground) or any type of event located at Moore Park."),
("2018-05-05", "501382", "Amy", "Louise was so friendly and welcoming with us. Her place is so clean and nice. Short drive to Bondi beach and Coogee beach. Loved stay here!"),
("2018-06-19", "501382", "Lara", "Great location and value for money. Check in and out was easy. Would definitely recommend."),
("2018-06-24", "501382", "Mitchell", "fantastic place. close to airport  Sydney cricket ground/ Allianz stadium entertainment quarter. louise was efficient with responses  and her apartment has everything you'd need. thanks louise!"),
("2018-07-09", "501382", "Steven", "Great location between airport and city."),
("2018-07-13", "501382", "Naomi", "Louise’s place was really nice. The rooms and beds were as described and nice and clean. The only downside was that the parking was really inconvenient. There wasn’t parking guaranteed for us  and the back streets weren’t clean whether it was one way or not  so it was a bit dangerous. There was only two visitor spots that could only fit small cars  not recommended for big cars. Other than that  everything else was awesome. Was a very homey and cute place with heating and a nice TV."),
("2018-07-21", "501382", "Szilvia", "I spent a very good time in Louise's apartment. Everything was as described. The arrival was very easy with the key in the key lock and Louise and her husband gave me all the information needed. They were very responsive and available by email. Internet connection worked perfectly in the apartment. The amazing city center is accessible by several buses (bus stop is about one minute by walk). The surrounding is quiet  I really appreciated the parrots coming on the balcony in the morning. Thanks Louise and John."),
("2018-12-31", "501382", "Sydney", "Louise's flat is a great  centrally located space with tons of beautiful natural light  easy access to public transportation and across-the-street proximity to a wonderful Sydney public park! Louise went out of her way to welcome us to her flat and go over local eateries  beaches and transportation for our trip. The flat was a great start to our Aussie adventures!"),
("2019-01-03", "501382", "James", "Excellent host! Very responsive and helpful prior to booking. Also available to assist during stay if required (though in our case not required). Apartment very well presented and clean. Excellent location for the Kensington area and also for commuting to city; public transport very easy to manage and close by. Thank you very much. Would definitely book again."),
("2015-04-05", "5116907", "Emma", "Great apartment and everything we needed was there. Ideal location and very comfortable. Enjoyed our stay very much. Thank you Ant for making it so easy ;)"),
("2015-07-26", "5116907", "Louise", "Anthony made clear plans so I could access the apartment. Good communication. It was a tidy and nice place to stay - about a 15 min walk to Bondi beach."),
("2015-08-16", "5116907", "Lauren", "We had a fantastic stay at Anthony's place in Bondi. The apartment was very clean  modern and exactly as the pictures show. The morning sun on the balcony is perfect for a cup of tea or coffee and a relaxed time.It is tucked away on a quiet street  which was excellent for a quiet nights sleep  but still just a quick walk to the main shops of Bondi and the beach."),
("2015-09-21", "5116907", "Simon", "Great spot. The owner was super prompt with replying to emails  accommodating and helpful. Perfect spot."),
("2015-09-28", "5116907", "Tevita", "Anthony's place was just as described. Great location  very clean  walking distance to everywhere. 10 minutes to the beach and even closer to cafes and shops.I would definitely stay there again and recommend it when staying in bondi "),
("2015-10-16", "5116907", "Danielle", "A lovely apartment in a great location  Anthony's place was perfect for me. Tucked away in a lovely quiet part of Bondi  it's a 15-minute walk to the beach and seconds to the bus stop to head into the city. The apartment is clean  modern and well maintained. I had a fantastic stay at Anthony's place in Bondi. "),
("2016-01-01", "5116907", "Emily", "We had a brilliant time staying at Anthony's place. It's clean  has everything you need  and is well located to enjoy Bondi and the rest of Sydney. Highly recommended! "),
("2018-02-25", "5116907", "David", "The apartment is conveniently located in a quiet suburban Bondi street but close enough to walk to the  beach and local cafes  so it's very handy. A clean and comfortable home away from home. Anthony is an awesome host who is very responsive to questions and give lots of useful local tips. Will definitely recommend it for a pleasant stay in Bondi Beach. Nice welcome touch on self-check in :-)"),
("2018-03-10", "5116907", "J", "PERFECT!! I couldn't ask for anything more. The space is decorated really nicely  location is awesome and Anthony is a thoughtful host. I would highly recommend this apartment to anyone."),
("2018-03-24", "5116907", "Alex", "My partner and I stayed for the weekend and were very happy with the accomodation  very clean and modern! Really good spot walking distance to the beach and lots of cafes and restaurants would definitely stay again  highly recommend Anthony’s place."),
("2018-03-31", "5116907", "Chao", "Nice place to stay. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-13", "5116907", "Ash", "Anthony’s place was perfect. We enjoyed two nights. He was great to communicate with. Would highly recommend this accommodation"),
("2018-10-07", "5116907", "Chloé", "Great stay at Anthony’s place. Lovely apartment and really nice welcoming gift.  We’ve been able to enjoy Bondi. Thanks a lot Anthony!"),
("2018-10-20", "5116907", "Mark", "Very nice place  great communication great location  highly recommend  thanks so much!"),
("2018-11-10", "5116907", "Laura", "This place was everything we expected and more! Anthony was an amazing host  accommodating our early check in. The place was left super clean and tidy and had everything we needed not to mention the complimentary wine/chocolate. Location was amazing with a short walk to bondi and 20min Uber to airport (Sunday). The ease of checkin/check out and communication throughout our stay was impeccable. We loved staying at Anthony's place in Bondi and would definitely love to stay again one day"),
("2015-02-24", "5224098", "Daniel", "Tam was the most attentive  considerate and friendly host. The introduction was very comprehensive but also informative and friendly. Tam responds to all questions very quickly. The apartment itself is in an amazingly convenient location and although cosy  is very modern and beautifully decorated."),
("2015-02-26", "5224098", "Paul", "Tam's apartment was beautifully decorated and very clean & tidy! I was so glad that I chose to stay here overnight on a work trip as it was close to everything with some great restaurants to choose from around the corner."),
("2015-03-06", "5224098", "Ian", "Thank you Tam  Your room was just as described  I flew in Early and responded right away to my sms about the key location and he made it a hassle free situation. Great location for my needs this time in Sydney  walking distance to various neighbourhoods and the city  I didn't need to get one cab in the 3 days there. Thanks for a hassle free stay  will look you up again on my next business trip to Sydney. "),
("2015-03-14", "5224098", "Hansjoerg", "He let me in at 12 pm. Took care of everything."),
("2015-04-03", "5224098", "Mike", "Wonderful location close to the city and paddington shops & restaurants. Tams apartment has lots of natural lighting  and is surprisingly quiet given its close proximity to the city.Tam was easy to deal with and accomodated us last minute  great communicator and made sure we were settled in nicely."),
("2015-04-06", "5224098", "Nuala", "Tam's place is fantastic.  Beautifully decorated and so clean.  The location is excellent  just a short stroll through the park and you're right in the centre of Sydney  Westfield and the main shopping district.Tam was so helpful and checked in via email to see how I was getting on.  The whole process was a breeze  considering I only booked a few days before travelling.  Thanks so much for making my stay in Sydney great!"),
("2015-04-13", "5224098", "Daysee", "My partner and I was happy staying at Tam's beautiful apartment in Darlinghurst. Tam's description of the space is accurate  and the apartment is  if anything  more beautiful than the photos might suggest. The house was immaculately cleaned and maintained  well equipped in a lovely neighborhood. The location is amazing; Hyde Park is literally 1 min walk from the apt  close to good restaurants  coffee shops  and convenient store. The setting is perfect for a weekend or holiday getaway. Perfect for tourists or when you're on a business trip. I didn't get to meet Tam as he was away for holiday. But things were easy! Tam was a terrific host; he responded promptly to my initial query  and once we were there  it seemed that he'd thought of everything. Highly recommended!"),
("2015-05-07", "5224098", "Alvin", "Tam is a great host! His place is AMAZING  the room is very comfortable  spacious and clean. The location is great too! The CBD  Circular Quay  Surry Hills are all a short walk away  and buses and trains to Bondi Beach  Newtown and the airport are all within a block of his place. I loved it and will definitely recommend his place to my friends who'll be visiting Sydney."),
("2017-01-29", "5224098", "Tanya", "Tam's place was perfect  offering everything that I needed in the perfect location. Very happy with my stay and Tam's communication. Highly recommended ! "),
("2017-02-05", "5224098", "Andrew", "Tam's apartment is in a great central location close to everything.  He obviously really cares about the aesthetics of his home and everything was clean  in good condition and I felt very comfortable.  Great communication too  made my trip a breeze.  Thank you  will come again. "),
("2017-02-17", "5224098", "Victoria", "Great place! Good location  and perfect for 1 traveler. Very quiet building."),
("2017-03-24", "5224098", "Yu", "Tam's place is very cosy and nice  but the toilet is too small that you're basically stuck between the left wall and the right shower room. Except for that  I think all is good."),
("2017-04-01", "5224098", "Chiedza", "Tam's place is a must stay. Located in an area close to restaurants and pubs on a quiet street. The apartment itself was immaculate. Tam thought of everything. The bed was a dream to sleep on  the decor was great and the place smelt amazing. It was light  airy and very clean! I would definitely return to stay if I'm in Sydney again. Tam was an amazing host  very understanding and accomodating when I hit a travel snag. He met me on arrival and showed me around  he also left a detailed guidebook I could refer to. "),
("2017-05-06", "5224098", "Prashant", "Really gorgeous place in an ideal location. Dealing with Tam was fast and efficient."),
("2018-02-19", "5224098", "Andrew", "Really nice place to be based to explore Sydney. The apartment is clean  cosy  and attractively funished. It's in a great location where it is a short 7 minute walk to access Museum subway station and the downtown area or buses to Bondi  Cogee and other beaches in the surrounding area. Nearby are a number of food stores and eateries on the lively Liverpool Steet  but the apartment is situated on a not far off quieter street  so it's quite a tranquil area. Tam is a very competent host: communication before and during the stay was first class. Highly recomended."),
("2018-02-25", "5224098", "Anna", "Everything is good  but there’s a little bugs in the kitchen. Tam is super nice  maybe next time we visit Sydney will choose the same house again!!"),
("2018-08-18", "5224098", "Rhian", "Tam’s apartment has everything you could possibly need to make your stay in Sydney feel like you’re staying in your own home. All aspects of the apartment are clean and functional  and there are special touches all over the place that elevate the experience. The location is amazing  so make sure you wander down Stanley street and check out the bars and restaurants while you’re there! 5 stars all the way ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️"),
("2018-08-23", "5224098", "Satomi", "The apartment was spotlessly clean and comfortable to stay. Tam was so kind and responded promptly for all the questions I had during the stay which made the stay even more comfortable. Bed was really comfy and good pressure of shower was a plus! The apartment was close to cafes and restaurants in Darlinghurst  very close to the city centre and easy walking distance to Museum station - one train from airport. I would highly recommend Tam’s place for anyone who is visiting Sydney. I would stay here again when I visit Sydney next time! Thank you for your hospitality Tam :) "),
("2018-10-02", "5224098", "Dieu Quynh Hoa", "Tam has been very nice and organised host. The place is very cozy and neat."),
("2018-11-11", "5224098", "Kate", "Tam’s place is amazing  I really felt as home. The deco it’s very stylish  the location is perfect and the roof top terrace is a must. If possible will definitely repeat his place for my next visit in Sydney. Thanks Tam :-)"),
("2018-11-16", "5224098", "Paul", "I have stayed in many Airbnbs before and always rented the whole apartment or house. This was the first time that I stayed in a place where  from the sheer amount of personal belongings  I had the impression that the apartment is inhabited when not rented out. The result of this is that every cupboard  wardrobe and drawer is full of personal stuff. Not really what I wanted or expected. I do not have a problem with this but it would have been good to know. The photos do paint a good picture of the apartment but what they don't show  and the listing does not clarify  is that this is a ground floor apartment in an old building  with no blinds/curtains  that backs onto an alley way (with bright street lighting) that forms an entrance way into the high school next door. On weekdays  it can be noisy as the kids arrive/depart the school as well as during the break times. On a positive note  Tam is a great host and very communicative. He immediately worked to darken the bedroom for me (thanks Tam!) and is very conscientious that his guests are comfortable. The bed is extremely comfortable  towels are soft and fluffy and the location is second to none. The shower is also very good. Value for money? This is Sydney and an awesome location but it felt somewhat overpriced.Cons:Cluttered  no blinds on windows  ground floor apartment that backs on to school entrance way  priceyPros:Great mattress  shower and towels. Amazing location"),
("2018-11-25", "5224098", "Laura", "Tam is great! Super helpful and responsive  which was much appreciated. Especially when I lost my key Great location within a short walk of museum station and some cute restaurants near by. There was also a corner shop for milk etc which was useful. Very easy to get to from the airport. It was nice and clean too. Stanley Street is quite steep with wheelies but made for good exercise!"),
("2018-12-02", "5224098", "Reece", "Great little place. Host was very responsive and the bed was comfy."),
("2015-02-08", "5178277", "Hannah", "What wonderful hosts! The house is very clean an organized. Newtown is a great place to explore and being so close to the train and buses  we weren't far from anything. Five stars! "),
("2015-02-14", "5178277", "Elisabeth", "Our stay in the home of Miss D was perfect! The bed is very comfortable and well equipped home. Miss D and her husband are very friendly and always willing to help. Do not hesitate to stay there."),
("2015-02-16", "5178277", "Robin", "I had the best experience  I didn't imagine a BnB could be so organized! The bedroom is beautiful  the whole house is clean and very modern  I suppose it was restored recently. The location is ideal  very close to popular King St. and to buses and trains. I was happy to find out that while you have to enter the bedroom after 2 and leave it before noon when you check in and out  there is space for luggage so you can drop off and collect out of check time! I couldn't meet the host personally but everything is so organized that I could move in and out with no problems. I highly reccommend this bedroom and host. "),
("2015-02-23", "5178277", "Lucy", "Easy check in and check out.Host very informative and helpful.Great location of house  near to shops bars station and airport. Room great!Thanks for a great stay!Would definately recommend. "),
("2015-03-08", "5178277", "钰", "非常好的民俗 房主非常热情 房间非常干净 由于我们的疏忽把钥匙拉房间了 房主深夜过来为我们开房间 下次有机会还会再来"),
("2015-03-09", "5178277", "Erin", "MissD was a great host. Although I never got to meet her she was friendly and responded to all my questions very quickly. The room was ideal for my boyfriend and I  location  cleanliness  value for money  everything. "),
("2015-03-14", "5178277", "Alvin", "Couldn't have asked for a better host than Miss D! Friendly  full of information and speedy response all the time.. Great place to get a good feel of Newtown.. Super close to the train station and plenty of food... Cafe options around.Would definitely return to Newtown again! Thanks for everything Miss D :) till next time !"),
("2015-03-18", "5178277", "Lucy", "After staying in the room with the balcony for 10 nights I switched to a separate room for my remaining 4 (and then booked an extra one) The rooms were both really spacious.I have loved staying in Miss D's house and I'm going to find it hard to move out. She is very friendly and helpful and I can give check in/ check out/ cleanliness / location all top marks!The beds are amazing  the guests have all been lovely and I really enjoyed meeting and chatting to Miss D.Location is 5 minutes from Newtown Station and easily accessible to everywhere in the city.This was the perfect place to stay for my first 2 weeks in Sydney and I am going to find it hard to leave.Thank you Miss D! "),
("2015-03-20", "5178277", "Amanda", "We had a lovely stay at MissD's home. It is very close (3 minute walk) to King Street for eats and drinks  as well as Enmore Theatre which was where we went for the evening. The home was clean  the bed and pillows were very comfortable  the towels were fluffy  and there are two clean and bright bathrooms. We will stay there again."),
("2015-03-21", "5178277", "Deborah", "Nothing is too much trouble for MissD. I had literally booked the day before. We arrived early and MissD's friendly husband was extremely helpful and accommodating preparing the room in no time and then by chance securing a perfect  handy parking space for us. Great atmosphere  locality very clean and well kept. Quality linen and fluffy thick towels. We would love to stay again. "),
("2015-03-22", "5178277", "Jenny", "Miss D was very helpful and responded quickly to every query.  The home and room were just as described - clean  airy  comfortable  and in a wonderful location.  We thoroughly enjoyed our stay and hope we may have a chance to return."),
("2015-03-23", "5178277", "Masa", "We really enjoyed staying here! Easy to find  super close to the shops and a great location! The place was very clean  homely  beautifully decorated and very comfortable. Miss D made it very efficient and was very friendly when we planned to stay the night. We will definitely be booking again! Thanks so much :) "),
("2015-03-25", "5178277", "Nick", "Excellent communication and kind gestures such as leaving Cadbury easter eggs for us in the kitchen one morning. Location is in a cool  young  hipsterish neighborhood 3 minute walk from Newtown Station  which was super convenient. The room is perfectly clean  The apartment itself has a lot of fun character and the owner has decorated in great taste that enhances the stay. Bed was large and VERY comfortable. I wasn't able to meet the owner  but briefly met the husband as he stopped by to welcome us. Seemed very kind. My girlfriend and I agreed that we have no choice but to stay here again if we ever visit Sydney again. We LOVED it!"),
("2015-03-26", "5178277", "Nic", "Attentive host that made check-in easy. Room was clean and as pictured. The neighborhood is very nice for finding food  and not too far from both the city and the airport. "),
("2015-03-27", "5178277", "Alana", "Lovely and clean  awesome location and Miss D bought us soy milk especially  - loved it thank you "),
("2015-04-01", "5178277", "Wiebke", "We stayed 1 Night in Miss D.s lovely Appartement. The House is easy to reach and close to the Train Station. The Check in was easy and fast. Our Room was really nice furnished and really comfortable! Unfortunatly the room was a bit noisy at night because the window went towards the street. The shared kitchen and lounge were nice. all in all we had a really nice stay here."),
("2015-04-03", "5178277", "Marion", "MissD's Appartement ist sehr schön und zentral gelegen und alles war so  wie auf den Bildern gezeigt und wie es beschrieben wurde. Erwähnen sollte man jedoch für lärmempfindliche Menschen die Einflugschneise des Flughafens direkt über dem Appartement. Wenn man länger als eine Nacht dort bleibt  sollte man sich eventuell überlegen  ob man sich nicht etwas Ruhigeres suchen sollte.MissD ist sehr hilfsbereit und jederzeit schnell zu erreichen  egal  um welche Frage es sich handelte. Auch die Informationen  die im Zimmer aushängen  sind sehr hilfreich. "),
("2015-04-06", "5178277", "Carmen", "I spent a night in Newtown during Easter. Walked into a neat and tidy room with welcoming bunny easter chocolate on the table. What a delight! Room was spacious. Very comfortable (and fluffy) bed! Although D was not there during my stay  she was very quick with replies and made sure I had no trouble getting in to the house. Self check in and check out system very efficient and flexible. Newtown is a lively suburb by day. Cannot stress more on the extremely strategic location of this listing. 4km / 15 minutes drive into CBD. Walking distance to famous cafes (Blackstar pastry 5 minutes walk) and there's a map to nearby cafes and eateries in our room! Street parking was free on designated hours  no issues at all. In general  very happy with the stay. "),
("2015-04-09", "5178277", "Melanie", "Me and my boyfriend stayed at Miss D's place for two nights and we had a great stay.The location was in an excellent location  5 minute walk to the train station and to the bustling street of Newtown.The place was very clean and tidy! And there were cereals  milk  coffee and tea for all guests to use in the morning. There was also clean towels and two bottles of water in our roomupon arrival!The communication with the host was great  she made sure we got in okay by sending a message and also messaged the next day to check that our stay was okay which showed how she cared about her guests!The check in process was very smooth as clear directions were given of how to get the key for our room. Overall a very nice stay and we would recommend this place to anyone!Thanks for a lovely stay! "),
("2015-04-12", "5178277", "Jolo", "The apartment has everything you need and you will look for in a place when you're in Sydney! I cannot emphasize how great the location was and how interesting the neighborhood is. Also a few meters away from the bus and train station. The apartment was very clean  orderly and was very photogenic as well. We really enjoyed our stay here. Miss D and her husband were very kind and accomodating  and even helped us book a cab for our super early flight. I highly recommend this apartment jf you want to maximize you. She even allowed us to leave our bags in the apartment while we roamed around as we were waiting for 2pm checkin. Bonus: you get free cereals and milk 24/7! "),
("2015-04-13", "5178277", "Robyn", "Organisation was great. No problems finding the lovely old terrace house or acccessing the key even though it was late Sunday. The room was bright  clean and airy with lovely linen. While the plane noise is a bit annoying the great location and access to trains and restaurants and the good price makes it a great place to stay."),
("2015-04-16", "5178277", "Romain", "The room is part of a 4 rooms lovely house in a very quiet street of Newton very close to King St. with all of its bars and restaurants. Everything is exactly as in the pictures. This place is also a good way to meet people as the whole house is for Airbnb travelers.Last  Miss D was very reactive  flexible and helpful to make my stay as good as possible!"),
("2015-04-29", "5178277", "Irean", "MissD really cares me and my family during the stay  as it was my first time to Sydney and i am not familiar with the transportation. We can get to the train from the house just 3 minutes. It is so convenient for those travellers. The house is very clean and comfortable. Even this house just behind the crowded street  but it is very quiet and makes us sleep very well. We must be back when we visit Sydney again:) nice people nice place"),
("2015-05-01", "5178277", "Myriam", "le taxi a trouvé facilement l'adresse.La description et les instructions parfaites."),
("2015-05-04", "5178277", "Isabelle", "Thank you for hosting us MissD! Quick and helpful in responses to queries and on matters of check-in  settling in and check-in! A pleasant stay with clean linen and fresh towels arranged asap in order with our check-in. The room and common areas were kept spick & span and decorated to give a homey feeling. Host and her husband were friendly and did their utmost to make all occupants happy with their stay! "),
("2015-05-10", "5178277", "Rosalie", "Charming and clean property in a great location. It was really easy to get around Sydney from here  but there's so much right on your doorstep too. We had everything we needed. Thanks!"),
("2015-05-14", "5178277", "Corinne", "We loved the street and location  the house is very well organised and convenient. Miss D kept in touch the whole time  making sure we had everything we needed. "),
("2015-05-31", "5178277", "Joan Frances Lenny", "Miss D was very responsive and helpful. I was amazed at how prompt she responded to all my queries. She also went an extra mile to always ensure that I was fully satisfied with the answers provided. I remember asking for a last minute change on the room setup as I had an extra friend joining us in the trip and she tried her best to accommodate my friend so we could all stay together. When I requested Miss D for an earlier check in  she also accommodated to my request. She even messaged me to ensure that I had no problem in checking in to the house. Throughout our short stay in Miss D's  she always ensured that we were comfortable and had all the necessities available and ready. Miss D was very friendly and exceptionally accommodating to her guests' request and feedback. I and my friend really liked the place! It was clean  organised  and very cosy. The room that we stayed in was also spacious even when there were 4 of us. The bathroom was clean. The house was very organised. I and my friend were so impressed that Miss D labelled everything so properly in the kitchen and put notes around the house which were helpful for visiting guests  who came from outside Sydney.This was my first airbnb stay and I could not stop advocating this place to all my other friends :) I would without any hesitance come back again if I am to visit Sydney in the future. Thank you so much for making our stay a pleasant one. I am looking forward to visiting again in the future.Cheers! :) "),
("2015-06-03", "5178277", "Matthew", "Very clean and brilliantly located. Very cool neighbourhood."),
("2015-06-06", "5178277", "Linda", "Thankyou Miss D  easy check in and accommodation exactly as described. Room and bedding comfortable and clean. Great handy location. Host provided good information and excellent communication."),
("2015-06-08", "5178277", "Jenny", "The location was perfect and the house is tucked away in a quiet area so I slept so well. Everything is clean and comfortable with good faculties. Everything went smoothly and my stay could not have been better."),
("2015-06-21", "5178277", "Carol", "The listing was as described. Didn't get to meet Miss D  all queries we responded to very promptly either by SMS or email.All instructions were clearly provided. Miss D assisted us with our arrival and departure times.The bed was very comfortable  the pillows were too big (though this is a personal choice) so would have been good if other options were available. Was a little put off to see hairs in the bed ( just hoping it was from the person changing the sheets).The room was clean as well as the bathroom and kitchen.It would have been good to have a television either in the room or the lounge area.Also first impressions  would be great to see the front garden looking a bit more loved.Location is very convenient and I would stay again.Thank you Miss D"),
("2015-06-26", "5178277", "Pierre", "Very good experience of BnB ! The location was excellent  3min from train station  took us only 15-20min to go to the main sites of Sydney (Opera house  Harbour Bridge  etc). The street is quiet but if you walk 3min you will find a lot of restaurants/cafes.The room and the rest of the house were clean and tidy. The instructions were very clear and there were some enjoyable tips about the neighborhood  the transports and Sydney in general inside the room.Even if we didn't have the pleasure to meet MissD  she was a great host. Always available  kind and full of good advices  I would definitely recommend her."),
("2015-07-08", "5178277", "Jacobi", "Although I didn't meet my host face to face  I immediately felt welcome with instructions for getting into the house and amenities for cooking etc. Everything was exactly as advertised. This place is very easy to find in  a lovely neighborhood (yoga studio right around the corner  if you're into that!) and the most convenient walk to the train station. It was very clean. If you're looking for a calm  quiet  and easy place to stay  this is it. I'd definitely recommend it."),
("2015-07-10", "5178277", "Michele", "L'accueil a été parfait. Je suis arrivée de l'aéroport très facilement avec le train et tous les renseignements qui m'avaient été donnés m'ont permis de rentrer dans la maison. L'hôte a fait son possible pour me donner ma chambre avant 14h. J'ai pu prendre une douche et ce fut bien agréable après 21 h de vol. Merci. La maison est propre  extrêmement bien organisée et on s'y sent très à l'aise.J'y retournerai si je reviens à Sydney. A bientôt. Michèle "),
("2015-07-11", "5178277", "Winnie", "The description is accurate and Station street is veryt quiet at night. Miss D is really nice beacuse she let us check in early in the morning. The room is tidy and clean  which is just like the picture. Good place to stay. :)"),
("2015-07-14", "5178277", "Debbie", "Check-in was very easy and I was lucky enough to meet the host upon arrival. The room is beautifully furnished and comfortable. The house is located within walking distance to the train station and there are also streets of interesting shops in the area."),
("2015-07-26", "5178277", "Jhun Yann", "It was a very welcoming and comfortable stay. The location is pretty convenient for us to travel around Sydney City by buses or trains. The room is clean and tidy and   Equipped with everything that we need during the stay. Thanks for providing us with this awesome stay and hope to see you again!"),
("2015-07-27", "5178277", "Eduardo", "Miss D was very nice and professional. The room was lovely  simple and clean. I really loved the small things to make the stay more enjoyable and welcoming. Top Place to stay. And excellent location for something outside the city center."),
("2015-07-30", "5178277", "Marie", "it was a beautiful place with a very friendly host!thanks for all"),
("2015-07-31", "5178277", "Richard", "Lovely accomodation  quiet an relaxing near great restaurants. Pity was fully booked for my next visit to Sydney.."),
("2015-08-08", "5178277", "Samantha", "Amazing and beautiful place to stay! We loved our stay here and even took adventage of the kitchen. The kitchen is clean and everything we needed is available. Location is perfect  couldn't possible be any better. Great place to stay and definitely worth it. "),
("2015-08-16", "5178277", "Weiling", "The location of the house is indeed situated near to Newtown Station and a few bus stops. Check in and check out were a breeze  and the rooms looked exactly like that in the photos. Instructions and help were readily available at any time.Breakfast and necessities were refilled very frequently and we never had to worry about running out of food or necessities. Miss D and her husband were extremely helpful and provided us with some really great recommendations for food places! We would definitely recommend Miss D's place to anyone looking to stay in the area and we cant wait to come back again. :)Just a tip for lone travellers - it does get quite dark at night on the street leading to the apartment  so best if you get back to the apartment before nightfall or just carry a flashlight with you. "),
("2015-08-19", "5178277", "Joanne", "I wasn't able to make it for the trip but my friends did. The room was cosy and spacious  everything was pretty good. Didn't manage to see MissD but she readily agreed to let us extend the checkout timing. "),
("2015-08-25", "5178277", "Sarah", "Very good experience staying at Miss D's house. Good  quick communications with the host and very comfortable and convenient house. Clean and organised house with many extras not normally found at air bnb houses. Thank-you! "),
("2015-08-27", "5178277", "Lyn", "Host make access to the property simple. Spacious room & communal lounge. Off street parking was a big bonus. Thank you Miss D. Lyn"),
("2015-09-04", "5178277", "Vibha", "This was our first experience with Airbnb and We had really very good time at Miss D's house. The location is superb  the house is nice and clean. We could not get a chance to meet Miss D but she was always available on the phone or message and I really appreciate this. I would love to stay again on our next visit and recommend to my other friends as well. "),
("2015-09-07", "5178277", "Christine", "A lovely comfortable and clean room was so nice to be in. The house is great. Got to chat with other guests and really handy to the yummy restaurants and transport. Reasonable price. Would not hesitate to recommend to others."),
("2015-09-23", "5178277", "Elif & Engin", "We enjoyed our stay. Newtown is a great location to start discover to Sydney."),
("2015-10-15", "5178277", "Blair", "Great room great location great everything~"),
("2015-10-19", "5178277", "Hui Min", "The house is quite easy to find and very near to the train station. Out of the house and after turning left  straight up and following the road out to the main road  turn left and walk straight for about 2 mins and you'll be at Newtown train station. There were 3 of us  and lucky for us we booked the room on the lower level (it'll be tough for us to carry our luggages up and down the stairs! ). The room is nice and clean  but as there were 3 of us  an extra mattress was added in front of the bed  making the room a little smaller and cramp  but still there is room for us to open 3 luggages at the same time  just that it makes it a little hard to walk. There is a common lounge and kitchen for everyone's use  cereals and milk provided as well for breakfast! There are 2 toilets  one in the building  one outside the house  a right turn from the kitchen just few steps away. Towels and toiletries are provided as well. However  as it is a shared toilet  it gets a little messy and dirty over the days.We stayed for 4 days and generally it was a quite a pleasant stay and the room is cosy enough. Just a note  our room is next to the main entrance so it gets a little noisy when people come in and exit the house."),
("2015-10-22", "5178277", "Donald", "Our second stay at Miss D's. A different room but the same quality  we loved it!"),
("2015-10-24", "5178277", "Kat", "We had a pleasant stay. The room was clean and comfortable. It is easily accessible to public transportation which is a super plus factor. We highly recommend this place. :)"),
("2015-10-28", "5178277", "Ying Ying", "I really love the room-it is the best type of room for a female guest-portable mirror  hairdryer  hangers  elegant ambience and most importantly  a very comfortable mattress to sleep in with good number of pillows-I'd certainly like to stay here again whenever I drop by Sydney in the future! "),
("2015-10-31", "5178277", "Jarryd", "Awesome room in a great house in the perfect Newtown location. Close to restaurants  bars and train station  check in/out was super easy. Really enjoyed our stay."),
("2015-11-01", "5178277", "Amy", "Miss D's place is conveniently located close to the station and many quirky cafes. The room looks exactly like the photo. Miss D is very friendly and informative. The local cafe/bars/restaurants Miss D recommended are quite nice. The area was a bit noisy at night but considering it was a Saturday night  it was acceptable."),
("2015-11-02", "5178277", "Roberta", "Well located  efficient  clean and SO organized. Everything is labelled and written instructions provided in clear  simple language.  Nice and quiet  we slept well. The neighborhood is quaint  and great affordable restsurants abound  big supermarket  lower level 1/2 block from the rail  station  which is just a short walk to the address  but she's right in her advice to use a cab for to and from the airport. "),
("2015-11-05", "5178277", "Alan", "MissD's place was very comfortable. The bed was good quality and I enjoyed a good nights sleep. MissD and her partner were very helpful and there to solve any issues. Thank you MissD for a good stay."),
("2015-11-09", "5178277", "Margherita", "The house is located in a very special area of Sydney. Newtown is the beating heart of the underground scene and you have everything you need.The house is conveniently located 5 min away from the Newtown station and it's basic but very clean. We didn't meet the host  neither all the other guests in the house but we didn't have a problem.The room was really spacious and although we were expecting the third bed to be a real bed  my dad slept well on the floor on a thin mattress. The kitchen has everything you need for a basic cook and the two toilets were clean and very new.The room did smell a bit of mould  but it's a very old house and those days Sydney was very rainy so didn't bothered us too much.I would come back again for a short stay."),
("2015-11-11", "5178277", "Vanessa", "Fabulous location. Great room. Will definitely be back."),
("2015-11-16", "5178277", "Ying Ying", "2nd time here-as good as I described before~thanks for the extra hangers!"),
("2015-11-20", "5178277", "Serena", "We enjoyed our experience there. And the location was good. We love the decoration in the room."),
("2015-12-01", "5178277", "Danielle", "Great accommodation! Very clean  well-kept  and atmospheric. MissD's husband was so gracious in giving us travel tips for our stay in Sydney. Would easily recommend this place for a pleasant  welcoming stay. "),
("2015-12-03", "5178277", "Craig", "This was an unusual AirBnB stay in that I never got to meet my host. I arrived mid-day  stored luggage  left to do appointments  arrived back late and left very early for a flight. I only say that as I am unable to comment on any direct guest:host engagement. It was of no account in terms of my stay - the briefing material was clear  the room very clean and comfortable  good quality bed and nice linen.Lots of interesting restaurants and little bars in the neighbourhood but far enough away not to get any noise from the busy main street. I would stay again."),
("2015-12-16", "5178277", "Kimberly", "Excellent communication! I didn't get to meet Miss D  but communication was clear and friendly. The location was very convenient and located in a cute town! It was easy to get around with the train station so close. We loved the room and the very detailed instructions for the place. Miss D was very accommodating and answered all our questions quickly. "),
("2015-12-18", "5178277", "James", "The room was exactly as described and the self check-in process was super easy. The house is in a great location - Newtown has great restaurants  bars etc.MissD was a pleasure to deal with (although we never met face to face).I would happily stay here again in future. Thanks for having me!"),
("2015-12-22", "5178277", "Anna", "The 4 nights in Sydney were amazing and the location of MissD's place was perfect. There were lots of food venues around and places to shop. Lots of cafes and a grocery store in easy walking distance. The Newtown Train Station was very handy  close  and made it simple to get into the city. The place was very comfortable and warming. I was surprised how nice the bathrooms/toilets were!! There was barely any waiting in line and the guest were mostly considerate of others and cleaned up after themselves in the bathrooms and kitchen area. I felt safe and comfortable especially on the first floor with the bars on the windows. Wifi work really well the whole time and if we needed anything (like fresh towels)  we got it. I highly recommend staying here when visiting Sydney!! You won't regret it!!"),
("2016-01-02", "5178277", "Sabrina", "Great big room and clean facilities. Really good locations near the trainstation. Easy self-check in and uncomplicated host. We enjoyed our stay."),
("2016-01-03", "5178277", "Wendy", "Perfect Airbnb experience  with a host who knows exactly what her guests need.  I never met Miss D  but she gave specific instructions for arrival  and everything was in place and labelled  she had great recommendations to make any visit to Sydney comfortable. The room was beautiful. The house was quiet (I never saw anyone else). I would definitely stay again."),
("2016-01-07", "5178277", "Marielle", "Chambre agréable dans un quartier sympa et animé de Sydney. Colocation très bien organisée avec de nombreux panneaux d'information. Cuisine tout équipée avec ustensiles pour cuisiner."),
("2016-01-14", "5178277", "Antti-Jussi", "MissD provided us with instructions for self-check-in which was easy and clear. The house was clean  everything is labeled  and there are instructions on how to do lots of stuff. The location is top-notch with Newtown's train station and lots of cafés etc. just around the corner. Despite this  the neighborhood is extremely quiet. Only noise you may get is from the other guests if they're not being considerate. Communication with MissD was pleasant and fast. Everything went great and I would recommend staying here."),
("2016-01-15", "5178277", "Mara", "Great place for a short stay in Sydney. The fashion room is very spacious and confortable and the neighbourhood is just perfect with great restaurants and local environment."),
("2016-01-19", "5178277", "Imran", "Great room in a great location.  The room was spotless  as well as the other live spaces.  The host was very quick to respond and everything was very clear.  Had a great experience!"),
("2016-01-23", "5178277", "Jayne", "We had a fantastic time in Newtown it was exactly as described. The house was perfect for what we needed it was clean and quiet the only issue was the air-conditioning system did not seem to be working. However we did have a fan in our room so that was perfect. We would definitely recommend this Airbnb."),
("2016-01-28", "5178277", "Tianna", "Very cozy room. 5 minutes walk to the train station and 3 minutes walk to bus stop. The King st is a perfect place for shopping. We had a good time here. Thank you Miss D."),
("2016-01-29", "5178277", "Simon", "Very comfortable  easy access  clean  great location - really vibrant part of the city  but leafy back street quiet. I'd definitely stay there again"),
("2016-02-02", "5178277", "Tasha", "Very pleasant stay. Excellent location being so close to restaurants  bars  and the Newtown train station. The Bed and Breakfast was spotlessly clean  had complimentary breakfast  and fast WiFi. My boyfriend and I loved the neighborhood and Mrs. D was extremely helpful with finding us parking for our van. I would highly recommend this place and would love to stay here again. "),
("2016-02-07", "5178277", "Dimph", "Perfect location in newtown! We had a great stay. We had an early check in so that was very Nice."),
("2016-02-09", "5178277", "Anne", "Comfortable room. Good amenities. Great location for Enmore theatre."),
("2016-02-10", "5178277", "Stacy", "We had a wonderful stay at MissD's air BnB  the neighborhood was very quiet  the room was light and airy and all the facilities were perfect and as described!"),
("2016-02-12", "5178277", "Elena", "挺不错的 去市中心就四站路左右 从住的地方去车站大约5-10分钟 住宿环境也很干净 物美价廉"),
("2016-02-18", "5178277", "Sophie", "We had a lovely stay in Sydney. We really enjoyed the room  it was really nice! Our door lock broke but she immediately fixed it. The neighbourhood was also really nice with lovely placed to have breakfast or dinner and really close to the train to the city. I would really recommend it!"),
("2016-02-24", "5178277", "Anita", "The room was really nice and tidy  and so was the kitchen. It was super convenient to get to the city centre as the trains in Sydney are really frequent and fast! Things to improve: I would say the mattress on the floor (3rd bed) got pretty uncomfortable after the 3rd night - especially because the blanket was so thin. The toilet got a bit messy since it was a shared bathroom (but this was due to the fault of the other guests  not the host). Overall  however  it was a great stay! We had a lot of fun in Sydney  and the accommodation was good :) "),
("2016-02-25", "5178277", "Kevin", "The room was great  clean  airy and bright!  So close to Newtown  King St where there is so much to do.The house is really nice and on a 'quiet' leafy street.  I experienced a little noise in the evening but not too bad considering proximity to a major city  suburb.I'd be happy to stay there again."),
("2016-02-27", "5178277", "Eve", "Comfy and clean room with self checkin/checkout instructions. Close to Newtown train station."),
("2016-03-02", "5178277", "Liz", "We did not meet our host but she made entry into the apt easy. The neighborhood was excellent. A perfect location to access the city and plenty of stores/restaurants within walking of the apt. We were very surprised though about the accommodations in general. The room picture was very accurate and the room itself was very nice. However the apt was run more like a hostel than we expected. There were several other guests staying in various rooms and the bathroom  kitchen and living room had a very communal feel. I would bring shower shoes for the shower. "),
("2016-03-06", "5178277", "Cassandra", "Such a great place  very central and so easy to take public transport from or get an Uber! Exactly what we expected. Great communications beforehand from hosts."),
("2016-03-13", "5178277", "Christina", "I'm really glad I choose Miss D's house. She is very organize and thoughtful  so I can just relax and enjoy holidays. Thank you for everything! "),
("2016-03-25", "5178277", "Pk", "Our host was very helpful right from the get go. The home was very warm and welcoming. The amenities was great. It felt like staying at home away from home."),
("2016-03-26", "5178277", "Angelina", "Devina was a very helpful and responsive host. Once i booked my accomodation  she contacted me directly asap. She was very detailed and we are able to locate the house quickly. The room was clean as shown in the photo. Thanks Devina!"),
("2016-04-08", "5178277", "Janice", "This place was as described in the listing. Clean and comfy."),
("2016-05-05", "5178277", "Alexandre", "Parfait  quartier génial ! Chambre propre et spacieuse.Bémol: Leger bruit de la rueToilettes dans salle de bain partagée"),
("2016-05-13", "5178277", "Tiffanie", "Overall  we have a pleasant stay. Convenient and easy to travel around in Sydney via buses and train. Near to Airport.Well equipped kitchen."),
("2016-05-15", "5178277", "Sue", "This is a great location (very central) and the room was clean and tidy."),
("2016-05-17", "5178277", "Jackie", "It was really a good choice. Clean  pleasant  good organisation... I hope to come back soon."),
("2016-05-23", "5178277", "Matthew", "Awesome host and place that is very clean  comfortable and in a fantastic location. MissD was a fantastic and friendly host  and I'd definitely recommend staying with her."),
("2016-05-30", "5178277", "Leigh", "Fantastic location and check in was easy as  no dramas "),
("2016-06-05", "5178277", "Linzi", "Great location  clean room and good communication from the host. Thanks! "),
("2016-06-07", "5178277", "William", "MissD was a fantastic host with a lovely place conveniently close to the Sydney CBD. The Newtown neighborhood is actually a destination in and of itself. Lots of interesting places to explore including plenty of shops  pubs  and restaurants nearby. Station st. is a quaint and classic street with most of buildings from the late 1800's and early 1900's! The building and room are lovely! **Just note that there are actually 4 rooms in MissD's home each with a unique character. Mine was on the first level and featured a very clean & modern decor with high ceilings. There are two shared shower facilities and a communal kitchen. Public transport to the city via train is great and fast but if going to the airport  I found the taxi / Uber style service to be more convenient. I didn't get to meet the host until check-out but there was an easy self check-in/check-out method available! I am confident you will love staying here and certainly recommend the listing :D"),
("2016-06-12", "5178277", "Thiago", "great"),
("2016-06-14", "5178277", "Sailing", "房东人很好 帮我们解答各种问题｡厨房的大烤箱非常方便 从house附近的超市购买半成品pizza在用烤箱加工一下非常赞｡房子离Newtown火车站很近 到各个景点都很方便｡只是晚上有点吵 因为近飞机场｡"),
("2016-07-12", "5178277", "Colene", "I like the neighborhood and the house is very comfortable to stay in. will definitely recommend my friends to stay in."),
("2016-07-17", "5178277", "Gladys", "Miss D and her husband are very kind..If you have any problem them will help you with their best..Besides you can find a lot of nice restaurant in Newtown..and it is very convenient to catch a train to the city^^"),
("2016-07-21", "5178277", "Olivia", "Cute place. Super comfy bed... Not well lit at night if arriving late."),
("2016-07-21", "5178277", "Scarlett", "Great staying at Miss D  very clean bedroom and bathroom. Quiet neighbourhood with easy access into the city.  "),
("2016-07-23", "5178277", "Rebekah", "Great room and great facilities. Incredibly close to everything you need in Newtown and only a few minutes to the train station. House felt clean and secure. Thank you !"),
("2016-08-03", "5178277", "Darren", "MissD's place was clean  comfortable and convenient. Pictures were accurate and the location was good; near the shops and near the train station. Newtown is also a fantastic neighbourhood to stay in. MissD gives her guests privacy and is also quick to respond to any queries. Overall a very pleasant stay!"),
("2016-08-09", "5178277", "Marcia", "O espaço era bom  mas o terceiro hospede dormiu num colchao no chao  nao havia cama. Nao havia lencol de cobrir para os hospedes. Na casa sao 4 quartos e 2 banheiros compartilhados  que sao limpos somente 2 vezes por semana  entao os banheiros nao estavam suficientemente limpos quando chegamos. E so foram limpos 3 dias depois."),
("2016-08-15", "5178277", "Shaun", "Fantastic"),
("2016-08-25", "5178277", "Claire", "Séjour très agréable dans cet appartement  aux portes de sydney.La chambre était fidèle à la description  propre  de bonne qualité (literie ...).L'ensemble de l'appartement est agréable  propre  les instructions pour les différents services sont très clairs."),
("2016-09-11", "5178277", "Michaela", "Great value for what you pay!"),
("2016-09-15", "5178277", "Mark", "only place I ever gave a bad review"),
("2016-09-19", "5178277", "Felicia", "The accommodation was in a quiet location close to everything in Newtown. It was more of a hostel than we expected as the other rooms of the town house were also rented out via Airbnb. As we did not spend any time in the house apart from sleeping at night and showering in the mornings we never really met any of the other people staying there. The only negative bit would be that my sister was sleeping on a mattress on the floor and there was no top sheet for her and only bare blankets and no doona. When we asked for a top sheet as it feels fresher miss d said: ""why would you need that?"". When we arrived to the accommodation there was also an unwashed plate in the kitchen  which we got a message about the next day implying that we had left it. As we never had any breakfast at the accommodation but went out to eat it could not have been us. We did not reply to that message though as we felt it had nothing to do with us  and maybe the guest which left the plate had cleaned up after him or herself. I am sorry if we came across as rude guests asking for the top sheet and not replying to the message about the plate. But for guests coming in the future: if there is dishes left by other people  maybe just do them for the sake of peace or tell miss d immediately  and if you are more than two people staying in one room  you can maybe bring a set of travel sheets for the one not sleeping in the bed.We never met miss d and only communicated via this app. The house was clean and if you just need somewhere close to sleep it is a good place to stay.Kind regards"),
("2016-09-25", "5178277", "Verena", "The house is located in a great neighborhood with lots of places to eat around and just a short train ride from the touristic center. Kitchen and bathrooms were nice and spacious. The room looked just like in the photos  really nice and big enough for two suitcases and stuff. The window faces the street so it might be a bit too noisy  if u're very sensitive to that. MissD was very helpful with our questions although we never met her. The cleanliness of the bathrooms depends a lot on the other guests too. For us it could have been a bit better  but was ok. Value for money is great!"),
("2016-09-28", "5178277", "Ching Ying", "I was pretty satisfied with the effort the host took to ensure that I am comfortably settled down at the place"),
("2016-09-29", "5178277", "Kuan", "Excellent neighbourhood to live like a local and explore the city. Didn't get to meet Miss D but her communication was prompt and that's very important for a traveller."),
("2016-10-01", "5178277", "Елин", "Really comfy place.. We didnt get the chance to meet miss D though. Excellent bathroom  it was very near to the train station  not to mention alot of good restaurant around the area. Tq!"),
("2016-10-03", "5178277", "Cole", "Was a lovely bedroom we stayed down stairs the room was spacious but the only downfall was we could hear every1s foot steps from upstairs. The Hosts were both really helpful to my early check in and check out. Both bathrooms were great  overall we would definitely stay here again"),
("2016-10-10", "5178277", "Vivien", "This is my first Airbnb experience.  The location of the room is excellent with everything you want in Newtown and Sydney at the door-step.  The room is comfortable and spacious.  The host is quick to communicate with the guests. However  the cleanliness of the house needs to be improved.  The bathroom was not cleaned during the entire stay unfortunately.  We ran out of toilet paper every second day.  This room is on the ground floor right by the stairs and also facing the street so it is quite noisy as the window is not fully sealed.  The listing was a little misleading as the host does not live in the house.  "),
("2016-10-15", "5178277", "Nina", "i stayed at MissD's place with 2 of my friends. we really love the place  the picture and the facilities are exactly the same as the description. We also thankful for MissD because we can contact her anytime and she will give fast response. The area where the house located is also very nice  so many restaurants and nice places and close to the bus stop and train station. Overall  it was a very enjoyable stay! Thank you MissD :D"),
("2016-10-21", "5178277", "Greta", "I will suggest it!!! Definitely:)"),
("2016-10-25", "5178277", "Pei Li", "Great neighborhood with lots of nice restaurants & cafes. Just a few train station from Central. The room was clean & big. Only 2 problems which were the dirty bathroom & smelly kitchen due to inconsiderate house mates. Miss D is a friendly & helpful host. She is contactable any any time."),
("2016-11-02", "5178277", "Dianne", "Great inner city location with shops  transport and cafes handy."),
("2016-11-11", "5178277", "지윤", "Comfortable and peaceful:)"),
("2016-11-14", "5178277", "Nita", "the appartement is very well located. the area was a bit noisy  but very close to train and bus station"),
("2016-11-23", "5178277", "Emma", "I had a great stay. I felt safe and comfortable. Located on a beautiful  quiet street - it is easy to forget that King Street is only a minute away!"),
("2016-11-28", "5178277", "Danelle", "MissD's place was clean  convenient and a great place to stay! I'd highly recommend a stay here if you wish to travel to the city as it's really close by! There are lots of eateries around here too! MissD responds to messages promptly and was very helpful! Thanks for having us!:)"),
("2016-12-07", "5178277", "Tonya", "This was a very lovely place to stay. It was very comfortable  accessible and close to all amenities. Miss D was very accessible and helpful. Highly recommend to anyone!"),
("2016-12-14", "5178277", "Luqman", "About 5 mins walk from Newtown Stn and it's a nice  cozy place!"),
("2016-12-20", "5178277", "Cathy", "Really good location. Close to train station that and easy to go to the city."),
("2016-12-29", "5178277", "Melissa", "Our stay here was absolutely amazing! After our original apartment ended up being horrific MissD was such a breath of fresh air. She responded quickly  and had her husband go and clean up for us  and he was there to greet us and give us the lay of the land. He was wonderful! These guys are suuuuuper organized!  They also have just about everything you could want  from shelf space (evenly divided by per room) to daily cereal & milk (that is replenished daily). Everything is neat and tidy  and the place truly is ""chic"" and has great design esthetic. The best part of all of this is the LOCATION! Not only is this city soooo cool and full of restaurants  bars  shops  etc. You're a 5 minute (or less)  walk to the train station and bus stops! All in all  I hiiiiiighly recommend this place! You won't regret it! "),
("2017-01-03", "5178277", "James", "The location of the place is great for exploring Sydney. The kitchen and bathroom are quite worn in compared to the photos and were very dirty on check in. Throughout the stay there were cockroaches throughout the property even though the place had been cleaned."),
("2017-01-08", "5178277", "Robert Kaya", "great location in sydneys hipster area. close to bars and restaurants. feels a bit more like a hostel  with anonymous check in/out and almost no direct face to face contact."),
("2017-01-10", "5178277", "Marvin", "Nice   tidy House   well located to the shops and the bus stop . Great room and good wifi ! Thanks for the stay ! "),
("2017-01-21", "5178277", "雯雯", "house is clean and comfortable  host always be warm welcome and friendly ｡New town is really a wonderful place to enjoy "),
("2017-01-26", "5178277", "Patty", "Basic room but has a cool and calm feel to it. Plenty big enough  bed is comfy and enough power points. Wifi works well. Can be a little traffic about in the morning but nothing too bad. Bring a washer and thongs for bathroom and outside as there are more room rented. Can recommend. Great coffee shops close by and young henry's brewery in the street! Check it out!"),
("2017-01-31", "5178277", "Angela", "We had a very good stay there  and also very easy for parking."),
("2017-02-12", "5178277", "Krystal", "The room is pretty clean.The location is convenient as it is only a few minutes away from Newtown Station. It can get a bit noisy though due to planes and traffic."),
("2017-02-20", "5178277", "Darrah", "This place is great for low budget travelers  however  you are essentially staying at a hostel. There is a shared bathroom  which is not that clean  along with shared amenities. The room itself was OK  but overall thought the price was a little steep for what you are getting. Location wise  it is great because you are right by the train. The bathroom was a bit dirty and on the last day there was no toilet paper. "),
("2017-03-07", "5178277", "Mark", "Superb location down at Newtown. We stayed during mardi gras week; the vibe was cheerful; the neighbours were partying until the early hours on one of the nights. If you're looking for a no nonsense room in a great location  this place would be great.2 bathrooms (one outdoors) spacious lounge and well equipped kitchen. Many shops and cafes nearby for you to try out."),
("2017-03-11", "5178277", "Larisa", "A great place to stay for a weekend trip. Clean  comfortable and a great location  close to public transport  shops and restaurants. Miss D was a responsive and attentive host.The only downside was that we were sharing the house with others and  as our room was near the front door  we heard everyone coming and going. But a minor downside to a great stay. "),
("2017-03-16", "5178277", "Kailyn", "Location is brilliant!!!!! So close to everything. Direct train to airport so no hassle. Everything is as same as the pictures shown and the detailed description. Very nice experience there!!"),
("2017-03-20", "5178277", "Stephanie", "Great location. Good sized room and bed. Bathrooms are good but could do with having a mop available to clear the floor after a house full of people have used them as the floor gets covered in water for the rest of the day. The cereal for breakfast in the mornings is great. Only gripe is that there was no laundry facilities available. All in all very pleasant."),
("2017-03-26", "5178277", "Tina", "We had a lovely stay as well as I experienced a little issue when I got locked out of my room and the key was in there. Miss D was very helpful and this issue could be resolved in no time. A great stay and very comfortable Would highly recommend this place!"),
("2017-04-15", "5178277", "Allison", "Great location! In the middle of everything  so there is a little bit of noise but nothing too bad. Lots of cafes and restaurants all around plus the train just up the road. Miss D communicated everything well. The house as clean and taken care of."),
("2017-04-24", "5178277", "Tiffany", "Overall experience was below expectation. The photos were all modern and new looking  however  the house itself said it the other way.Saw two cockroaches in the bathroom  floor full of hair (nasty!)  loud noises at night (party and chit chat next door until 2am)  overall cleanliness is about  a C-"),
("2017-05-02", "5178277", "Amanda", "Great location in the heart of Newtown....a great spot in Sydney. Lovely house. We shared with 5 other guests in the house but was easy to go in and out."),
("2017-05-13", "5178277", "Sunne", "Very clean  nice area with lots of veggie/vegan affordable restaurants and close to the city centre"),
("2017-05-29", "5178277", "Valentina", "Nice house and great location."),
("2017-06-23", "5178277", "Rob", "Pretty much hostel accomodation. Room security minimum ... Lock flimsy ... had obviously been previously broken. Bed saggy  dusty dark room. "),
("2017-07-02", "5178277", "Charmaine", "MissD's place is convenient with streets of food  pharmacies and a supermarket. She is a detailed and gracious host who provides more than just basic necessities. Highly recommended :)  "),
("2017-07-09", "5178277", "Diana Molina", "El alojamiento esta muy Bien ubicado  muy cerca de la estación de tren   la zona de restaurantes y bares pero la casa es muy tranquila y puedes descansar. Todo estuvo acorde a lo ofrecido   la habitación muy limpia   comoda   baño compartido pero muy limpio así como la cocina. Viaje con mi esposo e hijo y fue buena experiencia Recomiendo al máximo a Miss D!!"),
("2017-07-16", "5178277", "Ovic", "It is a perfect place if you want to live near the city and the suburb is also full of cafes & Clubs. Everything was clean and tidy. The best part is it cheap as well. If you are looking for a place just to sleep for few days  this will be perfect. "),
("2017-07-21", "5178277", "Porntipa", "❤️"),
("2017-08-14", "5178277", "Ying", "非常好的一次住宿体验｡房间干净整洁 房主很友好 还贴心地准备了麦片和牛奶｡地理位置离市中心近 交通便利 周围king street 非常热闹 离超市､饭店､素食馆子都很近｡"),
("2017-08-20", "5178277", "Cindy", "交通很方便 房间也很干净 就是有点吵!"),
("2017-09-08", "5178277", "Sora", "I enjoyed stay in miss D house. She is very considerable and very kind. :) Thank you"),
("2017-09-12", "5178277", "蒋英", "超棒的地理位置｡入住很便捷 房东也很Nice"),
("2017-09-21", "5178277", "Keshara&Harshi", "Great location to base yourself when discovering lovely Newtown. Walking distance to all (cafes  bars  shops  train station) but still in the lovely residential side street.  Place is very clean and the host was prompt attending to all needs. Highly recommend this place."),
("2017-09-23", "5178277", "Danica", "Great front room with natural light and comfortable bed. Wonderful location. The place is set up for airbnb guests. The hosts accommodated a same day check in for me  for which I was grateful."),
("2017-09-25", "5178277", "Charmaine", "Location is convenient! Great gelato and cafes walking distance away  and near a train station. Easy access to the city too"),
("2017-09-29", "5178277", "Alice", ".Appartement bien situé"),
("2017-10-06", "5178277", "汇显", "交通比较方便 附近就是网红西瓜蛋糕 都挺好的就是一楼的房间有点潮湿｡"),
("2017-12-04", "5178277", "Jeff", "Not much more that you could ask for: great location  very clean  easy check-in  and comfortable!"),
("2017-12-06", "5178277", "Boxuan", "Very good choice I made! So lovely!  Thanks a lot!"),
("2017-12-08", "5178277", "Victoria", "Nice large well decorated room in a very convenient location just a moments walk from Newtown’s main high street."),
("2017-12-28", "5178277", "Emily", "房東很親切. 地點方便  鄰近有很多小商店及餐廳  近火車站"),
("2017-12-31", "5178277", "Di", "房子位置很好 几分钟步行即是火车站 去city很方便｡房东人很nice 沟通及时｡House里四个房间均为airbnb房源 人比较多 起居洗漱等不是很方便｡没有洗衣机 对于需要换洗需求的旅客不是很方便｡也没有微波炉 略有不便｡我们的房间甲醛味道非常明显 不是很让人愉悦｡总体来讲 性价比较低 不十分推荐｡"),
("2018-01-06", "5178277", "Chris", "便利で気軽く都心へ行けます｡隣店多く並んでにぎやかです｡部屋もきれいだし､他のｹﾞｽﾄと交流できます｡"),
("2018-01-10", "5178277", "Steven", "Fantastic location; close to shops  restaurants  cafes and bars. Love the vibe and atmosphere in Newtown. The train station is also super convenient and 2 stops away from CBD!"),
("2018-01-23", "5178277", "Renae", "This house is perfectly located  immaculate and easy to live in.  I will 100% be staying here again on my next trip home to Newtown."),
("2018-02-04", "5178277", "Lea", "Wir haben zwei Nächte bei MissD verbracht. Die Lage war super  Newtown ist sehr hip  mit vielen Cafés  Restaurants  kleinen Läden  fernab von den Touristenströmen. MissD war eine grossartige Gastgeberin  die Kommunikation war reibungslos und wir konnten sogar früher einchecken  was wir nach einer 30-stündigen Reise sehr schätzten! Wir empfehlen dieses Airbnb sehr!"),
("2018-02-06", "5178277", "Barbara", "We had a very good stay here! Clean room  felt like a hotel. Also the communication was good  miss D did everything to make our stay comfortable."),
("2018-02-13", "5178277", "Alecia", "MissD's place is really clean and cosy. Fantastic location in cool Newtown with plenty of bars and restaurants on offer. Super easy to access and MissD was clear with instructions upon arrival. We had everything we needed so didn't need to follow up on anything during our stay. We were sharing with three other guest rooms but the house was cleaned regularly and guests were respectful of each other. Great value and would highly recommend for a stay in Sydney!"),
("2018-02-18", "5178277", "Tasha", "Great place and location! An excellent host and very responsive to questions. Will return for sure! Fully recommended! Thank you for having us!!!"),
("2018-02-21", "5178277", "David", "Apartment located near the train and several restaurants. It is clean and well equipped."),
("2018-02-25", "5178277", "鈺珊", "交通便利 房間乾淨"),
("2018-02-27", "5178277", "Michaela", "Perfect"),
("2018-03-10", "5178277", "Chen", "This is my first journey with Airbnb  and it is a happy one. Thanks for Miss D’ s hosting. Her lovely house is near Mary’s  black star pastry and Hakiki Turkish ice cream  which you don’t want to miss them. Few minutes walk to new tow station and king st."),
("2018-03-24", "5178277", "Ulrike", "Our stay was good  close to cafes and train. Big room  2 bathrooms to share with other guest in the house. A bit noisy in the evening and night as a room a right above it and it's very  sensitive. Early check in was possible. Otherwise I can recommend the room."),
("2018-03-27", "5178277", "Catherine", "My friend and I loved staying at MissD’s townhouse for a few nights! It was a lovely house in a perfect location - a short walk to the train station and to the bars and pubs of Newtown. Easy access to everywhere in Sydney. It was the perfect spot to spend a few nights when catching up with friends."),
("2018-03-30", "5178277", "Will", "Great location in the heart of Newtown  definitely recommend to check it out."),
("2018-04-08", "5178277", "Nicole", "Highly recommend MissD's place. My stay was incredibly enjoyable with no drama or confusion. Hands down the most comfortable AirBnB bed I've ever slept in."),
("2018-04-12", "5178277", "Natalie", "Best Airbnb I have stayed in in Sydney! Will stay again"),
("2018-05-11", "5178277", "Glenyss", "MissD’s place was clean and spacious and well organised. While she was not there herself she was very responsive. It is well located being easy to walk to King Street. A fun and lively area."),
("2018-05-25", "5178277", "Lin", "离火车站确实近 两条街的距离 公交车也很方便就在马路对面｡整个区都比较安静 就是每天早上和晚上飞机经过声音比较大 因为离机场不远在飞机起降的航路上｡房间干净卫生 厨房设置也很齐全 房东会为客人准备免费的牛奶｡入住及退房都是自助形式很完美｡以后有机会去还会选择这里｡"),
("2018-05-30", "5178277", "Henry", "Highly recommended place. Definitely  it's a good spot in town. Everything is well arranged and we were pretty happy with cleanliness. Special thanks to MissD and her hubby for hospitality and cozy place. "),
("2018-06-17", "5178277", "Elizabeth", "Great location and lovely room"),
("2018-06-21", "5178277", "Erika", "Had such a lovely stay.  Location is very near cafes and newtown station   about 5mins walk  very near the bus stop - 2mins walk .  Ms. D is very responsive with quiries.  Thank you! "),
("2018-06-26", "5178277", "Marcellia", "Such a beautiful place to stay! Close to public transport(walking distance to train station)  airport  and nearby cafe/restaurants. Perfect place for foodie. The area reminds me of Chapel Street in Melbourne . Very clear instructions in the house  numbers of goodfood guide book to go for meals.The room downstairs that I stayed gets the noise from upstairs  but everything else is great!"),
("2018-07-06", "5178277", "Lila", "Great Airbnb! Super close to transit and very easy to get to the CBD within 15-20 mins! The room was clean and great value for money. Only honest complaint would be the house is a lot older than I expected and because of this you could hear every time someone walked and talked upstairs or went to the bathroom. This being said it wasn’t a problem and wouldn’t stop me from staying here again  I would definitely recommend it!"),
("2018-07-17", "5178277", "Philip", "Great spot. Lovely room. Thank you!"),
("2018-08-10", "5178277", "裔宁", "Newtown附近不错的排屋｡"),
("2018-08-22", "5178277", "Lorraine", "Good Value for money  In a nice location for exploring."),
("2018-09-02", "5178277", "Antje", "If you don't mind a freezing cold house and lots of noise throughout the night  the place might b suitable. Nice location and very convenient... but overpriced."),
("2018-09-05", "5178277", "Sonal", "MissD’s place is clean  convenient and comfortable. The check-in system is hassle free and gives you the flexibility to check in at anytime. There is cereal and milk for breakfast along with various beverages and condiments such as sugar  coffee  tea etc.The room also has a heater in case it gets too cold. The bedding was clean and hygienic. And professional cleaners clean the common spaces pretty frequently.Location is just a stone’s throw away from Enmore road and the bus stop is just 5 minutes away.All in all  it’s GREAT value for money. I’d definitely come back again if I’m ever in Sydney. :)"),
("2018-09-16", "5178277", "Trish", "Good value  comfortable accommodation.  Some aircraft noise at night but bearable. Take own extras to go with cereal if wanted. Handy to rail station and wide range of shops."),
("2018-09-19", "5178277", "Esha", "Miss D is an amazing and wonderful host ever. Her instructions were clear and we managed to check in easily as per her instructions. It’s a small cottage style house with a friendly ambience in Sydney. The metro is near- just 5 mins of walking distance. You can use the metro to go anywhere to the city. Cabs are abundant in the area as well. We didn’t expect the place to be full of love and we met many friendly house mates there.  It exceeds our expectations. The bathroom and lounge area is indeed lovely. We had friendly chit chat with some of our housemates. Coffee  towel  tea  mugs and most amenities were provided. We had a heater in the room to keep ourselves warm. Overall  we love her place and would come back again next time. I would rate her place 10/10. I would recommend people staying at her cosy place anytime. Next time you are coming to Malaysia  please do visit us miss D. Thank you for hosting us. You are amazing."),
("2018-09-29", "5178277", "Ngoc", "Prime location in the middle of an funky hipster neighborhood. Great shops  cafe  restaurants  bar  weekend flea markets  train station  etc.  within 5mins from the house. The room is neat  tidy and lovely but expect to hear noises and footsteps from the upper floor if you book room downstairs."),
("2018-10-01", "5178277", "Huizhen", "The house is amazing. Miss D is so nice. And it is closed to the bus station and the train station. Good experience in Sydney.Thank you."),
("2018-11-06", "5178277", "Mandy", "Good location  nice house  shared space so bit noisy"),
("2018-11-10", "5178277", "Andry", "房東太太人很好 很照顧房客 讓我們提前寄放行李 非常感謝!地點真的很棒!廁所廚房都很乾淨 房間也很整潔!唯獨隔音不太好 會聽到樓上走路的腳步聲｡"),
("2018-11-14", "5178277", "Ignas", "It's a good place at great hipster-ish neighborhood for a decent price. The whole vibe it gives out is much like communal youth apartment so if you're into that  you'll like the place. There were some cleanliness issues with bugs but it was generally okay. As far as the room goes you get what you see in the picture. :)P.S. The complimentary breakfast (cereal) is quite good and a nice addition."),
("2018-11-18", "5178277", "Stephan", "Communication was easy - Self check-in went smoothly; host sent out clear description on what to do upon arrival. Location was fantastic - multiple public transport options (train & bus)  ~5mins walking to Newtown train station  many restaurants & cafes in the area - most open until late hours. The room was also spacious. Breakfast was provided. Host kindly accommodated my request for late check out. The only drawback was that the floor made noises when people walked  so it could be a bit noisy if your room was downstairs. Otherwise  it was a very pleasant stay! Truly enjoyed my stay there!"),
("2018-11-24", "5178277", "Reginald", "Wonderful location and responsive hosts!!"),
("2018-11-28", "5178277", "Emma", "Great spot  huge room with comfortable bed. Stone's throw from everything you need in Newtown"),
("2018-12-06", "5178277", "Dajung", "good:)"),
("2018-12-12", "5178277", "Luke", "The place was exactly as described. Large front room with heaps of natural light. Fantastic location. Although it's a room in a house with other travellers  it was so quiet I felt like I was there alone. Recommended for a stay in a great neighbourhood of Sydney."),
("2018-12-18", "5178277", "Daniele", "Very nice  good place  close to the station  recommended"),
("2018-12-24", "5178277", "Michael", "We had the room located at the ground floor with enough space for all our 3 luggage. The place is clean and the owner comes pretty much everyday and refills whatever needs to be like soap toilet paper etc... My girlfriend felt bad by the time of our arrival and he managed to let us in earlier than check in time. Really appreciated it! Thanks for a nice stay."),
("2018-12-26", "5178277", "Eva-Maria", "MissD's house is very central in Newtown with good access to public transportation  restaurants and cafes. The house has a lot of character and our room was beautifully decorated. Basic breakfast was provided and we enjoyed having access to a well-stocked kitchen where we could interact with the other guests. We were in the downstairs bedroom and you did hear a bit of noise from upstairs and the front door. But we knew that in advance so it wasn't a problem. Street parking is usually 2hrs  however there are some streets in the area with no restrictions.Overall very good value  a great place to stay in Sydney and we recommend MissD's house."),
("2019-01-18", "5178277", "Kelsey", "This place is clean  quiet  and super close to the Newtown station. So much to do and try in that area!!"),
("2019-01-31", "5178277", "Catherine", "Perfect location  perfect host  recommend highly.  Thanks MissD  we loved it."),
("2019-02-14", "5178277", "Sadie", "Fantastic location  great place just around the corner from King St. Very clean  2 bathrooms which helps with a house full of travelers  good kitchen facilities although no microwave and no TV in the lounge but great WiFi. Downstairs front bedroom was lovely with a beautiful fireplace  hairdryer  mirror and lots of nice touches such as plants and ornaments. All bedrooms are lockable."),
("2019-02-17", "5178277", "Ella", "The communication with MissD is easy and clear. We did not actually meet her  but everything was self-explanatory - if you read and follow the advice that is laying in your room  all your questions will be answered. The room and the bathroom were very clean and everything that you expect from an AirBnB is provided. The location is also a plus  Newtown is an interesting  alive town with a lot to see and it is also close to the city center. The only thing that was not perfect is that the house seems to have thin walls and you can hear almost everything that is happening above or next to you  but that’s just the architecture of the house. I would definitely recommend MissD‘s place."),
("2019-02-25", "5178277", "Phil", "Great spot in the heart of Newtown! Everything at your fingertips! Place was spotless and rooms were spacious. The hosts were very hospitable.Definitely recommend!"),
("2015-11-29", "5347035", "Michael", "Overall a great stay! Central location made it easy to get everywhere. Unfortunately it was quite loud from neighboring streets and rooms"),
("2015-12-13", "5347035", "Tristan", "The emails with Javier and then contact and meeting with his friend  who gave us the keys  was very friendly. That was probably the best part of our stay in this flat. It does not meet the quality and standards that we have enjoyed from other flats on airbnb  whose customer service responded quickly and helped us relocate.The photos of the flat are misleading: some furniture (like the two tables) has disappeared or been moved  some has been replaced  the two main blinds are broken  as is the shower-head holder - all in all resulting in a much less friendly and less practical feeling. Besides that  we found there to be a general feel of neglect: though the flat had been cleaned before we arrived  we had to bleach the bath tub twice and scrub it to make it look not disgustingly grimy. At least its cleaner now ... The shower curtain was mouldy  and there was an unpleasant smell from the kitchen cabinets.Finally  as the previous guest described in his comment - unfortunately posted after our booking - the neighbours are very very loud: they partied for three nights in a row until 4am  their front doors open to the corridor. We know Bondi Beach is a party place  but didn't expect it inside a residential building  and at this price for the flat."),
("2015-12-19", "5347035", "Claire", "Javier's apartment was perfect. The location was incredibly convenient  quiet and tranquil and beautifully furnished. The apartment was clean and inviting and provided a perfect Bondi base for my stay. "),
("2015-12-22", "5347035", "Andres Alexander", "Buena estadía"),
("2015-12-28", "5347035", "Lauren", "We had a great stay at Javier's apartment! The location was ideal- so close to the beach and town. The flat was spacious and homely and perfect for our Christmas stay :). The bed was very comfy and kitchen had everything we needed. Would definitely recommend Javier's apartment!"),
("2016-01-02", "5347035", "Juliette", "We had the most amazing time at the lovely home of Javier! They made us feel like we were just at home and it was so central we could reach everything in 5 minutes. Eventhough we were a little late you guys were so laid back and easy going that we experienced the surfinglife exactly like it is. Thank you guys so much for everything! It  was such a blast to stay at yours!!!!"),
("2016-08-16", "5347035", "Nik", "nice place! (bit humid) awesome neighbourhood! we had a really good time in Bondi and this apartment made it complete"),
("2016-08-20", "5347035", "Kathy", "Fantastic location  great place  a few bumps. The apartment was very clean  very comfortable  in a great neighborhood.  Javier was not in town but contacted me via email to make sure all was ok when I arrived.  I had originally booked a different place but it was cancelled last minute so I was lucky to find Javier's place.  Unfortunately  I was driving and did not have time to verify the parking situation.  Javier tried to offer ideas  but in reality I was stuck paying for parking whenever I was at the apartment on either a 1-hour or 2-hour meter.  Pricey and inconvenient!  If you are not driving  you'll really enjoy the chill apartment and great neighborhood."),
("2016-08-27", "5347035", "Leah", "Very welcome  easy going and good to communicate with"),
("2016-11-26", "5347035", "Cameron", "The unit was exactly as described. Was walking distance to everything we needed. Javier gave us tips on free parking which was only a 5 minute walk and easy to find. Communication was great with quick responses to any questions asked. We had our son with us which the sofa bed was finefor. Would stay here again."),
("2017-01-01", "5347035", "Simone", "Fantastic location in the heart of Bondi and very friendly host!"),
("2015-04-06", "5482864", "Sonia & Ricardo", "This place is as beautiful as it looks in the pictures. It is clean  tidy  well-decorated and makes you feel like home. The living room is nice and bright in the day and if you need a break from drinking in the bars and pubs at night (which are within walking distance by the way)  the balcony is a nice place to relax too. Lucile has been super helpful and friendly in providing us with all the necessary details required for our stay. If there is one thing you need to know about this place  it is that the beds are really comfy! It's like sleeping in your favorite clean  old t-shirt. Be careful  you might find it hard to peel yourselves off the bed in the mornings. Thank you once again for sharing your beautiful home with us!"),
("2015-04-20", "5482864", "Melanie", "Wonderful and good location. Very helpful host and easy to communicate with. I would recommend staying there :)"),
("2015-06-09", "5482864", "Georgie", "We had the best time staying at Francois and Lucile's sunny bondi pad. It is so beautifully decorated  clean  tidy and in a great spot. Definitely recommend. "),
("2015-08-02", "5482864", "Jennifer", "The host canceled this reservation 143 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-10-06", "5482864", "Emily", "Nice apartment and as it appears in photos. Flat was clean and conveniently located near bondi beach. Recommended!"),
("2015-12-14", "5482864", "Scarlet", "wir hatten keine genaue Ankunftszeit ausgemacht  da uns gesagt wurde wir können jederzeit am Nachmittag kommen  wenn wir allerdings vor einer gewissen Uhrzeit kommen wäre Francois noch da. Das machte uns nichts aus also kamen wir an und er war noch da. Die Begrüßung war freundlich und zuvorkommend. Er hat uns alles wichtige gezeigt. Einzig komische Sachen  dass wir unser Bett selbst beziehen durften. naja. Darüber sieht man hinweg wenn man das tolle Apartment sieht mit der super Lage! "),
("2015-12-15", "5482864", "Michaela", "The host canceled this reservation 19 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-02-08", "5482864", "Thomas", "Absolutely flawless stay at Lucile and Francois apartment - perfect location in south Bondi! Everything was as described and the living room decor was awesome. Best bits - super comfy bed  spotless apartment and the balcony was ideal for relaxing in the afternoon! The beach is so close we were back and forth several times a day. Lucile was only a text away whenever something was needed - super friendly couple and a great Airbnb host. "),
("2016-12-29", "5482864", "Marvin", "Lucile and Francois were very good hosts. The apartment is stylish  well furnished and with a big balcony. Its only a few minutes walking from Bondi Beach and close to many restaurants. We had a fantastic time and I would definitely come back. Thanks a lot.  "),
("2017-02-18", "5482864", "Alan", "Amazing stay at Lucile and Francois apartment - perfect location which as close enough to the nightlife but still secluded enough to enjoy a quiet evening. The decor in the apartment was lovely and showed alot of personality. The furniture was clean and comfy  especially the beds  great for a sleep in. The beach is so close we were back and forth several times a day. Communication with the hosts was easy and there was a high level of contact for anything we needed. Loved the place. "),
("2017-04-16", "5482864", "Mark", "Clean and comfy and within walking distance to everything in Bondi.lived it"),
("2017-10-15", "5482864", "Magda", "The host canceled this reservation 31 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-04-08", "5461928", "Gail", "Stephanie is a delightful thoughtful and generous host. She was prompt in responding to questions and left her home in a welcoming manner. The cottage is delightful comfortable and we thoroughly enjoyed our stay there. Glebe is just wonderful with lots of atmosphere and close to many of Sydney's highlights.This was our first foray into Airbnb and we are hooked! It was an excellent initiation and no doubt a hard act to follow!I thoroughly recommend Stephanie and her cottage and Glebe. I hope that I can stay there again."),
("2015-07-13", "5461928", "Claire", "Stephanie is an excellent host and her house is lovely.  It was perfectly ready for us when we arrived  Stephanie communicated well with us throughout the booking and arrival process  and her instructions for using the facilities were clear and easy to follow.The house is in a wonderful location  close to Sydney University and Glebe Point Road.  Staying there was thoroughly enjoyable as the house was in perfect order and the kitchen was well appointed.  The view out to the back garden was an added bonus."),
("2015-07-21", "5461928", "Paige", "We had the best time & that was due to Stephanie's home & how at ease she made us feel. It was just like home away from home & Glebe is a beautiful suburb."),
("2015-08-24", "5461928", "Colleen", "The house was clean  beautiful and had a lot of character. Steph is warm and professional  and we had no issues with any of the amenities or access during our short stay. Highly recommend this place!"),
("2015-10-06", "5461928", "Roberto", "We had a great stay at Stephanie's house.A walking distance from cafes  groceries stores and other amenities came in very handy. The apartment is very well kept and very clean. It has a cozy flavour as well."),
("2015-12-01", "5461928", "Melissa", "Highly recommended! Stephanie was a gracious host and her home was an inner city delight. Great location within walking distance to Sydney Uni and the restaurants and bars of Glebe  her home was comfortable and well appointed. A great experience! "),
("2015-11-27", "5469086", "Carlos", "Anitta was warm and welcoming with fantastic instructions on getting the most from the house and surrounding area."),
("2016-02-24", "5469086", "Tobias", "My stay at Annitas place was great! Very nice atmosphere and nice & calm neighborhood. Walking distance to the sea. Took me about 30 minutes to get to Bondi Beach by walking."),
("2016-03-03", "5469086", "Chloé", "Great location to enjoy Sydney beaches! Very nice atmosphere from the bedroom with large windows on a big tree full of birds! Do not miss the sunrise! Anitta send us lots of information to find our way to the apartment and enjoy the place and the environment!"),
("2016-05-30", "5469086", "Nils", "We really enjoyed our stay  thank you. Cosy and homely apartment with very comfortable beds (and fast wifi). We really appreciated the personal touch  toys + kids towels for our son and the homely feel. Bronte is lovely in its own right and it's a good location to explore the rest of Sydney. "),
("2016-07-04", "5469086", "Melissa", "We didn't get to meet Anitta but she answered all our questions before we arrived. The apartment had two comfortable beds and was very quiet at night. We loved the neighbourhood and found it to be delightful. It was easy to take a bus from the airport and into the city. We had a great stay."),
("2016-09-02", "5469086", "Fanny", "Very nice place to stay ! So close to the beach and buses are not far. Very quiet  neighborhood is very nice and respectful. I enjoy theses six weeks spent in this place. You can cook very easily because Anitta's got a lot of things in her kitchen. I recommand this place and Anitta was a very good host  very kind and helpful  she answers quickly !Thanks for everything ! All the best !"),
("2016-09-10", "5469086", "Joanne", "Anitta was very quick with responding to any requests. Her artwork is fascinating and there are many personal features that make this unit quaint. The location is ideal for getting around the Eastern suburbs. The apartment looks out onto the garden and 'nature's alarm' will ring out every morning. I can't remember the last time I heard a kookaburra laugh!"),
("2016-09-18", "5469086", "Imogen", "Anitta was very helpful and efficient with communication. The flat is very quiet and feels like you are in a national park rather than the city because of all the (Website hidden by Airbnb) feels quite lived in  which is nice but different to other Airbnb experiences I've had. A good place for a rest. Thanks X"),
("2016-10-04", "5469086", "Zak", "My partner and I stayed at this apartment for 10 nights in September.  The place was very very clean and homely and the owner made a lot of effort to ensure we were comfortable and had all the relevant info needed.  Only negative I would say was that it was more of a studio than a 1 bed so felt quite small with 2 of us. It would also have benefited from a plug in heater of some sort as it was very cold at night.   Other than that we very much enjoyed our stay."),
("2016-11-17", "5469086", "Luis", "Great position  close to the beach. Amazing morning sun in the bedroom. Very clean. And Anitta is an amazing host. She even reminded us not to miss the supermoon during our stay. Would definitely be back."),
("2016-12-05", "5469086", "Lynette", "Great location. Very close to shops & beach."),
("2016-12-30", "5469086", "Tania", "Enjoyed our stay at Anitta's! Place is within walking distance to Bondi Junction and Centennial Park."),
("2017-01-30", "5469086", "Jennifer", "Anitta's place was perfect for the 2 of us. Its walking distance to the beach and the tree line outside makes it feel so tropical. It's a close drive shops  beaches and CBD.This place is highly recommended if you enjoy the beach life."),
("2017-02-04", "5469086", "Joelle Aniko", "Anitta was great host. Very accomodating and helpful. Her place was very quaint and ideal for couples."),
("2017-02-11", "5469086", "Georgie", "The flat was incredibly comfortable and peaceful  in a gorgeous location with easy access to stunning beaches and public transport! A truly relaxing stay "),
("2017-02-15", "5469086", "Sandra", "This small apartment is really well located above Bronte beach  with a longish but attractive walk to the beach. The outlook was through trees with bird song and lovely sunrises. There is a nice big private car park and everything we needed was there. No aircon but a good fan made sleeping easy and the bed was comfortable. We found it hard to manage the TV and more instructions would be helpful. Anitta answered us on email when necessary and we enjoyed our stay. We would stay there again. "),
("2017-03-22", "5469086", "Patrick", "Logement à déconseiller  en l'état !"),
("2017-03-30", "5469086", "Kara", "Lovely views. Great art"),
("2017-04-09", "5469086", "Samantha", "Anitta's apartment is perfect for solo travelers or couples. It is easy to find  close to public transportation  in a safe and quiet area. Anitta's directions were flawless and incredibly helpful making check-in a breeze. This apartment is close public transportation and it is easy to get anywhere in Sydeny. This unit felt very private even with lots of windows and natural light. We loved it!"),
("2017-04-25", "5469086", "Rashko", "Superb location  very quiet  perfect view to the ocean and a garden in front of the balcony full of birds. We were really surprised to hear the call of the kookaburra!"),
("2017-07-15", "5469086", "Nadia", "Anitta's place was in a fab location just a short walk from the beach. It was a great base for us as we explored Sydney and the Eastern suburbs. It was a bit cold  because it was winter  but Anitta told us where to find extra blankets and provided a heater. And although she was overseas was really quick to respond to any queries we had. We had a really lovely time."),
("2015-04-01", "5511614", "Mel", "Our stay at Leanne's Queenscliff apartment was perfect from the outset. Leanne greeted us upon arrival at the apartment  giving us a quick tour of the space and building facilities. After a long international flight it was a lovely warm welcome. The apartment was extremely clean  modern and well appointed  perfect for two people with plenty of space for suitcases. It is located in a new  secure building within easy walking distance to Freshwater and Manly beach  shops and restaurants. There is a bus stop right outside the apartment building  and only a 15 minute walk to the Manly ferry.Leanne had kindly left us some pantry  fridge and bathroom supplies to get us started  we couldn't have asked for anything more! We spent many lovely evenings on the spacious balcony  enjoying the view of the garden looking out to the Manly lagoon.Communicating with Leanne was easy prior to arrival  and she was always available for any questions during our stay. We highly recommend a stay at Leanne's beachside apartment. Thanks Leanne  we thoroughly enjoyed it!"),
("2016-02-14", "5511614", "Brian", "Stayed in Leanne's Queenscliff apartment for 3 weeks during a 5 week work stay in Sydney. Apartment was absolutely first class  great location so close to Manly and surrounding beaches. Leanne was a fantastic host  meeting me on check in and showing me around. Couldn't fault anything about the apartment  lovely neighbours  secure parking. I would 100% recommend Leanne's apartment to anyone looking to enjoy Manly and the surrounding area. As a hostess  Leanne epitomised the Airbnb values. "),
("2016-03-05", "5511614", "Olivia", "Very friendly host that kept in touch throughout the booking phase as well as during the stay. Made everything easy which was great.The flat was ideal for a couple  very well laid out in a safe  quiet complex. Only 10 minute walk to Queenscliffe beach so ideal for someone looking to enjoy Manly and it's beach without being in the middle of everything."),
("2016-07-07", "5511614", "Brian", "Stayed at Leanne's apartment in Queenscliff for the second time in just over 4 months for a work trip. As with the previous stay  everything was very well organised and no stone left unturned to ensure my stay was as comfortable and stress-free as possible. Would highly recommend to any travellers looking for somewhere to stay in Queenscliff. "),
("2017-03-04", "5511614", "Brian", "Just checked out after another 2 week stay in Lea's fantastic apartment. Both Lea and Rohan are great to deal with and nothing was ever an issue. This was my 3rd stay for work at their beautiful apartment. Only downside over the 2 weeks was the weather but good as the guys are  even that was beyond their control. Thanks a million for everything  Lea - don't expect to be back any time soon but if I do will certainly get in touch. Cheers Brian"),
("2017-12-16", "5549057", "Gregory", "Brendan is a great host and has a lot to offer  especially if you never been Sydney. His apartment is wonderful and quiet. Walking distance to shops and public transportation. Also the view of Bondi beach is spectacular from his apartment. I would most definitely stay here again if I came to Sydney again!"),
("2018-01-02", "5549057", "Yuka", "We spend good days at Bondi.He offered us comfortable space. It was clean room  kitchen and bathroom.He is helpful and kind. When we asked about Sydney and Bondi  he gave us a lot of information. It was really nice.His place's location is amazing and convenient. You can see Bondi beach from his balcony and there are many shops around his house!! Also you can catch the bus to the city easily.So we enjoyed there.Thank you Brendan!!"),
("2018-01-07", "5549057", "Petra", "The appartment is just few minutes from Bondi beach and above the Iceberg swim pool (amazing start of the day with a swim  before everyone comes in). It is situated on a hill  but the walk is worth the balcony view and chill.Brendon was a great host. He is not in the flat during evenings  what provides privacy as well. Would highly recommendPetra"),
("2018-01-10", "5549057", "Letilda", "Brendon and his Bondi unit was totally amazing!!! Perfect location right near Bondi beach and Bondi road. Comfy bed and amentites. Brendon was such a nice host  very friendly and helpful. Best host ever!!! Thank you so much for our lovely stay."),
("2018-01-12", "5549057", "Jo", "Clean  tidy and comfortable space close to the beaches and cafes of Bondi. Brendan is lovely and was very accomodating- would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-01-17", "5549057", "Aleksandra", "My sister and I️ stayed at Brendan’s for a few days and had a great time. Check in was easy and flexible  he waited for us despite my many plane delays. The place itself was very clean and comfortable  and we loved being able to make ourselves at home. Great proximity to Bondi Beach. Brendan was very helpful and kind. 10/10 would stay here again."),
("2018-01-22", "5549057", "Olivier", "Brendan is a wonderful host. He will give you useful information. His flat is located from a 5-min walk from Bondi beach. But careful  the walk is steep when you come back from the beach ;) The coastal walk is very nice and a lot young people are gathering during summer time"),
("2018-01-27", "5549057", "Debbie", "Brendan was an excellent host   his home is lovely and l felt very comfortable staying there. He goes out of his way to make you feel at home which l  appreciated very much. I would recommend his home and will be booking again with  Brendan next time l visit Sydney."),
("2018-02-03", "5549057", "Peter", "Brendan's is beautiful close to the beach and many shops and cafe yet still far enough to get a little peace and quiet from the liveliness of the scene."),
("2018-02-07", "5549057", "Vicky", "Brendan is very thoughtful and also a great host who cares about your convenience  safety  and basically everything! He provided a lot of travel information and planned an itinerary for my short trip. His house is very clean and tidy! We feel very comfortable during the stay. We have a good talk too! Thanks again Brendan."),
("2018-02-09", "5549057", "Huong", "Brendan's place is positioned just a short walk from the beach and the iceberg pools. So if you are a beach goer it is a great place to stay. The apartment itself is presented neat & clean and Brendan supplies all the necessities you need for your stay and makes you feel very welcome. The apartment is clean and the fresh ocean air coming from the balcony is such a delight. I very much enjoyed sitting mindfully on the balcony having a quiet coffee watching the morning sun. Simple touches such as chocolates on your bed at arrival and on the coffee table in the evenings make for enjoyable appreciation. Thanks again Brendan you made our stay a special one. Keep up the great work"),
("2018-02-21", "5549057", "Kloe", "Good location and tidy place. Worth to stayed for 2 nights and we definitely love to enjoy the night view of Bondi beach from balcony. The host Brendan is very friendly to share place includes everything in Kitchen. It’s very helpful for us with 2 years old child. Also  Brendan spent time to drive us around the town and even to airport when we leave! It’s unexpected to have such a amazing guide."),
("2018-02-25", "5549057", "Mark", "Great location  easy to deal with host and clean apartment"),
("2018-03-07", "5549057", "Bjorn", "I had a comfortable stay in Brendan’s well-kept apartment in South Bondi  which has a lovely balcony overlooking the beach. Brendan was a sociable  helpful and generous host  providing lots of advice on what to do and see during my time in Sydney and even driving me to the airport. There were unexpectedly some noisy renovation works going on in the building during my stay but they were obviously not the host’s fault. Thank you Brendan!"),
("2018-03-09", "5549057", "Joseph", "Very recommended place to stay at Bondi Beach. Only 7 minutes walk from the beach. Brendan is an amazing host with kind heart and very helpful. He gave us a list of places to visit in Bondi  we could not visit all of them though. But we really enjoy staying in Bondi beach for 2 days. Brendan also gave us a short tour to Bondi beach  when we checked in. His place is very clean and stylish. Thank you so much for everything  Brendan. Cheers  Joseph & Jenny."),
("2018-03-13", "5549057", "Adrian", "Brendan’s flat is very comfortable and homely. He makes you feel very much at home and gives great suggestions about the locality. Great view across Bondi bay. Lots of amenities close by  but quiet location."),
("2018-03-15", "5549057", "Aj", "Brendan is easily one of the most nicest and hospitable hosts I’ve come across using AirBnB. His place was immaculate and contemporary. Highly recommended."),
("2018-03-19", "5549057", "Anthony", "Brendan is a great host. His place is very clean and neat. He was very helpful explaining the public transportation and spots around Sydney. I would def stay here again and the location to Bondi Beach is only a 3 minute walk! Cheers Brendan!"),
("2018-03-22", "5549057", "Olivia", "Brendan was an outstanding host  was very generous with his time and recommendations  very kind and made me feel very welcome and comfortable in is home. Incredibly close to the action of Bondi and a lovely view from the deck"),
("2018-03-25", "5549057", "Apolline", "Nous sommes deux français venus en sac à dos pour l’Australie. Afin de se reposer après les longues heures de vol nous avons décidés de passer deux nuits dans cet Airbnb. Le repos fut total ! L appartement est très propre  calme et fonctionnel. Il  est également bien situé à 5 minutes à pied de la plage de Bondi. L’hôte Brendan été toujours a notre écoute et nous a donner les meilleurs conseils pour les visites . Vous pouvez y aller les yeux fermés ! Merci encore et à bientôt je l’espéreApolline et Quentin"),
("2018-04-02", "5549057", "Alex", "Great place in the heart in Bondi ! Beautiful views from the balcony. Short walk to the beach  restaurants  shops and transport. Brandon is a great host  made me feel very welcome and shared some great itinery ideas for my trip."),
("2018-04-08", "5549057", "Zohra", "Brendan and his place get 10 stars from me!  His place is in the best location  and he is so cool to chat with.  My flight landed REALLY early in the morning  and he allowed me to check in early too.  One of the nicest people I've ever met  and I've traveled the WORLD!I was a solo traveler and he made everything convenient and easy for me. If you want a good Bondi Beach experience  B's place is perfect.Location - greatSpace - greatBathroom - great and cleanLocal tips - great"),
("2018-04-23", "5549057", "Dana", "What a wonderful stay in Bondi! Brendan was a lovely host and the location is perfect - just off the main streets so it's quiet but so close to the beach and the coastal walk!"),
("2018-06-25", "5549057", "Xiangyi", "This is a lovely room with everything we need. We had a really great time in the city and the house. The place is clean and tidy  Brendan also well prepared in details  like the heater and chocolates. He also showed us around and gave us useful tips  even plans for days! The place is close to the beach  you can have a great view from the balcony. The place is also close to the bus  which can directly to Bondi Junction  and transfer to everywhere else. The kitchen is also welcome to use  also provides milk and bottled water.Overall  it is a really nice place and we really enjoyed it! Highly recommend it✪ω✪"),
("2018-07-29", "5549057", "Debbie", "Brendan is a lovely host! Very helpful and super friendly. The place is in a wonderful location with a wonderful view. Brendan was very upfront about the lift being out of order while my Dad was staying with him and even offered an extra discount when we didn’t need it. He gave us local tips and made sure my Dad had everything he needed. Great experience - would thoroughly recommend Brendan’s place!"),
("2018-09-25", "5549057", "John", "Staying at Brendan’s was great. Wonderful flat  lovely town  easy to get downtown. Brendan is a great host."),
("2018-10-15", "5549057", "Kay", "Brendan is a helpful  caring host and his apartment is comfortable and very clean and tidy.Definitely recommended as a place to stay with views over Bondi Beach"),
("2018-10-21", "5549057", "Vince", "I had a very comfortable stay! The place is in a great location  close to the beach and public transportation. I would definitely recommend his place to anybody looking to stay in Bondi Beach."),
("2018-10-29", "5549057", "Ryan", "Excellent place to use as a launch pad for all of Bondi. Very clean and the view from the patio is excellent. The coffee and tea was a nice touch! Highly recommend."),
("2018-11-04", "5549057", "Reza", "I stayed at Brendan's place and had a wonderful stay. Brendan is very helpful  responsive and even took me to the tour around the neighborhood to familiar myself with the location. The apartment is located in a quiet neighborhood but it is  just behind the main road leading to the beach  offering variety of cafes  bars and restaurants.  All you need to do is simply take a leisure walk. In terms of public transportation  there is a nearby bus stop at the main road that can connect you to the Bondi Train Station  and from here you can take train ride to the city. All in all  it is a convenient place for me!"),
("2018-11-08", "5549057", "Jessi", "Best place in Bondi for stay and top host.Will stay again."),
("2018-11-10", "5549057", "Catherine", "I stayed at Brendan's place for 3 nights and had a pleasant experience. The apartment is merely a few mins walk from the famous Iceberg pool and yet its super quiet in the evenings. Brendan was kind and helpful with great local tips. I would highly recommend to those who visit Sydney and look to spend time at Bondi."),
("2018-11-17", "5549057", "Taryn", "Brendan was very accommodating and helpful with recommendations for spots to visit  and information on transport to his place. He was a wonderful host  and his place was clean and lovely. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-11-22", "5549057", "Werner", "Very nice and gentle host  nice Bedroom  great view on the balcony and very close to the beach and Costal Walkway. Excellent value for the money."),
("2018-11-25", "5549057", "Sascha Oskar", "I enjoyed the time at Brendan’s apartment. It was my best experience in Sydney. The apartment and room is clean and cozy. Very good located. And the view from the balcony during morning coffee or afternoon drink is amazing.Brandan is a very good host  and a great person."),
("2018-11-29", "5549057", "Cassandra", "Brendan's spot is absolutely a DREAM! Just steps away from the beach  333 bus line that goes to bondi junction toward the city  and tons of hip cafes that Bondi has to offer. Not to mention  Brendan is an extremely kind host. Our schedules didn't match up so I barely saw him  but it was lovely to meet him. Reviews talk about a big hill  which really isn't that big  so don't be deterred because of that. THANK YOU BRENDAN!"),
("2018-12-01", "5549057", "Warren", "Nice host. Great view and location. Cozy room."),
("2018-12-10", "5549057", "Pep", "Brendan is a fantastic host. Place is in a great location just minutes walk from Bondi Beach. Place is spotless. Bed is really comfortable. Great value. Definitely recommended."),
("2018-12-15", "5549057", "Diane", "Great location - really close to the beach & bus. Clean  tidy  great decor & Fresh flowers were a great touch.Brendan was a gracious host and fun to chat with. Made my stay very comfortable."),
("2018-12-30", "5549057", "Suzanne", "Awesome location  very clean and very kind host! Definitely recommended."),
("2019-01-02", "5549057", "Anastasia", "Brendan is great and his apartment and room is very comfortable. Perfectly located. Brendan is a walking book if you need a tip for a trip around. Was very kind and let us bring out bags earlier than a check in time and also was  activily helpful in general. Thank you Brendan!"),
("2019-01-05", "5549057", "Lisei", "Our 2 nights stay in Bondi Beach was nothing short of amazing  thanks to Brendan as he is such a fantastic host. Before arriving  he sent us some recommendations of things to do in Bondi  some nice restaurants  and also an easy to follow instructions for us to get to his house which was really helpful and courteous. He was also kind enough to send us to Bondi Junction when we were leaving  as he saw that we are carrying a huge luggage. My boyfriend left his bag at the house after we left to the CBD  Brendan was again very kind to send the bag to Bondi Junction train station for us.Brendan's property is located at the heart of Bondi Beach  within 5 minutes walking distance to the beach and Bondi Icebergs  and is also very near to some amazing bars and cafes. His house is clean  and very cozy as well."),
("2019-02-16", "5549057", "Italo", "Phantastic location   great host  stunning view on bondi  bright room.  Sincerely recommended"),
("2015-03-25", "5604994", "Alyas", "Jared & Diana are 2 very welcoming and kind hosts   they let me book their place on the last minute and was very helpful with the process  they also checked up via SMS as this was my method of contact on anything else we needed on a regular .Their place has absolutely everything all amenities and lots of extras  that makes a comfortable holiday   very good neighborhood as there's a Shopping Mall and  Supermarkets within 1 minute walk .Would definitely be recommending friends and will be going back for a second time ."),
("2015-04-01", "5604994", "Ray", "Incredibly welcoming and friendly host. Apartment very freshly decorated with scented flowers and candle.Very good appliances with ample kitchen utensils and tableware.More than sufficient consumables such as milk  refreshments  bathroom and laundry products.Towels and linen immaculate."),
("2015-04-07", "5604994", "Misho", "Jared and Diana's apartment is immaculate  very clean and right in the middle of town with only 5 floors separating you from all the shops and eateries. The apartment is very modern with all the necessary amenities to make you feel at home and the underground secure parking provides peace of mind. My booking enquiry was responded to within a couple of hours so we were able to book the apartment very quickly. Jared and Diana will make you feel very welcome so if you're looking for a place in and around Rouse Hill don't hesitate in booking this place it's awesome! P. S if you know how to play the piano you'll love It even more :)"),
("2015-05-11", "5604994", "Lisa", "Jared & Diana were wonderful hosts  were easy to communicate with  welcoming and happy to help in any way they could. The apartment is situated above a shopping precinct which was very convenient and was surprisingly very quiet! Highly recommend! "),
("2015-05-16", "5604994", "Nolita", "Jared & Diana were fantastic hosts  very friendly and professional.  The apartment was clean and neat. Everything was provided.The place is very convenient with plenty of shops  cinemas and restaurants below. We will definitely book this place again and highly recommend them."),
("2015-05-24", "5604994", "Viv", "Jared and Diana are the most delightful hosts  that go just that bit further to make your stay special.  The apartment is light a clean and has a beautiful feeling of open space  through the balcony.  There is everything you could possible want here  well equipped and immensely comfortable.   Amazing variety of shops on the door-step as well as access to express buses into the city.  Lovely!"),
("2015-06-09", "5604994", "Dushyant (Dee)", "Terrific hosts! Very helpful and down to earth. Lovely apartment! Top location! Great parking space  and no noise apartment  peaceful throughout the day/night. Everything is there that you need. Would definitely stay again."),
("2015-06-20", "5604994", "Douglas", "We had a great 2-week stay at the apartment.  It's in a great location right above the shopping centre.  Nicely furnished  very comfortable and fully equipped. Very clean on arrival and some really nice touches provided by the hosts.  Jared and Diana are great hosts  always replied promptly and gave us a warm welcome.  "),
("2015-06-26", "5604994", "Suzette", "Jared and Diana were very accommodating hosts. The location is wonderful with nice shops and restraurants at your doorstep. The apartment is comfortable and very quiet.  I spent 6 nights here and greatly enjoyed my stay!"),
("2015-06-30", "5604994", "Robert", "Please read the below."),
("2015-08-31", "5604994", "Nan", "Jared & Diana are very nice. Thanks for providing us such lovely and comfortable home.  The apartment is very convinent and very quiet. We spent a good  holidays living here.  :)"),
("2015-09-27", "5604994", "Jennifer", "The unit is very comfortable and nicely decorated. You could stay one night or a month in complete comfort. The bed is very comfortable but I would like to suggest there was an option of another pillow. My husband only uses one  but I need two. That is only a personal thing.  The position is fantastic  and you would never get bored.  There is every shop imaginable  cinemas and white we were staying  there was a hot rod/vintage care show on  in the main street  with live entertainment. We highly recommend the unit and its position to anyone visiting the hills district of Sydney. Jared and Diana are lovely."),
("2015-10-05", "5604994", "Chris", "Jared and Diana were great  they were very flexible and keen on making sure everything went well with my stay.  The apartment was perfect   very nicely furnished and in great location.  I would definitely stay again and would recommend it to others"),
("2015-10-11", "5604994", "Stewart", "Diana welcomed us at the apartment  showed us how to enter and leave the complex. Garage underneath and shops also under the apartments easily accessible. Apartment was as described. We were entirely satisfied and would return .Apartment itself very clean with all facilities you would require."),
("2016-04-22", "5604994", "Home Blinds", "The host was sensational. Diana was super helpful  super friendly and stayed in touch throughout our stay to ensure all went to plan. Highly recommended  and we will definitely stay again."),
("2016-06-21", "5604994", "Emma", "This was my first Airbnb experience and it was absolutely perfect! A huge thank you to Diana and Jared  who are were excellent hosts - communicative  thoughtful and warm.  I was made to feel incredibly comfortable in their home and I loved every bit of my stay.  Diana gave me clear instructions on how to find the place and communicated really well in the lead up to my arrival  making the transition smooth and stress free. I loved the little touches.  There were chocolates and water left out on the bed  milk and juice in the fridge and beautiful candles lit for my arrival.  I immediately felt right at home.  The unit is modern  comfortable and in a truly amazing location.  The Rouse Hill shopping precinct has every shop you would need and you literally step out the door and you are right in the thick of it.  The furnishings are modern yet comfortable  and the property is equipped with all the little things that you need for a week away (everything from laundry powder to salt & pepper shakers).  Thank you so much for your wonderful hospitality guys!"),
("2016-07-10", "5604994", "Yvonne", "Diana was so welcoming. She added little touches like Irish teabag and milk and chocolate to mention a few. She thought of everything.  Such a fantastic host. Always at the end of the phone if you needed her. Definitely would stay again."),
("2016-12-13", "5604994", "Errol", "Great accommodation  clean with all you could want to make your stay pleasant  great high speed broadband  close to the shops and restaurants.  Diana met us to check us in  nice touch with some juice a a chocolate on our bed.  Secure building with nice balcony on the top floor.  You don't need more than this..."),
("2017-01-05", "5604994", "Eileen", "We have just had 16 nights at Jared and Diana's apartment and perhaps the best compliment we can pay is that we did not want to leave as it had become to feel like home. It is a beautiful  spacious place  very well equipped with all you need to live there like a local. Being on the top floor there are good views across the lake and you hardly know that the shops are only a few steps away from the main door. We found having all the shopping facility and restaurants so available was a real bonus.Diana communicated very well prior to arrival and was at the apartment to meet us. A delightful lady who was most friendly and welcoming. There were provisions in the fridge  chocolates on the table and a beautiful vase of flowers all helping to give the feeling of home from home. She was always available on the phone if we had any questions.The car parking space below proved very useful too.We loved Rouse Hill and when we return we will definitely be looking to stay at Jared and Diana's apartment again."),
("2017-04-15", "5604994", "Melissa", "Awesome place. Would definitely recommend. Lovely couple  lovely home. "),
("2017-04-22", "5604994", "Ammar", "It's a very lovely place and I really enjoyed it there. Jared and Diana are very welcoming"),
("2017-04-28", "5604994", "Darryl", "I had a pleasant stay  in Jared and Diana's lovely top floor apartment. My only concern was that I couldn't stay longer !Well located and central  a great place to stay.Thanks Guys. !"),
("2017-05-11", "5604994", "Elliot", "The apartment is exactly as described and pictured. Check in and check out was simple and all communications were clear. The bed is very comfortable and the apartment is quiet and fully equipped with all you would need. It sits 5 floors above the shops  which means it only take a couple of minutes to get to either Coles or Woolworths and there are also a great cross section of restaurants and take aways if you don't feel like cooking. Secure car park is handy also. "),
("2017-05-22", "5604994", "Belinda", "Jared & Diana were fantastic to deal with and accommodating with our request.  The location is central to everything you need at Rouse Hill.  A very pleasant experience."),
("2017-07-08", "5604994", "Sal", "The apartment was very well positioned and was very comfortable to stay in. Diana was really responsive and helped us throughout the week. I would highly recommend this apartment for anyone who is traveling near the area  thank you Diana."),
("2017-07-14", "5604994", "Graeme", "Thank you Jared & Diana for the warm welcome and generous hospitality. We had a wonderful week in your immaculate apartment with all the comforts of home and the added bonus of an abundance of natural light throughout each room! The location is ideal and made every aspect of our holiday a breeze from the parking of our car  to walking to all the local amenities - shops  restaurants and entertainment. We highly recommend your apartment and thanks again for being such friendly  thoughtful hosts that go the extra mile..."),
("2017-07-29", "5604994", "Russell", "Location fantastic  accommodation fantastic  hosts fantastic!We really enjoyed our stay. The place is as advertised. Conveniently situated for leisurely shopping  with great selection of restaurants and a cinema all within walking distance!Thumbs up!"),
("2017-08-15", "5604994", "명아", "우리 부부는 Jared&Diana의 아파트에서 5박 6일을 머물렀습니다. 체크인 하루 전에 주소와  파킹 정보까지  상세한 정보를 보내주셨고  저희가 늦은 체크인을 했는데도 반갑게 맞아주시고 집안 구석구석  친절히 설명해주셨습니다. 은은한 향초의 향기와  센스있는 인테리어 덕분에 집안에 들어서는 순간  기분이 좋아졌고   주방기구  세탁기 건조기 등 모든 것이 갖춰져 있는 곳이라  내 집처럼 편안했습니다. 또한 오트밀과 꿀 차등도  준비해주셔서 머무는 내내 든든한 아침 식사도 했구요. 주변에 호수 공원이 있어 저희는 매일 아침 산책하고 힐링했습니다. 커피를 좋아하는 저에겐 커피 머쉰이 없다는 것이 살짝 아쉽긴 했지만 길건너 커피숍이 있어 괜찮았습니다. 조용하고 한적한 곳이지만 Rouse hill town center내에 위치한 곳이라  woolworths나 레스토랑 등 편의시설이 모두 가까워서 편리했습니다. 아파트 자체가  완벽한 보안이 되는 곳이고  rousehill town center 자체적으로 24시간 순찰을 하며 보안에 신경을 쓰는 곳이라ㅇ 안전하고"),
("2017-10-28", "5604994", "Jc", "Diana & Jared's is a nice well equipped Airbnb apartment located in a shopping mall  with a view on a bush and the rising sun from its balcony. 40kms away from CBD  but with all shopping facilities downstairs and a parking place that makes it a perfect location for business needs if you're planning to work somewhere around.Not suitable for a long stay though  if you can't afford to pay for the whole duration upfront. Although my plans for a 3 months stay there were shared with the owner from day one  I discovered another booking had been accepted meanwhile when trying to extend my booking to the third month planned."),
("2018-01-05", "5604994", "Stephen", "Long story short: My original place that I booked for my vacation was a noshow so as a last minute booking  I could not have been happier. It is above a shopping complex but you don't get the noise of the shoppers as you're 5 floors up. It is next to a main bus terminal and eventually on a rail line  so you won't be too far from town. The hosts were super flexible and were always available  if needed. I know when I return to Sydney  I will be booking this place again."),
("2018-01-29", "5604994", "Ashleigh", "Great location  clean  great hosts. Would recommend to anyone looking to stay in the area. Lots of nice little extra touches too - snacks  washing powder etc. the space was a lot bigger then expected. Thanks!"),
("2018-02-07", "5604994", "Sheree", "Immaculate  great value  extra amenities with personal touches. Great hosts to deal with. Would highly recommend"),
("2018-02-26", "5604994", "Nic", "Fantastic to deal with  lovely place."),
("2018-03-16", "5604994", "Katy", "Fantastic on all fronts. True home away from home and met all of my needs (and more!) for the 3wks I stayed. The location is perfect for accessing shops (literally on top of them!) and the bus stop is a 3min walk away for easy travel to the city. The apartment is as beautiful as pictures show  has washer/dryer!  parking was easy  and Diana/Jared were wonderful to work with. They were so friendly and checked in with me to make sure all was going well and to see if I needed anything. Will definitely stay here again in the future! Thank you!"),
("2018-03-31", "5604994", "Amer", "The place is simply amazing  cozy and in a very modern area just above the shopping town center.I highly recommend staying at Jared & Diana’s as they are wonderful hosts."),
("2018-04-16", "5604994", "Ron And Dee", "Location perfect  very convenient.  Coffee shops and stores available as needed. Flat beautifully furnished with artistic design. Thoughtful snacks  cereal  coffee and tea provided. Washer and dryer simplified visit. Top notch security. Friendly welcome and check out. Would love to stay every year."),
("2018-04-23", "5604994", "Jennifer", "I would highly recommend Jared and Diana’s place. It is a beautifully clean  light and airy place. The hosts are very welcoming. The location was perfect for me with the shops just downstairs. I would have extended my stay if that were possible and I would definitely stay again if I needed to visit the area."),
("2018-04-26", "5604994", "Saiful", "The place is immaculate  spacious comfortable  mordern clean and right in the heart of rousehill shopping centre yet you dont feel like it is .Jared and Diana are such amazin hosts and they look after you well and youll be spoilt by their thoughtfullness. We will be back!!"),
("2018-05-02", "5604994", "Issma", "Diane was so hospitable  accommodating and welcoming. The location was perfect and the apartment itself had such a relaxed vibe to it. Would stay again."),
("2018-06-01", "5604994", "Sam", "Me and my wife had an amazing stay in their apartment. The location is fantastic and there is good connectivity to the CBD. We loved dining at various restaurants near by and also there  aa beautiful lake near the house which is good for a morning walk. Total value for money.  Thanks Jared for this awesome experience."),
("2018-06-13", "5604994", "Tara", "Loved the apartment and Diana and Jared were so helpful."),
("2018-07-21", "5604994", "Aurélie", "Au top!Super accueil  appartement vraiment joli et cosy  très bien situé  tout à proximité pharmacie  commerces  bus...etc"),
("2018-08-19", "5604994", "David", "great location and very clean"),
("2018-09-24", "5604994", "Esther", "This apartment is in a great location  is secure  private  comfortable  and has access to shops  food  and public transportation. Thank you for this wonderful opportunity!"),
("2018-12-02", "5604994", "Michael", "The unit is immaculate right in the center of Rouse Hill shopping center with bars  cafe and restaurants galore. Public transport to downtown Sydney is easy with buses outside the door.  Any questions I had were answered very promptly though was pretty much self sufficient after the first night - outstanding stay"),
("2019-01-29", "5604994", "Lindsay", "We loved staying in Jared and Diana’s appartment.  It’s lovely and stylish and everything you could wish for was provided from shower gel and shampoo to cleaning products and sun tan lotion so we could start enjoying it straight away.  The location is great.  There are lots of lovely shops  supermarkets  coffee shops  places to eat  post office  cinema and bus station. Having said this the appartment is also lovely and quiet. We would not hesitate to recommend it."),
("2019-02-19", "5604994", "Phillip", "Great place and location   recommend this place for everyone visiting Sydney"),
("2019-02-26", "5604994", "Adams", "Excellent host and great personality. Easy approachable and make checking easy. I've no issues but she keeping on checking to ensure that I've no concern.  Thanks for be an excellent host."),
("2015-06-01", "5642546", "Marvin", "Rochelle was excellent from the very beginning till the end! She was quick to reply  and very flexible in arranging to meet us when we first arrive. The apartment was lovely and looked exactly the same as the pictures on the listing. It was very neat  clean and spacious. It is in a fantastic location  with yummy Black Star Pastry just around the corner. The apartment block is very quiet and private.  We rented a car during our stay   and the private car space was a great thing to have! I left some of my clothing there accidentally (silly me!) and Rochelle was nice enough to offer to post it back to me. I would highly recommend Rochelle's apartment to everyone! "),
("2016-01-02", "5642546", "Walter", "De hadde lagt gjen kart over området med tips om spisesteder  transport etc.  Vi var der nyttårsaften og Rochelle hadde satt en flaske musserende vin til å feire det nye året. Veldig omteksomt. Videre hadde hun ordnet med parkingstillatelse i parkeringshuset."),
("2016-02-17", "5642546", "Bradley", "The host canceled this reservation 16 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-03-16", "5581269", "Helen", "Michy and Paul are such great hosts. They made feel very welcome as soon as I arrived. The backyard cabin is newly renovated. It is very clean  modern  classy and quiet. It is very close to the beach. I will definitely come back again. Thank you Michy and Paul!"),
("2015-03-22", "5581269", "William", "A wonderfully renovated and very comfortable separate flat which we will look to stay at again. Michy and Paul were very nice and accommodating people who went out of their way to ensure we were ok with everything. The location is in a quiet and very pretty surrounding which in future when we have more time we would like to explore more.Overall a very pleasant experience which we would recommend to anyone and everyone."),
("2015-03-29", "5581269", "Nicole", "Michy's place was so PERFECT! We loved it. Perfect remote location only around and hour from Sydney  the perfect weekend escape. The cabin was beautifully furnished and very up to date. Super clean and with all the basics provided even though there isn't a full cook top facility the local pizza delivery was delicious! The walk across the road and down to the jetty is so beautiful for an evening sundowner and really is the perfect spot to watch the sunset. Thanks again for your welcoming vibe and beautifully equip cabin Michy  we'll definitely be back!"),
("2015-04-05", "5581269", "Jules", "We absolutely loved our stay at Michy's lovely cabin on Pittwater. It is even more beautiful in real life than the photos show. Michy went out of her way to accommodate us and make us feel at home  and was also very respectful of our privacy. The cabin is a delight  and full of lovely touches that made us completely spoiled. It's literally right on the water too. It rained the whole time we were there but we were so cosy in our beautiful cabin and enjoying cups of tea on the verandah that we didn't care at all. The Yoda Food restaurant in Avalon just 5 mins away is delicious too! Thank you Michy for a wonderful and much needed rest in your delightful cabin xx"),
("2015-04-07", "5581269", "Sophia", "Michy's cabin is very new  clean and equipped with everything you need for a comfortable stay (TV  wifi  general cooking equipment  books). The cabin is located in the gorgeous suburb of Clareville  right by the sparkling water and amongst the trees - one of the most beautiful places in Sydney. It's the perfect place to stay if you love the outdoors - you could walk 800m to Clareville beach or take a short drive to many other beaches  explore the coast on a kayak or paddle board  hike up Bangalley head for a striking view  just to name a few ideas. Michy was very kind and always available if we needed anything  but otherwise respected our privacy. We had a lovely stay and would recommend to everyone."),
("2015-04-19", "5581269", "Christine", "We were warmly welcomed by Michy to the lovely cabin which is modern  comfortable  clean and beautifully decorated.  We had everything we required. The Pittwater area is just stunning and we enjoyed exploring the surrounds  eating out and checking out the boating scene.  We had a fabulous weekend and can definitely recommend staying here."),
("2015-05-08", "5581269", "Suhela", "We recently spent two nights in Michy's backyard cabin and absolutely loved it. It is spacious and beautiful and decorated with love. the bed is  so comfy. Heaven! And the location and the area are unbeatable. Only a short drive to great restaurants too. water just across the road. I'm definitely hoping to stay here again."),
("2015-05-10", "5581269", "Jenni", "We loved staying at Michy's place in Clareville. It's a lovely self-contained cabin which is very well appointed. Originally booked this place as close by to a party we were attending  however given I was sick ended up staying in ordering take-away and enjoying the space instead. Loved having a cup of tea in the sunshine on the verandah in the morning. Would definitely recommend Michy's place to anyone wanting to explore the northern beaches of Sydney. Tucked away in one of the most beautiful suburbs of Sydney (one I had never visited  despite being a Sydney-sider) with lots to explore nearby. "),
("2015-07-13", "5581269", "Sarah", "Spontaneously  I arranged for a dear friend who was visiting from NZ to stay on a Saturday afternoon to stay at Michy's cabin on Sunday night! It was smooth and simple and my friend had a glorious time and now I can't wait to try it!! Must book again so I can experience it for myself. Thanks for being so flexible and spontaneous with us xx"),
("2015-07-26", "5581269", "Pamela", "Michy - very prompt and efficient in her replies. From the time I enquired till the end of my trip which makes things a lot easier as I didn't know what time exactly I'll reach her accommodation. She was informative and told us where to get food. The Thai food up from her place was good! She also allowed me to do a late check out cause I needed to come back to bathe after. Accommodation - was LOVELY. The photos doesn't do it justice at all! Place was super cosy  comfortable and new! I love the electric blankets and the heater. The kitchen and toilet was good too!! Would definitely live here should I be around the area again. Cheers!"),
("2015-08-01", "5581269", "Heather", "We loved staying here!  I never met Michy  but my husband said she was just the sweetest woman ever!  She brought us greek yogurt and granola for breakfast which was very sweet.  It is across the street from the bay and we even took out their surf skis briefly.  We loved being so close to Avalon Beach!  Great restaurants and beach nearby."),
("2015-08-02", "5581269", "James", "This was a great place to stay for a nice getaway weekend.The area is fantastic  with the beaches a short drive away  and some benches for a chill by the water only 5 minutes walkaway.Michy was great  nothing was too much  and the stay was everything we expected and more!"),
("2015-08-04", "5581269", "Frank", "Michy made as very welcome the property was as we expected.Every thing we needed was proved ( so clean ).Location was great and Michy told us about great walks near by.Although it may be classed as a back yard cabin it was cute comfortable and furnished with a romantic feel"),
("2015-08-16", "5581269", "Bryan", "We had a great stay hosted by Michy. Good communication and very welcoming. The cabin was great. Very clean  comfortable and modern. Highly recommended."),
("2015-08-20", "5581269", "Dana", "Neat clean and cute. Lovely helpful host. Quiet location easy to find"),
("2015-09-05", "5581269", "Aidan", "Amazing location  really lovely cabin which we found perfect for our overnight stay. Even had room for the portable cot! Michy and her husband were really lovely people and Michy was very willing to help with anything we needed. Only a short drive to shops and beaches and a very lovely neighborhood. Definitely recommend!"),
("2015-09-12", "5581269", "Levi", "Perfect  we stayed here on our wedding night. The cabin was quiet clean and very comfortable. Michy was excellent to deal with and everything went very smoothly. Would recommend highly. "),
("2015-09-13", "5581269", "Daniel", "Really loved this place for our stay. Paul and Michy were really accommodating and helpful. Couldn't have asked for more. The place was really nice inside and very clean. A great little spot with it's own access and just accross from the beautiful Pittwater. Avalon cafes and restaurants had us covered all weekend and the weather really turned on for us while we were there. Can't recommend it highly enough  definitely no compaints."),
("2015-09-18", "5581269", "Christiana", "Michy was a very friendly and helpful host. She was always happy to answer any questions and make sure we were happy and comfortable. The granny flat was absolutely perfect for my baby girl and I. The bed was comfy  beautiful bathroom  clean  very chic in a great suburb. I loved the mosquito net. Sheets were beautiful to sleep on. Surrounded by beautiful gum trees. Perfect. I'd absolutely recommend people stay at Michys."),
("2015-09-21", "5581269", "Anna", "Michy and Paul made us very welcome when we arrived and then left us to enjoy our weekend wedding and discovering the beautiful neighbourhood."),
("2015-09-26", "5581269", "Nathan", "I had a wonderful night's stay at Michy's cabin. What a beautiful place and the surrounding landscape is gorgeous."),
("2015-10-01", "5581269", "Debra", "Our stay at this lovely cabin was made even more memorable by the hospitality of Michy and Paul. Clean and attractively decorated the cabin was very private and a perfect place to rest after a day of sightseeing around the fabulous Pittwater area. Would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable stay."),
("2015-10-04", "5581269", "Prani", "We had a really lovely stay at this bungalow in Clareville. It's generous  light and well-ventilated  with many highly appreciated details  including a delicious breakfast  kitchenette at our disposal and kookaburra visitors. Michy is a warm and generous host. We stayed for a long weekend  most of which was spent at the wedding of friends nearby (or associated events)  so we didn't get to take her up on her offer of the use of some watercraft  but did get across the road to the beach a couple of times. The area too is worth a scout - a couple of early morning walks gave us a great survey of the widest variety of housing I've seen in one location  set amidst lush greenness and against spectacular views. We'd love to come back some time. The experience left us feeling very spoilt. "),
("2015-10-05", "5581269", "Cass & Ian", "The backyard cabin was like a secluded writer's retreat! So peaceful and homely  well stocked mini-kitchen too and a beautiful balinese style bed. There's very close by access to an almost private beach and jetty/swimming area  good place to watch the sunset and sip some BYO champers!Michy was a fabulous host  warm and friendly  and not only did she let us check in early  but also gave us a lift to Jonah's for lunch as it's a little difficult to get a taxi in the area. Highly recommend staying here for a romantic getaway from the city!"),
("2015-10-12", "5581269", "Kristyn", "We really enjoyed our stay at backyard cabin by Pittwater.  Michy was the most hospitable host who was eager to help us in any way.  We would definitely recommend staying there.  I would also recommend having your own transport as it can be difficult to get taxi service in the area. Thank you Michy once again!"),
("2015-10-25", "5581269", "Ben", "Great time here  very nice self contained flat out the back  clean etc."),
("2015-11-01", "5581269", "Brian", "Had a great stay in the Backyard Cabin. Very comfortable. Beautiful location. Very accommodating host."),
("2015-11-02", "5581269", "Tess", "Michy's cabin was just perfect. It was a private  quiet  exceptionally stylish little retreat for two  a 30 second stroll to an almost private park and beach over looking beautiful Pittwater. The bed was very comfortable and we had a fantastic sleep. We came and went as we pleased and loved our visit to Clareville. We will just have to make sure we come back to try out the kiosk (walking distance to the cabin)  which is suppose to be great for lunch and dinner. Thanks Michy!"),
("2015-11-06", "5581269", "Charley", "Michy is a gorgeous host  willing to help in thoughtful ways to make her guests feel welcome and comfortable. The space is lovely. Quiet neighbourhood very close to the water with good coffee at a nearby restaurant. Other features of the area accessible by bus or car. I didn't want to leave and hope to return another time."),
("2015-11-08", "5581269", "Greg", "Michy's place was perfect for our short stay in the northern beaches. It's really comfortable and we loved the location right next to the water. Arrival and communication were made very easily. All in all we had a great stay."),
("2015-11-15", "5581269", "Samantha", "My partner and I came up for the weekend for a wedding - fantastic location for us and the house was just what we needed. Michy was friendly and contactable and even had some milk in the fridge for a cup of tea the next morning. Lovely host lovely house  we would definitely recommend it."),
("2015-11-22", "5581269", "Lisa", "Beautiful cabin  fantastic location  everything you need for a quiet getaway. Eat at Clareville Kiosk nearby for a great meal. "),
("2015-12-01", "5581269", "Nikki", "We had such a great stay in Claireville. Private little oasis in the Cabin. Michy was a lovely host and even drove us to the restaurant we had booked into. Highly recommend."),
("2015-12-07", "5581269", "Chris", "Great place with a nice vibe. Loved the location."),
("2015-12-21", "5581269", "Carol", "What an absolutely fabulous place to stay. Michy is considerate warm and a genuine lady. From a warm welcome on arrival  milk in the fridge  everything one could desire in the perfect spot to even driving us to our restaurant for dinner she is amazing. The cabin is perfect  it is beautifully decorated. The bed is large  deep and immensely comfortable. It took a real effort to prize my boyfriend away amid grumbles of why he couldn't squat there.....the cabin is reached by the stepping stone path around the main house  through the small garden and sits on its own. It is breathtakingly pretty....has a comfy sofa  a full bookcase   a gorgeous mosquito net that makes you feel like you are lost in the orient falling asleep. I cannot tell you how fantastic this little treasure is we will most certainly be returning. "),
("2016-01-05", "5581269", "Paola And Arie", "We had a super lovely time at Michy's beach cabin. Location was perfect  just across the road for some lovely quiet beaches on Pittwaters  the interior design of the cabin was spotless and classy and we had all we need to spend a very comfortable week in paradise.Michy and her partner have been amazing hosts  always very kind and happy to have a chat  but also absolutely respectful of our privacy.We would love to stay there again soon!"),
("2016-01-06", "5581269", "Danielle", "Mitchy was a wonderful host. Accommodation was lovely and clean and in a perfect spot in clareville."),
("2016-01-13", "5581269", "Stuart", "We had a lovely time at Michy's.   It's a very comfortable place  very quiet little beach across the road  5 minutes to Avalon's restaurants.  Why bother driving hours up the coast when it's right here !"),
("2016-02-07", "5581269", "Genevieve", "Michy was so welcoming and made us feel very at home. The place was just as described- I would add that there's lovely light and air flow she has put mosquito nets over the windows so you can rest easy (if you get bitten alive like me) that you will have a mosquito free environment! We were so relaxed and rejuvenated after our stay (we live in Sydney and are a short drive away). Love the location and I'd recommend going to Clareville Kiosk- walking distance and beautiful restaurant- for dinner nearby."),
("2016-02-16", "5581269", "Mark", "Michy is a 10 out of 10 host in all facets of  the local area and making you feel at home  we were greeted by a very cheerful lady that made us feel like we were her friends. The property is  exactly as described and very comfortable. A short walk across the road to a wonderful beach location. So if you are into picnic's as we are  this is the place to go.  As we had not ventured to the Northern Beaches before  we were so very nicely surprised how beautiful the area is. Every restaurant we dined  the staff and food were excellent. A must to go is the boat house restaurant  at Palm Beach WOW views right on the river. We will definitely be going back. Therese and Mark"),
("2016-03-06", "5581269", "Dale", "Hey Michy. Thanks so much for a great weekend.  Your place was beautiful and you were so accommodating. We will be back. Thank you"),
("2016-03-12", "5581269", "Jon", "Quiet  comfortable and cosy cabin 50 yards from Pittwater and a few minutes from Avalon beach by car.Helpful friendly host  but privacy for those who wish.Very relaxing few days."),
("2016-03-20", "5581269", "Libby", "My partner and I stayed two nights recently and enjoyed our time in the beautiful Northern Beaches. I didn't get to meet Michy personally although my partner did. Communication through messages was always prompt and clear and we arrived late at night with the key left in the door and milk in the fridge for us. The cabin is cosy and had everything we needed. We couldn't get the wifi to connect but it didn't really bother us we were hardly there. I suggest you take your car as the bus only came out the front once an hour. Palm Beach close by is beautiful."),
("2016-03-29", "5581269", "Claire", "The cabin is lovely  really clean and has everything you need (including milk  tea  muesli for breakfast which was really appreciated). It's located right next to a beautiful beach. Michy was easy to communicate with but gave us a lot of privacy. Overall  we would highly recommend her place to anyone willing to spend a long weekend on the Northern beaches. "),
("2016-04-17", "5581269", "Debra", "Friendly helpful host nothing too much trouble.  The cabin was lovely  nicely decorated and in a nice quiet area.  The beach across the road was great to be able to go for a walk."),
("2016-05-08", "5581269", "Jason", "Michy's backyard cabin was brilliant.  It was  wonderful to be able to walk across the road and launch our kayaks for a morning paddle on the Pittwater. Thank you for making us feel so welcome."),
("2016-05-16", "5581269", "Simon", "Fantastic place and Michy was a great host. The Cabin is very clean  beachy and in a great location in Clareville."),
("2016-05-23", "5581269", "Alison", "This is a lovely little place for a night away. The cabin has everything you could possibly  need - a bed  sofa  dining table  tv and shower. All put together in a small but aesthetically pleasing cabin. Really appreciated that fresh milk was provided plus tea and coffee and very tasty muesli. It has very quite location  and perfectly situated  for launching a kayak ( across the road). Also 10 minutes walk from the Clareville kiosk for that special meal."),
("2016-07-25", "5581269", "Lachlan", "Great cabin! Parents really enjoyed it. It was very convenient and michy was very accommodating to our needs. Cheers!"),
("2016-10-08", "5581269", "Anna", "Perfect escape to paradise. Peaceful with the only sounds being the birds. Close to the water  walks along the beach  fishing  great restaurants. Michy was a wonderful hostess. Wished we could stay longer. "),
("2016-10-20", "5581269", "Niamh", "Beautiful secluded cabin  the perfect space to relax and unwind  just a short walk from clareville reserve  one of Sydney's most stunning waterfronts. Michy is the pe"),
("2016-10-30", "5581269", "Mel", "Michy's place is in a wonderful location  perfectly located for exploring around Pittwater and the coast. It is quiet and extremely comfortable. With lots of windows  the cottage is light and breezy. Everything we needed was there and it is immaculately presented. Michy and Paul were on hand if we ever needed anything  but they also ensured we had privacy. A perfect mix!  The beach is just a minute away (across the road) and is a lovely spot to sit. Although we had a car  the local bus stop is just across the road. We could not fault Michy's place and look forward to the next trip. "),
("2016-11-12", "5581269", "Cyril", "Awesome"),
("2016-11-20", "5581269", "Gen", "We enjoyed our stay and Michy's place lived up to expectations it is a beautiful garden studio in a very beautiful part of the world. Nice place to slow down and get away from it all. Michy was fantastic with communications and making sure we had everything we needed to make our stay successful. Highly recommend"),
("2016-12-02", "5581269", "Rafael", "Nice and quite."),
("2017-01-02", "5581269", "Warren", "We have just spent a wonderful month with Michy and Paul.  Their little studio was even better than described with everything necessary for our comfort. I had a health issue during our stay and Michy and Paul went out of their way to help. We highly recommend this accommodation for its proximity to beautiful scenery and beaches as well as the pleasure of meeting our kind and generous hosts.  We have become true friends! Thank you both so much."),
("2017-01-04", "5581269", "Joey", "Thanks so much for having us Michy! We definitely recommend this gorgeous place  everything was perfect! Must use the surf skis on the bay across the road. "),
("2017-01-14", "5581269", "Jeff", "Michy was very welcoming and our accommodation was perfect for visiting family   kicking back and taking in the wonderful environment in and around Clareville.The cabin was spotless   bed was very comfortable with everything we required. We had a hire car but a bus stop was right out front for trips to the city or nearby Avalon and beyond.Area was restful and we felt right at home with privacy but knowing Paul and Michy were a text away if required.We would certainly recommend this cabin to others and would like to visit again soon."),
("2017-01-21", "5581269", "Jo", "The cabin was clean and cosy and the bed is very comfortable. Very clean and new bathroom. I didn't get to meet Michy in person but she seems lovely online and is great with communication. Only thing is the wifi was pretty much non existent."),
("2017-01-25", "5581269", "Carolyn", "What a wonderful stay! Quiet  clean and just a beautiful cabin. Location was fantastic with Taylor's point opposite and within close distance to Paradise Beach and Clareville Beach. Michy and her hubby were lovely hosts and very helpful. It's one of the best stays we've had!"),
("2017-02-04", "5581269", "Carolyn", "Nice place to stay for the weekend"),
("2017-02-10", "5581269", "Jean-Claude", "le logement est parfait très propre bien situé dans un très beau quartier. Paul était là pour nous accueillir et repondre à  nos questions .Une petite plaque de cuisson serait un plus pour cuisiner ."),
("2017-02-11", "5581269", "Andrew", "Nice comfortable stay."),
("2017-02-18", "5581269", "Jenny", "We loved our night in the cabin. Woke up to the sound of birds in the trees. It's a magical part of the world. Michy was lovely to deal with."),
("2017-02-20", "5581269", "Lauren", "This cabin was lovely and the owners were very friendly and helpful throughout our stay. Highly recommend:)"),
("2017-03-03", "5581269", "Roanne", "Beautiful cabin. Very comfortable. Very clean. Lovely hosts."),
("2017-03-18", "5581269", "Werner", "Beautiful little cottage in a great location near secluded beaches"),
("2017-04-01", "5581269", "Carlee", "Such a beautiful spot! Shame it was raining and we couldn't enjoy the beach over the road. Thanks so much!"),
("2017-04-06", "5581269", "Nicole", "A very enjoyable stay  secluded  quiet  tranquil and just a short walk to Clareville beach. Borrowing the surf skis for a paddle on Pittwater was a highlight. Comfy bed and clean  we felt at home. Lovely hosts. "),
("2017-04-08", "5581269", "Tanya", "A lovely  quiet and well equipped cottage in the seaside suburb of Claireville. A perfect getaway for a single/couple. "),
("2017-04-24", "5581269", "Wendy", "Michy's place was a lovely quiet retreat for a few days."),
("2017-05-07", "5581269", "Reece", "A great spot to stay with a great host"),
("2017-06-02", "5581269", "Cameron", "What a great little spot. Perfect for those quick getaways both Michy and Paul are fantastic hosts and went out of their way to make us feel welcome. Thanks again!!"),
("2017-07-09", "5581269", "Maureen", "This is a really lovely cabin in a beautiful part of the Northern Beaches. The cabin is in Michy and Paul's backyard  entirely separate to the house but Michy and Paul are there should you need anything and they are lovely and friendly. Pittwater is just across the road; fabulous beaches and Avalon village with excellent restaurants and cafes are only a few kms away. The cabin is clean and comfortable for singles or couples. Beautifully decorated. Sitting on the verandah in the afternoon sun listening to the birds...paradise."),
("2017-07-13", "5581269", "Hilary", "A wonderful place  great location - simply take a glass of wine across the road and watch the sunset. Very friendly and welcoming hosts. "),
("2017-07-21", "5581269", "Cameron", "Always a great time to stay at this great little cabin! Our second time there and will be heading back again for sure."),
("2017-07-23", "5581269", "Esther", "We had a great time while staying at Michy's. The room is super clean  cosy and has a great little library. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2017-07-30", "5581269", "Kristen", "A beautiful guest house in the perfect location. Everything you need across the street from the water and very short drive to the main town with shops and restaurants"),
("2017-09-23", "5581269", "Kate", "Place was lovely with everything you would need for a night or two away. Can highly recommend a pre-dinner drink across the road at a little private beach followed by dinner at the Clareville kiosk which is only a few minutes drive from here."),
("2017-10-07", "5581269", "Silvija", "A lovely location if you're after some peace and quiet. Proximity to water is great and use of 2 x surf skis is a plus."),
("2017-10-08", "5581269", "Darcy", "Great spot with good people"),
("2017-10-09", "5581269", "Jen", "Love Michy's backyard cabin! Peaceful  clean  comfortable  everything you need and a stone's throw from the water! Michy was the perfect host and made sure i had everything i needed. Highly recommend!!"),
("2017-10-14", "5581269", "Jesper", "Place to go!!!"),
("2017-10-21", "5581269", "Celso", "Perfect for our trip!"),
("2017-12-30", "5581269", "Eloise", "Michy’s place is a real gem in a secluded and peaceful spot.Right across the road is Pittwater for a swim and around the corner is Forage for a great coffee! Michy is an amazing host and was so hospitable and kind! A great place to stay we couldn’t recommend more!"),
("2018-01-02", "5581269", "Jen", "A great little find for a one night stay. Clean  tidy and in a quiet neighbourhood. Michy is a fantastic host- clear  helpful and kind."),
("2018-01-06", "5581269", "Jonathan", "Michy and Paul were warm and welcoming hosts and made us feel right at home in their stylish cabin. It's in a great location with a secluded beach across the road with stunning views of Pittwater and beyond. We really enjoyed our early morning paddle on their two surf skis and some fishing from the nearby wharf. The perfect base for a relaxing getaway - I'm sure we will return."),
("2018-01-10", "5581269", "Clinton & Bianca", "A beautiful location and Michy and Paul were kind hosts. The only issue was the lawnmower man coming through the backyard at 9am. There for some peace and a sleep in but our luck brought the mower man too. Great place though."),
("2018-02-02", "5581269", "Mark", "Had a lovely stay. So peaceful  homely and comfortable. Michy and Paul were excellent hosts - lovely people who were only too happy to help but also respected privacy. Highly recommended!"),
("2018-02-14", "5581269", "Louise", "Wow  stunning area. Can highly recommend Michy’s backyard cabin if you’re keen to chill out for a few days @ Pittwater. The cabin is stylish  private  and functional. In fact  I felt like I was staying at a health retreat!I found the cabin a convenient short drive to trendy Avalon village with cafes  restaurants  and local shops. It was also great to walk down to the Pittwater and swim in the local’s netted beach area. Can recommend booking with Michy who is a friendly  and easy going host."),
("2018-02-28", "5581269", "Vivienne", "We had a fabulous 7 nights in Michy and Paul's leafy  garden cabin.  A very cosy  clean  comfortable  quiet and private bedsit cabin  with a washing machine available to use at the house. It was across the road from Clareville beach and the bus stop into Avalon shops where we picked up other bus connections.  We had no car and found it very easy to use public transport all over Sydney with the Opal card. Michy and Paul were very friendly and helpful  especially with dropping off something we left behind.......thank you."),
("2018-03-09", "5581269", "Megan", "Delightful findLovely thoughtful accomodationOnly downside for those seeking it  is that there are no grand views rather an intimate garden settingWe loved the little beach for a morning dip across the road"),
("2018-03-10", "5581269", "Didi", "My husband and I stayed here whilst attending my brothers wedding on clareville beach. The location was perfect  just a short stroll along the beach (at low tide) and we arrived to our destination. The cottage was gorgeous and homely and the bed was super comfy. The cottage felt like a private oasis and Michy was helpful  and welcoming. A great first Airbnb experience."),
("2018-03-17", "5581269", "Milan", "Amazing  magical place  a hidden gem close to clean Waters of Pitt Water."),
("2018-03-25", "5581269", "James", "Wonderful spacious cabin in a beautiful part of the world!"),
("2018-04-01", "5581269", "Sharyn", "The pefect weekend get away.Friendly and accomadating  hostClose to the Avolon eateries.We will definitely be returning."),
("2018-04-02", "5581269", "Lara", "Enjoyed my stay!"),
("2018-04-07", "5581269", "Mandy", "A little slice of heaven in one of Sydney’s most beautiful locations. Every aspect exceeded my expectations and I wish I could have stayed longer. The property was spotless  and had everything I needed. I felt right at home straight away."),
("2018-04-13", "5581269", "Isabelle", "Michy’s backyard cabin is in a wonderful location in Clareville  across from a small private secluded beach. Everything is as described and we enjoyed our short trip here. Wonderful hospitality and punctual communication made things run smoothly with no issues with checking in/out."),
("2018-04-15", "5581269", "Sarah", "Lovely little house in a quiet suburb. The house looks directly into their own home which I did not realise when booking. Apartment is small but enough for a 1 night stay."),
("2018-04-16", "5581269", "Peter", "Comfortable and everything you will need for a short stay. Little beach opposite is walking  distance and very nice. The cabin faces the host’ s house and that makes privacy difficult."),
("2018-05-05", "5581269", "Josie", "Had an awesome stay  perfect location for a weekend getaway. I would highly recommend!"),
("2018-06-03", "5581269", "Alex", "The cabin was absolutely fantastic and very comfortable. Loved the bed and we both had the best nights sleep. The location is nice and quiet  perfect for a stay on the beaches."),
("2018-06-18", "5581269", "Jacqui", "Lovely cabin very close to Pittwater and Clareville Beach  and short drive to restaurants. Nice walking in the local area. Michy very easy to deal with and respectful of our privacy. Will be going back!"),
("2018-07-22", "5581269", "Andi", "5 stars to everything! The space was clean  comfortable and warm considering how cold it was outside! Michy was a wonderful host and my partner and I very much look forward to staying in her beautiful space again next time we travel to Avalon.  "),
("2018-08-11", "5581269", "Martin", "This was our first Airbnb experience and I choose it first on the location close to Palm Beach and also the price when scrolling through. The scroll through price was $110 p/n but there were extras of $35 for cleaning and a $22.15 service fee. These may well be standard Airbnb extras but on a one night stay I guess the cleaning fee to cost of stay ratio seemed a bit high. I knew the total fee before finalising the booking but I guess I would have liked the pricing better if it was all inclusive at $165 and not the $110 plus  plus .... one good flip side is when I shared a screenshot of where we were staying and a few commented that it seemed like great value at $110. The place is very nice and neat. We arrived at night and the host had left the garage lights on so we could see along the narrow path to the shack at the back. Later the lights were off and getting another load from the car was tricky although a flashlight was left on the kitchen table for this purpose. We never met the host but that was maybe due to our late arrival ...but I’m also ok with this as I’m a bit shy and I knew we could contact them easily if needed. It’s an awesome spot very close to a nice dock and a little beach as well as a swimming area. Well recommended!"),
("2018-08-16", "5581269", "Lynn", "Lovely cabin  great serene location and friendly hosts! My partner and I have stayed a few times here and we always love it!! "),
("2018-08-19", "5581269", "Tenielle", "We loved our stay in Michy’s cabin  it felt very homely  a lovely get away! Michy was a great host  and very responsive to messages. "),
("2018-08-26", "5581269", "Erin", "Our stay at Michy’s cute cabin was fantastic. Beautiful  quiet  picturesque location; easy communication; great space with thoughtful touches. Best sleep I’ve had in ages! Would definitely recommend"),
("2018-09-16", "5581269", "Mathew", "Great studio near the water. Was perfect for us as we had a wedding in Avalon. Easy check-in and communication with Michy. Definitely recommend!"),
("2018-09-30", "5581269", "Anne", "Michy's cottage was really lovely and cosy. It was a perfect base to chill-out in the Avalon and Palm Beach area. Thanks. lot!"),
("2018-10-01", "5581269", "Gavin", "Great accomodation in a great quiet location"),
("2018-10-07", "5581269", "Carrie", "Great location but a car is necessary for most travellers."),
("2018-11-03", "5581269", "Matt", "Loved staying at Michy’s place. Would highly recommend."),
("2018-11-06", "5581269", "David", "Very accommodating host  terrific location within walking distance of Clareville Beach and a short drive to Palm Beach. Highly recommended and would stay again."),
("2018-11-10", "5581269", "Maria", "We loved Michy's cabin. It was clean  homely  very peaceful and we slept so well. We loved being within walking distance of the beach. Would definitely recommend staying here."),
("2018-12-01", "5581269", "Percy", "Michy is a wonderful host with a great little backyard shack in a beautiful location. Highly recommended."),
("2018-12-27", "5581269", "John", "Just completed a very enjoyable 3 week stay at Michy's cabin  while visiting family nearby. The cabin is opposite Michy and Paul’s home  but feels private. The property is in a beautiful location right on Pittwater  with good on road parking. The quiet reserve just across the road has lovely views along Pittwater to Lion Island. The cabin itself is compact  stylishly presented  very comfortable and well organised. The decking is a peaceful and shady place to relax during the heat of the day. We found we had everything we needed for an extended stay. Michy was a fab host throughout - always warm & friendly  respectful of privacy but quick to offer help when contacted. We enjoyed meeting her husband Paul and felt honoured when invited to the neighbours pre Christmas get together on the reserve. We had a super time with you Michy  thanks so much!Highly recommend staying here."),
("2018-12-31", "5581269", "Stephen", "Great place to stay on the Sydney northern beaches. very friendly and helpful host. Perfect size for couples. Nice touches like fresh milk and torches for late returns at night. great value also."),
("2019-01-02", "5581269", "Belinda", "A super friendly welcome to an amazingly clean unit. So close to everything you could need/want."),
("2019-01-18", "5581269", "Pascale", "Very charming  relaxing and memorable accommodation. Picturesque location and very friendly hosts. Highly recommended!"),
("2019-01-27", "5581269", "Tom", "Great location  very clean  reasonably priced and very good communication."),
("2019-01-28", "5581269", "Sam", "Perfect weekend’s stay - can’t add much but to say Taylor’s Point is a stunning location."),
("2019-02-09", "5581269", "Bec", "A lovely cosy cabin  perfect for a weekend getaway."),
("2015-05-19", "5712086", "Carla", "We loved staying at this home the night before and night of our wedding- it was spacious  well appointed and beautiful! The host Rachel goes out of her way to help you and ensure you have everything you need.Would highly recommend- thanks!"),
("2015-06-21", "5712086", "Frederick", "We had a wonderful month at the Idyllic Sanctuary on moving to Sydney. Stayed there with my wife and two young children who had a great time.Accommodation was as advertised and host was easily contactable and very accommodating. Location is extremely convenient for everything from shops to public transport to parks.The third room provides options for an extra person but it is significantly smaller than the two main rooms which are very spacious and have built in cupboards."),
("2015-07-05", "5712086", "Scott", "Our stay at Rachels home was everything the pictures show.We found it to be very spacious and secluded and so much to explore within walking distance.Or many busses only 5 minutes walk to take you to the city.We and our teenage girls loved it."),
("2015-07-11", "5712086", "Pauline", "Rachel met me on the morning of my arrival and showed me round the house.  The house was exactly as described  the beds were very comfortable and everything was of a high quality.  I preferred living in Mosman to the centre of Sydney.  It has a lovely community feeling but the city is easily accessible by bus or ferry.  We ate breakfast and dinner within a very short distance of the house and there was a large range of places to choose from  all providing excellent food.  Balmoral beach was also a short walk away which I think is the most perfect beach in Sydney."),
("2015-07-14", "5712086", "Kim", "A truly wonderful experience. The home is so lovely and in a fantastic location. Rachel is a great host and very helpful and attentive. Would recommend staying here to anyone."),
("2015-07-20", "5712086", "Lucy", "Beautiful home and Rachel was an excellent host."),
("2015-07-28", "5712086", "Kelli", "Rachel met us at the property with a warm welcome. We appreciated the milk in the fridge for a cup of tea - always great to have after a day of travel! The house was as advertised- spacious and in a great location. We much preferred staying in Mosman to the city as it gave us a different part of Sydney to experience. Ferries from Mosman Bay were easy to use and so beautiful  Balmoral Beach was so close by I think we went there every day! Very enjoyable stay."),
("2015-08-02", "5712086", "Peter", "We had an absolutely amazing time at this beautiful home.  It really is a sanctuary.  Beautiful linen  big bath  lovely patios and big old fashioned verandahs with comfy lounges you can curl up in and read with leafy surrounds.  Shops with a village atmosphere and ***** dining.  Balmoral beach and sea pool.  A 10 minute bus ride to town.  Trully the best place to stay in all of Sydney with a great host!"),
("2015-08-11", "5712086", "Hannah", "Rachel's home was beautiful. We rented the place to get ready for our wedding and it was perfect. Rachel was easy to communicate with and her directions were clear and easy to follow.The house was walking distance to shops and coffee. Thanks for having us Rachel!"),
("2015-08-16", "5712086", "Kevin", "We had a great stay at Mosman  beautiful house  great location  perfect. Thank you  will come again. "),
("2015-09-02", "5712086", "Traci", "Rachels place was perfect for accommodating various family members who came to Sydney for my daughters wedding. The bridal party readied themselves there and the decor enhanced the vibe. Locale handy although we did not really do any touristy things. Thanks Rachel for the beautiful flowers."),
("2015-09-07", "5712086", "Stella", "Good location  easy to find  just 20min driving to the rocks  the house is clean and comfortable  Rachel always give me very clear and detail answer to all my questions  all my friends enjoy staying in Rachel's house very much  thanks a lot for everything you do for us"),
("2015-09-13", "5712086", "Suzanne", "Rachel could not have been more helpful   flexible and genuine in wanting us to have the best time while we stayed at her lovely house .In the lead up to our visit lots of questions were answered and help offered to make us feel very welcome . The house is perfect!  Lots of space  everything we needed  inside /outside spaces to give us lots of choice and the most comfy beds possible! We will all be back and will highly recommend it to everyone . We did the Mossman -Manly walk (Trail we  could walk to) . Up to Freshwater on a bus caught 5 min walk away . We walked to Balmoral beach ( can get a bus) .We walked to the ferry ( 20min )  Everything we needed was close by and easy . Thanks Rachel for everything . "),
("2015-09-21", "5712086", "Lyndall", "Such a beautiful house  perfect for my pre-wedding photos. Had everything we needed to make our stay lovely  stress free and easy. Would recommend the house to anyone looking to stay in the area. "),
("2015-09-26", "5712086", "Nicole", "Although I did not meet Rachel in person  she was a fantastic host and great communicator  who gave excellent directions and ensured that we found her property easily.  Keys were left as agreed and any questions were answered quickly.  We found the property was light filled  airy  beautiful and as pictured  including special touches like fresh roses on the dining room table.  The beds were comfortable and french provincial kitchen well equipped.  My daughter especially liked playing the piano.  The Mosman location was a treat as it was only a quick 800m walk to shops  including a supermarket and great take-away food / restaurants nearby were plentiful.  The beach at Balmoral (3 minute drive or 20 minute walk) was gorgeous  a short drive (2 minute) to Mosman Wharf had us on the ferry into Circular Quay with those amazing harbour views and Taronga Zoo was a 3 minute drive away too.   My husband travels to Sydney CBD frequently for work so I chose Rachels property in Mosman so he could experience Sydney like a local and how he has never seen it before.   Now he tells me he could live there!   Rachel's place ticked all our boxes for a family road trip to Sydney with two  almost teenage children in tow.  I would definitely recommend to others "),
("2015-10-02", "5712086", "Richard", "Beautifully furnished  spacious and well equipped house within easy walking distance of the stylish shopping and eating amenities of Mosman village. Well placed for ferry and bus transport to Sydney Harbour area.Although Rachel was not able to meet us  she answered any questions w had very fully and helpfully by text message."),
("2015-10-06", "5712086", "Lynsey", "Great experience. Rachel sent detailed instructions for finding and getting access to the flat. The flat was very clean and comfortable. Easy 2 minutes walk to military rd with lots of shops and cafes or a 15 minute walk to the ferry. Great place I'll definitely recommend"),
("2015-10-13", "5712086", "Jennifer", "Rachel made the entire process so easy! It was such a beautiful place and the perfect location to get ready before my wedding. Thank you!"),
("2015-10-27", "5712086", "Angela", "Rachel was very easy deal to with  nothing was a problem.  Very accommodating in our arrival time and departure.  House is in a fantastic location  very close to everything you could need.  The beds are very comfortable  was a great place to base ourselves with our two small children.  We would definitely stay there again."),
("2015-11-11", "5712086", "Susan", "My husband and I and two friends stayed in this lovely home for 9 days.  Its a very comfortable space  with 2 large bedrooms upstairs  both having lots of light  a full and spacious bathroom and there is a small additional room downstairs (more a small office) that can be used as a third bedroom.  One of our group was older and had trouble with stairs so she stayed in this room which Rachel had made up with a single bed.  This room also has a toilet with sink off it so very convenient.  The kitchen is well supplied with cooking utensils  dishes  pots and pans so cooking was quite easy.  We even hosted a dinner one evening for our friends' aunt who lives here in Sydney.  About a 3 block walk from the house is Military Road  the main road in Mosman.  It is quite a busy street and this is where you would catch a bus down to the Mosman Wharf to catch a ferry into Circular Quay.  All very convenient and smooth connections  both going and returning home  as the bus is waiting for you when the ferry comes back to the wharf.  We enjoyed sitting on the back veranda having a glass of wine in the evening.  There is a deli close by  an IGA  supermarket and farmer type market as well  plus a bottle shop  all close walking distance.   We were most pleased with our stay here and would definitely recommend this home as your base in the city."),
("2015-11-27", "5712086", "Alexa", "Staying in Mosman at this stunning property really set us up for our stay in Australia.  We only stayed 3 nights and wished it could have been for longer. Photos were exactly as shown  it was lovely and cool in a funky suburb where you get to hang out with the locals. Found some great cafes round the corner for breakfast and lunch. Nearby Balmoral Beach was a great walk and well worth a visit as was the walk to Taronga Zoo for magnificent skyline views. Having a parking area for our 4x4 was a bonus and the outside seating areas were great. Just wish we had stayed longer to fully appreciate all that the property had to offer. Bedrooms lovely and airy with access to the verandah and sofas. Bathroom huge and loads of towels. Bedding luxurious and the beds were some of the comfiest ever ! Great experience and the memories of Mosman will stay with us. Thank you for making our first few nights in Sydney so perfect ! Lex and family."),
("2015-12-01", "5712086", "Megan", "Rachel gave us excellent instructions on how to find her home and upon arrival we couldn't have wished for anything more. The beds were outrageously comfortable  the neighbourhood was quiet with a village like atmosphere and the house itself was well equipped with all the things one needs to make a visit memorable.... and then there was the spa bath!!"),
("2015-12-15", "5712086", "Gwen", "Rachel  has been very helpful and easy to deal with. The house is gorgeous and described accurately  but is even better in reality than the photos. Every thing we might need is there  Rachel even had a beautiful vase of enormous roses on the table for us  very welcoming. Location is great  handy to shops  transport and Balmorel beach. I would highly recommend Rachel's house to everyone."),
("2016-01-01", "5712086", "Stuart", "The house was great. Very roomy considering there are just 2 proper bedrooms.  The decor was beautiful  the place was clean and the beds were very comfy. Plenty of crockery and cutlery  and lots of bath towels. Good location for reaching city and the Northern Beaches. It was a pleasure staying there."),
("2016-01-07", "5712086", "Carol", "We did not meet the host but she did text to see how things were and if we had any problems.The neighbourhood was residential and quiet"),
("2016-01-17", "5712086", "Earl", "Rachel was super! Everything was found as described and we thoroughly enjoyed our stay at her lovely house in Mossman! It was perfect for us as we had a wedding to attend at Balmoral Beach which is not too far away."),
("2016-02-07", "5712086", "Ebru", "Beautiful location   beautiful house. Thank you Rachel."),
("2016-02-24", "5712086", "Alec", "The villa was exactly as advertised and very comfortable  clean tidy and well located.The check in instructions were very helpful as were the brochures and local information"),
("2016-03-01", "5712086", "Tony", "Architecturally this is a fabulous building and well located for Mosman. Rachel provided excellent instructions on accessing the property. Unfortunately we did not meet Rachel in person during our stay."),
("2016-03-12", "5712086", "Carolyn", "The house was easy to find with the instructions we were given. It was true to the images displayed. The kitchen was well equiped and the house was very central to everything we required such as public transport  shops  restaurants and a local beach. There was an art gallery and large oval at the end of the street. The bedding was of a high standard."),
("2016-03-22", "5712086", "Kevin", "Absolutely beautiful abode in a great little neighbourhood. Very clean and comfortable  can't fault it."),
("2016-03-29", "5712086", "Hannah", "We have been staying all around the world with air BnB for years and this is one of the best. Homely  light  breezy. Exceptional facilities. Beautiful kitchen. Close to parks  cafes  groceries  public transport. So family friendly. We can't wait to stay here again. "),
("2016-04-30", "5712086", "Anastasia", "We loved staying for a few days at Rachel's exquisite home.  It is in such a great location  with a excellent providore up the road  and a 3 minute walk to the Military Road to catch a 15 minute bus ride into the CBD.  The house was clean and tidy and spacious for 5 of us. Rachel was very helpful  especially in giving directions and quick in her replies."),
("2016-05-22", "5712086", "Steve", "Rachel's home was certainly ""Idyllic"". 4 of us were accommodated most comfortably across the two large bedrooms upstairs and one single downstairs. The walking proximity to Military Road shops and laneway cafe's was very convenient. We even popped in to the free public Mosman Art Gallery at the end of the street. We chose Rachel's home for its location - close to the Georges Head venue of a family wedding  accessible to the City and easy driving to and from the airport. We had a car  so the off street parking was welcome - parking on the street was at a premium. The home was represented accurately in all photo's and the description. I also enjoyed tickling the ivories of the baby grand! Although we didn't meet Rachel  she was a great communicator and all the arrangements she made for our arrival and during the stay went off without a hitch. Thanks. We would choose this place again if we find ourselves on the North side of Sydney."),
("2016-07-16", "5712086", "EMily", "We are just back from our two week vacation in NSW. We had the good fortune to run across Rachels gorgeous home on Air bnb. This place was amazing.  We were here visiting relatives and sight seeing from the USA.  Its wonderful to hear the kookaburras right in the city and all the beautiful birds. This place is like a garden oasis. Rachel was so lovely and gave us all the information we needed to make  this trip perfect. Our family of four was very comfortable and we felt very at home here. My daughter is studying music and played Rachels gorgeous piano while we were there which was an added plus.  This home is in the most perfect place. Military road is two minutes walking distance from the house and there are plenty of buses if you do not have a car. We parked on the street because we had a very large mini van and it was just easier. Plenty of parking in the surrounding streets if you need to but there is a private garage there as well for your use.  There are wonderful cafe's everywhere and you are very close to Raglan street which takes you down to Balmoral beach. I cannot say enough wonderful things about this home but my kids and husband and I were sad to leave our home away from home. Thank you so much Rachel for sharing your lovely place with us. Hopefully we will be back again."),
("2016-07-20", "5712086", "Sarah", "This is a great house in a fantastic location in Mosman. The rooms upstairs are lovely old bedrooms with timber floors and spacious high ceilings. So close to cafes and everything you need on Military Rd. Parking was easy and convenient too! Thanks Rachel for a lovely stay."),
("2016-08-09", "5712086", "Tania", "We had a truly beautiful stay!!!It felt like.... home away from home!!! Loved it!! Will definitely be back!!"),
("2016-08-13", "5712086", "Dennis", "Our stay at Rachel's Mosman home was great.  The location is ideal and the home has a ton of character.  The kitchen is modern."),
("2016-08-22", "5712086", "Holly", "What a beautiful house ! We didn't want to leave . Great location and looks excatly As the pictures . Highly reccomend :)"),
("2016-08-26", "5712086", "Ryan", "I rented this property for several special guests in Australia on business. Rachel was an ideal host and extremely hospitable to us. The property is a elegant modern home with a beautiful decor. We were 15 minutes from the centre of Sydney and enjoyed the secluded nature of this property. Only 15 minutes from the beautiful Taronga Zoo and a local Beach. The stunning environment that was well heated on cold days but bright and warm on the sunny days was a great bonus as well as a gorgeous piano in the lounge room.We would recommend this to any AirBnB users who want a special Sydney experience."),
("2016-09-05", "5712086", "Debbie", "Rachel's house was perfect for us - it's just as  shown on the photographs and close to transport and shopping.  We were flying in early in the morning and Rachel was very accommodating allowing us to access the property early.  We were there for 9 nights in preparation for my daughter's wedding and it really felt like home from home.  We didn't  meet Rachel but did contact her a couple of times and she always respond quickly."),
("2016-09-11", "5712086", "Sam", "The house was very beautiful  and not too far from town. My family loved the style of the place. Only feedback would be cleaner sheets. Thanks a lot for sharing your home :) "),
("2016-09-18", "5712086", "Colleen", "The unit is pretty and had some nice conveniences. There was a lot of other conveniences in the kitchen that was so much better than a hotel. That was thoughtful. It looked bigger to me in the photos and fresher. Maybe more current photos would represent it better. It is located close to everything which was nice and the kitchen had everything we needed. The dishwater was great and it had plenty of nice extras needed to prepare a meal.....lThank You for that. It is a drafty place and there seemed to be a lot of noise of cars driving by.( seems the street has become a busy pass thru)there was lots of banging noises in the morning that we solved by putting towels over the doorway to stop that( one of the bedrooms has doors that lead to an semi exposed sitting area that was blowing a draft if the doors were closed it kept banging REALLY loud  after the towel was placed on top it stopped the constant open and closing of it. And one of the brass window closures was also banging all night from the breeze  I moved it to stop that but it woke us. I wanted to use the Jacuzzi tub but tried three times and the hot water ran out before it could be filled to level of jets.Maybe a bigger hot water tank might solve that. Bathroom was really good otherwise  quite gorgeous and towels were great. Liked the hand held shower head and shower was plenty of room. The beds weren't as large as I thought  I believe they were full size instead of Queen or King which I expected for the master suite. The bedding and Dooners as well as pillows were great. The chairs downstairs had blankets on them which seemed like a great touch. There was major rips and not much chair support left in them under the blankets( FYI ) all in all it was a nice stay. I just expected a bit more for the money paid. Slightly awkward floor plan. Wanted the four of us to chill out to watch a movie it just was laid out awkward downstairs. Just thought that area was bigger . Laundry was good  never used the drier. Dishwasher is a plus and it worked great.check in and out was seamless. The key in the door thing was weird. You had to leave the key in the door or you couldn't leave. This was awkward when we went for a walk and left kids at home we couldn't take keys with us because they could get out otherwise. Parking spot was good. Back yard looked nice but the fountain was full of old water that was green. Verandah was lovely. There are motion sensors in three of the rooms which felt a little weird to me when they went on but must be a security thing. I know we hadn't put the security on. Electricity didn't work in the bedrooms..."),
("2016-10-24", "5712086", "Anna", "My family and I had a fantastic stay in Rachel's home. The house was beautiful and very clean. I chose this place because the photos looked amazing and it did not disappoint. I got ready for my wedding here and the house provided the perfect backdrop for our photos. The 2 main beds upstairs were large and comfortable. Very spacious bedrooms with lots of wardrobe space. The only draw back was that it didn't have enough curtains in one of the rooms so it became really bright and sunny early in the morning when we wanted to sleep in. The single bed downstairs was great. It was great having two toilets  one up stairs in the main bathroom and one downstairs in the laundry room next to the single room. That way we didn't have to go up and down the stairs for the toilet. Another draw back was that two of the steel chairs on the dining table were missing its seat cushion so I used the bar stool cushions but it may be time to replace them. Also  the 2 single sofa chair cushions were old and worn out. It was covered by a blanket so you couldn't tell  but when you sat on it  the cushion would slide off the sofa with you on it. We had everything that we needed like bath towels and extra blankets (the weather was cold during our stay). It was a 5 minute walk to the local shops and restaurants which was super handy. The garage provided was super handy too because street parking in Mosman fills up pretty quickly. I did not get to meet Rachel in person but we communicated via mobile phones. Thank you for allowing us to stay at your lovely home. "),
("2016-10-30", "5712086", "Thomas", "We had a beautiful stay at Rachel's place.Everything about her place was of a very high standard.Highly recommended."),
("2016-11-05", "5712086", "Simon", "Lovely house  perfect area and great communication thank you"),
("2016-11-13", "5712086", "Debbie", "Rachel's house is lovely. We were a family of 5 in Sydney for my son's wedding at Balmoral and this spot was perfect for very easy access to Mosman shopping centre  buses to the city and Balmoral Beach. We parked the car and basically didn't use it again the entire weekend.There is only one full bathroom however so if you don't like sharing then maybe not for you. We had no problem as it is a huge bathroom and there is another toilet in the laundry/3rd bedroom.The house is spacious with lots of places to 'escape' for quiet time"),
("2016-12-15", "5712086", "Sharyn", "This house is in a perfect location for cafes  shops and restaurants as well as wedding venues and ferry and buses to beach and city. While in a private courtyard the noise from the road was more than expected."),
("2016-12-27", "5712086", "Robyn", "Rachel's place was central for us near shops oval  art gallery and public transport. It is well equipped and very comfortable. "),
("2017-01-06", "5712086", "Leonora", "Having travelled from the UK the house was a major disappointment in so many ways.  The cleanliness for a start particularly in the kitchen was quite disgusting  which probably is why we had visitors from lots of cockroaches each night!  The house had defiantly not been fumigated!  The third bedroom and ensuite bathroom should not be described as a third bedroom and the bathroom is very much a utility room with a sink and toilet.  The linen was put on the beds un-ironed and the towels were even presented to us with stains on.  The threadbare furniture in the lounge was a disgrace as was the debris in the garden.  Not an enjoyable experience at all  we couldn't wait to leave and it has defiantly put me off renting on Air B & B again."),
("2017-02-01", "5712086", "Christine", "Il faut y aller c est vraiment super"),
("2017-02-16", "5712086", "Rebecca", "Beautiful home set in a wonderful location. Everything that you could ask for and so much more. Thank you Rachel for being a tremendous host."),
("2017-02-24", "5712086", "Richard", "Really quirky house to stay in and we enjoyed our stay. The pictures on Air bib reflected house very well. Unfortunately there wasn't a house manual there which would help visitors with knowledge of the area etc. We arrived early evening time and weren't sure what was around in the way of restaurants etc but we walked around and realised we were close to the centre of Mosman and there were plenty of good restaurants within walking distance although a lot were closed on Monday evening. The house has probably been painted internally fairly recently and generally everything was clean apart from the kitchen especially the chopping board  glasses and the cupboards which were pretty cluttered. Wifi is a problem as it ran out very quickly however we asked Rachel if it could be topped up which she arranged for us but that also soon ran out. Really good sized bedrooms and a very small bedroom downstairs but that was sufficient for one adult for a short stay. The road was very noisy especially in the early hours of the morning but the house only has single glazing and some lovely stained glass windows. The garden furniture was ok but large chair had broken leg and was resting on a brick. There was a washing machine  tumble drier and dishwasher so that was really useful. It was a 20 minute walk to the ferry terminal but there is a bus service too. Mosman is a really nice location"),
("2017-03-05", "5712086", "Carol", "Rachel's place has loads of charm and character  very much like the photos. A pleasant surprise!We stayed for 3 nights and found the beds very comfortable  the house close to restaurants  shops and public transport (bus and ferry). There is only one full bathroom  but 2 toilets and basins.The kitchen appeared well appointed  however we didn't need to use it. There was evidence of cockroaches (as there is all over Sydney)  perhaps regular pest control would be a suggestion to the host.Unfortunately we didn't make into the lovely garden because of the incessant rain  but it had plenty of character as well.I would definitely return if given the opportunity."),
("2017-03-26", "5712086", "Kevin", "Our second stay at Rachel's house and hopefully not the last. Absolutely fantastic place with great amenities and a gracious host. Thanks Rachel."),
("2017-04-01", "5712086", "Sarah", "Dear Rachel  We loved staying in your place  lovely house  great atmosphere and wonderful location . "),
("2017-05-07", "5712086", "Hannah", "This was our second stay at Rachel's place. The location of this property is brilliant. Right in the heart of affluent and central suburb Mosman  loads of things for kids to do close by - amazing pizza  oval  park  shops  public pool. Perfect. All you need is in walking distance. The accommodation itself is lovely and everything you could want for a family stay.  "),
("2017-05-15", "5712086", "Alison", "Beautiful home and very helpful host. Had all the things we needed over the weekend. Thank you"),
("2017-05-29", "5712086", "Deborah", "Rachel's house was perfect!! Great furnishings  very comfy beds and a brilliant location. Would definitely stay there again. Rachel was very friendly and helpful too!!"),
("2017-06-12", "5712086", "Robyn", "A lovely home full of character and great for our family trip."),
("2017-07-01", "5712086", "Kirstin", "Rachel's house is perfectly located in Mosman - close to shops  restaurants and transport. The house was exactly as in the pictures - very stylish  clean  light and airy. The beds were all very comfortable and all mod cons were available for use. Rachel was easy to communicate with and we would highly recommend staying here. "),
("2017-07-18", "5712086", "Deborah", "A lovely property in a great location - 1 block to Spit Junction with all the amenities  transport and shops.  Lovely strolling in Mosman shops and the Providores for high end deli  fruit  bread just around the corner.  Fitness First and the Pool also 1 block away.  The property is very comfortable and stylish.  Rachel is a great host."),
("2017-07-26", "5712086", "Rhonda", "Rachel's house is a fabulous house with plenty of room.  Near shopping and small cafe's.  Bus route was very close as well."),
("2017-08-06", "5712086", "Dave", "A very accommodating host."),
("2017-08-19", "5712086", "Shae", "A fabulous location and plenty of space for a small group or family. Lots of natural light and charm. Thanks Rachel!"),
("2017-08-31", "5712086", "Jim", "The two upstairs bedrooms are large and well lit. Very comfortable. The third bedroom is more of a maid's quarters (with attached laundry room). If you plan to have a relative stay in that room  prepare for some feedback.My only real issue with the home is the vehicle traffic. Do not understand how a narrow suburban road that is only 3 blocks long can support so much traffic starting at 6am  continuing to 10pm. Plus one day there were some early major deliveries to the facility across the street. [Not sure why this did not appear in other reviews. After my visit I rechecked the reviews. Traffic mentioned on page 3. Deeper than I usually look.]  Don't plan to sleep in.Perhaps this was the price to pay for convenience to Mosman village. Walked there for breakfast  lunch  dinner  shopping  wandering. Very convenient. Very friendly."),
("2017-09-26", "5712086", "James", "Lovely house full of character  close to shops and amenities and bus route"),
("2017-09-28", "5712086", "Jonathon", "Fantastic townhouse just off Mosman village  perfect launching pad to explore Sydney. Perfect accommodation  well presented and Rachel is very welcoming. This place is fantastic  highly recommended."),
("2017-10-01", "5712086", "Kirthi", "Nice home in good location.  Worth a visit."),
("2017-10-15", "5712086", "Julie", "Beautiful apartment that was very convenient to our family for a wedding nearby. Easy walk to shops nad wonderful calm house."),
("2017-10-30", "5712086", "Alistair", "Great place in the leafy suburb of Mosman  short walk to really nice eateries  public transport etc.House was great value  and Rachel a great host who answered questions promptly. Would definitely come back when next in Sydney  just so easy to access all that is north of the Harbour."),
("2017-11-11", "5712086", "Anna", "Rachel's place is an amazing house within a perfect location. It is situated within walking distance of most things and the house itself is amazing! 5 of us were very comfortable in the house for a long weekend."),
("2017-11-24", "5712086", "Anton", "Excellent location"),
("2017-12-03", "5712086", "Juho", "The house is an old house in both good and bad  but we found it very comfortable and kids just loved having a garden to play in. Windows and balcony doors are a bit leaky  especially on stormy weather  but putting a piece of paper between the window will do the job. Public transportation was much better than expected  with M30 getting us fast to any place near the CBD. There are many grocery stores to pick from  and plenty of other small shops too. The square next to Mosman Council is quite lively on both mornings and evenings. Could've definitely stayed here longer!"),
("2017-12-11", "5712086", "Maurice", "Great location"),
("2017-12-23", "5712086", "Kate", "Great location. Close to shops and restaurants. Short drive to beach and ferry terminal. House was nice  could do with a thorough clean."),
("2018-01-02", "5712086", "Wayne", "Great stay in a lovely home and location. Rachel is a fab host."),
("2018-01-12", "5712086", "Rebecca", "Great location  very comfortable living and easy communication with the host. My girls loved hearing their Nanna play the piano"),
("2018-01-17", "5712086", "Jocelyn", "Mosman is a beautiful suburb.  From this location you can walk to Taronga Zoo  Middle Head  Chowder Bay  Balmoral Beach and the Spit.  It is close to many fine cafes and restaurants. Mosman also has excellent shopping.  Townhouse was in a quiet location close to Military Road."),
("2018-02-10", "5712086", "Toni", "A lovely house   close to amenities in Mosman. Well presented loads of character . I achel is a good host"),
("2018-02-18", "5712086", "Keira", "We enjoyed our stay at Rachels home  however there were positives and negatives. Positives were the décor  the spacious bedrooms  the comfortable beds  the backyard area and the location. Although I didn’t get to meet Rachel  she seems very friendly. Overall  the cleanliness was unsatisfactory. The kitchen needed a good clean. The fridge interior  kitchen drawers and kitchen floor were all food stained. We had to wash all the unclean cutlery  glasses  pots  etc before using them. We also found dirty items in the dishwasher. We wanted to use the outside table for a group lunch but the large umbrella appeared to be broken and fixed or stuck in the corner.  While the location is great to walk to restaurants  shops and down to Balmoral Beach  the noise of car traffic is very loud in the mornings. Difficult to sleep beyond 7am. The wifi did not work at all. We tried on many devices and nothing. Before we checked out  a broadband company arrived so hopefully the wifi will be ready for the next tenants."),
("2018-03-01", "5712086", "Claire", "Rachel's home is beautifully decorated and has a gorgeous outdoor sitting area. Walking distance from Mosman village cafes and restaurants."),
("2018-03-04", "5712086", "Jenny", "Convenient location to shops. Taronga Zoo and Balmoral Beach are a short drive away. Rachel's pictures are an accurate depiction of the residence. Our family enjoyed our three night stay."),
("2018-03-23", "5712086", "Michael", "Lovely house in a great location but let down by a dirty kitchen including the fridge along with a cockroach problem all of which could have been sorted with proper cleaning before handover. The Wifi was very weak throughout the house."),
("2018-04-04", "5712086", "Wendy", "Rachel's apartment was perfect for our stay in Mosman  it was very convenient for Mosman Village and had very easy transport links. We had a very happy stay in Rachel's apartment. Thank you"),
("2018-06-21", "5712086", "亚林", "Rachel的房子很漂亮 很有艺术感 我们一家五个人入住 房间分配刚刚好 需要的生活用品很齐全 冰箱里还贴心地放了牛奶､鸡蛋､肉饼､各种酱料等等;客厅里有个大电视 我先生和儿子每晚可以看世界杯;我女儿很喜欢那架钢琴 每天都去弹奏 只是建议需要调音;冬夜挺冷 暖气让我们很舒适;街边的车位很充足 我们每天都能顺利找到车位;交通也很便利 到哪里都很快;只是卫生真的需要改进 很多角落不干净;我们入住期间碰上雨天 衣服一定要烘干 烘干机可以用但动力不足 每次洗完衣服都要分两次烘干｡最后 真的非常感谢Rachel提供这么好的房子 我女儿还说好喜欢 真舍不得离开呢!这是一个非常适合体验当地生活的好房子!"),
("2018-07-12", "5712086", "Valissa", "Rachel was great to communicate with. The house is very comfortable and has all you need. The beds and all linen are excellent quality. Pretty verandahs and a courtyard to enjoy. A great location!"),
("2018-07-23", "5712086", "Shannon", "A truly beautiful home set in the heart of Mosman. Flooded with beautiful light and lush decorations. Set in a great location not 2 minutes from cafes  shops and more."),
("2018-09-30", "5712086", "Joseph", "Rachel is an amazing host  quick clear communication and a wonderful place to stay"),
("2018-10-11", "5712086", "Amit", "Rachel’s place is big  spacious and incredibly nice. It has high end appliances and lovely nice big rooms. It also has wonderful gardens which would be terrific to enjoy in summer. Highly recommend."),
("2018-10-22", "5712086", "Nicole", "Fantastic location + great host = wonderful stay.."),
("2018-11-05", "5712086", "Jacqui", "Great location and European character!Recommend!"),
("2018-11-17", "5712086", "Ellen", "Great location. Great home  but disappointing in cleanliness for the price."),
("2018-12-03", "5712086", "Annabelle", "Great place and great location!"),
("2018-12-08", "5712086", "Mieczysław", "i will write this opinion laterI'm to tired now"),
("2018-12-09", "5712086", "Prema", "Rachel's house is so beautiful. the garden is sunlit and magical and the details of the home are wonderful. Some of the vintage furniture is aged but to me this only adds to the beauty of the house. The sofa   beds  linens etc are fresh  clean and comfortable. If you appreciate a period house this place is a delight."),
("2018-12-14", "5712086", "Marcelo", "Five of us stayed here for a few nights. Overall the stay was nice and suited us perfectly. The architecture and furnishings had a classy feel and location was great. There were a few let-downs  though: we had to wash all plates and cutlery before use as they had food stains  pillows and linen were also stained and felt humid  some items in the fridge were way passed use-by date... If the cleanliness was up to scratch  this would be a top place to stay."),
("2019-01-01", "5712086", "Mel", "Beautiful home  comfortable   close location to park and restaurants   perfect for what we needed"),
("2019-01-05", "5712086", "Kathryn", "Wonderful location   but on an unexpectedly noisy street  so take ear plugs for sleeping! Stylish decor. Very welcoming host."),
("2019-01-13", "5712086", "Elyse", "Rachel has a gorgeous home. It was the perfect spot to celebrate our wedding."),
("2019-02-11", "5712086", "Maria", "The house was beautiful. Very clean with lots of fresh bed linen and towels. The kitchen facilities were excellent and the house had lots of cooking essentials that I would not have expected. I would highly recommend a stay at this property"),
("2019-02-17", "5712086", "Mark", "A beautiful home  in a great location. Easy to walk to shops and eateries."),
("2015-05-21", "5862093", "Faith", "Kariem's place was cosy and close to the Macquarie lighthouse where we walked to in the morning for the sunrise :) Additionally  he has lots of snacks! & a great Xbox system. Also  he gave us helpful suggestions on the places to eat around our area :) Thanks for having us!! "),
("2015-06-12", "5862093", "Philip", "warm and sunny in a great location. Kariam was not there but we enjoyed a relaxing time with a late check out. Nice to walk on the cliffs and visit Watson bay and the waterfront by foot  parking on the street"),
("2015-07-12", "5862093", "Susan", "You get exactly what it says on the tin - with the addition of a most charming host. Kariem seemed willing to do almost anything to make my stay as perfect as possible. I was even taught how to make barista coffee  a serious bonus! I was concerned about the cold - but my room was warm and a wool underlay was provided for my bed (I don't like electric blankets)  there was heating in the lounge. The apartment gets a good deal of natural sunlight.I arrived very early in the morning  Kariem stayed home from work to welcome me and make sure I had everything I needed. He even offered to take me into the CBD when he went in.I can fully recommend this. It is perfect for one person needing to be in this beautiful part of Sydney.There is also great storage for your luggage and draws as well as hanging."),
("2015-10-03", "5862093", "Mei", "Kariem was a great communicator and very accommodating. The unit was sunny  very tidy and in a stunning location. Booking and communicating with Kariem was easy."),
("2018-10-15", "5862093", "Fadi", "Kariem was a great host  the appartment was keen  tidy and more spacious than expected."),
("2018-11-15", "5862093", "Audrey", "L’appartement de Kariem est idéalement situé dans un beau quartier calme au nord du centre ville visible par la fenêtre  et tout à côté d’un grand parc qui borde l’océan  et ses falaises magnifiques. L'appartement est grand  très lumineux et bien équipé  et Kariem  que nous avons eu en contact via e- mail uniquement  était très serviable et réactif. Merci pour tout!"),
("2018-12-18", "5862093", "Thomas", "Great place. We stayed here a whole month after transitioning  back to Sydney from overseas. I would highly recommend the area especially for nature lovers; cliffs  parks and amazing beaches all at your door step. Kariem had a genuine concern for our well being and comfort during our stay and was very professional and upfront about what the apartment did and didn't offer. I have stayed in many airbnbs in Sydney as I travel alot and so far this has been the most comfortable and relaxing. Recommended."),
("2015-04-23", "5763156", "New", "The place was great; clean and quiet with modern and tasteful appointments. Large living/dining space. The location fantastic. Nicole was only a call away and always happy to offer advice when needed. Would definitely be back."),
("2015-04-28", "5763156", "Aenne", "Look no further! We had an excellent stay at this amazing apartment. It is so central everything is in walking distance  great restaurants  pubs  bars  entertainment yet the apartment is nice an quite. The apartment was very clean and had everything we needed. Nicole was only a phone call away and attend to all of our needs which were quite extensive. I will always come back to this apartment! "),
("2015-05-04", "5763156", "Emma", "Highly recommend this apartment! Fantastic location  with a 5 minute walk to Central station and also to Crown St cafes & shops  but feels like a leafy quiet residential neighbourhood. You couldn't get better! The apartment had everything we could possibly need on a trip and more - from umbrellas to hairdryers to bandaids! And a lolly bowl on arrival! The host has carfeully thought of everything. Huge tv  super comfy couch and very spacious balcony  comfy bed  lots of travel books  full kitchen.  The apartment feels very spacious and luxuious for 2. Key pick up/drop off was easy and communication from Nicole was fantastic. She responded instantly to any queries we had and was very helfpul on our last day checking out. We loved our stay and won't hesitate to book again if back in Sydney. Thanks! "),
("2015-05-07", "5763156", "John", "Fantastic place in surry hills. Very easy to check-in  as Simon and Nicole were waiting for me at the loft. The place is well designed  very bright and large. I would go back anytime!"),
("2015-05-09", "5763156", "Eileen", "Nicole has an amazing apartment. Well designed  cozy and fully equipped. The bed was very comfortable that we almost didn't want to wake every morning! It's centrally located near the Central station so it's a plus if you are on public transport though the area could get pretty quiet at night. Sweet little touches like a lolly bowl and chocolates near your bedside table made us feel welcome. Nicole was also very prompt in replying our messages. Great host and place!"),
("2015-05-13", "5763156", "Christian", "Thoroughly enjoyed staying at Nicole and Simon's apartment in the fantastic Surry Hills. The apartment is refreshingly spacious  clean and very quiet. The secure parking was very helpful to.Nicole really went out of her way to help us out on numerous occasions whether it was finding places to eat or getting around.The location is practically perfect for food and coffee lovers with numerous cafes  restaurants and bars all within a 5-10 minute walk. Central Station is just around the corner too.Highly recommended!"),
("2015-05-17", "5763156", "Melissa", "The place was beautiful  clean  and looks just like all of the photos.  Nicole was very helpful and accommodating with all of our travel needs.  It was close to central station which was great  but if you will be traveling with large  heavy luggage from the train there were hills to keep in mind when pulling around your suitcase.  "),
("2015-05-29", "5763156", "Lisa", "We were welcomed accordingly from our friendly host  Nicole. She was very considerate  helpful and great at communication. As soon as we walked into the apartment  we felt like it was our new home for our short visit. It's a spacious and very tidy apartment filled with a great selection of furniture. We loved the little frenchie decor! The bed was also one of the most comfortable beds I've ever slept on. The neighbourhood was nice and quiet yet we still found ourselves surrounded by interesting shops and cafes close by when we walked out from the building. Reuben Hills was a great cafe which we highly recommend!One of our favourite features of this airbnb was the access to the beautiful rooftop garden/pool area. Great view of the cbd and generally an awesome spot to relax in."),
("2015-06-04", "5763156", "Quan", "Simon and Nicole were very helpful throughout our stay. They were on hand to help at all times and addressed our needs without any issues.The apartment was as described  nicely renovated and maintained in a nice  quiet  easy to access building. It had everything we needed and more. Surry Hills is a great area close to all attractions in the city but away from the noise and hustle  cafes and restaurants are a short walking distance making it an area ideal for all purposes."),
("2015-06-08", "5763156", "Jade & Steve", "Thanks Nicole for a lovely stay! Checking in and out was very easy. The amazing studio apartment was very comfortable  thoughtfully filled with heaps of amenities. Location was perfect and very central  close walk to Central Station and you are spoiled for cafes and coffee in the surrounding neighbourhood. Thanks again for a great stay in Surry Hills!!"),
("2015-06-15", "5763156", "Colleen", "Simon and Nicole's apartment is in an excellent location  walking distance to Central station and Right next to Crown St. Nicole met us at check in to show us around. The apartment has everything you need and was very quiet  even on the weekend. We had a great time  thank you Simon and Nicole!"),
("2015-06-18", "5763156", "Ross", "Simon and Nicole's spacious apartment is nestled amongst the leafy streets of Surry Hills  only a few minutes walk from funky Crown St and to Central Station. The space is warm and comfortable with a well stocked kitchen and a feeling of being at home. We were able to arrive late on a Sunday night and Nicole made sure our arrival was problem free. This was a fantastic place to stay and I could not fault it!"),
("2015-06-22", "5763156", "Leigh", "This was such a beautiful experience so clean and fresh the bed is the most comfortable bed I have ever slept on! We are investing in a new bed and sheridan sheets doona etc now!I loved the balcony and would have my coffee there in the morning while reading my book. The location was perfect for us and Nicole went the extra mile to get us the milk froth machine to form part of our coffee experience. The hand and shampoo products were so lovely.THanks so much Nicole we will be back! The smarties at the bed side table were a nice touch and the umbrella which we needed so thank you!!"),
("2015-06-24", "5763156", "Samantha", "Simon and Nicole were wonderful hosts. Very polite and helpful. Their place was very clean spotles  close to transport and in walking distance to cafe and restaurants. I would recommend this place to my family and friends. Thankyou for having us there."),
("2015-07-02", "5763156", "Wilson", "We loved our stay in Surry Hills! Great apartment  perfectly located in a FANTASTIC neighborhood. We would rent the place again in a heartbeat! "),
("2015-07-05", "5763156", "Jane", "Thank you for having us stay in your amazing apartment  we felt most welcome and at home there. The apartment is beautifully decorated  very comfortable and was just perfect for us. We look forward to visiting again."),
("2015-07-21", "5763156", "Stephanie", "Simon and Nicole were very welcoming hosts. They greeted me on arrival and went through house details. They had prepared a handy book for guests with lists of their favourite restaurants and the locations. The kitchen was fully stocked with spices  tea flavours and an Nespresso machine. The bathroom had lovely toiletries and supplies.Overall I had a lovely stay. Simon and Nicole were very accommodating hosts. The area is in a great location with easy access to public transport. "),
("2015-07-30", "5763156", "Bethan", "Excellent accommodation for my business trip to Sydney. Excellent hosting and attention to detail  thank you so much!"),
("2015-08-03", "5763156", "Judy", "Nicole was able to meet us at the apartment to show us details about the use of keys and the security system and other provisions in the apartment.The location was ideal for what we intended to do in Sydney being a short walk to Crown Street and it was near our family who we were visiting.  Transport to The Opera House and The Sydney Theatre Company was also an easy taxi ride.The living and kitchen area in the apartment was spacious and light and airy  while the bedroom was discretely placed behind a wall divide. Even though the bathroom was on the small side  it was well equipped with hair dryer  soap  shampoo and all you would need for a short or longer stay. (We often want to do washing when we are away   but not this time). The apartment was clean and tidy with a very comfortable lounge. There was a great deal of cupboard space in the bedroom as well."),
("2015-08-07", "5763156", "Joanna", "My cousin and I stayed here for a couple nights in August 2015. It's a crazy short walk from Central Station  which makes it easy to get just about anywhere in the city and really handy if you're getting the train from the airport because the airport link stops at Central. The place was exactly as it looks in the photos: clean  spacious and filled with light. Nicole was lovely to deal with from start to finish and I said to my cousin that I'll definitely look this place up again next time I need a place in Sydney!"),
("2015-08-08", "5763156", "Libby", "My daughter and I stayed here for 2 nights last week. Its bright  clean and has everything you need. We had beautiful sunny days so the sunlight poured onto the balcony where I spent an hour attending to some work on my laptop. Its a very convenient location so we easily walked to Crown St for a fabulous breakfast before walking over to UTS campus in Ultimo. Lovely bonuses with aromatic handwash and body lotion. "),
("2015-08-12", "5763156", "Curt", "Simon and Nicole were great hosts with a fantastic apartment/designer warehouse. Simon and Nicole have put a high level of effort into the apartment to ensure that guests feel welcome and familiar with the area of Surry Hills. Nicole was contactable if we needed any assistance anytime during our stay. The apartment is lovely and spacious inside with only a short stroll to the Sydney CBD.I would highly recommend to anybody staying in Sydney."),
("2015-08-15", "5763156", "Jeremy", "Fantastic stay  superb accommodation and hosts par excellence! "),
("2015-08-21", "5763156", "Rachel", "The apartment was perfect for a week of visiting Sydney - we were walking distance from cafes  restaurants  tourist sites  and the central train station so we could get anywhere in the city. The pictures accurately represented the apartment  which was gorgeous  clean  and well appointed - but they didn't include the view  which was also spectacular. Thank you  Nicole  for making the visit so easy and seamless. "),
("2015-08-24", "5763156", "Shee Jee", "Our stay at Nicole ' s cosy studio apartment was definitely a wonderful experience. Nicole was prompt in answering our queries before the stay  she's also flexible to let us have the keys earlier. There're some snacks in the apartment and we absolutely love the nespresso  coffee machine. We also had a game at the rooftop tennis court on Sunday morning and that ended our stay in sydney perfectly. The apartment is within walking distance to shops and cafes."),
("2015-09-01", "5763156", "Adam", "I stayed in Nicole's amazing Warehouse apartment for 8 days and had the pleasure of meeting Nicole on check in. Everything was very easy and Nicole did everything possible to make my stay as comfortable as possible. On entering the apartment I had two thoughts. 1- this apartment looks better than the photos. 2- this place actually feels like home. Nicole has gone to great efforts to make this apartment really feel like it's home. Everything from the Nespresso coffee to the lollies and little extras in the fridge for arrival. I was so thankful for all of this. The amenities are great and a perfect  quiet location that is next to the city and so close to everything you need in Sydney. I would honestly say that this would be the most comfortable Air BnB that I have stayed in. The only real thing that I would say about this apartment would be that it is more like a studio apartment  as opposed to a 1 bedroom apartment. The bed is elevated in comparison to the rest of the living space and private thanks to half height walls  though all the actual  walls are common in the apartment which I was surprised about when I arrived. I do believe that 1 bedroom would be classed as a bedroom being completely separated from the rest of the living space  also something that I look for when staying away from home. In saying that  it's still one of the best Air BnB's that I've stayed in.Definitely recommended!Thanks Nicole!"),
("2015-09-13", "5763156", "Kylee", "We loved staying at Cooper Street! So close to everything including the city  restaurants  parks and transport! And the host Nicole went out of her way to accommodate our needs with our little one! Such a great spot!"),
("2015-09-25", "5763156", "Lyn", "This apartment is just perfect!  It's clean  spacious  in a good location -  close to public transport  grocery stores and heaps of great cafe's.  I didn't get to meet Nicole but she is very responsive  flexible and friendly  her mindfulness is evident in the attention to detail everywhere in the apartment. I'm so glad I booked for December too - can't wait to get back!Thanks Nicole  see you in a couple of months!"),
("2015-09-27", "5763156", "Wouter", "We had a great stay at the apartment of Simon and Nicole. Location is perfect  close to many nice restaurants and bars. The apartment itself is large and very convenient (great bed and shower). We highly recommend to stay here!"),
("2015-10-03", "5763156", "Stacy", "This apartment is clean  modern  and comfortable.  We appreciated the thorough communication and ease of hand-off for the keys.  We were especially grateful for the toiletries  guidebooks  laundry powder  and coffee provided - the attention to detail was wonderful!  The building requires the key to use the elevator  so we felt very secure. We would stay here again!  Be aware that the 1BD is separated by a partial wall  so if you're looking for privacy from the living room  it is limited.We enjoyed staying in Surry Hills. It is convenient being so close to Central Station.  It seems to be an up and coming neighborhood so I would advise others that you should assess your level of comfort with urban life. By day  I noticed all of the cute restaurants  yoga/barre spots  and shops. (Simon and Nicole provided excellent recommendations as well!) By night  I noticed more of the remaining graffiti  vacant storefronts  and quiet streets.  If you do not feel comfortable in cities or would feel more assured with constant tourist traffic  you may want to spend more to be closer to CBD. For us  it was perfect.  Thanks Simon and Nicole!"),
("2015-10-05", "5763156", "Meghan", "Perfect apartment - great location  size and beautifully decorated. Rooftop was huge and the pool looked lovely. We had a fantastic stay at the apartment and would definitely come back again."),
("2015-10-11", "5763156", "Eneida", "Nicole was very prompt and friendly in replying all queries and messages. I didn't have a chance to meet her but the flat was impeccable and so welcoming. The attention to detail was brilliant: great coffee  toiletries  and amazing bed and shower. The description was very accurate. I look forward to returning to the flat in the future. "),
("2015-10-17", "5763156", "Bree", "This was a lovely place to stay - great location  great apartment  great hosts. "),
("2015-10-30", "5763156", "Varsha", "Great apartment in a fab location! Really wonderful apartment in a cool part of Sydney  a few minutes walk from central station and also really close to the cafés and restaurants of Crown Street.  The apartment has been maintained to a really high standard and has some nice touches from the hosts such as lovely bathroom products  tennis racquets for the rooftop court and a really useful house manual with recommendations for your stay.  Really attentive hosts  really quick to respond to messages and helpful with queries. Would stay here again if I'm in Sydney."),
("2015-11-03", "5763156", "Anna", "Thank you Simon & Nicole for a very enjoyable three night stay in Sydney. We loved the location of the apartment and found it very convenient -only five min walk from central station and a very enjoyable half hour walk into the city. The roof top pool and tennis court was a highlight. We enjoyed a very relaxing day lazing around the pool- beach towels and tennis equipment supplied. Thank you again. Hope we can stay again soon."),
("2015-11-06", "5763156", "Caitlin", "Great apartment in an awesome part of Sydney. Nicole met us and showed us around - she was fantastic and really friendly. Great restaurant recommendations too. The apartment has everything you could need  as well as a rooftop pool and tennis court. Would highly recommend for a bit of indulgence in Sydney."),
("2015-11-27", "5763156", "Stuart", "From our initial communication to the day we checked out  we could not fault our stay here.  Nicole was super-efficient with communication  the apartment was perfect for our two week stay and we can't recommend this place highly enough.The location is perfect  just a five minute walk to the ""Central"" rail station which is a twelve minute ride from the airport.Surry Hills is a vibrant neighborhood  with a range of restaurants from coffee and cake to fine dining and everything in between.Bondi beach is a fifteen minute drive and Circular Quay (for the Opera House and Bridge) just four stops on the train."),
("2015-12-01", "5763156", "Fang", "Apartment was great  exactly like the photos. Had the most comfortable bed and nice touches like products and and other little goodies for a nice experience. Very helpful guidebooks and recommendations as well. Great location  right near the Central rail station so you can get anywhere easily and only a 15 min walk to the CBD. "),
("2015-12-08", "5763156", "Jojo", "Staying at the apartment in Surry Hills was such a great experience! It was well stocked with everything you would need  including a great pantry of seasonings! We LOVED having the Nespresso Maker as well!!! The bed was very comfortable and the shower head was like being under a waterfall!!!!!! The building itself was amazing and the rooftop views were beautiful  especially at sunset! Not to mention the awesome pool!!! Everything about the Surry Hills apartment was amazing  from brekkies on the balcony to evenings on the most comfortable couch in the world! Also the little details like the advent calendar with little chocolates in it and the bowl of yummy candies to munch on! Thanks for a great stay Nicole and Simon!"),
("2015-12-29", "5763156", "Lyn", "This is my second time staying at Nicole and Simon's beautiful bright  spacious apartment.  The  apartment is within walking distance of everything - transport  grocery stores and an abundance of cafes  restaurants and bars.  There is NOTHING that Nicole hasn't thought of!  Nicole is an absolute pleasure who goes above and beyond to ensure her guests wellbeing.  We will be back :-)"),
("2016-01-10", "5763156", "Cera", "Amazing apartment in a really great location  loads of nice bars and restaurants around Surry Hills and just a Stone's throw away from the city. We really enjoyed our time there and felt right at home in the apartment."),
("2016-01-16", "5763156", "Nic", "The place was amazing. Located on the top floor of an apartment complex in Surry Hills it was central yet quiet. Train station a five minute walk will get you anywhere and some nice local pubs and places to eat close by also. The space itself it awesome. Has everything you need and the cable TV caused us to stay inside a little more than we probably should have. Pool and gym located in the building as well as a roof top tennis court none of which seem to get overly busy which is good.Nicole and Simon were a pleasure to deal with and flexible with us as guests. Would recommend to anyone and would return when next in Sydney.Thanks again Nicole and Simon."),
("2016-01-18", "5763156", "Shinta", "We didn't meet Nicole and Simon when we arrived yet Nicole was very responsive with our inquiry and sent us the details of key pick up location. The check in process were seamless and we found the parking easily.The apartment has a great location  only minutes away from great restaurants and I found a great hairdresser just 5 minutes away who knows my hairdresser in Canberra. What a small world!I like the toiletries provided in the apartment. Normally I use Aesop products and the Brown Alchemist products were very similar to what I normally used. I also like the way they provided everything that we might need in a trip such as umbrella  hair dryer  even Opal cards (we have our own but it must be really handy for someone new to Sydney). We walked to central station and enjoying the gigs and shows at Sydney Festival. The Uber charge from the city was less than $10. Thanks Nicole and Simon for sharing your nice place with us. We'll stay again if we are going to Sydney next time :)"),
("2016-01-25", "5763156", "Huw", "Great apartment. Excellent location close to restaurants  bars  supermarkets and public transport.Very good facilities with nice personal touches.Nicole provided a very helpful booklet and the restaurant recommendations proved a big hit.We were able to check in early and the key pick up arrangements worked well.Although we didn't meet Simon and Nicole there was good communication throughout our stay.We really enjoyed our stay in Sydney  would highly recommend the apartment and would definitely stay again on a return trip."),
("2016-01-29", "5763156", "Dan", "Location very close to Central station makes everything in Sydney accessible. The restaurants and bars on crown street were perfect because we could relax close to home after a long day of site seeing. I would recommend this to anyone who likes living in a city and being a little outside of the tourist CBD. The apartment had everything we needed for a week long stay."),
("2016-01-31", "5763156", "Alicia", "Apartment was stunning  exactly like the photos. Very warm and welcoming and the little touches made my stay feel like home. Unfortunately there was a lot of construction work across the road  but as I was up for work during week  did not impact my stay. Nicole and Simon were both great hosts  particularly as I had to call them to assist. Great communication and very hospitable. "),
("2016-02-04", "5763156", "Jeroen & Beatrijs", "Great apartment in a nice neighborhood. The apartment is nicely maintained and everything was clean. It was the second time we stayed in one of the apartments of Simon & Nicole. We would definitely stay here again on our next visit to Sydney."),
("2016-02-22", "5763156", "Peter", "Check in instructions were easy and Nicole was very helpful in all communications. That apartment was perfect for my needs in a great location very close to the Surry Hills shops and restaurants. The rooftop pool was also a treat after exploring Sydney each day. Hope to stay here again on future trips."),
("2016-02-26", "5763156", "Gordon", "Made us very welcome  flexible and attentive   very well appointed apartment in a fascinating area. Just what we had hoped for!"),
("2016-03-03", "5763156", "Hyacinth", "Nicole met us at the loft and went over the TV  Wifi  etc.  - we were totally impressed as this did not happen at the places we stayed in  Cairns & the Brisbane area (those hosts were only available by email/phone/text which was welcomed).We loved this loft which was perfect for our 6 nights in Sydney. Nicole had thought of everything and supplied it which was wonderful  location is perfect for public transport  restaurants  sight-seeing  etc. The only negative was the work going on outside from around 7:30 - 4pm - demolishing of a building opposite the loft - it was pretty noisy at times.  Nicole mentioned it was temporary and she apologized that it was happening (she shared that she had just  found out about the demolition recently). We would defintely stay here again when in Sydney - it was the best place we have stayed in during our 3 week travel across Australia.We will definitely encourage friends to stay here too if they travel to Sydney."),
("2016-03-05", "5763156", "Kieran", "Fantastic  modern apartment in a very central location. Nicole was there to meet me on arrival which was terrific and hugely helpful. Would recommend this listing highly and hope to be back some day soon."),
("2016-03-10", "5763156", "John", "First rate host and apartment. The hosts cared about the quality of our stay and this showed. A lovely apartment. The only downside was the noise from building works directly outside. However when so many other things were perfect this is easily forgiven"),
("2016-03-17", "5763156", "Julie-Ann", "Simon and Nicole's apartment was an absolute delight! It is very conveniently located near the Central train station stop-which is the perfect place to be if you are going to the Blue Mountains  beaches  anywhere really- from Sydney. This stop is only minutes from Circle Quay which is the stop for the wharf and all ferry transfers  the Rocks  Sydney Opera House  etc. With the Central Station so near we felt truly like we were in the perfect location.The apartment itself is very clean  cozy  and has everything you need to feel right at home. Kitchen is well stocked with necessary items for  light cooking  but there are also many cafés and coffee houses near by. Staying here made us feel like we had a home ( or at least an apartment) away from home right in Sydney. We would definitely stay there again on future visits to this beautiful city!It was an absolute perfect place for us to stay on our first visit to Sydney! We would highly recommend this apartment to anyone!"),
("2016-03-31", "5763156", "Leanne", "Nicole was a great host.  She showed us around when we arrived  and was very responsive to all communications  providing the extra information we needed before travelling from the UK. The location was fantastic and we loved being so close to Central  and within a few minutes' walking distance from dozens of restaurants  pubs and shops. The apartment was beautiful  very comfortable and just perfect for two people  and had everything we needed. We absolutely loved it  and will be back next year.  Thanks Nicole and Simon!  "),
("2016-04-04", "5763156", "Jeremy", "Nicole est une hote tres arrangeante et tres disponible. L'appartement est agréable et parfaitement équipé ainsi que idéalement situé dans Sydney. De plus la piscine et le court de tennis situé sur le toit de l'immeuble permettent de passer un séjour inoubliable. N'hésitez pas réservez"),
("2016-04-10", "5763156", "Alastair", "We had a wonderful time in Sydney staying at Simon & Nicole's apartment. It's very well situated - Surry Hills is a really great neighbourhood with loads of great cafes  bars  restaurants  clubs  etc. and is only a 10 minute walk from the central station. From there you can go practically anywhere in the city. The airport is only a 10-15 minute train ride away  as is the harbour. The apartment itself is beautiful and well appointed. Nicole very kindly travelled through the busy Sydney traffic to the apartment from a BBQ to meet us as we arrived. She made us feel very welcome and showed us around and explained how to use the TV  appliances  etc. She also explained how to use the roof terrace which is just amazing with fantastic views over the city. Perfect for a morning swim!I would also like to note that the little touches such as the provision of factor 50 sun cream  beach towels  and tennis racquets (for the rooftop court) were brilliant. Very well thought out.We very much enjoyed our stay at Simon and Nicole's and would highly recommend it to anyone."),
("2016-04-11", "5763156", "Kim", "Simon and Nicole's apartment was lovely. Well set out in a safe and well appointed apartment block. The couch and bed were comfy and the shower has brilliant water pressure!Nicole was a pleasure to deal with for my first Airbnb experience  even helping me with using the app!"),
("2016-04-16", "5763156", "Zi", "Nicole was great host with excellent communication before  during and after our stay  also welcomed us warmly on our arrival showing us every detail of the apartment and surrounding.The place is just as good as on the pictures  and especially the bathroom to be underlined with amenities even more than you could need!Location is great  close to central station  and Surry Hills is such a perfect place full of wonderful dinning spots. Make sure you follow Nicole's guide book  all her recommendations are golden words. We tried 4 restaurants from the book  fantastic!We had very good time here. Highly recommended :D"),
("2016-04-23", "5763156", "Bert", "Nicole is a lovely host to deal with  very kind and helpful.  The apartment self is excellent  beautifully decorated and extremely comfortable to live in and the location is brilliant"),
("2016-05-07", "5763156", "Bert", "My colleagues Stefan and Mandie enjoyed the abundance space and location of this place. They assured me they will definitely be back."),
("2016-05-10", "5763156", "Jo", "This was an excellent experience.  A beautiful apartment in a fantastic neighbourhood.  Simon and Nicole were accommodating and easy to communicate with.  All good!"),
("2016-05-19", "5763156", "Shane", "Amazing large apartment in a terrific location"),
("2016-05-26", "5763156", "Sharon", "Great location and cozy flat. Parking is a great bonus especially int he city. The apartment was clean and check in was flexible and easy. Would definitely recommend for anyone wanting a place in city that has parking and is close to public transport. Central station is less then a 5 min walk and so many fantastic cafes close to the apartment. Great stay."),
("2016-06-01", "5763156", "Vicky", "Nicole and Simon's apartment in Surry Hills is a beautiful spot  really close to central station and all of Sydney's main attractions. The apartment itself was very comfortable and their attention to detail made it feel like a 5* hotel. Would thoroughly recommend staying there. "),
("2016-06-03", "5763156", "Pip", "Great apartment  super spacious  and in a great location. Definitely recommend Nicole & Simon's apartment. They were quick to reply with any questions and provided everything we needed for our stay."),
("2016-06-06", "5763156", "Joel", "Loved the place! Easy to find  and a great apartment. Nicole was helpful and informative. Couldn't ask for more :)"),
("2016-06-12", "5763156", "Jack", "Amazing location  great apartment with everything you need for a visit to Sydney. Would be happy to stay again  and recommend. "),
("2016-06-13", "5763156", "Ben", "Nicole & Simon's apartment was perfect for a weekend away. My girlfriend and I enjoyed every aspect of the apartment. It is very well furnished  stocked and all of a high quality. The apartment is in a prime location for walking to the City  Oxford street and Crown street. We didn't need the car at all! The attention to detail in the apartment is great  it has everything you need to make the most of your stay  it has a lot to offer. It is very quiet for its location  we never heard any noise during the day/night from inside the apartment. I highly recommend staying here for any couple! Thank you! "),
("2016-06-19", "5763156", "Ricardo", "We were very please with the apartment and its location. Unfortunately  we did not meet Nicole in person  but Donna was very kind to wait for us and give us the key. The unit is very well appointed and comfortable. Nice partial view of the Sydney skyline from the rooftop area. We were lucky to be in town for Vivid Sydney."),
("2016-07-05", "5763156", "Lyn", "Love this place - this is my third time staying here! It is a fantastic apartment in a great area at a great price.  Nicole always goes above and beyond!"),
("2016-07-09", "5763156", "Arvind", "Great clean space in a super convenient location with central station and great cafes at walking distance. Nicole was there to show us in  and was kind enough to allow us an earlier check in time. Recommended. "),
("2016-07-19", "5763156", "Joel", "Incredible place and incredible host...even was super flexible when I accidentally told her the wrong time of our arrival (oops). The place is gorgeous and makes you feel like a local while being an easy train ride or walk to all the tourist places. Highly recommend it."),
("2016-07-19", "5763156", "Tom", "Terrific space in a cracking spot of Surrey hills. Large  open living with really comfortable furniture and pretty much everything required to make for a very comfortable stay. The accom was clean  quiet at night and in the thick of the action. Would definitely recommend staying."),
("2016-07-26", "5763156", "Helen", "Loved staying at this light  bright and airy apartment  comfortable with attention to detail. The location is convenient and as an inner city spot this area has developed into a delightful place for exploring. A short walk to Cental Station made commuting further  easy. Recommended."),
("2016-08-05", "5763156", "Vincent", "Un très bon accueil (en Français  un plus pour nous)  logement confortable  très bien équipé  avec une jolie piscine sur le toit. Très bien situé pour les transports  les petits Resto recommandés par Nicole  & Simon sont bons et tout près. Un endroit à retenir."),
("2016-08-06", "5763156", "Tara", "Thank you again Nicole & Simon  another great stay in one of your properties. The apartment is spacious  well equipped and very comfortable for a few night or long term stay. Great location  we really love being in Surry Hills  so many delicious food options within a short walking distance. Communication prior to and during stay was prompt. There was some construction near the apartment during our stay which was not ideal in the mornings but obviously nothing that Nicole and Simon could have prevented  just as an FYI to guests in the coming weeks. Highly recommend and we will be back."),
("2016-08-11", "5763156", "Tim", "Stayed at Simon & Nicole's place for 4 nights at the beginning of our holiday  really easy to get in touch with and met us at the apartment even though we got there fairly late in the day. The apartment is in a great location for everything whether you want to catch the train or walk everywhere! It is very tastefully decorated &  really appreciated the little touches like the nespresso machine & travel guides. I wish our bed at home was as comfy! Only negative was that the pool was closed for refurbishment  which can't be helped & was just our bad luck! There was a bit of building work out the back which was pretty noisy from about 7.30am onwards but on the plus side it got us up & doing things in the short time we had in Sydney instead of lying in bed! Thanks for a great stay- have already recommended your place to friends!"),
("2016-08-15", "5763156", "Lorraine", "A really cool place to stay. Very vibrant neighborhood. Train from airport to Central and then a short walk to apartment. Not huge but way bigger and more comfortable than a hotel room. Hosts were very accommodating and allowed us to leave luggage til mid afternoon on day of departure.  Highly recommend this place."),
("2016-08-20", "5763156", "Stephanie", "Really nice and funky apartment in a great area! Very close to central train station and so many great places to eat! I didn't get to meet Nicole but she was so accommodating and we had everything that we needed! Would definitely recommend to all"),
("2016-08-28", "5763156", "Amanda", "We were thrilled with our stay here.  The location was great - it's centrally located near a main train station (Central) and it's a few blocks away from a grocery store  cafes  and restaurants.  It's a quieter neighborhood  which was perfect for us.  There was construction going on at the time  but Nicole let me know about that ahead of time.  The amenities were great - everything you could need.  The pool was being worked on  so that area was closed off.  When that space is back up and running  it's a great rooftop spot.  They even have a tennis court and Nicole and Simon provide you with rackets.  The bed was really comfortable and the layout of the apartment was perfect for a couple.  There was a day when it was raining  and we enjoyed snuggling up on the comfy couch  drinking tea  reading and watching movies.  They have a selection of movies available.  It seems they also had Netflix  but this was protected through parental controls  so we couldn't access it. It would be nice if there is an option for the renter to use their own account if they already have one  but that is really a minor thing in comparison with all the other great things this place offers.  Highly recommend staying here."),
("2016-09-01", "5763156", "Dominick", "Exceeded high expectations! The apartment is even more beautiful and charming than the pictures capture. And the location is PERFECT. Walking distance to everywhere - especially Crown Street where there are tons of cafes and coffee shops.Oh and the bed is heavenly. I'm disappointed that these guys are booked during my next trip to Sydney in November  otherwise I wouldn't have looked any further. It seems they are booked roughly 90% of the time  based on the calendar Nicole showed me...so book early!PS - their guide book is GOLD! Best listing of restaurants and cafes I've seen in 10 AirBnB stays. "),
("2016-09-03", "5763156", "Leanne", "Simon and Nicole welcomed us in their lovely apartment. The apartment has everything to help make our stay comfortable with all extras  I can think of nothing else they could include. Convenient location  comfortable bed  loved the decor. Thank you I would definetly stay again."),
("2016-09-08", "5763156", "Steven", "Great hosts  good place  very chic  very nice  would come back again."),
("2016-09-16", "5763156", "Natsumi", "The location is perfect  close to the city and all the wonderful eateries  we were excited every morning to explore the neighborhood for breakfast. The house is very neat and spacious. We enjoyed our stay very much. "),
("2016-09-20", "5763156", "Leesa", "Had a wonderful stay at Nicole and Simons place in Surry Hills. Close enough to the city and lovely local restaurants and bars. Bourke St bakery was lovely so was the little cafe across the Rd which served a lovely breakfast. Thank you so much  for our beautiful accommodation it was fantastic.Look forward to our next stay. "),
("2016-09-24", "5763156", "Hung", "The place was great and exactly as described.  The location was great and Nicole was helpful in explaing the area upon our arrival. Would definitely stay here again if visiting Sydney again."),
("2016-09-29", "5763156", "Matthew", "Simon and Nicole's apartment has everything you need and in a great location. Just a few minutes walk to Crown Street with loads of dining options and only 5 minutes or so walk to  Central Station. The Surry Hills is the best location to stay in Sydney. Definitely recommend staying in Simon and Nicole's apartment."),
("2016-10-07", "5763156", "Emily", "Simon & Nicole's designer warehouse in Surrey Hills was a perfect getaway spot for my husband and I. Walking distance from so much and they truly made us feel at home right down to the little details of leaving a comprehensive guide of what is close by and leaving little treats for us by our bedside!Would definitely stay here again and would recommend to anyone considering a holiday in Sydney."),
("2016-10-16", "5763156", "Melissa", "My husband and I had an amazing stay here. It was near the Central station and there was a small supermarket nearby which closed late  there was also lots of food around and was nearby the famed Bourke Street Bakery. The place was clean and the amenities were amazing  we could see that every thought was put into the decoration and we could find everything we needed. Everything was great and we will be back again!"),
("2016-10-18", "5763156", "Mary", "Eleanor told me that it was a great place!"),
("2016-10-22", "5763156", "Megan", "The host did make us feel very welcome and the Air bnb was amazing - exactly like the pictures. The hosts were very quick to answer any questions we had with helpful suggestions. The space was very comfortable and clean  however  we did not have access to the pool during our stay. The location was very convenient and we were able to access central station easily. We also found the suggestions for places to eat in the booklet provided very helpful. A highly recommended stay! "),
("2016-10-25", "5763156", "James", "Everything was perfect. Nothing was not concudered by the hosts and we had everything we needed for a perfect 3 days in Sydney. Beautiful space and a wonderful location. We were sad to leave."),
("2016-11-05", "5763156", "Alex", "Everything was great! They took care of each detail and made us feel like being at home!"),
("2016-11-19", "5763156", "Martha", "Nicole and Simon's apartment was exactly as pictured and we had a lovely stay in their clean  comfortable and spacious place. Our communication with Nicole was always easy and she was quick to reply. It is close to so many delicious restaurants and coffee shops  attractions and boutiques. We would highly recommend this place and hope to visit again. Thanks for everything!"),
("2016-11-26", "5763156", "Lyndell", "Nicole was excellent to deal with good communication throughout the booking Would highly recommend this property"),
("2016-11-26", "5763156", "Anna Maria", "A gorgeous little apartment in Surry Hills. Great location and the apartment had everything you could need. Perfect for people travelling solo or a couple. Nicole was lovely to deal with and always responded very quickly."),
("2016-12-16", "5763156", "Elizabeth And Brian", "Nicole was very friendly and helpful upon arrival.  The neighborhood was cute but we had trouble eating out in the area.  Only because everywhere was so crowded.  I would recommend reservations.  Even on week nights  the places we tried to go were overcrowded - this may have been just the restaurants we tried to go to though."),
("2016-12-18", "5763156", "Harry", "Very nice apartment at excellent location. It is on a quiet street  but building works on building opposite are still ongoing and start at 07:00.  Contacts with Nicole were easy with very quick responses.  A special arrangement was made to accommodate our later arrival  which went smooth.  Would be happy to come back to this apartment at a future visit to Sydney."),
("2016-12-22", "5763156", "Kellie", "This is a good spot if you want to be out of the hustle and bustle of the city but close enough to walk to it. The Air Con only goes down to 18 degrees celsius and mostly directs to the living room not the bed room so if you sleep hot be warned. Sweet place!"),
("2017-01-06", "5763156", "Ruby", "Great place! great time!"),
("2017-02-18", "5763156", "Carol", "Our stay was fabulous. Location is great  near everything. The apt is clean and exactly as described. Unfortunately the pool was being worked on the 6 weeks we were there   Would highly recommend it!"),
("2017-02-21", "5763156", "Nicky", "I have stayed at many air bnbs and this is definitely one of the best I have been in. The accomodation has all the facilities needed and very close to great Shops and restaurants. The attention to detail in property like the quality of duvets  towels etc is super and they kindly helped us with our very late check in! Perfect place to stay!"),
("2017-02-23", "5763156", "Nassima", "Simon and Nicole's apartment was just perfect. The location and free parking was a must for us. Fully equipped kitchen and lovely decoration. Plus the bed was extra comfy!! Nicole was very quick to answer and check in was easily done. I recommend this place without hesitation. Thanks again!"),
("2017-02-25", "5763156", "Andrew", "This place is great. Excellent location and well-presented."),
("2017-03-13", "5763156", "Leanne", "Our second stay here and we will come again. Brilliant location a quick walk from Central but quiet. Close to tons of restaurants and bars/pubs. Super clean and has absolutely everything you could want. Coffee machine  pool and gym will bring us back every time. Next time we'll try the tennis court. Host super-responsive and helped us check in early after long flight from London. Wouldn't hesitate to recommend. "),
("2017-03-17", "5763156", "Lauryn", "Fantastic place in the centre of Sydney! Everything is within walking distance  would definitely book again! "),
("2017-03-21", "5763156", "Marty", "A great size flat in an amazing location. Perfect access to every area of Sydney  while being far enough away from the centre of town.Really cool bars and restaurants in the area.Rooftop view is pretty good too!"),
("2017-03-26", "5763156", "Deirdre", "Simon and Nicole's place was very comfortable and perfectly situated for a few days exploring Sydney! It was quiet  the bed and linens soft  and included amenities that were very helpful (washer/dryer with detergent  all toiletries  good wifi  a bit of cable TV  good selection of kitchen tools  etc.). We walked everywhere  including the Central Business District  Paddington  Bronte  and a ton of other places. Simon and Nicole were very responsive and made our stay there a breeze!"),
("2017-03-30", "5763156", "Bill", "We had a great stay at Simon & Nicole's place. Good eating places and train station nearby. Clean  great location and would definitely stay here again next time we come to Sydney. "),
("2017-04-22", "5763156", "John", "Great location  very comfortable bed.  Everything just as shown on the website. We would stay here again if visiting Sydney.  Sydney is a wonderful place to visit!"),
("2017-04-28", "5763156", "Matt", "Great apartment  great location. Within walking distance of several nice cafes and restaurants. Having a pool on the roof and access to gym was great bonus. Nice views from rooftop. "),
("2017-05-04", "5763156", "Renee", "Great apartment  great location and great hosts. We would definitely stay here again! "),
("2017-05-13", "5763156", "Gilberto", "Great place.  Nice walk to many places around.  If you want to walk to the city  it's only a 30 minute walk.  Very safe at night.  If you are a late sleeper  worry about construction waking you up about 8am.  Washer/dryer are great!  The shower head is awesome! And free parking!"),
("2017-05-22", "5763156", "Caro", "Lovely and central place to stay in Sydney."),
("2017-05-31", "5763156", "Jimmy", "Appartement magnifique et tres bien équipé  dans une résidence sécurisée propre et qui offre de nombreuses prestations (salle de sport (bien Que tres petite )  court de tennis  piscine). Tres bon emplacement au coeur de La ville sans pour autant en avoir Les désagréments. Quelques travaux en face de l'appartement qui gâchent un peu La vue malheureusement  et sont source de petites nuisances sonores (en particulier le matin ) mais rien de bien méchant . Je n'ai pas eu la chance de Les rencontrer en personne mais Simon et Nicole sont vraiment tres disponibles par message en cas de besoin.  Globalement je recommande vivement cet endroit  idéal pour célibataire Ou couple sans enfant. "),
("2017-06-05", "5763156", "Kymlee", "Had a great stay  the location was perfect!"),
("2017-06-14", "5763156", "Cecilia", "Lovely apartment  close to public transport  city  restaurants. Hosts were great with communication! Great place to stay when visiting Sydney! "),
("2017-06-20", "5763156", "Colin", "My partner and I stayed in this clean spacious apartment for five nights. It's right in the heart of Surry Hills  a five-minute walk to all kinds of fun shops and restaurants. We walked *everywhere* during our stay---to the harbor many times  and to many parks and neighborhoods. We enjoyed returning to this apartment and relaxing in the evenings. We loved the building's roof deck---seriously  it's a delight!---and fitness center. We cooked almost every night while we were there  and loved the easy walk to great markets. Nicole was out of town during our stay  but still she and Simon responded to us promptly. We're very glad we stayed here."),
("2017-06-27", "5763156", "Richard", "Simon and Nicole's place was perfect for my needs. The location means that great cafes and restaurants  the central train station  the business district  and many of the main tourist attractions are all walkable.  The apartment is well equipped with high quality appliances and  best of all  a super-comfy bed! Nicole was responsive to all questions or requests  even though she was out of town at the time. I'll definitely try to stay here again the next time I visit Sydney."),
("2017-07-01", "5763156", "Linus", "Simon and Nicole's place is tiny and clean.They are easy to communicate with. Although we haven't meet them  but they have responded to every message and provides us some suggestions.The location is great  5-10 minutes walk from central station  and 5-10 minutes walk to Crown Street  where the pubs  bars and cafes is located in.Their guidebook is awesome as well.If I come to Sydney next time  I will stay in Simon and Nicole's place again."),
("2017-07-08", "5763156", "Tiarnah", "We had a great stay  good access to public transport  lots of great cafes around the area and places to eat. Wish we could have stayed longer! Nice apartment building  fairly close to central station."),
("2017-07-11", "5763156", "Michelle", "Simon & Nicole's Airbnb was great! Apartment was clean  had an awesome shower  comfy bed  fully equipped kitchen  even had a few little chocolates & snacks scattered thru the house. Location was close to shops  cafes restaurants and central station. Thanks so much Simon & Nicole for an fab stay in Surry Hills! "),
("2017-07-14", "5763156", "Mordi", "Fantastic apartment true to the description and painstakingly well maintained."),
("2017-07-22", "5763156", "Susan", "A great location  an awesome accommodation - we will be coming back"),
("2017-07-30", "5763156", "Brian", "Hosts were super accommodating and helpful throughout my stay. It's a very nice place to stay as it is in a great location and is super spacious and clean. Highly recommended."),
("2017-08-04", "5763156", "Becca", "Beautiful apartment  close to Surrey Hills restaurants and shops. Communication was amazing between Nicole and Simon and I  and we were also checked on via message to make sure our stay was comfortable. The apartment was so beautifully done and exceptionally clean. Couldn't get over how many products they had in the bathroom for guest use...they really supplied everything. Thank you so much and will definitely be staying again! "),
("2017-08-11", "5763156", "Tyler", "We had a wonderful stay at Simon & Nicole's place. The location is fabulous -- right next to many restaurants  bars  and cafes  and a short walk to Central Station. The apartment was clean  quiet  and had lots of natural light. The apartment is furnished well and has a nice kitchen and balcony. Nicole was also flexible about letting us drop off our bags well before check in. Would definitely recommend."),
("2017-08-13", "5763156", "Angela", "We loved how Simon and Nicole's apartment was so close to the city and Central Station. We were in amongst the trendy cafes and restaurants and a quick walk took us to the train station so we could go anywhere we wanted very easily!"),
("2017-08-19", "5763156", "소진", "일단 예정된 체크인 시간보다 빨리 체크인을 할 수 있게 해주셔서 정말 감사했어요. 숙소는 사진과 다를 바 없었구요. 의자 1개만 파손되어 있어서 미리 사진 찍어 놨었구요. 니콜은 만나지 못했지만 일을 도와주시는 도나에게 열쇠를 건네 받을 수 있었답니다. 침대와 소파는 정말 편했어요. 그리고 센트럴역과 걸어서 5분거리라서 이동할때 매우 편했구요. 주위가 조용해서 자기에도 좋았어요.단지 쓰레기 버리는곳을 찾지 못해서 니콜에게 미안했어요. 아 그리고 청소기가 성능이 좀 떨어져서 먼지 흡입이 잘 안되더라구요. 그래도 최상의 조건으로 잘 놀다 왔습니다. 니콜에게 감사해요."),
("2017-08-21", "5763156", "Rene", "It was quick  easy  simple  nice.... all good"),
("2017-08-23", "5763156", "Mat", "A fantastic apartment in a superb location with lots of lovely places to eat  drink and socialise nearby. Communication was brilliant - instructions for getting there were superb and very easy to follow and Nicole's welcome was warm and full of good local tips. We hope to return one day!"),
("2017-08-28", "5763156", "Dominick", "I come to Sydney 4 times a year and this is always my #1 destination. But it's so popular that it's always booked out 6 to 9 months in advance for long term stays! Highly recommended!"),
("2017-09-04", "5763156", "Franziska", "Das Apartment von Simon und Nicole ist wunderschön eingerichtet und gut gepflegt. Es war sehr sauber und super ausgestattet. Die Lage in Surry Hills  in der Nähe der Central Station  haben wir sehr genossen. Leider haben wir Nicole nicht persönlich zur Schlüsselübergabe antreffen können  sie hat aber eine gute Alternative für uns organisiert. Die Kommunikation mit Nicole verlief einwandfrei und immer sehr schnell. Gerne wieder!"),
("2017-09-21", "5763156", "Sharon", "Nicole was an excellent host and the apartment is lovely and actually looks as nice as the photos! The only issues were with the internet not working one day (which should be fine now that NBN has been installed)  loud music on the Friday and Saturday nights from neighbours and construction noise from the building works across the road from 7.30am 6 days a week. Overall a lovely apartment and I had a good stay but it may not work for you if you are a light sleeper wanting to sleep in on a holiday!"),
("2017-10-08", "5763156", "Glenn", "This apartment is well situated near Central Station and within walking distance to Oxford Street  Chinatown and many other attractions. It is well appointed with good quality appliances and products (shampoos etc). The look and feel of the apartment suggests space  and has a pleasing design. It was also a treat to have the large cable TV on hand. Nicole was very responsive and went out of her way to ensure I had a good stay. The gym was also particularly well appointed  which was unusual for these kinds of apartments. I recommend this apartment."),
("2017-10-28", "5763156", "Jane", "Nicole and Simon’s apartment was perfect for our two week stay in Sydney  right in the middle of Surry Hills  close to so many fantastic cafes  restaurants and pubs. Also really handy for Central Station or for a walk down into CBD or Sydney Harbour.  The apartment was exactly as described and immaculately maintained. Nicole and Simon provided a very handy guide to the local eateries which was really useful. Would not hesitate to go back again. Thanks so much to Nicole and Simon."),
("2017-11-04", "5763156", "Kelly", "This flat is in a perfect location for funky bars and cafes  close to Central Station which then gives easy access to the city.  Accommodation was exactly how it was described  lovely choice of decor.  There is also a rooftop pool (although whilst we were there  it was closed due to some redevelopment work) and a small gym.  The bed was super comfy! Thanks so much!!"),
("2017-11-17", "5763156", "Paul", "Simon and Nicole were amazing hosts as was their accommodation. It was ideal for our trip and so so central. Nothing was too far away. Thank you for the flexibility you provided at both the start and end of our stay. We so enjoyed our home for the trip and would definitely stay here again. Thank you."),
("2017-12-01", "5763156", "Olivia", "Cet appartement est très bien situé à Surry Hills  un quartier très agréable   plein de petites boutiques  restaurants et cafés super sympas  et pas du tout touristique ce que j’adore.L’équipement de l’appartement est parfait  la literie très bonne  tous les produits pour la salle de bain sont d’excellente qualité. Il y a un cours de tennis et une piscine sur le toit  et une petite salle de sport bien équipée.Simon et Nicole mettent à disposition tout plein de petites choses qui font que l’on se sent comme à la maison ( serviettes de plage  raquettes de tennis  crème solaire  guides de Sydney  livres  bonbons...)C’était parfait  encore un grand merci à Nicole et Simon!!!"),
("2017-12-13", "5763156", "Gerwin", "Great place and great host - as simple as that.PS: a tennis court and pool on the roof (!!!)"),
("2017-12-28", "5763156", "Jen", "Simon and Nicole were great hosts. The flat was impeccably clean and comfortable for our holiday stay. Communication was excellent for our late check-in. The heated pool upstairs is a nice touch  and the air conditioning was a good to have during the hot Australian summer days. Very much enjoyed staying here and would stay again!"),
("2018-01-08", "5763156", "Natalie Jade", "We had a great time at Simon & Nicole’s apartment. It was very clean and was situated in the very popular area of Surry Hills  where there are plenty of bars and places to eat. Would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-01-15", "5763156", "Pamela", "Fantastic place  nice quiet area within walking distance of Central Station"),
("2018-01-24", "5763156", "Lynn", "The hosts are helpful and interested in making they visitors feel comfortable. The apartment is clean and very well presented and there are a few nice ‘treats’ to make you feel at home ❤️"),
("2018-01-31", "5763156", "Moritz", "This place is ideal for discovering Sydney  a lot is within walking distance (and Simon&Nicole have loads of useful tips) and everything else is close by via public transport. The kitchen is well equipped and felt like at home - thanks again!"),
("2018-04-02", "5763156", "Monica", "Great apartment  super location and Nicole is an exceptional host."),
("2018-04-15", "5763156", "Viginia", "Interesting location worth exploring  stylish apartment with parking & also easy access to public transport.  Great hosts. Longer stay would have been better!"),
("2018-04-22", "5763156", "Olivia", "I booked Simon and Nicole’s place for my parents. They both commented on the great location  and the clean  comfortable space  as well as Simon and Nicole’s hospitality."),
("2018-04-25", "5763156", "Chantelle", "This condo is wonderful! It felt modern and comfortable to us (32 year old couple) and just like home. We adventured through Sydney for a couple days while working remotely from our laptops  and couldn't have been happier with our choice of housing. The condo is very clean  well appointed and a large generous space. I slept so wonderfully in the bed  it didn't even feel like jet lag! We loved the walkability and hip nature of the neighborhood  while still feeling inviting and authentic. We immediately felt like this is the area we would choose to live in Sydney. We ubered to/from the airport but walked everywhere else. From the unit there are lost of coffee shops/cafes/restaurants within a few blocks. We walked through downtown to the Opera House and even walked home from Bondi Beach. Everything feels safe and there are always people out and about. Definitely would stay here the next time I'm lucky enough to get out to Sydney!"),
("2018-04-29", "5763156", "Leslie", "Great location. Large  stylish studio apartment with all the necessities. Nicole is wonderful to work with. I would stay here again."),
("2018-05-05", "5763156", "Hans", "Uitstekend appartement leuke buurt en dicht bij openbaar vervoer"),
("2018-05-13", "5763156", "Mary", "Nicole and Simon’s place is 5mins from central station and with easy walking to the city. The apartment is beautifully set up and comfortable with everything you need supplied. It is quiet and there is seating on an internal balcony. Coffee and chocolates were lovely touch. Communication was prompt and helpful and our late checkin easy. Nicole and Simon also offer an extensive list of local cafes  bars and restaurants. We ate at Muum Maam and Yullis (both within a 5 min walk) and recommend both for delicious food and excellent service.We highly recommend Nicole and Simon and thank them for the care and thought that has gone into the making the apartment perfect for our Sydney stay"),
("2018-05-26", "5763156", "Magalie", "Un appartement idéal placé et très bien décoré. Très agréable à vivre !Le seul bémol : le manque d'isolation vis à vis du bruit dans le couloir et des voisins."),
("2018-05-27", "5763156", "Wes", "What a fantastic apartment and in a very good location. Some of the best places to eat just around the corner.Stylish apartment with pool on the roof. Local bars were good. Cuckoo Callay is a must visit! Loved our stay with you. Would definately stay there again.Thanks. x"),
("2018-05-31", "5763156", "Andrew", "Very big studio apartment  immaculately present and very comfortable.  Great location between Surry Hills village and central station.    "),
("2018-06-04", "5763156", "Rhonda", "Fantastic centrally located apartment. Hosts takes a lot of pride in their accommodation. Loved it!"),
("2018-06-06", "5763156", "Ed", "Great place  great location  would book again"),
("2018-07-06", "5763156", "María", "Nicole siempre ha respondido a todas mis cuestiones y peticiones de una forma extraordinaria. El apartamento está en una ubicación idónea  he estado 4 semanas y no he echado en falta nada  tiene una cama comodísima  un salón muy amplio y es tal y como aparece en las fotos. Además de esto la casa tiene todo tipo de utensilios de cocina  el baño es amplio y con todo lo que puedas necesitar. Una cosa que me llamó la atención muy en positivo es que en el apartamento había cápsulas de café para todo un mes.Recomiendo 100% a Nicole como anfitriona y el apartamento para una estancia en Sydney. "),
("2018-07-11", "5763156", "Li Chyi", "Perfect space for two. Spacious living and dining area with a lovely balcony. Great location. Communication with Nicole has been quick and easy. One of the best Airbnb we've stayed in."),
("2018-07-21", "5763156", "Carlo", "Nicole is a great host  always replied promptly to all my queries  location is great  close to Central station  CBD  grocery store and lots of cafes to choose around the area. Highly recommend staying in this “funky” unit in Surry Hills. "),
("2018-07-24", "5763156", "Sarah", "Very stylish space in a super central location in trendy Surry Hills  very short walk to Central Station and amaaaazing local restaurants. Was able to use the car space which was excellent. Very clean apartment and exactly as described. Easy check in and out!"),
("2018-07-27", "5763156", "Pauline", "very stylish place in a nice neighborhood of Sydney. easy to communicate with Nicole. lovely stay all together."),
("2018-08-26", "5763156", "Kim", "I really appreciate for their house and kindness. Thank you.I couldn't forget memory in Sydney."),
("2018-09-06", "5763156", "Suzanne", "Great location for walking into the city or catching a train or bus to anywhere in Sydney. Good selection of local cafes and bars. Very comfy bed"),
("2018-09-09", "5763156", "Paul", "We had a really great stay at Simon and Nicole's place. Check in and communication was quick and easy (many thanks Nicole!)  the apartment itself is very spacious and comfortable with all the amenities you could wish for  and the location was excellent. Would definitely book again  highly recommended - thanks Simon and Nicole!"),
("2018-09-14", "5763156", "Szymon", "Great location  right in the middle of Surry Hills with cafes and restaurants within walking distance. Parking spot in the garage was great and seems to be a rarity in this location."),
("2018-09-18", "5763156", "Margaret", "Fantastic location  within a few minutes walk to Central station and a few minutes walk up Cooper Street to Crown Street and all the shops and cafes there.  I also walked into the Circular Quay via the Opera House and Woolloomoollo one day which took an hour.  The apartment was sparkling clean  stylish and spacious.  There were lots of extra touches  such as beach towels  tennis rackets and lots of extra bathroom products.  I couldn't fault it and I would love to stay here again."),
("2018-10-19", "5763156", "Renata", "Beautifully decorated and immaculately presented apartment  in a quiet block in the hipster Surry Hills. Conveniently located close to Central station. Lots of amazing restaurants nearby. Nicole provides excellent communication and ensures all enquiries and needs are met."),
("2018-10-28", "5763156", "Sara", "Simon and Nicole's place is a great little place for a short or extended stay in Sydney. It is close to public transport and amenities. Unfortunately there was a party of one night of our stay at a neighbouring property that went well into the early hours of the morning. Otherwise it was a lovely  quiet location. Thanks Simon and Nicole."),
("2018-11-01", "5763156", "Merianah", "Great base for a visit or work trip to Sydney! Loved the location and it was easy for me to walk into the CBD for work each day and to get around from. Great places to eat nearby too and Nicole was great to communicate with  everything was super easy!"),
("2018-11-04", "5763156", "Lisa", "Great location. Note that the bedroom is not separate from the living area and also a very noisy nightclub downstairs."),
("2018-11-13", "5763156", "Andrew", "Simon & Nicole's place is very close to central station and hence very easy to access the CBD. The neighbourhood has some good restaurants and trendy stores. The flat itself is spacious and clean. Simon & Nicole also put in those little extras which make your stay a special one! Thank you Simone & Nicole!"),
("2018-11-20", "5763156", "Sarah", "Great place. Wonderful location with easy walking distance to the train station. Bed was comfortable and the home was very clean. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-11-28", "5763156", "Emily", "Great location  40 minute walk to harbour front. Really enjoyed our stay"),
("2018-11-30", "5763156", "Emily", "I had a wonderful stay here for two nights. The place was exactly as it looks in the photos - very modern  clean and comfortable  and is an easy walking distance from Central Station and Surry Hills bars  restaurants and coffee shops."),
("2018-12-18", "5763156", "Stephanie", "Simon & Nicole's place is perfect for a couple or individual traveler heading to Sydney. GREAT location  super clean place  lovely terrace for breakfast. The WiFi is great  perfect for a working holiday. Nicole and Simon were both so helpful with local tips as well as making sure we had all of the amenities we could ask for. Another perfect Airbnb belonging to likeminded lovers of travel that reminds you why you're a part of this community in the first place."),
("2019-01-03", "5763156", "Jane", "A very central place to stay in Sydney. Being so close to Central Station allowed us to get everywhere easily. We used all types of public transport  light rail to the Maritime Museum  buses to Coogee Beach  Bondi & Watson’s Bay  and of course the trains & ferry's. We also walked from the apartment to Chinatown  Hyde Park & the Botanical Gardens and Kings Cross. Being there over Xmas & New Year we expected it to be noisy but although a little noise from the neighbours we were pleased with how quiet it was. Great place to stay."),
("2019-01-12", "5763156", "Beth", "What a fantastic apartment - spacious and well laid out. One of the really great things was the fresh linen along with a very comfy bed and towels. There was really great facilities including a gym which was empty every time we went! The location was perfect for our stay close to some awesome cafes  bars and shops and public transport  with central station only a short stroll away. We needed a slightly later checkout and Nicole was very accommodating of this."),
("2019-01-25", "5763156", "Steph", "This is a wonderful house which I highly recommend. Its a great size  everything you need  great location  air con for the warm Sydney weather and wonderful hosts. The only negative is that its a bit dark which is shame when its sunny outside but in every other way  this place is perfect."),
("2019-01-27", "5763156", "Jez", "A cosy place in a good location. A short walk to cafes  train station and the city or a short drive into Darling Harbour. Simon and Nicole were very quick to respond and helpful about the local area and what was happening around Sydney during our stay."),
("2019-02-09", "5763156", "Cat", "Delightful stay  definitely recommend! This place ticks all the boxes. It’s stylish  clean  and well fitted with all the amenities for a more than comfortable stay. There was nothing lacking. Location wise  you can’t go wrong! Seriously! Short walk to Central station  even shorter walk to Crown St for delicious eats. Nicole and Simon were friendly  attentive and responsive hosts. Looking forward to my next stay here!"),
("2016-04-22", "5923031", "Wade", "I had a great stay at 'the mews'. It's a brilliant location surrounded by some of Sydney's best foodie haunts. The cow and moon (coffee and ice cream) as well as the stinking bishops (cheese and wine) both deserve a special mention Narelle was great to deal with and everything was as described"),
("2016-10-28", "5923031", "Sialo", "We did not feel welcome  we lost our way not Narelle's fault but her response when we called her was a put off.  The raising of voice as she questioned how we could loose our way was  unpleasant and unnecessary"),
("2016-11-16", "5923031", "Deborah", "Narelle was brilliant. The unit was just what we wanted. A perfect little spot right in amongst the bustle of Newtown. It had absolutely everything we needed. It was spotlessly clean and very comfortable. It was also amazingly quiet  we couldn’t hear any traffic at all even though we were right on Enmore Road. The position was great  with all the restaurants and shops only around the corner  very convenient to everything. Taxis always around  buses and train station less than 50 metres away! We enjoyed our stay there very much. We will definitely be back.  It was really the best way to spend a week in Sydney. Thanks so much Narelle."),
("2016-12-16", "5923031", "Louise", "Great location  clean and comfortable. Narelle was a fantastic host and very easy to communicate with and very helpful. Would highly recommend!"),
("2017-01-05", "5923031", "Carl", "Great location.  Close to train station  great restaurants and bars.  Very clean and private space."),
("2017-02-15", "5923031", "Isabelle", "Narelle was a lovely and highly accommodating host! The apartment was ideal  stocked with everything you might need for a comfortable and homely stay. I have now found my new spot for whenever I travel to Sydney for business! I highly recommend this place to all! "),
("2017-03-11", "5923031", "Sandra", "The flat is very clean and super close to transport and amazing food. We love Newtown and will definitely stay again. Thanks Narelle for sharing your beautiful apartment."),
("2017-03-15", "5923031", "Laura", "Great location  good facilities. Narelle was great at communicating and helping us out:) "),
("2017-03-26", "5923031", "Deborah", "The apartment is amazing.  Perfectly placed  amazingly quiet and just so close to everything.  It's my go to place in Newtown. Thanks Narelle.  Again!"),
("2017-03-30", "5923031", "Jodi", "This is my second stay at Mews in Newtown now  first in 14 & this time 7. Both stays have been amazing. Apartment is beautiful  central  walkable to anythign you need and the host wonderful. I stayed for business  and will try and book this apartment as often as I can. Everything I need so conveniently located. Thanks Narelle for having me again!"),
("2017-04-05", "5923031", "Jodi", "3rd (Email hidden by Airbnb) 7 for business this week. Love this little home away from home!"),
("2017-04-09", "5923031", "Marie-Helene", "Narelle was a great host"),
("2017-04-12", "5923031", "Jodi", "Another awesome stay at Mews. Perfect little apartment for everything I need. Thanks Narelle!"),
("2017-04-17", "5923031", "Helen", "Five stars. Lovely little flat very close to Newtown station (less than five minutes). Narelle has thought of everything - washing powder  plenty of sockets  small carton of milk - a great host. Small flat but perfectly formed. Very  very clean. Amazing comfortable bed  and nice and dark for a good lie in. Lovely little balcony. Triple glazing to keep out the traffic noise. I was travelling alone and felt very safe. Only issue could be the stairs - no lift - but I'm lazy and I could manage them easily! Highly recommend. I will try to stay here again next time I'm in Newtown."),
("2017-04-19", "5923031", "Jodi", "Another incredible stay at my favourite AirBnb yet! Thanks Narelle for having me"),
("2017-05-06", "5923031", "Nidale", "The one bedroom apartment was bright  clean  quiet  close to public transport  and minutes away from many cafes  restaurants and shops. The bed was comfortable  living space lovely and well appointed. The washer and dryer came in very handy. Narelle was welcoming  kind  easily accessible and responsive. Everything you need or want is just minutes away on King street. Will definitely stay there again on my next trip. Thank you Narelle!"),
("2017-05-21", "5923031", "Kerry", "Great location."),
("2017-05-24", "5923031", "Jodi", "I've stayed at Narelle's multiple times now for business. This time in particular I was quite unwell the day of check out  and Narelle and Simone were both kind enough to let me check out later and leave for my flight. Thank you so much ladies  for letting me stay longer and for another wonderful stay in your beautiful apartment. I honestly don't know what I would have done without the extended check out! Looking forward to my next already. See you soon!"),
("2017-06-05", "5923031", "Lody", "Beautiful appointed and comfortable accommodation in the heart of funky Newtown. Traffic and street noise due to central location."),
("2017-06-12", "5923031", "Michael", "Narelles unit is in a perfect location to experience all that Newtown has on offer.Public transport  cafes and restaurants  bars and night clubs are within a hop  skip and jump.The unit is modern  immaculate and presented tastefully. Considering the close proximity to the hustle and bustle of street  the units specialised glazed door blocks out all noise. The communication from the host was excellent and as a regular visitor to the area we will definately be returning for another stay."),
("2017-06-15", "5923031", "Jodi", "Yet another wonderful stay at Mews. Forgot just how comfy that bed was! Thanks ladies"),
("2017-06-17", "5923031", "Michael", "Loverly place. Very quite inside even though in busy area of Newtown. Great help with checkin and out"),
("2017-07-07", "5923031", "Matthew", "It was exactly as I'd expected  because I knew the place well. Spotless. Quiet. Nicely decked out."),
("2017-07-11", "5923031", "Matthew", "Thoughtfully set out  immaculately clean and amazingly peaceful - given that it's right on Enmore Road in what is now the epicentre of Sydney's night life. I wanted some space for reading and reflection and it was just perfect. "),
("2017-07-15", "5923031", "Tina", "Great place  clean very well set up  great location  loved Newtown."),
("2017-07-19", "5923031", "Jodi", "I can't count the number of times ive stayed at Narelle place for business now but never disappointed. Awesome location and that bed is almost more comfortable than my own. Thanks for having me again Narelle!"),
("2017-07-22", "5923031", "Matthew", "From first contact through to departure  this was one of the best AirBnB experiences I've had.Narelle was warm and welcoming with all communication & went above & beyond for a request I had on our check out day - which both myself & my friend (travelling with me) very much appreciated.The apartment was in a fantastic location within walking distance of everywhere in Newtown & in very close proximity to public transport.It was also very clean  extremely well-maintained & cozy - just perfect for our visit to Sydney. Thank you Narelle for being such a welcoming host - we really enjoyed this visit to Sydney even more so because of this wonderful accommodation & we'll definitely look this apartment up again for our next visit.All the best Matt"),
("2017-07-27", "5923031", "Robyn", "Narelle was very helpful. The apartment was clean  compact and had everything we needed to enjoy our stssy."),
("2017-07-29", "5923031", "Chandini", "An immaculate beautiful apartment in the heart of New Town! Excellent for those using public transport or taxi. Parking is difficult in this busy place. Though is we did not meet Narelle she was always at hand with clear instructions. We very much enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-08-04", "5923031", "Sean", "This unit is fantastic and the location couldn't be better. Narelle made check-in a breeze and was always quick to respond to messages. The unit was clean and very very comfortable. It has a full kitchen which  in addition to grocery stores and bakeries in easy walking distance  make it easy to save money on dining. However  if you want to go out  there are heaps of cafes and restaurants within a 10 minute walk. Easy access to public transportation makes exploring the city a breeze. Excellent!"),
("2017-08-06", "5923031", "Della", "Super quiet  secure and cute apartment. Awesome location and rooftop garden has wonderful views."),
("2017-08-15", "5923031", "Kelly", "Amazing location and apartment. 10/10."),
("2017-08-24", "5923031", "Jodi", "Perfect stay as always. This little apartment  location  access to shops  restaurants and public transport is the best i've ever stayed in while in Sydney. Will be back again and again! Thanks for having me again  Narelle :)"),
("2017-09-15", "5923031", "Alexandra", "Clean  central  friendly and amazing location. Couldn't be happier with the ammenities  location or communication with Narelle and Simone."),
("2017-10-05", "5923031", "Jenny", "Narelle's apartment is a great place to stay - just a 1 minute walk to the train and two stops to Central Station.  Newtown has lots of cafes  restaurants and also has a movie theatre - all within very easy walking distance.  There's also a really nice organic supermarket right next to the Train station.  Newtown is well lit and very safe to walk around in the evenings.  The apartment is small but very well appointed  very clean and comfortable.  The apartment complex is fresh and clean and quite secure.  Although the apartment faces onto a busy street it is perfectly quiet inside due to the triple glazing on the balcony door.  I would definitely stay here again and highly recommend it."),
("2017-10-09", "5923031", "Vicki", "The apartment is great and ideal for a couple.  We spent three nights there and it was ideal because of it's location - huge vibe in King Street - and proximity to public transport. Would definetly stay again.  Thank you Narelle."),
("2017-10-16", "5923031", "Lan", "很好的住宿"),
("2017-11-06", "5923031", "Deborah", "This is the most wonderful place to stay.  I just love it.  It has everything you need.  Even the little things like a plug adaptor and cling wrap. It is so close to everything and yet amazingly quiet.  I will definitely be back."),
("2017-11-12", "5923031", "David", "A great location in the lively town of Newtown - under 5 minute walk to the train which gets you to central Sydney very quickly  lots of shops and restaurants around.  And a lovely apartment - clean  nice layout.  Check-in is very easy and communications are great.  Highly recommended."),
("2017-11-26", "5923031", "Sharon", "Place was great. Very clean and modern. Close to everything you need."),
("2017-12-13", "5923031", "Berni", "Had a great stay at the mews  right in the centre of newtown surrounded by cafes  coffee and public transport.  No traffic noise and plenty of space and very comfy bed."),
("2018-01-05", "5923031", "Karla", "Bom apartamento  bem funcional. Perto da estação de trem  com lavanderia e AC. Acesso só por escada  com malas pesadas acho que seria o único contra. O chuveiro também achei baixo e só tenho 1 70m. Mas ótimo custo benefício."),
("2018-01-19", "5923031", "Alyssa", "Great apartment in the center of Newtown. We weren’t familiar with the neighborhood but it turned out to be a great choice. You’ve got all kinds of super hip restaurants  cafes and bars and a lot of small shops. The apartment was super clean and had everything we needed."),
("2018-01-27", "5923031", "Emma-Kate", "Perfect for a quick business trip to Sydney!"),
("2018-02-09", "5923031", "Harrison", "We love the Mews! As travelers of a certain age  we were a bit worried that Newtown's energy would be overwhelming  but Narelle's apartment was well-insulated from the hustle and bustle outside. The location would be hard to beat: the wide array of local shops and restaurants had everything we needed  and with the train station a stone's throw away  moving around the city was easy and efficient. Definitely a keeper!"),
("2018-02-21", "5923031", "Melinda", "If you need to stay in Newtown then this is the place. It's lovely  very clean  has aircon and is right by Newtown station. Narelle was lovely and very communicative.  I enjoyed it and will stay here again!"),
("2018-02-24", "5923031", "Tamara", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay in Narelle’s apartment! It had everything we expected and some lovely little touches that made us feel at home. The apartment was really close to public transport which suited us. Surprisingly  it was quiet  but also in the thick of the inner-west’s hustle and bustle! I would happily stay here again. Thanks  Narelle! You were so easy to correspond with! I wish you all the best!"),
("2018-03-02", "5923031", "Aaron", "The unit is exactly as described and it is excellent. In the heart of Newtown but still really quiet inside and very comfortable. The apartment was very well maintained and we really enjoyed staying there. Thank you."),
("2018-03-07", "5923031", "Arlette", "Fabulous location  very comfortable  clean and enjoyable apartment. Everything has been thought of and we enjoyed the fully equipped kitchen  hot shower and comfortable bed. Stairs are not a problem  they have handrails and even with luggage  very manageable. Great base for exploring Sydney as public transport is at the door  highly recommended."),
("2018-03-18", "5923031", "Samuel", "Smaller than it looks in the pictures. Sliding doors around bed are quite inconveniently close to the bedQuite small bathroom  shower has very little water pressureCan be almost noise free if door is closed properlyVery conveniently located near train station  bars andrestaurants"),
("2018-04-04", "5923031", "Adrianna", "It was our second time in Newtown and it did not disappoint! We had some little mishaps with wifi and some kitchen utensils but the host was very quick to respond with solutions and was able to help us whenever we needed it. The house is very close to local cafes and restaurants with ample amount of activities to do with the train station less than a 3 minute walk away. Fantastic service in a lovely home  we would recommend this place to everyone :)"),
("2018-04-08", "5923031", "Tanya", "This place is centrally located  super clean and well equipped and also very secure for the solo traveller. I was able to catch a train from the airport and walk only a couple of minutes to the destination. Nearby there are lots of restaurants and cafes  and I enjoyed the food from a different culture every meal. I would happily stay there again."),
("2018-04-14", "5923031", "Alvaro Andres", "Smack in the middle of Newtown  yet quiet and modern. Everything we were looking for."),
("2018-04-22", "5923031", "Paul", "This was by far one of my favourite AirBnbs. It is central  lively and has everything you could need all in a cosy and open little apartment. Thanks so much for letting me stay. I will definitely be looking for this place next time I'm in Sydney."),
("2018-05-02", "5923031", "New", "Een super locatie. Newtown is heel erg leuk om rond te lopen  en het is naast het station  waardoor je ook snel naar andere plekken toe kan.Het appartement is heel prettig en het bed ligt lekker. Het straatverkeer is wel vrij luidruchtig met de ramen open. Maar met de ramen dicht heb je er geen last van."),
("2018-05-12", "5923031", "Sarah", "Loved staying at Narelle's place. The location is unbeatable  the triple glazed balcony door really does keep out all the street noise. Lots of thoughtful touches like a well stocked kitchen and bathroom  and little things you might not have with you such as spare Opal cards and an umbrella. Self check in/out made everything easy. Also a very stylishly decorated and clean place  it was a very enjoyable stay."),
("2018-05-28", "5923031", "Cheryl", "This is the best location I could have imagined!  Less than a block from the train with direct service to the harbor.  But Newtown is a great place to hang out with many great restaurants and cafes.  Narelle and friends are responsive.  The place is neat and clean as advertised with the bonus of a comfy bed.  I recommended it to friends."),
("2018-06-14", "5923031", "Tiffany", "The apartment was very safe and cosy. I was staying on my own for 2 weeks and loved the convenient location to all public transport  restaurants and shops. I wouldn’t hesitate to recommend it and would definitely book again!"),
("2018-07-09", "5923031", "Pippa", "The unit was very clean  well designed and remarkably quiet while being at the heart of Newtown. It is close to public transport and all the amenities of Newtown. Narelle was a very responsive host  she replied to emails promptly and checked with us that all was well during our stay. The self check-in instructions were clear and easy to follow. Narelle had provided a short list of things to do in Newtown. We know Newtown well having visited a couple of times before  so my only suggestion for improvement would be some more comprehensive information about Sydney. Otherwise I wholeheartedly recommend this unit to other travellers and would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-08-03", "5923031", "Gilberto", "This place is great  location is hard to beat and the place has everything you may need for a stay in Newtown. Is clean  well planned and secure. Definitely will stay again! "),
("2018-08-12", "5923031", "Elliot", "We really enjoyed our recent stay at Newtown Mews. Great location  very clean  several clever uses of space  and nice amenities. We loved the neighborhood and the apartment and would highly recommend to others!"),
("2018-08-25", "5923031", "Walker Books", "Exactly as described. Would recommend"),
("2018-09-21", "5923031", "Satinder", "lovely space and location!"),
("2018-09-30", "5923031", "Jocelyn", "Narelle’s place is clean  tidy and cosy! Perfect location to experience all that Newtown has to offer."),
("2018-10-11", "5923031", "Chenyang", "Nice 10 days with a nice room!٩(๑^o^๑)۶"),
("2018-10-14", "5923031", "Jack", "Narelle was a wonderful host  quick to respond to any enquiry  the place is so neat  clean and homely. My partner and I enjoyed the locAtion and the night we cooked the most. Everything was spot on!!"),
("2018-10-22", "5923031", "Ed", "Really a perfect place to stay in terms of location  facilities  value and comfort.  Communication was very clear from start to finish.  Slept brilliantly every night and really appreciated the fact that Narelle gave some of her local recommendations for Newtown.  Proximity to the train station means that you can be in the centre of Sydney well within half an hour.   Strongly recommended!"),
("2018-10-28", "5923031", "Derek", "An excellent apartment  great location near train station  bars and restaurants. Would stay again."),
("2018-11-03", "5923031", "Marc", "Great location in a stylish space"),
("2018-11-17", "5923031", "Ella", "The Airbnb was absolutely perfect! I stayed for two weeks and it couldn’t have been better. The location is incredible  so central and the place itself is incredibly clean and has everything you need. The rooftop is also an amazing addition. Loved it."),
("2018-11-28", "5923031", "Robert", "This is a gem of an apartment in an outstanding location.The apartment itself  while a studio  is bright  spacious and tastefully decorated. Every amenity you could desire is provided  including a very well-equipped kitchen  a nice bathroom  and a good sized washer/dryer.While the apartment is on a busy road  none of the street sounds come into the apartment when the balcony door is closed.  The building is upscale  quiet and maintained well.Which brings us to the location. I've been to Sydney several times  but this was my first experience in Newtown. It's simply wonderful.  Within steps of this apartment are countless good restaurants  many moderately priced by Sydney standards.  If you plan to do some of your own cooking  there are decent markets within walking distance.  While the apartment is not located in the main tourist areas  they are readily accessible by public transportation.Finally  Narelle is a superb host. While we never met  she was extremely gracious in our written communications and responded promptly.  I  felt quite welcome in her apartment and would have no hesitation about booking this unit again in a future visit to Sydney.Very highly recommended!"),
("2018-12-07", "5923031", "Tonya", "Great place  superb value! I highly recommend that you go visit the rooftop terrace of the place  as it's lovely up there and exposing yourself to the sunlight (with proper precautions like 50+ Australian Cancer Council sun cream  a broad-brimmed hat  and some water) will help you get over your jet lag. Having the washing machine and drying racks for laundry is especially helpful for the compact traveller who doesn't bring much but does have to wash clothing often enough. I also loved the little terrace off the condo unit  where I had my breakfast every day. So wonderful! Give it a go! It's a great listing!!"),
("2018-12-21", "5923031", "Francine", "The apartment is very well-located  comfortable  cool and well-equipped. Narelle ensures everything runs smoothly and easily. I stayed five nights  and the apartment is equally well-suited to shorter or longer stays  with everything guests might need. The local neighbourhood is terrific. The apartment is located on a busy road in a bustling area  but the sound-proofing is excellent  so you have the benefit of being in the middle of a lively local scene while the apartment is calm and quiet. Recommended."),
("2018-12-27", "5923031", "Agastya", "great location and apartment! we really enjoyed our stay in sydney."),
("2018-12-31", "5923031", "Ashleigh", "Narelle was a fabulous host  always responding quickly and made check in and check out easy.Narelle's place was lovely. It was small  but had everything you need if you're on your own or with someone. It is close to trains and buses which take you straight into the city centre. The door blocked out most of the noise and there was a fan and air-conditioning  so if you can't handle the noise and it's hot  you can close the doors and still be cool. I would definitely stay again and would recommend it to anyone else travelling to Sydney."),
("2019-01-09", "5923031", "Adriana", "Narelle's apartment is a such a gem! Her place is tidy  stylish and she is extremely responsive. It is located in the heart of Newtown  literally steps away from cafes  restaurants  great indie shops  bars  supermarkets  etc. Everything you can possibly need is so nearby. It's also about a block away from the metro which was is so convenient to travel around Sydney. Though she is located on a busy street  you would never know it because her soundproof sliding door blocks out all noise and the place is very quiet (a must for me and my husband). We really enjoyed our stay here and I can't recommend it enough!"),
("2019-01-18", "5923031", "Craig", "This is a great little place to stay...handy to transport links and in a vibrant part of Sydney. Loved our stay!"),
("2019-01-30", "5923031", "Imogen", "Looks just like in the photos  has everything you need (even fresh milk in the fridge!)  clean  very central location right near Newtown station and surprisingly quiet with door closed or just tilted open  considering the busy street below. Also very good communication & quick resolution to an issue that arose with the downstairs lock. Definitely recommend!"),
("2019-02-01", "5923031", "Simone", "Narelle is a great host  lovely and clean and in a fantastic location"),
("2019-02-06", "5923031", "Miki", "Narelle は素晴らしいです｡ﾁｪｯｸｲﾝもﾁｪｯｸｱｳﾄもｽﾑｰｽﾞに出来ました｡お部屋も綺麗で静かでした｡近くにたくさんの良いｶﾌｪやﾊﾟﾌﾞがあって､食べ物に全く困りませんでした｡ありがとうございました｡またｼﾄﾞﾆｰに来た時は､ここに泊まりたいです｡"),
("2019-02-08", "5923031", "Sloane", "Very stylish apartment in fantastic location."),
("2019-02-17", "5923031", "Emma", "Super convenient place!! Right next to train station  so you could easily get to and from everywhere. Also  Newtown is a really neat and quirky area! The place is a great  quiet home base for Australia adventures :)"),
("2019-02-23", "5923031", "Chanele", "Narelles Airbnb was the perfect little home away from home! The location was absolutely perfect for us as it was central to everything and had a train station less then a 5 minute walk away. Would highly recommend this Airbnb to anyone :)"),
("2015-07-09", "6036714", "Ann", "Sally was excellent to deal with  location of house was perfect for seeing Sydney handy to both ferries and buses.  Very Homely"),
("2015-07-14", "6036714", "Karen", "Had woundeful stay in your home. Stay was made special with loving cat's"),
("2016-01-05", "6036714", "Zhibo", "Thank you Sally for such a beautiful house. The house is not that big but we find very thing we need. Perfect position to the ferry and the New year fireworks. The decorations and pictures on the wall give us lots of inspiration."),
("2015-12-11", "6033723", "Kai", "Jonny was a really nice and kind host and everything was as expected. We enjoyed staying there and if we'll return to Manly one day  I won't hesitate with booking his accommodation again. Highly recommended!"),
("2015-12-14", "6033723", "Sheila", "Jonny was a lovely guy that made us feel very comfortable in his home. The apartment is fresh and clean with a comfortable bed  it is in a great location with just a few minutes walk to the centre of Manly and the Wharf to get a ferry to the city."),
("2015-12-23", "6033723", "Nicolas", "Disfrutamos de una agradable estadía en lo de Jonny principalmente gracias a la calidez que recibimos de su parte. Jonny es una persona amable y divertida  siempre abierta a conversar y reirse. El departamento está muy bien ubicado a corta distancia del Corso y las mejores playas de Manly pero se mantiene en una zona tranquila  lo cual es muy bueno. Quedamos totalmente satisfechos y lo recomendamos!"),
("2015-12-30", "6033723", "Ben", "Jonny is an awesome host! His place is super clean and comfy! Could not recommend this highly enough!"),
("2016-01-02", "6033723", "Michele", "Jonny was super friendly and welcoming and made Alex and I feel very comfortable. We felt very at home in this apartment that is in an amazing location for exploring the north shore and Sydney."),
("2016-01-10", "6033723", "Jasmine", "Very friendly and gave us suggestions of places to visit. Nice & clean roomClose to CBD"),
("2016-01-31", "6033723", "Philippos", "I stayed with Jonny for 3 weeks while I was waiting for my new apartment to become available. He is a great host and  more importantly  an extremely friendly and fun guy to hang out with! The place is clean and tidy and very well located to enjoy everything that Manly has to offer. "),
("2016-02-04", "6033723", "Emily", "Greatest beach mate of all time."),
("2016-02-07", "6033723", "Alexander", "Jonny's place was perfect for us! Really awesome location short walk from bars  restaurants  and quite a few beaches.It was clean and tidy and he was super friendly. Would definitely stay again should we visit Manly again."),
("2016-02-13", "6033723", "Sven", "My parents had a lovely stay at Jonnys  flat. Everything was clean and tidy and Jonny is a realy helpful and nice person. My parents would stay again at his place  definitely recommendable!"),
("2016-02-18", "6033723", "Keiko", "Great host!Great stayed!Great apartment!Great location!Great surfing!Thank you everything Jonny!!"),
("2016-02-21", "6033723", "Min Soo", "Although I have arrived later than I initially confirmed  Jonny kindly left keys for me to get into the accommodation without any hassle. The house was tidy and comfy. Also the best location if you want to enjoy Manly beach."),
("2016-02-24", "6033723", "Devin", "Jonny was great! A good host to have  very friendly  and fun to be around. I was in Manly completing my open water diving certification and he was great with the flexibility of our schedules for the day. His location is close to the Corso and 2 beaches. It really is an amazing place to be. Thank Jonny for also being supportive with Zoe. I would recommend him any day. "),
("2016-02-27", "6033723", "Christine", "Jonny has a nice flat in a really good location  the ferry and beaches are very close. The flat is bright and clean and even has enough storage for some surfboards :) It's a good place from where you can explore manly."),
("2016-03-05", "6033723", "Dominique", "El departamento estaba muy bien ubicado. A una sola cuadra de la playa y del puerto. Manly es un hermoso lugar para conocer. Y el alojamiento de Jonny tenía todo lo necesario para complementar la experiencia. Es súper lindo y limpio. Sobre jonny es una persona súper agradable  compartimos viendo una película y nos dio algunos consejos donde ir . También cuido de algunas cosas que se me quedaron. Totalmente recomendado . "),
("2016-03-11", "6033723", "Scott G", "Jonny is a great host  always in communication and helpful.  The location is close to the main beach  bay  shops and restaurants.  It is about a 4 block walk from the ferry."),
("2016-08-06", "6033723", "Alessia", "Great location. Jonny was very accommodating with our early check in time. Pleasant stay."),
("2016-12-31", "6033723", "Leonardo", "Thanks Jonny  we had an awesome time at your flat. There was nothing missing and we felt more than welcome."),
("2015-10-18", "6055546", "Alvin", "David was a very accommodating and welcoming host! The place had a fantastic view as promised on the description and the bedroom was nicely set up for my arrival. I had a great stay and would recommend David's place for anyone looking to stay in the vicinity of the Eastern Suburb beaches or the university."),
("2015-11-13", "6055546", "Alyona", "I loved it! David is the best next door neighbor we could have :) he helped us a lot and was extremely nice during our whole stay at his place. The location us super comfy as well  so there are a lot of buses going to the city  beaches and pretty much everywhere. I came to Australia with my mom and at David's place we had our own bedroom as well as bathroom. We could use kitchen utilities  iron and washing machine too :) To sum up it is a great place to stay and we didn't hesitate of doing so! Thanks David!! :)))"),
("2017-03-14", "6055546", "Hua", "It's a very convenient place  close to transport and shopping center. David is very nice and helpful.  "),
("2016-01-03", "6066694", "Christopher", "We really enjoyed our time here. The house is absolutely amazing; the host friendly and informative and the location was superb. Thanks to Niki and family."),
("2018-01-01", "6066694", "Deborah", "We loved this home - so quiet and family friendly  yet so close to everything. We could walk to all the great beaches - Tamarama  Bronte and Bondi  and enjoyed having great shops and cafes just a couple of minute's walk away. Nicola's home is a lovely way to experience the best of Sydney life and she was great to deal with - super responsive and helpful with local information. "),
("2019-01-05", "6066694", "James", "A terrific location close to everything Bondi has to offer.  Fantastic communication from the host Niki."),
("2015-09-22", "5993432", "Polly", "Hugo was very welcoming when we first arrived and told us about his favourite local cafes and restaurants around the area which were awesome. The place was very artfully furnished and located conveniently next to the station. We would highly recommend his place. Loved it! Thanks  Hugo! :)) "),
("2015-09-29", "5993432", "Ellis", "Hugo was very friendly  the apartment has a lot of small thought out nice touches to make your stay more convenient.  The listing is very accurate  what you see on the photo's is what you get. The building is old but not noisy and the bed very comfortable. Good location for getting around Sydney  would recommend staying here to any of our friends!"),
("2015-10-04", "5993432", "Ethan", "Great apartment and great location  it's close to pretty much everything you need in Sydney!!"),
("2015-10-07", "5993432", "Lu", "房子位于悉尼达令赫斯特街区 交通还算方便 周边餐厅很多 去超市也很近｡房间很干净 设施也比较齐全｡"),
("2015-10-11", "5993432", "Hannah", "Hugo was easy to communicate and a great host - would recommend."),
("2015-10-14", "5993432", "Sherrie", "Hugo place was lovely   very clean and comfortable . Gorgeous Art Deco building  location was amazing . Walking distance to all big attractions and city . Hugo was very helpful and flexible with all requests and even though he was out of the city his friend Oliver met me and was very welcoming and accomodating . Seriously a great host and place to stay   I'll be backSherrie "),
("2015-10-17", "5993432", "Josh", "Great location. Clean. Cosy. Comfortable.  Close to cafes and Kings  cross. I would definately stay here again."),
("2015-10-19", "5993432", "Ann", "The apartment is very cosy and comfortable at such a great location! Couldn't meet Hugo but his friend was just as helpful 8) a great place to recommend to friends!"),
("2015-10-26", "5993432", "Nadirah", "I had an awesome stay at Hugo's  the place is magnificent and efficient. Everything that you need is in one place  and the apartment's near to convenient stores  the train station  restaurants and hot spots! Both Hugo & Oliver was very attentive and easy to connect with. Would definitely stay at Hugo's for upcoming trips to Sydney. Highly recommended!"),
("2015-10-30", "5993432", "Dereck", "Great location  neat  tidy and extremely comfortable. Top spot! "),
("2015-11-01", "5993432", "Isabelle", "I loved the place and the location. Hugo was communicating well before and after my booking. As he was overseas  his friend Oliver took care of the flat. He was very welcoming  solving my luggage problem and hat great tips for dining out. Thank you so much  I will be back."),
("2015-11-05", "5993432", "Nick", "I stayed at Hugo's with my Dad while we were travelling through on a road trip up the East Coast.  My Dad was in the bedroom and I was on the inflatable in the living room. There was more than enough space for the 2 of us and Hugo's home was exactly as expected.  Beautiful  homely and fantastically positioned close to the centre of Sydney.  We loved the art deco style of the building and how Hugo had furnished the apartment.  Hugo's communication was excellent through out the whole process and checking in and out was made seamless and flexible. The weather was terrible during our stay but fortunately there was huge range of fantastic cafes  restaurants and bars in the immediate area. Great location!To summarise  I would absolutely recommend Hugo's place to anyone visiting Sydney and we're sure to be back in touch next time we're in town :)Thanks for everything!"),
("2015-11-08", "5993432", "Lucia", "The apartment is perfect for a Sydney visit - complete with everything you need. A range of tourist information was left fir us which was helpful."),
("2015-11-19", "5993432", "Danny", "Great location and everything clean and tidy.  Hug's friend who saw us in was great"),
("2015-11-22", "5993432", "Chantelle", "Hugo's place was perfect for our weekend in Sydney. It was neat and tidy  conveniently located and had everything we needed. Thanks for having us!"),
("2015-11-29", "5993432", "Mark", "Hugo's friend was on hand to give us the keys and show us the apartment. He was really friendly and very helpful! The apartment was very clean  tidy and in a really good location. Hugo had also left out some tourist booklets for Sydney and the local area which was useful for us. Perfect for our 1st trip to Sydney!"),
("2015-12-02", "5993432", "Cosimo", "L'appartement d'Hugo est très bien situé. les photos sont fidèles à l'appartement."),
("2015-12-07", "5993432", "Helen", "Loved our stay at Hugo's. Lovely clean apartment which had a nice homely feel! Had a nice warm welcome from Oliver and thoroughly enjoyed our stay!"),
("2015-12-15", "5993432", "Sadira", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Hugo's apartment. The location is absolutely ideal and the apartment is well outfitted for a comfortable stay in Sydney. I wouldn't hesitate to recommend this place."),
("2015-12-18", "5993432", "Samuel", "Thanks for a great stay Hugo! Apartment is in the perfect spot  bed was comfortable and had all amenities needed.  Would definitely recommend to all"),
("2015-12-22", "5993432", "Fenella", "Lovely apartment in very central location  perfect for easy access to trains and buses and within walking distance of the City and Circular Quay. Bright  compact and comfortable - a very enjoyable stay. Many thanks Hugo."),
("2015-12-30", "5993432", "Peter", "Es hat alles super funktioniert. Kommunikation und Schlüsselübergabe ohne Probleme. Die Lage istneinfach top. Gute Anbindung an Bahn umd Bus. So gefällt AORBNB:-)"),
("2016-01-07", "5993432", "Flynn", "Stayed here only a few nights and didn't spend much time in the place other than sleep. The laundry room was a plus for me since I put it tons good use. Location is excellent as it only took me about 10 min to sit in a train at King's Cross station. Good number of places to eat and grab drinks nearby. Internet was also quite fast. Overall  I had a good experience and stay at Hugo's place."),
("2016-01-10", "5993432", "Patricia", "Hugo is a fantastic host and his place is amazing. He couldn't be there to give us the keys but he made arrangements with a friend that lives nearby.There were several Timeout books with information about the city and Hugo also left a public transport card for us to use.The apartment is really close to bars and restaurants and the night life of the area is a must ;)It was a great experience!!"),
("2016-01-22", "5993432", "Vania", "We really enjoyed our stay at Hugo's apartment. The location was prime as there were so many coffee shops and bars to walk to. Hugo was easy to communicate with and made sure that we felt as comfortable as possible. Thanks Hugo!"),
("2016-01-25", "5993432", "Leisa-Kay", "Hugo hosted us on such short notice which we were so appreciative for. His friend Oliver met us  let us in and showed us where everything was. He was extremely helpful  offered us his phone number if we needed anything. The apartment was super clean and had everything you need  and the location was awesome  literally walking distance to countless bars  cafes and shopping. We had a great time and will definitely stay at Hugo's next time we're back in Syndey."),
("2016-02-05", "5993432", "Luca", "Hugo's friend let me in and out and offered to keep my luggage until later in the day  which was very much appreciated.The apartment is very well located and well kept  though the fridge wasn't working properly unfortunately but was getting fixed.I'd stay here again :)"),
("2016-02-08", "5993432", "Fiona", "We had a wonderful time staying in Hugo's apartment. It had everything we needed for a long weekend away and was in a great location - very close to kings cross station and some local amenities. Also a few nice spots for coffee brekky! Hugo's fridge unfortunately broke during our stay however Oliver was very accommodating suggesting we use his fridge to cool down his beers as he lives close to the apartment. We did not take up this offer  but very thankful nonetheless.The bed was comfy and although there was no air con available (which we knew upon booking) the fan in the bedroom did the trick. I would certainly consider staying in the apartment next time we travel to Sydney.Thanks Hugo & Oliver!"),
("2016-02-16", "5993432", "David", "I really enjoyed my stay at Hugo’s apartment. His friend Oliver was incredibly helpful and held our luggage till the apartment was available as well as holding it until we flew out after check-out. The apartment is perfectly located and walking distance to most areas as well as public transport. It is an easy walk to the CBD as well as Oxford St and many restaurants. The fridge was broken however that was not really an issue for us. Would definitely stay at Hugo’s again."),
("2016-02-23", "5993432", "Jenny", "Hugos apartment is in a perfect location with lots of restaurants  bars and public transport close by. It is cozy and beautifully furnished. A nice extra where lots of interesting books about photography. The problem with the fridge was solved while we where there by replacing it. Happy to come back anytime! :)"),
("2016-02-27", "5993432", "Po Yi", "The location is very good  a 3 min walk to Kingscross station and easy to find. The house is clean enough. Worth the price."),
("2016-03-06", "5993432", "Martin", "My partner and I were in Sydney and stayed at Hugo's place.  Great apartment centrally located."),
("2016-03-11", "5993432", "Karen", "Really good location  great communication "),
("2016-03-17", "5993432", "Manisha", "We had a lovely stay at Hugo's apartment! Hugo was very responsive throughout the process. The studio was very homely and had everything we needed. The biggest plus point was its location! Just a 5 minute walk to Kings Cross train station  and dozens of restaurants and bars within walking distance. Check in and check out was extremely smooth thanks to Hugo's friend Oliver  who even helped us get our luggage up the flight of stairs. We highly recommend this apartment and would definitely stay here the next time we are in town. Thanks for having us!"),
("2016-03-22", "5993432", "Glenn", "Believe all the positive reviews  great place to stay and check out Oliver's recommendation for Chester white!"),
("2016-03-25", "5993432", "Paul & Kim", "Good location! Near train station  restaurant and supermarket.Walking distance to the harbour 30 min wich you walk true the botanic gardens! The app has everything you need  Nice kitchen  livingroom and is clean enough. We wouldt like to stay here if we are in Sydney again. Thx to Oliver for the tips and help!"),
("2016-04-01", "5993432", "Wendy", "Thanks to Hugo and Oliver  we really had a good time in Sydney.The apartment is not only clean and tidy  but also in perfect location. It took us 5 minutes to walk to the train station and nearly 20 minutes to reach most of the places we want to visit. My friend and I love the apartment very much. We will recommend it to our friends."),
("2016-04-30", "5993432", "Margaret", "Hugo's place is conveniently located near Kings Cross train station  and is about a 15 minute walk to the heart of Sydney CBD. It's close to the supermarkets and restaurants  everything one can ask for. The apartment is small but has everything that you need. Hugo's friend Oliver introduced my mum and I to the apartment while Hugo was away but both were available via text and Airbnb when I had queries. I would highly recommend Hugo's apartment. "),
("2016-05-04", "5993432", "Ignacio", "hugo`s place iTs a great place!!really nice home and really close to train station  also you can just walk to the best areas in city  the house its really full equiped and ready to stay!we didnt know hugo  but he gave a contact to help us in everything!!! (thanks Oliver you were great!!) if you are going to Sydney  this house its a must! !"),
("2016-05-08", "5993432", "Georgia", "Hugo's place was lovely! Exactly as he described and a great size for the two of us. It's far enough out of the city so you don't have the noise and traffic but still in close enough distance to public transport  supermarkets  and tourist attractions. It's also an easy walking distance to the city which we loved. I would highly recommend this place to people who are planning on getting out of their accommodation and exploring Sydney because for me it was a small space to be in for long periods of time. Having said that though  it was very liveable and comfortable! Thanks again to Hugo  and thanks to Oliver for being very hospitable on our arrival. "),
("2016-05-20", "5993432", "Katherine", "Thank you to both Hugo and Oliver for a great stay in Darlinghurst. Oliver was welcoming and friendly. Hugo also went above and beyond to help us out when we couldn't figure out the internet :) The place was lovely and set up well for our arrival. Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2016-05-28", "5993432", "Christine & Thomas", "The flat is perfect and very well located.  We enjoy the lovely king cross market recommended by Hugo. We really enjoy our week in this suburb."),
("2016-06-01", "5993432", "Cosmo", "I enjoyed my stay here. Hugo's place was cool and comfortable. Everything you need in an accessible location. Hugo was flexible and easy to deal with."),
("2016-06-11", "5993432", "Bill", "Hugo's place was very nice and very clean  and he went out of his way to make the stay easy and enjoyable. He was great at keeping in touch and I felt like he was available for help at any time (though I didn't need it.) The neighborhood itself was wonderful  and getting around Sydney was a breeze with Kings Cross station right down the road. Highly recommended."),
("2016-06-24", "5993432", "Rosa", "Falta un punt de llum per poder llegir."),
("2016-06-28", "5993432", "Emma", "Hugo was out of town so arranged a friend to meet us at the apartment when we arrived. It was very easy to get to (we walked from St. James station) and in a nice neighbourhood. The building/apartment is very secure and in a good central location.  Good places to eat close by  Bloody Mary's for breakfast was a great spot.Also probably the most comfortable bed I've ever slept in! "),
("2016-07-03", "5993432", "Jodie", "Both Hugo and Oliver were very helpful.The apartment was clean and tidy and had everything we needed for our stay. The location was perfect as it was a short walk from a lot of things. The train station  shops and restaurants were only a few minutes walk away  and it was a 25minute walk from the Botanical Gardens and the Opera House."),
("2016-07-10", "5993432", "Aneesh", "Great location and nice apartment. Hugo and Oliver were both very helpful and responsive. Perfect for walking to the CBD  museums  and parks  with easy access to public transit."),
("2016-08-13", "5993432", "Isabelle", "Didn't get to meet Hugo but his friend Ollie is really friendly and Hugo was easily contactable. Apartment was really nice and location was convenient. I would highly recommend!"),
("2016-08-18", "5993432", "Anastassia", "Lovely stay at Hugo's cozy apartment. Hugo and his friend Oliver were extremely responsive  helpful  and reassuring. The apartment was exactly as expected based on the listing. My boyfriend and I really enjoyed our stay and would come back anytime."),
("2016-08-22", "5993432", "Charlotte", "Really recommend Hugo's place. It's in the best location  and had all the things we needed for a short stay. Really clean and couldn't fault anything. Great communication with both Hugo and Oliver.  One of the best value places I've stayed in Sydney. "),
("2016-08-23", "5993432", "David", "It was a very good place to stay  a good desk  TV and DVD  comfy bed.  And a great location  too.Oliver (who met me) was very helpful.It was a fraction on the small side for my liking for an extended stay.  Regarding the kitchen  I'd rather not leave a permanent comment about a fixable problem  but I'd ask Hugo about the microwave and oven if you are planning to heat food."),
("2016-09-04", "5993432", "Carly", "We really enjoyed our stay because Hugo was very accommodating with our check in and check out time. It was a very central location. The apartment was spacious and the wifi was good."),
("2016-09-06", "5993432", "Monica", "Didn't get a chance to meet Hugo  however Oliver met with my friend and I and was very pleasant. He offered to show us around and was there when we needed him. Hugo was just a phone call away and was very accommodating.The place itself had everything you need  very great location. Literally 5 min walk from the train station which connects to everything. It's a nice town  there are always people walking around so you feel safe. Our wifi shut off one night and we contacted Hugo in the morning and he immediately had it taken care of even refunded a night for the inconvenience when he didn't have to. Definutely a great Host  would recommend. "),
("2016-09-10", "5993432", "Juliana", "Hugo is easy going  really flexible to arrange check in and check out. The place is great  good location and clean. We really liked our stay. We recommend it!"),
("2016-09-19", "5993432", "Chris", "Great stay. Quiet for this part of town and clean throughout. Thanks guys!"),
("2016-10-03", "5993432", "Lucia", "Our second visit - once again enjoyable and Oliver extremely helpful and generous with his time."),
("2016-10-13", "5993432", "Alex P", "Modern old apartment block with absolute peace time quiet ability to block out any city life. Full mini kitchenette and business desk plus couch relax area combo. Massive main room with an offset seperate bedroom with full fresh air if desired. Thank you : )"),
("2016-10-19", "5993432", "Pete", "Great little place. The location is perfect  lots to do near by and the train service at kings Cross is super handy. The hosts are top as well."),
("2016-10-21", "5993432", "Myeng", "Even after our flight getting delayed and shifting our schedules around  Hugo and Oliver have been very patient and generous to us on our arrival. The place is located in a very convenient location sitting in between CBD and Surry Hills  and has nice cafes and restaurants close by. The apartment is very clean and was more than spacious for two of us. Their couch is a perfect for a quick nap while watching TV. It's a quiet neighborhood and had no problem falling asleep day and night.Would definitely use again for our next visit to Sydney."),
("2016-10-23", "5993432", "Laura", "Oliver was very helpful  friendly and accommodating. Location was fabulous and the apartment was gorgeous  had everything we needed for our stay."),
("2016-10-27", "5993432", "David", "3rd time I've stayed here says it all.Now with a microwave - thanks Hugo!"),
("2016-10-29", "5993432", "Sarah", "We had a great little stay at Hugo's place. It was perfect for a couple  very comfortable and very clean.  Great location in regards to transport (very close to the Kings Cross train station)  cafes  supermarket etc.  We felt safe aswell.  I walked from the apartment to the Opera House  and it was a great walk via Darlinghurst St and through the Botanical Gardens. Thank you Oliver for meeting me to handover keys and instructions.  "),
("2016-11-03", "5993432", "Jory And Brandon", "Great little place in central location. Helpful hosts. Thank you!"),
("2016-11-10", "5993432", "Matthew", "This place was great! Convenient access to public transport and within a long walk of the harbor.  The bed was very comfortable and it was a perfect place for 2.  Highly recommend for exploring the town."),
("2016-11-14", "5993432", "Montana", "Our trip was improved tenfold by the friendliness and hospitality of Hugo & Oliver. The space is beautifully decorated and conveniently located near hubs of cafe's  shops and transport. The hosts went above and beyond to ensure our stay was as comfortable and easy as possible. We cannot speak highly enough of our experience. "),
("2016-11-17", "5993432", "John", "Hugo and Ollie made my first air BnB experience a good one  clean tidy apartment close to everything.. would recommended to others for sure!"),
("2016-11-19", "5993432", "Dariush", "Hugo's apartment is in a great location  walking distance from kings cross station  cafes and restaurants. The apartment itself is small and basic  a perfect crash pad if you plan to explore sydney and it's food and bar scene  but not a place you would want to spend relaxation time in. Hugo was very friendly and accommodating. "),
("2016-11-22", "5993432", "Stephanee", "Great location!"),
("2016-12-08", "5993432", "Alanna", "Hugo's is a great space  everything you could possibly need for 1-2 people  amazing location with everything at your fingertips and amenable hosts. I had a great stay and would recommend to others!"),
("2016-12-15", "5993432", "David", "I'm a regular visitor to Sydney and a regular at Hugo's  too.  It's one of the first places I look up when I'm planning a trip.  This time full marks for bending over backwards to help me check in conveniently."),
("2016-12-19", "5993432", "Gabriel", "Nice small flat within easy walking distance to Kings Cross station  good bed -  very comfortable matrass. Recommended to stay for a few days."),
("2017-01-28", "5993432", "Saskia", "Hugo's place is perfectly located for getting around Sydney  but equally for staying in the area; so many bars and restaurants and shops  you won't need to leave. The Opera House is only a 30 minute walk away - or 5 minutes by train! Bondi beach is 2 stops away by train.The apartment is lovely; especially for single travelers. The bed is really comfy  it's got everything you need  and check in and out was easy-peasy.I would recommend Hugo's place to anyone!"),
("2017-02-01", "5993432", "Renee", "The location is great. Coles is right next to the place which opens till 12am everyday. If you walk out to Surry  you will find nice restaurants and bars. The place is cute and quite spacious for two people. It looks exactly same as the pictures on the website. However  the entire building is quite old  which makes sense that the place cannot be completely free from cockroaches and other bugs. There is a rule that you should use one towel per person over your stay  otherwise you are expected to leave a few towels for the next guests."),
("2017-02-03", "5993432", "Giulia", "Perfect locations  in the same street there are a lots of bars and restaurants. I haven't meet Hugo  but a friend of his made the check in for him  really nice person. Both of them were so nice to me and answered all my questions. The apartment is cozy and perfect for 1 person or a couple. "),
("2017-02-06", "5993432", "Stéphanie", "Great location! Very central  animated and lively part of the city. We had a very pleasant stay and we thanks Oliver for his warm welcome and good advices. There is a great spot to buy ice cream around the corner. Don't miss it!"),
("2017-02-10", "5993432", "Corey", "Hugo's place was great! Spacious and modern for two people  comfy bed  cute location  walkable to central or to bus transportation to the beach  close to a grocery store  had power adapters for us to use  check-in was very easy (with Oliver)  WIFI  even had an umbrella we could use in the rain! I would highly recommend staying here. :) "),
("2017-02-12", "5993432", "Karan", "Oliver was really great and flexible in checking me in. Available on (Hidden by Airbnb) . Helped me hold on to my bags during my last day before going to the airport. Apartment was spacious with a nice kitchenette and seating area. Near to kings cross transit."),
("2017-02-17", "5993432", "Sunny", "This place is great  close to everything - transportation  Coles  cafes and restaurants. I loved the wooden floor and interior  it's very cozy and I loved it. Oliver and Hugo responses very quickly  there was no communication problem. The only downside was bugs - cockroaches. So we sprayed insecticide  like every morning before we left. "),
("2017-02-23", "5993432", "David", "Hugo's is one of my favourite places to stay in Sydney.  I love the comfy couch to chill out on while watching TV/DVD  and the amount of bench/storage spaces to dump and stow my gear - and to find it again."),
("2017-02-26", "5993432", "Jimmy", "Great value and location"),
("2017-03-02", "5993432", "Norris", "The place we stay for 4nights location is very central  about5 mins walk to the train station but the room condition is not good enough a little bite old design for everything the day we check in  host already tell us  we may be see some cockroach around the kitchen area then use the spray to spray them but that is not a good method the hosts must do something stop the cockroach.we will not recommen to any one else for this apartment "),
("2017-03-05", "5993432", "David", "Awesome central location close to everything. Despite being in the thick of it the residence is still quiet and getting a good nights sleep is a breeze. Thoroughly recommended."),
("2017-03-08", "5993432", "Daniel", "The apartment is very well located  you can walk to some main attractions  close to public transport and places to eat. Oliver and Hugo very good hosts."),
("2017-03-12", "5993432", "Bridget", "Awesome private little apartment. So close to Kings Cross station  it made everything so so easy. Oliver was really friendly and accommodating. "),
("2017-03-18", "5993432", "Pam", "Great location near Kings Cross."),
("2017-03-22", "5993432", "Cliff", "Awesome location! We were able to walk to the kings cross train stop. Street had lots of cute cafes and restaurants. It was a short walk to a local grocery store. There was a small refrigerator but no freezer. We found bugs in the kitchen and living space. When we notified the host and he told us that Sydney is known for its cockroaches. He thought the increase in rain over the last several weeks made it worse. He told us he would remedy the situation. Overall  a fine location for a few days. We loved Sydney! "),
("2017-03-25", "5993432", "Anna", "Hugo's place was clean  easily accessible by public transport  beautifully presented and perfect location. We would definitely return for a second stay. Hugo himself is polite and eager to help in anyway. Thank you for having us. "),
("2017-03-31", "5993432", "Jilian", "A lovely and central apartment. Comfortable and well equipped. Loved the very cute bedroom nook. I was warned beforehand that the bath was leaking  but all the rest worked fine. The place is dark  but the bed is next to a big window so you don't suffer from it. "),
("2017-05-06", "5993432", "Eddie", "Brilliant place for a single or couple travelling. Good location for everything."),
("2017-05-12", "5993432", "Jp", "The place was nice and close to the train since I work in CBD. Lots of good restaurants around."),
("2017-05-18", "5993432", "Kate", "Great location  safe  simple but everything you need! "),
("2017-05-24", "5993432", "Kurt", "great value  location is epic. "),
("2017-05-26", "5993432", "David", "It's always convenient to stay in this apartment."),
("2017-06-03", "5993432", "Chenrui", "1.in the room for 3min I witnessed COCKROACH on the kitchen table  living room wall  working space desk  the following days cockroaches are common also in bathroom  the LED screen of the oven( I doubt there's is a nest inside of the oven  cuz they come in and out from the oven door  and host even said to other ppl according to reviews cockroaches are well known in Sydney) COCKROACH IN ALL SIZE EVERYWHERE IN THE ROOM 2. Plastic used bottle under the curtain  ate fruit core next to the living room TV apparently there is a big problem with cleaning service. TRASH SCATTERED IN THE ROOMI've been in the Airbnb in downtown too there isn't any situation like this. 3. Good side you have a HUGE TV  and a soft bed. The heater is handy. Used to dry my hand drying clothes. Location next to the king cross  I can not say it is super downtown cuz it wasn't that central. But it is a bar&a restaurant street. Dominio  in walking distance 4. The downstairs shared public washing machine is right next to the trash place with all over the dead giant body of cockroaches. You don't want to wash your clothe there. I did all my laundry by hands.5 bathroom shower tap always leaking + the water sink in a TERRIBLE design+ cockroach activating zone. I CANT BEAR TO SHOWER IN SUCH A PLACE. Design:One tap with super hot water another one with super cold water. How am I able to mix them up by hands? I WONT RECOMMEND THIS PLACE UNTIL THEY SORT OUT THE COCKROACHES PROBLEM!"),
("2017-07-07", "5993432", "Thomas", "Appartement très sympa et très bien situé"),
("2017-07-19", "5993432", "White", "非常好的房源 位置很方便 房屋设施便利"),
("2017-08-10", "5993432", "Mar", "A cozy space situated in the heart of the city  the apartment was a great place to stay in. The apartment was well set up for my four day stay  reasonably quiet  and was close enough to restaurants and public transport."),
("2017-08-12", "5993432", "Nicola", "Oliver was very easy to deal with  friendly and gave great recommendations around the area. The house was very clean  had everything you would need. Very central location. Can be a tad noisy during the night during the weekend "),
("2017-08-23", "5993432", "Eva", "Appartement idéalement situé à a peine 5min à pied de la station king cross. Parfait pour rayonner dans la ville en utilisant les transports en communs. Sinon  à pied  il faut compter 30min pour rejoindre le CBD  ce qui est plutôt cool ! Contrairement à ce que certaines personnes m'avaient dit  le quartier de king cross ne craint pas. Je ne me suis jamais sentie en insécurité  même tard le soir.L'appartement est très sympa  lit confortable  grande cuisine  télévision  machine à laver pour 3$ au Rez de chaussé. Le seul inconvénient est la baignoire qui commence à être vieille et rouillée  mais cela reste amplement suffisant pour prendre une douche. L'hôte est très sympathique et attentionné  donne de bonnes recommandations et s'assure que tout se passe bien et que l'on ne manque de rien par message. Je recommande ce logement ! "),
("2017-08-27", "5993432", "Stuart", "Great place. Great location. Fantastic people to deal with. Highly recommend!"),
("2017-09-01", "5993432", "David", "Love staying here  it has everything I need."),
("2017-09-20", "5993432", "David", "I always appreciate staying at Hugo's apartment."),
("2017-09-26", "5993432", "Sylvia", "Thanks boys!Very cute apartment and photos don't do it justice Very convenient and you were very accommodatingAppreciate the last minute booking and enjoyed our stay! Sylvia and Gabe x"),
("2017-10-13", "5993432", "Mai-Anh", "Clean  comfortable and in a convenient location. Thank you Hugo for the wonderful stay!"),
("2017-10-15", "5993432", "Derry", "Thanks Hugo and Ollie - great little apartment in a super location. Ollie was very gracious with my late arrival. A top host!"),
("2017-10-21", "5993432", "Danielle", "Great location"),
("2017-11-05", "5993432", "Emily", "Brilliant location  perfect for a week of exploring Sydney. Lovely host with great knowledge of the area too! Thank you  I would definitely recommend "),
("2017-11-08", "5993432", "Mary And Gary", "Hugo's place is in a great location to were I needed to be and perfect for my needs. Recommended to anyone wanting to be be in the centre of the city experience."),
("2017-11-14", "5993432", "Raoni", "localização bem central em Sydney. Dá para ir a pé à maioria das atrações turísticas e fica perto da estação de metrô. O apartamento tem tudo  confortável. Recomendo."),
("2017-11-16", "5993432", "Chris", "Thanks to Hugo  and Ollie  who welcomed me and showed me the ropes.  Great location  close to the CBD  the Cross  the train   was comfortable and has everything needed for a busy stay in Sydney.   Cheers Chris"),
("2017-11-22", "5993432", "Tom And Cecilia", "Hugo's place is great  very clean  and fabulous location in Sydney.  We especially like the closeness to the Metro station  bus routes  and cafes and shopps at Kings Cross and Victoria Street.  The nearby gyms gave me free passes...wonderful!"),
("2017-12-03", "5993432", "Solène", "Appartement très bien situé et chaleureux. Hugo est très accueillant et prêt à vous conseiller sur votre séjour à Sydney. Le quartier est vivant mais l’appartement est calme et permet de se reposer après des journées bien remplies."),
("2017-12-10", "5993432", "Xuan", "I enjoyed my stay in Sydney! The host is very concerned and friendly! The location of the place is the heart of the city and has many chic and yummy bars and restaurant nearby. Many public transportation options are around the area that made my traveling extremely easy!"),
("2017-12-19", "5993432", "Robert", "Everything was perfect.  A great base for exploring Sydney or just to stay in and chill if you need a break from the road.  I would definitely stay here again!"),
("2017-12-23", "5993432", "Mark", "We loved staying at Hugo’s place. Awesome location. Close to transport  bars  restaurants. Comfortable bed. It had everything we needed. Great communication. We’ll definitely stay again"),
("2018-01-02", "5993432", "Matthew", "Thankyou Hugo and Ollie for having us at your Art Deco. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay and being so close to everything was a huge bonus. Will be requesting to stay here again next time!"),
("2018-01-06", "5993432", "Manuel", "Hugo & Ollie's place is just perfectly located for exploring Sydney with the bustling Kings Cross just around the corner and lots of food and party options. And to top it all off  they are just the perfect hosts with great local tips and they make you feel really welcome. And definite recommendation for your stay in Sydney"),
("2018-01-18", "5993432", "Julien", "Good"),
("2018-02-05", "5993432", "Benjamin", "Good place to stay"),
("2018-02-09", "5993432", "Anthony", "Ollie is a fantastic host! The place is perfect and located centrally to near everything by either walking or transit."),
("2018-02-16", "5993432", "Cedric", "I had a excellent stay at Hugo’s place. The studio is cosy and the location is perfect."),
("2018-02-21", "5993432", "Juan", "Excelent host and great location. Easy from the very first moment. A place that I will be booking next time I travel back to Sydney"),
("2018-02-26", "5993432", "Larry & Ti Juan", "I enjoyed my stay at Hugo’s place. It is exactly as pictured and situated in a great neighborhood surrounded by countless shops and restaurants  even a glorious supermarket that’s worth a visit just to browse. It’s easily accessible from the airport by subway train  just 3 or 4 blocks from where you get off. I was given excellent directions to the apartment  which is in a very secure building  up one flight of stairs. The unit was very clean  the water instantly hot and the strongest water pressure I’ve ever seen. The large desk and ample countertop made it really handy to spread things out  set up the laptop  etc. The wifi was fast. I didn’t watch any TV but there’s a huge one in front of a comfy sofa. The bedroom isn’t overly spacious but it has a large  comfortable bed and was more than adequate for me. I especially appreciated the room-darkening draperies in the bedroom. The place is quite quiet for being so close to the action outdoors. Ollie was a great host. He gave me a Sydney guidebook and pointed out places of interest  which was especially appreciated given that I hadn’t planned much in advance. He lives just a couple of doors down  so he’s at your service whenever needed. When I foolishly locked myself out  he was promptly there to let me back in. I highly recommend Hugo’s place to anyone. You could pay a lot more and stay at a place like the Waldorf Astoria. But I don’t like to pay a fortune for lodging when I can get a perfectly suitable place like this for a reasonable price."),
("2018-02-28", "5993432", "Wafa", "I thoroughly enjoyed my stay here and although I did not meet Hugo  Ollie was amazing in every way.  He went above and  beyond to provide me with information and suggestions and help me in every way he could.  I gained a new friend in the process too.  The apartment is very conveniently located and the bed really comfortable.  I walked to most places and took the bus or train at other times.  This was my first visit in Sydney and it was a blast.  Thank you  guys."),
("2018-03-05", "5993432", "Cameron", "Very responsive and helpful host. Apartment and building are vintage - a little rough around the edges  but clean  comfy  and nice to come home to at the end of the day. Building is safe (front door key access). Note - there is no freezer  and bedroom does not have a door (a thick curtain instead). Also - the bedroom is well circulated by the breeze if you leave the window open  but light sleepers might be interrupted by street noise (window opens to an alley between this building and the next). Small desk fan in lounge room works just fine  but not sure how building would be in summer (no a/c). Bathroom very well stocked with toiletries  and bedroom has handy shelving/hangers for clothes. A 10 minute leisurely walk straight to Oxford St. Good value for money given the location. A cute retro apartment."),
("2018-03-11", "5993432", "Lawrence", "Great little unit. Close to everything."),
("2018-03-17", "5993432", "Grace", "Great location  close to public transport and city. Host was excellent  would definitely recommend"),
("2018-03-21", "5993432", "Rocio Vanesa", "Muy lindo el departamento  perfecto para una pareja. Muy buena ubicación."),
("2018-03-28", "5993432", "Benjamin", "Appartement calme et très bien situé pour un séjour touristique à Sydney."),
("2018-03-29", "5993432", "Peter & Nancy", "Ollie was my host  and he was hugely friendly  helpful and prompt. I love the location of this apartment  and used it as my base for two nights and walked everywhere from there.The bed is really comfortable  and lots of hot water in the shower... two of my priorities!If you aren't looking for something fancy  but highly affordable and well located  this is the place for you."),
("2018-04-05", "5993432", "Puck", "We had a great time at Hugo's place. The apartment is central and has everything you need. The communication with Hugo was perfect. Would def go back!"),
("2018-04-13", "5993432", "Peter", "An amazing abode in an amazing location with an amazing host . Highly recommended ."),
("2018-04-23", "5993432", "Esther", "It is a great stay in Hugo’s place.The location is perfect and Ollie is very nice. Will definitely stay here again :)"),
("2018-05-03", "5993432", "Beth And Ryan", "This is a small sweet vintage apartment in a fantastic location. Super comfy  great value. Host is very helpful and responsive and great. I will stay again if I can next time I'm in Sydney!"),
("2018-05-11", "5993432", "Nici", "Such a good spot! Great location and beautiful little studio :)"),
("2018-05-22", "5993432", "Jindeok", "위치 전철역 근처라.  편하고 호스트 너무 좋았어요 근처 마켓도 친절하 알려주시구. 챙겨주셔서 gooood"),
("2018-05-27", "5993432", "Mandy", "The location was outstanding and meant I could walk everywhere!I also liked the apartment's New York vibe!"),
("2018-06-16", "5993432", "Alex", "Hugo’s flat is good value for money and has a great location  only a few hundred metres from Kings Cross station and 15 minutes walk into the city.The flat faces an internal courtyard which means it is a little on the dark side but also very quiet - much more than you would expect in this location.Hugo and Ollie were great hosts and very helpful  especially when we accidentally left something behind. In summary the flat was ideally suited for what we wanted - a not-too-expensive apartment close to the city and train."),
("2018-07-08", "5993432", "Thomas", "Was really nice. All you could wish for"),
("2018-07-25", "5993432", "Robbie", "This location is amazing  just 300m to the Kings Cross train station  and within short walking distance to pubs  cafes  and grocery mart.  The place was very functional  perfect for cooking my own meals at times during my 15 night stay.  The shower's water pressure was very strong and the hot water almost instantaneous (having a bathtub was a nice bonus).  The bed was very comfy with extra linens at hand  including plenty of large bath towels.  The oven didn't work nor was there a freezer as (both) stated in the printed instructions  but that didn't deter me from creating nice meals during my visit.  The portable space heater worked in a pinch when temperatures dropped a bit during the winter nights.  The unit backs onto a alleyway so not much natural light  but the interior lighting flooded the apartment nicely.  The apartment was very quiet  and very peaceful  just perfect after a busy day or night about town.  Check-in was a breeze  Ollie readily accommodated my early arrival and arrived seconds within my announced arrival on-site.  Ollie was very helpful  provided guide books in the unit and provided me with his own travel insight on places to visit in the local area.  Ollie was also quick to inquire about linen changes mid week  their laundering  including for bath towels.  Ollie was always just a text message away to offer any assistance when needed.  In summary  this place and Ollie as a host  made for a lovely hassle free 15 night stay in Sydney.  I definitely recommend this charming little place and I would return again.  "),
("2018-08-03", "5993432", "Samuel", "Fantastic place to stay for those looking to explore Sydney  or those in town for work. Easy walk into CBD and great transport links. Apartment is clean and looks as per photos. Hosts were responsive and friendly throughout "),
("2018-08-06", "5993432", "Teresa", "The apartment is minutes away from the train station. It has a lockable from door to the building so very safe for solo travellers. It’s in an older building but maintained and all part of the Art Deco charm. Was very quiet at night. I’d stay again."),
("2018-08-13", "5993432", "Mellie", "Ollie and Hugo are hosts with the most! This property is well positioned ~ close to city  public transport and some great restaurants and cafes. It was welcoming  warm and secure. I loved my stay and have no qualms in recommending this Airbnb and the hosts. Thanks guys ~ I’ll be back!Mellie"),
("2018-08-18", "5993432", "Glenn", "Great location very communicative host"),
("2018-10-05", "5993432", "Emma", "Such a great place in a great location. Ollie is a really great guy and easy to get ahold of if need be."),
("2018-10-08", "5993432", "Se Ho", "good location  clean rooms  kind host. Everything is perfect!"),
("2018-11-16", "5993432", "Yasuhiro", "I stayed Hugo's place for five weeks. Few minutes to Kings Cross Station or takes only about 20min to CBD. Great place for exploring Sydney. There is almost everything you need in the room. Public washing machine is located in down stairs you will need three one dollar coins to use washing machine. Unfortunately I could not use internet for 4weeks due to failure but Hugo gave me a refund for recharge my data-usage for hotspot."),
("2018-11-23", "5993432", "Chloe", "Great little apartment in Sydney. Super close to Kings Cross area for restaurants and bars. As well as several local cafes around. Not a bad walk into the actual city city (20-25mins depending on pace/destination and route). Communication was really good and we were able to leave our bags until our flight (obviously subject to booking demands). Convenient transport links nearby as well. Makes for a very good base to explore Sydney!"),
("2018-12-01", "5993432", "Elliot", "Beautiful space  stylish and great location. Awesome hosts always quick to respond and happy to help"),
("2018-12-12", "5993432", "Angus", "Great location  just a 20 min walk into the CBD and nearby many shops. Neat  tidy  no frills place with great communication from Hugo and Ollie. Perfect for a place to sleep while in the city."),
("2018-12-30", "5993432", "Jasmin", "Ollie war ein sehr zuvorkommender Gastgeber. Das Check-in war unkompliziert. Er fragte gleich am nächsten Morgen nach ob alles in Ordnung ist. Bei Fragen stand er uns immer zur Verfügung. An Silvester durften wir auf der Dachterasse ein paar Häuser weiter an eine von ihm organisierte Party mit super Blick fürs Feuerwerk! Nochmals vielen Dank dafür!"),
("2019-01-01", "5993432", "Katie", "Great location for New Year’s Eve!"),
("2019-01-13", "5993432", "Sinead", "A lovely apartment with everything you could need and more. The hosts were so friendly and extra helpful when we wanted to extend our stay. Fantastic location  20 min walk to Sydney harbour and right beside train station and shops. Would highly recommend."),
("2019-01-22", "5993432", "Anne Sophie", "The location was very convenient and communication with the host wast fast and easy. We felt very welcome  Ollie was helpful and super accomodating for check in/out. Would book again if visiting the area  thanks Hugo & Ollie for a great stay!"),
("2019-01-29", "5993432", "Ochir", "I liked Hugo and Ollie’s apartment. It’s small  convenient and in great neighborhood  close to metro  supermarkets  cafes and bars. I would definitely stay here!"),
("2019-02-02", "5993432", "Ahi", "Cute  charming and comfy haunt to chillax in. Neat design touches  (Hidden by Airbnb) worthy and close to everything. Highly recommend."),
("2019-02-09", "5993432", "Celine", "This apartment is very well equiped and easy to live. There is one detail we did appreciate: there are USB plugs available! It may be a detail but we’re French and we need adaptors for all our devices. With USB plugs things were easier for us. This shows the nice attitude towards people who stay at this apartment. It is very well located also. Close to bars  restaurants and food shops. We loved staying there. And on the top of that we loved meeting Ollie we were talking with. He was here to warmly welcome us when we arrived. He was very reactive with messages and helped us with information about things to do (special thanks for the markets Ollie ). He also booked a taxi for us. And we had conversations through Airbnb chat about our days. That was so nice! Thank you very much Ollie "),
("2019-02-13", "5993432", "Amelia", "Great place to stay in Sydney in the centre of everything. Ollie was amazing with check in and out.Thanks!"),
("2015-09-06", "6046461", "Isabelle", "Suzie was most welcoming  and our first Airbnb experience couldn't have gone better. The apartment is exquisitely furnished and feels very homey. It's posh yet comfy. The bed (including the bedding) is on par with upper-scale hotels. Suzie gave us a lot of privacy but was readily available to answer any question. The bathroom for our own usage also has the feel of chic hotels  with an assortment of high-end products. The location is great  between Wynward Station and Darling Harbour. The room is next to a road  but soundproofing is good and I slept well even without using ear plugs (Suzie provides high quality ear plugs should you need them). To sum up  my sister and I would go back in a heart beat.  "),
("2015-10-26", "6046461", "Jessie", "Sydney has stolen a piece of my heart. It was such a pleasure to stay with Suzie in her gorgeous  well- kept home. Her place was filled with charm and great details that made you feel like you were in a 5* hotel. The bed was exquisite and Suzie went the extra mile to make sure I had everything I needed to make my stay comfortable. Suzie was the most wonderful hostess! She gave great directions  offered ideas of what to do and also gave me space to do my own thing. She lives in a great area that is close to most of the major tourist attractions. I would definitely consider staying here again."),
("2015-11-02", "6046461", "James", "Absolutely brilliant experience from the second I arrived to the second I left.The apartment is beautiful and immaculately clean.Suzie met me upon arrival around 7am and was so helpful in orientation and advice of the area.The location is ideal- 5 minutes to the centre of the CBD.This is my favorite Airbnb house and host so far and would absolutely return to stay again on my next trip to Sydney!!Thank you Suzie!!"),
("2015-11-09", "6046461", "Patrea", "Suzie was very welcoming - meeting me at the entrance to the building and showing me around the unit. Suzie's place is very tastefully decorated and well appointed. It was very well located for where I had to go and I felt safe walking around the area. It is close to a busy road so there is a bit of background noise - so the earplugs are useful for sleeping! Very comfortable bed. Suzie was relaxed about having me stay around on the Sunday while I did some work. I enjoyed our chats. I'd recommend staying with Suzie."),
("2015-11-14", "6046461", "David", "Suzie was a brilliant host. Her apartment is well situated providing walking access to most CBD locations. Her apartment is tastefully furnished  clean and tidy. The added bonus for me was internet access included. David"),
("2015-11-17", "6046461", "Karen", "Quedarme en el departamento de Suzie  durante mi primer fin de semana en Sydney  fue perfecto! Suzie me mandó con tiempo las indicaciones adecuadas para llegar a su departamento y estuvo atenta a mi llegada. Me enseñó todo lo necesario para sentirme cómoda en el edificio y me ayudó en la elección de los horarios y recorridos de los buses  del tren y de los ferrys. Fue una gran ayuda al organizar mis paseos. El departamento está a un paso de Darling Harbour  con restaurantes  cafés y varias atracciones. Una estación del ferry está a 5 minutos. Es un barrio muy central y accesible  muy cerca del metro y buses. El departamento es precioso. La pieza es tal como la muestra en su aviso y llegar a descansar a esa cama después de 8 horas de caminar por Sydney  fue el broche de oro de unos días geniales! Volvería feliz a Sydney y de todas maneras a ese ""lovely room""! Gracias Suzie! "),
("2015-11-25", "6046461", "Julianna", "I am still under a great impression from my stay at Suzie's place: I enjoyed it a lot! She is the most caring host: pro-active  kind and welcoming. The real life experience exceeded far beyond my expectations. The place is located in the heart of Sydney: in the safe  clean and beautiful neighborhood  right next to the Harbor. The room is light  spacious  clean  and well-decorated.  I'd like to thank Suzie for her hospitality  it was a lovely stay! Thanks! "),
("2015-12-03", "6046461", "Bettina", "Suzie's appartments is very central  beautifully furnished and homely. The bedroom is generous and guests have their own bathroom. Everything was spotless. Suzie is very friendly  caring and easy to connect with. It was lovely to stay with her and will definitely come back again some time in the future. "),
("2015-12-06", "6046461", "Pierre", "A gorgeous and stylish apartment perfectly located for business or fun right in the heart of Sydney. Suzie is a delightful host - despite being busy with her own work  found time to provide a warm welcome and orientation tour from the stunning balcony overlooking town. Comfy bed  full privacy with own bathroom fully appointed with all the luxuries and conveniences of a 5-star hotel."),
("2016-02-21", "6046461", "Carolina", "Suzie is a great hostess  very pleasant and ready to assist you if you need any help. Her apartment is extremely well located  within walking distance to the city as well as public transportation if needed. It is also lovely furnished and the room in question is very comfortable and spacious. I highly recommend it!"),
("2016-02-26", "6046461", "Tanja", "I really enjoyed my stay at Suzies place. A very  very clean  well located and stilish place to be. Suzie was very supporting and carrying and offered by the way a delcious breakfast. Also she was very flexible regarding extending my stay and finally the check out time.An unreservedly recommended place for the perfect sydney Trip. Thanks a lot Suzie for being such a fabolous host!Tanja "),
("2016-03-02", "6046461", "Anna", "Suzie was an incredibly welcoming host  giving me tips on how to see the city and providing a comfortable home for me to stay in for a few days. The location of the apartment is ideal for exploring Sydney's CBD and the Darling Harbour area. "),
("2016-03-22", "6046461", "Toke", "I had a great stay at Suzie's airbnb. Suzie is really nice and helpful. She does a lot to make you feel at home and the room is great. The apartment is located very well in City close to the harbour  and everything is within walking distance."),
("2016-04-11", "6046461", "Adrien", "Un séjour parfait chez Suzie !L'appartement est très joli et très bien situé à 2 pas de Darling Harbour.J'ai également été très bien accueilli par Suzie !Elle a été aux petits soins pour moi  et m'a indiquée avec précision et enthousiasme les lieux à voir de Sydney.Bref un hôte à recommender si vous voulez visiter Sydney !!!"),
("2016-05-04", "6046461", "Fangwei Ivy", "I told Suzie that this is prob my best Airbnb experience. Generally I had busy schedule in Sydney so I didnt spend a lot of time staying in the apartment. However every pieces of the furniture is absolutely amazing and they make the place so unique I think. Also I love the little budda in her balcony. My bedroom is very comfy and I have own private restroom!!! Suzie is a super nice host and I told her that I will def call her next time when I visit Sydney. Thank you so much Suzie"),
("2016-05-31", "6046461", "Dave", "I had an excellent experience staying with Suzie. Suzie's apartment was very well kept and quite comfortable. It was located in a great area that had a lot of energy  which was great for site seeing. And Suzie's hospitality was excellent. She made sure I had everything I needed to have a good time during my stay. Thanks Suzie!"),
("2016-06-07", "6046461", "Claudia", "A lovely home away from home. Great host. Perfect location."),
("2016-06-12", "6046461", "Bill", "Suzie was a great host.  She has a beautiful apartment in Sydney and was very close to everything I needed.  Wish I could've stayed longer."),
("2016-07-26", "6046461", "Johnny", "Suzie was an amazing host. The listing accurately describes the property. Suzie was extremely organised and made the check-in and arrival process a breeze. Highly recommended!"),
("2016-07-30", "6046461", "Deepak", "Great house. Very neat and organised. Absolutely enjoyed my stay here. Will stay again if I come to Sydney again."),
("2016-08-03", "6046461", "Erica", "Suzie was a lovely host and I will be back. She did a great job checking me in  making sure I knew where everything was & ensuring I knew how to get to my destination the following morning.The room was lovely  bed ridiculously comfortable & those pillows were just right. She had everything you needed & more.Thank you for having me Suzie."),
("2016-08-27", "6046461", "Tim", "Really wonderful stay!I needed to be at Darling Harbour for work this week  and Suzie's place is right there. Perfect central CBD location.The room and the apartment are even nicer than described and shown n the photos. It's not a big place (expected in this location) but it's exquisitely appointed and meticulously clean. You get a room with a very comfy bed  and space to unpack your things. You also get your own bathroom with tub and shower. There's a sitting room  balcony: just really nice. And Suzie is lovely. I was very busy and we didn't cross paths much  but she was friendly and accommodating on the details of my arrival  and made it easy to live in her home for a few days. She added several nice touches  like fresh fruit in my room that was replenished.The only thing that might be a worry for some folks: this is a downtown location and there's a busy freeway nearby  which could be a problem if you're the sort of sleeper who needs absolute silence. But it's not a worry after all  as Suzie has a supply of earplugs in the bedside table!If you want a chic central apartment to be close to the action  Suzie's got your place."),
("2016-09-02", "6046461", "Nadia", "I really enjoyed staying at Suzie's. The bed was comfy  the decor was interesting and I felt very welcome. The apartment is close to transport  darling harbour  George St and lots of other city landmarks. I would happily stay with Suzie again. "),
("2016-09-11", "6046461", "Li", "Yes"),
("2016-09-14", "6046461", "David", "My stay at Suzie's was first rate.  The apartment is in a fantastic location and the room was everything (and more)as described in the listing. A very comfortable base for my 2 days in Sydney. Certainly my best AirBnb experience so far. I would heartily recommend and look forward to staying again in the future. Suzie is a great host!"),
("2016-09-18", "6046461", "Sheila", "Suzie was the most gracious host!  Her private room is spacious  cozy and clean.  Her home is in the best location for everything Sydney has to offer.  Ideal access to both the train and ferry systems and a block from the Darling Harbour waterfront.  "),
("2016-09-27", "6046461", "Luong", "Suzie was great. I had great communication with her from the start. She was also very flexible with my check in time. Her place is located near everything I wanted to see during my brief time in Sydney. It was also clean and I had my own bathroom. I would definitely stay here again."),
("2016-10-09", "6046461", "Brittany", "Suzie's apartment was a great stay! Everything was clean and the bed was comfortable. There is some noise at night from the road but it wasn't a problem for me. She has ear plugs if you are noise sensitive. Her place is a great location to explore the city by foot  ferry  or bus. Suzie was a reliable communicator and even let me check in early due to my flight arriving in the morning. She was very knowledgable about the area and answered any questions I had. "),
("2016-10-13", "6046461", "Mark", "Suzie's apartment is immaculately maintained  very comfortable and in a great location. She was easy to communicate with and was an excellent host. Highly recommended. "),
("2016-10-28", "6046461", "Fiona", "A lovely host and lovely apartment - I would highly recommend at stay at Suzie's. The guest facilities are excellent - with a very comfortable bedroom with ample storage  and full bathroom facilities for your private use. Although being in an extremely central location  the noise of the city traffic did not bother me in the slightest (I slept sooo soundly!). The location is excellent  with numerous restaurants/cafes and the Darling Harbour ferry service just a 2 minute stroll away. The nearest train station is only a short walk too. Suzie herself was a very warm and helpful  but also unobtrusive  host - perfect for this fairly independent traveller.I would certainly seek to stay again at Suzie's for any future visits to Sydney."),
("2016-11-05", "6046461", "Skye", "Suzie was a great host  she was very friendly and had some great tips on getting around. The apartment is in a great location  so close to the beautiful harbour and the city. I would definitely recommend staying here!"),
("2016-11-08", "6046461", "Fizz", "Suzie was great  making the time to meet me once I got into Sydney.  The flat is in a great location  right in the heart of everything  and absolutely immaculate.  The only thing to note is that if you're a very light sleeper then you may notice the traffic noise - although this wasn't a problem for me!"),
("2016-11-19", "6046461", "Kija", "The apartment was in the perfect location  close to the restaurants at Cockle Bay Wharf  5 minutes to the new mercantile walk restaurants and shopping  and a short ferry ride to circular quay. The apartment was comfortable  very clean and beautifully furnished. Suzie was a wonderful host."),
("2017-01-10", "6046461", "Ernest", "Suzie is a great host and has the best location in my opinion. She also accommodates the interests of her guest (s) and has great recommendations. I highly recommend her place. Thanks a bunch Suzie!"),
("2017-01-20", "6046461", "Dovi", "I had a great stay at Suzie's place. The apartment was beautiful and well located and Suzie was a gracious and helpful host!"),
("2017-01-31", "6046461", "Mitul", "Suzie was a great host and she gave great advice on a quick tour around the local area on my arrival. Although she went to work on the day I was leaving she managed to accommodate a reasonable check-out time for which I was grateful for. The apartment is exactly as shown in the pictures. There are a number of ornaments  paintings  books etc which add character to the place. The bed was comfortable and spacious with plenty of closet space. Although not an en-suite the private toilet/shower was also very clean and large with toiletries provided. There is a decent balcony area and large lounge/dining section  though I spent most of my time in my room so cannot really comment on this. As mentioned elsewhere  the bedroom is close to a busy highway and so traffic can be heard when the window is left open  and also a little noise can be heard at night when the window is shut...but I managed to sleep through this without an issue.The apartment is in Darling Harbour and a few minutes from the ferry stop which can be used to get good views of the Harbour Bridge/Opera House. There are many restaurants/bars/clubs a short walk from the apartment and the main city centre where all the shops are is about a 10-15 minute walk away. After visiting Sydney I personally thought that Darling Harbour was the best location to stay in and would not hesitate to recommend  Suzie's apartment to anyone!Mitul"),
("2017-02-09", "6046461", "Lauren", "Suzie was a very gracious and friendly host-- she even gave me a tour around the neighborhood when I arrived-- and her apartment was a beautiful space. I could not have found a better home base for my first stay in lovely Sydney. Definitely recommended for independent and curious visitors."),
("2017-06-18", "6046461", "Cara", "Beautiful place close to everything you could want. Very secure  warm in winter  beautifully set up... and Suzie is just a lovely hostess. I would definitely stay here again if given a chance. :)"),
("2017-06-23", "6046461", "Jenny", "Great place to stay. Really central and great host."),
("2017-06-28", "6046461", "Amanda", "Suzie was absolutely wonderful in helping me get set up and make the most of my short time in Sydney. She was full of great recommendations and useful directions and was incredibly friendly. It's a great central location and a short walk to just about anywhere or an even quicker train ride away from everything. The apartment was extremely clean and Suzie has everything you might need available  including power adapters for international travelers. "),
("2018-02-12", "6046461", "Akshita", "The host canceled this reservation 35 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-04-19", "6046461", "Neil", "Beautifully setup apartment at the edge of Barangaroo in Sydney. Close to everything  a stylish  calm place to stay."),
("2018-04-27", "6046461", "John", "Great location  nice space  friendly and responsive host."),
("2018-05-31", "6046461", "Claudio", "Perfect location  right in the centre of Sydney. The apartment was extremely clean. Suzie is really kind and friendly. She allowed me check in late and was always able to help me giving me directions.I would definitely recommend to stay at her place."),
("2018-06-03", "6046461", "Toni", "Great location to Kings Wharf and Wynward Station!"),
("2018-06-12", "6046461", "Christopher", "The host canceled this reservation 7 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-06-25", "6046461", "Chris", "This is a lovely stylish apartment. Great location near cafes  bars theater and transport connections. Suzie is a great host. One of the joys of airbnb is meeting interesting people like Suzie."),
("2018-08-07", "6046461", "Fritz", "A sparkling clean  very central  stylish place right in the middle of Darling Harbour. "),
("2018-08-17", "6046461", "Clinton", "Suzie is lovely  the apartment is immaculate and the interior is beautiful. As for location you couldn't get much better  next to Darling Harbour with amazing places to eat and the CBD so close."),
("2018-08-19", "6046461", "Allen", "Great place to stay"),
("2018-08-23", "6046461", "Saad", "A clean private room very close to CBD  darling harbour and museums. The road noise at night may be a tad loud for some. "),
("2018-08-29", "6046461", "Mahmood", "Suzie is such a friendly and attentive host. Makes you feel welcome in her immaculate place. Was a great stay - super handy to the conference center!"),
("2018-09-06", "6046461", "Mark", "great stay  great location  excellent host"),
("2018-09-12", "6046461", "John", "Excellent location  you couldn't be better placed for accessing the city.  It's a short walk to everywhere. Darling harbour is full of bars  restaurants  cafes shops and so on  with plenty to do and see. Oh and the bed is so comfy   slept well every night. please note this is a city location with city noises."),
("2018-09-21", "6046461", "Jason", "Great apartment  couldn’t use kitchen for cooking  but Suzie was a great host"),
("2018-10-07", "6046461", "Kathy", "Suzie is a great host  very helpful with directions  her home is enviably tidy and walking distance for everything I wished to visit."),
("2018-10-10", "6046461", "Johannes", "Very nice and clean apartment. Very nice and lovely hostess."),
("2018-10-25", "6046461", "Monem", "Venez y habiter sans hésitation. C’est près des coins les plus visités de la ville. En plus volet qualité prix vous en trouverez plus que vous n’attendez"),
("2018-11-01", "6046461", "Jerzy", "Lovely place in a beautiful neighbourhood  close to the waterfront and within a walking distance to most Sydney attractions. Subway is 3 minutes away.Although I've seen pictures of Suzie's place it surpassed my expectations. Beautiful furniture  a mix of modern and Asian - style. Super clean and with all the conveniences you might think of. Very (!) comfortable bed.And most important: Suzie  my host. My superhost. I already miss our discussions about Australia  world politics and ... life. I'd like to come back one day."),
("2018-11-08", "6046461", "Emily", "Susie’s apartment is beautiful. Really easily accessed and the location is perfectly positioned for the city  Darling Harbour and the new Bangaroo area. Suzie is charming and communicative. Would definitely recommend :)"),
("2018-11-11", "6046461", "Jo", "Everything is as shown on the website.  Susie is a great host - very friendly but not at all intrusive.  Excellent security.  Easy instructions  good communication."),
("2018-11-19", "6046461", "Demetri", "Suzie was a fantastic host. She methodically introduced me to all the details of the space  ensuring I had everything I needed. The apartment was exceptionally clean and stylishly decorated. Above and beyond  Suzie was very warm and welcoming. Ready and willing to provide local recommendations  but also respecting when to give privacy. Very enjoyable stay."),
("2018-11-21", "6046461", "Mandu", "Suzie was an awesome host. She was very thoughtful and looked in to all my needs. She gave me some great tips to explore the city. The location was fantastic too  it’s very close to all the attractions. I would definitely stay at Susie’s again. Thanks so much."),
("2018-11-27", "6046461", "Bora", "Suzie’s space is awesome for going to barangaloo  which is hot spot for trendy people.The house is  of course  very clean and has spacious room for the guest. It was impressive for the amenities as like the hotel. She offers enough towels  so don’t worry about the thing you didn’t bring.Anout the host  Suzie is also very warm and not intrusive as other people’s comment below. In other words  you can have enough time to relax your minds. One thing you be noticed is suzie’s location from the Museum station has a bit slope. (weak though) So it’s better to take an escalator near David Jones. :) it will help you a lot."),
("2018-12-06", "6046461", "Zhuo", "Suzie is super nice❤️ Very patient. Best host ever. The place is closely near darling habour and suitable for walking around. I really recommend Suzie’s apartment to people who want to enjoy their journey in Sydney."),
("2018-12-11", "6046461", "Andrew", "Suzie's place was excellent and the hospitality great. Would stay again :)"),
("2019-01-13", "6046461", "Iris", "Suzie is a great host! Respond quickly and very helpful. She gives me some really good suggestions about transportation and food. I had a great weekend there!"),
("2019-02-07", "6046461", "Catherine", "I stayed at Suzie's for 4 nights on a business trip. It was very convenient to coffee places and harbour views. As others have mentioned  the ear plugs came conveniently as the apartment is close to traffic. Bed is super comfortable and the fan worked well at cooling down the room at night (it was very hot in Sydney that week). Access to the fridge allowed me to make my own breakfast in the morning. Bathroom is not connected to the bedroom but Suzie was rarely in the path in between so was not an issue at all. Apartment is in a very secured complex and close to the Wynyard Station to get to the airport in 30 min. Suzie also gave me lots of local recommendations. Recommended for business trips where you spend little time in the apartment."),
("2019-02-11", "6046461", "Tim", "Upmarket decor  clean  super comfortable. Excellent location. Lovely host!"),
("2019-02-22", "6046461", "Océane", "Suzie’s appartement is really great. It’s clean and very well located. Suzie is nice  reactive and will answer to all your questions."),
("2015-06-30", "6170899", "Ericka", "Magnifique séjour. La maison est super jolie  très pratique  facile à prendre en main... un vrai décor de poupées  idéal pour les familles ou plusieurs couples. Un merveilleux accueil avec boîte de chocolats et vin blanc... bref  c'était la perfection et la douceur de vivre à l'australienne !Balmain est un quartier idéalement situé et très agréable. En ferry  on est à 15 mn de Darling Harbour ou de Circular Quay."),
("2015-07-28", "6170899", "Sharifah", "What a beautiful house in a beautiful area. Jennifer was a gracious host who left us a lot of information and chocolates  apples and flowers! The house is in a convenient location with Woolworths nearby which made simple food preparation a breeze after a long day. "),
("2015-10-10", "6170899", "Cornelius", "Place was in an excellent prepared state with all amenities in working order. Jennifer made us feel especially welcome and was always available to solve any potential problems"),
("2015-10-24", "6170899", "Valda", " Three old friends arrived to share Jennifer's house for 5 days. On arrival Jennifer was there to greet us. She showed us around her beautiful house  had left us information about the local area and lots of travel pamphlets. She also invited us to use anything she had left in the fridge. This was really helpful as when you fly you don't bring any extra food etc. She had also left a bottle of wine and chocolates for us to munch on. The house was immaculately clean and beautifully decorated. The backyard was also great to look out onto and had the weather been better would have been beautiful to sit out in. The house is even better that the great photo's Jennifer has supplied to Air bnb. We spent an entire day exploring the area around Balmain and found lots of interesting places to visit. We felt very safe in that area and on 2 nights we returned to the house quite late after being out exploring all day. I have no hesitation in recommending this beautiful house to anyone and I guarantee you will not be disappointed."),
("2015-11-07", "6170899", "Patricia", "Jennifer went over and above the call of duty in making us feel as though we were welcome guests in her beautiful property.  She left us wine  chocolates  milk and other provisions on arrival which were such a treat as we were too tired to go to the shops.  Jenny also took the time to explain the bus and ferry routes and gave us information about where to visit.  The property was most definitely a home and I appreciated that Jenny trusted us to stay in her home and to treat it with respect  which I hope we did.  It is an honour to have someone place so much trust in another person  especially as every item in the property was so obviously a much treasured possession.  I would love to stay at this property again at some time in the future."),
("2015-11-16", "6170899", "David", "Very glad we chose this place. Three good size bedrooms  2 living areas and separate well appointed kitchen/dining  private courtyard - all we could have hoped for. Our friendly and obliging host  Jennifer  met us on arrival and showed us round  clearly explaining the features of the property.  Parking outside  quiet street yet close to the main drag of Balmain makes it an excellent location. "),
("2015-11-28", "6170899", "Shelley", "Jennifer was a very accommodating and friendly host with a beautiful  house. We couldn't have asked for anything more from our stay. She even offered to take some of our excess baggage to the Op Shop as we were running out of time and space to pack! Would definitely recommend her as a host and her house as a place to stay-very comfortable and our home from home."),
("2015-12-03", "6170899", "Sally", "Charming accommodation With everything you could possibly need to make for a perfect holidayWalking distance to great shops and restaurants and a short stroll to the ferryLovely outdoor sitting areasJennifer was a very welcoming and accommodating hostWould definitely  recommend"),
("2016-02-04", "6170899", "Philippa", "Jennifer met us at the house when we arrived and made us feel at home. The house looked just as we had viewed on the website and fulfilled our expectations. We loved the private outdoor area."),
("2016-02-13", "6170899", "Jean", "Jennifer's house is comfortable  spacious and graceful  the fully-equipped kitchen and beautiful garden are our favorite sections. Jennifer is very friendly  charming and she prepared many flesh foods for us  introduced us the information about supermarkets  restaurants and transportation. During our stay  we embarked on a ferry and enjoyed the landscape in the harbor district  then returned to the tranquil Balmain Village  which has become our important memory of Sydney."),
("2016-02-22", "6170899", "Michele", "Everything described in previous reviews is absolutely true. Warm welcome by Jennifer  charming house in a quiet neighborhood  very accessible to public transport to the georgeous city .Thank you so much Jennifer  to have made our stay so easy and agreable."),
("2016-03-04", "6170899", "Clare", "Stayed for 3 nights in Jennifer's beautiful Balmain terrace. The kitchen was well stocked. We had a great stay in this beautiful house  no issues at all. I would note that the stairs are steep  which is typical for this type of house. If you have small children  staying (as we had) or people with mobility issues  you would need to take extra care. "),
("2016-03-19", "6170899", "David", "Lovely home in a great location. So much better than staying in a hotel. Jennifer is a wonderful host who worked hard to make sure all our needs were met. Highly recommended."),
("2016-03-31", "6170899", "Megan", "Jennifer's Balmain house is an absolute delight. A lovingly decorated and comfortable house in a quiet street. Our family had a most enjoyable stay - breakfast in the tree-filled  courtyard  nicely appointed bedrooms with quality linen. We enjoyed spending time in Balmain and imagining how nice it would be to live there.   "),
("2016-04-06", "6170899", "Darren", "Jennifer made us feel extremely welcome. She was there to greet us when we arrived and even had a fridge stocked full of essentials for us. This wan't necessary but was greatly appreciated. As for the house itself  it was better than perfect and suited our needs down to a tee. The area is very quiet yet very close to the shops on Darling St and would be a perfect place for you to have as a base camp while exploring the city. Highly recommended."),
("2016-04-18", "6170899", "Charles", "We had a lovely stay at the Balmain Village Garden House. Jennifer was a perfect host  meeting us on arrival and making sure everything was in order. We arrived to a well-stocked pantry  fresh fruit and a bottle of wine. The location was great  - close to transport  cafes and shops. The house was beautifully decorated and furnished - taking us back in time. We would be very happy to come and stay again. "),
("2016-05-02", "6170899", "Anthony", "Jennifer was agreeable to an early arrival and was very welcoming  explaining how the house 'worked' without being intrusive."),
("2016-05-23", "6170899", "Anne", "We had a wonderful week in Balmain. Jennifer was very welcoming  the house was charming  very attractively furnished and in a perfect location close to the shops  bus stop and ferry(with a frequent minibus connection) and was very quiet. Jennifer was very generous with a well stocked fridge & pantry   shampoo  soaps etc in the bathroom and fresh flowers. Would love to return one day!"),
("2016-07-19", "6170899", "Andrew", "We stayed at the Balmain Village Garden House in July  2016. Jennifer met us on our arrival and made us feel very welcome including a bottle of wine and some chocolates. The house is lovely  full of character and in a perfect location about 15 minutes walk from the ferry and 5 minutes from the buses. Balmain is a bustling place  with a multitude of cafes  bars and restuarents. The beds were comfortable  and even though it was the middle of winter we were never cold  in fact when we had the gas fire on it was very cosy indeed. The kitchen is well stocked and a supermarket is less than 5 minutes away. I don't think I could find a fault at all; everything was as described. The only concern would be the steepness of the stairs  common in house like this I imagine  but for a person with mobility issues the upstairs bedrooms could be difficult. The master bedroom+en-suite  and the family bathroom are downstairs however  so it might not be an issue at all. Highly recommended indeed."),
("2016-08-02", "6170899", "Christine", "This is a delightful gem cottage in Balmain with easy access to local cafes and walks  and near the city via bus or ferry. Jennifer had bus & ferry information  spare 'opal' transport cards  brochures and maps for us. Everything is beautifully presented  wonderful breakfast treats & welcome wine and chocolates. Perfect weekender when visiting Sydney."),
("2016-08-21", "6170899", "Leigh", "Jennifer was a great host who met us on arrival and explained all to us. We loved staying at her house - it's a great location within walking distance of all Balmain facilities.  Parking was no problem.  The house itself is lovely with a great ambiance and many amenities including breakfast packs  free wi-fi cable tv.  We stayed for a week and will definitely return if our travels bring us back to Sydney.  Highly recommended."),
("2016-08-30", "6170899", "Alex", "We all absolutely loved staying in Jennifer's house. There were 6 of us staying across the 3 rooms as although the house has a cosy feel it had lots of room for group meals etc. All spotlessly clean and beautifully decorated. When we arrived Jennifer greeted us with a bottle of wine and fresh fruit  crumpets and other breakfast stuffs in the fridge. Made us feel at home right away. Balmain as an area is lovely and has lots of good food and drink options and and handy supermarket a short walk away. Couldn't recommend highly enough."),
("2016-09-04", "6170899", "Margaret", "Jennifer was there to meet us and was very helpful . I loved staying at her house ."),
("2016-09-18", "6170899", "Elaine", "Had a wonderful long weekend at Balmain Cottage. Jennifer was very welcoming and left us breakfast  wine and chocolates. The cottage is beautiful  clean and the beds very comfortable.There's only a five minute walk to Balmain village with many great restaurants to choose from.Would highly recommend. "),
("2016-10-05", "6170899", "Bruce", "A warm and sincere greeting into a treasure of a house filled with beautiful things. The location was quiet and with close shopping and transport links. Wonderful restaurants nearby  although the kitchen is very well equipped.  Thoroughly recommended. "),
("2016-10-13", "6170899", "Alain", "Jennifer's welcome is fantastic. Plenty of food  drinks and chocdolate... The2 house is lovely  cosy and really well located."),
("2016-10-24", "6170899", "Julia", "Jennifer was very welcoming and clearly puts a lot of love and care into her home.  We thought the photos didn't do it full justice and were overwhelmed with the consideration she had put into items left for us.  As described in other reviews  the facilities are great and close to lots of amenities.  Great for exploring Balmain where there are restaurants  shops and pubs and good access to the buses which go into the city on a ten minute basis  and the ferry wharf is also available.We thoroughly enjoyed our time at Jennifer's home and would definitely recommend it.   "),
("2016-11-04", "6170899", "Rosemary", "Jennifer responded to my emails promptly and was very helpful. The extras of breakie provisions and wine was a lovely bonus. The private outdoor area was a delight. House accurately described. Nice house lovely owner. Highly recommended."),
("2017-01-04", "6170899", "Tessa", "The photos on Airbnb do not do Jennifer's house and garden justice. This is a traditional old house with all the modern comforts you would expect. Lovely quality cotton bedding. Jennifer made sure we were comfortable and even put in some deck lighting which made our three week Christmas stay all the more special. The daily copy of the Sydney Herald delivered to the front porch in time for breakfast was a bonus as were the other treats left for us. It suited our needs perfectly and we were a three generation group where the oldest person could stay on one level with the master en suite bedroom adjacent to the kitchen and family sitting roomsWe would recommend this house and the host. Rest assured any problem would be quickly resolved as Jennifer is usually only five minutes away"),
("2017-01-17", "6170899", "Dave", "Just leaving after a 3 day stay in this  beautiful house. The place is flawless with great character and a lovely garden  a real home from home. Jennifer has thought of everything from cards to use local transport to the local paper delivered early each morning  she even left us fresh food for breakfast and some liquid refreshments. The location is ideal  being a short 5 min walk from Balmain shops and restaurants and 15 minute walk to the ferry  bringing you straight to circular quay under Sydneys famous harbour bridge and along the Opera house. We would highly recommend staying here and will look it up again ourselves if in the area."),
("2017-02-06", "6170899", "Mark & Wendy", "Jennifer has a lovely period period home in what is like an inner city suburb. Might not feel inner city being in Balmain  but does have that feel. Our host is lovely and left us lots of provisions which made eating breakfast easy.There are books to read  a daily newspaper delivered and a quick bus ride to the ferry.A lovely time had by the four of us. Thank you."),
("2017-02-20", "6170899", "Andrew", "A lovely house in a beautiful neighbourhood  within easy reach of the city centre by bus or ferry  with ample on-street parking for the car.Jennifer ensured that the house was clean  well-presented and stocked with all the necessities and then some on our arrival. Our incoming flight was heavily delayed  yet she was still on hand to welcome us and was always available to answer questions.Thank you for a wonderful stay!"),
("2017-03-13", "6170899", "Mary & Richard", "A lovely house just a few blocks from shops and restaurants as well as the bus line. We loved everything about it."),
("2017-04-04", "6170899", "Tim", "We love Balmain and Jennifer's place is perfect for a quiet house but a short stroll to the centre.  Also the public transport is very accessible from here.  The house is very comfortable and cosy and the garden is very pleasant."),
("2017-05-08", "6170899", "Sue", "Everything you could possibly want is available. Access to Balmain shops/restaurants is 5 min walk. Easy access to city"),
("2017-06-04", "6170899", "Vera", "The host canceled this reservation 60 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-06-10", "6170899", "Noel", "Jennifer's house was more than we could have hoped for. Easily big enough for 6 people and the 2 bathrooms proved so useful. The house has such a cosy feel to it  with a gas coal-effect fire in the very comfortable rear lounge. The large kitchen diner is such a great area in which to socialise and if the weather had been a bit better  we would have made more use of the beautiful garden and barbecue area. The house is situated in a lovely area of Balmain  not far from the main shopping street (including Woolworths supermarket) and numerous bars  pubs and restaurants  with great links to the city. Couldn't have wished for a better place to stay for our four-and-a-half week stay in Australia visiting our new granddaughter and her parents."),
("2017-08-17", "6170899", "Tomomi", "We had a great time at Jennifer's place.Everything was perfect! We really hope to go back there sometime soon!Thank you!"),
("2017-09-03", "6170899", "Therese", "Home from home!!! Excellent facilities . Beautiful goodies for a first breakfast and a chilled bottle of wine to unwind with after our long flight. A most gorgeous private garden to enjoy the sunshine. If like me you don't want to leave as Jennifer's home better than any 5 star lodgings I have stayed in. It's in a beautiful suburb well serviced by retail shops coffee shops and restaurants. Will definitely return some day"),
("2017-09-13", "6170899", "Pamela", "Lovely traditional house very close to Balmain centre.September evenings were quite cold so had to use heating.In summer would be perfect.Jennifer is the perfect host. Many Thanks."),
("2017-10-01", "6170899", "Helen", "This beautiful tastefully decorated home offers supreme comfort and terrific location. The garden in the backyard is an oasis of beautiful and healthy plants. A very quiet location with on street parking that was never a problem. The house is full of charm and Jennifer's bedding and towels are of the highest quality and cleanliness. Jennifer was so generous and welcoming  giving us a walk through of all that we would need to know to make our stay as comfortable as possible. The kitchen was fully stocked for our use and Jennifer had thoughtfully provided breakfast provisions for us  - which we gratefully used - enjoying a leisurely start to the day and breakfast and coffee in the garden. Position of the house is excellent - walking distance to the shopping centre  ferry and bus transport  not to mention how easy it was to access the house with the help of (Hidden by Airbnb) maps. My friends and I can not recommended this property highly enough!"),
("2017-10-14", "6170899", "David", "Well appointed  clean and tastefully decorated. Friendly and accomodating host  the complementary breakfast and wine were a bonus. Highly recommended."),
("2017-12-07", "6170899", "Joe", "The Balmain Garden Home was perfect  the home is comfortable and beautifully decorated  it has all the amenities and very close proximity to public transport  restaurants and shops and a quick Bus or Ferry ride into the CBD. Jennifer is a wonderful host and very responsive and it was a pleasure to meet here. We hope to be able to stay here again sometime in the future. Very highly recommended."),
("2018-01-19", "6170899", "Anna", "Everything as described and much more  perfect holiday stay for six of us."),
("2018-03-17", "6170899", "Paul", "Jennifer was a wonderful  host very quick to communicate and her home was so comfortable and inviting in a perfect location. Balmain had some amazing restaurants and bars and yet only 15 minutes into circular Quay on the ferry. Jennifer kindly left us provisions for breakfast and a bottle off wine.Highly recommended."),
("2018-03-31", "6170899", "Jan", "Jennifer has been a great host! We have enjoyed our stay at Jennifer's house for the past 7 nights. The kitchen is well equipped with utensils and other supplies like bread  milk and eggs. The interiors are based on traditional English design and we felt peaceful  warm and cosy in the house.Highly recommended!"),
("2018-05-14", "6170899", "Alethea", "My siblings and I stayed here for 10 nights. This is one of the best Airbnb places we ever stayed at! The house is just beautiful with a nice garden. It has 3 bedrooms and 2 full baths. Close to public transport and shops. The kitchen is well equipped to cook a full meal. We only cooked once just because there’s so many restaurants in Sydney. Lots of towels  the bed and pillows were comfortable  the bed sheets smelled fresh and there’s even bathrobes for us to use. Wifi was fast. Jennifer was a great host. Highly recommended. Will definitely stay here again!"),
("2018-07-09", "6170899", "Ron", "Great place and great hospitality. There were 3 couples in our party and we all thought it was a treat to stay there. Note bathroom is on ground floor and two bedrooms upstairs. Master bedroom has an en suite. We stayed in winter and heaters and aircon kept place warm when needed. Highly Recommended."),
("2018-09-06", "6170899", "Maureen", "Jennifer was a very generous host and we were very appreciative of her lovely home. Great location in a quiet area but close to everything we needed."),
("2018-09-25", "6170899", "David", "Central  convenient  homely and relaxed."),
("2018-10-13", "6170899", "Megan", "A  serene home and pleasant garden perfect for a family stay. Balmain is a special part of Sydney - on its own peninsular  yet only a 12 minute bus ride into the CBD. The suburb is one of Sydney's best - with houses of original character and an extensive shopping street and supermarket nearby  and the Sydney harbour and ferry boats for alternative transport and scenic walking routes. Jennifer's sandstone house is decorated beautifully and in character with its 100+ year origins  with a light-filled kitchen that  is extremely well organised and equipped  and stocked with essentials and extra delicacies to enjoy. Jennifer is the perfect host and I guarantee you will enjoy your stay."),
("2018-10-30", "6170899", "Helene", "Great hospitaly and breakfast and wine and fresh flowers as an extra nice complimentary. Lovely garden and 4 min walk to shops  restaurants and buses to Sydney.  Quiet and very comfortable house and Jennifer is a very caring host. Looking forward to stay there again."),
("2018-11-21", "6170899", "Boyd", "This is a wonderful place to stay. The amenities were great and its just a short ferry ride away to the downtown attractions. I would certainly recommend this place to anyone who likes a little bit of peace and quiet.B&C"),
("2018-12-05", "6170899", "Ann", "A very comfortable stay in a perfect location."),
("2019-01-24", "6170899", "David", "Jennifer’s place is a lovely period house in the center of Balmain. Fantastic host!"),
("2019-02-02", "6170899", "Jane", "A lovely lovely end terrace cottage. Beautiful inside and a picturesque courtyard outside.Jennifer was a delightful hostess greeting us on arrival and showing us around. All communication was prompt. Lots of goodies left for us. near the main street so easy for the bus to city or ferry. Loved our stay."),
("2019-02-14", "6170899", "Deb", "Jennifer ‘s house was perfect for our stay in Sydney. The house was a home away from home and we all really appreciated the breakfast supplies. Our beautiful Aunty came to visit and enjoyed the wine that Jennifer left for us. The garden is a special place to spend time in on sunny mornings and afternoons."),
("2015-06-09", "6228208", "Martin", "The host canceled this reservation 73 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-06-09", "6201263", "Kevid Giselle", "The room is very clean and tidy. The house is so quiet and Robbie is very polite."),
("2015-06-11", "6201263", "Sky", "The house is cozy and nice to live in with everything you need. The bedroom is clean and tidy. The host is great and welcoming. No more to ask for this price and it's within walking distance to Central. Definitely the first choice if u ever visit Sydney."),
("2015-06-16", "6201263", "Jacob", "Nice room in big house - many housemates.  Unfortunately the bedroom is connected to next room by very large  thin doors with a massive gap underneath - every conversation and sound next door came blasting through. It was as if we were in the same room - could not sleep."),
("2015-06-18", "6201263", "Jordan", "Great place to stay! Very conveniently located within a short walk to the Central train station and Surry Hills. The room was huge and had all the amenities you would need. Very clean bathroom with your own drawer to house your toiletries. Yoco wasn't in town but was easy to communicate with. He had everything set upon my arrival. I would stay here again."),
("2015-07-07", "6201263", "Thomas", "Great location! As stated by the host  it is very close to Central Station which made traveling around Sydney an ease. Will consider staying here again if I return to Sydney!"),
("2015-07-11", "6201263", "Lacy", "虽然没见到房东 但是也能感觉到房东是一个很热心的人｡打扫房间的那个小哥人也超棒!!房子地理位置好 环境也不错 唯一缺点就是房子不隔音｡"),
("2015-07-16", "6201263", "Sarah", "This is one of my favourite places to stay in Sydney - great location  lovely house  easy check-in. Love it! "),
("2015-07-23", "6201263", "Hsuan Jui", "The house is near Central train station and provides all amenities you might need. However  the room seemed not to be cleaned before we checked in. And the sound insulation was poor. "),
("2015-07-26", "6201263", "Hugh", "Fantastic little place  awesome location. Room was clean and well appointed  great modern kitchen and beautiful little courtyard out back. Had breakfast under a blue sky around the veggie patch and ferns  really special. Yoco is friendly and efficient at communicating  has a great Eco mantra as well. Thanks!"),
("2015-08-03", "6201263", "Juliana", "Room is big  house is tidy  good location and has excellent wi-fi sign.We never met Yoco  but there was always good communication with him to arrive and extend our stay."),
("2015-08-12", "6201263", "Elke", "The house wasn't far from the train station and was easy to find. Our first impressions were very good: clean  calm  modern bathroom and kitchen  ... . There were two bathrooms  one outside and one upstairs  with shelves for our stuff - very handy! The kitchen was large and fully equipped. However  in the 'value for money' department  we did hit some minor bumps. First of all  despite there hadn't been any guests staying in our room the day before our arrival  we found 3 bags of garbage in the corner. Also  our personal shelf in the kitchen cupboard and refrigerator had not been emptied. While these things may be considered the responsibility of the previous guests  we expected the owner to have done at least a quick check. Furthermore  every evening there would be quite alot of creepy crawlers on the kitchen counter and under the appliances. We informed the owner of this and he responded immediately  saying that he would send someone to check it out. Sadly  the bug problem persisted until our departure. Finally  our room and the room of our neighbouring guests were separated by wall-sized collapsable closet doors. This essentially meant that  sound-wise  we simply seemed to share a room and had to be very quiet as to not disturb eachother. While we did have a pleasant first AirBnB experience  we have to admit we had expected a bit more value for money."),
("2015-08-16", "6201263", "YunJoo Karris", "Location was great. But the wall was too thin so i had to bear all the chatting noise from the next room. Not suitable for noise sensitive person."),
("2015-08-20", "6201263", "Nicolai", "The House was mess. Whats written about the noise from neighbours through the door is completely true. Its like sleeping with them. Also  We had a couple of data without toiletpaper in the house. There is rubbish piling up in the kichen along dirty laundry and cockroaches. The Owner was never there fyring our stay  and as someone else was staying in the room he had designated for us  we had to take the next one. Not the end of the World  but frustrating when the owner is not to get a hold of. He did reply  2 days later. Over all  Good location  not much else. "),
("2015-10-03", "6201263", "Shehan", "Stayed at Yoco's house for a week and a half and it was great. Ideal location close to the city and good value. Robbie was a great host! Will definitely be booking it again next time I'm in Sydney."),
("2016-01-12", "6201263", "Benjamin", "Very good located and a good price for such an apartment. Would book it again!"),
("2016-02-07", "6201263", "James", "The house was a perfect place to stay in Sydney. The rooms were all clean and tidy and cleaners came by regularly  the kitchen had everything we needed to cook up some good food (including fresh herbs outside). Robbie made us feel incredibly welcome - just make sure if you stay there you pester him to give you a guided meditation. Well worth it. If we are ever in need of a place to stay in Sydney we will be back. "),
("2016-03-18", "6201263", "Nicholas", "Very central location. Everyone staying at the house was lovely. Room was very spacious"),
("2016-03-23", "6201263", "Yuntao", "a good place  so near to the central . but MY room is to close to the street"),
("2016-04-23", "6201263", "Clare", "Great location  however  house had bugs running through it. "),
("2016-05-11", "6201263", "Taja", "I absolutely loved my stay at Yoco house! The apartment is so nice and the best value you can get in all of Sydney! Great location close to everything you need and want! I love how important sustainability recycling and renewable energy is to the house. Highly recommend staying here!"),
("2016-07-12", "6201263", "Jaehyeon", "만족했습니다."),
("2016-08-02", "6201263", "Carolane", "Very well located and Yoco was  answering and available if you needed something."),
("2016-09-02", "6201263", "Bin", "房屋位置很好 距离中央车站徒步十分钟 去机场也方便｡"),
("2016-09-11", "6201263", "Soomin", "Good location near to central station and a cozy room :-)"),
("2016-10-09", "6201263", "John", "My wife and I had a great weekend in Sydney. Yoco was very welcoming and a real nice guy. The position was great.. a short walk to Central station made it really easy to get around town and back again. I would definately stay here again. Thanks Yoco."),
("2016-10-22", "6201263", "Riley", "I had a nice few days here  lots of friendly people  easy going. Defiantly recommend "),
("2016-10-26", "6201263", "Nicolas", "I had a great stay at Yoco's  it reminds me a lot the movie Auberge Espagnole with mostly europeans roommates. I didn't have the chance to meet everyone because I was very busy but I would definitely stay again at his place. Yoco was also really flexible regarding the check-in time  I was able to drop my luggage early in the morning even though the room wasn't ready yet because an another guest hadn't checked out yet  that was really convenient after a long flight from USA.Also if you're a light sleeper  it can be loud  it's not really well soundproofing. I'm heavy sleeper it didn't disturb me."),
("2016-11-18", "6201263", "Guillaume", "La maison de Yocco est très bien situé. Les gens qui y vivent sont très accueillants et chaleureux  on se sent rapidement comme chez nous. Merci pour cette semaine "),
("2016-11-21", "6201263", "Jia", "Comfortable and lovely home. Flexible time to check in and out."),
("2016-11-23", "6201263", "Kenneth", "Stayed for two nights. Lovely flat mates  close to public transit. Communication was great and very comfortable stay. "),
("2016-12-13", "6201263", "Chingkhai", "Yoco's place is close to the Central station which is very convenient."),
("2016-12-16", "6201263", "Robin", "Nice room and good location  but it was not possible to get in touch with the host."),
("2017-01-26", "6201263", "Arnout", "Great place!"),
("2017-01-29", "6201263", "Longfei", "nice"),
("2017-02-04", "6201263", "Kate", "I had a fantastic stay at The Yoco House. Big thanks to everyone for making me feel welcome. Communication and check in was easy. The room is large with a comfortable bed  WiFi is good and kitchen is well equipped. I had a car and could park it on the street on the weekend for free. Lots of good cafes and restaurants to explore in the surrounding streets."),
("2017-02-10", "6201263", "Jenny", "Lovely spacious front room in a large house with ample kitchen space and friendly people staying in the house. The noise of the road was easily cancelled out with ear plugs. Very comfortable large bed. The bathroom was obviously well used by people in the house so was occasionally a bit dirty but nothing to complain about for me. Had a really enjoyable stay and would recommend  in particular for solo travellers. "),
("2017-02-23", "6201263", "Che", "Yoco is really friendly and his place is very well kept. It is really close to central and easy to get anywhere. The kitchen  bathroom  and room all were really clean. All of the others in the house were super friendly and it was a very positive  welcoming environment. "),
("2017-02-26", "6201263", "Regis", "Great location and friendly atmosphere in this big group house with young international people!"),
("2017-03-08", "6201263", "Philip", "Great location near Central Station. Only 15 min walk to CBD. Friendly host and the other who stayed there were kind too."),
("2017-04-29", "6201263", "Zubie", "Enjoyed our stay though we did not meet Yoco nor any other Airbnb guests there."),
("2017-05-09", "6201263", "Lena", "The shared house is located about 10 minutes from the central station and perfect for a city trip. You share the house with 3 other rooms/guests. Our room was spacious and comfortable. We really enjoyed our stay and liked how well organized everything was (e.g. Marked shelfs for each room  pin code for front door)."),
("2017-05-22", "6201263", "Charo", "This this home  is located very good area close to everything the home is large  well organized .  The walls could  have been done a bit more in my room but I'm not looking for perfection. I enjoyed myself there."),
("2017-05-27", "6201263", "Peet", "Nice location and really close to central railway station+bus stops. The road to the house gets quiet really early at night. Cute and spacious bedroom with a comfy big bed and air-con. However  I didn't expect so many housemates.  Worth paying for the location anyways. "),
("2017-05-30", "6201263", "Hamish", "The house is in a really good spot  close to Central station  Surry Hills and Redfern  so there are lots of cafes  bars and things to do nearby. The room is pretty noisy as it sits on a very busy road so probably not ideal for light sleepers. "),
("2017-07-07", "6201263", "Adarsh", "Located very close to the city. My room was clean and as described. The kitchen was a bit untidy at times  owing to the number of people who use it. The house(especially the red room) can get a bit nosiy due to the traffic on Chalmer st. But overall a highly recommended place. "),
("2017-07-17", "6201263", "Ashley", "Yoco keeps improving. I feel very comfortable to be there. Thanks. 房东一直会改进 如果你需要一个安静 但是什么设施都有的地方 这是很好的房子｡"),
("2017-07-22", "6201263", "Sukhvinder", "It was a pleasant stay at Yoco's house. He has the kept the house quite well. Its close to CBD and central station."),
("2017-08-06", "6201263", "Ashley", "This is the place I have been 3 times."),
("2017-08-15", "6201263", "Florence", "Maison très bien située pour Sidney (10 mn Central station / 40mn à pied ou 10 mn par train à partir de Central  pour aller à Circular quay  )Rapport qualité/prix très bon. La maison est très propre. Bruyant si vous êtes dans la chambre du bas située côté route.C'est un backpaker et non une chambre chez l'habitant."),
("2017-08-17", "6201263", "Sam", "Yoco's share house is a great little alternative abode a stones-throw from the heart of Sydney. He was prompt to reply to any of my queries and was more than accommodating. Great value for money as well and definitely recommend to anyone needing a friendly place to stay."),
("2017-09-03", "6201263", "Jak", "Really nice house  great location. Would definitely visit his house again."),
("2017-12-20", "6201263", "Pauline", "La maison est idéalement située pour découvrir Sydney. Le quartier est agréable et animé. La chambre est spacieuse et bien équipé. Les seuls reproches sont que la cuisine et la salle de bain n'étaient pas très propres et que nous n'avons vu personne dans cette maison pendant 4 jours. Décevant par rapport à notre envie de rencontrer des locaux ou autres voyageurs."),
("2017-12-27", "6201263", "Thomas", "Good value place if you don't stay for long and are only there to sleep. As already said  it is more like a small hostel  except there is no staff to take care of things. The yogi thing seems just to be the theme. Dirty or clean-ish depending on fellow guests."),
("2018-01-22", "6201263", "Madoka", "It was nice to be in a convenient location  because the room is fashionable  very close from the main station.主要な駅からとても近く､すごく便利な場所でした!部屋もおしゃれで素敵でした｡"),
("2018-02-12", "6201263", "Vikash", "It was an awesome stay at Yoco's place. The location of the house is just fabulous. The house is exactly the way it is  described. I got to meet some really nice people during my stay. Although I didn't get chance to meet Yoco in person he was just a call away.  Specially when my room door got auto locked  he helped me in every possible way and made sure to call the locksmith and solve the issue. I must recommend this property specially if you are looking to stay around the city."),
("2018-02-19", "6201263", "波心", "good place. across the road is a bus stop"),
("2018-02-22", "6201263", "Jong Yun", "수영장은 집 안에 있는게 아니라 근처 공원 내에 약 6달러 정도 유로이용이에요. 역까지 걷기 괜찮은데 바로 앞은아니에요."),
("2018-10-25", "6201263", "Anton", "It is a very nice place to stay. The location is great  it is close to everything - bus stop is just near the house  the train station is 10 minutes walk  there are a lot of supermarkets and cafes nearby.  The house is pretty good as well. We especially enjoy our spacious room with a big desk  a heater and a kettle. It was very comfortable"),
("2018-12-04", "6201263", "Austin", "Yoco's place was roomy  comfortable  in a decent neighborhood and full of other friendly guests you can meet  chat and hang out with! It's a bit far from the downtown area  about a good 30min walk if you don't mind  but thankfully right beside Central Station which can take you everywhere in and around the city."),
("2019-01-23", "6201263", "Carlo", "great location  nice bedroom  quick response"),
("2015-05-10", "6293102", "Jess", "This was a great house in a very cool area. It is in a super convenient location - trains and buses  grocery stores  cafes and restaurants all within 2 minutes walk from the house. The house is new and tidy  and full of plants and colour - it was a really nice atmosphere. The host was very helpful and made sure I had everything I needed  she even left me a little gift! The housemates were also really nice  they were friendly but did their own thing mainly  and that was fine with me. Overall an excellent airbnb experience. I would totally recommend it. "),
("2015-06-01", "6293102", "Alexandre", "Briohny little house was a perfect start for our Australian trip. The house was clean and comfortable (specially the balcony in the back). Her housemates were also quite nice and friendly. The location is great too  strongly recommend! "),
("2016-01-05", "6355925", "Ben", "Jamie's apartment overlooking Manly Beach was right on the Ocean .Very open and spacious. Also very handy for local restaurants and shops.Jamie was most welcoming and we had a great stay   although we were unlucky with the weather for a few days.Would recommend this apartment for anyone who likes being near a beach."),
("2017-01-01", "6355925", "Kathy", "I really enjoyed my stay at Jamie's   the view from the balcony is amazing  had my morning cup of tea and glass of wine in the evening sitting there.  Found it close to shops and restaurants. Very clean and spacious. I would love to stay again some day "),
("2016-09-02", "6361929", "Melissa", "Edi was very welcoming to her home.  She was very quick and responsive on taking us in on the very last minute. Thank you for your help."),
("2016-09-04", "6361929", "Jörg", "Edi is a wonderfull person and a great host. She was so friendly and helpful and didn't hesitate to show us around. The room (very clean) and the location (really close to the station) are perfect. Totally recommended! Thank you Edi!"),
("2016-09-05", "6361929", "Peter", "Edi has a clean neat home and she makes you feel very welcome. The bed was comfortable and warm. Great place to stay."),
("2016-09-09", "6361929", "Fernando", "Wonderful experience at Edi's place! Nice and clean house  bed and room really confortable! And pretty well located next to subway and bus stations and Sydney central area! Tottaly recommended!!"),
("2016-09-14", "6361929", "Amy", "Edi was an incredible host. She was super friendly and helped us with anything we needed. She showed us around her home and gave us suggestions of where to eat  drink and do our shopping! The house was super clean  and our room was great (bed was super comfy) lots of space to put your belongings and Jet (the cat) was super cute! We ended up staying longer than originally planned because we felt so at home at Edi's. The house itself was only a 3 minute walk to the train station where you can easily access trains to central etc. I would recommend anyone to stay here and I would to stay again! Can't thank you enough Edi :) *****"),
("2016-10-03", "6361929", "Luca", "edi is a wonderful person  kind and hospitable. the experience in this house has been excellent. will definitely"),
("2016-10-08", "6361929", "Dawit", "This is an excellent accommodation located within three minutes walk to  a train station. The house is very clean and quiet. The host  Edi  is a very nice and helpful person. This is an ideal place for me to stay at any time I'm in Sydney and I would definitely recommend it to others as well."),
("2016-10-15", "6361929", "David", "Thanks Edi for the amazing stay and being so flexible with my timings! Really made the house feel like a home while I moved into something more permanent in Sydney."),
("2017-01-03", "6361929", "Jun Wei", "Great location which near to train station. Convenient to go all around of Sydney. Great host which treated us like family."),
("2017-01-26", "6361929", "Joey", "房子近机场 但交通不算十分便利 早上飞机起降噪音相当大…!并且有蟑螂出没"),
("2017-02-26", "6361929", "Yurika", "Near to public transport and airport. And Edi is really friendly and warm person. Thank you very much :)"),
("2018-09-02", "6361929", "Honae", "Edi welcomed us into her lovely home. She is great for a chat (honestly we could have stayed talking all day) and has loads of travel tips. Thank you!"),
("2018-09-12", "6361929", "Siva", "excellent cosy stay  class to station and airport. very hospitable family who have been hosting for a while so they know how too give you space or interact with you."),
("2018-09-14", "6361929", "Mariana", "Edi was super helpful from the moment I contacted her and Dion. Instructions were sent properly to access the house while she was away and we even found the cat :) best cat ever I might say :) We really enjoyed how close to the station it was and close to the airport too. Location is great  security wise is amazing  own keys for room  plunger coffee and great stories if you around when Edi is there. Was delighted to wake up to Dion’s music and voice so thanks for that too. Will def return ! :)"),
("2018-09-18", "6361929", "Marcus", "We had such a wonderful time in Edi’s home. She’s a really friendly  inspiring woman who knows a lot about Sydney (and by the way  many other places in the world). She gave us the best ideas about where to visit and what to do in our stay. Her house is big  cozy  has a great kitchen to cook and the shower is great and warm. Just everything perfect! We felt like home  even so far away. Definitely recommend!!"),
("2018-09-23", "6361929", "Laila Tabea", "The stay was very good. Very central  close to the train station. I can recommend."),
("2018-10-02", "6361929", "Kathy", "Edi is a great host - she’s warm and tries to make you feel as comfortable as possible The house is located a 2min walk from the station  however is under a flight path (noting blackout period between 11pm-6am). I enjoyed the stay and would recommend especially for people who are looking for an easy location."),
("2018-10-14", "6361929", "Chris", "A very helpful host when dealing with an initial booking issue  Edi went beyond the call of duty ! Ease to come and go. Nice stay  although being on the flight path took a bit of getting used to. would definitely stay again  recommended"),
("2018-10-17", "6361929", "Grant", "Very accurate description of the place. Great overnight accommodation. Came in very handy. Highly recommend"),
("2018-11-03", "6361929", "Anisha", "Edi had such a lovely home. I was there with her  her 24-year-old son  and an English guest. She was so sweet and helpful  and we all hung out for trivia or drinks. She was incredibly accommodating when I had to stay longer  and I felt like I had a real home in Sydney. Would absolutely stay here again and recommend to friends!P.S. Her cat  Jet  is a real love!"),
("2018-11-16", "6361929", "Víctor", "just the perfect place to be edi makes you feel like home"),
("2018-11-18", "6361929", "Veronika", "I would really recommend this place as it is close to the public transport and it's affordable. Very clean and comfortable room. Edi is really friendly and kind  she gave us many tips where to go in Sydney and was ready to help anytime. The planes weren't an issue  we could sleep without any disturbing."),
("2018-11-21", "6361929", "Varitta", "The house is great  easy to get into the city centre  Sydhenam station is just across the road."),
("2018-11-22", "6361929", "Freek", "Lovely place with a warm welcome by Edi! ideal if you need to travel by train or plane!"),
("2019-02-06", "6361929", "Annika", "Edi made my stay in Sydney so nice... it was wonderful to chat with her and hear about her adventures. She gave me really good tips for exploring Sydney (which was very easy from the location) and it was a pleasure to stay at her place! I definitely recommend to stay with her as she is such a welcoming and caring person! Thanks so much Edi!"),
("2019-02-13", "6361929", "Ray", "We stayed Edi's place to go to the airport next day early morning. location was very good to go to the airport as well as station. House is old style but nothing made us uncomfortable. Her cat  Jet was so adorable and friendly. recommend!"),
("2019-02-16", "6361929", "Darron", "Exactly has described. Would stay again."),
("2019-02-22", "6361929", "Bradley", "Edi is very welcoming and I was very comfortable staying at her place. Interesting and easy to talk to with a very clean homely feel. Thanks for the stay!"),
("2019-02-27", "6361929", "Michael", "Edi is very friendly and nice! she let me know the best and cheapest option of travel from the airport to her place! its very helpful knowing that you are exhausted after travelling on planes and want to arrive at your accomdation conviniently and fast! she also tells me where to go for food and other which is very handy! also the house is only few minutes away from a train station!! overall it is a great experience and I really recommend to stay with Edi!"),
("2015-08-09", "6292364", "Alan", "Clean  basic accommodation and a convenient base during our stay in the northern beaches district of Sydney. Loved waking up to the sound of the birds! I recommend the short walk down to Paradise beach. Cathy  David and Max were great  and made sure we had everything we needed without making a fuss. Thanks!"),
("2015-08-13", "6292364", "Mark", "Cathy is warm and honest.  The room is well priced  clean and practical.  The bed is very comfortable  with a lovely new bathroom ensuite.  The location was very practical for my needs  the breakfast was lovely  with a great TV to watch from the bed  and a lovely selection of teas and coffee."),
("2015-09-27", "6292364", "Natasha", "Very comfortable room and Cathy had really thought of everything.  The coffee  yoghurt  fruit and fresh cut flowers were lovely.  Cathy was a very welcoming host.  We hope to stay again in the future."),
("2015-10-06", "6292364", "Helen", "Absolutely perfect in every way. I could not have chosen better! Thank you Cathy for making me so welcome in your home from the moment I arrived. The accommodation is beautiful  the bed was really comfortable with high quality organic bed linen. It was great to have a fridge in the room and delicious breakfast supplies provided. The area of Avalon beach is stunning. I cannot wait to come back! "),
("2015-10-17", "6292364", "Lorainne", "Room was clean  amenities good and reasonably priced. Great for a quick getaway to the northern beaches. Cathy was friendly and helpful."),
("2015-10-26", "6292364", "Diego", "Great place to stay. Cathy was warm  welcoming  helpful and a wonderful host  happy to assist you with what you need. The room is exactly as described. It was clean  comfortable  practical and beautifully decorated. Bed was cosy and neatly arranged. You have everything you need: clean and private bathroom ensuite  wall-mounted TV and a delicious and healthy breakfast  which you can enjoy on a nice table outside the room. I would highly recommend this place to everyone staying in Avalon as it is perfectly located and well priced. We would love to go back to this quiet and lovely place soon."),
("2015-11-01", "6292364", "Kerry", "Cathys place in Avalon is beautifully furnished with a huge very very comfortable bed. Cathy is a warm and welcoming host who made our stay very lovely. I would highly recommend staying here to explore the beautiful area."),
("2015-11-08", "6292364", "Ashley", "We stayed at Cathy's place for a friends wedding over the weekend and absolutely loved it! It was perfect for a comfortable nights sleep  very clean  nice and modern. Cathy was lovely  making sure we had everything we needed and then leaving us to it. We were running a little late so had to rush in and get ready before taking off to the wedding!The area is perfect too  just down the road from the shops and not too far to the beach. We will definitely be staying there again in the future if we are up that way and recommending to our friends. Thanks Cathy! "),
("2015-11-13", "6292364", "Tobias", "Cathy was a very nice and communicative host that helped us with some awesome and important tips and had many things to recommend in the area. Her place was only a 10 min. walk away from Avalon beach and an 15 min. drive to the gorgeous palm beach. The room was beautifully decorated and clean."),
("2015-11-15", "6292364", "Aurelie", "Cathy made us feel very welcome and went out of her way to help us on two occasions.Avalon was beautiful. We discovered the street we where on is not only close to avalon beach but also a stone through away from paradice beach - which is a small beach on the pittwater side of avalon. Stunning! Thank you Cathy We loved our stay!!"),
("2015-11-20", "6292364", "Joelee", "Beautiful. Serene. Private and in a beautiful location."),
("2015-12-04", "6292364", "Ilona", "Neighbourhood was peaceful and we really enjoyed our time in there."),
("2015-12-06", "6292364", "Su-Lin", "Cathy was welcoming and polite and even provided a nice and healthy breakfast for me for the next day. The room looked exactly as pictured  I found it to be clean and comfortable.  It was in a quiet neighbourhood  close to Avalon beach and overall a very pleasant stay. Thank you Cathy."),
("2015-12-12", "6292364", "Caroline", "The place was great - exactly what was on the description. Lovely room with lots of light  clean and cosy."),
("2015-12-17", "6292364", "Barbara", "Cathy's fully self-contained studio apartment has the comfort and stylishness of an inner-city space. Step outside and you are graced with the stunning scenery of a wilderness landscape. Then head down to the Avalon shops and you have the atmosphere of a friendly village. I had the most magnificent mid-week break at Cathy's apartment. She and the sweet (and useless-as-a-guard-dog) Maggie were welcoming and friendly.I can not recommend Cathy's place enough. It was rejuvenating. I live in the centre of Sydney  needed a break  so I headed north. The landscape  neighbourhood  people  food  everything was wonderful. And Cathy's kindness and her beautiful space just made it perfect.I will be back. And soon. "),
("2015-12-20", "6292364", "Sarah", "Cathy is a beautiful soft natured lady. Was very helpful."),
("2015-12-30", "6292364", "Gage", "Cathy provided everything we needed for a great stay. It was a lovely room walking distance to the beach. I would definitely recommend!"),
("2016-01-02", "6292364", "Kim", "Cathy is a lovely host that is providing a nice and cosy room in a quiet and relaxing area of Avalon Beach above Sydney.  A really comfortable stay  a short trip away to some amazing beaches!  Cathy provided plenty of useful local tips during our stay including helping us figure out our plans on NYE in Sydney relating to public transport.  "),
("2016-01-06", "6292364", "Sylvia", "We really loved our stay at Cathy's place. Location is very nice  close to everything but in a quiet surrounding. Cathy is a very nice lady who does everything she can to make your stay as comfortable as possible. Everything was very clean and she provided us with stuff for breakfast  towels.. Such a shame we had very bad weather. Perfect excuse to return one time :) We can really recommend Cathy's place! :)"),
("2016-01-10", "6292364", "Gavin", "Cathy was absolutely lovely. She made us feel welcome and completely at home! The room was immaculate - so clean and comfortable and plenty of space too. I loved the seperate entry to the room and so convenient being able to keep our car close by. Cathy looked after us so well  we are very grateful and look forward to returning some time soon!"),
("2016-01-17", "6292364", "Stephanie", "My boyfriend and I stayed at Cathy's property for 1 night whilst attending a Wedding in Palm Beach. The rooms was clean  tidy  presented beautifully and although we didn't eat it  there was breakfast (muesli  blueberries etc) in the fridge for us. Cathy responded straight away  was very friendly and I would recommend staying her property. "),
("2016-01-25", "6292364", "Karen", "Lovely apartment  just like the description / pictures. Off road parking and peaceful neighbourhood. Cathy was easy to communicate with and happy to help at any point. "),
("2016-01-27", "6292364", "Vicki", "Cathy met us on arrival and made us feel comfortable. As we were arriving back after dark Cathy left an outside light on for us. Decor in the room was tasteful and we had an enjoyable overnight stay.  We really appreciated the very comfortable bed and bedding and the delicious continental breakfast. Car access was great and we parked right next to our room. The room was well fitted out with everything we needed. We will be back."),
("2016-01-31", "6292364", "Robyn", "As I was running a little bit behind my advised arrival time  Cathy checked in with me to ensure I was ok and to advise she had left a key for me  as she may not be home when I arrived. This simple gesture was very thoughtful and much appreciated.Cathy was a perfect host  making me feel very welcome and if there was anything I needed to just ask.The room was fresh  clean and tastefully presented  with everything you would need for a short getaway.The location was perfect  private  quiet and peaceful. I will definitely be returning to this gem on the Northern Beaches.Thank you Cathy =)"),
("2016-02-08", "6292364", "Rubirosa", "Cathy is a wonderful host. She is very kind and hospitable. She made sure I got what I need. The place is as described. I was able to relax and enjoy the beaches (Paradise  Palm Beach  Avalon). "),
("2016-02-14", "6292364", "Natasha", "We had a really nice stay at Cathy's place. It was pleasant  convenient and had everything we needed. We had a lovely breakfast there too. It was overall really enjoyable."),
("2016-02-19", "6292364", "Jeff", "Cathy is a wonderful and generous host. The room is perfect for my needs."),
("2016-02-21", "6292364", "Mick", "Beautiful and clean room  facilities were really good and it was a great base for our weekend"),
("2016-02-25", "6292364", "Li Li", "I was made to feel very welcome through multiple texts and a personal greeting from Cathy."),
("2016-03-06", "6292364", "Sally", "Cathy was a perfect host.  We had strawberries  muslie  yogurt and milk in the fridge on arrival.  The room and bathroom were lovely and clean  with a very comfortable bed.Cathy has considered everything in the room  my mum and I were very comfortable there.The location is also perfect  the area is very peaceful and would highly recommend staying with Cathy.Thanks Cathy for a memorable stay! "),
("2016-03-10", "6292364", "Eve", "We had a couple of relaxing nights/days at Cathy's. Great but simple  set-up. It was quite homey and Cathy was a friendly and helpful host  and was quick to help us with a clothing rack  and made sure there was enough breakfast each morning. Thanks Cathy for your kind hospitality."),
("2016-03-13", "6292364", "Anthony", "Cathy's room was just what I needed. It was clean  comfortable and quiet and only a few minutes walk from the sailing club where I was attending a wedding reception. It's not a big space but has everything you need for a short stay and I would readily recommend it.Cathy was great with her directions and communication leading up to my stay. Oh and the surrounding area  all the huge mature eucalypts and down by the water are just beautiful. Thank's Cathy..Anthony."),
("2016-03-17", "6292364", "Jeff", "Cathy is a wonderful host"),
("2016-04-07", "6292364", "Lindsay", "Nice welcome  quiet neighbourhood. For most people a car would be necessary. In my case I enjoyed the 2k walk down to the cafes and shops at Avalon. Cathy was a nice host and any requests were quickly attended to."),
("2016-04-10", "6292364", "Phil", "Cathy was a friendly and helpful host. The room  bed and bathroom were clean  comfortable and welcoming. The location was a beautiful quiet street. Cathy supplied milk and a great selection of teas. Just what I needed for my stay.  I would definitely go back."),
("2016-04-13", "6292364", "Jeff", "Cathy is always a fantastic host - easy-going  flexible and a great communicator."),
("2016-04-18", "6292364", "Hannah", "Lovely room in a great area with a wonderful and accommodating host!"),
("2016-04-22", "6292364", "Kat", "Cathy was a wonderful host  the room was perfect- very clean  quiet and private  comfortable and great location. Cathy was super flexible when it came to check in time and her communication was excellent. The breakfast was a lovely touch and there are even beach towels included. An amazing place to stay if visiting Avalon and surrounding areas. Thanks again! "),
("2016-04-24", "6292364", "Géraldine", "It was amazing staying in this lovely room  it is all perfect in there  everything is easy with Cathy. We really enjoyed our weekend in palm beach thanks to Cathy. Thank you"),
("2016-05-08", "6292364", "Laura", "We had an amazing stay at Cathys place. The room has its own entry and is self contained with its own private bathroom  fridge and kitchenette. The place is very clean  bed very comfortable and Cathy was even kind enough to supply some fresh blueberries to go with breakfast. The location is perfect  we walked down to paradise beach which was gorgeous and 5 minutes away. Would highly recommend Cathys place for anyone looking for a weekend retreat! "),
("2016-05-16", "6292364", "Emma", "My partner and I really enjoyed Cathy's space. It was in a peaceful area  easy 10 15 minute stroll to town. The room was clean with everything we needed. The bed was so comfy with the nicest sheets. Cathy was very nice and we had all the privacy we needed. The provided breakfast of yoghurt  muesli and blueberries was so yum! Great little air BnB :) "),
("2016-05-30", "6292364", "Angela", "Very private  very quiet and lovely. The room was all I needed for a peaceful retreat.  Nice walking in the area  including down to Pittwater at Paradise beach.  Thanks Cathy!"),
("2016-06-19", "6292364", "Katie", "The room was private clean and comfortable. Cathy responded to all our queries promptly and made us feel very welcome."),
("2016-07-02", "6292364", "Fuchao", "Warmly welcomed and extremely clean room."),
("2016-07-15", "6292364", "Bec", "wonderful!!!!"),
("2016-08-27", "6292364", "Helen", "Avalon Beach is a very scenic destination  not far from Palm Beach. Cathy's cosy room was as expected. Great to walk down to nearby Paradise and Clareville Beaches and watch the water craft on beautiful Pittwater. There was a warm welcome from Cathy  very helpful with everything. Hopefully I will return for another stay ..."),
("2016-09-05", "6292364", "Anna", "Had a lovely single night stay here whilst in the area for a wedding. Room was comfortable  bed fantastic and breakfast (muesli  yogurt  fruit) fresh & delicious. Cathy was flexible with both check-in and check-out times. Couldn't have asked for more."),
("2016-09-09", "6292364", "Karilyn", "Ten out of ten. *****. The place is exactly as pictured - impeccably clean  bright and airy with all the facilities. Crisp white sheets  lots of pillows and a comfy bed complete the relaxing feel. I came here to rest and left refreshed and calm. Cathy was a perfect host. Her communications were excellent  prompt and relevant. I can't wait to return! Thankyou Cathy' "),
("2016-09-17", "6292364", "Greg And Carly", "Beautiful little private room with ensuite under the main house. Cathy has set the  room up beautifully  in keeping with it's nearby beach setting. Good comfortable bed  nice bathroom  very clean and off street parking was offered right outside our door. In addition the room is decked out with lots of extras  a little breakfast bar  tea and coffee (espresso machine)  a bar fridge with milk and breakfast items plus coathangers  powerboard for charging devices  travel books. It was more than we needed for a short one night stay to go to a nearby wedding but such a lovely touch. Cathy even left an outside light on and a note on our door for how to turn it off when we got home in a Uber after dark.Perfect spot to stay to explore Avalon  Pittwater  Whale Beach  Palm Beach  the Barrenjoey lighthouse. Would recommend for couples."),
("2016-09-25", "6292364", "Deborah", "Cathy made us very welcome and her cosy room is just that! Clean  comfortable  plenty of helpful amenities( tea/coffee  milk  lots of towels  very warm comfortable bed  reading material)We would recommend anyone to stay in this quiet spot  a short walk to Pittwater."),
("2016-10-07", "6292364", "Chris", "The perfect experience for our first Airbnb stay!  Friendly and effortless welcome with all of the info we would need to immediately feel right-at-home.  Secure parking right outside our door and beautifully private.  The room and facilities were immaculate and very well appointed  conducive to a very relaxed two weeks which my wife and I thoroughly enjoyed.  Our host was always available for queries and a chat but never obtrusive.Avalon should be on your to-do list when visiting Sydney with world-class beaches on one hand  beautiful Pittwater on the other and  boutique shopping and all the facilities one could require in between.  Conveniently situated within easy reach of all of these  Cathy's cosy room is an ideal retreat  cool and quiet on a hot afternoon with the sound of birds and the breeze in the tall gum-trees to enjoy as you unwind.We look forward to another visit in the not-too-distant future  knowing that our stay would be just as pleasant and fulfilling as the time we have already enjoyed there!"),
("2016-10-08", "6292364", "Jane", "This was my first Airbnb and it was everything and more that we hoped for. The room was as shown and described. Cathy was very helpful including volunteering to collect us from the Palm Beach Ferry if required. Cathy was also very flexible with check in and check out times which for us was a plus. The room was set back from the road in a garden with beautiful gum trees with off road parking available and a bonus was to be right opposite a bus stop. Fantastic."),
("2016-12-24", "6292364", "Sarah", "I had a wonderful stay at Cathy's place. It was a great experience. Very accommodating and as described. Highly recommend!"),
("2016-12-28", "6292364", "Trish", "Had a lovely stay at Cathy's place.Close to beautiful paradise beach and restaurant in hilltop Rd ouzo was conveniently located with great Greek food."),
("2017-01-01", "6292364", "Seldy", "Great place to stay and explore the Northern Beaches"),
("2017-01-03", "6292364", "Harriet", "We felt very welcome by Cathy. She was very easy going with the check in and out times. The crisp white sheets and a very comfortable mattress made for a sound sleep. Thank you Cathy."),
("2017-01-05", "6292364", "Sonali", "We were only at Cathy's place for one night but it was really lovely - spotlessly clean  comfy with a great selection of tea/coffee. Cathy was kind enough to pick us up from the bus stop  and was very helpful throughout our stay."),
("2017-01-07", "6292364", "Eliza", "Had a great and convenient stay at Chathy's. Super laid back and easy going. We would stay again! Thank you Cathy for your hospitality."),
("2017-01-17", "6292364", "Kim", "I enjoyed the privacy and it had everything I needed to enjoy my stay."),
("2017-01-25", "6292364", "Brittany", "Cathy place is  private  clean and well equipped. Loved our stay  we appreciated the fan in the room to keep us as some days as it was very hot. Cathy is super nice and helpful! Public transport is near accomodation and Cathy is also happy to drop you to close locations. Would be happy to come back and stay. Overall a pleasant and affordable stay :) "),
("2017-01-27", "6292364", "Grace", "Cathy's place is gorgeous! It was just what we were after - perfect for a  private getaway to the Northern Beaches of Sydney. Her place is located in a quiet and peaceful street between The River/Paradise Beach  and Avalon surf beach - we were able to walk to both.A comfy bed  beautiful bathroom and great additions like beachtowels and brekky provisions made for a relaxing one night stay for us. Cathy was very kind in offering us tips on the local area and is quick to communicate with.Will definitely stay here the next time we look into a trip to the Beaches.Thanks Cathy!"),
("2017-02-04", "6292364", "Jodie", "Our stay at Cathy's was wonderful. Cathy was so accommodating and really friendly. A great place to stay and a lovely neighbourhood."),
("2017-02-18", "6292364", "Danielle", "Cathy's airbnb is just perfect for a couple or solo traveler looking for privacy in a peaceful setting. With your own entrance  ensuite bathroom and the extra touches of soda water in the fridge  nespesso coffee machine  fruit yogurt and muesli for breakie and beach towels for use  it was a treat. The room was spotless  with modern bathroom and decorated beautifully. Cathy was even helpful enough to arrange a fan in the room for us prior to arrival as we had been having some very hot weather of late. Just fantastic!"),
("2017-02-21", "6292364", "Nicole", "Cathy's bnb was absolutely perfect. Private  beautifully styled  quality linens and appliances and the bathroom was brand new! So many beautiful touches  chilled water and a lovely breakfast which all made me feel very at home. Cathy was a really lovely lady  so easy to converse with. Will def. stay again if I am in the area. "),
("2017-03-03", "6292364", "Olesia", "We enjoyed our stay in Avalon with Cathy very much. Cathy coordinated with us when we needed to adjust our layover  and it was much appreciated. She is very responsive and accommodating. Her son was pleasant to talk to as well and was helpful with directions. The room looked great in the picture and was better in person. Very bright  white  clean  and prepared. All the amenities came in handy  as well: fridge  micro  and the light breakfast. Her place is near everything in the Avalon area  and the bus stop directly across from her place runs every hour and gets you anywhere you need to go  if you're like us and didn't hire a car. Avalon beach itself is a great holiday spot  with lots of shops in the village accross the way from the beach. and the nearby Palm and Whale beach make for a good getaway."),
("2017-03-07", "6292364", "Stewart", "Cathy has done well to transform a basement area into a bedroom and lovely ensuite  but I think it needs a little more work as it was a bit musty when we were there  in very wet Sydney weather."),
("2017-03-12", "6292364", "Gabrielle", "My daughter stayed at Cathy's place for a birthday week-end.  She enjoyed it immensely  and Cathy was a perfect host."),
("2017-03-18", "6292364", "Ken And Margie", "Comfortable and good location.  Communication was excellent."),
("2017-03-27", "6292364", "Alice", "We had a wonderful  relaxing stay at Cathys  she was an excellent host. Making sure we had everything we needed. We had three days in Avalon and enjoyed exploring the area. Our favourite spot being paradise beach for sun down. Which was very close to the house. The room was very well equipped with everything you need for a little break for two. "),
("2017-04-03", "6292364", "Rich", "Well equipped and excellent location. The host was a pleasure to deal with from the outset."),
("2017-04-09", "6292364", "Rhiannan", "Cathy was a very attentive host  taking care of everything to make us feel at home and our stay more comfortable. Unfortunately we didn't get to meet Cathy but communication was excellent before and throughout our stay. I would highly recommend staying here if you're ever in the area."),
("2017-04-17", "6292364", "Michael", "If you are looking for a fantastic place to stay in the Northern Beaches area Cathy s place is definitely a must."),
("2017-04-21", "6292364", "Nancy", "Cathy's place was just what we needed!  The location was perfect for us as we could walk to town  and walk to our relative's home.  All the basics were there for a comfy safe place to rest our heads and have a wonderful and comfortable night's sleep.  Cathy was a great host  and offered great suggestions for our time in the area  and even drove us locally for our errands on our departure morning which was unexpected and very helpful to us!We would stay again if the opportunity presents itself."),
("2017-04-29", "6292364", "Liam", "Cathy is a terrific host and the accommodation had everything we needed. The location is beautiful and only a short walk down to the water or into town."),
("2017-09-16", "6292364", "Gordan", "It was a good short stay in Cathy's room  unfortunately we arrived too late (11PM) and departures too early (7:30AM) so the host and guests missed out each other  but Cathy left the door opened for us.For future reference  I would recommend the guests who drive to the host  to park their cars at Cathy's front yard  as I parked my car on the street just outside Cathy's house and got someone intentionally scratched my car doors. "),
("2017-10-01", "6292364", "Graham", "It's the little things  like breakfast muesli  fresh strawberries  great coffee as well as well presented  quite neighbourhood.  We really loved our stay and can highly recommend to others staying on the northern beaches of Sydney."),
("2017-10-05", "6292364", "Lena", "We had a perfect stay! Nice  comfortable room  very clean!"),
("2017-10-08", "6292364", "Ian", "Cathy's place is very clean and comfortable and is ideally suited to short stays. It is located within walking difference to shops and restaurants etc. We were very happy with our stay."),
("2017-10-11", "6292364", "Liesbet", "The room was very nice and clean. We only stayed for one night  but felt welcome and comfortable immediately. Cathy is a very friendly person who gives you the privacy you need  but is also there when you have a question."),
("2017-10-14", "6292364", "Louise", "Lovely spot. Great host."),
("2017-11-01", "6292364", "Margit", "Cathy’s place is amazing! I ended up extending my stay an extra night (4 in total). An easy 20 min walk to Avalon Centre where you’ll find a few shops  restaurants  cafes and the beach. Highly reccommended!"),
("2017-11-12", "6292364", "Deb", "Cathy s place was very comfortable and clean . Cathy made sure that we were settled in and gave us plenty of information to make our stay (Website hidden by Airbnb) was a great location and make sure you wander down to Paradise Beach for sunset.Stunning. Cathy was a lovely  friendly lady and made us feel at home.Thanks Cathy xx"),
("2017-11-17", "6292364", "Tudor", "We really enjoyed our stay in Cathy’s room! It offers privacy  is spacious and has a very comfy bed. There is tea and coffee provided  as well as a toaster and some fruits  yoghurt  milk  and muesli for breakfast. Cathy was a great host  and even picked us up from the nearest bus stop on our arrival! There are plenty of beaches  shops and restaurants around. Great place!"),
("2017-11-20", "6292364", "Alexandra", "Cathy was a lovely host and her attention to small details made the stay most enjoyable. An affordable price and not a single thing that I could think off that Cathy didn’t provide us with. Would stay there again without a doubt and would definitely recommend it to others."),
("2017-11-25", "6292364", "Kieren-Lea", "Cute and comfy stay! Cathy was great & ensured we had everything we needed for our night away."),
("2017-12-02", "6292364", "Vern", "Lovely neighbourhood  comfy bed  loved the fresh strawberries and yoghurt. Thanks Cathy."),
("2017-12-10", "6292364", "Claudio", "Very nice room..clean and furnished! In a good queiet position!..and Cathy is a very good person! Recommended!!"),
("2017-12-17", "6292364", "Nia", "A wonderful place and wonderful host. Perfect for us as we were going to a wedding in Palm Beach. Thanks Cathy for having us."),
("2017-12-20", "6292364", "Amanda", "Cathy’s place couldn’t be more perfect! The bed and linens were incredibly comfortable  the room was beautiful  and a fan was cooling off the room on arrival. It also included a beach bag and towels  little kitchen set up  even yogurt and strawberries in the fridge. Along with Cathy’s wonderful recommendations for food in the area our stay couldn’t have been better. I would highly recommend staying here!"),
("2017-12-28", "6292364", "Roslyn", "Great location  walking distance to Paradise Beach (awesome sunset)  close to public transport.  Cathy is friendly and a great host. Shops and beaches are a short drive away.  The area is tranquil and I loved waking up to the sound of laughing kookaburras."),
("2018-01-06", "6292364", "Catrin", "This place is quite small as described but was exactly what we needed. The room is seperated from the rest of the house so is private and you have your own bathroom. Everything was clean and decorated nicely. Shower was very good and the place was nice and cool even when 40 degrees outside. Cathy was lovely and let us check in and out at our requested times.Location is great if you have a car with off road parking. If you have no car  the town and main beach are about 30 minutes walk and there is a quieter beach 5 minute walk away.This place was just what we needed!"),
("2018-01-11", "6292364", "Chantelle", "Cathy is a lovely host. Quick replies and always checks in to see how you are travelling. Cathy gives great local tips and offers a hand if in need. Quite a comfortable place to stay :)"),
("2018-01-14", "6292364", "Sophie", "Lovely spot and Cathy was very accommodating and responsive. Nice and clean room with personal touches which made the stay more enjoyable."),
("2018-01-27", "6292364", "Renee", "Highly recommended if you are looking for a place to explore the Northern Beaches. Great location and we had a lovely comfortable stay. Cathy was a great host!"),
("2018-02-03", "6292364", "Damien", "We had a pleasant stay at Cathy’s place. The room is quite narrow but clean and well located at convenient distance from the beach and a couple of cafes. Cathy gave us a very warm welcome at our arrival which was great."),
("2018-02-10", "6292364", "Donna", "Cathy thought of everything.  It is a beautiful  clean room in a lovely setting.  Cathy was there if we needed anything and still respected our privacy.  The room was very comfortable and spotlessly clean.  Excellent value for money. I would highly recommend."),
("2018-02-18", "6292364", "David", "Conveniently located between Clareville and Avalon village & beach  Cathy's space is as described compact and comfortable  ideal for a short stay being spotlessly clean  stylishly furnished and well appointed. We thoroughly enjoyed our brief stay with Cathy who goes out her way to ensure guests are comfortable and well informed."),
("2018-02-24", "6292364", "Andrea", "We had one amazing stay at Cathy's. The host is incredibly mindful  making sure everything is available for the guests. Location was super practical  the room was clean and Cathy was lovely! She was very helpful giving us tips on where to go  and made us feel very welcome."),
("2018-03-02", "6292364", "Nada", "Nice space and easy enough to get to. The coffee machine and selection of teas was a lovely touch."),
("2018-03-04", "6292364", "Natalie", "Home from home  beautifully presented room in a peaceful location. Cathy was a efficient hostess  warm and welcoming. We only got to spend one night here when attending a wedding at Whale beach; just wish we had longer! Thank you for having us!"),
("2018-04-02", "6292364", "Edisson", "Cathy's place was a great choice. It is well located  not far from public transport  sparkling clean and quite cozy.She gave us quite a few tips on how to get around as well as to what to do and see.The breakfast provided is good an simple.Even though it is rightly described as  pint sized we felt comfortable and didn't miss anything. Cathy was happy to help whenever we need it.Great value for money. Highly recommended."),
("2018-04-08", "6292364", "Paul", "good"),
("2018-04-15", "6292364", "Simon", "The room was fantastic  just what we needed for a short stay in the area. We'd love to stay again and explore the area in more detail. Room was just as described and if we needed anything we only had to ask."),
("2018-04-21", "6292364", "Alexa", "Great little space to stay if you're in this neck of the woods! 10-15 min drive to palm beach  so was perfect for us as we were attending a wedding there. Quiet location & while small  it has everything you need! Cathy is very friendly & accommodating to our early check-in request."),
("2018-04-29", "6292364", "Sarah", "Just what we needed for a one night stay. Cathy was lovely and everything was so clean. Thanks again"),
("2018-05-15", "6292364", "Tom", "Great little getaway with my partner"),
("2018-05-20", "6292364", "Sallyanne", "Peaceful and set in a wonderful part of the world. Stylish  warm and ticked all the boxes."),
("2018-06-03", "6292364", "Susan", "It is a small room  and you have to watch you don't hit your head on the staircase.  However  it was beautifully set out with a very comfortable bed  lovely homey touches and beautiful aromas  sparkling clean.  It was very convenient for us and within walking distance of where we needed to go.  Cathy is a lovely host and all went smoothly  it was just what we wanted."),
("2018-06-09", "6292364", "Josie", "Had a fantastic stay  everything you need and more!! Cathy was lovely and easy to communicate with to organise my stay. "),
("2018-06-17", "6292364", "Saskia", "Absolutely loved this place  perfect for what we needed. Cozy little place and close to shops and beach."),
("2018-06-24", "6292364", "Sonny", "Cathy is a great host  she was very nice and helpful  flexible and always got back to me quickly. The place is really nice with lots of little touches  is a great location to beach and shops. Also excellent parking is right out front!Thanks Cathy"),
("2018-06-27", "6292364", "Yuheng", "I booked the place for 2 nights and I really loved the place  all the basic items are all provided  there were even fruits and breakfast in the fridge  the place was very neat and clean  also having a very relaxing vibe. Cathy is a very nice host and offered to pick us up personally. "),
("2018-07-02", "6292364", "Kuuipo", "This little studio space is absolutely lovely! Had a great stay. Was delighted to find fresh raspberries in the fridge for a yummy cereal breakfast. Great off-street parking and in an amazing tranquil location just up the road from the cafes and shops at Avalon. Thanks to the exceptional host for such a wonderful stay!"),
("2018-07-15", "6292364", "Inae", "Cozy little room  we enjoyed our stay. There is a nice cafe 'Forage Cafe' just 5 minutes walking that has amazing food and coffee"),
("2018-08-04", "6292364", "Kaleb", "Had a lovely 2 night stay at Cathy’s flat  warm  clean with everything and more that we needed. Thanks"),
("2018-08-12", "6292364", "Frances", "We were very impressed with the hospitality and homely feel of this lovely little studio."),
("2018-08-18", "6292364", "Katie", "This was a lovely  charming place to stay. I absolutely loved it. The place was very clean and comfortable and I immediately felt at home. The bed was very comfortable  and there was an electric blanket underneath the linens so the bed was nice and warm (I was here in the winter so this was REALLY nice to have). There was also a little space heater  so it was very comfortable. There was a lovely breakfast set-up with cereal  tea and coffee  and a water boiler. There were fresh flowers on the table and Cathy had written a nice welcoming note. Cathy also drove me to one of my events (I was here for a wedding) when Uber didn't work. It was a lovely stay and I will definitely stay here again if I return!"),
("2018-09-01", "6292364", "Danielle", "Perfect place to stay!"),
("2018-09-09", "6292364", "Kendall", "Cathy’s place is lovely. A nice private space with EVERYTHING you could need for a stay in the Northern Beaches.Cathy is EXTREMELY hospitable and took extra steps to make our stay wonderful."),
("2018-09-15", "6292364", "Ami", "I’m not sure what I can add - all the reviews are accurate - Cathy has created a delightful little spot. She has thought of everything. It was a great spot to stay for the night before going to a wedding at Currawong Beach. Very comfortable with lots of comfy pillows. You can hear people walking around in the house above but you would be hard pressed to find a quieter spot this close to Palm Beach."),
("2018-09-23", "6292364", "Michael", "Such a wonderful host and cosy place. Really enjoyed my stay and would definitely come back again"),
("2018-10-13", "6292364", "Roy", "Awesome host and beautiful place. Definitely recommend"),
("2018-10-21", "6292364", "Shelley", "The room was perfect! It was clean  spacious and homely  exactly what I was hoping for. The bed was really comfy as well and also private from the rest of the house. Cathy’s hospitality was genuine and I found her to be friendly and easy to talk to. I also liked the warmth of the space and I felt very welcome. Would definitely stay again :)"),
("2018-10-24", "6292364", "Sara", "I loved staying at Cathy's place.  A perfectly sized beautiful space with a super comfortable bed and gorgeous to touch linen.  Lots of cute details in decor and Cathy provides everything you may need for a short stay."),
("2018-10-27", "6292364", "Tristan", "thank you so much for the stay  it was absolutely lovely! you have a great response time and your tips on eats are spot on."),
("2018-11-04", "6292364", "Jason", "Cosy room  nice and cool on a hot summer night. Lovely to wake up to the sound of birds. enjoyed the muesli  and yoghurt for breakfast. Plenty of walks around the neighborhood to the water."),
("2018-11-10", "6292364", "Grant", "Great little place for an overnight stay simple and easy experience with Cathie"),
("2018-11-26", "6292364", "Hazel", "This was exactly as described  and Cathy's extra touches made it a really comfortable stay.The place was spotlessly clean  the bed linen was really nice quality  there was even shampoo and conditioner (which I appreciated  having forgotten to pack mine).  I also really appreciated the extra touch of providing breakfast -- lovely muesli  greek yoghurt  fresh berries and milk  and Cathy got in touch ahead of time to see what kind of milk I preferred. Extremely thoughtful.Having stayed in a few places around this area  it was terrific to have off-street parking.All in all  it was perfect for my needs as a sole traveller in the area for business; I would happily stay here again anytime."),
("2018-12-02", "6292364", "Hannah", "Wonderful place to stay  beautiful room & Cathy was so helpful. Perfect for a weekend away!"),
("2018-12-08", "6292364", "Amy", "Cute little place  lovely hospitality  comfort bed and flexiable check in/ out. Breakfast included."),
("2018-12-14", "6292364", "Lauren", "This is perfect for a weekend getaway. It has everything you need  and Cathy is a very friendly host who is excellent at communicating regarding the booking. I would highly recommend this property and would stay there again."),
("2018-12-23", "6292364", "Mel", "This is a newly refurbished room  tastefully decorated with en suite shower and toilet all in pristine condition. Some welcome additional touches like availability of muesli  tea and coffee. Location was great: just down the road from my daughter who I was visiting. A very satisfying stay."),
("2019-01-08", "6292364", "Alex", "Not bad  the breakfast is considerate. It’s near garden so there are lots of small insects and spiders  if you don’t mind  it’s a good option. And it’s near shops and restaurants as well"),
("2019-01-12", "6292364", "Olivia", "Great location  off-street parking  very clean and comfy. Cathy even loaned me a phone charger for the weekend when I forgot mine. Perfect place to enjoy the area from "),
("2019-01-19", "6292364", "Fizzy", "Cathy's place was perfect for our stay in Avalon  just a short distance from all the restaurants and beaches we wanted to visit. The place was very clean and checking in/communicating with Cathy was made very easy. She even provided breakfast bits in the fridge for us which was a lovely touch. Highly recommend for a weekend stay!"),
("2019-01-23", "6292364", "Marine", "Nice place  good environment. We appreciated the sympathy and flexibility of Cathy."),
("2019-02-01", "6292364", "Amanda", "We had a lovely overnight stay. Very comfortable and well equipped room which included terrific breakfast. Clareville shopping centre only a short walk away for a great cup of coffee"),
("2019-02-03", "6292364", "Hannah", "Wonderful place! Very clean and comfortable. Easy communication and check in. The amenities were very thoughtful. Grateful for a hairdryer! And lovely breakfast :) Cathy's place is about 15 mins walk to Avalon town centre and beach  which is beautiful!We would highly recommend staying here. Thank you!"),
("2019-02-08", "6292364", "Pamela", "Cathy’s place is a delightful gem. I felt I was staying in a cosy Greek studio...close to the water  beautiful trees and a leafy terrace to enjoy an afternoon drink. Cathy’s local recommendations were spot on: sunset at nearby Paradise Beach; walk to Clareville Beach; French restaurant in Avalon and local shops were all excellent. My three days were just what I wanted  sun  swimming  long walks in beautiful bush and a charming village...I felt re-energised. Cathy is the perfect host: welcoming but not intrusive. The breakfast coffee  yoghurt  berries and muesli were a wonderful bonus. Many thanks  Cathy."),
("2019-02-09", "6292364", "Danielle", "We had a lovely stay at cathy's place to get away from sydney. The place was cute and cozy. Cathy provided all the amenities we required for a comfortable  stay. She was always prompt and helpful in her communications."),
("2019-02-15", "6292364", "Lottie", "Very cute little room. Perfect for a nights stay or weekend away. Had all the basics you need to keep your things and rest between enjoying Palm Beach/Avalon! Cathy was very communicative and helpful  but also gave us privacy which meant it felt like we were alone on a couples holiday."),
("2019-02-21", "6292364", "Leigh", "Cathy is a wonderful host  the room was lovely with a fabulously comfortable bed and  unexpectedly  an espresso maker!Cathy was brilliant on being touch and available if needed  everything was very clear and straightforward on arrival.Would recommend highly and stay here again.Very handy for the Forage  a great coffee shop.Thanks Cathy."),
("2019-03-02", "6292364", "Pj", "What a gem! just a few minutes from the beach and a short walk to the shops. Cathy pulls out all the stops in terms of hospitality  providing us with breakfast and even a coffee pod machine. There were even beach towels and a cute little bag to take with us to the beach. She even provided the much-needed and often impossible to pack pair of scissors  which came in handy for 2 people who had flown in. The room has everything you could need  a comfy bed and pillows  a fan  a TV and a fridge. The bathroom also has a large shower. All in all  a great place!"),
("2015-10-10", "6404761", "Liz", "Listing description accurate"),
("2015-11-20", "6404761", "Mary", "Lovely location close to everything we needed and also close to lovely beach. Room immaculate and comfortable though a little hot. Weather in Sydney was unusually hot."),
("2016-01-01", "6404761", "Will", "Robyn and Ken were lovely. They both looked after us from the beginning and worked hard to ensure that our stay over NYE was as comfortable as possible even to the extent of driving us to a NYE fireworks viewing location... I would highly recommend Robyn and Ken and their beautiful Mosman house to anybody traveling through Sydney."),
("2016-01-09", "6404761", "Henry", "We received a very friendly welcome from Robyn and her husband Ken. Robyn gave us a cup of tea in the garden as soon as we arrived. We immediately felt more like friends than paying guests. The room was spacious  and the bed comfortable. Robyn also made available a continental breakfast at a modest additional charge. Being able to put through a load of washing was a big bonus.Thanks both for a very pleasant stay!"),
("2016-02-13", "6404761", "Nicole", "So much appreciate your thoughtfulness Robyn  it was a great joy to stay with you  thank you"),
("2016-02-21", "6404761", "Alastair", "This is a wonderful place to stay! The house is beautiful and filled with character  the area peaceful and convenient.Robyn and Ken were excellent hosts and made each guest feel very comfortable. All in all  this was a delightful experience and I wouldn't hesitate in going back if the opportunity arose."),
("2016-03-17", "6404761", "David", "This was my first airbnb and I think I struck gold. Robyn and Ken were the perfect hosts and made me feel at home from the time I first arrived to the time I left.I would recommend this airbnb to anyone who wants the perfect hosts in a very convenient location."),
("2016-06-28", "6404761", "Sharon", "Robin and Ken were the most charming of hosts  their home felt like a home away from home. Nothing was too much of a problem. Easy walk to Mosman shops and 20 min casual walk to Balmoral beach.Would stay here again."),
("2016-08-08", "6404761", "Tilly", "Robyn and Ken were the perfect hosts. Went way beyond normal host efforts to ensure our comfort of needs. Delightful experience and we will be back."),
("2017-01-09", "6404761", "Shuang", "Robyn and her husband are so kind  like back to my home. you can not miss her and her home"),
("2017-02-26", "6404761", "Sarah", "Wonderful stay and lovely people."),
("2017-03-18", "6404761", "Alison", "Robyn and Ken were lovely hosts. We arrived late the first night and they kindly made arrangements to accommodate that. They also let us leave our cases on the day we left so we could go to the beach and collect them in the afternoon.The house is on a quiet street  a short walk from the bus stop and some nice bakeries  cafes and restaurants. You can also walk or get the bus to Balmoral beach and Taronga zoo. Robyn and Ken even offered us a lift but we decided to walk down to the beach. We got the bus back as it's quite steep.We actually stayed in their other double room  not the one in the photo  but the two rooms looked essentially the same. A nice  comfortable room and bed. The bathroom is shared but that wasn't a problem. There were other guests too but we barely saw them."),
("2018-05-11", "6404761", "Lynette", "Robyn was very welcoming and made sure that I was comfortable and warm as it had just turned very cold! Cosy bed. Very good value. Good central position. Lovely host!"),
("2018-10-19", "6404761", "James & Roz", "Robyn’s place is to n a wonderful location   a gorgeous house in Mosman close to everything! The room is very nice & the bed very comfortable Robyn & Ken are wonderful hosts & make you feel completely at home !!"),
("2018-11-18", "6404761", "Lukas", "Robyn and Ken were very accommodating and easy to communicate with. Great location and lovely house."),
("2018-12-02", "6404761", "Will", "lovely house with lovely people"),
("2018-12-08", "6404761", "Esmira", "Enjoyed breakfast in Robyn's lovely garden. Very nice location and welcoming hosts!"),
("2019-01-04", "6404761", "Herminia", "Robyn’s place is as beautiful as described  including the amenities. The location is great and near to shops  public transport and walking distance to Balmoral Beach. Robyn‘s house is tastefully furnished and you can enjoy your breakfast in their beautiful garden. We enjoyed walking through different streets to get to and from the beach. We also walked from Cremorne Point to Robyn‘s place via Mosman Bay and it is so beautiful and highly recommended."),
("2019-01-23", "6404761", "Margaret", "Beautiful garden to sit in for meals. Robyn makes sure you want for nothing.  A most pleasurable stay. Thankyou. Ann"),
("2019-02-15", "6404761", "Will", "I loved my stay here. The back patio  surrounded by plants  is perfect for breakfast . Robyn is a thoughtful and caring host."),
("2013-01-07", "644054", "Casey", "Very homely and unfussy house with a great garden and lovely neighbours. Belinda was very thorough about advice on local ameneties and very professional to deal with in all matters. They left bikes and a surfboard for my use too."),
("2017-07-15", "644054", "Lisa", "Belinda is a lovely host and their home is very welcoming & family friendly. You feel relaxed as soon as you arrive! Our kids loved the back yard and the trampoline and the other toys that Belinda kindly left out for us. Would highly recommend!"),
("2017-12-27", "644054", "Lida", "Belinda was a perfect host and made it really easy to check in and settle in her home. The house and garden are lovely and the garden studio very comfortable. The area is very quiet and close to lovely beaches. We enjoyed our stay  and felt right at home. Thanks for giving us a great Christmas break on the Beaches !"),
("2015-10-07", "6516405", "LorenSo", "The host canceled this reservation 84 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-03-30", "6516405", "Cara", "The host canceled this reservation 14 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-12-31", "6516405", "Abe", "I really did enjoy my stay especially I was able to park the car indoor and the place was perfect with a stunning view of the river. highly recommend it to any future guests. I met Zed and his gf last few minutes before we checked out as they were away during the new year and they seems really friendly and nice even with just talking with them for a short time."),
("2019-02-09", "6516405", "SandraMilena", "I highly recommend Zed place  location is amazing  just 15 away from the city  the complex is plenty of green areas and water view from the balcony.  We love the flat.Even tha t Zed were not around as He was in Europe  we got response very fast  He helped us with the late checking and also  very kind  He allowed us to stay one night more for free.I would love to find a place like Zed flat for my next Airbnb stay."),
("2019-02-28", "6516405", "Rolf Dieter", "Wonderful hosts  very warm and friendly. Absolute recommendation."),
("2012-09-01", "652063", "Marc", "The appartment is very nice  2nd floor  200 mt from the beach... Harnan is a very nice personat the disposal for any information that you need during my dungeon at home. I was like at home and never fails nothing. Muy buena onda :)"),
("2012-09-25", "652063", "Lorraine", "Hernan is a gracious host  pleasant and friendly in the short contact that we had. I arrived very late and he was amenable to receiving me though he had an early start the following morning.  I was attending a conference at the Novotel and it was close enough to have a pleasant walk along the beachfront and enjoy the ambience of cafes from several different ""countries"" such as Greece  Italy  Asia  an eclectic mix. Lovely area on the weekend with a festive spirit.I enjoyed the many touches of RED in the unit and the luxurious growth of indoor plants. It is like home from  home  a nice feel of the neighbourhood. "),
("2012-10-08", "652063", "Sabrina", "The apartment is really lovely and clean and even close to the beach!Hernan is a very nice  friendly and open-minded guy -and now a good friend :D Had a nice time with him: We did some barbecue and went to down town  etc -I'm very happy that I chose to stay at his place and that I met him!May good times continue  THANKS Hernan"),
("2012-11-28", "652063", "Manal", "Hernan and his grilfriend are lovely couple. It was pleasure staying with them.  Thanks guys."),
("2013-06-08", "652063", "Meg", "Hernan and Connie were wonderful and friendly hosts. Their appartment has a great vibe and is a short walk from the Bay Street shops and restaurants. Their place was an ideal place for me while I was attending a conference at the Brighton le sands Novotel.. Thanks again!"),
("2013-08-14", "652063", "Han", "It has been a pleasant stay with Hernan and Connie. Lovely and friendly couple with great hospitality. Their place is really close to the beach with plenty of eateries nearby within walkable distance. With convenient public bus access to the metro station. A quiet area which is good for travelers who are looking for some peace."),
("2013-09-19", "652063", "Starr", "Very nice neat clean accommodation. Host is a lovely person."),
("2013-09-24", "652063", "Jacqueline Yow", "Absolutely lovely stay in the small cosy apartment. Walkable distance to the bus stops and beach nearby. The apartment itself was clean and tidy  and Hernan + his girlfriend was a polite host. Highly recommended. Cheers. :)"),
("2013-09-27", "652063", "Beilei", "Great apartment with wonderful host. There is a beautiful beach  just 3 mins walk. The room has got everything you need   Highly recommend. "),
("2013-10-07", "652063", "Aline", "Quiet and well furnished room  really close to the beach.Since I arrived late and left early I didn't get to meet Hernan but he left me the keys in the mailbox and everything worked out perfectly."),
("2013-10-14", "652063", "Marie-Sophie", "Hernan and Connie are a very nice couple. We had a very good time at their apartment. They are generous  relax andd very sympathetic. The expression "" mi casa es su casa"" comes alive! Perfect room. Recommended!"),
("2013-11-11", "652063", "Edgar", "Fantastic room and wonderful persons that are connie and Hernan"),
("2013-11-14", "652063", "Benoit", "Thanks for this first night in Sydney. The Bed is very comfortable and Hernan and Connie are very nice people."),
("2013-11-18", "652063", "Param", "Very nice people  helpful and friendly. Cosy flat. Good shower!"),
("2013-11-20", "652063", "Danielle", "Hernan and Connie were kind  welcoming and accommodating.  It was just what we needed after our long days walking around Sydney.  Getting to see lorikeets on their balcony was an unexpected bonus!"),
("2013-11-24", "652063", "Param", "My second stay was as good as the first. Just overnight  but I arrived earlier and was able to catch up with a bit of TV news and then do internet and chat with some good music background."),
("2013-11-27", "652063", "Jaizen", "Had an excellent stay! Hernan and Connie are excellent hosts and very welcoming. They're place is easy to find  get to  and great for the price. Unfortunately I only stayed for one night but I definitely recommend! "),
("2013-12-14", "652063", "Andreas", "i stayed 4 days with hernan and connie both very nice and friendly room very clean comfotable big bed bus Station 5 minutes away.all in all: perfect"),
("2013-12-24", "652063", "Sebastian", "Hernan is a great and lovely host. When we had questions  Hernan and Konny help us  everytime!  For the week  it was like our second home. We missed the time  there. The appartment is in the near of the beach and there is a very good public traffic  to drive in the City.  It is a wonderful place.And thank you  Konnie  for the last evening ! :)Sebastian & Janine"),
("2014-01-22", "652063", "Goran", "Herman was a nice and easy person and his place is very welcoming. Nice and clean  you fill at home from the first moment. I would personally recommend to anyone."),
("2014-02-03", "652063", "Niels", "We stayed at Hernan's place for give days and enjoyed every single of them. Such a nice atmosphere with Herman and Connie. They gave us good advices and made an awesome BBQ last night. Hopefully see you again guys."),
("2014-02-07", "652063", "Stefan", "Nice room and very friendly  helpful hosts.Close to airport & beach  takes some timeto reach the city. But nearly unbeatableconcerning value for money :)"),
("2014-02-09", "652063", "Tim", "I found Hernant and Conni to be the ideal hosts- relaxed  attentive when it was required  with a lovely place which was clean and welcoming  but informal!"),
("2014-02-10", "652063", "Jc", "They are nice host. Room is clean and cosy."),
("2014-02-17", "652063", "Karen", "Hi Hernan is the perfect host very polite and thoughtful"),
("2014-02-25", "652063", "Paul", "Hernan was a very accommodating host. This was my first airbnb experience  so I was a little apprehensive  but I had no trouble at all. The room was exactly as expected. The beach an easy walk. Sunday breakfast at a beachside cafe was very pleasant. I'd recommend Hernan's room to anyone without hesitation. "),
("2014-03-06", "652063", "Joe", "Hernan and Koni are a nice couple that know how to make their guests feel comfortable with their warm and easy going attitude. I felt like staying with friends if I could expend my stay I would stayed with them. Thank you guys"),
("2014-03-08", "652063", "Kyla", "Hernan was a great host!! He told us how to get around the city and recommended good websites to get jobs. Very nice guy  we'd stay again!!"),
("2014-03-16", "652063", "Victor", "Hernán and Conni are a very good hosts. They gave me very useful valuables hints to go to the city and to take public transport. They loved to drink good wines so bring one and share it  for sure you will have a very talk with them. "),
("2014-03-21", "652063", "Gabriel", "Hernan's place is ideally located right by a beautiful beach and a short walk from caffes & restaurants. I was there only a couple of nights  but wish I could have stayed more  lying on the beach and watching planes take off. The hosts are very welcoming and helpful. Will definitely return."),
("2014-03-22", "652063", "Sabrina", "Hernan was a great host. the room was clean and close to the airport. he was helpful and friendly. true to the motto: take it easy."),
("2014-03-24", "652063", "Daniel", "Unfortunately I did not get to meet my hosts in person. However  communication was effortless and quick  and I had a pleasant stay. Thank you! "),
("2014-03-25", "652063", "Cesar", "The room is clean  close to the airport  and  to the (Website hidden by Airbnb) has a big bed and is just like its description.Hernan is a great host  helps you with information about the area  and queries you may have about Sydney."),
("2014-04-02", "652063", "Lynda", "The reservation was canceled 3 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-04-24", "652063", "Christophe", "Hernan was a very friendly and helpful host. Thanks to him and Conny my three night stay was very pleasant. I would fully recommend them!"),
("2014-04-25", "652063", "Kaila", "Hernan's place was clean and comfortable. It's close to the airport which was perfect for our last night in Australia. He is very quick to respond and help with any questions you may have - including my many inquiries about how to take the local pic lib transit. Thank you!"),
("2014-05-02", "652063", "Nienke", "I can only join the other positive reviews. The room is lovely and has everything you could ask for. Hernan and Chanique are great hosts  interested and caring. I can definitely recommend this place!"),
("2014-05-12", "652063", "Augustin", "Even I spent few time with Hernan  I had a very pleasant stay. The room is clean and very comfortable. Hernan is a very nice guy and qu definitely recommend him. Thank you Hernan :) "),
("2014-05-18", "652063", "Ying", "Herman and Conny are super nice! They are helpful all the time and made me feel at home. I didn't plan my trip in Sydney much. They recommended me a lot fun places to visit and I had a blast. I wish I could have more time talking with them. Thank you so much for your wonderful host. I will come back!"),
("2014-05-19", "652063", "Maurice", "Really awesome view and closed to beach. The host is a really friendly and easygoing person. I really liked my time there."),
("2014-05-31", "652063", "Lena", "I spent five out of ten days in Sydney staying at Hernan's comfortable apartment at Monterey (which is really within Brighton le Sands).The Apartment :  Comfortable size for two bedrooms  bathroom  living/dining area  kitchen and balcony.   Hernan is very neat and organised  so that added to the comfort level.The Bedroom :  Has a queen-sized bed  bedside table  small wardrobe  chest of drawers  writing desk.   More than adequate for a single traveller  though room size may be a little compact for two pax ... but there's always the living room and balcony area to chill in.Transportation :  Not a problem because I had a car.   Public transport within walking distance.   Even if it is not smack in the city area  I have always encouraged travellers to experience the beautiful suburbs of Sydney.  Time permitting  travelling by bus (as opposed to trains) will allow you to see a lot more.Surrounds :   Nice restaurants/eateries and a couple of large supermarkets are all within easy walking distance.   I managed to stock up on some groceries and had a few meals at ""home"".   The lovely beach is just a few minutes' walk away.   I would encourage guests who drive to explore other beaches and nooks to get a good feel of the district.Thank you  Hernan  for your warm hospitality and being such a gracious and kind host.   I definitely recommend a stay at this apartment.   "),
("2014-06-12", "652063", "Fabian", "Hernan is a great guy.  The accommodation was also very good.  I would recommend this accommodation"),
("2014-06-24", "652063", "Spiros", "Herman was a great host  very welcoming  helpful  very friendly and a great location! Thank you."),
("2014-06-29", "652063", "Milind", "Hernan is a gem of a person  he is a fabulous host and makes sure you feel comfortable around. He is a good guide and a good friend. The unit is very clean and yes close to two beautiful beaches. I will definitely recommend him ! Thanks for the fantastic stay."),
("2014-07-11", "652063", "Véronique", "I've stayed at Hernan's appartment for 5 nights and I can totally recommend his place. Hernan is an easy-going  friendly host who does everything to make your stay as good as possible. The place is clean and the bed is comfortable  which is pretty important to me. The neighbourhood seems to be safe and everything you need is within walking distance. His appartment is also very close to the airport  that's great for people coming to or leaving Sydney by plane."),
("2014-07-16", "652063", "Brenda", "Hernan was extremely friendly and welcoming! It was a much-needed rest & recharge to stay at his place. Everything was comfortable  clean  and an easy walk to the beach. Hernan was very helpful answering questions and recommending places to go - thanks for a great stay!"),
("2014-07-29", "652063", "Jennifer", "I can thoroughly recommend Hernan as a host. He was friendly and helpful  and my stay there was just what I needed. My room was affordable   clean and comfortable  as was the whole apartment. Excellent location close to public transport and good cafés and shops. A pleasant  hassle-free experience."),
("2014-08-03", "652063", "Jonathan", "A great budget option near the airport about a $25 taxi ride away  and a friendly host Hernan."),
("2014-08-06", "652063", "Phoenix", "It's a nice stay with Hernan and thanks for the tidy room. Convenient to city and you can get everything nearby"),
("2014-08-09", "652063", "신우", "quite comfortable"),
("2014-09-03", "652063", "Farmer", "I had an excellent experience staying at Hernan's place. He was very welcoming and friendly  and helped me making taxi arrangements  and made sure I was up early for my taxi to the airport. His apartment was comfortable and clean. Just up the road is a good place to find something to eat. I didn't have time to check out the nearby beach. The place is close to Sydney airport. A taxi ride during peak hour  from the airport to Hernan's  was around $41. It was significantly cheaper in the early morning  going to the airport."),
("2014-09-08", "652063", "Mathew", "We had a great stay with Hernan and his partner  he was very welcoming and let us use his place while away. The room is exactly as described and what the photos show. Within walking distance of train station and all conveniences. We would definitely stay with Hernan again and would recommend his home to anyone travelling to Sydney."),
("2014-09-19", "652063", "Benjamin", "Bonne expérience pour une première"),
("2014-09-28", "652063", "Lisa", "Everything was very nice. Its super easy to get to the airport and the beach is very close. There is also a kiosk nearby.I would definetly stay here again  when Im in Sydney. Cause Hernan was a great host."),
("2014-10-05", "652063", "Kate", "Room and apartment well kept  and clean. Hernan was a lovely host. room is located so  close to everything yet the noise  doesn't travel through for a good nights  sleep. plenty  of linen   towels etc provided. 10/10"),
("2014-10-06", "652063", "Dominik", "Hernan was a really nice and easy going guy. Arrived around noon and directly got the keys for the front door and apartment  so I was really flexible. The room was exactly like it´s shown on the pictures and in the description. For everyone who needs a room near the airport when just arrived in Sydney I highly recommend this place. Thanks again for your great hospitality Hernan!"),
("2014-10-19", "652063", "Sabrina", "Hernan rocks! Extremely laid back  friendly and welcoming. I really appreciated his help with coordinating my early morning (445am) cab to the airport - this including him setting up the appointment and checking in on me at 4:40am to let me know the cab was outside. Super responsive and I had everything I needed. I will definitely stay with Hernan again if I find myself back in Sydney. The only thing to note is cabs in Sydney are quite expensive and he's probably a $40-50 cab ride away from the city (or so I heard). That said  the bus stop is a short walk away from the house  and I took it several times to the train station and directly into the city. He also provided public transportation maps to make trip planning that much easier!Just can't get over how awesome Hernan is!"),
("2014-10-20", "652063", "Muroa", "Had a wonderful time staying with Hernan and would definitely recommend it to anyone! He's a super friendly  fun  and welcoming guy  going out of his way to help me find the nearest bus and train stations. The apartment was spacious and comfortable  and seriously the perfect location! So close to the beach  airport and city. If you're visiting Sydney I would absolutely recommend staying here!"),
("2014-10-25", "652063", "Serge", "Hernan is a very friendly person and an excellent host  I really enjoyed my stay. The room is clean and tidy  close to the beach and shops. Hopefully will stay with him again and recommend to anyone !"),
("2014-10-26", "652063", "Jennifer", "Hernan gave my daughter and myself a real warm welcome accommodating us and our travel arrangements. He gave us space to settle in and make ourselves at home and gave us good directions to the restaurants and beach area which was close to his home. We felt  relaxed and rested after our stay and would happily stay with him again. His home is up a few flights of stairs so be prepared for a bit of exercise. Thanks Hernan!!"),
("2014-11-01", "652063", "Stephanie", "I enjoyed my stay here  I stayed here to give myself a break from the traveling back and forth from home during my time of my placement at the nearby hospital. There is no negative feedback that I can think of. I didn't see Hernan that much due my early starts and early nights  but in between when I saw him he was really nice. I will defiantly be back if I ever need to stay in the area again. "),
("2014-11-02", "652063", "Alexis & Claire", "We stayed 1 night. Even if we didn't see Hernan a lot  he was very welcoming and friendly  and helpful.The accommodation is great : good bed  every room in the apartment is clean  and a useful kitchen.It is good located  we only paid around $25 for taxi transfer from and to airport. Coles is closed as well.We recommend Hernan's accommodation for your stay"),
("2014-11-07", "652063", "Chunfa", "Hernanはすごく優しくて親切な方でした｡部屋はとてもｷﾚｲでﾍﾞｯﾄﾞは大きく､ﾊﾞｽﾙｰﾑも清潔でｷｯﾁﾝも食器がたくさんあり､本当に快適でした｡場所はﾊﾞｽ停からすぐですので､OPALｶｰﾄﾞやﾌﾘｰﾊﾟｽなどがあれば､CITYまで出るにも一切問題ありません｡Hernanは本当に良いﾎｽﾄで､私はいつもﾘﾗｯｸｽして過ごすことができました｡私は今回の旅でHerananに出会えたことが一番の思い出です!本当にありがとうございました｡Hernan is very kind parson.We had amazing times.Thank you!!!room is very clean and bathroom and kitchen  also very good.He is perfect host!!"),
("2014-11-09", "652063", "Kristen", "I'm just so glad I'm here for 3nights  Hernan was really welcoming and the room is absolutely lovely and clean. I had nothing to complain about and  we had a good time together of sharing on. Would visit soon if we got chance and 100% sure to recommend my friend as well to stay at this amazing place with the friendly host ever."),
("2014-11-13", "652063", "Joseph", "Awesome stay  felt like home. Even had the same brand of liquid soap as I have in my house. "),
("2014-11-14", "652063", "Naqibah", "Hernan was really welcoming. He was at home only in the evening and we had a short conversation. It was really nice to be able to communicate with Hernan face to face. He makes sure I feel like I'm at home. Clean towels are available for me as he does not want to me to go home with a wet towel. How sweet! :)The only thing i find inconvenient was the stairs to Hernan apartment. Not advisable if you have heavy suitcases with you! But it is totally worth it if you're backpacking!"),
("2014-11-16", "652063", "Louise", "Hernan was really nice and ready to give us advices! The place was nice and quiet. I recommand his apartment."),
("2014-11-25", "652063", "Jasmin", "The reservation was canceled 84 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-11-29", "652063", "Kerstin", "Hernan hosted me 2 nights on weekdays. He has to work  so we have not much time together. But he is a very kind person and easy to get along with him. He gave me an extra key which I really appreciate. You have also free WiFi. I would definitely recommend Hernan and his flat."),
("2014-12-01", "652063", "John", "Hernan was not around much but was well organised and  made sure I had access when I needed it. When I did see him Hernan was friendly and engaging. The apartment has all that you need and is very well located to explore the suburb with all its restaurants and walks along the beach."),
("2014-12-04", "652063", "Scott", "I had a great stay here! The room was excellent and had a very nice bathroom. I would definitely recommend this Host. The location was excellent too! Right by the Beach and transportation."),
("2014-12-07", "652063", "Kim", "I stayed 3 nights. he was really nice and always smiled me welcoming. Hernan made me feel free at home. When I was in there  he was busy  but he never forgot me. (he prepared towel  tea and wine for me). And I got the home key from him and could come in and out freely.  And the room was exactly comfortable and tidy. The room is near by airport (about 15 min by car). It was perfect accommodation. I strong recommend you to go Hernan's home for your nice travel."),
("2014-12-12", "652063", "Augustin", "Hernan was a great host making it extra easy to arrange our arrival and departure  and quickly responding to all our requests including how to get there and arrange more transportation. The apartment was exactly as described with very nice decorating surprises (seashells and objects from Chile) that makes its feel unique. The room we stayed in was small but the living room is spacious and full of light with a great kitchen. We did not get to enjoy the apartment so much since we were only one day before a flight  but still had a chance to discover that the neighborhood (a quiet residential place with a nearby beach) had excellent restaurants (some of the best - and cheapest - seafood I had at Ocean's Heart). It takes 10~15mn to walk there along the beach. For us who wanted to stay in a convenient place before heading to the airport  it was perfect."),
("2014-12-14", "652063", "Patrick", "We have not had the chance to meet Hernan but he has made everything to make our short stay enjoyable in his home. The apartment has all that you need and is very well located.The apartment was exactly as described ."),
("2014-12-30", "652063", "Leonie", "Het is een ruime kamer vlakbij een gezellig strandje. Hernan is een gezellige man en je voelt je direct thuis in zijn huis!"),
("2015-01-01", "652063", "Franziska", "Hernan was a great host! Even though he wasn't at home  when we arrived  he gave us good instructions how to get to the apartment.We stayed just for one night but felt right at home. We really enjoyed our stay  the little chat  wine and cheese :)Thanks again!"),
("2015-01-04", "652063", "Anwar", "We had a really great time at Hernans place even it was for one day.The location was very nice .Great beach nice restaurants.Hernan is very chill and welcoming.He makes you feel at home."),
("2015-01-10", "652063", "Ivana", "I had a really nice stay at Hernan's. He was really helpful in finding my way around. The room was clean and tidy. I really enjoyed my time there. I would always choose this great host again! Thank you Hernan!"),
("2015-01-15", "652063", "Cecile", "Hernan accepted my last minute request and so  I was saved for Sydney! Easygoing  with a nice flat  very well located  2 min from the beach  5 min from shops  I felt immediately at home. Thanks for EVERYTHING Hernan ;). "),
("2015-01-18", "652063", "Thilo", "We stayed for only one Night. Everything was fine and Hernan was a great host. Would come back to his room."),
("2015-01-23", "652063", "Dominic", "Clean and tidy place. Handy location. Friendly host. Would stay again"),
("2015-02-01", "652063", "Joe", "Hernan was a great host. Very easy to communicate with and extremely easy going. The private bedroom was clean and affordable. I would definitely stay again. Thanks Hernan!"),
("2015-02-06", "652063", "Camelia", "Hernan was very welcoming and easy going. He answered to all our inquiries  so he was very helpful even if it wasn't is best day because he was sick but everything was alright and the apartment is nice  the place is not far from the airport.And his accent was nice  I loved it  better than ours french accent :)See you "),
("2015-02-22", "652063", "Usman", "Hernan is a great host. Cooperative  friendly and accomodating. The place is just as advertised. Neat  organised and all amenities properly provided. The location is wonderful with the beachy winds and easy access to bus and train. Being close to the airport helps for new comers. Hernan respects privacy and tidiness and was kind enough to offer any help when needed like a ride to the station in the rain or things like bank  train  buses or eating his delicious food. I would stay again and recommend him as  terrific host."),
("2015-02-23", "652063", "Yuxi", "Me&my friend Karen stayed at Hernan's for only 1 day but it was the funniest Airbnb experience I've ever had!Haha I won't tell everybody here:)It took 15 min taxi from the airport to his home.(Just want others to know taking taxi during the night costs service fee)Hernan is such a nice host!He allowed us to stay extra half day at his house without paying extra money.And he gave us access to his fridge so that we could have breakfast and fruits.The most unforgetable is the Bontany Bay!The view there was breath-taking and the restaurants are great.Hope we'll visit Sydney again and hang out with Hernan.You have to choose him!"),
("2015-02-25", "652063", "Donovan", "Hernan was a great host with a warm and welcoming home. It was a clean and comfortable experience and would recommend to any travelers looking for a place to stay in Sydney. Thanks hernan!"),
("2015-03-05", "652063", "Stephanie", "I enjoyed my time staying here  unfortunately had to cut the trip short due to my illness  which Hernan and his girlfriend were both really supportive and took time out of their night to take me to the nearby medical centre n hospital. Thanks Hernan for everything! "),
("2015-03-12", "652063", "Steph", "I stayed at Hernan's place only one night  but the experience was very nice.  Everything was exactly as described and as told.  The place is conveniently close to the airport and pleasantly close to a lovely beach.  Hernan is a very nice guy  and made me feel at home right away.  He helped me out with my logistics without hesitation.  I would stay there again."),
("2015-03-24", "652063", "Sarah", "Hernan was fantastic  he answered any questions I had and gave great advice. Goes out of his way to help you. His home was just as described  perfect!! Great location  2 minute walk to the bus stop and beach. Thanks for everything Hernan  especially the aquarium!"),
("2015-03-25", "652063", "Yun", "Warming department tidy room detail tips .Such a good experience in Sydney.Hernan is a kindly host.Hope to have a chance come again."),
("2015-03-29", "652063", "Patrick", "Really enjoyed Hernan's place. It was exactly as described. I only got to meet Hernan on the last day of my stay in his apartment  as I was busy sigh seeing and he was working. However we communicated well by text message before and during my stay. When we did meet  he was very nice and friendly. His place is very clean and it was a pleasure staying there."),
("2015-04-01", "652063", "Bob", "The position is good to airport and the room is nice. Hernan is friendly."),
("2015-04-09", "652063", "Tyler", "Hernans place is great and he is a great bloke. Exactly like the photos. Looking forward to staying there again."),
("2015-04-19", "652063", "Justin", "Hernan was a *lifesaver* for my time in Sydney. When my plans fell through  I needed a place to stay in a hurry before leaving super early for the airport. Hernan's place was a 15min taxi ride away and he gave me the number of a local firm. Air bnb's app was causing some issues and Hernan was so patient and kind with my many messages and took the time to really help me. I was sorry I didn't get to meet him personally to thank him  but I really appreciated all he went through to help me book the room. The bed was so comfortable and the room was super spacious and clean. Hernan's place was easy to get to by bus or train  next time I'd love to stay longer  its right next to a beach! Thanks for everything Hernan  you're awesome!"),
("2015-04-22", "652063", "Courtney", "Great place  great host! "),
("2015-04-28", "652063", "Rabea", "I really enjoyed my stay at Hernans place. I felt very welcomed and was happy about the relaxed and easy going atmosphere.The transport was okay  easy to reach with bus or half and hour walk to the next train station. Shoping and eating was near by.Altogether thanx so much for the wonderful stay Hernan."),
("2015-05-04", "652063", "Robert", "My first time overseas alone. I felt truly welcomed while staying with Hernan. He greets you as like greeting a friend. He is a good friend to anyone and a great man. He truly is very easy going. I was very comfortable at his place not just because of everything that was provided but also because of his great hospitality. It was a great stay. I will always remember this man."),
("2015-05-07", "652063", "Tyler", "Hernans place was perfect as usual. Unfortunately we didn't cross paths during my last stay but he is a great bloke and I recommend staying with him. Thanks again mate"),
("2015-05-10", "652063", "Dave", "Great experience. Really nice room  really convenient for what I needed. Hernan is a good guy  made my stay very comfortable and got on with our own thing. Definitely recommend staying."),
("2015-05-14", "652063", "Sarah", "Really clean and lovely place. host was really friendly. I was very comfortable staying there."),
("2015-05-17", "652063", "Michael Jason", "Hi stayed with Hernan 4 nights. Hernan was an excellent host very friendly and helpful. His home was lovely and good location to chill.  The next time i come to sydney i will definitely contact Hernan to stay again.  Cheers jas from spain"),
("2015-05-22", "652063", "Kasia", "Although we didnt have a chance to meet in person (just via txt msgs)  Hernan was a wonderful host and helped me out with everything I needed. The place was nice too and I was very happy to stay there. It was a pleasure! Thank you so much!"),
("2015-05-25", "652063", "Alicia", "Had a really short yet pleasant stay at Hernan's place. I was exhausted coming from a month-long trip  and only stayed a night to catch a connecting flight early the next day. That was probably the best sleep I had all month -- Lol! Got a really warm welcome and they instantly made me feel right at home. Despite my very brief stay  it felt like visiting a friend.Thanks again  guys  really appreciated everything! :)"),
("2015-05-28", "652063", "Tyler", "My stay at Hernans place was great as usual"),
("2015-05-30", "652063", "Kay", "Hernan was very good responding to messages straight away.Good location near the airport. Listing as per description. We didn't end up staying as we managed to get an earlier flight but would recommend this host as he is very helpful."),
("2015-05-31", "652063", "Kat", "Hernan gave instructions where to locate the key.  He made sure I was inside with no issues.  He planned to work late and told me so. Unfortunately we were never able to meet as he came home quite late while I slept. I woke up early to call Uber to get to the Airport.  Hernan did send an apology indicating he was sorry not to have been able to meet me.  I'm quite sad as I know we would have hit it off and had quite a bit in common.  Spice and Culture Foods!  And good Bier!  Lolololol. Cheers Mate!"),
("2015-06-04", "652063", "Tyler", "As usual Hernans place was fantastic. I stay here regularly when working in the area and its always great. Hernan is a champion and I recommend staying here"),
("2015-06-07", "652063", "Adam", "Thank you so much  your accomodation was perfect!! I just had a three day stay at your home  but I felt like I was at home! Amazing :) Hope we will see us again when I`m coming back to Sydney!!"),
("2015-06-11", "652063", "Tyler", "Great stay as usual. Thanks Hernan"),
("2015-06-16", "652063", "Liu", "Hernan is really friendly and helpful. He made the experience in Sydney very good. Would definitely recommend to the other travellers. Room was clean and amenities were more than enough."),
("2015-06-18", "652063", "Peter", "Hernan is a generous and friendly host. He is a very interesting man with lots of experiences to share. The room is wm located for public transport and only a few hundred metres from the Bay and swimming etc. the space is compact but comfortable. A little tragic noise if you're not used but all in all a lovely stay."),
("2015-06-20", "652063", "Rhys", "Had an excellent stay at Hernan's  which is conveniently close to the airport. Lovely guy  ""check in"" was extremely easy and the room was lovely. Would definitely stay again if transiting through Sydney!"),
("2015-06-21", "652063", "Louise", "We had a lovely brief stay with Hernan  just one night . Close to the airport and easy to find. Hernan made the arrival process smooth and easy. Thanks"),
("2015-07-20", "652063", "Chris", "Pleasant stay while in SYD. Highly recommend. Clean  clear instructions and correspondence. Great value."),
("2015-07-24", "652063", "Derek", "Hernan is an absolute gem of a human being. I would highly reccomend his listing to anybody. It was an absolute pleasure and he was extremely helpful and fun to talk to."),
("2015-08-01", "652063", "Lauren", "Hernan is a great host - he made getting to his place and checking in very easy and convenient and had handy recommendations about getting to the airport early the next morning. Description of property is accurate  internet is quick and connects easily and for the room  what you see is what you get. It's simple but is exactly what you need for a quick stop over between flights. "),
("2015-08-07", "652063", "Karina", "I had a very pleasant stay with Hernan beginning of August. The room was clean and cozy  fresh sheets and towels were available and also the WiFi worked excellent. It is very convenient that the apartment is so close to the airport. Connections to downtown Sydney are by bus and by train and dont take that long. Nice restaurants are also in walking distance. Can surely recommend this place and I really felt like home :)"),
("2015-08-15", "652063", "Lauren", "Stayed with Hernan for the second time in as many weeks – great host  makes everything very easy and the perfect spot to get a good night’s rest before a flight. "),
("2015-08-21", "652063", "Veith", "Hernan war ein sehr freundlicher und zuvorkommender Gastgeber. Ich kam gegen 8 Uhr morgens bei seiner Wohnung an und da ich einen sehr langen Flug hinter mir hatte war ich etwas verloren. Daraufhin rief ich Ihn kurz an und innerhalb weniger Minuten war alles geklärt und ich lag glücklich und zufrieden im Bett. 10 out of 10 - would stay again!"),
("2015-08-23", "652063", "Anastasia", "Room was clean and comfy. Also  it is only 10 mins walk from the beach. It is also close by the airport  convenient if you drive  a car. If you wanna take taxi it would be around 25-35 AUD$  depends on the traffic or u can take bus. However  it requires you to transfer  there is no direct bus to go there.Since it is located nearby the main road  it gets pretty noisy at night.Towel and showers amethyst are provided and free wifi !Hernan is really nice host  he had spare time so he offered me to drive me to the airport! Lovely! :)Overall  I would recommend this place because it is clean  close by the airport n the beach also nice host."),
("2015-08-29", "652063", "Matt", "Hernan is a top bloke. His place is really nice. Id recomend staying here."),
("2015-08-31", "652063", "Ketsia", "Hernan was an awesome host! This was my first time using airbnb and as a young woman traveling in a foreign country alone I was aiming for safety. His home was very comfortable and it has everything you could think you need. I give Hernan's place 5 stars. If you get the chance to stay here  do."),
("2015-09-05", "652063", "Stephanie", "It's always a pleasure staying with Hernan  he welcomes his place with open arms. I have stayed here a few times now. Will defiantly come back when I need to. "),
("2015-09-06", "652063", "Linda&Haisu", "Hernan was an awesome host - accommodating of my jet lagged early arrival and helpful in getting my luggage up the stairs. His place was clean  close to airport  beach and bus line. The bed was quite comfortable and the fast Internet made me smile after having recently dealt with the Great Firewall of China. So if getting a straight shooter host who provides everything he said he would provide and even more appeals to you  Hernan is your guy!"),
("2015-09-07", "652063", "Nora", "Hernan's home fits my requirements perfectly. Close to the airport  a clean and tidy room and a comfortable bed. Even though I stayed for only one night  Hernan was a welcoming host  carrying up (and down) my heavy luggage and helped me book a taxi to the airport and also gave me a ""wake up"" call when the taxi arrived. What can I say? It was a pleasure to have stayed!"),
("2015-09-13", "652063", "Narae", "Hernan even though the house was like a hotel. More than nice hotel.I could imagine the look he was cleaning the room and hard and ready for me.He gave me extra towels and duvets also prepared.He gives me the house key was known to use in detail.If you enter it will be be a smile on his home bathroom. The place where he was decorated so beautifully.Heolnan always looked at me with a bright smile was thinking of my safety."),
("2015-09-21", "652063", "William", "Had a very enjoyable five night stay at Hernan's unit while in Sydney for a seminar. The room  while cosy  was well appointed with a queen sized bed  wardrobe  blinds and a chest of drawers and a desk which I appreciated. The unit also has a light living area and kitchen. As a host Hernan  who is Chilean  was well travelled  friendly and a good conversationist with good local knowledge. Coupled with the location near the beach  good restaurants and a bus to the train station the unit is good value for money. Would stay again."),
("2015-10-06", "652063", "Ying Tao", "It was a great and pleasant one-week stay in Hernan's place. He welcomed us with warm regards and treated us very well. He concerned about our needs during the stay in Sydney and provided useful tips for traveling around. A nice place to recommend!"),
("2015-10-09", "652063", "Tang", "Hernan and his girlfriend r both really nice  the house is close to a bay and many restaurants  it's a wonderful choice!"),
("2015-10-11", "652063", "Paul", "I stayed at Hernan's place in Sydney. Hernan was very helpful and I had a comfortable stay. Would recommend."),
("2015-10-14", "652063", "Lainie", "Hernan made me feel very welcome in his homely apartment in a great location in Brighton Le Sands. The room is well equipped with internet  power sockets and a very comfortable bed. The room was clean and his apartment is well taken care of  neat and clean. Thanks for a lovely stay Hernan."),
("2015-10-17", "652063", "Josiah", "I had a great experience staying at Hernan's place. The place was easy to find; with a less than 5 minutes walk to the bus stop and the beautiful beach nearby. Despite I was out and about most of the time during my trip in Sydney  Hernan ensured he had provided everything I needed in the room and made me felt safe and comfortable during my stay. It was great to meet someone who's so easy-going and passionate about people! :)"),
("2015-10-18", "652063", "Pei-Yu", "The location is closed to airport  best for traveller. Also  you can walk along beach and go into a nice view restaurant. Hernan's space is very comfortable. I had a wonderful night there. "),
("2015-10-26", "652063", "Clarence", "Hernan was friendly and easy to contact. The apartment is clean and in a convenient location. Parking can be difficult on the street as it'd quite busy. It's also noisy as it's close to a main road with traffic. All in all it is a good find and recommended."),
("2015-10-31", "652063", "Ronja", "Wonderful apartment with a well-equipped kitchen! The apartment is close to public transportation so it is easy to get around. Hernan seem like a really nice and likeable guy  didn't meet him that much but he definitely had a good vibe.Good place to stay  I recommend it!"),
("2015-11-11", "652063", "Florian", "Hernan was a great host  he welcomed me warmly and helped me a lot to get started in Australia.Even after my stay I can consult him if I need help with something. Highly recommended!  "),
("2015-11-13", "652063", "Serene", "Hernan's house is real close to the airport and beach. I have stay there for 1 night with my boy friend and we find the house is very nice looking and clean. Hernan also very kind and help us to book the taxi for next day  we enjoy to chit chat with him and he willing to share information with us. Just a little inconvenient at night because there are noises from the road traffic."),
("2015-11-16", "652063", "Wenjie", "The apartment is clean and tidy  near to the beach and bus stop. Hernan is a really nice guy :)"),
("2015-11-18", "652063", "Sher Lyn", "My stay was a pleasant one. Hernan was very responsive to my queries. It was a shame though that I didn't get the chance to meet him. But still  overall I really had a pleasant stay in Hernan's place. The room was very clean and tidy  and he even provided the bus route information on the table in the room (just in case some people might need to refer it). Oh and one thing  his place is just about 10 minutes walk to the Beach. If you want a quiet time at a nice beach with lesser people  you should definitely check out Hernan's place! I would totally recommend his place to my friends (:"),
("2015-11-21", "652063", "Alex", "Really great stay - landed after a long flight from London and Hernan made me feel right at home.  Lovely  comfortable room in a great location and Hernan was very helpful with guides to the city.  As I was still recovering from Jetlag and sorting out bank accounts and SIM cards etc I needed somewhere nice and relaxing to stay as I settled in and the place was ideal.Hernan is the perfect host and I really appreciated his hospitality! "),
("2015-11-22", "652063", "Jeffrey", "Great host and great place.  Good communication and accepting of our last minute reservation."),
("2015-12-01", "652063", "Elena", "Wonderful person  cozy and clean apartment  top-notch hospitality. Thank you very much Hernan  for making me feel at home! Elena "),
("2015-12-04", "652063", "Jan", "The house was easy tot find and close to the airport.  For our start of our trip along the Eastcoast it was a good start to be with Hernan. As a host he is really helpfull  which we appreciated. "),
("2015-12-10", "652063", "Ivan", "Hernan was the perfect host. He is a very nice person. Very communicative  helpful and easy going. We had some pleasant conversations. The apartment is small but very cosy  clean and with a nice atmosphere. It is close to the beach and not far from the airport. The neighborhood is nice  safe and clean. If i happen to be in Sydney again  I would definately check if Hernan's place is available. Thank you Hernan!"),
("2015-12-14", "652063", "Celine", "Hernan 's place is perfect ! Room and flat clean and very cute ! Hernan is very friendly and helpfully ! I recommended it absolutely !"),
("2015-12-18", "652063", "Cindy", "바로 앞에 바다도 있고 조금만 가면 시티도 있고 너무 좋은 곳이었어요! 집도 아기자기하고 인테리어도 이뻐서 너무 맘에 들었답니다 편하게 잘 쉬었어요"),
("2015-12-25", "652063", "Thu", "Clean and cozy room close to the beach. Had a lovely stay in this space. Great value."),
("2016-01-02", "652063", "Li-Chun", "Didn't get to see Hernan. Overall room and the house is ok and close to everything. Downside saw a cockroach in the shower  found a ball of hair inside the bed  a little noisy from the car passing in front the house because it located on the main road. Overall I would still recommend to others."),
("2016-01-28", "652063", "Suzanne", "Staying at Hernan's was a pleasure. Although only for two nights and due to Australia Day we didn't interact very much  he was very kind and helpful with directions and public transport. He makes you feel at home very quickly. His apartment is very clean and tidy and situated in a great area. Just walk out the street to the beach  lots of shops and places to eat and drink  very close to the airport. At the beach you can see the planes arrive and depart and ships sail into Botany Bay. The only thing one should consider is that his apartment is on the second floor  no elevator  so if you are not travelling light  then you need to be fit.I had a great stay and hope to chat a bit more next time. "),
("2016-02-09", "652063", "Bertrand", "Super expérience chez un hôte très sympathique ! Accueil sans aucun problème et ambiance chaleureuse pendant ces 2 jours  à refaire avec grand plaisir ! :)"),
("2016-02-15", "652063", "Max", "Great room  great location and great price- very friendly host. Will stay again if in area."),
("2016-02-27", "652063", "Kai", "Good location for going to the beach and not far away from the Airport."),
("2016-02-28", "652063", "Dave", "Only stayed one night but Hernan is a lovely guy and the room is clean and very comfortable. Very nice apartment in a very nice area. I really recommend this for anyone who wants a quiet night near the airport. It's in a nice area too with lots of options for eating. Cheers Hernan!"),
("2016-03-06", "652063", "Kate", "Hernan was really friendly and made us feel at home right away. He was really informative and had all the information leaflets to hand about excursions and public transport."),
("2016-03-20", "652063", "Olivia", "The place was a perfect size room about a 15 minute drive from the airport and about 45 minutes to Sydney by train. We had a blast. The place was clean and had everything we needed. The only downside was no air conditioning but there was a fan in the room so we hardly noticed. I can't wait to go back. I would definitely recommend!!"),
("2016-03-23", "652063", "Lindsey", "Hernan was just the kind of person who you'd want to visit--friendly  generous  and easy-going.  The place was simple  and had everything you need.  I walked down to the beach and it was a lot of fun just like all the beaches in Sydney.  A great place and a great deal!"),
("2016-03-25", "652063", "Chancie", "Hernan's place was such a wonderful gem in Monterey! Easy access to bus routes (15-20 min ride to/from the airport via Uber)  beautiful views from The Grade Parade (about one block away)  plenty of food options AND such an easy going  welcoming and generous host! I highly recommend Hernan's Airbnb if you're staying in Sydney."),
("2016-03-27", "652063", "Yang", "he apartment is clean and tidy  near to the beach and bus stop.Wonderful apartment with a well-equipped kitchen! didn't meet him that much but he definitely had a good vibe."),
("2016-04-03", "652063", "Moritz", "Hernan was very kind and friendly. The room was clean and the same as on the pictures. I would definitely recommend this Airbnb room."),
("2016-04-04", "652063", "Selina", "Hernan was very friendly and easygoing. Altough it was a very short stay (had to leave early in the morning to catch my flight) we had a nice chat and he even gave me some recommendations for my next travellings to Thailand. The room has everything what you need (comfy bed  fan and tv). Good place to stay for the night before going to the airport to save some money on public transport because you can go by bus (3.50 $ instead of about 17$ when coming from the city center by train)"),
("2016-04-07", "652063", "Vanessa", "The room was very clean and tidy  the only problem I had was that the shower gets cold after 5 minutes  as I've got long hair it's almost impossible to take such a quick shower  and I wasn't waiting for that  because I didn't know."),
("2016-04-10", "652063", "Reven", "Hernan is really a nice guy that helped me with my route here and there. Having towel  extra blankets  television  printed time table for buses in room  brochures for tourist  travel adapter  coffee and tea for our benefits and convenience . Location wise is really easy for Travelling to airport  through and fro. Can't really do much in president avenue area other than having good food and chill at seaside with a bottle of beer. Overall I had my best experience in Sydney thanks to Hernan great hospitality. Hernan place has everything that you need  he have all the knowledge you want to know. "),
("2016-04-18", "652063", "Charles", "Hernan was very attentive to my needs. We kept in touch during my stay. The surroundings were lovely with the beach next door"),
("2016-04-23", "652063", "Lily", "Hernan is an extraordinary individual and it was my absolute pleasure to have stayed at this lovely room.  Hernan helped me with so many things  i am absolutely grateful for everything. The place was heaven for me  walking distance to a peaceful beach  and convenient to get to the city and the airport. The area had everything i needed and i am so glad i have stayed here  wish it was more days :) "),
("2016-04-29", "652063", "Chris", "Hernan was a great host..we didn't cross paths all that much during my stay however everything I needed was there.Thank you mate! Highly recommend a great place to stay!"),
("2016-05-05", "652063", "Doraemonlaw", "A very good memories in Sydney. Hernan is a very nice person  and he is very helpful. He and his girl friend are easy going  they drove me to the city in the first day. And his place is really closed to the beach and the restaurant. I will be there when I come to Sydney again."),
("2016-05-08", "652063", "Hoa", "Hernan was a great host. He was timely on his communications and provided great advice on the things I wanted to visit in Sydney.  We did not chat a lot as I was hardly in the house. Cheers Hernan. Thanks for the stay.Hoa"),
("2016-05-10", "652063", "Darryl", "Sadly  never got to meet Hernan. His pad is pretty cool tho  bed comfy  comm's were superb.  6 km's to Int 'airport."),
("2016-05-12", "652063", "Richard", "very nice guy and tidy room near to sea  recommend"),
("2016-05-15", "652063", "Manuel", "Hernan was kind enough to accept our booking on very short notice. We arrived in Sydney a day earlier than we had planned and he was able to accommodate us for the night. His place is quiet and cozy  just what we needed. The beach nearby is gorgeous and has a couple good restaurants. All in all a great experience for our first day in Australia!"),
("2016-05-27", "652063", "Calvin", "Location was very close to the airport and Hernan was able to provide information on how to get to his home by public transport. Took me only around 30mins by bus. Took me a some time to locate his apartment  might be a bit confusing for the first time. Location was near lots of food choices and the beach is just a 3min walk away. Bed was comfortable but pillows were a bit too soft for my liking. Host was very easy going and gave me my space at the same time was there when you needed some information. Really enjoyed my stay with Hernan! Would recommend it to anyone who wants to visit Sydney. "),
("2016-05-29", "652063", "Josye", "Everything was as expected  nice room  very clean  the whàle flat was clean and tidy  the bed was very good I slept very well. The only thing I would say is about I had troubles to find the key and the right appartment  I think that no native English speaking people like me needs more details.. For example.. for me the ""main entrance"" means the entrance facing the street.. Difference of culture? I didn't notice also while bookingthat I'll have 2 floors to climb with my luggage  late night..But Hernan even he wasn't here  helped me a lot by phone  he is a really good host and his flat is simple but very cosy. The price is very good as well. I write this comment from an other AIR BNB host close to the airport like Hernan's home  but I regret to have booked this one (done before Hernan  couldn't cancel). Hernan I miss your flat ! I would definitively recommand Hernan's flat for people wanted to leave SYD early   very close to the International Airport  and The host is very good."),
("2016-06-04", "652063", "Manuele", "I had a great experience! I found the place very easily  and Hernan was very nice and helpful! I really recommend this place!"),
("2016-06-10", "652063", "Sammie", "It was a wonderful experience! Hernan was so accommodating and kind. We really enjoyed our stay and the apartment was beautifully decorated. I would definitely stay there again next time I'm in Sydney!"),
("2016-06-13", "652063", "Mel", "Hernan was very open and welcoming. The proximity to the airport was a huge bonus as well.Thanks for making it a relaxed and comfortable stay."),
("2016-06-19", "652063", "Damon", "Hernan is a friendly and easy-going person and the room is clean and tidy!     It was definitely a wonderful experience for living here! :)"),
("2016-06-21", "652063", "Jason", "Hernan made me feel like a friend and was super welcoming. The room was as described  very clean and very close to shops  restaurants and the lovely Botany Bay. "),
("2016-06-30", "652063", "Clara", "Very nice apartment near the airport. We didn't see Hernan but he gave us all the informations to find the keys  feel like at home and let us stay longer at his apartment as we had our flight on the evening. "),
("2016-07-03", "652063", "Frances", "Hernan made sure I could access the keys as he was going out  he was very friendly and welcoming  told me to make a cup of tea if I liked etc. the room was nice and clean  the area is very good  and Hernan seemed like a very nice guy but we were both very busy   so only met briefly twice.  The location is easy walking distance to a lot of nice cafes and restaurants in Brighton  and bus routes to other areas. All up  the room was perfect for my visit."),
("2016-07-04", "652063", "Joao", "Hernan was helpful since we booked the room. Whole the instructions provided were clear to get to his place...i had the opportunity to meet him and had a short talk but enough to understand his kindness.Room was clean and tidy and well located...Really recomend to stay at his flat if available..See you in Europe HernanMariano"),
("2016-07-13", "652063", "Shu", "Highly recommended  and couldn't have asked for a better place to stay! Everything I needed was already prepared - from clean room and towels  to wifi passwords and extra blanket. Hernan was very hospitable and helpful  ready to give advice on transport  etc. Shame it was just one night  Monterey/Brighton is a beautiful place  and I would have really enjoyed staying longer.Thumbs up  and thanks for a great stay! Keep it up! :)"),
("2016-07-16", "652063", "Chris", "Very welcoming"),
("2016-07-18", "652063", "Susie", "Hernans place was perfect for a solo traveler staying near the airport! I was able to visit the city  you just have to get to the train station which Hernan kindly took me to! He was a great host and very easy to talk to!"),
("2016-07-21", "652063", "Jana", "I really enjoyed my stay here and would recommend it to everyone visiting Sydney. Herman provided me with a lot of helpful information and helped me with my suitcase and with finding the apartment. The bedroom has all you'll need and Herman provided me with an extra blanket and a heater since its was a little cold when I was there. Thanks again for a wonderful stay!"),
("2016-07-22", "652063", "Nathan", "Host was very friendly and helpful. Really helped me get to his place straight from the airport and generally orient myself in Sydney. Housing itself was also very nice. All amenities I could need  plus it was very clean and tidy."),
("2016-07-23", "652063", "Jeongkyo", "This place was so good to stay.I 'd arraived there at 4-5pmRoom mood was cute and kind. I couldn't see him but he txt to me directly. Inside wasn't cold. Quiet warm. really thanks to him to know this place."),
("2016-08-04", "652063", "Grace", "Hernan is a fantastic host! He is very welcoming and knowledgeable about the city. Communication through the Airbnb app about check-in and how to catch the bus/train was perfect. His home is cozy and a quick walk to the bus line. The neighborhood location is suburban so not many restaurants nearby. The grocery store Cole's is about a 20 min walk along Brighton-Sands beach. The bus/train ride to the city is about 45 mins and this is mentioned on the listing. It is a nice quiet spot and I felt safe in the home and neighborhood after roaming around Sydney all week. Thank you Hernan!"),
("2016-08-12", "652063", "Raymond", "This was my first time using Airbnb for lodging. What a great place for a single traveler in Sydney. This flat was clean  quaint and perfect for my travel needs. The beach was very close  about a 5 minute walk. Coffee shops and dining within walking distance. Public transportation was very convenient. While I never got to meet the host  Hernan  his accommodations were great and I would recommend this location to anyone  especially a single traveler. I will definitely return to this location when I return to Sydney. "),
("2016-08-14", "652063", "Yi Min", "房东的真诚热情使我们感到非常亲切 虽然语言不通 但彼此却能融洽相处｡住在这里 非常自如松驰 就像在家里一样｡"),
("2016-08-22", "652063", "Oscar", "Thank's Hernan. I had a short but pleasant stay here. Very good location. Walking distance to shops and restaurants. Easy Public transport to and from the airport. Very clean room and bathroom. Amenities and Wifi is provided. Hernan is a friendly guy. Would recommend for short business trips that require you to stay near the airport on a budget. Thanks for your hospitality. Cheers!"),
("2016-08-26", "652063", "GuoQing", "Hernan是个非常热情的人 房间非常干净舒服 离机场很近 离海边也很近 交通方便 满分好评!"),
("2016-09-03", "652063", "Shifang", "Good location near a beach and Sydney airport. It's very easy to find. Hernan is a very good guy. And the room is very very clean  made me feel like in my home in deed. "),
("2016-09-08", "652063", "Ig", "Great room Tx Hernan"),
("2016-09-15", "652063", "Yerim", "처음으로 시드니를 여행했는데 정말 만족스러웠습니다.에이비앤비 사용도 처음해봤는데  정말 집에서 지내는 것처럼 불편함이 없게 도와주셨어요.교통편을 물어보면 친절하게 알려주셨구요  할 수만 있다면 더 오래 지내고 싶었습니다."),
("2016-09-25", "652063", "Ria", "Friendly  clean and comfortable.  Hernan was a most congenial host and will certainly stay again if available next time I'm in Sydney area."),
("2016-09-27", "652063", "Sophia", "Cozy and clean apartment with friendly host.  Easy access to public transport to and from Sydney airport. Walking distance to a beautiful beach."),
("2016-09-29", "652063", "Reyzana", "Great stay! Room was clean  WiFi available  amenities and towels provided. Hernan was friendly and flexible. Would 100% stay again!"),
("2016-10-05", "652063", "云红", "Hernan is very friendly you will feel comfortable staying (Website hidden by Airbnb) close to the airport 5 mins walk to the beach but a little noise."),
("2016-10-06", "652063", "Sandro", "Hernan was a great host. Firstly he answered all my questions in relation to the accommodation before I booked. He also gave clear and concise instructions of how to access the premises in his absence.The room was very clean and had very close access to the bathroom  full kitchen facilities and a dining area so I was able to make a coffee when I wanted  bring back takeaway oid and eat it ir cook if I wanted to.I was staying as an airport transfer convenience  UBER fare to domestic terminal was $17 and 15min away. It is basic accommodation but clean and practical and I wouldn't hesitate to stay there again. It does involve 2 dlights of stairs which was no problem for me."),
("2016-10-11", "652063", "Paul", "This was a good stay! Hernan is a friendly and helpful host and his place is clean and had everything you need. Would recommend!"),
("2016-10-27", "652063", "Andrew & Kate", "Awesome guy  clean tide perfect"),
("2016-10-28", "652063", "Camille", "Hernan is very cool. His apartment is clean. we recomanded!! See you later Hernan"),
("2016-10-31", "652063", "Camille", "Great flat  close to public transportation. Hernan was very nice and let us drop our bags off before chek-in. Would recommend a 100%"),
("2016-11-02", "652063", "YongHyun", "Hernan의 집은 시드니에서 좋은 추억을 만들어주는데 결정적이었습니다. 바쁜 시드니 도심에서 벗어나 바로 앞에 해변가와 한적한 동네분위기  그리고 아기자기한 소품들이 가득한 이쁜 집은 아직도 생각이 나네요. 또한 hernan은 여행자들을 대화하는것을 좋아하는 쿨가이로 자유로운 분위기에서 살아볼수있도록 배려해주었습니다. 이용하신다면 방에만 있는것이 아닌 친구가 되어보세요."),
("2016-11-04", "652063", "Sonia", "l'host è stato molto accogliente  mi ha dato pure un mano con la valigia che pesava ben 25 kili!! è stato molto cordiale  e molto disponibile a qualsiasi domanda.inoltre è davvero silenzioso!"),
("2016-11-10", "652063", "Muhammad", "It's overall nice time to stay there... i just there for couple of hours thats why couldn't talk to much with the owner.."),
("2016-11-15", "652063", "Nadia", "Hernan was great. He left the keys for me and everything was set up nicely. The room had everything you need for a short stay."),
("2016-11-17", "652063", "Nadine", "It was a great stay. We had no time to explore the area around.  Very friendly  polite and helpful host."),
("2016-11-22", "652063", "Jacques", "Hernan était très gentil et le logement était bien situé et facilement accessible. Merci Hernan"),
("2016-11-24", "652063", "Andrew & Kate", "Herman is a Prince"),
("2016-11-26", "652063", "兰竹", "he is so nice and share everything with us.you can choice his house."),
("2016-12-05", "652063", "Maila", "The place is perfect. Everything is provided. We highly recommend Hernan's place."),
("2017-01-16", "652063", "Ben", "."),
("2017-01-18", "652063", "Abigyat", "Hernan is a very hospitable man. I really enjoyed the stay there. Thanks Hernan."),
("2017-01-21", "652063", "Elaine", "Herman is a very considerate host."),
("2017-01-24", "652063", "Yijie", "Hernan is a nice person. And the house is very sweet and beautiful. At beginning  I thought Hernan maybe is a romantic female. But Hernan is an experienced tourist and manager. Thanks."),
("2017-02-03", "652063", "Meike", "Apartment is nice and clean  host is really friendly and helpful  I had a really good time with Hernan!"),
("2017-02-09", "652063", "Jacob", "Hernan was a great host no issues whatsoever and very welcoming and friendly. Room was very clean. Thanks again Hernan!"),
("2017-02-17", "652063", "Dominika", "I stayed one night long at this place. The host is very supportive  takes care about all requests  the communication was very good! Thank you again for letting me stay at your place! "),
("2017-02-26", "652063", "Ara", "I stayed with Hernan for a week while visiting Sydney. The house is cozy and the bed I had in my room was really comfortable. Hernan is a great host and he will make you feel very welcome.  If I visit Sydney once more I will definitely pick this place up again for sure.Friendly host who makes you feel very welcome and offers useful local information. And he is very cooool"),
("2017-03-06", "652063", "Tim", "Hernan is a warm  friendly and accommodating person."),
("2017-03-09", "652063", "Sangman", "Henan is very kind and active. My first Sydney trip started here is so good. The guesthouse in Henan  which is used by people from many countries  is very clean and comfortable. I traveled freely on public transport  but I did not feel any inconvenience. I would like to see you again next time you come to Sydney."),
("2017-03-10", "652063", "Rodolphe", "Hernan is a great Host very kind and available for his guests. His place is very clean and all is in place to feel good in his room. I can just recommend His room !"),
("2017-03-11", "652063", "Ayako", "He is the greatest host!! I highly recommend this Airbnb:)"),
("2017-03-15", "652063", "Weibo", "地方很好 主人也很热情很好 性价比賊高｡挺好的｡"),
("2017-03-21", "652063", "Ewald", "Der Gastgeber ist sehr hilfsbereit und freundlich  und leider haben wir bei dem Straßen-Verkehrslärm kein Auge zumachen können. Leider !"),
("2017-03-23", "652063", "Colette", "Only stayed overnight. Arrived very late like midnight and had to carry 30kg or more up the stairs. Met Hernan the next morning and he allowed me to keep my luggage stored there for half the day which was great. The street noise was loud but i was exhausted from 22 hrs flying and slept uninterrupted. Hernan is a very nice guy and good communication."),
("2017-04-03", "652063", "Pj", "Very close to the airport  so if you've got a flight the next morning it's great. Far from the city center  I took a cab to Surry Hills for about 30 AUD  so not where you wanna stay unless you wanna take buses or cabs everywhere. "),
("2017-04-04", "652063", "Amanda Dickey", "Hernan is an extremely polite  accommodating  respectful  and helpful host. His home is beautifully furnished  quiet  and a great escape from the city. I highly recommend!"),
("2017-04-07", "652063", "Hannah", "D"),
("2017-04-11", "652063", "Jacek", "Great location close to the airport and with easy access to the city. Easy-going  welcoming  experienced host. Great value for money as well."),
("2017-04-21", "652063", "Fernando", "Thanks Hernan. Great place  easy to travel not only to the city  but also to the airport. Right on the beach. Also  really nice restaurants around.Totally recommend it."),
("2017-05-02", "652063", "Ferdei", "very nice place. clean and well kept. access to public transport is not an issue. hernan gave very clear instruction and provided assistance in whatever the guest needs. i highly recommend his place if you want to travel to sydney."),
("2017-05-05", "652063", "Samantha", "Stayed at Hernan's place for about 24 hrs as a stop over to the airport. Super close to the airport- about 15 minutes. The building was very quiet- the apartment was clean and quiet and the room was nice. Hernan was very pleasant and offered tea and coffee and made sure everything was good!"),
("2017-05-26", "652063", "Dylan", "Hernan's place was a extremely convenient. The location is great  being so close to the airport and the beach. Hernan is a really friendly host and communicated very well. I would recommend Hernan's to everyone."),
("2017-06-02", "652063", "Alex", "Great place to stay and Hernan is very informative and welcoming!"),
("2017-06-09", "652063", "Peter", "The host canceled this reservation 205 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-07-08", "652063", "Adrian", "Very nice place  easy to find. Host is very friendly. He has been amazing in helping me in giving information around the area."),
("2017-07-12", "652063", "Mino", "It was nice to stay"),
("2017-07-15", "652063", "Pauline", "Hernan's place is perfect if you are arriving in Sydney or if you are about to leave. Really nice host. You  will enjoy your time here talking with Hernan !"),
("2017-07-19", "652063", "Adam", "Welcoming and personable. Comfortable apartment. I enjoyed my stay at Hernan's."),
("2017-07-29", "652063", "Grant", "Very friendly helpful host."),
("2017-08-02", "652063", "Rafael", "Hernan is a very attentions host and amazing to have a conversation. The informations are pretty precise and I strongly recommend him. Room very clean and comfortable."),
("2017-08-05", "652063", "Shohei", "This is near of airport  and Hernan taught me how to go house from airport.This host is very kind I wanted to stay more."),
("2017-08-08", "652063", "Therese", "Hernan was a great host.He is very warm  friendly  helpful and easy to talk to.Prior to my stay  he provided me with clear instructions on how to find and access his apartment.  Great location and I would not hesitate in staying there again in the future."),
("2017-08-10", "652063", "Benjamin", "Bel appartement   Et Hernan est très sympathique   on s'y sent comme chez soi. (seul petit défaut   c'est un peu près de d'un gros axe de circulation   on entend pas mal les voitures) "),
("2017-08-12", "652063", "Jp", "Awesome host  very nice place  well recommended for sure!"),
("2017-08-16", "652063", "Daniel", "An impeccably clean and well-maintained apartment. Everything was perfectly prepared for my arrival. While I was staying an extremely short time  and did not even meet the host  he made the experience painless  and it is clear that a lot of effort goes into thinking of the little details for the apartment."),
("2017-08-19", "652063", "Phillip", "Hernan was a delightful gentleman and incredibly helpful and accommodating with checkin and my stay.  His place was a charming little unit and more than comfortable for my needs ... would happily stay again should I be in the neighbourhood"),
("2017-08-22", "652063", "紫蓉", "Hernan is very nice"),
("2017-08-29", "652063", "Fan", "Hernan is a great host! He is very flexible about when I check in. He also dropped me off at the bus stop for the airport. The apartment is clean and nice."),
("2017-09-07", "652063", "Jp", "Another great staying  the host is awesome! Well done!"),
("2017-09-29", "652063", "Valentina", "Hernan was one of the best host that I ever met. He is really friendly and helpful. The house is cozy and clean  just a bit far from the centre but really well connected by public transport. Definitely recommend."),
("2017-09-30", "652063", "Chris", "Low key and a quick $20 uber from the airport. Was perfect for my one-night stay before a long flight."),
("2017-10-11", "652063", "Lingling", "It's really nice to stay in Hernan's place. It's clean and has very good view. The place near the beach."),
("2017-10-17", "652063", "Byron", "Great host... Very helpful and welcoming... Makes you feel at home.... Will stay again.."),
("2017-10-19", "652063", "Enrico & Elena", "Saying at Hernan's place was great  we spent just one night because we were looking for a place to spend our last night in Sydney before leaving the country so we needed to stay not far from the airport. The apartment is 5 mins walking distance from the bus that takes you in the city. Everything was clean and tidy  communication was excellent  happy to recommend it to anyone :)"),
("2017-10-27", "652063", "牛", "The landlord is warm and hospitable  introduces us to the scenic route  provides us with cooking tools  a good experience."),
("2017-11-02", "652063", "Marcel Alexandre", "Hernan is a very nice guy and his house is very tidy and cozy. My wife and I just spent one night there  but we were really welcomed and we enjoyed our time there.We recommend Hernan's place. Five stars for sure."),
("2017-11-04", "652063", "Bin", "房间的位置非常好 靠近海滩和公交站点｡Hernan非常热心和友好 回复信息也很及时｡希望下次去悉尼还有机会住在这个房间｡"),
("2017-11-11", "652063", "José Ignacio", "Próximo al aeropuerto y buenas conexiones con el centro de la ciudad. Excelente elección para conocer Sydney sin gastar mucho dinero :)."),
("2017-11-13", "652063", "Byron", "Highly recommended"),
("2017-11-17", "652063", "Cashel", "Really cozy and close to the airport"),
("2017-11-20", "652063", "Jo", "Very convenient location for airport. Easy to access from cbd. Excellent communication and help with public transport. Great place to stay"),
("2017-11-22", "652063", "Aimee", "Perfect for my overnight stay close to work  and free parking along the street!Very polite and respectful."),
("2017-11-25", "652063", "Ranilo", "Hernan place was very nice. The location is good. He is very accomodating and thoughtful. Will recommend Hernan’s place to my friends."),
("2017-12-01", "652063", "Franz", "Schönes Doppelzimmer  saubere Wohnung. Gastgeber gibt sich große Mühe mit der Wegbeschreibung. Allerdings ist der Verkehrslärm ziemlich laut und die Lage nicht gerade zentral."),
("2017-12-19", "652063", "Felix", "This is a clean and lovely apartment  really cozy  and makes me feel at home"),
("2018-01-26", "652063", "Claus", "Herman is a warm and friendly host  I enjoyed staying with him:-) cosey apartment  close to beach and restaurants...super spot"),
("2018-01-30", "652063", "文强", "非常棒 很喜欢的房子"),
("2018-02-05", "652063", "Kyra", "Everything was great and Hernan was an amazing host. We arrived late in the evening and he was still up to welcome us. We unfortunately had to leave really early the next morning to catch a flight so didn't get to enjoy it more.  The location is great for anyone coming or going from the airport. Thanks Hernan!"),
("2018-02-09", "652063", "Madeleine", "A perfect place to stay after a long haul flight. It’s a stones throw away from the airport. Right by the beach 10min walk to bright ole sands. highly recommended. Hernan is a lovely host. If your not used to the heat there’s no air conditioning but it seems frequent on most air bnb in Sydney. Only minor issue."),
("2018-02-13", "652063", "Rhys", "Hernan is great and this was a super convenient place to stay for me."),
("2018-02-15", "652063", "Andrew", "Great location re the beach  great host who communicated well and was friendly and helpful  only negative was that street is a little busy."),
("2018-02-19", "652063", "Byron", "5 Stars"),
("2018-02-22", "652063", "Penny", "Good location  close to transportation  bus and train."),
("2018-03-06", "652063", "Byron", "Fantastic as always... highest recommendation..."),
("2018-03-09", "652063", "Ian", "5 minute walk to the beach. Hernan is very friendly and hospitable. I'm going to be staying again before I leave."),
("2018-03-15", "652063", "Jackie", "Highly recommended:)"),
("2018-03-16", "652063", "凤阳", "房间可以 地理位置也好 离AIRPORT不远｡"),
("2018-03-20", "652063", "Ian", "Hernan is a good man. I totally recommend him if you want somewhere close to the city  but removed just enough to not feel the angst  this is a good fit. He made my first experience with  airbnb a good one. And I was happy to return before my return to Canada."),
("2018-03-22", "652063", "Byron", "Excellent as always...I keep coming back..."),
("2018-04-06", "652063", "Charlotte", "Great stay! Very comfortable apartment  good facilities  close to airport and a little beach."),
("2018-04-10", "652063", "Byron", "Perfect place to stay"),
("2018-04-12", "652063", "Luca Marie", "Had a wonderful stay at Hernan's place. Nice and clean apartment with easy access to public transportation and very welcoming hosts. Definitely recommended!"),
("2018-04-15", "652063", "Barbara", "Hernan is an excellent host. Very worried and attentive in everything you need. Great chat and Angela very nice too. When I return to Sydney  I will not hesitate to return to Hernan's. Thank you for everything guys!"),
("2018-04-25", "652063", "Rizal", "Is quite OK if you like to hang out by the beach.  Buses to the rail station is quite frequent and they may also take you to the airport for less than AUD5 via Mascot... not convenient if you have large suitcases. With Hernan  just ask him if you need anything."),
("2018-05-03", "652063", "Claudine", "Extrema amabilidad del host."),
("2018-05-09", "652063", "Roy", "Very good value  very good host."),
("2018-05-11", "652063", "Emily", "Hernan was extremely quick to respond to my messages and was extremely hospitable. $20aud Uber ride from the airport - perfect spot for flying in/out of Sydney. Would highly recommend!"),
("2018-05-14", "652063", "Hayley", "I was at Hernan's place for just one night  but he was very warm  accommodating  and approachable. His place is close to both the airport and a cute beach strip  great for a run first thing in the morning. Everything was very clean and comfortable  and I appreciated that he gave me a lot of space and privacy. Wonderfully easy going and accommodating of my late-ish check-in; great host! "),
("2018-05-19", "652063", "Jeff", "Great location & very friendly and accommodating host"),
("2018-05-23", "652063", "Joleen", "We enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-05-29", "652063", "Amber", "Great directions. I am directionally challenged and I found this easily. Super clean  great bed  little bit of road noise but I slept very well. One hop and skip from the airport  we took the bus and it was cheap and easy. Thanks Hernan!"),
("2018-06-09", "652063", "Lukas", "Clean and fuss free. Hospitable stay."),
("2018-06-15", "652063", "Aydan", "Very easy  smooth communication  makes you feel like it's your own place."),
("2018-07-04", "652063", "Russell", "Nothing but good things to say. Super friendly and helpful. Good yarns and super super respectful. Wish I could have stayed longer!"),
("2018-07-05", "652063", "Chelsea", "The host canceled this reservation 8 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-07-11", "652063", "Amélie", "Everything was good. He’s quiet and really nice!"),
("2018-07-17", "652063", "Christina", "The room was very nice and enough space for two people and all their stuff. The room was very clean. We had many blankets and towels. Hernan is a very nice host and we had a lot of privacy. We really enjoyed our stay at Hernans home and can recommend it to everyone."),
("2018-08-06", "652063", "Lim", "아주 좋았습니다.친절하고 정이 많은 부부였습니다."),
("2018-09-07", "652063", "John", "Great"),
("2018-10-10", "652063", "Aya", "Good price for enough room! Could walk around the beach and see airplanes. You can take a bus to the shopping mall near by. Hernan is really friendly and kind! Thanks."),
("2018-10-26", "652063", "David", "A great host  a real pleasure having met them. Recommended. D"),
("2018-11-06", "652063", "Nicole", "Herman was responsive  helpful   quick replies and had amazing travel stories and helped me find my way. I felt very at home. Thanks Herman"),
("2018-11-09", "652063", "Robyn", "A wonderfully convenient place that Hernan has transformed into his own special space. Full marks for a lovely  hot   sparkling clean and spacious shower!Instructions on where to find the keys  where to shop  and how to get around on public transport were clear and accurate. Communication is outstanding.I enjoyed being able to come and go as I pleased but only wish I had stayed longer than one night and/or that my host didn't have to work so hard! I would like to have spent more time chatting and getting to know him but he got home from work so late ...Hernan has a wonderful energy  kind eyes  and a smile that just lights up his face. A gracious host  and definitely someone I would consider as a visitor in my home - perhaps one day on your travels  Hernan!Thank you  again."),
("2018-11-15", "652063", "Angie", "Hernan's place is in a good location close to shops and the beach. The apartment is on the 3rd floor so if you have a lot of luggage it's  bit awkward to go up and down.  Hernan is very efficient with responding to you.  Very good value for what it is."),
("2018-11-21", "652063", "James", "Great location near to beach and airport. 2nd floor apartment. Overlooks President Ave. friendly helpful people."),
("2018-11-28", "652063", "Rebecca", "Hernan's place is close to the airport."),
("2019-02-05", "652063", "Daniel", "Hernan’s place is clean  his communication is sharp and everything went smoothly. I would stay again if I found myself local."),
("2019-02-12", "652063", "Laura", "Hernan was a lovely host. His apartment was the perfect place to recover after my long flight. The beach is a very short walk away and perfect for a nice walk or a swim. There are also good restaurants and cafes a short walk away! 10/10 would stay again"),
("2019-02-21", "652063", "Monique", "Hernan est un hôte accueillant  aidant et flexible sur les heures d’arrivée  ce que j’ai beaucoup apprécié."),
("2015-11-17", "6785160", "Janice", "I can highly recommend Carole and Steve’s place  - what a lovely  light  spacious and spotlessly clean home! If you get a chance to rent the entire house  go for it. We stayed in the front two rooms of the house  in our own fairly separate area  and had sole use of a beautiful  spacious bathroom.  There are no kitchen facilities in this part of the house (as made clear in the ad) but there is a small fridge  kettle and toaster  as well as cutlery and crockery for guests to use. Meals are easy to find in any case as the house is close to some fantastic cafes  bars  pubs and restaurants – a real taste of Sydney’s cosmopolitan inner west. The house is in a peaceful  quiet  tree-lined street. Parking  if you need it  is easy to find nearby  or even out the front if you're lucky (check the parking signs to be sure though). Public transport – buses  trains –  in easy walking distance. Carole and Steve and Snoop dog were perfect AirBnB hosts  very friendly and considerate  without being intrusive. We were lucky to have found them! Absolutely recommended. "),
("2015-11-23", "6785160", "Christophe", "I had the privilege to stay at Carole and Steeve's house for a night. I was also disappointed cause I had to leave Sydney earlier than I expected.this couple made me feel really confortable. I really enjoyed my stay in their house. And I've been touched by the fact they proposed me to  eat together  the first evening. They are really open minded and kind persons. The bed was confortable. The bathroom is really big. Even if they start on airbnb  they behave like they're on many years ago  because they are travelers. So they're curious and they know what you need. You'll feel at home. Rent it; that's an order :) (french joke)"),
("2015-11-29", "6785160", "Crystal", "Very clean. Great location . House and room looks even better than the photos. Spacious your own bathroom and your own private lounge. Definitely come back here again. Btw  the cafe nearby is superb! You have to try :)"),
("2015-12-04", "6785160", "Marita", "Wir haben uns sehr wohl und willkommen gefühlt! Die Beschreibungen von der Unterkunft und dem Umfeld haben definitiv nicht zu viel versprochen. In 20 min. ist man bequem in der Innenstadt mit dem öffentlichen Nahverkehr  fußläufig gibt es mehrere Cafes und die Gastgeber sind sehr freundlich  aufgeschlossen und stets mit einem guten Tipp zur Stelle. Wir würden definitiv gerne wieder kommen  sollte es uns erneut nach Sydney verschlagen. Absolut empfehlenswert!"),
("2016-01-03", "6785160", "Jane", "Carole's house is very clean and comfortable.Better than the photo.There are very conveniently located near the bus with the train.Carole and Steve are very friendly.Have the opportunity to Sydney we will choose to live here."),
("2016-02-21", "6785160", "Annie", "Carole  Steve and Snoop Dog are a lovely and happy family ! There house is beautiful and so clean with a big new  modern bathroom all to ourself ! Perfect location right next to bus stops and funky cafe strips !Defiantly worth the stay !Thanks so much for having us !xxx "),
("2016-02-28", "6785160", "Alix", "Carole and her husband are welcoming and have a plethora of knowledge about Sydney that they are eager to share with their guests! The bedroom is comfy and that bathroom is luxurious. Highly recommended."),
("2016-03-06", "6785160", "Leanna", "Carole and Steve were extremely welcoming and helpful.  We had a lovely stay and I would highly recommend this listing!Everything you need in a convenient area."),
("2016-08-23", "6785160", "Shauna", "A Great stay  very welcoming  super clean and comfy  easy access - a home away from home. We'll be back!"),
("2016-09-25", "6785160", "Sharen", "From the moment that I booked with Carole and Steve I was made to feel welcome.  They are a friendly and helpful couple that went out of their way to ensure that I felt comfortable in their home.  Nothing was too much trouble and the accommodation was excellent.  I was more than happy with the lovely bedroom  the well set up sitting room and the light and airy private bathroom.  I would not hesitate to recommend their establishment for a place to stay in Sydney.  Their house is well situated to bus and train transport and there is local shopping available just down the street.  "),
("2016-10-02", "6785160", "Shuting", "Well designed house with two seperate rooms(one bed room and one living room) that you can stay in. Everything is clean and make you feel at home. Reasonable price and absolutely better than my imagination.   I highly recommend here as a place for short stay! Thank you Carole and Steve"),
("2016-10-10", "6785160", "Vanessa", "I was delighted with my stay. Carol and Steve are kind and thoughtful hosts. Beautiful rooms and bathroom  very clean. Having the lounge area was great for those rest times and having somewhere to chill out. It was the perfect accomodation for my weekend. Well done Carol and Steve  you guys were fab."),
("2018-01-13", "6785160", "Sana", "Carole and Steve were very friendly and cooperative. The place is well maintained and centrally located. We had a splendid time!"),
("2018-02-04", "6785160", "Peter", "Amazing place! Clean  spacious  all the necessary facilities are available  great hosts and very easy to get into the CBD quickly! Very much recommended"),
("2018-02-13", "6785160", "Xuewen", "Carole and Steve are really nice and often offer suggestions on our plan or when we have some questions. Their house is clean enough and we got surprised when we arrived that it is much better than the photos and is located in a quite convenient place. It took only half an hour to get to the city by train or bus  and so does the airport.  They provide us a living room  a bedroom and also a private bathroom  which made us feel like a home. By the way  their little Buddy is also very cute and always showed friendly to us."),
("2018-02-15", "6785160", "Arra", "Great location. Great price. Great house. Great hosts. Definitely recommend & would definitely go back. Thanks Steve & Carole"),
("2018-02-19", "6785160", "Simon", "Lovely and very well-kept home. Superb comfort and privacy. Good value and great access via local public transport. Would definitely recommend this place for anyone staying a few days in Sydney  who isn't focused on beaches. Easy 20 mins walk to Newtown and wide selection of eateries  bars and shopping. Can get a bus or train to Sydney centre  beaches or airport with ease. Buddy is irresistibly cute and very friendly.Steve and Carole were very good hosts and very flexible for our needs. Highly rated and possibly the best Airbnb experience we had so far in Australia."),
("2018-02-22", "6785160", "Arthur", "A very pleasant space that enabled me to come and go as i needed. It works well having the bedroom  private lounge and private bathroom in a row along the passage at the front of the house. Characterful and close to everything with friendly and helpful hosts."),
("2018-03-08", "6785160", "Clay", "我们在Carole的房子里住了十来天 房子很满意 交通方便 房间整齐 卫生间干净整齐 是一个安静的住宿区 房东夫妇待人热情 在悉尼停留的这段时间 为我们提供了很多帮助 帮我们叫出租车 解决上机换卡问题 等等｡因我们自身的原因最后一天退房时未能提前给Steven打招呼 而给他的生活造成了一些不便 感到抱歉｡总之 这是一个值得推荐的地方"),
("2018-03-21", "6785160", "Kuin Mee", "We stayed at this wonderful home for 6 nights. We truly enjoyed staying at this quiet and lovely home of Carole and Steve. They are so helpful and caring. Indeed  the energetic 16 month old and very friendly Jack Russell Terrier ""Buddy"" who is very smart. Thank you so much  Carole and Steve. Surely we will come back to stay with you again."),
("2018-03-24", "6785160", "Natalya", "This was a great airbnb: a homely  tidy and spacious multi-room space at the front of Carole's place. The bed was super comfortable and the bath in the private ensuite is divine! The location is very good  close to bus and train lines in to the city. Great hosts  prompt and easy to communicate with before and throughout the stay. I would happily stay here again."),
("2018-04-01", "6785160", "Garima", "The place was very beautiful  stylish  clean and very comfortable. Carole and her husband were very welcoming and hospitable people. We loved staying at their house."),
("2018-04-08", "6785160", "Mana", "I booked the place for my parents and they loved it. the hosts helped them alot and the place was clean amd comfy. a great place for refreshing for tourists who have walked all day."),
("2018-04-13", "6785160", "Bec", "Absolutely top-notch place to stay. Carole & her partner are unobtrusive  yet very friendly & warm  hosts. Their beautifully appointed  centrally located home is a sight for sore eyes after a long day/night out exploring. Their gorgeous place is a stone’s throw from amazing coffee shops  restaurants  watering holes  & public transport. I will definitely stay here again & highly recommend this to everyone."),
("2018-04-18", "6785160", "Jeremy", "This was our ideal accommodation; very comfy bed  wonderful bathroom with bath an shower and separate sitting room. Easy  ground floor private access. Best of all  Carol and Steve are the ideal hosts and made us feel very welcome. This was our perfect stay in an excellent location."),
("2018-05-05", "6785160", "Bren & Dell", "Great place to stay  nice quiet house close to everything. Nice  friendly  welcoming hosts."),
("2018-06-04", "6785160", "Abhilash", "The place was really well maintained. All necessary amenities were provided by Carole and Steve. The room and extra lounge was really helpful. The place that you have for yourself is private and you have plenty of space for yourself with the lounge room. Carole and Steve were always around for any requirement we had. Sweet place :)Additionally note  The cute doggo 'buddy' was is super friendly and had his own boundary but was always happy to play with you :)Definitely pick this place if an opportunity presented itself."),
("2018-07-27", "6785160", "Arthur", "It's a great pleasure to return to friendly hosts Carole and Steve's well appointed home  offering their guests plenty of private space  and  walking distance to everywhere. "),
("2018-09-25", "6785160", "Edward", "Very friendly hosts and plenty of space to ourselves. Walking distance to trains with easy access to the Waterfront and City."),
("2018-10-13", "6785160", "Alexandra", "I was meeting friends in Newtown so location for me was great. It's also only a short walk to the station from where you can go straight to circular quay. Bed was really comfortable and everywhere was very clean. Would stay again and definitely recommend."),
("2018-10-21", "6785160", "Sharon", "Loved my stay. Lovely people  comfortable bed and separate living room with lovely outlook to street. Everything super clean and really quiet street. Of course  in this part of Sydney aircraft noise began around 7am."),
("2018-10-28", "6785160", "Grace", "This was a lovely place to stay! it was nice and private but the hosts were also very kind  and friendly and happy to help out. Very cute pup! The rooms were clean and comfortable. We were really happy with our stay!"),
("2018-11-01", "6785160", "Courtney", "Carole's home was lovely! Everything was as described  and she was very responsive by phone to answer questions. Her partner Steve was home during most of our stay and readily available to answer any questions as well while Carole was working. Their dog Buddy is the cutest. The location is near a really cool part of town called Newtown. Highly recommend checking it out!"),
("2018-11-06", "6785160", "Nicolas", "Carole and her husband are extremely welcoming including their dog (Buddy). The house is nice and clean being a 10min walk from the nearest train station and 5min walk from the bus stop. Overall  great place to stay and we look forward to coming back!"),
("2018-11-08", "6785160", "Kelly", "Wonderful place!! Super peaceful and sweet and lovely neighborhood!!! Appreciated the extra help they gave me with transportation issues I was having. They were a blessing to me!!"),
("2018-11-11", "6785160", "Zemma", "Great place to stay - pretty neighbourhood  convenient  location  super clean. Would recommend!"),
("2018-11-18", "6785160", "Nicole", "Great place to stay.  Everything was perfect. Very friendly. Highly recommend staying there."),
("2018-11-21", "6785160", "Shabnam", "Steve and Carole are very friendly and hospitable. We enjoyed our stay at their place. They let us use the washing machine as we desperately needed it after a week on the road. The bathroom is super clean and spacious. Their place is very close to the bus stops. We also enjoyed a 15 mins walk to Newtown  a very funky neighbourhood with lots of cafes and bars. We would recommend staying at their place."),
("2018-11-24", "6785160", "Jeff", "Carole is a very generous host. The accommodation is of a very high standard and so close to everything in the City. Great neighborhood with a lot of interesting things to do. All our needs were well catered for. Thank you so much. Definitely recommend Caroles place."),
("2018-12-01", "6785160", "Rosalie", "Carole's place was just lovely  really clean and very peaceful. It is also close to transport and the city which is an advantage. I would certainly recommend it."),
("2019-02-02", "6785160", "Giancarlo", "If you are in Sydney  you should stay here!Aside from the place being perfect (private bathroom  aircon in the  bedroom - not just in the living room  small fridge and small private living room)  Carole and Steve are an absolute pleasure. They are super kind and very accommodating  and their little dog  Buddy  is adorable and friendly. If I am every in Sydney again  I just hope this place isn't already booked!"),
("2019-02-08", "6785160", "Elizabeth", "Stanmore great. Good parking. Station close. Great coffee at the Mule. Very comfortable and clean Aircon or a fan. Sitting room with tea and coffee great."),
("2019-02-15", "6785160", "Meg", "Easy place to stay  good transport. Very clean with Friendly people. Proximity to The flight path was a bit of an issue for me but might not be for others."),
("2019-02-21", "6785160", "Harmik", "We had a great stay !  Close to transit and the room was very clean and lovely.  Would definitely come back"),
("2019-02-24", "6785160", "Samir", "Carole’s place beautiful and convenient. Will come again. Thanks"),
("2019-03-03", "6785160", "Melody Ann", "Carole and Steve's house comes highly recommended! The perfect place to stay when in Sydney! The check in was smooth and Steve was very helpful and friendly! We were also allowed to leave our bags in the house while we explore Sydney on our last day and pick it up just before our evening flight. Location is great!! Located near Newtown which is a very nice and cool place to explore. It is also located very near to a bus and train that leads you straight to anywhere you would like to explore in Sydney. The house is also such a treat to return to after a long busy day out. You will have a nice big bed to sleep in and a big bathroom all to yourself. Additionally  there is also a lounge that we were allowed to use all to ourself to make coffee or tea. Overall  very thankful to Steve and Carole and will definetely be back here if ever in Sydney :)"),
("2018-10-24", "7285721", "Avihou", "The host canceled this reservation 65 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-01-02", "728222", "Gaurav", "Carl was a wonderful host and his apartment is comfortable and cozy. The apartment has awesome views of the harbor bridge and sky -- in fact we enjoyed the outstanding Sydney new year fireworks from the comfort of the house without needing to brave the  crowds in the park :) Would love to be back."),
("2016-01-05", "728222", "Elliot", "Carl and Jessy were great from the get go!  The place was perfect  fully stocked and a great location.  BONUS; was the fact that we had a Carl gave us his BMW car to use   very easy getting around the beautiful city of Sydney.  The bedroom was the perfect spot for NYE fireworks  both for the 9 pm and midnight show.  Carl and Jessy were readily available if need be and we had no issues. The apartment was like being at home with all the amenities plus.  WOULD HIGHLY RECOMMEND THIS PLACE GOING TO SYDNEY...."),
("2017-01-03", "728222", "Trivelloninarino", "Darling point e' la posizione giusta x un week end rilassante a Sidney ed e' la location per famiglie che si vogliono godere il clima estivo e la tranquillita' della baia.La casa di Carl e' molto accogliente  Carl e' stato sempre molto attento   provido di informazioni  e suggerimenti. Ritornerei subito ad abitare  in Casa di Carl ciamo trovati molto molto bene !!Grazie a Carl.________________________________________________Darling point is a great location if you are looking for  relaxing time in Sydney also it is the perfect location for families who want to enjoy the summer weather and the tranquility of the Bay with a great park where you can play make joging.Carl's House is perfect   Carl was always attentive  providing a lot  of information and tips.I would like to go back to sidney in carl's  house  to live.We feell at home we feel very very well!!Thanks to Carl."),
("2017-12-25", "728222", "Maggie", "The host canceled this reservation 4 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-07-14", "7132426", "Jacquie", "Fantastic  stylish apartment  in a top  easily accessible location. The photos say it all; everything was to a very high standard  super comfortable bed  we also used the deluxe air mattress (think I'll buy one myself). Paul was extremely accommodating  met us at the door and showed us around the apartment. Loved the guest guide with many suggestions that we followed  including shopping  walks  the best spot to get a coffee and amazing restaurants. Luke and Paul really know the best of Potts Point. They have certainly created a wonderful oasis for all to stay in. We'll certainly be staying there again. "),
("2015-07-25", "7132426", "Patrick", "What a delightful home - I was going to say 'property'  but the thoughtful touches like a waiting bottle of red wine and fluffy white bath towels really did feel like luxury. The apartment is impeccable in every way  and the hosts extremely helpful and flexible. The location couldn't be better - set in a classic art deco building on an elegant shopping street in a friendly neighbourhood  just footsteps from transport and walking distance to all the sights. I highly recommend the apartment  and thank the hosts for a lovely stay."),
("2015-07-27", "7132426", "Shane", "This place is gorgeous and Paul was a terrific host. All you need for a short stay in Sydney!"),
("2015-07-30", "7132426", "Damian", "Beautifully renovated one bedroom apartment in the gentrified Potts Point area in a classic old building. Close to fantastic cafes and food outlets and transport. Very convenient.  Will definitely be back!"),
("2015-08-04", "7132426", "Dianne", "Absolutely fabulous apartment  fabulous location and a fabulous place for the Sydney experience.  Beautifully appointed apartment.  Very comfortable and everything catered for. Looked after extremely well by Luke"),
("2015-08-10", "7132426", "Tracey", "This was our first time using Air BnB and we couldn't have wished for a better experience.   The apartment was all that was promised  small but beautifully appointed and there was plenty of room for the three of us.  The location was fabulous  we just walked out the door and hopped on a bus to the city or Chinatown.  The train was only a short stroll away.  We had no trouble getting around.  Not that you needed to go far.....there were plenty of delicious places to eat and wonderful farmer's markets directly opposite on Saturday morning.   The best treat was lying in the very comfortable bed  snuggled under the feather doona and just melting with the aromas of freshly baking bread wafting up from the French patisserie below....heaven.  Paul was a most gracious host...friendly  informative and everything was super organised.  We had a fabulous time and will most definitely stay again. Thanks  Paul!"),
("2015-08-15", "7132426", "Elena", "the apartmet is really cute  and Paul very kind and taking care to any detail: he has left even a little present for we guests  unforgettable!We strongly recommend this flat: 15 minutes by feet from The Opera House  a really good asutrain (Asutria  not Australia) restaurant for meat just in the square downstairs  the tube is at 5 minutes..The flat is delicious! "),
("2015-08-19", "7132426", "Liuyang", "Fabulous location. Kings Cross station just around the corner  so easy access to most places and the airport. One small default is that if you have a low tolerance of noise while sleep  nightlife of Kings Cross on weekends may be a little bit annoy. This is great apartment near to shopping grocery store and cafe  beside very clean this apartment had everything inside  very complete. We had 3 adults and the apartment fit us fine. Very personally decorated with great collection of books. Paul communicated very well and check in & out was smooth & easy.  They made a guide book with almost all information we needed to enjoy the local life  including iconic restaurants  local groceries. Would  recommend to a friend! "),
("2015-08-22", "7132426", "Jeffrey", "Great place to stay"),
("2015-08-24", "7132426", "Isabella", "Paul was very nice and helpful  providing us all the information we needed to know. We loved staying in the apartment  especially the location  and its interior. We would definitely stay there again! "),
("2015-09-05", "7132426", "Min-Kyoo", "Beautifully decorated and trendy designed house. The royal botanic garden located in walking distance. Everything is okay and convenient. Thanks Paul."),
("2015-09-07", "7132426", "Janet", "Paul was very welcoming and helpful.Description was spot on. Its in right in the heart of Potts Point and Kings Cross. Very cute area  bit noisy on a Friday night but you can walk to the city  beach  through the beautiful streets of Potts point."),
("2015-09-11", "7132426", "Stephen", "Paul was super friendly and the flat was great in an awesome location and he met us and made it easy to get in with a great packet for us with tons of info about the flat and neighborhood."),
("2015-09-22", "7132426", "Nicole", "Lovely apartment. Very neat and clean. Good location"),
("2015-09-24", "7132426", "Noemi & Jasper", "A tidy  professionally run airbnb. Perfect for 1 or 2 people. Fantastic location. Great restaurants and within striking distance of the city. Highly recommended. "),
("2015-09-27", "7132426", "Liz", "Paul was very friendly and helpful.  The apartment was lovely  very neat and clean with the added bonus of being located conveniently to public transport and amenities."),
("2015-09-29", "7132426", "Dream", "Perfect location!Clean and beautiful (Website hidden by Airbnb) you for the great apartment!"),
("2015-10-01", "7132426", "Tiffany", "We really enjoyed our stay in Sydney. Paul and Luke were great hosts - helpful  informative and responded to queries in a timely manner. The apartment in Potts Point was clean  tastefully furnished  and convenient located close to shops  cafes and public transport. Would love to stay here again. Thanks guys "),
("2015-10-06", "7132426", "David", "The apartment was well located. The bed room needed alot more sound and light proofing from the road  an iron and board would be great  had a few cocroach visitors as well  the kitchen was well equipped for what we wanted. Maybe a small coffee table in living room. A small side table for the bed room corner to charge phones on would be nice. All in all a good apartment but really need to sort out some large heavy noise and light blocking curtains.Thanks alot for the stay"),
("2015-10-09", "7132426", "Sonya", "Charming and large one bedroom apartment with cute separate study. It was thoughtfully prepared with visitor information. The apartment is very conveniently located with much choice for public transport. Our hosts were very welcoming  responsive and helpful. Things to consider prior to booking: the area where the apartment is located is mixed with trendy shops and cafes on the one hand but there are also a number of misfits in the area; the apartment doesn't have a lift but it's only two flights of stairs; apartment is on a busy street with single window glazing; no fan or air conditioning."),
("2015-10-25", "7132426", "James", "I booked the apartment for my parents whilst they were visiting us in Sydney. The flat is a great size for 2 people  and the small study with lots of storage and hanging space was a plus too. Kitchen is small (or about average if you live in a similar period block!) but has everything needed for cooking simple meals. Beautifully furnished and a great place to relax  plus amazing location. Only thing parents struggled with was traffic noise from the street  but some ear plugs and a weeks acclimatising to city life sorted that. Would highly recommend. Thanks Paul you were a great host! "),
("2015-11-02", "7132426", "Ginny", "Luke gave us a very warm welcome at the apartment  and went out of his way to accommodate an early arrival from the US.  The apartment was just as it appears in the photos: tastefully decorated and well-organized   with beautiful tree-filled views out the front windows onto square below.   We loved the Potts Point neighborhood  and after spending five days there  we could imagine living there.  It's filled with great restaurants and cafes  is out of the way of the crowds of tourists but also has easy access to anything you'd like to see or do. "),
("2015-11-04", "7132426", "Terri", "My partner and I spent two nights in Paul and Luke's lovely apartment. This place is a gorgeous little base for exploring Sydney! Paul and Luke have provided a wonderful guide for the Pott's Point area and we thoroughly enjoyed exploring their recommendations (mostly the food ones!). The bakery downstairs is a real winner! Really glad we chose to spend our long weekend here  it made for such a cosy retreat. Thanks guys!"),
("2015-11-08", "7132426", "Mandy", "Stylish apartment in trendy  convenient location with everything you need. There's a huge variety of dining and nightlife options on the doorstep. Great value for money. Paul and Luke were fantastic to deal with; extremely flexible and hospitable hosts!"),
("2015-11-12", "7132426", "Sansan", "We loved Paul's apartment! It's right in the middle of Potts Point and is about 5 minutes away from Kings Cross rail station. There's Woolie's a fee minutes away and coffee places all over! Room 10  which is right next door from the back served amazing coffee!The apartment was very clean and has a lot of character. It certainly felt like we were staying at someone's home and not just a random hotel. We especially loved the book collection!Overall  it was an awesome experience and we would definitely stay here again if we come back to Sydney. "),
("2015-11-16", "7132426", "Kate", "We really enjoyed our stay in Paul's apartment. Very hospitable even though we didn't actually meet! Great location  perfect for a short stay in Sydney."),
("2015-11-18", "7132426", "Dianne", "This is my second stay at this amazing apartment in Potts Point and I will most certainly be staying here every time that I am in Sydney.  Paul and Luke are excellent hosts and very friendly and knowledgeable about the area. The apartment is beautifully decorated and the book collection is 'to die for'. Is very clean and the linen is beautiful.  Perfect location for that get away in the heart of Sydney. I highly recommend that this is the best destination for your Sydney stay."),
("2015-11-20", "7132426", "Ai Hwa", "Thank you for the place. Everything was good - the location  the apartment  the greenery out of the windows  the neighborhood etc. It would be perfect if there is a coffee table and a hair dryer in the apartment though. But all is still good!!"),
("2015-11-27", "7132426", "Zaza", "Luke and Paul's flat listing caught my eye instantly  and we eagerly booked it as soon as we found that our desired dates were free. The flat looks exactly as it is pictured  and Paul was very responsive to our queries. While the neighborhood is quite close to the Kings Cross area (which we were told to be careful of)  the Potts Point area where the flat is located is safe  and has a few good restaurants for a quick bite or a full meal. Paul had several restaurant recommendations which we tried  and we were not disappointed. While it is not entirely Paul's fault nor his liking  the apartment building does not have a lift  which made it hard for us to transfer our heavy luggage. However  the space of the flat itself is just right for three travelers  and we had a comfortable stay. I liked how the kitchen is well equipped as well. There extra towels and linens were a plus too. We stayed over the weekend and was able to catch the weekend market just across the street. We enjoyed that as well. We would definitely stay in Paul's flat again if given the chance. "),
("2015-12-12", "7132426", "Pav", "Paul made me feel very welcome at his apartment and even arranged for an ironing board and iron.  The location is very central and has great access to really good food spots.  Easy walk to the Kings Cross Station."),
("2015-12-18", "7132426", "Hannah", "Paul's place in Sydney was fantastic! Exactly like the pictures. Less than five min walk to king's cross train station. Just what we needed for a few days. The check in was a piece of cake and after traveling far that's always appreciated. We also (embarrassingly) locked our keys in the flat and Paul was very nice about it and accommodating about it."),
("2015-12-21", "7132426", "Lea", "It was very nice at Pauls appartment! So central with a lovely facility! We enjoyed our Weekend. Thanks! :-)"),
("2015-12-31", "7132426", "David", "Paul's place is very nice  well situated near all the shops  restaurants  sites and bay on Macleay street. Easy to get to from the airport. Good bed and kitchen  nice cooking facilities. Thanks again Paul.David"),
("2016-01-05", "7132426", "Olivia", "Such a lovely stay - perfect location with a delicious bakery right below the apartment ;) Very clean with chic decorations  we felt very welcomed and comfortable! "),
("2016-01-06", "7132426", "Maggie", "Paul's apartment is super cute and in a lovely neighborhood. Clean and quiet  had everything we needed. Check in was a breeze and we had a lovely time!"),
("2016-01-13", "7132426", "Lizzie", "Paul's apartment was absolutely beautiful! The location was amazing. A 3 minute walk from the Kings Cross station and is near really great restaurants and establishments. A great location if you love to walk as well. A Weekend Market pops up on Saturdays & Sundays right outside the apartment. The place was very clean  orderly  and well decorated. Nothing bad to say about this apartment! Thanks Paul for the help and for returning the stuff I had left. Will stay here when I visit Sydney again for sure!"),
("2016-01-16", "7132426", "Elsa", "We had a fantastic time at luke and paul's. The apartment is very clean and well located  in a very vibrant area a short walk away from the rocks. It's stylish but cozy  it felt like being at home!"),
("2016-01-22", "7132426", "Dianne", "Paul and Luke were very responsive host's and the apartment is in a very handy location with so many great cafes and restaurants nearby.  The Kings Cross train station is only a few minutes walk away and its an easy walk to Hyde Park and the city."),
("2016-01-26", "7132426", "Steve", "The apartment is very stylish and comfortable. It is very conveniently located  close to King's Cross underground station and with many attractions accessible on foot. Paul was very helpful over arrangements with our arrival time."),
("2016-01-28", "7132426", "Karynn", "Paul made us feel very welcome even though he was out-of-town.  Paul gave us great info regarding getting to his apartment and Wendy was very helpful as well.    Fantastic location and apartment was lovely and cosy and met our needs."),
("2016-02-01", "7132426", "Alvaro", "Everything was great at Paul and Luke's. We had a fantastic base to explore Sydney and enjoyed the cozy apartment. We'd return to the Pott's Point base in a heartbeat."),
("2016-02-07", "7132426", "Christine", "Apartment was very well appointed as described. Neighbourhood busy but not too noisy."),
("2016-02-18", "7132426", "Javier", "Amazing experience in Sydney  with so many things to do and enjoy. The apartment is located in a nice area to get to the center and to the airport and other parts. It's very cozy and beautiful. It was very sunny these days but there is a fan to solve it. It's a noisy street but you can close the windows. And don't worry about strange people walking around  they don't cause problems"),
("2016-03-01", "7132426", "Justine", "Stylish flat in a central location - perfect for exploring the city centre and getting out to Bondi beach."),
("2016-03-08", "7132426", "Jennifer", "We stayed in Paul's place for six nights and had a wonderful time. The flat is compact  comfortable  and stylish. There is a bathroom with bath and shower as well as WC. there is a kitchen with a gas cooker  a dining table which can seat four  and a dressing room with good storage space. It is perfect for one or two. The location is in potts point  just three minutes walk from kings cross station. You can walk into the centre of sydney in 20 minutes. There are big supermarkets within ten minutes walk of the apartment. "),
("2016-03-12", "7132426", "Kay", "Small apartment in a central  noisy location. Good for exploring the city. Good communication. "),
("2016-03-17", "7132426", "Edmund", "It was a great cosy place to leave at King Cross area. Train station was in walking distance. Area is close to plenty interesting cafes. Room is clean."),
("2016-03-26", "7132426", "Kay Yong", "Great location to stay in Sydney. A few minutes walk to Kings Cross Station which is just 2 stops away from Bondi Junction and Town Hall. Lots of food options around the area. Paul was very prompt and polite to us."),
("2016-04-04", "7132426", "Varun", "Paul's place is furnished beautifully  clean and looks exactly like in the pictures. And although  we couldn't meet Paul in person  he was a pleasure to interact with over the phone. He was accommodative of our late check out and had a well curated brochure explaining the basics and more of the house and a bit of Sydney.Located quite ideally to look around Sydney  we enjoyed our stay and would definitely come again."),
("2016-04-11", "7132426", "Chad", "The apartment could not have been better...stylishly decorated and perfectly located. Additionally  the hosts were always available to answer questions and did so quickly. Highly recommend to anyone visiting Sydney!"),
("2016-04-19", "7132426", "Leslie", "We had a wonderful stay! The apartment was exactly how it was shown and perfectly located in beautiful Potts Point. Our hosts we extremely friendly  professional and easy to communicate with. I would and will recommend them to everyone we talk to about our amazing trip! Thank you so much !!! "),
("2016-04-21", "7132426", "Joseph", "Really nice place  very clean. even left us some fresh coffee!! "),
("2016-04-24", "7132426", "Keri", "Paul was extremely easy to get in touch with  flexible  and kind.The apartment was just as described  and the neighborhood was incredible. Public transit in the area was easy for bus or train access as well. Overall  we had a perfect stay and would absolutely return to this spot!"),
("2016-04-30", "7132426", "Emma", "The place was clean and stylish and conveniently located for us - although it is in the 'red light' district  it didn't bother us - and if you turn out left of the apartment you get to some really lovely shops  restaurants and bars. Walkable to the botanical gardens  Opera House and the CBD."),
("2016-05-02", "7132426", "Clayton", "Paul's apartment is conveniently located. It is cosy and overlooks a small park. Paul is readily contactable and accommodating."),
("2016-05-04", "7132426", "Loi", "Lovely little spot in Potts Point. Right amongst all the best it has to offer  Paul was very accomodating with an early check in and catered for our little family just perfectly  would definitely stay here again when in Sydney. The convenience was second to none."),
("2016-05-09", "7132426", "Jon", "Great centrally locate apartment  with a super yummy patisserie at the bottom and loads at cafes and restaurants in the immediate vicinity. Host Paul was very accommodating.  "),
("2016-05-13", "7132426", "Samuel", "Lovely place to stay  beautiful clean flat  and a short walk to the botanical gardens and harbour "),
("2016-05-18", "7132426", "Jill", "What a delight it was to stay in this very cute apartment. The location is an ideal place to launch daily adventures all over Sydney. Immaculately clean  comfortable  and convenient. Also  Wendy who cleans the place helped us with our bag drop and getting the keys. She is a total gem! "),
("2016-05-22", "7132426", "Xio", "The apartment was exactly like it was shown on the picture. Very nice and clean. It was easy to find and is well located."),
("2016-05-25", "7132426", "Halle", "Lovely apartment easy to find and was exactly what you need for a couple of days getaway to Sydney! Hopefully get the chance to stay here again at some point. Thank you for hosting us!"),
("2016-05-31", "7132426", "Daniel", "Our family had a lovely stay at Paul's apartment  which was comfortable and in a great location."),
("2016-06-03", "7132426", "Nick & Grant", "We had the best stay in Potts Point. Such a cute apartment  had everything we needed and the BEST location. Easy communication  looking forward to staying again."),
("2016-06-07", "7132426", "Daryl", "Hi! It has been an awesome stay in Paul's place. There was a lot of recommendations by them and we certainly felt at home with their hospitality"),
("2016-06-14", "7132426", "Devina", "Stayed for 5 nights. If you bring a lot of luggage with you  don't bother to stay here  because there is no lift  only stairs and the unit is on the 2nd floor. I bring 4 luggage so its a bad experience from the start. The bed was ok  but the blanket was filthy  under the bed its even worse. There was a very thick dust  like its never been cleaned for months. And there was a dead cockroach in the wardrobe. When I was asked for new floor mat for bathroom on 3rd night because its wet  the cleaner told me to just use the new towel as the floor mat. Literally the worst experience ever and not going to try any airbnb in the future after this. "),
("2016-06-21", "7132426", "Ryan", "Great experience with Paul's apartment. Everything is nice  available  ready and fit for use. Very good location and easy to access. Highly recommend!"),
("2016-06-24", "7132426", "Hobby", "Paul is a great host which always attend to all our queries in a positive manner. He even reminded us when the check in time was near. The place is artistic and you can feel a designer touch in the house. The hot water run well and the kitchen is fully equipped.The kings cross train station is just around the corner makes you travel easily around the city. Special appreciation to the shopkeeper inside the station that help us buying our first opal card.Special thanks to the cleaner that enthusiastic welcome us and help with the trash bin."),
("2016-07-02", "7132426", "Suzy", "Overall  this was a great space for our quick three night stay in Sydney.  The location was terrific for getting around the city either by train or on foot and the binder left by Paul gave some great suggestions of nearby places.  There were a few finer details missing that would have made the place feel more homey  but it was a terrific base to see Sydney from.  Thanks!!"),
("2016-07-05", "7132426", "Amanda", "Very beautiful  stylish and comfortable apartment. Everything you need is here and the location is very convenient. Host very responsive and helpful. If you like to sleep in a dark  quiet room  I advise you to have an eye mask and ear plugs. It is light outside and the blinds don't quite shut it all out. "),
("2016-07-11", "7132426", "Thomas", "Listing accurate. Location superb. Greeted by Wendy the cleaning lady who made us very welcome and went out of her way to allow us drop bags early."),
("2016-07-16", "7132426", "Servane", "Luke and paul's apartment is fantastically central  literally a stone's throw from a number of hip cafes and restaurants  and Kings Cross station. Very stylish. The corridors and staircases are charmingly old world... "),
("2016-07-17", "7132426", "David", "Wicked location  great place to crash for a couple of nights to explore Sydney!"),
("2016-07-24", "7132426", "Maria", "Paul es un excelente anfitrión. Se retrasó el vuelo y nos dejaron las llaves en un comercio abajo y un vino en la nevera. El apartamento está impecable y en una zona muy ambientada. Súper cómodo para visitar Sydney.El único pero es el edificio  un poco viejo lleno de moqueta y sin ascensor. Toca subir la maleta a pulso. Por lo demás  perfecto!"),
("2016-07-29", "7132426", "James", "Great little spot. Paul was super helpful with places to see and things to do. Very well located  cool apartment. "),
("2016-08-01", "7132426", "Zac", "Great stay at Paul's - super convenient location right next to the excellent weekend market and plenty of good cafes and restaurants. Paul was a pleasure to deal with and made it easy to get in/out etc. Located close to the hectic Kings Cross but remarkably  once you turn the corner towards the park and the apartment  it becomes quieter and lovely! "),
("2016-08-05", "7132426", "Lingli", "The apartment is well-maintained  conveniently located near the Kings Cross station and has plenty of restaurants/shops nearby."),
("2016-08-09", "7132426", "Pieter", "I had a great time staying at Paul's cozy apartment. The location is great  plenty of nice bars and restaurants to choose from and about a 15min walk to the ferries at circular quay. Apartment layout is efficient  space is compact. Lot of daylight on the street side; it is on a fairly busy street  but I slept really well. Enjoyed my stay and hope to come back soon."),
("2016-08-18", "7132426", "Ben", "Paul was very quick to get back to me even though he wasn't in the country. His apartment was perfectly clean and well presented."),
("2016-08-22", "7132426", "Donna", "Fantastic apartment in a great area. Close to good food & short distance from the city. Nice  clean apartment. Great communication. Really enjoyed our stay."),
("2016-08-27", "7132426", "Mike", "I didn't meet Paul as he was travelling at the ti me  but he was super helpful and responsive. I came in to Sydney off a 15 hour overnight flight  and Paul was generous enough to accommodate an early check-in so I could freshen up and drop my bags off before a day in the office. The place is perfectly located in the heart of the Cross  and well appointed inside."),
("2016-08-28", "7132426", "Karen", "Had a great stay in this clean and charming little place that is in the perfect location. A short walk to the city and Sydney Harbour ...surrounded by things to do and great places to eat/drink."),
("2016-09-01", "7132426", "Mike", "This is a clean  conveniently located apartment surrounded by an excellent selection of shops  bars  cafes and restaurants. It is just a few minutes walk from the train station (subway) and about a 20-minute walk from the CBD. The host  Paul  was very pro-active with email communications and very helpfully arranged for us to drop our bags off in the morning before the apartment had been cleaned  allowing us to spend the day in the city luggage-free. "),
("2016-09-09", "7132426", "Binna", "Paul's flat is located in Potts Point where there are many nice cozy  fancy shops nearby. Also walking distance to Opera House  Botanical Garden so it was nice to walk around. However  it is also close to Kings Cross station and it could be little dangerous at night. I saw many drug addicts on the street and felt insecure. I am not expecting 5 star hotel when choosing Airbnb but I would expect more when I am still paying quite amount for the service. My biggest concern was the bathroom  not about the size but level of hygiene in it. I could see black mould from ceiling and wall  shower curtain was small and it kept sticking onto me when taking a shower and bathroom drain was rusty. I originally booked 6 nights but was provided 3 towels and no extra. It could be nice if extra towels can be provided for longer term stay. It would be also nice if the cleaner can clean the flat more thoroughly. I still saw the hairs here and there on the floor (of course) and on the couch  not to mention underneath the bed  couch..Understand that there are bars  lounges nearby but the noises were quite disturbing as there were no proper soundproof. I was up until 2-3am for outside to be quiet enough so I could fully rest. Despite its great advantage of its location  I could not stand the bathroom and dusts in the house  I decided to move out on Sunday which basically I stayed for 2 nights only. This may be suitable for a single  couple  friends or family without child. "),
("2016-09-12", "7132426", "Jill", "Fantastic location with super easy access to public transport (we travelled via Kings Cross station every day). Communal areas on interior of building in need of brightening but sort of adds to the charm as is. Apt is small but comfortably accommodated 2 adults and our daughter on a blow up mattress and had everything we needed. Stairs are a but of a hike with heavy suitcases but nothing we haven't encountered frequently in our travels o/s. Paul and Mary (house cleaner) were very responsive to any communication and kindly accommodated us when we needed to checkin early and to store luggage before departure flight. Night crowd outside a little loud at times but it didnt stop us sleeping. Colourful and cool area - would definitely stay again.  (Recommend Beer & Dumplings for take away  pastry shop below for delicious treats  and weekend market for great healthy interesting food)"),
("2016-09-13", "7132426", "Julie", "The host canceled this reservation 143 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-09-17", "7132426", "Chris", "I have to say i am a little baffled at how positive the reviews are for the place we arrived at  and I completely agree with Binna's review below mine. I didn't see any 'drug addicts' around the apartment areas and the area has all the shops and takeaways you could need. We also felt safe in the area  and didn't run into any problems. However  On arrival  We were met by the cleaner who showed us to our apartment. The apartment itself is in a dilapidated building with marks  chips and wallpaper coming off which obviously isn't advertised. It seriously needs renovating as it's in a bad state. For £550 over a week  and the fact that the cleaner had asked us to come back in 30 minutes when she had finished cleaning (after check in time)  the floor was still covered in dust which we found attached to the suitcases as we had to put them in the lounge area due to no room for them in the bedroom  and the couch is also pretty stained (also not in the pictures). I advise you to not look under the couch... as it needs a clean before anyone does... and finally the bathroom is covered in Mould (also not in the pictures). Bath also needs a good clean  as neither myself or my parter were interested in one. Could also do with sorting out the rusty drains in the bathroom too.You will also need to bring earplugs as an essential item  it took us 3 nights to get an 'ok' sleep due to the noise  over the weekdays too as the walls are paper thin. We live on a busy main road at home  but I can't emphasis enough that the road outside the apartment is seriously loud  don't underestimate it as it does sound like you are outside. I had to buy -85 decibel silicon earplugs for my partner just so she could sleep.The guide to the area was good and the amenities were too  except for the towels  as we were given 2 towels between the 2 of us for a week's stay. The shower was powerful enough and didn't run out of hot water which was great. I also contacted Paul and asked about the internet issue on arrival  as the wifi is particularly slow. I understand Australia doesn't have the greatest network  but 2mbps isn't usable  so bring a 4G data package with you for your mobile. I understand that I could of emailed Paul and complained about the bathroom  towels  noise  internet  cleanliness  etc.. But I have never had to do this before or do I really feel I should need to. Previous places I have stayed have been great with air bnb  but there is a difference when unsatisfied and paying £550 for a week for the above. Believe me  I am usually pretty chilled out with accommodations  but this one really needs a thorough clean and some sound proofing."),
("2016-09-19", "7132426", "Laila", "A stylish and comfortable apartment in an excellent location for our two-night stay in Sydney. Paul was super-responsive  provided excellent restaurant recommendations (we tried three of them) and had we had more time we might have even made it the end of Macleay St without getting distracted by another cute coffee shop. Bed was excellent  as was shower. Be warned that if you are a light sleeper this is in an older building in a lively neighbourhood - so it was pretty noisy out there on Saturday night. Thanks Paul and Luke (and Wendy who let us in as the hosts were travelling themselves)."),
("2016-09-20", "7132426", "Loy", "Amazing place to stay if you are visiting Sydney  the location was amazing and easily accessible. The place was really clean and well taken care of. The host was really friendly and welcoming and attends to your needs"),
("2016-09-27", "7132426", "Maayan", "Stayed for 5 nights at Paul's  was very friendly from the beginning. Apartment is at a perfect location  close to the train station and a walking distance to Sydney's Botanic Gardens. Lots of shops and places to eat around aswell  a supermarket just a few minutes down the road was also comfortable. The apartment is at quite an old building but is kept up and clean. The climb to the second store with the luggage was a challenge but manageable. The place itself was perfect for us and had all the things we needed. Overall great value for money  perfect location and great communication."),
("2016-09-28", "7132426", "Stephanie", "This home in Potts Point was an amazing place to stay! It is especially close to the city and only a short walk to the Botanical Park! The apartment is very cute too and the main bedroom looks over the busy street of Darlinghurt and the public garden! It was additionally easy to get in contact with Paul and he always replied back to any questions I had super quickly! I'd definitely recommend this place to anyone wanting to experience Sydney and all its quirks!"),
("2016-10-01", "7132426", "Gwyn", "Quite simply  a perfect place to stay for a Sydney weekend getaway. A wonderful little apartment in a great location  close to everything. Would certainly be first choice if staying in Sydney again. "),
("2016-10-04", "7132426", "Brayden", "Perfect location for a short stay in Sydney - this apartment is within walking distance to everything important and 3mins walk from the Kings Cross Train Station. This apartment has all the amenities that you would expect. As mentioned in other posts  there is traffic noise  but we felt it was all part of the experience of staying in this area.  Thanks Paul!"),
("2016-10-15", "7132426", "Silvio", "Kleine gemütliche Wohnung in Sydney. Restaurants  Supermärkte  Bus- und Bahnstation sind in 5 Minuten zu Fuß zu erreichen. Wir haben uns in der Unterkunft sowie in der Umgebung sehr wohl und trotz Nähe zum Rotlichtviertel auch sicher gefühlt. Leider sind die Häuser in Australien nicht gut gedämmt  deshalb ist es im Schlafzimmer durch den Straßenverkehr auch sehr laut. Vielen Dank an Wendy für den netten Empfang."),
("2016-10-17", "7132426", "Fion", "It's good to stay at Paul's place."),
("2016-10-19", "7132426", "Edward", "A perfect place to stay while in Sydney. It was a cozy and comfortable spot to rest and see the sights. The listing was accurate to what we found and they were the best to work with when it comes to arrival. I would highly recommend staying here."),
("2016-10-24", "7132426", "Elise", "We loved staying at Paul's place! He was very responsive and it is obvious that a lot of thought and care has been put into making the apartment feel airy and liveable. The location could not be more central and we had two excellent dinners at some of the many restaurants in easy walking distance. Thanks again  Paul."),
("2016-10-29", "7132426", "Loraine", "Thanks for allowing us to drop our luggage early and begin our vacation. Bring earplugs if staying on the weekend as the bedroom window does nothing to muffle the street noise."),
("2016-11-12", "7132426", "Si Pui", "Paul's place in Potts Point was perfect for our two week stay in Sydney. Location wise it was spot on with the station just a couple of minutes away  buses on our doorstep and just walks away restaurants  coffee shops and more. Paul was an absolute pleasure to liaise with. He would respond so quickly  answering any questions we had. We can't thank him enough for letting us stay in his lovely apartment. If I had to choose one con  it would be the noise from the street below. We struggled with it one night out of our 12 so it wasn't too bad for us but if you're a lightsleeper  you may need earplugs. "),
("2016-11-18", "7132426", "Robert", "Really great location and Paul was very helpful throughout our trip. As mentioned in other quite noisy out front so bring earplugs"),
("2016-11-22", "7132426", "Joel", "Great apartment.  Great location.  I would highly recommend staying here."),
("2016-11-24", "7132426", "Rosie", "Paul's place is super close to the train station and easily accessible to uber and taxi pick ups. Parking is a struggle so wouldn't recommend taking your car. It's a cozy place perfect for 2. Nice small kitchen to prepare meals. Dining table  lounge and study spaces available. Noisy street with trucks at times so may not be good for couples with children or light sleepers. Overall we rated this place very highly! Service was professional and so helpful. Thanks Paul for a great weekend "),
("2016-11-28", "7132426", "Maria", "Paul's apartment was in a great location  short walk to train station and surrounded by many shops and cafes. Communication was great and the space was well equipped for our stay  thankyou! "),
("2016-12-04", "7132426", "Sophie", "We absolutely loved our stay at Paul's place. Great location opposite the park and weekend markets. Delicious pizza joint called Pizza Boccone around the corner. We found it within walking distance of most places  or ease of access to public transport. Very clean and well presented apartment. Building is older but has character. Thanks again Paul for being a great host and for the ease of communication and check-in process."),
("2016-12-07", "7132426", "Naoka", "Luke and Paul's lovery apartment felt like a home away from home  making our stay warmly welcomed.  A comfortable bed to sleep on  a view of rush green  a smell of freshly baked goodies  a sound of vital city (Website hidden by Airbnb) was all so perfect:). We would love to return again!  "),
("2016-12-10", "7132426", "Terry", "Paul's place is right in the heart of the action in Potts Point  just down the road from King's Cross. It's a great central location for exploring inner Sydney. Communication was great and checkin was easy. While it's technically one bedroom  our four year old was very happy on a mattress in the study nook which has its own door and effectively becomes a small second bedroom."),
("2016-12-19", "7132426", "Keira", "Paul was an amazing host! He was so easy to communicate with and super accommodating  one of the best hosts I've ever come across. The place is super cute and in a perfect location"),
("2016-12-21", "7132426", "Charlotte", "Paul was fantastic to deal with and got back to us really quickly with our queries. The apart. is in such a central location- walking distance to beautiful Rushcutters Bay and only 10 min (dependant on traffic) to Circular Quay ferry terminal. And fabulous eateries literally on your doorstep."),
("2016-12-26", "7132426", "Anne", "Appartement très bien situé et bien agencé. Accueil attentionné. Chambre sur rue bruyante Globalement très bon séjour"),
("2016-12-30", "7132426", "Nacho", "Nice place to be in Sidney"),
("2017-01-06", "7132426", "Aika", "Great and convenient place to stay! Highly recommend the location :)"),
("2017-01-08", "7132426", "Stephanie", "The place was perfect for what we needed! Close to spots to go out  we walked to the botanic gardens and the opera house  and an overall lovely stay. Communication ahead of time was timely and check is was a breeze. Thanks again!"),
("2017-01-13", "7132426", "Rodrigo", "Muy buen alojamiento  cumple con todo lo que se necesita para una buena estadía en Sydney e inmejorable ubicación."),
("2017-01-17", "7132426", "Florian", "Nice and clean apartment  tastefully furnished in a very lively and interesting neighbourhood  and easy to reach with public transportation. Paul was an excellent and helpful host - very quick with communication when we needed it. Due to a delayed flight we had to check-in 15 hours later than planned  and Paul still made it possible  that was a real life saver - thank you  Paul! The bedroom window is not too far away from the street  so guests should not be too sensitive about acoustics from traffic driving by - but no problem with the crowd from Kings Cross which keeps a block away around the corner."),
("2017-02-02", "7132426", "Alice", "Great  stylish appartment in Kings Cross. Paul was really great with communication and his cleaner Wendy was very attentive. Definitely recommend but probably best for couples"),
("2017-02-18", "7132426", "Mariana", "Un departamento hermoso  tiene todo para pasar unas buenas vacaciones. La ubicación es muy buena ya que está a metros del metro. Súper recomendable  pasamos unos días soñados en sydney ."),
("2017-02-27", "7132426", "Andrés", "Great. Beautiful apartment at a second floor (no elevator) in a excellent location  near a train station and in a zone full of places to go.Paul was great responding very quickly our questions. No complains  we would stay there again."),
("2017-03-07", "7132426", "Marvin", "Paul's place was great and very clean. Their help was highly appreciated. We would recommend their place to anyone visiting the area!"),
("2017-03-09", "7132426", "Lynn", "Wonderfully done  great place to stay and waking up to the smell of fresh pastries from the French Patisserie."),
("2017-03-11", "7132426", "Martina", "Very nice apartment  close to everything. Would stay here again"),
("2017-03-20", "7132426", "Manish", "Paul's place is well designed  cosy and in an excellent location.  We would stay here again"),
("2017-03-22", "7132426", "Colleen", "perfect and awesome place"),
("2017-04-01", "7132426", "Katrina", "Luke and Paul's place was perfect for my mum who was visiting from Queensland. It's location is amazing  right in the heart for foodie heaven Potts Point with easy access to transport (at the front door) and all the goodies that this inner city suburb has to offer. The apartment was clean  cosy and well stocked. We'd highly recommend this awesome place for anyone visiting Sydney."),
("2017-04-05", "7132426", "Kyle", "A cozy place in an old building located in a transitioning neighbourhood. Lots of new hip food and drink venues. Excellent communication and flexibility of hosts. A nice touch point to roam the city from."),
("2017-04-07", "7132426", "Diane", "We loved the Potts Point neighborhood and this apartment. Perfect for the two of us  and my niece stayed with us one night so the air mattress and extra bedding was perfect for her. Hot water shower. Foodie area  with visits to the bakery  coffee shop a few doors down  and Saturday farmers market right across the street. Buses and cabs are right in front  convenience store across the street. Hosts were out of town but extremely responsive  and Wendy who cares for the apartment was fantastic - friendly  prompt  and flexible. We would visit again and recommend!"),
("2017-04-09", "7132426", "Martin", "Great little apartment. Super convenient."),
("2017-04-14", "7132426", "Anastasia", "Impressive apartment that is very conveniently located. Royal gardens  Opera house and CBD might be easily reached on foot (30 minutes to Opera House) and by public transport (Kings Cross train station is  very close to the apt). The hosts are friendly and accomodating  they arranged a very convenient arrival for us  though it was quite early in the morning. Another thing to mention is that we were charmed by the musician living in one of the nearby apartments  whose playing added to the awesome atmosphere of the place. Still  if you are a light sleeper  you need to consider the fact that you can hear things through the walls. P.S. The croissants in the patisserie near the entrance to the house are delicious!"),
("2017-04-17", "7132426", "Christal", "It was all good  very easy access. Thank you!"),
("2017-04-21", "7132426", "Christopher", "Great location. Great market across the street on the weekends  with lots of great food and drinks. Would highly recommend"),
("2017-04-24", "7132426", "Ann", "A great place to experience Potts Point. The flat was. comfortable and stylish. A great restaurant to one side of the front and a patisserie to the other. The bedroom looks out into the tree canopy. Noise no great problem."),
("2017-04-28", "7132426", "Abbey", "We loved staying here! Perfect location + the flat was a great for a girls weekend away. The host Paul was very good with communication and there was lots of information about what to do in Sydney which was super helpful. The cleaner/host Wendy who checked us in was lovely & both her and Paul were wonderful about a later check in time due to a late flight. The flat itself is great. Thank you!"),
("2017-05-02", "7132426", "Sonam", "Great location. But the cleansiness was absolutely not up to par."),
("2017-05-05", "7132426", "Rebecca", "We had a great stay in Paul's place. It's in a very convenient location for exploring the city and surroundings. The road directly outside the building is quite busy. If you are a light sleeper this might not be the best option for you  but we were mostly undisturbed. Paul was easy to communicate with and was flexible about check in  which I appreciated. I would recommend Paul's place to others who want a convenient base for exploring Sydney. "),
("2017-05-13", "7132426", "Christophe", "Excellent location"),
("2017-05-21", "7132426", "Sharon", "Awesome place and easy access to everywhere"),
("2017-05-24", "7132426", "Farah", "The apart so clean  and no charge if you add person. Because we carry big luggage  we have a trouble to make that luggage to the apart  but we love the apart. Thanks paul and wendy for your support  "),
("2017-05-29", "7132426", "Amanda", "Great place  ideal location for exploring Sydney. Excellent saturday market and local coffee shop. Plenty of choice for restaurants and cafes. We were lucky enough to be in Sydney for Vivid festival which was amazing. The building corridors etc could do with a spruce up and the apartment wasn't as clean as it could be but nothing major. One slight gripe was we were hoping that the spare bed would be a single blow up not a double as it would have fitted in the little dressing room and given that guest a bit of privacy and we did have to move some furniture to place the air bed in an area where we wouldn't trip over it when getting up in the night. Overall really pleased with our choice  thank you Paul. Communication and check in was very smooth "),
("2017-06-01", "7132426", "Nathan Stephen", "The previous reviews this location are mostly accurate but we did want to point out a few details. Pros: The location of the apartment is excellent. Easy access to the train  taxis  as well as the ability to walk to just about anywhere in town. We had a lovely stroll from the apartment to the Sydney Bridge  Darling Harbour  and Circular Quay. There are many local restaurants and pubs to visit  we did not go hungry! The house manual has many wonderful suggestions. Cons: We recognize that these may be exclusive to our experience only. While communication with Paul and Luke was great  we did have some hiccups. As international travelers  we had been using WiFi wherever available so as to not incur any additional charges. We set up a time for Wendy (the housekeeper)  to meet us to drop off the key. We waited 20 minutes until having to turn on our phones to try to sort out where Wendy was. After texting Wendy 3 times  she responded that she had left he key with a local business owner. It was frustrating that the plan had changed  that we weren’t notified immediately  and that we had to find this out after having to incur international phone charges. The apartment itself is as advertised. Cozy  lovely style  mostly well maintained. The double bed is a bit lumpy for our taste. The washroom/toilet is a bit dated  and could use a deep clean. The tub is rounded at the bottom so you could never stand with flat feet  it was quite slippery. While the tub is large  note that the shower is rather small and the shower head does not move. You are restricted to a small  rather tight area  as the shower curtain only encloses a small circular space around the shower head. Neither of us could close the curtain fully around us. The water pressure and hot water is outstanding. As pointed out  the street in which the apartment is located is quite noisy with bright street lights gleaming in that the blinds don’t fully block out  so lite sleepers beware  but that is a part of the city experience. Also note that the building is older. The entrance way is dark and has a musty smell. There were plenty of stairs to walk up  so if you have heavy luggage  beware. Online  the check-out time states 10am  though the manual at the apartment states 11am. Having thought the checkout time was at 11am  we were finishing packing and showering when Wendy  knocked at a bit past 10am. She was extremely abrupt  to the point of being rude. She insisted that the check out time was 10am  and suggested twice that we should have ‘checked our email’. She also brought a tradesman with her and was wanting to come in with him to start cleaning. I told her that my husband was in the shower and I did not feel comfortable having her and another person inside the apartment..."),
("2017-06-05", "7132426", "예리", "한국 게스트들에게 꼭 도움이 되었으면 합니다! 우선 인테리어 부분은 사진과 동일하였으나 곳곳에 거미줄  다른사람의 머리카락 등 청결부분에 문제가 있었습니다 ㅜ 라면을 먹고싶어서 주전자를 사용하려 했는데 물때가 심각하여 결국 포기했고 창문을 닫고 자려고 손잡이를 잡았더니 부러지더라구요; 전 다시 시드니 간다면 절대 이용 안할겁니다"),
("2017-06-09", "7132426", "Gustavo", "Great location in a very old building. The apartment has been renovated but has some problems... The building itself is very old and not nice. And the shower is a bit disappointing... Overall a good stay."),
("2017-06-12", "7132426", "Caleb", "This little apartment is lovey inside  though the building it's in is a little creepy. Everything went smoothly  although this apartment is right on a busy street with many loud cars and people passing by at night. Other than that though  this is in a prime spot. Literally right in front of a BigBug tour stop if that's your thing."),
("2017-06-17", "7132426", "Zara", "The area is more suitable for a group of friends and light travelers as you will have to climb two flight of stairs to the second floor.  The area is quite unique where you have a nice weekend market just opposite at the Fitzroy garden  supermarkets within walkable distance and a fantastic Japanese restaurant just downstairs the accommodation. The noise wasn't that bad but the bed is not for someone who is looking for good quality sleep. Wendy responses quick to my enquiries :) "),
("2017-07-01", "7132426", "Daniel", "Paul was an excellent host who communicated well with us. Unfortunately he is not based in Australia and his local contact Wendy  the cleaner  was unhelpful and caused us to lose the first day of our holiday. The lock on the front door broke on the first afternoon and she originally said she couldn't get someone until after 6pm the following day. Thus we had to babysit the flat all afternoon and evening as we couldn't lock the door. We eventually got in contact with Paul who agreed to call an emergency locksmith. The locksmith didn't arrive until around 7.30pm  and it took until almost 8pm to fix the problem which Wendy was alerted to before 1.30pm. Additionally  Wendy agreed to watch the flat for us when the problem first occurred so we could get lunch. We picked up takeaway so as to return quickly but found her walking down the street two blocks away on our way back. The flat had been left unattended  unlocked  and with the door slightly ajar. This was completely unacceptable after having promised to stay and watch our belongings and Paul's flat. Overall  the apartment was decent. It is in an excellent location with just a 30 minute walk to the Opera House through the beautiful botanic gardens  and lots of cool cafes and restaurants on the street and nearby. The apartment has the potential to be great however it is not currently being maintained adequately  with some broken window locks  burnt out lights  and mould in the shower. Having had a bad experience with Wendy we did not contact her again during our stay and instead put up with these issues. Again  Paul was very helpful and did everything he could to help us. We did love staying in the area and would do so again  and hope that Paul is able to get a better cleaner/local contact in the future. "),
("2017-07-07", "7132426", "Debbie", "Handy location for travelling the city. Paul was efficient with communication and always willing to help solve the problem! Good stay!"),
("2017-07-12", "7132426", "Carina", "The place is lovely and really closed to the public transport through which you can go to most of the attractions."),
("2017-07-14", "7132426", "Hanwei", "Paul's apartment is really a cozy nice place and located at an ideal area where is just 5 mins walking from Kings Cross station. I stayed 2 nights with my parents  the house keeper Wendy is nice and easy to communicate. For deep sleepers  it's not noisy at all. The only thing is I saw a cockroach in the smaller room and killed it. Overall is quite nice!"),
("2017-07-16", "7132426", "Chris", "Great property and a great host"),
("2017-07-24", "7132426", "Daniel", "Very Nice location and apartment. Great base location to visit sydney from  but plenty of amazing food and other things to visit nearby.Pauls knowledge of the area shows through the area guidebook that was amazing for introducing us to the good food and other sights of the area"),
("2017-07-30", "7132426", "Jay", "The place was perfect! It is centrally located and a short walk to the park to the opera house and the bridge."),
("2017-08-02", "7132426", "Paola", "Excellent location!! I will definitely come back!"),
("2017-08-12", "7132426", "Jay", "Thanks for a great stay. We had a really great time and it was so convenient for walking around Sydney or getting the metro about.  Loved the appt - we cooked a few times which was great."),
("2017-08-16", "7132426", "Kirsty", "Nice apartment  good location close to kings cross tube station. Good wifi. Excellent Japanese restaurant just down stairs. Flexible with check in time and good communication. Thanks Paul!"),
("2017-08-18", "7132426", "Xiaoyan", "很棒的公寓 去哪里都很方便｡房东很热心｡"),
("2017-08-21", "7132426", "Karen", "Location is good. Very close to King Cross station. Host very responsive. A lot of restaurants nearby. Bedroom is facing the road though and might be a little too noisy at night. Not for light sleepers. But overall a very good and comfortable stay."),
("2017-08-24", "7132426", "Mudassar", "Great location - 3 mins walk to King Cross station and $10-15 uber to anywhere in the city. Lots of fast food options - Mcdonalds  Oporto  Coffee Places  Great Croissant shop just below  Halal options etcKitchen has all the necessary cutlery and appliances Apartment is clean and cozyCommunication was fast and easy."),
("2017-09-01", "7132426", "Oliver", "Paul's place is as good as how he described it. The unit is in a very good location. We were able to walk around the neighbourhood as well as commute to other parts of Sydney by bus or train with ease. It was an added bonus that when we requested Paul if we could have another heater (there were 3 of us) since one was not enough for both the bedroom and living room  he readily provided. Though we were out most of the time  we appreciated the fact that Paul's unit is a very beautiful and well-appointed one. It was nice going back to the unit after a long day of going out and seeing the sights. We highly recommend this place to anyone travelling to Sydney. Lastly  although Paul was away on a trip  he was very accommodating in terms of communicating with us during our stay and it certainly made it easier for us to get settled in and get the most of our stay in Sydney."),
("2017-09-06", "7132426", "Emma", "Had a great stay in Paul's apartment. It was perfect for our stay and in a great location. Excellent value  will recommend to anyone coming to Sydney"),
("2017-09-08", "7132426", "Holly", "Was a lovely place  cosy and very comfortable.  There are lots of stairs  but it's good exercise  overall would stay again"),
("2017-09-10", "7132426", "Anneke", "Fantastic apartment  perfectly positioned. Loved kings cross and the great market on the weekend across the road."),
("2017-09-15", "7132426", "Nicolle", "Very cute  but small place.  Paul was very quick to respond when i had a question.  Keep in mind that you must climb 2 sets of stairs to get to the apartment and the shower was very tiny.  It was still comfortable and i loved the bakery downstairs."),
("2017-09-23", "7132426", "Holly", "Paul's place overall was great. It was located in a great place with enough privacy. It was just enough room for the 3 of us. The only thing I can say we weren't the happiest about was that we were using the blow up mattress and there were two fitted sheets (single) that didn't fit the queen single."),
("2017-09-30", "7132426", "Becca", "Great location of this art deco apt building close to transit trains and buses patisserie market on Saturday right across the street But there was an odour and dirty in the foyer and stairwell of the common areas of the building While we were there the apt had 3 cockroaches and there was a sign to say the exterminators were scheduled for the building The apt towels and linens were great And the apt was clean and tidy except for dust in the corners A small fridge but very functional Thanks Luke and Paul we enjoyed many evenings at your well situated apt"),
("2017-10-03", "7132426", "Jasmine", "Communication with Paul was great. He was very flexible with check-in/out. We arrived late in the night and was checked in by Wendy. Communication with Wendy was great too. She is responsive and friendly. Location of the apartment is fantastic - 5 minutes walk to King Cross station  30 minutes walk to the Royal Botanic Gardens and lots of food option around the apartment. The only issue we had was the cleanliness of the apartment."),
("2017-10-09", "7132426", "Debbie", "A really good spot  close to Potts Point nightlife with excellent transport links to the rest of Sydney. Well furnished with a nice kitchen too."),
("2017-10-13", "7132426", "Tegan", "Great location with plenty of cafes and public transport within walking distance. Apartment was clean and had everything we needed for a 2 night stay. Paul was a pleasure to deal with and checkin was very simple. Thoroughly enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-10-20", "7132426", "Clare", "Easy checkin  and great communication from Paul.   Cute apartment in a great location.  Only letdown was the place needed a solid clean."),
("2017-10-23", "7132426", "Claire", "Nicely styled apartment in a central location for our activities. Enjoyed the leafy views from the bedroom window and weekend markets over the road. Excellent communication. Thanks for having us!"),
("2017-10-26", "7132426", "Peter", "My friends and I had a lovely mid-week trip up to Sydney in Paul's apartment. It was so conveniently located to the rest of Sydney and easy to get to from the train station. The apartment had so much charm and everything you needed. The communication was excellent and I had a wonderful time. I will definitely be staying here again when I return  would definitely recommend!"),
("2017-10-28", "7132426", "Rolf", "Wir waren für 3 Nächte in Pauls Apartment und sie war perfekt für uns  um die Stadt zu erkunden."),
("2017-11-13", "7132426", "Tom", "Really nice stay  the apartment is close to everything that you'll need and Paul is more than willing to help."),
("2017-11-17", "7132426", "Jessica", "We’ve enjoyed our stay at Paul’s place. Wendy has been great too and we had no problem checking into the apartment. The location is good and within short walking distance to Kings Cross station  and there are plenty of nearby eateries as well. Highly recommended."),
("2017-11-20", "7132426", "Eva", "We stayed at Paul’s place for 3 nights. The location is great  a 20-minute walk from the opera  surrounded by shops and restaurants. The flat was clean and very pleasant to stay in. I would totally highly recommend it for a stay in Sydney !"),
("2017-11-23", "7132426", "Allison", "Paul’s space was cute  and the location could not have been more perfect. I was able to take the train(very safe and clean) to and from the airport and towards Bondi Junction. The walk to the harbor takes 20-30 minutes through the Botanical Gardens and was one of my favorite parts of the stay. Potts Point also has some lovely restaurants that I wish I was able to explore. Paul is so responsive and has some great advice for visitors to the area. Just one little watch out—don’t pack too much since there are two flights of stairs to climb."),
("2017-11-29", "7132426", "Roger", "apartment styling enpointe for the building era and area very welcoming and relaxing feel whilst in the centre of the city thank you"),
("2017-11-30", "7132426", "Gina", "Great stay!"),
("2017-12-04", "7132426", "Jessica", "We loved staying here for the weekend! Something to note  the apartment doesn’t have AC and there is only one fan so it can get quite hot in the rooms. The location was just close enough to easily get to and from all the Sydney hotspots!"),
("2017-12-07", "7132426", "Roger", "Fantastic location  efficient communication  lovely leafy outlook over Fitzroy square  many eating  supermarket options nearby and public transport availability was very good. Good ventilation cross flow negated the need for the provided fan  bed comfortable and high quality linen and towels. Basic necessities all provided  great wi-fi  hot water good and amazing collection of books. A really enjoyable Air BnB experience."),
("2017-12-09", "7132426", "Amelia", "Nice little apartment very easy to get about. It felt a lot more like New York than Sydney.The Saturday market has fantastic food  it’s only across the road. Only downfall is it’s a touch loud. I’d bring earplugs (but I am from the country and are used to silence)"),
("2017-12-13", "7132426", "Lee", "Perfect comms amazing location. We'll be back for sure on are next trip over... What's more to say..!!"),
("2017-12-18", "7132426", "Clarisse", "Great location  nice and cozy flat. Perfect for 2 people  not really for 3."),
("2017-12-20", "7132426", "Rachelle", "The apartment is in an unbeatable location - close to the action and public transport. Communication with Paul was prompt and easy."),
("2017-12-27", "7132426", "Ross", "Paul’s place in Potts Point is an excellent location. The restaurants around the area are excellent and it has perfect proximity to the Kings Cross Station. The only issue would be the road noise on the street. I would recommend the flat for a couple only as it is a bit small for more than two."),
("2018-01-07", "7132426", "Robert", "Great place to stay in Sydney at Kings Cross"),
("2018-01-14", "7132426", "Rebecca", "We loved our stay in Paul's apartment and found it a great base to explore the galleries of Sydney. The apartment is just as described and the neighbourhood is perfect if u enjoy great food and interesting people. We would definitely book in again!"),
("2018-01-19", "7132426", "Vicki", "It was very clean nice location and easy to find would recommend this place to anyone thank you"),
("2018-01-23", "7132426", "Alber And Yayi", "El apartamente de Paul es muy bonito y bien situado para conocer la ciudad.Quizás en mas fotografías se ve más cuidad y parece mucho más grande y luminoso. Estaba un poco descuidado  sobre todo a nivel limpieza profunda y comparándolo con las fotografías mostradas.El trato de Paul perfecto! Amable  atento y servicial."),
("2018-01-27", "7132426", "Chris", "Great little home nice  neat and cozy. Wendy the cleaner was an absolute gem! Thank you for letting us call your home ours for the 5days Paul! Cheers"),
("2018-01-29", "7132426", "Kiah", "This is a lovely space! Stylish  not too big or too small. We would even have had room for a 3rd visitor  if our plans had not changed. We could hear the fountain across the street flowing all night  which acted as white noise to help us sleep. The location is perfect  a short walk to the train station. If you're in the mood for a slightly longer walk  you could walk all the way to the Australian Museum  which is what my boyfriend & I did after a lovely breakfast at Marcelle (just next door). :)"),
("2018-02-01", "7132426", "Stephanie", "Central location right next to King’s Cross. Apartment has all the basics. Building was a bit more run down than expected which didn’t give the best first impression but the apartment itself is in better shape. Definitely quite noisy at night which was mentioned in the post so I would recommend bringing earplugs to sleep. Overall a good apartment considering the price."),
("2018-02-05", "7132426", "Carol", "Great location for access to all sorts of transport  eateries  coffee spots  etc. Though Macleay Street is busy  we found it was only a daytime phenomenon. Nice sleeping sat night in a comfy bed. Very pleased with our choice."),
("2018-02-09", "7132426", "Georgina", "great location. not family friendly. weird damp smell in the building. quite a number of flights of stairs. very small also"),
("2018-02-16", "7132426", "Mia", "The apartment is very close to the city  very convenient place  which also means quite noisy. Besides that  everything is fine."),
("2018-02-24", "7132426", "James", "Good communication from Paul before and during the visit. Apartment is cozy  comfortable and accurate to photos. Excellent neighborhood. Plenty to do and see nearby  and easy access to elsewhere in Sydney via nearby public transit or even a solid walk. Although  light sleepers should be aware that the bedroom faces a fairly busy street."),
("2018-03-04", "7132426", "Marj", "This is a great spot to stay  super centrally located with easy access to all you could need on holidays. Host Paul is great at communicating and keeping in touch  and we would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-03-06", "7132426", "Marlin", "Great location and so close to train station. Paul left a folder full of useful and helpful information. We love the cafe and patisserie downstairs. Everything was so conveniently located and my toddler enjoyed her stay there!"),
("2018-03-07", "7132426", "Tristan", "Great place in a very handy spot. Paul made things very easy in terms of checking in etc. I’d recommend this place to a friend."),
("2018-03-10", "7132426", "Ryno", "The apartment was nice however the main building is in need of some serious maintenance."),
("2018-03-15", "7132426", "David", "Great location  near to Rail station and with plenty of shops and cafes.    The shared area in the block is very dilapidated  but Paul’s apartment is stylish and well appointed.   Arrangements for arrival were perfect.   Yes  the road is a little noisy  but it didn’t stop me sleeping.   The flat had everything I needed for a week in Sydney.  Thank you."),
("2018-03-18", "7132426", "Erica", "We had an amazing stay at Paul’s place in Potts Point. The apartment was centrally located  and overlooked a beautiful pot with a fountain. The best part about this place is we were able to walk almost everywhere we wanted to go  and Kings Cross station was so very close for our farther exploration trips.  Paul’s place had everything we needed for our stay  and more  including a small desk work space! Everything was just as pictured. The full kitchen had everything we could ask for  and we were able to save a few dollars by cooking in - although the nearby amazing restaurants and cafes definitely drew us in!!! As some others mentioned  the street is a bit noisy  but it honestly did not affect our sleep at all! We were comfortable and thankful for such a beautiful recharging spot before our days exploring Sydney. Thank you  Paul!"),
("2018-03-20", "7132426", "Jonathan", "Perfect location and nice character to the building.  We stayed for 2 days in Sydney and the apartment was a great base to go out and explore Potts point and the rest of the city"),
("2018-03-30", "7132426", "Dianne", "Comfortable apartment with a good location :)"),
("2018-04-04", "7132426", "Paul", "Clean trendy apartment  great location with amazing local tips on local eateries and attractions. Hosts are very quick to respond and more than accommodating."),
("2018-04-06", "7132426", "Caroline", "Incredible location  cute little unit. Perfect for our needs for the evening and a close walk to the best restaurants. Waking up to see the markets across the road was a highlight. Be warned though  the mattress is a double only so if there are two you’ll be close!"),
("2018-04-12", "7132426", "Will", "We had a lovely stay. Apartment is modern and tastefully decorated  and in a secure locked building. The hosts supplied plenty of bedding  linen and kitchen supplies  even a little inflated bed for our child. The location is very convenient  a short stroll to the water  close to the train station  with many high quality cafes and restaurants and supermarkets close by- we even walked into Sydney one sunny day. I see others have commented on the street noise  we only found this noticeable on weekend nights but it was not such an issue. The hosts provided a booklet on the local area. Thank again such a great stay!"),
("2018-04-15", "7132426", "Sammie", "I would highly reccomended this place. Prime location  cute cosy apartment  nice and clean and very affordable . The hosts are soo helpful and get back to you very promptly.  The cleaning lady is lovley and does a excellent job. Sheil make you feel very welcome. I would highly reccomended this place to stay whilst your time in Sydney. Close to everything.  I would stay here again 100%"),
("2018-04-20", "7132426", "Mandy", "There are pros and cons but everything about the apartment is written clearly so it's up to you to decide  no regrets about it."),
("2018-04-22", "7132426", "Cat", "Fabulous host  great loacation  smaller and much older than appears in photos but otherwise fantastic!"),
("2018-04-24", "7132426", "Nina", "Location is phenomenal  tons of cute restaurants  things to do and close to the train station! Paul and Susan were very nice and accommodating  we got in late (10pm) and they accommodated a late checkout request as well. The building is a bit old and shabby  but the unit itself is done well. Lots of dust (if you're allergic like me)  hair on the floors/rug and the shower is a bit small.  Great for a quick stay when your primary concern is location!"),
("2018-04-28", "7132426", "Adam", "The host canceled this reservation 13 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-05-10", "7132426", "Meryl", "Really loved the place  warm and cosy and close to king cross station. Great place for a few days in Sydney! Value for money in the CBD area.:)"),
("2018-05-18", "7132426", "Jie Xi", "Apartment was as described  good location within easy walking distance to kings cross station. Also  heard about how the Kings cross area is supposedly a red light district  but the whole area really wasn’t as shady as how people generally made it out to be online. And while the building may seem a little dodgy when you first enter  the apartment itself was stylishly decorated and comfortable. Great value and stay for me!"),
("2018-05-21", "7132426", "Sharon", "This cozy apartment is conveniently located near the train (Kings Cross Station) and the weekend market in the park. WiFi is strong and lots of hangers! Nice to have travel books and maps available also. Excellent and a good price."),
("2018-05-27", "7132426", "Georgina", "Amazing find on airbnb! Close to public transport  food  woolworths  a few bars! Perfect size for two people and the apartment was very neat with a stylish touch! I loved every bit about staying in this apartment!! Thankyou :)"),
("2018-06-02", "7132426", "Corttni", "Very cute apartment that’s extremely close to an array of shops and transit. A great place to stay while visiting Sydney!"),
("2018-06-15", "7132426", "Ashleigh", "Great place to stay and Paul is amazing to communicate with."),
("2018-06-16", "7132426", "Dani", "A fab little apartment in the heart of everything - definitely can’t fault the location!"),
("2018-06-30", "7132426", "Marlo", "Location is incredible and the apartment is cosy but well laid out. Bed is super comfortable and on a Saturday you can cross the road for the markets and listen to some live music with a coffee. Nothing I wouldn't recommend about this place!"),
("2018-07-06", "7132426", "Asanka", "Fantastic place to stay  great location and very close to Kings Cross station."),
("2018-07-08", "7132426", "Christopher", "Essentially its Kings Cross  a suburb that bears no resemblance to the one of my youth. Paul & Lukes apartment is centrally located in a inner suburb that is blessed by trees  exceptional Thai Takeaway and great restaurants. Walking is a breeze. Close to the city. Probably not a great place for light sleepers  with Macleay Street never sleeps. A great classic 1930’s period apartment in character filled neighbourhood"),
("2018-07-13", "7132426", "Elise", "Cozy apartment in a great location - thanks Paul for hosting me"),
("2018-07-14", "7132426", "Daniel", "Great apartment! Paul is a great host  super easy to communicate with and easy going. Would recommend for anyone looking for a great stay in the heart of Sydney"),
("2018-07-15", "7132426", "Terri", "Beautiful little apartment  well kept and exactly what you need without being too much! Location is prime  Paul and Luke have gone out of their way to ensure travellers are equipped with all the information they might need to experience Sydney."),
("2018-07-22", "7132426", "Sarah", "Great location  central to many great places  restaurants and suburbs. Cozy and comfy apartment. Clean and many amenities provided. Great service from Paul and the cleaner  very kind and polite. Can get a bit loud at night from the street and the lobby has a funny smell but those things kind of grow on you. Paul’s apartment is a nice little place to come back to after a night out!"),
("2018-07-25", "7132426", "Paul", "The location is awesome  very close to the subway station.There is also a convenient store across the street  a super market a block away  where you can buy some groceries ! Even more  the ice-cream shop and the pie shop beside the apartment serve excellent food!The last but not least thanks for the warm welcome from Susan!"),
("2018-07-28", "7132426", "Yuka", "Thank you for reply quickly.l enjoyed art and fashion book:)Very nice place."),
("2018-07-30", "7132426", "Natalie", "Our stay at Paul’s place was really great. The location is great to spend time in Darlinghurst or near Circular Quay  and still amazing if you don’t mind a bit of a walk to Darling Harbour and Barangaroo. His book of local recommendations was a life saver  and he was great with communication overall. The place is basic but stylish and contains everything you need."),
("2018-08-02", "7132426", "Nathalie", "The location is just perfect  very close to the old town  Sydney opera and botanic garden. Paul left in the flat some traveler books that are really useful :) The flat is all conform to the pictures. Arrival and departure very easy as no timetable."),
("2018-08-05", "7132426", "Sue", "Paul's apartment was totally fabulous.  From the tasteful deco decorating to the fantastic location. It was our cosy home for 4 nights and we loved it - we will be booking with you again no doubt about that ! Thank you"),
("2018-08-13", "7132426", "Deborah", "Centrally located and within walking distance of all the major attractions. Transport is close at hand if you wish to venture further afield."),
("2018-08-19", "7132426", "Chun Yin", "Stylish decor and good location but have to expect noise from streets during sleep especially weekend"),
("2018-08-25", "7132426", "Katherine", "We really enjoyed our stay at Paul’s apartment! The space is very clean with a comfortable bed - exactly what we needed after long days of sightseeing in Sydney. It was very easy to access public transportation from Paul’s place  but if you’re up for a walk  it’s not far from downtown. Potts Point is a fun neighborhood and we’re glad we stayed here. We highly recommend Paul’s place if you’re traveling through Sydney!"),
("2018-08-26", "7132426", "Chao", "Nice location  nice property  supermarket  local market  transport  restaurants  you name it. Very very nice and cozy stay  awesome detailing of the place  warm and welcoming. Hope to come back sometime soon!"),
("2018-09-03", "7132426", "Tyler", "Fantastic value for the money. A stylish spot in a nice area  close to many restaurants and cafes. A good spot for a solo Traveller."),
("2018-09-19", "7132426", "Angel", "What can I say.. This was our home for 2 weeks! The apartment is tastefully decorated  clean  spacious and had all the amenities we needed. It is the perfect space for two people. The location is ideal   in the hustle and bustle of Potts Point. Despite being a busy area we managed to slept through every night without any disruption (maybe we are deep sleepers). Everything we needed was in walking distance  including Kings Cross station which has fantastic links to all the key attractions Sydney has to offer.  To anyone looking at staying in Sydney  we highly recommend Paul's apartment!"),
("2018-09-26", "7132426", "Zoe", "This place was amazing! Such a central location  able to walk everywhere that was around the city. Paul was super nice and easy to message  also the little booklets in the apartment were helpful too!"),
("2018-09-29", "7132426", "Michael", "Great little place! Good spot to explore Sydney from. Paul’s communication was great  and he was very helpful. Would recommend!"),
("2018-10-13", "7132426", "Erika", "Easy to go anywhere in Sydney. Lots of resturants near."),
("2018-10-19", "7132426", "Flora", "A very cozy place at a convenient location. Host is very responsive and considerate. We were allowed to check in early and there are helpful tips and travel books in the apartment for guests that are here for sightseeing.The only thing we struggled a bit was the noise from the main road which could be challenging for light sleepers like myself.Overall we had a good stay and would like to thank Paul for hosting us."),
("2018-10-27", "7132426", "Daniel", "Simple apartment with everything you need."),
("2018-11-05", "7132426", "Mark", "Great location  nicely decorated. Very responsive host. Thank you Paul!"),
("2018-11-10", "7132426", "Laura", "Paul's place was absolutely fantastic! perfect for a few days exploring the city and so easy to get everywhere from. Was met by Susan their cleaner who was absolutely fantastic and so helpful!"),
("2018-11-10", "7132426", "Kate", "Great location   lovely place"),
("2018-11-14", "7132426", "Cole", "The location is absolutely incredible! We were able to walk to a number of coffee shops and eateries right below the apartment and hop on the train just two minutes away to get anywhere else! The apartment was exactly what we were hoping for as far as location! The apartment is old and it's in the (Website hidden by Airbnb) it's a bit dirty and loud at night! All in all  it was exactly what we were looking for  just didn't expect to be woken up so often throughout the night! :)"),
("2018-11-16", "7132426", "Brenda", "Really awesome location in the city and super convenient to get everywhere from (it’s minutes walk from Kings Cross Station). There was some noise from construction but as we were out all day it didn’t bother us. Would definitely recommend!"),
("2018-11-17", "7132426", "Mariah", "Neat spot with cute aesthetics."),
("2018-12-06", "7132426", "Roisin", "This apartment is perfectly located. We had such a great time and Paul is a wonderful host. We got quite attached to our little home away from home for the week we were there. Would definitely recommend and would definitely stay again."),
("2018-12-08", "7132426", "Tim", "Great location and weekend market in. park across the road is great on Saturdays"),
("2018-12-21", "7132426", "Dianne", "Always stay here when I am in Sydney. Fabulous location  very stylish apartment  fantastic host and everything you need for a very comfortable stay."),
("2018-12-24", "7132426", "Demetre", "This little apartment is really well situated. There are great coffee shops and restaurants within walking distance. It is also close to transport and the French café around the corner has some amazing pastries. You will need to bring ear plugs and a sleeping mask  as sometimes the light from the outside street light it quite bright. It is a really well laid out apartment with enough room for everything you need. We will be back."),
("2018-12-29", "7132426", "David", "Booked this apartment for friends  visiting from Paris.  Perfect location  clean apartment and great communication.  Highly recommended."),
("2018-12-31", "7132426", "Sophie", "Fantastic location. Great access to trains  supermarket and gorgeous cafes."),
("2019-01-03", "7132426", "Anna", "This is such a great place and ideally located in the ‘nicer’ part of the neighbourhood. I found it incredibly peaceful even with the hustle and bustle of the area and noise outside. This is helped by the bedroom view of the trees of the square opposite together with the sound of the water fountain. The place is easily accessible to lots of places and all the shops and restaurants nearby are classy and funky. I stayed in this area last time and this place is in a better location. The flat is cutely designed and a great size for a City break. I didn’t want to leave so soon! Great hosts. Friendly and helpful cleaner!"),
("2019-01-10", "7132426", "Andrew", "An extremely well located place. Has all that you need. It would be helped by having AC so front window could be closed to minimise night noise from bedroom. We did get used to it but disrupted sleep was still normal."),
("2019-01-18", "7132426", "Belinda", "I have to say it was tough to be in the apartment with only a small fan during this heat  but perhaps the apartment would be quite comfortable for guests during other seasons. Some areas of the apartment don’t match the current photos anymore  such as the bathroom and the living room. Unfortunately  we also had to deal with several cockroaches (live and dead) in the apartment during our one week stay here. That being said  I thank the host(s) for being accommodating with our late check in request for the first night. Also  the location of the apartment is great  with close walking distance to king’s cross station which can conveniently get you anywhere. Cute brunch spots on the next street. Thanks."),
("2019-01-22", "7132426", "Clotilde", "L'appartement est bien situé  dans une rue commerçante et proche du métro  à seulement 2 stations du centre. Il est propre et bien équipé."),
("2019-02-04", "7132426", "Elina", "Paul’s place is fantastic. The apartment is stylish and spacious  it has everything you need and the location is perfect. I always got a very fast reply if I had any questions and the check in and out times were flexible. The place was surprisingly cool without aircon even during the hot days. I really don’t have anything bad to say  we had a wonderful stay and would recommend it to everyone!"),
("2019-02-07", "7132426", "周", "The apartment is located in a great area that’s quite during the night but very convenient for us to explore Sydney. However  as we were three people we used the air mattress but it got flat quite easily and wasn’t so comfortable. Would highly recommend this apartment for two or single travelers!"),
("2019-02-18", "7132426", "Loren", "The absolute best location in Potts Point. Super convenient. Cute art deco building."),
("2019-02-21", "7132426", "Sheila", "If you’re visiting Sydney  Paul’s place is a wonderful place to still be a tourist and play a local at the same time. It’s situated in a great location - availability to food options  walking distance to the train which was so great and neighborhood feels so safe. It’s comfortable for two  maybe three if your other guest is not picky with the sleeping arrangements and Paul covers everything that you’d need. If not  their cleaner Susan is available to help you should you need. Everything that Paul notes in his description is extremely accurate so we appreciated that. We definitely enjoyed our stay and trust you will too!"),
("2019-03-05", "7132426", "Joseph", "We spent 10 days in this lovely space while at at Mardi Gras and could not have been happier.  Very short walk to hop on train  amazing neighborhood with great cafes  Saturday market in the park across the street on weekends.  12 minute walk to Oxford Street.  Loved it!"),
("2015-08-09", "7439246", "Mia", "Beautiful clean home and in an excellent spot. Host was very quick to respond and helpful. Would recommend this place."),
("2015-09-06", "7439246", "Ian", "The main reason I chose Nathan's place was the kids bedroom. When we arrived and saw it  it exceeded our expectations indeed. For those that are traveling with kids  the kids room in this apartment is any child's dream wonderland which made settling our little girl in all that much easier. The location of the beach (just across the road) made it all the more fun. For a small apartment  I was very impressed with how Nathan has maximised the space. The apartment has obviously been updated with quality appliances. It was my first time using an induction stove top - it was most impressive. The heated master bed was also a great luxury.Finally  it was all the little extras that Nathan provided that made it a memorable experience. We got a large box of chocolates  quality soap and well known brand name (eco and organic) hand wash and cleaning products.Nathan kept in contact throughout the week and even recommended local places for us to check out which was very helpful for us. Check out was also very convenient for us which was great considering we were traveling with a child."),
("2015-09-27", "7439246", "Danielle", "I felt very welcome by Nathan and we had a great weekend in the city. Very stylish and clean. Perfect for what we needed. Many thanks."),
("2015-10-04", "7439246", "Sanna", "Nathan's place was just what we were looking for. We stayed only two nights and alreday now would go there back. It was really like a home away home. We loved it. It was clean  cozy and everything just like told and even more. Our kids loved the kids room! April  who we met at arrival gave wetsuits and boards for our kids to borrow. Thank you also nice treats left for us. We could recommend the place everyone who likes to stay near beach in cozy relaxing place."),
("2015-10-19", "7439246", "Rachel", "Nathan's charming beach-style apartment was perfect for our family weekend get away. It had everything we needed  and Nathan even added little extra touches  like the chocolates and soaps. The bus stop  right out the front  was very convenient  allowing us access to all areas of Sydney. It was also wonderful to spend the day sightseeing  and come back to Maroubra beach to relax. A fantastic spot. Thank you again Nathan  for your hospitality."),
("2015-10-24", "7439246", "Melisse", "This was our first experience using Airbnb and Nathan set the bar extremely high for other hosts during our trip. My husband and I are visiting Australia from the U.S.  so after our 15 hour flight  Nathan so graciously offered us an earlier check-in time to freshen up and relax. Unfortunately  we didn't get to use the early check-in because 3 hours into our arrival in Sydney  we had an accident with a roundabout and a curb. Nathan was so thoughtful and checked in on us until we received a new rental car  and he was nice enough to leave us keys for when we arrived.  Nathan's home is beautiful and very comfortable. The bed was completely cozy and we slept well during our stay. The home is literally across the street from Maroubra  beach and you can enjoy the soft sand there while watching the surfers. It is also about a 0.5 mile beautiful scenic walk to Mahon Pool and an amazing cafe called Pool Cafe that has the best coffee and breakfast/lunch to start your mornings/days. At night we could walk to any of the restaurants and bars and felt very safe  and the locals were so friendly. Overall an incredible host  a beautiful home  and a wonderful area to enjoy your vacation."),
("2015-11-02", "7439246", "Chrissy", "This was our first time using Airbnb and we had a really positive experience.  Nathan was very quick to respond to our messages and was very easy to deal with.  We appreciated Nathan and April's recommendations  which were very helpful.  The apartment was exactly as described.  It has been set up really nicely and is light and airy  clean and comfortable.  The kids' room in particular is great.  The apartment is in a perfect location  being just across from the beach but still quiet at night.  We really enjoyed our stay here.  Highly recommended!     "),
("2015-11-18", "7439246", "Rachel", "This was our first time using airbnb and it was made so easy with the help of Nathan.  His responses were always so quick and helpful. This was an absolutely lovely property and was everything it said in the listing.  We felt so welcome in this home and thoroughly enjoyed our stay in Maroubra!"),
("2015-11-23", "7439246", "Lan", "The host canceled this reservation 4 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-01-02", "7439246", "Lizzie", "Nathan was a very helpful and considerate host. The flat is in a fantastic location  full of lovely things and very comfortable. He left us chocolates and some fancy soap which were nice touches. Local transport is really good and the beach is amazing."),
("2016-01-17", "7439246", "Sally", "As we were at Maroubra for a  surf competition. The location was perfect opposite the beach. Bus stop right out the front and a quick walk to shops & restaurants. The unit was clean  tidy & had everything we needed. Would definitely stay again. Nathan was very helpful. "),
("2016-01-24", "7439246", "Bree", "We absolutely loved staying here. Lovely unit  great for the kids and in the perfect position for where we needed to be  with everything we needed. Nathan is a wonderful host. Thank you for having us  we hope we can stay again one day."),
("2016-02-21", "7439246", "Shiva", "Totaly good and clean house. But notify   no car park  you should park your car in 4 hours limited street car park  no washing and drying machine  no view to ocean  it is located in ground level and back of the building.  Oh the important one  the door lock does NOT work well  every time you have to stay behind the door and struggle with key and lots of stress for little kids. Good points: lots of toys for kids  ocean sound at night  clean sheet and beautiful kangaroo skin on sitting room  candles. There was a laundry  with old broken washing machine that if you are expert in repairing and plumbing  you can use that area."),
("2016-03-25", "7439246", "Jacinta", "Was a great stay at this little beach pad. We had all we needed well located to the best end of the beach. Simple clean private access made it more like a beach house"),
("2016-04-21", "7439246", "Dakota", "I had an awesome stay at Nathan's home. He was very easy to work with and I'm happy I got to stay here"),
("2016-10-10", "7439246", "Sanna", "Thank you Nathan! We stayed the 2nd time in Nathan's home  this time the whole week and we just enjoyed. We came again  because last time/year we spent just two days and already then we falled in love with Maroubra. House location is perfect  busses leaves to Sydney just front of the house  it's next to the beach (the most important)  house itself is nice  cosy and beautiful  good coffee houses nearby - eveything just perfect!! No complains- nothing at all!! Thank you for letting us stay in your great place!  Cheers Sanna and familyPS. This time we saw  actually during various of days THE whales during our morning walks :)"),
("2017-01-01", "7439246", "Alberta", "It is obvious that the owner has put in much love and style into their apartment and we are fortunate to be able to share it at peak times of the holiday season. The location is so convenient with the beach right across the road."),
("2017-03-12", "7439246", "Chris", "This home is a hidden gem!! Directly across from the beautiful beach with great cafes and restaurant a few hundred meters away what more could you want. Nathan was a wonderful host and I wouldn't hesitate to highly recommend. Thanks for the great stay."),
("2017-07-16", "7439246", "Alexandre", "Great place! If you have kids  this is the place : The kids room is fantastic. "),
("2017-07-22", "7439246", "Tracey", "Great little apartment for a family to stay at. Convenient to everything! Beaches cafes and restaurants. Very cosy and clean. Parking was quite easy to get across the road. "),
("2017-10-02", "7439246", "Andrea", "Very convenient to Maroubra beach  easy walk to so many great cafes and restaurants. The hosts go the extra mile with hotel style toiletries   chocolates and tea.Very clean and comfortable.Very relaxing environment."),
("2017-10-08", "7439246", "Mandy", "The place is at great location and easily accessed. The host was friendly and helpful. It might be good to let the host know in advance if you have a fair bit of luggage so that they can empty out the robes and rooms. Otherwise everything is reasonable."),
("2018-01-01", "7439246", "Micheal", "Great location  nice apartment and good communication. Thanks for having us Nathan"),
("2018-01-19", "7439246", "Darren & Tracey", "Had a great stay at Nathan’s   great location   would stay again "),
("2018-01-26", "7439246", "Trudi", "Nathan’s place was awesome. Very clean and tidy  lots of homely touches  modern kitchen and across the road from the beach. Also great recommendations from Nathan of where to eat and get good coffee. It was ideal  for our family with two boys. If you want a great value beach holiday this is ideal. Our family will definately be back!!"),
("2018-02-03", "7439246", "Carlene", "Had a great stay .Close to beach and cafes.Nice (Website hidden by Airbnb) was really cute."),
("2018-02-25", "7439246", "Shana", "This apartment was in a fantastic location. You really could not get any closer to the beautiful beach. The bus system was also very easy with a convenient stop right outside of the apartment. Maroubra is such a cute little beach subarb that I’d love to visit again."),
("2018-04-20", "7439246", "Tracey", "The whole family loved our beach holiday at Nathans place - it is literally only steps away to the beach!  If you prefer ocean baths to the beach  these are only a short walk away as well. The apartment is not large  however it is very well set up to maximise the space available. Nathan was great to communicate with  and provided lots of suggestions about places to eat and things to see.  We loved El Tora Pizza and Tapa for dinner and Crazy Rays for a morning coffee.  Parking on the street was not difficult -  even on busy days it on took 5 minutes to find a spot.  We are looking forward to visiting again."),
("2018-06-02", "7439246", "Cathal", "We had a great stay at Nathan's place. Ideal location and good communication. Would happily stay again"),
("2018-07-18", "7439246", "Stephen", "A lovely little gem right by the sea"),
("2018-07-29", "7439246", "Jye", "A perfect place for our needs. Great location  perfectly clean and tidy and very stylish. Nathan was very accommodating  easy to communicate with   and reply’s were very prompt. Highly recommended "),
("2018-10-06", "7439246", "Jessica", "Nathan’s place is stunning; the perfect beachside getaway for a couple or young family to enjoy long-term or for a long weekend. We loved our stay and after two months we were very sad to leave what felt like home. Nathan and his wife and kids are simply lovely  kind people who didn’t hesitate to help us with any issues or queries. I’m still blown away that after messaging Nathan with news that the dryer had broken  he replied right away and we had a replacement THE NEXT DAY. Our baby son loved all the little hiding spots around the house. We were impressed with the style of the place  plus the HUGE amount of storage available. But our favourite part? The ocean is so close you can hear it from anywhere in the house. Thank you for a truly wonderful and memorable stay!"),
("2018-11-14", "7439246", "Alex", "Nathan and April are great hosts and their place is top notch. Beachfront with a bus stop that goes almost everywhere in Sydney is tough to find. If you love the beach and surfing this is the place to go!"),
("2018-12-10", "7439246", "Monica", "I had a fantastic stay at Nathan’s place  with my two nieces and brother in law. We only stayed a weekend  but it felt much longer in a good way  with morning and afternoon trips to the beach which is literally across the road  and buses outside the door into the city  the location could not be any more convenient. Nathan and April were also great hosts  very accommodating  fast to respond  and did everything they could to make our experience great. I would definitely recommend staying here to anyone looking for a beach holiday!"),
("2018-12-16", "7439246", "Judy", "Great place in excellent location. So close to the beautiful beach and bus stop right by the apartment made everything easy.There was a small issue  but the excellent communication of the owners contacted us straight away and sorted it out promptly.Thanks for the lovely stay."),
("2019-01-06", "7439246", "Amy", "Fantastic location!  We are half way through our 2 week stay and can’t wait to book again. Nathan & April are super hosts for a reason!  Beautiful Maroubra Beach is right across the street  saltwater pools are a 5 minute walk as are plenty of charming cafes. No need for a car  walk or use the bus that stops directly in front of the apartment.  Great for families & couples."),
("2019-01-20", "7439246", "Amy", "We cannot wait to return to this charming apartment!  Nathan and April go above and beyond as hosts.  Great location  easy public transport and excellent value. Amazing beach across the street  great for families and or couple retreat. Cafes galore  tics all the boxes for a great getaway."),
("2016-01-01", "7549277", "Jo", "We have just returned from our trip to Australia and our stay at Beacon Hill. From the moment we entered the property we knew we had found our home for 3 weeks. The house had been carefully prepared to make us feel that we were not intruding but feel at home. All spaces were organised clean and of a very high standard. Communication with Mari has always been fast and informative. Our stay in Mari and James home has been a pure pleasure and we are so happy that we had the opportunity to share in their home. We had full access to all the house which made our stay comfortable and relaxed. The outside space for entertaining was excellent and the beds  linen towels and use of washing machine  dishwasher etc made for a very comfortable sleep and stay. We have 2 teenage sons so the extra space the house gave was very important for our trip as were spending quality time with our sister who lives in the northern beaches.We were met by Mari 's mother who was so very welcoming and there was no problems at all during our stay. We would all recommend this home as a choice on AIRBNBWITH REGARDS JO AND PAUL STEVENS"),
("2019-01-01", "7549277", "Ash", "Mari's home is a lovely family home that is looked after very well.Location is great being such a short drive to various beaches  there's also bus stops a short walk away  as is the local shopping mall.The house itself has everything you need  beautiful well kept gardens  a brilliant sheltered BBQ space complete with ceiling fan and speakers to hook music up to  lovely kitchen area  modern bathroom and main ensuite  plenty of towels  aircon works well on hot summer days!Finally  Mari was very easy to deal with  quick to respond to messages and happy to help where she can. I do not have a single bad thing to say about this home and my family would gladly stay here again!"),
("2019-01-11", "7549277", "Tania", "What a wonderful stay at Mari's place! The house is so close to shops and beaches and there are great connections to the city from Warringah Mall. Only 30 mins to the city by bus if you don't have a car. The garden is beautiful with a lovely treetop view and cubbyhouse that was a hit with the kids. Mari was fast to respond to any questions we had during our stay. Thank you for providing everything we needed Mari  we appreciate you sharing your home with us."),
("2016-04-15", "7503081", "Katie", "The apartment was close to bondi junction shops and bondi beach. Only really suitable for two guests. The bed was comfy and there was plenty of storage for suitcases and clothes"),
("2016-05-11", "7503081", "Nachum", "We (myself and 2 of my young sons) stayed a week at George's. All good. Place was very clean and tidy when we arrived at around 9am. The place is small but sufficient for our needs  as we spent most of our time out-and-about. Great location  just a 2 minute walk to Bondi Road.If you rent a car then plan to spend 5 minutes looking for a parking place along Penkivil St  and perhaps walk a few hundred yards to the building. We had no problems parking in the building's driveway to load/unload luggage.I met George just once during the stay  when we locked ourselves out. He immediately responded to my message and I went to get spares from him. Worked out fine and we lost only the time it took me to drive to his work and back - around a half hour.All my communications with George were very quick. Everything he told us was true and I would recommend staying at his place. Enjoy!"),
("2015-08-16", "7667264", "Simon", "Unfortunately Isabella was not there so we never actually met  but the room was very cosy and the location beautiful  right in front of a picturesque park in Newtown and a very short walking distance to the main street with an almost endless choice of great bars  restaurants and cafes  would definitly stay here again :)"),
("2015-09-06", "7667264", "Hannah", "I had a lovely stay in Isabella's house. The room was beautifully set up and very  very comfortable. The facilities were easy to find and were clean. The location is perfect and the house is located on a gorgeous inner-city street across from a park. Unfortunately I was unable to meet Isabella  as I was out and about during much of my short stay  but she made it very easy for me to let myself in and find everything I needed. I felt very welcome and at home. "),
("2015-09-11", "7667264", "Karen", "Perfect if you enjoy your own company which I do.  Ideally situated for my shopping trip to Ikea.  Really comfy bed. Couple of minutes walk to King Street for shops  bars   restaurants.  On street parking was a bit of a mission later in the evening due to diners but earlier on its a breeze. "),
("2015-09-18", "7667264", "Georgia", "Isabella communicated very well and made the entry in her absence very easy. Housemates were more than lovely and hospitable. House itself is beautiful  clean and very central to newtown in a great area. Room was excellent. Had a great stay! Would definitely go back and recommend to others if available. Thanks!"),
("2015-10-07", "7667264", "Ben", "Nice place close to Kings street in Newtown.The house and the bedroom are really nice.Don't hesitate to spend time in this house.The house mates are really kind"),
("2015-11-01", "7667264", "Dee", "Isabella was so lovely from the point of booking and until my stay. Her response to my messages were prompt and thorough. Her instructions were detailed on where things are in the house and where nice eateries are around Newtown  I think this was very kind of her to do so. Isabella's house is in a very convenient location  and moreover her bedroom is an inspiration  so tidy and quaint! I was made to feel like I was at home  and the bath tub in the bathroom is an absolute treasure! I will definitely stay here again!"),
("2015-12-27", "7667264", "Merry Angela", "Room was comfortable.  Put suitcase on floor and sleep well. Cool nightlight and nice breeze. Cute kitty cat will try to come in  but you can simply close door. I was here 3 days and saw roommates a few times. So glad they didnt party there. I had peaceful Christmas and that is what I wanted. Fair price and good location. "),
("2015-12-29", "7667264", "Or Luis", "had a 2 nights reservation at Isabella's room. it's really nice  the house also. area is very cool. best bars and food I've found in Sydney and within walking distance to the center. "),
("2015-10-01", "7718248", "Tim", "Sharon has a lovely home. It's centrally located with buses nearby. Her home is very well presented and clean with plenty of bedrooms and room to move. As a host she went out of her way to ensure we had everything we needed and was very responsive to any questions (even though she was overseas!). We had a great time and I wouldn't hesitate to stay there again."),
("2016-01-03", "7718248", "Anita", "Our stay at Sharon's home was delightful. Her home is lovely  clean and well presented and we were pleasantly surprised at how roomy it was. It is located in a fantastic spot  we were easily able to access Sydney's beautiful southern beaches as well as the city and many of Sydney's major sights. Sharon was lovely to deal with and happily accommodated our last minute request for additional guests and even went out of her way to return items that we had left behind. We had a lovely stay and we would happily stay again (I highly recommend this home for young families - my children just loved the chickens!)."),
("2016-07-29", "7718248", "Lisa", "Sharon's place was clean  bright and spacious! It was a perfect home-away-from-home for us! The house was very clean and modern  inviting and warm. It is much larger than the photos show. Very family friendly (we had several kids similar in age to Sharon's)  with a separate play room full of toys  DVDs and books! The house is at the end of a small residential street central to everything. Great restaurants and grocery store within walking distance. There is no dedicated parking spot  however we never had to park more than a block away so it was never any trouble.Sharon was great! Even though she was traveling she made sure we had everything we needed and made sure we had a means of contacting her should we have needed anything. She was great with our last minute request to change check-out date  allowing us to extend our stay at her lovely home!Thanks again Sharon for sharing your wonderful home with our family! It made our summer (Sydney's winter) down under so enjoyable!"),
("2012-11-27", "781631", "Marisa", "Mike is a great host! we felt home from the first second. It is clean and very nice in his appartment. He knows nearly everything about Sydney and has an answer for all your questions. We would definitely go back to him for a second stay  once back in Sydney. The appartment has also an amazing view on the city from the roof top. within 10-15 min walk you are at the centre. You have all facilieties you need around. We liked it a lot!"),
("2012-12-03", "781631", "Andrea", "Great guy  Great location ;)As he said ""the best view of all sydney"" and it's true!!Easy going and always ready to give one hand!If you want to enjoy KingsX life this is the place for you!Thank you Mike!!"),
("2013-03-02", "781631", "Jean", "Location is very convenience. Big dining room. Unfortunately  there isn't internet service."),
("2013-03-12", "781631", "Charlie", "Mike is such a great guy and made my stay so easy. Great apartment which is clean and the area has everything you need. Make sure you check out the view from the roof. Cheers Mike.."),
("2014-02-27", "781631", "Jeff", "Mike is respectful  friendly  accommodating and easy going.  The location of the flat is great and the views from the roof are spectacular.  Within walking distance to Kings Cross  the CBD and major tourist attractions.  I would gladly stay with Mike again in the future."),
("2014-05-13", "781631", "Umberto", "Staying with Mike is like staying with an old friend  very easy to communicate and to live with. It is the first time I share a place with somebody and it was very pleasant  thanks to Mike. Actually he is never home  you will miss him! Great location  very easy to reach the city or the train station in Kings Cross. Highly recommended."),
("2014-05-27", "781631", "Daniel", "Mike is a fantastic host and did everything possible to make my stay enjoyable. Everything was perfect and above all I have a genuine friend as a result of this experience. The rooftop view was a spectacular way to take in the panoramic views of the CBD  opera house and Sydney harbor. I have no hesitation in recommending him to fellow AirBnB members! Six stars out of five!"),
("2014-06-18", "781631", "Jonny", "Great apartment in a great location. Stunning views from the roof terrace and a cool host to boot!"),
("2014-09-08", "781631", "Isa", "Mike is a great guy  he will make you feel welcome. He was good to chat to.I had a pleasant stay - as I had finished work earlier  I had a nice break  and being in Potts Point is the best place for a holiday. The flat is in a great location  near some of the best restaurants and cafes in Potts Point. Its a beautiful area for walks around the neighborhood  near the wharf. The flat is older style  but in excellent condition. There are magnificent 360 degree views on the rooftop! I recommend this place for your stay!"),
("2014-10-08", "781631", "Cat", "Mike is one of the most easy going guys ever and immediately makes you feel at home! He is all to happy to let you into his world and introduce you to the cool places to go  things to see and his love for art  music and culture definitely shines through with the tasteful art-deco furniture he has in his flat. The flat is in a great location to explore Sydney and the Potts Point scene and minutes from Kings X. I had a wonderful time during my stay there and made a friend for life! "),
("2014-10-11", "781631", "Victoria", "I had a great stay with Mike! He's very friendly and a wonderful host. Truly a local around Potts Point/Kings Cross neighborhoods and have great recos for food and nightlife - even knows a great $5 pizza spot! The apartment is clean and spacious  and the location can't be beat! Super convenient to walk into CBD or up to shops in Paddington. I would recommend Mike's place to anyone visiting Sydney!"),
("2014-10-18", "781631", "Aurélien", "Awesome week in Sydney at Mike's apartment for me and my friend! Mike is a really nice person always here to help if you need information and make you feel home the first second you're at his place! and the plus is the view from the roof  just perfect ! also if you like walking everything is pretty close   KingCross station is not far by walk so easy to go to Bondi beach or anywhere else.you can choose this place without a doubt!"),
("2014-10-24", "781631", "Gordon", "Mike is a very easy going  friendly host and gave me plenty of privacy. The apartment is good value and very well located: just a thirty minute walk to the CBD / Opera House or a $15 cab fare. This is an old but clean building and clean apartment. It is fairly noisy from the street traffic in the morning and early evening but I found I got used to it quickly. There a lots of places to eat and a supermarket is very convenient. I cooked for myself in Mike's kitchen with no dramas. Overall  this is excellent value. I would stay again  definitely."),
("2014-11-30", "781631", "Lana", "Mike is a friendly and great guy. The apartment is clean and in a great location. Lots of nice cafes and restaurants near by. Room isn't great with sound proof against the street noise and the place does not look as new as the pictures but overall good value."),
("2014-12-07", "781631", "Martin", "It's a beautiful place and Mike is the perfect host! Thank you!"),
("2015-01-08", "781631", "Laura", "Mike was very nice and helpful to us. We stayed at Mike's place for 10 days and really felt at home. The appartment is spacious  conveniently located and the view from the rooftop is certainly one of the best you can get in Sydney. Potts Point is furthermore a very nice area with a wide choice of restaurants and bars. We would love to come back!"),
("2015-03-15", "781631", "Hannah", "Mike is a great host and a great guy. He made us feel very welcome and gave us lots of advice on everything from where to eat  to things to do on the weekend and areas of the city to property hunt in!The apartment is in a great location - easy to get to everywhere in the city and out to the coast. It has everything you need and plenty of privacy (Mikes hardly ever there!).There's no Wi-fi in the apartment  which we were a little worried about  but Mike gave us a list of cafes / libraries etc to go to and we also found a few others. We also get a Optus PAYG sim with 1.5GB of data for $30 (£15GBP) which worked out quite well. Would definitely recommend and v happy to have made a friend through AirB&B!"),
("2015-03-24", "781631", "Veronique", "Mike is an awesome host: very hospitable  warm  knowledgeable about his city and neighbourhood (he could wven advise on yoga classes;-) The apartment is beautiful and comfy  in the Manhattan if Sydney. I had to change the dates of my stay and he was ever so generous and understanding."),
("2015-04-18", "781631", "Sarah", "Mike is a very friendly and relaxed host. The apartment is a spacious Art Deco style in a very vibrant area. I highly recommend as its great value for this area."),
("2015-09-27", "781631", "Cécile", "Mike was friendly  very helpful and easy to communicate with. The apartment is such perfect location for whoever wants to spend a bit of time visiting Sydney - with a awesome view up there! We had a lovely weekend  and now are in love with Potts Point :) "),
("2015-10-31", "781631", "Floris", "I had a fantastic stay with Mike. The house is nice and so is the room. The rooftop terrace has amazing views! Mike is an extremely easy going and friendly guy. He showed me a few good places and made me feel home immediately. Potts Point is a great area to stay in and I can recommend Mike’s place to anyone visiting Sydney!"),
("2015-11-12", "781631", "Yoshua", "Staying at Potts Point was brilliant. It's close to anything you could need  the neighborhood is calm and the bay is very pretty.Mike was very warm and welcoming; being an excellent host all around. I can definitely recommend spending at least a few nights in Potts Point."),
("2015-11-17", "781631", "Manolis", "The apartment is simple  roomy  comfortable and in a very convenient location. The area has lots of things to do and is 10-15 minutes walking from King's across station. The rooftop on the 10th floor gives you amazing and unobstructed views of the city! As for cleanness and luxury don't expect too much  it's a man's place  so be prepared for a little anarchy.. But on the other hand you will get a nice sense of comfort and freedom  which I personally enjoyed very much!Mike is a talented young guy  extrovert and easy going  multicultural and well educated so talking to him fills you with lots of positive energy! He will also give you all kind of hints and information you might need about the city and make sure you will feel like home!"),
("2015-11-28", "781631", "Katy", "I had a great week staying at Mike's beautiful apartment in Potts Point.  It's a fantastic location  walking distance to the city centre and with everything you could need right on your door step. Mike was a friendly and relaxed host and it was a very easy stay. The apartment was clean and had everything I needed. I would recommend Mike's place to anyone coming to Sydney  and as an area Potts Point is ideal. "),
("2015-12-02", "781631", "Inge", "Mike was really friendly. Gave lots of advice about where to go. Very hospitable!"),
("2016-02-22", "781631", "Mike", "Mike is extremely nice and hospitable. He made my stay extremely easy. The apartment is in a very convenient area."),
("2016-04-14", "781631", "Wolfgang", "Mike ist ein sehr herzlicher  offener und sehr entspannter Gastgeber. Er gab mir viele Tipps  was ich in Sydney unternehmen und anschauen kann.Die Wohnung ist wie beschrieben und liegt sehr zentral in Potts Point  einem Stadtteil  von dem man aus gut alles zu Fuß machen kann und in ca. 15-20 Minuten auch zu Fuß am Sydney-Operahaus ist (Weg durch den Botanischen Garten). Potts Point selbst ist ein lebendiger Stadtteil mit einer anregenden Kneipen- und Lokaldichte."),
("2016-01-03", "7901220", "Sandy", "Anat was a fantastic host from the very beginning. She was very responsive during the booking process and flexible with my family's arrival  which helped us greatly arriving in a new country. The house is a beautifully renovated 3 bedroom in South Coogee with tons of natural light and outdoor lounge space. The kitchen was well supplied for us to cook and bake  and we were surprised to see the BBQ was hooked up to the main gas line. Very cool!We drove most of the trip  but there are also nearby bus lines that take you into Sydney proper in 45 mins or so. I highly recommend this BnB and am excited for all that have the opportunity to stay here :)."),
("2015-09-30", "7920463", "Nadine", "My stay with Kondrad and Mish was the best experience I had with airbnb! And I seriously believe that it probably won't get  any better than this! When you are looking for a place to stay this is the one! Not only is their place beautiful but it is the people making it very special. I never ever felt more at home in any other place I stayed at. For a change everything that is shown and described is the real deal- which I experienced not always to be true. Konrad and Mish are very nice and kind and made me feel very welcome. They shared not only their home with me but also their knowledge about their beautiful country and let me be part of their lifes. Thank you for having me stay with you and thank you for taking me with you to the event and on the trip exploring in the Blue Mountains National Park! I also enjoyed the walks with your dog! I had a fantastic time and made new friends ;) I am definitely gonna be back!"),
("2015-10-05", "7920463", "Toby", "My Dad and myself spent two nights at this wonderful house with Konrad and Mish. The description of  what is on offer is spot on.This is a great house with separate rooms in an decent location adjacent to bushland and not too far from shops and transport. Wonderful hosts who are willing to go the extra distance to help out.  Highly Recommended!"),
("2015-10-24", "7920463", "Tracey", "My booking was made at relatively short notice whilst travelling and I was really appreciative that Konrad and Mish were able to accomodate me. The location and accomodation was exactly what I required for my visit to see my mother in Sydney. But Konrad was very organized. Thanks again and if your ever in Canada please don't hesitate to connect with us.  Kind regards  Tracey and Bob Forster"),
("2015-11-09", "7920463", "Katja", "Konrad was a friendly host."),
("2016-03-17", "7920463", "Claire", "Lovely  very genuine and welcoming people. Clean room with comfortable bed and very convenient location. I am definitely planning on going back!"),
("2016-04-05", "7920463", "Ryan", "I had a great time in the two weeks spent with Konrad and Mish. Felt more like living with housemates than anything else. Konrad took me out on a few mountain bike trails bearing in mind I haven't rode a bike in years but that didn't deter him. Nice location and great company would highly recommend....just don't ask Konrad for his review on your food as you will get the review of an Australia Manu"),
("2016-09-10", "7920463", "Lisa", "Great place and Konrad was really flexible and accommodating when I had to check in late. Even fed me dinner upon my late arrival! Really thankful for the room on such short notice. Just what I needed. Would recommend konrads place and would happily stay again!"),
("2016-09-15", "7920463", "Chris", "Was a very enjoyable experience. I felt very at home in the house. Will stay there again."),
("2016-09-22", "7920463", "Chris", "All very good once again"),
("2016-09-29", "7920463", "Chris", "Once again great to be there."),
("2016-10-06", "7920463", "Chris", "Was great to enjoy dinner and chat with both Konrad and Mich. Great place to stay."),
("2016-10-13", "7920463", "Chris", "Once again a very pleasant stay"),
("2017-01-18", "7920463", "Hannah", "Mish (Konrad was away during my stay) was a superb host who was friendly and welcoming the whole time. Even breakfast was offered which was lovely! I also borrowed their laundry equipment during my stay.Communication was clear and details were provided via SMS. The room is spacious with good natural sunlight  and was accurate to what the photos showed. Everything was really clean including all shared spaces. Thanks for having me and being so friendly!"),
("2017-01-31", "7920463", "Albert", "I had a great stay at Konrad and Mish places. They're lovely and friendly people and gave me plenty of advice on what to see and do in and around Sydney. The place is like advertised  so comfy room   nice bathroom and great kitchen.I would suggest to have a car   as the transit system in this particular area is not great. Also be aware that the room can be really hot on warm days!But it's still a great place to stay ;)"),
("2017-02-02", "7920463", "Chris", "All good"),
("2017-02-28", "7920463", "Andreas", "Helt kort  10/10 over hele linjen.Konrad og Michelle bor i et smukt og roligt villa kvarter i Carlingford  i et dejligt hyggeligt og sikkert hjem  det ligger tæt på både supermarked og togstation. De er utroligt imødekommende og søde værter og står altid klar med en hjælpende hånd hvis det mangler og de er fantastiske til at komme med råd og vejledning om gode steder at besøge  som turist. De er glade for at inkludere dig i både sports aktiviteter  gå-tur med hunden eller brætspil om aftenen.Det var en fornøjelse at bo hos dem og jeg vender gerne tilbage. "),
("2017-03-10", "7920463", "John", "Great people Very friendlyVery clean and tidy"),
("2017-04-11", "7920463", "Katya", "Thanks to you both for the opportunity to stay and connect with you two  much appreciated.  My stay was nice and comfortable  I'd stay again. Best wishes :-) "),
("2017-05-07", "7920463", "Husain", "Great hosts. Konrad is a wonderful man and fun talking to. Got to learn a great deal from you for the short time spent. Wish we could chat more but nonetheless hope to keep in touch with you.Michelle was always busy and working but caring too. You guys makw a great coupleThanks for hosting me guys RegardsHusain"),
("2017-06-02", "7920463", "Anna", "Nice area  nice house and nice hosts. I am glad that I picked up this place. "),
("2017-06-08", "7920463", "Anna", "Energetic and hardworking hosts. Thank you for your education on wines  and for bearing with me for sometimes improper use of kitchen facilities :-) "),
("2017-06-16", "7920463", "Anna", "Thank you for hosting me for yet another week :-)"),
("2017-06-23", "7920463", "Anna", "Stayed here for 3 weeks in total  hesitating to move mainly due to too much luggage plus having many things bought after coming here :-) "),
("2017-07-07", "7920463", "Hui", "Konrad and Mish are very nice. And their friendly dog is so cute. It is a really nice place. I spent a nice week here."),
("2017-11-17", "7920463", "Weichen", "it's been such a wonderful experience staying at Korad and Michelle's. They were very lovely so does their fluffy family member  Morpheus:)) It's a very clean and tidy homely place  very peaceful and quiet at night. The best part I loved is the view you have when you look out to the window from the room  it was AMAZING!!! It's the backyard but it's not just a backyard  it's a great piece of beauty whenever you look at it  so peaceful!!"),
("2019-02-21", "7920463", "Mark", "Perfect hosts in every way  thank you for making my first Airbnb experience a great one!"),
("2015-11-01", "7926712", "Sandreen", "My boyfriend and I were greeted by Angela and Geoff upon arrival and taken to the ground level of their private home  - their place looks just like the pictures!! What a great way to spend a mini weekend getaway. Angela and Geoff are so warm and welcoming and make you feel right at home from the moment we met them. Great place to stay in Palm beach  highly recommend their beautiful home! Couldn't get any better than this "),
("2015-11-15", "7926712", "Erin", "We had such a wonderful stay here in this gorgeous apartment with my husband and his parents. It really does feel like a tropical retreat away from it all! Thank you to Angela for making our stay so special. Every little detail had been thought about and Angela went above and beyond to make us feel so comfortable.It is stunning accommodation like this and wonderful hosts that make a getaway so perfect and memorable.Thank you! xo"),
("2015-11-27", "7926712", "Luke", "Amazing location  Amazing house and amazing Host! Would definitely stay again. It was a paradise :) "),
("2015-12-06", "7926712", "Victoria", "Immaculate home in great location. We had an enjoyable overnight stay."),
("2015-12-20", "7926712", "Paris", "Angela was very welcoming and hospitability upon arrival.  The apartment was amazing and our only regret was that we did not stay for more days. The beach was extremely close with all amenities within walking distance. Would love to come back and stay for a longer period. Thank you  Angela and hope to see you soon."),
("2016-01-15", "7926712", "Damian", "Wow wee!! What a brilliant time away. Geoff and Angela's place is just 'Brilliant'  from the outdoor alfresco living space to the master bedroom suite  these areas are just perfect!Oops I forgot to mention the beautiful back garden as well!'We'll be back'Cheers Damian Tanya and Jude."),
("2016-01-21", "7926712", "Annie", "We could not have been happier with our stay in Avalon!!!! The house was everything described and more!!! Angela had added so many personal touches such as flowers and fruit  fresh bread and other bits and pieces in the fridge  .... The house was immaculate and had everything we could have wanted!!We cannot recommend Angela and Geoff's house enough and hope to be able to come back again one day ..."),
("2016-01-23", "7926712", "Louise", "Angela and Geoff were fantastic hosts. They were very welcoming  gave us plenty of information and even offered to help us source dinner. The apartment is just stunning. It is beautifully decorated and very comfortable. The beds were really comfortable. The apartment was so well equipped with more than we could possibly need. We really appreciated the fresh bread  fruit and variety of tea available. Angela and Geoff even organised a cot and high chair for my son so I didn't have to bring the portacot or worry about chasing him around to feed him. I wish we needed to stay longer! Highly recommended."),
("2016-01-28", "7926712", "Giles", "The house is amazing and even better than the photos! We rent a couple of holiday homes ourselves and were blown away with the quality and value of the property. Lovely soft furnishings throughout  plush linen  Bose sound system and large TV  and the added extras such as flowers and soaps make for a truly luxurious stay. Although there is another apartment upstairs  we never felt that this invaded our privacy  since the owners have now installed fully automatic roof system. We loved our stay there and wish we could have stayed longer. Could not recommend more..."),
("2016-01-31", "7926712", "Samantha", "Absolutely amazing  thanks Angela and Geoff for your hospitality! Wonderful place in a perfect location  we had the best time and enjoyed having our relaxation hen's getaway here. The yard was perfect for afternoon yoga! We'll definitely be back again :)"),
("2016-02-22", "7926712", "Rob", "This North Avalon Beach Apartment was perfect.  Angela was so accommodating  and the pictures don't even do the place justice.  From extremely responsive to our inquiries regarding accessibility issues  to the fruit and bread left for us upon arrival  our trip to Sydney was made by the friendly and comfortable accommodation.  Would recommend to all!"),
("2016-03-05", "7926712", "Kirrily And Tom", "What an incredible sanctuary! We had the best time staying at Angela's beautiful home. Every detail had been thought of to make our stay enjoyable. Angela was a fantastic host and the home was very relaxing in its beautiful surrounds and lovely furnishings."),
("2016-03-11", "7926712", "Maria", "Angela and Geoff were so welcoming. It was lovely  comfortable  spacious yet cosy and very relaxing. You don't want for anything in this little sanctuary as everything is already thought out for you. Truly feel like you're in a home away from home. Pictures are exactly how you find it. Location is very convennient too. Thank you so much!!!"),
("2016-03-13", "7926712", "Laura", "Felt very welcome in this gorgeous house. Was very comfortable  spacious  clean and peaceful. Loved the proximity to Avalon beach. Had a lovely swim and walk there. Looking forward to another stay there one day. "),
("2016-03-29", "7926712", "Matt", "Fantastic  beautifully appointed home in an amazing Northern Beaches location - better than the photos if that's possible!  Angela was the perfect host  made us feel right at home and so many nice touches!  Thanks!"),
("2016-04-11", "7926712", "Zoe-Claire", "Angela and Geoff have created a stunning  homey getaway spot in North Avalon. So close to local cafes and shops and short walk to the beach. Perfect for a quick weekend away- exactly what we needed. They were very accommodating and have put effort into lovely little touches for their guests which make it that little bit more special. We will be back!! "),
("2016-04-25", "7926712", "Ben", "Angela and Geoff made us feel very welcome.The apartment was stunning and equipped with all the latest technology. Private entry so felt like it was our own place.Location was fantastic to use as a base to explore Avalon and the Palm beach area. Would highly recommend and would return again."),
("2016-05-01", "7926712", "April", "We loved our stay at North Avalon Beach Apartments. Hosts Angela & Jeff were both very friendly  welcoming & helpful during our stay picking us up from the ferry & offering to drive us anywhere during our stay. Although they are living up stairs the downstairs apartment is extremely private  quiet & separate to up stairs. It feels as if there is no one else around. This neighbour hood is filled with many other beautiful beach houses and feels very safe and welcoming. We will definitely be back to stay at the North Avalon Beach apartments again. Thank you! "),
("2016-05-16", "7926712", "Cathy", "What a great place to stay and explore Avalon. The apartment was very welcoming  even better than the photos  with every little consideration covered. The outdoor patio was perfect to sit and relax with a cheese plate and wine. Angela and Geoff made us feel very at home  and allowed us the privacy to enjoy the weekend away with our kids. Angela also made the extra effort for our kids to enjoy the break - plenty of toys and books and even offered a cot and highchair.We will be back!  "),
("2016-06-13", "7926712", "Ryan", "Amazing location and stay. Better than the pictures. Really nice sunny backyard and very private. Inside furnishings and bed were five star and super close to cafe and headland walk. Thoroughly enjoyed our stay and our the owners were lovely. Highly recommended!!!!"),
("2016-07-10", "7926712", "Brian", "We had a lovely time staying at Angela's downstairs apartment. The separate entrance gave us the privacy we were looking for & we were able to enjoy the BBQ and modern appliances. The Foxtel access to movies & such was a nice touch as the living room was absolutely beautiful to relax in. Would recommend up to 4 people staying at this spot if they're looking for an Avalon trip."),
("2016-07-19", "7926712", "Tee & Josh", "Angela and Geoff made us feel so welcome! Their property is stunning and they don't miss a single detail - everything is beautiful  right down to the hand soap and shampoo. I can't recommend this property enough to anyone looking at staying in the northern beaches. Amazing! "),
("2016-07-23", "7926712", "Jing", "Angela's house is really stunning  attention to details  very close to beach. Angela and Geoff are both very nice  helpful and welcoming. Highly recommend!!!"),
("2016-08-04", "7926712", "Rachel", "Fantastic apartment and only a 1 minute walk to Avalon beach. The apartment is beautifully furnished having 2 large double bedrooms both with ensuite bathrooms and it has everything you need. The hosts were very thoughtful and left fresh milk  bread and loads of other essentials  even books for our kids. The apartment is very private and looks out on a lush garden  the house is on a quiet street and access to the beach is  at the end of the road. Avalon village is also within walking distance and has lots of cafes  restaurants and cute shops. Absolutely recommend this property!!"),
("2016-09-20", "7926712", "Jodey-Alice", "Angela and Geoff were very fast to respond to messages and check in was smooth. The space itself is very well appointed and spacious. We stayed here for our wedding accommodation and there were so many small details that made our stay really special. From the delicious bottle of french champagne  farmers market strawberries  bowl of fruit and yogurt  to the beautiful smelling fresh garden roses placed through out the property.If you like a good bath then you will love this one  the outlook is onto a little tropical garden area and it was raining when I had mine and the sound of the raindrops on the leaves outside the window was so relaxing.Overall our experience was perfect - this would have to be our favourite airbnb stay to date.Thanks for making it so special Angela and Geoff! "),
("2016-09-30", "7926712", "Mardi", "Highly recommended! Great hosts  wonderful light filled property with every little detail considered. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay and look forward to the next visit. "),
("2016-10-02", "7926712", "Alan", "This truly is ""Beachside luxury at its absolute finest"". A very unique and beautiful apartment   with high standards of luxury that I have not even experienced in some 5 star hotels.  Angela and Geoff are absolutely wonderful hosts and really amazing to chat to. They obviously put tremendous work  pride and passion into presenting the apartment to their guests in such an impeccable way. Such an incredible base to immerse yourself in the salubrious beauty of Sydney's northern beaches. I cannot wait to come back here some time   a truly spectacular experience.  "),
("2016-10-11", "7926712", "Alex & Dina", "This place is a GEM and truly perfection! Angela and Geoff were the perfect hosts - great communication and very welcoming on arrival!We loved/enjoyed every second of our 5 nights stay! Didn't want to leave this paradise. The apartment is very well equipped and everything is high standard. The terrace has a BBQ and is great for outdoor dining. The garden is very spacious and with a lot of privacy. We were travelling with a baby and were provided with a portable cot which was very much appreciated!We were surprised by the complimentary goods in the kitchen and we loved the beautiful flowers in every room. The kitchen is very well equipped and has everything you need for cooking. The location is great and only a couple of minutes walk to the beach. The area is far away from traffic and ideal for a getaway. It was by far the best place we ever stayed at!!"),
("2016-10-15", "7926712", "Heena", "From the warmest of welcomes and first moment you enter Angela & Geoff’s home  you instantly realise that you are about experience a very unique property and enjoy all the creature comforts that make their home feel as if it is yours. Each element of how the property caters for you is well thought out beyond your expectations  notwithstanding how serene its surrounds are and proximity it is to town  beach and coastal views. A return visit is already on the cards!"),
("2016-10-29", "7926712", "Pauline", "Angela and Geoff are such a wonderful host  the house is so stylish  chic and super nice. I would highly recommend who loves to visit Avalon beach to stay at this lovely house. Thanks Angela and Geoff and hope to see you again!"),
("2016-11-01", "7926712", "Xin", "The place is beautifully decorated and very chic even better than the photos. I was so impressed by all the decor  art and furniture   it had a ""wow"" factor. I would definitely recommend staying there!Angela and Geoff are the perfect hosts."),
("2016-11-05", "7926712", "Dana", "The entire experience was not only great but amazing and even better than the illustrations in the photographs.  Angela and her other half are excellent hosts and the amenities  etc. were top notch all the way!  I even took a photo of a few products to buy when back at my house.  I will definitely be staying here again...and again.Thanks for a great weekend!"),
("2016-11-05", "7926712", "David", "Thank You Angela  everything was Brilliant"),
("2016-11-09", "7926712", "Julian", "Loved this apartment in Avalon. Beautifully styled and finished with a cool  sophisticated beachy aesthetic and a lovely outlook into the garden. Angela was a great host  and went over and above to make sure we had everything we needed and more - she even provided fresh  organic fruit and croissants.Highly recommend this place "),
("2016-11-12", "7926712", "Marianne", "We had a great long weekend at this place. Would highly recommended it."),
("2016-11-18", "7926712", "Laura", "Not only are Angela and Geoff the nicest most easy going people  their place is one of the nicest homes I have ever been in. It was the perfect size and had everything we needed. Angela has decorated the place beautifully  it is clean and warm and homely.The hospitality and attention to detail is on another level  from fresh fruit and beautiful classical music on arrival  and a beautiful souvenir on checkout we just loved our stay even though it was short. It is in a great location  minutes to Palm Beach on one end and Newport the other  it is also right near the main street at Avalon making it the perfect location.We absolutely loved our stay in their beautiful home and would love to go back again soon xx"),
("2016-11-20", "7926712", "David", "The place was great  spacious and very private. Perfect little getaway. Our hosts were lovely  very welcoming and helpful. Highly recommend. "),
("2016-11-21", "7926712", "Molly", "Angela and her husband Jeff were so great. Such lovely  kind hosts. Their Airbnb is phenomenal  fresh yoghurt and jam in the fridge  fresh fruit and a gorgeous  spotless apartment. My three friends and I had a blast.Would absolutely stay again. Thanks Angela and Jeff!!"),
("2016-11-26", "7926712", "Sue", "A lovely  modern  beautifully decorated apartment within easy walking distance of North Avalon Beach. Very comfortable bed and gorgeous bathroom(s)."),
("2016-12-03", "7926712", "Jesi An", "Angela and Geoff were amazing hosts. They allowed us to check in early but we came too early  but it was a great opportunity for us to meet them and they're absolutely lovely! The place itself is beautiful  we stayed there to get ready for our wedding and the pictures are perfect. The location is central to all the beautiful beaches and close to the shops. We would definitely recommend staying here  in fact we're looking forward to the next opportunity for us to stay. "),
("2016-12-10", "7926712", "Amanda", "We were made to feel very welcome from the moment we arrived.  Leading up to our stay the communication was excellent and Angela our host went above and beyond to accommodate our every wish. The house was beautiful with everything we would wish for and more.  Extremely comfortable  relaxing and a very easy stroll to the beach and town.  Thanks for making our stay so wonderful  we would love to come back sometime and will definitely recommend the Beach Apartment to our friends and family  "),
("2016-12-20", "7926712", "Umberto", "Angela and Geoff are warm  lovely hosts. We have never had such a well-stocked larder and fridge in any other Airbnb we have stayed at! The flat is beautifully appointed and the quality of amenities is superb. There are all comforts one could possibly wish for and the garden is a delight. You can walk to the beach in less than 5 minutes and to Avalon village in less than 10. We will definitely be back."),
("2017-01-09", "7926712", "Danya", "Great hosts who go out of their way to make sure you have the best time! The place is lovely  stilish  cozy  spacious and so well located! Wouldn't consider staying anywhere else in Avalon! Thanks Angela and Geoff for sharing your beautiful house with us  we've had special holidays! "),
("2017-01-12", "7926712", "Dana", "This was my 2nd stay at Angela's place.  She and Geoff are excellent hosts who really go out of their way to make sure that you're comfortable and enjoy your stay/holiday! They remembered that my son (5) liked a particular type of milk and ensured that this was the brand stocked in the fridge when we arrived.  There were also lots of fresh fruits and delicious fresh bread from a local patisserie.  We brought pop up soccer goals and a ball for my son to play a bit in the back garden and they didn't mind at all.There are beach chairs  a beach umbrella and little extras left for you to use during your stay that makes the whole experience special and easy.  They've really tried to think of everything that you might need during your stay.The house is a 5 minute walk to the beach and a short walk to town.  As I was with a little one I drove more than I walked and Palm and Whale Beach are also a short drive away.I have recommended many of my friends to stay here and I will certainly be staying here again soon!  Thanks again for making our summer holiday in Avalon the best!"),
("2017-02-11", "7926712", "John", "I have stayed in over 30 AirBnB's and can say with certainty that this is one of the very best.Beautiful apartment  wonderfully furnished and equipped and spotlessly clean.  Angela and Geoff were the perfect hosts in every way.  Very keen to stay again soon - even though I live a very long way away!"),
("2017-02-16", "7926712", "Sally-Anne", "We have had the most amazing 5 nights at Angela and Geoffs home. The house is stunning and exactly as described and shown in the pictures. They have thought of absolutely everything you may need while staying away from home  even the beautiful toiletries in the bathrooms and the welcome pack. The location is fabulous - 2 minutes to the beach and a 5 minute walk to the shops/restaurants. We hired a car to explore the area which was beautiful and to experience some of the other restaurants.We would love to go back and stay again."),
("2017-02-21", "7926712", "Sandra", "What a beautiful home to stay. Attention to details from Angela and Geoff is what made our stay memorable... they have though of everything all you need is your personal belongings! Which makes it easy while traveling with kids! Even after a big storm hit the area the night before we were able to check in early! The area is peaceful  quiet and yet so close to all amenities... we most enjoyed the 5 mns walk to Avalon beach the kids (4/10) loved spending time surfing  making sand castles  relaxing and then going for a bite in Avalon city... one of our best day was walking up the light house and have lunch at the boat house.If you are looking for the perfect get away to visit the northern beaches don't look any longer you found it!!! "),
("2017-02-27", "7926712", "Jesse", "Angela and Geoff were wonderful hosts. From the minute we arrived  they warmly welcomed us into their beautiful home. If you're after a relaxing weekend away  you cannot beat this property and location. "),
("2017-03-05", "7926712", "Simon", "Great break with the parents."),
("2017-03-11", "7926712", "Alison", "Our stay was perfect. A beautiful apartment with high quality appliances  furniture and a beautifully kept garden. We stayed two nights and were very comfortable... loved the BBQ and outdoor space. Our 3 year old loved the garden. It's only a short drive to the shops and beaches (and a short walk to north Avalon beach). A quiet  peaceful location. We definitely recommend and would stay again. "),
("2017-03-25", "7926712", "Efemena", "Our stay at Angela & Geoff's stunning apartment was perfect from start to finish. The apartment itself is decorated to the highest level of quality and feels truly like a home away from home. Angela communicated well ensuring that we had everything we needed both prior to and during our stay. The location is also great  a short walk to Avalon Beach and a short drive from Palm Beach makes it easy to explore both. I would highly recommend staying here  it is great value for money - so great that we didn't want to leave! "),
("2017-04-08", "7926712", "Sammi", "Thank you very much Angela and Geoff  we have wonderful stay there! will definitely visit again and recommend to our friends !"),
("2017-04-16", "7926712", "Marloes", "We had a fantastic stay and can highly recommend this apartment to anyone! This place is simply stunning  very tastefully decorated and everything is of the highest quality. You can tell Angela and Geoff put lot of effort in decorating this place to the highest standard. The outdoor area was beautiful and our little girl loved the big garden area. The location is perfect  close to Avalon center and a short drive from Whale beach and Clareville  two of our favourite beaches in the area. My husband surfs so he was very happy with the short walk to Avalon beach which is stunning as well. We will def be back!  "),
("2017-04-24", "7926712", "Linden", "My partner and I stayed here for our babymoon and it was magnificent. Beautiful space  really friendly hosts and fantastic location. Has everything you need (loved the Foxtel and bath!) and Avalon is such a great location year round with fantastic restaurants and great walks/beach. We had the best time. Highly recommend. "),
("2017-06-04", "7926712", "Joe And Natalie", "Angela was an outstanding host.. in fact she was the best host I have ever had! Will definitely stay again  the place was very well designed with quality finishes. We loved our holiday. Thank you for making it so lovely. "),
("2017-07-24", "7926712", "Cliff", "Angela and Geoff were exceptional hosts in every aspect of our stay. They made us feel really welcome and provided us with more than we expected. We enjoyed complimentatry wine  champagne  bread  milk yougurt and cheese which were just a few of the personal touches we experienced. The home is clean  well presented and neat with a contemporary flair. Located in one of Sydney's best kept secrets  Avalon is a great holiday destination. The superb is quint and quite  with one of the best beaches on your door step. We highly recommend Angela and Geoff's home  best AIRBNB EXPERINCE TO DATE!"),
("2017-10-23", "7926712", "James", "Angela and Geoff were amazing hosts. They had gone out of their way to ensure that they had stocked the kitchen with not only all the necessities but many thoughtful touches from local stores etc. The apartment exceeded our expectations. It's a quiet and tranquil location. Angela and Geoff were always available to give advice and directions etc. but went to great lengths to give us privacy and to make us feel that the space was our own. Lovely people and a beautiful property."),
("2017-10-29", "7926712", "Sharon", "Angela and Geoff were wonderful hosts  providing extra touches and attention to our needs. They really went out of their way! The communication was great and everything went smoothly. What a lovely space. The kids loved it. Thank you!"),
("2017-11-06", "7926712", "Katie", "We absolutely loved our stay at Angela and Geoff's place!! They made us feel so welcome  communication was fantastic and there were so many thoughtful little touches and extras that made this stay our best Air BnB experience. The apartment is stunning  the space is spotless with absolutely everything that you might need and the location is perfect. We can't wait to go back!!!"),
("2017-11-11", "7926712", "Jenny", "A really lovely place to stay."),
("2017-11-18", "7926712", "Andrew", "Angela is a truly wonderful host. Outstanding communication  gorgeous house with incredible hospitality; we can’t wait to come back!"),
("2017-12-02", "7926712", "Renee", "We had a wonderful weekend at Angela’s place. It was immaculately kept  warm and welcoming as was Angela herself. I couldn’t recommend her place any higher  we felt very relaxed and right at home."),
("2017-12-09", "7926712", "Amanda", "Second time staying here and was once again wonderful.  Clean  comfy  great location  wonderful hosts with great local knowledge and so helpful.  Thanks for a wonderful stay.  We will be back"),
("2017-12-16", "7926712", "Alexandra", "What an amazing apartment. Everything provided was of the highest quality and Angela and Geoff went out of their way to make us and our children welcome."),
("2017-12-21", "7926712", "Carole", "We really enjoyed our stay  beautiful place and very relaxing."),
("2018-01-01", "7926712", "Robert", "We enjoyed our stay at Angela and Geoff's place!! They made us feel very welcome. the communication was great and the apartment was really great with a superb AV installation  this and all other extras made this stay our best Air BnB experience. The apartment is stunning  the space is spotless with absolutely everything that you might need and the location is perfect. if possible we really wou;d like to go back there."),
("2018-01-06", "7926712", "Rachael", "We loved the accommodation  Angela's hospitality and all the added extras (Bread  milk  yogurt and fruit in the fridge  hairdryer and straightener in the bathroom  along with beach towels  sun umbrella and beach chairs to take to the beach). Angela is a fabulous host. She greeted us on arrival and provided information on facilities  she was more than happy to assist during our stay and accommodate our requests. A guide was available on local restaurants etc. The apartment is a beautifully decorated  quiet and relaxing home away from home and only minutes from the beach. Top rate accommodation we would not hesitate in recommending. Loved it."),
("2018-01-14", "7926712", "Stephen", "Angela and Geoff were so hospitable and thoughtful. Generosity in every thing they do makes for a wonderful airbnb experience. My Daughter and I visited the Avalon Beach apartments for a week. On Arrival - When we arrived we found to our delight a superb selection of Freshly baked bakery Bread  Premium Fruit (including mango  rock melon  blue berries and raspberries)  Yogurt and the milk of our choice. We asked for an early check in which at this time of year (January)they could not do but to compensate there was a bottle of French Champagne in the fridge and a bottle of Aussie Red on the counter. But this was to be the first of many surprises. I then discovered a lovely selection of premium cheeses in the crisper. As well as selection of unopened French jams and spreads just added to the already extensive pantry. The kitchen – every need or requirement had been carefully thought of. Every type of glassware and china in the cupboards was of the highest standards in design and style and again very generously provided. The kitchen appliances  fridge  washer/Dryer  stove was all of the highest specification and all as new. Entertaining was a so easy. The generous designer lounge spilled out onto the terrace. State of the art technology provided many hours immersed in the latest movies. The windows featured an electronic block out blind for privacy and to mange the sun. Internally a thoughtful arrangement of blinds managed the totally privacy of the areas. Again  premium appliance including a Bose sound System and Jet Master Fireplace. Designer furniture  Interiors books and magazines. Picture windows opening on to the stunning tropical garden. As well as delightful collection of original artwork from the region. The Terrace – again every need had been carefully thought of. Centering on a delightful table for 8 the designer flagstone floor flowed seamlessly via concertina doors opening into the lounge. A huge 4 burner BBQ  ceiling mounted outdoor heating. Generous collection of Comfortable premium garden furniture to enjoy the stunning garden. Stylish beach mats provided. In the main bed room good design was again present in everything they had chosen. The premium beds and linen and towels were all immaculate. Stylish bathroom  double sink and huge European bath  heated towel rails  hair straightener and hair dryer  Spare Razors  makeup removal pads  cue tips and designer toiletries. – again  everything carefully provided. Double hanging and 30 black velvet covered hangers – generosity again. A fresh arrangement of orchids on the Dresser. Generous selection of fresh designer Turkish towels and Beach bags. Generous designer bath and beach towels provided. The second bedroom featured a double bed and again generous hanging and storage. It features a generous library of classics and current design and food books that kept me entertained for hours. Another large stylish en-suite bathroom with every need again considered. Again all immaculate. Local area recommendations for everything we could need in restaurants and cafés was provided in Blue Binder..."),
("2018-01-25", "7926712", "Emma", "We had a fantastic time at Angela’s. Travelling with our 22-month old toddler  we appreciated the extra amenities - toys  travel cot  high chair and a stocked pantry. Angela even bought bread  milk and yogurt for us before we arrived. How thoughtful! The apartment itself was very clean  tastefully furnished and well cared for. Both the outdoor and indoor space was toddler-friendly. Our son could easily occupy himself minutes on end in the garden! We also enjoyed putting some beautiful  fresh produce on the barbie. Dinner sorted! (The apartment has a small open kitchen. The stove is too small for any serious cooking so bbq is the easier option.)In terms of location  the house is walking distance from the beach. The road is not flat though and there are a few steps of stairs to access the beach. One can walk to the town centre via the beach but we always drove as we would often come back with shopping.All in all  we’d highly recommend Angela’s apartment to any couple or small family travelling to Sydney in the summer."),
("2018-01-27", "7926712", "Vered", "What an amazing place to stay and such wonderful hosts. It’s tempting to want to keep it a secret  but too good not to write a review. We had 4 of us come up from Sydney for a couple of nights for our friends’ wedding and we had such a lovely time staying at North Avalon Apartment. From top to bottom everything was very well thought of  well-equipped  tasteful and clean. I echo all the previous comments about how awesome Angela and Geoff are. Angela even drove the 4 of us to the wedding up at Palm Beach and offered to pick us up afterwards too. Such a champion. Super easy to communicate with  quick to respond and always helpful  not that we needed any help - absolutely everything was done! Thanks again."),
("2018-02-02", "7926712", "Kristy", "Immaculate  every detailed considered  beautiful quality furnishings  great hospitality and peaceful environment. Definitely returning!"),
("2018-02-12", "7926712", "Sherrin", "Had a wonderful stay at Angela’s !Can’t wait to return Beautiful home with lovely relaxing feel Future guest will not be disappointed"),
("2018-02-17", "7926712", "Hannah", "Probably the best air bnb we’ve ever stayed in. Such care and attention to everything you would ever need. Fresh fruit  dairy products and bread provided and asked what we’d like pre-arrival. In addition to fresh flowers  an amazingly stocked kitchen  and a great place which was so clean - our hosts provided a range of toys (and kitchen utensils) for our toddler which were very well received. She loved playing in the garden and we enjoyed our bbqs while she was asleep in the evening! Thanks for a wonderful weekend"),
("2018-02-24", "7926712", "Kate", "This is a perfect Avalon escape  walking distance to the beach and immaculately presented. Angela has considered every detail  from fresh bread  kids toys because we needed them  and Champagne. There’s a perfect green lawn for kids or sunbathing  and shaded outdoor dining. The kitchen is well appointed  the fridge full size  the aircon works well. Loved our stay!! We’ll be back!"),
("2018-03-23", "7926712", "Brianna", "It was a lovely stay  from how beautiful the place is to how amazing Angela was with making me welcome and comfortable. Everything was worlds above average."),
("2018-03-25", "7926712", "Martine", "Angela’s place is stunning!! The thoughtful touches everywhere were great and we had a very relaxing and peaceful stay. The outside area is perfect for dinners and with the heater we could stay outside until late. Angela was lovely and got us absolutely everything we needed. Highly recommend and we’ll definitely be back :)"),
("2018-04-02", "7926712", "Kelly", "Angela’s place could not have been more perfect for our stay. Private  quiet  clean and beautiful! The amenities are amazing  everything from bathroom products to beach chairs  towels  and beautiful bread  fruit  cheeses and champagne for our arrival. This place is a rare find in Avalon!"),
("2018-04-06", "7926712", "Nigel", "This is a wonderful spot - easily walkable to great beaches and all the local amenities in AvalonAngela is a really wonderful hostess - I cannot recommend it highly enough"),
("2018-04-22", "7926712", "Deb", "What a beautiful place. Such a warm welcome from Angela and Geoff  a beautiful space with 5* finishing touches. A really beautiful  peaceful garden to enjoy a long lunch and so close to Avalon.We would love to come back again. A wonderful experience throughout. Thanks so much Angela and Geoff - outstanding hospitality at its best and a really memorable night away.Great dinner at Berts restaurant (Merivale) in Newport - an easy Uber ride and lovely meal."),
("2018-04-25", "7926712", "Kelly", "All expectations were met at Angela’s Airbnb. Such a beautiful setting with perfect touches inside and outside of this property. I highly recommend a stay at least once  thank you Angela for your kind hospitality."),
("2018-04-29", "7926712", "Cassandra", "Amazing apartment! Cosy and perfect for a getaway from the city. Every little touch was perfect and definitely well worth it."),
("2018-05-06", "7926712", "Jalda", "Angela’s place was absolutely perfect! Even better than I expected it to be from the photos. The apartment has everything you need and is decorated with a lot of attention to detail!  Angela also provided Eggs  Fruit  Milk and Bread for breakfast. The conversation  check-in and out was super easy and quick.We loved our stay!Thank you!"),
("2018-05-20", "7926712", "Deborah", "What a wonderful weekend. Angela was easy to communicate with right from the beginning. Geoff gave us a warm welcome and tour of the house when we arrived. The kitchen was fully equipped  there were many fine touches throughout and it is clear the space has been designed for comfort. It was clean  luxurious and had everything we needed. Would definitely recommend Angela and Geoff’s apartment!"),
("2018-06-11", "7926712", "Lisa", "This is a special unit.  The details of rich  beautiful fabrics  cozy blankets  lovely decor  not cluttered and simply stunning. The outdoor space was a great place to eat even though it rained quite a bit.  The heating element outside kept us warm and there are lots of throws and blankets if you need more.  The fridge had champagne  a gorgeous cheese plate  yogurt  fruit  milk (all our choices)  crackers and more. This was in the top 2 airbnb's I've stayed in (and I am a veteran!). The walk into Avalon village was easily done via a pathway  just a few minutes away. The unit is quiet with blackout shades on every window. You will be very pleased with your choice. "),
("2018-06-24", "7926712", "Michelle", "Angela's place lives up to all your expectations.  It is beautifully and tastefully furnished and spotlessly clean and all the added extras were absolutely fantastic.  We will most definitely be back."),
("2018-07-03", "7926712", "Nicho", "The best place I have stayed"),
("2018-07-15", "7926712", "Christine", "Beautiful apartment with everything you could wish for with lots of added extras. Breakfast provisions were delicious. Great location  close to Palm Beach  the Boat House and the northern beaches. A truly wonderful stay and lovely host."),
("2018-07-22", "7926712", "George", "A lovely place to stay  great location and a stunning property! We will be going back again no question about it."),
("2018-08-19", "7926712", "Elizabeth", "Brilliant in all aspects. Will definitely stay here again"),
("2018-09-01", "7926712", "Max", "Great location and is a short walk to North Avalon Beach. The space itself was exquisite and everything catered for. Angela is an amazing host and very accomodating. We would not hesitate staying again or recommending to our friends"),
("2018-09-09", "7926712", "Mira", "Thank you Angela for amazing accomodation. Beautiful North Avalon Apartment exceeded all expectations. Sparkling clean  very stylish  and comfortable accomodation. Best Airbnb experience. I can't wait to come back to this place for another weekend away. Highly recommended."),
("2018-09-15", "7926712", "Jessica", "Absolutely stunning. The most amazing get away in the most amazing home! Angela is wonderful!"),
("2018-09-24", "7926712", "Maree", "Angela's place will not disappoint. It stays true to its online images and description but its the little touches and Angela's friendliness that made our stay extra special. Thanks Angela!"),
("2018-09-29", "7926712", "Meena", "Our stay was amazing. Everything about Angela's accomodation was exceptional. Beautiful decor  calm and serene."),
("2018-09-30", "7926712", "Daisy", "What a great find! We loved our stay here. Angela's place is exactly as it looks in the photos! Self check-in was a breeze and communication with Angela was excellent. The location was perfect and easy to find. Angela went above and beyond to make sure our stay was comfortable and the information pamphlet she sent was very thorough. The apartment is also close to Avalon beach and the supermarkets/shopping strip which was very convenient. I would recommend this place to anyone who is looking for a beach getaway :)"),
("2018-10-06", "7926712", "Cara", "Incredibly designed apartment. Super stylish with all the amenities and more provided.Angela was super quick to respond and very nice to deal with. Highly recommend"),
("2018-10-27", "7926712", "Lorraine", "This was the best Airbnb we’ve experienced. Such a beautiful and stylish  space. My husband and I stayed here with another couple and it was the perfect size for 2 couples. The host went out of her way to ensure an easy stay. We really appreciated the milk  bread  yogurt  Nespresso pods and fruit placed in the kitchen for us. Awesome location with the beach at the bottom of the street and an easy stroll to the local shops and cafes. Hope to return one day soon."),
("2018-10-27", "7926712", "Amy", "Our stay at Angela’s was amazing. The place is stunning and clean !! Very close to the beach and local shops. We really enjoyed our stay!"),
("2018-11-04", "7926712", "Michael", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Angela’s - a fantastic place to spend a few nights in Sydney’s Northern Beaches  either to explore or just relax. The property is located in a quiet  residential area but in walking distance of Avalon beach  and all local amenities. The space is beautifully decorated and maintained  with lots of space for 4 adults to share and enjoy. Angela was an extremely thoughtful host (extra thanks for the wonderful food and drink supplies that welcomed us on arrival) and easy to contact throughout. Would highly recommend staying here  wish we could have stayed longer!"),
("2018-11-09", "7926712", "Felicia", "Angela's place is absolute luxury! We loved the provision of additional fruit and gourmet food! It's a really a nice touch and super handy when in a rush. I booked her place the day before my wedding - and it did not disappoint. Angela herself is very helpful and responsive. I would definitely stay here again for a holiday experience."),
("2018-11-17", "7926712", "James", "Angela’s place is absolutely wonderful - she has thought of absolutely everything. You are guaranteed a perfect time when you stay here!"),
("2018-11-26", "7926712", "Wendy", "We enjoyed our stay at this lovely property. Quiet location with a nice private outdoor area adjacent to the garden. Facilities were excellent and the hostess was great to deal with. We would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-12-08", "7926712", "Carly", "I would highly recommend this apartment- we really couldn't have asked for anything more. The apartment is beautiful and cosy  had everything we needed  and was fresh and spotless . Lots of lovely extra touches- luxury bathroom products  books  essentials for the beach  delicious food in the fridge.  Great location. Communication was  prompt and easy."),
("2018-12-13", "7926712", "Eleanor", "Angela & Geoff’s place is beyond exceptional. My husband and I and our 2 young children spent 2 very enjoyable and comfortable nights there. The apartment is private  really quiet and beautifully stylish. The beds are the most comfortable I’ve ever slept in. Angela made sure there were toys and a travel cot for my 2 year old and responded so quickly to any questions I had. Fantastic stay  loved it!!!"),
("2018-12-28", "7926712", "Daniel", "10/10Thank you for your help"),
("2019-01-05", "7926712", "Jessica", "An absolute gem  superb location and very luxurious. We loved just strolling to the beach and sitting in the garden. Angela and Geoff were fantastic hosts  very helpful and on hand to assist. We would definetely stay again."),
("2019-01-31", "7926712", "Jaspreet", "Angela's place was inviting  cosy and contemporary at the same time. my family and I quickly settled in during our stay and felt very comfortable throughout our stay. The size and facilities for our family of 4 was perfect ( the washing machine  dryer and lovely garden was especially handy having two young kids) Our privacy was not at all compromised yet Angela made sure she was available for any questions or help we may have had. The amenities located around the beach house are excellent and all within walking distances. I will say pushing a stroller with a toddler in tow was particularly tiring when returning back from the beach as the beach house was located at top of a relatively steep hill. I would bare this in mind if you plan to not hire or take a car. Other than that  an excellent location  beach house and host!"),
("2019-02-10", "7926712", "Remi", "We had a beautiful time at Angela’s apartment. Everything was exactly as described and Angela went out of her way to provide thoughtful touches including ammenities for the beach and gorgeous fresh fruit  bread and other snacks. The apartment is in a great spot and very easy to get in to Avalon town with many great restaurants and things to do. I would highly recommend this place to anyone!"),
("2019-02-18", "7926712", "Graeme", "Great location. Very luxurious .Tranquil garden setting. Great breakfast provisions. Angela was amazing."),
("2019-02-22", "7926712", "Kristy", "Second time we’ve stayed here  we love this place. Has such a warm and cosy feel. It’s so clean  modern and on trend. beautiful thoughtful touches from Angela the host. Such a gorgeous place  highly recommended."),
("2013-01-04", "794910", "Lucia", "Gavin's place is very clean and well laid out and is ideally located close to Central Station. We stayed for four nights over New Years Eve and enjoyed our time immensely!What we liked the most was the host! He is a very good person  respectful  cordial and polite at all times. He even made time to show us the tourist attractions as well as some of the local hotspots.We shared some great evenings with Gavin and enjoyed the conversation on a range of interesting topics. During our stay  I also had the chance to introduce him to my favourite European drink ""the Hugo"" which went down a treat! ;)We enjoyed staying in Surry Hills and can happily recommend the place and the host  and if given the chance would gladly stay there again."),
("2013-01-19", "794910", "German", "Gavin's apartment is located in the heart of the city  not far from the Central station  at the same time the street is very quiet and peaceful.The apartment is very clean  well-organized and balanced. We had a feeling that we were at our own home (also we cannot forget the incredibly delicious ice cream - Gavin certainly knows the simple pleasures of life and doesn't mind sharing them with the guests).The guest bedroom is quite spacious and comfortable  with pillows of 2 different heights to choose from (not a frequent option in B&Bs).Gavin is a nice person  and knows a lot about his country and city. His travel suggestions for our further trip in Australia have helped us a lot.Very good place  excellent host."),
("2013-02-01", "794910", "Gabriel", "It goes without saying  Gavin was a great host and guide. We stayed with him for two weeks  and couldn't have asked for a better place. His home is lovely  clean and there was always plenty of fresh fruits for breakfast. The bed was really comfortable and the room was quite  convenient. Upon our arrival  after 30+ hours of flights and airport  a great home cooked meal and a bottle of wine was waiting for us. With all his great tips about Sydney and the area (he would sometimes plan a great day trip for us)  he really made us feel at home and welcomed! Si vous passez par Sydney  vous devez absolument passez chez Gavin. Son accueil et la connaissance de sa ville native  font de lui un hôte extraordinaire! Gavin  best wishes  if your ever pass by Montreal  you are more than welcome to come see us!Gabriel & Ngoc-An"),
("2013-02-26", "794910", "Michael", "Es war einfach ein grossartiger Aufenthalt! Super Host  praktische Lage  feines australisches Lamm  gemütliche Stunden. Danke vielmals. "),
("2013-03-11", "794910", "Ida", "First of all i have to say that Gavin is a great person and excellent host! He was very thoughtful and polite. Apartment was very clean and comfortable  on great location  near by Central Station. I would recomend Gavin""s place to everyone! Tnx Gavin for wonderful tree days in my favorite place on earth!! "),
("2013-03-16", "794910", "Junshien", "Gavin's a very nice host he'll basically try his best to answer your questions happily and talks with you easily. He allows his guest to fully utilize his accommodation which we appreciate very much. He made an effort to stock up his kitchen with full of foods upon our arrival. The location is amazing with free shuttle bus and central station (train) around the corner. His place is clean tidy and big enough to accommodate quite a number of people in fact. The setback is there's no air conditioned which was what he'd mentioned. It gets quiet at night that we felt insecure while on the way back but so far it's fine for us.Overall  it's a good stay for us!"),
("2013-04-05", "794910", "Anne-Kathrin", "Staying at Gavin's place was our first airbnb experience and he made it very easy for us to feel at home... We really enjoyed our stay at his apartment. Gavin was always very helpful  gave us some advice what to see and where to go in Sydney and was always open for a nice chat at home. We even stayed at his place a 2nd time on the way back to Germany and it felt like coming home for us... :) If we should ever come back to Sydney  we would also be checking in for a 3rd time if Gavin is fine with it! :)"),
("2013-04-11", "794910", "Christophe", "We stayed 3 nights at Gavin's flat; it was really convenient because next to the Central station  CBD  Chinatown etc (the place for cheap food).About the home  the living room and the kitchen form especially a nice and spacious open-space.We could finally book one more night at the last minute.Thanks again Gavin for your welcoming and all the lovely ""gift"" foods  we rediscovered the peanut better thanks to you!"),
("2013-05-06", "794910", "Ying Shing", "Firstly  Gavin's place has a superb location! Only 3 minutes' walk to Central station thus extremely convenient. From Central station  you are able to take the train or light rail to almost everywhere! Surry Hills is an awesome area and we were spoilt for choice for every meal. It is also within walking distance to Darling Harbour  Chinatown  George St  Darlinghurst etc. and a short bus ride from Bondi beach. Gavin is very approachable and friendly and it was a pity we weren't able to hang out much; we were out exploring most of the time. He gave great advice about travelling to various locations  which bus to take and which way to walk and we really appreciate that! The room was adequate for us with good space for our luggage. The bed was really comfortable with 4 pillows and we slept really well during our 5 nights there. Also  the apartment is very neat and tidy and great to return to after tiring days out. This was our first Airbnb experience and it will definitely not be the last! Ying Shing & De Yong"),
("2013-06-09", "794910", "Marilyn", "Gavin was an excellent host - friendly  direct  thoughtful and helpful. Everything was easy. His place is clean and comfortable and the location is amazing. There are fantastic places to eat nearby and so easy to catch a train anywhere.We'll be back!"),
("2013-06-18", "794910", "Anton", "Our stay at Gavin's place was very enjoyable. The apartment was always clean and tidy. Gavin is a good bloke who was very easy to stay with."),
("2013-07-08", "794910", "Mae", "Gavin was kind enough to make arrangements for an early check-in when we arrived in the morning  even though he was at work till evening. Instructions were clear and he was always prompt in replying to our queries. The apartment was simply decorated but clean  uncluttered and Gavin had provided us with towels and even kindly helped change our sheets for the comfortable bed during our 10 days stay. The bathroom too was clean and spacious and Gavin picked up after us to make sure it stayed tidy. Breakfast - various kinds of tea  cereal  bread  constant supply of bananas and milk- was great. He even taught me the tip for a good Vegemite toast. All in all  everything we needed was available and easily found. Gavin was very helpful with what we may have needed and basically allowed us make ourselves completely at home. The bonus was a very useful and top notch hair dryer (sorry for the noise).Wish we weren't always out and got to chat more. See you again hopefully! All the best  Mae."),
("2013-07-16", "794910", "Samara", "There isn't much we can add to all the glowing reviews from everyone else except to confirm that it is all true!Gavin was a very welcoming and accommodating host  and we really enjoyed over evening chats with him over dinner. The flat is extremely well placed and is clean  tidy and has everything you could need. We were a little surprised by how chilly Sydney winters could be in the mornings so bring wooly socks!Gavin  thanks for making our first visit to Sydney so enjoyable."),
("2013-07-24", "794910", "Romain", "Gavin was by far the best host I had in Oz. (the others were good too) He was there when I arrived  nice  a good conversationalist  good tips  and shared with me his honemade cooking.His place is just a few minutes walking from Central  the main train stationin town. Plus  it was a 3 minute walk to my favorite coffee shop  Di Bella  that he told me about."),
("2013-08-05", "794910", "Clément", "We enjoyed a lot our week at Gavin's home. He gave us good advice and thanks to him we learnt a lot of things about Australia. Don't worry if you don't speak very well English  Gavin takes care about speaking slowly and clearly ;) so pleasant! His flat is well located  next to Central Station it was very convenient for us! His flat is also clean  tidy and our room was large enough for us and our luggage. To conclude I think it’s the best place to be in Sydney! :)"),
("2013-08-12", "794910", "Subathra", "Extremely friendly host that made me feel right at home. Lovely place just next to Central station. Very comfortable home. Pleasant stay."),
("2013-09-01", "794910", "Kelli", "Gavin was a great host  very friendly and reliable. Great location within close proximity to public transport and cafes/restaurants. I would highly recommend staying at Gavin's apartment. "),
("2013-09-09", "794910", "Rosa Jo", "This was our first Air BnB experience and Gavin from the start was prompt and professional. As our flight was early  Gavin kindly made arrangements for my friend & I  to be able to check in early.  The location of the apartment is amazing. It is literally less than 5mins walk from Central Station. The room is much larger than what we expected from the pictures  it had plenty of  room for our luggage. The apartment was clean  the room and bathroom immaculate  bed and pillows were comfortable and clean. Gavin even has a hair dryer for us ladies or guys with really long hair. We spent the day wondering around Surrey Hills and coming from Melbourne I need my coffee in the morning  Sample coffee on Devonshire st  and Le Monde on Foveaux St has amazing coffee and it is just around the corner less than 5mins walk.   That evening we spent dinner with Gavin and had a enjoyable conversation while watching my AFL team WIN  GO HAWKS! Gavin is a great host making us feel welcome and comfortable  making sure we had everything we needed for our stay. Living in the area Gavin knows where everything is  is it spot on with recommending place to eat around Surrey Hills and its all within walking distance( I have said that enough already? lol). YOU MUST try the pie's at Bourke St Bakery and Churros from Movida.As you can see I'm BIG on food. I Loved that we were only 5 mins walk away from china town  there is also a taxi depot in the next street so we had no issues getting a cab. If you are down for the weekend over spring head down to The Rocks for the markets and eat macarons at la renaissance café and the food stalls there amazing food!If your a foodie like me my favourite places to eat was: Din Tai Fung for dumplings  be prepared to wait but they are worth it  Gumshara Ramen for their thick tonkotsu broth and N2  ice cream in Chinatown  Ms g's for a twist on Vietnamese food in Potts point. Around Surrey Hills Morh fish  Bourke st Bakery  Ruben Hills and Chur Burger.All in all   with our bellies full  our legs and feet exhausted we had a great experience in Sydney and staying with Gavin and would defiantly stay again without hesitation.  "),
("2013-09-15", "794910", "Yu Ming", "Gavin's place was cosy  well-kept and really clean! Conveniently located near Sydney's Central train station  with the CBD just a further 5 mins walk...Gavin was a great host too - recommending food places  places of interest and even taking time at the end of a long day at work to chat with us and share on the history of Sydney :)  Wouldn't have made much sense out of random chalk marks on the pavement otherwise..!Would definitely recommend Gavin's to anyone  and stay there again on our next visit!"),
("2013-10-02", "794910", "Erika", "Gavin is a very friendly person  he help you and he cooks very well. The room is big  very comfortable. The house is in a convenient location  very near to the train station and bus stop. I recommend it to all people the house of Gavin if you come to visit Sydney. "),
("2013-10-27", "794910", "Wei Kin", "It was a great experience staying there! Like what Gavin has said  it was really a few mins walk from central station. If you need to have air con in your room  then this will not be the place for you. And yes  the toilet door has been fixed! Do note that it will be a shared toilet with the host. Satisfied with my stay  if you're looking at a place just to wash up and sleep while on holiday in Sydney  this is the place for you."),
("2013-11-05", "794910", "Joel", "We had a nice stay in Sydney. The room was no frills which suited us fine and we had a great chat with Gavin. We recommend staying here if you are looking for a simple room with good company."),
("2013-11-11", "794910", "Natalie", "This was my first time using AirBnB and it was really easy.  Gavin was a great host - very prompt response to the initial booking  clear and easy instructions to get to the apartment.  He was also friendly and helpful with recommendations for restaurants  activities  and even some interesting books!  The location was great - really handy to the train station for coming in from the airport  and close to the CBD  Paddington and Surry Hills for shopping.  The room was simple but spacious and nice and clean.  Highly recommended."),
("2013-11-20", "794910", "Susanne", "My partner and I really enjoyed our time at Gavins home. We can highly recommend  to stay with Gavin."),
("2013-12-06", "794910", "Caberin", "Gavin is definitely a great host  he is so nice and always there when u'be got any questions. His place is amazing  clean  quite  convenient to anywhere u wanna go. I spent 3 days in Sydney and every time went out just rely on walking. Next time when I go back to Sydney  will definitely choose to stay with Gavin again. "),
("2013-12-20", "794910", "Sebastien", "We had a great time at Gavin's apartment. Gavin is a super host. He helped us to plan our short stay in Sydney and we saved a lot of time by following is recommendations. The apartment is REALLY well located (a couple of minutes from the Central station) and clean. Don't hesitate to book this accommodation to discover beautiful Sydney!"),
("2014-01-12", "794910", "Tracy", "Lovely clean flat in a superb location.  Gavin had lots of recommendations & local knowledge on how to have a great time in Sydney."),
("2014-01-22", "794910", "Kelly", "Excellent location  nice apartment  great host.  Highly recommend this apartment to anyone visiting Sydney who wants easy access to Central Station or Surrey Hills."),
("2014-01-30", "794910", "Jan-Willem", "We had a nice room in the perfect location to explore Sydney and surroundings. We had a good bed and shared the fine shower and kitchen with our host Gavin.Gavin was very friendly  and let us come and go whenever we wanted. We didn't see him a lot  but when we did he always had time for a chat. There was some confusion about the dishes  unfortunately  but this was our first AirBnB experience and we weren't sure about the house rules."),
("2014-02-07", "794910", "Margo", "I would highly recommend a stay at this apartment. Great location - right next to Central Station. Gavin is a fantastic host and really helped me out during my stay."),
("2014-02-21", "794910", "Adrian", "Gavin was a very good host and helped us planning our stay. The room and all the facilities were clean and the bed was very comfortable. The location is a good starting point for the exploration of the whole of Sydney and with the detailed directions from Gavin  it's also easy to find. All in all we can only recommend the stay!"),
("2014-02-26", "794910", "Joe", "Galvin was accommodating as I arrived early on a Sunday morning. The location near the central train station was fantastic for me to arrive and depart by the airport and also to go visit friends in Paramatta. The built in bench in the bedroom was very convenient for spreading out my stuff.   I liked having some good places to eat nearby. The Shakespere over on Devonshire had great food at a cheap price. If you want a great location for seeing Sydney and the surrounding neighborhoods this is the place to be."),
("2014-03-26", "794910", "Ken", "Very convenient location minutes walk away from Central train station.Gavin was very hospitable.  He walked me around town and showed me lots of places to see."),
("2014-04-05", "794910", "Zohreh", "We stayed at Gavins Place for some days.. It was very nice  Great Location and Gavin was a Great Host!! We had a wonderful Time.. You can walk everywhere from the Appartement. We had Really good conversations with Gavin and Would Love to go there again :)"),
("2014-04-21", "794910", "Lish", "We stayed at Gavin's for 2 nights and the experience was awesome!Location- very near to city/ china town etc all within walking distanceGavin was very accommodating as we arrived in the morning on a public holiday. He is a very easy going and hospitable host with minimum fuss and everything was well organized when we got there.Definitely recommend Gavin to those who would like to visit Sydney  we definitely will stay at his place if we visit Sydney again!Thanks Gavin!!"),
("2014-07-13", "794910", "HuiShan", "Gavin's place is extremely convenient & a short walk to some of the greatest meals on earth. I'll definitely be back the next time I'm in Sydney! The best part is that Gavin is always up for a conversation about anything (thanks for the insight into Australian politics!). Anyone who wants to experience the beautiful Surry Hills neighbourhood should stay here. It really is incredible."),
("2014-07-22", "794910", "Thomas", "Gavin was a great host! He was welcoming  friendly and great to speak with. He knows the area quite well and is always willing to offer advice. Although we didn't see him too much we were lucky enough to have Gavin come along to breakfast with us before we left. He showed us some great places to eat and was very entertaining. The room was exactly as advertised  except the bed was brand new and super comfortable. The bed in the current picture doesn't do it justice. Surry Hills is excellent. It's about a 10 minute walk from some great bars  and cafes and about a 5 minute walk from Central train station. Overall it was a wonderful stay."),
("2014-08-03", "794910", "肖", "Gavin's house is at the best location of Sydney  close to every thing. Gavin is a really nice guy."),
("2014-08-11", "794910", "Nicola", "Had a brilliant stay at Gavin's place  which is conveniently located a short walk (less than a minute) from Central Station and also a reasonably short walk (15 -20 mins) to Oxford Street. Gavin is a friendly and engaging host and made my brief stay enjoyable. "),
("2014-08-19", "794910", "Eduardo", "Gavin was a very nice and friendly host - I enjoyed a lot talking to Gavin about australian society  politics  aussie football and so on.Gavin's appartment is very well located - just a few step further and you are in Central Station - in a cool and trendy neighbourhood.About the room - it has been renovated  spacious and the matress is awesome :) Thanks Gavin and see you soon in Portugal or France!"),
("2014-08-24", "794910", "Jerome", "Had a great time  very personable and offered great advice on where to go  and what to do. Great location with good access to central station for trains/busses. I would totally stay with Gavin again! "),
("2014-08-31", "794910", "Tahnee", "Gavin's place is incredibly convenient  only a couple minutes walk from Central Station. This meant that on the morning we flew into Sydney we could go straight from the airport to Central by train and leave our suitcases there for the day while we did some sightseeing  then we picked up our cases in the evening and walked round the corner to Gavin's. Easy! And the place was so central that we could easily get to all the tourist destinations we wanted to either by foot or by a quick train ride from Central Station.Another great feature of Gavin's place was the bed - it was soooo comfortable! I actually came down with the flu whole we were there and had to spend a couple of days on bed  and having a cosy bed to sleep in all day really helped.Gavin was polite and friendly and gave us lots of privacy  which we appreciated. The place was clean and exactly as advertised. It's not a luxury hotel to spend lots of time hanging out in  it's more a convenient base to sleep in for people who want to spend their days out and about seeing Sydney.The only negative about the place is that we were there during an exceptionally cold and rainy week in Sydney  and the room had no heating so was very cold overnight. But I'm sure during a normal week of Sydney weather the room temperature would be perfect. We were just unlucky with the timing of our visit.All in all we recommend Gavin's place for anyone wanting a clean  easy  convenient base right in the middle of Sydney. Thanks  Gavin!"),
("2014-09-24", "794910", "Andrea", "Great location! Gavin's place is right around the corner from the busiest public transportation station in Sydney. This made getting around easy and allowed us to take full advantage of the time we had. The room was very spacious and had all the essentials. Gavin was a great host! He made us feel at home at all times and even asked us to join him to some local sporting events. He gave us great tips on Sydney  and answered any other questions we had. Overall a great place to stay in Sydney! "),
("2014-10-03", "794910", "Wenyin", "We enjoyed our stay at Gavin's place! He's a nice host who recommended some nice beaches and helped to plan our days in the lovely city of Sydney. This apartment is super clean and has nicely aired room. Will come back if we get the chance to revisit this wonderful country!"),
("2014-10-13", "794910", "Alicia", "Gavin was a great host. Very friendly easy to get on with and always welcoming. Always on hand to provide tips on resturants and local attractions.Anything we wanted was there. Bed really comfortable & quiet area easy to sleep. Very central location  we walked everywhere only used buses for beaches. The stop for these around the corner from apartment. Couldn't have asked for a better stay  thanks Gavin! Alicia & Mark "),
("2014-10-25", "794910", "Yunn Ru", "Our stay for four nights were great! And Gavin was a friendly & helpful host. The location is perfectly convenient as its close to the central station plus there are a lot of nice cafes around the neighborhood."),
("2014-10-31", "794910", "Jolien", "Gavin is a great host. He gave us great ideas (places to see). We enjoyed our stay very much. The location is great; lots of busses and trains within walking distance."),
("2014-11-09", "794910", "Angelika", "Great host. My friend and I felt very comfortable during our stay.   Gavin had an answer to all our touristical questions and it was nice to chat about other topics anyways. Loved the central location."),
("2015-04-26", "794910", "Iain", "The apartment is ideally located in a cool suburb of the city with plenty of bars and cafes nearby (we recommend the Dove & Olive!) The room was basic but clean  and Gavin kindly provided us with towels. Gavin was welcoming and helpful and able to offer local tips and travel information."),
("2015-05-04", "794910", "Brocherie", "Gavin's place is near central. It is a perfect situation. His apartment is huge and we had a good bedroom."),
("2015-05-17", "794910", "Philippe Et Claudie", "Gavin was really nice   easy to communicate with and flexible.The location of his place is ideal to visit Sydney. The bedroom is big and we could put our clothes away in the cupboard. We could easly cook in the kitchen."),
("2015-06-04", "794910", "Joel", "Gavin was very friendly and accommodating and easy to get along with. He made the stay really comfortable.His place was really tidy  clean  spacious (it's more spacious than the photos) and in a really convenient location (minutes from central station). I would definitely recommend!"),
("2015-06-10", "794910", "Kyle", "Gavin was such a hospitable host.  After I arrived at his place  a short  easy  and safe walk from Central Station  we went to coffee at one of his favorite local spots  which I appreciated and enjoyed.  The room in his apartment where I stayed was newly painted  comfortable  and clean  and the WiFi connection was solid  which enabled me to call home to the U.S. using (Hidden by Airbnb) .  Throughout my stay  I enjoyed my conversation with Gavin about sports  culture  and life  and he catered his assistance to my needs.  If you want a great location (especially if sticking to mass transit  which I recommend) and an even better host  I recommend staying here as Gavin helped to make my first days in  Australia enjoyable ones  and I thank him for it!"),
("2015-07-20", "794910", "David", "Excellent location  very comfy bed and Gavin great host  excellent value for money"),
("2015-07-28", "794910", "Jane", "Gavin made us feel very welcome.  The room is as described and is in a great location.  We really enjoyed our stay with Gavin in Surry Hills.  Thanks."),
("2015-08-17", "794910", "Paul", "The apartment was centrally located and convenient for visiting the city. Gavin was friendly and easy to get on with. We enjoyed our two days in Sydney."),
("2015-09-02", "794910", "Matthew", "Our stay with Gavin was perfect  his apartment is fantastic and he was an excellent host. I would recommend that anyone coming to Sydney stay here. "),
("2015-09-23", "794910", "Andrea", "Wir kamen sehr spät am Abend an. Wir fuhren mit dem Taxi zur Adresse und haben Ihm geschrieben  dass wir unten stehen. In ca 2 Minuten war er schon unten=)"),
("2015-11-11", "794910", "Andrew", "Friendly host  Lovely apartment  excellent location for surry Hills  City and Central station. "),
("2015-11-23", "794910", "Winnie", "Gavin is a nice guy to make my first Bnb experience fantastic. I appreciate him to host us after his long distance trip with jet lag. We were easy to talk with and get along well with each other. There're all same as describe  even much better than it  special room  comfy bed  clean and well-appointed home  excellent location... My mum and me definitely enjoyed staying at Gavin's place. There's no doubt that I will be there. I highly recommend you to stay at Gavin's place. "),
("2018-11-03", "794910", "Dougie", "A really handy spot to stay - close to everything and Gavin was very helpful and welcoming."),
("2018-11-19", "794910", "Cornelia", "Gavin is a very friendly  welcoming and helpful Host. His appartement is very central and is in the perfect area to explore the city by foot. I would really recommend staying in his appartement."),
("2018-11-28", "794910", "Yujia", "The room is really tidy and comfortable. The location is perfect  very near to the central station. Gavin is a nice person  very warmhearted and considerate. We will definitely choose there again when next time we come to Sydney!"),
("2019-01-02", "794910", "Selena", "Gavin is a very helpfull and great host! The location is perfect -> directly near central and Crown street! Thx for everything!!"),
("2019-01-28", "794910", "Judith", "Gavin is a very nice host.  The bedroom is on the second floor of unit. The air conditioner is excellent. We liked the location of the condo..  It is very convenient  a variety of restaurants."),
("2015-12-14", "8106459", "Kari", "Brendas place is absolutely wonderful. It's got a huge terrace with lots of space to hang out and relax. The apartment itself is wonderfully decorated and very cosy. The loacation is also brilliant - just a small stroll down to the beach and an easy bud travel to the city centre. We stayed here in just over a month with our to kids and loved it!"),
("2017-01-16", "8106459", "Anders", "My parents stayed in this apartment and here is what they had to say: ""Our stay in Brendas apartment was terrific! Brenda herself greeted us and gave us helpful hints and a tour of her stylish home. We were impressed by the lovely white towels   lovely bedlinen and even beachtowels for us to use  very thoughtful as we came all the way from Sweden! We loved the very nice and spacious home  which we quickly felt was cozy and easy to relax in. The apartment is tastefully furnished and decorated with Art Deco from the smallest items  furniture and lamps as well as interesting art. We had breakfast  lunch and dinners on the fantastic green and shaded terrace where we even could catch a glimps of Coogee Beach! Our stay in Sydney after Christmas was terrific  including precious family time with our two sons and their partners  as well as friends who also could stay in the extra bedroom. New Years Eve was celebrated on the terrace where we had a great view of the fireworks in Coogee. We could easily find the shops closeby and nice walks in the surroundings. Buses and subway took us around in Sydney in no time! We are happy to recommend Brenda as a friendly and trusting host and who knows  we might be back again soon!?"""),
("2017-02-19", "8106459", "Fiona", "Could not recommend this place more! My daughter and I stayed for 2 weeks in Brenda's place. Fantastic location  everything supplied that you would need. Beautiful apartment  & furnishings  comfortable beds and an outdoor balcony that you will not believe until you see! Easy walk to restaurants/pubs in Randwick and Coogee and to the beach. Thanks Brenda! "),
("2017-02-26", "8106459", "Maya", "Breandas  House was great  amazing artwork  clean and with everything you could ever need. We truly enjoyed that amazing Terrace and view.I would recommend Brenda's place for anyone  visiting  Coogee beach."),
("2017-03-03", "8106459", "Clarisse", "Fantastic stay. Brenda's flat is cosy and perfectly equiped for a several nights stay. Brenda is a very kind host and Coogee is a convenient location to explore SYdney without the hustle and bustle of the city. The beach is 7mn down the road and we enjoyed combining visits in Sydney and relaxing on the beach and in cafes in Coogee. There's a bit of traffic on the street so if you shouldn't be too fussy about noise. But for urban dwellers like us that was nothing compared to the quality of the stay. Thanks!"),
("2017-03-10", "8106459", "Paul", "Brenda's place is well worth a stay. It is quirky and the art alone fascinating.We would recommend the accommodation without hesitation."),
("2017-03-13", "8106459", "Marianne", "Brenda's place is full of art and sculptures. We also loved the spacious verandah. Quite close to cafes  groceries etc. We all loved our stay at Brenda's and would recommend it if you wanted to stay in Coogee. Thanks Brenda!"),
("2017-03-18", "8106459", "Gina", "Brenda's place is wonderfully furnished and gives off a very homely vibe. The beds were comfortable and all the amenities were working well. The place is located in a nice suburb very near to coogee beach. Supermarkets  convenience stores and eating places were also within walking distance.It's also a convenient location to stay in as many buses around the area bring you to the city center and other explore-worthy suburbs such as Surry Hills.Brenda was very communicative since the time booking was made till we checked in and the days we were there. She is a very hospitable host and me and my group of friends really enjoyed staying there.Would not hesitate to recommend! "),
("2017-04-06", "8106459", "Mary", "Brenda has a beautiful home. It is a perfect place for a quiet  relaxing stay close to all the Too spots in the area. We were visiting our Mum in hospital and we couldn't have found a better place. Brenda is a wonderful and welcoming host and I highly recommend her place to anyone. Regards  Mary"),
("2017-04-11", "8106459", "Richie", "Beautiful old apartment with good sized rooms and lots of sunlight  huge terrace which would be perfect for a sunny afternoon. Brenda is a great host and was very easy to deal with  highly recommend"),
("2017-04-18", "8106459", "Hannah", "A beautiful apartment! Brenda was very accommodating with our arrival and departure times. This is a great spot for easy bus routes in to Sydney and a 15 min walk to Coogee Beach and Randwick."),
("2019-01-11", "8106459", "Isobel", "A really lovely space with some very interesting decor which makes it more interesting than your average accommodation. Brenda is a lovely host and is quick to respond. The location is great with bus stops only a few minutes walk  so you can easily get into the city and around Sydney. The terrace is glorious so you are able to soak up the summer sun and eat outside. Many thanks Isobel"),
("2015-11-25", "8121226", "Sumin", "I stayed at Jenny's apartment in Potts Point for over a month and it was a perfect home away from home.  Jenny was an impeccable host.  So welcoming and accomodating - even when I locked myself out of the house she was around in five minutes to save me!  I loved every minute of my stay at the apartment.  Jenny's beautifully decked out apartment is a newly renovated studio  so compact but with everything you need - including a great kitchen and bathroom.   The location couldn't be better as you are in the heart of Potts Point  which is my favourite Sydney suburb.  My only wish is that I could have stayed longer!"),
("2015-12-04", "8121226", "Nathalie", "The apartment is very  pretty and is very properly placed. Thank you a lot. I advise this apartment for holydays in Sydney."),
("2015-12-19", "8121226", "Mark", "Great place to stay  the apartment has everything you could ask for. Jenny is very accommodating.It was just like staying in a hotel. I'd recommend staying if you are after an alternative to a hotel suite. I would stay again. "),
("2016-01-08", "8121226", "Jean Guy", "Jenny's apartment is as described and is located in the middle of a wonderfully eclectic neighborhood. the location is within a half hour of circular quay and the Opera House and the is a train station within a couple of minutes... easy access to most great spots in and around Sydney.Jenny was very accommodating on my arrival and departure  over an above what any hotel would do..."),
("2016-03-22", "8121226", "Lisa", "Jenny could not have been more accommodating or helpful.  The apartment was even nicer than the photos suggest.  Everything has been finished to a very high standard.  The area is vibrant and convenient."),
("2016-04-08", "8121226", "Ellen", "My stay at Jenny's place was fantastic. The apartment is thoughtfully and thoroughly appointed  and the location is unbeatable. Jenny is a gracious host  who is extremely responsive and kind. I highly recommend this apartment."),
("2016-06-03", "8121226", "Antoine", "Jenny was so nice with great advise.The place is great I recommend it.a"),
("2016-07-24", "8121226", "Olya", "Lovely clean and central flat. Jenny was very helpful and overall stay was pleasant. Would definitely return."),
("2016-08-18", "8121226", "Tom", "Jenny was extremely hospitable  the location is extremely convenient and the listing was accurate."),
("2016-08-30", "8121226", "Mikheily", "I've spent one week at Jenny's Studio. Location is good  Just few mins walk from Kings cross Tube station  There're lots of Bars  restaurants   Supermarkets   gyms and etc. Everything in a walking distance.She was so sweet and nice to me  good communication and friendly.Studio is like same size as hotel room but has kitchen too.I liked this place and I will return .Thanks Jenny."),
("2017-01-29", "8121226", "Sebastien", "I booked Jenny's place for my parents as they were visiting from overseas. Jenny is a great host and really responsive to any messages/questions/issues. The place was clean  well-equipped and central. Great location which makes it easy to visit around. The building is not recent but the apartment is  well renovated with all modern amenities such as washing machine  dryer  air conditioning (definitely a plus in summer). It doesn't have a view but it didn't bother my parents as they were just there at night."),
("2017-02-14", "8121226", "Carolina", "Jenny's apartment is the perfect place to have everything you need while getting to know Sydney. It is close to public transport which makes everything easier  but it is also close to the city so if your in the mood to walk it would be perfect! Communication was great and Jenny is a very nice host! Made my stay really good. "),
("2017-03-18", "8121226", "Ludmila", "The place is very well equipped with everything that we needed during our 4 weeks stay. The location is excellent! Close to public transport  Sydney most beautiful parks  etc. Jenny is a very nice host who gave us a warm check in. We were happy to stay at the apartment and would certainly come back. "),
("2017-05-21", "8121226", "Alessandra", "Jenny is the most ideal host and that's  because she's just a lovely human being. Everything was most ideal. Being completely new to Airbnb myself I felt safe and comfortable. Is there anything more you'd want?"),
("2017-06-03", "8121226", "Grzegorz", "Me and my wife have spent a very nice week at Jenny's apartment. Studio was clean  well-equipped with everything that we needed. Location is very good  close to the public transport  just a few minutes walk to the Kings Cross station. There are lots of bars  restaurants  supermarket in the neighborhood.Jenny and Simon are a very nice and helpful. Check in was quick and nice  despite it was a late evening. Summarizing - everything was perfect. We hope to be back to Sydney and this lovely place."),
("2017-06-18", "8121226", "Melissa", "Location was good  2 minutes walk to the train station  2 supermarkets which were each 5 minutes away. The weekend market was so interesting and the food sold was great. The studio was well-equipped and saw to all our needs. There were many eateries around  a police station nearby. It's safe  well furnished. It's a 10-15 min ride to the city which makes it very convenient. Jenny  our host  was prompt in her responses and made sure we were comfortable throughout. "),
("2017-08-13", "8121226", "Hillary", "Jenny was great! She was very accommodating with our early morning flight and check in. The apartment is cute and cozy and in a perfect location. The train is a short walk away and the bus stop is right outside the building. The apartment was clean and had everything we needed for the week!"),
("2017-08-29", "8121226", "Scott", "I really loved staying in Jenny's meticulously designed and brilliantly anticipated apartment in Pott's Point (King's Cross). I've stayed in a lot of places all over the world in the last few years  so I've become more and more aware of well-planned and practical design. This place was one of the best designed I've ever been in. I stayed for 2 weeks and was perfectly comfortable using it as a home base the entire time. It's not big at all though  but the layout flows so nicely you shouldn't mind. I think it's great for a single traveler or maybe a vey cosy couple  but I wouldn't recommend it for more (though Jenny also does the same). The building is centrally located and the halls are a bit dingy  but they open up to a really fun and bright apartment  like a nice secret surprise. I highly recommend it!"),
("2017-12-09", "8121226", "Sofia", "Jenny is a great host: super kind  quick replies and so easy do get along with - thanks for that!The apartment look like on the fotos. It is pretty small but clean and cute  with everything you may need.The only negative thing was the house itself  which looks old and a bit dirty. But I’ll be clear here: this is nothing what Jenny could change.So  thanks a lot for your help and your recommendations! I really enjoyed Sydney and especially staying in your beautiful little studio apartment."),
("2018-01-11", "8121226", "Colin", "Fantastic little appartment in a great location  about 30 mins walk from sydney opera house or if you prefer about 5 mind walk to kings cross station from where you can go anywhere  a very well appointed place and spotlessly clean"),
("2018-01-27", "8121226", "Matilda", "Had a great stay at Jenny's place. The apartment is in a very convenient location  close to shops and the train station. The apartment had everything we needed and was super clean. Highly recommend."),
("2018-02-03", "8121226", "Nick", "My partner and I had a fantastic stay in Jenny's apartment. It’s the perfect base for exploring Sydney. Awesome neighborhood with lots of character. Make sure to check out the weekend markets across the road. While the building is a little rustic  the apartment has been renovated extremely well. Modern  clean  every amenity you’d need. As the description states - it’s a pied-à-terre. But we found it a-ok for a couple. Also communication was fantastic. Would definitely stay there again."),
("2018-03-30", "8121226", "Walter", "Wonderfully modular pied-à-terre that truly felt like home for my 2 months there. Recommend!"),
("2018-04-09", "8121226", "Rachel", "Jenny was very nice and sweet  we felt welcomed once we arrived. When me and my boyfriend lost our wallets at Bondi Beach  we were offered to help with money and were also allowed to rearrange with the check out time. The apartment is perfect for couple  compact but has everything you need and is well decorated. Lots of good cafes around the area  Kings Cross station is only 5 mins away. Good experience :)"),
("2018-07-31", "8121226", "Andre", "Just stayed there for 3 months! Had a really great time  the apartment has everything you need Jenny and Simon are just great! They helped me on everything I needed! This is the place to go  for sure!"),
("2018-10-12", "8121226", "Tora", "I cannot recommend Jenny's place highly enough - lots of lovely little touches to make it feel like home  super communicative and helpful hosts  and a wonderful easy location!"),
("2018-10-20", "8121226", "Travis", "Was a great location on edge of CBD  heaps of great restaurants and cafes around  easy walk to Kings cross station  a nice market across the road on the weekend in front of the police station and fountain area  house inside was cosy but too small"),
("2018-11-30", "8121226", "Sawako", "I stayed Jenny’s place for about a month and I had been happy to stay there. Jenny’s place was amazingly clean and had everything I needed. Easy check-in/out. Location was convenient  easy access to public transport  only 5 mins walk to Kings Cross Station and less than 5 mins walk to grocery  chemist and post office. Jenny and Simon were friendly  super kind  excellent communication  quick response and helpful all the time! I would absolutely recommend Jenny’s place. Thank you Jenny and Simon for being the best host!!"),
("2018-12-11", "8121226", "Samantha", "We stayed 7 nights at Jenny's apartment and loved everything about it! Communication with Jenny was easy and she was flexible and let us keep our suitcases in the apartment after we checked out. Would highly recommend to anyone visiting Sydney!"),
("2016-04-12", "8130620", "Fraser", "This was a great place to stay. Heaps of room for an inner city apartment in a leafy area. Great views from the deck. Sara met us in the carpark and showed us to the apartment and was friendly and informative about access to shops  transport and to the city. The kitchen had everything we needed to cook a meal and the shops and fish market are really close to source ingredients. We'd definitely stay here again. Very clean and homely."),
("2016-04-18", "8130620", "Ange", "Sara was a fantastic host.  Prior to our stay she was easy to communicate with  responded quickly and with no fuss.  Sara met us on the grounds of her apartment and showed us around on arrival.  The apartment was clean and tidy and in a great location.  We enjoyed our stay. "),
("2016-04-25", "8130620", "Sandy", "Sara was a lovely host  she had great communication and was extremely helpful. Her apartment is located in a prime area of Glebe; directly adjacent to the main street  which has many cafes and restaurants. The place is very tidy and cosy with a stunning balcony view."),
("2016-06-13", "8130620", "Savvas", "This was my firs time booking via Airbnb  and thoroughly enjoyed my stay.The place was clean  roomy  ideally situated  and with a fantastic view of the Sydney CBD and the harbour itself."),
("2016-06-27", "8130620", "Busiku", "This was our first time booking via airbnb  and the process was pretty straight forward. Sara was very nice  helpful and easy to get in touch with.Her apartment is nice and tidy and has amazing views.Plenty of shops/cafes in walking distance.Overall a really impressive stay  would recommend her apartment to anyone heading to sydney."),
("2016-07-25", "8130620", "Brock", "Great spot  amazing  view"),
("2016-10-03", "8130620", "Richard And Liz", "Sara's apartment is in a great location to plenty of convenience stores  cafes  takeaways and a bottle store. Handy to the buses and light rail system  but there is a bit of a uphill hike if you get off at the Glebe Station - it's a much easier walk if you get off at Jubliee Park Station.She was very easy to deal with and flexible with the time to meet us and responded to messages promptly during our stay. Was a great space with all the amenities that you need  plus more - our wee girl loved all the toys and books (Thanks for having these available)."),
("2016-11-06", "8130620", "Steve", "The views were  amazing   most of the time spent in the apartment were out on the balcony taking in the scenery . We felt like we were in a home from home the apartment was lovely and clean and the area was nice and quiet but just a few mins drive from the city centre . It had everything we needed and Sara responded immediately with any queries we had. It was a lovely place to stay and if I ever return to Sydney will be looking to book with Sara again"),
("2016-12-04", "8130620", "Cheng", "The host is easy to communicate with  and give a help efficiently."),
("2016-12-11", "8130620", "Ingrid", "Excellent city views can be enjoyed form a delightful balcony - excellent pool as well."),
("2017-01-21", "8130620", "Eduardo", "Really good place  quiet quartier and amazing  views. It is possible to go on foot to the main places of the city. Comunnication was perfect with Sara."),
("2017-02-27", "8130620", "Katharine", "Great location!! Short walk to Glebe shops  bus and restaurant. Second bedroom is for a child  not suitable for an adult. "),
("2017-06-11", "8130620", "Thomas", "Sara was welcoming and the flat was tidy and ready for our stay"),
("2017-07-10", "8130620", "Jennifer", "Fantastic family apartment! It is great to have a break away and be able to have a separate room from the kids. Sara went above and beyond providing a high chair  port a cot and sharing her daughters toys; our boys loved it.The view and location was amazing  the apartment clean and stylish. We would really like to stay again next time we are in Sydney."),
("2018-02-17", "8130620", "David", "Sara was an excellent host  very responsive to questions and made check in easy. Place was clean  comfortable  as described with beautiful view and a great location. Would happily book again."),
("2018-03-03", "8130620", "振华", "The host canceled this reservation 33 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-03-04", "8130620", "Dean", "We loved staying at Sara's. The place easily big enough for 4 adults and really close to both the CBD and surrounding Sydney. She welcomed us and made as sure we had everything we needed   and even let us stay late on Sunday. Definitely would stay again if back in Sydney!"),
("2018-05-30", "8130620", "Tiano And Ali", "Sarah property was everything we were looking for  clean  spacious  comfortable and located on a very good location. Definitely recommend anyone to stay there. Very suitable for couples and small families. The host was also very friendly."),
("2018-06-11", "8130620", "Versha", "Sara was a great host and has a great place to stay. Great view of the city."),
("2018-06-17", "8130620", "Jan Julius & Marlou", "Sara was just lovely. She was very quick and accurate in her communication and the apartment is just perfect. You fee that the people living there really love living there  as we did. The view is to die for. Our kids loved all the toys they could play with."),
("2018-07-24", "8130620", "Renee", "Thanks for letting us stay at your place.  The visitor parking was full everyday we stayed.  So was a bit concerning during the 2 hour limit times during the week.  The light in your daughters room being out was disappointing and the lamp bulb blew on our last night.  Otherwise we had a great time and loved staying.  Close to tram and local shops.  Would definitely recommend and stay again."),
("2018-12-03", "8130620", "Willis", "Excellent communication service and provided a lovely accomodation. Would recommend."),
("2019-01-02", "8130620", "William", "Sara's place has an incredible set-up  view  and more importantly  a kind and wonderful host!"),
("2019-01-28", "8130620", "Pauline", "Sara's home was just perfect for us. Large 2 bedroom  in a great location with views of the city. It was clean and comfortable with little touches like Netflix and Wifi. Sara's was a great communicator.. thanks so much 5 out of 5! Will def stay again next time in Sydney."),
("2015-12-04", "8242333", "Anna", "Kirrilly was very welcoming from the moment I booked the stay. She made it super easy to pick up the keys and find the flat and then she left us tea  coffee  chocolate and milk and bread plus extras in the fridge. The apartment was compact but cute - a good size for a couple to stay and we were completely at home and relaxed there. It's clean and bright with all mod cons and very reasonably priced for the fabulous location.Mosman is a bit of a hidden gem of Sydney - one of the most beautiful and fancy spots yet so convenient and with not to much tourist traffic. The flat is right near Mosman shops and there are buses straight into town or down to Manly.Best of all you can walk down the hill and find yourself at gorgeous Balmoral beach. We had hot chips down there every other day and strolled around  even going for a few early summer swims. Glorious!Do yourself a favour and stay at Kirrilly's."),
("2017-08-26", "8242333", "Eleanor", "The host canceled this reservation 125 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-09-14", "8242333", "Phil", "The place was exactly what we were after. The location was excellent and Kirrilly was great to deal with."),
("2017-09-17", "8242333", "Lin", "I stayed at Kirrilly's beautiful & well-equipped apartment with a friend who was visiting from interstate.  We both loved it here! The apartment is in a security block in a quiet street  located near to a bus stop  where you can catches buses to & from the city & Chatswood from very early in the morning till very late at night. The apartment is only a 5-10 min walk to Balmoral Beach & a 15-20 min walk to the start of The Spit To Manly coastal walk. The bed & sofa are both very comfortable & the apartment is very nicely decorated & spacious  with good heating.  Kirrilly was a friendly & very helpful host & absolutely wonderful to deal with! I would highly recommend this place to anyone looking for a good place to stay in Sydney. Thanks to Kirrilly & AirBnB for such a great holiday rental experience!  :-)"),
("2015-09-15", "8277472", "Lorraine", "The hosts Elizabeth and Simon are extremely welcoming hosts with lots of helpful tips to get around Sydney. The room was well appointed  very clean and comfortable with a gorgeous private marble bathroom located nearby. There are a few stairs but easily manageable with luggage. Elizabeth provided a concise list of all information making access to the Internet and building really easy. Would highly recommend this location for an awesome holiday experience. The hosts have gone above and beyond to make my holiday wonderful and I thank them again for it."),
("2015-09-18", "8277472", "Jane", "This was a wonderful experience. The picture doesn't do justice. It's in a very modern apartment in a historical building  the room is quiet  private  simply and elegantly furnished  with a dreamily comfortable bed.   Glebe Point Road is close by  and so it is very convenient for shops  buses etc  but there is little noise.   Elizabeth and Simon were kind  thoughtful and welcoming.  I recommend this without reservation  except for people who need to have the bathroom on the same level as the bedroom."),
("2015-09-27", "8277472", "Benjumin", "Great host! Made us feel very welcome. Would be happy to stay there again when in Sydney"),
("2015-10-03", "8277472", "荆景", "My poor vocabulary cannot describe how my wife and I love this family and how wonderful this experience is. Just see some details.*Day 1  when I saw Elizabeth standing at front door  waiting for us arriving  I have already felt moved.*One of my suitcases  with most of our clothes in it  got lost when I landed. Elizabeth offered her daughter's dresses to my wife just in case she has nothing to change. How thoughtful!*She collected some useful travel tips and printed on a piece of A4 paper so we can save a lot of time searching all these info.*We cooked and had dinner together just like a family  and also shared an old movie in the night before we leave. Elizabeth and Simon have travelled a lot of places all around the world. If you are also a fan of tour-all the world  they are the best people to talk with. And you will learn a lot."),
("2015-10-11", "8277472", "Michael", "Elizabeth is a delightful host  she and her husband Simon made us feel most welcome in their lovely and tranquil home. The bedroom was bright  airy and peaceful. The bed  was very comfortable and the bathroom private  spacious and spotlessly clean. Our visit was brief but Elizabeth and Simon were ""easy-going"" and very friendly  they made us feel at home and we would happily stay with them again. Thank you both."),
("2015-10-24", "8277472", "Hash", "I stayed with Elizabeth and Simon for around 2 weeks and it was like being at home. They are really nice people and treated me like a family. Elizabeth went out of her way to accommodate me and i still miss Simons cooking and spending time with me. I could not speak any more highly of them that i do and would definitely live with them if ever needed.  They are like family."),
("2015-10-26", "8277472", "Jayden", "Elizabeth and Simon are wonderful friendly hosts.I have never stayed in foreigner house.So when i arrived in front of Elizabeth house  I was a little bit scared.But she welcomed us glad. So we were happy and relief.Although I can not speak English well she tried to listen to me.And when I could not understand her say  she was carefully explained again.And i'm not going to forget dinner that they prepared for us. Simon is good chef. :)  Thank you for your kindness.Glebe is so peaceful.And house has comfortable bed  nice interior and very clean bathroom.I will miss them and lovely cat Lady. I wanna meet again.Thank you for everything!"),
("2015-10-29", "8277472", "Sophie", "I had a wonderful stay in Glebe with wonderful friendly hosts  a lovely room  comfortable bed  clean bathroom and peaceful location.  Thank you to you both for sharing your home with me  it was lovely to meet you and I will hope to stay with you again in the future when I'm back in Sydney."),
("2015-11-17", "8277472", "Ika", "Both Eliz and Simon were so kind. It was the best airbnb stay for us to date. The room was very cozy and private  just the way we like it. Feels like home  Simon cooked for us dinner and it was fantastic. The location is not too far from the city. Definitely a recommended stay. "),
("2015-11-23", "8277472", "Irene", "Elisabeth and Simon were fantastic host. They made us feel immediately like home.The room is very cosy  clean and quiete and with your own tv and reading sofa.The bed was very confortable ( better than my own!)They assisted us with every single request we had  always with a smile.They even cooked dinner for us and it was really delicious.Very convinient location ( the bus stop is just around the corner with different bus taking you to the city centre(10 minutes) or to the beach(30 minutes).Simon and Elisabeth have a great sense of hospitality and they are really nice person to chat with.Located in a very quiete and tranquil area. I would definitely go back  as it was like being home away from home."),
("2015-11-28", "8277472", "Matthew", "Many good things can be said about the room and atmosphere Elizabeth and Simon provide. They are down to earth people and gladly help you in anyway they can. Everything was clean and the bed was comfy. The location is great for sightseeing with light rail and buses close by."),
("2015-12-07", "8277472", "Anne & Daniel", "Elizabeth and Simon were just terrific and greeted us at their beautiful appartment. They were always available if we had any questions during our stay. They cooked a delicious breakfast for us and during our stay they offer us a glass a champagne. The appartment was everything advertised and it was even better than we expected. The room was clean and very confortable with all amenities that you could need. Its easy to travel all around the city and the area is one of the best area in Sydney. Elizabeth and Simon we really enjoyed your kind hospitality."),
("2016-01-13", "8277472", "Kim", "I spent a wonderful week at this great apartment in Glebe in the heart of Sydney.  The apartment is very clean and tidy  very spacious and the host's niece made me very welcome. My large room had an extremely comfortable double bed and I slept soundly every night. There was plenty of storage and wardrobe space to hang my clothes. I had my own bathroom with a walk in shower that was amazingly hot and powerful.  There is WiFi throughout  a kitchen for cooking meals and a lovely lounge area to relax in and watch TV. The apartment itself is situated just off Glebe Point Road with at least 3 buses running directly to the city centre and beaches. Get an Opal card and use the buses which stop at the end of the road. The apartment was really quiet with no outside noise. The hosts were in contact throughout if I needed help or advice and provided travel books and handy tourist information that I used to get about. I loved the location best of all and would recommend walking three blocks down to the waters edge where there is a beautiful park  that is a hidden gem."),
("2016-11-06", "8277472", "Dave", "This safe and beautiful tree-lined suburb  with easy access by foot or very regular public transport to the Airport  Sydney city and surrounds  made a stay in Glebe perfect.  Every type of restaurant  cafe  store etc are just around the corner. The room and spacious bathroom were immaculately clean  and our hosts Elizabeth and Simon made us feel incredibly welcome - almost part of the family.  We look forward to returning again  and recommend Elizabeth and Simon's beautiful home to anyone looking for a relaxing stay in Sydney  with the chance to meet two fantastic new friends. "),
("2016-11-17", "8277472", "Debbie", "I couldn't rate this place highly enough. Elizabeth and Simon were wonderful hosts  there were extremely accommodating  making me feel very much at home. The house is lovely  it's a comfortable bed and the room is accompanied by an amazing shower. I'd definitely stay here again. Best airbnb stay I've had to date."),
("2016-11-21", "8277472", "Daniela", "wonderful and welcoming hosts  beautiful room in a lovely neighbourhood with many little cafes and restaurants  about 30 mins walking to Darling Harbour and about an hour to the Opera House  definitely recommended "),
("2016-11-26", "8277472", "Isabella", "I had an amazing time at Elizabeth and Simons home in Sydney. They're so lovely! Couldn't have asked for a better place to stay. They cooked me breakfast  dinner and every night we had a glas of wine together. I will definitely come back and stay with these incredible people again."),
("2016-11-30", "8277472", "Hilary", "We had a wonderful stay at Elizabeth and Simon's home. Our hosts were most welcoming and helpful.  Their home is modern  stylish and beautifully looked after. Glebe itself is a vibrant place within easy access of the city centre. It has a village feel  with plenty of restaurants and bars (we ate there every night).  We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Elizabeth's place and would definitely put it top on our places to stay when in Sydney."),
("2016-12-03", "8277472", "Kym", "Elizabeth's hospitality blew me away.  The room and our own bathroom were immaculate and we had everything we needed for our stay.  Elizabeth was a warm and friendly host and also provided us with a lovely warm breakfast as part of the stay.Glebe is an amazing area and Elizabeth's home is well located close to the shops  the light rail and Darling Harbour all being in walking distance.  I'm so glad I got to stay in such a lovely home.  Thank you!"),
("2017-03-26", "8277472", "Nicole", "Well  this was by far the best Accommodation experience I have ever had  after travelling 5 months around the world  that's a big call. It was really easy to get from the Airport and back and forth to the ICC at Darling Harbour. They were the most hospitable hosts you could wish to have  your own bathroom and comfy bed with plenty of room to move. So many restaurants to choose from and a huge Shopping Centre just up the road. I almost cried when I had to leave. Thank you sooo much.  "),
("2017-05-02", "8277472", "Lorraine", "Awesome location with hosts who offer excellent hospitality. They are generous with their efforts in comfort and companionship if you want it  and they have excellent knowledge on Sydney plus locations around the world. A top little find!"),
("2017-10-02", "8277472", "Philip", "Charming obliging and gracious hosts  generous and accommodating. The room is pleasant and well-furnished  with a large comfortable bed. Small thing missing  I'd have liked a bedside table. Bathroom perfect. Would certainly recommend to anyone  and I'll check if the room is available next time I'm in that part of the world."),
("2017-10-08", "8277472", "Bin", "It's my first time to use this service in Sydney  I was a little nervous  not very sure what kind of place I would dwell in  not sure who I am going to deal with to be honest. I was totally relaxed after the initial communication with her  she is very kind and warm  she kept on informing me what necessary matters  even including parking. When I arrived in front of her house  which is right behind the historical Valhalla cinema at Glebe  my eyes wildly opened  her place is sitting in an old-style building with a beautiful garden  a nice bobbling fountain. She met me and lead to my place  when I stepped in the room  my jaws fell on the ground and it took me a few minutes to pick them up and closed. In a big room  sits a nice iron-framed bed  the bedding looks like an oil painting  very artistic. The space is much more bigger than I would expect. The owner hearted prepare fruits  snacks and even bottled water  that is so touched  everyone who lives in Sydney would know drinking water is not an issue at all  however she prepares the bottled water  when she realized that I drink more water  she prepared jags of them  you know what  she even used the food wrapper to cover it. The independent bathroom is also big  she would clean it up everyday  when you step in it  it looks like it isn't being used at all  there is no a drop of water on the glass door  mirror  or wherever you would think it would be.Both her husband and herself are super nice to the guest  even though I am a horrible one  hardly communicate with them  except basic greetings. How terrible I am. The night before I go back to China  both of them prepared a farewell dinner for me  but I bailed  you can see how a terrible guest I am. Her location is wonderful  next to Glebe point road  It's easy to walk around the neighbourhood  beautiful cafes  restaurants  stores and bus stops are within two minutes walking distance. Her place is so beautiful  I would wake up in the birds' singing every morning  sometimes  her cute house cat would come and greet you.Stay at her place is a wonderful experience  like staying at home…this would carve in my brain for a long long time."),
("2017-11-05", "8277472", "Gwen", "Great location  very comfortable accommodation  own bathroom! But best of all  outstanding hospitality & kindness. Elizabeth & Simon were so welcoming  & Elizabeth was extremely helpful by communicating frequently before we arrived. Highly recommended!"),
("2017-11-15", "8277472", "Jimmy", "Elizabeth y Simon son grandes anfitriones  con una casa muy bonita y confortable para alojarse  su hospitalidad y el lugar son recomendados."),
("2017-11-19", "8277472", "Joan", "Very hospitable and quick responses to requests.Great location  close to public transport (bus & light rail)."),
("2017-11-23", "8277472", "Lisa", "Great location. Great room to stay. Friendly hosts."),
("2017-12-10", "8277472", "Gavin", "Excellent host and a great location  highly recommend."),
("2016-03-30", "8356824", "Kaan", "Awesome spot. Very clean and spacious. Would definitely recommend"),
("2016-11-24", "8356824", "Suthan", "Great place clean and a great host close to everything you need."),
("2016-12-28", "8356824", "Courtney", "Good location."),
("2016-12-31", "8356824", "Elena", "Great location  smooth check in & excellent communication. Loved the Xmas tree :) Thank you Sandra for having us at your place. "),
("2017-01-28", "8356824", "Kate", "Amazing location close to the beach and restaurants at Bondi. Apartment is cosy and comfortable."),
("2017-02-11", "8356824", "Kristine", "Sandra's apartment was very clean  comfortable bed  when you opened the windows a great breeze came through  for it was very hot in Sydney while we were there for the weekend. Very close to everything  beach down one street.Near the famous Icebergs club which is a must when you visit Sydney.  Would recommend for long or short stays thankyou to Sandra for having my husband & myself. "),
("2017-03-11", "8356824", "Stanislav", "Great location  close to the beaches and all amenities. Cozy and beautiful one bedroom apartment for great value. My dad felt like at home and Sandra's hospitality and communication is top notch. There is not be a better place to stay for my family! Thank you Sandra! "),
("2017-03-28", "8356824", "Diana", "The apartment is located 5mins walking from the Bondi beach in a quiet residential area. Sandra was very nice and responsive. The check in and check out went very smoothly. We had few issues with the apartment's cleanliness but nevertheless we have enjoyed the stay :)"),
("2017-04-03", "8356824", "Emma", "Great place to stay. Would stay again"),
("2017-04-10", "8356824", "Tricia", "Lovely place 5mins walk from beach..lots of shops + bars closeby.buses to city within 5mins walk.really comfy cosy apartment."),
("2018-01-01", "8356824", "Cara", "We had a great experience in Sandra's place! It was wonderful being just a few minutes away from the beach and heart of Bondi  and Sandra's place was very clean and well kept. In addition  we appreciated her thorough directions  great food/drink recommendations  quick response times  and hospitality all the way through.  We would definitely stay here again!"),
("2015-12-26", "8392955", "Jan", "The house is really wonderful. We were warmly welcomed and got a delicious apple strudel - a great start after arriving on a long flight from Europe. The garden is a small green paradise. Walk into Manly is roughly 20 min. We highly appreciated our stay and would love to come back."),
("2016-01-03", "8392955", "Steph", "Absolutely wonderful stay at a beautiful home! Thank you so much Helen  you were helpful and went above and beyond during the whole booking process. Place was spotless when we arrived and beautifully decorated. Would 100% recommend and come back. Thank you "),
("2017-01-02", "8392955", "Kari", "Thank you Helen! We had a lovely time over new year at your gorgeous place. The house was so homey which was much needed for us during or travels. The place was spotless for our arrival and Helen kindly left us a welcome gift and also allowed us to help ourselves to things from the fridge and pantry. She was very easy to contact and get hold of both prior to and during our stay. Thank you so much! Happy New Year :)"),
("2018-01-05", "8392955", "Joel", "The house was amazing  even better than the photos make it look. In particular the backyard was very nice and private. The location was also great -  within walking distance of Manly beach and the wharf  making it easy to get into the city via the ferry. The three bathrooms was good to have. It should be noted that as the house has four levels there are quite a few stairs. Helen was very friendly and responsive."),
("2016-01-02", "8397068", "Tina", "My friends and me had here a perfect time over christmas and NYE!Jo have a really beautiful and cosy home with 2 bed- and bathrooms  a big balcony with a BBQ and a great view over Brookvale/Manly. And she is so helpful and very friendly!Because Jo was not in town  her awesome mother in law gave us the key. We were allowed to check in at 8am because our bus arrived earlier and we were also allowed to check out later - she is really helpful and straightforward  too! The busstation to Sydney CBD is only a few minutes away and the bus takes about 30-45 min.The wifi is good and Jo has a lot of DVDs for the TV as well. The apartment situated on a big hill;  great for views  but tiring with suitcases! ;)We where thrilled and we can highly recommend this apartment ..we would love to come back one time."),
("2017-01-28", "8397068", "Cherie", "The boys really enjoyed their stay in the apartment  great value for money and so close to the shopping centre!  Jo was flexible with check in and a great communicator.  Thanks again Jo!"),
("2017-02-26", "8397068", "Garry", "Great generous hosts. We'll miss it (hope to be back one day)  Very comfy and homily.  A nice Soft Landing for us :)"),
("2018-01-03", "8397068", "Jorge", "Me and my friends who stayed here had such a wonderful time over New Years and a big part of that was Jo’s place. Before arrival Jo was so helpful in sending through information in what could be done in the immediate surrounding area.Due to time restraints we couldn’t do everything but we certainly had a go at and discovered some little gems we other wouldn’t have known about.The place itself was cosy and had a lovely warmth to it. Everything that we expected for our stay was met and exceeded. The accommodation of an early check in given the long flight in was especially appreciated.Highly recommended. Thanks for everything!"),
("2018-01-07", "8397068", "Kyrie", "Jo has a lovely place in a beautiful location. close to public transport and easy for us with a car to get around. beaches and shops very close by. Jo was very quick to respond with any questions and very helpful and welcoming. Would gladly stay again."),
("2018-08-05", "8397068", "Scott", "Wonderful place for our weekend stay  thank so much Jo!"),
("2019-01-02", "8397068", "Sue", "Very compact apartment. A bit small for four adults plus luggage. As this is someone’s home  there is little space to put your own things. Nice to have two bathrooms though.It is up a very steep hill in one of Sydney’s suburbs . You do need a car but you can walk to the main road to get buses etc. We were there over a heatwave at New year and being a top floor unit  it was very warm. There are fans but no A/C. Jo had left things in the fridge for us to use  plus some beers which were appreciated and was always contactable to answer any questions."),
("2015-10-11", "8408379", "Florian", "Well I felt very comfortable in my room and the living area ""warmly atmosphere "".  Karen is a really pretty person she's always up for a friendly conversation ready and gives good tips for everything! The location is perfect  close the City and to the beaches:) I'll never forget the time with Karen here  and can only recommend this accommodation. Peace & love Florian "),
("2016-10-03", "8408379", "Peter", "The host canceled this reservation 87 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-10-08", "8408379", "Max", "Karen was a fantastic host throughout our stay  she made us feel welcome and did everything she could to help us. The home has a lot of character and is in a great location  half way between Waverley and Bondi Junction so getting around was simple."),
("2016-10-14", "8408379", "Renate", "Karen was a very nice and good host. She answered quickely and give information and tips for nice places to eat  to visit and how to travel. The room and the bathroom were clean and very comfortable and the kitchen and livingroom were als nice to use. It is a very attractively house with garden and I felt really home. The location is very good  because close to beaches and to a bus/train station."),
("2016-10-30", "8408379", "John", "离邦迪海滩非常近 走路十分钟就到了 靠海边那块全是这种house 车也不多很安静｡附近有商场和购物街道 房东人也很好 想在邦迪海滩附近玩的值得推荐｡"),
("2015-10-12", "8559496", "Ian", "Thanks Tiger! Your place was just great for what I needed - spotlessly clean  the bed the height of comfort and the location near the airport excellent. Your communication and welcome made me feel very at home! This was a really great stay. I suggest using the bus to and from airport. It's quicker  cheaper (A$2.10 and avoids the unjust cost of the train (A$9.20 to travel 2 stations!). The bus is about 100 metres away."),
("2015-10-16", "8559496", "Roland", "Everything perfectI recommend this place to everyoneVery clean and comfortable"),
("2015-10-24", "8559496", "Marianna", "Living with Tiger was a great experience!Alltough we booked just one day before Tiger prepared everything and made us feel very welcome everytime! (He also took pictures from the complex the street his flat to explain how we can find everything and to make sure that we can't get lost- so cute :D )His flat is so lovely and very clean.Tiger had to work during our stay but he offered help anytime. Thank you again! :)We had space and much time on our own he really cared about us.Thank you for everything Tiger! Hopefully we can return some day because we couldn't say goodbye :(All the best for you!Marianna&Fabiola"),
("2015-12-19", "8559496", "Gregor", "Good place to stay. Very good traffic links."),
("2016-03-30", "8559496", "Jamie", "Thank you for everything Tiger! A great  clean and tidy place  easy location  and Tiger helped me plan my sightseeing in Sydney. He was really easy to contact during my stay  everything was great. I hope to return soon!"),
("2016-05-24", "8559496", "Xj_my2003", "I had an unforgettable time in Sydney. Staying at Tiger's place is such a joy and extra point to that. The place is right above the station  u don't even need to think about miss the direction. Taking the train from airport just 2 stops (I remember is 5 mins?)  and walk downstairs to catch the train to city  circular quay  Hyde Park  Western area or north part of Sydney  and anywhere  you can't think of any more convenient. Woolworth is just opposite of the road  lots of cafe and restaurants just downstairs  which the place is located on a quite street. I'm very glad I didn't choose another place which looks also close and similar but is on a noise street.  Tiger's place is spacious  clean  modern and well organized. There are some flight noises in the morning but I didn't even notice. The most comfortable bed I have ever had when traveling overseas  of course my own bed at home is the best. :)Tiger is a friendly funny man  he helped a lot while I'm staying at this beautiful. Thanks again  I'll come back again. Highly recommended."),
("2016-08-13", "8559496", "Yin", "Tiger is a great host. The place is accurately described. It is by the train station and 2 stops away from Central station. It is tidy  clean and modern. I cannot recommend enough. "),
("2016-11-12", "8559496", "Imogen & Bob", "Tiger was a very friendly host  I enjoyed my stay here. I was in Sydney for a conference in Mascot airport  so the location was absolutely perfect for me. The public transport was literally at our doorstep which made getting around very easy for me. Thanks for making my stay in Sydney an enjoyable one Tiger  it was nice to have met you and share life experiences!"),
("2016-11-26", "8559496", "Maryame", "Beautiful  very good  perfect  clean. 5 stars!!! "),
("2017-02-10", "8559496", "Clément", "The apartment is perfect and Tiger too"),
("2017-03-07", "8559496", "Markus", "It was a great time at Tigers place. His flat is clean and beautiful and directly over the train station. Tiger is very helpful and makes your time in Sydney more comfortable."),
("2017-03-12", "8559496", "Jan-David", "Tiger is a very nice and friendly guy. I really enjoyed the stay. I got a lot of advices where to go and what to do. So I can really recommend to stay at his home."),
("2018-03-11", "8559496", "Luke", "Tiger was a great host. Very friendly and helpful. The apartment was very clean  large and had everything you might need. Perfect location next to a major train station."),
("2018-12-12", "8559496", "Steve", "What a great place and a great host. With Mascot station right at your footstep you are less than 10 mins from anywhere. The strip of shops  restaurants and great little bar are all there outside your front door."),
("2019-02-07", "8559496", "Steve", "Always a great place to stay when in Sydney - so easy to get around with the train at your footstep. Tiger is a great host and very quick and helpful to make sure your check in is smooth."),
("2015-12-16", "8571561", "Michele", "The host canceled this reservation 10 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-01-12", "8571561", "Laura", "I can't even begin to tell you how brilliant my stay was. Rudi and Avalon were a total dream. From start to finish they were both so attentive and helpful. The house is charming and full of character and it was amazing to hear all of Rudis stories. Feeding the birds in the morning was such a memorable experience!!! I would recommend the b&B to everyone! Palm beach is the perfect place to relax and Rudis place was the perfect place to stay. I will be back one day!!!you've reminded me how good staying in a proper b&B can be! Thank you"),
("2016-02-15", "8571561", "James", "Simply put  Rudi's place is fantastic. A secluded hide-away a few minutes walk from the beach or the bay. Rudi is very warm  relaxed and attentive - and even gave us a lift to a nearby wedding. A shame we had to leave so soon! Highly recommended. "),
("2016-03-09", "8571561", "Tom", "Staying at Rudi's was the perfect tonic to a hot a busy stay in the city.  The B&B is easily accessible from Sydney - one bus ride all the way.  My room was clean and comfortable with balcony views to the Pitt Water which turned into theatre for the local birds to perform on in the morning!Rudi was a great host - giving the lowdown on facilities and local amenities whilst letting me explore the area on my own.  Sharing breakfast with two Kookaburra will not be forgotten!!One tip - for a couple of days from the city I would say a car is unnecessary - the bus takes a while but is frequent and direct  but it is DEFINITELY worth arranging a pick-up with Rudi if possible as the walk up to the B&B was a bit of a struggle with a large amount of luggage!"),
("2016-07-04", "8571561", "Ashley", "Great location - close to the beach and restaurants. Relaxed environment and great host. Rudi was very informative on the local area giving us valuable knowledge. Nice room  comfy bed and good shared facilities."),
("2016-11-14", "8571561", "Julia", "We had a great time. Rudi and Avalon were excellent hosts!"),
("2017-01-15", "8571561", "Jamie", "One of the best Airbnb's I've ever stayed. Rudi and Avalon are total legends and two of the kindest people I've ever stayed with. Would go back in a shot."),
("2017-03-18", "8571561", "Emeline", "We had a wonderful stay at Rudi's beautiful B&B and only wished we could have stayed longer. He was a lovely host and extremely hospitable and we couldn't have asked for a better more relaxing room. We look forward to returning soon."),
("2017-04-08", "8571561", "Kenneth", "We were attending a wedding at Palm Beach and needed a place to stay for the night.  This place was just what we needed.  Rudi & Avalon were extremely helpful and delightful hosts."),
("2017-05-14", "8571561", "Maartje De Hosson", "A great place to stay at palm beach!"),
("2017-12-16", "8571561", "Susanna", "We were in Palm beach for a wedding and had an absolutely amazing time at Rudi and Avalon's b&b. The place is situated in the most beautiful area and Rudi and Avalon are very lovely and friendly people  they made us feel very welcome and were simply incredible hosts. The room itself was clean with a comfy bed and a really cute balcony with a lovely sea view. Thanks for such a great stay!"),
("2018-01-06", "8571561", "Colin", "There is no better place to stay!"),
("2018-01-13", "8571561", "Immy", "Exactly as described would stay again"),
("2018-10-06", "8571561", "Liz", "We had a wonderful time at Rudi and Avalon’s place. They were incredible hosts (even dropping us down to the wedding we had nearby) and the place was clean  fresh and comfortable. We would definitely stay there again!"),
("2016-03-03", "8797439", "Leeanne", "I absolutely love my stay at Kirsty's place. Photo/description  are accurate.House was very beautiful  very comfortable   clean and spacious rooms  it was fully  stocked with everything we needed. A great location  close to beach and shop  easy to find. Fantastic  communication and hospitality  Kirsty is the    perfect  host.  10 / 10 I would definitely  rrecommend this home to anyone. "),
("2016-03-08", "8797439", "Kristin", "The hosts were really great with communication and kept in touch throughout our stay. The house was incredibly tidy. The house is a short drive from Cronulla beach and shops and restaurants. This a lovely home and definitely not somewhere for those looking to party. It's perfect for a cosy home away from home for families or couples. There's a lovely little garden we liked to eat our dinner in and enjoy the evenings. Fully stocked kitchen and air con was good. The main bathroom is amazing with shower and spa bath. It was lovely for our family to stay here whilst our daughter was treated at Westmead hospital and easy to get onto train into Sydney  go to the beach and go for dinner etc. "),
("2016-03-22", "8797439", "Hugh", "The home was presented to us in a clean & immaculate state  the rooms were very comfortable  the area was quiet so made a sleep in possible. The home is very convenient to the Caringbah Railway Station & the travel time into Sydney was less than an hour.Also very convenient to the beautiful precinct of Cronulla where you have some wonderful eating places & a lovely beach we did not get to use. This was due to our stay was not a holiday but a visit to a eye surgeon for our daughter.Couldn't fault the home at all  would go back if required."),
("2016-04-06", "8797439", "Sam", "Guests were very satisfied with the home and would stay there again.Very impressed. Kirsty was very professional. I would recommend her home to anyone."),
("2016-04-12", "8797439", "Jessica", "Wonderful home in Caringbah"),
("2017-03-20", "8797439", "Daniel", "Great place and location. Close to everything."),
("2018-01-09", "8797439", "Roger", "A lovely comfortable and private home  that we found very practical for 5 adults. Neat  clean and thoughtfully presented  this really made our guests first nights in Australia  a most pleasant ""home away from home""."),
("2018-04-22", "8797439", "Zac", "Perfect!!"),
("2018-04-29", "8797439", "Sarah", "Great stay for the weekend! Kirsty was fantastic to deal with. Had a bit of an issue getting in but she worked so hard to make sure it was resolved and we were happy! Much appreciated  and thank you for having us"),
("2018-05-11", "8797439", "Latimah", "We felt comfortable and at home the moment we walked in. It was perfect for our family of four! Tidy  clean  cosy and quality. And what topped it off was Kirsty’s caring contact and responses ensuring we had a great stay. Thank you."),
("2018-05-20", "8797439", "Gary", "We loved our stay. Everything was perfect and anytime we needed something Kirsty was happy to help."),
("2018-12-26", "8797439", "Dave", "If the property still has a king sized bed and a queen sized bed in the description and this is important to you then you may wish to get an explicitly acknowledgement that this is the size of the beds at the property as when we stayed the sizes were double and double."),
("2019-01-01", "8797439", "Tingyi", "A beautiful house with 4 bedrooms and a lovely garden  located in a quiet area  near two big supermarkets and not far from beach. We all enjoyed the stay in the house."),
("2019-02-02", "8797439", "Rebecca", "Kirsty was great to deal with and quick to respond to any queries we had from before we secured the booking and during our stay.  The house was clean and tidy and well equipped."),
("2019-02-17", "8797439", "Paul", "Good house for a stay in the shire"),
("2019-02-23", "8797439", "Sophie", "Very clean and well maintained"),
("2013-11-29", "884057", "Joe", "This is a high quality  furnished apartment about 5-10 minutes walk from some lovely beaches which are often deserted. The top-floor apartment itself is well kitted-out and clean and very quiet. Maree and her husband  who live downstairs  are very welcoming and kind. There is a bus very close to the apartment which takes just under an hour to get into the centre. There is a convenience store down the road.On the downside  the kitchen is quite small and any cooking is based around plug-in hobs and woks which means that cooking for two was a bit of a challenge  but not impossible by any means. The pool is a reasonable size (not for lengths but for dipping in) but unfortunately was unusable for much of our stay. This was a bit of a disappointment  but the sea is not far away!All in all  this was a nice stay with lovely hosts and I would recommend it to others."),
("2016-02-01", "884057", "Leo", "Very nice accommodation  great owner  location is also very good  close to the ocean. The rooms are clean too"),
("2017-03-07", "884057", "Pete", "Great spot to experience suburban Sydney."),
("2017-03-15", "884057", "George", "We had a very pleasant stay in Maree's property. It was clean and spacious. The cooking facilities were slightly limited  but it was very easy to work around! The property was also in a perfect location  right next to the beach and park. Maree and her husband were always on hand to help and very easy to communicate with. Overall  Maree's Airbnb was amazing and I would happily stay there again! "),
("2017-03-28", "884057", "Matthew", "The host canceled this reservation 7 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-04-29", "884057", "Honorlee", "By the bay is a fantastic place in a beautiful location. Maree is a great host and we loved our stay from day 1. Ps: There is a great Cafe 200m down the road."),
("2017-05-25", "884057", "Sage", "Comfortable. Kind hosts. Had a good stay."),
("2017-09-28", "884057", "Jodie", "The host canceled this reservation 8 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-03-01", "884057", "Gong", "I booked Maree's place for my family visit to Sydney. Maree is very friendly and quick to response."),
("2013-03-16", "888107", "Florence", "Un super séjour chez Wyatt ! Le quartier est très sympa et a toute les commodités  l'accès au centre ville est simple et rapide ! Et Wyatt est toujours de bon conseil pour les visites à effectuer à Sydney !"),
("2013-08-30", "888107", "Subramaniam", "I had my privacy  quietness  clean and good surrounding area to be in."),
("2013-09-30", "888107", "Wendy", "Wyatt is nice and very informative  gave us a lot of ideas where to go and how to go...A convenience place to stay  only a min walk to bus stop from his place and 15 mins to Chinatown by bus Restaurants  convenience store and supermarket can easily reach by foot Thank you for your advice and caring msg  Wyatt All the bestWendy and her mummy"),
("2013-10-03", "888107", "Viviana", "Wyatt is a warm and friendly host. We spent a comfy and joyful stay at his apartment in Annandale. Great location  just 15 mins by bus to the centre and steps away walking distance from Glebe and Leichardt suburbs.It is close to cafes  shops and transport buses too.We will highly recommend it!"),
("2013-11-10", "888107", "Alexandre", "Nous avons passé nos 2 premières nuits à Sydney chez Wyatt  et nous ne le regrettons pas ! Discret et disponible  Wyatt respecte très bien les valeurs du Bed and Breakfast. Il a de plus été précieux dans ses conseils sur Sydney  les endroits à découvrir  ou sortir  les balades à faire  les bon restaurants etc... On peut dire que Wyatt a été notre guide touristique pendant notre séjour !L'appartement est au pied des transports en commun  et tout proche des commerces. La chambre et l'appartement sont très agréables  et la petite terrasse donnant sur le jardin donne un coté rustique à cette maison de Sydney.Vous le constaterez par vous même  on est très bien chez Wyatt !"),
("2013-11-20", "888107", "Magali", "Séjour très agréable chez Wyatt que nous recommandons. N'hésitez pas à laisser votre empreinte sur son mur ;)"),
("2013-12-06", "888107", "Janina", "We had a great time at Wyatts place! His house is just so nice and comfy and we especially enjoyed having dinner outside at his small porch. The location is also great  very close to Uni and everything you need for everyday life... Wyatt is a very carring host and we'll definitely recommend his place!"),
("2013-12-20", "888107", "Vivian", "We had a really good time at Wyatt's house. We loved the area  cause it was possible to walk into the city and Annandale has several nice cafés and shops and it was not too busy. We enjoyed ourselves during a breakfast on the little balcony. Wyatt's place is furnitured with a lot of love and good taste. He always was there if we had any questions about the city. The only little thing we could criticise is that the bed in the smaller room is like a sleeping couch which was not the most comfy sleep. But it was ok for us. We had a great time at his place and would recommend it!"),
("2014-01-13", "888107", "Federica", "My mother stayed at Wyatt's place for ten days during her visit in Sydney. She really enjoyed both the accomodation and Annandale. We will certainly consider Wyatt for her next visit."),
("2014-02-13", "888107", "Kathy", "Where do I begin? Wyatt is the perfect host.  Super friendly and down to earth  Wyatt really made me feel at home.  Not only did he have many recommendations for things to do in the city  he also showed me around some of Sydney's landmarks.  Traveling alone and this being the first time I visited this city  it was nice to have a locals perspective and insight to getting around town.  When I look back on my trip and stay in Sydney  I smile... Thanks to Wyatt for making it such an amazing and enjoyable visit.  WHEN I come back  I will definitely stay at Wyatt's place :)"),
("2014-02-23", "888107", "Natalie", "Thanks so much Wyatt for being so welcoming and generous :) Col and I loved our stay and would recommend a stay at Wyatt's to anyone looking for accomodation in Sydney.  Goodluck with all your adventures Wyatt :)"),
("2014-02-27", "888107", "Bolivar", "I stayed in Wyatt's house with my girlfriend for 4 nights. Wyatt is really nice host. This was my second time in Sydney and he recommended me good spots to visit which I hadn't seen in my first trip. He has a big painting along the wall in the hall of the house so we were asked to paint something in there. We really enjoyed it and we thought it was a really good idea. Regarding the room  it is really small  so there was space just for us and our small bags. Anyway our stay was short so we didn't spend much time in the house. For sleeping 4 nights it was good and I consider a great value for money. It is a better choice instead of backpackers. The house is cozy and well equipped in all areas. The toilet is shared and it could be a bit cleaner. Anyway it is enough for a short stay. "),
("2014-03-24", "888107", "Yu Chen", "When my friend and I was there  Wyatt was not in the house so his mum hosted us. A really nice and helpful lady. I forgot to bring the house key on one of the nights and Wyatt's mum helped me to contact the other guests (who were not in the house at that moment) to see I they are coming back soon. The house itself is filled with that artistic atmosphere with wall painting and canvas. Our room is a bit small and simple but that's enough for two girls. The only thing is that they don't seem to have an air-con in the room. Bathroom is clean and they have a bathtub. Kitchen is free for usage for all guests and is quite well equipped.  "),
("2014-05-06", "888107", "Michael", "We reviewed Wyatt's other listing as we booked two rooms at his house! My sister and our friend had a great time staying in this room. We all enjoyed Wyatt's house and his hospitality! It was in a nice  quiet neighborhood that had several shops  bars  cafés and restaurants and was in about a 20-25 minute walk to Glebe Rd! There were also a couple bus stops right out the front door.  Bathroom was a bit small to share between everyone but that was no problem in the end. "),
("2014-09-01", "888107", "Hayley", "Wyatt was a great host  very welcoming and had lots of great tips for exploring Sydney. The house and room itself was great and had everything that we needed. The bed was ridiculously comfy and made for a great sleep. Annandale is a perfect spot with lovely cafes and just a 15 main bus ride into the city centre. We would definitely recommend this place. Thanks Wyatt."),
("2014-09-26", "888107", "Richard", "Very. Easy communications to let me book in and find his house. And when Wyatt was away  his sister popped around to make sure that I had everything I needed.  The bed was comfortable  the kitchen and sitting room spacious and everything I needed was available  right down to some tourist brochures and transport timetables on the area.  It soon felt like living in ones own home.  But ones action say more than words.  I have booked to extend my current visit here and also booked a return visit on my way back through Sydney in a weeks time. Thank you Wyatt  great place."),
("2014-11-03", "888107", "Min", "enjoyed staying there for the short trip. It was a nice experience. The house is well designed and comfortable. The host is thoughtful and nice."),
("2014-11-22", "888107", "Samuel", "Emplacement parfait calme et proche du centre. Chambre propre et appartement très sympathique. Wyatt est incroyablement accueillant très ouvert et on peut voir que c'est quelqu'un qui à lui même voyagé et qui sait donc exactement ce que un voyageur recherche durant son voyage. Malgré le fait que c'est une chambre dans un appartement on se sent tranquille et on à pas l'impression de faire intrusion dans la vie de l'hôte ni de se marcher sur les pieds. Thanks a lot! Samuel & Karolina"),
("2014-11-26", "888107", "Zoei", "Wyatt has been a really great host! The place was comfy and the toilet was kept clean all the time. The place was also very convenient and easily accessible to all the attractions like Sydney Opera House  Darling Habour  Chinatown and the City. I really enjoyed my stay there and look forward to renting the place again if I go back to sydney."),
("2014-11-29", "888107", "Lisa", "Wyatts place was very clean and comfortable. It is a fair distance from the city but public transport is very convenient and there is a bus stop right outside the door and there are shops and restaurants nearby. Taxi from the airport cost us around $50 dollars but was worth it as it was much quicker than public transport. We would definitely recommend this place to anyone visiting Sydney!"),
("2014-12-02", "888107", "Gabrielle", "A cosy cottage in one of the best neighbourhoods in Sydney. A lovely and convenient base to explore from  with a warm and welcoming host."),
("2014-12-06", "888107", "Benjamin", "From the first second on Wayne made our stay as pleasant as possible. He supplied us with loads of informations of what to do and where to go. If he is not busy working  you can have a sophisticated chat with him.The room was very comfortable and clean. Everything worked although it's a very old house he manages to keep it clean  tidy and working. Thanks for the awesome stay and hope to see you again."),
("2014-12-10", "888107", "Cindy", "Wyatt made us feel right at home!!  He let us use his fridge  kitchen  garden  showers  bathroom  (Website hidden by Airbnb) was like staying at home :)!!!"),
("2014-12-26", "888107", "Daniela", "Vielen Dank für die Gastfreundschaft im weihnachtlichen Sydney. Wyatt hat mich mit guten Tipps versorgt  die Gegend ist sehr nett. "),
("2015-01-03", "888107", "Jonas", "Dank Wyatts offenheit und Gastfreundschaft haben wir uns gleich sehr wohl gefühlt. Das teilen der Küche und des Badezimmers hat gut geklappt. Die Wohnung ist mit dem Bus gut verhältnissmäßig schnell zu erreichen."),
("2015-01-08", "888107", "Olivier", "Wyatt was a friendly  accommodating and generous host  he even helped us with our laundry even though he had many things to do. The small bedroom is a bit tight for a couple but was as described in Wyatt's listing so we expected that  but it had a comfy bed and clean bedding. The house itself is indeed charming and cool  and located in a good  central suburb and you can bus down to CBD within half hour max  so that was great.We really enjoyed Wyatt's company and found him a great host  thanks Wyatt."),
("2015-01-14", "888107", "Stefano", "the house of wyatt is perfect for enjoying Sydney for a few days. nice neighborhood  the bus stop for the city at a few meters from the front door. the house is beautiful and wyatt is a good host  he explained us how to move and where to go. i would definitely go back or recommend it.  "),
("2015-02-10", "888107", "Emeline", "The house was very clean and well situated  in a quiet and nice suburb with some shops really close.Wyatt was an awesome host who showed us everything in the house and gave advices on what to do in Sydney. He made us very confortable. Really good place in Sydney for a short stay!! :)"),
("2015-02-28", "888107", "Simon", "Wyatt is a great host! Always give you some tips about the city and chates with you if you like.The house is great and you have everything that you need. Bus station is just 1 minute away and you get to the city or to the famous beaches!When we come back to sydney i stay in that house again!"),
("2015-03-03", "888107", "Kim", "Wyatt was great!! He is a very cool and genuine guy that makes an effort to communicate and interact with his guest. Wyatt saved us a couple of bucks and picked us up from the train station  so nice! The house was very cute and charming. It was fun to hang around with the other guest and Wyatt and share stories about our home country and the activities we enjoy! I would definitely recommend staying at this house!"),
("2015-03-12", "888107", "Aymeric", "Really nice place to stay  not far from the city. It was a shame that we did not meet Wyatt but we had a great time in Syndey."),
("2015-03-23", "888107", "Paolo", "We stayed at Wyatt place for 3 nights. The room is in a typical Australian terrace house with a nice backyard and conveniently located close to transports and Annandale's shops. We slept in one of the 2 rooms available for airbnb guests; the bed was very comfy and the place is very quiet. We were also lucky enough to have the entire place for us for most of our stay since the other room was vacant and (unfortunately) Wyatt was overseas. We would suggest Wyatt's place to anyone looking for a cost-effective accommodation in Sydney (way better than any double room in a hostel for about half of the price!)."),
("2015-04-06", "888107", "Kristin", "We really enjoyed staying at Wyatt's place. His flat is very close to busstops and some little shops. He is a great host - very helpful and care about all your needs.We would recommend him to any travler. Thanks a lot for your hospitality :-)"),
("2015-04-20", "888107", "Ye Xuen", "Hi! The stay at Wyatt's house was amazing (: I had such a lovely time there with my boyfriend  he's helpful and provide tips and where to go. The room are very comfortable and it's the best place to stay if you're looking for something cozy  definitely will choose this place again the next time! "),
("2015-05-02", "888107", "Keith", "Great being back in Annandale at Wyatts place and visiting old friends and making new ones."),
("2015-05-10", "888107", "Emma", "Great host  great house  great area! Would thoroughly recommend. If only our stay was longer !! "),
("2015-06-06", "888107", "Rebecca", "Had a great 4 days stay at Wyatt's place. Location was good and we enjoyed our stay. Wyatt is really easy going and provides great advice on all queries we have about visiting the places interest. Would love to stay at Wyatt's place again if we come back to Sydney."),
("2015-11-04", "888107", "Doreen", "Wyatt is very helpful and friendly. He take his time to explain every but of things that we hv question to. Location was good. The bus is easy to take and train is just a 15mins walk away from home. I had a great stay and the room isnt too small :)"),
("2015-11-14", "888107", "Petra", "Très bonne expérience  jolie maison pleine de charme à une vingtaine de minutes du centre de Sydney par le bus (arrêt de bus à deux pas). Hôtes très accueillants  Julie  la compagne de Wyatt  est française pour l'anecdote. Pour les fumeurs  le jardin sera apprécié ! Nous avions la plus petite des deux chambres  finalement d'une taille suffisante  et malgré le descriptif  nous n'avons pas été gênés par les bruits de la salle de bains attenante. Seuls les avions pourront être entendus de ceux qui ont le someil léger  mais ils ne survolent pas le quartier tous les jours.Bref  que du positif  n'hésitez pas  d'autant que le budget est raisonnable."),
("2015-11-21", "888107", "Silvia", "We stayed at Wyatt's house for a couple of days and it was really comfortable  the house is charming and has everything you need. It is in a nice neighbourhood with a lot of shops and cafes. The bus stop is right infront of the house so the transport was convenient.We had no problems with the host whatsoever  he was helpful and nice to us.I would recommend Wyatts place to everybody who wants to enjoy Sydney and a quiet place to stay.Regards Silvia"),
("2016-01-22", "888107", "Joseph", "We were made to feel very welcome by the hosts. They were also politely accommodating of our late check-in. The room and kitchen were in excellent condition and everything was as described. Would certainly recommend."),
("2016-02-11", "888107", "Nicoline", "We've stayed at Wyatt's house for 6 nights. Julie and Wyatt were very helpful  calm and welcoming. The room and the bed was very comfortable and the room was clean and nice. The city was not far away and it was very easy to get around with busses and train. Wyatt was also very helpful our last day  because we needed to hire a taxi and stuff. Thanks very much for your kindness!"),
("2016-03-30", "888107", "Jakob", "We went to Sydney for sightseeing and stayed at Wyatt's place for 4 nights. We were overly happy with this decision  felt comfortable at all time and enjoyed Wyatt's and Julie's hospitality. I would definitively recommend this place for backpackers on a budget. The bed was very comfortable. Everything was just as Wyatt described on the listing. Wyatt is a very well prepared host when it comes to briefings on how living together can be more enjoyful. I really liked this and it makes everything running more smoothly:). As stated  the room is a little small but all our stuff (one big suitcase  two large backpacks and a drone case) fitted well in there. Tthe bathroom is a little small but fits the atmosphere of the house. We can definitively recommend staying in Wyatt's place!"),
("2016-04-15", "888107", "Thomas", "Very relaxed and easy going what else is important for a nice stay :)"),
("2016-05-15", "888107", "Stephen", "We stayed 3 nights in May 2016. We had a lovely time both Wyatt and Julia. They made us both feel very welcome and we had some great chats. The apartment is close to liz of places to eat and very easy to get into the city. The house was clean and tidy the whole time we was there and We parked outside the house and it was free. Over all we had a great time staying at Wyatt house it was the best Airbnb experience we have had so far. We will for sure be back when we are next in Sydney."),
("2016-06-05", "888107", "Wendy", "It was a short enjoyable trip thanks to Wyatt. Thank you for his hospitality and warmth welcome to his home. Wyatt is very easy-going and comfortable to get along with. We shared and exchanged quite a bit of interest in common and thanks to Airbnb I have made a new friend :)"),
("2016-07-19", "888107", "Florence", "The place was quiet and clean. I just wish  there  was a heating  in the  room as its winter  and the room is very  cold. Lucky i got thick  onesie to sleep on. Plus I suggest  atleast 1 clean towel to use for the  guest  on the duration  of their stay  would be good. I have to buy my own towel somewhere."),
("2016-09-30", "888107", "Wang", "谢谢Julie和Wyatt!他们很热情友好!我们在悉尼过了很开心的四个晚上 悉尼是个很大很漂亮的城市｡"),
("2016-11-03", "888107", "祝", "房东和女朋友人特别好 很热心 会尽力帮助别人｡房子很干净 整洁 卧室很舒服｡"),
("2016-11-14", "888107", "Kathleen", "The place was a great location in the city  close to bus stop and shops. He gladly let us come earlier for check in. He was there when we arrived letting us know about his house and rules and such. The bed was super comfy. The only issue I had was the window was locked open and couldnt close or open it more. Otherwise place was good  quiet and safe."),
("2016-11-17", "888107", "Markus", "The host is very friendly. He gave us a lot of useful information. The room was very small and VERY VERY .. as well as the bathroom My opinion not to recommend. I do not want to get too close now  but maybe a lot can be improved!"),
("2017-02-03", "888107", "Winnie", "Julie and Wyatt greeted us warmly when we arrived. They made the check-in process easy. They are both knowledgeable about Sydney and Australia. They are both polite about the many house rules. The small bedroom was big enough for two backpackers  and being next to the bathroom on the other side of the house gave it a more private feel. Wyatt's apartment is in a great location: walking distance to several restaurants and cafes; 470 bus stop just down the street that takes you to Central (<15 mins); and walkable (a little longer  ~35 mins) to Newtown and Redfern. The text description of the apartment is more forthcoming than most hosts'  and accurate. We feel that there was a large discrepancy between the photos and the actual state of the apartment. We would have enjoyed our stay more so if we had a fan  or the window in the small bedroom had a screen; the screen could have prevented mosquitoes from entering the room on a hot  rainy summer night."),
("2017-02-22", "888107", "Cuixin", "She is a very zealous hostess  offering us so many useful tips on our trip. The house is quiet  clean and tidy  a really good place for rest! Also  the house locates in a beautiful town which is near the center of Sydney  so it's really convenient to have a meal or take a bus. "),
("2017-03-14", "888107", "Xing", "房东人很热情 是华人 有问题都可以找他解决 很干净 交通特别方便 门口就有470bus往返central 机场uber大概30刀 下次有机会还会来"),
("2017-03-18", "888107", "Dylan", "Nice stay  hosts were lovely  bit out the way for the city and surround area  would be best for though with a car."),
("2017-04-02", "888107", "Tom", "Nice house and friendly hosts. Quiet neighbourhood and easy to get into town  would recommend and stay again "),
("2017-04-09", "888107", "Evelin", "Ccv"),
("2017-04-16", "888107", "Emily", "My friend and I stayed with Wyatt over Easter and had a lovely time! It’s easy to get to the city with buses running past regularly. The bed is so comfortable and we felt very relaxed! I’d highly recommend Wyatt’s place  thanks again for having us! "),
("2017-06-10", "888107", "芹", "Thanks a lot for the help that Julie and Wyatt gave us. They are both really nice. Julie is very beautiful and good at cooking. Wyatt is very talented. We had great days with them. The location of the house is well and it is so easy to go to city by bus. Shopping is also convenient. It is near to the newtown which is full of delicious food. The house is cute  quiet and tidy with a nice balcony.We enjoyed our stay in this place and certainly recommend it. Thanks very much for welcoming hosts and friends."),
("2017-08-15", "888107", "骏", "房子虽然不在市中心 但出门走1､2分钟就有公交到central station 所以出行还是很方便｡如果自驾来 街边都可免费停车｡附近也有一个超市可以买到日常要用的东西｡有独立的房间 共用客厅､厨房和卫生间等公共空间 因为房东很好相处 所以也很自由方便｡另外小宋和Julie 还提供了许多关于旅行､出租等等信息的帮助｡总之 值得推荐｡"),
("2017-08-26", "888107", "Tina", "Very comfortable & central location."),
("2017-09-19", "888107", "Caroline", "As the advertisement noted  this is a budget accommodation wherein which the room is small  but it was enough for my partner and I to be happy. Wyatt and his partner are both lovely people and great to chat with! Overall everything was tidy and the experience was smooth. I would definitely recommend staying here as it is minutes from the city  too!"),
("2017-10-03", "888107", "Maxime", "Un appartement bien situé qui permet d'être dans le centre très facilement. Julie et Wyatt sont des hôtes très sympathiques. La chambre était conforme à nos attentes."),
("2017-10-15", "888107", "金丽", "Wyatt and Julie are very friendly and gave us some advice of our trip. The location is very convenient  easy to go everywhere. The room is clean and comfortable. Nice stay in their house."),
("2017-10-23", "888107", "Safia", "Our stay at Wyatt and Julie 's home was fantastic. The house is clean and cosy  it feel's like home! It is close to the city (15min by bus) but you can spend a real quite and relaxing night.We Had the chance to spend some time with Julie and she is such à nice person! ""Don't be afraid to ask"" that' s what she taught us. And indeed  she does her best to Help  provides pieces of advise .. she now is more than a host  but a friend ! We did not see Wyatt much  but he was very welcoming and cheerful! If you are planning a trip to Sydney you should definitely stop at their lovely house !"),
("2017-11-12", "888107", "Mark", "First of all  i wanted to talk about Annandale Village. My wife and i loved the place. It's a very quiet village with friendly people and lots of options for food and coffee. It is not too far from CBD and if you want a quiet/peaceful environment  Annandale is the perfect location.Wyatt's place- we loved staying at Wyatt's home. We didn't get to meet Wyatt and Julie as they were travelling during our stay. Erika hosted us instead. She was very helpful and accomodating. The house is literally less than a minute to the bus stop (470 to the City and 370 to Cogee Beach).  The location is just 15 to 20 minutes to the City. Very convenient. We enjoyed our stay at Wyatt's place. There's a rustic  homey feel to it. The room  although small is just about right for my wife and myself. We even spent 1 day just being lazy in the room and drinking coffee in the balcony.  I will not hesitate booking the same room on our next visit to Sydney. I recommend Wyatt's place and please read his instructions first so you would know what to expect. All in all  we had a great stay in Sydney and our trip was made even more memorable by staying in Annandal and Wyatt's place. We miss it already. Hope to be back soon!"),
("2017-11-26", "888107", "Johan Hasle", "Super location in annandale  not to far from centrum with a bus leaving evry 10 min from the doorstep to centrum (often late though). Wyatt was super nice even though he was in France  and had a great system to give us the key. The house is very neat and cool design with good facilities and beds.Thanks a lot."),
("2017-12-29", "888107", "Karen", "Strongly recommend! Julie is very nice and friendly. The house is very pretty. Check in and out is easy. Some high quality local cafe nearby. Would definitely visit again next time in Sydney!"),
("2018-03-02", "888107", "Caroline", "房东是一个很热心 nice的人｡给了许多旅游建议｡公交也很方便 从central station 坐470 15分钟左右到 家门口就是站台｡好评指数五颗星希望有机会再次入住^_^"),
("2018-03-25", "888107", "Paul", "We stayed at Wyatt’s old villa over the weekend. It's located in a great place close to City. It was a great value for money."),
("2018-04-05", "888107", "H Jenshen", "Nice room in a convenient location just outside the city. About 15 minutes bus ride to the heart of the city  very convenient. Also  just a couple minutes walk will lead you into a few Annandale shops  consisting of cafes  bakeries and a convenience store. The room was clean and also cozy. No big complaints. Only one would be that the house is old  with creeking floors everytime someone walks by  so if you are a light sleeper/ gets annoyed by noises  this could be a concern.Wyatt and Julie were also friendly  sharing with us about Sydney's hangout spots and some local insights on them. They were also very hospitable during our stay  constantly checking if we were all good during our time there.Overall happy with the place!"),
("2015-11-04", "8977830", "Brendan", "We enjoyed a five night stay in Sydney at this apartment.  The view is an amazing outlook over Hyde Park and the harbour as pictured.  It was wonderful to wake up to that view each morning. The location was great for exploring the city on foot and with public transport as buses and trains are close by  as are the iconic Sydney attractions and delicious restaurants and wine bars.  Hugo was great at communicating check in details and left a handy apartment guide with apartment and city info.  We really enjoyed our stay and would stay here again if back in Sydney. "),
("2015-11-09", "8977830", "Alex", "10/10. Fantastic apartment located right in the center of Sydney. Amazing views  full service amenities plus more  close to absolutely everything. Hugo was easy to deal with  welcoming  friendly  and very helpful. The listing details and photos are very accurate. The views of Hyde Park  Royal Botanical Gardens and the Sydney Harbour are lovely. The apartment was extremely clean and well kept; it had a cosy  warm  homestyle type of feel. A very refreshing place to retreat to after a day out. I found it much more private and comfortable compared to normal Sydney hotels and apartments. After staying for a few days I almost didn't want to go home. I'd highly recommend this apartment listing to anyone wishing to stay in Sydney whether it's your first time and you want to see all the tourist locations or even if you travel to Sydney regularly and just want a great place to check in to  like a home away from home. I'll definitely look at staying here again on my next trip to Sydney. Thankyou Hugu  your hosting is very much appreciated."),
("2015-11-25", "8977830", "Tom", "Excellent location in the heart of Sydney. Great view private view of the harbour from the 34th floor. As 1st time visitors we had the prefect base for exploring the city. Detailed sign in instructions and Hugo was easy to reach ...though assistance was not needed as everything was as presented. Have no hesitation recommending as a good value. There is a Woolworths a block away to pick up any supplies."),
("2016-02-08", "8977830", "Kathleen", "An apartment with stunning views within easy reach of Darling Harbour  Circular key and the main shopping areas. Close to train stations and local buses. The apartment was clean and tidy with everything you need for a short break. The only downside for us was how noisy it could be from the street level through the night  considering you were 34 floors up. The whole building was very quiet internally."),
("2016-02-13", "8977830", "Wayne", "Great location with outstanding view of Sydney.i could sit in apartment and just look out the window all day.bathroom and kitchen alittle cramped but workable.Loved the place Hugo."),
("2016-02-17", "8977830", "Marjorie", "Lovely apartment in a very convenient part of Sydney. Five minutes from the Town Hall and QVB and about 20 minutes from Circular Quay. Lots of food and drink outlets in the immediate vicinity.  The apartment was clean and well equipped with amazing views over the harbour and Botanic Gardens. Hugo's instructions for getting in and using the apartment were clear and helpful. Bonus is the roof top terrace and swimming pool  which unfortunately we didn't have time to use!  Many thanks Hugo and Pamela"),
("2016-02-24", "8977830", "Joe", "Had a great 4 night stay at Hugo and Pamela's apartment. The description and photos are accurate and the view is just as amazing as it looks. The check in process was simple and Hugo checked to make sure everything was fine once we arrived. The location is perfect  multiple train stations nearby and buses right outside. I'd recommend this apartment to anyone and would stay again if in Sydney."),
("2016-03-08", "8977830", "Chema", "l'appartement ressemble aux photos sur le site  très bien situé en centre ville très calme et propre; je recommande vivement l'appartement de Hugo et Pamela"),
("2016-03-15", "8977830", "Cindy", "Hugo and Pamela's apartment is in a great location to visit all of Sydney. Public transport is very close 1/2 - 1 block depending where you are going. If you want to walk to Sydney Harbor  it is less than a mile  but we hopped on the bus each way because it is so convenient and affordable. Hugo will contact you a couple of days prior and explain how to access the apt. He gives very clear directions  easy to follow. He also has everything you need to know about the apt. written out in a binder  which we referenced a few times.We loved the big windows with the view of the harbor. There's great air flow once the windows are all opened  so no worries about not having AC.We had a great stay  and I would definitely recommend Pamela and Hugo's place."),
("2016-03-22", "8977830", "Diane", "Thank you for all your assistance in making us feel so welcome at your apartment.  It was truly wonderful waking up and going to sleep with the view which is ever changing.  The position of your apartment is sensational which Hyde Park across the road  trains and buses so very close and main downtown shopping a 5 minute walk.  All in all a great spot to stay.  Thank you."),
("2016-04-12", "8977830", "Laurence", "Hugo was super helpful upon arrival and responded promptly to any questions. He was always kind and polite in communications.Instructions were clear to retrieve the key to the apartment and getting around in the building. The view is exactly as shown in the pictures. The apartment is equipped with everything needed in the kitchen (pots  pans  toaster  cooking oil  salt  pepper  even a hand blender). Location is right downtown  45 second walk to Hyde Park  5 minute walk to the cathedral and 10-12 minutes to the Royal Botanical Gardens which leads to the famous Sydney Opera. We didn't even need a transit card to get around the city  we were able to walk everywhere. The view is fantastic  the location is great if a bit noisy because it is downtown and there is a lot of traffic  but I would definitely stay here again!"),
("2016-04-25", "8977830", "John", "Eagles Nest was perfect for our stay with wonderful views in a great location. The apartment was clean  well appointed and comfortable. Communication with host was easy and helpful. We would love to stay there again."),
("2016-05-01", "8977830", "Richard", "Hugo was unfailingly polite on the phone as I homed in on the property without being able to access his impeccable directions. The view from floor 34 is as good as you could get. The apartment was just the job for accessing all parts of the Sydney area and I was very grateful for the basic provisions in the fridge. Lots of facilities nearby."),
("2016-06-07", "8977830", "Charlotte", "We had a wonderful stay here! The location vouldn't be more perfect  especially for people like us that like to walk everywhere to make a weekend trip feel as much as holiday as possible. And the view! Wow!"),
("2016-06-21", "8977830", "Tom", "Hugo and Pamela's place was incredible. The location is excellent and the place was clean when we arrived. Hugo was very friendly and made this trip stress-free. There was also a guide explaining what's nearby in the area  which really helped when we needed some tips from a local for sightseeing and the best places to buy necessities.The view from every room was breathtaking -- the pictures really don't express how amazing it is to look out over Hyde Park.I would definitely stay here again and will be recommending Eagle's Nest to friends."),
("2016-08-09", "8977830", "Brad", "I enjoyed three nights at this flat. It's located very well  walking distance from public transit (< 20C). Pick up of key was easy  as was wifi and use of the apartment. "),
("2016-08-30", "8977830", "Rainie", "Good location  beautiful city view!"),
("2016-09-06", "8977830", "Jean", "We spent à nice stay in Hugo and Pamela's apartment. The apartment well located was comfortable and pleasant with a beautiful view. The host Hugo was very attentive to all our questions and our well being during the stay and very available when needed. Thanks a lot Hugo !!"),
("2016-09-14", "8977830", "Danielle", "Location  location  location! The apartment is in a central part of the city so you can walk practically everywhere! Pictures were exactly as shown (with an amazing view) and Hugo was a great host. He allowed me to check-in early  which was great since my flight got in at 6am! Hugo met me at the apartment when I arrived and showed me around the unit plus gave me tips on what to see and do while in Sydney since it was my first time visiting. The place was tidy and extrmemely clean. I would highly recommend this place and if I do ever come back to Sydney  this is where I will stay."),
("2016-09-22", "8977830", "사랑", "모든게 완벽한 숙소였습니다. 위치가 정말 좋았고 뷰도 아름다웠습니다. 깔끔한 인테리어와 편안한 잠자리  그리고 주방에 필요한건 거의다 갖춰져있어서 식사를 챙겨 먹기에 부족함이 없었습니다. 체크인아웃도 편리했습니다. 최고의 숙소였습니다. "),
("2016-09-27", "8977830", "Haley", "We loved our stay at Pamela and Hugo's. The apartment is in a great location  very close to several train stops and is a short walk to some of the best parts of the city. The apartment was spacious and clean  and had amazing views. Hugo was a fantastic host  very quick to respond to questions and was very accommodating and flexible in our arrival and departure. He even left us beer in the fridge! We would gladly stay here the next time we are in Sydney. "),
("2016-10-05", "8977830", "Jiaying", "i really enjoyed 4 nights in Sydney and in Hugo's apt! Fantastic view through window that we can see sea and Hyde Park and Sydney Tower. Hugo is very kind who answered our message even in the evening. The apt has a really good location  200m from Town Hall  100m from Woolworths and Chemist Warehouse  just in the very Sydney CBD. We walked to anywhere. Thank you Hugo and if I have another journey to Sydney  I will first choose your comfortable apt to sleep."),
("2016-10-12", "8977830", "Stephen", "Really brilliant location and fantastic views. perfect as a base. we ate out most of the time but we could easily have eaten in."),
("2016-10-24", "8977830", "Jill", "Neighborhood was great! Right in the middle of everything  close to transportation  taxis  great restaurants  shopping  and very walkable. The view from the apartment was fantastic!! There were a couple of glitches at the beginning of the stay  but Hugo was very responsive and diligent  and everything was resolved in no time at all. Apartment was comfortable  we'll definitely try to book it again when we're able to return to beautiful Sydney!"),
("2016-10-30", "8977830", "Dan", "What an excellent stay! The views from the apartment are stunning and the location couldn't be more central. Really easy to get to from the airport and an excellent base for exploring Sydney. Great communication from Hugo before we arrived with areanging early check in and late depaeture  and during our stay when i managed to (temporarily) misplace the key card... thanks for your help Hugo and sorry for the inconvenience!"),
("2016-11-29", "8977830", "Sue Ellen", "Location can't be beat for ease of walking the town  shopping & restaurants. Comfortable bed; a small but fully equipped kitchen & spectacular view. Expect city noises. "),
("2016-12-04", "8977830", "Jill", "We loved our stay in Pamela and Hugo's inner-city apartment! The views from the apartment are amazing and the location is unbeatable. It's close to public transport and walking distance to the iconic sites that Sydney has to offer! Communication prior to arrival and during our stay was clear and concise.Highly recommended!"),
("2016-12-11", "8977830", "David", "Great location to get around Sydney CBD as well access to public transport  restaurants etc.  "),
("2016-12-31", "8977830", "Adam", "Apartment was advertised.  The instructions were very easy to follow. Unbeatable location ."),
("2017-01-09", "8977830", "Anne", "Centrally located close to Town Hall Station  this place is my new favorite in Sydney. The views.were.absolutely.amazing.mind blowing. The TV was left off  there is enough entertainment sitting in the couch looking out the big windows in front. This apartment has everything what you need for a convenient stay. I will definitely book again!If you drive with your own car to Sydney  the best carpark would be the one in Sussex street (Wilson)- 20 dollars a day for a bay"),
("2017-01-16", "8977830", "Joanne", "This apartment has a fabulous view and is very centrally located between Town Hall and Museum stations and close to a large supermarket at TH station.  The host was very helpful and available to assist if needed. The apartment is compact but with a range of facilities  including really good internet connection which was much appreciated.  There was traffic noise even on 34th floor with the windows closed  but it did not stop us  getting a sound sleep.   We were there during a heatwave  and one night was quite hot.  Otherwise  the cross breeze at night cooled the apartment and we were mostly out during the day.  The bed was comfortable.   We only had one access card to the building which at times was limiting if we wanted to go out separately.   A great place to stay and the view made up for the minor inconveniences such as traffic noise. "),
("2017-02-06", "8977830", "Stephan", "The apartment is completely and usable furnished. Its location near town hall ist perfect to visit Sydney."),
("2017-02-14", "8977830", "Kyle", "Great apartment  great location. Easy to get anywhere by foot or public transport. Incredible view from room or rooftop pool. Would stay here again in a heartbeat!"),
("2017-02-21", "8977830", "Soojin", "Lovely cozy place. perfect location. easy to go famous places. hosts are also very kind. thank you for having me good memory."),
("2017-02-28", "8977830", "Nancy", "Hugo and Pamela went out of their way to help us. Hugo went to the apartment to meet us so we could park our car and unload our luggage before returning the rental car to the airport so we didn't have to drag it through the city. They also let us stay on the day of check out in the apartment longer since we had a late flight. The view of the city is beautiful and the apartment is located close to all transportation. It is very basic  clean apartment conveniently located. They even provided milk and a bottle of water in the refrigerator to get you started. Nice flat screen TV in family room with excellent sound system. "),
("2017-03-07", "8977830", "Jackie", "Thanks to Pamela and Hugo for being a great host! We arrived a few hours earlier after a long journey from Canada. Pamela and Hugo managed to get us in right away. The place has great view of the Royal Botanic Garden area and the ocean. It is very clean and safe. Pamela and Hugo provide a lot of stuff  including tea  milk  and etc. for guests to do simple cooking  to keep clean  and to enjoy the life in Sydney! The location is really central  2 minutes walk to Town Hall Station  Woolworths supermarket  Queen Victoria Building; and only 25 minutes walk to the Opera House; very convenient to tourists. We love the host and the place!"),
("2017-03-20", "8977830", "Patricia", "Good location. Better then I spect"),
("2017-03-28", "8977830", "未", "The house is very good.and it is close to all the scenic spots.The view is great and the entrance is safe.There's everything you need in the (Website hidden by Airbnb) owner is patient and careful.This is a very good choice if you choose a free trip."),
("2017-04-04", "8977830", "娜", "非常愉快的旅行 房子可以看到海德公园 景色很好 楼下有便利店非常方便 距离悉尼的景点也可以走路到达 距离超市也很近 推荐"),
("2017-04-16", "8977830", "Colin", "Fantastic views  great location  very comfortable "),
("2017-04-24", "8977830", "Ming", "the apartment is soooo great. Near to every place. We can go anywhere on foot. Besides  the scenery outside the window is so fabulous. I love this place. "),
("2017-05-02", "8977830", "Maria", "We loved the soft seat in front of the fabulous views of Sydney through huge windows. The rest of the apartment - bed  bath  kitchen etc were so comfortable. Hugo & Pamela provided great directions  communication and welcome. We'll be back!"),
("2017-05-09", "8977830", "Celia", "Everything about our experience was first class.  Traffic noise at night or through the day if you wanted the windows open was an issue but was easily forgotten with the fabulous location and views.  Highly recommend this host and apartment."),
("2017-06-04", "8977830", "Amelia", "Everything it promises and more. The views are incredible  the apartment is immaculate. So walkable - 10 minutes from everywhere (25 to Mrs Macs chair)  depending how fast you walk  obviously.Pamela & Hugo have presented a lovely apartment  with perfectly sized furniture to make it comfortable without being crowded. The full kitchen was amazing to have access to as someone with dietary restrictions. Being 2 blocks from a full supermarket made life so easy.Our only almost-negative was the neighbour playing super loud music when we got in at 10pm  but the doors are incredible noise barriers  and once indoors  the ambient road noise covered it.The views are amazing. The public transport in the immediate vicinity life changing. If we lived in Sydney  this is where we would want to be."),
("2017-06-12", "8977830", "Chai Karl", "Great compact unit in the heart of the cbd. really close to all the shops and harbour or Oxford street. The apartment has every thing you would need for a short stay and a great view"),
("2017-06-21", "8977830", "Leslie", "Hugo was a great host  very flexible with check-out and readily available by text to answer questions.  The apartment location is ideal for exploring the entire city; it's an easy walk to shopping  the ferries at circular quay  the opera house  the botanic garden as well as to great restaurants in CBD/Hyde Park as well as Surry Hills.  "),
("2017-06-30", "8977830", "Victor", "The big window with incredibally harbor view of Sydney is really amazing. For cooking lover  this will be your first choice. Pamela & Hugo's apartment kitchen is not that big  but it does equipment almost EVERYTHING  you need.(including aboundant seasoning stuff) You just need to buy fresh ingredient from the 1 min. walking distance Woolworth supermarket.  narrow street  high raise building and the frequent road noise from police car and fire truck make this area very similar like NYC Manhattan. The excellent location makes our one week discovery in Sydney all done by foot without the OPAL card.  so highly recommend Pamela & Hugo's lovely   cozy apartment. "),
("2017-07-04", "8977830", "Elson", "We booked Hugo' s apartment for the view and it certainly didn't disappoint. Fabulous views over Hyde Park and St Mary's Cathedral out to the Harbour.The apartment is compact but well appointed and complete. It is clean and well maintained.Communication with Hugo was excellent throughout and when our travel plans got thrown into disarray  he graciously helped us out."),
("2017-07-24", "8977830", "Robert", "Location  location and great view!All perfect"),
("2017-08-21", "8977830", "Jo", "The view from this apartment is just stunning! The location is perfectly central in the city-very easy to get everywhere! There is well stocked cupboards with all of the essentials which was such a welcome relief after arriving from a long flight! Hugo is a fabulous host with great communication! I couldn't recommend this apartment more highly! Thank you Hugo!"),
("2017-09-05", "8977830", "Pascal", "Appartement correspondant en tous points à l'annonce. Très commodément situé en plein centre à proximité des principales attractions  commerces et transports publics. Petit mais bien organisé; très belle vue. Hôte très efficace et réactif. Très bon choix!"),
("2017-09-13", "8977830", "Nick", "Awesome view  great communication  and the location is perfect for tourist activities."),
("2017-09-19", "8977830", "Randy", "Great view and location"),
("2017-09-25", "8977830", "Fiona", "Absolutely wonderful apartment in a perfect location! We had a fantastic stay in the Eagle's Nest and Hugo was so accommodating with checking in/out times. It's a lovely apartment with breathtaking views and walkable to all the sights. If we're in ever in Sydney again we'll definitely be back."),
("2017-10-16", "8977830", "Amanda", "As central as you can be really  5 minutes from central locations and easily accessible. Would definitely recommend staying here— Hugo and Pamela were quick responders via messaging and  upon arrival  everything was as promised!"),
("2017-10-24", "8977830", "Catherine", "I had the most wonderful stay in Pamela and Hugo’s unit.  Everything was perfect and the location is incredible!  I had friends staying in an executive sweet at the Hilton (just around the corner) and the view from Pamela and Hugo’s unit was much better!!  I would rate my stay 10/10."),
("2017-10-30", "8977830", "Bowie", "The Apartment is clean neat  exactly match with the photo. and the view from living room is so beautiful~ but in the evening there is a little bit noise. And the location is very inconvenience!!!! close to Museum Station ( the train to airport )  walk to Darling Harbor 10mins  china town 10 mins  circular quay 20mins."),
("2017-11-05", "8977830", "Lynne", "Great views of Sydney and the hosts were so responsive to our requests to arrive early"),
("2017-11-12", "8977830", "Haley", "The convenient location  extraordinary views and excellent communication with the hosts made our stay in Sydney fantastic. Definitely recommend this apartment!"),
("2017-11-18", "8977830", "Cathy", "This is a fabulous place if you get the chance to visit Syndey.  The location is fabulous  Pamela and Hugo communicated with us quickly and were very helpful and the apartment was exactly liked it looked in the pictures.  The views are terrific!!"),
("2017-11-21", "8977830", "Alex", "Great place and excellent position in the centre of Sydney.BAthroom is on the small size  but otherwise flat is excellent.Amazing communication with Hugo and easy to arrange different times to check in/leave.Would recommend +++"),
("2017-11-25", "8977830", "Chris", "Just do it  stop looking and do what you have to do"),
("2017-12-05", "8977830", "Jane", "'' Eagle's Nest "" is the perfect name for such a great position in central Sydney. The views to die for and so handy to bus  train and a 20 minutes walk through the gardens to Circular Quay. The best shopping in Sydney QVB and David (Website hidden by Airbnb)  perhaps too close ! Handy supermarket n an attractive pool on the roof . Very kind generous host and hostess."),
("2017-12-18", "8977830", "Elizabeth", "Fantastic location for the shops  sight seeing  trips and restaurants.  Lovely little apartment with fantastic views and thoughtful little touches. Will certainly return next time I visit Sydney."),
("2017-12-25", "8977830", "Kakli", "Great location. Very helpful and communicative hosts."),
("2018-01-02", "8977830", "Steven", "What an awesome place. View. Location. Just perfect.  Hugo and Pam excel in their service to their guests. From communication and directions to on the spot support for any unforseen help needed. They were great. Steve Jackson"),
("2018-01-07", "8977830", "Pip", "We really enjoyed our stay. Amazing views all the way out to the ocean. Pamela and Hugo were very quick to respond and very accomodating when it came to checking in early."),
("2018-01-15", "8977830", "A J", "Pamela & Hugo's place has a spectacular view of the harbor and downtown. They gave us good suggestions about the local area. A great location to explore Sydney CBD. The apartment features a good living space for guests. I would pick this place again if I go back anytime in the future."),
("2018-01-19", "8977830", "Rosemary", "A very well equipped flat in a brilliant location close to public transport  shops and all the sights!  We very much hope to return!"),
("2018-01-29", "8977830", "Ashley", "The place was in an awesome location with a fantastic view. Working TV and Wifi were great. It was a little smaller than I expected and had no AC. But I was out of the apt most of the time so it didn't matter too much. Overall a pretty good experience for my short time in Sydney."),
("2018-02-06", "8977830", "Eddie", "Highly recommended !!!"),
("2018-02-13", "8977830", "Nina", "Wir hatten eine super Zeit in Sydney  das Apartment hat eine großartige Aussicht und liegt perfekt  so dass man wenn man will alles zu Fuß erreichen kann."),
("2018-02-17", "8977830", "Christine", "Great little apartment right in the heart of Sydney CBD. The most incredible awesome views of Sydney and the Harbour. Easy stress free booking with great communication providing great directions and instructions. Look forward to hopefully staying again in the future.  Thanks so much."),
("2018-02-27", "8977830", "Yvon", "Excellent downtown location  beautiful view  apartment well stocked  highly recommended"),
("2018-03-06", "8977830", "Chris", "Was a great apartment  modern and clean in an amazing location. Would definitely recommend"),
("2018-03-12", "8977830", "Sue", "Pamela and Hugo's apartment has a fantastic location  right next to Hyde Park  close to stations Town Hall and Museum  near the supermarket  shops and restaurants. It is comfortably furnished  has a comfy bed and great TV. The kitchen  although functional  could possibly be updated to modern standards I think. But it has fantastic views over Hyde Park and part of Sydney Harbour."),
("2018-03-19", "8977830", "Kelly", "非常棒的地理位置 窗外就是海德公园｡房东很贴心 消息回复很及时｡非常棒的入住 强烈推荐!"),
("2018-03-26", "8977830", "Pania", "Very well located  tidy apartment  with great views.  Apartment is surrounded by good restaurants  coffee shops and a local supermarket. but offers a neat fully equipped kitchen if you prefer to cook your own meals.   Apartment has access to rooftop pool and sun deck.   Air con would have been delightful  but ceiling fans and window coverings kept the heat at comfortable temperature."),
("2018-04-23", "8977830", "Camila", "My partner and I stayed at this apartment for 4 nights in April  and we absolutely recommend it. If you're looking for a very central place with really breathtaking views  this is a no-brainer. It's a great size for two people  and we could walk to all main Sydney attractions. We cooked some of our meals with no issues. Light sleepers  be mindful that this apartment is at the heart of the city  so there is traffic noise. Communication with Hugo was great  and we're very thankful for the early check-in. In sum  we came in with high expectations  and they were exceeded. Thanks to the hosts!"),
("2018-05-07", "8977830", "Ryan", "A prime location between public transport and shops. Great host who replied instantly to any questions! Only slight complaint was the dated bathroom and kitchen. But the beautiful views from the apartment more than made up for it."),
("2018-05-15", "8977830", "Cas & Jenny", "We enjoyed our four night stay  thanks to Pamela and Hugo  having everything we needed and of course we loved the great views and location. Check-in was easy due to Hugo’s clear instructions. Yes there’s some traffic noise being mid-city but earplugs at night helped and it didn’t worry us much at all. We would stay again. Highly recommended."),
("2018-06-01", "8977830", "Coline", "Excellent rapport qualité prix pour ce logement très agréable malgré le bruit. Nous avons passé une très bonne semaine."),
("2018-08-08", "8977830", "Sarah", "Fabulous apartment! Great views  super comfy bed  deep bathtub  excellent central location. Very detailed instructions and fast response and support from Hugo. Highly recommended. "),
("2018-08-12", "8977830", "Eddie", "Unit as described. Great location. Amazing views."),
("2018-08-22", "8977830", "天宇", "Good experience!"),
("2018-09-16", "8977830", "Deborah", "Noise  random  loud  at all times of the day or night from the street below. Sirens  trucks  motorcycles  vehicle horns  crowds... If you don't need to sleep or have very poor hearing  the location is great."),
("2018-09-23", "8977830", "Lauren", "Excellent apartment in the heart of the city. Exceeded expectations as clean  tidy and good value for money."),
("2018-10-20", "8977830", "Lee", "Such a great location and the photos don't do the fabulous view justice. Positive prompt hosting and a good folio of info and tips on site. This is an excellent value  convenient apartment for a Sydney stay."),
("2018-10-27", "8977830", "Adam", "The place is exactly as described and has a great view. The building is a little dated but it has a laundry and pool. it is central to everything and their are lots of good restaurants and cafes around. I particularly liked the coffee shop downstairs and fix wine bar down the road on Elizabeth st.  All in a good stay."),
("2018-11-05", "8977830", "Marja", "Great apartment to stay in if you are in Sydney! Perfect location  comfy couch  nice shower  very comfortable bed and stunning views. Hugo and Pamela are great hosts. They inform you well and respond quickly on messages. Check in is easy."),
("2018-11-15", "8977830", "Patricia", "Pamela and Hugo have an amazing apartment here. I was visiting for a conference at Sydney ICC and this was the perfect home base. It's walking distance to the conference center  opera house  botanical gardens. The large windows make the views incredible. Street noise was minimal and we slept very well in the comfortable bed."),
("2018-11-22", "8977830", "Jessica", "The location is very central  and the views are indeed fantastic. The building and fixtures are showing their age a bit  but everything was fully functional. Amenities like binoculars  umbrella  and travel outlet converters are a nice touch. Hugo was very communicative and accommodating with regard to check in/out. The apartment is over 30 floors up  but sound still carries from the busy streets below. If you need somewhere quiet  I recommend staying in a quieter neighborhood outside of the CBD. If you can handle some city hustle and bustle  though  this spot is great!"),
("2018-12-05", "8977830", "Jen", "Perfect for a stay in the city. Everything you need and in a fabulous  location. Hosts were great"),
("2019-02-08", "8977830", "Grace", "真的像自己家一样 设备全 特别是厨房用品 适合家庭出行｡位置也好 旁边就是大超市和公交站｡房东给的游玩等建议也很棒 写在入住的小册子里｡最主要是窗外风景 每天早上对着这样的景色吃早餐 太舒服了 不想走｡"),
("2019-02-15", "8977830", "Matt", "Hugo was a super host! His apartment had spectacular views and was in a very central and convenient location. Near Townhall train station and a local supermarket. Very much appreciated Hugo’s thoughtfulness with local tips and sites to see and always had quick responses."),
("2019-02-23", "8977830", "Nick", "Central  great view  clear instructions  easy check in. Highly recommended."),
("2015-11-03", "9080393", "Frederick", "It was great to stay in this place. It was easy communicating with Lina and the neighbors are OK."),
("2015-11-23", "9080393", "Xiaoqing", "Brandnew house  location is beautiful.Lina is very nice host.We enjoy this stay.Lina的房子位于一个漂亮而平静的社区 房子很新 附近几公里的地方有Woolworth超市和Chemistry warehouse 购物方便｡我在Airbnb上租了好多次房子了 这次是第一遇到华人房东 很亲切 Lina也是第一次遇到中国房客 她非常热情 给了我们很多旅行和购物的建议｡入住这里体验极佳 强烈推荐｡"),
("2015-12-06", "9080393", "Mathieu", "Lovely house  well presented and clean  owner was lovely enough to give us a bowl of cherries when we arrived. Recommended. "),
("2015-12-08", "9080393", "Margaret", "Place is very neat  clean and tidy  location is handy to nearby shops and also the motorway  Lina was very flexible & understanding with checkout/check in  very welcoming when we arrived as we were shown the granny flat & given the key  would stay again if in Sydney :)"),
("2015-12-12", "9080393", "Laura", "The host canceled this reservation the day before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-12-12", "9080393", "Ben", "Easy experience  helped us out whenever we had a question. Great hosts!"),
("2015-12-25", "9080393", "Heri", "Lina is a very warming host. She was there when we arriving and kindly showing to us the entire place. The house itself is very convenient for a family to stay couple of night. Very clean house! It's located in about an hour from CBD which is provide us with quiet environment. Nice place to stay."),
("2015-12-30", "9080393", "Prashad", "Very clean and well arranged.when we arrived lina's husband was there.he was very helpful.good for families."),
("2016-01-01", "9080393", "Kazuhito", "There is very clean and quiet.Tony was very welcoming and kind.We spend good time at this accomodation.Tony and Lina Thanks a million!"),
("2016-01-02", "9080393", "Lea", "The host canceled this reservation 6 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-01-03", "9080393", "Lachlan", "Lina and her husband were very helpful with the stay. We really enjoyed how clean and modern the house was as well as the location. Would love to stay there again."),
("2016-01-05", "9080393", "Zt", "Perfect place to rest after a trip to the blue moutains before heading back toSydney! It has everything you need from TV  wifi to kitchen and laundry facilities. It's very clean and new and it has got quite enough space to accommodate 2 to 5 people."),
("2016-01-05", "9080393", "Александра", "Absolutely new apartment. Very clean  has big living room and a parking space. Lina and her husband Tony were very friendly and always willing to help. Before we leave Tony even gave us a bucket of homegrown tomatoes  which were very delicious!  "),
("2016-01-08", "9080393", "Jniu6193", "非常开心的旅程 谢谢Lina and Zhou.推荐家庭入住｡"),
("2016-01-15", "9080393", "Paul", "Host Tony  made us very welcome on arrival   Than inside he had left fresh bread  tomatoes   butter  cool drinks. Then more home grown tomatoes during our stay Location is great a quiet area the 2 bedroom house is new only 6 months old very clean & tidy  We had a great stay with our 3 grand childrenThis is a safe area to stay we went walking after dinner each night The host description was very good.We highly recommend this Airbnb"),
("2016-01-18", "9080393", "Muhammad", "Awesome place. We book the apartment on a last minute basis and still we get a friendly welcome and help from the the host and her husband!!!Place look clean and awesome as well. 10/10 will come again if we r visiting sydney!"),
("2016-02-17", "9080393", "Lucie", "We were very well received by Lina and her husband. The house is very clean  very well appointed  and the hosts are very nice and accommodating.We will come again . Thank you for everything."),
("2016-02-27", "9080393", "Sheikh Waleed", "The house was really new and very nicely decorated. Everything was there  and the location was convenient for shopping and transportation as well. The host was really informative and helpful. "),
("2016-03-16", "9080393", "Janice", "We had a lovely stay  even though only for one night. Very convenient location for everything we had planned for weekend.  House was very clean  spacious  had everything you could possibly need on a trip away and the kitchen was even stocked with extra supplies which was a real bonus!!  Beds were comfortable too.!Perfect spot for myself and three young children.  Much better value and atmosphere than any hotel. We are regular visitors to Sydney and will definitely book this accommodation again. Thank you"),
("2016-03-22", "9080393", "Vanessa", "Very convenient accommodation for our trip. Very neat and tidy and well equipped."),
("2016-03-29", "9080393", "Nadeem", "It was my first ever experience to get a house through airbnb.com. It was awesome  house was very clean and tidy and the LINA herself she's really a nice lady  she helped me and my son to pick up the luggage to the hose. She's always there for your help. Whenever I visit NSW I will definitely go for this house."),
("2016-04-02", "9080393", "Daniel", "Spacious  clean and quiet appartment. Lina  her husband and her son have been very friendly and helpful. Highly recommanded!"),
("2016-04-04", "9080393", "Brad", "It was my first Airbnb experience and an absolute pleasure. Lina was flexible with arival and departure times and respected our privacy with minimal contact. Although she was very kind and I'm sure she would have helped with any requirements."),
("2016-04-11", "9080393", "Khurram", "My first time on (Website hidden by Airbnb) was awesome!The place was exactly as advertised & Lina was a fantastic host. She gave us a warm welcome & a wonderful send-of.Very clean  cosy and homely place - it had everything we needed & the price was right too. Thanks Lina..."),
("2016-04-14", "9080393", "Nicole", "Great little cottage. Perfect for a family. We stayed with our 2 kids   (3 & 6yrs )  for one night and had everything we could need.  Located in the host's  back yard on a quiet suburban street.  Surrounded by houses yet was very private. The local shopping centre with Coles just a few km's away.  We were very happy with our 1st Airbnb experience and when we next need accommodation in Sydney will try to book again. "),
("2016-04-18", "9080393", "Carmen", "This was a great place to stay. We spent a weekend here with two kids (under 12) so we could make an easy day trip to the Blue Mountains. Clean  private and secure."),
("2016-05-02", "9080393", "Fotios", "The place was even better from what we expected. Nice and big and really clean. Everything you need for a short or a little bit longer stay in Sydney. We really recomend the place and for sure we are going to choose it for our next trip in Sydney. Thank you..."),
("2016-05-04", "9080393", "永贵", "Thank you for giving us such a warm house. Although getting along with two days  we feelt your warm and careful. You provide us with the site and the train route made us to the Sydney opera house easily. When we booked room difficulties  and help us to solve the problem. Thank you again  wish you have a long career.感谢你为我们提供了如此温馨的房屋｡ 我们相处虽然两天 但感到了你的热情和细致｡你为我们提供的火车站点和路线让我们顺利到了悉尼歌剧院｡当我们订房间困难时 又帮助我们解决了问题｡再次感谢 祝你事业顺利｡"),
("2016-05-07", "9080393", "Sebastiaan", "Absolutely loved my stay in your beautiful unit. It was exactly as advertised  clean  comfortable  quiet and perfect. You made me feel very welcome  especially with some tim tams  waiting for me in the fridge!! :) Will definitely stay again next time im in Penrith. All my other friends that stayed elsewhere in Penrith were jealous! :)Thanks again.Seb."),
("2016-05-08", "9080393", "Siang Woen", "It was my first Airbnb experience and it is above my expectation. Lina was a great host to us and kept offering help to us. Everything was as per published and the property is quite new and the area is safe and quiet."),
("2016-05-10", "9080393", "Christina", "Starting with a warm welcome from Lina's son  our overnight stay was perfect. A very quiet street and a delightful home with every mod con at a reasonable price.Thank you Lina Tina"),
("2016-05-20", "9080393", "Wiraaj", "Our experience staying at Lina's Kingswood property was very positive. The newly-built house is well-appointed and true to the online listing. Lina and her family are friendly welcoming hosts who were eager to help make our stay as comfortable as possible. I would readily stay here again in future."),
("2016-06-12", "9080393", "Shannon", "Lina's place was immaculately clean & was 5 minute walk to Nepean Hospital  which was perfect for our purposes. Lina was very helpful & obliging. "),
("2016-07-21", "9080393", "Sarah", "Lina and her family were incredibly helpful and friendly. The unit was spotless and all the facilities were excellent. I had my 18 month old daughter with me and it was ideal for our week long visit to Sydney. I would definitely stay here again. Thank you Lina for your hospitality."),
("2016-10-12", "9080393", "Laura", "The host canceled this reservation 17 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-12-27", "9080393", "Jane", "We used Lina's place as a base for visiting family in the Blue Mountains for Christmas. It was really comfortable for 4 adults and one 10 year old. It was super clean and looked the same as in the photos. There were fabulous restaurants and Aldi just a 5 minute drive away. If you need to stay near Penrith Lina's place is value for money."),
("2017-04-01", "9080393", "Shannon", "Very homely convenient and quite location"),
("2017-09-16", "9080393", "Lynette", "We stayed one night only - in at 8:00pm and out again early in the morning.  We had 3  adults and it was ideal for us.  It is a new separate unit behind the owner's house  away from the street.  Everything was easy with the owner.  We enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-10-08", "9080393", "Claire-Lyn", "Thanks Lina! Great and convenient place for my staff to stay while on work. Lina is a great communicator and helpful."),
("2017-10-15", "9080393", "Jodie", "Great communication and happy to help out"),
("2017-11-04", "9080393", "Matthew", "Very comfortable home. The best mattress we have had through Airbnb! Great a/c  good kitchen and quality appliances. Lina and her family was very friendly. The photos don’t give the apartment justice  it’s actually quite large. Can recommend for short or long stays!"),
("2017-11-18", "9080393", "Jill", "Very hospitable host.  Flat was very clean  bed was comfortable  adequate bedding and towels.  Would definitely stay there again"),
("2017-11-26", "9080393", "Christopher", "Lina was an amazing host. She provided excellent communication and everything was super smooth from check in to checkout. She even gave us some cherry tomatoes from her garden. She is a very sweet woman and an amazing host. Highly recommend."),
("2017-12-09", "9080393", "Alex", "Great stay  great house. Thank you Lina"),
("2017-12-28", "9080393", "Mel", "Normally I find something that is wrong with an air b&b  just because I compare it to home.. This one is excellent. Our double room bed was comfy  our friends in the double decker bunk bed however said it was as if they were sleeping on the floor..."),
("2018-01-09", "9080393", "Michelle", "Lina's accomodation is clean and comfortable. Much roomier than you would imagine and modern for the area. Lina is happy to help with advice. Really enjoyed our accomodation."),
("2018-01-21", "9080393", "Angie", "Great little hidden gem. Lina’s property was in the perfect location to where we needed to go. Property is much larger than we had thought it would be. Pictures don’t do it justice. Communication with questions was easy answered. Big thanks to Tony as he opened this property up for us in late November  when we couldn’t seem to find anything close by. Will stay again if ever in the area."),
("2018-01-28", "9080393", "Harley", "Great house   tony was very nice and helpful when needed   would definitely stay there again"),
("2018-02-04", "9080393", "Tracey", "This is a granny flat not an entire apartment. The spare bed is a very hard mattress"),
("2018-02-11", "9080393", "Laura", "Lina’s place is a little hidden gem of a granny flat which was perfect to stay at for our needs. It has everything and is very comfortable. Would stay again for sure"),
("2018-02-24", "9080393", "Deb", "a great spot in a lovely quiet location ... close to transport  a short drive/bus ride to major shopping centres ... and the hospital (if necessary)Very comfortable for the 3 of us  more roomy than the photos suggest and great value for money.If we need to stay in the area again  we will definitely come backThanks Lina and Tony"),
("2018-03-11", "9080393", "Tracey", "Great value for money. Friendly host.Would definitely stay again if needed."),
("2018-03-16", "9080393", "Amanda", "This was the perfect place for us. It was our first Airbnb experience and we loved it. A couple of the mattresses are a little hard but everything else was exceptional.   Thanks Lina!"),
("2018-03-22", "9080393", "Andy", "Lina was a fantastic host. She was always prompt with her communications  and went out of her way to facilitate our request for an early check in. Anyone looking for a base when visiting the local hospital  or exploring the Penrith area would appreciate this flat."),
("2018-03-24", "9080393", "Marcus", "It was was good  clean  decent bed and great shower. Didn’t realise it was in her back garden from the description - but it was all fine ."),
("2018-03-31", "9080393", "Richard", "We had a great stay! Lovely place - clean  well equipped  comfy. I can recommend staying here."),
("2018-04-01", "9080393", "Sam", "Beds were hard   pillows were as flat as pancakes   with no spares . Never once saw the host .You can’t wheel your suitcase up to the unit as it’s paved with pebbles .Living area and bedrooms was clean. No fresh ice in the freezer"),
("2018-04-13", "9080393", "Tammy", "The place was perfect for our family  a good place to stay while visiting nearby family. Lina was great to deal with. We'd come back next time."),
("2018-04-18", "9080393", "Arran And Lisa", "Tidy comfortable quiet and excellent value."),
("2018-04-24", "9080393", "Gavin", "Such a lovely family would recommend to anyone."),
("2018-05-03", "9080393", "Ayu", "The place is amazing and quite convenient for us. Great hospitality. Quick to respond. Overall  just great."),
("2018-05-25", "9080393", "Dongbeom", "Lina's house is really wonderful also very clean and tidy."),
("2018-06-11", "9080393", "Tracy", "A little far to Katoomba (blue mountains) and jenolan cave...."),
("2018-06-30", "9080393", "Kimberley", "Lina’s place is a cozy granny flat in a nice  quiet location. It fit the four of us comfortably. The bottom bunk mattress was a little hard  but that was only negative. Lina was very helpful and even brought us extra blankets to help with the cold. Would stay again!"),
("2018-08-17", "9080393", "Kevin", "Great place close to Nepean Hospital.  Worked out really well for a 6 week stay. Host is very friendly and helpful. Has everything you need for short or longer stay."),
("2018-08-19", "9080393", "Charlene", "Lina’s homestay was perfect for us. Central to everything we needed/wanted. The home was exactly what the pictures show. Lina was lovely. Came and went as we pleased. Was very comfortable. We will definitely be stayed My here again."),
("2018-08-28", "9080393", "Ben", "Lina’s place is easy to access and has all the things you need to look after the family while away. The flat is spacious and clean and communication with Lina is excellent. I will definitely use this space again when I’m in Penrith again."),
("2018-09-02", "9080393", "Alice", "집은 매우 청결했고  호스트와의 연락 역시 매우 용이하고 빨랐습니다.깨끗한 침구와 집 내부가 매우 청결하였으면 늦은 체크인 역시나 매우 친절하게 맞아주었습니다!!Thank you Lina!!"),
("2018-09-07", "9080393", "Christina Josephine", "Lina is a wonderful Host! Her Airbnb is fabulous. Great bed and fridge :) The washing machine is a big plus. Amazing cute little house."),
("2018-09-09", "9080393", "Manuel", "Man bekommt hier eine super schöne und saubere Wohnung. Die Ausstattung ist super. Man kann diese Wohnung nur empfehlen  sollte man in der Gegend etwas suchen."),
("2018-09-27", "9080393", "William", "Great clean modern accommodation at a good price. Recomended place to stay."),
("2018-09-30", "9080393", "Shana", "Perfect space  thank you!"),
("2018-10-01", "9080393", "Yvonne", "Nice place"),
("2018-10-06", "9080393", "John", "Wonderful stay. Would recommend for easy access to the Blue Mountains."),
("2018-10-07", "9080393", "Sophie", "Excellent accommodation - very clean  spacious  modern and with everything we needed."),
("2018-10-08", "9080393", "Kathy", "Lovely 2 bedroom separate home  comfortable beds  spotless  full kitchen facilities  great place to stay."),
("2018-10-20", "9080393", "Gary", "Very modern and cosy easy to find it was the perfect place for me wife and the two kids to live in comfortably for 2 weeks while we got set up for our adventure in Australia would recommend definitely"),
("2018-11-06", "9080393", "Orna", "Lina's home is clean and comfortable.  We had everything we needed. About an hour drive to the Blue Mountains."),
("2018-11-10", "9080393", "Dale", "Had a nice stay in Lina’s ‘granny flat’. New  clean and enjoyable stay. I’ll stay there again "),
("2018-11-24", "9080393", "Anthony", "Loved our stay and communication with Host Lina... thank you! Very quiet and clean space. The rooms and living area were bigger than expected  which was great. My dad and I stayed for the Ironman in Penrith  we needed and  good kitchen  relaxing space  quiet and clean... ALL were appreciated. Will stay next year :)"),
("2018-12-08", "9080393", "Melissa", "Excellent. Very clean and comfortable. Very quiet. Great air conditioning  linen and amenities. Very comfortable main bed. Easy check in and check out. Felt very safe by myself. Very happy with my stay. Thank you"),
("2018-12-16", "9080393", "Emily", "Nice little place in a handy spot"),
("2018-12-23", "9080393", "Julie", "Definitely recommend this accommodation. Enjoyed my stay. Thank you"),
("2018-12-26", "9080393", "Jack", "A+"),
("2018-12-30", "9080393", "Dominique", "C'est en toute confiance que vous pouvez vous rendre chez Lina.Vous trouverez une maison agréable à vivre  bien équipée  très propre. Une literie confortable et également très propre.Nous n'avons pas eu le plaisir de rencontrer Lina  nous avons récupéré et remis la clé sans la voir.Dommage."),
("2019-01-01", "9080393", "Sheila", "Sparkling clean! Very kind hosts. Would stay there again!"),
("2019-02-26", "9080393", "Xabi", "All great there!! Perfect place!!"),
("2019-03-01", "9080393", "Joe", "Great place  friendly host. Recommended."),
("2015-11-16", "9098095", "Sheldon", "Absolutely perfect. Margaret and John are lovely and made the stay even more memorable. Thanks so much."),
("2015-11-23", "9098095", "Laura", "Beautiful and unique property with great hosts. The breakfast spread was very welcome and the surrounding property has some lovely walks. Would highly recommend visiting the river as well. Many thanks for a wonderful stay!"),
("2015-12-01", "9098095", "David", "A wonderful experience and a great host. Margaret went out of her way to make us feel welcome and to make our anniversary special. Her and her husband take great pride in the train and their property and made us feel right at home. A really great experience."),
("2015-12-20", "9098095", "Felicia", "We had such a lovely time at this charming authentic train carriage. The train car had so much history and was such a unique place to stay and is nestled in a tranquil green setting surrounded by trees. From the moment we got there Margaret and her husband were  welcoming and gracious hosts. The little touches were fantastic and the fixings for breakfast were a welcome and lovely surprise. I would highly recommend this place."),
("2016-01-11", "9098095", "Leah", "This property was a little but out of the way but that only added to the experience. Tucked away amongst the trees was this gorgeous train carriage. I loved the attention to detail  both in the train refurbishment and with the breakfast. Loved staying here and would highly recommend it to everyone. "),
("2016-01-20", "9098095", "Paul", "This is a gem  and we will most definitely return in future. Not the cheapest accomodation by a long shot  but considering the class and character of the reconditioned railway carriage (actually suprisingly spacious  except for the kitchenette)  the beautiful forest location - its a good deal. Margaret and her husband is a friendly and engaging couple  provided quality breakfast ingredients and just took great care of us. We particularly enjoyed inviting 9 people over and entertaining them at the pavillion !"),
("2016-01-21", "9098095", "Inge", "A  very exciting experience. We have never before slept  in a 1st class bedroom in a 100 year old train wagon situated in the bush. We can certainly recommend a stay in Margaret and John's well preserved wagon. Also we were treated more than good  and we had a joyful and interesting night together.  Thank you Margaret and John."),
("2016-02-15", "9098095", "Michael And Dani", "Margaret was a great host. The train is beautiful and so are its surroundings. Great getaway just out of Sydney. We cooked up a feast on the BBQ which Margaret helped arrange. We will definitely be coming back"),
("2016-03-13", "9098095", "Sally", "This was my first stay through AirBNB and thanks to both Margaret and John  you were very welcoming.  I thoroughly enjoyed my stay and completely loved the carriage  my daughter would have enjoyed it and I was wishing she was there with me.  I would definitely recommend your carriage and I would stay with you again.  The fridge was well stocked and although I didn't have breakfast it was all there if I had chosen to have it.  Thanks so much for having a wine with me I really enjoyed the whole experience."),
("2016-04-09", "9098095", "Lisa", "Margaret and John are the nicest and most helpful hosts I met so far.Since I didn't have a car Margaret offered me several times to take me to town. She also helped me move all my belongings on the the day I moved into my new home. John and Margaret also took me out for dinner with their friends  which was a really lovely evening.The property is very beautiful  there is trees everywhere and a lot of nice sitting opportunities to hang out. You can go for walks and do bicycle tours in the surrounding forest  there is also a river not to far away.The carriage is a very special place to stay. There are so many unique  beautiful and old details and everything works very well (lights  shower  wifi...).The kitchen is equipped with everything you need and Margaret had set fruits and filled up the fridge.The bed is super comfy and even got warm heating blankets.I would love to return to the carriage which was my nest for about a week. Thank you so much Margaret and John!"),
("2016-04-11", "9098095", "Sarah", "My partner and I had an absolutely lovely stay in Minto. The property is beautiful and the train was such a unique and fun place to stay. Everything we could have needed was either provided or minutes away.  My only hope is that we can come back again some time soon :) Do note that you will definitely need to follow Margaret's directions. (Hidden by Airbnb) maps has no clue how to find this place!"),
("2016-05-04", "9098095", "Christina", "The carriage was an absolute delight to stay in. We were there two nights and wish we could have stayed longer. It had been beautifully restored and the hosts had clearly invested a lot of thought and effort into creating a one of a kind step-back-in-time experience. The hosts were very warm and welcoming  and were an incredible source of information about the train as well as the surrounding area. The food provided for us to use  along with the presentation of the in-carriage dining table really gave it that extra first-class 20th century touch. Although shops were conveniently located a 15 minute drive away  the property is isolated giving the carriage a very embedded-in-bushland glamping feel. One of our best Airbnb stays to date - would definitely recommend."),
("2016-05-21", "9098095", "Angeline", "My boyfriend and myself spent a night at Margaret's train carriage. It was absolutely charming and cosy. The carriage was pretty big and had everything we needed and even a few surprises. Margaret is such a great host  she did all the necessary to make our stay perfect. She was available as soon as we needed it  offered us a lovely breakfast and set a fire. We had a beautiful romantic weekend. We definitely recommend it and thinking of going again some time. "),
("2016-06-03", "9098095", "Ruth", "Margaret had the carriage warm and ready for us with lovely supplies for breakfast and more. Although it took some juggling to prepare our meal the first evening we got into the swing of it and indoor-outdoor was part of its charm. We loved the bush surrounds (how could it be near suburbia?)  the fire pit on our last night and the warmth of hospitality and conversations. Margaret went out of her way to care for our needs while respecting our privacy and space. We definitely recommend the Carriage and all the location has to offer. "),
("2016-06-13", "9098095", "Stuart", "Margaret and her husband well very welcoming hosts in making us feel at home . The train carriage was lovely to stay in and amazing nature at which they stay on with some lovely little Bush walks down by the Creek. Would love stay there again with lovely genuine down to earth people ... Who treated us with some home made apple pie before we left ."),
("2016-08-01", "9098095", "Avenell", "Margaret was a lovely  welcoming and warm hostess that made our special weekend away that much nicer. The train itself is set on a sprawling 9 acres of bushland and there is a warm fire for the cold nights and great outside cooking facilities."),
("2016-08-03", "9098095", "Zachary", "Two words: luxury & value. This place is beautiful  warm  and private. Margaret is a generous host and easy going."),
("2016-08-06", "9098095", "Tim", "Margaret was such a welcoming and lovely host  her communication was great and she was so helpful catering to my arrival times. The train itself is beautiful and felt like i was taking a step back in time. They have decorated it brilliantly and it is rather spacious and very comfortable. She was even nice enough to supply some goodies for a nice breakfast! Would definitely recommend this place and will go back again!"),
("2016-08-12", "9098095", "Zachary", "Margaret was very easy going and accommodating."),
("2016-08-20", "9098095", "India", "Margaret was the perfect host. The carriage is beautiful and Margaret and John have done an incredible job at restoring / keeping in great condition! It feels like a piece of history. I took my partner here as a birthday gift and it was better than could have been expected... We felt so welcomed  and there was such attention to detail and we even had fresh coffee and a bowl of blueberries and strawberries! The area is also beautiful and great for walking. Would definitely recommend and it would make a great gift."),
("2016-08-27", "9098095", "Julie", "Margaret and John were welcoming hosts. The train carriage was lovely with everything you need including quality linen and comfortable bed. The bush setting was a delight to wake up to with easy access bush walks. I would definitely recommend."),
("2016-08-31", "9098095", "Nat", "What a beautiful  magical place to stay. Set in bush land this wonderful railway carriage is all romance and charm. Margaret and John were lovely hosts. A fantastic peaceful getaway from the city."),
("2016-09-17", "9098095", "Candice", "Generous and helpful hosts. Loved the carriage  loads of character."),
("2016-09-24", "9098095", "DionSimone", "Loved the novelty of staying in the carriage. Lovely bush setting. Extremely generous in the breakfast food provided.  Margaret and her husband were very kind and generous people.  Thank you for your hospitality. Julie"),
("2016-09-27", "9098095", "Maverick", "Such a lovely place with such lovely people! Very warm and welcoming to me and my Film crew. It is definitely a place I would love to come back  but next time will be for a vacation for sure! Thank you so much for your warm and kind service you have shown us on the day!"),
("2016-10-02", "9098095", "Bec", "Margaret was exceptionally helpful from when we first booked our trip! Even though she was away the weekend we were staying she organised for a friend to meet us and gave us all the information we needed before we arrived. She also left us fresh fruit and vegetables  as well as food for breakfast which was a lovely surprise! The railway carriage itself is a wonderful space and full of historical touches. It is easy to see that a lot of love and work has gone into the carriage and it truly felt like a home away from home. It was very relaxing waking up right next to the bush  and located a short drive away from shops and other bushwalks. We also loved getting to meet Margaret's dog and puppies! We look forward to hopefully staying at the railway carriage again in the future - perfect for a weekend escape from the city! "),
("2016-10-07", "9098095", "William", "Great place to stay  plenty of character and lovely hosts  will definitely be back!Thanks Margaret"),
("2016-10-20", "9098095", "Bronwyn", "Delightful hosts who went out of their way to be welcoming - even picked me up from the station when the taxi didn't show. The accommodation is delightful  filled with memorabilia and collectibles  comfortable and containing everything one could ever wish for. The bushland setting  puppies and parrots add another dimension! Just loved it."),
("2016-11-08", "9098095", "Steve", "Location  location  location. We are North American residents and stayed two weeks. From Minto Heights  the train station and local mall are only ten minutes away. The train ride to Sydney is only about an hour  the drive to the Blue Mountains about two hours  to Illawarra about an hour-and-a-half  and to Canberra  about two-and-a-half hours. It's a perfect location to see much of the Sydney-Canberra area. Staying in a converted railcar is a unique experience. It is not like a standard apartment and some of the spaces are a little quirky. John and Margaret are excellent hosts and we found nothing wanting. Our stay was both comfortable and pleasurable. We would return in a minute! "),
("2016-11-12", "9098095", "Anoop", "Lovely place. Margaret and John were really friendly. Wish we could stay longer. Will be back soon!!! Thanks guys for having us."),
("2016-12-04", "9098095", "Ari", "Margret and John were very accommodating. From bush walking tips to where to get a bite. We enjoyed our stay."),
("2016-12-17", "9098095", "Margaret", "A very special place  set in an Australian bush setting and a unique and interesting experience spending the night in a converted train carriage. "),
("2017-01-15", "9098095", "Susanna", "An amazing unique experience  with great hosts who thought of everything. We will be back to enjoy the beautiful scenery. It is a very special place!"),
("2017-02-15", "9098095", "Robyn", "Margaret is a generous host who respects your privacy yet unobtrusively ensures that you have everything that is needed  including generous breakfast provisions.We stayed several weeks whilst waiting to move into our new home and although the bathroom and kitchen are compact they are functional and we soon adapted to cooking and boiling water for washing up in the indoor/ outdoor kitchen. The shower has plenty of hot water but once again is compact. The bed is comfortable and the living area quite spacious. Train enthusiasts will particularly enjoy checking out the many original artifacts that decorate the spaces. The accommodation is located a few kilometres from the train station so a car is recommended. There are some beautiful bushland walks leading to the George's River that are well worth exploring and Sydney is about 50 minutes by train.We would highly recommend Margaret's place  especially for short stays. We loved the convenience of being close to everything yet being on the edge of bushland and the river. We also enjoyed interacting with Margaret's three dogs that live on the property and look forward to returning when we return to the area."),
("2017-03-10", "9098095", "Lisa", "Very authentic. Nice rural safe location  you wouldn't believe you were 10 minutes from Campbelltown. Great hosts and very private. Looks like they are adding a small conductors office  and the friendliest quietest h blue healers I've ever met. Great stay"),
("2017-04-12", "9098095", "Shona", "This place is very special and you will never stay anywhere quite so unique. The hosts were so lovely I would recommend this place to anyone"),
("2017-04-24", "9098095", "Martin", "It was fantastic staying in the unique train carriage. Margaret  John and the dog's were delightful company!"),
("2017-04-30", "9098095", "Ebony", "A cute little get away  very well presented and lovely location. The train is unquie  with great features. Margaret was very hospitable  and thought of all the little touches. Thank you very much. "),
("2017-05-14", "9098095", "Jo", "Great stay everything perfect and this accomodation offers just that little bit more! Awesome"),
("2017-05-17", "9098095", "Andreas", "Margaret and her husband have done an amazing job restoring this over 100yo carriage. It takes you right into another space and time. Thank you Margaret."),
("2017-05-24", "9098095", "Stephen", "I loved the secluded bush setting of the train carriage  and found it a beautiful place to relax and recharge."),
("2017-06-04", "9098095", "Jess", "Adorable! Exactly what i was looking for! I would love to stay again :) what a treasure! Thank you!"),
("2017-06-11", "9098095", "Jason", "Fantastic place to stay if you are after something a little different. Beautiful bush setting and lovely hosts. Very well recomended"),
("2017-06-25", "9098095", "Michael", "I bought two nights in the train carriage for my dad who is a train enthusiasts. He had an absolute ball spending two nights there. We also had a family bbq at the premises on one of the days  and the hosts were absolutely fantastic. There were 20 of us at the bbq  and there was ample room and Margaret was very accommodating and obliging. Excellent facilities!The communication with Margaret was excellent  she made sure we knew everything we needed to make this a memorable stay. We will definitely think about booking this for other treat train enthusiasts we know. "),
("2017-06-28", "9098095", "Andrew", "You don't need to be a train buff to really enjoy the experience of the carriage and surrounds. But it's even better if you are. :)It is easy to get lost in the romance of train travel as it was. A perfect place for a romantic getaway; if only I was young again.Highly recommended and I will be returning as it is a perfect place to relax but still be close to the big smoke."),
("2017-07-30", "9098095", "Amanda", "Very quiet. Nice stay."),
("2017-08-20", "9098095", "Daniel", "Awesome unique place to stay. Warm and comfortable with everything you need. Dogs were gorgeous as well and so friendly."),
("2017-08-27", "9098095", "Nadia", "Staying in this beautiful train carriage is one of the nicest Airbnb experiences I've ever had. Everything was delightful - from the wonderfully preserved vintage interiors  to the thoughtful modern upgrades  to the beautiful bush setting. Best of all was the kindness of the hosts - Margaret not only came to pick me up from the station  but also stocked the train carriage with simple  delicious supplies (sourdough bread  tomatoes  eggs  fresh basil etc) so I could make my own meals in the tiny kitchen. Other highlights include the hammock/day-bed which was perfect for reading in the sun  and the three gorgeous dogs who were endlessly playful and amusing. I would recommend this place to railway enthusiasts  vintage lovers  and anyone who wants to immerse themselves in nature. I hope to stay in this beautiful place again! "),
("2017-08-31", "9098095", "Jensen", "Nice quiet retreat and unique accommodation in a train with a few treats as extra."),
("2017-09-05", "9098095", "Daniela", "I loved my short stay at Margaret's Air BnB. I was looking for somewhere quiet and relaxing to do some reading and writing  and a friend had recently raved about her weekend spent staying in this beautiful restored train carriage. It was just what I needed  and Margaret and her family were extremely generous and welcoming to me. It was such an easy trip from Sydney centre and is surrounded by beautiful bushland  creeks and rivers. I would recommend it to any person or couple looking for a relaxing and lovely little getaway. Thank you for such a wonderful stay!"),
("2017-10-01", "9098095", "Sally", "Had the most amazing 3 week stay here . I can't recommend the train enough. If you love peace and tranquility this is the place for you.In the most beautiful setting. John and Margaret are perfect hosts.I felt at home as soon as I arrived from the Uk.The train has everything you need for a very comftable stay with lots of little personnel touches to.Margaret provided me with some lovely things for breakfast upon my arrival .I will always have the fondest of memories of my stay there and was sad to leave easily could have stayed longer ."),
("2017-10-05", "9098095", "Rebecca", "Great place to stay - relaxing  easy and novel."),
("2017-10-14", "9098095", "Arlene", "Pleasant people and lovely bushland"),
("2017-11-19", "9098095", "Dayna", "Great  unique experience. Very welcoming. Excellent instructions made it easy to find. Authentic train  beautifully restored. Made extra special by lots of little extras and the added benefit of a beautiful log fire. "),
("2017-11-26", "9098095", "Lauren", "We had an event with 20 people out on the patio during the day  and then in then stayed in the train overnight afterwards. Such a great day! So much history and train has been beautifully restored! Such a lovely place!"),
("2017-12-17", "9098095", "Penny", "The train carriage was exactly the place I wanted for a relaxing weekend getaway. The accommodation was amazing in that it was quiet  uniquely designed and surrounded by nature. Margaret was very welcoming and baked us cakes which was delicious. Overall  it was a enjoyable stay and we're planning to go back."),
("2018-02-04", "9098095", "Mark", "This stunning historical train carriage is a unique place to stay  surrounded by the quiet bush  so close yet so far away from suburbia.  Margaret is also an excellent and helpful host.  "),
("2018-02-11", "9098095", "Andrew", "Great relaxing place to stay. Loved the bush setting  the quirky carriage  the 2 welcoming cattle dog pups and all the little special touches that Margaret provides. Had a great stay and would return anytime."),
("2018-02-13", "9098095", "Harrison", "The rail car was the perfect get-away after four bustling days in Sydney. Margaret and John were lovely hosts -- welcoming and attentive  not a bit intrusive. Wifi was on the blink when we arrived  but my husband (on working holiday) survived the brief disconnect and I enjoyed the added serenity! Highlights of our stay included bush walks  "" brekkie with the lot"" using the fresh ingredients Margaret provided  and a relaxing day trip to the New South Wales Rail Transport Museum (Thirlmere) and Australian Botanic Garden (Mt Annan). Would love to stay again!"),
("2018-02-17", "9098095", "Lauren", "Margaret was very accomodating to our late check in and late check out the next day. There were thoughtful touches to the carriage that we only discovered before we left. On a longer stay  I’m sure there are more surprises to be found. A very memorable stay!"),
("2018-03-05", "9098095", "Alison", "This was a fantastic find   especially if you’re looking for a quiet place  out of the way but near enough to get to other amenities . We thougherly enjoyed our stay and wouldn’t hesitate to come again if the opportunity presented itself."),
("2018-03-11", "9098095", "Donna Marie", "Great accommodation Nice to have experience something a little different Dogs are super friendly"),
("2018-03-22", "9098095", "Robin", "Unique experience."),
("2018-04-02", "9098095", "Kaiqi", "Such an unique experience and Margaret even provided us with fresh fruits and toasts and heaps for us to have during our stay. Their dogs are very friendly and smart  welcoming us and even leading us to the way to exit on the first day. I would say overall Margaret made us felt like home away from home  and  in the meantime the help she offered is just right on spot so the privacy is 100% guaranteed as well."),
("2018-04-09", "9098095", "Robyn", "Margaret and John are absolutely sterling hosts!  What a unique and restful experience this was!  In the midst of a peaceful Australian forest  you will find a private  refurbished railway carriage with so many true to period furnishing for you to enjoy a lovely yesteryear ambiance.Margaret provided fresh fruit  vegetables  breakfast makings and beverages.  A very generous food offering.I highly recommend this venue.You will particularly enjoy the experience if you have an appreciation for historical railway memorabilia  and days gone by!"),
("2018-04-22", "9098095", "Guy", "A Quirky place in a lovely location full of charm and personal touches. It just works"),
("2018-06-10", "9098095", "Ashlea", "We had to find last minute accomodation and what a fantastic surprise  we absolutely loved it. We only stayed at the property minimally as we were in Sydney for work  Margaret very thoughtfully made sure the carriage was heated for us before we arrived home each night. We will definitely be staying in this little gem find on future trips :) It provided a lovely reprieve from what were very exhausting days."),
("2018-06-12", "9098095", "Sarah", "This place is absolutely beautiful! The little touches like fresh strawberries  tomatoes  eggs  bacon and jams really made a difference! Thank you for a lovely stay at this unique Airbnb!"),
("2018-07-15", "9098095", "Ja", "The weekend away was amazing. The accommodation transported us back in time   the whole carriage is fascinating. Outside  the walking tracks and friendly dogs were a highlight. Margaret's tips on bushwalks and local spots added to the perfect weekend getaway."),
("2018-07-21", "9098095", "Vinod", "Thanks Margaret for the amazing time we had over your property   enjoyed the stay even though it was only for a day . It was a surprise for my wife's birthday and she was delighted . Has all the amenities that you need . Peaceful stay and will not forget the fresh strawberries "),
("2018-08-04", "9098095", "Stacey", "Such an amazing stay! Margaret is an outstanding host  will lend a hand when you need it  even if it's just turning the heat on in the carriage before you arrive. "),
("2018-08-11", "9098095", "Karen", "We would absolutely recommend this place  would have loved to stay longer and are hoping to be able to come back some day!"),
("2018-09-02", "9098095", "Jennifer", "Margaret’s train carriage is a hidden gem in a beautiful location. Margaret and John are wonderful hosts and made our stay perfect. We would definitely come back again. Loved it!"),
("2018-09-16", "9098095", "Andrew", "A unique experience. Amazing place. Not to be missed."),
("2018-09-22", "9098095", "Siobhan", "Margaret and John were such generous and friendly hosts  we had plenty of privacy but they were always on hand for advice. The train carriage is so artfully done up with extra thoughtful touches. We were very comfortable during our stay  and the supplies left for us to cook breakfast were delicious. Such a quiet  beautiful escape to the bush yet conveniently close to the city. Would definitely recommend staying here for a novel experience with lots of character and wonderful hosts!"),
("2018-09-30", "9098095", "Maree", "Great place to stay. Great hosts. Quiet and peaceful and ideal romantic getaway."),
("2018-10-13", "9098095", "Jason", "This is an Airbnb experience like no other. A train carriage set in a quiet bushland reserve...amazing. All of the historical touches (the old signs and black and white photos) really enrich the experience even if you're not a history nerd. On top of that  Margaret is incredibly hospitable and charming  as are the two dogs. Would highly recommend the train carriage to anyone looking for something relaxing and special."),
("2018-10-26", "9098095", "Amanda", "What a little gem found in such a beautiful setting. We loved the history of the train and that it was beautifully restored. We hope to stay again next time we visit our old home town. Definitely worth a visit !"),
("2018-10-27", "9098095", "Amanda", "Awesome and novel experience. Clean and tidy. Train lovers will love it. Couples seeking peace and quiet will love it. Small touches included making the stay wonderful get away. You won’t regret staying here."),
("2018-11-04", "9098095", "Christian", "Margaret is a great host  and this wonderfully restored train carriage is a unique piece of history and a far more interesting place to stay than your standard run-of-the-mill hotel. The property is located on a pleasant and secluded acreage  were you'll be gently woken by bird calls and the wind in the trees. The train carriage itself is cozy and well-appointed for two guests - with cooking facilities  chairs and benches for lounging  and a private room to retire in. We enjoyed the games that were provided  as well as reading about some of the history of the railroads in the greater Sydney area. We hope to visit again soon!"),
("2018-11-23", "9098095", "Damon And Rachael", "Margaret and John were lovely and their two dogs friendly and welcoming. The carriage is spotless and beautifully restored! Absolutely loved the tranquility.... great stay and I highly recommend to all Air Bnb travelers!"),
("2018-12-11", "9098095", "Peter", "Most Outstandig Experience"),
("2018-12-23", "9098095", "Jens", "A wonderful place to stay. Very special! We had a fantastic nightly train ride. Margarete is a perfect host and the communiction was always very easy."),
("2018-12-27", "9098095", "Pat", "Margaret is an amazing host and the carriage was some much more nostalgic than I expected.  The touches around the carriage added to the nostalgia. The bush setting ia amazing. The train was spotless and comfortable. Would definately stay here again. Thanks again Margaret and John."),
("2018-12-29", "9098095", "Andrea", "A magic place  a very unique experience. Staying in a museum. Everything just perfect.And Margaret and her husband such lovely people.My best Airbnb experience ever"),
("2019-01-02", "9098095", "Joshua", "Margaret & John’s hospitality was wonderful & the two dogs as welcoming committee! The outdoor kitchen  fireplace and the train itself are beautiful and the photos don’t do it justice. I’m hoping to send through some new photos we took of the train to further show what’s on offer. Only a short walk away is a river for swimming and there’s a few paths for short bush walks. Anyone interested in the local history will get a kick out of some of the ‘Easter eggs’ around the train- with commemorative photos. Definitely recommend getting the fire going and cooking outdoors- bring bug spray! Would recommend to anyone- and looking forward to staying again."),
("2019-01-27", "9098095", "Emma", "Truly unique experience  excellent host  very pleased with the booking"),
("2019-02-02", "9098095", "C Stephen", "This is the perfect slice of history for those wanting to experience an authentic train carriage. The details of the restoration are perfect. Lovely country atmosphere  and great hosts! We had an amazing stay!"),
("2019-03-01", "9098095", "Katieann", "One of a kind experience. The railcar is absolutely stunning  in pristine condition and decorated as it might have been for a cross-country haul in the 1930s. I stayed for a night  enjoyed sleeping in the cozy bedroom area of the car  and dined in the dining area. Even did some writing in the little railcar office. It's a little spooky at night  but in a fun way. You're staying in a piece of history! Margaret and her husband and their dogs are incredibly welcoming and kind and went out of their way to make my stay wonderful. Thanks  Margaret!"),
("2015-11-02", "9223554", "Yvonne", "The host canceled this reservation 56 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-02-28", "9223554", "家宁", "That room is good. Those two night was comfortable. Profect breakfast.Sorry my english is not good. I just want to say she is a nice lady. Maybe next time I will choose this room"),
("2016-04-03", "9223554", "Mark", "Gayles place is like her  amazing place amazing person. So relaxed and laid back. Thanks "),
("2016-05-13", "9223554", "Agne", "Gayle is the best host you ever can imagine. She is incredibly kind  caring and easy going person who makes you feel like home. The apartment is nice  clean and tidy  and just a few minutes from the city centre. I would highly recommend Gayle's place for everyone! "),
("2016-08-13", "9223554", "Peter", "Gayle was a great host. Easy to communicate with and very informative. The room was great n the bed was comfy. Thanks heaps Gayle"),
("2016-10-29", "9223554", "Carmen", "It was perfect!!! Gayle it was like family for me! She helps me a lot  and we had a good terrace conversation together.It's the best place where you can sleep if you go to Sydney!Thank you for all Gayle!!!! "),
("2016-11-23", "9223554", "Mr B", "Wow... EXCELLENT indeed. From the moment I stepped in. I felt completely welcomed. The host is excellent  great and very respectful. Really excellent always. The host told me I have unlimited supply to towels. I felt home. I can use everything in the kitchen. Very clean. This is something you will notice. The place is really clean. Clear instruction.  I was offered to use the washing machine. There is a natural feeling of feeling comfy there. The area is great. It is close to Newtown walking distance. Few minutes from train station. Train is 5 to 10 minutes from Central station in Sydney. Once you're in Central station you're in the city and you can walk around. A++++ Would love to revisit someday. Excellent!"),
("2016-12-03", "9223554", "Jacob", "The host canceled this reservation 25 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-02-09", "9223554", "Ling", "5 minutes to railway station Hostess very nice Very clean tidy and comfortable"),
("2018-02-01", "9223554", "Mengchan", "Gayle is a very nice lady.my mum can't speaks too much English.but she speaks very slowly and clearly.thank you for all the time and give my mum a wonderful Sydney accommodation experience."),
("2018-02-10", "9223554", "Manuela", "The apartment is really good located (5' from the train station). Gayle is the perfect host: friendly  helpful and able to make you feel at home. She also allowed me to leave my luggage in her apartment for 1week after my check-out. Thanks Gayle! Hope to se you again :)"),
("2018-03-29", "9223554", "Carla", "Really nice place. Gayle is very friendly and kind. I rented a bedroom in her house for almost two months and she gave me a ride to a supermarket and to the airport once. The apartment is really close to the bus stop and train station as well as restaurants and supermarkets (Woolworths is like 10 min walk). There is a set of stairs to get to the apartment. The place has one A/C in the common area and each room has a ceiling fan. While the apartment in general is clean  I did find two spiders during my stay. The apartment also has another room (her room) which she also rents in Airbnb. The only thing I would improve would be communication since some of the times I didn't know there were other guests staying in her room and would find strangers in the apartment without a notice that if I saw other people inside the apartment it was okay because they were guests (eventually she tells you but sometimes its after you see the other guests). We cooked for each other and had a lovely dinner! Thanks again for having me Gayle :)"),
("2018-05-20", "9223554", "David", "Thank you Gayle  I enjoyed my stay at your place. Excellent communication too"),
("2015-12-09", "9156574", "Heather", "We really enjoyed staying with Kath   the place was great and really clean and tidy. Also really central and close to supermarkets and redfern train station. The fridge in the room was a lovely touch  as were the welcome biscuits! :)"),
("2015-12-15", "9156574", "Lily", "My overall experience at Redfern at Kath's was very high and enjoyable. This room was actually my second room staying with Kath right after the first which was also a wonderful experience. Kath was consistently a wonderful lady who made my partner and I feel very welcome right from the start  all the way to the end. Even prior to meeting her in person  what  I was impressed with how highly responsive Kath was with communication. She was very welcoming and friendly with an approachable nature. The room was very accurate to description; quite large and spacious with lots of natural light  especially with a wonderful and large balcony attached. I was very impressed with the interior design of the room by Kath herself which brought out the unique aspects  and brought character to the room. It was bright and beautiful with wonderful combinations of patterns and colours. It was very impressive. Everything was accessible and ready when we arrived  including many fresh towels  shampoo  conditioner  body wash etc. as well as chargers on either sides of the bed. The bed itself was very large and comfortable. Additionally  Kath even went out shopping and brought home cereal etc. which made us feel welcome. In addition  the accommodation at Redfern itself was quite convenient. It was approximately 200m away from the train station which was very close by Central (even within walking distance ~15mins). Late night shops  especially bars and restaurants were also close-by and near walking distance. Definitely will be recommending to family and friends to stay :). Thanks Kath. "),
("2015-12-29", "9156574", "Natalie", "Loved my time at kath's apartment  spacious room with balcony  the welcome Tim tams were a treat.It was so easy to get to the city from redfern station two blocks up. Would recommend staying there to anyone  didn't want to leave after a week "),
("2016-01-08", "9156574", "Svenja", "The room is exactly like the pictures and the balcony is very nice. It was really close to the train station and you are very fast in the city."),
("2016-01-25", "9156574", "Christopher", "Both the host and the apartment were wonderful. The apartment is very clean and well organised  with paintings and decorations around the apartment providing a soothe homely feeling. Inside the room was a wooden stand with towels  books and dvds which added a lot of personality to the apartment. The room had a nice balcony attached to it which provided a nice place to eat and relax. As well as this  the room had 2 powerboards next to the bed so everything can be plugged in and a mini-fridge next to the bed.The host provided most of the items that you might not remember to bring with you including plates  cups  cutlery  shampoo/body wash and more. The apartment was less than a 2 minute walk from the Redfern Train Station which is just 1 stop away from central  so this was in the perfect location to do sight seeing. I would recommend staying at this apartment."),
("2016-02-01", "9156574", "Michael", "Kath was a great host  everything was well prepared when we arrived."),
("2016-02-08", "9156574", "Jamie", "My husband and I stayed for 3 nights. It was a happy stay at Kath's home! It was clean and comfy. It was just like friend's house! Thanks for Kath!!!"),
("2016-02-27", "9156574", "Irma", "Kath is a great host. She is nice and very accommodating. She welcome us when we arrived and explain how everything worked out in the apartment. The apartment is clean and well organized. The room is nice and comfy  just exactly like what it was described. And of course  as shared by previous guests  there are tim tam  fruits and bread with jams provided for us. For location..  it is great! Close to the Redfern station  need only few minutes to reach the city. Thanks Kath!   "),
("2016-03-03", "9156574", "Kaya", "Out stay with Kath was great! She was a very helpful and nice host!Thanks for having us!"),
("2016-03-11", "9156574", "Corina", "Staying at Kath's place was an amazing experience! My mum and I were there for a few days to explore Sydney. Great location just minutes away from the train station and it took no time at all to get to the CBD. It was a really nice room with a nice balcony and everything was clean. It was great that we also had our own private mini fridge. Kath provided towels and soaps for the shower as well. Kath also provided suggestions for things to do in Sydney and she recommended a restaurant called Blue Fish in Darling Harbour which was the most delicious seafood dinner I have ever had. The service at the restaurant was also amazing  we mentioned Kath's name and they gave us a free calamari dish! The view from the restaurant was also beautiful. If you want a nice seafood dish I would definitely recommend it! Overall the experience was lovely and I wouldn't hesitate to stay there again if I'm ever back in Sydney. Thanks Kath! "),
("2016-03-13", "9156574", "Richard", "Lovely room  good setting  good communication. Many thanks"),
("2016-03-15", "9156574", "Dominik", "Friendly host  even welcomed us an hour earlier than we arranged. Thanks again  kath! Room was clean  balcony was a great addition to the room. Had a fridge in the room as well - would stay there again."),
("2016-03-27", "9156574", "Kalpukai", "Kath was a very good host  she welcome us at the door show us arround the house  we feel at home  there is tv if you want to watch news or you can watch dvd  nice place to be and easy going to the train station 5mns walk..Thank you Kath"),
("2016-03-30", "9156574", "Anna Lorraine", "This room was lovely! I bring my cup of coffee to the balcony every morning and do a bit of light reading because the balcony is just perfect for that.Kath was generous with amenities  a lot of pillows  a lot of towels  shampoo  conditioner  body wash  all at our disposal. Coffee  milk  tea and bread on the house.Fan is available too. Initially wanted to let the cool air in  but cars keep passing by so best to get that glass door shut to keep the noise out.If the two rooms are rented  bathroom time can be tricky in the morning so best to get up early  i guess. (Ask whether the other room will be rented on your dates!)Location is very ideal  a few steps away from Redfern station  one stop away from Central and easily accessible to everywhere. Did not get to try the bus from here  as trains got us everywhere anyway.Uber to airport was $29."),
("2016-04-11", "9156574", "Nicki", "A wonderful place and host. Cheers."),
("2016-04-19", "9156574", "Adriano", "Kath is an amazing hostess  she cared for every detail to make your stay in Sydney was the best !! The location of the apartment is very good  just steps from a train station. If I return to Sydney sure I will contact again."),
("2016-04-27", "9156574", "Fiona", "We were warmly welcomed by Kath and Rusky when we arrived and was glad that the room was spacious  clean  comfortable and well equipped. Our stay was very pleasant and convenient given the train/bus stations are just within 5 mins walk. The washing machine and dryer was a plus for our stay. All in all  we did enjoy our time with them. We highly recommend Kath's place. "),
("2016-05-01", "9156574", "Mark", "Kath is a very accommodating and friendly host. I arrived late on the day and she waited patiently for me to check in. She lives at a super convenient location - 10 minutes train ride to city  apple store  China town etc. Would definitely stay again next time I'm in Sydney!! "),
("2016-05-09", "9156574", "June", "Kath's apartment was a great way to start our vacation. We stayed in the room with the balcony and had plenty of room. Kath supplied bread  fruit and other breakfast items. We also enjoyed the many bakeries that are close to the apartment. Kath thought of everything from a fridge in the room  big bath towels  washer and dryer  to Tim Tam cookies. We enjoyed pleasant conversations and Kath was a great asset in dealing with our little emergency.  Kath was willing for us to check in early in the morning after flying in from the US. The only drawback was sharing the small bathroom with the other Airbnb guests who were staying there  but this was just a minor inconvenience. "),
("2016-05-14", "9156574", "Sue", "Kath was a  very warm & welcoming host  ably assisted by her adorable dog Rusti! The room was as shown with the useful addition of a small fridge  and the private balcony off the room was a lovely place to sit & eat  chat  etc. The apartment was well appointed and a wonderful location  particularly to Technology Park where I was attending a seminar. Kath offered great hints for local restaurants  etc. Would highly recommend staying here!"),
("2016-05-19", "9156574", "Domenica", "Absolutely loved my stay at Kath's. Felt just at home the entire time. So close to everything including Redfern Station. Will definitely be staying again!"),
("2016-05-22", "9156574", "John", "The room is the ideal urban retreat - large and airy  with a sunny balcony  only 5 minutes away from Redfern station and the vibrant strip of restaurants and bars along Redfern Street. Kath has a large number of guests  and she has the routine of welcoming people into her home down pat - she strikes the perfect balance between making you feel at home and giving you space to get on with things. A special bonus was her gorgeous dog  who was always ready for pats and to shake hands. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2016-05-24", "9156574", "Natalie", "Kath is very nice person and we like her dog very much. The location is close to the train station and easy to go anyplace. The apartment is same as the pictures. If I come  I will choose it again."),
("2016-05-29", "9156574", "Matthew", "Kath was a great host  very communicative and flexible! Will stay with her again :)"),
("2016-06-07", "9156574", "Gu", "Kath is a nice guy ~ She provide nice breakfast. She have a dog   so cute ~ The room is very comfortable~"),
("2016-06-20", "9156574", "Maasa", "Our stay at Kath's place was wonderful! She was friendly and the room was clean and comfortable. The location was easily accessible to the train station as well."),
("2016-07-04", "9156574", "Debbie", "I second what other guests have mentioned. Great location  cosy room  felt right at home. Loved having Ruski around too. Thanks Kath for having me! "),
("2016-07-09", "9156574", "Rachel", "It's a very comfortable home  complete with a very friendly big and lovable dog! We didn't feel incredibly safe out at night in the neighbourhood but the house was a secure safe haven for us. Thanks Kath & Ruski!"),
("2016-07-16", "9156574", "小娟", "Kath is a beautiful hosted  we  all like her and lovely Ruski  a big dog .Her house is clean and warm .We enjoyed our holiday in Sydney.Thanks Kath !we will miss you!Good luck to her!"),
("2016-07-25", "9156574", "Mark", "Another wonderful stay always. Kath was very professional and kept the room in a great state. I'll keep going back everytime I'm in Sydney."),
("2016-07-29", "9156574", "Rob", "Kath was very friendly and a perfect host. Although she had to work during daytime she was helpful and her apartment was nice and clean! Good connection to the city. Train station is only 2 minutes walk! Definitely would recommend staying at her place!"),
("2016-08-02", "9156574", "Rajitha", "Great and friendly place  loved the interior and balcony. Loved Rusty  the dog."),
("2016-08-07", "9156574", "Kaushik", "I had a very comfortable stay here. Kath is a great host  and her dog Ruski is very friendly. The room was clean  and the place is very close to a train station (just one stop to the city center). The neighborhood is a bit quiet with not many people around  but doesn't feel unsafe. Thanks Kath!"),
("2016-08-14", "9156574", "세라", "it was good time with kath and rusky."),
("2016-08-26", "9156574", "Michael", "Kath was super friendly and the place was very comfortable  super close to the railway."),
("2016-08-30", "9156574", "Daeho", "Good location & clean room with balcony. I enjoyed the time at Sydney thanks to her house. The room was clean and she provided enough towels and the other amenities. The balcony was sweet too. The dog  Ruski was my favorite in her house. It is so lovely."),
("2016-09-11", "9156574", "Travis", "Kath was a wonderful host- very clean  safe  welcoming accommodations- and we fell in love with her dog! We Highly recommend her place."),
("2016-10-04", "9156574", "Alex", "Great location next to Redfern train station which can take you practically anywhere in the city. Kath was a great host  providing just the right amount of guidance"),
("2016-10-07", "9156574", "Emma", "Great easy stay with Kath and the dog (I forgot his name!). Very clean and comfortable and a really easy location to base from."),
("2016-10-10", "9156574", "Jing", "Kath的房子非常干净整洁 离红坊区火车站只有7分钟路程 交通非常方便!家里有一只非常可爱的dog 叫Ruski."),
("2016-10-15", "9156574", "Natalia & Ryan", "The apartment is located in a great neighborhood  very close to the train station. The separately balcony is really great and a nice place to spend time on a sunny day or warm night. Kath was a very welcoming host and her dog was very friendly as well! There were a few slight inconveniences  like not being able to use the bathroom from 8-10am while the cleaner was there on Saturday morning and sharing the bathroom with another set of guests  but overall I would definitely recommend the apartment! "),
("2016-10-23", "9156574", "Jack", "Thanks for the hospitality  it has been a wonderful experience to me  especially this is the first time i am using the airbnb. The room and the location is perfect  i reckon your room is better than a hotel. So thanks again  hopefully see you next time."),
("2016-11-20", "9156574", "Loren", "Clean  big comfy room. Walking distance from station. Loved our stay here."),
("2016-11-29", "9156574", "Adrian", "Kath has really thought about how to make the experience great for her guests. The place is super well organised and spotless. It has everything you could need (even shampoo in the room  plug adapters and spare light bulbs). Kath is very on the ball  welcoming and friendly. Ruski the dog is brilliant and an added bonus. Comfy bed and only a 5 min walk to Redfern station with good cafes nearby. Will definitely stay again. "),
("2016-12-05", "9156574", "Charles", "Good location to take train at Redfern Station  nice host to clearly deliver message and guidance. Two rooms are set for Airbnb which means we will share bathroom with the other guests. Both are polite. In all  it is convenient and comfortable stay."),
("2016-12-21", "9156574", "Niall", "Excellent location and only one stop from central train station. One thing to note is that the front door of the flat is permanently left open  only secured by a mesh security gate which poses a slight security risk. This is due to the kitchen  living room or bathroom not having any windows  and needing additional circulation. Check in only offered before 8am or after 6pm which was inconvenient."),
("2017-01-03", "9156574", "Margit", "The host canceled this reservation 360 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-01-04", "9156574", "Elise", "The appartment was nice and we enjoyed taking the breakfast on the little balcony. Kath also provided us breakfast  saved us the first morning :)We liked staying there  the room was nice and cosy and we had everything we needed. Her dog is a big relaxed one:)"),
("2017-01-08", "9156574", "Shanshan", "交通很便利 距离地铁很近 外面还有免费的停车位｡Kath对房子的管理很利落 沟通上很简单｡"),
("2017-01-16", "9156574", "천", "위치와 청결 모두 만족 스럽습니다"),
("2017-01-24", "9156574", "Judy", "A lovely place to stay  very close to the train and clean. Kath is very helpful  apart from offering breakfast  she also patient to give me advice when I needed to buy some medicine during the trip.Rusky  Kath's dog is very cute and good behave. "),
("2017-01-30", "9156574", "Daniel", "Kath's place is close to the central. there is lots of space and she is very friendly.nice balcony!"),
("2017-02-03", "9156574", "Bella", "Kath is very nice and friendly! And her pet dog is sooo cute and quiet! The room is clean and comfortable. And the traffic to Sydney center is very convenient. I strongly recommend your staying here."),
("2017-02-05", "9156574", "Ian", "Kath was a fantastic host! The room was well prepared with lots of nice little touches (balcony was a treat). Very well located next to the station and really easy to get around. All-in-all a home away from home!"),
("2017-02-09", "9156574", "Julian & Co", "Kath's apartment is well located within walking distance to the Redfern St  which was a big plus since we used public transit quite a lot during our visit. The bedroom was clean and cozy. Kath was very easy to communicate with and just as friendly as her lovely dog. The bathroom was a bit tight considering the fact that it had to be shared with the other guest couple and the host. Check-In time wasn't too flexible  but as former hosts  we understand that work and everyday schedule have to come first  so that wasn't a problem at all. We can definitely recommend this place to other travelers!"),
("2017-02-19", "9156574", "Jessica", "We had an extremely bad experience with Kath. When we first arrived in Sydney (8am) we were not allowed to drop our luggage off until after 5pm. We had to pay some ridiculous amount to leave it at a train staion in storage for the day.The bed was extremely hard and uncomfortable. The toilet paper had run out at one point and wasn't even replaced for abit. The appartment was otherwise clean and very close to Redfern train station making it very convenient getting everywhere you need to go in-and-around Sydney.We orgainised with Kath a couple of days prior to leave our luggage at the appartment on the last day as our flight wasn't until 9.30pm. We agreed we would be past to pick our luggage up at 7-7.30pm. When we messaged Kath that we were outside the appartment complex  she sent a reply message saying ""she wasn't in Sydney"" and that it would take around 45 minutes to organise for her to find someone to come and let us in to the apartment. Luckily for us the couple renting the other Airbnb room came home and let us in as otherwise we definitely would have missed our flight home. We have done many Airbnbs and they have all been fantastic. This has been the worst experience so far."),
("2017-02-22", "9156574", "Guillaume", "Very good host  I recommend her.  "),
("2017-03-18", "9156574", "Alexis", "Kath's place is good  walkable distance to Redfern train station. The roomwas so clean and with good smell. I loved the balcony especially! Ruski is super cute and quiet. It was a great stay anyway  although the water heater seemed not that perfect  since the temperature of water shifted to too cold or to hot sometimes."),
("2017-03-25", "9156574", "Ivan", "Kath's place is closed to the Redfern station. There is a fridge in the room so that we can store our groceries Individually. There are fruit  milk and bread provided as breakfast. It's very convenient place for tripper. There are also a dog and a cat live in there.  If you are an animal lover. It should be your great choice. "),
("2017-04-14", "9156574", "Jen", "lovely place Very comfortable room and good location.Ruski is super cute dog"),
("2017-04-17", "9156574", "Loh", "Very comfortable room and great location!"),
("2017-04-20", "9156574", "影", "Kath is a really nice host . Her house is very lovely we really enjoy the place."),
("2017-04-24", "9156574", "Savannah", "Kath was accomodating and responsive. The apartment was clean. A bit noisy in the morning"),
("2017-05-07", "9156574", "Tzu-Hsuan", "溝通上可能有點問題 位置是真的方便 但房東請人打掃當天才講這點讓人很不舒服 因該提早講才對｡"),
("2017-06-04", "9156574", "Chin Hou", "Good location."),
("2017-06-14", "9156574", "Madelene", "Kath was a lovely host. The room was big and very comfortable for my boyfriend and I. The apartment was in kept clean and in good condition. The Redfern neighbourhood is also convenient as it is in a central location - great for tourists! Ruski was very friendly and nice to have around the house as well. Would definitely recommend Kath's place!"),
("2017-06-24", "9156574", "Yunli", "lovely apartment one stop from CBD which is convenient. The apartment is very clean because of well organized cleanup. However  the time of checkin time on website is incorrect and we have to store our luggage in the station  cost extra unnecessary money. And wait until 7pm to be checked in."),
("2017-07-12", "9156574", "Jie", "这家民宿是我住过的最糟糕的一家 中午到达后主人没时间让我们自己把行李寄存火车站等候她6:00到家 见面后一句客气的话没有 安排入住态度冷酷 感觉很寒心!进到房间地毯上尘土很多 毛发也多 掀开被子很多黑毛 着实让我吃惊!算了由于我停留时间长 再找其他家 在这里只好忍忍了 钱都交了免得惹麻烦 原本住民宿想自己做点可口的饭菜 结果这家女主人的冷漠让我望而却步了 每天只能牛奶麦片了 用他家烤箱还没有使用到位被她大声呵斥一顿太凶悍了!老实的忍了一周终于到期了 我换了一家舒服的公寓 摆脱了这种宣传不符的民宿 本不打算影响她的生意 结果这位女主人居然发邮件说把她家地毯弄脏了 晕!我们什么都没有做 简直了!跟她无法沟通了!我怎么招惹你就这么好欺负吗?你穷疯了吗?真想骂她!还是忍住了 实际给她评一下吧!要不然我心里也不舒服!"),
("2017-07-15", "9156574", "Luna", "nice place and lovely dog"),
("2017-07-25", "9156574", "Lucas", "Enjoyed my stay here. The room was spacious with large windows  and a balcony. All amenities were well cleaned and the space was very comfortable. Kath was also flexible with our checkout time making it very easy for us."),
("2017-08-02", "9156574", "羽柔", "The host canceled this reservation 28 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-09-09", "9156574", "Vivien", "Kath is friendly  fast response  given clear instruction and flexible check out time which made us had wonderful stay.  Good location and quiet area! The only comment is the water heater are sometime cold after there are someone shower before us. Strongly recommend to stay with Kath & lovely Ruski !"),
("2017-09-17", "9156574", "Karen", "Location was reasonably closed to the train station and CBD. This listing is suitable for travellers who are easy going."),
("2017-09-27", "9156574", "Nitish", "Nice central place to stay in Sydney!!"),
("2017-10-01", "9156574", "Kimberley", "Excellent location  very close to everything that we needed for the weekend. Very easy going and relaxing stay. Would definitely come back here again."),
("2017-10-15", "9156574", "琬琪", "陽台好舒適 環境也很整潔 房東家的兩隻狗狗也超溫馴好可愛"),
("2017-10-29", "9156574", "Claire", "A lovely room! Had a great stay at Kath's  she provided plenty of advice about Sydney  the dog was a gigantic cutie  and the balcony made the place an absolute stand out :)"),
("2017-11-06", "9156574", "Imogen", "A great place if you're wanting to explore and make the most of Sydney's pubic transport - walking distance to supermarkets and cafes and super close to a main train station. A very welcoming space :)"),
("2017-11-12", "9156574", "Lingshuang", "First time in Airbnb  Kath’s apartment is really clean and warm  Kath was away in the first two days  her friend Kane helped us with checking in  and Kane is friendly. Kath’s adorable dog Ruski is really quiet and friendly  I like him!"),
("2017-11-17", "9156574", "Mun", "Kath's place is clean and very near to the Redfern station. Community is quite safe at night as the building is along the main road from the train station. Near to supermarket as well. Check in time is not exactly flexible as the host is only available early in the morning or in the evening. However  Kath did adjust check in time to 2:30pm to accommodate us. We greatly appreciate that. Generally we did have a very pleasant stay at Kath's place. Her dog is very cute too."),
("2017-11-25", "9156574", "Joyce", "The location is really close to train station  the host is nice and the dogs are super cute. It’s a good stay."),
("2018-01-28", "9156574", "Julien", "Very good"),
("2018-02-03", "9156574", "Howard", "Great hospitality on Kath   awesome dog and nice room really great location"),
("2018-02-15", "9156574", "Aridanto", "Only 3 minutes walking from Redfern station. Spacy room. The room can be a bit noisy at night since it faces Gibbons Street  but overall it was a good experience to stay at Kath's apartment."),
("2018-02-18", "9156574", "湘星", "Overall  this place is way better than I expected  i booked this place for my parents who were visiting me during the Chinese New Year holiday. Kath is an responsive and helpful host  and she has a lovely giant Teddy. Location is good  very close to the bus station and train station. Less than 10mins walk to University of Sydney  Broadway  Central Park."),
("2018-03-09", "9156574", "Wing Yi", "The house is extremely close to redfern Station - just less than 5 minutes walk! Very convenient   there are nice cafes and a supermarket on the walk to the redfern train station.The house is neat and clean   well maintained   with a big doggie. Milk  bread are provided for breakfast. Utensils are free to use. Kath would tell me how to keep the kitchen and bathroom clean after use.Can sit at the sofa in the living room and watch TV while having breakfast. The bedroom is well decorated and with a relaxing balcony. The room is nice scented and has a Comfy atmosphere . Can use the washing machine and dryer so long stay tourists need not worry about running out of clothes to wear.However  future residents have to consider that Kath has to work and has to stay at home for Check in at evening to night on your day of arrival. It is not convenient for her if I change my check in time (eg postpone the check in time ) on the day of arrival.Sometimes  there may be problems in finding the transportation and arrive later than expected   then Kath has to stay at home and wait. Especially for those arrived at morning / early afternoon at Sydney - have to find a locker somewhere first to store the luggage first then do some sightseeing    or maybe is not so familiar with the new environment so a bit difficult to find the right restaurant to eat - may not arrive on time at Kath’s house.Kath will brief me on every important points of living in her house and she respected residents’ privacy well. She is of reach by using Airbnb messages. She answers promptly and instruct clearly on the check out details.By the way  Rusky the dog is not very active and usually lies on carpet and sofa  having his own good time ~ : )"),
("2018-03-24", "9156574", "Lisa", "Great location  one train stop from central. Great room with the comfiest bed  more comfy than mine at home! A lovely balcony  great facilities and Kath provided tea  coffee  milk and bread. A lovely safe and quiet area. The biggest highlight was being greeted by Ruski the groodle. Always ready for a cuddle. I would highly recommend this Airbnb. Thanks Kath and Ruski."),
("2018-03-29", "9156574", "John", "Lovely bedroom and comfortable bed. The property is very conveniently located for the city as the train station is five minutes walk and one stop from Central Station. We were happy to be left to ourselves as Kath was out at work from early morning but we're a bit disappointed that breakfast items weren't replenished over the three days we were there and there were no 'ordinary' tea bags or cereal after first night.However  we wouldn't  necessarily  let this put us off as the accommodation  itself is good."),
("2018-05-06", "9156574", "Lim", "It was a pleasant stay at Kath’s place. Near to train station  not too far from town."),
("2018-06-27", "9156574", "Yu", "Kath is a great and responsible host  her place is cozy and neat. The refrigerator in our room is so convenient. The balcony is also cute and quiet. What's more  although I'm a little bit scared of pets  but Ruski is so well behaved adorable and quiet! We all enjoy the time we spend in here. Besides  one important factor that we choose this place is because it is close to Redfern station(2 mins)~"),
("2018-07-18", "9156574", "Valérie", "We've stayed at Kath's place for 8 days and felt like we're at home. The location is just perfect!"),
("2018-08-18", "9156574", "Shimpei", "wonderful place.Good location."),
("2018-09-29", "9156574", "Clare-Marie", "Great stay at Kath's place. Excellent location and Kath's apartment is clean  comfortable with all amenities needed for a relaxing and homely stay. Kath is also extremely friendly and helpful! Thanks for a great stay :)"),
("2018-10-12", "9156574", "Barb", "Kath and her dog Ruski welcomed us into their very clean and well maintained home.  When we arrived earlier than check in  she offered us luggage drop off and even a shower. Kath has a fantastic location.  Only a 5 minute walk to the train station and 10 minute ride to downtown Sydney.  Our favorite coffee is the The Urban Piccolo (1 block) (Say Hi to Lucas) and The Tudor Pub for a beer and a bite.  Kath had breakfast items and was always willing to answer question in person or by email.  Thanks Kath and Ruski. We highly recommend your place   --  Cheers  Barb and Chris"),
("2018-11-08", "9156574", "Elaina", "Really loved our stay at Kath's place. Convenient location as most trains go past Redfern  and only a one or two stations away from all the CBD goodness. The house is clean and tidy and her dog Ruski is just the sweetest!! The only thing I will say is if you're a light sleeper such as myself  it can be a bit noisy with the surroundings streets. However if thats not an issue for you then I highly recommend! :)"),
("2018-11-18", "9156574", "Nguyen", "Kath’s place was cozy  close to the station. Rusky is a really good boy  he is well trained. I enjoy having him around during my stay."),
("2019-01-04", "9156574", "Anouk", "Very nice place to stay on your trip to Sydney. Great location! Close to the train station  it’s just a short walk. The bedroom and restroom were nice and clean. We’ve enjoyed our stay."),
("2019-01-15", "9156574", "Patrik", "Rent och bra boende nära tunnelbana. Vill man gå till Sidney centrum så är du där på 15-20 minuter. Stort rum med en stor balkong. Fanns alla saker som man kunde tänka sig behöva."),
("2019-01-23", "9156574", "정임", "I really  really was upset about her attitude. Each room has not even key.  She was insisting on claiming me not confirming missed pillow. I was very embassed  with her act. I had seriously bad feeling about Austlaian people."),
("2019-01-26", "9156574", "Kylie", "Good communication with our host. Gorgeous dog! Our only real issues were the traffic noise as this location is close to a busy thoroughfare and we stayed during a spell of hot weather and we found the pedestal fan not to be adequate. Good location in terms of close access to public transport."),
("2019-02-06", "9156574", "Shahira", "HIGHLY RECOMMEND: If you are tossing up between places and Kath's apartment is in your saved lists - look no further  pick her place! The bedroom is HUGE with its on private balcony with chairs etc  and  your own fridge. The kitchen was well resourced with all the utensils you need. Great water pressure in the shower + dryer / washer for you to use. My FAV part of my stay was ofcourse Ruski. He is a gentle giant who loves a pat and will melt your heart."),
("2013-07-15", "927923", "Brian", "We stayed here for several weeks during a gap between leases. This is a lovely quiet apartment situated close to public transport (buses and ferries) connecting you to the city. The apartment was clean and spacious with all mod cons available. Julia was excellent to deal with  and was very responsive to any queries that we had.I'd recommend this apartment to anyone looking to stay in Sydney."),
("2014-06-30", "927923", "Carlos", "The apartment was perfect!!!So much space!!!Definitely a place to recommend.Julia & Adele were so helpful.The bus to the city was a couple of blocks away and to get to Bondi Beach was also pretty close.Being 2 blocks from the Bay made the trip to Manly so nice!!!!!100% recommended."),
("2014-08-31", "927923", "Chloe", "Julia and her sister Adelle are friendly and helpful  they always respond to my enquiry within a day. When we reached their place after a tiring flight  Adelle gave us a warm welcome and they even prepared some snacks for us. That was very thoughtful.. The unit is clean and tidy  with a big bedroom and a cute kitchen. It's located at a great neighborhood  convenient and quiet. The unit is within walking distance to ferry and bus stop. We stayed for two months and spent a really great time there. PS  do try the pizza shop nearby  you won't be disappointed!"),
("2016-09-04", "927923", "Daniel", "Very nice place. Very spacious and cozy at the same time. I had some problems with the wifi (my fault) and Julia helped solving it very fast!We stayed for almost 2 months and everything went very well.Getting to the city by ferry is very nice  passing in front of the Opera House and the Harbour Bridge. I took it almost everyday and did not get tired."),
("2017-04-01", "927923", "Jeff", "The apartment is fantastic.  We stayed for over a month  and really enjoyed being there.  It is easy to get from Rose Bay to the CBD on the ferry.  And Julia is a great host.  I thoroughly recommend this place."),
("2018-08-03", "927923", "Rita", "We had a lovely time staying at Julia's place.  The place has a spacious living room  bedroom and bathroom.  Great shower pressure.  The location is quiet but not isolated.  Ferry is pretty close by  though we mostly take the bus to get around.  Communication with Julia was very fast and easy.  Julia is very friendly.  She met us upon check in and walked us through the apartment.  Would highly recommend this place to anyone looking for a short term home in Sydney/Rose Bay."),
("2019-01-01", "927923", "Aaron", "Great place in a fantastic location with lots of nearby amenities . Julia is an amazing host with lots of local knowledge. Highly recommended."),
("2013-05-10", "928035", "Jacquie", "Wow! What a lovely house! Freshly painted  beautiful old floorboards  ( they are floorboards so a bit squeaky!)  clean minimalist furnishings  and in a QUIET area of Randwick about 17 minutes from the airport  and straight down Coogee Bay Rd  to the ocean. You have the SPOT around the corner  and the best Japanese  on Belmore Rd ( TEN). Best of all there is a garage  because parking in this area is a big problem.  Thank you so much Simone and John for your kindness in accommodating us. We had a lovely stay."),
("2013-11-04", "928035", "Alan", "The Sudan is an excellent house very well maintained and in a great (Website hidden by Airbnb) is exactly as described and  Simone ensured the booking arrangements were conducted entirely smoothly. Garage parking is a major bonus although the location is well served by Taxis and frequent buses both to Central and the beaches. At the end of the road is The Spot  with great Cafe's and Bars. We look forward to our next visit ! Alan and family"),
("2013-12-16", "928035", "Deborah", "Simone was extremely helpful and thoughtful.It was so good to not have to move out until Sunday afternoon when our flights left.The accommodation was very clean and spacious just perfect for the 4 of us plus a baby. It was so good to have a garage too.It was perfect location to walk to bus transport and cafes and supermarkets.We would stay there again."),
("2013-12-23", "928035", "Nik", "I had a wonderful stay at Simone's place. The house was clean  modern and stocked with everything we could need  right down to cling wrap and oil and gas for the BBQ. The location was fantastic  a lovely walk to the beach and Simone was fantastic in all her correspondences. "),
("2014-01-10", "928035", "Anne", "This is a great holiday house to stay in.  We are a family of 5 and were very comfortable in the space.  The flat was nice and clean with all the kitchen essentials  plenty of seating and an outside area which we used a lot too.  The area is great  the shops are close enough to walk to and just up the road there are lots of different restaurants and a fantastic patisserie.  The bus services are excellent with buses every few minutes into the city and down to Coogee Beach... Look out for the family funday sunday tickets at $2.50 per person for full day travel on buses  trains and ferries (if you are travelling with kids)!"),
("2014-02-17", "928035", "Angela", "The Soudan is beautiful and homey  just like the photos. We felt right at home especially in this wet weather we've had in Sydney! The rooms however did get a bit humid due to the weather but we are not too worried about it. All in all It was a wonderful stay. Thank you Simone. "),
("2014-03-03", "928035", "Joanna", "Myself and two friends stayed at Simone's lovely home in Randwick for a little under a week.  The home was extremely neat and clean and she was kind enough to leave us a bottle of wine in the fridge too!  It was absolutely perfect for our needs during our trip since we had a car  it made transportation easy however  I saw many bus stops in the area.  We had a really fantastic time exploring Sydney and having Simone's home as our base.  It was a quiet and peaceful neighborhood and the home was really charming :)"),
("2014-03-20", "928035", "Syl", "We stayed at Simones beautiful home for nine days in March. The home is exactly as described with everything supplied. The location is perfect with bars and restaurants literally around the corner. Coogee beach and Bondi Junction(for the shoppers) are just a few minutes drive away. There were five adults and an infant staying and Simone also supplied a cot and high chair for the baby.We enjoyed our stay immensely and would highly recommend Simones home to anyone staying in Sydney."),
("2014-03-28", "928035", "Jim", "We had a great stay at Simone's house in Randwick. The house is very spacious and well appointed and well stocked with necessities. It is located very close to shops  cafés  and public transport  but in a quiet street. The house also has a large outdoor entertainment area which unfortunately we didn't get a chance to use. Highly recommended!"),
("2014-07-21", "928035", "Alice", "We stayed in Simone's house for a week (two couples with two babies) and had a wonderful time! The house is lovely - beautiful linen and towels provided; well appointed kitchen & laundry  and even a lovely little courtyard with outdoor setting! We loved it and can't recommend it enough. Also so impressed by the professional cleaning service who left the house in pristine condition for us. "),
("2014-09-14", "928035", "Robyn", "The reservation was canceled 101 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2014-09-21", "928035", "Sharon", "Our stay at Simone's home was everything we expected and more. Great location  within walking distance from shops and beaches. Short cab ride to Allianz football stadium and Randwick race course which was perfect for our weekend plans. The house was very comfortable and had everything you would need. The off street parking was an added bonus. Would definitely recommend Simone house to anyone wishing to stay in the Randwick area. I know we will be back! "),
("2014-12-21", "928035", "Victoria", "We had a great week at Simone's place in Randwick. The home was very clean  well equipped with everything we needed and exactly as presented in the photos. Public transport and shops were very convenient and it was helpful to have a garage as street parking was a little difficult on some days. Simone was very responsive and we would love to stay here again when in Sydney. "),
("2015-03-01", "928035", "Kim & David", "Beautiful house  well-appointed and deceptively spacious. So close to the shops. "),
("2015-06-26", "928035", "Elizabeth", "What a perfect stay in Sydney. The ""Sudan"" is ideal for staying near UNSW  the beautiful Coogee Beach and close to transportation into Sydney. The semi is spacious  comfortable and well appointed. The back area is a bonus for barbecuing  and relaxing in the open-air. "),
("2015-07-17", "928035", "Tanya", "This was a lovely property in a great location. Simone had left a comprehensive welcome folder and a bottle of wine  which was a nice touch. The property is just around the corner from The Spot which has a great range of restaurants and cafes."),
("2015-09-07", "928035", "Amanda", "The house was clean  comfortable and all that I expected. It is a charming house. It was perfect for our stay. The neighborhood is quiet and pleasant and close to cafes. I would be happy to stay again."),
("2015-09-15", "928035", "Ross", "We stayed in the Sudan for a week and the place was lovely. It is in a great location that is 5 minutes walking distance to a shopping mall with a supermarket etc  and only 2 minutes walk to the bus stop and to local bars and restaurants.The house itself is nice with everything there that you would need. The garage is really handy  albeit with a bit maneuvering required to get the car in if you have a longer car due to the back lane being fairly narrow.We didn't have any interaction with Simone but she left us a bottle of wine  some milk and a great welcome pack with guides to house  shop  transport  etc.  but everything was there so no interaction was required."),
("2015-09-29", "928035", "Mark", "The property was in a great location  close to cafes  shops and transport.  It was quiet  clean and exactly as described on the site.  Would happily stay again."),
("2015-10-16", "928035", "Glesni", "Thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Simone's beautiful house. Very spacious  with everything you could possibly need. The house was spotlessly clean  beds extremely comfortable and provisions left for us in the fridge. Also very convenient to local shops and only a bus ride away from the city. Wouldn't hesitate to stay here again."),
("2015-10-24", "928035", "Frances", "Our host made us feel very welcome. There was a bottle of wine in the fridge and a carton of milk  to get us started. The apartment located in a fabulous area...2 minute walk to a street full of great restaurants  short walk to Coogee Beach and to UNSW. The apartment is on the older side...very funky and extremely clean! Beds were comfortable and kitchen had everything we needed. There are laundry facilities as well which was very helpful for us. Only negative is that only one window had a screen on it so it didn't feel comfortable to us to sleep with them open  both from a bug angle and a safety angle since the front bedroom is right on the street. There is an air conditioner in the living room but it does not work well so it was a bit warm in the apartment. Other than that  a great experience!!"),
("2015-11-01", "928035", "Nicole", "Simone's house was the perfect location for our purpose in attending a conference nearby at the uni. It was bright and airy with plenty of room for 3 of us. It was also quite handy having the extra toilet outside!The pantry is well stocked with the basics like salt  pepper  oil etc and there was a lovely bottle of wine in the fridge on arrival.The nights were a little cool and although we found an extra blanket  we all felt we could have done with a quilt/doona as well.  The WIFI seemed a little slow...perhaps it was shaped at that time? but i found i needed to use my own personal hot spot on my phone rather than wait for the house wifi to load up.The location is great as is also close to Coogee beach and The Spot offering a great variety of restaurants."),
("2015-11-15", "928035", "Natasha", "Communication with Simone was very easy and quick.  She is a very responsive host.  The property was lovely and very clean.  It was a little warm as there was only an air conditioner in the lounge (which didn't work brilliantly).  The kitchen had everything you could need.  The beds were comfortable and the lounge too.  Fly/security screens on the windows would have been useful - there were a few mosquitos around which we couldn't stop entering the house if we wanted to keep the windows open.  The location is brilliant - so close to the shops/cafes etc.  Yet  the house itself is on a quiet road and we didn't hear any noises at night.  Perfect!"),
("2015-11-21", "928035", "Rebecca", "Simone's house was perfect. She was a flexible and excellent host. Super close to town and extensive bus network. I almost didn't want to leave a great review in case other people want to book the place and I can't book it next time I'm in town! Thanks!"),
("2015-11-28", "928035", "Yoram", "Simone's house is very well located  spacious and very nice. My grandchildren enjoyed the outside sun-sheltered space."),
("2015-12-03", "928035", "Peter", "A perfect home in an ideal location  very convenient to UNSW where we were attending a conference. House was exactly as described  and had been well maintained and cleaned. The bedrooms are large and beds comfy. Courtyard is perfect for a relaxed BBQ  with outdoor couches and fresh herbs. We will definitely stay here again when next in town."),
("2015-12-13", "928035", "Patrice", "What a wonderful house to stay in - it is as described 3 excellent bedrooms with very comfortable beds  plenty of space for us to sit in the lounge  dining room or the lovely outdoor shaded area. Simone responded quickly to all enquiries & organisiational points with the key being very easy to access. We really appreciated the extra unexpected touches i.e. complimentary wine  & milk in the fridge as well as sauces etc in the pantry. The location is fabulous .... not a long walk to the beach or the wedding we attended  it is a quiet neighbourhood with shops nearby. The house is spotlessly clean. Having a garage was very important so we could leave the car there for the duration. Thank you Simone we'd love to come back."),
("2016-02-09", "928035", "Rebecca", "Great location  comfortable home"),
("2016-02-15", "928035", "Anthony", "Simone was always very quick  informative and welcoming with her communications  on arrival to her beautiful home there was even a bottle of wine to greet us. The home is large  fresh  light filled and located in a quiet centrally located street. It is perfect for three couples or a family (as was our case). It was especially great to have the car port out the back as we had driven from Melbourne and wanted to use the car to get around whilst we were there. Having said that  there are a number of different bus stops all within 2mins walk from the home  there's also many cafe's  bars and a cinema all in close walking distance. We very much enjoyed our stay thanks Simone!"),
("2016-02-19", "928035", "Renee", "Simone thank you for your wonderful house for us to stay! We loved it! It was perfect  warm and welcoming. Our family loved it too. The little outdoor garden was beautiful for our champagne breakfast. The house is large  nice big bedrooms and plenty of space. We would highly recommend to anyone wanting to stay. Very cleAn  very comfortable "),
("2016-02-21", "928035", "Neo", "很好的房东 周边生活很方便 房子很干净 很有本地生活的味道 推荐!"),
("2016-03-01", "928035", "Anwar", "The house is perfect for our stay. It's 10mins walking distance to UNSW and a few mins away from supermarket and eateries. The house and rooms are very clean and our stay made pleasant with the amenities provided in the house like washer and dryer  a big kitchen with a separate dining and living room.  "),
("2016-03-06", "928035", "Alicia", "We had a great stay at Simone's lovely house. It is very spacious  the bedrooms all a nice size  living room  breakfast room and kitchen all easy to be in. The area out the back is also a nice little escape. We appreciated the complimentary bottle of wine and the equipment in the kitchen  which we used each night. The location is very handy  20 minute walk to to Coogee beach for a swim  or bus stops so close for a ride into the city. Simone was also very flexible with the check in and the check out which made things very easy for us. So all good!"),
("2016-03-18", "928035", "Jason", "This place is amazing! Simone is a great host  replying very quickly to my queries. The house is very welcoming  comfortable and perfectly located. Would love to stay here again!"),
("2016-06-05", "928035", "Haylee", "We had a great time at Simone's place despite the gloomy weather. The house was the perfect size for 4 adults and 2 kids and nicely furnished. Very handy to have the garage for parking with all the rain we had. Also enjoyed the complimentary bottle of wine  nice touch! Very handy to local coffee shops and we loved the Creperie just around the corner! "),
("2016-06-27", "928035", "John", "Simone has been a wonderful and attentive host. Her property was brilliant for our family stay in Sydney. The location offers great strategic access to both Coogee / Randwick life and transport links to city centre attractions. A great place to stay to base yourself in Sydney."),
("2016-07-09", "928035", "Tanya", "This was our second stay in this property and we enjoyed it as much as our first stay. The property is lovely and very conveniently located."),
("2016-07-20", "928035", "Rmhc", "A beautifully furnished place in close proximity to the SCH."),
("2016-08-12", "928035", "Mike", "A wonderful warm and inviting home with lots of amenities in it to make our stay comfortable. A great location with lots of shops  cafes  restaurants and public transport nearby.This is an excellent base for visiting the local area as well as having great access to the city.The outdoor area with BBQ is brilliant and we just wish we had more time to enjoy the house."),
("2016-08-23", "928035", "Lucy", "Comfortable home in convenient location.  Simone was very helpful organising everything quickly and promptly communicating."),
("2016-09-05", "928035", "Mary", "Simone's place was fantastic. Great location close to shops and cute cafes and restaurants. My sister had stayed here before and it didn't disappoint.. Thanks Simone for offering your place to us  we will definitely be staying here again whenever we are in Sydney for a couple of days or more. Highly recommended!"),
("2016-09-19", "928035", "Jessica", "Great house Simone! My family stayed here while my wedding was on and it was so close to Randwick shops. The house itself was very beautiful and had everything we needed."),
("2016-10-02", "928035", "Anne", "We didn't meet Simone but she was very responsive to messages and made it easy to get into the house. The house was pleasant and close to shops and the beach. Simone had left a bottle of wine in the fridge  which we appreciated!  A nice place to stay in the beach suburb of Coogee."),
("2016-10-11", "928035", "Gemma", "Great house to stay in  very conveniently located with bus stop two mins away  beds very comfy and was provided with everything we needed! Hidden gem!"),
("2016-10-31", "928035", "Varun", "Great place to stay  close to the shops  city and all the attractions around Sydney.."),
("2016-11-08", "928035", "刘月", "Simone is very friendly and willing to help. The Sudan with great location that can easily find  about 20min drive to the city  5min drive to Googee Bay  8 min drive to Bongdi beach. You can also take the bus by 2min walk to bus station; the bus 377 373 can take you to city of Sydney. The house has plenty of space  conformable bedding and various sauces in kitchen. Outdoor couches and garage are also handy. The wifi is very helpful let us get in touch with friends. Thanks again for the bottle of wine. We enjoyed the stay and thanks Simone.Emily"),
("2017-02-26", "928035", "Nelsen", "Wonderful location with many cafes and shopping around each corner. Easy 10-15min walk to Coogee beach. The home is well laid out with good mingling areas and an outdoor patio with BBQ."),
("2017-03-04", "928035", "Asha", "We were absolutely delighted with Simone's gorgeous house and enjoyed our stay. The house is a stones throw from cafes and restaurants at the Spot in Randwick. It was great to have the garage for undercover parking and also the outdoor area. I would highly recommend this place to anyone rating in Randwick. Simone was excellent to deal with responded to straight away when we had a small problem with one of the taps. Her husband was round to fix it ten minutes after we spoke."),
("2017-03-31", "928035", "Victoria", "."),
("2017-04-07", "928035", "Jamie", "Beautiful home on a nice quiet street just around the corner from shops and restaurants. Walking distance to Coogee beach. The garage is very useful and the house itself is lovely. Thanks for the bottle of wine cooling on arrival  it was a really nice stay. Zero complaints!"),
("2017-04-17", "928035", "Lisa", "This property is just a short stroll to shops  cafes and restaurants and just a 10 min walk to the beach.  It is roomy and very comfortable with Simone  our host  thinking of the little things that make your stay more pleasant.  "),
("2017-05-08", "928035", "Kate", "We had a great weekend here. The house has lots of room and is equiped with everything you need. Fantastic location - 2 mins walk to cafes  restaurants  movie theatre and a delicious French patisserie. And the main shops of Randwick just up the road. We would recommend to couples  families  groups of friends  travellers or anyone looking for a great pad in the Randwick area."),
("2017-05-28", "928035", "Kylie", "Perfect spot for my family. My partner was working at the hospital  while we had easy access to transport  food etc.  Comfy Clean Perfect "),
("2017-06-11", "928035", "Thanh", "We had a short stayed in Simone beautiful family friendly home. The house is very warm and cosy central to surrounding coffee shops and petrol station. We all enjoyed our stay and will be booking our next trip soon with Simone."),
("2017-07-03", "928035", "Eric", "A lovely  spacious  and neat home with all the accommodations a family of four would want  one half block from the bus line going right into Sydney CBD and Central Station. The host was communicative and helped us make arrangements as needed during our stay. We highly recommend this rental unit."),
("2017-07-18", "928035", "Janelle", "Very well presented  quiet  great spot "),
("2017-07-23", "928035", "Susanna", "Enjoyed our stay tremendously.  Very clean  well appointed and convenient. Would come. Ack to stay for sure...."),
("2017-10-02", "928035", "Kristy", "Great place  thanks"),
("2017-10-15", "928035", "Grace", "The Soudan is a beautiful house that is decorated well. It is close to The Spot and a supermarket. Instructions on how to enter were perfect. We were provided a later check out which was greatly appreciated. We all left agreeing that we would return to this cottage in the future."),
("2017-11-26", "928035", "Lesley", "Very comfy home. Great location for restaurants  and walking distance to the beach."),
("2017-12-17", "928035", "Fallyn", "The house is gorgeous and spacious. Great location close to shops and cafes! So beautiful  really enjoyed our stay."),
("2018-01-01", "928035", "Michael", "Great location and very clean and tidy - probably ready for a kitchen and bathroom upgrade!"),
("2018-02-11", "928035", "Allan", "Great location  spacious rooms  rear lane garage and friendly neighbourhood. Nice and solid with polished floors but a little musty so keep those windows open!"),
("2018-02-16", "928035", "Rebecca", "The house is in a fantastic location  with the best resturaunts in Randwick just at the end of the street. And yet it is very quiet with no street noise even when sleeping in the front bedroom. The house was comfortable and would be a great base to explore Sydney. The small touches like milk  wine and basic cooking needs were lovely."),
("2018-02-21", "928035", "Cheryl", "Beautiful home in a very convenient location! Will definitely come back!"),
("2018-02-27", "928035", "Katrin", "It’s a very wonderful place to be!!!"),
("2018-03-16", "928035", "Roger", "Great location in a lovely character house with plenty of space."),
("2018-04-28", "928035", "Lauren", "The Sudan is a lovely place to stay  a good amount of space  and all the facilities you need to make a home away from home. A perfect location if you need to spend time at the Prince of Wales hospital (as we did). The Spot (around the corner) has great eat out options  and supermarkets and other shops are all in walking distance.Simone is a great host  responsive and very easy to connect with - we felt welcome and Simone accommodated extensions to our stay easily.Thanks for making a hard time for us easier Simone!"),
("2018-05-19", "928035", "Shanti & Lauren", "Simone’s place was fantastic! We stayed for 4 nights with 3 adults  two babies and two kids and there was plenty of room for all of us. Simone left us a portacot and high chair  both of which were very useful. The location was fantastic  we walked  and on occasion took the bus  to the beach. And the proximity to The Spot was great for dinners and early breakfast at the bakery!We would definitely stay here again."),
("2018-07-17", "928035", "Jess", "Perfect location. Warm home. Comfortable beds. Everything you could wish for in a place away from home."),
("2018-07-22", "928035", "Joanna", "We had a lovely 2 night stay at Simone’s house  within walking distance to shops and a lovely outside area and convenient lock up garage as limited parking out front. "),
("2018-07-30", "928035", "Tony", "Great location - central to everything without being noisy. Well maintained and safe for family and pooch."),
("2018-08-06", "928035", "Hannes", "Heel leuk huisje  voldoende dichtbij centrum Sydney en stranden. Winkels op wandelafstand."),
("2018-08-14", "928035", "Roo", "Simone’s house was perfect for a few days in Sydney. Randwick is a great area if you need to get in and out of the city easily and the beach is an easy walk from the house. Simone makes everything a breeze with great communication and clear instruction. The house was clean and well laid out for a small family and a few friends. Will definitely rebook in the future!"),
("2018-08-28", "928035", "Elio", "Great house- it had everything we needed for a great stay with two kids  the car park was wonderfully handy  perfect location for all Randwick and Coogee had to offer  quiet  clean  comfortable! We would definitely stay again if visiting Sydney. "),
("2018-10-04", "928035", "Susan", "Perfect home  perfect location  perfect hosts resulting in the most magical  memorable family moments ... we loved every minute of our 4 day stay at this beautiful Randwick home!!!"),
("2018-10-11", "928035", "Amna", "Simone’s place was beautiful  extremely convenient and her hospitality made our stay very easy. Thank you so much for hosting us!"),
("2018-10-29", "928035", "Melissa", "The house is charming and cosy and in the most perfect area! An easy 2min walk up to cafes and bus stop and about 5mins walk to Randwick central. Simone was a great host and very responsive  she even had a lovely welcome present that was enjoyed sitting out the back in the sun! We will definitely be back"),
("2018-11-02", "928035", "Jarrod", "Simones place was very well maintained and clean. It was perfect for our young family and the kids loved the place. Simones place was so close to the local shops and beach which made staying there very convenient."),
("2018-11-11", "928035", "Marise", "This house is a perfect base to explore Sydney. It has three comfortable bedrooms  with a dining room and living area to enjoy. We enjoyed the space and the proximity to Coogee beach and other areas. It is a quiet area with lovely gardens. We enjoyed the smell of the jasmine flowers coming from the front garden.We did not have time to enjoy the outside area  but can imagine that it can be a great spot to have a barbecue.A great find in Randwick!"),
("2019-02-02", "928035", "Cristian", "We thoroughly enjoyed the premises for our family weddings weekend at centennial park. The close proximity to the shops allowed us ease to services. The garage parking was invaluable. We enjoyed the facilities like sufficient glassware when we hosted refreshments for our families between church and reception. Very charming house! Thank you"),
("2019-02-05", "928035", "Elizabeth", "Peaceful  spotless and close to everything"),
("2019-02-10", "928035", "Janine", "Great house  great location. Just perfect couldn't have asked for anything better. Everything was just right. The special touches were just a nice highlight. Will definitely come back. Would recommend everyone to stay here  just has such a nice feel you won't want to leave!!"),
("2019-02-16", "928035", "Dominic", "Comfortable and well located  had a great stay."),
("2019-03-03", "928035", "Wojtek And Ewa", "Simone's home is perfect - well appointed  excellent location with great shopping  food and transport just around the corner.  Easy 20 minute bus trip to the center of the city  5 minutes to Coogee beach. The house was the ideal base for our family when attending our son's wedding.  We were able to have friends over between wedding and reception as there were plenty of glasses  cups etc and a beautiful lounge and dining area to entertain in. As it was  quite hot the air conditioning and fans in all bedrooms were most welcome. Communication with Simone was effortless and we greatly appreciated the special touches and care shown for our special circumstances.."),
("2017-02-25", "9415438", "Liz", "I had an absolutely lovely week staying at Bj's comfortable home. The room itself was nicely equipped  with a comfortable bed  and plenty of space. I really enjoyed the little balcony too. I LOVED the neighborhood of Surry Hills too - so many cute shops and restaurants a hop away. Bj was super responsive and accommodating. I highly recommend a stay at Bj's home!"),
("2016-01-24", "9577071", "Yoo Deok", "Awesome place!Unfortunately I couldn't meet Jason. He was on vacation  so his friend Stu hosted us. He was just on time when we checked in & out  and very friendly. House is just like in the pictures. Nice living room with wide open terrace. The one of the best thing is there is a small park where you can oversee the Bondi beach in just 50m away. Also around 5min walking distance to beach.The main room has double bed and empty drawers to keep things. And second room has 2 bed and 1 bed-like shelf.There is no A/C (small room has small one  bue can cover the whole house)  but in day you can open window. there is breeze so it is not so hot. In night  each room has fan  so no need for AC.There is laundry room with laundry machine and dryer. Bondi beach is quite more humid than Sydney. so it was very convenient.I'll definitely visit again with my family someday. This is perfect place for family. I so envy Jason to live this house:) "),
("2016-10-01", "9577071", "Joel", "Jason's place was exceptional! Our hosts were able to meet us at check-in  and getting to know them briefly was fantastic. Their home is welcoming  as is Bondi Beach. The flat is walking distance from groceries  restaurants  and of course  the bus. We were comfortable with the assurance that when coming home after long days in the city  we would have anything we needed and a quiet place to rest up for the next big day out. Bondi is a wonderful community - staying here  I think we saw the best side of Sydney."),
("2016-10-07", "9577071", "Suzanne", "Jason's place is such a gem! We loved staying here. It's the perfect spot in North Bondi and we felt at home right away.  It has plenty of space and a great kitchen if you choose to make breakfast and lunch at home as we did. And the neighbors are very friendly. I highly recommend this spot."),
("2018-01-22", "9577071", "Dan And Kari", "Amazing location with access to everything we needed  super comfortable space. We'd definitely recommend this place!"),
("2015-12-24", "9516607", "Wenjing", "Thanks Philip for providing a really nice design house in a convenient location  we do have a great time. The host is nice and always helpful. The location is really close to CBD and any public transportation. Highly recommend to friends who travel to Sydney with a group of people."),
("2016-01-05", "9516607", "Ida", "Philip welcomed me and my family to his gorgeous house. He showed me around and explained how everything was working  from the dishwasher to tv. He is easy to communicate with and was very helpful if needed. And he's got such a nice home! It was super clean  comfy beds  great showers and it felt like a home but also like a luxury hotel.Each bedroom has its own shower and toilet  perfect for a group traveling together. Its located in one of the coolest areas of Sydney  just a short walk to Darlinghurst and Surry Hills vibrant cafès  restaurants and shops. Even a short walk to public transport. This is a great place to stay and I would loved to have a home like this! Cheers!  "),
("2016-03-08", "9516607", "Johnny", "Loved the place! Amazing location! Had a lovely time here  and Philip was a great host. "),
("2016-03-13", "9516607", "Trish", "Philip was a great host- good communication from the start and very welcoming on arrival. Great house in an ideal location for restaurants  bars  walking into the city and public transport. Perfect for city break. Thanks Philip."),
("2016-03-17", "9516607", "Chloe", "Location is absolutely perfect:) I really enjoyed to stay here. Specially I loved the sparkling water tab:D Philip is very helpful! I recommend here to everyone:) thanks Philip!!"),
("2016-03-22", "9516607", "Jim", "Fab very easy to deal with the house was great fab location and well equipped  spotless clean"),
("2016-04-12", "9516607", "Amanda", "Had a wonderful stay at Philip's place in Darlinghurst. The place was very clean  beds were extremely comfortable and it was a Perfect location for anything you want to do in the city. All very close to wonderful bars and restaurants. Be warned though  there are many stairs! Very much recommended as long as you're fit!"),
("2016-04-15", "9516607", "Ayya", "Beautiful townhouse located in the quieter and residential side of Darlinghurst  with walking distance to many resources and tourist destinations. We were wowed the moment we walked in the stylish  and space-savvy apartment  and welcomed warmly by Philip's very kind friends  Trevor and Sally  who also kindly bid us farewell. The apartment were well equipped  with everything you need to feel at home. As there was six of us staying here  the bonus were the three showers and bathrooms.We thoroughly enjoyed staying at Philip's apartment."),
("2016-04-23", "9516607", "Ben", "As Phillip was out of town  his friends  Sally and Trevor hosted us during our stay. And they will fantastic! Upon arriving at the house  they showed us every single room and where certain appliances are. The house was just a 5 minutes walk to the Museum Station and maybe 3  to the bus stop on Oxford Street. It was only a few minutes walk to the 'Cafe Street' aka Crown Street and maybe 15-20 minutes walk to Haymarket. Our group truly enjoyed ourselves in the house  the filtered water hose was a huge plus!"),
("2016-04-27", "9516607", "Andrew", "Fantastic pace.  Our favorite piece was the ducky shower in the top floor.   Very stylish.  Amazing location!"),
("2016-05-02", "9516607", "Flavia", "Philip was out of town  his friend Tate was our host during our stay  he was very welcoming and helpful. "),
("2016-05-08", "9516607", "Gautam", "Philip was out of town  but his friend Tat welcomed when we arrived.  A very quaint  tastefully done up house  centrally located  yet in a quiet neighborhood in Darlinghurst. The rooms were all very comfortably setup  and house was well equipped with pretty much everything one would need on a vacation. What we absolutely loved was the continence of getting around  with both the bus & train stations located nearby  and walking distance to the Parks  Opera House  and tons of cafes and restaurants to choose from.  A great holiday home. Thanks Philip. Cheers."),
("2016-06-21", "9516607", "Jayne", "We loved our stay at Philip's house.  His communication was great  and he was easy to get along with.  We felt very welcome.  The apartment is beautiful & is in a fabulous  easily accessible and central location.  We highly recommend Philip's apartment."),
("2016-08-11", "9516607", "Marty", "We arrive late (after 8pm)  Philip was there to meet us and go over the home.  You talk about Location it was the best location  walking to everything was right.  The home was clean and ready for us.  If we needed anything or questions Philip was just a phone call away and willing to help.  Thanks Philip if we come back to Sydney I would love to stay at your place again."),
("2016-08-23", "9516607", "Ana", "Philip was there to meet us. Any problem we only had to call him. He even brought us a Nepspreso.  The house was clean and the beds were super comfortable.  Perfect location. Thanks Philip! Ana"),
("2016-08-27", "9516607", "Brooke", "House was exactly what we were after  perfect for a group of friends clean & great location "),
("2016-09-01", "9516607", "Lisa", "The house was fabulous and Philip made us feel very welcome."),
("2016-09-22", "9516607", "Allison", "Philip's warm  cosy yet modern home is exactly as pictured and described.  It definitely is in an ideal location  close to everything a visitor to Sydney would need or want to do.  All the beds were very comfortable and Philip's home was very well equipped. Philip welcomed us when we arrived and happily explained how things operated.  Thankyou so much Philip for opening your fabulous home to us  and making our stay so pleasurable.  Our family loved staying there and would have no hesitation in recommending to family and friends. "),
("2016-10-04", "9516607", "Robert & Evelyn", "The accommodation was clean and tidy. Close to transport and walking distance. Close to shops."),
("2016-10-13", "9516607", "Jerry", "Philip is an informative good host.  He has done a great job restoring this 1840 house.  Great location.  Real nice being in a house and not in a hotel room.  Thank you Phil for helping to make our stay in Sydney a wonderful event."),
("2016-10-18", "9516607", "Elita", "Was a great stay and the host made it all very smooth and easy"),
("2016-10-25", "9516607", "Lucy", "Philip was very flexible about check-in and check-out arrangements. He could not have been more accommodating & friendly. The property was great although the stairs would be an issue for children and anyone with mobility problems. A fantastic location with all the sights & great shopping easily accessible on foot. We found the train link direct from the airport & nearby Museum station an added advantage. Would stay here again & recommend to anyone staying in Sydney. So great to be able to get a load of washing done before moving on as well!"),
("2016-11-13", "9516607", "Libby", "By meeting us at the house and showing us around."),
("2016-11-19", "9516607", "Bryn", "Excellent base to explore Sydney and surrounding areas."),
("2016-11-25", "9516607", "Brent", "Everything was great.  Great location.  Great place.  Would highly recommend it."),
("2016-12-01", "9516607", "Deryk", "Location was fantastic. We had a wonderful experience at this airbnb. I would highly recommend this to anyone looking to come to Sydney."),
("2016-12-06", "9516607", "Mary", "This is a great house! It is so convenient! Tat greeted us and helped us figure out the neighborhood. The home has three bedrooms and had the most comfortable beds. The kitchen is wonderful and the outdoor space is lovely. Each bedroom is on a separate floor and the stair case is steep but each bedroom has its own bathroom and Philip has done a remarkable job in updating the house. It is very modern and comfortable."),
("2016-12-20", "9516607", "Daryl", "A great house for seeing Sydney. 5 minutes from the nearest train station or bus stop and 10-20 minute walk to the shops and restaurants. House was fantastic  renovated recently to a very high standard  equipped with everything you need. Perfect for 2-3 couples as there are four floors. One floor is the living area and the other three floors has one bedroom and a bathroom on each."),
("2016-12-24", "9516607", "Arnis", "Great place in a great location. I would recommend this property to all!"),
("2016-12-29", "9516607", "Kerrie", "Our stay in Philip's house was excellent.  We were welcomed by Oliver who was very responsive to every request we subsequently had.  The location is great  just 5 mins walk from Hyde Park and the CBD.  The house is very cool  with multiple levels and is well equipped.  Would definitely stay again if in Sydney with the family."),
("2017-01-05", "9516607", "Kristina", "Perfect place!!!+great house+top equipment and furniture+super comfi beds+great location +sparkling water tap+ super fast communication +washing powder and everything you need is available for freeAll in all we enjoyed our stay very much and I will definitely recommend your place.  When we come back to Sydney I will definitely book it again."),
("2017-01-14", "9516607", "Yvonne", "We had no problems finding our beautiful well appointed house we were given plenty tips from our frienly host Ollie I would recommend this very central home to anyone keenfor a Sydney city break  the cafe next door do great breakfasts and the staff are very friendly. We will definitely be back."),
("2017-01-16", "9516607", "Alicia", "Loved this place! For all it's character  space  location. Everything we wanted was close by and easily accessed by foot or public transport right at the door. Such a groovy space. Looks like a great team that run it  they were all so easy to communicate with."),
("2017-01-24", "9516607", "Jiacheng", "perfect location and communication; nice house; highly recommend to stay hier."),
("2017-01-28", "9516607", "Jason", "Secluded place but right in the city. Nice place to stay. Stairs were hard to go up and down  but manageable."),
("2017-02-03", "9516607", "Yvonne", "Very nice house with perfect location (walking distance to Hide Park  museum  Botanic garden  opera house  shopping street  Darling harbour  China town  etc.) We enjoyed walking around very much. Thanks very to Oli for the wonderful hosting. He's very quick and efficient for communication and very supportive with our requests. It made us a pleasant holiday.If you want a convenient and central location  modern house with full equipment  and a nice host  that's it!"),
("2017-02-08", "9516607", "S", "Great place. Booked it for my family  5 adults  including elders. They loved it  very comfortable. One of the sinks was a little clogged  but no biggie. They loved the stay and would recommend! Very comfortable  lots of space  central location  and free street parking too."),
("2017-02-15", "9516607", "Amber-Lea", "What an amazing location. We walked everywhere: Circular Quay  Sydney Opera House  Darling Harbour  Haymarket  Central Station  Hyde Park etc. Lovely walks no matter where we went! Darlinghurst is nice in itself. We knew nothing about Sydney but quickly found our bearings. The house is beautiful  has everything we needed and we felt entirely at home. Thank you Philip and Oi. We absolutely loved our stay!! "),
("2017-02-24", "9516607", "Judith", "House is well situated in a ""Soho"" type fashionable area of the city - with easy access to great restaurants  Hyde Park and other areas of interest. House has been renovated with high end appliances and excellent showers - we only used two floors but note that there are stairs leading to both upstairs and downstairs bedrooms. Beds are very comfortable and there's a lovely small terrace off the kitchen.There's a parking garage space available; directions just need to be clearer."),
("2017-03-12", "9516607", "Tobie", "I don't think the description for this place does justice to the incredible location or quality of this home. SO central. Beautiful inside and out. Well equipped and comfortable. Fantastic hosts. The two mums that went on our trip were a little concerned that the stairs aren't overly child friendly (narrow and steep)  but luckily for this fact  we'd left our children at home. Parking was a breeze! I might never stay anywhere else when travelling to Sydney."),
("2017-03-24", "9516607", "Peter", "Lovely place brilliant location. Really enjoyed our stay."),
("2017-03-27", "9516607", "Carlye", "Amazing location. On a quiet one way street so it's not too loud  but also just a quick walk to downtown. Having a parking spot is key  too. It's a beautiful place! We would definitely stay here again. "),
("2017-04-02", "9516607", "Teresa", "Really is a great location & perfect for families  especially with older kids  would highly recommend"),
("2017-04-09", "9516607", "Ivy", "A cozy  clean  convenient place.  The decorations are very nice and the kitchen is well equipped.The host is very nice and helpful.  Highly recommended to stay."),
("2017-04-14", "9516607", "Yingxian", "地段非常好 闹中取静 去主要景点都是步行的距离 距离机场十五分钟地铁｡房子装修得很有品味 电器厨卫品质非常高｡唯一的缺点是卫生间有点小通风不够好 没办法 老房子的通病｡由于我们来得晚走得早 没能见到Chris 有点遗憾 但是入住和退房他都安排妥当 非常感谢!"),
("2017-04-18", "9516607", "书豪", "Great"),
("2017-04-29", "9516607", "Julio", "Amazing house  it has everything you need and a great location."),
("2017-05-08", "9516607", "Einat", "The host canceled this reservation 232 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-05-10", "9516607", "Helene", "A very nice house central in Sydney!"),
("2017-05-15", "9516607", "静雅", "Good location and facility! Need some improvement"),
("2017-05-23", "9516607", "Xuan", "Wonderful house and amazing stay!"),
("2017-05-27", "9516607", "Filippo Maria", "Very nice flat a stone's throw for Hyde Park  close to subway  food market  and the  hip bars and restaurants of Surry Hills.  It is a small flat but the way it was cleverly designed makes it look spacious and luminous  with a nice living room  a well-equipped open kitchen and a small outdoor area.  There are three very comfortable bedrooms each with own shower room  one on ground floor  and two on upper floors. I truly enjoyed my stay and definitely recommend this place to anyone. "),
("2017-06-02", "9516607", "Steve", "What a fabulous space which Philip offers. The place is simply divine; so well laded out with quality furniture  bedding and fittings. I cannot speak highly enough of the place. To complement the apartment is its location on the edge of the wonderful Hyde Park. The place ticks every box and I cannot recommend it highly enough. From the first communications with Philip till our checkout  this was a first class experience. Thanks to Philip for allowing me the privilege of sharing this great piece of Sydney."),
("2017-06-06", "9516607", "Jeffrey", "These guys were amazing and the house was amazing. There was nothing we did not need that was there. It was close to the city  and the house was bright modern and perfectly equipped. Have already recommended to others and would stay again"),
("2017-06-11", "9516607", "Nicole", "Nice apartment in a great location. Stairs are a bit tricky as place on 4 levels. Very good value though"),
("2017-06-19", "9516607", "Georgie", "We loved staying in Phillips house. More than enough room for a family of 5. Fantastic central location to some of the best areas of Sydney. The house was very clean and had everything we needed."),
("2017-07-01", "9516607", "Ellisa", "location is absolutely great! walking distance to city centre and chinatown public transport is less than 5 mins away. Phillip is a wonderful host  he will response to your message quickly. Will definitely come back the next time Im in sydney "),
("2017-07-08", "9516607", "Penny", "Fantastic place to stay. Central location close to restaurants and easy walk to Circular Quay. Very clean and comfortable. Great value. Accommodation great for 5 people including 3 teenage sons. Would definitely stay again. Thanks Phillip and Chris."),
("2017-07-15", "9516607", "Andrew", "Great place to stay to explore Sydney.  Space was perfect for us as we had elderly children but stairs are steep for young children.  Communication with host was excellent and we would highly recommend."),
("2017-07-21", "9516607", "Sheree", "Absoutely loved it ... loved it that much I'm booking it again. So close to everything and a beautiful home to nestle in and be away from the hustle and bustle .. I honestly didn't need to use my car at all cause everything is so close. And anything I wasn't sure about they helped me with right away. And make sure you check out the gorgeous coffee shop on the corner . Yummiest Italian food and nicest guys who own it ."),
("2017-07-25", "9516607", "Cathy", "Perfect apartment for our group of six! Great location  well appointed and stylish. Highly recommended! "),
("2017-07-29", "9516607", "Xue Jin", "Great modern place  well located and equipped."),
("2017-08-05", "9516607", "Michelle", "Excellent location. We walked pretty much to everything  all the major sightseeing spots in the city and to Central Station and Circular Quay to catch transportation for day trips out of the city. Home was clean and had all the amenities to make our stay comfortable. Also just really cool in design. So glad we choose this home."),
("2017-08-10", "9516607", "Michael", "Great location. Interesting place  perfect for three adults and a kid (as we were)"),
("2017-08-13", "9516607", "Bee", "We stayed for 3 nights! The location is simply awesome  close to everything we wanna see! Room space is enough for 6 of us! Very clean and has everything we need! Just to take note of the staircase  luggages not able yo bring up or down to rooms  toilet we only used lvl 2  the other 2 rooms open concept. Haha.. overall nice place to stay at! recommanded!"),
("2017-08-16", "9516607", "Chris", "Great location on the border of Sydney CBD and Surry Hills . Easy to get to via car and train. Kitted out to a good spec and comfortable.Beware for the less mobile: steep internal staircases and low ceiling in attic room."),
("2017-08-22", "9516607", "Vera", "Excellent logement mais attention  difficile accees aux chambres par des escaliers étroites"),
("2017-08-29", "9516607", "Christopher", "Awesome location and fuss free check in and out. Nicely equipped for all your daily needs.Hosts Philip & Chris are always easily contactable. We had a fun time. Highly recommended!!"),
("2017-09-04", "9516607", "Sharni", "This place is excellent! We had the best stay  it was so close to everything! Communication with host was great  very comfortable for 6 adults. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2017-09-17", "9516607", "Carmen", "Philip has a cozy apartment with wonderful location  close the museum station and those sightseeing spots.  My parent had 11 great nights there.  I just wanna thanks Philip and Chris for taking care of my parents  they are so friendly and patience and wholeheartedly welcome the Asian guests like us.  We really appreciated the welcome bouquet you had sent  they were so adorable and I think I should send you some HK style cookies to taste next time.Thank you so much Philip  we really enjoy our time there."),
("2017-09-24", "9516607", "Margaret", "The home was in a excellent spot to get around Sydney. Hosts were very accommodating  as we had a late flight we were able to leave our bags at the home till we were ready to go to the airport.Be warned regarding the stairs  they were very steep and you needed to watch your footing  especially carrying cases to the rooms. The spare folding mattress  was questionable for spending 3 nights on  okay for a child but not for an adult. All in all it was a pleasant place to be while in Sydney."),
("2017-09-29", "9516607", "Jodie", "Fantastic place to stay! Philip generously allowed me to drop my luggage off before official check in time which was greatly appreciated. I was greeted by Matt who was so friendly and welcoming. The house was immaculate in both presentation and cleanliness. The stairs take a little  bit of getting used to but they are very sturdy. Location was convenient for my needs and the neighbour felt safe. Certainly enjoyed my stay and would definitely recommend Philip's place. Thank you!"),
("2017-10-01", "9516607", "Courtney", "Fantastic  central location in Darlinghurst and within walking distance to lots of sights. As mentioned by previous reviews  the stairs are very steep but for people without mobility issues it should be no problem. Comfortable beds  stylish fit-out  inventive use of natural light and well-equipped for our long weekend in Sydney. No doors on two of the en suites was not hugely ideal for family/friend stay but we made it work perfectly fine and for couples it likely wouldn't have been an issue. Friendly hosts and easy check-in. Would highly recommend."),
("2017-10-14", "9516607", "Taras", "Great location  charming house  very helpful host  great amenities. Very small sink in a bathroom  narrow stairs but after day or two get use to it. Will recommend this place to a friends."),
("2017-10-17", "9516607", "Neel", "This is an amazing place for a family to stay. The hosts were quick with their responses and accommodating to our needs. The area is very cool and is well located to properly experience the Sydney area!"),
("2017-10-29", "9516607", "Roisin", "House and location excellent. Across from Hyde Park  10 mins from botanic gardens and Darling Harbour. My family of 6 had an wonderful time in Sydney. Staying in Philips house was perfect. Had everything we needed and more. Host very attentive.  Would highly recommend. xx :)"),
("2017-11-04", "9516607", "Juan Paulo", "It's our first time using AirBnb as we wanted our family to experience what it is living like a local in Sydney  as we have lived in Surry Hills for 2 1/2 yrs. We always use hotels and serviced apartments for our holiday trips. The apartment itself is well renovated and the location is great  however there are a couple of misses that we'd like to point out in this review. COMMUNICATION: During our last night  we sent a message to Matthew and asked permission if we can check out at around 12-1pm as we are sending our family to the airport. He replied that we are only allowed to leave our bags in the apartment until 2pm because they need to clean the house. At 9 AM before going to the airport  we neatly placed our belongings including our souvenirs in the living room next to the TV. At 10:19 AM I even gave Matthew a call that we are on our way back to the house from the airport and we will be arriving back before 12 noon. We returned to the apartment on time to pick our belongings. We were in shock to find out that the cleaner/co-host Chris THREW AWAY our souvenir bag in the rubbish bin outside the house!!! The souvenirs are two fragile wax model of our hands from Madame Tussauds which we had made for our 6th wedding anniversary!!! It was kept nicely in a box and a Madame Tussauds souvenir tote bag. We could not comprehend how Chris could mistook it for rubbish! To make it worse  it was raining during that day and the rubbish bin was wet and dirty. This Chris kept making excuses and blamed Matthew that he wasn't informed that we will leave our belongings. However even if he was not informed by Matthew  he still has NO RIGHT to touch the guests' belongings and more so throw it to the rubbish bin. Clearly  communication was not the only issue here but also the lack of common sense. CLEANLINESS: 1.) The basement bedroom has a strong musty odour on the day of arrival and smells like sewage everytime we go back to the apartment after spending the day on tour. They only have a Glen 20 spray which did not mask the odour. 2.) On day of arrival  there is a lock of hair (possibly from the previous guests) in the kitchen trash bin. There are also left over drinks (soft drinks and juices) inside the fridge. 3.) Upon arrival  we strictly followed the No Shoes policy in the house straight away. However  as Matthew was touring us inside...he had his shoes ON while walking around the house which made the floor dirty. 4.) Dusty tables beside the bed and underneath the TV in the basement bedroom. 5.) My brother saw cockroaches in the Attic bedroom on two occasions. 6.) The sheets on the first floor bedroom smelled nice  however  the sheets on the Attic bedroom smelled musty...."),
("2017-11-09", "9516607", "Jamie", "Great area and a very cool place!"),
("2017-11-14", "9516607", "Nichola", "Great place for a group - six of us fit very comfortably. Very well appointed apartment close to the center of the city. Communication was quick  friendly and very helpful."),
("2017-11-17", "9516607", "Paul", "Great location in the heart of Sydney  well equipped apartment with very interesting modern design. Matthew was easy to communicate to and very quick to respond. We enjoyed staying there and would be happy stay there again."),
("2017-11-24", "9516607", "Maureen", "Great location. Stairs are a bit steep. I had a hard time with them but I am 61. Also the streaming tv really needed a better router/modem because it was always freezing up. Matthew did try to help but they really need to update that. The bathroom downstairs was a combo toilet and shower in one room. It was very wet after taking a shower. Mostly a good stay though."),
("2017-12-02", "9516607", "Shuming", "As advertised  the location is great! The host is very considerate and flexible to let us check in early so we were able to unload the luggage and start touring the beautiful city right away! Highly recommended!"),
("2017-12-05", "9516607", "Bella", "地理位置非常棒 每一个房间都单独在一层并且拥有独立的卫生间 很适合朋友一起出行｡"),
("2017-12-16", "9516607", "Shaun", "It would be hard to find a better location - you are so close to the beautiful streets of Darlinghurst  a short walk to the heart of the city and Circular Quay after that  just 5 minutes to a train station and you’re surrounded by everything you could possibly want. The house is a gorgeous terrace home styled beautifully. Our favourite part was the chilled sparkling water on tap (!!!). Matthew was an excellent host who did everything we could have asked to make our stay as smooth and enjoyable as possible. Highly recommend!"),
("2018-01-04", "9516607", "Célio", "Recomendo vivamente esta casa  muito bem localizada  muito bem organizada e decorada. O anfitrião muito simpático que facilitou todo o processo de entrada e saída. Obrigado."),
("2018-01-07", "9516607", "Noela", "Handy spot centrally located. Suit a big group. Can walk everywhere."),
("2018-01-10", "9516607", "Alan", "We loved our stay with our two teenage sons.  Groovy apartment that packs a lot into a small place.  Great location and walked to the CBD  Opera House and Botanical Gardens and only a short uber ride to Bondi and Coogee   All in all a great apartment and great host.  Thanks for everything"),
("2018-01-14", "9516607", "Shuang", "房子位于悉尼市中心 去购物只要走几分钟就到了 去机场有T8二十分钟就可以到达｡建议住两家人比较合适 地下一楼洗澡没有隔间相对会比较潮湿｡房子装修很时尚 设备很全｡住了三个晚上很愉快｡楼梯是真的很陡 要小心慢慢走｡总之是个时尚便利的房子 负一楼很安静 二楼可以听到外面的声音 给大家做个参考｡"),
("2018-01-19", "9516607", "Miikka", "Meillä oli erinomainen viikko Sydneyssä. Kohde oli hyvällä sijainnilla ja trendikäs."),
("2018-01-28", "9516607", "Chris", "Absolutely loved this place! The location can’t be beat. Very nice beds/linens and nice separation of rooms. The air conditioning kept the place comfortable and the spacious living room with the large TV was a great place to hang out. Would highly recommend to anyone. Look forward to returning in the future."),
("2018-01-31", "9516607", "天琴", "地理位置非常棒 房间设施新 东西全 整洁干净｡"),
("2018-02-03", "9516607", "Richard", "Great location and excellent value"),
("2018-02-09", "9516607", "卢", "Philip的房子位置很好 就在市中心 市中心的景点基本可以步行到达｡厨房卫生间充足用品齐全 房子装饰品味一流｡唯一的缺点是有个房间在地下 通风稍差 三个房间在三个楼层 楼梯比较狭窄｡"),
("2018-02-13", "9516607", "Alex And Madeline", "This was a wonderful place to make our temporary home in Sydney. Only downside is we were only able to stay a few nights - wish we could have stayed longer.The location is incredibly convenient to the Sydney museum  airport (short taxi ride or train ride)  local eateries and bars  and sightseeing bus stops. Check-in was a breeze  as we were met by Matthew despite having a late arrival. He showed us where everything was located  and was friendly and welcoming.Inside  the apartment is filled with amenities and welcoming touches that made us feel right at home. It's very clean and well-decorated. We would agree with other reviewers that said the stairs are a bit steep and narrow. It was absolutely no problem for us to navigate  but I would not recommend it for the elderly or those with disabilities  as there are no bedrooms on the entry floor.Overall  5-star place that we would absolutely choose again."),
("2018-02-19", "9516607", "Zhanxi", "房子非常干净 设施也很齐全｡位置很好 去市区所有的景点都在步行氛围内｡周围吃饭的选择很多 绝对是在悉尼停留的好去处"),
("2018-02-24", "9516607", "Ting", "Great location. Very stylish design."),
("2018-02-27", "9516607", "Terry", "Stayed here with work colleagues as we all got our own rooms and bathrooms. Would highly recommend as its in a great location  clean and as described. Thanks!"),
("2018-03-12", "9516607", "Melissa", "We stayed at Philip's house for 6 nights. We were so impressed with the house and the location. Chris was a wonderful host and made sure we had everything we needed. Everything we needed was within walking distance. Would definitely stay there again. Very happy with our stay!"),
("2018-03-15", "9516607", "Leila", "Located 5 mins from Museum station and very close to the city centre. Ideal if you want to explore the city or neighbouring suburbsWould highly recommend this well presented terrace house  although probably not suited for the elderly as the internal stairs to the first and second floors a quite steep and my mother struggled a little.Overall it is a great house in a great location close transport and bars and restaurants as well as for groceries.Would highly recommend for a stay in Sydney.Leila"),
("2018-03-18", "9516607", "Nicole", "The best location. So close to everything that Sydney has to offer!"),
("2018-03-22", "9516607", "Justine", "We stayed here for just under a week and it was a great trip. The location is amazing  such a short walk to the city  and the area is really vibrant. The house is stylishly appointed  and we really appreciated three bathrooms plus a kitchen. The stairs are steep but for my kids it was no bother. The home has been renovated to a high standard. Our communication was fast and quick  and it was a pleasure to stay at Philip's place."),
("2018-03-26", "9516607", "Bree", "Absolutely fantastic. Couldn't ask for a better location - close to city but fabulous neighbourhood with great cafes and restaurants. Apartment was even better than we expected as with six people having three bathrooms was great. Can't rave enough about this place - a must stay in Sydney."),
("2018-04-02", "9516607", "Bob", "Unbelievable location.  Only one block from Hyde Park and close to all public transportation.  The house was modern  clean  and had plenty of space for all six of us.  We really appreciated that each bedroom had their own bathroom."),
("2018-04-09", "9516607", "Mark", "Pros:- amazing location. Next to oxford st and walking distance to almost anywhere you need to be- fully renovated property. - 3 spacious bedrooms easily fit the 6 of us.- great hosts and check in process with easy check in and excellent communication Cons:- wifi. For us was fairly inconsistent and slow in patches of the day despite resetting modem.- tv in main living room has signal issues and unable to watch some free to air channels.- noise. Stayed over a weekend and due to the fact the terrace is close to the street and a stones throw to Oxford st you do get noise. We had a couple of prank knocks over our weekend and so I wouldn’t say it’s ideal for families or those wanting to get on uninterrupted sleep. All in all a great stay despite minor issues. Thanks to the hosts for their hospitality."),
("2018-04-11", "9516607", "Farah", "Great location and amenities."),
("2018-04-15", "9516607", "Rachel", "Great house  great location  great money for value. Highly recommend."),
("2018-05-06", "9516607", "Ling", "This is an ideal house for a group of travellers who just want to  visit the main tourist attractions of Sydney  on foot. The house is newly-renovated to a fashionable one. Very comfortable. As it is on the street  sometimes you can hear noises caused the car. But for those who have no difficulty in sleeping  that is not a problem.  Thank you   Philip. We will come back."),
("2018-05-13", "9516607", "Don", "Great location. Middle of city. Many choices for dining and entertainment Very comfortable property"),
("2018-05-22", "9516607", "Ben", "Great location  great host!"),
("2018-05-31", "9516607", "Adrienne", "FIVE STARS!Hosts were great communicators and very responsive. Place is stylish  clean  well appointed and very centrally located. We loved it!"),
("2018-06-11", "9516607", "Sue", "Excellent terrace in a great location  some extra special features which were wonderful  sparkling water on tap! We’ll definitely be back."),
("2018-06-22", "9516607", "Danny", "Fun-tas-tic! We had a great stay.The house is fully equipped as you would a vacation home and is tastefully done. Comfortable bed linens & mattresses. TV with good sound system. Only wish is to have a speedier broadband internet for the Apple TV as it hangs frequently.Very centrally located. Close to all transportations  restaurants  grocers  drinks  park & CBD. Hosts kept us updated on coming stay. Thanks to Phillip & Matthew."),
("2018-07-01", "9516607", "Kate", "We loved staying at Philip's place! Highly recommend it! One of the best Airbnb's I've ever stayed at. Great location  great host  great house. The amenities: kitchen  bathroom  bedrooms etc. had everything we needed! If you're into cooking  there was a wide range of condiments too. The gas fire kept us warm in June no worries. The stairs wouldn't be great if you had kids or if you weren't up to navigating a tight spiral staircase. "),
("2018-07-08", "9516607", "Daniel", "The location of this place can’t be beat. The main level is very stylish and roomy. Bedrooms require either a walk down a narrow spiral staircase or a walk up some steep stairs. There is no door on the downstairs bathroom. The owner  Philip  is very responsive and accommodating. "),
("2018-07-13", "9516607", "Chris", "Great location. Excellent host. Amazing place to stay!"),
("2018-07-16", "9516607", "Chloe", "We had a great stay at Philips place. So nicely decorated  favourite space was the living and kitchen area. We loved that there was a bathroom with each of the bedrooms  even surprisingly a shower in the attic ! Location was great  surrounded by great food and not a far walk to Sydneys CBD. Philip was very accommodating on arrival and offered us a map with suggestions of things he likes to do around the city. Also very quick with responses with whatever we needed. Would definitely stay there again and recommend to anyone looking to stay somewhere great in Sydney :) "),
("2018-07-22", "9516607", "Jorge", "This is a great home and a great location. The overall design the house is quite charming. Very comfortable for 6 guests. Philip is a great host  and responds very fast. I highly recommend this house."),
("2018-08-05", "9516607", "Rob", "If you are looking for a place for five or six people to stay in Sydney  this is the perfect accommodation. Very well furnished  three bedrooms and bath. More than enough room for diner and relax. Fully equiped with special attention at arrival. Perfect location nearby city  bus and train. Also parking for one car available."),
("2018-08-11", "9516607", "Catherine", "We had a wonderful stay at Phillip’s place. My family and I were finishing the last leg of our vacation and Philip’s apartment had all the amenities we needed  i.e. a washing machine and dryer. The location was excellent. We were able to walk to the Sydney opera house  stopping at various attractions along the way. Darlinghurst has many quaint restaurants. We felt close enough to all the action and far enough away from the too-touristy areas. "),
("2018-08-14", "9516607", "Kristine", "This terrace was perfect for our party of 3 couples.The location for cafes pubs or shopping in CBD was awesome not to mention how close it was to Blue start group for City 2 surf .If you want to be in a safe location close to the action this is a gem."),
("2018-08-22", "9516607", "Tony & Ing-Marie", "Perfect house and location for our family! We could walk everywhere but also very close to train station. It was plenty big enough for 6 adults. Well equipped kitchen and comfortable beds. Highly recommend and we would definitely come back"),
("2018-09-07", "9516607", "Stephanie C.", "Really recommended this place. It was a really unexpected experience"),
("2018-09-12", "9516607", "Wendy", "Great location. Wonderful basement room. Nice kitchen! Fast and efficient check in. Great “after sales” service. This was the best."),
("2018-09-17", "9516607", "Hazel", "Fantastic central location within easy reach of everything. Amazing communication and flexibility. It’s a real gem with great amenities and a lovely sunny terrace"),
("2018-09-21", "9516607", "Benjamin", "I sent our developers here for a tech conference and the location was perfect  the house was great with a few interesting quirks that made it a little fun. All in all it was a great experience by all accounts."),
("2018-09-25", "9516607", "Petting", "Gorgeous house and we had a great stay."),
("2018-10-06", "9516607", "Yuejia", "Philip的房子非常棒!位置绝佳 可以步行到大多数景点 附近还有IGA超市 方便买东西｡房子里有各种生活用品 厨具 甚至煮饭的锅 我们很惊喜!Philip是个超级好的房东 非常大方和贴心 都能第一时间回复我们 帮我们解决问题｡希望下次有机会再来悉尼 再次入住!"),
("2018-10-08", "9516607", "Jerry", "Excellent property! We loved how central it was. Perfect for a family getaway. Can’t wait to come back! Matt and Philip are fantastic hosts"),
("2018-10-14", "9516607", "Meredith", "We have just had a fabulous few days in Darlinghurst.  Philip's place was amazing - so well thought out.  Very very cool and stylish. Fabulous location!"),
("2018-10-19", "9516607", "Kim", "Great location  quick and easy communication."),
("2018-10-22", "9516607", "Kevin", "Great location and comfortable and clean. Everything you would want for 2 couples or family.  Good kitchen facilities and loved the fact that here was ice in the freezer.  Host made us very welcome and looked after us well."),
("2018-10-26", "9516607", "Ely", "It's a given that the location was the best part about it. It was very clean and Philip was very attentive and explained everything for us in person which was a nice touch. The downstairs ""wine cellar"" was a bit scary at first  but it made things interesting. The second bedroom was perfect in the sense that it had a good mix of a specious bedroom and best bathroom of the house. The top floor bedroom's bathroom was very tight and the downstairs bathroom seemed to get soaked everywhere when you showered. Overall  it was a very neat place to stay. It was a lot of fun to hang out at the house. Somewhere you can feel relaxed and really feel ""at home."""),
("2018-11-03", "9516607", "美榮", "Great location  we were able to walk to the city such as the harbour bridge  the Sydney opera house etc…. The home was clean and had all the amenities you may need. The space is just enough for the 6 of us  although the stairs going up and down are little tight  but we love the character of this house. Parking spot is a bonus  since it is impossible to find parking around the city. Great communication with Philip  our flight was cancelled and scheduled 3 hours later than expected  Philip was very accommodating with our check in time. Philip provided us with a quick tour of his place  oriented us to his neighbourhood  and recommended restaurants to check our while in Sydney. I would recommend Philips house to my family and friends."),
("2018-11-08", "9516607", "John", "Philip's place was close to everything...we did not need a car to see Sydney. He made the most of all available space and the place felt bigger then it actually was. Although we managed  I could see some people having trouble with getting luggage up the stairs especially if they are in the top (Website hidden by Airbnb) is not for tall or unfit people. That being said  6 of us had a great stay there and I would recommend Philip's place."),
("2018-11-10", "9516607", "Ted", "Everything was fantastic  great communication and very helpful. Would recommend"),
("2018-11-15", "9516607", "Stuart", "This place exceeded our expectation and we are so happy we chose this place to stay. Everything was easy to use and we were amazed at the great features in your home. Thank you so much!"),
("2018-11-17", "9516607", "Tom", "Great style  great location  excellent host"),
("2018-11-27", "9516607", "Matthew", "My friends and I loved this place so much  this was our second time staying! An absolutely beautiful city home in a location in Sydney that can’t be beat. (If you stay  take a look at the awesome before & after photos hanging in the living room to see what a wonderful job was done remodeling this residence.)The layout of the house (each bedroom+bathroom on its own floor) offers a unique private feel for each guest  which is especially great when traveling with a group. Philip was also gracious  responsive  and accommodating. I wouldn’t hesitate to stay yet again!"),
("2018-12-04", "9516607", "Halfdan", "Philip's place is very centrally located and within walking distance of the CBD  and Paddington and Surrey Hills neighbourhoods.  Combine that with very close train and bus access and you have a near perfect location for visiting Sydney and all its sights  shopping and culture."),
("2018-12-08", "9516607", "Neil", "Outstanding 3 bed townhouse in the heart of the action in Darlinghurst.  Philips house is simply brilliant.  Super cool with everything you would ever need for a great stay.  5 stars for sure!"),
("2018-12-10", "9516607", "Edward", "An excellent space in a excellent location. Everything you need at house and Philip went above and beyond with his assistance. Couldn’t be better."),
("2018-12-14", "9516607", "Jason", "This apartment is in a perfect location for exploring Sydney. The place is stylish  decently quiet for the busy location (as mentioned in other reviews)  and well equipped. The kitchen was very functional and supermarkets are within a few minutes walk."),
("2018-12-25", "9516607", "Marco", "great location and nice apartment!"),
("2019-01-05", "9516607", "Tiffany", "Fantastic location with everything you need for a home away from home. We walked everywhere. 15-20 min Uber from airport. Philip was waiting for us and easy to reach if needed. Would go back in a heartbeat"),
("2019-01-12", "9516607", "Claus", "Great location and cool house"),
("2019-01-18", "9516607", "Luke", "This place is amazing. Perfect location and great modern facilities. Phillip is a great host  quick response and friendly. Would stay here again for sure."),
("2019-01-27", "9516607", "Gabi", "Stunning  unique place at a great location close to everything. However  there are quirks that may mean it is not suitable for every group. For 2-3* couples it is a nice stay  and groups of friends should consider the review before they make up their mind.The use of space is stunning and creative  so  as long as the below is ok for you – I would definitely recommend the place.   A little more detail in the description would help match expectations. For example  the top bedroom size is better for a close couple or one single - as it is very small and you can look straight at the toilet  which also has no door. The downstairs bedroom is also more suited to couples  given there is no toilet door on its ensuite either. There doesn't appear to be any extra space to adequately fit the spare mattresses offered  so we would recommend no more than five guests or three couples (if the third couple can squeeze into the top level).  Aircon was not available in the downstairs bedroom. There was no hanging space in the middle-floor room as the cupboard was locked. The stairs are very narrow and need to be navigated slowly & with feet sideways to avoid falls. We had a small hiccup getting access to the carpark at check-in  which I assume was a one-off."),
("2019-02-02", "9516607", "Christina", "非常好的房东 在门口迎接我们 介绍了房子的所有功能 用品 房子简直就是一个小别墅 一层厨房 二三层 地下一层各有一个房间和一个卫生间"),
("2019-02-06", "9516607", "思瀚", "位置很棒｡厨房设施齐全｡房东非常好 给我们很多建议和帮助｡由于晚上的飞机 还主动帮我们寄存行李 非常贴心的体验｡感谢~"),
("2019-02-14", "9516607", "Lora", "Phillip’s place is beautiful and in the perfect location. It is walking distance to bus and train stations. It location near the grocery store and bottle store. This place is perfect for couples or a group of friends.  We enjoyed cooking a couple of nights and a few night lounging on the large couch and watching local tv shows. If you don’t mind a few stairs... this is the place to stay."),
("2019-03-04", "9516607", "Lloyd", "We had a fantastic stay for 3 people. Philip was great to deal with and always willing to help  and we arrived to a charming  clean property in a perfect location close to Oxford street  Hyde park and the CBD.Would highly recommend Philip and his property for small groups looking for a unique stay in a prime position."),
("2016-02-21", "9597872", "Anna", "Our hosts were very friendly and welcoming. It was the first time they have listed this apartment with air bnb  and they helped us out at very short notice. They welcomed us to help ourselves to anything eg fridge and pantry. We were well equipped so didn't need to  but the generosity was appreciated. They supply a Nespresso coffee machine and pods too!  The location is great. Walking distance to Manly Harbour  Manly ferry  cafes  bars and shops.Interesting and peaceful green nature reserve in front of the apartment which we walked through to access Manly harbour. Glimpses of the harbour. Not a lot of street parking  but we managed ok most of the time. Car not needed tho if you are exploring Manly and with the ferry so close! The Friday night international food markets very close by. Just a short walk over to the surf side and round to beautiful Shelly Beach.We had everything we needed for a 2 night stay  and would recommend our hosts and their apartment."),
("2017-11-22", "9597872", "Sayan", "The host canceled this reservation 38 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2017-11-22", "9597872", "Tom", "The host canceled this reservation 35 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2018-01-06", "9597872", "Nico", "Great location and place to stay"),
("2018-01-13", "9597872", "Glen", "It was a good location with friendly locals and good bars"),
("2018-02-27", "9597872", "Chad", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2019-01-01", "9597872", "Awatif", "Lovely apartment  we stayed with a family of four. The apartment was clean and tidy. Great location only 5 min walk to beach  ferry  shops and restaurant. Monica was very responsive when we were having problems with the internet. Would recommend this place."),
("2019-02-23", "9597872", "Christoph", "Wonderful apartment a stone throw from the wharf and beachLovely!"),
("2017-01-07", "9639849", "Mati", "A really nice place. We enjoyed our stay and Samanthas room was modern  clean and had a really comfortable bed. Samantha was a great host although she was travelling at the same time she did her best to stay in touch. We also received towels  shampoo  body wash and a sponge at the welcome  which was awesome. Beside this Samantha has two really cool housemates who are friendly and helpful. The busses and trains are in a walking distance of 10 minutes which takes you to the CBD  although the famous beaches as Manly and Bondi will take you more than one hour with public transport. I would highly recommend this place. "),
("2015-12-30", "9612902", "Linda", "Beautiful house and gorgeous pool and spa! Perfect for our family with young kids"),
("2016-01-06", "9612902", "Jessica", "Heidi's home was perfect. Our family group was very comfortable and had a wonderful time. Heidi was very accomodating  the house was clean and everything we needed. The kids loved playing in the pool and the adults loved having a spa when the kids went to bed! It was a great location and home base for sightseeing. We'd definitely stay again! Thanks for having us and helping make our family reunion so wonderful  "),
("2016-01-07", "9612902", "Grag", "The host canceled this reservation 30 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2016-01-11", "9612902", "Penelope", "All is as described. Lovely home  not just a house. We were made to feel completely welcome. Our stay in Sydney at Heidi's home was like coming back to an oasis. Thank you for your hospitality. "),
("2016-01-17", "9612902", "James", "Beautiful house - the photos do not do it justice  and Heidi was absolutely lovely to deal with and was ready to help with any issues that arose during our stay  literally coming to the house in the rain to fix the spa!A lovely weekend overall  in a lovely house with a lovely owner. Would definitely stay again."),
("2016-02-20", "9612902", "Van", "Our family has such a wonderful time living in Heidi's house. We have 7 adults and 1 baby and this house comfortably accommodates all. It is a very nice house with every convenient facility you could ask for a holiday rental. Heidi even got a rice cooker and so many spices that we use for our cooking. It's so great because my family is from Vietnam and they love to cook and cannot live without rice. We also have great time using the clean pool and barbecue. My husband and I had a good experience when taking my 5 month baby to swim for the first time. Heidi is a fantastic host that welcomed us in the first day and showed us every corner of the house. We are very satisfied and definitely will come back here if we have a chance"),
("2016-03-09", "9612902", "Catherine", "This house is absolutely stunning. We were in town for a family funeral  and I'm so glad we found Heidi and her house as it made our stay a lot easier to deal with.The house and property are gorgeous  a lot of effort has gone into how it looks. There's everything you can think of here and is perfect for families. It's perfect for anyone really. Our toddler was in heaven and I suspect a bit sad to come home.The linen felt and smelt new and incredibly fresh  the instructions Heidi left described everything well. The air conditioning  netflix and internet were all terrific. Having three bathrooms and toilets was a blessing with our large family. The pool  yard  trampoline  cubby house  swings and hammocks all got used a lot.Heidi was incredibly accommodating  she let us stay at really short notice and did her very best to make our stay as comfortable as it could be given our circumstances.This stay was worth every cent and not only will we recommend the house but we'll also stay again should the need arise.Thank you Heidi."),
("2016-03-15", "9612902", "Belinda", "Heidi was very pleasant to deal with and provided me the flexibility I needed when it came to a late checkout. The large beautiful home was extremely comfortable and very well equipped to suit my large family's needs. Her backyard was manicured abc the pool was super clean."),
("2016-03-26", "9612902", "Erin", "This was booked on behalf of my colleagues and they really enjoyed their stay. Thanks Heidi"),
("2016-04-02", "9612902", "Kevin", "Heidi welcomed our family in person at the house. She gave us a nice tour and made sure we were comfortable using all the controls for the pool  appliances  TV's ect. She then sat with us and reviewed our itinerary for the week. She had some great suggestions that we would have never known about that really made our visit to Sydney special.The house has been updated but still has the charm of an older home with the crown molding and tray ceilings. The kids had a great time in the Pool and jumping on the trampoline.The neighborhood was quiet and provided easy access to the train as well as shopping and restaurants.Our family thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Heidi's property and would recommend it with no reservations."),
("2016-04-11", "9612902", "Nicole", "We had a fantastic family reunion trip staying at Heidi's home. She was extremely accommodating letting us stay at the last minute and also letting us extend our check-out when some family members took ill. Heidi has a very welcoming and comfortable house which is obviously a well-loved family home. The pool and back garden were amazing. Towels  linen and all appliances etc. were all in great condition. We really couldn't have asked for any more! Thank you so much  Heidi"),
("2016-04-18", "9612902", "Kim", "Thanks Heidi Awesome property! Our family had a lovely time. We had a gorgeous family bbq on sunday where my children and nephew ran around in the 'park' as my nephew called it. We all enjoyed the pool & spa - even our bubbly black lab! Beds super comfy & delightfully decorated. To top it all off - very quite neighbourhood close to all amenities. Thanks Heidi & family for sharing your fab home."),
("2016-05-08", "9612902", "Judith", "There are no words to describe how perfect this property was for our needs and for how amazing Heidi was in accommodating our request. Heidi bent over backwards to make the property available to us even though it meant she and her family had to change their plans to vacate the property. The location and size of the house plus all the extras were a perfect fit for us. We needed a place where family could come together - from Spain  Bangladesh  Melbourne  Albury  Gundaroo and Canberra - for a funeral and Heidi's place was like coming home. On the one night when everyone was staying over  the house easily slept 9 adults and 3 children. It was great having access to 3 bathrooms. Off road parking and great relaxing options both inside and outside. The pool and spa and trampoline and cubby house were the icing on the cake. Thank you a million times over for your generosity Heidi - it made a world of difference to all of us. "),
("2016-10-30", "9612902", "Luke", "Heidi's place was absolutely amazing. The house was immaculate with plenty of space for the 3 other couples we had staying with us. The house itself had everything you could possibly want for a weekend in Sydney.The location was absolutely incredible close to Carlton train station and not to far from the Airport.A big backyard with plenty of space for kids to run around an amazing pool which was incredible. I will be recommending Heidi's place to all my family and friends and will not hesitate to contact Heidi for any further trips to Sydney to see if her place is available."),
("2016-11-08", "9612902", "Henry", "The most amazing host and home I have ever had the pleasure of visiting! We used Heidis lovely home for a film shoot and could not have found a more idillic location. The entire crew wanted throughout the day to jump in the pool and go for a swim it was that inviting.Heidi is also the perfect host  nothing is too hard or can't be done  she even sourced another dining room table for us!I would recommend Heidi and hour home to anyone who would listen. Now I want to go back and stay there with my family!"),
("2016-11-14", "9612902", "Ying", "Heidi's house is clean and comfortable. My kids loves her back garden very much. It's a mini playground for them. It's easy to reach the shopping center and airport. We enjoyed every minutes here in her house."),
("2016-12-10", "9612902", "Kelly", "We loved our stay at this delightful house. The house was perfect for our family holiday of 3 couples and 5 children. The backyard space and amenities were so well suited to our needs  our children happily played outside every waking hour. The kitchen is well equipped  with indoor and outdoor dining options. The bathrooms were modern and lovely. The bedrooms were clean and comfortable and spacious for those needing a portacot. Heidi is a lovely  accommodating and well organised host and made our stay very comfortable and easy. We will most definitely rebook here in the future. "),
("2016-12-27", "9612902", "Taqi", "The place is amazing.  Great location for morning walks. Very friendly neighbourhood. The house is very clean and the swimming pool is just way too relaxing. I honestly enjoyed my stay for 5 nights. The place is very spacious and I could not look for any place better than this."),
("2017-01-22", "9612902", "Dan", "Great house with all the inclusions you could ask for. Very comfortable  private and quiet neighbourhood . Very central and easy to get into the city or to the south. We stayed for two weeks with our three young children and it met our needs perfectly. Will definately recommend."),
("2017-01-29", "9612902", "Zulfiqar Ali Khan", "this home was big and very spacius.can easly stay upto 8 peoples.pool was plus and childrreb likes it.home have enough aminties and OK wifi.bugs and flies are only downside but it  its ok if you are not staying long in kitchen."),
("2017-02-03", "9612902", "Ying", "非常酷的地方 交通方便 设施齐全 干净温馨的家｡"),
("2017-03-05", "9612902", "Julie", "Had a very comfortable stay at Heidi's place. Good central location  close to some great Lebanese restaurants on Rocky Point Rd and handy to Brighton cafes. Comfortable beds and good linens. Bathrooms are lovely. Would recommend for a family trip and would stay again. Thanks Heidi!"),
("2017-03-19", "9612902", "Zhu", "Best airbnb experience I ever had. Beautiful place  nice house  well equipped. All you need is provided. "),
("2017-06-26", "9612902", "Imogen", "Heidi's house was absolutely perfect for our stay. Immaculately presented and with all the necessary amenities. Plenty of space too--excellent host!"),
("2017-07-03", "9612902", "Rebecca", "Great hospitality  huge house in friendly neighbourhood "),
("2018-11-28", "9612902", "Alex", "Heidi was a fantastic host. Communication was fast. clear and easy and the house was great. Highly recommended for families and groups."),
("2019-01-01", "9612902", "Tracy & Eddie", "My family had a wonderful time thank you for your sharing your home with us Heidi . Everything was there that we wanted in a holiday home  Although it would  of been nice to have a second fridge and little more shade for around the pool. Highly recommended"),
("2019-01-06", "9612902", "Judith", "Our family group stayed at Heidi's back in 2016 and we all loved it. One of the kids  aged 8  who has travelled the world and stayed in many fabulous places  declared ""Oh  I LOVE that house"" when he heard we were returning this year. And once again it lived up to his expectations and surpassed ours. The five bedrooms are stunning and the mattresses to die for on the comfort front. The three bathrooms are the epitome of luxury - they have all been completely made over since our last visit and are both beautiful and functional. The pool  the spa  the cubby house  the hammocks  the undercover outdoor area ... the list of features goes on. And to complete the package is Heidi - the most responsive  flexible host you could hope to meet. If you are looking for a space to share and create memories this is it. Book it now. You won't regret it."),
("2019-01-07", "9612902", "Terence", "The host canceled this reservation 2 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2019-01-27", "9612902", "Monique", "Such a beautiful home that is very comfortable and relaxing. My friends and I really enjoyed our stay here!"),
("2016-01-02", "9735397", "Bin", "A great experience the first time live at home locals  owner of the house is very intimate  all kinds of problems can patiently answer. The house is very comfortable  the family can barbecue  appliances complete  the location is great  go out to take a bus into the city center  if you look at Sydney's New Year's fireworks  it would be a good choice  you can see the panoramic view  if you come to Sydney This would be an excellent choice."),
("2016-01-06", "9735397", "David", "Great location  nice folks  more than adequate lodging.  Sean & Nadia very helpful."),
("2015-12-14", "9567840", "Chris", "This is a great  well presented apartment. It is located in the heart of Sydney within easy walking distance of everything. Gavin is a great host keeping in really good communication all the time. He was very flexible and allowed us to have a great relaxing stay. Highly recommended."),
("2015-12-19", "9567840", "Shereena", "I was in Sydney for 5d4n with my family and stayed at Gavin's apartment. Gavin was very helpful in replying all my messages as when I required his assistance. The check in process was rather easy and straight forward if you follow the steps in his message accordingly. The apartment ticked all the basic requirements in terms of comfort and amenities. It was such a hot period whilst we were in Sydney and the strong air conditioning unit and the stand fan in the apartment was a total life saver! However I must give a thumbs up to the location as it was walking distance to the Darling Harbour  QVB  Pitt street mall  Martin place and also just less than 10 minutes walk to Wynyard train station. Gavin allowed us to check in early and also leave our baggages after check out time which was really helpful as we would not need to carry our luggages every where we go.My family which consist of 4 over 50 year olds has no complain whatsoever on the apartment. It's their words that ""the apartment is good.""Overall  I must say  I would totally recommend Gavin's apartment. It has ticked all my requirement boxes when it comes to finding a place with good location and comfort :) "),
("2015-12-21", "9567840", "Lee", "The premise was clean and well maintained and is located in a very strategic area near to Sydney tower eye. Give you a flavor of 'living in an apartment of Sydney CBD'. Highly recommended."),
("2015-12-29", "9567840", "Pranab", "Apartment is in excellent location- 2 min walking distance to Darling harbour and 15min to Opera house.  Gavin was very responsive to our queries. Everything was accurate as advertised. There is also one laminated information sheet in the apartment describing how to use WiFi  etc. That's really nice. I would recommend this place to those who wants to stay heart of CBD. One of two building lifts was not stopping on this apartment's floor.  It was not fixed by building management during our stays (probably due to Christmas holidays).  "),
("2015-12-31", "9567840", "Frederic", "Really excellent situation in Sydney. Easy  simple  comfortable. perfect !"),
("2016-01-03", "9567840", "Rueben Alexander", "Gavin was a great host  very friendly and helpful. The apartment was very clean and spacious  an awesome place to stay in the city!"),
("2016-01-08", "9567840", "Nicole", "We really enjoyed staying at Gavin's apartment.  The apartment is very well located in the CBD of Sydney - a short walk to everywhere you will want to visit.  The apartment is exactly as described and is incredibly comfortable.  There is everything that you need for your stay and the kitchen has pots  pans and plates to enable you to prepare food.  The gym was an added bonus and unfortunately we didn't use the pool as the weather was not great but it looked lovely. The check in process was very easy and the apartment was clean and ready for our arrival.  While we didn't meet Gavin during out stay  Gavin was very easy to deal with.  I would definitely stay at Gavin's apartment again."),
("2016-01-23", "9567840", "David", "The apartment is conveniently located in Sydney's CBD near Darling Harbour and just a short walk to trains  Martin Place  etc. Sydney is a very walkable city and this apartment is in the middle of the city  so the location is tops. For the price  it would not be possible to find a better place. Clean linens and towels were provided. The apartment has a dish washing machine in the kitchen and a washer & dryer for laundry. They all worked fine. The host even left a box of welcome chocolates which was a nice touch.We stayed during an unusually hot week. As the aircon is in the main room and not the bedroom  this did mean the bedroom was quite warm. It was not a deal breaker for us.Clean  the apartment is not brand new  but for the rate absolutely acceptable. I would recommend the apartment."),
("2016-02-02", "9567840", "Ana", "Great location  everything was as described.  Found a very helpful drawer full of tools and stationery you usually need a little when you are away from home.  They really thought about the guests with little details.   Had a great time in Sydney. "),
("2016-02-13", "9567840", "Sonia", "Gavin's apartment in Kent St is located in a great central location of Sydney  is clean and fitted the 5 of us. It has a kitchen fir those that want to cook and a balcony too. Check in was easy and we had no issues during our stay. I would definitely recommend it to others and would be happy to stay again. Booking and contact with Gavin was easy too."),
("2016-02-16", "9567840", "Meg", "Conveniently located and clean. Overall  pleasant stay."),
("2016-02-23", "9567840", "Agathe", "Excellent appart 1 chambre (1 lit double dans la chambre  1 lit double dans le salon/cuisine et possibilité 1 lit double confortable par terre) + 1 salle de bain. Petit balcon. Cuisine fonctionnelle  machine à laver le linge  sèche linge et lave vaisselle. Appart extrêmement bien placé (à 1 rue de Darling Harbor et l'aquarium) à 1 rue d'une supérette et 3 rues des boutiques. Circular quai disponible facilement à pied. Les clés sont disponibles facilement et sans stress"),
("2016-03-15", "9567840", "Sng", "Gavin's place is conveniently located near Darling Harbour and is a short walk to numerous places of interest. The house is furnished beautifully and he provided everything needed. Thank you for being a wonderful host Gavin."),
("2016-03-24", "9567840", "Sallyann", "Very good instructions apartment brilliant very central recommend it"),
("2016-03-31", "9567840", "Marcy", "Great location.  Clean apartment with all the extra things you need in the kitchen  bath  and laundry.  Nice stay."),
("2016-04-06", "9567840", "David", "Really enjoyed our stay. Great location in CBD  great place!"),
("2016-04-09", "9567840", "Justin", "Gavin's instructions were clear and simple and he thought of everything we needed before even getting there. Communication from him was great and he was very helpful. The place was very well situated  amazingly close to the Darling Harbor for scenic and romantic walks  but also in great proximity to a lot of shopping. It fit our party of 6 very well and served as a great place to come back to after a full day of activity in Sydney. The room was well maintained and very clean. Internet & WiFi was fast and saw no issues with all six people connected to it at the same time. Gavin even had a couple board games in the room which added to a friendly touch. Some of us even had a chance to use the exercise room which was well equipped. Overall a great experience and highly recommended. "),
("2016-04-24", "9567840", "Daniel", "Great location and accomodation exactly as described. Would def use again."),
("2016-05-03", "9567840", "Elisa", "My family of 5 had a wonderful time in Sydney.  Gavin's apartment was bright  spacious and had all of the amenities that we needed in a central Sydney location.  Gavin was responsive and accommodating to a couple queries that we had.  We would recommend this apartment to family and friends.   "),
("2016-05-08", "9567840", "Monique", "Excellenr position close to everything! Able to walk everywhere. Stayed with 5 others and the apartment wasn't crowded at all good use of space. Would stay again."),
("2016-05-13", "9567840", "Jo", "Gavin is a good host  he had recommended some restaurant to us and he allow us to have late check out as our flight is at night time. It is very good to us as no need carrying suitcase to shopping before we go airport. Also  the house was in a perfect location to Darling Harbour and easy access to all areas of CBD. We would recommend to to our friend."),
("2016-05-26", "9567840", "Ana Carolina", "Just steps from the Darling Harbour this is the perfect location to stay while visiting Sydney. This apartment was tidy clean and equipped with everything we could possibly need."),
("2016-06-01", "9567840", "Laura", "Windows Windows Windows !!   Beautiful Windows !!!  And fabulous location in the heart of the city.  Walking distance to everything.  Comfortable and well equipped apartment as advertised.  Extra blankets  pillows  towels   shampoo  laundry detergent  even tea and coffee.   Enjoyed our stay and very happy with our choice.  This was the first time I had used Airbnb so I was nervous about it.  I shouldn't have worried.  Everything went smoothly.   Thanks Gavin ! Reviewed by Laura from Ohio  USA. "),
("2016-06-11", "9567840", "Sirli", "Directions how to get to the apartment were good and check-in was easy. Great location."),
("2016-06-17", "9567840", "Ferry", "The BadThe price that was advertised was inaccurate  please be careful when booking this apartment. The price looked cheap but under certain circumstances which was not told. For the same price you could stay at meriton apartments which is far better. Bathroom door would not close  which caused wet floors. Tv is smal. Address is different from advertised. The GoodLocation  washing dryer  Internet  kitchen. "),
("2016-06-20", "9567840", "Carolyn", "The host made us feel welcome by providing all the amenities of home  and the listing was exactly as described.  Beautiful view from the balcony... nice place!"),
("2016-06-27", "9567840", "Reena", "Felt welcome n kids love the chocolate left behind. Big n clean apartment with plenty of extra linens n towels. Great CBD location with Darling Harbour right at the corner. Overall  happy stay."),
("2016-07-03", "9567840", "Margaret", "Great location close to shops and public transport. Clean and  spacious for the two of us. Even had some basics in the cupboard which was very welcome. Easy to follow instructions and house rules."),
("2016-07-16", "9567840", "Conlan", "Place was great. Awesome location in heart of city."),
("2016-08-12", "9567840", "Stephanie", "The apartment was beautiful! It was in an amazing location right in the center of things so it was easy to walk to many of the sights we wanted to visit. The train was also very close for when we needed it  and supermarkets and restaurants were easy to walk to. The door handle was loose which Gavin assured us he would fix. The apartment was clean  the beds were comfortable  and the kids loved the chocolates : )"),
("2016-08-19", "9567840", "Christine", "Good place to stay!convenient & comfortable!Thanks Gavin"),
("2016-08-22", "9567840", "Steve", "This was an exceptionally great central apartment within easy walking distance to all of the iconic Sydney landmarks. We had very good communication with our host Gavin who was very accommodating as he allowed us to leave our luggage at the appartment so as we could enjoy our last day without having to carry heavy baggage around with us. The apartment was to a high standard and very clean. We would highly recommend this appartment to anyone with children  groups or just couples as it will meet everyones needs. Thank you so much Gavin for your hospitality."),
("2016-08-24", "9567840", "Sabine", "We enjoyed our stay in Gavin's appartement. Everything was fine. The appartement is best located for discovering the city  as the next trainstation is only a five minutes walk away."),
("2016-08-30", "9567840", "Cheryl", "Gavin has been really helpful during check in   and his apartment is fully equipped. We really enjoyed ourself during this trip."),
("2016-09-06", "9567840", "Atieh", "The location is superb  the apartment is clean and has all u need for a short stay. We stayed for two nights and walked to all the touristic places.Gavin is responding very fast and you can easily reach him. The oven was not working at the time of our stay."),
("2016-09-18", "9567840", "Reza", "Gavin's apartment is really well organised and certainly lacks nothing. The location is great too  very close to local amenities  good cafes and restaurant (I highly recommend next door Italian cafe  the food is superb and the staff are friendly too). Gavin's instruction is also very clear."),
("2016-09-22", "9567840", "Hannah", "Awesome location. Lots of sleeping room. So close to everything in the city!"),
("2016-09-22", "9567840", "Brittany", "We had a fabulous stay and Gavin was extremely accommodating and made our visit extra easy for us. Thanks so much Gavin!"),
("2016-10-01", "9567840", "Ananya", "Great location and walking distance from all major attractions. Cute little apartment  sufficient for my family of 5. Had a great stay  comfy bedding and kitchen as well. Would definitely stay here again and recommend it to all family and friends too!!"),
("2016-10-08", "9567840", "Ana Carolina", "We had a great time in Sydney and we can definitly say that Gavin's apartament contributed to make us feel as home. It is very comfortable place and it is very well located. Strongly recommended!"),
("2016-10-10", "9567840", "Pat", "Our stay was awesome. The location is amazing. Literally a walk away to all the local tourist spots. Very close to the aquarium which we loved. The apartment was spacious  clean and packed with everything we could gave possibly need. Apartment manual had clear instructions that were very easy to follow. Gavin was quick to respond to any queries we had. It also had a great view of Syd buildings which we loved. Thanks again Gavin! Would definitely stay again and will recommend to friends & family."),
("2016-10-14", "9567840", "Thomas", "Perfect location  clean modern apartment ... V happy! Would definitely stay again!"),
("2016-10-16", "9567840", "Jo", "This apartment was so convenient and comfortable for our 3 night stay. Straight forward to access  with really clear instructions to follow. Incredibly handy to Darling Harbour and an easy walk tot he train station for travelling further a field. The pool was a welcome relief from the heat after long days exploring / shopping around Sydney. The space itself is much larger than other 1 bedroom apartments I have stayed in and was very comfortable. I would recommend this apartment to others heading to Sydney. I couldnt fault it! "),
("2016-10-18", "9567840", "Juliane", "What a great Sydney getaway in such a comfortable place! So clean  right in the heart of the city  and there was even a portacot for our little toddler  very unexpectedly! Check-in was easy and just like described in the manual  we'll put this one on our list if favorites! Great coffee shop right next door and lots of yummy take away place close by. A home away from home! Thanks for having us."),
("2016-10-25", "9567840", "Edward", "Just GREAT!~"),
("2016-10-28", "9567840", "Molly", "Great stay! Sam kindly allowed us to check out a few hours later which was very lovely. Sam was always prompt and friendly with communication. We would stay here again!"),
("2016-11-01", "9567840", "Aaron", "Great location  roomy apartment and decent amenities. Disappointing that the apartment wasn't clean - bed linen was clean  but the carpets and tops of surfaces weren't clean (dead bugs  crumbs  hair  fluff  threads etc) and there are a few maintenance items that need to be addressed. Overall  once I cleaned the apartment myself  we had a great stay and the price was very reasonable. "),
("2016-11-03", "9567840", "Caroline", "The location is very central with public transport and places of interest at walking distance.The apartment itself is very comfortable for 4 people with large living space."),
("2016-11-09", "9567840", "Dionne", "Sam was a great host - although we did not meet in person  he (and Gavin) left clear instructions on how to get in/out  and was able to help me with my need for parking as well. Very responsive to all messages  which was much appreciated!The apartment was quite spacious and had lots of room for my group of 5 adults. The sofa was SO comfortable  that we didn't bother with the spare mattress provided for the 5th person. Great location  very clean  lots of towels  bedding  utensils  hangers  etc.. Would definitely stay again."),
("2016-11-14", "9567840", "Jennifer", "Great stay.  Apartment is very central to everything  clean and had everything we needed for a comfortable stay."),
("2016-11-16", "9567840", "Mona", "Great location.  Easy access."),
("2016-11-20", "9567840", "Dian", "步行就可以到达歌剧院 在阳台就可以看见悉尼塔 步行10分钟就能到达购物中心 非常便利!"),
("2016-11-23", "9567840", "Mark", "This place is smack bang in the CBD of Sydney. A very easy stroll to Darling Harbour. Secure building with great amenities. Previous guests have complained about the noise. Yes it is noisy  but refer to my first point. You are in the heart of Sydney  so go hard or go home. Sam and Gavin were a pleasure to deal with. Fantastic communication. This is our first Airbnb experience. We will certainly stay again here. "),
("2016-11-27", "9567840", "Kay", "My sister and 2 nieces spent 4 nights here. Great location and not too far fromtransport. Easy to find. Recommend and would stay again"),
("2016-12-20", "9567840", "Sora", "Sam's place is close to public transport and Sam was very quick to reply to any questions. The place was clean and cosy."),
("2016-12-27", "9567840", "Vanessa", "We were delighted to have booked this centrally located apartment hosted by Sam and Gavin. They have been most helpful during our trip allowing us to check in the apartment earlier than the usual check in time  as our flight arrived at 11:30 am. The apartment is walking distance to most tourist spots and restaurants which saves us a lot of trouble having to travel around during this period. It was disappointing to find several items not working in the apartment during our stay  though we know that Sam & Gavin were not able to help as it was Christmas period :( the Aircon broke down on first night; tap in the basin was flowing continuously hence we had to turn on n off the mains each time we use; freezer in fridge was not working either. However  cos it was Xmas period  there was no handyman working :( Sam & Gavin were helpful to allow us to check out at 11 am instead  as we rushed to do our last errands. Thanks! What we loved:- location location location! What more can you ask for  than an apartment 8 min from Darling Harbour and Townhall? :) - strong wifi in the apartment - plenty of extra towels and extra bed available - shampoo and body wash provided - fully equipped kitchen- Chromecast TV!- Fully equipped Gym and a lap pool in the building.What we didn't - Aircon broke down on first night :( - there's only a fan in the living room  no aircon in bedroom- the tap that flows continuously and having the trouble to turn on n off the mains. :(- the fridge that couldn't make ice. We know that all these issues would have been fixed by now  so there wouldn't be much issues for future tenants :) "),
("2016-12-29", "9567840", "Nga", "My family of 6 stayed recently for 4 nights leading towards the new year. Sam was very friendly and his responses to fixing issues we had were prompt - very easy to talk to. The fridge was replaced with a new one and works very well! The aircon in the living room and bedroom was a huge plus! We stayed very comfortably :) Thank you!"),
("2017-01-01", "9567840", "El", "No comment"),
("2017-01-08", "9567840", "Christina", "Sam's place was very nice and convienent. It was clean and spacious  comfortablly seeping a group of 4. It is central to most of the city and close to public transport for other places you may want to go. Sam was also very accommodating in helping us store luggage after check out since our flight wasn't until late!"),
("2017-01-20", "9567840", "Ingrid", "Very central and conveniently located. Close to shops  cafes  short walking distance to Darling Harbour.  "),
("2017-01-21", "9567840", "Jessica", "Everything was as advertised. We were able to sleep 5 people comfortably in the apartment. The location is very central  being a 10-15 minute walk to Darling Harbour and about 20 minutes to Circular Quay. The host was very helpful and responded to any queries quickly. He was also able to help with weekend parking. Would recommend and would stay again "),
("2017-01-31", "9567840", "Jasmine", "The location is very good.Just only a few minutes to go to anywhere you want.For instance  Daring Harbor  Coles shopping (Website hidden by Airbnb) night  it will be a good place to enjoy a part of Sydney's skyline.highly recommend!"),
("2017-02-03", "9567840", "Siyu", "This house is very good! Located in the bustling downtown area of Sydney  it takes only more than and 10 minutes to walk to every scenic spot! As long as the balcony can see the Sydney tower. Kitchen utensils are complete  we cook their own meals every day."),
("2017-02-10", "9567840", "Laurence", "Bien situé et bien équipé  cet appart est idéal pour quelques nuits au cœur de Sydney."),
("2017-02-14", "9567840", "Robert", "Fantastic location!"),
("2017-02-25", "9567840", "Nancy", "PERFECT place for us!!!  Easily walked everywhere we wanted to go  easy to get in and out of building -- great wheelchair accessibility -- that's in perfect location!  Comfort.  Relaxing.  Affordable for area -- loved that "),
("2017-02-27", "9567840", "Bumjin", "Goooood"),
("2017-03-03", "9567840", "Wyn", "Large apartment in Central Sydney with full kitchen  washing machine  dryer and separate main bedroom with a fan and air con unit. Only thing missing was a large umbrella which we had to buy due to some heavy downpours so we left it for use of other guests! Although we didn't meet Gavin he was quick to respond to all emails and very helpful. "),
("2017-03-05", "9567840", "Louise", "Great location  easy walk to habour  very central."),
("2017-03-07", "9567840", "Katrina", "Sam's place is huge!  Everything is thought of for his visitors.  The location is brilliant.  Close to train stations  buses  great bars and a quick walk to George Street.  Sam is a perfect host.  "),
("2017-03-11", "9567840", "思穎", "住宿地點超棒 只要靠雙腳就能在短時間內走到各大景點 交通也便利"),
("2017-03-19", "9567840", "Julie", "This was a dirty place to stay the bed sheets were stained the pillows  sheets and towels stunk. The host rudely asks you to clean your own towels on the way out even though you have to check out by 10 a.m so you spend the morning washing and drying your own linen which was dirty and smelly to start with. We left or luggage in the room and went back to collect it and used the toilet  and even though we cleaned our own towels  paid a cleaning fee and had to buy glen 20 to get the stench off the pillows and bed clothes the host charged another $20 for using the toilet.  We are all different ages ranging from 18 to 70 and none of us recommend this dirty horrible place to stay. Sydney is beautiful and we had a great time but DO NOT stay here.  Not sure why there are views of the harbor on the airbnb site either as  there are no views from this unit!!!  I host airbnb myself and it takes a lot for me to write a bad review for anything especially airbnb! WE DO NOT RECOMMEND!"),
("2017-03-25", "9567840", "Marianette", "Even though I didn't get to meet Sam  our stay went really well. He was very organised  and his place was by far the best one my family stayed in while they're here in Aus. I love that this place is close to everything (bus stops  train stations  shops  restaurants  places to see)  yet it's quiet and not too busy.  It was a comfortable place for my family to stay in  allowed us to rest well after a day of going around the city.  It is definitely a perfect place for a family travelling to Sydney."),
("2017-03-31", "9567840", "Aurelia", "Appartement bien situé proche de Wynyard station et à cinq min à pied de Darling Harbour. Le logement est très propre et fonctionnel avec une belle vue sur la ville. Nous avons apprécié la piscine pour se relaxer et le calme de la résidence. Nous recommandons."),
("2017-04-02", "9567840", "Kenneth", "Helpful host as they lend us their storage for us to put our luggage after check up. Much appreciated!"),
("2017-04-09", "9567840", "Scott", "Location was great and Sam was really good with communication. We were busy enjoying Sydney and this was an easy place to stay!"),
("2017-04-12", "9567840", "Eva", "Great location with many attractions within a walkable distance. Well organised and responsive host."),
("2017-04-16", "9567840", "Carlee", "All good. Great location... so close to Darling Harbour. We walked everywhere from the apartment to Circular Quay  Botanic Garden etc. Nice and quiet at night given the central location. Easy to check in - the instructions and lock box were ideal. Facilities all good and beds super comfy. All in all a great base for us to explore Sydney. Just the right size for two couples on a budget. Thanks for a great stay :-)"),
("2017-04-19", "9567840", "Aaron", "Great location  great host!"),
("2017-05-01", "9567840", "Hengyue", "The apartment is located in the heart of Sydney and importantly near to many attractions. We find that the apartment is suitable for a group of 6  and with sufficient necessities provided by the host. The process for check-in and check-out is easy with the detailed instructions provided by the host."),
("2017-05-15", "9567840", "Tushar", "Had a nice stay!"),
("2017-05-24", "9567840", "Alex", "This place is walkable to so many things to see in Sydney. This location helped make our trip so memorable. The building was easy to use and Sam was great to work with."),
("2017-05-29", "9567840", "Domenic", "Great stay  was just a bit chilly in the main bedroom due to the fact that the window remains permanently open and there is a strong draft that fills the room very quickly. Did not want to leave the small heater on all night to compensate for that.Regardless  was a nice place. "),
("2017-06-06", "9567840", "Raquel", "Nice place. Great host. Best location.Highly recommended."),
("2017-06-13", "9567840", "Diana", "This place was in the perfect location - just steps from the Darling Harbor.  We enjoyed it very much.  Security at the building was a bonus and made us feel very comfortable.  Place is as described.  Thanks for having us!"),
("2017-06-18", "9567840", "Melissa", "Apartment shown is exactly as it turned out to be  modern and clean  the location was great and close to the cbd mall  QVB  Galleries  Town Hall stn etc. There was some traffic noise at night from cars below but that is to be expected living so central in a busy area. One downside was the hot water in the shower wasn't hot enough and the next person to shower didn't get much hot/warm water. "),
("2017-06-27", "9567840", "Madeline", "it is a very nice place to stay if you are looking for a strategic location  only 5min walks to Queen Victoria Building and 7min walks to Westfield/ Sydney Tower and of course the supermarkets are nearby. The place is really nice and comfortable and also very clean! Overall  it was really great! "),
("2017-07-02", "9567840", "Rico", "Sam's place is great. Close to everything and had all we needed. Appreciated how Sam responded quickly. Highly recommended"),
("2017-07-11", "9567840", "Janine", "The location made it a perfect base to explore the city from. Communication with the owners was great throughout the booking process. Self check-in was easy. We would happily stay here again."),
("2017-07-13", "9567840", "Lee", "Really well located in CBD  close to everything we wanted to see and do and easy flexible arrangements for arrival and departure. "),
("2017-07-15", "9567840", "David", "Excellent location with an easy walk to the restaurants and attractions of darling harbour or the CDB. Perfect for a stay in Sydney."),
("2017-07-18", "9567840", "Emily", "Fabulous large apartment in a great area central to everything.  Lovely comfortable beds and all you could need in an apartment."),
("2017-07-23", "9567840", "Ruel", "The location was nice and Sam allowed us to leave our luggages before checking in   it gives us more time to stroll around . "),
("2017-07-29", "9567840", "Karen", "This apartment is in a great location in Sydney and has all the conveniences of home.  We were able to walk to either Darling Harbor  Wynard Station or the QVB building quite easily.  We enjoyed our time and having a great place to stay made it that much better.  Karen"),
("2017-08-01", "9567840", "Wei", "位置非常不错 如果住在City里 是个不错的选择!"),
("2017-08-10", "9567840", "Carly", "Sam's place was wonderful for a getaway. A beautiful apartment in a perfect location. A great space  very clean and Sam as a host was very accommodating. Would definitely stay here again!"),
("2017-08-13", "9567840", "Jen", "Great location for exploring Sydney but the apartment could use a little TLC to make your stay a little more comfortable. Host instructions were excellent and when we had to change the date of the booking it was made very easy  thanks"),
("2017-08-29", "9567840", "Aizul", "The apartment was exactly as advertised. I was travelling with 2 adults and 3 kids and we stayed comfortably at Sam's place for 5 days. The location was great  5 to 15 mins walks to Darling Harbour  nearest Coles supermarket  Wynyard train station  Chinatown  Paddy's market and others. There's Nandos just opposite the street. Sam was very responsive to all queries and was very kind to allowed early check in and late check out as well. We would definitely recommend Sam's apartment for travellers with kids."),
("2017-09-10", "9567840", "Chun-Hua", "位置不錯!離達令港､雪梨塔相當近!"),
("2017-09-14", "9567840", "Graham", "Had a great stay at Sam's...excellent location  check in and out was pain free...was very comfortable and would happily stay there again."),
("2017-09-19", "9567840", "Samantha", "A comfortable and convenient apartment. We enjoyed our stay here."),
("2017-09-25", "9567840", "Sreekanth", "Central Location  decent facilities  good place for people looking for a place close to city"),
("2017-09-26", "9567840", "Skip", "Fantastic little apartment with easy access to Darling Harbor and surrounding areas. Will definitely be using this place again in the future."),
("2017-10-08", "9567840", "Dohyung", "Best location for Sydney city trip. Great place for family travellers. Strongly recommend Sam's apartment to everyone."),
("2017-10-16", "9567840", "Guillaume", "Appartement parfaitement situé  à deux pas de Darling Harbour  quartier en pleine expansion avec beaucoup d’activités. Le cœur de la ville est accessible en 10 min à pied. L’appartement est spacieux et très confortable  très bien équipé. Tous les petits tracas ont été prévu : exemple  le 2 e jour une ampoule a grillé : il y avait dans un placard tout un stock pour en changer facilement. L’hote réponds rapidement  avec beaucoup de gentillesse.Je conseille cet appartement pour découvrir Sydney sans avoir de véhicule"),
("2017-10-31", "9567840", "Poirel", "Great location. Everything you need in the city centre"),
("2017-11-06", "9567840", "Laetitia", "emplacement parfait au coeur de Sydneyappartement spacieuxpiscine commune accessiblelave vaisselle et lave linge avec des tablettes lave vaisselle et de la lessive à dispositionpeu d'eau chaude pour la doucheSam a répondu rapidement à nos mails durant le séjour"),
("2017-11-12", "9567840", "Martina", "My family stayed at Sam's place for five nights and we were extremely happy with the location as it is close to the train stations as well as the CBD. There was pretty much everything you could need (utensils  cookware  etc.) and as a family of five adults we were quite comfortable staying here."),
("2017-12-02", "9567840", "Peter", "Absolutely great location  about a 5min walk from Darling harbour and a quick walk from train stations. The apartment was very clean & spacious  easily fitting a whole family! The amenities and facilities were really great  everything you need to make meals etc. Communication with host was easy and quick. Overall a convenient apartment in such an awesome location  we highly recommend."),
("2017-12-11", "9567840", "Simon", "The flat location is good in central Sydney and convenient for walking. The flat facilities are basically in ok condition  but more care needs to be taken over plumbing in the bathroom sink and muffling of noise from the street outside  as the bedroom windows look upon the street and one of the windows' latch handles was missing  so it could not be closed (this meant more noise but also a lot of the summer heat entering the flat)."),
("2017-12-16", "9567840", "Hoang Vy", "Excellent i would say!!!!! Easy to get around. Nice and clean apartment. Very lovely place and host ."),
("2018-01-06", "9567840", "Julie", "Fantastic location and so close to all the things we wanted to do in Sydney. Very easy getting the keys. Plentry of towels and linen and having the extra queen bed to put on the floor was fantastic seeing my boys don’t like sharing a bed. Plenty of room to just sit and chill after long days sightseeing. Lifts are quick and the floor is quiet. Would definitely stay there again. Thanks heaps."),
("2018-01-09", "9567840", "Haylea", "Great sized apartment for central Sydney and well situated whether you are in the city for business or leisure.Communication with the owner was timely and effective and check in / check it was no hassle which is always appreciated."),
("2018-01-11", "9567840", "Sue", "Central location  large apartment  would particularly suit a family or group of people."),
("2018-01-14", "9567840", "Tanya", "Great central location  close to everything.  The place had everything you needed  may need a little revamp   but definitely will go back."),
("2018-01-19", "9567840", "Bright", "Good memories of Sydney couse by Sam'house."),
("2018-01-25", "9567840", "Alberto", "Everything was good; great location so we could visit lot of things walking.highly recommended"),
("2018-01-27", "9567840", "Salem", "Great place and nice and clean"),
("2018-01-29", "9567840", "Tori", "Amazing location and super easy check in. Very close to train station and Darling Harbour. Apartment is looking tired (old curtains etc) but was fine for us."),
("2018-02-04", "9567840", "Elizabeth", "El departamento está muy bien ubicado a pocas cuadras de la torre de Sydney muy cerca de la Pitt st y de la Elizabeth st  cerca del Martin Place y de Hyde Park. muy lindo todo el departamento cómodo eramos 5 muchos toallnoes y sabanas  platos  tazas todo muy bien."),
("2018-02-10", "9567840", "Na", "Sam‘s place was very close to the CBD  all the famous place  like Darling Harbour  Sydney Opera House  5 or 15 minuets can be arrived by walking. And Sam was a very nice host  all the things was very clean. Thanks very much  it’s a very nice traveling in Sydney."),
("2018-02-20", "9567840", "Xiaosi", "It absolutely is a good accommodation in Sydney. The house is large and the facilities in house is complete. However  the shower water is too cold. Maybe it will be better if it has a calorifier. Anyways  the house is in the city centre and house price is quite cheap. It is high performance cost ratio."),
("2018-02-26", "9567840", "Kianna", "The Ad makes it very clear what you get. Plenty of clean towels and bedding. We had 6 people sleep across 3 double mattresses and we had enough space. Kitchen and bathroom clean and well stocked. 3 fans and two air conditioners was great to have. Washing machine and dryer came in handy and the balcony was lovely :) only downside was hot water in showers was a bit hit and miss. Overall great value for money"),
("2018-03-02", "9567840", "Lexie", "Central  roomy apartment ideal for a city stay. Comfortable and clean. A seamless check-in experience too. Sam was a great host."),
("2018-03-17", "9567840", "Madelain", "We loved the llocation and there was enough room to spread out - which was nice - we were really disappointed with not being able to have nice hot showers."),
("2018-03-25", "9567840", "Sophie", "Nice place. Very convenient location for working in the CBD. It got a little warm at night but there are fans in the apartment that help. Beds were decent. Shower took a while to warm up. Check-in was super easy with a lockbox  which we appreciated. We'd definitely consider coming back if we're ever in Sydney again!"),
("2018-03-29", "9567840", "Christophe", "Positives: Well equipped large flat in a very central locationNegatives: Noisy and a bit run down"),
("2018-04-04", "9567840", "Kelly", "A great spacious  clean apartment in a fantastic location.The pool and gym were a huge hit for my family.Sam was a great host with very detailed information and communication during our stay.Thank you."),
("2018-04-28", "9567840", "Ella", "Fantastic location with a very easy and smooth check in. So many great coffee shops close by and just minutes walk from Darling Harbour and the ICC. Great room for a short term stay as it is very basic. There were three of us over five nights and it suited fine  a little bit cramped but it was good for what we needed."),
("2018-05-06", "9567840", "Anton", "Great place  super central  everything just about 100 m away ! Also very Nice furniture etc."),
("2018-05-22", "9567840", "Jen", "Stayed here for a few nights in Sydney. Convenient to Darling Harbour  and walked everywhere else. Check in  although a little unusual  was easy. It was my mother’s first stay at an Airbnb and she enjoyed it!"),
("2018-06-09", "9567840", "Minsung", "시티중심에 있고 비비드 축제로 너무 즐거웠어~다음에 또 방문하고 싶어요~^^"),
("2018-06-19", "9567840", "Naomi", "Sam’s apartment is much much better in real life than in the pictures. I even think it is newly renovated. Location was great and it is very convenient. We had a comfortable stay as well!! Would definitely recommend the place to everyone and stay again if ever we go back to Sydney. :)"),
("2018-07-02", "9567840", "Rajiv", "Very spacious - our family of four with two grown up kids really stretched out. The apartment was nice and clean  with good amenities  and at the fourteenth floor  we had gorgeous views. The location was truly awesome as well - we could walk to most of the local attractions. The apartment was a bit pricey  but well worth the money. We would stay there again!"),
("2018-07-06", "9567840", "Grace", "Awesome location great apartment"),
("2018-07-23", "9567840", "Sean", "Location was perfect for me. Clean room  nice view. A little noise (Saturday night  expected) but didn’t lose any sleep. Would stay again! "),
("2018-08-02", "9567840", "Rachael", "Great location for our short stay in Sydney at a very reasonable price! Apartment had plenty of space and was clean  lots of extra blankets and pillows  "),
("2018-08-05", "9567840", "Rick", "great place to stay. location is awesome. place is clean and very accessible. will definitely stay again"),
("2018-08-16", "9567840", "Ajitha Devi", "Sam's place is as expected from his post. The best thing about renting his place is the proximity to darling harbor  CBD  Westfield mall and a whole bunch of food options which will fit your bill. Even though there were a couple of things like an uncomfortable bed and what seemed like a non operational gas oven  we might rent again just because of all the other positives. Thank you Sam again for offering your space to our family.  "),
("2018-09-06", "9567840", "Erika", "We booked at 10Pm the night before and we were able to checkin the next day with no issues. Awesome location. Will stay here again!"),
("2018-09-09", "9567840", "Vivek", "Awesome place"),
("2018-09-12", "9567840", "Erik", "Large apartment in a perfect location right in the CBD"),
("2018-09-16", "9567840", "James", "Location & price is excellent. Perfect for a family on holiday in the heart of Sydney!"),
("2018-09-18", "9567840", "Riyan", "Good location"),
("2018-09-21", "9567840", "Juan", "Great place right in the heart of the city  including a beautiful view. The apartment is spacious and has plenty of room for lounging and for sleeping  ideal for groups."),
("2018-09-24", "9567840", "Melanie", "Great location to Darling Harbour and public transport. Very comfortable beds  spacious apartment."),
("2018-10-21", "9567840", "Samm", "The location for this listing was a godsend - it’s right smack in the middle of pretty much every iconic spot to visit in Sydney - so walking is always doable and Uber rides are short. The apartment itself is in great condition and comfortable and clean to live in. Sam is also a very responsive host and gets back with info fast."),
("2018-10-27", "9567840", "Robert", "This is our second time using an Airbnb venue.The first was a brilliant experience and we were keen to try again. Unfortunately not so good the second time around.The property read really well so we went ahead and booked. Location is great and we understand you pay a premium price for this.The positives were that the beds weren’t the worst we have ever slept in.The apartment is tired generally but as stated by the owner it’s someone’s home so we shouldn’t be too harsh. We do think though that when renting out for significant amounts then the basics of cleanliness and equipment that is not held together with masking tape should be standard.Thanks anyway but perhaps we will stick to hotels in future so we don’t have to do the washing etc."),
("2018-11-02", "9567840", "Lea", "Sam and Janelle’s place was in a great location. All necessary amenities were provided. Sam and Janelle responded to all questions in a timely fashion and made themselves available for all questions."),
("2018-11-18", "9567840", "Pearl", "Super endroit pour passer quelques jours a Sydney  proche de tout  appartement agreable et très fonctionnel. propriétaire a l écoute et réactif!! recommandé vivement."),
("2018-11-24", "9567840", "Greg", "This is a beautiful place in a great location. The views are amazing and the balcony was wonderful to sit on. It was convenient to everything we wanted to see!"),
("2018-11-26", "9567840", "Ann", "Great location.  Plenty of places for breakfast locally.  Spacious and clean.  Thanks for having us."),
("2018-12-14", "9567840", "Rishabh", "You will never get a reply on time from the host.!!He is very laid back in replying to messages and unresponsive to any problems you face.He will always find a way to avoid answering you to your problems by replying irrelevant answers.!!"),
("2018-12-16", "9567840", "Bảo Hoàng", "Sam’s apartment is a tidy and comfortable place which is just a few steps from the shopping centers and other landmarks. 2 queen beds and a mattress are ample for 6 (or more) persons. Whatever you expect about a nice and affordable place to stay in the middle of crowded Sydney  you can find it here. The hosts were very friendly and helpful as well. Definitely would come again in the future."),
("2018-12-18", "9567840", "Nghi", "Great convenient location  close to everything"),
("2018-12-26", "9567840", "Chloe", "We stayed here for 6 nights during the Christmas period and had an amazing time. The apartment is very central and the view from the balcony overlooking the city is incredible."),
("2019-01-02", "9567840", "Aaseline Elizabeth", "The apartment was really nice  and the location was even better! It was clean  and there was all the essentials like soap  towels and sheets. The check in was easy and quick. We enjoyed our stay and can recommend it to others!"),
("2019-01-12", "9567840", "Jacky", "Très bonne situation  au coeur de tout. Comme à la maison  confort des literies. Un peu bruyant la nuit  ( bruit de la rue)."),
("2019-01-14", "9567840", "Khush", "wasnt expecting that tbh it was my first experience in sydney and i wasnt happy coz once i get in the place was smelly and dusty.. i tocuhed curtains it seems like they havent cleaned them for ages.. really unexpected the room aircon which was lrovided by the host wasnt working.. personally wouldnt stay at this place ever.. plus point only is its close to darling harbour"),
("2019-01-23", "9567840", "Brahim", "very central close to  Everthing  specially public  transports    restaurants  bars . shopping centres  opera hpuse .very clean    I highly recommended."),
("2019-01-27", "9567840", "Hyunji", "gooood"),
("2019-02-05", "9567840", "Christine", "Nice comfy place in the middle of the city. Close to Darling Harbour  and close to 2 train stations. Many good eating place just downstairs or next door  including several Asian food places. Or you can cook too as there are utensils for cooking  including a rice cooker. It's nice to be able to 'go home'and rest a little bit before going out to explore the city again. Friendly and fast responding host."),
("2019-02-14", "9567840", "Ross", "Sam needs to sharpen up and do some renovations and replace or repair his Ac. Ear plugs are a necessity especially  with the constant construction noise across to road  if you are to expect a good nights sleep."),
("2019-02-17", "9567840", "Vineet", "Had a pleasant stay at Sam and Janelle's apartment"),
("2019-02-19", "9567840", "Mubeen", "Nice location"),
("2016-09-08", "9759372", "Justin", "Allison was EXTREMELY helpful and accommodative. Lovely girl  and so are the other 2 ladies. Comfortable bed  plenty of space in the wardrobe.  Newtown is a fantastic location  a couple minute walk to the train station and a 10minute train into Circular Quay. "),
("2016-09-17", "9759372", "Rafael", "Allisons and co were awesome. The place was perfect for me. I just needed a couple of nights in Newtown with some similar aged people. Was a very relaxed and independent vibe. One of housemates was very nice and even invited me out with her friends. I felt very welcomed although with a good dose of space and privacy. Perfect 5/5. Oh and it was my first air bnb stay :) Thanks Allison and co!"),
("2016-09-24", "9759372", "Lee", "Had a great week here Allison was super helpful! She worked away for the week but was there when we checked in and told us all about the property! Her room mates are really nice and friendly and made us feel welcome for the week! I would defiantly stay here again and would highly recommend it!"),
("2016-10-02", "9759372", "Darren", "Very good place to stay and try all that Newtown has to offer  especially food. The girls put us onto the carriage works food market."),
("2016-10-08", "9759372", "Jon", "Alison's was a great place to stay. Very conveniently located close to the main streets of Newtown and less than 10 minutes from Newtown Station. Her other house mates were great and I enjoyed a good chin wag with them one evening I was there. Highly recommended."),
("2016-10-22", "9759372", "Kristian", "The room was bright and airy. The location was only a couple of streets from King St in Newtown and was very close to cafes and train stations. The house was clean and well maintained and the housemates were friendly and welcoming.  All in all a good location and a great little place to stay."),
("2016-01-16", "9701620", "Robin", "We enjoyed staying at the Treetop Cottage on our visit to Sydney!  Bryan welcomed us warmly when we arrived and provided a tour and a description of all the amenities.  The two level cottage is a charming row house in the historic district of Glebe.  Our family was very comfortable (2 adults  2 children)  it was truly a home away from home.  Bryan thought of everything to make our visit comfortable; from great coffee  to comfortable bedding.  He even went out of his way to offer a wifi connection and Opal cards for public transportation.  We loved our Australian holiday and really enjoyed Sydney and the Treetop Cottage!"),
("2016-01-21", "9701620", "Dain And Geraldine", "Bryan was a fantastic host. He was really helpful  quick with communication and made us feel at home. He was there to meet us upon check-in and gave us a run through the house  as well as some handy tops for our stay in Sydney. The house itself was just perfect. It is on a lovely quiet street  set back from the shops and restaurants near-by. The city is in walking distance and the view from the terrace is lovely.I would 100% stay here again and would recommend it to anyone visiting Sydney. Thanks Bryan! "),
("2016-02-03", "9701620", "Yas & Andrew", "My husband  baby and I had a wonderful time staying at the cottage. All the baby equipment at the cottage really made our stay so much easier. We loved the easy access to restaurants and often strolled around the waterfront and darling harbor.  Bryan and his daughter are such great hosts! "),
("2016-02-11", "9701620", "Liberty", "The house was exactly as described and in a fantastic location  communication was exceptionally fast  friendly and helpful.Would definitely recommend!"),
("2016-02-15", "9701620", "Lu", "非常不错的房东和住宿 房子不是很大 但是非常温馨 比较有情调的地方 厨房的用具一应具全 房东先生非常热情 钥匙不用非要随身带着房东设置的小密码盒非常实用就在门上钥匙在里面回来的时候取出用完锁上不错!"),
("2016-02-19", "9701620", "Gene", "It was a great experience staying at this awesome victorian old house. Bryan is a fantastic host and we were able to feel the great care and effort he had put in to make our stay nice and cozy. We only have good things to say about Bryan and his lovely spot."),
("2016-02-24", "9701620", "南希", "Bryan is a really nice host. We can feel his love in the house. There are essential appliance and stuff prepared in the house. So people arrived in a rush can have a rest before buy anything. And the environment is really nice. People can have a walk along the bay. The public transportation is also convenient. The central is about 30 minutes bus away. If I will travel in Sydney again  I may choose Bryan's house again:) My friend and I had a really nice experience here."),
("2016-02-29", "9701620", "Lauren", "Fantastic host and house! Our family had a great time and Bryan catered too all our needs. Highly recommend!!"),
("2016-03-08", "9701620", "Jason Wayne", "Nice clean tidy place I would highly recommend it to anyone."),
("2016-03-16", "9701620", "Zack", "we enjoyed our stay at this unique spacious loft. We love the balcony  and the neighborhood is nice and convenient. Though we never met  Bryan was very prompt in fulfilling our requests. Overall an enjoyable stay."),
("2016-03-20", "9701620", "Wenjie", "Great house with great location  walking distance to Main Street and mins drive to CBD  opera house and darling  harbor. Within half an hour  u could reach Sydney's most fabulous beaches. Bryan maintained his house very well and provided all necessary commodities which makes the stay very comfortable and convenient.And BTW the treetop balcony is fantastic."),
("2016-04-02", "9701620", "Christian", "This was our first Airbnb experience and Bryan's cottage was perfect! Bryan welcomed us even when we arrived on Easter Sunday! Throughout our weeklong stay  Bryan was very quick to respond to any questions we had. As for the cottage  it was well appointed and cozy  great location with easy access to the light rail and a plethora of cafes  bakeries  markets  it was perfect. What I really appreciated was the collection of snacks and beverages that was waiting for us in the kitchen  making our stay great. In addition  Bryan had prepared a book of maps  activities  take out menus  and best of all  a set of Opal (rechargeable public transportation) cars for us to use and reasonably asking us to keep a minimum balance I found great.Bryan  thank you again for your hospitality and contributing to a great family vacation."),
("2016-04-08", "9701620", "Mark", "Bryan made us feel very welcome. The house had everything that we needed from milk in the fridge  chilled bottle of wine  transit cards and maps. Loved the house  neighbourhood and proximity to public transport. We had a fantastic time!!!"),
("2016-05-10", "9701620", "Akon", "Bryan is a kind and hospitable host. He came by on one of the evenings to meet us and make sure we were settling in well. It was clear that he wanted us to have a nice stay in Sydney.We would love to return to Sydney and stay at Bryan's place."),
("2016-05-18", "9701620", "Jai", "Stayed at Bryan's treetop cottage for a week with some mates  best Airbnb I've stayed at.Met Bryan when we arrived and couldn't have felt more welcome.Perfect location  beautiful house at a good price.I would recommend to everyone."),
("2016-05-25", "9701620", "Fiona", "Bryan was a great host  very prompt and thorough when answering any questions both before and during the stay. Great location  Glebe on your doorstep and Darling Harbour is a 20 minute walk or short train journey away. The cottage is exactly as described  and was spotlessly clean when we arrived. Fabulous balcony with a lovely view  perfect to enjoy your morning coffee or relax with a book.  Comfortable beds and living areas  and the extras left by the host  including travel cards  made everything really easy. If I'm lucky enough to return to Sydney I would love to stay here again. "),
("2016-05-30", "9701620", "海清", "Bryan人很好 当天入住我们不会用厨房设施 还特意过来教我们用｡房子位置很好 和鱼市场很近 和市中心也近 房子周边很安静 适合睡眠｡"),
("2016-07-10", "9701620", "Sky", "Clean  cosy  comfortable! Quiet neighbourhood (we are not home most of the time lol). Spacious shower room is a plus. Nice to hang out together for TV time in the living room and a game of chess. Thumbs up!"),
("2016-09-22", "9701620", "Jeanne", "Bryan was a terrific host  very communicative  even anticipating our needs.  For instance  we are academics and Bryan  without prompting  sussed out that we might need a desk during our stay and set one up upstairs!  The Treehouse is in the perfect location - Glebe is AMAZING - and totally comfortable."),
("2016-09-25", "9701620", "Annie", "Very clean and comfy. The cottage is in a fantastic location right near Glebe Point Road and the light rail. Water views from the terrace too. Would definitely stay again."),
("2016-10-02", "9701620", "Alison", "Yes Bryan was very accommodating with the availability when checking in and checking out which was appreciated due to our travelling a long distance.Your home was very accommodating for the family having everything available that you would in your own home.  The weekend experience was fantastic."),
("2016-10-10", "9701620", "John", "Enjoyed our stay. Bryan very responsive and helpful.  House well set up and clean.  Facilities very good. Stairs to upper floor posed some problems for us but would be OK for most.  Entertained by the plover birds that escorted their chick up and down the street! Great location - hilly but could walk to the city and light rail is convenient. Felt very inner Sydney."),
("2016-10-18", "9701620", "Aurélie", "Nous avons passé un tres bon séjour chez Bryan. La maison est bien adapté pour 5 adultes. Nous sommes accueilli avec  dans le frigo  jus d'orange  bière et bouteille d'eau! Bryan est tres disponible. Il répond toujours présent à chaque demande. L'arrêt de bus est à 5 minutes à pieds. Ensuite il faut compter 25 minutes pour atteindre le centre.Pour finir  merci à Bryan pour ce séjour!!!"),
("2016-10-24", "9701620", "Carol", "Bryan is a great host who goes out of his way to make guests comfortable.  Providing Opal (transport) cards and SIM cards is a particularly nice touch (we didn't need but so great for overseas guests).  Great location close to loads of restaurants and bus or light rail.  The highlight of Treetop Cottage is absolutely the rooftop deck which is a glorious place to sip wine or read a book."),
("2016-11-14", "9701620", "Kasey", "The cottage was exactly as described and Bryan was very helpful. The baby equipment at the cottage was handy  my 1 year old son enjoyed getting around Sydney in the pram that was provided at the Treetop cottage. The location was fanatic. It was quite convenient to take the public transport  even with two young kids."),
("2016-11-25", "9701620", "Brandon", "My family and I very much enjoyed our stay in Sydney largely due to Bryan and his lovely house. We were traveling with a 16 month old so the pram  portable high-chair and other baby/kid amenities were a major plus for us. Bryan even offered to come over and install a baby gate for us in the house! Everything in the house was clean when we arrived and there were multiples of all the basics such as towels  toilet paper  etc. We have stayed other places where only 1 towel per person is provided. Bryan even dropped off extra pillowcases and toilet paper during our stay =) Bryan was also more than accommodating to our travel schedule and even offered to let us check out later. The house is close to public transit so it's really easy to get to places. The house even has OPAL cards to you to use during your stay. There is an abundance of eclectic foods to choose from only a block or two away. We really enjoyed our stay in Glebe and will definately look to stay here next time we are in Sydney."),
("2016-12-16", "9701620", "Rob", "Treetoppers is a nice place  conveniently located in Glebe. the house is cosy and not very big  suitable for max 4 people. we enjoyed our stay and Bryan was a very nice host."),
("2016-12-31", "9701620", "Scott", "Nice little place  fairly handy to shops and restaurants  and approx 10 minutes to the tram. Bryan also comes recommended as a great host -- happily pointed us tourists in the right direction. "),
("2017-02-27", "9701620", "Anita", "Danke Bryan für dein gemütliches cottage. Wir haben es sehr genossen in Glebe zu wohnen. Ein tolles Viertel mit vielen Restaurants und Cafés."),
("2017-03-08", "9701620", "Magdy", "Great place  vey bice location. The cottage is PERFECT for familys with children or couples. Bryan was the best host I have ever  he had everything you can think about in the cottage. He have left some eggs  mill  juce and lots of other stuff on our check-in. He came also to brong us a power extension and some other things that we have asked for. Thanks Bryan for the great place and being a great host. "),
("2017-03-14", "9701620", "Eris", "Nice place for the family!"),
("2017-03-23", "9701620", "Shirley", "Lovely cottage  we felt like locals living there  everything Sydney has to offer nearby  very helpful hostRecommended"),
("2017-03-31", "9701620", "Charlotte", "Quaint and well equipped little terrace house close to the city (1/2 hour walk or 20 min by tram) but still in a quiet and very charming neighbourhood. The upstairs terrace has a fantastic view over the harbour. The kitchen even had a dishwasher and there were  both a washing machine and tumbling dryer. Only small problem we encountered was that the fan in the bathroom was not working so it got quite humid in there - but the host told us it has only just stopped working and he was getting it fixed. He was very helpful and even had milk  juice and a bottle of wine waiting for us in the fridge upon arrival. Would highly recommend this house  you get a lot more for your money than in central Sydney and are still really close to everything. "),
("2017-05-13", "9701620", "Lutz", "Gastgeber Bryan sehr nett und hilfsbereit  Haus dagegen stark sanierungsbedürftig  muffig  nicht beheizt  wenig Warmwasser und dunkel  Dachterrasse entschädigt dafür etwas  für kurze Aufenthalte im Sommer (weniger Feuchtigkeit) prima  bei längeren Besuchen im Winter mit 3 Personen stimmt Preis - Leistung nicht"),
("2017-06-11", "9701620", "Imogene", "A wonderful cottage with plenty of room and amenities. Close to  what Sydney has to offer and with a homeliness feel for an extended stay."),
("2017-06-26", "9701620", "Cham", "Place is a little narrow  but very cosy. the second floor is gorgeous. The view near the park nearby is amazing if you're into good scenery. The host is very helpful and communicates well with you."),
("2017-07-17", "9701620", "Clare", "Lovely quirky cottage in handy position to reach Darling Harbour and nearby Glebe. Comfy beds. Nice gesture of welcome pack on arrival. Only criticism is extractor fan broken in bathroom which caused humidity and difficult to keep clean. The host is very helpful and keeen to share local knowledge and wants to help you have a great time."),
("2017-07-29", "9701620", "Hui", "thanks for facilitation"),
("2017-08-28", "9701620", "Arthur", "Bryan's cottage is located in a beautiful quiet residential neighborhood. We loved the combination of antique charm and renovated kitchen & bathroom facilities. Communication was smooth and instant. Will definitely stay there again!"),
("2017-09-11", "9701620", "Anna", "A lovely little house in an interesting area. Walks to the Blackwattle Bay and fish market were great and Glebe markets were really good. Bryan is a great host. Really recommend."),
("2017-09-30", "9701620", "Elizabeth", "This is a fantastic place to stay! There was lots of room and it has a fantastic location. The view from the balcony is also fabulous and a perfect place to hang out on a warm night."),
("2017-10-13", "9701620", "Syed Ismail", "Bryan's place in Glebe offer great value for money. Transportation connectivity is excellent"),
("2017-10-25", "9701620", "Karla", "Fantastic spot  convenient location  lots of hidden treasures all around. Worth the stay!"),
("2017-10-30", "9701620", "Emily", "We've stayed in a lot of airbnbs and this was a top for us. Great location  really well stocked and clean and great hosts. Thanks!"),
("2017-11-06", "9701620", "Clifford", "Excellent location  lovely space for 4-5 friends  accessible to anywhere that’s worth going to in Sydney!"),
("2017-11-13", "9701620", "Jiaying", "Very beautiful place to stay. Lovely neighborhood. Easy access to bus/train station. Highly recommend!"),
("2017-11-21", "9701620", "Jennifer", "The cottage was exactly what we needed for our stay in Sydney! It's so easy to access all the amazing sites and there's tons to do right outside the front door. Bryan was great with quick responses and provided so many helpful extras that you would never get at a generic hotel. Highly recommend the French toast with bacon and bananas at Esca and all the other cafes on Glebe Point Road. We had everything we could have needed for a couple with a toddler. It was my first trip to Sydney and this home made it so easy to get to know the city."),
("2017-11-29", "9701620", "Yophie", "Bryan is very helpful and kind. The house is lovely and very close to the Harbour. It has everything we need and is just few minutes to CBD by tram. It was a pretty nice experience:)."),
("2017-12-03", "9701620", "Fiona", "Excellent location and good value for money. Not the cheapest place but it was well worth the cost - nice little extras eg. milk were waiting for us in the fridge which was a great touch! The balcony and view is lovely!"),
("2017-12-12", "9701620", "Lena", "We loved our time in Bryan’s accommodation! The cottage is very cozy  comfortable and perfectly located - close to the center and a just 3 minutes walk to the park. The park is perfect for jogging  skating  walks and provides an incredible view of the Anzac and Harbour Bridge! If you want to have another amazing view  you just need to go the cottage’s balcony and enjoy the sundown with a glass of good wine. We had an amazing time while we visited Sydney. If you search for a cozy home  close to the city  but a in quiet neighbourhood  the Glebe and Bryan’s cottage is perfect for you!!"),
("2017-12-20", "9701620", "Neil", "Great place. Nice quiet area. Shops  cafes and a couple of pubs near. Nice walk into town. Parks and cinema also near. Owner always replied quickly to messages. House compact but was great for our family of 5 for 4 nights."),
("2018-01-01", "9701620", "Louise", "This is such a great querky cottage to stay in.  Lovely location  comfortable and has eveyrthing you need for a city stay.  Many thanks Bryan!"),
("2018-01-20", "9701620", "Miriam", "Lovely house  perfect location  really friendly host and lots of thoughtful extras. Would stay again whenever possible."),
("2018-01-29", "9701620", "Susanne", "Glebe ist ein alternativer und sehr angenehmer Stadtteil und Bryans Haus liegt in einer ruhigen und schönen Seitenstraße mit alten Häusern. Besonders das Deck mit Blick auf die Anzac Bridge und das Wasser hat uns gut gefallen  frühstücken dort oder ein Glas Wein nach der Stadtbesichtigung trinken. Die Anbindung per Bus war unproblematisch  der Fußweg zum Jubilee Park (unbedingt den neuen Tramshed mit vielen tollen Läden und Restaurants besuchen!) und zum Darling Harbour herrlich am Wasser entlang und leicht zu finden. Kleines Minus: wir waren zu zweit und es hat uns gut gefallen  mit mehr Leuten könnte es etwas eng werden. Wir würden auf jeden Fall gerne wieder dort wohnen."),
("2018-02-18", "9701620", "Rikke", "Bryan is a great host. Very friendly and helpful. His house is really nice  close to public transport - buses and lightrail. It seems bigger than shown at the photos. Super stay :-)"),
("2018-02-27", "9701620", "Daniela Fernanda", "Very nice and comfortable house. Thanks very much Bryan. We recommend 100%!"),
("2018-03-11", "9701620", "Toyah", "An excellent  clean and cute place to stay in Sydney! Wonderful cafes and stores just around the corner and only a 20 minute walk to darling harbour! Highly recommend this beautiful home."),
("2018-03-18", "9701620", "Roddick", "Amazing holiday in Glebe. Very lovely house and very convenient. Close to the fish market and downtown. Thanks to the kindhearted landlord Bryan."),
("2018-03-25", "9701620", "Gaz", "Amazing experience. Very clean  great communication and very close to public transport. Strongly recommend it. Thank you Bryan!"),
("2018-04-13", "9701620", "Amber", "Thanks for a lovely stay! The location was perfect and a very quiet neighborhood. Loved the upstairs balcony view. Plenty of space to settle in and enjoy for a week. Also appreciated the tips for nearby restaurants and other needs. Highly recommend a trip to the swimming pool down the street at Victoria Park if you like swimming laps."),
("2018-05-12", "9701620", "Marc", "We stayed by Bryan for 5 nights (2 adults with 3 little childrens). Bryan is an amazing host. From the first moment we booked he was super responsive  gave lots of tips  filled the fridge with some stuff for us  and even gave us stroller to use for the little one and some games for the childrens. The place is well equipment with everything you need in the living room  in the kitchen and in the showers. Everything was clean when we got there  and also was clean towels and clean sheets waited for each of us. Also the place is in excellent location: super quite neighborhood  5 minutes from bus station  7 minutes from the train station  and 22 minutes to the center (harbor). You can't ask more then that... Super great location for anyone including families. I have been in many AirBnB apartments in different countries  and hosting like Bryan gave I never saw.... I highly recommend to anyone traveling to Sydney to stay at Bryan's place - better the  hotel."),
("2018-06-04", "9701620", "Cameron", "Bryan was very helpful and eager to please. It's a great location in historic Glebe close to the Light Rail which gets you to Darling Harbour in 5 minutes."),
("2018-06-20", "9701620", "Ahmad", "Reliable host."),
("2018-07-03", "9701620", "Yvette", "A great place with great hosts  easy walk to everything and so close to the light rail and buses. Quiet at night for a great sleep and space for everyone to chill. Lots of places an easy walk to eat  really was the perfect spot for us to have our holiday . Definitely planning to stay here again."),
("2018-07-17", "9701620", "Jonathan", "Bryan's cottage is an easy to find BNB. Very close to trams and bus routes. Owners are great with responding to questions."),
("2018-08-09", "9701620", "Yasuro", "A neat cozy old house.  The host is great.  The location is great.  Use UBER if you travel with your family.  Only A$15-18 to Opera House and other sightseeing spots in the city."),
("2018-08-25", "9701620", "Bianca & Horatiu", "Great Glebe location  close to restaurants  shops and recreation  plus walking distance to the Darling Harbour!"),
("2018-09-02", "9701620", "Richard", "An excellent venue  clean  comfortable and brilliant location. Walking distance from the city. Bryan is a great host and professional as he is friendly. I very much liked the fact that the cupboard and fridge has essential supply’s and a light breakfast. I would highly recommend staying here and would stay again if we would be visiting Sydney."),
("2018-09-10", "9701620", "Sean", "Had an wonderful stay  the place is great and Brian is a very accommodating host. Hope to return."),
("2018-09-17", "9701620", "Huong", "My first ever airbnb and Bryan made it stress free. Bryan was very hospitable  and accommodating during our stay. This little place is perfect for families. Everything was provided for little kids including a portacot  toys  plastic cups and plates. A little kitchen to make breakfast for the hungry tummies and if you feel like cooking everything is provided to make a proper meal. We didn't cook while we were there as there were plenty of restaurants and cafes on Glebe point road just 5 minute walk around the corner. Shops including bakers delight  a corner store  fruit and veggies and a butchers! Light rail (tram) was just a 5 minute walk away. Great location and perfect little home away from home. Definitely recommend!"),
("2018-09-22", "9701620", "璐", "Bryan is very hospitable.The house is very clean.The location is near Glebe tram station about 5minutes by walk."),
("2018-09-29", "9701620", "Chloe", "Cette maison est parfaite pour voyager en famille. Nous étions 3 adultes et deux enfants  dont un bébé. Bryan nous a très bien accueillis  nous avions tout le nécessaire pour bébé fourni (poussette  chaise haute  lit parapluie). Il y a également tout ce qu’il faut pour cuisiner  ce qui est appréciable quand on ne veut pas tout le temps manger dehors ou se faire livrer.  Vraiment la maison est top et la vue à l’étage est juste sublime. La maison est également bien située  tram à 5min à pied  et bus pareil. Les deux lignes sont direct pour central. Et très facile également d’accéder à Darling Harbour. Nous ne pouvons que recommander Bryan qui est très disponible et n’hésite pas à nous donner de bons conseils pour apprécier Sydney! Nous reviendrons c’est certain!"),
("2018-10-05", "9701620", "George", "I’d highly recommend Bryan’s house. It’s in a convenient location - handy to the tram  shops  and harbour  it was tidy and clean on arrival  had plenty of supplies to make living easy  and the deck is a very pleasant spot to relax with a good view. To top all of those factors off  you have Bryan who is very easy to communicate with  replies in a timely manner and is more than willing to assist when asked. Not sure you can ask for too much more."),
("2018-10-12", "9701620", "Xavier", "Le logement de Bryan est agréable  bien équipé et situé dans une zone résidentielle non bruyante. Une ligne de bus (nº431) permet d’aller au centre de Sydney en moins d’une demi-heure. Bryan est très à l’écoute de ses hôtes et répond rapidement à ses hôtes. Il nous a spontanément proposé du matériel pour enfants (chaise haute  poussette  porte-bébé  lit parapluie  jeux)Merci Bryan pour ton accueil"),
("2018-10-27", "9701620", "Beth", "Lovely little house  great location  Bryan was a great host and made sure we had everything we could need with 2 babies staying"),
("2018-11-06", "9701620", "Ruth", "Bryan was a great host. Excellent communication  a great space a fabulous location. Exactly as promoted: accommodation with soul  close to everything. We'd love to stay again."),
("2018-11-19", "9701620", "杨", "房东热情好客 非常友好 这套房子地点很好走路到海边2分钟 距离fish market和情人港都1到2公里 走到bus站2分钟 坐车到city10分钟生活设备一应俱全 各种调料 咖啡 茶叶都有 洗漱用品也一应俱全 价格实惠  适合一家人入住 性价比超高"),
("2018-11-25", "9701620", "Anne", "Overall a good stay  just small issues with cleanliness but otherwise a great location  easy access to transport and main attractions. Cute cottage with character. Flexible early check in and late check out."),
("2018-12-26", "9701620", "Jon", "Great character cottage in fantastic location!"),
("2019-01-06", "9701620", "Fiona", "We had a great time here!! We have 4 children and it fit us all in really well and was a great quaint place. Great location  especially once we worked out the light rail!!! But the kids enjoyed the walk to darling harbour anyway. Bryan was super helpful and really responsive! He even delivered a 2nd fan on a really hot day. Great place to stay."),
("2019-01-13", "9701620", "Melanie", "Great intro place to Sydney."),
("2019-02-07", "9701620", "Emmanuelle", "Very nice place. Close to the fish market. In a very nice neighbourhood.The place was very good for a family of 5. I would come back again..."),
("2019-02-27", "9701620", "Lily", "Great location!!! Was close to everything we needed but still felt quiet and private. The upstairs deck was the cherry on top!"),
("2015-12-05", "9599384", "Deepti", "The host canceled this reservation 25 days before arrival. This is an automated posting."),
("2015-12-12", "9599384", "Keren", "Great apartment  clean and spacious.Communication and check-in was very easy.Location is good - 5 min walk to king cross station.Thank you David for your great hospitality!"),
("2015-12-21", "9599384", "Garrett", "David's place was stunning! When we first arrived (two couples) David patiently waited for us on the street so we could find the place more easily  though there was no need with the listings accurate address and pictures to find it. David showed us around the beautiful apartment  which was even more lovely than the pictures  then gave us a quick overview of the area on a map before leaving us with the keys! The four of us slept amazing in the two beds and couldn't have asked for a better place to stay to tour around Sydney for a weekend! David was extremely nice and accommodating  and we would highly recommend staying at his place!"),
("2015-12-29", "9599384", "Tran", "We stayed at David's place for two nights and really enjoyed every minute of it. Nicely situated cosy apartment with plenty of space  light and character. Everything was clean and most comfortable. Communication during the booking  check in  check out process was too easy. "),
("2016-01-03", "9599384", "Neptali", "I'm gonna make this short and sweet... David and his son Alex made my arrival smooth and very clear. The place itself is amazing!! It's clean  very quaint  secure  modern and central to everything you can possibly think of including the train station. Also  the fountain across the street is insanely therapeutic when relaxing in the apt. If you want to have the greatest experience in one of the most beautiful city's in the world  David's Potts Point gem apartment is the place! I would definitely stay there again. -N"),
("2016-01-06", "9599384", "Xiaolu", "David was kind enough to greet us in person and to show us around. The apartment was superb. It's BIG! The beds and sofa are super comfy and the large windows gives a perfect natural lighting to the whole room (LOVE IT!). The location was perfect  too. Kings cross station is just around the corner  tons of restaurants and cafes on the Macleay st as well.I'd definitely recommend David's place to all my friends who's going to visit Sydney."),
("2016-01-13", "9599384", "Emma-Louise", "Such a beautiful flat and in the perfect location. The flat was light and airy and decorated in a modern style. We were sad to leave!"),
("2016-02-13", "9599384", "Victoria", "David was a wonderful host. He met with me and took me through the apartment which was just divine! Located in the heart of Potts Point  with restaurants and bars a stone throw away! I am hoping to book through David again in the future  was a great experience. Thank again David :)"),
("2016-02-17", "9599384", "Jiao", "Great experience of staying in David's lovely apartment. Clean and tidy with good location. Very convenient for everything.(bus and train station  shopping center&restaurants ) Davis is a excellent host  easy communicate  reply every message very fast  nice and friendly to explain everything."),
("2016-02-19", "9599384", "Robert", "Spacious  clean  charming apartment with everything you need. All in a good location too. Recommended!"),
("2016-02-21", "9599384", "Tan", "very beautiful and tidy house. Thanks for David give us a beautiful memory of Sydney. the house is better than the picture show.David is so kind that introduce for us allthings in house. although it's a little noisy at night . but I will choose stay here second time"),
("2016-02-27", "9599384", "Carol", "David made us feel very welcome; great communication throughout. Lovely apartment; fantastic location! Only downfall  it was very warm in the apartment during our stay & due to not having air conditioner we needed to leave the window wide open which was extremely noisey at all hours of the day (not surprising since we were right in the heart of Kings X). We would love to stay again in the cooler months. Thanks David!"),
("2016-02-29", "9599384", "Sehoon", "Perfect location  just a block away from the train station  and the place was clean and beautiful. Shame that we only had 1 day at David's place. And we really want to thank David for the hospitality. It made our trip to Sydney so special. "),
("2016-03-10", "9599384", "Jake", "Lovely apartment in great location...clean  as described and the host was a pleasure to deal with. Would definitely stay here again. "),
("2016-03-12", "9599384", "Steve", "Host was very accomodating  meeting us early to let us into the apartment after arriving from the airport. The photos don't do the apartments justice  it was very clean and the dining area over looking the street and fountain was great. The area itself has good local ammenities and some nice restraunts near by. We read on other reviews the area was quite noisy at night but we didn't find a problem with the noise  even on a friday night. Within reasonable walking distance to the botanical gardens  from which you can cut through to the opera house. All in all a great stay and would recommend to anybody looking to visit the city."),
("2016-04-10", "9599384", "Karl", "David is great host  he is very responsive in communication with attention to details and great intention to respond to all requests in a positive way  he makes us feel home by very nice touches he made in the apartment to welcome us after long exhausting trip. We spent a month in David's apartment  it is just awesome  the location is great  everything is just at your door step literally  with access to the city attractions by train (4 mnts walk)  buses and even if you fancy walk like us you can reach the heart of Sydney straight on foot in 20 to 25 mnts. It can easily accommodate 4 people (we were 2 adults and 3 years old child) and has everything you may need for you to feel like home. Thank you David for the great stay and we will certainly stay here again."),
("2016-04-14", "9599384", "Judy", "David is the perfect host. He was responsive and attentive. The apartment is well located  clean  and stocked with essentials. We thoroughly enjoyed our time there  and hope some day to return!"),
("2016-04-18", "9599384", "Jerry", "We had a very enjoyable stay at David's apartment. The apartment is spacious  tastefully decorated  and quite comfortable. It is also located in a terrific neighborhood  Potts Point  with accessible shops  coffee  restaurants  etc. It is also very easy to get to the Sydney Harbor and Opera House from the apartment. David was easy to work with in advance of our stay and made sure to welcome us when we arrived. He had great information and maps for us and even some treats for when we arrived! There are two things we did want to mention. First  the apartment is close to a busy street and things can get a bit lively on weekend nights. Second  the apartment is on a very nice safe stretch of road  but within a short walk  there are various clubs that might make some individuals feel a bit uncomfortable. This did not get in the way of our enjoyment of our visit  but for some  this might be an issue to consider.Overall  we would recommend David's place and encourage anyone to contact David to talk with him about your plans to visit Sydney.Jerry  Mary  & Mickey"),
("2016-04-24", "9599384", "Zachary", "An amazing time sums it all up! David's place is way better than the pictures! It is convenient and close to the trains and is really pretty! Theres weekend markets just outside!"),
("2016-04-30", "9599384", "Queenie", "We had great time in our stay. This unit is very clear and stylish. Window view is amazing make us so relax when sitting in. Many top best cafés in this area. David is very friendly and helping us a lot. Perfect for a small family like us."),
("2016-05-10", "9599384", "Chee Sean", "Me and my family had a wonderful time at  David's place throughout out our stay in Sydney. On the day of arrival  we met Cathy  David's wife who was friendly and helpful. And we were happy to be there as the apartment was well equipped and located near to the king cross station. Will definitely recommend this place."),
("2016-05-17", "9599384", "Anne", "Great place with restaurants and fabulous coffee shop in the immediate vicinity.  We had an early arrival into Sydney and were met by Cathy at 9.30am which was really appreciated.Everything was as expected from the photos with breakfast bits and bobs and great extra.Would not hesitate to recommend and will definitely hope to stay there again on our next visit to Sydney."),
("2016-05-22", "9599384", "Grace", "Great stay. Place is bright  comfortable and clean. Excellent location and surprisingly quiet at night. "),
("2016-05-26", "9599384", "Ana", "David's place is located in a great place  is easy to walk into town or to get public transport. Lots of places to eat around  shops are close by and the apartment has everything you need to feel at home. I would for sure contact David again if I ever get back to Sydney. "),
("2016-06-30", "9599384", "Martin", "David was a great  friendly  helpful host and the place had the perfect location! Thank you again for having us :)"),
("2016-07-03", "9599384", "Lars", "This must be one of the best places to stay in Sydney. We a family of 4 had a great time here. To have breakfast overlooking the square with the fountain and all the people passing by was fantastic. The apartment is top condition and very well equipped  and the host filled up the kitchen with enough tea and coffe bags and that is great in the morning. The neighborhood has everything you need with good restaurants and shops.If we are so lucky and have the possibilty to come back to Sydney we want to stay here."),
("2016-07-17", "9599384", "Yves", "L'appartement est fidèle à sa description  et l'accueil de David est très chaleureux. Possibilité de laisser les valises avant le check in  très pratique. "),
("2016-07-28", "9599384", "Stéphanie", "Great location and great apartment"),
("2016-08-01", "9599384", "Kristine", "We had a wonderful 4 days loved the apartment and location."),
("2016-08-08", "9599384", "Fleur", "Great place. Great location."),
("2016-08-17", "9599384", "Lyle", "David was courteous communicative and extremely accommodating on our arrival providing all the necessary and helpful info that we required. His place is clean  modern and secure and met the listing description. It felt a little more spacious than we pictured it  possibly because of the high ceilings and warm lighting. This is the best location in Sydney. As tourists we enjoyed easy access to an immense choice of restaurants cafes entertainment and shopping within a walk from the front door. Would definitely recommend and return again."),
("2016-08-24", "9599384", "Emilie Et David", "What a perfect place to visit Sydney ! The apartment is beautiful  clean  well equiped  and the view is so nice.  It is also very well located  close to everything you need (train  shops  restaurants...) Also David was very welcoming. We had a wonderful week here ! "),
("2016-09-07", "9599384", "Trinidad", "The apartment is amazing  great location  very clean  nice decoration and David was always available for any thing that we need. I recommend the apartment 100%"),
("2016-09-11", "9599384", "Ashleigh", "Lovely bright apartment in perfect location! I booked David's Potts Point apartment for myself  as well as my mum and sister for two nights. It was a great size for the three of us! I loved sitting by the big window and people watching with a cup of tea in the mornings and glass of red in the evening! I really loved the apartment  quite spacious for Sydney - it was a plus that it was so secure too!There are markets literally metres away on Saturday  which have plenty of food stalls on offer. There are so many restaurants & bars to choose from all well within walking distance!David had brilliant communication and was very accommodating. He met us at the apartment and showed us on a map where to walk to get to the gallery the next day  which was extremely helpful and very kind of him. It's a nice walk into Circular Quay  Botanic Gardens and The Rocks.Last but not least  all 3 of us were in awe of the book collection in the apartment. You have great taste David  I will have to make the next stay longer so I can read some! Thank you so much! "),
("2016-09-15", "9599384", "Annah", "David was such a wonderful host. He met me in front of his place and showed me around. He made sure everything was fine before he left me. The place was very clean   comfy pillows and mattresses . The place is beautiful   Internet was fast   you will feel safe and secure because the police station is just right across the apartment. The location was great   convenient as mentioned. We'll book again if given a chance to go back to Sydney . Thank you David ! "),
("2016-09-20", "9599384", "Les", "The space was very nice and clean  and a great location to get to transit  and if you are there on the weekend  it was great for the outdoor market.  There was quite many locations to eat and shop.  It was a little loud on the traffic side since the it faces the main street  but other than that it is a great place."),
("2016-09-30", "9599384", "Melisa", "David was a wonderful host. My family and I were welcomed kindly in front of the apartment. The place was extremely clean and had everything we needed. The location was walking distance to many tourist locations or a quick bus/taxi ride away. We'll definitely recommend this location to family and friends who plan to travel to Sydney."),
("2016-10-02", "9599384", "Antonio", "David's place is a gem in the whole city of Sydney. It's close to public transit  the place had a charm few other places have. Its placement  so close to the parklet of Potts Point  really make you feel like you're a world away. The stay was great thanks to David's little personal touches."),
("2016-10-04", "9599384", "Marnie", "This was our first Airbnb experience.  David's listing at Potts Point looked very promising and it certainly lived up to expectations. The location in the village was great  with public transport at the door but easy walking to the CBD. Much nicer than high rise in the centre of town. The apartment was exactly as stated  light  bright and comfortable. A place we would not hesitate to visit again. David was an excellent host  prompt is his communication and very friendly and helpful. "),
("2016-10-10", "9599384", "Ralph", "Our stay in David's apartment was perfect in every detail and everything we could possibly want was provided by David right down to greatly appreciated supplies of milk and cereal to start us off. The apartment is superb  as is the situation. Would stay again and recommend to anyone and everyone.  Superb!"),
("2016-10-12", "9599384", "Romain", "The Flat is really good located and wonderful! Clean  quiet. Really easy to communicate with David  nice stay in nice place! Thank you."),
("2016-10-15", "9599384", "Leeanna", "Great apartment in Potts Point  close to everything and great value for place to stay! David was super friendly and easy to communicate with. Highly recommended!"),
("2016-10-23", "9599384", "Kevin", "David's light and airy flat is situated just at the sweet spot on Macleay St between the grit and eclectic vibe of Kings Cross and the genteel delights of Potts Point. With the fountain across the street providing a constant bubbling soundtrack we spent a very enjoyable five nights with immediate Darlinghurst at our doorstep and  via KX station two minute walk out the door  greater Sydney. Our third person in our party wanted to report that the futon was one of the most comfortable she has ever slept on. David was helpful before arrival and met us on the door to walk us through the locking systems  easily mastered  of the semi-public courtyard setup of the building. Flat was comfortably and stylishly furnished and we were not lacking for any amenity. Very much recommended. Oh  he was flexible on our departure time as he had a late next arrival so this made our leaving that bit easier. Thx David."),
("2016-10-25", "9599384", "Dorine", "We had a great time at David place in Pott's Point. The location was very good  we could do a lot of things walking from here. The place itself was fine  nice and clean  only the noises from the street were a little bit disturbing."),
("2016-10-29", "9599384", "Ulrika", "En fantastisk värd som välkomnade oss och hjälpte oss med väskor och introducerade lägenheten och området för oss. Lägenheten var underbar och var nog bättre än beskrivningen. En klar överraskning. Området var perfekt om du vill ta dig runt i Sidney. Nära till tåg och buss."),
("2016-11-03", "9599384", "Cloe", "Lovely apartment with the perfect location (only 2 mn walk to Kings Cross station)  there's also a very nice walk to do from Potts Point to the Opera house through the Royal Botanical Gardens. Will definitely be back again! "),
("2016-11-15", "9599384", "Siobhan", "We had a lovely time at David's place  it is in a fantastic location  right by the subway station so it's easy to connect with the rest of Sydney. The apartment is clean and comfortable and has everything you could need. David was very welcoming and friendly  and gave us helpful advice about the area  and left us plenty of maps and information. If I ever come back to Sydney  I will hopefully stay here again!"),
("2016-11-16", "9599384", "Daniel", "Dear David  we really enjoyed our stay in your wonderful apartment. We all felt comfortable right away. And thanks again for helping us with our crazy luggage load.  best wishes. Judith  Daniel with  Matti and Emmi "),
("2016-11-24", "9599384", "Thomas", "If you are looking for an flat in Potts Point this is the place to be. Well equipped  everything (super market  Bars) is very close to the apartment. With the opal card it´s really easy to travel everywhere from Kings Cross which is the nearest station. David waited in the front of the building in front of the house and welcomed us very friendly. Thanks a lot David. Best Thomas & Marlon "),
("2016-11-26", "9599384", "Karynn", "David welcomed us warmly on arrival.  His lovely apartment lived up to our expectations - cosy and inviting.  A great place to relax after a busy day.  An extensive book collection was a bonus.The apartment is in an ideal location - very handy to all that Sydney has to offer.We very much look forward to returning to David's apartment when we next visit Sydney.  Thanks David"),
("2016-11-29", "9599384", "Lindsay", "David's place is in a great location in the city.  The apartment is very clean and nice and easy to find.  David communicated well leading up to our arrival and had someone there to meet us.  The apartment is on a major street  so you will hear some noise.  Closing the doors helps quite a bit  though.  Overall  great stay!"),
("2016-12-07", "9599384", "Amy", "We had a great stay at David's place  David let us check in early and met us at the apartment to make sure we were all settled in and knew where everything was. It was in a great location  easy to walk to the sights and surrounded by great cafes and restaurants. Would definitely stay again!"),
("2016-12-10", "9599384", "Sandra", "lovely place."),
("2016-12-21", "9599384", "Hendrik", "We enjoyed the time in the apartment very much. David's communication was always promptly and detailed. He gave us a warm welcome and already awaited us upon our arrival. The apartment itself was exactly as described. Only the noises from the adjacent apartment surprised us. The connection to public transport with Kings Cross Station is perfect. Within 30 minutes you can get to Bondi Beach  Airport or any other well known place in central Sydney. This is the perfect location for a couple to stay in Sydney."),
("2016-12-28", "9599384", "Mia", "Great apartment with walking distance to Opera House!!!!"),
("2016-12-29", "9599384", "Chelsea", "Location is amazing! Loved the feel of the apartment and how well appointed it is - David made the checking in experience really easy as well and also gave tips on how to get around/things to see. Thanks for a great stay!"),
("2017-01-02", "9599384", "Kim", "David was very easy to communicate with and he offered information about the area. He left a few things in the fridge for us  which we really appreciated. We stayed 3 nights over New Year's Eve and spent much of our time walking and visiting the city so the small apartment was fine for us and our 2 grown daughters. It would be perfect for a couple. It was hot  even with the windows open at night and the ceiling fans running.  Renters should be aware that this is a very noisy neighborhood and there are several ""adult"" type businesses up the street. Not great if you are travelling with small kids.We did have trouble sleeping with the street noise.  I would recommend David's place. It's situated less than 2km from the Circular Quay and Opera House  a perfect distance for a nice walk."),
("2017-01-06", "9599384", "Nicola", "We were very well at David's house. The apartment in old style is furnished very well and located a very lively neighborhood  close to all the comforts. "),
("2017-01-11", "9599384", "Nicki", "Everything in the listing was as described.  Great location and very convenient.  You need to make sure you can keep to the agreed meeting time tho.  I felt we had upset the host when with one hours notice we advised we were going to be late.  Otherwise  everything else was perfect and would happily recommend the place to others.  "),
("2017-01-11", "9599384", "Gillian", "Davids place was in an excellent location - easily accessible by underground and quick to the airport. Check in was made easy and his communication was excellent with us. Good value for money. Lots of nice little cafes and juice bars nearby."),
("2017-01-18", "9599384", "Joan", "David's appartment is extremely well located. Close to King Cross station and at a pleasant walking distance of the Opera House and the city. The neighbourghood is lively and can be noisy (specially on Saturday night); but MacLeay St is also very fancy and full of exceptional restaurants and coffee places. The apparment is neat and comfortable and there is always a nice air flow to cool down summer's hot air."),
("2017-01-26", "9599384", "曦颖", "位置非常好 步行30min左右可以到达海德公园､植物园､歌剧院､海港大桥､市政厅等地方｡唯一的就是没有空调 夏天可能会热吧……"),
("2017-01-29", "9599384", "Kate", "I stayed at David's place with my mother  who was visiting from the UK. We both found it to be a lovely  well-equipped apartment  in a fantastic location for exploring Sydney. The sun room is an especially nice space for watching the world go by down below.David was a great host to communicate with and greeted us personally to show us in to the apartment. Thanks  David  for a great stay!"),
("2017-01-31", "9599384", "Esther", "David's apartment is very convenient to the very center of sydney city  we can just go sightseeing by walking of 25 minutes. David is very helpful and easygoing  he reply me promtly after I text him  It's a preasure to stay in potts point  Thank you!"),
("2017-02-06", "9599384", "佳", "非常好的民宿 老板热情 民宿位置好 周围有超市和吃饭的地方｡推荐!"),
("2017-02-07", "9599384", "Jane", "This is a lovely little apartment in a good location - plenty of restaurants &   Cafes & within easy reach of the clean & efficient train network.  Well equipped  comfortable beds &. Strong  wifi.  "),
("2017-02-17", "9599384", "Tracey", "We loved staying at David's place - a fantastic apartment  well equipped and in a great location. The apartment has lovely high ceilings and was cool even in heatwave temperatures. David had left tea  coffee  milk and  especially welcome after a long journey  cool water in the fridge. Potts Point is lively and full of great restaurants and coffee shops. Local amenities are great and it's really easy to get around by walking or by public transport with the train station just 2 or 3 minutes walk away. Fitzroy Square with the fountain is a great place to sit and watch the world go by. We'd love to return"),
("2017-02-26", "9599384", "Toya", "what a great place. the big front window is fantastic  as is the rest of the cosy  stylish flat. our two kids slept wonderfully on the futon. we really enjoyed potts point and can definitely recommend davids flat and him as a host as he was easy to communicate and really friendly when meeting us. 10 out of 10!"),
("2017-03-06", "9599384", "Sara", "Absolute perfect!"),
("2017-03-11", "9599384", "Julien", "Great place to stay in Sydney. Very close to the city center  convenient flat. I definitely recommend to stay in David's place."),
("2017-03-29", "9599384", "David", "Anytime you can access this apartment do it  especially for longer stays ideal for the city and further afield"),
("2017-04-03", "9599384", "Britta", "Sehr schön  allerdings fehlen Möglichkeiten um Klamotten aufzuhängen und es hätte etwas sauberer sein können "),
("2017-04-07", "9599384", "Yichi", "Very central  easy access to all places. Great cafe and restaurants around. Great value for nice bright room  the extra sofa bed is super comfortable too! "),
("2017-04-12", "9599384", "Pauline", "A lovely apartment in a great location for easy walking access to the main harbour sites and good public transport links to other areas. Comfortable for the 3 of us with a sunny kitchen area. Really enjoyed our stay here."),
("2017-04-18", "9599384", "Kari", "Very enjoyable stay! Communication with David was great.  Very bright and welcoming... walking distance to main attractions and very close to kings cross train station.  One thing to note it's quite noisy at night from being right above the street but overall an excellent stay!"),
("2017-04-21", "9599384", "Elisa", "David è stato un host attento e presente. La casa è accogliente e ben attrezzata. Consigliato!"),
("2017-04-23", "9599384", "Annie", "Great location  good host "),
("2017-04-27", "9599384", "Nichole", "Really lovely apartment in a great location!"),
("2017-05-02", "9599384", "Martin", "Grate place for a visit to Sydney"),
("2017-05-27", "9599384", "Helen", "This apartment was modern and tastefully decorated.  The location is excellent  with a lovely outlook over the fountain at Kings Cross.  Walking distance from the Botanic Gardens  Opera House and Circular Key  Rushcutters Bay and shopping centres.  Plenty of restaurants within 5 minutes walk  as well as grocery shopping a Harris Farm Market and Woolworths.The Kings Cross Train Station is only 5 minutes walk and taxi rank and bus stop outside.  The kitchen needs more utensils and baking dish to use in the oven  but was otherwise well equipped.  It was nice to have tea and coffee provided  as well as basics such as dishwashing liquid.David was prompt in his communications with me and very helpful."),
("2017-06-04", "9599384", "Alberto", "Amazing place   very good communicated with the train  supermarket and the CBD  so wonderful and spacious. I really recommend this place . So beautiful and clean ."),
("2017-07-01", "9599384", "Kathleen", "David's place is a perfect place with privacy and the amenities needed to make it feel like home. The restaurants and cafes are wonderful. The Saturday market was a nice surprise and experience. The location is very close to the Kings Cross Train station  making it a perfect launching place for a car free  public transit based urban vacation. The train station area is a little on the sketchy side with some hang-over adult entertainment businesses still present. But a short block away  the neighborhood turns into a rather hip  locals-only restaurant filled area that was nice to spend time in."),
("2017-07-15", "9599384", "Kathleen", "You really can't beat the location of this apartment.There's a great view of the fountain and is an easy walk to the train (subway) and because of the apartment's location  we almost only ever needed to go a couple stops. There are lots of cafes  restaurants  and supermarkets nearby.The apartment is spacious and good value for the money.The only heads up I would have is that the futon (second bed) is off the entry way of the apartment so light sleepers may hear early risers in the hallway (we think it was someone walking their dog early).This apartment is definitely worth a stay!"),
("2017-07-21", "9599384", "Brenda", "David's place in wonderful in all aspects. A real oasis in the middle of a busy  beautiful city. We stayed here with our two young daughters who also loved it. There is so much to do here. David is really friendly and helpful. We can definitely recommend it here!"),
("2017-07-28", "9599384", "Rakesh", "Super place in a great location... easy walk to the Opera house and Circular Quay. Gets nice sun in the mornings. We enjoyed!"),
("2017-07-30", "9599384", "Siew Han", "Great place. Convinent location! ^_^"),
("2017-08-04", "9599384", "Agnita", "We really enjoyed our stay in Davids apartment. Great location. Nice energy. Good beds! Wonderful base for our exploring Sydney! David has been helpful and easy to communicate with! Inwoukd certainly recommend this place."),
("2017-08-16", "9599384", "David", "David is a very nice host  it was very easy to communicate with him. The apartement is well located with very good connection with bus and train. It is very comfortable. We were a little bit afraid of noise at night but we didn't hear anything  even during the week-end!We had a great stay here (we loved the overlooking on the fountain) ans we definetly recommand this place!Thanks for all David."),
("2017-08-22", "9599384", "Janne", "David is really nice host  easy to communicate. He left us tea and coffe and things for breakfast.The apartement has really good location if you don`t mind walking. I was perpared for traffic noise in the evening but  it wasn`t problem at all  although the saturday night was really a party night at that street. There was 4 of us in the apartement and we fitted well  maybe the sleeping couch is not very convient location. If you come from Europe as we did  be prepred that electric plugs are different  so you need the adaptor (could be bought also from neighborhood). Wifi connection was really good in the apartement."),
("2017-08-31", "9599384", "Ian", "This place was bigger than expected  had plenty of hot water  fully functional kitchen  and close to 3 grocery stores  lots of places to eat  and transit stops.  David is a great host  left tea  coffee  cereal  dish soap  etc. to use. There is one portable heater so rooms got chilly without the heater but there are extra blankets. Bring slippers. Definitely noisy in the living room at night from people in the corridor downstairs and the queen bed was quite bouncy. However  it was the perfect spot for our stay  we were quite happy."),
("2017-09-10", "9599384", "Donnie", "David is a great host  the location is great and close to cafe  pâtisserie  train station  restaurant  pub and supermarket. 25 minutes walk to opera house across the beautiful royal botanic garden and costal track. The house is clean  equiped  safe and sunny. Highly recommended to everybody. I also did my morning routine run 5 k return from Sydney top 10 bakery Bourke street bakery in Surry hill  wonderful place for first time visitors too. "),
("2017-09-17", "9599384", "Tim", "I didn't know what to expect  but was very happy with our stay.  The apartment was clean and bright  kitchen and bathroom were updated and wifi and security were solid.  Bonus points to David for being flexible and a gracious host.  Saturday morning  we woke up to a brilliant farmers market across the square. Loved the spot and would stay again."),
("2017-09-22", "9599384", "Joel", "Appartement spacieux et trės fonctionnel. Comme nous étions 3  le recoin avec le lit supplémentaire fut des plus agréable."),
("2017-10-11", "9599384", "Clement", "David est un hôte très sympa et très disponible.L'appartement correspond parfaitement à l'annonce  il est très agréable  le quartier très sympathique et idéal pour visiter la ville. Je recommande fortement!"),
("2017-10-18", "9599384", "Michael", "A lovely apartment with everything you could need. The location was also great - just five minutes walk from Kings Cross Station and lots of great restaurants even closer. The Saturday morning market in the square outside was also a nice surprise."),
("2017-10-24", "9599384", "Elizabeth", "The stay at David’s Place was perfect.  David met us on the street and stored our luggage before check in because we arrived early before check in time.  He also briefed us on the apartment and how to get around the area  and gave us the keys.  We had lunch right across the street while we waited for check in.  His apartment couldn’t have been more enjoyable  and convenient."),
("2017-10-30", "9599384", "Marie-Amelie", "Un joli appartement très bien situé si vous souhaiter sortir. Logement spacieux et  accueillant. David a été charmant et réactif tout au long de nôtre séjour. Je recommande grandement l endroit!"),
("2017-11-01", "9599384", "Pierre", "Super appart juste à proximité des transports et du centre ville en train."),
("2017-11-06", "9599384", "Kari", "David’s place was a great find for our pre-cruise stay in Sydney.  Our flight from California arrived at 6:00 am  and we were able to check in early.  We texted David to let him know we were on our way  and he met us once we got off the train.  He took us right to the apartment.  The apartment was clean and described just as the photos in the listing.  It’s a short walk to public transportation and centrally located to all the sites.  Lots of great little restaurants in the area and a wonderful market on Saturday morning.  David was a very gratious host  and we wouldn’t hesitate to stay here again for our next visit to Sydney."),
("2017-11-16", "9599384", "Shawn", "David is very good host  easy to communicate. The apartment located is very nice   easy go to train station. Walk distance to CBD   SOH and Royal botanic garden. Very recommended."),
("2017-11-22", "9599384", "Yunyeong", "위치도 좋고 호스트도 친절하고 좋았습니다~~!"),
("2017-11-25", "9599384", "Deborah", "The location of this apartment is sensational. You can just sit at the breakfast bar and look into the passing parade of characters walking by the gorgeous El Alamein fountain. The apartment was like something out of a magazine: bright  white  and stylish. The bed was very comfortable  and there is an abundance of natural light through the leafy outlook."),
("2017-11-30", "9599384", "Paul", "Great unit in a fantastic location."),
("2017-12-04", "9599384", "Rebekah", "An awesome apartment in a fun neighborhood. David’s place was even prettier than the pictures. We loved all of the cafes and restaurants right downstairs. There was even a playground across the street that our 2 year old really enjoyed. Great base to explore Sydney!"),
("2017-12-14", "9599384", "Patricia", "Perfect location. Next to Kings Cross station and a lovely stroll to circular quay."),
("2017-12-23", "9599384", "Carolyn", "Very clean and perfectly located. David was very quick to answer any emails which we really appreciated.  I would stay there again and again if I could! Thanks for everything David."),
("2017-12-25", "9599384", "Xinyi", "We had a great stay here during our first two days in Sydney. The apartment is even better than in the photos  and we absolutely loved the dining area overlooking the fountain and street below! Location is perfect  walking distance to Kings Cross Station  supermarkets  CBD  SOH  and Royal Botanic Gardens. Also very clean and well-equipped  and David left us things for breakfast too which was really appreciated. David was an amazing host  and we highly recommend this place!"),
("2017-12-29", "9599384", "Marte", "Staying at Potts Point at Dave’s is hugely recommended for exploring Sydney - 3mins from metro  a short walk to Botanics  the biggest navy ships you can imagine and 20 mins walk to Opera house & CBD area. Very neat appartement  stylish  great daylight  high ceilings  opposite great coffee shop  playground nearby which was great for our 5&7 yr old. Overall a really good stay."),
("2018-01-09", "9599384", "Lisa", "David is a great host. From the beggining letting us leave our ridiculous amount of luggage early so we did not have to lug it around till check in and also allowed us to check out late for the same reason. The apartment is in a perfect spot. Park across the road for our 5 year old daughter. Close to trains and buses  cafes and restaurants. A clean  comfortable and most enjoyable stay. Thank you. Lisa."),
("2018-01-15", "9599384", "Chrystel", "Nice place to stay in Sydney."),
("2018-01-21", "9599384", "Sue", "A lovely clean  light and airy apartment in a great location for seeing central Sydney. Plenty of nearby restaurants and within quite easy walking distance of the Opera House through the Botanic gardens."),
("2018-01-27", "9599384", "Raphaël", "Merci pour ce logement avec une situation exceptionnelle.David a répondu à toutes nos demandes.Je conseille vivement ce logement.merci"),
("2018-02-02", "9599384", "Hope", "David’s unit was in a great location and just looking out the windows at life on the streets was a great pastime. The unit was perfect for our purpose as a base for our sightseeing trip to Sydney. Checkin went smoothly  the unit was clean and provided everything that we needed to make our stay relaxed and comfortable"),
("2018-02-09", "9599384", "Anne Catherine", "Très bien situé  charmant."),
("2018-02-21", "9599384", "Jackie", "David is a great host!Very kindly friendly and helpful!The location is really great! The house is very clean   cozy and much more beautiful than the pictures!The kitchen has all the equipment you will need when you cooked by yourself!If I come back to Sydney again  I will rebook there again!Highly recommended David’s house!"),
("2018-02-24", "9599384", "Joanna", "Fantastic location - a beautiful walk along the water to the Opera House and Bridge  countless cafes and restaurants at your doorstep  and a superb Saturday market just across the road  plus only a short walk to the train station to go further afield. We loved the apartment itself too and will definitely return one day!"),
("2018-02-26", "9599384", "存义", "The apartment is perfect!David are waiting for us once we are checking in.He can response quickly every time we need his help.What’s more we love the fountain on the front his (Website hidden by Airbnb) next time we can live again"),
("2018-03-03", "9599384", "Samantha", "David’s Airbnb was awesome! Super close to the Sydney CBD action  our weekend was made great by having literally everything at the doorstep. David was really hospitable and welcoming  and even let us stay a little longer knowing we’d be out late celebrating Mardi Gras. Honestly wonderful  and would happily stay again!"),
("2018-03-07", "9599384", "Terrill", "We would highly recommend staying in this lovely Potts Point apartment.  In the middle of a vibrant neighborhood  it was surprisingly quiet.  It was a beautiful half hour walk from the Botanical Gardens & Art Museum.  We appreciated David meeting us for a warm welcome & introduction to the area."),
("2018-03-11", "9599384", "Amber", "David’s apartment was fantastic- right in the middle of the Potts Point area  awesome restaurants - close to public transport and a short walk to the city. He accomodated our earlier arrival time and we were able to request a later check out time. Would highly recommend David’s home  and would gladly return again!"),
("2018-03-18", "9599384", "Oscar", "Great location.  Walking distance to Ópera House  Museums  shops and restaurants!"),
("2018-03-25", "9599384", "Jeanette", "David’s place is wonderful  and he is a very gracious host. One of the very best places we have visited and one of the very best experiences we’ve had. He is thoughtful and meticulous. We had a great time!"),
("2018-03-30", "9599384", "Ross", "This is a nice apartment in a convenient location  easy to get around  with plenty of restaurants and services nearby. It’s in a nightlife zone with a few adult shops and backpacker hostels around too  but noise and people were never a problem at all.  In fact I think it’s why there are so many neat coffee shops and diverse restaurants nearby. Be sure to eat at Pizza Boccone just behind the building  it’s the best pizza we have EVER eaten  anywhere!  David set up the futon couch as a second bed for my son  very nice!  And he was super helpful getting us settled in and explaining how best to get around the area. Thanks David! We’d happily stay here again."),
("2018-04-05", "9599384", "Marj", "Great location for visiting all parts of the city. Lots of amenities close by making it a great place to stay"),
("2018-04-09", "9599384", "Sarune", "David's place is very stylish  comfortable and spacious apartment with all amenities you need. We wore traveling with two young children and we appreciated everything went smooth and uncomplicated. The area is busy  a lot of bars and restaurants but also very loca amd individual  what i liked most."),
("2018-04-18", "9599384", "Juan", "David es un excelente anfitrión. La casa es muy recomendable y su situación inmejorable"),
("2018-05-10", "9599384", "Susan", "Great sleeping arrangements where a second or third person can sleep in a private nook on comfortable futon sofa bed. Great aspect. Some early morning noise but that’s the price of being in the heart of Potts Point"),
("2018-05-14", "9599384", "Hianyang", "Family was visiting and they enjoyed the convenience and hospitality of David’s place!"),
("2018-05-19", "9599384", "Jia", "David’s house is in perfect location and close to everything you can ask for. In front of the building across the street there is a lovely cafe and you can enjoy a brunch in the open air with sunshine kissing your face. That’s also a plus for this house. The only thing that can be improved is the shower. It would’ve been perfect if it was strong enough."),
("2018-05-27", "9599384", "Kiew Hong", "Clean  good location and you won't regret on booking a stay at this place."),
("2018-06-04", "9599384", "Bronte", "Great host  location and apartment. David was very hospitable and we thoroughly enjoyed our stay in Sydney. Thanks again"),
("2018-06-10", "9599384", "Creagan", "Wow!  Great host  great space  super easy access to the city.  Sweet location  lots to do and see and just a few meters to the train.  We had a perfect stay  one of the few 5 stars ive given for cleanliness.  Thanks for having us we will be back!"),
("2018-06-17", "9599384", "Trang", "Thank you for a such a nice place. It is central and close to many things. We can walk to the museum  parks and shops.We love the wide window with a lot of sunlight.You are a very good host  David.Your communication is great. Thank you for letting us check in early and check out late."),
("2018-06-25", "9599384", "John", "David’s place was fantastic and situated in a lovely neighborhood. It’s quite spacious and could comfortably fit 4 people. There are lots of groceries  bars  and restos nearby. I guess the highlight of this place is the dining table overlooking the fountain. "),
("2018-06-29", "9599384", "David", "A beautiful space with a lovely view in one of the best locations for exploring the city. Located in a vibrant area with  a wide variety of interesting shops and excellent restaurants within walking distance. Clean  comfortable  and well equipped. Our host David is an excellent communicator  pays attention to detail  and made every effort to help us enjoy our stay. Highly recommended. "),
("2018-07-05", "9599384", "Chanette", "Very nice apartment in the middle of Potts Point. Close to Kings Cross station and several restaurants and shops. The apartment is big and light and has heaters - good for winter!And also David was a very good host and flexible with check-in."),
("2018-07-09", "9599384", "Renata", "Localização é muito boa  pertinho da Opera House. 15 minutos a pé!"),
("2018-07-14", "9599384", "Ying", "公寓乾淨整潔､窗外景致優美 略顯吵"),
("2018-07-31", "9599384", "Johnson", "Location-wise  David's place was conveniently situated close to some places of interest- only a few minutes walk to a couple of pharmacies  restaurants (McDonald's  Pizza Boccone  etc)  groceries (Cole's and Woolworths)  and some shops. It is also close to the King's Cross Train Station (only a 2-minute walk) and some bus stops. In terms of the home itself  it was very cozy and it didn't take long for us to feel at home. There was a lot of space for baggage storage  and it was generally easy to manoeuvre around. David was able to provide an assortment of breakfast cereals  coffee  and even tea for breakfast. Overall  this place would be one that I would gladly rebook in the future."),
("2018-08-07", "9599384", "Claudia", "We enjoyed our stay at Davids appartment very much! It is excellent located  not far away from the main attractions. It has a very good atmoshere and David was very flexible with the ceck-in time. Communication was allways uncomplicated. We can fully recommend it und would book it again. "),
("2018-08-11", "9599384", "Nina", "A comfortable apartment"),
("2018-08-21", "9599384", "Adrian", "We stayed as family (2 adults + 2 teenagers) for 4 nights in August 2018.We had excellent stay. The flat is in great location - just on edge of potts point and kings cross.Close to station  restaurants  take aways with great view out on the fountain and the goings on.Flat is a bit noisy unless close the doors to window room but everyone slept well.Can walk into botanical gardens / opera house easily and eay to get on subway at kings cross.Things to recommend:Pizza Boccone - v tasty and good value.Saturday morning market around the fountain.Plateia where friends meet - great greek takeaway ( on Bayswater road with few other Good quality take aways).Dear sainte eloise - great wine bar and owners but vvvv expensive and alas one very rude waitress :-(David was great to deal with and ensured we hot into flat easily. He then left us to our own devices. Good host of a good flat.Thanks a-lot."),
("2018-08-25", "9599384", "Trelise", "We loved everything about our stay!Great location and super cute apartment"),
("2018-08-29", "9599384", "Catherine", "Fabulous location and lovely airy space to stay in."),
("2018-09-15", "9599384", "Tuan Anh", "Excellent location in the heart of Kings Cross  very clean and wonderful breakfast options. Cosy place with the weekend market right at the door. Quiet and safe in the evening  lively during the day."),
("2018-09-23", "9599384", "Dylan", "Great apartment in an amazing location with a very helpful host"),
("2018-10-03", "9599384", "Melanie", "David's flat was very unique  cosy and clean. We feeled like home. You find here everything you need for an unforgettable trip to Sydney. We loved to have our breakfast with a view to the El-Alamein Fountain. David was always reachable and helped us with everything. Thanks for hosting uns David."),
("2018-10-15", "9599384", "Nathalie", "Super emplacement! À 5 minutes du métro de Kings Cross et de 3 épiceries. Grande chambre et salon. Beaucoup de rangement.Même le futon était confortable. Cuisine fonctionnelle mais peu équipée. Avec un peu de créativité  on se débrouille bien. Petite salle de bains  pas de porte de douche et l'eau s'étend sur le plancher. Mais comme il y a très peu de pression  ce n'est pas trop problématique. Bruits de la rue et du corridor très perceptibles  bouchons pour les oreilles conseillés. Le logement prend la température de l'extérieur. Heureusement  il y avait des couvertures supplémentaires et un chauffage d'appoint portatif. J'y séjournerait de nouveau sans problème!"),
("2018-10-22", "9599384", "Sara", "David is a fantastic host! He had so many nice touches that made our stay more comfortable. He gave us a map of the area and talked us through getting around.The apartment was clean and simple. It's nothing fancy  but it was just right for our needs. The location is great  5 minutes walk from the train station. We used public transportation to get all around Sydney. There is good food available nearby  and a grocery store a short walk away if you prefer cooking. The area can be a bit noisy at night. If you're a light sleeper  maybe bring some earplugs. The apartment may be a bit small for 4 adults if you're not good friends. The second bed is right in front of the door  so just be aware of that. Overall  this place is a great value. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay here."),
("2018-10-28", "9599384", "Albert", "My family of four felt completely at-home in this BandB and in the surrounding neighborhood. There are great small restaurants nearby  a huge open-air market that sets-up in the park across the street on Saturday morning  and abundant transit (bus  train  taxi  uber) close-by to explore Sydney."),
("2018-11-03", "9599384", "Marianne", "Great apartment in a great location in Sydney!Arrival and communication with David were perfect. The apartment is cosy  perfect for our 5 days stay in Sydney. The neighborhood is fantastic with many restaurants and shops  it is also very nice with Victorian houses . And you can walk to the opera and city center through the botanic garden  which is a great walk. I recommend and would definitively come back there if in Sydney!"),
("2018-11-08", "9599384", "Noah", "Great location in Sydney. Lots of restaurants nearby (and many open late). There is no elevator in the building  but David was very helpful in getting our luggage up the stairs — and it’s good exercise after a day of eating."),
("2018-11-11", "9599384", "Janhavi", "David was a really good host. The house is pretty secure. The circular quay isn’t far from the area of stay. Lots of good places to eat nearby"),
("2018-11-19", "9599384", "Penni", "Good location to train and grocery store"),
("2018-11-27", "9599384", "Ilona", "Es ist eine tolle Wohnung an einem schönen Ort in Sydney und David ist ein toller Gastgeber! Wir kommen gerne wieder."),
("2018-12-06", "9599384", "Martina", "David har varit mycket enkel att ha att göra med  vänlig och hjälpsam. Mysig lägenhet. I Kings cross med alla dess kontraster har vi känt oss trygga. Står i beskrivningen att det är risk för ljud utifrån och det kan vi hålla med om. Trevlig vistelse."),
("2018-12-10", "9599384", "Haziq", "David’s place is great! Awesome location with sparkling clean facilities. Very comfy and cosy for my party of 4. Will definitely stay again if I have the chance!"),
("2018-12-24", "9599384", "Cristina", "Lovely place  fully furnished and great location. Better for two than for four but still really good"),
("2018-12-28", "9599384", "Marilyne", "perfect"),
("2019-01-01", "9599384", "Rachel", "Great location  lovely space and close to everything."),
("2019-01-05", "9599384", "David", "David is a nice host reactive and easy communication. His appartement is well located and have a ancient touch."),
("2019-01-07", "9599384", "Micheal", "This place was much larger than expected. great for backpackers and small families. Grest location in a nice clean area. paid parking near by."),
("2019-01-20", "9599384", "Rob & Sam", "The apartment was super cute and spacious and They were waiting to let us in as soon as our uber arrived. There is not a lift/ elevator and your space is on the third floor  so it is a bit of a hump with the luggage. The view from the breakfast table is very nice when you get there. Remember bug spray because it is hot-hot-hot in the summer and no ac and no screens on the windows got us eaten up by mosquitos. Also  I would not recommend this place for children. It it’s a fun party neighborhood with loud and rowdy activities until 2-3 am on Fridays and Saturdays. It was our most adventurous stay on our current travels so far!"),
("2019-02-06", "9599384", "Agnes", "Appartement tres agréable et tres bien situé  dans un quartier tres vivant et à 20 Minutes à pied de l'opéra"),
("2019-02-11", "9599384", "Valerie", "Logement très beau et bien placé. David communique rapidement. Le quartier est calme et vraiment sympa . Nous reviendrons !"),
("2019-02-24", "9599384", "Margie", "David’s apartment is lovely great position in the heart of Potts Point so convenient to everything. The communication with David was fabulous the apartment was spotless and all the ammenities you need for a short stay would highly recommend."),
("2017-01-01", "9815988", "Allie", "Pascale was awesome! I got a very bad sunburn and she was so helpful  getting me aloe Vera and coconut oil to help out. She was very attentive and helped us with everything from restaurant recommendations to a place to park our car. The location was perfect; not far from the city but away from the craziness of it all. "),
("2016-01-31", "9802077", "Agustin", "Best AirBnb we had so far. The apartment is lovely  clean and tidy. It has everything you need for a short or long stay. It's one block away from the main bus in glebe which takes you to central or the city (from there you can go everywhere). It's near a lot of really nice cafe's and bars and several parks. Helena was great in helping us with everything we needed and more!The only thing I would advice is to be sure to find the apartment beforehand because its a little bit hard to find by the number  ask your helena for directions  she'll be more than happy to help!"),
("2016-02-20", "9802077", "Patricia", "Helena met us at the appartment to get us settled in.  She had put some basics and some goodies in the fridge for us and made us feel at ease immediately.  We were able to contact her very easily if we needed to and when we left we felt we had made a friend."),
("2016-03-06", "9802077", "Thomas", "Amazing view of the Sydney skyline  quiet location  fast wifi & beautiful area!Helena is a very nice and caring host. Eventhough I was late upon my arrival she changed her plans and came to me personally to hand in the keys.The view from the balcony is amazing and the area is perfect for a walk or jogging.Helena's apartment is highly recommended for business and / or leisure guests."),
("2016-03-20", "9802077", "Line", "What a great first experience with Airbnb! The apartment was great and well cleaned. All communication with Helena was positive and fast. The Glebe area is great with lots of restaurant. I definitely recommend this place and I would stay again :)"),
("2016-04-04", "9802077", "Sherry", "Helena's place was absolutely lovely! The apartment is basically fully equipped with whatever needed  nice view of sydney skyline  close to bus station plenty of restaurants nearby and fast wifi. Communication with Helena was fast  she replied most of my messages almost instantly and she's kind enough to meet me earlier for me to check-in. A place I would definitely recommend to others if you would like to have a complete home away from home experience. "),
("2016-07-31", "9802077", "Toni", "Helena is a charming host  who met me to hand over the keys and show me the unit. The studio is bright and compact with a well equipped kitchen  and a comfortable bed. The balcony has a great view!This is a quiet neighbourhood  only a short walk to shops  cafes and transport.The waterfront walk to Rozelle or the Fish markets is a bonus."),
("2016-10-02", "9802077", "Lally", "Helena was extremely welcoming and helpful. She went out of her way to meet up with my parents and give them the keys because I was arriving early the next morning. Her place is clean  lovely  and very well stocked for guests. And it's in a  great location. I would recommend staying there to anyone. Glebe Point Road is such a lovely area too. "),
("2016-11-28", "9802077", "Nigel", "Accommodation was ideal for a month's stay in Sydney visiting close family. Although the kitchen and bathroom were  'dated' the apartment was well equipped with everything necessary for our stay and adequately suited our needs."),
("2017-01-05", "9802077", "Marleen", "A great appartment! A good location and Helena is a very nice host. Communication was very good! We had a nice stay in Sydney. We would really reccoment this place. Thanks Helena"),
("2017-04-01", "9802077", "Aidan", "Great location  comfortable bed.  Everything you need in a little apartment. Awesome view from the balcony. "),
("2017-04-14", "9802077", "Martin", "Lovely stay and very nice apartment. Helena was a great host"),
("2017-04-20", "9802077", "Nadia", "Great host with a very nice apartment in Glebe. Amazing view from balcony. Apartment had everything you need for both short or long stay. A lot of dining/cafes in Glebe. Really recommend this place!"),
("2017-05-24", "9802077", "John", "I had a great stay at Helenas apartment. Helena was a great host and very quick to respond whenever I had any questions. The apartment was very clean upon arrival (and the complimentary fruits and drinks was a nice touch!) and has all the things you need to have a comfortable stay. I think the one thing I missed was a drier to dry my clothes/sheets/etc. in after washing them  but that didn't become a problem either since you can easily dry the clothes on the balcony or indoors. The apartment is situated in a nice and quite area in Glebe  and within walking distance to bus stops  shops and restaurants  the harbour and so on. I can truly recommend Helenas apartment for single travelers or couples looking for a nice apartment for longer or shorter stays in Glebe/Sydney."),
("2017-06-07", "9802077", "Angela", "Das Apartment liegt an perfekter Lage  um Sydney zu erkunden. Es gibt sehr gute Bus- und Lightrailverbindungen ins Zentrum (ca. 15 min) und in Glebe selber gibt es viele schöne Restaurants  Cafés und Läden. Das Apartment selber ist sehr schön und sauber  Bad und Küche sind etwas älteren Datums aber völlig in Ordnung. Wir haben hier zwei Wochen gewohnt und würden jederzeit wieder hierher kommen. Helena ist eine sehr nette und zuvorkommenden Gastgeberin  der Kontakt mit ihr war sehr einfach. "),
("2017-07-02", "9802077", "Karen", "This is a great place to stay in Sydney. It's close to an efficient public transport system and lots of little shops and restaurants. Helena is a great host who keeps in touch to make sure everything is okay. The flat is well equipped and she provides fresh fruit and drinks to be sure you get off to a great start. Highly recommended."),
("2017-10-15", "9802077", "Miminurulmerryan", "Helena is a great  warm and very welcoming host. The studio at Glebe is in a very nice neighbourhood. It is very simple  clean and very well located tks to Light Rail and Bus close to it. The stay allowed me to discover a real typical Sydney area. Enjoyed the stay a lot."),
("2017-10-30", "9802077", "David", "Helena’s place was ideal for my visit. Situated not far from the trendy neighbourhood and many eateries. The place also has balcony and great city scape views. Overall very enjoyable. Would love to stay again in the future. Helena was excellent and extremely prompt in communicating!"),
("2018-03-31", "9802077", "Ming-Ting", "My wife and I were very fortunate to stay at Helena’s place as our first stop in Australia. Helena is very considerate. She welcomed us with fresh fruits  drinks  and chocolates which gave us a very warm feeling after a long flight from the U.S. The apartment was clean  roomy  and well equipped with all we need for a month’s long stay. Fast Wifi made our work efficient. Helena was extremely informative and responsive. Her place locates at an excellent location  in a quiet and very nice neighborhood. A very short walk to bus-stop and light-rail station took us to anywhere at Sydney. The apartment is within walking distance to lots of nice shops  eateries  water-fronts  Fish Market  Broadway Mall  and the University of Sydney.  We enjoyed the morning walks to the nearby bayside park and Saturday’s interesting Glebe Market. We highly recommend Helena’s place for a business/leisure stay."),
("2018-05-12", "9802077", "Alexander", "Comfortable apartment in a quiet and cool spot close to the Sydney CBD   with excellent transport access  great facilities and thoughtful touches. Had a very relaxing time during my stay!"),
("2018-05-16", "9802077", "Yann", "Very tidy apartment in one of the suburbs of Sydney. I will come back!"),
("2018-06-15", "9802077", "Yolanda", "Clean  cozy and convenient place to stay. Helena is a nice and friendly host."),
("2018-07-14", "9802077", "J", "Great apartment  close to public transport and amazing views back over the cbd. Being off the main road very quite and for a studio very roomy and comfortable with well appointed kitchen. The host was excellent "),
("2018-08-14", "9802077", "중환", "It was nice place. I recommend this accommodation for everyone. Rapid response and kindness of host make me comfortable in Australia. Don't hesitate to reserve this room!"),
("2018-09-02", "9802077", "Hallam", "I was in Sydney for a week for conferences at the ICC in Darling Harbour. Helena's place was a great choice for this -- easy to get around on the light rail  nice neighbourhood  and had everything I needed."),
("2018-11-29", "9802077", "Karl", "Helena’s apartement is really the best quality/price place that you can find in Sydney. Great location  amazing CBD’s view from the balcony and all that you need is provided in the flat. In addition Helena was very accommodating with our arrivals condition. Finally my best Airbnb experience. Thanks again Helena."),
("2015-12-17", "9810515", "Andreas", "Stor och trivsam lägenhet. Dock störande oljud från ventilationen i fastigheten nattetid. Trevligt område med flera restauranger och pubar i närheten. Enkelt att ta sig de centrala delarna av Sydney till fots."),
("2016-03-13", "9810515", "Kendra", "The apartment was very spacious and clean upon arriving. I loved that there were restaurants  convenience stores and public transportation options close by.  Less than 2 km from the Opera House and Circular Quay.  Secure building.  All in all  this is a nice property.  We had a question about the wi-fi and Andrea responded promptly  which we appreciated!"),
("2016-03-19", "9810515", "Carter", "Listing was very accurate and what we expected!"),
("2016-03-29", "9810515", "Darren", "Great apartment  good location close to the City. "),
("2016-07-05", "9810515", "Ron", "My family loved our stay in Andrea's apartment  great location  walking distance to Sydney Opera house and harbor bridge. Would definitely book again! Thx Andrea! "),
("2016-09-18", "9810515", "Zoe", "Andrea was a great host  she gave clear instructions as to how to collect keys. The location is at a nice and convenient location  with easy assess to major sightseeing spots."),
("2016-11-14", "9810515", "Ty", "Good apartment with a great view of the Harbour Bridge. Easy walking distance to city and botanic gardens. Good amenities close by (restaurants and grocery stores). Apartment is managed by World Apartments and Andrea was very responsive to our communications. Secure building with helpful reception staff."),
("2017-04-24", "9810515", "Louise", "Great apartment"),
("2017-05-30", "9810515", "Jackie", "We had a very comfortable stay in this beautiful apartment within walking distance to the Woolloomooloo Wharf. The space is large and nicely furnished  beds comfortable  and fantastic views! We walked to many of the local sights and especially enjoyed VIVID which we were not aware was happening when we booked our trip. We would love to stay here again if we come back to Sydney. Thank you for your easy communication throughout. "),
("2017-06-11", "9810515", "Matthew", "Fantastic 2 bedroom apartment with great views of the city and the Harbour Bridge.  The location in Woolloomoolloo is excellent and is within easy walking distance of the CBD and Opera House.   The apartment is well-appointed and spacious with large bedrooms."),
("2017-07-23", "9810515", "Kate", "The accommodation was perfect for our family. The apartment was huge so you never feel cramped. Comfy beds and good ammenities. Great views of city skyline and Harbour Bridge glimpses. A wonderful walk into the city via the botanical gardens  where you can catch ferries and see . Close to cafes and restaurants. Good prompt accomodating communication from Andrea. Thank you."),
("2017-07-31", "9810515", "Kate", "We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Andrea's place. The location was just great  we walked to lots of restaurants and cafes   centenial park  into the city and across to circular quay. The apartment itself was just as pictured  very spacious with a great view."),
("2017-09-10", "9810515", "Matthew", "Spacious appartment with great views of the city."),
("2017-10-09", "9810515", "Elizabeth", "This is a very spacious apartment with a good view. Good for eating in or dining out at the local restaurants. A great base for exploring the city."),
("2017-10-18", "9810515", "David", "Extremely comfortable  stylish and well stocked with all amenities and equipment for a great stay. Modern  well furnished apartment with huge windows and lots of natural light.  Very easy access to hip neighborhoods as well as the gardens and parks.  Andrea was easy to communicate with and responded instantly.  An excellent resource for any  visitor to Sydney."),
("2017-10-23", "9810515", "Victor", "Very nice place to stay.. definitely gonna stay again next trip"),
("2017-11-08", "9810515", "Hugh", "This was a great property to rent  within walking distance of the Opera House and CBD. There were many great restaurants nearby. Andrea was very helpful and organised. I would recommend staying here as a good option."),
("2018-02-15", "9810515", "Lizzy", "The apartment is really nice good location and the host reply very fast the room is big enough and kitchen is awesome I do enjoy stay here Thanks Andrea!"),
("2018-03-18", "9810515", "Georgia", "Andrea is most helpful and provided us with information on public transport and other things when asked.  The apartment is only a short walk to many things including the botanic gardens  Sydney opera house and circular quay."),
("2018-04-22", "9810515", "Michelle", "Fantastic location if you want to be near Kings Cross but also close enough to walk to circular quay and around the botanical gardens. The apartment was fairy quiet even though next to a pub (we stayed over the weekend). It is also right next to a primary school so no noise until kids start at school for the day (it was school holidays for us so wasn’t an issue at all). Highly recommend eating at Sienna Marina which is nearby and a walk along the wharfs and to see the Navy ships. Comfy beds and a lovely deep bath!!"),
("2018-06-11", "9810515", "Jay", "Perfect location  quiet neighborhood with plenty of restaurants in a short walking distance.  Great beds  awesome view  short-walk to King's X station"),
("2018-07-09", "9810515", "Andrea", "Amazing location. Close to harbour and restaurants. Clean  spacious apartment with incredible views of city and harbour bridge."),
("2018-08-15", "9810515", "Mark", "Great location. Nice quiet and clean accommodation."),
("2018-09-16", "9810515", "Moira", "A lovely spacious and comfortable apartment in lovely quiet cul-de-sac location.  Very handy to city centre  mainly caught an Uber for around $11 but could also easily walk through the botantic gardens which were right there.  Restaurants handy  Finger Wharf just over the road and a great little cafe just down on the corner of the street.Andrea at World Apartments was excellent to deal with  very helpful with great location.Highly recommend for a central Sydney stay"),
("2018-11-17", "9810515", "Andy", "Perfect size and location for a family visit to Sydney. Easy walk into CBD/circular quay in 20 mins."),
("2018-11-30", "9810515", "Irina", "This apartment is spacious and in an amazing location for walking to  the ferries at circular quay and the Botanical Gardens  the Wooloomooloo Wharf area has some great restaurants only five minutes walk. The view includes the harbour bridge from the balcony. We stayed for a week and the facilities for cooking and doing laundry were more than adequate. Andrea was a great host replying very quickly and providing perfect key collection details. We would love to return next time we make it to zdydney from the Uk"),
("2018-12-09", "9810515", "Suzanne", "A very comfortable and spacious Apartment close to restaurants and other amenities... Lovely views from the large living room and a lovely little balcony to sit and enjoy a coffee or a wine .... Interesting things to discover within walking distance... The Apartment suited the purpose of our stay in Sydney for our long weekend..."),
("2019-01-06", "9810515", "Jo", "Beautiful apartment in a big complex. Close to all amenities and easy walking distance to the city and amazing restaurants nearby. Our only complaint was the noise and behaviour of neighbours from nearby housing estate late at night."),
("2019-01-18", "9810515", "Justin", "Great location for the family as quite but close enough to the city action.  Lots of food choices in walking distance and a great cafe  (coffee) 100m away.  A comfortable 20m stroll to the Opera House via the gardens.  Apartment very generous in size for 4 and has all you need including foxtel.  Air Conditioner works well and car park is a bonus."),
("2019-02-11", "9810515", "Reijo", "Nice place"),
("2016-02-15", "9848837", "Frances", "Hi   Really enjoyed staying in this beautiful house. It looked just as good as the pictures and everything was nice and clean. The garden was beautiful  really well done. It was close to the beach. Frances. "),
("2016-04-26", "9848595", "Matthew", "Great experience. Communication from beginning to end with Charles was faultless. Apartment was exactly as advertised. In a convienent location  close to a great cafe and a short stroll to a few good beaches (uphill a slog on the way home!). Flat was clean and tidy and everything worked like it should do. We would fully recommend a stay here. "),
("2016-10-30", "9848595", "Marion", "I had such a wonderful stay at Charlie & Gioia's apartment. They gave me all the instructions I needed to get around the flat and even left a bottle of red wine. While it's a bit of a hike to get up there  Fairlight is beautiful and quiet and the walk to Manly and all the beautiful places to see around is totally worth it. The apartment is super clean and nicely decorated  I definitely felt at home. Thanks a lot for the warm welcome :)"),
("2017-05-17", "9848595", "Lucien", "We had a wonderful stay in Charles & Gioia´s very nice and convenient apartment. Cleanness at arrival and equipment as described made life easy  also in respect of near shops  restaurants and bus stops to reach Manly. Communication with Charles was easy too and we would highly recommend that flat  even if its actualized daily rates may appear to be slightly too high for Fairlight. "),
("2017-09-22", "9848595", "Heleen", "Perfectly located  nice  clean apartment - as described."),
("2018-01-07", "9848595", "Helary", "Charle & Gioia have a beautiful apartment in Fairlight  there were really helpful for the organisation of this trip  my mother and her friend who stayed there enjoy the location nearby the beach and the fact that the place was really quiet and sunny. I definitely recommend this place for travellers who like a place to settle for 1 week or more.. thanks :)Erwan"),
("2018-09-10", "9848595", "Joshua", "Clean  good location  modern and has all the amenities. Double thumbs up"),
("2019-01-09", "9848595", "Gabriel", "Good and comfortable apartment with everything you need for a pleasant stay. The hosts were responsive and caring. I would definitely recommend."),
("2016-04-05", "9849915", "Michele", "I loved the apartment  the location is perfect  and Valentine & Jack has been very good hosts. Highly recommended!"),
("2016-05-05", "9849915", "Jef", "Great experience  friendly hosts  lovely part of North Bondi"),
("2016-06-10", "9849915", "Jef", "Another great stay in North Bondi at Valentine's place - thanks for the hospitality!"),
("2016-08-27", "9849915", "Fari", "Very nice hosts in a great apartment with a beautiful Ocean- and Bondi-Beach-View!Valentine and her partner were very friendly and good to chat with. She was very flexible and made it possible to check in very late. She was a good host and did everything she could to make our stay even better! We would come back !"),
("2016-09-20", "9849915", "Damien", "Valentine et Jack sont des hôtes très agréables  avenants  arrangeants sur les horaires si possible  ouverts à la discussion et désireux de partager leurs connaissances des lieux à visiter aux alentoursL'appartement est parfaitement entretenu  décoré avec goûts  et surtout avec une vue magnifique sur Bondi BeachC'était LA réservation à faire!"),
("2016-09-26", "9849915", "Faye", "译文Scenery is very good and i want wo sent some pic here to prove what i said! We regret we arrived at the lodging place ahead of schedule  lead to the landlord and boyfriend back to the house immedietly. Landlord and her boyfriend are a couple in love and they are good person.The house have a lot of daily products  from bondi is also in 5 minutes distances  it is belong to the north  quiet rest environment. If u went along the way  there are many coffee shops  were only 4 or 5 minutes distance from the bus station  the sitting room can see the sea  very comfortable  we like it so much and thank you!"),
("2016-10-10", "9849915", "Corinna", "It was absolutely wonderful: Valentine is a very friendly person and gave us a warm welcome and so many informations even it was very late at night when we arrived. The view from the appartement above bondi beach is amazing. We would definetly come back!"),
("2016-10-25", "9849915", "Ryan", "Valentine's place was beautiful  super clean and comfortable  and in an amazing location with superb views of bondi beach. Everything in bondi is an easy walk from her place. Valentine and her boyfriend were both very lovely  generous  and helpful. It was wonderful to meet them both. "),
("2016-11-09", "9849915", "Ottilie", "Val & Jack's place is awesome. The location couldn't be better with the most incredible views of Bondi and beyond  and they were always very generous  kind and accomodating. It's a lovely apartment with a comfy bed  decent sized room and lovely bathroom – plus a balcony made for whale & dolphin watching. Very sweet folk in a top-drawer place."),
("2016-11-15", "9849915", "Tamir", "We had a great time at Valentine's place.  Location is excellent  easy walk to beach  transportation  restaurants and stores  and views are spectacular."),
("2016-12-11", "9849915", "Raymond", "Love the view from the verandah!"),
("2017-01-18", "9849915", "Philip", "Great location  great view  nice and clean place. Valentine was very friendly. "),
("2017-02-11", "9849915", "Sylvie", "Logement idéal pour découvrir le charme de la vie à Bondi"),
("2017-02-17", "9849915", "Juliane", "I can highly recommend staying with Valentine.Her place is just beautiful  overlooking Bondi Beach. I really enjoyed my time there. You are so close to everything and it is quiet too. Valentine and her boyfriend are very friendly and nice to talk with."),
("2017-02-23", "9849915", "Fabienne", "Fantastique!"),
("2017-02-26", "9849915", "Fabienne", "This house is fantastic  run to it!!"),
("2017-03-29", "9849915", "Claire", "Excellent location! Wonderful views of Bondi. The apartment was very clean  comfortable and Valentine is a lovely hostess. Would highly recommend staying here if in Sydney!"),
("2017-04-08", "9849915", "Peter", "We had a great stay at Valentine's place in North Bondi. Location is great - just outside  but in reach of  the hustle and bustle of Bondi. Public transport is close by  but quite slow - so expect to use taxis/Ubers a bit. Also  the view is even better than the pictures suggest."),
("2017-04-27", "9849915", "Yun Gon", "경치가 환상적이고 집도 깔끔합니다. 개인실이지만 평일 낮시간에 호스트는 직장 근무로 비교적 자유로운 생활이 가능한 점도 장점입니다. Thanks for your host during my stay Valentine!"),
("2016-06-12", "9944044", "Antonio", "Lovely cosy place  perfect as a start point to the Coastal Walk. Scott was extremely friendly and helpful.Private accommodation  with a separate entrance and great independent back garden."); 
